# Generated from script.rpy. Fill results of translate_batch.py.
# Place this file in game/tl/zh_cn/ together with 00_hook.rpy.

translate zh_cn strings:

    # game/script.rpy:58
    old "After Dark"
    new "入夜之后"

    # game/script.rpy:93
    old "I'd been mindlessly staring at the wall in front of me for a few minutes. When that finally registered, I slowly spun around."
    new "我对着眼前的墙壁呆呆望了好几分钟。等终于回过神来，才慢慢转过身去。"

    # game/script.rpy:95
    old "I'd always thought I'd be quick at adapting to sudden changes, but I'd recently realized how mistaken that was. Still unable to process everything, my brain continually struggled to accept that the previous few days had really happened."
    new "我一直以为自己面对突发变故总能很快适应，最近才发现根本不是这样。那几天的事，我至今还回不过神来，脑子里怎么也接受不了那是真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:97
    old "...I wasn't familiar with the walls around me, but I'd always known of the place. Next to me was Shiroya, less willing to acknowledge her surroundings. Keeping her gaze on the floor, she suddenly spoke for the first time since we'd entered."
    new "……四周的墙壁对我来说很陌生，但这地方我早有耳闻。身旁的 Shiroya 却更不愿意面对周围的一切。她始终盯着地面，忽然开口，这是进来之后她第一次说话。"

    # game/script.rpy:102
    old "...I think it'll be time soon."
    new "……我想，快到时候了。"

    # game/script.rpy:104
    old "Yeah, probably less than twenty minutes."
    new "嗯，大概不到二十分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:111
    old "That was all I managed to muster. Even though I was still the same Atsuki as always, it felt like I'd been rewritten into an entirely different entity in only a few days."
    new "我只挤得出这一句。我明明还是原来的我，却觉得短短几天里，自己已经被改写成另一个人了。"

    # game/script.rpy:115
    old "..."
    new "……"

    # game/script.rpy:116
    old "I didn't try to say anything else. During the previous two weeks, I'd grown accustomed to those brief interactions with Shiroya. After I spoke, the lost look in her eyes returned. We had both agreed to go together, but it seemed like neither of us knew what we were doing."
    new "我没有再说别的。过去两周，我已经习惯了和 Shiroya 这样简短地说上几句。等我说完，她眼里那种茫然又回来了。我们明明说好一起过来，可到头来，两个人好像都不知道自己在做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:121
    old "We awkwardly scanned the vast hall, moving forward tiny steps at a time and awaiting further instructions."
    new "我们局促地打量着这座空旷的大厅，一小步一小步地往前挪，等着接下来的指示。"

    # game/script.rpy:122
    old "Neither of us had any strength; I'd known Shiroya for more than fifteen years, and not once had she looked so empty. On top of everything else, I hadn't even been able to make her feel any better."
    new "我们俩都没什么力气了。我认识 Shiroya 超过十五年，从没见她这样空落过。更糟的是，我连让她好受一点都做不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:123
    old "Despite that, at almost {time=9}, we were inside Ashiya Tower."
    new "尽管如此，快到 {time=9} 的时候，我们还是走进了芦屋塔。"

    # game/script.rpy:130
    old "The biggest building in Yushibana—the town where we'd always lived. It was situated on the outskirts, and we had never entered it before."
    new "那是丰花镇上最大的一栋楼——我们一直生活在这个镇上。楼在镇子边上，我们却从没进去过。"

    # game/script.rpy:131
    old "From the outside, the tower's contrast with its surroundings was immense. Beyond all the similar-looking houses, its size made it visible anywhere in the town. It was that contrast which had caused it to be called a \"tower\", but it was only as big as an urban building. The structure itself was more or less a cube, essentially as wide as it was tall, but it seemed towering to people who had spent their whole lives in a rural area."
    new "从外面看，这座塔和周围的反差大得惊人。附近全是差不多的房子，可它体量太大，站在镇上哪儿都能望见。也正因为这份反差，它才被叫作「塔」，其实它也就是城里一栋楼的规模。整栋楼差不多是个立方体，宽和高几乎一样，但对一辈子住在乡下的人来说，已经显得很高耸了。"

    # game/script.rpy:132
    old "It was a place Shiroya and I had always avoided because of the stigma associated with it. A significant amount of the citizens opposed the tower's existence due to both the group who owned it and its unnatural size."
    new "Shiroya 和我一直避开这个地方，因为它名声不好。不少镇民都反对这座塔，既因为拥有它的那伙人，也因为它的体量大得不正常。"

    # game/script.rpy:139
    old "I wasn't very familiar with the topic. Apparently, decades in the past, when the building hadn't been anywhere near as large, it was the original Ashiya family's home. It was known that they were a shady family, but they never suffered any real consequences. At that time, they held a silent power over the town, and over the years, it gradually grew stronger."
    new "这些事我知道得不多。据说几十年前，这栋楼还远没有今天这么大，是芦屋家最早的老宅。人人都知道这家人来路不正，可他们从没真正吃过亏。那时他们在镇上暗中掌权，多年下来，势力越来越大。"

    # game/script.rpy:140
    old "They became the image of Yushibana. Anyone visiting from the outside knew about that family before anything else in the town. Over the years, the old residence transformed into a focal point for business and tourism."
    new "他们成了丰花的门面。外地来的人，最先听说的就是这家人，之后才轮到镇上的其他事。多年下来，那座老宅渐渐成了商贸和观光的中心。"

    # game/script.rpy:144
    old "I had never immersed myself in the matter, but that was common information that I couldn't even recall where I'd heard first."
    new "我从没去深究过这些，可这都是人人皆知的说法，我连最初是从哪儿听来的都想不起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:145
    old "The place was some sort of museum, and behind it extended a mountain range that encircled Yushibana. It was known for housing numerous caves that held valuable gemstones, so enthusiasts tended to visit often. The Ashiya family had taken advantage of it and utilized their building as a gallery for the different gemstones that could be found in the nearby mountains."
    new "那个地方算是一座博物馆，它后面延伸着一道环绕丰花的山脉。这座山脉以拥有众多蕴藏贵重宝石的洞穴而闻名，因此宝石爱好者常常前来探访。芦屋家族利用了这一优势，把自己的建筑用作陈列附近山中出产的各种宝石的陈列馆。"

    # game/script.rpy:146
    old "And when that happened, the part of the town in favor of the tower increased due to the incoming flow of people who specialized in those gemstones. That was what caused a split in the population; the younger residents generally didn't mind Ashiya, while the older maintained their private discontent."
    new "随着专为宝石而来的人越来越多，镇上支持这座塔的人也多了起来。人们因此分成了两派：年轻的大多不介意芦屋家，年长的则暗暗不满。"

    # game/script.rpy:147
    old "That was why we had never entered it, and on top of our more recent circumstances, I thought Shiroya might've been experiencing a feeling of betrayal simply by being there. While I couldn't say I shared that strong of an emotion toward it, I wasn't very fond of the whole thing either."
    new "我们一直没进去过，原因就在于此。再加上近来这些事，我想 Shiroya 单是待在这里，或许就有种被背叛的感觉。我虽说不上有她那么强烈的情绪，对整个地方也谈不上喜欢。"

    # game/script.rpy:152
    old "...{w}The reason why we were inside wasn't one I could easily put into words."
    new "……{w}我们为什么会在里面，我很难说清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:157
    old "There had been constant publicity about the day's event for two weeks. According to Ashiya, they were going to showcase a major discovery, one found in the very same mountains around the town."
    new "两周以来，关于今天这场活动的宣传铺天盖地。按芦屋家的说法，他们要展示一项重大发现，那东西正是在镇子周围的山里找到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:160
    old "But that wasn't something that particularly interested me, and I wasn't sure what to expect. Our motivation for coming to the tower wasn't anything as simple as curiosity."
    new "可我对这个并不太感兴趣，也说不清自己到底在期待什么。我们来这座塔，并不是单纯出于好奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:165
    old "It was December 15th. Outside, the environment was cold and coated in snow, and while the temperature inside was regulated, we'd been outside for so long that we still felt unpleasant."
    new "那天是十二月十五日。外面天寒地冻，到处是雪。屋里虽然有温控，可我们在外头待得太久，身上还是不舒服。"

    # game/script.rpy:167
    old "I glanced at Shiroya, who didn't return my look. Feeling slightly agitated, I turned a little."
    new "我瞥了 Shiroya 一眼，她没有看我。我有点烦躁，稍微转了转身。"

    # game/script.rpy:172
    old "I could see a line of people who had come thanks to Ashiya's ambitious advertisements. Shiroya and I had been at the front of it for a long time."
    new "我能看见一队人，都是被芦屋家大张旗鼓的宣传引来的。Shiroya 和我已经在队伍最前面待了很久。"

    # game/script.rpy:178
    old "Next to us was a man I'd never seen before. He was tall and had dark hair, and like us, he seemed distant from everyone else. I hadn't seen him so much as look at me, so I hadn't paid attention to him."
    new "我们旁边站着一个从没见过的男人。他个子很高，头发乌黑，和我们一样，似乎跟旁人都隔着一段距离。他甚至没朝我看过一眼，我也就没去留意他。"

    # game/script.rpy:179
    old "We were next to him because we would go see the gemstone in groups of three. Since we'd been the initial three to show up, we formed the first group."
    new "我们之所以挨着他，是因为参观宝石要三人一组。我们是头三个到场的，于是成了第一组。"

    # game/script.rpy:187
    old "The entrance fee had been expensive, but we'd paid it well in advance. From our perspective, it had been worth it."
    new "门票很贵，不过我们早就付过了。我们觉得这钱花得值。"

    # game/script.rpy:188
    old "We remained by the door that would open at {time=9}, simply waiting for that to happen. At our left was another door that would open at the same time, and according to what we'd been told, both led to the main floor of the tower.{w} On that particular day, not many people seemed to care about that, as everyone who could be seen was in our same line."
    new "我们待在 {time=9} 会打开的那扇门前，就等着门开。左边还有一扇门也会同时开，听说两扇门都通向塔的主层。{w} 不过今天好像没多少人在意这个，能看见的人全排在我们这条队里。"

    # game/script.rpy:189
    old "For a moment, I wondered what the big deal was. Yushibana wasn't a large town, so the amount of people waiting behind us was fairly impressive. All that for a gemstone didn't seem quite right to me."
    new "有那么一瞬间，我在想这有什么大不了的。丰花不算大，身后排队的人却多得有点惊人。只为一块宝石就弄成这样，我总觉得不太对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:190
    old "But perhaps it made sense, given that it was Ashiya's event. They cared about appearances, as anyone could attest. They had their hands in all types of business, but the most important one was looking good."
    new "不过，既然是芦屋家办的活动，也许就说得通了。谁都知道他们极重门面。他们什么生意都插手，但最看重的还是让自己显得体面。"

    # game/script.rpy:191
    old "Apart from the line, the only other people in the lobby were guards talking with a policeman, a woman behind the reception desk checking everyone's tickets, and a janitor who had been scrubbing the same part of the floor for a while."
    new "除了排队的人，大厅里就只有几个正和警察说话的门卫、接待台后核验门票的女子，以及一个在同一块地板上擦了半天的清洁工。"

    # game/script.rpy:198
    old "It was all unsettling and alien. The event itself was an abstract thing to me, and my view on the people who ran it was far from positive. All I could do was look at things and wait for it all to start."
    new "这一切都让人不安又陌生。这场活动本身对我来说仍是个抽象的概念，我对主办方的印象也远谈不上好。我能做的只有四处看看，等着开场。"

    # game/script.rpy:199
    old "We'd been asked to leave our phones outside for the duration of our stay, as nothing of the sort was permitted in the building. That meant that I had no way of looking at the time; there weren't any clocks on the walls."
    new "我们被告知，逗留期间要把手机留在外面，楼内一律不许携带这类东西。这就意味着我没法看时间——墙上也没有挂钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:200
    old "Adding the fact that the person I was with was clearly uncomfortable and trying to hide it, the long wait had been much more tedious than I'd hoped."
    new "再加上身边那人明显不自在，还努力掩饰着，这段漫长的等待比我预想的要难熬得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:206
    old "I continued looking at her, not knowing how to deal with the situation better. Finally, after minutes of looking down, she suddenly lifted her head as if she'd just remembered that she was in a public environment."
    new "我一直看着她，不知道该怎么办才好。她低头看了好几分钟，最后忽然抬起头，像是这才想起自己是在公共场合。"

    # game/script.rpy:211
    old "Following behind, she looked at me and seemed to try to smile."
    new "接着，她看向我，似乎想挤出一点笑容。"

    # game/script.rpy:217
    old "But it was barely visible before vanishing again."
    new "可那笑意还未成形，便又消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:224
    old "...I kept falling back into negative thoughts. No matter how I tried, I couldn't help that."
    new "……我又一次次陷回那些消沉的念头里。不管怎么努力，都拦不住自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:225
    old "I needed to be stronger and help lift Shiroya out of the pit she was in, but that was tricky, seeing as I first had to get out of the same one."
    new "我得振作起来，把 Shiroya 从她掉进去的那个坑里拉出来；可我自己也陷在同一个坑里，得先爬出去才行，这就难办了。"

    # game/script.rpy:226
    old "So I just struggled against my feelings, wishing all the while that I could go back to how things had been before."
    new "于是我只能跟自己的情绪较劲，一边盼着一切能回到从前的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:235
    old "Minutes later, a well-dressed man who'd been standing near the entrance told us that if we weren't waiting for the event, we could go through the left door."
    new "几分钟后，一个衣着考究、一直站在入口附近的男人告诉我们：要是我们不打算等这场活动开始，可以从左边那扇门进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:242
    old "Shortly after, a tall, blonde woman wearing a suit entered through the one on the right."
    new "不久之后，一个穿西装的高个金发女人从右边那扇门走了进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:245
    old "I'd seen her in a coat earlier, before she'd disappeared through one of the doors. She looked over everyone present and began to explain what the procedure would be."
    new "我先前见她穿着大衣，后来她进了其中一扇门，不见了。她环视在场的所有人，开始说明流程。"

    # game/script.rpy:246
    old "Sorry for the wait, everyone. We'll now begin the group entrances.{w} My name is Naomi. I'll be chaperoning today's guided visit."
    new "各位，久等了。现在开始分组入场。{w}我是 Naomi，今天的参观由我带队。"

    # game/script.rpy:247
    old "As you likely already know, groups of three will move forward in turns. Each viewing is estimated to take approximately fifteen minutes.{w} Once inside, I will personally explain what we have prepared, and I will also be available to answer questions within the specified time."
    new "各位大概已经知道，三人一组，依次进场。每次参观预计十五分钟左右。{w}进去之后，我会亲自为大家讲解我们准备的展品，也会在规定时间内回答大家的问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:252
    old "Naomi's explanation was directed at everyone present, but it was hard to believe anyone farther back could've heard her. She continued in a monotone voice."
    new "Naomi 这番话是冲着全场所有人说的，可站在后面的人多半听不见。她继续用毫无起伏的语调说着。"

    # game/script.rpy:258
    old "Keep in mind that phones and video cameras are strictly prohibited. I ask for all of you to please be patient and await your turn."
    new "请记住，手机和摄像机一律不准带入。也请大家耐心等候，轮到了再进。"

    # game/script.rpy:263
    old "When her scripted message was over, she relaxed her posture and directed her look at us."
    new "那套照本宣科的话讲完，她整个人才松下来，目光转向我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:264
    old "You three are the first group, correct?"
    new "你们三位就是第一批，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:267
    old "Seconds later, nobody had answered. The two people at my sides had barely paid attention to her, so I spoke before she would have to ask again."
    new "几秒过去，没人应声。我身边那两个人也没怎么理会她，于是我赶在她再问一遍之前先开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:268
    old "Yes."
    new "是的。"

    # game/script.rpy:269
    old "...All right, then. Please follow me to the event room to be the first to see the Sekimeiya."
    new "……好吧。那请随我去活动室，你们会是第一批见到 Sekimeiya 的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:272
    old "I'd heard that word many times recently. As soon as she said it, she turned around and walked through the same door she'd entered from."
    new "这个词我最近听过无数遍了。她刚说完，就转身从进来时的那扇门走了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:276
    old "I looked to my right to check on Shiroya. Her demeanor hadn't changed, but she was aware of the situation."
    new "我转头向右，看看 Shiroya 怎么样了。她神色如常，却也知道眼下的局面。"

    # game/script.rpy:279
    old "By the time I turned back, the man on my left had nearly reached the door. It seemed he was taking the initiative despite his unenthused appearance."
    new "等我回过头，左边的男人已经快走到门口了。他看上去提不起兴致，倒先迈开了步子。"

    # game/script.rpy:280
    old "Rather, it was probably better to think of myself as lagging behind than him being proactive. I followed, motioning to Shiroya as I did. She approached me, still wearing her heavy-looking coat."
    new "与其说他积极，不如说是我落后了。我跟上去，一边朝 Shiroya 示意。她朝我走来，身上还穿着那件看上去很厚重的外套。"

    # game/script.rpy:287
    old "We found ourselves in a long hallway. We could see many doors lining each wall, some opened and connected by a decorative handrail. However, there were no traces of Naomi or the man."
    new "我们来到一条长长的走廊。两侧墙上排着许多门，有几扇敞开着，一道装饰扶手把各扇门连在一起。可是，Naomi 和那个男人都不见踪影。"

    # game/script.rpy:288
    old "The floor seemed pointlessly wide. Up to the end of the hall, I could see a number of security cameras hanging from the ceiling. As we started walking, unclear about where to go, I found it appropriate to try talking with Shiroya again."
    new "地面宽得有些莫名其妙。朝走廊尽头望去，天花板上悬着好几台监控摄像头。我们开始往前走，却不知道该往哪儿去，我觉得正好可以再和 Shiroya 说说话。"

    # game/script.rpy:294
    old "Are you feeling better?"
    new "你好些了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:299
    old "Oh... Yeah, I'm fine. Don't worry about it."
    new "哦……嗯，我没事。别在意。"

    # game/script.rpy:302
    old "...She continued walking, assuming that was the end of our exchange."
    new "……她大概觉得话已到此为止，继续往前走。"

    # game/script.rpy:303
    old "I tried to press it a bit further."
    new "我试着再追问一句。"

    # game/script.rpy:306
    old "...Do you regret coming?"
    new "……你后悔来这儿吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:311
    old "...No, of course not.{w} I'm seriously glad we're here. I mean it."
    new "……不，当然不后悔。{w}能来这里，我真的很高兴。我是认真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:312
    old "I know how you feel, okay? It's... the same for me. It doesn't help a lot to say it, but I don't want to see you sad."
    new "你的心情我明白，好吗？我也……一样。说出来未必有什么用，但我不想看你难过。"

    # game/script.rpy:317
    old "I'm here because I want to be, Atsuki. I'm okay. This is where I need to be right now. Sorry, I must look terrible."
    new "Atsuki，我是因为想来才来的。我没事。现在我就该待在这里。抱歉，我这副样子一定很难看。"

    # game/script.rpy:318
    old "She wasn't being very convincing."
    new "这话听着并不怎么让人信服。"

    # game/script.rpy:319
    old "...You know this isn't something you need to apologize for. Nothing about this is your fault."
    new "……你该知道，那件事没什么好道歉的。没有一处是你的错。"

    # game/script.rpy:324
    old "I'm... not so sure. I wish I didn't have to be a drag for you now."
    new "我……不太确定。真希望现在不是我拖累你。"

    # game/script.rpy:325
    old "H-Hey, come on. If you want to leave, we still can. Don't feel like you have to push yourself for my sake."
    new "喂、喂，别这样。你要是想走，我们现在也能走。别为了我勉强自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:331
    old "It's all right. Thank you.{w} Let's continue, though. I was the one who wanted to do this."
    new "没事的。谢谢你。{w}不过，我们继续走吧。当初想这么做的人是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:333
    old "Okay."
    new "好。"

    # game/script.rpy:338
    old "We'd hoped coming to the exhibition would be for the better. Once it was settled that we wouldn't back out, I looked around hesitantly until a voice calling for us came from the middle of the hallway, through an open door."
    new "我们原本希望来这个展览会能让情况好转。既然已经说好了不会打退堂鼓，我便迟疑地四下张望，直到走廊中段一扇敞开的门后传来喊我们的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:342
    old "You two, hurry up! The clock is ticking."
    new "你们两个，快一点！时间不等人。"

    # game/script.rpy:343
    old "Her unprofessional shout broke the silence and drew us forward."
    new "她这一嗓子谈不上专业，却打破了寂静，引得我们向前走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:347
    old "I saw her figure in a seemingly empty room. Through the other doors, there were cabinets covered by red cloths."
    new "我看见她站在一间看似空荡的屋里。透过另外几扇门，能看到盖着红布的展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:354
    old "Good, we're all finally here. Now we can start."
    new "好，人总算齐了。那就开始吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:360
    old "Once I went inside, I realized my initial impression had been wrong. The room would've been barren if it weren't for a single cabinet covered by a velvet curtain."
    new "走进去我才发现，先前的印象错了。屋里除了一个罩着天鹅绒遮布的展示柜，什么都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:367
    old "The black-haired man was there, yet again looking entirely aloof and fixing his eyes on the plain opposite wall."
    new "那个黑发男人也在，还是一副漠不关心的样子，眼睛盯着对面那面光秃秃的墙。"

    # game/script.rpy:370
    old "All right. It would be helpful if you could tell me your names since you know mine."
    new "好。既然你们知道我的名字，那也请告诉我你们叫什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:373
    old "While she said that, she closed the door we'd come through, and I took notice of the security camera in one of the corners, which was fitting for the place we were in. There was another closed door on the opposite wall, so we had fifteen minutes ahead of us where we would be shut inside."
    new "说着，她关上了我们进来的那扇门。我注意到角落里装着监控摄像头——这地方有这种东西倒也寻常。对面墙上还有一扇紧闭的门，也就是说，接下来的十五分钟，我们都要被关在这间屋里。"

    # game/script.rpy:378
    old "Naomi looked at me expectantly, probably because I'd been the one to speak earlier."
    new "Naomi 期待地看着我，大概是因为刚才开口的人是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:379
    old "Atsuki Hakutoki."
    new "Atsuki Hakutoki。"

    # game/script.rpy:384
    old "Shiroya Mirana."
    new "Shiroya Mirana。"

    # game/script.rpy:385
    old "Without being cajoled, Shiroya spoke her name. To my relief, she was looking directly at Naomi, and her posture was significantly less stiff than before."
    new "不用人催，Shiroya 便报上了名字。让我安心的是，她直视着 Naomi，姿态也比先前松弛了许多。"

    # game/script.rpy:388
    old "The black-haired man didn't respond immediately when we eyed him."
    new "我们看向那个黑发男人，他却没有立刻回应。"

    # game/script.rpy:389
    old "And your name?"
    new "还有你的名字？"

    # game/script.rpy:390
    old "...{w}Akaro.{w} Akaro Esata."
    new "……{w}Akaro。{w}Akaro Esata。"

    # game/script.rpy:391
    old "Perfect. Happy to meet the three of you."
    new "很好。很高兴见到你们三位。"

    # game/script.rpy:392
    old "It was hard to read him. He looked passive, but he must've been interested in the exhibition."
    new "我看不透他。他看上去无动于衷，可他对这场展览想必是有兴趣的。"

    # game/script.rpy:402
    old "Naomi moved aside and placed herself before the velvet curtain.{w} Then, she took out a keyring from her pocket as she got ready to begin the introduction."
    new "Naomi 走到一旁，站到天鹅绒遮布前。{w}接着，她从口袋里掏出一串钥匙，准备开始讲解。"

    # game/script.rpy:408
    old "As you might already know, what's behind this curtain is not to be taken lightly, and being the first public viewers is a bigger privilege than you might think."
    new "你们或许已经知道，这遮布后的东西不容小觑；能成为第一批公开参观的人，这份殊荣比你们想的更大。"

    # game/script.rpy:409
    old "What's being kept here is among the rarest pieces that we've ever seen, and it's only been two weeks since the discovery."
    new "放在这里的，是我们见过的最稀有的藏品之一，而从发现到现在才过了两周。"

    # game/script.rpy:410
    old "We estimate that the value of this cabinet's contents is immense. A proper appraisal has already occurred, but more estimates will come forth as everyone realizes just what we have on our hands."
    new "这柜子里的东西，价值难以估量。虽说已经做过正式鉴定，可等大家都看清它究竟是什么，只怕还得再估一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:415
    old "Part of the experience is the touch, so I will open the cabinet and let you experience it yourselves. However, I must insist that you be gentle and keep your hands inside the cabinet at all times."
    new "这次体验的一部分就是亲手触摸，所以我会打开展示柜，让你们自己感受。不过有件事我必须强调：动作要轻，手自始至终别伸出柜外。"

    # game/script.rpy:420
    old "We know, and don't need this introduction, so let's move along. You've been praising this find of yours in every advertisement. Let's see how your claims hold up."
    new "这些我们都清楚，用不着再介绍了，直接进入正题吧。你们在广告里把这东西吹得天花乱坠，倒要看看是不是在骗人。"

    # game/script.rpy:422
    old "Akaro's sudden input took us by surprise, but it made it clear that he did actually care about the event."
    new "Akaro 突然插话，让我们有些意外，不过这也说明他确实在意这次活动。"

    # game/script.rpy:423
    old "M-My apologies. Let's start, then."
    new "抱、抱歉。那我们开始吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:426
    old "Naomi put a small key into a lock on the left side of the cabinet and turned it."
    new "Naomi 把一把小钥匙插进展示柜左侧的锁孔，转动了一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:432
    old "Admittedly, all the build-up was making me slightly curious, but for all I knew, we were talking about a slightly shining rock, nothing that would ever interest me very much."
    new "平心而论，被这么一番铺垫，我也起了几分好奇。可说白了，那多半只是块会微微发亮的石头，引不起我多少兴趣。"

    # game/script.rpy:437
    old "Let's stop with the teasing. Here's what you've come here to see, named \"The Sekimeiya\"."
    new "别再卖关子了。这就是各位此行的目的，它名为『The Sekimeiya』。"

    # game/script.rpy:441
    old "With one hand, she grabbed the bottom of the curtain and began to raise it."
    new "她一只手抓住遮布下沿，缓缓将它掀起。"

    # game/script.rpy:444
    old "But even though my focus should've been on the cabinet, something else took priority."
    new "可我的注意力本该落在展示柜上，却偏偏被别的东西抢先夺走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:451
    old "When I was least expecting it, smoke rose instead of the curtain, accompanied by a familiar, putrid smell that invaded the room."
    new "就在我毫无防备之际，升起的不是遮布，而是浓烟；一股熟悉的腐臭随之弥漫开来，迅速充满了整个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:455
    old "Wha... What is this!?"
    new "这……这是什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:458
    old "Without bothering to ask myself questions, I tried to find Shiroya. At my right, I saw her face morphing into shock."
    new "我顾不上多想，立刻去找 Shiroya。她就在我右手边，我看见她脸上渐渐显出惊愕。"

    # game/script.rpy:459
    old "Atsuki... Wha..."
    new "Atsuki……怎么……"

    # game/script.rpy:464
    old "Her last word faded out quietly, and it was then when I realized that my consciousness was getting cloudy. All of a sudden, the only thing I could see was very dark smoke filling my field of vision. I couldn't believe it was happening again."
    new "她最后那个字轻轻消散，我这才意识到自己的意识正一点点模糊。转眼间，视野里只剩下浓黑的烟雾。我不敢相信，这种事竟然又发生了。"

    # game/script.rpy:466
    old "Naomi's hand had immediately released the curtain, and she was trying to steady herself while covering her nose. I couldn't find Akaro until I looked down and saw that he had already fallen to the floor."
    new "Naomi 的手当即松开遮布，她捂住鼻子，努力稳住身子。我一时找不到 Akaro，低头才看见他已经倒在地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:467
    old "The smoke filled up the entire room at once. In just a few seconds, my legs stopped responding, and every effort at getting my muscles to obey me met with failure."
    new "浓烟一下子充满了整个房间。不过几秒，我的双腿便不听使唤，无论怎么使劲，肌肉都不肯服从。"

    # game/script.rpy:473
    old "At last, my entire body gave up, and I plummeted down. Thanks to the view I had from the floor, I could see Shiroya's outcome had not been any different, and from the falling noise I heard, the same could be said for Naomi."
    new "终于，我浑身一软，重重栽倒在地。躺在那儿，我看见 Shiroya 也一样倒下了；听那声响，Naomi 想必也没能撑住。"

    # game/script.rpy:474
    old "Behind Shiroya was the door we'd come through. The smoke had covered the ceiling, so everything was dark. Amid the confusion, I was able to notice the lack of light under the door, something which should've been easily noticeable from where I was."
    new "Shiroya 身后就是我们进来的那扇门。烟雾遮住了天花板，四下昏暗。混乱之中，我仍注意到门缝下没有一丝光——从我当时的位置，这本该一眼就能看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:478
    old "After I ultimately accepted there was nothing I could do to salvage the situation, I had a few seconds where I could only think about what was going on. Our room and its surroundings were fully silent: I couldn't hear a thing despite what had happened, and I wasn't able to produce any noise."
    new "最终我认了命，知道局面已无可挽回，只能趁着那几秒钟想想究竟是怎么回事。房间内外一片死寂：出了这种事，我却什么都听不见，自己也发不出半点声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:479
    old "What the fuck had just happened? I was able to recognize how strange it was. Both doors had been closed, so I had no idea where the smoke came from."
    new "这他妈到底是怎么回事？我清楚这有多蹊跷。两扇门都关着，我根本想不到烟是从哪儿来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:480
    old "Knowing the smoke was blotting out our awareness, I realized it had been done deliberately, and there were many reasons I could come up with as to why, going off what we'd just been told."
    new "既然这烟能夺走我们的意识，那显然是有人刻意为之；结合刚才听到的那些话，我能想到的理由有不少。"

    # game/script.rpy:481
    old "As my remaining consciousness faded away, I could only hope I would quickly wake up to see Shiroya again. I wanted to pretend that I knew nothing would happen, but the images came back to me. ...Seeing that hole in the floor."
    new "残余的意识渐渐消散，我只盼着能快些醒来，再见到 Shiroya。我想装作自己笃定不会有事，可那些画面又浮现眼前。……地板上的那个洞。"

    # game/script.rpy:482
    old "My heartbeat slowed and became inaudible. I knew that resisting was completely futile, so I closed my eyes, hoping to fast-forward to being awake again. The thought of dying there was pathetic, but without a choice in the matter, I resigned myself to what was happening."
    new "心跳慢了下来，渐渐听不见了。我知道反抗毫无意义，便闭上眼睛，只盼能快进到苏醒的那一刻。想到自己可能死在这里，实在窝囊，可事到如今别无选择，我只能听天由命。"

    # game/script.rpy:489
    old "Before all my senses faded, the silence was broken by a loud alarm, which had taken a while to be broadcast after the appearance of the smoke. Further in the background, I briefly perceived a much fainter and rougher sound that I couldn't identify."
    new "就在所有感官彻底消退之前，一阵刺耳的警报划破了寂静——烟雾出现之后过了好一会儿，警报才响起来。更远的背景里，我隐约捕捉到另一种声音，微弱而粗粝，辨不出是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:491
    old "I lay on the floor of that smoky room with three other people, completely powerless and clueless."
    new "我躺在那间烟雾弥漫的房间里，身边还有另外三个人，全然无能为力，也毫无头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:498
    old "Soon after the alarm played, the darkness became absolute, and all my thoughts vanished."
    new "警报响过不久，四周彻底陷入黑暗，我的思绪也尽数消散。"

    # game/script.rpy:510
    old "Cave-in"
    new "坍塌"

    # game/script.rpy:525
    old "An indeterminate amount of time had passed. I was a complete mess, and a constant pain pounded against the interior of my skull."
    new "不知过了多久。我整个人狼狈不堪，颅骨内侧一阵接一阵地作痛。"

    # game/script.rpy:537
    old "Nothing had changed apart from the walls and ceiling, which had been tainted by the smoke."
    new "除了被烟熏黑的墙壁和天花板，一切都没有变。"

    # game/script.rpy:538
    old "As I confirmed that I was still in the event room, I tried to battle the intense headache mercilessly hammering me from the inside, focusing my vision in an attempt to spot Shiroya."
    new "确认自己还在活动室后，我强忍着脑袋里一阵阵狠狠锤击的剧痛，凝神寻找 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:542
    old "There she was, still on the floor. She hadn't moved since I'd blacked out."
    new "她就在那儿，仍躺在地上。从我昏过去起，她就没动过。"

    # game/script.rpy:543
    old "I used all the energy I could muster to try to rise, and after a few attempts, I was able to sit up."
    new "我拼尽全身力气想撑起身，试了几次，总算坐了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:544
    old "While I crawled to Shiroya, I looked behind me. As expected, Akaro's body still lay on the floor, but he was far from my first priority."
    new "我一边朝 Shiroya 爬去，一边回头看了一眼。果然，Akaro 仍躺在地上，可他远不是我首先要管的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:547
    old "I reached Shiroya and turned her to face me. Her eyes were half-open, and she seemed conscious, which was exactly what I needed to see."
    new "我爬到 Shiroya 身边，把她扳过来面向我。她双眼半睁，似乎还有意识——这正是我最想看到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:548
    old "Are y—*cough* *cough*"
    new "你没——*咳* *咳*"

    # game/script.rpy:549
    old "My sentence was cut off by dry coughing that took over my body. It seemed I had inhaled a bit of the smoke, but it might've meant that we hadn't been unconscious for a long time."
    new "话还没说完，一阵干咳便攫住了我。看来我吸进了一些烟——不过这也说明，我们昏过去的时间或许并不长。"

    # game/script.rpy:550
    old "Yes... I think so. *cough*"
    new "嗯……我想是吧。*咳*"

    # game/script.rpy:551
    old "Her eyes opened fully, and she tried to steady herself with an arm."
    new "她完全睁开眼，用一只手臂撑住身子。"

    # game/script.rpy:552
    old "That smoke... W-Was it...?"
    new "那阵烟……难、难道是……？"

    # game/script.rpy:553
    old "Maybe. Liste—*cough* {w}Listen. We'll find out what happened. Just stay there for a minute, okay? Do you feel okay?"
    new "也许吧。听我——*咳*{w}听我说。我们会弄清楚发生了什么。你先在那儿待一会儿，好吗？你感觉还好吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:554
    old "Y-Yes..."
    new "嗯……还好。"

    # game/script.rpy:555
    old "I could tell that she was barely keeping it together. She must've been afraid of the worst, just like I was, but that time we'd woken up safely."
    new "我看得出她几乎撑不住了。她一定和我一样，往最坏处想过，可这一次，我们好歹平安醒了过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:560
    old "I looked around me. It was a bizarre sight, and the disgusting smell was still present after the smoke had faded.{w} The room had been painted black. The curtain's beautiful red, the walls, the ceiling... They'd all been corrupted by an ugly, dark color, almost purple."
    new "我环顾四周。眼前的景象诡异至极，烟雾散去后，那股恶臭依然残留。{w}整个房间都被染成了黑色。遮布原本漂亮的红色，还有墙壁、天花板……全被一种难看的深色侵蚀，近乎发紫。"

    # game/script.rpy:561
    old "The floor, however, had not received the same treatment. It had become gray, but it was nowhere near the strong black that consumed the ceiling."
    new "地板却不一样。它变成了灰色，远没有天花板那种浓重的黑。"

    # game/script.rpy:562
    old "And there was something much more important that I quickly noticed."
    new "而我很快还注意到一件重要得多的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:563
    old "Naomi's gone... She's not here."
    new "Naomi 不见了……她不在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:564
    old "...What? Y-You're right. Wh-Where could she have gone?"
    new "……什么？你、你说得对。她、她能去哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:565
    old "The door's open."
    new "门开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:567
    old "The door opposite the one we'd entered was very slightly ajar. Naomi could've woken up and left through it, maybe to understand what had happened after seeing that we were still knocked out."
    new "我们进来的那扇门正对面，还有一扇门微微开着一条缝。Naomi 也许醒了过来，从那儿出去了——或许是见我们还昏着，想去弄清到底发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:568
    old "Even reaching that small conclusion took a lot out of me, but the headache was beginning to fade almost as quickly as it had come on."
    new "光是理出这么一点头绪，就已耗尽了我的心力，好在头痛来得急，退得也快。"

    # game/script.rpy:571
    old "I noticed our voices had woken Akaro, who still hadn't moved at all."
    new "我这才发觉，我们的说话声已经把 Akaro 吵醒了——他此前一直一动不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:573
    old "...Ugh."
    new "……唔。"

    # game/script.rpy:574
    old "What the... fuck is this?"
    new "这他妈是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:576
    old "He felt his face with his hand as he grimaced. Then, he slowly stood up and attempted to balance himself while perplexedly looking around him."
    new "他抬手摸了摸自己的脸，皱起眉头。随后慢慢站起身，一边努力稳住身体，一边困惑地环顾四周。"

    # game/script.rpy:581
    old "Hey, what is all this? You said Naomi's gone? What the fuck just happened...? I think a lot of smoke suddenly appeared out of nowhere, right? Did it knock us out?"
    new "喂，这到底是怎么回事？你说 Naomi 不见了？刚才到底他妈发生了什么……？我记得好像忽然凭空冒出好多烟，对吧？我们是被那烟弄晕的？"

    # game/script.rpy:582
    old "For the first time, he started a conversation with us. Before answering, I began to clean my face, as the smoke had created a sticky mask on it as well."
    new "这是他头一次主动跟我们搭话。我没有立刻回答，先擦起脸来——那烟雾也在我的脸上凝成了一层黏腻的薄膜。"

    # game/script.rpy:585
    old "I have no idea. But yes, th-that smoke must've had something in it that made us fall unconscious."
    new "我完全不知道。不过没错，那、那烟里肯定掺了什么，才让我们失去意识的。"

    # game/script.rpy:586
    old "And a few seconds before I fainted, a very loud alarm went off."
    new "而且在我昏过去前几秒，传来一阵很响的警报声。"

    # game/script.rpy:591
    old "An alarm? I must've fallen unconscious too fast. All I remember is getting dizzy as hell out of nowhere and falling over."
    new "警报？那我大概是晕得太快了。我只记得突然间头晕得要命，接着就栽倒了。"

    # game/script.rpy:592
    old "...I don't think I heard it either. Did it say anything?"
    new "……我好像也没听见。它有说什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:593
    old "No, it was only a loud sound."
    new "没有，只是很响的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:596
    old "While I was still attempting to stand up, Akaro walked to the open door and looked through it."
    new "我还在地上试着站起来，Akaro 已经走到敞开的那扇门前，探头往外看。"

    # game/script.rpy:599
    old "Oh... What the hell happened here?{w} It's dark in this room, but the hallway is too. The walls and ceiling are black, and I can't see anyone. The whole hallway's covered. How much smoke was there?"
    new "噢……这里到底出了什么事？{w}房间里很暗，走廊也一样。墙壁和天花板都黑了，一个人也看不见。整条走廊都被熏遍了。这得有多少烟啊？"

    # game/script.rpy:600
    old "Everyone must've evacuated when they heard the alarm, even though it came a bit after the smoke appeared."
    new "大家应该都是听到警报就疏散了吧，虽然警报比烟雾出现得晚了些。"

    # game/script.rpy:601
    old "...Did you see where the smoke came from? I didn't see anything, and there's nothing here."
    new "……你看到烟是从哪儿冒出来的吗？我什么都没看到，这里也没有任何东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:602
    old "N-No, but you're right. It surrounded us in an instant, and it probably appeared in this room and in the hallways at the same time."
    new "没、没有，不过你说得对。它一瞬间就把我们包围了，恐怕是同时出现在这个房间和几条走廊里的。"

    # game/script.rpy:603
    old "Both of these doors were closed, so the origin had to have been here. Something must've happened while we were unconscious."
    new "两扇门当时都关着，所以源头只能在这里。我们昏迷的时候一定出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:604
    old "Why are we alone, though? There were police officers outside. Why haven't they come?"
    new "可为什么只有我们在这儿？外面明明有警察。他们怎么没过来？"

    # game/script.rpy:607
    old "I had no idea.{w} Still a bit disoriented, I forced my neck to turn. The only thing in the room was the covered cabinet. However, I doubted the Sekimeiya would still be there. The easiest conclusion to reach was that the smoke had been part of an attack designed to steal it."
    new "我也答不上来。{w}我还有些恍惚，硬是扭过头去。房间里只有那个盖着遮布的展示柜。可我不觉得 Sekimeiya 还会在里面。最容易想到的结论是：那阵烟雾是袭击的一部分，目的就是偷走它。"

    # game/script.rpy:612
    old "The smoke wasn't released in the other rooms in the hallway."
    new "走廊上其他房间并没有冒出烟来。"

    # game/script.rpy:613
    old "Everything was giving me a surreal vibe. I had no idea what was going on, but at first glance, the danger seemed to have faded away."
    new "眼前的一切都透着一种不真实感。我完全不知道发生了什么，但乍看之下，危险似乎已经退去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:616
    old "My headache was nearly gone, thankfully. That meant that I could start thinking things through. {w}What had happened? Why had it happened? How was I going to find the person responsible?"
    new "所幸头痛几乎已经消失，这意味着我可以开始把事情理清楚了。{w}发生了什么？为什么会发生？我又要怎么找出该为此负责的人？"

    # game/script.rpy:617
    old "Maybe I was just trying to distract myself from reality by thinking things like that, but I had a personal stake in it. I couldn't forgive whoever was responsible."
    new "也许想这些只是我在逃避现实，但这件事与我切身相关。不管是谁做的，我都无法原谅。"

    # game/script.rpy:618
    old "Shiroya probably felt the same way. We couldn't just ignore it, and someone was missing."
    new "Shiroya 大概也是同样的想法。这件事不能就这么算了，而且还有一个人下落不明。"

    # game/script.rpy:621
    old "The room was empty, and it had been empty before we'd fallen unconscious. Only the cabinet had been with us, but if the smoke had come out of it, it wouldn't have surrounded us so fast.{w} We had been stained, but not as much on the lower parts of our bodies. The ceiling was significantly darkened, the floor not so much. The smoke's density was low."
    new "房间里空无一物，我们昏迷之前也是这样。我们身边只有那个展示柜；可如果烟是从柜子里冒出来的，不可能这么快就把我们团团围住。{w}我们身上都沾上了烟渍，但下半身要少得多。天花板明显变黑了，地板却没有那么严重。说明烟的密度并不高。"

    # game/script.rpy:622
    old "...Did that mean that the origin of the smoke had been the very center of the room? How did that make any sense?"
    new "……那是不是说，烟的源头就在房间正中央？可这根本说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:623
    old "Shiroya staggered slightly. I reached out to try and hold her shoulder, but as my body was still recovering, both of us fell back to the floor."
    new "Shiroya 晃了一下。我伸手去扶她的肩，可我的身体还没恢复，结果两个人一起摔回了地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:626
    old "Without looking at us, Akaro walked to the door we'd entered through."
    new "Akaro 看都没看我们一眼，径自朝我们进来的那扇门走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:631
    old "It happened here too."
    new "这边也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:632
    old "...Yeah. When I fell to the floor, I noticed there was no light below that door. Given how dark the room had become, I thought the hallway must've been just as dark. ...The smoke was released at the same time, even though both places looked empty."
    new "……嗯。我倒在地上的时候，注意到那扇门底下一点光都没有。房间里已经这么暗，我想走廊肯定也一样。……烟是同时冒出来的，可这两处看上去都空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:637
    old "...What the fuck is this about? That woman disappeared, but she fell unconscious too, didn't she? And you're right. Why is no one else here?"
    new "……这他妈到底是怎么回事？那女人不见了，可她不也一样昏过去了吗？还有，你说得对，为什么这里没有别人？"

    # game/script.rpy:643
    old "Although those points were very strange, I was still relieved that none of us had been harmed. I lay on the floor for a bit, attempting to gather more strength.{w} When thoughts came to me, it was calming to realize that they were different from what had recently filled my head."
    new "这些疑点虽然十分蹊跷，但至少我们谁都没有受伤，这让我松了口气。我在原地躺了一会儿，想多攒些力气。{w}等思绪重新浮起来，我竟觉得安心——它们与近来盘踞在我脑中的东西截然不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:644
    old "This room connects two parallel hallways, which were attacked alongside this room all at once. Was this done to isolate us?"
    new "这个房间连接着两条平行的走廊，那两条走廊和这个房间同时遭到了袭击。这样做是为了把我们孤立起来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:645
    old "Someone attacked the building to steal the Sekimeiya, right? That must've been the intention. The smoke formed an easy path for whoever had planned it to make their way here, obtain the Sekimeiya, and leave."
    new "有人袭击了这栋楼，为的是偷走 Sekimeiya——大概就是这样。烟雾为策划者铺出一条通路，让他能一路来到这里，取走 Sekimeiya，再离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:646
    old "It sounds like a messy, risky plan, but it's the obvious thing that comes to mind. The open door seems to back it up, even though Naomi must have left through one anyway."
    new "听起来是个混乱又冒险的计划，却也是最容易想到的。敞开的那扇门似乎也印证了这一点，尽管 Naomi 反正是要从某扇门离开的。"

    # game/script.rpy:647
    old "Do I have to conclude that Naomi was part of this, and while we were out, she took the Sekimeiya and left? ...Making herself look suspicious immediately? Being a staff member, she'd know many things about the security system... and we were the first group to enter, meaning out of us four, she was the only one that wasn't part of the first visit coincidentally."
    new "难道我只能断定 Naomi 也牵涉其中，趁我们昏迷时拿走 Sekimeiya 离开？……她这样一来，不就立刻让自己显得可疑了吗？身为工作人员，她对安保系统了解得不少……而我们又是第一批进入的人，也就是说，四个人里只有她参加第一次参观并非偶然。"

    # game/script.rpy:648
    old "Or, I could say that if I knew Akaro at all. I did think he looked distant from everything else."
    new "又或者，如果我真了解 Akaro 的话——我确实觉得他对周围的一切都漠不关心。"

    # game/script.rpy:651
    old "Maybe Akaro was aware of the fact the smoke would appear. He could have immediately faked his unconsciousness by throwing himself to the floor, knowing he would avoid breathing in anything from the upper half of the room. The fact the floor is barely stained proves the smoke never came down."
    new "也许 Akaro 早就知道会有烟雾出现。他可以立刻扑倒在地，装作昏过去，因为他清楚这样就能避开房间上半部的烟。地板几乎没有被熏黑，正说明烟从未沉到下面来。"

    # game/script.rpy:652
    old "Once we're all out of it, he obtains the Sekimeiya.{w} I should also consider that the smoke first arose shortly after Naomi unlocked the cabinet. This doesn't mean much, given that she could have had her key taken after she was unconscious, but if whoever did this didn't know much about the cabinet's mechanism, it makes sense they waited until it was unlocked."
    new "等我们都失去意识，他就能把 Sekimeiya 弄到手。{w}我还得考虑另一种可能：烟雾是在 Naomi 打开展示柜后不久才出现的。这一点说明不了太多——毕竟她的钥匙也可能是在昏迷后被人取走的；不过，如果下手的人对展示柜的构造不甚了解，那么等到柜子被打开再行动就说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:653
    old "But how did they know exactly when that was? Doesn't this mean that they must've been inside the room? Or, again, doesn't this mean that only Akaro could've done it? Assuming this precise timing actually happened... how did he trigger the smoke? It could simply be that he gave some sort of signal to someone else outside, but phones aren't allowed here."
    new "可他们怎么知道那是什么时候？这不就意味着，他们当时必定就在房间里？或者说，只有 Akaro 才做得到？倘若时机真的如此精准……那他又是怎么触发烟雾的？也可能只是他给外面的某个人发了什么信号，但这里不允许带手机。"

    # game/script.rpy:654
    old "After we regained consciousness, he seemed to be perfectly fine physically. However, the mass difference between his body and our nineteen-year-old ones is significant. It makes sense that the substance had a somewhat weaker effect on him."
    new "我们醒来之后，他身体看上去毫无异样。不过，他的体格与我们这些十九岁的人相差不少。那种药物对他的作用稍弱一些，倒也说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:657
    old "Is Akaro in possession of the Sekimeiya right now, or did he leave it somewhere? If so, why did he come back? Only to avoid suspicion? But this doesn't explain Naomi's disappearance. And how did the smoke appear, or why did the alarm sound late? And what kind of risky plan is this?"
    new "Sekimeiya 现在在 Akaro 手上吗，还是被他藏到了别处？如果是后者，他为什么还要回来？只为洗脱嫌疑？可这解释不了 Naomi 的失踪。还有，烟是怎么出现的，警报为什么迟了？这又算哪门子的冒险计划？"

    # game/script.rpy:658
    old "I grimaced. I was getting carried away without realizing how far I was going. In the first place, it was ridiculous to suspect anyone until I had information."
    new "我皱紧了眉。我想得越来越远，自己却浑然不觉。说到底，在掌握情报之前就去怀疑谁，实在荒唐。"

    # game/script.rpy:659
    old "But I knew. I could never let things remain as they were. Someone was responsible, and I wouldn't let them get away. I only had to bide my time."
    new "但我心里清楚。事情不能就这样维持原状。总有人要为此负责，而我绝不会让他逃掉。我只需等待时机。"

    # game/script.rpy:660
    old "Before I could stand, I realized there was another avenue open to me. There was a security camera on the ceiling."
    new "还没等我站起来，我就意识到自己还有另一条路可走。天花板上装着监控摄像头。"

    # game/script.rpy:664
    old "If someone was looking at the footage and the smoke came out of an automated system, this would make a lot more sense. However, Akaro could've simply been the one to wait for the automated smoke and then followed up with whatever plan they had. This must've happened during the first visit for a reason."
    new "如果有人一直在看监控画面，而烟雾又是自动系统放出来的，那事情就合理多了。不过，也可能只是 Akaro 等系统自动放出烟雾，再顺势执行他们的计划。这件事偏偏发生在首次参观期间，一定有原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:665
    old "It means that whoever was looking at the direct footage would've been the one to activate the smoke system."
    new "也就是说，看着实时画面的人，就是启动烟雾系统的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:666
    old "...{w}I was doing it again, almost like a coping mechanism. I had to make sure Shiroya was really okay before anything else."
    new "……{w}我又开始这样了，几乎像是一种自我安抚。无论如何，我得先确认 Shiroya 真的没事。"

    # game/script.rpy:670
    old "When I attempted to lift my head, my body thankfully obeyed. I stared at the curtain that concealed the so-called Sekimeiya. It was dark, and the substance the smoke was composed of had dried up on it."
    new "我试着抬起头，身体总算还听使唤。我望着那块遮着所谓 Sekimeiya 的遮布。遮布已经发黑，烟雾凝结成的物质在上面干结成了块。"

    # game/script.rpy:671
    old "...Can you stand up?"
    new "……你站得起来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:672
    old "I think so."
    new "应该可以。"

    # game/script.rpy:677
    old "Supporting each other, Shiroya and I slowly steadied ourselves. Then, I realized Akaro had gone to the hallway."
    new "我和 Shiroya 互相搀扶着，慢慢站稳了身子。这时我才发现，Akaro 已经往走廊那边去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:678
    old "Finally! Thank goodness!"
    new "总算醒了！谢天谢地！"

    # game/script.rpy:687
    old "A shout came from the same area. It was a feminine voice, which at least indicated we weren't alone."
    new "同一个方向传来一声喊叫。那是个女人的声音，至少说明这里还有别人。"

    # game/script.rpy:691
    old "We walked to it slowly as I wiped more of the solidified substance off of myself. I was curious to see if the Sekimeiya was still in the cabinet, but we would find that out very soon regardless."
    new "我一边擦掉身上更多凝固的污物，一边慢慢朝那边走去。我也想知道 Sekimeiya 是否还在展示柜里，不过答案很快就会揭晓。"

    # game/script.rpy:702
    old "The hallway was almost as dark as the room. The smoke had coated every light bulb, but since there were many of them, some light could make it past the barrier."
    new "走廊几乎和房间一样昏暗。烟雾裹住了每一只灯泡，但灯泡为数众多，总有些光能透过那层遮蔽。"

    # game/script.rpy:703
    old "The smoke had created a thorough cover on the walls and ceilings, which must've been an intended result. It had set up a dark environment, but that couldn't be the sole purpose: something had been added to the smoke to create the same effect on every surface it touched."
    new "烟雾在墙壁和天花板上留下了厚厚一层覆盖，这想必是刻意为之。它营造出一片昏暗，但这显然不是唯一的目的：烟雾里掺了东西，凡是它接触到的表面，都会产生同样的效果。"

    # game/script.rpy:704
    old "Close to the start of the hallway, near the door Naomi had first appeared through, I saw human figures. Our approaching footsteps were noticed by one, and it rose from its knees."
    new "走廊入口附近，也就是 Naomi 最初出现的那扇门旁，我看见了人影。我们的脚步声被其中一人察觉，那人从跪姿站了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:712
    old "We got closer and saw two more people kneeling down. Akaro was with them, and after finally arriving where they were, I noticed a small body on the floor."
    new "走近些，又看见两个人跪在那里。Akaro 也在其中。等我们终于走到他们身边，我才发现地上躺着一个小小的身影。"

    # game/script.rpy:713
    old "Isla's finally waking up. Thank God."
    new "Isla 终于醒了。谢天谢地。"

    # game/script.rpy:721
    old "That woman was the person we'd heard. She had the little girl on her lap and was looking at her closed eyes with concern."
    new "方才那声喊叫就是她发出的。她把小女孩抱在膝上，忧心地注视着她紧闭的双眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:727
    old "I see. So, you three were also unable to evacuate."
    new "原来如此。这么说，你们三个也没能撤出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:728
    old "The person who had stood up was a well-dressed old man. As he said that, the two kneeling people turned their heads to face us."
    new "站起来的是位衣着考究的老人。他说这话时，跪着的两人转头看向我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:729
    old "But the words \"unable to evacuate\" were more ominous than I'd expected, especially due to his rough voice."
    new "可「没能撤出去」这几个字，比我预想的更叫人不寒而栗——尤其是从他沙哑的嗓音里说出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:734
    old "Is she okay?"
    new "她没事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:735
    old "I... I think so. She's finally breathing fine."
    new "我……我想她应该没事。她总算能好好喘气了。"

    # game/script.rpy:736
    old "Shiroya sat next to the others and worriedly looked at the girl who'd been called Isla. Next to them was a guy my age, who was staring at the girl in silence."
    new "Shiroya 在几人身边坐下，忧心忡忡地看着那个叫 Isla 的女孩。旁边还有个和我年纪相仿的男人，一言不发地盯着女孩。"

    # game/script.rpy:743
    old "Smoke appeared out of nowhere and knocked us out. Do you know what happened?"
    new "烟雾不知从哪儿冒出来，把我们全弄晕了。你知道这是怎么回事吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:748
    old "...I'm afraid I don't.{w} You were in the event room, right? Shouldn't another woman be with you?"
    new "……这我恐怕不清楚。{w}你们当时在活动室吧？不是还有一位女士和你们在一起吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:753
    old "Naomi, yes. She was gone when we woke up."
    new "Naomi，对。我们醒来时她已经不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:758
    old "Despite the dim light, I was able to discern his frown."
    new "光线虽暗，我还是看得出他皱起了眉。"

    # game/script.rpy:761
    old "I'm pretty sure she passed out too, but the door to the other hallway was open when we woke up."
    new "她肯定也昏过去了，可我们醒来时，另一条走廊的门是开着的。"

    # game/script.rpy:766
    old "...She left while you were still unconscious? That's strange. I inspected this floor a bit and didn't find her."
    new "……她趁你们昏迷时离开了？奇怪。我大致查过这一层，没找到她。"

    # game/script.rpy:767
    old "Is that strange? Maybe she exited the building entirely."
    new "这有什么奇怪的？也许她直接出了大楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:769
    old "When his look lowered again, I realized there was something very important that we were missing. Why was nobody else there? Why had the unconscious child not been taken outside, at the very least?"
    new "他再次垂下目光时，我意识到我们漏了一件至关重要的事。为什么这里没有别人？至少，为什么没人把昏迷的孩子带到外面去？"

    # game/script.rpy:774
    old "She couldn't have left. If she fell unconscious like the rest of you, she still has to be here."
    new "她不可能离开。如果她像你们一样昏了过去，那她一定还在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:779
    old "What?"
    new "什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:780
    old "The man didn't answer immediately, so I took that time to look him over. Due to the lighting, I'd just gotten the impression that he was a simple well-dressed old man, but those weren't casual clothes."
    new "男人没有立刻回答，我便趁这段时间打量他。因为光线昏暗，我先前只觉得他是个衣着得体的普通老人，可那身衣服并不是普通的便装。"

    # game/script.rpy:785
    old "Did all of you hear the alarm that played throughout the building? After I heard it, I saw all the smoke."
    new "楼里响过的警报，你们都听见了吧？我听到警报之后，就看见到处是烟。"

    # game/script.rpy:786
    old "Those words made me consider an important detail. His shirt was white and a lot less stained than ours, indicating that it hadn't been hit by the smoke during its release. In contrast, the woman and the other guy had the same smoke pattern we did, being more stained on their top halves."
    new "这番话让我留意到一个重要细节。他的衬衫是白色的，污迹比我们少得多，说明烟雾喷出时并没有沾到他身上。相比之下，那女人和另一个男人身上的痕迹与我们一样，上半身沾得更多。"

    # game/script.rpy:791
    old "I am responsible for this building's security system. When the smoke appeared, I was in the security room, found in the other hallway."
    new "这栋楼的安保系统由我负责。烟雾出现时，我在监控室——就在另一条走廊上。"

    # game/script.rpy:792
    old "Since today was a special day, most of the visitors were in the lobby awaiting their turn for the event, so they had no problem leaving safely when they saw the smoke. You might know that this tower has many floors, but only this one is open to the public, and no one was on the higher levels."
    new "今天是个特殊的日子，多数来客都在大厅等候活动开始，所以一看到烟雾就顺利疏散了。你们或许知道，这座塔有很多层，但只有这一层对外开放，楼上并没有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:793
    old "It was a big shock to see all that smoke, so I panicked and spent a while in the security room trying to figure out what had happened. When I realized I couldn't get anywhere, I exited and began searching through this floor. It seems you all were the first two groups of three for today's event."
    new "看到那满楼的烟，我一时慌了神，在监控室里待了好一阵，想弄清究竟出了什么事。等发现毫无头绪，我才走出来，开始在这一层搜寻。看来你们就是今天活动的前两组，每组三个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:799
    old "Yes. We were told to wait here after the first group moved forward."
    new "是的。第一组进去之后，我们就被告知在这里等候。"

    # game/script.rpy:800
    old "Oh, that's right. I remember seeing her earlier, now that I look at her closer."
    new "哦，对了。凑近一看，我想起之前见过她。"

    # game/script.rpy:801
    old "I also recalled seeing the three of them behind us in the lobby. I was still trying to understand the older man's words, though, as he had said the security room was in the other hallway. At the same time, we cleaned the rest of the smoke off our bodies until only a few traces remained."
    new "我也想起来了，在大厅时他们三个就排在我们后面。不过，我还在琢磨老人的话——他说监控室在另一条走廊上。与此同时，我们把身上剩下的烟渍也擦掉了，只留下浅浅几道痕迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:807
    old "You said you saw the smoke, but your clothes are much cleaner than ours. Did it not hit you?"
    new "你说你看见了烟雾，可你的衣服比我们干净多了。难道没沾到你身上？"

    # game/script.rpy:808
    old "That's right. I didn't leave the room while it was in the hallway. When I said I saw the smoke, I was talking about the security cameras."
    new "没错。走廊里满是烟的时候，我并没有出房间。我说看见烟，是指从监控画面上看到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:809
    old "Oh, I see."
    new "哦，原来如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:810
    old "...So, he was the person I'd just accused in my head."
    new "……原来我刚才在心里冤枉的就是他。"

    # game/script.rpy:815
    old "I wasn't able to figure anything out through the cameras, unfortunately. When I left a few minutes later, I saw all the walls were black."
    new "可惜，我从监控里什么也没看出来。几分钟后我出门时，只见到处墙壁都是黑的。"

    # game/script.rpy:817
    old "I knew he was slowly giving me information, so I didn't want to interrupt him. However, more questions were coming to my mind, such as why he hadn't come across our group first."
    new "看得出他在一点点透露信息，我不想打断他。可心里冒出的疑问越来越多，比如他为什么没有先遇到我们这一组。"

    # game/script.rpy:818
    old "Wait, you saw what the hallway looked like after you left the security room? Don't you have enough security cameras to see it from there?"
    new "等等，你是出了监控室之后才看到走廊变成什么样？监控室里的摄像头不是足够看清楚吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:819
    old "I couldn't help myself from asking for details. The more I tried to coast through things, the more I resisted it. I needed to know as much as possible."
    new "我忍不住追问细节。越是想要敷衍过去，心里就越抗拒——我必须尽可能多了解情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:824
    old "No. The thing is, they became useless after the smoke appeared. It instantly covered the lens of every camera that was hit by it."
    new "不。问题在于，烟雾一出现，它们就派不上用场了。凡是沾到烟的摄像头，镜头转眼就被糊住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:825
    old "...That makes sense. It must be why the smoke created this film on every surface it touched. It worked to disable the cameras."
    new "……这就说得通了。烟雾之所以在接触到的每样东西上留下一层膜，就是为了让摄像头失灵。"

    # game/script.rpy:826
    old "Yes. While I was there, I had no way to know what was happening in the hallways or in the event room. I took my time to look at the footage of all the other rooms, but I didn't see anything suspicious at all. No people, either."
    new "对。我待在监控室里时，完全不知道走廊和活动室里发生了什么。我把其他所有房间的录像都慢慢看了一遍，却没发现任何可疑之处，也没看到人。"

    # game/script.rpy:831
    old "...But I should get into what's most important. The alarm that played wasn't your usual emergency alarm. It was one that hadn't played before."
    new "……不过，先说最要紧的事。刚才响起的并不是平常那种紧急警报，而是一种从未响过的警报。"

    # game/script.rpy:836
    old "I said that I stayed in the security room out of panic, but that's not all. Even if I'd left, it would've been pointless. One of the special functions of the alarm is to shut down all methods of escape. This means that we have no way to leave this building, and that people outside can't enter."
    new "我说过，我是慌了才留在监控室，但原因不止于此。就算当时离开，也没有意义。那个警报的特殊功能之一，就是封锁所有逃生手段。也就是说，我们没法离开这栋楼，外面的人也进不来。"

    # game/script.rpy:842
    old "...Although I'd been kind of anticipating those words, it was still a heavy blow. Shiroya and I looked at each other. It seemed everything insisted on getting worse."
    new "……虽然我隐约已有预感，这话听着仍是不小的打击。我和 Shiroya 面面相觑。看来一切偏要往更糟的方向去。"

    # game/script.rpy:845
    old "Hang on, hang on. What the fuck? We're trapped in here? How long does it close the exit for? Why!? And is there no way to undo it or contact the outside!?"
    new "等等，等等。搞什么鬼？我们被困在这儿了？出口要封多久？为什么！？就没办法解除，也没法和外面联系吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:850
    old "...It closes all the exit routes for twelve hours. The reason as to why is a bit complicated, and for our purposes, confidential. I'm sorry, but I can't get into that."
    new "……所有出口会封闭十二个小时。至于原因，说来有些复杂，而且按规定属于机密。抱歉，这一点我不能细说。"

    # game/script.rpy:855
    old "As for a way to contact the outside, there should be one. We can try it."
    new "至于联络外面的方法，应该是有的。可以试一试。"

    # game/script.rpy:860
    old "Shiroya wasn't faring well, and Akaro seemed to be in complete disbelief at what he was hearing."
    new "Shiroya 的脸色不太好，Akaro 则似乎完全不敢相信自己听到的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:863
    old "...Hey."
    new "……喂。"

    # game/script.rpy:865
    old "...It's going to be fine. Okay?"
    new "……不会有事的。好吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:870
    old "Yeah. Yeah, okay."
    new "嗯。嗯，好。"

    # game/script.rpy:878
    old "I turned back to the others. Barring Akaro, none of them seemed very surprised about the situation."
    new "我转身看向其他人。除了 Akaro，其他人都没显得多意外。"

    # game/script.rpy:879
    old "Is this not a shock for you?"
    new "你们就不觉得震惊吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:880
    old "I already told them. Getting Isla out of here would normally have been the first thing any of us would have done."
    new "我已经跟他们说过了。换作平常，我们任何人第一个念头都是把 Isla 带出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:881
    old "It didn't seem like the type of building to have medical equipment stored in it, so the woman must have immediately tried to extract who I could only assume was her daughter."
    new "这栋楼不像是会存放医疗设备的地方，所以她当时一定立刻想把那个女孩带出去——我只能猜那是她女儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:882
    old "There was no reason to think that some secret entrance existed, so I more or less had to assume that we really were trapped for half a day. The existence of such an alarm seemed absurd, but it also might've succeeded at trapping whoever'd been responsible for the smoke."
    new "没有理由认为存在什么秘密通道，我也只能认为，我们确实要被关在这里半天。这种警报的存在显得荒唐，不过它或许也确实困住了放出烟雾的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:889
    old "S-So, you're right, Naomi still has to be here.{w} And is that everyone? I get that most people were in the lobby, but if someone else entered the hallways, they couldn't have evacuated either."
    new "那、那么，你说得对，Naomi 肯定还在这里。{w} 在这里的人就这些了吗？大部分人当时在大厅，这我明白，可要是有人进了走廊，也一样没法撤离吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:890
    old "Is it possible the smoke in the hallway wasn't as dense, which gave people time to run from it before the alarm went off?"
    new "走廊里的烟雾会不会没那么浓，让人能在警报响起前跑开？"

    # game/script.rpy:891
    old "No, that can't be."
    new "不，不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:898
    old "The guy who'd remained quiet finally spoke."
    new "一直沉默的那个人终于开口了。"

    # game/script.rpy:899
    old "We were right here when the smoke appeared. The moment we inhaled a bit of it, we were out like a light. We pretty much collapsed instantly."
    new "烟雾出现的时候我们就在这儿。才吸进一点，就什么都不知道了。几乎是当场倒下。"

    # game/script.rpy:900
    old "I see. Then I couldn't tell you."
    new "原来如此。那我就说不准了。"

    # game/script.rpy:904
    old "...From what I could see from there, the other rooms in the hallway were clean. If someone had been in one, they were definitely trapped too. I could recall that the alarm played approximately twenty seconds after the smoke's appearance, but it was unlikely that had been enough time for it to entirely dissipate."
    new "……从我当时所在的位置看过去，走廊里其余的房间都是干净的。要是有人在里面，也肯定一样被困住了。我记得烟雾出现大约二十秒后警报才响，但这点时间不足以让烟雾完全散去。"

    # game/script.rpy:912
    old "I-I can't believe what you're telling us. What the fuck does this mean? Why are we trapped here!?"
    new "我、我不敢相信你刚才说的。这他妈到底是什么意思？我们为什么会被困在这里！？"

    # game/script.rpy:917
    old "I sincerely apologize. I'm confused as well, but there's nothing I can tell you. We'll have to be here all day, but I'll try to figure out what happened. My name is Katei Kuiji."
    new "实在抱歉。我也很困惑，但能告诉你们的就这些了。我们怕是要在这里待上一整天，不过我会尽力查明发生了什么。我叫 Katei Kuiji。"

    # game/script.rpy:919
    old "It was ridiculous, but we couldn't do anything about it. After a period of silence where nobody knew how to react, the woman spoke."
    new "事情虽然荒唐，我们却无能为力。沉默了一阵，谁都不知道该怎么反应，那位女士开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:927
    old "She's Isla, my daughter. She's been unconscious since the smoke appeared, but her breathing's steadier now. I'm Erina."
    new "她是 Isla，我女儿。烟雾出现后她就一直昏迷，不过现在呼吸平稳些了。我叫 Erina。"

    # game/script.rpy:929
    old "...I'm Shiroya."
    new "……我叫 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:930
    old "And my name's Atsuki. We came here together. ...How old is she?"
    new "我叫 Atsuki。我们是一起来的。……她多大了？"

    # game/script.rpy:931
    old "She'll be ten in a bit more than a week. Her birthday is two days before Christmas."
    new "再过一个多星期她就十岁了。生日是圣诞节前两天。"

    # game/script.rpy:932
    old "Realizing the rest of his group had introduced themselves, the guy followed."
    new "见同伴都报了名字，那个人也跟着开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:933
    old "I'm Sai."
    new "我叫 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:941
    old "We looked back at the man separated from us."
    new "我们回头看向那个离我们有些距离的男人。"

    # game/script.rpy:946
    old "Akaro."
    new "Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:959
    old "Immediately, the silence returned. What the hell had happened? I thought back on the wordless alarm that had locked us in. It communicated zero information, seemingly only designed to tell us that we'd been trapped."
    new "四周立刻又安静下来。到底发生了什么事？我回想起那道把我们锁在里面的警报。它没透露任何信息，似乎只是为了告诉我们：我们被困住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:960
    old "It made sense if the culprit was one of us, but not even the staff member who was still there had any idea who it could have been, which made things difficult."
    new "如果犯人就藏在我们之中，那倒说得通，可就连还留在这里的那位职员也毫无头绪，这就麻烦了。"

    # game/script.rpy:961
    old "And the target of the attack... It had to be the Sekimeiya. There was no way it wasn't related. The very first showing of a newly-discovered gemstone being interrupted meant only one thing."
    new "至于袭击的目标……只能是 Sekimeiya。不可能与它无关。一颗新发现的宝石首次公开展示就被打断，只意味着一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:962
    old "We hadn't checked whether the Sekimeiya was still in the room, but it was confirmed that it was still in the building with us, even if it had been taken out of its cabinet."
    new "我们还没确认 Sekimeiya 是否仍在展室里，但已经确定它仍和我们同在这栋楼里——即便它被人从展示柜中取走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:963
    old "The attack had been deliberate. That was the most important point. Whoever was responsible, I wanted to find them out and expose them. It was deeply personal."
    new "这场袭击是蓄意的。这才是最关键的一点。不管下手的人是谁，我都要把他找出来、揭穿他。此事与我切身相关。"

    # game/script.rpy:968
    old "*cough*... *cough*"
    new "咳……咳……"

    # game/script.rpy:973
    old "We all glanced at Isla's pained face. After the second cough, she proceeded to slightly open her eyes."
    new "我们纷纷看向 Isla，她脸上露出痛苦的表情。第二声咳嗽之后，她的眼睛微微睁开了一条缝。"

    # game/script.rpy:976
    old "Isla! Finally! Are you okay? How do you feel?"
    new "Isla！你总算醒了！你没事吧？感觉怎么样？"

    # game/script.rpy:977
    old "Erina's sudden outburst seemed to confuse her daughter. She raised her head and blinked blearily at all of us."
    new "Erina 突然的呼喊似乎让女儿有些发懵。她抬起头，睡眼惺忪地眨着眼看我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:980
    old "Looking back at her mother, she coughed weakly again and spoke."
    new "她转头看向母亲，又虚弱地咳了一声，开口道。"

    # game/script.rpy:981
    old "Wh-Where are we...? What are we... d-doing here?"
    new "这、这是哪里……？我们……在、在这儿做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:982
    old "Her disorientation definitely wasn't helped by the fact that all the walls were stained black. Shiroya seemed like she wanted to say something, but she held back and let Erina speak."
    new "四周墙壁全被熏成黑色，无疑让她更加茫然。Shiroya 似乎想说些什么，却忍住了，让 Erina 先开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:985
    old "We're still inside Ashiya Tower. Do you remember all that smoke? It knocked us out, and you're the last one to wake up."
    new "我们还在芦屋塔里。你还记得那些烟吗？我们都被熏晕了，你是最后一个醒过来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:986
    old "Erina stroked Isla's hair gently, which seemed to soothe her."
    new "Erina 轻轻抚着 Isla 的头发，似乎让她安定了些。"

    # game/script.rpy:987
    old "Weren't we going to see the Sekimeiya? I'm trying to remember what happened after that, but I can't. Did we ever do that?"
    new "我们不是要去看 Sekimeiya 吗？后来发生了什么，我想回忆却怎么也想不起来。我们到底去看了没有？"

    # game/script.rpy:988
    old "No, sweetie. We were waiting for that in this very hallway when the smoke came out. Do you not remember?"
    new "没有哦，乖孩子。我们当时就在这条走廊上等着，烟就是那时候冒出来的。你不记得了？"

    # game/script.rpy:989
    old "Oh... smoke? I'm not sure... Is this that hallway? Why is everything black?"
    new "咦……烟？我不太记得……这里就是那条走廊吗？为什么到处都是黑的？"

    # game/script.rpy:990
    old "That's also the smoke's doing. It stained everything it touched."
    new "那也是烟造成的。凡是它碰过的东西，都被染黑了。"

    # game/script.rpy:991
    old "Shiroya finally spoke up. Isla seemed to realize that everyone else had faint black stains on their clothes, so she looked down at her own to find them almost completely clean. At her height, her head had been primarily affected, but Erina had evidently wiped off the remnants already."
    new "Shiroya 终于开口了。Isla 似乎这才发现，其他人衣服上都带着淡淡的黑色污迹，便低头看自己身上，却发现几乎干干净净。以她的身高，受波及的主要是头部，不过 Erina 显然已经替她把残留的污迹擦掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:992
    old "Do you feel okay? You've been out for a long time. I was really worried..."
    new "你感觉还好吗？你昏过去好久了，我一直很担心……"

    # game/script.rpy:996
    old "Sorry... I think I feel okay, but my head hurts."
    new "对不起……我觉得还好，就是头有点疼。"

    # game/script.rpy:997
    old "But why are we here? Why is there no light, and why are we alone?"
    new "可是我们为什么会在这里？为什么没有灯，又为什么只有我们几个？"

    # game/script.rpy:998
    old "We all looked at each other, and for a few seconds, nobody knew how to answer. Katei quickly decided it was his job to do so."
    new "我们面面相觑，有那么几秒，谁也不知道该怎么回答。Katei 很快决定由他来回答。"

    # game/script.rpy:999
    old "We're not aware of what caused the smoke, but it must've triggered a special alarm that shut down all entrance and exit methods. That means that we will have to stay here for the next twelve hours, and it's possible there's only eight of us who didn't evacuate in time."
    new "烟是怎么来的，我们也不清楚，但它一定触发了某种特殊警报，把所有的出入口都封住了。也就是说，接下来十二个小时我们只能待在这里；而且很可能只有我们八个人没来得及疏散。"

    # game/script.rpy:1000
    old "We all slightly lowered our heads, unsure whether his abrupt explanation had been a good idea to direct at a kid who had just woken up."
    new "我们都微微低下了头，不确定他这番突兀的解释，对一个刚醒来的孩子来说是否妥当。"

    # game/script.rpy:1001
    old "Isla processed that information in silence for a minute. I didn't expect she'd take it well."
    new "Isla 沉默了一阵，把这些话在心里慢慢过了一遍。我本以为她会承受不住。"

    # game/script.rpy:1002
    old "But against my own prediction, she passively tossed out some words in response."
    new "可出乎我的预料，她只是淡淡地抛出一句话来。"

    # game/script.rpy:1005
    old "Oh... I see... What are we going to do until then?"
    new "哦……这样啊……那在那之前，我们要做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:1006
    old "I was relieved that she hadn't reacted badly. Telling a kid something like that could've gone much worse."
    new "她没有闹起来，我松了口气。那种话对一个孩子说出口，反应再糟也不奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:1013
    old "...Sadly, there's not much to do here. This first floor is filled with exhibition rooms, and it's officially called the \"crystal floor\" in reference to all the gems. The upper floors are nothing but offices, and I'm afraid they're as uninteresting as they sound."
    new "……可惜，这里没什么可做的。这一层全是水晶展室，因为陈列着各色宝石，正式名称叫「水晶层」。楼上清一色是办公室，恐怕就和听起来一样无趣。"

    # game/script.rpy:1018
    old "They're offices? Does that mean we could use them to communicate with the outside? Is that what you meant earlier when you said that could be possible?"
    new "办公室？那是不是说，我们可以用它们和外面联络？你刚才说也许有办法，指的就是这个吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1023
    old "Oh, no. Usually, that would be the case, but the local internet connection is also something that the alarm shuts down, precisely to block all communication methods."
    new "哦，不是。平时确实可以，但这里的网络也会被警报切断，为的就是堵死所有联络手段。"

    # game/script.rpy:1028
    old "You people cut the internet too? Is that only going to come back when the exit opens?"
    new "你们连网络都切了？也要等出口打开才会恢复吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1034
    old "Yes. We can't access it until then. There's no phone either, and I don't have mine here."
    new "对。在那之前都连不上。电话也没有，我自己的那部也没带在身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:1037
    old "What did you mean, then? How do we have any way to speak to anyone outside?"
    new "那你刚才说的是什么办法？我们还能怎么和外面联系？"

    # game/script.rpy:1042
    old "The room where I work, the security room, has a function that lets us enable communication with the outside. That one should not be out of commission."
    new "我工作的房间，也就是监控室，有一项功能，能让我们和外面联络。那功能应该还没有失效。"

    # game/script.rpy:1043
    old "That was slightly relieving. If we could talk with people and understand the situation better, that'd make the wait much more bearable."
    new "这让我稍稍安心了些。能和人联系上、把情况弄清楚，这段等待也会好熬不少。"

    # game/script.rpy:1044
    old "However, it seemed strange to me that a communication method wouldn't be disabled. Entirely blocking off the exit and shutting down the internet connection seemed to indicate the goal was to fully isolate the interior. Leaving one method available didn't fit, which meant it wasn't one anyone would know how to access."
    new "可是一种联络手段居然没有被切断，这让我觉得蹊跷。封死出口、断开网络，看来都是为了让内部彻底与外界隔绝。偏偏留下一条通路，实在说不通——也就是说，那绝不是谁都知道该怎么用的手段。"

    # game/script.rpy:1045
    old "Isla stood up and brushed herself off. She seemed ready to say something else, but a nearby sound startled us."
    new "Isla 站起身，拍了拍衣服。她似乎还想说什么，近旁却传来一声响动，把我们吓了一跳。"

    # game/script.rpy:1046
    old "We turned to face it and were met with a door opening. It was the one that led to the lobby."
    new "我们循声望去，只见一扇门正被打开。那是通往大堂的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:1054
    old "Had someone else gotten trapped? I thought that until I saw Sai next to the door. Then, I realized he hadn't said anything since he'd told us his name."
    new "难道还有别人被困在这里？我这么想着，直到看见门边的 Sai，才意识到他自报姓名之后就再没开过口。"

    # game/script.rpy:1055
    old "His left hand was gripping the knob."
    new "他的左手握着门把。"

    # game/script.rpy:1060
    old "Where are you going?"
    new "你要去哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:1061
    old "It looked like we were all a little confused that he'd been about to leave without warning."
    new "他一声不吭就要走，我们似乎都有些摸不着头脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:1062
    old "I'm going to check the lobby. I'm not doubting what Katei has said, but I haven't personally seen the exit closed, so I'm curious if it could be forced open, for example."
    new "我去大堂看看。不是不信 Katei 的话，只是我没亲眼见过出口封死，所以想试试看能不能硬撬开之类。"

    # game/script.rpy:1067
    old "Nobody said anything. Instead, everyone but Shiroya, who was still sitting down, began to slowly walk to the door."
    new "谁都没有说话。除了仍坐着的 Shiroya，大家都慢慢朝门口走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:1068
    old "I took the opportunity to pull her aside and check on her."
    new "我趁机把她拉到一旁，问问她的情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:1073
    old "...This was a deliberate attack, and I want to find out who did it if I can. Are you okay with that?"
    new "……这是一场有预谋的袭击，可以的话，我想把出手的人揪出来。你能接受吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1078
    old "Why are you asking me that?"
    new "你为什么要问我这个？"

    # game/script.rpy:1079
    old "If you want to just hole up in a room for twelve hours, I'll respect it. But I don't want the person or people responsible getting away, and I think you feel the same way."
    new "如果你想找个房间躲上十二个小时，我尊重你的意思。可我不想让凶手逍遥法外，我想你也是一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:1084
    old "...Yeah. I'm... I just don't want you to get caught up in something dangerous, Atsuki."
    new "……嗯。我只是……不希望你卷进危险里去，Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:1085
    old "It's not like I'm some detective... I know that. But if you notice someone lying, or find out something I don't, I want to know."
    new "我又不是什么侦探……这点自知之明还是有的。但要是你看出谁在撒谎，或者查到我不知道的事，我希望你告诉我。"

    # game/script.rpy:1086
    old "I just figure if we really are trapped here, we should keep track of what happens. The culprit must've gotten trapped, so we can't trust anyone here."
    new "我只是想，既然我们真的被困在这儿了，就该把发生的事一一记下来。凶手多半也被困在里面，所以这里的谁都不能轻信。"

    # game/script.rpy:1091
    old "I know. Usually, the police would handle this, but... if the cameras are all covered, there might be no records."
    new "我知道。这种事平常该交给警察，可是……如果摄像头全被遮住了，恐怕一点记录都不会留下。"

    # game/script.rpy:1096
    old "And if they got away... If they got away, I'd..."
    new "要是让他们跑了……让他们跑了的话，我……"

    # game/script.rpy:1097
    old "I knew perfectly well what she meant without her finishing the sentence."
    new "她没说完，我也完全明白她的意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:1100
    old "I'm hoping that whoever did this was stupid enough to get caught on camera before that happened, but we'll see. I know you're right. We're not the police. I just don't know who we can trust."
    new "我倒是希望凶手蠢到在遮住摄像头之前就被拍了下来，不过只能走着瞧了。我知道你说得对，我们不是警察。我只是不知道该信谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:1105
    old "S-Sorry, I'm just trying to... process everything. I didn't mean to be so quiet until now. I feel the same way you do."
    new "对、对不起，我只是在……把这些事理清楚。我不是故意一直不说话的。我的想法和你一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:1110
    old "Maybe I feel worse, actually. I... hate this. I want this to be over."
    new "说实话，我可能比你更难受。我……讨厌这样。我想早点结束。"

    # game/script.rpy:1111
    old "Yeah... Yeah. Me too. Let's get going."
    new "嗯……嗯，我也是。走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:1112
    old "I helped Shiroya to her feet, and we headed to where everyone else had gone."
    new "我扶 Shiroya 站起来，一起往其他人去的方向走。"

    # game/script.rpy:1121
    old "As if we'd stepped into another world, the lobby looked almost as it had when we'd last been there. The lights weren't blackened, but some had been turned off, most likely automatically. Only a bit of the smoke had sneaked through the gaps of the doors, forming a dark outline around them."
    new "仿佛踏进了另一个世界，大堂几乎还是我们上次离开时的样子。灯没有被熏黑，只是有几盏灭了，多半是自动关掉的。只有少许烟雾从门缝里渗进来，在门四周勾出一圈黑影。"

    # game/script.rpy:1128
    old "That would've been all if it weren't for the metal shutter blocking the door we'd entered through. Aside from the reception desk, the only things of note in the room were the couch and cleaning bucket."
    new "本来也就这些了，只是我们进来的那道门被金属卷帘封住了。除了接待台，屋里值得一提的只有沙发和清洁桶。"

    # game/script.rpy:1129
    old "Everyone seemed to have lapsed into silence except for Katei, who simply appeared as if he didn't know what to tell us."
    new "除了 Katei，大家都沉默了下来。他只是一副不知道该对我们说什么的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:1133
    old "...Oh. Guess there's no way we're opening that."
    new "……哦。看来这门是别想打开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:1138
    old "Isn't it... a bit excessive? Why would they trap us like this?"
    new "这是不是……有点过头了？为什么要这样把我们关起来？"

    # game/script.rpy:1143
    old "I agree that this looks over the top, but I'm afraid the same has occurred with every window of the tower, and all the blockades are designed to not let sound pass. We won't be leaving earlier than intended. I apologize that this has happened."
    new "我也觉得这有些过头了，但很遗憾，塔里每一扇窗户都是这样，而且所有封堵都做了隔音。我们没法提前离开。发生这种事，我很抱歉。"

    # game/script.rpy:1149
    old "Can't you at least tell us why? Why is there a metal shutter here? This doesn't look normal at all."
    new "至少能告诉我们原因吧？这里为什么会有金属卷帘门？这怎么看都不正常。"

    # game/script.rpy:1153
    old "My apologies, but as I said earlier, I'm not allowed to supply that information."
    new "抱歉，但就像我之前说的，这些信息我不能透露。"

    # game/script.rpy:1158
    old "But don't misinterpret me. Even though I could give you some details, I'm mostly kept in the dark when it comes to knowing the reasons. I'm only charged with making sure the system is functional, so I wouldn't be able to tell you much about what you want to know."
    new "但请别误会。就算我能说一些细节，背后的原因我自己也基本不清楚。我只负责确保系统正常运转，你们想知道的事，我恐怕说不出多少。"

    # game/script.rpy:1164
    old "What are the details you know, then? Look at it from our perspective. We deserve the basics."
    new "那你到底知道些什么？替我们想一想。至少最基本的情况，总该让我们知道吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:1165
    old "I understand, I promise. However, I can't say anything."
    new "我明白，真的。但我什么都不能说。"

    # game/script.rpy:1166
    old "We all felt the need to sigh. Knowing information was being kept from us wasn't a pleasant thought, and it disrupted any cooperation we might've wished for. However, it would've been pointless to press the issue further."
    new "我们都不由得想叹气。明知有人对我们隐瞒信息，这滋味并不好受，也打消了我们本可能有的合作意愿。但继续追问下去也没有意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:1171
    old "Twelve hours it is, then."
    new "那就十二个小时吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:1174
    old "After saying that, he walked up to the shutter and tried to move it aside to confirm that it was as sturdy as it looked."
    new "说完，他走到卷帘门前，试着把它挪开，想确认它是否真如看上去那样结实。"

    # game/script.rpy:1175
    old "Of course, it didn't budge at all.{w} Shrugging a little, Sai turned back."
    new "当然，它纹丝不动。{w}Sai 微微耸了耸肩，转过身来。"

    # game/script.rpy:1184
    old "This door wasn't closed, by the way. It was slightly open."
    new "顺便说一句，这扇门当时并没有关。它是半开着的。"

    # game/script.rpy:1185
    old "Yeah, I saw that."
    new "嗯，我也看到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:1190
    old "And look, very little smoke passed through it."
    new "而且你看，从这扇门穿过去的烟很少。"

    # game/script.rpy:1191
    old "So it was opened after the smoke was released."
    new "所以它是在烟雾释放之后才被打开的。"

    # game/script.rpy:1192
    old "Yes. It was closed when we were knocked out."
    new "对。我们被迷晕的时候，它还是关着的。"

    # game/script.rpy:1197
    old "I was the one who opened it."
    new "是我打开的。"

    # game/script.rpy:1202
    old "...I see."
    new "……原来如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:1208
    old "I looked at the other door. Although it was closed, it appeared that more smoke had gone through it."
    new "我看向另一扇门。它虽然关着，但穿过它的烟似乎更多。"

    # game/script.rpy:1214
    old "...{w}There was something else piquing my curiosity."
    new "……{w}还有一件事勾起了我的好奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:1215
    old "Katei, you said all methods of escape were sealed. What are those? Or rather, how many of them are on this floor?"
    new "Katei，你说所有逃生手段都被封死了。都有哪些？更准确地说，这一层有几处？"

    # game/script.rpy:1220
    old "On this floor, only this one. There are no windows at ground level, so this is all that's locked. The other floors do have windows, though, and they were fully sealed too as soon as the alarm went off."
    new "这一层只有这一处。一楼没有窗户，所以需要上锁的只有这里。其他楼层倒是有窗户，但警报一响，它们也全都被封死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:1221
    old "I see. I assumed the point of the smoke was to isolate the event room for an easy path to it, obtain the gem, and then leave with it. But that's strange."
    new "原来如此。我本以为放烟是为了隔离活动室，好方便接近、取走宝石再带着它离开。可这就奇怪了。"

    # game/script.rpy:1227
    old "Strange? I think that's the most likely scenario too."
    new "奇怪？我倒觉得这是最有可能的情形。"

    # game/script.rpy:1228
    old "I say that because the lobby has been left alone. If the goal was to bring the Sekimeiya outside, why wouldn't they also release the smoke here? After all, two full hallways were attacked, so why not the lobby too?"
    new "我这么说，是因为大厅完全没有被动过。如果目的是把 Sekimeiya 带出去，为什么不在大厅也放烟？毕竟整整两条走廊都遭了殃，大厅为什么偏偏例外？"

    # game/script.rpy:1234
    old "Yeah. If the goal was to bring the Sekimeiya out during all the confusion, it doesn't make sense that they didn't do it here.{w} I don't know what released the smoke. I didn't see anything in the hallways, but this is a much bigger room. It could be that whatever method they used simply wouldn't have worked here."
    new "是啊。如果目的是趁混乱把 Sekimeiya 带出去，那没在大厅动手就说不通。{w}我不知道烟是怎么放出来的。走廊里我没看到任何装置，而这里空间大得多。也许他们用的手段在这里根本行不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:1242
    old "Maybe. If you wanted to block off the security cameras and then immediately get spotted in this hall, your plan obviously wasn't very well thought out."
    new "也许吧。可要是你遮住监控摄像头，转眼却在这座大厅里被人看见，那这计划显然没怎么经过推敲。"

    # game/script.rpy:1243
    old "Could it be that leaving with the Sekimeiya wasn't the goal of the plan? Or maybe that they intend to do it later?{w} ...Is it realistic to think anyone could cause panic with the smoke, leave with this incredibly rare item, and not be caught immediately? Even if the cameras were blocked, once outside, you're still one of the last people to exit and would be searched."
    new "会不会带着 Sekimeiya 离开并不是计划的目的？又或者他们打算之后再动手？{w}……放烟制造混乱、带走这件稀世珍品，还能不被立刻抓住——这种事真有可能吗？就算摄像头被遮住了，到了外面，你终究是最后离场的那批人之一，照样要被搜查。"

    # game/script.rpy:1244
    old "There is something that comes to mind, and it's why I only asked about this floor's escape routes.{w} The lobby was never used to escape. Now, Katei says the windows on the upper floors are sealed, but when they're open, they provide a feasible way out."
    new "我想到了一种可能，这也是我只问这一层逃生路线的原因。{w}大厅从来就不是逃生出口。Katei 说楼上的窗户都封死了，可只要打开，它们就是一条可行的出路。"

    # game/script.rpy:1247
    old "Keeping in mind that the alarm came late and that we never actually saw the Sekimeiya, could it be that by the time we stepped into the room, it already wasn't there?"
    new "别忘了警报来得迟，而且我们其实从未亲眼见到 Sekimeiya 本身。会不会在我们踏进那间房的时候，它早已不在那里了？"

    # game/script.rpy:1248
    old "The culprit could've gone up a floor to escape through the windows. Katei hasn't spoken about the footage of this timeframe, so he might not have been looking at the cameras. Then again, even if the cameras spotted the culprit, they'd be able to leave through a prepared window route and flee immediately once outside."
    new "犯人可以先上一层楼，从窗户逃走。Katei 一直没有提到这段时间的录像，也许他当时并没有盯着监控。再说，就算摄像头拍到了犯人，对方也能沿着预先安排好的窗户路线离开，一出楼就立刻逃之夭夭。"

    # game/script.rpy:1249
    old "Then... use an automated mechanism to create the smoke and lock the tower right before the Sekimeiya is ever shown to the public. For the people outside, this would make it look as if it's still in the building and entirely obscure the time in which it was stolen."
    new "那么……就用自动装置制造烟雾，并在 Sekimeiya 对外展示之前锁死整座塔。在外人看来，它似乎还留在楼里，失窃的时间也就彻底模糊了。"

    # game/script.rpy:1252
    old "We started our session a bit later than expected because Shiroya and I were slightly delayed, but even if we'd gone faster and seen the missing Sekimeiya, it wouldn't have meant anything to the person who'd successfully stolen it since we'd soon be locked inside."
    new "我和 Shiroya 耽搁了一点，所以参观开始得比预定晚了些。可就算我们走得快些、发现 Sekimeiya 不见了，对那个已经得手的犯人来说也毫无意义——我们很快就会被关在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:1253
    old "If I assume some cameras recorded the culprit leaving through the window, it doesn't make sense that the smoke would then be deployed. However, if they also had a way around those cameras using another method, it'd give off the illusion that someone who got trapped must've been the one to steal the Sekimeiya, and only after the smoke showed up. After all, the lobby was left untouched, and no one would've left through it after the smoke appeared."
    new "如果我假设有摄像头拍到了犯人从窗户离开，那之后再放烟就说不通了。可要是他们另有一套办法绕开那些摄像头，就能制造一种假象：偷走 Sekimeiya 的，必定是被困在里面的人，而且是在烟雾出现之后才下的手。毕竟大厅没被动过，烟雾出现后也不会有人从那里离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:1254
    old "Since the alarm came later, whatever else the culprit did one floor above must've triggered it. Maybe the culprit triggered it purposely, which is why it didn't match the smoke's timing. That would be a bit involved, but it would work."
    new "既然警报来得晚，那多半是犯人在楼上做的事触发了它。也许犯人是故意触发的，所以时间才和烟雾对不上。这样是麻烦了些，但确实行得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:1255
    old "I might be deluding myself a bit too much. I'm also assuming they were able to get the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet without being noticed, which is probably too hard to believe. Not to mention Naomi unlocked the cabinet with her key, meaning it was locked by that time, so why would the culprit lock it after getting the Sekimeiya out, let alone have a way to do it...?"
    new "或许我想得太玄了。我还假设他们能神不知鬼不觉地把 Sekimeiya 从展示柜里取出来，这本身就难以令人信服。更何况，展示柜是 Naomi 用她的钥匙打开的，也就是说那一刻它还是锁着的。犯人取走 Sekimeiya 之后为什么还要上锁，又怎么上得了锁……？"

    # game/script.rpy:1262
    old "I believe it's far simpler than that, Sai."
    new "Sai，我觉得事情远比这简单。"

    # game/script.rpy:1267
    old "Katei took a while to answer. While I'd been thinking, he also had."
    new "Katei 隔了一会儿才回答。我一直在想，他也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:1272
    old "After all, the lobby doesn't have security cameras."
    new "毕竟，大厅里根本没有监控摄像头。"

    # game/script.rpy:1277
    old "Wh-What...?"
    new "什、什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:1281
    old "I realized immediately I'd already gone too far and got slightly embarrassed. Making up complicated theories was a habit of mine, but making a leap without even considering the facts was the last kind of mistake I needed to be making given the circumstances."
    new "我立刻意识到自己扯得太远，脸上有些发烫。凭空构想复杂的推理是我的老毛病，但连基本事实都不顾就妄下结论，在当前这种局面下，正是我最不该犯的错误。"

    # game/script.rpy:1282
    old "Regardless, that seemed pretty ridiculous. It was a big lobby, so even though I couldn't spot any cameras, I had figured they were well-hidden. All of us frowned, doubting that decision."
    new "可无论如何，这都显得相当荒唐。大厅这么大，我虽然没看到摄像头，也只当它们藏得隐蔽。我们全都皱起眉头，对这做法心存疑虑。"

    # game/script.rpy:1283
    old "I know it might sound strange. Next to the main door are guards who inspect everyone who enters, making sure they don't possess any kind of suspicious item. For this very reason, the fact that a big quantity of smoke was somehow released from the inside is already very strange."
    new "我知道这听起来可能很奇怪。正门旁边有警卫检查每一位入场者，确保没人携带任何可疑物品。也正因如此，大量烟雾竟然从馆内释放出来，这件事本身就已经非常蹊跷了。"

    # game/script.rpy:1288
    old "There's nothing of value in this lobby. The only way to access any valuable item is by entering the actual exhibition section through one of the two hallways. There is no other way to reach the gemstones aside from these two doors."
    new "这座大厅里没有任何值钱的东西。要接触任何贵重品，只能经由两条走廊之一进入真正的展区。除了那两扇门，没有别的路能通到宝石那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:1289
    old "Since there are cameras in the hallways, the entrance to the valuables is monitored. Having them here is simply not necessary."
    new "走廊里装有摄像头，通往贵重品的入口始终在监控之下。这里根本没必要再装。"

    # game/script.rpy:1295
    old "What the hell...? You guys aren't very good at this security thing, are you?"
    new "搞什么……？你们这安保还真是不怎么样啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:1300
    old "We have our reasons, but nobody could steal anything and leave without being recorded."
    new "我们有我们的考虑。但不管是谁，想偷走东西又不被拍到，都是不可能的。"

    # game/script.rpy:1301
    old "But it meant, with the smoked hallways, it was actually possible someone could've stolen something and left without being seen by the cameras. However, it was pretty hard to believe that they could've managed to leave with the stolen object, even more so after seeing how harsh the security measures were."
    new "可这也意味着，走廊被烟雾笼罩后，确实可能有人偷了东西还没被摄像头拍到。不过要说他们能带着赃物顺利离开，实在很难相信，特别是见识过这么严密的安保之后。"

    # game/script.rpy:1306
    old "You said there's no way to make it to the actual rooms containing the gemstones. Then what about that door?"
    new "你说过，存放宝石的展室根本进不去。那扇门呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:1313
    old "She was pointing at a smaller door situated behind the reception desk."
    new "她指的是前台后面一扇较小的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:1321
    old "Oh, that leads to a room right under us. Past the door, a staircase goes to the room that stores the main boiler for the building, the electricity meter, the circuit breakers, and some pieces of furniture that we don't use anymore. Naturally, there are no cameras there either."
    new "哦，那扇门通向就在我们正下方的一个房间。进门后有段楼梯，通到存放这栋楼主锅炉、电表、断路器，还有几件不再使用的旧家具的房间。那个房间当然也没有摄像头。"

    # game/script.rpy:1326
    old "It's right under us...?"
    new "就在我们正下方……？"

    # game/script.rpy:1327
    old "Yes. The staircase is a semicircle, so that room, which we call the mechanical room, is below the lobby."
    new "对。楼梯是半圆形的，所以那个房间——我们叫它机械室——就在大堂下面。"

    # game/script.rpy:1328
    old "What about that computer? Can we use it for anything?"
    new "那台电脑呢？能用上吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1332
    old "No. As I said earlier, the internet connection has been cut. That's not all, though. The alarm also disabled this computer so that the people trapped inside couldn't look through its files."
    new "不行。我刚才说过，网络已经断了。而且不止如此。警报系统还把这台电脑锁死了，免得被困在里面的人翻看里面的文件。"

    # game/script.rpy:1337
    old "Is the door locked?"
    new "那扇门锁着吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1342
    old "It's not. Since it's right behind the reception counter, visitors can't enter it."
    new "没锁。不过它就在前台柜台后面，客人进不去。"

    # game/script.rpy:1343
    old "I doubt that room could've been used for anything regarding this incident. Even if someone managed to make it inside, they would've needed a key to access the breakers, but it's not like the lights went out."
    new "我看那个房间跟这次事件扯不上什么关系。就算有人溜进去，想碰断路器也得有钥匙，况且灯也没灭过。"

    # game/script.rpy:1344
    old "Would Naomi have had that key?"
    new "Naomi 会有那把钥匙吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1349
    old "Naomi? No, that's not part of her job. I do have it, but I don't think I've ever used it."
    new "Naomi？不会，那不在她的职责范围内。钥匙倒是在我这儿，不过我好像从来没用过。"

    # game/script.rpy:1350
    old "As a thought, could we power off the system in charge of the alarm to open up the exit?"
    new "我在想，能不能把负责警报的系统断电，这样出口就能打开了？"

    # game/script.rpy:1355
    old "No, of course not. It'd be a big oversight if a thief could go there, force open the lid, and then break free. Not every circuit can be handled from that room—only the basic ones that power on the lights and such. Essential operations like the security system and maintenance functions can't be turned off."
    new "不行，当然不行。要是小偷跑到那儿，撬开盖子就能脱身，那也太疏忽了。那个房间只能控制一部分线路——只有照明之类的普通电路。安保系统和维护设施这类关键功能，是关不掉的。"

    # game/script.rpy:1363
    old "With another escape method eliminated, our spirits sank."
    new "又一条脱身之路被堵死，众人的心沉了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:1369
    old "Meanwhile, Isla had been watching our discussion and stared at us intensely."
    new "另一边，Isla 一直看着我们讨论，目光紧紧盯着我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:1374
    old "What is that?"
    new "那是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:1375
    old "She seemed to be looking at Shiroya's neck."
    new "她似乎在看 Shiroya 的脖子。"

    # game/script.rpy:1380
    old "...Hm, this?{w} It's a pendant."
    new "……嗯？这个？{w}是条吊坠。"

    # game/script.rpy:1386
    old "I believe it's tanzanite, right?"
    new "这应该是坦桑石吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:1387
    old "Yeah."
    new "嗯。"

    # game/script.rpy:1392
    old "Oh, it's really pretty! I want one like it!"
    new "哇，好漂亮！我也想要一个这样的！"

    # game/script.rpy:1397
    old "Tanzanite? I doubt that. This seems to be an imitation; they're very common."
    new "坦桑石？我看未必。这像是仿制品，市面上到处都是。"

    # game/script.rpy:1398
    old "...Is that so? I don't know."
    new "……是吗？我不太清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:1399
    old "Shiroya gave him a terse reply, obviously displeased."
    new "Shiroya 简短地应了一句，显然不太高兴。"

    # game/script.rpy:1404
    old "If it's not, then that gem must be worth quite a lot."
    new "如果不是仿制品，那颗宝石可值不少钱。"

    # game/script.rpy:1409
    old "Ah. ...It doesn't matter, though. I really like it."
    new "啊。……不过没关系，我很喜欢它。"

    # game/script.rpy:1415
    old "Isla, you wanted to say something else before, right? What was it?"
    new "Isla，你刚才是不是还有话要说？是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:1420
    old "Yeah...! We came here for the Sekimeiya, right? I just wanted to go see it..."
    new "对……！我们不是为 Sekimeiya 来的吗？我就是想去看看它……"

    # game/script.rpy:1426
    old "She glanced down, expecting to get scolded, but nobody reacted that way."
    new "她垂下视线，像是等着挨骂，可谁也没有责怪她。"

    # game/script.rpy:1432
    old "There's no way it's still there, right? What even was it?"
    new "那东西不可能还在吧？话说回来，它到底是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:1437
    old "Sai began looking at me and ended his sentence at Akaro. We hadn't mentioned that we never directly saw the Sekimeiya, so since I'd referred to it being stolen, it was only natural for him to assume it was missing."
    new "Sai 先看向我，话说完时目光已经落到 Akaro 身上。我们没提过自己从未亲眼见过 Sekimeiya，而我说过它被偷了，他自然就以为它已不在原处。"

    # game/script.rpy:1440
    old "Actually, we don't know... We were gonna check it when we woke up, but Erina's shout interrupted us."
    new "其实我们也不清楚……本来打算醒来后就去查看，结果被 Erina 的喊声打断了。"

    # game/script.rpy:1445
    old "Are you serious...?"
    new "真的假的……？"

    # game/script.rpy:1456
    old "Shiroya and Akaro nodded as well, and everyone else had the same look as Sai. It seemed they'd all assumed the Sekimeiya had been stolen."
    new "Shiroya 和 Akaro 也点了点头，其余人的神情都跟 Sai 一样。看来他们都以为 Sekimeiya 已经被偷走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:1457
    old "Once again, without warning, Sai made his way out of the lobby. Isla was the first to follow him. No one objected, as we were all curious about what the Sekimeiya actually was and whether it would even be there."
    new "Sai 又一次毫无预兆地走出了大堂。Isla 头一个跟了上去。没人提出异议，因为我们都想知道 Sekimeiya 究竟是什么，它到底还在不在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:1480
    old "Shiroya and I made our way back to the room where we'd fallen unconscious. Once Katei entered, our seven pairs of eyes focused on the dark-colored curtain that blocked the view to the cabinet's interior."
    new "我和 Shiroya 回到了我们昏倒的那个房间。Katei 一进门，我们七个人的视线便齐齐落在那块挡住展示柜内部的深色遮布上。"

    # game/script.rpy:1486
    old "So, none of you saw what was behind this curtain before or after the smoke, right?"
    new "那么，烟雾出现前后，你们都没看见这遮布后面是什么，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:1487
    old "Yes. Naomi was about to raise it, but then the smoke appeared."
    new "对。Naomi 正要掀开遮布，烟雾就出现了。"

    # game/script.rpy:1491
    old "People went quiet at the mention of Naomi. Given the alarm had played when she'd been there, her disappearance was still peculiar."
    new "一提到 Naomi，大家都沉默了。警报是在她还在的时候响起的，她的消失至今仍透着蹊跷。"

    # game/script.rpy:1496
    old "Let's see, then. What do you guys think? Is it still here?"
    new "那就看看吧。你们觉得呢？它还在吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1497
    old "...It was very hard to think it still would be, and going off their expressions, everyone else agreed with me."
    new "……实在很难相信它还在，看众人的表情，大家也都这么想。"

    # game/script.rpy:1502
    old "I say it is. That would make things more interesting, wouldn't it? And I'm curious about how it looks."
    new "我觉得它还在。那样事情会更有意思，不是吗？我也挺好奇它长什么样。"

    # game/script.rpy:1507
    old "After those questionable words, Sai proceeded to slowly raise the curtain, exaggerating his own action."
    new "说完这番不着调的话，Sai 便缓缓掀起遮布，动作夸张得很。"

    # game/script.rpy:1508
    old "As the curtain was being raised, dust that had gotten stuck on it shook loose and formed a little pile on the floor."
    new "遮布掀起时，积在上面的灰尘簌簌落下，在地板上堆成一小撮。"

    # game/script.rpy:1509
    old "The majority of the curtain was covering clean wood that contrasted the stained room. Finally, a transparent pane of glass sheltering a cushion came into view."
    new "遮布遮着的大部分是一块干净的木板，与污迹斑斑的房间格格不入。最后，一片透明玻璃露了出来，玻璃罩着里面的一块软垫。"

    # game/script.rpy:1511
    old "The curtain had been fully raised. Because of the darkness of the room, it took us a bit to see what was behind that glass."
    new "遮布已经完全掀开。房间里光线昏暗，我们花了一会儿才看清玻璃后面的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:1512
    old "Let me see, is it there?"
    new "我看看，它还在不在？"

    # game/script.rpy:1513
    old "Sai, directly next to the cabinet, stared inside. We all got closer as well."
    new "Sai 就站在展示柜旁，探头朝里面看。我们几个也凑了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:1514
    old "Inside was a red cushion, a color that would've definitely looked beautiful if not for the lack of proper illumination."
    new "里面铺着一块红色垫子。若不是光线太暗，那颜色一定很好看。"

    # game/script.rpy:1521
    old "And on that cushion, occupying the middle of it, was what appeared to be a white-colored sphere. Looking closer, it wasn't actually a sphere, but an egg-shaped stone. It shined very faintly."
    new "垫子正中放着一个乍看像是白色球体的东西。凑近细看，那并不是球，而是一块蛋形石头，表面泛着极淡的光泽。"

    # game/script.rpy:1525
    old "It could easily have been mistaken for an actual egg, albeit a large one. However, we all knew it wasn't. Naomi had told us that it was an incredibly rare gem, and despite its simplicity, it was pretty and elegant."
    new "很容易让人误以为是一枚真正的蛋，只是个头大了些。可我们都知道并非如此。Naomi 告诉过我们，那是一块极其稀有的宝石；它虽然朴素，却漂亮而雅致。"

    # game/script.rpy:1531
    old "It's this, right? It wasn't taken."
    new "就是这个吧？没被人拿走。"

    # game/script.rpy:1537
    old "So this is Ashiya's big find? How can we be sure it's the real thing?"
    new "这就是芦屋的重大发现？我们怎么能确定它是真品？"

    # game/script.rpy:1543
    old "It is. I have seen it before. I happen to spend hours in front of the security cameras."
    new "是真的。我以前见过——我时常在监控画面前一待就是几个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:1551
    old "Isla looked dumbfounded and couldn't help but stare."
    new "Isla 目瞪口呆，忍不住盯着它看。"

    # game/script.rpy:1557
    old "How disappointing. I guess it'd still please all those other people, but I came here purely out of curiosity. Despite not having any kind of expectations, I'm embarrassed to admit I'm a bit let down. You can call this thing rare all you want, but it's just an egg."
    new "真叫人失望。其他人或许还是会满意，可我来这里纯粹是出于好奇。明明本来没什么期待，说来惭愧，我还是有点失落。你们尽可以说这东西有多稀有，可它终究只是个蛋。"

    # game/script.rpy:1558
    old "An incredibly valuable one, apparently."
    new "不过，听说它价值连城。"

    # game/script.rpy:1559
    old "And it's still here? What was all the smoke for, then?"
    new "那它怎么还在这儿？那阵烟又是为了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:1560
    old "I know I said I hoped for this to be the case, but I'm not too sure anymore. This probably means that the culprit's plan wasn't really all that elaborate.{w} They might just plan to spend twelve hours with us and take this thing out of here when it's time to leave."
    new "我确实说过希望事情如此，可现在也没那么确定了。这大概说明犯人的计划没那么周密。{w} 也许对方只打算陪我们耗上十二个小时，等该离开时再把东西带走。"

    # game/script.rpy:1565
    old "...And how exactly will they pull that off?"
    new "……那他们到底打算怎么做到？"

    # game/script.rpy:1570
    old "I don't know, but it's practically impossible that what's happening doesn't have to do with this, right? The end goal must be to steal it, so this just means that the plan isn't over yet."
    new "我不知道，但眼下发生的事几乎不可能和它无关吧？最终目的肯定是偷走它，所以这只能说明计划还没结束。"

    # game/script.rpy:1575
    old "I'm not so sure.{w} Hey, Katei, do you know if Naomi was aware of the existence of that alarm?"
    new "我可没那么确定。{w} 喂，Katei，你知道 Naomi 是否知道有那道警报吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1581
    old "Naomi? She should not have been, but I couldn't tell you for sure. Why?"
    new "Naomi？按理说她不该知道，但我也不能确定。怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:1584
    old "Imagine this for a second. Naomi's job is perfectly positioned for this. She acted confused when the attack happened but was prepared for the smoke."
    new "不妨设想一下。Naomi 的职位正好方便她做这件事。袭击发生时，她装出一副不知所措的样子，可对那阵烟早有准备。"

    # game/script.rpy:1589
    old "However, the alarm that locked her inside didn't factor into her plan because she wasn't aware of it."
    new "然而，把她关在里面的那道警报并不在她的计划之中，因为她根本不知道有这回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:1594
    old "Atsuki, you said you heard the alarm a few seconds after the smoke was released. Do you know how many, approximately?"
    new "Atsuki，你说过烟雾放出几秒后你听见了警报。大概隔了几秒，你还记得吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1595
    old "...Twenty, maybe?"
    new "……大概二十秒吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:1600
    old "So twenty seconds later, pretty much everyone is unconscious and Naomi hears this alarm. By this point, she doesn't know that it's trapping her in the tower. If she had, she would've pretended to be unconscious until we all woke up."
    new "也就是说，二十秒后，几乎所有人都失去了意识，而 Naomi 听见了警报。此时她还不知道这道警报会把她困在塔里。如果她知道，她大可以一直装昏，直到我们全部醒来。"

    # game/script.rpy:1605
    old "But she didn't. Instead, she obtained the Sekimeiya thanks to her key and left with it to proceed with her plan."
    new "但她没有。她反而用自己的钥匙取得 Sekimeiya，带着它离开，继续她的计划。"

    # game/script.rpy:1610
    old "I'm not sure how it continues now or how she intended to escape, but she realized that the exit had been blocked off. Katei said this was a very specific alarm that hadn't gone off before, so it'd make sense if she didn't recognize the sound."
    new "我不知道接下来会怎样，也不知道她原本打算怎么逃出去，但她已经发现出口被封死了。Katei 说过，这是种很特殊的警报，以前从没响过；她听不出那声音，也说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:1622
    old "...Well, as she finished searching for an exit or a way to continue with her plan, she thought her only choice was to come back and play the confused card. But, as she was coming back, she probably heard me opening this door and backed out."
    new "……于是，她找遍了出口，也没找到把计划继续下去的办法，便认定自己只剩一个选择：回来装糊涂。可就在她折返时，大概听见我在开这扇门，又退了回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:1623
    old "It's clear she's the most suspicious person in the building. It's possible she was listening to us and heard that we didn't look behind the curtain. By leaving before doing so, we gave her a chance to look innocent."
    new "这栋楼里最可疑的人显然就是她。她可能一直在偷听我们，知道我们没去看遮布后面。我们没查就先离开，反倒给了她装无辜的机会。"

    # game/script.rpy:1628
    old "When we were in the hallway, she simply entered the room again and placed the Sekimeiya back in the cabinet. Now it's possible we'll find her playing dumb or pretending to be knocked out somewhere, claiming she was disoriented and trying to assess the situation. It's impossible she's not trapped in here with us."
    new "我们还在走廊时，她只要重新进房间，把 Sekimeiya 放回展示柜就行。现在她很可能躲在某处装傻，或者装成昏倒的样子，说自己当时晕头转向，正在摸清状况。她必定也和我们一样被困在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:1633
    old "I see. That would make sense. It could very well be that this top-secret alarm only played whenever someone tried to get the Sekimeiya out of here and that she hadn't been informed of it."
    new "原来如此，这样就说得通了。很可能这道绝密警报只在有人试图把 Sekimeiya 带出去时才会响起，而她并未被告知这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:1634
    old "Sai shot Katei a glance, clearly displeased that he had to make that assumption based on limited information."
    new "Sai 朝 Katei 瞥了一眼，显然不满他只能凭有限的信息作出这种推断。"

    # game/script.rpy:1641
    old "Come on. We haven't found her yet, so shouldn't you wait to draw conclusions until we do? For all we know, she's looking for a way out to help us."
    new "别急着下结论。我们还没找到她，是不是该等找到人再说？说不定她正在替我们找出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:1642
    old "...You're right. We can't assume that Naomi is responsible, and we need to establish something that clears her name a little bit."
    new "……你说得对。不能就这样认定 Naomi 有责任，我们得找出点东西，多少替她洗清些嫌疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:1643
    old "Even though you guys just tried to explain things with the delayed alarm, it doesn't make a lot of sense to me."
    new "虽说你们刚才想用警报延迟来解释，可我还是觉得说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:1644
    old "Naomi's job was to explain everything about the Sekimeiya and make sure the exhibition happened smoothly. An alarm that's triggered when the Sekimeiya is removed is something she would know about, so thinking that she was unaware of it is pretty ridiculous.{w} And, while her position is convenient to orchestrate this, it also makes her a very strong suspect from the get-go."
    new "Naomi 的职责就是讲解 Sekimeiya 的一切，并确保展览顺利进行。Sekimeiya 被取走时会触发警报，这种事她不可能不知道；所以认为她对此毫不知情，实在很离谱。{w} 再说，她的职位虽然方便她策划这一切，却也让她从一开始就显得非常可疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:1645
    old "I can't be sure of this, but before the time I heard the alarm, I did hear the sound of a body falling, and given all three of us were already down on the floor, it must've been Naomi's. On top of that, the cabinet hadn't been opened, so if she opened it while I was on the floor and triggered the alarm, I think I would've heard it.{w} Not to mention how risky this is. Surely she would've waited until all of us were definitely unconscious to get the Sekimeiya out."
    new "这一点我不能确定，但在我听见警报之前，确实听到了有人倒地的声响；既然我们三个当时都已经倒在地上，那多半是 Naomi。更何况，展示柜并没有被打开过。如果她是在我倒地后打开柜子、触发了警报，我想我应该会听见。{w} 更别说这有多冒险了。她肯定会等到我们全都彻底失去意识，才把 Sekimeiya 取出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:1648
    old "This also implies the alarm was unstable. Even if she triggered it by opening the cabinet, she had previously unlocked it. Wouldn't the alarm have gone off when someone forced it open, not when someone opened it after unlocking it?"
    new "这也说明警报本身并不可靠。就算警报是她打开展示柜时触发的，可柜子之前是她解锁的。警报难道不该在有人强行打开时响，而不是在解锁后正常打开时响吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1649
    old "Also, there's one thing that's totally impossible, and that is that the Sekimeiya was first stolen and then brought back."
    new "还有一点是绝对不可能的，那就是 Sekimeiya 先被偷走、之后又被放回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:1655
    old "Akaro seemed intrigued to know why his idea was incorrect."
    new "Akaro 似乎很想知道自己的推断到底错在哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:1656
    old "Remember the curtain back then?"
    new "还记得当时那块遮布吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1663
    old "Oh...{w} I think I see what you mean."
    new "哦……{w} 我好像明白你的意思了。"

    # game/script.rpy:1664
    old "The black substance was already dried on the curtain. But just now, when Sai raised it, a bunch of those particles fell on the floor, and almost none of them stayed on the curtain."
    new "那些黑色物质原本已经干在遮布上了。可刚才 Sai 把遮布掀起来时，一大堆颗粒落到了地上，几乎没多少还留在遮布上。"

    # game/script.rpy:1673
    old "So it didn't move after you left."
    new "所以在你离开之后，它就没被动过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:1674
    old "And it's not possible to touch the glass without moving the curtain. ...The Sekimeiya must've also been here when we woke up."
    new "而且不掀动遮布，就不可能碰到玻璃。……那我们醒来时，Sekimeiya 应该也一直在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:1675
    old "It could be that Naomi brought back the Sekimeiya while we were still sleeping. That wouldn't contradict anything since the substance might not have fully dried on the curtain by that point. That doesn't make sense either, though."
    new "也可能是 Naomi 趁我们还在睡的时候把 Sekimeiya 放了回来。这倒不矛盾，因为那时遮布上的物质可能还没完全干透。不过，这样也说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:1676
    old "She would've only done that if she hadn't accounted for the alarm, so if she gave up on her plan and placed the Sekimeiya back before we woke up, she would've also closed her eyes and laid on the floor as if nothing had happened."
    new "她只有在没料到警报的情况下才会这么做；所以，如果她放弃计划、在我们醒来前把 Sekimeiya 放回去，她也应该会闭上眼躺在地上，装作什么都没发生过。"

    # game/script.rpy:1682
    old "Regardless of what the exact events had been, the Sekimeiya was inside its cabinet. What had the point of the smoke been? What had triggered the alarm, and what would happen next...? It still felt surreal, everything that had suddenly happened."
    new "不管经过究竟如何，Sekimeiya 确实还在展示柜里。那阵烟到底有什么意义？警报又是怎么被触发的，接下来还会发生什么……？突然发生的这一切，仍让人觉得不真实。"

    # game/script.rpy:1687
    old "Can I touch it?"
    new "我可以摸一下吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1692
    old "...What!? No, don't."
    new "……什么！？不行，别碰。"

    # game/script.rpy:1693
    old "Isla had been staring at the Sekimeiya with an astonished face. Maybe because it seemed to be the core of everything, touching it must have sounded almost dangerous."
    new "Isla 一直满脸惊讶地盯着 Sekimeiya。或许因为它像是所有事情的核心，光是碰一下都让人觉得危险。"

    # game/script.rpy:1698
    old "Why not? Naomi was going to let us do it."
    new "为什么不行？Naomi 本来还打算让我们碰的。"

    # game/script.rpy:1703
    old "Is this even open? It looks like the glass is shut."
    new "这柜子开了吗？玻璃看起来是关着的。"

    # game/script.rpy:1708
    old "It shouldn't be. According to what Naomi said earlier, the key she had would've unlocked it."
    new "按理说不该如此。Naomi 之前说过，她手里的钥匙应该能打开它。"

    # game/script.rpy:1713
    old "If it's open, you should be able to move the glass."
    new "如果锁开了，应该就能推动玻璃板。"

    # game/script.rpy:1715
    old "Let me see."
    new "让我看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:1716
    old "It's open, yes. I can scroll the glass down."
    new "嗯，锁开了。我可以把玻璃板往下滑。"

    # game/script.rpy:1726
    old "The glass had a little opening to put your fingers in and push it down. If the lock was open, we'd be able to move it."
    new "玻璃板上有一处小开口，能把手指伸进去往下推。只要锁是开的，就能挪动它。"

    # game/script.rpy:1727
    old "From the looks of it, it wasn't particularly sturdy or thick glass, so breaking it with force seemed possible too."
    new "看样子，那玻璃板既不算厚，也不怎么结实，硬砸开似乎也不是不行。"

    # game/script.rpy:1735
    old "Sai scrolled it all the way down, and we fixed our eyes on the Sekimeiya, no longer protected by any layer of security."
    new "Sai 把玻璃板一路滑到底，我们的目光落在 Sekimeiya 上——它已不再有任何一层防护。"

    # game/script.rpy:1736
    old "Isla extended her arm slowly. Nobody except Erina looked concerned about her doing it, but I could tell that Shiroya was still agitated by the fact that none of them wanted to drop everything and find the missing person."
    new "Isla 慢慢伸出手。除了 Erina，没人在意她这么做，但我看得出，Shiroya 还是很不安，因为谁都不愿意放下手头的事去找那个失踪的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:1737
    old "Before Isla got to touch the Sekimeiya, she spoke."
    new "Isla 还没碰到 Sekimeiya，就先开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:1742
    old "It's cold."
    new "好冷。"

    # game/script.rpy:1747
    old "You're right, actually. The air inside the cabinet is cold."
    new "说得没错，展示柜里的空气确实是冷的。"

    # game/script.rpy:1751
    old "Oh, right, I was told about this. Apparently, the Sekimeiya must remain in a cold place. This was a very basic thing everyone was told, and it sounded very important."
    new "哦，对，我听说过。据说 Sekimeiya 必须存放在寒冷的地方。这是所有人都被告知过的基本事项，听起来非常重要。"

    # game/script.rpy:1756
    old "Why would that be needed?"
    new "为什么需要这样？"

    # game/script.rpy:1761
    old "I'm afraid I'm clueless. This is why the temperature inside the cabinet is very low, though."
    new "这我就不清楚了。不过展示柜里的温度之所以这么低，就是因为这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:1762
    old "That sounded interesting. For whatever reason, the Sekimeiya had to always stay in a cold place, or at least that was what the Ashiya family had instructed."
    new "这倒有点意思。不知出于什么原因，Sekimeiya 必须始终存放在寒冷的地方——至少芦屋家是这么交代的。"

    # game/script.rpy:1767
    old "Do we check what happens if we get it out?"
    new "要试试把它拿出来会发生什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1772
    old "What!? Of course not! The Sekimeiya must remain inside this cabinet. We were very specifically told not to remove it or subject it to any kind of heat."
    new "什么！？当然不行！Sekimeiya 必须留在展示柜里。我们被明确告知过，绝不能把它拿出来，也不能让它接触到任何热源。"

    # game/script.rpy:1779
    old "I suppose it's still Katei's duty to act according to the rules. If something happened to the Sekimeiya, there would probably not be a positive outcome for him given that he was basically supervising us."
    new "我想，按规矩行事毕竟还是 Katei 的职责。万一 Sekimeiya 出了什么事，考虑到他基本上是在监督我们，结果对他恐怕不会有利。"

    # game/script.rpy:1780
    old "Assuming the blame didn't get shifted to Naomi for some reason, at least."
    new "至少，前提是责任不会因为某种原因被推到 Naomi 身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:1781
    old "If the Sekimeiya was actually left here due to the cold temperature, it follows whoever put the attack together must've somehow learned of that requirement..."
    new "如果 Sekimeiya 真是因为低温才被留在这里，那么策划这场袭击的人一定以某种方式得知了这个要求……"

    # game/script.rpy:1787
    old "Isla, who'd paused her movement due to Katei's serious voice, continued moving her arm toward the Sekimeiya."
    new "Isla 因为 Katei 严肃的语气停住了动作，随后又继续把手伸向 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:1790
    old "In just a second, she placed her small hand on top of it. Silently, she felt it for a few moments before letting out an amazed gasp."
    new "转眼间，她的小手就放了上去。她安静地摸了几秒，随后发出一声惊叹。"

    # game/script.rpy:1795
    old "Oh...! It's super smooth. I love it!"
    new "哇……！好光滑。我太喜欢了！"

    # game/script.rpy:1796
    old "She started feeling it conspicuously with a smile on her face."
    new "她脸上带着笑，毫不掩饰地摸了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:1802
    old "Is it? Naomi did say that touching it was part of the experience."
    new "是吗？Naomi 确实说过，亲手摸一摸也是体验的一部分。"

    # game/script.rpy:1803
    old "Shiroya joined her, evidently trying to make Isla feel better."
    new "Shiroya 也凑了过去，显然是想让 Isla 心情好一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:1809
    old "You're right, this feels very pleasant to the touch, and also really cold."
    new "你说得对，摸起来很舒服，而且真的很凉。"

    # game/script.rpy:1813
    old "Worth all the advertisements and expectations?"
    new "配得上那些宣传和期待吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1814
    old "Yes!"
    new "嗯！"

    # game/script.rpy:1821
    old "...N-No, not really, but touching it is pretty relaxing. It feels almost silky."
    new "……不、不算吧，不过摸起来挺让人放松的，几乎像丝绸一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:1828
    old "Given our situation and the fact Naomi is missing, we should let this be. I know we'll most likely be here for twelve hours, but this piece is very important, and we should not be careless."
    new "考虑到我们现在的处境，还有 Naomi 失踪这件事，还是到此为止吧。我知道我们多半要在这里待上十二个小时，但这件东西非常重要，不能大意。"

    # game/script.rpy:1833
    old "Sai and I were going to be the next ones to touch it, but we had to respect that. Without responding verbally, Isla and Shiroya removed their hands from the cabinet. Katei's request was a reasonable one, and we still had more important things to think about. Even though six of us had come to see the Sekimeiya, only Isla seemed to have a legitimately strong interest in it."
    new "接下来本来轮到我和 Sai 去摸，但我们必须尊重 Katei 的意思。Isla 和 Shiroya 没有作声，把手从展示柜里收了回来。Katei 的要求合情合理，何况我们还有更重要的事要考虑。虽然我们六个人都是来看 Sekimeiya 的，但真正对它抱有强烈兴趣的，似乎只有 Isla。"

    # game/script.rpy:1834
    old "I looked at the left side of the cabinet, expecting to find something. There was the keyhole Naomi had used."
    new "我看向展示柜左侧，料想能找到点什么。那里有 Naomi 用过的锁孔。"

    # game/script.rpy:1839
    old "It says \"unlocked\" right here. This is how Naomi unlocked the cabinet. Katei, do you know how many keys can open it?"
    new "这里显示的是“已解锁”。Naomi 就是这样打开展示柜的。Katei，你知道有几把钥匙能打开它吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:1840
    old "I don't know for sure, but certainly not many. I'm only aware of the one Naomi had."
    new "我不确定，但肯定不会多。我只知道 Naomi 手里那一把。"

    # game/script.rpy:1846
    old "So the only person who can open this is Naomi, who just happened to disappear and might be hiding somewhere."
    new "也就是说，能打开它的只有 Naomi，而她偏偏失踪了，还可能藏在某处。"

    # game/script.rpy:1852
    old "...Stop assuming her intentions are bad just because we haven't seen her yet. We have to find her as soon as we can."
    new "……别因为我们还没见到她，就把她往坏处想。我们得尽快找到她。"

    # game/script.rpy:1858
    old "Yes, but before that, we have to contact the outside from the security room. I would like to know what our situation actually looks like, and if Naomi went upstairs all by herself and chose to leave us unconscious, I won't be prioritizing her now."
    new "对，但在那之前，我们得先去监控室联系外界。我想弄清楚我们现在的处境究竟如何；如果 Naomi 是自己上的楼，还把我们丢在那里昏迷不醒，那我现在不会优先去找她。"

    # game/script.rpy:1864
    old "I guess so. Splitting up is probably a bad idea, but if she isn't back when we finish, we really need to go looking."
    new "好吧。分头行动多半不是好主意，但等我们办完事她还没回来，就真的得去找她了。"

    # game/script.rpy:1865
    old "There wasn't any other opposition. If Naomi intended to show herself to us, she would come back eventually.{w} We worked under the assumption that she still had the cabinet key. However, if she'd ever fallen unconscious, someone could've easily grabbed it, maybe failing to recognize that the cabinet was already unlocked. If she'd woken up as that happened, the culprit might've panicked and been responsible for her disappearance."
    new "没人再提出反对。如果 Naomi 有意现身，迟早会回来的。{w}我们暂且认定钥匙还在她手上。不过，若她曾经失去意识，别人很容易就能把钥匙拿走，而且对方也许没发现展示柜已经解锁了。如果她恰在那时醒来，下手的人说不定会惊慌失措，那她的失踪可能就是这么造成的。"

    # game/script.rpy:1866
    old "...But that was a worst-case scenario, and not something we could easily jump to. It was true that contacting the outside was much more important."
    new "……但那只是最坏的情况，不能轻易下这种结论。联系外界确实重要得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:1871
    old "Let's go to the security room. That is where I work. We're very close to it, actually. It is beneficial to have it on the lowest floor, next to the entrance."
    new "去监控室吧。我就在那里工作。其实我们离得很近。把监控室设在最底层、紧挨入口，是有好处的。"

    # game/script.rpy:1878
    old "Katei closed the glass and gave us a look that once again indicated how precious of an item the Sekimeiya was."
    new "Katei 把玻璃板合上，又看了我们一眼，那眼神再次表明 Sekimeiya 是何等贵重的物品。"

    # game/script.rpy:1881
    old "Subsequently, he opened the opposite door of the room. Past it was a very similar hallway."
    new "随后，他打开了房间另一侧的门。门后是一条十分相似的走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:1891
    old "Like in the other one, the ceiling and walls were stained by an ugly, dark color. It had been a while since the smoke's release, so the substance was fully dried up, letting more light pass through."
    new "和另一条走廊一样，天花板和墙壁上染着难看的深色。烟雾释放已经有一阵子，那层物质彻底干透，透过的光线也多了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:1892
    old "Once everyone was with us, I peeked into one of the rooms in front of us."
    new "等所有人都到齐后，我朝前方的一间房间探头看了看。"

    # game/script.rpy:1895
    old "As Akaro had said, it looked clean, creating the same contrast as the lobby. The light worked perfectly, and there was almost no trace of the smoke apart from the small amount that had passed through the gaps of the door."
    new "正如 Akaro 所说，里面看上去很干净，和门厅形成了同样的反差。照明完全正常，除了从门缝渗进来的少许烟雾，几乎看不到任何痕迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:1899
    old "It seemed the function of the room was only to showcase different kinds of gemstones placed inside cabinets. I couldn't be sure, though, as all of them were covered by curtains."
    new "这间房似乎只用来展示各种放在展示柜里的宝石。不过我也说不准，因为它们都被遮布盖着。"

    # game/script.rpy:1900
    old "It's that door."
    new "就是那扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:1907
    old "Without moving, Katei indicated the single door that stood out."
    new "Katei 没有挪步，只是抬手指了指那扇格外显眼的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:1908
    old "While all the others were normal wooden doors, that one was gray and looked much more sturdy. Once Katei approached it, we walked behind."
    new "其余的都是普通木门，唯独那一扇是灰色的，看上去结实得多。Katei 朝它走过去，我们跟在后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:1912
    old "On it was a nameplate with the words \"security room\"."
    new "门上挂着一块门牌，写着「监控室」。"

    # game/script.rpy:1918
    old "{w=0.6}Katei grabbed the doorknob, and upon turning it, he tried to push the door forward. However, it didn't budge."
    new "{w=0.6}Katei 握住门把，拧了一下，向前推门。门却纹丝不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:1922
    old "Oh, right. I locked it earlier. Let me see."
    new "哦，对了。我之前把门锁上了。我看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:1928
    old "You locked it?"
    new "你锁了门？"

    # game/script.rpy:1933
    old "Yes, I have the key right here."
    new "嗯，钥匙就在我身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:1934
    old "Taking a couple of keys out of his pocket, Katei inserted one of them in the keyhole."
    new "Katei 从口袋里掏出几把钥匙，把其中一把插进锁孔。"

    # game/script.rpy:1939
    old "This is an important room. When I left, I wasn't exactly aware of the situation, given I couldn't see through some of the cameras. I found it appropriate to lock the only room that allows communication with the outside until I knew more about what had happened."
    new "这间屋子很重要。我离开时，有些监控看不到画面，所以对情况还不太清楚。在弄清究竟发生了什么之前，把唯一能与外界联络的房间锁上，我觉得是妥当的。"

    # game/script.rpy:1945
    old "That was probably a good idea."
    new "那大概是个明智的决定。"

    # game/script.rpy:1946
    old "With a simple turn, the door was audibly unlocked. Before entering, I inquired about something I found next to it."
    new "钥匙只转了一圈，便传来开锁的声响。进门之前，我问起了摆在旁边的那样东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:1947
    old "Oh, is this a map? I almost didn't notice it since the entire wall looks the same."
    new "哦，这是地图吗？整面墙都一个样，我差点没注意到。"

    # game/script.rpy:1952
    old "Yes. It's a map of this first floor. The rooms labeled with a letter and a number are what we call the \"crystal rooms\". They're the exhibition rooms, where all the gemstones are displayed."
    new "对。这是一楼的地图。标着字母和数字的房间，就是我们所说的『水晶展室』，也就是陈列所有宝石的展厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:1953
    old "I brushed off the dry dust and looked at it."
    new "我拂去上面干结的灰尘，看了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:1965
    old "Minimap unlocked.   Press {} or {} to access it.   You can display it permanently in Settings > General > Other."
    new "小地图已解锁。   按 {} 或 {} 打开。   可在「设置 > 通用 > 其他」中设为常驻显示。"

    # game/script.rpy:1967
    old "Minimap unlocked.   Press {} to access it.   You can display it permanently in Settings > General > Other."
    new "小地图已解锁。   按 {} 打开。   可在「设置 > 通用 > 其他」中设为常驻显示。"

    # game/script.rpy:1971
    old "As Katei had said, the map only showed the first floor's contents, and it seemed stairs and an elevator would lead us to the others. It was the only floor that was usually open to the public, so there were a large number of rooms to visit."
    new "正如Katei所说，地图上只标出一楼的内容，通往其他楼层似乎要靠楼梯和一部电梯。平时对外开放的只有这一层，因此要查看的房间相当多。"

    # game/script.rpy:1972
    old "We found ourselves in hallway A, next to the security room, and had plenty left of the whole floor to look through."
    new "我们来到A走廊，紧挨着监控室，整层楼还有不少地方等着查看。"

    # game/script.rpy:1973
    old "As a notable point, the event room was the only place that connected both hallways apart from the lobby and the perpendicular hallway C. As expected, there were bathrooms too, so we wouldn't have to worry on that front."
    new "值得一提的是，除了大厅和与之垂直的C走廊之外，活动室是唯一连通两条走廊的地方。这里果然也有洗手间，这方面不必担心。"

    # game/script.rpy:1974
    old "There's light coming from the end of the hallways. That means the horizontal one wasn't hit by the smoke, right?"
    new "走廊尽头透着光。也就是说，横向那条走廊没有被烟雾波及，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:1983
    old "Yes, only these sections were."
    new "对，只有这几段被波及了。"

    # game/script.rpy:1984
    old "Katei, who'd claimed to have slightly inspected the floor, showed us exactly where the smoke had been released."
    new "Katei说过自己略微查探过这一层，他指了指烟雾释放的确切位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:1995
    old "Hm...{w} So, if one of the goals of the smoke was to disable the security cameras, they didn't use hallway C for anything."
    new "嗯……{w}这么说，如果放烟雾的目的之一是要让监控失效，那他们并没有利用C走廊做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:1996
    old "Yes. I looked at the live footage of it while I was in this room, and no one showed up. They still would've had two available ways to cross the hallways, though."
    new "对。我待在这间屋里时看过那里的实时画面，没有一个人出现。不过，他们要横穿走廊，本来也还有两条路可走。"

    # game/script.rpy:1998
    old "Everyone looked pensive, including Isla, but they voiced none of their thoughts."
    new "所有人都若有所思，Isla也不例外，却没人把想法说出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:1999
    old "The layout was pretty simple. Remembering it wouldn't be a problem, but we could always look at the map again."
    new "布局相当简单，记住它并不成问题，何况随时可以再回来看地图。"

    # game/script.rpy:2010
    old "Katei waited until everyone was done examining it to open the door."
    new "Katei等大家都看完了，才打开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:2025
    old "Window Net"
    new "Window Net"

    # game/script.rpy:2028
    old "Like the lobby and the room I'd just looked into, the place was completely clean, and no traces of smoke could be found, not even any that had slipped through the door. However, the contrast wasn't as noticeable given the room's darker colors and faint light."
    new "与大厅以及我刚才看过的那间屋子一样，这里一尘不染，也找不到丝毫烟雾的痕迹，就连从门缝渗进来的也没有。不过，这间屋子色调偏暗、光线微弱，与外面的反差并不那么醒目。"

    # game/script.rpy:2029
    old "Paying no mind to everyone's silence, Katei made his way to the chair and sat down. When he moved the mouse, the computer exited its suspended state and reactivated the three monitors above it, showing us what the last person to use it had been doing."
    new "Katei没有理会众人的沉默，径直走到椅子前坐下。他一动鼠标，电脑便退出了休眠状态，上方的三台显示器重新亮起，显示出上一个使用者当时正在做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:2032
    old "Above those three screens were many more monitors that displayed the real time footage of the cameras. While there was no way every room of every floor was shown there, at first glance, there was no trace of Naomi or another person."
    new "那三块屏幕上方还装着更多显示器，实时播放着监控画面。那里不可能把每层楼的每个房间都显示出来，但一眼望去，既不见Naomi，也不见其他人的踪影。"

    # game/script.rpy:2038
    old "All these security cameras... Does this mean we'll be able to look at the recorded footage?"
    new "这么多监控摄像头……这么说，我们能看到录下来的画面？"

    # game/script.rpy:2043
    old "...We should be able to. I don't believe you'd be authorized to, but given the situation, we might be able to look at it after we talk with the outside."
    new "……应该可以。按规矩你们恐怕没有权限，但事已至此，等我们和外界联络上之后，或许就能查看。"

    # game/script.rpy:2044
    old "That was an interesting proposition. Looking at the recorded footage might have revealed the source of the smoke, if someone else hadn't been able to evacuate, and information on Naomi's whereabouts."
    new "这个提议很有意思。查看录像，或许能弄清烟雾的来源，确认是否有其他人没能撤离，也能查到Naomi的下落。"

    # game/script.rpy:2050
    old "We all got closer to Katei and looked at the screens. It seemed the computer was using a standard operating system."
    new "我们围到Katei身边，看向屏幕。这台电脑用的似乎是常见的操作系统。"

    # game/script.rpy:2055
    old "Is this the time it is right now?"
    new "这是现在的时间吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2056
    old "Oh, yes. It's {time=9:41.}"
    new "哦，对。现在是 {time=9:41.}"

    # game/script.rpy:2057
    old "As Katei said, next to the numbers that displayed the date, the current time showed {time=9:41.} That meant the exit would unlock at approximately {time=21:05}, in eleven hours and twenty minutes."
    new "正如Katei所说，日期旁边显示的当前时间正是 {time=9:41.}。也就是说，出口大约会在 {time=21:05} 解锁，距此还有十一小时二十分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:2062
    old "We started a bit late, so I think the smoke appeared five minutes after we left the lobby. I'd say we've been awake for more than twenty minutes already, so this would mean we were unconscious for about fifteen minutes."
    new "我们出发得晚了些，所以我想烟雾是在我们离开大厅五分钟后出现的。算下来我们醒着已经有二十多分钟了，那么昏迷的时间大约是十五分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:2066
    old "Yes, this matches with the amount of time I stayed here after I saw the smoke."
    new "对，这和我看到烟雾之后留在这里的时间对得上。"

    # game/script.rpy:2067
    old "Shortly after that, the alarm went off, so I knew I was already trapped. During that time until I exited, I kept my eyes on the cameras. I also tried to use the computer to look up information about what had happened, but the alarm even shut down my internet connection."
    new "那之后不久警报就响了，我便知道自己已经被困住了。在离开这里之前的那段时间，我一直盯着监控。我也试着用电脑查过发生了什么，可警报把网络连接也切断了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2074
    old "Wait, what? Why would it do that? You said you still have a way to communicate with the outside, so why didn't you use it?"
    new "等等，什么？为什么要切断网络？你说过还有办法和外界联络，那为什么不用？"

    # game/script.rpy:2077
    old "Oh, I did not find it appropriate. My top priority was to find out what was happening here, so I focused on looking at all the cameras that remained functional."
    new "哦，我认为那样不妥。当务之急是弄清这里发生了什么，所以我就专心盯着所有还能用的监控。"

    # game/script.rpy:2083
    old "Don't you think a very good way to find out what was happening would've been to ask the outside?"
    new "你不觉得，要弄清当时的情况，去问外界本来是个很好的办法吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2084
    old "You might be right. That could've been the smarter choice, but I did not think it through well enough."
    new "或许你说得对。那也许是更明智的选择，只是我当时没考虑周全。"

    # game/script.rpy:2090
    old "So, even though the internet connection is cut off, you have a communication method?"
    new "也就是说，就算网络断了，你还有联络的办法？"

    # game/script.rpy:2091
    old "Yes. This computer is connected to all the computers on the upper floors. Even though there's no connection, a way exists to connect with the Ashiya family, and only the security staff knows about it. It does not use the normal internet connection, and it was designed in case of emergencies."
    new "是的。这台电脑与楼上所有电脑相连。即使没有网络，也有一条能与芦屋家联系的途径，只有安保人员知道。它不走普通的网络线路，是为应对紧急情况而设计的。"

    # game/script.rpy:2092
    old "So, if you weren't here, we would have to spend twelve hours locked up not knowing what's actually happening and without a way to communicate with the outside world."
    new "这么说，要不是你在这里，我们就得在不知实情、也无法与外界联系的情况下被关满十二个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:2095
    old "Yes... It sounds rough, but this alarm doesn't go off for no reason. We should just be content with the fact that I stayed inside. I wouldn't have been doing my job if I'd evacuated."
    new "嗯……听起来是够呛，但这警报不会无缘无故地响。我留在了里面，我们该庆幸这一点。要是我当时撤了出去，那才叫没尽到职责。"

    # game/script.rpy:2100
    old "Nobody had anything else to add, so Katei proceeded."
    new "没有人再补充什么，Katei 便继续操作。"

    # game/script.rpy:2101
    old "Deep within many folders, he started up a program that contained a very simple interface. After inputting a username and a password we couldn't read, he pressed the enter key."
    new "他在层层叠叠的文件夹深处启动了一个界面极为简单的程序。输入了我们看不清的用户名和密码后，他按下了回车键。"

    # game/script.rpy:2104
    old "The small window shifted into a much larger and empty one. The first thing we noticed was that a loud, unintelligible audio feed was being played. Seconds later, a video appeared in the center of the window."
    new "那个小窗口随即变成了一个大得多的空白窗口。我们最先注意到的是，里面正播放着响亮而听不清内容的音频。几秒后，窗口中央浮现出画面。"

    # game/script.rpy:2109
    old "Is this a car?"
    new "这是车吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2114
    old "Yeah, it looks like a car seat."
    new "嗯，看上去像汽车座椅。"

    # game/script.rpy:2115
    old "Everyone looked at Katei, but he shrugged and kept watching."
    new "所有人都看向 Katei，他却耸了耸肩，继续盯着屏幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:2121
    old "The video was probably live, and the echo was obnoxiously loud. We could hear many people talking in the background, but it was impossible to make out any words."
    new "画面大概是实时传输的，回声响得刺耳。背景里能听见许多人在说话，却一个字也辨不清。"

    # game/script.rpy:2122
    old "We continued staring at the screen, unsure what we were actually looking at."
    new "我们继续盯着屏幕，说不清眼前究竟是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:2127
    old "Is anything going to change?"
    new "会有什么变化吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2128
    old "After more than fifteen seconds, nothing had happened, and the audio continued playing."
    new "过了十五秒多，什么也没发生，音频仍在播放。"

    # game/script.rpy:2133
    old "This is for communication, right? Can they hear us right now?"
    new "这是用来联络的吧？他们现在能听见我们说话吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2134
    old "They actually should be able to.{w} ...Hello? Can anyone hear us?"
    new "按理说应该听得见。{w}……喂？有人能听见吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2139
    old "Hello? Can anyone hear me!?"
    new "喂？有人听得见我说话吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:2141
    old "Amid the messy noise, we noticed one of the voices was getting louder."
    new "在一片杂乱的声响中，我们注意到其中一个声音渐渐大了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:2144
    old "I'm from Ashiya, talking from inside the tower. Is anyone there?"
    new "我是芦屋的人，正在塔里通话。有人在吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2145
    old "...Oh, yes, it's coming from inside. There's finally an incoming connection."
    new "……哦，对，信号是从塔里来的。总算接通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2147
    old "My apologies. He-Hello? Is this working? Do you see me?"
    new "抱歉。你、你好？这个能用吗？能看到我吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2148
    old "The camera was manually moved by the person who sat in front of it. Still inside a car, a police officer was uncertainly fixing his eyes on the lens."
    new "坐在摄像机前的人手动把摄像机挪了一下。一名警察仍坐在车里，目光迟疑地盯着镜头。"

    # game/script.rpy:2149
    old "Y-Yes. By the looks of it, you're aware of the situation."
    new "是、是的。看样子，你已经了解这边的情况了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2150
    old "Katei said that because Ashiya Tower could be seen through the car's windows. A great deal of police officers were in front of it, and I could see that the metal shutter looked just as ridiculous from the other side."
    new "Katei 这么说，是因为透过车窗就能望见芦屋塔。塔前聚着大批警察，而我能看出，那扇金属卷帘从外面看同样荒唐。"

    # game/script.rpy:2153
    old "It was a bizarre thought knowing that we were inside. We definitely hadn't been on a streak of good luck, but getting trapped inside a building the first time we'd stepped into it let us know that life wouldn't feel like redeeming itself any time soon."
    new "一想到我们就在那里面，这念头透着说不出的怪异。我们的运气显然一直不怎么样，可头一次踏进这栋楼就被困在里面，足以说明生活短时间内不会忽然对我们仁慈起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:2154
    old "I had been trying to act composed and stave off all my negative thoughts, but the prospect of having to spend another eleven hours trapped in a building was daunting, and Shiroya surely felt similarly."
    new "我一直努力保持镇定，把消极的念头挡在外面，可一想到还得在这栋楼里再困上十一个小时，心里就发沉。Shiroya 想必也有同感。"

    # game/script.rpy:2155
    old "We know what occurred, yes. The Ashiya family was in contact with us, and we were informed of this communication method. Since a member of the security staff was assumed to still be in the tower, we kept this device with us expecting it to be activated at any moment.{w} I'm a police officer. My name is Suripo."
    new "是的，我们清楚发生了什么。芦屋家的人联系过我们，也告知了这种联络方式。考虑到可能还有安保人员留在塔内，我们一直带着这台设备，等着它随时接通。{w}我是警察，名叫 Suripo。"

    # game/script.rpy:2160
    old "So, can you see us?"
    new "那么，你能看到我们吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2161
    old "Ah... No. I can only receive audio feed."
    new "啊……不行。我只能收到音频。"

    # game/script.rpy:2162
    old "The man sounded a bit thrown off after hearing the voice of a little girl. It was only natural, given the vast majority of the people who'd been inside were adults."
    new "听到小女孩的声音，那人似乎有些不知所措。这也难怪，毕竟原本在塔里的绝大多数人都是成年人。"

    # game/script.rpy:2166
    old "What happened in there? How many of you are inside?"
    new "里面出了什么事？你们一共有多少人在里面？"

    # game/script.rpy:2167
    old "There should be eight of us, even though only seven are present. However, we can't be certain someone else didn't get trapped either. We have not inspected the entire building yet."
    new "我们这边应该有八个人，可现在只有七个人在场。不过，我们也无法确定是否还有别人同样被困住。整栋楼我们还没查过。"

    # game/script.rpy:2168
    old "You're in the security room, right? If there were more people, couldn't you see them through the security cameras?"
    new "你们在监控室吧？如果还有别人，难道不能通过监控摄像头看到吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2169
    old "Let me see. We just got here, so we haven't looked extensively. Some cameras have been disabled by the smoke, and some places are without cameras, but I can try looking through the ones that remain functional."
    new "我看看。我们刚到这儿，还没来得及仔细查。有几台摄像头被烟雾挡住，用不了了，有些地方本来也没装，不过我可以试试调出还能用的那些。"

    # game/script.rpy:2173
    old "Since the number of monitors wasn't enough to display all the live cameras at once, Katei started to move through them with a program that seemed to manage the entire system. Presumably, only the first floor was being monitored continuously, being the one with unfettered public access."
    new "监视器的数量不足以同时显示所有实时画面，于是 Katei 用一个似乎能统管整个系统的程序逐一翻看。想来只有一楼是持续监控的，因为那是公众可以随意进出的楼层。"

    # game/script.rpy:2174
    old "He was able to change all the cameras being displayed at once, making the process simple and brief.{w} As he'd said, the only thing to be seen through a handful of them was a black screen created by the smoke. Even after the substance had solidified, there was no chance we could see well through it."
    new "他可以一次性切换所有正在显示的摄像头，整个过程既简单又迅速。{w}正如他所说，有几台摄像头的画面里只有一片漆黑，那是烟雾造成的。即便烟雾已经凝固，也根本不可能透过它看清什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:2175
    old "Strangely enough, the last cameras that Katei displayed showcased a much different environment. The first floor had contained all the exhibition rooms, and from there, it had only been dull offices. But some of the cameras were displaying a bedroom."
    new "奇怪的是，Katei 最后调出的几台摄像头显示的却是截然不同的景象。一楼全是展厅，再往上就只有乏味的办公室。可其中几台摄像头里，出现的竟是一间卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:2176
    old "This must look odd to you all, correct? Do you know the story behind this place? This was the Ashiya family's residence until a decade ago. Then, its purpose changed, and work floors began to be added.{w} This is why it's called a tower. The townspeople saw that floors kept being constructed, and they started to call it a tower sarcastically, as if it would never stop increasing in height. I don't know if Ashiya liked the name or if they officialized it to counter its negative connotations. You might've also heard it called the \"Ashiya skyscraper\"."
    new "你们一定觉得奇怪吧？知道这地方的来历吗？十年前，这里还是芦屋家的宅邸。后来用途变了，办公楼层才一层层加上去。{w}塔这个名字就是这么来的。镇上的人看着楼层不断加盖，便带着几分讥讽地叫它塔，仿佛它会一直往上长，永不停歇。我不知道是芦屋家喜欢这个名字，还是为了消除其中的贬义才正式沿用下来。你们或许也听过「芦屋摩天楼」这种叫法。"

    # game/script.rpy:2179
    old "What you're seeing is the very top floor. When the structure was expanded, for a while, the living area was kept as the highest floor, and now it's referred to as the Ashiya floor or the attic. It's not possible to enter it without a very particular key, one I most certainly don't possess. In fact, I have never set foot inside it despite monitoring these cameras daily."
    new "你们看到的是最顶层。建筑扩建时，居住区一度被保留在最高层，如今那里被称作芦屋层，或者阁楼。没有一把特别的钥匙就进不去，而我当然没有。事实上，尽管我每天都盯着这些监控，却从未踏进去过一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:2180
    old "Of course, the cameras were installed after the place stopped being their residence, and they were only placed in some of the rooms before continuing was deemed unnecessary.{w} The initial reason was to make sure it was preserved well, given that it was of great importance to the Ashiya family. They were installed with the thought of someone breaking in and expecting to find unguarded, hidden information. However, the installation process was never completed."
    new "当然，摄像头是在他们不住这里之后才装的，而且只装了一部分房间，后来觉得没必要再继续装。{w}最初的用意是确保这里得到妥善保护，因为这个地方对芦屋家意义重大。装上摄像头，是考虑到可能有人闯进来，想找一些没人看守的隐秘信息。然而，安装工程始终没有完成。"

    # game/script.rpy:2181
    old "While I don't know many of the details, I can say that not one time have I seen anything of importance happening inside."
    new "具体细节我了解不多，但我可以肯定，里面从来没发生过什么要紧的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:2182
    old "...That was all well and good, but it didn't mean much to us. Those cameras still showed an entirely desolate space."
    new "……这番话固然不错，对我们却没多大意义。那些摄像头拍到的，仍旧是一片彻底的荒凉。"

    # game/script.rpy:2186
    old "Every room with a camera is empty at the moment. This doesn't account for places like bathrooms, areas where the cameras are blocked by smoke, the lobby, other staff-only rooms, and the section of the attic that's not monitored."
    new "目前，凡是装有摄像头的房间都空无一人。这还不包括洗手间这类地方、被烟雾遮住镜头的区域、大厅、其他员工专用房间，以及阁楼里没有监控的那部分。"

    # game/script.rpy:2191
    old "I'm just curious, but this room doesn't have a camera either, does it? I didn't see it on the monitors."
    new "我只是好奇，这个房间也没有摄像头吧？我在监视器上没看到。"

    # game/script.rpy:2192
    old "No, it doesn't. For now, the number of us in the building is no lower than eight. We haven't been able to find the eighth person yet, but she must be here. I'm talking about Naomi Cabca, another staff member."
    new "对，没有。目前楼里至少有八个人。第八个人我们还没找到，但她一定在这里。我说的是 Naomi Cabca，另一名员工。"

    # game/script.rpy:2195
    old "I understand. Give me the name of everyone present. I will add Miss Cabca to the list."
    new "明白了。把在场每个人的名字告诉我。我会把 Cabca 小姐也加进名单。"

    # game/script.rpy:2196
    old "I am Katei Kuiji. I'm the main person in charge of the tower's security system. Everyone else I have with me is a visitor."
    new "我是 Katei Kuiji，主要负责芦屋塔的安保系统。跟我在一起的其他人都是访客。"

    # game/script.rpy:2197
    old "Understood. What are your names?"
    new "明白。你们叫什么名字？"

    # game/script.rpy:2202
    old "I'm Erina Majutsu. My daughter, Isla Majutsu, is who spoke earlier."
    new "我是 Erina Majutsu。刚才说话的是我女儿，Isla Majutsu。"

    # game/script.rpy:2203
    old "I'm noting it down."
    new "我记下了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2209
    old "Akaro Esata."
    new "Akaro Esata。"

    # game/script.rpy:2223
    old "Sai."
    new "Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:2224
    old "Sai what?"
    new "Sai……姓什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:2229
    old "Sai Yomiya."
    new "Sai Yomiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:2230
    old "All right, thank you."
    new "好，谢谢。"

    # game/script.rpy:2233
    old "So, adding in Miss Cabca, these are the eight people we know for sure are currently inside. This will be helpful."
    new "那么，再加上 Cabca 小姐，目前能确定在里面的就是这八个人。这很有帮助。"

    # game/script.rpy:2234
    old "Yes. Right now, she has to be in a place we can't see from here. The chances someone else is too are slim."
    new "嗯。眼下她一定在从这里看不到的地方。至于是否还有别人也在那里，可能性不大。"

    # game/script.rpy:2240
    old "So, how's our situation looking? We'd also appreciate having information."
    new "那么，我们这边的情况怎么样？也希望能得到些消息。"

    # game/script.rpy:2241
    old "We don't have much to work with, only the testimony from people who were inside at the time. Given all the visitors were in the lobby, we don't have a comprehensive rundown to give you."
    new "我们手头能用的线索不多，只有当时在里面的人的证词。来访者全都待在大厅，所以我们也拿不出完整的说法。"

    # game/script.rpy:2244
    old "Unidentified smoke appeared on the first floor, and shortly after, an alarm went off. An effect of this alarm was to seal all the exit routes."
    new "一楼出现了不明烟雾，紧接着警报响起。警报的作用之一，是把所有出口都封死。"

    # game/script.rpy:2249
    old "We already know this. Why was the alarm triggered, and how can we leave?"
    new "这些我们已经知道了。警报为什么会响，我们又该怎么出去？"

    # game/script.rpy:2254
    old "There's one thing that triggers the alarm. According to what we've been told, it's forcing open the Sekimeiya cabinet."
    new "触发警报的条件只有一个。据我们得到的说法，是强行打开 Sekimeiya 的展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:2255
    old "What do you mean? We were there just now, and the cabinet looked fine. Not only that, but when the alarm went off, I was in the room with that very cabinet, and I didn't hear anything happening to it."
    new "什么意思？我们刚才就在那儿，展示柜好好的。而且警报响的时候，我人就在那个展示柜所在的房间里，根本没听见它那边有什么动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:2256
    old "That... doesn't sound right. This is reliable information that's been provided to us, so I don't know if it's possible something else triggered it. Maybe the system broke."
    new "这……就说不通了。这条情报是可靠渠道给我们的，所以会不会是别的东西触发了警报，我也说不准。也许是系统出了故障。"

    # game/script.rpy:2257
    old "What's for sure is that we just observed the Sekimeiya. Everything there is intact."
    new "能确定的是，我们刚刚亲眼看过 Sekimeiya。那里一切完好。"

    # game/script.rpy:2259
    old "I'm sure the Ashiya family will be glad to hear that. I'll tell them immediately. However, that is as expected, seeing as all that was stolen were a few gemstones of little value."
    new "芦屋家听到这个消息一定会安心。我这就去通知他们。不过，这也是意料之中的事，毕竟被偷走的只是几颗不值钱的宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:2261
    old "Everyone had a hard time processing that last sentence. Meanwhile, Suripo looked to be sending a text message, most likely to Ashiya, assuring the well-being of the Sekimeiya."
    new "最后那句话，让所有人都一时没反应过来。与此同时，Suripo 似乎在发短信，多半是发给芦屋家，告知 Sekimeiya 安然无恙。"

    # game/script.rpy:2264
    old "...What do you mean? What was stolen?"
    new "……什么意思？被偷了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:2265
    old "Well, naturally, after the alarm went off, it took a while to confine everyone who had evacuated. A young individual carrying a black suitcase dashed off, so they were pulled aside. Inside it, we found various gemstones that belonged to Ashiya."
    new "这个嘛，警报响起之后，把疏散的人群全部控制住花了些时间。有个年轻人提着黑色手提箱想溜，被我们拦了下来。箱子里装的是芦屋家的各种宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:2266
    old "That individual has refused to say anything. However, we assumed that some part of their actions triggered the alarm. If the Sekimeiya cabinet hasn't been damaged, we'll have to reconsider."
    new "那个人什么都不肯说。不过我们原本推测，是对方的某个举动触发了警报。既然 Sekimeiya 的展示柜没有损坏，那就得重新考虑了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2271
    old "If their plan triggered the alarm, how did they manage to avoid getting trapped?"
    new "如果他们的计划触发了警报，那他们又是怎么没被一起困住的？"

    # game/script.rpy:2272
    old "We don't know, but since nothing is wrong with the Sekimeiya, this seems to confirm the goal was to divert everyone's attention and steal a bunch of regular gems while everyone in charge thought that they knew the next target."
    new "我们也不清楚。不过既然 Sekimeiya 没事，这似乎恰好印证了他们的目的：把所有人的注意力引开，趁管理层自以为已经掌握下一个目标的时候，卷走一批普通宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:2275
    old "What do you mean the next target? ...And how long will we need to stay here as a result of this stunt?"
    new "下一个目标是什么意思？……还有，被这一出闹的，我们得在这儿待多久？"

    # game/script.rpy:2278
    old "Both of your questions are related, actually. I assume this means you haven't heard of the past incidents?"
    new "其实你这两个问题是连在一起的。看来你们没听说过以前那些案子？"

    # game/script.rpy:2279
    old "Past incidents? What does that mean?"
    new "以前的案子？你指什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:2285
    old "I read about it not too long ago, in Yushinews. About how Ashiya Tower had suffered another robbery yet again by a group called Xyn, I believe."
    new "我不久前在 Yushinews 上读到过。说的是芦屋塔又一次遭到一个叫 Xyn 的团伙抢劫。"

    # game/script.rpy:2286
    old "Yushinews was a monthly newspaper that released a compilation of every notable recent event. Given our town wasn't very big, it was a popular way to keep oneself updated, but it wasn't something I often looked at."
    new "Yushinews 是一份月刊，专门汇总近期发生的各种要闻。我们镇子不大，想了解近况的人常看它，不过我本人很少翻。"

    # game/script.rpy:2289
    old "Exactly. The Ashiya family and Xyn have a history together. Even though Ashiya are perceived as a major influence around here, when they attracted people interested in their business, they inevitably drew in competition and enemies too."
    new "正是。芦屋家和 Xyn 之间积怨已久。芦屋在这一带被视为极有势力的一方，可一旦有人盯上他们的生意，竞争者和仇敌也就不可避免地随之而来。"

    # game/script.rpy:2290
    old "That's when Xyn started moving in. They're a long-running group that specializes in robberies of valuable objects, alongside similar criminal activities. When the Ashiya family became an established and wealthy entity, they also became a perfect target for Xyn. The fact they had developed in such a calm environment meant their security measures weren't adequate."
    new "Xyn 就是那时开始插手的。这是个活动多年的团伙，专门盗取贵重物品，也干其他类似的勾当。芦屋家成了根基稳固的豪门之后，也就成了 Xyn 再合适不过的目标。他们是在这样安稳的环境里发展起来的，安保自然谈不上充分。"

    # game/script.rpy:2293
    old "It's rumored that Xyn is a small group of people who work together and put a great deal of effort into their plans. None of them have ever been caught, which evidently gave them a reputation among plenty of people."
    new "据说 Xyn 人数不多，彼此配合，在筹划上极费心思。他们至今无一人落网，名声自然也就传开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2294
    old "While the Ashiya family might look like an almighty entity for Yushibana residents, they're not one at all in the bigger picture. This led to them focusing on expanding themselves before even foreseeing or trying to prevent these attacks, which have only been getting bolder."
    new "在丰花居民眼里，芦屋家或许无所不能，可放到更大的格局里，他们远没有那么强大。结果他们把心思都放在扩张上，连这些袭击都未能预见，更谈不上防范，而对方的行动也一次比一次大胆。"

    # game/script.rpy:2295
    old "The first one happened two years ago. The security at the time was nothing special, so it looked like a small job, not anything of particular note..."
    new "第一起发生在两年前。那时的安保平平无奇，看起来只是桩小案子，没什么特别值得在意的……"

    # game/script.rpy:2296
    old "However, since then, the attacks increased in both scale and frequency. I couldn't tell you how big this group calling itself Xyn really is, but they've been tormenting Ashiya for a while now."
    new "然而从那以后，袭击的规模和次数都在增加。自称 Xyn 的这个团伙究竟有多大，我说不准，但他们已经折腾芦屋很久了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2297
    old "Stopping them has been pretty problematic, and now they're moving in broad daylight with mass panic like this. At least, we assume they're involved here."
    new "要拦住他们相当棘手，而如今他们竟敢在光天化日之下动手，闹出这么大的恐慌。至少我们是这么推断的——这次也有他们插手。"

    # game/script.rpy:2301
    old "...{w}Had such a battle actually been happening in the town I'd always lived in? I'd purposely avoided anything to do with that aspect of Yushibana, but I hadn't heard of Xyn even once. I could vaguely recall hearing about Ashiya Tower being robbed, but I'd never imagined the situation was so large scale.{w} No one I frequently talked to had an interest in the topic, so if it was common knowledge, I'd never been told. Ashiya had always felt like a taboo, and I'd never personally researched them."
    new "……{w}这样的争斗，真的一直发生在我生活了这么多年的镇子上吗？关于丰花的这一面，我一向刻意回避，可即便如此，Xyn 这个名字我竟一次也没听过。芦屋塔遭劫的事，我隐约有些印象，却从没想过规模如此之大。{w}常和我来往的人里没人关心这类话题，所以就算这早已人尽皆知，也从来没人跟我提起。芦屋对我而言一直像个禁忌，我也从未主动去了解过他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:2306
    old "I think the last time this happened wasn't too long ago, right? I was a bit hesitant to bring Isla here, but she was really excited."
    new "我记得上一次发生这种事，离现在也没多久吧？我本来还有点犹豫要不要带 Isla 来，可她特别兴奋。"

    # game/script.rpy:2307
    old "Yes. On the 24th of November, 21 days ago, Xyn attacked again. Ignoring the latest security upgrades, they made their way in during the night and stole a lot of valuable gems. It was one of the worst blows Ashiya's taken."
    new "对。11 月 24 日，也就是 21 天前，Xyn 又一次动手。他们无视最新的安保升级，趁夜潜入，盗走了大量贵重宝石。那是芦屋遭受过的最沉重的打击之一。"

    # game/script.rpy:2308
    old "Correct. Nothing actually indicates Xyn were the ones involved, and in fact, nothing ever does. However, the way everything goes smoothly and all of Ashiya's efforts are proven futile screams \"Xyn\" to everyone."
    new "没错。其实没有任何证据表明是 Xyn 干的，事实上从来都没有过。可每次行动都顺顺当当，芦屋的所有努力全成徒劳，任谁看了都只会觉得是 Xyn。"

    # game/script.rpy:2313
    old "So this time, Ashiya took it a step further, right?"
    new "所以这一次，芦屋又往前迈了一步，是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2314
    old "Perhaps we'd all been thinking that. It looked like we had simply been caught in the middle of a rivalry, and Ashiya's latest move had imprisoned us."
    new "也许我们都是这么想的。看起来，我们只是被卷进了两方的争斗之中，而芦屋最新的这步棋，反倒把我们关在了里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:2319
    old "...Yes.{w} It's possible that Xyn aren't actually involved, given the stolen gems were found. Nonetheless, the method used to get them out is still unknown. They were in one of the deepest rooms of the floor you're on."
    new "……是的。{w}既然被盗的宝石已经找回来了，Xyn 也未必真的参与其中。但宝石是怎么被运出去的，至今仍是个谜。它们原本放在你们这层最深处的一间房里。"

    # game/script.rpy:2320
    old "What closed the exit was the alarm, which had never gone off in the past. While Ashiya are denying it, malfunctions are a possibility.{w} The alarm was supposed to only go off whenever the Sekimeiya cabinet was forced open. If stealing the gems we found was what triggered it, it doesn't make sense that they were brought outside. And on top of that, you're telling me the Sekimeiya and the cabinet are completely fine..."
    new "封死出口的是警报，而这种警报过去从未响过。芦屋家否认存在故障，但也不能排除这种可能。{w}按设计，只有 Sekimeiya 的展示柜被强行打开时，警报才会响。如果真是因为偷走那些宝石才触发的警报，那宝石被带到外面就说不通了。更何况，你们还说 Sekimeiya 和展示柜都完好无损……"

    # game/script.rpy:2321
    old "It all sounded very strange, and I was admittedly intrigued."
    new "这一切听来都透着古怪，而我不得不承认，自己被勾起了兴趣。"

    # game/script.rpy:2322
    old "I've been given authority to tell you about Ashiya's latest move against Xyn, which led to this incident."
    new "我已经获准向你们说明芦屋为对付 Xyn 采取的最新举措——也正是这次事件的起因。"

    # game/script.rpy:2323
    old "I see. This is what I felt I couldn't say earlier."
    new "原来如此。这就是我刚才觉得不便说出口的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:2324
    old "Keep in mind that what I'm about to tell you is a confidential matter that you're only allowed to hear because of your circumstances."
    new "请记住，我接下来要说的是机密，你们能听到，纯粹是因为眼下的处境特殊。"

    # game/script.rpy:2327
    old "One constant that has always followed with Xyn's attacks is that they attack during the night, presumably to minimize risks."
    new "Xyn 的袭击有一个始终不变的特点：他们总在夜里动手，大概是为了把风险降到最低。"

    # game/script.rpy:2328
    old "Since Xyn bypassed anything Ashiya did without an issue, they recently put their full effort into a way to eliminate the threat."
    new "既然芦屋做的任何防备都被 Xyn 轻易绕过，他们最近便倾尽全力，想找出一个根除威胁的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:2329
    old "The Sekimeiya exhibition... was no more than bait they put out to lure in Xyn. That, and the alarm they secretly designed, were the main two factors of their plan.{w} The tower is equipped with cameras and security. However, Ashiya hoped Xyn wouldn't anticipate such an abrupt jump in their measures."
    new "Sekimeiya 的展览……不过是他们放出的诱饵，用来引 Xyn 上钩。这场展览，加上他们暗中设计的警报，就是整个计划的两大支柱。{w}塔内装有监控和安保人员。不过芦屋希望 Xyn 料想不到他们的手段会如此突然地加强。"

    # game/script.rpy:2330
    old "There was so much advertising done for this particular showing that everyone in town bought into it. That was the goal. But, on the side, Ashiya secretly designed the alarm."
    new "这次展出宣传得铺天盖地，镇上的人全被吸引来了——这正是他们的目的。不过与此同时，芦屋还暗中设计了那套警报。"

    # game/script.rpy:2331
    old "It was going to be activated whenever the cabinet was forced open. Only one key for the cabinet was made, and the lock was very carefully designed to only allow the correct one. The cabinet itself, however, was one they already had and could easily be broken with force."
    new "只要展示柜被人强行打开，警报就会启动。柜子的钥匙只配了一把，锁也经过精心设计，只认那一把。可柜子本身却是他们本来就有的，用力一砸就能砸开。"

    # game/script.rpy:2332
    old "Obviously, breaking the glass of the cabinet would also activate the alarm. It was done so that any method of getting the Sekimeiya out without the key would trigger the alarm and trap the culprit with no way to escape."
    new "当然，砸碎柜子的玻璃同样会触发警报。这样一来，任何不借助钥匙、想把 Sekimeiya 取出来的手段都会触发警报，把犯人困在里面，无路可逃。"

    # game/script.rpy:2337
    old "What the hell is this about? That shutter could've injured people as they were escaping!"
    new "这算怎么回事？卷帘门落下的时候，正在往外逃的人可是会受伤的！"

    # game/script.rpy:2338
    old "No. The mechanism is equipped with a sensor. If anyone had been in front of the shutter before it closed, it would've stopped moving until they stepped away."
    new "不会。装置里装有感应器。卷帘门关闭之前，只要有人站在门下，它就会停住，等人走开才继续落下。"

    # game/script.rpy:2346
    old "We all kept silent at the realization that our situation was far more unusual than we'd thought."
    new "意识到处境远比我们想象的离奇，所有人都沉默了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2347
    old "The final element of the plan was the room you're currently in: the security room."
    new "计划的最后一环，就是各位现在待的这个房间——监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:2348
    old "The alarm, along with blocking off all methods of escape, has other smaller functions such as disabling the elevator, some lights, and communication methods. The maximum time the exit was going to be shut was twelve hours."
    new "警报除了封死所有逃生的途径，还兼有一些次要功能，比如让电梯、部分照明和通讯手段失效。出口最长会被封闭十二个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:2353
    old "...Maximum time? Does that mean it can be less than that?"
    new "……最长？也就是说，也可能不到十二个小时？"

    # game/script.rpy:2354
    old "Yes, but please don't get your hopes up."
    new "没错，不过还请别抱太大希望。"

    # game/script.rpy:2358
    old "After the alarm, the Xyn members that got trapped inside would have no way to leave. You might've noticed the security room's door is sturdier than the others. The last function of the alarm was to lock it.{w} Like the cabinet's lock, once the security room's door is locked, it can only be opened with the actual key, which is possessed by the security staff. Every staff member worked to put this mechanism and plan into effect, and they knew very well what they had to do. Today, only Katei Kuiji was present."
    new "警报启动之后，被困在里面的 Xyn 成员就再也出不去了。各位或许已经注意到，监控室的门比别处结实得多。警报的最后一项功能，就是把这扇门锁上。{w}和展示柜的锁一样，监控室的门一旦锁死，就只能用真正的钥匙打开，而钥匙在保安人员手里。所有员工都为这套装置和方案的实施出过力，对自己该做什么一清二楚。可今天在场的，只有 Katei Kuiji 一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:2360
    old "A security member would be inside the room constantly, monitoring the cameras. Of course, this is always done. Xyn have shown multiple ways to overcome the cameras, but this time, this was of little importance."
    new "监控室里始终有一名保安留守，盯着摄像头画面。当然，平时本来就是这样。Xyn 已经展示过好几种避开摄像头的法子，但这一次，这一点无关紧要。"

    # game/script.rpy:2361
    old "During the time anyone from Xyn was trapped, the security member in the security room would have one job: to relay information between the inside and the outside. This is why the security room is the only place where communication methods aren't cut off."
    new "只要还有 Xyn 的人被困在里面，监控室的保安就只负责一件事：在内外之间传递消息。也正因如此，监控室是唯一没有被切断通讯的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:2363
    old "Once it was all over, the security staff would be able to unlock the exit before twelve hours had passed. To ultimately ensure nothing funny occurred, that request would have to be approved by the Ashiya family themselves. Only then would the exit be opened before the maximum time."
    new "等一切结束，保安人员就能在十二个小时之内解除出口的封锁。为了确保不出岔子，这个请求必须由芦屋家的人亲自批准。只有得到批准，出口才会提前打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:2368
    old "So what, they aren't approving it?"
    new "怎么，他们不肯批？"

    # game/script.rpy:2369
    old "No. They can't.{w} They don't know why, but they are unable to even access the command that would let them give their approval to open the exit."
    new "对。他们做不到。{w}原因不明，但他们连那条批准开启出口的指令都调不出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:2370
    old "They aren't sure, but most likely something went wrong. Given the cause of the alarm is unknown, the most reasonable explanation is a malfunction."
    new "他们也不确定，但多半是哪里出了差错。既然警报的起因不明，最合理的解释就是故障。"

    # game/script.rpy:2376
    old "Hey, Katei, you knew about this function, right? Why did you say that we'd be here for twelve hours without mentioning that you had the chance to open the shutter earlier?"
    new "喂，Katei，这个功能你是知道的吧？那你为什么只说我们要在这里待上十二个小时，却完全没提你有可能提前打开卷帘门？"

    # game/script.rpy:2377
    old "Oh... Back then, I didn't think I was allowed to explain the mechanism and reason behind the alarm, but I was certain we wouldn't be leaving before the time was up."
    new "啊……当时我以为自己没有权限解释警报的机制和缘由。但我很确定，时间没到之前，我们出不去。"

    # game/script.rpy:2378
    old "When I was still in this room, I noticed the same thing the Ashiya family noticed. I didn't have permission to access that command. That meant that we would have to spend the full time here."
    new "我还待在这个房间的时候，就注意到了芦屋家也注意到的那件事：我没有权限调出那条指令。这就意味着，我们必须在这里待满规定的时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:2379
    old "In case something went wrong, this failsafe was designed: the exit would always open twelve hours after it locked. Obviously, that much time ensured that if a Xyn member had gotten trapped, they couldn't escape when the time ran out."
    new "为了防止出岔子，还设了一道保险：出口在封锁满十二个小时后必定开启。显然，留出这么长的时间，就是为了确保万一有 Xyn 成员被困，也没法等到时间结束再逃出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:2385
    old "How is it possible that you don't have access to it? Can't you fix it?"
    new "你怎么可能没有权限？难道不能修好吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2386
    old "I'm afraid I wouldn't know where to start. I have no clue what caused it, but if the Ashiya family is encountering the same error, it doesn't look like something I could solve."
    new "恐怕我连从哪儿下手都不知道。起因我毫无头绪，可既然芦屋家也遇上同样的错误，那多半不是我一个人能解决的。"

    # game/script.rpy:2392
    old "Then... isn't there a way to take down the shutters from the outside?"
    new "那……就没有办法从外面把卷帘门拆下来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2393
    old "No.{w} ...The attack was assumed to come during the night, but it happened this morning instead. I don't know a lot of details about this, but evidently Ashiya were going to trap at least one Xyn member inside and try to squeeze them for information over the security room microphone."
    new "没有。{w}……原本预计袭击会发生在夜里，结果却是在今天早上。细节我了解得不多，但看来芦屋是打算至少困住一名 Xyn 成员，再通过监控室的麦克风从他嘴里撬出情报。"

    # game/script.rpy:2394
    old "No one really knows how big Xyn is, but the shutters were designed in such a way that, in case members came to rescue their trapped comrades, they couldn't do anything from the outside. This is why, in much the same way, we can't do anything to break them down without a method that would also collapse the entire building. They might look flimsy, but I guarantee you they're not."
    new "没人真正清楚 Xyn 的规模，但卷帘门的设计，就是为了在同伙前来营救时，让他们从外面无从下手。同样地，我们也拿它没办法——除非连整栋楼一起弄塌。它们看着单薄，但我可以保证，绝不单薄。"

    # game/script.rpy:2400
    old "I'm confused. Katei, if you knew about this, why did you ever leave the security room? Why didn't you use the microphone to talk to the trapped culprit, as you'd all agreed?"
    new "我有点糊涂了。Katei，既然你清楚这些，当初为什么要离开监控室？为什么不像事先商量好的那样，用麦克风和被困的犯人说话？"

    # game/script.rpy:2401
    old "To tell you the truth, I did. All of you were unconscious, though, so you didn't hear me. I didn't receive any reply, and since the most important cameras had been disabled, I wanted to see for myself what had happened."
    new "老实说，我说了。只是你们当时全都昏迷着，没听见。我没有得到任何回应，而最重要的几台摄像头又已经失效，所以我想亲眼看看出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:2408
    old "So, all of this means that there's no way out right now. At all."
    new "这么说，现在是真的出不去了。一点办法都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:2409
    old "Yes. Ashiya informed us of this plan days ago. They were certain Xyn would attack, so the police had to be caught up."
    new "是的。几天前芦屋就把这个计划通知了我们。他们确信 Xyn 会动手，所以警方也必须知悉。"

    # game/script.rpy:2410
    old "Since today was the last possible day, we were all anticipating Xyn to come during the night. Long before {time=9}, I myself was in the tower, aware that the chances of a theft were incredibly likely. I was in contact with Ashiya staff about what the procedure would be if something were to happen."
    new "今天是最后的机会，所以我们都预料 Xyn 会在夜里行动。早在 {time=9} 之前，我就已经待在塔里，清楚盗窃的可能性极高，并一直与芦屋的员工联络，确认万一出事该如何应对。"

    # game/script.rpy:2413
    old "Sure enough, after thinking about it, I recalled seeing him next to the entrance while we'd been waiting."
    new "仔细一想，果然不假——我们等候的时候，我的确见过他站在入口旁边。"

    # game/script.rpy:2416
    old "I left before the hallway doors opened. We were told something could still happen, and one of us had also been pretty insistent in saying there'd be an attack. That's why we stayed outside and were able to contain everyone who evacuated very quickly."
    new "我是在走廊门打开之前离开的。上头说过仍有可能出事，我们当中也有人坚称袭击会发生。所以我们才守在外面，疏散的人一出来，就能迅速把所有人控制住。"

    # game/script.rpy:2418
    old "I believe this is the scenario Ashiya will be going with: this was an attack by Xyn intended to subvert their expectations and target a lot of regular gems instead of the Sekimeiya. Maybe it would've been a success if it hadn't been for the new alarm. The suitcase was discovered right away, and all the gems were retrieved."
    new "我想芦屋那边会这样定性：这次是 Xyn 的一次袭击，意在出乎他们的意料，不冲着 Sekimeiya，而是瞄准大量普通宝石。要不是有那套新警报，说不定就让他们得手了。手提箱当场被发现，所有宝石都追了回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:2419
    old "It's possible the alarm went off due to a malfunction, which is also preventing them from opening the exit before the maximum time. Right now, all they can do is wait and tell you guys to do the same. They don't believe anything else has happened and will most likely be calling this their victory."
    new "警报可能是故障触发的，而同样的故障也让他们无法提前打开出口。眼下他们只能等，并且让你们也一起等。他们不认为还发生了别的事，多半会把这次当成一场胜利。"

    # game/script.rpy:2420
    old "I'm sorry I can't be of more help. While some details are still unclear, it all more or less makes sense."
    new "抱歉，我能帮上的有限。虽然还有些细节不清楚，但大体上都说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:2425
    old "All right. Is there anything else you should tell us?"
    new "好吧。还有别的该告诉我们的事吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2426
    old "...I don't believe so. There's nothing you should worry about besides having to be in there for a while. I personally apologize for all the inconvenience, and I'm sure Ashiya will compensate all of you for being innocently trapped."
    new "……我想没有了。除了要在里面待上一阵子，没什么需要担心的。给你们添了这些麻烦，我个人深表歉意；各位无辜被困，芦屋一定会给予补偿。"

    # game/script.rpy:2427
    old "Nobody wanted to mention that someone among us might not have been \"innocently\" trapped, and instead we stayed silent, thinking about the hours that awaited us."
    new "没有人愿意提起，我们当中或许有人并非「无辜」被困。大家只是沉默着，想着接下来那几个小时该如何度过。"

    # game/script.rpy:2430
    old "Was that really everything, though? Was it all just a malfunction? Was Xyn actually involved? I knew many things didn't quite add up.{w} What the hell had happened to Naomi, on top of it all?"
    new "可真的就只有这些吗？一切都只是故障？Xyn 真的牵涉其中吗？我知道有很多地方对不上。{w}更何况，Naomi 身上到底出了什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:2431
    old "Recently, there had been... a similar attack in Yushibana, where smoke had also been released. Assuming that Xyn were involved in the attack on the tower, it was a pretty easy leap to assume that they had been behind the other."
    new "最近在丰花也发生过……一次类似的袭击，同样放出过烟雾。假设芦屋塔这次是 Xyn 所为，那么很容易就能推断，那一次也是他们干的。"

    # game/script.rpy:2437
    old "...So, what are we gonna do? Twelve hours is a lot of time. Can we go to the Sekimeiya again?"
    new "……那，我们接下来怎么办？十二个小时可不短。还能再去看 Sekimeiya 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2438
    old "I think you should first reunite with Miss Cabca. After that, make sure not to do anything Ashiya might not be happy with, or they could find a way to avoid compensating you."
    new "我看你们还是先和 Cabca 小姐会合为好。之后，千万别做让芦屋不高兴的事，否则他们可能会找借口不给补偿。"

    # game/script.rpy:2440
    old "Suripo forced a smile and was about to put an end to the conversation."
    new "Suripo 勉强笑了笑，打算就此打住。"

    # game/script.rpy:2452
    old "Suddenly, out of the three computer monitors, the leftmost one went black."
    new "突然，三台显示器中，最左边的那台黑了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:2458
    old "Wh-What? What just happened to this screen?"
    new "什、什么？这屏幕怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:2459
    old "Sai, who was the one in front of it, was first to react."
    new "站在那台屏幕前的 Sai 最先反应过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:2464
    old "Let me see... It's possible the computer stopped recognizing the screen. One second..."
    new "我看看……可能是电脑突然认不出显示器了。等一下……"

    # game/script.rpy:2465
    old "Sai's overreaction threw everyone off, including Suripo. That was because we had only been looking at the middle screen, and the computer was still working. The leftmost screen had been displaying nothing but an empty part of the desktop."
    new "Sai 反应过度，让所有人都摸不着头脑，连 Suripo 也不例外——因为我们一直只盯着中间那块屏幕，而电脑明明还在运转。最左边那块屏幕显示的一直只是桌面上的空白区域。"

    # game/script.rpy:2468
    old "Regardless, Sai quickly grabbed the mouse and navigated to the screen configuration settings."
    new "不管怎样，Sai 很快抓起鼠标，打开了屏幕设置界面。"

    # game/script.rpy:2469
    old "At least you aren't using some custom operating system. I know what I'm looking for."
    new "至少你们用的不是什么自制系统。我知道该看哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:2470
    old "I see... How strange. The left monitor isn't being detected at all..."
    new "原来如此……真奇怪。左边那台显示器完全检测不到……"

    # game/script.rpy:2473
    old "Does it matter? The computer didn't actually shut down, did it?"
    new "这有关系吗？电脑又没有真的关机，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:2478
    old "Oh, no, obviously not. We can still hear and see you. Sorry, I was just confused. I don't know what caused it, though. It just stopped detecting it out of the blue."
    new "啊，没有，当然没有。我们还能听见、看见你们。抱歉，我只是有点困惑。不过我也不知道是什么原因，它突然就检测不到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2479
    old "You'll have time to figure it out. For now, there are better thi—"
    new "你有的是时间慢慢查。眼下还有更要紧的——"

    # game/script.rpy:2484
    old "Suripo never finished that sentence. Before he could, the other two screens also went black."
    new "Suripo 那句话没能说完。还没等他继续，另外两块屏幕也黑了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2489
    old "What... happened now?"
    new "又……怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:2496
    old "It wasn't only the screens this time. The computer seems to have shut down too."
    new "这次不只是屏幕。电脑好像也关机了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2501
    old "How...? What the hell?"
    new "怎么会……？搞什么鬼？"

    # game/script.rpy:2502
    old "Shiroya, Erina, and Isla were looking upward. It seemed the three computer screens weren't the only ones to turn off."
    new "Shiroya、Erina 和 Isla 都抬头向上看。看来熄掉的并不止那三块电脑屏幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:2507
    old "All the security cameras too...? Oh no..."
    new "连监控摄像头也……？糟了……"

    # game/script.rpy:2508
    old "The light works, so it can't be a power outage."
    new "灯还亮着，应该不是停电。"

    # game/script.rpy:2513
    old "Did a cable get disconnected?"
    new "是线松了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2516
    old "Katei crouched under the desk and looked behind the computer."
    new "Katei 蹲到桌下，查看电脑背面。"

    # game/script.rpy:2521
    old "There's nothing that looks wrong."
    new "看不出有什么不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:2522
    old "He pressed the power button multiple times, but the computer refused to start up."
    new "他连按了几次电源键，电脑始终没能启动。"

    # game/script.rpy:2523
    old "What the hell just happened?"
    new "到底是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:2528
    old "Was it Naomi?"
    new "是 Naomi 干的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2533
    old "Naomi...?"
    new "Naomi……？"

    # game/script.rpy:2534
    old "We were almost done with Suripo, and it was time to look at the recorded footage. If it implicated her, she might be responsible for the computer shutting off."
    new "我们快问完 Suripo 了，接下来就该看录像。如果录像里牵涉到她，电脑关机或许就是她动的手脚。"

    # game/script.rpy:2539
    old "Is... Is she listening to us?"
    new "她……她是不是在听我们说话？"

    # game/script.rpy:2545
    old "Katei sprinted out of the room and looked at both sides of the hallway. He even peeked at the lobby."
    new "Katei 冲出房间，朝走廊两端张望，甚至还探头看了看大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:2546
    old "While he was out and everyone's focus had diverted to the door, I noticed something behind me."
    new "趁他出去、众人的注意力都转向门口时，我却注意到身后有什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:2552
    old "Sai had just taken his arm away from the leftmost monitor."
    new "Sai 刚把手臂从最左边那块屏幕上移开。"

    # game/script.rpy:2557
    old "When he noticed I was looking at him, our eyes met, and he smirked."
    new "他发觉我在看他，与我对上视线，嘴角一扬。"

    # game/script.rpy:2558
    old "Before I could think, noise filled the room again."
    new "我还没来得及细想，房间里又响起了声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:2565
    old "Katei came back, panting. It seemed the possibility of being spied on in his workroom had really gotten to him."
    new "Katei 喘着气回来了。看来，一想到自己的工作室也可能被人监视，他是真的慌了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2571
    old "We didn't have to ask to know he'd found nothing."
    new "不用问也知道，他什么都没找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:2572
    old "Do you know how someone would have turned off the computer from outside the room?"
    new "你知道有什么办法能从房间外面关掉这台电脑吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2573
    old "No... That should be impossible."
    new "不知道……那应该不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:2574
    old "As I said earlier, underneath the lobby is the panel that handles the tower's electricity. While it isn't incredibly well protected, it should be impossible to power off the main computer from there."
    new "就像我之前说的，大厅底下是控制整座塔供电的配电盘。虽说防护算不上严密，但想从那里切断主电脑的电源，应该是不可能的。"

    # game/script.rpy:2579
    old "That doesn't make sense... Are you sure it wouldn't be possible?"
    new "这说不通……你确定真的不可能吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2580
    old "I have worked here for many years, so yes."
    new "我在这里工作很多年了，所以我很确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:2581
    old "Maybe we should go check anyway."
    new "还是去确认一下吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:2586
    old "I agree. Let me go with you, esteemed visitor."
    new "我同意。让我陪你走一趟吧，尊贵的访客。"

    # game/script.rpy:2587
    old "Without waiting for a reply, Sai grabbed me by my shirt and lightly ushered me out of the room."
    new "Sai 没等回答，便抓住我的衣襟，半推半送地把我带出了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:2594
    old "Hey, wait."
    new "喂，等等。"

    # game/script.rpy:2597
    old "He didn't wait."
    new "他没有等。"

    # game/script.rpy:2598
    old "I-It's fine. I'll be right back."
    new "没、没事，我很快就回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:2609
    old "That must have been enough for Shiroya, because she didn't follow us."
    new "这句话大概足以让 Shiroya 放心，她没有跟上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:2610
    old "I did actually want to see the panel, so I let Sai do what he wanted. It was better to not put up a fight if it gave me the same result either way."
    new "我本来也确实想看看那个配电盘，便随 Sai 去了。既然横竖都是一个结果，与其争执，不如顺着他。"

    # game/script.rpy:2616
    old "We'd talked about the room before, so we knew how to access it even though it wasn't marked on the map."
    new "那间房间我们之前聊起过，所以即便地图上没有标注，我们也知道该怎么过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:2622
    old "Sai started walking without uttering a word, and I followed behind."
    new "Sai 一言不发地走了起来，我跟在后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:2623
    old "I wanted to ask what exactly was up with him, but the words didn't leave my mouth."
    new "我想问他到底是怎么回事，话却没能说出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:2634
    old "We went past the reception desk. Being behind it was a strange feeling, but I didn't have time to look around."
    new "我们走过前台。站在柜台后面的感觉怪怪的，但我没工夫四处张望。"

    # game/script.rpy:2638
    old "As Katei had said, the door to the mechanical room was unlocked. Past it was a very narrow and dark staircase that made a sharp turn to the right."
    new "正如 Katei 所说，机械室的门没有上锁。门后是一道狭窄昏暗的楼梯，向右急转。"

    # game/script.rpy:2643
    old "How scary. You go first."
    new "真吓人。你先走。"

    # game/script.rpy:2644
    old "His nonchalant way of speaking made it clear he wasn't being serious. If it was supposed to be a joke, it didn't seem very appropriate."
    new "他说话时那副漫不经心的样子，摆明了没在认真。如果这算玩笑，也不怎么合适。"

    # game/script.rpy:2647
    old "Nonetheless, I entered the stairwell first. The ceiling became a bit lower, which required me to crouch to advance. Both of us stepped into the mechanical room after opening a smaller second door."
    new "尽管如此，我还是率先走进了楼梯间。天花板矮了一截，我得弯着腰才能前进。推开第二道小门后，我们两人一同进了机械室。"

    # game/script.rpy:2655
    old "The temperature didn't change, but the light was very dim, much worse in quality than the other ones used throughout the tower. The illumination was worse than the smoke-filled hallways'."
    new "温度倒没变，光线却暗得厉害，这里的灯比塔里其他地方用的差远了。连那些烟雾弥漫的走廊都比这儿亮。"

    # game/script.rpy:2659
    old "High up on the wall was the panel Katei described. I had to move aside a low table to walk up to it, but reaching it didn't present a problem: I could easily touch the ceiling with my hand."
    new "Katei 说的那块面板就装在墙面高处。我得挪开一张矮桌才能走到墙边，不过够到它并不难——我随手一抬就能碰到天花板。"

    # game/script.rpy:2660
    old "I looked around me. Past all the cobwebs, I could see the boiler Katei had mentioned, and it emitted a constant buzzing sound. There were also small, worn-out pieces of furniture littered around, presumably because nothing bigger could fit through the staircase."
    new "我环顾四周。透过层层蛛网，能看见 Katei 提过的那台锅炉，一直发出嗡嗡的声响。地上还散落着几件破旧的小家具，大概是因为再大些的东西根本搬不进楼梯间。"

    # game/script.rpy:2665
    old "It seems he was right. All the switches are on."
    new "看来他没说错。所有开关都开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:2666
    old "...Yeah. This probably hasn't been used lately. It's covered in dust."
    new "……嗯。这里最近应该没人动过，上面全是灰。"

    # game/script.rpy:2671
    old "I agree."
    new "我同意。"

    # game/script.rpy:2672
    old "The panel was protected by a plastic cover with a key lock, and every switch had a label on top of it. They were hard to read, but the one labeled \"security room\", just like all the others, was on."
    new "面板外罩着一层带锁的塑料盖，每个开关上方都贴着标签。字迹很难辨认，但标着「监控室」的那个和其余开关一样，都开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:2677
    old "Can I ask something?"
    new "我能问一句吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2678
    old "Hm?"
    new "嗯？"

    # game/script.rpy:2679
    old "Do you believe a word of what Katei's been saying?"
    new "Katei 说的那些，你信几分？"

    # game/script.rpy:2681
    old "Wh-What...?{w} What do you mean?"
    new "什、什么……？{w}你这话是什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:2682
    old "That took me by surprise. Maybe not so much the fact that he'd been suspecting Katei, but that he'd asked me so suddenly."
    new "这话让我吃了一惊。倒不是因为他怀疑 Katei，而是他问得太突然了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2687
    old "I mean what I said. Everything that Katei has said... There's no way you believe it, right?"
    new "就是字面意思。Katei 说过的每一句话……你总不至于都信吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:2688
    old "From the beginning, when he found us. When he claimed to have searched the entire floor without finding your group.{w} About monitoring the cameras and trying to open the exit."
    new "从最开始他找到我们那会儿。他说自己把整层都搜遍了，却没发现你们几个。{w}还有他盯着监控、试着打开出口的那些话。"

    # game/script.rpy:2689
    old "Remember what he said? That he hadn't found it appropriate to try to talk to the outside and instead kept looking at the available cameras?"
    new "还记得他是怎么说的吗？说自己觉得不该贸然联系外界，就一直盯着能调出来的监控画面。"

    # game/script.rpy:2694
    old "You can't seriously tell me you believe that."
    new "你总不会真跟我说你信这套吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:2695
    old "I... I don't know."
    new "我……我不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:2699
    old "It's true that I've thought that some of his claims sounded a bit off, but this might be taking it a bit too far."
    new "我确实觉得他有些说辞不太对劲，可怀疑到这个地步，未免有些过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2700
    old "I can't definitely doubt what he said, that he panicked and prioritized figuring out what was happening before trying to contact anyone."
    new "他说自己当时慌了神，只顾先弄清状况，才没去联系别人——这一点我也没法一口咬定是假的。"

    # game/script.rpy:2701
    old "It's weird that he didn't find us, yeah, but he said he hadn't thoroughly examined the floor..."
    new "他没找到我们，确实奇怪，可他自己也说了，没有把整层仔细查过……"

    # game/script.rpy:2702
    old "He's been helpful to us and let us contact the police. I don't think he's as suspicious as you think."
    new "他帮过我们，还让我们联系了警察。我觉得他没你想的那么可疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:2707
    old "Hm...{w} Then I'll put it bluntly."
    new "嗯……{w}那我就挑明说吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:2713
    old "I guarantee you that everything he's said has been a lie. Don't trust anything he says."
    new "我可以打包票，他说的话全是假的。一个字都别信。"

    # game/script.rpy:2714
    old "...{w}How can you be sure...?"
    new "……{w}你怎么能确定……？"

    # game/script.rpy:2719
    old "You're free to not believe me. I told you this because I thought you'd realized it earlier."
    new "信不信由你。我之所以说这些，是以为你早就察觉到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2722
    old "He smiled the same way as earlier and left the room with a shrug. From his face, all I could make out was that he was trying to have fun, but I couldn't tell if he was just messing with me."
    new "他又是先前那副笑容，耸耸肩走出了房间。从他的表情里，我只能看出他在自得其乐，却分不清他是不是在拿我寻开心。"

    # game/script.rpy:2727
    old "I went upstairs. Through the door, I saw Sai in hallway B. I wanted to shout at him, but I caught up to him instead."
    new "我上了楼。隔着门，我看见 Sai 在 B走廊。我本想冲他喊，最后还是追了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:2734
    old "There's hallway C ahead, the one that's clean. Do you feel like investigating the upper floors?"
    new "前面就是 C走廊，那条干净的。想不想去上面几层看看？"

    # game/script.rpy:2735
    old "...What? Let's go back."
    new "……什么？回去吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:2739
    old "He ignored me and kept walking forward.{w} Instead of repeating myself, I felt like being the one to ask something."
    new "他没理我，继续往前走。{w}我没再重复，反倒想由我来问他点什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:2740
    old "What do you think happened to Naomi?"
    new "你觉得 Naomi 出了什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:2746
    old "I couldn't quite grasp Sai's behavior, but he was also trying to piece things together and might've agreed that more than met the eye was going on.{w} He didn't seem unintelligent, and since his approach appeared different from mine, his input was potentially useful."
    new "我实在摸不透 Sai 的举动，不过他也在拼凑真相，或许同样觉得事情并不简单。{w}他看上去并不笨，而且思路与我不一样，听听他的看法也许有用。"

    # game/script.rpy:2749
    old "I couldn't tell you for sure. Katei seemed fine looking through the monitors, but it was also not his priority."
    new "这我可说不准。Katei 查监控时看着挺上心，可那也不是他最要紧的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:2754
    old "This probably means that either he doesn't think much of Naomi's disappearance, or he knew we wouldn't spot her even if we looked through all the available cameras."
    new "这大概说明，要么他根本没把 Naomi 的失踪当回事，要么他早就知道，就算把能调的监控全看一遍，也找不到她。"

    # game/script.rpy:2755
    old "Are you sure she really passed out?"
    new "你确定她真的昏过去了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2756
    old "I'm almost certain, yes."
    new "几乎可以肯定。"

    # game/script.rpy:2761
    old "Then it's hard to believe she regained consciousness before a person as big as Akaro did. If she really inhaled the smoke and wasn't there by the time the three of you woke up, the easy explanation is that she was moved."
    new "那就很难相信她会在 Akaro 那么壮的人之前醒过来。要是她真吸进了烟，而你们三个醒来时她已不见踪影，最简单的解释就是有人把她挪走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2762
    old "Who would do that though, and why?"
    new "可谁会这么做？又为了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:2767
    old "How about the only person out of all of us who was conscious at the time?"
    new "那当时我们之中唯一清醒的人呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:2768
    old "But why?"
    new "可他为什么这么做？"

    # game/script.rpy:2773
    old "Don't ask me. It certainly makes him look obviously suspicious, so if he still did it, he must've had a good reason."
    new "别问我。他这么做，嫌疑明摆着，所以若他真动了手，一定有非做不可的理由。"

    # game/script.rpy:2781
    old "Let's check the Sekimeiya. I entered this hallway so that they wouldn't see us from the security room."
    new "去看看 Sekimeiya 吧。我特意走这条走廊，就是为了不让监控室里的人看见我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:2782
    old "Why?"
    new "为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:2785
    old "He turned to the left and opened the event room door. Why else, though? He wanted to see if it was still there."
    new "他向左一转，推开了活动室的门。还能为什么？他想确认那东西是否还在原处。"

    # game/script.rpy:2793
    old "If it's not here, Naomi took it. It's as simple as that, so I'm only curious."
    new "要是它不在了，那就是 Naomi 拿走的。就这么简单，我不过是好奇罢了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2794
    old "Sure, go ahead."
    new "行，你请便。"

    # game/script.rpy:2795
    old "It'd be pretty interesting if it wasn't here."
    new "要是它真不在，那就有意思了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2800
    old "We would know we hadn't taken it, but the other five wouldn't. Not only has this room's camera been blocked off, now they can't access any."
    new "我们自己清楚没拿，可另外五个人不会这么想。这间房的摄像头本来就被人挡住了，如今他们连任何画面都调不出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:2801
    old "Imagine we tell them the cabinet was empty. They would have three suspects. If we look throughout the entire tower and can't find Naomi, do you think they'd suspect us?"
    new "假设我们告诉他们展示柜是空的。他们就有三个嫌疑人。要是我们把整座塔搜遍都找不到 Naomi，你觉得他们会怀疑到我们头上吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2806
    old "They would insist it could have only been us—that Naomi was never trapped to begin with, and we would be the only ones to know the truth. How would you suggest we'd defend ourselves?"
    new "他们一定会咬定只可能是我们——说 Naomi 根本没被困住，而知道真相的只有我们。你说我们该怎么替自己辩解？"

    # game/script.rpy:2807
    old "...I don't know. I'm sure Shiroya would believe me. I honestly doubt they would actually suspect us."
    new "……我不知道。Shiroya 肯定会信我。说实话，我不觉得他们真会怀疑我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:2811
    old "Hm, you might be right. What if I claim you took off running and came here? ...That could be why we took so long."
    new "嗯，你说得没错。要是我说，你是突然跑到这里来的呢？……这样就能解释我们为什么去了那么久。"

    # game/script.rpy:2812
    old "...Why the hell are you acting like this?"
    new "……你到底为什么要这样？"

    # game/script.rpy:2817
    old "Don't worry, I wouldn't do that.{w} Let's see. In case it's not here, should we tell them?"
    new "放心，我不会那么做的。{w}这样吧。万一东西不在这儿，我们要告诉他们吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:2818
    old "Of course."
    new "当然。"

    # game/script.rpy:2823
    old "Why? We would be certain only Naomi or a mysterious ninth person could've taken it, but from their point of view, we would be possible suspects too."
    new "为什么？在我们看来，能拿走它的只有 Naomi，或者那个神秘的第九人；可在他们眼里，我们也一样可疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:2824
    old "If we didn't tell them, we could proceed to split up. Someone would find out that the Sekimeiya was stolen, which would lead to many more possible suspects, and their focus on us would decrease. They'd have no way to know we had already seen the empty cabinet."
    new "不告诉他们也行，之后我们照常分头行动。总会有人发现 Sekimeiya 被偷了，嫌疑人一下子多出一大堆，他们对我们的注意力自然就淡了。他们根本无从知道我们早已看过那个空展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:2825
    old "It might be unfair for them since we're giving them a bunch of fake suspects, but I'd say it's pretty fair for us since we know we didn't do it, right?"
    new "这对他们或许不太公平，毕竟我们凭空塞给他们一堆假嫌疑人；可对我们来说倒是挺公平的——我们知道自己没拿，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:2829
    old "I wasn't sure how to respond. I didn't disagree with him, but it was hard for me to humor his presumptuous attitude. Although I couldn't easily imagine being suspected, the thought of him falsely accusing me was a bit unnerving."
    new "我不知该如何回应。我并不反对他的说法，只是实在难以迁就他那副自以为是的态度。虽然很难想象自己会被怀疑，但一想到他竟会反过来诬陷我，心里还是有些不舒服。"

    # game/script.rpy:2830
    old "Sai didn't make a lot of sense to me unless I assumed that he was just messing around for the sake of messing around."
    new "Sai 的话，我实在听不出多少道理，除非他纯粹就是闲得无聊、故意胡闹。"

    # game/script.rpy:2831
    old "Whatever, let's look first."
    new "算了，先找找看吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:2835
    old "I walked forward and raised the curtain. Unlike before, very few dust particles fell off, leaving the pile on the floor practically unchanged."
    new "我走上前，掀起遮布。与之前不同，这次几乎没落下多少灰尘，地板上那堆灰尘也几乎原封未动。"

    # game/script.rpy:2841
    old "Here it is."
    new "在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:2842
    old "I wanted to say something along the lines of \"see, you're just being paranoid\", but he beat me to it."
    new "我本想揶揄一句「看吧，就是你多心了」，却被他抢先开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:2847
    old "Of course it is.{w} After all, if it weren't, it could only have been Naomi, and that'd be too simple."
    new "当然在。{w}毕竟要是不在，那就只可能是 Naomi 拿的——那也未免太简单了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2848
    old "...{w}Are you sure you wouldn't want to consider the other five conspiring together and taking it while we were in the mechanical room? Then they could point the finger at us."
    new "……{w}你真不考虑一下吗？剩下五个人串通好，趁我们在机械室的时候把它拿走，之后再把矛头指向我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:2849
    old "What exactly is your deal? What were you even doing behind the monitor earlier?"
    new "你到底是怎么回事？刚才在显示器后面，你又到底在做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:2854
    old "That's what I was talking about. You should think about what I told you."
    new "我说的就是这个。我跟你讲的那些，你该好好想想。"

    # game/script.rpy:2855
    old "I could only sigh. I lowered the curtain and left the room."
    new "我只能叹了口气，放下遮布，离开了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:2870
    old "When we returned to the security room, everyone but Katei was next to the monitors. He was on the ground, and from the looks of it, he hadn't fixed a thing."
    new "我们回到监控室时，除了 Katei，其他人都围在显示器旁。他趴在地上，看样子什么也没修好。"

    # game/script.rpy:2875
    old "You were gone for a while."
    new "你们去了好一阵子。"

    # game/script.rpy:2880
    old "Yeah, we took the time to go to the bathroom."
    new "是啊，我们去了趟洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:2882
    old "I had no reason not to call him out, but that might've pointlessly complicated things or ended up being exactly what he wanted. ...His approach to our situation was an enigma."
    new "我没有理由不揭穿他，可那样做也许只会徒增麻烦，甚至正中他的下怀。……他对待眼前局面的方式，实在令人费解。"

    # game/script.rpy:2883
    old "Shiroya was looking right at me, so I decided to ignore Sai's lie and moved on."
    new "Shiroya 正看着我，于是我决定无视 Sai 的谎话，继续说下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:2884
    old "How are things going?"
    new "情况怎么样？"

    # game/script.rpy:2889
    old "Katei has been trying to power the computer back on. It doesn't seem like he's achieving much, though."
    new "Katei 一直在试着重新启动电脑。不过看样子没什么进展。"

    # game/script.rpy:2890
    old "He appeared to be messing with some cables under the table. After a few seconds, he got out and stood up."
    new "他似乎正在摆弄桌子底下的几根线缆。几秒过后，他从桌下钻出来，站直了身子。"

    # game/script.rpy:2897
    old "Let's try again..."
    new "再试一次……"

    # game/script.rpy:2898
    old "He pressed the power button, but nothing happened."
    new "他按下电源键，却毫无反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:2903
    old "Damn it... I don't know what the problem is."
    new "该死……我搞不清问题出在哪儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:2908
    old "Oh, I assume all the power switches were on, correct?"
    new "对了，我猜所有电源开关都开着，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:2917
    old "He sighed and kneeled down once again. I didn't know what he was trying, but so far, it hadn't given him any results."
    new "他叹了口气，又一次蹲下身去。我不知道他在试什么，但到现在还没有任何成效。"

    # game/script.rpy:2918
    old "Everybody kept looking at him even though there wasn't much to observe, as Katei's body covered all that he was doing."
    new "大家的目光都没离开他，尽管根本看不出什么——他整个身子把手上动作都挡住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2919
    old "Sai's indictment replayed in my mind."
    new "Sai 的指控又在我脑中回响。"

    # game/script.rpy:2920
    old "\"I guarantee you that everything he's said has been a lie. Don't trust anything he says.\""
    new "「我可以打包票，他说的话全是假的。一个字都别信。」"

    # game/script.rpy:2926
    old "Why had Sai sounded so sure? And how was Katei trying to fix the issue?"
    new "Sai 为什么说得那么笃定？而 Katei 又在用什么办法排除故障？"

    # game/script.rpy:2927
    old "If Katei was part of that group, Xyn, and had been shamelessly working under the pretense of security, their massive success rate could begin to be explained."
    new "倘若 Katei 就是 Xyn 那伙人的一员，一直打着安保的幌子行事，那他们高得离谱的成功率也就不难解释了。"

    # game/script.rpy:2928
    old "Under the table, he kept sighing methodically while making noise with the cables."
    new "桌子底下，他一边拨弄线缆发出声响，一边有节奏地叹着气。"

    # game/script.rpy:2929
    old "I can't figure out what the problem is. It could be that electricity stopped coming from an outlet. I've been trying many different things, but this is just an incomprehensible mess of cables, and I'm not sure the problem is here."
    new "我找不出问题所在。可能是某个插座不再供电了。我试了很多办法，可这线缆乱成一团，让人摸不着头脑，问题未必出在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:2930
    old "Some seconds after nobody had answered, he repeated the cycle of trying to power on the computer, kneeling down again, messing further with the cables, and standing back up."
    new "无人应声，过了几秒，他又重复起那一套：试着开机，再蹲下去，继续摆弄线缆，然后站起身。"

    # game/script.rpy:2931
    old "I apologize, but I don't seem able to fix this. I don't know what the cause was nor what's remaining a problem. All I could do here has proven useless."
    new "抱歉，看样子我修不好。我不知道起因是什么，也不知道眼下还卡在哪儿。我在这里能做的都试过了，全是白费。"

    # game/script.rpy:2936
    old "We understand. The way it happened was odd in the first place."
    new "我们明白。这事本来就很蹊跷。"

    # game/script.rpy:2941
    old "Do you not have any idea what could've gone wrong? Everything just turned off instantly, and this is the office where you work."
    new "你一点头绪都没有吗？所有东西都是一瞬间断电的，而且这里还是你工作的办公室。"

    # game/script.rpy:2942
    old "I just told you... I can't begin to think of anything. However, it wasn't all instant, was it? This monitor was the first one to stop functioning."
    new "我刚才说过了……我根本想不出任何原因。不过，也不是一次全断的吧？最先停掉的是这台显示器。"

    # game/script.rpy:2948
    old "He was talking, of course, about the leftmost computer monitor. He approached it and examined it carefully."
    new "他说的当然是左边那台显示器。他走过去，仔细端详了一番。"

    # game/script.rpy:2953
    old "Everything looks fine... It pains me to say it, but I'm completely lost."
    new "看上去一切正常……说来惭愧，我完全摸不着头脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:2954
    old "Had Sai created the situation? The smirk he'd given me alongside what he'd said seemed to indicate that he at least had something to do with it."
    new "难不成这局面是 Sai 一手造成的？他说那番话时冲我露出的那抹笑，似乎至少说明此事与他脱不了干系。"

    # game/script.rpy:2959
    old "Hey, Katei, are you done with the cables? Since you got up from there, you haven't tried to power on the computer. Why not?"
    new "喂，Katei，线接好了吗？你从那儿站起来以后，就没再试着开机。怎么不试？"

    # game/script.rpy:2960
    old "Oh, you're right. I did this a few times when you two were gone, but nothing worked. This last time I didn't actually change anything important, so it hardly mattered."
    new "哦，你说得对。你们俩不在的时候我试过好几次，都没用。刚才那一次，我其实也没动到什么要紧的地方，试不试都差不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:2963
    old "While he said that, he approached the computer. With a single finger, he pressed the power button."
    new "他边说边走向电脑，伸出一根手指按下电源键。"

    # game/script.rpy:2968
    old "In the blink of an eye, the middle screen lit up and a sound that indicated the computer had begun to run echoed throughout the narrow room."
    new "转眼间，中间那块屏幕亮了起来，电脑启动的提示音在狭小的房间里回荡。"

    # game/script.rpy:2969
    old "Sai met Katei's eyes quietly, and Isla was the first to break the silence."
    new "Sai 静静地与 Katei 对视，Isla 先打破了沉默。"

    # game/script.rpy:2974
    old "It's finally working, right? Great!"
    new "总算能用了，对吧？太好了！"

    # game/script.rpy:2979
    old "Y-Yes... It seems so."
    new "是、是啊……看样子是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:2985
    old "...Do you think you were the one to fix it?"
    new "……你觉得是你修好的？"

    # game/script.rpy:2986
    old "There's no way. This is as strange as it powering off... I really don't even think I ended up changing anything since the last time I tried it."
    new "怎么可能。这跟它莫名其妙关机一样蹊跷……我甚至觉得，从上次试过到现在，自己根本没改动什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:2991
    old "How bizarre."
    new "真是怪事。"

    # game/script.rpy:2996
    old "Yes... It very much is."
    new "是啊……确实怪得很。"

    # game/script.rpy:3002
    old "Do you think this was also done from outside the room?"
    new "你觉得这次也是从房间外面动的手脚？"

    # game/script.rpy:3003
    old "I can't tell. It's possible the electrical system was the problem and that it just fixed itself."
    new "我说不准。也许问题出在供电系统上，而它自己恢复了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3009
    old "Wouldn't the system have powered on automatically if that had happened?"
    new "要是那样，系统不会自动通电吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:3014
    old "Possibly..."
    new "有可能……"

    # game/script.rpy:3017
    old "Katei sat back on his chair and grabbed the mouse once the computer had finished booting up. After bringing the keyboard closer to him, he logged onto his user account."
    new "电脑启动完毕后，Katei 靠回椅子上，握住鼠标，又把键盘拉到身前，登录了自己的账户。"

    # game/script.rpy:3027
    old "What happened to the cameras, though?"
    new "那摄像头是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:3033
    old "Even though the computer had been brought back online, a dozen powered-off screens still remained on the wall."
    new "电脑虽然恢复了运行，墙上却仍有十几块屏幕黑着。"

    # game/script.rpy:3038
    old "This computer is connected to the entire tower. That includes the computers upstairs and the security system. I must first initiate the program that will display the footage up there in real time."
    new "这台电脑和整座塔都连着，包括楼上的电脑和安保系统。我得先启动程序，才能把楼上的画面实时显示出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:3042
    old "Upon saying that, he double-clicked on a security camera logo, and a program with a messy interface covered the entire screen."
    new "说完，他双击了监控摄像头的图标，一个界面杂乱的程序占满了整个屏幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:3043
    old "This was running earlier as well, but it was minimized. The cameras won't be shown without it open."
    new "这个程序之前也开着，只是被最小化了。不打开它，摄像头画面就显示不出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:3044
    old "After looking at the taskbar icon, I did recognize it from earlier, and it was the same one he'd used to change the cameras being displayed."
    new "我看了看任务栏上的图标，认出之前确实见过——就是他用来切换显示画面的那个程序。"

    # game/script.rpy:3045
    old "Katei once again typed out what looked like gibberish as the username and a password that was obfuscated from us. After he pressed the enter key, access was granted."
    new "Katei 又一次输入了那串乱码似的用户名，密码也照旧不让我们看见。按下回车键后，便获得了访问权限。"

    # game/script.rpy:3046
    old "All right, this button will start up the system."
    new "好，按下这个按钮就能启动系统。"

    # game/script.rpy:3049
    old "Below the text \"Logged in as Katei Kuiji\" was a button that read \"Initialize Camera Monitoring\", which Katei quickly clicked on."
    new "「已登录为 Katei Kuiji」的下方是一个写着「初始化摄像头监控」的按钮，Katei 飞快地点了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:3050
    old "However, upon doing so, an error window showed up. The text \"Couldn't detect video footage\" was written on it."
    new "然而一点下去，就弹出了报错窗口，上面写着「无法检测到视频画面」。"

    # game/script.rpy:3051
    old "Wh-What...? What the hell does this mean? I-I've never seen this error message."
    new "什、什么……？这到底是什么意思？我、我从没见过这种报错。"

    # game/script.rpy:3056
    old "You can't look through the cameras?"
    new "看不到摄像头画面？"

    # game/script.rpy:3057
    old "Yes. Usually, after pressing this button, the screens would turn on and automatically display the live feed the cameras are recording."
    new "对。平时按下这个按钮，屏幕就会亮起，自动显示摄像头拍到的实时画面。"

    # game/script.rpy:3062
    old "What if you check the saved footage?"
    new "要不要查查存档的录像？"

    # game/script.rpy:3063
    old "Yes, that's what I was going to try..."
    new "对，我正打算试试……"

    # game/script.rpy:3066
    old "The cursor, controlled by Katei, hovered over and clicked on the \"archived footage\" button."
    new "Katei 把光标移过去，点下了「存档录像」按钮。"

    # game/script.rpy:3067
    old "Once again, though, an error window followed by an obnoxious sound appeared, containing the text: \"No archived footage detected. No camera system detected.\""
    new "可这回又响起一声刺耳的提示音，随即弹出报错窗口：「未检测到存档录像。未检测到摄像头系统。」"

    # game/script.rpy:3072
    old "Okay, what the hell is this!? This has never happened before!"
    new "搞什么，这到底是怎么回事！？以前从没出过这种事！"

    # game/script.rpy:3073
    old "It's outright saying the camera system isn't being detected..."
    new "它明说检测不到摄像头系统……"

    # game/script.rpy:3076
    old "Sai made his way out of the room and returned before anyone had time to be confused."
    new "Sai 走出房间，转眼又折了回来，快得没人来得及多想。"

    # game/script.rpy:3081
    old "I looked at one of the hallway's security cameras. It's showing a tiny green light. That means it's currently functioning and recording, right?"
    new "我去看了走廊里的一台监控摄像头，上面亮着很小的绿灯。那说明它还在工作、还在录像，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:3086
    old "Yes. If the green light is there, it means the camera is recording."
    new "对。亮着绿灯就说明摄像头在录像。"

    # game/script.rpy:3087
    old "So, the problem here is that we can't currently access the live footage or look at the recordings. The cameras are still actually functioning."
    new "也就是说，问题在于我们现在既看不到实时画面，也调不出录像。摄像头本身其实还在运行。"

    # game/script.rpy:3090
    old "Yes, I think so. For some reason, the computer won't connect to the system."
    new "对，我想是这样。不知为什么，这台电脑连不上系统。"

    # game/script.rpy:3095
    old "Heh. Looking at the recorded footage so easily sounded too good to be true anyway."
    new "呵。能这么轻易调出录像，本来就好得让人不敢相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:3096
    old "I'd been doubting we would find anything in the recordings since the relevant cameras had been disabled by the smoke, but it was true that it could've given us crucial information, especially regarding Naomi."
    new "相关摄像头已经因烟雾失效，我本就怀疑录像里查不出什么，但也不能否认，它或许能提供关键线索，尤其是关于 Naomi 的。"

    # game/script.rpy:3097
    old "Well, let's talk to the police again. They might know what caused this."
    new "算了，再去问问警察吧。他们或许知道是什么原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:3103
    old "You're right, we should still be able to do that."
    new "说得对，这个我们应该还做得到。"

    # game/script.rpy:3104
    old "Give me a second."
    new "稍等一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:3107
    old "Katei did everything he'd done the last time. When the small window appeared, he input a password and pressed the enter key."
    new "Katei 把上次的操作又做了一遍。小窗口弹出后，他输入密码，按下回车键。"

    # game/script.rpy:3108
    old "\"Access Denied\" appeared in red letters below the login information."
    new "登录信息下方，红色的「拒绝访问」字样浮现出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:3113
    old "Wh-What...!?"
    new "什、什么……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:3120
    old "Access denied? What the fuck does it mean by that!?"
    new "访问被拒绝？这他妈是什么意思！？"

    # game/script.rpy:3121
    old "That's what I was about to say! I know I'm repeating myself here, but this has never happened before!"
    new "我也正想说！我知道这话我已经说过了，可这种情况以前从没发生过！"

    # game/script.rpy:3126
    old "I'll try again..."
    new "我再试一次……"

    # game/script.rpy:3129
    old "He reentered the login information four times, but that same message kept appearing."
    new "他又输入了四次登录信息，可屏幕上反复出现同一行提示。"

    # game/script.rpy:3134
    old "I don't understand this..."
    new "我不明白这是怎么回事……"

    # game/script.rpy:3140
    old "Do you think your authority has been revoked?"
    new "你觉得你的权限被收回了？"

    # game/script.rpy:3145
    old "I-It must... But why? Why would that happen now!?"
    new "只、只能是这样了……可为什么？为什么偏偏是现在！？"

    # game/script.rpy:3146
    old "It's not like we can contact the outside to ask. I know you said earlier that the alarm cut off access to the internet, but everything's out of order anyway, so there's no harm in checking."
    new "我们也没法联系外界去问。你之前说过警报切断了网络，但反正现在一切都乱套了，确认一下也无妨。"

    # game/script.rpy:3147
    old "Yes, you're right. It might not be disabled."
    new "对，你说得对。也许网络并没有真的断。"

    # game/script.rpy:3151
    old "Katei double-clicked on the browser icon, and we were met with a white screen containing the text: \"There is no internet connection\"."
    new "Katei 双击了浏览器图标，屏幕上随即跳出一片白色，上面写着：「没有网络连接」。"

    # game/script.rpy:3152
    old "To further make sure, he typed a common URL, but the same screen appeared."
    new "为保险起见，他又输入了一个常用网址，可出现的还是同一个页面。"

    # game/script.rpy:3157
    old "I guess we're not getting that lucky..."
    new "看来我们没那个运气……"

    # game/script.rpy:3162
    old "I'm sorry... I don't think I can do anything about this."
    new "抱歉……这件事我恐怕无能为力。"

    # game/script.rpy:3163
    old "It's okay, it's not your fault. If we can't access the security cameras or connect to the outside, our priority should be to investigate this whole building. Naomi's still a mystery."
    new "没关系，这不是你的错。既然监控摄像头连不上，外面也联系不了，我们就该先调查整栋楼。Naomi 的下落也还是个谜。"

    # game/script.rpy:3164
    old "That's true... We should try to find her and gather any useful information we can."
    new "说得对……我们得试着找到她，一边找一边尽可能搜集有用的信息。"

    # game/script.rpy:3169
    old "B-But, how could this have happened? I don't understand it.{w} The timing was too coincidental. Did Ashiya remotely power off the computer to revoke my access? All I could do with it was talk to them.{w} Maybe the problem with the security system is a side effect of whatever happened...{w} I will stay here for a bit, while you go. I have a couple more things to do."
    new "可、可这怎么会发生？我实在不明白。{w}时机也太巧了。难道是芦屋远程关掉了电脑，收回了我的权限？我只能靠它和他们通话。{w}也许安保系统的问题是那件事引起的副作用……{w}你们先走吧，我在这里待一会儿。我还有几件事要处理。"

    # game/script.rpy:3174
    old "Such as?"
    new "比如？"

    # game/script.rpy:3179
    old "Well, I'd like to investigate more about what caused the shutdown. The security system not being detected is very strange, and in addition, it seems my authority might've been revoked."
    new "我想再查查这次系统怎么会停机。安保系统完全检测不到，这已经很奇怪了，况且我的权限似乎也被收回了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3180
    old "You must understand how odd of a situation this is for me. I'd like to see if I can figure something out."
    new "你们应该能明白，这情况对我来说有多反常。我想看看能不能查出点什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:3181
    old "However, there are a few things I'll work on for sure. This computer is still connected to the rest of the tower, so I can undo a few smaller effects of the alarm. I can try to restore power to the elevator and some lights; those don't really require any kind of login. I'll catch up with you all once I'm done."
    new "不过，有几件事我肯定能处理。这台电脑还连着塔里其他设备，所以我能消除警报造成的一些小影响。我可以试着恢复电梯和部分照明的供电，这些并不需要登录权限。等我弄完就去找你们。"

    # game/script.rpy:3182
    old "I see. That sounds fair to me. We'll go, then."
    new "原来如此。这样安排也合理。那我们就先走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3188
    old "Should we really be splitting up? It'd be better if we moved in groups, at least."
    new "真的要分头行动吗？至少也该几个人一起走比较好吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:3193
    old "There's no real point to any of you staying here. I am the only person here who knows how to access these parts of the system, and it would be better to have the elevator available than not. Go on ahead."
    new "你们留在这里也没有任何意义。整个塔里只有我知道怎么访问系统的这些部分，而且电梯能恢复总比没有好。你们先走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:3194
    old "...All right. Good luck. It's weird to think that Naomi is out there and hasn't tried to reach us, so I'm a bit worried."
    new "……好吧。祝你好运。Naomi 明明就在外面，却一直没试着联系我们，怎么想都奇怪，我有点担心。"

    # game/script.rpy:3195
    old "You're right. Let's go with them, Isla."
    new "说得对。Isla，我们跟他们一起走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:3216
    old "Everybody started to look a bit more tense in the hallway, maybe because we hadn't yet seen anything beyond the first floor, or maybe because the reality of being trapped was creeping in."
    new "走廊里，大家的神色都渐渐紧绷起来。也许是因为我们还没看过一楼以外的任何地方，也许是因为被困住的现实正一点点压上心头。"

    # game/script.rpy:3217
    old "I looked at the cameras and noticed that the tiny, green recording light could only be noticed on some of them, as the dried smoke fully covered a good number."
    new "我看了看那些摄像头，发现只有少数几个上面还能看见那小小的绿色录制指示灯——大部分摄像头都被干结的烟尘糊了个严实。"

    # game/script.rpy:3226
    old "We walked together a few steps until we all stopped silently. Our task was to investigate a huge building we had never entered before only to track down someone who could've been hiding with malicious intent."
    new "我们一起走了几步，随后不约而同地停下，谁也没有出声。我们要搜索的是一栋从未踏足过的巨大建筑，只为找出一个可能怀着恶意藏身其中的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:3227
    old "Isla started talking casually to Erina about their daily life. I didn't disturb them, figuring it was better if Isla remained as calm as possible."
    new "Isla 开始和 Erina 闲聊起日常。我没有打扰她们，心想让 Isla 尽量保持平静也好。"

    # game/script.rpy:3231
    old "I leaned against a wall, next to Shiroya. I didn't think she wanted to talk, so I kept quiet.{w} The handrail made the position uncomfortable, but I tried not to mind it. Instead, I focused on thinking..."
    new "我靠着墙，站在 Shiroya 旁边。我觉得她不想说话，便保持沉默。{w}扶手让这个姿势很不舒服，但我尽量不去在意，转而专心思考起来……"

    # game/script.rpy:3232
    old "What exactly had happened in the security room? What had Sai done?"
    new "监控室里究竟发生了什么？Sai 又做了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:3240
    old "I looked at him. He wore a silent, carefree expression, appearing almost on a different plane from the rest of us."
    new "我看向他。他神情平静，甚至有些若无其事，仿佛与我们不在同一个世界里。"

    # game/script.rpy:3249
    old "Earlier, when I looked at him after Katei rushed out of the room, he took his hand out from behind the leftmost monitor. What exactly did I see?"
    new "刚才 Katei 冲出房间后，我看向他时，他正把手从最左边那台显示器后面抽出来。我到底看见了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:3250
    old "Let me take a different approach. Assuming the monitor powering off was his doing, what could the reason be?"
    new "换个角度想。假设显示器熄灭是他动的手脚，那理由会是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:3251
    old "What did he do right after the monitor stopped working? He tried to see what had happened... But if he'd been the one to cause it, that couldn't have been his goal..."
    new "显示器出故障后，他立刻做了什么？他试着查看发生了什么……可如果事情正是他造成的，那他这么做就不可能是为了弄清状况……"

    # game/script.rpy:3255
    old "After considering a couple of possibilities, an idea came to me. If I was right, what he'd told me later made sense."
    new "考虑过几种可能后，我忽然有了一个想法。如果我想得没错，他后来对我说的那番话就说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3257
    old "At that point, with what he did to the monitor, he was probably confirming his suspicion."
    new "那时，他对显示器所做的那番举动，大概是在确认自己的怀疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:3258
    old "He was right: a lot of things Katei has been saying have been questionable at best, but now that I think about it, there was one major thing that I overlooked."
    new "他说得没错：Katei 说过的许多话，往好了说也只是可疑。可如今回想起来，有一件关键的事被我忽略了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3263
    old "\"Katei grabbed the doorknob, and upon turning it, he tried to push the door forward. However, it didn't budge.\""
    new "「Katei 抓住门把手拧了一下，试着把门往前推。门却纹丝不动。」"

    # game/script.rpy:3268
    old "\"Oh, right. I locked it earlier. Let me see.\""
    new "「啊，对了。我之前把门锁上了。让我看看。」"

    # game/script.rpy:3269
    old "I bet Sai noticed this. Katei didn't think the door would be locked."
    new "Sai 肯定注意到了这一点。Katei 当时根本没想到门会被锁上。"

    # game/script.rpy:3270
    old "He was quick to make up a lie. He said that since it's an important room, he thought it appropriate to lock it before going outside to inspect things."
    new "他立刻就编了个谎。他说既然这是重要房间，出去查看情况前把它锁上比较妥当。"

    # game/script.rpy:3271
    old "He even claimed to have done it because the room contained the single way to communicate with the outside, but later, he showed us that you could only enable it with a password that only the security staff knew."
    new "他甚至声称，之所以锁门，是因为房间里有着唯一能联系外界的手段；可后来他又亲口向我们证明，那套设备只有输入安保人员才知道的密码才能启用。"

    # game/script.rpy:3279
    old "It's probably not that he thought the door would be open, but that he didn't realize it wouldn't be."
    new "问题大概不在于他以为门会开着，而在于他根本没意识到门会被锁上。"

    # game/script.rpy:3280
    old "After all, we know what actually locked it—the alarm."
    new "毕竟，我们知道真正把门锁上的是什么——是警报。"

    # game/script.rpy:3281
    old "Suripo explained the entire function and mechanism behind the alarm to us. The person inside the security room would relay information between the people that got trapped and the outside. The door of the security room would close alongside the exit, and it would be impossible to open it with anything but the right key."
    new "Suripo 向我们完整讲解了警报的功能和运作机制。待在监控室里的人负责在受困者和外界之间传话。警报启动时，监控室的门会和出口一起关闭，没有正确的钥匙绝对打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:3284
    old "Meaning that if I'm right, from the time I heard the alarm to the time we entered the security room... no one was inside it."
    new "也就是说，如果我没猜错，从我听见警报响起，到我们进入监控室为止……里面根本没有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:3285
    old "Katei had actually never been inside the security room. This was a huge lie, and most likely something Sai assumed after noticing Katei's actions before he opened the door, or when the alarm's functions were explained."
    new "Katei 其实从没进过监控室。这是个弥天大谎——Sai 多半是在开门前注意到 Katei 的举动，或者是在听到警报功能的说明时，就已经猜到了这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:3286
    old "A lot of things Katei said hinge on him being in the security room during the time the smoke was released."
    new "Katei 的不少说法，都建立在「烟雾释放时他在监控室」这一点上。"

    # game/script.rpy:3287
    old "Seeing the smoke appearing out of nowhere through the cameras, looking at the available ones and not seeing anyone, not trying to contact the outside, not being allowed to input his command to open up the exit..."
    new "从监控里看到烟雾凭空冒出，把能调出的画面都看了一遍也没见到半个人影，没有试着联系外界，权限又不允许他输入打开出口的指令……"

    # game/script.rpy:3288
    old "All those claims are impossible if I assume he was never in the security room during that period of time. Even seeing the smoke through the cameras and then exiting the room before the alarm went off would be far from believable. This would have both stained his clothes and knocked him out."
    new "可只要假定那段时间他根本不在监控室，这些说法就全都站不住脚。就算他只是通过监控看到烟雾，然后在警报响起前离开房间，也很难让人相信。那样一来，他的衣服会沾上烟渍，人也会被熏倒。"

    # game/script.rpy:3291
    old "I should question something important if he truly was never in the room. Katei's clothes weren't stained, but he still knew about the smoke. Did Erina's group tell him and he acted as if he'd seen it through the cameras? Did he see it from far away? Or did he have another way to know about it without personally seeing it?"
    new "如果他真的一次都没进过监控室，有个关键问题就必须问清楚：Katei 的衣服没有沾上烟渍，可他知道烟雾的事。是 Erina 他们告诉了他，他再装作是从监控里看到的？还是他远远地看见了？又或者，他另有别的途径，不必亲眼看到也能知道？"

    # game/script.rpy:3292
    old "To maintain his claim of seeing the smoke appear through the cameras, it's possible he knew it would appear and quickly left the security room with a mask and spare clothes right before the alarm sounded. Like this, he would've been able to lie about his location the whole time. After all, it would have been too risky for him to leave before the smoke was released."
    new "为了保住「从监控里看见烟雾冒出」这个说法，也可能他早就知道烟雾会出现，赶在警报响起前带着面罩和换洗衣物迅速离开监控室。这样一来，他就可以一直谎报自己的位置。毕竟，在烟雾释放之前离开，风险实在太大了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3293
    old "If this is what he did, he must've used the time we were unconscious to do something. What's for certain is that aside from seeing the smoke through the cameras, if he wasn't in the room by the time the alarm went off, all his other claims become impossible."
    new "如果真是这样，他一定趁我们昏迷的那段时间做了什么。可以确定的是：除了「透过监控看到烟雾」之外，只要警报响起时他不在监控室里，他其余的说法就全都无法成立。"

    # game/script.rpy:3294
    old "...But he also might not have been on this floor during the attack. If he showed up later, that could explain why he found Erina's group before ours. They told him what had happened, and he made up a lie accordingly. This would mean that everything he's told us has been a fabrication."
    new "……不过，袭击发生时他也许根本不在这一层。如果他出现得比较晚，那就能解释为什么是他先找到 Erina 他们，而不是先找到我们。他们把发生的事告诉了他，他再据此编出一套谎话。若果真如此，他告诉我们的每一句话就都是捏造的。"

    # game/script.rpy:3298
    old "Once I assume Katei was never in the room, the exact reason for that lie is not too important. What it means is that he's untrustworthy and that he has an ulterior motive."
    new "一旦认定 Katei 从未进过监控室，他撒这个谎的具体理由反倒不那么重要了。重要的是：他不值得信任，而且另有图谋。"

    # game/script.rpy:3299
    old "And... it is very possible his authority as a security member has been revoked. The timing was too precise to be a coincidence. It could be that Ashiya and the police figured something out about him and removed his privilege as a security member. However, they'd know that doing so would also prevent us from contacting them again, so they must've had a very good reason."
    new "还有……他作为安保人员的权限，很可能已经被取消了。时机太巧，不像是偶然。也许是芦屋和警方查出了他的什么问题，才剥夺了他安保成员的特权。不过他们应该清楚，这么做同时也等于让我们再也联系不上他们——所以他们必然有充分的理由。"

    # game/script.rpy:3303
    old "Then, what Sai did to confirm his theory..."
    new "接着，Sai 为了证实自己的推测，做了这样一件事……"

    # game/script.rpy:3304
    old "He pulled it off shamelessly, in front of everybody. I'm sure he could've done it later alone, but it's possible he feared Katei would've prevented it with a new lie."
    new "他当着所有人的面，毫无顾忌地做了。他完全可以之后独自去确认，但他也许担心 Katei 会再编一套新谎话来阻挠他。"

    # game/script.rpy:3305
    old "Right before Sai started, he asked Suripo: \"Is there anything else you should tell us?\" He wanted to check something as soon as possible, before Katei could interfere again."
    new "动手之前，Sai 先问 Suripo：「还有别的该告诉我们的事吗？」他是想趁 Katei 再次插手之前，尽快确认某件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:3306
    old "Once Suripo said he'd told us everything we needed to know, Sai unplugged the cord behind the leftmost monitor—the one he was next to."
    new "等 Suripo 说该讲的都已经讲了，Sai 就拔掉了最左边那台显示器背后的线——他当时正站在那台旁边。"

    # game/script.rpy:3307
    old "This was only done to have a justification for checking the screen settings. He quickly grabbed the mouse and opened them from the desktop."
    new "这么做只是为了给查看屏幕设置找个由头。他迅速抓起鼠标，在桌面上打开了设置。"

    # game/script.rpy:3313
    old "\"I see... How strange. The left monitor isn't being detected at all...\""
    new "「原来如此……真奇怪。左边那台显示器完全检测不到……」"

    # game/script.rpy:3314
    old "However, that's not what Sai was actually looking at."
    new "然而，Sai 真正在看的并不是那个。"

    # game/script.rpy:3315
    old "When we all entered the security room, Katei quickly went to use the computer."
    new "我们一起进监控室时，Katei 立刻走过去用那台电脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:3321
    old "\"Paying no mind to everyone's silence, Katei made his way to the chair and sat down. When he moved the mouse, the computer exited its suspended state and reactivated the three monitors above it, showing us what the last person to use it had been doing.\""
    new "「Katei 不在意众人的沉默，径直走到椅子前坐下。他一动鼠标，电脑便退出休眠状态，上方三台显示器也随之亮起，显示出上一个使用者当时在做些什么。」"

    # game/script.rpy:3322
    old "I bet Sai's goal was actually to look at how long it'd take for the computer to enter sleep mode, which is information found on the same settings screen. That's because Katei said he'd used it while he'd been in the room."
    new "我猜 Sai 的真正目的，其实是看电脑进入睡眠模式需要多长时间——这项信息正好也在同一个设置界面上。因为 Katei 说过，他在监控室待着的时候用过这台电脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:3329
    old "\"Shortly after that, the alarm went off, so I knew I was already trapped. During that time until I exited, I kept my eyes on the cameras. I also tried to use the computer to look up information about what had happened, but the alarm even shut down my internet connection.\"{w} He'd also said that he tried to input the command to unlock the exit."
    new "「紧接着警报就响了，我知道自己已经被困住。从那时到离开，我一直盯着监控画面。我也试过用电脑查发生了什么，可警报连网络都切断了。」{w}他还说过，自己试过输入解锁出口的指令。"

    # game/script.rpy:3330
    old "We know the alarm went off at approximately {time=9:05.} Thanks to the time the computer displayed and that it was in sleep mode when we entered the room, if the settings perhaps showed that an hour of inactivity had been needed to enter that state, Sai could've confirmed that Katei had not been there at all."
    new "我们知道警报大约是在 {time=9:05.} 响起的。借助电脑上显示的时间，加上我们进屋时它正处于睡眠模式，只要设置里显示进入该状态需要闲置一小时，Sai 就能确认 Katei 根本不曾待在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:3336
    old "And, apparently, it did confirm it. That's why he was sure that Katei was lying."
    new "而结果显然证实了这一点。所以他才会断定 Katei 在说谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:3337
    old "This also explains his subsequent action. When I saw Sai taking his arm out from behind the leftmost monitor, he'd just plugged the cord back in."
    new "这也解释了他随后的举动。我看到 Sai 把胳膊从最左边那台显示器后面抽出来时，他刚把线重新插回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:3338
    old "Despite sounding risky, he'd had nothing to lose, and if he'd waited longer, Katei could've prevented it."
    new "这听起来很冒险，可他其实没什么可失去的；而且再拖下去，Katei 说不定就能阻止他。"

    # game/script.rpy:3339
    old "And Sai's timing had been great: right after that, all the monitors and even the computer stopped working. That probably wasn't his doing, even though Katei implied otherwise."
    new "而且 Sai 的时机挑得极好：就在那之后，所有显示器连同电脑一起失灵了。这大概并非他造成的，尽管 Katei 话里话外是这个意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:3346
    old "\"However, it wasn't all instant, was it? This monitor was the first one to stop functioning.\""
    new "「不过，并不是一下子全部失效的吧？这台显示器是最先停止工作的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:3352
    old "He said it as if both things were connected, but I don't think that was right. Sai unplugged the first monitor, but the rest must've had a different cause."
    new "他说得好像两件事互有关联，但我认为并非如此。Sai 拔掉的是第一台显示器的线，其余那些必定另有原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:3353
    old "One thing is for sure: Sai has confirmed his theory and is now certain Katei has fed us lie after lie.{w} And I should probably think the same."
    new "有一点是确定的：Sai 已经验证了自己的推论，如今确信 Katei 对我们满口谎言。{w}而我大概也该这么想。"

    # game/script.rpy:3354
    old "Is this it, then...? Is Katei simply a blatant liar with an ulterior motive?"
    new "难道就这样了……？Katei 只是个心怀鬼胎、谎话连篇的人？"

    # game/script.rpy:3357
    old "I thought about everything that had happened up until then and shortly noticed another inconsistency Katei presented very early on. He'd later introduced a contradiction himself."
    new "我把此前发生的一切在心里过了一遍，很快又注意到 Katei 很早就露出的另一处破绽。而这处矛盾，是他后来自己说出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:3366
    old "\"Did all of you hear the alarm that played throughout the building? After I heard it, I saw all the smoke.\""
    new "「整栋楼里响起的警报，你们全都听见了吧？我听见警报之后，才看到那片烟雾。」"

    # game/script.rpy:3367
    old "He claimed to have heard the alarm, then seen the smoke. However, just after that, he said the smoke disabled the cameras instantly. Given the alarm went off some seconds after the smoke was released, he could only have seen smoke after hearing the alarm if he had been outside the security room.{w} It's a bit strange that he said that but was still correct in saying that the smoke disabled the cameras."
    new "他声称先听到警报，然后才看到烟雾。可就在这之后，他又说烟雾瞬间就让监控失效了。既然烟雾释放后过了几秒警报才响，那么他若真是在听到警报之后才看到烟雾，就只能说明他当时人在监控室外。{w}奇怪的是，他一方面这么说，另一方面关于烟雾让监控失效的说法又完全正确。"

    # game/script.rpy:3368
    old "If he planned his phrasing well enough to make it sound as if he'd been inside the room, to the point of realizing that the cameras would've become useless, it follows he wouldn't have mentioned the huge inconsistency of seeing the smoke after hearing the alarm."
    new "如果他把说辞编排得足够周密，让自己听起来就像在室内，甚至考虑到监控会因此失效，那么他按理不会提到「先听到警报、后看到烟雾」这种明显的自相矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:3369
    old "If there's a reason for this, it must be that without looking at the monitors, he knew the smoke would've left them useless. However, he must not have thought about it too hard, or else he would've never contradicted himself so blatantly."
    new "若要说有什么缘由，那一定是他不必看画面也知道烟雾会让监控彻底失效。可他显然没在这上面多想——否则绝不会如此露骨地自相矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:3370
    old "There is one simple way this could've happened: if he designed the plan. He would've known the effects of the smoke but would not have thought of what they would've entailed if he'd truly been in the security room."
    new "有一种再简单不过的解释：这计划本就出自他手。他清楚烟雾的效果，却没细想，倘若他真的待在监控室里，这些效果意味着什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:3378
    old "I didn't want to believe that. Not because I trusted a stranger by default, but because I wasn't sure if I was only deluding myself by believing it."
    new "我不愿相信这一点。并非因为我天生就信任陌生人，而是因为我不确定，这样相信是不是只是在自欺欺人。"

    # game/script.rpy:3379
    old "I went back to my previous thought. Could Katei have still been inside the security room until he'd left it before the alarm had played? That would've made him a bit more trustworthy, even if it wasn't much."
    new "我又回到先前的想法上。会不会 Katei 一直待在监控室里，只是在警报响起前才离开？若真如此，他多少还值得一点信任——尽管并不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:3380
    old "The problem was, once again, that he didn't have any traces of smoke on him. Even if he'd changed clothes, his face and hair would've been noticeably stained.{w} Technically, there was a way to get around that. I knew hallway B had been hit by the smoke by the point I'd noticed the lack of light under the door. However, I couldn't be sure the same thing could be said of hallway A, the third and last section that had been inundated. We'd only seen it filled with smoke after waking up."
    new "问题依旧在于，他身上没有任何烟雾的痕迹。就算换了衣服，脸和头发也会明显沾上。{w}严格说来，倒有一种能绕过去的可能。我注意到门缝下透不进光时，B走廊已经灌满了烟雾。可 A走廊是否同样如此，我无法确定——那是第三处、也是最后一处被烟雾淹没的区域，我们醒来之后才看到它烟雾弥漫。"

    # game/script.rpy:3381
    old "But if he left because he saw the smoke through the cameras, he realistically would've mentioned that hallway A hadn't yet been darkened by that point..."
    new "可如果他是因为从监控里看到烟雾才离开的，按说他会提到，那时候 A走廊还没有被烟雾遮蔽……"

    # game/script.rpy:3384
    old "The only confirmed fact is that he wasn't in the room from the time the alarm went off to the point we entered it. It could be that he saw the smoke disabling the cameras, left the room, and then the alarm locked it. If this happened, the smoke in hallway A must've been released afterward."
    new "唯一能确定的事实是：从警报响起到我们进入监控室，他都不在屋里。也许他看见烟雾让监控失灵，便离开房间，随后警报把门锁上了。若情况如此，A走廊的烟雾应该是在那之后才释放的。"

    # game/script.rpy:3385
    old "Finally, if I'm only pointlessly trying to reduce the number of lies Katei has been spewing, it could be that he was in the room but never touched the computer. Then, the sleep mode settings wouldn't mean anything, but lying about using the PC seems pointless."
    new "最后，如果我只是在做无用功，想把 Katei 撒的谎减少几条，那也可能是他确实在屋里，却从未碰过电脑。这样的话，睡眠模式的设置就说明不了什么——但在用电脑这件事上撒谎，似乎毫无意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:3389
    old "Is there a way to go against Sai's confirmed theory?"
    new "有没有办法推翻 Sai 已经证实的那套推论？"

    # game/script.rpy:3391
    old "I suppose there's only one."
    new "想来只有一种。"

    # game/script.rpy:3392
    old "If the computer's current time is incorrect, the time shown in the screen settings could be refuted."
    new "如果电脑当前的时间不准，那么屏幕设置里显示的时间也就不足为凭。"

    # game/script.rpy:3393
    old "Considering that when we talked to Suripo, at no point was the actual time mentioned... if it wasn't actually {time=9:41} when we checked the time, it could all hold up."
    new "回想我们和 Suripo 说话时，从头到尾都没提过真实时间……如果我们查看时间的那一刻，实际并非 {time=9:41}，那么一切就都还站得住脚。"

    # game/script.rpy:3394
    old "If the computer was an hour behind and the real time was {time=10:45}, we would've been unconscious for longer than we thought, and everything could fit. Katei could have been in the security room, and enough time for the suspended state to be reached could've passed."
    new "如果电脑慢了一小时，真实时间是 {time=10:45}，那我们昏迷的时间就比以为的更久，所有事情也就都能对上了。Katei 完全可能待在监控室里，而且已经过了足够长的时间，让电脑进入休眠状态。"

    # game/script.rpy:3395
    old "However, this single last possibility was denied by the only person who didn't fall unconscious... Katei himself."
    new "然而，这最后一种可能，却被唯一没有昏迷的人否定了……正是 Katei 自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:3402
    old "\"Yes, this matches with the amount of time I stayed here after I saw the smoke.\""
    new "「没错，这和我看到烟雾之后在这里停留的时间正好吻合。」"

    # game/script.rpy:3411
    old "It seemed it was unquestionable. For one reason or another, Katei had lied about what he'd been doing during the incident. He hadn't been where he should've been, and he had continuously claimed to do things that would've been impossible."
    new "看来这已是无可置疑的了。不管出于什么理由，Katei 对事件发生时自己的所作所为撒了谎。他没有待在该待的地方，还一再声称做过那些根本不可能做到的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:3412
    old "Before we'd all entered the security room, he wasn't fast enough to think that the alarm would have locked the door. He simply tried to open it manually, as he hadn't locked it himself."
    new "我们还没全进监控室的时候，他根本没来得及想到警报会把门锁上。他只是去手动开门——毕竟门不是他锁的。"

    # game/script.rpy:3413
    old "What is Katei after...? Why did he lie so much? After all, he was the one who told us about the way to communicate with the outside. All of his actions have been bizarre."
    new "Katei 到底想干什么……？他为什么要撒那么多谎？毕竟，和外界联络的方法还是他告诉我们的。他的一举一动都透着古怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:3416
    old "Hang on... I haven't considered this, but what if he isn't who he claimed to be?"
    new "等等……这种可能我还没想过。万一他根本不是他自称的那个人呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:3417
    old "Could it be he isn't actually part of the security staff? He refused to explain anything because it would've been \"confidential\", but then Suripo didn't have an issue doing so. What if he simply didn't know anything? The only thing he said was that we'd be locked inside the building for twelve hours and that he knew of the way to communicate with the outside."
    new "他会不会根本就不是安保人员？他拒绝解释任何事，说那属于「机密」，可 Suripo 解释起来却毫无顾忌。万一他其实什么都不知道呢？他说过的只有两件事：我们会被关在这栋楼里十二个小时，以及他知道和外界联络的方法。"

    # game/script.rpy:3418
    old "His clothes weren't stained, but he knew about the smoke. He had a safe place he should've stayed in, but he wasn't in it. He had the security room key, but he didn't think the door would be locked. He investigated this floor, but he didn't look in the event room..."
    new "他的衣服没有沾上痕迹，却知道有烟雾。他本有一个该待着的安全之处，人却不在那里。他拿着监控室的钥匙，却没想到门会被锁。他查过这一层，却没有查看活动室……"

    # game/script.rpy:3421
    old "If this was all his plan... it could be that he borrowed the name of Katei, an actual security staff member. Not only his name, but also his clothes and room. Then, those stained clothes the actual Katei was wearing would've been disposed of."
    new "如果这一切都是他计划好的……那他可能是冒用了某个真正的安保人员 Katei 的名字。不只是名字，还有衣服和房间。至于真正的 Katei 穿的那身沾了痕迹的衣服，想必已经被处理掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3422
    old "Suripo admitted that a security staff member hadn't evacuated the tower, and he was familiar with the name \"Katei Kuiji\", but this could simply mean that the real Katei Kuiji is still trapped with us. Maybe his body was hidden in a spot out of the cameras' reach."
    new "Suripo 承认有一名安保人员没有撤出塔楼，他也确实听过「Katei Kuiji」这个名字。但这也许只说明，真正的 Katei Kuiji 还和我们一起困在这里。也许他的尸体被藏在了摄像头拍不到的角落。"

    # game/script.rpy:3423
    old "Suripo talked to Katei, but he was a simple police officer and had no way to confirm that the voice belonged to the actual staff member. On top of that, he never actually saw us. It was only audio from our end."
    new "Suripo 和 Katei 通过话，可他只是个普通警察，没办法确认那个声音是否真属于那名安保人员。更何况，他始终没见到我们本人，只有我们这边传过去的音频。"

    # game/script.rpy:3431
    old "...{w}Since I couldn't arrive at a conclusion, I lowered my head after being lost in thought for a while."
    new "……{w}想了半天也得不出结论，我最终还是低下了头。"

    # game/script.rpy:3437
    old "Shiroya was standing near me, looking almost as detached as I was sure I did."
    new "Shiroya 站在我旁边，神情有些恍惚，我猜自己看起来也差不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:3438
    old "Shiroya?"
    new "Shiroya？"

    # game/script.rpy:3443
    old "H-Hm?"
    new "唔、嗯？"

    # game/script.rpy:3444
    old "Are you okay?"
    new "你没事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:3449
    old "Yeah... I am."
    new "嗯……没事。"

    # game/script.rpy:3450
    old "I rubbed at my face with one hand and pulled her aside, speaking in a hushed tone."
    new "我用一只手抹了把脸，把她拉到一旁，压低声音说话。"

    # game/script.rpy:3451
    old "Shiroya. It's fine. We're fine. Naomi is fine too. You can't let this stuff get to you."
    new "Shiroya，没事的。我们都没事，Naomi 也没事。别让这些事压垮你。"

    # game/script.rpy:3456
    old "I-I'm not..."
    new "我、我没有……"

    # game/script.rpy:3457
    old "Don't get sucked into some depressive loop, okay? I'm here. We're going to find her."
    new "别让自己陷进没完没了的消沉里，好吗？有我在。我们会找到她的。"

    # game/script.rpy:3463
    old "I mean it."
    new "我是认真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:3468
    old "All right. I'm sorry. It was just... the camera footage is..."
    new "好。对不起。只是……那段监控录像实在……"

    # game/script.rpy:3469
    old "The police will recover it."
    new "警方会把它找回来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:3474
    old "...You're right."
    new "……你说得对。"

    # game/script.rpy:3475
    old "Somewhat satisfied, I patted her shoulder and stepped back into the middle of the hallway."
    new "我这才稍稍放心，拍了拍她的肩膀，回到走廊中央。"

    # game/script.rpy:3480
    old "Close by, Isla, who had finished talking with her mother, was walking to the event room."
    new "不远处，和母亲通完话的 Isla 正朝活动室走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:3481
    old "We were supposed to investigate the building, but we had all silently agreed to wait a bit out of either anxiety or hesitation."
    new "按说我们该去搜查这栋楼，可不知是出于不安还是犹豫，大家都不约而同地选择再等一等。"

    # game/script.rpy:3490
    old "I wanna see it again!"
    new "我还想再看一遍！"

    # game/script.rpy:3493
    old "Without further explanation, she quickly made her way into the room."
    new "她没再多说，快步走进了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:3498
    old "*sigh*"
    new "唉……"

    # game/script.rpy:3501
    old "Erina followed behind her. The rest of us did the same since staying by ourselves didn't seem very useful."
    new "Erina 跟在她身后。我们其余的人也跟了上去，毕竟各自留在原地也没什么用。"

    # game/script.rpy:3502
    old "The previous two weeks had been difficult for Shiroya and me. I knew the cheerful Shiroya I was fond of would take a longer time to come back, but all things considered, both of us were handling the situation pretty well. I was just concerned about pushing her too far."
    new "过去这两周，对 Shiroya 和我来说都很难熬。我知道，我喜欢的那个开朗的 Shiroya 还要过些日子才能回来，但总的来说，我们两个都应对得还算不错。我只是担心把她逼得太紧。"

    # game/script.rpy:3510
    old "Isla was in front of the cabinet. I entered the room just as she was about to uncover the cabinet, and Akaro and Sai followed silently after me."
    new "Isla 站在展示柜前。我走进房间时，她正要掀开柜上的遮布，Akaro 和 Sai 默默跟在我身后。"

    # game/script.rpy:3517
    old "Blue Light"
    new "蓝光"

    # game/script.rpy:3519
    old "Look at how pretty it is! Now that the light has gotten a bit better, I like it even more."
    new "你们看它多漂亮！光线比刚才好了些，我就更喜欢它了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3524
    old "I agree, it's pretty elegant-looking."
    new "是啊，确实挺雅致的。"

    # game/script.rpy:3525
    old "Akaro and Sai walked in farther. However, once Akaro stopped, Sai did not."
    new "Akaro 和 Sai 又往房间里走了几步。可 Akaro 停下时，Sai 却没有停。"

    # game/script.rpy:3530
    old "He placed himself in front of the cabinet and stared at the Sekimeiya. In the same way, everybody else just stared at him while he thought to himself."
    new "他在展示柜前站定，盯着 Sekimeiya。就在他独自沉思的时候，其他人也同样只是盯着他看。"

    # game/script.rpy:3534
    old "Then, with the same neutral expression, he scrolled the glass down."
    new "然后，他依旧面无表情，把玻璃罩往下拉。"

    # game/script.rpy:3540
    old "What are you doing...?"
    new "你在做什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:3541
    old "Instead of responding, he reached to touch the Sekimeiya."
    new "他没有回答，伸手去碰 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:3542
    old "Or that's what I first thought. Instead, he grabbed it and took it out of the cabinet."
    new "我原本是这么以为的。可他却一把抓住它，把它从展示柜里取了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:3551
    old "Hey, what's up with you!? Didn't Katei say not to take it out!?"
    new "喂，你搞什么！？Katei 不是说过不能把它拿出来吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:3556
    old "I guess he did. However, right now, he's in the security room doing God knows what."
    new "他确实说过。不过此时此刻，他正在监控室里，天知道在干什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:3561
    old "...What are you trying to do?"
    new "……你到底想做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:3562
    old "Isla extended her arm and let out a charming \"Can I have it?\""
    new "Isla 伸出手，甜甜地说了句「可以给我吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:3567
    old "Yeah, of course, here."
    new "嗯，当然，给你。"

    # game/script.rpy:3568
    old "I looked at the camera in the upper right corner and saw the flickering green light. After handing Ashiya's precious gem to the nine-year-old, Sai answered Akaro."
    new "我看向右上角的摄像头，只见绿灯一闪一闪。Sai 把芦屋的珍宝交到那个九岁女孩手里，这才回答 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:3574
    old "I was just considering that what Katei said earlier might've been false. Just in case he's not been the most sincere person."
    new "我只是在想，Katei 之前说的那些话说不定是假的。也许他并没有那么诚恳。"

    # game/script.rpy:3575
    old "What part of it?"
    new "哪一部分？"

    # game/script.rpy:3580
    old "I'm talking about when he said that the Sekimeiya has to be kept in a cold place."
    new "我指的是他说 Sekimeiya 必须放在低温环境里那句。"

    # game/script.rpy:3585
    old "I'm just floating the possibility of him saying it to scare us into not taking it out."
    new "我只是提出一种可能：他那么说，是为了吓住我们，让我们不敢把它拿出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:3590
    old "Why would he lie like that? And really, why else would the cabinet be refrigerated other than because it's beneficial for the Sekimeiya?"
    new "他何必撒这种谎？再说了，要不是对 Sekimeiya 有好处，展示柜为什么非得制冷？"

    # game/script.rpy:3591
    old "Why would he lie? I just told you: so that we keep it in the cabinet. Keeping this thing cold might be \"beneficial\", but he made it sound essential."
    new "他为什么撒谎？我刚说了：好让我们把它留在展示柜里。保持低温也许确实「有好处」，可他把它说成了非如此不可。"

    # game/script.rpy:3596
    old "...And look."
    new "……而且你看。"

    # game/script.rpy:3597
    old "Sai pointed at Isla, who looked to be enjoying her time despite the serious situation. She was clearly delighted at being able to hold the Sekimeiya, something she would never have been able to do under normal circumstances."
    new "Sai 指向 Isla。眼下情况明明很严重，她却一副乐在其中的样子。能亲手捧着 Sekimeiya，她显然高兴极了——换作平时，她绝不会有这种机会。"

    # game/script.rpy:3598
    old "Right now, the Sekimeiya looks perfectly fine to me, yet it's not inside a cabinet that provides it a very low temperature. Curious, isn't it?"
    new "在我看来，Sekimeiya 现在完好无损，可它并没待在能维持极低温的展示柜里。不觉得奇怪吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:3603
    old "You don't know how the temperature might damage it. It could slowly crack it, which would be very bad. Its strongest point is how smooth it is... Right, Isla?"
    new "你根本不知道温度会怎样损伤它。也许会让它慢慢裂开，那可就糟了。它最突出的优点就是光滑……对吧，Isla？"

    # game/script.rpy:3609
    old "Isla nodded strongly. She definitely agreed, as she wouldn't stop fiddling with it."
    new "Isla 用力点头。她显然完全赞同，手上还一直摆弄着它。"

    # game/script.rpy:3612
    old "You're right. I was just testing what would happen."
    new "你说得对。我只是想看看会有什么结果。"

    # game/script.rpy:3617
    old "What if the Sekimeiya melted after getting it out? Do you know the consequences that would follow!?"
    new "万一 Sekimeiya 拿出来之后就融化了怎么办？你知道那会引发什么后果吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:3618
    old "Then Katei would've been telling the truth. Right now, the Sekimeiya looks perfectly normal to me, and it's not like Katei told us exactly what a higher temperature would do. He was just \"told\" a low one was needed."
    new "那说明 Katei 说的是实话。可眼下 Sekimeiya 在我看来毫无异样，再说 Katei 也没讲清楚温度升高究竟会造成什么。他也只是「被告知」需要低温罢了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3623
    old "Don't worry, though. If it had melted, we all would've said that he'd forgotten to warn us and they would've busted his ass."
    new "不过别担心。真要融了，我们就一致咬定是他忘了提醒，上头自然会狠狠收拾他。"

    # game/script.rpy:3624
    old "I don't think that's something Katei made up. Naomi also said something similar."
    new "我不觉得那是 Katei 编出来的。Naomi 也说过类似的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:3639
    old "As if he'd been summoned, Katei appeared behind the open door."
    new "仿佛被召唤而来一般，Katei 出现在敞开的门后。"

    # game/script.rpy:3646
    old "Isla, plenty aware of impending trouble, instinctively hid the Sekimeiya behind her back. But she wasn't fast enough."
    new "Isla 很清楚麻烦要来了，下意识把 Sekimeiya 藏到身后。可她的动作还是不够快。"

    # game/script.rpy:3652
    old "What are you guys doing here...? Why is the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet!?"
    new "你们在这里做什么……？Sekimeiya 怎么会被拿出展示柜！？"

    # game/script.rpy:3657
    old "Rather, what were you doing in the security room? Did you find a way to restore the security system or contact the outside again?"
    new "倒是你，在监控室做什么？找到恢复安保系统的办法了，还是又联系上外界了？"

    # game/script.rpy:3662
    old "...No. Nothing worked. I did undo some effects of the alarm, though. The elevator is now functioning, and proper illumination has been restored."
    new "……没有。什么都没成。不过警报造成的部分影响我已经解除了。电梯恢复了运行，照明也恢复正常了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3667
    old "Sounds great."
    new "听起来不错。"

    # game/script.rpy:3671
    old "What do you mean, \"sounds great\"!? Why did you get the Sekimeiya out!? I told you how important it is not to remove it from the cabinet!"
    new "什么叫「听起来不错」！？你们为什么把 Sekimeiya 拿出来了！？我明明告诉过你们，绝不能把它从展示柜里取出来，也说过这有多重要！"

    # game/script.rpy:3675
    old "Katei, who looked and probably was rightfully angry, walked forward and forcefully took the Sekimeiya out of Isla's hands. She gave him a blank, depressing look in response."
    new "Katei 满脸怒色——他大概也确实有理由发火——走上前一把从 Isla 手中夺过 Sekimeiya。Isla 则回以一个空洞而沮丧的眼神。"

    # game/script.rpy:3679
    old "Important why? What is the higher temperature gonna do? It looks perfectly fine to me.{w} Don't tell me: it's a real egg, right? It must be kept cold so it doesn't hatch."
    new "有什么重要的？温度高一点又能怎样？它看起来明明好得很。{w}别告诉我：它其实是个蛋吧？得一直冷藏，免得孵出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:3684
    old "Listen, kid. I know you might find this a boring situation and you're trying to stay entertained. However, you should understand how serious this is."
    new "听好了，小子。我知道你觉得这局面很无聊，想找点乐子。但你该明白这事有多严重。"

    # game/script.rpy:3685
    old "It seemed Katei had correctly assumed that the whole thing was Sai's idea."
    new "看来 Katei 猜得没错，这整件事就是 Sai 的主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:3690
    old "I don't know what the effects will be. I don't know if they'll happen immediately, but I know one thing. I know that my superiors told me that no matter the circumstances, the Sekimeiya could never be taken out of this cabinet, and that while they were saying it, their eyes were as serious as they could've been."
    new "我不知道会有什么影响，也不知道会不会立刻显现，但有一点我清楚。上级告诉过我，无论出于什么情况，Sekimeiya 都绝不能离开这个展示柜。他们说这话时，眼神严肃得不能再严肃。"

    # game/script.rpy:3691
    old "The cameras here are disabled, so I'm sure you think you can do as you please without facing consequences. For your own good, or for our entire good, rather, do not think of doing this again."
    new "这里的摄像头已经失效，所以你肯定觉得可以随心所欲、不用承担后果。为了你自己好——不，倒不如说是为了我们所有人好——别再动这种念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:3698
    old "Katei placed the Sekimeiya back in the cabinet, shut the glass and the curtain, and looked into Sai's eyes as he finished."
    new "Katei 把 Sekimeiya 放回展示柜，合上玻璃柜门，拉上遮布，说完时直视着 Sai 的眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:3704
    old "Sai kept staring back, unfazed, but his expression had slightly changed."
    new "Sai 毫不退让地继续回望，神情却有了细微的变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:3705
    old "If I had to guess what he was thinking... It was probably something along the lines of \"You're one hell of an actor.\""
    new "硬要猜他在想什么的话……大概是「你可真会演戏」之类的吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:3706
    old "However, to me, it didn't look like Katei was lying. I didn't rule it out, but I could believe he was very worried the orders he'd been given wouldn't be followed, foreseeing the punishment he'd be dealt by the Ashiya family."
    new "不过，我不觉得 Katei 在说谎。我并不排除他说谎的可能，但更愿意相信他是真的担心上级的命令没被遵从，也预见到了芦屋家会怎样责罚他。"

    # game/script.rpy:3707
    old "Yeah, sure."
    new "行，知道了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3713
    old "I don't know why you don't seem able to believe me. I can't tell you everything, but if it's going to make you feel better, I can tell you all that I know about the Sekimeiya. Maybe I can earn your trust like this."
    new "我不知道你为什么就是不肯信我。我不能把一切都告诉你，但如果这能让你安心些，我可以把我知道的 Sekimeiya 的事全说出来。也许这样能换来你的信任。"

    # game/script.rpy:3714
    old "He didn't only look at Sai, but also at the rest of us. Suddenly, he seemed very serious about proving his sincerity. Perhaps he felt that everybody had been suspecting him in some way."
    new "他不只看着 Sai，也看向我们其他人。忽然间，他像是下定决心要认真证明自己的诚意。也许他觉得，每个人都在以某种方式怀疑他。"

    # game/script.rpy:3715
    old "Again, I was told about this very briefly and only to have the needed context as part of the security staff. I can't elaborate much on it, but given all that Suripo said, it's probably fine if I tell you the basic outline I know."
    new "再说一次，我当初只得到过极为简短的说明，仅仅是为了让安保人员掌握必要的背景。我没法细讲，但既然 Suripo 已经说了那么多，我把知道的大致轮廓告诉你们，应该也无妨。"

    # game/script.rpy:3716
    old "Instead of saying anything, everybody stayed silent, intrigued by whatever Katei could have to say."
    new "谁都没有开口，所有人都保持沉默，对 Katei 可能要说的话颇感兴趣。"

    # game/script.rpy:3721
    old "...As you all already know, the Sekimeiya was no more than bait for Xyn. After the last time the tower was attacked, on the 24th of November, Ashiya began to look for something they could use."
    new "……正如你们所知，Sekimeiya 不过是用来引诱 Xyn 的诱饵。11 月 24 日芦屋塔上次遇袭之后，芦屋家便开始寻找能加以利用的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:3727
    old "Yushibana is now full of people who dedicate their lives to gemstone location and extraction. The number of them increased exponentially when the tower's opening informed people of the valuable gems in the nearby mountains."
    new "如今丰花遍地都是靠寻找和开采宝石为生的人。芦屋塔开放后，人们得知附近山中藏有贵重宝石，这类人的数量便成倍增长。"

    # game/script.rpy:3728
    old "For many people, going and finding these all around the mountains became a successful gamble. The Sekimeiya was found by a single person who did just that, on the 27th of November."
    new "对许多人来说，进山四处寻宝成了一场成功的赌博。11 月 27 日，就有一个人这样做，结果发现了 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:3733
    old "Another common practice upon finding a rare or valuable gem is informing the Ashiya family with hopes that they'll be interested in it. For this reason, we were the first ones to be informed of the Sekimeiya."
    new "发现稀有或贵重宝石后，另一种常见做法是通知芦屋家，希望他们能感兴趣。正因如此，我们是最先得知 Sekimeiya 的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:3734
    old "A unique-looking gemstone worked perfectly for Ashiya. Regardless of its actual value, it did look special, so that was enough to work as the bait they needed."
    new "一块外形独特的宝石对芦屋家来说再合适不过。不管它实际价值如何，看上去确实特别，这就足够充当他们需要的诱饵了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3735
    old "After paying the original discoverer for the Sekimeiya and their silence, they purposely touted the Sekimeiya's value as hard as they could. The first mention of the Sekimeiya by that name was made on the 29th, as you probably know. Ashiya told everyone who would listen they were in possession of something incredibly rare and that it'd be shown today, on the 15th of December."
    new "他们付钱给最初的发现者，买下 Sekimeiya 并让对方守口如瓶，随后便刻意拼命抬高它的价值。你们大概也知道，Sekimeiya 这个名字第一次出现是在 29 日。芦屋家逢人便说，他们手中有一件极其稀有的宝物，并将在今天——12 月 15 日——公开展出。"

    # game/script.rpy:3738
    old "Every night until today, we've been expecting Xyn's attack.{w} Everyone was led to think Ashiya had their rarest find in a while, so as Suripo said earlier, regardless of its actual initial worth, after all the publicity, the Sekimeiya was incredibly valuable for Xyn."
    new "直到今天为止，每一晚我们都在提防 Xyn 来袭。{w}所有人都被引导相信，芦屋家得到了近年最稀有的发现；所以正如 Suripo 之前所说，不管 Sekimeiya 最初的实际价值如何，经过这一番宣传，它对 Xyn 而言已价值连城。"

    # game/script.rpy:3741
    old "We sold many tickets for today's event—you all saw how far the line of people extended in the lobby. Despite realizing Xyn could pass up on the bait, Ashiya still went with the option of letting the Sekimeiya they'd praised nonstop be seen."
    new "今天的活动，我们卖出了许多门票——你们都看见大厅里的队伍排得有多长。尽管知道 Xyn 可能放过这个诱饵，芦屋家仍旧选择把他们不停吹捧的 Sekimeiya 公开展出。"

    # game/script.rpy:3742
    old "Naomi was instructed to give out a bunch of made-up facts about it and its worth during her guided visit to try to justify all the hype. To add interaction and lengthen the visit time, the visitors were going to touch its surface, but only inside the cabinet."
    new "Naomi 被指示在导览过程中讲一堆关于它本身及其价值的编造说辞，好让这番炒作站得住脚。为了增加互动、延长参观时间，原本还安排参观者触摸它的表面，但只能在展示柜内触摸。"

    # game/script.rpy:3743
    old "To tell you guys the truth, Xyn did actually attempt to steal the Sekimeiya once. Suripo had no reason to inform you of this, but almost as soon as its existence was announced, Xyn made a move for it."
    new "实话告诉你们，Xyn 确实试图偷走 Sekimeiya 一次。Suripo 本来没理由把这件事告诉你们，但它的存在刚一公布，Xyn 就出手了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3747
    old "As you can see, their plan ended in failure. We even came close to catching someone from Xyn for the first time, but they were able to escape. This was almost Ashiya's success, but this information was never published even though it would've been seen as Xyn's first failure."
    new "如你们所见，他们的计划以失败告终。我们甚至头一次差一点就抓到 Xyn 的人，可对方还是逃脱了。这几乎可算芦屋家的一次成功，但这个消息从未公开，尽管它本可被视为 Xyn 的首次失手。"

    # game/script.rpy:3749
    old "The reason was that they wanted to keep up the charade and put the plan in motion to catch Xyn for real. The Sekimeiya wasn't in this building yet, so the mechanism we had designed wasn't activated."
    new "理由是，他们想继续把这出戏演下去，并推进真正抓捕 Xyn 的计划。当时 Sekimeiya 还不在本楼里，所以我们设计的机关并未启动。"

    # game/script.rpy:3750
    old "Additionally, even though Xyn were the ones to try to steal it, Ashiya had no way to prove it. Since the circumstances were unusual and everyone knew they wanted to crush Xyn, people could've thought they'd made it all up, as no one had actually been apprehended."
    new "此外，尽管动手偷窃的确实是 Xyn，芦屋家却无法证明这一点。当时情况非同寻常，而所有人都知道他们急于击溃 Xyn；既然根本没有抓到人，外界很可能会认为这一切都是他们编造的。"

    # game/script.rpy:3754
    old "That's all I can say about this. Now, the cold temperature rule was not something Ashiya realized, but something the seller instructed. They said that it had to always be kept chilled to preserve it based on their own experience."
    new "关于这件事，我能说的就这么多。至于必须低温这一条，并非芦屋家自己发现的，而是卖家叮嘱的。对方说，根据自身经验，必须始终冷藏，才能将它保存好。"

    # game/script.rpy:3755
    old "The fact they knew that putting it under a higher temperature could damage it implies they did so at one point and noticed the damaging effects. However, as Sai said, after you all took it out for a bit, it still seemed to be fine. They probably did the same and found out that leaving it for longer could be harmful."
    new "他们既然知道放在更高温度下会损坏它，就说明曾经这么干过，并且察觉到了损坏的后果。不过，正如 Sai 所说，你们把它取出来放了一阵，它看起来仍然完好。他们大概也做了同样的事，发现放得太久会有害。"

    # game/script.rpy:3756
    old "Ashiya did not particularly care, so they naturally accepted and followed that single rule without much of a concern. Ashiya already had this cabinet, alongside others that also possess temperature functions, so it was a convenient place to keep it after stylizing it a little."
    new "芦屋对此并不特别在意，自然就接受了这条规矩，照做时也没多少顾虑。芦屋本来就有这个展示柜，另外还有几个带温控功能的柜子，所以稍微改装一下之后，放在这里很方便。"

    # game/script.rpy:3760
    old "Since it was found pretty high up on the mountains behind the tower, the temperature there was already very low. At their request, the location where it was found was revealed to Ashiya."
    new "它是在塔后群山相当高的地方被发现的，那里气温本来就极低。应芦屋家的要求，发现地点也告知了他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:3761
    old "A vast mountain range surrounds Yushibana, which I'm sure you see daily. On Airun, a mountain close to this building, there is a little upward path that was much more visible a few years ago.{w} That part of the range has almost been abandoned. Over time, many fewer gemstones have been found on Airun than the others."
    new "丰花四周环绕着广阔的山脉，想必你们每天都看得见。离这栋楼不远的艾伦山上，有一条向上延伸的小径，几年前要比现在显眼得多。{w} 那一片山域几乎已被废弃。久而久之，在艾伦山发现的宝石远比别的山少。"

    # game/script.rpy:3762
    old "Eventually, up that mountain is a small field that's pretty well-hidden. It's not easy to spot, and you have to deviate onto a smaller path. All I was told was that it's fairly tucked away."
    new "沿山而上，最后会到一小片相当隐蔽的平地。那里不容易发现，得岔到一条更窄的小路上去。我只听说那地方藏得相当深。"

    # game/script.rpy:3767
    old "That's where this was found."
    new "这东西就是在那儿被发现的。"

    # game/script.rpy:3769
    old "Katei pointed at the cabinet.{w} That was all interesting and consistent with what we knew, but my mind had gone someplace else."
    new "Katei 指了指展示柜。{w} 这些话都很有意思，也和我们已知的对得上，可我的思绪已经飘到了别处。"

    # game/script.rpy:3774
    old "As I expected, when I looked at Shiroya, she was already looking at me. It seemed she'd thought the same thing."
    new "果然，我看向 Shiroya 时，她也正看着我。看来她想到了同一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:3780
    old "Bizarre as it sounded, the location Katei had just described matched perfectly with the place where we used to play as kids. Past that grassy terrain, there used to be a cabin she and I would frequently visit."
    new "说来离奇，Katei 刚刚描述的地点，和我们小时候玩耍的地方完全对得上。那片草地再过去，曾有一间我和她常去的小屋。"

    # game/script.rpy:3781
    old "It was the same mountain, the same narrow path, and maybe the same plain and grassy field which were covered by snow."
    new "同一座山，同一条窄路，或许还是同一片被雪覆盖的平地与草地。"

    # game/script.rpy:3782
    old "It seemed pointless to think much of it; we hadn't been there for more than a decade, but back in the day, it was the perfect hidden place for us to go spend our time.{w} Not once had we seen anyone else there, but eventually, going to the mountains just to play was seen as rude by the people who tried to make a daily living on them."
    new "多想似乎也没什么意义；我们已有十多年没去过那里，可当年，那正是我们消磨时光的绝佳藏身处。{w} 我们在那儿从没见过别人，但后来，那些靠山谋生的人渐渐觉得，只为玩耍就上山是一件失礼的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:3783
    old "Admittedly, we also didn't want to have anything to do with the strangers on the mountain, which decreased the frequency of our visits until we finally stopped going altogether. The final visit was something we hadn't even realized was final."
    new "平心而论，我们也不想和山上的陌生人有什么牵扯，于是去的次数越来越少，最后干脆不去了。那最后一次，我们当时甚至没意识到那就是最后一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:3788
    old "...Do you remember?"
    new "……你还记得吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:3789
    old "Yeah, of course. I'm not sure the place is the same, but thinking back on those times makes me happy."
    new "嗯，当然记得。我不确定是不是同一个地方，但回想那段日子，心里很高兴。"

    # game/script.rpy:3790
    old "You're right. We used to have a lot of fun there."
    new "是啊。我们那时候在那里玩得很开心。"

    # game/script.rpy:3794
    old "Reminiscing evoked a very particular feeling within me. When the weather was ideal, we would spend entire afternoons in our unreachable hidden place, playing all sorts of different games. We brought things from home every day we went to make it ours."
    new "回忆让我心里涌起一种很特别的感觉。天气好的时候，我们会在那个谁也到不了的秘密基地里待上一整个下午，玩各种各样的游戏。每次去，我们都会从家里带些东西过去，把那地方变成我们自己的。"

    # game/script.rpy:3796
    old "Even though if you were to look at Shiroya, you might not have believed it, her usual self was a very cheerful one, so remembering some of those early memories was bittersweet."
    new "如今看着 Shiroya，或许很难相信，可她向来是个非常开朗的人，所以回想起那些早年的往事，心里五味杂陈。"

    # game/script.rpy:3801
    old "On the other hand, after I looked at her... She was smiling, and wore an expression that had lately disappeared from her face. The memories we shared from that time were very special."
    new "不过，我看向她时，她笑了，脸上露出了近来难得一见的神情。我们共同拥有的那段记忆，实在太特别了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3802
    old "No matter what I'd tried to say, I hadn't been able to cheer her up. That might've been the first time in two weeks she'd clearly reacted positively to anything, and I probably knew why."
    new "不管我说什么，都没能让她振作起来。这大概是两周来她第一次对什么事反应积极，而我多半也明白原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:3803
    old "Those memories were so old that Miiya had not yet appeared in our lives. That was why Shiroya was able to think about them without sparking the negative reactions that obfuscated everything else."
    new "那些记忆太过久远，那时 Miiya 还没出现在我们的生命里。正因如此，Shiroya 想起它们时，才不会激起那种把其他一切都搅得模糊不清的负面反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:3804
    old "Maybe we should go back one day and see what it looks like now."
    new "也许哪天我们该回去看看，现在那里是什么样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:3805
    old "Yeah... That is a good idea."
    new "嗯……这是个好主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:3806
    old "Even though her smile had slightly faded, she seemed to genuinely mean that. It was reassuring to hear, and it made me trust that everything would eventually get better."
    new "她的笑容虽然淡了些，但这话听着是真心实意的。听她这么说，我安心了不少，也相信一切终究会好起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:3809
    old "Katei had continued talking while I'd been digging up old memories, but he'd only gone back over his previous points."
    new "在我回想那些旧日记忆的时候，Katei 一直在往下说，不过他只是把先前的话又重复了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:3814
    old "This is all I know. It's not much, but hopefully you can at least believe me."
    new "我知道的就这些。虽然不多，但希望你们至少能信我。"

    # game/script.rpy:3820
    old "You sure are good at coming up with stories to cover your ass. It's honestly impressive."
    new "你还真擅长编故事给自己开脱。老实说，挺让人佩服的。"

    # game/script.rpy:3825
    old "Sai said that, but it didn't look like he disbelieved Katei's explanation. He was most likely referring to everything else Katei said previously with the sole intention to provoke him."
    new "Sai 虽然这么说，但看上去并不像是不信 Katei 的解释。他多半只是拿 Katei 先前提到的其他那些话来激他，唯一的目的就是惹他发火。"

    # game/script.rpy:3826
    old "If that didn't please you, there's not much else I can say. This was probably more than I am allowed to, actually."
    new "要是这还不能让你满意，我也没什么可说的了。其实，我说的这些，大概已经超出我能说的范围了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3832
    old "Ah. I see."
    new "啊。原来如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:3835
    old "Even though I could've seen Sai's playful behavior as intriguing earlier, it had become off-putting. After shifting my thoughts to some of my childhood memories, the thought of getting out of the tower was much more appealing."
    new "早些时候，我或许还会觉得 Sai 这种玩闹似的态度有意思，现在却只觉得不舒服。想起一些童年回忆后，我更想离开这座塔了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3836
    old "Finding out who was responsible for the attack was a goal, but as long as the police had some way to recover the camera footage, they could handle that. They could have already captured the person responsible for all we knew. Ashiya's compensation was certainly a nice thought to keep in mind, too."
    new "查出袭击的主谋固然是个目标，但只要警方有办法恢复监控录像，这件事交给他们就行。说不定他们早就抓到人了。而且，芦屋的赔偿也确实值得期待。"

    # game/script.rpy:3837
    old "It was more important to keep an eye out for anyone doing anything suspicious and nail them once we got out than constantly and baselessly accuse anyone in the vicinity like Sai seemed to want to."
    new "与其像 Sai 那样，不停毫无根据地指控身边每一个人，不如留意周围有没有人行为可疑，等出去之后再把他揪出来，这才是更重要的。"

    # game/script.rpy:3846
    old "Anyway... weren't you all supposed to be investigating the building? I think it's time for that. We keep repeating this, but Naomi's disappearance gets weirder by the second."
    new "总之……你们不是该去调查这栋楼了吗？我看差不多该动手了。这话我们说了又说，可 Naomi 的失踪一秒比一秒更离奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:3852
    old "Yeah, we should go."
    new "嗯，我们走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:3856
    old "I agree. Let's look through this floor first; it's where she was when the smoke appeared, and it has plenty of disabled cameras."
    new "我同意。先搜这一层吧。烟雾出现的时候她就在这层，而且这一层有不少摄像头被停用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3872
    old "We made our way to hallway A. Finally starting to inspect the huge building was an imposing task.{w} A lot of time had already passed, so I had no idea what to think of Naomi's disappearance. She was either incapable of reaching us... or didn't want to."
    new "我们来到 A走廊。终于要开始搜查这栋庞大的建筑了，这项任务可不轻松。{w} 已经过去了这么长时间，我对 Naomi 的失踪实在不知该作何感想。她要么是无法联系我们……要么是不想。"

    # game/script.rpy:3877
    old "How do we do it? Do we split up?"
    new "怎么查？要分头行动吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:3882
    old "No. Let's make the situation clear first. Funny things can happen later."
    new "不。先把情况弄清楚。之后要是出了什么怪事，再作打算。"

    # game/script.rpy:3883
    old "Let's enter every room in this hallway and then move on to the other one. After we're done with this floor, we'll move up one at a time."
    new "先把这条走廊的每个房间都进去看一遍，再去另一条。这一层查完之后，我们一层一层往上走。"

    # game/script.rpy:3888
    old "Yeah. Let's begin there."
    new "好。就从那里开始吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:3891
    old "Erina looked at the crystal room in front of the security room. It was the one labeled \"A1\" on the map."
    new "Erina 望向监控室前面的那间水晶展室。就是地图上标着「A1」的那间。"

    # game/script.rpy:3899
    old "Given the floor's layout, if there was someone who wanted to avoid being seen, as long as we didn't split up, they could easily achieve that."
    new "照这一层的格局，要是有人想避开我们的视线，只要我们不分开，对方就能轻易做到。"

    # game/script.rpy:3900
    old "There were three different ways to make it from one hallway to the other, so we would never be able to rule out a sneaky moving culprit."
    new "从一条走廊到另一条有三条路可走，所以我们始终无法排除有人暗中转移的可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:3901
    old "Taking that same possibility in mind, though, the thought of splitting up was distressing. It was better to investigate together and hope that wouldn't happen."
    new "可正因为有这个可能，分头行动的念头才让人不安。还是一起调查，但愿不会发生那种事。"

    # game/script.rpy:3907
    old "We were in front of the room we'd start with. Katei opened it, and yet again, I felt the same recurring sensation of stepping into a different world."
    new "我们站在要搜查的第一个房间门前。Katei 推开门，我又一次涌起那种熟悉的感觉，仿佛踏进了另一个世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:3914
    old "A clean floor, walls, and ceiling awaited us. Just like in the room I'd looked at, there were many cabinets, presumably displaying different kinds of valuable gemstones."
    new "迎接我们的是干净的地板、墙壁和天花板。和我看过的那间一样，这里摆着许多展示柜，想必陈列着各式各样的贵重宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:3920
    old "Why are they covered?"
    new "为什么都盖着？"

    # game/script.rpy:3921
    old "As Isla said, the interior of the cabinets wasn't visible. Velvet curtains, as pretty as the Sekimeiya's had once been, were neatly placed over all of them."
    new "正如 Isla 所说，看不见展示柜里面。所有柜子都整齐地罩着天鹅绒遮布，漂亮得就像当年盖着 Sekimeiya 的那块一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:3926
    old "Oh, yes, this is something that we do every morning. Except on Sundays, when the tower is closed."
    new "哦，对，这是我们每天早上都要做的事。周日闭馆时除外。"

    # game/script.rpy:3927
    old "While at {time=9:00}, the floor opens to the public, it isn't until {time=9:10} that the showcase cabinets are uncovered. This is purely done for dramatic effect and, honestly, to give the visitors the impression that they're about to witness something very valuable."
    new "{time=9:00}时，这一层便向公众开放；但展示柜要到{time=9:10}才会揭开遮布。这纯粹是为了制造戏剧效果，说实话，也是为了让参观者感到自己即将见证一件极其贵重的珍宝。"

    # game/script.rpy:3932
    old "Oh... Can I?"
    new "哦……可以吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:3933
    old "Yeah, of course. Let me raise them for you."
    new "当然可以。我来帮你把它们卷起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:3936
    old "In the same manner that Katei might've seen it done daily through the cameras, he carefully rolled up every curtain, letting us see what they were hiding."
    new "Katei 或许每天都在监控画面里看惯了这套动作，此刻也依样而行，小心翼翼地卷起每一块遮布，让我们看清遮布后藏着的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:3942
    old "As amazed as a little girl trapped in a building could be, Isla lit up while Katei uncovered the next mysterious interior."
    new "一个被困在这栋楼里的小女孩，再惊喜也不过如此——Katei 揭开下一处神秘陈设时，Isla 的眼睛一下子亮了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:3943
    old "Sai gave it a similar look, one I couldn't help but question."
    new "Sai 也露出了相似的神色，我不禁有些起疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:3945
    old "The cabinets in those rooms were different from the Sekimeiya's. They were lower to the ground, and on top of them was a screen of glass that sheltered the gemstones."
    new "那些房间里的展示柜与 Sekimeiya 的不同。它们更贴近地面，上方还罩着一层玻璃，把宝石护在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:3951
    old "Wow, look at this black one, Mom! Isn't it pretty? I love it."
    new "哇，妈妈你看这颗黑色的！是不是很漂亮？我好喜欢。"

    # game/script.rpy:3957
    old "It's quite pretty. I wish I could wear it as a necklace."
    new "确实很漂亮。要是能把它做成项链戴上就好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:3958
    old "If nothing else, it was good that Erina treated Isla as if they were in a normal visit, letting her feel comfortable."
    new "至少，Erina 让 Isla 觉得这就是一次寻常的参观，使她放松了不少，这总归是件好事。"

    # game/script.rpy:3963
    old "Shortly, Katei finished with every cabinet.{w} They had all contained gemstones of different shapes and tones. Some also had a brief explanation below them, detailing where they'd been found along with the name of who'd found them. Most were discovered in the mountains I was used to seeing in the background of Yushibana."
    new "很快，Katei 把所有展示柜都揭完了。{w}每个柜子里都放着形状、色泽各异的宝石。有些柜子下方还附有简短说明，写明发现地点和发现者的名字。其中大多数都发现于我早已看惯的、丰花远景中的群山里。"

    # game/script.rpy:3967
    old "Despite the events and my lack of interest, I spent some time looking at each one, immersing myself in them without noticing it. Everyone else did the same, drawn into Isla's rhythm briefly."
    new "尽管经历了那些事，我本来也没什么兴致，却还是挨个看了一会儿，不知不觉便沉浸其中。其他人也一样，一时都被 Isla 的步调带了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:3973
    old "Do you like this one?"
    new "你喜欢这颗吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:3974
    old "Shiroya was pointing at a tiny, light blue jewel with round white marks on its smooth surface. She'd said it because I'd been looking at it for a while, and she knew that shade of blue was my favorite color."
    new "Shiroya 指着一颗小小的浅蓝色宝石，光滑的表面上有几处白色圆斑。她之所以这么问，是因为我盯着那颗宝石看了好一会儿，而她知道这种蓝色是我最喜欢的颜色。"

    # game/script.rpy:3975
    old "I really do. I wouldn't mind going to the mountains someday if I can manage to find one like this."
    new "真的很喜欢。要是能亲手找到一颗这样的，哪天进山一趟也无妨。"

    # game/script.rpy:3980
    old "I'm sure it wouldn't be easy, but it'd be worth the effort."
    new "我想那肯定不容易，不过值得费这番功夫。"

    # game/script.rpy:3982
    old "After talking about going back to our personal playground, I started to really look forward to the time where we'd visit it again, spending a day trying to find a gem as pretty as that one."
    new "聊起要回我们自己的那片私人乐园后，我便开始真心期待再次前往的那一天——花上一整天，找一颗和那颗一样漂亮的宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:3989
    old "Can I see it again, Tanya?"
    new "坦桑娅，能再让我看看吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:3995
    old "...Huh? Are you talking to me?"
    new "……咦？你是在叫我吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:4000
    old "Yes! Can I see your pendant?"
    new "对呀！我能看看你的吊坠吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:4005
    old "A bit confused, Shiroya took it out."
    new "Shiroya 有些困惑，把吊坠取了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:4010
    old "I knew it! It's even prettier than everything here!"
    new "我就知道！它比这里所有的宝石都漂亮！"

    # game/script.rpy:4011
    old "...What's with that name, though?"
    new "……不过，这名字是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:4016
    old "Hm? Tanya? That's you! It's for tanzanite."
    new "嗯？坦桑娅？就是你呀！是从坦桑石来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4031
    old "I'll admit I'm a bit fascinated by these myself."
    new "我得承认，我自己也有点被这些宝石迷住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4032
    old "Sai's voice sounded from behind us as he peeked over my shoulder."
    new "Sai 的声音从身后传来，他正越过我的肩膀探头看过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:4037
    old "I came here of my own volition, after all. We shouldn't spend so much time doing this in the next rooms, though. We have other priorities."
    new "毕竟，我是凭自己的意愿来这里的。不过接下来几个房间，我们不该再在这上面花太多时间，还有更要紧的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:4042
    old "Yes. Sorry, Isla, but once we're done, we'll have more than enough time to revisit every room."
    new "嗯。抱歉，Isla，不过等我们办完事，回来看遍每个房间的时间多得是。"

    # game/script.rpy:4047
    old "Hm. You'll still let me see them though, right?"
    new "唔。不过你之后还是会让我看它们的，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:4052
    old "Yeah. We'll briefly look over them."
    new "会。我们会简单看一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:4067
    old "We moved on to the next room, which looked almost identical."
    new "我们来到下一个房间，这里看上去几乎一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:4070
    old "The same procedure was repeated: Katei uncovered every cabinet, and Isla had a few seconds to appreciate all of their contents."
    new "同样的流程又重复了一遍：Katei 揭开所有展示柜，Isla 则有几秒钟时间欣赏柜中的每一颗宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:4076
    old "Undercurrent"
    new "暗流"

    # game/script.rpy:4078
    old "After we finished with it, Akaro spoke."
    new "我们看完这个房间后，Akaro 开口了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4079
    old "Do we really have to look at the inside of every cabinet? It's only slowing us down."
    new "我们非得把每个展示柜里面都看一遍吗？这只会拖慢我们的脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:4086
    old "Yes. It doesn't take up a lot of time, and remember what Suripo said. He mentioned some gems on this floor had been stolen. We need to find that room and see if there's something to find there."
    new "对。这花不了多少时间，而且别忘了 Suripo 说过的话。他提到这一层有宝石被盗。我们得找到那个房间，看看那里能不能发现什么线索。"

    # game/script.rpy:4091
    old "Oh, yes, that's true. He said it happened in one of the farther back rooms."
    new "哦，对，确实如此。他说过事情发生在靠后的某个房间里。"

    # game/script.rpy:4092
    old "You're right... I'd forgotten about that, but it still sounds very weird to me. What do these gems have to do with anything? It sounded like Ashiya have already assumed those gems were the target, which feels off considering nobody even knows how they were brought outside."
    new "你说得对……我都忘了这回事，不过我还是觉得很奇怪。那些宝石和整件事到底有什么关系？听上去芦屋已经认定宝石就是目标，可没人知道它们是怎么被带出去的，这一点实在说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:4097
    old "You mean to say they were probably a measure to distract, right?"
    new "你是说，那些宝石很可能只是用来分散注意力的幌子，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:4102
    old "I agree. If this supposed theft is over or already failed, it could be that some kind of trick was used to get the gems outside and make Ashiya think they were the goal. Once their guard is lowered, steal the actual target: the Sekimeiya."
    new "我同意。如果这场所谓的失窃已经结束，或者本来就失败了，那也许是有人用了某种手法，把宝石弄到外面，让芦屋以为宝石才是目标。等他们放松警惕，再偷走真正的目标——Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:4107
    old "Yeah, something like that, even though I can't really visualize how the plan would work."
    new "嗯，差不多是这样，只是我实在想不出这计划要怎么实施。"

    # game/script.rpy:4112
    old "Before you assume that, there's something else to consider in opposition."
    new "在你们下这个结论之前，还有一个相反的情况需要考虑。"

    # game/script.rpy:4117
    old "...What would that be?"
    new "……是什么情况？"

    # game/script.rpy:4118
    old "Well... the two side hallways and the event room were put out of commission with the smoke. If the gems were the goal, it could be assumed that the event room was, for some reason, only attacked because it's the only way to go from the middle of one hallway to the other."
    new "嗯……两条侧廊和活动室都被烟雾弄得无法通行。如果目标真是宝石，那就只能推测：他们对活动室下手，是因为要从一条走廊的中段走到另一条走廊，就只能从那里经过。"

    # game/script.rpy:4125
    old "However, that has a flaw. Even though the smoke certainly disabled the security cameras, the room those gems were stolen from wasn't ever subjected to the smoke, according to what Katei told us."
    new "可这个说法有个破绽。烟雾确实让监控摄像头失了效，但按 Katei 告诉我们的，那些宝石失窃的房间根本没有被烟雾波及过。"

    # game/script.rpy:4126
    old "That's weird, don't you think? It outright implies that the room's security camera was never a factor they took into consideration. So, if that were the case, why did they disable all the others?"
    new "很蹊跷，不是吗？这分明意味着，他们压根没把那个房间的监控摄像头放在心上。既然如此，他们又何必让其余所有摄像头失灵？"

    # game/script.rpy:4127
    old "What I mean to say is that the robbery of those gems could've been executed without needing to release smoke in the event room, and the substance to cover the lenses of the security cameras wouldn't have been needed."
    new "我的意思是，偷走那些宝石根本不需要在活动室放烟雾，也不需要用到遮住监控镜头的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:4136
    old "If being spotted by the security cameras in the room of the robbery wasn't an issue, it means the only other goal of the smoke was to provide a clear route to the outside. The event room and the opposite hallway wouldn't have been needed, and there would be no point in disabling the cameras. This immediately indicates that the gems were never the goal, which shatters any illusion with them."
    new "如果无须担心被失窃房间的监控拍到，那就意味着，烟雾剩下的唯一目的，就是清出一条通往外面的路。活动室和对面那条走廊都用不上，让摄像头失灵也毫无意义。这就直接说明，宝石从来不是目标，围绕宝石的假象也就不攻自破。"

    # game/script.rpy:4137
    old "Maybe you're right... If they were the goal, only one hallway and that very room would've been attacked."
    new "也许你说得对……如果那些宝石才是目标，被袭击的应该只有一条走廊和那个房间才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:4141
    old "And you also can't assume the smoke was released to make everyone nearby fall unconscious because not all the rooms where people could've been were attacked."
    new "而且也不能断定放烟就是为了让附近的人全部昏迷，因为并不是所有可能有人待着的房间都被波及了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4146
    old "And yet those gems were brought outside in a suitcase before the exit closed..."
    new "可那些宝石偏偏在出口封闭之前，被人用手提箱运到了外面……"

    # game/script.rpy:4151
    old "Yeah, only for that person to then be arrested immediately. I can't quite figure out what the whole deal is here, especially given the Sekimeiya is still with us."
    new "是啊，结果那人紧接着就被抓了。我实在想不明白这一连串到底是怎么回事，尤其是 Sekimeiya 现在还留在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:4152
    old "The people outside think the gems were the goal and that the robbery was a failure. However, part of that relies on them not knowing the exact rooms that were covered in the smoke.{w} I'm sure more people will conclude what I'm saying once they enter the tower. If the culprit intended to use those gems as a feint, this plan is lacking."
    new "外面的人认为宝石才是目标，抢劫已经失败。不过这种看法能成立，部分是因为他们并不知道烟雾究竟覆盖了哪些房间。{w} 我相信等更多人进入塔里，就会得出和我相同的结论。如果犯人本想用那些宝石作幌子，这个计划未免太不高明。"

    # game/script.rpy:4157
    old "There's no way it ends with someone sneaking the Sekimeiya out as soon as the exit opens, right? That would be beyond stupid. Not to mention that stealing the gems would be rendered useless since Ashiya would quickly notice that the Sekimeiya has been stolen too. Then, the gems would ultimately return to Ashiya, and the person who had them would be arrested."
    new "总不可能等出口一开，就有人把 Sekimeiya 偷偷带出去吧？那也太蠢了。更何况，偷走宝石也毫无意义——芦屋很快就会发现 Sekimeiya 也失窃了。到头来，宝石还是得回到芦屋手里，而拿着它的人只会被逮捕。"

    # game/script.rpy:4158
    old "I hadn't taken those gemstones into consideration for any of my thoughts, but he was right."
    new "我此前所有推想都没把那些宝石算进去，可他说得没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:4162
    old "Hey, Katei. I know you brought this up earlier, but are you sure that the exit was sealed immediately after the alarm went off?"
    new "我说，Katei。我知道你之前提过这事，但你确定警报一响，出口就立刻封死了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:4167
    old "Hm... While it is the first time the alarm has been activated, it's how it was programmed to work. Anything else would be pointless, really."
    new "嗯……虽然这是警报头一次启动，但程序本来就是这么设定的。否则根本没有意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:4168
    old "Could it have been another malfunction? I was just thinking that Naomi might have brought the gems out."
    new "会不会又是故障？我刚才在想，会不会是 Naomi 把宝石带出去的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4173
    old "Naomi? But that should be impossible, right?"
    new "Naomi？可那应该不可能吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:4174
    old "Not if that malfunction actually occurred. When Suripo mentioned the person who brought them outside, he only said it had been an \"individual\". It could've been a woman, but I think he would've said it when we mentioned Naomi was still with us."
    new "除非那个故障真的发生了。Suripo 提到把宝石带出去的人时，只说那是「某个人」。也可能是个女人；可如果是 Naomi，我们提到她还在这里时，他应该就会说了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4179
    old "If the alarm's effects were delayed, Suripo would've brought it up, or someone from the outside would've entered. But it is true that Naomi, who's disappeared and knows the entire layout of the tower, is a pretty good candidate to take out a bunch of gems and play this silly role of purposely getting arrested with a conspicuous suitcase."
    new "如果警报真的延迟生效，Suripo 应该会提起这事，外面的人也该会进来。不过话说回来，Naomi 确实很合适——她人不见了，又熟悉整座塔的布局，完全可能把一批宝石带出去，再提着显眼的手提箱演一出故意被捕的蠢戏。"

    # game/script.rpy:4182
    old "If that is what happened, targeting the event room too would make sense even if the goal was elsewhere. It was Naomi's location, and she would've needed a way to escape."
    new "如果真是这样，那么即便目标在别处，连活动室一起攻击也说得通。那是 Naomi 所在的地方，而她需要一条逃路。"

    # game/script.rpy:4187
    old "You're... right. I hadn't thought of this, but I'm not convinced.{w} Targeting both hallways still wouldn't make much sense, and most importantly, it implies her plan only worked because the alarm's effects got delayed; it would've been no so-called malfunction."
    new "你说得……也对。这一点我倒没想到，可还是说服不了我。{w} 而且同时袭击两条走廊仍然说不通，最重要的是，照这说法，她的计划能成全靠警报效果延迟——那可就谈不上什么「故障」了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4188
    old "Yeah... Also, we still don't know what actually triggered the alarm, and while I could be wrong, it really seemed to me like Naomi did fall unconscious in our room."
    new "嗯……而且我们至今还不知道警报到底是怎么触发的。虽说我可能看错了，但我真觉得 Naomi 当时确实在我们房间里昏过去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4193
    old "Hm...{w} Remember what Suripo said? If anyone was in front of the shutter as it closed, it would've stopped. It's possible it was delayed, which gave Naomi enough time to leave even though she was in the event room when the alarm played."
    new "嗯……{w}还记得 Suripo 说过的话吗？卷帘门下降时若有人挡在前面，就会停下来。也许它确实延迟了，于是即使警报响起时 Naomi 在活动室里，她也来得及离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:4198
    old "That's true, but Suripo would've told us as well."
    new "确实如此，可那样的话 Suripo 也会告诉我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:4199
    old "Wait, no. I don't think that could've happened."
    new "等等，不对。我觉得那不可能发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:4203
    old "Why not?"
    new "为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:4204
    old "When I heard the alarm, there was another sound too, much fainter. I just realized that must've been the shutter closing, because it was pretty rough and came from the lobby.{w} That means there was no delay, and there was a louder sound at the end when it hit the floor. I'm almost certain it went the whole time without stopping."
    new "听到警报的时候，我还听见了另一个声音，轻得多。我刚刚才意识到，那一定是卷帘门在关闭——那声音很粗重，而且是从大厅方向传来的。{w} 也就是说根本没有延迟；最后它落到地面时还发出一声更响的动静。我几乎可以确定，它中途一直没有停过。"

    # game/script.rpy:4205
    old "If that's true, it confirms Naomi's still here."
    new "如果真是这样，那就证实 Naomi 还在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:4207
    old "...Is this a key?"
    new "……这是钥匙吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:4217
    old "I saw Shiroya staring at the floor, confused as to where to direct her gaze."
    new "我看见 Shiroya 盯着地面，神情困惑，不知该把视线投向哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:4221
    old "...Oh, you're right. What's this doing here?"
    new "……啊，真的。这东西怎么会在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:4225
    old "When we went quiet, the two people who hadn't participated in the conversation spoke.{w} They were a bit ahead of us, so we walked up to them. After focusing on the point where they were staring, we saw what Isla had found. Next to the right wall was a small, rusty key."
    new "我们安静下来后，那两位一直没参与讨论的人开了口。{w} 他们走在我们前面一点，我们便走上前去。顺着他们注视的地方看去，我们看见了 Isla 发现的东西。右侧墙壁旁边，躺着一把小小的、生锈的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:4233
    old "Isla kneeled to pick it up. Once in her hands, she showed it to us."
    new "Isla 蹲下身把它捡起来，拿到手里给我们看。"

    # game/script.rpy:4234
    old "Was this on the floor?"
    new "这是掉在地上的？"

    # game/script.rpy:4235
    old "Yes... I just saw it."
    new "嗯……我刚看见的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4236
    old "There's no way we've missed it until now, right?"
    new "我们总不至于到现在都没发现吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:4237
    old "The color is close to the floor's, and the lighting is bad. I'd say we did since it took me a few seconds to see it."
    new "它和地板颜色接近，光线又暗。我看我们确实漏掉了，因为我自己也看了好几秒才看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:4238
    old "...Really? It was right next to the event room."
    new "……真的？就在活动室旁边啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:4239
    old "More importantly, what's it for? Do you recognize it, Katei?"
    new "更重要的是，它是开什么的？Katei，你认得吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:4240
    old "...No. I don't think I've ever seen this key before."
    new "……不认得。我应该从没见过这把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:4241
    old "Katei grabbed it to give it a closer look. It appeared very old and rusty; it wasn't the kind of key that would be used in a modern building."
    new "Katei 拿过钥匙凑近细看。它显得陈旧斑驳、锈迹很重，不像是现代建筑会用的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:4242
    old "It's impossible this belongs here. I know it's an old building and there are keys I don't possess, but it must be for something else.{w} Keys are not prohibited items in this tower. It's possible someone dropped it and didn't realize it."
    new "这东西不可能属于这里。我知道这栋楼年头久了，有些钥匙不在我手上，但这把肯定是开别的东西的。{w} 塔里并不禁止携带钥匙。也许是有人掉了却没发觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:4246
    old "How would you not notice it? If you drop it here, it would make a noise when it hit the floor."
    new "怎么会没发觉？掉在这种地方，砸到地上总会有声音吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:4247
    old "For sure. Which means that whoever dropped it knew they did and then didn't pick it back up."
    new "确实。也就是说，掉钥匙的人知道自己掉了，却没有回头捡。"

    # game/script.rpy:4255
    old "It would have been a bit ridiculous to think that it had been left purposely to indirectly pass it on to someone or something of the sort. Given what we knew had happened so far, what Sai said made a lot of sense."
    new "若认为它是被人故意留下，好间接交到某人手里，未免有些荒唐。而就我们目前所知的情况来看，Sai 的推断相当合理。"

    # game/script.rpy:4260
    old "You get what I mean, right? This key probably belonged to the culprit."
    new "你明白我的意思吧？这把钥匙多半是犯人的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:4261
    old "As they were running against a timer that would trap them, they dropped this key. Naturally, they didn't waste time stopping to retrieve it."
    new "他们当时正争分夺秒，想赶在被困住之前脱身，钥匙就是那时候掉的。他们自然不会浪费时间停下来去捡。"

    # game/script.rpy:4262
    old "It could be a pretty important key if it's one the culprit was holding as they were committing a crime."
    new "如果这是犯人在作案时随身带着的钥匙，那它很可能相当重要。"

    # game/script.rpy:4267
    old "I'll keep it safe and give it to the police as soon as I can."
    new "我会好好保管，尽快交给警方。"

    # game/script.rpy:4272
    old "That's a good idea."
    new "这主意不错。"

    # game/script.rpy:4276
    old "You might be jumping to conclusions again, though. It could belong to an innocent person who rushed to escape from the tower."
    new "不过你们也许又把结论下得太早了。它也可能属于某个慌忙逃出塔的无辜者。"

    # game/script.rpy:4281
    old "You think so? I'm not sure that's possible. I've gone over this."
    new "你这么想？我看不太可能。这一点我已经反复想过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4282
    old "Why would an innocent person ever rush to escape? One reason would be if they saw smoke appearing out of nowhere. However, they would've fallen unconscious if they ran through this hallway."
    new "无辜的人为什么要慌忙逃跑？一种可能是他们看见烟雾凭空冒了出来。可要是从这条走廊跑过去，他们早就昏倒了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4287
    old "The other reason would be if they heard an unknown alarm, but this can also be ruled out because the alarm blocked off the exit. Naturally, this key doesn't belong to any of us, right?"
    new "另一种可能是听到了莫名其妙的警报，但这也可以排除——警报一响，出口就封死了。再说，这把钥匙也不属于我们中的任何人，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:4292
    old "Nobody answered.{w} He was saying that no innocent person aware of danger could've escaped through the hallway."
    new "没有人回答。{w} 他的意思是，任何察觉到危险的无辜者都不可能从这条走廊逃出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:4293
    old "If the key didn't belong to the culprit, it had to belong to someone who'd also gotten trapped and we hadn't seen. Even Naomi didn't make sense as a candidate—I'd been with her up until the alarm had sounded.{w} If someone had fallen unconscious there, they could have dropped the key and failed to realize it upon waking up. Perhaps even the sound of it falling was obscured by the alarm, but I considered it unlikely."
    new "如果这把钥匙不是犯人的，那就只能是另一个同样被困住、我们却没见过的人留下的。就连 Naomi 也说不通——警报响之前，我一直和她在一起。{w} 要真有人在那儿昏了过去，钥匙可能会从他手里掉出来，而他自己醒来后也没发觉。说不定连钥匙落地的声音都被警报盖过去了，不过我觉得这种可能性不大。"

    # game/script.rpy:4296
    old "I doubt this was here before the attack. There was a janitor cleaning the floor in the lobby, so I'm sure these hallways were cleaned today too."
    new "这东西在袭击之前应该不在这儿。大厅里有清洁工在拖地，所以这几条走廊今天肯定也打扫过。"

    # game/script.rpy:4297
    old "...On the surface, that appeared to be a very solid argument, but there was a way around it, and it involved something I'd thought before."
    new "……表面上看，这套说法无懈可击，但还是有办法绕开它，而且这办法跟我之前想到的一件事有关。"

    # game/script.rpy:4298
    old "We didn't know for a fact the smoke in hallway A had been released at the same time as in the other two places. There was no reason to believe it hadn't been, but it also would've allowed one of Katei's claims be the truth.{w} One part of me wanted to directly ask Katei, but I held off."
    new "我们并不能确定 A走廊的烟雾和另外两处是同时放出来的。虽然没有理由认为不是，但要不是同时，Katei 的某个说法就有可能是真的。{w} 我有点想直接去问 Katei，但最后忍住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4299
    old "If someone had heard yells coming from the lobby or seen smoke coming through the door of the event room, they might've rushed out without stopping to retrieve their key...{w} I recalled that I'd heard only silence when we were about to fall unconscious."
    new "若是有人听见大厅传来的喊声，或是看见烟雾从活动室的门缝里涌出，也许就会慌忙跑出去，顾不上取回自己的钥匙……{w} 可我记得，就在我们即将失去意识的时候，听到的只有一片寂静。"

    # game/script.rpy:4300
    old "I saw Isla in front of the next door. Even though she'd found a key, she didn't seem very interested. Inspecting the contents of every cabinet was probably far more exciting for her."
    new "下一扇门前，我看见了 Isla。她虽然也找到了一把钥匙，却似乎并不怎么在意。对她来说，逐一查看每个展示柜里的东西恐怕要有趣得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:4305
    old "Let's continue for now. If this was important for the culprit, it's likely they'll try to get it back, so I'll make sure to keep it safe until we get out."
    new "先继续走吧。如果这东西对犯人来说很重要，对方多半会设法取回去，在出去之前，我会妥善保管。"

    # game/script.rpy:4319
    old "We accepted that and moved on.{w} The next room was no different from the previous. Katei went ahead and began to make sure nothing had been stolen from its cabinets."
    new "我们接受了这个安排，继续前进。{w} 下一个房间与之前那间并无不同。Katei 走在前面，开始逐一确认展示柜里没有东西失窃。"

    # game/script.rpy:4323
    old "Sai approached me while I was separated from the others. Anticipating his reason, I was first to speak."
    new "我与其他人分开的时候，Sai 走了过来。我料到他的来意，便先开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:4331
    old "Do you still doubt Katei? I think he did a good job of proving his sincerity."
    new "你还在怀疑 Katei 吗？我觉得他已经充分证明了自己的诚意。"

    # game/script.rpy:4332
    old "Oh, of course I do. I'll agree that he's pretty good at lying."
    new "哦，当然怀疑。我倒是承认，他撒谎的本事相当高明。"

    # game/script.rpy:4337
    old "You already realized he was never in the security room, right? Why are you defending him?"
    new "你早就发现他根本没在监控室里待过，对吧？为什么还要替他说话？"

    # game/script.rpy:4338
    old "...I looked at Katei. He was putting up with Isla and acting interested in the gems he'd presumably seen hundreds of times."
    new "……我看向 Katei。他正耐着性子应付 Isla，装出一副对宝石很感兴趣的样子——那些宝石他大概已经看过几百遍了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4339
    old "Are you certain he wasn't?"
    new "你确定他不在？"

    # game/script.rpy:4344
    old "He couldn't have been there after the alarm went off. I checked the time needed for the computer to go to sleep, and that confirmed it. The only other possibility is that he was there and lied about using the computer, but that doesn't make it any better."
    new "警报响过之后，他不可能在那里。我查过电脑进入休眠需要多久，这就足以确认了。剩下的唯一可能，就是他当时确实在监控室，却谎称自己用过电脑，可这也不会让情况变得更好。"

    # game/script.rpy:4347
    old "Have you considered that the computer time might not have been accurate?"
    new "你有没有想过，电脑上的时间也许并不准确？"

    # game/script.rpy:4352
    old "The computer time?"
    new "电脑上的时间？"

    # game/script.rpy:4353
    old "Yes. If it was wrong, Katei could've had the time to be there without lying."
    new "对。如果时间有误，Katei 就有时间待在那里，而不必撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:4354
    old "Yeah, and then lied about how much time he spent outside it."
    new "是啊，然后再谎报自己在外面待了多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:4355
    old "I know. Maybe you're right and there's no other explanation."
    new "我知道。也许你说得对，除此之外没有别的解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:4356
    old "I have considered the computer time being wrong, and not only that."
    new "电脑时间出错的可能，我早就想过，而且还不止这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:4357
    old "Sai raised his sleeve. Under it, there was a digital wristwatch."
    new "Sai 撩起袖子，腕上戴着一块电子手表。"

    # game/script.rpy:4358
    old "I always wear this. It doesn't seem like there are wall clocks anywhere, so the time displayed on the computer is the only source we have available."
    new "我一直戴着它。这里似乎哪儿都没有挂钟，所以电脑上显示的时间是我们唯一能参照的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4359
    old "Besides my wristwatch, that is. My time and the computer's are the same."
    new "当然，除了我这块表。我的时间和电脑上的时间是一致的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4360
    old "I see... So that can't be it either."
    new "原来如此……那么这条也说不通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4363
    old "Well, as I said, I didn't consider that the computer time was wrong, but rather that someone went way further than that."
    new "就像我说的，我考虑的根本不是电脑时间出错，而是有人做得远比那更绝。"

    # game/script.rpy:4364
    old "Oh... I-I see what you mean. Yeah, that should be the only way out Katei has."
    new "哦……我、我明白你的意思了。是啊，那应该是 Katei 唯一的出路了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4365
    old "Yeah. If someone messed with my wristwatch while I was unconscious, they could've made me falsely confirm the computer's time.{w} Someone could have done that to frame Katei.{w} It's too ridiculous to consider it seriously. They'd need to know that Katei would say everything he said only to turn around and disprove it with the computer's sleep mode, risking the possibility of nobody noticing it."
    new "对。如果有人趁我昏迷时动过我这块表，就能让我错误地替电脑时间作证。{w} 也可以借此栽赃 Katei。{w} 不过这种设想太过荒唐，不值得当真。对方必须事先料到 Katei 会说出那一整套话，然后再用电脑的休眠模式把它推翻——而且还得赌没人会察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:4366
    old "And not only that, but it's also something that only works with the people who got trapped. This wouldn't mean anything if we brought it up outside.{w} And Katei, who didn't fall unconscious, would've said the time was wrong. It would be insane for him to create a problem for himself by changing my watch time.{w} He also let us talk to Suripo, who could've mentioned the time at any moment."
    new "而且不止如此，这种做法只对被困在这里的人有效。要是我们到外面提起，根本说明不了什么。{w} 再说，Katei 并没有失去意识，大可以一口咬定时间不对。他若改了我的表，等于给自己找麻烦，实在说不通。{w} 他还让我们和 Suripo 交谈，而 Suripo 随时都可能提到时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:4369
    old "...But why would Katei lie about being in the security room? Do you actually think he's responsible?"
    new "……可 Katei 为什么要谎称自己去过监控室？你真的认为他就是幕后之人？"

    # game/script.rpy:4370
    old "Or heavily involved in some way. There's no way he's not hiding anything or looking to gain something."
    new "或者至少深度参与其中。他不可能什么都没隐瞒，也不可能什么都不图。"

    # game/script.rpy:4371
    old "So, you don't believe his story about how the Sekimeiya was found? You were accusing him of lying about that too."
    new "那么，你不信他说的 Sekimeiya 是怎么被发现的那套话？你刚才也在指责他在这件事上撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:4376
    old "Oh, no. I do believe everything that he said there. It just gave him even more of a motive."
    new "哦，不。那部分我全都相信。正因为如此，他的动机反而更充分了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4377
    old "...Hm?"
    new "……嗯？"

    # game/script.rpy:4378
    old "I still think the Sekimeiya has to be the core of all this. That has to be right.{w} Now, don't you find it strange that a simple security member would know all that?"
    new "我仍然认为，Sekimeiya 才是这一切的核心。这一点应该没错。{w} 那么，你不觉得奇怪吗？区区一个保安，竟然知道这么多。"

    # game/script.rpy:4379
    old "He said it in a desperate time because he wanted to earn our trust, which is why he relied on factual truth to lessen our suspicion."
    new "他是在那种走投无路的关头说出口的，为的是博取我们的信任，所以才会借着事实来减轻我们的怀疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:4380
    old "But what I think he did was change his own perspective. I'm telling you this in case you think I'm missing something, but I think all he did was merge his version with what Suripo told us to form an accurate story and pass it off as something Ashiya told him."
    new "但我认为，他只是换了个角度。我先把这话说在前头，免得你觉得我漏了什么。我认为，他做的只是把自己的说法和 Suripo 告诉我们的内容拼在一起，凑成一个准确的故事，然后说成是芦屋告诉他的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4383
    old "I don't follow."
    new "我没听懂。"

    # game/script.rpy:4388
    old "I'm saying he could be the the guy who originally found the Sekimeiya. He didn't know about what Suripo told us beforehand. Otherwise, he would've said it all to earn our trust.{w} Once he knew about Suripo's factual story, he combined his own knowledge with it to make us believe he truly works in the tower."
    new "我是说，他很可能就是最初发现 Sekimeiya 的那个人。他事先并不知道 Suripo 告诉我们的那些事。否则，他早就全盘说出来博取信任了。{w} 等他听说了 Suripo 那套有据可查的说法之后，便把自己的见闻和它拼在一起，好让我们相信他真的在塔里工作。"

    # game/script.rpy:4389
    old "The way he detailed some things was very questionable. He knew the exact location where the Sekimeiya was found, and everything he told us was information the person who found it would've known after hearing Suripo's story."
    new "他描述某些细节的方式很可疑。他知道 Sekimeiya 被发现的准确位置，而他告诉我们的每一件事，都是一个发现者在听过 Suripo 的说法之后就能掌握的信息。"

    # game/script.rpy:4390
    old "...That might be true, but it sounds like a pretty big assumption, and didn't he say the seller was already paid?"
    new "……也许吧，但这听起来是个很大的假设。再说，他不是说卖家已经拿到钱了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:4395
    old "I'll tell you one of the theories I formed. It's all speculation, yes, but I think it could make sense given whoever's behind this already went pretty far with all the smoke."
    new "我跟你说说我想到的一个推测。没错，这全是猜想，但考虑到幕后之人连那些烟雾都用上了，手段已经相当出格，我觉得这个推测还算说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:4396
    old "I haven't told you this since it might not mean anything. You and I both showed up early and were at the front of the line for a while, in front of the hallway B door."
    new "这件事我一直没说，因为可能毫无意义。你和我都到得很早，在 B走廊的门口排了好一阵子，位置相当靠前。"

    # game/script.rpy:4397
    old "Right. We didn't have a way to check the time, but we were definitely there for a few hours."
    new "没错。我们当时没法确认时间，但确实在那里等了几个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:4400
    old "All right. So at approximately {time=8}, I saw Katei in the lobby. The reason why I started questioning him so quickly was because when I first saw him, he was wearing normal clothes."
    new "好。大约在 {time=8}，我在大厅里看见了 Katei。我之所以那么快就开始质问他，是因为我第一次看见他的时候，他穿的是便服。"

    # game/script.rpy:4401
    old "Of course, back then, I didn't think anything of it. I don't know what he did either. I just saw him for a few seconds, and I'm certain he was never actually in line."
    new "当然，那时我并没多想，也不知道他做了什么。我只看见他几秒，而且可以肯定，他从来没真正排过队。"

    # game/script.rpy:4402
    old "Considering everything, I think this is one of the ways everything could've played out. Take whatever you want from it."
    new "综合这些来看，整件事可能是这么发生的。至于你能从中得出什么，随你。"

    # game/script.rpy:4403
    old "The person claiming to be called Katei found the Sekimeiya a couple weeks ago. He contacted the Ashiya family, and given their interest, they bought it from him."
    new "那个自称 Katei 的人，在两三周前发现了 Sekimeiya。他联系了芦屋家，对方很感兴趣，就从他手里买下了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4404
    old "At no point did he expect they'd set up so much advertisement for his own find. It's possible Ashiya said things that were wrong only to draw people in, and perhaps not being credited with the discovery bothered him."
    new "他万万没想到，他们会为他发现的这东西大张旗鼓地宣传。芦屋说不定故意说了些不实之词来招揽人群；而发现者的名分没落到自己头上，或许也让他心里不快。"

    # game/script.rpy:4407
    old "It's a pretty plain motive, but think about it. If you sold it to them and they started playing up its value like crazy, would you be happy about how little you were paid? The scale of this attack is a bit much for one normal person to come up with, but things line up here."
    new "这动机很普通，但你想想：如果你把它卖给了他们，他们却开始拼命抬高它的价值，你会甘心自己只拿到那么点钱吗？这样一场袭击，单凭一个普通人很难策划出来，但在这件事上，线索都对得上。"

    # game/script.rpy:4408
    old "Xyn isn't behind this, which is why it's happening during the day. He enters the tower at {time=8:00} this morning. He could have somehow met with the real Katei Kuiji and learned about the alarm and emergency contact line from him."
    new "这事背后不是 Xyn——也正因如此，它才会发生在白天。他今天早上 {time=8:00} 进入塔内，有可能设法见到了真正的 Katei Kuiji，并从对方口中问出了警报和紧急联络线路的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:4409
    old "The way he learned that information isn't important. At the very least, I know the man with us right now wasn't in the lobby shortly after I saw him. What matters is that they met and he put on Katei's clothes. Then, he proceeded to hide Katei somewhere without cameras."
    new "他是怎么问出来的并不重要。至少我知道，此刻跟我们待在一起的那个男人，在我看见他之后不久，已经不在大厅里了。要紧的是他们见了面，他换上了 Katei 的衣服，随后把 Katei 藏到了没有监控的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:4412
    old "He could have done this any number of ways, but Katei was charged with keeping track of the security cameras, so obviously nobody would notice his body being hidden if he was the one who was supposed to watch everything."
    new "他动手的方式可以有很多种。但负责看监控的偏偏是 Katei——既然本该盯着所有画面的人就是他自己，自然谁也不会察觉他被藏了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:4413
    old "Along with the clothes, he also took the security room key. Then, he released the smoke in the two hallways and event room through some method I'm unaware of. It's likely he knew he'd get trapped by doing so."
    new "除了衣服，他还拿走了监控室的钥匙。接着，他用某种我不知道的手段，让两条走廊和活动室都弥漫起烟雾。他多半清楚，这么做会把自己也困在里头。"

    # game/script.rpy:4414
    old "He acted as if he'd found us and played the role of a security member to justify his presence in the tower."
    new "他装作偶然发现了我们，又扮演起保安的角色，好让自己待在塔里显得名正言顺。"

    # game/script.rpy:4419
    old "Naomi... It's possible he hid her body while she was unconscious. He'd have a good reason for it, because Naomi would've revealed that he doesn't work in the tower."
    new "Naomi……他有可能趁她昏迷时把她藏了起来。他这么做理由充分——Naomi 一旦开口，就会戳穿他根本不在塔里工作。"

    # game/script.rpy:4420
    old "By saying everything is confidential, he's managed to avoid explaining anything he doesn't know. He lied about spending any time in the security room since he'd been carrying out this plan of his. That's why he knew things only a person inside the room with all the monitors would've known without actually being there."
    new "他一句「一切保密」，就避开了所有自己答不上来的事。他谎称在监控室待过，因为他一直在执行自己的计划。所以他明明从未进去过，却知道些只有守着满墙监视器的人才说得出的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:4425
    old "Suripo clearly told us that security staff would stay in the room and relay information through the installed microphone. But Katei told us that he left it because he didn't know about that before talking to Suripo. He said he used the microphone while we were unconscious, but I'm sure he was lying."
    new "Suripo 明确告诉过我们，保安应当留在房间里，通过装好的麦克风传递消息。可 Katei 说，他在和 Suripo 谈过之前并不知道这回事，所以才离开了监控室。他还说在我们昏迷时用过那支麦克风——我敢肯定他在撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:4426
    old "I don't know why he let us talk to the outside, but it's possible he had something to gain from that. Maybe he wanted everyone outside to think that Katei Kuiji really is in the tower and that everything here is going well.{w} Maybe he wanted to make sure the bait gemstones worked and tricked Ashiya. This is so messy that it almost feels unrelated to what he did, but that can't be it."
    new "我不知道他为什么让我们和外界通话，但也许他能从中得到什么好处。也许他想让外面的人都相信 Katei Kuiji 确实在塔里，这里一切顺利。{w} 也许他想确认那些诱饵宝石起了作用，骗过了芦屋。整件事太乱了，简直像跟他做的事无关，但不可能只是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:4427
    old "Anyway, it all comes down to this: he had no way to get the Sekimeiya out without spending twelve hours here, so he's intentionally spending twelve hours here."
    new "总之，一切归结起来就是：他若不在这里耗满十二个小时，就没法把 Sekimeiya 带出去，所以他是有意在这里待满十二个小时的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4428
    old "I don't know how this plan ends. I have no idea how he intends to get the Sekimeiya out once the exit opens, but consider the following. If he manages to do it, nobody will miss him—none of us will know who he actually was. I'm only speculating that he originally found the Sekimeiya to give an easy explanation for all the knowledge he's had since the start."
    new "我不知道这个计划最终会怎样收场，也想不出出口一开，他打算怎么把 Sekimeiya 带出去。但请想一想：如果他真做成了，没有人会惦记他——我们谁都不会知道他到底是谁。我只能推测，他最初发现 Sekimeiya，不过是为了给自己从一开始就掌握的那些知识找个现成的解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:4431
    old "Once he makes it out, only the Sekimeiya will be missing. Katei Kuiji will still be here, since he's where that guy talking to Isla right now hid him. This ghost of a person will have escaped with the real target."
    new "等他一出去，失踪的只会是 Sekimeiya。Katei Kuiji 仍会留在这里——那个正和 Isla 说话的家伙，就把他藏在了这里。这个连身份都不存在的幽灵，将带着真正的目标扬长而去。"

    # game/script.rpy:4437
    old "...After saying it all out loud, I know it sounds pretty absurd, but whatever this plan is, it has to be far from over. There are a lot of things that don't make sense, and somehow, the Sekimeiya is still in its cabinet as if nothing happened."
    new "……全部说出来之后，我自己也知道听起来相当荒唐。但不管这个计划是什么，它都远没有结束。说不通的地方太多了，而 Sekimeiya 竟然还好端端地待在展示柜里，像什么都没发生过一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:4442
    old "Also, one last thing.{w} We only think that what we saw is the Sekimeiya because Katei told us so. The plan could already be further along. The real Sekimeiya could've been replaced while we were asleep.{w} That could be another reason why Naomi's presence had to be taken care of, as she would expose that illusion."
    new "另外，还有最后一件事。{w} 我们之所以认定看到的就是 Sekimeiya，全是因为 Katei 这么说。计划也许早就推进得更远了——真正的 Sekimeiya 可能在我们睡着时就被换掉了。{w} 这也许也是必须处理掉 Naomi 的另一个原因，因为她会戳穿这个假象。"

    # game/script.rpy:4444
    old "...I'm done. What do you think? Do you agree with anything?"
    new "……我说完了。你怎么看？有哪一点你同意吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:4446
    old "I was looking at the floor, and I'd been listening to everything expressionlessly. Katei remained engaged with Isla while her mother looked on from behind. Akaro and Shiroya were leaning against the wall, waiting to move on. Before I responded, we all walked to the next room, A4."
    new "我一直低着头盯着地面，面无表情地听完了这一切。Katei 仍在和 Isla 周旋，她母亲在后面看着。Akaro 和 Shiroya 靠着墙，等着继续往前走。我还没开口，大家已经一起走向了下一个房间——A4。"

    # game/script.rpy:4456
    old "I waited for Katei and Isla to begin uncovering the cabinets before resuming the conversation with Sai."
    new "等到 Katei 和 Isla 开始掀开展示柜的遮布，我才接着和 Sai 说下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:4465
    old "*sigh* I don't think I can directly object to anything you said..."
    new "唉……你说的这些，我好像哪一条都没法直接反驳。"

    # game/script.rpy:4466
    old "Admittedly, I did think Sai's theory was a leap. It didn't have to be wrong, and I had come to a similar idea myself, but some of his assumptions were a bit of a reach. Despite Sai's fervor, I cared about what was going on as well."
    new "我承认，Sai 的推理确实有些跳跃。它未必就是错的——我自己也想到过类似的思路——但他有些假设实在牵强。尽管 Sai 说得激动，我也一样在意眼前的局面。"

    # game/script.rpy:4467
    old "There was no way it had been an accident. Many things indicated that nothing had happened coincidentally: the particular day, the smoke locations, the alarm, the recurring Xyn events, Naomi..."
    new "这绝不可能是意外。太多迹象都表明，没有一件事是巧合：特意选定的这一天、烟雾出现的位置、警报、反复出现的 Xyn 事件、Naomi……"

    # game/script.rpy:4468
    old "Before anything else, there are two options to choose from. The plan failed, probably because of the new alarm, or the plan hasn't ended yet."
    new "首先，摆在我们面前的只有两种可能：计划失败了——多半是因为那套新警报；或者，计划还没有结束。"

    # game/script.rpy:4469
    old "If whatever this plan is hasn't ended, it's almost certain that a culprit must be here with us.{w} Who would that be, and what do they intend to do next?"
    new "如果这个计划尚未结束，那几乎可以肯定，犯人就在我们之中。{w} 会是谁？接下来又想做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:4474
    old "There weren't that many possibilities."
    new "可能性并不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:4475
    old "Everything has pointed to Katei, and there are multiple ways to construct it. If he's really a security member, he probably would've had an easy time setting this up. If he's not, Sai's theory is valid too. He's definitely the most suspicious person here."
    new "所有线索都指向 Katei，而且能拼出好几种解释。如果他真是保安，布置这一切大概轻而易举；如果他不是，Sai 的推理也同样成立。他无疑是这里最可疑的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:4476
    old "Unless I choose to doubt Sai, it's almost a guarantee that Katei lied about being in the security room during the attack. There could be many reasons behind the lie, though. If Katei is actually innocent, a similar plan could be adapted around anyone who got trapped."
    new "除非我连 Sai 也一并怀疑，否则几乎可以肯定，Katei 说袭击时自己待在监控室里是谎话。不过，他说谎的理由可以有很多。若 Katei 真是清白的，那么同样的计划，也可以套用在任何被困在这里的人身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:4477
    old "Of course, I can rule myself and Shiroya out. We've come here innocently and never expected anything like this to happen. Shiroya and I have spent our entire lives together, and I know she'd never think of doing such a thing, not even with her being less than fond of Ashiya."
    new "当然，我和 Shiroya 可以排除。我们来这里问心无愧，从没料到会发生这种事。Shiroya 和我从小到大都在一起，我知道她绝不会动这种念头——哪怕她对芦屋没什么好感。"

    # game/script.rpy:4480
    old "I myself don't suffer from memory loss or split personalities, nor do I have a particular interest in ruining my life after failing a robbery attempt."
    new "至于我自己，既没有失忆，也没有多重人格，更不至于在抢劫未遂之后，还一心想把人生彻底毁掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:4486
    old "Akaro was the last person in our group. Out of us seven, I feel he's the easiest person to suspect after Katei. He claimed not to care much about today's event but was here from the very beginning. Earlier, his behavior was clearly off, but it's gotten better since we woke up."
    new "我们这群人里，最后一个是 Akaro。七个人当中，我觉得除 Katei 之外就数他最值得怀疑。他嘴上说对今天的活动没什么兴趣，却从最开始就待在这里。先前他的举动明显不对劲，不过我们醒来之后，他倒是正常多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4487
    old "It could be that he's letting the time pass so that his plan can conclude. But since he stands out from the rest of us, he's an easy target to blame for a plan Sai and I have concocted."
    new "也许他是在拖时间，好让自己的计划走向终点。可他本就跟我们格格不入，也难怪会被我和 Sai 拿来当作这套推论的靶子。"

    # game/script.rpy:4494
    old "The same could be said for Erina and Isla, even though it sounds less likely. It's too naïve to rule them out because of Isla's age. A well-constructed plan could take advantage of that to lower our guard."
    new "Erina 和 Isla 也一样，尽管听起来可能性小些。因为 Isla 年纪小就把她排除在外，未免太天真了——一个周全的计划，完全可以利用这一点让我们放松警惕。"

    # game/script.rpy:4497
    old "Out of the six of us that were waiting for the event, only they have their early arrival justified... Isla's the only one who seemed to care about the event, but I can only truly rule out Shiroya and myself."
    new "在我们六个等待活动开始的人里，只有她们的早到有正当理由……真正在意这场活动的只有 Isla，而我能完全排除的，也只有 Shiroya 和我自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:4504
    old "And Sai... I don't believe he's the culprit, but if he's even crazier than he seems, he could've designed the whole thing and then messed with me for entertainment, maybe even to prevent my suspicion and interference. He could be trying to manipulate me into thinking whatever is convenient for him."
    new "还有 Sai……我不认为他是犯人，可万一他比表面看上去还要疯狂，那整件事就可能是他一手设计，再拿我来消遣——甚至是为了让我不起疑、不来碍事。他也许正引导我往对他有利的方向去想。"

    # game/script.rpy:4505
    old "I don't think that's likely, though. Similarly, he might've determined I'm not a likely suspect."
    new "不过我觉得这不太可能。同样地，他或许也已经断定，我不像是会做出这种事的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:4509
    old "There are two more options: Naomi, and an unknown person."
    new "还剩两种可能：Naomi，以及一个身份不明的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:4514
    old "If Naomi wants to wait until the exit opens to execute the last part of her plan, then hiding from us is probably a good idea. She's been hidden from the very beginning and will spend all the remaining time without being spotted, able to move by herself whenever she needs to. There's gotta be a good hiding spot somewhere in this huge building."
    new "如果 Naomi 打算等到出口打开时再执行计划的最后一步，那么躲着我们大概就是上策。她从最开始就藏了起来，接下来的时间也只要一直不被发现，随时都能自行行动。这么一栋大楼里，总该有处藏身的好地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:4515
    old "Using Naomi as the culprit helps explain the alarm triggering. Suripo said that the only way to activate it was by breaking open the Sekimeiya cabinet, and when I heard the alarm, Naomi was the one next to it."
    new "如果把 Naomi 当作犯人，警报为何会响也就说得通了。Suripo 说过，唯一能触发警报的方式就是强行撬开 Sekimeiya 的展示柜，而我听到警报时，守在柜子旁边的正是 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:4516
    old "If she silently \"broke\" it in a way she knew would work and then faked being unconscious, she could've covertly trapped us. Then, when we looked at the cabinet, we failed to recognize what had triggered the mechanism."
    new "如果她不声不响地用自己确信可行的方式「破坏」了柜子，然后假装昏迷，就能神不知鬼不觉地把我们困住。而后我们去看展示柜时，也没能看出究竟是什么触发了机关。"

    # game/script.rpy:4519
    old "Why would she do that? Could she have wanted to make it look like it was a malfunction, so anything else could be a malfunction too? The fact that the alarm went off right after Naomi unlocked the cabinet with her key also leads me to think that the source of the alarm had to be something else."
    new "她为什么要那样做？难道是想让一切看起来像是设备故障，好让别的异常也能一并归到故障上？而且，警报恰好是在 Naomi 用钥匙打开展示柜之后响起的，这也让我觉得触发警报的必定另有其物。"

    # game/script.rpy:4520
    old "However, this also could have been done purposely to make the three of us confirm that by the time the alarm was set off, there was no reason to force the cabinet open. After all, there's no way Naomi could've known I'd stay conscious for enough time to hear the alarm."
    new "不过，这也可能是刻意安排的，好让我们三个人认定：警报响起时，根本没有必要去强行打开展示柜。毕竟，Naomi 不可能知道我还能保持清醒，撑到听见警报。"

    # game/script.rpy:4521
    old "But if Naomi is innocent, is there more than one option behind her disappearance? Unless she woke up ahead of time and saw the culprit, the only person with a clear motive would've been Katei. She could still be trapped and walking around, but I'm not sure why she wouldn't have shown herself already if she has nothing to do with the attack..."
    new "可如果 Naomi 是清白的，她失踪的原因就不止一种了。除非她提前醒来，看见了犯人，否则唯一动机明确的人就是 Katei。她也可能只是被困住，还在某处走动——但如果她与这场袭击毫无关系，我想不出她为什么至今不肯露面……"

    # game/script.rpy:4524
    old "Is it actually possible Naomi is currently outside the tower? This would mean that the alarm had a delayed effect and Naomi's not innocent at all. I'm pretty sure what I heard in the event room was the shutter, but I can't be totally certain."
    new "Naomi 真的有可能此刻已经在塔外吗？若真是这样，就说明警报有延迟，而 Naomi 也绝非清白。我相当确定自己在活动室听到的是卷帘门的声音，但没法完全肯定。"

    # game/script.rpy:4525
    old "The only way she could be outside is if Naomi is a culprit. Otherwise, Suripo surely would've said that she was outside when we brought up her name. The only way this wouldn't have happened is if Naomi was the \"individual\" with the suitcase whose identity was kept a secret."
    new "她若在塔外，唯一的可能就是 Naomi 本人就是犯人。否则，我们提到她的名字时，Suripo 一定会说她就在外面。而他没有这么说的唯一解释，就是 Naomi 正是那个被隐去身份、带着手提箱的「某人」。"

    # game/script.rpy:4528
    old "The \"unknown person\" option is basically the same, but better. After all, with Naomi, we'd know the identity of the culprit by the end. If an unknown person has stayed with us and somehow plans to sneak out with the Sekimeiya when the time comes, we'll have no way to know who they were."
    new "「身份不明的人」这一种本质上相同，却更站得住脚。毕竟若犯人是 Naomi，到最后我们至少还知道她是谁；可要是一个身份不明的人一直混在我们当中，还打算到时候带着 Sekimeiya 悄悄溜走，我们就根本无从知道他是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:4529
    old "The lobby doesn't have security cameras. When everyone evacuated, someone hid behind the reception desk or entered the staircase to the mechanical room. Once the smoke faded, they hid in a better place, maybe after moving Naomi's body. Maybe they were in one of the rooms in a hallway, and that's why they made sure we couldn't look at the recorded footage."
    new "大厅里没有监控摄像头。所有人撤离时，某个人躲到了接待台后面，或者进了通往机械室的楼梯间。等烟雾散去，对方又藏到了更稳妥的地方——也许是在搬动 Naomi 的身体之后。对方也许一直待在走廊旁的某个房间里——正因如此，对方才确保我们看不到监控录像。"

    # game/script.rpy:4533
    old "Once this is all listed out, there are a few extra options, like two people working together. If Naomi and Katei were in cahoots, one would cover what doesn't make sense if the other person is working alone."
    new "这样一一列下来，还有几种额外的可能，比如两人合谋。若 Naomi 和 Katei 是一伙的，那么单独一人行动时说不通的地方，另一个人正好能补上。"

    # game/script.rpy:4534
    old "The two staff members could have easily designed an internal attack thanks to the knowledge they possess. Katei made us think the Sekimeiya we saw was the real deal. Now, Naomi can do as she pleases since she'll be constantly covered by Katei, who will guide all of us as the most knowledgeable person here.{w} ...Perhaps that's unlikely since he had no problem staying behind in the security room while we went to investigate."
    new "这两名员工凭着自己掌握的内情，要策划一场内部袭击并不难。Katei 让我们相信眼前的就是真正的 Sekimeiya；而 Naomi 则可以随心所欲，因为 Katei 会一直替她遮掩——作为这里最了解情况的人，他还在为我们所有人带路。{w} ……不过这也许不太可能，毕竟我们出去调查时，他留在监控室里毫无顾虑。"

    # game/script.rpy:4541
    old "Surprisingly, the conclusion I drew was that if the plan was still being carried out, Sai's theory was close to what I believed to be likely."
    new "出乎意料，我的结论是：如果计划还在继续，那么 Sai 的推理已经很接近我认为最有可能的情形。"

    # game/script.rpy:4542
    old "We had to know what triggered the alarm. It would clear up multiple doubts and remove possibilities such as the person responsible already escaping."
    new "我们必须弄清是什么触发了警报。这能解开好几处疑点，也能排除诸如犯人早已逃出去之类的可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:4543
    old "Maybe what you said is the most likely possibility. A lot of things point to Katei being suspicious, and he knew about the alarm from the start. That could mean that he's the most likely person to be carrying out a plan that involves waiting for the alarm's timer."
    new "也许你说的就是最有可能的情况。很多地方都让人觉得 Katei 可疑，而且他从一开始就知道警报的事。照这么说，最有可能实施这个「等警报计时」计划的人就是他。"

    # game/script.rpy:4548
    old "...Yes, I agree.{w} Either him or Naomi, but with the scenario I constructed, Naomi's already taken care of. Most things are, actually. I don't know how the smoke was released, what triggered the alarm, and how Katei plans to disappear with the Sekimeiya. It's also good to note that regardless of the method, a member of security staff like him could easily design a way to release the smoke."
    new "……嗯，我同意。{w}不是他就是 Naomi，不过按我构建的情形来看，Naomi 那边已经处理妥当了。其实大部分环节都有着落了。烟雾是怎么放出来的、警报是什么触发的、Katei 又打算怎么带着 Sekimeiya 消失，这些我还不知道。另外还有一点值得记下：不管用什么方法，像他这样的安保人员都很容易设计出释放烟雾的手段。"

    # game/script.rpy:4553
    old "It'd be wise to keep track of him at all times. He stayed alone earlier, and in the security room of all places. I'm very curious to know how he intends to make this plan work. He'll probably make sure that we don't come across Naomi or the body of the real Katei, if I'm also right about that."
    new "最好一直盯着他。他刚才单独待过一阵，而且偏偏是在监控室。我很想知道他打算怎么让这个计划成立。如果我另一项推断也没错，他多半会设法不让我们碰上 Naomi，也不让我们看到真正 Katei 的尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:4556
    old "You seem pretty excited."
    new "你看起来相当兴奋。"

    # game/script.rpy:4561
    old "A bit. Aren't you?{w} Aren't you looking forward to knowing which theory ends up being the correct one? Or maybe to find out that we were both incorrect. What if this is all bigger than we think, or just a coincidental accident?"
    new "有一点。你不兴奋吗？{w}你就不想知道最后哪一种推理才是对的？又或者，发现我们两个都猜错了。万一这件事比我们想的要大得多，或者只是一场偶然的事故呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:4562
    old "I want to make a lot of theories and then have the best one turn out to be right. That would be great."
    new "我想先提出一大堆推理，最后让最漂亮的那个被证明是对的。那就太棒了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4567
    old "For example, think about this. Everything we've thought about has been in part based on the call with Suripo. However, our main assumption right now is that Katei is responsible for all this."
    new "比如说，你想想这个。我们所有的思考，多少都建立在和 Suripo 的那通通话上。可我们眼下最主要的假设，是这一切都是 Katei 干的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4568
    old "You brought up a good point earlier when you asked why Katei said we could communicate with the outside. You're right. If he's a security member while also being the culprit, he'd look incredibly bad to the police if he never told us about it."
    new "你刚才那个问题问得很好——Katei 为什么说我们能和外界联系。你说得对。如果他既是安保人员，又是始作俑者，却始终不告诉我们这件事，在警方眼里他就太可疑了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4569
    old "But if I'm right and he doesn't work here, it wasn't very smart of him to bring it up voluntarily."
    new "可如果我猜得没错，他根本不在这里工作，那他主动提起这件事就实在算不上聪明。"

    # game/script.rpy:4572
    old "You're saying that Suripo was an accomplice, and they planned what to tell us?"
    new "你是说 Suripo 是同伙，那些话是他们事先商量好的？"

    # game/script.rpy:4577
    old "Exactly. ...He spoke very highly of Xyn.{w} What if he was speaking very highly of himself? The group he works for, alongside Katei?"
    new "正是。……他把 Xyn 夸得很高。{w}可要是他夸的其实是他自己呢？夸的是他和 Katei 同属的那个组织？"

    # game/script.rpy:4578
    old "He had a police uniform and was in a car next to the tower, ignored by everyone around it. If it was a real video feed, he's an actual policeman. Wouldn't things make sense if Xyn was involved with the police?"
    new "他穿着警服，坐在塔旁的车里，周围的人却对他视而不见。如果那是真实的视频画面，他就是货真价实的警察。要是 Xyn 和警方有牵连，一切不就说得通了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:4579
    old "That program hidden deep within the computer's folders could've been another factor of this plan designed by Xyn. They knew Ashiya were working on a mechanism to defeat them, so they created this plan to keep their superiority. Assuming part of what he told us was the truth."
    new "藏在电脑文件夹深处的那段程序，也许就是 Xyn 设计的这个计划里的另一环。他们知道芦屋正在研制对付他们的手段，于是布下这个计划来保住优势。前提是他告诉我们的话里有一部分是真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4580
    old "As soon as he began to explain things, my suspicions about Katei immediately lessened. After all, what that policeman was saying matched up well with the information Katei gave us. Now, if they were working together, made-up details would appear like the absolute truth, and they'd make all of Katei's subsequent claims sound authentic."
    new "他一开口解释，我对 Katei 的怀疑立刻就淡了。毕竟那个警察说的和 Katei 给我们的信息对得上。可要是他们本就是一伙的，编造的细节也会显得千真万确，还能让 Katei 之后说的每一句话都显得可信。"

    # game/script.rpy:4581
    old "Suripo mainly spoke to Katei. If they were following a script, they could pretty easily deceive us. Suripo is the only reliable source we think we have."
    new "Suripo 主要是在跟 Katei 说话。如果他们是照着剧本演的，骗过我们并不难。而 Suripo 是我们自认为唯一可靠的消息来源。"

    # game/script.rpy:4584
    old "And after he was done, the power conveniently went out. Not only that, but Katei was unable to contact him again. How believable is that, really? Did the Ashiya family really revoke his authority, knowing they'd leave us incommunicado for twelve hours?"
    new "而且他说完话，电就恰好断了。不止如此，Katei 也再也联系不上他。这种事真有那么可信吗？芦屋家真的会在明知会让我们失联十二小时的情况下，撤掉他的权限？"

    # game/script.rpy:4589
    old "Wouldn't it be exciting if we were in the middle of such a plan? Would you stop Xyn if you saw through everything?"
    new "如果我们正身处这样一个计划之中，难道不让人兴奋吗？要是你看穿了一切，你会去阻止 Xyn 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:4590
    old "...I'm not excited about being caught up in this, I can say that much. But if I get the chance to take these guys down, I absolutely would. I won't let them get away with this... this shit."
    new "……被卷进这种事里，我可兴奋不起来，这点我可以肯定。但要是有机会把这些人扳倒，我绝对不会放过。我不会让他们干了这种事……这种混账事还逍遥法外。"

    # game/script.rpy:4595
    old "I see.{w} Me, I'm just curious. I can't wait to know how this plan ends. Sadly, there's still a while until that. Maybe they need these twelve hours for something... Suripo corroborated the amount of time Katei said, so it would be strange if it turned out to be wrong."
    new "原来如此。{w}我嘛，只是好奇而已。我迫不及待想知道这个计划会怎么收场。可惜离那还有好一阵子。也许这十二小时他们另有用途……Suripo 也证实了 Katei 说的时间，要是这个数目出了错，反倒奇怪了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4596
    old "We'll have to see what happens."
    new "只能看接下来的发展了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4597
    old "I suppose so, but if this is an ongoing plan, they won't make it obvious. If they're trying to trick the Ashiya family, we might get tricked too. I'm just not going to get fooled so easily."
    new "话是这么说，可如果这个计划还在继续，他们不会做得那么明显。他们要是想骗芦屋家，我们说不定也会被骗。只不过我没那么容易被糊弄。"

    # game/script.rpy:4598
    old "Hm."
    new "嗯。"

    # game/script.rpy:4604
    old "I didn't feel like saying anything else. A part of me thought that everything Sai was saying entailed pointless danger. I related to the interest, but not so much to his approach."
    new "我不太想再说什么。心里有一半觉得，Sai 说的那些都带着毫无必要的危险。那份兴趣我能理解，他的做法我却不敢苟同。"

    # game/script.rpy:4605
    old "In our situation, there was no reason for us to be in danger. It was something between Ashiya and Xyn, and we'd just been caught up in the middle of it. Letting everything happen without giving our own input to strangers seemed like the smarter course of action."
    new "以我们的处境，根本没有理由让自己陷入危险。这是芦屋和 Xyn 之间的事，我们只是被卷了进来。顺其自然，不向陌生人说出自己的看法，似乎是更明智的做法。"

    # game/script.rpy:4606
    old "However, trying to piece things together on the side probably wouldn't do any harm."
    new "不过，在一旁自己试着拼凑真相，大概也无伤大雅。"

    # game/script.rpy:4609
    old "Although I hadn't reacted, what Sai said was intriguing. I'd let Suripo influence my thoughts with no opposition, but it was true that Katei had been the one who'd let us hear him."
    new "我虽然没有表露出来，Sai 的话却勾起了我的兴趣。我毫无抵触地任由 Suripo 影响了我的想法，可让我们听到他说话的，确实是 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:4610
    old "The first thing he'd said was that Ashiya instructed the police to talk to us, but he'd never proven that at all. It hadn't sounded all that strange, but instead of telling the police what to let us know, Ashiya could've said everything directly."
    new "他开口第一句就说，是芦屋让警方来跟我们通话的，可这一点他从未证实过。这话听着倒也不算太奇怪，但芦屋与其让警方转告我们，本可以直接把一切告诉我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:4611
    old "Suripo also said that Ashiya told them about the communication method. Initially, the other side should've been picked up by Ashiya, who'd supposedly passed it off to the police..."
    new "Suripo 还说，通信方式也是芦屋告诉他们的。最初本该是芦屋接到另一头的信号，然后他又把它转交给了警方……"

    # game/script.rpy:4612
    old "While there was room for suspicion, thinking that he was an actual corrupt policeman was probably incorrect. If he had fed us false information, he would be exposed after we got out."
    new "虽然有值得怀疑的地方，但认定他就是个真正的腐败警察，恐怕并不正确。如果他真给了我们假情报，等我们出去之后，他就会被揭穿。"

    # game/script.rpy:4622
    old "I could feel my head getting cloudy. The tiredness was coming back, so I tried to cool off."
    new "我能感觉到脑子越来越混沌。倦意又涌了上来，我便试着让自己冷静一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:4623
    old "The room's inspection finished without anything missing. Once again, we silently moved on to the next one."
    new "这个房间检查完毕，什么也没少。我们又默默走向下一个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:4624
    old "After not talking for two weeks, my voice had easily come out in front of Sai. As I'd thought, it was only Shiroya who I had difficulty talking to."
    new "两周没开口，我的声音却在 Sai 面前很自然地发了出来。果然，让我难以开口的只有 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:4625
    old "At the same time, the incident had given me something else to think about after so long. It was likely I was trying to fill up my mind with it, as I knew what would fill it otherwise."
    new "同时，这起事件也让我在这么久之后，终于有了别的事情可想。我多半是在用这件事填满脑子，因为我知道，若不这样，脑子里就会被别的东西占满。"

    # game/script.rpy:4630
    old "...Isla didn't look tired of repeating the same procedure. She ran to the door, eagerly awaiting Katei."
    new "……Isla 一遍遍重复同样的流程，却看不出丝毫厌烦。她跑到门边，急切地等着 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:4631
    old "I'd noticed that every room had a specific theme. Before leaving, I'd glanced at the cabinets and seen a bunch of unimpressive white gemstones, much smaller in size than the Sekimeiya."
    new "我注意到每个房间都有各自的主题。离开前我瞥了一眼展示柜，里面是一堆并不起眼的白宝石，个头比 Sekimeiya 小得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:4634
    old "Labeled A5, the last crystal room in the hallway was left before the storeroom. When Isla turned the knob, we expected to be met with the same scene as the other rooms."
    new "标着 A5 的这间，是走廊里最后一间水晶展室，再往前就是储藏室。Isla 转动门把手时，我们都以为会看到和其他房间一样的景象。"

    # game/script.rpy:4646
    old "Oh..."
    new "哦……"

    # game/script.rpy:4647
    old "The entire room was tinted black, and it was shaped differently. The ceiling and four walls had been deprived of their color, as a dry, dark coating had taken hold of them."
    new "整个房间都染上了黑色，形状也不一样。天花板和四面墙壁失去了原本的颜色，被一层干涸的深色附着物盖住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4648
    old "Every cabinet was covered by a curtain, but instead of bright red, they were gray, black, and purple, colors that removed all of their elegance."
    new "每个展示柜都罩着遮布，可不再是鲜红色，而是灰、黑、紫，这些颜色把原本的雅致一扫而空。"

    # game/script.rpy:4650
    old "It was the same appearance the hallways bore. We immediately understood the smoke had also gotten into the last room.{w} We only found it a shocking sight because of what Katei previously told us."
    new "走廊里也是同样的景象。我们立刻明白，烟雾也进了最后一间房。{w}只因 Katei 先前说过的话，这一幕才让我们如此震惊。"

    # game/script.rpy:4655
    old "I see. This makes a lot of sense."
    new "原来如此。这样就说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4660
    old "What does? Didn't Katei say that the smoke hadn't been released in any other room?"
    new "说得通什么？Katei 不是说，别的房间都没放过烟雾吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:4673
    old "Instead of clarifying, Sai moved forward. He stained his hand black by grabbing the bottom of a curtain, and without any care, he raised it to show us the interior of the cabinet it was covering."
    new "Sai 没有解释，而是走上前去。他抓住遮布下摆，手被染成了黑色，却毫不在意地把遮布掀起，让我们看柜内的情形。"

    # game/script.rpy:4678
    old "What...? There isn't anything..."
    new "什么……？里面什么都没有……"

    # game/script.rpy:4683
    old "He did the same with every cabinet, and the result never differed."
    new "他把每个展示柜都掀了一遍，结果毫无二致。"

    # game/script.rpy:4686
    old "I see, this is the room that was robbed. The gems found in the suitcase came from these cabinets."
    new "原来如此，失窃的就是这个房间。行李箱里找到的宝石，就是从这些展示柜里拿的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4691
    old "Yes, that has to be it. But the smoke..."
    new "对，一定是这样。可那些烟雾……"

    # game/script.rpy:4696
    old "You all remember what I said earlier, right?{w} That this part of the plan didn't make a ton of sense. The gems were stolen without releasing smoke in their room, which implied that the smoke had another purpose."
    new "你们都记得我刚才说的吧？{w}我说这部分计划说不通。宝石被偷，却没有在它们的房间里放烟雾，这就说明烟雾另有用途。"

    # game/script.rpy:4697
    old "But it seems the smoke was released in this room too. Of course, that's required if they wanted to make it seem like those various gems were the target."
    new "可看来这个房间里也放了烟雾。当然，如果想让人觉得那些各式各样的宝石才是目标，这一步是必须的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4700
    old "The lens of the single camera was stained black, showing that we weren't being recorded. The green light had been buried under the same blackness, but it was still discernible."
    new "唯一一台摄像头的镜头也被染黑了，说明我们没有被拍到。绿色指示灯被同一层黑色盖住，却仍能分辨出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:4701
    old "Katei told us the places where the smoke was released. Obviously, he wouldn't have said that if he hadn't been sure of it, so I believed him."
    new "Katei 告诉过我们烟雾是在哪几处放的。他若没有十足把握，显然不会那样说，所以我信了他。"

    # game/script.rpy:4706
    old "I'm sorry. I must've made a mistake."
    new "抱歉。是我弄错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4711
    old "No. I have no idea why you did that, but this settles it: this proves you were not in the security room when the alarm went off."
    new "不。我不知道你为什么要那样做，但这一点就足以定论了——这证明警报响起时，你并不在监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:4712
    old "Sai glanced at me to let me know that he'd been correct. I was probably the only person aside from Katei who knew what he was talking about."
    new "Sai 朝我瞥了一眼，示意自己说对了。除了 Katei，大概只有我知道他在讲什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:4717
    old "What do you mean...?"
    new "你这话是什么意思……？"

    # game/script.rpy:4722
    old "Exactly! What are you talking about?"
    new "就是！你到底在说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:4723
    old "You didn't even suspect it? This is about the fifth thing that confirms it, but this one lets me bring it up openly. After all, it also rules out a few things I talked about with Atsuki."
    new "你连这都没怀疑过？算起来，这差不多是第五条佐证了，只不过这一条能让我当着大家的面提出来。毕竟，它也排除了几件我和 Atsuki 谈过的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:4727
    old "I more or less understood why Sai said that. Without inspecting every room, Katei felt confident in saying that only three different places had been hit with the smoke, but he'd been incorrect.{w} That indicated he hadn't been behind the attack itself, since he wouldn't have made that mistake. It let Sai confront him since he no longer believed he was confronting Xyn, but a mere suspicious individual."
    new "我大致明白 Sai 为什么这么说。Katei 并没有逐一检查每个房间，却敢断言只有三处被烟雾波及，而他错了。{w} 这说明他并非袭击的幕后主使——若真是他，就不会犯这种错。这也让 Sai 敢于当面质问他，因为他已不再觉得自己面对的是 Xyn，而只是一个形迹可疑的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:4728
    old "I don't know what you mean... How does this indicate in any way that I wasn't in the security room?"
    new "我不明白你的意思……这怎么能说明我当时不在监控室？"

    # game/script.rpy:4733
    old "It's very simple, but let me ask first: why did you say that only the hallways and the event room had smoke released in them?"
    new "道理很简单，不过我先问你：你为什么说只有走廊和活动室里放了烟雾？"

    # game/script.rpy:4738
    old "...I had a bit of time to inspect these rooms before I found Erina's group. Every room I entered was clean, so I simply assumed it was the case with all of them. I shouldn't have made such an assumption."
    new "……在找到 Erina 他们之前，我还有点时间查看那些房间。我进过的每一间都是干净的，便想当然以为所有房间都如此。我不该这样臆断。"

    # game/script.rpy:4743
    old "All right. This proves it further. You were not in the security room."
    new "好，这更能证明你不在监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:4747
    old "You all get it too, right?"
    new "你们也都明白了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:4748
    old "Katei has said multiple times that during the time the smoke was released, he was locked inside the security room. He also claimed that he tried to monitor what the situation was on this floor by looking through the available cameras."
    new "Katei 反复说过，释放烟雾的那段时间他被锁在监控室里，还声称通过能用的摄像头查看过这一层的情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:4749
    old "Not only that, but he also said that he saw the smoke rising out of nowhere. I'm saying that if he really was looking through the cameras when the smoke appeared, he would've seen it being released here."
    new "不止如此，他还说他看见烟雾凭空升起。我的意思是：烟雾出现时，他若真在看监控，就该看到这里也有烟雾放出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:4754
    old "What? No. I was in a rush, so I never realized it."
    new "什么？不。当时太急，我根本没注意到。"

    # game/script.rpy:4759
    old "I don't understand it at all. You were never in the security room and you never inspected the first floor. So then, why did you say that only three places had been hit by the smoke? Why were you certain you could say that, despite being wrong?"
    new "这我就完全想不通了。你从没进过监控室，也从未查看过一楼。那么，你凭什么说只有三处被烟雾波及？你明明说错了，为什么还那么笃定？"

    # game/script.rpy:4760
    old "That was the same question I'd been wondering. If Sai was right, Katei wouldn't have stated incorrect information he hadn't been able to verify, which meant that he felt certain about the room's appearance without personally seeing it."
    new "这也正是我一直没想通的地方。若 Sai 的推断没错，那 Katei 说的就是自己无从核实、又确实弄错了的信息；也就是说，他根本没亲眼看到，却对那间房里的情形十分笃定。"

    # game/script.rpy:4765
    old "Your assumption is mistaken. I can explain what led to that assertion.{w} When I was in the security room, most of the cameras from this floor were being displayed. It is true that I saw the smoke appearing out of nowhere, but at that time, this room's camera was not being shown. Usually, monitoring the interior of a room isn't needed if another camera shows its door."
    new "你的假设不对。我可以解释我为什么会得出那个结论。{w} 我在监控室时，这一层大部分摄像头的画面都开着。我确实看到烟雾凭空冒出，但那时这间房的画面并没有显示出来。通常来说，只要另有摄像头对着房门，就不必再看房内的情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:4766
    old "Then, I proceeded to look through all the other cameras while trying to determine what was happening. As you saw with your own eyes, some of them had been disabled; because of the smoke, a black screen was all that I could see through them."
    new "接着，我一边查看其余所有摄像头，一边判断发生了什么。正如你们亲眼所见，其中有些已经失效；因为烟雾，那些画面只剩一片漆黑。"

    # game/script.rpy:4771
    old "So, all that this room's camera showed was a black screen. This means that I was unable to recognize that one of the disabled screens belonged to this room.{w} Since both hallways possess numerous cameras, I did not notice there were one too many black screens. Later, since I looked into most of the clean rooms, I wrongly assumed that they all were the same."
    new "所以，这间房的摄像头画面也只是一片黑。也就是说，我没发现其中一块黑屏属于这间房。{w} 两条走廊都装了不少摄像头，我没察觉黑屏多了一块。后来，我查看过的房间大多是干净的，便错误地以为所有房间都一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:4777
    old "We all thought about it. Did what Katei said make sense? If I'd been in their places, it's likely I would've believed it, but Sai and I had more reasons to think Katei had never been in the security room and that he was fabricating another lie out of nowhere."
    new "我们都在想，Katei 的说法讲得通吗？如果我是他们，多半会信；但我和 Sai 有更多理由认为，Katei 根本没进过监控室，这番话不过是他临时编的又一个谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:4780
    old "Are you really sure about this, Sai?"
    new "Sai，你真有把握吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:4781
    old "Absolutely."
    new "当然。"

    # game/script.rpy:4782
    old "Now answer me this. At first, you saw the smoke being released through some cameras. To assess the situation, you looked at all the remaining places on this floor, and this room wasn't initially being displayed."
    new "那你回答我：一开始，你从几个监控画面里看到烟雾放出。为了判断情况，你把这一层其余的地方都看了一遍，而这间房起初并没有显示出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:4787
    old "Correct. That is why I never saw the smoke appearing here."
    new "没错。所以我一直没看到这里有烟雾冒出。"

    # game/script.rpy:4792
    old "All right. So then you switched the displayed cameras. This means that at some point, you switched one of the cameras for this room's. You're seriously saying that when you did that, you didn't realize the smoke had also been released here?"
    new "好。那么你切换了显示的摄像头。也就是说，在某个时间点，你把其中一个画面切到了这间房的摄像头。你是在说，你那么做的时候居然没发现这里也冒了烟？"

    # game/script.rpy:4797
    old "Oh, I see what you mean. That eventually, I must've chosen to observe the live footage of this room by manually selecting its camera and I would've noticed the black screen."
    new "哦，我明白你的意思了。你是说，我迟早会手动选中这间房的摄像头去看实时画面，然后就会发现那块黑屏。"

    # game/script.rpy:4798
    old "...Yes."
    new "……对。"

    # game/script.rpy:4801
    old "It's understandable you'd think that, but no. That would've been slow and suboptimal given the situation. Do you remember earlier, when I looked through the cameras while talking to Suripo?"
    new "你会这么想，也情有可原，但并非如此。那样做在当时既慢又不合适。你还记得吗，刚才我和 Suripo 说话时，查看过监控？"

    # game/script.rpy:4802
    old "The program that manages them lets me replace the nine cameras being displayed at once for the ones that come next on the list. That's what I did."
    new "管理这些摄像头的程序可以让我一次性把当前显示的九个画面换成列表中的下一组。我就是这么做的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4803
    old "I was nervous and switched the cameras nine at a time. I never consciously acknowledged that one of the new cameras belonged to this room. As I already said, I simply failed to recognize that there was an extra black screen. The crystal rooms all look very similar, so I didn't really miss this one."
    new "我当时很紧张，一次切换九个画面。我根本没留意新画面里有一个属于这间房。正如我所说，我只是没看出多出了一块黑屏。几个水晶展室看起来都很相似，所以我没特别注意到这一间。"

    # game/script.rpy:4808
    old "The shape of this one is completely different, though."
    new "可这一间的形状完全不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:4813
    old "To tell you the truth, it all threw me off. The mere sight of the screens displaying nothing but black was disconcerting because they're equipped with night vision and I'd never seen them like that. I wasn't really thinking about the number of crystal rooms."
    new "老实说，那情形把我弄懵了。光是看到屏幕上只剩一片黑，就足够叫人心慌——它们都装了夜视功能，我从没见过那样的画面。我根本没心思去数水晶展室的数目。"

    # game/script.rpy:4817
    old "Katei's explanation was unconvincing, but there was nothing Sai could use to object to it. At least, not without the computer's sleep mode timer, which Sai didn't appear to be using for his argument."
    new "Katei 的解释难以服人，但 Sai 也拿不出什么来反驳。至少，不借助电脑的休眠计时器，Sai 就驳不倒他——可 Sai 似乎并不打算拿这一点来当论据。"

    # game/script.rpy:4818
    old "Katei hadn't addressed the event room either. If he'd seen the smoke appearing in the event room, it should've been a given that our group had been trapped in the tower, but that wasn't what he said when we met."
    new "Katei 也没提到活动室。他若真看到活动室冒出烟雾，按理说就该立刻想到我们这伙人被困在塔里了，可他见到我们时说的并不是这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:4819
    old "It was unbelievable that the event room wouldn't have been displayed on such a special day. If it really hadn't been, it meant that Katei hadn't failed to notice one extra black camera, but two. And it was still very questionable that he had stopped at Erina's group before ours."
    new "在这么特殊的日子，活动室的画面居然没被调出来，实在令人难以置信。若果真如此，那就意味着 Katei 漏看的黑屏不是一块，而是两块。再说，他先找到 Erina 那一组、后找到我们，这本身也很可疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:4820
    old "Everyone else looked dubious as well, but less so, as they hadn't yet entertained that possibility."
    new "其他人也都面露疑虑，只是没那么深——他们还没往这个方向想过。"

    # game/script.rpy:4823
    old "Not for a second do I believe anything that you're saying."
    new "你说的这些，我一个字都不信。"

    # game/script.rpy:4824
    old "I apologize for not being more convincing. I understand why you might find what I'm telling you strange, but I promise all of you that I'm telling the truth."
    new "没能让你更信服，我很抱歉。我知道我说的这些话在你们听来很奇怪，但我向你们保证，我说的都是实话。"

    # game/script.rpy:4829
    old "So, you switched all the cameras at once and, for some reason, assumed only three places had been exposed to the smoke."
    new "于是，你一次性切换了所有摄像头，又不知怎么的，认定只有三处被烟雾波及。"

    # game/script.rpy:4834
    old "Yes. I saw the smoke appearing in the hallways, which disabled multiple cameras. I mistakenly assumed all of them belonged to the hallways."
    new "是的。我看见走廊里冒烟，有好几台摄像头因此失效。我误以为那些黑屏全都来自走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:4835
    old "And after that, despite not having looked through every room, you claimed that the smoke hadn't been released anywhere else but in the three places we'd all personally observed."
    new "然后，你明明没有逐间查看过所有房间，却宣称除了我们都亲眼看到的那三处，别处都没有释放过烟雾。"

    # game/script.rpy:4836
    old "Correct. I apologize for my mistake. It seems it led you to suspect something about me, but I repeat that it was all a mistake I made in a rush."
    new "没错。是我疏忽了，抱歉。看来这让你对我起了疑心，但我再说一遍，这全是我匆忙之中犯的错。"

    # game/script.rpy:4841
    old "Let me be clear: I don't believe you nor intend to do so. You are full of shit. However, I don't know why you told us that only those three places had been hit, and it's pissing me off.{w} Do you remember when you said you'd left the lobby door open? Like Atsuki pointed out, it was opened after the smoke was released since almost none went through it. Still saying that's true?"
    new "我把话说清楚：我不信你，也不打算信你。你满嘴鬼话。可我还是想不通，你为什么要告诉我们只有那三处被烟雾波及——这让我很不痛快。{w} 你还记得你说过，大厅的门你没关吗？就像 Atsuki 指出的那样，那扇门是在烟雾放出之后才开的，因为几乎没有烟从那边透过去。你现在还坚持这个说法？"

    # game/script.rpy:4842
    old "Yes, of course."
    new "是，当然。"

    # game/script.rpy:4843
    old "Well, when you said that, I looked at the hallway A door. That one was properly closed."
    new "你说那句话的时候，我看了一眼A走廊的门。那扇门关得好好的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4844
    old "...And?"
    new "……然后呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:4845
    old "According to you, after you left the security room, you ended up where we were without going through the event room. If you'd done that, you would've gone through the lobby, so you should've opened both doors."
    new "按你的说法，你离开监控室之后，没经过活动室就到了我们所在的地方。可如果真是那样，你就得穿过大厅，那两扇门你应该都打开过才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:4846
    old "Which is what I did."
    new "我确实都打开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4851
    old "And why did you leave the hallway A door closed but not the other one?"
    new "那你为什么让A走廊的门关着，另一扇却没关？"

    # game/script.rpy:4852
    old "...Because the three of you were unconscious in hallway B, and I hurried to kneel beside you."
    new "……因为你们三个都昏倒在B走廊，我急忙蹲到你们身边。"

    # game/script.rpy:4857
    old "Sure, I imagined you'd say that. However, if you really opened that door, what I find most likely is that you didn't come from the security room and that you never went through the other one. Maybe it was Naomi who opened it and you had to say you did it because of the movements you'd already claimed you made."
    new "当然，我早就料到你会这么说。可如果你真打开过那扇门，我觉得最可能的情况是：你根本不是从监控室过来的，也没有穿过另一扇门。也许是 Naomi 打开的，而你先前已经交代过自己的行动路线，只好把这事也揽到自己头上。"

    # game/script.rpy:4862
    old "You're ridiculous."
    new "真是荒唐。"

    # game/script.rpy:4863
    old "Okay, but if you'd never looked at the cameras or entered the rooms, why the hell did you say something that could easily be wrong...? Were you misinformed about the plan you took part in? That's what would be ridiculous."
    new "好，可要是你根本没看过监控、也没进过那些房间，你为什么要说这种一戳就破的话……？难道你参与的那个计划，连你得到的消息都是错的？那才叫荒唐。"

    # game/script.rpy:4864
    old "*sigh* I already told you what happened. If you find it hard to believe, there's nothing else I can do."
    new "*叹气* 该说的我都说了。你要是不肯信，我也没有别的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:4866
    old "There were a few seconds of silence during which nobody knew what to say. In the background, Isla ignored us and kept looking through the cabinets, hoping something had been left behind."
    new "有几秒钟，谁都没有出声，也不知道该说什么。另一边，Isla 没理会我们，仍在翻看那些展示柜，盼着里面还留着什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:4867
    old "Erina followed everything she did with her eyes, obviously unwilling to needlessly engage in the barrage Sai was firing off."
    new "Erina 的目光一直跟着她的动作，显然不愿无谓地卷进 Sai 那一连串炮火般的追问里。"

    # game/script.rpy:4873
    old "You know... It's possible you're right. It's possible that not noticing the extra black screen and the missing crystal room is too unlikely. Even under the stress of not knowing what was happening."
    new "说起来……也许你说得对。没注意到多出来的那块黑屏，也没发现少了一间水晶展室，这确实不太可能。哪怕当时一头雾水、心里发慌，也不至于。"

    # game/script.rpy:4874
    old "What if this room was clean at that time? It has already been a long time since I looked through the cameras. The smoke could've been released here afterward."
    new "如果那时这个房间还没有被动手脚呢？我看监控已经是很久以前的事了。这里的烟雾，也许是之后才放的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4875
    old "This wouldn't contradict anything, and it might make even more sense than what I first believed."
    new "这不会和任何线索冲突，甚至比我先前那套说法更说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:4876
    old "Quick lie revision? Are we supposed to listen to that?"
    new "临时改口？这种话也要我们听？"

    # game/script.rpy:4881
    old "Well, I don't know why that would've been done, but you can't deny it just because you find it unlikely.{w} It could very well be that it happened after I left the security room. The rooms all look very similar, so maybe I did see this one when I looked through the cameras. Now I'm not sure. I don't know which of the two possibilities I'm presenting is the correct one."
    new "这个嘛，我也不知道为什么要那么做，但你不能只因为觉得不太可能就否定它。{w}完全有可能是在我离开监控室之后才发生的。这些房间看起来都差不多，说不定我看监控时确实看到了这一间。现在我也说不准了。我提出的两种可能性，到底哪一种是正确的，我自己也不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:4882
    old "You know very well they're both incorrect. But yes, I can deny the second one."
    new "你心里很清楚，两种都不对。不过，没错，第二种我确实可以否定。"

    # game/script.rpy:4887
    old "How would you do that?"
    new "你怎么否定？"

    # game/script.rpy:4890
    old "It has to do with something very important. Normally, I would've brought it up straight away."
    new "这牵涉到一件很重要的事。按说，我一开始就该提出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:4891
    old "It makes this whole situation much easier to understand. Remember the two questions from earlier? Why were the gemstones stolen, and how were they brought outside before the alarm went off?"
    new "有了它，整件事就好懂得多了。还记得之前那两个问题吗？宝石为什么被偷，又怎么在警报响起之前被带出去？"

    # game/script.rpy:4892
    old "I'm fairly sure the answers are, respectively, to make it seem like they were the goal of the attack, and because they were stolen before the time we thought."
    new "我基本可以确定，答案分别是：为了让它们看起来像是袭击的目标；以及，它们在我们以为的时间之前就已经被偷走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4893
    old "I mean, the curtains here were lowered when we entered. Most importantly, they were stained with the smoke.{w} This means that during the time the smoke was released, the cabinets were covered."
    new "我是说，我们进来的时候，这里的遮布是放下来的。最关键的是，遮布上沾了烟雾的痕迹。{w}也就是说，放烟雾的时候，这些展示柜是遮着的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4898
    old "If someone stole the contents of these cabinets when the smoke was being released, as the Ashiya family thinks right now, why would they have lowered the curtains again? No way they would've all fallen down by themselves."
    new "如果有人是在放烟雾的时候偷走这些展示柜里的东西——就像芦屋家现在以为的那样——那他们为什么还要把遮布重新放下来？总不可能所有遮布都自己掉下来吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:4899
    old "You all see what I'm saying, right? It would have been a pointless waste of time to lower them. After the smoke was released in this room, the curtains weren't moved.{w} To put it simply, the gemstones that were once here were stolen before the smoke was released. This is why someone was able to bring them outside before the exit closed."
    new "你们都明白我的意思吧？再把它们放下来纯属浪费时间。这个房间放出烟雾之后，遮布就没再被动过。{w}简单来说，原本放在这里的宝石，是在烟雾放出之前就被偷走的。所以才会有人能在出口关闭之前把它们带出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:4904
    old "I suppose that makes sense, but how did they do that?"
    new "听上去有道理，可他们是怎么做到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:4909
    old "You tell me. What's important is that they could've been stolen during the night. Then, before the exit closed, they were brought out."
    new "这得问你了。重要的是，它们有可能是在夜里被偷走的。然后在出口关闭之前被带了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:4910
    old "By releasing the smoke here too, they tried to make it look like the gems were stolen at a later time and that they were the actual target of the theft."
    new "他们在这里也放了烟雾，就是想让人以为宝石是在更晚的时候被偷的，而且它们才是这次盗窃真正的目标。"

    # game/script.rpy:4911
    old "...What you're saying makes sense, but I still have a hard time visualizing how this plan works."
    new "……你说的有道理，可我还是很难想象这个计划具体是怎么运作的。"

    # game/script.rpy:4916
    old "Me too. A very important thing we don't know yet is whether the alarm was taken into consideration. You said it was a top-secret alarm, right?"
    new "我也是。还有一件很关键的事我们不知道：他们有没有把警报算进去。你说过那是绝密警报，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:4921
    old "Yes. I believe it's nearly impossible that Xyn designed a plan with it in mind."
    new "对。我认为 Xyn 几乎不可能在制定计划时考虑到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:4926
    old "If so, that means the smoke here couldn't have been released after you left the security room. That would only have been done if they already knew the exit was getting locked down."
    new "这样的话，这里的烟雾就不可能是你离开监控室之后才放的。只有已经知道出口即将封锁，才会那么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:4927
    old "I believe you're right. If they didn't know about the alarm, they would not have staggered the smoke in this room. It would've been released everywhere at once."
    new "你说得对。如果不知道警报的事，他们不会让这个房间的烟雾晚一步放出，而是会在各处同时释放。"

    # game/script.rpy:4930
    old "...Exactly."
    new "……正是。"

    # game/script.rpy:4934
    old "...Can I say something? We're only assuming the gems here were stolen before the time of the attack because the curtains were down. That makes sense, but wouldn't they have thought of it?"
    new "……我能说一句吗？我们之所以认为这里的宝石是在袭击之前就被偷走的，只是因为遮布放了下来。这确实说得通，可他们难道会想不到这一点吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:4935
    old "That's true. If Xyn didn't know about the alarm, they must've expected Ashiya to rush in right away. They would only have seen these curtains, not that the gems were missing."
    new "确实。如果 Xyn 不知道警报，他们一定以为芦屋会立刻冲进来。那样他们只会看到这些遮布，而不会发现宝石不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4940
    old "Yeah. After all, they only believe these random gems were the target because they don't have access to the tower. Isn't it as if the alarm is working positively for the culprit?"
    new "对。毕竟，他们之所以认定这些随便摆在这里的宝石就是目标，只是因为他们进不了塔。这么看，警报反倒像是在帮犯人的忙，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:4945
    old "Yeah... There's no way Xyn would've ignored the curtains giving away the timing of the theft, right?"
    new "嗯……遮布会暴露盗窃的时间，Xyn 不可能忽略这一点吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:4946
    old "Not if they didn't know about the alarm. If they did, and the intent was to simply let Ashiya think what they think until the tower unlocks, it doesn't matter that we've figured it out. After all, it's not like we can contact the outside to tell them, is it?"
    new "除非他们并不知道警报的事。要是他们知道，而且目的只是让芦屋一直抱着现在的想法，直到塔解锁，那就算我们看穿了也无所谓。毕竟，我们也没法联系外面告诉他们，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:4952
    old "You're wrong. Then they would've had no reason to release the smoke here."
    new "你错了。那样的话，他们就没有理由在这里放烟雾了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4957
    old "Hm, I'm not sure. We did have the chance to talk to the police, but it happened before we came here.{w} I'm saying this was done to trick Ashiya into thinking the gems were the goal. However, I also think that the plan must somehow end by stealing the Sekimeiya, which will directly reveal that the gems were never the goal. It could definitely be that the smoke was released to trick us—the people who got trapped. It all depends on whether someone is trying to trick us."
    new "嗯，我也说不准。我们确实有过联系警方的机会，但那是在我们来这里之前。{w}我的意思是，他们这么做是为了让芦屋以为宝石才是目标。不过我也认为，这个计划最后必定会以偷走 Sekimeiya 收场，而那样就直接表明宝石从来不是目标。那些烟雾说不定就是为了骗我们这些被困住的人。关键在于，到底有没有人在骗我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:4959
    old "There were a few seconds of silence. Would Xyn have put so much effort into deceiving us? It didn't sound likely, but it was true that we had a method to contact the outside and could've informed Ashiya of every suspicious detail we'd noticed. It was strange, because if the culprit had always been able to disable the communication method, there would have been no point in doing any of it."
    new "几秒钟的沉默。Xyn 会花这么大力气来骗我们吗？听起来不太可能，但我们确实有办法联系外界，本来也可以把注意到的每一处可疑之处都告诉芦屋。奇怪的是，如果犯人一直有办法切断我们的联络，那做这些就毫无意义了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4962
    old "...Do you actually believe the alarm was considered?"
    new "……你真觉得他们考虑过警报？"

    # game/script.rpy:4963
    old "Who knows? If the gems were stolen during the night through some method Xyn are capable of, they'd leave the curtains lowered to prevent it from being noticed through the cameras and so that the visitors couldn't see them before {time=9:10.}"
    new "谁知道呢。如果宝石是在夜里被 Xyn 用某种他们办得到的手段偷走的，那他们就会让遮布一直保持放下的状态，免得被监控看出来，也让参观者在 {time=9:10.} 之前看不到里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:4968
    old "I wasn't the guard on duty last night, so I can't help you with that."
    new "昨晚值班的守卫不是我，这个我帮不了你。"

    # game/script.rpy:4969
    old "...{w}Well, they were forced to leave the cabinets covered, but doing so also indicates that the gems were stolen before the doors were open to the public..."
    new "……{w}总之，他们是不得已才让展示柜一直遮着，可这样一来，也说明宝石是在对公众开放之前就被偷走的……"

    # game/script.rpy:4975
    old "I don't know why. I've approached it from different angles, but I can't come up with something that makes sense.{w} In some way, these gems must've only been a side part of the plan. Them getting stolen before the smoke was released is close to confirmation, but how everything pieces together is not as simple to figure out."
    new "我不知道为什么。我换了好几个角度去想，还是想不出一个说得通的解释。{w}从某种意义上看，这些宝石一定只是计划中的次要部分。它们是在烟雾放出之前就被偷走的，这几乎可以确定；但整件事怎么拼在一起，就不是那么容易想明白的了。"

    # game/script.rpy:4976
    old "I apologize that I can't be of more help. I assume this is Xyn's doing, but I don't know what they intend to do. I am equally clueless when it comes to how these gems could've been stolen before this morning."
    new "很抱歉，我帮不上更多忙。我猜这是 Xyn 所为，但不知道他们打算做什么。至于这些宝石怎么可能在今天早上之前就被偷走，我同样毫无头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:4981
    old "Sai, I know you don't believe much of what I say, but I have been honest from the beginning. I have just been trying to help and provide you with as much information as I can."
    new "Sai，我知道我说的话你多半不信，但我从一开始就没有撒谎。我只是想帮忙，尽量把我能提供的信息都告诉你。"

    # game/script.rpy:4986
    old "Is that so?"
    new "是这样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:4989
    old "While everyone stood still, Sai began to examine the room. Even though it looked drastically different from the others, only the illumination and shape varied. It was still a simple room that only contained cabinets."
    new "众人还愣在原地，Sai 已经开始打量这间屋子。它看上去与其余几间大不相同，可变化的只有光线和形状，说到底仍是个只摆着展示柜的简单房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:4995
    old "I don't think there's much to do here. Every cabinet is empty, and the same kind of smoke was released, most likely at the same time as in the other places. We should move on."
    new "这里应该没什么可查的了。每个展示柜都是空的，释放的也是同一种烟雾，多半和其他几处同时发生。我们走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:5001
    old "...Yeah. Let's get going."
    new "……嗯。走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:5002
    old "Isla seemed happy with that proposition as well. We all agreed and left quietly to avoid any more conflict."
    new "Isla 似乎也赞成这个提议。大家一致同意，为了不再起争执，我们安静地离开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5014
    old "Only the storeroom remained in hallway A. We tried to enter it together, but it was too narrow for all of us."
    new "A走廊只剩下储藏室还没查。我们本想一起进去，可门内太窄，容不下所有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:5018
    old "It was a stretched-out, dim room. While the name implied that its purpose was to store things, the amount of space didn't allow for much of that, and it only contained a few empty shelves and a dusty couch that looked dangerous to sit in. Even the door was lower quality than the rest."
    new "房间狭长而昏暗。名字虽说是用来储物，可这点空间也存不了多少东西，里面只有几个空架子，还有一张落满灰尘、坐上去怕是会出事的沙发。连门都比别处劣质。"

    # game/script.rpy:5026
    old "I exited the room as Akaro and Erina entered it. Sai seemed to be enjoying himself, considering different options in an attempt to \"win\"."
    new "Akaro 和 Erina 进去时，我退了出来。Sai 似乎乐在其中，正盘算着各种可能，想借此「赢」下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:5027
    old "If we parted from the assumption that there was a plan more complex than met the eye, I had something to consider."
    new "若抛开表象，假设背后另有更复杂的算计，那有一点值得我细想。"

    # game/script.rpy:5030
    old "We had all assumed that the gems were stolen before the smoke was released since the curtains had been lowered. If anyone stole the gems after the attack, there was no reason to waste their time lowering the curtains again.{w} However, that was a very simple indicator of the time the gems had been stolen, and one that would not have been overlooked."
    new "遮布被放了下来，所以我们才都认定宝石是在烟雾释放之前被偷走的。若有人是在袭击之后才行窃，就没必要多此一举再把遮布放下。{w} 可这个判断失窃时间的依据实在太过简单，谁都不会忽略。"

    # game/script.rpy:5031
    old "So, what if the curtains had been lowered again precisely for that reason? To make us, or anyone who looked at it, think that they had been stolen before the time of the attack. After all, anything else would've been a huge mistake."
    new "那么，如果遮布正是为此才被重新放下呢？为了让我们——或任何看到这一幕的人——以为宝石是在袭击之前失窃的。毕竟除此之外的任何情形，都等于犯下大错。"

    # game/script.rpy:5032
    old "I couldn't think of an immediate benefit, but deliberately misleading us about the time or reason behind an action was a potent move. That effect wouldn't have been achieved if the tower had really been robbed at night and the curtains were left down. {w} ...And realistically, even though Xyn could've been involved, how could they have emptied so many cabinets during the night? Hadn't the police been nearby? Hadn't the cameras been monitoring everything?"
    new "我一时想不到这能带来什么好处，但刻意误导他人对某个举动的时间与缘由的判断，本身就是极有效的手段。若塔里真是在夜里失窃，遮布也一直垂着，就达不到这样的效果。{w} ……况且说实在的，就算 Xyn 牵涉其中，他们又怎能在夜里搬空那么多展示柜？警察难道不在附近？监控难道没有拍下一切？"

    # game/script.rpy:5033
    old "Before I could determine if there was a better conclusion to reach, everyone left the storeroom, Katei returning last."
    new "我还没想清楚是否另有更合理的结论，众人已陆续走出储藏室，Katei 走在最后。"

    # game/script.rpy:5038
    old "We didn't all have to enter. There isn't anywhere to hide in here."
    new "不必全都挤进来。这里根本没有能藏人的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:5039
    old "What's this room even for? It's called the storeroom, but there isn't much inside, and I doubt it'd be much use with how small it is."
    new "这房间到底是干什么用的？叫储藏室，里面却没多少东西，还这么小，我看也派不上什么用场。"

    # game/script.rpy:5044
    old "Things have been stored here before, but it's true that now it looks like a useless room. I heard that this room already existed before this building started to be used for business, and it was too small to give it any other purpose."
    new "以前确实在这里存过东西，不过如今看来，它就是个派不上用场的房间。听说这栋楼改作商用之前，这间屋子就已经存在了，因为太小，也改不成别的用途。"

    # game/script.rpy:5045
    old "I see..."
    new "原来如此……"

    # game/script.rpy:5046
    old "The door didn't look that different from the others. However, once you opened it, the room would detract from the aesthetic the place usually had. I figured that when the building was repurposed, they replaced the door but left the inside unchanged."
    new "那扇门看上去和别处没什么两样。可一打开，屋里的景象就破坏了这里一贯的美感。我猜这栋楼改用途时，门换了新的，里面却原封未动。"

    # game/script.rpy:5051
    old "...So we're halfway done with this floor. Maybe we'll find something in hallway B."
    new "……这么说这层我们已经查了一半。说不定 B走廊能有所发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:5052
    old "To get there, we stepped into hallway C for the first time, which contained the stairs and elevator to move through the different floors."
    new "为了到那里，我们头一次走进 C走廊——通往各层的楼梯和电梯都在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:5060
    old "What's this...?"
    new "这是……？"

    # game/script.rpy:5061
    old "Something immediately caught our attention."
    new "有件东西立刻吸引了我们的注意。"

    # game/script.rpy:5071
    old "It's a suitcase, Katei."
    new "一个行李箱，Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:5076
    old "...Yes. What is it doing here?"
    new "……嗯。它怎么会在这儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:5085
    old "We all approached it. Just like he said, a small and conspicuous black suitcase was lying in the middle of the hallway, next to the wall."
    new "我们一齐走上前。正如他所说，走廊中央紧挨着墙的地方躺着一只不大的黑色行李箱，格外显眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:5086
    old "Let's see... There might be something inside."
    new "看看再说……里面说不定有东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:5087
    old "Sai went ahead and unclasped it. He opened it up on the floor and exposed its interior."
    new "Sai 径直上前打开卡扣，把箱子摊在地上，露出里面的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:5092
    old "Nothing...?"
    new "什么都没有……？"

    # game/script.rpy:5098
    old "That's disappointing, but I suppose otherwise they wouldn't have left it here."
    new "真让人失望。不过话说回来，要是里头有东西，他们大概也不会把它留在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:5104
    old "Did you see this when you looked through the security cameras?"
    new "你查看监控的时候，看到过这个吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:5109
    old "Erina looked at Katei. The cameras in hallway C hadn't been touched, so Katei should've been able to look through them."
    new "Erina 望向 Katei。C走廊的摄像头没有被动过，Katei 理应能看到那里的画面。"

    # game/script.rpy:5114
    old "He didn't."
    new "他没看到。"

    # game/script.rpy:5119
    old "Right. I would've told you if I had."
    new "对。要是看到了，我会告诉你们的。"

    # game/script.rpy:5123
    old "I see. Does that mean that it was left after we woke up?"
    new "原来如此。那是否说明，它是在我们醒来之后才被放在这里的？"

    # game/script.rpy:5128
    old "No, of course not. Did you not hear anything I said? He never looked through the cameras."
    new "不，当然不是。我刚刚说的话你没听见吗？他根本没看过监控。"

    # game/script.rpy:5133
    old "You're still going with that? I guess you'll never change your mind."
    new "你还是坚持这套说法？看来你是不会改主意了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5138
    old "I understand you can't say that you saw this suitcase since it'd be suspicious you hadn't told us, but you should give up on the lie. It's kind of pathetic."
    new "我明白你没法承认自己见过这只箱子，毕竟之前一直没告诉我们，现在再说反而可疑。但这谎还是别撒了，实在有些难看。"

    # game/script.rpy:5139
    old "If you really didn't see this, it would mean that someone was here after or right before we woke up. It's not impossible, but I don't find it more likely than you lying."
    new "如果你真没看到，那就说明有人在我们醒来之后、或者就在醒来前不久来过这里。这不是不可能，但我不觉得这比你在撒谎更有可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:5144
    old "Katei looked at us. He was asking if we all thought the same, and no replies were heard."
    new "Katei 看向我们。他是在问，我们是不是都这么想。没有人应声。"

    # game/script.rpy:5149
    old "Look at where the cameras are positioned. A bit of smoke covered them, but not enough to block the image completely."
    new "看看摄像头架在什么位置。有些烟雾遮住了镜头，但还不至于把画面完全挡住。"

    # game/script.rpy:5164
    old "One encompasses the bathrooms, and the other records the staircase and elevator. This middle section isn't shown at all. Even if the suitcase was here, I wouldn't have seen it. That's why none of us saw it earlier when we briefly looked through the monitors."
    new "一个拍的是洗手间，另一个拍的是楼梯和电梯。中间这一段根本不在画面里。就算当时箱子已经在这儿，我也看不到。所以刚才我们匆匆扫过监控时，谁都没发现它。"

    # game/script.rpy:5169
    old "I figured you'd say that, but it's only an excuse. If you actually inspected this floor, there's no way you never came across it."
    new "我猜你就会这么说，可这不过是借口。你若是真查过这一层，绝不可能没撞见它。"

    # game/script.rpy:5170
    old "I inspected part of this floor and didn't see it. Not because I didn't come here, but because it wasn't here yet."
    new "我查过这一层的部分区域，没有看到它。不是因为我没来过，而是那时它还不在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:5175
    old "I see. It's a shame the recorded footage just so happened to stop being accessible."
    new "原来如此。可惜偏偏那么巧，录像正好看不了了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5180
    old "You're right, that's unfortunate. It'd be an easy way to prove myself."
    new "你说得对，确实可惜。那本是证明我清白最省事的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:5187
    old "Sai and Isla continued examining the suitcase, but they didn't find anything. No smaller compartments appeared to exist, so it was actually empty."
    new "Sai 和 Isla 继续翻查箱子，却一无所获。箱内似乎没有更小的隔层，确实是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:5188
    old "Look. I can see traces of the smoke."
    new "看，这里有烟雾留下的痕迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:5189
    old "Oh, right. There's no way it was hit directly, though."
    new "哦，对。不过它应该没有被直接喷到吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:5190
    old "Yeah. Perhaps it made contact with it before it had fully faded. I'm not sure."
    new "嗯。也许是在烟雾散尽之前沾上的。我也不确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:5197
    old "Why was it left here, then? If it happened after you looked around, it's a big red flag telling us that someone else is still here."
    new "那它为什么会被留在这里？如果这是在你查看之后才发生的，那就等于明明白白地告诉我们，还有别人留在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:5202
    old "But we already know that. It must've been Naomi.{w} After she did something, she must've wanted to get rid of this and didn't care about leaving it here. It makes sense that she would have disabled the security system before dropping it."
    new "可这一点我们早就知道了。只可能是 Naomi。{w} 她做完那件事之后，想必就想处理掉这个，也不在乎把它丢在这里。她会在丢下它之前先关掉安保系统，这说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:5203
    old "That's stupid. Footage is still being recorded, so I doubt she'd care whether we saw her or not. Especially given that leaving the suitcase after we woke up tells us she's here."
    new "这说法未免太蠢了。录像还在继续拍，我不觉得她会在意我们有没有看到她。何况，她若是在我们醒来后才把行李箱放在那里，就等于告诉我们她还在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:5212
    old "...The culprit must've wanted to get rid of the suitcase as soon as possible since it's linked to the robbery attempt. Suripo did tell us an \"individual\" was found outside with a black suitcase, so being seen with one wouldn't be desirable."
    new "……犯人想必想尽快处理掉那个行李箱，因为它和那起抢劫未遂事件有关。Suripo 确实说过，外面发现过一个带着黑色行李箱的「人」，所以被人看见自己拿着行李箱总归不妙。"

    # game/script.rpy:5213
    old "If Katei is telling the truth, it means that whoever left it here could've only been Naomi or an unknown culprit. ...There's technically another possibility, but it's too ridiculous to consider it seriously."
    new "如果 Katei 说的是真话，那么把行李箱留在这里的人，只可能是 Naomi，或者某个我们不知道的犯人。……严格来说，还有一种可能，但实在荒谬，没必要当真。"

    # game/script.rpy:5221
    old "When we went to the mechanical room, you all stayed together, right?"
    new "我们去机械室的时候，你们一直待在一起吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:5222
    old "For better or worse, Sai had been thinking the same."
    new "也不知是好是坏，Sai 显然也想到了同一个问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:5223
    old "Yes. Nobody left the security room."
    new "是的。没人离开过监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:5228
    old "You want to suspect us this openly? Did you two get separated at all when you left?"
    new "你就这么明目张胆地怀疑我们？你们离开的时候，有没有分开过？"

    # game/script.rpy:5233
    old "N-Now that you mention it, yes.{w} I went to the mechanical room while Atsuki said he would inspect the rest of this floor."
    new "这、这么一说，确实有。{w} 我去了机械室，Atsuki 则说他要去查看这一层剩下的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:5239
    old "Wh-What?"
    new "什、什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:5240
    old "It was a strange sensation, seeing everyone turn to me while I silently waited for Sai to retract what he said."
    new "大家一齐看向我，而我默默等着 Sai 收回刚才那句话——那种感觉说不出的古怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:5243
    old "...He's messing with you."
    new "……他在耍你们。"

    # game/script.rpy:5249
    old "Probably. We didn't get separated."
    new "多半是。我们并没有分开。"

    # game/script.rpy:5254
    old "You aren't being funny."
    new "这并不好笑。"

    # game/script.rpy:5259
    old "Well, I'm just surprised you don't find us suspicious."
    new "我只是有点意外，你们居然不觉得我们可疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:5264
    old "Why would we? Even though you left, that's not enough of a reason."
    new "为什么要怀疑？你们虽然离开过，但那不足以成为理由。"

    # game/script.rpy:5269
    old "Ah, no. That's not what I meant. I think you have a good reason to suspect us.{w} Don't you remember when we got back? We said we'd gone to the bathroom, didn't we?"
    new "啊，不，我不是那个意思。我觉得你们有充分的理由怀疑我们。{w} 你还记得我们回来的时候吗？我们说过去洗手间了，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:5274
    old "Did you? I didn't hear you from under the desk."
    new "有吗？我就待在桌子底下，可没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:5279
    old "I bet you regret not accusing us first, then."
    new "那你现在一定后悔没先指控我们了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5284
    old "Did we go to the bathroom and miss this suitcase? It could be Katei was right and it wasn't here yet."
    new "难道我们去洗手间的时候，正好错过了这个行李箱？也许 Katei 说得对，那时候它还不在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:5285
    old "...Don't take him seriously. We didn't go."
    new "……别听他的。我们没去。"

    # game/script.rpy:5290
    old "Of course. Katei wouldn't really tell the truth, would he? Admittedly, we were a bit late, so we agreed we'd say that so we weren't suspected of anything."
    new "当然。Katei 怎么可能真说实话呢？不过我们确实来晚了一点，所以商量好那么说，免得被人怀疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:5291
    old "We never came here, but I knew we should've. Didn't I tell you?"
    new "我们根本没来过这里，可我知道我们本该来一趟。我不是跟你说过吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:5296
    old "So you accuse me of lying and immediately admit to lying yourself. Your arguments keep falling apart."
    new "你指控我说谎，转头又承认自己在撒谎。你的说法根本站不住脚。"

    # game/script.rpy:5297
    old "...We don't really have a way to know when this was left here, but I'd say it's likely it wasn't one of us. It must've been left by the people behind the attack."
    new "……我们确实没法知道这东西是什么时候留在这里的，不过我看多半不是我们当中的人。应该是袭击事件的幕后之人留下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:5298
    old "Right, and most likely before we woke up. There could be a reason why they had to leave it here."
    new "对，而且很可能是在我们醒来之前。他们不得不把它留在这里，说不定有什么原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:5304
    old "...Like what?"
    new "……什么原因？"

    # game/script.rpy:5310
    old "No clue. I'm only saying that because the smoke wasn't released here. Even though this exact spot isn't recorded, whoever left the suitcase must've been seen by one of these two cameras."
    new "不清楚。我之所以这么说，只是因为这里没有释放烟雾。虽然这个位置本身没被拍到，但放下行李箱的人一定被这两台摄像头中的某一台拍到过。"

    # game/script.rpy:5311
    old "If you wanted to dispose of something incriminating, I'd say you'd do it in a place without cameras, and there are many."
    new "如果想处理掉什么见不得光的东西，总该挑没有摄像头的地方吧？而这里没摄像头的地方多得是。"

    # game/script.rpy:5317
    old "That's true. If it was put here after Katei inspected this floor, whoever did it is back to hiding."
    new "有道理。如果是在 Katei 检查完这一层之后才放下的，那动手的人现在又躲回去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5322
    old "Which is why we should keep investigating. Let's finish checking the crystal floor and move up."
    new "所以我们才要继续查。先把水晶层检查完，再往上走。"

    # game/script.rpy:5332
    old "The bathrooms were empty, so we were ready to move on. Regarding the suitcase, we weren't sure what to think, but we didn't take it with us.{w} The location where it had been discarded was the only information we had to work with. I didn't want to think too deeply into every detail, but something came to mind."
    new "洗手间里空无一人，我们便准备继续调查。至于那个行李箱，我们不知道该怎么判断，但也没有把它带走。{w} 唯一可供我们推敲的线索，就是它被丢弃的地点。我本不想对每个细节想得太深，可有个念头还是冒了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:5333
    old "It could be that Katei was right this time. The location someone chose to leave the suitcase was one we hadn't yet been in.{w} If the culprit left it there before we woke up, I can't think of a reason why they wouldn't have left it in one of the two main hallways. After all, the plan only involved them and the event room at a glance. At no point was it necessary to enter hallway C, which has security cameras."
    new "也许这一次 Katei 说对了。留下行李箱的人所选的地点，正是我们还没去过的地方。{w} 如果犯人在我们醒来之前就把它留在那里，我想不出他们为什么不干脆放在两条主走廊中的一条。毕竟表面上看，整个计划只涉及他们和活动室。根本没有必要进入装有监控摄像头的 C走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:5336
    old "I felt someone might've been nearby and had known we hadn't yet been in hallway C. They'd chosen it so that we couldn't be sure it hadn't been there the whole time. If they'd known we couldn't access the saved footage anymore, they could've tricked us. If they'd left it in one of the two parallel hallways instead, we would've immediately known it wasn't there before."
    new "我觉得，也许有人就在附近，而且知道我们还没去过 C走廊。对方选在那里，就是为了让我们无法确定行李箱是不是从一开始就在。如果对方知道我们已经调不出保存的录像，就能借此误导我们。可要是把行李箱留在两条平行走廊中的任意一条，我们立刻就能知道它之前并不在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:5337
    old "In addition, that spot wasn't in range of any of the cameras, so we couldn't have seen it while we'd been in the security room.{w} ...But the trick wouldn't work on Katei, who'd already inspected the area."
    new "此外，那个位置不在任何摄像头的拍摄范围内，所以我们待在监控室时不可能看到它。{w} ……但这套把戏对已经检查过那片区域的 Katei 不起作用。"

    # game/script.rpy:5338
    old "However, there was a plethora of reasons to believe he was lying. The culprit could've known that Katei had never been in hallway C, and unaware he had lied about it, placed the suitcase to trick him as well."
    new "然而，有太多理由让人相信他在说谎。犯人也可能知道 Katei 从未进过 C走廊，却不知道 Katei 在这件事上撒了谎，于是把行李箱放在那里，想连他一起骗过。"

    # game/script.rpy:5339
    old "There weren't many better places to do that. It was true that upper floors existed, but according to Katei, they weren't open to the public. No matter the way I thought about it, it was baffling that it hadn't been left in a room without cameras like the storeroom."
    new "比那更合适的地方并不多。楼上确实还有楼层，但据 Katei 说，那些地方并不对公众开放。可无论怎么想，我还是不明白，为什么它没有被留在储藏室那种没有摄像头的房间里。"

    # game/script.rpy:5344
    old "I thought about it as we entered hallway B, and an ominous feeling hit me. If I was right, someone else trapped there was still very close to us."
    new "我们走进 B走廊时，我仍在想这件事，一股不祥的预感忽然袭来。如果我没猜错，还有另一个人被困在这里，而且离我们很近。"

    # game/script.rpy:5353
    old "We walked to the first room, which had a sign stuck on its door. When we removed the smoke dust on it, we saw an image of a mop and a bucket."
    new "我们走到第一个房间前，门上贴着一块标牌。擦掉上面的烟尘后，我们看到一幅拖把和水桶的图案。"

    # game/script.rpy:5363
    old "As you see, the cleaning cart is left here when it's not in use, alongside cleaning products and items."
    new "如你们所见，清洁推车不用的时候就放在这里，和清洁用品之类的杂物放在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:5364
    old "Yeah, there's probably nothing of importance here. It's not a big room."
    new "嗯，这里应该没什么重要的东西。房间也不大。"

    # game/script.rpy:5365
    old "Akaro was the first to step inside and glance around. As he'd said, the room was small and only served the obvious purpose of storing cleaning materials. After stepping in and out, we all agreed and silently moved on to the crystal rooms in hallway B."
    new "Akaro 第一个走进去，环视了一圈。正如他所说，房间很小，显然只是用来存放清洁用品。我们进去看过后都表示同意，便默默前往 B走廊的水晶展室。"

    # game/script.rpy:5374
    old "We had the first one in front—B6. Once Katei and Isla made sure nothing was off, we moved to the next door."
    new "第一间就在我们面前——B6。Katei 和 Isla 确认没有异常后，我们走向下一扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:5385
    old "This is the staff room, right?"
    new "这是员工室吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:5390
    old "Yes. Visitors are not supposed to go in, but it's not locked."
    new "没错。访客按理不能进去，不过门没锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:5395
    old "So we can't go in?"
    new "那我们不能进去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:5400
    old "Don't worry. It's fine under the circumstances."
    new "别担心。这种情况下进去也没关系。"

    # game/script.rpy:5403
    old "Katei opened the door. Behind it, we saw another small room, different than all the others we'd been in."
    new "Katei 推开门。门后又是一间小屋，和我们之前进过的所有房间都不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:5416
    old "Every staff member has their own space here. We use it to leave and pick up personal objects, and it's where we store our uniforms before heading off."
    new "每位员工在这里都有自己的空间，用来存放和取用私人物品，下班前也会把制服放在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:5421
    old "I see. So the belongings of some employees are still in these lockers."
    new "原来如此。所以有些员工的物品还留在这几个储物柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:5422
    old "Isla soon stopped looking interested, but for the rest of us, it was the most notable room yet."
    new "Isla 很快就不太感兴趣了，但对我们其余人来说，这却是目前为止最引人注意的房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:5423
    old "Yes, but everyone tends to lock them."
    new "是啊，不过大家一般都会上锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:5428
    old "Let's see if any are open."
    new "去看看有没有哪个没上锁吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:5433
    old "I'm not sure we should. We might get in trouble."
    new "我觉得还是别这么做。说不定会惹上麻烦。"

    # game/script.rpy:5434
    old "You kidding me? There could be a phone or something in here. I'd call that incredibly useful."
    new "开什么玩笑？这里面说不定有电话之类的。那可太有用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5435
    old "As I said, they're not usually left open. You can check if you want."
    new "我说过了，这些柜子平时都锁着。你要想查，尽管去看。"

    # game/script.rpy:5438
    old "Sai went ahead and tried to open every locker.{w} Shortly, we confirmed that Katei was right: they were all locked tight."
    new "Sai 径直上前，试着逐个打开储物柜。{w}没过多久我们就证实 Katei 说得没错：所有柜子都锁得严严实实。"

    # game/script.rpy:5445
    old "You have your own locker, right? Do you keep anything that could be useful in it?"
    new "你也有自己的储物柜吧？里面有没有放什么能派上用场的东西？"

    # game/script.rpy:5446
    old "No. They do allow us to bring phones in as long as we keep them here, but I never bring mine. Right now, the only thing in my locker should be my coat."
    new "没有。他们确实允许我们带手机进来，只要把手机放在这里，不过我从来不带。现在我的柜子里应该只有一件外套。"

    # game/script.rpy:5451
    old "Can we see it?"
    new "能让我们看看吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:5456
    old "You want to see my coat?"
    new "你想看我的外套？"

    # game/script.rpy:5461
    old "Partly yes, but I also want to see the lack of other things."
    new "算是吧，不过我也想确认里面没有别的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:5466
    old "Do you still think I'm lying? Very well, it's good that this is something I can easily prove."
    new "你还觉得我在说谎？也好，这件事我正好能轻易证明。"

    # game/script.rpy:5467
    old "Katei took a few keys out of his pocket. One of them was the one he'd used to unlock the security room."
    new "Katei 从口袋里取出几把钥匙。其中一把正是他之前用来打开监控室的那把。"

    # game/script.rpy:5470
    old "He inserted a small one into a locker and turned it. Without a problem, he opened the door and showed us what was inside."
    new "他把其中一把小钥匙插进储物柜，转动了一下。他顺利打开柜门，让我们看里面的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:5476
    old "We could only see a coat, but Katei went ahead and brought it out to show that nothing else was hidden behind it. He went as far as to show us every empty pocket."
    new "里面只能看到一件外套，但 Katei 还是把它取了出来，证明后面没有藏别的东西。他甚至把每个空口袋都翻给我们看。"

    # game/script.rpy:5479
    old "You see? I understand it's easy to suspect me, but I've only been telling the truth."
    new "看到了吧？我知道我很容易让人起疑，可我一直说的都是实话。"

    # game/script.rpy:5484
    old "One truth doesn't make up for all the previous lies. Certainly, if the contents of your locker were harmful to you, you would've claimed not to have any."
    new "一次实话弥补不了之前所有的谎话。更何况，若柜里的东西会对你不利，你自然会一口咬定里面什么都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:5489
    old "I really can't make you happy. Do you have more requests that would prove my sincerity?"
    new "我实在没法让你满意。你还想让我做什么，来证明我的诚意？"

    # game/script.rpy:5494
    old "No, not really."
    new "没有了，没什么要求。"

    # game/script.rpy:5497
    old "Katei put the coat back inside and locked it up again."
    new "Katei 把外套放回去，又重新锁上了柜子。"

    # game/script.rpy:5502
    old "All the lockers were very tall and had an extra smaller compartment in their upper part. Three horizontal bars could be seen in the metallic doors, slits that allowed us to somewhat see the interior of those smaller compartments. However, I couldn't spot anything of importance, as the darkness concealed what was in them."
    new "所有储物柜都很高，上半部另有一个较小的隔层。金属门上可见三道横向细缝，透过缝隙勉强能窥见小隔层内部。只是里面黑漆漆的，我什么要紧的东西都没看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:5505
    old "Everyone was listening closely to the conversations between Katei and Sai. Sai had continually reiterated that Katei was openly lying to us, so it was no surprise that they wanted to form their own thoughts."
    new "所有人都在仔细听着 Katei 和 Sai 的对话。Sai 一再重申 Katei 在当面撒谎，大家想自己判断也不足为奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:5506
    old "Sai knew nothing would be found inside the locker, so I suspect he wanted to see that coat. If it was the same one he'd seen Katei wearing in the lobby, it could back up his identity."
    new "Sai 知道柜子里找不到什么，所以我猜他想看的是那件外套。如果那正是他在大厅里见过 Katei 穿的那件，就能佐证 Katei 的身份。"

    # game/script.rpy:5507
    old "Since he didn't react to it, it's fair to assume it was the same one, but it doesn't settle anything. One extra step of his impersonation plan could've involved changing the locker's contents while we were unconscious."
    new "既然他没什么反应，姑且可以认为就是同一件，但这说明不了什么。若他真要冒充，完全可能趁我们昏迷时把柜里的东西换掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:5511
    old "Could there be a way to force open the lockers? One of them must be Naomi's, so it'd be interesting to look inside it."
    new "有没有办法强行打开储物柜？其中一个肯定是 Naomi 的，看看里面应该会很有意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:5516
    old "What? No, please don't think about that. There are no tools to do it with, the lockers are quite sturdy, and I'm sure Ashiya would not be happy about it."
    new "什么？不行，请别打这个主意。这里没有能用的工具，柜子也很结实，而且我敢肯定芦屋不会乐意看到这种事。"

    # game/script.rpy:5517
    old "Similarly, I'm not happy with spending twelve boring hours here without getting to conclusions. Right now, Naomi is very suspicious."
    new "同样，我也不想在这里无聊地耗上十二个小时，最后却什么结论都没有。眼下 Naomi 的嫌疑很大。"

    # game/script.rpy:5518
    old "And what if she is? What do you think you'll find inside her locker? I'm letting you overstep a little. You shouldn't be allowed in this room, but I will not be giving you free reign. Please, get this idea out of your head."
    new "就算她可疑又怎样？你觉得她柜子里能找到什么？我已经让你越界了一点。这间屋子本来不该让你进，但我不会让你为所欲为。请把这个念头打消吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:5523
    old "I'll keep thinking whatever I want, but I agree. It'd probably be a worthless hassle. If Naomi is the culprit, she must know how suspicious she is, so she wouldn't have left anything relevant in her locker."
    new "我想怎么想是我的事，不过这点我同意。那多半只是白费力气。如果 Naomi 真是犯人，她肯定知道自己有多可疑，不会把相关的东西留在柜子里。"

    # game/script.rpy:5524
    old "...That's what I'm saying."
    new "……我就是这个意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:5525
    old "Isla tugged at Erina's clothes."
    new "Isla 拽了拽 Erina 的衣角。"

    # game/script.rpy:5530
    old "Let's go. There's nothing in here..."
    new "走吧。这里什么都没有……"

    # game/script.rpy:5547
    old "We kept moving at a good pace until we had searched through the remaining five crystal rooms in hallway B. They all looked the same, and nothing felt out of place."
    new "我们保持着较快的步速，搜完了 B走廊里剩下的五间水晶展室。它们看起来都一样，也没有任何不对劲的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:5555
    old "This is it. We knew that if someone was hiding, it wouldn't be easy to find them."
    new "到此为止了。我们本就清楚，若真有人藏着，也不会轻易被找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:5560
    old "Yeah. It's already past {time=10.} One more person is confirmed to be with us, so if she hasn't appeared yet, she must not intend to show herself."
    new "是啊。现在已经过了 {time=10.}。已经确认还有一个人和我们在一起，如果她还没露面，那多半是不打算现身了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5561
    old "...Sai and I considered that Naomi's body might've been hidden. If that's what happened, it's likely no one else is hiding. The main point that indicates otherwise is the suitcase, but if Katei lied about it, he could be the one who hid Naomi."
    new "……我和 Sai 也考虑过，Naomi 的尸体可能被人藏了起来。若真是如此，恐怕就没有别人藏着了。唯一能推翻这个推断的，是那只手提箱；可如果 Katei 在手提箱的事上撒谎，藏起 Naomi 的人也许就是他。"

    # game/script.rpy:5567
    old "We'll have to move up, then. We might find something on the higher floors."
    new "那我们就得往上走了。楼上也许能找到线索。"

    # game/script.rpy:5568
    old "Our priority should be to understand the structure of this place and find Naomi. We'll have many hours to go after that, which won't make it easy for anyone to stay hidden."
    new "我们的首要任务是弄清这里的结构，并找到 Naomi。之后还有很多时间，到那时谁想一直藏着就没那么容易了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5574
    old "We approached the hallway C staircase."
    new "我们走向 C走廊的楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:5581
    old "Only employees ever go to the other floors. The structure of this building is like this..."
    new "只有员工才会去其他楼层。这栋楼的结构是这样的……"

    # game/script.rpy:5582
    old "Right now, we are on the crystal floor. The five floors above us are offices, and they were empty during the attack."
    new "我们现在在水晶层。上面五层都是办公室，袭击发生时那里没有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:5587
    old "Why are there so many offices?"
    new "为什么会有这么多办公室？"

    # game/script.rpy:5592
    old "When the structure of the building was first expanded, it served the purpose of containing many offices that worked for Ashiya. This was before they thought of using the lowest floor as a sort of museum."
    new "这栋楼最初扩建时，就是为了容纳许多为芦屋服务的办公部门。那时他们还没想到把最底层改成类似博物馆的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:5597
    old "That was the case for a while, until the perception people had of this place shifted to what it is now: the single remaining entity of Ashiya in Yushibana and a tourist attraction point."
    new "这种情况持续了一段时间，直到人们对这里的印象逐渐变成了如今的模样：芦屋在丰花唯一留存的设施，也是一处旅游景点。"

    # game/script.rpy:5598
    old "Nowadays, not many people who work in the offices remain, and they closed entirely just this December. Ashiya doesn't make much use of them anymore, so they might disappear and be reworked eventually."
    new "如今在办公室工作的人已经不多，而且这些办公室今年十二月刚刚全部关闭。芦屋已经不怎么使用它们，所以它们说不定迟早会被撤掉、重新改造。"

    # game/script.rpy:5599
    old "The seventh floor is the Ashiya floor, also called the attic. I explained that one earlier."
    new "七楼是芦屋层，也叫阁楼。那一层我之前解释过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5604
    old "Can we go in there?"
    new "我们能进去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:5609
    old "There's no way. As I said, I've never entered it, and only a handful of people who remain here have. Ashiya are very fond of it since it's where they once lived, or at least that's what they claim. Regardless of the reason, they want to preserve it well."
    new "不行。我说过了，我从没进去过，留在这里的人里也只有少数几个进去过。芦屋家非常珍视那里，因为那里曾是他们的住处——至少他们是这么说的。不管出于什么原因，他们都想把它妥善保存下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:5614
    old "How would we go about getting in?"
    new "我们要怎么才能进去？"

    # game/script.rpy:5615
    old "Like most places, you enter with a key. One that I don't have."
    new "和大多数地方一样，得有钥匙才能进去。而我手上没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:5618
    old "Katei pointed his finger up the stairs, where a door prevented us from making it all the way up."
    new "Katei 抬手指向楼梯上方，那里有一扇门挡着，我们没法一路走到顶。"

    # game/script.rpy:5627
    old "I have the key for this one since it only keeps us from accessing the offices."
    new "这扇门的钥匙我这儿有，它只是用来拦着不让人进办公区而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:5630
    old "He walked up and inserted another key of his in the keyhole. As he'd already done twice, he turned it."
    new "他走上前，把自己的另一把钥匙插进锁孔，像前两次那样拧了一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:5631
    old "Unlike previously, however, the door didn't appear to smoothly unlock."
    new "可这一次，门并没有像先前那样顺畅地打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:5632
    old "What? It's not letting me."
    new "怎么回事？拧不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:5637
    old "Hold on."
    new "等等。"

    # game/script.rpy:5640
    old "Sai stepped up to him, twisted the knob, and pushed the door forward."
    new "Sai 走上前，转动门把手，把门推开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5641
    old "It was open."
    new "门本来就没锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:5642
    old "O-Oh... That's strange. Sometimes this door is left open, but it's weird that it was now. Nobody has worked upstairs for two weeks."
    new "啊、啊……这就怪了。这扇门有时候确实会忘了锁，可偏偏是现在……楼上已经两个星期没人办公了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5643
    old "It's not really strange. Naomi also had the key, right? It just means that she probably opened it or someone did with her key. If it was you, you're not very good at remembering whether you locked a door."
    new "倒也没什么好奇怪的。Naomi 也有钥匙吧？那多半就是她开的门，或者是别人拿了她的钥匙开的。要是你自己开的，那你记性可真成问题，连门锁没锁都记不住。"

    # game/script.rpy:5651
    old "I'll ask one more time so you guys understand it better. Katei, you did not see anyone when you looked through the security cameras, right?"
    new "我再问一遍，好让你们都清楚。Katei，你看监控的时候，没看到任何人，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:5656
    old "...Correct."
    new "……没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:5661
    old "Then, once again, that's strange. It's very likely someone unlocked this door and went through it. If they wanted to hide from us, they wouldn't have done so on this floor, meaning that it's likely they went up some floors before we woke up and while you were allegedly in the security room."
    new "那就又说不通了。多半是有人打开这扇门，从这里过去了。对方要是想躲着我们，就不会停在这一层——也就是说，很可能在我们醒来之前、也就是你自称待在监控室的那段时间里，对方已经往上走了好几层。"

    # game/script.rpy:5666
    old "You won't stop trying to find ways to frame me, will you?{w} You're wrong. They would've known I was inside the security room and must've only gone up when they saw I'd left it."
    new "你非要把一切都往我身上套才肯罢休，是吧？{w}你错了。他们知道我就在监控室里，一定是看见我离开了才往上走的。"

    # game/script.rpy:5672
    old "Katei was right. Sai's thoughts operated under the assumption that Katei hadn't been in the room, so he hadn't considered that simple angle."
    new "Katei 说得对。Sai 的思路一直建立在「Katei 不在监控室」这个前提上，所以没往这个简单的角度想。"

    # game/script.rpy:5677
    old "Well, let's go up. I bet the person we're searching for is currently above us."
    new "好了，先上去吧。我敢说我们要找的人现在就在我们上面。"

    # game/script.rpy:5681
    old "We began to climb up the stairs."
    new "我们开始顺着楼梯往上走。"

    # game/script.rpy:5686
    old "Can't we take the elevator? There's a lot of stairs to get to the top, right?"
    new "我们不能坐电梯吗？上去得爬不少楼梯吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:5694
    old "The elevator...? I'm not sure that'd be appropriate."
    new "电梯……？我觉得那样不太合适。"

    # game/script.rpy:5695
    old "We all slowly stepped down. We had entirely ignored the elevator."
    new "我们都慢慢从楼梯上退了下来。我们之前完全忘了电梯这回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:5700
    old "There shouldn't be an issue."
    new "应该没什么问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:5701
    old "The elevator door was fully metallic, so we weren't able to see the inside without opening it. Next to it was the button to call it with, and nowhere did it indicate whether it was being used or on which floor it was situated."
    new "电梯门是全金属的，不打开就看不到里面。门旁只有呼叫按钮，没有任何地方显示它是否正在使用，或者停在哪一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:5704
    old "Katei called it quietly. Many seconds later, the button lit up for a second, indicating that the elevator had arrived. Then, Katei opened the door, exposing an empty and narrow interior."
    new "Katei 轻轻按下了呼叫按钮。过了好几秒，按钮亮了一瞬，说明电梯到了。随后 Katei 拉开门，露出空无一人的狭小轿厢。"

    # game/script.rpy:5713
    old "It wasn't on this floor... It took a while, so it must've been pretty high up."
    new "它刚才不在这一层……等了好一会儿，说明它停得挺高。"

    # game/script.rpy:5723
    old "That doesn't mean anything, does it? It could've been up before today's event even started."
    new "那也说明不了什么吧？今天这场活动开始之前，它可能就一直停在上面了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5724
    old "You're right. Katei, do you happen to know where the elevator should've been?"
    new "说得也是。Katei，你知道这电梯本来该停在哪一层吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:5725
    old "Not at all. I didn't have the night shift, and I didn't see it being used."
    new "完全不知道。我昨晚没值班，也没见有人用过。"

    # game/script.rpy:5726
    old "It'd be good to know when it last moved."
    new "要是能知道它上次是什么时候动的就好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5733
    old "Doesn't this elevator bypass the door in the middle of the staircase?"
    new "这部电梯不是能绕过楼梯中间那扇门吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:5738
    old "Yes, it does."
    new "对，能绕过。"

    # game/script.rpy:5744
    old "Then what's the point of locking it...?"
    new "那锁上它还有什么意义……？"

    # game/script.rpy:5745
    old "I just said that it's not unusual for it to be left unlocked. In the past, when the offices were actively used, measures were stricter. Since nothing ever happened, everyone started to be more lenient, often leaving the door unlocked."
    new "我刚才说了，那扇门没锁也不算稀奇。以前办公室还在正常使用的时候，管理要严得多。后来一直没出过事，大家也就松懈下来，常常不锁门。"

    # game/script.rpy:5750
    old "A similar change occurred to the elevator. Look inside."
    new "电梯也有类似的变化。你们往里看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:5761
    old "We all peeked in. What Katei was referring to was above the floor buttons."
    new "我们都探头往里看。Katei 指的是楼层按钮上方。"

    # game/script.rpy:5766
    old "Keyholes? Do you need a key to make the elevator move?"
    new "锁孔？难道要让电梯动起来还得用钥匙？"

    # game/script.rpy:5771
    old "In the past, you needed the same key that opens the door to reach floors 2 to 6 from here. That regulation was removed since the door was continuously left open and there were some complaints about it being pointless."
    new "以前要从这里上到 2 至 6 层，得用开那扇门的那把钥匙。后来门总是不锁，也有人抱怨这规定形同虚设，这条规矩就取消了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5772
    old "However, this other keyhole is still mandatory. To reach floor 7—the attic—a special key is needed. The same key opens the door that leads up to it."
    new "不过另一个锁孔还是得用钥匙。要上到 7 层——也就是阁楼——就得用一把专用钥匙。通往阁楼的那扇门，用的也是同一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:5773
    old "So that's the only floor we can't get to at all."
    new "也就是说，那是我们唯一无论如何都上不去的楼层。"

    # game/script.rpy:5774
    old "Right."
    new "没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:5781
    old "Isla hopped into the elevator by herself, causing Erina to gasp slightly."
    new "Isla 自己一个人跳进了电梯，Erina 轻轻倒吸了一口气。"

    # game/script.rpy:5787
    old "This is interesting, actually."
    new "其实，这事挺有意思的。"

    # game/script.rpy:5788
    old "...What is?"
    new "……什么有意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:5793
    old "Well, whoever went up to hide from us used the door instead of the elevator."
    new "你想，不管是谁上去躲我们，走的都是那扇门，而不是电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:5798
    old "You're right. They wouldn't have needed to."
    new "没错。他们本来也用不着坐电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:5803
    old "I don't think so, at least. If it's true that it should've been locked, by leaving it unlocked, they're telling us they possess the key.{w} Naomi wouldn't do that purposely because it makes her suspicious. It's possible someone who's not a staff member unlocked the door."
    new "至少我不这么认为。假如那扇门本该锁着，他们却让它开着，就等于告诉我们：钥匙在他们手上。{w}Naomi 不会故意这么做，那只会让自己惹上嫌疑。所以，开门的也可能不是这里的工作人员。"

    # game/script.rpy:5804
    old "I see what you mean. There could've been a reason why they didn't use the elevator instead."
    new "我明白你的意思了。他们之所以不走电梯，也许另有原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:5805
    old "For example?"
    new "比如说？"

    # game/script.rpy:5806
    old "Well, if the elevator wasn't on this floor, and the culprit knew it while they were in a hurry, they would've gone through the door instead of waiting for the elevator to arrive."
    new "如果电梯当时不在这层，犯人又急着走，也知道这一点，那就会直接走门，不会等电梯上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:5811
    old "I suppose so."
    new "大概吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:5814
    old "It's a bit strange they didn't lock the door behind them, but there's any number of reasons for that."
    new "他们没顺手把门锁上，这点是有些奇怪，不过理由要多少有多少。"

    # game/script.rpy:5815
    old "Hm. This should help us visualize this person's movements a bit more."
    new "嗯。这样一来，那个人的行动路线就更容易想象出来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:5820
    old "Are we going to go up?"
    new "我们要上去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:5826
    old "Don't be impatient. We can't all go up at once."
    new "别急。我们没法一次全都上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:5827
    old "With Katei keeping the door open, I was able to see why he'd said that. Inside the elevator was a sign indicating the number of people that could board it before the weight could prove a problem."
    new "Katei 扶着门，我才明白他为什么这么说。电梯里贴着一块标牌，写着最多可乘坐的人数，以免超重。"

    # game/script.rpy:5832
    old "Only four of us can be inside at once. It's a fairly old elevator.{w} The stairs really aren't so bad, so let's walk up."
    new "一次最多只能进四个人。这电梯有些年头了。{w}楼梯也没那么难走，我们还是走上去吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:5837
    old "No! I wanna use the elevator."
    new "不要！我就要坐电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:5838
    old "...We hadn't yet had an issue with Isla's behavior, so we didn't want something so trivial to put an end to that."
    new "……Isla 至今还没在行为上给我们添过麻烦，我们也不希望因为这种小事就破坏了这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:5842
    old "Sweetie, come on. We can't demand things like this."
    new "乖，别这样。不能这么提要求。"

    # game/script.rpy:5847
    old "I wanna use the elevator... If not, I can just stay on this floor and go back to the Sekimeiya."
    new "我就要坐电梯……不然我就留在这层，回 Sekimeiya 那边去。"

    # game/script.rpy:5857
    old "It's fine. We've already spent a while investigating, and it's getting old. Let's move it along."
    new "算了。已经查了这么久，再拖下去也没意思。就这么办吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:5858
    old "If someone's hiding from us and we want to find them, we won't accomplish it if we stay together. The culprit has an elevator, stairs, and knowledge of the layout. Much like on this floor, they could easily avoid us."
    new "要是有人躲着我们，而我们也想把人找出来，一直待在一起是找不到的。犯人能坐电梯、能走楼梯，也熟悉这里的布局。就像在这层一样，他们很容易就能避开我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:5859
    old "To speed it up and increase our chances of finding them, let's split into two groups."
    new "为了加快进度、也提高找到人的几率，我们分成两组行动吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:5860
    old "Weren't you against that earlier?"
    new "你之前不是反对分头行动吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:5865
    old "I'm fine with it depending on the groups. Isla and Erina will take the elevator up to the sixth floor. As long as Atsuki and Shiroya go up with them, it should be all right."
    new "只要分组得当，我就没意见。Isla 和 Erina 坐电梯上六楼，只要 Atsuki 和 Shiroya 跟着一起去，应该就没问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:5871
    old "Why us?"
    new "为什么是我们？"

    # game/script.rpy:5874
    old "To isolate the least suspicious people, of course. A problem with splitting up would be if someone could take advantage of it before we're able to thoroughly inspect this building. Katei, Akaro, and I will start with floor 2 and progress upward until we meet you guys again."
    new "当然是为了把嫌疑最小的人单独分出去。分头行动的风险在于，在我们把这栋楼彻底查清之前，有人可能趁机钻空子。Katei、Akaro 和我从二楼开始往上查，直到和你们会合。"

    # game/script.rpy:5879
    old "Okay!"
    new "好！"

    # game/script.rpy:5880
    old "Is that a good idea...?"
    new "这样安排真的妥当吗……"

    # game/script.rpy:5885
    old "Any reason why it's a bad one?"
    new "有什么不妥的地方吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:5886
    old "It's fine by me, but we don't have to do it like this. We could use the elevator twice or simply take it to the second floor."
    new "我倒是没意见，只是不必非得这么安排。电梯可以分两趟用，或者干脆先坐到二楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:5887
    old "I looked at everyone else, and their reactions indicated indifference toward Sai's arrangement. It was true that it'd increase our speed and chances of finding the culprit, and as long as Isla's whim was satisfied, she wouldn't complain."
    new "我看了看其余的人，他们对 Sai 的安排似乎都不以为意。这样确实能加快速度，也更容易找到犯人，而且只要顺了 Isla 的性子，她就不会再有怨言。"

    # game/script.rpy:5892
    old "All right, let's go."
    new "好，走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:5897
    old "Sai went up the stairs and quickly disappeared from my field of vision. Akaro and Katei followed him, and I held the door Katei had kept open until then."
    new "Sai 上了楼梯，转眼就从我的视野里消失了。Akaro 和 Katei 跟在他后面，我扶住了 Katei 一直撑着的那扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:5901
    old "...Let's go too."
    new "……我们也走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:5911
    old "Isla went in first, followed by her mother. After Shiroya had entered, I boarded it last and closed the door behind us."
    new "Isla 先进去，她母亲跟在后面。Shiroya 进去之后，我最后一个上电梯，关上了身后的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:5918
    old "This isn't exactly spacious. I'm surprised it's supposed to support four people."
    new "这地方算不上宽敞。真没想到它居然能装下四个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:5919
    old "In the cramped space, Shiroya moved her finger up to the floor 6 button. Admittedly, she was right, since Isla didn't occupy the space of an adult and ended up buried in the back."
    new "在这狭小的空间里，Shiroya 抬手按下了六楼的按钮。她说的倒也没错，Isla 占不了成年人那么大的地方，结果被挤在了最里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:5920
    old "As soon as the button was pressed, the translucent secondary doors closed, and we slowly began to rise."
    new "按钮一按下，半透明的内层门便合上了，我们开始缓缓上升。"

    # game/script.rpy:5933
    old "{w=0.6}The elevator didn't shake at all, so we only knew we were moving because of the screechy noise the ropes above us were making."
    new "{w=0.6}电梯没有一点晃动，我们只能靠头顶钢索发出的刺耳声响判断它在移动。"

    # game/script.rpy:5939
    old "{w=0.6}They were a quiet few seconds, and since the doors to the other floors were fully opaque, they were also dim. I felt a vague sense of claustrophobia for the first time since we had awakened."
    new "{w=0.6}那几秒钟里一片安静，通往其他楼层的门都完全不透光，光线也很暗。醒来之后，我第一次隐约感到一阵幽闭的压迫感。"

    # game/script.rpy:5948
    old "{w=0.6}Once the elevator slowed down and we were allowed to leave, I opened the door that would lead us to an unknown place."
    new "{w=0.6}等电梯减速停下、门可以打开时，我推开了那扇通往未知之处的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:5960
    old "Line Art"
    new "线稿"

    # game/script.rpy:5963
    old "{w=0.6}We stepped out and looked around us. A long hallway composed of calm colors extended far ahead."
    new "{w=0.6}我们走出电梯，环顾四周。一条色调沉静的走廊向远处延伸。"

    # game/script.rpy:5968
    old "...Is this really the same building?"
    new "……这真的还是同一栋楼吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:5969
    old "Compared to what we'd seen downstairs, it was far more pleasant. We even felt a slight cold breeze that alleviated some of the tension we'd been accumulating."
    new "和楼下见到的景象相比，这里让人舒服得多。甚至有一丝凉风拂过，稍稍缓解了我们一路积攒的紧张。"

    # game/script.rpy:5976
    old "More bathrooms?"
    new "又有洗手间？"

    # game/script.rpy:5981
    old "Since people used to work here, there might be two on every floor."
    new "以前有人在这里上班，也许每层都有两间。"

    # game/script.rpy:5987
    old "Outside the elevator, we found ourselves in a wide corridor that only contained a few potted plants. At our right were the bathrooms and the staircase that led to floor 5."
    new "电梯外是一条宽敞的走廊，里面只摆着几盆绿植。右手边是洗手间，还有通往五楼的楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:5992
    old "I suppose we should look around."
    new "还是先四处看看吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:5998
    old "The other three entered their bathroom while I stepped into the men's by myself. Like the one on the crystal floor, it was spacious, but only contained a sink with a mirror, a garbage bin, and a toilet. It was immediately evident that I was the only person inside."
    new "另外三人进了女洗手间，我独自走进男洗手间。这间和水晶楼层那间一样宽敞，里面却只有一个带镜子的洗手台、一个垃圾桶和一个马桶。一眼就能看出，里面只有我一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:5999
    old "Although a potentially dangerous culprit might've been hiding from us, I loosened up a little. The thought of looking through those huge floors without restriction released some strain from my body, which allowed me to think about needs that had disappeared from my mind, like using the bathroom for its intended purpose."
    new "明知可能有危险的犯人正躲着我们，我还是松了口气。想到可以不受限制地搜查那几层偌大的楼层，身上的紧绷感便消散了些，也让我想起了先前被抛在脑后的需求——比如好好上一趟洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:6006
    old "Outside, I found the others waiting for me behind the door, and we went ahead to see if anything of importance awaited us nearby."
    new "出门后，我看到其他人都在门外等我，于是我们继续往前走，看看附近有没有什么重要的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:6011
    old "We turned left past the large hallway and were met with a narrower path whose left wall was made of glass."
    new "我们向左拐过那条大走廊，前面是一条更窄的通道，左侧的墙壁是玻璃做的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6016
    old "What's this?"
    new "这是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:6024
    old "These must be the offices. I can only see desks and computers."
    new "这里应该是办公室。只能看见桌子和电脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:6027
    old "Shiroya felt the handle and realized that the door wasn't locked. She easily pushed it open without making a sound and let us pass."
    new "Shiroya 摸了摸门把，发现门没有锁。她轻轻一推，门无声地开了，她让我们先进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:6035
    old "There's another door in the back. This floor is as big as the first one, so it must have a bunch of these to fill the space."
    new "后面还有一扇门。这层楼和第一层一样大，所以这种房间肯定不止一间。"

    # game/script.rpy:6036
    old "Isla walked up to the far door and opened it."
    new "Isla 走到最里面的门前，把门推开。"

    # game/script.rpy:6041
    old "It looks the same."
    new "看起来一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:6047
    old "We glanced through it and saw a replica of the room. It looked identical down to the last object, with the same arrangement of desks and computers."
    new "我们往里一望，看到的是一模一样的房间。连陈设都分毫不差，桌椅和电脑的摆法完全相同。"

    # game/script.rpy:6050
    old "There's another door there."
    new "那边还有一扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:6054
    old "We approached it. Although the first wall was made of glass, the next two partitions were separated by plastic that heavily obscured the other side."
    new "我们走过去。第一道隔墙是玻璃的，后面两道隔断则用塑料板隔开，把另一侧遮得严严实实。"

    # game/script.rpy:6060
    old "{w=0.6}Through the door, we were able to see that, once again, the third section looked exactly like the first two. The exception was the lack of a door leading to a fourth."
    new "{w=0.6}透过门望进去，第三个隔间果然也和前两个一模一样。唯一的区别是，那里没有通往第四间的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:6061
    old "Even though the initial concept of inspecting a huge building had sounded somewhat involved, the layout made it a trivial task."
    new "搜查一整栋大楼，原本听上去是件麻烦事，可这里的格局让这件事变得很轻松。"

    # game/script.rpy:6066
    old "There's nothing here either."
    new "这里也什么都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:6067
    old "Let's look around a bit. I doubt it, but we might find something."
    new "稍微找一找吧。虽然希望不大，说不定能发现点什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:6072
    old "Yeah. Let's see."
    new "嗯，看看吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:6078
    old "We dispersed ourselves throughout the three large partitions, and I was left with the third one. The desks all had drawers, but upon further inspection, they didn't contain anything relevant to us. The only thing of note was that each desk contained a computer tower inside its lower, larger compartment."
    new "我们分头进了三个大隔间，我负责第三间。每张桌子都带抽屉，可仔细翻过之后，里面没有一样与我们有关的东西。唯一值得留意的是，每张桌子下方较大的柜格里都放着一台电脑主机。"

    # game/script.rpy:6083
    old "I returned to the second partition."
    new "我回到第二个隔间。"

    # game/script.rpy:6084
    old "There are even cameras here?"
    new "这里居然还装了摄像头？"

    # game/script.rpy:6088
    old "Yeah, I saw them. They do look a bit out of place.{w} No idea what they're so paranoid about."
    new "嗯，我也看到了。确实显得有些突兀。{w}真不知道他们有什么好紧张的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6089
    old "I'm not sure these would help them much."
    new "我看这些未必能起多大作用。"

    # game/script.rpy:6090
    old "Maybe it was to make sure the workers here didn't slack off."
    new "也许是想盯着这里的员工，别让他们偷懒吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:6092
    old "Even though it had sounded like a joke, I understood she hadn't intended it as one. After all, in the second and third partitions, you couldn't be seen from outside. The wall covered the partitions' sides, and a cloudy white one kept them from seeing each other. It was a pretty cramped place, and I couldn't imagine myself working calmly with that camera pointed at me."
    new "这话听着像玩笑，可我知道她并不是在开玩笑。毕竟在第二、第三个隔间里，从外面根本看不到里面。两侧被墙封住，中间那块白蒙蒙的塑料板又让两个隔间彼此看不见。这地方本就狭窄，要是还有摄像头对着自己，我可没法心平气和地干活。"

    # game/script.rpy:6093
    old "I wasn't sure what the jobs there entailed, but judging from the number of computers, a large amount of people must've worked at once. Adding the fact that five similar floors were supposed to exist, it felt a bit excessive."
    new "我不清楚这里的工作具体是做什么的，但从电脑的数量看，同时在这里工作的人一定不少。再想到据说还有五层同样的楼层，未免有些夸张。"

    # game/script.rpy:6098
    old "I stepped into the first partition to see Erina and Isla looking at a lit screen. Upon noticing me, they were first to speak."
    new "我走进第一个隔间，看见 Erina 和 Isla 正盯着一块亮起的屏幕。她们一注意到我，就先开口了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6103
    old "I powered on this computer, but it's taking a while to boot up."
    new "我打开了这台电脑，不过启动有点慢。"

    # game/script.rpy:6104
    old "On the screen, I could see a progress bar that was nearly finished. I briefly worried that Ashiya would review the footage of us using the computers, but it wasn't like we were doing anything illicit."
    new "屏幕上，进度条已经快走完了。我一度担心芦屋会调出我们使用电脑的监控录像，不过我们也没做什么见不得人的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:6108
    old "Soon, Shiroya came from the middle partition and the four of us stared at the same screen."
    new "不一会儿，Shiroya 从中间的隔间走了过来，我们四个人一起盯着同一块屏幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:6115
    old "...Found anything?"
    new "……有什么发现吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6116
    old "No, and I don't imagine we will."
    new "没有，我想也不会有。"

    # game/script.rpy:6121
    old "I see. I haven't either."
    new "这样啊。我这边也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:6122
    old "Isla was mimicking what she'd seen Shiroya do, opening and closing the drawers. She appeared visibly sad when the last one still contained only pens and papers."
    new "Isla 照着 Shiroya 刚才的样子，把抽屉一个个拉开又关上。可最后一个抽屉里也只有笔和纸，她明显有些失落。"

    # game/script.rpy:6125
    old "Oh, look. I doubt we'll be able to access anything."
    new "哦，看这个。我看我们是进不去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6126
    old "On the screen were two text boxes demanding a username and a password. Without them, we wouldn't be able to look at anything."
    new "屏幕上弹出两个输入框，要求填写用户名和密码。没有这两样，什么也看不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6131
    old "That's unfortunate."
    new "那可真不巧。"

    # game/script.rpy:6132
    old "Just in case, I tried inputting common default information, but nothing yielded a positive result."
    new "为保险起见，我试着输入了几组常见的默认账号和密码，可一个都没能登进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:6133
    old "Yeah, these won't be any use."
    new "嗯，这些电脑派不上用场了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6134
    old "I gave up and straightened myself."
    new "我只好放弃，直起身来。"

    # game/script.rpy:6139
    old "Let's keep going. The lower floors will probably be the same, so we'll go through them faster."
    new "继续走吧。下面的楼层多半也是这样，检查起来会快一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:6140
    old "The stairs leading to floor 5 were next to the elevator, but let's see what's on the other side first."
    new "通往五楼的楼梯就在电梯旁边，不过我们先去看看另一头吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:6147
    old "We walked out, Isla holding the door for us. Shiroya gave her a charming smile and helped her before Erina exited."
    new "我们走出去，Isla 替大家扶着门。Shiroya 朝她露出一个好看的笑容，赶在 Erina 出来前也伸手帮她扶住门。"

    # game/script.rpy:6151
    old "As soon as we turned left, we were met with something I'd seen from behind the glass."
    new "我们刚向左一转，眼前便出现了一样我在玻璃后面见过的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:6152
    old "What's that for?"
    new "那是做什么用的？"

    # game/script.rpy:6153
    old "Oh, right, I forgot about these."
    new "哦，对了，我把这些给忘了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6158
    old "Two big windows were in the wall, but as we'd been told, a shutter prevented us from seeing through them."
    new "墙上嵌着两扇大窗，可正如之前听说的那样，卷帘挡住了视线，什么也看不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:6163
    old "Yeah, they're the windows. These are the same kind of shutter as the one in the lobby."
    new "对，就是那些窗户。这里的卷帘和大厅里的一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:6169
    old "Isla made a thinking sound. I also hadn't thought of the windows, and since they were barely visible from the first partition, their purpose must not have been to relax the workers."
    new "Isla 沉吟了一声。我也没想到窗户这回事，而从第一个隔间几乎看不到它们，可见装窗并不是为了让员工放松。"

    # game/script.rpy:6174
    old "I remember seeing them from outside."
    new "我记得从外面看到过这两扇窗。"

    # game/script.rpy:6175
    old "Yes, they should be facing the front of the tower. We'd normally be able to see most of Yushibana from here."
    new "没错，它们应该正对着塔的正面。平时从这里望出去，丰花大半都能收进眼底。"

    # game/script.rpy:6180
    old "I knew it."
    new "我就知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:6183
    old "Isla approached the shutters with her hand and felt them a bit. They seemed properly sturdy."
    new "Isla 把手伸向卷帘，轻轻摸了摸。看起来相当结实。"

    # game/script.rpy:6188
    old "I'm not sure this would be the most viable escape route for a criminal. We're on the sixth floor, so to escape through here, you'd definitely need special help."
    new "我看这对犯人来说算不上什么可行的逃跑路线。这里可是六楼，想从这里逃出去，肯定得有特别的帮手。"

    # game/script.rpy:6193
    old "Yeah. They took no risks this time."
    new "是啊。这回他们一点险都不肯冒。"

    # game/script.rpy:6194
    old "Hm. It would be tough, but even this window could serve as an exit with a proper plan."
    new "嗯。虽然困难，但只要计划得当，这扇窗也未必不能当作出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:6201
    old "Isla, who had been acting as if she were at home, left us behind and went to explore what looked to be another corridor."
    new "Isla 一直像在自己家里一样自在，这会儿又撇下我们，跑去查看一处看上去像是另一条走廊的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:6202
    old "After understanding that nothing was to be done with the windows, we moved along too."
    new "确认窗户那边无计可施后，我们也继续往前走。"

    # game/script.rpy:6206
    old "A narrower path was on the other side of the floor. However, it didn't appear to lead anywhere."
    new "楼层另一侧有一条更窄的通道，但看上去哪儿也通不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:6211
    old "Is it a dead end?"
    new "是死路吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6216
    old "Oh."
    new "哦。"

    # game/script.rpy:6221
    old "Isla turned around when she realized it."
    new "Isla 察觉后转过身来。"

    # game/script.rpy:6222
    old "As nothing else was left to be inspected, we walked back and returned to the initial hallway."
    new "再没有别的地方需要查看，我们便折返回了最初那条走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:6231
    old "I guess this was floor 6. Let's see if anything's different on the others."
    new "这里应该就是六楼了。去看看其他楼层有没有什么不同吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:6232
    old "We came to the conclusion that it's very likely the culprit is here, so this layout makes things easy for us."
    new "既然基本确定犯人就在这里，这种布局反倒方便我们行动。"

    # game/script.rpy:6248
    old "We arrived on floor 5 in silence. It looked very similar to the sixth, and it had the same bathrooms at our right."
    new "我们沉默着来到五楼。这里和六楼很相似，右手边也是同样的洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:6252
    old "We looked at them while making sure nobody could sneak past us and go a floor up. At first glance, the floor appeared to have the same structure as the previous."
    new "我们一边查看，一边留意不让人从身边溜过去、上一层楼。乍看之下，这层楼的结构和上一层别无二致。"

    # game/script.rpy:6255
    old "I inspected one of the plants just to be safe."
    new "为求稳妥，我检查了其中一盆植物。"

    # game/script.rpy:6256
    old "The soil in these is actually really shallow. I don't think anyone could hide something in here."
    new "这些盆栽里的土其实很浅。应该没人能把东西藏在这里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:6257
    old "The pots themselves weren't hollow, either. Nobody could hide anything underneath them. I didn't think anyone had, but in case there was still something else going on, I wanted to have my bases covered."
    new "花盆本身也不是空心的，底下同样藏不了东西。我并不认为有人这么做过，但万一还有别的蹊跷，我想尽量把该查的都查一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:6258
    old "I couldn't actually tell if the plants were fake or not."
    new "我其实分辨不出这些植物是真是假。"

    # game/script.rpy:6259
    old "I visualized the layout of the floors in my head as I considered how unlikely it actually was for someone to be hiding in them."
    new "我在脑中勾勒出各层的布局，也思索着有人藏身其中的可能性究竟有多低。"

    # game/script.rpy:6264
    old "After walking farther into it, it was clear that it was almost identical."
    new "继续往里走了一段，便能看出这里几乎与刚才那层一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:6269
    old "Is every floor exactly like this?"
    new "每层楼都完全一样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6274
    old "They probably are, but we'll have to look at them to be sure."
    new "多半是吧，不过还是得亲眼确认才行。"

    # game/script.rpy:6279
    old "Why is this place so big?"
    new "这地方为什么这么大？"

    # game/script.rpy:6284
    old "Come on, Isla. You're bothering Shiroya and Atsuki. We need to keep moving."
    new "行了，Isla。你这样会打扰到 Shiroya 和 Atsuki。我们得继续走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6289
    old "...Oh."
    new "……哦。"

    # game/script.rpy:6300
    old "As long as someone stays in the first partition and can look through the glass, we can make sure nobody moves between the floors unseen."
    new "只要有人留在第一个隔间里，能透过玻璃观察，就能确保没人能在楼层之间移动而不被发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:6301
    old "Right. One person always needs to stay out of the last two."
    new "对。得有人始终留在最后两个隔间外。"

    # game/script.rpy:6302
    old "All right."
    new "好。"

    # game/script.rpy:6303
    old "Since we'd seen no stairs going down, I walked to the other side."
    new "既然没看到下楼的楼梯，我便走向另一侧。"

    # game/script.rpy:6308
    old "Yeah, that's what I figured. The stairs to the fourth floor are here."
    new "嗯，果然如此。下四楼的楼梯在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:6318
    old "I walked back as the others entered the first partition. Once again, the four of us found ourselves in a room full of desks and computers."
    new "其他人走进第一个隔间时，我也走了回去。我们四人又一次置身于摆满桌子和电脑的房间里。"

    # game/script.rpy:6323
    old "I've been trying not to think about it, but what if there's someone in one of the next two rooms? What do we plan to do?"
    new "我一直尽量不去想这件事，可万一后面两个房间里有人呢？我们打算怎么办？"

    # game/script.rpy:6324
    old "We went quiet for a bit."
    new "我们沉默了片刻。"

    # game/script.rpy:6325
    old "She's right. We've been going about this with a light-hearted attitude, but things can change drastically in an instant."
    new "她说得对。我们一直抱着轻松的心态行动，可局势随时都可能急转直下。"

    # game/script.rpy:6326
    old "We don't know what we're up against, but the truth of the matter is that we're in a dangerous situation. Maybe we should just stay put."
    new "我们连对手是谁都不清楚，但眼下的确身处险境。也许最好还是按兵不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:6327
    old "Without Sai around, that sounded a lot smarter. Erina'd been playing along with us, but she was almost definitely afraid something could happen to Isla."
    new "Sai 不在，这番话听起来就明智多了。Erina 一直配合着我们行动，但她几乎肯定是怕 Isla 出什么意外。"

    # game/script.rpy:6330
    old "I doubt they'd want to hurt us, but without Akaro, our only physical advantage is that there are four of us. ...Although I guess if someone's hiding, nothing guarantees it's only one person."
    new "我觉得对方应该不想伤害我们，但少了 Akaro，我们唯一的优势就是有四个人。……不过，要是真有人躲着，也不能保证对方只有一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:6335
    old "As our perspective on the situation shifted over a single comment, I slowly moved toward the door in front of me."
    new "仅凭一句话，我们对局势的看法就变了。我缓缓走向面前的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:6336
    old "Even though those walls weren't transparent, they let light through. If someone were right next to them, we'd see a fuzzy outline of them. Slightly tense, I placed my hand on the handle and slowly opened the door."
    new "那些隔墙虽不透明，却能透光。若有人紧贴在另一侧，我们会看见一团模糊的轮廓。我略微绷紧神经，把手搭上门把手，慢慢推开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:6342
    old "...I don't see anybody. I'll check the last one."
    new "……我没看到人。我去看看最后一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:6345
    old "Shiroya kept the door open so that my voice could still reach the first partition. I grabbed the next handle and pushed the door forward."
    new "Shiroya 让门开着，好让我的声音还能传到第一个隔间。我握住下一个门把手，把门推开。"

    # game/script.rpy:6350
    old "It's empty too."
    new "这边也没有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:6351
    old "I loosened my grip and walked back to the others. It seemed nobody had been on floor 5 either."
    new "我松开手，走回其他人身边。看来五楼同样没有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:6357
    old "Should we also look around here?"
    new "这里也要搜一遍吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6362
    old "We probably won't find anything, but I think we should."
    new "多半什么也找不到，不过我觉得还是该查一查。"

    # game/script.rpy:6363
    old "I agree. We're not only looking for people. In the instance that the culprit wanted to get rid of something like they probably did with the suitcase, they wouldn't have had many places to do so."
    new "我同意。我们要找的不只是人。犯人很可能处理过那个行李箱，若还想处理掉别的东西，能下手的地方并不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:6364
    old "That's true. The crystal floor has a simple layout, but these are even worse. If you wanted to hide something here, you'd only have these drawers."
    new "确实。水晶层的布局很简单，这几层更是如此。想在这里藏东西，也只能藏进这些抽屉里。"

    # game/script.rpy:6365
    old "That's what I mean. Someone was likely here since that door at the stairs was unlocked, so let's see if we can find something."
    new "我就是这个意思。楼梯那儿的门没锁，说明很可能有人来过这里，所以我们找找看有没有线索吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:6372
    old "Isla took that as her cue to start opening all the drawers. Again, I went to the third partition while Shiroya stayed in the middle one."
    new "Isla 把这当作信号，开始逐个拉开抽屉。我照旧去了第三个隔间，Shiroya 则留在中间那个。"

    # game/script.rpy:6373
    old "Opening every drawer was all I could do. There wasn't anything under the desks that could hide something, and the floor had nothing on it but cables."
    new "我能做的也只有把所有抽屉打开一遍。桌下没有能藏东西的地方，地板上除了线缆别无他物。"

    # game/script.rpy:6374
    old "In less than two minutes, I could be sure that nothing of importance existed in that section of floor 5. I left it to find Shiroya nearly done with hers."
    new "不到两分钟，我便能确定五楼这一片没有藏任何要紧的东西。我离开那里去找 Shiroya，她那边也快查完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6380
    old "Nothing, I imagine?"
    new "我猜，什么也没找到？"

    # game/script.rpy:6385
    old "Yeah. I looked at some of these papers, but I don't think they have anything to tell us. Some were financial reports, but others I didn't understand at all."
    new "嗯。我翻了几份文件，但应该看不出什么有用的信息。有些是财务报告，还有些我完全看不懂。"

    # game/script.rpy:6386
    old "That's about what I saw on the other floor. I tried not to look at them too much since a camera was right behind me."
    new "我在另一层看到的也差不多。当时摄像头就在我背后，所以我尽量没多看那些文件。"

    # game/script.rpy:6390
    old "Oh, yeah. They'll probably look through the footage to make sure nothing strange happened."
    new "对，没错。他们多半会翻看录像，确认没出什么怪事。"

    # game/script.rpy:6391
    old "She apologized, facing the camera, before opening the door to the first partition. ...She might have been doing better than I thought, gradually moving back to her usual persona. I smiled at her and went through the door she'd opened, calmed by the thought that my worries about her had been overblown."
    new "她朝着摄像头道了歉，然后推开通往第一个隔间的门。……她或许比我以为的恢复得更好，正一点点回到平日的样子。我朝她笑了笑，走进她打开的那扇门，觉得自己对她的担心大概是多余的，人也随之安定下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:6398
    old "Are you done? We didn't find anything."
    new "你们查完了？我们什么都没找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:6403
    old "Neither did we."
    new "我们也是。"

    # game/script.rpy:6404
    old "We can move on, then. If the other group went at the same pace, we should find them on the next floor."
    new "那就继续走吧。另一组要是速度一样，下一层应该就能碰上。"

    # game/script.rpy:6411
    old "We were about to leave when a sound alerted me."
    new "我们正要离开，一个声响让我警觉起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:6416
    old "A vanishingly faint but deep noise that lasted almost two seconds was very slightly audible from where we were. Two of us visibly reacted at the reminder that our situation was uncertain, and hearing it after moving through two harmless floors amplified its effect."
    new "那声音极轻却很低沉，持续了将近两秒，从我们这里只能勉强听见一点。它提醒我们眼下的情况还不明朗，有两个人明显紧张起来；走过两层楼都平安无事，再听到这声音，心里那股不安就更重了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6417
    old "Isla, however, appeared unfazed. Perhaps ignorance was bliss, but it seemed like she had no concerns whatsoever."
    new "唯独 Isla 一副若无其事的样子。也许不知情反倒是种福气，可她看上去压根没有任何顾虑。"

    # game/script.rpy:6422
    old "You guys heard that, right?"
    new "你们也听见了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:6427
    old "Hm? I didn't hear anything."
    new "嗯？我什么都没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:6432
    old "I-I'm not sure I did. What was it?"
    new "我、我也不太确定。那是什么声音？"

    # game/script.rpy:6433
    old "I don't know, but I heard it too. It was quiet, but I think it came from this floor."
    new "不知道，可我也听见了。声音很轻，不过应该就是从这一层传来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6434
    old "Shiroya and Erina looked a bit unnerved and focused their hearing in case something else made a noise."
    new "Shiroya 和 Erina 都有些不安，竖起耳朵留意是否还有别的动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:6435
    old "...It must've been the others."
    new "……肯定是另一组人。"

    # game/script.rpy:6444
    old "I opened the door. I wanted the initial inspection to finally end, to permanently release the stress I'd been building up at the concept of someone hiding."
    new "我推开门。我只想初次搜查快点结束，好彻底甩掉因为「也许有人躲着」而积压的紧张。"

    # game/script.rpy:6445
    old "I realized Erina and Shiroya were coming along. We only had two directions to choose, and I hadn't made out the origin of the sound. However, since the right path led to floor 6, it was fair to assume it had come from the left."
    new "我发现 Erina 和 Shiroya 也跟了上来。眼前只有两条路可选，而我没能辨清声音的来处。不过右边那条路通向六层，那么声音多半是从左边传来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6449
    old "Erina quickly checked the right hallway and indicated that she hadn't seen anything. As I reached the end of the glass through which Isla was watching me, I peeked into the next corridor."
    new "Erina 迅速查看过右侧走廊，示意什么都没发现。我走到玻璃尽头，Isla 一直隔着玻璃注视着我；我探头望向下一条走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:6454
    old "...I don't see anything."
    new "……我什么都没看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:6459
    old "Shiroya looked too and saw the completely empty path."
    new "Shiroya 也看了看，那条路空空荡荡，什么也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:6464
    old "It might've come from floor 4."
    new "也许是从四层传来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6465
    old "Possibly. I couldn't tell."
    new "有可能。我听不出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:6472
    old "We entered the first partition again, where Isla was calmly sitting on a rotating chair and staring at our distressed faces."
    new "我们回到第一间隔间，Isla 正安稳地坐在转椅上，望着我们满脸凝重的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:6477
    old "Do we keep going...?"
    new "还要继续吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:6478
    old "Yes. We need to ask the others what that sound was."
    new "继续。得去问问另一组，刚才那声音是怎么回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:6479
    old "All of us felt it appropriate to exhale. However, Isla disagreed."
    new "我们几个都觉得该松口气了。可 Isla 并不这么想。"

    # game/script.rpy:6484
    old "You don't need to look so worried. Nothing bad will happen."
    new "不用这么愁眉苦脸的。不会有坏事发生的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6489
    old "...I would always have imagined I'd be the one saying that in a time like this..."
    new "……换作平时，我总以为这种时候该说这话的人是我呢……"

    # game/script.rpy:6494
    old "Believe me. There's no reason to be scared."
    new "相信我，没什么好怕的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6495
    old "Any particular reason you're saying that?"
    new "你这么说有什么根据吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6500
    old "Hm... I know nothing will happen. We just need to wait until we can leave."
    new "嗯……我就是知道不会有事。我们只要等到能离开就行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6505
    old "Shiroya stared at her skeptically. She knew optimism was great when it hadn't failed you yet."
    new "Shiroya 半信半疑地盯着她。她明白，乐观还没让人失望的时候，总是显得很有道理。"

    # game/script.rpy:6510
    old "You're probably right. We only got caught up in an inconvenient situation."
    new "你说得大概没错。我们不过是撞上了点麻烦而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:6515
    old "Yeah. We'll be back home in just a few hours, so let's go back down already."
    new "对啊。再过几个小时就能回家了，赶紧下楼吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:6516
    old "If nothing else, her playful smile made it clear that she was aware she was being unreasonable with that last part. Her high spirits were genuinely impressive."
    new "至少她那俏皮的笑容说明，她自己也知道最后那句话有多不讲理。这份好兴致着实令人佩服。"

    # game/script.rpy:6521
    old "But I'm being serious. We don't need to search for any hidden person. There's no one here."
    new "可我是认真的。根本不用去找什么藏起来的人，这里没人。"

    # game/script.rpy:6522
    old "We're searching precisely to know that for sure."
    new "正因为要确认这一点，我们才在找。"

    # game/script.rpy:6527
    old "I'm already telling you. These floors are a lot more boring than the crystal floor, so we don't need to waste our time like this."
    new "我都说了嘛。这几层比水晶层无聊多了，没必要这样浪费时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:6528
    old "\"Waste our time\"... If I had intended to take her seriously, I couldn't have helped but laugh."
    new "「浪费时间」……要是我真想把她的话当真，恐怕忍不住要笑出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:6531
    old "So you know the result of a search that hasn't finished?"
    new "所以，还没查完，你就知道结果了？"

    # game/script.rpy:6543
    old "Shiroya's and Erina's expressions told me that arguing would lead us nowhere.{w} But I was stubborn and slightly curious about her attitude."
    new "从 Shiroya 和 Erina 的表情看来，争下去也不会有结果。{w}可我这人固执，对她的态度也有几分好奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:6544
    old "How can you possibly know that?"
    new "你怎么可能知道？"

    # game/script.rpy:6549
    old "Because I was told!"
    new "因为有人告诉过我啊！"

    # game/script.rpy:6551
    old "...{w}My brain processed that line as another thoughtless remark she had made up to justify what she was saying. Only after a few seconds of silence did I fully comprehend it."
    new "……{w}我起初只当这是她又一句随口编出来给自己撑腰的话。沉默了几秒，我才真正明白过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:6552
    old "What do you mean? ...Who told you?"
    new "什么意思？……谁告诉你的？"

    # game/script.rpy:6557
    old "My friend."
    new "我的朋友。"

    # game/script.rpy:6562
    old "Not again... Don't take her seriously. She's been acting like this lately."
    new "又来了……别把她的话当真。她最近一直这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:6567
    old "What do you mean? Maybe she's a bit careless, but she's a kid. I don't think it's anything strange."
    new "什么意思？她也许有点马虎，可到底还是个孩子。我觉得没什么奇怪的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6572
    old "I don't just mean the lies. Her behavior has been changing recently..."
    new "我说的不只是她撒谎。她最近的行为一直在变……"

    # game/script.rpy:6573
    old "In what way?"
    new "哪方面？"

    # game/script.rpy:6578
    old "Isla, who was right there, responded with a disgruntled look."
    new "就在一旁的 Isla 露出不悦的神情。"

    # game/script.rpy:6579
    old "Well... I've talked to her a bit about this. I don't know why, but a few weeks ago she started talking about this friend of hers."
    new "嗯……这事我跟她聊过几句。也不知为什么，几周前她开始提起她的一个朋友。"

    # game/script.rpy:6584
    old "Again, Isla exhaled in a sad manner, as if she were being ridiculed unfairly."
    new "Isla 又难过地叹了口气，像是受了无端的嘲弄。"

    # game/script.rpy:6588
    old "She just doesn't wanna believe me, but I know I'm right. I only tried to make you feel better..."
    new "她就是不肯信我，可我知道我没说错。我本来只是想让你好受点……"

    # game/script.rpy:6589
    old "What kind of friend do you mean? Who are they?"
    new "什么样的朋友？是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:6590
    old "I can't tell you that. It's our secret."
    new "这个不能说。那是我们之间的秘密。"

    # game/script.rpy:6595
    old "See, this is what she says. Recently, she started constantly referencing this intangible friend of hers. At first, I was happy to hear her talking about a friend since the teachers at her school usually tell me that she's more on the lonely side. She never really talked about her friends until now."
    new "你看，她就是这么说的。最近她老是提起这个看不见摸不着的朋友。起初听她谈起朋友，我还挺高兴，因为学校老师常说她性格偏孤僻，她以前从来没提过什么朋友。"

    # game/script.rpy:6600
    old "But she made it sound as if she was always with them and kept telling me things that she'd been told. I knew she made it all up because I never saw her with anyone, and the things she'd presumably been told were all things that she'd said before or things I already felt she would say."
    new "可她说得好像自己一直和那个人待在一起，还总把「对方告诉她」的话转述给我。我知道那都是她编的——我从没见过她和谁在一起，而那些所谓别人告诉她的话，要么是她自己以前说过的，要么就是我早就觉得她会说的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:6606
    old "\"We watched my favorite movie together, and it was her favorite too!\" and \"She went to the aquarium last month, just like us!\" You see what I mean?"
    new "「我们一起看了我最喜欢的电影，那也是她最喜欢的！」「她上个月去了水族馆，跟我们一样！」——你明白我的意思吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:6611
    old "So she's a girl too?"
    new "那就是说，对方也是个女孩？"

    # game/script.rpy:6612
    old "Yes. That's the only thing we agreed we could say."
    new "对。这是我们说好能说的唯一一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:6617
    old "I'd probably be taking it better if it was the only thing that changed, but she also started to behave differently in other ways. She stopped listening to what I told her to do, spent less time with me, and one day I found out that she hadn't gone to school because she \"didn't feel like it\". I really don't know what's gotten into her."
    new "如果只是这一点变了，我大概还能接受，可她在别的方面也开始不对劲。我让她做的事她不听了，陪我的时间也少了，有一天我还发现她没去上学，理由居然是「不想去」。我真不知道她是怎么了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6622
    old "An imaginary friend at her age isn't too strange, but it makes me feel a bit uncomfortable, especially if it comes with so many more changes."
    new "她这个年纪有个想象中的朋友也不算太奇怪，可我还是觉得不太舒服，尤其是它还带来了这么多变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:6627
    old "...Why won't you believe me? She is real, I keep telling you..."
    new "……你为什么就是不信我？她是真的，我都说了好多遍了……"

    # game/script.rpy:6637
    old "I don't think you need to do anything about it, do you? Let her have fun with her friend."
    new "我觉得你不用特意去管吧？就让她和自己的朋友玩去吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:6638
    old "So she told you that everything would be fine and that we'd make it out safely, right?"
    new "所以她说一切都会没事，我们都能平安出去，是吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:6648
    old "I believe you. There's nothing wrong with what you're saying."
    new "我相信你。你说的话没什么问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:6653
    old "Thank you, Tanya."
    new "谢谢你，坦桑娅。"

    # game/script.rpy:6656
    old "So, how is she handling this? Did she like the Sekimeiya?"
    new "那她现在怎么样？她喜欢 Sekimeiya 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6662
    old "Isla looked confused, as if she'd been betrayed by the first person who'd accepted her."
    new "Isla 一脸困惑，仿佛被第一个接纳她的人背叛了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6663
    old "No, of course not... She's not here, right?"
    new "不，当然没有……她不在这里，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:6668
    old "O-Oh, no, I suppose not."
    new "啊……不，我想也不在吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:6674
    old "She told me that we would make it out safely before we came to the tower."
    new "来塔之前她就跟我说过，我们都能平安出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:6675
    old "What are you trying to say...? What exactly did she tell you?"
    new "你想说什么……？她到底跟你说了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:6676
    old "You shouldn't listen to her. Don't you see this isn't something to take seriously? I've tried it, but it's pointless."
    new "你别听她的。你也看出来了吧，这种事不能当真。我试过，没用的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6681
    old "Hm... She told me that something would happen in the tower, but not to worry. She said that if we stayed calm in one place, nobody would be hurt. And she promised I'd be able to see and touch the Sekimeiya, so she was right, wasn't she?"
    new "嗯……她说过塔里会出事，但让我别担心。她说只要我们在一个地方好好待着，就不会有人受伤。她还保证我能亲眼看到、亲手摸到 Sekimeiya——她说对了，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6685
    old "...{w}Before answering, I kept trying to make sense of such a confusing bunch of words. I was starting to think that her story could be seen in a completely different way—a much more ominous one."
    new "……{w}我没有立刻回答，只是反复琢磨她那一堆让人摸不着头脑的话。我渐渐觉得，她这套说辞完全可以换个角度去理解——一个要凶险得多的角度。"

    # game/script.rpy:6690
    old "You never lied like this until a month ago. What happened?"
    new "你以前从来不会这样撒谎，这一个月才开始。到底怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:6695
    old "Do you mind telling us details about this person? How old is she, for example?"
    new "能跟我们说说那个人的具体情况吗？比如她多大？"

    # game/script.rpy:6696
    old "I won't tell you anything. That's what we promised..."
    new "我什么都不会说的。这是我们约好的……"

    # game/script.rpy:6702
    old "Erina, you said she's an honest kid. Do you think there's a chance she's telling the truth?"
    new "Erina，你说过这孩子很老实。你觉得有没有可能，她说的是真的？"

    # game/script.rpy:6707
    old "I understand you'd think that, but no. I'm sure that she's lying. She always makes it sound as if her friend lives with us, but of course, I know that's not possible. We live alone."
    new "我明白你会这么想，但并不是。我确定她在撒谎。她总说得好像那个朋友就和我们住在一起，可那当然不可能——我们是自己住的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6708
    old "Isla, we're talking about a human person, right?"
    new "Isla，那个人是真人，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:6713
    old "Yes. Animals can't talk."
    new "对。动物又不会说话。"

    # game/script.rpy:6714
    old "R-Right. You got me there."
    new "对、对。这我倒没法反驳。"

    # game/script.rpy:6718
    old "She was clearly unhappy with our reactions, but we had no other way to respond to what she was saying. Obviously, no friend would appear out of nowhere and start living with you. If that was what Isla claimed, then I agreed with Erina's conclusion."
    new "她显然对我们的反应很不高兴，可面对她那些话，我们实在没有别的回应方式。朋友总不可能凭空冒出来，住进你家里。如果 Isla 说的就是这个意思，那我只能认同 Erina 的判断。"

    # game/script.rpy:6719
    old "So, what did she tell you about today's incident? Any more details?"
    new "那关于今天的事，她跟你说了什么？还有别的细节吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6724
    old "Why would I tell you if you won't believe me? She couldn't come, so she said that even though she didn't know how it would end or how long we'd stay here for, she'd wait for me at home."
    new "你们又不信我，我为什么要说？她来不了，所以她说，她不知道最后会怎样，也不知道我们要在这里待多久，但她会在家里等我。"

    # game/script.rpy:6730
    old "She didn't know how it would end? What does that mean? And why couldn't she come?"
    new "她不知道最后会怎样？这是什么意思？还有，她为什么来不了？"

    # game/script.rpy:6735
    old "She can't see the future. She was right about a lot of stuff, so I trusted her. And today, she couldn't come here because I was supposed to."
    new "她没法预知未来。她有很多事都说对了，所以我相信她。至于今天，她不能来，是因为该来的人是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:6741
    old "You were supposed to? What does that even mean?"
    new "该来的人是你？这又是什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:6746
    old "I was supposed to come here, right? We planned this since the Sekimeiya was announced, and I was really excited, so you even let me skip today's classes. If she had come, you would've seen her, so that's why she couldn't."
    new "本来就该我来这儿，不是吗？Sekimeiya 公布的时候我们就计划好了，我那么期待，你还特意让我今天不用上课。要是她也来了，你就会看见她——所以她不能来。"

    # game/script.rpy:6751
    old "All right, then. I apologize for putting a damper on your fun."
    new "好吧。抱歉扫了你的兴。"

    # game/script.rpy:6756
    old "Don't worry about that. What matters is that nobody else is here. We don't really need to keep searching."
    new "没关系。重要的是这里没有别人了。我们其实不用再找下去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6757
    old "Is that something your friend mentioned? Did she tell you the people who would get trapped?"
    new "这也是你朋友说的？她告诉过你会有哪些人被困在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:6762
    old "...Maybe. I'm not really sure if I should tell you, but she didn't say a lot about it."
    new "……也许吧。我不太确定该不该告诉你们，不过她说的也不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:6763
    old "It might be helpful, so we'd appreciate it."
    new "说不定会有帮助，要是能告诉我们，就帮大忙了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6768
    old "Well... She didn't tell me the names of everyone, but she did say that only seven people would get trapped, and that if we kept calm, nothing bad would happen."
    new "嗯……她没告诉我每个人的名字，不过她说过，只有七个人会被困住；只要大家保持冷静，就不会有事。"

    # game/script.rpy:6773
    old "Seven people? But Naomi must also be here."
    new "七个人？可 Naomi 也应该在这里啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:6774
    old "Hm... She wanted to be helpful, so she told me as much as she could. She said it'd be me, Mom, three boys, and two girls. ...And that they wouldn't be bad people."
    new "嗯……她想帮忙，所以把能说的都告诉我了。她说会是我、妈妈、三个男生和两个女生。……还说他们都不是坏人。"

    # game/script.rpy:6780
    old "Come on, Isla. How can you possibly explain her knowing that?"
    new "得了吧，Isla。这种事她怎么会知道？你又要怎么解释？"

    # game/script.rpy:6785
    old "She's very smart. A lot smarter than me. But she was wrong here, so I think I might not be remembering right..."
    new "她很聪明，比我聪明得多。可这次她说错了，所以我想……也许是我记错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6786
    old "Yeah. According to her, three men and four women would end up trapped. As things are right now, it's four men and three women, not counting Naomi."
    new "嗯。按她的说法，最后被困住的会是三男四女。可照现在的情况看，不算 Naomi 的话，是四男三女。"

    # game/script.rpy:6791
    old "That's true, see? If she was wrong about this, she might've been wrong when she said that nobody else would get trapped."
    new "说得没错吧？她连这个都弄错了，那她说不会再有别人被困，也可能是错的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6796
    old "But, no... That's not right. I might be wrong about the number of boys and girls, but I'm sure she said that only seven people would stay."
    new "可是，不对……不是这样的。男生女生的人数也许是我记错了，但她肯定说过，只会留下七个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:6799
    old "Listen, we can't stop searching because of what someone told you before we came here. She couldn't have known anything. Don't you get it?"
    new "听好了，我们不能因为来之前有人对你说了几句话，就停下搜索。她不可能知道什么。你明白吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6804
    old "...But she was right. We ended up trapped, and it's seven of us. She even said that all the windows would lock down."
    new "……可她说对了。我们确实被困住了，而且正好七个人。她甚至说过，所有窗户都会锁死。"

    # game/script.rpy:6805
    old "I'm very confused about this. Are you just making this up for fun? Because only a very select number of people would've known about the alarm's existence. If she really said that, could it be that your friend works here?"
    new "这件事让我很困惑。你该不会是在编故事逗我们吧？知道警报存在的人少之又少。如果她真说过那种话，难不成你那位朋友就在这里工作？"

    # game/script.rpy:6810
    old "No, that's impossible. I won't say anything else or I might put her in danger... You can believe what I said if you want."
    new "不，那不可能。我不能再说了，否则可能会让她有危险……信不信由你。"

    # game/script.rpy:6816
    old "Standing up from the chair, Isla reached for the door and left. Despite all she'd said, we still saw leaving her alone as dangerous, so we followed her toward the fourth floor."
    new "Isla 从椅子上起身，伸手拉开门走了出去。尽管她说了那一番话，我们仍然觉得让她一个人行动太危险，于是跟着她前往四楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:6823
    old "What the hell was all of that?"
    new "刚才那到底是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:6824
    old "There really are only two options. Either Isla is lying, or someone who knew the attack would happen has been in contact with her."
    new "真的只有两种可能：要么 Isla 在说谎，要么有人知道袭击会发生，并且跟她接触过。"

    # game/script.rpy:6825
    old "I'm not sure I want to believe her, but I think it's much more likely that the first option is correct. Creating an imaginary friend and making up all sorts of lies and excuses to justify their existence isn't the most uncommon behavior."
    new "我不想轻易相信她，但第一种可能性应该大得多。虚构一个朋友，再编出各种谎言和借口来证明对方存在，这种行为并不算罕见。"

    # game/script.rpy:6826
    old "But some things she said are really strange..."
    new "可她说的有些事真的很奇怪……"

    # game/script.rpy:6827
    old "If she was trying to justify her friend's existence, why would she purposely list out the number of men and women incorrectly? And given how likely it is for Naomi to still be here, why would she claim otherwise? Wouldn't finding Naomi disprove her friend?"
    new "如果她真想证明那位朋友存在，为什么偏要把男女数量说错？再说 Naomi 很可能还在这里，她为什么偏要反过来说？一旦找到 Naomi，她那位朋友的说法不就站不住脚了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6831
    old "If someone told Isla about the alarm, they had to work here. We've been told multiple times that very few people knew about it."
    new "如果真有人把警报的事告诉了 Isla，那个人一定在这里工作。我们不止一次听说，知道这件事的人极少。"

    # game/script.rpy:6832
    old "I guess another possibility is that Xyn found out about the alarm and its features. Isla did say that her friend doesn't work here."
    new "另一种可能，是 Xyn 得知了警报及其功能。毕竟 Isla 说过，她那位朋友不在这里工作。"

    # game/script.rpy:6833
    old "Now the big question: why would Xyn make contact with Isla and tell her all that? What's there to gain, and why Isla?"
    new "那么关键问题来了：Xyn 为什么要联系 Isla，还把那些事告诉她？这么做能得到什么，又为什么偏偏是 Isla？"

    # game/script.rpy:6834
    old "There's no way her friend lives with them like she said. That would mean that Xyn instructed her to lie about her friend's identity so that the actual person couldn't be found.{w} But why the hell would they let her speak about it at all instead of telling her to keep fully quiet?"
    new "她那位朋友绝不可能像她说的那样，和她们住在一起。也就是说，Xyn 指使她隐瞒朋友的真正身份，免得被人查到。{w} 可既然这样，他们为什么还任由她说出这些，而不是让她彻底闭嘴？"

    # game/script.rpy:6840
    old "Isla told us that she promised her friend not to reveal information about her, but it doesn't seem like they agreed not to reveal information about today's incident."
    new "Isla 说，她答应过那位朋友，不透露关于她的信息；但她们似乎并没有约定不能提今天的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:6841
    old "I have no idea what anyone would have to gain by telling Isla about any of this, but if their intention was to manipulate her actions in some way, there has to be a very important reason..."
    new "我想不出把这一切告诉 Isla 对谁有好处；但如果对方是想借此操纵她的行动，那就一定有个极其重要的理由……"

    # game/script.rpy:6842
    old "One last thing is that Isla's friend didn't know how things would end. This appears to back up Sai's theory: the plan isn't over yet."
    new "最后一点，Isla 的那位朋友并不知道事情会如何收场。这似乎印证了 Sai 的推测：计划还没结束。"

    # game/script.rpy:6843
    old "However, she also said that she didn't know how long we'd stay here for.{w} Twelve hours is the maximum time... Is it possible that depending on how some events play out, we could leave earlier?"
    new "不过她也说过，她不知道我们会在这里待多久。{w} 十二小时是最长时间……有没有可能，随着某些事态的发展，我们能提前离开？"

    # game/script.rpy:6844
    old "Incidentally, her friend told her that everything would be fine if we stayed put somewhere. Could it be that Xyn doesn't want us to search around the building?"
    new "另外，她那位朋友告诉她，只要我们老老实实待着，就不会有事。难道说，Xyn 不想让我们在楼里四处搜索？"

    # game/script.rpy:6845
    old "I'm not sure how I should be handling this. It doesn't seem as if she was instructed to tell us any of this. She just mentioned it out of honest concern after seeing how worried we were. If none of her actions were coerced and she was only given details, I can't think of a single reason why Xyn would do something so pointlessly risky."
    new "我不知道该怎么处理这件事。她似乎并不是受指使才把这些告诉我们，只是看到我们那么担心，出于真心的关切才提了一句。如果她的行动没有受到胁迫，只是被告知了一些细节，那我想不出 Xyn 有什么理由做这种毫无意义又冒险的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:6849
    old "If her friend is an actual person who knew this incident would occur, it follows that they knew she would end up involved in it."
    new "如果她那位朋友确有其人，而且事先知道这起事件会发生，那对方自然也知道 Isla 会被卷进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:6854
    old "Since I can't think of why Xyn would do it, the smallest thing I can construct has, once again, Katei as the focus."
    new "既然我想不出 Xyn 这么做的理由，那么我能想到的最简单的解释，又一次落在 Katei 身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:6855
    old "The only things Isla revealed about her friend's identity were her gender and the fact that she doesn't work in this building. I've been thinking of Katei as the core suspect, so it's easy to pin him as the identity behind Isla's friend."
    new "Isla 透露的关于那位朋友身份的信息，只有性别，以及她不在这栋楼里工作。我一直把 Katei 当作核心嫌疑人，所以很容易就会认为，Isla 的那位朋友其实就是他。"

    # game/script.rpy:6856
    old "If he instructed Isla to make sure not to reveal his identity, she would've called her friend a girl, and the one thing she would've denied would've been them working in the tower."
    new "如果是他叮嘱 Isla 绝不能暴露自己的身份，那 Isla 就会称这位朋友为女生，并且会特意否认对方在这座塔里工作。"

    # game/script.rpy:6857
    old "I'm not sure how much credit I should give Isla or if I'm going off too many branches, but even though she's a kid, she should surely be able to bring things up without making it evident she'd been waiting for a good moment."
    new "我不知道该信 Isla 几分，也怀疑自己是不是想得太岔了。可她就算是个孩子，也总该能做到提起这些事时不让人看出她一直在等合适的时机。"

    # game/script.rpy:6858
    old "I have no idea what any of this accomplishes, but since only some Ashiya workers should've known about the alarm's existence, only they or an attacker with inside information could've been in contact with Isla.{w} Reasons aside, an Ashiya employee could have been relaying information to her. Two happen to come to mind, one being a man, and the other a woman."
    new "我完全不知道这一切有什么目的，但既然应该只有部分芦屋员工知道警报的存在，那能接触 Isla 的就只可能是他们，或者掌握内情的袭击者。{w} 先不论理由，确实可能有芦屋员工向她传递消息。我恰好想到两个人，一男一女。"

    # game/script.rpy:6862
    old "In the end, though, I went back to thinking that the most likely possibility was that Isla had made everything up. Maybe she had randomly thought of mentioning the number of men and women but purposely said them incorrectly as an unusual thing there would've been no reason to make up. Maybe she'd intended to say it the right way but quickly realized that she miscounted."
    new "可到最后，我还是转回了最初的想法：最有可能的，是 Isla 把一切都编了出来。也许她只是随口想到要提男女数量，却故意说错，好让这个本没有理由编造的反常细节显得可信。也许她本来想按正确的数目说，却很快发现自己数错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6863
    old "...The whole thing really messed with me, and I kept trying to make sense of it as we reached the fourth floor."
    new "……这件事始终让我心绪不宁。直到我们抵达四楼，我还在不停地琢磨它。"

    # game/script.rpy:6872
    old "It appeared desolate as soon as we arrived. The chances of finding people increased with each floor, so with a bit of precaution, we moved toward the offices."
    new "四楼看上去一片空寂。每上一层，找到人的可能性就增加一分，因此我们稍加提防，朝办公室走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:6881
    old "Is the other group not here yet?"
    new "另一组人还没到吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6883
    old "The first partition looked empty. Once again, we saw the same layout as the other floors."
    new "第一个隔间看起来空无一人。和之前几层一样，仍是同样的格局。"

    # game/script.rpy:6884
    old "Maybe they found something. I'd think they would've already arrived here."
    new "也许他们发现了什么。按理说，他们早该到这里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6891
    old "I repeated the earlier process and quickly deemed the three partitions empty."
    new "我照先前的方法检查了一遍，很快断定三个隔间都是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6896
    old "Next were the two bathrooms. However, before we headed to them, I thought I noticed another sound, just as faint as the last."
    new "接下来是两间洗手间。可就在我们过去之前，我好像又听见了另一个声音，和刚才一样微弱。"

    # game/script.rpy:6900
    old "It was easy to pinpoint its origin. I peeked into the right corridor and saw two human figures standing next to the staircase."
    new "声音的来源很容易确定。我朝右侧走廊里望去，看见两个人影站在楼梯旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:6901
    old "They're here."
    new "他们在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:6902
    old "Our attention was quickly diverted. The other three with me quickly spotted them as well."
    new "我们立刻注意到了那边。身边的另外三人也很快发现了他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:6909
    old "Where's Katei?"
    new "Katei 在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:6910
    old "As Isla pointed out, only Sai and Akaro were there. As soon as they noticed us, they stopped talking and gestured at us to come over."
    new "Isla 说得没错，那里只有 Sai 和 Akaro。他们一看到我们，便停止交谈，招手示意我们过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:6918
    old "How did things go? Anything notable?"
    new "情况怎么样？有什么值得注意的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6923
    old "Nothing. Are the other two floors like this one?"
    new "什么也没有。另外两层也跟这里一样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6928
    old "Exactly the same. They only contain three big rooms full of offices."
    new "完全一样。每层只有三个大房间，里面全是办公区。"

    # game/script.rpy:6931
    old "...Where did Katei go? Why is he not with you?"
    new "……Katei 去哪了？他怎么没和你们在一起？"

    # game/script.rpy:6936
    old "Well, it's not the easiest thing to explain."
    new "这个嘛，解释起来不太容易。"

    # game/script.rpy:6942
    old "Sure it is. Naomi showed up and requested to talk to him privately."
    new "其实也不难解释。Naomi 出现了，还要求跟他单独谈谈。"

    # game/script.rpy:6947
    old "...Huh? Where was she?"
    new "……啊？她当时在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:6953
    old "What...? Naomi shouldn't be here."
    new "什么……？Naomi 不该在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:6959
    old "It's time to stop, Isla. Don't keep going when it's clear you were wrong."
    new "到此为止吧，Isla。既然明摆着是你错了，就别再继续了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6963
    old "Why shouldn't she be here? We were about to move up to this floor when Naomi came from the second. I'm positive she came from the stairs."
    new "她为什么不能在这里？我们正准备上这一层时，Naomi 从二楼过来了。我敢肯定她是从楼梯上来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6964
    old "From the stairs? Shouldn't you guys have inspected floor 2?"
    new "从楼梯？你们不是应该检查过二楼了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6970
    old "We did. It's very possible she was on the crystal floor since there was no place to hide on the second one."
    new "检查过了。二楼没有能藏人的地方，所以她很可能就在水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:6975
    old "And she voluntarily appeared to talk to Katei?"
    new "然后她就主动现身，去找 Katei 谈话了？"

    # game/script.rpy:6980
    old "Pretty much. It looked like she wanted to talk to Akaro first, but as soon as she saw Katei, she forgot about him."
    new "差不多吧。她本来似乎想先找 Akaro 谈，可一看见 Katei，就把他忘到一边了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6981
    old "...Well, she approached me first because I was closer to the stairs. Then they went down to talk."
    new "……这个嘛，我离楼梯更近，所以她先朝我走过来了。之后他们才下楼去谈。"

    # game/script.rpy:6987
    old "Yeah. We finished up floor 3 and have been waiting here since we looked at the two bathrooms. They left about fifteen minutes ago."
    new "对。我们查完三楼，看完那两间卫生间后就一直等在这里。他们大概十五分钟前走的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6988
    old "Did you not try to follow them? What did they want to talk about?"
    new "你们没试着跟上去？他们想谈什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:6993
    old "Naomi went ahead and asked us not to follow them, so unfortunately, I had to abandon my plan of tagging along. Realistically, if they made sure they were alone, we couldn't have done anything to eavesdrop without being noticed. The quarters here are pretty tight."
    new "Naomi 先开口让我们别跟过去，所以我只好打消了跟上去的念头。说实话，他们既然确保只有彼此在场，我们想偷听又不被发现，根本无从下手。这地方太窄了。"

    # game/script.rpy:6998
    old "It sounded like they wanted to talk about \"confidential\" matters. When I first saw Naomi, I got really surprised, but she must've been even more than me. She looked preoccupied and determined at the same time—that's how she was when insisted that Katei talk with her privately."
    new "听起来他们想谈的是「机密」之类的事情。我刚见到 Naomi 时吃了一惊，但她肯定比我更惊讶。她当时看上去既心事重重，又态度坚决——坚持要 Katei 跟她单独谈话时，她就是那副样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:7004
    old "We were debating the contents of their discussion just now. I gave Akaro the rundown regarding Katei, and he really hadn't considered anything."
    new "我们刚才还在争论他们究竟谈了些什么。我把 Katei 的事大致跟 Akaro 说了一遍，他之前确实完全没往那方面想。"

    # game/script.rpy:7009
    old "I still think you're overthinking a few things, but I can't deny they're the two most suspicious people. Sai really thinks they're up to no good."
    new "我还是觉得你有几处想多了，但不能否认，他们俩确实最可疑。Sai 认定他们在打什么坏主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:7014
    old "Am I being unreasonable? If I was wrong, they would've told us the main gist of it. Naomi might not have been with us the whole time, but she must've been conscious of the situation and our perception of her. Despite that, she barely acknowledged us."
    new "是我太不讲理了吗？如果真是我猜错了，他们至少会告诉我们个大概。Naomi 也许没有一直和我们在一起，但她不可能不清楚眼下的状况，也不可能不知道我们怎么看她。可即便如此，她几乎没理会过我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:7019
    old "I'm still trying to process everything. So Naomi really was here. Doesn't that mean the most likely scenario is that she was the one to leave the suitcase downstairs?"
    new "我还在理清这一切。也就是说，Naomi 真的来过这里。那最可能的情况，不就是她把行李箱留在楼下了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:7024
    old "Yes. She might not have been aware of how wary we were of her and openly showed up to talk with the other main suspect. Katei didn't look like he was expecting it, so perhaps he thought she should've remained hidden. Regardless, it's safe to assume they're now talking about their plan."
    new "对。她也许没察觉到我们有多提防她，就这么光明正大地现身，去找另一个主要嫌疑人谈话。Katei 看上去也没料到她会来，或许他原以为她应该继续藏着。总之，可以认为他们现在正在商量他们的计划。"

    # game/script.rpy:7029
    old "You should trust them a bit more... Since the two of them work here, I think it's very possible they're talking about Ashiya matters."
    new "你们也该多信任他们一点……既然他们俩都在这里工作，我觉得他们很可能是在谈芦屋的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:7034
    old "Okay, then why did Naomi hide from us? Why did she appear out of nowhere and not even try to explain anything? Her actions are strange even if she's on the culprit's side, but her face wasn't the one of someone who suddenly got trapped and looked for people for an entire hour."
    new "好，那 Naomi 为什么要躲着我们？为什么突然冒出来，却连一句解释都没有？就算她站在凶手那边，这些举动也很奇怪。可她脸上的神情，又不像是一个突然被困住、四处找人找了一整小时的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:7039
    old "Her perspective might be different from ours, being an Ashiya employee that's aware of Xyn's attacks."
    new "她身为芦屋的员工，又知道 Xyn 的袭击，想法或许和我们不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:7040
    old "And I acknowledge that possibility. Her actions simply make it unlikely."
    new "我不否认有这种可能。只是从她的举动来看，可能性很小。"

    # game/script.rpy:7045
    old "We'll have to wait for them to come back. I'm sure they'll clarify all of this."
    new "只能等他们回来了。我相信他们到时候会把一切解释清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:7050
    old "Yeah. We decided to stay here to make sure they couldn't escape, but we were also waiting for you four."
    new "嗯。我们决定守在这里，免得他们逃掉，同时也是在等你们四个。"

    # game/script.rpy:7053
    old "If there are more than two of us, we can split ourselves through the first three floors while someone stays here to make sure they're confined below."
    new "只要我们超过两个人，就可以分散到下面三层搜查，同时留一个人守在这里，确保他们被困在楼下。"

    # game/script.rpy:7058
    old "Wouldn't they be able to use the elevator?"
    new "他们难道不能用电梯吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:7059
    old "Yes, but we would know. I meant to ask you guys about that."
    new "能用，但我们会知道。我正想问问你们这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:7064
    old "A few minutes ago, after Katei and Naomi left, we heard the elevator moving through our floor. Even though we were next to it, we weren't able to determine the direction it was going."
    new "几分钟前，Katei 和 Naomi 离开之后，我们听见电梯经过我们这一层。虽然我们就在旁边，却判断不出它往哪个方向走。"

    # game/script.rpy:7069
    old "But since you took it to the sixth floor, it could only have been going down. We only heard it once."
    new "可既然你们乘电梯到了六楼，它只可能是往下走。我们只听到了一次动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:7070
    old "Oh, so that was the elevator."
    new "哦，原来那是电梯啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:7071
    old "That made sense. It had been a deep noise that had lingered for a bit. Since it was moving, the exact position and floor it had come from hadn't been easily distinguishable."
    new "这就说得通了。那声音很低沉，还拖了一小会儿。因为电梯在动，所以很难分辨它确切的位置和来自哪一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:7075
    old "As I thought, none of you used it. That's strange, right?"
    new "果然，你们没人用过电梯。这很奇怪吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:7080
    old "We're sure it was the elevator because it made the same noise we heard when you used it on the lowest floor. Even if you'd decided to go back down for some reason, we found it appropriate to stay here."
    new "我们确定那就是电梯，因为那声音和你们在最底层用电梯时我们听到的一样。就算你们因为什么原因决定返回楼下，我们也觉得守在这里比较妥当。"

    # game/script.rpy:7081
    old "Are you sure it only moved one more time?"
    new "你确定它后来又只动过一次？"

    # game/script.rpy:7086
    old "Yeah, we were right next to it and only heard it once. So if Katei and Naomi use it, we'll know."
    new "嗯，我们就在旁边，只听见了一次。所以只要 Katei 和 Naomi 用电梯，我们就会知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:7087
    old "We could even call it and keep the door open. That way, they wouldn't be able to use it at all."
    new "我们甚至可以把电梯叫上来，让门一直开着。这样他们就根本用不了电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:7088
    old "Right, that's what I thought you'd suggest."
    new "对，我就知道你会这么提议。"

    # game/script.rpy:7092
    old "I stayed here for another reason too, which is why we didn't call it here and do that immediately. The sound might make it possible to anticipate the elevator. We might be quick enough to press the button before it goes past us. That would trap them inside it, and we could open the door before they could start moving again."
    new "我留在这里还有另一个原因，所以我们才没有立刻把电梯叫上来这么做。凭声音或许能预判电梯的动向。我们也许来得及在它越过这一层之前按下按钮。那样就能把他们困在里面，而我们可以在电梯重新开动前把门打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:7095
    old "I see.{w} The sound from earlier doesn't make much sense, though. We left the elevator on floor 6 and heard it moving on floor 5. Like you said, it could only have been going down."
    new "原来如此。{w}不过刚才那阵动静还是说不通。我们把电梯留在六楼，却在五楼听见它移动。就像你说的，它只可能是往下走。"

    # game/script.rpy:7100
    old "Yeah, I don't get it. By floor 5, we knew nobody could've been above us."
    new "是啊，我也想不通。到五楼时，我们已经确定上面不可能有人了。"

    # game/script.rpy:7105
    old "Is it possible someone sneaked past you while you investigated? If all of you were inside the offices without looking through the glass, it could've happened."
    new "有没有可能，在你们搜查的时候，有人从你们眼皮底下溜过去了？如果你们全都进了办公室，没透过玻璃留意外面，那确实有可能发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:7110
    old "I really don't think so. I stayed in front for the most part, and I really doubt I missed anyone."
    new "我觉得不可能。大部分时间我都待在前面，我不觉得自己会漏掉任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:7115
    old "Well, if you didn't, then someone below us could've called it, and what we heard was the empty elevator."
    new "好吧，如果真是这样，那也可能是楼下有人叫了电梯，我们听到的是空电梯在动。"

    # game/script.rpy:7120
    old "Huh? It must've been either Katei or Naomi, so if you didn't hear it again, they must've called it and then not used it."
    new "咦？叫电梯的只可能是 Katei 或 Naomi。既然你们后来没再听见动静，那他们一定是叫了电梯，却没进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:7125
    old "Right. Maybe they wanted it easily available on floor 1 if they needed to use it."
    new "对。也许他们想让电梯停在一楼，需要用时能立刻乘上。"

    # game/script.rpy:7132
    old "We began to hear footsteps in the distance. We all quieted down at the same time, straining to check if we'd imagined it."
    new "远处传来脚步声。我们同时安静下来，屏息凝神，想确认那是不是错觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:7133
    old "They didn't stop. The sound became more and more perceptible until it was clear that only one pair of legs was approaching."
    new "脚步声没有停。那声音越来越清晰，最后能听出只有一个人正朝这边走来。"

    # game/script.rpy:7134
    old "Let's see what's up."
    new "去看看情况吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:7135
    old "We stared at the staircase, where the sound was coming from, until Katei's white hair peeked from below."
    new "我们一直盯着传来声响的楼梯，直到 Katei 的白发从下方探出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:7141
    old "When he saw all of us, he looked up with a plain expression and stopped moving partway up the stairs."
    new "看到我们所有人后，他神情平淡地抬头看了一眼，随即在楼梯半途停下脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:7146
    old "Where's Naomi?"
    new "Naomi 在哪？"

    # game/script.rpy:7147
    old "...{w}We went to the crystal floor, but she didn't want to come back."
    new "……{w}我们去了水晶层，但她不肯回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:7157
    old "Sai's immediate reaction threw Katei off, and he took a few seconds to answer."
    new "Sai 立刻追问，让 Katei 有些措手不及，他过了几秒才开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:7160
    old "During that time, he looked at the rest of us. It might've been just my impression, but it felt like he particularly fixed his eyes on me."
    new "那几秒里，他扫视了我们其他人。也许只是我的错觉，但他的目光似乎格外落在我身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:7165
    old "She didn't explain it. I asked her to come since I knew I'd be suspicious otherwise, but she refused. She left the room where we were, and I stayed there a few more minutes, sorting my thoughts out before returning here."
    new "她没有解释。我知道不叫她一起回来，自己难免会被怀疑，所以开口让她同行，但她拒绝了。她离开我们待的那个房间后，我又在那里留了几分钟，理清思绪才回到这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:7166
    old "What did you talk about?"
    new "你们谈了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:7168
    old "About the incident, of course. It surprised me a bit, but her intention was to clear her name. She told me she hadn't done anything."
    new "当然是那起事件。她主动提起时我还有点意外，不过她是想洗清自己的嫌疑。她告诉我，她什么都没做。"

    # game/script.rpy:7173
    old "That was what she wanted to talk to you about privately?"
    new "她想私下跟你谈的就是这个？"

    # game/script.rpy:7174
    old "Yes. I didn't believe her, though."
    new "是。不过我不信她。"

    # game/script.rpy:7179
    old "...You didn't?"
    new "……你不信？"

    # game/script.rpy:7184
    old "No. Her words sounded forced, as if she was trying to cover herself up with lies. I know you've been suspecting me, but since I know I'm innocent, my main suspicions were directed to Naomi from the beginning."
    new "不信。她的话听着很牵强，像是在用谎言替自己开脱。我知道你一直在怀疑我，可我清楚自己是清白的，所以从一开始，我最怀疑的就是 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:7189
    old "She saw her explanations weren't working and refused to appear before you all. She must've tried her luck with me because we've worked together for a long time."
    new "她见解释不起作用，便不肯再到你们面前来。大概是觉得我们共事多年，想在我这里碰碰运气。"

    # game/script.rpy:7190
    old "So you're the only one she wanted to convince?"
    new "也就是说，她只想说服你一个人？"

    # game/script.rpy:7195
    old "Yes. I don't know why, though. Even if she'd achieved that, it's not like she could've convinced the police. Hearing her justifications made me even more convinced that she's involved in some way.{w} Even though she ran away, I didn't try to find her immediately since I figured there was no way she could keep hiding. She still has to be somewhere on the crystal floor."
    new "是。可我不知道她为什么这么做。就算说服了我，她也说服不了警察。听她那些辩解，我反而更确信她多少牵涉其中。{w} 她虽然跑了，我却没有立刻去找，因为我认定她躲不了多久。她一定还在水晶层的某个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:7197
    old "Out of curiosity, did you ever call the elevator?"
    new "顺便问一句，你叫过电梯吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:7202
    old "The elevator? No. Why?"
    new "电梯？没有。怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:7207
    old "We heard it moving down, so if it wasn't you, Naomi might've called it. It didn't go up again, though."
    new "我们听见它往下走。如果不是你叫的，那就可能是 Naomi。不过它之后没再上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:7212
    old "I see... So she's definitely still under us."
    new "原来如此……那她肯定还在我们楼下。"

    # game/script.rpy:7217
    old "Regardless, what did Naomi tell you? What was it that made you suspect her even harder?"
    new "先不说这个。Naomi 到底跟你说了什么？是什么让你更怀疑她？"

    # game/script.rpy:7222
    old "...{w}She spat out nothing but inconsistencies.{w} She said that she'd been trying to find help since waking up. She couldn't answer why she'd gone up to the office floors instead of aiding Erina's group or staying with everyone in the event room."
    new "……{w}她说的话处处自相矛盾。{w} 她说自己醒来后一直在找人帮忙。可她却答不上来，自己为什么上到办公楼层，既不去帮 Erina 他们，也不留在活动室和大家待在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:7223
    old "She tried to make me believe that she'd been searching for people until now and that, coincidentally, she hadn't found us yet. There was no way I could have believed that."
    new "她想让我相信，她一直在找人，只是碰巧到现在还没找到我们。这种话我怎么可能信。"

    # game/script.rpy:7224
    old "According to her, she had nothing to do with the power outage or the suitcase. She said she didn't see the suitcase the first time she went up, but it was there when she came back down."
    new "据她说，停电和那个行李箱都与她无关。她还说，第一次上去时没看见行李箱，可下楼时它就在那里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:7225
    old "...I assume you didn't find anyone, naturally."
    new "……不用问，你们也没找到人吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:7236
    old "Then that has to settle it. If nobody else is here, only she could've left the suitcase in hallway C. She almost broke down as she thought of more ways to explain herself. You'll see when we find her."
    new "那就说得通了。如果这里没有别人，能把行李箱留在C走廊的只可能是她。她绞尽脑汁想更多说辞时，几乎要撑不住了。等找到她，你们就知道了。"

    # game/script.rpy:7241
    old "By the way, when the elevator moved, couldn't it have been the higher group?"
    new "对了，电梯动的时候，会不会是上面那组人？"

    # game/script.rpy:7247
    old "Us? No. We didn't use it again."
    new "我们？没有。我们没再用过电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:7251
    old "...Is that so? And you didn't get separated?"
    new "……是吗？你们没有分开过？"

    # game/script.rpy:7253
    old "Again, he said that while looking directly at me."
    new "他又一次直视着我说出这句话。"

    # game/script.rpy:7258
    old "...No. We stayed together until now."
    new "……没有。我们一直在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:7259
    old "Are you sure?"
    new "你确定？"

    # game/script.rpy:7260
    old "Why are you being so insistent? Do you have a reason to think we split up?"
    new "你为什么非要问这个？难道你有理由认为我们分开了？"

    # game/script.rpy:7265
    old "Oh, no, I don't think so. Forgive me, Atsuki."
    new "哦，不，我没那个意思。抱歉，Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:7269
    old "What the hell was up with him? That had sounded like a taunt without feeling like one."
    new "他到底怎么回事？那句话听着像是在挑衅，却又没有挑衅的感觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:7270
    old "His behavior toward me had changed in some way. I didn't know the reason, but it felt like he was trying to incite me to say something."
    new "他对我的态度确实有些变了。我不知道原因，但感觉他像是在激我说些什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:7275
    old "I'm sure they didn't split up. The four of them came from floor 5, and nobody could've gone past us while we were investigating floors 2 and 3."
    new "我确定他们没有分开。他们四个人是从五楼下来的，而我们在二楼和三楼调查时，不可能有人从我们身边过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:7280
    old "...All right, then."
    new "……那好吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:7281
    old "As if we were all conspiring against him, he turned around and stopped moving. I was a bit puzzled, trying to understand how to interpret his new attitude."
    new "他转过身停住脚步，像是我们都在合谋对付他似的。我有些困惑，不知该怎么理解他这种新态度。"

    # game/script.rpy:7286
    old "Well, we will always be able to check the security footage once that's fixed. For now, we should make sure to find Naomi, I'd say."
    new "总之，等监控修好，我们随时都能查看录像。眼下还是先找到 Naomi 要紧。"

    # game/script.rpy:7287
    old "Implying one more time that there was more to our actions than we'd let on, he breathed slowly and started to go back down without turning around."
    new "他再一次暗示我们的行动另有隐情，随即缓缓呼了口气，头也不回地朝楼下走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:7292
    old "Someone should stay here in case Naomi tries to go up. The rest of us will split downstairs to make sure she's found.{w} Another person will also be needed to stay on floor 2 to make sure she doesn't intend to pointlessly go hide there. Three will be enough to inspect the whole first floor. One person will stay in the lobby, the other in hallway C, and the last person will check every room in both hallways. She will not escape."
    new "得有人留在这里，以防 Naomi 想上楼。其余人分头去楼下，确保找到她。{w} 还需要一个人守在二楼，免得她又想着躲到那里去。检查整个一楼，三个人就够了。一个人守大厅，一个人守 C走廊，最后一个人搜查两条走廊的每个房间。她逃不掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:7293
    old "The person at the lobby will look through hallway B, and the one at hallway C will look through hallway A. This time, Naomi won't be able to cross between hallways. Let's go. I'll stay in the lobby and check the mechanical room."
    new "守大厅的人负责查 B走廊，守 C走廊的人负责查 A走廊。这次 Naomi 没法在两条走廊之间穿过去了。走吧。我留在大厅，顺便检查机械室。"

    # game/script.rpy:7294
    old "...All right. That doesn't sound bad to me."
    new "……好。我没意见。"

    # game/script.rpy:7300
    old "I'll look through the rooms. I think I should be the one to do that."
    new "房间由我来查吧。我觉得这事该由我来做。"

    # game/script.rpy:7307
    old "Isla and I will stay here since only four people are needed. We'll keep watch at the elevator."
    new "只需要四个人，所以我和 Isla 留在这儿。我们在电梯口守着。"

    # game/script.rpy:7312
    old "No! I'll look through the rooms too!"
    new "不行！我也要去查房间！"

    # game/script.rpy:7313
    old "Be a bit cooperative, Isla. I think staying here would be better for everyone."
    new "Isla，配合一点。我觉得留在这里对大家都好。"

    # game/script.rpy:7321
    old "As if she hadn't heard her mother, Isla ran down the stairs. Instead of trying to convince her, the others thought it better to follow behind."
    new "Isla 像是没听见母亲的话，径自跑下了楼梯。其他人见状也不再劝，索性跟了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:7326
    old "Shiroya, Sai, and I were the ones without an assigned position, which left us unaware of what to do."
    new "Shiroya、Sai 和我都没有分到位置，一时不知该如何是好。"

    # game/script.rpy:7327
    old "It's not ideal, but I'll quickly check through floors 3 and 2 with Akaro's help and then stay in hallway C. You two make sure the elevator doesn't let Naomi escape."
    new "虽然不太理想，但我让 Akaro 帮忙，快速查一遍三楼和二楼，然后守在 C走廊。你们俩盯住电梯，别让 Naomi 从那儿跑了。"

    # game/script.rpy:7331
    old "Without waiting for a reply, Sai left both of us on the fourth floor, all by ourselves."
    new "Sai 没等我们答话便走了，把我和 Shiroya 两个人留在了四楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:7338
    old "Ring Chain"
    new "锁链之环"

    # game/script.rpy:7341
    old "All right then. Here we are."
    new "好吧。就是这儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:7346
    old "...Hopefully they can find her and clear everything up."
    new "……但愿他们能找到她，把事情弄清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:7347
    old "I can't imagine Naomi hiding from them unless she knows about some secret spot."
    new "除非 Naomi 知道什么隐蔽的地方，不然我想不出她怎么能躲过他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:7348
    old "Yeah. It won't take very long either."
    new "嗯。应该也用不了多长时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:7350
    old "I'm curious to see what'll happen. It's unfortunate she showed up while we weren't there."
    new "真想知道会怎么样。可惜她偏偏趁我们不在的时候出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:7351
    old "But it's very likely she actually did appear since the three of them would have no reason to lie together."
    new "不过她多半真的出现过——他们三个没有理由串通起来一起撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:7356
    old "Were you thinking that maybe Naomi was never there at all?"
    new "你是在想，说不定 Naomi 根本没来过？"

    # game/script.rpy:7357
    old "No, not really. I just couldn't take it completely seriously since we hadn't seen her."
    new "也不是。只是我们没亲眼见到她，我总觉得不能全当真。"

    # game/script.rpy:7362
    old "You thought Katei was lying to us earlier, right? Have you changed your mind?"
    new "你之前觉得 Katei 在骗我们，对吧？现在改主意了？"

    # game/script.rpy:7363
    old "Thinking back on what Katei had just said... I wasn't sure how to approach it."
    new "回想 Katei 刚才说的话……我不知该怎么理解这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:7366
    old "I don't know. Honestly, everything Katei said regarding Naomi just now was pretty questionable, but it seemed like he really wanted us to find her. You heard how determined he sounded. I'm not sure he'd lie about what Naomi told him only to turn around and make us find her."
    new "说不好。老实说，Katei 刚才关于 Naomi 的那些话都很可疑，可他看起来是真心想让我们找到她。你也听见他语气有多坚决了。他总不至于捏造 Naomi 对他说过的话，转头又催着我们去找人吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:7367
    old "So it's likely it was all the truth."
    new "那就是说，他讲的很可能都是真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:7368
    old "I'm really not sure.{w} Anyway, how are you holding up? Sorry, I've just been trying to think about—"
    new "我真说不准。{w}对了，你还好吗？抱歉，我一直在想——"

    # game/script.rpy:7374
    old "We were both startled. Though louder and clearer, the same sound we'd heard earlier repeated."
    new "我们两个都吓了一跳。先前听见的那个声音又响了一遍，比之前更响、更清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:7377
    old "She took the elevator...!"
    new "她坐电梯了……！"

    # game/script.rpy:7382
    old "Why would she run away?"
    new "她为什么要跑？"

    # game/script.rpy:7387
    old "I recalled what Sai had said too late. We weren't close enough to stop it on the fourth floor. Trying to avoid wasting time, we ran toward the other side to arrive at her destination before we missed her.{w} In our defense, we'd heard the sound when the elevator had been about to pass us by, so stopping it in time wouldn't have been possible."
    new "等我回想起 Sai 的叮嘱时，已经晚了。我们在四楼离得太远，根本来不及拦下。为了不浪费时间，我们朝另一侧跑去，想赶在她离开之前到达她的目的地。{w} 说句公道话，我们听见动静时电梯已经快要驶过这一层，本来也来不及拦住。"

    # game/script.rpy:7392
    old "We should've just kept it open...! I didn't think she would actually go up!"
    new "早知道就让它一直开着……！我没想到她真的会往上跑！"

    # game/script.rpy:7393
    old "And I didn't think fast enough, damn it! Sai just wanted us to keep them in place."
    new "怪我反应太慢，可恶！Sai 只是要我们把人看住而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:7399
    old "Shiroya ran behind me. I wanted to tell her to slow down and let me go by myself, but it would've been inconsiderate. If I thought going up was dangerous, I would've tried to make her stay behind, but Naomi was presumably running around defenseless, so the odds were probably in our favor."
    new "Shiroya 跟在我身后跑。我想叫她慢一点，让我一个人去，可那样未免太不体谅人。若我认为上楼有危险，一定会劝她留下；但 Naomi 多半手无寸铁地四处乱跑，局面应该对我们有利。"

    # game/script.rpy:7403
    old "Even though the floors were very wide, the path to the next one was straightforward enough to make it a quick trip."
    new "楼层虽然宽阔，通往上一层的路线却很直接，没费多少工夫。"

    # game/script.rpy:7412
    old "We arrived on floor 5. We thought the elevator hadn't stopped there because it seemed to linger for a bit too long, but I still quickly went through the three partitions while Shiroya stayed next to the first door.{w} As I'd thought, they were empty."
    new "我们到了五楼。电梯刚才似乎停得久了些，我们怀疑它在这一层停过，但我还是迅速把三个隔间查了一遍，Shiroya 则守在第一个隔间门口。{w} 果然，里面空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:7418
    old "I met Shiroya by the door with a dubious look. We would hear it if Naomi used the elevator to go back down, so there was no way she'd make it past us unnoticed."
    new "我带着狐疑的神情回到门边，与 Shiroya 会合。Naomi 若乘电梯下楼，我们一定会听见，所以她绝不可能悄无声息地从我们眼皮底下溜过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:7419
    old "Nothing. She must be upstairs."
    new "什么都没有。她一定还在楼上。"

    # game/script.rpy:7424
    old "We directed ourselves toward the sixth floor, but Shiroya stopped me."
    new "我们往六楼走去，Shiroya 却叫住了我。"

    # game/script.rpy:7429
    old "H-Hold on, let's check this."
    new "等、等一下，先看看这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:7437
    old "She tried to open the elevator, but the door didn't budge. Since that meant it was above us, she pressed the button to call it."
    new "她试着拉开电梯门，门却纹丝不动。这说明电梯停在楼上，于是她按下按钮呼叫电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:7438
    old "Shortly, the button lit up orange in silence. Then, Shiroya opened the door and we saw the empty elevator."
    new "片刻后，按钮静悄悄地亮起橙光。接着 Shiroya 拉开门，电梯里空空如也。"

    # game/script.rpy:7446
    old "With how fast it got here, it must've been on the sixth floor."
    new "它来得这么快，一定就在六楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:7448
    old "Technically, there was just one more possibility: the attic.{w} But you'd need a unique key for that, and Shiroya was right. The elevator only took a few seconds to arrive, indicating that there had only been a single floor of separation.{w} By moving it, we'd also prevented Naomi from using it upstairs."
    new "严格说来，还剩一种可能：阁楼。{w} 但那里需要专门的钥匙，而且 Shiroya 说得对——电梯只花了几秒就到，说明它只隔了一层。{w} 我们把它叫下来，也断了 Naomi 在楼上用电梯的路。"

    # game/script.rpy:7455
    old "We quickly went up to the sixth floor, where the elevator had been taken. It was only used once, so someone was definitely there. Naomi was very close."
    new "我们迅速上了六楼——电梯刚才就停在这里。它只被用过一次，说明这里肯定有人。Naomi 就在不远处。"

    # game/script.rpy:7459
    old "The bathrooms were empty, so she had to be farther ahead."
    new "洗手间里没有人，她一定在更前面。"

    # game/script.rpy:7465
    old "I'll go check. Make sure nobody can leave."
    new "我去看看。你守住，别让任何人离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:7468
    old "What? It might not be safe. Don't just go alone."
    new "什么？里面未必安全。别一个人去。"

    # game/script.rpy:7474
    old "With a meaningless head gesture, she ran off and left me by myself. She was clearly not content with the thought of waiting behind again."
    new "她随意地点了下头，便跑开了，把我一个人留在原地。她显然不愿再守在后面等。"

    # game/script.rpy:7475
    old "I knew I had to go with her. Letting someone escape was far less important than letting Shiroya confront potential danger, but I couldn't bring myself to move."
    new "我知道自己该跟她一起去。比起放走一个人，让 Shiroya 独自面对危险要严重得多——可我的脚却怎么也迈不出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:7479
    old "She had disappeared from my field of vision. Given the layout of the floor, she wouldn't be able to make sure nobody could sneak past her, so I had to wait behind in anticipation."
    new "她已经从我视野里消失了。照这一层的布局，她没法保证没人偷溜过去，所以我只能留在原地，提高警惕等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:7480
    old "If she first checked the opposite corridor and someone was hiding in the offices, they could then escape. If someone was in the corridor and she chose to first inspect the offices, they could also escape."
    new "如果她先查对面的走廊，而有人藏在办公室里，那人便能趁机逃走；反过来，若走廊上有人，她却先去查办公室，同样会让人溜掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:7481
    old "However, that didn't actually hold up perfectly. To inspect the corridor, she would only have to see if it was empty from a position that would still let her see the inside of the first partition. That could let the culprit escape, but at least they'd be seen."
    new "不过，这个推断也并非全然成立。要确认走廊的情况，她只需站在一个仍能看见第一间隔间内部的位置，看看走廊是否空着。这样一来，藏在隔间里的人也许能逃掉，但至少会被她看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:7482
    old "I felt like she'd known I'd been about to ask her to stay behind and had chosen to reverse our roles before I had a chance to act. Trying not to let undesired thoughts get the best of me, I attempted to stay calm as Shiroya had asked."
    new "我觉得她早就看出我要开口留她，索性抢在我行动之前跟我换了位置。我努力不让那些不愿去想的念头占据上风，按 Shiroya 说的，尽量保持冷静。"

    # game/script.rpy:7486
    old "...Almost half a minute passed, and I began to get impatient and a bit anxious. While the floor was big, it was also silent except for air movement. If she felt she was in danger, I would be able to hear her shout easily."
    new "……将近半分钟过去，我渐渐等得不耐烦，也生出几分不安。这层楼虽然宽敞，却静得出奇，只听得见空气流动的声响。若她察觉危险，只要喊一声，我应该很容易听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:7487
    old "Only a few seconds after that, I snapped. What was I doing, standing there and leaving her up against an unknown person who'd been involved in the attack? I prepared to take off running as soon as the realization finally came to me."
    new "又过了几秒，我猛地回过神来。我究竟在做什么？竟站在原地，让她独自面对一个参与袭击的身份不明的人。一想到这里，我立刻准备拔腿狂奔。"

    # game/script.rpy:7488
    old "But before I could, I saw Shiroya's figure coming out of the narrow passageway."
    new "可还没等我迈步，Shiroya 的身影便从狭窄的通道里走了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:7489
    old "She approached me slowly and noticed my anxiety."
    new "她缓缓走近，察觉到了我的不安。"

    # game/script.rpy:7495
    old "D-Did something happen?"
    new "出、出什么事了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:7496
    old "...No, nothing. You took a bit, so I started to worry."
    new "……没，没什么。你去了好一会儿，我有些担心。"

    # game/script.rpy:7501
    old "Oh, really...? I'm sorry. I didn't find anyone, though."
    new "啊，真的吗……？抱歉。不过，我没找到任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:7503
    old "...How is that possible? There should've been someone."
    new "……怎么可能？这里本该有人的。"

    # game/script.rpy:7508
    old "I know. But look, this is what I wanted to show you."
    new "我知道。不过你看，我想让你看的，就是这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:7509
    old "Huh?"
    new "嗯？"

    # game/script.rpy:7513
    old "Once again, she walked back to where she'd come from, instructing me to follow her. Had she found something important?"
    new "她再次转身走回原路，示意我跟上。难道她发现了什么要紧的东西？"

    # game/script.rpy:7525
    old "Instead of stopping in front of the offices, she continued toward the other corridor."
    new "她没有在办公室前停下，而是继续朝另一条走廊走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:7526
    old "Earlier, we thought this place was empty and completely missed a door."
    new "之前我们以为这一带空荡荡的，结果完全漏看了一扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:7527
    old "...What?"
    new "……什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:7528
    old "See, look. But it's closed."
    new "你看，就是那儿。不过门关着。"

    # game/script.rpy:7537
    old "She was right. At the far back of what had appeared to be a dead end, there was a small door that we'd entirely failed to notice."
    new "她说得没错。在那条看似死路的尽头，藏着一扇我们完全没注意到的小门。"

    # game/script.rpy:7538
    old "Oh, of course. We were told this door existed."
    new "哦，对了。之前确实有人提过这扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:7547
    old "It looked just like a plain door. Instinctively, I reached for the doorknob and tried to get it open to no avail—it was tightly locked. Under it was a big keyhole that would require an equally big key to unlock the special section of the tower."
    new "那看上去只是一扇再普通不过的门。我下意识握住门把，试着推开，却纹丝不动——门锁得严严实实。门把下方是一个很大的锁孔，要打开塔内这片特殊区域，想必得用同样大的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:7549
    old "So, past this door must be the attic, where Ashiya lived for years."
    new "这么说，门后就是阁楼——芦屋家曾在那里住了好些年。"

    # game/script.rpy:7550
    old "Yeah, it has to be that. There must be different stairs leading up to it since it's a floor higher."
    new "嗯，肯定是这样。阁楼比这里高一层，应该另有楼梯通上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:7551
    old "Right, so it's very likely whoever came up here had a way to open this door. There's no other explanation, really."
    new "对。那么，上到这里的人多半有办法打开这扇门。除此之外，实在没有别的解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:7557
    old "I thought about it a little, and that doesn't make sense to me."
    new "我稍微想了想，还是觉得说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:7560
    old "I looked through this corridor first, and since you were covering the only exit, I knew I had plenty of time, so I walked farther and realized we'd missed this door."
    new "我先查看的是这条走廊。出口只有一个，又有你守着，我知道自己时间充裕，便一直往里走，才发现我们漏掉了这扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:7561
    old "I tried to open it, but it was already locked. Then I went to the offices, which were empty. Since nobody could've left this floor, the only explanation is that they went through here."
    new "我试着开过，但门已经锁上了。之后我去了办公室，那里空无一人。既然没人能离开这层楼，那就只可能是从这儿过去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:7566
    old "What doesn't make sense to me is that they got off on this floor with the elevator."
    new "我想不通的是，他们居然是在这一层下的电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:7567
    old "...You're right. We determined it was here, so if whoever used it was able to open this door, they would've just taken the elevator all the way up."
    new "……你说得对。我们确定电梯停在这一层；既然使用电梯的人能打开这扇门，那他们大可直接乘电梯上到阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:7568
    old "Yeah. Katei specifically said that the key works for both the door and the elevator."
    new "是啊。Katei 特意说过，那把钥匙既能开这扇门，也能开电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:7569
    old "Hm..."
    new "嗯……"

    # game/script.rpy:7570
    old "I tried to look through the keyhole and under the door, but nothing could be seen. Was there someone behind it, possibly listening to us?"
    new "我试着透过锁孔和门缝往里看，却什么也看不见。门后会不会有人，正在偷听我们说话？"

    # game/script.rpy:7573
    old "We went up fast, so I doubt they could've taken the elevator up to the attic and then sent it to the sixth floor to conceal where they'd gone."
    new "我们上来得很快，所以他们应该来不及先乘电梯到阁楼，再把电梯送到六楼，好掩盖自己的去向。"

    # game/script.rpy:7574
    old "Yeah, we experienced how slow it was. There wouldn't have been time for that.{w} I thought that maybe this door was already unlocked or that they had the key hidden somewhere on this floor."
    new "是啊，我们都见识过它有多慢，根本来不及那么做。{w}我原本想，也许这扇门本就没锁，或者他们把钥匙藏在了这层楼的某处。"

    # game/script.rpy:7575
    old "I doubt the door was unlocked. We could've easily found it earlier, so they wouldn't have let us enter it like that."
    new "我不认为门当时是开着的。那样的话，我们之前很容易就能发现它，他们不会任由我们就这样进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:7576
    old "Also, it's locked now. If it was actually open, unless it can be manually locked from the inside, they must've had the key."
    new "再说，门现在锁着。如果它原本真的开着，除非能从里面手动上锁，否则他们一定有钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:7577
    old "I stayed quiet for a bit. Were we on the right line of thinking? If the culprit had access to the attic, a few things we'd considered would be invalidated."
    new "我沉默了片刻。我们想的方向对吗？如果凶手能进入阁楼，那我们先前的一些推断就都站不住脚了。"

    # game/script.rpy:7580
    old "What if the elevator was empty?"
    new "如果电梯里根本没人呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:7585
    old "And someone sent it here from the crystal floor?"
    new "还是说，有人从水晶层把它送到这儿的？"

    # game/script.rpy:7586
    old "I'm not sure what the intention would be, but it's possible whoever sent it was hoping to lure us out of where we were."
    new "我不确定这么做有什么目的，但叫电梯的人或许是想把我们引开。"

    # game/script.rpy:7591
    old "Oh, yeah. If they wanted to get to the fourth floor, they could've sent the elevator to make us follow it, but that seems pointless. It'd give them time, but they'd still be cornered. It's not that difficult to inspect every floor."
    new "哦，也对。假如他们想去四楼，大可以让电梯引我们追过去，可这似乎没有意义。那样确实能争取时间，但他们仍会被逼进死角。逐层搜查又不是什么难事。"

    # game/script.rpy:7592
    old "...And Sai did say that he would check the second and third floors before staying in hallway C. Unless he was the one who moved it, the culprit would've also had to make it past him."
    new "……而且 Sai 说过，他检查完二楼和三楼后，会守在 C走廊。除非电梯是他动的，否则凶手还得从他眼皮底下过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:7593
    old "Such a theory sounded very unlikely, but if it was right, we'd soon find out. We couldn't know if the elevator had moved before the others reached the crystal floor."
    new "这种推测听起来可能性很小，但若果真如此，很快就能见分晓。在其他人到达水晶层之前，电梯究竟有没有动过，我们无从得知。"

    # game/script.rpy:7596
    old "I was also thinking that if the person we're searching for has access to the attic, they might've been responsible for the first time we heard the elevator."
    new "我也在想，如果我们要找的人能进阁楼，那第一次听到的电梯声，或许也是那人弄出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:7597
    old "We made sure floors 5 and 6 were empty, but if that person was one floor higher, they could've called the elevator resting on floor 6 and then gone down with it. That would explain why it didn't immediately go back up."
    new "我们确认过五楼和六楼都没人，可如果那人就在更高一层，就能把停在六楼的电梯叫上去，再乘着它下来。这也就解释了电梯为什么没有立刻升回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:7602
    old "Hm... Then the same person must've been who used it just now. It's possible they got off on floor 6 instead of the attic because they knew it would be empty and could easily reach this door.{w} If we noticed the elevator and followed it, it would look like it was empty, but if they went directly to the attic instead, we might've noticed it went there if we called it fast enough."
    new "嗯……那刚才用电梯的肯定也是同一个人。他们没去阁楼，而是在六楼下了电梯，可能是因为知道这层没人，能轻易到门前。{w} 如果我们注意到电梯并追过去，看到的只会是空电梯；可要是他们直接去了阁楼，我们只要及时叫电梯，就可能发现它停到了那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:7603
    old "I see. Something along these lines might make the most sense. We should go see if the others found Naomi."
    new "原来如此。这样解释或许最说得通。我们该去看看其他人有没有找到 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:7609
    old "We slowly walked back. I'd always seen Shiroya as intelligent, and she had just shown that sharing my thoughts with her was a good idea despite her recent state of mind."
    new "我们缓步往回走。我一向觉得 Shiroya 聪慧，而她刚才也证明，尽管近来心绪不佳，把我的想法说给她听仍是明智的。"

    # game/script.rpy:7610
    old "Perhaps she had been silently thinking by herself until then. Regardless, that was the longest conversation we'd had in many days, but it already felt like we were many steps closer to normalcy."
    new "也许在那之前，她一直独自默默思考。不管怎样，那是我们许多天以来最长的一次交谈，却已让人觉得，我们离恢复如常近了许多。"

    # game/script.rpy:7614
    old "I knew things wouldn't quite feel right for a much longer time, but if we went back to being our normal selves around each other, we could get there much quicker."
    new "我知道，要真正觉得一切如常，还需很久；但只要我们能在彼此面前恢复原本的样子，就能更快走到那一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:7618
    old "I'd been thinking about it nonstop. I didn't know if wishing to go back to how things used to be meant that I was a bad person, but I couldn't change the way I felt."
    new "我一直在想这件事。我不知道，希望一切回到从前是否就说明我是个坏人，可我改变不了自己的感受。"

    # game/script.rpy:7622
    old "Before we reached the staircase, we noticed that fast but quiet footsteps were approaching. We stopped awkwardly and waited to see who they belonged to."
    new "还没走到楼梯口，我们就听见一阵急促却轻悄的脚步声正在靠近。我们有些尴尬地停下，等着看来人是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:7623
    old "...It was Akaro. He came running from floor 5."
    new "……是 Akaro。他从五楼跑了过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:7629
    old "What are you doing here? We need you two to come to the crystal floor."
    new "你们怎么会在这儿？都到水晶层来一趟。"

    # game/script.rpy:7630
    old "Did you find Naomi?"
    new "找到 Naomi 了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:7635
    old "No, quite the opposite. Sai said that all of us should be there to discuss what happened."
    new "没有，正好相反。Sai 说大家都要到场，一起商量发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:7636
    old "A-All right... Let's go, then."
    new "好、好吧……那我们走。"

    # game/script.rpy:7639
    old "Akaro, out of breath, turned around without wasting time."
    new "Akaro 上气不接下气，转身就走，一刻也没耽搁。"

    # game/script.rpy:7640
    old "I didn't think you'd be on the highest floor. Weren't you supposed to wait on the fourth?"
    new "我还以为你们不会在最高层。你们不是该在四楼等着吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:7645
    old "We began to go down the stairs. Meanwhile, we told Akaro that we'd determined the elevator stopped on the sixth floor and there was no one there."
    new "我们一边下楼，一边告诉 Akaro，我们已经确认电梯停在了六楼，而且那里一个人也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:7650
    old "Our conversation continued as we quickly circled through floors 5 and 4. Akaro was hurrying up a fair bit, and he hadn't given us much context."
    new "我们一边快步穿过五楼和四楼，一边继续交谈。Akaro 走得相当急，也没跟我们多解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:7651
    old "Oh, right. We heard the elevator going up too, but Sai told us not to chase it since you two would take care of it and could've been sent as bait."
    new "哦，对了。我们也听见电梯上去了，但 Sai 说别去追，你们俩会处理，说不定是故意放出来钓人的诱饵。"

    # game/script.rpy:7652
    old "I suppose he gave us too much credit. We didn't react immediately, but I doubt we could've intercepted it."
    new "他未免太高看我们了。我们没能立刻反应过来，不过就算反应过来了，恐怕也拦不住。"

    # game/script.rpy:7656
    old "Those were the last words we heard during the way down, as neither of them chose to reply with anything else."
    new "下楼途中，那便是我们听到的最后几句话，他们两个都没有再回应。"

    # game/script.rpy:7661
    old "Once we'd made it to the last set of stairs, we slowed down our pace as I began to think about what could've happened to warrant the demand of our immediate presence."
    new "走到最后一段楼梯时，我们放慢了脚步。我开始琢磨：究竟出了什么事，才非得让我们立刻赶过去？"

    # game/script.rpy:7672
    old "The others were all next to the stairs, waiting for us."
    new "其他人都在楼梯旁等着我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:7681
    old "That took a bit. Where were you?"
    new "费了不少工夫啊。你们跑哪儿去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:7682
    old "On the sixth floor."
    new "在六层。"

    # game/script.rpy:7687
    old "Oh, so you had to check every floor."
    new "哦，那你们是一层层查过去的？"

    # game/script.rpy:7692
    old "I just ran up hoping to eventually find them, and they said they hadn't seen anyone."
    new "我就是一路往上跑，想着总能碰上他们，结果他们说谁也没看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:7693
    old "It's where the elevator stopped, but we're not sure anyone came out of it."
    new "电梯确实停在那一层，不过有没有人出来，我们说不准。"

    # game/script.rpy:7698
    old "So I was right. For some reason, they just wanted it to be followed."
    new "看来我猜对了。不知为什么，他们就是要让人去追。"

    # game/script.rpy:7699
    old "I doubt it, honestly. They could only gain time doing that, and given there are eleven hours left, it seems silly. It's possible they don't know that they've been trapped here for twelve hours, but they can't be simply trying to buy themselves time. I think they actually might've escaped by using the elevator."
    new "老实说，我不这么看。他们那样做只能拖延时间，可离结束还有十一个小时，这么做未免太蠢了。也许他们并不知道自己已经被困在这里十二个小时，但总不至于只是为了拖时间。我反倒觉得，他们真的可能借电梯逃掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:7700
    old "How?"
    new "怎么逃？"

    # game/script.rpy:7703
    old "Before that, why don't you tell us what happened? Was Naomi here?"
    new "先说说你们这边出了什么事吧。Naomi 来过吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:7704
    old "I couldn't see her, so it was safe to assume that wasn't the case. I wanted to get straight to the point before suggesting that the person hiding from us might've had access to the attic."
    new "我没看见她，看来她不在。我想先把话说到点子上，再提出那个猜想：躲着我们的人，也许能进阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:7709
    old "We haven't looked through the whole floor yet, actually."
    new "其实这一层我们还没搜完。"

    # game/script.rpy:7710
    old "I quickly made sure nobody was on the third and second floors while the others prevented anyone from sneaking past. That was when the elevator was used, and I assume you couldn't stop it."
    new "我很快确认了三层和二层都没人，其他人则守着，防止有人溜过去。电梯就是那会儿动的，看来你们也没拦住。"

    # game/script.rpy:7711
    old "No, we weren't expecting it so soon."
    new "没有，我们没想到会这么快。"

    # game/script.rpy:7712
    old "Whatever. We went to the first floor, and we did what you heard Katei propose. He went ahead and looked through the lobby and the mechanical room. When he was done, he stayed next to the door leading to hallway B."
    new "算了。我们下到一层，照你们听到的 Katei 提议的那样做。他先查了大堂和机械室，查完就守在通往B走廊的那道门旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:7715
    old "Akaro began to look through the hallway B rooms since he'd looked at the bathrooms previously. Isla wanted to join him, so Erina had to follow behind. The three of them started to enter the rooms while I stayed here, looking at hallway A so that nobody could escape."
    new "Akaro 之前查过洗手间，这回就由他查B走廊的房间。Isla 想跟去，Erina 只好也跟上。他们三个一间间进去，我留在原地看着A走廊，免得有人逃掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:7724
    old "Since the elevator had already gone up, it was pointless to call it and leave its door open. I couldn't see the three of them looking inside the rooms since I was staring at the other hallway and blocking the staircase, though."
    new "电梯既然已经上去了，把它叫下来、让门开着也没意义。不过我一直盯着另一条走廊、堵着楼梯口，看不到他们三个进屋查看的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:7725
    old "Anyway, apparently when they entered the event room, Isla went ahead and raised the curtain on the cabinet. The \"It's gone!\" shout I heard even from here conveyed her surprise pretty well."
    new "总之，据说他们进了活动室，Isla 直接掀开了展示柜的遮布。她那声『不见了！』我在这边都听得见，把她的惊讶传达得再清楚不过。"

    # game/script.rpy:7732
    old "What...? The Sekimeiya's gone?"
    new "什么……？Sekimeiya 不见了？"

    # game/script.rpy:7737
    old "Yes... It should've still been there, but I didn't see it anywhere."
    new "嗯……它本该还在那里的，可我哪儿都没看到。"

    # game/script.rpy:7742
    old "Katei abandoned his post after hearing Isla shout, but I didn't want to rush inside and leave an easy escape route open. When they came and told me what had happened, I thought you two had to get down here. Since we're dealing with this situation, I found it appropriate to join up and make sure nothing slipped away."
    new "Isla 一喊，Katei 就离开了岗位，可我总不能也冲进去，把一条容易逃跑的路空在那儿不管。等他们过来把事情告诉我，我就觉得你们俩该下来了。既然出了这种事，我想还是大家汇合到一起，别让什么溜走为好。"

    # game/script.rpy:7747
    old "I told Akaro to go find you, and I took that time to check if it really had disappeared while the others waited here.{w} It's gone. I stayed there a while, thinking about what could've happened, and expecting to find you two when I came back. Anyway, many of these rooms haven't been investigated yet. We stayed here until you came back to secure the only exits."
    new "我让 Akaro 去找你们，趁这工夫自己去确认它是不是真不见了，其他人就守在这里。{w}确实不见了。我在那儿待了一阵，一边想究竟是怎么回事，一边还想着回来时能看见你们俩。总之，这里还有不少房间没查。我们一直守在这儿，看住仅有的出口，等你们回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:7748
    old "I understand... It's good that the stairs and the elevator are next to each other.{w} Can I go see it?"
    new "我明白了……楼梯和电梯挨在一起，这倒是好事。{w}我能去看看吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:7749
    old "If you're looking forward to seeing an empty cabinet, go ahead. As long as someone stays here, we can move through this floor."
    new "要是你就想看个空展示柜，请便。只要这儿留着人，我们就能在这层走动。"

    # game/script.rpy:7757
    old "Everyone else had been looking at us without uttering a word. Shiroya and I slowly walked toward hallway A, and as we saw that nobody was stopping us, we sped up to the event room."
    new "其他人都一言不发地看着我们。我和 Shiroya 慢慢走向A走廊，见没人拦，便加快脚步赶往活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:7766
    old "It's really not here."
    new "真的不在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:7767
    old "I suppose he was right. There wasn't much of a point in checking."
    new "看来他说得没错。这一趟确实没什么必要。"

    # game/script.rpy:7772
    old "Not really."
    new "那倒也不是。"

    # game/script.rpy:7778
    old "We left through the same door and approached the others as I thought about it: what had happened? Were there really that many possibilities?"
    new "我们从同一扇门出去，走向其他人。我一直在想：到底发生了什么？可能性真有那么多吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:7784
    old "Was it gone, or did we all lie?"
    new "是真不见了，还是我们全都在撒谎？"

    # game/script.rpy:7785
    old "...Apparently not."
    new "……看来确实不在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:7786
    old "The Sekimeiya has been stolen this early, which is surprising. Anyone have a suggestion regarding what could've happened before we resume our search?"
    new "Sekimeiya 这么早就被偷走，实在出人意料。继续搜查之前，有谁猜得到可能发生了什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:7791
    old "It could only have been Naomi, right?"
    new "只能是 Naomi 干的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:7796
    old "No. It could only have been Naomi, Katei, or an unknown person."
    new "不对。只可能是 Naomi、Katei，或者某个我们不知道的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:7801
    old "Are you going to suspect me forever?"
    new "你打算一直怀疑我吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:7802
    old "It seems so. When we split up in two groups, it's possible either Naomi or an unknown person had already stolen the Sekimeiya. That's very easy to conclude. When we were in hallway B, Naomi could've entered the event room from hallway A, for example."
    new "看来会吧。我们分成两组的时候，Naomi 或者某个我们不知道的人可能已经把 Sekimeiya 偷走了。这很容易想到。比方说，我们在B走廊的时候，Naomi 完全可以从A走廊进活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:7805
    old "The group that took the elevator—Atsuki, Shiroya, Erina, and Isla—couldn't have gotten to this floor."
    new "坐电梯的那一组——Atsuki、Shiroya、Erina 和 Isla——不可能到这一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:7810
    old "Are you sure? It's possible they went past us and we didn't notice."
    new "你确定？说不定他们从我们旁边过去了，只是我们没注意。"

    # game/script.rpy:7811
    old "You already tried to say this earlier, didn't you? They couldn't have done that.{w} The way we looked through the floors would've made that impossible, and they couldn't have used the elevator since we only heard it once."
    new "这话你刚才就说过了吧？他们不可能做到的。{w}我们那样一层层搜过来，他们根本不可能从我们旁边过去；电梯也只响过一次，他们也没法用。"

    # game/script.rpy:7817
    old "And, naturally, when you came here with Naomi, you would've had an easy time picking up the Sekimeiya and then hiding it somewhere. Later, we'll check that mechanical room you were so happy to inspect."
    new "而且，你自然可以借着和 Naomi 一起来这里的机会，轻松取走 Sekimeiya，再藏到什么地方去。回头我们会查查你那么乐意检查的机械室。"

    # game/script.rpy:7822
    old "This is ridiculous. Didn't I say how important it was for the Sekimeiya to stay in its cabinet? Why would I hide it? There aren't even places to hide it in this building, and it would be pointless!"
    new "这太荒唐了。我不是说过 Sekimeiya 留在展示柜里有多重要吗？我为什么要藏它？这栋楼里根本没有能藏东西的地方，藏了也没有意义！"

    # game/script.rpy:7827
    old "I will admit that I have no idea what your reason could be, but similarly, I can't think of one regardless of who the culprit is. It is true that there aren't many hiding spots, and it's very early for this."
    new "我承认，我想不出你有什么理由；可同样地，不管犯人是谁，我也想不出理由。藏东西的地方确实不多，而且现在就做这种事，未免太早了。"

    # game/script.rpy:7832
    old "If one thing's for sure, it's that right now, the Sekimeiya must be on this floor with the culprit. There's no other possibility unless you question me and think that Akaro and I could've gone down instead of waiting on floor 4."
    new "有一点可以肯定：此刻 Sekimeiya 一定和犯人一起在这一层。除非你们怀疑我，觉得我和 Akaro 没守在四楼、而是下过楼，否则没有别的可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:7833
    old "I don't believe that's true. You looked through floors 3 and 2 for Naomi, but if the Sekimeiya was left there, you might've missed it."
    new "我不这么认为。你们为了找 Naomi 搜过三楼和二楼，可要是 Sekimeiya 被留在那儿，你们也可能漏掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:7838
    old "Oh, correct. That's a possibility too, but since the elevator that went up was probably empty, nobody can still be upstairs and hide it further, so we can go look for it above if nothing's found on this floor."
    new "哦，也对。那也是一种可能。不过上去的电梯里多半没人，所以楼上不可能还有人把东西再藏到别处。这一层找不到的话，我们再上楼找。"

    # game/script.rpy:7839
    old "...Even though floors 2 and 3 were a possibility, I knew it was also very possible that the culprit had gone to the attic holding the Sekimeiya. If our search amounted to nothing, I would bring up the conclusion Shiroya and I had reached."
    new "……虽说二楼和三楼也有可能，但我也清楚，犯人带着 Sekimeiya 去了阁楼的可能性同样不小。要是我们一无所获，我就把我和 Shiroya 得出的结论提出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:7840
    old "Let's proceed, then. We'll need to start from the beginning. Someone else go look through the lobby and the mechanical room, though."
    new "那就开始吧。得从头来一遍。不过，大厅和机械室换个人去查。"

    # game/script.rpy:7841
    old "Maybe we should start with that one."
    new "也许该从那一间开始。"

    # game/script.rpy:7849
    old "I directed my look at the room where the gemstones had been stolen—A5."
    new "我把目光投向宝石失窃的那间水晶展室——A5。"

    # game/script.rpy:7855
    old "Because of the camera?"
    new "因为摄像头？"

    # game/script.rpy:7856
    old "Yes. Like Sai said, hiding anything on this floor right now seems weird since we should be able to find it easily. We have plenty of time, and it's not a hard task. ...Not to mention that even if we can't find it, Ashiya surely will. It feels pretty redundant."
    new "对。就像 Sai 说的，现在把东西藏在这一层很奇怪，我们本该很容易找到。时间多得是，这也不是什么难事。……更何况就算我们找不到，芦屋也一定能找到。这么做实在多余。"

    # game/script.rpy:7857
    old "But there must be an actual reason behind it, and if they really intended to hide it from us, a room that's not being recorded seems to be the most likely place. Even if it's found, Ashiya will never be able to look at the footage to see who hid it."
    new "但背后一定有实际的理由。如果他们真想瞒过我们，没有被拍到的房间看来最有可能。就算东西被找到，芦屋也永远无法从录像里看出是谁藏的。"

    # game/script.rpy:7858
    old "This is a bit confusing, though. It's true that our three suspects are Katei, Naomi, and an unknown person. All of them would've had access to the Sekimeiya while we were knocked out, so I wonder why they didn't hide it then."
    new "不过这事有点让人想不通。我们的三个嫌疑人确实是 Katei、Naomi，还有一个不明人物。我们昏迷的时候，他们都有机会碰到 Sekimeiya，那为什么当时不藏起来呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:7863
    old "That's true...{w} Well, we can check there first if someone stays here."
    new "确实……{w}也罢，只要有人留在这里，我们就先去那儿查。"

    # game/script.rpy:7866
    old "Sai walked to the room and gestured at me to follow him. Everyone else stayed next to the stairs, as it wasn't yet a thorough search that would require further positioning."
    new "Sai 朝那间展室走去，示意我跟上。其他人留在楼梯旁——这还谈不上彻底搜查，不必再分头把守。"

    # game/script.rpy:7874
    old "Let's see. We should keep the door open. Otherwise, we won't see anything."
    new "看看再说。门得开着，不然什么都看不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:7875
    old "At first glance, there wasn't anything odd in the room. It all looked as it had when we'd last been there. Even though cabinets were the only thing inside, Sai started slowly examining them."
    new "乍看之下，展室里没有什么异样，和上次来时的样子一模一样。屋里除了展示柜别无他物，Sai 却开始慢慢逐一查看。"

    # game/script.rpy:7879
    old "I began looking through the opposite side of the room. There were plenty of places to hide a small object.{w} Behind the cabinets, under the pillows that normally held gemstones... A cabinet even had empty drawers."
    new "我从展室另一侧开始查看。能藏下小东西的地方多得是。{w}展示柜背后、平日托放宝石的垫子下面……甚至还有一只柜子带着空抽屉。"

    # game/script.rpy:7882
    old "As I looked at Sai, I realized that even though their appearances were nearly identical, not every cabinet was the same. He was inspecting the expansive interior of a cabinet after he'd opened up the heavy-looking lid. It seemed that the upper sections, where the gemstones usually were, could be lifted up."
    new "我望向 Sai，才发现这些展示柜虽然外表几乎一模一样，却并非全都相同。他掀开一只看似沉重的柜盖，正在查看柜子宽敞的内部。看来平时摆放宝石的上半部分可以整个抬起。"

    # game/script.rpy:7883
    old "Is there anything there?"
    new "里面有东西吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:7889
    old "...Yes. Some of these have hollow interiors, most likely to store things. Look, though."
    new "……有。有几只是空心的，大概是用来储物。不过你看。"

    # game/script.rpy:7890
    old "I had to get close to him, as the lack of illumination made it impossible to see what he was holding.{w} It was nothing noteworthy; he was cupping a small, yellow gemstone on his palm."
    new "我不得不凑近他，光线太暗，看不清他手里拿着什么。{w}也不是什么稀奇东西——他掌心里托着一颗小小的黄色宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:7894
    old "They must keep some of these inside the cabinets to swap out the displayed ones. Apparently, not all of this room's valuables were stolen."
    new "他们一定是把备用的宝石收在柜子里，用来替换展出的那些。看来这间展室的贵重物品并没有全部被盗。"

    # game/script.rpy:7895
    old "I see. I guess this could make for a decent hiding spot."
    new "原来如此。这倒算是个不错的藏东西的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:7896
    old "Sort of. The others were taking a while earlier, so they probably opened up some cabinets too. It's still an obvious spot if you're trying to find something."
    new "算是吧。刚才其他人也花了不少时间，多半也打开过几只柜子。不过真要找东西，这里还是太显眼了。"

    # game/script.rpy:7902
    old "...I went ahead and opened up a cabinet that looked like the one Sai was next to. It was a lot easier than it looked, and a wide but completely empty compartment appeared before me. As all the displays were usually attached to the surface below the glass, when the lid was opened up like a chest, they wouldn't roll."
    new "……我跟着掀开一只和 Sai 身旁那只相仿的展示柜。比看上去轻得多，一个宽阔却空无一物的隔层出现在眼前。因为所有展品平时都固定在玻璃下方的台面上，柜盖像箱子一样掀开时，它们也不会滚动。"

    # game/script.rpy:7903
    old "There's nothing in this one."
    new "这一只里什么都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:7909
    old "Yeah, the first one I looked at was empty as well."
    new "嗯，我看的第一只也是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:7912
    old "Not many more cabinets were left. Shortly after that, we had looked through all of them."
    new "剩下的展示柜已经不多。没过多久，我们就把所有柜子都查完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:7917
    old "It seems you were wrong. It's not here."
    new "看来你错了。不在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:7918
    old "I started to go over the cabinets Sai had looked through to be confident."
    new "为了确认，我又把 Sai 查过的那几只柜子重新看了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:7924
    old "Do you doubt my searching abilities, or do you think I hid it here and ignored it?"
    new "你是不信我搜查的本事，还是觉得是我藏在这里、又故意装没看见？"

    # game/script.rpy:7925
    old "...Neither, I just want to make sure we don't miss anything."
    new "……都不是。我只是不想漏掉什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:7927
    old "I answered without looking at him. It didn't take me long to come to the same conclusion: the Sekimeiya was not in the room."
    new "我没看他，答道。没过多久，我也得出了同样的结论：Sekimeiya 不在这间展室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:7932
    old "Are you done? We'll take forever if every room takes us this long."
    new "查完了吗？每间屋子都这么费时，得查到什么时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:7933
    old "We should probably look for anyone on this floor and then do a slower search for the Sekimeiya. The chances of someone and the Sekimeiya being here are pretty much the same."
    new "我们最好先在这一层找人，再慢慢搜 Sekimeiya。有人在这儿的可能性和 Sekimeiya 在这儿的可能性，其实差不了多少。"

    # game/script.rpy:7934
    old "That could be a good idea. Let's go back."
    new "这主意不错。回去吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:7938
    old "When he turned around, I fixed my eyes on Sai's back. Specifically, at the hip pack going around his waist. He stopped when he noticed I was still staring at him."
    new "他转身时，我把目光落在 Sai 的背上——准确地说，是他腰间那只腰包。他察觉到我还在盯着看，便停下了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:7943
    old "Are you looking at this?"
    new "你在看这个？"

    # game/script.rpy:7944
    old "He turned it around him and showed me its contents. I could only see a wallet and lip balm appropriate for the cold."
    new "他把腰包转到身前，让我看里面的东西。我只看到一个钱包，还有一支适合寒冬用的润唇膏。"

    # game/script.rpy:7949
    old "Don't be stupid. It might fit in here, but it'd be more than noticeable. Did you think I'd found it and masterfully put it in without your notice?"
    new "别犯傻了。那东西也许塞得进来，可会鼓得一眼就能看出来。你以为是我找到后，手法高超地趁你不注意塞进去的？"

    # game/script.rpy:7950
    old "Oh, no. I was just looking at it."
    new "哦，不是。我只是随便看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:7952
    old "I quite like it too. One of those birthday presents I first shrugged off and then ended up using frequently."
    new "我也挺喜欢它。算是生日礼物之一，起初我没当回事，后来却用得最勤。"

    # game/script.rpy:7955
    old "Once again, he turned around and quickly left the room.{w} I sighed and followed his steps. Outside, he was already next to the others."
    new "他又一次转过身，快步走出展室。{w}我叹了口气，跟了上去。到了外面，他已经站到其他人身边了。"

    # game/script.rpy:7964
    old "Anything...?"
    new "有发现吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:7965
    old "Nothing."
    new "什么都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:7966
    old "I tried to think of places where the Sekimeiya could've been hidden, but I couldn't come up with any good ones. If it was still on the crystal floor, we should've been able to find it."
    new "我试着去想 Sekimeiya 可能被藏在哪些地方，却想不出一个像样的。要是它还在水晶层，我们本该找得到。"

    # game/script.rpy:7967
    old "In a locker, maybe? That's the only safe place I can think of."
    new "也许在储物柜里？我能想到的安全之处只有那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:7968
    old "Oh, how about there?"
    new "啊，那里怎么样？"

    # game/script.rpy:7974
    old "The suitcase was still on the floor of hallway C."
    new "行李箱依旧搁在 C走廊的地板上。"

    # game/script.rpy:7975
    old "Did they bank on us not checking it again?"
    new "难道他们指望我们不会再检查一次？"

    # game/script.rpy:7976
    old "As I got closer to it, my confidence in that theory decreased. Surely they hadn't relied on such a simple trick."
    new "我越走近，就越怀疑这个推测。他们总不会真的只靠这么简单的小手段吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:7978
    old "It was still empty."
    new "里面依旧空空如也。"

    # game/script.rpy:7985
    old "Let's start, then. I suppose checking the bathrooms again is pointless since nobody could've entered them."
    new "那就开始吧。再查一遍洗手间也没意义，毕竟不可能有人进去过。"

    # game/script.rpy:7988
    old "Without waiting, Akaro stood up and headed toward hallway B. Isla followed behind, which obligated Erina to go with them."
    new "Akaro 没等别人回应便站起身，朝 B走廊走去。Isla 跟在后面，Erina 也只好一同前往。"

    # game/script.rpy:7993
    old "Let's continue with hallway A, actually. It's about time we find out if someone else is here, so let's first check for that. Akaro, before you move on to hallway B, look through the mechanical room too. Mind being the one in the lobby this time, Atsuki? Katei and I will stay here to watch hallway B."
    new "还是接着查 A走廊吧。也该弄清楚这里有没有别人了，所以先查这个。Akaro，你去 B走廊之前，也顺便看看机械室。Atsuki，这次换你留在大堂，行吗？Katei 和我留在这里盯着 B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:7994
    old "...Sure."
    new "……行。"

    # game/script.rpy:7995
    old "The others accepted it easily and began with hallway A, ignoring the room we'd just gotten out of."
    new "其他人爽快地接受了，从A走廊开始查起，完全没理会我们刚出来的那间房。"

    # game/script.rpy:8002
    old "Presumptuous as it was, Sai could've kept ordering us around as long as it was efficient. Since Shiroya didn't have a fixed position, she moved to the lobby door with me."
    new "Sai 这样安排固然有些自以为是，但只要效率够高，他尽可继续指挥我们。Shiroya 没有固定位置，便和我一起去了大堂门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:8005
    old "From there, we looked at the three people checking every room. Akaro led the pack."
    new "我们在大堂门口望着那三个人逐一检查房间，Akaro 走在最前头。"

    # game/script.rpy:8006
    old "My first idea was that someone left the Sekimeiya in a room without active security cameras. While the first location had been incorrect, that was still the most likely possibility."
    new "我最初的想法是，有人把 Sekimeiya 留在了没有启用监控摄像头的房间里。虽然第一个地点猜错了，但这仍是最有可能的情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:8007
    old "Five other rooms that met that criterion were still available: the staff room, the cleaning room, the mechanical room, the security room, and the storeroom.{w} I looked inside the cleaning bucket, the only place in the lobby where the Sekimeiya could've been hidden from view, but it only contained soapy water."
    new "符合这个条件的还有五个房间：员工室、清洁间、机械室、监控室和储藏室。{w} 我看了看清洁桶，那是大堂里唯一能把 Sekimeiya 藏起来不让人看见的地方，可里面只有肥皂水。"

    # game/script.rpy:8008
    old "The storeroom was examined, but they were just quickly looking for people—not the Sekimeiya. It was very possible it was in one of those rooms, and if Naomi had put it inside her locker in the staff room, for example, there wasn't much we could do about it. That was one of the only good hiding spots I could think of."
    new "储藏室也查过了，但他们只是快速确认里面有没有人，并不是在找 Sekimeiya。它很可能就在那些房间里；比如 Naomi 要是把它放进自己在员工室的储物柜，我们也拿她没办法。那是我能想到的少数几个好藏处之一。"

    # game/script.rpy:8011
    old "They entered the event room once again. After that, the security room, another place with a route to it that had no concern for cameras, was acknowledged as clean."
    new "他们又进了一次活动室。随后，监控室也被确认没有异常——通往那里的路线同样不会被摄像头拍到。"

    # game/script.rpy:8014
    old "Once I'd seen them come out of every room and claim that nobody had been in them, Akaro went to look at the mechanical room. Even though Isla remained outside, uninterested, Erina joined him as well."
    new "等我看着他们从每个房间出来、都说里面没人之后，Akaro 才去看机械室。Isla 留在外面，显得没什么兴趣，Erina 也跟着他一起进去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8015
    old "They took a considerably longer time with it since the messy interior made a proper search difficult. Once they returned, their expressions indicated that again, nothing of relevance had been found inside, refuting Sai's suspicion. Afterward, they moved on to hallway B."
    new "因为里面杂乱不堪，仔细搜查很费劲，他们花的时间明显更久。回来后，两人的表情说明里面仍没找到任何相关的东西，Sai 的怀疑也就落了空。随后，他们前往 B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:8019
    old "Shiroya and I headed to the hallway B door too, as it wasn't necessary to keep watching A any longer. As soon as it was confirmed empty, the only remaining concern was whether someone could move from hallway B to A through the event room, and since Sai and Katei had watched hallway B, it wasn't a real possibility."
    new "A走廊已经没必要继续盯着，Shiroya 和我也走向 B走廊的门口。等那边确认没人，剩下的唯一顾虑就是会不会有人从 B走廊经活动室溜到 A走廊；但 Sai 和 Katei 一直守着 B走廊，这种情况实际上不可能发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:8024
    old "Technically, only two people were needed to optimally search through the whole floor as long as someone stayed next to the stairs while looking into hallway A. Then, the other person could safely look through every room. We'd only been doing it differently because it was what Katei had suggested."
    new "严格来说，只要有人守在楼梯旁、留意 A走廊，两个人就足以把整层楼高效搜完。另一个人便能安全地检查所有房间。我们之所以采用别的安排，只是因为那是 Katei 提议的。"

    # game/script.rpy:8025
    old "They started from the rooms on the lobby side onward. Shiroya and I could clearly see Sai and Katei standing on the other exit of the hallway, enacting tight control over the few rooms that remained for Naomi or an extra person to be inside."
    new "他们从大堂这一侧的几间房开始查起。Shiroya 和我清楚地看见 Sai 与 Katei 站在走廊另一端的出口，牢牢盯住最后几间可能藏着 Naomi 或另一个人的屋子。"

    # game/script.rpy:8026
    old "If nobody was found in them, the possibility Shiroya and I had come up with would be almost confirmed: that the actual culprit had been in the attic until we'd heard the elevator going down, and that they'd brought the Sekimeiya up with them to hide on a floor we couldn't access."
    new "如果里面都没人，我和 Shiroya 想到的那个可能就几乎可以确认了：真凶一直待在阁楼，直到我们听见电梯下行；随后他带着 Sekimeiya 上楼，把它藏在我们去不了的楼层。"

    # game/script.rpy:8027
    old "As that theory grew more likely, I thought further on it and quickly picked up on an important inconsistency."
    new "随着这个推测越来越可能成立，我又往下想了想，很快发现了一处重要的矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:8028
    old "Akaro and Sai said that when they'd heard the elevator sound, Naomi had already shown up and left with Katei.{w} If that was the case, Naomi could not have been in the attic the way I'd thought about things. To make it work, I had to slightly change it."
    new "Akaro 和 Sai 说，他们听到电梯声响时，Naomi 已经出现，并和 Katei 一起离开了。{w} 若果真如此，Naomi 就不可能像我想的那样待在阁楼。要让推测成立，我得稍作修改。"

    # game/script.rpy:8031
    old "Nothing was out of place if we'd missed Naomi when we'd inspected the crystal floor together, she went up to the third floor to talk with Katei, and she then called the elevator to keep it on the first floor. Later, she'd used it to move to the attic as soon as she'd obtained the Sekimeiya, probably because she'd realized she couldn't convince Katei."
    new "如果我们一起检查水晶层时漏看了 Naomi，她随后上三楼找 Katei 谈话，又把电梯叫到一楼，让它停在那里；之后一拿到 Sekimeiya，就乘电梯去了阁楼——大概是她意识到自己说服不了 Katei。这样一切就都说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8032
    old "The first three rooms were handled with ease. The others kept going and looked through the event room once again despite the fact that it was impossible anything in it had changed."
    new "前三个房间很快查完。其他人继续往前走，又看了一遍活动室，尽管那里面根本不可能有什么变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:8033
    old "Nonchalantly—almost forgetting what could've been resting in any of the rooms—Akaro opened the door in front of it. He looked inside, and his body froze."
    new "Akaro 若无其事地打开面前的门，几乎忘了那些房间里可能藏着什么。他朝里一看，整个人僵住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8035
    old "From afar, I was able to see his expression shifting to a blank and pale one. With his hand on the doorknob, he turned around, frantically trying to meet someone else's gaze."
    new "隔着一段距离，我也能看见他的神情变得茫然，脸色发白。他一手仍握着门把，转过身，慌乱地想寻找别人的目光。"

    # game/script.rpy:8042
    old "What's wrong...? Anything inside?"
    new "怎么了……？里面有东西吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:8043
    old "The silent corridors allowed us to make out their words. On the other side, Sai and Katei had also realized that something unusual was inside that room."
    new "走廊里一片寂静，我们才听得清他们的话。另一头，Sai 和 Katei 也意识到那间房里有些不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:8047
    old "...Wh-What!? Isla, stop!"
    new "……什、什么！？Isla，住手！"

    # game/script.rpy:8048
    old "Erina, after peeking over Akaro's shoulder, immediately pushed aside Isla, who'd been about to glance into the room."
    new "Erina 从 Akaro 肩后探头看了一眼，随即推开正要往房里张望的 Isla。"

    # game/script.rpy:8049
    old "Hm...? Let me see..."
    new "嗯……？让我看看……"

    # game/script.rpy:8050
    old "Guys, come here. It seems we weren't wrong."
    new "大家过来。看来我们没猜错。"

    # game/script.rpy:8051
    old "With an altered voice, Akaro instructed we could abandon our positions, as the search had finished."
    new "Akaro 的声音变了调，叫我们不必再守在原位，搜查已经结束。"

    # game/script.rpy:8060
    old "Unnerved, we went to see what had caused those reactions. Sai brushed past Akaro to see what he'd found. Despite his constant effort at appearing unfazed and composed, the moment he set his eyes inside, he was visibly startled."
    new "我们心里发毛，走过去看是什么引起了那些反应。Sai 从 Akaro 身边挤过去，想看看他发现了什么。尽管他平时总是一副不动声色、镇定自若的样子，可视线一落进房内，还是明显吃了一惊。"

    # game/script.rpy:8064
    old "S-Seriously...?"
    new "真、真的假的……？"

    # game/script.rpy:8068
    old "The room, B4, was in the middle of the hallway. Katei, Shiroya, and I arrived at the same time, silently glancing at each other. Erina was still tightly holding Isla, and both of them moved back to let us see through the door."
    new "那间房——B4——位于走廊中段。Katei、Shiroya 和我同时赶到，默默交换了一个眼神。Erina 仍紧紧拉着 Isla，两人往后退开，让我们从门口看清里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:8075
    old "...!"
    new "……！"

    # game/script.rpy:8080
    old "Oh God, no..."
    new "天哪，不……"

    # game/script.rpy:8091
    old "Darkroom"
    new "暗室"

    # game/script.rpy:8093
    old "It took us not even a second to understand it. On the floor lay the body of Naomi over a pool of blood. On the wall, close to the door, were traces of more blood. Not only that, but a strange odor became noticeable as soon as I stepped inside. I couldn't associate it to anything, but it wasn't prominent enough to be aggravating."
    new "我们只用了一瞬就明白了。Naomi 的尸体躺在地上，身下是一滩血。门旁的墙上还有更多血迹。不仅如此，我一踏进去就闻到一股怪味。我分辨不出那是什么，但味道不算浓，还不至于让人难受。"

    # game/script.rpy:8098
    old "Katei, if you're gonna kill somebody, don't make it so obvious."
    new "Katei，真要杀人，也别弄得这么明显。"

    # game/script.rpy:8099
    old "It was far from the first time Sai had said something careless, but it was far over the line for all of us that time. Especially Erina, who had been trying to keep Isla unaware of what had happened."
    new "Sai 说话不知轻重也不是第一次了，但这一次，在场所有人都觉得他太过分。尤其是 Erina——她一直努力不让 Isla 知道发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:8104
    old "You must be joking... Don't even think about accusing me."
    new "你在开玩笑吧……别想把这罪名扣到我头上。"

    # game/script.rpy:8108
    old "Sai moved over to the body. With two fingers, he confirmed its status."
    new "Sai 走到尸体旁，伸出两根手指确认她的情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:8114
    old "She's definitely dead. She probably already was when we got back to this floor. This room wasn't searched earlier, right?"
    new "她确实已经死了。我们回到这一层的时候，她恐怕就已经死了。这间房先前没搜过，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:8119
    old "No. We stopped at the event room. This one was next, so you could be right."
    new "没有。我们查到活动室就停下了，接下来本来就是这个房间，所以你说得也许没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:8124
    old "No, th-that's..."
    new "不，那、那是……"

    # game/script.rpy:8129
    old "Wait!"
    new "等等！"

    # game/script.rpy:8132
    old "Isla, who hadn't yet put up any resistance, was able to escape from Erina's grip. Her shock escalated when she understood that we were telling the truth."
    new "Isla 一直没有反抗，因此得以从 Erina 的手中挣脱。当她明白我们说的是真话时，震惊更甚。"

    # game/script.rpy:8133
    old "But... that's impossible! Why did—"
    new "可是……这不可能！为什么——"

    # game/script.rpy:8138
    old "It's clearly possible, just look at her. And I'll sure think about it, Katei. You are the only person who could've done this."
    new "怎么不可能，你看看她就知道了。至于那件事，我自然会好好考虑，Katei。能做出这种事的，除了你没有别人。"

    # game/script.rpy:8145
    old "While they were audibly reacting, I found myself silently aghast, which I hadn't been prepared for. I'd been carelessly going over the entire incident, but as soon as the image of the dead Naomi met my eyes, any focus on reality departed from my body."
    new "他们还在出声议论，我却发现自己一言不发地怔住了，这并不在我的预料之中。我本在漫不经心地回想整起事件，可 Naomi 死去的模样一映入眼帘，我便再也无法专注于现实。"

    # game/script.rpy:8152
    old "Shiroya, at my side, looked identical to me. The concept of death and loss had recently been changed for us.{w} She and I hadn't experienced it until two weeks ago, when the world we'd created together crumbled down without warning."
    new "身旁的 Shiroya 神情与我如出一辙。对我们而言，死亡与失去的含义近来已被改写。{w} 直到两周前，我们共同构筑的世界毫无预兆地崩塌，我和她才第一次尝到这种滋味。"

    # game/script.rpy:8153
    old "Naomi's lifeless body was an immediate reminder. One that came as soon as I started having hope for the future again."
    new "Naomi 毫无生气的躯体就是最直接的提醒。偏偏在我刚刚对未来重燃希望的时候，它出现了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8154
    old "I fixed my eyes on Shiroya's face as the others kept up their arguing. They wouldn't have noticed the sheer panic she was experiencing, but I knew her better. Her effort at moving on had been denied by reality; we'd been put back in our place."
    new "其他人仍在争执，我的目光却定格在 Shiroya 的脸上。他们注意不到她正经历着怎样的恐慌，但我比他们更了解她。她想努力向前迈进，却被现实推了回来；我们又被按回了原处。"

    # game/script.rpy:8155
    old "I never knew how to respond. Thoughtless reassurance wouldn't achieve anything. However, even though it might not have been any help, I tried to put everything I wanted to say into a hand that I placed on her shoulder—as a way to distance myself from the insentient and inanimate support I'd been until then."
    new "我向来不知该如何回应。空洞的安慰毫无意义。可即便如此，哪怕起不了任何作用，我还是把想说的话尽数倾注到搭上她肩膀的那只手里——好让自己不再是此前那种没有温度、形同死物的依靠。"

    # game/script.rpy:8171
    old "Shiroya and I knew each other since our first year of elementary school, where we became classmates for the first time. Our parents were friends, which quickly tied us together.{w} We would see one another during school and our parents' meetings, so we rapidly grew close. Before becoming classmates, we'd already met a few times, but we'd never really spoken."
    new "我和 Shiroya 从小学一年级起就认识，那一年我们第一次同班。我们的父母是朋友，这层关系很快就把我们牵到了一起。{w} 无论在学校还是父母聚会时，我们总能碰面，因此很快就熟络起来。其实在成为同班同学之前，我们已经见过几次，只是从未真正说过话。"

    # game/script.rpy:8173
    old "Our parents worked for Yushibana's hospital, but their work involved securing deals with entities outside the town, which made them travel very often. We'd been told that the four of them were a group of friends since long before we were born, and that they all met when they were lower down their workplace's ladder."
    new "我们的父母都在丰花的医院工作，但他们的职责包括与镇外的人洽谈合作，因此经常出差。我们听说，他们四人早在我们出生之前就是朋友，都是在职场底层时结识的。"

    # game/script.rpy:8174
    old "A bit more than a year prior, they accepted a job offer overseas. Despite their insistent attempts at making us accompany them, we were strongly against it, as we'd lived in Yushibana our whole lives. The idea of traveling to another continent wasn't a pleasant one. Unlike them, we didn't even know the language there."
    new "一年多以前，他们接受了一份海外的工作。尽管他们一再想让我们同行，我们却坚决反对——我们从小到大一直住在丰花，远赴另一片大陆并不是什么好主意。和他们不同，我们连那边的语言都不懂。"

    # game/script.rpy:8175
    old "They eventually had to give up and accepted paying for our necessary expenses like food and rent. We'd lived by ourselves since then."
    new "他们最终只能作罢，答应替我们负担伙食、房租等必要开销。自那以后，我们便独自生活。"

    # game/script.rpy:8180
    old "One year ago, Shiroya and I finished high school together. In Yushibana, people tended to move out if they planned to attend university, seeing as the closest one was hours away. That was why we hadn't yet decided on what to do and thought of the year 2011 as a pivotal point where we'd decide. Money wasn't an immediate problem for either of us, and we weren't sure what we wanted to study if we decided to move."
    new "一年前，我和 Shiroya 一起读完了高中。在丰花，若打算上大学，人们通常会搬走，因为最近的一所也要好几个小时车程。正因如此，我们还没决定将来要做什么，只把 2011 年视作作出抉择的关键节点。钱暂时不是我们俩的难题，可就算决定搬走，我们也不确定想学什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:8181
    old "The last important factor that influenced our decision first made an appearance in our lives when we started middle school. Most of us were the same people who had attended elementary school together, but a new classmate named Miiya moved to Yushibana that year."
    new "影响我们决定的最后一个重要因素，在升入初中时第一次出现在我们的生活中。班上大多还是小学时的那批人，不过那一年，一位名叫 Miiya 的新同学搬到了丰花。"

    # game/script.rpy:8182
    old "At first, Shiroya and I didn't talk to her much, and neither did our usual group of friends. Miiya quickly became comfortable with other people in our class, which kept some distance between us."
    new "起初，我和 Shiroya 很少与她交谈，我们平日的那群朋友也是如此。Miiya 很快就和班上其他人打成一片，与我们之间反倒隔着一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:8185
    old "That changed three years later, the day she approached me when I was alone. She was curious about us and wanted to hang out. I never really understood what drove her to do that, but we spent an entire afternoon together, and following that day, she would spend some time with me every so often."
    new "三年后，一切才有了转变——那天我独自一人时，她走过来找我。她对我们的情况很好奇，想一起玩玩。我至今也没弄明白她为何会那样做，但我们一起度过了一整个下午；从那以后，她时不时会来找我待上一阵。"

    # game/script.rpy:8186
    old "A few months later, she appeared when Shiroya and I were together, and they introduced themselves in more depth. Since then, the three of us started to become comfortable around each other after school. It was out of the ordinary for us since we were used to being alone, but we quickly took a liking to Miiya.{w} She was a blunt and sincere girl—one who didn't seem to have many worries in life or think too hard about things. Even though she'd made her way into our lives out of the blue, we became accustomed to her presence."
    new "几个月后，正当我和 Shiroya 在一起时，她出现了，两人也更详细地互相介绍了一番。自那以后，放学后我们三人便渐渐熟络起来。我们早已习惯独处，这样的变化并不寻常，但我们很快就喜欢上了 Miiya。{w} 她是个直率而真诚的女孩——看上去生活里没多少烦恼，也不爱把事情想得太复杂。尽管她是不期而至地闯进了我们的生活，我们还是习惯了她的存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:8187
    old "Initially, she passed the time with us sporadically and acted as another link between Shiroya and me, but the frequency increased to the point where the three of us would spend almost every afternoon together."
    new "起初，她只是偶尔来陪我们消磨时间，也像是联结我和 Shiroya 的另一条纽带；后来次数越来越频繁，几乎每个下午都是我们三人一起度过。"

    # game/script.rpy:8190
    old "Last year, the end of high school became somewhat of an obstacle for what had grown to be our daily lives. Miiya was different from us in the sense that she knew she didn't want to continue studying, and she instead started searching for a job in Yushibana while living with her parents."
    new "去年，高中毕业成了我们日常生活的一道坎，而那样的生活早已成了常态。Miiya 与我们不同：她清楚自己不想继续读书，于是住在父母家，开始在丰花找工作。"

    # game/script.rpy:8191
    old "The previous summer was not an easy one for us. Shiroya and I weren't sure what to do with our futures, and we knew that if our decisions differed, we might stop seeing each other. Behind everything else, that was always my biggest worry, and at the same time, Miiya was only focused on searching for a job that wanted her.{w} I felt like I was stuck in the past, wishing that our school days could continue as always. Meanwhile, the uncertainty of the future prevented Shiroya from resting easy. That made it hard for us to keep up with each other, and even though the circumstances were perfect for a summer together, the three of us spent it alone."
    new "对我们来说，前一个夏天并不好过。我和 Shiroya 都不确定未来该走向何方，也明白一旦选择不同，我们或许就再也见不到彼此。在这一切背后，这始终是我最深的忧虑；而与此同时，Miiya 一心只想找到一份愿意雇她的工作。{w} 我觉得自己被困在过去，盼着学生时代能一如往常地延续下去；未来的不确定又让 Shiroya 无法安心。我们因此难以跟上彼此的步调，那个夏天明明最适合三人一起度过，我们却各自孤单地过完了它。"

    # game/script.rpy:8192
    old "It all started to shift back to normal once Shiroya and I decided that neither of us wanted to move out for the time being. We would spend one extra year thinking about it, so at first, that was a perfect excuse to go back to how everything had been before the holidays."
    new "直到我和 Shiroya 决定，眼下谁也不想搬走，一切才开始重回正轨。我们打算再多花一年考虑，所以起初，这简直是回到假期前那种状态的绝佳借口。"

    # game/script.rpy:8195
    old "Unfortunately, all of our conversations had grown stiff. Shiroya and I talked frequently about our decisions through messages, but the three of us hadn't personally seen each other in a while. None of us were at our best, and none of us felt anything resembling enthusiasm. Our relationships loosened even further, and the distance between us widened into a chasm."
    new "遗憾的是，我们所有的对话都变得生硬。我和 Shiroya 常常通过消息商量决定，可我们三人已有好一阵子没见面了。谁都不在状态，谁也提不起半点热情。我们的关系愈发松散，彼此间的距离渐渐裂成一道鸿沟。"

    # game/script.rpy:8196
    old "When I recognized what it had all turned into, I grew despondent. I couldn't do anything to return to our routine, and I wasn't sure if they wanted to. Other friends I had from school completely disappeared from my life in the blink of an eye."
    new "当我意识到一切变成了什么模样，我陷入了消沉。我无力让我们的日常复原，也不确定她们是否还想复原。学校里其他的朋友，转眼间便从我的生活中彻底消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8197
    old "For two or three months, my old life continued fading away.{w} ...That was until I received a call from Miiya. She confessed to feeling a lot like I had and wanting to restore everything. I immediately called Shiroya, who sounded like she was in the same position."
    new "两三个月里，我旧日的生活持续褪色。{w} ……直到我接到 Miiya 的电话。她坦言自己的感受和我十分相似，也想把一切恢复原样。我立刻打给了 Shiroya，听她的语气，她也处在同样的境地。"

    # game/script.rpy:8198
    old "It was just over two weeks before the Sekimeiya showing when we met at my house. We'd gone our longest ever without meeting, but we still recognized each other as the people we'd spent the entirety of our teenage years with. It was difficult at first, but since we knew the three of us wanted to finally get over our new barriers, the constricting ice that had formed around us broke much more easily than I'd anticipated."
    new "就在 Sekimeiya 展出前两周多一点，我们在我家碰了面。那是我们分别最久的一次，但我们仍认得出彼此——我们曾一起度过整个少年时代。起初很艰难，可既然我们都清楚，三人终究想跨过新筑起的隔阂，那层将我们封住的坚冰，融化得比我预想的要容易得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:8201
    old "We said that we'd go back to how everything had been during the start of the year. The three of us needed it and all feared that it had ended long ago.{w} Even though we'd settled that, there weren't many things to do during the winter in Yushibana. Hanging out and talking for hours used to work in the past, but if we were starting fresh, that might not have sufficed. That was how we came across Ashiya's advertisement; on December 15th, their biggest event to date would be held."
    new "我们说好，要回到年初时的那副样子。我们三人都需要它，也都害怕它早已终结。{w} 话虽如此，丰花的冬天并没有多少可做的事。过去只要凑在一起聊上几个小时便足够，但若要从头来过，那或许并不够。就在那时，我们看到了芦屋的广告：12 月 15 日，他们将举办迄今为止规模最大的一场活动。"

    # game/script.rpy:8202
    old "Shiroya and I disliked Ashiya to an extent, but Miiya, having moved to Yushibana as a kid, didn't share the same feeling that had been prominently pushed onto us by the older residents. She had only been vaguely told about the main outline of it all, so when she proposed that we attend the event, we didn't refuse."
    new "我和 Shiroya 多少有些讨厌芦屋，但 Miiya 小时候才搬来丰花，并不像我们那样被老一辈居民灌输了那种情绪。她只隐约听过个大概，所以当她提议去参加那场活动时，我们没有拒绝。"

    # game/script.rpy:8203
    old "It honestly sounded like a fine idea to us. Anything the three of us could go to was good.{w} According to the announcement, an event was held in Ashiya Tower every Thursday, each one requiring special entrance tickets."
    new "说实话，我们也觉得这主意不错。只要是三人能一起参加的活动，怎样都好。{w} 公告上说，芦屋塔每逢周四都会举办活动，每场都需要专门的入场券。"

    # game/script.rpy:8206
    old "We accepted it and bought them before they ran out. December had always been a special month for me and Shiroya: my birthday was on the 21st, while hers was on the 19th. We were happy we had reunited just in time for them."
    new "我们同意了，赶在售罄之前买好了票。十二月对我和 Shiroya 来说一向特别：我的生日是 21 日，她的则在 19 日。能在生日之前及时重聚，我们都很高兴。"

    # game/script.rpy:8207
    old "As no other special matters were scheduled to happen in Yushibana, we decided to keep looking through Ashiya's events. One that might've been interesting was scheduled for January 26th, when every gemstone in the building would be replaced. We thought that if we enjoyed it the first Thursday, maybe that'd be a good day to return. Meanwhile, we agreed to meet up frequently until the 15th."
    new "丰花没有其他特别安排，我们便决定继续翻看芦屋的活动。其中一场或许会很有意思，定在 1 月 26 日，届时馆内所有宝石都会更换。我们想着，若第一个周四玩得开心，那天或许值得再来一趟。同时，我们约好在那之前经常见面，直到 15 日。"

    # game/script.rpy:8213
    old "However, just the next day, Miiya died. We found ourselves in an incident that took her life, and Shiroya had to be hospitalized."
    new "然而，就在第二天，Miiya 死了。我们被卷入一场夺走她性命的事件，Shiroya 也不得不入院。"

    # game/script.rpy:8215
    old "It was comically tragic. Everything we thought we had regained was immediately ripped away from us."
    new "那简直是一场滑稽的悲剧。我们以为已经失而复得的一切，转瞬便被夺走。"

    # game/script.rpy:8216
    old "Shiroya was in a coma for a few days, but she ultimately didn't suffer from anything major. The days during which I waited still, thinking that I might've lost the last two people remaining from my normal life, were harder than anything I ever thought I'd have to suffer. To add unnecessary cruelty, neither my parents nor Shiroya's were able to show up, and they only talked to police officers and doctors over the phone."
    new "Shiroya 昏迷了几天，但终究没有大碍。那些日子里，我静静等待，以为自己已经失去了正常生活中仅剩的两个人——那段时光比我以为自己要承受的任何苦难都更难熬。更残忍的是，我的父母和 Shiroya 的父母都无法赶回，只能在电话里与警察和医生交谈。"

    # game/script.rpy:8217
    old "My parents even used the opportunity to tell me once again that I should go live with them. They'd been very insistent about that in the past, and the incident gave them the chance to force it even further."
    new "我的父母甚至借机再次劝我搬去和他们同住。他们过去就对此极为坚持，这次的事让他们更有理由步步紧逼。"

    # game/script.rpy:8218
    old "I had almost never talked to Miiya's parents, but when I saw them talking to the agent in charge of things, it was clear that they were devastated; everything in their lives had collapsed in the span of a single day."
    new "我几乎没和 Miiya 的父母说过话，但看到他们与负责此事的探员交谈时，谁都看得出他们已悲痛欲绝；他们生活里的一切，都在一天之内崩塌了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8222
    old "When Shiroya woke up, I was in her hospital room and told her about what happened. She couldn't even cry—she must've despised everything that led to that outcome. After the doctors told her that she wouldn't have to spend more time in the hospital, I offered to let her stay at my house. Having each other as company should've been beneficial for both of us, and my parents' house was big enough."
    new "Shiroya 醒来时，我正守在她的病房里，把事情告诉了她。她连哭都哭不出来——她想必恨透了所有导致那种结果的东西。医生说她不必再住院后，我提出让她住到我家里。彼此作伴对我们两人都有好处，何况我父母的房子够大。"

    # game/script.rpy:8223
    old "She almost accepted immediately, but she ended up saying she'd think about it. I insisted, saying that she wouldn't be a bother, and accompanied her to her apartment.{w} The next day, she accepted and came over for a temporary stay."
    new "她几乎当场就要答应，最后却说想再考虑一下。我再三坚持，说不会添麻烦，并陪她回了公寓。{w} 第二天，她答应了，搬来暂住。"

    # game/script.rpy:8224
    old "Despite all my efforts at being helpful, I spent the days closed up physically and mentally, hating myself for that too. I remained shut in my room, sleeping during the day and glancing through the window at night."
    new "尽管我一心想帮上忙，那些日子却把自己身心都封闭起来，还因此愈发厌恶自己。我终日关在房间里，白天睡觉，夜里望着窗外。"

    # game/script.rpy:8225
    old "The life we'd lived for years had met an abrupt end immediately after resuming itself. It wasn't something anyone should have experienced, and it was nothing short of impossible for us to stop wallowing in our own pathetic misery."
    new "我们多年来过的那种生活，刚刚恢复便骤然终结。这不该是任何人需要经历的事，而我们根本不可能不继续沉溺在自己可悲的痛苦中。"

    # game/script.rpy:8228
    old "I didn't want to distance myself from Shiroya; facing the thought of being left alone was unbearable. That was why I'd immediately asked her to remain together for a few days. At home, we briefly saw each other every day, but no conversations aside from simple words to coordinate ourselves came from either of us.{w} At least, she spent the days with Maxi and Umi, a dog and a cat that had lived with me for years, which I hoped made her feel less lonely. I also got to hear her voice a handful of times when she talked to her parents over the phone, but they were too busy to leave."
    new "我不想和 Shiroya 拉开距离；一想到要独自留下，我就无法忍受。正因如此，我才立刻请她多留几天。在家里，我们每天都会匆匆见上一面，却除了协调琐事之外谁也不开口。{w} 至少，她还有 Maxi 和 Umi 陪着——那是我养了多年的狗和猫，我希望这能让她少些孤单。她在电话里和父母说话时，我也听到过几次她的声音，可他们忙得脱不开身。"

    # game/script.rpy:8229
    old "On the 14th, the day before the event, we met in the living room and saw the three tickets we'd bought for it inside the brown purse Miiya would sometimes carry. Knowing that our plans would never happen completely tore me up. I didn't know whether to throw the tickets away, but before I could decide, Shiroya spoke."
    new "14 日，活动的前一天，我们在客厅碰面，看见 Miiya 有时会背的那只棕色手袋里，还放着我们买的三张票。一想到我们的计划再也不会实现，我便心如刀割。我不知道该不该把票扔掉，还没等我决定，Shiroya 开口了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8232
    old "\"Should we still go?\""
    new "「我们还去吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:8233
    old "It wasn't something I'd expected to hear at all, but it conveyed everything Shiroya had been feeling. ...I'd been trying to muster the strength to say it myself too. Despite our sudden loss, she didn't want us to grow cold again."
    new "这是我完全没料到会听到的话，却道尽了 Shiroya 的心意。……其实我也一直在鼓起勇气，想亲口说出来。尽管骤然失去了挚友，她也不想让我们再度疏远。"

    # game/script.rpy:8236
    old "We decided we'd go anyway, trying not to let the death of our closest friend directly kill our relationship too. We saw it as confirmation that even though everything looked more than grim, we'd do all we could to make it eventually get better."
    new "我们决定还是去。我们不想让挚友的死，把我们的关系也一并夺走。对我们而言，这也是一种确认：纵然一切惨淡至极，我们也会竭尽所能，让它终有好转的一天。"

    # game/script.rpy:8237
    old "We finally talked a bit before the night came. Our schedules were all over the place, and we had to wake up very early to make it to Ashiya Tower before {time=9.}{w} As the night went on, it was clear that neither of us would be able to sleep."
    new "夜幕降临前，我们总算聊了一阵。我们的作息一片混乱，必须起得极早，才能在 {time=9.} 之前赶到芦屋塔。{w} 夜渐深，谁都明白我们两人都睡不着了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8238
    old "Painfully conscious of our surroundings, we both stayed awake, unable to rest in any way. Once it was clear that it would persist, Shiroya suggested leaving early. It was a relieving thought, one I'd also considered."
    new "我们对周遭的一切过于敏感，甚至到了痛苦的地步，两人都醒着，怎么也无法休息。眼看这状态不会好转，Shiroya 提议早点出发。那念头让我松了口气，我自己也曾这样想过。"

    # game/script.rpy:8239
    old "I agreed immediately. I needed to move and feel the cold night air. Shiroya took two of the three tickets from Miiya's purse and put them in hers, along with our identification to validate them and the keys to my house. As we stepped outside, a calm and pleasant night welcomed us back to our town. We walked through desolate streets without an objective in mind, letting time move at its own pace."
    new "我立刻答应了。我需要走动，需要感受夜里冰冷的空气。Shiroya 从 Miiya 的手袋里取出三张票中的两张，连同用来验证身份的证件和我家的钥匙一起放进自己的包。走出门外，迎接我们的是一个平静而宜人的夜晚，我们回到了镇上。我们在空旷的街道上漫无目的地走着，任时间按它自己的步调流逝。"

    # game/script.rpy:8243
    old "Eventually, we reached the outskirts. We were close to Ashiya; we wouldn't usually walk through that part of Yushibana, but we waited right outside the tower in a little plaza Ashiya kept clean, waiting for the sun to rise."
    new "最终，我们走到了郊外。离芦屋已经很近；我们平时并不常走丰花的这一带，但这次我们就在塔外一处由芦屋打理得整洁的小广场上等着日出。"

    # game/script.rpy:8244
    old "At {time=6}, everything around us was covered in snow, and even though we'd grown used to the sheer cold of the mountains, staying outside for that long exceeded our limit. We walked to the entrance of the tower and were told by a guard that we could wait inside until the doors opened to the public."
    new "到了 {time=6}，四周的一切都覆着雪。尽管我们早已习惯山间的严寒，在外面待上那么久还是超出了极限。我们走到塔的入口，一名警卫告诉我们，可以在里面等到向公众开放的时刻。"

    # game/script.rpy:8245
    old "We were met by a lady sorting a bunch of papers behind the reception desk. Shiroya and I hadn't talked much, but staying with each other was more than enough. The only other person there was a man in the middle of the room, wearing a lost look. He glanced at us for an instant before going back to how he had been.{w} We'd later learn his name was Akaro, and I would speak to him for the first time in the event room."
    new "接待台后，一位女士正整理着一叠文件，接待了我们。Shiroya 和我一路没说上几句话，可只要能彼此作伴，便已足够。屋里另有一个男人站在房间中央，神情茫然。他朝我们瞥了一眼，随即又恢复了先前那副模样。{w} 后来我们才知道他叫 Akaro，而我第一次同他说话，是在活动室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:8256
    old "Things had continued and led to... death. Once again, the cruel sensation of death had appeared before us after avoiding it for almost twenty years."
    new "事情就这样一路发展下去，最终走向了……死亡。将近二十年里，我们一直避开了它，可死亡那残酷的气息，又一次出现在我们面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:8257
    old "It took a single dead body to make me reminisce over my whole life. I'd started to think that I'd been climbing the first steps to get over what happened by immersing myself in our present incident, but that was far from accurate. Even though I'd gotten Shiroya to start returning to her usual self, at that moment, her face gave away how meaningless that was."
    new "仅仅一具尸体，就让我把自己的一生从头回想了一遍。我原以为，埋头于眼前这桩事件，就等于踏上了走出过去的第一步——可事实远非如此。我好不容易才让 Shiroya 开始恢复往日的模样，可那一刻，她脸上的神情却说明这一切毫无意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:8266
    old "Words started making sense again. Sai, who had been thoughtlessly messing with me without a clue what my last few days had been like, was accusing Katei of murder."
    new "耳边的声音重新有了意义。Sai 刚才还在没头没脑地拿我打趣，全然不知我这几天过的是什么日子——现在，他却在指控 Katei 杀人。"

    # game/script.rpy:8267
    old "You're out of your mind! I would never kill anyone!"
    new "你疯了吗！我怎么可能杀人！"

    # game/script.rpy:8268
    old "Then why did you? Don't you recall what we've been doing? Nobody else could've been here to do this."
    new "那为什么是你做的？你忘了我们之前都在做什么？除了你，没有别人能在这里做下这种事。"

    # game/script.rpy:8272
    old "What if you were the one who did it, Sai?"
    new "如果动手的人是你呢，Sai？"

    # game/script.rpy:8277
    old "It was pissing me off. It was reasonable to think that Katei was the culprit, but accusing anyone of stealing someone's life so lightly was something I really didn't like. Even Shiroya didn't expect me to suddenly spit that out."
    new "这让我火了起来。认为 Katei 是凶手，并非没有道理，可这样轻描淡写地指控一个人夺走他人的性命，我实在无法接受。连 Shiroya 也没料到我会突然冒出这么一句。"

    # game/script.rpy:8278
    old "Excuse me? I was with Akaro on the fourth floor, and the last time we entered this room, we all saw it was empty."
    new "你说什么？我一直和 Akaro 待在四楼，而且我们上一次进这间屋子的时候，谁都看见里面是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:8283
    old "He's right, we didn't move from there. Are you saying that maybe we both did it to frame Katei?"
    new "他说得没错，我们一直没离开那儿。你的意思是，我和他合谋栽赃 Katei？"

    # game/script.rpy:8284
    old "No. Sure, that might also be a possibility that lets Katei not be a murderer, but Sai had an easier way all by himself.{w} He said it earlier, right? That he went to check if the Sekimeiya had truly disappeared while you all waited next to the stairs."
    new "不。确实，那种可能也能让 Katei 摆脱杀人的嫌疑，可 Sai 一个人就有更省事的办法。{w} 他刚才说过吧？你们都在楼梯边等着的时候，他跑去确认 Sekimeiya 是不是真的消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8285
    old "He even admitted to spending a while thinking about what happened. The event room connects both hallways, and from the stairs, you wouldn't have seen what was happening in hallway B. You saw Naomi and chased her over to this room. You definitely could've done this."
    new "他还承认自己在那儿想了好一阵子发生了什么事。活动室连接着两条走廊，而从楼梯那边，根本看不见 B走廊里发生的事。你看见了 Naomi，一路追她到这儿——你完全有机会动手。"

    # game/script.rpy:8286
    old "I couldn't let out the word \"kill\" easily since I didn't believe that Sai being responsible was the most likely thing, but I didn't want to let him forcibly label Katei as a murderer if other possibilities existed."
    new "「杀」这个字，我怎么也说不出口。我并不认为 Sai 才是最有嫌疑的那个，可只要还存在别的可能，我就不愿任由他把「凶手」的名头强按在 Katei 头上。"

    # game/script.rpy:8291
    old "You're not being serious, are you? Don't you think Naomi would've yelled? There's blood on the wall, so since blood is coming from the back of her head, she was probably pushed into it. It follows that she was seeing her killer as it happened, so she would've yelled."
    new "你不是认真的吧？你觉得 Naomi 会不出声吗？墙上沾着血，血是从她后脑流出来的，那她多半是被推着撞上去的。也就是说，出事的时候她正看着凶手，那她肯定会喊出声来。"

    # game/script.rpy:8293
    old "We would only have missed a yell like that if Katei and Naomi were the only ones present on this floor at the time."
    new "除非当时这层楼上只有 Katei 和 Naomi 两个人，否则我们不可能没听见那样的喊声。"

    # game/script.rpy:8294
    old "But what if she didn't yell? You can't possibly be saying that blood on the wall means she had to. Maybe it happened too fast for her to react, or maybe her mouth was covered."
    new "可她要是没喊呢？你总不能说墙上有血，她就非喊不可吧。也许事情快得她来不及反应，也许她的嘴被捂住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8299
    old "Atsuki, don't be stupid. You must also be aware that Katei has to be the one who did this."
    new "Atsuki，别犯傻。你心里也清楚，动手的人只可能是 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:8305
    old "The blood on the wall is next to the door, and Naomi's body is perpendicular to the wall. If you're gonna push someone against a wall, you'll need to be farther from it than your victim, right?"
    new "墙上的血迹就在门边，而 Naomi 的尸体与墙面垂直。要把人往墙上推，你自己总得站得比对方离墙更远，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:8306
    old "Meaning that the culprit was farther from the door than Naomi. You could infer from there that they either entered the room before Naomi or that they entered at the same time."
    new "也就是说，凶手比 Naomi 离门更远。由此可以推断，凶手要么比 Naomi 先进屋，要么和她同时进门。"

    # game/script.rpy:8307
    old "That makes sense if Katei was the culprit, but if I chased Naomi here, I wouldn't have had an easy time pushing her into this wall. She would've been farther into the room than me, so I would've had to push her against one of the other three walls.{w} Ignoring, obviously, that she would not have run into a room and cornered herself; she would've escaped from the hallway."
    new "如果凶手是 Katei，那确实说得通。可如果是我把 Naomi 追到这里，我想把她推到这面墙上可没那么容易。她只会比我更靠里，那我推她撞上的，就该是另外三面墙之一。{w} 更别提，她根本不会跑进一间屋子把自己逼进死角——她大可以从走廊逃走。"

    # game/script.rpy:8308
    old "Or maybe you entered the room first and the noise lured her in. Maybe you chased her down when she was in the middle of the room, and since she headed to the exit, you pushed her against this wall."
    new "又或者，是你先一步进了屋，动静把她引了进来。也许你是在她走到房间中央时追上她的，而她要往出口跑，你就把她推到了这面墙上。"

    # game/script.rpy:8309
    old "I'm not trying to accuse you, but stop acting as if Katei must be responsible."
    new "我不是要指控你，可你也别总摆出一副只可能是 Katei 干的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:8315
    old "Also, what the hell is this smell? Does anyone recognize it?"
    new "还有，这到底是什么味道？有人闻得出来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:8318
    old "Everyone denied it with nearly imperceptible movements. They'd all noticed it, but seeing so much blood under a body must've forced them to ignore it. We had to continue for eleven hours bearing the thought of being trapped with someone who had killed a person."
    new "众人几乎难以察觉地摇了摇头。他们都闻到了，可尸体底下摊着那么多血，想必只能强忍着不去理会。接下来的十一个小时，我们只能揣着这个念头熬过去——那个杀了人的人，就和我们困在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:8319
    old "...I have no idea what it is."
    new "……我完全不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:8320
    old "Me neither, but fine. Atsuki, do you honestly believe I killed Naomi? There's a working security camera here, for fuck's sake. Do you think I'd ruin my life to kill someone I didn't even know a couple hours ago?"
    new "我也一样，算了。Atsuki，你真觉得是我杀了 Naomi？这儿可是有能用的监控摄像头，妈的。你觉得我会为了杀一个几小时前还不认识的人，把自己的人生搭进去？"

    # game/script.rpy:8321
    old "I don't really think you're responsible."
    new "我并不认为是你干的。"

    # game/script.rpy:8326
    old "Then you're accusing Katei too! Sure, I could've had the chance to do it, but there's no other possibility. If you're saying you think I didn't do it, you're also saying you think Katei did."
    new "那你就是在指控 Katei！没错，我确实有机会动手，可除此之外没有别的可能。你说你认为不是我做的，那就等于说，你认为是 Katei 做的。"

    # game/script.rpy:8331
    old "I would never kill a person. This has gone too far, Sai."
    new "我绝不会杀人。Sai，你太过分了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8336
    old "Oh, shut the fuck up."
    new "呵，给我闭嘴吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:8337
    old "You're wrong. There's at least one more possibility."
    new "你错了。至少还有一种可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:8343
    old "What, did Naomi jump into the wall and break her head open?"
    new "怎么，难道是 Naomi 自己一头撞上墙，把头撞破了？"

    # game/script.rpy:8346
    old "...Remember when the elevator went up before you all reached this floor? It stopped on the sixth. Shiroya and I made sure nobody could've gone unnoticed, but there's a way around that."
    new "……还记得你们上来之前，电梯先往上走了一趟吗？它停在了六楼。Shiroya 和我确认过，不管谁上去都会被我们发现——不过，还有办法能绕开这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:8347
    old "Right, through the door we can't open."
    new "对，走那扇我们打不开的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:8348
    old "The one leading to the attic."
    new "通向阁楼的那扇。"

    # game/script.rpy:8354
    old "...He's right. Someone could've gone in before we got there."
    new "……他说得对。也许有人在我们赶到之前就进去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8355
    old "Shiroya was trying not to let the shock and despair consume her, and I was glad to be backed up. Even though Erina and Isla should've reacted to the mention of a door they hadn't seen, they didn't so much as twitch."
    new "Shiroya 正竭力不让震惊与绝望将自己吞没；有人替我说话，我自然松了口气。提到一扇她们从未见过的门，Erina 和 Isla 本应有所反应，可她们连眉头都没动一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:8360
    old "But it was locked, right? Didn't Katei say that a unique key was required to enter the attic?"
    new "可那扇门是锁着的吧？Katei 不是说过，要进阁楼必须用一把专用的钥匙吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:8361
    old "Yes, but imagining a culprit with that key isn't all that crazy, is it?"
    new "没错，可假设凶手手里有那把钥匙，也不算荒唐吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:8367
    old "Please... This is just pathetic to watch."
    new "够了……这种戏码，实在让人看不下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:8370
    old "Hm? What is?"
    new "嗯？看不下去什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:8375
    old "It also took me by surprise. Katei was looking directly at me."
    new "我也吃了一惊。Katei 正直直地看着我。"

    # game/script.rpy:8376
    old "Atsuki, stop trying to find nonexistent ways out.{w} You are the one who killed Naomi."
    new "Atsuki，别再去找那些根本不存在的方法了。{w} 杀死 Naomi 的人，就是你。"

    # game/script.rpy:8385
    old "You're kidding, right...? You're accusing him?"
    new "你在开玩笑吧……？你是在指控他？"

    # game/script.rpy:8386
    old "He absolutely could not have done it. You had the opportunity to at least accuse me."
    new "他绝对不可能做到。真要指控，至少也该冲我来——我才有那个机会。"

    # game/script.rpy:8387
    old "I was still recovering from the most unexpected words I could've heard. He had, without warning, accused me of killing Naomi..."
    new "这句话完全在我的意料之外，我一时回不过神。他毫无征兆地指控我杀了 Naomi……"

    # game/script.rpy:8388
    old "...I'm sorry, but how do you think I did that? I was always with Shiroya, and security cameras recorded every one of my actions on the upper floors."
    new "……抱歉，可你觉得我是怎么办到的？我一直和 Shiroya 在一起，上层的监控也把我的一举一动全拍了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:8394
    old "And not only that, he didn't have a chance to make it down without being spotted."
    new "不止如此，他想下楼还不被人发现，根本不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:8400
    old "That's why I have to come to the conclusion that you're all lying to me. All of you."
    new "所以我只能得出这个结论——你们全都在骗我。你们每一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:8406
    old "I'm sure of it. Atsuki was here when Naomi and I were on this floor. You guys are giving him a very solid alibi, one that's not possible to circumvent. That's why you must all be lying."
    new "我确信如此。我和 Naomi 在这一层的时候，Atsuki 就在这里。你们给他编了一个无懈可击的不在场证明，根本无从绕开。所以你们一定都在说谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:8407
    old "However, it is as you say. Security cameras had to record what happened in this room and on the office floors. Your lie won't last long once the system is recovered."
    new "不过，正如你们所说。监控一定拍下了这个房间和办公层发生的事。等系统恢复，你们的谎言撑不了多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:8408
    old "What's gotten into you...? At least your lies earlier had some effort."
    new "你这是怎么了……？至少你先前编的谎话还费了点心思。"

    # game/script.rpy:8413
    old "He's right. This is almost disappointing. Try to convince anyone of that."
    new "他说得对。这话听着简直令人失望。你倒是去说服别人看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:8414
    old "For the first time, one of Sai's retorts was well-received by everyone else. Katei had alleged they were all liars, but they knew the truth: I hadn't killed Naomi."
    new "这是头一回，Sai 的反唇相讥得到了其他人的一致认可。Katei 一口咬定他们全在撒谎，可他们清楚真相：Naomi 不是我杀的。"

    # game/script.rpy:8419
    old "You're only digging your own grave by acting as if we're all conspiring against you. You had an actual method of escape that Atsuki provided you with. Taking it would've been a much smarter decision than accusing him."
    new "你非要把我们都说成串通一气，只会自掘坟墓。Atsuki 明明给了你一条真正的脱身之路，走这条路，可比反过来指控他明智得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:8424
    old "It's especially idiotic even for this guy. Why are you saying that Atsuki was on this floor?"
    new "这种事搁在他身上也蠢得离谱。你凭什么说 Atsuki 就在这一层？"

    # game/script.rpy:8429
    old "Because I saw him!{w} After Naomi left, when she understood that I wasn't buying it, I heard a noise. In this hallway, B, I saw Atsuki."
    new "因为我亲眼看见他了！{w}Naomi 走后——她明白我根本不信那套说辞——我听见了动静。就在这条 B走廊上，我看见了 Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:8430
    old "It surprised me, so I kept silent and waited for him to move. However, trying not to be seen also made me lose track of him completely. I looked around a bit, but I couldn't find him or Naomi again."
    new "我吃了一惊，便没有出声，等着他先动。可我一心不想被看见，反倒彻底跟丢了他。我四下找了一阵，却再没找到他，也没找到 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:8435
    old "When I went back up, I saw him with the others, and you all said that he could not have been downstairs. That's what leads me to the conclusion that you've all been lying to me."
    new "等我回到上面，却看见他和大家待在一起，而你们都说他不可能在楼下。这让我只能断定，你们全都在骗我。"

    # game/script.rpy:8436
    old "...That ridiculous claim, if anything, explained why Katei had insisted multiple times that the elevator group might've been able to sneak down. Naturally, though, it was met with silence and shared disapproval."
    new "……这番荒唐的说辞，倒是解释了他为何几次三番咬定电梯那一组人有可能偷偷下楼。当然，回应他的只有沉默和众人的不以为然。"

    # game/script.rpy:8441
    old "At least this proves you're nothing but a lying machine. Your fuel must've run out and now you can only fabricate these limp little things."
    new "至少这证明了你就是个撒谎机器。看来你的燃料已经耗尽，如今只能编出这种软绵绵的瞎话。"

    # game/script.rpy:8442
    old "You think you sound smart, but I believe all of us here know that you are the one lying."
    new "你自以为说得聪明，可我相信这里所有人都清楚，撒谎的人是你。"

    # game/script.rpy:8447
    old "Let me just tell it to you straight. In the one in a million chance that you're either telling the truth or hallucinating, what you saw could not have been Atsuki. If you actually saw someone, it wasn't him."
    new "我就直说了吧。即便你真有百万分之一的可能说了实话，或者只是产生了幻觉，你看见的也不可能是 Atsuki。你若真看见了什么人，那也不是他。"

    # game/script.rpy:8452
    old "Incorrect. I am certain it was him. His clothes could've been borrowed, but borrowing a face and the size of someone's body is much different. I don't know why you're all lying and aiding a criminal, but I'm certain of what I saw."
    new "不对。我确信那就是他。衣服可以借，但一张脸、一副身量，可不是随便借得来的。我不知道你们为什么都要撒谎、包庇一个凶手，但我对自己看见的东西深信不疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:8457
    old "Then we're left with a hallucination. You get your brain checked recently?"
    new "那就只剩下幻觉这一种可能了。你最近检查过脑子没有？"

    # game/script.rpy:8458
    old "I will refrain from saying anything else. When this is all thoroughly investigated by the police, the truth will be proven."
    new "我不再多说了。等警方把这一切彻底查清，真相自会水落石出。"

    # game/script.rpy:8464
    old "As I knew I hadn't killed anyone, I hadn't been seriously considering any of it. I'd ruled it as just Katei's desperate, pathetic, and ineffective way of not being suspected."
    new "我清楚自己没杀过人，所以这些话我根本没往心里去。我只当那是 Katei 为了摆脱嫌疑，走投无路之下使出的拙劣手段，既可怜又无用。"

    # game/script.rpy:8465
    old "My attention had been drawn to one of the cabinets present with us in the room. At first glance, it looked like every other cabinet we'd seen, but there was something unusual about it."
    new "我的注意力被房间里的一个展示柜吸引了过去。乍一看，它和我们见过的其他展示柜没什么两样，但它有些不同寻常。"

    # game/script.rpy:8470
    old "On its right side was what looked to be a small wheel. To get a closer look, I approached it, making sure not to step on any of the blood. As I moved to it, I was once again reminded of the inexplicable odor I had never smelled before, which was starting to blend in seamlessly."
    new "它的右侧有个像是小转轮的东西。我想看仔细些，便走了过去，小心不踩到地上的血迹。走近时，那股从未闻过的莫名气味又一次扑来——它已经开始悄无声息地融入四周。"

    # game/script.rpy:8471
    old "...Did you see something?"
    new "……你看到什么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:8473
    old "Yes, this.{w} Oh, it's a temperature regulator."
    new "嗯，这个。{w}哦，是温度调节器。"

    # game/script.rpy:8474
    old "How interesting. What's it set at?"
    new "有意思。设定在多少？"

    # game/script.rpy:8475
    old "Nothing. It says \"room temperature\"."
    new "什么都没设。上面写着「室温」。"

    # game/script.rpy:8476
    old "I turned around to meet Katei's eyes."
    new "我转过身，迎上 Katei 的目光。"

    # game/script.rpy:8482
    old "...Some cabinets have temperature functions, like the Sekimeiya's. This room has them."
    new "……有些展示柜带温控功能，存放 Sekimeiya 的那个就是。这个房间里的展示柜也有。"

    # game/script.rpy:8486
    old "The white wheel looked a bit damaged, which was what caught my attention. Anything could've caused that, but it stood out from everything else in the room."
    new "那个白色转轮看上去有些损坏，正是这一点引起了我的注意。造成损坏的原因可能有很多，但它在这房间里格外扎眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:8487
    old "I kept inspecting it. Behind it, I quickly noticed another similar wheel, a bit smaller in size."
    new "我继续查看。很快，我注意到它后面还有一个类似的转轮，个头略小一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:8488
    old "And what's this one for?"
    new "那这个又是做什么的？"

    # game/script.rpy:8489
    old "That one? It regulates the temperature."
    new "那个？是调节温度的。"

    # game/script.rpy:8490
    old "I can see the degrees symbol, but this one isn't set to anything, not even to \"room temperature\". I mean, why are there two of them?"
    new "我能看到度数符号，可这个什么都没设定，连「室温」都不是。我是说，为什么会有两个？"

    # game/script.rpy:8492
    old "Well, I think that one regulates the temperature of the gems behind the glass while the big one regulates the temperature inside the cabinet."
    new "这个嘛，我想那个是调节玻璃后面宝石的温度，大的那个则调节展示柜内部的温度。"

    # game/script.rpy:8493
    old "I see, to store gems that also require a determined temperature."
    new "原来如此，用来存放那些同样需要恒定温度的宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:8494
    old "I tried to lift up the cover, but it was too heavy."
    new "我试着抬起盖子，可它太重了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8499
    old "How do I open it, though? I don't seem to be able to."
    new "不过，这要怎么打开？我好像打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:8500
    old "I don't know, I've never opened one."
    new "我不知道，我从没开过这种东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:8506
    old "And you've never seen anyone opening one through the cameras."
    new "而且你也从没在监控里见过别人打开它。"

    # game/script.rpy:8511
    old "...Perhaps I have. I think they first look behind the cabinet, but I'm not sure what the process is. These cabinets have an actual method of locking them so that the temperature inside is well-preserved."
    new "……也许见过。我记得他们先是查看展示柜后面，但具体流程我不清楚。这种展示柜有专门的锁定方式，好让内部温度保持稳定。"

    # game/script.rpy:8521
    old "I tried following his instructions. Behind the cabinet and next to the wheel, there was a tiny plastic latch that I was able to open."
    new "我照他说的试了试。展示柜后面、转轮旁边，有一个小小的塑料卡扣，我把它打开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8522
    old "I think it should be unlocked now..."
    new "现在应该解锁了吧……"

    # game/script.rpy:8523
    old "I put my hands under the lid and brought it up while everyone else stared at me dubiously. Then, Sai began to approach me with curiosity."
    new "我把双手伸到盖子底下，将它抬起，其他人则一脸狐疑地盯着我。随后，Sai 好奇地朝我走了过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:8524
    old "Like before, I was able to open it with ease. When I had fully opened it and kept the lid supported against the wall, I looked inside."
    new "和刚才一样，我没费什么力气就打开了。我把盖子完全掀开，让它靠着墙撑住，然后朝里面看去。"

    # game/script.rpy:8529
    old "There was no appreciable change in temperature, as the wheel hadn't been set to anything. However, there certainly was something inside. I saw the Sekimeiya resting at the bottom, covered by walls with a velvet texture and emitting a faint glow."
    new "转轮没有设定任何温度，所以温度几乎没有什么变化。然而，里面确实有东西。我看见 Sekimeiya 静静躺在底部，四壁是天鹅绒般的质地，它隐隐泛着微光。"

    # game/script.rpy:8531
    old "I-It's here.{w} I have no idea why, but it's here."
    new "它、它在这里。{w}我不知道为什么，但它就在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:8533
    old "Before the others could react, I stretched out my arm to grab it. With one hand, I leaned on the cabinet to support my weight while I put the other inside. As I slowly approached it, I thought to myself: what possible purpose could anyone have for leaving the Sekimeiya there?"
    new "没等其他人反应过来，我已伸出手去抓它。我一只手撑在展示柜上支住身体，另一只手探了进去。手缓缓靠近时，我心里想着：究竟谁会出于什么目的，把 Sekimeiya 留在那种地方？"

    # game/script.rpy:8534
    old "Without giving it much thought, I touched the surface of the egg-shaped object.{w} A burst of heat flowed through my fingers, and the world broke."
    new "我没再多想，指尖触上了那枚蛋形物体的表面。{w}一股灼热穿过我的手指，随即，世界碎裂了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8540
    old "B-Side"
    new "B-Side"

    # game/script.rpy:8544
    old "The burning sensation vanished, and I was no longer stretching out my arm. Before me was a long corridor that I'd seen before.{w} My body froze, and I broke out in a cold sweat. A heavy cloak of confusion was cast on me as my heart took off like a rocket."
    new "灼烧感消失了，我的手臂也不再向前伸。眼前是一条我见过的长走廊。{w}我浑身僵住，冷汗直冒。浓重的困惑笼罩着我，心脏狂跳不止。"

    # game/script.rpy:8547
    old "Something had happened to me—something that I hadn't ever experienced before. When I slowly began to discern my surroundings, I saw that I was in hallway A, next to the lobby."
    new "我身上发生了什么——一件我从未经历过的事。等我慢慢辨清周围，才发现自己身处A走廊，就在大厅旁边。"

    # game/script.rpy:8557
    old "I tried to calm down and think. I timidly moved my head and saw the huge shutter blocking my way to the outside world. Around the hallway A door, dark marks left by the smoke were easily noticeable."
    new "我试着冷静下来思考。我怯怯地转过头，看见那扇巨大的卷帘门堵住了通往外面的路。A走廊的门周围，烟雾留下的暗色痕迹清晰可见。"

    # game/script.rpy:8558
    old "Next, I moved my legs forward. I was still able to control my whole body; nothing seemed to have changed in that regard. I moved up to hallway B, which surrounded me with its dark, unsettling scenery and pure silence."
    new "接着，我迈步向前。我仍能自如地控制全身，这方面似乎没有任何异样。我走到B走廊，那里幽暗而令人不安的景象与彻骨的寂静将我团团围住。"

    # game/script.rpy:8565
    old "In the right wall, I could see the door of the room I'd been in a few seconds ago. It was closed, like all the others."
    new "右侧的墙上，我能看见几秒前自己还待着的那间房的门。它关着，和其余的门一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:8566
    old "As I gently approached it, I tried to think about what could've happened. However, it was as bizarre as it sounded: I had touched the Sekimeiya and appeared in the lobby."
    new "我轻手轻脚地靠近，一边琢磨究竟发生了什么。可这件事说起来就匪夷所思：我碰了一下Sekimeiya，人就出现在了大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:8570
    old "Not only that, but it had been instantaneous. Not a moment of time had seemed to pass before my surroundings changed."
    new "不仅如此，这一切还是瞬间发生的。周围景象变换之前，仿佛连一瞬的时间都没有流逝。"

    # game/script.rpy:8578
    old "I gripped the knob. As soon as I started to open the door, I saw blood. On the floor, Naomi's dead body rested, her face clearly distressed. My senses alerted me of another change: the strange smell didn't appear to exist anymore."
    new "我握住门把手。刚一推开门，我就看见了血。Naomi的尸体躺在地上，脸上分明写满痛苦。我的感官又察觉到另一处变化：那股奇怪的气味似乎已经不存在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8582
    old "I kept looking inside the room. Everyone else had already left it, and the cabinet I'd opened was closed."
    new "我继续往房里看。其他人都已经离开了，我打开过的展示柜也合上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8587
    old "The haunting atmosphere radiating throughout the room was overwhelming, and it chased me out. I closed the door behind me and made an effort at breathing properly to calm myself down. What the hell was happening?"
    new "弥漫在整个房间里的阴森气息压得人喘不过气，把我逼了出来。我随手关上门，努力平稳呼吸让自己镇定下来。到底出什么事了？"

    # game/script.rpy:8588
    old "Was there a blank spot in my memory? Had I forgotten about something past the last memory I had?"
    new "是我的记忆出现了空白吗？我是不是忘了最后那段记忆之后的事？"

    # game/script.rpy:8589
    old "Nothing made sense. It couldn't make sense. The others had disappeared, and I had, in the blink of an eye, moved from one place to another."
    new "一切都说不通。根本不可能说得通。其他人不见了，而我眨眼之间就从一处到了另一处。"

    # game/script.rpy:8590
    old "...Was I knocked out?{w} I had my back against the others when I reached for the Sekimeiya, but wouldn't I remember it? Wouldn't I feel pain in my head if I was hit?"
    new "……我是被打晕了吗？{w}我伸手去够Sekimeiya的时候，背还朝着其他人，可要真挨了打，我总该记得吧？要是头上挨了一下，也该觉得疼啊？"

    # game/script.rpy:8591
    old "And... when I realized I was somewhere different than before, I was standing up. If I'd been knocked out, I would've woken up on the floor..."
    new "而且……等我意识到自己不在原来的地方时，我是站着的。如果真被打晕了，我醒来时该是躺在地上的……"

    # game/script.rpy:8594
    old "No matter how I thought of it, it felt as if no time had passed between the Sekimeiya's touch and the change in what I was looking at. To put it bluntly, it felt as if I had teleported between places."
    new "无论怎么想，从碰到Sekimeiya到眼前的景象改变，中间好像一点时间也没过去。说得直白些，就像我被传送到了别处。"

    # game/script.rpy:8595
    old "However, that was impossible. There must've been a reason why it had felt like that."
    new "可那是不可能的。我会有那种感觉，一定另有原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:8603
    old "I opened the door to the event room. Nothing but a single, ugly cabinet was inside. I couldn't see its contents, but I didn't care. I kept looking through every room in the hallway to find the people that should've been there—to confirm that I hadn't been left alone and to understand what had happened to me."
    new "我推开活动室的门。里面只有一个难看的展示柜。我看不见柜里的东西，也不在意。我把走廊上的每一间房都看了个遍，想找到本该在这里的那些人——想确认自己没有被独自丢下，也想弄清我到底出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:8648
    old "I opened and closed every door in quick succession until I knew that I was on a desolate floor. ...Where was Shiroya?"
    new "我一扇接一扇地开门又关门，直到确定这一层空无一人。……Shiroya在哪里？"

    # game/script.rpy:8654
    old "In front of me was the elevator door. I wanted to see the others, so I called it. If they were somewhere above me, they would hear the sound and come down to find me."
    new "面前是电梯门。我想见到其他人，于是叫了电梯。如果他们在我上面的某一层，应该能听见声音，下来找我。"

    # game/script.rpy:8656
    old "After I pressed the button, though, nothing happened."
    new "然而按下按钮之后，什么反应都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:8658
    old "...Is it here?"
    new "……是在这里吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:8659
    old "I grabbed the handle of the large, metallic door. As I'd suspected, I was able to open it."
    new "我抓住那扇金属大门的把手。果然如我所料，门能打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:8664
    old "Since I wouldn't be able to draw people down to me, I had to modify my idea. I boarded the tiny elevator and pressed the button for the sixth floor. If anyone could hear it, I hoped they'd be lured."
    new "既然没法把人引下来，我只好换个办法。我走进狭小的电梯，按下六楼的按钮。要是有人能听见，我希望这声音能把他们引过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:8670
    old "It was my second time taking a full six-floor trip in that gloomy space, and being alone only made it worse. Just what had happened? I'd been accumulating questions since we'd gotten trapped, but the situation I was in surpassed all of them."
    new "这是我第二次在这个阴暗的空间里乘电梯走完六层，独自一人只觉得更难熬。究竟发生了什么？自从被困在这里，我心里的疑问越积越多，可眼下的处境却比所有疑问都更叫人费解。"

    # game/script.rpy:8671
    old "Being alone let me look inside the elevator freely. ...I stared at the red button with the word \"stop\" on it. They would usually stop it abruptly, mostly in case someone got stuck on a door. Other times, they'd only play a loud alarm throughout the building."
    new "独自一人，反倒让我能随意打量电梯内部。……我盯着那个写着“stop”的红色按钮。平常他们会直接按下它，让电梯骤然停住，多半是怕有人被门夹住。还有些时候，只是整栋楼里会响起刺耳的警报。"

    # game/script.rpy:8672
    old "On the wall next to it, there was a little paper with instructions detailing how it worked. I took the time to read it, trying to calm myself down."
    new "旁边的墙上贴着一张纸条，上面详细说明了这个按钮的用法。我索性花时间读了一遍，借此让自己冷静下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:8675
    old "\"Pressing the stop button will instantly deactivate the elevator and contact an emergency line. It is strictly prohibited to press it without a good reason, and to prevent ulterior uses, the elevator won't be enabled again until a staff member consents. Keep in mind that you are being recorded.\""
    new "「按下停止按钮，电梯将立即停止运行，并接通紧急专线。严禁无故按下此按钮；为防止不当使用，在工作人员确认之前，电梯不会重新启用。请注意，本区域设有监控录像。」"

    # game/script.rpy:8676
    old "I looked behind me, and sure enough, I saw a small camera in an upper corner with a green light on it. It seemed Ashiya had made sure the button would only be used during a real emergency. Regarding the contact line, it was likely it had been nullified by the alarm."
    new "我回头看去，果然在上方角落发现一台小摄像头，绿灯正亮着。看来芦屋早已确保这个按钮只在真正的紧急情况下才会被按下。至于那条紧急专线，多半已经随警报一起失效了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8677
    old "The remaining seconds once again left me in awe at how unsettling that small and quiet elevator could get. Even though I could hear the friction of the ropes, that imposing and deep sound that was more than apparent outside couldn't be appreciated well from the interior."
    new "余下的几秒又让我领教了这部狭小安静的电梯能阴森到什么地步。绳索的摩擦声我听得见，可那种在外面格外明显、令人压抑的低沉声响，在轿厢里却听不真切。"

    # game/script.rpy:8690
    old "I went to the highest accessible floor and hastily pushed the door open. The sight was just as I remembered. I remained solitary and was met with another silently overwhelming floor."
    new "我来到能到达的最高一层，匆匆推开门。眼前的景象和我记忆中别无二致。我依旧孤身一人，面对的是又一个沉默得令人窒息的楼层。"

    # game/script.rpy:8691
    old "While I hoped people had heard me and were coming, I had to know whether there was someone around. We'd seen how easy it was to inspect those floors, so I started the same procedure from before."
    new "我一方面盼着有人听见动静正赶过来，一方面也必须确认附近有没有人。我们已经知道检查这些楼层并不费力，于是我照旧开始。"

    # game/script.rpy:8698
    old "I looked at the empty left corridor. A door was hiding from my field of vision, but there was nobody to be seen."
    new "我望向空荡的左侧走廊。有一扇门落在我的视野之外，但看不见半个人影。"

    # game/script.rpy:8703
    old "Then, I made my way to the offices to see if they weren't vacant for some reason.{w} There was something I recognized in the first one."
    new "随后我走向办公区，看看那里是不是也空无一人。{w}第一间里有样东西我认得。"

    # game/script.rpy:8708
    old "The computer we'd powered on earlier still showed a lit screen and an empty prompt to input access information."
    new "我们先前开过的那台电脑依然亮着屏，停留在等待输入访问信息的空提示框上。"

    # game/script.rpy:8712
    old "Without paying any mind to it, I entered the second partition. Being alone meant that I couldn't keep watch over the connecting corridor."
    new "我没再多看它一眼，走进了第二个隔间。独自一人，就意味着我无法兼顾连接走廊那边的动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:8716
    old "In the second and third partitions, my only company was a functioning camera recording my every movement.{w} I sat on a chair and sighed deeply, unraveling at the sudden turn things had taken. Did we not have enough already? What the fuck had just happened!? My whole body hadn't stopped shaking for a second. I rejected the thought that any of it was real."
    new "在第二和第三个隔间里，陪着我的只有一台运转中的摄像头，记录着我的一举一动。{w}我在椅子上坐下，长长叹了口气，被这突如其来的转折弄得心神溃散。我们遇到的麻烦还不够多吗？刚才到底他妈发生了什么！？我浑身抖个不停，一刻也没停过。我不肯相信这一切是真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:8722
    old "I left the offices once I felt ready to continue, but I was still hopeless.{w} I was about to repeat my movements on the floors below when I heard a very distinguishable sound coming from my left."
    new "等我觉得自己能继续了，便离开办公区，可心里依旧茫然无着。{w}我正要下楼重复同样的搜索，左边忽然传来一个很容易辨认的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:8730
    old "Footsteps. And ones I knew I'd heard many times in the past. I turned around and saw Shiroya coming out of the left corridor."
    new "脚步声。而且是我过去听过许多次的脚步声。我转过身，看见Shiroya从左侧走廊里走出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:8736
    old "I didn't have time to act surprised or throw a bunch of questions at her before she spoke."
    new "我还没来得及露出惊讶的表情，也没来得及把一肚子问题抛给她，她就先开口了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8742
    old "Oh, you're here. I found something."
    new "哦，你在这儿啊。我发现了点东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:8743
    old "...Wh—"
    new "……什——"

    # game/script.rpy:8748
    old "Completely unfazed, she opened the transparent door and entered the first partition. I was left outside, utterly bewildered.{w} Without looking back, she stepped to the next door."
    new "她神色如常，推开那扇透明门走进了第一个隔间。我被撇在外面，彻底懵了。{w}她头也不回地走向下一扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:8750
    old "How was that her reaction after seeing me? I was too shocked to follow her. Even though my confusion had only intensified, I was at least glad to see I wasn't alone, and she had appeared from the left corridor..."
    new "见到我之后，她怎么是这个反应？我惊得没能跟上去。困惑只增不减，可至少看见自己不是孤身一人，我心里还是松了口气，而且她是从左边走廊出来的……"

    # game/script.rpy:8755
    old "I walked over to it. I knew an extra door was located at the end, so I approached it, wondering if she'd come out of it."
    new "我走了过去。我知道走廊尽头还有一扇多出来的门，于是走近它，心想她会不会就是从那里出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:8759
    old "But it was still locked, and there was nothing out of the ordinary about it."
    new "可那扇门依旧锁着，看不出任何异常。"

    # game/script.rpy:8763
    old "Trying to decipher what she said, I ran back to the door of the offices and entered them in a desperate attempt at understanding."
    new "我想弄懂她那句话的意思，便跑回办公区门前，急着进去想弄个明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:8769
    old "The first partition was empty. So was the second one. A chill ran down my spine when the third one didn't appear any different."
    new "第一个隔间空着。第二个也是。等到第三个也不见不同，一股寒意顺着脊背爬上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:8773
    old "I froze for a few seconds, questioning what had happened to me and Shiroya."
    new "我僵了几秒，心里反复追问我和Shiroya到底出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:8774
    old "I recalled teleporting from one place to another. She couldn't have disappeared from the offices, could she? I exited them to look at the other corridor."
    new "我想起自己从一处传送到另一处。她总不能凭空从办公区消失吧？我退出来，朝另一条走廊望去。"

    # game/script.rpy:8780
    old "There was nobody there."
    new "那里空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:8784
    old "Dumbfounded, I went down the stairs."
    new "我怔怔地走下楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:8798
    old "There was nobody on the outer part of the fifth floor, so I looked through the partitions.{w} The three of them were empty."
    new "五楼外侧空无一人，我便挨个查看隔间。{w}三间隔间里都没有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:8805
    old "As I was about to make it out, I stopped myself in the middle partition, far beyond confusion. What the hell was my objective?"
    new "眼看就要走出去，我却停在中间那间隔间里，茫然得无以复加。我究竟想干什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:8806
    old "Hadn't I just found Shiroya and been completely ignored? She'd acted as if I was a ghost and moved on only to immediately disappear again."
    new "我不是刚找到 Shiroya，就被她彻底无视了吗？她表现得好像我是幽灵，径直走开，转眼又消失不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:8807
    old "I'd been in continuous motion since we'd gotten trapped, but that was the first time I couldn't settle on an objective to pursue. I took advantage of it to sit on a chair for a little while, attempting to calm my alarmed heart down."
    new "自从被困在这里，我一直没停下过脚步，可这是第一次，我连该追什么目标都定不下来。我索性趁这机会在椅子上坐了一会儿，试着让惊惶的心平静下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:8809
    old "But it was useless. I thought about what had happened and felt as if I was driving myself crazy. What could I make of Shiroya's behavior after feeling like I'd literally teleported? It was insane, and I feared there was something wrong with me."
    new "可这毫无作用。一想到刚才发生的事，我就觉得自己快被逼疯了。亲身经历了一次传送之后，我又该如何理解 Shiroya 的举动？太荒唐了，我甚至怕是自己出了问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:8810
    old "After a while, I knew I had to continue looking around, but no determination came to me. Since I'd already seen Shiroya, everyone else should've been nearby, so I kept moving down the floors."
    new "过了一会儿，我知道自己该继续去找，却没有半分干劲。既然已经见到 Shiroya，其他人应该也在附近，于是我继续往楼下走。"

    # game/script.rpy:8819
    old "I went to the fourth floor and looked through it. I slowly moved down to the third and repeated the same process."
    new "我把四楼查了一遍，又慢慢下到三楼，重复同样的步骤。"

    # game/script.rpy:8823
    old "I didn't see any signs of life."
    new "看不到任何有人活动的迹象。"

    # game/script.rpy:8826
    old "I repeated the same inefficient movements on floor 2, and yet again, the result was the same. The crystal floor, where my lonely adventure had begun, was the one that remained."
    new "我在二楼又重复了一遍这徒劳的搜索，结果依旧相同。只剩下水晶层——我这场孤独的冒险开始的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:8830
    old "Surely anyone would've been able to make it past me while I'd been looking through the offices, so I couldn't even be certain nobody was above me, even less so having spent minutes inside one of them."
    new "我翻查办公室的时候，任何人都有可能从我身边溜过去。我连楼上是否真的没人都不敢确定，何况我还在其中一间里待了好几分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:8841
    old "I didn't know where to begin, but I quickly spotted an obvious point. After peeking at both hallways, I saw an open door in hallway B."
    new "我不知该从哪儿找起，却很快发现了一处显而易见的地方。我朝两条走廊各瞥了一眼，便看到 B走廊有一扇门开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:8845
    old "It belonged to the room where we'd found Naomi's corpse—where I'd last seen the others."
    new "那是我们发现 Naomi 尸体的房间，也是我最后一次见到其他人的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:8849
    old "I approached it, but I couldn't see what was behind it through the small gap.{w} As I approached, I started to hear something. There were voices, ones that sounded shocked."
    new "我走近那扇门，可透过窄窄的门缝看不清里面的情形。{w}走近之后，我开始听到些动静。是说话声，语气里透着震惊。"

    # game/script.rpy:8853
    old "The doorknob was finally in reach. I ignored it, simply pushing the door open, and a very familiar sight appeared before me."
    new "门把手终于触手可及。我没有去碰它，直接推门而入，眼前出现了再熟悉不过的景象。"

    # game/script.rpy:8865
    old "Wh-What...!? How did you...?"
    new "什、什么……！？你怎么会……？"

    # game/script.rpy:8870
    old "Where the fuck did you go?"
    new "你他妈跑哪儿去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:8871
    old "Shiroya rushed to me and asked the same thing. Meanwhile, I looked at the six pairs of eyes focusing their most intense gazes on mine. ...On the floor, Naomi still lay in her own blood."
    new "Shiroya 冲到我面前，问的也是同一句话。与此同时，六双眼睛用最锐利的目光盯着我。……地板上，Naomi 还躺在血泊里。"

    # game/script.rpy:8872
    old "...I-I don't know? What exactly are you asking me?"
    new "……我、我不知道？你们到底在问我什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:8877
    old "Just a minute ago, you were looking inside that cabinet. How did you make it out of the room?"
    new "就在一分钟前，你还在往那个展示柜里看。你是怎么离开这个房间的？"

    # game/script.rpy:8878
    old "\"Just a minute ago\"? Were they messing with me? There was no way Shiroya would..."
    new "「就在一分钟前」？他们在耍我吗？Shiroya 不可能……"

    # game/script.rpy:8879
    old "...You mean to say that I disappeared from in front of the cabinet?"
    new "……你是说，我从展示柜前面消失了？"

    # game/script.rpy:8884
    old "Atsuki, don't fuck around. We don't mean to say that you disappeared, we're asking you how you did it."
    new "Atsuki，别他妈装傻。我们不是说你消失了，是问你到底怎么做到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:8885
    old "...I didn't do anything. I touched the Sekimeiya and instantly appeared in hallway A."
    new "……我什么都没做。我碰了一下 Sekimeiya，转眼就出现在 A 走廊了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8886
    old "Excuse me?"
    new "你说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:8891
    old "We were talking about how you were the true culprit of this murder. You clearly did something to shift our focus."
    new "我们刚才在说你才是这起命案的真凶。你显然动了什么手脚，好转移我们的注意力。"

    # game/script.rpy:8898
    old "Wait a second, though. What's in this cabinet is not the Sekimeiya."
    new "不过，等一下。这展示柜里的东西不是 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:8899
    old "Huh? I'm certain it was. I touched it and felt a burn on my fingers."
    new "咦？肯定是。我碰到它的时候，手指还被烫了一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:8900
    old "Not the one we saw earlier, at least. Look."
    new "至少不是我们之前看到的那个。你看。"

    # game/script.rpy:8901
    old "He put his right arm inside the cabinet and removed it, holding an object that looked very similar to the Sekimeiya."
    new "他把右臂伸进展示柜，抽出来时，手里拿着一个和 Sekimeiya 非常相似的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:8906
    old "Yeah. That's the only thing that was inside."
    new "没错。里面就只有那个。"

    # game/script.rpy:8907
    old "I have no idea how you made it to the hallway. There's nothing else in the cabinet."
    new "我完全想不通你是怎么到走廊去的。展示柜里没有别的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:8909
    old "My eyes were still directed at the Sekimeiya in Sai's hand. It no longer glowed at all, and it was gray."
    new "我的目光仍停在 Sai 手里的 Sekimeiya 上。它已经完全不发光了，整个是灰色的。"

    # game/script.rpy:8913
    old "I'm telling the truth. Wh-What I found in the cabinet looked like the Sekimeiya we'd seen. I saw it glowing in the dark."
    new "我说的是实话。我、我在展示柜里看到的东西，就跟我们之前见过的 Sekimeiya 一样。我看见它在黑暗里发光。"

    # game/script.rpy:8914
    old "I had to explain myself however I could, but I had no concept of what had happened."
    new "我必须想办法解释清楚，可我自己也完全不明白发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:8919
    old "But this thing doesn't glow. Katei says he doesn't know what it is, even though that means nothing."
    new "但这玩意儿不发光。Katei 说他不知道这是什么，不过他那话也说明不了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:8924
    old "...I'm telling you what I know. This Sekimeiya was never here."
    new "……我只是把我知道的说出来。这个 Sekimeiya 从来就不在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:8929
    old "Atsuki, let me try to understand what you're saying. You mean that when you touched that thing, you teleported outside?"
    new "Atsuki，让我理理你的意思。你是说，你碰到那东西的时候，就被传送到了外面？"

    # game/script.rpy:8930
    old "...{w}Th-That's what it felt like."
    new "……{w}感、感觉就是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:8944
    old "Everyone looked skeptical, but they remained quiet."
    new "每个人脸上都写着怀疑，却都没出声。"

    # game/script.rpy:8945
    old "...You weren't here by that point yet, though. When I found myself in the lobby, I entered this room and only saw Naomi's body on the floor.{w} I went up to the sixth floor to find you and eventually went back down. That's when I just found you here."
    new "……可那时候你们还没到这儿。我发现自己在大厅里后，就进了这个房间，只看到 Naomi 的尸体躺在地上。{w}我上六楼去找你们，后来又下来了。就是在那时，我才在这里碰到你们。"

    # game/script.rpy:8946
    old "I felt strangely uncomfortable while I attempted to explain myself. I sounded crazy, and if I wasn't, they were the ones tricking me. The only explanation was that I'd been knocked out in some way and they were acting as if it had just happened seconds ago."
    new "解释的时候，我心里莫名地难受。我听起来像个疯子；可如果我没疯，那就是他们在骗我。唯一的解释是：我不知怎么失去了意识，而他们装作那不过是几秒钟前的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:8956
    old "...Isla, still between Erina's arms, looked the least dubious of me, but she still seemed to be trying to process that her friend's prediction hadn't come true."
    new "……Isla 仍被 Erina 搂在怀里，在众人当中，她看起来最不怀疑我，但似乎仍在想着，她朋友的预言竟没有应验。"

    # game/script.rpy:8962
    old "So, you want to make us believe that you traveled to the past. That's impressive."
    new "所以，你是想让我们相信你穿越到了过去。真了不起啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:8963
    old "...N—"
    new "……不——"

    # game/script.rpy:8964
    old "\"To the past\", right. That was the conclusion to draw from what I'd said.{w} Not only teleportation, but time travel too. It was a ridiculous claim even if they'd really seen me disappear."
    new "「穿越到过去」，没错。按我刚才说的，只能得出这个结论。{w}不只是传送，更是时间穿越。就算他们真的亲眼看见我消失，这说法也荒唐得可笑。"

    # game/script.rpy:8969
    old "Are you hearing him? I bet you all thought he was innocent before seeing his true colors. You can't honestly tell me you believe a word of what he's saying."
    new "你们都听见了吧？我猜在看清他的真面目之前，你们个个都以为他是清白的。别告诉我你们真信了他一个字。"

    # game/script.rpy:8974
    old "Then how do you think he escaped from this room? I... I saw him vanish with my own eyes, and I believe we all did. You told us there's no hidden paths in these rooms."
    new "那你说他是怎么逃出这个房间的？我……我亲眼看见他消失的，我想我们也都看见了。你还跟我们说过，这些房间里没有暗道。"

    # game/script.rpy:8980
    old "Tell us, Atsuki. How did you do it? There is a security camera here, so your trick has been recorded. Are you going to claim ignorance and state that you traveled to the past?"
    new "说吧，Atsuki。你到底是怎么做到的？这里装了监控摄像头，你的把戏都被拍下来了。你还打算装糊涂，说自己穿越到了过去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:8994
    old "Did I travel to the past? I couldn't have. That's impossible."
    new "我回到过去了？不可能。这种事根本不可能发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:8995
    old "Even if such a thing were possible, would everything hold up?"
    new "就算真有可能，一切都能对得上吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:8998
    old "I have no idea what caused it, but if the others didn't knock me out, I must've teleported in some way. I guess traveling to the past only adds a bit more impossibility to that."
    new "我不知道是什么原因，但既然不是其他人把我打晕的，那就只能是我以某种方式被传送了。要说还顺带穿越了时间，也不过是在这上面再添一层不可能罢了。"

    # game/script.rpy:8999
    old "At least, one thing would begin to make sense if that's what happened. Earlier, when I looked in this room, Naomi was already dead. Didn't Katei say this? That I was on this floor during the time Naomi died?"
    new "至少，若真是如此，有一件事就说得通了。先前我查看这个房间时，Naomi 已经死了。Katei 不是说过吗？说在 Naomi 遇害的那段时间里，我就在这一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:9000
    old "Through normal means, I wouldn't have been able to be on the crystal floor. I was upstairs, and I would've been noticed if I'd headed down. This would make it possible."
    new "正常来说，我不可能出现在水晶层。我当时在楼上，若往楼下走，必定会被人看见。而这样一来，就有了可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:9001
    old "It would be absurd to immediately justify Katei's accusation like this, but it would explain why he decided to make such a nonsensical claim in the first place, and it would make a lot of what he said believable."
    new "就这样立刻替 Katei 的指控找到依据，未免荒唐；可这样一来，他当初为何要提出如此荒谬的论断，反倒有了答案，他所说的许多话也就变得可信了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9004
    old "I'd seen it countless times: time travel appearing out of nowhere to construct crazy events. I'd experienced many stories that were ruined by such an exploitable mechanic. Thinking about it, I felt as if the same thing was happening to my reasoning."
    new "这样的桥段我见过无数次：时间穿越凭空冒出来，拼凑出一连串离奇的事件。我也读过不少故事，就是被这种可以随意取巧的设定毁掉的。想到这儿，我仿佛觉得自己的推理也正走上同一条路。"

    # game/script.rpy:9005
    old "If I couldn't explain my own experience, did I have to assume that time traveling was possible? Had it been a factor the whole time?{w} I thought about the full sequence of events up until that point. If they were somehow related to time travel, how were we supposed to think about that?"
    new "既然我解释不了自己的遭遇，就非得认定时间穿越可行吗？它会不会从一开始就是整件事的一环？{w}我把此前发生的一切按顺序梳理了一遍。若这些事真与时间穿越有所牵连，我们又该怎么去看待？"

    # game/script.rpy:9007
    old "What would be more reasonable? To deny its existence and ignore my unexplained experience, or to think that it could be possible?"
    new "哪一种更合理？是拒不承认它存在，把自己无法解释的遭遇置之不理，还是承认它或许真有可能？"

    # game/script.rpy:9010
    old "I felt no enthusiasm thinking about either option, so I thought back on the previous few minutes."
    new "两个选项都提不起我的兴致，于是我回头去想刚才那几分钟里的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:9011
    old "How would this even work? Whenever time travel comes up, the word \"paradox\" is usually thrown all around. Depending on its rules, the way time travel works can greatly differ."
    new "这究竟是怎么运作的？一提到时间穿越，人们总爱把「悖论」这个词挂在嘴边。规则不同，时间穿越的方式也会大相径庭。"

    # game/script.rpy:9012
    old "One simple type of paradox is the famous \"going back to the past and preventing your birth\". Would you instantly disappear, or would you live a life in a world where you never existed? Either way, the past was changed."
    new "一种简单的悖论就是著名的「回到过去，阻止自己出生」。你会当场消失，还是在一个你从未存在过的世界里活下去？无论哪种，过去都被改变了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9013
    old "On the other side is the bootstrap paradox: you find a key, open a door with it, find a time travel machine inside, use it to go back to the past, and finally place the key on the floor so that your past self can find it."
    new "另一类则是自举悖论：你捡到一把钥匙，用它打开一扇门，在门内发现一台时间机器，乘它回到过去，最后把钥匙放在地上，好让过去的自己捡到。"

    # game/script.rpy:9014
    old "In that case, did time travel matter at all? The past was not changed, so by traveling back, you only understood how it all came to happen. Essentially, it's a loop without a starting point, and it only occurred because it occurred."
    new "若是如此，时间穿越还有什么意义？过去并未改变，回到过去只是让你明白这一切是如何发生的。说到底，这是一个没有起点的循环，它之所以发生，仅仅因为它已经发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:9017
    old "That's a concept far from sensible. It could come in handy to justify grand motives in a story, but it's nothing short of completely impractical."
    new "这种说法实在谈不上合理。在故事里用来给宏大的动机找理由或许方便，可实际上完全行不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:9018
    old "However, no matter how I feel, I think that everything points to this direction: that if I have just traveled to the past, I haven't actually changed anything. It seems like I just reexperienced the events I previously lived."
    new "然而无论我作何感想，种种迹象似乎都指向同一个方向：倘若我方才真的回到了过去，那我其实什么也没有改变。我似乎只是重新经历了一遍自己已经历过的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:9019
    old "The starting point seems to have been making physical contact with the Sekimeiya. As nothing that I did once I arrived in the past directly led to my travel, I'm not sure I'd quite perceive it as that kind of paradox."
    new "起点似乎是我与 Sekimeiya 发生了身体接触。我回到过去之后所做的任何事，都没有直接导致这次穿越，所以我不太确定这能否算作那种悖论。"

    # game/script.rpy:9020
    old "Looking ahead, though, it seems that I unconsciously repeated the past I had lived with Shiroya."
    new "可往后看，我似乎无意识地重演了与 Shiroya 共同度过的那段过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:9023
    old "\"Just a minute ago, you were looking inside that cabinet.\" According to this, I can draw that I supposedly went back about twenty minutes to the past. That's the time I estimate I spent confusedly looking around for people."
    new "「就在一分钟前，你还在看那个展示柜。」照此说来，我大概是回到了二十分钟前。那正好是我东奔西走、四处找人所花去的时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:9024
    old "By that point, Naomi had already been killed. Shortly after, I took the elevator that was on this floor up to the sixth."
    new "那时 Naomi 已经遇害。不久之后，我便乘这一层的电梯上到了六楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:9025
    old "This cleanly holds up with what we experienced... At that point, the elevator was on the crystal floor, as it had probably arrived there when we'd heard it on the fifth.{w} Then, when I went up to the sixth would be when Shiroya and I rushed to follow it up."
    new "这一点与我们经历过的完全对得上……那时电梯停在水晶层，大概是我们在五楼听见它时，它正好到了那里。{w}而我上到六楼，正是 Shiroya 和我匆忙追着电梯上楼的那一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:9026
    old "What the hell is this? Did I, without being aware of it, replicate the past I'd experienced?"
    new "这到底是怎么回事？难道我在毫不知情的情况下，重现了自己经历过的过去？"

    # game/script.rpy:9029
    old "I think that something curious happened when we chased the elevator up. If the elevator hadn't been empty, we had to assume that whoever went up entered the attic. The only other explanation was that the person inside vanished."
    new "我想，我们追着电梯上楼时，发生了些蹊跷的事。如果电梯里并非空无一人，那就只能认为上去的人进了阁楼。除此之外唯一的解释，就是里面的人凭空消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9030
    old "But... it seems that what I just went through explains what actually occurred."
    new "不过……我刚才经历的一切，似乎正好解释了实际发生的情形。"

    # game/script.rpy:9040
    old "I got out of the elevator and looked through the sixth floor. The corridor appeared empty, and I spent a bit of time inside the offices."
    new "我走出电梯，在六楼各处查看。走廊里空无一人，我又在几间办公室里待了一阵。"

    # game/script.rpy:9041
    old "As I was there, Shiroya and another version of myself were chasing me. They called the elevator to the fifth floor, but as I saw earlier, that wouldn't have made a noticeable sound from where I was."
    new "我在那里的时候，Shiroya 和另一个我正追着我。他们把电梯叫到了五楼，可正如我刚才所见，从我所在的位置根本听不出什么动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:9052
    old "Then, as I remember, the previous me stayed next to the elevator while Shiroya looked through the two main parts of the floor. She also mentioned how she'd first looked through the opposite corridor."
    new "然后，按照我的记忆，先前的我守在电梯旁，Shiroya 则查看了这一层的两个主要区域。她还提到，自己最先查看的是对面的走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:9055
    old "She and I saw each other when I was about to continue looking for people. She was about to look through each partition."
    new "我正要接着去找人时，和她打了个照面。她那时正要逐个查看隔间。"

    # game/script.rpy:9058
    old "That's why she reacted the way she did. From her perspective, I should've been next to the elevator, but where she found me, my job still would have worked. From there, you could still prevent anyone from escaping, so she thought I had moved from next to the elevator to outside the offices."
    new "她之所以有那样的反应，原因就在这里。在她看来，我本该待在电梯旁，但她找到我的地方，同样能起到看守的作用。站在那里照样能防止有人逃走，所以她以为我是从电梯旁挪到了办公室外面。"

    # game/script.rpy:9059
    old "So, to her, it appeared as if the floor had been empty. She didn't realize that she'd actually seen the person who'd brought the elevator up."
    new "所以在她眼中，这一层仿佛空无一人。她并没有意识到，自己见到的其实正是把电梯叫上来的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:9067
    old "That was her reaction when she thought I'd slightly moved."
    new "那便是她以为我只是略微挪了位置时的反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:9072
    old "Similarly, when she was done investigating, something she said did throw me off a little."
    new "同样，她调查完之后，有一句话让我有些摸不着头脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:9078
    old "But look, this is what I wanted to show you."
    new "不过你看，这就是我想给你看的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:9079
    old "She was referencing what she'd told me just before that point, unaware that she wasn't talking to the same person."
    new "她在说刚才对我说过的话，却没意识到面前已经不是同一个人了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9086
    old "When she reacted coldly to my presence and said she'd found something in the corridor, I thought I had to look at it, so I went to check. During that time, she confirmed that the offices were empty."
    new "她见我出现，反应冷淡，说在走廊里发现了东西。我觉得非得去看看不可，便过去查看。就在那段时间里，她确认了办公室里没有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:9090
    old "I didn't see anything of importance in the corridor because what she had found was the attic door itself. I entered the partitions to demand a further explanation, but she was already talking to the previous me, next to the elevator."
    new "我没在走廊里看到什么要紧的东西，因为她发现的其实就是那扇通往阁楼的门。我走进隔间想再问个明白，她却已经在电梯旁和先前的我说话了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9094
    old "When I left, the two of them had gone around to inspect the door they'd just discovered."
    new "我离开时，她们两人已经绕过去查看刚发现的那扇门了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9099
    old "And later, I spent a few minutes inside the offices of the fifth floor, so I didn't notice Akaro going up or the three of us going down."
    new "后来，我在五楼的办公室里待了几分钟，因此既没注意到 Akaro 上楼，也没注意到我们三人下楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:9102
    old "After a while, I continued looking through every floor until I reached the point I'd traveled from."
    new "又过了一阵，我继续逐层查看，直到走到我穿越而来的那个节点。"

    # game/script.rpy:9104
    old "...Even though I couldn't easily accept such a concept, it neatly explained many things.{w} Was it all a ridiculous coincidence...? A trick, maybe?"
    new "……虽然我无法轻易接受这种说法，但它确实把许多事情解释通了。{w}难道这一切都只是荒唐的巧合……？又或者，是某种把戏？"

    # game/script.rpy:9113
    old "Insulation"
    new "隔音"

    # game/script.rpy:9120
    old "...Do you intend to answer?"
    new "……你打算回答吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:9121
    old "I'd briefly fallen silent. Once I'd thought of the possibility, answers had quickly fallen into place."
    new "我一时沉默了。这个可能性一旦浮上心头，答案便接连归位。"

    # game/script.rpy:9122
    old "Something so outlandish certainly sounded impossible under any normal circumstances, but the simple fact was that it had happened to me. Unless there was another explanation I was missing, there was no choice but to accept it."
    new "如此离奇的事，在平常情况下当然显得不可能，但事实很简单，它偏偏就发生在了我身上。除非还有什么我没想到的解释，否则只能接受。"

    # game/script.rpy:9123
    old "I... don't have a reason to deny that traveling to the past seems to be the most likely answer. Rather, it's the only one."
    new "我……没有理由否认。回到过去似乎就是最可能的答案。不如说，那是唯一的答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:9128
    old "Pathetic. You were accusing me of being a bad liar, Sai?"
    new "可笑。你先前不是还说我连谎都撒不好吗，Sai？"

    # game/script.rpy:9136
    old "If that was truly what had happened, it also meant that Katei had to be the killer."
    new "如果真相确实如此，那也就意味着，凶手只能是 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:9137
    old "The elevator going up was my doing, so there'd been nobody else on the first floor. Nobody had gone to the attic."
    new "电梯是我叫上去的，所以一楼再没有别人。也没有人进过阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:9138
    old "But a line of reasoning that time traveling demolished was another one that it created. That was the can of worms that thinking about possibilities involving time travel opened.{w} After all, I had randomly teleported to hallway A. Someone could've been on the same floor, killed Naomi before we'd thoroughly investigated it, and then traveled through time to an entirely different place."
    new "可时间穿越推翻了一条推论，却又造出了另一条。只要去设想时间穿越的种种可能，就会惹出这堆麻烦。{w} 毕竟，我是随机传送到 A 走廊的。当时也许有人就在同一层，趁我们尚未彻底调查便杀了 Naomi，再穿越到完全不同的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:9139
    old "There was still one thing to keep in mind: the first time the elevator had gone down."
    new "还有一点不能忘记：电梯第一次下行的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:9140
    old "It was possible someone had been in the attic before we'd heard it. They could've gone down with the elevator, killed Naomi, and then traveled to the past, back inside the attic. Thinking about tight possibilities with such uncertain and volatile mechanics was impossible."
    new "也许在我们听见电梯声之前，就已经有人待在阁楼里。那人可以随电梯下去，杀死 Naomi，再穿越回过去，回到阁楼之中。可这种机制既不确定又反复无常，想严密地推敲各种可能性，根本不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:9143
    old "So according to you, his claim is as bad as or worse than yours, but yours were all easily disproven. Can you give an alternative to what Atsuki's saying?"
    new "照你这么说，他的说法和你的一样糟，甚至更糟，可你的说法全都被轻易推翻了。那你能对 Atsuki 的说法提出另一种解释吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:9148
    old "Are you going to tell me that because I don't know how he made it out of this room, he must've time traveled? For the love of God, Sai, and you were trying to act smart?"
    new "你是想告诉我，就因为我不知道他怎么离开这个房间，他就肯定时间穿越了？老天啊，Sai，你还想装聪明？"

    # game/script.rpy:9153
    old "Well, let me tell you something. If Atsuki didn't time travel, he can't be Naomi's killer. If he did, though, it's still an option."
    new "那我来告诉你。如果 Atsuki 没有时间穿越，他就不可能是杀死 Naomi 的凶手；可要是他穿越了，那他仍然有嫌疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:9155
    old "Sai and Shiroya had realized the same thing. I was really there by the time she died."
    new "Sai 和 Shiroya 也想到了同一件事。Naomi 死的时候，我确实就在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:9161
    old "...Okay, it might happen to explain that Katei saw Atsuki here, but it doesn't make it any less insane."
    new "……好吧，这或许正好能解释 Katei 为什么会在这里看见 Atsuki，但这依然一样荒唐。"

    # game/script.rpy:9167
    old "Hm, why not? I think it makes sense."
    new "嗯，为什么不行？我觉得说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:9173
    old "...What? Don't be crazy. We can't use time travel to explain anything..."
    new "……什么？别胡说了。我们不能拿时间穿越来解释任何事……"

    # game/script.rpy:9184
    old "I'd say that's a fair question. By the way, it seems Katei was right about something. The Sekimeiya appears to have broken, right?"
    new "这问题问得倒没错。话说回来，Katei 似乎有件事说对了。Sekimeiya 好像坏了，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:9192
    old "We were all taken aback by that question, but we quickly understood what he meant. It had changed colors to a much less pleasant gray."
    new "这话让我们都愣住了，但很快就明白了他指的是什么。它的颜色变了，变成了一种不怎么讨喜的灰色。"

    # game/script.rpy:9193
    old "See! This is all because it was removed from the cabinet!"
    new "看吧！这都是因为把它从展示柜里拿出来了！"

    # game/script.rpy:9194
    old "Are you sure? It was still white when I saw it."
    new "你确定？我看到它的时候，它还是白色的。"

    # game/script.rpy:9195
    old "Go ahead and prove that. Did you put it there and just want to avoid facing the consequences?"
    new "那你证明啊。是不是你把它放回去的，现在只想逃避后果？"

    # game/script.rpy:9201
    old "Shut up. God.{w} This is what Atsuki asked about earlier. It's a function to regulate the cabinet's temperature, is it not?"
    new "闭嘴。天哪。{w} Atsuki 之前问的就是这个。那是用来调节展示柜温度的功能，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:9206
    old "Yes, but it's set to room temperature."
    new "没错，不过它设定的是室温。"

    # game/script.rpy:9211
    old "It's slightly damaged, though. And let's think: out of all of us, who would hide the Sekimeiya in a place that has a cold temperature function?"
    new "可它有点损坏了。再说了，我们这些人里，谁会特意把 Sekimeiya 藏在一个带制冷功能的地方？"

    # game/script.rpy:9216
    old "...Even when I'm proven innocent, you still insist on suspecting me."
    new "……就算证明了我的清白，你还是非要怀疑我。"

    # game/script.rpy:9217
    old "This guy was scared out of his mind at his bosses, remember? He would be dumb enough to hide the Sekimeiya here after he told us that story."
    new "这家伙被上司吓得魂都没了，记得吧？他跟我们讲完那件事以后，完全可能蠢到把 Sekimeiya 藏在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:9218
    old "Do I have to repeat it? The cold function wasn't activated."
    new "还要我重复一遍吗？制冷功能根本没有启动。"

    # game/script.rpy:9223
    old "Who cares about that? It was still hidden here of all places. You'd also be the only one to know about the function of the cabinets, right?"
    new "那又怎样？它到底还是被藏在了这种地方。再说，知道展示柜功能的人也只有你，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:9228
    old "What? Didn't Atsuki notice it too? That's why he appeared intrigued by this cabinet while he was being accused, acting as if he'd found the Sekimeiya he hid. I bet he put it here to frame me after I explained the cold rule."
    new "什么？Atsuki 不也注意到了吗？所以他在被指责时才对这个展示柜表现出兴趣，像是找到了自己藏起来的 Sekimeiya。我敢说，他就是在听我解释完制冷规则后把它放进去，好栽赃我。"

    # game/script.rpy:9229
    old "...That's not at all what happened, and the cameras will eventually prove it."
    new "……根本不是这么回事，监控迟早会证明的。"

    # game/script.rpy:9236
    old "I'm sure they will. For now, let's hurry up and put this thing where it belongs. Just in case it's not too late."
    new "我相信会的。现在先赶紧把这东西放回该放的地方，免得来不及。"

    # game/script.rpy:9237
    old "Yeah, sure. We can try that."
    new "嗯，行。试试也无妨。"

    # game/script.rpy:9241
    old "Holding the Sekimeiya in his hands, Sai closed the cabinet, which made a metallic sound as if it had locked automatically. Then, he left the room followed by Katei.{w} Shiroya was still unsure of what to say, and Akaro and Erina both looked at me with uncertainty."
    new "Sai 双手捧着 Sekimeiya，合上了展示柜。柜子发出金属声响，像是自动锁上了。随后他离开了房间，Katei 跟在后面。{w} Shiroya 仍不知道该说什么，Akaro 和 Erina 都带着不安看向我。"

    # game/script.rpy:9248
    old "We were in front of the event room. I squeezed my eyes shut and rubbed at the bridge of my nose, remembering that someone in the building had actually died. Things were moving too fast. A death, moving through time after touching a gem...{w} But it would have been even more dangerous to stop thinking. Before I entered the room, I realized that something else went against the theory that Katei hadn't killed Naomi."
    new "我们站在活动室前。我闭上眼，揉了揉鼻梁，想起这栋楼里真的有人死了。事情发生得太快。一桩命案，一次触碰宝石后的穿越……{w} 可要是就此停下思考，只会更危险。进房间之前，我意识到还有一点与「Katei 没有杀 Naomi」的推论相悖。"

    # game/script.rpy:9249
    old "Sai was holding the Sekimeiya with his hands. However, I recalled feeling a painful burn on my fingers during the split second before I'd disappeared from the room."
    new "Sai 是亲手拿着 Sekimeiya 的。可我记得，在我从房间里消失的前一瞬，指尖曾传来灼痛。"

    # game/script.rpy:9250
    old "At that moment, the Sekimeiya was glowing white, so if that was still the same object, it meant it had changed colors as soon as I'd traveled. In other words, it had powered off."
    new "那时 Sekimeiya 正发着白光。如果那还是同一件东西，就说明它在我穿越的同时变了颜色。换句话说，它已经停止运转。"

    # game/script.rpy:9251
    old "So, if anyone had consciously vanished from the first floor after killing Naomi, it should've powered off just like it did when I'd been the one to travel."
    new "所以，如果有人杀了 Naomi 后有意从一楼消失，它也应该像我穿越时那样停止运转。"

    # game/script.rpy:9252
    old "I couldn't know how it worked, but the fact that I'd seen it glowing might've indicated that nobody had traveled before me—that Katei was the only suspect.{w} In addition, the Sekimeiya had been inside a locked cabinet. To travel and leave it inside, the culprit must've had to shut themselves inside it and then touch the Sekimeiya..."
    new "我不知道它的原理，但我看见它发光这件事，或许说明在我之前没有人穿越过——Katei 是唯一的嫌疑人。{w} 此外，Sekimeiya 原本锁在展示柜里。凶手若要穿越后还把它留在柜中，就只能把自己关进展示柜，再触碰 Sekimeiya……"

    # game/script.rpy:9260
    old "There was another problem, though. I didn't think about it until we'd all entered the room.{w} \"Touching the Sekimeiya made me travel to the past\". Ignoring how an item with such an obvious power could've made it to a place where they'd let us touch it, something directly contradicted its powers."
    new "不过，还有另一个问题。直到我们全都进了房间，我才想到。{w}「触碰 Sekimeiya 让我穿越到了过去」。先不论一件拥有如此明显力量的物品怎么会落到允许我们触碰它的地方，有一点直接与它的力量相矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:9261
    old "Earlier, Isla had touched it inside its cabinet, and so had Shiroya. Following that, Sai even took it out of the cabinet while holding it with his hands, and none of them teleported at all."
    new "先前，Isla 曾在展示柜里碰过它，Shiroya 也是。之后，Sai 甚至亲手把它从展示柜里取了出来，可他们谁都没有传送。"

    # game/script.rpy:9262
    old "Was I the difference? Since I hadn't touched it back then, I couldn't discern whether the differing factor was the person to touch it or something about the Sekimeiya itself."
    new "难道差别出在我身上？那时我没有碰过它，所以无法判断，造成差异的究竟是触碰它的人，还是 Sekimeiya 本身。"

    # game/script.rpy:9263
    old "Maybe it wasn't actually powered off. It could be that Sai couldn't travel."
    new "也许它并没有真的停止运转。也可能只是 Sai 无法穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:9267
    old "Can I touch it again?"
    new "我能再碰它一次吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:9272
    old "Of course. Have at it."
    new "当然。随你。"

    # game/script.rpy:9273
    old "He handed me the gray gemstone.{w} I felt no burn, and I remained where I was. However, I was able to appreciate the smooth surface of the Sekimeiya, which definitely hadn't disappeared with its beautiful white."
    new "他把那颗灰色宝石递给我。{w} 我没有感到灼痛，也没有离开原地。不过，我还能摸到 Sekimeiya 光滑的表面——它并没有连同那片漂亮的白色一起消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:9274
    old "...Hm."
    new "……嗯。"

    # game/script.rpy:9279
    old "You're putting on such a pathetic show. You should know that."
    new "你这场戏演得真够难看，自己心里该有数。"

    # game/script.rpy:9280
    old "You're beginning to get on my nerves. I know how crazy I sound, but if anyone's been putting on a pathetic show from the start, it's been you."
    new "你越来越让我烦了。我知道自己听起来有多荒唐，可要说从一开始就在演一出难看的戏，那个人是你。"

    # game/script.rpy:9281
    old "Oh, he caught you."
    new "噢，被他戳穿了吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:9286
    old "This is unbelievable. Put it in the cabinet already."
    new "真是难以置信。快把它放回展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:9297
    old "I didn't want to argue further, so I opened the glass covering and placed it inside. The colder temperature became easily noticeable as I left it on top of the cushion."
    new "我不想再争下去，便打开玻璃罩，把它放了进去。我把它放到垫子上时，能明显感到里面更冷。"

    # game/script.rpy:9300
    old "Then I closed it again, and everyone remained staring at the mysterious source of the day's incident."
    new "随后我又合上玻璃罩，所有人仍盯着今天这场事件的神秘源头。"

    # game/script.rpy:9310
    old "...What? Did it change back?"
    new "……什么？它变回去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:9315
    old "It did...?"
    new "真的变回去了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:9320
    old "Yes! It's white!"
    new "对！是白色的！"

    # game/script.rpy:9326
    old "We all saw it firsthand. A couple seconds after I put the Sekimeiya in the cabinet, it regained its old white glow."
    new "我们全都亲眼看见了。我把 Sekimeiya 放进展示柜后不过几秒，它就重新泛起了原先那种白光。"

    # game/script.rpy:9331
    old "That's interesting. The temperature brought it back."
    new "有意思。是温度让它恢复的。"

    # game/script.rpy:9336
    old "That's it, then. We must not take it out of here until the front door opens. It's clear that will bring us a bunch of issues with Ashiya."
    new "那就这么定了。前门打开之前，不能把它带出这里。否则显然会给我们和芦屋惹来一堆麻烦。"

    # game/script.rpy:9341
    old "Katei, this thing made Atsuki travel through time. Can you shut up for a second about goddamn Ashiya?"
    new "Katei，这东西让 Atsuki 穿越了时间。你能不能先闭嘴，别再提该死的芦屋？"

    # game/script.rpy:9342
    old "You were right. The cold fixed it, so isn't it strange? According to your story from earlier, the original discoverer of the Sekimeiya realized the cold was needed."
    new "你说对了。低温把它修好了，这不奇怪吗？按你刚才的说法，Sekimeiya 最初的发现者早就知道需要低温。"

    # game/script.rpy:9343
    old "If this can send you to the past, they must've certainly touched and tried all sorts of things to keep it stable. Could they have not noticed its power?"
    new "如果这东西能把你送回过去，他们为了让它保持稳定，肯定碰过它，也试过各种办法。他们怎么可能没发现它的力量？"

    # game/script.rpy:9348
    old "What power!? Kid, this thing will not send you to the past! Something like that is impossible!"
    new "什么力量！？小鬼，这东西不会把你送回过去！那种事根本不可能！"

    # game/script.rpy:9355
    old "Didn't we touch it earlier? Isla definitely held it, and nothing happened to her."
    new "我们之前不是碰过它吗？Isla 明明拿过它，也没出什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:9362
    old "That's true... Why didn't it make me go anywhere?"
    new "对啊……为什么我没被送到别处去？"

    # game/script.rpy:9363
    old "Because it's just a gemstone!"
    new "因为它只是块宝石！"

    # game/script.rpy:9372
    old "Well, it appears to have fixed itself. Shall we test it?"
    new "看来它自己好了。要不要试一下？"

    # game/script.rpy:9377
    old "I'm beginning to wonder if you process any of what I say. We're not taking this out of here again."
    new "我开始怀疑你到底有没有听进去我的话。我们不会再把它带出去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9382
    old "Okay. Sure thing."
    new "好。当然。"

    # game/script.rpy:9383
    old "Sai's insincere reply left us with a few seconds of silence. Erina was the one to break it."
    new "Sai 这句毫无诚意的回答让场面静了几秒。最后是 Erina 打破了沉默。"

    # game/script.rpy:9388
    old "...Isn't that a lock?"
    new "……那不是锁吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:9397
    old "I tilted my head to look at where Erina was pointing. Under the keyhole, on the left side of the cabinet, there was a small arrow directed to the word \"unlocked\", with \"locked\" being right under it."
    new "我偏过头，顺着 Erina 手指的方向看去。展示柜左侧的钥匙孔下方，有一个小箭头指向「unlocked」，正下方则是「locked」。"

    # game/script.rpy:9402
    old "That's just indicating the status of the cabinet, right?"
    new "那只是在显示展示柜的状态吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:9404
    old "With a finger, I rotated the dial. It didn't appear to move at first, but as soon as I applied a bit of pressure, it gave out and locked itself into place with a click."
    new "我用一根手指转动旋钮。起初它似乎纹丝不动，可我稍一用力，它便松动了，咔哒一声锁到位。"

    # game/script.rpy:9405
    old "...Did that do it?"
    new "……这样就成了？"

    # game/script.rpy:9406
    old "Sai, next to the glass, tried to scroll it down."
    new "Sai 在玻璃旁，试着把玻璃向下滑。"

    # game/script.rpy:9412
    old "...I think so. I did hear a sound coming from here."
    new "……应该是。我确实听见这边响了一声。"

    # game/script.rpy:9413
    old "I attempted to set it back to \"unlocked\", but it was impossible."
    new "我试着把它拨回「unlocked」，却怎么也拨不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:9419
    old "You must actually need the key for that."
    new "看来要解锁，还是得用钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:9424
    old "So we can lock it manually but not unlock it again. That's almost fair."
    new "也就是说，我们可以手动上锁，却不能再解锁。倒还算公道。"

    # game/script.rpy:9427
    old "Katei, you work here, right? Did you not know about this mechanism with how much you've insisted to keep the Sekimeiya inside?"
    new "Katei，你在这里工作吧？你一直那么坚持要把 Sekimeiya 留在里面，难道不知道有这个机关？"

    # game/script.rpy:9433
    old "...I didn't. It seems changes were made to this cabinet, as the others don't possess this function."
    new "……不知道。看来这个展示柜被人改动过，其他展示柜并没有这种功能。"

    # game/script.rpy:9438
    old "Well, congratulations. You did it. Now we'll have to keep it here for the remainder of the day. Ashiya will be pleased."
    new "好吧，恭喜。你如愿了。今天剩下的时间，我们都得把它留在这里。芦屋会很高兴的。"

    # game/script.rpy:9439
    old "Since we'd evidently not looked through the cabinet well enough, I inspected it further. Shortly, I noticed something else."
    new "显然我们之前没把展示柜检查得够仔细，于是我又细看了一遍。很快，我注意到了另一样东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:9445
    old "There's an outlet behind it, and the cabinet's connected to it."
    new "它后面有个插座，展示柜正接在上面。"

    # game/script.rpy:9446
    old "Of course. It's needed for the temperature regulation. Every cabinet with that function has to be connected to a power supply."
    new "当然。温度调节需要用电。每个具备这种功能的展示柜都必须接电源。"

    # game/script.rpy:9447
    old "I s—{w=0.3}{nw}"
    new "我正——{w=0.3}{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:9454
    old "It had already happened a few times, but once again, the immediate shock of hearing something we couldn't have heard infested the room. From outside, we all distinctly heard the sound of a door closing."
    new "这种事已经发生过几次，可这一次，听见本不可能听见的声音，那股瞬间的冲击又一次笼罩了整个房间。我们所有人都清楚地听见外面传来一声关门声。"

    # game/script.rpy:9459
    old "...That was a door, right?"
    new "……刚才是门吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:9467
    old "Shit, there's actually someone else here!"
    new "该死，这里竟然真的还有别人！"

    # game/script.rpy:9473
    old "We all hurried to open the right door, but we were stopped by Sai."
    new "我们急忙去开右边的门，却被 Sai 拦住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9478
    old "What are you doing? Someone look at hallway A too!{w} The staircase is there, so we can't all leave from here."
    new "你们在干什么？也得有人去 A走廊看看！{w}楼梯在那边，不能所有人都从这里离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:9485
    old "Sai, Shiroya, and Akaro exited through the right door since they'd been next to it. I'd been to the left of the cabinet, so I went with the others through the left door."
    new "Sai、Shiroya 和 Akaro 原本就在右门附近，便从那里出去了。我站在展示柜左侧，就和其他人一起从左门出去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9495
    old "As usual, hallway A appeared empty. We'd continuously done the same thing, but it seemed we had to search it one more time. ...Was it really possible a hidden culprit had remained unspotted for that long? The question had already come back."
    new "A走廊一如往常，看上去空无一人。同样的事我们已经做过一遍又一遍，可看来还是得再搜一次。……那个躲在暗处的人，真有可能这么久都没被发现吗？这个疑问又浮了上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:9496
    old "Looking through the whole tower left me exhausted, so I moved to the lobby door to make sure nobody was there and to keep watching the hallway."
    new "把整座塔搜下来让我筋疲力尽，于是我走到大厅门口，确认那里没人，同时继续盯着走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:9501
    old "The atmosphere continuously shifted in the span of a few seconds. After looking at the empty hallway C, Erina and Isla entered every room together while Katei checked through some others to speed up the process. My position guaranteed that nobody could come out of a room while the others were busy inspecting them."
    new "短短几秒间，气氛几度变化。看过空无一人的 C走廊后，Erina 和 Isla 结伴逐个进入房间，Katei 则去检查另外几间，好加快进度。我守的位置正好能保证，其他人在房里搜查时，不会有人从房间里出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:9502
    old "I sighed deeply. If nothing was found in either of the two hallways, would we have to move upward once again and look through every floor? The door we'd heard couldn't have closed on its own."
    new "我深深叹了口气。如果两条走廊都没找到什么，我们难道还得再往上走，把每一层都搜一遍？我们听见的那扇门，不可能自己关上。"

    # game/script.rpy:9503
    old "Surprisingly, the others were taking a while with every room, as they knew that they all contained cabinets with empty interiors big enough to fit a person. While I stared ahead, I realized that making such an obvious sound seemed to defy the persistent stealth of the culprit."
    new "出乎意料的是，其他人每查一间房都要花上不少时间，因为他们知道，每间房里都有展示柜，柜内空得足以藏下一个人。我盯着前方，忽然觉得，弄出这么明显的声响，与那人一直以来的悄无声息实在不符。"

    # game/script.rpy:9505
    old "About ten minutes later, the search in our hallway concluded. I could hear that Isla, who was still holding up surprisingly well, had slowed them down, constantly asking to stay with the gems for longer. My group came to me and reported the result I'd already seen. The mechanical room still remained unchecked, so since I'd stayed put, I told them to make sure nobody appeared in the hallway while I went to inspect it myself."
    new "大约十分钟后，我们这边的走廊搜完了。我能听出来，Isla 虽然仍出奇地撑得住，却一再要求多看看宝石，拖慢了他们的进度。我这边的人走过来，把我已经看到的结果告诉了我。机械室还没查，因为我一直守在原地，便让他们盯紧走廊，确保没人出现，由我亲自去查看。"

    # game/script.rpy:9510
    old "On the way, I looked at the few drawers the reception desk had, which were only filled with papers."
    new "路上，我拉开接待台的几个抽屉看了看，里面只有文件。"

    # game/script.rpy:9515
    old "Downstairs, I was reminded of the fact that such an off-putting place existed on that same floor. Being alone there was much different from the time I'd looked through it with Sai, and when I considered that I was searching for a hidden culprit that could easily catch me off guard, tension constricted my body once more."
    new "到了楼下，我才重新想起这一层还有那么一个令人发怵的地方。独自待在那里，和上次与 Sai 一同查看时截然不同；一想到自己是在找一个随时可能趁我不备的藏匿者，紧张感又一次攫紧了我的身体。"

    # game/script.rpy:9519
    old "Fortunately, it wasn't a big space, so confirming it was empty was easy. I went back up to see my group where I'd left them, and I saw that the others were by the end of hallway B."
    new "幸好空间不大，确认里面没人并不难。我返回楼上，回到同伴们等候的地方，看见另一组人已经聚在 B走廊尽头。"

    # game/script.rpy:9523
    old "I approached my group first. Erina told me that nothing had happened in hallway A, so we regrouped in C."
    new "我先走到自己这组人身边。Erina 告诉我 A走廊没有异样，于是我们便在 C走廊会合。"

    # game/script.rpy:9532
    old "Nothing, huh?"
    new "什么都没有，是吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:9537
    old "Yeah, the rooms were all empty."
    new "对，所有房间都是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:9542
    old "...So, if a person made the noise, they must be above us right now."
    new "……这么说，如果那声响真是人弄出来的，那他现在一定在我们楼上。"

    # game/script.rpy:9548
    old "Someone watched your hallway to make sure it was always being observed, right?"
    new "有人一直守着你们的走廊，确保那里始终有人盯着，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:9553
    old "Yes, Sai did. We also checked the bathrooms once we were done."
    new "是，Sai 守的。查完之后，我们也把洗手间查了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:9558
    old "Who remained outside in yours?"
    new "你们那边留在外面的是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:9559
    old "It was Atsuki."
    new "是 Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:9564
    old "Oh, my friend Atsuki? That's good.{w} Say, did Katei look at any room all by himself?"
    new "哦，是我的朋友 Atsuki 啊？那就好。{w}对了，有没有哪间房是 Katei 一个人查的？"

    # game/script.rpy:9570
    old "I did. Are you implying that perhaps I ignored something on purpose?"
    new "是我查的。你是在暗示，我可能故意漏掉了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:9571
    old "Yup. Stay here. Sorry for slowing the process down, but I can't just take his word for it."
    new "没错。你留在这儿。抱歉拖慢了进度，不过光凭他一句话，我可不能就这么信了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9579
    old "Sai stepped into hallway A. He didn't ask for the rooms Katei had entered and simply went ahead with looking through all of them."
    new "Sai 走进了 A走廊。他没有问 Katei 查过哪几间，只是径直把每一间都看了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:9580
    old "I couldn't blame him for suspecting Katei, and the rest of us felt the same: there was no complaint besides Katei's outraged look."
    new "他怀疑 Katei，我怪不着他，其他人也是一样的心思：除了 Katei 一脸愤慨，谁也没有异议。"

    # game/script.rpy:9581
    old "After the smoky crystal room, Sai entered the storeroom. We expected him to silently move on to the next one again, but once he exited it, he directed his look at us and showed what he had between his hands."
    new "查过那间烟雾弥漫的水晶展室后，Sai 走进了储藏室。我们以为他还会一言不发地转去下一间，可他一出来，目光便投向我们，亮出了手里的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:9582
    old "Upon processing the sight, we ran to him in a daze."
    new "看清那东西的瞬间，我们恍恍惚惚地朝他跑了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:9591
    old "What...? Was it in the storeroom?"
    new "什么……？在储藏室里？"

    # game/script.rpy:9597
    old "Held in Sai's hands was the Sekimeiya. It was white, as being touched hadn't changed its color at all."
    new "Sai 手里拿着的正是 Sekimeiya。它是白色的——被触碰过，颜色却丝毫没有改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:9604
    old "Yes. I found it hidden behind the sofa."
    new "没错。它就藏在沙发后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:9605
    old "Without warning, he moved the object to make contact with my skin. It scared me a bit, but nothing happened."
    new "他毫无预兆地把那东西贴上我的皮肤。我吓了一跳，却什么也没发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:9610
    old "So it's not working now."
    new "看来它现在不起作用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9615
    old "Anyway, Katei, did you look through this room?"
    new "总之，Katei，这间房你查过吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:9626
    old "Not only that, but it was the first one he entered."
    new "不止查过，这还是他第一个进去的房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:9627
    old "That's true, I remember."
    new "没错，我记得。"

    # game/script.rpy:9628
    old "But that's because it's the farthest room from this side. I was looking for a person, so I didn't look behind the sofa."
    new "那是因为那间房离这边最远。我要找的是人，就没去看沙发后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:9630
    old "What a convenient excuse."
    new "这借口找得倒轻巧。"

    # game/script.rpy:9635
    old "Do you actually think I hid it? I couldn't have done that. We locked the cabinet."
    new "你真觉得是我藏的？我根本做不到。展示柜是我们锁上的。"

    # game/script.rpy:9640
    old "Atsuki, was Katei the last person to exit the event room? He might've had a key."
    new "Atsuki，最后一个离开活动室的是 Katei 吗？他手里可能有一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:9641
    old "I don't know, but we all left very fast. I don't think he could've had the time."
    new "我不清楚，不过我们走得都很快。我觉得他来不及。"

    # game/script.rpy:9646
    old "Someone stay here. This floor is definitely empty, but we need to check the event room while making sure that nobody can move between the floors."
    new "留几个人守在这里。这层楼肯定是空的，但我们要去查活动室，同时还得保证没人能在楼层之间来回。"

    # game/script.rpy:9651
    old "All right. We'll stay behind."
    new "好。我们留下。"

    # game/script.rpy:9656
    old "Can't we go too...?"
    new "我们不能一起去吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:9657
    old "Isla, enough. You all can go."
    new "Isla，别闹了。你们都去吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:9658
    old "Let's see what happened."
    new "去看看究竟是怎么回事吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:9662
    old "Erina and Isla stayed where they were. That was the safest option up until that point, but as things were, staying in an uncertain spot such as the stairs was more dangerous than moving through an empty floor. It was something Erina must not have realized, but her demeanor was clear: she wasn't leaving Isla alone.{w} Nonetheless, the rest of us agreed and entered the event room once again."
    new "Erina 和 Isla 留在了原地。在此之前，这算是最稳妥的选择，可照眼下的情形，守在一处像楼梯这样情况不明的地方，反倒比穿过空荡的楼层更危险。Erina 大概没意识到这一点，但她的态度很明白：她不会把 Isla 一个人留下。{w} 尽管如此，其余的人还是达成一致，再次走进了活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:9680
    old "I-It's really not here. How's that possible?"
    new "真、真的不在了。这怎么可能？"

    # game/script.rpy:9681
    old "Raising the curtain revealed that the Sekimeiya we'd left there a few minutes ago was gone."
    new "掀开遮布，几分钟前我们放在那里的 Sekimeiya 已经不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9682
    old "It shouldn't be, right? We made sure nobody was in the two hallways."
    new "不该这样吧？我们明明确认过两条走廊里都没人。"

    # game/script.rpy:9687
    old "That's why I said that the last person to exit must've already had it."
    new "所以我才说，最后一个离开的人早就把它拿走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9688
    old "Look. It's unlocked."
    new "你看，锁开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9689
    old "Of course it is. Katei must have a key."
    new "当然开着。Katei 手上一定有钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:9694
    old "...I already said that I don't have it. There's no way I could've unlocked this cabinet."
    new "……我说过了，钥匙不在我手里。我不可能打开这个展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:9699
    old "Could he even have unlocked it if he had it? Did he enter this room again?"
    new "就算他有钥匙，他有机会打开吗？他后来又进过这间房吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:9700
    old "Not that I saw. When they were done, I went to the mechanical room, so he might've had his chance then. Erina would've brought it up, though."
    new "我没看见。他们查完之后，我去了机械室，他要是有机会，也只能是那时候。不过真要有这回事，Erina 会说的。"

    # game/script.rpy:9705
    old "I see, so he had an opportunity."
    new "原来如此，那他确实有机会。"

    # game/script.rpy:9710
    old "But there's no way he did that, right? Our group was done quickly, so we could've appeared at any moment. And Erina would've had to keep this from us."
    new "可他不可能那么做吧？我们那组查得很快，随时都可能出现。再说，那也得 Erina 替他瞒着我们才行。"

    # game/script.rpy:9715
    old "It's amusing to see that now you have to resort to this to keep suspecting me. Erina wouldn't lie to you."
    new "真是可笑，为了继续怀疑我，你们已经沦落到要靠这种猜想了。Erina 不会对你们说谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:9720
    old "Weren't we all liars a second ago? And what else makes sense? Did it disappear magically?"
    new "刚才不是还说我们个个都在撒谎吗？那除此之外还有什么说得通？难不成它是凭空消失的？"

    # game/script.rpy:9721
    old "Well... It made me teleport. Would it be that crazy to think that maybe it did?"
    new "唔……毕竟它让我传送过。要说它自己也传送走了，也不算太离谱吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:9726
    old "And it unlocked the cabinet too, right? Did the fucking Sekimeiya send the cabinet to the past to when it wasn't locked and just stroll on out of it?"
    new "还顺手把展示柜打开了，是吧？难道这该死的 Sekimeiya 把展示柜送回它还没上锁的过去，然后自己溜达出来了？"

    # game/script.rpy:9731
    old "I didn't discard the possibility of you traveling to the past purely because nothing else explained what happened. This has a simple explanation: Katei did it."
    new "我之前没排除你们穿越到过去的可能，纯粹是因为别的说法都解释不通。这事解释起来很简单：就是 Katei 干的。"

    # game/script.rpy:9732
    old "I know that you think he didn't have the time, but I don't care about that. I left this room when he was inside, so for all I know, he could've easily done it, even if all of you are lying."
    new "我知道你们觉得他来不及，可我不在乎。我离开这间房的时候他还在里面，所以我觉得他完全可能轻松办到——哪怕你们全都在撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:9733
    old "Well, you're free to think that. I highly doubt it, though."
    new "随你怎么想。不过我对此很怀疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:9738
    old "It seems that your reasoning has stopped being so influenced by Sai. That's good, Atsuki."
    new "看来你的判断已经不再那么受 Sai 左右了。这是好事，Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:9739
    old "Now put the Sekimeiya in the cabinet at once. It hasn't changed colors yet."
    new "现在立刻把 Sekimeiya 放回展示柜。它还没变色。"

    # game/script.rpy:9740
    old "Fine. There you go."
    new "好吧，放进去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9749
    old "Sai put it in the cabinet and closed the glass. It was a slightly funny sight after hearing him say that we wouldn't take it out again."
    new "Sai 把它放进展示柜，合上了玻璃门。他刚说过不会再把它取出来，眼前这一幕便显得有些滑稽。"

    # game/script.rpy:9757
    old "Do we lock it?"
    new "要上锁吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:9758
    old "Why would we? Katei will be able to keep getting it out."
    new "何必上锁？Katei 照样能把它拿出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:9763
    old "You can watch everything I do if you so desire. I will never get the Sekimeiya out of here."
    new "你愿意的话，尽管盯着我的一举一动。我绝不会把 Sekimeiya 从这里拿出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:9764
    old "You said that Naomi had the only key to open this cabinet, right?"
    new "你说过，能打开这个展示柜的钥匙只有 Naomi 那一把，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:9765
    old "The only one I'm aware of, yes."
    new "据我所知，只有那一把。"

    # game/script.rpy:9770
    old "But she's... The culprit must have her key."
    new "可她人已经……钥匙一定落到了犯人手里。"

    # game/script.rpy:9775
    old "We saw her unlocking the cabinet before the smoke appeared. If the culprit didn't take it, could anyone have picked it up from her dead body?"
    new "烟雾出现前，我们看见她打开了展示柜。如果犯人没有拿走钥匙，那会不会有人从她尸体上把它捡走了？"

    # game/script.rpy:9780
    old "Sai checked her pulse, isn't that right?"
    new "是 Sai 探的脉搏，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:9785
    old "I did. Why, are you concerned that she had a key up by her neck?"
    new "是我。怎么，你担心她脖子上挂了把钥匙？"

    # game/script.rpy:9790
    old "No, but only you approached her."
    new "不。但靠近过她的只有你。"

    # game/script.rpy:9793
    old "That was after you killed her, though. It sounds to me like you had a much better opportunity."
    new "可那是在你杀了她之后。照我看，你的机会比我大得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:9794
    old "...Sai couldn't have picked it up. I was paying attention."
    new "……Sai 不可能捡走它。我一直留意着。"

    # game/script.rpy:9799
    old "Thank God someone's competent enough. Nobody else checked her corpse after that, so the key must've already been gone."
    new "谢天谢地，总算还有个靠得住的。那之后没人再查看过她的尸体，所以钥匙肯定早就不在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9804
    old "Why don't we go see if we can find it?"
    new "不如我们去看看能不能找到？"

    # game/script.rpy:9812
    old "Sai opened the hallway A door to indicate to Erina and Isla that we'd go check the other hallway."
    new "Sai 打开 A走廊的门，向 Erina 和 Isla 示意我们要去查看另一条走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:9817
    old "They're still there, so let's go see if we find the key."
    new "他们还在那边，我们过去看看能不能找到钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:9832
    old "Opposite to the event room in hallway B was the room where we'd found Naomi—B4. The last time, we hadn't searched her body."
    new "B走廊里，活动室的正对面就是我们发现 Naomi 的房间——B4。上一次，我们没有搜过她的尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:9839
    old "Who wants to look for it? I'd do it, but I don't wanna be suspected even more."
    new "谁愿意去找？我可以去，但我不想再被多怀疑一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:9840
    old "Nobody volunteered. Being close to a corpse was already enough for us."
    new "没人愿意动手。光是靠近一具尸体，就已经够我们受了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9845
    old "Fine. I'll do it, but if I find it, don't suggest that I could've skillfully placed it in one of her pockets."
    new "行，我来。但要是我真找到了，可别又说是我手法高明，自己塞进她口袋里的。"

    # game/script.rpy:9850
    old "Go ahead already."
    new "那就快点。"

    # game/script.rpy:9853
    old "Sai started feeling every pocket of Naomi's clothes. It didn't take long for him to find something."
    new "Sai 开始逐个摸 Naomi 衣服上的口袋。没多久，他就摸到了东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:9858
    old "Here, these are keys."
    new "喏，是钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:9863
    old "Yeah, this is the pocket where she had the cabinet key."
    new "没错，她原来放展示柜钥匙的就是这个口袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:9867
    old "Sai was holding a keyring containing three keys: two big ones and a small one."
    new "Sai 手里拿着一串钥匙，上面挂着三把：两把大的，一把小的。"

    # game/script.rpy:9872
    old "It's none of those. They wouldn't fit."
    new "哪一把都不是。插不进去的。"

    # game/script.rpy:9877
    old "Yeah, that's what I thought. Do you know what these three open?"
    new "我也这么觉得。你知道这三把是开什么的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:9882
    old "That one opens the door in the floor 2 staircase. I don't know about the other two, though."
    new "这一把开的是二楼楼梯间的门。另外两把我就不知道了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9888
    old "So she doesn't have the key for the cabinet?"
    new "这么说，她身上没有展示柜的钥匙？"

    # game/script.rpy:9889
    old "Let me keep looking."
    new "我再找找。"

    # game/script.rpy:9894
    old "Sai searched through the remaining pockets, but they were all empty."
    new "Sai 又把剩下的口袋翻了一遍，里面全是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:9900
    old "It seems not. Her killer took the cabinet key after killing her, and we know who that was."
    new "看来是没有。凶手杀了她之后拿走了展示柜的钥匙，而那个人是谁，我们都知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:9905
    old "Katei looked at me while everyone else looked at him."
    new "Katei 看向我，其余人的目光却都落在他身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:9906
    old "Don't try it again, Katei. You must have killed Naomi and then unlocked the cabinet with her key. You've proven yourself to be quite stupid a few times, so you must've hidden the Sekimeiya in a room you looked through hoping we'd ignore it."
    new "别再耍这种把戏了，Katei。一定是你杀了 Naomi，然后用她的钥匙打开了展示柜。你已经不止一次证明自己有多蠢，所以你肯定把 Sekimeiya 藏在了自己检查过的某个房间里，指望我们不会去搜。"

    # game/script.rpy:9911
    old "That's ridiculous. I'd have no reason to do that, let alone the time. It's baffling how you don't realize only Atsuki could've done this."
    new "荒唐。我既没有理由那么做，也没有那个时间。真不明白你怎么会看不出来，能做到这件事的只有 Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:9912
    old "...What now?"
    new "……又怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:9917
    old "You killed Naomi, so naturally, you got your hands on her key. Then, while you were looking at hallway A from the lobby, you went to the event room. You unlocked the cabinet and left the Sekimeiya in a room I had searched in order to frame me. There's no other way."
    new "你杀了 Naomi，自然就拿到了她的钥匙。然后，你在大厅里盯着 A走廊的时候，去了活动室。你打开展示柜，把 Sekimeiya 藏进我搜过的房间，好嫁祸给我。除此之外别无可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:9923
    old "Don't you know how risky that'd be? He could've been seen at any time."
    new "你难道不清楚那有多冒险？他随时都可能被人看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:9928
    old "Likewise, if you intend to blame me, you're implying I took the same risk."
    new "同样，你若想把罪名安到我头上，就等于说我也冒了同样的风险。"

    # game/script.rpy:9933
    old "The difference is that Atsuki had a reason to move it: to frame me. If his plan succeeded, I would've been the main culprit. However, by hiding it, I wouldn't gain anything."
    new "区别在于，Atsuki 有动机去转移它：为了嫁祸我。他的计划若成功，我就会成为头号嫌疑人。而我把东西藏起来，却什么也得不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:9938
    old "Neither of your motives are enough, and Atsuki would've been more likely to be seen with the Sekimeiya. You're not going to convince anyone."
    new "你们俩的动机都站不住脚，而且 Atsuki 拿着 Sekimeiya 更容易被人撞见。你这些话，说服不了任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:9939
    old "Why don't we do a thorough search, then? Let's search each other to see who has the key."
    new "那不如彻底搜一遍？大家互相搜身，看看钥匙在谁身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:9940
    old "Of course not. Nobody would be dumb enough to keep it on themselves. I bet you already disposed of it in another one of the rooms you inspected."
    new "当然不会。没人会蠢到把钥匙带在身上。我敢打赌，你早就把它丢在你检查过的另一个房间里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9941
    old "Even though he said that, I still showed my empty pockets."
    new "他虽这么说，我还是把空口袋翻出来给大家看。"

    # game/script.rpy:9946
    old "Atsuki doesn't have a motive. Please, stop accusing him... There's so much blood, so this is where everything happened, and to do this to someone in front of a camera... You'd need to have a real reason for it.{w} We need to find the person who did this to Naomi. They made that noise earlier...{w} L-Look at Naomi's face. She must've been terrified, and being afraid of this happening might even be why she hid from us."
    new "Atsuki 没有动机，请你别再怀疑他了……这里血这么多，说明一切就发生在这儿；而且还是在镜头前对人下这种狠手……没有充分的理由，谁做得出来。{w}我们得找到对 Naomi 下手的凶手。刚才那阵动静就是那个人弄出来的……{w}你、你看 Naomi 的脸。她当时一定怕极了；也许正因为害怕会遭这种事，她才一直躲着我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:9947
    old "You said that, right, Akaro? That she looked preoccupied when she appeared. She didn't do anything, and the real person responsible took her life."
    new "Akaro，你刚才是这么说的吧？她现身的时候，看上去心事重重。她什么都没做，是真正的凶手夺走了她的命。"

    # game/script.rpy:9952
    old "And why would they do that? It's true that she looked like the culprit, and that's why I still think she was. By killing her, they'd only be confirming that she was innocent."
    new "那他们又为什么要这么做？她看上去确实像凶手，所以我还是认为她就是。杀了她，反倒只会证明她是清白的。"

    # game/script.rpy:9953
    old "...Or involved in a way that's harmful for them. We need to know what happened to her and find who's actually behind it."
    new "……又或者，她牵扯进了对他们不利的事。我们得弄清她身上发生了什么，找出真正的幕后之人。"

    # game/script.rpy:9958
    old "...We shouldn't leave her like this, though. She doesn't deserve to spend eleven more hours lying face-up with that expression."
    new "……不过，总不能让她就这么躺着。让她保持那副表情仰面躺上十一个小时，太不体面了。"

    # game/script.rpy:9963
    old "What, do you wanna cover it?"
    new "怎么，你是想把脸盖上？"

    # game/script.rpy:9968
    old "Isn't that... what you do for corpses?"
    new "给遗体蒙上脸，不都是这么做的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:9973
    old "We should prioritize maintaining the crime scene."
    new "我们得优先保护现场。"

    # game/script.rpy:9979
    old "I don't think so... She died in this room, and cameras recorded it. There's nothing to preserve, and we can give her some dignity."
    new "我不这么想……她就死在这间房里，监控全都拍下来了。现场也没什么可保留的，倒不如让她走得体面些。"

    # game/script.rpy:9985
    old "Her stance was understandable, and nobody wanted to argue against it. It was possible I'd get in trouble for it, but I went ahead and detached a curtain from a cabinet and laid it over Naomi's body, covering the face that communicated how she'd spent her last moments."
    new "她的立场可以理解，也没人想再反驳。这么做或许会给我惹上麻烦，但我还是从展示柜上扯下一块遮布，盖在 Naomi 身上，遮住了那张仍带着她最后时刻神情的脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:9994
    old "Thank you... I'm sure she would appreciate it."
    new "谢谢……她一定会感激的。"

    # game/script.rpy:9999
    old "I'm not sure that was a great idea, but now let's make sure to find the person who did it. Doesn't it feel like they're taunting us, making noise to let us know they're there and refusing to appear?"
    new "这主意好不好，我可说不准；总之现在得把凶手找出来。他们故意弄出声响，让人知道他们在，却又始终不肯露面，不觉得这像是在挑衅我们吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:10004
    old "But even so, they wouldn't have had a chance to move the Sekimeiya."
    new "可就算这样，他们也没机会动 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:10009
    old "Can we really be sure? Our priority should be to find them. I don't think any of us did this. There's a real culprit who murdered Naomi and is responsible for the Sekimeiya vanishing. ...Who knows what else will happen if we don't stop them immediately?"
    new "真能这么肯定吗？我们得优先把他们找出来。我不认为我们之中有人做了这事。凶手另有其人，他杀了 Naomi，还让 Sekimeiya 消失了。……要是不马上拦住他，谁知道还会出什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:10010
    old "I don't know how they did everything or how they weren't found, but we have to hurry. They're somewhere on a higher floor right now, so let's find them."
    new "我不知道他是怎么做到这一切的，又是怎么一直没被找到，但我们得抓紧。他现在就在上面某一层，我们上去找他。"

    # game/script.rpy:10019
    old "We left the room behind, and with it Naomi's corpse, which lay under a beautiful red cloth. She had lost her life in the tower with us, and yet we knew nothing about her or the identity and intentions of her murderer. I was trying not to let it get the best of me, but my mind was all over the place. I couldn't allow anything to happen to me and Shiroya, and the moment I'd instantaneously moved between places kept replaying in my head."
    new "我们离开了那间房，把 Naomi 的遗体留在那里，盖着一块艳丽的红布。她就在这座塔里、在我们身边丢了性命，可我们对她的来历、对凶手的身份和意图一无所知。我竭力不让自己被这些压垮，思绪却乱作一团。我不能让自己和 Shiroya 出任何事；我从一个地方瞬间移动到另一个地方的那一刻，不断在脑中回放。"

    # game/script.rpy:10028
    old "We met up with Erina and Isla and summarized the few conclusions we'd been able to draw. Once again, we had five floors to go through."
    new "我们与 Erina、Isla 会合，把勉强得出的几点结论交流了一遍。眼下又有五层楼要逐层搜过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:10029
    old "Were we going to find anyone a second time? It must've been almost {time=11}, implying that someone might've been able to remain unseen for two full hours."
    new "这次还能再找到人吗？时间应该快到 {time=11} 了，也就是说，有人可能整整两个小时都没被任何人看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:10034
    old "This is starting to get old, so let's be fast. This person only wants to hide from us, and they're also being recorded by cameras, so our only goal is to find them and question them."
    new "这种事越来越烦人了，动作快点。对方只想躲着我们，而且一直被监控拍着，所以我们唯一的目标就是找到他，问个清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:10035
    old "Since it couldn't have been any of us, splitting up won't matter. Everyone make sure a floor is empty and then stay somewhere outside the offices. This way, someone who's hiding can only escape by moving between floors, and they'll be easily spotted."
    new "既然凶手不可能是我们当中的人，分头行动也无妨。每人负责确认一层没人，然后守在办公室外面。这样一来，躲着的人想逃，只能在楼层之间移动，很容易被看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:10036
    old "After a few minutes, it'll be impossible not to have found them, so we'll all move back to this floor with that person in tow."
    new "用不了几分钟，就一定能找到对方；到时候我们带上那个人一起回到这一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:10046
    old "I don't think this is needed at all."
    new "我看根本没必要。"

    # game/script.rpy:10047
    old "We went up the stairs, following Akaro. If none of us were the culprit or had ulterior motives, then the plan would work. It was only slightly faster than moving up progressively, but it'd be equally successful."
    new "我们跟着 Akaro 上了楼梯。如果我们当中没有人是凶手，也没有人别有用心，这个计划就行得通。这比一层层往上查快不了多少，但同样管用。"

    # game/script.rpy:10052
    old "We'll stay here, then."
    new "那我们就留在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:10062
    old "...Actually, never mind. This arrangement of yours is a great idea."
    new "……算了，当我没说。你这个安排很好。"

    # game/script.rpy:10070
    old "After we checked that nobody was in the bathrooms, Erina and Isla were left behind on floor 2, free to enter the partitions. Sai said he'd inspect and wait on floor 3."
    new "我们检查完洗手间、确认里面没人后，Erina 和 Isla 留在了二层，可以自由进出隔间。Sai 说他负责三层，检查完就在那里等。"

    # game/script.rpy:10075
    old "I'll look through this one. The rest of you keep going up."
    new "这一层我来查，其他人继续往上。"

    # game/script.rpy:10080
    old "With Akaro staying on the fourth floor, Shiroya and I remained on the fifth. Katei was left with the last one, and he said that he'd make sure nobody could stay hidden there."
    new "Akaro 留在四层，我和 Shiroya 留在五层。最后一层交给 Katei，他说会确保没人能藏在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:10084
    old "We easily looked through our three sections. There was nobody there, so we stayed next to the elevator."
    new "我们很轻松地查完了自己负责的三个区域。里面都没有人，我们便守在电梯旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:10091
    old "We'll have to wait, then."
    new "那就只能等了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10093
    old "We can head downstairs whenever Katei comes back."
    new "等 Katei 回来，我们就下楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:10102
    old "We have to find someone this time, right? Someone must've been on the crystal floor when we heard that noise."
    new "这次总该能找到人吧？听到那个声音的时候，水晶层上一定有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:10103
    old "I'd say so. Unless they can make it to the attic, the only way we could miss them is if someone purposely covers for them."
    new "应该是。除非他能跑到阁楼去，否则唯一可能漏掉的情况，就是有人故意替他遮掩。"

    # game/script.rpy:10105
    old "Are you tired? When did you wake up yesterday?"
    new "累不累？你昨天几点醒的？"

    # game/script.rpy:10110
    old "Sometime in the afternoon. I'm okay, though, just a bit hungry."
    new "下午吧。我还好，就是有点饿。"

    # game/script.rpy:10111
    old "Yeah, I'm the same. I'm glad I ate a bit before leaving. Do you not carry cereal bars with you anymore? You always used to have one or two in your purse."
    new "我也是。幸好出门前吃了点。你现在不带麦片棒了？以前你包里总有一两根。"

    # game/script.rpy:10116
    old "That was at school. I brought the ones I had when I came over, but I finished them off a few days ago. I wouldn't be surprised if they stopped people from bringing food in here anyway."
    new "那是上学的时候。过来时我把手边的都带来了，前几天吃完了。再说，这里说不定本来就不让人带食物进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:10117
    old "...Right. I didn't think about that."
    new "……也是，我没想到这层。"

    # game/script.rpy:10121
    old "I was thinking that if we want to go find that old cabin, we could do it tomorrow. It hasn't snowed in a bit, so that should help us get there. It was pretty far."
    new "我在想，要是想去那座旧木屋看看，不如明天就去。有一阵没下雪了，路会好走些。那地方挺远的。"

    # game/script.rpy:10122
    old "...Are you sure it'll still be there? I don't think I remember how to get to it, and I'm sure it's changed a lot since then."
    new "……你确定它还在吗？我都不太记得怎么走了。而且过了这么久，那里肯定变了不少。"

    # game/script.rpy:10123
    old "It wasn't that fragile of a cabin. I'm sure it held out against the weather, but maybe the door is buried in snow. We'll have to see."
    new "那木屋没那么脆弱，风吹雪打应该扛得住。只是门说不定被雪埋了，到时候只能看了再说。"

    # game/script.rpy:10124
    old "You know, I thought of something earlier. Do you remember Danny?"
    new "说起来，我刚才想到一件事。你还记得 Danny 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:10125
    old "...Danny?"
    new "……Danny？"

    # game/script.rpy:10130
    old "Danny the tiger."
    new "那只老虎 Danny。"

    # game/script.rpy:10131
    old "Oh! That stuffed thing? Yeah, of course. It's been forever since I thought about that."
    new "哦！那个玩偶？当然记得。好久没想起过它了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10136
    old "I haven't been able to find him in years. I just thought that maybe I left him in that cabin."
    new "我好几年都找不到他了。刚才在想，会不会是落在那个木屋里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10137
    old "You think so...? You definitely brought him there a few times. Maybe I left something there too. Now I want to go even more.{w} Katei didn't mention a cabin in his story, but I'd be shocked if it was the same place. There are probably a few similar fields on that mountain."
    new "会吗……？你确实带他去过几次。说不定我也在那儿落下了什么。这下我更想去了。{w}Katei 讲的事里没提到木屋，不过要真是同一个地方，我可要吃惊了。那座山上大概有好几片相似的草地。"

    # game/script.rpy:10142
    old "Mmm. I'd be happy if we could find him. I used to have him with me all the time."
    new "嗯。要是能找到他就好了。以前我一直把他带在身边。"

    # game/script.rpy:10143
    old "Yeah. We'll get through this. We'll find the person who made that noise and put an end to everything. There was a pretty big couch in the lobby, so you can probably rest there if you need to."
    new "会的。我们一定能挺过去。我们会找到弄出那个动静的人，把这一切了结。大厅里有张挺大的沙发，你要休息的话，在那儿躺一会儿应该没问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:10150
    old "Shiroya didn't reply. I was forcing myself to be optimistic and distract her from what was going on, but it wasn't enough. Naomi's empty eyes weren't something she was going to easily forget. She lowered her shoulders, trying to loosen up, but her posture was still completely rigid."
    new "Shiroya 没有回答。我强作乐观，想把她的注意力从眼前的状况上引开，可这还不够。Naomi 那双空洞的眼睛，不是那么容易就能忘掉的。她垂下肩膀，像是想让自己放松下来，可整个人的姿态依旧僵硬。"

    # game/script.rpy:10153
    old "Our arrangement was efficient, but if someone had gone to the sixth floor, Katei could pretend it was empty. Due to the attic door, we wouldn't be able to prove he lied unless we had the security footage."
    new "我们的安排很高效，可万一有人去过六楼，Katei 只要一口咬定上面空无一人就行。有那扇阁楼门在，除非拿到监控录像，否则我们无法证明他在说谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:10154
    old "However, it seemed like Katei was serious about finding the culprit. If he hadn't been making that up, he would report his part of the search truthfully."
    new "不过，Katei 似乎真的想找出凶手。如果他没说谎，那他负责的那部分搜查，应该会如实汇报。"

    # game/script.rpy:10155
    old "As I thought of him, I heard muffled noises coming from above us. They were incredibly faint footsteps we could hear solely because of the pure silence surrounding us, which indicated that Katei was walking across the sixth floor."
    new "正想着他，头顶便传来了隐约的声响。那脚步声轻得几乎听不见，全靠四周一片死寂才传到我们耳中——是 Katei 正走在六楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:10159
    old "...Do you think I could've time traveled?"
    new "……你觉得，我有没有可能穿越了？"

    # game/script.rpy:10164
    old "...Huh? I don't know. It's kind of unbelievable...{w} Do you think you did?"
    new "……诶？我不知道。这事有点难以置信……{w}你自己觉得呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:10165
    old "I think so. Experiencing it myself makes me doubt that anything else could've happened."
    new "我觉得是。亲身经历过之后，我实在想不出还有别的解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:10170
    old "I see... How was it? Did it hurt at all?"
    new "这样啊……那是什么感觉？会痛吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:10171
    old "Oh, no. It was immediate. Did I really disappear from your perspective?"
    new "不，一点也不痛。一瞬间就完成了。在你看来，我真的消失了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:10176
    old "...Yes. I thought I must've imagined it somehow, but my first impression was that you instantly vanished. I actually ran up to the cabinet to check if you fell inside, but I could only see the gray Sekimeiya."
    new "……嗯。我还以为自己不知怎么产生了错觉，可我的第一印象就是你一下子消失了。我还跑到展示柜旁，查看你是不是掉进去了，结果只看到灰色 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:10178
    old "If anyone else said that, I would've left it open for doubt. Someone else could deliberately lie to make me think I'd teleported when they knew what actually happened.{w} But I had to take Shiroya's experience at face value. If I intended to think of an alternative to time travel, I had to factor in her viewpoint as well."
    new "换作别人这么说，我还会留个疑心。对方也许明知真相，却故意骗我，让我以为自己被传送了。{w}但 Shiroya 的亲身经历，我不能不当真。若想找出时间穿越之外的另一种解释，我就必须把她的视角也算进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:10181
    old "I'm also pretty sure I time traveled because of what happened on the sixth floor earlier. You saw me next to the offices and thought I'd moved over there, right?"
    new "之前六楼发生的事，也让我相当确信自己时间穿越了。你看到我在办公室那边，还以为是我自己走过去了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:10186
    old "Oh, that's right. When I got back, you were next to the elevator again. I was gonna bring it up, but you looked a bit nervous, and I thought something might've happened."
    new "哦，对。我回来的时候，你又站在电梯旁边了。我本来想提这事，可你看起来有点紧张，我就以为是不是出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:10187
    old "So you were the one who brought the elevator up?"
    new "那么，把电梯叫上来的人是你？"

    # game/script.rpy:10188
    old "It seems so..."
    new "看来是这样……"

    # game/script.rpy:10189
    old "Traveling to the past had caused her search to come up empty, but the circumstances of that were highly specific. For our second search, everyone was watching over a separate floor, so it was unlikely something like that would repeat."
    new "穿越到过去，才让她的搜查扑了个空，可那种情形极为特殊。第二轮搜查时，每层楼都有人盯着，同样的事不太可能再发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:10194
    old "...I'm sorry. If I hadn't brought up coming here, this wouldn't have happened."
    new "……对不起。要不是我提议来这里，也不会出这种事。"

    # game/script.rpy:10195
    old "...You don't have to apologize for that. I wanted to go too."
    new "……这事你不用道歉。我也是自己想来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:10200
    old "Are you sure? Nothing has happened to us yet, but depending on what's really going on, we might be in danger. Someone is... dead."
    new "你确定吗？我们目前还没出事，但真相究竟如何还不好说，我们说不定也会有危险。毕竟已经有人……死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10203
    old "I feel... horrible about what happened to Naomi, but it's likely she was involved with this plan in some way. There's no reason for anyone to target us."
    new "Naomi 的事……我心里也很难受。但她多半和这个计划有某种牵连。没有理由会有人盯上我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:10208
    old "But we're searching for the person who did it, right? That might be a motive in itself. They killed Naomi in front of the security cameras, so they're not afraid of being recorded. ...And there's also this teleportation."
    new "可我们正在找凶手吧？这本身就可能成为动机。他们当着监控杀了 Naomi，根本不怕被拍下来。……再加上这次的传送。"

    # game/script.rpy:10209
    old "Not only that, but a lot of things don't seem right, do they? How did the Sekimeiya disappear just now?"
    new "不止这样，还有好多地方都不对劲吧？刚才 Sekimeiya 是怎么消失的？"

    # game/script.rpy:10211
    old "Well, someone must have used the key to open the cabinet..."
    new "这个嘛，肯定是有人用钥匙打开了展示柜……"

    # game/script.rpy:10212
    old "But nobody could have. And if someone did, it was one of us seven. Or, I guess, either Sai or Akaro. You were looking at hallway A, right?"
    new "可没人能做到啊。真有人开了，也只能是我们七个人之一。或者……Sai 或 Akaro 吧。你当时在看 A走廊，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:10213
    old "That sounded reasonable from her point of view. She wouldn't have kept track of Sai and Akaro while she'd looked through the hallway B rooms."
    new "站在她的角度，这话很合理。她在 B走廊各房间里搜查时，不可能一直盯着 Sai 和 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:10214
    old "Yes, but that's not really the case. Sai, Akaro, Katei, Erina, Isla, and an unknown person could've still done it."
    new "对，但事实并非如此。Sai、Akaro、Katei、Erina、Isla，还有一个不明身份的人，都有可能做到。"

    # game/script.rpy:10217
    old "When I went to look inside the mechanical room, Katei, Erina, and Isla were looking at hallway A. During that time, they had the chance to enter the event room.{w} Although it would imply that they were either working together or threatened into silence."
    new "我去查看机械室的时候，Katei、Erina 和 Isla 正看着 A走廊。那段时间里，他们有机会进入活动室。{w}只不过这样一来，就说明他们要么是同伙，要么是被威胁封了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:10218
    old "Similarly, if they didn't keep watching the hallway or were working with an unknown person, that person could've also had the opportunity to enter. That doesn't make much sense to me, and it means that they had Naomi's key even before we found her body."
    new "同样，如果他们没一直盯着走廊，或者和不明的第三人串通，那个人也有机会进去。我觉得这说不通，而且这样一来，他们在我们发现 Naomi 的尸体之前，就已经拿到了她的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:10219
    old "But what you said about Sai and Akaro doesn't make much sense either because the Sekimeiya was found in the storeroom—in hallway A. Sai and Akaro were looking through hallway B, so they could've opened the cabinet by picking up the key from Naomi's body and then going to the event room."
    new "不过你说 Sai 和 Akaro 那部分也说不通，因为 Sekimeiya 是在储藏室找到的——就在 A走廊。Sai 和 Akaro 当时在搜 B走廊，他们倒是可以先从 Naomi 的尸体上取走钥匙，再去活动室打开展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:10225
    old "But then they couldn't have left it inside one of the hallway A rooms."
    new "可那样的话，他们没法把东西留在 A走廊的房间里。"

    # game/script.rpy:10226
    old "Yeah. The only way to do that would've been by cooperating with Katei and Erina. When I was in the mechanical room, either of them could've entered the event room knowing that their hallway B companion had unlocked the cabinet, or maybe they let them hide it."
    new "是啊。要做到这一点，只能和 Katei、Erina 配合。我在机械室那段时间，他们俩中任何一个人都可以进活动室，因为他们知道 B走廊那边的同伙已经打开展示柜；也说不定，是他们放对方进去藏的。"

    # game/script.rpy:10232
    old "So, in the end, the only possibilities are that either Katei and Erina are the culprits, worked with them, or were forced to keep quiet.{w} ...Nobody could've hidden it in the storeroom without being seen by both of them... and Isla too, I suppose."
    new "也就是说，到头来只有几种可能：Katei 和 Erina 就是凶手，或者他们和凶手合作，或者他们被迫闭嘴。{w}……毕竟不管是谁，想在他们两人的眼皮底下把东西藏进储藏室都不可能……我想，还有 Isla。"

    # game/script.rpy:10233
    old "That's right. And if it's true that no more keys exist and they weren't threatened, they must've been behind what happened to Naomi... They wouldn't have been able to unlock the cabinet otherwise, unless they cooperated with someone from hallway B."
    new "没错。而且如果确实没有别的钥匙，他们也不是受人胁迫，那 Naomi 的事就一定是他们干的……否则他们打不开展示柜，除非和 B走廊的某个人联手。"

    # game/script.rpy:10235
    old "\"At least three people are lying to us or nothing makes sense\". That was the conclusion we'd come to, and Shiroya looked pretty defeated about it."
    new "「至少有三个人在骗我们，否则一切都说不过去。」——这就是我们得出的结论。Shiroya 看上去相当泄气。"

    # game/script.rpy:10240
    old "What you said earlier... that nobody from hallway B could've hidden the Sekimeiya in the storeroom... Could there be a way around that?"
    new "你刚才说的……B走廊的人不可能把 Sekimeiya 藏进储藏室……有没有办法绕过这一点？"

    # game/script.rpy:10241
    old "I considered that it was Sai. He entered the storeroom and acted like he'd found the Sekimeiya inside, when in reality, he'd had it on him the whole time."
    new "我也想过是 Sai。他进了储藏室，装成在里面找到了 Sekimeiya，其实东西一直带在他身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:10242
    old "That's the only way I can think of, but it's not really possible. Technically, Sai could have hidden the Sekimeiya in his hip pack.{w} However, we talked for a bit before he went to examine hallway A, and his back was facing us when he entered the two rooms there."
    new "我能想到的只有这一种，可实际上行不通。严格来说，Sai 可以把 Sekimeiya 藏进腰包里。{w}但他去查看 A走廊之前，我们还聊了一会儿，而他走进那边两个房间时是背对着我们的。"

    # game/script.rpy:10243
    old "I'm sure that if the Sekimeiya had been there, one of us would've noticed. His pack would've looked bulkier than normal."
    new "我敢说，要是 Sekimeiya 真在他身上，我们总有人会察觉。他的腰包会比平时鼓出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:10244
    old "You're probably right. He wouldn't have any other way to keep it hidden.{w} ...So the only possibility is that Katei and Erina did it while you weren't there."
    new "你说得大概没错。他也没有别的办法把它藏起来。{w}……那就只剩一种可能：是 Katei 和 Erina 趁你不在时动的手。"

    # game/script.rpy:10245
    old "I think so... They must've had the key before we found Naomi, and only Katei could've killed her.{w} However, Katei can't be responsible just by himself since he wouldn't have been able to get the Sekimeiya before I went to the mechanical room. By that point, he was already with Erina and Isla."
    new "我想是的……他们一定在发现 Naomi 之前就已经有钥匙了，而能杀她的只有 Katei。{w}可是单凭 Katei 一个人不行，因为在我去机械室之前，他拿不到 Sekimeiya。那时候他已经和 Erina、Isla 在一起了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10248
    old "When I left the mechanical room, Erina told me that nothing had happened. So she was either working with Katei, or she was threatened to keep quiet. Nothing works involving someone from hallway B acting on their own, and the only other possibility could be an extra person threatening Erina and Katei to keep quiet.{w} You were with your group in hallway C when you finished, so it's unlikely that person came down from a higher floor. They might've been in one of the hallway A rooms we checked."
    new "我离开机械室时，Erina 告诉我什么都没发生。所以，她要么和 Katei 是同伙，要么是被威胁封了口。B走廊的人单独行动，怎么都说不通，剩下的可能只有一种：另有一个威胁 Erina 和 Katei 闭嘴的人。{w}你们结束时，你和你的小组在 C走廊，所以那个人不太可能是从更高楼层下来的。他或许就藏在我们查过的某个 A走廊房间里。"

    # game/script.rpy:10253
    old "Hm...{w} Someone else was definitely on that floor, right? So that shouldn't be impossible."
    new "嗯……{w}那一层确实还有别人吧？那样的话，也不算不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:10254
    old "That's true, and if someone was threatened like that, they wouldn't reveal the culprit's position now even if they found them... In fact, they might still be on the crystal floor."
    new "确实。而且，如果真是被人那样威胁，就算现在找到了凶手，他们也不会说出对方的位置……说不定那人还在水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:10259
    old "So... maybe the way everyone spread out on these floors wasn't the best idea."
    new "那么……或许大家这样分散在各层搜查，未必是个好主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:10266
    old "I can hardly take myself seriously, but I have to think about time travel and teleportation too. I just don't want to miss possibilities, and... ones involving what should be impossible have now become potential realities. I can't deny what I experienced."
    new "我自己都觉得这念头荒唐，可时间穿越和传送，我也非得考虑不可。我只是不想放过任何一种可能，而且……那些本该不可能的事，如今都成了可能的现实。我亲身经历的一切，无法否认。"

    # game/script.rpy:10267
    old "I have no idea what the rules would be, but if the Sekimeiya grants time travel abilities, it makes a lot of sense that someone's chasing after it or trying to accomplish something with it. They could know more about its powers than we do—they might've been making use of them from the beginning."
    new "我不清楚它遵循什么规则，但如果 Sekimeiya 真能赋予人时间穿越的能力，那有人追逐它、或想借它达成某种目的，就完全说得通了。他们对它的力量也许比我们了解得更深——说不定从一开始就在加以利用。"

    # game/script.rpy:10271
    old "But why would anyone bother hiding the Sekimeiya? No matter what I think, there doesn't appear to be a clear purpose since it would always be trivial to locate it if it's not brought to a locker or the attic."
    new "但为什么会有人费心把 Sekimeiya 藏起来？无论怎么想，我都看不出明确的目的——只要不把它带进储物柜或阁楼，找到它从来都不是难事。"

    # game/script.rpy:10272
    old "But let's assume the culprit wanted to hide it in the storeroom, whatever their reason. If they truly did it with the time travel that occurs upon touching the Sekimeiya, it follows that in the future, they'll have access to it.{w} So someone could be ready to go to the past and hide it in the storeroom right this moment. They might intend to make it out of here with the Sekimeiya in some way."
    new "不过，先假设犯人出于某种理由，想把它藏进储藏室。如果真是靠触碰 Sekimeiya 时发生的时间穿越办到的，那么到了未来的某个时刻，他们就能碰到它。{w} 也就是说，此刻可能正有人准备回到过去，把它藏进储藏室。他们或许打算以某种方式带着 Sekimeiya 离开这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:10273
    old "It teleports you to the past, doesn't it? One goal could be to make it to the past holding the Sekimeiya itself or other gemstones. It would appear as if they'd disappeared from inside the tower, and only one of us could be responsible. But I wasn't holding the Sekimeiya when I traveled to hallway A, so how would you go to the past with it?"
    new "那东西会把人传送到过去，对吧？其中一个目的，也许就是带着 Sekimeiya 本身或其他宝石回到过去。这样一来，他们看起来就像从塔里凭空消失了，而能办到这种事的人只可能在我们之中。可我传送到 A走廊时并没有拿着 Sekimeiya，那又要怎么带着它回到过去？"

    # game/script.rpy:10276
    old "Avoiding the two hallway groups is more than possible if someone used time travel: first, they lured us out of the event room by making the sound we heard."
    new "如果有人用了时间穿越，要避开走廊里的两拨人并非难事：首先，他们弄出我们听见的声响，把我们引出活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:10277
    old "Then, they appeared inside the event room from the future.{w} I don't know what could determine the position you teleport to, because I appeared in hallway A when I hadn't been there twenty minutes before, but if the culprit touches the Sekimeiya while holding the cabinet key, they could appear inside the event room with it."
    new "接着，他们从未来出现在活动室里。{w} 我不知道传送的落点由什么决定——二十分钟前我根本不在 A走廊，却还是出现在了那里；不过，如果犯人握着展示柜钥匙触碰 Sekimeiya，就有可能带着它一起出现在活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:10278
    old "Once we were all in hallway C, they got out of the event room and left it in the storeroom while they hid elsewhere.{w} If they had already lived through that portion of time, they could've known the entire sequence of events—that they would be safe in the event room until we found the Sekimeiya. But then they'd also know that it would be found right away, so why bother doing all this?"
    new "等我们全都进了 C走廊，他们便离开活动室，把东西留在储藏室，自己躲到别处。{w} 如果他们早已经历过那段时间，就可能知道整串事件的走向——知道自己在活动室里一直安全，直到我们找到 Sekimeiya。可这样一来，他们也该知道东西马上就会被发现，那又何必费这么多功夫？"

    # game/script.rpy:10279
    old "Regardless, that leaves open the possibility of the culprit still being on the crystal floor. They could've even disappeared by touching the Sekimeiya if it was necessary, and even though it was white when we found it, maybe it didn't make us travel because someone else had just used it."
    new "无论如何，犯人仍有可能还在水晶层。必要时，他们甚至可以触碰 Sekimeiya 直接消失；虽然我们发现它时它是白色的，但也许只是因为有别人刚用过，它才没让我们穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:10282
    old "My initial thought is some sort of cooldown: after I traveled, nobody else could travel. Once the cold restored it, it allowed for one more travel. That still doesn't explain the strange color change it underwent right as I touched it."
    new "我最初想到的是某种冷却：在我穿越之后，其他人就无法再穿越；等冷却恢复，它才又允许了一次穿越。但这仍然解释不了我碰到它的瞬间，它为何会发生那种诡异的颜色变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:10283
    old "If we're chasing a culprit who has knowledge of how to disappear and go to the past easily, it makes a lot of sense that we haven't found them yet. It also explains why they're trying to hide from us when we would normally find someone right away in this building."
    new "如果我们追的犯人懂得如何轻易消失、回到过去，那我们至今找不到人就说得通了。这也能解释他们为何要躲着我们——换作平时，在这栋楼里找人本该一找就能找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:10284
    old "But the person who lured us out of the event room would've had to go up the floors before traveling to the past, and they can't disappear from there since the Sekimeiya's still on the crystal floor.{w} ...Once again, though, the attic makes it possible."
    new "可是，把我们引出活动室的人若想回到过去，必须先上楼；而既然 Sekimeiya 还在水晶层，他们就不可能从上边消失。{w} ……不过，说到底，阁楼又让这一切成为可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:10285
    old "Nonetheless, if no time travel or teleportation was involved at all in what happened, Katei, Erina, and Isla know the truth of it. If it really was a factor, I wonder how far we are from understanding anything at all that's happened."
    new "但反过来说，如果发生的一切根本不涉及时间穿越或传送，那么 Katei、Erina 和 Isla 就知道真相。若这些确实牵涉其中，我真不知道我们离弄清事情全貌还有多远。"

    # game/script.rpy:10288
    old "Katei's coming."
    new "Katei 来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10293
    old "I anticipated his arrival thanks to the echoing footsteps. He came from the floor above."
    new "脚步声在楼道里回响，我早已料到他会来。他是从上一层下来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:10298
    old "Did anything happen?"
    new "有什么情况吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:10303
    old "...No. There was no one there, so as we agreed, I stayed on that floor for a while to make sure no one escaped there with the elevator. More than enough time has passed, so we should go back down."
    new "……没有。那里空无一人。所以按我们说好的，我在那层守了一阵，确认没人能乘电梯从那里逃走。时间已经足够久了，我们该下去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10304
    old "He shot me another incensed look, but I tried to ignore it."
    new "他又怒气冲冲地瞪了我一眼，我尽量不去理会。"

    # game/script.rpy:10305
    old "If anyone was here, they must've been found."
    new "这里若真有人，早该被找到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10306
    old "...Okay. Let's go to the crystal floor."
    new "……好。去水晶层吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:10313
    old "We took the stairs down. Akaro was waiting for us, uncertain of what to do. He also hadn't found anyone."
    new "我们沿楼梯下去。Akaro 正在等我们，似乎不知该如何是好。他也一无所获。"

    # game/script.rpy:10318
    old "One floor below was Sai. According to him, the third floor was empty and nothing had happened after we'd left."
    new "再下一层是 Sai。据他说，三楼空无一人，我们离开后也没发生任何事。"

    # game/script.rpy:10323
    old "The situation was the same on the second, where Erina and Isla had remained. There was no point to it, but as we'd said earlier, we all moved down to the crystal floor."
    new "二楼也一样，Erina 和 Isla 一直守在那里。虽然再查下去也没什么意义，但我们还是照先前说好的，一同下到了水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:10337
    old "Well. Did anyone find the culprit and let them escape?"
    new "怎么样。有人找到犯人，又让人跑了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:10338
    old "Everyone stated that they had found no one. We'd just searched through the entire tower without a result, so the only remaining possibilities were that the culprit had access to the attic, that one of us was lying, or that they'd managed to escape by teleporting through time, which should've only been possible on the crystal floor."
    new "每个人都表示没找到人。我们刚把整座塔搜了一遍，却毫无结果，剩下的可能便只有三种：犯人能进入阁楼；我们之中有人在撒谎；或者他们利用传送穿越时间，成功逃走了——而这本该只可能在水晶层发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:10339
    old "...So that's a no?"
    new "……那就是没找到了？"

    # game/script.rpy:10340
    old "We all kept quiet, as we'd already announced our results."
    new "大家都没再作声，毕竟各自的结果早就报过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10345
    old "They have to be in the attic, then. We just searched every other floor, after all."
    new "那就只可能在阁楼了。毕竟其他每一层我们都搜过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10350
    old "O-Oh, wait, I can actually think of another place where they could be."
    new "啊，等等，我其实还能想到另一个他们可能在的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:10355
    old "Are you sure...? We looked through the whole tower. The way we did it didn't allow for anyone to hide from us. Where else could they have been?"
    new "你确定……？整座塔我们都查过了。照我们那种搜法，没人能躲得过去。还能有什么地方？"

    # game/script.rpy:10360
    old "There."
    new "那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:10366
    old "Shiroya turned around and pointed at the elevator."
    new "Shiroya 转过身，指向电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:10371
    old "Oh, inside the elevator? Nobody went into it, correct?"
    new "哦，电梯里？没人进去过，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:10372
    old "No one spoke up. Could someone have been inside the elevator the whole time, banking on us ignoring it?"
    new "没人应声。难道真有人一直藏在电梯里，赌我们不会去查？"

    # game/script.rpy:10377
    old "Which floor should it be on?"
    new "它现在应该停在哪一层？"

    # game/script.rpy:10378
    old "We were the last ones to use it. We called it from floor 5 to test which floor it stopped on when we followed it up."
    new "最后用电梯的是我们。我们从五楼叫了它，想看看跟着它上楼时它会停在哪层。"

    # game/script.rpy:10383
    old "That's good. If we left it here, they could've come out as soon as we went up. At least we don't have to search this floor again."
    new "那还好。要是把它留在这层，我们一上楼，他们就能立刻出来。至少这层不用再搜一遍了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10389
    old "Anything wrong?"
    new "怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:10390
    old "Plenty. Wait a second."
    new "问题不少。等一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:10395
    old "Following the out of place sigh, he walked up to the elevator and pressed the button to call it.{w} After a few seconds, the orange light surrounding the button told us that it had arrived, and Sai immediately grabbed the handle."
    new "那声突兀的叹气过后，他走到电梯前，按下呼叫按钮。{w} 几秒后，按钮周围的橙光亮起，说明电梯已经到了，Sai 立刻抓住了门把手。"

    # game/script.rpy:10400
    old "Let's see, I suppose. There's no way anyone's inside. They would've gotten out as soon as they heard people leaving the floor it was on, and if they'd still been inside, they could've pressed any floor button before this one to stop it earlier."
    new "那就看看吧。里面不可能有人。要真有人，听见有人离开电梯所在的那层，早就出来了；就算还留在里面，也可以在电梯到这一层之前随便按个楼层按钮，让它提前停下。"

    # game/script.rpy:10404
    old "He opened the door. It was empty, as we'd all expected."
    new "他打开门。里面空空如也，和大家预料的一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:10410
    old "Oh, I meant to ask you something, Katei. The instructions inside state that pressing the stop button will enable contact with an emergency line. Is that possible right now?"
    new "对了，我正想问你一件事，Katei。里面的说明写着，按下停止按钮就能接通紧急线路。现在还能用吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:10415
    old "No. Naturally, the alarm shuts that down. The line can enable communication both with the outside and the security room, but right now it's disabled completely."
    new "不行。警报启动后，那功能自然就被切断了。那条线路可以联系外界，也能联系监控室，但现在已经被完全禁用。"

    # game/script.rpy:10416
    old "...I'd strongly recommend that none of you touch it. It was originally installed knowing Xyn could try to secure the elevator, but there's no point in that now, and we left up clear instructions.{w} If you press it as the elevator is moving, it won't move again until permission is granted from outside, and given communication has been temporarily disabled, I fear nothing could be done until the exit unlocks."
    new "……我强烈建议你们谁都别碰它。当初设置它，是考虑到 Xyn 可能会试图控制电梯；可现在已没有那个必要，我们也留下了明确的说明。{w} 如果在电梯运行时按下它，电梯在获得外部许可前都不会再动；而通讯眼下已被暂时切断，恐怕在出口解锁之前，谁也做不了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:10421
    old "That's scary. We'll keep it in mind."
    new "真吓人。我们会记住的。"

    # game/script.rpy:10424
    old "Anyway, given how long it took to get here, it was on the fifth floor."
    new "总之，看它过来花了这么久，刚才应该停在五楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:10429
    old "You can tell?"
    new "这也能看出来？"

    # game/script.rpy:10435
    old "Yes. I've never used it, but it's fairly slow. The seconds I counted match up with it being on the fifth floor, assuming it doesn't take very long for the doors to close and to start moving."
    new "能。我没用过它，但它慢得很。我数的秒数和它从五楼下来的时间对得上——前提是关门和启动花不了太久。"

    # game/script.rpy:10436
    old "That would add five seconds at most."
    new "那最多也就会多出五秒。"

    # game/script.rpy:10441
    old "Which is what I added. I tried to open the door as soon as the button lit up, but since it didn't budge, it must light up before the inner doors open."
    new "这正是我补上的那一点。按钮一亮我就试着开门，可门纹丝不动，所以按钮应该是在内侧门打开之前就亮的。"

    # game/script.rpy:10447
    old "But as you said, if someone stopped it before it got here, it would have taken longer. What if it was on the third floor and had someone stopped it on the second?"
    new "可照你这么说，要是有人赶在它到这儿之前把它拦下，那耗时就得更长。要是它本来在三楼，却在二楼被人按停了呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:10448
    old "No. That whole process would've taken even longer.{w} If it wasn't on the fifth floor, the only way I could get the time I counted is if the door was open before I called it.{w} This is kind of batshit, but if someone kept the door open upstairs and closed it a few seconds after I called it, it would've started to go down later than I expected. That would have made it seem like it was higher."
    new "不对。那样一来，整个过程只会更久。{w}如果它本来不在五楼，我数出的这个时间，唯一的可能就是：我按按钮之前，门就已经开着了。{w}这话听着有点离谱，但假如楼上有人一直开着门，等我按了按钮几秒后才关上，那它开始下降的时间就比我预计的要晚。这样一来，看起来就像它原本停在更高的楼层。"

    # game/script.rpy:10454
    old "And why would anyone do that, let alone know when you called it?"
    new "可谁又会这么做？更别说还得知道你什么时候按的按钮。"

    # game/script.rpy:10459
    old "No idea, I'm just saying it's possible. Is there a light that indicates someone is trying to call it while the door's being kept open?"
    new "不知道，我只是说这有可能。有没有什么灯，能在门一直开着的时候显示有人在叫电梯？"

    # game/script.rpy:10464
    old "No such thing exists."
    new "没有这种东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:10469
    old "Then it's incredibly unlikely that's what happened."
    new "那就几乎不可能是这么回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:10471
    old "So it was on the fifth floor, right? There's no point in thinking too hard about this."
    new "所以它本来就在五楼，对吧？这事没必要想得太深。"

    # game/script.rpy:10472
    old "Incorrect. There's a very big inconsistency with the elevator being on the fifth floor, but it has to do with something I haven't mentioned yet. I imagined someone else would've figured it out, though."
    new "错了。电梯在五楼这一点，有个很大的矛盾，不过它牵涉到我还没提到的东西。我本以为别人会发现的。"

    # game/script.rpy:10478
    old "What is it...?"
    new "是什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:10485
    old "I found it quite intriguing, and I wasn't gonna comment on it immediately if you hadn't brought the elevator up. Let me explain what I heard."
    new "我觉得这事挺有意思，你要是没提起电梯，我本来也不打算马上说。先说说我听到了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:10486
    old "I was on the third floor, waiting right outside the offices. Imagine my surprise when I heard the elevator moving."
    new "我当时在三楼，就在办公室外面等着。听见电梯在动的时候，我真是吃了一惊。"

    # game/script.rpy:10487
    old "Wait, the elevator moved?"
    new "等等，电梯动了？"

    # game/script.rpy:10492
    old "Yes. Did nobody else hear it?"
    new "对。你们都没听见？"

    # game/script.rpy:10494
    old "For the third time, one of Sai's answers was received with silence. Personally, I hadn't heard anything."
    new "这已经是第三次，Sai 的回答换来一片沉默。至少我什么都没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:10499
    old "See, what makes this weird is that I know I heard the elevator three times. Did not even one of you hear it?"
    new "你瞧，怪就怪在我很确定自己听见电梯响了三次。你们真的一个都没听到？"

    # game/script.rpy:10500
    old "No one had."
    new "谁都没听到。"

    # game/script.rpy:10505
    old "You heard it three times and didn't follow it?"
    new "你听见它响了三回，却没跟过去看看？"

    # game/script.rpy:10510
    old "Of course not. I didn't know if it was going up or down, and we all agreed to stay put. I also didn't want to unwittingly bite some bait."
    new "当然没有。我连它是在往上还是往下都分不清，而且我们说好了待在原地。我也不想稀里糊涂地咬上别人的诱饵。"

    # game/script.rpy:10515
    old "Unfortunately, since there's no light that indicates the door's open on another floor, I couldn't know which floors it stopped on by counting the seconds as soon as I heard it moving."
    new "可惜没有灯能显示别层的门是不是开着，所以我没法一听见它动就掐着秒数，算出它停在了哪几层。"

    # game/script.rpy:10521
    old "But three times? Surely something must've been happening."
    new "可三次？那肯定出过什么事才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:10522
    old "Who remained on each floor above me?"
    new "我上面每一层都有谁在？"

    # game/script.rpy:10527
    old "...Erina and Isla remained on the second floor, apparently you heard the elevator from the third, Akaro stayed on the fourth, Atsuki and Shiroya on the fifth, and I went up by myself to the sixth."
    new "……Erina 和 Isla 留在二楼，看来你是在三楼听见的，Akaro 在四楼，Atsuki 和 Shiroya 在五楼，我一个人上了六楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:10532
    old "And when you went down, everyone was still on their appropriate floors, correct?"
    new "那你下去的时候，大家还都在各自该在的楼层，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:10538
    old "A lot of things could've happened, but some people here have to be lying. After three trips, no matter where the elevator started from, anyone could've gone to a different floor and then back to their own."
    new "可能发生的情况有很多，但这里一定有人说谎。它跑了三趟，不管起点在哪，任何人都能趁机去别的楼层，再回到自己那层。"

    # game/script.rpy:10539
    old "Yes, two trips would be required, and the third one could've been them calling the elevator for the first time."
    new "的确，那样需要两趟，第三趟说不定才是那人第一次按电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:10540
    old "That's wrong. That order of events is impossible."
    new "这不对。这种先后顺序根本不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:10550
    old "The elevator was on the fifth floor, right? I could've only heard someone who called it from below me. If Akaro called it from floor 4, I wouldn't have heard it."
    new "电梯当时在五楼，对吧？我只可能听见我下面楼层有人叫它。要是 Akaro 从四楼按的，我就听不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:10555
    old "So, if Erina and Isla called it and then I heard it two more times, the elevator would've stopped under me. And I just determined it was on the fifth. That couldn't have happened."
    new "所以，如果是 Erina 和 Isla 叫的电梯，之后我又听见了两次，那电梯就一定在我下面停过。可我刚刚才认定它在五楼。这不可能发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:10560
    old "If anyone above me used it, I wouldn't have heard them calling it. The strange thing is that I heard it three times, and I'm sure of that.{w} This is the inconsistency here: even if someone above me used it, it would not have ended up on the fifth floor because I heard it three times."
    new "要是我上面有人用它，我不会听见他们按按钮的声音。可怪的是我确实听见了三次，这点我敢肯定。{w}矛盾就在这儿：即便上面有人用过它，它也不该停在五楼，因为我听见它响了三次。"

    # game/script.rpy:10565
    old "It was there initially, right? The first trip was the elevator going down, then it went up, and then down again. There is no other combination that works, of course. Despite that, the elevator ended up above me."
    new "它本来就在那儿，对吧？第一趟是电梯往下走，然后往上，再往下。当然，没有别的组合说得通。可即便如此，电梯最后还是停在了我上面。"

    # game/script.rpy:10566
    old "We were a bit speechless, unaware of how to take all that."
    new "我们一时无言，不知该怎么理解这一番话。"

    # game/script.rpy:10571
    old "Erina, Isla, and Akaro. Are you sure you didn't hear the elevator even once?"
    new "Erina、Isla、Akaro。你们真的连一次都没听见电梯响？"

    # game/script.rpy:10581
    old "I didn't."
    new "我没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:10582
    old "...Me neither, but the first time was almost unnoticeable, so it's possible we missed it. We were far away from it."
    new "……我也没有。不过第一次几乎难以察觉，所以也有可能我们漏掉了。我们离得挺远。"

    # game/script.rpy:10589
    old "I'm sure I didn't hear it either."
    new "我也确定自己没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:10594
    old "What the hell? I heard the elevator three times, so it had to be on floors 4 and 2 also three times."
    new "搞什么？我听见了三次，那它经过四楼和二楼也应该各有三次。"

    # game/script.rpy:10599
    old "Be honest. Are you just making this up? I'm sure I would've heard it at least once if it passed my floor multiple times."
    new "说实话。你是不是在编？要是它从我这一层过了好几趟，我至少该听见一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:10600
    old "There's a way you would've missed it only once, but it's almost as unlikely."
    new "确实有一种可能，让你只漏听一次，但那同样几乎不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:10601
    old "What are you talking about?"
    new "你在说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:10602
    old "We understand, it couldn't have started on floor 5 if you heard it three times. So if you actually did, it must have been on floors 1 or 2 at the start."
    new "我们明白，要是你真听见了三次，它就不可能在五楼起步。所以如果你没听错，它一开始只可能在1楼或2楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:10603
    old "As an example, what if it was on the second floor and then went to the fourth? After that, from the fourth to the second, then from the second to the fifth."
    new "举个例子，假如它本来在二楼，然后去了四楼呢？接着从四楼下到二楼，再从二楼上到五楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:10604
    old "Just now, we didn't hear any sound. We only knew the elevator was here because the button lit up. If it stops on your floor, you won't necessarily notice it."
    new "刚才我们一点声音都没听到。只是按钮亮起，我们才知道电梯到了。电梯停在你那一层，你也未必会察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:10605
    old "Hm... So Erina and Isla couldn't have noticed it at all, and Akaro would only have had the chance to notice it when it went to the fifth."
    new "嗯……那就是说，Erina 和 Isla 根本不可能察觉，而 Akaro 只有电梯上五楼那一趟才有机会察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:10611
    old "And we wouldn't have heard it either when it stopped on ours."
    new "它停在我们这层的时候，我们也一样听不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:10616
    old "Well, hang on. This doesn't explain anything. Nobody got off on my floor."
    new "等等。这什么都解释不了。没人从我这一层下电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:10622
    old "...I'm certain nobody got off on ours either. We were next to the offices, keeping an eye on the elevator from a bit away. We might've missed the button lighting up, but not someone getting out."
    new "……我也确定没人从我们这层下电梯。我们就在办公室旁边，隔着一段距离盯着电梯。按钮亮起时我们也许没注意到，但有人出来绝不会看漏。"

    # game/script.rpy:10623
    old "Yeah, I get that. So whoever was inside the elevator didn't open the door when they came to a stop."
    new "嗯，我明白。也就是说，电梯里的人停下时并没有开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:10628
    old "...And what would the purpose of doing that be? They're only alerting us that they're moving."
    new "……这么做又能有什么目的？他们那样做，无非是在告诉我们有人在动而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:10629
    old "I don't know, but you should understand that hearing the elevator three times already confirms that someone moved the elevator before we started searching. It's confirming the presence of a ninth person."
    new "我不知道。但你该明白，电梯响了三次，这已经足以证明在我们开始搜查之前，就有人动过它。这等于证实了第九个人的存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:10630
    old "It couldn't have been on the fifth floor, right? It was on one of the first two.{w} Why would someone move it like that when all it does is reveal them?"
    new "它不可能停在五楼吧？它本来在一楼或二楼中的某一层。{w} 这么做只会暴露自己，谁会干这种事？"

    # game/script.rpy:10636
    old "Maybe it really was on the fifth floor... It's not completely impossible.{w} You heard it three times, Sai, and that put it below you. When we all came back here, someone got out and sent it up to the fifth before we called it. We wouldn't have heard it no matter where it was."
    new "说不定它真的一直在五楼……也不是完全没可能。{w} Sai，你听见了三次，那就说明它当时在你下面。等我们都回到这里，有人出了电梯，赶在我们叫它之前把它送上了五楼。这样一来，不管它停在哪儿，我们都听不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:10637
    old "It could also be that it moved four times and you missed one. That'd solve everything easily, excluding who moved it, of course."
    new "也可能它其实动了四次，而你漏听了一次。这样一切就都说得通了——当然，除了是谁动的之外。"

    # game/script.rpy:10642
    old "You know what I find to be the most likely scenario? That you're all deaf."
    new "你们知道我觉着最有可能的情况是什么吗？是你们全都聋了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10643
    old "These situations you're all presenting are ridiculous, so let me detail what probably happened."
    new "你们说的这些情况都荒唐得很。还是让我来讲讲大概发生了什么吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:10644
    old "When I entered the storeroom and found the Sekimeiya, the rest of you remained in this hallway, next to the elevator. Someone, probably Katei, called it here knowing it'd be unnoticeable."
    new "我进储藏室找到 Sekimeiya 的时候，你们其余的人都留在这条走廊里，就在电梯旁边。有人——多半是 Katei——把它叫到了这里，因为他知道这不会被人察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:10650
    old "Excuse me...! Are you blaming me again for something that doesn't make sense?"
    new "喂……！你又要拿这种毫无道理的事来怪我？"

    # game/script.rpy:10655
    old "Yes. It could've been Akaro, Atsuki, or Shiroya—anyone who later searched above me."
    new "没错。也可能是 Akaro、Atsuki 或 Shiroya——任何后来在我上方搜查的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:10656
    old "Maybe someone wanted to create the illusion that it was impossible for anyone above me to use the elevator. I don't know."
    new "也许有人想制造一种假象，让人觉得在我上方的人根本不可能用到电梯。谁知道呢。"

    # game/script.rpy:10659
    old "But this relies on knowing that we'd separate across the floors, all our positions, and that you'd both hear the elevator and not follow it."
    new "可这得建立在事先知道我们会分层搜查、知道我们每个人的位置，还算准了你们俩听见电梯响也不会追过去的基础上。"

    # game/script.rpy:10664
    old "Not too plausible, is it? It's also possible some hidden culprit moved it down before our search started, but the truth of the matter remains that we looked through this entire building and found nobody else. The sound we heard is no confirmation of anything."
    new "听起来不太可信吧？也有可能在我们开始搜查之前，有个藏起来的人把它调了下去。但事实就是，我们搜遍了整栋楼，谁也没找到。我们听到的声音什么也证明不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10669
    old "Once we were all in place, Katei used the elevator. He first called it up to the sixth floor, which I heard. Then, he took it down."
    new "等我们都各就各位之后，Katei 用了电梯。他先把它叫上六楼，这我听见了。然后他乘着它下来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10670
    old "Nobody saw the elevator stopping on their floor, but that's fine if he stopped here. I heard it three times no matter what happened, so that means it went down at least once. Since Erina and Isla didn't see anyone coming out, the times it went down must've been to the crystal floor.{w} Afterward, Katei took it back up, to the sixth. He knew it should've initially been on the fifth, so he sent it back there."
    new "没人看见电梯在自己那层停下，可如果他停在这一层，那也说得过去。不管怎样，我听见它响了三次，也就是说它至少下降过一次。既然 Erina 和 Isla 都没看见有人出来，那它下降的时候一定是去了水晶层。{w} 之后，Katei 又把它送回六楼。他知道它起初应该停在五楼，于是又把它送回了那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:10671
    old "That's not at all what happened, and I would've noticed that the elevator was far below me with how long it would take to arrive. I just can't wait to show you the security footage once this is all over and see the look on your face."
    new "事情根本不是这样。要是电梯离我那么远，光是等它上来花的时间就够我察觉了。等这一切结束，我迫不及待要给你看监控录像，看看你到时候是什么表情。"

    # game/script.rpy:10678
    old "I also really don't believe we would've missed the elevator three times."
    new "我也实在不信我们会漏掉三次电梯声。"

    # game/script.rpy:10681
    old "Shiroya's right. Even if it was a faint sound, we were paying attention right next to it."
    new "Shiroya 说得对。就算声音再轻，我们就在旁边留意着，不可能漏掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:10687
    old "I agree. No way we would have missed it."
    new "我同意。我们不可能漏听。"

    # game/script.rpy:10693
    old "...All I can say is that we didn't hear anything and nobody stopped on the second floor."
    new "……我只能说，我们什么都没听见，也没有人在二楼停下。"

    # game/script.rpy:10699
    old "It's clear as day, isn't it? He's just making this up."
    new "这不是明摆着吗？全是他编的。"

    # game/script.rpy:10705
    old "Most likely. The elevator was where it should've been, after all. There's probably no inconsistency."
    new "多半是这样。电梯毕竟就停在它该在的地方，大概本来就没有什么矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:10706
    old "Just in case, all of you take a hearing test after we're out. At least one of you has to be lying—that's for sure."
    new "以防万一，出去之后你们都去做个听力检查。你们当中至少有一个在撒谎——这点可以肯定。"

    # game/script.rpy:10712
    old "According to what you heard, someone got off here, right?"
    new "照你听到的，有人在这一层下了电梯吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:10713
    old "Yes, and we know what the reason would be. We didn't lock the cabinet the last time, so someone must've realized they had a free path to the Sekimeiya."
    new "对。至于原因，我们也清楚。上次我们没锁展示柜，所以一定有人意识到自己可以毫无阻碍地接近 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:10719
    old "Let's see if it's there, then. If it's not, that'll give you some credibility."
    new "那就去看看它还在不在。要是不在，你的话倒还有点可信度。"

    # game/script.rpy:10720
    old "Of course. We're in front of the stairs, so there was no reason to hurry. Let's see what we find."
    new "当然。我们就站在楼梯前，没必要赶。去看看能发现什么吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:10729
    old "That time, all of us went to the event room. We'd just looked through every single floor, and even though some things still didn't make sense, it felt pointless to guard the exit."
    new "那一次，我们全都去了活动室。我们刚把每一层都搜过一遍，虽然还有些事说不通，但守着出口也没什么意义了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10733
    old "We entered through hallway A. As soon as we set foot inside, the status of the Sekimeiya became apparent."
    new "我们从 A走廊进去。刚一踏进门，Sekimeiya 的状况就一目了然。"

    # game/script.rpy:10750
    old "See? It's still here! Nobody came down at all."
    new "看吧？它还在！根本没人下来过。"

    # game/script.rpy:10755
    old "That's what I thought. You're just trying to have a bit too much fun."
    new "我就知道。你不过是有点玩过头了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10760
    old "That's true, but I did definitely hear the elevator, so I'm not sure what happened. They might've had another reason to come here."
    new "确实。可我分明听见了电梯声，所以也说不清到底怎么回事。也许他们下来是另有目的。"

    # game/script.rpy:10765
    old "I'm confused. Do you think it was one of us or someone we still haven't found?"
    new "我有点糊涂了。你觉得是我们当中的某个人，还是我们还没找到的人？"

    # game/script.rpy:10770
    old "Who fucking knows? If it was one of us, it could have only been someone who was above me and is still lying."
    new "谁他妈知道。要是我们当中的人，那只能是当时在我上方、到现在还在撒谎的那个。"

    # game/script.rpy:10771
    old "If it was someone else, there's one extremely tight explanation: unless someone is still working with the culprit, they would need to have been inside the elevator from the beginning.{w} The elevator would've been below me and not where it was left, but then all its movements become useless."
    new "要是另有其人，那就只剩下一种极其勉强的解释：除非还有人跟犯人串通，否则那个人从一开始就得待在电梯里。{w} 那样电梯就会一直在我下方，而不是停在原来那个位置，可这样一来，它所有的移动也就毫无意义了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10774
    old "You might just be mistaken about the goal. Yes, if they wanted to come down here, there was no reason to ever send the elevator up. There's not much reason for someone to stay down here, though.{w} What you heard could've been someone going up to the attic. They get to hole up there and nobody sees anyone coming out."
    new "也许只是你把目的想错了。的确，如果那人想来这一层，就没必要把电梯往上叫。不过，也没什么理由让人待在这一层。{w} 你听见的，可能是有人上阁楼去了。只要人躲在阁楼里，就谁也不会看见有人出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:10779
    old "So this person was in the attic, which is why we didn't find them. From there, they called the empty elevator up, went down once, and finally back to the attic again. Is that it?"
    new "所以那个人一直待在阁楼里，我们才没找到他。他从那儿把空电梯叫上去，下来一次，最后又回了阁楼。是这样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:10780
    old "Maybe, but I have no idea what the purpose would be. They also would have sent it to the fifth again. It'd explain why we didn't find anyone, and nobody would have to be lying."
    new "也许吧，可我实在想不出这有什么目的。而且之后也得把电梯再送回五楼。这样一来，既能解释我们为什么谁都没找到，也不必有人撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:10785
    old "You'd all still be deaf, and why would the culprit come here from the attic if they'd been here just minutes prior? Surely this same person made the noise we heard?"
    new "那你们还是全聋了。再说，如果犯人几分钟前才来过这里，又何必从阁楼再下来一趟？我们听到的动静，难道不是同一个人弄出来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:10790
    old "This is risky anyway. If anyone from below entered the elevator before they called it back up, you could make it to the attic without the need for the key."
    new "这本来就很冒险。如果下面有人在电梯被叫回楼上之前先进了电梯，那不用钥匙也能上到阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:10791
    old "I guess so...{w} Meaning that it's really difficult to explain this unless one of us is lying."
    new "大概吧……{w} 也就是说，除非我们之中有人在撒谎，否则这件事很难解释得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:10794
    old "And conveniently, we know of someone who's been lying from the beginning."
    new "而巧的是，我们恰好知道有个人从一开始就在撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:10799
    old "Talking about yourself, or Atsuki?"
    new "你是在说你自己，还是在说 Atsuki？"

    # game/script.rpy:10804
    old "I'm not sure what to think anymore. If the Sekimeiya's still here, there's no reason to come down in such a risky manner."
    new "我已经不知道该怎么想了。既然 Sekimeiya 还在这里，就没理由用那么冒险的方式下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:10805
    old "Unfortunately, even though I was allowed to reason things out with time travel in mind, it didn't make them any easier. The issue of the motive was just as hard to settle despite the fact that I could create even more theories."
    new "遗憾的是，就算我把时间穿越考虑进去，事情也没变得更容易。尽管我能提出更多理论，动机的问题还是同样难以确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:10806
    old "I could suppose that someone was inside the elevator on the crystal floor and went to the attic. Then, the same person time traveled to the crystal floor. They wanted to go to the attic again, so they called the elevator and went back up.{w} It had significant risk, but it was another way to justify the likely truth of being lied to."
    new "我可以这样假设：有人在水晶层进了电梯，上到阁楼。随后，同一个人穿越时间，回到了水晶层。因为想再去阁楼，就叫来电梯又上去了一趟。{w} 这样做风险不小，但也可以换个角度解释：我们确实很可能被人骗了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10807
    old "Sai looked at his watch and turned his wrist to show us the time. It was {time=11:20}, and right above it, the date was also shown: 2011-12-15."
    new "Sai 看了看表，把手腕转过来给我们看时间。上面显示 {time=11:20}，正上方还标着日期：2011-12-15。"

    # game/script.rpy:10812
    old "...It's been a pretty eventful couple hours. I wonder if we'll be able to figure everything out before our time runs out."
    new "……这两个小时还真是多事。不知道我们能不能在时间耗尽之前把一切弄清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:10817
    old "Who cares about that? The police will investigate what happened a lot better than we can. We shouldn't keep overstepping this much."
    new "谁管那个？事情经过，警方会查得比我们清楚得多。我们不该再这样越界了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10822
    old "They'll definitely question all of us. Not every camera works, so their understanding of what happens here will depend pretty heavily on our testimony."
    new "他们肯定会挨个盘问我们。摄像头不是每个都好用，所以要弄清这里发生了什么，很大程度上得靠我们的证词。"

    # game/script.rpy:10828
    old "Isla, whose mood had greatly diminished over time, was quietly looking at the Sekimeiya through the glass. Her friend's prediction ended up entirely incorrect, and Erina made an attempt to comfort her."
    new "Isla 的心情早已低落下去，只是隔着玻璃静静望着 Sekimeiya。她朋友的预言彻底落了空，Erina 试着安慰她。"

    # game/script.rpy:10830
    old "Right as the atmosphere seemed to calm down a bit, something that we'd already experienced repeated itself."
    new "气氛才稍稍缓和，那件我们已经经历过的事却又重演了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:10836
    old "The Third Law"
    new "第三定律"

    # game/script.rpy:10846
    old "What the hell was that...!?"
    new "刚才那到底是什么……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:10851
    old "I think it was a door closing again, but slightly quieter."
    new "应该又是关门声，不过比上次轻一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:10852
    old "We had no time to rest. We knew that a foreign sound implied another long search if we didn't get results immediately."
    new "我们没工夫歇息。我们知道，这陌生的声响意味着：若不能立刻查出结果，就又要耗上一轮漫长的搜查。"

    # game/script.rpy:10860
    old "Since it hadn't come from close by, we didn't rush out like the previous time. Instead, Sai approached hallway A and opened the door."
    new "这次声音不是从近处传来的，我们便没有像上次那样冲出去。Sai 走到 A走廊前，推开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:10865
    old "We can see the exit from hallway A. Splitting up was useless last time and only caused more questions, so let's stick together while making sure the exit is being guarded."
    new "从 A走廊能看到出口。上次分头行动毫无用处，反而多出一堆疑问，这次就一起走，同时确保出口有人守着。"

    # game/script.rpy:10866
    old "For the first sound, we'd all rushed to the right door because it seemed like it came from hallway B. However, the location of what we'd just heard was harder to discern."
    new "第一次听到声响时，我们都朝右边的门冲去，因为那声音像是从 B走廊传来的。可刚才这一声，却很难判断方位。"

    # game/script.rpy:10875
    old "We'll stay next to the stairs."
    new "我们守在楼梯旁边。"

    # game/script.rpy:10876
    old "Isla didn't object. She already understood that we weren't playing around.{w} The procedure of opening every room started once again."
    new "Isla 没有反对。她早已明白，我们不是在闹着玩。{w}于是，我们又开始逐个开门检查了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10877
    old "Since the sound was distant, it was very possible the source was no longer on our floor. Regardless, we couldn't move any faster because so many rooms had cabinets where a person could hide."
    new "声音既然来自远处，源头很可能已经不在这一层。可即便如此，我们也快不起来——太多房间里都有能藏人的展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:10885
    old "Every door in hallway A was opened and closed until we acknowledged each room was empty. Since Erina and Isla were by the stairs, we moved on to hallway B after Akaro claimed the mechanical room was vacant too."
    new "我们反复开关A走廊的每一扇门，直到确认每一间房都是空的。Erina 和 Isla 还守在楼梯旁，Akaro 也说机械室里没人，我们便转向了 B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:10892
    old "We didn't relent despite quickly running out of rooms. The last time we'd gotten complacent, a body had suddenly appeared.{w} The event room, acting as the midpoint of the hallway, still stored the Sekimeiya. ...If a culprit remained with us, they were trapped within the few last rooms."
    new "能查的房间很快见了底，我们却没有松劲。上次正是因为松懈，尸体才忽然出现。{w}位于走廊中段的活动室里仍存放着 Sekimeiya。……如果凶手还混在我们中间，那他就被困在最后这几间房里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:10894
    old "However, nothing was found inside them. The room where Naomi had died, the last crystal rooms, the staff room, and the cleaning room were all devoid of life."
    new "然而这些房间里一无所获。Naomi 死去的房间、最后几间水晶展室、员工室和清洁间，全都不见人影。"

    # game/script.rpy:10901
    old "How does this keep happening!? There must be someone else here!"
    new "怎么会一而再、再而三地出事！？这里肯定还有别人！"

    # game/script.rpy:10906
    old "Maybe it's a ghost?"
    new "说不定是鬼？"

    # game/script.rpy:10911
    old "A ghost, huh? That'd explain a lot."
    new "鬼啊……这么一说，倒能解释不少事。"

    # game/script.rpy:10917
    old "Ghosts don't exist. This is two times we've heard a noise, so it's clear a person caused them."
    new "鬼是不存在的。这已经是第二次听到动静了，显然是人弄出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:10918
    old "I figured Isla was serious. We were chasing behind someone who could vanish, make sounds without being seen, commit crimes in front of security cameras, and create innumerable questions doing so."
    new "我猜 Isla 是认真的。我们追在后面的那个人，能凭空消失，能在无人看见时弄出动静，能在监控摄像头前作案，还顺手留下一堆解不开的疑问。"

    # game/script.rpy:10923
    old "Do we actually have to investigate upstairs again? Why don't we stop playing with the culprit and let the police handle this?"
    new "我们真得再上楼搜一遍？何必还陪凶手玩下去，交给警察处理不就行了？"

    # game/script.rpy:10924
    old "Because I'm not fond of that idea. They made a sound twice and then disappeared. They must be conscious of what they're doing, so let's go up again without splitting up. We'll leave the elevator open here so that they can't use it."
    new "因为我不喜欢这个主意。对方弄出两次声响，随后就消失不见。他做这些事肯定是有意为之，所以再上楼一趟，别再分头。电梯就保持在这一层敞着门，让他没法用。"

    # game/script.rpy:10931
    old "Wait...{w} We're forgetting one place again."
    new "等等……{w}我们又漏掉了一个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:10932
    old "Are we?{w} ...Oh, right. The bathrooms."
    new "漏了吗？{w}……哦，对了，厕所。"

    # game/script.rpy:10942
    old "...That's true. And nobody could've left them yet."
    new "……确实。而且这段时间没人能从那里面出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:10943
    old "The map indicated that the left door was the women's and the right one the men's. We walked up to them while Erina and Isla blocked access to the other floors."
    new "地图上标着，左边是女厕，右边是男厕。我们走上前去，Erina 和 Isla 则守着通往其他楼层的路。"

    # game/script.rpy:10945
    old "Shiroya went ahead and opened the women's bathroom; it was completely empty."
    new "Shiroya 上前打开女厕的门，里面空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:10948
    old "Then, Sai grabbed the opposite knob and turned it to open its door.{w}{w=0.5} ...He seemed to be having trouble."
    new "接着，Sai 握住另一扇门的把手，想要拧开。{w}{w=0.5}……他似乎拧不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:10955
    old "...I don't think I can open this."
    new "……这扇门我打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:10964
    old "What? Is the door locked?"
    new "什么？门锁上了？"

    # game/script.rpy:10965
    old "It could be. You can lock it from the inside without a key."
    new "有可能。里面不用钥匙也能反锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:10970
    old "Are you sure it's locked? Try turning it the other way."
    new "你确定是锁了？换个方向拧拧看。"

    # game/script.rpy:10971
    old "Sai didn't even try it. He was clearly sure it wouldn't open and caught the implication of what Katei said."
    new "Sai 连试都没试。他显然确信门打不开，也听懂了 Katei 那句话里的意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:10977
    old "There's someone inside...?"
    new "里面有人……？"

    # game/script.rpy:10982
    old "I-I suppose there must be.{w} Hey! Open the door, you don't have any way to escape!"
    new "大、大概吧。{w}喂！开门，你逃不掉的！"

    # game/script.rpy:10983
    old "We'd all seen the interior of that bathroom once before. There was nothing that could serve as a way out, so even if someone inside intended to wait us out, the police would end up breaking the door down."
    new "那间厕所里面，我们之前都看过一次。没有任何能当出口的地方，所以就算里面的人想跟我们耗下去，最后也只会等来警察破门。"

    # game/script.rpy:10987
    old "Sai crouched, trying to see through the gap."
    new "Sai 蹲下身，想从门缝往里看。"

    # game/script.rpy:10992
    old "There's barely any space. I was hoping I could see shoes or something."
    new "缝太窄了。我还想着能看见鞋子什么的。"

    # game/script.rpy:10993
    old "Can you open the door for us, Katei?"
    new "Katei，你能帮我们把门打开吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:10998
    old "Hm... Now that you mention it, I might be able to."
    new "嗯……你这么一说，我倒也许有办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:11001
    old "There was a keyhole next to the doorknob, so it was possible to unlock the door without the manual inner lock."
    new "门把手旁边有个锁孔，所以不用碰里面的手动锁，也能从外面开锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:11006
    old "There's a key that unlocks all the bathrooms. We have it in case an accident happens or someone locks themselves inside for too long, but I've never used it."
    new "有一把钥匙能打开所有厕所的门。备着是为了应对意外，或者有人把自己锁在里面太久，不过我一直没用过。"

    # game/script.rpy:11011
    old "Which also means that someone with that key could've locked the door from outside."
    new "也就是说，拿着那把钥匙的人，也可能从外面把门锁上。"

    # game/script.rpy:11012
    old "Yes. It's not a guarantee that someone is still inside."
    new "对。所以不能保证里面一定还有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:11013
    old "Every employee should have a key. I'll go check if I can find one in the security room. I think I recall seeing it in a drawer."
    new "每个员工都应该有一把。我去监控室看看能不能找到，印象里好像在抽屉里见过。"

    # game/script.rpy:11014
    old "Okay. We'll wait here."
    new "好，我们在这儿等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:11017
    old "Katei went off to hallway A while the rest of us remained in front of the door."
    new "Katei 朝 A走廊去了，其余人留在门前。"

    # game/script.rpy:11027
    old "I'll bring this to the security room. I don't want it to stay here."
    new "这个我拿去监控室。我不想把它留在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:11031
    old "On his way, he grabbed the empty suitcase and disappeared with it. It didn't seem like a bad idea, because it would make it harder for the culprit if they wanted to retrieve it at some point."
    new "他顺路拎起那只空手提箱，一并带走了。这主意倒不坏——凶手日后若想取回箱子，就没那么容易了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11039
    old "...So, if there's nobody inside, it'll mean that Naomi's killer likely took the bathroom key from her alongside the cabinet's."
    new "……也就是说，如果里面没人，那杀害 Naomi 的凶手多半是从她身上拿走了洗手间和展示柜的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:11044
    old "And you think Katei did it, right?"
    new "你觉得是 Katei 干的，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:11045
    old "If I had to pick somebody, it'd be him. I wonder if he had the key on him the whole time and wants to act like he found it in the security room."
    new "真要挑一个人的话，只能是他。我在想，会不会钥匙一直就在他身上，他却想装成是在监控室找到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:11051
    old "Didn't he ask to search everyone earlier? We could've found it."
    new "他之前不是还提出要搜所有人的身吗？那样说不定就能找到钥匙了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11056
    old "Yes, but at that point, this door wasn't locked yet. He might not have planned to use it later, and even if we found it, he could have lied to us about what it was."
    new "话是这么说，可那时这扇门还没锁。他未必打算之后再用那把钥匙；就算我们找到了，他也能随便编个说法，把钥匙说成别的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:11061
    old "But he couldn't have locked this door, could he? That had to be related to the sound we just heard."
    new "可这扇门不可能是他锁的吧？那肯定和我们刚才听到的声音有关。"

    # game/script.rpy:11066
    old "He definitely had a chance. It's likely someone above floor 3 took the elevator here, remember? Katei was on floor 6 and is the most likely person to have killed Naomi."
    new "他绝对有机会。还记得吗？很可能是 3 楼以上的某个人坐电梯下来的。Katei 当时在 6 楼，是最有可能杀害 Naomi 的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:11067
    old "He just said that every employee has one of these keys, so whoever locked the door could have gotten it from somewhere else."
    new "他刚说过每个员工都有这种钥匙，所以锁门的人完全可能从别处弄到一把。"

    # game/script.rpy:11070
    old "That's true, but everything keeps casting more and more doubt on Katei. First, let's see if anyone's inside. If we don't find anyone, Katei will be the most likely suspect once again."
    new "的确如此，可所有迹象都在不断加深对 Katei 的怀疑。先看看里面有没有人吧。要是没找到人，Katei 就又会成为最有可能的嫌疑人。"

    # game/script.rpy:11076
    old "...Why do you think so? Even if nobody's inside, he must've been trying to hide something by locking this door. He wouldn't have told us how to unlock it."
    new "……你为什么这么想？就算里面没人，他锁这扇门也一定是为了藏什么。他本来可不会把开锁的方法告诉我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:11081
    old "Assuming he comes back with the key. The other possibility is that we're still dealing with an unknown person, someone who took the key off Naomi and wants us to spend a while in front of an empty bathroom..."
    new "前提是他真会带着钥匙回来。另一种可能是，我们面对的还是那个不明身份的人——他从 Naomi 身上拿走了钥匙，想让我们在一间空洗手间前白耗一阵子……"

    # game/script.rpy:11088
    old "Hm... It's the smell again..."
    new "嗯……又是那股味道……"

    # game/script.rpy:11094
    old "Smell? ...Oh, you're right. It's hard to tell, but it's there. The same as before."
    new "味道？……哦，你说得对。虽然不太明显，但确实有。和之前一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:11100
    old "You say that, but I don't think it ever faded away. I've been noticing it the entire time I looked through these rooms."
    new "话是这么说，可我觉得它压根就没散过。我在这些房间里查看时，一直都闻得到。"

    # game/script.rpy:11110
    old "We all visibly sniffed the air. I didn't notice it greatly, but I could somewhat pick out the strange smell from before. Shortly after that, we spotted Katei coming from the hallway. As soon as he made eye contact with us, he showed us a silver key in his hand."
    new "我们几个人都不约而同地嗅了嗅空气。我闻得并不真切，但多少能分辨出之前那股怪味。没过多久，我们看见 Katei 从走廊那边走来。他一和我们对上视线，就亮出了手里的一把银色钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:11117
    old "I was... not doing too well the first time we noticed it, but I feel like I've smelled this before."
    new "第一次闻到的时候，我……状态不太好，但我总觉得自己以前闻过这个味道。"

    # game/script.rpy:11118
    old "Really...? I don't feel that way at all."
    new "真的吗……？我完全没这种感觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:11124
    old "I think it's this one."
    new "应该是这一把。"

    # game/script.rpy:11130
    old "Hm, it's not like any that Naomi had."
    new "嗯，和 Naomi 的那些钥匙都不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:11135
    old "Oh? Of course not. This doesn't mean that her key must've been stolen, if that's what you're thinking. I doubt any employee would always have theirs, seeing as we never need them."
    new "哦？那当然。如果你是在想她的钥匙一定被偷了，那可不见得。我们从来用不上这些钥匙，我不觉得会有哪个员工一直带在身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:11141
    old "Fine. Just try to open the door."
    new "好吧。你试着开一下门。"

    # game/script.rpy:11144
    old "Katei sighed and inserted the key. It turned, showing that he'd picked the correct one.{w} The door made a clearly audible sound, and Katei proceeded to gently open it."
    new "Katei 叹了口气，把钥匙插了进去。钥匙转动了，说明他选对了。{w} 门发出一声清晰可闻的响动，随后 Katei 轻轻把门推开。"

    # game/script.rpy:11159
    old "Once we saw what awaited inside, all of us froze, failing to comprehend what we were looking at."
    new "看清里面的景象后，我们全都僵住了，一时无法理解眼前所见。"

    # game/script.rpy:11165
    old "What the fuck...?"
    new "这他妈是怎么回事……？"

    # game/script.rpy:11166
    old "Th-This is impossible..."
    new "这、这不可能……"

    # game/script.rpy:11168
    old "We all must've experienced a strong feeling of déjà vu.{w} On the floor of the men's bathroom lay Naomi's unmoving body."
    new "我们所有人一定都产生了强烈的既视感。{w} 男洗手间的地板上，躺着 Naomi 一动不动的尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:11175
    old "Instinctively, Erina ushered Isla aside, but she had already seen what was in the room."
    new "Erina 本能地把 Isla 拉到一旁，可她已经看见了房间里的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:11180
    old "...Why the hell would anyone lock her body in here?"
    new "……到底为什么会有人把她的尸体锁在这里面？"

    # game/script.rpy:11185
    old "...Lock her body in? Didn't we just look at it a second ago?"
    new "……把她的尸体锁起来？我们刚才不是才看过吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:11186
    old "She was right. We'd entered the room where Naomi died and seen her."
    new "她说得没错。我们进过 Naomi 遇害的那个房间，还看到了她。"

    # game/script.rpy:11187
    old "Or had we? Had we perhaps only seen the curtain that should've been covering her...? Everyone else was likely thinking the same, but Sai instructed us to take it slow."
    new "又或者，我们真的看到了吗？也许我们看见的，只是那块原本该盖住她的遮布……？其他人多半也都在这么想，但 Sai 让我们先别急。"

    # game/script.rpy:11192
    old "Hold on. We can see that room from here, so there's no point in running to it. There's no security camera in the bathroom, so we need to make sure we don't miss anything right now."
    new "等等。从这里就能看到那个房间，没必要跑过去。洗手间里没有监控摄像头，所以现在绝不能漏掉任何细节。"

    # game/script.rpy:11196
    old "It felt like a pointless attempt, but I crouched to check Naomi's pulse like Sai did the first time.{w} I felt nothing."
    new "我知道这多半是徒劳，但还是蹲下去探了探 Naomi 的脉搏，就像 Sai 第一次那样。{w} 我什么也没摸到。"

    # game/script.rpy:11201
    old "What are you doing? Did you think she might've revived?"
    new "你在做什么？你以为她还能活过来？"

    # game/script.rpy:11202
    old "No... but this isn't right. There should be a bit of blood oozing from her, shouldn't there? But there's none. And the floor... it's completely clean."
    new "不是……但这不对劲。她身上多少应该渗点血出来吧？可一滴都没有。还有地板……也干干净净。"

    # game/script.rpy:11207
    old "What...? You're right—there's no blood at all."
    new "什么……？你说得对——一点血都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:11212
    old "At least this confirms that the lock wasn't set from the inside. Someone locked her inside with the key."
    new "至少这能确认，锁不是从里面上的。是有人用钥匙把她锁在了里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:11213
    old "There's nothing else here... We need to check the other body."
    new "这里没有别的了……我们得去看看另一具尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:11224
    old "We all ran to room B4 except for Erina and Isla, who stayed guarding the bathrooms and in sight of the stairs. In hallway B, in front of the event room, Naomi had died. We'd left her body under a curtain to preserve her dignity..."
    new "我们都跑去了 B4房间，只有 Erina 和 Isla 留在洗手间旁看守，同时待在能看见楼梯的位置。Naomi 死在 B走廊的活动室门前。为了保全她的体面，我们把尸体留在了遮布下……"

    # game/script.rpy:11225
    old "Sai forcibly opened the door. In very quick succession, another impossibility immediately appeared before us."
    new "Sai 用力推开门。紧接着，又一件不可能的事立刻出现在我们眼前。"

    # game/script.rpy:11229
    old "The cloth's sides had been tainted by blood, which was all around it. In the middle of the huge, red circle was a bulge the size of a human."
    new "遮布边缘被血浸染，四周也全是血。那个巨大的红色圆圈中央，有一块人形大小的隆起。"

    # game/script.rpy:11234
    old "It can't be... She's still here."
    new "不可能……她还在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:11236
    old "We couldn't form a response. Her body was still beneath the curtain."
    new "我们谁也说不出话来。她的尸体仍盖在遮布下面。"

    # game/script.rpy:11242
    old "It appears Atsuki was correct, then. Something very out of the ordinary is going on."
    new "看来 Atsuki 说对了。眼下发生的事非同寻常。"

    # game/script.rpy:11243
    old "Sai ran out of breath at the end of his sentence. Not even he could easily fathom it."
    new "Sai 说到最后，气息都有些不稳。即便是他，也没法轻易想明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:11246
    old "He approached the body and gently removed the curtain from it. The result was what we'd expected, yet it still seemed impossible. Naomi's corpse hadn't moved in the slightest."
    new "他走近尸体，轻轻掀开遮布。结果和我们预想的一样，却仍旧显得难以置信。Naomi 的尸体一动也没动过。"

    # game/script.rpy:11249
    old "What the hell is this...?"
    new "这到底是怎么回事……？"

    # game/script.rpy:11254
    old "Katei, let's get this out of the way. Does Naomi have a fucking twin?"
    new "Katei，先把话说清楚。Naomi 是不是他妈有个双胞胎？"

    # game/script.rpy:11259
    old "U-Um... Not that I know. I wasn't close enough to her."
    new "呃、嗯……据我所知没有。我和她没那么熟。"

    # game/script.rpy:11260
    old "A-A twin wouldn't explain this. Look here."
    new "双、双胞胎也解释不了这个。你看这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:11261
    old "Her suit had a product label by its neck, containing four numbers."
    new "她这件防护服的领口处贴着一张产品标签，上面印着四个数字。"

    # game/script.rpy:11266
    old "63-22? Was it the same in the bathroom?"
    new "63-22？浴室里那件也是这个号吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:11267
    old "...Yes. I saw it when I felt for her pulse. Katei, you know Ashiya. Is that just a model number or something?"
    new "……对。我探她脉搏时看到的。Katei，你熟悉芦屋的产品吧。这会不会只是型号之类的编号？"

    # game/script.rpy:11272
    old "...It isn't. Those are individual product run numbers."
    new "……不是。那些是单件产品的生产流水号。"

    # game/script.rpy:11273
    old "Then this is the exact same suit."
    new "那这就是同一件防护服。"

    # game/script.rpy:11279
    old "So there's... no doubt that Atsuki was telling the truth. The killer used the Sekimeiya's powers to do this."
    new "这么说……Atsuki 没说谎。凶手是用 Sekimeiya 的力量做到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:11281
    old "Katei could no longer deny it; two identical dead bodies had appeared before him."
    new "两具一模一样的尸体就摆在眼前，Katei 再也无从否认。"

    # game/script.rpy:11286
    old "The Sekimeiya was still in the cabinet, so they must've returned it..."
    new "Sekimeiya 还在展示柜里，那他们应该是把它放回去了……"

    # game/script.rpy:11287
    old "...A-All right. According to you guys, the Sekimeiya made Atsuki time travel. How would traveling through time lead to this?"
    new "……好、好吧。按你们的说法，是 Sekimeiya 让 Atsuki 穿越了时间。可时间穿越怎么会造成这种事？"

    # game/script.rpy:11292
    old "We don't know how it works. There might be more to it than it first seemed, but just consider this... What would happen if you tried to make a dead body time travel?"
    new "它到底怎么运作，我们也不清楚。也许内情比表面看到的更复杂。不过你们想一想……如果让一具尸体穿越时间，会怎么样？"

    # game/script.rpy:11293
    old "Normally, you'd think nothing would happen, but what if the dead body actually traveled through time?"
    new "一般来说，大概会觉得什么都不会发生。可万一尸体真的穿越了呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:11299
    old "Y-Yeah... Someone might've made Naomi's body time travel by touching it with the Sekimeiya."
    new "对、对啊……也许有人用 Sekimeiya 碰了 Naomi 的尸体，让她穿越了时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:11300
    old "If they knew Naomi would appear in the bathroom, they could've locked it preemptively. If not, maybe they just moved the identical body inside and locked it. That has to be related to that noise we heard."
    new "如果凶手事先知道 Naomi 会出现在浴室，就能提前把门锁上。否则，也许他只是把那具一模一样的尸体搬进去，再锁上门。这一定和我们听到的那声响有关。"

    # game/script.rpy:11305
    old "An identical body... We should inspect it more thoroughly. We don't know what happened, but that other Naomi might have something important on her."
    new "一模一样的尸体……我们得再仔细检查一遍。虽然不知道发生了什么，但那个 Naomi 身上也许带着什么要紧的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:11313
    old "We didn't have much else we could do to figure anything out, so we went back to the bathroom."
    new "除此之外，我们也没有别的办法查明什么，只好回到浴室。"

    # game/script.rpy:11318
    old "The other Naomi hadn't moved."
    new "另一个 Naomi 依旧一动不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:11323
    old "Let me check..."
    new "让我看看……"

    # game/script.rpy:11325
    old "I watched Sai carefully to make sure he couldn't do anything in secret. All he did was check every pocket, and they were all empty."
    new "我紧盯着 Sai，提防他暗中动手脚。可他只是把每个口袋都翻了一遍，里面空空如也。"

    # game/script.rpy:11330
    old "Huh... She doesn't have any keys. Not even the keys that the other body had."
    new "咦……她身上没有钥匙。连另一具尸体身上的那些钥匙也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:11331
    old "So that theory was probably wrong. If whoever did this created an identical body in the past, it would've had the same keys."
    new "看来那个推测多半不成立。如果凶手是在过去造出了一具一模一样的尸体，那它应该也带着同样的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:11336
    old "I-If that's how it worked... I'd think so."
    new "如、如果真是那样……我想应该是吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:11341
    old "Couldn't the culprit just have taken them?"
    new "会不会只是凶手把钥匙拿走了？"

    # game/script.rpy:11342
    old "But why? They didn't take them from the original body."
    new "可为什么呢？他们可没从原来那具尸体上拿走钥匙啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:11345
    old "There are two more things that don't hold up.{w} The clothes are the first. If Naomi's body traveled to the past, her clothes would've been stained with blood, just like they were at the time it traveled.{w} And second: you all saw me vanish when it happened to me, right? If the same thing happened to Naomi, the first body should've disappeared."
    new "还有两点说不通。{w}第一是衣服。如果 Naomi 的尸体穿越到了过去，衣服上应该带着穿越那一刻的血迹。{w}第二：那件事发生在我身上时，你们都亲眼看到我消失了吧？如果 Naomi 也一样，那第一具尸体就该消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11352
    old "Technically, with how little we knew, my points could've still been refuted."
    new "不过严格说来，凭我们知道的这点东西，我提出的疑点仍有可能被驳倒。"

    # game/script.rpy:11353
    old "\"What if the replica of the body only takes into consideration the state of the body in the past?\"{w} With the way I'd traveled, I couldn't be sure whether my then-present body had teleported into the past, or if the body I'd arrived in was identical to how it was at the point in time I appeared."
    new "「如果复制出的尸体只还原它在过去那一时刻的状态呢？」{w} 以我自己的穿越经历，我分不清到底是当时的那具身体穿越回了过去，还是我抵达的那具身体，只是和我出现那一刻的状态一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:11354
    old "If Naomi had gone back to the past far enough, to a point before her death, her clothes might've been clean. Even though she was alive at that point, if the body that had traveled was dead, she probably would've appeared dead in the past. ...Otherwise, she would have come back to life."
    new "如果 Naomi 回到足够远的过去，远在她死之前，那她的衣服也许就是干净的。即便她在那个时间点还活着，只要穿越过去的是尸体，她在过去大概也会以死人的样子出现。……否则，她就会活过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:11357
    old "It also implied that the second body had been with us in the tower before we'd found the first one and had only just been shown to us. ...Given how we'd been unable to find the culprit, it couldn't be ruled out."
    new "这也意味着，第二具尸体在我们发现第一具之前，就一直待在塔里，只是刚刚才出现在我们眼前。……既然我们始终找不到凶手，这种可能也无法排除。"

    # game/script.rpy:11358
    old "Is there another way to make this work? I've thought of a few things involving time travel, but now we have no other choice. There's nothing else that could begin to explain this, so what I went through has to be related to the truth of what happened."
    new "还有别的解释能说得通吗？我想到过几种与时间穿越有关的可能，可现在已别无选择。除此之外，再没有别的东西能勉强解释这一切，所以我亲身经历的事，必然与事情的真相有关。"

    # game/script.rpy:11359
    old "This body is dead, but there's no blood around it. Could it be that she appeared dead from the future and that's why no blood is anywhere? That her body is as it was when she was alive, yet her true state is from after her death?"
    new "这具尸体已经死了，周围却没有血迹。她会不会是死后才从未来出现的，所以哪里都没有血？身体还是她活着时的样子，实际状态却来自她死之后？"

    # game/script.rpy:11362
    old "The only other thing I can think of slightly contradicts my own experience, but it'd sound more believable if not for that."
    new "我唯一还能想到的另一种可能，与我的亲身经历稍有矛盾。若没有这一点，它反倒更让人信服。"

    # game/script.rpy:11363
    old "It would only require the past to be malleable. I didn't personally change anything when I traveled back in time, but that's not enough reason to think that's impossible."
    new "那只需要假设过去是可以被改写的。我自己穿越回去时没有改变任何事，但仅凭这一点，还不能断定那种事不可能发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:11364
    old "What if Naomi traveled back in time when she was alive? Two of them would've existed in the past. Then, all the culprit needed to do was kill both of them."
    new "如果 Naomi 是在活着的时候穿越回过去的呢？那样过去就会同时存在两个她。凶手只要把这两个都杀掉就行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11365
    old "This should never be possible; it's a paradox. By killing the Naomi who will travel to the past, you're making it impossible for the new one to exist."
    new "这按理说绝不可能发生，那是个悖论。杀掉那个将要穿越回过去的 Naomi，就等于让新出现的那个无法存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:11366
    old "But I don't know if these kinds of paradoxes exist. What if Naomi's actions upon traveling made it impossible for her initial self to travel? Two of them would permanently exist at the same time, and us finding two dead bodies would work."
    new "可我不知道这类悖论是否真的存在。假如 Naomi 穿越后的所作所为，让她最初的那个自己无法再穿越呢？那样两个她就会永久并存，我们找到两具尸体也就说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11369
    old "However, if this isn't a possible occurrence in our universe, I can't think of anything else. The mere fact that traveling makes your body instantly disappear means that, without paradoxes, two of the same person couldn't exist at once as corpses."
    new "不过，如果这种事在我们的世界里根本不可能发生，我就再也想不出别的解释了。光是穿越会让身体瞬间消失这一点，就说明在没有悖论的前提下，同一个人不可能同时以两具尸体的形式存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:11370
    old "To circumvent the paradox, I can suppose that a dead body can travel to the past and create a new dead body. This still hits the barrier of \"the original body should've disappeared as soon as it traveled\", but it's not absolute: maybe the first dead body will travel back in the future, and that's why it's still there."
    new "为了绕过这个悖论，我可以假设尸体也能穿越回过去，并造出一具新的尸体。这仍然绕不开「原本的尸体一穿越就该消失」这一点，不过也并非绝对：也许第一具尸体将来会穿越回去，所以它至今还留在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:11371
    old "And on top of all this, there has to be a motive. A motive for all of this to be happening. For a culprit to create this mess, to kill the same person twice, and for something with time traveling powers to be publicly exposed in this place. Is Xyn actually behind it...?"
    new "况且，这一切背后必定有动机。让这一切发生的动机。凶手为什么要制造这场混乱，为什么要把同一个人杀死两次，又为什么要把拥有时间穿越之力的东西在这个地方公之于众。难道幕后真是 Xyn……？"

    # game/script.rpy:11382
    old "Nobody had said anything in a while. We were all dumbfounded, staring at the impossible image."
    new "好一阵子，谁都没有开口。我们全都愣在原地，盯着那幅本不该存在的画面。"

    # game/script.rpy:11388
    old "Hm, that's interesting.{w} She has a bump on the back of her head. It's similar to her other body, but blood's not coming out of this one."
    new "嗯，有意思。{w}她后脑上有一块肿包。和她另一具身体的情况相似，可这具没有流血。"

    # game/script.rpy:11389
    old "...Is that so?{w} Then this body isn't the same as when she was alive despite the lack of blood."
    new "……是吗？{w}那么，这具尸体虽然没流血，状态却和她活着时并不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:11394
    old "Let's go test it. Let's try to understand how the Sekimeiya works."
    new "去验证一下吧。试着弄清 Sekimeiya 是怎么运作的。"

    # game/script.rpy:11402
    old "Hey! Stop!"
    new "喂！站住！"

    # game/script.rpy:11406
    old "But Sai continued toward the event room, housing what we believed to be the center of every mystery."
    new "可 Sai 继续朝活动室走去，而那里正是我们认定的一切谜团的核心。"

    # game/script.rpy:11407
    old "None of us wanted to stop him. Instead, we ran behind him, forcing Katei to follow us."
    new "我们谁也没打算拦他，反而跟在他身后跑了起来，Katei 也只得跟上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:11414
    old "We entered the room at the same time and saw the Sekimeiya still in the cabinet."
    new "我们同时走进房间，看见 Sekimeiya 仍在展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:11419
    old "It's good that we didn't lock this. Only the culprit has the key, so it only hurts us."
    new "幸好我们没把这个锁上。钥匙只有凶手才有，锁上只会对我们不利。"

    # game/script.rpy:11424
    old "Sai, you'll get all of us in trouble..."
    new "Sai，你这样会让我们都惹上麻烦的……"

    # game/script.rpy:11429
    old "What might get us in trouble is the murderer that's somewhere in this place. If something happens to the Sekimeiya, it's their fault."
    new "会给我们惹上麻烦的，是藏在这地方某处的凶手。Sekimeiya 要是出了什么事，那也是他们的责任。"

    # game/script.rpy:11434
    old "He proceeded to scroll down the glass and then took the Sekimeiya out."
    new "他接着把玻璃罩滑下，将 Sekimeiya 取了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:11439
    old "We stared at him as he held it in his hands. He remained nonchalant, and there was no reaction."
    new "他把 Sekimeiya 捧在手里，我们全都盯着他。他依旧神色淡然，什么反应也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:11444
    old "Nothing?"
    new "什么都没发生？"

    # game/script.rpy:11449
    old "Maybe I just cloned myself in the past—who's to know? I'm clearly still here, though."
    new "也许我只是在过去复制了一个自己——谁知道呢？不过我可还好端端站在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:11451
    old "Without asking, he dropped it between my hands. It was really cold, and it didn't send me anywhere. Its color wasn't changing either."
    new "他问也不问，就把它丢到我两手之间。那东西凉得很，却没有把我送去任何地方，颜色也没有变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:11456
    old "I don't understand it. Maybe the Sekimeiya didn't do anything and something else is the actual cause of this phenomenon."
    new "我搞不懂。也许 Sekimeiya 根本什么也没做，造成这种现象的其实是别的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:11461
    old "But it changed colors, right? Both when Atsuki touched it and when we put it here."
    new "可它变过颜色，对吧？Atsuki 碰到它的时候，还有我们把它放上去的时候，都变了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11466
    old "Let's keep it outside. We'll see if it happens again."
    new "先把它放在外面吧。看看还会不会再发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:11471
    old "I won't allow that.{w} I couldn't stop you from getting it out, but you only proved that the Sekimeiya isn't at all related to what's going on. Put it back in."
    new "我不允许。{w}我拦不住你们把它取出来，可你们恰恰证明了 Sekimeiya 与眼下的状况毫无干系。放回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:11472
    old "Mind if I go poke Naomi's body with it first? Something could happen."
    new "不介意我先拿它去碰一碰 Naomi 的尸体吧？说不定会有什么反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:11473
    old "You're losing your mind. That'd be beyond disgraceful."
    new "你简直是昏了头。那样做就太不成体统了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11474
    old "Katei took the Sekimeiya from my hands and put it in its cabinet."
    new "Katei 从我手里拿过 Sekimeiya，放回了展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:11483
    old "Oh... I might've realized something."
    new "哦……我好像想明白了一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:11488
    old "What is it?"
    new "什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:11489
    old "It's not directly related to the Sekimeiya, but I just remembered something when you mentioned touching Naomi's body."
    new "和 Sekimeiya 没有直接关系，不过你刚才说到去碰 Naomi 的尸体，让我想起了一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:11490
    old "They all waited for me to continue and reveal something important, but I wasn't sure if I was right. Instead, I took off toward the room with the original body of Naomi."
    new "他们都在等我接着说，等我说出什么重要的事，可我自己也不确定猜得对不对。于是我干脆转身，朝放着 Naomi 原本遗体的房间走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:11501
    old "I was followed in. Inside, I kneeled beside the body and looked around it."
    new "他们跟了进来。我在遗体旁跪下，四下查看。"

    # game/script.rpy:11506
    old "...What are you doing?"
    new "……你在做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:11507
    old "Good, it's still here."
    new "很好，还在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:11508
    old "I showed them the result of my successful search: the keyring we'd found in one of Naomi's pockets."
    new "我把搜寻的成果亮给他们看——那串从 Naomi 的某个口袋里找到的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:11514
    old "What about this? Do you know what they're for?"
    new "那这个呢？你知道这些钥匙是开哪儿的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:11519
    old "...Oh! Of course, this big one..."
    new "……啊！当然，这把大的……"

    # game/script.rpy:11520
    old "Yes. I think it might be the key to the attic."
    new "嗯。我觉得它也许就是阁楼的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:11527
    old "...A-Are you serious?"
    new "……你、你是认真的？"

    # game/script.rpy:11528
    old "I am. We saw the keyhole upstairs, and it needed a big key like this one. The elevator has one too, but you can't really determine the shape of the key from it, so I understand why you didn't notice it."
    new "认真的。我们在楼上见过那个锁孔，要开它就得用这么大的钥匙。电梯上也有一个锁孔，可从那儿看不出钥匙的形状，所以你当时没留意到，也难怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:11533
    old "What do you say, Katei?"
    new "你怎么看，Katei？"

    # game/script.rpy:11538
    old "...Honestly, I can't tell. He could be right, but I'm not sure why Naomi would have it."
    new "……说实话，我也说不准。他也许说得对，可我想不通 Naomi 为什么会有那把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:11541
    old "So we could have access to the attic, where the culprit might've been hiding all this time."
    new "这么说，我们就能进阁楼了——凶手说不定一直躲在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:11542
    old "Not only that. If I'm right, we've had access for a while. We could've entered it during our last search."
    new "不止如此。如果我没猜错，我们早就能进去了。上次搜寻的时候，我们本可以进阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:11543
    old "But I can't think we would've found someone there so easily. First, it would mean that they have another key. Second, they hid there knowing we had access to it. Third, they didn't take this key from Naomi.{w} ...And yet the one for the cabinet was taken."
    new "但我不觉得我们能那么轻易就在那儿找到人。第一，那意味着他们另有一把钥匙；第二，他们明知我们能进去，却还是躲在那里；第三，他们没有从 Naomi 身上拿走这把钥匙。{w}……可展示柜的钥匙却被拿走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11544
    old "So maybe they don't care about us going to the attic."
    new "也许他们根本不在乎我们进不进阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:11545
    old "This doesn't matter. Let's just go see if it fits."
    new "这些都不重要。先去试试这把钥匙合不合用。"

    # game/script.rpy:11549
    old "I removed the key from the set and was about to exit the room until Shiroya made us aware of something."
    new "我从钥匙串上取下那把钥匙，正要走出房间，Shiroya 却提醒了我们一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:11554
    old "...Where is Akaro?"
    new "……Akaro 人呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:11562
    old "We looked around in bewilderment. She was right: Akaro wasn't with us."
    new "我们愕然地环顾四周。她说得没错，Akaro 没和我们在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:11564
    old "Did he even come in here?"
    new "他到底有没有进来过？"

    # game/script.rpy:11571
    old "We looked around hallway B, but it appeared empty. In front of us was the event room, which we could also see was empty through the door."
    new "我们在 B走廊里四处张望，却不见半个人影。正前方就是活动室，从门口也能看出里面空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:11577
    old "Where the hell did he go?"
    new "他到底跑哪儿去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:11582
    old "Did he go off on his own? No way someone attacked him, right? It's hard to believe we wouldn't have heard anything, and restraining Akaro would require quite a bit of effort. This floor should've been clear too."
    new "他是自己走开的？总不能是被人袭击了吧？真要是那样，我们不可能一点动静都没听见，何况要制住 Akaro 也得费不少力气。再说这一层本该只有我们才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:11591
    old "We kept talking as we looked through the other hallway. Erina and Isla were still next to the stairs, alone."
    new "我们一边说着，一边查看另一条走廊。Erina 和 Isla 仍守在楼梯旁，只有她们两人。"

    # game/script.rpy:11596
    old "Do we try to go to the attic before looking for him thoroughly? It's just fantastic that someone disappeared as soon as we found our way in..."
    new "我们是先彻底找他，还是先去阁楼？偏在我们刚找到入口的当口有人不见了，可真会挑时候……"

    # game/script.rpy:11601
    old "But he might be in danger..."
    new "可他也许有危险……"

    # game/script.rpy:11611
    old "If he is in danger, he will be even if we search for him. If he walked away by himself, he wouldn't let us just find him again, and if the culprit took him, they've been dodging us for quite a while.{w} This is the first time we've been in this situation and have access to the attic, so we should go there first. Afterward, we'll move down if we haven't found him."
    new "他要是真有危险，就算我们去找，他也一样有危险。如果是他自己走开的，就不会让我们轻易找到；如果是凶手把他带走的，那对方已经躲了我们这么久。{w}这是我们头一回既碰上这种局面，又能进阁楼，所以该先去那儿。之后要是还没找到他，我们再往下走。"

    # game/script.rpy:11612
    old "No. Akaro must still be here. Let's look for him."
    new "不。Akaro 一定还在这儿。先找他。"

    # game/script.rpy:11617
    old "...{w}Fine. He better have a very good reason if he separated from us on purpose."
    new "……{w}好吧。他要是故意离开我们，最好有个像样的理由。"

    # game/script.rpy:11622
    old "Do you really think he did...?"
    new "你真觉得他是故意的……？"

    # game/script.rpy:11623
    old "Isn't he incredibly suspicious? He's been cooperative, but he's felt out of place from the beginning. He showed no interest in anything going on here, but he got trapped because he arrived so early."
    new "他难道不可疑吗？他一直很配合，可从一开始就显得格格不入。这里发生的事他一件都不关心，却偏偏因为来得太早被困住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11626
    old "Aren't you in the same position?"
    new "你的处境不也一样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:11631
    old "No, but you are. I came here out of curiosity."
    new "不，你才是。我只是出于好奇才来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:11632
    old "Regardless, hallway B was empty when we entered Naomi's room. If someone took him by surprise, they would've had to come from behind. Unless you wanna say that maybe they materialized right behind Akaro, it's a dubious thing to think, because we looked through this entire floor not long ago."
    new "总之，我们进 Naomi 房间的时候，B走廊是空的。若有人趁其不备，也只能从背后下手。除非你想说那人凭空出现在了 Akaro 身后——这念头站不住脚，毕竟不久前我们才把这一层查了个遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:11643
    old "But the Sekimeiya's still here. What other reason could he have to vanish like that?"
    new "可 Sekimeiya 还在这里。除此之外，他还能有什么理由那样凭空消失？"

    # game/script.rpy:11648
    old "I don't know, to make us waste time? Isn't that what the culprit has been doing from the beginning?"
    new "谁知道，也许是想让我们白白浪费时间？犯人从一开始不就在这么干吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:11661
    old "We explained everything to Erina and Isla while Sai called the elevator. It was still on our floor, so it probably hadn't been used. If it had, we wouldn't have heard it, so we couldn't be sure. Erina and Isla would've needed to miss the button lighting up for a couple seconds."
    new "Sai 去叫电梯的时候，我们把事情的经过都跟 Erina 和 Isla 讲了一遍。电梯还停在我们这一层，所以应该没人用过。就算真有人用过，我们也听不见，无法确定。而这需要 Erina 和 Isla 恰好有几秒钟没看到按钮亮起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:11663
    old "He suddenly disappeared...? Nobody could've gone up."
    new "他就这么突然消失了……？不可能有人上去啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:11668
    old "Lend me the key, Atsuki. I wanna see if it fits."
    new "Atsuki，把钥匙借我。我看看能不能对上。"

    # game/script.rpy:11669
    old "Here."
    new "给你。"

    # game/script.rpy:11676
    old "I gave him the big, brown key that I'd detached from the keyring. Sai took it and attempted to insert it in the keyhole inside the elevator."
    new "我把从钥匙圈上取下的那把棕色大钥匙递给他。Sai 接过，试着把它插进电梯里的锁孔。"

    # game/script.rpy:11682
    old "...You were correct. It's this one."
    new "……你说得对。就是这把。"

    # game/script.rpy:11683
    old "As he turned it, the seventh button lit up, indicating it had become available."
    new "他一转动钥匙，七楼的按钮就亮了起来，说明已经可以按了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11688
    old "Seriously? That's very strange...{w} I'm not sure you understand how restricted that place is. I'm not certain we should even go."
    new "真的？这可太奇怪了……{w} 你们恐怕不明白那地方管得有多严。我甚至不确定我们该不该去。"

    # game/script.rpy:11689
    old "Oh, we're going, but first we'll see if we can find Akaro here. The culprit must have another key to the attic, given they left this one on Naomi."
    new "当然要去，不过先看看能不能在这儿找到 Akaro。既然他们把这一把留在了 Naomi 身上，那犯人手里肯定还有一把阁楼的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:11695
    old "When Sai took the key out, the light surrounding the button turned off. Then, he handed it back to me. As I put it in my pocket, he carefully shut the elevator and let go before it was fully closed. By doing so, he created a small gap between the door and the elevator."
    new "Sai 拔出钥匙，按钮周围的灯随之熄灭。然后他把钥匙还给了我。我收进口袋时，他小心地把电梯门合上，在完全关严之前松了手，让门与门框之间留下一道细缝。"

    # game/script.rpy:11701
    old "Good, this works. We can keep it open like this without sticking something in there. Later, if we do a thorough search, we'll be able to do this so nobody can call it."
    new "很好，这样就行。不用塞东西，也能让门一直开着。之后要是我们仔细搜查，就可以这么办，免得有人把电梯叫走。"

    # game/script.rpy:11702
    old "Since Akaro can only be here, let's see if we can find him real quick. After that, our priority is looking for something important in the attic."
    new "既然 Akaro 只可能在这儿，那就赶紧找找他。找到之后，我们的首要任务就是去阁楼找一样重要的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:11708
    old "He closed the elevator again. We'd gotten used to the crystal floor searches, so it didn't feel like an imposing task anymore. Erina and Isla remained where they'd been while the rest of us chose individual rooms to look through, including the bathrooms and the mechanical room.{w} Every single one of them was empty, so we reunited by the stairs."
    new "他重新把电梯门关上。水晶层的搜索我们已经习惯了，不再觉得是什么难事。Erina 和 Isla 留在原处，其余人各自挑了房间查看，连卫生间和机械室也没放过。{w} 每一间都是空的，我们于是回到楼梯旁会合。"

    # game/script.rpy:11717
    old "Either Akaro managed to disappear or the culprit managed to make him disappear. The Sekimeiya didn't work for us earlier, so a lot of this isn't adding up. I'm not sure what Akaro has to do with this, but for now, let's get moving."
    new "要么是 Akaro 自己消失了，要么是犯人让他消失了。方才 Sekimeiya 对我们毫无反应，所以很多地方都对不上。我不清楚 Akaro 与这件事有何关系，但眼下还是先走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:11718
    old "We can't all fit in the elevator, so let's go through the main door. It'd be better to stick together."
    new "电梯装不下我们所有人，走正门吧。还是一起行动比较好。"

    # game/script.rpy:11725
    old "Without wasting time, we moved through the floors to reach the sixth.{w} It was surreal not having Akaro with us. Naomi's second appearance eclipsed the oddity of his disappearance, but it was also something that I couldn't even begin to understand."
    new "我们没多耽搁，一路穿过各层，来到了六楼。{w} Akaro 不在身边，这种感觉很不真实。Naomi 的第二次出现盖过了他失踪的诡异，可那本身也是我完全无法理解的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:11728
    old "\"The Sekimeiya didn't work for us earlier, so a lot of this isn't adding up.\"{w} Sai implied that the Sekimeiya must've caused Akaro's disappearance, but there was an important discrepancy: it was shut behind the glass. If it was involved, it worked in a way beyond what we knew."
    new "「方才 Sekimeiya 对我们毫无反应，所以很多地方都对不上。」{w} Sai 话里的意思是，Akaro 的失踪必定出自 Sekimeiya 之手，可这里有个重要的矛盾：它当时还锁在玻璃罩内。若它真的参与其中，那起作用的方式也超出了我们的认知。"

    # game/script.rpy:11737
    old "Oh, I didn't see this door."
    new "哦，我都没注意到这扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:11742
    old "It's my first time looking at it too. It's pretty sturdy—no way we'd be opening it without the key."
    new "我也是头一回见到。这门相当结实——没有钥匙，我们根本打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:11746
    old "They all looked at me expectantly. I took the key out of my pocket and inserted it into the keyhole. I'd been half expecting something to go wrong, but I was able to smoothly turn it and unlock the door to the mysterious attic."
    new "他们都满怀期待地看向我。我掏出钥匙，插进锁孔。我原本还有些担心会出岔子，结果钥匙转动得很顺，神秘阁楼的门就这样开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11748
    old "Sai quickly dragged the door open. There was a narrow staircase leading upward that obligated us to form a line."
    new "Sai 一把将门拉开。门后是一段向上延伸的窄楼梯，我们只能排成一列。"

    # game/script.rpy:11757
    old "It's pretty dark..."
    new "里面好黑……"

    # game/script.rpy:11758
    old "Hm... Do we need to go?"
    new "唔……我们非去不可吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:11759
    old "These stairs are like this because there's no room directly above us. They had to link this door to the closest room. It wasn't an easy task, and there wasn't much space to make a wider staircase."
    new "楼梯会成这样，是因为我们正上方没有房间。他们只能把这扇门接到最近的一间房去。这活儿不容易，也没有多少空间可以修更宽的楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:11760
    old "...You saw the attic earlier through the cameras. It's a tidy floor in the layout of a normal household. Since not many people can access it, they didn't bother making a more pleasant entryway."
    new "……你们之前通过监控看过阁楼。那一层收拾得很整齐，布局就像普通住家。能进去的人不多，所以他们也没费心弄个像样的入口。"

    # game/script.rpy:11761
    old "But won't we get in trouble for going in?"
    new "可我们进去，不会惹上麻烦吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:11762
    old "We might. I'm advising you all not to keep going.{w} It's a restricted area, and I doubt Ashiya will be understanding even if our circumstances require this."
    new "也许会。我是在劝你们别再往前了。{w} 那是禁区，就算我们是迫不得已，恐怕芦屋也不会通融。"

    # game/script.rpy:11763
    old "Sai, who was in front, continued up the stairs."
    new "走在最前面的 Sai 继续拾级而上。"

    # game/script.rpy:11767
    old "The rest of us followed him and quickly reached the top of the short staircase, where we found another door at our left."
    new "我们跟在后面，很快走完了这段不长的楼梯，在左侧又看到一扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:11770
    old "The space above wasn't large enough for all of us, so Erina and Isla could barely see the door. Sai grabbed the aged handle and realized that it was slightly open. Finally, he pushed open the last barrier preventing us from seeing what we were up against."
    new "上面的空间容不下我们所有人，Erina 和 Isla 几乎看不到那扇门。Sai 握住老旧的门把手，发现门微微开着。最终，他推开最后一道屏障，我们终于看清了要面对的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:11771
    old "A rusty creak rang out as the door slowly opened. Sai had to put unusual strength into it—the door kept getting stuck on the floor. Once he'd won that battle, I was able to see inside."
    new "门缓缓打开，发出一声锈涩的吱呀。Sai 不得不用上格外大的力气——门底老是卡在地板上。等他把门推开，我终于看清了里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:11775
    old "Condemned"
    new "定罪"

    # game/script.rpy:11780
    old "It looked like an old living room, and not at all Japanese-styled. A sofa with a suitcase on it quickly came into view, along with a few lights hanging from the ceiling. I could see two more doors in the corner of the room, and as I thoroughly inspected it, I questioned why Sai hadn't yet moved."
    new "那看起来像一间老旧的客厅，全然不是日式风格。一张放着行李箱的沙发很快映入眼帘，天花板上还吊着几盏灯。房间角落里另有两扇门。我仔细打量着四周，心里纳闷 Sai 怎么还没动。"

    # game/script.rpy:11782
    old "...Wait up. Look at the floor."
    new "……等等。看地板。"

    # game/script.rpy:11783
    old "I took it as if he'd been talking to me because I was the one with the best view. As soon as he pointed it out, I understood what he was looking at."
    new "我站的位置看得最清楚，便以为他在对我说话。他这一提醒，我立刻明白他在看什么了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11786
    old "There was someone here..."
    new "这里有人来过……"

    # game/script.rpy:11789
    old "Yeah, there are footprints on the floor. Someone must've been here."
    new "是啊，地板上有脚印。肯定有人来过。"

    # game/script.rpy:11790
    old "The entire floor was covered by a blue carpet, and any steps someone took on it would remain visible thanks to its thickness. Over time, they would become harder and harder to discern until they disappeared altogether. It was definite proof that someone had walked around there recently."
    new "整片地面铺着蓝色地毯，地毯很厚，踩上去的脚印会一直留着。随着时间推移，痕迹会越来越淡，直至彻底消失。这足以证明，不久前有人在这里走动过。"

    # game/script.rpy:11793
    old "Yeah, someone must have been here. Sure. This is exactly why we couldn't find the person we were looking for. The second Naomi didn't have a keyring, so it's very possible they still have easy access to this place. That isn't exactly what I meant, though."
    new "是啊，肯定有人来过。没错。我们找不到要找的人，原因就在这里。第二个 Naomi 身上没有钥匙圈，所以她很可能仍能随意进出这里。不过我想说的并不完全是这个意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:11795
    old "Don't you see it? These footprints don't make sense. Nobody could've entered through this door."
    new "你们没看出来吗？这些脚印说不通。不可能有人从这扇门进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:11797
    old "It took me a moment to see why he'd said that since there were footprints right next to the door. The key to that statement was their origin."
    new "门口明明就有脚印，我愣了一下才明白他为什么这么说。关键在于脚印的起点。"

    # game/script.rpy:11798
    old "Wait, you're right... How did this happen?"
    new "等等，你说得对……这是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:11800
    old "Against the wall before us was a red sofa. In front of it, the footprints began and walked up to the door Sai had opened. From there, they headed toward another door."
    new "我们面前的墙边摆着一张红色沙发。脚印从沙发前开始，一直延伸到 Sai 打开的那扇门，随后又朝另一扇门去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11808
    old "I'm not sure what to gather from this, but once we enter, these footprints will fade away and merge with ours, so let's not disrupt the rightmost part of the room yet."
    new "我还看不出这能说明什么，但我们一进去，这些脚印就会淡去、和我们的混在一起，所以房间最右边那块先别碰。"

    # game/script.rpy:11809
    old "Once Sai entered, I was free to do so as well, and the people behind me all slowly made their way into what seemed to be the living room."
    new "Sai 进去之后，我才跟着踏进去，身后的人也一个个慢慢走进了这间像是客厅的房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:11815
    old "Next to the sofa was a modest table, and in front of it a shelf supporting an old but large CRT television."
    new "沙发旁摆着一张不大的桌子，桌前是一个架子，上面搁着一台老旧而宽大的显像管电视。"

    # game/script.rpy:11823
    old "What the hell is this doing here...?"
    new "这东西怎么会在这儿……？"

    # game/script.rpy:11824
    old "He was talking about the suitcase. It looked like the one he'd taken from hallway C minutes prior, and it couldn't have somehow moved to the attic ahead of us since we hadn't heard the elevator. It had to be an entirely different suitcase."
    new "他说的是那只手提箱。它看起来和他几分钟前从 C走廊拿走的那只一模一样。我们没听见电梯的动静，它不可能先一步跑到阁楼来，所以那必定是另一只手提箱。"

    # game/script.rpy:11825
    old "It's empty too, and it looks like the one downstairs. It's exactly the same suitcase."
    new "里面也是空的，而且和楼下那只长得一样。根本就是同一只手提箱。"

    # game/script.rpy:11831
    old "The same one, literally? Or do you mean the same model?"
    new "同一只，还是同一款？"

    # game/script.rpy:11832
    old "Probably the same model, but honestly, I can't be sure. Naomi's body appeared twice, so this could still be the exact same suitcase depending on what happened."
    new "大概是同一款吧，但说实话，我也说不准。Naomi 的尸体都出现过两次，所以这也可能真的是同一只，具体要看发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:11837
    old "Huh, look. It also has faint traces of smoke..."
    new "咦，你看，这上面也有淡淡的烟熏痕迹……"

    # game/script.rpy:11843
    old "Do they not belong to people who work here, Katei? There's no way two of these were snuck into the tower, right?"
    new "Katei，这些难道不是在这里工作的人的东西吗？总不可能有两只这样的箱子被偷偷带进塔里吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:11850
    old "Three, in fact. One more was being carried by the person holding the stolen gemstones. And no, I don't recognize it at all.{w} More importantly, what is it doing here?"
    new "其实有三只。还有一只由那个拿着失窃宝石的人提着。而且，我完全不认识它。{w} 更要紧的是，它怎么会在这儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:11851
    old "I looked around me. There were no visible security cameras, and I recalled that I hadn't seen the living room through the monitors. I was sure that one of us would've noticed the suitcase otherwise, and maybe even the person who had been hiding."
    new "我环顾四周。看不到任何监控摄像头，而我也想起，之前在监视器画面上从没见过这间客厅。否则，我们之中总有人会注意到这只手提箱，说不定还会看到那个藏起来的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:11856
    old "...{w}Honestly, I have no idea. I'm not sure why they'd bring this here, no matter what its contents were. If they wanted to leave it behind, they could've done so downstairs, which is what we thought they did."
    new "……{w}说实话，我完全想不通。不管里面装的是什么，我都想不出他们为什么要把这东西带上来。要是想丢下它，在楼下丢掉就行——我们本来也是这么以为的。"

    # game/script.rpy:11861
    old "Right. What's the point of leaving one on the crystal floor and another one here?"
    new "是啊。一只丢在水晶层，一只放这儿，有什么意义？"

    # game/script.rpy:11862
    old "Whatever it is, it's less strange than the footprints we've walked over. Atsuki and Shiroya realized it."
    new "不管怎么说，这都比我们踩过的那串脚印正常。Atsuki 和 Shiroya 也发现了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11867
    old "The footprints started right in front of the suitcase, moved toward the staircase, and then to that door over there. What's past it?"
    new "脚印从手提箱正前方开始，朝楼梯那边去，然后到那边那扇门。门后是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:11873
    old "That door leads to the hallway. From there, you can access the elevator and the bedrooms. The other door you see leads to the kitchen, which is also connected to the hallway."
    new "那扇门通向走廊，从那里能到电梯和卧室。你看到的另一扇门通向厨房，厨房也和走廊相连。"

    # game/script.rpy:11878
    old "But I see what you mean. If no more footprints exist, they couldn't begin by the sofa."
    new "不过我明白你的意思。要是没有别的脚印，那它们就不可能从沙发那儿开始。"

    # game/script.rpy:11883
    old "Well, no, they could. If someone spent a few hours on the sofa, the next time they walked around, their previous footprints would've faded away, so it would look as if the starting point was the sofa itself."
    new "不，也不是不可能。如果有人在这沙发上待了几个小时，等他再走动时，之前的脚印早就淡掉了，看上去就好像起点是沙发本身。"

    # game/script.rpy:11888
    old "They could've also come from the kitchen, but they must've jumped onto the sofa to avoid leaving footprints, which sounds insane."
    new "他也可能是从厨房过来的，但那样就得跳到沙发上，免得留下脚印——这听着也太荒唐了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11892
    old "Sai, careful not to step on the preexisting footprints, opened the door to the kitchen."
    new "Sai 小心翼翼地避开原先那些脚印，推开了通往厨房的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:11893
    old "The floor here is different, so we won't be able to know if anyone came from the kitchen. Now, should we check everyone's shoes?"
    new "这里的地板不一样，所以没法判断有没有人从厨房过来。那么，要不要检查一下每个人的鞋？"

    # game/script.rpy:11899
    old "What...?"
    new "什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:11904
    old "Why do you think I preserved a few of these? Naturally, to check if one of us has been here already. Naomi's killer would've had a way in with the same key we used or the one that the other Naomi might've had."
    new "你以为我为什么特意留着这几个脚印？当然是为了确认我们之中有没有人早就来过这里。杀害 Naomi 的凶手，可以用我们手里的钥匙进来，也可以用另一个 Naomi 可能有的那把。"

    # game/script.rpy:11907
    old "These are barely recognizable, though. We might not be able to compare them well."
    new "可这些脚印几乎看不出形状了，恐怕很难比对。"

    # game/script.rpy:11908
    old "That's fine. The size itself should be enough. ...Strangely, nobody should've been able to enter this place through the stairs we just came from because no footprints start there."
    new "没关系，光看大小就够了。……奇怪的是，按理说没人能顺着我们刚走的那道楼梯进来，因为没有任何脚印是从那里开始的。"

    # game/script.rpy:11911
    old "Sai opened the remaining door."
    new "Sai 打开了剩下的那扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:11912
    old "Look, this hallway has a wooden floor too, and I can see the elevator right there. Using that, anyone could've come up here with the key."
    new "你看，这条走廊也是木地板，电梯就在那儿。只要有钥匙，谁都能乘电梯上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:11920
    old "That sounded right. Our own footprints were still very much visible, so they wouldn't fade immediately. The door had gotten stuck on the floor when Sai tried to open it, and the markings from that were still on the carpet. However, we had no way to tell if it had been opened earlier."
    new "这话有道理。我们自己留下的脚印还清晰可见，说明它们不会马上消失。Sai 推门时门曾卡在地板上，地毯上还留着那道痕迹。但那扇门之前有没有被打开过，我们无从判断。"

    # game/script.rpy:11921
    old "There was no way to jump to the sofa from the staircase, so accepting Sai's claim was reasonable. I looked up to see if I could notice a ceiling opening to drop from, but I didn't spot anything."
    new "从楼梯那儿不可能跳到沙发上，所以接受 Sai 的说法也合理。我抬头看了看，想看看天花板上有没有能让人下来的开口，却什么也没发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:11924
    old "Before I agreed with him fully, it was important to remember that we were likely up against someone cunning who was trying to mislead us while avoiding detection. Like Akaro said before he disappeared, it felt as if they had been taunting us at times."
    new "但在完全认同他之前，有一点不能忘：我们的对手很可能十分狡猾，一面隐藏自己，一面设法误导我们。就像 Akaro 消失前说的那样，有时感觉对方简直是在戏弄我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:11925
    old "If their intention was to play with our reasoning again, they could have intentionally made us think that the main door was unused and the elevator was the only method of entering."
    new "如果对方又打算玩弄我们的推理，那他们完全可以故意让我们以为正门没人用过，电梯是唯一能进来的途径。"

    # game/script.rpy:11928
    old "The key behind that was the state of the footprints. They'd clearly been there for a while, so it wasn't simple to determine the way they were facing. Even though we'd all interpreted the sofa to be the starting point, that wasn't guaranteed to be the case."
    new "关键就在于脚印的状态。它们显然已经存在了一段时间，所以很难看清它们朝向哪边。尽管我们都把沙发当成了起点，可事实未必如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:11929
    old "To trick us, the culprit could've purposely walked from the door to the sofa. From there, making it to the kitchen without stepping on the floor again seemed easy, and they could've gone around the room through the hallway, then exited through the main door."
    new "为了误导我们，凶手完全可以故意从门口走到沙发。到了沙发那儿，再想不踩地板进厨房，似乎也不难；之后还可以经由走廊绕行，从正门离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:11939
    old "It sounded excessive, and it implied they'd left the suitcase there so that we would find it, but we still had to ask ourselves an important question: why would someone leave the key to the attic in Naomi's pocket when the Sekimeiya cabinet key was removed?"
    new "这听起来太过刻意，还意味着他们是故意把手提箱放在那儿让我们发现的。但我们仍得问自己一个重要的问题：既然 Sekimeiya 展示柜的钥匙被取走了，为什么会有人把阁楼的钥匙留在 Naomi 的口袋里？"

    # game/script.rpy:11940
    old "If they had known that we were going to look at the room, they might've prepared something like that. But I couldn't identify the goal of it, because the idea that they hadn't come from the main door didn't seem to contradict anything yet."
    new "如果他们早就知道我们会来查看这个房间，或许就会做这种准备。可我推不出这样做的目的，因为「对方不是从正门进来的」这一设想，眼下似乎还没有和任何事实相矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:11943
    old "...{w}The more I stared at the footprints, the more I doubted whether they were facing the way I was thinking. I wasn't sure anymore, but I was confident that only one pair of shoes had left them."
    new "……{w}脚印看得越久，我越怀疑它们的朝向是不是跟我想的一样。我已经拿不准了，但有一点我可以肯定：留下它们的只有一双鞋。"

    # game/script.rpy:11944
    old "If they were backwards, there were more arrangements. Perhaps they entered from the staircase, went to the hallway to take the elevator down, and quickly returned from the staircase so they could walk over to the sofa."
    new "如果方向是反的，那还有更多走法。也许对方从楼梯进来，去走廊乘电梯下楼，又很快沿楼梯折返，好走到沙发那边。"

    # game/script.rpy:11950
    old "Well, are you gonna show me your shoes, or do I need to compare your footprints?"
    new "那么，你是打算把鞋给我看，还是要我亲自比对脚印？"

    # game/script.rpy:11955
    old "Look, mine are a little bigger, see? It's very simple."
    new "看，我的鞋要大一些，看到了吧？很简单。"

    # game/script.rpy:11960
    old "Fine, here. I know you're still suspecting me, but you must admit that mine are also considerably larger."
    new "好，给你。我知道你还在怀疑我，但你得承认，我的鞋也大得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:11965
    old "Hm...{w} Who did you steal those from?"
    new "嗯……{w}你这是从谁那儿偷来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:11971
    old "I'm not used to ruling you out so quickly. That's all."
    new "我只是不习惯这么快就把你排除在外，仅此而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:11972
    old "Unfortunately, we can't really look at Akaro's for the moment, but I'm sure they'd be bigger too."
    new "可惜眼下没法查看 Akaro 的鞋，不过我敢肯定，他的也更大。"

    # game/script.rpy:11973
    old "Anyway, Atsuki, you're next on the suspect list."
    new "总之，Atsuki，下一个就轮到你了。"

    # game/script.rpy:11974
    old "And I just let you know about the attic key?"
    new "而我刚刚才把阁楼钥匙的事告诉你？"

    # game/script.rpy:11979
    old "Just show me your shoes. I'm pretty lost when it comes to the intentions of the culprit, anyway."
    new "先把鞋给我看吧。反正凶手的意图，我到现在也没摸清。"

    # game/script.rpy:11983
    old "He looked at them, and once again, there was no match."
    new "他看了看，结果还是一样，对不上。"

    # game/script.rpy:11993
    old "She left a footprint, and Sai looked at it for a few seconds with a conspicuous frown on his face."
    new "她留下了一个脚印。Sai 盯着它看了几秒，眉头明显皱了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:11994
    old "Yours are awfully close, but I can't say for sure they're the same. The size is at least very similar."
    new "你的鞋印和它非常接近，但我不能断言就是同一双。至少尺寸十分相近。"

    # game/script.rpy:11999
    old "...So what? Are you gonna move me above Atsuki on your list?"
    new "……所以呢？你是打算在名单上把我挪到 Atsuki 前面去？"

    # game/script.rpy:12004
    old "This might give you enough points for that, but I'll admit I was only hoping for Katei's shoes to match. That would've meant a lot more than your size coinciding."
    new "这或许能让你嫌疑大增，不过老实说，我本来只盼着能对上 Katei 的鞋。那可比你的尺码吻合更能说明问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:12009
    old "Anyway, Erina, mind playing along too?"
    new "总之，Erina，你也来配合一下好吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:12015
    old "You can see mine are slightly bigger too."
    new "你也看得出来，我的也稍大一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:12020
    old "You're right. Let's see if we can find something else, then."
    new "说得对。那我们再找找别的线索。"

    # game/script.rpy:12024
    old "Are you not gonna look at mine?"
    new "你不看看我的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:12029
    old "Oh... sure. Isla, do you understand what'll happen to you if your shoes match?"
    new "哦……当然。Isla，你明白要是你的鞋对上了，会有什么后果吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:12031
    old "Don't worry. They're not even close."
    new "别担心。差得远呢。"

    # game/script.rpy:12036
    old "That's what I thought."
    new "我就知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:12041
    old "Sai moved to the television and tried to power it on.{w} Nothing happened."
    new "Sai 走到电视机前，试着开机。{w}什么反应也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:12046
    old "I guess this is broken, seeing as it's plugged in.{w} ...Anyway, let's look around the area."
    new "插着电却开不了，看来是坏了。{w}……算了，我们在这一带看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:12054
    old "We started with the kitchen. It had an empty refrigerator, an oven, and some compartments to store food that no longer contained anything but dust."
    new "我们先从厨房查起。里面有一台空冰箱、一台烤箱，还有几个储物格，如今里面除了灰尘，什么也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:12062
    old "Next, we all stepped over to the hallway. The floor was a little creaky, and the walls were beige. Everything about the place was old, but it was still well-preserved."
    new "接着我们一起走到走廊。地板踩上去有些吱呀作响，墙壁是米色的。这里的一切都上了年头，却仍保存得相当完好。"

    # game/script.rpy:12071
    old "This room used to serve as a storeroom, but it's empty now, and it seems the ceiling light stopped working. Pressing the switch isn't doing anything."
    new "这间原本是储藏室，现在已经空了，顶灯似乎也坏了。按开关没有任何反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:12083
    old "We ignored the elevator and began to look through the other rooms. According to Katei, the two doors farthest back led to bedrooms."
    new "我们没去管电梯，开始查看其余房间。据 Katei 说，最里面的两扇门通向卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:12089
    old "There's a second floor?"
    new "还有一层？"

    # game/script.rpy:12090
    old "Inside the spacious bedroom, Isla noticed a ladder that led to a room above us. However, we should've already been on the highest floor."
    new "宽敞的卧室里，Isla 发现一架梯子，通往我们头顶的房间。可这里按理已经是最顶层了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12095
    old "Oh, not quite. Back then, when this was a residence, it's true that the house had two floors. The second one wasn't fully preserved when the building was expanded, but as you can see, remnants are still present in these bedrooms."
    new "哦，也不尽然。当年这里还是住宅的时候，这栋房子确实有两层。后来扩建时，二层并没有完整保留下来，不过如你所见，这些卧室里还留着它的痕迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:12100
    old "Oh... What's up there, then?"
    new "哦……那上面是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:12105
    old "Another bedroom like this one. These were used as double rooms back in the day, so Ashiya specified that the higher ones shouldn't be demolished."
    new "和这间一样的另一间卧室。当年这些房间都用作双人房，所以芦屋特别交代过，楼上那几间不能拆。"

    # game/script.rpy:12109
    old "I sat on the bed, still pretty tired from not sleeping the night before. It wasn't really comfortable due to how long it had gone unused, but the sheets made it look like it was still maintained daily."
    new "我在床上坐下，前一晚没睡，仍觉得相当疲惫。床闲置太久，坐着并不舒服，可床单却让人以为它每天都有人打理。"

    # game/script.rpy:12110
    old "I stood up as soon as I noticed a security camera recording me. I definitely recalled seeing the bedroom through the monitors."
    new "一发现监控摄像头正对着我，我立刻站了起来。我确实记得在监视器里见过这间卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:12119
    old "Shiroya, Isla, and I went up to the second level of the bedroom. Like Katei said, it was similar, and there were only two beds and a closet. I opened it, given that we were still looking for Akaro, but it only contained a few articles of clothing."
    new "我、Shiroya 和 Isla 爬上卧室的二层。正如 Katei 所说，那里与下面相仿，只有两张床和一个衣柜。我们还在找 Akaro，我便打开了衣柜，里面只有几件衣服。"

    # game/script.rpy:12124
    old "We went back down. Another door was in front of the bedroom."
    new "我们回到下面。卧室正前方还有另一扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:12128
    old "It led to a mirrored version of the bedroom I'd seen, and it also had a ladder."
    new "门后是与刚才那间卧室格局对称的另一间，同样有一架梯子。"

    # game/script.rpy:12132
    old "Above, nothing was different. There were effectively four bedrooms on the floor."
    new "上面别无二致。这一层实际共有四间卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:12143
    old "The final area was the bathroom. It had a shower, a shelf, and a modest carpet on the floor. It was bigger and fancier than the ones below, but the door didn't have a locking mechanism."
    new "最后是浴室。里面有淋浴、一个架子，地上铺着一块不大的地毯。它比楼下的浴室更大、更讲究，门却没有锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:12153
    old "The entire floor had a simple layout. According to Katei, the household used to be quite bigger in the past, but not much of that remained."
    new "整层格局十分简单。据 Katei 说，这户人家从前要大得多，但留存下来的已经不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:12154
    old "In addition, the hallway wasn't as long as the ones downstairs, meaning that the attic didn't make use of the whole space the large building provided, probably because it had been significantly expanded at one point."
    new "此外，这条走廊不如楼下的长，也就是说，阁楼并没有占满这栋大楼的整个空间——多半是因为这栋楼曾在某一时期大幅扩建过。"

    # game/script.rpy:12155
    old "We'd looked through every room while someone always remained in the hallway, so we'd determined that we were alone. Once we were done, Sai called us from the elevator."
    new "我们查遍了每个房间，全程都有人守在走廊，因此确定这里没有别人。查完后，Sai 在电梯那边叫我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:12162
    old "There are light switches everywhere, but every light was turned on. Is that normal?"
    new "到处都是电灯开关，可每盏灯都亮着。这正常吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:12167
    old "Yes, it doesn't mean anyone turned them on separately. The lights turn off automatically at night, and every morning we manually turn them all on at once, including the attic's. That's why the office floors were lit up as well."
    new "正常，这并不代表有人一盏盏开过。灯在夜里会自动熄灭，每天早晨我们会手动把它们全部打开，阁楼的灯也一样。所以办公楼层同样亮着。"

    # game/script.rpy:12172
    old "That sounds like a huge waste."
    new "听起来太浪费了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12175
    old "Katei nodded but stayed in the hallway's bend so that nobody could enter without him seeing. We realized Sai had called the elevator as soon as we saw the button lighting up."
    new "Katei 点了点头，仍守在走廊拐角，任何人进来都逃不过他的眼睛。我们看到按钮亮起，才意识到 Sai 已经按了电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:12176
    old "All right, so we haven't found anyone. That's fair. As we said earlier, we now need to make sure to thoroughly inspect every floor, so we'll leave the elevator here and disable it by keeping the door open."
    new "好，看来我们没找到人。行吧。就像刚才说的，接下来每一层都必须彻底查一遍，所以电梯就停在这儿，让门一直开着，这样它就没法运行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12180
    old "Just like he'd done downstairs, he held it with his hands so that it wouldn't close. Once he let go of it, the door didn't have the force to close itself and remained stationary."
    new "就像在楼下那样，他用双手扶住门，不让它关上。松手之后，门并没有自行合拢的力道，就那样停着不动了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12185
    old "If we make it all the way down without finding anyone, we'll have to consider some pretty outlandish things. Until then, we have to expect to at least find Akaro."
    new "要是我们一路查到最下面还是没找到人，那就得考虑些相当离谱的可能了。在那之前，我们至少得指望能找到 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:12191
    old "We entered the living room. Sai and Katei went through the kitchen, as it was the last place anyone could've hoped to sneak in."
    new "我们走进客厅。Sai 和 Katei 去查了厨房，因为如果有人想偷偷溜进来，那里是唯一还可能藏身的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:12193
    old "...What does this look like to you guys?"
    new "……你们看这个像什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:12194
    old "I stopped them without giving them context. They weren't sure what I was referring to, so I made it clearer."
    new "我叫住他们，却没说明缘由。他们不清楚我指的是什么，我便说得更明白些。"

    # game/script.rpy:12195
    old "The footprints, I mean. They can look like an impossibility, but there's a simple explanation for them, right?"
    new "我是说那些脚印。它们看上去像是绝无可能，但其实有简单的解释，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:12200
    old "Teleportation?"
    new "传送？"

    # game/script.rpy:12201
    old "...Yes. Earlier, I did consider our mystery culprit teleporting to the attic. If they appeared next to the sofa, that'd be the natural beginning of their footprints."
    new "……对。刚才我确实考虑过，那个神秘的真凶是传送进阁楼的。如果人就出现在沙发旁，那自然会成为脚印的起点。"

    # game/script.rpy:12206
    old "Here's something else: these footprints probably belong to a woman. What's your shoe size, Shiroya?"
    new "还有一点：这些脚印多半属于一个女人。Shiroya，你穿多大码的鞋？"

    # game/script.rpy:12211
    old "Oh, a 6.5."
    new "哦，6.5 码。"

    # game/script.rpy:12216
    old "And the only other person we know who could have a similar shoe size is Naomi. Furthermore, we found two Naomis, and on the sofa, where she would've teleported to, there's a suitcase that we've also seen before."
    new "除此之外，我们认识的人里唯一可能穿相近鞋码的，就是 Naomi。况且，我们遇到了两个 Naomi；在她本该传送到的沙发上，还放着一只我们之前也见过的手提箱。"

    # game/script.rpy:12221
    old "See? This is what I told you guys earlier. Naomi had the suitcase from the beginning. Once she teleported or time traveled to this living room, the suitcase was replicated and she must've left it here."
    new "看吧？我早说过了。Naomi 从一开始就拿着手提箱。她传送或者穿越时间来到这间客厅之后，手提箱就被复制了一份，她一定是把它留在了这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:12222
    old "Oh, are you just gung-ho about time travel now? You were ridiculing Atsuki for it earlier."
    new "哦？你现在倒对时间穿越这么起劲了？刚才你还拿这个嘲笑 Atsuki 呢。"

    # game/script.rpy:12227
    old "Well, it's become clear that something strange is going on. These footprints are even further proof."
    new "看来事情确实有古怪。这些脚印就是进一步的证据。"

    # game/script.rpy:12232
    old "If this is what happened, Naomi must've traveled here while she was holding the suitcase—before we found it on the crystal floor. That would mean two Naomis have existed for quite a while, and that not only did we miss both of them, they were also killed.{w} And let me tell you, there are some pesky contradictions down that line of thought. First, during the time Naomi could've been holding the suitcase, the Sekimeiya was in its cabinet. It wasn't locked inside, but we touched it and nothing happened to us. If that's how she time traveled up here, it again begs the question of why it worked for her."
    new "如果真是这样，那 Naomi 一定是拿着手提箱穿越到这里的——就在我们在水晶层发现它之前。也就是说，有两个 Naomi 同时存在了相当长一段时间，而我们不仅两个都没撞见，她们还都被杀了。{w} 不过我得说，这条思路上有几个挺麻烦的矛盾。第一，在 Naomi 可能拿着手提箱的那段时间里，Sekimeiya 一直在展示柜里。柜子并没有上锁，可我们碰过它，什么也没发生。如果她就是那样穿越上来的，那问题又回来了：为什么偏偏对她起了作用？"

    # game/script.rpy:12237
    old "Honestly, I assumed that being outside the cabinet without refrigeration was what made the Sekimeiya transport Atsuki into the past. However, the fact that we found the Sekimeiya still in its cabinet minutes before seeing that suitcase might imply that was wrong."
    new "说实话，我原本以为，是离开展示柜又没有冷藏，才让 Sekimeiya 把 Atsuki 送回了过去。但我们看到那只手提箱的几分钟前，Sekimeiya 还好好待在展示柜里——这一点恐怕说明我想错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12242
    old "I'm not wrong, right? If Naomi touched it while it was out of the cabinet, we would've found it outside.{w} The next contradiction is what we talked about earlier: Naomi would've disappeared upon traveling, so we couldn't have found her corpse and the suitcase twice."
    new "我没说错吧？如果 Naomi 是在它离开展示柜的时候碰了它，那我们本该在柜外发现它。{w} 下一个矛盾就是我们之前谈过的：Naomi 一穿越就会消失，那她的尸体和手提箱就不可能被我们发现两次。"

    # game/script.rpy:12243
    old "I get what you're saying regarding the Sekimeiya, but after traveling back, she could've gone downstairs to pick it up from the floor. She would've known where she'd traveled from, so she could've returned it to the cabinet."
    new "Sekimeiya 那部分我听明白了。可她穿越之后，可以下楼把它从地上捡起来。她应该知道自己是从哪儿穿越过去的，自然也就能把它放回展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:12248
    old "Incorrect, I think.{w} Remember what Katei said after we got the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet?"
    new "我觉得不对。{w} 你还记得我们把 Sekimeiya 从展示柜里拿出来之后，Katei 说了什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:12253
    old "...What did I say?"
    new "……我说什么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:12258
    old "That you restored power to the elevator. According to you, the alarm disabled it."
    new "你说你把电梯的电源恢复了。按你的说法，是警报让电梯停下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:12259
    old "Oh, right. I got it running again after I stopped trying to understand what caused the power outage."
    new "哦，对。后来我不再琢磨停电是怎么回事，就把它重新弄好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12262
    old "I see, so Naomi couldn't have used the elevator before we saw the Sekimeiya in the cabinet, and right after that, we saw the suitcase in hallway C, which probably means that Naomi would've already traveled."
    new "原来如此。也就是说，在我们看到 Sekimeiya 还留在展示柜里之前，Naomi 用不了电梯；而紧接着，我们就在 C走廊看到了手提箱。这么说来，那时的 Naomi 应该已经穿越了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12263
    old "What? She could've just left through the staircase."
    new "什么？她走楼梯出去不就行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12268
    old "No, I don't think so. It's likely that the first time we heard the elevator moving down, Naomi used it from here. There's still no other explanation for that, and there's something else that makes me think she couldn't have exited through the door. That's the last contradiction I can point out."
    new "不，我看不是。我们第一次听见电梯往下走，多半就是 Naomi 从这里坐的。这件事至今没有别的解释。而且还有一点让我觉得她没法从门口出去——这是我能指出的最后一个矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:12269
    old "When Naomi traveled with the suitcase, it's very safe to assume she also had her keys. She had them before the smoke appeared and when we found her first corpse. Her cabinet key had been removed, but that probably only happened after she was killed."
    new "Naomi 带着手提箱穿越的时候，几乎可以肯定钥匙也在她身上。烟雾出现之前她带着钥匙，我们第一次发现她尸体时钥匙也在。她的展示柜钥匙被取走了，但那多半是她死后的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:12274
    old "Now recall the footprints we found here. They start next to the sofa, go over to the staircase, then toward the hallway door."
    new "再想想我们在这儿找到的脚印：从沙发旁边开始，走向楼梯，然后折向走廊的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:12279
    old "Oh, so Naomi's first movements after appearing would've been to try leaving through the staircase."
    new "哦，所以 Naomi 出现之后，第一反应就是试着从楼梯离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:12280
    old "Exactly. And despite that, she went back to the hallway. The reasonable explanation is that she didn't have the key to get out."
    new "正是。可即便如此，她还是回到了走廊。合理的解释只有一个：她没有能出去的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:12283
    old "Then why would she go to the door?"
    new "那她为什么还要去门口？"

    # game/script.rpy:12284
    old "To try opening it? Maybe she thought she still had her keys, but when she went down the stairs and was about to take them out, she realized she didn't have them. Her only way out was through the elevator, so she came back up and went to the hallway. Eventually, she must've used it when the power came back."
    new "想试着开门吧？也许她以为自己还带着钥匙，可下了楼梯正要掏的时候，才发现钥匙根本不在身上。她唯一的出路就是电梯，于是又折回来，往走廊去了。后来恢复供电时，她一定是坐电梯下去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12289
    old "Since the footprints are all similar, there's only one other explanation that makes sense to me: she had the key and exited the room. Either before or after all this, she entered the attic again and went straight to the hallway.{w} But the footprints were all in similar condition, so there must not have been a lot of time between them. I'm not sure why she'd enter again only to use the elevator and go down. ...If she didn't want to be noticed, the elevator noise wouldn't do her any favors."
    new "既然这些脚印的状况都差不多，那在我看来，就只有另一种解释说得通了：她带着钥匙，离开了房间。在这之前或之后，她又进了阁楼，径直走向走廊。{w} 可所有脚印的新旧都相差无几，说明中间隔的时间并不长。我不明白她为什么又进来一趟，只为坐电梯下楼。……如果她不想被人发现，电梯的动静可帮不上她半点忙。"

    # game/script.rpy:12290
    old "She thought she'd have her keys, then...? Maybe she didn't know that much about the Sekimeiya even though she used it so early on.{w} I think that makes the most sense. She would be the second Naomi we found. I still don't understand how we missed her if she was the one who took the elevator down, or who killed her, but the truth is that we didn't find any keys on her body."
    new "她以为自己还带着钥匙，结果……？也许她虽然很早就用上了 Sekimeiya，对它却了解不多。{w} 我觉得这样最说得通。她应该就是我们发现的第二个 Naomi。如果坐电梯下楼的人是她，我到现在还是想不通我们怎么会漏掉她；也还是想不通是谁杀了她。但事实就是，她身上没有钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:12295
    old "And the person who killed her didn't remove them the first time, so they wouldn't have cared if the second Naomi had them either."
    new "而杀她的人第一次并没有把钥匙拿走，所以第二个 Naomi 身上有没有钥匙，对方也不会在意。"

    # game/script.rpy:12296
    old "The footprints painted a clear picture: she thought she had keys she didn't have. Was that due to the travel itself, or had she lost them beforehand?"
    new "脚印把事情的轮廓勾勒得很清楚：她以为自己带着钥匙，其实并没有。这是穿越本身造成的，还是她在那之前就已经把钥匙弄丢了？"

    # game/script.rpy:12301
    old "Let's head back down for now. When we get to the crystal floor, we'll know if the footprints could've belonged to her. If not, Shiroya's gonna have to move up a few spots on the naughty list."
    new "先下楼吧。到了水晶层，就能知道那些脚印是不是她的。如果不是，Shiroya 在嫌疑人名单上的排名可就要往前挪几位了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12310
    old "There was no point in arguing that, so we made our way to the sixth floor. Through normal means, there was no way anyone could still be in the attic, so we didn't have to worry about the elevator for once."
    new "争下去也没有意义，我们便动身前往六楼。按常理，阁楼里不可能还有人，所以我们难得不必再为电梯提心吊胆。"

    # game/script.rpy:12318
    old "We followed an exceedingly simple plan: Erina and Isla remained outside the office partitions while the rest of us looked through them. Only one person was needed for that, but by grouping up, we avoided picking one single person to do the important and potentially dangerous job."
    new "我们照着一个再简单不过的方案行事：Erina 和 Isla 守在办公隔间外面，其余人进去逐一查看。这活儿本来一个人就够了，但大家结伴行动，就不必单挑出某个人去承担这件重要又可能危险的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:12322
    old "Afterward, we inspected the bathrooms. Opening the doors was enough to determine they were desolate, but we remained on high alert after what we'd found in the crystal floor's bathroom."
    new "之后我们去查看洗手间。门一开就足以确认里面空无一人，但有了水晶层洗手间里的发现，我们仍旧不敢松懈。"

    # game/script.rpy:12326
    old "When we finished with floor 6, we were sure that nobody else was on the two highest floors, so we went down to repeat the process."
    new "六楼查完，我们已经能确定最高的两层没有别人，于是下楼重复同样的流程。"

    # game/script.rpy:12331
    old "The fifth floor wasn't any different. Even though we believed that Akaro and whoever the culprit was had to be somewhere in the tower, they would never remain on an office floor if they intended to hide.{w} Since we knew that, the most important reason why we were following that procedure was to isolate the crystal floor and be able to thoroughly look there once again."
    new "五楼也没什么两样。尽管我们相信 Akaro 和真凶一定还在塔里的某处，可他们若想藏身，绝不会留在办公楼层。{w} 正因为如此，我们走这套流程最重要的目的，是把水晶层隔离出来，好在那里再彻底搜查一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:12335
    old "As the search of the fourth floor was completed without an issue, I wondered again what might've happened to Akaro. Even if he'd been able to travel through time, it wouldn't have made things much different, since that would mean we'd failed to spot the extra Akaro at some point."
    new "四楼的搜查也顺利结束，我却又一次琢磨起 Akaro 究竟出了什么事。就算他真能穿越时间，局面也不会有太大不同——那意味着我们在某个时刻漏看了多出来的那个 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:12336
    old "Of course, that was assuming he'd undergone a similar experience to mine. If he'd traveled much farther into the past or appeared outside the tower, we'd be unable to find him again. Maybe we'd find him outside once the shutter retracted, but we couldn't think about that until our search ended with no results."
    new "当然，这得假设他经历的事和我类似。要是他被送去了更遥远的过去，或者出现在塔外，我们就再也找不到他了。也许等卷帘门升起后，我们能在外面找到他——但在搜查一无所获之前，还轮不到考虑这些。"

    # game/script.rpy:12348
    old "We hadn't found traces of a single person as we stepped on the last set of stairs, and unless we wanted to toss in the possibility of someone recently teleporting upstairs, nobody could've remained anywhere but on the crystal floor. There was no point in considering that Erina and Isla could've let the culprit pass deliberately, so we put our full focus on the final floor."
    new "踏上最后一段楼梯时，我们连一个人的踪迹都没发现。除非要把「有人刚刚传送到楼上」这种可能也算进去，否则除了水晶层，哪里都不可能还藏着人。怀疑 Erina 和 Isla 故意放走真凶也没有意义，于是我们把全部注意力放在了最后一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:12359
    old "You two stay here again. We'll do this quickly."
    new "你们两个还是留在这里。我们速战速决。"

    # game/script.rpy:12360
    old "We were about to begin when something caught our attention. From where we were, we could see that the door to the men's bathroom was slightly open."
    new "我们正要开始，某样东西却吸引了我们的注意。从我们站的位置，能看见男洗手间的门微微开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:12369
    old "Did we leave it like that...?"
    new "我们走的时候，门是开着的吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:12370
    old "The rest of us weren't sure either, but we'd all felt something was off. We still instructed Erina and Isla to stay next to the stairs and approached the bathroom with caution."
    new "剩下的人也都拿不准，但大家都察觉到不对劲。我们还是让 Erina 和 Isla 守在楼梯旁，自己则小心地靠近洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:12377
    old "As soon as we peeked inside, we knew we'd been right: the door had been opened farther. Next to Naomi's body was the toilet, and on top of it, Akaro sat, focusing his gaze on the wall in front of him.{w} When he noticed us, he slowly turned his head to the door and stood up."
    new "我们往里一探，就知道果然没错：门被推得更开了。Naomi 的尸体旁边是马桶，Akaro 就坐在上面，目光直直盯着面前的墙。{w} 察觉到我们，他缓缓把头转向门口，站了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:12389
    old "...Akaro? What are you doing?"
    new "……Akaro？你在做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:12395
    old "By which she means, where the fuck did you go?"
    new "她的意思是，你他妈到底跑哪儿去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:12396
    old "...{w}He barely reacted to our presence.{w} ...He slowly turned his head again and spent a few seconds in silence until he acknowledged us."
    new "……{w}他对我们的到来几乎没有反应。{w}……他又缓缓转过头，沉默了几秒，才总算理会了我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:12397
    old "Hey. I have a question..."
    new "喂。我有个问题……"

    # game/script.rpy:12398
    old "He took a bit of time to stand up. Maintaining a plain expression and breathing deeply, seemingly to calm his nerves, he spoke."
    new "他过了一会儿才站起来，脸上没什么表情，深深吸了口气，像是在平复心绪，然后才开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:12403
    old "Sai, you had a wristwatch, right? What... time is it?"
    new "Sai，你带着手表吧？现在……几点了？"

    # game/script.rpy:12408
    old "What?{w} It's {time=11:36.}"
    new "什么？{w} 现在是 {time=11:36.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:12409
    old "{time=11:36.} So it had been sixteen minutes since we'd heard the noise in the event room. It felt like more time had passed since the contents of those minutes had been dense, but it didn't seem wrong."
    new "{time=11:36.} 也就是说，从我们听到活动室传来声响算起，已经过了十六分钟。那段时间里发生的事太多，感觉上不止过了这么久，但细想也并不矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:12414
    old "{time=11:36}, I see. Of course, it appears you were wrong, Atsuki. We didn't travel through time..."
    new "{time=11:36}，原来如此。看来你确实弄错了，Atsuki。我们并没有时间穿越……"

    # game/script.rpy:12415
    old "\"We\"? Did you travel too?"
    new "你说的「我们」？你也穿越了？"

    # game/script.rpy:12416
    old "No, I just said I didn't. I think... we just hallucinated or something..."
    new "不，我刚说了没有。我想……我们只是产生了幻觉之类的吧……"

    # game/script.rpy:12423
    old "Oh...! Akaro, where were you?"
    new "啊……！Akaro，你刚才在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:12424
    old "We were looking for you."
    new "我们刚才一直在找你。"

    # game/script.rpy:12425
    old "Erina and Isla came to us once they realized we'd found something. From where we were, we could still see the stairs, so if someone went up, we'd at least spot them."
    new "Erina 和 Isla 察觉到我们发现了什么，就过来和我们会合。我们所在的位置还能看到楼梯，所以如果有人上楼，我们至少能看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:12432
    old "You hallucinated...? What exactly happened, and why did you disappear?"
    new "你产生了幻觉……？到底发生了什么，你又为什么会消失？"

    # game/script.rpy:12433
    old "I disappeared? Right, it seemed as if I teleported, and I heard some noise. I was still here, though, and after that... I just waited here until you appeared."
    new "我消失了？对，感觉像是被传送了一样，还听到了一些响动。可我其实一直在这里，之后……我就一直在这儿等着，直到你们出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:12439
    old "...Why did you wait here? What made you teleport?"
    new "……你为什么要在这里等？又是什么让你传送的？"

    # game/script.rpy:12440
    old "For some reason, Akaro was somewhat unresponsive. Was the cause... the teleportation itself? It might've been a shock, but at no point had I experienced a similar effect."
    new "不知为何，Akaro 有些反应迟钝。原因……是传送本身吗？那或许是种冲击，可我自己经历时，从未有过类似的感觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:12443
    old "I looked around the hallways a bit, and then I felt like waiting here. And I'm not sure what caused it. Maybe... it was the Sekimeiya."
    new "我在走廊里转了一圈，然后就想在这里等着。至于原因，我也说不准。也许……是 Sekimeiya 吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:12449
    old "Are you sure? We touched it right before you vanished and nothing happened."
    new "你确定？你消失之前我们也碰过它，什么都没发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:12450
    old "Well, yeah... I'm not sure, then."
    new "嗯，是啊……那我就不知道了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12456
    old "It doesn't make sense. I thought about it earlier.{w} If you touched the Sekimeiya, why was it shut in the cabinet after you disappeared?"
    new "这说不通。我之前就想过。{w}如果你碰过 Sekimeiya，那你消失之后，它为什么还锁在展示柜里？"

    # game/script.rpy:12457
    old "Huh...?{w} I don't know."
    new "咦……？{w}我不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:12458
    old "Akaro, just tell us exactly what happened."
    new "Akaro，你就把发生的事原原本本告诉我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:12459
    old "I am. It seemed as if I teleported, and then I searched around a bit, very confused. ...I waited in here until you showed up. Nothing else, and the time makes it clear: I didn't time travel. At most, I could have teleported, but I think something was wrong with me, and I imagined it."
    new "我说的就是实话。当时像是被传送了一样，之后我满心困惑地四处找了一圈。……然后就在这里等到你们出现。除此之外什么都没有，从时间上看也很清楚：我没有时间穿越。顶多就是被传送了，可我觉得是自己哪里不对劲，产生了错觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:12464
    old "You didn't imagine anything. You actually disappeared."
    new "你没有产生错觉。你是真的消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12465
    old "No... I did, I did imagine it. Teleporting is impossible."
    new "不……就是错觉，肯定是我的错觉。传送是不可能的。"

    # game/script.rpy:12472
    old "Well, we found the key to the attic. Naomi had it. We went up and looked for you, but we didn't find anything."
    new "总之，我们找到了阁楼的钥匙，在 Naomi 身上。我们上去找过你，却一无所获。"

    # game/script.rpy:12473
    old "I see."
    new "原来如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:12474
    old "I had no idea what had happened to him. Had teleporting changed him so much? It was reasonable to conclude that he was making it all up. The Sekimeiya hadn't worked for us, so why would he have been able to travel? And according to him, he hadn't moved through time, just space..."
    new "我完全不明白他到底出了什么事。传送会把他变成这样吗？推断他在编造，也说得过去。Sekimeiya 对我们没起作用，他凭什么能穿越？而且照他的说法，他没穿越时间，只是移动了空间……"

    # game/script.rpy:12480
    old "In other news, these shoes match. It's likely Naomi was in the attic."
    new "另外，这双鞋是配对的。Naomi 多半去过阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:12481
    old "...Shiroya, don't you want to cover her body again?"
    new "……Shiroya，她的遗体不打算再盖上吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:12487
    old "Huh...? Oh, yes, we should do that too."
    new "咦……？哦，对，是该这么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:12491
    old "...We all looked at each other, wondering what to think. No cameras existed in the bathroom, but since they were functional in hallway C, it was probably fine to at least do that much. However, Akaro's question had come out of left field."
    new "……我们面面相觑，不知该作何感想。浴室里没有摄像头，但 C走廊的摄像头还运作着，至少做到这一步应该无妨。只是，Akaro 忽然问出这句话，实在太突兀了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12492
    old "Sai and Shiroya went off on their own. They came back at the same time, and Shiroya was holding a velvet curtain."
    new "Sai 和 Shiroya 分头行动，又同时回来了。Shiroya 手里抱着一条天鹅绒遮布。"

    # game/script.rpy:12498
    old "The Sekimeiya's still there. I touched it too, and nothing happened."
    new "Sekimeiya 还在那儿。我也碰过了，什么都没发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:12499
    old "Akaro, did you touch it? What caused your teleportation?"
    new "Akaro，你碰过它吗？到底是什么引发了传送？"

    # game/script.rpy:12500
    old "I did. I think touching it is what triggered it."
    new "碰过。我想，就是碰到它才触发的。"

    # game/script.rpy:12506
    old "Why did you touch it? Didn't we all go to the next room? We had just touched it too."
    new "你为什么要碰它？我们不是都去了隔壁房间吗？我们才刚碰过它。"

    # game/script.rpy:12512
    old "Did you wanna steal it, maybe?"
    new "难不成，你是想把它偷走？"

    # game/script.rpy:12513
    old "As Shiroya covered Naomi's body with the curtain, Akaro took a few seconds to think about it."
    new "Shiroya 用遮布盖住 Naomi 的遗体时，Akaro 花了几秒钟考虑这个问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:12519
    old "I was only curious since I hadn't personally touched it yet. I didn't expect anything to happen."
    new "我只是好奇，毕竟我自己还没亲手碰过。我没料到会出什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:12525
    old "And where did you appear? We searched for you."
    new "那你出现在哪里？我们找过你。"

    # game/script.rpy:12526
    old "...Somewhere in hallway C, I think."
    new "……我想，是在 C走廊的某处。"

    # game/script.rpy:12529
    old "That's not possible. We searched all around this floor, and you weren't here."
    new "这不可能。这一层我们全找遍了，根本没见到你。"

    # game/script.rpy:12534
    old "Oh, that's right. I did see and hear you searching, but you didn't see me. I never left this floor..."
    new "哦，对了。你们找我的时候，我确实看见也听见了，可你们没看见我。我一直没离开过这一层……"

    # game/script.rpy:12541
    old "...What? That should be impossible."
    new "……什么？那应该不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:12542
    old "It's not, because it's what I experienced myself... After that, I stayed here until now."
    new "并非不可能，因为那是我亲身经历的……之后我就一直待在这里，直到现在。"

    # game/script.rpy:12543
    old "I had no idea how to interpret what he was saying.{w} At my side, Naomi's body rested under a beautiful cloth that practically occupied the entire bathroom floor. Given the surroundings, it wasn't the most respectful thing, but we couldn't do much else for her."
    new "我完全不知道该如何理解他的话。{w}我身旁，Naomi 的遗体躺在一块几乎铺满整个浴室地面的漂亮遮布下。受条件所限，这算不上多么体面的做法，可我们能为她做的也只有这些了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12549
    old "...So you didn't see the culprit? Or go to the other floors? We entered the attic. ...Don't you want to go?"
    new "……那你没看见凶手？也没去其他楼层？我们已经进过阁楼了。……你不想去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:12550
    old "No... not yet. You guys go, and I'll follow in a bit."
    new "不……暂时不去。你们先走吧，我过一会儿再上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:12556
    old "We can wait for you."
    new "我们可以等你。"

    # game/script.rpy:12561
    old "No, please, leave me alone for a bit longer. I'm still a bit curious about what this attic might be, so I'll go up shortly."
    new "不用了，请让我一个人再待一会儿。我对这阁楼究竟是怎么回事还有点好奇，很快就会上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:12567
    old "Are you serious? You'll have some explaining to do."
    new "你认真的？到时候你可得好好解释清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:12568
    old "Yes... Just leave me here for now."
    new "嗯……暂时就让我留在这里吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:12569
    old "All of us hesitated, baffled. We'd expected to get answers from Akaro if we found him, but he'd only given us more questions. It was possible he was just acting, but that wouldn't explain his disappearance. If he was correct, the Sekimeiya only made him travel through space..."
    new "我们都迟疑了，满心困惑。本以为找到 Akaro 就能得到答案，结果他却只让我们生出更多疑问。他也许只是在演戏，可这解释不了他的消失。若他所言属实，Sekimeiya 只是让他穿越了空间……"

    # game/script.rpy:12570
    old "It couldn't be. He couldn't have appeared in hallway C, or we would've found him. ...He was either lying or had a mistaken perspective."
    new "不可能。他若真的出现在 C走廊，我们不可能找不到他。……他要不是在说谎，就是他的认知出了偏差。"

    # game/script.rpy:12571
    old "Was there any other choice? I could only theorize that maybe our perspective was wrong instead, but I couldn't come up with an explanation beyond that."
    new "还能有别的选择吗？我只能推测，也许出错的反而是我们的认知，可除此之外，我再也想不出任何解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:12583
    old "I wasn't content with Sai's claim, so I made sure to check the event room. The mysterious egg was still inside the cabinet, and as Sai had done, I went ahead and touched it, receiving no response."
    new "我对 Sai 的说法并不放心，便特意去了活动室确认。那颗神秘的蛋仍摆在展示柜里，我像 Sai 那样伸手碰了碰，毫无反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:12586
    old "I lowered the curtain again and headed toward the stairs."
    new "我把遮布重新放下，朝楼梯走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:12591
    old "Why would it have worked for Akaro? Why had it worked for me the other time? And what about when Naomi traveled, since it was basically confirmed that she appeared in the attic...? Was there a recurring factor among the times it had worked?"
    new "为什么在 Akaro 身上就起了作用？之前在我身上又为什么能生效？还有 Naomi 那次穿越，既然基本可以确定她到过阁楼……？这几次成功之间，有没有什么共同点？"

    # game/script.rpy:12595
    old "Ultimately, we went up again. We hoped that Akaro would soon regain his composure so that we could draw more information out of him, but if he truly wasn't stable, it was best to leave him be. We told him that the elevator might still be disabled by the time he decided to go up and that we'd leave the door on floor 6 unlocked."
    new "最终，我们还是上去了。我们盼着 Akaro 能尽快平复下来，好从他口中问出更多消息；可若他当真情绪不稳，还是别去打扰为好。我们告诉他，等他想上楼时，电梯说不定还没恢复，六楼的门我们会留着不锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:12600
    old "We moved back up, unaware of what our goal had become and knowing that we hadn't thoroughly inspected the crystal floor. It was technically possible someone remained down there, as the sound we'd heard in the event room was yet to be explained, but we decided to ignore that and go along with what Akaro asked."
    new "我们又回到了楼上，说不清目的已经变成了什么，只知道水晶层还没彻底查过。严格来说，下面可能还有人——我们在活动室听到的声响至今没有解释——但我们还是决定不再理会，照 Akaro 说的做。"

    # game/script.rpy:12601
    old "Going up and down the stairs so often was getting tiring, but we couldn't take the elevator."
    new "这样上上下下地爬楼梯，实在累人，可电梯又坐不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12605
    old "Had Akaro really only teleported without moving through time? I kept circling around that detail.{w} Since we knew barely anything about the mechanism behind the Sekimeiya, I couldn't definitely object. However, I estimated that I went about twenty minutes to the past. If that was variable, it was possible Akaro hadn't realized he'd gone less than a minute to the past thanks to the time on Sai's wristwatch."
    new "Akaro 真的只是传送，而没有穿越时间吗？这个细节在我脑中反复打转。{w}我们对 Sekimeiya 背后的原理几乎一无所知，我自然无法断言不对。但按我的估计，我大约回到了二十分钟之前。倘若穿越的幅度并不固定，那 Akaro 或许只是凭 Sai 手表上的时间，没能察觉自己其实只回到了不到一分钟之前。"

    # game/script.rpy:12614
    old "Walls Of Glass"
    new "Walls Of Glass"

    # game/script.rpy:12621
    old "We entered the attic again. We'd left the door unlocked, and the key was still inserted in its hole. Since we didn't have anything in mind, we dispersed ourselves throughout the few rooms, waiting for Akaro's arrival."
    new "我们再次走进阁楼。门没有锁，钥匙也还插在锁孔里。反正也没什么头绪，我们便分散到几个房间里，等 Akaro 过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:12631
    old "Sai and Katei remained in the living room while Shiroya, Erina, Isla, and I entered the right bedroom. We'd been a group earlier, so staying together felt right. Shiroya and I threw ourselves onto the spacious bed and tried to rest for a bit, both of us pretty worn down."
    new "Sai 和 Katei 留在客厅，我则与 Shiroya、Erina、Isla 进了右侧的卧室。先前我们几个就一直待在一块儿，如今凑在一起也更安心。我和 Shiroya 一头扑到宽敞的床上，想歇一会儿——两个人都已经相当疲惫了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12639
    old "The other two mimicked us and sat at our side."
    new "另外两人也学着我们的样子，在我们身旁坐下。"

    # game/script.rpy:12645
    old "*yawn*"
    new "哈啊——"

    # game/script.rpy:12650
    old "Are you tired?"
    new "你困了？"

    # game/script.rpy:12651
    old "Yes... I hate waking up so early. Mom made me set my alarm to {time=6.}"
    new "嗯……我最讨厌起这么早了。妈妈非要我把闹钟定在 {time=6.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:12656
    old "That early? Do you live far from the tower?"
    new "那么早？你住得离塔很远吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:12661
    old "No, but I knew a lot of people would come today. I wanted us to be some of the first visitors so that I could drop Isla off at school afterward."
    new "不远，不过我知道今天会有很多人来。我想让我们赶在头一批进去，这样之后还能送 Isla 去学校。"

    # game/script.rpy:12667
    old "I see. You must be pretty happy that you'll get to skip the entire school day."
    new "原来如此。能翘掉一整天的课，你一定很高兴吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:12672
    old "Yeah, but I already knew that would happen."
    new "嗯，不过我早就知道会这样了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12678
    old "...Oh, right."
    new "……啊，也对。"

    # game/script.rpy:12684
    old "So, is this the first time you came here?"
    new "话说回来，你是第一次来这里吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:12689
    old "Yup. I didn't know this place was so cool."
    new "对呀。我都不知道这里这么厉害。"

    # game/script.rpy:12694
    old "That's surprising. With how much you seem to like gemstones, I figured you would've come here before."
    new "这倒让我意外。看你这么喜欢宝石，我还以为你以前来过呢。"

    # game/script.rpy:12699
    old "She's had many passing interests. She just got back from school one day and told me she wanted to come to this place."
    new "她感兴趣的东西多了，都只是一阵风。有天放学回来，她突然就跟我说想来这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:12704
    old "Because Amelie came to school with a really pretty bracelet. She said it was... uh, athemist like the ones in Ashiya Tower. She let everyone touch it but me. I don't know why, but she doesn't like me."
    new "因为 Amelie 戴着一条特别漂亮的手链来学校。她说那是……呃，紫水晶，跟芦屋塔里的一样。她让每个人都摸，就是不让我碰。我也不知道为什么，她就是不喜欢我。"

    # game/script.rpy:12709
    old "...I see. That's why you looked so happy downstairs."
    new "……我明白了。难怪你在楼下看起来那么开心。"

    # game/script.rpy:12714
    old "I actually told her that I didn't want to bring her here at first. I should've just stuck to that, but she kept mentioning it, and when she's infatuated with something, she doesn't talk about anything else. ...I caved in too quickly."
    new "其实我一开始就跟她说过，不想带她来。我要是坚持住就好了，可她一直提，一旦迷上什么，嘴里就再没别的了。……我松口松得太快了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12719
    old "That was only when Amelie said that her parents wouldn't let her go see the Sekimeiya. She was saying really ugly things about her mom, but she always buys her anything she asks for. I don't get it."
    new "那只是因为 Amelie 说她爸妈不让她去看 Sekimeiya。她把她妈妈说得可难听了，可她要什么，她妈妈明明都会给她买。我搞不懂。"

    # game/script.rpy:12724
    old "It's good that you're not like that. I'm sure she'll be embarrassed about that when she's older."
    new "你不像她那样，这很好。等她长大些，一定会为自己说过的话害臊的。"

    # game/script.rpy:12729
    old "Everyone really likes her, though. I don't hate her, but she's really mean sometimes."
    new "可是大家都很喜欢她。我也不讨厌她，只是她有时候真的很刻薄。"

    # game/script.rpy:12730
    old "So you live in Yushibana, right? You probably go to the same school Atsuki and I attended. There were some people like that when we were your age, but they all matured eventually. I think that's an effect of there being so few people."
    new "那你住在丰花，对吧？你上的多半就是我和 Atsuki 念过的那所学校。我们像你这么大的时候，也有几个那样的人，不过后来都慢慢懂事了。我想，这大概跟这里人少有关吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:12735
    old "Oh! You went to my school? Do you know Miss Bisky?"
    new "哦！你也是我那所学校的？你认识 Bisky 老师吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:12736
    old "The teacher?"
    new "你说老师？"

    # game/script.rpy:12737
    old "Yeah!"
    new "对呀！"

    # game/script.rpy:12742
    old "She still works there? I remember her, yeah. She was always really nice to us."
    new "她还在那儿教书？我记得她，嗯。她一直对我们特别好。"

    # game/script.rpy:12747
    old "She's my favorite teacher. I'll tell her that I met you two."
    new "她是我最喜欢的老师。我要告诉她，我碰到你们俩了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12748
    old "I'm surprised she's still there. She was pretty old when she taught us."
    new "她居然还在，真让人意外。教我们那会儿，她年纪就已经不小了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12753
    old "She knew we were going to come here, so she might be a bit worried if she heard about what happened. She's usually the person behind Isla's sudden interests. One day, she told her that she had an aquarium at home. The next few weeks, I didn't hear about anything except wanting to go to an aquarium."
    new "她知道我们要来这儿，要是听说了发生的事，说不定会有点担心。Isla 那些突然冒出来的兴趣，多半都是她带起来的。有一天她跟 Isla 说自己家里有鱼缸，接下来好几个星期，除了想去看鱼缸，我就没听她提过别的。"

    # game/script.rpy:12758
    old "Do you remember how interested you became in fish out of nowhere? Where did that passion go? Did you read all the books I bought you?"
    new "你还记得自己当初怎么突然迷上鱼的吗？那股热情跑哪儿去了？我给你买的那些书，你都读完了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:12763
    old "I still love them! And yes, I read all of them. Did you know that fish can get sunburned when they're near the surface?"
    new "我现在也还喜欢呀！而且那些书我全读完了。你知道吗，鱼游到水面附近的时候也会被晒伤？"

    # game/script.rpy:12773
    old "I prefer them pan-seared.{w} Why are you all on the bed? We didn't inspect this floor that thoroughly, so you should be looking for clues."
    new "我倒更喜欢煎的。{w}你们都赖在床上干什么？这一层我们还没仔细查过，该去找线索才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:12774
    old "Why don't you do that?"
    new "那你怎么不去找？"

    # game/script.rpy:12779
    old "Sorry, I need to keep my eyes on Katei in case he kills Naomi a third time. Let me know if you find something."
    new "抱歉，我得看紧 Katei，提防他第三次对 Naomi 下手。你们要是查到什么，跟我说一声。"

    # game/script.rpy:12790
    old "...Sai is so weird."
    new "……Sai 真奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:12791
    old "Yeah, maybe you should forget what I said about people here maturing."
    new "是啊，刚才我说这里的人总会懂事——你就当我没说过吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:12792
    old "He doesn't go to our school, right? He's around our age, and I don't think I've seen him before."
    new "他不跟我们上同一所学校吧？他年纪跟我们差不多，可我好像从没见过他。"

    # game/script.rpy:12797
    old "He might go to the one outside town. I don't know him either."
    new "他说不定上的是镇外那所。我也不认识他。"

    # game/script.rpy:12802
    old "Instead of doing what Sai said, we reclined on the bed. Unlike me, Shiroya had always been good at dealing with kids. The tone of her voice changed significantly when she talked to Isla. I wished the conversation would continue just so that I could keep hearing it."
    new "我们没有照 Sai 说的去做，反倒又躺回了床上。与我不同，Shiroya 一向很会跟小孩子相处。她和 Isla 说话时，语气变了许多。我甚至盼着这场对话别停，好让我一直听下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:12803
    old "The three of them had all been holding something to contain their belongings. Just like Sai had his hip pack, Shiroya carried a modest purse she'd had for a long time. Isla had a child-sized shoulder purse, and Erina had a bigger, black purse with her."
    new "她们三个都带着装随身物品的包。就像 Sai 有他的腰包一样，Shiroya 拎着一只用了很久的普通手提包；Isla 背的是儿童尺寸的挎包；Erina 则带着一只更大的黑色手提包。"

    # game/script.rpy:12805
    old "Something caught my attention, so I stood back up."
    new "有什么东西引起了我的注意，我便站了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:12811
    old "What are you looking at? That's mine."
    new "你在看什么？那是我的。"

    # game/script.rpy:12812
    old "I couldn't see inside Shiroya's or Erina's, but Isla's had remained slightly open while she was lying face-up. Inside, something felt out of place."
    new "Shiroya 和 Erina 的包我看不到里面，可 Isla 仰面躺着时，她的包一直半开着。里面的某样东西看着不太对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:12819
    old "Hm? That's my purse. I don't use it every day, but I took it today."
    new "嗯？那是我的包。我平时不是每天都用，不过今天带上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12820
    old "I mean that device."
    new "我是说那个装置。"

    # game/script.rpy:12825
    old "...Device? What are you talking about?"
    new "……装置？你在说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:12826
    old "Erina and Isla got up and frowned when they saw what had intrigued me."
    new "Erina 和 Isla 站起身来，看到引起我注意的东西后，眉头都皱了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:12831
    old "...Oh, is that a recorder? It has a play and record button."
    new "……哦，这是录音笔吧？上面有播放键和录音键。"

    # game/script.rpy:12836
    old "What...? I don't know. I've never seen it."
    new "什么……？我不知道。我从没见过这东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:12841
    old "It was inside your purse. Where did you get it?"
    new "它就在你的手提包里。你从哪儿弄来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:12842
    old "I just said I've never seen it before... I don't know what it's doing here."
    new "我刚说了，我从来没见过它……我也不知道它怎么会在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:12847
    old "...Are you making things up again? What's it doing in your purse if you've never seen it before?"
    new "……你又在编故事了？既然从没见过，它怎么会在你包里？"

    # game/script.rpy:12852
    old "I'm telling you that I don't know!"
    new "我说了我不知道！"

    # game/script.rpy:12861
    old "It wasn't very big, but it occupied most of the space in the purse. It was hard to believe anyone could've dropped it inside while Isla had been wearing it, and I hadn't seen her leaving it behind anywhere and giving someone an opportunity to plant an object in it. Shiroya grabbed the device and began to fiddle with it."
    new "它并不算大，却占去了手提包里大半的空间。要说在 Isla 拎着包的时候有人能把它塞进去，实在难以想象；而且我也没见她把包放在哪里，让人有机会往里面放东西。Shiroya 拿起那个装置，摆弄了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:12862
    old "There's a record button and a recording saved. I think we can listen to it. This seems to be a speaker."
    new "上面有个录音键，里面还存着一段录音。应该能听。这大概是个扬声器。"

    # game/script.rpy:12863
    old "On one side of the recorder, a symbol indicated that audio could come out of it. On the back was a slot for an SD card, but there wasn't one inserted."
    new "录音笔的一侧印着一个符号，表示声音可以从那里放出。背面是一个 SD 卡插槽，但里面没有插卡。"

    # game/script.rpy:12864
    old "When Shiroya pressed the \"record\" button, a message appeared. It said: \"Delete previous recording before starting a new one\".{w} Instead of doing that, Shiroya selected the single audio track with the circle pad and pressed the play button."
    new "Shiroya 按下「录音」键，屏幕上跳出一行提示：「删除已有录音后方可开始新录音」。{w} 她没有照做，而是用圆形摇杆选中了唯一的那段音频，按下播放键。"

    # game/script.rpy:12867
    old "A time bar appeared on the screen. Static started playing immediately, and we frowned, waiting for something else to happen.{w} On the screen, the seconds ticked up for a while as the static went on. ...Were we hearing footsteps?{w} Eventually, that noise was interrupted by a very loud one. It sounded as if someone had sat right next to us. Then, that person heaved a sigh, and as soon as they started speaking, we recognized who they were."
    new "屏幕上出现了一条时间轴。沙沙的杂音随即响起，我们皱起眉，等着别的动静。{w} 杂音持续着，屏幕上的秒数一点点往上跳。……那是脚步声吗？{w} 不久，那阵杂音被一阵很响的动静打断了，那声响听起来就像有人就在我们身旁坐了下来。接着，那人长叹一口气，刚一开口，我们就认出了那是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:12873
    old "Well... what do we do now?"
    new "那么……现在怎么办？"

    # game/script.rpy:12874
    old "We immediately recognized it as Akaro's voice."
    new "我们立刻听出那是 Akaro 的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:12881
    old "Wh-Why did I have this?"
    new "为、为什么我会有这个？"

    # game/script.rpy:12882
    old "Does it show the date anywhere?"
    new "上面有显示日期吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:12883
    old "No... there's nothing like that."
    new "没有……没看到这类东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:12889
    old "What do you want to do? We might've been here for more than a month and the exit's not open. Unless you wanna take down the shutter by hand, we can only keep waiting."
    new "你想怎么办？我们可能已经在这儿待了一个多月，出口还是没开。除非你想徒手把卷帘门拆下来，否则只能继续等。"

    # game/script.rpy:12890
    old "Shiroya's eyes met mine in disbelief. \"More than a month\"? Our fear was amplified by the next sentence we heard."
    new "Shiroya 难以置信地看向我。「一个多月」？紧接着传来的那句话，让我们更加害怕了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12891
    old "I don't get it. What the hell happened? Did Ashiya just abandon their own building with us inside...? And we thought we'd be free after twelve hours..."
    new "我不明白。到底出了什么事？芦屋就这么把自己楼里的人丢下不管了……？我们还以为熬过十二小时就能出去……"

    # game/script.rpy:12892
    old "What...!? Th-This can't mean...?"
    new "什么……！？这、这该不会是说……？"

    # game/script.rpy:12893
    old "And once again, the recording hammered us with the hardest hit yet."
    new "而录音又一次给了我们最沉重的一击。"

    # game/script.rpy:12894
    old "Atsuki, what are you thinking about? Do you have any more ideas...? And hey, Erina, what's with that face?"
    new "Atsuki，你在想什么？还有什么主意吗……？还有，Erina，你那是什么表情？"

    # game/script.rpy:12901
    old "It almost seemed as if Sai had been talking to us directly. We were speechless, wondering if we were there too."
    new "那语气几乎就像 Sai 在直接对我们说话。我们说不出话来，只在心里揣测：我们是不是也在那里？"

    # game/script.rpy:12907
    old "What, not going to answer?"
    new "怎么，不打算回答？"

    # game/script.rpy:12908
    old "Then, we heard the recorder play the sound of a door being pushed, and following it, gasps. Expressions of pure shock filled our ears, which perfectly conveyed the bewilderment shared by everyone who'd been recorded."
    new "接着，录音笔里传出推门的声音，随后是几声倒抽冷气。那些声音里满是震惊，把被录下的每一个人共有的茫然传达得淋漓尽致。"

    # game/script.rpy:12909
    old "Isla...! What the hell!?"
    new "Isla……！搞什么鬼！？"

    # game/script.rpy:12910
    old "What...? Isla, when did this happen?"
    new "什么……？Isla，这是什么时候的事？"

    # game/script.rpy:12911
    old "She indicated that she had no idea with a gesture, so we kept waiting while the device emitted nothing but silence."
    new "她做了个手势，表示自己毫不知情。于是我们继续等着，装置里只剩一片寂静。"

    # game/script.rpy:12912
    old "Hey, answer us...! Wh-What are you looking at!?"
    new "喂，回答我们啊……！你、你在看什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:12913
    old "...{w}Where am I...?"
    new "……{w}我这是在哪儿……？"

    # game/script.rpy:12914
    old "Wh-What do you mean? We're still in Ashiya Tower. Do you not remember?"
    new "你、你说什么？我们还在芦屋塔里啊。你不记得了？"

    # game/script.rpy:12915
    old "No, I know. What I mean is... what happened to me? Where am I?"
    new "不，我知道。我是说……我到底怎么了？我在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:12919
    old "Akaro's confusion must've been shared by the rest of us. What kind of question was that, regardless of the context?"
    new "Akaro 的困惑想必也是我们所有人的困惑。不管放在什么情境下，那都是个莫名其妙的问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:12920
    old "No... I should be..."
    new "不对……我应该在……"

    # game/script.rpy:12922
    old "Following that, there were a couple of unsteady, heavy footfalls, most likely someone staggering. During the next few seconds, Isla cried, and nobody spoke, inside or outside the recording."
    new "紧接着，响起两三下沉重而不稳的脚步声，多半是有人踉跄了一下。接下来的几秒里，Isla 叫了一声，录音里外都没有人说话。"

    # game/script.rpy:12929
    old "Huh...?{w} I've never... done this."
    new "咦……？{w}我从来没……做过这种事。"

    # game/script.rpy:12935
    old "I-Isla, what's gotten into you? ...What are you holding?{w} And Erina, why aren't you doing anything!?"
    new "Isla，你、你这是怎么了？……你手里拿的是什么？{w} 还有 Erina，你怎么什么都不做！？"

    # game/script.rpy:12936
    old "With a final sob... the recording ended.{w} The screen left us with a button to rewind the audio, and we remained motionless, with expressions we'd never worn before."
    new "随着最后一声啜泣……录音结束了。{w} 屏幕上只剩下一个倒回音频的按钮，我们一动不动，脸上挂着从未有过的神情。"

    # game/script.rpy:12937
    old "I'd fallen unconscious from a smoke attack, probably traveled to the past, and found two dead bodies that belonged to the same person. However, the sensation left by that bizarre recording surpassed all of those."
    new "我因烟雾袭击昏了过去，多半是经历了时间穿越，还发现了两具属于同一个人的尸体。可那段诡异录音留下的感触，比这一切都更强烈。"

    # game/script.rpy:12944
    old "...It said that we'd be here for over a month. It's not possible, right? Even if the exit doesn't open, the people outside would find a way to rescue us."
    new "录音里说我们会在这儿待一个多月。这不可能吧？就算出口不开，外面的人也会想办法来救我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:12949
    old "Y-Yes. This must be a trap created by Sai and Akaro."
    new "对、对。这一定是 Sai 和 Akaro 设下的圈套。"

    # game/script.rpy:12950
    old "Usually, I would have also jumped to that possibility, but Isla was in that recording too. Could she have been in on it?"
    new "换作平时，我也会马上想到这种可能，可那段录音里也有 Isla。难道她也参与其中？"

    # game/script.rpy:12951
    old "I remembered Isla's \"friend\". Were Sai and Akaro somehow involved in everything?"
    new "我想起了 Isla 的「朋友」。难道 Sai 和 Akaro 与这一切都有关联？"

    # game/script.rpy:12956
    old "You and Atsuki were mentioned as if you were there, but you didn't actually say anything. And Katei and I weren't mentioned at all, but with how short it was, that doesn't mean anything."
    new "录音里提到你和 Atsuki，好像你们也在场，可你们其实一句话都没说。至于我和 Katei，根本没被提到——不过录音那么短，这也说明不了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:12957
    old "It didn't mean anything, but it was still unsettling. According to the recorded Sai, I'd been quiet for a while and Erina's behavior had also been strange."
    new "说明不了什么，却仍让人心里发毛。按录音里 Sai 的说法，我沉默了很长一段时间，Erina 的举动也有些反常。"

    # game/script.rpy:12958
    old "If we were to believe the contents of the recording, it meant that it had somehow traveled to the past from one month in the future. I couldn't even imagine why and how that would've happened."
    new "若录音的内容属实，那就意味着它不知怎么从一个月后的未来回到了过去。至于其中的缘由和方式，我根本无从想象。"

    # game/script.rpy:12961
    old "Isla, sorry to ask again, but be as honest as you can. Have you really never seen this device? Have you really never spoken the words we just heard? And do you really not know anything about it?"
    new "Isla，抱歉再问一次，但请你尽量说实话。你真的从没见过这个设备？我们刚才听到的那些话，你真的从没说过？关于它，你真的什么都不知道？"

    # game/script.rpy:12966
    old "I promise... I have no idea where this came from, and I never said any of that... You believe me, Tanya, right?"
    new "我保证……我不知道这东西是从哪来的，那些话我也从没说过……坦桑娅，你相信我的，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:12972
    old "Y-Yes, but this is surreal."
    new "是……是的，可这也太不可思议了。"

    # game/script.rpy:12973
    old "Isla had begun to sound like she had in the recording, trying not to break down. The four of us had just been handed a month-long sentence with no bail, and it sounded as if it could be extended indefinitely."
    new "Isla 说话的语气已经和录音里一样了，正强撑着不让情绪崩溃。我们四人刚被判了一个月、不得保释的刑期，而这刑期听上去还可能无限延长。"

    # game/script.rpy:12974
    old "Don't worry. This recording must've been manipulated. There are plenty of things in it that don't make sense."
    new "别担心。这录音肯定被人动过手脚。里面说不通的地方多得是。"

    # game/script.rpy:12975
    old "Of course, as Shiroya said, we'll be rescued if things go wrong when the exit is supposed to open. There's no food here, so it's impossible we could be here for an entire month. Akaro and Sai sounded perfectly healthy, didn't they?"
    new "当然，就像Shiroya说的，出口该打开时若出了岔子，会有人来救我们。这里没有食物，我们不可能在这儿待上整整一个月。Akaro和Sai听起来都很健康，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:12980
    old "That's right. I bet they didn't think this through. There's still nine hours until we can leave, but no more than that. Don't believe any of this, Isla. We're fine. We'll all be fine."
    new "没错。我看他们根本没想周全。我们还要九个小时才能离开，但也仅此而已。别信这些，Isla。我们没事。大家都会没事的。"

    # game/script.rpy:12983
    old "Like Isla, I was looking forward to making it out a lot more than I appeared. I wanted my life to get back on track and go to the mountains with Shiroya as we'd agreed."
    new "和Isla一样，我比表面上更盼望能出去。我想让生活回到正轨，想按约定和Shiroya一起去山里。"

    # game/script.rpy:12984
    old "The thought of remaining imprisoned crushed down on my shoulders. We had come to the tower for the purpose of getting a fresh start, and the recording threatened to turn all of that on its head once again."
    new "一想到还要被困在这里，我的双肩就像被压垮了一般。我们来这座塔，本是为了重新开始，而那段录音却可能把这一切再次掀翻。"

    # game/script.rpy:12985
    old "I believe we heard something else that stood out. Apart from what Isla said, the way Sai phrased it...{w} \"We might've been here for more than a month.\"{w} ...This \"might've\" is very odd."
    new "我觉得还有一处很突兀。除了Isla说的那些，Sai的措辞……{w}「我们可能已经在这里待了一个多月。」{w}……这个「可能」很反常。"

    # game/script.rpy:12990
    old "Oh, that's right... Why would he not be sure?"
    new "哦，对……他为什么会不确定？"

    # game/script.rpy:12991
    old "It's true that we could easily lose track of time after spending a month locked in here, but we could know how long it's been just by looking at the date."
    new "在这里关一个月，确实容易记不清时日，可只要看看日期，就能知道过了多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:12992
    old "And on the crystal floor, we have a computer that displays it. Even Sai himself has a watch in case the computer stopped working."
    new "而且水晶层有台电脑会显示日期。就算电脑坏了，Sai自己也带着手表。"

    # game/script.rpy:12994
    old "It has to be a trick, and one that's easy to see right through. Someone must've put this recorder in your purse."
    new "这肯定是个把戏，而且一眼就能看穿。一定是有人把录音笔塞进了你的手提包。"

    # game/script.rpy:12997
    old "Do you know when that could've happened?"
    new "你知道那可能是什么时候的事吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:13002
    old "No... I had it the whole time since we left home."
    new "不知道……从家里出来以后，它一直都在我身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:13003
    old "When you entered the tower, a guard looked at your purse, right? Do you remember if it was there?"
    new "你进塔的时候，警卫检查过你的手提包，对吧？你还记得那时它在不在吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:13005
    old "I-I don't know. I didn't look, I just gave it to him."
    new "我……我不知道。我没看，直接把包递给他了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13007
    old "...{w}Isla, mind telling us the identity of your friend now? She could've had access to it, and somehow, she knew this incident would happen. Not only that, but she lied to you, right? About the number of people and when she said that nothing bad would happen."
    new "……{w}Isla，现在能告诉我们你那位朋友是谁了吗？她有可能接触过这支录音笔，而且不知怎么就知道会出事。不止如此，她还骗了你，对吧？人数上骗了你，还说不会出什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:13012
    old "N-No! She has nothing to do with this, I promise! She was wrong, but she didn't lie. She's waiting for me outside, and I don't wanna leave her alone for long. Christmas is in ten days, and we promised we'd spend it together..."
    new "不……不是的！这事跟她没关系，我保证！她只是说错了，没有撒谎。她还在外面等我，我不想把她一个人留在外面太久。再过十天就是圣诞节，我们约好一起过的……"

    # game/script.rpy:13024
    old "Before I could press her further, the door opened and Sai appeared with Katei behind him. They forcibly stepped in and closed the door again."
    new "我还没来得及追问，门就开了，Sai走进来，Katei跟在后面。两人硬挤进门，又把门关上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13026
    old "Hey guys. I found a little thing."
    new "各位。我发现了点小东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:13031
    old "Can you just say what it is already?"
    new "你倒是直接说是什么啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:13032
    old "Yes, that's why we came here. It wouldn't have been the same without them."
    new "对，我们就是为这个来的。没有他们可就不一样了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13033
    old "I thought about it. Was Sai hiding something from us? If he was, it must've been something pretty significant."
    new "我琢磨了一下。Sai是不是有什么瞒着我们？要真是这样，那一定不是小事。"

    # game/script.rpy:13034
    old "Instead of asking questions, we waited for what he had to say. While he wasn't paying attention, Erina put the recorder back inside Isla's purse to avoid being questioned. Isla and Erina could easily be called suspicious if anyone knew they had it."
    new "我们没有追问，只等着他开口。趁他没注意，Erina把录音笔放回了Isla的手提包，免得被人问起。要是有人知道录音笔在她们手上，Isla和Erina很容易被当成嫌疑人。"

    # game/script.rpy:13039
    old "Who wants to read this?"
    new "谁想看这个？"

    # game/script.rpy:13040
    old "Sai was holding a folded piece of paper. Since there were no volunteers, he handed it to me."
    new "Sai手里拿着一张折起来的纸。没人应声，他便递给了我。"

    # game/script.rpy:13045
    old "You've been chosen. I found this in a drawer in the kitchen."
    new "就你了。这是我在厨房抽屉里找到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:13046
    old "I sighed faintly and began to read."
    new "我轻轻叹了口气，读了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:13049
    old "\"Sir, I have done as you instructed, and I didn't spot any difference in the attic since Xyn's last attack. I believe it wasn't targeted.\""
    new "「先生，我已经照你的吩咐做了。自Xyn上次袭击以来，阁楼里没有发现任何异常。我想这里并不是目标。」"

    # game/script.rpy:13050
    old "\"I've finished this month's preservations, but some paint has begun to wear off, so next month I'll attempt to fix that on my own. Until then, thank you for your trust and let me know if you have any new requests.\""
    new "「本月的养护工作已经完成，不过有些漆面开始脱落，下个月我会试着自己修补。在那之前，谢谢你的信任，若有新的吩咐请告诉我。」"

    # game/script.rpy:13051
    old "\"Naomi\"."
    new "「Naomi」。"

    # game/script.rpy:13056
    old "...It's a letter from Naomi?"
    new "……这是Naomi写的信？"

    # game/script.rpy:13062
    old "Precisely—your ears do work. It sounds as if Naomi was tasked with keeping this attic tidy. It's addressed to the head of the Ashiya family, who must've lived here back in the day."
    new "正是——看来你的耳朵没毛病。看样子Naomi负责打理这间阁楼。信是写给芦屋家当主的，当年住在这里的想必就是那位。"

    # game/script.rpy:13072
    old "Understand? It means that Katei has lied yet again! It's great, he never stops. We're going to set a world record at this rate."
    new "明白了吗？这就是说Katei又撒了一次谎！真棒，他这谎话简直没完没了。照这势头，我们都要破世界纪录了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13078
    old "I suppose you're right. He must've known about this, so finding the attic key in Naomi's pocket shouldn't have been a big surprise."
    new "我想你说得对。他肯定早就知道这事，所以在Naomi口袋里找到阁楼钥匙，本不该让人那么吃惊。"

    # game/script.rpy:13083
    old "I didn't know. I don't look through these cameras very often, and according to this letter, she worked here once a month. It makes sense that I never saw her."
    new "我不知情。我不常翻看这些监控，而信上说她每月来这里工作一次。我没见过她，这也说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:13088
    old "Holy shit, Katei. You know that you're fucked once we get out, right? You said that you work here with Naomi and that she tried to personally convince you of her innocence earlier because of that.{w} ...But you didn't know what her job entailed?"
    new "我靠，Katei。你知道出去以后你就完了，对吧？你说过你和Naomi在这里共事，还说她之前就是因为这个才亲自来找你、想让你相信她清白。{w}……可你竟然不知道她负责什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:13093
    old "I didn't. It's not my business to know what everyone does. I certainly didn't see her often, so I never knew exactly what her work was."
    new "不知道。别人做什么，不该由我过问。我确实不常看到她，自然一直不清楚她的具体工作。"

    # game/script.rpy:13098
    old "Yeah, of course. She's probably been handling this floor by herself for years, and you, who takes care of the security of the entire building, never knew that. This letter mentions Xyn, so it must be recent enough, most likely from last month."
    new "是啊，当然了。她大概一个人打理这一层好几年了，而负责整栋楼安保的你，却全然不知。这封信提到了Xyn，说明它是最近写的，多半就是上个月的。"

    # game/script.rpy:13099
    old "It must've happened when I wasn't present in the tower, since I only have the night shift every two weeks. For example, if she only came the first day of every month, I would never have seen her."
    new "那一定是在我不在塔里的时候发生的，因为我每两周才上一次夜班。比方说，她若只在每月第一天来，我就永远碰不上她。"

    # game/script.rpy:13100
    old "Was it not a second ago when you said you'd seen her a few times?"
    new "你刚才不是还说你见过她几次吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:13106
    old "Katei never answered, but he looked enraged during the moments of silence that followed."
    new "Katei始终没有回答，但在随后的沉默里，他满脸怒容。"

    # game/script.rpy:13107
    old "Well, it seems Naomi had direct communication with Ashiya and she was a trusted individual tasked with maintaining this special floor. I bet that's why she was chosen for her new job and told the secret of the Sekimeiya's true purpose."
    new "看来Naomi与芦屋有直接联系，是个受信任的人，负责维护这一特殊楼层。我敢说，正因如此她才被选中接下新工作，还被告知了Sekimeiya真正用途的秘密。"

    # game/script.rpy:13110
    old "...None of us appeared to care much about the letter given what we'd just heard. Sai was excited to find something that strengthened his suspicions about Katei, but we'd all accepted at some point that he was lying about a number of things. It was routine."
    new "……听了刚才那些话，我们似乎都没太把这封信放在心上。Sai找到了能加深他对Katei怀疑的东西，兴奋不已，但我们早就在某个时候接受了：他在不少事情上都在撒谎。这已是常态。"

    # game/script.rpy:13111
    old "We heard the sound of a zipper being unfastened coming from the bed."
    new "床边传来拉链被拉开的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:13117
    old "...Hey, Shiroya, what's that?"
    new "……喂，Shiroya，那是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:13125
    old "We all turned to her and saw a key in her hand."
    new "我们一齐看向她，只见她手里拿着一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:13130
    old "Did you get that from your purse? Isn't that...?"
    new "你从包里翻出来的？那不是……？"

    # game/script.rpy:13136
    old "Yes, it's the cabinet key. The Sekimeiya cabinet's."
    new "嗯，是展示柜的钥匙。Sekimeiya 展示柜的。"

    # game/script.rpy:13138
    old "I-I think it is. It was inside."
    new "大、大概吧。它就在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:13145
    old "What were you looking for?"
    new "你在找什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:13150
    old "Oh, nothing. I don't know how this got here, though..."
    new "啊，没什么。只是我不知道这东西怎么会在包里……"

    # game/script.rpy:13151
    old "She wouldn't admit it, but after Isla found something so bizarre inside her own purse, Shiroya must've felt the need to check hers too—and it yielded a result."
    new "她不肯承认，可Isla从自己包里翻出那么离奇的东西之后，Shiroya想必也想查查自己的包——而这一查，还真查出了名堂。"

    # game/script.rpy:13152
    old "I see, so you had the key. Very interesting."
    new "原来如此，钥匙在你手上。真有意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:13153
    old "...Someone had to put it in here without me noticing."
    new "……肯定是有人趁我不注意塞进来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:13158
    old "...Is that so? Don't I get to suspect you?"
    new "……是吗？那我是不是也该怀疑你？"

    # game/script.rpy:13163
    old "I mean, it wasn't inside, but in this side pocket that should've been empty and where anyone could've easily dropped it."
    new "我的意思是，它不在主袋里，而是在这个侧袋——本来该是空的，谁都能轻易塞进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:13165
    old "I suppose you would've left it in the main section, where the zipper could hide it. I'm fine believing that."
    new "换作是你，应该会把它留在主袋里，拉链一拉就藏住了。这个说法我倒愿意相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:13173
    old "...Before we realized that this key was missing from the first Naomi, only the real culprit or the group that inspected hallway B could've picked it up. So Shiroya, Sai, and Akaro."
    new "……在我们察觉第一个Naomi身上缺了这把钥匙之前，能拿到它的只有真凶，或者搜查过B走廊的那几个人。也就是Shiroya、Sai和Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:13174
    old "Sai, who searched the room with Naomi?"
    new "Sai，当时和Naomi一起搜查房间的是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:13180
    old "So he could've picked it up and later dropped it inside Shiroya's purse. However, he couldn't have unlocked the Sekimeiya cabinet, right?"
    new "那他就有可能捡到钥匙，之后又塞进Shiroya包里。可是，他不可能打开Sekimeiya的展示柜，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:13181
    old "...Yes. Nobody entered the event room."
    new "……对。没人进过活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:13182
    old "Okay, then the only suspects are Sai, Akaro, and whoever the killer was. Shiroya didn't enter Naomi's room, so she couldn't have even picked that key up."
    new "好，那可疑的就只剩Sai、Akaro，还有凶手。Shiroya没进过Naomi的房间，连捡到那把钥匙的机会都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:13187
    old "Surely she could've if she killed Naomi, right? I know she's supposed to have an alibi, but remember that you traveled to the past and anyone might've been able to appear on the crystal floor."
    new "要是她杀了Naomi，那不就捡得到了？我知道她有不在场证明，可别忘了你穿越到了过去，谁都有可能出现在水晶层上。"

    # game/script.rpy:13192
    old "The real suspect here is obviously Sai.{w} Akaro couldn't have done anything with the key, but Sai could've unlocked the cabinet because he was outside the hallway B rooms during the search."
    new "这里真正可疑的显然是Sai。{w}Akaro就算拿到钥匙也做不了什么，可Sai能打开展示柜——搜查的时候，他人就在B走廊的房门外。"

    # game/script.rpy:13197
    old "But I didn't do it, and I definitely couldn't have hidden the Sekimeiya in the storeroom, so ultimately, the only suspect here is Katei, who killed Naomi. Shiroya's been wearing her purse off to her side, so it wouldn't be too hard to hide a small key in there without her knowing."
    new "可我没做过，也绝不可能把Sekimeiya藏进储藏室，所以到头来，唯一可疑的就是杀了Naomi的Katei。Shiroya的包一直挂在身侧，想不让她察觉地塞一把小钥匙进去，并不难。"

    # game/script.rpy:13202
    old "God! I didn't kill Naomi, and if I had to hide a key, I'd hide it in a room. If I put it in someone's purse, I'd at least make sure they could actually be suspected. Shiroya couldn't have picked it up, so there's no reason to do that."
    new "天哪！我没杀Naomi。要藏钥匙，我会藏在房间里。真要塞进谁的包里，至少也得挑个确实会被怀疑的人。Shiroya根本不可能捡到钥匙，我这么做毫无道理。"

    # game/script.rpy:13203
    old "Can you think of who could've had the best chance to do it?"
    new "你觉得谁最有机会下手？"

    # game/script.rpy:13208
    old "...No. I'm sure anyone could have done it at some point."
    new "……想不出。我想，谁都有可能在某时某刻下手。"

    # game/script.rpy:13214
    old "We'll have to call Akaro out when he comes. You still haven't searched around here?"
    new "等Akaro回来，得当面问问他。这附近你们还没搜过吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:13220
    old "...We haven't. What's there to find?"
    new "……没搜。这里能有什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:13221
    old "We search precisely to figure that out. This letter was pretty well-hidden, and there are a few drawers and hiding spots I can see around here."
    new "搜过才知道有什么。那封信藏得就够隐蔽，而且我一眼就看到这儿有几处抽屉和能藏东西的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:13224
    old "Fine, let me look around."
    new "好吧，我来看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:13231
    old "I stood up from the bed and casually crouched to open some drawers. I could see some worn out papers, expired promotions, and some more ancient stuff that wouldn't be any use."
    new "我从床上起身，顺手蹲下拉开几个抽屉。里面有几张破旧的纸、过期的宣传单，还有些更老旧、派不上用场的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:13232
    old "While everyone watched me, I moved through the drawers until something notable caught my attention. It was, again, a key."
    new "大家看着我，我把抽屉逐一翻过，直到某样东西引起了我的注意。又是一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:13235
    old "Do you recognize this, Katei?"
    new "Katei，你认得这个吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:13241
    old "Oh, yes. It's the key to this bedroom. The only one that remains.{w} The other bedroom also has one, but the keys shouldn't be interchangeable."
    new "啊，认得。这是这间卧室的钥匙，仅剩的一把。{w}另一间卧室也有一把，不过两把钥匙应该不能通用。"

    # game/script.rpy:13242
    old "I see. It still won't help us much, then."
    new "这样啊。那还是帮不上什么忙。"

    # game/script.rpy:13245
    old "I finished looking through the drawers without finding anything else. There was a wardrobe upstairs, but I didn't bother going. Instead, I looked at the door and found the keyhole I'd ignored. There was also a chain that would lock the door from the inside without needing a key."
    new "我把抽屉翻完，再无别的发现。楼上有个衣柜，我懒得上去，转而看向房门，注意到了之前忽略的锁孔。门上还有一条链子，不用钥匙就能从里面把门锁上。"

    # game/script.rpy:13246
    old "...Wait, was there a chain in the other room as well?"
    new "……等等，另一间房里也有这种链子吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:13251
    old "Not anymore. It broke years ago, so only this bedroom has one."
    new "现在没有了。几年前就坏了，只有这间卧室还留着一条。"

    # game/script.rpy:13257
    old "...I'm not sure what Akaro's doing down there, but I'll look around a bit more until he comes since it's clear you're all slacking off."
    new "……不知道Akaro在下面磨蹭什么。既然你们一个个都在偷懒，那我就再多看看，等他上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:13260
    old "I wasn't sure what exactly he expected to find, but he went up the ladder. It wasn't so much that we were slacking off; rather, the recording had sapped every trace of our remaining initiative.{w} I sat down again and blankly stared at my lap."
    new "我不确定他究竟指望找到什么，但他还是爬上梯子去了。我们倒也不是偷懒；那段录音把我们所剩的一点干劲都抽干了。{w}我重新坐下，茫然地望着自己的膝盖。"

    # game/script.rpy:13266
    old "...I can't come to a likely conclusion. How could the recording be fake? If Isla isn't hiding anything important from us, it's clear that we have to basically consider it as truthful after everything that's already happened."
    new "……我得不出什么像样的结论。那段录音怎么可能是假的？如果Isla没瞒着我们什么要紧的事，那么经历了这一切之后，我们基本只能把它当真。"

    # game/script.rpy:13267
    old "However, if this recording is going to occur in the future, why did we find it now? And most importantly, why did we find it inside Isla's purse when she doesn't think anyone had the chance to put it there?"
    new "可是，如果这段录音是将来才会发生的事，为什么我们现在就找到了它？最关键的是，为什么它会在Isla的包里——而她认为根本没人有机会把它放进去？"

    # game/script.rpy:13268
    old "It can still be some sort of bizarre trap. One that involves Isla as a participant with the intention of making us believe we won't be free in nine hours."
    new "这仍可能是某种古怪的陷阱。让Isla也参与其中，目的就是让我们相信九小时后我们仍然脱不了身。"

    # game/script.rpy:13269
    old "Moreover, we've already heard the recording. If we're still here in a month, why would anyone record anything? What would the point of recording a few minutes of a random conversation be? Why would the person behind it even have a voice recorder inside the tower, and how would it travel back to us?"
    new "况且，录音我们已经听过了。如果我们一个月后还困在这里，那还有谁会去录什么音？把一段闲谈录下几分钟，又有什么意义？设下这一切的人为什么会在塔里带着录音笔，那录音笔又怎么会回到我们手上？"

    # game/script.rpy:13270
    old "When I time traveled, it seemed like causal loops are the way things work. It follows that if we let Sai and Akaro listen to the recording, the chances that it'll happen in the future will vanish. There's no way they would repeat everything exactly as they heard it. Although if the twelfth hour comes and we're still trapped, we'll have to let them know what our future looks like."
    new "我时间穿越的时候，事情似乎就是按因果循环的方式运转的。如此说来，只要让Sai和Akaro听了这段录音，它将来发生的可能性就会消失——他们绝不可能一字不差地照着自己听到的内容重演一遍。不过，要是第十二个小时到了，我们仍被困在这里，那就只能让他们知道我们未来会是什么样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:13273
    old "My initial reaction was that not letting anyone else listen to the recording was the smarter choice. It would prevent fear, commotion, being suspected, and potentially falling into a trap.{w} That just so happened to go along nicely with the way the universe seemed to function, as letting Sai or Akaro listen to the recording could've immediately made its own existence an impossibility."
    new "我最初的反应是，不让其他人听这段录音才是明智之举。这样能避免恐慌、骚动、被人怀疑，也能避免落入陷阱。{w}而这恰好与这个宇宙运作的方式不谋而合——一旦让Sai或Akaro听了录音，录音本身的存在就可能立刻化为不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:13274
    old "I didn't want to believe it.{w} It was a chilling thought in many ways. I had a dog and a cat to take care of. Being locked away for a month would end the worst way possible if the people outside neglected both them and us at the same time."
    new "我不愿相信。{w}这个念头在许多方面都叫人发寒。我家里还有一只狗和一只猫要照顾。要是被困上一个月，外面的人又同时不管它们和我们，结局会糟糕到极点。"

    # game/script.rpy:13276
    old "Meanwhile, the cabinet key appearing in Shiroya's purse had a much straighter line of reasoning. I silently gestured at her so that she'd come to the hallway with me. Outside, I closed the door behind us while she looked slightly confused."
    new "相比之下，展示柜钥匙出现在Shiroya包里这件事，脉络就清楚得多。我默默朝她打了个手势，让她跟我到走廊。到了外面，我随手带上房门，她一脸不解。"

    # game/script.rpy:13284
    old "Did you think of something?"
    new "你想到什么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:13291
    old "Sort of... I think we must have something backward. I think I know what happened with the key. ...It was put in your purse by whoever picked it up from Naomi's body."
    new "算是吧……我觉得我们一定有一处搞反了。关于那把钥匙，我大概知道是怎么回事了。……捡到 Naomi 身上那把钥匙的人，把它放进了你的包里。"

    # game/script.rpy:13296
    old "Yeah, I was probably the easiest target."
    new "是啊，我大概是最容易下手的目标。"

    # game/script.rpy:13297
    old "Exactly, which is why if the person who killed Naomi did it, they wouldn't have chosen you. They would've chosen a possible suspect or a spot within a room that a suspect had access to."
    new "正是如此。所以，如果做这事的是杀害 Naomi 的凶手，就不会选你。他会挑一个可能的嫌疑人，或者挑嫌疑人进得去的房间里的某个位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:13298
    old "The first time it disappeared, the Sekimeiya was in a cabinet in the room where Naomi died. However, the cabinet in the event room hadn't been locked, so the key wasn't needed.{w} Then, we split up between both hallways and the Sekimeiya was taken. That's when the key was used."
    new "它第一次消失时，Sekimeiya 就放在 Naomi 遇害那个房间的展示柜里。可活动室的展示柜当时没上锁，用不着钥匙。{w}后来我们分成两路去搜走廊，Sekimeiya 被人拿走了——那一次才用上了钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:13299
    old "...Later, when we returned from the higher floors without finding anyone, the Sekimeiya hadn't been stolen yet. It was still in the cabinet. ...And according to Sai, someone took the elevator down.{w} I don't think the killer's intention was to take the Sekimeiya.{w} If it had been, and they'd purposely removed the cabinet key from Naomi's set, they wouldn't have taken the Sekimeiya while we'd been searching both hallways. They would've waited for us to leave, and they wouldn't have dropped the key in your purse."
    new "……后来我们从楼上下来，一个人也没找到，那时 Sekimeiya 还没被拿走，仍然在展示柜里。……而且据 Sai 说，有人坐电梯下过楼。{w}我不认为凶手的目标是拿走 Sekimeiya。{w}若真是如此，对方又特意从 Naomi 的钥匙串上取下了展示柜的钥匙，就不会趁我们分头搜两条走廊的时候把 Sekimeiya 拿走。他会等我们离开，也不会把钥匙丢进你的包里。"

    # game/script.rpy:13304
    old "So someone took an opportunity after we found Naomi's body."
    new "也就是说，有人是在我们发现 Naomi 的尸体之后才找到机会的。"

    # game/script.rpy:13305
    old "Yeah. The culprit spent time removing it from her set of keys but didn't take the attic key.{w} All of us found Naomi's body at the same time, and even though I disappeared, you're positive nobody could've picked the key up before I came back, right?"
    new "对。凶手花时间把钥匙从她的钥匙串上取了下来，却没有拿阁楼的钥匙。{w}我们发现 Naomi 尸体的时候大家都在场，而且就算我消失了一阵，你也很肯定在我回来之前没人能捡走那把钥匙，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:13306
    old "I am, and even more so if they had to take it off the keyring."
    new "我很肯定，更何况那钥匙还得从钥匙圈上取下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:13307
    old "In that case, when we left her body to put the Sekimeiya in the event room cabinet, it's very likely she still had all of her keys. The people that could've picked it up from that point on were your group and the person who made the sound—someone who couldn't have gone on to use it to unlock the cabinet. It's also likely they were the true culprit, seeing as they didn't pick it up after killing Naomi."
    new "既然如此，我们离开她的尸体、去把 Sekimeiya 放进活动室展示柜的时候，她身上的钥匙很可能还是齐全的。从那时起能捡到钥匙的，只有你们那一组人，还有发出声响的那个人——而那个人之后不可能再用它去打开展示柜。而且，既然那人杀了 Naomi 之后并没有捡走钥匙，他很可能才是真凶。"

    # game/script.rpy:13308
    old "It goes back to what we said earlier: the suspects are pretty much only Sai and Akaro."
    new "这就回到刚才说的：嫌疑人基本上只剩 Sai 和 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:13309
    old "I began moving toward the living room, and Shiroya followed me without asking anything."
    new "我动身往客厅走，Shiroya 一言不发地跟了上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:13315
    old "Akaro entered the room where Naomi died, but he couldn't have unlocked the cabinet. Sai, though, had the chance to do both things. If the search ended while one of them still had the key, they would've chosen to leave it in your purse because you were in their group.{w} You also investigated hallway B, so if Sai hadn't denied it, you could've had a chance to get the key too."
    new "Akaro 进过 Naomi 遇害的房间，但他不可能打开展示柜。Sai 却两件事都有机会做。如果搜查结束时钥匙还在他们某个人手上，他们会把钥匙留在你包里，因为你跟他们同组。{w}你也在 B走廊搜过，所以要不是 Sai 否认，你本来也有机会拿到那把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:13320
    old "And then Akaro started acting weirdly, purposely remaining on the crystal floor all by himself."
    new "然后 Akaro 就开始举止反常，故意一个人留在水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:13325
    old "...Yeah. None of this makes sense because we found the Sekimeiya in the storeroom. This part is what feels like we might have it backward."
    new "……是啊。这些全都说不通，因为我们是在储藏室找到 Sekimeiya 的。问题就出在这里——感觉我们可能有一处搞反了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13333
    old "How so?"
    new "怎么说？"

    # game/script.rpy:13334
    old "I'm not sure yet, because I doubt there could've been any normal method to make the Sekimeiya appear there. Maybe it has to do with its powers, but I think we should look through hallway B in case we can find hints of what actually happened."
    new "我还没想清楚。我不觉得有什么寻常办法能让 Sekimeiya 出现在那种地方。也许跟它的力量有关，不过我想先去 B走廊查一遍，说不定能找到线索，弄清究竟发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:13343
    old "Without an objection, we continued heading down. I wasn't exactly sure what line we were pursuing, but I knew something strange had to have happened with the hallway B group."
    new "她没有反对，我们便继续往下走。我其实不太确定我们究竟在追哪条线，但我知道 B走廊那一组人身上一定发生过什么古怪的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:13352
    old "When the Sekimeiya was hidden in room B4, where we first found Naomi...{w} It was hidden inside a temperature regulation cabinet, and that would have happened at a time where we didn't know that the cabinets had inner compartments yet."
    new "Sekimeiya 最初被藏起来，是在水晶展室 B4——也就是我们第一次发现 Naomi 的地方……{w}它被藏进了一个控温展示柜，而当时我们还不知道这些柜子设有内层隔间。"

    # game/script.rpy:13353
    old "Anyone could've secretly known this, but think about Katei's perspective. Suripo told him that gemstones had been stolen from a room, and he didn't know which one.{w} Therefore, he had no reason to think they had been gemstones on display instead of the ones kept in those inner compartments, right? ...But the first time we searched, he never looked in those or let us know about them."
    new "这事谁都可能私下知道，但站在 Katei 的立场想想。Suripo 只告诉他有间展室的宝石被偷了，却没说是哪一间。{w}那么他也没理由认为丢的是展出的宝石、而不是内层隔间里存放的那些，对吧？……可我们第一次搜查时，他从没去看过那些隔间，也没跟我们提过。"

    # game/script.rpy:13358
    old "...Maybe he wanted to keep them a secret."
    new "……也许他想把那些东西藏着不说。"

    # game/script.rpy:13359
    old "It's possible."
    new "有这个可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:13366
    old "As soon as we reached floor 5, we faintly heard someone approaching."
    new "刚到五楼，我们就隐约听见有人靠近。"

    # game/script.rpy:13373
    old "...Oh, hey. Were you coming for me?"
    new "……哦，是你们。你们是来找我的？"

    # game/script.rpy:13378
    old "Sort of... The others are waiting for you in the attic, but we'll go right back up in a bit. What were you doing down there?"
    new "算是吧……其他人都在阁楼等你，我们待会儿就上去。你刚才在下面做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:13383
    old "Nothing, as I said. I stayed where I was for a few more minutes, sorting my thoughts out."
    new "什么也没做，我说过了。我就在原地多待了几分钟，理了理思绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:13386
    old "Any reason why you chose a bathroom with a body to stay in?"
    new "有什么理由非要待在一间有尸体的洗手间里？"

    # game/script.rpy:13391
    old "I don't think so... I'll be going. I'm sure Sai's eager to question me."
    new "没有吧……我走了。Sai 肯定正等着审我呢。"

    # game/script.rpy:13396
    old "He took off without waiting for a response."
    new "他没等我们回应，径直走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13401
    old "Maybe he's back to normal. He looked really off earlier."
    new "也许他恢复正常了。刚才他那样子很不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:13402
    old "He did... I'm not sure how it was for him, but he must've experienced something completely unnatural."
    new "确实……我不知道他当时是什么感受，但他肯定经历了某种完全不合常理的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:13407
    old "We continued moving down as we wondered what exactly had been up with Akaro."
    new "我们一边往下走，一边琢磨 Akaro 到底出了什么状况。"

    # game/script.rpy:13412
    old "He said he only teleported and the Sekimeiya was the trigger. Do you believe him?"
    new "他说自己只是被传送了，而 Sekimeiya 就是触发点。你信吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:13413
    old "I'm not sure. It probably was caused by the Sekimeiya in some way, but right before that point, it didn't have any effect on us. I thought earlier that maybe he just traveled a few seconds to the past, which would have been unnoticeable."
    new "不好说。多半是 Sekimeiya 以某种方式造成的，可在那之前，它对我们没有任何影响。我之前想过，也许他只是回到了几秒之前，短得根本察觉不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:13414
    old "Oh, that's true. But he said he still appeared on the crystal floor, so I think he would've noticed it, and we should've seen him..."
    new "哦，也对。可他说自己还是出现在水晶层，那他应该会察觉，我们也该看见他才对……"

    # game/script.rpy:13421
    old "Yeah... Maybe the shock stopped him from thinking properly, I don't know. I also wonder why he didn't show himself if he was right there the whole time and saw us. And there's still the fact that if he really touched the Sekimeiya, we shouldn't have seen it behind the glass in the cabinet."
    new "是啊……也许是冲击太大，让他没法好好思考，我也说不准。我还想不通，他如果一直都在那儿，也看见我们了，为什么不出面。另外还有一点：如果他真碰过 Sekimeiya，我们就不该在展示柜的玻璃后面看见它。"

    # game/script.rpy:13427
    old "None of it makes much sense."
    new "这些怎么看都说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:13434
    old "...{w}I'm already doubting what I said regarding the Sekimeiya's disappearance."
    new "……{w}我开始怀疑自己刚才关于 Sekimeiya 消失的那番话了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13440
    old "I said that if Naomi's killer took her key, they would've waited before taking the Sekimeiya; they wouldn't have done it while we were all searching the crystal floor.{w} That's not definitely true, though. If Sai or Akaro took the key, they would've waited too."
    new "我说过，如果拿走钥匙的是杀害 Naomi 的凶手，他应该会等到以后再拿 Sekimeiya，不会挑我们全都在水晶层搜查的时候动手。{w}但这也不一定。换成 Sai 或 Akaro 拿了钥匙，他们同样会等。"

    # game/script.rpy:13445
    old "...{w}Yeah.{w}{w=0.4} They would've kept the key until a better chance came."
    new "……{w}是啊。{w}{w=0.4} 他们会把钥匙留到更好的机会再动手。"

    # game/script.rpy:13446
    old "Right?{w} But instead, the Sekimeiya was taken while the search was going on.{w} Why? There has to be a reason why they didn't wait.{w} After all, the fact that it happened during the search feels wrong, because it means that nobody who searched could've done it.{w} How did they do it? Whoever hid the Sekimeiya took advantage of the search to appear clean—they didn't wait for a calmer opportunity."
    new "对吧？{w}可事实是，Sekimeiya 偏偏在搜查途中被拿走了。{w}为什么？他们之所以没等，一定有原因。{w}毕竟事情发生在搜查期间，这点很不对劲——那等于说，参与搜查的人都不可能下手。{w}那他们究竟是怎么做到的？藏起 Sekimeiya 的人借搜查洗清了自己，没有等更稳妥的时机。"

    # game/script.rpy:13454
    old "It's so confusing! People in both hallways could've worked together when I wasn't looking, but is that really it...?{w} It doesn't make any sense! They rushed to hide the Sekimeiya in the storeroom, but they didn't rush to take it out of the cabinet the next time we left the crystal floor. In fact, it should still be there."
    new "太乱了！两条走廊上的人完全可能趁我不注意串通好，可真是这样吗……？{w}完全说不通！他们急着把 Sekimeiya 藏进储藏室，可下一次我们离开水晶层时，他们却不急着把它从展示柜里取出来。照理说，它应该还在那儿才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:13455
    old "Damn it... I don't want to baselessly suspect everyone, but I don't know how else to approach this."
    new "可恶……我不想毫无根据地怀疑所有人，可除此之外我实在不知道该怎么查。"

    # game/script.rpy:13460
    old "It's okay, Atsuki. You're just trying to be careful. I wish I could be more help."
    new "没关系，Atsuki。你只是谨慎罢了。要是我能帮上更多忙就好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13471
    old "We arrived at the crystal floor. If no one was hiding nearby, we were the only people there. It was fainter, but as we walked down the last staircase, we could still perceive the smell from earlier."
    new "我们到了水晶层。附近若没人躲着，这里就只有我们两个。走下最后一段楼梯时，先前那股气味还闻得到，只是淡了许多。"

    # game/script.rpy:13475
    old "Perhaps because nothing about it made sense, we instinctively went to check the second of Naomi's bodies, the place where Akaro had remained."
    new "也许是因为一切都毫无道理，我们下意识地先去查看 Naomi 的第二具尸体，也就是 Akaro 之前停留的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:13480
    old "I don't think anything's different here."
    new "这里看起来没什么异常。"

    # game/script.rpy:13487
    old "It looks the same. Someone must've locked her inside, and that was the sound we heard..."
    new "和之前一样。一定是有人把她锁在了里面，我们听到的声音就是这个……"

    # game/script.rpy:13491
    old "If so, then they should've still been somewhere while we searched."
    new "若真是这样，那我们搜查的时候，那个人应该还在什么地方才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:13496
    old "Well, when we heard the sound, we all went out of the event room toward hallway A. From there, we could see the staircase and elevator, so we know nobody ran up a floor after that."
    new "唔，听到声音的时候，我们全都出了活动室，朝 A走廊走去。从那里能看见楼梯和电梯，所以之后没人跑上一层楼，这点可以确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:13497
    old "If the person responsible expected that and quickly entered the event room from hallway B just behind us, they might've been able to use the Sekimeiya to escape. We still don't know how it works, and we locked the cabinet, but it's possible..."
    new "如果那个人料到这一点，趁我们刚走，立刻从背后的 B走廊进入活动室，说不定就能用 Sekimeiya 逃走。我们至今不清楚它的运作原理，展示柜也锁上了，可这还是有可能……"

    # game/script.rpy:13498
    old "It supposedly made Akaro travel later, so that could be right. It might just be inconsistent about when it actually does something."
    new "据说它后来让 Akaro 穿越了时间，所以这也有可能。也许它究竟何时才会发动，本来就没什么定数。"

    # game/script.rpy:13503
    old "But then they wouldn't have relied on it to escape. If they used it, they must've known how to properly use it.{w} There's still the same problem, though. The glass in the cabinet would have been down."
    new "可那样的话，他们就不会靠它逃走了。既然用了它，说明他们懂得怎么正确使用。{w} 不过老问题还在——展示柜的玻璃罩应该是放下来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:13504
    old "That's right..."
    new "说得也是……"

    # game/script.rpy:13511
    old "As the conversation had once again shifted to the Sekimeiya's mechanics, we walked to the center of the floor."
    new "话题又一次转到 Sekimeiya 的运作原理上，我们一路走到了楼层中央。"

    # game/script.rpy:13516
    old "We entered through hallway B and found ourselves in the barren space, only shared by the covered cabinet. The darkness in there was a stark reminder that we'd been victims of an attack, and one that was most likely far from over. I walked up to the cabinet as I spoke."
    new "我们从 B走廊进去，眼前是一片空荡荡的空间，只有罩着遮布的展示柜与我们作伴。室内的昏暗无时无刻不在提醒我们：我们遭遇了袭击，而这场袭击多半远未结束。我一边说，一边走到展示柜前。"

    # game/script.rpy:13520
    old "Do you still have the key?"
    new "钥匙还在你身上吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:13525
    old "No, it must still be on the bed, assuming nobody picked it up. I didn't wanna just put it back in my purse."
    new "不在，应该还留在床上，前提是没人捡走。我可不想就那么塞回包里。"

    # game/script.rpy:13526
    old "So the potentially solitary method to unlock the cabinet was in anyone's possession. I raised the curtain, hoping to finally get more information on what the Sekimeiya could really do."
    new "也就是说，那把很可能是唯一能打开展示柜的钥匙，现在在谁手里都不奇怪。我掀开遮布，盼着这回能多了解一些 Sekimeiya 的能耐。"

    # game/script.rpy:13535
    old "However, instead of helping us piece things together, it appeared the curtain was only covering more questions. Behind it, the glass only protected a cushion, as the Sekimeiya had once again disappeared."
    new "然而，遮布没能帮我们拼出真相，掀开之后反而只露出更多疑问。玻璃罩后面护着的不过是一块坐垫——Sekimeiya 又一次不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13536
    old "...It's not here? Didn't you see it just before we went up?"
    new "……不见了？我们上楼之前，你不是还亲眼见过它吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:13537
    old "I-I did... I even touched it."
    new "见、见过的……我还摸过它。"

    # game/script.rpy:13538
    old "Then was Akaro just acting? He could've easily taken it out..."
    new "那 Akaro 只是在演戏？他本可以轻易把它取出来……"

    # game/script.rpy:13539
    old "Unless we assume an unknown culprit is somehow still here, it was him. He did tell us to leave him alone, but I have no idea why he'd want to hide it."
    new "除非我们认定有个不知名的人物还藏在这里，否则只能是他。他确实让我们别去打扰他，可我想不通他为什么要把它藏起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:13540
    old "This question still pisses me off. Why would anyone hide the Sekimeiya? There's nothing to gain from it because we can always find it by just searching thoroughly."
    new "这事到现在还让我火大。谁会无缘无故把 Sekimeiya 藏起来？这么做一点好处也没有，只要仔细搜一遍，我们总能找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:13545
    old "There might be another reason... What if what they're trying to do is remove it from the cabinet instead of hiding it?"
    new "也许还有别的缘由……万一对方的目的不是藏它，而是把它从展示柜里取出来呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:13546
    old "Just removing it? Oh, because of the temperature?"
    new "只是取出来？哦，因为温度？"

    # game/script.rpy:13547
    old "Maybe. The first time, we found it inside a cabinet that could keep it cool, but it wasn't powered on. It might be related to that."
    new "也许吧。第一次发现它时，它就在一个能给它降温的展示柜里，可那个柜子并没有通电。说不定和这有关。"

    # game/script.rpy:13550
    old "They could just unplug this cabinet, which would be much harder to notice. By moving it, they also exposed themselves in front of the cameras."
    new "他们大可以拔掉这个柜子的插头，那样更难被人察觉。把东西挪走，反而让自己暴露在监控摄像头下。"

    # game/script.rpy:13551
    old "I looked behind just in case, and the cabinet's plug was still inserted into the outlet."
    new "我以防万一朝展示柜后面看了一眼，展示柜的插头还好端端插在插座上。"

    # game/script.rpy:13556
    old "The cameras make me think that the culprit doesn't mind being seen. It'd make sense if it was always Akaro, because he's leaving himself as the only suspect by hiding the Sekimeiya now anyway."
    new "摄像头的事让我觉得，犯人并不介意被人看见。如果从头到尾都是 Akaro，那就说得通了——反正他现在把 Sekimeiya 藏起来，等于把自己变成了唯一的嫌疑人。"

    # game/script.rpy:13557
    old "But to accomplish everything, he needs to have used the Sekimeiya's powers multiple times and still did his best to always hide from us. Whoever the culprit is, why do they care so much about avoiding us but aren't fazed by the cameras?"
    new "可要办成这么多事，他必须多次动用 Sekimeiya 的力量，同时还得千方百计避开我们。不管犯人是谁，为什么如此在意避开我们，却对摄像头毫不在乎？"

    # game/script.rpy:13562
    old "...I don't know. They must've caused the power outage in the security room, but all that did was stop us from looking at the recordings. The cameras are still working, so once everyone outside can get back in, they'll be able to look through all of it."
    new "……我不知道。监控室的停电肯定是他们搞的，可那顶多只让我们没法查看录像。摄像头还在正常工作，等外面的人能进来，就能把全部录像翻一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:13565
    old "It might just be that they're confident in their plan. If they intend to vanish as soon as Ashiya enter this place, even if their identity is exposed, they'd still be long gone."
    new "也许只是因为他们对自己的计划有把握。若他们打算一等芦屋的人进来就消失，那么即便身份败露，人也早已远走高飞了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13566
    old "The fact that they're trying so hard to avoid being seen by us might mean that we already know them. If they're making use of the Sekimeiya, understand how it works, and are creating an alibi for themselves, we could just restrain them once we know who they are. It's like they're hiding the Sekimeiya while also hiding themselves thanks to it."
    new "他们如此费尽心机躲着我们，或许说明我们本就认识这个人。若此人利用 Sekimeiya、摸清了它的运作方式，还借此替自己制造不在场证明，那只要我们查明身份，就能直接把他控制住。就好像他一边把 Sekimeiya 藏起来，一边又借它把自己也藏了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:13567
    old "And at the same time, the fact that Akaro is the main suspect could mean that he isn't responsible; every other action performed by the culprit has managed to keep their identity hidden, but this would directly reveal it."
    new "而与此同时，Akaro 成了头号嫌疑人，这反倒可能说明他并非幕后之人：犯人其余每一步都成功掩住了自己的身份，唯独这一手会直接把自己暴露出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:13568
    old "Even though Katei has always looked like the most suspicious person, he could've accomplished almost everything through normal means. At no point was it necessary for him to use the Sekimeiya for anything, and it's very likely the culprit has been making use of it to stay out of sight and remain less suspicious."
    new "尽管 Katei 一直显得最可疑，但他几乎每件事都能用寻常手段办到。他从未有过非用 Sekimeiya 不可的时候，而真正的犯人很可能一直在借它藏身，让自己显得没那么可疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:13573
    old "So the blame just falls on Katei?"
    new "所以怀疑就全落到 Katei 头上了？"

    # game/script.rpy:13574
    old "I doubt it's just that. He's still hiding a bunch of things for sure. Regarding the Sekimeiya, the attic, and the way we got trapped."
    new "恐怕不止如此。他肯定还瞒着不少事。关于 Sekimeiya、阁楼，还有我们是怎么被困住的。"

    # game/script.rpy:13577
    old "For now, since we're here, we could try to find the Sekimeiya. The others must be questioning Akaro and, well, wondering where we are. There aren't many places to hide it, and if we do find it, we could learn something important. Assuming Akaro didn't do it, it means that someone else took advantage of him being distracted."
    new "眼下既然来都来了，我们就试着找找 Sekimeiya 吧。其他人想必正在盘问 Akaro，嗯，也在想我们跑哪儿去了。能藏东西的地方不多，真找到了，说不定能有重要发现。假如不是 Akaro 干的，那就说明有人趁他分神下了手。"

    # game/script.rpy:13578
    old "It could've been an \"unknown culprit\", but Sai and Katei were actually viable suspects too, as they'd claimed to be in the living room while we'd been occupied by an impossible recording. They would've had just enough time."
    new "也可能是「不知名的犯人」，但 Sai 和 Katei 其实同样有嫌疑。我们被那段根本不可能存在的录音缠住时，他们声称自己在客厅，时间刚好来得及。"

    # game/script.rpy:13579
    old "Or would you prefer to go back to the attic? Sorry, I just dragged you all the way down here without asking you. Being alone could be dangerous, so we can go back if you want."
    new "还是说，你更想回阁楼？抱歉，我没问一声就把你一路拖到这儿。一个人待着可能有危险，你想回去的话，我们就回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:13584
    old "...No, I'd like to look for it.{w} We were going to look through hallway B, so let's start with that. If we figure out how the Sekimeiya appeared in the storeroom, we might be able to find out who did it."
    new "……不用，我想找找看。{w} 我们本来就打算把 B走廊查一遍，就从那里开始吧。要是能弄清楚 Sekimeiya 是怎么出现在储藏室的，也许就能查出是谁干的。"

    # game/script.rpy:13585
    old "I nodded. It wasn't impossible someone was hiding, but they could've easily left already, and it wasn't our goal to begin a full search of the building. We intended to find the Sekimeiya, which was more likely to be on the crystal floor."
    new "我点了点头。不能说没人藏在这里，但对方也完全可能早就离开了，况且我们的目的并不是把整栋楼搜个底朝天。我们要找的是 Sekimeiya，而它更可能在水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:13586
    old "Which room do we start with?"
    new "先从哪一间开始？"

    # game/script.rpy:13594
    old "It shouldn't matter. I think that's the first one Akaro looked through."
    new "哪一间都无所谓吧。我记得那是 Akaro 最先查的一间。"

    # game/script.rpy:13599
    old "We walked to room B3 in silence...{w} It was undeniable that staying put somewhere was much safer than being there by ourselves; someone had died, and we were up against an elusive unknown..."
    new "我们沉默着走向水晶展室 B3……{w} 不可否认，待在原地比我们俩单独行动要安全得多。已经有人死了，而我们面对的是一个行踪难测的不明人物……"

    # game/script.rpy:13600
    old "We'd even heard that bizarre recording just minutes ago, but we were trying to understand what had happened to the Sekimeiya."
    new "就在几分钟前，我们才听过那段诡异的录音，如今却一心想着查清 Sekimeiya 究竟出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:13601
    old "After all, it made me travel through time.{w} We hadn't spoken about it at length, but it was evident both of us wanted to understand how it worked..."
    new "毕竟，它让我穿越了时间。{w} 这件事我们还没细谈过，但显然，我们俩都想弄明白它到底如何运作……"

    # game/script.rpy:13608
    old "...We opened the door and entered without high hopes."
    new "……我们推开门走进去，并没有抱多大期望。"

    # game/script.rpy:13612
    old "I started with the rightmost cabinets. Only a few of them could be opened up, but there was always space behind and under them, making it a considerably lengthy process."
    new "我从最右边的展示柜开始查。能打开的只有少数几个，但柜子后面和底下总有空隙，查起来相当费时。"

    # game/script.rpy:13613
    old "Just as I thought that, Shiroya spoke."
    new "我正这么想着，Shiroya 开口了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13614
    old "W-Wait, it's here."
    new "等、等一下，它在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:13621
    old "I turned around abruptly. Shiroya was looking inside the cabinet she'd started with. I approached her, thinking that perhaps I'd misheard."
    new "我猛地转过身。Shiroya 正往她最先查看的那个展示柜里看。我走过去，心想也许是我听错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13625
    old "...Do you mean the Sekimeiya?"
    new "……你是说 Sekimeiya？"

    # game/script.rpy:13630
    old "Yes... Look, it's under the cushion, and there's a lot of space beneath it too. I thought I saw a slight bump, so I checked."
    new "嗯……你看，就在坐垫下面，垫子底下空间也不小。我好像看到有个地方微微凸起，就查了一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:13637
    old "I spotted it when I got closer. Shiroya had removed the cushion with the gems, which uncovered the space beneath it. There, the Sekimeiya was hidden."
    new "走近之后我就看见了。Shiroya 拿开了嵌着宝石的坐垫，露出底下的夹层。Sekimeiya 就藏在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:13639
    old "...So, once again, out of all the places to choose from, they chose to hide it in a room with security cameras."
    new "……结果，在所有能挑的地方里，他偏偏又一次选了一间装着监控摄像头的房间来藏它。"

    # game/script.rpy:13640
    old "We'd gotten used to our searches not ending as desired, so such a quick result threw me off."
    new "我们早已习惯搜寻无果，这么快就有了结果，反倒让我一时愣住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13641
    old "It can't have been here for very long. What do we do? Do you wanna try to, um... activate it?"
    new "它应该没在这里放多久。我们怎么办？你要不要试着，呃……启动它？"

    # game/script.rpy:13642
    old "...The last time, it worked right after it was hidden. It's obvious that the culprit is behind this, so by learning how it works, we might be able to understand a few things."
    new "……上次，它刚被藏起来就发动了。这背后显然是犯人在搞鬼，所以只要弄明白它的运作方式，或许就能看清一些事。"

    # game/script.rpy:13647
    old "That's true, but won't it be dangerous? ...You saw how Akaro reacted."
    new "话是没错，可这样不会很危险吗？……你也看到 Akaro 的反应了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13648
    old "I felt fine the last time. I also touched it before going to the attic and nothing happened, so it's possible it won't be any different now."
    new "上次我没什么感觉。去阁楼之前我也碰过它，什么都没发生，所以这次说不定也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:13649
    old "It might've been dangerous, but I wanted to know if going to the past was truly achievable. I felt overwhelmed by the simple-looking object I had in front of me."
    new "这或许很危险，但我想确认回到过去是否真的可行。眼前这件东西看着不起眼，却让我心绪难平。"

    # game/script.rpy:13654
    old "I see. ...Try it, then."
    new "原来如此。……那就试试吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:13657
    old "If it works, I'll go back to the past again. If that happens, it means that I might already be outside the door, waiting for the past me to travel. Assuming that's the case, I'll come in as soon as I disappear to meet back up with you. Keep looking at the Sekimeiya in case it changes colors."
    new "要是成功了，我会再次回到过去。这样一来，就说明我可能已经等在门外，等着过去的我穿越。若果真如此，等我一消失，我便会立刻进来与你会合。你继续盯着 Sekimeiya，以防它变色。"

    # game/script.rpy:13662
    old "A-All right."
    new "好、好的。"

    # game/script.rpy:13670
    old "Was another version of me... right outside the room?{w} If we went to look and that version acted surprised to be found... assuming the past couldn't be changed and only looked at from a different perspective, it would mean that I needed to travel to the past and recreate a fake reaction."
    new "另一个我……就在房间外？{w} 如果我们出去查看，而那个我装作被发现时很惊讶……假设过去无法改变，只能从另一个角度去观察，那就意味着我得回到过去，把那个假反应重新演一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:13671
    old "Something like that was ridiculous; if we went to check outside, that version of me would know that we'd done so and would hide accordingly. It was pointless to even try it, as we didn't know if the travel would work in the first place."
    new "这种事太荒唐了。我们真去外面查看，那个我自然会知道，并会相应地躲起来。况且连穿越能不能成功都还不知道，贸然去试也毫无意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:13674
    old "I'll touch it. If nothing happens, let's bring it upstairs. Leaving it in the cabinet would just provide the culprit with another opportunity to hide it, assuming it wasn't Akaro's doing."
    new "我来碰它。要是没反应，我们就把它搬到楼上。如果这不是 Akaro 干的，把东西留在展示柜里，只会再给犯人一次藏起它的机会。"

    # game/script.rpy:13676
    old "Yeah.{w} I'll wait here. I'm a little scared to touch it, but I think it's better if one of us stays here."
    new "嗯。{w} 我在这里等着。我有点怕碰它，不过我觉得还是留一个人在比较好。"

    # game/script.rpy:13679
    old "I stretched my arm toward it. Hesitant at what was about to happen, Shiroya backed up while I shortened the distance between my hand and the Sekimeiya.{w} As soon as I made the slightest physical contact with it, I felt a ridiculously painful burn on my fingers. It lasted less than a split second, and I was somewhere else."
    new "我朝它伸出手。Shiroya 似乎对即将发生的事有些迟疑，向后退开；我的手则一点点靠近 Sekimeiya。{w} 指尖刚触到它，一阵剧烈的灼痛便从手指上窜起。那感觉只持续了不到半瞬，下一刻，我已身在别处。"

    # game/script.rpy:13682
    old "Behind Bars"
    new "铁窗之后"

    # game/script.rpy:13692
    old "Before I could comprehend that it worked, I fell to the floor and hurt myself. Disoriented, I looked around."
    new "我还没反应过来它真的生效了，人已摔在地上，磕得生疼。我晕头转向地环顾四周。"

    # game/script.rpy:13703
    old "It took me a few seconds to recognize where I was. In front of me were blank screens, and my surroundings were overall dim. It was the security room.{w} My pose had also changed. I'd appeared in front of the desk and immediately fallen backward, hitting my back on the chair."
    new "我花了几秒钟才认出自己在哪。面前是一排黑着的屏幕，四周光线昏暗。这里是监控室。{w} 我的姿势也变了——我出现在桌前，随即向后摔倒，后背撞上了椅子。"

    # game/script.rpy:13704
    old "What the fuck...? Was I sitting...?"
    new "搞什么鬼……？我刚才……是坐着的？"

    # game/script.rpy:13706
    old "That was what it felt like. I'd been sitting on top of nothing, which resulted in my fall."
    new "感觉就是这样。我方才像是坐在了一片虚空上，所以才会摔倒。"

    # game/script.rpy:13710
    old "I sighed and stood up. It had worked again, and I'd appeared in the security room instead. I was about to exit the room when I realized that I had a much smarter option."
    new "我叹了口气，站起身。它又生效了，而这次我出现在监控室。我正要出门，忽然想到还有一个更聪明的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:13714
    old "I dragged the chair I'd knocked away back to its place and sat on it. Then, I moved the mouse around to power on the screens."
    new "我把撞到一边的椅子拖回原位，坐了上去，然后晃了晃鼠标，让屏幕亮起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:13717
    old "They all lit up at once, which made me squint momentarily.{w} ...The large desktop appeared, but I only directed my eyes at the lower right side of the middle screen.{w} {time=11:10} was the time that I saw."
    new "所有屏幕同时亮起，刺得我眯了眯眼。{w} ……整个桌面显现出来，我只把视线投向中间屏幕的右下角。{w} 上面显示的时间是 {time=11:10}。"

    # game/script.rpy:13720
    old "I did go back to the past once again... This is confirmation that I wasn't going crazy."
    new "我确实又一次回到了过去……这证明我没有发疯。"

    # game/script.rpy:13721
    old "The last time we checked the time, Sai said it was {time=11:36}, and he already confirmed to me that his time is the same as this computer's."
    new "上次看时间时，Sai 说当时是 {time=11:36}，而且他已经跟我确认过，他的时间和这台电脑一致。"

    # game/script.rpy:13722
    old "I'd estimate that after that point, fifteen more minutes passed until I touched the Sekimeiya, which means that I went approximately forty minutes into the past."
    new "我估计从那时起又过了十五分钟，我才碰到 Sekimeiya，也就是说，我回到了大约四十分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:13724
    old "Forty minutes... twice the last amount. Is that a coincidence...?"
    new "四十分钟……是上次的两倍。这会是巧合吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:13727
    old "It could just be that the amount of time traveled is also determined randomly. I thought earlier that could be the case with the location you go to, but given I appeared sitting down right in front of this desk, there must be more to that."
    new "也可能穿越的时间长度同样是随机决定的。我之前就想过，落点或许也是如此；但既然我出现时正坐在这张桌前，事情肯定没那么简单。"

    # game/script.rpy:13728
    old "At this point in time, I should be on the fifth floor with Shiroya. At {time=11:20}, we were all inside the event room after regrouping, discussing the elevator movements."
    new "此刻，我应该正和 Shiroya 在五楼。到了 {time=11:20}，我们已经重新会合，都在活动室里讨论电梯的异动。"

    # game/script.rpy:13729
    old "When we heard a noise...{w=0.5} that's right!{w=0.4} I can attempt to see what made it, and most importantly...{w} what happened to Naomi."
    new "我们听到声响的时候……{w=0.5}对了！{w=0.4} 我可以试着去看看是什么弄出了那声响，更重要的是……{w} Naomi 到底出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:13732
    old "I tensed up. It was possible a murder was about to occur. We'd deemed the bathroom empty before searching the other floors, and I was in the timeframe where the second Naomi had died."
    new "我浑身一紧。也许一场谋杀即将发生。我们在搜查其他楼层前，曾确认洗手间里空无一人，而我现在正处在第二个 Naomi 死去的那段时间里。"

    # game/script.rpy:13738
    old "I exited the security room slowly. We'd searched through the whole floor before going up, so there shouldn't have been anyone hiding who I didn't know about. However, the elevator movements still remained unexplained. Someone had arrived on the crystal floor while we'd been investigating the others."
    new "我慢慢走出监控室。我们上楼前搜过整层，按理说不该有我不知道的人躲在这里。可是电梯的异动仍然无法解释。在我们调查其他楼层时，有人来到了水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:13739
    old "Could I even consider preventing Naomi's death? If causal loops were how time travel worked, I wouldn't be able to. ...Did I have a way to be sure, though?"
    new "我难道真能考虑去阻止 Naomi 的死吗？如果时间穿越遵循的是因果循环，那我就做不到。……可是，我有办法确认这一点吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:13740
    old "Even though what happened the first time indicated that modifying the past wouldn't happen, the only way I could learn that with certainty was by attempting it."
    new "尽管第一次的经历已经表明过去无法被改变，但我要想真正确认这一点，唯一的办法就是亲自去尝试。"

    # game/script.rpy:13741
    old "Incidentally, by attempting to change the past, I was putting myself at risk. We hadn't found my dead body, so I could feel a bit calm in that regard. However, if my actions could alter the past, that would no longer be valid."
    new "话说回来，尝试改变过去，也等于把我自己置于危险之中。我们还没有发现我的尸体，所以这一点还能让我稍微安心。可如果我的行动真能改变过去，那我就不能这么安心了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13744
    old "Should I be worried about that? If I try to prevent Naomi's death and subsequently die for it, that could make my time travel an impossibility and lead into an obvious paradox. How would the universe handle that? Would it even allow it?"
    new "我该为此担心吗？如果我试图阻止 Naomi 的死，并因此丧命，那我的时间穿越就会变得不可能，进而导致一个显而易见的悖论。宇宙会怎么处理这种情况？它会允许这种事发生吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:13745
    old "Maybe anything I try to change the past will be completely futile. I just have to wait and see what I can do."
    new "也许我想改变过去的任何尝试都会完全徒劳。我只能等着看，自己究竟能做到什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:13746
    old "From hallway A, I saw people walking down the stairs. I dashed toward the lobby, knowing that they wouldn't see me."
    new "我在 A走廊看见有人正走下楼梯。我知道他们不会看见我，便朝大厅跑去。"

    # game/script.rpy:13753
    old "They've already come, so the elevator movements have already occurred. It's possible Naomi's already dead. Did I appear too late to see what happened...?"
    new "他们已经来了，说明电梯已经动过了。Naomi 可能已经死了。我是不是出现得太晚，没能看到事情经过……？"

    # game/script.rpy:13757
    old "I moved to hallway B. I knew we'd shortly enter the event room through the opposite door, so I'd be safe there."
    new "我转移到 B走廊。我知道我们很快就会从另一扇门进入活动室，所以待在那里应该安全。"

    # game/script.rpy:13758
    old "Are they really not going to see me...? I went forty minutes into the past, and even though nobody claimed to have seen me, it appears I was always on this floor..."
    new "他们真的不会看见我吗……？我回到了四十分钟前，虽然没人说见过我，但我似乎一直待在这一层……"

    # game/script.rpy:13762
    old "I approached the bathrooms slowly, trying to remain silent. From the middle of the hallway, though, I noticed that something important hadn't happened yet."
    new "我放轻脚步，慢慢靠近洗手间。可走到走廊中段时，我注意到一件重要的事还没有发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:13763
    old "The door... It's open."
    new "门……开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:13764
    old "We'd found the bathroom door locked, and inside was Naomi's body. Since it wasn't locked at that moment, something was bound to happen if I just watched from a distance."
    new "我们发现时，洗手间的门是锁着的，里面躺着 Naomi 的尸体。既然此刻门还没有锁，只要我远远看着，就一定会有什么事发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:13765
    old "Unfortunately, the door was only barely ajar, so I couldn't see inside."
    new "可惜门只开了一条细缝，我看不见里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:13770
    old "I kept moving and entered the cleaning room, which would provide me with the best view of the bathrooms without being spotted."
    new "我继续往前走，进了清洁间。这里既能清楚看到洗手间，又不容易被人发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:13775
    old "A little paranoid, I looked behind me to make sure there was no one else there."
    new "我有些疑神疑鬼，回头确认身后没有别人。"

    # game/script.rpy:13781
    old "Who's going to appear? Will I be able to see the killer's identity? Naomi might also show up at any moment, but from where?"
    new "接下来出现的人会是谁？我能看清凶手的身份吗？Naomi 也可能随时出现，可她是从哪里来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:13782
    old "This floor was empty, and the rest up to the attic were just investigated too... Maybe whoever's about to appear will travel from the future if they haven't been in the attic the whole time."
    new "这一层空无一人，往上直到阁楼的其他楼层也都刚查过……如果那个人并非一直待在阁楼里，接下来出现的人或许就是从未来穿越而来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:13783
    old "It's unlikely anyone exited the attic through the main door, given the footprints. Even though the elevator should've been on the fifth floor, it was below the third. Someone from the attic could've called it, arrived here, and then sent it back up with no one inside. That'd fall into place with what Sai heard."
    new "从脚印来看，不太可能有人从正门离开阁楼。电梯本该停在五楼，实际却停在三楼以下。也许有人从阁楼叫了电梯，来到这一层，又让空电梯返回楼上。这样就能和 Sai 听到的动静对上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13784
    old "It also means that person must now be on this floor, and most importantly, that Shiroya and I missed the elevator's sound three times. Is that really a possibility...?"
    new "这同时也意味着，那个人此刻一定就在这一层；更要紧的是，Shiroya 和我竟然三次都没听见电梯的声音。这种事真的可能吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:13794
    old "I kept watching for a few minutes. Eventually, the indistinct voices I'd been hearing faded away, indicating that the group had gone to the event room."
    new "我继续观察了几分钟。耳边那些若有若无的说话声终于渐渐远去——那群人应该是去了活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:13795
    old "...It has to happen at any moment. We did hear a noise, and the door hasn't been locked yet."
    new "……应该就在这一两分钟内了。我们确实听到过响声，而那扇门还没有上锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:13796
    old "I remained motionless, peeking through the small gap in my door. Was I about to witness a murder? Would I see a person popping into existence out of nowhere? Where would they go then?"
    new "我一动不动，透过门缝往外看。我这是要亲眼目睹一场凶杀吗？还是会看见一个人凭空出现？那之后，那个人又会去哪里？"

    # game/script.rpy:13797
    old "If the second Naomi isn't dead yet, both her and the culprit have to come. One of them is accounted for given the elevator movements, but what about the other one? ...Or were both of them responsible for the elevator trips?"
    new "如果第二个 Naomi 还没有死，那她和凶手就都得来过这里。按电梯的动静，其中一个人的行踪已经能对上，那另一个呢？……又或者，那几趟电梯本就是他们两个都有份？"

    # game/script.rpy:13798
    old "Before I could continue imagining all sorts of scenarios, it began. Naomi was coming from hallway C."
    new "我还没来得及继续设想各种情形，事情就开始了。Naomi 正从 C 走廊那边走来。"

    # game/script.rpy:13803
    old "There she is...! Should I show myself?"
    new "她来了……！我要不要现身？"

    # game/script.rpy:13804
    old "I couldn't decide if that was a good idea. There was still no culprit to be found, so I chose to hold off."
    new "我拿不准这样做是否妥当。连凶手的影子都没见到，我决定先按兵不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:13805
    old "Akaro's description of Naomi's face fell short of her actual expression. She was visibly terrified, breathing heavily, moving oddly, and stopping in place every few seconds."
    new "Akaro 对 Naomi 神情的描述，远不及她此刻的真实模样。她显然惊恐到了极点——呼吸急促，动作透着古怪，每隔几秒就停在原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:13806
    old "Even though I was a fair distance away, I saw pure distress all over her. What had she experienced? Did she know her own body had been found?{w} Was she aware of what would happen to her...?"
    new "尽管隔着一段距离，我也能一眼看出她满心惶恐。她究竟经历了什么？她知不知道自己的尸体已经被发现了？{w}她清不清楚自己接下来会落得什么下场……？"

    # game/script.rpy:13807
    old "She must've traveled to the past at least once, or her own existence wouldn't make sense..."
    new "她至少穿越回过去一次，否则她的存在本身就说不通……"

    # game/script.rpy:13815
    old "Finally, after a very long breath that seemed to give her some confidence, she did what I thought she'd do: she headed toward the bathrooms."
    new "终于，她长长地呼出一口气，仿佛从中汲取了些许勇气，然后做出了我预料中的举动——朝洗手间走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:13818
    old "She opened the women's and looked inside it. It appeared she was searching for something, and given she didn't look around very much, it might've been a person."
    new "她推开女洗手间的门，往里看了看。她似乎在找什么；但她没怎么四处张望，要找的也许是一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:13823
    old "Quickly, something caught her attention inside the other bathroom. I couldn't know what it was, but as she placed her hand on the doorknob, her stance gave away that she was wary of whatever was behind the door."
    new "很快，另一间洗手间里的什么动静吸引了她的注意。我不知道那是什么，但从她把手搭上门把的姿势就能看出，她对门后的东西心存戒备。"

    # game/script.rpy:13828
    old "I hadn't seen anything strange happening in the bathroom since I'd begun watching. Was it possible that someone had been there the whole time?"
    new "从我开始盯着那边起，洗手间里就没出现过任何异常。难道真有人一直待在里面？"

    # game/script.rpy:13829
    old "Naomi opened the door carefully, keeping her guard as high as it could've been.{w} I bit my lip tightly. When the door was open, she looked inside."
    new "Naomi 小心翼翼地推开门，戒备已经到了极点。{w}我用力咬住嘴唇。门一开，她就朝里面望去。"

    # game/script.rpy:13830
    old "Since the knob was on the left, it was impossible for me to see what she'd seen, but her tension slightly lowered once she saw the contents of the tiny room. At the same time, mine increased, as I knew what was probably about to happen."
    new "门把在左侧，我根本看不到她所见的情形；但那间狭小房间里的景象似乎让她稍稍放松了紧绷的神经。与此同时，我的心却提得更紧了——我清楚接下来多半会发生什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:13831
    old "I was too far to hear her, but she was speaking. Someone had really been inside the bathroom the entire time."
    new "距离太远，我听不见她的声音，但她在说话。洗手间里真的有人，而且一直都在。"

    # game/script.rpy:13832
    old "It didn't make sense. That person had to be the source of the elevator movements, so where had Naomi come from? She didn't have the attic key, and she couldn't have come from the future either, as that was about to become impossible..."
    new "这说不通。电梯的动静只能出自那个人之手，那么 Naomi 又是从哪儿冒出来的？她手里没有阁楼的钥匙，也不可能是从未来过来的——毕竟那很快就将变成不可能……"

    # game/script.rpy:13833
    old "Out of nowhere, Naomi's body was pulled from the inside.{w} I felt as if my heart was pulled along with her. I couldn't see her anymore, and two people were in the bathroom, their figures hidden from me."
    new "冷不丁地，Naomi 的身体被从里面拽了进去。{w}我的心仿佛也跟着被拽走了。她的身影消失了，洗手间里有两个人，我却一个也看不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:13837
    old "I'd probably never had the chance to stop it, and a camera must've at least caught the image of her murderer, but during the few seconds that I was pathetically scared without actually being in danger, I knew that the life of a person was being taken right in front of me. Despite my future knowledge and advantageous position, I hadn't done anything to prevent it."
    new "也许我根本来不及阻止；监控至少该拍到了凶手的模样。可就在那几秒里，我明明身处安全之地，却怕得如此可悲——我清楚地知道，一条人命正在我眼前被夺走。我明明知晓未来，又占着这样的位置，却什么都没做。"

    # game/script.rpy:13838
    old "I'd been thinking that at least the culprit would have to escape while I watched until I realized how inhuman that was."
    new "我竟一直想着，至少凶手逃走的时候，我总能看在眼里——直到我意识到，这念头有多冷酷。"

    # game/script.rpy:13842
    old "The universe wouldn't allow me to change the past? That was ridiculous, and if anything, it was providing me with a way to do it.{w} I bolted to the bathroom as fast as I could. I definitely still had time to change the past."
    new "宇宙不许我改变过去？荒唐。真要说的话，它反倒给了我改变过去的机会。{w}我拼尽全力冲向洗手间。我绝对还有时间改变过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:13843
    old "It wasn't too late, and I could trap the culprit inside. I wouldn't let them escape, and it would change the past in some way."
    new "还来得及，我可以把凶手困在里面。我绝不会让他逃掉——这样一来，过去多少会被改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:13851
    old "But that thought evaporated when I heard a sound in front of me.{w} Before I could reach the bathroom, the door was forcefully shut from the inside and then locked. I recognized the sound as soon as I heard it: it was the one we'd heard from the event room."
    new "然而身前传来的一声响，让这个念头瞬间消散。{w}我还没跑到洗手间，门就从里面被用力关上，随后落了锁。那声音我一听就认了出来——正是我们在活动室里听到过的响动。"

    # game/script.rpy:13854
    old "...How? It should've been impossible since the killer was still inside. However, I didn't have time to think about it. Faster than I'd ever run, I scrambled to the stairs, knowing that in less than a couple seconds, Erina's gaze would seal off the entire floor."
    new "……怎么可能？凶手明明还在里面，这门理应锁不上才对。可我无暇细想，用前所未有的速度奔向楼梯——我知道，不出几秒，Erina 的视线就会封死整层楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:13864
    old "I made it before I was spotted only because I'd reacted fast enough, but... it didn't make any sense.{w} We were going to search through the entire floor and find no culprit."
    new "全靠反应够快，我才赶在被发现之前脱身，可是……这一切根本说不通。{w}我们接下来会把整层楼搜个遍，却一个凶手都找不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:13865
    old "Were Erina and Isla going to let them escape? If so, I was about to see it, and since I was one floor higher, I could hear the elevator too. It was still on the crystal floor."
    new "Erina 和 Isla 会放任凶手逃走吗？如果是，那我很快就能亲眼看到。再说我比他们高一层，电梯的动静也听得见——它现在还停在水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:13870
    old "Once again, I waited, watching over the stairs from afar.{w} However, a couple minutes later, nobody had gone up. At that time, we were already next to the locked door, and we would only find Naomi inside."
    new "我再次等待着，远远盯着楼梯。{w}可几分钟过去了，没有一个人上来。那时我们已经站在那扇锁着的门前，而里面只会有 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:13871
    old "The way we'd coordinated ourselves back then had been effective. Erina and Isla prevented me from going down and seeing what happened to Akaro, which was also something I'd wanted to find out."
    new "当时我们的分工确实奏效。Erina 和 Isla 拦住了我，让我没法下楼去看 Akaro 出了什么事——而那也正是我想弄清楚的。"

    # game/script.rpy:13872
    old "So, by rushing to the door, I didn't change anything.{w} That always happened, and yet we didn't find the person who should've been inside. Like I thought, the past won't change. As soon as I determined that I was going to do it, I was blocked off."
    new "也就是说，我冲向那扇门，什么也没能改变。{w}事情总是如此，可我们依然没找到那个本该在里面的人。果然，过去无法改变。我刚下定决心要动手，路就被堵死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:13873
    old "Although before I say that for sure, I have to verify that they really didn't find someone and that everything is happening as I remember."
    new "不过在下定论之前，我必须确认他们真的没找到人，确认一切都在按我记忆中的样子发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:13874
    old "...{w}But this means that something happened to the killer. Did they go back to the past before we found them? They locked the door as soon as I approached it, so they must've escaped after that point."
    new "……{w}可这就意味着凶手出了什么事。他们是在被我们发现之前回到过去了吗？我一靠近，门就被锁上了，所以他们一定是在那之后才逃走的。"

    # game/script.rpy:13875
    old "There's a big problem. The Sekimeiya is currently in the event room. It's clear that under some circumstances, it does make you travel to the past, but they couldn't have used it unless we're severely misunderstanding how it works."
    new "这里有个大问题。Sekimeiya 现在就在活动室里。在某些情况下它确实会让人穿越回过去，这一点已经很明确了；可凶手不可能用到它——除非我们严重误解了它的运作方式。"

    # game/script.rpy:13878
    old "If touching it physically is a requirement to travel, anyone inside the bathroom couldn't have used it. Is there any way to get around that?"
    new "如果穿越的前提是亲手触碰它，那洗手间里的人根本用不上它。有没有什么办法能绕开这一点？"

    # game/script.rpy:13879
    old "For example, since we had inspected the whole floor earlier, it's very likely that the culprit appeared from the future. Could they have brought the Sekimeiya with them and then used it to escape from the bathroom?"
    new "比方说，既然我们先前已经查过整层楼，那凶手极有可能是从未来过来的。会不会是他们把 Sekimeiya 一起带了过来，再靠它从洗手间逃走？"

    # game/script.rpy:13880
    old "I don't know how that would be possible. The Sekimeiya is the cause of the travels, so you shouldn't be able to travel with it too."
    new "这怎么可能做到，我想不通。Sekimeiya 本身就是穿越的起因，没道理能带着它一起穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:13881
    old "So then, what method could they have used to disappear like that...? Why did they kill Naomi? And while we're at it, who the fuck is this person?"
    new "那么，他们究竟用了什么法子，才能那样凭空消失……？又为什么要杀 Naomi？还有——这个人他妈到底是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:13884
    old "\"Someone who will travel to the past\".{w} We have that person: Akaro.{w} He's about to travel to the past right now, but for some reason, we won't find him again until later."
    new "「一个将要穿越回过去的人」。{w}我们正好有这么一个人：Akaro。{w}他马上就要穿越回过去了，可不知为何，我们要等到更晚些才会再次找到他。"

    # game/script.rpy:13885
    old "Did he have a way to escape the bathroom? Was he the one who shut and locked the door before I reached it...?"
    new "他有办法逃出洗手间吗？在我赶到之前把门关上并上锁的，难道就是他……？"

    # game/script.rpy:13886
    old "My whole body felt like a coiled spring, and I'd been continuously biting my lip. I couldn't get the thought that I'd let Naomi die out of my head."
    new "我全身像绷紧的弹簧，嘴唇也被自己咬了一遍又一遍。我没能救下 Naomi——这个念头怎么也甩不掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:13887
    old "...How was that even possible, though!? She had died twice!"
    new "……可这怎么可能！？她已经死过两次了！"

    # game/script.rpy:13891
    old "I made a plan in my head: if Akaro was responsible, he had to be the one who'd hidden the Sekimeiya while we were in the attic.{w} We'd walk up in a few minutes, and I knew for a fact that we wouldn't look through every floor."
    new "我在心里盘算：如果凶手是 Akaro，那么趁我们待在阁楼的时候把 Sekimeiya 藏起来的人一定是他。{w}再过几分钟我们就会上去，而我清楚地知道，我们不会逐层搜查。"

    # game/script.rpy:13892
    old "As long as I hid myself in a partition, I wouldn't be seen. Afterward, I could go down again and see who'd hidden the Sekimeiya. Once more, I'd have a chance to see the murderer firsthand.{w} And if Akaro had been telling the truth about seeing us during our inspection, I would see him for sure."
    new "只要躲在隔断后面，就不会被发现。之后我可以再下去一趟，看看究竟是谁藏起了 Sekimeiya。这样我又有机会亲眼见到凶手。{w}而如果 Akaro 说他在我们搜查时看见了我们，这话属实，那我就一定能看见他。"

    # game/script.rpy:13893
    old "I recalled our movements downstairs. Erina and Isla stayed in place, observing the path between floors while the rest of us moved back and forth between the two rooms with their individual Naomis. Eventually, after exiting the event room, we lost track of Akaro."
    new "我回想了一下我们在楼下的行动。Erina 和 Isla 留在原处，盯着楼层之间的通道；其余人则来回奔走于两个房间之间，两个房间里各有一个 Naomi。最后，走出活动室之后，我们就跟丢了 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:13894
    old "We'd searched through the whole floor after that, and I could attempt to repeat that myself.{w} I waited out the brief time until there was a safe way down."
    new "那之后我们把整层楼搜了一遍，而我也可以试着照做一遍。{w}我熬过那段短暂的时间，等到能安全下楼的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:13899
    old "After four or five minutes, I saw the group coming up the stairs. We were going to the attic, which confirmed that Erina and Isla had never gone anywhere. They were definitely watching the entire time."
    new "四五分钟后，我看见一行人沿着楼梯上来。我们正要前往阁楼——这也证实了 Erina 和 Isla 自始至终都守在原处。她们一定全程都在盯着。"

    # game/script.rpy:13904
    old "I slipped into the offices to avoid being seen."
    new "我闪身躲进办公室，以免被发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:13916
    old "When the group was gone, I slowly stepped out. Nobody had the chance to pass by after them—I'd been watching the glass from the second partition.{w} The crystal floor was isolated, and according to Akaro, he had to be there."
    new "等一行人离开后，我才慢慢走出来。他们走后没人再经过——我一直从第二道隔断后面盯着玻璃。{w}水晶层是封闭的，而按 Akaro 的说法，他一定就在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:13922
    old "I moved down. I couldn't do an optimal search since I was only one person, but I should've been able to find someone who wasn't deliberately hiding from me."
    new "我下了楼。只靠我一个人，搜查不可能做到滴水不漏，但只要对方没有刻意躲着我，我总该能找到人。"

    # game/script.rpy:13923
    old "Akaro specifically said he'd only \"teleported\". Regardless of the veracity of that, he had to still be on the crystal floor."
    new "Akaro 特别强调过，自己只是「传送」过去的。这话是真是假暂且不论，他应该仍待在水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:13930
    old "I opened the door to the elevator, revealing its barren interior."
    new "我打开电梯门，里面空无一物。"

    # game/script.rpy:13934
    old "Next, I looked at the bathrooms, which only contained Naomi's body the way I remembered leaving it—not yet covered by a curtain. It was further confirmation that I was reliving something I'd already experienced, just from another viewpoint."
    new "接着我又去看了卫生间。里面只有 Naomi 的遗体，和我记忆中离开时一样——还没有被遮布盖住。这进一步证实，我正从另一个视角重温已经经历过的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:13935
    old "Akaro had stated that he didn't go up any floors, so even though I couldn't keep track of the entire area, he had to be lying if I didn't see him."
    new "Akaro 说过自己没有上过任何一层楼。我虽然无法盯住整片区域，但只要没看到他，就说明他在说谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:13940
    old "I began looking through every room. I'd seen other people do it, but I'd never personally been the one to inspect.{w} Investigating like that felt a bit paradoxical: if Akaro was in one of the rooms, he would see me even though he'd never mentioned it to us. Despite that, I continued."
    new "我开始逐间查看。以前都是看别人这么做，自己从没亲手查过。{w} 这样查总觉得有点矛盾：假如 Akaro 就在某个房间里，他会看到我，可这件事他从没跟我们提过。尽管如此，我还是继续查了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:13944
    old "The cleaning and staff rooms were empty, and so were the first few crystal rooms. Once I entered the event room, I saw the Sekimeiya still there, revealing that it would soon be moved."
    new "清洁间和员工室都空着，最初的几间水晶展室也一样。走进活动室时，我看到 Sekimeiya 还在原处，这说明它很快就会被转移。"

    # game/script.rpy:13948
    old "I continued with the remaining rooms in hallway B, which all appeared empty. Even though Akaro's body was the biggest out of everyone's, he could still fit inside a cabinet. It was outlandish to think he would hide in one, but I couldn't ignore them just because of that."
    new "我接着查完 B 走廊剩下的房间，全都空荡荡的。Akaro 虽然是我们当中块头最大的，可还是挤得进展示柜。他会躲在那种地方，想想都荒唐，但我也不能因为这个就不去看一眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:13970
    old "After the mechanical room, I began the hallway A search.{w} A few minutes later, I'd confirmed that it was fully vacant."
    new "查完机械室，我开始搜 A 走廊。{w} 几分钟后，我确认那里一个人也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:13975
    old "I knew how suspicious that was. Surely, if Akaro was there and wasn't up to anything, he would've been drawn in by the noise. I should've seen him."
    new "我知道这有多可疑。如果 Akaro 就在那里、又没有做什么见不得人的事，他一定会被声响引来。我本该看到他的。"

    # game/script.rpy:13976
    old "Had he seen me all by myself and avoided me? If so, he would know that I was about to travel to the past when he saw me and Shiroya heading downstairs—we'd told him that we all stayed together the whole time...{w} If he'd hidden the Sekimeiya, he would be aware that we were about to find it. And despite that, he hadn't stopped or questioned us."
    new "难道他看到我独自一人，就故意避开？如果真是这样，那他看见我和 Shiroya 下楼时，就该知道我们马上要穿越到过去——我们跟他说过，大家一直待在一起……{w} 如果他藏起了 Sekimeiya，也清楚我们即将找到它。可他并没有拦下我们，也没有多问。"

    # game/script.rpy:13986
    old "I moved to the cleaning room again, knowing that Akaro would eventually enter the men's bathroom. Immediately, I noticed two things."
    new "我重新回到清洁间，心里清楚 Akaro 迟早会走进男卫生间。我一进去就注意到两件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:13987
    old "One: the bathroom's door looked exactly like it had when we'd come back down. We'd seen that it looked different from how we'd left it."
    new "第一，卫生间的门和我们下楼回来时看到的一模一样。当时我们就发现，它跟我们离开时的样子不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:13988
    old "The second thing I noticed was that I'd been responsible for it. I had looked inside it and left the door slightly more open than it had been."
    new "第二，造成这一点的人正是我自己。我往里面看了一眼，把门留得比原来更开了一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:13989
    old "What the hell was up with that bathroom? I knew Akaro would be inside it in a few minutes, but the door threw me for a loop."
    new "那间卫生间到底是怎么回事？我知道再过几分钟 Akaro 就会待在里面，可那扇门让我摸不着头脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:13990
    old "Unable to piece together what was happening, I stood still, waiting for what was bound to occur. At the point Akaro asked Sai for the time, it was {time=11:36.}"
    new "我怎么也理不清正在发生什么，只好站在原地，等待注定要发生的事。Akaro 向 Sai 问起时间的那个时候，是 {time=11:36.}"

    # game/script.rpy:13994
    old "After the time I'd taken to investigate every room, I didn't have to wait very long before I saw the others appearing from the other side of hallway C. They had just searched every upper floor after visiting the attic for the first time."
    new "查遍所有房间花了不少时间，所以我没等多久，就看见其他人从 C 走廊的另一头出现。他们刚第一次去过阁楼，又把上面每一层都搜了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:13996
    old "They noticed the difference with the bathroom's door and went to check it. Inside, they saw Akaro."
    new "他们察觉到卫生间门的异样，便过去查看。里面正是 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:13997
    old "I couldn't completely rule out that he'd entered it, but the position of the door indicated otherwise. ...Something extremely peculiar had happened inside that small room."
    new "我不能完全排除是他自己走进去的，但门的位置说明并非如此。……那间狭小的房间里，发生过某种极为诡异的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:14002
    old "After a bit, Sai turned around and headed toward the event room at the same time that Shiroya went to grab a curtain. I reacted fast enough to avoid being seen, but I hadn't anticipated it. Regardless, everything was happening just as I'd already experienced it."
    new "过了一会儿，Sai 转身走向活动室，与此同时 Shiroya 去取遮布。我反应够快，没被他们看见，不过我没料到会来这么一下。不管怎样，一切都和我已经经历过的一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:14003
    old "What had happened to Akaro? The truth was likely obscured behind his odd claim—his lack of time travel."
    new "Akaro 究竟遭遇了什么？真相恐怕就藏在他那句古怪的话背后——他并没有穿越时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:14004
    old "When he'd disappeared from our side, we were unable to find him. Before that point, Naomi's killer also vanished completely from the bathroom. And Akaro, who we found there, claimed to have only teleported. Properly piecing all that together had to reveal the truth or form another piece to place somewhere."
    new "他从我们眼前消失后，我们怎么也找不到他。而在此之前，杀害 Naomi 的凶手也从卫生间里彻底消失。至于我们在那里找到的 Akaro，他声称自己只是传送了过去。把这些线索正确地拼合起来，要么能揭示真相，要么能成为另一块待安放的拼图。"

    # game/script.rpy:14005
    old "But despite thinking that, I couldn't decide whether to suspect him or not, because I still didn't fully understand the way the Sekimeiya worked. The little I did know was contradicted by everything I'd witnessed from my new point of view."
    new "可话虽如此，我仍拿不定该不该怀疑他，因为我对 Sekimeiya 的运作方式还远远谈不上了解。我仅有的那点认知，又被我从新视角目睹的一切推翻了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14012
    old "After my past self went to check the Sekimeiya, everyone but Akaro left.{w} I saw Isla's and Shiroya's purses, and they were oblivious of what they were carrying. No matter how much I thought about the abnormal death of the second Naomi, the recording that the four of us were about to hear had remained in the back of my mind."
    new "过去的我去确认 Sekimeiya 之后，除了 Akaro，其他人都离开了。{w} 我看到了 Isla 和 Shiroya 的手提包，而她们对自己带着什么毫不知情。无论我怎么琢磨第二个 Naomi 那场不寻常的死亡，我们四人即将听到的那段录音始终盘踞在我脑海深处。"

    # game/script.rpy:14013
    old "Being abandoned inside the building for a month, buying into some trick, falling into disarray along with Shiroya... The last thing I wanted was to be a victim of any of that."
    new "被丢在这栋楼里整整一个月、中了某个圈套、再和 Shiroya 一起陷入混乱……我最不愿意的，就是成为这些事里的受害者。"

    # game/script.rpy:14016
    old "From that spot, I kept watching. I knew the Sekimeiya would be moved before Shiroya and I returned, and the cleaning room provided me with a way to look at Akaro while listening to the event room and the room I'd traveled from. If either door was opened, I was fairly certain I'd hear it."
    new "我待在那处继续观望。我知道在我和 Shiroya 回来之前，Sekimeiya 会被移走；而待在清洁间，既能看着 Akaro，又能听见活动室和我穿越出来的那个房间的动静。无论哪扇门被打开，我都有把握听到。"

    # game/script.rpy:14017
    old "In a bit more than ten minutes, I would reach my own present and meet up with Shiroya again. I still had an important chance to understand what was going on."
    new "再过十几分钟，我就会回到自己的现在，与 Shiroya 会合。我仍有一个重要的机会去弄清事情的真相。"

    # game/script.rpy:14018
    old "...So my thoughts fixated on the culprit. The person responsible for everything."
    new "……于是我的思绪锁定在了犯人身上。那个该为一切负责的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:14021
    old "The incident, the two murders, and hiding the Sekimeiya. At first, since we hadn't known what the Sekimeiya was capable of, we'd strongly considered someone else was trapped with us and that they were behind it all. However, that was no longer as concrete."
    new "那起事件、两桩命案，还有藏起 Sekimeiya。起初我们不知道 Sekimeiya 究竟能做什么，便强烈怀疑另有某人和我们一起被困在这栋楼里，一切都是那人所为。可现在，这个推测已不再那么确定了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14022
    old "The culprit had used the Sekimeiya and possessed knowledge of it. I'd been pretty sure of that already, but seeing them vanish from the bathroom was a stark confirmation. They knew what they were doing, and they were consciously escaping from us.{w} While it was possible that a ninth person was present, thanks to the Sekimeiya, it wasn't necessarily the case. Everything that the \"culprit\" had done could've been done by one of us as long as they had knowledge of the Sekimeiya's mechanics."
    new "犯人使用过 Sekimeiya，也了解它。这一点我早就很有把握，但亲眼看到对方从卫生间消失，才算是确凿的印证。那人清楚自己在做什么，也有意识地躲避我们。{w} 借助 Sekimeiya，确实可能存在第九个人，但也未必如此。只要掌握了 Sekimeiya 的运作原理，「犯人」做过的一切，我们当中任何人都能做到。"

    # game/script.rpy:14023
    old "Sai had previously brought up the idea that Katei originally found the Sekimeiya. If so, he was a good candidate to know how it worked. However, he'd repeatedly told us to keep it in the cabinet while it had already been removed three times."
    new "Sai 之前提出过，最初发现 Sekimeiya 的人可能是 Katei。若果真如此，他很可能了解它的用法。可他一再叮嘱我们把 Sekimeiya 放回展示柜，而它已经被取走三次了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14024
    old "The power outage, hiding the Sekimeiya in the storeroom, the two killings of Naomi, and whatever might've happened in the attic... I still couldn't explain any of that, but something odd had happened in every one of those instances, meaning that the person responsible must have deliberately used the Sekimeiya to their advantage."
    new "停电、把 Sekimeiya 藏进储藏室、Naomi 的两次死亡，还有阁楼里可能发生过的事……这些我依然一件都解释不了，但每一桩里都出现了反常之处。也就是说，那个人一定是有意利用 Sekimeiya 为自己谋利。"

    # game/script.rpy:14027
    old "So then, who were they? What was their purpose? I never stopped asking myself that last question. Why did they need to kill Naomi?{w} Did their bizarre plan involve trapping us inside the building for the next few weeks...?"
    new "那么，那人是谁？目的又是什么？我一直在不停地问自己最后那个问题。为什么非要杀掉 Naomi？{w} 难道那人荒唐的计划，就是把我们关在这栋楼里好几个星期……？"

    # game/script.rpy:14028
    old "I reassured myself that there was no way they could accomplish that...{w} However, it was undeniable that the cameras recorded them. They surely intended to prevent anyone outside from viewing the recordings. We'd already seen an \"Access Denied\" message, after all."
    new "我安慰自己，这种事他们绝不可能办到……{w} 可监控摄像头拍下了他们，这一点无可否认。他们一定打算阻止外面的人看到这些录像。毕竟，我们已经见过「拒绝访问」的提示了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14029
    old "Even though it was clear that Katei was the most suspicious person there, he had also gotten more and more questionable by the second. That was what made me hesitant."
    new "Katei 显然是这里最可疑的人，但他身上的疑点也一分一秒地越积越多。正是这一点让我犹豫不决。"

    # game/script.rpy:14031
    old "I continued waiting. At around {time=11:50}, I'd travel to the past, and before that, the Sekimeiya would be stolen and Akaro would leave. At least I was safe where I was—I knew Shiroya and I hadn't entered the cleaning room."
    new "我继续等待。大约 {time=11:50}，我会穿越到过去；在那之前，Sekimeiya 会被偷走，Akaro 也会离开。至少我待的地方是安全的——我清楚我和 Shiroya 没有进过清洁间。"

    # game/script.rpy:14032
    old "Like before, the minutes passed and nothing changed. I couldn't see Akaro inside the bathroom, but I knew he was still there, and he'd also told us that he didn't leave until he went to the attic."
    new "和之前一样，时间一分分过去，什么也没发生。我看不见卫生间里的 Akaro，但我知道他仍待在里面；他也告诉过我们，自己直到去阁楼才离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:14035
    old "Even though I knew I'd hear him, I kept glancing at the other side of the hallway every once in a while. If Akaro was responsible for the Sekimeiya's disappearance, though, he'd have to move first."
    new "明知能听见动静，我还是时不时朝走廊另一头瞥上一眼。不过，如果 Sekimeiya 的消失是 Akaro 造成的，他总得先有所行动。"

    # game/script.rpy:14036
    old "I didn't know what I was about to see, but in the meantime, the floor was completely silent. There were no traces of anyone else, and Akaro didn't appear to have been lying for the time being."
    new "我不知道接下来会看到什么，但此刻这一层安静至极。没有任何其他人的痕迹，至少到目前为止，Akaro 似乎没有说谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:14038
    old "A few more minutes passed; our past selves were occupied with listening to the recording. {w} There wasn't a lot more time left until we'd appear, but I knew for sure that Akaro would first exit the bathroom."
    new "又过了几分钟，过去的我们正忙着听录音。{w} 距离我们出现已经没有多少时间了，但我确信 Akaro 会先从卫生间出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:14039
    old "...Or was that necessarily the case? Hadn't I just experienced someone vanishing from that same bathroom? I started to feel uncertain, but that sensation quickly disappeared. About eight minutes after the group had disappeared, Akaro did, in fact, leave the bathroom."
    new "……真是这样吗？我不正是刚刚才经历过有人从同一间卫生间里消失吗？一丝不安涌了上来，但很快便消散了。那伙人离开大约八分钟后，Akaro 果然走出了卫生间。"

    # game/script.rpy:14040
    old "He looked tired and still a bit groggy. After breathing deeply, he walked off toward the stairs and disappeared from my field of vision.{w} We'd told him the elevator wasn't functional, so he went up by foot. That meant Shiroya and I were about to head down."
    new "他看上去很疲惫，还带着几分昏沉。深吸一口气后，他朝楼梯走去，从我的视野里消失。{w} 我们告诉过他电梯不能用，所以他只能走上去。这也意味着，我和 Shiroya 马上就要下楼了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14051
    old "Similarly, the Sekimeiya was about to be stolen. Keeping an eye on hallway B, I moved toward the bathroom, as I still felt something was off with it. I quickly saw the curtain on the floor, covering Naomi."
    new "同样地，Sekimeiya 也快被偷走了。我一边留意着 B走廊，一边朝卫生间走去，总觉得那里有些不对劲。很快我就看到了铺在地上、盖住 Naomi 的遮布。"

    # game/script.rpy:14052
    old "The killer had disappeared from the inside, and Akaro might have appeared in the same place. I'd thought that someone could only travel by making physical contact with the Sekimeiya, so I wanted to see if that was somehow possible from the bathroom."
    new "凶手从里面消失了，而 Akaro 或许就出现在同一个地方。我一直以为，人必须与 Sekimeiya 有实际接触才能穿越，所以想看看在那间卫生间里是否可能存在别的途径。"

    # game/script.rpy:14053
    old "There weren't many places to check. I looked in the toilet, in the water tank, and in the garbage can. I couldn't find anything of importance."
    new "可以检查的地方并不多。我看了马桶、水箱和垃圾桶，没找到任何要紧的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:14055
    old "No Sekimeiya that had traveled from the future, and nothing that indicated how someone would disappear from the inside. Only the Sekimeiya could've made the culprit disappear, and there was no way it had vanished through the toilet..."
    new "没有从未来穿越而来的 Sekimeiya，也没有任何能说明人如何从里面消失的线索。能让犯人消失的只有 Sekimeiya，而它绝不可能从马桶里消失……"

    # game/script.rpy:14056
    old "I was checking the bathroom about twenty minutes after the culprit had escaped it, but that shouldn't have mattered. When we'd first discovered Naomi's body, nobody had the chance to remove anything because I was the only person to even set foot inside. After that, Erina and Isla were watching from the stairs, so moving around the area was also impossible."
    new "我检查卫生间时，距离犯人从那里逃走已经过了二十分钟左右，但这本该无关紧要。最初发现 Naomi 的遗体时，没人有机会取走任何东西，因为踏进那间卫生间的只有我一个人。之后 Erina 和 Isla 一直守在楼梯那边看着，想在那片区域动手脚也不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:14059
    old "Once the group moved to the attic, I'd quickly come back from the second floor and opened the door to see if Akaro was present. There were a few seconds around then where someone could've tampered with the bathroom's interior, but since we'd just searched through the entire floor, they needed to have traveled from the future...{w} I could justify it like that, but there was hardly any chance of it."
    new "那伙人一去阁楼，我便立刻从二楼折返，打开门确认 Akaro 在不在。就在那前后几秒里，确实可能有人对卫生间内部动过手脚；可我们刚把整层搜过一遍，那人就必须是从未来穿越过来的……{w} 这样解释也说得通，但几乎没有这种可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:14060
    old "After that, I checked every room on the floor. Someone could've entered the bathroom at that time, but the door hadn't moved when I returned to the cleaning room—it would be open wider if someone went through it."
    new "之后我查遍了这一层的每个房间。那段时间里，有人可能进过卫生间，可我回到清洁间时，那扇门并没有动过——若有人进出，它会开得更大。"

    # game/script.rpy:14061
    old "So the state of the bathroom was almost certainly identical to how it was when we found Naomi's body, and there was nothing that allowed the culprit to escape. If you could travel back in time and bring the Sekimeiya with you, that was one method, but nothing indicated it was possible."
    new "所以卫生间的状态，几乎可以肯定和发现 Naomi 遗体时完全一样，里面没有任何能让犯人逃走的办法。假如人能带着 Sekimeiya 一起穿越回过去，那倒算一种方法，可没有任何迹象表明这行得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:14062
    old "...{w}Could the key to what happened have been removed by Akaro? Whatever it was, had he left the bathroom with it just then...?"
    new "……{w}难道那件事的关键，是被 Akaro 拿走了？不管那是什么，他刚才离开卫生间时，是不是就把它带在身上……？"

    # game/script.rpy:14063
    old "He had nothing in his hands when he left. Aside from that, he only had a couple small pockets in his pants."
    new "他离开时两手空空。除此之外，他裤子上只有几个很小的口袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:14070
    old "Out of the blue, I heard a sound while I was still watching hallway B. The sound itself didn't surprise me since I knew someone else had to be skulking around to hide the Sekimeiya."
    new "我还盯着 B走廊，忽然听见一声响动。声音本身并不让我意外——要把 Sekimeiya 藏起来，本来就得有另一个人在暗处活动。"

    # game/script.rpy:14071
    old "Trying not to announce my presence, I observed the hallway, knowing that it couldn't yet have been me and Shiroya. Nobody appeared to be there, which was odd.{w} Shortly after, I heard another sound come from the opposite hallway."
    new "我尽量不暴露自己，只静静观察着走廊。那个时间点，弄出动静的不可能是我和 Shiroya。可那里似乎空无一人，这就怪了。{w} 没过多久，对面的走廊又传来一声响动。"

    # game/script.rpy:14075
    old "I approached hallway A, a little nervous. As soon as I peeked in, I saw who else was there."
    new "我怀着几分紧张走近 A走廊，探头一望，便看清了那边的人是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:14084
    old "Thunderhead"
    new "雷云"

    # game/script.rpy:14087
    old "It was Sai...{w} He had made the sound and was in front of the event room... However, that shouldn't have been possible. At that moment, he was in the attic. We'd left him in the bedroom after he climbed the ladder to look around."
    new "是 Sai……{w} 声音是他弄出来的，人就站在活动室前……可这根本不可能。那一刻，他明明在阁楼。他爬上梯子四处看过之后，我们就把他留在了卧室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:14088
    old "While I paused, unsure of how to react, he noticed me. As if he'd seen a deadly creature, he visibly recoiled. He had clearly not expected to see me there, and once we made eye contact, he was left petrified just like I was."
    new "我一时愣在原地，不知该如何反应，他倒先看见了我。那副模样，像是撞见了什么致命的东西，整个人明显往后一缩。他显然没料到会在这里遇上我；四目相对之后，他僵住了，我也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:14093
    old "I didn't know what his next action would be, so I moved over to him. I was half expecting him to run away, but he stood immobile, waiting for me to arrive."
    new "我猜不透他接下来会做什么，索性朝他走过去。我本来有些以为他会转身就跑，他却一动不动，站在原地等我走近。"

    # game/script.rpy:14101
    old "...Um.{w=0.4} Hey,{w=0.3} Atsuki.{w=0.4} How are you doing?"
    new "……呃。{w=0.4} 那个，{w=0.3} Atsuki。{w=0.4} 你还好吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:14102
    old "I quickly noticed it. He was pretending not to know what he was carrying in his hip pack."
    new "我立刻就注意到了——他正装作不知道自己腰包里装着什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:14103
    old "All's good—trying to get the most out of my imprisonment. What about you?"
    new "还行，尽量让这段被囚禁的日子过得有滋有味。你呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:14108
    old "Coincidentally, me too. Has that led you anywhere?"
    new "说来也巧，我也是。有什么收获吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:14109
    old "...{w}Let's go to the lobby."
    new "……{w}去大厅吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:14110
    old "Huh? Why?"
    new "咦？为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:14111
    old "I don't know, so we don't freeze the world or something."
    new "说不上来，免得我们一个不小心把世界给冻住了之类的。"

    # game/script.rpy:14119
    old "Shiroya and I were about to arrive. To avoid anything undesirable, we walked to the lobby even though I didn't elaborate further to Sai."
    new "我和 Shiroya 马上就要到了。为免节外生枝，我们一同走向大厅，尽管我没有向 Sai 多作解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:14124
    old "Do you like it better here?"
    new "你更喜欢这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:14125
    old "...Yes. Let's not be too loud, either. Anyway, where were you gonna bring that?"
    new "……嗯。说话也别太大声。话说回来，你打算把那东西带到哪儿去？"

    # game/script.rpy:14130
    old "Bring what?"
    new "带什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:14131
    old "What you're hiding there."
    new "你藏在那儿的那个东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:14133
    old "Sai frowned. He tilted his head down, toward his hip pack. Without changing his expression, he unzipped it, and {tip=future}the Sekimeiya was uncovered{/tip}."
    new "Sai 皱起眉，低头看向自己的腰包。他面无表情地拉开拉链，{tip=future}露出了里面的 Sekimeiya{/tip}。"

    # game/script.rpy:14138
    old "What the...?"
    new "什……什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:14139
    old "This is going to sound funny, but I had no idea this was here."
    new "说出来你大概不信，我完全不知道它在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:14143
    old "Additionally, the Sekimeiya wasn't white. It was gray—the same shade it had shifted to the last time."
    new "而且，那个 Sekimeiya 并不是白色的，而是灰色——和它上次变色后的灰色一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:14148
    old "It does sound funny. Did you accidentally get it from the cabinet and put it there? Or did it maybe teleport inside?"
    new "确实难以相信。是你无意间从展示柜里拿了它、顺手塞进去的？还是它自己传送进去的？"

    # game/script.rpy:14150
    old "More importantly, how did you get here?"
    new "更重要的是，你怎么会到这儿来？"

    # game/script.rpy:14151
    old "You mean that I shouldn't be here, right? I figured. And no, I definitely didn't put it in here. It's not heavy at all, so I didn't notice I had it."
    new "你的意思是我不该出现在这儿，对吧？我就知道。不，我绝对没把它放进去。它一点也不重，所以我根本没察觉到。"

    # game/script.rpy:14152
    old "He took it out. It didn't make him travel, and nothing seemed to have happened."
    new "他把 Sekimeiya 拿了出来。什么事也没有发生——他并没有因此穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:14153
    old "Well, that's hard to believe. Right now, the Sekimeiya has disappeared. You must've taken it out and just been about to hide it."
    new "这话很难让人信服。就在刚才，Sekimeiya 明明不见了。肯定是你把它取了出来，正准备藏起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:14154
    old "...The past Shiroya and I had surely already arrived. We went to the bathroom first, and then to the event room.{w} ...So if Sai had the Sekimeiya, had I interrupted his actions, thereby changing the past?"
    new "……过去的 Shiroya 和我肯定已经到这里了。我们先去了洗手间，然后才到活动室。{w} ……那么，既然 Sekimeiya 在 Sai 手上，是不是我打断了他的行动，把过去给改变了？"

    # game/script.rpy:14155
    old "If that was it, my travel would become impossible. Was something terrible about to happen...? None of my other actions had resulted in anything similar."
    new "若真是如此，我恐怕就无法穿越了。难道要出什么可怕的事……？可我之前的每一个举动，都没造成过类似的后果。"

    # game/script.rpy:14160
    old "Hm...{w} Yeah, I did see the Sekimeiya disappeared. Was it Akaro, or was it you?"
    new "嗯……{w} 对，我确实看见 Sekimeiya 不见了。拿走它的是 Akaro，还是你？"

    # game/script.rpy:14161
    old "It wasn't either of us. I heard Akaro going up the stairs as soon as he left the bathroom, so it wasn't him. I couldn't look at both hallways at the same time, so I can't be sure that you did it, but you just so happen to be holding it."
    new "我们两个都没有。Akaro 一出洗手间，我就听见他上楼去了，所以不是他。我没法同时盯住两条走廊，因此不能断定是你干的——可东西偏偏就在你手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:14166
    old "Apparently, I am. You traveled from the future, right?"
    new "看来确实在我手上。你是从未来穿越过来的，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:14167
    old "Why, because I shouldn't be here?"
    new "怎么，就因为我不该出现在这儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:14168
    old "...Maybe."
    new "……也许吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:14169
    old "I might've traveled, yes. You did too, right?"
    new "也许我确实穿越过。你也一样，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:14170
    old "Me? Don't be stupid. I don't know where the Sekimeiya is. I was just searching for it, and it seems I didn't realize I had it."
    new "我？别傻了。我连 Sekimeiya 在哪儿都不知道。我一直在找它，结果好像根本没意识到自己一直带着它。"

    # game/script.rpy:14171
    old "...I had no idea how I was supposed to take that. I was about to travel with the Sekimeiya from room B3, so why did Sai have it? Of course, believing that he didn't know it was in his hip pack was ridiculous."
    new "……我实在不知道该怎样理解这番话。我明明马上就要从 B3房间带着 Sekimeiya 穿越，它怎么会在 Sai 手里？当然，要说他不知道自己的腰包里装着它，那也太荒唐了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14174
    old "You definitely traveled, right? Did you already have it in your hip pack when you appeared? Is that what you mean?"
    new "你肯定是穿越过的吧？你出现的时候，它就已经在腰包里了？你想说的是这个意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:14179
    old "...That's an interesting thought, even though I didn't travel."
    new "……这想法倒有意思，可惜我并没有穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:14180
    old "If that had happened, it meant that the Sekimeiya traveled with him too, but what would the reason for that be?{w} ...And even then, who hid the Sekimeiya from the cabinet? It was a fact that we'd seen it empty, but I didn't notice anyone entering the room where Shiroya found it."
    new "若真是那样，就说明 Sekimeiya 也跟着他一起穿越了——可这又是出于什么缘由？{w} ……再说，究竟是谁把 Sekimeiya 从展示柜里拿走的？我们确实亲眼见过展示柜是空的，可我也没见有人进过 Shiroya 找到它的那个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:14181
    old "It turned white again..."
    new "它又变白了……"

    # game/script.rpy:14186
    old "You're right. How bizarre."
    new "没错。真是怪事。"

    # game/script.rpy:14191
    old "Sai had put the Sekimeiya back in his pack, and out of nowhere, it changed colors again, recovering its white glow."
    new "Sai 已经把 Sekimeiya 放回包里，它却毫无征兆地再次变色，重新泛起白色的光泽。"

    # game/script.rpy:14197
    old "So, it went back to normal without needing a lower temperature."
    new "这么说，不用降温它也恢复正常了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14198
    old "Maybe it works again, then. Why don't you try touching it?"
    new "那它说不定又能用了。你要不要碰一下试试？"

    # game/script.rpy:14203
    old "Because that'd be very stupid of me. I'd disappear and leave the Sekimeiya here with you. What if you're the one who keeps hiding it?"
    new "那可就太蠢了。我一消失，Sekimeiya 就留在这里了。万一一直藏它的人就是你呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:14206
    old "I don't want to hide it anywhere, and you'd appear in the past. You could make it here the moment you disappear to prevent me from hiding it."
    new "我根本不想把它藏到任何地方。而且你会出现在过去——你完全可以在消失的那一刻赶回这里，阻止我把它藏起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:14211
    old "That's assuming I appear inside the tower. If I appear outside, you could do anything you wanted with it."
    new "前提是我能出现在塔里。要是我落在塔外，那东西就随你处置了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14212
    old "He zipped the Sekimeiya inside his pack."
    new "他把 Sekimeiya 塞进背包，拉上了拉链。"

    # game/script.rpy:14214
    old "...{w}I didn't respond, but he wouldn't break the silence before I did."
    new "……{w}我没有出声，而在我开口之前，他也不会打破沉默。"

    # game/script.rpy:14215
    old "Do you really expect me to believe that you're not going to run off with it? Come on, Sai. I get how you work at this point, more or less."
    new "你真以为我会相信你不会带着它跑掉？得了吧，Sai。你是什么路数，我多少也摸清了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14220
    old "What does that mean, exactly?"
    new "这话具体是什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:14221
    old "You just like seeing how things play out. You took the Sekimeiya and did something to end up here. I'm not Katei, and you know I'm trustworthy, so why are you trying to lie to me?"
    new "你就是喜欢看事情怎么发展。你拿了 Sekimeiya，做了点什么，才落到这里。我不是 Katei，你也清楚我信得过，那你为什么还要骗我？"

    # game/script.rpy:14226
    old "I'd never lie to you, Atsuki. You know that. We're partners. This brief time we've spent together has awoken my deepest feelings for you, in fact."
    new "我怎么会骗你呢，Atsuki。你清楚得很。我们是同伴。事实上，这短短一段相处，已经唤醒了我对你最深的感情。"

    # game/script.rpy:14227
    old "...Can you stop fucking with me just for the sake of it? I want this gem put back in the cabinet. That's all."
    new "……你能不能别没事就耍我？我只想把这颗宝石放回展示柜。就这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:14232
    old "I'd love to do that. I was just following your orders. You haven't told me to move since you brought me here, so I was waiting for your next command."
    new "我很乐意。我一直都在照你的吩咐做。你把我带到这里以后，就没再叫我动过，所以我一直在等你下一句吩咐。"

    # game/script.rpy:14233
    old "Put it back in the cabinet."
    new "放回展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:14236
    old "Did you not hear me?"
    new "你没听见吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:14237
    old "I heard you."
    new "听见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14242
    old "Oh, was that all? What cabinet? There are almost a hundred of them."
    new "哦，就这样？哪个展示柜？这里差不多有一百个。"

    # game/script.rpy:14243
    old "...The one in the event room."
    new "……活动室那个。"

    # game/script.rpy:14248
    old "That one, huh? Sure thing.{w} Give me a second, though. This is my self-reflection moment of the day."
    new "那个啊？行。{w}不过等我一下。这是我今天的自我反省时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:14251
    old "What the hell was with his face? His appearance was totally blank."
    new "他那张脸到底是怎么回事？整张脸一点表情都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:14256
    old "I stared at the floor for a while, thinking to myself while Sai let me be. He didn't seem to want to move, so I just observed him in silence."
    new "我盯着地板看了一会儿，Sai 没来打扰，让我自己待着。他似乎不打算动，我便静静地观察他。"

    # game/script.rpy:14257
    old "It wasn't like I wanted to get into a fight with him, but he clearly had a problem with me. He shifted his weight from one leg to the other in the few minutes we spent in silence, sighing slightly as well. I ran in circles mentally, getting nowhere fast in understanding what the hell was up with him or what had happened with the Sekimeiya."
    new "我并不是想跟他吵，但他显然对我有意见。沉默的那几分钟里，他不住地把重心从一条腿换到另一条腿，还轻轻叹了口气。我翻来覆去地想，却怎么也想不明白他到底是怎么回事，也弄不清 Sekimeiya 究竟发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:14262
    old "...{w}I should have already disappeared, assuming things happened as I remember them. Shiroya must be waiting. Follow me. Got it?"
    new "……{w}如果一切和我记得的一样，那我现在本该已经消失了。Shiroya 一定还在等。跟我来，明白吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:14267
    old "Sure. I gotta say, it's not the same without mint tea."
    new "好啊。不过说真的，没有薄荷茶就是差点意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:14274
    old "I walked to the hallway B room where we'd found the Sekimeiya."
    new "我走向 B走廊里我们找到 Sekimeiya 的那个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:14281
    old "It was empty."
    new "里面空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:14282
    old "...Sh-She's not here."
    new "……她、她不在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:14288
    old "Did your girlfriend abandon you? That's tragic."
    new "被女朋友抛弃了？真是悲剧。"

    # game/script.rpy:14292
    old "I stepped in farther, but I stopped right as I heard Sai taking off behind me."
    new "我又往里走了几步，却听见身后 Sai 撒腿就跑，当即停下脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:14299
    old "I turned around to chase after him. Fortunately, I'd reacted fast enough to grab him as he was opening the door to the event room."
    new "我转身追了上去。好在我反应够快，在他正要推开活动室的门时一把抓住了他。"

    # game/script.rpy:14300
    old "...What the fuck are you doing?"
    new "……你他妈在干什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:14305
    old "You're fast. I just got really antsy to see if the Sekimeiya was here. That's all."
    new "你跑得真快。我就是迫不及待想看看 Sekimeiya 在不在。仅此而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:14312
    old "You were totally running from me. And here, you can see that it's not."
    new "你分明就是在逃。这里你也看见了，它不在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:14317
    old "Yeah, it appears I'm holding it."
    new "是啊，看起来它在我手里。"

    # game/script.rpy:14318
    old "The sudden acceleration wore me out for a moment, so I breathed heavily for a few seconds. I had no idea what Sai was doing there, and it seemed Shiroya had gone somewhere as well."
    new "猛地一冲让我一时有些吃不消，喘了好几秒粗气。我完全不知道 Sai 为什么会在这儿，而 Shiroya 似乎也不见了踪影。"

    # game/script.rpy:14319
    old "Anyway, put it inside."
    new "总之，把它放回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:14324
    old "The Sekimeiya? Of course, that's what I was gonna do. Let me try not to touch it."
    new "Sekimeiya？当然了，我本来就打算这么做。我尽量不直接碰它。"

    # game/script.rpy:14326
    old "He unzipped his pack and hid his hand under his sleeve."
    new "他拉开背包拉链，把手缩进袖子里。"

    # game/script.rpy:14327
    old "Since keeping the Sekimeiya in the pack doesn't make me travel, it could be that it requires physical contact with your skin. I'll try to only touch it with my shirt."
    new "既然把 Sekimeiya 放进背包不会让我穿越，那可能就是需要皮肤直接接触。我试试只用衣服碰它。"

    # game/script.rpy:14331
    old "He held it in his hand, which was covered by cloth. He didn't disappear, so what he said made sense. Then, I scrolled open the glass for him, and he placed the Sekimeiya on top of the cushion. Finally, I closed the glass again."
    new "他用裹着布的手托着它，人没有消失，看来他说得没错。接着，我替他滑开玻璃罩，他把 Sekimeiya 放到软垫上。最后，我又把玻璃合上。"

    # game/script.rpy:14339
    old "I suppose I was correct."
    new "看来我说对了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14340
    old "Maybe, but touching it has done nothing a few times. It's possible it wouldn't have worked even if you'd touched it directly."
    new "也许吧，但之前有几次碰它都没反应。说不定就算你直接碰它，也不会起作用。"

    # game/script.rpy:14345
    old "Uh... I doubt it, actually. Feel this."
    new "呃……我倒是觉得不会。你摸摸这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:14346
    old "He touched my arm with his sleeve.{w} It was hot."
    new "他用袖子碰了碰我的手臂。{w}很烫。"

    # game/script.rpy:14351
    old "It wasn't hot at all when it was gray, but now it is—even the pack is. I bet something would happen if I touched it. That's probably why the refrigeration is needed."
    new "它还是灰色的时候一点也不烫，现在却烫了——连背包都是。我敢说，要是我碰它，肯定会出事。大概就是因为这个才需要冷藏。"

    # game/script.rpy:14352
    old "But that's strange. We took it out of the cabinet earlier and touched it while it was white, but it was still cold."
    new "可这就怪了。我们之前把它从展示柜里拿出来，在它还是白色的时候碰过，可它当时是凉的。"

    # game/script.rpy:14353
    old "Maybe something else is needed to activate it. Who knows?"
    new "也许还要别的条件才能激活它。谁知道呢。"

    # game/script.rpy:14354
    old "Whatever. What are you doing here? You should still be in the attic."
    new "算了。你为什么会在这里？你现在应该还在阁楼才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:14359
    old "And I am. Consider the me you're talking to right now as a ghost."
    new "我确实在那儿。你就把正在跟你说话的我看成幽灵吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:14362
    old "...Are you just fucking with me? You traveled to the past, just like I did."
    new "……你又在耍我？你跟我一样，穿越到了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:14363
    old "No way. Traveling to the past is impossible."
    new "怎么可能。回到过去根本不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:14364
    old "You're getting irritating. I admitted I traveled to the past, so just do the same."
    new "你越来越烦人了。我都承认自己穿越到过去了，你也承认不就行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14369
    old "Don't get me wrong, I would if I had. It's just that I haven't. I haven't traveled in time, teleported, or activated the Sekimeiya successfully even once."
    new "别误会，我要是真做过，自然会承认。问题是我没做过。时间穿越也好，传送也好，成功启动 Sekimeiya 也好，我一次都没做到过。"

    # game/script.rpy:14370
    old "That's bullshit. How can you be here, then? It's not possible."
    new "胡说。那你怎么会站在这里？这根本不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:14375
    old "You said I should be in the attic, right? Consider this: what if I touch the Sekimeiya in a bit to go back to the past, then go to the attic? I don't have to be the version that's already traveled. I can be the original."
    new "你说我本该待在阁楼里，对吧？那你不妨想想——要是我过一会儿去碰 Sekimeiya，回到过去，然后再去阁楼呢？在这里的不一定是已经穿越过的那个我，也可以是原本的我。"

    # game/script.rpy:14376
    old "...So, at some point, the Sai that was around us changed places with you?"
    new "……也就是说，某个时候，一直和我们在一起的 Sai，和你换了位置？"

    # game/script.rpy:14381
    old "Of course not. I was only letting you know that it's not impossible. I'm telling you, just treat me as a ghost you hallucinated. I can't be here, you know? I'm in the attic."
    new "当然不是。我只是想告诉你，那并非不可能。我说了，你就当我是你幻想出来的幽灵吧。我本来不可能在这儿，不是吗？我在阁楼里。"

    # game/script.rpy:14384
    old "Why are you being so stubborn? After Shiroya and I headed downstairs, you did too. Then you traveled to the past, and that's why you're here now."
    new "你为什么这么固执？我和 Shiroya 下楼之后，你也跟着下去了。然后你穿越回过去，所以现在才会出现在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:14385
    old "Except that won't happen. You might not believe me, but it's the truth."
    new "只可惜那不会发生。你也许不信，但这是实话。"

    # game/script.rpy:14386
    old "Then how can you be here?"
    new "那你怎么会在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:14391
    old "Are you sure I truly am? Am I not a figment of your imagination?"
    new "你确定我真的在这里？说不定我只是你凭空想出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:14392
    old "...You're not."
    new "……你不是。"

    # game/script.rpy:14393
    old "I suddenly thought of something I could corner him with."
    new "我忽然想到一个能逼他就范的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:14398
    old "I grabbed Sai's hand. It was definitely corporeal: he was no ghost. Without explaining, I dragged him to the security room."
    new "我抓住 Sai 的手。那触感实实在在的，他分明有躯体，绝不是什么幽灵。我二话不说，把他拽去了监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:14409
    old "Immediately, I noticed something odd."
    new "一进门，我就察觉到了异样。"

    # game/script.rpy:14410
    old "Sai, did you enter this room?"
    new "Sai，你进过这个房间吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:14415
    old "Didn't we all enter it at some point?"
    new "我们不是都进来过吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:14416
    old "...Did you enter it during the past forty minutes?"
    new "……最近四十分钟里，你进来过吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:14417
    old "No, I didn't."
    new "没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:14425
    old "That's strange, because the door wasn't completely shut. And look, the computer isn't suspended."
    new "那就怪了，门并没有完全关严。而且你看，电脑也没有进入休眠。"

    # game/script.rpy:14430
    old "And so what, I must've entered it?"
    new "那又怎样？难道就一定是我进来过？"

    # game/script.rpy:14435
    old "I walked forward to see the time displayed on the computer. It said it was {time=11:57.}"
    new "我走上前去看电脑上显示的时间。上面显示的是 {time=11:57.}"

    # game/script.rpy:14436
    old "I used this computer 47 minutes ago, at {time=11:10.} You determined that Katei wasn't in this room during the attack thanks to the sleep timer, so it must be more than 45 minutes."
    new "我四十七分钟前用过这台电脑，那时是 {time=11:10.}。你之前靠休眠计时推断出袭击发生时 Katei 不在这个房间里，所以间隔一定超过四十五分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:14441
    old "Yes, fifty minutes of inactivity are needed for the computer to power off the screens."
    new "没错，电脑要闲置五十分钟，屏幕才会断电。"

    # game/script.rpy:14442
    old "So if we wait these remaining three minutes, we'll be able to see if I was the last person to use the computer. If the screens stay on, someone else used it."
    new "所以只要再等三分钟，就能看出最后一个用电脑的人是不是我。如果屏幕一直亮着，那就是别人用过。"

    # game/script.rpy:14447
    old "Brilliant."
    new "真高明。"

    # game/script.rpy:14450
    old "Also, the last time this door should've been opened was earlier, when we searched through the entire floor. We made it a point to close every door when we were done for efficiency, so it would be harder for anyone hiding to move between rooms."
    new "另外，这扇门上一次被打开，应该还是早些时候我们搜遍整层楼的时候。当时我们说好，搜完一处就把每扇门都关上，这样藏起来的人想在房间之间移动就没那么容易了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14455
    old "Yeah, I saw the computer was powered on, which told me that someone had used it in the past hour. The others didn't pay much mind to it, and neither did you. After that, we closed the door."
    new "是啊，我看到电脑开着，就知道这一小时里有人用过。其他人没怎么在意，你也没有。之后我们把门关上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14456
    old "So you remember. Good.{w} Despite that, it was open a little bit just now. Someone must have come in here. This door isn't loose, and it won't open all by itself."
    new "看来你记得。很好。{w}可刚才那扇门却开了一条缝。一定是有人进来过。这扇门并不松，不会自己开的。"

    # game/script.rpy:14461
    old "Yes, and? Do you think it was me?"
    new "是，然后呢？你觉得是我？"

    # game/script.rpy:14462
    old "Well, I found you in hallway A, and you said you were searching for the Sekimeiya. Did you really not enter this room?"
    new "我在 A 走廊找到你的，你说自己在找 Sekimeiya。你真的没进过这个房间？"

    # game/script.rpy:14467
    old "I didn't. And even if I had, would you have anything to say?"
    new "没有。就算我进来过，你又能说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:14468
    old "I'm not sure yet. Let me tell you the reason I brought you here."
    new "我还没想清楚。先说说我带你来这里的理由吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:14469
    old "Show me your wristwatch."
    new "把你的手表给我看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:14470
    old "...My what?"
    new "……我的什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:14473
    old "It's hidden beneath your sleeve, but I saw you still have it. This is the only room that provides us with the current time, so show me what your own watch displays."
    new "你把它藏在袖子里，但我看见你还戴着。这里只有这个房间能告诉我们现在的时间，所以让我看看你自己的表显示的是几点。"

    # game/script.rpy:14482
    old "Because it might reveal your lie.{w} Let's say you traveled from {time=12:10.} It's possible the time displayed would now be something like {time=12:20.}"
    new "因为它也许能揭穿你的谎话。{w}假设你是从 {time=12:10.} 穿越过来的，那表上现在显示的时间很可能就是 {time=12:20.} 之类。"

    # game/script.rpy:14487
    old "I see. That would reveal that I've come from the future. It's a smart idea.{w} I even said earlier that my time matches the computer's, didn't I?"
    new "原来如此。那样就能看出我是从未来来的。这主意很聪明。{w}我先前还说过，我的时间和电脑上的一致，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:14488
    old "...You did.{w} If your time's ahead, you time traveled. If it's the same, it's possible that the body you appear with is identical to how it was at that point in time. That would help us confirm what happened with the second Naomi."
    new "……你确实说过。{w}如果你的时间超前，那你就是穿越了。如果时间相同，那也许你出现时的身体和那个时间点上的身体完全一致。这能帮我们弄清第二个 Naomi 身上发生的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:14489
    old "What if someone edited the computer's time? It'd be trivial."
    new "要是有人改过电脑的时间呢？那可不是什么难事。"

    # game/script.rpy:14490
    old "Well, if someone did that, it would've been you. The door was opened, and the screens are still lit. Although I did check the time fifty minutes ago, so I guess it couldn't have been modified recently. Technically, I guess you could have changed your wristwatch's time instead."
    new "要说有人动过手脚，那也只能是你。门被打开过，屏幕还亮着。不过五十分钟前我确认过时间，所以最近应该没被改过。严格来说，你倒是有可能改了自己手表的时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:14491
    old "I actually don't even know how to do that."
    new "我其实根本不会调。"

    # game/script.rpy:14498
    old "Just as he said that, the computer entered sleep mode."
    new "他话音刚落，电脑就进入了休眠。"

    # game/script.rpy:14499
    old "Oh...?"
    new "哦……？"

    # game/script.rpy:14504
    old "Well, unfortunately, there goes your little theory."
    new "可惜，你那套小推论泡汤了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14505
    old "So did someone enter this room and not use the computer? There's no way the door just opened."
    new "这么说，有人进了这个房间却没碰电脑？门总不可能自己打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:14510
    old "Who knows?"
    new "谁知道呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:14511
    old "Just show me your watch."
    new "少废话，把手表给我看。"

    # game/script.rpy:14512
    old "My what?"
    new "我的什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:14513
    old "Your watch."
    new "你的手表。"

    # game/script.rpy:14518
    old "But I'm watching you right now."
    new "可我现在就在看着你。"

    # game/script.rpy:14520
    old "He clearly had a problem with showing me the time, so I knew I was correct. I quickly positioned myself in front of the door so that he couldn't escape again."
    new "他明显不想让我看时间，我便知道自己没猜错。我立刻站到门前，挡住他的去路，免得他又溜走。"

    # game/script.rpy:14523
    old "If you don't want to, you can just admit that you traveled. It's not very hard to figure out."
    new "你要是不愿意，大可直接承认自己经历了时间穿越。这并不难猜出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:14524
    old "After he spent a few more seconds in silence, I decided to act first. I grabbed his arm and looked at the miniature screen on his wrist."
    new "他又沉默了几秒，我决定抢先行动。我抓住他的胳膊，看向他腕上的微型屏幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:14526
    old "...What?{w} Did you just do this?"
    new "……什么？{w}这是你刚才弄的？"

    # game/script.rpy:14531
    old "Huh? What's the time?"
    new "嗯？现在几点？"

    # game/script.rpy:14533
    old "Don't be stupid. {tip=9999}It's broken{/tip}."
    new "别装傻。{tip=9999}它坏了{/tip}。"

    # game/script.rpy:14538
    old "E-Excuse me?"
    new "你、你说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:14540
    old "The screen was blank. Nothing was being displayed on it."
    new "屏幕一片空白，上面什么也没有显示。"

    # game/script.rpy:14541
    old "Really...? When did it stop working?"
    new "真的……？它什么时候坏的？"

    # game/script.rpy:14542
    old "Are you just fucking with me again? Did you do this right now, somehow?"
    new "你他妈又在耍我？是不是刚才动了什么手脚？"

    # game/script.rpy:14547
    old "I didn't do anything. You were looking at me. I didn't even touch the watch."
    new "我什么都没做。你一直看着我，我连表都没碰。"

    # game/script.rpy:14548
    old "I couldn't object to that. Even though he'd been buying time, he hadn't touched it at all."
    new "这一点我无法反驳。他刚才虽然一直在拖延，却确实没有碰过表。"

    # game/script.rpy:14551
    old "You might have anticipated I was gonna ask this and disabled it as soon as we entered this room."
    new "你也许早就料到我会问，所以一进这房间就让它失灵了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14556
    old "It's flattering if you think I did that, but honestly, I have no idea what happened. I've had it for a long time, so perhaps the battery ran out. I don't even know how I'd \"disable\" it."
    new "你会这么想，倒是抬举我了。不过说实话，我也不知道发生了什么。这表我用了很久，大概是电池耗尽了吧。我甚至不知道该怎么让它「失灵」。"

    # game/script.rpy:14557
    old "Let me look at it."
    new "让我看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:14558
    old "I was already grabbing his arm, so I inspected the wristwatch a bit more. It had two buttons on its sides, probably to edit the time and other parameters."
    new "我本来就抓着他的胳膊，便顺势仔细端详起那块腕表。表侧有两个按钮，大概是用来调整时间和其他参数的。"

    # game/script.rpy:14559
    old "Can you remove it?"
    new "能把它摘下来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:14564
    old "Yes. I take it off every night."
    new "能。我每晚都会摘下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:14565
    old "...You've become pretty uncooperative. Just take it off."
    new "……你还真是越来越不配合了。摘下来吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:14570
    old "Are you confiscating it? You've taken a liking to this watch."
    new "你是要没收吗？看来你挺喜欢这块表的。"

    # game/script.rpy:14571
    old "While he continued speaking in his frivolous tone, he handed it to me. I'd gotten curious about what happened since Sai clearly didn't want to show me his watch at all."
    new "他仍用那副轻佻的语气说着，一边把表递给我。Sai 明明一点也不想让我看表，我反而更想知道究竟出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:14574
    old "How did you do it? I don't see a power button."
    new "你是怎么弄的？我没看见有电源键。"

    # game/script.rpy:14579
    old "I didn't do anything. It just so happened to run out of battery now."
    new "我什么都没做。只是碰巧在这个时候没电了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14580
    old "That'd be a little too convenient."
    new "那未免也太巧了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14581
    old "You can call it fate. Don't worry, though, I didn't have anything to hide in the first place."
    new "你就当是命运吧。不过别担心，我本来也没什么好隐瞒的。"

    # game/script.rpy:14583
    old "On the backside of the watch, there was a slot for the battery. It took some effort, but I opened it to see a single lithium battery."
    new "表背有一个电池槽。我费了点劲才把它打开，里面装着一枚锂电池。"

    # game/script.rpy:14584
    old "How long have you had it for?"
    new "这表你用了多久？"

    # game/script.rpy:14585
    old "A few years."
    new "几年吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:14586
    old "How many, approximately?"
    new "大概几年？"

    # game/script.rpy:14591
    old "Seven or eight."
    new "七八年。"

    # game/script.rpy:14592
    old "Maybe it would have run out now, but I'm not sure. Lithium batteries are more expensive, but they last a very long time. They outlast plenty of devices."
    new "也许到现在确实该没电了，但我不确定。锂电池虽然贵些，却很耐用，寿命比许多设备都长。"

    # game/script.rpy:14596
    old "Hey, you're pretty good. In that case, maybe the watch itself broke."
    new "嘿，你懂得还挺多。那样的话，说不定是表本身坏了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14597
    old "It looks perfectly fine to me."
    new "我看它一点问题都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:14598
    old "Unfortunate, then. I'm curious about what happened too, but it might be a bigger mystery than we thought."
    new "那就可惜了。我也很好奇到底怎么回事，不过也许比我们想的还要蹊跷。"

    # game/script.rpy:14599
    old "You're ridiculous. You know exactly what you did to avoid being exposed."
    new "你可真会装。为了不被拆穿，你动了什么手脚，自己心里清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:14604
    old "I think you're the one being silly here. First, I didn't have anything to hide, and second, I did nothing to this watch. I take good care of it, so I wouldn't break it on a whim."
    new "我看胡闹的人是你。第一，我没什么可隐瞒的；第二，我没对这块表做过任何事。我一直很爱惜它，不会无缘无故弄坏。"

    # game/script.rpy:14605
    old "...{w}You know, remember upstairs, in the attic?{w} I looked through a few drawers and found a bunch of useless junk. I believe I might've seen a compatible battery somewhere."
    new "……{w}说起来，你还记得楼上的阁楼吗？{w}我翻过几个抽屉，里面全是没用的杂物。我好像在哪见过能配上的电池。"

    # game/script.rpy:14611
    old "...And you were talking about conveniences. You're pretty insistent."
    new "……亏你刚才还说太巧了。你还真是穷追不舍。"

    # game/script.rpy:14612
    old "I want to know what happened. It's not uncommon to have a couple batteries like this lying around. It's also true that I didn't see you mess with the watch, and since it's not damaged, the most likely explanation is a faulty battery or that it actually was time for it to run out. Let's see if we can power this back on."
    new "我想知道到底发生了什么。家里随手放着几节这种电池也不稀奇。而且我确实没看见你碰表；既然表没有损坏，最有可能的就是电池出了问题，或者它真的到了该没电的时候。我们试试能不能让它重新开机。"

    # game/script.rpy:14615
    old "This watch doesn't receive the time from a satellite. You sounded pretty convincing earlier when you said that you didn't know how to edit the time. Maybe you just didn't foresee this at all and the battery actually stopped working.{w} If the battery ran out when the displayed time was, say, {time=12:10}, it could pick up from there when we put in a new one—watches like that exist. Also, this watch was working just earlier, when you said it was {time=11:36.} Let's see what happens when we insert a new battery."
    new "这块表不是靠卫星对时的。你刚才说自己不会调时间，听起来倒挺像那么回事。也许你根本没料到这一步，电池是真的耗尽了。{w}如果电池耗尽时，表上显示的是 {time=12:10} 这样的时间，那换上新电池后，它可能会从那里继续走——市面上确实有这种表。而且，刚才你说时间是 {time=11:36.} 的时候，这块表还在正常走着。我们换上电池，看看会怎么样。"

    # game/script.rpy:14620
    old "Are you being serious...? We can't go to the attic."
    new "你是认真的……？我们可不能去阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:14621
    old "I bet I know why. You're up there and we'd see your past self. Additionally, you don't remember anyone going up.{w} Where did you stay? We could just avoid anyone else."
    new "我大概知道原因。你就在上面，我们一上去就会遇见过去的你。再说，你也不记得有人上去过。{w}你当时待在哪里？我们避开其他人就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:14626
    old "You're getting annoying. I don't know what the people above us are doing."
    new "你越来越烦人了。我不知道楼上那些人现在在做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:14627
    old "Let's go, then."
    new "那就走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:14632
    old "Where did you see the battery?"
    new "你在哪儿看见的电池？"

    # game/script.rpy:14633
    old "In the living room, under the television."
    new "客厅，电视机下面。"

    # game/script.rpy:14638
    old "...Hm, okay. Let's be quick."
    new "……嗯，好吧。动作快点。"

    # game/script.rpy:14639
    old "That works."
    new "也行。"

    # game/script.rpy:14646
    old "I made sure to keep my grip on Sai's sleeve so that he couldn't escape. I hadn't disregarded Shiroya, so before moving up, I looked through hallway B and still found no trace of her."
    new "我牢牢攥着 Sai 的袖子，免得他跑掉。我也没把 Shiroya 忘在一边，上楼之前先看了一遍 B走廊，仍旧不见她的踪影。"

    # game/script.rpy:14647
    old "...I started to get a bit worried. She wouldn't have gone off anywhere."
    new "……我开始有些担心了。她总不至于自己跑到别处去。"

    # game/script.rpy:14648
    old "I'd entered the room soon after we'd left, and she no longer seemed to be on the crystal floor... She couldn't have been attacked, could she? We would've heard a yell, and there hadn't been that much time for anything to happen."
    new "我们离开没多久，我就进过那间房，那时她似乎已经不在水晶层了……总不会是被袭击了吧？真出了事，我们该听见喊声，而且那么短的时间也来不及发生什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:14652
    old "By going to the attic, I could also check whether she was on the higher floors. For that reason and because the elevator was still supposed to be disabled, we took the stairs up."
    new "去阁楼的话，也能顺便确认她在不在上面的楼层。出于这个考虑，加上电梯据说还没恢复，我们便走了楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:14660
    old "We circled through every floor without finding her.{w} The attic was unlocked, so we went up the last, narrow staircase and entered the living room."
    new "我们把每一层都转了一遍，还是没有找到她。{w}阁楼没有上锁，我们便沿最后那段窄楼梯上去，走进了客厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:14665
    old "The floor showed we'd surpassed the time we'd gone down—I could see Shiroya's and my own footprints heading out. I looked at them for a few seconds, but it was difficult to determine if anyone had left after us."
    new "地面的痕迹显示，时间已经超过我们下楼的时候——我能看见自己和 Shiroya 往外走的脚印。我盯着看了几秒，却很难判断之后有没有人离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:14666
    old "It should be here."
    new "应该就在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:14670
    old "I kneeled down and opened a drawer. I had to let go of Sai's hand, but he didn't run away. He at least seemed to be genuinely confused about what happened to his wristwatch."
    new "我蹲下身拉开抽屉，不得不松开 Sai 的手，但他没有跑。至少对于他的手表出了什么事，他看上去是真的摸不着头脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:14672
    old "Yeah, here it is."
    new "嗯，就在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:14677
    old "All right. Let's leave."
    new "好。走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:14678
    old "If he wanted to leave, the most likely reason was that he'd lived through that time already and knew the people who were still in the bedrooms wouldn't notice us. If that was the case, there was no point in defying what he'd experienced."
    new "他想走的话，最可能是因为他已经经历过那段时间，知道还留在卧室里的人不会注意到我们。若是这样，硬要违逆他亲历过的事也没有意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:14683
    old "Both of us stepped out of the living room. Before moving down, I looked at the floor one last time, making a mental note of the arrangement of footprints for later."
    new "我们两人走出起居室。下楼之前，我又最后看了一眼地面，把脚印的分布默默记在心里，留待之后对照。"

    # game/script.rpy:14695
    old "Will it work?"
    new "能用吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:14696
    old "Yes, I think so. It should be compatible with your watch."
    new "能吧。应该能配你的手表。"

    # game/script.rpy:14700
    old "It was still inside its original package, so it hadn't been used at all. It took me a couple of minutes to get it out with no tools, and as soon as I succeeded, it became clear that it would easily fit. It looked the same as the one that was already inside the wristwatch."
    new "它还装在原包装里，一次都没用过。手边没有工具，我花了几分钟才弄开，取出来一看就知道尺寸正合适，和手表里原来那颗一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:14704
    old "I uncovered the battery slot again and removed the original battery. I headed to the first partition and left it in a drawer since I didn't have a proper place to dispose of it."
    new "我再次打开电池槽，取出原来的电池。这里没有合适的地方丢弃，我便走到第一个隔间，把它留在了抽屉里。"

    # game/script.rpy:14705
    old "After that, I put the new one in place. It was small, so it took me a bit, but it fit perfectly. Finished, I put the cover back on and left the packaging in the same drawer."
    new "之后我装上新的那颗。电池很小，费了些工夫，但装得严丝合缝。弄完后我盖回表盖，把包装也留在了同一个抽屉里。"

    # game/script.rpy:14710
    old "...Anything?"
    new "……怎么样？"

    # game/script.rpy:14711
    old "I turned the watch around and immediately saw that something had changed."
    new "我把手表转过来，立刻看出有哪里变了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14712
    old "It did, but I was wrong."
    new "确实变了，不过是我猜错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14717
    old "...I told you. I wasn't hiding anything."
    new "……我说过了，我什么都没藏。"

    # game/script.rpy:14718
    old "That's not quite what I meant. Look."
    new "我不是那个意思。你看。"

    # game/script.rpy:14723
    old "I showed him what the screen displayed."
    new "我把屏幕上的内容给他看。"

    # game/script.rpy:14724
    old "The four digits displaying the time showed a \"--:--\", which most likely indicated that no time had been set.{w} I would have assumed that the battery removal reset the internal system if not for what was above the time."
    new "显示时间的四个数字变成了“--:--”，多半表示还没有设定时间。{w}要不是时间上方还显示着别的，我本会以为拆电池把内部系统重置了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14725
    old "That's strange... It might've been like this when I first got the watch."
    new "奇怪……我刚拿到手表的时候，说不定就是这个样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:14726
    old "This should be displaying the current date, right?"
    new "这里显示的本该是当前日期，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:14728
    old "...It wasn't."
    new "……并不是。"

    # game/script.rpy:14732
    old "The date, above the time, showed \"9999-12-31\"."
    new "时间上方，日期显示为“9999-12-31”。"

    # game/script.rpy:14733
    old "...I suppose there was no point to my plan, then. I don't know if you purposely arranged this, but something definitely happened to this watch."
    new "……看来我这个计划是白费了。我不知道这是不是你刻意安排的，但这块手表肯定出过什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:14738
    old "It still works, though. The battery had to be the problem. Give it to me."
    new "不过它还能用。问题肯定出在电池上。给我吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:14739
    old "I handed it over, and he began to fiddle with the buttons."
    new "我把它递了过去，他便开始拨弄起按钮。"

    # game/script.rpy:14740
    old "I see, I can easily set the time with these."
    new "原来如此，用这些按钮很容易就能调时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:14741
    old "The time began displaying numbers, and Sai set it to {time=4:00.}"
    new "时间重新显示出数字，Sai 把它调成了 {time=4:00.}"

    # game/script.rpy:14742
    old "I really don't get what happened, but I'm glad I won't have to get rid of it. I'll make sure to thank Ashiya for the new battery too."
    new "我还是搞不懂到底怎么回事，不过不用把它丢掉就好。新电池的事，也得好好谢谢芦屋。"

    # game/script.rpy:14746
    old "I wanted to object again, but I couldn't find the words. I didn't know anymore if Sai was aware of what had happened."
    new "我还想再反驳，却找不到话说。我已经不知道 Sai 到底清不清楚发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:14747
    old "You traveled to the past, right?"
    new "你是穿越到过去的，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:14752
    old "Me?"
    new "我？"

    # game/script.rpy:14753
    old "Let's say you appeared in hallway A. I'll even believe what you said: you realized the Sekimeiya was gone and failed to notice it was in your hip pack."
    new "就假设你出现在 A 走廊。你说的那些我也愿意相信：你发现 Sekimeiya 不见了，却没注意到它就在你的腰包里。"

    # game/script.rpy:14754
    old "You have a watch, so you would've looked at it to find out how far back you went.{w} Did you do that?"
    new "你带着手表，肯定会看一眼，好知道自己回到了多久以前。{w}你看了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:14759
    old "...{w}I didn't.{w} However, I didn't travel to the past either, so your question is pretty pointless."
    new "……{w}没有。{w}不过我根本没穿越到过去，你这个问题毫无意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:14761
    old "The date was the odd point. Swapping the batteries shouldn't have changed it to \"9999-12-31\", and it was unlikely Sai edited it. Needless to say, it was the highest date the format of the watch would allow."
    new "蹊跷的是日期。只换电池，不该把它变成“9999-12-31”，也不像是 Sai 改的。不用说，那是手表格式所能显示的最大日期。"

    # game/script.rpy:14766
    old "Anyway, let's go back down."
    new "总之，先下去吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:14767
    old "To the crystal floor?"
    new "去水晶层？"

    # game/script.rpy:14768
    old "Yes. I have something to do."
    new "对。我有点事要办。"

    # game/script.rpy:14769
    old "...All right."
    new "……好吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:14775
    old "We started moving down. I didn't know what Sai planned to do, but I still had to find Shiroya, who most likely was somewhere below us."
    new "我们开始下楼。我不知道 Sai 打算做什么，但我还得找到 Shiroya——她多半就在下面某处。"

    # game/script.rpy:14778
    old "Shiroya's not currently in the attic, right?"
    new "Shiroya 现在不在阁楼里，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:14779
    old "Who's that?"
    new "谁啊？"

    # game/script.rpy:14781
    old "I let it go before he got on my nerves."
    new "我赶在他惹我心烦之前，不再追问了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14787
    old "We silently walked all the way down. At first glance, the floor still appeared desolate."
    new "我们一言不发地一路往下走。乍看之下，这层楼依旧一片荒凉。"

    # game/script.rpy:14790
    old "What did you want to do?"
    new "你本来打算做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:14796
    old "Oh, let's go to the security room."
    new "啊，去监控室吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:14799
    old "Through hallway A, we began walking toward it. His pace was slow, and I'd been in front of him the whole time."
    new "我们穿过A走廊，朝那里走去。他脚步很慢，我一路都走在他前头。"

    # game/script.rpy:14803
    old "Once I was about to reach the doorknob, I heard a sound behind me."
    new "我正要伸手去够门把，身后传来一声响动。"

    # game/script.rpy:14811
    old "I saw an empty hallway as I heard the event room closing."
    new "我听见活动室的门合上，走廊里空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:14815
    old "Upon realizing I'd lowered my guard, I sprinted as fast as I could."
    new "我这才意识到自己松懈了，立刻拔腿狂奔。"

    # game/script.rpy:14820
    old "I entered the event room, but it was empty. By the time I opened the door to hallway B, I'd lost him."
    new "我进了活动室，里面空无一人。等我推开通往B走廊的门，已经不见他的踪影。"

    # game/script.rpy:14828
    old "Every door around me was closed except the lobby's. I didn't know where he'd gone, but as soon as I picked the wrong path, Sai would escape."
    new "四周的门都关着，只有通往大堂的那扇开着。我不知道他去了哪里，可只要我选错方向，Sai 就会溜掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:14832
    old "Running toward hallway C meant facing the task of searching through every floor, and going to the lobby meant that he could already have been in hallway A. Instead, I opened a bunch of doors in hallway B hoping he'd taken shelter in one of them, as I couldn't hear the distant sound of running footsteps."
    new "往C走廊追，意味着要把每一层都搜一遍；去大堂，又可能他早已绕进A走廊。我索性在B走廊一连推开几扇门，指望他躲进了其中一间——毕竟远处并没有传来奔跑的脚步声。"

    # game/script.rpy:14839
    old "They were all empty, and I didn't bother searching too deeply into them.{w} I understood what Sai's business on that floor was. He needed us to go there to have a chance at escaping—he had no way of dodging me on the upper floors."
    new "里面全是空的，我也没心思一间间细查。{w}我明白 Sai 为什么要在这层动手脚了：他需要我们来到这一层，才有机会脱身——在楼上，他根本甩不开我。"

    # game/script.rpy:14840
    old "I sighed. Perhaps I should've expected it, but I didn't blame myself too much. I'd lost Sai, and he'd accomplished his goal of ditching me. Just in case, I went to the security room, where he said he wanted to go."
    new "我叹了口气。或许我早该料到，不过也没太责怪自己。Sai 从我手里溜了，他成功甩掉了我。为防万一，我还是去了他说想去的监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:14847
    old "It was empty, and the computer remained suspended. In a corner, I saw the suitcase that Katei had brought there from hallway C."
    new "里面空无一人，电脑仍停在休眠状态。角落里放着 Katei 从C走廊搬来的那只手提箱。"

    # game/script.rpy:14848
    old "What was Sai's deal, exactly? Maybe I'd have a better idea once I returned to the attic, but I still needed to find Shiroya."
    new "Sai 到底在打什么主意？也许回到阁楼后能想明白些，但当务之急还是找到 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:14857
    old "I went to look at the computer's time, which read {time=12:18.}{w} I sat on the chair and sighed in exasperation for a few seconds. There were plenty of things to think about, but instead my mind went to something that continued to gnaw at me."
    new "我去看了一眼电脑上的时间，上面显示 {time=12:18.}{w} 我在椅子上坐下，懊恼地叹了好一会儿气。该想的事多得是，我的思绪却偏偏飘向那件一直耿耿于怀的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:14867
    old "Sai's watch. More specifically, the date \"9999-12-31\"."
    new "Sai 的手表。更确切地说，是上面那个日期——「9999-12-31」。"

    # game/script.rpy:14868
    old "When I found Sai, he should've been in the attic. This means that it's very possible he traveled through time in some capacity, even though he kept denying it. If he did, his watch would've done the same."
    new "我找到 Sai 的时候，他本该待在阁楼里。也就是说，他很可能以某种方式穿越了时间，尽管他一直否认。若果真如此，他的手表也该一同穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:14869
    old "\"9999-12-31\" hints at that even further.{w} It's the highest date the watch could display, so it could be linked to another common concept related to time travel: loops."
    new "「9999-12-31」更是加深了这个猜想。{w}那是手表能显示的最大日期，因此可能与时间穿越的另一常见概念有关——循环。"

    # game/script.rpy:14870
    old "Looping through time—reliving the same portion of time over and over. I'm jumping to this thought not only because of the date, but also because the battery ran out before the time it was supposed to."
    new "在时间里循环——反复重历同一段时间。我之所以会想到这个，不仅因为那个日期，也因为电池在预计耗尽之前就没了电。"

    # game/script.rpy:14873
    old "For example, if the watch is in the process of traveling from {time=12:20} to the past, until it reaches the travel point, the time displayed would increase per travel. If that's repeated infinite times, the date would eventually hit its maximum value and stay there."
    new "举例来说，如果手表正从 {time=12:20} 向过去穿越，那么在抵达穿越点之前，每穿越一次，显示的时间就会增长。如此重复无数次，日期终会达到最大值，并停在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:14874
    old "If the watch had repeated that process infinitely when I saw it, the date could make a bit of sense. Similarly, every few years, the battery would run out, so replacing it would allow the time to continue advancing."
    new "如果我看到手表时，它已经将这一过程重复了无数次，那这个日期就勉强说得通了。同理，每隔几年电池就会耗尽，换上新的，时间便能继续向前。"

    # game/script.rpy:14875
    old "So, assuming something of the sort is what happened, is it a coincidence that I just so happened to experience the loop in which the battery had to be replaced?{w} There would be times in which the watch would appear functional and ones in which the date wouldn't have reached the year 9,999 yet. All of those would have to reach the same loop point, which contradicts the way I thought this worked, because traveling to the past would end up modifying it in different manners."
    new "那么，假设事情正是如此，我恰好碰上需要更换电池的那一轮循环，难道只是巧合？{w}有时手表看上去还正常，有时日期尚未走到9999年。这些情况最终都得汇入同一个循环点，这与我设想的运作方式相矛盾——毕竟穿越回过去，会以各不相同的方式改变它。"

    # game/script.rpy:14876
    old "But I suppose it's pointless to think about this because a bunch of other contradictions prevent anything like that from ever happening."
    new "不过再想下去也是徒劳，因为还有一堆矛盾之处，让这种事根本不可能发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:14879
    old "To begin with, if the wristwatch had traveled back insane amounts of times, it would have physically degraded. If it had survived at least the 8,000 years needed to reach 9,999, the metal would've appeared rusty, and it's hard to believe it wouldn't have just disintegrated instantly."
    new "首先，这只腕表若穿越了难以计数的次数，早就该出现物理上的损耗。它至少要撑过八千年才能走到9999年，金属理该锈迹斑斑，很难相信它不会瞬间崩解。"

    # game/script.rpy:14880
    old "Also, Sai had to be the one to bring it back through time, so he'd be older, and he couldn't have existed for the same number of years without dying. This would be circumvented if going to the past replicated your past body, but then the watch's date and time would reset after every travel too."
    new "再者，把手表带回过去的人必须是 Sai，那他就得一同变老，不可能活过那么多年还不死。若穿越回过去会复制你过去的身体，这一点倒能绕开，可那样一来，手表上的日期和时间每穿越一次也该重置。"

    # game/script.rpy:14881
    old "This is not how the Sekimeiya works. If you travel thirty minutes to the past, during those thirty minutes, two versions of you exist at the same time. If Sai went back with his watch that many times, he would have created a new copy of himself each travel."
    new "Sekimeiya 并不是这样运作的。你若穿越回三十分钟前，那三十分钟里就会同时存在两个你。Sai 若带着手表回去过那么多次，每一次都会造出一个新的自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:14882
    old "That isn't all. Naturally, I'm thinking about this to justify the watch's date, but there's no apparent reason why Sai would travel back to the same spot more than once.{w} And if he somehow could circumvent aging, it'd mean that after the point he traveled from, he couldn't exist anymore; if there is a point in time in which he always travels back, he could never make it past that point. Despite that, I'm sure that if I go to the attic right now, I'll see him."
    new "还不止这些。我这样推想，自然是为了解释手表上的日期，可 Sai 根本没有理由一次又一次回到同一个时间点。{w}而就算他有办法绕开衰老，那也意味着他从某个时间点穿越离开后，在那之后便无法继续存在；倘若存在一个他总会穿越回去的时刻，他就永远越不过那一刻。尽管如此，我确信此刻回到阁楼，仍能见到他。"

    # game/script.rpy:14886
    old "The origin of the Sai I was talking to a few minutes ago should give me some insight, but I'm not sure how much, because he himself seemed unaware of what happened to his watch."
    new "几分钟前和我说话的那个 Sai，他的来历应该能提供些线索，但能有多少，我也说不准——毕竟连他自己似乎都不知道手表出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:14887
    old "Did the date go up to the year 9,999 for no reason? Was it a malfunction, maybe? Tied with the battery's loss of power, it seems like a bit of a stretch to treat it as one."
    new "日期会无缘无故跳到9999年吗？也许只是故障？可若再把电池耗尽一并算上，单以故障解释，未免牵强。"

    # game/script.rpy:14888
    old "The facts are as follows: Sai probably only traveled once because countless versions of himself didn't exist at the same time. The watch can't be in a regular time loop because the Sekimeiya doesn't work like that and because the watch would physically degrade before reaching the year 9,999.{w} And yet the date reached its highest possible value. I really feel that something of significance might be the cause behind it..."
    new "事实如下：Sai 大概只穿越过一次，因为并不存在无数个同时并存的他自己。手表也不可能处在寻常的时间循环里，一来 Sekimeiya 不是那样运作的，二来手表在抵达9999年之前就会先一步损耗殆尽。{w}可日期偏偏走到了它的最大值。我总觉得，背后或许有什么要紧的东西在作祟……"

    # game/script.rpy:14889
    old "One last important thing I can take from this is that if the watch's status was caused by Sai traveling to the past, adding that he was surprised to see it disabled and that it was working at {time=11:36}, it's possible that he hadn't yet traveled by that time."
    new "最后还有一点值得留意：倘若手表的状态是 Sai 穿越回过去造成的，再考虑到他看见手表停摆时的惊讶，以及 {time=11:36} 时它还正常运转，那么他到那个时刻为止，或许还没有穿越过。"

    # game/script.rpy:14894
    old "I also had to keep in mind that Sai had some good reason to escape from me and that he was in the middle of doing something when I found him. The battery's power running out also felt like it was pretty important, but I couldn't reach any conclusion regarding that."
    new "我也不能忘记，Sai 甩开我一定有他的理由，而且我找到他时，他正做某件事，还没做完。电池耗尽这件事似乎也颇为关键，可我对此得不出任何结论。"

    # game/script.rpy:14895
    old "I shifted my focus. I had to find Shiroya, but I'd already looked through the crystal floor twice."
    new "我收回思绪。我得找到 Shiroya，可水晶层我已经找过两遍了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14896
    old "Being in front of the computer made me think of the cameras. It was possible the system had restored, so I tried to see if I could do something with it and find out where Shiroya and Sai were."
    new "坐在电脑前，我想起了监控摄像头。系统说不定已经恢复，于是我试着看看能否操作它，查明 Shiroya 和 Sai 的下落。"

    # game/script.rpy:14897
    old "I clicked on the program with a security camera icon. The text \"logged in as Katei Kuiji\" was still on the bottom. When I noticed it, I wondered if Katei intentionally left his account logged in to use the excuse that anyone could've used it."
    new "我点开了那个带监控摄像头图标的程序。底部的「以 Katei Kuiji 身份登录」字样还在。看到这行字，我不禁猜想，Katei 是不是故意让账号保持登录，好在必要时推说谁都能使用它。"

    # game/script.rpy:14898
    old "Next, I pressed \"Initialize Camera Monitoring\", but as before, I was met with a message box containing the \"Couldn't detect video footage\" text. Trying to look at the archived footage yielded no result either.{w} In the lower right corner was a button that read \"Power system off\", but it was grayed out."
    new "接着我按下「初始化摄像头监控」，可和之前一样，弹出的仍是一个写着「未检测到视频画面」的提示框。想查看存档录像同样毫无结果。{w}右下角有个「电源系统关闭」的按钮，却是灰色的，无法点击。"

    # game/script.rpy:14901
    old "It was a messy and hard to follow interface, so the only thing I recognized was a symbol of a wrench that was probably the settings menu."
    new "界面杂乱难懂，我只认出那个扳手图标，大概就是设置菜单。"

    # game/script.rpy:14902
    old "When I clicked on it, a panel with several options appeared. One in particular caught my eye: \"Footage\"."
    new "点开之后，弹出一个列着若干选项的面板。其中一项格外醒目：「录像」。"

    # game/script.rpy:14903
    old "A new screen appeared after selecting it, showing the path where the recordings could be found. The set path was \"B:\\Archived\", which sounded simple enough."
    new "选中后跳出新的界面，显示录像的存放路径。设定的是「B:\\Archived」，听上去倒简单明了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14904
    old "In case the program was the cause of the issue, I went ahead and looked for that specific folder. \"B:\\\" indicated that it wasn't saved on the main drive."
    new "为了排除程序本身的问题，我去找了一下那个文件夹。「B:\\」说明它并不存放在主硬盘上。"

    # game/script.rpy:14905
    old "I searched for it, but I couldn't find it. No extra drive appeared to exist whatsoever, so it made sense that the footage wasn't being detected."
    new "我找了一遍，却没有找到。根本不存在什么额外的硬盘，录像检测不到也就说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14907
    old "I kept looking, but to no avail. I performed a thorough search for the word \"Archived\", but none of the results interested me. The time had been passing fast, and I didn't want to waste any more of it. The computer displayed {time=12:31.}"
    new "我继续翻找，依旧一无所获。我把「Archived」这个词彻底搜了一遍，可搜出来的结果没有一条让我感兴趣。时间过得飞快，我不想再浪费下去。电脑上显示的时间是 {time=12:31.}"

    # game/script.rpy:14908
    old "I stood up from the chair. I had to search through the entire floor, but going to the attic for aid was potentially a better choice. Although I didn't think Shiroya would go hide, searching alone was never ideal."
    new "我从椅子上起身。整层楼都得搜一遍，但回阁楼求助或许是更好的选择。我虽然不认为 Shiroya 会躲起来，可独自搜寻终究不是办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:14916
    old "Once I left the room, I was once again met with the cold silence of a barren floor. The door closing behind me didn't echo as well as it should've because the smoke cover on the ceiling didn't allow the sound to bounce back properly."
    new "我一走出房间，空旷楼层那冰冷的寂静又一次迎面而来。身后的门关上时没有发出应有的回声，因为天花板上的隔烟层让声音无法正常反射。"

    # game/script.rpy:14917
    old "Despite that, I still noticed the sound of someone approaching from hallway C."
    new "尽管如此，我还是听见有人从C走廊走来。"

    # game/script.rpy:14928
    old "It was Shiroya. As soon as she saw me, she sped up with a concerned look. As if I were her reflection, I reacted the same way."
    new "是 Shiroya。她一看见我，便带着忧色加快了脚步。我像照镜子一样，也做出了同样的反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:14929
    old "Where were you...!? Are you okay?"
    new "你跑到哪儿去了……！？没事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:14930
    old "Y-Yeah, I'm fine... I've been on this floor, for the most part. I was searching for you."
    new "嗯、嗯，我没事……我基本一直待在这层。刚才在找你。"

    # game/script.rpy:14935
    old "I went to the room where you said you'd return to, but you weren't there..."
    new "我去了你说会回来的那个房间，可你不在……"

    # game/script.rpy:14936
    old "You went there? You just had to wait."
    new "你去了？明明只要等着就好。"

    # game/script.rpy:14941
    old "No... Right as you touched the Sekimeiya, I disappeared too."
    new "不是……就在你碰到 Sekimeiya 的那一刻，我也消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14942
    old "...{w}Those words came as a surprise, so I forced my breathing to remain normal."
    new "……{w}这话出乎我的意料，我竭力让呼吸保持平稳。"

    # game/script.rpy:14943
    old "You traveled too? At the same time...?{w} Why did I never see you, then?"
    new "你也穿越了？同一时间……？{w}那为什么我一直没见到你？"

    # game/script.rpy:14948
    old "Well... Just as you touched it, I appeared on the second floor, inside the offices. It was disorienting, like I changed places instantly. That's what happened to you too, right? I thought your travel might've somehow taken me along with you."
    new "这个……就在你碰到它的瞬间，我出现在了二楼的办公室。那种感觉让人晕头转向，就像瞬间换了个地方。你也是这样吧？我还以为是你穿越时，把我也一起带上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14953
    old "I couldn't believe it was real... Talking about it and having it happen are two totally different things. Where did it send you?"
    new "我实在不敢相信那是真的……听说和亲身经历完全是两回事。它把你送到了哪里？"

    # game/script.rpy:14956
    old "I appeared in the security room. Do you know how far back you went?"
    new "我出现在了监控室。你知道自己回到了多久以前吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:14957
    old "I think so. I spent a few minutes sitting down since I could barely understand what happened... Then I went to the attic to confirm I'd really traveled back in time. When I saw that the door was still locked, I figured it had really happened."
    new "应该是吧。我当时几乎没弄明白发生了什么，坐着缓了几分钟……然后去了阁楼，想确认自己是不是真的回到了过去。看到门还锁着，我才确定这一切真的发生了。"

    # game/script.rpy:14962
    old "Eventually, I started to go back down until I heard sounds approaching me from below that made me hide on the fourth floor. It was a group of people, so I thought it was us when we first entered the attic."
    new "后来我往下走，听到下面有动静朝我这边来，只好躲到四楼。来的是好几个人，我还以为是我们最初进阁楼时的那群人。"

    # game/script.rpy:14964
    old "I figured I could go to the crystal floor to look at the time. I looked at the computer and estimated I'd gone back about forty minutes."
    new "我想可以去水晶层看看时间。我看了电脑，估计自己回到了大约四十分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:14965
    old "So you opened the door to the security room... We both traveled the same amount of time, then.{w} I-I see... I was in the cleaning room when you came down, so we didn't see each other."
    new "所以监控室的门是你打开的……那我们俩穿越的时间一样。{w}我、我明白了……你下来的时候我在清洁间，所以我们才没碰面。"

    # game/script.rpy:14971
    old "Hm...{w} The others returned and then went up again. I knew they were going to the attic, so I followed them to see if everything was actually repeating.{w} I didn't go up immediately, so when I got there, Sai and Katei were already in the bedroom. I entered and listened from the hallway, and they were saying the same things as before."
    new "嗯……{w}其他人回来后，又上去了。我知道他们要去阁楼，就跟上去看看一切是不是真的在重演。{w}我没有立刻上去，所以等我到的时候，Sai 和 Katei 已经在卧室里了。我进了阁楼，在走廊里听着，他们说的和之前一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:14976
    old "I was so scared of being seen, Atsuki. If the past changes, do things just... unravel?"
    new "我好怕被人看见，Atsuki。要是过去被改变，事情会不会就……彻底崩坏？"

    # game/script.rpy:14977
    old "I have no idea. Nobody noticed me this entire time, so it was all consistent with the past that we know. I think nothing changed. Everything I experienced with people from the past was just me observing them without them knowing I was there, so nothing deviated. I even tried to change the past by saving the second Naomi, but it was useless."
    new "我完全不知道。这段时间一直没人注意到我，所以一切都和我们所知的过去吻合。我想什么都没改变。我和过去那些人的接触，都只是我在旁边看着他们，而他们不知道我在场，所以没有任何偏离。我甚至试过救下第二个 Naomi 来改变过去，但毫无用处。"

    # game/script.rpy:14980
    old "Anyway, Sai and Katei really didn't leave the attic, did they...?"
    new "总之，Sai 和 Katei 真的没有离开阁楼，对吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:14985
    old "I don't think so, no. I knew we'd be going down in a bit, so I hid in the floor 6 offices. I stayed there for a while so Akaro didn't see me as he went up. Then I came here to meet with you, but you weren't in the room."
    new "我想是没有。我知道我们过一会儿就要下楼，就躲进了六楼的办公室。我在那里待了一阵，免得 Akaro 上楼时看见我。之后我来这里找你，可你不在房间里。"

    # game/script.rpy:14986
    old "I wasn't...? I suppose I might've spent a few minutes with Sai in the lobby, but I thought you'd stay there."
    new "我不在……？我可能在大厅和 Sai 待了几分钟，但我以为你会留在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:14991
    old "With Sai? But he was in the attic. What do you mean? I waited a bit in the room until I got worried something had gone wrong. I saw the Sekimeiya too. It was still where we left it, but it changed colors to the gray from before."
    new "和 Sai 一起？可他当时在阁楼啊。你是什么意思？我在房间里等了一会儿，后来担心出了什么差错。我也看到了 Sekimeiya。它还在我们放下的地方，但颜色变成了之前那种灰色。"

    # game/script.rpy:14992
    old "So activating it is what powers it off like that."
    new "所以启动它，就会让它像那样断电关闭。"

    # game/script.rpy:14997
    old "Probably, but I didn't try to touch it again. I closed the cabinet before I looked around this floor briefly, and I thought that you might be back in the attic. I went there, but not much had seemed to change.{w} I stayed in the hallway to listen to the conversation going on in the bedroom. Even if they'd seen me, it wouldn't have mattered much since we had just left from their perspective."
    new "大概吧，不过我没敢再碰它。我先关上展示柜，把这一层大致看了一圈，然后想你可能已经回阁楼了。我上去后，发现似乎没多少变化。{w}我留在走廊里听卧室里的谈话。就算被他们看见，也没什么大不了的，因为从他们的角度看，我们才刚刚离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:15000
    old "At that point, Sai was still there, right?"
    new "那个时候，Sai 还在那里，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:15005
    old "Yes. He was leading the conversation, telling everyone not to follow us down. Akaro was there too, and he confirmed that he saw us. Sai told them all to wait for us because we'd be responsible for anything that happened after leaving of our own volition..."
    new "是的。他在主导谈话，叫大家不要跟着我们下去。Akaro 也在，还确认他看见了我们。Sai 让他们都等着我们，因为我们是自己擅自离开的，之后发生什么事都由我们负责……"

    # game/script.rpy:15006
    old "...I see. So he wanted the others not to come down."
    new "……我明白了。所以他想让其他人别下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:15007
    old "He kept saying it. He never left, and the elevator was still there with the door open. The conversation started winding down, and when they talked about going to the bathroom, I left right away so nobody would see me.{w} I stayed in the living room for a couple minutes with the doors closed, but I think that they all took that time to go to the bathroom, so I started going down again to find you. I looked through every floor until I saw you right as I was about to start with this one."
    new "他反复这么说。他一直没离开，电梯也还停在那里，门开着。谈话渐渐接近尾声，他们提到要去洗手间时，我立刻离开，免得被人看见。{w}我关着门在客厅里待了几分钟，但我想他们就是趁那段时间一起去了洗手间，于是我又往下走去找你。我把每一层都找过了，正准备从这一层开始找时，就看见了你。"

    # game/script.rpy:15008
    old "Hm...{w} I suppose it makes sense we never saw each other. Five minutes before the point we traveled from, I saw Sai on this floor. I thought he traveled from the future because he was supposed to still be upstairs.{w} If he actually was there during that time, I had to be right in some way. He escaped from me more than ten minutes ago, so I'm not sure where he is right now."
    new "嗯……{w}我们一直没碰面，倒也说得通。在我们穿越回来的五分钟前，我在这一层看见了 Sai。我以为他是从未来穿越回来的，因为他本来应该还在楼上。{w}如果他当时真的在那里，那我的某个判断应该没错。他十几分钟前从我眼前逃走了，所以我现在不知道他在哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:15013
    old "Oh, I haven't seen him anywhere."
    new "哦，我哪儿都没看到他。"

    # game/script.rpy:15014
    old "I guess he didn't go up."
    new "看来他没上楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:15015
    old "Well, I looked inside every partition, so he might've been able to."
    new "不过每个隔间我都看过了，所以他或许还是能上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:15016
    old "I don't know what his goal was, but he's probably accomplished it by now. Regardless, the most important thing is that you were able to travel without touching the Sekimeiya. Not only that, but you went back just as far as me."
    new "我不知道他的目的是什么，但到现在他大概已经达成了。不管怎样，最重要的是你没碰 Sekimeiya 也能时间穿越。不仅如此，你回到过去的时间还和我一样久。"

    # game/script.rpy:15017
    old "I considered that I went back twice as far as my initial travel, but that shouldn't matter anymore since this was your first."
    new "我之前还想过，我这次回溯的时间是第一次的两倍，不过既然你是第一次穿越，这应该已经不重要了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15018
    old "And our locations were also different. I'm not sure why I appeared on the second floor."
    new "而且我们出现的位置也不一样。我不知道自己为什么会出现在二楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:15019
    old "Yeah... It could be that it chooses random nearby locations, but that might be a bit of a stretch. It would mean that we could keep trying it until we appear outside the tower, but that recording didn't seem to indicate that will be possible.{w} There's no way it was real, though..."
    new "是啊……也许它会在附近随机选择位置，但这有点牵强。那样的话，我们只要不断尝试，直到出现在塔外就行；可那段录像似乎并不表示有这种可能。{w}不过，那怎么可能是真的……"

    # game/script.rpy:15028
    old "Forty minutes before we traveled, both of us were together, moving down from the fifth floor. It can't be that where we appear is decided based on that position, or we would've appeared together."
    new "在我们时间穿越的四十分钟前，我们俩还在一起，正从五楼往下走。出现的位置不可能由穿越前所在的位置决定，否则我们俩应该会出现在同一个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:15029
    old "Yeah, I don't know. The amount of time traveled and the location might just be random."
    new "是啊，我也不知道。回溯多久和出现在哪儿，也许都是随机的。"

    # game/script.rpy:15030
    old "Both were different than the first time I traveled, but when I disappeared in front of all of you, nobody else went with me. Why did it affect you as well this time?"
    new "这两点都和我第一次时间穿越时不同，可我在你们所有人面前消失时，没有别人跟着我一起走。为什么这次连你也受到了影响？"

    # game/script.rpy:15035
    old "I thought about this... I was a few steps behind, and I'm sure at least Sai was closer to you the first time. He was walking to you before you disappeared."
    new "我也想过……我当时落后几步，而第一次的时候，至少 Sai 肯定比我更靠近你。你消失前，他正朝你走过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:15036
    old "But Sai didn't vanish. From that, we can probably assume that the Sekimeiya has an effective range around itself."
    new "可 Sai 没有消失。由此大概可以推断，Sekimeiya 周围存在一个有效范围。"

    # game/script.rpy:15037
    old "You think so...?"
    new "你是这么想的……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15038
    old "Well, even though you were picked up too, it's not like the people in the attic traveled. There's a specific distance from the Sekimeiya in which people can travel if it's activated.{w} The first time, it was smaller, which is why Sai didn't travel."
    new "这个嘛，就算你也被卷了进去，阁楼里的人却没有时间穿越。Sekimeiya 周围有一个特定范围，它启动时，范围内的人就能时间穿越。{w}第一次那个范围更小，所以 Sai 没有时间穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:15043
    old "...If that's the case, are the distance it picks people up and the distance you move through time related?"
    new "……如果是这样，那它把人们卷入的范围，和时间穿越的跨度，会不会互有关联？"

    # game/script.rpy:15044
    old "That was my first thought too. The first time, I went twenty minutes into the past, and Sai, who was a few steps behind me, wasn't within range. This time, I went forty minutes into the past, and you went too despite being a bit farther away.{w} Both times before traveling, I felt a painful burn on my fingers for a split second. The Sekimeiya was searing. I believe the second time it was even hotter, so that could be tied to this as well.{w} Inside its cabinet, the Sekimeiya is kept cold. Once it's removed, it begins to get progressively hotter at an unnatural rate. Sai brought up something like this earlier."
    new "我起初也这么想。第一次我回到了二十分钟前，而落后我几步的 Sai 不在范围内。这次我回到了四十分钟前，你离得稍远些，却也一起时间穿越了。{w}两次时间穿越前，我的手指都有一瞬间像被灼伤般刺痛。Sekimeiya 烫得厉害。我觉得第二次甚至更烫，所以这也许也有关联。{w}放在展示柜里时，Sekimeiya 是冷的。一旦取出，它就会以不自然的速度逐渐变热。Sai 之前提过类似的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:15045
    old "After traveling, I paid attention to the room where we found the Sekimeiya, but I didn't see anyone hiding it there. We don't know how long it was there, but it should've been outside the cabinet for longer than the first time."
    new "时间穿越之后，我留意过我们发现 Sekimeiya 的那个房间，但没看到有人把它藏在那里。我们不知道它在那里放了多久，但它离开展示柜的时间应该比第一次更久。"

    # game/script.rpy:15050
    old "It could be something like that, yeah. The distance traveled, the range around it, and how hot it gets could all increment slowly as soon as the Sekimeiya's away from a regulated temperature."
    new "嗯，有可能是这样。回溯的时间长度、它周围的范围，还有温度，也许都会在 Sekimeiya 离开恒温环境后慢慢上升。"

    # game/script.rpy:15053
    old "The place we teleport to still seems to be completely unrelated, though. Despite everything we've learned, I'm not sure if there's some other factor given that it hasn't responded on touch sometimes."
    new "不过，我们传送到的地点似乎仍然和这些完全无关。尽管我们已经弄清了不少，我还是不确定是否另有因素，毕竟它有时被碰到也没有反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:15054
    old "It seems that when it's activated, the energy stored is released completely, and the Sekimeiya turns gray and cools off immediately. I think it starts glowing again after some time, but exposing it to the cold might accelerate that, like we saw. I'm saying this because the Sai I met had the Sekimeiya on him, and it went from gray to white before we put it in the cabinet."
    new "它启动时，蓄能会完全释放，Sekimeiya 会立刻变成灰色并冷却下来。我想过一段时间它会重新发光，但把它置于寒冷中也许会加快这个过程，就像我们看到的那样。我这么说是因为我遇到的 Sai 身上带着 Sekimeiya，在我们把它放进展示柜之前，它就从灰色变回了白色。"

    # game/script.rpy:15055
    old "I still don't follow what you're saying about this Sai. We should go upstairs already to see what he's been getting up to. He was priming everyone to suspect us."
    new "你说的这个 Sai，我还是没听明白。我们该上楼了，看看他到底在搞什么。他一直在让大家对我们起疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:15056
    old "Yes, but hang on a second..."
    new "嗯，不过等一下……"

    # game/script.rpy:15059
    old "I hadn't fully explained to her what I'd gone through upon traveling to the past. The big mystery I'd experienced was still the killer vanishing from the bathroom without being able to touch the Sekimeiya. I'd gotten to the conclusion that, most likely, the bathroom was completely empty when we saw Naomi's second body."
    new "我穿越到过去之后的完整经历，还没告诉她。我亲身经历的最大谜团，仍然是凶手无法触碰 Sekimeiya，却从洗手间里凭空消失。我得出的结论是：我们看到 Naomi 的第二具尸体时，洗手间里很可能空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:15060
    old "And we'd just learned of a supposed \"range\". It would let someone travel without needing to touch the Sekimeiya, but they'd need to be close to it. Since the Sekimeiya was in its cabinet at that time, it wouldn't have been possible."
    new "而我们才刚刚听说了一个所谓的「范围」。它能让人不必触碰 Sekimeiya 就能传送，但必须待在它附近。当时 Sekimeiya 就收在展示柜里，所以这说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:15063
    old "I was in front of the bathroom when it was locked, so if that was when the culprit disappeared, it would've teleported me as well alongside the others in the event room, assuming that was the source.{w} After we heard the sound, we first searched through hallway A. During that time, is it possible that someone used the Sekimeiya and the range encompassed the culprit in the bathroom? Given that we still found it inside the cabinet after finding the second Naomi, that doesn't seem feasible."
    new "上锁的时候，我就站在洗手间门前。假如犯人正是在那一刻消失的，那就等于说传送的源头就在这里——若果真如此，我该和活动室里的其他人一样被一并传走才对。{w}听到那声响后，我们最先搜查的是 A走廊。在这段时间里，会不会有人动用了 Sekimeiya，而范围恰好把洗手间里的犯人也圈了进去？可我们找到第二个 Naomi 之后，Sekimeiya 依旧在展示柜里，这么想来又说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:15064
    old "But... there might be one way. According to Shiroya, she returned to room B3 and found the Sekimeiya in the cabinet where I'd activated it, and at that point, Sai had a disabled Sekimeiya in his hip pack. Was there a second Sekimeiya at the same time as another?{w} While the culprit was locked in the bathroom, could it be that someone made them escape with another Sekimeiya? ...Someone who remained in hallway B, maybe? Could it have happened from the second floor?{w} And then, did both that person and the culprit escape to the past? If so, where the hell have they been all this time? This concept of \"range\" must start to explain what happened..."
    new "可是……或许还有一种可能。据 Shiroya 说，她回到 B3房间，发现 Sekimeiya 就在我启动它的那个展示柜里；而在那一刻，Sai 腰包里装着一个已经停用的 Sekimeiya。也就是说，同一时间存在两个 Sekimeiya？{w}犯人在洗手间被锁住的时候，会不会有人用另一个 Sekimeiya 把他带走了？……是某个留在 B走廊的人？还是从二楼动的手？{w}然后，那个人和犯人一起逃到了过去？若真是如此，他们这段时间究竟躲在什么地方？看来「范围」这个概念，应该能解释这一切了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15067
    old "...Before we go up, let's check the Sekimeiya. Katei might get unreasonably angry if we don't leave it in the cabinet, and something's still really strange."
    new "……上去之前，先确认一下 Sekimeiya 吧。要是没把它留在展示柜里，Katei 说不定会莫名其妙地发火；而且还有件事怎么想都不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:15072
    old "What is?"
    new "什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:15073
    old "Well, Sai was holding a powered-off Sekimeiya in his hip pack right when we both traveled."
    new "我们俩传送的时候，Sai 的腰包里正好装着一个已经停用的 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:15078
    old "Hm, so there were two of them at that point."
    new "嗯，这么说，那个时候就已经有两个了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15079
    old "If the past wasn't changed at all, yes. Sai seemed legitimately surprised to see himself holding it, but it's insane to think that it was put there without him noticing. Even if he somehow traveled from the future holding it, he should've been conscious that he had it."
    new "如果过去完全没有被改变的话，那就是两个。Sai 看到自己手里拿着它时，那副吃惊的样子不像是装的；可要说是趁他没注意塞进去的，也太离谱了。就算他真的从未来带着它传送过来，他自己总该清楚身上有这东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:15084
    old "How would you appear while taking it with you, though?"
    new "不过，带着它一起传送的时候，人又会是什么状况呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:15085
    old "I can't think of anything. But right now, more than one Sekimeiya might exist.{w} If you had two, you could bring one to the past. You just need to be holding one while you touch the other.{w} I really don't think that can be the answer. The second one would've spawned out of nowhere."
    new "我想不出任何可能。但现在，世上也许不止一个 Sekimeiya。{w}只要有两个，就能把其中一个带到过去——手里握着一个，再去触碰另一个就行。{w}可我实在不觉得这能成立。第二个总不可能凭空冒出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:15090
    old "We entered the event room, where that Sai and I had left his Sekimeiya."
    new "我们走进活动室，那个 Sai 和我曾把他的 Sekimeiya 留在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:15096
    old "However, the cabinet was empty."
    new "然而，展示柜里空空如也。"

    # game/script.rpy:15097
    old "Oh... What?"
    new "啊……怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:15102
    old "What's wrong?"
    new "怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:15103
    old "Right, the Sekimeiya Sai had... We put it here."
    new "对，Sai 的那个 Sekimeiya……我们把它放在这儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15108
    old "Huh? Then, did he...?"
    new "咦？那，难道是他……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15113
    old "Instead of answering, I opened the opposite door and entered the room we'd traveled from."
    new "我没有回答，而是推开对面的门，走进我们当初传送过来的那个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:15119
    old "You closed the glass again. Did you also put the cushion back in place?"
    new "你又把玻璃罩盖上了。坐垫也放回原位了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:15124
    old "Yes. It was left out, and I put it back with the Sekimeiya under it so that it wouldn't stand out. I didn't want to touch it, and I thought you had to be nearby."
    new "嗯。它被放在外面，我就把它放了回去，压在 Sekimeiya 下面，免得显眼。我不想碰那东西，也以为你肯定就在附近。"

    # game/script.rpy:15128
    old "I went ahead and grabbed it.{w} It didn't take me long to confirm that nothing was below it."
    new "我干脆伸手把坐垫拿了起来。{w}很快就确认了下面什么都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:15135
    old "...It's not here."
    new "……不在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:15136
    old "That's..."
    new "那岂不是……"

    # game/script.rpy:15137
    old "Yeah, Sai must've taken it. Both of them."
    new "是啊，肯定是 Sai 拿走的。两个都拿走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15141
    old "He had the perfect chance and alibi. After he slipped away, he came here. Maybe he hid it somewhere else."
    new "时机挑得正好，还有不在场证明。他溜走之后，就来了这里。也许他把东西藏到别处去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15146
    old "Really? What's he trying to do...?"
    new "真的？他到底想做什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15147
    old "I don't know, but he might have an extra Sekimeiya at his disposal. If he travels to the past holding one, he could appear where I saw him and explain the existence of it."
    new "不知道。但他手上说不定多了一个可以随意使用的 Sekimeiya。只要他拿着一个传送到过去，就能出现在我看见他的那个地方——他那个 Sekimeiya 的来历也就说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15152
    old "But... like you said, this is a paradox, right? The other Sekimeiya has no origin, and him traveling with it is what allowed him to travel with it."
    new "可是……就像你说的，这不就成了悖论吗？另一个 Sekimeiya 根本没有来源，而正是因为他带着它传送，他才能带着它传送。"

    # game/script.rpy:15153
    old "Which is why I think there has to be more to it. We need to go talk to him."
    new "所以我才觉得事情没那么简单。得去当面问他。"

    # game/script.rpy:15158
    old "Shiroya agreed, and I repositioned the cushion before leaving. Since the elevator should've still been out of commission, we took the stairs up."
    new "Shiroya 同意了。离开前我把坐垫重新摆好。电梯应该还没修好，我们就走楼梯上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:15161
    old "In a short time, we were in front of the top staircase. Before stepping inside the attic, I asked Shiroya to hold up."
    new "没多久，我们就来到顶层楼梯前。进阁楼之前，我让 Shiroya 先等一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:15166
    old "...I looked at these footprints before leaving. They've all degraded, but I believe these are new."
    new "……我离开前看过这些脚印。全都已经模糊了，不过这一对应该是新的。"

    # game/script.rpy:15167
    old "I pointed at the pair of footprints that looked more prominent."
    new "我指向那对看起来更清晰的脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:15172
    old "You can tell? These should be mine since I was the last person to leave the attic. They fit."
    new "你看得出来？最后离开阁楼的是我，那应该是我留下的。对得上。"

    # game/script.rpy:15173
    old "I thought so. Meaning that nobody else entered or left through this door apart from you..."
    new "我也这么想。也就是说，除了你，没人从这扇门进出过……"

    # game/script.rpy:15178
    old "We walked in. Nobody was in the living room, but faint voices could be heard coming from the bedroom where we'd been. Upon opening the door, five pairs of eyes fixed themselves on us, and Sai took the initiative to begin speaking without letting anyone else react."
    new "我们走了进去。客厅里没人，但我们原先待的那间卧室里传来隐约的说话声。门一开，五双眼睛齐刷刷地看过来；还没等别人有所反应，Sai 先开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:15186
    old "Hey, you two. Did you enjoy your fifty minute trip downstairs? What the hell were you doing?"
    new "喂，你们俩。下楼这一趟逛了五十分钟，挺尽兴吧？到底干什么去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:15191
    old "We were getting worried...! Why did you leave without saying anything?"
    new "我们都担心起来了……！为什么一声不吭就走？"

    # game/script.rpy:15192
    old "Well, we went to check if the Sekimeiya was where we thought it'd be."
    new "我们去确认了一下 Sekimeiya 是不是还在我们以为的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:15197
    old "What? We left it in the cabinet! Where else would it be? And that doesn't take fifty minutes!"
    new "什么？我们把它留在展示柜里了！还能在哪儿？而且那也花不了五十分钟！"

    # game/script.rpy:15198
    old "Before we explain ourselves, let me request something. Sai, can you show me your wristwatch?"
    new "在解释之前，我有个请求。Sai，能让我看看你的手表吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:15203
    old "What? Do you wanna know the time? It's {time=12:37.}"
    new "干嘛？想知道几点了？现在是 {time=12:37.}"

    # game/script.rpy:15204
    old "No, just show it to me."
    new "不是，让我看看就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:15205
    old "Do you not believe me? Look."
    new "不信我？喏，自己看。"

    # game/script.rpy:15206
    old "He turned his wrist around. That was the time displayed on the watch's screen, along with the correct date: \"2011-12-15\"."
    new "他把手腕转了过来。表盘上显示的正是这个时间，日期也没错——「2011-12-15」。"

    # game/script.rpy:15209
    old "Did you just set the date back to normal?"
    new "你刚才是不是把日期调回正常了？"

    # game/script.rpy:15214
    old "What do you mean? Why would I need to change it?"
    new "什么意思？我干嘛要调它？"

    # game/script.rpy:15215
    old "Forget it. When we went down, we found the Sekimeiya in room B3 after seeing that the cabinet in the event room was empty."
    new "算了。我们下楼之后，发现活动室的展示柜空了，后来在 B3房间找到了 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:15221
    old "What...? That's impossible."
    new "什么……？这不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:15229
    old "We all instinctively looked at Akaro, who seemed like the only person who could've done it, but he denied any involvement."
    new "我们不由自主地看向 Akaro——在场的人里，似乎只有他做得到——但他否认自己与此有关。"

    # game/script.rpy:15230
    old "After that, we told them about our respective travels, about seeing Sai on the crystal floor with a disabled Sekimeiya, about being unable to find Shiroya for a while, about coming to the attic, and about Sai's escape. It all amounted to the fifty minutes we'd been gone, but from our perspective, we'd been gone for about an hour and thirty minutes."
    new "之后，我们把各自传送的经历都说了出来：在水晶层看见 Sai 拿着一个已经停用的 Sekimeiya；有好一阵子找不到 Shiroya；后来上了阁楼；还有 Sai 溜走的事。这些加起来，正好就是我们离开的那五十分钟——可从我们的感受来说，我们离开了大约一小时三十分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:15238
    old "This is a laughable story you're making up. You hid the Sekimeiya and are now trying to blame me."
    new "编出这种荒唐的故事。Sekimeiya 明明是你藏的，现在却想把罪名推到我头上。"

    # game/script.rpy:15243
    old "It can't be... Sai was here the whole time."
    new "不可能……Sai 一直待在这里啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:15249
    old "Are you sure? Did he ever have the time to go down?"
    new "你确定？他真有机会下楼吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:15254
    old "No, he didn't leave."
    new "没有，他一步都没离开过。"

    # game/script.rpy:15258
    old "Sai, do you really not know what I'm talking about?"
    new "Sai，你真的不知道我在说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:15263
    old "I have no clue."
    new "我完全不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:15264
    old "If that's the case, you'll eventually travel back to the past and experience what I said."
    new "如果真是这样，你早晚会穿越回过去，亲身体会我说的那些事。"

    # game/script.rpy:15269
    old "I'm sorry, but that won't happen. You've said that you spotted me in hallway A, so if I ever go back to the past, I'll avoid being seen.{w} It's that simple. You've told me what happened, so you've made sure I won't ever let it occur. If I travel to the past, I'll quickly check my hip pack, so there's no way I won't know I had the Sekimeiya there. This proves you're just making it all up."
    new "很遗憾，那不可能发生。你说过在 A走廊看见我，那只要我真回到过去，就一定会避开你的视线。{w} 就这么简单。你已经把会发生的事告诉我，也就等于确保了我不会让那一幕发生。要是我穿越回过去，第一时间就会检查腰包，不可能不知道自己带着 Sekimeiya。这足以证明，你说的全是编的。"

    # game/script.rpy:15270
    old "...I didn't know how to refute that. If he was truly unaware of the events downstairs, he couldn't live out what I'd experienced unless he lost his memory of me describing it. After all, when I saw him, he'd looked legitimately surprised to see me because I shouldn't have been there. If the Sai in front of me traveled, he would know about it, causing that reaction to be either impossible or fake."
    new "……我不知该如何反驳。如果他真的对楼下发生的事一无所知，就不可能亲身经历我经历过的那一幕——除非他忘了我刚才的描述。毕竟我看见他时，他脸上的惊讶不似作伪；那时的我根本不该出现在那里。如果眼前这个 Sai 真的穿越过，他理应对此心知肚明，那他的反应要么根本不该出现，要么就是装出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:15275
    old "You know, Atsuki... Are you sure you're not just creating an alibi for Shiroya? She seems like the most suspicious person to me, given what you told us."
    new "我说，Atsuki……你该不会只是在给 Shiroya 编不在场证明吧？照你告诉我们的那些来看，她才是最可疑的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:15280
    old "I'm sorry...?"
    new "你说什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15281
    old "Shiroya frowned too. How was she any more suspicious than I was?"
    new "Shiroya 也皱起了眉。她哪里比我更可疑了？"

    # game/script.rpy:15286
    old "This version of myself you describe... It just seems like your imagination. I was here the whole time, so what's with this Sai appearing down there for no reason and clearly holding the Sekimeiya, which told you he was up to something...?"
    new "你口中的那个我……听起来只像是你的想象。我一直都待在这里，那这个莫名其妙出现在楼下、手里还分明拿着 Sekimeiya、让你认定他图谋不轨的 Sai，又是怎么回事……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15291
    old "According to you, Shiroya went back to the past. She knew where to hide the Sekimeiya and was the only one who could've done it. She also wasn't where you agreed to meet, right? This version of myself you saw, who couldn't have existed, is nothing but an excuse to remove suspicion from her. Am I wrong?"
    new "按你的说法，Shiroya 回到了过去。她知道该把 Sekimeiya 藏在哪里，也是唯一做得到的人。而且她没出现在你们约好碰面的地方，对吧？你看到的那个根本不可能存在的我，不过是你为了替她洗清嫌疑找的借口。我说错了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:15292
    old "You're being ridiculous. If anything, I now know you're very aware of what I saw, or else you would've suspected both of us. You know my story is true."
    new "你这话才叫荒唐。真要说什么的话，我现在反倒确定，你对我的所见心知肚明；否则，你也会连我一起怀疑。你清楚我说的都是真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:15297
    old "Don't act like a smartass. I just chose to suspect her before you. Are you sure you can really trust her that much? Didn't she have the cabinet key in her purse?"
    new "别自作聪明。我不过是先怀疑她罢了。你真那么信得过她？她的包里不是有展示柜的钥匙吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:15300
    old "I also remember that she couldn't have hidden the Sekimeiya in the storeroom."
    new "我还记得，她不可能把 Sekimeiya 藏进储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:15305
    old "That's true! Unfortunately, nobody else could have, which means that someone who appears not to have been able to do it did it anyway. What if it was her?"
    new "没错！可惜别人也做不到，也就是说，看似做不到的人偏偏做到了。万一就是她呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:15310
    old "...Don't look at me like that. You're the two people who left us without saying a word, and now you claim the Sekimeiya disappeared from the cabinet. Either you two are responsible, or only one is. I was only trying to trust you, Atsuki."
    new "……别用那种眼神看我。一声不吭离开我们的是你们俩，现在又说什么展示柜里的 Sekimeiya 不见了。要么你们都有份，要么只有一个。Atsuki，我本来只是想相信你。"

    # game/script.rpy:15311
    old "I'm going to make this very clear for you, Sai. Don't try to push her around. You can say what you want about Katei, even about me, but you'd seriously better think twice before you go accusing her. She's done nothing wrong. In fact, she's the last person who would ever try to take advantage of this incident, right after me."
    new "Sai，我把话说清楚。别想欺负她。你想怎么说 Katei，甚至想怎么说我，都随你，但在指责她之前，你最好想清楚。她什么都没做错。事实上，除了我，最不可能利用这起事件的人就是她。"

    # game/script.rpy:15313
    old "You don't need to. Sometimes, you just need to be quiet and listen."
    new "你没必要明白。有时候，只要安静听着就好。"

    # game/script.rpy:15319
    old "I-I still can't believe this is all for real. Are you two being serious? Did you travel through time? Atsuki said it before, but..."
    new "我、我还是不敢相信这一切是真的。你们两个是认真的？你们真的经历了时间穿越？Atsuki 之前也说过，可是……"

    # game/script.rpy:15320
    old "Yes. I'm completely sure now. There's no other explanation for what we experienced."
    new "是。我现在完全可以肯定。我们经历的事没有别的解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:15325
    old "I'm certain too. Somehow, the Sekimeiya has that power."
    new "我也确定。不知为何，Sekimeiya 拥有那种力量。"

    # game/script.rpy:15328
    old "Listen, if I'd hidden a device that lets me travel to the past, I'd currently be buying yesterday's lottery ticket, not hanging around here."
    new "听着，如果我真藏了一台能回到过去的装置，现在早该去买昨天的彩票了，哪还会耗在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:15329
    old "The rules seem a bit volatile, so maybe you're not aware of them. Something led me to believe that the Sai I met never traveled before. Your purpose might be to experiment with it or to try to leave this building with it."
    new "这套规则似乎不太稳定，你也许还没摸清。我总觉得，我遇见的那个 Sai 在此之前从来没穿越过时间。你的目的，也许是想拿它做实验，或者带着它离开这栋楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:15334
    old "Did you lose your mind? How would I get out and still keep it?"
    new "你疯了吗？我怎么可能出得去，还把它带在身上？"

    # game/script.rpy:15335
    old "At one point earlier, two copies of the Sekimeiya might've existed at once. I'm not sure how that came to happen, but by hiding only one, you could lead Ashiya to believe the Sekimeiya hadn't been stolen while keeping the other one hidden to retrieve it later."
    new "先前有一段时间，可能同时存在过两个 Sekimeiya。我不清楚这是怎么发生的，但你只要藏起其中一个，就能让芦屋以为 Sekimeiya 没被偷走，同时把另一个藏好，日后再取回。"

    # game/script.rpy:15336
    old "Well, unfortunately, this second Sekimeiya is just part of your imagination. It can't exist, and it seems both of them vanished. We're not going to take any of this seriously when it comes from the most likely suspect behind this new disappearance."
    new "很遗憾，那第二个 Sekimeiya 只是你想象出来的。它根本不可能存在，而且现在两个似乎都不见了。这番话出自这起新失踪案最可能的嫌疑人，我们可没法当真。"

    # game/script.rpy:15337
    old "Do you no longer think an \"unknown culprit\" is behind this?"
    new "你已经不觉得背后有个「身份不明的犯人」了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:15342
    old "That's still the second most likely possibility along with Akaro."
    new "那种可能性仍然排第二，和 Akaro 并列。"

    # game/script.rpy:15347
    old "It wasn't me. I promise."
    new "不是我。我保证。"

    # game/script.rpy:15353
    old "We have to go downstairs. If someone hid it again, we should be able to find it just like before."
    new "我们得下楼。如果有人又把它藏了起来，我们应该能像之前那样找出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:15358
    old "That's true. We keep repeating this, but the cameras are still working. They will eventually expose everything to the police."
    new "说得对。这话我们重复了很多遍，但监控一直都在运作。它们迟早会让警方知道一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:15359
    old "Akaro seemed to have gone back to his normal self. He was probably right, but a culprit with time traveling knowledge might not have cared too much about that."
    new "Akaro 似乎恢复了常态。他大概说得没错，但一个掌握时间穿越手段的犯人，未必会把这点放在心上。"

    # game/script.rpy:15364
    old "Do we need to? We can just stay here, where we're more comfortable."
    new "有必要吗？我们待在这里更自在。"

    # game/script.rpy:15369
    old "I'm not fond of staying with people I know are plotting something, especially when it's more than one of you. Let's go see what these two are talking about."
    new "我可不想和明知在打什么主意的人待在一起，何况还不止一个。走吧，去看看那两个人到底在说什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:15378
    old "We agreed to go down. Meanwhile, I continued to debate whether the Sai next to us the one I'd seen on the crystal floor. If so, how had he managed to trick all of us?"
    new "我们决定下楼。与此同时，我仍在反复琢磨，身旁这个 Sai 到底是不是我在水晶层见过的那一个。如果是，他又是怎么把我们所有人都骗过去的？"

    # game/script.rpy:15379
    old "...Because if he wasn't the same one, the origin of the extra Sai remained as the hardest mystery to solve, alongside his motive and actions."
    new "……因为如果两者并非同一人，那么这个多出来的 Sai 的来历，连同他的动机和行动，都依然是最难解开的谜。"

    # game/script.rpy:15380
    old "Had two Sekimeiya ever existed at the same time? Was that still the case? And if so, how had it happened?{w} I hoped we'd quickly have a better idea of all that, but in the meantime, I continued running through my previous thoughts. We were only four hours into our imprisonment, and we were already dealing with a seemingly incomprehensible pile of questions."
    new "是否真的同时存在过两个 Sekimeiya？现在是否仍然如此？若是，又是怎么发生的？{w} 我希望我们能尽快弄清这些，但在那之前，我仍在反复梳理先前的思绪。我们被困在这里才四个小时，眼前却已经堆满了看似无法理解的问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:15384
    old "Before leaving the attic, we made sure nobody else was there. The elevator was still open, and we left it that way."
    new "离开阁楼前，我们确认过没有别人。电梯门仍然开着，我们也就没去动它。"

    # game/script.rpy:15388
    old "As we moved down the floors, we entered all the offices; once we were done with the ones on floor 2, nobody could've been above us. At the end, only the crystal floor remained."
    new "我们逐层往下，把所有办公室都查了一遍；等查完二楼，上面就不可能再藏着人了。最后，只剩下水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:15393
    old "All of us went to the event room, leaving Erina and Isla by hallway A to watch the stairs like before. Shiroya and I had left the cabinet uncovered, so everyone else immediately had a view of the empty interior."
    new "我们全都去了活动室，只留下 Erina 和 Isla 在 A走廊看着楼梯，和之前一样。Shiroya 和我先前没把展示柜的遮布盖上，所以其他人一进来就看见柜子里空空如也。"

    # game/script.rpy:15402
    old "...Atsuki, be aware that if this is your doing, Ashiya will figure it out."
    new "……Atsuki，你最好明白，如果这是你干的，芦屋迟早会查出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:15403
    old "That's fine. We had nothing to do with it. It must've been Sai."
    new "没关系。这事与我们无关。一定是 Sai 做的。"

    # game/script.rpy:15404
    old "We waited a couple seconds for his denial, but it never came."
    new "我们等了几秒，想听他的否认，却始终没有等到。"

    # game/script.rpy:15409
    old "Wait... Is he not here?"
    new "等等……他不在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:15415
    old "We turned around to discover that Sai wasn't with us. Shiroya, next to the other door we'd left open, peeked at hallway B."
    new "我们回头一看，才发现 Sai 没跟上来。Shiroya 站在我们没关的另一扇门旁，正朝 B走廊张望。"

    # game/script.rpy:15416
    old "Where are you going...?"
    new "你去哪儿……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15426
    old "Sai didn't reply. When I looked at the hallway, I saw him in front of a door. Even though he'd heard us, he ignored our call and disappeared off to hallway C."
    new "Sai 没有回应。我朝走廊望去，只见他站在一扇门前。他明明听见了我们的声音，却无视我们的呼喊，转身朝 C 走廊走去，消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15427
    old "What the fuck is he doing now...?"
    new "这家伙现在到底在搞什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15431
    old "Katei gestured at Erina to stay in the opposite hallway. Shiroya and I were interested in the room Sai'd been next to, so we approached it with Katei behind us."
    new "Katei 示意 Erina 留在对面的走廊。Shiroya 和我对 Sai 刚才站在旁边的那间屋子起了兴趣，便朝它走去，Katei 跟在后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:15436
    old "Sai! Come here! Where did you go...!?"
    new "Sai！过来！你跑到哪儿去了……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:15440
    old "Shiroya reached the door first and opened it. Inside was the cleaning room."
    new "Shiroya 先一步走到门前，把门推开。里面是清洁间。"

    # game/script.rpy:15445
    old "I wasn't sure what Sai planned to do, but we'd seen him standing in front of the door. Shiroya and I entered while Katei continued toward hallway C in pursuit of him."
    new "我不知道 Sai 打算做什么，但我们确实看见他站在门前。Shiroya 和我进了那间屋子，Katei 则继续朝 C走廊追去。"

    # game/script.rpy:15450
    old "He stopped himself, but I saw his arm about to open this door. He was definitely going to go in here."
    new "他中途收了手，可我看得清清楚楚，他的手臂本来正要推开这扇门。他绝对是打算进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:15451
    old "There was only one reason why. He wanted to activate the Sekimeiya there after previously hiding it. If he did that, he could disappear without us noticing it."
    new "原因只有一个。他先前把 Sekimeiya 藏在了这里，现在想就地启动它。只要这么做，他就能在我们毫无察觉的情况下消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:15454
    old "Shiroya was looking around while I questioned Sai's ambiguous action. If he'd concealed the Sekimeiya in that room, I wasn't sure why he left upon realizing that we'd seen him. He had the opportunity to give up, but instead, he left for hallway C."
    new "我琢磨着 Sai 这番难以理解的举动，Shiroya 则在四下打量。如果他把 Sekimeiya 藏在了那间屋里，为什么一发现被我们看见就离开了？他本可以就此作罢，却偏偏朝 C走廊去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15461
    old "Airtight Room"
    new "气密室"

    # game/script.rpy:15468
    old "Before I had time to think about it, the dim environment around me changed; a large light was illuminating the much more comforting room. I felt no confusion that time, as I realized immediately that I had teleported to the living room in the attic."
    new "我还没来得及细想，周围昏暗的环境就变了，明亮的灯光照亮了这个让人安心许多的房间。这一次我没有困惑，立刻意识到自己已经传送到了阁楼的客厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:15471
    old "This is getting too crazy... What the fuck happened now...?"
    new "事情越来越离谱了……这回又他妈出了什么事……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15472
    old "I knew I had traveled, but I wasn't the one to activate the Sekimeiya. It didn't catch me completely off guard—I already knew that was possible."
    new "我知道自己穿越了时间，但启动 Sekimeiya 的人不是我。我并没有完全措手不及——我早就知道这种事有可能发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:15473
    old "That meant I had just been in the range of the Sekimeiya. It was most likely in the cleaning room."
    new "也就是说，我刚才正处在 Sekimeiya 的作用范围内。它多半就在清洁间里。"

    # game/script.rpy:15474
    old "And Shiroya was probably been the one to activate it, meaning that she should've also appeared somewhere."
    new "启动它的人多半是 Shiroya，那她应该也被传送到了某处。"

    # game/script.rpy:15476
    old "How far did I go this time...?"
    new "这次我跳到什么时候了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15479
    old "Once I thought that, I considered some implications of what had occurred. The past hour was extremely dense; Sai managed to appear and disappear, and Shiroya had investigated every floor. Assuming that Shiroya traveled with me, we had both remained unseen for that entire duration. I looked behind me and saw that the door to the staircase was open."
    new "这么一想，我又琢磨起刚才发生的事可能意味着什么。过去这一小时里发生的事实在太多：Sai 一会儿出现一会儿消失，Shiroya 则把每一层都查了一遍。假如 Shiroya 是和我一起穿越过来的，那我们两人在这整段时间里都没有被任何人看到。我回头一看，通往楼梯间的门开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:15484
    old "Drawn to my noise, a figure appeared from the hallway. It was Shiroya, with a disoriented expression."
    new "似乎是被我的动静引来，一个人影从走廊里出现。是 Shiroya，神情恍惚。"

    # game/script.rpy:15485
    old "Oh...! You're here. Wh-What time is it...?"
    new "啊……！你在这儿。现、现在是什么时候……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15486
    old "No idea. You just traveled from the cleaning room, right?"
    new "不知道。你刚从清洁间穿越过来，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:15492
    old "Yes. You did too?"
    new "嗯。你也是？"

    # game/script.rpy:15493
    old "I did. I appeared here, so I don't know the time."
    new "是。我直接出现在这里，所以不知道现在几点。"

    # game/script.rpy:15499
    old "I see... I thought I saw something inside the cleaning cart. I reached out for it, and I suddenly felt pain and appeared in this hallway. I think there was {tip=grenades}something else{/tip} pretty small and dark next to the Sekimeiya, but I didn't get to see what it was."
    new "原来是这样……我好像看到清洁推车里有什么东西。我伸手去够，突然一阵疼痛，然后就出现在这条走廊上了。Sekimeiya 旁边似乎还放着{tip=grenades}别的什么{/tip}，很小，颜色很深，但我没来得及看清。"

    # game/script.rpy:15500
    old "So I did get caught in your travel."
    new "看来我确实被卷进你的穿越里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15503
    old "...Regarding your question, I think I might know the time, approximately."
    new "……至于你刚才问的时间，我大概能推算出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:15504
    old "The staircase door is open, so this is past the time we unlocked the attic. There are a bunch of footprints next to the door, but I don't see ours. This must mean that you and I haven't gone down yet."
    new "楼梯间的门开着，说明现在已经过了我们打开阁楼的时间。门边有一堆脚印，却看不到我们的。也就是说，你和我还没有下楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:15505
    old "These are probably the ones that we left after going back up, when we found Akaro in the bathroom. We're not before that point since there are too many."
    new "这些大概是我们重新上楼、发现 Akaro 在浴室里时留下的。脚印这么多，说明现在不会早于那个时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:15510
    old "Then we're all in the bedroom right now?"
    new "那现在大家都在卧室里？"

    # game/script.rpy:15511
    old "Most likely... I think we should hurry."
    new "多半是……我们得快点。"

    # game/script.rpy:15516
    old "What do you mean?"
    new "什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:15520
    old "I started moving toward the hallway as I explained it."
    new "我一边解释，一边朝走廊走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:15526
    old "I whispered to her."
    new "我压低声音对她说。"

    # game/script.rpy:15527
    old "Earlier, you said that you followed the group up, and when you got to the attic, Katei and Sai were already in the bedroom telling us about Naomi's letter. This is happening now, so we're about to head downstairs, and your past self hiding inside the floor 6 offices is going to come up here."
    new "你之前说过，你跟着大家上楼，到阁楼的时候，Katei 和 Sai 已经在卧室里跟我们讲 Naomi 那封信的事。现在正是这个时候——我们马上就要下楼，而躲在六层办公室里的那个你，接下来就会上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:15532
    old "That's... Right, yeah, and we weren't seen."
    new "那是……对，没错，而且我们没被人看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:15533
    old "We hadn't left any footprints right in front of the door. The ones around the room would blend in with the others, making it unnoticeable that we'd appeared there. In a few minutes, Sai and I would also arrive, and that past me wouldn't pay any mind to those footprints."
    new "我们在门前没留下脚印。屋里其他地方的脚印会混在众多痕迹之中，谁也看不出我们曾在那里出现过。再过几分钟，Sai 和我也要上来了，过去的我不会去留意这些脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:15539
    old "Should we take the elevator?"
    new "要坐电梯吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:15544
    old "Its door was open. If Shiroya was on floor 6, she'd probably hear it, and she said that it hadn't been used once."
    new "电梯门是开着的。要是 Shiroya 在六层，她多半会听见动静，而她也说过，电梯一次都没被用过。"

    # game/script.rpy:15545
    old "I didn't want to use it, but not only because of that. By going down, my past self who was looking around for Akaro on the crystal floor could see us. During the following minutes, Shiroya and I had inspected every floor and managed to miss each other."
    new "我不想乘电梯，原因不止于此。一旦下去，正在水晶层找 Akaro 的那个我可能会看见我们。而接下来那几分钟里，Shiroya 和我把每层都查了一遍，却始终没有撞上对方。"

    # game/script.rpy:15548
    old "I'm not sure what we should do. Hiding from ourselves purely because we didn't see anyone in the past seems pointless and kind of crazy, but the only place we can actually stay hidden is this floor."
    new "我也不知道该怎么办。仅仅因为在过去没看见任何人，我们就要躲开自己，这听起来既没意义又有点荒唐，可我们真正能藏身的地方，也只有这一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:15553
    old "Yeah... We should probably stay here. Maybe we'll be able to understand what Sai did, too."
    new "嗯……我们还是待在这儿吧。说不定还能弄清楚 Sai 到底做了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:15554
    old "She was right, and we had three places to choose from: the elevator, the storeroom, and the other bedroom. We knew every other place would be entered eventually, so of course, we chose the more spacious bedroom."
    new "她说得对。能选的地方有三处：电梯、储藏室，还有另一间卧室。其他房间迟早都会有人进去，我们自然选了更宽敞的那间卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:15559
    old "As we headed there, our bodies froze for a second."
    new "我们刚朝那边走，身体便僵了一瞬。"

    # game/script.rpy:15562
    old "Coming from the bedroom where our past selves surely were, we heard footsteps approaching us."
    new "我们听见脚步声从卧室那边传来，越来越近——过去的我们肯定就在那间房里。"

    # game/script.rpy:15568
    old "We knew we had to speed up, so we opened the opposite door and closed it slowly to avoid making noise."
    new "我们知道必须加快脚步，便推开对面那扇门，再缓缓合上，免得发出声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:15574
    old "What do we do...?"
    new "我们该怎么办……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15575
    old "In a quiet voice, Shiroya asked the same question I had. It was my third trip through time, but that instance didn't seem like we'd get much out of it, given how Shiroya had already witnessed the attic the previous travel."
    new "Shiroya 压低声音，问的正是我心里的疑问。这已经是我第三次时间穿越，可这一次似乎不会有多大收获——毕竟上一趟穿越时，Shiroya 已经亲眼看过阁楼里的情形。"

    # game/script.rpy:15576
    old "Was this door closed while you watched from the hallway?"
    new "你在走廊上守着的时候，这扇门是关着的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:15578
    old "We should just stay here, then. It's hard to believe anything important will happen, but we didn't come back until fifty minutes after we left, so we might have to be here a while."
    new "那就待在这儿吧。很难相信会发生什么要紧的事，但我们离开后过了五十分钟才回来，所以恐怕得在这里待上一阵。"

    # game/script.rpy:15587
    old "It was a bit frustrating because the only reason we couldn't head down and suss out the situation was that we'd already done that; we couldn't easily exist on a lower floor. Traveling under those circumstances had turned out to be a literal waste of time, but something was piquing my curiosity."
    new "让人有些烦躁的是，我们之所以不能下去探查情况，唯一的原因就是已经下去过了；我们没法轻易待在下层。在这种情况下再穿越一次，纯粹是浪费时间，不过有件事却勾起了我的好奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:15590
    old "Even though there shouldn't have been any danger, we didn't feel safe staying there because someone could discover us simply by opening the door. For that reason, we went up the ladder and sat on a bed above, where we could speak without being easily heard."
    new "按理说那里不该有什么危险，可只要有人一开门就能发现我们，待在那里终究不踏实。于是我们爬上梯子，坐到上面的床上，这样说话不容易被听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:15597
    old "I took a pillow and shook it, removing a bit of dust from the cover. It wasn't hygienic in the slightest, but I rested my head on it since my body noticeably demanded it."
    new "我拿过一个枕头抖了抖，掸掉枕套上的一点灰。这实在谈不上卫生，可身体已经明显撑不住了，我还是把头枕了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:15600
    old "While Shiroya did the same, we were startled by a sound. As was becoming common, it was the sound of a door closing, and it came from the hallway."
    new "Shiroya 也照样做了，这时一个声响把我们吓了一跳。像近来常见的那样，是关门的声音，从走廊那边传来。"

    # game/script.rpy:15605
    old "It must be us..."
    new "应该就是我们吧……"

    # game/script.rpy:15606
    old "Right. We'll be back in fifty minutes, then."
    new "对。那我们五十分钟后回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:15620
    old "Before that thought could become too overwhelming, I began speaking about a detail that I'd noticed."
    new "趁这个念头还没压得我喘不过气，我开口说起了自己注意到的一个细节。"

    # game/script.rpy:15621
    old "So, Sai most likely stored the Sekimeiya in the cleaning cart. He wanted to either activate it or move it. I'm not sure why, but he knew a search was coming."
    new "这么说，Sai 很可能是把 Sekimeiya 放进了清洁推车。他想激活它，或者把它转移走。原因不清楚，但他事先知道会有人来搜。"

    # game/script.rpy:15622
    old "He might've hidden two of them, right? I never really got to see it, so it's possible there were two inside the cart. The plastic bag and the light being dim meant I couldn't exactly see inside it, and I only noticed something strange when I saw a glow coming from the inside."
    new "他也许藏了两个吧？我一直没能看仔细，所以推车里有两个也有可能。有塑料袋隔着，光线又暗，我看不清里面的东西，直到看见里面透出光，才觉得不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:15623
    old "I see. You did feel a burn, didn't you?"
    new "原来如此。你确实感到过灼痛吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:15625
    old "Yes, when I touched the Sekimeiya. It disappeared as soon as I changed places."
    new "嗯，就在我碰到 Sekimeiya 的时候。我一换位置，那种感觉就消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15626
    old "Precisely. I think this means that our bodies now aren't the same ones we traveled with. If they were, the burn would still persist, and you'd still feel it."
    new "正是如此。我想这说明，我们现在的身体已经不是穿越时的那具身体了。否则灼痛会一直留着，你也应该还能感觉到。"

    # game/script.rpy:15627
    old "I suppose so..."
    new "大概是这样吧……"

    # game/script.rpy:15630
    old "I think we went about an hour to the past. I'm not sure if this is a coincidence, but that's twenty minutes more than my second travel. First, I went twenty minutes back. Then forty, now maybe an hour. Every subsequent travel has had an incremental increase of twenty minutes."
    new "我想我们回到了大约一小时前。不知道是不是巧合，但这比我第二次穿越多了二十分钟。第一次回到了二十分钟前，然后是四十分钟前，现在也许是一小时前。之后每一次穿越，时间都增加二十分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:15631
    old "But I activated the Sekimeiya this time, and this is only my second time."
    new "可这次是我激活了 Sekimeiya，而且我才第二次穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:15632
    old "I know, which is why I still think it could be a coincidence."
    new "我知道，所以我才说这可能只是巧合。"

    # game/script.rpy:15633
    old "Remember what we thought earlier? That the time traveled is dependent on the amount of time the Sekimeiya's not in the cold? That might remain consistent.{w} I'd say we traveled at approximately {time=12:40.} The one before this was at {time=11:50}, and after that, you saw the Sekimeiya had powered off. That Sekimeiya shouldn't have been put in the cabinet again, so if it's the one you activated, it was out of the cabinet for a long time."
    new "还记得我们之前的推测吗？穿越的时间长短，取决于 Sekimeiya 离开低温环境多久。这一点或许仍然成立。{w} 我们大概是在 {time=12:40.} 穿越的。上一次是在 {time=11:50}，之后你看到 Sekimeiya 已经断电了。它应该没有再被放回展示柜，所以如果你激活的就是它，那它离开展示柜已经很久了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15635
    old "Right, so we would've gone this far back."
    new "嗯，所以我们才会回到这么早。"

    # game/script.rpy:15636
    old "But the origin of the Sai I saw downstairs still doesn't make sense. He traveled to the past at some point to appear there, but if he did it between this time span, he would have reset the Sekimeiya. You didn't see him going down from the attic, and neither did the others... I can't figure out what happened with him."
    new "但我在楼下见到的那个 Sai 是从哪儿来的，还是说不通。他肯定是在某个时刻穿越回了过去，才会出现在那里；可如果是在这段时间里做的，他就会让 Sekimeiya 重置。你没看见他从阁楼下去，其他人也没看见……我实在想不明白他到底出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:15639
    old "Can't he just go back to the past after {time=12:40}?"
    new "他不能在 {time=12:40} 之后再回到过去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:15640
    old "Yes, but if that's what happened, it means that his surprise at seeing me was fake. It means he knew everything that would occur. I really don't think that's what happened."
    new "可以，但真是那样的话，说明他看见我时的惊讶是装出来的，说明他对要发生的一切了然于胸。我实在不觉得事情会是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:15641
    old "Hm...{w} Well, there's still the Sekimeiya he had in his hip pack, right? Maybe he traveled using that one."
    new "嗯……{w} 对了，他腰包里不是还放着一个 Sekimeiya 吗？也许他是用那个穿越的。"

    # game/script.rpy:15642
    old "I can't say since the origin of that Sekimeiya is a mystery in itself. If he did use that one, it was somewhere else when we traveled from the cleaning room. It could be that Sai ignored us to go use that one instead..."
    new "不好说，那个 Sekimeiya 的来历本身就是个谜。如果他真用了那个，那我们从清洁间穿越的时候，它应该在别处。也可能 Sai 根本不管我们，是去用那个了……"

    # game/script.rpy:15643
    old "Both of us sighed. The possibility of spending a very long time there had forced its way in front of us, and if we knew what was going on, the thought might've been a bit more bearable. On the other hand, it was also useful to have information that could protect us."
    new "我们俩都叹了口气。可能要在这里待上很久——这个可能性已经硬生生摆在我们面前；要是能弄清到底发生了什么，这个念头或许还能让人好受些。不过，掌握能保护我们的信息也总归有用。"

    # game/script.rpy:15644
    old "Shiroya had apparently recovered somewhat from her grief at Naomi's death, but I was sure it was due to absurdity. Someone dying twice made the whole thing surreal and removed from reality."
    new "Shiroya 似乎已经从 Naomi 之死的悲痛中恢复了些，但我确信那只是因为事情太荒诞。一个人死了两次，整件事便显得离奇而脱离现实。"

    # game/script.rpy:15648
    old "I spoke again after a few seconds, as I hadn't yet explained what had piqued my curiosity about our travel."
    new "几秒后，我又开了口，因为我还没说明这次穿越中究竟是什么勾起了我的好奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:15649
    old "The place we teleport to has seemed random every travel. But if we believe the amount of time traveled isn't at all random, it's hard to believe the place would be."
    new "每次穿越，我们传送到的地点看上去都很随意。可既然我们相信穿越的时间长短绝非随机，那就很难相信地点会是随机的。"

    # game/script.rpy:15650
    old "You thought of something?"
    new "你想到什么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:15651
    old "Not exactly, but I appeared in the living room while you appeared in the hallway. There was a time when those were our locations, right?"
    new "也算不上。不过，我出现在客厅，你出现在走廊。有那么一段时间，我们正好就在这两个位置，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:15652
    old "Huh? Definitely not an hour before we traveled, right? At that point, we were all in the other bedroom.{w} Oh, you mean later?"
    new "咦？总不会是穿越前一小时吧？那时候我们都在另一间卧室里。{w} 哦，你是指之后？"

    # game/script.rpy:15653
    old "Yes... When I explained to the others what Sai and I did downstairs, I mentioned that we briefly came up to the attic. I didn't elaborate on that, but we went to grab a battery. At that point, you were in the hallway, listening to the conversation going on. That coincides with the locations we appeared at, right?"
    new "对……我向其他人说明我和 Sai 在楼下做了什么时，提到过我们短暂上过阁楼。我没细说，其实我们是去拿电池。那时你就在走廊里，听着那边的谈话。这和我们的出现地点正好对得上，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:15654
    old "I... think so. I didn't notice you two back then since I was paying close attention to the bedroom."
    new "我……想是吧。那时我一直在留意卧室那边，没注意到你们俩。"

    # game/script.rpy:15657
    old "That had to indicate something. On the surface, the location you appeared could seem like something trivial, but with how many things didn't make sense, understanding smaller mysteries could work well to decipher others."
    new "这一定意味着什么。乍看之下，出现的地点似乎无关紧要，可既然有这么多说不通的地方，解开这些小谜团，或许正好能帮我们看懂其他的。"

    # game/script.rpy:15658
    old "For example, if we figured out what determined our arriving location, we could predict where we'd appear if we were to touch the Sekimeiya. That could help us decide if traveling purposely would be a good idea."
    new "比如，要是弄清是什么决定了我们的落点，就能预测碰到 Sekimeiya 后会在哪里出现。这有助于判断主动穿越是否明智。"

    # game/script.rpy:15659
    old "Oh... So where we appeared might be related. We went an hour to the past, and at around {time=12:10} both of us were in the attic, right?"
    new "哦……那我们出现的地方也许与此有关。我们回到了一小时前，而在 {time=12:10} 前后，我们两个都在阁楼，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:15660
    old "That would hold up, I think. That's around when Sai and I went to the living room."
    new "我觉得说得通。差不多就是我和 Sai 去客厅的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:15662
    old "Well, you said we traveled at around {time=12:40}, so to {time=11:40.} That means {time=12:10} was the middle point."
    new "你说我们是在 {time=12:40} 左右穿越的，回到了 {time=11:40.} 那 {time=12:10} 正好是中间点。"

    # game/script.rpy:15663
    old "Oh, hm... You're right."
    new "哦，嗯……你说得对。"

    # game/script.rpy:15664
    old "I thought about it and quickly found direct contradictions."
    new "我仔细一想，马上就发现了直接的矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:15667
    old "It's not consistent, though."
    new "可这对不上。"

    # game/script.rpy:15668
    old "\"The location we appear at is determined by the midpoint of the distance traveled\". It sounds promising, but it only happened during this travel."
    new "「出现地点由穿越时间跨度的中点决定」。这个说法听着挺有道理，可只在这一次穿越时成立。"

    # game/script.rpy:15669
    old "The first time, I appeared in hallway A. I went twenty minutes to the past, so at the midpoint before traveling, ten minutes later, I would've been next to the stairs. That was when I was being told that the Sekimeiya disappeared from the cabinet for the first time."
    new "第一次，我出现在 A走廊。我回到了二十分钟前，所以穿越前的中点——也就是我到达后十分钟——我应该在楼梯旁。那时我第一次听到有人说 Sekimeiya 从展示柜里消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15670
    old "However, now that I think about it, around five minutes later, at fifteen out of those twenty, I was in the hallway, keeping watch from the lobby while the others looked through every room. That's pretty much where I appeared, so it could actually have been that same position."
    new "不过现在回想，从我出现的时候算起大约五分钟后，也就是那二十分钟里的第十五分钟，我就在走廊，从大厅那边望风，其他人则在逐个房间搜查。那和我出现的位置差不多，所以或许真是同一个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:15671
    old "I-I see. So you appeared where you were at three-fourths of the distance traveled...?"
    new "原、原来如此。也就是说，你出现在穿越时长走到四分之三时所在的位置……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15672
    old "I have no idea. I said I was there fifteen minutes after the point I appeared, but I can't be sure about the exact number of minutes."
    new "我也不清楚。我说过自己是在出现后十五分钟待在那里，但具体是几分钟，我没法确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:15675
    old "This falls apart in the second travel, though. We went forty minutes to the past, and I appeared in the security room while you appeared in the floor 2 offices. Not only that, but I was sitting down in midair."
    new "可这个说法在第二次穿越时就不成立了。我们回到了四十分钟前，我出现在监控室，你出现在二楼的办公室。而且，我还是坐在半空中的。"

    # game/script.rpy:15676
    old "We traveled from {time=11:50} to {time=11:10}, and during those forty minutes, I was never in the security room. We just found the second Naomi and moved back and forth between the attic and the crystal floor."
    new "我们从 {time=11:50} 穿越到 {time=11:10}，而那四十分钟里，我从没进过监控室。我们只是发现了第二个 Naomi，然后在阁楼和水晶层之间来回跑。"

    # game/script.rpy:15677
    old "Yeah... During that time, I never entered the second floor's offices either. Well, before we found Akaro in the bathroom, we came down from the attic and searched every floor, but I didn't step very far into the partitions since everyone else was looking too. I appeared deep into the second one, so it can't be from that time."
    new "是啊……那段时间我也没进过二楼的办公室。嗯，在洗手间找到 Akaro 之前，我们从阁楼下来，把每一层都搜了一遍，可其他人也在找，所以我没往隔间深处走。我出现的地方是第二间的深处，所以不可能是在那时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:15678
    old "So we can't get anywhere with this. Appearing where both of us were at {time=12:10} could be a coincidence, but if it isn't, I have no idea what determined it."
    new "我们各自出现在 {time=12:10} 时所在的位置，也许只是巧合；可如果不是巧合，我完全想不出是什么决定的。"

    # game/script.rpy:15682
    old "As I said that, I thought of another valuable thing we could get out of figuring out what determined the appearing location."
    new "说完这些，我又想到，若能弄清出现地点由什么决定，还能得到另一项有用的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:15683
    old "We were dealing with Sai and a culprit who had traveled with the Sekimeiya. If the place you appeared somehow depended on a previous location, we could know exactly where someone had been in the past if we knew the location they'd appeared in, effectively drawing information out of them.{w} I couldn't apply it to Sai, since I hadn't seen him appearing anywhere, but it was something to keep in mind in the future."
    new "我们面对的是 Sai，以及一个曾与 Sekimeiya 一同穿越的犯人。假如出现的地点与先前所在的位置存在某种关联，那么只要知道某人出现的位置，就能准确推断他过去去过哪里，等于从他身上套出情报。{w} 我没法把这套推断用在 Sai 身上，因为我没见他出现在任何地方；不过往后可以留意这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:15692
    old "...After that, the silence persisted. Both of us lay down completely and gave our bodies their needed rest. We had fifty blank minutes in which our existences were isolated from the rest of the world, so we weren't in any type of hurry."
    new "……那之后，沉默延续了下去。我们两人都完全躺下，让身体得到必要的休息。接下来有五十分钟的空白，我们仿佛与外界隔绝，因此不必急着做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:15693
    old "My eyes closed, and I realized that I was a lot more tired than I'd thought. I'd been awake for over twenty hours."
    new "我闭上眼，才发现自己远比想象中疲惫。我已经醒着超过二十个小时了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15694
    old "As soon as I thought that, it all came back to me. How we'd spent our past week and everything about Miiya."
    new "刚这么一想，种种往事便涌上心头。我们过去一周是怎么度过的，还有关于 Miiya 的一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:15695
    old "I couldn't see Shiroya's face, but her immobile body gave away that she was exhausted too. Our deep breathing became background noise as I subconsciously reminisced about how our life had been until recently."
    new "我看不见 Shiroya 的脸，但她一动不动，显然也累坏了。我们的呼吸声渐渐成了背景音，我下意识地回想着不久之前我们的生活。"

    # game/script.rpy:15696
    old "I knew none of that would go back to the way it was, but even though I had already accepted it, I still felt the same sharp pain every time I acknowledged the truth."
    new "我知道那些都不可能恢复原样。可即便早已接受，每次意识到这个事实，胸口仍会传来同样的锐痛。"

    # game/script.rpy:15697
    old "And instead of moving through things normally, the Sekimeiya had appeared before us. It was still unbelievable, but I'd traveled back through time more than once. It was real, and highly ironic."
    new "而事情没有照常发展，Sekimeiya 反倒出现在了我们面前。至今仍令人难以置信，可我确实不止一次穿越回了过去。这是真的，也讽刺至极。"

    # game/script.rpy:15700
    old "During the past two weeks, I'd pointlessly thought about it a number of times. \"If only I could go back in time.\""
    new "过去两周里，我不止一次毫无意义地这样想过——「要是能回到过去就好了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:15701
    old "Every time something negative of significance occurred in my life, I'd resorted to those useless thoughts. They were necessary, though, as immersing myself in a better world often seemed to temporarily alleviate the pain."
    new "每当生活中发生什么重大的坏事，我就会躲进这些无用的念头里。可它们又是必要的——沉浸在一个更美好的世界，往往能暂时减轻痛苦。"

    # game/script.rpy:15702
    old "While I thought of a world in which Miiya hadn't met such an abrupt end, I could successfully depart from the real one briefly. The only way to truly achieve that, I'd thought, was by traveling through time and avoiding the path that led to her death."
    new "只要想象一个 Miiya 没有如此突然地迎来结局的世界，我便能短暂地逃离现实。我曾以为，要真正实现这一切，唯一的办法就是穿越时间，避开那条将她引向死亡的路。"

    # game/script.rpy:15703
    old "And then, as if the universe was laughing in our faces, time travel had become possible right in front of us. However, instead of reopening the door to the normal world, it created a tangled mess, threatening to trap us in the tower for weeks."
    new "接着，仿佛宇宙在当面嘲笑我们似的，时间穿越就在眼前成了可能。可它并没有重新打开通往正常世界的大门，反而织出一团乱麻，险些把我们困在塔里数周之久。"

    # game/script.rpy:15704
    old "Not only that, but it seemed that even if we managed to solve every riddle surrounding the Sekimeiya, it would be useless for us. Changing the past was not possible—traveling back would just form a loop."
    new "不仅如此，就算我们解开了围绕 Sekimeiya 的所有谜题，似乎也毫无用处。改变过去是不可能的——回到过去只会形成一个循环。"

    # game/script.rpy:15707
    old "If we were right about the power storage, left the Sekimeiya out of the cold for a very long time, and traveled more than two weeks to the past, we wouldn't be able to change anything. Perhaps that wasn't the real way to put it: something would prevent us from traveling like that in the first place, as it was an impossibility. ...Or maybe we'd travel and suffer an accident before we could try to defy reality."
    new "若我们对蓄能的判断没错，让 Sekimeiya 长时间离开低温环境，再穿越到两周多以前，我们什么都改变不了。也许这么说还不够准确：首先就会有某种东西阻止我们那样穿越，因为那根本不可能。……又或者，我们还没能试着违抗现实，就会在穿越途中遭遇事故。"

    # game/script.rpy:15708
    old "There was no way Shiroya hadn't thought of it already. If we went back prior to Miiya's death, we'd just have to suffer it again from another angle."
    new "Shiroya 不可能没想到这一点。就算我们回到 Miiya 死前，也不过是从另一个角度再承受一次同样的痛苦。"

    # game/script.rpy:15709
    old "In my head, as my consciousness slowly dissipated more and more, it all sounded like an outlandish story I was making up. Although, in reality, plenty of time travel stories revolved around going back to the past to prevent an incident from taking place."
    new "随着意识一点点消散，脑海里这一切听起来就像我自己编出来的荒诞故事。可现实中，许多时间穿越故事本就是讲回到过去、阻止某起事件发生的。"

    # game/script.rpy:15710
    old "Be it to save a person or save humanity—I wasn't the originator of that idea. It might have been present within every person; haphazardly thinking of going back in time after a bad experience was fairly common."
    new "无论为救人还是救人类——这念头都不是我首创。它或许存在于每个人心中；遭遇不幸后随口想着「要是能回到过去就好了」，实在再寻常不过。"

    # game/script.rpy:15711
    old "I laughed inwardly because something else usually present in those stories had occurred in the incident two weeks ago... Miiya's body hadn't been found."
    new "我心里发笑——两周前那起事故里，恰好也出现了这类故事中常见的另一个要素……Miiya 的遗体没有被找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:15714
    old "But I would've already jumped into all sorts of possibilities if it had only been that. In fact, Miiya's body couldn't have been found. It disappeared in the blink of an eye due to the explosion that took her life."
    new "可若只是如此，我早就放任自己设想各种可能了。事实上，Miiya 的遗体根本不可能被找到——它在那场夺走她生命的爆炸中瞬间消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15715
    old "Despite that, parts of her had been quickly found. Her jaw confirmed her identity with zero chance of doubt. Her clothes were identified all over the place as well, and it hadn't been anything short of a miracle that Shiroya and I made it out safely without critical injuries."
    new "尽管如此，她身体的一部分还是很快被找到了。仅凭下颌就确认了她的身份，毫无疑义。她的衣物碎片也散落各处，被一一辨认出来；而 Shiroya 和我竟能安然脱身、没受重伤，简直是个奇迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:15716
    old "That was why thinking about giving another meaning to the past was also futile. It was the only way to get around causal loops: going back to the past to explain what had happened in a different way. Lamentably, her jaw had been found, preventing that completely."
    new "所以，想为过去赋予另一种解释也是徒劳。绕过因果循环的唯一办法，就是回到过去，以另一种方式解释已经发生的事。遗憾的是，她的下颌被找到了，这条路被彻底堵死。"

    # game/script.rpy:15722
    old "I was aware that I was about to fall asleep. I didn't want to, but I also couldn't resist it. I didn't know if Shiroya had already given up, but she hadn't moved in a while."
    new "我知道自己快要睡着了。我不想睡，却也无法抗拒。不知道 Shiroya 是否也已经放弃抵抗，但她已经有一阵子没动过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15723
    old "\"Can I not go back to the past, save Miiya, and threaten the forensic technicians to say that they've found her jaw?\"{w} Something like that was a complete delusion. Had I already saved Miiya? Of course not. I often used to be optimistic as I fell asleep, and I'd realize how foolish I'd been immediately after waking up."
    new "「我难道不能回到过去，救下 Miiya，再威胁法医，让他们声称找到了她的下颌吗？」{w} 这种念头纯属妄想。我已经救下 Miiya 了吗？当然没有。我过去常在入睡前盲目乐观，醒来后立刻意识到自己有多愚蠢。"

    # game/script.rpy:15724
    old "In reality, I'd personally seen pieces of her clothes with burnt skin stuck on them. I could have very slightly embellished it by thinking that they could've belonged to someone else and that Miiya had already been saved by one of my future travels, but I knew that the flesh I'd seen really belonged to her no matter how many imaginary scenarios I intended to make up."
    new "现实中，我亲眼见过她的衣物碎片，上面还粘着烧焦的皮肉。我本可以稍稍自我安慰，去想那些东西也许属于别人，而 Miiya 早已被我未来的某次穿越救下；但我清楚，无论编出多少假想情景，我看到的皮肉确实属于她。"

    # game/script.rpy:15726
    old "The next thought I had was very different."
    new "紧接着冒出的念头，却截然不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:15730
    old "{w=0.5}...I fell asleep."
    new "{w=0.5}……我睡着了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15732
    old "During all my fantastic thoughts, my consciousness had receded. It felt like no time had passed, but I knew better, as sometimes that meant I'd been asleep for a full day."
    new "在那些天马行空的念头中，我的意识渐渐退去。感觉像没过多久，但我心里清楚并非如此——有时候，那只意味着我已经睡了一整天。"

    # game/script.rpy:15735
    old "It wasn't easy to move. When I tried to stand up, I saw that Shiroya had fallen asleep on the other bed. I sat up, aware that since nobody had come for us, not much time could've passed."
    new "我动弹起来很吃力。试着起身时，我看见 Shiroya 已经睡在另一张床上。我坐起身，心想既然没人来找我们，时间应该没过多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:15736
    old "I didn't want to wake her, but I also wouldn't leave her behind to go explore. So I simply waited, as that brought no downsides."
    new "我不想叫醒她，但也不愿把她留在这里独自去探查。于是我干脆等着——反正这样没有任何坏处。"

    # game/script.rpy:15737
    old "My head was cloudy, and my muscles informed me that I hadn't chosen a good position to sleep in. With how tired I was, though, I barely cared about that."
    new "脑袋昏沉，肌肉也在提醒我，刚才睡着的姿势并不好。不过实在太累，我几乎顾不上这些。"

    # game/script.rpy:15739
    old "My movements had a delayed effect on Shiroya, so I didn't have to wait very long. She woke up seconds after I'd started to lie against the wall."
    new "我的动作过了一小会儿才让 Shiroya 有了反应，所以我没等太久。我刚靠上墙不过几秒，她就醒了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15743
    old "Mmm..."
    new "唔……"

    # game/script.rpy:15744
    old "With her eyes almost closed, she turned to face me. It wasn't a new sight, as I'd seen her woozy morning face a few times in the previous days."
    new "她几乎闭着眼转向我。这景象并不陌生——过去几天里，我已见过几次她清晨睡眼惺忪的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:15748
    old "Sorry, I fell asleep... How long has it been?"
    new "抱歉，我睡着了……过去多久了？"

    # game/script.rpy:15749
    old "I don't know, I slept too. Since nobody has come for us yet, probably not that long."
    new "不知道，我也睡着了。既然还没人来找我们，应该没过多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:15754
    old "Instead of sitting up, she went straight back to how she was. Sleeping for such a short time used to make me feel even more tired, but since there was no guarantee I could continue, I forced myself to resist."
    new "她没有坐起来，而是直接恢复了原来的姿势。只睡这么短的时间，通常会让我更疲倦，但既然无法保证还能继续睡下去，我只能强迫自己忍住睡意。"

    # game/script.rpy:15757
    old "It was clear that we needed to sleep for much longer, but we were still in an uncertain situation around someone who'd murdered the same person twice. Seeing it that way, it was mortifying to think we'd fallen asleep, because once our fifty minutes ran out, we'd be completely defenseless. ...Technically, nothing prevented anyone in the other bedroom from entering ours as soon as Shiroya left the hallway."
    new "显然，我们还需要睡上很久，可我们仍处在不确定的局势中，身边还有一个已经两次杀死同一个人的凶手。这么一想，我们居然睡着了，实在令人后怕——五十分钟一过，我们就完全没有防备。……严格说来，只要 Shiroya 一离开走廊，另一间卧室里的人随时都能闯进我们房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:15758
    old "I was sure that Shiroya felt it too, probably more strongly than I did. A creeping fear that we could be killed at any moment, forced deep down inside of us by the rapid pace of developments inside the tower. It was a testament to her resilience that she hadn't outwardly broken down, and I didn't know how I was managing it."
    new "我确信 Shiroya 也有同样的感受，或许比我更强烈。那是一种随时可能被杀死的恐惧，塔内接连不断的变故把它硬生生压进了我们心底。她表面上还没有崩溃，足见其坚韧；而我自己是怎么撑住的，连我也不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:15765
    old "A couple of minutes later, Shiroya had rolled in bed a few times until coming to the realization that she wasn't going to easily fall asleep again."
    new "几分钟后，Shiroya 在床上翻了几次身，终于意识到自己没法轻易再睡着了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15766
    old "Being more aware of the risks might have prevented her from doing so that time. After a moment, she perked up and slowly exhaled while rubbing her eyes. With a final yawn, she decided to speak."
    new "这一次，也许是因为更清楚其中的风险，她才没能再睡着。过了一会儿，她振作起来，揉着眼睛缓缓吐出一口气。最后打了个哈欠，她开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:15769
    old "...Well, what do we do?"
    new "……那么，我们接下来怎么办？"

    # game/script.rpy:15770
    old "If we look through the door, we should be able to know if we used up all our time or not."
    new "透过门看一眼，应该就能知道我们的时间是不是已经用完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15771
    old "All right... Let's see if anyone is still there."
    new "好吧……看看还有没有人在。"

    # game/script.rpy:15776
    old "I had to balance myself after standing up—my body didn't react well to the abrupt change. After I was steady, Shiroya grabbed her purse, and we went down the ladder."
    new "站起来后，我不得不先稳住身体——起身太急，身体有些吃不消。等我站稳，Shiroya 拿起手提包，我们一起下了梯子。"

    # game/script.rpy:15780
    old "I gripped the handle and peeked through the small gap that let me see the hallway."
    new "我握住门把手，从能望见走廊的那道细缝往外窥看。"

    # game/script.rpy:15789
    old "Is the other bedroom still closed?"
    new "另一间卧室的门还关着吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:15790
    old "Yes, but we also closed it when all of us went to the crystal floor."
    new "关着，不过我们所有人去水晶层时，也把它关上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15795
    old "Oh, so how do we figure out if anyone's inside?"
    new "哦，那要怎么判断里面有没有人？"

    # game/script.rpy:15796
    old "Hm... Maybe the footprints could tell us."
    new "嗯……也许可以从脚印看出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:15803
    old "We walked carefully through the hallway. Having no sense of time was a peculiar feeling, but our surroundings were fully silent. If people were still in the other bedroom, the door was perfectly hiding their presence.{w} Once we got to the living room, we identified a slight change."
    new "我们小心翼翼地穿过走廊。失去时间感是种异样的感觉，但四周一片死寂。如果另一间卧室里还有人，那扇门也把他们的存在掩藏得严严实实。{w} 到了客厅后，我们察觉到了一处细微的变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:15812
    old "Did we leave it like this?"
    new "我们走的时候就是这样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:15813
    old "We were used to looking at the footprints in front of the door, but that was no longer possible. The door was closed, and the movement of it had erased every single footprint nearby, creating an empty arc."
    new "我们原本习惯先看看门前的脚印，现在却看不到了。门已经关上，它转动的轨迹把附近的脚印抹得一干二净，只留下一道空荡荡的弧。"

    # game/script.rpy:15814
    old "We must have. This means that the group already left, though."
    new "应该是吧。不过这也说明，那群人已经先离开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15815
    old "Even though the motion of the door wiped out the nearby marks, there were many around the entire room. They were much fainter than the last time I'd seen them, but I was still able to recognize that new ones existed."
    new "门的转动虽然抹去了近处的痕迹，但整个房间里还留着许多。它们比我上次见到的淡了不少，可我还是能辨认出，其中有些是新留下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:15820
    old "I glanced at the elevator. Its door had not yet been closed."
    new "我瞥了一眼电梯。门还没合上。"

    # game/script.rpy:15825
    old "We'll need to go down, then. We traveled from the cleaning room right after we got to the crystal floor, so it'll be fine."
    new "那就得下楼了。我们一到水晶层就从清洁间穿越过来，所以不要紧。"

    # game/script.rpy:15830
    old "Yeah. Let's see if something happened. I figure the others must be searching for us."
    new "嗯。去看看有没有出什么事吧。我想其他人应该正在找我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:15836
    old "I opened the door, retracing its arc, and we began going down the stairs after I left it open. The next door was closed too, but it was unlocked."
    new "我顺着门刚才擦出的弧线把门拉开，让门开着，然后我们开始下楼。下一扇门同样关着，但没有上锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:15841
    old "We stepped onto the sixth floor and were met by less comforting scenery. It was a strong reminder of our situation. We didn't have the will to check every office, so we walked around the floor at a slower speed than normal, gradually regaining our rhythm."
    new "我们踏上六楼，眼前的景象并不让人安心，反而清楚地提醒着我们眼下的处境。我们没那个精力逐间查看办公室，只能以比平时更慢的步子在这一层走动，渐渐找回节奏。"

    # game/script.rpy:15849
    old "We hadn't used the elevator, but there was no real point to that. As we headed down, our echoing footsteps were all that we could hear."
    new "我们没有用电梯，不过那其实也没什么意义。下楼途中，耳边只有自己的脚步声在回荡。"

    # game/script.rpy:15860
    old "The silent path ended at the final staircase. Even though we logically should have heard people, we only encountered more silence."
    new "这条寂静的路止于最后一段楼梯。按理说，我们早该听见人声，可迎接我们的只有更深的沉默。"

    # game/script.rpy:15868
    old "There should be people here..."
    new "这里应该有人才对……"

    # game/script.rpy:15869
    old "Let's go to the cleaning room."
    new "去清洁间吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:15870
    old "Right, maybe the Sekimeiya's still there. I also want to know what else was in that cart."
    new "对，说不定 Sekimeiya 还在那儿。我也想知道那辆推车里还装着什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:15877
    old "We walked up to the door, which hadn't been fully closed. As soon as we opened it, we instantly noticed the drastic change the room had undergone."
    new "我们走到门前，门没有完全合上。刚一推开，我们立刻发觉房间的变化大得惊人。"

    # game/script.rpy:15887
    old "The cleaning cart that had previously been there was nowhere to be seen."
    new "原先放在那里的清洁推车已经不见了踪影。"

    # game/script.rpy:15891
    old "I recalled that it was in the corner of the small room. Aside from its disappearance, I didn't think anything else had changed."
    new "我记得它原本放在这个小房间的角落。除了它不见了，我并没觉得还有别的变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:15916
    old "Did someone take it with the Sekimeiya inside?"
    new "是有人把它连同里面的 Sekimeiya 一起搬走了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:15917
    old "N-No, I don't think so."
    new "不、不是吧，我想不是。"

    # game/script.rpy:15922
    old "No...?"
    new "不是……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15923
    old "Of course, that should've been my first thought, but there was an inconsistency."
    new "这当然本该是我最先想到的答案，可其中有一处说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:15924
    old "I'd looked at the cleaning cart a few times before. Underneath and around it, there were three buckets storing scourers and chemicals like bleach.{w} ...Those hadn't moved."
    new "我之前看过那辆清洁推车好几次。车底和车旁摆着三只水桶，里面装着清洁海绵和漂白剂之类的化学用品。{w}……那几只桶却纹丝没动。"

    # game/script.rpy:15925
    old "These three buckets... One was under the cart, right?"
    new "这三只桶……有一只原本在推车底下吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:15933
    old "They must have put it under it because there's not a lot more space here, but if you tried to move the cart, you'd hit it and the other two. You'd need to take them out first, and then you could move the cart."
    new "他们大概是因为这儿没多大空间，才把它塞到车底下。可你要推车，就会撞到它和旁边那两只。得先把桶挪开，车才动得了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15938
    old "O-Oh, yeah, I guess so."
    new "啊、嗯，也是。"

    # game/script.rpy:15939
    old "I can't say for sure that nobody moved them, but if they had, it would be really odd for them to put them back in the exact same spots..."
    new "我不敢保证没人动过它们，可要是真动过，还把它们分毫不差地摆回原位，那就太奇怪了……"

    # game/script.rpy:15944
    old "I suppose. Nobody would get the cart out, anyway..."
    new "说得也是。反正也不会有人把车推出去……"

    # game/script.rpy:15945
    old "This means that the cart disappeared too, right? And only the cart—not the buckets under it. In other words, what you were touching. This also means that we're past the time we traveled from."
    new "这就是说，那辆推车也消失了，对吧？而且只有推车消失，车底下的桶都还在。也就是说，只有你当时碰着的东西消失了。这也说明，现在的时间已经过了我们穿越的起点。"

    # game/script.rpy:15950
    old "...Are you serious?{w} That can't be it, you were touching the cabinet when you traveled for the first time. How come it didn't disappear?"
    new "……你不是认真的吧？{w}这说不通啊，你第一次穿越的时候明明碰着展示柜。它怎么就没消失？"

    # game/script.rpy:15951
    old "...Th-That's true. I supported my body on it with my left hand, so I was touching the cabinet.{w} That's strange. If this cart disappeared when we traveled, did it appear somewhere else...?"
    new "……确、确实。我当时用左手撑着身子，是碰着展示柜没错。{w}那就怪了。要是这辆推车在我们穿越时消失了，它是不是跑到别的地方去了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15954
    old "Shiroya leaned forward with a frown. She was looking inside the buckets."
    new "Shiroya 皱着眉探过身去，朝桶里张望。"

    # game/script.rpy:15959
    old "Wait... It's here! Look, inside this one."
    new "等等……在这儿！你看，就在这只桶里。"

    # game/script.rpy:15960
    old "Adopting a similar frown, I walked ahead to see what was inside. I saw it immediately: the Sekimeiya."
    new "我也皱起眉，走上前去看。一眼就瞧见了：Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:15967
    old "It was inside the bucket that had been under the cart, on top of a pack of sponges. It was white, indicating that it was already powered on."
    new "它就在原本位于推车底下的那只桶里，搁在一包海绵上。通体白色，说明它已经启动了。"

    # game/script.rpy:15973
    old "Why is it here now...?"
    new "那它怎么会在这儿……？"

    # game/script.rpy:15974
    old "I think this actually makes sense."
    new "我觉得这其实说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:15979
    old "...{w}M-Maybe you're right."
    new "……{w}也、也许你说得对。"

    # game/script.rpy:15980
    old "If our travel made the cleaning cart disappear, the Sekimeiya, which was inside it, would've fallen in here."
    new "如果我们的穿越让清洁推车消失了，那原本装在车里的 Sekimeiya 就会掉进这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:15985
    old "But why is it still here? Did nobody enter this room?"
    new "可它怎么还在这儿？难道没人进过这个房间？"

    # game/script.rpy:15986
    old "They must not have..."
    new "应该是没人进过……"

    # game/script.rpy:15987
    old "Well, what do we do with it?"
    new "那这东西怎么办？"

    # game/script.rpy:15988
    old "I thought for a few seconds. We'd lived out a portion of our recent past from up to three different perspectives. There was no need to immediately touch it again unless we needed to figure out what had happened after we'd traveled."
    new "我想了几秒。我们已经从最多三种不同的视角，把最近这段过去经历了一遍。除非想弄清穿越之后发生了什么，否则没必要马上去碰它。"

    # game/script.rpy:15991
    old "Let me do what Sai did earlier to avoid traveling. We should investigate before we think about activating it."
    new "让我照 Sai 之前的做法，避开穿越。在考虑启动它之前，我们该先查清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:15997
    old "I hid my hand under my sleeve and kneeled to grab the Sekimeiya. I touched it with my shirt, and nothing around me changed. As I stood back up while holding it, I noticed something was wrong."
    new "我把手缩进袖子里，蹲下去拿 Sekimeiya。隔着衬衫碰到它，周围没有任何变化。可当我握着它站起身时，发觉有些不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:15998
    old "Wait... It's not hot at all."
    new "等等……它一点都不烫。"

    # game/script.rpy:16005
    old "Earlier, when Sai did this, the Sekimeiya felt really hot for him. He even touched me with his sleeve. Now, though, it's actually cold."
    new "刚才 Sai 这么做的时候，Sekimeiya 摸起来烫得厉害，他还隔着袖子碰了我一下。现在它摸上去却是凉的。"

    # game/script.rpy:16006
    old "So it won't do anything right now?"
    new "也就是说，它现在什么反应都不会有？"

    # game/script.rpy:16008
    old "I wanted to test it, and I got close to Shiroya so that if it worked, the range would encompass her too. Perhaps it was a bad idea since nothing assured us we'd appear together, but it was better to try it like that.{w} Without overthinking it, I placed my entire left hand on top of the Sekimeiya.{w} After a full second, nothing had happened."
    new "我想试一试，于是靠近了 Shiroya，这样若真的奏效，范围也能把她一并覆盖进去。这或许不是个好主意，毕竟谁也无法保证我们会一同出现，但那样试总归更好一些。{w}我没有多想，把整只左手覆在 Sekimeiya 上。{w}整整一秒过去，什么也没有发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:16011
    old "Yeah, it doesn't work."
    new "嗯，没用。"

    # game/script.rpy:16016
    old "That's strange...{w} Can you think of why?"
    new "这就怪了……{w}你能想到是什么原因吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:16017
    old "Not at all. At least not if it stays consistent with the previous events. If the mechanics are completely random, it can just be that it takes a random amount of time until it starts to get hot.{w} However, minutes after the Sekimeiya that Sai had in his pack turned white, it was already really hot."
    new "完全想不到。至少，如果它跟之前的表现一致，那就更没头绪了。假如机制完全是随机的，也可能只是需要一段随机的时间，它才会开始发烫。{w}可是，Sai 背包里那个 Sekimeiya 变白之后只过了几分钟，就已经烫得厉害了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16018
    old "I don't get it, then."
    new "那我就更不明白了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16019
    old "It's... pretty confusing, yeah."
    new "确实……挺让人费解的。"

    # game/script.rpy:16023
    old "You know, aside from the obvious time travel, a lot of bizarre things keep happening around this, and someone with us is behind this whole thing."
    new "你也知道，抛开显而易见的时间穿越不谈，围绕着它还有各种怪事不断发生，而且幕后的人就在我们之中。"

    # game/script.rpy:16024
    old "We've put it in its main cabinet a few times, but they keep getting it out. The last time we saw the cabinet key was in the attic, but we shouldn't go back up just to see if it's still there."
    new "我们好几次把它放回主展示柜，可总有人把它取出来。最后一次见到展示柜钥匙是在阁楼，但总不至于为了确认它还在不在就跑上去一趟。"

    # game/script.rpy:16025
    old "We should try to understand how it works. I think working on that is better than just putting it back where it came from."
    new "我们该试着弄明白它的运作方式。比起只是把它放回原处，我觉得把工夫花在这上面更有意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:16030
    old "So what do you wanna do?"
    new "那你打算怎么做？"

    # game/script.rpy:16031
    old "This time, let's be the ones to hide it.{w} Later, we'll be able to see if anything has changed and hopefully understand how it functions a bit better. We have a chance since, for some reason, nobody appears to be here..."
    new "这次，换我们来把它藏起来。{w}之后我们就能看看有没有什么变化，运气好的话，还能更了解它运作的规律。机会难得——不知为何，这里好像一个人都没有……"

    # game/script.rpy:16032
    old "Are you sure? The cameras are still recording, and we know that every place where we can hide it is somewhere someone will eventually look at."
    new "你确定？监控还在录，而且我们都清楚，能藏东西的地方，迟早都会有人去看。"

    # game/script.rpy:16033
    old "Regarding the cameras, I'm not sure we should worry. The culprit has been recorded plenty of times, and we'll be able to justify our actions if that ever becomes necessary."
    new "至于监控，我看不必太担心。凶手已经不知道被拍到多少次了，真到了需要解释的时候，我们也能把自己的行为说清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:16034
    old "When it comes to hiding spots, I can think of a couple."
    new "说到藏东西的地方，我倒是想到两个。"

    # game/script.rpy:16037
    old "The times we were trying to find the Sekimeiya, we only really looked through this floor, and I believe every spot in the attic would also be easy to find."
    new "我们之前找 Sekimeiya 的时候，其实只搜了这一层；而阁楼里的每一处，我想也都容易找出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:16038
    old "So, I have two suggestions. One is inside a computer tower.{w} I saw screwdrivers in the attic. If we open up a computer tower and hide the Sekimeiya inside it, it's hard to think anyone will easily find it. It requires thinking about it and unscrewing every other tower until you find it."
    new "所以我有两个提议。第一个是藏进电脑主机里。{w}我在阁楼见过螺丝刀。只要拆开一台主机，把 Sekimeiya 藏进去，很难想象有人能轻易找到。得先想到这种可能，再一台台拧开其他主机，才能找到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:16040
    old "That'd be a bit of a hassle for us, though, so here's my better option: a locker."
    new "不过那样我们自己也会觉得有点麻烦，所以更好的方案是：储物柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:16041
    old "I thought of it earlier... the last key in Naomi's keyring.{w} It's likely it belonged to her locker, given that every staff member has one, and the size of the key seemed appropriate for it."
    new "我之前就想到了……Naomi 钥匙圈上的最后一把钥匙。{w}它多半就是她储物柜的钥匙——每个员工都有一个，那把钥匙的大小也正合适。"

    # game/script.rpy:16046
    old "Wouldn't Katei have recognized it?"
    new "Katei 难道认不出那把钥匙？"

    # game/script.rpy:16047
    old "Yes, just like how he should've recognized the attic's. We can try it."
    new "是啊，正如他本该认出阁楼那把钥匙一样。试一试就知道了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16049
    old "I'd thought that maybe Shiroya would be more hesitant, and I'd been ready to abandon the idea, but she didn't oppose it. Given the purpose was to further understand the Sekimeiya, it was likely she was also hopelessly thinking about using it to rewrite our recent past."
    new "我原以为 Shiroya 会犹豫，甚至做好了放弃这个念头的准备，可她没有反对。既然目的是进一步弄清 Sekimeiya，她多半也怀着同样无望的期待，想着用它改写我们不久前的过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:16053
    old "With that thought in mind, it was the first time we felt the countdown ticking along. The exit was presumably going to be unlocked in fewer than eight hours, and we still had to confirm what time it was. We only had those hours to understand what the rules were and if the Sekimeiya would ever be useful to us."
    new "怀着这个念头，我们头一次有了倒计时的实感。出口大概还有不到八小时就会打开，而我们连现在几点都还没确认。要弄清规则以及 Sekimeiya 究竟能否为我们所用，只剩这几个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:16054
    old "But the specter of the voice recorder haunted us; we'd found something that implied we'd be there for a whole month.{w} For the first time, that sounded just a bit desirable, as it would've given us more time to comprehend what was going on and how to use the Sekimeiya. It was possible someone was angling to trap us for a month just to accomplish that, but I couldn't begin to imagine how the rest of the plan would unfold in that case."
    new "可录音笔的阴影始终挥之不去：我们发现的东西暗示，我们会在这里待上整整一个月。{w}这个念头头一次让人觉得还有几分可取之处，因为那会给我们更多时间去弄清究竟发生了什么，以及如何使用 Sekimeiya。或许有人正是为了这个目的才想把我们困上一个月；但若真是如此，我完全想象不出计划的其余部分会如何展开。"

    # game/script.rpy:16055
    old "At the same time, the exit was going to open at some point, and the Sekimeiya would be exposed to the world. Supposedly, it had been found two weeks prior on a nearby mountain. It was hard to believe nobody had experienced its supernatural powers, but as I thought that, I recalled that I was also harmlessly holding it in my hands."
    new "与此同时，出口终将有打开的一刻，Sekimeiya 也会暴露在世人面前。据说它是在两周前于附近的一座山上被发现的。很难相信没有人体验过它的超自然力量——可这么想着，我又想起自己此刻正安然无恙地把它捧在手里。"

    # game/script.rpy:16067
    old "We entered B4, the room with the first Naomi. I remembered where the keys were, so I found them easily.{w} Two keys remained: the small one I wanted and the one for the door in the first staircase. I took the smaller one off the keyring; otherwise, it was too large to keep on my person, and it might've made noise."
    new "我们走进水晶展室 B4，也就是第一个 Naomi 所在的房间。我记得钥匙放在哪里，所以很轻松就找到了。{w}钥匙圈上只剩两把：我想要的那把小钥匙，以及第一段楼梯那扇门的钥匙。我把小的那把从钥匙圈上取了下来；否则整串太大，揣在身上不方便，还可能发出声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:16077
    old "Then, we moved to the staff room.{w} I inserted the key into a locker—I'd once again been correct about the purpose of a key."
    new "随后我们去了员工室。{w}我把钥匙插进一个储物柜——我又一次猜对了这把钥匙的用途。"

    # game/script.rpy:16078
    old "I'm pretty sure it'll work. It's not for this locker, so let me find the right one."
    new "我觉得应该能开。这把不是这个柜子的，让我找找是哪一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:16079
    old "I inserted the key into another locker and attempted to turn it, to no avail. Then, I repeated the process with others until one opened."
    new "我把钥匙插进另一个柜子，试着转了转，却没有转动。然后我一个个试过去，直到有一格打开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16083
    old "Good. It's this one."
    new "好，就是这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:16086
    old "Two compartments were inside: a small and empty one on the top, and the bigger, main one that had Naomi's coat hung inside it."
    new "柜子里分两格：上面一格很小，空着；下面较大的是主格，Naomi 的外套挂在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:16087
    old "I placed the Sekimeiya in the smaller one and took the coat out. I felt through the pockets, but they were all empty aside from a single handkerchief that I left alone.{w} I put the coat back inside. It was a bit disappointing that we hadn't found anything substantial, but I hadn't expected to."
    new "我把 Sekimeiya 放进上面那格，取出外套，逐一摸过口袋。里面都是空的，只有一条手帕，我没有动它。{w}随后我把外套挂了回去。什么像样的线索都没找到，多少有些失望，不过这本来也在意料之中。"

    # game/script.rpy:16090
    old "I closed the door and locked it with the key while Shiroya observed all my actions from the side."
    new "我关上柜门，用钥匙锁好，Shiroya 一直在一旁看着我做完这些。"

    # game/script.rpy:16094
    old "That's it, then. At least there are no security cameras here, so we won't be seen hiding it."
    new "那就这样吧。至少这里没有监控，我们藏东西的过程不会被人看到。"

    # game/script.rpy:16099
    old "I know. That's good."
    new "我知道。这样正好。"

    # game/script.rpy:16100
    old "By the way, regarding the cart disappearing...{w} I think it makes more sense than not. What's really strange is that apparently nobody noticed the Sekimeiya after it fell."
    new "对了，关于推车消失的事……{w}我倒觉得这样才说得通。真正奇怪的是，Sekimeiya 掉下来之后，居然没有人注意到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:16105
    old "For example: when I touched the Sekimeiya, why did I teleport, but not the cabinet? And why did my clothes teleport?"
    new "比如说：我碰到 Sekimeiya 的时候，为什么传送的是我，而不是展示柜？我的衣服又为什么跟着一起传送？"

    # game/script.rpy:16106
    old "I was stepping on my shoes, so they teleported. My shoes were stepping on the floor, though, so why didn't the floor teleport?{w} It's probably just because my clothes were under my possession, while the floor wasn't."
    new "我脚上穿着鞋，所以鞋也传送了。可鞋踩在地板上，地板为什么没有传送？{w}大概只因为衣服算我的所有物，而地板不算。"

    # game/script.rpy:16107
    old "Similarly, the cabinet I was touching wasn't in my possession, but the cart was in yours. Isn't that interesting? The cart is designed to be moved by whoever is holding it while the cabinets aren't. That's why the simple act of touching the cart makes it \"yours\", but touching a cabinet or the floor isn't enough."
    new "同样，我碰到的展示柜不算我的所有物，而那辆推车却算你的。有意思吧？推车本来就是给人推着走的，展示柜却不是。所以只要碰一下推车，它就成了「你的」；光碰一下展示柜或地板就不够了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16112
    old "That's about what I imagined, but it means that the Sekimeiya somehow recognized the cart was movable and the cabinet wasn't."
    new "和我预想的差不多。不过这也就是说，Sekimeiya 不知通过什么方式分辨出推车可以移动，而展示柜不行。"

    # game/script.rpy:16115
    old "Exactly, which is convenient for us, or else we could've made a bunch of other things disappear just because we were making contact with them."
    new "正是如此。这对我们倒方便，否则光是碰到别的东西，就可能让它们跟着一起消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:16116
    old "Remember the suitcase in the attic? Something similar must've happened. Naomi traveled holding it, so it traveled along too.{w} We didn't find it strange at all since it's natural to imagine it'd happen, but your purse has traveled both times when it was only touching your clothes. It has to be because it's recognized as part of your whole entity when you travel."
    new "还记得阁楼里的手提箱吗？应该也是同样的道理。Naomi 传送时提着它，它便跟着一起传送了。{w}我们丝毫不觉得奇怪，因为理所当然地认为会这样；可你的手提包两次都只是贴着衣服，却也跟着传送了。这只能是因为传送时，它被认定为你这个整体的一部分。"

    # game/script.rpy:16121
    old "But we didn't appear upstairs with the cart, while I had my purse."
    new "可我们出现在楼上时，推车并没有跟着，而我的包却在。"

    # game/script.rpy:16122
    old "Right. If the cart actually appeared somewhere else, that would indicate again that the location where we appear isn't determined by where we are when we touch the Sekimeiya, or else it would've appeared with us."
    new "没错。如果那辆推车真的出现在了别处，那就再次说明，我们出现的位置并不取决于碰到 Sekimeiya 时所在的地方；否则它应该和我们一起出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:16127
    old "So if the cart has appeared somewhere else, that position is determined by where the cart was at another point in time... And it should be easy to draw conclusions from that because it spent the entire time in the cleaning room."
    new "那么，如果推车出现在了别处，那个位置就取决于它在另一个时间点所在的地方……这一点应该不难推断，因为它一直放在清洁间里。"

    # game/script.rpy:16128
    old "I'd think so. Finally, consider this as well: when the cart traveled, everything that formed the \"cleaning cart\" disappeared alongside it. That included the bag covering its interior and the cleaning products that were placed at the front of it. All of that disappeared. It was treated like a single element you were holding."
    new "我也这么想。最后，再考虑一点：推车传送时，构成「清洁推车」的一切都随之消失了。包括套在车内的袋子，以及放在推车前部的清洁用品。全部一起消失。它被当成你手里握着的单一物件来处理。"

    # game/script.rpy:16131
    old "That's why it's notable that the Sekimeiya didn't disappear while it was also part of the cart. It was inside it, so it should've been part of what you were touching with your other hand. However, it remained in place and fell in the bucket that was underneath it, which didn't teleport as it wasn't attached to the cart."
    new "所以值得注意的是，Sekimeiya 明明也算推车的一部分，却没有消失。它就在车里，按理说也该算你另一只手触碰到的东西。可它留在了原地，掉进了下方的水桶——水桶没有传送，因为它并没有连在推车上。"

    # game/script.rpy:16136
    old "And just like we thought, the Sekimeiya can't go along with us."
    new "正如我们所想，Sekimeiya 无法跟着我们一起走。"

    # game/script.rpy:16137
    old "Pretty much. Even though it's what allows you to travel in the first place, it should've been included in your possessions. That wasn't necessarily the case in the previous travels—I wasn't holding the cabinets in the same sense.{w} The Sekimeiya must exclude itself when it comes to what it makes travel. And lastly, even if it had traveled, it's unlikely we would've appeared with it, which is what I speculated happened with the Sekimeiya in Sai's hip pack. Since the cart didn't appear with us in the attic, the Sekimeiya probably wouldn't have either."
    new "差不多吧。虽然正是它让你能够穿越，它本身也该算在你的随身物品里。之前那几次穿越就未必如此了——那时我算不上真正「拿着」展示柜。{w} Sekimeiya 在让物体穿越时，必然要把自己排除在外。最后，就算它真的穿越了，我们也不太可能和它一起出现——我先前推测 Sai 腰包里的 Sekimeiya 就是这种情况。既然推车没有和我们一起出现在阁楼，Sekimeiya 多半也不会。"

    # game/script.rpy:16143
    old "I guess you're right... This clears a few things up.{w} We should probably try to get an idea of what happened here, though."
    new "大概吧……这样一来，有几件事就说得通了。{w} 不过，我们最好还是先弄清楚这里究竟发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:16144
    old "Yeah, the others should still be around. I'd imagine they looked at the place we disappeared from, so I have no idea why the Sekimeiya was still there. Let's go find them."
    new "嗯，其他人应该还在附近。我想他们肯定查看过我们消失的地方，所以我实在不明白 Sekimeiya 为什么还留在那儿。我们去找他们吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:16152
    old "We'd been moving through hallway B for a few minutes, so it seemed appropriate to begin there. It was unlikely anyone had been near us, but we weren't going to lose much time by making sure to glance over every room."
    new "我们已经在 B走廊走了好几分钟，从那里开始找也顺理成章。应该不会有人靠近过我们，不过把每个房间都扫一眼，也耽误不了多少时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:16153
    old "The start was the two bathrooms, and aside from Naomi's body, there was nothing there. Rapidly, we began to open every door to see if anything we could easily spot was around. The Sekimeiya cabinet, as expected, was empty."
    new "最先查的是两间洗手间，除了 Naomi 的遗体，里面空无一物。随后我们加快速度，挨个打开每一扇门，看看有没有一眼就能发现的东西。Sekimeiya 的展示柜果然空了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16157
    old "The original Naomi was still partially under a curtain after I'd grabbed her key, so I covered her properly again. The last crystal rooms were as they'd been from the start."
    new "我取走钥匙之后，原本的 Naomi 还半露在遮布外面，于是我重新替她盖好。最后几间水晶展室也和最初一样，没有任何变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:16169
    old "To cross to the opposite hallway, we went through the lobby, knowing that the mechanical room was also on our way.{w} Unexpectedly, our search came to an abrupt stop when we stepped into the large hall."
    new "为了到对面的走廊去，我们穿过大厅，顺路也能看看机械室。{w} 没想到，刚一踏进那座宽阔的厅堂，搜索就戛然而止。"

    # game/script.rpy:16172
    old "People were next to the metallic shutter. We recognized them immediately: Erina, Akaro, and Katei were kneeling down next to the wall, while Sai looked at them from above."
    new "金属卷帘门旁有人。我们一眼就认了出来：Erina、Akaro 和 Katei 跪在墙边，Sai 站在一旁俯视着他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:16173
    old "As soon as we opened the door, their heads lifted to meet our gazes. After a couple quiet seconds, Katei was first to further acknowledge our presence and stood up from the floor. He began walking toward us, and we did the same until we met in the middle of the room."
    new "门一开，他们就抬起头，迎上我们的目光。安静了几秒之后，Katei 最先反应过来，从地上站起身。他朝我们走来，我们也迈开脚步，最终在房间中央碰面。"

    # game/script.rpy:16181
    old "Where were you...? What the hell happened earlier?"
    new "你们去哪儿了……？刚才到底出了什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:16185
    old "While the conversation started, we approached the others who had kept silent. Strangely, they were looking down again, wearing unsettling expressions."
    new "谈话开始时，我们走近了那些一直沉默的人。奇怪的是，他们又低下头去，脸上的神情让人不安。"

    # game/script.rpy:16191
    old "You mean when Sai sneaked away? Right, we disappeared. The Sekimeiya made us go to the past again, and this time we appeared in the attic."
    new "你是说 Sai 悄悄溜走的时候？对，我们消失了。Sekimeiya 又让我们回到了过去，这次出现在阁楼里。"

    # game/script.rpy:16196
    old "Oh. I... see."
    new "哦。原来……是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:16197
    old "After his strangely short response, we went over to the shutter. Something might've happened, as everyone else appeared quiet and unresponsive. I wondered why they'd decided to stay there, too."
    new "他只应了这么一句，短得有些反常。我们走向卷帘门。其他人个个沉默不语、毫无反应，看样子是出了什么事。我也纳闷他们为什么要一直待在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:16202
    old "Did you search for us at all?"
    new "你们到底有没有找过我们？"

    # game/script.rpy:16203
    old "Since that wasn't a question directed at anyone in particular, Sai decided to speak."
    new "这话并没有特意问谁，于是 Sai 开口了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16208
    old "You were in the attic, you said? Why didn't you come down sooner?"
    new "你说你们在阁楼？那怎么没早点下来？"

    # game/script.rpy:16209
    old "We fell asleep and lost track of time. Did something happen?{w} Where's Isla?"
    new "我们睡着了，没注意时间。出什么事了吗？{w} Isla 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:16215
    old "I asked that instinctively, but I hadn't consciously realized that Isla wasn't with them."
    new "我脱口而出，其实并没有真正意识到 Isla 不在他们当中。"

    # game/script.rpy:16218
    old "Erina, who I'd imagined would quickly answer, remained looking down at her lap, hiding her face from us. Strain filled my body, as that mere action made me imagine that something terrible could've happened."
    new "我本以为 Erina 会立刻回答，她却一直低头看着自己的膝头，把脸藏了起来。仅仅这一个动作，就让我全身绷紧——我忍不住想，是不是出了什么可怕的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:16223
    old "None of the others decided to respond either, and instead shut their eyes before lowering their heads. Finally, I noticed that their expressions were tinged with sorrow."
    new "其他人也都没有作声，只是闭上眼，低下头。我这才注意到，他们的神情里带着悲伤。"

    # game/script.rpy:16224
    old "They understood that their own reactions had started to fill us in. After a few unsettling seconds, Sai began speaking in a faint voice, uncharacteristic of the way he'd come across at any other time."
    new "他们明白，自己的反应已经让我们猜到了几分。令人不安的几秒过去，Sai 开口了，声音微弱，与他平日给人的感觉截然不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:16225
    old "Shiroya and I, along with the others against the wall, listened to the words that narrated what had taken place while we'd been sleeping six floors above."
    new "我和 Shiroya，还有靠墙站着的其他人，一起听着那段讲述：我们睡在六楼上的时候，这里发生过什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:16241
    old "Hidden Cliff"
    new "隐秘悬崖"

    # game/script.rpy:16245
    old "At the same time that Shiroya and Atsuki disappeared from the cleaning room, Erina and Isla, who were in the opposite hallway, saw Sai appearing from hallway C."
    new "Shiroya 和 Atsuki 从清洁间消失的同时，身在对面走廊的 Erina 和 Isla 看见 Sai 从 C 走廊走了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:16246
    old "As soon as they made eye contact, Sai's body visibly relaxed. As if he'd changed personalities in an instant, he began slowly walking toward the two next to the event room, who hadn't said anything yet."
    new "四目相接的瞬间，Sai 整个人明显放松下来。仿佛一瞬间换了个人，他慢悠悠地朝活动室旁那两个还没开口的人走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:16252
    old "Without a care in the world, he was the first to ask a question."
    new "他一副若无其事的样子，反倒第一个开口发问。"

    # game/script.rpy:16253
    old "What's going on? Where did the others go?"
    new "怎么回事？其他人去哪儿了？"

    # game/script.rpy:16259
    old "What...? They went to find you since you disappeared all of a sudden. Why did you do that?"
    new "什么……？你突然就不见了，他们才去找你的。你为什么要那样做？"

    # game/script.rpy:16260
    old "Naturally, Erina didn't know how to react, given that the others had made it seem essential to guard hallway A in case Sai went there before they could get him."
    new "其他人先前反复强调必须守住 A 走廊，免得 Sai 抢在他们抓住他之前先赶到那里，所以 Erina 自然不知该如何应对。"

    # game/script.rpy:16265
    old "What do you mean? We were gonna start searching for the Sekimeiya, so I just went ahead first."
    new "什么意思？我们本来就要开始找 Sekimeiya，我就先走一步了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16266
    old "What? Why didn't you tell us, then? Didn't you go to hallway B?"
    new "什么？那你怎么不跟我们说一声？你不是去 B走廊了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:16267
    old "Yes, but I headed over here since it's a better place to start with. I was gonna tell you two to come, but you were looking at me weird, so I wasn't sure if anything happened."
    new "是啊，不过我觉得从这边开始找更合适，就先过来了。我本来想叫你们俩一起，可你们看我的眼神怪怪的，我怕是不是出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:16270
    old "Those weren't very convincing words, but Erina didn't question him further, mostly because Sai's own question cut in."
    new "这话听着并不怎么可信，但 Erina 没有继续追问，主要是因为 Sai 自己又问了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:16271
    old "Where are the others?"
    new "其他人呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:16281
    old "Peeking inside the event room with a frown, Sai noticed the lack of other people."
    new "Sai 皱着眉往活动室里探了一眼，发现里面一个人也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:16286
    old "Didn't I just say they went behind you? They're in hallway B."
    new "我刚才不是说了吗，他们跟在你后面去了。人在 B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:16287
    old "The door to the opposite hallway was open, and Akaro could be seen with his own frown, evidently ignoring the sound of their conversation."
    new "通往对面走廊的门开着，可以看见 Akaro 也皱着眉，显然没在听他们的谈话。"

    # game/script.rpy:16290
    old "Sai said Akaro's name out loud, and a few seconds later, his head finally turned to face them. Upon asking him what he was worried about, he let them know that Shiroya and Atsuki had not yet left the cleaning room."
    new "Sai 高声叫了 Akaro 的名字，过了几秒，他才终于转过头来。问起他在担心什么时，他告诉他们，Shiroya 和 Atsuki 还没有离开清洁间。"

    # game/script.rpy:16298
    old "Sai, showing the strongest reaction, approached the room while letting out a conspicuous grunt.{w} He opened the door and stayed still for some time. Then, he entered the small space. Before the others had time to wonder what he was doing, he exited and told them that it was empty."
    new "反应最大的是 Sai，他闷哼一声，走向那间房。{w} 他推开门，在门口一动不动地站了好一会儿，随后才走进那个狭小的空间。其他人还没来得及琢磨他在做什么，他就已经出来，说里面空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:16301
    old "Akaro, who had a hard time believing it, stepped forward and became aware of the glaring contradiction within the room."
    new "Akaro 难以置信，走上前去，随即察觉到房间里那处再明显不过的矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:16302
    old "Seeing his dumbfounded face, Erina and Isla got closer too. The four of them saw that not only had Shiroya and Atsuki vanished from the room, the cleaning cart had too."
    new "见他一脸愕然，Erina 和 Isla 也凑了过来。四个人这才看清：不光 Shiroya 和 Atsuki 从房间里消失了，连清洁推车也不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16308
    old "A disappearing cart was nothing compared to everything that had already happened. Once the other three stepped in, they became aware of the cause. The Sekimeiya sat inside one of the few buckets that remained on the floor of the cramped room."
    new "和先前发生的种种相比，一辆消失的推车实在算不了什么。另外三人走进去后，也明白了原因。Sekimeiya 就躺在狭小房间里仍留在地上的其中一只水桶里。"

    # game/script.rpy:16309
    old "It was Sai who first questioned its status, as it somewhat contradicted a few things they'd concluded earlier. It was white instead of the gray color they thought it'd become after teleporting two people and a whole cleaning cart."
    new "最先察觉不对劲的是 Sai——它的状态与他们先前的几项推断有些出入。它仍是白色，而他们原以为，在传送了两个人外加一整辆清洁推车之后，它应该已经变成灰色。"

    # game/script.rpy:16310
    old "Not much discussion was had. Up until then, they'd grown accustomed to Katei's voice immediately instructing them to put the Sekimeiya back in its cabinet. It was the lack of those words that alerted them that Katei wasn't there."
    new "他们没有多作讨论。此前每次都是 Katei 立刻出声，吩咐他们把 Sekimeiya 放回展示柜，他们早已习惯。而这一次，正是因为那句话迟迟没有响起，他们才意识到 Katei 不在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:16316
    old "Where is Katei?"
    new "Katei 在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:16321
    old "He followed you to hallway C."
    new "他跟着你去 C走廊了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16322
    old "Me? Then why didn't he come to the event room when we were in hallway A?"
    new "跟着我？那我们在 A走廊的时候，他怎么没来活动室？"

    # game/script.rpy:16323
    old "Doubtful looks were the only answer. Sai, Erina, and Isla had spent a few seconds talking next to its door. Of course, Katei should have been visible."
    new "回应他的只有几道怀疑的目光。Sai、Erina 和 Isla 在那扇门旁谈了几秒钟。按理说，他们本该看得见 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:16329
    old "Taking advantage of Katei's absence, they removed their full focus from the Sekimeiya and left it where they'd found it, prioritizing finding him."
    new "趁着 Katei 不在，他们不再把全部注意力放在 Sekimeiya 上，任它留在原处，先去找人要紧。"

    # game/script.rpy:16330
    old "All of them assumed that attempting to locate Shiroya and Atsuki was futile, as they'd most likely teleported through time and were somewhere else entirely. Sai was first to suggest going to see where Katei had gone, which shouldn't have taken a long time."
    new "他们都认定，寻找 Shiroya 和 Atsuki 已经毫无意义——两人多半是穿越了时间，此刻身在别处。Sai 最先提议去看看 Katei 去了哪里，那本该花不了多少时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:16335
    old "With Akaro in the front and Sai in the back, the four left the room and saw the empty hallway C. The stairs presented the possibility of Katei moving upstairs, but hallway A was the most likely option."
    new "Akaro 在前，Sai 在后，四人离开房间，望见空无一人的 C走廊。从楼梯来看，Katei 有可能上了楼，但最有可能的仍是 A走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:16341
    old "Shiroya and Atsuki should still be here even if they traveled back in time. It could be that Katei took advantage of this situation to do something."
    new "就算 Shiroya 和 Atsuki 回到了过去，他们也该还在这里。说不定 Katei 就是趁这个空当做了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:16342
    old "Sai called out Katei's name while Akaro viewed the entire situation with suspicion, as he'd seen Sai in front of the cleaning room, where the Sekimeiya turned out to be. He asked Sai why he'd disappeared earlier, which was answered the same way he'd justified his actions to Erina."
    new "Sai 呼喊着 Katei 的名字，Akaro 则对眼前的局面满腹狐疑——他曾在清洁间门口看见 Sai，而 Sekimeiya 恰恰就在那里。他质问 Sai 先前为何消失，得到的答复与 Sai 向 Erina 辩解时如出一辙。"

    # game/script.rpy:16351
    old "They stopped in front of the stairs, and Sai sighed as soon as he saw the other long, empty hallway."
    new "他们在楼梯前停下。Sai 一看见另一条同样漫长而空荡的走廊，便叹了口气。"

    # game/script.rpy:16356
    old "You all rushed too quickly to find me when I was only trying to move things along, and now this happened. We found the Sekimeiya already, at least, but now we have to search for three people, which is just great..."
    new "我不过是想推进一下，你们就急着跑来找我，结果就成了这样。至少 Sekimeiya 已经找到了，可现在得去找三个人，真是好极了……"

    # game/script.rpy:16359
    old "Sai began directing the others. With Atsuki and Katei gone, his demands met no resistance. His arrangement consisted of Erina and Isla staying next to the stairs and Akaro checking hallway B, while he himself looked through the hallway A rooms. That way, the search wouldn't take more than two minutes."
    new "Sai 开始指挥众人。Atsuki 和 Katei 都不在，他的安排没遇到任何阻力。他让 Erina 和 Isla 守在楼梯旁，Akaro 去查 B走廊，自己则搜 A走廊的各个房间。这样，搜寻用不了两分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:16360
    old "As they put that into practice, Sai continued yelling out Katei's name. He wasn't being drawn to the noise, so it followed that he wasn't nearby.{w} Drawing a zigzag pattern, Akaro and Sai met in the lobby after looking through every room in their respective hallways. In the meantime, Isla observed next to her mother. Despite her initial optimism, she was aware of what the situation had become.{w} Sai put an end to the search by concluding that the mechanical room was empty."
    new "方案付诸实施，Sai 一边搜一边继续高喊 Katei 的名字。他没有循声而来，可见并不在附近。{w} Akaro 和 Sai 走着之字形路线，搜完各自走廊的每个房间后在大厅会合。这期间，Isla 在母亲身旁看着。她起初虽抱着乐观，此刻也明白局面变成了什么样。{w} Sai 断定机械室是空的，结束了这次搜索。"

    # game/script.rpy:16368
    old "They walked back to the starting point, where Erina and Isla waited. Once the four of them knew that they were the only people on that floor, they could only speculate on where Katei'd gone off to. With a free way to the other floors, he could have been anywhere, and even though they'd quickly accepted that Shiroya and Atsuki had once again traveled through time, they should've reappeared by that point."
    new "他们回到出发的地方，Erina 和 Isla 正在那里等候。四人确认这一层只剩他们之后，也只能猜测 Katei 去了哪里。通往其他楼层的路畅通无阻，他可能在任何地方；尽管他们很快接受了 Shiroya 和 Atsuki 又一次穿越时间的事实，可到这时他们也该重新出现了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16369
    old "Atsuki's and Shiroya's actions weren't openly questioned. After all, everyone had assumed they'd found the Sekimeiya and touched it without malicious intentions. After Akaro revealed that Sai had been about to enter the cleaning room, Erina couldn't help but suspect that they were being shamelessly manipulated."
    new "没有人当面质疑 Atsuki 和 Shiroya 的举动。毕竟大家都以为，他们找到 Sekimeiya 后触碰它是出于无心。可自从 Akaro 说出 Sai 当时正要走进清洁间，Erina 便不由得怀疑，有人正肆无忌惮地操纵他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:16377
    old "She sat on the stairs.{w} She was tired and had to bear the constant burden of bringing her daughter into danger. They were locked up in a huge building with a murderer, and the people she wanted to trust had accepted that time travel was an ongoing factor they'd used to explain the mysteries pressing down on them."
    new "她在楼梯上坐下。{w}她累了，还不得不一直背负着把女儿带入险境的压力。他们被困在一栋巨大的建筑里，里面还有杀人凶手；而她本想信任的那些人，早已把时间穿越当成反复出现的一环，用它来解释压在众人头上的种种谜团。"

    # game/script.rpy:16378
    old "Mentally, she was exhausted. Ever since the first time they had found Naomi's body, she had been especially careful not to let Isla out of her sight or go off with anyone else. She simply couldn't fully trust them. From finding Naomi's second body onward, it was irrefutable that something unnatural was happening, but her only priority was her daughter's safety."
    new "她的精神已经疲惫不堪。自从第一次发现 Naomi 的尸体起，她就格外小心，不让 Isla 离开自己的视线，也不让她跟别人走开。她实在没法完全信任那些人。从发现 Naomi 的第二具尸体开始，已经可以确定有某种不寻常的事在发生，但她唯一在乎的，是女儿的安全。"

    # game/script.rpy:16379
    old "Isla had initially been eager to go to what was supposed to be a routine event, but it had morphed into something incomprehensible. Erina couldn't imagine that someone would want to harm her, but the risk of being there at all gradually eroded any confidence she had in that notion."
    new "Isla 起初还盼着去参加这场本该寻常的活动，可它已经演变得叫人摸不着头脑。Erina 想象不出会有人想伤害她，然而光是身在此处的风险，就一点点磨掉了她对这一想法的笃定。"

    # game/script.rpy:16381
    old "By taking a seat, she only wanted to show that she needed a short break before the search that inevitably followed. Her own daughter, though, didn't grasp that intention, as she suddenly walked off toward hallway A while the others watched her curiously."
    new "她坐下，只是想表明：在接下来不可避免的搜寻之前，她需要稍作歇息。可她女儿并没领会这层意思，忽然就朝 A走廊走去，其余的人则好奇地望着她。"

    # game/script.rpy:16393
    old "Sweetie...? Where are you going?"
    new "宝贝……？你要去哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:16395
    old "With distress and concern lacing her voice, Erina asked that question, looking up from the stairs. Isla turned around and saw her mother's face, which she found a bit tricky to decipher. Choosing to answer the question with her own actions, she continued walking and stopped next to room A5. It was the place where gemstones had been stolen, the sole crystal room exposed to the smoke."
    new "Erina 从楼梯上抬起头，声音里掺着不安与担忧。Isla 转过身，看见母亲的脸，却觉得那神情有些难以读懂。她选择用行动作答，继续往前走，在水晶展室 A5 旁停下。那里正是宝石失窃的地方，也是唯一被烟雾侵入的水晶展室。"

    # game/script.rpy:16398
    old "Isla reached up to grab the doorknob and turned it to open her way in. From the stairs, three people looked at her, finding what they were seeing very odd. As soon as they saw Isla entering the room, Erina gave up on her brief rest and stood."
    new "Isla 踮起脚抓住门把手，拧开，走了进去。楼梯上的三人望着她，都觉得眼前这一幕十分古怪。一看到 Isla 进了房间，Erina 也顾不上短暂的休息，站起身来。"

    # game/script.rpy:16401
    old "While she approached the room, she timidly called Isla's name. Once she was by the door, the two men behind started to approach her, intrigued by Isla's behavior."
    new "她朝房间走去，一边怯怯地唤着 Isla 的名字。等她来到门口，身后的两个男人也被 Isla 的举动勾起了好奇，跟了上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:16404
    old "Isla had left the door open, so Erina was the first one to see the interior. Just as she remembered, it was dirtied by a purplish black color, and almost no brightness penetrated the coating on the ceiling.{w} The light leaking in from hallway C was the main source of illumination. It took her a second to spot Isla with how dark it was; she was putting all of the force she could into opening up a cabinet. Unbeknownst to Erina, what would then occur would not leave her memories until they all faded away."
    new "Isla 没关门，Erina 便成了第一个看清室内的人。正如她记忆中那样，里面被一层紫黑色污迹浸染，天花板上的涂层几乎透不进半点光。{w}主要的光源，是从 C走廊漏进来的微光。光线太暗，她花了一秒才找到 Isla——那孩子正用尽全身力气去掀开一个展示柜。Erina 并不知道，接下来发生的事，将一直盘踞在她的记忆里，直到一切褪色。"

    # game/script.rpy:16413
    old "Applying force with her two small arms, Isla lifted up the heavy cover of the cabinet, found deep in the room. To prevent it from closing, she leaned it on the wall. After that, she attempted to peek inside, but her short body didn't make it easy. With both hands, she grabbed the top of the cabinet and propelled herself upward to see inside it."
    new "Isla 用两条纤细的胳膊使劲，掀起房间深处那个展示柜沉重的柜盖，又把它靠在墙上，免得盖回去。随后她探头往里看，可个子太矮，怎么也够不着。她双手扒住柜顶，把身子往上撑，好瞧见里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:16415
    old "Once her eyes made contact with what lay within the compartment she'd uncovered, a nightmarish scream tore through the room, terrifying Erina while she looked in from the hallway."
    new "她的目光刚一触及自己掀开的柜格里那样东西，一声凄厉得如同噩梦的尖叫便撕裂了整间房，把在走廊上往里张望的 Erina 吓得魂飞魄散。"

    # game/script.rpy:16416
    old "But that was only half of what she had to witness. Isla's face was hidden in the cabinet, so Erina was unable to see that her confident look had shifted into an agonizing expression."
    new "可她要目睹的还不止这些。Isla 的脸埋在展示柜里，Erina 看不见她那原本自信的神情已经扭曲成了痛苦的模样。"

    # game/script.rpy:16417
    old "Erina's mind reeled in response, and as she began running to aid her daughter, she frantically questioned what the cause of such a horrible scream could've been. Had it been physical pain, or a reaction to something she'd seen?"
    new "Erina 脑中一阵天旋地转。她拔腿奔向女儿，心里疯狂地追问：这样骇人的尖叫究竟因何而起？是身体的疼痛，还是看见了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:16418
    old "As Erina rushed inside, Isla's instincts told her to get out of the position she'd put herself in. However, due to jumping upward, the front of the cabinet had suspended her in midair, painfully pressing into her stomach and preventing her legs from reaching the floor.{w} The only way she could move was by leaning forward."
    new "Erina 冲进房间时，Isla 的本能正催她脱离自己摆出的姿势。可她是往上跳的，柜子的前壁把她悬在半空，硬生生压进她的肚子，疼得厉害，双腿也够不到地面。{w}她唯一能动的方向，就是往前倾。"

    # game/script.rpy:16423
    old "Next to the door, Erina's senses all perceived the same thing: Isla, in her helpless state, inclined forward and fell inside the cabinet. Only the sound of her body landing was audible, as no yell came out. Like the curtain falling after a play, the impact made the lid fall, shaken out of its precarious balance."
    new "门边的 Erina 所有感官都指向同一件事：无力的 Isla 往前一倾，跌进了展示柜里。只有身体落下的声响，没有传出任何喊叫。那一撞震动了本就摇摇欲坠的柜盖，使它顺势合上，仿佛戏剧落幕时垂下的遮布。"

    # game/script.rpy:16426
    old "Erina let out a cry and ran as fast as she could. Meanwhile, Sai and Akaro looked on from the door.{w} When Erina reopened the lid and leaned in, she finally saw what the ominous cabinet contained."
    new "Erina 惊叫一声，拼了命地跑过去。与此同时，Sai 和 Akaro 在门口看着。{w}等 Erina 重新掀开柜盖、俯身探入，她终于看清了那个不祥的展示柜里装着什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:16430
    old "Nothing.{w} Erina didn't see anything but the five faces of the cabinet, covered by a velvet texture that, while untainted by the smoke, appeared black due to the lack of light."
    new "什么都没有。{w}Erina 看到的只有柜子的五面内壁，覆着天鹅绒般的材质；那材质虽没被烟雾侵蚀，却因光线不足而显得漆黑。"

    # game/script.rpy:16432
    old "She stood still while her heart took off. Then, she snapped and began to feel its walls, trying to understand how that cabinet had swallowed up her daughter."
    new "她僵立着，心脏却狂跳不止。接着她猛地回过神，开始摸索柜壁，想弄明白这个展示柜是怎么把女儿吞进去的。"

    # game/script.rpy:16433
    old "Unable to find anything, she desperately looked around the cabinet in case she'd misinterpreted what had happened. Akaro and Sai, however, both bewildered, had arrived just in time to corroborate that Isla's lower body had fallen inside."
    new "她什么也没摸到，便绝望地绕着柜子查看，生怕自己误解了刚才发生的事。而一脸茫然的 Akaro 与 Sai 恰好赶到，证实了 Isla 的下半身确实掉了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:16440
    old "They stepped in while Erina's next reaction was to open up the adjacent cabinets in hope of a hidden connection. Within all of them, the only contents were a handful of gems."
    new "两人走进房间，而 Erina 的下一步反应，是去打开旁边的那些展示柜，指望能找到什么隐藏的连通之处。可那些柜子里，都只放着寥寥几颗宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:16443
    old "As that wordless commotion continued, Sai moved toward the cabinet Isla had fallen into. He looked inside it for a few seconds and verified with his own eyes that there was nobody inside. Just as Erina had done, he couldn't suppress the need to reach in, attempting to find a hidden passageway. He felt the entire interior, and once he was done, he stood back up to gesture at Akaro that Erina was right: there was nothing there."
    new "无声的骚动还在继续，Sai 走向 Isla 跌入的那个展示柜。他往里看了几秒，亲眼确认里面空无一人。和 Erina 一样，他也按捺不住伸手进去，想找找有没有暗藏的通道。他把内壁摸了个遍，摸完后直起身，朝 Akaro 比了个手势，表示 Erina 说得没错：里面什么也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:16446
    old "They turned to Erina, who had gone completely immobile. Every cabinet had been opened and closed, and she was leaning against the last one without the strength to look up. Before the others had to wait, she spoke with a nearly broken voice."
    new "他们转向 Erina，她已彻底僵在原地。所有展示柜都被开过又合上，她靠着最后那一个，连抬头的力气都没有。没让别人多等，她便用几乎破碎的声音开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:16451
    old "Where did she go...? She couldn't have disappeared."
    new "她到哪儿去了……？她不可能就这么消失的。"

    # game/script.rpy:16452
    old "In their circumstances, that normally sensible claim had no basis. Of course she could have disappeared, as such a thing had already happened multiple times. The real question they had to ask themselves was how. Sai and Akaro knew that, but they didn't reply, unable to find appropriate words."
    new "在他们这样的处境里，这句平日再合理不过的话毫无根据。她当然可能消失——这样的事已经发生过好几次了。真正该问自己的，是怎么消失的。Sai 和 Akaro 明白这一点，却找不到合适的话，只能沉默。"

    # game/script.rpy:16457
    old "Tell me. Something must've happened to her, and it has to do with this... teleportation you two keep talking about. What happened...!?"
    new "告诉我。她一定是出了什么事，而且和你们俩一直说的那个……传送有关。到底发生了什么……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:16460
    old "They had realized that the room was empty. Isla had suddenly disappeared without leaving a trace. Even though disappearances had become commonplace, they'd thought that the Sekimeiya had to be directly involved for one to occur.{w} Despite that, they'd found it in the cleaning room and left it there. Furthermore, Atsuki's earlier explanation of the \"range\" emitted by the Sekimeiya couldn't explain what had occurred, as nobody else nearby had disappeared along with Isla."
    new "他们这才意识到，房间里已空无一人。Isla 骤然消失，没留下半点痕迹。虽说消失这种事早已见怪不怪，他们却一直以为，发生这种事时 Sekimeiya 必定直接参与其中。{w}可尽管如此，Sekimeiya 明明是在清洁间被找到、又被留在那里的。况且，Atsuki 先前解释过 Sekimeiya 会散发某种「范围」，这也无法解释眼前的事——因为 Isla 消失时，附近并没有其他人一起不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:16461
    old "And even though it seemed of less importance, there was one last thing without an explanation: Isla's scream. She'd let out a terrifying cry as soon as she looked inside the cabinet. However, Erina had immediately looked inside and seen nothing."
    new "还有最后一件看似不那么重要、却同样无从解释的事：Isla 的尖叫。她一往展示柜里看，便发出了骇人的哭喊。可 Erina 立刻往里看，却什么也没看到。"

    # game/script.rpy:16466
    old "Sai and Akaro told all of that to Erina, who until that point hadn't completely considered the full implications of the paranormal events she had witnessed. They wanted to reassure Erina that even though Isla had somehow disappeared, she had gone to the past and was safe somewhere else."
    new "Sai 和 Akaro 把这些一五一十地讲给 Erina 听——在此之前，她还没真正想过自己目睹的这些超常事件意味着什么。他们想宽慰 Erina：Isla 虽然不知怎么消失了，但她去了过去，在别处安然无恙。"

    # game/script.rpy:16474
    old "Erina knew that what had happened couldn't be immediately answered, so she rushed out to find Isla, hoping they would reunite soon. They had a whole building to search through and no guarantee that Isla was still in it. At the same time, a part of Erina was still trying to understand why Isla had suddenly walked up to that cabinet."
    new "Erina 知道眼前发生的事无法立刻得到答案，便冲出去找 Isla，盼着母女能尽快重逢。整栋楼都要搜，而且没人能保证 Isla 还在里面。与此同时，Erina 心里也有一角仍在琢磨：Isla 为什么会忽然走向那个展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:16475
    old "She tried to comfort herself when she remembered the recording they'd heard in the attic since, in the worst-case scenario, it told her that Isla was going to be safe in a month. For the first time, Erina viewed it as a failsafe instead of one of the worst possibilities."
    new "她想起在阁楼听过的那段录音，便借此安慰自己——按最坏的情况说，那段录音告诉她，一个月后 Isla 会平安无事。这是她第一次把它当作一颗定心丸，而不是最糟的可能之一。"

    # game/script.rpy:16478
    old "Only three people were part of the group that still remained on the crystal floor. They wanted to urgently find Isla, whose vanishing had suddenly generated the first real instance of chaos since the start of their imprisonment. They confirmed that the Sekimeiya hadn't moved from the cleaning room, and their rushed search began."
    new "还留在水晶层的那组人只剩下三个。他们急着找到 Isla——她的消失，突然引发了自他们被囚禁以来的第一场真正的混乱。他们确认 Sekimeiya 没有离开清洁间，随后便匆匆开始了搜寻。"

    # game/script.rpy:16479
    old "They continually yelled Isla's name, hoping that she would appear before them. Even though a single disappearance hadn't yet been linked to direct danger, Erina's nerves were clearly shot, which was why they went through the whole building as fast as they could."
    new "他们不断高喊 Isla 的名字，希望她会出现在眼前。虽说单独一次消失还没和直接的危险联系起来，可 Erina 显然已濒临崩溃，正因如此，他们才拼尽全力把整栋楼飞快搜了个遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:16484
    old "Having recently looked through the entire bottom floor, they were done with it swiftly. The elevator should've still been disabled in the attic, so their search continued through the stairs."
    new "最底层不久前才刚搜过，他们很快便查完了。电梯应该仍旧停在阁楼、处于停用状态，于是他们顺着楼梯继续往上搜。"

    # game/script.rpy:16487
    old "Emitting clear desperation, they hastily looked through the rest of the building, yelling for Isla."
    new "他们明显透着绝望，一边呼喊 Isla，一边匆匆搜遍了建筑的其余部分。"

    # game/script.rpy:16490
    old "Once they finished, the result took a bit of time to sink in. Not only had they not found Isla, but Katei, Shiroya, and Atsuki hadn't been drawn to their yells either."
    new "搜完之后，好一会儿他们才回过神来。他们不但没找到 Isla，就连 Katei、Shiroya 和 Atsuki 也没被喊声引来。"

    # game/script.rpy:16493
    old "As they thought, the elevator was still open, and they chose not to reenable it yet."
    new "果然不出所料，电梯门还开着，他们决定暂时不重新启用。"

    # game/script.rpy:16496
    old "With a much slower pace and devoid of energy, they headed downstairs, surrounded by the haunting silence. Erina's thoughts kept returning to the recording, which she could no longer make Sai and Akaro listen to even if she wanted to, as it had disappeared along with Isla's purse."
    new "他们拖着疲惫的身子，以慢得多的速度下楼，四周萦绕着令人不安的寂静。Erina 的思绪一次次回到那段录音——如今即便她想让 Sai 和 Akaro 再听一遍也做不到了，它已随着 Isla 的手提包一同消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:16501
    old "The crystal floor was just as empty as before. None of them knew what to do, so they lethargically walked to the lobby."
    new "水晶层和先前一样空荡。三人都不知如何是好，只好无精打采地走向大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:16513
    old "Before them was the immutable shutter preventing them from escaping and obtaining help. Erina leaned against it while the other two stayed still. Imagining how much Erina was suffering, being faced with the precarious disappearance of her child, they had chosen long ago not to say anything unnecessary."
    new "拦在他们面前的，还是那道纹丝不动的卷帘门，挡住他们逃生求援的路。Erina 靠着它，另外两人静静站着。想到 Erina 面对孩子下落不明，该是何等痛苦，他们早就决定不说多余的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:16514
    old "For a while, they stayed there, powerless against the confusing reality, hoping that waiting would lead them somewhere."
    new "有好一阵子，他们就这样待着，对眼前这令人费解的现实无能为力，只盼着等待能带来些什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:16515
    old "They knew where the Sekimeiya was, but without Katei, dealing with it seemed far from their priority. It appeared impossible that it had been related to Isla's disappearance, but no other explanation existed. Out of the blue, they found themselves alone in a huge building with two identical corpses after four people had vanished."
    new "他们知道 Sekimeiya 在哪里，可 Katei 不在，处理它远谈不上是当务之急。要说这东西与 Isla 的失踪有关，几乎不可能，可除此之外再无别的解释。转眼之间，四个人下落不明，偌大的建筑里只剩他们自己，以及两具一模一样的尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:16521
    old "The silence had continued uninterrupted since they'd set foot on the crystal floor, but the three of them had been thinking about drastically different things.{w} It was an outside sound that finally breached the empty air, coming from hallway A."
    new "自从踏上水晶层，四周的寂静便一直延续，未曾中断，可三个人心里想的却是天差地别的事。{w} 最终打破这片空寂的，是外面传来的一声响动，来自 A走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:16526
    old "They immediately lifted their heads. The door had been left open, so they all rushed to see if they could spot the origin of the sound."
    new "他们立刻抬起头。门本就敞着，三人一齐冲过去，想看看声音是从哪儿来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:16529
    old "They did so easily. Katei's figure was in the middle of the wide floor, his shoulders slumped. As soon as they saw each other, Katei hurried over to them."
    new "他们一眼便看清了。Katei 就站在宽阔楼层的中央，双肩低垂。两边一对上视线，Katei 便急忙朝他们走来。"

    # game/script.rpy:16539
    old "Where did you go...? We searched for you."
    new "你去哪儿了……？我们一直在找你。"

    # game/script.rpy:16540
    old "Sai shot the first question, and an immediate answer came that left the three of them unsatisfied."
    new "先开口的是 Sai，回答来得也快，却让三人都不满意。"

    # game/script.rpy:16541
    old "I don't know. I think I experienced what Atsuki said... That teleportation. I've been searching for you."
    new "我不知道。我大概经历了 Atsuki 说的那件事……那个传送。我一直在找你们。"

    # game/script.rpy:16542
    old "That brief explanation was all they got, as the next thing that came out of his mouth was the question they'd known would come."
    new "他们只得到这么一句简短的解释，因为他接下来问出口的，正是他们早就料到的问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:16543
    old "Where are Isla, Atsuki, and Shiroya?"
    new "Isla、Atsuki 和 Shiroya 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:16548
    old "Katei looked through the door and saw the empty hall. Three faces lowered in front of him, communicating what had occurred. Akaro, knowing how hard it was for Erina to hear those words, chose to speak and briefly explained the recent events."
    new "Katei 透过门望向空荡的走廊。三人在他面前低下了头，已经把发生的事说明白了。Akaro 知道那些话让 Erina 听着有多难受，便主动开口，简要讲了讲最近的经过。"

    # game/script.rpy:16553
    old "It was a lot of information to take in for Katei, and it only made everything that had recently happened even more confusing. Despite that, he had a few thoughts that he chose to keep to himself."
    new "这些信息太多，Katei 一时难以消化，只让近来发生的一切更加扑朔迷离。尽管如此，他心里还是有了些想法，只是选择不说出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:16559
    old "I see. I'm sorry, but I have no clue what happened to any of us. You said you searched the building, right...?"
    new "原来如此。抱歉，我们几个到底出了什么事，我也毫无头绪。你们说已经搜过这栋楼了，对吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:16560
    old "The others nodded."
    new "其余三人点了点头。"

    # game/script.rpy:16566
    old "They'd told him where Isla, Atsuki, and Shiroya had disappeared from, so he began walking to where they'd last seen Isla, as that part of the story was what he least understood."
    new "他们已把 Isla、Atsuki 和 Shiroya 各自失踪的地点告诉了他，他便先朝最后见到 Isla 的地方走去——那一段他听得最不明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:16569
    old "They all entered room A5 and were hit by the memory of Isla's body falling into that looming void. They'd lowered every lid before leaving, so Sai pointed at the one in question."
    new "他们一同走进水晶展室 A5，Isla 的身体坠入那片幽暗虚空的画面立刻涌上心头。离开前他们把每个柜盖都放了下来，Sai 便指了指出事的那一只。"

    # game/script.rpy:16572
    old "Katei approached it, finding it hard to believe that nothing had been found inside. He completely denied the thought of any opening or passage within the cabinet, so he wanted to see if he could get a good idea of what had happened or if he could reinforce what he believed had truly occurred."
    new "Katei 走上前去，很难相信里面什么都没找到。他完全不接受展示柜里有什么开口或通道的说法，所以想亲眼看看，或许能弄清发生了什么，或许能印证他所认定的真相。"

    # game/script.rpy:16574
    old "He gripped the lower part of the lid with his right arm and lifted it. As soon as the smallest gap appeared, he peeked inside.{w} Even though there was very little light, he frowned."
    new "他右手抓住柜盖下沿，向上抬起。刚露出一丝缝隙，他就朝里看去。{w} 光线虽暗，他的眉头却皱了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:16577
    old "As he continued revealing the cabinet, that frown shifted into a much darker expression. Once he was done, he could only gesture at the others to see with their own eyes, as he couldn't bring himself to say the words out loud."
    new "随着柜盖越抬越高，他的眉头越皱越紧，表情也越发阴沉。完全打开后，他只能朝其他人示意，让他们亲眼看一看——那话他说不出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:16578
    old "Hearing his faint but trembling voice, Erina ran up to see what he'd seen."
    new "听见他那微弱而发颤的声音，Erina 跑了过来，想看看他究竟看到了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:16585
    old "When she saw the body of her daughter lying face-up, her mind broke, and all of her thoughts were defied. Isla almost looked like she was sleeping, but the lack of her chest rising made Erina fear the worst."
    new "看到女儿仰面躺着的身体，她的心彻底碎了，脑海里的一切念头都被击得粉碎。Isla 看上去几乎像是睡着了，可胸口毫无起伏，Erina 不敢再想下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:16586
    old "Without thinking, she reached inside, and as soon as she felt Isla's skin, she gave out and collapsed onto the cabinet, creating a sight reminiscent of the last time Isla had been seen."
    new "她想也没想就伸手探了进去，一触到 Isla 的皮肤，整个人便支撑不住，瘫倒在展示柜上——那副模样，恰似 Isla 最后一次被人看见时的情景。"

    # game/script.rpy:16587
    old "She had felt no trace of life—only a cold piece of flesh with a texture far from the one she recognized as her daughter's."
    new "她感觉不到一丝生气，只有一块冰冷的血肉，那触感与她记忆中女儿的肌肤相去甚远。"

    # game/script.rpy:16588
    old "While the others stared with pity, Erina didn't move, her sharp cries piercing the air. The recording, which she had begun to see as proof of hope, had become an impossibility."
    new "其他人只能怜悯地望着，Erina 却一动不动，尖利的哭声划破了空气。那段录音，她本来已渐渐当成希望的证明，如今却彻底落空了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16589
    old "After some time, Katei looked inside the cabinet again while everyone kept an eye on him. He didn't see anything else; Isla rested alone in the space she'd disappeared from."
    new "过了一会儿，在众人的注视下，Katei 又朝柜里看了一眼。他没有再看到别的东西；Isla 独自躺在她当初消失的那方空间里。"

    # game/script.rpy:16593
    old "The others knew how heartless it was to attempt to solve what had happened right away, but nobody could help but think about how little sense it all made. Isla had disappeared from an empty cabinet and reappeared inside it later, the only change her status from alive to dead."
    new "其他人都明白，此刻就急着解开谜团有多无情，可谁也忍不住去想这事有多么不合常理。Isla 从一只空柜子里消失，之后又出现在同一只柜子里，唯一的变化只是从生到死。"

    # game/script.rpy:16594
    old "A third death had surfaced, and that time, someone who'd been with the group from the start was the victim. Once again, a number of questions came along with it, but no answers—not even the cause of death."
    new "第三起死亡浮出水面，而这一次，倒下的是从一开始就与他们同行的人。疑问照旧随之而来，却依旧没有答案——连死因都无从得知。"

    # game/script.rpy:16595
    old "Regardless, the unfortunate reality was that a mother had lost her child on what should've been an enjoyable day which had transfigured into an inexplicable nightmare. The rest of them verified that Isla was no longer alive, and while they were hit hard by such a tragedy, they knew they couldn't begin to imagine what Erina was feeling."
    new "无论如何，残酷的现实是：这本该是愉快的一天，却化作了一场无从解释的噩梦，一位母亲失去了自己的孩子。其余的人确认了 Isla 已经不在人世，这场悲剧固然令他们深受打击，但他们也知道，Erina 的心情是他们根本无法想象的。"

    # game/script.rpy:16596
    old "They exchanged looks without interfering with her, her body trembling as she hid her face. Eventually, she stood up abruptly and bolted out of the room, briefly displaying her tormented expression."
    new "他们没有去打扰她，只是彼此交换了眼神；她掩着脸，身体不住地颤抖。终于，她猛地站起，冲出房间，脸上短暂地露出饱受折磨的神情。"

    # game/script.rpy:16600
    old "Erina had left due to her recollection of Naomi's death. A killer was nearby and had managed to remain unseen."
    new "Erina 之所以离开，是因为她想起了 Naomi 的死。凶手就在附近，却始终没有露面。"

    # game/script.rpy:16601
    old "Even though she couldn't begin to take in what had happened, she understood that her life had warped into something terrible, regret her only companion. She took advantage of the last amount of strength she had within herself and used it while adrenaline still let her."
    new "尽管她一时还理解不了发生的一切，却明白自己的人生已经扭曲成了可怕的模样，只剩下悔恨相伴。她趁着肾上腺素还未退去，把体内最后一点力气都用上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16602
    old "Frantically, she opened every door in the hallway. Then, she looked through every cabinet in case the killer had brazenly hidden in one. Her thoughts on the matter were clear, and she knew who to suspect. Katei, Atsuki, and Shiroya could've been responsible in some way."
    new "她发疯似的打开走廊上的每一扇门，又逐一查看每个展示柜，生怕凶手就公然藏在其中。她心里很清楚该怀疑谁：Katei、Atsuki 和 Shiroya 都可能脱不了干系。"

    # game/script.rpy:16606
    old "However, as soon as she entered the huge and overwhelming lobby, her body gave out under the full weight of her daughter's death. She wouldn't be able to find her killer, and most likely, she would never begin to understand what had happened to her.{w} Suffering from the ultimate feeling of emptiness, she slumped on a wall and slowly slid to the ground."
    new "然而，一走进那空旷而令人窒息的大厅，女儿的死便如山压顶，她的身体再也撑不住了。她找不到凶手，多半也永远弄不明白女儿遭遇了什么。{w} 被极致的空虚吞噬，她靠上墙壁，缓缓滑坐到地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:16614
    old "Sai, Akaro, and Katei, upon noticing that the sound of Erina's movements had abruptly faded, walked to the lobby and saw her sitting on the floor ahead."
    new "Sai、Akaro 和 Katei 察觉到 Erina 的动静忽然消失了，便走到大厅，看见她坐在前方的地板上。"

    # game/script.rpy:16620
    old "They approached her slowly and remained at her side.{w} A loud noise resounded through the entire floor... and they understood what it had been."
    new "他们缓缓走近，守在她身旁。{w} 一声巨响在整个楼层回荡……他们明白那是什么声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:16623
    old "The cabinet's lid had fallen when nobody had been looking, sealing Isla inside while also letting her rest peacefully."
    new "就在无人留意时，展示柜的柜盖落了下来，将 Isla 封在其中，也让她得以安息。"

    # game/script.rpy:16624
    old "Nobody chose to leave the lobby. They knew that gravity, a simple law of the universe, had closed Isla's coffin by itself.{w} However, they didn't know the true consequences that sound had brought, and spent the time unaware until the hallway B door opened."
    new "谁也没有离开大厅。他们知道，是重力这条再简单不过的宇宙法则，自行合上了 Isla 的棺盖。{w} 可他们并不知道那声响真正带来了什么后果，就这样毫无察觉地待着，直到 B走廊的门打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:16644
    old "Sai finished summarizing what had happened, avoiding explicit words that would've hurt Erina even more. It was way too much to take in, and it revealed that we'd slept for longer than we'd thought."
    new "Sai 把经过讲完了，措辞避开了那些会更深地刺痛 Erina 的字眼。信息量太大，一时难以接受，也说明我们睡的时间比以为的要长。"

    # game/script.rpy:16645
    old "As I looked at Erina, who hadn't raised her head since we'd entered, I saw the wet stains on her lap that I'd missed before."
    new "我看向 Erina——自从我们进来，她一直没抬过头——这才发现她膝上那片湿痕，之前竟没有留意。"

    # game/script.rpy:16646
    old "Shiroya looked crushed. She couldn't believe such a sudden and tragic story had unfolded while she'd slept.{w} I began to feel guilty about my recent actions, ones I'd taken in ignorance."
    new "Shiroya 神情黯然，几乎垮了。她无法相信，就在自己睡着的时候，竟发生了这样突然而惨烈的事。{w} 我开始为自己近来的举动感到愧疚——那些事都是我在毫不知情时做下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:16647
    old "I didn't know what to say, so I just stood there, repelling the thought that Isla was really no longer with us."
    new "我不知道该说什么，只能站在原地，竭力不去想 Isla 真的已经不在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16648
    old "I felt terrible for her and Erina, but also unimaginably pissed off. Instead of having the chance to mourn privately, Erina had to spend hours locked up with us, not understanding how or why her daughter had passed away."
    new "我为她和 Erina 难受，同时又一肚子说不出的火。Erina 连独自哀悼的机会都没有，只能和我们一起被关了几个小时，却始终不明白女儿是怎么死的、为什么而死。"

    # game/script.rpy:16649
    old "It was a bad idea, but I asked it regardless, in a quiet voice."
    new "我知道这不合时宜，却还是低声问了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:16652
    old "...Can I go see?"
    new "……我能去看看吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:16657
    old "Sai nodded hesitantly, as it wasn't his decision. Shiroya must have been horrified at the thought of seeing Isla with her own eyes. I didn't want to see her either, but I wanted to understand what had happened more than anything. It was the least we could do."
    new "Sai 迟疑地点了点头——这事本不该由他决定。想到要亲眼去看 Isla，Shiroya 一定吓坏了。我也不想看，可我更想弄清到底发生了什么。至少这是我们能做的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:16658
    old "I didn't know how to act, only that attempting to comfort Erina was foolish. We'd told her how sorry we were as soon as Sai mentioned Isla's death, but that had been it."
    new "我不知道该怎么做，只知道这时候去安慰 Erina 是愚蠢的。Sai 一提到 Isla 的死，我们便说了几句惋惜的话，可也就仅此而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:16667
    old "Before I could move, Erina stood up and looked at us. Although she didn't have the strength to speak, she breathed while wiping her face and walked toward hallway A."
    new "我还没来得及动，Erina 已经站起身，看向我们。她连开口的力气都没有，只是喘着气抹了把脸，朝 A走廊走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:16670
    old "She needed to know what had occurred. Many things stood out, starting with Isla's behavior. She had gone to that cabinet by herself without explaining why, so there had to be something important there."
    new "她必须弄明白发生了什么。可疑之处太多了，首先是 Isla 的举动。她独自走向那个展示柜，却没说原因，那里一定有什么要紧的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:16671
    old "Then, her yell upon seeing its contents. Given how Erina had found the cabinet empty, it seemed possible to conclude what Isla had witnessed... And even though the Sekimeiya had been in the cleaning room, there was a chance that two existed."
    new "其次是她看到柜中之物时的喊叫。既然 Erina 后来发现柜子是空的，Isla 当时看见了什么，似乎也能推断出来……而且，就算 Sekimeiya 在清洁间里，也不排除存在两个的可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:16676
    old "If Isla's disappearance had been caused by the Sekimeiya, it was possible that she had seen a human body. It would have warranted the scream, and humans were all that the Sekimeiya seemed to make travel. Maybe there'd been someone in the cabinet and they'd disappeared at the same time as Isla."
    new "如果 Isla 的消失是 Sekimeiya 造成的，那她当时看到的很可能是人的身体。那声尖叫便说得通了，而且 Sekimeiya 似乎只能让人类穿越。说不定柜里当时有个人，和 Isla 一起消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16677
    old "However, I kept in mind what Shiroya and I had just discussed. If falling into the cabinet made Isla touch what was inside, she might've traveled with it if it had become something she possessed, for lack of a better term."
    new "不过，我记着我和 Shiroya 刚才的讨论。如果 Isla 跌进柜子时碰到了里面的东西，而那样东西——姑且这么说——成了她随身之物，她就可能连同它一起穿越了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16678
    old "And if that was what had happened, the source of the range had to have been outside the cabinet, or else the Sekimeiya would've remained inside it.{w} If the range came from the Sekimeiya in the cleaning room, Erina, by the entrance to room A5, should've traveled as well. Sai and Akaro saw Isla falling into the cabinet, so Katei, who had just disappeared, could've been who'd activated it. In that case, nobody would have noticed he'd traveled too."
    new "如果真是这样，那么范围的源头就只能位于展示柜之外，否则 Sekimeiya 应该仍留在柜中。{w}倘若范围源自清洁间的 Sekimeiya，那么守在 A5 展室入口旁的 Erina 也该被传送走才对。Sai 和 Akaro 亲眼看见 Isla 倒进展示柜，那么刚刚消失的 Katei，或许正是启动它的人。若果真如此，谁也不会注意到他也被传送了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16681
    old "However, the crystal floor had just been searched, so if Katei's range had encompassed the whole cabinet... it might have come from floor 2.{w} If the range went through solid objects and Katei was above the room, the ceiling was no obstacle."
    new "不过，水晶层才刚刚被搜寻过；如果 Katei 的范围覆盖了整个展示柜……那源头或许来自二楼。{w}如果范围能穿透实体，而 Katei 就在展室上方，那么天花板也构不成阻碍。"

    # game/script.rpy:16682
    old "In fact, my third travel suggested that the range could go through solid objects. The Sekimeiya had been in the cleaning cart and I'd been picked up too, so if the Sekimeiya was the nucleus of the range, the cart's walls should've prevented me from traveling."
    new "事实上，我第三次被传送的经历已经说明范围可以穿透实体。当时 Sekimeiya 在清洁推车里，而我也被卷了进去；若 Sekimeiya 是范围的中心，推车的箱壁本该阻止我被传送才是。"

    # game/script.rpy:16686
    old "After Isla's disappearance, the group searched through the whole building and didn't find Katei. If he activated the travel from floor 2, he could appear on the crystal floor, escaping the search.{w} However, it was important to note that they never found me and Shiroya, so their search wasn't perfect.{w} That theory explained Katei's and Isla's disappearances along with the lack of the Sekimeiya in the cabinet. ...Would it mean that it was all just a very unfortunate coincidence, though?"
    new "Isla 失踪后，众人搜遍了整栋楼，也没找到 Katei。如果他是在二楼启动传送的，就可能出现在水晶层，从而躲过搜索。{w}不过有一点值得留意：他们始终没发现我和 Shiroya，可见搜索并不彻底。{w}这套推断能解释 Katei 与 Isla 的失踪，也能解释展示柜里为何没有 Sekimeiya。……可这难道意味着，一切只是极为不幸的巧合？"

    # game/script.rpy:16692
    old "Isla had found something peculiar about the cabinet, and there had been something frightening inside it..."
    new "Isla 曾发现展示柜有些蹊跷，而柜里确实有什么令人害怕的东西……"

    # game/script.rpy:16696
    old "We were all in front of it. Since nobody else was going to step in, I walked forward myself."
    new "我们全都站在柜前。既然没人肯上前，我便自己走了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:16697
    old "I was afraid and worried about how Isla would look, but I needed to find something that hinted at what had happened. I began raising the lid while everyone kept their eyes slightly diverted from me."
    new "我又怕又担心 Isla 会是什么样子，但我必须找到能暗示事情经过的线索。大家都不太敢正眼看，视线稍稍避开，我则动手掀起了柜盖。"

    # game/script.rpy:16701
    old "I carefully leaned it on the wall so that it wouldn't close again. Then, I finally looked inside, hoping that the dim light would prevent the sight from being too harsh."
    new "我小心地把柜盖靠在墙上，免得它再次合上。随后，我终于朝里面看去，只盼昏暗的光线能让眼前的情景不至于太过刺眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:16703
    old "W-Wait...{w} This isn't what you said."
    new "等、等等……{w}这跟你说的不一样啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:16704
    old "What isn't?"
    new "哪里不一样？"

    # game/script.rpy:16705
    old "Sai, thinking that I'd accused him of lying, walked forward while everyone else frowned. As soon as he looked, he understood what I meant."
    new "Sai 以为我在指责他撒谎，便走上前来，其余人则皱起了眉。他只看了一眼，就明白了我话里的意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:16711
    old "Huh? I-I don't get it, why is this...?"
    new "咦？我、我不明白，这东西怎么会……？"

    # game/script.rpy:16716
    old "The others all got closer. They saw Isla resting face-up with her knees folded.{w} However, my own tiny wish had been denied by the Sekimeiya beside her, emitting a faint light which illuminated her more than I'd wanted."
    new "其余人也纷纷凑近，看见 Isla 仰面躺着，双膝蜷曲。{w}然而，我那个小小的愿望却被她身旁的 Sekimeiya 打破了——它散发着微弱的光，把她的样子照得比我期望的更清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:16718
    old "What? I-It shouldn't be here...{w} I haven't gone to the cleaning room myself, but I'm certain that when I saw her, there was nothing else here. I didn't find it appropriate to blame them for leaving the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet since Isla had disappeared, but none of us could have moved it."
    new "什么？它、它不该在这里……{w}我虽然没亲自去过清洁间，但我很确定，我见到她的时候，这里没有别的东西。Isla 失踪之后，他们没把 Sekimeiya 收回展示柜，我不好因此责怪他们，可我们之中谁都不可能挪动过它。"

    # game/script.rpy:16719
    old "Y-Yes. I'm sure the Sekimeiya wasn't here when we left."
    new "对、对。我们离开的时候，Sekimeiya 肯定不在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:16720
    old "Erina, who had been the only one to refrain from looking, gave a small nod when our eyes met."
    new "唯独 Erina 始终没有去看。我们的目光相遇时，她轻轻点了点头。"

    # game/script.rpy:16721
    old "There's no way it got here by itself."
    new "它绝不可能自己跑到这儿来。"

    # game/script.rpy:16724
    old "Katei left the room as he gestured at us to follow. Naturally, he was going to the cleaning room, so Shiroya and I instinctively looked at each other, knowing how that would end."
    new "Katei 朝我们示意跟上，随即走出房间。他自然是要去清洁间，我和 Shiroya 心知这一去会是什么结果，下意识地对视了一眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:16735
    old "What the...?{w} Oh, right, you said the cleaning cart disappeared after our travel."
    new "搞什么……？{w}啊，对了，你说过我们传送之后，清洁推车就不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16740
    old "This is too much. Does it simply not exist anymore?"
    new "这也太离谱了。难道它就这么凭空没了？"

    # game/script.rpy:16746
    old "We'd hidden the Sekimeiya, but admitting it was pointless, as that had nothing to do with Isla's death and would only make us extremely suspicious. I made sure to communicate my stance on it to Shiroya by appearing to be surprised."
    new "Sekimeiya 是我们藏起来的，可坦白毫无意义——这跟 Isla 的死无关，只会让我们显得格外可疑。我装出一副惊讶的样子，好让 Shiroya 明白我的立场。"

    # game/script.rpy:16751
    old "It's not here... We left the Sekimeiya in this bucket."
    new "不在这里……我们明明把 Sekimeiya 留在这只桶里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16752
    old "What, then? Did it teleport to Isla?"
    new "那又是怎么回事？它自己传送去找 Isla 了？"

    # game/script.rpy:16757
    old "Listen, Atsuki. I don't want to throw out useless accusations right now, but you understand that you and Shiroya are the only two people who could've moved it, right?"
    new "听我说，Atsuki。我现在不想胡乱指控谁，但你也明白，能挪动它的只有你和 Shiroya 两个人吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:16763
    old "That's not true... Someone who came from the future could've done it too."
    new "不对……从未来过来的人也可能动过它。"

    # game/script.rpy:16768
    old "You're right, but assuming that didn't happen, it could only have been you two. Katei could've taken it as well, but he couldn't have left it in the cabinet."
    new "你说得对，但假设没发生那种事，那就只可能是你们俩。Katei 也可能拿走它，但他不可能把它放进展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:16773
    old "This is the first time you've seen the cleaning cart gone, right? You came to the lobby from hallway B, so did you not explore these rooms? Why did you go straight to the lobby?"
    new "你们是头一次发现清洁推车不见的吧？你们是从 B走廊来到大厅的，那这些房间你们没搜过？为什么径直去了大厅？"

    # game/script.rpy:16778
    old "Understand that what you've told us is that you two spent all this time asleep in the attic. Despite this, you weren't found."
    new "你要清楚，按你的说法，你们俩这段时间一直在阁楼里睡觉。可即便如此，你们却没被找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:16779
    old "...You didn't find Katei either, so you obviously didn't do a great job. And you were in a rush, so you kept yelling Isla's name while quickly looking. I bet you didn't look at the upper levels of the bedrooms, which is where we were, and since we were asleep, we didn't hear you."
    new "……你们不也没找到 Katei 吗？可见你们搜得也不怎么样。而且你们当时急匆匆的，一边喊着 Isla 的名字一边草草查看。我敢说，你们根本没看卧室的上层——我们就待在那儿；再说我们睡着了，也听不见你们。"

    # game/script.rpy:16783
    old "And yes, we found it unlikely you'd be in a crystal room, so our first instinct was to go to the event room and then to the lobby."
    new "还有，我们觉得你们不太可能待在水晶展室，所以第一反应是先去活动室，再去大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:16784
    old "Forgive me, but I find this hard to believe. You came from hallway B, which is unneeded for what you're saying. In fact, since you knew the Sekimeiya had been in the cleaning room, what I find most believable is that you came here straight away."
    new "恕我直言，这很难让人相信。按你们的说法，根本不需要走 B走廊。倒不如说，既然你们知道 Sekimeiya 曾在清洁间，我觉得最可信的解释就是你们直接来了这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:16787
    old "We didn't. We just had to go to the bathroom after sleeping, so we took hallway B afterward."
    new "我们没有。我们睡醒后只是去了趟洗手间，之后才走 B走廊的。"

    # game/script.rpy:16792
    old "Both of you?"
    new "你们两个都去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:16793
    old "Yes. Does that matter?"
    new "对。这有什么关系？"

    # game/script.rpy:16794
    old "If I'm not misremembering, there's a corpse covering the entire floor of the men's. Did it not bother you?"
    new "如果我没记错，男洗手间的地板上躺着一具尸体。你们不觉得碍事吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:16795
    old "...{w}Don't be stupid. I used the other one too."
    new "……{w}别犯傻了。另一个洗手间我也用过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16796
    old "I'd admittedly missed that, but Sai stopped talking, as it had started to feel very disrespectful. I wasn't sure if he was accusing us of hiding the Sekimeiya or of being involved in Isla's death. I didn't have to say it, but I'd been ready to claim that if we'd hidden it in Isla's cabinet, we would have appeared from hallway A."
    new "我确实没留意这一点，但 Sai 已经闭了嘴，因为话说到这份上，多少显得对死者不敬。我拿不准他是在指控我们藏了 Sekimeiya，还是在暗示我们与 Isla 的死有关。这话不必我说出口，但我早已备好一套说辞：若真把 Sekimeiya 藏进了 Isla 的展示柜，我们本该从 A走廊出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:16801
    old "Well, no matter how, the Sekimeiya moved from here to the cabinet. I don't know why the culprit would do this."
    new "总之，不管是怎么做到的，Sekimeiya 就是从这儿移动到了展示柜。我不明白犯人为什么要这么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:16804
    old "Shiroya and I had hidden the Sekimeiya in Naomi's locker, so it was even more confusing for us. Nobody could've put it in the cabinet, the goal seemed impossible to decipher, and there was the entire existence of another Sekimeiya to deal with."
    new "Sekimeiya 其实被我和 Shiroya 藏进了 Naomi 的储物柜，所以我们更加摸不着头脑。没人能把它放进展示柜，目的也完全无法推测，何况还有另一个 Sekimeiya 要应付。"

    # game/script.rpy:16805
    old "...Something Sai had said bothered me: \"the culprit\".{w} He was implying that what happened to Isla was someone's fault, and one who had orchestrated everything deliberately. I wasn't so convinced about that, so we moved again to where Isla lay to determine an important fact: the cause of her death."
    new "……Sai 有句话让我耿耿于怀：「犯人」。{w}他言下之意，Isla 的遭遇是某人的过错，而且是有人刻意安排好了一切。我并不那么确信，于是我们再次回到 Isla 躺着的地方，要弄清一件要紧的事——她的死因。"

    # game/script.rpy:16815
    old "We'd left the lid uncovered, and as I peeked inside, I saw that the Sekimeiya was still present. It was white, and it emitted a bit of light around itself."
    new "柜盖我们一直敞着。我朝里张望，Sekimeiya 仍在那儿。它通体白色，周身泛着淡淡的光。"

    # game/script.rpy:16816
    old "I covered my hand with my sleeve and reached in to grab it. I underestimated the depth of the cabinet, and my fingers brushed the Sekimeiya, causing it to roll and contact Isla's face.{w} Frowning, I retrieved it properly and stood up straight."
    new "我用袖子裹住手，探进去拿它。我低估了展示柜的深度，指尖擦到了 Sekimeiya，它滚了一下，碰到了 Isla 的脸。{w}我皱起眉，重新把它拿好，直起身子。"

    # game/script.rpy:16819
    old "Remember what we thought about Naomi? That maybe the Sekimeiya replicated her dead body...? Well, I accidentally knocked it into Isla's cheek, and given how the Sekimeiya is still white and I wasn't picked up by any range, it's unlikely anything happened."
    new "还记得我们关于 Naomi 的猜测吗？也许 Sekimeiya 复制了她那具尸体……？刚才我不小心让它磕到了 Isla 的脸颊，而 Sekimeiya 现在仍是白色，我也没有被任何范围捕捉到，所以多半什么也没发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:16820
    old "Is it hot?"
    new "它是热的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:16821
    old "Slightly, yes."
    new "有一点，是的。"

    # game/script.rpy:16822
    old "Really, it was almost hot enough to hurt, but I didn't feel like indulging Sai."
    new "其实它烫得几乎有些灼手，可我不愿顺着 Sai 的话往下说。"

    # game/script.rpy:16829
    old "Since I didn't know what to do with it, I made my way to the event room and put it in the cabinet. I explored the possibility of activating it myself, but I discarded it quickly, as it was clear that we didn't truly know how it worked, and a death that seemed to have been closely tied to its mechanics had just taken place."
    new "我不知该拿它怎么办，便走到活动室，把它放进了展示柜。我也想过由自己来启动它，但很快打消了这个念头——我们显然并不真正了解它的运作方式，何况刚刚才发生过一起似乎与它的机制密切相关的死亡。"

    # game/script.rpy:16837
    old "Going back, I met Katei in the hallway."
    new "回去的路上，我在走廊里遇见了 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:16839
    old "I went to grab this from the security room. It's a little flashlight I use to move around this floor when the lights are off. It should be helpful."
    new "这是我从监控室拿来的。平时关灯后，我就用这支小手电在这层走动。应该能派上用场。"

    # game/script.rpy:16841
    old "I see. It will."
    new "我明白了。会派上用场的。"

    # game/script.rpy:16849
    old "Once I returned, I showed the light to Erina, letting her know that it'd help us examine Isla and the cabinet."
    new "回去后，我把手电拿给 Erina 看，告诉她这能帮我们查看 Isla 和展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:16850
    old "...Erina, are you okay with this? If you prefer, we can wait until the police investigate. I... do want to see if there's anything to find and learn what happened, but I understand if you want us to hold off."
    new "……Erina，你同意这么做吗？如果你更愿意，我们可以等警方来调查。我……确实想看看能发现什么、弄清发生了什么，但如果你想让我们先别动，我也理解。"

    # game/script.rpy:16860
    old "...No. Go... Go ahead."
    new "……不。继续……继续吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:16861
    old "...Okay."
    new "……好。"

    # game/script.rpy:16862
    old "If nothing else, it was good to see that she didn't strongly suspect us of being responsible even though it seemed that only Shiroya and I could've had the chance to move the Sekimeiya."
    new "至少让我感到宽慰的是，她并没有强烈怀疑是我们所为——毕竟有机会移动 Sekimeiya 的，似乎只有 Shiroya 和我。"

    # game/script.rpy:16863
    old "Based on the story that Sai told us, it should've also been possible for Sai, Akaro, and Katei to be working together and put the Sekimeiya there themselves, but I considered it far from likely."
    new "根据 Sai 告诉我们的说法，Sai、Akaro 和 Katei 也有可能联手，亲手把 Sekimeiya 放到那里，但我觉得这几乎不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:16869
    old "I stepped forward again. My intention was not to touch Isla directly, and even though I'd appreciated the lack of proper illumination earlier, I was about to use a light myself. It made me uneasy, but the darkness could easily obscure something vital."
    new "我又往前迈了一步。我并不打算直接触碰 Isla；先前光线昏暗，我本来还庆幸如此，可现在我却要自己打开手电。这让我有些不安，但黑暗很容易掩盖关键之处。"

    # game/script.rpy:16874
    old "As soon as I turned it on, the flashlight proved to be potent. I illuminated the entire room, and for the first time, we clearly saw what the walls and ceiling looked like. They could almost be called disfigured, but nothing else stood out."
    new "手电一打开，光亮得惊人。它照亮了整个房间，我们第一次看清墙壁和天花板是什么样子。那几乎可以说是面目全非，但除此之外没有别的异样。"

    # game/script.rpy:16875
    old "I moved to the cabinet, and aside from Erina, who remained by the door, the rest got closer too."
    new "我走到展示柜前，除了留在门边的 Erina，其他人也都靠了过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:16876
    old "I could clearly see Isla's hauntingly peaceful face. It was overwhelming, and for an instant, I thought I'd suddenly wake back up in the attic."
    new "我能清楚地看见 Isla 那张安详得令人心悸的脸。那股冲击几乎压得人喘不过气，有一瞬间，我甚至以为自己会突然在阁楼里醒来。"

    # game/script.rpy:16877
    old "However, apart from that, the result wasn't what I expected. The cabinet wasn't concealing anything from us. In fact, the interior was exactly as it appeared. Not a single drop of blood had stained it, and there was no hint toward the way Isla lost her life."
    new "然而除此之外，结果并不如我所料。展示柜没有藏起任何东西，里面和外观看起来完全一致。没有一滴血沾在上面，也没有任何线索指向 Isla 的死因。"

    # game/script.rpy:16880
    old "For the first time, and with a slight frown, I reached my hand out to touch her.{w} However, any doubts I had were wiped away by contacting her lifeless skin. Even though nothing indicated how it had happened, Isla was not alive."
    new "我微微皱眉，第一次伸手去碰她。{w}可一碰到她那毫无生气的皮肤，我心中的疑虑便烟消云散。尽管没有任何迹象说明事情是如何发生的，Isla 确实已经死去。"

    # game/script.rpy:16881
    old "How had the leap from life to death happened? I had no good guess.{w} I spoke in a faint voice so that Erina wouldn't hear me. Two weeks prior, a death had destroyed my life, but that was almost minuscule compared to how Erina must have felt. If I had any answers for her, they needed to be certain."
    new "从生到死的这一步究竟是如何发生的？我毫无头绪。{w}我压低声音，不让 Erina 听见。两周前，一场死亡毁掉了我的生活，但和 Erina 此刻的感受相比，那几乎微不足道。如果我要给她答案，那答案就必须确凿无疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:16882
    old "I can't know what happened to her just by looking, but there's no blood at all. It reminds me a bit of the second Naomi."
    new "光看是看不出她出了什么事的，但完全没有血。这让我有点想起第二个 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:16883
    old "So physical damage wasn't the cause, unless brain damage from a blow didn't leave a wound. It could've been poisoning."
    new "所以死因不是外伤，除非是头部受击导致了脑损伤却没有留下伤口。也可能是中毒。"

    # game/script.rpy:16884
    old "You think someone had the chance to poison her in a situation like this?"
    new "你觉得这种情形下，有人能有机会给她下毒吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:16885
    old "I'm just keeping my options open."
    new "我只是不想排除任何可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:16886
    old "I don't know.{w} If someone did this to her, sure, but in terms of natural deaths, not many things would apply. Children don't really have their hearts suddenly fail very often."
    new "我不知道。{w}如果有人对她下了手，那倒说得通；可若论自然死亡，符合条件的并不多。小孩子心脏突然衰竭，毕竟不常见。"

    # game/script.rpy:16889
    old "The Sekimeiya was involved in some way, so we have to think about more out of the ordinary causes."
    new "Sekimeiya 以某种方式牵涉其中，所以我们必须考虑更不寻常的死因。"

    # game/script.rpy:16890
    old "Yeah. ...What if traveling is what caused this to begin with? When she disappeared, she traveled through time and appeared somewhere else. If she couldn't have existed at that point, it's possible she appeared in this state.{w} Even though she reminds me of the second Naomi, that body had a head wound. ...I can't see any such thing here, though."
    new "嗯。……如果一开始就是时间穿越造成的呢？她消失的时候穿越了时间，出现在别处。如果她在那个时间点本不可能存在，那她以这种状态出现也有可能。{w}虽然她让我想起第二个 Naomi，但那具尸体头上有伤。……可这里看不到那样的伤。"

    # game/script.rpy:16891
    old "What else would leave her in this state? Starvation, for example?"
    new "还有哪种死法会让她变成这样？比如饿死？"

    # game/script.rpy:16892
    old "Well... she would have died of dehydration before starvation, and that has effects on the skin."
    new "这个嘛……比起饿死，她会先死于脱水，而脱水会在皮肤上留下痕迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:16893
    old "I gently pinched Isla's cheek, lightly pulled it, and then released it."
    new "我轻轻捏起 Isla 的脸颊，稍微拉了拉，然后松开。"

    # game/script.rpy:16894
    old "If someone is dehydrated, their skin isn't very elastic. I don't see anything indicating it here. It looks normal. Also, she'd have to have spent a pretty long time in here. Definitely more than a day."
    new "人若脱水，皮肤就会失去弹性。我在这里看不出这种迹象，皮肤看起来很正常。而且，她得在这里待上相当长的时间，肯定超过一天。"

    # game/script.rpy:16897
    old "What about asphyxiation?"
    new "窒息呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:16898
    old "Someone could easily do that since she's a kid... but there are no marks on her neck."
    new "她还是个孩子，别人要掐死她并不难……可她脖子上没有痕迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:16899
    old "Uh, I meant... asphyxiation within the cabinet. It doesn't seem very large, so could that have happened?"
    new "呃，我是说……在展示柜里窒息。柜子看起来不大，有可能发生这种情况吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:16900
    old "...{w}I doubt it. It's true that something was up with this cabinet, but that'd require her to spend a long time inside, and there's no reason why she wouldn't have gotten out. That would take a lot less time than dehydration, but it's still considerable.{w} Let's say that she couldn't escape, though. The way she'd die would be from carbon dioxide intoxication, not from lack of oxygen. Even in a small space like this, I think it'd take six or seven hours. Maybe even more since a child would breathe less."
    new "……{w}我不这么认为。展示柜确实有些不对劲，可若真如此，她得在里面待上很长时间，而她没理由不出来。这虽然比脱水所需的时间短得多，但也相当可观。{w}不过，假设她真的逃不出来。那她的死因会是二氧化碳中毒，而非缺氧。即便在这么小的空间里，我想也要六七个小时。孩子呼吸量小，也许还更久。"

    # game/script.rpy:16901
    old "It was far less than seven hours ago when we last looked through this room and these cabinets."
    new "我们上次查看这个房间和这些展示柜时，离现在远不到七个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:16902
    old "Right. The way this happened, we can't tell if it was a homicide or an accident caused by the Sekimeiya. She most likely traveled to the past, but even if she spent that time in the cabinet, it wouldn't have been enough to kill her. And since Erina wasn't picked up by the travel, it's likely she didn't go very far back."
    new "对。照目前的情况，我们无法判断是凶杀，还是 Sekimeiya 引发的事故。她多半穿越到了过去，可就算她在展示柜里待了那么久，也不足以致死。而且既然 Erina 没有被那次穿越带走，她大概没有回到太远的过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:16905
    old "There was another reason why I believed something like that might've happened, and it was Isla's yell. If she'd traveled to the past and spent time in the cabinet, it meant that Isla screamed because she saw her own body.{w} However, that same travel would've made two bodies travel back, multiplying the number every time. That couldn't be right, and it also meant that the body she saw was alive."
    new "我之所以觉得可能发生过那样的事，还有一个理由：Isla 的喊叫声。如果她穿越到了过去，又在展示柜里待过一段时间，那就说明 Isla 之所以尖叫，是因为看见了自己的尸体。{w}可同一次穿越会让两具身体一起回到过去，而且每经历一次，数量还会翻倍。这说不通；这也意味着她看见的那具身体当时还活着。"

    # game/script.rpy:16906
    old "...{w}What I'd just said replayed in my mind: probably six or seven hours would've been needed for her to suffocate inside the cabinet. That time could be cut in half if two Islas had been in the cabinet, breathing twice as much air..."
    new "……{w}我刚才说的话在脑中回放：她要在展示柜里窒息，大概需要六七个小时。可如果有两个 Isla 待在柜子里，呼吸量翻倍，这个时间就会缩短一半……"

    # game/script.rpy:16908
    old "Nonetheless, if that was completely off the mark, there was no other possibility except a bizarre homicide, which was one of the most unnerving thoughts that could come to me."
    new "然而，如果这个推测完全不着边际，那就只剩一种可能：离奇的凶杀。而这是我能想到的最令人不安的念头之一。"

    # game/script.rpy:16911
    old "I still have no idea why the Sekimeiya appeared here. You're sure it wasn't here before you left, right?"
    new "我还是不知道 Sekimeiya 为什么会出现在这里。你确定在你们离开之前，它不在这里，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:16912
    old "Yes, we checked around her."
    new "确定。我们在她周围检查过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16913
    old "Then something else happened that put it here. If someone brought it deliberately, it was the culprit, who needed it for whatever happened. If not, then it means that the Sekimeiya can teleport on its own."
    new "那就是后来发生了别的事，把它带到了这里。如果是有人刻意带来的，那这人就是凶手，他需要它来造成后来发生的一切。若不是，那就说明 Sekimeiya 能自行传送。"

    # game/script.rpy:16914
    old "Maybe that's why we didn't find it when Isla disappeared. The Sekimeiya she traveled with also teleported."
    new "也许这就是 Isla 消失时我们没找到它的原因。和她一起穿越的 Sekimeiya 也发生了传送。"

    # game/script.rpy:16915
    old "Yes... but if that's it, it would've appeared with Isla's body, not later."
    new "对……可如果真是这样，它应该和 Isla 的尸体一起出现，而不是之后才出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:16920
    old "We continued looking at her face, slight traces of pain present behind its seeming serenity. A few hot tears stung the corners of my eyes. The peaceful appearance she had was a cruel joke, nothing more."
    new "我们继续看着她的脸，那看似安详的神情背后，隐约透着痛苦的痕迹。几滴热泪刺得我眼角发疼。她脸上的平静不过是个残酷的玩笑，仅此而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:16921
    old "Although I kept trying to reach a conclusion, everything was too broad and nebulous to definitely conclude anything. At my side, Shiroya hadn't taken her eyes off Isla, and she hadn't spoken in a while."
    new "我一直在试图得出结论，可一切都太笼统、太模糊，根本无法定论。我身旁的 Shiroya 始终没有把目光从 Isla 身上移开，也已经有一阵没说话了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16927
    old "Eventually, we turned around. Erina was by the door, looking at the ground. I couldn't imagine what her thoughts were, but we let her know the gist of what we'd determined."
    new "最后，我们转过身。Erina 站在门边，低头看着地面。我想象不出她在想什么，但我们把得出的结论大致告诉了她。"

    # game/script.rpy:16931
    old "She accepted what we said with almost imperceptible nods. We didn't know what else to do, but as we were about to leave, she stepped into the room and walked up to Isla again."
    new "她几不可察地点着头，接受了我们的话。我们也不知还能做什么，可就在准备离开时，她走进房间，再次来到 Isla 身边。"

    # game/script.rpy:16934
    old "I wasn't sure why until I saw her staring inside and crying again. ...We silently watched her, understanding how excruciating the sight was but that she still had to look."
    new "我起初不明白为什么，直到看见她再次望着柜内哭了起来。……我们默默看着她，明白那景象有多令人痛苦，也明白她仍然必须去看。"

    # game/script.rpy:16935
    old "When she was ready, she stood up straight and approached us. We had only known her for a few hours, but I felt the most sincere pity for her."
    new "等她准备好了，便挺直身子朝我们走来。我们认识她才不过几个小时，我却对她生出最真切的怜悯。"

    # game/script.rpy:16939
    old "Excluding Naomi, Isla was the second death I'd had to directly face. If the past two weeks hadn't drained me like they had, I probably would've been unable to control my emotions."
    new "除去 Naomi，Isla 是我不得不直接面对的第二个死者。若不是过去两周已经把我耗成了这样，我大概早已控制不住情绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:16940
    old "I recalled the recording that told us Isla would be alive in a month. How to treat it, I had no idea, but it had ironically become a last hope.{w} Could the Sekimeiya have the power to bring a person back to life? It wasn't that crazy of a thought depending on how it worked, so the recording coming true at the cost of spending a month in the tower was the best-case scenario."
    new "我想起那段录音，它告诉我们 Isla 一个月后还会活着。我不知道该如何看待它，可讽刺的是，它竟成了最后的希望。{w}Sekimeiya 难道有让人复活的力量？取决于它的运作方式，这想法倒也不算太荒唐。所以，以在塔里待一个月为代价让录音成真，便是最好的结果。"

    # game/script.rpy:16941
    old "If one thing was certain, it was that some kind of plan existed behind it. Out of everyone there, the recorder had appeared inside Isla's purse. Not only that, the audio on it was downright bizarre. In a few hours, at {time=21}, we'd have a much better understanding of its veracity. Although we hadn't checked, it was very likely within that mysterious cabinet, still inside Isla's purse."
    new "有一点可以肯定：这背后必然藏着某种计划。在场所有人里，录音笔偏偏出现在 Isla 的手提包中。不止如此，里面的录音简直诡异至极。再过几个小时，到 {time=21}，我们对它真伪就能有更清楚的判断。虽然还没确认，但它很可能就在那个神秘的展示柜里，仍旧放在 Isla 的包中。"

    # game/script.rpy:16959
    old "After giving the flashlight back to Katei, he brought it to the security room. Once again, we moved to the lobby due to its proximity to the outside world and how spacious it was.{w} Shiroya, Katei, and I sat on the couch. There were chairs next to the reception desk, but everyone else chose to sit on the floor in silence, leaning against a wall.{w} Every speck of motivation within me had been crushed. While I wanted to know what was going on even more, I only had the energy to think to myself."
    new "我把手电筒还给了 Katei，他把它送回了监控室。我们又一次回到大堂——这里离外界最近，地方也宽敞。{w} Shiroya、Katei 和我坐在沙发上。接待台旁明明有椅子，其他人却都默不作声地靠墙坐在地上。{w} 我仅剩的一点干劲也彻底消失了。我更加想知道究竟出了什么事，却只剩下独自胡思乱想的力气。"

    # game/script.rpy:16965
    old "I was almost sure that two Sekimeiya existed and that one had been the source of Isla's death. I still held the key to the other one."
    new "我几乎可以确定，Sekimeiya 有两个，其中一个正是 Isla 的死因。而另一个的钥匙仍在我手里。"

    # game/script.rpy:16966
    old "My intent was to eventually check on the Sekimeiya that we had, so I had to eventually decide what to do regarding that.{w} We were all sitting down, letting the time pass and waiting for our release. If I didn't do anything, it was possible the police would find the key on me, giving away that I'd been the one to hide the Sekimeiya. I would have to discard it before it was too late."
    new "我终究还是得去查看我们手上的那个 Sekimeiya，所以迟早要为它做个决断。{w} 我们全都坐着，任时间流逝，等着有人来放我们出去。如果我什么也不做，警察说不定会在搜身时找到那把钥匙，从而得知藏起 Sekimeiya 的人就是我。我得在被发现之前把它处理掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:16972
    old "I could see Shiroya next to me, staring at the tiles. She'd still been trying to accept Miiya's death, Naomi's had surely made things worse, and Isla, who had taken a liking to Shiroya fairly quickly, was gone too. The best thing I could do for her was let her process it."
    new "我能看见身旁的 Shiroya 盯着地砖。她还在试着接受 Miiya 的死，Naomi 的死无疑让一切更糟，而很快就与她亲近起来的 Isla 也走了。我能为她做的，唯有不去打扰，让她自己慢慢接受这些。"

    # game/script.rpy:16973
    old "Unlike two weeks ago, we'd seen Isla's dead body, meaning that using the Sekimeiya to prevent her death was almost certainly impossible. Despite that, it would probably still be useful to understand what had happened if we used it to go to the past."
    new "和两周前不同，这一次我们亲眼见到了 Isla 的尸体，也就是说，想用 Sekimeiya 阻止她的死，几乎不可能。尽管如此，若用它回到过去，对弄清事情的经过恐怕仍有用处。"

    # game/script.rpy:16980
    old "Can the past be changed? There are many different ways the universe could work."
    new "过去可以被改变吗？宇宙的运作方式，可以有许多种可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:16981
    old "Upon traveling, would the timeline we live in change instantly? If so, the person who traveled would be the only one aware of the change, and everyone else would only have memories of the new timeline."
    new "穿越之后，我们所处的时间线会立刻改变吗？若是如此，只有穿越者本人知道变化发生过，其他人都只会拥有新时间线的记忆。"

    # game/script.rpy:16982
    old "Another way would be that once you travel and change the past, a new flow of time is created with that change. In this case, the original world would continue without being affected, and the person who had traveled would stop existing in it altogether."
    new "另一种可能是：一旦穿越并改变了过去，就会随这一改变诞生一条新的时间流。这样一来，原本的世界不受影响地继续下去，而穿越者将彻底从那个世界里消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:16983
    old "But it doesn't seem like the Sekimeiya allows for either one. We travel to the past, to the very same timeline, and don't change anything. Yet, the travels do allow for occurrences to happen that we've already experienced before traveling."
    new "但 Sekimeiya 似乎两种都不允许。我们穿越到过去，抵达的是同一条时间线，也改变不了任何事。然而，这些穿越确实让某些事件得以发生——而那些事，我们在穿越之前就已经经历过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16984
    old "It's impossible to feel sure about this, but hours ago, I tried to save Naomi. As soon as I became determined to change the past, and just when it seemed possible, the universe put a barrier in front of me and made everything occur as it had.{w} Even though it might have already been too late to save Naomi when I ran to the bathroom, I had already decided not to let her killer escape. Even that was seamlessly denied."
    new "这一点无法完全确定。但几个小时前，我试图去救 Naomi。就在我下定决心要改变过去、眼看就要成功的那一刻，宇宙在我面前立起了一道墙，让一切照原样发生。{w} 我冲向洗手间时，也许已经来不及救 Naomi 了，但我当时已经决定绝不让凶手逃走。就连这一点，也被无声无息地否定了。"

    # game/script.rpy:16987
    old "We'd kept the Sekimeiya we last traveled with inside Naomi's locker. If we were right about it sending us farther back in time the longer it wasn't cold, we might've been able to use it to go more than two weeks into the past."
    new "我们最后一次穿越用的那个 Sekimeiya，被放在了 Naomi 的储物柜里。如果我们「离开低温状态越久，就能回到越远的过去」的猜测没错，或许可以用它回到两周以前。"

    # game/script.rpy:16988
    old "I knew nothing good would come from that, but at least seeing Miiya again was a vague possibility.{w} However, the Sekimeiya hadn't appeared to work when we hid it, so we simply had to hope it would start working again before doing anything. ...To go back far enough, the time traveled couldn't be less than or equal to the time stored, but I didn't think was the case."
    new "我知道那样做不会有任何好处，但至少，再见到 Miiya 还存着一线模糊的可能。{w} 可是我们把它藏起来时，Sekimeiya 似乎已经不再起作用；所以在动手之前，我们只能盼着它重新恢复。……若要回到足够远的过去，穿越的时间就不能小于或等于蓄能的时间——但我觉得并不是那样。"

    # game/script.rpy:16989
    old "...If keeping the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet for twenty minutes resulted in a twenty-minute travel, we couldn't go so far back. But if a minute stored resulted in a thirty-minute travel, it could become possible, although it wouldn't correspond to my three travels."
    new "……如果让 Sekimeiya 在外放置二十分钟，就只穿越回二十分钟，那我们根本回不了那么远。可要是蓄能一分钟能换来三十分钟的穿越，那就有可能了——只是这和我经历的三次穿越对不上。"

    # game/script.rpy:16993
    old "I thought about something.{w} Why had the Sekimeiya not worked when we stored it in the locker? Could the universe have prevented it from working? What if, after traveling, we would've been guaranteed to change what had already occurred? Maybe the Sekimeiya would disallow any travel that was going to lead into an impossibility."
    new "我想到了一件事。{w} 我们把 Sekimeiya 放进储物柜时，它为什么不运作？会不会是宇宙阻止了它？假如穿越之后，我们必定会改变已经发生的事呢？也许，凡是会引发不可能情况的穿越，Sekimeiya 都不允许。"

    # game/script.rpy:16995
    old "Once more, a thought led me back to the recorder that informed us we'd spend my and Shiroya's birthdays in the tower. If it came true, we could possibly store the Sekimeiya for thirty days, granting what would surely be a massive travel. We'd found the recorder in our present, so a clear implication was that someone had traveled from the future to bring it to us."
    new "又一次，思绪把我带回了那支录音笔——它告诉我们，我和 Shiroya 的生日都将在塔里度过。若它成真，我们或许能把 Sekimeiya 蓄能整整三十天，那必然是一次规模惊人的穿越。录音笔是在当下被发现的，这就清楚地表明：有人从未来穿越而来，把它带给了我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:16996
    old "It had appeared inside Isla's purse, but she couldn't have been the one to bring it back since she was dead. Yet somehow, it also seemed to prove that she would be alive in a month, and to top it off, the recorded voices of Sai and Akaro had sounded particularly surprised to see her."
    new "它出现在 Isla 的手提包里，可 Isla 已经死了，不可能由她把录音笔带回来。然而不知怎的，这似乎又证明她在一个月后仍然活着；更何况，录音里 Sai 和 Akaro 的声音听起来见到她时格外惊讶。"

    # game/script.rpy:17003
    old "I got a bit dizzy. Just what was the reality of it all? It had to be related to Isla's mysterious friend."
    new "我有些头晕。这一切的真相究竟是什么？一定和 Isla 那位神秘的朋友有关。"

    # game/script.rpy:17004
    old "...Someone in that silent room with me could have had the intention to trap us for an entire month. Potentially so that they could achieve a very far travel.{w} As I thought about it, I cemented more and more how important it was to fully understand the Sekimeiya."
    new "……和我一起待在这间寂静房间里的人当中，也许就有人打算把我们困上整整一个月，好完成一次距离极远的穿越。{w} 越想下去，我越发确信：彻底弄清 Sekimeiya 的机制有多么重要。"

    # game/script.rpy:17005
    old "While the person responsible had to be around us, it was possible they hadn't thought of it yet. Since Erina and Shiroya had heard the recording, I found it unlikely either of them would be the one to eventually cause that outcome. If they did, their idea of staying for one more month would've originally come from hearing the recording, just like how I'd thought of some of its benefits only because the idea had been presented to me. A causal loop like that, generating an idea from nothing, still sounded irrational to me."
    new "真凶肯定就在我们中间，但对方此刻可能还没想到那一步。Erina 和 Shiroya 都听过录音，所以我不认为她们之中有人最终会造成那个结果。若真是她们，那「再留一个月」的念头最初必然来自那段录音——就像我想到其中一些好处，也只是因为那个想法先被人提了出来。像那样凭空产生想法的因果循环，在我看来仍然不合理。"

    # game/script.rpy:17006
    old "Sai was the one who first presented the draft of a theory I was using—that the time the Sekimeiya spent outside of its cabinet was what determined the amount of time traveled.{w} If that was the fundamental motive of our extended imprisonment, Sai was the best candidate to suspect. He had never listened to the audio. However, that same recording also made it sound as if we'd been abandoned by the world outside, so it was potentially foolish to blame someone in the building instead."
    new "我此刻用的那套理论——Sekimeiya 离开展示柜的时间决定穿越的时间——最初的雏形正是 Sai 提出的。{w} 如果这就是我们被长期困住的根本动机，那 Sai 是最值得怀疑的人选。他从未听过那段录音。可那段录音听起来也像是我们被外面的世界抛弃了，因此一味怀疑楼里的某个人，也许是愚蠢的。"

    # game/script.rpy:17009
    old "But the reality was that we were most likely still sharing space with a murderer who had killed anywhere from one to three times. The death of the second Naomi had almost certainly been a normal homicide, but I wasn't sure if the case was the same with Isla.{w} The culprit's actions had been linked to the Sekimeiya from the beginning, and they had managed to escape us so far. It was strange how they'd known about the Sekimeiya's powers straight away, and it had begun to seem like they were from the far future."
    new "但现实是，我们仍然很可能与一名杀过一人、甚至三人的凶手共处一室。第二个 Naomi 的死几乎可以肯定是普通的凶杀，至于 Isla，我就说不准了。{w} 凶手的行动从一开始就与 Sekimeiya 有关，而我们至今没能抓住对方。对方一上来就了解 Sekimeiya 的力量，这一点很蹊跷，渐渐地，我甚至觉得他们来自遥远的未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:17010
    old "...We could all easily have been in the middle of their process.{w} All of us had learned about the Sekimeiya's powers. Then, someone decided to trap us for an entire month and would actually accomplish it somehow.{w} In the future, once the required time passed, they would travel back and exist at the start of the day's events with a full understanding of the Sekimeiya."
    new "……我们很可能正处在对方计划的中间阶段。{w} 我们所有人都了解了 Sekimeiya 的力量。接着，某个人决定把我们困上整整一个月，而且真的会以某种方式办到。{w} 到了未来，等所需的时间一过，那个人就会穿越回来，以对 Sekimeiya 了如指掌的状态，出现在这一天的事件开始之时。"

    # game/script.rpy:17011
    old "They would cause what they'd once seen, which meant that at that moment, a future version of one of us existed somewhere. It was a bit paradoxical too, but depending on how they would replicate the events they'd experienced, it might've made sense.{w} It was like the first time I'd traveled to the past, when Shiroya hadn't realized that I was from the future.{w} What if we had already found the culprit in one of our searches but didn't realize it? Could they have impersonated their past self at some point?"
    new "他们会促成自己曾经见过的那些事，也就是说，在这一刻，我们之中某人的未来版本正存在于某处。这同样带来些许悖论，但要看他们如何重现自己经历过的那些事件，也许就说得通。{w} 就像我第一次回到过去时，Shiroya 根本没意识到我来自未来。{w} 万一我们在某次搜索中已经找到了凶手，却没能察觉呢？对方会不会在某个时刻冒充了过去的自己？"

    # game/script.rpy:17015
    old "I might've been completely off, and without the recording's existence, my thoughts would've been vastly different. If it had been faked in order to mislead us, it had proven to be very effective."
    new "我可能完全想偏了。要是没有那支录音笔，我的想法会截然不同。假如它是为了误导我们而伪造的，那这一手确实非常有效。"

    # game/script.rpy:17016
    old "If we had to trust it, the fact that the person who traveled brought the voice recorder with them was still crucial. They surely had a solid reason to do that, one I wanted to believe they'd come up with independently. Not just \"because they previously experienced the reality in which the voice recorder was brought back to the past\"."
    new "如果我们不得不相信它，那么穿越者随身带着录音笔这一点依然至关重要。他们这么做必定有充分的理由，而我愿意相信，那理由是对方自己想到的——而不是「因为他在过去经历过录音笔被带回过去的那段现实」。"

    # game/script.rpy:17017
    old "We wouldn't have food to survive, and there was no way Ashiya and the police would abandon us. However, if the recording we'd heard would truly occur in the future, there was one last thing I had to consider."
    new "我们没有食物，撑不下去；而芦屋和警方也绝不可能抛下我们不管。可是，如果我们听到的那段录音真的会在未来发生，那还有最后一件事需要我考虑。"

    # game/script.rpy:17018
    old "I believed that, somehow, it would be one of us who would trap everyone inside the tower for longer than we expected. While it sounded impossible, we possessed the Sekimeiya, which had powers we didn't know the extent of. It was likely that keeping the tower shut would be even harder from the outside."
    new "我相信，最终会把所有人困在塔里、困得比预想更久的，是我们中的某个人——不管他用什么办法。听起来虽然难以置信，可我们手上有 Sekimeiya，它的力量究竟有多大，谁也不知道。况且，从外面封住这座塔，恐怕只会更难。"

    # game/script.rpy:17019
    old "Inside, we had access to the computer that managed the security system—altering the alarm's functions was well in reach.{w} It wasn't that simple, though. Even if one of us permanently locked the exit, the outside would have to get us out in less than a month, as it would become a life or death situation."
    new "从内部，我们能接触到管理安保系统的电脑——改动警报的功能并非难事。{w} 但事情没那么简单。即使我们当中有人把出口彻底锁死，外界也必须在不到一个月内把我们救出去，否则就成了生死攸关的问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:17022
    old "They had said that blowing off the shutters wasn't viable, but there had to be something they could do if it came down to it. An underground passage, for example; there was no way shutters alone would keep us trapped for a month.{w} And regarding the motive, I didn't think I was being unrealistic. It might've been to use the Sekimeiya in a specific way, and I couldn't think of anything else. That would confirm that the time traveled wasn't determined with a 1:1 ratio."
    new "他们说过炸开卷帘门行不通，但真到那一步，总该有别的办法。比如地下通道——光靠几道卷帘门，绝不可能把我们困上一个月。{w} 至于动机，我不觉得自己是在空想。也许就是为了以某种特定方式使用 Sekimeiya，除此之外我想不出别的。那样一来，也就证实了穿越的时间并非按一比一的比例决定。"

    # game/script.rpy:17023
    old "If ten stored minutes resulted in a travel of ten minutes, storing more time, or up to a month, would be useless. No matter how much time the Sekimeiya spent outside of its cabinet, activating it would always send you to the point where time had begun to be stored."
    new "如果蓄能十分钟只能穿越回十分钟，那蓄更久、甚至蓄上一个月，都毫无意义。因为无论 Sekimeiya 在展示柜外待多长时间，启动它都只会把你送回开始蓄能的那一刻。"

    # game/script.rpy:17025
    old "When I thought of that, I came to a pretty unsettling realization.{w} If that was the motive of someone's grand plan, the Sekimeiya would have stored a great deal of time after a month—at least one month back, probably more. We'd reached the conclusions that the range was likely proportional to the time traveled and that it most likely went through solid objects."
    new "想到这里，我得出了一个相当令人不安的结论。{w} 如果那就是某人宏大计划的动机，那么一个月后，Sekimeiya 将蓄满大量时间——至少能回到一个月前，恐怕还不止。我们已经推断出：重叠范围很可能与穿越的时间成正比，而且它多半能穿过固体。"

    # game/script.rpy:17026
    old "If the range of a forty-minute travel had equaled a sizable room, a thirty-day range would surely reach far outside the tower. That would encompass many people outside, and they'd be sent back alongside the culprit who activated the Sekimeiya. Of course, there hadn't been any reports of a bunch of people suddenly arriving from the future."
    new "如果穿越四十分钟的重叠范围相当于一间不小的房间，那么三十天的范围必定会远远超出这座塔。那会囊括外面的许多人，他们会和启动 Sekimeiya 的凶手一起被送回过去。当然，从没有任何报道说有大批人突然从未来出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:17036
    old "The minutes continued to pass, and the mutual silence remained broken.{w} I went back over everything I'd considered, but ultimately, we would have to wait to decide further on any theory. At the very least, considering all those options would prepare me for whatever would end up happening."
    new "时间一分一分地过去，谁也没有开口。{w} 我把想过的一切又理了一遍，但说到底，任何理论都得等事情有了眉目才能再作判断。至少，把这些可能都想一遍，能让我对接下来无论发生什么都有所准备。"

    # game/script.rpy:17037
    old "I didn't reach any conclusion. Everything that came to mind, I had already thought of."
    new "我没能得出任何结论。凡是能想到的，我早已想过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17038
    old "Waiting like that only slowed our perception of time, but there was nothing else we could do. Shiroya kept looking at her lap, breathing deeply every so often. Erina hadn't moved in a long time, and her knees hid her face from us. Sai's, Akaro's, and Katei's expressions alternated between concern and thought, and they rarely lifted their heads."
    new "这样干等，只会让我们觉得时间过得更慢，可除此之外也别无他法。Shiroya 一直低头看着自己的膝头，时不时深深吸一口气。Erina 很久都没有动过，双臂抱膝，把脸藏了起来。Sai、Akaro 和 Katei 的神情在忧虑与沉思之间来回变换，很少抬起头。"

    # game/script.rpy:17047
    old "30 Minutes Later"
    new "三十分钟后"

    # game/script.rpy:17054
    old "We remained frozen like that for a long time, during which we all must've been thinking about Isla, Naomi, the Sekimeiya, and the culprit behind it all.{w} The sound that resumed time's march came from one of us. We turned our blank faces and saw Katei standing up, stretching his arms a little."
    new "我们就那样僵坐着，过了很久。在那段时间里，每个人想必都在想着 Isla、Naomi、Sekimeiya，以及这一切背后的凶手。{w} 让时间重新走动起来的声音，出自我们中的一人。我们木然转过头，看见 Katei 站了起来，稍稍伸展着手臂。"

    # game/script.rpy:17059
    old "I'm going to the bathroom."
    new "我去趟洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:17062
    old "With a faint but hoarse voice, showing that he hadn't cleared his throat in a while, he let us know his destination. Nobody responded to him, so he left through hallway A."
    new "他的声音微弱而沙哑，显然已经很久没清过嗓子。他说了自己要去哪儿，但没人回应，于是他穿过 A 走廊离开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17068
    old "We turned our eyes back down as if nothing had happened. What he'd just done was easy to label as suspicious behavior, but nobody said anything."
    new "我们像什么都没发生过一样，又把视线垂了下去。他刚才的举动，很容易被认定成可疑行为，可谁都没有开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:17069
    old "The Sekimeiya was in its unlocked cabinet. However, it was kept cold, and Shiroya and I were in possession of the other one. Katei wouldn't be able to activate it and go substantially back into the past. All he could do was move it, leaving himself as the only suspect."
    new "Sekimeiya 就放在没有上锁的展示柜里。但它一直保持低温，另一个则在 Shiroya 和我手上。Katei 没法启动它，也就没法真正回到过去。他能做的只有把它挪走，而那样一来，嫌疑就全落在他身上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17070
    old "At least, that was what I thought until another sound reached our ears."
    new "至少，在听到另一个声音之前，我是这么想的。"

    # game/script.rpy:17075
    old "I'll go too. It's been a while..."
    new "我也去一趟。有一阵没去了……"

    # game/script.rpy:17081
    old "Without paying attention to our reactions, Sai stood up and left through hallway B, which he'd been closer to. All of a sudden, the two most questionable people had gone off on their own, and they'd closed both doors behind them."
    new "Sai 毫不在意我们的反应，起身从离他更近的 B 走廊离开。转眼之间，两个最可疑的人各自单独行动，还各自关上了身后的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:17082
    old "...It didn't change what I thought: they couldn't go back to the past.{w} Shiroya and I looked at each other, but we decided to ignore them and wait."
    new "……这不会改变我的判断：他们回不到过去。{w} Shiroya 和我对视一眼，但我们决定不予理会，继续等下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:17083
    old "It was a little strange that Sai had left right after Katei. Perhaps he was still wary of him and wanted to see what he'd gone to do.{w} I thought further on it: was the possibility of one of them going considerably back to the past truly something I could rule out?{w} If everything was as we thought, yes. I'd personally put the Sekimeiya in its cabinet, and at that moment, I felt the cold temperature. After that, nobody had entered the room. It wouldn't have been possible for anyone to unplug the cabinet or take the Sekimeiya out later..."
    new "Sai 紧跟着 Katei 出去，这有点奇怪。也许他仍对 Katei 心存戒备，想看看他到底去做什么。{w} 我又往下想：他们中的一个真正回到过去的可能性，我真的能排除吗？{w} 如果一切都如我们所想，那确实能排除。Sekimeiya 是我亲手放进展示柜的，当时我还摸到了那股低温。那之后，没有人进过那个房间。谁也不可能事后再拔掉展示柜的电源，或者把 Sekimeiya 取出来……"

    # game/script.rpy:17084
    old "We remained on the floor, waiting for Katei and Sai to come back as we kept every thought to ourselves. The atmosphere had suddenly become a lot more uneasy as soon as one of us departed.{w} Akaro kept looking at the door Katei had disappeared through, visibly doubting him. Erina, on the other hand, hadn't reacted to Sai's movements in the slightest."
    new "我们仍坐在地上，等着 Katei 和 Sai 回来，各自把心思藏在心里。有人一离开，气氛顿时变得紧张起来。{w} Akaro 一直盯着 Katei 消失的那扇门，显然在怀疑他。而 Erina 对 Sai 的举动毫无反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:17088
    old "Two minutes passed without either of them returning. It was nothing alarming, but every second dragged on. I expected Katei to come back first, so as I watched the hallway A door, I considered how odd it was that he'd left through it."
    new "两分钟过去了，两人都没回来。这没什么大不了的，可每一秒都格外漫长。我以为 Katei 会先回来，于是一直盯着 A 走廊的门，心里想着他偏偏从那边离开，实在有些奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:17090
    old "After more than five minutes, I began to worry. I'd chosen not to pointlessly voice my suspicions because of Isla's death, but Sai and Katei might've purposely abused that."
    new "过了五分多钟，我开始担心起来。因为 Isla 的死，我原本不想无谓地说出怀疑，可 Sai 和 Katei 说不定正是有意利用了这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:17094
    old "I'll see if I can find them."
    new "我去看看能不能找到他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:17099
    old "I stood up and directed myself toward hallway B. I didn't want to be the third person to leave suspiciously, so I only intended to check if I could see anyone next to the bathrooms."
    new "我站起身，走向 B 走廊。我可不想成为第三个形迹可疑地离开的人，所以只打算看看洗手间旁边有没有人影。"

    # game/script.rpy:17102
    old "Before I could reach the doorknob, the opposite door opened. From behind it came Katei, who quickly saw me and gave me a conspicuous frown."
    new "我还没碰到门把，对面的门便开了。Katei 从门后走出来，一眼看见我，眉头立刻拧了起来，毫不掩饰。"

    # game/script.rpy:17109
    old "...To see if I could find you and Sai. Why did you take so long?"
    new "……去找你和 Sai。你怎么去了这么久？"

    # game/script.rpy:17114
    old "I went to the bathroom, so that's not a very appropriate question. ...Did Sai go to find me too?"
    new "我是去洗手间，这问题问得可不太合适。……Sai 也去找我了？"

    # game/script.rpy:17115
    old "No, he said he'd also go to the bathroom."
    new "没有，他说他也去洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:17117
    old "Did you not see him? Also, forgive me for all these questions, but why did you leave and come back from hallway A if you went to the bathroom?"
    new "你没碰见他？还有，恕我多问一句，你既然去了洗手间，为什么是从A走廊出去又回来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:17122
    old "Atsuki, do you not remember what's in the bathroom on this floor? I could have chosen to go to the women's, but I went to the one on floor 2 instead. That's likely why I didn't see Sai."
    new "Atsuki，你忘了这层洗手间是什么状况？我本可以去用女洗手间，但还是去了二楼那间。大概就是因为这个才没遇上Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:17123
    old "Hm... All right."
    new "嗯……好吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:17124
    old "Perhaps I'd jumped the gun too quickly, even though Sai's long absence was still on my mind. He'd gone to a different bathroom, so he hadn't had to wait for it to become available."
    new "也许是我下结论太早了，尽管Sai迟迟不归这件事仍压在我心上。他去了别的洗手间，自然不必等空位。"

    # game/script.rpy:17131
    old "I resumed what I was doing and opened the hallway B door. I saw it devoid of anyone and with every door closed, including the bathrooms in the distance."
    new "我继续刚才的动作，推开B走廊的门。走廊里空无一人，所有的门都关着，远处洗手间的门也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:17137
    old "I don't see anyone. It's been almost ten minutes, so I'll try to find him."
    new "一个人都没有。已经快十分钟了，我去找找他。"

    # game/script.rpy:17141
    old "Before I could leave, Shiroya stood up and came with me."
    new "我正要动身，Shiroya却站了起来，跟了过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:17146
    old "I'll help you. I... can't just keep sitting there."
    new "我也来帮忙。我……总不能一直坐在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:17147
    old "All right. We shouldn't take too long."
    new "好。别耽搁太久。"

    # game/script.rpy:17155
    old "As Sai had done, we closed the door behind us. I knew Shiroya had spent plenty of time silently mourning our loss, so I understood her—repeating it was unbearable, and I needed to occupy myself with something after sitting for so long. I was sure she felt the same about Sai's behavior being off; he'd openly accused her earlier, so her impression of him had to be poor."
    new "我们像Sai那样随手带上了门。我知道Shiroya已经沉默着哀悼了许久，所以理解她的心情——要再讲一遍实在让人受不了；而我自己坐了那么久，也需要找点事做。我确信她同样觉得Sai的行为很不对劲；他之前当众指责过她，她对他的印象肯定好不到哪里去。"

    # game/script.rpy:17156
    old "Let's check the event room first."
    new "先去活动室看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:17163
    old "We headed there and verified that the Sekimeiya was still present. I looked behind the cabinet and saw the cord plugged into the outlet too."
    new "我们过去确认了Sekimeiya还在。我又看了看展示柜后面，电线也仍插在插座上。"

    # game/script.rpy:17168
    old "Next, we moved to the bathrooms."
    new "接着，我们去了洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:17173
    old "Although the doors were closed, neither one was locked, and Sai wasn't inside."
    new "门虽然关着，但两间都没上锁，里面也没有Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:17176
    old "It looks like he really took this chance to do something. If he went to a bathroom above, Katei would've seen him."
    new "看来他确实是趁这个机会去做什么了。要是他去了楼上的洗手间，Katei应该会看见他。"

    # game/script.rpy:17182
    old "I feel like he might've gone to search for the Sekimeiya that we have. It was the one he hid in the cleaning room."
    new "我觉得他可能是去找我们手上的那个Sekimeiya了。就是他藏在清洁间的那个。"

    # game/script.rpy:17183
    old "Yeah, it's possible. He's probably somewhere on this floor."
    new "嗯，有可能。他多半还在这层某处。"

    # game/script.rpy:17189
    old "Beginning with the hallway B rooms, we opened every door and briefly searched for him. We'd learned already which cabinets had interiors large enough to contain a person, and after what had happened to Isla, checking them was less due to routine and moreso necessity."
    new "我们从B走廊的房间开始，逐一开门，粗略地找了一遍。我们早已弄清哪些展示柜的内部容得下一个人；Isla出事之后，查看它们与其说是例行公事，不如说是非做不可。"

    # game/script.rpy:17193
    old "We decided that there was no purpose in checking the Sekimeiya in Naomi's locker since we could've been seen, we didn't want to move it or activate it, and it was possible it wasn't working anyway. Shiroya sounded hesitant about that decision, but I also hadn't abandoned the thought of trying to use it later and find out what had happened to Isla, at the very least."
    new "我们商量后认为，没必要去查看Naomi储物柜里的那个Sekimeiya：我们可能被人看见，也不想搬动或启动它，况且它说不定根本用不了。Shiroya对这决定似乎有些迟疑，但我也没有打消之后再设法使用它的念头——至少弄清Isla究竟遭遇了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:17194
    old "We entered a room, made sure it was empty, and moved on to the next one."
    new "我们进一间，确认里面没人，再走向下一间。"

    # game/script.rpy:17201
    old "As I was checking the cabinets in the room where we'd found the first Naomi, the interior of one of them immediately let me know something about it was different. Upon unlocking it and opening its cover, a frigid burst of air hit my face."
    new "我在发现第一个Naomi的那个房间里查看展示柜时，一眼就看出其中一个柜子里面不对劲。我解锁掀开柜盖，一股冷气扑面而来。"

    # game/script.rpy:17202
    old "Katei had stated that room contained the cabinets with temperature regulation functions. However, the previous times we'd opened them, no special temperature had been set. Shiroya noticed my reaction and came to see if anything was wrong. After feeling the cold air that had begun to diffuse through the room, she checked the wheel on the right side of the cabinet."
    new "Katei说过，那个房间里的展示柜带有温度调节功能。可我们之前几次打开时，都没有设过什么特殊温度。Shiroya注意到我的反应，过来看是不是出了什么事。感受到那股已经在房间里弥散的冷气后，她查看起柜子右侧的旋钮。"

    # game/script.rpy:17203
    old "It's set to 0 °C."
    new "设成了0 °C。"

    # game/script.rpy:17206
    old "Hm... It had to have been changed recently. There's nothing inside, so that's pretty strange."
    new "嗯……这肯定是最近才调过的。里面又没放东西，实在有些奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:17207
    old "It was a different cabinet than the one I'd first traveled from, and I wasn't sure why it would be done since the Sekimeiya hadn't been put inside."
    new "这并不是我最初时间穿越时用的那个展示柜；而且既然没把Sekimeiya放进去，我实在想不出为什么要调温度。"

    # game/script.rpy:17212
    old "When we got the locker key from Naomi, it might've already been like this, so we can't just suspect Sai and Katei."
    new "我们从Naomi那里拿到储物柜钥匙的时候，它说不定就已经是这样了，所以不能只怀疑Sai和Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:17213
    old "Yeah, and we can't blindly believe Sai's story either. Regardless, whoever did this didn't let the others know, so we should probably revert the temperature."
    new "嗯，而且Sai的说法我们也不能全信。总之，做这事的人没让其他人知道，我们最好还是把温度调回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:17218
    old "...Someone might be counting on this cabinet for later if they changed the temperature in preparation. If I switch the wheel to \"room temperature\", we should be able to close the lid."
    new "……如果有人提前调了温度，那说不定是打算之后用这个展示柜。我把旋钮拨到「常温」，应该就能合上柜盖了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17219
    old "I nodded, and she did so before we left the room. It wasn't clear if setting it to room temperature would make the inside of the cabinet match the outside or if it would only stop the regulation, but leaving the lid open would communicate to whoever changed the temperature that their measures had been reversed."
    new "我点点头，她便照着做了，随后我们离开房间。调到常温究竟是能让柜内与外界同温，还是仅仅停止调节，我也说不准；可要是就这么敞着柜盖，就等于告诉调温度的人，有人把他的设置改回去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17226
    old "We proceeded to the other rooms and resumed the search. We didn't want to waste much time, or we'd become the suspicious ones. As soon as hallway B was done, we began with the parallel hallway."
    new "我们继续检查其余房间，重新开始搜寻。我们不想耽搁太久，否则反倒会显得可疑。B走廊一查完，我们就转向与之平行的另一条走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:17235
    old "The first room we entered was the storeroom, continuing with our backward order. It was one of the smallest rooms on the entire floor, and its purpose was still a bit unclear, as it wasn't storing anything that was particularly useful.{w} Given how small it was, we should've left it immediately, but Shiroya noticed something that prolonged our stay."
    new "我们继续按倒序，先进了储藏室。这里是整层最小的房间之一，用途至今不太明确，也没存放什么特别有用的东西。{w} 地方这么小，本来看一眼就该走，可Shiroya发现了什么，让我们多留了一阵。"

    # game/script.rpy:17242
    old "Wait, come here. Look at this part of the wall."
    new "等等，过来一下。你看墙上这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:17247
    old "Shiroya, who'd gone to the end of the dimly lit room, was pointing her finger at the place she wanted me to see. I stepped in, making my way through the cluttered, narrow space. Then, I looked beyond her finger, faintly illuminated by the single light."
    new "Shiroya走到了昏暗房间的尽头，正伸手指着她要我看的地方。我走进去，穿过堆满杂物的狭窄空间，然后顺着她的手指望去——那地方只有一盏灯照着，光线微弱。"

    # game/script.rpy:17248
    old "It took me a while to understand what she meant. She was pointing at the left corner, and after glancing up and down in search of anything out of place, I finally noticed the oddity she'd found."
    new "我花了一会儿才明白她的意思。她指的是左侧墙角；我上下打量，寻找任何不对劲的地方，最后才注意到她发现的那处异样。"

    # game/script.rpy:17249
    old "Huh... How did you even notice this?"
    new "咦……你是怎么注意到这个的？"

    # game/script.rpy:17253
    old "The wall was dirty and uneven from years of aging. You could still see the outline of a grid that separated the wall into tiny squares. They were all defined by white lines which had started to fade with time."
    new "墙面陈旧，脏污而不平整。依稀还能看出把墙面分成一个个小方格的网格轮廓，勾勒它们的白线已随年月褪色。"

    # game/script.rpy:17254
    old "On one of the squares touching the left wall, Shiroya had seen a slight lack of dust, which was otherwise present over every surface of the room.{w} Even though the poor illumination made it hard to see, what seemed to be fingerprints existed on it. Not only that, but its close surroundings were a bit cleaner than the rest of the walls."
    new "在贴着左墙的一个方格上，Shiroya发现那里的积灰比别处少——这房间的每处表面原本都落着灰。{w} 虽然光线昏暗难以看清，但上面似乎留着指纹。不止如此，那一带也比墙面其余部分干净一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:17259
    old "From the door, I saw this area reflecting the hallway C light a lot more. I don't know when, but it looks like someone touched this corner."
    new "从门口看，这一块反射的C走廊灯光明显更强。我不知道是什么时候，但看来有人碰过这个角落。"

    # game/script.rpy:17262
    old "I suppose so...{w} But I doubt it means anything, and we can't even be sure it happened today."
    new "大概吧……{w} 不过我看这未必说明什么，而且也没法确定就是今天弄的。"

    # game/script.rpy:17267
    old "Hold on. These fingerprints... It's hard to see, but they're not vertical, right?"
    new "等等。这些指纹……虽然看不太清，但它们不是竖着的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:17268
    old "Yeah, they look horizontal."
    new "嗯，看起来是横的。"

    # game/script.rpy:17269
    old "You wouldn't touch any wall with three fingers in this horizontal position... accidentally."
    new "三根手指横成这样去碰墙，总不可能是……不小心碰上的吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:17272
    old "I wouldn't think so. Just touching it would leave them vertical, and more separated."
    new "我不这么认为。只是碰一下的话，留下的指印会是竖的，彼此也分得更开。"

    # game/script.rpy:17273
    old "I shaped my hand to match the three fingerprints and placed it over them. My arm formed a right angle with the left wall, but it didn't make me understand the meaning of what we'd found."
    new "我把手摆成与那三道指印相符的形状，覆了上去。手臂与左侧墙面正好成直角，可即便如此，我还是想不通我们发现的这些究竟意味着什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:17274
    old "I have no idea why you'd ever touch a corner of a room like this."
    new "我实在想不通，怎么会有人去碰房间这种角落。"

    # game/script.rpy:17275
    old "There's nothing important in this room either."
    new "这房间里也没什么要紧的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:17276
    old "...{w}Huh?{w} Wh-What...?"
    new "……{w}咦？{w}什、什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:17277
    old "As I removed my hand from the wall, I felt something."
    new "我把手从墙上移开时，察觉到了异样。"

    # game/script.rpy:17282
    old "Did something happen?"
    new "出什么事了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:17283
    old "When I took away my hand, it seemed as if this square moved a bit."
    new "我把手拿开的时候，这块方形好像动了一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:17288
    old "...Hm? I didn't see anything."
    new "……嗯？我什么都没看出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:17289
    old "I pressed my fingers on the square again. Instead of pulling away, I moved my hand around, and as I'd thought, it was a bit loose."
    new "我又把手指按在那块方形上。这回没有松开，而是让手在它周围动了动——果然，它有些松动。"

    # game/script.rpy:17294
    old "You're right. It's moving a little."
    new "你说得对，确实在动，只是幅度很小。"

    # game/script.rpy:17295
    old "It didn't go anywhere, though. I could only move it sideways, and it wouldn't detach from the wall."
    new "可它也去不了别处。我只能左右挪动它，它却离不开墙面。"

    # game/script.rpy:17296
    old "This must be why someone touched this spot, but it's not doing anything."
    new "这肯定就是有人碰过这里的原因，可这样弄根本起不了作用。"

    # game/script.rpy:17297
    old "Will it move any more than that?"
    new "还能动得再大些吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:17298
    old "It was sliding side to side, almost imperceptibly. Realizing that I hadn't been applying enough force, I attempted to move it past its apparent limit."
    new "它左右滑动着，幅度几乎看不出来。我意识到是自己用力不够，便试着把它推过那道看似到头的界限。"

    # game/script.rpy:17312
    old "All of a sudden, as if it were a door, the wall opened, revealing a hidden space behind."
    new "忽然，那面墙像门一样开了，露出后面一处隐蔽的空间。"

    # game/script.rpy:17318
    old "I-It's a hidden door!?"
    new "这、这是暗门！？"

    # game/script.rpy:17319
    old "I'd slid the moving piece to the right, and before I could think, my hand had pushed open the entire wall. It was revealed to be very thin, and past it, the corridor extended."
    new "我把那块可动的方板向右滑去，还没等我反应过来，手已经把整面墙推开了。那墙原来极薄，墙后延伸出一条通道。"

    # game/script.rpy:17320
    old "They've even got secret passages here? What is this place...?"
    new "这地方连密道都有？到底是什么来头……？"

    # game/script.rpy:17321
    old "No light existed on the other side, but it seemed to lead to a narrow area."
    new "墙那边没有一丝光，却似乎通向一处狭窄的空间。"

    # game/script.rpy:17322
    old "There's another door..."
    new "还有一扇门……"

    # game/script.rpy:17329
    old "Y-Yes, but it doesn't have a handle. At first I thought it was just another wall."
    new "对、对，可是它没有把手。我一开始还以为那不过是又一堵墙。"

    # game/script.rpy:17330
    old "I tried to push it open, but it didn't move. Where a handle or a doorknob should have been, there were two round holes: a big one with metallic pieces inside, and a smaller, empty one."
    new "我试着推门，纹丝不动。本该装把手或门钮的地方，有两个圆孔：大的那个里面嵌着金属件，小的则是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:17335
    old "Someone here knows about this, right? Those marks have to mean someone opened this recently."
    new "这里有人知道这事吧？那些痕迹说明最近有人开过这扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:17336
    old "...And no matter if they went through this door, the culprit could've easily escaped from us if they just hid here."
    new "……再说，不管有没有进过这扇门，凶手只要藏在这里，就能轻易从我们眼皮底下溜走。"

    # game/script.rpy:17341
    old "Why was something like this even built in the first place?"
    new "这种东西当初到底为什么要建？"

    # game/script.rpy:17342
    old "It might've been part of Ashiya's countermeasures to Xyn, but that means that Katei would have to know about it."
    new "也许是芦屋为对付 Xyn 准备的反制措施之一，可这样一来，Katei 就不可能不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:17347
    old "I mean, no matter what it's for, there's no way he doesn't know about this, right...?"
    new "我是说，不管它是干什么用的，他不可能不知道吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:17350
    old "That part of the storeroom felt colder than the rest of the building, likely because the temperature regulation didn't reach it. Still awestruck, I kept examining the door."
    new "储藏室的这一角比楼里别处更冷，大概是温度调节到不了这里。我还在震惊中，继续打量着这扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:17351
    old "I think there should be a handle here. When you remove a handle with a keyhole from a door, you're left with these holes. I think the small one is where the keyhole would be, and the bigger one is what connects the handle with the turning mechanism. This means that this door can usually be unlocked with a key, but without the handle, we won't be able to open it even if we find the right one."
    new "这里本该有个把手。把带锁孔的把手从门上拆下来，就会留下这样的孔。小的那个应该是锁孔的位置，大的那个是把手连接转动机构的地方。也就是说，这扇门平时能用钥匙打开，可把手没了，就算找到钥匙，我们也开不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17356
    old "Oh, I guess someone could've unscrewed it on purpose to make sure it's never unlocked again."
    new "哦，那大概是有人故意把把手拆了，好让它再也打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:17357
    old "Yeah. I have no idea what's through here, but we can't find out. It looks like a sturdy enough door, so it won't open without both the handle and the key."
    new "嗯。里面有什么，我完全不知道，我们也查不了。这门看着够结实，缺了把手和钥匙，是打不开的。"

    # game/script.rpy:17358
    old "I tried it a few more times, but it didn't budge at all."
    new "我又试了几次，门纹丝不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:17361
    old "Hey!"
    new "喂！"

    # game/script.rpy:17365
    old "What the hell is going on!?"
    new "到底出什么事了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:17366
    old "The sudden voice startled us, and we turned around instantly. Katei's silhouette was behind us, the single light only hitting his back."
    new "突如其来的声音吓了我们一跳，我们立刻回头。Katei 的身影就在身后，唯一的光只照在他的背上。"

    # game/script.rpy:17370
    old "...We found this hidden section behind the wall. Where does this door lead to?"
    new "……我们在墙后发现了一处隐蔽的空间。这扇门通向哪里？"

    # game/script.rpy:17375
    old "You must be screwing with me! A hidden section? There's no way."
    new "你开什么玩笑！墙后面有空间？怎么可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:17379
    old "You're seeing it right now. Did you not know about it...?"
    new "你现在就看着呢。你不知道有这地方……？"

    # game/script.rpy:17384
    old "No, I did not know about it! What is this!?"
    new "不，我根本不知道！这到底是什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:17385
    old "Whoa, look at this. Good find, Atsuki."
    new "哟，看看这个。干得漂亮，Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:17386
    old "From behind Katei, another silhouette appeared. Without a doubt, the voice belonged to Sai."
    new "Katei 身后又现出一道身影。那声音毫无疑问是 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:17387
    old "Shiroya found it, actually."
    new "其实是 Shiroya 发现的。"

    # game/script.rpy:17392
    old "Oh, you finally did something. Good job."
    new "哦，你总算做了点事。不错嘛。"

    # game/script.rpy:17393
    old "Sai's condescending attitude had already resurfaced. He skittered over to us and began to examine the door."
    new "Sai 那副居高临下的态度又回来了。他小跑着凑到我们身边，开始打量那扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:17397
    old "Two more figures peeked in from the entrance. As they stepped in, the light revealed they were the last two remaining people: Akaro and Erina."
    new "入口处又探进两道身影。等他们走进来，灯光照清了他们的脸——正是最后剩下的两人：Akaro 和 Erina。"

    # game/script.rpy:17404
    old "We were gonna search for you. Did you take this chance to sneak into your hideout?"
    new "我们正打算去找你们呢。你该不会是趁这机会溜回自己的老巢了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:17405
    old "We actually found it while we were searching for you, so you tell us. Where did you go? The bathrooms here were empty."
    new "我们是在找你们的时候发现的，所以轮到你来告诉我们。你们去哪儿了？这边的洗手间都是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:17406
    old "You're all always in a rush as soon as I go somewhere. I just went to the floor 2 bathrooms since Naomi's still in the one down here."
    new "我一走开，你们就急得不行。Naomi 还占着楼下那间，我只好去二楼的洗手间了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17411
    old "Wait, what? No, you didn't. I was there, and you definitely didn't come."
    new "等等，你说什么？不，你根本没有。我当时就在那儿，你绝对没来过。"

    # game/script.rpy:17416
    old "...{w}All right, let's settle this quickly. Katei is lying. I was up there, and he never showed up."
    new "……{w}行了，这事赶紧说清楚。Katei 在撒谎。我上去过，他根本没露面。"

    # game/script.rpy:17418
    old "I bet he already told you he'd gone upstairs, right? Now, since I revealed I was there, he couldn't back out of his lie, so he chose to accuse me. That's Katei for you."
    new "他肯定早就跟你们说过自己上过楼了吧？现在我讲明我就在楼上，他没法再圆那套谎话，索性倒打一耙。这就是 Katei 的作风。"

    # game/script.rpy:17423
    old "This is getting old. You guys can choose to believe him if you want, but he's only manipulating you."
    new "翻来覆去就这几句。你们要信他随你们，但他不过是在摆布你们罢了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17426
    old "Katei, we found a hidden passage, so stop trying to always be the center of attention. Let's cut to the chase: did you leave the bathroom's door open or closed?"
    new "Katei，暗门我们已经找到了，你就别老抢风头了。直说吧——你离开洗手间的时候，门是开着还是关着？"

    # game/script.rpy:17427
    old "Closed. I always close doors behind me when I leave an empty room."
    new "关着。我离开空房间时一向会随手关门。"

    # game/script.rpy:17433
    old "Unfortunately, he's right. I closed the door, so take him up on his offer and believe me."
    new "不巧，他说得没错。门确实是我关的——既然他这么说，你们就信我吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:17438
    old "Now look at this. Someone removed the keyhole from this door to prevent us from opening it.{w} Hm... Not only that, but the inner mechanism was broken too. This won't allow for a new handle to be inserted."
    new "看看这个。有人把门上的锁孔整个拆掉了，为的就是不让我们打开。{w}嗯……不止如此，里面的机关也被弄坏了，再想装个新把手也不行。"

    # game/script.rpy:17439
    old "Whoever the culprit is, they're likely to still be somewhere, so they might be behind this door right now, which is how they keep avoiding us."
    new "不管凶手是谁，多半还留在这栋楼里。说不定此刻就躲在这扇门后，所以才能一直避开我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:17444
    old "Katei, be smart for once and tell us where this goes."
    new "Katei，你就聪明一回，告诉我们这扇门通向哪儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:17449
    old "You heard me earlier. I was unaware of this hidden area entirely."
    new "我刚才就说过了。这处隐蔽的区域我完全不知情。"

    # game/script.rpy:17450
    old "You're awful at your job, then. Ashiya must've constructed this for a reason, and it's impossible you weren't aware of it."
    new "那你可真是失职。芦屋建这东西总有理由，你不可能毫不知情。"

    # game/script.rpy:17458
    old "Do you guys not think it might lead to the left side of the tower?"
    new "你们有没有想过，它也许通往塔的左侧？"

    # game/script.rpy:17467
    old "...You mean, outside?"
    new "……你是说，通到外面？"

    # game/script.rpy:17472
    old "Yes.{w} This entire corridor now stretches farther than the crystal rooms. I think it might extend far enough to reach outside."
    new "对。{w}整条走廊现在比水晶展室还长。我觉得它延伸得够远，说不定一直通到了楼外。"

    # game/script.rpy:17473
    old "That's some hope you're giving us. Katei didn't know about this door, so if it leads outside, the alarm shouldn't have blocked it."
    new "你这话倒给了我们一点希望。Katei 并不知道这扇门，所以如果它真能通到外面，警报应该没有把它封住。"

    # game/script.rpy:17478
    old "Th-That's right. I can assure you that the alarm did not do anything to this door."
    new "没、没错。我可以保证，警报没有对这扇门做任何手脚。"

    # game/script.rpy:17483
    old "Someone did, though. The keyhole was removed, probably to prevent us from unlocking it with the key. Isn't that implying that one of us has it? Otherwise, the lock would be enough of a barrier."
    new "可确实有人动过手脚。锁孔被拆掉，大概是不让我们用钥匙开门。这不就等于说，钥匙在我们当中的某个人手上吗？否则，光是一道锁就足够拦住我们了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17484
    old "Well, nothing around here looks modern. If this door is old, the chances of picking the lock are high. Maybe it was done to prevent that."
    new "这附近的东西都不现代。如果这扇门年头够久，撬锁成功的可能性就很大，也许拆掉锁孔就是为了防这一手。"

    # game/script.rpy:17485
    old "True, yeah. How did you spot the hidden opening, Shiroya?"
    new "说得也是。Shiroya，你是怎么发现那个暗门的？"

    # game/script.rpy:17491
    old "...I saw some light reflecting off one of the tiles. Someone's fingerprints had removed some dust in the corner of the wall. That ended up being the way to open it."
    new "……我看见有块瓷砖反着光。墙角的灰尘被指纹抹掉了一些，而那里正好就是开门的机关。"

    # game/script.rpy:17496
    old "Listen, then. This was recent. If the door leads outside, the culprit might actually have escaped with the handle. This building is situated at the outskirts of town, so the sides and back are never seen by anyone and are empty, grassy fields."
    new "那就听我说。这是最近才动的手。如果这扇门通到外面，凶手说不定已经带着把手逃走了。这栋楼在镇子边缘，侧面和背面从没人经过，只有一片长满野草的空地。"

    # game/script.rpy:17497
    old "I'm sure the police are keeping watch outside, but probably only at the front, where the entrance and windows are. They shouldn't be aware of this door either, so escaping unseen is certainly doable."
    new "警察肯定在外面守着，但多半只盯着正面有入口和窗户的那一侧。他们也不会知道有这扇门，想不被发现地溜走完全有可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:17502
    old "There's no way this leads out of the building. I've never seen the outline of a door from the outside, and there's no light coming from behind the door. It's absolutely impossible this kind of way out exists."
    new "这绝不可能通向楼外。我在外面从没见过什么门的轮廓，门后也没有透出光来。这种出口根本不可能存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:17507
    old "The gaps aren't big enough to let light pass, or the door is wider than it seems. Just think about it, though. Why would this secret passage exist?{w} If they had something to hide in it, they wouldn't have another locked door past it. They would just hide it in the secret passage itself. Otherwise, this door wouldn't be here or be locked.{w} This passage is the secret itself. It's hidden because this door leads outside. If the middle wall didn't exist, the length of the room would reveal it."
    new "缝隙太窄，光透不过来；也可能是这扇门比看上去更宽。可你们想一想，这条暗道为什么会存在？{w}如果里面藏了什么，他们不必在尽头再设一道上锁的门，直接把东西藏在暗道里就行。否则，这扇门根本不必有，更不必上锁。{w}这条暗道本身就是秘密。它之所以被藏起来，是因为这扇门通向外面。要是没有中间那道墙，房间的长度就会把它露出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:17508
    old "I think you're right. That's what this wall is hiding."
    new "你说得对。这道墙藏的就是这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:17514
    old "So, we're a single door away from making it out...? Can we break it down?"
    new "也就是说，我们离出去只差一扇门了……？能把它砸开吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:17519
    old "There's no way, just look at it. Whoever removed the handle knew very well that we couldn't do that."
    new "不可能，你看看它就知道。拆掉把手的人清楚得很，我们砸不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:17524
    old "I know this is bound to happen eventually, but do you realize what will occur if we manage to force it open? We'll reveal that the Sekimeiya has time traveling powers. What kind of consequences will that have?"
    new "我知道这事迟早瞒不住。可你们想过没有，要是我们真把这扇门强行打开，会发生什么？Sekimeiya 拥有时间穿越能力这件事就会暴露。那会带来什么样的后果？"

    # game/script.rpy:17525
    old "...That was completely inconsiderate. Erina was still next to us, and she hadn't said anything in a very long time. Our priority had to be making it out as soon as possible so that the police could understand what happened to Isla even if it invalidated the recording."
    new "……这话说得太不顾及别人了。Erina 就在我们旁边，她已经很久没有开口。当务之急是尽快出去，哪怕录音因此作废，也要让警方明白 Isla 出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:17530
    old "Don't get me wrong. I'm not worried. I'm just intrigued.{w} How is it even remotely possible the Sekimeiya exists? How did it make it here without anyone finding out about its powers? These big picture questions are what I'm most lost about."
    new "别误会。我不是担心，只是好奇。{w}Sekimeiya 这种东西究竟怎么可能存在？它又是怎么一路来到这儿，却没有一个人察觉它的能力？我最想不通的，就是这些大方向上的问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:17532
    old "I hit the door, and the sound echoed heavily throughout the corridor. I repeated that a few times, trying to be as loud as I could and intending to be heard from the outside."
    new "我捶了捶那扇门，闷响在走廊里沉沉回荡。我又连捶了几次，尽可能弄出最大的声响，指望外面能有人听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:17538
    old "Nobody will come. I refuse to believe this leads outside. I'm more inclined to think the culprit is currently behind this door, listening."
    new "不会有人来的。我不相信这扇门通到外面。我更倾向于认为，凶手此刻就躲在这扇门后听着。"

    # game/script.rpy:17544
    old "Is there nothing else we can do? Sliding anything through the gaps, for example?"
    new "就没有别的办法了吗？比如从缝隙里塞点什么东西出去？"

    # game/script.rpy:17549
    old "What, a letter? We're too far from the entrance to be heard, and I doubt anyone is currently looking at this side. Regardless, these gaps are way too thin—probably to hide the door's existence from the outside."
    new "塞什么，求救信吗？这里离入口太远，喊也没人听得见，而且现在恐怕没人会往这一侧看。再说，这些缝隙细得很——大概就是为了不让外面看出这里有一扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:17550
    old "It was incredibly frustrating. We'd finally discovered an exit that the alarm shouldn't have affected, but the culprit had made sure to finish the job. ...Was it just in case we found the moving wall, or was there a deeper reason?"
    new "实在令人憋闷。好不容易找到一处本不该受警报影响的出口，凶手却已经把后路堵得干净。……是防着我们会发现那面可移动的墙，还是另有更深的缘由？"

    # game/script.rpy:17560
    old "And how did the culprit know about it, but not Katei? Why was it there in the first place? Not only did the door lock us inside, but it also produced even more questions. Feeling defeated, we left what had become a narrow, dim corridor to return to the wider but still dark hallway A."
    new "而且，为什么凶手知道这扇门，Katei 却不知道？这扇门最初又是为何而建？它不但把我们锁在里面，还带来了更多疑问。我们无可奈何，只能离开这条已经变得又窄又暗的走廊，回到宽敞些却同样昏暗的 A走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:17561
    old "I thought something was noteworthy. Even though a perfect hiding spot existed, the Sekimeiya had never been hidden in it.{w} ...Why? Earlier, it had been hidden in the storeroom. Therefore, the person who hid it there was probably not aware of the movable wall."
    new "我觉得有件事值得留意。明明有这样一处绝佳的藏匿之所，Sekimeiya 却从未被藏在那里。{w}……为什么？先前它是被藏在储藏室里的。也就是说，把它藏起来的那个人，多半并不知道这面可以移动的墙。"

    # game/script.rpy:17562
    old "...We'd ignored the little fight between Sai and Katei, but there weren't many layers to it. One of them was lying, and it was nothing new, as they'd surely lied more than once already. The fact that one of them took advantage of the situation with Isla to act on their own, though, proved that they weren't to be taken lightly. In addition, one of them could've easily been responsible for the cold cabinet Shiroya and I had returned to normal."
    new "……Sai 和 Katei 那点争执我们没有理会，可其中并没有什么复杂的门道。他们当中有一个在撒谎，这也不新鲜，两人肯定早已不止一次说过谎。然而，其中一人趁着 Isla 出事的机会擅自行动，这就说明他们谁都不能小看。何况，那个被我和 Shiroya 调回常温的冰冷展示柜，也很可能是他们其中一人动的手脚。"

    # game/script.rpy:17569
    old "Mechanically, we went to the event room. It didn't have anything new to tell us, as the Sekimeiya was still present behind the glass."
    new "我们木然地走向活动室。那里没有什么新线索——Sekimeiya 依旧待在玻璃后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:17574
    old "So it hasn't moved. It's clear that either Sai or Katei didn't go to the bathroom earlier, so they were up to some other business."
    new "看来它没被动过。也就是说，Sai 和 Katei 当中必有一个刚才没去洗手间，而是去忙别的事了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17579
    old "Good thought. Tell us, Katei, what exactly were you doing that justified lying to us?"
    new "想得不错。那么 Katei，你说说看，究竟是什么事让你非得对我们撒谎？"

    # game/script.rpy:17584
    old "*sigh* It's time to put an end to this. Sai won't stop lying as much as he pleases, so we'll have to wait until the security footage reveals all of his actions."
    new "*叹气* 该结束这一切了。Sai 想怎么撒谎就怎么撒谎，根本不会停，我们只能等监控录像把他的所作所为全部揭出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:17589
    old "You keep saying that, but do you really believe the footage will be salvaged? Even though the cameras are recording, is it really being saved somewhere?"
    new "你老是这么说，可你真觉得那段录像还能救回来？就算摄像头还在录，那些画面真被存到什么地方了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:17590
    old "Of course. The computer isn't detecting the system, but as soon as that's solved, it'll have access to all the stored footage. Did you perhaps think you'd be able to roam freely without consequences?"
    new "当然。电脑现在识别不到系统，可一旦解决，它就能调出所有存下的录像。你该不会以为自己可以到处乱走而不用承担后果吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:17591
    old "No, but I have trouble swallowing that. The culprit made sure to cut our access to the system, but why would they do that if Ashiya will come in and be able to look at what happened?"
    new "不是，只是这种说法我很难接受。凶手特意切断了我们访问系统的权限，可既然芦屋会来、也能查到发生了什么，他又何必多此一举？"

    # game/script.rpy:17594
    old "That's not all they did, though. At the same time, our only method of communication was removed. I believe the reason behind that entire thing was to prevent us from conveying what's happening while we're still here. It's possible that whoever did it doesn't care about Ashiya finding out."
    new "可他们做的还不止这些。同一时间，我们唯一的联络手段也被切断了。我认为这一连串举动，都是为了不让我们趁还留在这里的时候把情况传出去。说不定动手的人根本不在乎芦屋会不会查到。"

    # game/script.rpy:17599
    old "You try to make that sound interesting, but it's idiotic. They were able to power off the computer, but it turned back on minutes later, so why didn't they choose to keep it off forever?"
    new "你想把这事说得好像很有意思，其实蠢得很。他们既然能关掉电脑，电脑几分钟后又自己开了，那为什么不索性让它一直关着？"

    # game/script.rpy:17600
    old "Most likely, the reason they let us use it again was because they'd made sure that the recordings wouldn't be accessible. Additionally, it clearly told us that they could somehow disable our communication method."
    new "他们之所以又允许我们使用，多半是因为已经确保那些录像不会落到别人手里。而且这也明明白白地告诉我们：他们自有办法切断我们的联络手段。"

    # game/script.rpy:17605
    old "So, to be honest, even though the cameras are still functional, I find it hard to believe what's being recorded will ever be seen. There's no way the person responsible would be fine with being seen once we get out, so if we can't access the system, it's doubtful Ashiya or the police will be able to."
    new "所以说实话，摄像头虽然还能用，我也很难相信录下的画面将来会有人看到。等我们出去之后，那个人绝不会愿意自己被拍到。连我们都进不了系统，芦屋和警方恐怕也未必做得到。"

    # game/script.rpy:17611
    old "I feel like you're right about that. It would also explain why they keep putting themselves in front of the cameras."
    new "我觉得你说得没错。这也能解释他们为什么总是往镜头前凑。"

    # game/script.rpy:17616
    old "Now, I understand I'm repeating myself, but wouldn't you think that the security staff member among us who conveniently avoided giving us information, has lied multiple times, and could've had knowledge of the secret passage is the most likely candidate to have orchestrated this?"
    new "我知道这话我已经说过好几遍了。可你们想想——我们当中那个当保安的，偏偏该说的信息全都避而不谈，撒过不止一次谎，还可能早就知道暗门的存在。要说谁最有可能在幕后操纵这一切，除了他还能是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:17621
    old "That's enough, Sai."
    new "够了，Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:17626
    old "Is that all you have to say? Of course, once your \"the security cameras will prove that I'm right\" excuse runs out, you have no arguments to defend yourself with."
    new "你只会说这一句吗？当然，等『监控录像会证明我是对的』这个借口撑不下去，你就再没有别的说辞替自己辩解了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17627
    old "It seemed the discussions between those two wouldn't cease until one was proven wrong definitively. I knew that Sai wasn't any less of a liar than Katei, but if that hadn't been the case, I would've quickly sided with him."
    new "那两人之间的争论，看来非要斗到一方被彻底驳倒才会罢休。我知道 Sai 撒谎的本事并不比 Katei 逊色；要不是这一点，我早就站到他那边了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17635
    old "...Why don't we stop with this and wait until we can leave?"
    new "……不如先到此为止，等能离开的时候再说？"

    # game/script.rpy:17637
    old "Surprisingly, it was Erina who tried to calm them down. Her voice came out like the wind rustling on dried leaves."
    new "出乎意料，出面劝架的竟是 Erina。她的声音听起来像风掠过干枯的叶子。"

    # game/script.rpy:17642
    old "That's easy to say, but Katei will just take advantage of that again."
    new "话说得轻巧，可 Katei 只会再拿这一点做文章。"

    # game/script.rpy:17643
    old "...No matter who's in the right, someone is guilty. Although we don't know who it is, can't we lock ourselves up in one place so they can't move around freely?"
    new "……不管谁有理，我们当中确实有人有罪。既然不知道是谁，那我们能不能干脆把自己关在一个地方，让那个人没法随意行动？"

    # game/script.rpy:17649
    old "Is anyone opposed to that? Technically, only the culprit should have a problem with it."
    new "有人反对吗？按理说，只有真凶才会不愿意。"

    # game/script.rpy:17652
    old "If that was what Erina wanted, I'd attempt to make it happen. She wanted to avoid any more tragedy and only intended to wait for external help."
    new "既然这是 Erina 的意愿，我愿意尽力去办。她只想避免更多悲剧，安分地等待外界的救援。"

    # game/script.rpy:17657
    old "Locking ourselves up...? Isn't that going a bit too far?"
    new "把自己关起来……？这未免有些过火了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:17658
    old "Why would it be? You'd agree if you were innocent, and if something happens while we're staying somewhere, it means the culprit was never one of us."
    new "怎么会过火？清白的人自然会答应。要是我们待在一处的时候还出了事，那就说明凶手根本不在我们之中。"

    # game/script.rpy:17663
    old "...Could we even do that if we wanted to?"
    new "……就算真想这么做，我们办得到吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:17668
    old "I doubt it. We can lock the bathrooms, but they're not big enough for all of us."
    new "我看难。卫生间倒是能锁，可装不下我们所有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:17674
    old "Are there no other places?"
    new "就没有别的地方了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:17675
    old "What about the security room? Didn't Katei have the key for it?"
    new "监控室怎么样？钥匙不是在 Katei 手上吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:17676
    old "We won't be able to lock ourselves in there. From the inside, the lock can be undone with just the doorknob."
    new "那里没法把我们锁在里面。从内侧只要转动门把手，锁就能解开。"

    # game/script.rpy:17677
    old "What about the lobby? The hallway doors are locked until {time=9}, isn't that right?"
    new "大厅呢？走廊的门不是要等到 {time=9} 才开吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:17682
    old "They aren't. Permission to move ahead is simply not granted until that time. They can be locked, but I don't have the keys."
    new "不是锁着。只是到那个时间之前，不允许我们继续往前走罢了。门确实能锁，但钥匙不在我手里。"

    # game/script.rpy:17688
    old "If we do this... we'll have to commit to it. Locking ourselves in a place with the key to unlock it doesn't prove anyone's sincerity since they could leave any time they wanted."
    new "真要这么做……就得下决心坚持到底。把人锁在某个地方，钥匙却还留在自己手里，证明不了任何人的诚意——谁想走都能走。"

    # game/script.rpy:17693
    old "But that's all we could do if we managed to find the right keys. We won't be able to lock ourselves inside and leave the key out because the doors won't close if the deadbolt is set."
    new "可就算找对了钥匙，我们能做的也只有这一步。把钥匙留在外面、自己锁在里面是行不通的——门闩一扣上，门就关不上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17700
    old "Are you all forgetting about the attic bedrooms? We saw they had a keyhole, one had a working chain, and they're spacious enough for all of us. Could they work?"
    new "你们都忘了阁楼的卧室吗？我们看过，那儿有钥匙孔，其中一间有能用的链条锁，而且空间足够容下我们所有人。那里行不行？"

    # game/script.rpy:17705
    old "Wouldn't we run into the same problem?"
    new "那不会碰上同样的问题吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:17713
    old "I turned around, and after staring at the door for a short time, I spoke."
    new "我转过身，盯着那扇门看了一会儿，才开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:17724
    old "Hm... I don't think so, actually. I can think of a difference that would let us lock ourselves up without being able to leave."
    new "嗯……我倒觉得未必。我能想到一个不同之处，正好能让我们把自己关进去，又出不来。"

    # game/script.rpy:17725
    old "The silence let me know that nobody would directly oppose me. I began to walk until I thought of a question to ask."
    new "没人出声，我便知道不会有人当面反对。我迈开脚步，一边走一边琢磨该问些什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:17731
    old "Oh, does anyone have the cabinet key? If we're gonna stay put, let's make sure to lock the cabinet too and keep the key with us. It's possible the person behind all this has a duplicate, but nothing actually proves that."
    new "对了，展示柜的钥匙在谁那儿？既然要留在这里，就把展示柜也锁好，钥匙随身带着。幕后的人说不定有备用钥匙，不过没有证据证明这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:17733
    old "Once again, nobody said anything."
    new "这一次，依旧没有人作声。"

    # game/script.rpy:17739
    old "...If not, it has to still be where I left it, on top of that bed in the attic."
    new "……要是没人拿，那它应该还在我放的地方——阁楼那张床上。"

    # game/script.rpy:17740
    old "Let's see if it's there, then."
    new "那就去看看还在不在吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:17751
    old "We took the stairs up. The elevator had already been out of commission for a very long time, and it was better to keep it like that, as it had caused us a few headaches during the short time it worked."
    new "我们走楼梯上去。电梯停用已经很久了，而且最好就一直这么停着——它短暂恢复运行的那阵子，给我们添了不少麻烦。"

    # game/script.rpy:17758
    old "Wind Shelter"
    new "避风之处"

    # game/script.rpy:17763
    old "It's actually still here. Good."
    new "居然真的还在。很好。"

    # game/script.rpy:17766
    old "Surprisingly enough, the key hadn't been taken while everyone had a chance. I picked it up and glanced at the door."
    new "出乎意料，这钥匙明明谁都有机会拿走，却一直留在这里。我把它捡起来，朝门口看了一眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:17769
    old "I messed with it a little. It appeared to be a double cylinder lock, meaning that to unlock it, the key would be needed from each side, as opposed to the security room's lock."
    new "我摆弄了几下。看样子是双面锁芯，也就是说两侧都必须用钥匙才能开锁，和监控室的锁不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:17772
    old "It's going to work. We won't have to lock it either."
    new "能成。而且我们也不用上锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:17781
    old "I went ahead and looked through the drawers I'd inspected earlier. First, I took out the key to the room."
    new "我径直去翻先前查看过的抽屉。先取出来的是这间房的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:17785
    old "We'll have to leave this outside. Now, I'll explain how we can technically do this, but it's not exactly a smooth way."
    new "这把得留在外面。接下来我说明一下具体怎么操作——只是这办法算不上多漂亮。"

    # game/script.rpy:17788
    old "The second thing I took out of the drawer was a screwdriver. Admittedly, what I'd thought of had been inspired by the secret door we'd just found."
    new "我从抽屉里拿出的第二样东西，是一把螺丝刀。得承认，这个主意是刚才那扇暗门给我的启发。"

    # game/script.rpy:17793
    old "Removing a handle is incredibly easy. We can take it out, leave it outside, and close the door. Since we'll be unable to turn it, even though the door will be unlocked, we won't be able to open it. That's the big difference with this door—the handles on the crystal floor don't have visible screws to detach."
    new "拆下一个门把手容易得很。把它卸下来，留在门外，再把门关上。没有把手可转，门虽然没上锁，我们也打不开。这扇门和别处最大的不同就在这里——水晶层的门把手上看不到能拧下的螺丝。"

    # game/script.rpy:17796
    old "Since the keyhole isn't on the handle itself, we would need to leave the key outside. Otherwise, we could still get the door to open by inserting the key and turning it. Even though the lock wouldn't be set, it would act as a turn of a handle, and the door could be dragged open. On top of that, we can remove the outer handle as well so that no one can easily get in."
    new "钥匙孔并不在把手上，所以钥匙也得留在外面。否则只要插进钥匙一转，门照样能开。虽然锁不会扣上，但转动钥匙就等于转动把手，门就能被拉开。另外，外侧的把手我们也可以一并拆掉，这样谁都没法轻易进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:17797
    old "Finally, even though we'd hide the key outside, if someone found it and wanted to enter, they couldn't do it. They could find the key and open the door like I just described, but we can set the chain from the inside. If we do this, the door shouldn't be opened until the police enter the building. There's no way it'll be broken down."
    new "最后，就算我们把钥匙藏在外面，有人找到了想闯进来，也进不来。他们可以找到钥匙，照我刚才说的方式开门，但我们能从里面挂上链条锁。这样一来，在警方进楼之前，这扇门都不该被打开。想破门而入是不可能的。"

    # game/script.rpy:17802
    old "Nobody was sure what to say. Personally, I knew that it meant giving up on understanding the Sekimeiya's mechanics, but after what happened to Isla, it was clear that something terrible could come out of that."
    new "谁都不知道该说什么。我心里清楚，这么做等于放弃弄清 Sekimeiya 的运作原理；可看到 Isla 的遭遇之后，已经很明白了——继续追查下去，说不定会招来可怕的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:17807
    old "You must be joking... This is Ashiya's special place, and we're currently being recorded. Do you not understand what will happen if they see us ripping the handles apart?"
    new "你是在说笑吧……这里可是芦屋的特别之处，况且我们眼下正被拍着。要是让人看到我们在拆门把手，会有什么后果，你难道不明白？"

    # game/script.rpy:17808
    old "Honestly, who cares? It'll be easy to reattach them. We could do that right as the tower opens, but we'll unfortunately have to leave the handles out of the room or else we could leave at any point."
    new "说实话，谁在乎？重新装回去又不难。等塔开门的时候再装也行，只可惜门把手只能留在房间外面，否则我们随时都能出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:17809
    old "That reminds me... What time is it? It's been a while since the last time I checked it."
    new "说起来……现在几点了？我上次看时间已经过去好一阵了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17810
    old "With a brief sigh indicating that he wasn't fond of my proposition, Sai turned his wrist. I looked at his watch and saw that the displayed time was {time=14:56.}"
    new "Sai 轻叹一声，显然并不赞同我的提议，随即转动手腕。我看向他的手表，上面显示的时间是 {time=14:56.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:17811
    old "Almost {time=15}, I see. We're past the halfway point, so with all that's happened, let's spend the last six hours calmly until the police enter and we can have a better understanding of what's been going on."
    new "都快 {time=15} 了啊。时间已经过半，既然发生了这么多事，剩下的六个小时就安静度过吧，等警察进来，我们也好更清楚地弄明白到底出了什么状况。"

    # game/script.rpy:17812
    old "It was an easy way to finally test the recording. If nothing happened after we waited those last six hours, we would have to have a long discussion about it."
    new "这倒是个简单的办法，正好能借此测试录音。要是最后六个小时过去仍毫无动静，我们就得为此好好谈一谈了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17818
    old "This is what I wanted. Thank you."
    new "这正是我所希望的。谢谢你。"

    # game/script.rpy:17819
    old "Erina's gratitude was the ultimate deciding factor. We'd lock ourselves away from the Sekimeiya, ensuring that its powers wouldn't influence our peaceful wait. Hopefully, we'd also be preventing the culprit's plan from moving along."
    new "Erina 的感谢，最终让我下定了决心。我们要把自己和 Sekimeiya 隔开，确保它的力量不会干扰我们安稳等待。但愿这样一来，也能拖住犯人的计划。"

    # game/script.rpy:17820
    old "I'd go lock the Sekimeiya cabinet myself, but we're trying to act together by doing this. Let's avoid separating now and creating chances to prepare anything."
    new "我本来想自己去把 Sekimeiya 的展示柜锁上，但这么做正是为了我们能一起行动。现在别再分开，免得给谁留下准备的机会。"

    # game/script.rpy:17821
    old "...Any objection?"
    new "……有谁反对吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:17827
    old "Sai and Katei rolled their eyes, but they kept quiet. If we were alone with both Sekimeiya locked in place as well, nobody could use them.{w} Everyone looked uncertain, and Sai seemed depressed. He'd made it obvious he was enjoying his time in the tower, and instead of having another six hours to play with a time travel device, it was already over."
    new "Sai 和 Katei 翻了个白眼，但都没作声。只要我们单独待在这里，两个 Sekimeiya 也都锁在原处，谁也没法使用它们。{w}众人神色犹疑，Sai 则显得颇为沮丧。他之前明显很享受在塔里的时光；本来还有六个小时能摆弄时间穿越装置，现在就这么结束了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17839
    old "We entered the event room and saw that the Sekimeiya hadn't moved. I made sure the glass was properly adjusted, and I manually locked it. From that point on, only the key that I had could open it, so I possessed the keys to both Sekimeiya. Regarding the locker key, I'd have to surreptitiously leave it somewhere in the bedroom after waiting a while. That way, anyone could've had it."
    new "我们走进活动室，确认 Sekimeiya 没有移动。我检查了玻璃罩是否摆正，然后亲手上了锁。从那一刻起，只有我手里的钥匙能打开它，也就是说，两个 Sekimeiya 的钥匙都在我身上。至于储物柜的钥匙，我得等一阵子后再悄悄留在卧室某处，这样一来，谁都有可能拿到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:17848
    old "Finally, we went up again. We'd just gone through staircases eighteen times, so we were pretty exhausted. The idea of waiting calmly in a bedroom with three big beds started to sound slightly more pleasant."
    new "最后，我们又上了楼。我们刚刚上上下下走了十八趟楼梯，大家都累得够呛。想到能在有三张大床的卧室里安静等待，竟开始觉得稍微惬意了些。"

    # game/script.rpy:17849
    old "We'll be here for six hours, so it's the right time to use the bathroom."
    new "我们要在这里待六个小时，趁现在去趟洗手间正合适。"

    # game/script.rpy:17852
    old "Once inside, we'd have no way to exit, so everyone made sure to prevent a future problem. All of us went to the bathroom one at a time, and when we were all set, Sai spoke."
    new "一旦进去，我们就没法出来了，所以大家都尽量提前把问题解决掉。我们一个接一个去了洗手间，等全都准备妥当，Sai 开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:17859
    old "Sure, if we're gonna do this, let's do it well. We're dealing with someone who's teleported and gone back in time before, so regardless of whether they're one of us or not, we need to keep that in mind."
    new "行，既然要做，就做周全些。我们要对付的人既传送过，也曾回到过去，所以不管对方是不是我们中的一员，这一点都得记在心里。"

    # game/script.rpy:17860
    old "We need to make sure the door won't be opened no matter what, but a single key can ruin that."
    new "必须确保这扇门无论如何都打不开，可只要有一把钥匙，就能让这一切前功尽弃。"

    # game/script.rpy:17863
    old "He went to grab the bedroom key that I'd left on top of the drawers."
    new "他去拿我放在抽屉柜顶上的卧室钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:17868
    old "Katei, are you sure the key in the other bedroom won't work?"
    new "Katei，你确定另一间卧室的钥匙打不开这扇门？"

    # game/script.rpy:17873
    old "I said it earlier: they're not interchangeable."
    new "我刚才说过了：两把钥匙不通用。"

    # game/script.rpy:17877
    old "Sai moved from one room to the other and came back with the key for the neighboring bedroom."
    new "Sai 从一间卧室走到另一间，带着隔壁卧室的钥匙回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17882
    old "You're right. They're different."
    new "你说得对。两把钥匙不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:17883
    old "He attempted to insert the wrong key into the door's keyhole, but it only went halfway in."
    new "他试着把错误的钥匙插进门上的锁孔，却只插进去一半。"

    # game/script.rpy:17886
    old "He went to return it and closed the door behind him once he came back to the hallway."
    new "他把钥匙放回去，回到走廊后顺手带上了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:17891
    old "Now, there've been instances where we thought the Sekimeiya teleported. The first time was when it appeared in the storeroom, but recently, it appeared inside the cabinet, next to Isla..."
    new "到目前为止，我们有好几次以为 Sekimeiya 发生了传送。第一次是它出现在储藏室里，而最近一次，它出现在展示柜内，就在 Isla 旁边……"

    # game/script.rpy:17892
    old "Atsuki and Shiroya could've put it there, but if they didn't, it might've moved by itself. That's not a random location either, so if it was part of the culprit's plan, there's a chance they understand how to exploit this self-teleportation."
    new "Atsuki 和 Shiroya 有可能把它放到那里，但如果不是他们，那就可能是它自己移动的。那个位置也绝非随机，所以若这是犯人的计划，对方或许已经懂得如何利用这种自我传送。"

    # game/script.rpy:17897
    old "It's more likely they moved it themselves, but keep in mind that if that's what happened, they had to travel from the future because we inspected the whole building before that point. If we're gonna stay here until the end, that means that none of us will have the chance to go back in time and move the Sekimeiya."
    new "更可能是犯人自己搬动的，但别忘了，若真是如此，对方只能从未来穿越回来，因为在那之前，我们已经检查过整栋楼。如果我们打算一直待在这里直到最后，那就意味着我们之中没人有机会回到过去搬动 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:17902
    old "The four main possibilities are: the culprit isn't one of us and we kept missing them.{w} The Sekimeiya teleported there randomly.{w} The culprit made the Sekimeiya teleport there without touching it.{w} One of us will go back to the past after spending six hours here."
    new "主要可能性有四种：犯人并不在我们之中，只是我们一直没撞见对方。{w} Sekimeiya 随机传送到了那里。{w} 犯人没有触碰 Sekimeiya，却让它传送到了那里。{w} 我们中的某个人会在这里待满六小时后回到过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:17907
    old "No matter which one is right, before we lock ourselves away, we need to thoroughly inspect this bedroom. Both levels.{w} If a Sekimeiya's already here, the imprisonment wouldn't mean anything, as anyone could leave at any time after making sure nobody else is in range. A key would do the trick too, and we've seen that some kind of replication has occurred. We found two identical suitcases and two Naomis."
    new "不管哪一种才是真的，在把自己关起来之前，我们都得把这间卧室彻底检查一遍。上下两层都要查。{w}如果这里已经有一个 Sekimeiya，那我们把自己关起来就毫无意义——只要确认没有其他人在重叠范围内，谁都能随时离开。一把钥匙也能达到同样的效果，而我们已经见过某种复制现象：两个一模一样的行李箱，还有两个 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:17908
    old "He didn't mention it, but even though I hadn't seen both at the same time, two Sekimeiya had to have existed too, at least at one point."
    new "他没有提到这一点，但尽管我没同时见过两个 Sekimeiya，至少在某段时间里，确实存在过两个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:17913
    old "Searching for an extra key to this bedroom might sound paranoid since nothing indicates it exists, but it's necessary. If we ignore these precautions, we're leaving a potential escape route for the culprit that can be used at any time.{w} They have higher knowledge of the Sekimeiya than we do, so we have no guarantee that they couldn't obtain a key they would hide later, use it to escape, go back to the past, and preemptively hide a replicated key inside knowing we'd lock ourselves in here."
    new "现在去找这间卧室的备用钥匙，听起来或许有些疑神疑鬼，毕竟没有任何迹象表明它存在，但这一步是必要的。要是忽略这些防范，就等于给犯人留下一条随时能用的退路。{w}对方对 Sekimeiya 的了解远胜于我们，所以我们无法保证他们不会弄到一把钥匙：他们可以先把钥匙藏好，再用它逃出去，回到过去，然后提前在这间房里藏下一把复制钥匙——毕竟他们知道我们会把自己锁在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:17916
    old "...{w}Yeah. Our intention is to be safe in here, so let's search around beforehand."
    new "……{w}是啊。我们就是想在这里确保安全，所以先搜一遍吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:17922
    old "You're saying \"be safe\", but at the same time, you and Sai keep implying that one of us is behind all this. This person has already killed up to three times, so if what we're doing opposes their plan, wouldn't they just kill us instead of escaping in this convoluted way?"
    new "你嘴上说「确保安全」，可你和 Sai 又一直暗示我们当中有人是幕后黑手。这个人已经夺走了多达三条人命。如果我们的做法妨碍了对方的计划，对方何不直接杀了我们，偏要用这么迂回的方式脱身？"

    # game/script.rpy:17927
    old "I wouldn't say they'd have an easy time of it, but let's see...{w} Hey, jackass, if you're actually here, we're gonna lock ourselves in this room for six hours.{w} If you intend to kill us to continue with your plan at some point, hurry up and do it now before you need to deal with breaking the door down."
    new "我倒不觉得他们能轻松得手，不过……走着瞧吧。{w}喂，混账东西，你要是真在这儿，我们接下来会把自己锁在这间房里六个小时。{w}如果你打算之后杀了我们继续你的计划，那就趁现在赶紧动手，省得到时候还得费劲破门。"

    # game/script.rpy:17930
    old "Nobody moved, but it was clear that we all had our guard up. If someone was around and didn't care about killing us if they had to, the right call would likely be to start after we were locked inside so that nobody could run away."
    new "没人动弹，但显然大家全都提起了戒心。如果真有某个人在附近，并且不介意必要时杀掉我们，那么最合理的做法，大概是等我们被锁在里面之后再动手，这样谁都逃不掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:17935
    old "It's not like anyone has really spoken up against this plan, right? It might even be that by staying here, we're not inconveniencing some mastermind. In any case, it's undeniably safer than continuing to roam around."
    new "毕竟也没人真的反对这个计划，对吧？甚至有可能，我们待在这里并不会碍着某个幕后黑手。不管怎么说，这总比继续四处乱转安全得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:17941
    old "That seemed to assuage Akaro's worries.{w} The six of us went to the upper section of the bedroom to inspect it. I used that time to try to prevent something really bad from happening, as Sai's insistence made me realize something else was to come."
    new "这番话似乎打消了 Akaro 的顾虑。{w}我们六个人来到卧室上层检查。我趁那段时间设法阻止真正糟糕的事发生，因为 Sai 的坚持让我意识到，后面还有别的变故。"

    # game/script.rpy:17946
    old "The space was small, so we shortly determined that there were no keys anywhere."
    new "空间不大，我们很快就确认哪里都没有钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:17951
    old "We repeated the process below, and once again, it seemed nothing had been preemptively hidden, revealing that nobody had already attempted to outsmart us."
    new "我们在下层又重复了一遍，结果同样没有发现任何提前藏好的东西，这说明还没有人试图抢先算计我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:17952
    old "We're ready, then."
    new "那就准备好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17957
    old "Don't be silly. We're missing the most important part."
    new "别傻了。最重要的部分还没做。"

    # game/script.rpy:17959
    old "We need to search everyone. Someone could currently have the key."
    new "我们得搜每个人的身。现在可能就有人带着那把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:17963
    old "Of course, as I'd thought, Sai wouldn't miss such an obvious procedure. It was very important to do it, but in our situation, it meant something else: the key to Naomi's locker that I'd kept on myself was likely about to be found."
    new "果然如我所料，Sai 不会漏掉这么显而易见的步骤。这一步固然重要，但在我们眼下的处境里，还意味着另一件事：我一直带在身上的 Naomi 储物柜钥匙，恐怕就要被搜出来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17964
    old "Shiroya must've been aware of it too. As soon as I found myself in that unavoidable situation, there was nothing I could do without being seen. ...All I managed to do was prepare a risky trick before we went up the ladder, and I'd already begun to run through possible excuses while foolishly regretting that I hadn't hidden it in the bathroom."
    new "Shiroya 一定也察觉到了。一旦陷入那种避无可避的局面，我只要行动就会被人看见。……我唯一做到的，是在我们爬上梯子之前准备了一个冒险的花招；同时，我已经开始在心里盘算各种可能的借口，还愚蠢地后悔没把那东西藏进洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:17969
    old "When we were up top, I made sure nobody had the funny idea of leaving anything hidden for later. I am very sure that, right now, both sections of this bedroom don't contain anything the culprit has deliberately left here.{w} I'll begin."
    new "我们在上面时，我已经确认过没人动过歪脑筋，提前藏下什么东西。现在我可以肯定，这间卧室的上下两层都没有犯人故意留下的物品。{w}我先来。"

    # game/script.rpy:17970
    old "Sai showed us the contents of every one of his pockets, his hip pack, and shoes. He held the original key to the bedroom, but he'd been gripping it even before we'd started to look around. However, he took something else from one of his back pockets."
    new "Sai 把每个口袋、腰包以及鞋子里的东西都展示给我们看。他拿着那间卧室原本的钥匙，而早在开始搜查之前，他就一直攥着它。不过，他又从一只后袋里拿出了另一样东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:17971
    old "This is the key to my house and my identification, and this is the ticket for today's event. I have nothing else on me."
    new "这是我家的钥匙和我的证件，这是今天活动的门票。我身上没有别的东西了。"

    # game/script.rpy:17972
    old "Let's all do the same."
    new "大家都照这样来。"

    # game/script.rpy:17975
    old "Hold on. You don't mean to say that proves you're clean, do you?"
    new "等等。你不会想说，这样就能证明你清白吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:17980
    old "My objection had a reason behind it.{w} That method of showing we didn't possess anything was highly disadvantageous for me. Even though letting them find my key wouldn't have been the worst, Shiroya and I would've become very suspicious, and if anyone realized what the key was for, they would all see the Sekimeiya in the locker. Furthermore, it'd bring back the commotion Erina had been trying to eliminate. That was why I took the single chance I believed I had."
    new "我出言反对，是有原因的。{w}那种证明我们身上没藏东西的做法，对我极为不利。就算被他们搜出我的钥匙还不算最糟，我和 Shiroya 也会立刻成为重点怀疑对象；而一旦有人想明白那把钥匙是开什么的，所有人就会看到储物柜里的 Sekimeiya。更何况，那还会重新掀起 Erina 一直在设法消除的骚动。所以我才抓住了自认为唯一的一次机会。"

    # game/script.rpy:17985
    old "No, of course... Do you want me to get naked?"
    new "不，当然不是……你该不会想让我脱光吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:17986
    old "Just a while ago, you said we should do this well. You could have a key under your clothes, yes, but you don't have to undress."
    new "刚才不是你自己说，这件事要认真做吗。衣服里确实可能藏钥匙，可没必要脱衣服。"

    # game/script.rpy:17992
    old "I walked up to him, and like a security agent, I began patting his body from top to bottom."
    new "我走到他面前，像安检员一样，从上到下拍打他的身体。"

    # game/script.rpy:17999
    old "All right, now you can say you're clean."
    new "好了，现在你可以说自己身上干净了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18000
    old "Well, thank God. I was going to do this too, don't worry. ...Let's continue with you, then."
    new "那就好，谢天谢地。我也打算这么做的，放心。……接下来换你了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18001
    old "I just wanted to make sure, and that's fine, since you won't find anything."
    new "我只是想确认一下。反正你什么也搜不到，这样正好。"

    # game/script.rpy:18002
    old "I immediately knew that I had sounded a little off. It was intentional, to set the expectation that nothing would be found on me.{w} As such, when he got to the right pocket of my pants, he looked at me with a frown, noticing that I'd been incorrect."
    new "话一出口，我就知道自己听着有些不对劲。那是我故意的，好让他以为我身上什么都搜不出来。{w}因此，当他摸到我裤子右边口袋时，皱起眉头看向我——他察觉到我方才说错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18008
    old "I took that brief moment of surprise to take out what he'd felt from my pocket."
    new "我趁他那一瞬间的惊讶，把被他摸到的东西从口袋里掏了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:18014
    old "Ah, right. I'd forgotten I put this key there."
    new "啊，对。我忘了自己把这把钥匙放那儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18015
    old "With two fingers, I was gripping the Sekimeiya cabinet key. I moved aside and placed it on top of the drawers."
    new "我用两根手指捏着 Sekimeiya 展示柜的钥匙，移到一旁，把它放到抽屉顶上。"

    # game/script.rpy:18023
    old "I'll leave it here; we need to lock ourselves inside with it, as I said before."
    new "就放这儿吧。像我之前说的，我们还得用它把自己锁在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:18027
    old "Trying to appear nonchalant, I walked back and told Sai to continue. Like I'd done to him, he finished checking the lower part of my body."
    new "我故作若无其事地走回去，让 Sai 继续。他也像方才我对他那样，把我下半身检查完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18032
    old "...Okay, you're clean too.{w} Katei, mind being next?"
    new "……好，你也没问题。{w}Katei，下一个你来？"

    # game/script.rpy:18042
    old "I took a deep, discreet breath. Shiroya had been fixing her eyes on me, but I'd attempted not to meet them. I stepped back, and Katei took my place."
    new "我暗暗深吸一口气。Shiroya 一直盯着我看，我却尽量不去迎她的目光。我退到一旁，Katei 站到了我的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:18043
    old "I moved to Shiroya's side; she was probably wondering if I'd already gotten rid of the key. Later, without being heard, I'd have to tell her what I'd done. Despite how things seemed, it was still located in my right pocket."
    new "我挪到 Shiroya 身边。她大概在担心我有没有把钥匙处理掉。等之后找机会，我得悄悄告诉她我做了什么。表面上看起来是那样，可钥匙其实还在我右边口袋里。"

    # game/script.rpy:18046
    old "Before going up the ladder, I'd thought that I had only one way to avoid being found out; I would've been easily noticed if I attempted to leave the key somewhere.{w} Taking advantage of the fact that I also had the cabinet key and that it was slightly bigger, I'd removed the locker key from my back pocket and slid it into the same pocket as the cabinet's. Until that point, I'd avoided keeping both together so that I didn't produce metallic noises as I walked."
    new "上梯子之前我就想过，要避免被识破，我只有一条路可走。若想把钥匙藏在别处，必定会被人轻易发现。{w}幸好我身上还带着展示柜的钥匙，而且比储物柜那把稍大一些；我便把储物柜钥匙从后裤袋取出，塞进装展示柜钥匙的同一个口袋。此前我一直刻意不让两把钥匙放在一起，免得走路时发出金属碰撞的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:18047
    old "The locker key was small. I'd purposely put it horizontally behind the cabinet's so that Sai would press his hand on it and only notice the bigger shape at the front.{w} Fortunately, I'd been able to abuse his minor surprise by taking out the cabinet key and leaving the smaller one inside. When the body inspection proceeded, he assumed the right pocket was clean and didn't check it again."
    new "储物柜的钥匙很小。我故意把它横着塞在展示柜钥匙后面，这样 Sai 摸到时，只会注意到前面那个更大的轮廓。{w}幸好我趁着他那一瞬间的惊讶，把展示柜钥匙取了出来，小钥匙仍留在口袋里。之后继续搜身时，他便以为右边口袋已经查过，没有再检查一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:18053
    old "...Hm, what's this?"
    new "……嗯，这是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:18054
    old "I looked up. Sai was feeling one of Katei's pockets, and it appeared he'd found something inside. That time, it was Sai who first put his hand in and retrieved, yet again, a key."
    new "我抬起头。Sai 正在摸 Katei 的一个口袋，似乎在里面摸到了什么。这一次是 Sai 先把手伸进去，掏出来的又是一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:18059
    old "Oh, right. I'd also forgotten I had this."
    new "哦，对。我也忘了自己身上有这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:18065
    old "We all recognized it. It was the old-looking key we'd found on the floor of hallway A."
    new "我们全都认了出来。那是我们在 A走廊地板上捡到的那把看起来很旧的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:18066
    old "Didn't you say you'd keep it somewhere safe?"
    new "你不是说要把它放到安全的地方吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:18067
    old "I forgot, but don't worry. My pocket is plenty safe."
    new "忘了，不过放心吧。我口袋里就很安全。"

    # game/script.rpy:18074
    old "After staring at it, Sai put the key back in.{w} In the next pocket, he found something else. For the third time in a row, they were keys."
    new "Sai 盯着它看了半晌，把钥匙放了回去。{w}他又在下一个口袋里摸到了别的东西。连续第三次，都是钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:18079
    old "You know these four as well. One is for the bathrooms, another is for the security room, this one opens my locker in the staff room, and this one is for the door leading to floor 2."
    new "这四把你们也认得。一把开洗手间，一把开监控室，这把开我在员工室的储物柜，还有这把是开通往二楼那扇门的。"

    # game/script.rpy:18082
    old "Silently, Sai finished the inspection without finding anything else. Still unsatisfied, he took out all the keys once again and attempted to insert them into the door's keyhole."
    new "Sai 没再说什么，把剩下的检查做完，别无所获。他似乎仍不满意，又把所有钥匙取出来，逐一试着插进门上的锁孔。"

    # game/script.rpy:18088
    old "They don't work.{w} You're done, then."
    new "都开不了。{w}那你也查完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18089
    old "He gave the keys back to Katei, and before the next person could be examined, I voiced a thought."
    new "他把钥匙还给 Katei。下一个人还没开始检查，我便说出了心里的一个念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:18092
    old "That first key... Could it be for the hidden door we found?"
    new "最先那把钥匙……会不会就是开我们找到的那扇暗门的？"

    # game/script.rpy:18098
    old "I just thought the same thing. Both have this feeling of being fairly old, and there's no other door in this building that does."
    new "我也刚想到这个。两样东西都让人觉得相当旧，而这栋楼里也没有别的门给人这种感觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:18103
    old "Huh. You might be right, actually."
    new "嚯。说不定还真是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:18104
    old "We thought the culprit dropped it in a hurry. If that's what happened, it could be why they had to remove the handle."
    new "我们原本以为，是犯人匆忙间把它掉在了那里。如果真是这样，也许正因如此，他们才不得不把门把手拆掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:18105
    old "But the key spent a long time on the floor, so why didn't they retrieve it before we found it? They already left the suitcase in hallway C at some point."
    new "可那把钥匙在地板上放了很久。他们为什么没在我们发现之前把它捡回去？毕竟他们不知什么时候就已经把行李箱留在了 C走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:18106
    old "We went quiet at the mention of the suitcase. We'd more or less assumed that Naomi had left it there, but we weren't sure anymore."
    new "一提到行李箱，大家都沉默了。我们之前大致认定是 Naomi 把它留在那里的，可如今已经不敢肯定了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18113
    old "You're right... Maybe they wanted to avoid every possibility of being spotted and didn't want to step into hallway A.{w} The fingerprints that you saw... Are they clear enough to be useful? If the police can figure out who they belong to, that could be a path to the culprit."
    new "你说得对……也许他们想杜绝一切被人看到的可能，所以不愿意踏进 A走廊。{w}你看到的那些指纹……清晰到能派上用场吗？如果警方能查出指纹属于谁，那或许就是追到犯人的一条线索。"

    # game/script.rpy:18116
    old "I'm not sure. The clear ones were all replaced by mine, but there might've been some more around because you need to push the wall in order to open it."
    new "不好说。清晰的那几枚全被我的指纹盖掉了，不过周围可能还有别的，毕竟得推开那面墙才能把门打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:18121
    old "I see. If whoever it is doesn't go erase them upon realizing that we found them, some should still remain. But if they're one of us, the fingerprints won't mean anything since it won't be provable that they were left before we found the door."
    new "原来如此。如果那个人意识到我们已经发现了门，却没有去擦掉指纹，那应该还会留下一些。可要是犯人就在我们之中，指纹就没有意义了，因为无法证明那是在我们发现门之前留下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:18122
    old "Yeah. There's one more thing, too.{w} When we discovered the secret door, my first thought was that someone bypassed our searches by hiding there."
    new "嗯。还有一点。{w}我们发现那扇暗门时，我首先想到的是，有人藏在那里，躲过了我们的搜查。"

    # game/script.rpy:18123
    old "However, even though the light wasn't very bright, what Shiroya and I initially saw were three distinguishable fingerprints. I don't think any were overlapping."
    new "可是，尽管光线并不算亮，我和 Shiroya 最初看到的却是三枚清晰可辨的指纹。我记得它们并没有互相重叠。"

    # game/script.rpy:18124
    old "You mean that the door was only recently opened once?"
    new "你的意思是，那扇门最近只被打开过一次？"

    # game/script.rpy:18125
    old "From hallway A, maybe. If it was only opened once, it can't be that someone went to hide there all the times we searched unless they spent hours inside. Maybe that proves it wasn't one of us."
    new "也许是从 A 走廊那边开的吧。如果只开过一次，那就不可能每次我们搜查时都有人躲进去——除非他们在里面待了好几个小时。这也许能证明，犯人不在我们之中。"

    # game/script.rpy:18130
    old "Huh...{w} I suppose they could've used the Sekimeiya to teleport inside without opening the wall, but that doesn't sound likely.{w} Anyway, who's next?"
    new "唔……{w}他们也可能用 Sekimeiya 直接传送进去，根本不用开墙，不过这听起来不太可能。{w}总之，下一个是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:18136
    old "Shiroya volunteered.{w} In her case, nothing was found in her clothes. Her purse was almost empty and only contained a wallet, two of the three tickets we'd bought for the event, our personal identification to match the tickets, and the key to my house."
    new "Shiroya 主动上前。{w}她身上什么都没搜出来。她的手提包里几乎空无一物，只有一只钱包、我们为活动买的三张票中的两张、用来核对门票的身份证件，以及我家的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:18144
    old "Akaro was next. In the same way, his inspection was handled quickly, and once again, personal keys, his identification, and his own entrance ticket were all we found on him. It wasn't surprising, as the same kind of body search would also be performed before entering the tower."
    new "接着是 Akaro。同样，他的检查很快就结束了，从他身上找到的依旧只有他自己的钥匙、身份证明和入场券。这并不奇怪，毕竟进塔之前也会进行同样的搜身。"

    # game/script.rpy:18150
    old "All right, done. Finally, I don't mean to suspect you, Erina, but ignoring you would defeat the purpose of what you're trying to accomplish."
    new "好，结束了。最后，Erina，我不是想怀疑你，可要是跳过你，你想达成的目的就落空了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18155
    old "...I know. That's fine."
    new "……我知道。没关系。"

    # game/script.rpy:18156
    old "She moved ahead. Usually, it would've been worth considering that the person who proposed the arrangement had a secret reason, but I knew Erina was genuine. Sai gently made sure she hadn't been concealing anything, and by letting us know that her purse was clean as well, he put an end to our last measure.{w} Personal keys and identification had also been found in her purse. We were specifically searching for hidden keys, so even though it was normal we all possessed ours, Sai made sure to confirm that their shape didn't match the bedroom door's."
    new "她走上前。按理说，该想一想提出这个办法的人是不是另有隐情，但我知道 Erina 是真心实意的。Sai 不紧不慢地确认她没藏任何东西，又告诉我们她的手提包也没有问题，我们最后一道措施到此结束。{w}她的包里同样只有她自己的钥匙和身份证明。我们要找的正是藏起来的钥匙，因此虽然人人带着自己的钥匙再正常不过，Sai 还是逐一确认了它们的形状与卧室门锁不符。"

    # game/script.rpy:18163
    old "Good, this went well. Now, doing what I explained should be easy."
    new "很好，很顺利。那么，按我说的去做应该不难。"

    # game/script.rpy:18165
    old "Since nobody had any complaints, I took one screwdriver out of a drawer and compared it with the screws that kept the door's handle attached."
    new "既然没人有意见，我从抽屉里拿出一把螺丝刀，对着固定门把手的那几颗螺丝比了比。"

    # game/script.rpy:18170
    old "It'll work. It's not a perfect match, but it'll definitely suffice."
    new "行得通。虽说不是完全吻合，但绝对够用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18179
    old "We wanted to hide the key and outer handle outside, right? There's not much of a point to it since the chain will prevent anyone from entering, but can you think of a good place to hide it?"
    new "我们是要把钥匙和外把手藏到门外吧？反正有门链挡着，谁也进不来，其实意义不大——不过，你能想到什么藏东西的好地方吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:18180
    old "I feel like under the bathroom carpet is good enough. Like you said, it's not too important.{w} Regarding the handle, no great spot comes to mind, but it doesn't matter anyway. The attic's full of removable handles, so someone outside could probably unscrew one to use it on the door if they really wanted to open it. In case that happens, we have the chain to rely on."
    new "我觉得藏在卫生间地毯下面就可以了。就像你说的，这本来也不太重要。{w}至于外把手，我一时想不出什么好地方，不过反正无所谓。阁楼里可拆的把手多得是，外面的人若真想开门，卸一个下来装上去就行。真到那一步，还有门链拦着。"

    # game/script.rpy:18185
    old "Yeah, that sounds fine."
    new "嗯，就这样吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:18193
    old "From the hallway, we clearly saw Sai leaving the key under the carpet without any kind of trick involved."
    new "站在走廊里，我们看得清清楚楚，Sai 把钥匙塞到地毯下，没耍任何花招。"

    # game/script.rpy:18202
    old "There it is. Only one thing to do, then."
    new "找到了。那就只剩一件事要做了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18203
    old "We all moved back inside. With the big screwdriver, I removed the four screws of the inner handle, which fell on my hands."
    new "我们一行人重新回到屋里。我用那把大螺丝刀拧下内侧把手的四颗螺丝，把手落在我的手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:18211
    old "...It'd be great if we could use this on the storeroom door."
    new "……要是这法子能用在储藏室的门上就好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18216
    old "We should all get ready to face the consequences of this. Don't be surprised if Ashiya blows this tiny action out of proportion."
    new "大家都做好承担后果的准备吧。芦屋就算把这点小事大做文章，也不足为奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:18217
    old "We get it. That's fine, they can do what they want."
    new "我们知道。无所谓，随他们怎么折腾。"

    # game/script.rpy:18222
    old "I unscrewed the outer handle too and left both of them under the bed in the opposite bedroom.{w} In the door, only one hole became visible, as the keyhole wasn't found on the handles themselves. I made sure that the door couldn't be opened through the hole. A very short metal cylinder was poking out, but it was incredibly tight; we weren't going to turn it from the inside. When I was certain, I asked one last time."
    new "外侧的把手我也一并卸下，两个都放到对面卧室的床底。{w}门上只露出一个孔，因为锁孔并不在把手上。我确认过，光凭这个孔打不开门。孔里探出一小截金属圆柱，但卡得极紧，从内侧根本拧不动。确认无误后，我最后问了一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:18223
    old "Okay, this is it. If I close this door, we won't be able to open it again. Any final objection?"
    new "好，就到这里。这扇门一旦关上，我们就再也打不开了。还有人有异议吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:18233
    old "I looked at the five of them, who knew what their next six hours would be like. Nobody opened their mouth, so I proceeded with the most important action."
    new "我看了看他们五人——接下来六个小时会怎么过，他们心里都清楚。没有人开口，我便开始了那最关键的一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:18241
    old "Slowly, I pushed the door forward. There was no friction against the floor, so I applied force until it satisfyingly set into place."
    new "我缓缓把门往前推。门底与地面毫无摩擦，我一点点加力，直到它干脆地合到位。"

    # game/script.rpy:18250
    old "...We'd sealed ourselves in. Surprisingly, it had taken a fair amount of concord. It was clear that nobody wanted to oppose the request because Erina made it. Any regrets were no longer meaningful."
    new "……我们把自己封在了里面。出乎意料的是，这需要相当的齐心协力。显然，因为是 Erina 提出的请求，谁都不愿反对。事到如今，后悔也没有意义了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18253
    old "As the icing on the cake, we set the chain. I attempted to pull the door inward and push it outward, and as expected, it didn't budge. It had become a barrier from both sides, and the only way to unlock it would be telling the police where we'd left the key and detaching the chain for them. Cooperation from both sides was needed."
    new "最后，我们又挂上了门链。我试着把门往里拉、往外推，果然纹丝不动。这扇门从两侧都成了屏障，要打开它，唯一的方法就是告诉警察钥匙放在了哪里，再替他们把门链取下——必须两边配合才行。"

    # game/script.rpy:18267
    old "Now we wait. We could do with a deck of cards."
    new "接下来就是等了。要是有副扑克牌就好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18272
    old "We don't have any, so just try to stay still and quiet for once. You have been enough of a handful for one day."
    new "没有牌。你就安安静静待着吧，哪怕就这一回。今天你惹的麻烦已经够多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18277
    old "Katei, there's a lot of resentment within you. How does it feel to know that after we wait six hours, you're gonna go straight to prison?"
    new "Katei，你心里怨气可不小。等这六个小时过去，你就直接进监狱了，作何感想？"

    # game/script.rpy:18282
    old "I haven't done anything, so that won't happen."
    new "我什么都没做，不会发生那种事。"

    # game/script.rpy:18287
    old "Well, Ashiya doesn't seem to think the same, remember? Wasn't your authority revoked?"
    new "是吗，可芦屋好像不这么看，记得吗？你的权限不是已经被撤了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:18288
    old "...What's the time?"
    new "……现在几点了？"

    # game/script.rpy:18295
    old "Hm, {time=15:08.}"
    new "嗯，{time=15:08.}"

    # game/script.rpy:18296
    old "Did nothing else happen to your watch? Seems like it's still working fine."
    new "你的表后来没再出别的问题？看起来走得挺正常。"

    # game/script.rpy:18306
    old "Oh, you know about that? Yeah, we fixed it earlier."
    new "哦，你知道这事？是啊，之前就修好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18312
    old "Yes, when we were waiting in the lobby, before you two appeared."
    new "对，就在大厅等着的时候，你们俩还没来。"

    # game/script.rpy:18318
    old "...You didn't know? Sai asked me if I had lithium batteries because his watch wasn't working. He didn't mention that part when he told you what happened, but it was insignificant."
    new "……你不知道？Sai 的表停了，问我有没有锂电池。他跟你讲经过的时候没提这一段，不过那也无关紧要。"

    # game/script.rpy:18323
    old "That's right. How did you know that, Atsuki?"
    new "没错。Atsuki，你是怎么知道的？"

    # game/script.rpy:18324
    old "I wasn't talking about that. It didn't work once before that point. You're still claiming that wasn't you, right?"
    new "我说的不是这件事。在那之前，它已经停过一次了。你仍然坚持说那不是你干的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:18329
    old "Probably, since I don't know what you're talking about. It was convenient that Katei had the right type of battery in the security room."
    new "大概吧，反正我不知道你在说什么。好在 Katei 在监控室里正好有这种电池。"

    # game/script.rpy:18331
    old "What time and date was displayed when you changed the battery?"
    new "你换电池的时候，表上显示的是几月几日、几点？"

    # game/script.rpy:18332
    old "Some minutes earlier than the time shown on the computer, which is when it must've stopped working. Then, I synced it properly again."
    new "比电脑上显示的时间早几分钟，应该就是那时候停的。然后我重新把它校准了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18334
    old "Is that so...?"
    new "是这样吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:18339
    old "I don't know what you two are talking about, but I bet Sai failed at looking innocent again, right?"
    new "我不知道你们俩在说什么，不过我猜 Sai 又没装出那副无辜的样子，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:18344
    old "Your irony knows no limits. Are you already thinking about how you'll lie to the police?"
    new "你这讽刺真是没完没了。你已经在琢磨怎么跟警察说谎了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:18345
    old "Stop. We decided to stay here to end these discussions."
    new "够了。我们决定留在这里，就是为了让这些争论到此为止。"

    # game/script.rpy:18350
    old "I know. We're already locked in, though, so I have to rub it in Katei's face. I bet he's crying internally since his plan can't be finished now."
    new "我知道。不过反正门已经锁了，我总得当面挖苦 Katei 几句。他的计划这下完不成了，心里肯定在哭吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:18351
    old "...But Katei was right. Sai had noticed his watch stopped working again, so like I did, he asked for lithium batteries. That was further indication that he remembered the time he and I fixed the watch."
    new "……但 Katei 说得没错。Sai 发现自己的表又停了，于是和我当初一样，找人要锂电池。这进一步说明，他还记得我和他一起修表的那一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:18357
    old "...I'll go up and wait there."
    new "……我到楼上去等。"

    # game/script.rpy:18358
    old "Before the conversation snowballed again, Erina was the one who stopped Sai. To get as far from the door as possible, she chose to go rest in the upper bedroom. I knew that the illusion of tranquility was well achieved there, so taking advantage of her opening, I decided to follow her."
    new "在话题再度失控之前，是 Erina 出面拦住了 Sai。为了离大门越远越好，她选择去楼上的卧室休息。我知道那里能很好地营造出安宁的假象，于是趁她提出这个建议，决定跟上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:18359
    old "We will too. Separating ourselves into two groups of three will be the best way to utilize the space."
    new "我们也上去。分成两组、每组三人，是最好利用这块空间的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:18368
    old "Taking my cue, Shiroya went up with me. It seemed that Erina wanted to distance herself from the commotion that Sai and Katei continued to spawn, so by claiming the upstairs area for ourselves, we at least had a chance to remain unbothered for a long time."
    new "Shiroya 会意，随我一起上了楼。Erina 似乎想远离 Sai 和 Katei 不断掀起的喧闹，我们把楼上这块地方占下来，至少能有一阵子不受打扰。"

    # game/script.rpy:18377
    old "Erina was sitting on a bed. She didn't pay much attention to our presence, so we silently sat on the opposite one.{w} Although six hours still had to pass, I promptly realized that I was still exhausted. It was possible I could sleep and fast-forward to {time=21.}"
    new "Erina 坐在一张床上，没怎么理会我们，我们便默默坐到对面那张床上。{w}虽说还有六个小时要熬，我很快意识到自己依旧疲惫不堪。说不定睡一觉，就能直接睡到 {time=21.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:18380
    old "We'd closed the hatch, so we couldn't hear the people under us. If they decided to keep arguing with moderate voices, we wouldn't hear it."
    new "我们把盖板合上了，所以听不到楼下的动静。就算他们打算压低声音继续吵，我们也听不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:18382
    old "It was time to disconnect. I'd been actively trying to piece everything together, but after choosing to abandon that, only time would force me to go back, in the case that something horrible awaited us at the end of the road.{w} At least, that was what I'd been ready to accept."
    new "我该停止想这些了。我一直在努力想拼凑出全貌，但既然选择放手，就只有时间能逼我重新面对——假如路的尽头真有什么可怕的东西在等着我们。{w}至少，我已经准备好接受这一点了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18389
    old "You two didn't do anything to Isla, right...?"
    new "你们俩没对 Isla 做什么吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:18390
    old "Taking both of us by surprise, Erina broke the silence she had set up. We raised our heads to see her deep eyes peering at us."
    new "Erina 忽然开口，打破了自己先前营造的沉默，我和身旁的人都吃了一惊。我们抬起头，正对上她那双深邃的眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:18395
    old "Absolutely not...! We were sleeping in the other bedroom when everything happened."
    new "绝不可能……！事情发生的时候，我们都在另一间卧室里睡觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:18400
    old "Is it possible one of you left while the other was sleeping?"
    new "有没有可能，你们中的一个趁另一个睡着时离开过？"

    # game/script.rpy:18401
    old "...There's no way that happened."
    new "……那不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:18407
    old "Do you two... trust each other that much even though there's a... a killer around? Are you two related? I saw that only one of you had house keys."
    new "你们俩……就算附近可能有个……杀人凶手，你们还这么信任彼此吗？你们是亲属吗？我看见你们中只有一个人带着家门钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:18408
    old "...We're just friends. Unfortunately, we have no way to prove it, but I promise that we left after... Isla was found."
    new "……我们只是朋友。可惜我们没法证明这一点，但我保证，我们是在……Isla 被发现之后才离开的。"

    # game/script.rpy:18415
    old "...Earlier, I thought that Sai had a point. Why did you go straight to the lobby from hallway B without looking at the cleaning room?"
    new "……刚才我觉得 Sai 说得有道理。你们为什么从 B走廊直接去了大厅，却没看一眼清洁间？"

    # game/script.rpy:18421
    old "...That was my mistake. I should've acted as if we had already seen the cart and the missing Sekimeiya, but without a second thought, I had tried to appear surprised to make it seem like we'd never entered the room and couldn't have hidden it."
    new "……那是我失策了。我本该表现得像是早就见过那辆推车和不见了的 Sekimeiya，可我却想都没想就装出惊讶的样子，好让人以为我们从未进过那个房间，也不可能把它藏起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:18422
    old "It might sound iffy, but what we said earlier was the truth. We went to the bathroom and then checked the event room and the lobby, where we thought people could be."
    new "听起来也许不太可信，但我们之前说的都是实话。我们去了洗手间，然后去活动室和大厅看了看，觉得那里可能会有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:18427
    old "Then, is Katei the only person who could've done it?"
    new "那么，能做到这件事的只有 Katei 一个人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:18428
    old "Him...? Right, a lot of things regarding his whereabouts still don't make sense, but it shouldn't be that straightforward. It could've been an accident caused by the Sekimeiya."
    new "他……？也对，关于他行踪的许多事情仍然说不通，但事情应该没这么简单。也可能是 Sekimeiya 造成的一场意外。"

    # game/script.rpy:18433
    old "It was no accident. Isla saw something inside that cabinet, so she must've been lured there. Katei could've made her disappear; he's known about the Sekimeiya for longer than anyone else.{w} Then, he showed up after he left Isla's body in the cabinet... You two have experienced what the Sekimeiya does, but I don't know how to think about it."
    new "那不是意外。Isla 在展示柜里看见了什么，所以一定是被人引过去的。Katei 可能让她消失了；他了解 Sekimeiya 的时间比任何人都长。{w} 然后，他把 Isla 的遗体留在展示柜里，自己又现身了……你们俩已经见识过 Sekimeiya 的作用，可我不知道该怎么看待这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:18434
    old "It's possible that she... was sent to the cabinet from the future, right? Isn't that similar to something you said a while ago? If that happened, it could've been anyone, but she would have to still... be alive."
    new "有没有可能，她……是从未来被送到展示柜里的？这和你之前说的某件事不是很像吗？如果真是这样，那谁都可能做到，但她必须还……活着。"

    # game/script.rpy:18435
    old "It was clear that Erina was attaching herself to the slightest gleam of hope that still persisted. The recording \"proved\" that Isla would be alive in the future, so Erina needed the time to pass to know if there was any trust left to be placed in it. She must've suggested waiting in the room in the hope of nothing occurring at {time=21.}"
    new "看得出来，Erina 正紧紧抓住最后一丝尚存的希望。那段录音「证明」了 Isla 在未来会活着，所以 Erina 需要等时间过去，才能知道它是否还值得相信。一定是她提议在房间里等到 {time=21.}，盼着那时什么都不会发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:18436
    old "I've been thinking about it, but I don't know what could've happened. I-I'm sorry..."
    new "我一直在想这件事，可我也想不出究竟发生了什么。对、对不起……"

    # game/script.rpy:18441
    old "I wanted to give her even more hope, but I stopped myself, knowing that it would only make things worse if I was wrong. Even if Isla would somehow be alive in a month, her fate had already been shown to us: she would end up dead in the crystal floor's cabinet even if she had to travel there from a month in the future."
    new "我本想再给她一些希望，但还是忍住了。我知道，如果我猜错了，只会让事情更糟。就算 Isla 一个月后真的还活着，她的命运也已经摆在我们眼前：即便她不得不从一个月后的未来穿越到那里，最终也会死在水晶展室的展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:18442
    old "At least, that was what I thought until I remembered that the two Naomi bodies defied that belief.{w} I believed that no matter what had happened to Isla, being dead inside the cabinet had to be the end of her path. However, two identical corpses hinted that the Sekimeiya could have some sway even after death. That was the actual hope Erina had to rely on—the recording didn't guarantee a bright future even if it turned out to be legitimate."
    new "至少，我原本是这么想的——直到我记起那两具 Naomi 的遗体，这个念头才被推翻。{w} 我曾相信，无论 Isla 遭遇了什么，死在展示柜里都必然是她这条路的终点。然而，两具一模一样的尸体暗示着，Sekimeiya 在死后仍可能施加某种影响。那才是 Erina 真正能依靠的希望——即使那段录音是真的，也并不能保证一个光明的未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:18443
    old "In that instant, I felt a bubble of hope growing in my head.{w} The Sekimeiya hadn't caused any apparent effect when it touched Isla's dead body, even though we might not have seen it immediately. If that had created a living version of her at an earlier point in time like I speculated with Naomi... My thoughts were directed to Miiya once again."
    new "那一瞬间，我脑中仿佛有一个希望的泡沫正在膨胀。{w} Sekimeiya 触碰到 Isla 的遗体时，并没有造成任何明显的效果——尽管我们也许没能立刻看出来。如果它像我对 Naomi 的推测那样，在更早的时间点创造出了一个活着的她……我的思绪又一次转向了 Miiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:18446
    old "...But that bubble popped as soon as images of her burnt pieces of flesh appeared in my mind. The Sekimeiya had to exist somewhere two weeks in the past, but how could I touch a body that had been blown to pieces?"
    new "……可她的身体被烧成焦黑碎块的画面一浮现在脑中，那个泡沫便立刻破灭了。两周前的过去里，Sekimeiya 必定存在于某处，可我要怎么去触碰一具已经被炸成碎片的身体？"

    # game/script.rpy:18447
    old "I forced myself to stop thinking. The three of us present in the room had all lost someone very dear to us, and we all silently prayed that somehow they could be brought back."
    new "我强迫自己不再想下去。房间里的三个人都失去了珍视的人，我们都在心里默默祈祷，盼着他们能以某种方式回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:18448
    old "It was cruel to consider that there was a culprit somewhere who had killed at least once, possessing a higher knowledge of how the Sekimeiya worked—exactly what all of us needed the most."
    new "一想到某处有个至少杀过一人的凶手，而且比我们更了解 Sekimeiya 的运作方式——那恰恰是我们所有人最需要的东西——我就觉得无比残酷。"

    # game/script.rpy:18454
    old "...It's my fault, isn't it? It doesn't matter who did it... I brought her here."
    new "……都怪我，对吧？不管是谁下的手……是我把她带到这里来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:18460
    old "I bought the tickets for today... to make Isla happy. And instead, she..."
    new "我买今天的票……是想让 Isla 开心。结果她却……"

    # game/script.rpy:18462
    old "It should have been me. Why would anyone want to hurt Isla?"
    new "该遭殃的人是我才对。为什么会有人想伤害 Isla？"

    # game/script.rpy:18463
    old "I had no idea how to respond to something as dark as that, and Shiroya clearly didn't either. We lapsed into silence for a few minutes. Part of Erina, I was sure, believed that Isla was still alive somewhere, while another part accepted that she was dead and already mourned her."
    new "面对如此沉重的话，我不知该如何回应，Shiroya 显然也一样。我们沉默了好几分钟。我确信，Erina 心里一部分仍相信 Isla 还在某处活着，另一部分却已经接受她的死，开始为她哀悼。"

    # game/script.rpy:18466
    old "...Do you know about Akashic Park?"
    new "……你们知道阿卡西公园吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:18477
    old "The amusement park?"
    new "那座游乐园？"

    # game/script.rpy:18479
    old "I'd heard about it. It was a few hours away from Yushibana. Apparently, it was surrounded by mountains, and it competed worldwide for the largest park in size. Its selling point was that it contained \"all possible configurations of every ride in the world\", so despite my low interest, it had piqued my curiosity more than once."
    new "我听说过。它离丰花有几个小时的路程。据说那座公园四面环山，面积之大在全世界也名列前茅。它的卖点在于汇集了「世界上所有游乐设施的一切可能形态」，所以尽管我兴趣不大，它也不止一次勾起了我的好奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:18484
    old "You might've thought Isla was obsessed with the gems downstairs, but that didn't even come close to how much she wanted to go there. ...She brought it up countless times, but it's really expensive, and I've always been a bit afraid of ride malfunctions."
    new "你或许以为 Isla 对楼下的宝石很着迷，可那远比不上她想去那里的程度。……她提过无数次，可那里实在太贵，而且我一直有点害怕游乐设施出故障。"

    # game/script.rpy:18485
    old "I was going to have more money than usual this month since it's the end of the year. I decided to finally give in and surprise her with a trip after Christmas..."
    new "这个月是年底，我手头会比平时宽裕一些。我终于决定让步，等圣诞节过后带她去旅行，给她一个惊喜……"

    # game/script.rpy:18490
    old "I told her about it less than a week ago, in case she preferred to hold off with the money and plan a trip during the summer instead. Even though she was really excited at first, she actually told me that she didn't want to go."
    new "不到一周前，我把这件事告诉了她，想着她也许更愿意先把这笔钱留着，改到夏天再安排旅行。她起初明明很兴奋，最后却说自己不想去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18493
    old "I couldn't believe it, but she said that she didn't want to leave her friend alone while she went to have fun. At one point, she also said that she would only come to see the Sekimeiya because I already bought the tickets and she didn't want to make me waste money... even though she started to talk about her friend before we got the tickets."
    new "我真不敢相信，可她说她不想自己出去玩，把朋友一个人丢下。她还一度说过，她会来看 Sekimeiya，只是因为我票都买好了，她不想让我浪费钱……可她在我们买票之前就已经开始提起那个朋友了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18498
    old "I told you the other ways her behavior changed, right? I forgot one. Sometimes, she hid something from me. A small object, I believe."
    new "我跟你说过她行为上的其他变化，对吧？我漏了一点。有时候，她会背着我藏东西。我觉得是个很小的物件。"

    # game/script.rpy:18508
    old "That's what it felt like. I noticed... a few times, she'd keep her hand in a fist for a long time. If I asked her to show me what she was hiding, she would run off, so I had to ignore it. It must've been something very small."
    new "给我的感觉就是这样。我注意到……有好几次，她一直攥着拳头，很久都不松开。要是我让她把藏着的东西给我看，她就会跑开，所以我也只能装作没看见。那一定是个很小的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:18510
    old "I can't get it all out of my head... Whatever happened to Isla started weeks ago, and I never realized it."
    new "这些事一直在我脑子里打转……Isla 遭遇的一切从几周前就开始了，可我从没察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:18512
    old "All of that was difficult to respond to, so I stayed quiet. However, Shiroya said something far from the shallow answers I'd kept to myself."
    new "这些话我都不知道该怎么接，只好沉默。可 Shiroya 说出口的话，与我压在心底的那些浅薄回答截然不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:18517
    old "Hold on... Erina, I might know who Isla's friend was."
    new "等等……Erina，我或许知道 Isla 的朋友是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:18521
    old "Wh-What...? Who?"
    new "什、什么……？是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:18522
    old "I frowned. How could she have known that? The only ideas I'd kept in mind were an imaginary friend, a Xyn member, and a staff member from the tower."
    new "我皱起眉。她怎么会知道？我心里想到过的可能，只有虚构的朋友、Xyn 的成员，以及塔里的工作人员。"

    # game/script.rpy:18527
    old "I'm not sure if it makes sense... When we learned about her friend's story, we hadn't experienced the Sekimeiya's powers yet. But just now... I thought of something that could make a lot of sense."
    new "我不确定这讲不讲得通……我们听说她那位朋友的事时，还没亲身经历过 Sekimeiya 的力量。但刚才……我想到了一种很可能成立的解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:18528
    old "Apparently, she and her friend were living together, but you said that was impossible since you hadn't seen her."
    new "按她的说法，她和那位朋友住在一起，可你说那不可能，因为你从没见过那个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:18533
    old "Could it be that her friend was herself? After traveling to the past?"
    new "会不会那位朋友就是穿越到过去之后的她自己？"

    # game/script.rpy:18534
    old "...{w}With that sentence, the huge but simple possibility opened up in my mind. I hadn't considered it at all since I'd been blinded by conspiracies, but I immediately understood why Shiroya reached that idea."
    new "……{w}听到这话，一个巨大却简单的可能性出现在我脑中。此前我完全没想到，因为我一直被种种阴谋猜测蒙住了眼，但我立刻明白了 Shiroya 为什么会想到这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:18539
    old "H-Herself...? What are you talking about!? I would've seen her!"
    new "她、她自己……？你在说什么啊！？我肯定会看见她的！"

    # game/script.rpy:18540
    old "I... think Shiroya might be right."
    new "我……觉得 Shiroya 也许说得对。"

    # game/script.rpy:18542
    old "You would've seen her, yes. You said that she started to disobey you sometimes, and you even found her at home once instead of being at school."
    new "你确实见过她。你说过她有时会不听你的话，还有一次，你发现她没去上学，就待在家里。"

    # game/script.rpy:18547
    old "Right. They were actively keeping her identity from you because they felt like they couldn't reveal that another Isla had appeared, but when one of them went to school or to do what you instructed her to do, the other couldn't follow. During those instances, you could have been seeing the Isla who came from the future."
    new "对。她们一直在刻意向你隐瞒她的身份，因为她们觉得不能让人知道又出现了一个 Isla。可当其中一人去上学，或者照你的吩咐去做事时，另一个就没法跟着。那种时候，你看到的很可能就是从未来来的那个 Isla。"

    # game/script.rpy:18552
    old "Wh-What...? Did I just imagine that her behavior changed? She distanced herself and spent much less time with me..."
    new "什、什么……？她态度变了，难道只是我的错觉？她开始疏远我，陪我的时间少了很多……"

    # game/script.rpy:18553
    old "Then this is one of the few things that explains it. Why else would she hide a friend from you? She didn't have bad intentions, and neither did her friend."
    new "这么说，能解释这一切的也就只有这个了。不然她为什么要把一个朋友藏起来不让你知道？她没有恶意，她的朋友也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:18557
    old "\"We watched my favorite movie together, and it was her favorite too!\" \"She went to the aquarium last month, just like us!\" I recalled a few things Erina had said."
    new "「我们一起看了我最喜欢的电影，那也是她最喜欢的！」「上个月她去了水族馆，和我们一样！」我想起了 Erina 说过的几句话。"

    # game/script.rpy:18558
    old "The way Isla described her friend made it sound as if she'd made up a persona that had her own traits and experienced the same events. However, it was herself from the future, wasn't it...? She wasn't lying."
    new "Isla 描述那个朋友的方式，听起来就像她凭空编出了一个人物——带着她自己的特质，经历着同样的事。可那其实就是未来的她自己，不是吗……？她没有说谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:18563
    old "Why else would she refuse to go to the amusement park? Both of them couldn't go at once, so she must not have wanted to leave her behind, knowing firsthand how much she wanted to go too."
    new "不然她为什么不肯去游乐园？两个人没法同时去，而她比谁都清楚对方有多想去，所以才不愿把对方一个人留下。"

    # game/script.rpy:18568
    old "Then, right now, she's outside...!"
    new "那么，她现在就在外面……！"

    # game/script.rpy:18569
    old "Isla... specifically said her friend was waiting for her outside."
    new "Isla……她特意说过，她的朋友在外面等她。"

    # game/script.rpy:18574
    old "That has to be it! She will exist in a month!"
    new "一定是这样！一个月后她就会存在了！"

    # game/script.rpy:18575
    old "...I didn't want to deny it, but it wasn't that simple.{w} In fact, nothing about her fate had changed.{w} I could assemble things the following way: \"when Isla disappeared from the cabinet, she went far into the past. The range should've been a lot bigger, but we might be wrong about that part. In a month, that Isla will somehow enter the tower\"."
    new "……我并不想否认，可事情没那么简单。{w} 事实上，她的命运丝毫没有改变。{w} 我只能这样拼凑：『Isla 从展示柜里消失时，回到了很久以前。重叠范围本该大得多，不过这一点也许是我们弄错了。一个月后，那个 Isla 会以某种方式进入塔里。』"

    # game/script.rpy:18578
    old "Tragically, no matter what I thought up, the following step had to be: \"Isla travels to the past and ends up dead in the cabinet\". There was no way to end it differently.{w} However, even though the voice recorder had appeared in Isla's purse, the origin of it was still unexplained with that theory."
    new "可悲的是，无论我怎么设想，下一步都只能是：『Isla 回到过去，最后死在展示柜里。』没有别的结局。{w} 然而，尽管录音笔出现在 Isla 的包里，这个说法仍然解释不了它的来历。"

    # game/script.rpy:18583
    old "Erina's head lowered, and her expression went back to how it had been minutes before."
    new "Erina 低下头，神情又变回了几分钟前的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:18584
    old "...I don't know. I appreciate that you want to believe Isla, but there's no way what she said was true. You remember what her friend supposedly told her about today's incident, right?"
    new "……我不知道。你想相信 Isla，这份心意我明白，可她说的不可能是真的。你还记得她那个朋友对今天的事是怎么说的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:18585
    old "...I'd tried to leave the major inconsistency for the end, but Erina was right."
    new "……我本想把这个最大的矛盾留到最后，可 Erina 说得对。"

    # game/script.rpy:18586
    old "\"Hm... She told me that something would happen in the tower, but not to worry. She said that if we stayed calm in one place, nobody would be hurt. And she promised I'd be able to see and touch the Sekimeiya, so she was right, wasn't she?\""
    new "『嗯……她告诉过我，塔里会出事，但不用担心。她说，只要我们待在一个地方保持冷静，就不会有人受伤。她还保证我能见到 Sekimeiya，还能摸到它——她没说错，对吧？』"

    # game/script.rpy:18591
    old "Yeah... According to her, there was going to be no danger. ...And she said that only seven people would get trapped."
    new "嗯……按她的说法，不会有什么危险。……她还说，只有七个人会被困住。"

    # game/script.rpy:18596
    old "Exactly. There's no way she'd say those things after seeing Naomi's body and after everything else that happened."
    new "正是。见过 Naomi 的尸体，又经历了后来发生的那些事，她绝不可能说出这种话。"

    # game/script.rpy:18599
    old "Actually, this isn't what I'm the most worried about. Thinking about it conceptually, this is something that cannot work."
    new "其实，我最担心的还不是这个。从道理上想，这件事根本不可能成立。"

    # game/script.rpy:18605
    old "Conceptually...? You have time traveled, right? Things that would normally be impossible are happening. You've said so yourself."
    new "从道理上……？你不是已经时间穿越了吗？本来不可能的事正在发生。这话是你自己说的。"

    # game/script.rpy:18606
    old "That's not what I mean. We've come to the conclusion that the past can't be changed, so what we're suggesting is that Isla met her own self who had traveled from the future. They kept her existence hidden from you, and the friend let the original Isla know about today's events."
    new "我不是那个意思。我们已经得出结论：过去无法改变。所以现在这套说法等于在讲，Isla 遇见了从未来穿越回来的自己。她们一起向你隐瞒了另一个人的存在，而那个『朋友』把今天会发生的事告诉了原本的 Isla。"

    # game/script.rpy:18607
    old "Ignoring that what she was told was incorrect, the next step is flawed. She can't go back to the past and \"relive what she experienced\". She would have to replicate exactly what her friend had done and said, as the past would occur exactly as it already had. There's naturally no way she would willingly do that."
    new "暂且不管她听到的内容本身就出了错，接下来的环节也说不通。她不可能回到过去，『重历一遍自己的经历』。她必须把那位朋友做过的事、说过的话一模一样地重演，因为过去会原封不动地重演。她当然不可能心甘情愿这么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:18608
    old "Isla said they'd been hanging out a lot, so as I said, conceptually, it's incredibly unreasonable to think that she spent the time as her friend knowing how everything would play out.{w} You saw her once when she hadn't gone to school, which should be an impossibility since she would've known you would see her, and she would've avoided that."
    new "Isla 说她们经常一起玩，所以正如我所说，从道理上讲，要认为她以朋友的身份度过那段时光、而且明知一切会怎么发展，实在荒唐透顶。{w} 有一次你看见她没去上学，这本来不可能发生——她明知会被你撞见，就该避开才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:18613
    old "I see... Y-You're right. It's not possible. I hadn't seen it like that..."
    new "原来如此……你、你说得对。这不可能。我之前没往这方面想……"

    # game/script.rpy:18616
    old "Everything we think about goes back to the same core: we don't really understand how the Sekimeiya works. We can't say it's not possible, but the way we're currently thinking about it can't function."
    new "我们想到的一切最后都绕回同一个核心：我们并不真正了解 Sekimeiya 是怎么运作的。我们不能断定它不可能，可按我们现在的思路，这条路走不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:18617
    old "I've made up arbitrary rules to explain a few things that have occurred, but as long as they work, we can't discard them. If traveling so long to the past made Isla's memory fuzzy, for example, she might not have remembered the time she spent with herself."
    new "为了解释已经发生的几件事，我临时编了些规则，可只要它们还成立，我们就不能丢掉。比如说，如果穿越到那么久远的过去让 Isla 的记忆变得模糊，那她也许就不记得和自己相处的那段时光了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18618
    old "From her perspective, that would've been happening for the first time, so she would've acted on her own without being aware that she was repeating everything. She would've also misremembered what occurred today and given Isla false information that she trusted completely."
    new "从她的角度来看，那些事都是第一次发生，所以她会按自己的意愿行动，根本不会察觉自己是在重演一切。她还会记错今天发生的事，把错误的消息告诉 Isla，而 Isla 却完全相信了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18623
    old "All right... Thank you."
    new "好吧……谢谢你。"

    # game/script.rpy:18633
    old "Instead of continuing, Erina turned around and lay on the bed while Shiroya and I looked lost. Her idea had a lot of promise, but it appeared ultimately impossible until we had more information.{w} I'd usually been able to create a patchwork design out of the loose ends of a theory, but in that case, I couldn't think of anything else. Needless to say, I didn't think any part of my memory had been erased upon traveling—although, to be fair, perhaps I wouldn't have realized it."
    new "Erina 没有再说下去，转身躺倒在床上，我和 Shiroya 则愣在原地。她的设想很有希望，但在掌握更多线索之前，似乎终究行不通。{w} 换作平时，我总能把理论里那些散落的线头拼成一个勉强自洽的轮廓，可这一次，我再也想不出别的了。不用说，我并不认为自己在穿越时丢失了某段记忆——不过话说回来，就算真丢了，我大概也不会察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:18635
    old "Were we completely off-base? Was it all just a scheme planned by someone? Before I gave up on the idea, an extra piece of the puzzle that we'd ignored came back to me."
    new "难道我们完全想错了方向？这一切会不会只是某个人布下的局？我正想放弃这个念头时，一块被我们忽略的拼图又浮现在脑海里。"

    # game/script.rpy:18641
    old "...Where am I...?"
    new "……{w}我这是在哪儿……？"

    # game/script.rpy:18643
    old "No, I know. What I mean is... What happened to me? Where am I?"
    new "不，我知道。我是说……我到底怎么了？我在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:18644
    old "\"Following that, there were a couple of unsteady, heavy footfalls, most likely someone staggering. During the next few seconds, Isla cried, and nobody spoke, inside or outside the recording.\""
    new "『紧接着，是两下沉重而不稳的脚步声，多半是有人踉跄了几步。接下来几秒里，Isla 哭了，录音里外都没有人说话。』"

    # game/script.rpy:18645
    old "Those were words said by Isla, and they were scheduled to happen in about a month. Was the dark meaning behind Isla's future actions... that she'd discovered the fate that awaited her?"
    new "那是 Isla 说的话，而它注定会在约一个月后应验。Isla 未来那些举动背后的含义……难道是她已经发现了等待自己的命运？"

    # game/script.rpy:18646
    old "Had she found out that she had died and that her fate had been sealed?"
    new "她是否已经知道，自己死了，命运早已注定？"

    # game/script.rpy:18647
    old "\"...What happened to me? Where am I?\" I remembered the agonizing way that sounded."
    new "『……我出了什么事？我到底在哪儿？』我记得那声音听起来有多么痛苦。"

    # game/script.rpy:18648
    old "I breathed deeply, but anxiety began to crawl up my back, exacerbated by my own lack of knowledge.{w} I hated exploring all sorts of options without knowing if I'd ever find the truth. Isla's bleak ending had already been revealed to us, making the process of putting together its outline all the more draining."
    new "我深深吸了口气，焦虑却沿着脊背爬上来。因为对真相一无所知，这份焦虑越发强烈。{w} 我讨厌在不知道能否找到真相的情况下，把所有可能性都试一遍。Isla 凄惨的结局已经摆在我们眼前，要把它的轮廓拼出来，就更让人心力交瘁。"

    # game/script.rpy:18655
    old "Shiroya was resting her head on top of a large pillow. We'd been there for a little while, and the people below us hadn't interrupted us yet. It seemed like relaxing would be an actual option."
    new "Shiroya 把头枕在一个大枕头上。我们在这儿已经待了一阵，下面的人始终没来打扰。看来放松一下确实可行。"

    # game/script.rpy:18656
    old "I climbed over Shiroya and lay down, making contact with the cold wall. She was occupying both pillows, so I knew I'd have a hard time staying in a comfortable position. Trying to not mind it, I closed my eyes."
    new "我越过 Shiroya 躺下，背贴上冰冷的墙壁。两个枕头都被她占了，我知道自己很难保持舒服的姿势。我尽量不去在意，闭上了眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:18663
    old "As usual, attempting to keep my mind blank was futile, but the contents of what tormented me were very different. Time travel, a smoke attack, body doubles, murders, suspicion... What kind of mess were we in?"
    new "和往常一样，想让脑子一片空白只是徒劳，但折磨我的东西已经全然不同。时间穿越、烟雾袭击、冒牌货、杀人、猜疑……我们到底卷进了怎样的乱局？"

    # game/script.rpy:18664
    old "I was aware that there was no guarantee I'd ever feel my own bed again, depending on what the truth around us really was. Ironically, the stiff bed began to help me get rid of those thoughts, and my senses slowly faded away."
    new "我心里清楚，真相如何尚未可知，我未必还能再躺回自己的床上。讽刺的是，这张硬邦邦的床反倒帮我把那些念头赶了出去，我的意识也慢慢模糊了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18673
    old "Nobody moved for many minutes."
    new "有好几分钟，谁也没有动。"

    # game/script.rpy:18674
    old "Atsuki! Who do you think you are!?"
    new "Atsuki！你以为你算什么东西！？"

    # game/script.rpy:18677
    old "I was about to lose touch with reality when a sound brought me back to my surroundings. The three of us were startled simultaneously and looked at the hatch that had just opened."
    new "我正要彻底脱离现实，一个声响把我拉回了当下。我们三人同时一惊，望向那扇刚被打开的活板门。"

    # game/script.rpy:18680
    old "...Hm?{w} ...Wh-What...?"
    new "……嗯？{w}……什、什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:18681
    old "Katei appeared through the hatch with a dour expression. Since he'd addressed me, I tried to stand up, but I could only support my torso with an arm."
    new "Katei 沉着脸从活板门里钻了出来。他既然叫了我，我便想站起来，却只能用一条手臂撑起上半身。"

    # game/script.rpy:18689
    old "Atsuki!{w} Did you really think you could get out of this with simple threats? Those will not work on me, so once we make it out, you can say goodbye to your normal life."
    new "Atsuki！{w} 你真以为几句威胁就能把这事了结？威胁对我没用。等我们出去，你就跟正常生活告别吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:18690
    old "I couldn't comprehend a word of what he was saying. He'd sat on the bed and put his face up close to mine. His eyes told me that he was being serious, but I couldn't help but respond with an exaggerated frown."
    new "他的话我一个字也没听懂。他坐到床上，把脸凑到我面前。他的眼神说明他是认真的，我却忍不住夸张地皱起眉来。"

    # game/script.rpy:18694
    old "Are you listening to me!?"
    new "你到底有没有在听我说话！？"

    # game/script.rpy:18695
    old "What the hell are you on about...?"
    new "你他妈到底在胡说些什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:18700
    old "Stop with your façade. It all makes sense, and I know Shiroya must be working with you."
    new "别再装了。一切都说得通，Shiroya 一定和你是一伙的。"

    # game/script.rpy:18706
    old "...Huh?"
    new "……啊？"

    # game/script.rpy:18712
    old "For a second, I thought he might've figured out we'd hidden the Sekimeiya and decided to blow it out of proportion."
    new "有那么一瞬，我甚至以为他察觉了我们藏起 Sekimeiya 的事，要拿它大做文章。"

    # game/script.rpy:18717
    old "Don't worry, Erina, I know he's been threatening you from the start. We're all locked up here, so now he can't pull one of his tricks."
    new "别怕，Erina，我知道他从一开始就在威胁你。现在我们都被关在这里，他耍不出什么花招了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18722
    old "When I left the lobby earlier, you were who followed me, not Sai. However, you made the others cover for you. That wasn't a smart move, idiot."
    new "刚才我离开大厅的时候，跟上来的人是你，不是 Sai。可你让其他人替你圆谎。这可不是什么聪明的做法，蠢货。"

    # game/script.rpy:18723
    old "I didn't realize that everything was a fabrication. You killed the first Naomi and had everyone else lie about it. That's why you made up the elevator noise: to frame me or someone else."
    new "我竟没看出来，这一切都是编出来的。第一个 Naomi 是你杀的，还让别人替你撒谎。电梯的响动也是你编的——为了嫁祸给我，或者别人。"

    # game/script.rpy:18727
    old "Are you fucking out of your mind...? Why would I want to frame you if everyone else was covering for me?"
    new "你他妈脑子坏掉了吗……？既然所有人都替我遮掩，我干嘛还要嫁祸你？"

    # game/script.rpy:18732
    old "Do not try to change the facts. When the second Naomi died, conveniently, I ended up on floor 6 while you and everyone you'd threatened were under me. That's why you could all act as if you had an alibi for her death."
    new "别想歪曲事实。第二个 Naomi 死的时候，我偏偏在六楼，而你和你威胁过的所有人都待在我楼下。所以你们才能个个装出有不在场证明的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:18737
    old "You knew about the attic key and had been here already. You could've had every key from the beginning."
    new "你早就知道阁楼钥匙的事，也早就来过这里。说不定从一开始，所有钥匙就都在你手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:18742
    old "...Right! How did I ignore such suspicious behavior? You and Shiroya left the attic and didn't come back for fifty minutes! And then the Sekimeiya mysteriously disappeared!"
    new "……对了！这么可疑的举动，我怎么就没在意？你和 Shiroya 离开阁楼，整整五十分钟没回来！紧接着 Sekimeiya 就不翼而飞了！"

    # game/script.rpy:18747
    old "But you instructed Sai to immediately act suspiciously as soon as we went down to confuse me."
    new "可你还指使 Sai，我们一下去，他就立刻做出可疑的举动，好扰乱我的判断。"

    # game/script.rpy:18749
    old "Despite everything that had occurred, my bewilderment thus far couldn't compare to what I felt from the words I was hearing."
    new "此前无论出了多少事，都比不上此刻这些话带给我的错愕。"

    # game/script.rpy:18754
    old "And then... Isla died. You were behind that, right? You tried to make us believe that you were sleeping as it happened! How did I swallow that lie...?{w} Shiroya found the hidden passage in the storeroom? How was I so stupid...? You were about to use it...!"
    new "然后……Isla 死了。那也是你干的吧？你还想让我们相信，事发时你正在睡觉！我怎么就信了这种鬼话……？{w} Shiroya 在储藏室里找到了暗门？我怎么这么蠢……？你本来就要用那扇门……！"

    # game/script.rpy:18755
    old "Before showing up in the lobby, you came from hallway B! You were too stupid to appear from hallway A after removing the Sekimeiya from the cleaning room!"
    new "出现在大厅之前，你是从 B走廊过来的！你把 Sekimeiya 从清洁间拿走之后，蠢到连从 A走廊现身都想不到！"

    # game/script.rpy:18760
    old "No wonder you sided with Erina and wanted everyone to stay locked in here. After all, you'd hidden the Sekimeiya and could safely sleep like you were doing just now. Did you actually think any of this would work?"
    new "难怪你要站在 Erina 那边，还巴不得所有人都锁在这里。毕竟 Sekimeiya 已经藏好了，你大可以像刚才那样安心睡觉。你真以为这一套能行得通？"

    # game/script.rpy:18761
    old "...{w}Are you just fucking around, or are you really this dumb?"
    new "……{w}你他妈是在耍我，还是真就蠢到这个地步？"

    # game/script.rpy:18766
    old "I suppose you're not going to give up. You two are the culprits behind this incident.{w} Why were you in the first group of the guided visit when you've shown no interest in the gems? Now that I've learned about it, you must confess. I know you didn't attempt to threaten me individually since I work here and there's no way I'd give in to you."
    new "看来你是不会认了。这起事件就是你们俩干的。{w}你对宝石从来没什么兴趣，为什么偏偏排在参观的第一批？既然我已经查清了，你就老实交代吧。我知道你没单独来威胁我——我在这里工作，绝不可能向你低头。"

    # game/script.rpy:18767
    old "I'm having a hard time following. Do you actually believe what you're saying?"
    new "我实在跟不上你的思路。这些话，你自己信吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:18774
    old "Katei's face shifted. I couldn't understand what was happening."
    new "Katei 的脸色变了。我看不懂眼前究竟在发生什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:18775
    old "I never thought you were brilliant, but come on. There are some huge inconsistencies with everything that you said. What's gotten into you?"
    new "我从来没觉得你有多聪明，可这也太离谱了。你刚才说的那些，前后矛盾一大堆。你到底怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:18780
    old "Instead of replying, he looked at Erina. Upon seeing that she didn't immediately corroborate his story, he breathed faintly to keep calm."
    new "他没有回答，而是看向 Erina。见她并没有立刻附和，他轻轻吸了口气，努力让自己镇定下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:18781
    old "I'm serious, tell me. Did you just rub some brain cells together for this and come here thinking that you'd cracked the mystery? I discarded a few theories earlier because they relied on you being completely brainless, but now I should reconsider them."
    new "我是认真的，回答我。你就把脑子里那点东西凑了凑，跑到这儿来以为案子破了？我之前舍弃过几种推论，因为它们都要求你完全没脑子；现在看来，我该把它们重新捡起来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18782
    old "Once again, he decided to remain quiet."
    new "他依旧选择沉默。"

    # game/script.rpy:18785
    old "Subsequently, he retraced his steps and looked through the hatch. My perception of him had been changing as time advanced, but it had suddenly taken a significant turn. I still hadn't processed a few of the things he said."
    new "随后，他退回原路，透过活板门往下看。随着时间推移，我对他的看法一直在变，此刻却突然出现了一个大转折。他刚才说的几句话，我还没能理清。"

    # game/script.rpy:18786
    old "What the hell...? That son of a bitch...!"
    new "搞什么……？那个混蛋……！"

    # game/script.rpy:18791
    old "...It was time to stand up. I moved first since Katei had forcefully changed my mood. I walked up to him, and ignoring his awkwardly placed body, I kneeled down, trying to understand what he was looking at."
    new "……该起身了。Katei 硬是搅乱了我的情绪，于是我第一个动了。我走到他身旁，不去理会他那别扭的姿势，蹲下身，想看清他究竟在看什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:18796
    old "...What? There's no way..."
    new "……什么？不可能……"

    # game/script.rpy:18797
    old "Sai and Akaro weren't there.{w} From the hatch, I could see the entire lower bedroom devoid of any human presence."
    new "Sai 和 Akaro 不在那里。{w}透过活板门望下去，下面整间卧室里不见半个人影。"

    # game/script.rpy:18798
    old "Where are they? They couldn't have left..."
    new "他们人呢？不可能走得掉啊……"

    # game/script.rpy:18804
    old "I went down the ladder.{w} They weren't in the wardrobe or under the bed.{w} Countless questions hammered from inside my head, but I immediately went to check the door."
    new "我顺着梯子下去。{w}衣橱里没有，床底下也没有。{w}无数疑问在脑中敲打，可我还是先去查看房门。"

    # game/script.rpy:18810
    old "The chain isn't set."
    new "门链没有扣上。"

    # game/script.rpy:18811
    old "I said that out loud to inform the others who still remained upstairs. I attempted to get the door to open, but it still was locked in place."
    new "我出声说出来，好让还留在楼上的人听见。我试着把门弄开，门却依旧锁得死死的。"

    # game/script.rpy:18816
    old "I don't get it... How did they do it?"
    new "我搞不懂……他们到底是怎么做到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:18817
    old "It had to be around {time=15:30.} I doubted we'd been in the bedroom for more than 25 minutes. No matter what had happened, it was clear that calmness wasn't what awaited us."
    new "那时应该差不多是{time=15:30.}了。我们在卧室里待的时间，想必不超过二十五分钟。无论发生了什么，有一点很清楚：等着我们的绝不是平静。"

    # game/script.rpy:18828
    old "...At first, Sai began telling me that you'd threatened him and went into detail explaining how you'd managed to accomplish everything."
    new "……一开始，是 Sai 跟我说你威胁过他，还详细讲了你究竟是怎么做到这一切的。"

    # game/script.rpy:18829
    old "I didn't believe him at all, but he started to make some compelling arguments. It was Sai, though, so I didn't take him seriously."
    new "我根本不信他，可他说的渐渐有了几分说服力。不过那是 Sai，所以我也没有当真。"

    # game/script.rpy:18834
    old "However, even though Akaro had been looking at him with skepticism from the start, after a while, he confirmed Sai's story and gave us his version. He said you'd threatened him too, that Erina had fallen victim as well."
    new "然而，Akaro 虽然从一开始就满脸怀疑地看着他，过了一会儿却证实了 Sai 的说法，还讲了他自己的一套说法。他说你也威胁过他，Erina 也成了受害者。"

    # game/script.rpy:18839
    old "I'm sorry... But at that time, everything was pieced together, and I truly believed them."
    new "对不起……可当时所有事情都能拼得严丝合缝，我真的信了他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:18840
    old "This is too much... So they escaped after you went through the hatch?"
    new "这也太离谱了……所以他们是在你从活板门下去之后逃走的？"

    # game/script.rpy:18845
    old "I don't know how, but yes."
    new "我不知道他们是怎么做到的，但没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:18846
    old "I had no idea what was happening. Leaving should've been impossible, let alone in such a short time."
    new "我完全不明白发生了什么。离开本来就不可能，更别说在这么短的时间内了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18851
    old "Both of them probably wanted you to go up so they could leave without being seen."
    new "他们俩大概就是想让你上楼去，好趁机悄悄离开吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:18852
    old "And your stupidity was the perfect base for that to work. Like flour in a cake."
    new "而你的愚蠢正好成了最合适的底子。就像蛋糕里的面粉一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:18862
    old "Maybe the lock could be forced with something like a card, but it'd take a long time. There's no way they could've escaped in less than a minute."
    new "也许能用卡片之类的东西把锁撬开，但那得花很长时间。不到一分钟就逃出去，根本不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:18863
    old "The chain isn't set, so they definitely left through the door."
    new "门链没挂上，所以他们一定是从门离开的。"

    # game/script.rpy:18868
    old "Would we not have heard it if they'd forced it open? Maybe it was removed as a trick, to make us think they used the door."
    new "要是他们硬撬开的，我们怎么会没听见？也许门链是故意摘下来的，好让我们以为他们走的是门。"

    # game/script.rpy:18869
    old "I hated that feeling. We'd been shoved into another mystery without solving anything, and Sai's plan had worked. Additionally, it appeared that Akaro had no problem working with him to create a story where I was the main culprit."
    new "我讨厌那种感觉。什么都没查清，我们又被拖进了另一桩谜团里，而 Sai 的计划已经得逞。更糟的是，Akaro 似乎毫不介意与他联手，编出一个以我为主谋的故事。"

    # game/script.rpy:18870
    old "We would've left eventually, but the notion that nobody would be able to go back to the past if we stayed there was already obsolete. It had become possible for Sai and Akaro to appear in the past, if that was part of their intent."
    new "我们迟早会离开，可「只要守在这里，就没人能回到过去」这个念头早已作废。只要 Sai 和 Akaro 有意，他们完全可能出现在过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:18876
    old "Even though Erina hadn't reacted strongly, there was an important implication: Sai and Akaro worked together, so they could've orchestrated the recording if they'd either worked with Isla or threatened her."
    new "尽管 Erina 没有太大反应，这里却藏着一个要紧的含义：Sai 和 Akaro 是一伙的，那么只要他们与 Isla 合作，或者胁迫她，那段录音就完全可能由他们策划。"

    # game/script.rpy:18879
    old "Does it even matter? This is the logic Sai used when Shiroya and I left the attic: if something happens, it'll be their fault. Can we not apply it now?"
    new "这有意义吗？Shiroya 和我离开阁楼时，Sai 用的就是这套逻辑：一旦出了事，错都在对方。现在就不能照用吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:18880
    old "Admittedly, I was tired, and my body demanded me to sleep again."
    new "说实话，我确实累了，身体又在催我睡过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:18885
    old "You're crazy. They played us like this!"
    new "你疯了。他们就这么把我们耍了！"

    # game/script.rpy:18886
    old "They played you. Do you want to break the door open? We agreed to stay here until the police come, and now we've learned who the culprits were. They must've had a goal in mind, and it's very likely they accomplished it already. You can go search for them if you think that'll do anything."
    new "你被耍了。你想把门砸开吗？我们说好了留在这里等警察来，如今已经知道犯人是谁了。他们肯定早有目的，而且很可能已经达成了。你要是觉得追上去有用，尽管去追。"

    # game/script.rpy:18893
    old "I was exhausted. I let my body fall onto the bed at my side and disconnected from the conversation."
    new "我筋疲力尽，索性任身体倒向旁边的床，退出了这场对话。"

    # game/script.rpy:18902
    old "Katei began knocking on the door and yelling. I didn't know what to think, as I couldn't bring myself to completely trust his story. If everything actually happened like he said, Sai and Akaro would have clearly communicated that they had ulterior motives—which they'd managed to keep mostly hidden until that point—even though they escaped."
    new "Katei 开始砸门叫喊。我却不知道该作何感想，因为我没法完全相信他的说法。若事情真如他所说，Sai 和 Akaro 就是明明白白地表明了自己另有图谋——而此前他们几乎一直藏得很好——哪怕他们已经逃了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:18903
    old "Leaving anyway meant that they'd needed to get out so badly, they didn't care."
    new "他们仍然选择离开，说明他们急于脱身，已顾不得掩饰。"

    # game/script.rpy:18907
    old "*sigh* Should we try to leave? They were probably hoping we'd still stay here after they escaped, which is why they blatantly did so."
    new "唉……我们要不要也试着离开？他们多半就盼着逃了之后我们还守在这儿，所以才敢做得这么明目张胆。"

    # game/script.rpy:18908
    old "I don't want to. I'm not sure what Akaro's deal is, but if Sai was the only one to escape, I would've thought that his motive was to make us chase after him to undo the bedroom lock.{w} If they're still in the tower, there's not much they can do. They can go to the past or hide the Sekimeiya, but they'd still be trapped in here. Even if they went far back enough to exit the tower, there's no reason for us to chase them."
    new "我不想走。Akaro 到底想干什么我不清楚，但如果只有 Sai 一个人逃了，我会以为他的动机是引我们去追，好让我们从里面解开卧室的锁。{w} 他们若还留在塔里，能做的不多。回到过去也好，把 Sekimeiya 藏起来也好，终究还是困在这里。就算他们回到足够早的时候离开这座塔，我们也没有追上去的理由。"

    # game/script.rpy:18909
    old "But what if one of them had the handle for the hidden exit? They could leave with the Sekimeiya!"
    new "可万一他们中有人拿到了暗门的把手呢？那样就能带着 Sekimeiya 离开！"

    # game/script.rpy:18910
    old "Then they're already gone. However, if they could open it, they would've done that earlier."
    new "那他们早就走了。不过，要是他们能打开，之前就该动手了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18911
    old "Th-They could've figured out a way to open the door after they found it!"
    new "他、他们可能在找到门之后想出了打开的办法！"

    # game/script.rpy:18918
    old "Katei sighed in exasperation and set the chain again. The key was outside, so the chain would prevent Akaro and Sai from returning."
    new "Katei 无奈地叹了口气，重新挂上门链。钥匙在外面，门链能 preventing Akaro 和 Sai 回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:18923
    old "\"Why is the culprit hiding the Sekimeiya if we'll be able to find it?\" That recurring question felt similar to our present situation.{w} What could they have wanted to achieve by making it out? Unless they wanted to experiment with the Sekimeiya or hide it, the only reason I could produce was that they'd needed to go back in time to finish something off."
    new "「既然我们迟早能找到，犯人为什么要藏起 Sekimeiya？」这个反复出现的问题，与眼前的处境颇为相似。{w} 他们逃出去究竟想达成什么？除非是为了试验 Sekimeiya 或者把它藏起来，我能想到的唯一理由，就是他们需要回到过去，了结某件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:18924
    old "The other question was a lot more intriguing to me: how had they escaped? There was time to break the door open, and there was no way we'd missed a hidden person who'd opened it from the outside."
    new "另一个问题更让我在意：他们是怎么逃出去的？时间足够他们破门，而我们也不可能漏掉某个躲在暗处、从外面开门的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:18925
    old "To open the door, the key would have been needed. There was no other way to accomplish it. However, we knew it couldn't have been inside the bedroom.{w} As I'd thought earlier, the only way to undo the lock was by using the key from the outside and then unsetting the chain from the inside."
    new "要开门就必须有钥匙，此外别无他法。可我们知道，钥匙不可能在卧室里。{w} 正如我之前所想，解开这道锁的唯一办法，是用钥匙从外面开锁，再从里面摘掉门链。"

    # game/script.rpy:18928
    old "With my eyes closed and without giving it much thought, I could reach a very easy explanation, similar to what Sai proposed before we'd locked ourselves in the bedroom:{w} \"they left through the door and went to the past with the Sekimeiya. Then, they opened the bedroom's door with the key that we hid under the bathroom carpet. To escape, they simply pulled the door open from the inside, which would've been slightly open\"."
    new "我闭着眼，几乎不必多想，就得出一个极其简单的解释，与 Sai 在我们把自己锁进卧室前提出的说法如出一辙：{w}「他们从门离开，带着 Sekimeiya 回到过去。然后用在浴室地毯下藏着的钥匙打开了卧室的门。要出去，只需从里面把门拉开——那时的门应该已经开了一条缝。」"

    # game/script.rpy:18929
    old "It was reminiscent of the first bootstrap paradox concept I'd thought of a few hours earlier. The clean, brief way they'd managed to escape could have been an indication that it was accepted in our universe."
    new "这让我想起几小时前自己刚想到的第一个自举悖论。他们逃脱的方式如此干净利落，或许正说明这个解在我们的宇宙里被接受了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18930
    old "There was an inherent property of those types of paradoxes: they had no origin. They were closed loops that occurred with no root or motive whatsoever."
    new "这类悖论有一个固有的性质：它们没有起源。它们是无根无由、凭空成立的闭环。"

    # game/script.rpy:18931
    old "Their escape method, though, had a real origin.{w} Sai's and Akaro's thoughts."
    new "然而他们的逃脱方式，却有着真实的起源。{w} Sai 和 Akaro 的念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:18932
    old "If one of them had thought of the way to escape, the final thing they needed to perform it was the universe's approval. They would've set an intangible origin of the loop, making it fundamentally different from a causal loop."
    new "只要他们之中有一人想到了逃脱的办法，要付诸实施，最后差的就只是宇宙的认可。他们为这个循环设下了一个无形的起点，使它从根本上区别于因果循环。"

    # game/script.rpy:18938
    old "The key to the Sekimeiya cabinet isn't there..."
    new "Sekimeiya 展示柜的钥匙不见了……"

    # game/script.rpy:18945
    old "I'd realized that to accomplish that sort of plan, they had to escape with the cabinet key to be able to go to the past. Upon turning my head, I'd seen that it wasn't on top of the drawers where I'd left it anymore."
    new "我这才意识到，要实现那样的计划，他们必须带着展示柜的钥匙逃走，才能回到过去。我转过头，发现它已经不在我原先放的那个抽屉顶上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18950
    old "What the hell did they want to do?"
    new "他们到底想干什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:18954
    old "In short, Sai and Akaro could've attempted one type of escape route: they knew where the Sekimeiya was, so they were in reach of one of the points necessary to accomplish the creation of the loop. After thinking of the way things would play out, they baited Katei out of the room. Subsequently, they left through an unlocked door."
    new "简而言之，Sai 和 Akaro 可能尝试过这样一条逃脱路线：他们知道 Sekimeiya 的位置，也就握有了创造这个循环所必需的条件之一。想清楚事情会如何发展后，他们把 Katei 引出房间，随后从一扇没上锁的门离开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18955
    old "The last thing they had to do was travel back in time and unlock the door. If a result of their travel hadn't incited the idea to travel in the first place, their loop had a clear starting point. It also implied they were both culprits in the incident—we knew that any culprit possessed higher knowledge of the Sekimeiya's mechanics and limits."
    new "他们最后要做的，就是回到过去，打开那道锁。如果他们穿越的结果并没有反过来催生穿越的念头，这个循环就有明确的起点。这也意味着他们二人都是这起事件的犯人——我们早已知道，任何犯人都对 Sekimeiya 的机制与极限掌握着更深一层的知识。"

    # game/script.rpy:18958
    old "There was a slight problem: unlocking the door from the outside would make a bit of noise. If it happened before they thought of the concept, the loop would have no origin, as the noise itself would tell them what to do.{w} I couldn't think of a way to circumvent it easily. If the key could fit under the door, their future selves could've slid it inside. However, the gap wasn't big enough, or else we would've simply locked ourselves in and slid it out of the bedroom."
    new "但有个小问题：从外面开锁会发出一点声响。如果这声响在他们想到这个主意之前就已经出现，循环就没有起点，因为那声响本身就会告诉他们该怎么做。{w} 我一时想不出能轻易绕开这一点的办法。要是钥匙能从门缝底下塞进去，未来的他们就可以把钥匙送进来。可惜门缝不够宽——否则我们只要把自己锁进卧室，从门缝把钥匙推出去就行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18959
    old "Beyond that concept, I felt that Katei's story was iffy. As likely as it was that Sai and Akaro could've conspired together, nothing told us Katei hadn't been in on it too.{w} They could've spent half an hour unlocking the door and then made it seem as if they'd magically escaped. Katei immediately suggested unlocking the bedroom to us, making for a simple motive if all three of them were secretly against Erina's request."
    new "除了这一点，我还觉得 Katei 的说法有些可疑。Sai 和 Akaro 合谋的可能性固然不小，可也没有任何证据能说明 Katei 没有参与其中。{w} 他们大可花上半个小时慢慢开锁，再装作是凭空逃了出去。而 Katei 立刻提议替我们打开卧室门——若这三人暗地里都反对 Erina 的要求，动机就再简单不过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18966
    old "Sai! Akaro! What the hell are you trying to do!?"
    new "Sai！Akaro！你们到底想干什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:18972
    old "Katei continued knocking on the door, acting accordingly for someone who'd been played as badly as him."
    new "Katei 继续砸门，那副样子倒确实像是一个被人耍得这么惨的人该有的反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:18973
    old "Hey! Sai! Akaro!"
    new "喂！Sai！Akaro！"

    # game/script.rpy:18974
    old "Yes, Katei. I'm sure they'll come back if you ask nicely."
    new "是啊，Katei。你好好说，他们一定会回来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:18979
    old "Are you not worried at all about what they could be trying to do?"
    new "你就一点也不担心他们想做什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:18980
    old "Not very much. If they're the culprits, we're safer now that they left. All they can do is go back in time, which sounds fairly harmless at this point—and unavoidable."
    new "不怎么担心。若他们真是犯人，他们走了我们反而更安全。他们能做的无非是回到过去，事到如今那听起来也没什么害处，而且无法避免。"

    # game/script.rpy:18985
    old "You're right there. It's now clear that they were the culprits, so if they come back, we won't let them in."
    new "这倒是。现在已经清楚他们就是犯人，要是他们回来，我们绝不放他们进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:18986
    old "Sure, so you can stop with the knocking. They have the Sekimeiya, though, so I'm betting they could teleport back inside if they really wanted to."
    new "嗯，所以你别再砸门了。不过 Sekimeiya 在他们手上，我猜他们真想回来的话，大可以直接传送进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:18987
    old "...That's not a great thought to keep in mind."
    new "……这可不是什么让人安心的念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:18991
    old "Katei stepped aside. It appeared we'd decided to stay."
    new "Katei 退到一旁。看来我们都已经决定留下来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:18994
    old "Even though Shiroya and Erina hadn't given their input, I figured they wanted that too and were likely dumbfounded by the fact that our self-imposed imprisonment hadn't even lasted for thirty minutes."
    new "Shiroya 和 Erina 虽然没有表态，但我想她们也是这个意思；我们这场自我囚禁连三十分钟都没撑过，她们多半也被这事弄得哑口无言。"

    # game/script.rpy:19002
    old "Cable-Stayed"
    new "斜拉桥"

    # game/script.rpy:19004
    old "Synchronized, we all looked at the door. As we thought, Katei was no longer in front of it."
    new "我们像是约好了一样，一齐望向门口。果不其然，Katei 已经不在门边了。"

    # game/script.rpy:19005
    old "What the...? Did they come back?"
    new "搞什么……？他们回来了？"

    # game/script.rpy:19010
    old "...Hey! Who is it!?"
    new "……喂！是谁！？"

    # game/script.rpy:19011
    old "It's me. What are you doing here?"
    new "是我。你在这儿做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:19012
    old "Without a doubt, Akaro was behind the door."
    new "门外的人，毫无疑问就是 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:19013
    old "Don't play dumb. We won't let you in!"
    new "别装傻。我们不会让你进来的！"

    # game/script.rpy:19014
    old "Wait, wh-who...?{w} What the fuck happened to this handle...?"
    new "等等，谁、谁啊……？{w}这门把手怎么他妈搞成这样……？"

    # game/script.rpy:19015
    old "Ignoring Katei's assertion, Akaro began to forcefully attempt to open the door. We understood he had the key, as we heard it being turned over and over."
    new "Akaro 没理会 Katei 的话，开始用力扳门。我们听见钥匙反复转动的声音，便知道钥匙在他手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:19016
    old "What the hell are you doing!? You're not getting back in!"
    new "你到底在干什么！？你别想再进来！"

    # game/script.rpy:19030
    old "But he was mistaken. After a few seconds of Akaro's struggle, the chain burst out and the door opened. Akaro's figure was behind it, and we saw the key placed in the outer keyhole."
    new "然而他失算了。Akaro 折腾了几秒，链条便脱开，门随之打开。Akaro 就站在门外，钥匙插在外侧的锁孔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:19031
    old "...That's not a very good chain."
    new "……这链条可真不结实。"

    # game/script.rpy:19036
    old "What do you think you're doing!? Where's Sai!?"
    new "你究竟想干什么！？Sai 在哪！？"

    # game/script.rpy:19037
    old "Everyone was speechless. The chain hadn't broken, but it had been forced open. It was old, so it wasn't too surprising. Apparently, my plan had an obvious hole from the start."
    new "众人一时无言。链条并没有断，只是被硬生生拽脱了。那链条本就老旧，倒也不足为奇。看来我的计划从一开始就有一个明显的破绽。"

    # game/script.rpy:19044
    old "Strangely, Akaro wore a very confused expression. He looked at us one by one."
    new "奇怪的是，Akaro 一脸困惑，挨个打量着我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:19045
    old "What the fuck...? Who are you?"
    new "搞什么鬼……？你谁啊？"

    # game/script.rpy:19046
    old "Seconds of silence followed. Nobody knew how to answer, as we weren't sure who that had been directed at."
    new "随后是几秒的沉默。谁也不知该如何回答，因为没人确定他这句话是对谁说的。"

    # game/script.rpy:19052
    old "Who, me...?"
    new "谁？我吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:19060
    old "...What's your game? Are you going to pretend you don't recognize me?"
    new "……你打的什么主意？打算装作不认识我？"

    # game/script.rpy:19061
    old "Akaro responded by looking at the rest of us, expecting to be backed up. However, his confusion only grew when he realized we found his words to be the strange ones."
    new "Akaro 转头看向我们其余人，指望有人附和。可当他发现我们反倒觉得他这话才奇怪时，脸上的困惑更深了。"

    # game/script.rpy:19066
    old "...Excuse me? Why are you all looking at me like that? Where the fuck did this man appear from?"
    new "……什么？你们干嘛都这么看着我？这人他妈是从哪儿冒出来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:19067
    old "You will not trick me twice."
    new "你别想再骗我第二次。"

    # game/script.rpy:19068
    old "Where's Sai?"
    new "Sai 在哪？"

    # game/script.rpy:19073
    old "Sai? I have no idea. He left the room earlier and didn't come back. What are you all even doing here?"
    new "Sai？我完全不知道。他早些时候离开了房间，就没再回来。你们到底在这儿干什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:19074
    old "As I saw how lost he looked, I began to take him seriously. He sounded genuine, but not a thing he was saying made sense."
    new "看他那副茫然的样子，我开始认真对待他的话。他语气诚恳，不像作假，可他说的话没有一句说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:19075
    old "What do you mean? Do you really not remember Katei?"
    new "你什么意思？你真的不记得 Katei 了？"

    # game/script.rpy:19080
    old "Katei? Is that his name?{w} Where should I remember him from?"
    new "Katei？他叫这个名字？{w}我怎么会记得他？"

    # game/script.rpy:19081
    old "He's been with us the whole time."
    new "他一直和我们在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:19084
    old "He took a few seconds to answer, during which he eyed me like I'd gone insane."
    new "他停了几秒才回答，看我的眼神就像我已经疯了一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:19085
    old "Why... are you all lying? What's happening?"
    new "为什么……你们为什么要撒谎？到底出什么事了？"

    # game/script.rpy:19091
    old "...H-Huh? What do you mean?"
    new "……啊、啊？你什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:19092
    old "Out of nowhere, he looked at Shiroya. Like the rest of us, she was taken aback, as the two of them had barely exchanged words since we'd gotten trapped."
    new "他冷不防看向 Shiroya。她和我们一样愣住了——自从被困在这里，他们两个几乎没说过几句话。"

    # game/script.rpy:19093
    old "I mean... what I said. Why are you all here?"
    new "我是说……我刚才问的。你们为什么都在这儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:19094
    old "We tried to stay put in one place together. Do you not remember that?"
    new "我们不是一直一起待在一个地方吗？你不记得了？"

    # game/script.rpy:19099
    old "No, I do. That doesn't answer my question, though."
    new "不，我记得。可这没回答我的问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:19100
    old "How does it not answer your question? You and Sai escaped, and now you came back."
    new "怎么没回答？你和 Sai 逃了出去，现在又回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:19105
    old "What!? That's not true! I didn't escape."
    new "什么！？胡说！我根本没逃出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:19106
    old "I couldn't quite grasp it, but something felt off about Akaro's behavior. Past his bizarre claims, he seemed more aggressive, and his voice sounded more composed. Not only that, but he'd been fixing his gaze on Shiroya."
    new "我说不清，但 Akaro 的样子有哪里不对劲。除了那些古怪的说辞，他的态度更咄咄逼人，声音却更沉稳。不仅如此，他的目光一直落在 Shiroya 身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:19113
    old "Akaro, why did you come back? Do you intend to stay here again?"
    new "Akaro，你为什么回来？是打算再待在这里吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:19118
    old "The door was locked, so were you all waiting here? I'm very confused."
    new "门是锁着的，所以你们就都在这儿等着？我实在搞不懂。"

    # game/script.rpy:19123
    old "What you are is a lying piece of shit. Do you think you can simply come back acting as if nothing happened?"
    new "你就是个满嘴谎话的混蛋。你以为回来装成没事人，就能糊弄过去？"

    # game/script.rpy:19128
    old "I don't know who you are, but don't yell at me. I'm not opposed to staying here, but you'll all need to explain yourselves."
    new "我不知道你是谁，但别冲我吼。留在这里我不反对，不过你们得把话说清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:19131
    old "Erina moved forward and took the key out of the door. She brought Akaro inside, closed the door, and locked it. Then, she set the chain again."
    new "Erina 走上前，把钥匙从门上拔下。她带 Akaro 进了屋，关上门锁好，又把链条重新挂上。"

    # game/script.rpy:19139
    old "Even if the chain can be ignored from the outside, we'll easily hear it if someone tries to force it open again.{w} I was probably wrong before. We should've kept the key inside to avoid all this. I'll keep it with me. This way, if Sai comes, he won't be able to enter or let anyone leave easily."
    new "就算外面的人能无视链条，只要有人再想硬撬，我们很容易就能听见。{w}之前是我错了。钥匙本该留在里面，也就不会有这些事。钥匙我来保管。这样，就算 Sai 来了，他也进不来，也没法轻易把谁放出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:19145
    old "What about Isla? Aren't you going to go get her?"
    new "Isla 呢？你们不去接她吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:19155
    old "None of us could believe what we were hearing. Had he forgotten what had happened, or was he talking about her dead body?"
    new "我们谁都不敢相信自己的耳朵。他是忘了发生过什么，还是在说她的尸体？"

    # game/script.rpy:19160
    old "I don't know what you're trying, but it's futile. You're revealing your true colors by trying to play dumb."
    new "我不知道你在耍什么花招，但都是白费。你装傻充愣，反倒露了馅。"

    # game/script.rpy:19165
    old "...I don't understand anything. I saw that the elevator was fixed, but how did you all get here?"
    new "……我完全不明白。电梯是修好了，可你们是怎么上来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:19166
    old "Again, such an ambiguous question couldn't be answered by any of us since we didn't comprehend its meaning."
    new "又是这种含混的问题，谁也答不上来，因为我们根本听不懂他在问什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:19173
    old "...The elevator? That was fixed a long time ago. And where do you mean...?"
    new "……电梯？那早就修好了。你说的是哪儿……？"

    # game/script.rpy:19178
    old "Here, the Ashiya floor."
    new "这里，芦屋这一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:19185
    old "Uh... With the key Naomi had. Do you actually not remember that?"
    new "呃……用 Naomi 手里那把钥匙啊。你是真的不记得了？"

    # game/script.rpy:19190
    old "Are you fucking with me...?"
    new "你他妈在耍我……？"

    # game/script.rpy:19191
    old "She's not. What's wrong with that?"
    new "她没有。这有什么奇怪的？"

    # game/script.rpy:19196
    old "Well... I don't get it. Where was the key, exactly?"
    new "这……我不明白。那把钥匙到底在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:19197
    old "In one of her pockets."
    new "在她其中一个口袋里。"

    # game/script.rpy:19202
    old "But... there's no way."
    new "可是……这不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:19205
    old "Do you not remember that Naomi died?"
    new "你不记得 Naomi 已经死了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:19210
    old "What? No... I mean, when was her body found?"
    new "什么？不……我是说，她的尸体是什么时候被发现的？"

    # game/script.rpy:19211
    old "Many hours ago."
    new "好几个小时前。"

    # game/script.rpy:19216
    old "Akaro closed his eyes and took a deep breath. He was as confused as us."
    new "Akaro 闭上眼，深吸了一口气。他和我们一样困惑。"

    # game/script.rpy:19217
    old "Are you all lying to me?"
    new "你们都在骗我吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:19222
    old "That's funny of you to say. Wasn't it you who told me that Atsuki had been threatening everyone?"
    new "你这话说得倒好笑。难道不是你对我说过，Atsuki 一直在威胁所有人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:19227
    old "Excuse me...? I never said that."
    new "什么……？我从没说过那种话。"

    # game/script.rpy:19228
    old "My head was going numb. I had no way to interpret what I was hearing."
    new "我的脑子开始发麻。我完全无法理解自己听到的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:19233
    old "This is ridiculous. Did you all go insane?"
    new "太荒唐了。你们都疯了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:19235
    old "If you're being sincere, it's clear that your memories contradict ours. What time do you think it is?"
    new "如果你说的是真心话，那你的记忆显然和我们的对不上。你觉得现在几点？"

    # game/script.rpy:19240
    old "I have no idea, but I don't think it's {time=16} yet."
    new "我不知道，但我想还没到 {time=16}。"

    # game/script.rpy:19243
    old "Right, that matches the current time. What do you remember, beginning at the start of our imprisonment?"
    new "对，和现在的时间吻合。从我们被关起来的那一刻起，你都记得什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:19248
    old "Atsuki, please don't tell me you're playing along. He's trying to manipulate us, and this time it's a lot more obvious."
    new "Atsuki，别告诉我你还要顺着他的话说下去。他在操纵我们，这次明显得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:19253
    old "Shut up. As I said, we stayed put, but eventually, you all left. Then, I went to find you and I heard knocks coming from here."
    new "闭嘴。我说过了，我们待在原地，可后来你们全都走了。我去找你们，就听见这边传来敲击声。"

    # game/script.rpy:19255
    old "That's not how it happened. You and Sai were the only ones who left. Do you not remember anything from the time before we started to wait?"
    new "事情不是这样。离开的只有你和 Sai。我们开始等待之前的那段时间，你一点都想不起来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:19256
    old "I understood why Katei didn't want me to humor Akaro, but not too long ago, I'd considered the possibility that the Sekimeiya could cause memory loss. I wanted to know if that was possible, as it could've let Isla's story occur as we'd imagined it.{w} If Akaro had traveled through time after escaping, it could have been the direct cause of the state he was in."
    new "我明白 Katei 为什么不想让我顺着 Akaro 的话说，可就在不久前，我还考虑过 Sekimeiya 是否会造成记忆缺失。我想确认这种可能是否成立，因为若真如此，Isla 的说法就有可能如我们所设想的那样成立。{w}如果 Akaro 是在逃出去之后穿越了时间，那很可能就是他变成现在这样的直接原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:19263
    old "...I-I'm having trouble understanding what you're referring to. Before we started to wait? We investigated the building, and Naomi appeared briefly just to disappear again."
    new "……我、我听不懂你在指什么。我们开始等待之前？我们调查了这栋楼，Naomi 短暂露过面，随后又消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:19264
    old "That's not true. You were surprised that Naomi's body was found, but not that she died. Subconsciously, you must've known that, but you didn't remember finding her. Is that right?"
    new "不对。你惊讶的是 Naomi 的尸体被找到了，却不惊讶她已经死了。潜意识里你肯定知道这件事，却不记得自己发现过她。是这样吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:19271
    old "Are you sure that nothing happened right before we began to wait?"
    new "你确定我们开始等待之前什么都没发生吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:19276
    old "I don't know what you're talking about."
    new "我不知道你在说什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:19277
    old "We found a hidden passage in the storeroom, and a door that could lead outside."
    new "我们在储藏室里发现了一条暗道，还有一扇也许能通到外面的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:19282
    old "You can't be serious. A hidden exit? Why are we still here, then?"
    new "你在开玩笑吧。秘密出口？那我们为什么还待在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:19283
    old "We had no way to open it. Do you really not recall any of that?"
    new "我们打不开。你真的一点都不记得？"

    # game/script.rpy:19288
    old "I don't, because it didn't happen. There are no gaps in my memory, so don't treat me as if I'm delusional. Shiroya, tell me, is this some sort of trap?"
    new "不记得，因为根本没发生过。我的记忆没有缺口，别把我当成有妄想症的人。Shiroya，告诉我，这是什么陷阱吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:19294
    old "...N-No?"
    new "……不、不是？"

    # game/script.rpy:19299
    old "I understand. That's fair, I suppose."
    new "我明白了。这也难怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:19300
    old "I'm sorry to sound so blunt, but is there a reason why you keep talking to her specifically?"
    new "恕我说得直白，你为什么总是特意找她说话？"

    # game/script.rpy:19305
    old "Huh...{w} I don't know how to answer this. I sympathize with you two, as I've already said. That's why it's surprising to see you lying like this."
    new "嗯……{w}这我该怎么回答。我已经说过，我同情你们二位。正因如此，看到你们这样撒谎才叫我意外。"

    # game/script.rpy:19310
    old "You're really saying that this guy has been with us the whole time... I suppose I deserve this treatment, don't I? Why don't you be straight with me, then?"
    new "你们居然说这家伙一直和我们待在一起……看来我活该被这样对待，是吧？那你们何不干脆跟我直说？"

    # game/script.rpy:19311
    old "Akaro... What the fuck are you talking about?"
    new "Akaro……你他妈到底在说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:19317
    old "You sympathize with us...?"
    new "同情我们……？"

    # game/script.rpy:19322
    old "Just drop it."
    new "别提了。"

    # game/script.rpy:19323
    old "What the hell does that mean!? Everything about you has been suspicious from the start!"
    new "你这话到底什么意思！？从最开始你就处处可疑！"

    # game/script.rpy:19328
    old "I get it."
    new "我懂了。"

    # game/script.rpy:19331
    old "What do you get? Is your plan to drive us insane? Because you're doing a great job!"
    new "你懂什么了？你的打算就是把我们逼疯吗？那你干得可真漂亮！"

    # game/script.rpy:19338
    old "Why won't you answer? ...Why did you say that you sympathize with us?"
    new "你为什么不肯回答？……你为什么要说同情我们？"

    # game/script.rpy:19343
    old "Maybe you're the ones who lost your memories and forgot about the time when you told me."
    new "也许失去记忆的是你们，忘了自己是什么时候告诉我的。"

    # game/script.rpy:19344
    old "...Are you out of your mind? Why the hell would we tell you anything about us?{w} No, I get it, the Sekimeiya must've inserted false memories into your head, right? Is that what you're going to say next?"
    new "……你脑子有问题吗？我们凭什么要把自己的事告诉你？{w}不，我明白了，一定是 Sekimeiya 往你脑子里塞了假记忆，对吧？你接下来是不是就要这么说？"

    # game/script.rpy:19349
    old "The Sekimeiya?"
    new "Sekimeiya？"

    # game/script.rpy:19350
    old "Oh, you forgot about it too? That's funny."
    new "哦，你连这个也忘了？真有意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:19355
    old "I didn't forget about it, of course not. Why would it give me false memories, though?"
    new "我当然没忘。可它为什么要给我假记忆？"

    # game/script.rpy:19356
    old "I... wasn't being serious."
    new "我……只是随口一说。"

    # game/script.rpy:19359
    old "I was beginning to lose it. Until then, I'd been trying to tackle every mystery calmly no matter how crazy it had been. That time, though, knowing that Akaro could've been lying to us, I couldn't do the same. Was he messing with us and hinting at knowing more about us deliberately? I couldn't tell if he'd been referring to that."
    new "我开始有些撑不住了。在此之前，无论事情多离奇，我都尽力冷静地解开每一个谜团。可这一次，一想到 Akaro 可能一直在骗我们，我就做不到这一点了。他是在耍我们，还是故意暗示自己对我们了解得更多？我分不清他指的是不是这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:19364
    old "...{w}I could tell you weren't serious, but why did you mention the Sekimeiya?"
    new "……{w}我听得出来你不是认真的，可你为什么要提 Sekimeiya？"

    # game/script.rpy:19365
    old "Do I have to give you the rundown? We found out the Sekimeiya could make us travel to the past, so we locked ourselves up to escape from the culprit who's been using it."
    new "还要我把来龙去脉再讲一遍？我们查明 Sekimeiya 能让人穿越到过去，才把自己锁在这里，好躲开那个一直在利用它的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:19370
    old "Akaro didn't answer, but he remained pensive. Since he hadn't objected to the existence of a time travel stone, he must've known about it in some capacity, even if some of his memories had really disappeared."
    new "Akaro 没有回答，只是若有所思。既然他没有对时间穿越之石的存在表示异议，那即便部分记忆真的消失了，他心里多少也该知道些什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:19373
    old "Is there anything wrong with what I said?"
    new "我说的有什么问题吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:19375
    old "You don't seem too fazed after hearing that the Sekimeiya made us travel through time. But earlier, you didn't mention it when you explained your version of events, so how did you know about it?"
    new "听说 Sekimeiya 让我们穿越了时间，你似乎并不怎么吃惊。可刚才你讲自己那边的经过时，压根没提到这件事——那你是怎么知道的？"

    # game/script.rpy:19376
    old "...{w}I'm not sure."
    new "……{w}我也不清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:19381
    old "You're pathetic, Akaro. What's your goal with these theatrics?"
    new "真难看啊，Akaro。你演这一出，到底图什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:19386
    old "Shut the fuck up..."
    new "他妈给我闭嘴……"

    # game/script.rpy:19389
    old "...In the case he was telling the truth, some of his memories must've remained hidden within his mind, as Naomi's death and the Sekimeiya's powers hadn't been received as a surprise."
    new "……倘若他所言属实，那他脑中必定还残留着某些记忆——听到 Naomi 的死讯、听闻 Sekimeiya 的力量时，他都没有表现出意外。"

    # game/script.rpy:19390
    old "Do you really not remember Katei at all? He works in this building, managing the security system. He told us about all of that a while ago."
    new "你真的一点都不记得 Katei 了？他就在这栋楼里工作，负责管理安保系统。那些事都是他不久前告诉我们的。"

    # game/script.rpy:19395
    old "None of that happened."
    new "根本没这回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:19397
    old "I laughed in frustration. Since we'd gotten trapped, not a single thing had made sense, and when we'd thought we'd begun to have the slightest grasp on some events, Akaro appeared and threw it all into question. If touching the Sekimeiya had caused it, we had probably ignored an extra effect of the travels from the beginning."
    new "我无奈地笑了一声。自从被困在这里，就没有一件事说得通；好不容易觉得对某些事摸到点头绪，Akaro 又冒了出来，把一切都推翻。若这是碰触 Sekimeiya 所致，那我们恐怕从一开始就忽略了穿越带来的另一重影响。"

    # game/script.rpy:19406
    old "Wha... Isla?{w} Isla!"
    new "什……Isla？{w} Isla！"

    # game/script.rpy:19407
    old "All of a sudden, Erina snapped. Her whole face shifted into the most desperate expression a human could make, and she dashed toward the door, slamming into it.{w} Ignoring that she had the right key and that the chain was set, she tried to pull it open frantically until her motions abruptly stopped."
    new "Erina 忽然失控了。她整张脸扭曲成了一个人所能露出的最绝望的神情，朝门口冲去，一头撞在门上。{w}她全然不顾钥匙还在自己手里、门链也还挂着，发疯似的想把门拉开，动作却突然停住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:19408
    old "What are you doing!?"
    new "你干什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:19414
    old "I stood up from the bed, reacting to her sudden change. With Shiroya's help, I grabbed her shoulders before she stopped moving, thinking that she might've suffered from a panic or anxiety attack. Before we could say anything else, she crumpled down and started crying."
    new "她突然变成这样，我从床上站了起来。趁她的动作还没停下，我在 Shiroya 的帮助下抓住她的肩膀，担心她是恐慌发作或急性焦虑。可还没等我们开口，她就瘫软下去，哭了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:19418
    old "Isla... She's there. I heard her."
    new "Isla……她就在那儿。我听见她了。"

    # game/script.rpy:19424
    old "In a voice distorted by sobs, she let out those words. The four of us exchanged looks, unsettled by that claim."
    new "她用哭得变了调的声音挤出这句话。我们四人面面相觑，这话让我们心里发毛。"

    # game/script.rpy:19425
    old "Even though Akaro seemed to have forgotten about Isla's death, he looked confused as well since none of us had heard anything."
    new "Akaro 似乎已经忘了 Isla 的死，可他也一脸困惑——毕竟我们谁都没听见任何声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:19426
    old "She was suffering... I could hear her yell. She's here, outside this door.{w} There. You all hear her too... right?"
    new "她很难受……我听见她在喊。她就在这儿，就在门外。{w}听，你们也都听见了吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:19427
    old "Whenever Erina stopped speaking, pure silence filled the room. After she asked us that, we paid attention, but no sound entered our ears."
    new "Erina 一住口，房间里就只剩下纯粹的寂静。她这么一问，我们都侧耳细听，却什么也没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:19432
    old "Yes... it's her!"
    new "对……是她！"

    # game/script.rpy:19433
    old "Erina, there's nobody outside..."
    new "Erina，门外没有人……"

    # game/script.rpy:19438
    old "I don't hear anything. You should lie down."
    new "我什么都没听见。你还是躺下吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:19443
    old "What? No, there's no way..."
    new "什么？不，不可能……"

    # game/script.rpy:19444
    old "Even though she said that, her body gave out even further, as she understood that what she was saying couldn't be true."
    new "她嘴上虽这么说，身子却垮得更厉害了——她自己也明白，她说的不可能是真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:19445
    old "She tried to steady herself by supporting her body on the door. I helped her stand back up and brought her closer to the bed."
    new "她扶着门想撑住身体。我扶她重新站好，把她带到床边。"

    # game/script.rpy:19450
    old "She was forcefully shutting her eyes as a measure to resist the pain. What had happened to Isla might have suddenly rushed back to her—it was trauma she could never truly forget. She had surely hallucinated the sound, given how no one else had heard it."
    new "她用力闭着眼，像是在强忍疼痛。Isla 出的事大概突然涌回了她心头——那是她永远无法真正忘掉的创伤。既然别人都没听见，那声音一定是她的幻听。"

    # game/script.rpy:19458
    old "Hey... you don't mean to say that Isla...?"
    new "喂……你的意思该不会是说，Isla 她……？"

    # game/script.rpy:19464
    old "I nodded, making eye contact with him. Even though we knew nothing about Akaro, if he was acting disconcerted, it meant he'd maintained a façade from the start and had begun taking advantage of the low amount of suspicion we'd openly thrown at him."
    new "我迎上他的目光，点了点头。虽然我们对 Akaro 一无所知，但若他此刻的慌乱也是装出来的，那就说明他从头到尾都在演戏，如今不过是钻了我们对他几乎不曾起疑的空子。"

    # game/script.rpy:19469
    old "That's... It can't be. She was with us the entire time."
    new "那……不可能。她一直都和我们在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:19478
    old "Akaro sat on the other bed and placed his hands on his forehead, staring at his lap. He had stopped questioning us since we had mentioned the Sekimeiya, realizing that we hadn't been lying. Instead, he seemed to be trying to comprehend what had happened to him and why his memories didn't match ours."
    new "Akaro 坐到另一张床上，双手抵着额头，低头盯着自己的膝盖。自从我们提到 Sekimeiya，他就不再追问了，因为他明白我们并没有说谎。他似乎在努力弄懂自己身上究竟发生了什么，以及他的记忆为何和我们对不上。"

    # game/script.rpy:19479
    old "Do you remember touching the Sekimeiya after leaving with Sai, even vaguely...? Touching the Sekimeiya with your skin makes you travel to the past. You know that, right?"
    new "你跟着 Sai 离开之后，还记不记得自己碰过 Sekimeiya？哪怕只有一点模糊的印象……？皮肤碰到 Sekimeiya 就会让人穿越到过去。这点你是知道的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:19484
    old "No, stop. I haven't seen Sai in a while, since he left the room, and I haven't touched the Sekimeiya like that either."
    new "不，别说了。Sai 走出房间以后我就没再见过他，我也没那样碰过 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:19485
    old "That's not true. You admitted to touching it a while after we found the second Naomi."
    new "不对。我们发现第二个 Naomi 之后不久，你亲口承认碰过它。"

    # game/script.rpy:19490
    old "The second...? I have no idea what you're saying. Please, shut up."
    new "第二个……？你在说什么，我完全不懂。拜托，别说了。"

    # game/script.rpy:19491
    old "I was seriously straining him, so I refrained from continuing."
    new "我把他逼得太紧了，便没有再往下说。"

    # game/script.rpy:19494
    old "He knew what time it was and didn't remember touching the Sekimeiya even once...{w} If he was being honest, it indicated that he hadn't traveled far through time. His internal clock would've differed from ours if he had, and if he'd looked at the time, he would've known it was earlier than it should've been, as he didn't remember the exact moment of the travel.{w} ...So if his memory issues were caused by the Sekimeiya, it was unlikely it was due to traveling farther than I had yet."
    new "他知道现在是几点，却完全不记得自己碰过 Sekimeiya……{w}若他所言属实，那便说明他穿越的时间跨度并不大。若跨得远，他的时间感就该和我们不同；而只要他看过一眼钟，就该发现时间比他以为的要早——毕竟他并不记得穿越的那一刻。{w}……所以，纵使他的记忆问题是 Sekimeiya 造成的，起因也不太可能是他穿越得比我更远。"

    # game/script.rpy:19498
    old "I'm sorry, but can you leave me alone? I don't feel well, and it's hard to breathe with so many people around."
    new "抱歉，能让我一个人待会儿吗？我不太舒服，这么多人围着，我喘不上气。"

    # game/script.rpy:19500
    old "He might not have been aware of how unreasonable his demand was since he hadn't yet accepted what Erina was going through. His face was identical to the one he'd been making when we found him in the bathroom—maybe he had a tendency to seek solitude when overwhelmed."
    new "他或许还没意识到自己的要求有多不讲理，因为他尚未接受 Erina 正经历的一切。他的神情和在洗手间里被我们发现时一模一样——也许他一撑不住，就想独自待着。"

    # game/script.rpy:19501
    old "Erina gave an immediate, wordless response in the form of standing up and moving to the ladder, obviously intent on going up."
    new "Erina 一言不发，立刻起身走向梯子，显然打算上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:19502
    old "All right. Let us know if anything comes to you."
    new "好吧。要是想起什么，就告诉我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:19510
    old "Mind Over Matter"
    new "心胜于物"

    # game/script.rpy:19512
    old "Shiroya and I followed Akaro's request too, and Katei, while he maintained an offended expression full of doubt, joined us last. He closed the hatch so that anything he said couldn't reach Akaro's ears."
    new "我和 Shiroya 也照 Akaro 的意思离开了，Katei 最后一个跟上，脸上仍挂着满是怀疑的愠色。他关上活板门，好让他说的话传不进 Akaro 耳中。"

    # game/script.rpy:19518
    old "Atsuki, I thought you were a bit smarter than this. Are you going to let him trick you so blatantly?"
    new "Atsuki，我还以为你没这么蠢。他就这么明目张胆地骗你，你也由着他？"

    # game/script.rpy:19519
    old "The irony of his question was almost nauseating, but I fought back the urge to object to it. I was in no mood for pointless discussion. He sighed and sat on the same bed as Erina, in front of Shiroya and myself. He tried a few positions until he decided to lean back against the wall."
    new "他这句话里的讽刺几乎让我作呕，但我强忍住了反驳的冲动。我实在没心情做无谓的争辩。他叹了口气，坐到 Erina 那张床上，正对着我和 Shiroya，换了几次姿势，最后决定靠墙仰着。"

    # game/script.rpy:19527
    old "And we need to leave him the entire lower bedroom so that he doesn't cry. Meanwhile, only God knows what Sai is doing."
    new "还得把整个下层的卧室都让给他，免得他哭鼻子。至于 Sai 在干什么，只有天知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:19530
    old "Once again, nobody acknowledged Katei's presumptuous and poorly timed jabs. He rolled his eyes, accepting that nobody would humor him."
    new "Katei 又一次挑了个最不合适的时机出言不逊，依然没人搭理。他翻了个白眼，认命似的接受了没人愿意顺着他这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:19531
    old "His behavior had clearly changed gradually as time had gone on. While he'd attempted to look composed and firm at the start, he was no longer actively suppressing his anger and frustration."
    new "随着时间推移，他的变化显而易见。起初他还努力摆出镇静坚定的样子，如今已不再刻意压着怒火与烦躁。"

    # game/script.rpy:19532
    old "I tried to clear my head a bit. Nothing about Akaro's or Erina's recent actions made sense, but I knew I'd be lost if I tried to tackle those questions. Instead, I went one step back as I realized that I'd missed an important detail during all the fuss."
    new "我试着让脑子清醒一些。Akaro 和 Erina 刚才的举动没有一处讲得通，但我知道，硬去追究这些问题，只会陷进一团乱麻。于是我退了一步，这才意识到，在方才那片混乱中，我漏掉了一个重要的细节。"

    # game/script.rpy:19540
    old "Akaro was able to enter the room on his own, and when he did, we saw that the key was placed in the outer keyhole of the door. Since Akaro later told us that he'd only been drawn to the bedroom after hearing Katei's knocks, it's very unlikely that he had the key on him."
    new "Akaro 是自己进的房间。他进来时，我们看见钥匙就插在门外的锁孔里。后来 Akaro 说，他是听见 Katei 敲门才被引到卧室来的，所以钥匙带在他身上的可能性极低。"

    # game/script.rpy:19541
    old "Instead, it must've already been placed in the keyhole, and he used it to open the door. This is a solid indicator of how Akaro and Sai managed to escape: the door was opened from the outside, using the key we'd hidden."
    new "也就是说，钥匙事先就插在锁孔里，他只是拿它开了门。这清楚地说明了 Akaro 和 Sai 是怎么逃出去的：有人用我们藏起来的那把钥匙，从外面打开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:19542
    old "Of course, it's always possible they left it there to make us think that, but that seems a bit pointless because they didn't hesitate to leave us behind, openly telling us that we should suspect them anyway. Once they made it out, they probably left the key in the keyhole since they didn't need it for anything else."
    new "当然，也可能他们是故意留下钥匙，好让我们这么想。可他们抛下我们时毫不迟疑，还当着我们的面说，我们尽管怀疑他们就是了。这么一来，这种做法就没什么意义了。出去之后，钥匙对他们再没有别的用处，多半就留在锁孔里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:19545
    old "Outside help was used to escape, and they accepted it by unsetting the chain. This supports what I thought of earlier, regarding the looped set of actions they could've fabricated on the spot."
    new "他们是靠外面的帮助逃走的，并且主动解开门链，接受了这份帮助。这印证了我先前的想法：他们可以当场编出一整套循环的行动。"

    # game/script.rpy:19546
    old "They thought of the loop, lured Katei up here, saw that the door had been opened, exited through it, traveled back in time, unlocked the door from the outside, and left the key in the outer keyhole. If the universe accepted this, it was a completely viable way out."
    new "他们先想到这个循环，把 Katei 引上来，确认门已被打开，从门出去，穿越回过去，从外面打开门锁，再把钥匙留在外侧锁孔里。只要宇宙认可这一套，这就是一条完全可行的出路。"

    # game/script.rpy:19547
    old "In fact, since the door had to be opened from the outside, not much else works. It's very unlikely anyone else could've fulfilled that role. If one of us exits the room with the key that Erina has in a while and goes to the past to unlock the door, we'd still be creating a causal loop, as the only reason Erina has the key is because someone unlocked the way out for Akaro and Sai."
    new "事实上，门必须从外面打开，除此之外几乎没有别的办法，而能扮演这个角色的，也不太可能是别人。假如我们当中有人拿着 Erina 稍后才拿到的那把钥匙离开房间，回到过去开门，那依然是在制造因果循环——因为 Erina 手里之所以有钥匙，正是因为有人替 Akaro 和 Sai 打开了出路。"

    # game/script.rpy:19548
    old "So if someone does go back to the past to unlock the door, for it to be a cohesive travel, that person will have to be unrelated to our imprisonment, and going back to the past can't be a result of our actions after we locked ourselves in here. Each of those actions branches out from the fact that Akaro and Sai have left."
    new "所以，假如真的有人回到过去开门，那么要让这次穿越自洽，这个人就必须与我们的被困毫无关系；而且回到过去这一举动，也不能是我们把自己锁在这里之后的行为所导致的结果。那些行为，无一不是从 Akaro 和 Sai 已经离开这件事衍生出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:19549
    old "With how likely it is that Akaro and Sai dealt with the Sekimeiya after escaping, the person who will or already has traveled through time must use the Sekimeiya we hid in Naomi's locker, as its location hasn't been influenced by the escape."
    new "Akaro 和 Sai 逃出去之后处理掉 Sekimeiya 的可能性很大，因此将要或已经穿越的那个人，只能用我们藏在 Naomi 储物柜里的那个 Sekimeiya——它的位置没有受到这次逃脱的影响。"

    # game/script.rpy:19552
    old "Lastly, there's a much easier solution: that there was always someone else inside the building who we missed.{w} Just now, Erina acted like she heard Isla outside the bedroom. Even though nobody else heard anything, if it truly happened, she could've opened the door for Akaro and Sai if her existence there wasn't in any capacity derived from their escape."
    new "最后，还有一个简单得多的解释：这栋楼里一直有另一个人，只是我们漏掉了。{w} 刚才 Erina 那副样子，就像她在卧室外听见了 Isla 的声音。虽然其他人都没听见，但若真有此事，而且她出现在那里与 Akaro 和 Sai 的逃脱无关，那她就有可能替他们打开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:19553
    old "I tried to calm Erina down by saying that nobody was outside, and I thought that it was impossible. However, it shouldn't be. It follows Shiroya's theory from earlier, in fact.{w} If Isla went weeks back in time, dying in the cabinet must be the final step of her travels. However, she said that her friend would wait for her outside the tower, meaning that there can be a living Isla somewhere right now."
    new "我安慰 Erina 说外面没有人，当时也认定那不可能。可仔细想想，未必不可能。事实上，这正合 Shiroya 先前的推论。{w} 如果 Isla 回到了几周之前，那么死在展示柜里就该是她这趟穿越的终点。可她说她的朋友会在塔外等她——也就是说，此刻在某处，很可能还有一个活着的 Isla。"

    # game/script.rpy:19554
    old "And we found a door that might lead outside. We can't open it from here since we have no handle to turn, but the story might be different from the outside. Thinking about it, it's technically possible for anyone to have entered the tower after the last time we did a thorough search, so they could've opened the bedroom's door. Of course, they would've required knowledge of what was going on inside..."
    new "而且我们找到了一扇可能通往外面的门。这一侧没有可转动的把手，我们打不开；但从外面看，情况也许就不一样了。想想看，在我们最后一次彻底搜查之后，任何人都有可能进入这座塔，也就有可能打开过卧室的门。当然，前提是他们对里面的情况有所了解……"

    # game/script.rpy:19558
    old "I was still fixated on the thought that Akaro and Sai had the chance to retroactively open the door through the mere idea of having thought of a causal loop well-aligned with the circumstances..."
    new "我还在反复想着那个念头：Akaro 和 Sai 只要想到一个与当时情形足够吻合的因果循环，就有可能反过来让门打开……"

    # game/script.rpy:19559
    old "If it was possible, it was a very powerful concept to put into practice, and the only requirement was to properly think of what you had to do. I knew I could be seen as suspicious, but I decided to attempt it."
    new "如果这真的可行，那就是一种极其强大的手段，唯一的条件只是要想清楚自己该做什么。我知道这么做会让自己显得可疑，但还是决定试一试。"

    # game/script.rpy:19563
    old "Erina, can you lend me the key for a second?"
    new "Erina，能把钥匙借我用一下吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:19568
    old "Hm...? Why?"
    new "嗯……？为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:19573
    old "What are you doing?"
    new "你要做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:19578
    old "A slight frown also appeared on Shiroya's face in response to my request."
    new "听到我的请求，Shiroya 的眉头也微微皱了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:19579
    old "I honestly just want to understand how Akaro and Sai left. I won't use it."
    new "说实话，我只是想弄明白 Akaro 和 Sai 是怎么离开的。我不会用它。"

    # game/script.rpy:19584
    old "Then why do you want it?"
    new "那你为什么要钥匙？"

    # game/script.rpy:19585
    old "...Because I need it to see if what I'm thinking of could work."
    new "……因为我需要它来验证我的想法能不能成立。"

    # game/script.rpy:19586
    old "Technically, I'd lied. If it worked, I would end up using the key."
    new "严格说来，我撒了谎。要是真能成立，我终究还是得用这把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:19591
    old "Is it important...?"
    new "这很重要吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:19597
    old "...{w}Okay. As long as you don't run off with it or anything."
    new "……{w}好吧。只要你别拿着它跑掉就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:19598
    old "I'll be back in a second."
    new "我马上就回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:19604
    old "She gave me the key with her trust. My idea might have been rushed, but I didn't think that posed an issue. Essentially, I wanted to replicate what I thought Akaro and Sai did to escape."
    new "她把钥匙和信任一并交给了我。这个想法或许有些仓促，但我不认为这有什么问题。说到底，我只是想重现我认为 Akaro 和 Sai 逃走时所做的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:19605
    old "They didn't need to have the key inside since it was outside the room from the beginning and they could've used it after traveling. However, if I just managed to leave the room, I couldn't open the door after traveling. The key would be inside with Erina. That wouldn't allow the loop to work, so I wouldn't be able to exit in the first place."
    new "钥匙从一开始就在房门外，他们穿越之后就能用，所以并不需要把钥匙带进来。可要是我光是离开房间，穿越之后就打不开门了——那时钥匙还在房里，在 Erina 手上。这样循环就无法成立，我从一开始也就根本出不去。"

    # game/script.rpy:19608
    old "Hence, my idea had to be shifted a little bit.{w} I would go down and attempt to open the door. If it was open, it'd mean that the loop could be completed. I'd leave, and on the crystal floor, I would unlock Naomi's locker and activate the Sekimeiya.{w} It was likely I would go back far enough, given how long the Sekimeiya had already been there. Then, when the time came, I would unlock the door from the outside with the key Erina had handed me, allowing the loop to be created."
    new "所以，我的计划得稍微改一改。{w} 我先下楼试着开门。如果门开着，就说明这个循环能够成立。我会离开房间，到水晶层打开 Naomi 的储物柜，启动 Sekimeiya。{w} 考虑到 Sekimeiya 已经在那里放了那么久，我多半会被送回到足够早的时间。然后，等时候到了，我再用 Erina 交给我的钥匙从外面开门，让这个循环得以形成。"

    # game/script.rpy:19609
    old "Finally, once my original self left the room, I'd enter it immediately after experiencing the whole loop. For them, it would seem as if I hadn't gone anywhere."
    new "最后，等原来的我离开房间，我就在走完整个循环之后立刻回到房里。在他们看来，我就像哪儿也没去过一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:19618
    old "I opened the hatch and went down, a little nervous to see if it would work. Akaro raised his head, but he didn't say anything until I began to walk toward the door."
    new "我打开活板门下楼，心里有些紧张，不知这法子行不行。Akaro 抬起了头，但直到我朝门口走去，他才开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:19623
    old "...Are you leaving?"
    new "……你要走了？"

    # game/script.rpy:19624
    old "No idea."
    new "不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:19627
    old "If it worked, the door would be very slightly open, enough to allow me to drag it inward. Since Akaro had been sitting on the bed the whole time, in the future, I would have to open the door very slowly so that I didn't make noise he could notice."
    new "如果成功，门会微微开着一条缝，刚好够我把门往里拉。Akaro 一直坐在床上，所以到时候我得把门开得极慢，不能发出他能察觉的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:19631
    old "I unset the chain, put two fingers in the hole, and dragged the door toward me."
    new "我解开门链，把两根手指伸进孔里，将门朝自己拉过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:19637
    old "You need to use the key."
    new "得用钥匙才行。"

    # game/script.rpy:19639
    old "It didn't budge."
    new "门纹丝不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:19645
    old "Could such a thing really not occur...? I sighed, slightly disappointed, and set the chain again.{w} Figuring the trick out would've felt like good progress toward understanding the Sekimeiya, so it was unfortunate that I couldn't know the reason why it hadn't functioned."
    new "这种事真的不可能发生吗……？我有些失望地叹了口气，重新扣上门链。{w} 若能看破其中的诀窍，对理解 Sekimeiya 来说该是很大的进展；可惜我弄不清它为什么没有奏效。"

    # game/script.rpy:19646
    old "Ignore me. Do you remember anything else?"
    new "别管我了。你还记得别的什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:19651
    old "No, and I won't ever, since I have nothing to remember."
    new "不记得，以后也不会想起来。我根本没有什么可回忆的。"

    # game/script.rpy:19652
    old "...If you say so."
    new "……既然你这么说。"

    # game/script.rpy:19653
    old "I accepted his claim and went back up."
    new "我接受了他的说法，回到楼上。"

    # game/script.rpy:19662
    old "Did you find anything out...?"
    new "你查出什么了吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:19663
    old "I doubt it."
    new "恐怕没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:19672
    old "I gave the key back to Erina and sat where I'd been before. I heaved a sigh, ignoring the odd looks I received, and wondered if I could work with the result of my little test."
    new "我把钥匙还给了 Erina，坐回原来的位置。我没理会周围投来的异样目光，长叹一口气，琢磨着这次小小的试验结果能不能派上用场。"

    # game/script.rpy:19682
    old "This is really frustrating... There's no way to know why it didn't work.{w} While it's easy to assume that the existence of this kind of loop is impossible, or perhaps willingly creating one is... I can't draw a single conclusion. There are too many factors that could've stopped the loop from reaching its end, effectively denying its existence."
    new "真是让人心烦……根本无从得知它为什么没有成功。{w} 大可以简单认定这种循环不可能存在，或者说，凭人的意志去制造一个循环本就不可能……可我连一个确定的结论都下不了。有太多因素都可能让循环走不到终点，也就等于否定了它的存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:19683
    old "For example, what if Akaro is lying to us?{w} He became cautious of my presence as soon as I approached the door, so if I'd gotten it to open, he might've restrained me if what he's after is preventing us from leaving and allowing Sai to roam freely. That could be why he prompted the four of us to go up top."
    new "比如，万一 Akaro 在骗我们呢？{w} 我一靠近门，他就对我起了戒心。要是我真把门弄开了，而他所图的正是阻止我们离开、让 Sai 在外自由行动，那他也许会当场制住我。他之所以鼓动我们四个人到上面去，原因或许就在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:19684
    old "If he did that, I couldn't proceed, so the door would never have been open.{w} Similarly, what if Sai took the Sekimeiya out of Naomi's locker? Downstairs, I couldn't have used it to go back to the past, yet again cutting off the loop."
    new "如果他这么做了，我就无法继续，门也永远不会开着。{w} 同理，要是 Sai 把 Sekimeiya 从 Naomi 的储物柜里取走了呢？我在楼下就无法用它回到过去，循环同样会断掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:19685
    old "Depending on what determines the amount of time traveled, it's possible that activating the Sekimeiya wouldn't have sent me back far enough to open the door and that this problem would've repeated in the future if I'd tried it again. There are plenty of unknown factors that would make this loop an impossibility."
    new "穿越的时间长短由什么决定还不清楚。有可能启动 Sekimeiya 后，我回到的时间不够早，来不及开门；而且就算以后再试，同样的问题还是会发生。让这个循环无法成立的未知因素，实在太多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:19688
    old "I recognized another potential point that could've interfered with my plan, and it was a pretty big oversight, as it had to do with the biggest difference between what I'd attempted and what I thought Akaro and Sai might've done."
    new "我又想到一个可能干扰我计划的要点，而且是个相当大的疏漏：它牵涉到我这次的尝试与我所推测的 Akaro 和 Sai 的做法之间最大的不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:19689
    old "Right... When Shiroya and I traveled from the cleaning room, even though the cart disappeared, it didn't appear in the attic with us, as the bodies we appeared in were most likely identical to how they had been at {time=12:10}, when both of us were in the attic in those same locations..."
    new "对了……我和 Shiroya 从清洁间穿越时，推车虽然消失了，却没有和我们一起出现在阁楼。因为我们现身时所用的身体，多半与 {time=12:10} 时完全相同——那时我和 Shiroya 就待在阁楼的相同位置……"

    # game/script.rpy:19690
    old "This means that if I had traveled holding the bedroom key, chances are I wouldn't have appeared with it in the past. Akaro and Sai wouldn't have encountered that problem since, for them, the key would've always been under the bathroom's carpet.{w} But... no, that shouldn't have been a problem. I could've used one of the handles we left under the beds. There might've been another screwdriver in the opposite bedroom, and even if there wasn't, putting in screws without a screwdriver isn't too hard. Could it be that wasn't possible because it wasn't part of the loop I'd thought of...? Or maybe I just wouldn't have been able to do it without alerting Akaro."
    new "这意味着，如果我拿着卧室钥匙穿越，多半不会带着钥匙一起出现在过去。Akaro 和 Sai 就不会遇上这种问题，因为对他们来说，钥匙一直就在浴室地毯下面。{w} 可是……不，那本来不该成为问题。我可以用我们留在床下的其中一个把手。对面卧室里也许还有另一把螺丝刀；就算没有，不用螺丝刀装螺丝也不算太难。难道这之所以行不通，是因为它不在我设想的循环之中……？又或者，我只是没法在不惊动 Akaro 的情况下做到？"

    # game/script.rpy:19691
    old "Or, what if I wouldn't have been able to travel? When we left the Sekimeiya in Naomi's locker, it wasn't working. Perhaps it never started to function again for some reason."
    new "又或者，我根本没能穿越？我们把 Sekimeiya 留在 Naomi 的储物柜里时，它已经不能用了。也许出于某种原因，它再也没有恢复运作。"

    # game/script.rpy:19695
    old "Finally, I thought about the most interesting reason why the loop might not have worked for me, and I was reminded of how messy time travel could become in the blink of an eye."
    new "最后，我想到一个最有趣的原因，解释循环为什么可能在我身上行不通；同时我也想起，时间穿越转眼间就能变得多么混乱。"

    # game/script.rpy:19696
    old "We've already been here for more than forty minutes, and we think that the location we travel to is somehow determined by where we were in the recent past."
    new "我们已经在这里待了四十多分钟。而且我们认为，穿越的目的地在某种程度上取决于我们不久前所在的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:19697
    old "So, for example, it's possible that I would've gone thirty minutes to the past and appeared where I'd been fifteen minutes prior. Since I've been here in both of those time coordinates, I would've appeared in this bedroom."
    new "所以，比如说，我有可能回到三十分钟前，并出现在十五分钟前自己待过的地方。既然这两个时间点我都在这里，我就会出现在这间卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:19698
    old "Even if I appeared with the key, that would cause a situation that I never experienced. Going to the past would've immediately changed things, overwriting the way in which I'd gone to the past in the first place. The loop would've become impossible if this happened, resulting in my failed attempt.{w} ...And Akaro and Sai, who spent less time in the bedroom and most likely used a different Sekimeiya, might not have faced this issue either."
    new "即便我带着钥匙现身，也会造成一段我从未经历过的情形。回到过去会立刻改变现状，把我原本回到过去的方式覆盖掉。若真如此，循环就不可能成立，我的尝试也会以失败告终。{w} ……而 Akaro 和 Sai 在卧室里待的时间更短，多半用的也是另一个 Sekimeiya，他们或许同样不会遇到这个问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:19707
    old "For a few minutes, my mind lapsed into silence. I'd managed to ignore how tired I was, but the feeling was starting to kick back in."
    new "有那么几分钟，我的思绪彻底沉寂下来。先前我一直强压着疲惫，可那种感觉又开始涌了上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:19708
    old "The four of us kept shifting around, mindlessly looking at the ceiling or at the walls. We were all powerless, and our lack of mutual trust wore us down from constantly being on guard."
    new "我们四个人不停地挪动身子，漫无目的地望着天花板或墙壁。我们全都无能为力，而彼此间的不信任又让我们因时刻提防而疲惫不堪。"

    # game/script.rpy:19715
    old "I didn't discard my recent thoughts. Akaro and Sai had found a way to escape that involved outside help. Furthermore, if the Akaro below us wasn't acting, he had undergone something that caused his memories to differ from ours."
    new "我没有抛开刚才那些想法。Akaro 和 Sai 找到了一条靠外界帮助逃出去的路。况且，楼下那个 Akaro 若不是在演戏，就是经历了某些事，才让他的记忆和我们不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:19716
    old "The more I thought about it, the more I realized how powerful it would be if you could create loops that ensured your success from the beginning. The culprit we'd chased behind could've taken advantage of it, making sure that their movements would always work."
    new "我越想越觉得，如果能创造出从一开始就确保成功的循环，那将是多么强大的力量。我们一路追查的凶手很可能利用了这一点，让自己的行动始终奏效。"

    # game/script.rpy:19719
    old "It's bizarre, but if you understood how the Sekimeiya works thoroughly, you could abuse this concept to a sky-high extent."
    new "这听起来很离奇，但只要能彻底理解 Sekimeiya 的运作方式，就能把这个概念利用到极致。"

    # game/script.rpy:19720
    old "You want to cross a hallway full of doors and deadly traps, but you can think of many ways to do it and you're not sure which one will work."
    new "假设你想穿过一条满是门和致命陷阱的走廊，能想出许多种走法，却不确定哪一种行得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:19721
    old "With the Sekimeiya, if you could be the creator of causal loops, assuring success in these situations would be a way to use them."
    new "借助 Sekimeiya，如果你能成为因果循环的缔造者，那么在这些情况下保证成功，就是利用因果循环的一种方式。"

    # game/script.rpy:19722
    old "You could think: \"I will try doors 1, 3, and 5, and I'll walk touching the right wall. After I make it across, I will go around from the outside and leave a mark behind the door to this place.\""
    new "你可以这样想：「我会试 1、3、5 号门，贴着右墙走。穿过去之后，我会从外侧绕回来，在通往这里的门后留下记号。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19723
    old "If you look where you'll leave a mark and find it, you'll know that arrangement of doors and movements will work. If the mark isn't there, you'll know you would die midway, rendering you unable to leave the mark.{w} You can keep thinking of different arrangements until the mark appears. Since you'll only move forth once you see the mark, it's an effective bootstrap—the end result is what allows it to happen. But despite being a \"paradox\", there's actually an origin to it."
    new "你去看自己准备留记号的地方，如果记号已经在了，就知道那种门与行动的组合行得通。如果记号不在，就说明你会中途丧命，无法留下记号。{w} 你可以不断设想不同的组合，直到记号出现。既然你只有看到记号才会真正行动，这就构成了一种有效的自举——结果本身促成了它的发生。可尽管它被称为「悖论」，实际上仍有源头。"

    # game/script.rpy:19726
    old "Even though this is an extreme situation, it can apply in any circumstance because it removes the generalized risk associated with going back to the past.{w} Regardless of the circumstances, you can think something up in your head. If it'll work, you'll see the successful result, and if it won't, nothing will happen. You would be guaranteed to never fail, no matter what you attempt.{w} The killer could've used this method before killing Naomi; \"if I move this specific way after killing her and I'm not seen, I'll let my current self know by leaving a drawer in the next room open\", for example."
    new "这虽然是极端情形，却能适用于任何情况，因为它消除了回到过去时通常伴随的风险。{w} 无论处境如何，你都可以先在脑中设想。若行得通，你就会看到成功的结果；若行不通，就什么也不会发生。这样一来，无论尝试什么，你都能保证自己不会失败。{w} 凶手在杀害 Naomi 之前，也可能用过这个方法；比如：「如果我在杀了她之后按这种特定方式行动，而且没有被看见，我就把隔壁房间的抽屉打开，好让当下的我知道。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19727
    old "Another big advantage is that you'd be able to make any move that's currently hard to accomplish by deciding it to occur retroactively.{w} At some point, the killer might have wanted to prevent us from entering a room. However, they couldn't go and lock it, or they would've been seen."
    new "另一个巨大优势是，任何眼下难以完成的行动，你都可以决定让它在过去发生，借此完成。{w} 某个时候，凶手也许想阻止我们进入某个房间。可他们不能直接去上锁，否则就会被看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:19728
    old "Their solution would've been to decide: \"in the future, I'll go to the past and lock it, so it's already locked now\". This doesn't have to be a bootstrap paradox, but it's fundamentally very similar to what I'm thinking."
    new "他们的解决办法会是做出决定：「将来我会回到过去把它锁上，所以它现在就已经锁好了。」这未必是自举悖论，但本质上和我所想的十分相似。"

    # game/script.rpy:19732
    old "Depending on how it works, the possibilities could be limitless. There's even a higher step to reach."
    new "看它如何运作，可能性也许无穷无尽，甚至还有更高的一层可以抵达。"

    # game/script.rpy:19733
    old "It's considerably different, but it follows along with a few things I thought about earlier, regarding the date displayed on Sai's watch."
    new "这虽然相当不同，却与我先前关于 Sai 手表上那个日期的一些想法相呼应。"

    # game/script.rpy:19734
    old "Out of the countless examples, could you go back in time, trade information with someone, write it all down, and leave it all on a note that you'd see before traveling through time?"
    new "在无数例子中，有没有这样一种：你回到过去，和某人交换信息，把一切写下来，全部留在一张便条上，让自己在时间穿越前看到？"

    # game/script.rpy:19735
    old "You'd read the note and go back to the past. However, since you would already know the contents of it, you'd have no reason to exchange the information—all you'd have to do is leave behind the note you'd read so that you could read it before traveling."
    new "你读到那张便条，然后回到过去。可既然你已经知道上面的内容，就没有理由再去交换信息——你只需把读过的那张便条留下，让自己在穿越前读到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:19736
    old "The note itself would be a paradox that you caused, but was the past truly changed? Was a past in which you exchanged information truly overwritten? ...Or did it never exist in the first place?"
    new "那张便条本身会是你造成的悖论，但过去真的被改变了吗？那个你曾交换信息的过去，真的被覆盖了吗？……还是说，它从一开始就不存在？"

    # game/script.rpy:19737
    old "...If Sai's watch got to \"9999-12-31\" by spending infinite time in a loop, did the pasts in which the time counted up to that date really exist in any capacity?"
    new "……如果 Sai 的手表是在循环中度过了无限时间才走到「9999-12-31」，那么那些让表上的时间累积到那个日期的过去，到底有没有以任何形式存在过？"

    # game/script.rpy:19741
    old "The final step is one I'm not willing to accept:{w} could you witness a very smoothly committed crime, decide that you were the perpetrator, and go back to the past to replicate it?"
    new "最后一步我不愿接受：{w} 你能目睹一桩实施得天衣无缝的罪行，认定自己就是凶手，然后回到过去将它重演吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:19742
    old "The loops until now always had some kind of origin to them, but this one doesn't. It firmly defies causality."
    new "此前的循环总归都有某种源头，可这一种没有。它彻底违背了因果。"

    # game/script.rpy:19743
    old "However, what would be possible is going back in time, preventing the real perpetrator from committing their crime, and then replicating it being certain of your success. That's just a way to use a time travel device."
    new "不过，真正可行的是回到过去，阻止真正的凶手犯案，再在确信自己会成功的前提下，把那桩罪行重演出来。这不过是使用时间穿越装置的一种方式。"

    # game/script.rpy:19746
    old "The Sekimeiya must operate on one of these levels, the lowest one being \"thought-up loops aren't possible\". If this is the case, Akaro and Sai must've received outside help from a third party."
    new "Sekimeiya 必定按其中某一层级运作，最低的一层是「凭空设想的循环不可能成立」。如果真是这样，Akaro 和 Sai 一定得到了第三方的协助。"

    # game/script.rpy:19747
    old "Level 1, using a loop they created mentally, would've allowed them to escape on their own in the way I've been thinking about."
    new "第一层，他们利用在脑中创造出的循环，就能以我一直在设想的方式自行逃脱。"

    # game/script.rpy:19748
    old "Level 2 would complicate things, and it's more of an interesting concept than anything. The recorder in Isla's purse made me think that there are some possible benefits of staying here for a much longer time even though it seemed incredibly negative at first."
    new "第二层会让事情复杂得多，更像是一个有趣的构想。Isla 手提包里的录音笔让我想到，在这里待上更久，虽然起初看起来极为不利，但或许也有某些好处。"

    # game/script.rpy:19749
    old "If I found a very important reason to stay, and a method to accomplish it, probably through the security room's computer... Could I grab the recorder, go back to the past with it, and place it in Isla's purse for the sole purpose of reproducing everything exactly and to get to the point in which I decided to turn it into reality? ...That would be level 2."
    new "如果我找到一个必须留下来的重要理由，以及实现它的方法——大概要通过监控室的电脑……我能不能拿起录音笔，带着它回到过去，把它放进 Isla 的手提包里，只为了让一切精确重演，并到达我决定把它变成现实的那一刻？……那就是第二层。"

    # game/script.rpy:19750
    old "For now, I'll ignore it.{w} Would I send the recorder back in time to reproduce everything instead of writing a note that details it all thoroughly purely because \"I didn't live that\"? That's ridiculous."
    new "眼下，我先不去管它。{w} 难道仅仅因为「那段经历不是我亲身度过的」，我就要把录音笔送回过去、重现一切，而不是写一张把所有细节都交代清楚的便条？太荒唐了。"

    # game/script.rpy:19754
    old "Even though level 1 appears to have endless applications, there should be a daunting barrier to cross: the memories of the person who thinks of the loop. Someone who did this would always have to work around the past that they remember.{w} Let's say the culprit wanted to kill someone in the event room and then had to choose between hallways A and B to escape."
    new "第一层看似用途无穷，但应该有一道难以逾越的障碍：设想出循环之人的记忆。做过这种事的人，永远得设法绕开自己记忆中的过去。{w} 假设凶手想在活动室杀掉某人，之后必须从A走廊和B走廊中选一条逃走。"

    # game/script.rpy:19755
    old "These loops always entail going back to the past. If the culprit had seen hallway A empty after the point Naomi would be killed, later, when they thought that they had to create the loop, they'd know they couldn't use hallway A.{w} If they'd seen both hallways A and B empty instead, they would've put themselves into a corner and would be unable to create a loop in which they escaped successfully."
    new "这类循环总意味着要回到过去。如果凶手在 Naomi 将被杀的那个时间点之后看见A走廊空无一人，那么后来当他们意识到必须创造循环时，就会知道自己不能用A走廊。{w} 可要是他们看见A走廊和B走廊都空着，反而会把自己逼进死角，无法创造出成功逃脱的循环。"

    # game/script.rpy:19756
    old "It sounds a bit crazy; \"it doesn't matter if they saw these hallways empty—if they hadn't looked at them, they still would've been empty\".{w} That's not the case, though. That logic clashes with the most important part of this concept: that the origin of the loop is the mind of the person who will execute it."
    new "这听起来有点疯狂：「他们看见这些走廊空着也无所谓——就算不看，走廊也还是空的。」{w} 可事实并非如此。这种逻辑和这个概念最关键的一点相冲突：循环的源头，在于将来执行它的人的脑中。"

    # game/script.rpy:19759
    old "Both hallways were empty. Why hadn't the culprit seen their future self escaping through one of them? The reason is that seeing their escape route would've told them about the plan they'd later think of, and the origin would've disappeared.{w} So one would never see a result of a future loop before having thought of it, as that could induce or highly influence its creation, resulting in the classic bootstrap \"they thought of the loop because they had experienced it\"."
    new "两条走廊都空着。凶手为什么没看见未来的自己从其中一条逃出去？因为看见自己的逃脱路线，就等于知道了自己之后才会想出的计划，源头便会消失。{w} 所以，在想到某个循环之前，人绝不会先看见它的结果；否则，那可能诱发或极大地影响循环的诞生，最终变成经典的自举情形：「他们之所以想到这个循环，是因为他们经历过它。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19760
    old "If the culprit is operating under this knowledge, that'd be a very good reason to stay hidden. If they spent all their time in front of the security screens observing what occurred in real time across the building, whenever they needed to make a retroactive move, their own memories of all the empty places would be the one thing preventing them from accomplishing it.{w} Of course, this is also because the past can't be changed, so if they observed too much, they would make any future loop impossible, as they would never see a loop in action before thinking of it."
    new "如果凶手也明白这一点，那便是隐藏行踪的绝佳理由。要是他们把所有时间都花在监控屏幕前，实时观察整栋楼里发生的一切，那么每当需要做出回溯性行动时，自己对那些空无一人的场景的记忆，反而会成为阻止他们成功的唯一障碍。{w} 当然，这也是因为过去无法改变；观察得太多，就会让任何未来的循环都变得不可能，因为他们不可能在想到某个循环之前，先看到它正在发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:19761
    old "What it basically boils down to is that, in some instances, having a lack of knowledge could actually be far more beneficial than knowing everything."
    new "归根结底，在某些情况下，一无所知反而可能比无所不知有利得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:19765
    old "It was a very intriguing concept, but nothing assured me it was applicable.{w} I was still a bit upset that I had no indication of why my plan hadn't worked... Would it work if I could slide the key under the door and wait a few minutes before trying to leave?"
    new "这个概念非常耐人寻味，可没有任何东西能保证它适用。{w} 我仍然有些烦躁：自己的计划为何没有成功，竟连一点线索都没有……如果我先把钥匙从门底塞出去，等上几分钟再尝试离开，会不会就行得通？"

    # game/script.rpy:19766
    old "That would've matched Akaro's and Sai's circumstances more closely, but it could've led into even more reasons behind the failure. For example, Sai could've taken the key from under the door if he'd been nearby.{w} ...I wasn't sure what to do or think."
    new "那样会更接近 Akaro 和 Sai 的处境，却也可能引出更多导致失败的原因。比如，Sai 若就在附近，完全可能把门下的钥匙拿走。{w} ……我不知道该怎么做，也不知道该怎么想。"

    # game/script.rpy:19770
    old "There might've been indications of how loops are handled already."
    new "说不定，循环的运作方式早已露出过端倪。"

    # game/script.rpy:19771
    old "Technically, the first time I traveled to the past, I could have created a bootstrap unconsciously."
    new "严格来说，我第一次穿越到过去时，或许就在无意间创造了一个自举。"

    # game/script.rpy:19772
    old "From room B4, I traveled twenty minutes to the past. I didn't know what had happened, so I ended up taking the elevator to the sixth floor.{w} That action made our original selves follow the elevator up, and eventually, it all led into me traveling through time."
    new "我从B4房间穿越到了二十分钟前。当时我不知道发生了什么，结果乘电梯上了六楼。{w} 这个举动让原本的我们跟着电梯上了楼，而最终，这一切又让我穿越了时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:19773
    old "If I hadn't gone up with the elevator, things would have played out considerably differently. We would've remained on floor 4, and everyone else's thoughts would've varied."
    new "如果我没有乘电梯上去，事情会截然不同。我们会留在四楼，其他人的想法也会发生变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:19774
    old "In short, if I hadn't gone up, it's possible I wouldn't have ended up traveling to the past. Therefore, traveling to the past is, in a way, what led me to traveling to the past.{w} I'm not sure it was a bootstrap, but what's certain is that I didn't intend for it to occur; by traveling, I merely finished up the past that had already taken place."
    new "简而言之，如果我没有上楼，我或许就不会穿越到过去。所以，从某种意义上说，正是穿越到过去这件事，导致了我穿越到过去。{w} 我不确定这算不算自举，但可以肯定的是，我并非有意让它发生；我所做的穿越，不过是补完了早已发生的过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:19777
    old "I ceased my thoughts—I was getting dizzy. The minutes had continued passing, and as expected, nothing had occurred."
    new "我停下了思绪——头已经开始发晕。时间一分一秒地过去，而正如预料，什么也没有发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:19778
    old "We were facing a dilemma regarding Sai. We knew he was probably still down there, but we didn't know whether following him was what he wanted. His intent was unclear whether it was disrupting the peace, experimenting with the Sekimeiya, or following along with his bigger plan.{w} Ultimately, we had once again decided to continue staying locked up because of Erina's input."
    new "我们在 Sai 的问题上陷入了两难。我们知道他多半还在楼下，却不知道跟上去是否正合他的心意。他的意图并不明确：是想制造混乱，是想试验 Sekimeiya，还是在推进自己更大的计划。{w} 最终，因为 Erina 的意见，我们再次决定继续闭门不出。"

    # game/script.rpy:19787
    old "My thoughts had trailed off and were revived by Shiroya's yawn. The silence had become unsettling, as it had gone on for more than thirty minutes since we'd left Akaro below."
    new "我的思绪渐渐飘远，又被 Shiroya 的哈欠拉了回来。自从我们把 Akaro 留在楼下，沉默已经持续了三十多分钟，让人越来越不安。"

    # game/script.rpy:19795
    old "...Are you guys really fine with this?"
    new "……你们真的能接受这样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:19796
    old "Katei took my renewed awareness as a chance to question our actions again."
    new "Katei 见我回过神来，又趁机质问起我们的做法。"

    # game/script.rpy:19801
    old "We're letting Sai run free and ignoring Akaro's obvious lies. Don't you understand they set this up? Akaro's just making sure we don't head down. Why else would he have come back?"
    new "「我们放着 Sai 不管，对 Akaro 那明摆着的谎话也视而不见。你还不明白这是他们设的局吗？Akaro 无非是不想让我们下去。不然他何必回来？」"

    # game/script.rpy:19802
    old "Don't you think that if that was what he wanted, he wouldn't have chosen to tell us such a wild story?"
    new "「你想想，如果真是这样，他何必特意跟我们说那么荒唐的一套话？」"

    # game/script.rpy:19807
    old "Of course I don't. Before they left, they made up this whole scenario where you were the mastermind. I'm betting they thought of this \"Akaro has lost his memories\" story precisely to make us think it's too ridiculous to be a lie."
    new "「我当然不明白。他们走之前，编了一整套说辞，把你当成幕后主使。我猜，他们想出『Akaro 失忆』这种话，正是要让我们觉得它荒唐得不像谎话。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19808
    old "Well, if you wanna leave, you're alone on that. We've already decided what we'll do."
    new "「你要走就自己走。我们该怎么做，早就定下了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19809
    old "He glared at me with an incensed look and attempted to calm himself."
    new "他怒目盯着我，随即又强自平复下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:19814
    old "He didn't insist further before closing his eyes again.{w} I thought he had given up, but not long after, he opened his mouth again."
    new "他没再坚持，又闭上了眼睛。{w}我以为他已经放弃，谁知没过多久，他又开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:19819
    old "Fine. Stay here if you want, but unlike you, I won't let anyone laugh in my face like Akaro is doing right now."
    new "「行。你想留就留，可我不像你，不会任人像 Akaro 这样当面嘲笑。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19822
    old "With three silent pairs of eyes looking at him, he approached the hatch and opened it. He roughly climbed down the ladder, not letting go of his indignation for one second."
    new "三道沉默的目光落在他身上，他走到舱口打开盖板，动作粗暴地顺着梯子爬了下去，满腔怒气半点未消。"

    # game/script.rpy:19825
    old "We returned our gazes to where they had been, intending to continue letting time pass quietly."
    new "我们把目光收回原处，打算继续静静地等时间过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:19826
    old "What the...? What a joke.{w} Atsuki! Come here!"
    new "「搞什么……？开什么玩笑。{w}Atsuki！你过来！」"

    # game/script.rpy:19833
    old "Katei's voice boomed through the open hatch. Shiroya and Erina looked at me, in search of my reaction. I simply sighed and stood up."
    new "Katei 的声音从敞开的舱口传上来。Shiroya 和 Erina 都看向我，等着我的反应。我只叹了口气，站起身。"

    # game/script.rpy:19841
    old "I mimicked Katei's actions and climbed down. Upon stepping off the ladder, it didn't take me even half a second to comprehend Katei's shout."
    new "我照着 Katei 的样子爬了下去。刚离开梯子，我便瞬间明白了 Katei 那一嗓子是怎么回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:19844
    old "Well, this is just great."
    new "「这下可真是好极了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19849
    old "Stop messing around. Perhaps the two of them weren't so far off the mark earlier."
    new "「别胡闹了。也许刚才那两人说得也没那么离谱。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19850
    old "With intrigued looks, Shiroya and Erina peeked through the hatch. From it, they could see the empty room around Katei and me."
    new "Shiroya 和 Erina 一脸好奇地从舱口探身往下看，从那里能望见 Katei 和我周围空荡荡的房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:19851
    old "Is he gone again...?"
    new "「他又不见了……？」"

    # game/script.rpy:19852
    old "Well, he's not here! So yes!"
    new "「人都不在这儿了！你说呢！」"

    # game/script.rpy:19856
    old "I rubbed my eyes at Katei's obnoxious voice. Meanwhile, I got closer to the door as he confirmed that Akaro wasn't anywhere."
    new "Katei 那聒噪的声音让我揉了揉眼睛。他确认 Akaro 不见踪影的同时，我走近了门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:19862
    old "The chain is still set. That's strange."
    new "「链条还挂着。奇怪。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19868
    old "Strange? No, Atsuki, you really screwed up this time."
    new "「奇怪？不，Atsuki，你这次可真捅了大娄子。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19869
    old "From Shiroya's face, I could tell she and I knew word by word the accusation Katei was about to make."
    new "看着 Shiroya 的表情，我就知道她和我一样，一字不差地猜到了 Katei 要指控什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:19870
    old "What's strange is what you did earlier. You took the key from Erina, came here, and unlocked the door for Akaro. Then you set the chain."
    new "「奇怪的是你刚才做的事。你从 Erina 手里拿走钥匙，来到这儿，替 Akaro 开了门，然后又把链条挂上。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19871
    old "Why the hell would I do that?"
    new "「我凭什么要那么做？」"

    # game/script.rpy:19876
    old "To let him escape, idiot!"
    new "「好放他跑啊，蠢货！」"

    # game/script.rpy:19877
    old "Wasn't he the one who decided to come in the first place?"
    new "「可他一开始不就是自己要进来的吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:19882
    old "Yes. It appears both of you aren't quite on the bright side. If I'm wrong, go ahead and illuminate us: why did you want the key?"
    new "「对。看来你们俩都不怎么聪明。我要是说错了，你倒说说看：你要钥匙做什么？」"

    # game/script.rpy:19883
    old "To see if I could retroactively open the door."
    new "「想试试能不能回溯过去，把门打开。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19888
    old "...You think you're smart, don't you? You have gone too far. It seems that Atsuki, Akaro, and Sai were working together the whole time. Shiroya, are you part of the group too?"
    new "「……你觉得自己很聪明是吧？你做得太过分了。看来 Atsuki、Akaro 和 Sai 一直都是一伙的。Shiroya，你也是同伙吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:19894
    old "Instead of answering, she came down, followed by Erina. She looked around, but Akaro wasn't anywhere. He'd disappeared without leaving a trace, as if he'd been an illusion from the start."
    new "她没有回答，顺着梯子下来，Erina 跟在后面。她环视四周，却不见 Akaro 的踪影。他消失得无影无踪，仿佛从一开始就只是个幻影。"

    # game/script.rpy:19895
    old "At the same time, I couldn't blame Katei that much for suspecting me since I understood how questionable my actions looked."
    new "与此同时，我也不太怪 Katei 怀疑我——我自己也清楚，我的举动看着有多可疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:19905
    old "Anyway, this is more than enough. We're leaving.{w} Atsuki, this time, that camera clearly recorded your actions when you let Akaro escape. Don't think this will go unpunished."
    new "「总之，这已经够了。我们要走了。{w}Atsuki，这回摄像头可把你的所作所为拍得清清楚楚——是你放走了 Akaro。别以为这事会不了了之。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19906
    old "Oh shit. How could I forget about it?"
    new "「糟了。我怎么把这茬忘了？」"

    # game/script.rpy:19907
    old "I had to stop taking him seriously, as that would eventually drive me insane."
    new "我不能再把他的话当真了，否则迟早要被逼疯。"

    # game/script.rpy:19911
    old "He pushed me aside, unset the chain, and tried to open the door, but only met with failure."
    new "他把我推开，取下链条，试着开门，却没能打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:19916
    old "All right, Erina, we've tried your suggestion, but it's not going to work if half of us have different intentions. We need to go find Akaro and Sai. We can't even trust these two kids."
    new "「行了，Erina，你的提议我们试过了，可要是有一半人各怀心思，这法子根本行不通。我们得去找 Akaro 和 Sai。这两个小鬼根本靠不住。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19922
    old "I didn't feel like giving my input, so I remained quiet. So did Erina, who looked down uncertainly."
    new "我懒得发表意见，便沉默着。Erina 也一样，她低着头，神色犹疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:19927
    old "Enough already!"
    new "「够了！」"

    # game/script.rpy:19931
    old "Remembering the pocket in which she'd hidden the key, Katei suddenly reached inside and retrieved it at the cost of startling her. Without reacting further, she stayed immobile, watching him insert the key into the door."
    new "Katei 想起她藏钥匙的口袋，突然伸手进去把钥匙掏了出来，把她吓了一跳。她没再反应，只僵在原地，看着他把钥匙插进门锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:19942
    old "With abrupt and stiff motions, he turned it and dragged the door open. Without looking back, he walked away. He opted not to lock us inside and kept the door as it was."
    new "他动作生硬而唐突地转动钥匙，把门拉开，头也不回地走了。他没有把我们锁在里面，门就那么开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:19946
    old "None of us said anything or looked at each other. Instead, against my own expectations, Erina walked forward and exited the room too."
    new "我们谁都没说话，也没人对视。出乎我意料的是，Erina 反倒走上前，也离开了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:19952
    old "Then, Shiroya and I exchanged looks. She gave me a bitter smile that I replied to with a long sigh.{w} I estimated it was around {time=16:20}, meaning that less than five hours remained until our scheduled freedom. We stayed still for a few seconds, contemplating the open door in front of us that symbolized our utter failure to keep everyone in one place."
    new "随后，Shiroya 和我对视了一眼。她冲我苦笑，我回以一声长叹。{w}我估摸现在大约是 {time=16:20}，距离约定重获自由的时刻已不足五个小时。我们静静站了几秒，望着眼前敞开的大门——它象征着我们彻底没能把所有人留在一处。"

    # game/script.rpy:19957
    old "Satellite"
    new "卫星"

    # game/script.rpy:19960
    old "I'm guessing you wanted to try to see if Akaro and Sai could've escaped alone?"
    new "「我猜，你是想试试 Akaro 和 Sai 有没有可能靠自己逃出去？」"

    # game/script.rpy:19961
    old "Yes. It didn't work, though."
    new "「嗯。不过没成功。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19966
    old "I figured... Maybe we really missed a hidden person, then."
    new "「我就知道……那也许我们真的漏掉了某个藏起来的人。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19967
    old "Maybe."
    new "「也许吧。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19968
    old "I shrugged lightly. I didn't know how else to approach their disappearance."
    new "我轻轻耸了耸肩。他们究竟是怎么消失的，我也想不出别的解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:19969
    old "Well, do you wanna stay here?"
    new "「那……你想留在这儿吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:19974
    old "I'm not sure... First, we should fix that."
    new "「我还说不准……不过，得先把那个弄好。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19975
    old "She pointed at the handleless door. The handles should've still been under the bed in the other bedroom."
    new "她指了指那扇没有门把手的门。门把手应该还在另一间卧室的床底下。"

    # game/script.rpy:19976
    old "Right, we shouldn't keep them detached."
    new "「说得对，不能一直让它们这么拆下来放着。」"

    # game/script.rpy:19982
    old "After more than an hour, I stepped out of the room and viewed the scenery of the attic again."
    new "一个多小时后，我走出房间，再次打量阁楼的景象。"

    # game/script.rpy:19985
    old "Then, I entered the other bedroom and kneeled to see that both handles were still there."
    new "随后，我走进另一间卧室，蹲下身查看，两个门把手都还在。"

    # game/script.rpy:19992
    old "With the same screwdriver as before, I put them in place. I turned both to test that they worked properly, and I removed the key that Katei had left in the inner keyhole. Finally, I put it back in the drawers where we'd found it, along with the screwdriver."
    new "我用之前那把螺丝刀把它们装了回去，转动两下确认能正常使用，又取出了 Katei 留在内侧锁孔里的钥匙。最后，我把钥匙和螺丝刀一起放回当初找到它们的抽屉里。"

    # game/script.rpy:19994
    old "Remember this?"
    new "「还记得这个吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:19995
    old "From my pocket, I took out the key to Naomi's locker."
    new "我从口袋里掏出 Naomi 储物柜的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:20000
    old "Oh... You still had it?"
    new "「哦……你还留着它？」"

    # game/script.rpy:20001
    old "Yeah, I used the cabinet key to hide it. Akaro and Sai likely left with that later."
    new "「嗯，我用展示柜的钥匙把它藏了起来。后来 Akaro 和 Sai 多半是带着那把钥匙离开的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20006
    old "I think so, if they needed to use the Sekimeiya. I guess that's why Akaro was in such an odd state."
    new "「我想是这样——前提是他们得用 Sekimeiya。Akaro 那副反常的样子，大概就是这么来的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20007
    old "Most likely, if he wasn't lying. We could've been lucky the times we traveled since nothing happened to us. Maybe Akaro and Isla suffered from a side effect..."
    new "「多半如此，只要他没撒谎。我们那几次时间穿越没出事，或许只是运气好。也许 Akaro 和 Isla 是受了副作用的影响……」"

    # game/script.rpy:20012
    old "Like before, Shiroya went quiet at the mention of Isla. It had already been quite a while since we'd learned about her fate."
    new "和之前一样，一提到 Isla，Shiroya 就沉默了。距离我们得知她的遭遇，已经过去了好一段时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:20015
    old "...By the way, is it me, or is the smell from earlier back?"
    new "「……对了，是错觉吗，之前那股气味又回来了？」"

    # game/script.rpy:20021
    old "Oh, yes, now that you mention it... It's really similar to the one all around the crystal floor."
    new "「哦，对，你这么一说……确实很像水晶层到处弥漫的那股味道。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20022
    old "Hm... I can't tell where it's coming from, and it's not easy to perceive."
    new "「嗯……我分辨不出是从哪儿来的，而且这气味很难察觉。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20023
    old "I moved around to see if getting closer to the source would be noticeable, but I felt no change."
    new "我四处走动，想看看靠近源头时气味会不会变得明显，却察觉不到任何变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:20025
    old "...I spent a while going over the way Akaro and Sai could've escaped, but I focused on the fact that the key was left in the outer keyhole. But even though Akaro escaped again, the chain is intact."
    new "「……我花了好一阵子琢磨 Akaro 和 Sai 可能是怎么逃掉的，但我最在意的还是那把钥匙被留在了外侧锁孔上。可 Akaro 明明又逃了出去，门链却完好无损。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20030
    old "I know. I think we should go down to see what happened with the Sekimeiya. We could come across the person who opened the door for Akaro and Sai too."
    new "「我知道。我觉得该下去看看 Sekimeiya 那边发生了什么。说不定还会碰上给 Akaro 和 Sai 开门的人。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20032
    old "We hadn't inspected Akaro after he'd come back, so it was possible he had a key on him. Despite that, he couldn't have left the chain set when he exited."
    new "Akaro 回来后，我们没检查过他，所以他身上可能带着钥匙。可即便如此，他离开时也不可能把门链重新挂好。"

    # game/script.rpy:20036
    old "We took timid steps out of the bedroom, as if an invisible net was still pulling us in. Once we were in the hallway, the first thing I did was enter the kitchen."
    new "我们怯生生地迈出卧室，仿佛仍有一张无形的网在把我们往回拽。一到走廊，我做的第一件事就是走进厨房。"

    # game/script.rpy:20041
    old "It's been so long since I drank anything. I bet you're thirsty too. We should've anticipated it."
    new "「我已经很久没喝过水了。你肯定也渴了吧。我们早该想到这一点。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20047
    old "Yeah. I tried to drink water when I went to the bathroom, but it wasn't very good."
    new "「嗯。我去洗手间时试着喝了点水，可那水实在不怎么样。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20048
    old "I opened a cabinet to grab a glass. Tap water wasn't my preference at all, but it would suffice. I turned the valve, filled up the glass, and quickly took a sip."
    new "我打开柜子，拿出一个杯子。自来水完全不合我的口味，但也能凑合。我拧开水龙头，接满一杯，迅速抿了一口。"

    # game/script.rpy:20049
    old "Oh, what the...?{w} You're right, no way this is drinkable."
    new "「哦，搞什么……？{w}你说得对，这玩意儿根本没法喝。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20050
    old "I grimaced at the taste. Not much water had flowed out of the tap, but although it was pretty transparent, it wasn't something I could drink.{w} It had slightly alleviated the dryness, at least."
    new "尝到那味道，我皱起了眉。水龙头只流出一点水，看着倒也清澈，却根本不能喝。{w}不过至少稍稍缓解了口干。"

    # game/script.rpy:20053
    old "I left the glass on the countertop and went to inspect one of the many things we had to check: the living room's floor."
    new "我把杯子留在台面上，去查看我们必须检查的众多地方之一——客厅的地板。"

    # game/script.rpy:20062
    old "Look at this. I can see different pairs of footprints going between the entrance and the hallway, and there are many more under them that have degraded a lot.{w} It's too hard to conclude anything from them, though."
    new "「看看这个。玄关和走廊之间有好几组不同的脚印，下面还有许多已经严重模糊的脚印。{w}不过，光凭这些实在难以下结论。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20063
    old "Erina and Katei had just left, so two of the pairs probably belonged to them. As I looked at the footprints more, I realized that at least three different pairs were distinguishable. One set was fairly small, another was medium-sized, and the last was the biggest. In addition, the smaller ones were older."
    new "Erina 和 Katei 刚离开不久，其中两组脚印大概属于她们。我再仔细看，发现至少能分辨出三组不同的脚印：一组相当小，一组中等大小，最后一组最大。而且，较小的那组更旧。"

    # game/script.rpy:20065
    old "H-Huh...{w} A-Are these Isla's? They can't be, right? And I think they're a bit too big."
    new "「呃、呃……{w}这、这些是 Isla 的吗？不可能吧？而且我觉得尺寸有点太大了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20071
    old "Wait, look. The elevator's door is shut."
    new "「等等，你看。电梯门关上了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20077
    old "I walked back to the hallway and saw that the elevator was back in operation. After the many hours it had spent stuck in the attic, someone had chosen to reenable it."
    new "我回到走廊，发现电梯已经恢复运行。它被困在阁楼里好几个小时，如今有人选择重新启用它。"

    # game/script.rpy:20082
    old "I wondered if Erina or Katei had done it. What it meant was that the footprints wouldn't reveal the exact number of people who'd entered or exited the attic."
    new "我想会不会是 Erina 或 Katei 做的。这意味着，脚印无法准确揭示进出阁楼的人数。"

    # game/script.rpy:20083
    old "We wanted to understand what had gone on while we'd stayed in the bedroom, so we chose to walk down a floor."
    new "我们想弄清楚待在卧室期间外面发生了什么，于是决定往下走一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:20099
    old "The attic key was still in the door. The vast and desolate sight of the sixth floor, which contrasted the comfort of the attic, was a stark reminder of how things had progressed since that morning."
    new "阁楼钥匙还插在门上。六楼空旷而荒凉，与阁楼的舒适形成鲜明对比，也清楚地提醒我们，从那天早上起，事情已经发展到了哪一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:20105
    old "We should find Sai. He has to be somewhere, and he could know what happened to Akaro."
    new "「我们该去找 Sai。他一定在某个地方，而且说不定知道 Akaro 出了什么事。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20106
    old "I'm not sure he'll willingly talk to us after what he did. If he's still around, though, we'll find him."
    new "「他做了那种事，我不确定他还愿不愿意跟我们说话。不过，只要他还在这里，我们就能找到他。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20107
    old "The same applied to Akaro, and there was a possibility one last person was to be found. Had Erina imagined her dead daughter's yells, or was there some truth behind them? After everything we'd thought, we couldn't fully rule out a living Isla being present around us."
    new "Akaro 也是如此，而且还有可能找到最后一个人。是 Erina 幻听了死去女儿的喊声，还是那些喊声背后确有其事？经过此前种种推测，我们已经无法完全排除活着的 Isla 就在我们身边的可能性。"

    # game/script.rpy:20124
    old "We monotonously circled down the floors like we'd done many times. We didn't waste time looking through the offices, as making it to the crystal floor was our priority. Although using the elevator would've been expedient, we wanted to stretch our legs and at least give a cursory glance through the drab center of the tower."
    new "我们像先前许多次那样，沿着楼层一圈圈往下走，单调而乏味。我们没有浪费时间逐一查看办公室，因为抵达水晶层才是首要目标。虽说乘电梯更省事，但我们想活动活动腿脚，也至少顺便扫一眼塔楼中央那片乏味的区域。"

    # game/script.rpy:20129
    old "After moving down three floors, an unexpected sound interrupted the overwhelming silence. It was the elevator, moving through floor 4."
    new "往下走了三层后，一个意想不到的声音打破了令人窒息的寂静。是电梯，正经过四楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:20134
    old "...There it is again."
    new "「……又来了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20135
    old "We were in front of the elevator, but the opaque door didn't reveal any information."
    new "我们站在电梯前，但不透明的门什么也说明不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20136
    old "I wish the button would light up when the elevator's moving.{w} I doubt Erina and Katei would've used it already, no matter the reason. I'd say it was probably someone else."
    new "「电梯运行的时候，按钮要是会亮就好了。{w}不管出于什么原因，我都不觉得 Erina 和 Katei 会这么快就用电梯。要我说，多半是别人。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20137
    old "We hadn't tried to open its door in the attic, so we couldn't know the direction it was moving toward. However, it was likely it had been used to move from one extreme of the building to the other."
    new "我们在阁楼时没有试着打开电梯门，所以无从得知它正朝哪个方向移动。不过，它很可能是被人从建筑的一端叫到了另一端。"

    # game/script.rpy:20143
    old "We would've gone back up if we'd known for sure that the elevator wasn't in the attic and was logically going up. Instead, it took us a few seconds to circle the outer corridors until we were by the staircase leading to floor 2."
    new "如果我们能确定电梯不在阁楼、而且按理说正在上行，就会折返回去。结果，我们花了几秒钟绕过外围走廊，才来到通往二楼的楼梯旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:20147
    old "There, the sound repeated, but it was much harder to notice."
    new "到了那里，声音再次响起，却更难察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:20148
    old "Again?"
    new "「又响了？」"

    # game/script.rpy:20154
    old "Hm... It's only been a few seconds, so the first time, someone must've called it."
    new "「嗯……才过了几秒钟，所以第一次一定是有人叫了电梯。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20155
    old "You're right, yeah. So, either someone called it from under us and they just went up, or the opposite. I wouldn't think we missed someone above us, so I'd say the elevator was going up this last time."
    new "「你说得对。那么，要么是有人在下面叫了电梯，刚上去；要么正好相反。我想我们不会没注意到上方有人，所以这次电梯应该是在往上走。」"

    # game/script.rpy:20157
    old "If we were about to find an empty crystal floor, we'd go up again. Since the attic key was still in the door, unless the elevator had been called from the attic, it could've only reached floor 6. Of course, assuming another key hadn't been used, but it wasn't likely one existed."
    new "如果下去后发现水晶层空无一人，我们就再上去。阁楼钥匙还插在门上，所以除非有人从阁楼叫了电梯，否则电梯最多只能到六楼。当然，前提是没人用过另一把钥匙；但那种钥匙多半并不存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:20161
    old "Knowing that it still could've been going down, we continued heading toward the crystal floor."
    new "明知它说不定还在下行，我们仍继续朝水晶层走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:20171
    old "Shortly, we were in front of the stairs that led to that dark place where everything had started."
    new "不多时，我们已站在那道楼梯前——它通向一切开始的那片黑暗。"

    # game/script.rpy:20176
    old "There was no revealing sight that immediately met our eyes. The floor spread out in front of us exactly as we remembered it.{w} In hallway A, the light had begun to find a path through the dark coating and bounced off the walls more than it had the last time I'd been there. The strange smell hadn't faded since we'd been in the attic, and it had started to seem like the natural scent of the tower. It wasn't unpleasant, only intriguing, as I couldn't associate it to anything I'd ever smelled, and we couldn't identify its source."
    new "眼前并没有什么能说明问题的景象。这一层在我们面前铺展开来，与记忆里别无二致。{w} A走廊里，光线已开始在黑色涂层中找到通路，映在墙上的反光也比上次来时更多。那股怪味从我们在阁楼时起就没散过，如今倒像是这座塔本来就有的气味。算不上难闻，只让人好奇——我实在想不起在哪里闻过类似的味道，我们也查不出它的来源。"

    # game/script.rpy:20177
    old "Let's see."
    new "去看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:20181
    old "At our left was the elevator. I approached it and grabbed its handle."
    new "左手边是电梯。我走上前，握住把手。"

    # game/script.rpy:20185
    old "With little force, I attempted to open it, and there was unexpectedly no resistance. The door moved, uncovering an empty elevator and my mistaken assumption."
    new "我轻轻试着拉开它，没想到毫无阻力。门开了，里面是空电梯，也证明我刚才想错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20188
    old "It was going down...? Was there someone above us who we didn't see?"
    new "刚才它是在下行……？楼上还有我们没看见的人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:20193
    old "If so, they must be here now."
    new "若真如此，那他们现在一定就在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:20198
    old "That left me more confused than I expected. While it was possible that someone went up and down from the crystal floor or sent an empty elevator down upon arriving in the attic, Shiroya's claim was the most probable one."
    new "这让我比预想中更困惑。的确可能有人从水晶层上下往返，也可能有人抵达阁楼后把空电梯放了下去，但 Shiroya 的说法才是最有可能的。"

    # game/script.rpy:20199
    old "However, if we'd already missed someone on the upper floors, they'd probably stayed away from us intentionally, so using the elevator to reveal their existence was a little strange. I moved aside, trying not to obsess over it yet."
    new "可若我们真在楼上错过了某个人，对方多半是刻意避开我们，那还用电梯暴露自己的存在，就有些奇怪了。我退到一旁，暂且不去钻这个牛角尖。"

    # game/script.rpy:20203
    old "Before any of that, we should check if the Sekimeiya we left in the cabinet is still there."
    new "在那之前，先确认我们留在展示柜里的 Sekimeiya 还在不在。"

    # game/script.rpy:20208
    old "Yeah, but I wouldn't bet on it."
    new "嗯，不过我可不抱指望。"

    # game/script.rpy:20212
    old "We stepped into hallway A. The cabinet key had been taken by Akaro and Sai, so no part of me expected to find a shiny egg behind the curtain."
    new "我们走进 A 走廊。展示柜的钥匙已被 Akaro 和 Sai 拿走，所以我根本没指望遮布后面还会有一颗发亮的蛋。"

    # game/script.rpy:20218
    old "We entered the event room, and I approached the cabinet to see if my expectations would be betrayed twice in a row."
    new "进了活动室，我走到展示柜前，想看看自己的预想会不会接连第二次落空。"

    # game/script.rpy:20219
    old "It's not there, right?"
    new "不在里面吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:20226
    old "...No.{w} I can't wait to find Sai and hear the excuses he'll come up with."
    new "……不在。{w} 我已经等不及找到 Sai，听听他能编出什么借口了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20229
    old "Before I let the curtain fall, I tried to scroll the glass open, and it moved along with my fingers easily."
    new "放下遮布之前，我试着把玻璃门滑开，它随着我的手指轻巧地移开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20232
    old "The cabinet was definitely unlocked with the key, so there's no way the Sekimeiya \"teleported itself out\"."
    new "展示柜肯定是用钥匙打开的，所以 Sekimeiya 绝不可能「自己传送出去」。"

    # game/script.rpy:20237
    old "Isn't that still a little strange?"
    new "这不还是有点奇怪吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:20243
    old "That they didn't lock it again. Maybe it's not, since it's obvious that Akaro and Sai did it, but I thought they would've done that to hide that they used the key."
    new "他们没有再锁上。也许不算奇怪，毕竟很明显是 Akaro 和 Sai 干的；可我以为他们会顺手锁好，好掩盖用过钥匙这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:20244
    old "I'm not sure. They could've been in a hurry, but they knew they'd be suspected regardless."
    new "不好说。他们也许走得太急，可他们也清楚，无论如何自己都会被怀疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:20245
    old "However, the glass had been shut, not showing any signs of a hurry. The cabinet wasn't even locked, which was trivial to do manually. It was possible that there was more to Shiroya's input, but we had no way to be sure."
    new "然而玻璃门是合上的，看不出任何匆忙的痕迹。展示柜甚至没上锁，而手动锁上不过举手之劳。Shiroya 的话或许另有含义，可我们无从确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:20250
    old "Earlier, I thought that they were maybe taking the Sekimeiya out so the cold wouldn't affect it. If that was the case, I'm pretty sure they would've locked the cabinet to prevent us from putting it back if we found it."
    new "刚才我以为，他们拿走 Sekimeiya 是为了不让低温影响它。若真是这样，他们肯定会把展示柜锁上，免得我们找到后把它放回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:20251
    old "There are other cabinets with temperature functions, but I think you're right. I'm sure they could've taken care of the others in different ways too."
    new "还有别的带温控功能的展示柜，不过你说得对。我想他们也有别的办法处理其他东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:20256
    old "I suppose it's time to check our Sekimeiya."
    new "差不多该去看看我们自己那颗 Sekimeiya 了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20261
    old "It's impossible anyone took it, but it might be working now. Do you want to activate it...?"
    new "不可能有人拿走它，不过它现在也许能用了。你想启动它吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:20262
    old "I don't know. It could be dangerous, but nothing happened to us the other times. It sounds reckless, but it can take us to the past... If it started working at some point, we might be able to go quite a few hours back."
    new "我不知道。也许很危险，可前几次我们也没出什么事。这听着是有点莽撞，但它能把我们带回过去……如果它真在某个时候恢复运作，也许能让我们回到好几个小时之前。"

    # game/script.rpy:20267
    old "If that happens, we won't appear in the tower, because there's no way we missed ourselves from the beginning. It could put us outside instantly."
    new "若真是那样，我们就不会出现在塔里——毕竟从一开始，我们绝不可能看漏自己。它也许会直接把我们丢到塔外。"

    # game/script.rpy:20268
    old "Technically, we could've been in the secret part of the storeroom... You're right, though. It could take us out."
    new "严格说来，我们也可能待在储藏室的隐秘区域里……不过你说得对，它有可能把我们送到塔外。"

    # game/script.rpy:20269
    old "Seeing it like that, it was a lucky chance. Did the Sekimeiya have the power to kill us, erase our memories... and free us from the tower? Could it even let us see Miiya again?"
    new "这么一想，倒是个难得的机会。Sekimeiya 是否有力量杀死我们、抹去我们的记忆……让我们离开这座塔？甚至让我们再次见到 Miiya？"

    # game/script.rpy:20270
    old "I hadn't made up my mind. If we had the chance, activating it would always be tempting, as it could let us understand its mechanics and what had been going on. Undecided, we exited through hallway B."
    new "我还没拿定主意。只要有机会，启动它总是诱人的，说不定能弄清它的原理和这一切的来龙去脉。就这样犹豫着，我们从 B走廊出去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20279
    old "Directly at our left was the staff room, housing our own Sekimeiya. We couldn't feel the presence of anyone else, so we entered it."
    new "左手边正对着员工室，我们那颗 Sekimeiya 就放在那里。感觉不到还有别人，我们便走了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:20284
    old "Remembering which locker belonged to Naomi, I stepped toward it while Shiroya stayed by the door to alert me of any sound."
    new "我记起哪个储物柜是 Naomi 的，便朝它走去；Shiroya 留在门边，一有动静就提醒我。"

    # game/script.rpy:20285
    old "I took the key out of my pocket and inserted it into the keyhole. With two fingers, I turned it to undo the lock. The sharp sound told me that I'd been successful."
    new "我从口袋里取出钥匙，插进锁孔。用两根手指一转，锁便开了。清脆的一声告诉我成了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20288
    old "Lastly, I removed the key, which opened the metallic door at the same time. I saw the narrow interior, with the coat hanging as we'd left it. Then, I raised my line of sight to reach the higher compartment."
    new "最后我拔出钥匙，金属门也随之打开。狭长的柜内一览无余，外套还挂在我们离开时的位置。接着我抬起视线，望向上面那层。"

    # game/script.rpy:20294
    old "It wasn't storing anything.{w} Its interior contained nothing but an empty space waiting to be filled. ...My dumbfounded look persisted until the realization fully sank in."
    new "那层里什么都没有。{w} 柜内空无一物，只余一个等着被填满的空位。……我愣在那里，直到这个事实彻底沉进心里。"

    # game/script.rpy:20296
    old "Hey, this is the right locker, isn't it? We left it up here."
    new "喂，是这个储物柜没错吧？我们当时就放在这上面。"

    # game/script.rpy:20301
    old "Yes... Is it not there?"
    new "没错……里面没有吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:20302
    old "Look, there's nothing."
    new "你看，什么都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:20303
    old "She approached me with a neutral face. Not a slight hint of surprise emanated from her. By that point, something truly impressive would need to occur to evoke genuine shock from us. We felt like we'd seen it all."
    new "她面无表情地走过来，没有流露出半分惊讶。到了这个地步，非得发生点真正了不得的事，才能让我们真正震惊。我们觉得自己已经什么都见过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20309
    old "We definitely left it here. Was it still locked?"
    new "我们确实把它放在这里了。刚才还是锁着的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:20315
    old "We let out exasperated sighs. We had kept the Sekimeiya hidden so that nobody else would find it, but it seemed it decided to spite us and disappear. Even though it hadn't made us travel before we'd left it, it evidently did have powers, as nobody should have been able to take it out."
    new "我们无奈地叹了口气。我们把 Sekimeiya 藏起来，正是为了不让别人发现，它却像是存心跟我们作对，消失了。尽管我们离开之前它并没有让我们穿越，但它显然确实有力量——毕竟本不该有人能把它取走。"

    # game/script.rpy:20320
    old "Did it teleport like Sai's been saying?"
    new "它真像 Sai 一直说的那样，自己传送走了？"

    # game/script.rpy:20321
    old "Well, he and Akaro couldn't have taken it..."
    new "这个嘛，他和 Akaro 是不可能拿走它的……"

    # game/script.rpy:20326
    old "If it did, we might know when.{w} We've never seen two Sekimeiya exist at the same time, but it should've happened when one supposedly appeared in Sai's hip pack, right?"
    new "若真是如此，我们也许能知道那是何时。{w} 我们从没见过两颗 Sekimeiya 同时存在，但据说有一颗出现在 Sai 的腰包里，那时候就该发生过这种情况，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:20327
    old "I nodded, unsure."
    new "我不太确定地点了点头。"

    # game/script.rpy:20332
    old "Maybe there were two right then, but they had to be the same one and one had traveled from the future. Sai told you he didn't know he had it and he never put it there. He could've been telling the truth."
    new "也许那一刻确实有两颗，但它们必定是同一颗，只是其中一颗是从未来穿越而来的。Sai 说过他并不知道自己带着它，也从没把它放进去。他也许说的是真话。"

    # game/script.rpy:20333
    old "At that point, there was another Sekimeiya in that cabinet in room B3, and we used it to travel to the past. If it can randomly teleport itself, it could be traveling to the past as well. After all, when we came back to that room, the Sekimeiya in the cabinet had disappeared after the time I saw it was gray."
    new "当时 B3房间的展示柜里还有另一颗 Sekimeiya，我们用它穿越回了过去。如果它能随机自行传送，那也可能是传送到了过去。毕竟我们回到那个房间时，柜里的 Sekimeiya 正是在我看到它变成灰色之后消失的。"

    # game/script.rpy:20336
    old "Right, but we thought Sai took it."
    new "对，可我们原本以为是被 Sai 拿走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20341
    old "It could've traveled to the past, to Sai's hip pack. I get Sai's own existence is another mystery, though.{w} ...After that, he hid it in the cleaning room."
    new "它也可能穿越到了过去，落进 Sai 的腰包。不过 Sai 本人的存在本身就是另一个谜。{w}……之后，他把它藏进了清洁间。"

    # game/script.rpy:20346
    old "Next, we hid it in this locker, but at some point, the same thing happened. It teleported to the hallway A cabinet, with Isla...{w} This time, it didn't even have to go to the past. It could've simply teleported."
    new "接着，我们把它藏进了这个储物柜，可不知什么时候，同样的事又发生了。它传送到了 A走廊的展示柜，和 Isla 在一起……{w}这一次，它甚至不必回到过去，可能只是单纯传送了一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:20351
    old "Then, since we brought it to the event room, Akaro and Sai could take it with the key. This could also explain how it appeared in the storeroom at the start..."
    new "后来我们把它带到了活动室，Akaro 和 Sai 就能用钥匙把它拿走。这也能解释它一开始为什么会出现在储藏室……"

    # game/script.rpy:20352
    old "I spent a few seconds in thought."
    new "我思索了几秒。"

    # game/script.rpy:20353
    old "So, is it disappearing randomly?{w} There are a couple things I'm not sure about. Even though it could have teleported to the storeroom, the cabinet in the event room was unlocked, so I think one of us moved it...{w} I suppose it's possible someone hid it in hallway B and it teleported to the storeroom, but that's hard to believe."
    new "那么，它是在随机消失吗？{w}有几处我还不太确定。它固然可能传送到储藏室，但活动室里的展示柜当时没上锁，所以我觉得是我们中的某个人把它挪走了……{w}要说有人把它藏在 B走廊，然后它传送到储藏室，也不是不可能，只是难以相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:20356
    old "And there's one unexplained thing I can think of: the first time Isla disappeared from the cabinet, before appearing again.{w} Nothing was found inside it, so the Sekimeiya couldn't have teleported from this locker yet."
    new "还有一件事我想不通：Isla 第一次从展示柜里消失，之后又重新出现。{w}当时柜里什么都没找到，所以 Sekimeiya 那时不可能已经从这个储物柜传送过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:20361
    old "Oh, something else is needed to explain that, yeah. I guess maybe it moved from the locker to another place, Katei activated it, and then it traveled again to the cabinet with Isla."
    new "哦，那确实得有别的东西才能解释。我猜也许是它先从储物柜到了别处，Katei 启动了它，然后它又穿越到了 Isla 所在的展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:20362
    old "That's one way to put it together. I think everything holds up.{w} Anyway, if the Sekimeiya was actually taken from here by someone, it's very possible they put it inside Isla's cabinet. Honestly, it feels out of place to think that it's been teleporting itself through time at random intervals."
    new "这么拼也说得通，我觉得前后都对得上。{w}总之，如果 Sekimeiya 真是被人从这里拿走的，那很可能就是被放进了 Isla 的展示柜。说实话，要认为它自己在随机的时间间隔里反复传送，总觉得不太对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:20367
    old "Well, how else could it have disappeared from here? There's no way this lock was picked, right?"
    new "那它还能怎么从这里消失？这锁不可能被撬开吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:20369
    old "After thinking about it, I spotted a couple of alternative paths to take."
    new "想了一会儿，我发现了另外几条可能的思路。"

    # game/script.rpy:20372
    old "The door was still locked, so I highly doubt the lock was picked and then set again. Only one thing would've been needed to get the Sekimeiya out of here if it never disappeared all by itself: the key.{w} Duplication can be easily achieved by traveling to the past since two versions of yourself exist at the same time. I'm still not sure about everything you can do with it, but it can work with objects, like how we're replicating our clothes after traveling."
    new "门当时还锁着，所以我不认为有人撬过锁又把它复原。如果 Sekimeiya 不是自己凭空消失的，那要把它从这里带走，只需要一样东西：钥匙。{w}回到过去就能轻松复制出第二份，因为同一时刻会存在两个自己。时间穿越能做到哪些事，我还没完全弄明白，但物品同样适用——就像我们穿越之后衣服会被复制一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:20373
    old "I don't believe that ever happened to this key, but it's not out of the question. Since the time we found the first Naomi up to this point, it never traveled through time."
    new "我不认为这把钥匙经历过这种事，但也不能完全排除。从我们找到第一个 Naomi 到现在，它一次都没有穿越过时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:20374
    old "Before that point, though, we don't know. While the mystery of the second Naomi is as unsolved as ever, she didn't have any keys on her, which makes me think that her keyring wasn't replicated alongside her body and clothes."
    new "但在那之前，我们就无从得知了。第二个 Naomi 的谜团依旧毫无头绪，不过她身上没有钥匙，这让我觉得她的钥匙串并没有随着身体和衣服一起被复制。"

    # game/script.rpy:20375
    old "But that's not necessarily the truth. The main reason why I think that is because of the initial footprints in the attic and because her keys weren't removed from her first body. Maybe the reason for that is the killer had a replica of Naomi's keyring from the start.{w} It's even possible an entirely different person killed the second Naomi and grabbed her keys..."
    new "但这未必就是真相。我这么想的主要依据，是阁楼里最初的那些脚印，以及她的钥匙并没有从她第一具身体上被取走。也许原因是凶手从一开始就持有复制出来的 Naomi 钥匙串。{w}甚至有可能，杀死第二个 Naomi 并取走钥匙的是完全另一个人……"

    # game/script.rpy:20378
    old "They would've hidden them somewhere, so after how much we've searched, it's impressive if we still haven't found them. Since we searched everyone before locking ourselves up in the attic, it can't be that someone still had the four keys from the second Naomi at that point."
    new "他们总得把钥匙藏在某处，我们搜了这么多地方，要是还没找到，那可真够厉害的。毕竟我们把自己关进阁楼之前搜过所有人，那时不可能还有人身上带着第二个 Naomi 的那四把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:20379
    old "...While it's possible, I don't think another key like this one exists. I'm inclined to believe that the second Naomi never had any keys on her."
    new "……虽然不无可能，但我不认为还存在另一把这样的钥匙。我更倾向于相信，第二个 Naomi 身上从来就没有钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:20384
    old "Yeah, so nobody could've opened the locker."
    new "是啊，那就没人能打开那个储物柜了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20385
    old "No, we could have.{w} We have the key, so we could go back to the past and unlock it."
    new "不，我们能打开。{w}钥匙在我们手上，只要回到过去就能把锁打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:20390
    old "Oh... Well, I guess so."
    new "哦……也是吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:20391
    old "But this can't be it. I've spent a while thinking about these kinds of loops, and even though they seem possible, I find it hard to accept them."
    new "但事情不可能是这样的。这类循环我琢磨了很久，它们看似行得通，我却很难接受。"

    # game/script.rpy:20394
    old "If we go back to the past and get the Sekimeiya out of this locker, would the origin be that we realized it had happened? Would we be choosing to explain this mystery in our way?"
    new "如果我们回到过去，把 Sekimeiya 从这个储物柜里取出来，原因难道是我们已经意识到它发生了？难道我们要按自己的方式去解释这个谜？"

    # game/script.rpy:20395
    old "Even if we go back to the past and get it out because we realize that Sai or Akaro will do it otherwise, the fundamental reason would still be that we've witnessed the end result already. On the surface, it sounds possible, but I don't believe it is."
    new "即便我们回到过去把它取出来，理由是我们意识到不这么做的话 Sai 或 Akaro 就会动手，根本原因仍然是我们已经目睹了结果。表面上听起来可行，我却认为并非如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:20396
    old "Shiroya appraised me with an odd look. Perhaps listening to me toss out those words sounded bizarre, as we'd never had conversations remotely similar to that."
    new "Shiroya 用古怪的眼神打量我。或许听我说出这种话显得太离奇，毕竟我们之间从未有过哪怕稍微相似的交谈。"

    # game/script.rpy:20401
    old "You're still saying that there's no other possibility, right?"
    new "你还是想说，没有别的可能了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:20402
    old "No, I'm saying that, right now, there's likely only one:{w} someone else will grab this key, go back to the past, and use it to unlock the locker."
    new "不，我是说，眼下大概只剩一种可能：{w}有别的人会拿走这把钥匙，回到过去，用它打开储物柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:20407
    old "Huh."
    new "哈。"

    # game/script.rpy:20408
    old "Such an abrupt response made me laugh. I might've been deluding myself a little, but I thought I'd reached that conclusion through semi-logical reasoning."
    new "这反应来得太突然，我不禁笑出声。也许我有点自欺欺人，但我自认为这个结论多少是凭逻辑推出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:20411
    old "I shook some thoughts away and closed the locker without locking it. Then, I left the room and told Shiroya to follow me."
    new "我甩开杂念，关上储物柜，没有上锁。随后我离开房间，让 Shiroya 跟上。"

    # game/script.rpy:20421
    old "I entered the women's bathroom and waited for her to come in. While she looked at me quizzically, I opened the toilet's lid, dropped the key inside, and flushed it."
    new "我走进女厕所，等她跟进来。她一脸疑惑地看着我，我掀开马桶盖，把钥匙丢进去，冲了水。"

    # game/script.rpy:20427
    old "There it goes. What are you doing?"
    new "冲走了。你这是在干什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:20428
    old "Yeah, it seems I was wrong. Perhaps I'm taking myself too seriously.{w} The universe didn't break, and I doubt the past changed."
    new "嗯，看来我错了。也许是我太把自己当回事了。{w}宇宙没有崩坏，过去大概也没被改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:20434
    old "My theory involved someone else using the key to go back to the past and taking our Sekimeiya, so this was an easy way to deny that reality. It appears the answer was another one, though, meaning that the Sekimeiya vanished differently."
    new "我的推论是别人用这把钥匙回到过去，拿走了我们的 Sekimeiya，所以冲掉它是最简单的验证办法。但看来答案是另一种，也就是说 Sekimeiya 是以别的方式消失的。"

    # game/script.rpy:20440
    old "It could be teleporting itself."
    new "它也可能是自己传送走的。"

    # game/script.rpy:20441
    old "...Maybe it's just becoming invisible."
    new "……也许它只是变得看不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20448
    old "...We went back to the staff room. If, against all odds, my action had changed the past without breaking the universe or altering our memories, the locker would be locked and we'd have no way of getting the Sekimeiya out."
    new "……我们回到员工室。万一我的举动真的改变了过去，却没有让宇宙崩坏、也没有改变我们的记忆，那储物柜就该是锁着的，我们也就没办法把 Sekimeiya 取出来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20453
    old "I stepped inside and tried to open it."
    new "我走进去，试着打开柜门。"

    # game/script.rpy:20456
    old "I'd left it unlocked, so it opened. Once again, the winter coat was the only thing inside.{w} I brushed my hand through the higher compartment just to make sure that it wasn't actually going invisible or anything. I shrugged and closed the locker, unable to lock it anymore."
    new "我之前没上锁，柜门应声而开。里面依旧只有那件冬季外套。{w}我把手伸进上层隔间扫了一遍，确认它并不是真的隐身了之类的。我耸耸肩，关上柜门——已经没法再锁上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20457
    old "Still nothing."
    new "还是什么都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:20463
    old "Well, Sai seems like a bottom feeder, so maybe you flushed the key into his home."
    new "这个嘛，Sai 看起来就是个下三滥，说不定你这一冲，正好把钥匙冲进他家了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20471
    old "I exited the room without revealing that I'd been about to consider something similar. I smiled slightly to myself and looked around the hallway."
    new "我没透露自己刚才也差点想到类似的事，径自走出房间。我暗自微微一笑，环顾走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:20473
    old "I guess we should try to find the others. We have to be close to someone."
    new "我看我们该去找其他人了。总该离某个人不远吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:20478
    old "Yeah, let's see who we come across."
    new "嗯，看看会碰上谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:20484
    old "After the longest time, we put into action the usual procedure.{w} We began with the cleaning room at our side. Next was the crystal room B6, found on the opposite side."
    new "隔了这么久，我们终于又照例行动起来。{w}先从身旁的清洁间开始，接着是对面的水晶展室 B6。"

    # game/script.rpy:20486
    old "Atsuki, the Sekimeiya's on the floor."
    new "Atsuki，Sekimeiya 掉在地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:20493
    old "I'd been about to move to the next room when Shiroya's casual voice stopped me in place. I turned around slowly to see her nodding at my disbelief.{w} I approached the door and looked through it."
    new "我正要走向下一个房间，Shiroya 随口一句让我停住了脚步。我慢慢转过身，看见她正点着头，像是在回应我这副难以置信的表情。{w}我走到门边，透过门看进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:20502
    old "In front of a cabinet was the Sekimeiya, lying on the floor and glowing white. Once again, Shiroya had found it as soon as we started to search."
    new "一个展示柜前，Sekimeiya 躺在地上，泛着白光。我们刚开始搜，Shiroya 就又一次发现了它。"

    # game/script.rpy:20503
    old "That's sudden. Who would've left it there?"
    new "这也太突然了。谁会把它丢在那儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:20508
    old "Nobody. I bet someone activated it, disappeared, and didn't come back."
    new "没有人。我猜是有人启动了它，消失之后就没再回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:20509
    old "I thought of Akaro's case. If he'd forgotten about traveling from that room, he wouldn't have come back. Similarly, if someone had time traveled and appeared outside the tower, the Sekimeiya would've stayed there."
    new "我想起 Akaro 的情况。要是他忘了自己是从那个房间穿越出去的，就不会再回来。同理，若有人穿越到塔外，Sekimeiya 也应当留在原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:20513
    old "We walked up to it with guarded stances. The sight was reminiscent of an anglerfish's lure, so we'd instinctively scanned the empty room before stepping in."
    new "我们保持着戒备靠近。那景象像极了鮟鱇鱼的诱饵，所以我们本能地先扫视了一遍空荡的房间，才迈步走进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:20519
    old "I kneeled, hid my right hand under my sleeve, and stood back up holding the Sekimeiya."
    new "我跪下来，把右手藏进袖中，再起身时已将 Sekimeiya 握在手里。"

    # game/script.rpy:20523
    old "It's definitely working. It burns."
    new "确实起作用了。烫得厉害。"

    # game/script.rpy:20528
    old "What do we do with it?"
    new "我们该怎么处理它？"

    # game/script.rpy:20529
    old "I couldn't hold it for very long due to the heat increasing rapidly through my shirt. I started to walk toward the door as I thought about it."
    new "热度透过衬衫升得很快，我拿不了多久。我一边琢磨，一边朝门口走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:20538
    old "Either we use it or we leave it in its cabinet. There's no point in hiding it again if we're not gonna ever activate it."
    new "要么用它，要么就把它留在展示柜里。既然根本不打算启动它，再藏一次也没有意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:20539
    old "The potential for danger was real, but greed and curiosity were powerful. In my hands, I had the key to every mystery. I thought we had given up on understanding it, but if we figured out how to use a time travel device before it was exposed to the world, it was undeniable that the options were endless."
    new "危险确实存在，但贪婪与好奇心同样强烈。我手中握着的，是解开一切谜团的钥匙。我本以为我们早已放弃弄懂它，可只要能在它暴露于世之前弄清这件时间穿越装置该怎么用，眼前的选择无疑会无穷无尽。"

    # game/script.rpy:20542
    old "Given what happened while we were in the attic, it seems likely that whoever took the Sekimeiya was the main culprit behind everything. Despite that, they simply left it here, probably after using it. They haven't come back for it, so maybe that's a hint to their goal—or their failure.{w} Regardless, it was probably activated recently, so we shouldn't go too far back, just enough to understand what went down while we were in the attic.{w} Also, I don't think it's as hot as it was in the past, so depending on how far back we go, we could confirm that correlation."
    new "从我们在阁楼时发生的事来看，拿走 Sekimeiya 的人很可能就是这一切的主谋。可即便如此，他们还是把它留在了这里，大概是在用过之后。他们没有回来取，这或许暗示了他们的目的——又或者是他们的失败。{w} 无论如何，它多半是最近才被启动的，所以我们不该回到太远的过去，只要刚好能弄清我们在阁楼时外面发生了什么就行。{w} 另外，我觉得它没有过去那么烫了，所以看我们回到多远的过去，也许就能证实这种关联。"

    # game/script.rpy:20548
    old "...All right. Let's see what happens."
    new "……好吧。看看会发生什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:20549
    old "She moved closer to me, stating that she wanted to be in the range too. It was potentially a horrible idea, but the Sekimeiya's existence felt like nothing short of a miracle which we'd otherwise regret not taking advantage of. It could've been about to doom the entire world, but during those twelve hours, we had it all to ourselves... and a race to understand it could easily have been happening behind the scenes."
    new "她靠了过来，说她也想待在范围内。这或许是个糟糕透顶的主意，但 Sekimeiya 的存在本身就像一场奇迹，若不加以利用，我们必定会后悔。它也许正要将整个世界拖向毁灭，可在整整十二个小时里，它都属于我们……而暗地里，一场弄懂它的竞赛很可能早已展开。"

    # game/script.rpy:20551
    old "We hadn't inspected the whole building yet, so the possibility of traveling to the recent past was open. I took my left hand out of my sleeve and brought it toward the Sekimeiya with intentions of further figuring out its mechanics, limits, and what had occurred outside the bedroom walls."
    new "我们还没检查完整栋建筑，所以仍有可能穿越到不久前的过去。我把左手从袖子里抽出来，伸向 Sekimeiya，想进一步弄清它的运作机制、极限，以及卧室门外究竟发生过什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:20554
    old "A Step Forward"
    new "向前一步"

    # game/script.rpy:20562
    old "As soon as I felt the direct heat on my fingers, I saw a door."
    new "指尖刚接触到那股灼热，我就看见了一扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:20565
    old "I'm... back here."
    new "我……又回到这里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20566
    old "Wait, the handle is attached."
    new "等等，门把手还装在上面。"

    # game/script.rpy:20571
    old "I heard a sound coming from behind me. As I turned around, I saw Shiroya climbing down the ladder."
    new "身后传来声响。我回过头，看见 Shiroya 正从梯子上下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:20572
    old "...Did you just appear there?"
    new "……你刚才就出现在那里？"

    # game/script.rpy:20578
    old "Yeah. We traveled from room B6, right?"
    new "嗯。我们是从水晶展室 B6 穿越过来的，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:20580
    old "Yes, and look, there's the handle. Either we went more than an hour and a half into the past, or just a few minutes."
    new "对，而且你看，门把手还在。我们要么回到了一个半小时以前，要么只回到了几分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:20581
    old "Shiroya and I slowly scanned the place we'd traveled to, but we didn't spot anything else noteworthy. We'd appeared in the bedroom where we'd just been."
    new "我和 Shiroya 慢慢打量我们穿越到的地方，但没发现别的值得注意之处。我们出现在刚才待过的卧室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:20586
    old "You said it didn't feel as hot as the previous times, so probably the latter."
    new "你说过它不像之前几次那么烫，所以多半是后者。"

    # game/script.rpy:20587
    old "She was right, meaning that we weren't going to see what had happened while we'd been locked up. However, every single travel revealed plentiful factors to analyze. Comparing them with earlier travels felt like the best way to get to conclusions."
    new "她说得没错，也就是说，我们看不到被关起来的那段时间里发生了什么。不过，每一次穿越都留下了许多可供分析的线索。把它们同先前的穿越对照，似乎是最容易得出答案的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:20590
    old "This is my fourth travel, and again, nothing bad has directly come out of it. I don't know what happened to Isla and Akaro, but I doubt the mere act of traveling is bringing any danger."
    new "这是我第四次穿越了，而且它同样没有直接带来什么坏结果。我不知道 Isla 和 Akaro 出了什么事，但我不认为光是穿越本身会带来危险。"

    # game/script.rpy:20591
    old "Regarding my memories, I summarized the basic events in case there was a glaring contradiction she could find."
    new "至于我的记忆，我把基本经过讲了一遍，好让她看看能不能找出什么明显的矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:20597
    old "Yeah, that's all that happened. Unless traveling affected our memories in the same way, there's nothing wrong with what you said."
    new "嗯，事情就这些。除非穿越也以同样的方式影响了我们的记忆，否则你说的并没有问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:20600
    old "I'm starting to think more and more that Akaro lied to us. He reacted to the mention of the Sekimeiya, but that could've been intentional, to relate his memory loss to it and make it more believable. I feel that Katei was right and he was trying to prevent us from leaving. After his job was done, he escaped somehow."
    new "我越来越觉得 Akaro 骗了我们。听到 Sekimeiya 时他确实有反应，但那也可能是故意演出来的，好把失忆和它扯上关系，让那番说辞更可信。我觉得 Katei 说得对，他当时是在阻止我们离开。等他的任务完成，他就不知用什么办法逃走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20606
    old "...How, though?"
    new "……可他是怎么做到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:20607
    old "I don't know, but I can come up with a bit of an idea.{w} We had the key, and the chain was left set. That makes it likely that he teleported out. ...I thought that perhaps Sai did that.{w} Maybe he traveled next to the door to encompass Akaro and make him escape since neither of them could open the door. It could be that he made us go to the upper bedroom so that we wouldn't travel with him. I don't know why they'd do any of that, but there's not much else I can think of."
    new "我不知道，不过我大概能想到一种可能。{w} 钥匙在我们手里，门链却还扣着，所以他多半是传送出去的。……我想，也许是 Sai 做的。{w} 也许他穿越到门边，把 Akaro 也纳入范围，好让他一起逃出去，毕竟他们谁都打不开那扇门。他让我们去楼上卧室，也许就是为了不让我们跟他一起穿越。我不知道他们为什么要做这些，但除此之外我也想不出别的可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:20608
    old "Actually, no, Akaro could've escaped all by himself and left the chain set.{w} Maybe he suddenly disappeared from the room, traveling to the past. Then, in the past, he activated the Sekimeiya to encompass the bed on which he was sitting; it wasn't necessary for Sai to do that as long as Akaro had thought of it."
    new "不对，Akaro 也可能全靠自己逃出去，离开时门链依旧扣着。{w} 也许他突然从房间里消失，穿越到了过去。然后在过去启动 Sekimeiya，把当时自己坐着的床也纳入范围；只要 Akaro 自己能想到，就不必由 Sai 来做。"

    # game/script.rpy:20613
    old "That must've happened before someone traveled from room B6, then."
    new "那一定是在有人从水晶展室 B6 穿越之前发生的。"

    # game/script.rpy:20621
    old "We walked out. When I looked at the living room, I instantly recognized our own footprints."
    new "我们走了出去。我一看客厅，就立刻认出了我们自己的脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:20622
    old "These are definitely ours, and they're very recent. We went a few minutes to the past."
    new "这些肯定是我们留下的，而且非常新。我们回到了几分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:20627
    old "Someone used the Sekimeiya very shortly before us. We can't see what happened, but we can be pretty sure of that."
    new "有人在我们之前不久刚用过 Sekimeiya。虽然看不到发生了什么，但这一点几乎可以肯定。"

    # game/script.rpy:20628
    old "And if Akaro never actually escaped the way I said, it's possible they went very far into the past. We spent a long time in the bedroom, so there was a lot of time for the Sekimeiya to store energy.{w} You know, this could've been what Akaro and Sai worked together to accomplish. The stored time was originally Sai's idea."
    new "而且，如果 Akaro 根本不是照我说的那种方式逃走的，他们也可能穿越到了很久以前。我们在卧室里待了那么长时间，Sekimeiya 有足够的时间蓄能。{w} 你想想，这也许正是 Akaro 和 Sai 联手做成的事。蓄能这个点子本来就是 Sai 提出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:20629
    old "Akaro's job could have been to keep us from exiting the bedroom, letting the Sekimeiya store time for a while. Once they'd waited the required amount, they activated it and went far enough into the past to exit the tower. Since the Sekimeiya was left on the floor, it's possible they aren't here anymore."
    new "Akaro 的任务也许就是拖住我们，不让我们离开卧室，好让 Sekimeiya 蓄能一段时间。等他们等够了所需的时间，就启动它，穿越到足够久远的过去，从塔里出去。既然 Sekimeiya 被留在了地上，他们现在可能已经不在这里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20634
    old "Hm... And they couldn't simply have waited more before escaping the bedroom because the Sekimeiya was chilled.{w} There's still the disappearing Sekimeiya in the locker to explain, but that'd be the only thing."
    new "嗯……而且他们不能在逃出卧室前多等一会儿，因为 Sekimeiya 已经凉了下来。{w} 这样一来，唯一还需要解释的就是储物柜里消失的 Sekimeiya，不过也就只剩这一件事了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20637
    old "Yeah.{w} Sai seemed to be having fun, so exiting the tower doesn't seem like something he'd want to do. However, they did this right after discovering the storeroom's secret exit.{w} As soon as they saw that, they probably realized they could go back many hours in time, find that door from the outside, and try to enter and exit with the Sekimeiya. They might be about to try coming back in since doing it earlier would've made their own travel impossible."
    new "嗯。{w} Sai 看起来玩得挺开心，不像是会想离开塔的人。可他们偏偏是在发现储藏室那条秘密出口之后立刻行动的。{w} 一看到那个出口，他们大概就意识到，自己可以回到许多小时前，从外面找到那扇门，再带着 Sekimeiya 进出。他们也许正准备试着回到塔内，因为要是更早行动，他们自己就没法穿越了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20638
    old "Let's go down and keep an eye on the Sekimeiya. It's a bit hard to believe that everyone doesn't want to escape with it."
    new "我们下楼去盯着 Sekimeiya 吧。说大家都不想靠它逃走，实在有点难以置信。"

    # game/script.rpy:20643
    old "I nodded. Shiroya rushed to the elevator and called it after seeing that the door wouldn't open."
    new "我点点头。Shiroya 见电梯门打不开，便跑过去按下了呼叫按钮。"

    # game/script.rpy:20647
    old "Huh... This happened again."
    new "咦……又发生了一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:20654
    old "The elevator, remember? We were the ones to call it, it seems. This also happened at the beginning, during my first travel."
    new "电梯啊，还记得吗？看来叫电梯的人就是我们自己。最开始我第一次穿越时，也发生过同样的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:20659
    old "Oh... I didn't even think about it."
    new "哦……我完全没想到这一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:20660
    old "It's coming up, meaning that it was below us when we heard it on the office floors. We're going to the crystal floor, where we saw it already arrived."
    new "它正在上来，说明我们在办公楼层听到它时，它还在我们下面。我们要去水晶层，到了那里会看到它已经先到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20661
    old "According to her, she called it without realizing that she was about to cause the noise we'd already heard. The belief that every event had an origin point was reinforced once more, as she'd unconsciously reenacted the past. Us hearing the elevator had derived into traveling to the past, but the action of calling the elevator had an organic origin.{w} Not only that, we'd explained the single sign of life we'd experienced, so we had to seriously wonder what happened to Sai, Akaro, Erina, and Katei."
    new "按她的说法，她按电梯时并没有意识到，自己正要弄出我们早就听到的那个声音。每个事件都有个起点，这个想法又得到了一次印证，因为她无意中重演了过去。我们是因为听到电梯声才穿越回过去的；而按电梯这个动作本身，却有个自然的起因。{w} 不光如此，我们之前察觉到的唯一一点生命迹象，现在也解释通了，于是我们不得不认真去想：Sai、Akaro、Erina 和 Katei 到底出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:20669
    old "When the button lit up, she opened the door, and we boarded the elevator. Without a second thought, she pressed the floor 1 button."
    new "按钮亮起后，她打开电梯门，我们走了进去。她毫不犹豫地按下了1楼的按钮。"

    # game/script.rpy:20674
    old "While it started to move down, we once again experienced the claustrophobic atmosphere that the dim light and opaque doors effortlessly created. We soon passed floor 3, where our past selves surely found themselves wondering who was inside the elevator and where it was headed."
    new "电梯开始下行，昏暗的灯光和不透明的门轻而易举地又营造出那种幽闭感。我们很快经过3楼，在那里，过去的我们想必正纳闷电梯里是谁、又要去哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:20675
    old "We weren't in a big hurry, but we knew that we would soon appear on the crystal floor from the stairs. I thought of what to do to escape our past field of vision."
    new "我们并不怎么急，但知道再过不久，我们就会从楼梯口出来，出现在水晶层。我盘算着该怎么做，才能避开过去的我们的视线。"

    # game/script.rpy:20676
    old "We entered the event room from hallway A, and after seeing the empty cabinet, we looked inside Naomi's locker. We should go to the lobby, where we won't be seen."
    new "我们是从 A走廊进入活动室的，看到展示柜空着之后，又查看了 Naomi 的储物柜。我们该去大厅，那里不会被人看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:20693
    old "It sounded like the best idea, so we moved there and closed the hallway A door behind us. Even though there wasn't much to be tense about, we felt safe staying there, and we began to automatically move toward the metal shutter."
    new "听上去这是最稳妥的办法，我们便移到那里，关上了身后的A走廊门。其实没什么可紧张的，但待在那里让人安心，我们不知不觉就朝金属卷帘门走了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:20704
    old "Remember what I thought the time you appeared in the living room? It seemed like we appeared where we'd been in the midpoint of the time traveled."
    new "你还记得你出现在客厅那次，我当时是怎么推测的吗？我们出现的地方，好像就是穿越时段正中间那一刻我们所在的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:20705
    old "Yes, and this time, something similar happened. I noticed it too."
    new "记得，这次也是差不多的情况。我也注意到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20710
    old "I think it was the opposite. You appeared in the lower level of the bedroom, and I was upstairs, next to the hatch. Those exact positions occurred before we unlocked the bedroom."
    new "我看恰恰相反。你出现在卧室下层，我在楼上，就在舱口旁边。这两个位置，都是我们打开卧室之前才有的。"

    # game/script.rpy:20711
    old "Right. I followed Katei down, and you peeked from the hatch when I was already below. That might've been the location."
    new "对。我跟着 Katei 下楼，等我到了下面，你从舱口探头往下看。那大概就是当时的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:20712
    old "And that probably happened a bit more than ten minutes before we touched the Sekimeiya. After that, we discussed whether to leave, placed the handles back on the door, walked down to the crystal floor, and talked about the Sekimeiya vanishing.{w} We appeared in the bedroom before the time we'd heard the elevator... We might've appeared where we'd been ten minutes prior to traveling while only going back five. It's the opposite of what I thought before. It swapped the two points, although I'm not sure if the times fit that well."
    new "而那大概是在我们碰触 Sekimeiya 之前十多分钟。之后我们商量要不要离开，把门把手装回门上，下到水晶层，又聊起 Sekimeiya 消失的事。{w} 可我们出现在卧室的时间，却在听见电梯之前……也许我们只回溯了五分钟，出现的地点却是穿越前十分钟所在的位置。这和我先前的推测正好相反。两个时点掉了个个儿，只是时间上对不对得上，我还没有把握。"

    # game/script.rpy:20714
    old "That could be it, but it's still not consistent with any of the past travels. If there aren't set rules, there's no point in trying to understand how the Sekimeiya works. But what's most important is that a past position was once again used to determine where we appeared, even if it was done differently."
    new "有可能，但这样跟之前几次穿越都对不上。如果没有固定的规则，再去琢磨 Sekimeiya 怎么运作也没有意义。不过最关键的是，决定我们出现位置的，又一次是过去待过的地点——哪怕方式不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:20720
    old "We heard an indistinct sound coming from hallway A, made by a door."
    new "A走廊那边传来一阵模糊的响动，是门发出的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:20721
    old "That's us. We just entered the event room."
    new "是我们。我们刚进活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:20724
    old "We waited, and seconds later, the same sound came from hallway B. Unmistakably, a closing door had created it."
    new "我们等着，几秒之后，B走廊也传来同样的声音。毫无疑问，那是门被关上的响动。"

    # game/script.rpy:20726
    old "Now we're in the staff room. We'll travel very soon."
    new "现在我们在员工室。马上就要穿越了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20727
    old "We thought we only had to wait until Shiroya became aware of one thing we'd missed."
    new "我们以为，只要等 Shiroya 注意到我们漏掉的那一处就够了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20732
    old "H-Hey, look at the floor, there. Isn't that blood?"
    new "喂、喂，你看地上那儿。那不是血吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:20739
    old "She was pointing at a spot next to the hallway A door. From afar, I could see a tiny red spot, close to the cleaning bucket. Both of us walked to it, and as the sight became clearer, Shiroya's interpretation proved to be right. A single drop of blood existed on the spacious floor of the lobby."
    new "她指着A走廊门旁的一处。远远望去，清洁桶附近有个小小的红点。我们两人走上前，越看越清楚，证明 Shiroya 说得没错。空旷的大厅地板上，确实有一滴血。"

    # game/script.rpy:20745
    old "It's definitely blood..."
    new "确实是血……"

    # game/script.rpy:20746
    old "The contrast with the shiny, white floor was immense. I looked around the entire room, but the drop Shiroya had found was the only one I could see. Fortunately, it was enough to tell us something very important."
    new "在那光洁雪白的地板上，它格外刺眼。我环视整个房间，却只看见 Shiroya 找到的这一滴。所幸，仅凭它就足以告诉我们一件很重要的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:20747
    old "It's almost dry. It's been here for a little while."
    new "血快干了。落在这儿有一阵子了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20748
    old "From when we were locked up in the attic. Blood dripped off someone...{w} Akaro didn't look injured when he came back, but that doesn't mean much."
    new "是我们被关在阁楼那阵子留下的。血是从某人身上滴下来的……{w} Akaro 回来的时候看不出受伤，可那也说明不了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:20749
    old "Isn't it strange that it was left here? If someone was in a hurry or being chased by an attacker, they wouldn't have cleaned it, but I feel like the culprit would have, right? Maybe it's not evidence worth cleaning up, but it tells us that something happened."
    new "它就这么留在这儿，不奇怪吗？如果有人急着走，或是被袭击者追着，顾不上清理还说得过去；可我觉得凶手应该会清理干净吧？也许这点证据不值得费心，但它至少说明这里出过事。"

    # game/script.rpy:20750
    old "Blood can never be a good sign... I feel like this is a place where evidence would be removed because it doesn't have security cameras."
    new "有血总不会是好事……这地方没装监控摄像头，证据很可能是在这里被清理掉的。"

    # game/script.rpy:20753
    old "I stared at the single drop of blood.{w} Something about it was intriguing—while it wasn't a puddle, it was fairly wide. It wasn't a single drop that would come out of an innocuous scratch. Despite that, there was only one mark.{w} Since any wound that produced a drop of that size would keep bleeding, it was likely it had been covered to prevent further blood loss."
    new "我盯着那一滴血。{w} 这滴血有些耐人寻味——它虽没有积成一摊，却铺得相当开。这样的大小，不像是无关痛痒的擦伤能滴出来的。可地上就只有这一处痕迹。{w} 能滴出这么大一滴血的伤口，必然会继续流血，所以多半是用什么东西按住了伤口止血。"

    # game/script.rpy:20754
    old "Erina and Katei must be somewhere, but they can't have anything to do with this.{w} Even though Akaro didn't appear injured, it's possible he dripped blood before traveling to the past, and time traveling could have undone a recent injury."
    new "Erina 和 Katei 应该也在某处，可这事跟他们不会有关系。{w} 就算 Akaro 看起来没受伤，也可能是在穿越回过去之前滴的血——时间穿越会把新近的伤一并抹去。"

    # game/script.rpy:20755
    old "After saying that, a thought came to me. \"Is the Sekimeiya reconstructing our past bodies?\" We'd asked ourselves that question many times before, and I had found a way to answer it."
    new "说完这句，一个念头浮了上来。「Sekimeiya 是否在复现我们过去的身体？」这个问题我们自问过许多次，而此刻我找到了回答它的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:20756
    old "Abruptly, I put my hand in my right pocket and felt something. I took it out and showed it to Shiroya."
    new "我忽然把手伸进右边口袋，摸到了东西。我掏出来，给 Shiroya 看。"

    # game/script.rpy:20762
    old "Ah, that's for Naomi's locker! Did you appear with it after traveling?"
    new "啊，那是 Naomi 储物柜的钥匙！你是穿越之后带着它出现的？"

    # game/script.rpy:20763
    old "I must have. I flushed it away before touching the Sekimeiya, but since I had it when we were in the bedroom, I appeared with it in my pocket."
    new "看来是。碰 Sekimeiya 之前我已经把它冲下马桶了，可我们在卧室那会儿它就在我身上，所以我出现时它也在口袋里。"

    # game/script.rpy:20765
    old "Like we suspected, the Sekimeiya has been replicating our past bodies exactly as they were in the past. In the bedroom, I appeared facing the door. Even the position of my body matched, and yours must have too."
    new "果然如我们所料，Sekimeiya 一直在照原样复现我们过去的身体。在卧室里，我出现时面朝门口，连身体的姿态都对得上，你的多半也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:20766
    old "Since the key was \"under my possession\" at that point, it was also on the body I appeared in. Again, that's why the cleaning cart didn't appear anywhere in the past. What's more likely is that it ceased existing as soon as you traveled touching it."
    new "那一刻钥匙「在我身上」，所以它也在我出现的那具身体上。同样，清洁推车没有出现在过去的任何地方，也是这个道理。更可能的情况是，你碰到它穿越的瞬间，它就不复存在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20771
    old "I see, yeah... That must be how it works."
    new "原来如此……应该就是这么回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:20778
    old "I closed my eyes. It was very likely we'd concluded something regarding the Sekimeiya's travels, but at first glance, it didn't seem too important. I had even thought of it before without giving it much consideration."
    new "我闭上眼。关于 Sekimeiya 的穿越，我们很可能已经得出了某个结论，可乍看之下，它并不那么要紧。我此前甚至想到过，只是一直没往深处想。"

    # game/script.rpy:20779
    old "However, we could be almost certain that the Sekimeiya replicated our past bodies exactly as they'd once been. As soon as I tried to explore that concept, something major came to me. It was proof that small details could open seemingly sealed doors and that we had to explore every little path."
    new "然而，几乎可以肯定，Sekimeiya 是把我们过去的身体一丝不差地复现出来的。我试着顺着这个念头往下推，立刻想到了一件大事。它证明了细微之处足以撬开看似封死的门，也证明我们必须把每一条小路都探到底。"

    # game/script.rpy:20786
    old "Escaping alive was our main goal at the start. Then, escaping with a time travel device had begun to sound like an achievable goal that some of us probably shared.{w} However, Shiroya and I had internally sought an unreachable peak while we'd been taunted by such inconsequential time travel. That was saving our friend who'd died two weeks earlier."
    new "起初，活着逃出去是我们主要的目标。后来，带着时间穿越装置逃出去，也渐渐成了触手可及的事，我们之中大概有人抱着同样的打算。{w} 可在这种只能挪动些许时间的穿越一次次撩拨之下，Shiroya 和我心里真正盯着的，却是一座够不着的山巅——救回两周前死去的朋友。"

    # game/script.rpy:20787
    old "Even though it had appeared impossible regardless of the approach, concluding that last detail might've opened the first real path to it, no matter how vague or improbable.{w} If we could understand what determined the exact amount of time to be traveled, and most importantly, the appearing location...{w} If there had been a time in which I'd been touching Miiya, and I could replicate that body..."
    new "无论怎么尝试都显得不可能，可最后那个结论，也许已经为我们打开了第一条真正的路，哪怕它多么模糊、多么渺茫。{w} 只要弄清是什么决定了穿越的确切时长，尤其是出现的位置……{w} 只要我曾有过触碰 Miiya 的时刻，而我又能复现那具身体……"

    # game/script.rpy:20788
    old "The possibility that Miiya would appear with me was potentially real. While it didn't sound all that special, the locker key had just been brought back into existence. I'd flushed it away through the toilet, and I'd managed to get it back with the Sekimeiya. Miiya's circumstances were the same, with the sole difference that she was a human being."
    new "Miiya 也许会随我一同出现——这或许真的可能。听上去没那么特别，可储物柜钥匙刚刚就凭空回来了。我把它冲进马桶，却靠 Sekimeiya 拿了回来。Miiya 的处境并无不同，唯一的差别在于，她是一个活人。"

    # game/script.rpy:20789
    old "My past body and my possessions of the past could be replicated, but Miiya might not have counted if I'd simply been \"touching her\".{w} But what if I could think of a time where I'd been holding her hand or her shirt? None immediately came to mind, but they could apply."
    new "过去的身体和当时随身的东西都能被复现，可如果我仅仅是「碰到她」，Miiya 未必算数。{w} 但若我能想起某个曾握着她的手、或是抓着她衣角的时刻呢？一时想不起来，可这样的时刻未必没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:20794
    old "I looked at Shiroya, whose pensive look surely resembled mine. We'd remained silent for many seconds, and while I hadn't thought of voicing my recent thoughts to her, it was a path she could also find herself."
    new "我看向 Shiroya，她若有所思的神情想必和我一样。我们沉默了很久，我没打算把刚才的念头说出口，可这条路她自己也能找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:20798
    old "I took a couple steps back to lean on the column, trying to break through the single wall that blocked my reasoning."
    new "我退了两步，靠在柱子上，想冲破挡在推理前的那唯一一道墙。"

    # game/script.rpy:20804
    old "I might have jumped the gun by minimizing the fact that Miiya is a human.{w} While I thought that we couldn't rule this out without attempting it, I see a big problem that might just reveal its impossibility."
    new "我可能太急着下结论，忽略了 Miiya 是人类这一点。{w} 我原以为不实际试一试就不能排除这种可能，但现在我看出一个大问题，它可能恰恰说明这条路走不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:20805
    old "The biggest difference between a key and a human being, is, without a doubt, the possession of consciousness."
    new "钥匙与人的最大差别，无疑在于是否拥有意识。"

    # game/script.rpy:20806
    old "In the bedroom, our past bodies were recreated, and we appeared within them. The locker key is proof enough of that.{w} However, what happened to the brain? If our past bodies were recreated, the brain belonged to a past version of us. Despite that, we possessed memories and knowledge obtained after the recreated point."
    new "在卧室里，我们过去的身体被重新造出，而我们现身其中。储物柜钥匙足以证明这一点。{w} 可是，大脑又是怎么回事？既然被复现的是我们过去的身体，大脑自然也该属于过去的我们。然而我们却拥有复现时点之后的记忆与知识。"

    # game/script.rpy:20807
    old "So even though we appeared in bodies identical to our past's, the past minds were left out..."
    new "也就是说，尽管我们现身的身体与过去分毫不差，过去的意识却没有被一并复制……"

    # game/script.rpy:20810
    old "Why did our consciousnesses appear in our past bodies without conflicting with our past consciousnesses? That has to be because we touched the Sekimeiya while in possession of a future consciousness. Then, it was put within a past version of us—one that had a vacant mind."
    new "为什么我们的意识会进入过去的身体，却不与过去的意识冲突？原因只能是我们带着未来的意识触碰了 Sekimeiya。随后，这份意识被放进过去的我们体内——那具身体里的意识是空置的。"

    # game/script.rpy:20811
    old "So, what would happen if I could replicate my body from a time I was holding Miiya? My consciousness would make it to the replicated body, but since Miiya's wouldn't travel with the Sekimeiya, there'd be none to insert into hers. Therefore, it's possible I'd appear next to a lifeless body, as past consciousnesses aren't being replicated."
    new "那么，假如我能复现自己牵着 Miiya 那一刻的身体，会发生什么？我的意识会进入复现出的身体；可 Miiya 的意识不会随 Sekimeiya 穿越，也就没有意识能填进她的身体。于是，我很可能只会出现在一具没有生气的躯体旁边——因为过去的意识并不会被复制。"

    # game/script.rpy:20812
    old "But I can't know whether I'm overwriting my past consciousness every time I replicate my body or if it's merely not being replicated and I'm occupying an empty spot.{w} After all, the Sekimeiya touched Isla's dead body and she didn't travel. That's probably because there was no longer a consciousness present within her."
    new "可我无从判断：每次复现身体时，是我覆盖了过去的意识，还是过去的意识根本未被复制，我只是占据了一个空位。{w} 毕竟，Sekimeiya 曾碰到 Isla 的遗体，她却没有穿越。那大概是因为她体内已不剩任何意识。"

    # game/script.rpy:20813
    old "To try to make this happen and test which hypothesis is correct, attaching ourselves to the smallest possibility, we'd have to understand the Sekimeiya completely. We would need to make one final, thorough attempt to save Miiya. Shiroya and I can't arrange the necessary circumstances by ourselves to see if it could ever work because a successful result would create an extra, permanent version of one of us..."
    new "若要把这件事做成、验证哪种假设才正确，哪怕只有一线可能也不放过，我们就必须彻底弄懂 Sekimeiya。我们需要为救 Miiya 做最后一次周全的尝试。可仅凭 Shiroya 和我，无法自行凑齐验证所需的种种条件——因为一旦成功，就会多出一个永久存在的自己……"

    # game/script.rpy:20816
    old "So, the first step: what determines the point in time our replicated bodies are based on? It's definitely different from the amount of time traveled, and it doesn't seem to be consistent."
    new "那么第一步：是什么决定了复现身体所依据的那个时点？它显然不同于穿越的时长，而且看不出规律。"

    # game/script.rpy:20817
    old "But the second step—the amount of distance traveled—appears to operate under a consistent rule: the longer the Sekimeiya spends storing energy, the farther we travel.{w} ...Meanwhile, the replicated location has differed with each travel, and there's no clear rule to draw. Nonetheless, it's hard to think only one thing would be consistent."
    new "可第二步——穿越的距离——似乎遵循着一条稳定的规律：Sekimeiya 蓄能越久，我们走得越远。{w} ……相比之下，复现的位置每次都不同，找不出明确的规则。不过，很难相信其中只有一项是有规律的。"

    # game/script.rpy:20818
    old "The core of replicating a past location is purely teleportation. We're teleporting to a coordinate of space we were once at.{w} However, how is the Sekimeiya working with that coordinate? While the answer could be that its powers are simply magical, there's more depth to it than I first thought."
    new "复现过去位置的核心，说到底就是传送。我们被传送到自己曾经待过的某个空间坐标。{w} 可是，Sekimeiya 究竟如何处理这个坐标？答案或许只是「它的力量本就近乎魔法」，但其中牵涉的东西比我最初想的要深。"

    # game/script.rpy:20821
    old "The easiest concept of teleportation to grasp consists of two containers and matter teleporting from one to the other. The teleportation point is \"the other container\" because it exists and can be accessed.{w} We aren't appearing inside designated and fixed containers, though, so let's assume that the coordinate of the bedroom, where I appeared, can be measured with a number."
    new "最简单的传送概念，就是两个容器：物质从一边传到另一边。传送点就是「另一个容器」，因为它存在、可以抵达。{w} 但我们并不是出现在某个被指定好的固定容器里，所以不妨假设：我现身的那间卧室的坐标，可以用一个数值来表示。"

    # game/script.rpy:20822
    old "When I touched the Sekimeiya, it sent me to that space coordinate after recognizing that I'd found myself there in the past. The problem is that we live on Earth, a planet that is constantly moving."
    new "我触碰 Sekimeiya 时，它认定我过去曾到过那个空间坐标，便把我送到了那里。问题在于，我们居住的地球无时无刻不在移动。"

    # game/script.rpy:20823
    old "As time went forward, Earth would've moved away from that coordinate, and it wouldn't have corresponded to the attic's bedroom anymore. If the Sekimeiya had simply sent me to one of my past coordinates, chances are I would've appeared in the middle of space."
    new "随着时间推移，地球早已离开那个坐标，那里也不再对应阁楼的卧室。若 Sekimeiya 只是把我送到过去自己曾待过的某个坐标，我多半会出现在太空中央。"

    # game/script.rpy:20824
    old "Going off Shiroya's estimate, we appeared where we were ten minutes prior to traveling while only going back five. At that point, the coordinate that had once belonged to the attic's bedroom had already been vacated by Earth..."
    new "按 Shiroya 的估算，我们只回溯了五分钟，却出现在穿越前十分钟所在的位置。而在那一刻，原本属于阁楼卧室的坐标早已被地球抛在身后……"

    # game/script.rpy:20831
    old "I'd been walking in circles around the column, absorbed in my unusual thoughts. Shiroya saw that I'd stopped and stretched her body a bit."
    new "我一直绕着柱子打转，沉浸在这些异样的思绪里。Shiroya 见我停下脚步，便稍稍伸展了一下身体。"

    # game/script.rpy:20832
    old "...Should we go? It's well past the time we traveled."
    new "……该走了吧？我们穿越过来已经过了很久了。"

    # game/script.rpy:20833
    old "Yes, but I want to do one thing first."
    new "嗯，不过我想先做一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:20838
    old "I showed her the locker key. Then, we left through hallway B."
    new "我把储物柜的钥匙给她看，随后我们从 B走廊离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:20843
    old "It became evident we'd left the doors of two rooms open: the event room and room B6. I ignored them and walked to the bathrooms."
    new "很明显，我们让两个房间的门开着：活动室和 B6 房间。我没有理会，径直走向洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:20850
    old "Like before, I raised the toilet's lid and tossed the key inside, then flushed it away."
    new "和之前一样，我掀开马桶盖，把钥匙丢进去，冲水冲走。"

    # game/script.rpy:20851
    old "Had to do it. I want to deny the reality where someone uses it in the past to take our Sekimeiya."
    new "必须这么做。我要否定那种现实——有人在过去利用它夺走了我们的 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:20857
    old "Well, the universe handled it fine again. The way the Sekimeiya disappeared from the locker is still basically a locked-room mystery."
    new "算了，宇宙又一次把事情处理得很好。Sekimeiya 从储物柜里消失的方式，至今基本上仍是一桩密室谜案。"

    # game/script.rpy:20862
    old "She shrugged, and while she was right, I still went to the staff room."
    new "她耸了耸肩。虽然她说得没错，我还是去了员工室。"

    # game/script.rpy:20870
    old "I was able to open the locker just fine, and there was no Sekimeiya inside."
    new "储物柜顺利打开了，里面没有 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:20871
    old "Hm...{w} Nobody else ever held that key, right? Could someone go back in time and replicate a position where they were holding it?"
    new "嗯……{w} 没有别人拿过那把钥匙吧？有没有可能，有人回到过去，复制出自己握着钥匙时的位置？"

    # game/script.rpy:20876
    old "Only when Sai found the whole set on the first Naomi, I'm pretty sure."
    new "我记得只有 Sai 在第一个 Naomi 身上找到那整串钥匙时，才有人拿过。"

    # game/script.rpy:20880
    old "My mind had gone pretty deep into it: what if someone replicated a position in which they'd been \"holding\" me? Had that ever happened?{w} ...If that would create a lifeless body of mine, it could appear holding the key."
    new "我的思绪越陷越深：如果有人复制出自己曾「抱着」我的那个位置呢？这种事发生过吗？{w}……假如这会造出一个没有生命的我，那个我就可能握着钥匙出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:20882
    old "...Let's get the Sekimeiya. It still has to be in the other room."
    new "……去拿 Sekimeiya 吧。它一定还在另一个房间里。"

    # game/script.rpy:20889
    old "Across the hallway was the crystal room we'd traveled from. We pushed the door farther and peered into the empty space."
    new "走廊对面就是我们来时的水晶展室。我们把门推得更开，朝空荡荡的室内看去。"

    # game/script.rpy:20894
    old "We lowered our view and scanned the shining floor. With puzzled faces, we stepped in to access better angles after failing to spot the Sekimeiya."
    new "我们低头扫视发光的地面。没找到 Sekimeiya，便带着困惑走进去，换个角度继续找。"

    # game/script.rpy:20906
    old "That didn't make any sense. Had someone taken it while we were in the lobby?"
    new "这说不通。难道我们在大堂时，有人把它拿走了？"

    # game/script.rpy:20910
    old "When we traveled, it would've fallen to the floor. Did it roll somewhere?"
    new "我们穿越过来时，它应该掉在地上了。会不会滚到什么地方去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:20915
    old "I looked all around me and shook my head.{w} Then, I continued circling the room with my eyes until I noticed an oddity."
    new "我环顾四周，摇了摇头。{w} 接着，我继续用目光扫视房间，终于发现一处异样。"

    # game/script.rpy:20916
    old "A few cabinets were composed of drawers instead of having a hollow interior compartment. One of the drawers was sticking out more than the others."
    new "有几个展示柜并非中空，而是由抽屉构成。其中一个抽屉比别的抽屉凸出一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:20920
    old "I walked up to it, unsure if it was anything important. When Shiroya saw what I was staring at, she also realized what was off.{w} Upon closer examination, even though the difference was minimal, my observation was proven correct: the lowest drawer of a cabinet wasn't fully closed. Before I could reach it, Shiroya spoke about a detail I'd missed."
    new "我走上前，不确定那是否值得留意。Shiroya 看见我盯着的东西，也看出是哪里不对劲。{w} 我凑近细看，尽管差别微乎其微，我的判断还是得到证实：一个展示柜最下层的抽屉没有完全合上。我还没伸手，Shiroya 就说起一个我漏掉的细节。"

    # game/script.rpy:20925
    old "This is the cabinet the Sekimeiya was next to, right?"
    new "Sekimeiya 之前就放在这个展示柜旁边吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:20926
    old "Oh, earlier? You're right, it was on the floor, in front of it..."
    new "哦，之前？对，它当时就在地上，就在柜子前面……"

    # game/script.rpy:20927
    old "Which meant that, most likely, the person who left the Sekimeiya behind also opened the drawer.{w} I extended my arm and pulled the drawer toward me. Immediately, an object within rolled around the narrow interior, making dry noises as it hit the wood."
    new "也就是说，留下 Sekimeiya 的人很可能也打开过抽屉。{w} 我伸出手，把抽屉拉向自己。里面立刻有东西在狭窄的空间中滚动，撞上木板，发出干涩的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:20931
    old "After it stopped rolling, the immobile Sekimeiya met our eyes, letting out a surrounding faint glow. Aside from it, there was nothing else inside."
    new "它停止滚动后，静止不动的 Sekimeiya 映入我们眼帘，周身散出微光。除此之外，抽屉里空无一物。"

    # game/script.rpy:20937
    old "Shiroya and I looked at each other, well aware that what we were seeing didn't make sense. The Sekimeiya had disappeared only to reappear inside a nearby drawer."
    new "我和 Shiroya 面面相觑，都明白眼前这一幕说不通。Sekimeiya 消失之后，竟又出现在旁边的抽屉里。"

    # game/script.rpy:20938
    old "Is it even the same one? The drawer wasn't shut all the way, so we can probably ignore the self-teleportation we've been thinking of. Someone most likely put it here."
    new "这真的是同一个吗？抽屉没有完全关严，所以我们大概可以排除先前设想的自我传送。多半是有人把它放进来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:20939
    old "But... who would've failed to properly close a drawer? Once again, it seemed as if we'd been lured to the Sekimeiya's whereabouts."
    new "可是……谁会连个抽屉都关不严？这一次，我们又像是被人引到了 Sekimeiya 所在的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:20940
    old "Before questioning anything else, I put my shirt between my hand and the Sekimeiya's surface, as I'd been trained to do. However, I couldn't last more than a couple seconds before I had to take my hand off."
    new "我没有先追问别的，而是按照之前学到的做法，用衬衫垫在 Sekimeiya 表面和我的手之间。可我撑不过几秒，就不得不把手移开。"

    # game/script.rpy:20941
    old "What the fuck...!? It's burning."
    new "搞什么鬼……！？烫得要命。"

    # game/script.rpy:20946
    old "If we're right, that must mean that it's been here for a while..."
    new "如果我们的判断没错，那它一定在这里放了很久……"

    # game/script.rpy:20947
    old "\"The longer the Sekimeiya spends away from a cold temperature, the hotter it gets, the farther back in time you go, and the bigger the range is\". If that was correct, she must've been right."
    new "「Sekimeiya 离开低温越久，温度就越高；回溯的时间越远，范围也越大。」如果这条规律没错，那她说的就是对的。"

    # game/script.rpy:20949
    old "I'm pretty sure it wasn't this hot during previous travels."
    new "我记得之前几次穿越时，它没这么烫。"

    # game/script.rpy:20952
    old "It was an imposing claim. Every time we'd found the Sekimeiya, the decision of whether to touch it had been quick to arrive. If the proposition was to go substantially back through time, I wasn't so sure about it, as it would make our presence in the tower hard to accomplish and we would still be unable to change the past."
    new "这个推断分量不轻。每次找到 Sekimeiya 时，该不该碰它，我们总能很快做出决定。可如果这意味着要大幅回溯时间，我就不那么确定了——那样的话，我们很可能很难继续待在这座塔里，而且依然改变不了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:20957
    old "Let's put it in the cabinet."
    new "把它放进展示柜吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:20958
    old "I looked at Shiroya and was met with a bitter expression. She'd already made up her mind.{w} Touching it could have brought us out of the tower, but it also had the chance to considerably drag out our stay while we'd be unable to have any impact on a history which had already occurred. I nodded and began thinking about how to move it without burning myself."
    new "我看向 Shiroya，对上的是一脸苦涩。她显然已经下定决心。{w} 碰到它也许能让我们离开这座塔，但也可能大大延长我们滞留的时间，而且我们仍无法对已经发生的历史产生任何影响。我点了点头，开始琢磨怎么搬动它才不会烫伤自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:20963
    old "I think we should just stop altogether... Let's just wait until we can leave.{w} We can travel through time, which is still insane to think about, but there's no point to it, right? At most, it can help us understand what's going on, but there are cameras all over the place, and the police are probably a few hours away from entering.{w} We don't even know how the Sekimeiya got inside the drawer, and it's clear that we don't understand anything about what we got caught up in. Touching it again could just be dangerous, so there's no point in risking it..."
    new "我看，我们干脆别再折腾了……就等到能离开的时候吧。{w} 我们能穿越时间，这事想起来仍然很离谱，可这又有什么意义呢？顶多帮我们弄明白发生了什么，但这里到处是摄像头，警察大概再过几个小时就会进来。{w} 我们连 Sekimeiya 怎么进了抽屉都不知道，显然也完全没弄懂自己卷进了什么。再碰它可能只会带来危险，所以没必要冒这个险……"

    # game/script.rpy:20966
    old "I tacitly listened to her giving multiple reasons not to touch it. It left me a bit confused, as she hadn't been opposed to it mere minutes ago."
    new "我默默听着她列举种种不该碰它的理由，心里有些困惑——就在几分钟前，她还不反对碰它。"

    # game/script.rpy:20971
    old "...I'm sure you can imagine that I've been thinking about how we could undo what happened... but it's not possible. The more time I spend thinking about it, the further I am from being able to let the wound heal. I don't think having hope itself is bad, but it is if we know that it doesn't really exist. The Sekimeiya is useless."
    new "……你大概能想到，我一直在想怎样才能挽回已经发生的事……但那不可能。我越想，伤口就越难愈合。我不觉得抱有希望本身有什么错，可明知希望并不存在还抱着它，那就是错的。Sekimeiya 毫无用处。"

    # game/script.rpy:20972
    old "I was left dumbfounded by those harsh words, and I found myself trying to think about a reply before realizing that I agreed with her. I'd been going on about Isla's decided fate while obsessing over a way to reverse Miiya's. In reality, both were just as impossible to change. ...I recalled the pensive face Shiroya had been making in the lobby, where she must've reached that ultimate conclusion."
    new "那番严厉的话让我一时怔住。我本想找话回应，却发现自己其实认同她。我一直念叨 Isla 已经注定的命运，却又执迷于找出逆转 Miiya 命运的办法。可实际上，两者同样无法改变。……我想起 Shiroya 在大堂里那副沉思的神情——她一定是在那时得出了这个最终结论。"

    # game/script.rpy:20978
    old "We said we'd go to Airun after we get out to see what's become of the cabin. Let's make sure that happens."
    new "我们说过，出去之后要去 Airun，看看那间小屋变成了什么样。这件事一定要做到。"

    # game/script.rpy:20979
    old "As I felt a breaking wave of emotions, I managed to give her a nod. I'd let the desire to escape become a background goal, while it should've been the only thing to strive for. It had been sudden, but after all those dreamlike hours, Shiroya brought me back to reality—Miiya's death was irreversible.{w} I breathed deeply, trying to keep myself balanced."
    new "一阵翻涌的情绪几乎将我淹没，我还是勉强朝她点了点头。我竟把逃出去的念头降成了次要目标，而它本该是我唯一该争取的事。一切来得突然，可在那几个如梦似幻的小时之后，Shiroya 把我拉回了现实——Miiya 的死无法逆转。{w} 我深吸一口气，努力让自己镇定下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:20980
    old "A-All right... I agree.{w} Let's wait patiently and ignore whatever the hell the others are doing. At {time=21}, the front door has to open."
    new "好、好吧……我同意。{w} 我们就耐心等着，别管其他人到底在搞什么。到了 {time=21}，前门一定会打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:20985
    old "Right... What's going on here has nothing to do with us, and it's gotten too big to try to understand. You said Akaro and Sai could enter from the outside to grab the Sekimeiya, so let's leave it in the cabinet and wait next to it."
    new "对……这里发生的事跟我们无关，而且已经闹得太大了，不是我们能弄明白的了。你说过 Akaro 和 Sai 可能从外面进来拿走 Sekimeiya，那就把它留在展示柜里，我们守在旁边等。"

    # game/script.rpy:20988
    old "I grabbed the bottom of my shirt with my left hand to create a small hammock where I placed the Sekimeiya. As the cloth wasn't touching my skin, I was able to transport the Sekimeiya safely. I quickly headed toward the door, and we left the room."
    new "我用左手抓住衬衫下摆，兜成一个小吊床，把 Sekimeiya 放进去。因为布料没有碰到我的皮肤，我能安全地搬运它。我快步朝门口走去，然后我们离开了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:20995
    old "We were in hallway B. My perspective on the recording had been fluctuating drastically, and once again, it had become one of the worst possibilities. If it did occur, despite meaning that Isla would be alive in the future, that was only the illusion of an upside: she'd end up going to the past to die inside the room A5 cabinet."
    new "我们在 B走廊。我对那段录音的解读一直摇摆不定，这一次，它又变成了最糟糕的几种可能之一。若它真的发生，就算意味着 Isla 在未来仍然活着，那点好处也不过是假象：她终究会回到过去，死在水晶展室 A5 的展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:20999
    old "I took short steps so that the Sekimeiya would stay still. Eventually, I reached the open door that led to the event room, where we would again attempt a wait, detaching ourselves from our surroundings."
    new "我小步小步地挪动，好让 Sekimeiya 保持平稳。终于，我来到通往活动室的那扇敞开的门前。我们要在那里再试一次等待，与周围的一切隔绝开来。"

    # game/script.rpy:21010
    old "Touch the Sekimeiya."
    new "触碰 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:21012
    old "Enter the room."
    new "进入房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:21029
    old "The world froze.{w} However, strangely, movement was still within."
    new "世界静止了。{w} 然而奇怪的是，静止之中仍有东西在动。"

    # game/script.rpy:21035
    old "Atsuki and Shiroya lived in a delicate universe. A single modification could collapse the complex structure they were climbing."
    new "Atsuki 和 Shiroya 身处一个脆弱的宇宙。哪怕只改动一处，也可能让他们正在攀爬的复杂结构彻底崩塌。"

    # game/script.rpy:21036
    old "...However, the structure could be partially frozen and then changed."
    new "……不过，结构可以先局部冻结，再加以改动。"

    # game/script.rpy:21037
    old "This universe will be frozen, and that will permit its observation. It will become a universe that would collapse if set in motion."
    new "这个宇宙将被冻结，唯有如此才能观测它。它将成为一旦重新运转便会崩塌的宇宙。"

    # game/script.rpy:21038
    old "Rules have to be bent abstractly—the flow must stop. Only that will allow an impossibility."
    new "必须抽象地扭曲规则——让流动停下来。唯有如此，才容得下一件不可能之事。"

    # game/script.rpy:21045
    old "Theater Under The Sun"
    new "烈日下的剧场"

    # game/script.rpy:21057
    old "Atsuki and Shiroya were in front of the event room. Unbeknownst to them, instead of deftly weaving their way through myriad, tangled threads, those very same strings took hold of their own bodies.{w} Atsuki's hand reached for the Sekimeiya, and as his brain was informed of the most painful burn he'd ever felt, his eyes took in the sudden darkness that appeared around him."
    new "Atsuki 和 Shiroya 站在活动室门前。他们并不知道，自己并非在灵巧地穿行于无数纠缠的丝线之间；恰恰相反，是那些丝线攫住了他们的身体。{w} Atsuki 的手伸向 Sekimeiya，大脑随即感到一阵从未有过的剧烈灼痛，同时他的双眼捕捉到了四周骤然浮现的黑暗。"

    # game/script.rpy:21060
    old "He attempted to understand where he'd appeared, but the lack of light made it futile. He'd touched the Sekimeiya, going against what he'd agreed with Shiroya. However, while there hadn't been a reason behind it, he didn't question his action."
    new "他试图弄清自己到了哪里，可四周没有一丝光，怎么努力也是徒劳。他违背了与 Shiroya 的约定，碰到了 Sekimeiya。然而，尽管这一举动背后并没有什么理由，他也没有去质疑它。"

    # game/script.rpy:21064
    old "After a few seconds lost within the darkness, his eyes began to adjust, and he spotted a faint light coming from his left. Immediately, he recognized where he was."
    new "在黑暗中茫然过了几秒，他的眼睛渐渐适应，发现左侧透来一点微光。他立刻认出了自己身在何处。"

    # game/script.rpy:21065
    old "It belonged to the reception desk found in the lobby of Ashiya Tower. That was where he had appeared."
    new "那光来自芦屋塔大堂的接待台。他出现的地方正是那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:21068
    old "He had to determine the time. While the lack of light wasn't a complete giveaway, he knew he hadn't traveled just a short time back."
    new "他必须弄清现在是什么时刻。没有光虽然不能完全说明问题，但他知道自己绝不是只回到了片刻之前。"

    # game/script.rpy:21073
    old "He approached the hallway B door and surreptitiously turned the doorknob, spending a while locating it. Without offering any resistance, it opened the path to the wide corridor, which resembled nothing more than a haunting void. It was just as dark as the lobby, with no light to verify his surroundings."
    new "他走近 B走廊的门，摸索了一阵才找到门把手，悄悄转动。门毫无阻力地开了，通向那条宽阔的走廊——那地方看上去活像一片阴森的虚空，和大堂一样漆黑，没有一丝光能让他看清四周。"

    # game/script.rpy:21076
    old "However, he knew the layout and began to move forward. Even though he was lost in time, his movements hinted at a goal.{w} After a few steps, his motion was halted by a sound that echoed off the walls."
    new "不过他熟悉这里的布局，便向前走去。尽管他在时间中迷失了方向，动作却透出某种目的。{w} 走了几步，一阵在墙壁间回荡的声响让他停住了脚。"

    # game/script.rpy:21080
    old "Stop moving at once! Stay still and do not run away."
    new "立刻停下！站在原地，不许逃跑。"

    # game/script.rpy:21081
    old "The sudden, robotic noise pierced through Atsuki's chest, accomplishing its demand before the words could be processed. Atsuki understood the meaning behind the voice, as it had been explained to him. It must've belonged to the microphone installed in the security room."
    new "那突如其来的机械声刺进 Atsuki 的胸口，还没等他把话听明白，身体已经照做了。这个声音的含义他清楚，因为有人向他解释过。它应当来自安装在监控室里的麦克风。"

    # game/script.rpy:21082
    old "He hadn't seen it, but a speaker was surely placed somewhere in the walls. Conclusions could be drawn from the overly loud voice: someone was in the security room, and most importantly, the hallway cameras were functioning. As Katei had told them, they possessed night vision. Atsuki had traveled to a point that met those conditions."
    new "他没看见，但墙里一定装着扬声器。从这过大的音量可以推断出几点：监控室里有人；更重要的是，走廊的摄像头正在运作。正如 Katei 告诉过他们的，那些摄像头带有夜视功能。Atsuki 穿越到的时间点，正符合这些条件。"

    # game/script.rpy:21083
    old "Awaiting his next instructions, he stayed immobile, showing no intention of defying what he'd been told. However, when the voice played again, a frown drew itself over his face."
    new "他等着下一道指示，一动不动，毫无违抗之意。然而当那个声音再次响起时，他的眉头皱了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:21086
    old "What are you doing!? You cannot escape!"
    new "你在干什么！？你逃不掉的！"

    # game/script.rpy:21087
    old "Atsuki was beginning to lose his sense of direction, as he still couldn't discern the walls around him. Those words let him know that he was not aware of the situation either."
    new "Atsuki 渐渐分不清方向，他仍然看不清四周的墙壁。而这句话让他明白，对方也同样没弄清状况。"

    # game/script.rpy:21088
    old "It was unlikely the last message had been addressed to him because he hadn't moved at all. To test it, he walked forward, waiting to see if his existence would be recognized."
    new "上一条讯息不大可能是冲他来的，因为他根本没动过。为了验证，他向前走去，等着看自己的存在会不会被察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:21090
    old "After a few steps, no new message reverberated.{w} He looked up and saw a distant and faint green light. It belonged to a security camera, but he couldn't know if it was working."
    new "走了几步，没有新的声音回荡。{w} 他抬起头，看见远处一点微弱的绿光。那是监控摄像头，但它是否在运作，他无从得知。"

    # game/script.rpy:21091
    old "However, he had a way to assure he remained unseen. Attempting to achieve a safer position, he took a few more steps and began to feel the cold left wall."
    new "不过，他有办法确保自己不被看见。为了挪到更安全的位置，他又走了几步，摸到了左侧冰冷的墙壁。"

    # game/script.rpy:21093
    old "He shortly spotted a door and took hold of its knob. Then, he felt an alien pain in his hand that startled him. Confused, he tried with his other hand and pushed open the door with ease.{w} To comprehend where he was, he reached for the closest wall. After recognizing the shape of a locker, he knew he'd picked the correct door and had arrived in the staff room."
    new "很快他摸到一扇门，握住门把手。随即，手上传来一阵陌生的疼痛，令他吃了一惊。他满心疑惑，换成另一只手，轻轻一推，门就开了。{w} 为了弄清自己在哪儿，他摸向最近的墙壁。认出储物柜的形状后，他知道自己选对了门——这里是员工室。"

    # game/script.rpy:21097
    old "He'd chosen it for its lack of cameras. He thought something was happening around him, so he didn't want to be mistaken for an escaping culprit, and he could feel slightly more comfortable in a closed-off space."
    new "他选这里，是因为这里没有摄像头。他觉得周围正发生着什么，不愿被人当成逃跑的犯人；何况待在一个封闭的空间里，多少能让他安心一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:21098
    old "There, he waited. He didn't know why it had all come to that, but the imposing darkness only allowed him to wait until he could understand what was happening."
    new "他就在那里等着。他不知道事情为什么会变成这样，但那沉重的黑暗只容他等待，直到弄明白发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:21099
    old "Just a few minutes earlier, he'd been talking to Shiroya about making it out of the tower and resuming their old life. He couldn't yet be sure if touching the Sekimeiya had made that easier."
    new "就在几分钟前，他还在和 Shiroya 谈论离开这座塔、恢复从前的生活。至于触碰 Sekimeiya 是否让这条路变得容易了些，他还无法确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:21103
    old "He stood next to the door, certain that he'd notice it if someone were to try to open it."
    new "他站在门边，确信只要有人试图开门，他一定会察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:21104
    old "But what he'd expected to be a short wait eventually morphed into more than half an hour of pure silence. As the empty minutes kept going by, ominous emotions began to fill his mind. Would he be mistaken for a criminal at the end of his wait? Was he alone, even though someone else must've been addressed earlier? If someone else was present, should he try to evade them or go look for them?"
    new "可他原以为短暂的等待，最终变成了长达半个多小时的死寂。时间一分一秒地在空寂中过去，不祥的念头开始占据他的脑海。等下去，他会不会被当成犯人？刚才那句话分明是对别人说的，那么此刻他是否只是孤身一人？如果还有别人在，他应该避开对方，还是主动去找？"

    # game/script.rpy:21105
    old "Countless thoughts passed through his brain, yet he couldn't decide. Wherever that point in time was, Atsuki spent a full hour of it as the sole guard of the staff room while uncertainty permeated his being."
    new "无数念头在脑中掠过，他却始终拿不定主意。无论那一刻对应的是哪个时间点，Atsuki 都整整一个小时守在员工室里，任由不安浸透全身。"

    # game/script.rpy:21106
    old "Suddenly, he checked his pocket. There, he found a small key, which he recognized had the shape of Naomi's locker's."
    new "忽然，他摸了摸口袋。里面有一把小钥匙，他认出那把钥匙的形状属于 Naomi 的储物柜钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:21116
    old "Without warning, the lights turned on, emitting no noise. Instead of being startled, Atsuki shut his eyes forcibly, attacked by the intense illumination.{w} After a few attempts at reopening them, his vision finally adapted, and he looked around the room where he'd spent so much time. He confirmed that it was the staff room, looking exactly as he'd thought."
    new "毫无预兆地，灯亮了，却没有一点声响。Atsuki 没有被吓到，反倒被刺目的光逼得紧紧闭上眼。{w} 他试了几次才重新睁开，视线终于适应，于是环顾这个他待了许久的房间。他确认这里就是员工室，和他想象的一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:21117
    old "The lights indicated that he wasn't alone in the building, but they were no cue to start moving. His dilemma hadn't yet been solved, so he remained indecisive."
    new "灯亮说明楼里不只他一个人，但这并不代表他该行动了。他的两难还没有解开，于是仍旧犹豫不决。"

    # game/script.rpy:21122
    old "Before he could give his updated situation much thought, he heard a sound coming from the hallway, resembling the one of footsteps he'd heard a few times during the past hours."
    new "还没等他想清楚眼下的新状况，走廊里传来了声响，像是他这几个小时里听到过几次的脚步声。"

    # game/script.rpy:21123
    old "Further amplifying their presence, the person in the hallway continued to make noise. Atsuki heard a door being opened and closed as well as sounds coming from behind the wall to his left."
    new "走廊里的人继续弄出动静，更显出几分存在感。Atsuki 听见一扇门开了又关，还听见左侧墙壁后面传来的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:21126
    old "Atsuki's heart began to beat faster. As much as he wanted to understand what was happening, he had no desire to be found. He was paying close attention to every sound, but he failed to recognize that someone was right behind the door."
    new "Atsuki 的心跳开始加快。他虽然想弄清发生了什么，却绝不愿被人发现。他全神贯注地听着每一个声响，却没意识到有人就站在门外。"

    # game/script.rpy:21127
    old "He heard the knob being gripped and looked at it turning. He stepped back, and as soon as the door opened, Atsuki fixed his gaze on the eyes of the person who'd finally found him."
    new "他听见门把手被人握住，看见它转动起来。他退后一步，门一开，Atsuki 的目光便对上了终于找到他的那个人的眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:21133
    old "The figure was immediately taken aback while its expression shaped into one of defiance. Atsuki, on the other hand, wore an unsure look after immediately recognizing the man."
    new "那人顿时一愣，随即露出戒备的神情。而 Atsuki 在认出对方的一瞬间，脸上显出迟疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:21136
    old "\"Wh-What the fuck are you doing?\" Those were the first words Atsuki heard in more than an hour.{w} He didn't know how to reply, so he moved forward, drawn in by the scenery behind the man."
    new "「你、你他妈在干什么？」这是 Atsuki 一个多小时以来听到的第一句话。{w} 他不知该如何回答，于是被那人身后的景象吸引，向前迈了一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:21141
    old "However, he stopped himself when he spotted something of massive importance. The man was transporting a black suitcase."
    new "然而，当他看见一样至关重要的东西时，又停住了脚。那人正提着一只黑色手提箱。"

    # game/script.rpy:21143
    old "\"Aren't you going to fucking answer me!? Who are you!?\""
    new "「你他妈倒是回答我啊！？你是什么人！？」"

    # game/script.rpy:21148
    old "Since Atsuki knew that explaining wouldn't serve a purpose, he produced an inquiry of his own."
    new "Atsuki 清楚解释也无济于事，便反过来提出了自己的问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:21149
    old "\"What's that suitcase for?\"{w} The man's expression instantly morphed again. Those cold words were interpreted as a clear and sudden attack, but he tried to hide his reaction."
    new "「那只手提箱是做什么用的？」{w} 那人的表情立刻又变了。这句冷冰冰的话被他当成了突如其来的直接挑衅，但他试图掩饰自己的反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:21152
    old "What do you mean? It's just a suitcase. How were you even here?"
    new "什么意思？不就是个手提箱吗。你到底是怎么进来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:21157
    old "First, tell me what you need the suitcase for."
    new "先告诉我，你拿那只手提箱要做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:21158
    old "Are you trying to imply something? I'm not following."
    new "你是在暗示什么吗？我听不明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:21159
    old "Huh... I understand what's going on now. Are the gems already inside it, or were you about to go get them?"
    new "哈……现在我明白是怎么回事了。宝石已经装在里面了，还是你正要去取？"

    # game/script.rpy:21160
    old "Being able to reason something out had calmed Atsuki. Every trace of fear had left his body, replaced by confidence. \"...Can the past be changed after all?\" That question floated into Atsuki's mind."
    new "理清头绪后，Atsuki 平静了下来。恐惧从他身上消散殆尽，取而代之的是自信。「……过去终究还是能被改变的吗？」这个疑问浮上 Atsuki 心头。"

    # game/script.rpy:21163
    old "The man's face didn't change. He was lost in thought after Atsuki's abrupt accusation."
    new "男人面不改色。Atsuki 突如其来的指控，让他陷入了沉思。"

    # game/script.rpy:21168
    old "Nonchalantly, he entered the room and locked his piercing eyes on Atsuki, who didn't waver."
    new "他不紧不慢地走进房间，锐利的目光钉在 Atsuki 身上。Atsuki 没有退缩。"

    # game/script.rpy:21171
    old "Suddenly, he grabbed Atsuki's neck and threw him into the wall."
    new "突然，他一把掐住 Atsuki 的脖子，将他甩向墙壁。"

    # game/script.rpy:21172
    old "What the fuck do you know? Were you waiting for me?"
    new "「你他妈知道些什么？你是在这儿等我？」"

    # game/script.rpy:21173
    old "Atsuki's reasoning had given him reassurance, but it hadn't prepared him. He had future information, so he should've had the upper hand. However, his discussions with Sai had given him false expectations, and he hadn't reacted properly to an abrupt physical attack."
    new "推论让 Atsuki 安了心，却没能让他做好准备。他掌握着未来的情报，本该占尽上风。可他与 Sai 的几番交谈给了他错误的预期，面对突如其来的袭击，他没能及时反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:21176
    old "Kid, no matter what you think you know, you are done for. You are sticking your nose into something very delicate, and this will not stand."
    new "「小子，不管你自以为知道多少，你都已经完了。你插手的事情极为敏感，我绝不会坐视不管。」"

    # game/script.rpy:21180
    old "Those words didn't reach Atsuki, as his head had slammed too hard into the wall. While the man threw more and more threats at him, he was unaware that Atsuki's sight was only registering a blurry image of his face."
    new "那些话没能传进 Atsuki 耳中——他的头撞在墙上，撞得太重了。男人接连抛出一句句威胁，却不知道 Atsuki 眼里只映出他一张模糊的脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:21181
    old "Once he had told him everything he'd deemed necessary, he let go of him, thinking that he'd managed to convey the seriousness of the situation. However, Atsuki's body plummeted down, the same lost gaze looking upward at the ceiling."
    new "把自认为该说的都说完后，他松开了手，以为自己已经让对方明白事情有多严重。可 Atsuki 的身体却直直滑落下去，那双失神的眼睛依旧望着天花板。"

    # game/script.rpy:21182
    old "As soon as he understood what he'd done, the man rushed to grab him, hoping that he was only being tricked. However, that was far from the truth. Atsuki's remaining time alive was in a countdown, and as it ticked down, he couldn't even process that his fresh start with Shiroya would never begin."
    new "意识到自己做了什么，男人急忙伸手去扶他，盼着这只是虚惊一场。然而事实远非如此。Atsuki 余下的生命已进入倒计时；而随着秒数一点点流逝，他甚至没能意识到，自己与 Shiroya 重新开始的机会，永远也不会到来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21185
    old "When the man realized he'd become a murderer, he froze, inheriting Atsuki's dilemma. He couldn't move, and he knew that the hallway's cameras would record him. For that reason, he stood next to the door, spending the minutes growing accustomed to the thought that his life had been ruined."
    new "明白自己成了杀人凶手，男人僵在原地，仿佛接过了 Atsuki 的困局。他动弹不得，也知道走廊的监控会拍下他。于是他站在门边，用几分钟时间慢慢接受一个念头：他的人生已经毁了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21186
    old "He ran through many courses of action. Suddenly, he concluded that there was some hope left for him. Even though exiting the room would cement the reality of his actions, he might've had a way around it. After what had happened, though, he was unsure he could count on it."
    new "他把种种对策在脑中过了一遍。忽然，他断定自己还有一线希望。虽说走出这个房间就等于让所作所为成为事实，但他或许有办法绕开。只是出了这种事，他不敢肯定那办法还靠得住。"

    # game/script.rpy:21189
    old "Eventually, the previous events repeated themselves. The door was opened from the outside, and the man met face to face with the first person who'd see him as a killer."
    new "最终，先前的情景重演了。门从外面被推开，男人与第一个会将他视作凶手的人打了个照面。"

    # game/script.rpy:21190
    old "On the floor, Atsuki spent the last seconds of his life facing up, unable to move any part of his body. Resembling a hallucination, he saw his killer being startled by the knob's movement. When the door completed its arc and bounced on the wall, three more figures entered Atsuki's sight, but he couldn't distinguish their expressions.{w} In front of him, he saw four people."
    new "Atsuki 仰面躺在地上，身体任何部位都动弹不得，就这样度过生命最后的几秒。恍如幻觉一般，他看见凶手被门把的转动惊了一下。门扇划开弧线、撞在墙上弹回，又有三个人影进入他的视野，可他辨不清他们的神情。{w} 他眼前，站着四个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:21191
    old "Two men, a woman, and a girl. It seemed all of them were looking at him, and he felt something: he knew all of them. He recognized their clothes, bodies, and faces. He saw the last three of them rushing to him, but his mind cut off."
    new "两个男人、一个女人和一个女孩。他们似乎都在看着他，而他心里泛起一种感觉：这些人他全都认识。他认得他们的衣着、身形和面孔。他看见后面三个人朝他奔来，意识却就此中断。"

    # game/script.rpy:21198
    old "That was the last image Atsuki saw. Then, his consciousness didn't fade away, as he had none."
    new "那是 Atsuki 看到的最后一幕。随后，他的意识并没有消散——因为他早已没有意识。"

    # game/script.rpy:21205
    old "Similarly, none of this happened, as it couldn't. If the frozen sections could've been reached, everything would've crumbled down."
    new "同样地，这一切都没有发生，也不可能发生。倘若那些冻结的区段能被触及，一切都将崩塌。"

    # game/script.rpy:21206
    old "But... that wasn't all. Something else denied the whole structure's connection."
    new "可是……不止如此。还有别的东西否定了整个结构之间的关联。"

    # game/script.rpy:21208
    old "...Another rule had been defied."
    new "……又一条规则被打破了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21209
    old "Ending: Ethereal Arc"
    new "结局：空灵之弧"

    # game/script.rpy:21242
    old "Only White"
    new "唯有纯白"

    # game/script.rpy:21252
    old "Still cupping the Sekimeiya with my shirt, I stepped into its room, where I saw the cabinet and another open door. Shiroya came after me, glancing at the cabinet, which was partially covered by the dark curtain."
    new "我用衬衫兜着 Sekimeiya，走进它所在的水晶展室，看见了展示柜和另一扇敞开的门。Shiroya 跟在我身后进来，瞥了一眼被深色遮布遮住一半的展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:21257
    old "She scrolled open the glass and helped me place the Sekimeiya inside. After we closed it again, we had a question to ask ourselves."
    new "她滑开玻璃罩，帮我把 Sekimeiya 放了进去。合上之后，我们得问自己一个问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:21258
    old "Should we lock it?"
    new "「要上锁吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:21263
    old "I think we should. We said we wouldn't use it anymore, so there's no reason not to."
    new "「我觉得该锁。既然说过不再用它，那就没有理由不锁。」"

    # game/script.rpy:21264
    old "I nodded after thinking about it. Akaro and Sai took the key when they left the bedroom, so it stood to reason that they still had it. If they'd traveled through time far enough to appear outside the tower, they wouldn't have appeared with it—if they planned to enter once more, they would have hidden it somewhere to retrieve it easily."
    new "想了想，我点了头。Akaro 和 Sai 离开卧室时带走了钥匙，按理说钥匙还在他们手上。若他们穿越到足够远的地方，出现在塔外，钥匙就不会跟着他们一起出现；而如果他们打算再进来一次，就该把钥匙藏在某个方便取回的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:21268
    old "Nonetheless, locking it would prevent everyone else from opening it. I moved to the left side of the cabinet and crouched to manually turn the wheel."
    new "不过，上了锁，其他人就打不开了。我绕到展示柜左侧，蹲下身，用手转动转轮。"

    # game/script.rpy:21272
    old "There. Only someone with the key will be able to open it. We'll stay here, though, so that won't happen."
    new "「好了。只有拿钥匙的人才打得开。不过我们会守在这里，不会有人来开的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:21275
    old "She tried to move the glass and confirmed that I had locked it properly. To achieve a better effect, she pulled down the curtain and proceeded to glance around the room noncommittally, unsure of what else to do."
    new "她试着推了推玻璃，确认我锁好了。为了更保险，她拉下遮布，随后漫无目的地环视房间，似乎不知道该再做些什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:21276
    old "We haven't seen Erina and Katei since we left the bedroom. Do you wanna search for them before we decide to stay put?"
    new "「离开卧室之后，我们就没见过 Erina 和 Katei。要不要先去找找他们，再决定守在这里？」"

    # game/script.rpy:21277
    old "She didn't answer. I thought she was considering the whereabouts of Akaro and Sai, who we had to find as well, but a single word defied my assumption."
    new "她没有回答。我以为她在琢磨 Akaro 和 Sai 的下落——那两个人也得找到——可她只说了一个词，推翻了我的猜测。"

    # game/script.rpy:21282
    old "Look."
    new "「看。」"

    # game/script.rpy:21284
    old "Her gaze was fixed on the floor. I traced the line, spotting a drop of blood in the middle of a room for the second time."
    new "她的目光定在地面上。我顺着看过去，第二次在房间中央看见一滴血迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:21289
    old "We were right next to it and hadn't seen it easily. It was smaller than the one in the lobby, but there was a much more important distinction."
    new "我们就在旁边，却也不容易看见。这滴比大厅那滴小，但还有一点更为要紧的区别。"

    # game/script.rpy:21290
    old "This one isn't that old. It's not completely dry."
    new "「这滴没那么久。还没完全干。」"

    # game/script.rpy:21291
    old "Is someone walking around and bleeding?"
    new "「是有人在到处走动，一路滴血？」"

    # game/script.rpy:21292
    old "Despite what it seemed, there had to be something more to it. If what we'd seen in the lobby was only a single drop, it came from a fairly serious injury. The one in front of us didn't give the same impression. I looked all over the floor again and didn't see even another speck."
    new "看似如此，其中却必有蹊跷。大厅那滴若只有一滴，那伤得相当重。眼前这滴给人的感觉却不同。我又把地板细细看了一遍，连一点血迹也没再找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:21293
    old "I think we should try to find the others, in case something bad has happened."
    new "「我觉得该去找找其他人，万一出了什么事呢。」"

    # game/script.rpy:21294
    old "I took a good look at the blood. It wasn't fully dry like the spot in the lobby, indicating that the bleeding could've gone on for a while. If a wound had started to clot, it explained the smaller drop."
    new "我仔细端详那滴血。它不像大厅那处已经完全干透，说明出血可能持续了一阵。若是伤口已经开始凝血，那滴血偏小也就说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21295
    old "Small amounts of blood dry up fast. While many factors are involved, I could estimate it would take, say, half an hour for a bit of it to fully dry in our conditions. This spot is close to meeting that mark, while the one in the lobby dried up before we saw it..."
    new "「少量血迹干得很快。影响因素很多，不过按我们的环境估算，这么一点血完全干透大概要半小时。这一滴已经接近这个时间，而大厅那滴在我们看见之前就干透了……」"

    # game/script.rpy:21300
    old "How do we do it, then? Does one of us stay here to make sure nobody takes the Sekimeiya?"
    new "「那我们怎么分？留一个人守在这里，确保没人拿走 Sekimeiya？」"

    # game/script.rpy:21301
    old "After all we'd considered, exploring the possibility of a deliberate trap to send us out wasn't that ridiculous. In truth, the two drops of blood didn't feel very natural."
    new "结合我们此前的种种推测，去考虑「有人故意设局把我们引出去」这种可能性，也不算荒唐。说实话，那两滴血怎么看都不太自然。"

    # game/script.rpy:21306
    old "I think we should do what we've been doing up until now. One of us stays in hallway C while the other looks through the rooms. It's unlikely anyone had an accident and bled on and off for so long... We should be careful."
    new "「我觉得照旧来就行。一个人留在 C走廊，另一个去各个房间查看。不太可能有人受了伤，还断断续续流了这么久的血……还是小心为上。」"

    # game/script.rpy:21313
    old "I wasn't opposed, so we entered hallway A. Our tension had gradually escalated since we'd seen blood on the floor of the lobby. Using that arrangement felt safe enough, as we wouldn't be forced to separate ourselves while searching. Moving to the mechanical room would be the only unavoidable instance of that."
    new "我没有反对，于是我们走进了 A走廊。自从在大厅地板上看到血迹，我们的紧张便一点点攀升。照这个安排行事，感觉还算稳妥——搜查时不必被迫分开。唯一避不开要分开的，只有去机械室的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:21318
    old "I'll see if I find anyone, then."
    new "「那我去看看能不能找到人。」"

    # game/script.rpy:21320
    old "She nodded sharply, standing next to hallway C. Volunteering to look through some rooms was no heroic task, but I felt a bit better doing it myself."
    new "她干脆地点了点头，站到 C走廊旁。主动去查看房间算不上什么英勇之举，但由我自己来做，心里会踏实一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:21325
    old "Naturally, my attention was first directed at the storeroom. I opened the door with Shiroya looking on from behind. The long corridor still extended up to the door without a handle, and I stepped in to see if I could spot any change."
    new "我自然先想到储藏室。Shiroya 在身后看着，我推开了门。狭长的走廊依旧一直延伸到那扇没有把手的门前，我走进去，看看有没有什么变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:21328
    old "However, everything was identical, just as I remembered it. I had no way to know if the door had been opened from either side, but I was certain that I still couldn't do it."
    new "然而一切如旧，与我记忆里分毫不差。我无从得知那扇门是否曾从哪一侧被打开过，但我确信，自己仍然打不开它。"

    # game/script.rpy:21334
    old "In front was room A5, where the gems were stolen. Although \"the room where Isla was found\" was a more suitable name... I looked down as I entered it, knowing that I'd have to see her face again."
    new "前方是水晶展室 A5，宝石就是在这里失窃的。虽说叫「Isla 被发现的那个展室」更贴切些……我低下头走了进去，知道自己又要见到她的脸了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21338
    old "There she was, immobile, her skin already showing a slight ashen tint. There was nothing next to her, so I quickly closed the lid and looked through the other cabinets."
    new "她就在那里，一动不动，皮肤已泛起淡淡的灰白。她身旁空无一物，我急忙合上柜盖，又去查看其他展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:21342
    old "After I'd seen all of their harmless interiors, I moved to the next room. Deeming it vacant was an easy task, which was repeated for the next four identical ones."
    new "我把这些展示柜内部都看过一遍，确认没有异样后，走向下一个房间。判断里面空无一人并不难，后面四个一模一样的房间也是如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:21347
    old "Only the security room remained. After it, I'd go to the mechanical room, make sure nobody had entered the event room, and Shiroya would move toward hallway B. That would prevent anyone from using the event room as a bridge to remain hidden."
    new "只剩下监控室了。查完那里，我会去机械室，确认没人进过活动室，Shiroya 则前往 B走廊。这样一来，就不会有人利用活动室当通道躲起来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21352
    old "But when I opened the door, I was met with a sudden and unexpected sight.{w} My mind reeled as I stared at it, too stunned to react differently. I abruptly turned to face Shiroya, who responded to me with a plain expression.{w} I yelled at her to come over, and she sprinted toward me. Not only had I seen something that put an end to the search, but I also knew that Shiroya and I absolutely couldn't be separated."
    new "可我一推开门，骤然撞见一幅完全出乎意料的景象。{w}我怔怔地望着，脑中一片混乱，惊得做不出别的反应。我猛地转头看向 Shiroya，她神情平淡地回望我。{w}我朝她大喊，让她过来，她便向我奔来。我不只看到了足以终结这场搜寻的东西，也清楚我和 Shiroya 绝对不能分开。"

    # game/script.rpy:21360
    old "As soon as she peeked inside, she visibly recoiled. Then, she had to force herself to breathe deeply and try to look again. Once she did, she saw she hadn't been mistaken."
    new "她刚往里一看，身体就明显一缩。随后，她强迫自己深吸一口气，才敢再次看去。这一次，她看清自己并没有看错。"

    # game/script.rpy:21368
    old "Katei's body was on the floor, partially under his desk. It appeared the two drops of blood had been a mere introduction to the sea we saw in the security room. His clothes, the desk, the floor... they'd all been splashed by the same red substance."
    new "Katei 的尸体倒在地板上，一部分在办公桌下面。先前那两滴血，看来不过是我们在监控室里见到的那片血海的序曲。他的衣服、办公桌、地板……全被同样的红色液体泼溅过。"

    # game/script.rpy:21370
    old "Even after trying to process the image for a full minute, I couldn't bring myself to move. The thick smell of blood began to disperse through the open door, repelling us."
    new "我试着让自己接受眼前的景象，可整整一分钟过去，身体依然动弹不得。浓烈的血腥味从敞开的门里漫出来，逼得我们不敢靠近。"

    # game/script.rpy:21375
    old "Wh-What is this...? There's no way..."
    new "这、这是什么……？怎么可能……"

    # game/script.rpy:21376
    old "At some point, she said that, radiating pure disbelief. I couldn't bring myself to reply, but I took a step forward, scanning the dimly lit room."
    new "不知何时，她吐出了这句话，满是不敢置信。我说不出话来，只能向前迈出一步，扫视昏暗的房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:21380
    old "Three bright lights were situated in front of me. They were the three main computer monitors, which indicated that less than fifty minutes ago, it had been used."
    new "前方亮着三块屏幕，那是三台主显示器；这说明不到五十分钟前，电脑还被使用过。"

    # game/script.rpy:21381
    old "Shiroya entered behind me, taking careful steps to avoid the blood that covered the majority of the floor. We looked at Katei's face, under the shadow of the desk. His darkened expression looked distressed and agitated, reminiscent of the one he'd made in the attic."
    new "Shiroya 跟在我身后进来，小心翼翼地避开覆盖了大半地板的血。我们看向办公桌阴影下 Katei 的脸。他脸色发暗，神情痛苦而焦躁，让我想起他在阁楼里的那副表情。"

    # game/script.rpy:21385
    old "I swallowed my accumulated saliva and carefully crouched to check his pulse, but I didn't feel anything."
    new "我咽下口中积起的唾液，小心地蹲下探他的脉搏，却什么也没摸到。"

    # game/script.rpy:21386
    old "I tried not to look in Shiroya's direction and continued inspecting Katei until I saw that a bit of blood was still pouring out of his skull. I didn't have to turn his head too much to see a huge crack. I immediately averted my eyes, with no doubts about what I would've seen if his white hair hadn't prevented it."
    new "我尽量不去看 Shiroya，继续检查 Katei，直到发现他的颅骨仍有少许血在往外渗。我几乎不用怎么转动他的头，就看见一道巨大的裂口。我立刻别开眼。若不是他的白发遮着，我毫不怀疑自己会看见怎样的景象。"

    # game/script.rpy:21388
    old "I stood up, shaken by the eerie background noise that the arrhythmic sound of dripping blood and the whirring computer had joined forces to create."
    new "我站起身，心里发毛。滴血声毫无节律，电脑嗡嗡作响，二者交织成一种诡异的背景音。"

    # game/script.rpy:21389
    old "...There's a horizontal crack in the back of his head. Given how much blood is on the desk, I think he fell on its edge."
    new "……他后脑有一道横向的裂口。桌上血这么多，我想他是摔在桌沿上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21390
    old "Once again, Shiroya looked down at the pool of blood. It was natural for a head injury to bleed so much, and what I'd observed didn't reveal much. For all we knew, it was an accident.{w} The way I imagined it, if he'd fallen back, he would've hit his head against the desk, ended up under it, and pushed the chair away. Despite how much blood covered the floor, there were no bloody footprints leaving the room."
    new "Shiroya 又一次低头看向那摊血。头部受伤流这么多血本就正常，而我看到的情况也提供不了多少线索。就目前所知，这也许只是一场意外。{w}按我的设想，他若是向后倒下，头撞在办公桌边缘，身体滑到桌下，还顺势把椅子推开——现场就会是这样。尽管地板上到处是血，却没有带血的脚印通向房间外。"

    # game/script.rpy:21393
    old "However, the gruesome scenery obligated us to think that someone could've done it. Pushing Katei would've achieved the same result.{w} Vast pools of blood would take a long time to dry, so I easily spotted smaller drops on the sides of the desk. Those were much closer to drying up, reminding me of the one in the event room."
    new "然而，眼前的惨状逼得我们不得不考虑，也可能是有人所为。只要推 Katei 一把，也能造成同样的结果。{w}大片血迹要很久才会干，因此桌边那些细小的血滴格外显眼。它们已经快要干透，让我想起活动室里的那一滴。"

    # game/script.rpy:21394
    old "No matter what happened, though... he was dead. Katei, who was an enigma of his own and never stopped claiming his innocence, met his sudden end right after freeing himself from confinement in the attic."
    new "可不管究竟发生了什么……他死了。Katei 本身就充满谜团，又始终声称自己无辜，却刚摆脱阁楼里的囚禁，就突然丢了性命。"

    # game/script.rpy:21399
    old "...Look at the screen. There's a message."
    new "……看屏幕。上面有条消息。"

    # game/script.rpy:21400
    old "Huh...?"
    new "啊……？"

    # game/script.rpy:21404
    old "I quickly glanced at it. As she'd said, in the center of the middle screen, I saw a tiny message box, containing one single line of text."
    new "我迅速瞥了一眼。正如她所说，中间那块屏幕的中央有个小小的消息框，里面只有一行字。"

    # game/script.rpy:21405
    old "\"{time=10:04}: Camera(s) disabled and associated footage erased\"."
    new "「{time=10:04}：摄像头已停用，相关录像已删除」。"

    # game/script.rpy:21407
    old "Oh, what...? At {time=10:04}?"
    new "啊，什么……？是在 {time=10:04}？"

    # game/script.rpy:21408
    old "That must've been when Katei was here alone. We checked the time at {time=9:41.}.. Twenty minutes later was when we left, and he stayed behind, trying to fix the system."
    new "那应该是 Katei 独自留在这里的时候。我们在 {time=9:41.} 看过时间……二十分钟后我们离开，他留下来想修好系统。"

    # game/script.rpy:21409
    old "You're right. And instead, he erased the existing footage and shut down the cameras. That's what this is saying."
    new "你说得对。可他反倒删掉了原有录像，还关掉了摄像头。这条消息就是这个意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:21411
    old "The most conspicuous hint, a message left on the computer, was potential proof that Katei had been the culprit we were trying to ferret out. I reached for the mouse and dragged the message aside.{w} Behind it, the program Katei had attempted to display the footage with was the only thing seen on the screen. It had a list of all the cameras, but they were useless if they'd actually been disabled."
    new "电脑上留下的那条消息，是最显眼的线索，也可能证明 Katei 就是我们要揪出的犯人。我伸手握住鼠标，把消息拖到一旁。{w}消息后面，屏幕上只剩下 Katei 原本用来播放录像的程序。程序里列着所有摄像头，可如果它们真被停用了，那也毫无用处。"

    # game/script.rpy:21415
    old "I lowered my eyes. The taskbar contained the single clock we had at our disposal. As soon as I glanced at it, the numbers switched from {time=16:59} to {time=17:00.}"
    new "我垂下目光。任务栏上显示着我们唯一能参照的时钟。我刚看过去，数字便从 {time=16:59} 跳到了 {time=17:00.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:21416
    old "It's {time=17.} Only four hours are left."
    new "已经 {time=17.} 了。只剩四个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:21417
    old "...Let's get out of here. From this room too. The smell is getting unbearable."
    new "……走吧。离开这里，也离开这个房间。气味越来越让人受不了了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21421
    old "I had no complaints. Even though the hallway's illumination was worse, we left the much darker room and breathed steadily after the minutes we'd spent inside."
    new "我没有异议。走廊的光线虽然更暗，我们还是离开了那间更加昏暗的房间；在里面待了几分钟后，总算能顺畅呼吸了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21428
    old "The message on the screen... Without a doubt, it belonged to the security system program, but was that full proof of its trustworthiness? With such an obvious message being found next to him, I had to ask myself if it was legitimate or a diversion left by his killer. Not only did the room leave the possibility of an accident open, it also displayed an incriminating message next to Katei."
    new "屏幕上的那条消息……它无疑来自安保系统程序，但这足以证明它可信吗？这么显眼的消息就出现在他身旁，我不禁要问，它是真的，还是凶手留下的障眼法。这个房间既留下了意外死亡的可能，又把一条对他不利的消息摆在了 Katei 身边。"

    # game/script.rpy:21429
    old "Was the message a fabrication by the real culprit to pin the blame on Katei and play it off as an accident while they were the ones to deal with the cameras and the security system? It wasn't easy to tell, and I wasn't sure which idea I was more inclined to lean toward."
    new "这条消息会不会是真凶伪造的，用来把罪责推到 Katei 身上，再把现场伪装成意外，而真正处理摄像头和安保系统的人其实是他们？这并不好判断，我也说不清自己更倾向于哪一种可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:21436
    old "Wait, no. It doesn't make any sense. Look."
    new "等等，不对。这说不通。你看。"

    # game/script.rpy:21437
    old "I followed Shiroya's line of sight again, that time up to the ceiling."
    new "我再次顺着 Shiroya 的视线望去，这一次是抬头看向天花板。"

    # game/script.rpy:21445
    old "That green light is supposed to indicate that the camera's recording, right? There's no way they were disabled so long ago."
    new "那盏绿灯应该表示摄像头正在录像，对吧？它们不可能那么早就被关掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21446
    old "I'd forgotten about that... You're right.{w} However... it was Katei who told us what the green light meant. We can't be certain about it."
    new "我都忘了这回事……你说得对。{w}不过……绿灯的含义是 Katei 告诉我们的。我们没法确定他说的是不是真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:21447
    old "They haven't stopped flickering, and I'm sure they also were before {time=10}, so if the cameras really aren't recording, the lights must simply indicate that they're powered on."
    new "它们一直在闪，我敢肯定 {time=10} 之前也一样。所以，如果摄像头真的没在录像，这灯就只能表示它们通着电。"

    # game/script.rpy:21448
    old "It's strange that Katei would tell a lie like that. If he disabled the cameras, part of the reason would be that he didn't want the police to see him when they entered. Despite that, he incriminated himself by lying to us about what the lights mean."
    new "Katei 会撒这种谎，实在奇怪。如果他关掉了摄像头，部分原因应该是他不想让警察进来时看到他。可即便如此，他又在绿灯含义上骗了我们，反而把自己牵连了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:21449
    old "Yeah, that's... not consistent. Could someone else have left that message to blame him?"
    new "是啊，这……对不上。会不会是别人留下那条消息，为了嫁祸他？"

    # game/script.rpy:21450
    old "I'm not sure, but thinking about it more, there's no way this was an accident...{w} If Katei fell backward and hit his head against the desk, it means he was exiting the room. Why would he try to leave with that message being shown on the screen? Another person had to be involved somehow."
    new "我不确定，但再仔细想想，这绝不可能是意外……{w}如果 Katei 是向后倒下、头撞上桌沿，那就说明他当时正要离开房间。屏幕上还显示着那条消息，他为什么要在这时候离开？一定有另一个人以某种方式牵涉其中。"

    # game/script.rpy:21456
    old "Shiroya agreed with me. After a few pensive seconds, being presented once again with the fact that a murderer was nearby, we had to decide on what to do."
    new "Shiroya 同意我的看法。沉思几秒后，我们不得不再次面对凶手就在附近的事实，并决定接下来该怎么办。"

    # game/script.rpy:21457
    old "Do you want to search for the others?"
    new "要去找其他人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:21462
    old "W-We should. We don't know what happened to Akaro and Sai, but I'm worried about Erina. Just... We can't split up, Atsuki. We have to stay together no matter what."
    new "我、我们得去。Akaro 和 Sai 不知道怎么样了，但我担心 Erina。只是……Atsuki，我们不能分开。无论发生什么，都得待在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:21463
    old "I couldn't say it was unlikely for Erina to become a target for the culprit. Katei was employed by Ashiya, a member of the security staff, but Isla had died despite being a complete outsider and a child. Any one of us could've been next."
    new "我不能说 Erina 不会成为凶手的目标。Katei 受雇于芦屋，是安保人员，可 Isla 明明只是个完全无关的外人，还是个孩子，却同样死了。我们当中的任何一个人，都可能是下一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:21464
    old "Yeah, okay. Let's stick together and find Erina. Let's just be extremely careful. We have nothing to defend ourselves with if we're suddenly attacked."
    new "好，就这么办。我们一起行动，去找 Erina。一定要格外小心。万一突然遭到袭击，我们连能防身的东西都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:21469
    old "She gave me a strained, saddened look. Even though only four hours remained, seeing the outside world felt infinitely far away."
    new "她看了我一眼，神情勉强而哀伤。明明只剩四个小时，外面的世界却遥远得仿佛永远也到不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21470
    old "Let's see if the Sekimeiya's still here."
    new "去看看 Sekimeiya 还在不在。"

    # game/script.rpy:21477
    old "We entered the event room."
    new "我们走进了活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:21480
    old "The Sekimeiya hadn't been taken while our attention was grabbed by the security room, so it was unlikely that was the intent of the culprit's plan. As a routine effort, I lowered the curtain again."
    new "我们被监控室吸引注意力的那段时间，Sekimeiya 并没有被人拿走，所以那不太可能是凶手计划的真正目的。我照例又把遮布拉了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:21487
    old "We have to find Erina. It's... not good that we haven't seen her yet."
    new "得找到 Erina。到现在还没见到她……这可不妙。"

    # game/script.rpy:21488
    old "All right. There's no need to separate at all. We're only trying to find her, and she wouldn't hide from us. It could be dangerous to try to corner the culprit."
    new "好吧。完全没必要分头行动。我们只是想找到她，而她又不会躲着我们。贸然去逼凶手现身，反而危险。"

    # game/script.rpy:21493
    old "Right. Let's finish up this floor..."
    new "嗯。先把这一层搜完吧……"

    # game/script.rpy:21506
    old "We went to the lobby to access the mechanical room. Down the staircase was the strangely imposing room which could have served purposes beyond our understanding."
    new "我们回到大厅，前往机械室。顺着楼梯下去，那间屋子透着莫名的压迫感，用途或许远非我们所能理解。"

    # game/script.rpy:21510
    old "There were some spots out of reach from the stairs—under a table or behind some chairs in the back. Stepping farther in revealed the lack of any hidden person."
    new "从楼梯的位置看，有几处角落根本瞧不见——桌子底下，或者靠里的几把椅子背后。再往里走几步，便发现那里并没有藏着人。"

    # game/script.rpy:21519
    old "I doubt Erina would be in a hallway B room, but let's look before going up."
    new "我不觉得 Erina 会在 B走廊的房间里，不过上楼之前还是先看看吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:21523
    old "The first room we looked into was empty. Failing to stumble upon anyone made things grow gradually more unsettling... We knew someone had to have traveled with the Sekimeiya shortly before we did..."
    new "我们查看的第一间房空空如也。始终没撞见半个人影，气氛反倒一点点变得令人不安……我们很清楚，就在我们之前不久，一定有人用 Sekimeiya 穿越了时间……"

    # game/script.rpy:21524
    old "I'd explored the thought that, perhaps, if the range was huge, Erina had the chance to be caught up in it and escape the tower. However, Katei had gone downstairs before her and should've traveled as well. Since the dryness of his blood indicated that he'd died almost half an hour before we'd found him, I was willing to disregard that theory."
    new "我也想过，也许重叠范围足够大，Erina 有可能被卷入其中，从而逃出了芦屋塔。可 Katei 比她还早下楼，按理也该一同穿越。他的血迹干燥程度说明，他在被发现前将近半小时就已经死了，所以这个推测我愿意暂且搁下。"

    # game/script.rpy:21528
    old "Shiroya and I proceeded to the next room. Of course, if they'd traveled out of the tower after leaving the attic, it was possible Katei had reentered the tower through the storeroom entrance and then died. If the search for Erina yielded no results, that angle would gain some traction."
    new "我和 Shiroya 走向下一间房。当然，如果他们离开阁楼后走出了塔，那 Katei 也有可能从储藏室入口重新回到塔内，然后才死去。要是找 Erina 一无所获，这条思路就值得多想一想。"

    # game/script.rpy:21532
    old "The next room underwent an identical search. Halfway through, we realized that searching inside the cabinets defeated the point of what we agreed on. They were only a potential hiding spot for a culprit we'd decided was out of our reach."
    new "下一间房也用同样的方式搜了一遍。搜到一半，我们才意识到，翻找展示柜内部已经违背了先前商定的做法。那些展示柜不过是凶手可能藏身的地方，而我们早已认定，那个凶手不是我们能应付的。"

    # game/script.rpy:21537
    old "We opened the door to room B4."
    new "我们推开了水晶展室 B4 的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:21540
    old "Past it, on the floor, Naomi's corpse reminded us that it was the room where we'd found her. The sight stopped us in place, leaving us dumbstruck."
    new "门一开，地板上 Naomi 的尸体便提醒我们，这里正是当初发现她的地方。那景象让我们僵在原地，说不出话来。"

    # game/script.rpy:21543
    old "Because at her right, Erina lay, her clothes tinted maroon by all the blood on them.{w} Shiroya looked at me with the clear wish to deny reality. It hit us like a truck: Erina was dead too, and the only people remaining with us were dangers who we wanted to avoid."
    new "因为就在她右侧，Erina 躺在那里，衣服被血染成了暗红。{w} Shiroya 望着我，眼神里分明盼着这一切不是真的。这个事实如重锤砸下：Erina 也死了，而还留在我们身边的，尽是些我们避之不及的危险人物。"

    # game/script.rpy:21547
    old "I gulped before I took short steps forward. She was lying sideways, which let us see all the blood on her chest, though not extensively on the floor. There was some on her stomach and legs too. Unlike Katei's expression, hers looked almost serene despite everything the tower had put her through."
    new "我咽了口唾沫，小步走上前。她侧躺着，胸前的血迹一览无余，地板上倒不算多。腹部和腿上也有。与 Katei 不同，尽管这座塔让她受了那么多折磨，她的神情却近乎安详。"

    # game/script.rpy:21549
    old "When I turned around, I saw Shiroya kneeling down, burying her face in her hands. Someone around us had killed a mother who'd just lost her daughter, and we would have to continue fearing that looming danger... for four more hours. I had no words for the horrendous view I was forced to accept."
    new "我回过头，只见 Shiroya 跪在地上，双手掩面。我们身边有人杀了一位刚刚失去女儿的母亲，而我们还得继续提防那潜伏的危险……整整四个小时。面对这被迫接受的惨状，我一句话也说不出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:21550
    old "We stared at the scene in silence. Erina's clothes were slightly torn, signaling a physical fight, and the color of the blood indicated that it had been drying long enough to almost be a solid, just like Katei's."
    new "我们默默注视着眼前的景象。Erina 的衣服有轻微的撕裂，说明她曾与人搏斗；血液的颜色则表明，它已经干涸到几乎凝固，和 Katei 的一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:21556
    old "That's it... I can't look at her. Let's go..."
    new "够了……我实在看不下去。走吧……"

    # game/script.rpy:21557
    old "I lowered my head even more than it already was, clenching my fists. Seeing Shiroya like that was heartbreaking, but it was ultimately impressive how strong she'd been. On my end, I only found myself rejecting reality, never fully allowing the deaths we'd seen to sink in."
    new "我本就低着的头垂得更低，攥紧了拳头。看到 Shiroya 那个样子，我心里一阵绞痛，可她终究坚强得令人敬佩。至于我，只是一味地拒绝现实，从不肯让亲眼所见的死亡真正落进心里。"

    # game/script.rpy:21560
    old "I stepped out of the room, but I couldn't avoid turning around again and witnessing the end of two women we'd met that day."
    new "我走出房间，却还是忍不住回头，看了我们那天才认识的两个女人最后一眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:21563
    old "Naomi's body was covered by an elegant curtain, so I didn't want to leave Erina behind without one. The cameras might not even have been recording, so I went ahead and detached another curtain from a cabinet, laying it over Erina. With that small attempt at dignity, we left the room."
    new "Naomi 的遗体盖着一块雅致的遮布，我也不想让 Erina 就这么露着。反正监控未必还在录像，我便从展示柜上又扯下一块遮布，盖在 Erina 身上。算是力所能及地给她留了点体面，随后我们离开了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:21576
    old "We walked to the event room, lost. A threatening atmosphere had reared its ugly head with more finality than before; two murders in a row, and perhaps while we were on the same floor as them. Given the state of Erina's blood, it was more than likely that her body had been in that room for a while."
    new "我们茫然地走向活动室。一股比先前更沉重的威胁感笼罩上来，带着几分已成定局的意味；接连两起命案，也许就发生在我们与他们同处一层的这段时间。从 Erina 的血迹来看，她的遗体很可能已经在那间房里躺了许久。"

    # game/script.rpy:21582
    old "We hadn't reacted strongly to the past two—or three—deaths. It wasn't that we were desensitized, but that our feelings seemed insignificant compared to what was going in that place, as if our defeat had been unavoidable from the start. There had been no time to really stop and consider the true gravity of being sealed away with one or more murderers, at least not for me. Thinking of ways to either avoid or root out danger had taken priority."
    new "先前那两起——也许是三起——死亡，我们并没有太大的反应。倒不是麻木了，只是与这里正在发生的一切相比，我们的感受显得微不足道，仿佛从一开始就注定要败下阵来。至少对我而言，根本没有余力停下来细想：与一名乃至多名凶手一同被封在这座塔里，究竟意味着什么。如何避开危险、如何根除危险，才是当务之急。"

    # game/script.rpy:21583
    old "But things had changed. Shiroya and I being the only ones left hammered in just how deadly the situation was. With all color drained from the world, we simply moved forth, feeling like birds with clipped wings trapped in a cage."
    new "但如今不同了。只剩下我和 Shiroya 两人，这本身就足以说明局势有多致命。世界仿佛褪尽了颜色，我们只是机械地向前走，像被剪去翅膀、困在笼中的鸟。"

    # game/script.rpy:21589
    old "I made sure the Sekimeiya was inside the cabinet and sat next to the hallway A door. Then, Shiroya leaned against the wall in front of me. More than likely, we were no match for the culprit behind those deaths, so there was no point in trying to do anything else. We had nowhere to possibly hide. Wishing for only stillness, we quietly let time carry us."
    new "我确认 Sekimeiya 收在展示柜里，随后在通往 A走廊的那扇门旁坐下。Shiroya 则靠在我正前方的墙边。凭我们的力量，多半敌不过制造这些命案的凶手，再做别的也是徒劳。这里根本没有可以藏身的地方。我们只求一切静止，就这样安静地任时间流逝。"

    # game/script.rpy:21594
    old "With nothing left to do, I meaninglessly ran through the possibility of trusting one of the others."
    new "既然无事可做，我便漫无边际地推想，能否信任其余人中的某一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:21595
    old "There was one detail that felt off. Doubting that Akaro and Sai were the culprits was foolish... but one thing pointed me toward it."
    new "有一个细节不太对劲。怀疑 Akaro 和 Sai 是凶手本显得愚蠢……可偏偏有一处线索把我往这个方向引。"

    # game/script.rpy:21596
    old "It was the drop of blood we'd found in the lobby. It was completely dry, meaning that it was left there while we'd been locked in the attic. However, the blood around Katei's and Erina's bodies had been, naturally, from a time after we unlocked the bedroom."
    new "就是我们在大厅发现的那一滴血。它已经完全干涸，说明它是在我们被关在阁楼期间留下的。而 Katei 和 Erina 尸体周围的血，自然是我们打开卧室之后才流出的。"

    # game/script.rpy:21597
    old "Therefore, during the time Akaro and Sai should've been the only people outside the attic's bedroom, someone had lost blood. In addition, I thought that a small injury wouldn't have produced a single drop as big as that one."
    new "也就是说，在那段时间里，阁楼卧室外本该只有 Akaro 和 Sai，却有人流过血。而且，我觉得小小的擦伤不可能留下那么大的一滴血。"

    # game/script.rpy:21598
    old "It had every possibility of being an accident. Akaro and Sai also could've fought, resulting in Akaro's victory, going off the lack of injuries when he'd joined us again. However, the truth had the potential to be slightly more convoluted: perhaps Katei or Erina traveled to the past after leaving the attic. Then, they'd been attacked in the lobby and finished off even later."
    new "那完全可能只是场意外。Akaro 和 Sai 也可能交过手，而从 Akaro 重新与我们汇合时毫无伤痕来看，赢的是他。不过，真相也许还要更曲折一些：或许 Katei 或 Erina 离开阁楼后穿越回了过去，他们在大厅遭到袭击，之后才被彻底了结。"

    # game/script.rpy:21601
    old "No matter what had happened, it was clear that something went wrong while we were at the top of the tower. And no matter who was left nearby, we didn't want to cross paths with them anymore."
    new "无论真相如何，有一点很明确：我们待在塔顶的那段时间里，出了岔子。而不管留在附近的是谁，我们都不想再撞上他们了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21602
    old "Nonetheless, we were guarding the Sekimeiya. We hadn't discussed it again, but it was what we'd intended to do before seeing the last two corpses. If the culprit showed themselves to obtain it, in the instance we had to escape, there were doors on both sides of the room which we'd left open."
    new "尽管如此，我们还是在守着 Sekimeiya。那之后我们没再商量过，可早在看到那两具尸体之前，我们就是这么打算的。万一凶手现身来取它，而我们又不得不逃，房间两侧各有一扇门，我们一直留着没关。"

    # game/script.rpy:21606
    old "I closed my eyes and left my mind blank. It felt nice after going over so many thoughts. But as soon as I did, different questions came to me."
    new "我闭上眼睛，让脑子放空。在翻来覆去想那么多之后，这样反倒舒服。可刚一放空，别的问题又冒了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:21610
    old "Instead of how... why? Why had someone killed Erina? What could anyone have gained with that? Had it been out of pure malice, taking advantage of the disabled cameras?"
    new "比起怎么做到的……我更想问为什么。为什么会有人杀了 Erina？杀了她又能得到什么？难道只是趁监控失灵，出于纯粹的恶意？"

    # game/script.rpy:21611
    old "That didn't feel right; we all would have been killed by that point. With the Sekimeiya around, actions were bound to have more depth than they appeared to, and I had a hard time believing that someone who had actively chosen to remain undiscovered for so long would have no real motive."
    new "这也说不通。真是那样，我们早该全都被杀了。有 Sekimeiya 存在，任何举动背后都必定另有深意，我实在难以相信，一个刻意藏了这么久的人会没有真正的动机。"

    # game/script.rpy:21612
    old "I couldn't be sure with Katei, but Erina hadn't done anything to warrant her death. At most, I could assume she'd found the culprit."
    new "Katei 的情况我无法确定，但 Erina 并没有做过任何招致杀身之祸的事。硬要猜，最多也只能猜她发现了凶手。"

    # game/script.rpy:21613
    old "I went back to the small theory I'd put together. If she had traveled to the past and confronted Akaro and Sai while the rest of us were in the bedroom, that could have given them a motive for her death...{w} Even though they were the only suspects, they hadn't shown back up, so it was appropriate to think that they might never intend to."
    new "我又想起自己拼凑出的那个小推测。如果她穿越回过去，在我们其余人还待在卧室时与 Akaro 和 Sai 撞上，这可能就成了他们杀害她的动机……{w} 虽然他们是仅有的嫌疑人，却始终没再露面，想来他们也许根本不打算再出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:21617
    old "Wait... the recording!"
    new "等等……那段录音！"

    # game/script.rpy:21618
    old "According to Akaro and Sai, Erina was alive."
    new "按 Akaro 和 Sai 的说法，Erina 当时还活着。"

    # game/script.rpy:21621
    old "Even though the scenario played out as if Erina and I were present, that isn't possible anymore. Who did that recording actually intend to trick...?"
    new "那段录音演得就像我和 Erina 都在场，可这已经不可能了。那段录音究竟是想骗谁……？"

    # game/script.rpy:21622
    old "It couldn't be a coincidence that Akaro and Sai were the only other people still alive and the only ones to have been mentioned in the recording. However, Erina's death nullified its chances of being real."
    new "还活着的人只剩 Akaro 和 Sai，而录音里提到的偏偏也只有他们，这不可能是巧合。可 Erina 一死，录音为真的可能性就被彻底否定了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21623
    old "...Or did it? I tried to think about it."
    new "……真的是这样吗？我试着往下想。"

    # game/script.rpy:21626
    old "Even though Isla's already dead, she was the third and last person to appear in the recording. But her death wasn't enough to completely deny it being real."
    new "Isla 虽然已经死了，但她却是录音里第三个、也是最后一个出现的人。不过，仅凭她的死，还不足以完全否定录音的真实性。"

    # game/script.rpy:21627
    old "And that's solely thanks to the Sekimeiya's existence. It's possible that Isla's still alive, she'll be part of the recording in the future, and will travel to the past to end up in the cabinet where we found her corpse. There might be different arrangements, but the gist would always be the same."
    new "而这一切全靠 Sekimeiya 的存在。Isla 或许现在还活着，将来会出现在那段录音里，然后穿越回过去，最终出现在我们发现她尸体的那个展示柜里。具体的经过也许各有不同，但大致情形总归如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:21628
    old "Could something similar apply to Erina...? Nothing supports it in her case, but the exact same thing could be going on with her, couldn't it?"
    new "类似的情况会不会也发生在 Erina 身上……？她这边没有任何证据支持，但完全相同的事也可能正发生在她身上，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:21629
    old "So not even her dead body is enough to disregard the recording. Not while the Sekimeiya exists."
    new "所以，即便见到了她的尸体，也不能就此否定那段录音。只要 Sekimeiya 还在，就不能。"

    # game/script.rpy:21636
    old "Despite my uncomfortable position, my sight began to fade, and I started to feel drowsy."
    new "尽管姿势很不舒服，我的视线还是渐渐模糊，困意涌了上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:21637
    old "Every time I rested a little, my body reminded me of how tired I was and of its strong demand for a full sleep."
    new "每次稍微歇一会儿，身体就会提醒我有多疲惫，又是多么渴望好好睡上一觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:21638
    old "I saw that Shiroya's eyes were shut. I desperately wanted to resist it, but I couldn't help but close mine too, lay my head on my shoulder, and put my body against the wall."
    new "我看见 Shiroya 闭着眼睛。我拼命想撑住，却还是不由自主地合上眼，脑袋歪靠在肩头，身体抵住墙壁。"

    # game/script.rpy:21643
    old "I knew that my consciousness was soon to fade, but having to wait for almost another four hours made any attempt at preventing it futile. I let myself go, temporarily abandoning the nightmarish tower engulfed in mystery."
    new "我知道自己的意识很快就要沉下去，可还要再等将近四个小时，再抗拒也是徒劳。于是我放任自己沉入黑暗，暂时将这座笼罩在谜团中的噩梦之塔抛在脑后。"

    # game/script.rpy:21655
    old "My subconscious was alert at all times, aware that I was surrounded by ever-present danger. For that reason, as soon as the faintest sound met my ears, all my senses came back."
    new "我的潜意识始终警醒，清楚自己身处无时不在的危险之中。因此，耳边刚传来最细微的声响，我的神志便立刻恢复清明。"

    # game/script.rpy:21660
    old "As if I'd traveled through time, I opened my eyes, unaware of how long I'd been there for. Thanks to the open doors, I discerned the origin of the noise. I stared ahead, where hallway B was."
    new "我睁开眼，仿佛穿越了时间，不知道自己在那里待了多久。门开着，我辨出了声音的来源，便朝前方望去——那是 B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:21664
    old "Wha—!"
    new "什么——！"

    # game/script.rpy:21667
    old "I froze. The dry sound of my heart echoed within me and stuttered."
    new "我僵住了。干涩的心跳声在体内回响，断断续续。"

    # game/script.rpy:21668
    old "Just behind the door was Shiroya. As soon as she looked inside the event room, she saw my piercing gaze and returned it with her own."
    new "门后正是 Shiroya。她刚朝活动室里看，就迎上我锐利的目光，也回望过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:21671
    old "After an eternity of a second, she turned around and sped up, her figure rapidly disappearing."
    new "那一秒漫长得如同永恒。她随即转身，加快脚步，身影迅速消失在视野里。"

    # game/script.rpy:21672
    old "Then, without moving, I looked at... Shiroya. She was still sitting down and leaning against the wall before my very eyes, resting her head on her arms."
    new "我还是没动，只把目光投向……Shiroya。她仍坐在我眼前，靠着墙，头枕在自己的手臂上。"

    # game/script.rpy:21673
    old "H-Hey... Are you awake?"
    new "喂、喂……你醒着吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:21674
    old "Shiroya...!"
    new "Shiroya……！"

    # game/script.rpy:21676
    old "...Mm."
    new "……嗯。"

    # game/script.rpy:21682
    old "She lifted her face and looked at me with nearly closed eyes."
    new "她抬起脸，半睁着眼看我。"

    # game/script.rpy:21686
    old "Were you sleeping?"
    new "你刚才在睡觉？"

    # game/script.rpy:21691
    old "Sorry... yeah."
    new "抱歉……嗯。"

    # game/script.rpy:21692
    old "I stood up, clueless, my mind cluttered."
    new "我站起身，满心茫然，脑子里乱作一团。"

    # game/script.rpy:21693
    old "No... It might sound ridiculous, but I just saw you."
    new "不……说出来可能很荒唐，但我刚才看见你了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21699
    old "I dashed to hallway B. It was empty.{w} My mind still reeling, I reentered the event room."
    new "我冲向 B走廊。那里空无一人。{w}我脑子仍乱成一团，又回到了活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:21707
    old "I'm being serious. Footsteps woke me up, and I saw you in hallway B. You saw me too, but you walked toward hallway C, and there's no one here."
    new "我是认真的。脚步声把我吵醒，我看见你在 B走廊。你也看见我了，却朝 C走廊走去——可这里根本没人。"

    # game/script.rpy:21708
    old "What? How long have I been asleep?"
    new "什么？我睡了多久？"

    # game/script.rpy:21709
    old "I don't know."
    new "不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:21710
    old "What I saw could only have been achieved with the Sekimeiya, so I uncovered the curtain."
    new "我看到的景象，只可能是 Sekimeiya 造成的。于是我揭开了遮布。"

    # game/script.rpy:21716
    old "The Sekimeiya's still here, and it's locked."
    new "Sekimeiya 还在这里，而且上了锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:21722
    old "I don't understand. Are you sure it was me?"
    new "我不明白。你确定那是我？"

    # game/script.rpy:21726
    old "Yes, but... there was a big difference. You were wearing different clothes."
    new "确定，不过……有一处很大的不同。你穿的衣服不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:21731
    old "Different clothes...? Were they mine?"
    new "衣服不一样……？是我的衣服吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:21735
    old "No, but I think I recognized them. You still had your coat, but you were wearing a different shirt and pants, and I think I saw them earlier in one of the attic wardrobes."
    new "不是，但我好像认得那些衣服。外套还是你那件，可衬衫和裤子换了。我先前似乎在阁楼的某个衣柜里见过那身衣服。"

    # game/script.rpy:21737
    old "She was too lost to respond, and understandably so. It meant that in the future, she was guaranteed to travel to the past and live out what I'd experienced. But it all went far beyond my comprehension, especially her strange behavior and clothing."
    new "她茫然得答不上话，这也不难理解。那意味着，未来的她注定会穿越回过去，经历我方才见到的一切。可这一切远超我的理解，尤其是她那古怪的举止和衣着。"

    # game/script.rpy:21738
    old "Stay here for a second."
    new "在这里等一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:21748
    old "I rushed out of the room and ran to hallway C. It was empty as well.{w} Had it been a hallucination? There was no way—I was sure of what I'd seen."
    new "我冲出房间，跑向 C走廊。那里同样空无一人。{w} 难道是我的错觉？不可能——我很确定自己看见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21755
    old "I circled the floor and entered the event room from hallway A. It appeared the Shiroya I'd seen had deliberately hidden herself, so I wasn't sure if searching in depth was a good idea."
    new "我绕着这一层走了一圈，从 A走廊回到活动室。看来我见到的那个 Shiroya 是故意躲起来的，因此我也不确定该不该仔细搜查。"

    # game/script.rpy:21756
    old "Let's go to the attic. I need to see if I'm right about this."
    new "去阁楼吧。我得确认自己的猜测对不对。"

    # game/script.rpy:21757
    old "She shot me another questioning look and approached with her hand on her forehead. No matter how much we wanted to spend the remainder of our time in the event room, Shiroya's bizarre apparition indicated that something else was happening or just about to."
    new "她又向我投来疑问的目光，手扶着额头走近。无论我们多想在活动室度过余下的时间，Shiroya 那诡异的现身都说明，有别的事情正在发生，或者即将发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:21762
    old "Should we check the time first?"
    new "要不要先看一下时间？"

    # game/script.rpy:21763
    old "Oh, probably."
    new "哦，也对。"

    # game/script.rpy:21768
    old "Hallway A was still completely vacant. Shiroya had clearly seen me and chosen to walk away. It made no sense. If that was a future version of her, she already knew that I would see her."
    new "A走廊依旧空无一人。Shiroya 明明看见了我，却选择走开。这说不通。如果那是未来的她，她早就知道我会看见她。"

    # game/script.rpy:21769
    old "It was Sai's dilemma all over again. I had just explained what I saw to Shiroya, so if she ever did travel to the past and repeat what I'd told her, she would be completing a loop with no origin. It couldn't be that she purposely let me see her just because I said so.{w} If Shiroya ever traveled again, she'd immediately recognize that the situation I described could come at any time. There was no chance for it to happen without foreknowledge, like when she'd called the elevator in the attic..."
    new "这又成了 Sai 当初的困境。我刚把自己看见的告诉了 Shiroya；若她日后真的穿越回过去，并做出我所说的那些事，她就是在补全一个没有源头的因果循环。她不可能仅因我这么说了，就故意让我看见她。{w} 如果 Shiroya 再次时间穿越，她立刻就会明白，我描述的情形随时都可能出现。若没有预知，这一幕根本不可能发生——就像她在阁楼里叫来电梯那次……"

    # game/script.rpy:21777
    old "The state of the security room was unchanged. I saw some drops of blood had fully dried up, which was consistent with the time displayed on the computer:{w} {time=17:29.}"
    new "监控室仍保持原样。我注意到几滴血已经完全干涸，这与电脑上显示的时间相符：{w} {time=17:29.}"

    # game/script.rpy:21783
    old "Shiroya! Are you there!?"
    new "Shiroya！你在吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:21788
    old "It was such a nonsensical sight. The person I was calling for was next to me, but she wasn't who my shouts were directed to."
    new "那景象实在荒诞。我呼喊的人就在身旁，可我的喊声并不是冲她去的。"

    # game/script.rpy:21789
    old "Once again, if I tried to continue reasoning with my assumption that \"everything has to have an origin of some kind\", the most simple explanation behind things was that Shiroya would eventually lose her memories."
    new "我若再一次以「凡事必有其源头」为前提继续推想，那么一切背后最简单的解释，便是 Shiroya 最终会失去记忆。"

    # game/script.rpy:21790
    old "I was getting a headache. I'd wanted to finally put a stop to all those maddening lines of thought, but I couldn't. Not after the way the Shiroya in the hallway stared right through me."
    new "我的头开始疼了。我本想彻底放下这些折磨人的念头，却办不到——尤其是在走廊里那个 Shiroya 直直地看穿我之后。"

    # game/script.rpy:21797
    old "The elevator is still here, so if you went up, you probably didn't use it. Let's walk."
    new "电梯还停在这里，所以你要是上去过，大概也没坐它。我们走楼梯吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:21803
    old "She simply nodded. I understood that since she hadn't personally seen herself, she was too baffled and sleepy to feel the urgency I did."
    new "她只点了点头。我明白，她毕竟没有亲眼看见另一个自己，又困惑又困倦，自然感受不到我这份紧迫。"

    # game/script.rpy:21807
    old "As I went up, I reassured myself of what I believed."
    new "上楼时，我不断在心里告诉自己，我的判断没有错。"

    # game/script.rpy:21813
    old "Something else has to be happening. The way we think the Sekimeiya works does not explain this."
    new "一定还有别的事情在发生。我们对 Sekimeiya 运作方式的理解，解释不了这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:21814
    old "Both of us wanted to stay in the event room until {time=21}, but it was a different Shiroya who made us leave. What if whatever's about to happen leads into Shiroya traveling and she experiences her side of what I just saw?"
    new "我们俩都想在活动室待到 {time=21}，可把我们叫走的是另一个 Shiroya。假如接下来要发生的事，最终导致 Shiroya 穿越时间，让她经历我刚看见的那一幕中属于她的那一侧呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:21815
    old "That doesn't make a single bit of sense. Again, the reason why we left the room would be because we left the room and then made ourselves leave the room. There's something clearly missing."
    new "这根本说不通。照这样推，我们离开活动室的理由，就成了我们离开过活动室，然后又叫自己离开活动室。显然还有什么缺失。"

    # game/script.rpy:21816
    old "Not only is this a bootstrap paradox, it contradicts our own interests. We both had every intention of staying there, so what could the meaning behind this actually be?"
    new "这不仅是一个自举悖论，还与我们自身的意愿相悖。我们两人当时都打算留在那里，那这件事背后的意义究竟何在？"

    # game/script.rpy:21822
    old "I hoped that whatever the attic contained, there would be some kind of hint. The other Shiroya was wearing clothes I thought I'd seen up there, which amplified how outlandish it would be for that bootstrap to occur."
    new "我原本希望，阁楼里不管有什么，总能留下些线索。另一个 Shiroya 身上的衣服，我似乎在上面见过——若真有那样的自举发生，就愈发显得匪夷所思。"

    # game/script.rpy:21823
    old "Why was she dressed in clothes from the attic? Instead of going over how unlikely causal loops were, I had to shift my approach—the answer had to be something that wouldn't directly come from me seeing her wearing the clothes."
    new "她为什么穿着阁楼里的衣服？与其反复琢磨因果循环何等罕见，我得换个思路——答案不该直接来自「我看见她穿着这身衣服」这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:21824
    old "However, that had already happened, and I'd told her about it. So what possibilities remained? What could the masked answer have been?{w} ...Reason. That was what I needed to locate."
    new "可那件事已经发生，我也已经告诉了她。那么还剩下哪些可能？那个被遮掩的答案究竟是什么？{w}……是理由。我要找的就是理由。"

    # game/script.rpy:21830
    old "We arrived at the entrance to the attic. The key was still in the keyhole, so we began to go up the narrow staircase."
    new "我们来到阁楼的入口。钥匙仍插在锁孔里，于是我们踏上了狭窄的楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:21834
    old "A reason behind the Shiroya I just saw, who still has to be somewhere..."
    new "刚才那个 Shiroya 背后的理由——她此刻一定还在某处……"

    # game/script.rpy:21835
    old "Is it a coincidence that the hardest mysteries to solve have involved double selves? Now that I think about it, almost everyone but me has produced this mystery individually."
    new "最难解的谜团都牵涉到另一个自己，这难道是巧合？现在回想，除我之外，几乎每个人都各自经历过这样的怪事。"

    # game/script.rpy:21836
    old "Naomi's body appeared dead twice. Sai existed both in the attic and on the crystal floor, and simple time travel couldn't explain it. What about the Akaro who had different memories?{w} Isla and Erina have died despite the fact they're supposed to be alive in the future. Now, a Shiroya that's very hard to explain with pure time travel has suddenly shown herself."
    new "Naomi 的尸体两次出现。Sai 同时存在于阁楼和水晶层，单纯的时间穿越解释不通。那个记忆不同的 Akaro 又该如何解释？{w}Isla 和 Erina 已经死去，可在未来她们本该活着。如今，又有一个很难用纯粹的时间穿越解释的 Shiroya 突然露面。"

    # game/script.rpy:21837
    old "The core mystery is always the origin of the extra person and their reason for existing. Something else might have been happening right under our noses, and we just haven't noticed yet."
    new "谜团的核心始终是多出来的那个人从何而来、又为何存在。或许还有别的事情一直在我们眼皮底下发生，只是我们尚未察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:21840
    old "Could it be related to..."
    new "会不会和……有关？"

    # game/script.rpy:21841
    old "A second Katei hasn't appeared. Is that related to what Akaro said in the bedroom?"
    new "第二个 Katei 始终没有出现。这和 Akaro 在卧室里说的那番话有关吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:21842
    old "He didn't know who Katei was...{w} but he knew me."
    new "他不知道 Katei 是谁……{w}却认得我。"

    # game/script.rpy:21849
    old "It doesn't seem like anyone's been here recently, going off the floor."
    new "看这地板的样子，最近似乎没人来过。"

    # game/script.rpy:21853
    old "We entered, leaving behind the first footprints in a while. If anyone had entered or exited the attic, they used the elevator. However, since the key was still in the door below us, it was unlikely that the elevator could possibly have gone up so far."
    new "我们走进去，留下了许久以来的第一串脚印。若有人进出过阁楼，只可能是乘了电梯。可钥匙还插在楼下的门上，电梯不太可能一路开到这么上面来。"

    # game/script.rpy:21858
    old "I believe it's in the right bedroom. The wardrobe had a few articles of clothing."
    new "应该在右边的卧室里。衣柜里有几件衣服。"

    # game/script.rpy:21867
    old "That one, right? I saw them too."
    new "就那个房间吧？那些衣服我也看见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21873
    old "I nodded and opened it up. Inside, a few old-looking clothes hung in the empty space."
    new "我点点头，打开了衣柜。里面空荡荡的，只挂着几件显得陈旧的衣服。"

    # game/script.rpy:21874
    old "I thought so. You were wearing these."
    new "果然如此。你当时穿的就是这些。"

    # game/script.rpy:21876
    old "I took out a moderately sized white shirt and dark pants, neither of which looked to have been designed for a young girl."
    new "我取出一件尺码中等的白衬衫和一条深色长裤，两件都不像是给年轻女孩设计的。"

    # game/script.rpy:21881
    old "These? I'm not sure I like them."
    new "这些？我不太喜欢。"

    # game/script.rpy:21882
    old "Well, there isn't much else to choose from."
    new "可也没有别的可选了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21887
    old "...I suppose, yeah. I imagine I'd pick these if I wanted to use this wardrobe to get dressed."
    new "……大概吧。要是我真想用这个衣柜换衣服，应该也会挑这几件。"

    # game/script.rpy:21888
    old "And you were wearing them even though they're still here."
    new "可它们还在这儿，你却穿着它们。"

    # game/script.rpy:21893
    old "I'm very lost about this, but does it mean that I'll go back to the past with them?"
    new "我完全搞不明白。不过，这是不是说，我会穿着它们回到过去？"

    # game/script.rpy:21894
    old "I... don't know."
    new "我……不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:21897
    old "Could something else have been the answer? I thought about that first.{w} I'd just put together how unlikely it was that anyone had entered the attic recently. That meant the Shiroya I'd seen probably hadn't hurried up to the attic and returned those clothes to the wardrobe."
    new "会不会另有答案？我先想到的是这一点。{w}我刚推断出最近几乎没人进过阁楼，也就是说，我见到的那个 Shiroya 应该没有匆匆跑上阁楼、把这些衣服放回衣柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:21898
    old "I didn't imagine that had happened, but it wasn't out of the question. If that Shiroya had possessed another key to the attic, she could've come faster than us while we'd gone to the security room."
    new "我并不认为真会这样，但也并非全无可能。若那个 Shiroya 另有一把阁楼钥匙，趁我们去监控室时，她或许能比我们更快赶到这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:21899
    old "I wasn't sure if she had the ability to use the single key we knew existed. The elevator had probably been on the crystal floor, so even if she had the key, she would've had to go up with it, leave the clothes behind, take the elevator down to the sixth floor, send it to the crystal floor, and place the key back in the attic's keyhole."
    new "我们所知只有那一把钥匙，她能不能用得上，我也说不准。电梯多半停在水晶层，所以就算她有钥匙，也得先乘它上去，把衣服留下，再乘电梯下到六楼，把电梯送回水晶层，最后把钥匙插回阁楼门口的锁孔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:21900
    old "...{w}Even though they look the same, I'm willing to assume these clothes aren't the exact same ones I saw you wearing. Meaning that two identical sets exist at the moment, if your other self is still here somewhere."
    new "……{w}虽然看着一样，但我觉得这身不是我见你穿过的那一套。也就是说，如果你的另一个自己此刻还在这栋楼里某处，那眼下就有两套一模一样的衣服。"

    # game/script.rpy:21901
    old "It feels pointless trying to think about how it happened when I'm completely clueless as to why it did. But if you travel to the past and see me in the event room, something similar to our last travel has to happen."
    new "连原因都毫无头绪，再去想事情是怎么发生的，总觉得白费力气。可如果你穿越回过去，在活动室见到我，那就一定会重演类似上次穿越的情形。"

    # game/script.rpy:21906
    old "You mean that I'd need to wear the clothes for a while and then travel with the Sekimeiya. After that, I'd have to appear far back enough and the place I show up would have to be from the time I was wearing the clothes."
    new "你是说，我得穿着这身衣服过一阵子，然后带着 Sekimeiya 穿越。之后，我出现的时间要足够早，出现的地点也得是我穿着这身衣服时待过的地方？"

    # game/script.rpy:21908
    old "I was getting incredibly overwhelmed. The way she described it was one way for it to work. Other arrangements existed, such as traveling far to the past, borrowing the clothes, seeing me in the event room, and eventually going to the past again to return them to the wardrobe."
    new "我越听越觉得头绪纷乱。她说的只是其中一种可能。还有别的安排，比如先穿越到很久以前，借走这身衣服，在活动室见到我，最后再次回到过去，把衣服放回衣柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:21909
    old "Nonetheless, it didn't make any sense. Why would she do that? It was so bizarre and unlike anything else that had happened, I couldn't think of even a semi-logical explanation."
    new "可这依然说不通。她为什么要那么做？整件事太过离奇，和此前发生的任何事都不同，我连一个勉强合乎逻辑的解释都想不出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:21910
    old "Let me see... It's possible we'll come across that version of you again, even though she didn't look too surprised to see me. Just in case we do..."
    new "让我想想……我们也许还会再遇上那个你，虽然她见到我时并不怎么惊讶。以防万一……"

    # game/script.rpy:21911
    old "I opened the drawers and took a marker out."
    new "我拉开抽屉，取出一支记号笔。"

    # game/script.rpy:21912
    old "I hope this hasn't dried yet. If these cameras are actually still working, I might get in trouble for this, but it could tell us something of value."
    new "但愿这支笔还没干透。要是这些摄像头其实还在运转，我这么做可能会惹上麻烦，但也许能让我们弄清一件要紧的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:21919
    old "Are you gonna leave a mark?"
    new "你要做个记号？"

    # game/script.rpy:21920
    old "Yes. Washing it won't get rid of it, so I'll make it tiny."
    new "对。洗也洗不掉，所以我会画得很小。"

    # game/script.rpy:21924
    old "On the collar of the shirt, I drew a tiny black cross."
    new "我在衬衫领口上画了一个小小的黑色十字。"

    # game/script.rpy:21925
    old "The more I think about it, the more unlikely it seems that whatever happened was accomplished by traveling from the future. It'd be a loop without origin, which is not how a consistent timeline would work."
    new "我越想越觉得，这件事不像是从未来穿越回来促成的。那会成为一个没有起点的循环，而自洽的时间线不该如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:21926
    old "Just like I'd thought when we were locked in the bedrooms, there was a way to place the origin of the loop inside Shiroya's mind.{w} If she'd created a plan downstairs in the event room where a future self of hers would lure us out to accomplish something, and she'd later travel to make that happen, I'd begin to accept it as possible. Since it had happened to Shiroya, though, I wasn't able to reason it out like that."
    new "就像我们被关在卧室里时我想过的，有一种办法能把循环的起点放在 Shiroya 的头脑里。{w}如果她早在楼下的活动室里定下计划——让未来的自己把我们引出去、以此达成某件事——而她后来真的穿越回去促成此事，那我或许还能接受这种可能。可这次事情是 Shiroya 亲身经历的，我就没法这么推想了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21927
    old "If we ever see that version of you again and you're wearing these clothes, I'll check this spot.{w} If the mark is there, it'll mean that you traveled from the future with it somehow. If it's not, that'll tell us the truth is different."
    new "要是我们再见到那个你，而她穿着这身衣服，我就检查这里。{w}如果有记号，就说明她是带着这身衣服从未来穿越来的。如果没有，那就说明真相并非如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:21928
    old "If I ran into that Shiroya and saw no mark, there were next to no ways to explain it with her coming from the future, and they all relied on returning the clothes to the wardrobe before we found them. Once again, I couldn't help but experience an impending and threatening pressure when I tried to think about what reason existed behind it all."
    new "如果我遇上那个 Shiroya，却看不到记号，那就几乎没有办法用「她从未来而来」来解释，仅剩的几种可能也都得靠她赶在我们找到衣服之前把衣服放回衣柜。一想到这一切背后的原因，我又感到一种迫在眉睫的压迫感。"

    # game/script.rpy:21936
    old "I left the marker inside the drawer and sat on the bed. Shiroya joined me at my side, evidently not fully accepting yet that a mysterious version of her was most likely roaming around downstairs."
    new "我把记号笔放回抽屉，坐到床上。Shiroya 过来坐在我身边，显然还没能完全接受：楼下很可能正有一个神秘的她四处走动。"

    # game/script.rpy:21937
    old "You don't plan to travel to the past or put on those clothes, right? How could that have happened if you'll never make it happen?"
    new "你并不打算穿越回过去，也没打算穿这身衣服，对吧？可如果你永远不会去做，那件事又怎么会发生？"

    # game/script.rpy:21942
    old "I won't, no, and I don't know either. I think it's just as strange as you're making it out to be."
    new "我不会，真的不会，我也搞不懂。我也觉得这事确实像你说的那样古怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:21946
    old "I replayed the moment in my head. That expressionless person who'd unmistakably been Shiroya... What were her thoughts at the time?"
    new "我在脑中回放那一刻。那个面无表情的人分明就是 Shiroya……她当时在想什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:21947
    old "I lay back in frustration. That was the first time the bizarre \"double body\" situation happened to someone I could trust and freely speak with, but she had no idea what the meaning behind it was. Perhaps that also applied to every other case."
    new "我懊恼地仰面躺下。这种诡异的「双重身体」情形，第一次发生在我信任且能畅所欲言的人身上，可她对其中的含义也一无所知。也许其他每一次都是如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:21948
    old "It could be that the original Naomi wouldn't have been able to explain the existence of her double self either. Could something have been creating replicas of us without our notice?"
    new "或许原本的 Naomi 也同样无法解释另一个自己的存在。会不会有什么东西在我们毫无察觉的时候，一直在制造我们的复制品？"

    # game/script.rpy:21949
    old "There was no way. Otherwise, the other Shiroya would've run to me as soon as she'd seen me. And even if the answer was that she had a reason to borrow the clothes from the attic, they wouldn't have still been in the wardrobe."
    new "绝无可能。否则，另一个 Shiroya 一见到我就该朝我跑来。再说，就算她真有理由从阁楼借走这身衣服，它们也不该还好端端地留在衣柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:21950
    old "I clicked my tongue, sighed, and rolled on the bed... I hated everything about it. When I looked at Shiroya, all I got from her face was a despondent expression."
    new "我咂了咂嘴，叹了口气，在床上翻了个身……这一切都让我厌烦透顶。我看向 Shiroya，她脸上只露出一副消沉的神情。"

    # game/script.rpy:21953
    old "That version of you had some goal. If she was lost somehow or suddenly popped into existence, she wouldn't have ignored me."
    new "那个你是带着目的的。如果她只是迷了路，或者凭空出现，她不会对我置之不理。"

    # game/script.rpy:21958
    old "What kind of goal...?"
    new "什么目的……？"

    # game/script.rpy:21959
    old "Well, look at what she accomplished. By wearing clothes from the attic, not responding to my shouts, and quickly hiding from view... she brought us here."
    new "看看她做成了什么。穿上阁楼里的衣服，不回应我的喊声，又飞快地躲起来……她把我们引到了这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:21960
    old "You think I wanted to lead us far away from the event room?"
    new "你觉得我是想把我们引得离活动室远远的？"

    # game/script.rpy:21961
    old "Honestly, what else could it be? That's where the Sekimeiya is. I'm not accusing you of anything—I'm sure you would have had a good reason for doing it..."
    new "说实话，还能是什么？Sekimeiya 就在那里。我不是在指责你——我相信你那么做一定有充分的理由……"

    # game/script.rpy:21966
    old "No... that can't be it. I'm sure I don't want to touch the Sekimeiya again."
    new "不……不会是这样。我确定自己不想再碰 Sekimeiya 了。"

    # game/script.rpy:21967
    old "But you could've come from the future with further knowledge and a specific plan to achieve."
    new "但你也可能是从未来而来，知道得更多，还有明确的目的要实现。"

    # game/script.rpy:21972
    old "You just said earlier that doesn't make sense, right? Even if I ever think of a good reason to travel back to this point and use the Sekimeiya, I'd know how to do it just because me doing it already happened. I'd be repeating what you saw thanks to the fact that I repeated what you saw. ...That can't be it."
    new "你刚才不是说过，这说不通吗？就算我将来真想到一个好理由，要穿越回这个时间点使用 Sekimeiya，我也只是因为自己已经做过，才知道该怎么做。我之所以会重演你看到的那一幕，理由仅仅是我已经重演过那一幕。……所以不会是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:21976
    old "I couldn't object. I'd used that same argument to deny a multitude of theories, but it wasn't fully reliable, as we didn't know the rules of the universe regarding time travel."
    new "我无从反驳。我用同样的论点否定过许多推测，可这套说法并不完全可靠——关于时间穿越，这个宇宙的规则我们并不清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:21977
    old "Let's go back down, I suppose. We'll see if the Sekimeiya's still there, and there's a chance we'll see you again."
    new "那就先下去吧。看看 Sekimeiya 还在不在，说不定还能再见到你。"

    # game/script.rpy:21989
    old "Accompanied by an unsettling, gloomy mood, we entered the hallway. We weren't feeling too energetic, so we called the elevator."
    new "我们怀着不安而沉闷的心情走进走廊。两人都提不起劲，便叫了电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:21993
    old "After a few seconds, the button lit up orange. I opened the door and entered after her."
    new "几秒后，按钮亮起橙光。我打开门，跟在她后面走了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:21997
    old "After pressing the lowest button, I leaned on the uncomfortable handrail and wished for everything to finally end. We began to descend, surrounded by the unassuming sound of the elevator's motion and my deep sighs."
    new "按下最底层的按钮后，我靠在并不舒适的扶手上，只盼这一切能尽早结束。电梯开始下降，四周只剩下它运行时的轻微声响和我的沉重叹息。"

    # game/script.rpy:22018
    old "Shiroya also realized that we'd stopped earlier than expected. As the secondary doors opened, we saw the floor 3 button blinking."
    new "Shiroya 也察觉到我们停得比预想中早。内门打开时，只见三楼的按钮正在闪烁。"

    # game/script.rpy:22019
    old "Did you hit it accidentally?"
    new "是你误按了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:22020
    old "No."
    new "没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:22023
    old "We looked at each other, puzzled, before staring at the opaque door that led to the third floor. We were unaware of what awaited us, but we expected something to happen."
    new "我们困惑地对视一眼，随后一同望向通往三楼的那扇不透明的门。我们不知道门外有什么在等着，却都觉得一定会发生些什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:22025
    old "Someone must've pressed the button while we were inside..."
    new "我们还在里面的时候，肯定有人按了按钮……"

    # game/script.rpy:22027
    old "However, the door didn't immediately open. The only explanation was that someone had called it from the third floor, but they weren't getting in.{w} I cautiously reached forward and pushed the door."
    new "可门并没有立刻打开。唯一的解释是有人在三楼叫了电梯，却又不进来。{w}我小心翼翼地伸手推开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:22034
    old "A desolate corridor came into view, with zero apparent signs of life."
    new "一条冷清的走廊出现在眼前，看不出半分有人活动的迹象。"

    # game/script.rpy:22035
    old "I don't see anyone..."
    new "一个人也没有……"

    # game/script.rpy:22039
    old "I stepped out with Shiroya right behind. I looked at the button, but nothing indicated whether it had been pressed."
    new "我走了出去，Shiroya 紧跟在后。我看了看按钮，可看不出它是否被人按过。"

    # game/script.rpy:22044
    old "You're sure you didn't hit it, right?"
    new "你确定自己没有按到吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:22045
    old "Yeah, definitely."
    new "嗯，确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:22050
    old "Oh, the elevator kept moving to the crystal floor."
    new "啊，电梯自己继续往水晶层去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22053
    old "Shiroya called it again as I walked a few automatic steps, attempting to comprehend what could've happened."
    new "我下意识地走了几步，试图想明白究竟发生了什么，Shiroya 则再次叫回了电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:22054
    old "Did someone run away after pressing the button...?"
    new "难道是有人按下按钮后就跑掉了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:22058
    old "I approached the stairs, the most likely route anyone would've chosen to hide in a rush. I couldn't immediately see anyone, so we'd have to choose which way to go."
    new "我走向楼梯——要是有人匆忙躲起来，那里最有可能。一时看不到人影，我们只能自己决定往哪边走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22063
    old "There's really no one here. Should we keep going down?"
    new "这里真的没人。我们要继续往下走吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:22068
    old "I guess so..."
    new "大概吧……"

    # game/script.rpy:22072
    old "Maybe we should continue on foot. It could've been the other version of you."
    new "也许我们该走楼梯下去。那说不定就是另一个你。"

    # game/script.rpy:22073
    old "...{w}Okay."
    new "……{w}好。"

    # game/script.rpy:22077
    old "Our synchronized footsteps began to lightly echo around the wide interior, setting up an uncomfortable atmosphere we'd gotten very familiar with."
    new "我们整齐的脚步声开始在宽敞的空间里轻轻回荡，营造出那种我们早已熟悉的不安气氛。"

    # game/script.rpy:22082
    old "I was barely ahead of Shiroya. After a few steps, I reached the left turn, where the entrance to the offices was."
    new "我走在 Shiroya 前方不远处。几步之后便到了左转的拐角，办公室的入口就在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:22086
    old "Bloodhound"
    new "猎犬"

    # game/script.rpy:22093
    old "Wh...!"
    new "什……！"

    # game/script.rpy:22094
    old "Out of nowhere, I saw a hand gripping a knife swing toward me.{w} My heart didn't have time to stop before I began to see the motion slowly. Without being able to give it any thought, I turned my whole body around as fast as possible."
    new "一只握着刀的手不知从何处朝我劈来。{w}我甚至来不及心惊，那动作就已在我眼中慢了下来。顾不上思考，我用尽全力扭转身子。"

    # game/script.rpy:22099
    old "I felt a breeze at my side from the swipe whiffing and looked up to witness Shiroya's expression progressively changing to a terrified mask. As fast as my worn-out body let me, I bolted to her and grabbed her hand, running the opposite direction."
    new "刀锋落空，一阵风从我身侧掠过。我抬起头，只见 Shiroya 的神情一点点化作惊恐。我以这具疲惫身躯所能达到的最快速度冲到她身边，抓住她的手，朝反方向狂奔。"

    # game/script.rpy:22102
    old "Hm...!"
    new "唔……！"

    # game/script.rpy:22106
    old "We ran as fast as possible and began to hear a third person coming from behind us. We were being chased."
    new "我们拼命奔跑，随即听见身后传来第三个人的动静。有人正在追我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:22112
    old "The distance between us and the attacker was minimal. While we desperately sprinted, we saw the elevator and the floor 4 staircase in front of us."
    new "我们与袭击者之间的距离近得可怕。我们拼命冲刺，前方出现了电梯和通往四楼的楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:22113
    old "I was certain we weren't going to have time to open the elevator and use it before being caught. The staircase was our single option."
    new "我很清楚，在对方追上之前，我们来不及打开电梯坐进去。楼梯是唯一的选择。"

    # game/script.rpy:22117
    old "I fully focused on running as hard as I could, tightly gripping Shiroya's hand. Without a doubt, the person we heard behind us had tried to kill me."
    new "我全神贯注地拼命奔跑，紧紧握着 Shiroya 的手。毫无疑问，身后那人是真的想杀我。"

    # game/script.rpy:22121
    old "Before we reached the stairs, I let go of her hand and prayed we could go up fast enough. Halfway up, the crisp steps below us let us know the attacker hadn't given up and would continue to chase us."
    new "还没跑到楼梯，我就松开了她的手，只盼我们能爬得够快。爬到一半时，下方清晰的脚步声告诉我们，袭击者并未放弃，还会继续追来。"

    # game/script.rpy:22125
    old "My heart began to race faster than I'd ever felt it. Despite how unreal it seemed, the idea that someone around us wanted our death had proven correct. As soon as we reached the higher floor, we took off again."
    new "我的心跳快得前所未有。尽管难以置信，但「身边的人想要我们死」这个想法果然被证实了。一登上更高一层，我们立刻又跑了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:22127
    old "I looked to my side, ensuring that Shiroya was still okay. She met my look with terror, not a trace of wooziness remaining in her. What had we done, and why had we been attacked? A myriad of similar questions flooded my mind as we kept running through the straightaway."
    new "我朝身旁看去，确认 Shiroya 安然无恙。她满脸恐惧地回望我，先前那股昏沉已荡然无存。我们究竟做了什么？为什么会遭到袭击？类似的疑问涌进我的脑海，而我们仍在笔直的走廊上不停地跑。"

    # game/script.rpy:22128
    old "Even though the bathrooms could be locked from the inside, Katei said that his key opened all of them. We were most definitely being chased by his killer, who could've picked it up or could go back to the security room to do so.{w} Entering the partitions would only doom us too. Instead, with the distance between us and our attacker beginning to extend, we did our best not to slow down for even a second."
    new "卫生间的门虽然可以从里面反锁，但 Katei 说过，他的钥匙能打开每一间。追我们的十有八九就是杀他的凶手——那把钥匙，对方可能已经捡走，也可能回监控室去取。{w}躲进隔间只会让我们也送命。眼下我们和对方的距离正渐渐拉开，我们拼尽全力，一秒也不敢放慢。"

    # game/script.rpy:22133
    old "Let's go to the attic...!"
    new "去阁楼……！"

    # game/script.rpy:22134
    old "In a hoarse voice, I let out what I'd intended to be reassurance. I'd realized our only chance relied on the attic: the key should've still been there, so if we could keep the same pace until we arrived at the door, we'd have enough time to lock ourselves inside."
    new "我用沙哑的嗓音喊了一句，本意是想让她安心。我已明白，我们唯一的生路就在阁楼——钥匙应该还在那里，只要保持这个速度撑到门前，就有时间把自己反锁在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:22138
    old "Once more, we forced our exhausted bodies up the floor 5 staircase while the adrenaline's effect started to wear off. I desperately needed to slow down, but I pushed myself more than I'd ever thought I could. I wasn't going to die; I rejected that thought more than anything."
    new "肾上腺素的效力开始消退，我们又一次拖着精疲力竭的身体爬上通往五楼的楼梯。我非常想慢下来喘口气，却逼着自己跑得比任何时候都拼命。我不能死——这个念头，我比什么都抗拒。"

    # game/script.rpy:22144
    old "I grabbed Shiroya's hand again and sprinted toward the offices. We hadn't come to the tower to die! It had been the complete opposite!"
    new "我再次抓住 Shiroya 的手，朝办公区飞奔。我们来这座塔，可不是为了送命！恰恰相反！"

    # game/script.rpy:22145
    old "Almost four hours remained, and the footfalls behind us continually warned us how badly someone wanted us dead. Despite their lower speed, they were still running."
    new "还剩将近四个小时，身后的脚步声不断提醒我们，有人多么迫切地想要我们的命。对方速度虽然不快，却始终没有停下奔跑。"

    # game/script.rpy:22149
    old "We had to go to the attic—that was our only way to survive. Somehow, the culprit had a knife."
    new "必须去阁楼——那是我们唯一活下去的办法。不知为何，凶手手里有刀。"

    # game/script.rpy:22150
    old "As soon as I considered how nonsensical that was, a flash of Erina's death came to me. There had been a bloodstain on her chest, and although we hadn't inspected it, the same knife had surely taken her life."
    new "我刚想到这有多荒谬，Erina 死时的景象便闪过脑海。她胸口有一处血迹，虽然我们没细看，但多半就是同一把刀夺走了她的性命。"

    # game/script.rpy:22154
    old "The last staircase we'd have to power through was in reach. Shiroya's body began to tremble as a sign of how much she'd pushed herself to escape from the danger of death."
    new "我们最后要咬牙冲过去的那段楼梯已经近在眼前。Shiroya 的身体开始发抖，那是她为了活命拼尽全力的迹象。"

    # game/script.rpy:22155
    old "Only one more... We'll lock ourselves up in the attic!"
    new "只剩一段了……我们进阁楼，把门锁上！"

    # game/script.rpy:22156
    old "My mind started to feel numb as soon as I spat out some words. She nodded almost imperceptibly while the terrifying echo of our persistent attacker refused to fade."
    new "我勉强挤出几个字，脑子就开始发麻。她几不可察地点了点头，而身后紧追不舍的凶手那可怕的脚步声始终没有消散。"

    # game/script.rpy:22162
    old "I stepped up the stairs, unable to match our prior pace. Our bodies couldn't withstand much more.{w} As much as I tried to keep up for just a few more seconds, my legs were barely responding. Seeing how the same thing was happening to Shiroya, I feared that our lack of sleep would finally catch up to us."
    new "我迈上楼梯，却已经跟不上先前的速度。我们的身体撑不了多久了。{w} 我拼命想再撑几秒，双腿却几乎不听使唤。看到 Shiroya 也是同样的样子，我担心睡眠不足终于要拖垮我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:22163
    old "I hadn't been able to see the body of the attacker, but there weren't many options. They were chasing us with a knife, so we weren't going to die without knowing our killer's identity."
    new "我没能看清袭击者的身形，但可能的人选并不多。对方拿着刀追我们，我们绝不能连凶手是谁都不知道就死在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:22168
    old "We stepped onto the sixth floor and resumed what could no longer be called running, but a forced stagger. Fortunately, our pursuer seemed to be in similar shape, as they hadn't used our exhaustion to catch up despite their continuous, audible steps."
    new "我们踏上六楼，继续向前，但那已经称不上奔跑，只能勉强踉跄着前进。所幸追赶者似乎也好不到哪里去——脚步声虽然一直清晰可闻，对方却没能趁我们力竭追上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:22177
    old "It's still there!"
    new "还在！"

    # game/script.rpy:22181
    old "The attic's door was open, and I could see the shining key placed in it. Merely wishing not to faint, we forced a last sprint as we heard the noise behind us growing louder."
    new "阁楼的门开着，我能看见那把闪亮的钥匙插在上面。我们只求别昏过去，拼命做最后的冲刺，身后的声响却越来越大。"

    # game/script.rpy:22187
    old "My body had already given out, but thankfully too late to spell disaster for me. I took the key and entered the narrow staircase with Shiroya right behind me. As fast as I could, I shut the door and inserted the key in the inner keyhole. With a trembling hand, I turned and locked it. As soon as the tumbler clicked, I stopped trying to control my body and collapsed between the two walls."
    new "我的身体早已到了极限，好在垮得够晚，没有酿成灾难。我取下钥匙，钻进狭窄的楼梯间，Shiroya 紧跟在后。我尽快关上门，把钥匙插进内侧的锁孔，用发抖的手转动钥匙上了锁。锁芯咔哒一响，我便再也撑不住，瘫倒在两侧墙壁之间。"

    # game/script.rpy:22191
    old "...Are you okay?"
    new "……你没事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:22199
    old "We spent a full minute catching our breath, during which no other sound reached our ears. Even though we'd achieved our only available goal, in instance that whoever it was had another key to the attic, there'd be nothing we could do."
    new "我们花了一整分钟才喘匀气，这期间再没有别的声音传进耳朵。虽然我们达成了唯一可行的目标，但万一对方也有一把阁楼的钥匙，我们便无计可施了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22201
    old "I-I'm fine... Let's go up."
    new "我、我没事……上去吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:22204
    old "I stood up as soon as I felt able to. Still staggering, we began walking up the stairs to distance ourselves as much as possible from the door. The culprit hadn't even tried to open it after chasing us the entire way up, which made it all even more unsettling."
    new "觉得能动了，我便站了起来。我们依旧踉跄着往楼梯上走，尽量离那扇门远一些。凶手一路追到这里，却连试着开门都没有，这反倒更加令人不安。"

    # game/script.rpy:22211
    old "You didn't see their face, right?"
    new "你没看到对方的脸吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:22216
    old "No... I only saw a knife coming out of the corridor, and I think their sleeve was black. They must've had it hidden somewhere."
    new "没有……我只看到一把刀从走廊那边伸出来，袖子的颜色好像是黑的。对方一定是把刀藏在了什么地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:22217
    old "I'm not sure... but it could only be Akaro or Sai. I found out earlier that I run faster than Sai, which I very much doubt is the case with Akaro..."
    new "我不确定……但只可能是 Akaro 或 Sai。我之前发现自己跑得比 Sai 快，但要是 Akaro，我恐怕就未必跑得过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22222
    old "It... has to be him, then."
    new "那……就只能是他了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22223
    old "I didn't know what to think. Someone had really tried to take my life when I had done nothing. Was I a threat, or were they just a psychopath...? If it was Sai, I couldn't honestly decide."
    new "我不知道该怎么想。我什么都没做，却真的有人想要我的命。是我碍了谁的事，还是对方根本就是个疯子……？如果那人是 Sai，我实在无法判断。"

    # game/script.rpy:22225
    old "I don't know, but we might be safe here."
    new "我不知道，不过待在这里也许安全。"

    # game/script.rpy:22226
    old "I looked by my feet. No new footprints had been left since the last time we'd looked at the floor."
    new "我低头看了看脚边。自从上次查看地面以来，没有新的脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:22227
    old "There's supposed to be only one key for this place, but who can really tell... Duplication is a trivial matter at this point."
    new "这里按理说只有一把钥匙，可谁知道呢……到了这一步，复制一把根本不算什么难事。"

    # game/script.rpy:22228
    old "At least if they haven't made a duplicate yet, they won't be able to do it now. We could be all right..."
    new "至少，如果他们还没复制，现在也做不到了。说不定我们真的没事……"

    # game/script.rpy:22231
    old "I'm... not sure. If this is the same culprit who's been using the Sekimeiya all this time, I'm certain they'd have a way to replicate the key even if we have it with us.{w} If it's Sai, he could go back to the past and replicate his body during a time he was holding it."
    new "我……没把握。如果对方就是一直使用 Sekimeiya 的那个凶手，那就算钥匙在我们手上，他多半也有办法复制一把。{w} 要是 Sai 的话，他只要回到过去，在自己还拿着钥匙的时候复制身体就行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22232
    old "The pale fear projected on her face for a single instant was more than soul-crushing. I'd been with her for so many years and never seen anything like it—not even recently."
    new "她脸上一瞬间闪过的惨白恐惧，几乎要把人的心都碾碎。我和她相识这么多年，从没见过她这样——就连最近这段日子也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:22233
    old "That was why I didn't voice the much more frightening way the culprit could make their way in. By traveling from the future, they could deliberately materialize themselves in the attic if their location was simply based on a time they'd been there."
    new "所以我没有说出那个更可怕的潜入方式。如果传送的位置只取决于过去待过的某个时间，凶手就能从未来穿越过来，直接让自己出现在阁楼里。"

    # game/script.rpy:22234
    old "Let's make sure we're alone."
    new "确认一下这里是不是只有我们吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:22235
    old "Yeah..."
    new "嗯……"

    # game/script.rpy:22236
    old "No matter who the attacker had been, two people would still be unaccounted for between Sai, Akaro, and the other Shiroya. We'd been in the attic just a couple minutes earlier, but it wasn't impossible that someone else had also been present at the time."
    new "不管袭击者是谁，Sai、Akaro 和另一个 Shiroya 三个人里，总还有两个人下落不明。几分钟前我们就在阁楼里，当时还有别人在场也并非不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:22243
    old "We quietly walked around while a piercing feeling invaded my chest. Erina and Katei had recently died. I was barely able to accept it, and their killer had shifted to targeting us, the last people remaining."
    new "我们悄声在阁楼里查看，一阵刺痛涌上胸口。Erina 和 Katei 刚刚死去，我几乎还无法接受，而杀害他们的凶手已经把目标转向了我们——最后活着的两个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:22244
    old "I truly hoped that, at {time=21}, the police would come. I needed to get out with Shiroya at that time. There was no way I could make it even a second longer without breaking down."
    new "我真心盼着{time=21}警察能来。我必须在那时和 Shiroya 一起离开这里。再多撑一秒，我都会崩溃。"

    # game/script.rpy:22248
    old "...My heart still racing, I went to the hallway through the kitchen and looked at the storeroom while Shiroya stayed in the corner. After I'd seen the empty bathroom, we'd isolated the two bedrooms."
    new "……我心跳还没平复，便穿过厨房走进走廊，查看储藏室，Shiroya 留在角落。确认卫生间没有人之后，我们要查的就只剩两间卧室了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22255
    old "I'll go up the ladder. Stay here."
    new "我爬梯子上去看看，你待在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:22259
    old "She came to the two parallel doors and watched me while I climbed up the ladder in the rightmost bedroom. I was easily able to confirm nobody was hiding."
    new "她来到那两扇并排的门前，看着我爬上最右边卧室的梯子。我很容易就确认了里面没人藏着。"

    # game/script.rpy:22264
    old "I repeated the process in the opposite one to conclude that we were the only people in the attic."
    new "我在对面那间照做了一遍，最终确定整座阁楼里只有我们两个。"

    # game/script.rpy:22269
    old "Shiroya joined me inside. Our lives were at risk of being cut short, but we couldn't do anything else. She sat on a bed, knowing that we were possibly in the path of an unstoppable force."
    new "Shiroya 也进了房间。我们的性命随时可能被夺走，却别无他法。她坐在床上，心里明白我们也许正挡在一股无法阻挡的力量面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:22282
    old "No...!"
    new "不……！"

    # game/script.rpy:22283
    old "But life took no pity on us. Before we could speak any words, a heart-stopping sound came from the hallway. Through a terrified whisper, Shiroya's raw anguish tore at the foundations of my will. The sound had made it clear: we were dealing with the real culprit, who had been able to enter our makeshift fortress. Trying to escape was futile."
    new "可命运并未怜悯我们。我们还没来得及开口，走廊里就传来一声令人心脏骤停的响动。Shiroya 发出一声惊恐的低语，那赤裸的绝望几乎撼动了我意志的根基。那声音已经说明了一切：我们面对的是真正的凶手，对方能够闯进我们临时搭起的堡垒。逃跑已经没有意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:22284
    old "But I couldn't think of anything else. During the few seconds in which the approaching footsteps grew louder, only a single course of action came to me."
    new "可我再也想不出别的办法。在那脚步声越来越近的几秒里，我脑中只浮现出一个选择。"

    # game/script.rpy:22289
    old "The key...! We need to lock ourselves in again!"
    new "钥匙……！得再把自己锁起来！"

    # game/script.rpy:22290
    old "An equally terrified whisper came from within me. I rushed to the drawers, where the key to the bedroom should've been. The bedroom we were in didn't have a chain, and crossing the hallway was too risky."
    new "我也发出了一声同样惊恐的低语。我冲到抽屉前，卧室的钥匙本该放在那里。我们所在的卧室没有门链，穿过走廊又太过冒险。"

    # game/script.rpy:22291
    old "What!?{w} It's not here!"
    new "什么！？{w} 不在这儿！"

    # game/script.rpy:22294
    old "The bathroom's door was opened and closed; the culprit was searching for us. Within my panic, I remembered it. Sai had tried to use that bedroom's key to unlock the opposite door, and we hadn't seen where he left it afterward."
    new "卫生间的门被打开又关上，凶手正挨个房间搜寻我们。慌乱之中，我想起来了——Sai 曾用那间卧室的钥匙去开对面的门，之后我们没看见他把钥匙放在了哪儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:22298
    old "Another door was opened. It wasn't ours, but the one in front, leading to the bedroom where we'd spent more than an hour locked inside."
    new "又有一扇门被打开了。不是我们这扇，而是前面那扇通往卧室的门——我们曾在里面被锁了一个多小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:22299
    old "Fuck! We could shut the culprit inside with the key, but entering to get it might be too dangerous."
    new "该死！我们本可以用钥匙把凶手关在里面，可要进去拿钥匙，未免太冒险了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22300
    old "...We need to leave!"
    new "……我们得走了！"

    # game/script.rpy:22301
    old "As I said that, I took my shoes off and gestured at Shiroya to quickly do the same. We'd been able to hear the approaching culprit because of their shoes. Without them, walking on wood would be almost imperceptible."
    new "话音未落，我便脱下鞋，示意 Shiroya 也赶紧照做。我们能听见凶手逼近，是因为他们穿着鞋。赤脚踩在木地板上，几乎听不出声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:22307
    old "I looked through the door and heard movements coming from the other bedroom. We didn't have much time. Shiroya and I nodded at each other and left while making the least amount of noise possible, holding our shoes with our hands."
    new "我透过门缝张望，听见另一间卧室里传来动静。时间不多了。我和 Shiroya 对了个眼神，手里拎着鞋，尽可能不出一点声地离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:22311
    old "We approached the living room and began to increase our speed. The culprit had somehow entered the attic, but we didn't know their method. If they'd taken the elevator, it was likely still there, but we couldn't afford the risk of waiting for it to arrive."
    new "接近客厅时，我们加快了脚步。凶手不知怎么进了阁楼。如果是乘电梯上去的，电梯多半还停在那儿，可我们冒不起等它下来的风险。"

    # game/script.rpy:22316
    old "Without giving it much thought, we entered the living room. As soon as we did, the dry noise of footsteps on wood froze us in place again."
    new "我们没多想，便踏进了客厅。刚进去，木地板上那干涩的脚步声又让我们僵在了原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:22317
    old "They were coming to us. Instead of entering the other bedroom, very faint footsteps were approaching the living room, where we were."
    new "他们朝我们来了。那极轻的脚步声没有进另一间卧室，而是直奔我们所在的客厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:22318
    old "Wait."
    new "等等。"

    # game/script.rpy:22323
    old "Wh...?"
    new "什……？"

    # game/script.rpy:22324
    old "No, we can't rush out.{w} We might be going up against Sai, and he wouldn't let us escape like this. If he entered the attic with another key, he could be luring us to the staircase."
    new "不，不能就这么冲出去。{w} 对手也许是 Sai，他不会让我们这样轻易脱身。如果他另有一把钥匙进了阁楼，那多半是在把我们往楼梯口引。"

    # game/script.rpy:22327
    old "We'd been so desperate that I'd left our key on the floor, next to the attic door. If Sai had managed to enter and then locked the door... If he'd also picked up our key, we couldn't leave, and we would just corner ourselves by walking down the stairs."
    new "方才情急之下，我把钥匙落在了阁楼门边的地板上。要是 Sai 已经进去了，又把门锁上……要是他顺手捡走了我们的钥匙，我们就出不去了，顺着楼梯往下走，只会把自己逼进死角。"

    # game/script.rpy:22328
    old "I glanced down and saw footprints that didn't belong to us. Our pursuer had definitely walked across the carpet after our arrival."
    new "我低头一看，地毯上有不属于我们的脚印。追我们的人，确实是在我们到达之后才踩过这块地毯。"

    # game/script.rpy:22329
    old "The terror locked my muscles in place. While the sound got closer, I began to explore the thought of attacking the culprit as soon as they entered the living room."
    new "恐惧让我的身体动弹不得。脚步声越来越近，我开始盘算：等凶手一进客厅，就扑上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:22330
    old "Fuck! Why didn't I think about this!? They have a knife, and I can't just tell Shiroya to help me!"
    new "该死！我怎么没想到这一点！？对方手里有刀，我又不能直接叫 Shiroya 来帮我！"

    # game/script.rpy:22333
    old "W-We can't go that way."
    new "不、不能往那边走。"

    # game/script.rpy:22334
    old "She'd been telling me to hurry up with her eyes, but that could've sealed our fates. I grabbed her available hand and dashed to the kitchen."
    new "她一直用眼神催我快点，可那会要了我们的命。我攥住她空着的那只手，直奔厨房。"

    # game/script.rpy:22335
    old "What are you doing...!?"
    new "你干什么……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:22340
    old "Trying to leave through the main door didn't sound right, but we might've already been done for. The only other way out, the elevator, was no guarantee either.{w} The person behind us had waited a couple minutes before making their entrance, so if they'd used that time to disable the elevator below us, we were completely trapped."
    new "从大门出去似乎行不通，可我们或许早已无路可走。另一个出口就只有电梯，同样未必靠得住。{w}身后那人等了几分钟才现身，要是他们利用那段时间弄停了我们下面的电梯，我们就彻底被困死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22341
    old "From the kitchen, we heard the living room's door being opened. We had to make our move."
    new "厨房里，我们听见客厅的门被推开了。必须行动了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22343
    old "If they look at the footprints, it's possible they could see that we're in the kitchen. We have to get out of here."
    new "要是他们看脚印，说不定能看出我们躲在厨房。得马上离开这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:22345
    old "But a different thought came to me. If they recognized the footprints and anticipated our actions, they could wait in the hallway, knowing we'd immediately leave.{w} It was too late, as I'd already grabbed Shiroya's hand, and I wasn't able to stop mine from turning the handle of the door."
    new "可我又想到另一种可能。如果对方认出了脚印，料准了我们的行动，就会守在走廊里，等着我们自投罗网。{w}已经太迟了——我早已抓住 Shiroya 的手，也停不下自己转门把手的手。"

    # game/script.rpy:22353
    old "The hallway was empty, but we could see the open door to the living room. With very little time to think, I could only come up with two courses of action."
    new "走廊空无一人，但客厅那扇敞开的门看得清清楚楚。留给思考的时间太少，我只想出两条路。"

    # game/script.rpy:22354
    old "Do we go to the other bedroom where we can lock the door, or do we try to use the elevator!?"
    new "是去另一间卧室把门锁上，还是赌一把电梯！？"

    # game/script.rpy:22355
    old "I couldn't decide. Once again, I considered that we were potentially up against Sai, who'd taken some time to think up a strategy specifically so that we couldn't run away. He would have thought far enough ahead to disable the elevator below us."
    new "我拿不定主意。我再次想到，对手很可能是 Sai——他特意花时间谋划，就是为了让我们逃不掉。他一定早已想到要弄停我们下面的电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:22356
    old "But... he just left the bedroom, and earlier, I put the key inside the drawer where we'd found it. What if he just took it, and going there will trap us as well?"
    new "可是……他刚从卧室出来，而先前我把钥匙放回了我们找到它的那个抽屉里。万一他顺手把钥匙拿走了，那我们过去，也一样是自投罗网？"

    # game/script.rpy:22357
    old "We had the chain, but it was unreliable. We'd seen how Akaro burst through it in five seconds. Not only that, but even though we were supposed to possess the single key to the attic, someone had managed to make their way in. The same thing could repeat in the bedroom.{w} Earlier, Akaro and Sai had escaped with its key, and we knew they'd then activated the Sekimeiya in some way. It was possible they'd produced a spare key already."
    new "我们有门链，但那靠不住。我们都见过 Akaro 只用五秒就撞断了它。更何况，阁楼的钥匙本该只有一把、就在我们手里，却还是有人闯了进去。同样的事也可能在卧室重演。{w}先前 Akaro 和 Sai 带着卧室的钥匙逃走，而我们知道他们随后以某种方式启动了 Sekimeiya。说不定他们早已配出了一把备用钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:22360
    old "L-Let's try the elevator. Trying to call it is all we can do. If it doesn't come, we'll have to leave."
    new "还、还是试试电梯吧。能做的也只有把它叫上来。要是它不来，我们就只能离开这里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22366
    old "My heartbeat running wild inside my ears almost drowned out our voices. The culprit hadn't entered the kitchen, meaning that they were either in the living room or the staircase. We'd have to pass through the open door to get to the elevator, so we had to hope they'd gone down the stairs and wouldn't see us."
    new "我耳边狂跳的心跳声几乎盖过了我们的说话声。凶手没有进厨房，说明他们要么在客厅，要么在楼梯间。要去电梯，就必须经过那扇敞开的门，只能指望他们已经下了楼，不会看见我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:22374
    old "In an instant, we were on the other side. I'd been able to glance through the door and seen an empty living room."
    new "转眼之间，我们已到了另一侧。我趁隙往门里瞥了一眼，客厅空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:22378
    old "We sped up toward the elevator, but I stopped myself as soon as I remembered something."
    new "我们加快脚步奔向电梯，可我刚想起什么，便立刻收住了脚。"

    # game/script.rpy:22384
    old "W-Wait... Th-This could be bad."
    new "等、等等……这、这下不妙了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22385
    old "Everything carried the threat of a trap, and even though we were in close proximity to a killer, we had to attempt to think rationally. We'd been instinctively running away to gain time, but we knew that was utterly pointless if every place was in reach of them. There was one goal we could strive for."
    new "处处都可能是陷阱。纵使凶手近在咫尺，我们也必须冷静思考。我们一直凭本能逃跑，只为争取时间，可只要任何地方都在对方的掌握之中，这样做就毫无意义。我们还有一个目标可以去争取。"

    # game/script.rpy:22386
    old "The noise behind us resumed. Again, the culprit was approaching."
    new "身后的声响又起。凶手再次逼近。"

    # game/script.rpy:22387
    old "We don't have time to run to the elevator and hope it's either here or functioning. This is definitely a trap."
    new "我们没时间跑去电梯，再指望它正好停在这儿还能用。这绝对是个陷阱。"

    # game/script.rpy:22393
    old "I opened the storeroom and dashed inside."
    new "我拉开储藏室的门，闪身冲了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:22398
    old "Through the gap of the door, we could see the hallway. The sound of the culprit's movements still reached our ears, but it had become too hard to discern the way they were going."
    new "透过门缝，能看见走廊。凶手的动静仍传进耳中，却已难以分辨他们朝哪个方向去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22400
    old "They're not coming here."
    new "他们没往这边来。"

    # game/script.rpy:22401
    old "I think it's very possible that after we left the event room, the Sekimeiya was taken out. We have to rely on that and try to find it since we don't have the key to open the cabinet."
    new "我觉得很可能在我们离开活动室之后，Sekimeiya 就被人取走了。我们只能按这个推断去找它——毕竟没有展示柜的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:22402
    old "If we find it, we can choose a place to stay hidden until we're unavoidably found. Then, we can activate it.{w} If we go far into the past, we won't be able to think of ambushing the culprit knowing where they'll be since it'd contradict them finding us, but we could make it outside the tower if we're lucky enough.{w} If we travel to the recent past, we could find a new place to hide that this person had just looked at. It'd only be buying us more time, but it's better than having to confront someone with a knife or keep exhausting ourselves."
    new "找到它，我们就能选个地方藏起来，一直撑到不得不被发现为止，然后再启动它。{w}若是回到很久以前，我们就不能靠知道凶手的行踪去埋伏——那样就和他们找到我们这件事相矛盾了，不过运气好的话，也许能跑到塔外去。{w}若是回到不久前，我们就能另找一处他刚刚搜过的地方藏身。那也不过是多拖些时间，但总好过跟一个拿着刀的人正面相对，或者把自己累垮。"

    # game/script.rpy:22403
    old "This has to work. On the third floor, our attacker was by the offices' corner and not in the staircase next to the elevator. That was either to watch us from afar or prevent us from going down to the crystal floor; they wanted to chase us up instead of down."
    new "这次一定要成。在三楼时，袭击者守在办公室拐角，而不是电梯旁的楼梯间。那要么是为了远远盯着我们，要么是为了阻止我们下到水晶层——他们想逼我们往上跑，而不是往下。"

    # game/script.rpy:22408
    old "...Eventually, every sound faded away, and we could only hear our shaking breaths. In the cramped storeroom, we had to prepare for what our next and most important move would be."
    new "……到最后，所有声响都消失了，只剩下我们颤抖的呼吸。在这狭小的储藏室里，我们必须想好下一步——也是最关键的一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:22409
    old "Why are they not moving anymore...? Are they waiting for us?"
    new "他们怎么不动了……？是在等我们出去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:22416
    old "Should we try to call the elevator?"
    new "要不要试着叫电梯？"

    # game/script.rpy:22417
    old "N-No. I remembered how this all started when I stopped myself.{w} We were going down with the elevator and stopped on floor 3 because someone called it knowing we were inside. No matter who this is, at this point, they must've thought of disabling the elevator under us so that we can't use it to escape."
    new "不、不行。我刚要动，就想起了这一切是怎么开始的。{w}当时我们乘电梯下行，却在三楼停下，因为有人明知我们在里面，还是按了电梯。不管对方是谁，到了这一步，他们一定已经想到，要让我们下面的电梯停住，叫我们没法靠它逃跑。"

    # game/script.rpy:22418
    old "If we called the elevator anyway and it came, it would definitely be a trap and they intend to do the same thing as before. As soon as we go down, they could call it.{w} The last time, they waited next to the offices, but this time, I'm sure they'd be right outside to make sure we can't continue moving.{w} Think about it, it's also possible we're dealing with both Akaro and Sai. If one of them is on a floor under us, they could be hoping we take the elevator and lose any way out."
    new "就算我们按了，电梯真的上来，那也一定是个陷阱，他们打算故技重施。我们一旦下去，他们就能把电梯叫走。{w}上次他们守在办公室旁边，这一次，我敢肯定他们会直接守在门外，确保我们没法再移动。{w}你想想，对手也可能是 Akaro 和 Sai 两个人。只要其中一人在我们下面的楼层，他们就可能巴不得我们坐电梯，好让我们彻底断了退路。"

    # game/script.rpy:22419
    old "But there's nothing else we can do, is there...?"
    new "可我们也没别的办法了吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:22421
    old "Assuming the elevator hasn't been used again... it should still be on floor 3. If the culprit, or one of them, is waiting next to the floor 6 elevator and we call it from here, they'd hear it going up. Then, they'd know we'd be about to board it and use it, so they could call it to intercept us."
    new "假设电梯没再被人用过……应该还停在3楼。要是犯人——或者他们中的某个人——正守在6楼电梯旁，而我们从这里叫梯，他们就会听见电梯升上去的动静。这样一来，他们便知道我们打算乘梯，可以先叫走电梯，截断我们的路。"

    # game/script.rpy:22428
    old "I was experiencing the most unsettling silence possible. Waiting in the storeroom wasn't an option, so I could only find three:{w} trying to use the elevator to go down, trying to lock ourselves in a bedroom, and trying to leave the attic through the main door."
    new "我从未体会过如此令人不安的寂静。守在储藏室不是办法，我能想到的只有三条路：{w}乘电梯下楼，躲进卧室反锁房门，或者从正门离开阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:22429
    old "The person outside wasn't moving. They could've been close by or far away. Regardless, it was certain they'd thought of a course of action to apprehend us."
    new "外面的人没有动静。他可能近在咫尺，也可能早已退远。但无论远近，他一定已经想好了抓我们的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:22435
    old "Why would they have stopped searching for us when it's certain we're in the attic?{w} ...It could mean they're working alone. If they quit looking and want to ambush us instead, it could mean nobody is working with them. Their partner would've taken care of that while the other kept trying to find us."
    new "明知我们就在阁楼里，他们为什么停止搜索了？{w}……也许说明他们只有一个人。如果对方不再找人，转而打算伏击我们，那就可能没有同伙。若有同伙，本该一个继续搜，另一个去准备伏击。"

    # game/script.rpy:22436
    old "So, where are they waiting? No matter who we're dealing with, they aren't stupid: they must've grabbed the bedroom key just now, so going there is too obvious of a mistake."
    new "那么，他们究竟守在哪里？不管对手是谁，对方都不蠢：刚才肯定顺手拿走了卧室钥匙，所以我们要是去卧室，就成了再明显不过的失误。"

    # game/script.rpy:22437
    old "If the elevator is working, it means they have a contingency for us going down. It sounds illogical, but trying to walk out could be the best idea."
    new "如果电梯还能用，就说明他们早就防着我们下楼这一手。听起来不合常理，但直接从正门走出去，或许反而是最好的选择。"

    # game/script.rpy:22438
    old "It doesn't make sense to think they're just outside of the storeroom, waiting for us to leave. That implies they know we're somewhere around here, and if they did, they would be rushing in. After all, they were opening every room earlier..."
    new "说他们就在储藏室外等我们出去，讲不通。那等于他们知道我们就在附近；若真知道，早就冲进来了。毕竟刚才他们还在一间间地开门……"

    # game/script.rpy:22439
    old "Therefore, for some reason, they might've left the attic. Even though we're exhausted, we're also faster than them. We should be able to run away again if they see us on a floor below, where there's more space."
    new "所以，出于某种原因，他们可能已经离开阁楼了。我们虽然筋疲力尽，但速度仍比他们快。要是在下面楼层更开阔的地方被看见，应该还能再逃掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:22442
    old "I thought about going to a bedroom to pick up a screwdriver. It was the only weapon I could think of, but I abandoned the thought. It was no match against a knife, and the more I thought about it, the more I felt that going back to a bedroom was a bad idea.{w} Furthermore, if the person chasing us had taken the key, they would probably have taken such an obvious weapon as well."
    new "我想过去卧室拿螺丝刀。那是我唯一能想到的武器，但很快打消了这个念头。它敌不过刀，而且越想越觉得，折回卧室不是个好主意。{w}再说，追我们的人既然拿走了钥匙，多半也不会漏掉这么显眼的武器。"

    # game/script.rpy:22443
    old "...Let's go. We'll try to leave through the main entrance."
    new "……走吧。我们试着从正门出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:22448
    old "Shiroya responded with a confused look, but she didn't object. We had to hope that, out of the few options we had, one would let us live. I wasn't confident I'd picked the correct one, but that applied to all of them."
    new "Shiroya一脸困惑地看了我一眼，却没有反对。我们只能指望，在仅有的几条路里，总有一条能让我们活下来。我没有把握自己选对了，但换作其他几条，我也同样没把握。"

    # game/script.rpy:22455
    old "We stepped into the hallway, praying that the faint noise our feet produced wasn't being conveyed to the attacker."
    new "我们走进走廊，祈祷脚下那点细微的声响不会传到袭击者耳中。"

    # game/script.rpy:22459
    old "Every corner made my heart stop, and my senses were on higher alert than they'd ever been. Knowing a knife could suddenly swing at any time, we took short steps forward until we saw the entire empty hallway."
    new "每经过一个转角，我的心都会骤然一紧，感官也绷到了从未有过的极限。明知刀锋随时可能从某处劈来，我们只能小步向前，直到整条空荡的走廊尽收眼底。"

    # game/script.rpy:22463
    old "But our terror couldn't subside yet. Silently, I peeked into the living room and let out a long-coming breath as soon as I saw it empty."
    new "但我们的恐惧还没有消退。我悄悄往客厅里看了一眼，见里面空无一人，才吐出憋了许久的一口气。"

    # game/script.rpy:22464
    old "Okay, we need to leave."
    new "好，我们得走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22468
    old "The tension I felt when I found myself in the middle of the living room was unlike anything I'd ever experienced. There were three doors someone could suddenly appear through. We paid attention to everything in our surroundings until the staircase came into view."
    new "当我站到客厅中央时，那种紧张感是我从未经历过的。那里有三扇门，随时可能有人从某扇门后出现。我们留意着周围的一切，直到楼梯出现在视野里。"

    # game/script.rpy:22473
    old "Nobody was there, but I knew I had to look for something else."
    new "那里没有人，但我知道自己还得去确认另一样东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:22474
    old "That's our key..."
    new "那是我们的钥匙……"

    # game/script.rpy:22478
    old "On the floor, the key we'd used to lock ourselves in showed that the culprit hadn't taken it."
    new "地上躺着我们反锁房门时用的那把钥匙——看来犯人并没有把它拿走。"

    # game/script.rpy:22479
    old "We can leave, at least."
    new "至少，我们能离开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22483
    old "Making it to wherever the Sekimeiya was still felt like the single goal we could attempt to achieve. We started to walk down at the same time. At the bottom, I crouched to pick up the key, but midway through, I realized we wouldn't need it to leave: the door wasn't closed."
    new "赶到 Sekimeiya 所在的地方，仍像是我们唯一能尝试达成的目标。我们一同动身下楼。到了楼下，我蹲身去捡钥匙，弯到一半却意识到出门根本用不上它：门并没有关。"

    # game/script.rpy:22484
    old "Look. This settles it. They have another key for this door, and that's how they entered."
    new "看吧。这下就说得通了。他们有这扇门的另一把钥匙，就是这么进来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:22485
    old "While they could've teleported inside and unlocked the door with our own key, they wouldn't have left it behind. I reached for the door and began to push it from a distance so that I'd be able to quickly turn around if someone was behind it."
    new "他们确实可能直接传送进来，再用我们的钥匙开门，但那样就不会把钥匙留下。我伸手够到门，尽量离得远些，慢慢把门推开，这样万一门后有人，我也能立刻转身。"

    # game/script.rpy:22495
    old "...But nobody was. The barren scenery of floor 6 felt almost harmless, although nothing would've made us fully lower our guard."
    new "……但门后没有人。6楼那片空旷的景象几乎显得无害，不过无论看到什么，我们都不可能真正放下戒备。"

    # game/script.rpy:22501
    old "Wait, one second."
    new "等等，稍等一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:22505
    old "Shiroya turned around and grabbed the attic key from the floor. Then, from the outside, she locked it."
    new "Shiroya转身从地上捡起阁楼钥匙，然后从外面把门锁上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22512
    old "If they're still inside and disabled the elevator, I just locked them in. If they already left, they might think we locked ourselves inside again."
    new "要是他们还在里面，而且把电梯弄停了，我这一锁就把他们关在阁楼里了。要是他们已经离开，说不定会以为我们又把自己反锁在里面了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22516
    old "It was a good idea. She put the key in her purse, and attaching ourselves to the left wall, we picked up a fairly brisk pace, intending to reach the crystal floor."
    new "这主意不错。她把钥匙放进手提包，我们贴着左墙，加快脚步，打算前往水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:22522
    old "Every floor was packed with perilous turns where our attacker could've been waiting, and I found it very likely they were near an elevator door, expecting us to use it at any point."
    new "每一层都布满危险的转角，袭击者可能就藏在某处；而我觉得，对方很可能守在电梯门旁，等着我们随时去乘电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:22530
    old "We circled through the entire sixth floor and went down the first staircase. We still had our shoes in our hands, so we were making the least amount of noise possible. Unfortunately, the strong echo amplified our steps enough to nullify the effect."
    new "我们绕过整层6楼，从第一段楼梯下去。鞋还提在手里，我们已经尽量不发出声音。可不幸的是，强烈的回声把脚步声放大，这点小心完全白费了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22540
    old "Running through floor 5, I thought of what we'd do if the Sekimeiya hadn't been taken from the cabinet. Unable to undo our own lock, we'd be done for. Going to the security room to try and get Katei's bathroom key would be the last thing we could depend on. However, it was very likely the killer had taken it."
    new "跑过5楼时，我想到，要是Sekimeiya并没有被人从展示柜里拿走，我们该怎么办。自己上的锁解不开，那就只有死路一条。去监控室试着拿Katei的浴室钥匙，就是我们最后的指望了。然而，凶手极有可能已经把它拿走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22549
    old "We made it to floor 4. We continually made a series of turns moving down through the building; meanwhile, I kept trying to force out the thought that any of those plain walls could be the last thing we ever saw."
    new "我们到了4楼。穿行下楼时，我们不断拐过一个又一个弯；与此同时，我一直努力把那个念头压下去——这些平平无奇的墙壁，随时可能成为我们此生最后见到的景象。"

    # game/script.rpy:22562
    old "{w=0.6}The same knife, the same breeze at my side... After leaving the partitions, as if the culprit had teleported behind me, I saw another missed swing that was incredibly close to taking my life. It had happened again—a sudden ambush."
    new "{w=0.6}又是那把刀，又是身侧那阵风……绕过隔板后，犯人仿佛传送到了我身后，我又一次看见挥空的刀锋，离夺走我的性命只差毫厘。又来了——又一次突袭。"

    # game/script.rpy:22568
    old "Shiroya let out a cry at my side. We didn't stop running, but something had taken my desire to react. That time, I saw it."
    new "Shiroya在我身旁惊叫出声。我们没有停下脚步，可我却莫名没了反应的心思。这一次，我看清了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22569
    old "The hand gripping the knife—and a wristwatch."
    new "握着刀的那只手——还有一块手表。"

    # game/script.rpy:22570
    old "Then, the voice of the person who'd tried to kill me broke out and resounded through the entire floor."
    new "接着，那个试图杀我的人的声音骤然响起，回荡在整层楼中。"

    # game/script.rpy:22575
    old "{w=0.7}\"Atsuki! {w=0.5}You son of a bitch!\"{w=1.1}{nw}"
    new "{w=0.7}「Atsuki！{w=0.5}你这王八蛋！」{w=1.1}{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:22583
    old "Sai's voice echoed in my mind. Without stopping, we turned our heads around to see an enraged expression full of malice. Then, he took off behind us, knife in hand."
    new "Sai的声音在我脑中回荡。我们没有停步，只回头望去，看见一张写满恶意的狰狞面孔。紧接着，他提着刀追了上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:22589
    old "The chase resumed. Shiroya and I sprinted as fast as we could toward the staircase to floor 3 while I reeled at the fact that it had actually been Sai.{w} Why... and why then? His face had made it clear that trying to ask would be our end."
    new "追逐再次开始。我和Shiroya拼命朝通往3楼的楼梯跑去，而我的脑中仍嗡嗡作响：追来的人竟然真的是Sai。{w}为什么……又为什么偏偏是那时候？他的表情已经说明，开口去问就是死路一条。"

    # game/script.rpy:22590
    old "However, as soon as I forced my body to move, it rejected me. I understood there was no way I could run for much longer, and the same surely applied to Shiroya. As we headed toward the staircase, I thought of something."
    new "然而，我刚强迫身体迈开步子，身体便立刻发出抗议。我明白自己撑不了多久，Shiroya想必也一样。就在奔向楼梯的途中，我想到了一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:22594
    old "Sai's pretty far behind... It's very likely the elevator is still on floor 3, just under the stairs, since Shiroya called it before we were attacked. If it is, we might be able to get in before he can catch us this time."
    new "Sai已经被甩开很远……电梯很可能还停在3楼，就在楼梯下方——毕竟遇袭前Shiroya叫过电梯。如果真是这样，这次我们或许能在他追上之前进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:22595
    old "It sounded feasible. As soon as we got to the lower floor, we could attempt to open the elevator. If Sai had disabled it, it was likely still there. We'd concluded that he probably entered the attic through the main door, meaning that it wasn't in the attic."
    new "这听起来可行。一到下面那层，我们就可以试着打开电梯。如果Sai让电梯停用了，它多半还停在那里。我们已经推断出他大概是从正门进的阁楼，也就是说，电梯并不在阁楼里。"

    # game/script.rpy:22596
    old "It was risky, but our bodies were on the verge of giving up, our lives balanced on a knife's edge."
    new "这样做有风险，但我们的身体已濒临极限，性命也悬在一线。"

    # game/script.rpy:22601
    old "Even if Akaro's working with Sai, as long as the elevator is here, that shouldn't be a problem... If Sai's really working with him, what's likely is that Akaro was the one to go to the attic while Sai waited here to ambush us."
    new "就算Akaro和Sai是一伙的，只要电梯在这里，应该就不成问题……如果Sai真和他联手，最可能的情况是Akaro去了阁楼，而Sai留在这里伏击我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:22602
    old "The way it happened, I imagined Sai was hiding inside the first partition, waiting for us to pass by.{w} We began to speed down the stairs while I tried to decide on what to do. Sai hadn't started to chase us until he'd yelled my name, which had created enough distance between us to seriously consider the elevator."
    new "从当时的情形看，我想Sai是躲在第一道隔板后，等我们经过。{w}我们加快脚步下楼，我一边盘算接下来该怎么办。Sai直到喊出我的名字才开始追，这段距离足够我们认真考虑电梯这条路。"

    # game/script.rpy:22603
    old "Despite that, it still felt off. Our attacker was Sai—not many things slipped by him. The elevator wasn't particularly fast, but most importantly... would he really let us use it? Even though we could outrun him at full speed, trying and failing to open the elevator was time we didn't know we had, considering we weren't going to be able to keep running for long."
    new "尽管如此，我还是觉得不对劲。袭击者是Sai——很少有事情能逃过他的眼睛。电梯并不算快，但最关键的是……他真的会让我们用电梯吗？即便全速奔跑能甩开他，可万一试着开电梯却失败，耗掉的时间我们根本浪费不起；毕竟我们撑不了多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:22613
    old "Try to enter the elevator."
    new "试着进电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:22616
    old "Continue running down."
    new "继续往下跑。"

    # game/script.rpy:22635
    old "This universe will be frozen, and that will permit its observation. A universe that would collapse if set in motion."
    new "这个宇宙将被冻结，唯其如此才能被观测。一个一旦运转起来便会崩溃的宇宙。"

    # game/script.rpy:22653
    old "Ultimately, just before stepping onto the third floor, Atsuki changed his mind. He was exhausted, and at that point, the elevator seemed safe."
    new "到头来，就在即将踏上三楼时，Atsuki改了主意。他实在太累，而在那一刻，电梯似乎更安全。"

    # game/script.rpy:22656
    old "One second! I'll try to open the elevator!"
    new "等一下！我来试着打开电梯！"

    # game/script.rpy:22657
    old "Shiroya had also been thinking about it, but she hadn't thought that Atsuki would attempt to use it."
    new "Shiroya也考虑过这件事，但没想到Atsuki会试着使用电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:22658
    old "It was next to the staircase, so it didn't take him very long to confirm it: the elevator was still on the third floor, and it hadn't been disabled. He opened it, and its empty interior came into their view."
    new "电梯就在楼梯旁，因此他没花多久便确认了情况：它仍停在三楼，也没有被停用。他打开电梯门，空荡荡的轿厢映入两人眼中。"

    # game/script.rpy:22659
    old "All right, get in!"
    new "好，快进去！"

    # game/script.rpy:22663
    old "Before Sai could catch them, both of them boarded the elevator. They had enough time to press a button, but that was yet another decision to make. They looked at the panel and decided to touch one of the eight available buttons."
    new "趁Sai还没追上，两人便钻进了电梯。他们还来得及按下一个按钮，可这又是一个必须做出的选择。他们看向按钮面板，决定按下八个可用按钮中的一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:22672
    old "Go back to the attic and lock yourselves in a bedroom."
    new "回到阁楼，把自己锁进卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:22673
    old "Change of Mind"
    new "改变主意"

    # game/script.rpy:22680
    old "Atsuki's plan was simple. He wanted to take advantage of the distance they'd gained from Sai."
    new "Atsuki的计划很简单。他想利用他们与Sai之间拉开的距离。"

    # game/script.rpy:22681
    old "Perhaps they could trick him. He thought they were going to continue running down, so if they went back up, Sai might've thought they'd already turned toward the offices. In addition, they knew the elevator couldn't be heard if it arrived at or left the floor one was on."
    new "也许能骗过他。Sai以为他们会继续往下跑，所以要是他们折返上楼，他说不定会以为他们已经转向办公室那边了。况且他们清楚，电梯抵达或离开自己所在的楼层时，根本听不到声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:22688
    old "With eyes almost closed, Atsuki waited a few seconds so that Sai would have time to arrive and miss the sound. Meanwhile, he reached into Shiroya's purse to grab the attic key and used it to unlock the floor 7 button, which he confidently pressed."
    new "Atsuki几乎闭着眼等了几秒，好让Sai赶到时电梯的声响已经过去。与此同时，他把手伸进Shiroya的手提包，取出阁楼钥匙，用它解开了7楼按钮的锁，然后笃定地按了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:22689
    old "But what was really crossing Atsuki's mind? Had that been the plan he'd designed and decided on? Sai must've known the elevator was available, and using it would've ceased their echoing footfalls. At his side, Shiroya couldn't help but be confused by the action he'd chosen to take."
    new "可Atsuki心里究竟在想什么？这真是他设计并定下的计划吗？Sai一定知道电梯还能用，而一旦乘上电梯，他们回荡的脚步声便会消失。在他身旁，Shiroya不禁对他选择的做法感到困惑。"

    # game/script.rpy:22692
    old "I hate that it's come to this, but we can't escape from Sai for more than three hours. We have to put all our faith in locking ourselves up in a bedroom."
    new "我很不愿事情变成这样，可我们躲Sai撑不过三个小时。现在只能指望把自己锁进卧室这一招了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22693
    old "Shiroya was speechless at his sudden change, but she couldn't object to him. She decided not to reply and trusted the decision her oldest friend had made to save both of their lives."
    new "Shiroya被他突然的转变惊得说不出话，却也无法反对。她决定不再多言，选择相信这位相识最久的朋友，相信他这样做是为了保住两人的性命。"

    # game/script.rpy:22698
    old "Up there, we'll set the chain and physically prevent the door from opening. Even if Sai has the key, he won't be able to break the door down. In case he enters... we can try to use something to defend ourselves."
    new "上去以后，我们把门链挂好，从里面把门死死挡住。就算Sai有钥匙，他也撞不开门。万一他真进来了……我们也能试着拿东西自卫。"

    # game/script.rpy:22699
    old "They had seen Sai's murderous expression and felt how strongly he'd desired their eradication. Even though the physical demand was high, keeping a chained door from opening was much more reasonable than perpetually running away."
    new "他们见过Sai那副杀意毕露的表情，也感受过他有多想除掉他们。尽管很耗体力，但用门链挡住门不让它打开，总比永无止境地逃跑更现实。"

    # game/script.rpy:22706
    old "The elevator stopped and began to slowly open its doors. The trip had created a great deal of tension that was released when they burst out of it. They were back in the hallway they'd just escaped from, but they'd shifted their goal."
    new "电梯停了下来，门缓缓打开。这一趟下来，他们紧张到了极点，直到冲出电梯才松了口气。他们又回到了刚刚逃离的那条走廊，但目标已经改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:22712
    old "They ran, ignoring the turns they'd previously handled with care. They wanted to enter the bedroom, which they began to see as their only salvation."
    new "他们拔腿就跑，不再像先前那样小心绕过拐角。他们只想冲进那间卧室——在他们看来，那已是唯一的救赎。"

    # game/script.rpy:22715
    old "Both open doors were in sight. Only the right one possessed a chain, so they didn't hesitate over which one to enter. Running, the lack of friction between Atsuki's socks and the wooden flooring almost made him trip, but he managed to steady himself. Shiroya made her way in first and immediately shut the door as soon as Atsuki joined her."
    new "两扇敞开的门都映入眼帘。只有右边那扇挂着门链，所以他们毫不犹豫地选择了它。奔跑时，Atsuki的袜子踩在木地板上几乎没什么摩擦，险些让他摔倒，但他还是稳住了身子。Shiroya先一步进去，等Atsuki一跟进来，便立刻关上了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:22718
    old "On the left side of the door, the chain began to swing in response to the abrupt slam. As Atsuki hurried to check the drawers, Shiroya's trembling arm set the chain, recalling how unreliable it had been in the past."
    new "门被猛地摔上，左侧的门链随之晃动起来。Atsuki急忙去翻抽屉，Shiroya则用发抖的手扣上门链，一边想起这东西过去有多不牢靠。"

    # game/script.rpy:22723
    old "Do you see the key?"
    new "你看到钥匙了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:22726
    old "Atsuki remembered. He had left it in the top drawer of the stand."
    new "Atsuki想起来了。他把钥匙放在了抽屉柜最上面那层抽屉里。"

    # game/script.rpy:22728
    old "\"Yes!\" He let out a cry of joy when he saw that {tip=key}it hadn't been taken{/tip}. Their chances of surviving had just drastically increased."
    new "“找到了！”看到{tip=key}钥匙没有被拿走{/tip}，他欣喜地喊出声来。他们活下来的几率顿时大增。"

    # game/script.rpy:22733
    old "But nothing had been settled. While holding the key, the nightmarish sound of a bursting door struck Atsuki's ears. When he turned around, he saw Shiroya's body being knocked away."
    new "可一切还没有尘埃落定。他握着钥匙，门被撞开的声响如噩梦般传来。回头时，他看见Shiroya的身体被撞飞出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:22739
    old "Past the door, the terrifying silhouette of Sai paralyzed Atsuki's mind. The knife was still gripped in his right hand, and as soon as he saw Atsuki's defeated expression, Sai grinned."
    new "门后，Sai那骇人的身影让Atsuki的脑子一片空白。他右手仍紧握着刀，一看到Atsuki那副认命的表情，便咧嘴笑了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22740
    old "On the floor, Shiroya yelled desperately, but Sai ignored her. He began to approach Atsuki, who stared at him in regret. He hadn't even had time to grab the screwdriver."
    new "Shiroya倒在地板上拼命喊叫，Sai却置若罔闻。他朝Atsuki逼近，而Atsuki只是悔恨地望着他。Atsuki甚至没来得及去拿螺丝刀。"

    # game/script.rpy:22743
    old "\"Stop!\"{w} Shiroya cried again, but anything she could say was meaningless to Sai, who was certain of her fate."
    new "“住手！”{w}Shiroya再次喊道，可她说什么对Sai都已毫无意义——他早已认定她难逃一死。"

    # game/script.rpy:22745
    old "Atsuki's hands let go of his shoes, and he made his first step backward, inevitably backing himself into the wall. When he made eye contact with his killer, he noticed Sai had a bit of blood in his mouth. Such trivial information had become utterly pointless, but he thought that blood might've dripped off him some time in the past."
    new "Atsuki松开了手里的鞋，第一次向后退了一步，结果不可避免地把自己逼到了墙边。与杀自己的人对上视线时，他注意到Sai嘴边沾着一点血。这种无关紧要的信息此刻已毫无用处，但他还是想，那血或许是之前从Sai身上滴落的。"

    # game/script.rpy:22746
    old "He made no attempt at putting that information to use. His mind had broken down, and he couldn't move. He'd realized his reckless action had resulted in not only his own death, but Shiroya's."
    new "他根本没打算利用这条信息。他的思绪已经崩溃，身体也动弹不得。他意识到，自己的鲁莽不仅害死了自己，也害死了Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:22747
    old "She placed her hand on the floor and attempted to stand up. Wasting no time, she launched herself toward Sai, whose murderous aura had spoken every needed word."
    new "她把手撑在地上，试图站起来。她毫不迟疑，朝Sai扑了过去；Sai浑身散发的杀意已经说明了一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:22753
    old "Once again, she was ignored, and instead, Sai dashed forward. ...Atsuki had no time to even react."
    new "她又一次被无视，Sai却向前冲去。……Atsuki连反应的时间都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:22760
    old "When he looked down, he saw the knife had pierced through his stomach. \"So this is how being stabbed feels\". Such a ridiculous thought was all that crossed his mind. The sensation surprised him; it hadn't been as painful as he'd expected."
    new "他低头看去，刀已经刺穿了他的腹部。“原来被刺中是这种感觉。”他脑中闪过的竟只有这个荒唐的念头。那感觉让他意外——并没有他预想中那么疼。"

    # game/script.rpy:22764
    old "But his body crumpled down, unable to keep supporting itself. From a lower perspective, he saw that Sai's face had become even more warped. Behind him, Shiroya's fell into disrepair. She reached for Atsuki, but Sai did not allow it."
    new "可他的身体再也支撑不住，瘫倒下去。从更低的位置望去，他看到Sai的脸扭曲得更厉害了。他身后，Shiroya的脸也彻底垮了。她伸手想够Atsuki，Sai却不允许。"

    # game/script.rpy:22765
    old "Mercilessly, he moved his arm in an arc, drawing a long horizontal cut through Shiroya's chest. Inwardly, Atsuki cried in anguish.{w} But Sai frowned. After instinctively reacting to Shiroya's attempt at aiding Atsuki, he looked at his second victim in disbelief."
    new "他毫不留情地挥臂划出一道弧线，在Shiroya胸前横着划开一道长长的口子。Atsuki在心里痛苦地嘶喊。{w}可Sai却皱起了眉。他本能地对Shiroya救助Atsuki的举动做出反应，随后难以置信地看向自己的第二个受害者。"

    # game/script.rpy:22767
    old "\"{tip=pendulum}What...?{/tip}\" He sounded surprised, but soon snapped out of it. Before Atsuki could make a last effort at understanding why they'd had to be finished off like that, Sai jumped back at him and stabbed him a second time."
    new "“{tip=pendulum}什么……？{/tip}”他的声音里透着惊讶，但很快便回过神来。Atsuki还来不及拼尽最后的力气想明白他们为何非得这样被了结，Sai便又扑了回来，第二次刺中了他。"

    # game/script.rpy:22768
    old "And then a third, and a fourth... All of them felt much more painful, but he couldn't move. \"You brought this on yourself, you fucking idiot!\"{w} Those words were received as static noise. An irreversible cloudiness began to fill Atsuki's consciousness, and eventually, his brain stopped interpreting the splashes of blood that every stab produced, shortly cutting off forever."
    new "接着是第三刀、第四刀……每一刀都比之前疼得多，可他已经动弹不得。“这是你自找的，你这该死的蠢货！”{w}那些话落进他耳中，只剩一片杂音。不可逆转的混沌开始充满Atsuki的意识；最终，他的大脑不再去辨认每一刀溅起的血，很快便彻底停止了运作。"

    # game/script.rpy:22769
    old "Ending: Pendulum"
    new "结局：钟摆"

    # game/script.rpy:22797
    old "Stay inside the elevator."
    new "留在电梯里。"

    # game/script.rpy:22798
    old "Self-Causality"
    new "自我因果"

    # game/script.rpy:22807
    old "When Atsuki ran down through all the buttons, he realized there was one he hadn't considered. Above the others, a red button with the word \"Stop\" immediately grabbed his attention."
    new "Atsuki扫过所有按钮后，意识到自己漏掉了一个。其余按钮上方，一个写着“停止”的红色按钮立刻吸引了他的注意。"

    # game/script.rpy:22812
    old "The stop button! We'll be safe if we lock ourselves in here!"
    new "停止按钮！只要把自己锁在这里面，我们就安全了！"

    # game/script.rpy:22817
    old "Shiroya's eyes widened in amazement. Both of them had failed to recall its existence.{w} They thought back on Katei's words. He'd told them that if the button was pressed while the elevator was moving, only an entity from outside the tower could enable it again."
    new "Shiroya惊讶地睁大了眼睛。两人都忘了还有这个按钮。{w}他们回想起Katei的话。他说过，如果电梯运行时按下那个按钮，就只有塔外的人才可能让它重新启动。"

    # game/script.rpy:22819
    old "Before Sai had time to arrive and open the door, Atsuki rushed to press the floor 4 button. That was solely done to begin motion, since stopping it while stationary might've left the outer button functional."
    new "趁Sai还没来得及赶来开门，Atsuki急忙按下四楼按钮。这么做只是为了先让电梯动起来，因为若在静止时按下停止按钮，外面的按钮说不定仍能使用。"

    # game/script.rpy:22821
    old "As soon as they departed the third floor, Atsuki pressed the stop button. Without any delay, the whole structure abruptly ceased moving and kept itself suspended between the third and fourth floors."
    new "他们刚离开三楼，Atsuki便按下停止按钮。整个电梯结构毫无迟滞地骤然停住，悬在三楼与四楼之间。"

    # game/script.rpy:22824
    old "There we go... It worked!"
    new "好……成功了！"

    # game/script.rpy:22830
    old "Both of them breathed with relief. An inaccessible elevator in the middle of an inaccessible tunnel; they'd reached the safest position within the tower."
    new "两人松了一口气。一部外人也无法靠近的电梯，停在同样无法进入的通道中央；他们已抵达塔内最安全的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:22831
    old "Like Katei said, no connection with the outside occurred because it's something the alarm disabled. We'll have to wait until the front door opens to be rescued, but that's more than okay."
    new "就像 Katei 说的，外界之所以联络不上，是因为警报把通讯切断了。我们只能等正门打开后才能获救，不过这样已经足够好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22832
    old "Shiroya agreed with a faint voice. They knew they had slightly more than three hours to go, and a narrow elevator was all the space they had. Deciding to rest as best they could, they put their shoes on and let their bodies drop until they sat on the floor."
    new "Shiroya 轻声应下。两人知道还剩三个小时多一点，而身边只有这部狭窄的电梯。他们决定尽量休息，于是穿上鞋，任由身体滑下去，坐到地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:22846
    old "After the elevator had stopped, not the faintest external sound had been heard. Their bodies were still tired, so despite the long wait, they knew they could wait through it with ease. Leaning on opposite corners, they let their bodies loosen, starting to feel their heartbeats slowing down."
    new "电梯停稳后，外面再没传来半点声响。两人的身体依旧疲惫，所以哪怕等待漫长，他们也知道熬过去并不难。他们各靠在相对的两个角落里，任由身体松下来，渐渐觉得心跳慢了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:22847
    old "Both of them wanted to talk to the other, but didn't do so. Instead, they used their imaginations to explore what they'd do after escaping."
    new "两人都想和对方说些什么，却都没有开口。他们只是在脑海里想象，逃出去之后要做些什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:22848
    old "Shiroya had been living in Atsuki's house for a week, and they'd never set an end date. She hoped she could stay with him for a little bit longer without being a bother.{w} In the meantime, Atsuki's mind kept going to what they'd talked about hours previously. It had been so long since they'd visited their old cabin that he really felt a strong desire to go back there with her."
    new "Shiroya 已经在 Atsuki 家住了一个星期，两人却从未定下期限。她希望能再多留一阵子，又不至于给他添麻烦。{w} 与此同时，Atsuki 的思绪一直绕着几小时前他们谈过的事打转。他们已经太久没去过那座旧小屋了，他实在很想再和她回去看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:22849
    old "But he knew what had been happening around them. He knew that, for some reason, Sai wanted them dead. He'd somehow acquired a knife and abused the Sekimeiya's powers. It was very unlikely he could reach their position, but depending on his true motives, the chase might've continued even after exiting the tower."
    new "但他清楚他们周遭正发生着什么。他知道，不知出于什么原因，Sai 想要他们的命。他不知从哪弄来一把刀，还滥用 Sekimeiya 的力量。他很难追到他们所在的位置，但要看他的真实动机，这场追逐或许在离开塔之后仍会继续。"

    # game/script.rpy:22850
    old "After all, it appeared the cameras hadn't been working, and with the aid of the Sekimeiya, Sai could've known how to avoid being caught by the police. Even if they'd outsmarted him once, it was impossible to be at peace yet."
    new "毕竟，监控似乎一直没有工作，而借助 Sekimeiya，Sai 也许知道该如何避开警方的追捕。就算他们曾智胜他一次，现在也远远不能安心。"

    # game/script.rpy:22854
    old "Minutes started to pass. Not a thing had reached their ears, but as they were between two floors, it was unlikely even a loud sound could have."
    new "时间一分一分过去。他们什么也没听见，但他们正卡在两层楼之间，就算外面有再大的声响，也未必传得进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:22855
    old "Every now and then, they'd raise their heads to check on each other. It was impossible to keep a comfortable position, so they continued slightly adjusting themselves."
    new "每隔一会儿，他们就抬起头看看对方。无论怎么坐都不舒服，两人便不时微微调整姿势。"

    # game/script.rpy:22856
    old "As soon as Atsuki realized that he was still thirsty, he knew he wouldn't be able to get it out of his mind. He was about to attempt some small talk by saying it, but stopped himself, as it could've made Shiroya feel the same way."
    new "Atsuki 一意识到自己还是渴，就知道这个念头会一直缠着他。他本想拿这件事随口聊两句，却又忍住了，因为那可能会让 Shiroya 也觉得渴。"

    # game/script.rpy:22857
    old "A few more minutes went by. Atsuki didn't know how long they'd been in the elevator. Without a watch, and given how tired they were, it was far too difficult to tell. Any range from ten to twenty minutes seemed possible to him."
    new "又过了几分钟。Atsuki 不知道他们在电梯里待了多久。没有手表，加上身体疲惫，实在很难判断。十分钟到二十分钟，似乎都有可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:22860
    old "But... a sudden, dark atmosphere began to creep up on them."
    new "可是……一股阴郁的气氛突然向他们袭来。"

    # game/script.rpy:22861
    old "With a broken sense of time, Atsuki remembered one of the most mysterious events they'd experienced. They had listened to a recording that had claimed the exit would never open... that the alarm's effects would be permanent."
    new "时间感已经错乱，Atsuki 想起了他们经历过的最离奇的事情之一。他们听过一段录音，说出口永远不会打开……说警报的影响会一直持续。"

    # game/script.rpy:22862
    old "When he'd made the rushed decision of activating the emergency stop function of the elevator, he hadn't thought of it. If it was legitimate, nobody was going to let them out.{w} When the thought came to him, Atsuki's heart began to speed up again."
    new "他匆忙决定按下电梯的紧急停止按钮时，并没有想到这一点。如果那段录音是真的，就没人会放他们出去。{w} 这个念头一冒出来，Atsuki 的心脏又开始狂跳。"

    # game/script.rpy:22866
    old "Had Shiroya thought of it? He couldn't tell her. In less than a minute, the claustrophobic sensation had begun to invade Atsuki's body."
    new "Shiroya 想到了吗？他不敢对她说。不到一分钟，幽闭感便开始侵入 Atsuki 全身。"

    # game/script.rpy:22869
    old "Yes, don't worry."
    new "嗯，别担心。"

    # game/script.rpy:22870
    old "Shiroya noticed he'd started to take deeper and faster breaths. Their decision was irreversible, but the process to learn if it had been the correct one was what began to assault Atsuki."
    new "Shiroya 注意到他的呼吸开始变得又深又急。他们的决定已无法撤回，而真正折磨 Atsuki 的，是等待验证这个决定是否正确的过程。"

    # game/script.rpy:22871
    old "Had his finger already sealed their fate? He didn't know how much longer they'd have to wait to find out. Atsuki began to sweat nervously as he imagined the terrifying scenarios they could've already caught themselves in."
    new "那根手指是否已经替他们定下命运？他不知道还要等多久才能知道答案。Atsuki 想象着他们可能已经陷入的可怕境地，紧张得开始冒汗。"

    # game/script.rpy:22872
    old "How long until {time=21}? If they could be sure that point in time would mark the end to their suffering, reaching it wouldn't be an issue. As soon as Atsuki had thought of the not-unlikely worst scenario, though, every second had begun to feel unbearable."
    new "距离 {time=21} 还有多久？如果能确定那个时刻就是痛苦的终点，熬到那时也不成问题。然而，Atsuki 一想到最坏的情况并非不可能发生，每一秒都开始变得难以忍受。"

    # game/script.rpy:22876
    old "Would they die inside the elevator if help never came? It should've been impossible. After all, if the recording was legitimate and they'd spend a month in the tower, it must've also been true that Atsuki would survive until it occurred."
    new "如果救援始终不来，他们会死在电梯里吗？按理说不可能。毕竟，如果那段录音是真的，他们要在塔里待上一个月，那么 Atsuki 也一定能活到那一刻。"

    # game/script.rpy:22877
    old "...However, what about Shiroya? She hadn't been mentioned in it."
    new "……可是，Shiroya 呢？录音里没有提到她。"

    # game/script.rpy:22878
    old "Atsuki was used to feeling betrayed by his own mind. Shiroya had been wearing a neutral expression, but if nothing had happened in three hours... what kind of expression would she have? Would he be the only one to survive after seeing his friend deteriorate?"
    new "Atsuki 早已习惯被自己的思绪背叛。Shiroya 一直面无表情，可如果三小时后什么也没发生……她会露出怎样的表情？难道他会眼睁睁看着朋友衰弱下去，最后只有自己活下来？"

    # game/script.rpy:22879
    old "The rational part of him denied it: there was no food anywhere, and none of them could survive for so long. Yet, he couldn't relieve any of his worries."
    new "他理智的一面否定了这个念头：这里根本没有任何食物，他们谁都不可能撑那么久。可即便如此，他还是没法减轻半点忧虑。"

    # game/script.rpy:22883
    old "He stood up and stretched his body as much as he could. Maintaining the verbal silence, he sat back down. His mind begged for noise, the lack of anything else happening driving him mad."
    new "他站起身，尽可能伸展身体。他依旧没有说话，又坐了回去。他的脑子渴望听到些声响，周围却什么也没发生，这快把他逼疯了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22884
    old "He wasn't sure how much longer they had to wait for... Perhaps they'd been inside for half an hour. As much as he wanted the time to pass, he knew an inevitable time would come: almost {time=21.}"
    new "他不确定他们还要等多久……也许他们已经在里面待了半个小时。他虽盼着时间快点过去，却也知道那个无可避免的时刻终将到来：将近 {time=21.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:22887
    old "The uncertain period of time in which nothing would be known. Was it past {time=21}, and they were already doomed? Was the way out about to unlock? ...How could they know?"
    new "那是一段什么都无法确定的时间。是不是已经过了 {time=21}，他们早已注定无救？出口是不是马上就要解锁了？……他们又怎么可能知道？"

    # game/script.rpy:22888
    old "If it was truly never going to open... when would they know it? Would they have to wait for six hours before being sure that their perception of time hadn't shattered?"
    new "如果出口真的永远不会打开……他们又要到什么时候才能确定？难道要等上六个小时，才能确认自己的时间感没有错乱？"

    # game/script.rpy:22895
    old "He didn't know what to think. Nearby, Sai might've been trying to find a way to kill them. Could it be that he wouldn't let the exit open precisely to achieve that?"
    new "他不知道该作何感想。Sai 也许就在附近，正想办法杀掉他们。会不会他正是为了这个目的，才不让出口打开？"

    # game/script.rpy:22896
    old "The tendency Atsuki had to overthink everything made for the perfect paranoid mind. Beyond everything, thinking about a reality in which they'd be trapped there forever, sharing a long and agonizing end while he could only blame himself, was the most petrifying conclusion he could imagine."
    new "Atsuki 凡事都爱想太多，这性子让他格外容易疑神疑鬼。他能想象到的最可怕结局，就是两人永远被困在这里，一起熬过漫长而痛苦的最后时光，而他只能责怪自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:22898
    old "And it wouldn't occur.{w} He had spent the past few minutes with his eyes closed when he opened them after a sudden noise."
    new "而这一切并没有发生。{w} 过去几分钟他一直闭着眼睛，直到一声突如其来的响动让他睁开眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:22911
    old "He looked up. A knife had been stabbed into his chest, one gripped by a hand. When it was taken out, blood began to pour out of him, wetting his shirt."
    new "他抬起头。一把刀已经刺进他的胸口，刀柄握在一只手里。刀被拔出时，鲜血从他体内涌出，浸湿了衬衫。"

    # game/script.rpy:22912
    old "A cold and simultaneously hot pain invaded his whole torso. He couldn't comprehend what had happened and looked at the blood in disbelief."
    new "一股又冷又热的疼痛侵入他整个躯干。他无法理解发生了什么，难以置信地看着鲜血。"

    # game/script.rpy:22915
    old "Then, his gaze turned to Shiroya's expression. It was one he'd never seen on her."
    new "随后，他的目光落到 Shiroya 的脸上。那是他从未在她脸上见过的神情。"

    # game/script.rpy:22916
    old "His mind fell into disarray as he frantically looked around the cramped space. He couldn't believe what he was seeing. The situation was so laughable that he couldn't bring himself to scream or utter a word."
    new "他的思绪陷入混乱，发疯似的环视这个狭小的空间。他无法相信眼前的景象。这情形荒唐得可笑，他竟连喊一声、说一句话都做不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:22924
    old "Flickering shreds of sound began to fill his ears while his sight blackened. \"No, why...?\" Those words echoed within himself, unable to be released."
    new "断续的细碎声响开始灌入耳中，视野逐渐发黑。「不，为什么……？」这句话在体内回响，却怎么也吐不出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:22925
    old "He opened his eyes to confirm it one more time: indeed, what he saw was a senseless nightmare. Every scenario he'd thought of had been erased."
    new "他睁开眼，想再确认一次：没错，他看到的是一场毫无道理的噩梦。他此前设想的每一种情形都被抹去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:22926
    old "Atsuki felt a disconnect from reality, as if his body had been hijacked. Without the strength to resist, he gave out on keeping hold of himself, and as soon as he collapsed to the ground, his consciousness burst like a bubble."
    new "Atsuki 感到自己与现实脱了节，仿佛身体已被他人夺走。他没有力气抵抗，再也撑不住自己；刚一倒在地上，意识便像泡沫般破灭。"

    # game/script.rpy:22928
    old "Ending: Personal Paradox"
    new "结局：个人悖论"

    # game/script.rpy:22954
    old "Catch-22"
    new "第二十二条军规"

    # game/script.rpy:22963
    old "Entering the elevator was too risky; that was my final conclusion. There was no way Sai hadn't prepared for it."
    new "进电梯太冒险了——这是我最后的结论。Sai 不可能没为此做准备。"

    # game/script.rpy:22967
    old "We set foot on the third floor. I glanced at my right and saw the shut elevator. That meant it probably hadn't been disabled, giving off a further feeling of a trap. I saw the bathrooms again as well."
    new "我们踏上了三楼。我往右边一瞥，看见电梯门紧闭。那大概说明电梯并没有被停用，反而更让人觉得是个陷阱。我又看见了那些洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:22971
    old "We had the opportunity to lock ourselves inside one, but I doubted the inner lock would be able to withstand the force of someone turning a key from outside. Ignoring both options, we continued running forward."
    new "我们本有机会把自己锁进其中一间，但我怀疑里面的锁根本挡不住有人从外面用钥匙开门。我把这两个选择都抛在脑后，继续向前跑。"

    # game/script.rpy:22975
    old "Sai had probably been waiting for us inside the first partition of the previous floor, so running next to them was hair-raising. Behind us, Sai's noisy attempts at catching up began growing audible throughout the entire floor. We had to put the distance between us to good use."
    new "Sai 很可能就等在我们上一层的第一间隔间里，所以从旁边跑过时，我吓得头皮发麻。身后，Sai 追赶时弄出的声响渐渐传遍整层楼。我们必须好好利用拉开的距离。"

    # game/script.rpy:22983
    old "When we arrived on the second floor, my limbs began to tremble, pushed harder than I had ever expected."
    new "到达二楼时，我的四肢开始发颤，它们承受的负荷远超出我的预料。"

    # game/script.rpy:22984
    old "W-W-We should probably go to the... event room... to s-see if the Sekimeiya's still there."
    new "我、我们最好去……活动室……看、看看 Sekimeiya 还在不在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:22988
    old "Shiroya didn't react to what I said, but we continued to make our way through the floor.{w} There was another reason we had to target the event room: if Sai was our only attacker, for as long as we circled in and out of it, we wouldn't be caught. Of course, we couldn't do that for the remaining three hours, but it was better than putting ourselves in a corner."
    new "Shiroya 没有回应我的话，但我们继续穿过这一层。{w} 我们非去活动室不可，还有另一个原因：如果袭击者只有 Sai，那么只要我们在活动室里外绕圈子，就不会被他抓住。当然，剩下三个小时不可能一直这样，但总比把自己逼进角落要好。"

    # game/script.rpy:22993
    old "The final staircase was just ahead of us. We'd begun to slow down, but Sai hadn't been able to close the distance between us. We could hear his footsteps still descending the previous flight of stairs."
    new "最后一段楼梯就在前方。我们的速度已经慢了下来，但 Sai 始终没能缩短我们之间的距离。还能听见他的脚步声，他仍从上一段楼梯上往下追。"

    # game/script.rpy:22997
    old "When we crossed the door in the middle of the staircase, we saw the floor of hallway A. Without hesitating, we kept running toward the door in the middle."
    new "我们穿过楼梯中段的那扇门，A走廊出现在眼前。我们没有迟疑，继续朝正中的门跑去。"

    # game/script.rpy:23006
    old "There was another drop of blood... on the floor of hallway C."
    new "C走廊的地板上又有一滴血……"

    # game/script.rpy:23008
    old "It looked recent too..."
    new "看上去也是刚留下不久的……"

    # game/script.rpy:23009
    old "Had someone been occasionally bleeding small drops for two hours...? I had no time to wonder about it as I pushed open the door in front of us."
    new "难道这两个小时里，一直有人断断续续地在滴血……？我没空多想，推开了面前的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:23016
    old "In the dark room, the covered cabinet appeared camouflaged by the walls. Drawn by its overwhelming aura, I grabbed the bottom of the curtain and lifted it."
    new "昏暗的房间里，蒙着布的展示柜几乎与墙壁融为一体。那股压倒性的气息吸引着我，我抓住遮布的下摆，将它掀了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:23021
    old "Really...?"
    new "真的……？"

    # game/script.rpy:23026
    old "What do we do?"
    new "我们该怎么办？"

    # game/script.rpy:23027
    old "The Sekimeiya was behind the glass. Neither the mysterious Shiroya nor Sai had taken it."
    new "Sekimeiya 就在玻璃后面。无论是神秘的 Shiroya 还是 Sai，都没有把它取走。"

    # game/script.rpy:23029
    old "I tried to open it, which confirmed that our lock was still in effect. Only the key would deliver the Sekimeiya back to us, and Akaro or Sai surely had it. ...And even though another Sekimeiya could exist, that was no guarantee."
    new "我试着打开，确认我们的锁仍然有效。只有那把钥匙才能把 Sekimeiya 交还到我们手上，而钥匙必定在 Akaro 或 Sai 那里。……况且，就算可能存在另一个 Sekimeiya，也无从保证。"

    # game/script.rpy:23032
    old "We can't keep running away forever, but there's no safe place...!"
    new "我们总不能一直逃下去，可又没有安全的地方……！"

    # game/script.rpy:23037
    old "I froze, trying to think, but my nerves prevented me from doing so. There was nothing we could do but keep running to escape from Sai."
    new "我僵在原地，想要理清思路，可紧绷的神经根本不容我思考。除了继续逃、躲开 Sai，我们别无他法。"

    # game/script.rpy:23038
    old "Another Sekimeiya could be somewhere, but we can't enter any of the rooms to find it, or we could be backing ourselves into a dead end..."
    new "说不定哪里还有另一个 Sekimeiya，可我们没法挨个进房间去找，否则很可能把自己逼进死路……"

    # game/script.rpy:23039
    old "The intense sound of Sai's footsteps hadn't been audible since we'd arrived on the crystal floor."
    new "自从我们来到水晶层，就再没听到 Sai 那逼人的脚步声。"

    # game/script.rpy:23040
    old "Let's go. I don't know where, but we should at least be in a hallway to see him coming."
    new "走吧。去哪儿都行，至少得待在走廊里，才能看见他过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:23044
    old "The hallway B door hadn't been closed. We rushed to it, but that thoughtless action immediately proved to be a critical mistake."
    new "B走廊的门没有关上。我们冲了过去，可这不假思索的举动，立刻成了致命错误。"

    # game/script.rpy:23054
    old "...There we go.{w=0.5} You two were starting to really tire me out."
    new "……找到了。{w=0.5} 你们俩还真让我费了不少劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:23056
    old "As soon as we tried to leave, Sai's body collided with mine at full speed. I was knocked down and fell by his feet.{w} When his terrifying voice made me look up, I saw the knife we'd been running from, pointed right in front of my face."
    new "我们刚要离开，Sai 整个人便全速撞了上来。我被撞倒在地，摔在他脚边。{w} 听到他那骇人的声音，我抬起头，随即看见我们一路躲避的那把刀，正对着我的脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:23057
    old "Sai... what the fuck are you doing!?"
    new "Sai……你他妈到底在干什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:23058
    old "I knew I couldn't run away. Behind me, I could feel Shiroya's trembling legs. She still had the chance to escape, but the shaking of her body ruled that out."
    new "我知道自己逃不掉了。身后能感觉到 Shiroya 的双腿在发抖。她本来还有机会逃，可身体抖成那样，根本跑不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23063
    old "Tell me, Atsuki. What do you think I'm doing?"
    new "说说看，Atsuki。你觉得我在做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:23064
    old "His face shifted into an unsettling smile while he slowly brought the knife closer to me."
    new "他脸上浮起一个令人发毛的笑容，同时慢慢把刀凑近我。"

    # game/script.rpy:23065
    old "Please, stop! Wh-Why do you want to kill us!?"
    new "求你了，住手！你、你为什么要杀我们！？"

    # game/script.rpy:23070
    old "\"Us\"? Don't worry, I was only chasing Atsuki. I'm not gonna be the one to kill you."
    new "「我们」？放心，我追的人一直只有 Atsuki。杀你的人不会是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:23071
    old "Do you mean... someone else will?"
    new "你是说……会有别人来杀我？"

    # game/script.rpy:23072
    old "Precisely."
    new "正是。"

    # game/script.rpy:23075
    old "Shut the fuck up! There's no way she'll die!"
    new "少他妈胡说！她怎么可能死！"

    # game/script.rpy:23080
    old "Oh... I guess you haven't seen it? I thought for sure you had."
    new "哦……看来你没看到？我还以为你肯定看见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23086
    old "Let me make it clear for you: Shiroya's fate is death. She is close to dying, and I will be the cause behind it if I have to be."
    new "我就直说吧：Shiroya 注定会死。她已经离死不远了，必要的话，我会亲手促成这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:23091
    old "Unfortunately, you won't get to see it. You brought this upon yourself for being so fucking stupid."
    new "可惜，你是看不到了。落得这个下场，全怪你自己蠢得离谱。"

    # game/script.rpy:23092
    old "The knife seemed to grow bigger as it approached me. Was I truly about to die, without understanding anything, in that pathetic position...?"
    new "刀离我越近，就越显得巨大。难道我就要这样不明不白地死在这么难看的姿势里……？"

    # game/script.rpy:23093
    old "Wait! Stop!"
    new "等等！住手！"

    # game/script.rpy:23094
    old "Tell me, at least! Why do you want to kill me!?"
    new "至少告诉我！你为什么要杀我！？"

    # game/script.rpy:23105
    old "I started to use my arms to drag myself backward. Sai followed my movements with his knife, his expression growing absent."
    new "我开始用双臂撑着身体往后挪。Sai 的刀跟着我的动作移动，神情却渐渐变得恍惚。"

    # game/script.rpy:23111
    old "Answer me!"
    new "回答我！"

    # game/script.rpy:23118
    old "No, just let him go! He hasn't done anything!"
    new "不行，放他走！他什么都没做！"

    # game/script.rpy:23125
    old "You stay right there."
    new "你给我待在那儿别动。"

    # game/script.rpy:23126
    old "For the first time, Sai's voice wavered."
    new "Sai 的声音第一次发颤了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23127
    old "Why...? Did he realize something?"
    new "为什么……？他想通了什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:23128
    old "Then, he stared at my eyes with the most incensed and serious expression I'd seen on him."
    new "随后，他盯住我的眼睛，那是我在他脸上见过最愤怒、最严肃的神情。"

    # game/script.rpy:23133
    old "I'll ask again: why do you think?"
    new "我再问一遍：你觉得是为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:23134
    old "I don't know! That's why I'm asking!"
    new "我不知道！所以才问你！"

    # game/script.rpy:23139
    old "I continued to move back, and he stopped following me. When I'd separated myself enough from him, I stood up, but I couldn't run away. I'd ended up in the corner of the room, and there was no real method of getting around him."
    new "我继续往后退，他不再跟上来。等我与他拉开足够的距离，我站了起来，却还是逃不掉。我已经退到了房间角落，根本没有办法绕过他。"

    # game/script.rpy:23144
    old "Are you okay...?"
    new "你没事吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:23145
    old "I nodded uncertainly. Keeping her eyes on Sai, she walked up to me, abandoning any remaining chance of fleeing. Sai at least appeared not to be an immediate threat to Shiroya, so I didn't tell her to stay back."
    new "我迟疑地点了点头。她视线不离 Sai，走到我身边，把仅剩的逃跑机会也放弃了。Sai 至少看起来暂时不会对 Shiroya 动手，我便没有叫她退开。"

    # game/script.rpy:23146
    old "When I looked at Sai with a clearer mind, I saw something of importance that stood out: there was a bit of blood in his mouth. Immediately, I associated it with the drops we'd found."
    new "脑子稍微清醒后，我再看 Sai，注意到一件要紧的事：他嘴里有血。我立刻把它和我们发现的血滴联系了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:23148
    old "...Why is your mouth bleeding? When did that happen?"
    new "……你嘴里为什么在流血？什么时候弄的？"

    # game/script.rpy:23153
    old "After looking down for a few seconds, he lifted his head back up, regaining his imposing aura."
    new "他低下头，过了几秒又抬起来，那股逼人的气势重新回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23154
    old "Are you laughing at me?"
    new "你在笑话我？"

    # game/script.rpy:23155
    old "What...? No, why?"
    new "什么……？没有，怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:23156
    old "To answer your question, not more than thirty minutes ago."
    new "回答你的问题——不到三十分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:23157
    old "O-Oh."
    new "哦、哦……"

    # game/script.rpy:23160
    old "Was that supposed to mean something? The way he said it made it sound like he wanted to convey something more."
    new "他这话是有什么含义吗？他的语气听上去像是还想传达别的什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:23161
    old "...I thought you might've left some blood behind, like that drop, for example."
    new "……我还以为你留下了血迹，比如那一滴。"

    # game/script.rpy:23162
    old "I pointed at the floor, where the fully dried-up drop was."
    new "我指向地板，那滴血就落在那儿，已经完全干涸了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23163
    old "I don't know where that came from, but it's not mine. That has been here for longer than thirty minutes."
    new "我不知道那是从哪来的，但不是我的。它在这儿的时间不止三十分钟了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23164
    old "I thought so...{w} Have you stopped trying to kill me...? I don't understand what you're doing."
    new "我就知道……{w}你不打算杀我了……？我不明白你在做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:23165
    old "Shut up."
    new "闭嘴。"

    # game/script.rpy:23166
    old "Unable to feel completely relieved, Shiroya and I glanced at each other. Had Sai been trying to kill me for something he thought I did? His murderous intent previously seemed incredibly determined, but my own bewilderment caused it to diminish out of nowhere."
    new "我和 Shiroya 对视一眼，谁都没能真正松口气。Sai 想杀我，是因为他认定我做了什么吗？方才那股杀意坚决得不容置疑，可我这一脸茫然，却让它凭空消退了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:23171
    old "Pensively, Sai glanced around the room. Suddenly, in visible shock, his whole body went one step backward."
    new "Sai 若有所思地环顾四周，突然像是受了什么惊吓，整个人后退了一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:23177
    old "Did something happen...?"
    new "怎么了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:23182
    old "Atsuki, tell me something. What time do you think it is?"
    new "Atsuki，我问你，你觉得现在几点了？"

    # game/script.rpy:23183
    old "Uh... Right now... it should be around {time=17:40.}"
    new "呃……现在……应该是 {time=17:40.} 左右。"

    # game/script.rpy:23185
    old "You're right. My watch says it's {time=17:41}, and I'm sure it's correct."
    new "你说得没错。我的表显示 {time=17:41}，而且我确定它走得准。"

    # game/script.rpy:23186
    old "...Does that tell you anything?"
    new "……这能说明什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:23187
    old "I suppose so, but I'm not sure what."
    new "大概能，但我还说不清是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:23189
    old "What the fuck...? Did he think I'd say an incorrect time?"
    new "搞什么……？他以为我会把时间说错吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:23194
    old "Do you know where Akaro is?"
    new "你知道 Akaro 在哪儿吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:23199
    old "That son of a bitch? No idea."
    new "那个混蛋？不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:23200
    old "Did something happen between you two? You escaped the bedroom together. How did you do it?"
    new "你们之间出什么事了？你们是一起逃出卧室的。怎么做到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:23201
    old "Try to figure it out yourself. Telling you anything I've concluded wouldn't be smart. I don't think Akaro is with us anymore, though. He might be outside."
    new "你自己琢磨去。我推断出来的东西，告诉你可不太明智。不过我觉得 Akaro 已经不在我们这边了。他可能在外面。"

    # game/script.rpy:23206
    old "What? Using the Sekimeiya?"
    new "什么？用 Sekimeiya？"

    # game/script.rpy:23207
    old "Yes, most likely."
    new "对，多半如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:23208
    old "A few minutes after you two left, Akaro came back to the bedroom."
    new "你们走后没几分钟，Akaro 就回到了卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:23218
    old "Yes. He said he didn't remember leaving, but he disappeared again without removing the chain."
    new "对。他说他不记得自己离开过，可门链没被取下，他却又不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23223
    old "What the fuck?{w} Don't tell me you believed him. I knew he could try to enter from the storeroom door, but I haven't guarded it the entire time."
    new "搞什么？{w}别告诉我你信了他。我早知道他会试着从储藏室的门进来，可我不可能一直守着那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:23224
    old "You think he entered from the outside after escaping? ...Still, he vanished, and the Sekimeiya is right here."
    new "你觉得他是逃出去之后又从外面进来的？……可他还是消失了，而 Sekimeiya 就在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:23229
    old "Show me."
    new "让我看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:23233
    old "Shiroya went ahead and raised the curtain, which had fallen by itself at some point. As we'd seen, the Sekimeiya was behind the glass."
    new "Shiroya 上前掀起了遮布——不知何时，遮布自己落了下来。和先前看到的一样，Sekimeiya 就在玻璃后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:23240
    old "Did you two put it inside?"
    new "是你们把它放进去的？"

    # game/script.rpy:23241
    old "Yes, a long while ago."
    new "是，很久以前了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23246
    old "...{w}Was it in the farthest back room in hallway B? B6?"
    new "……{w}是在 B走廊最里面那间？B6？"

    # game/script.rpy:23248
    old "I thought about it again. The origin of that Sekimeiya still didn't make sense."
    new "我又想了想。那个 Sekimeiya 的来历依旧说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:23249
    old "Where?"
    new "在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:23250
    old "First, it was on the floor. We used it, but when we came back, we couldn't find it. Then we found it inside a drawer in the same room."
    new "一开始它放在地上。我们用了它，可回来之后就找不到了。后来才在同一个房间的抽屉里找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:23255
    old "...{w}Huh. I see.{w} It teleported there after you used it... I get it."
    new "……{w}哼，原来如此。{w}你们用过之后，它传送到了那里……我明白了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23256
    old "How did you know we found it in that room?"
    new "你怎么知道我们是在那间房里找到它的？"

    # game/script.rpy:23257
    old "I just remembered that it could have been there. Now, let me pass."
    new "我只是想起来它可能在那儿。好了，让开。"

    # game/script.rpy:23262
    old "Move away."
    new "让开。"

    # game/script.rpy:23263
    old "Do you want the Sekimeiya? Do you have the key?"
    new "你想要 Sekimeiya？你有钥匙？"

    # game/script.rpy:23264
    old "Shut up and move away."
    new "少废话，让开。"

    # game/script.rpy:23265
    old "I couldn't decipher his intent. His voice had changed completely, and he sounded as if we were the present threat instead of him, keeping him away from the Sekimeiya."
    new "我摸不透他的意图。他的语气彻底变了，仿佛此刻真正的威胁是我们，是我们挡着他、不让他接近 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:23266
    old "You just wanted to kill me! Why would we let you use the Sekimeiya?"
    new "你刚才还想杀我！我们凭什么让你用 Sekimeiya？"

    # game/script.rpy:23271
    old "Are you really this dense? I have a knife."
    new "你真有这么迟钝？我手里有刀。"

    # game/script.rpy:23272
    old "That's a fair point. Are you going to kill us if we don't step aside?"
    new "说得有理。我们要是不让开，你打算杀了我们吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:23274
    old "There was no determination in that threat. For some reason, everything murderous about him was gone."
    new "那句威胁里听不出半点决心。不知为何，他身上那股杀气已经荡然无存。"

    # game/script.rpy:23278
    old "Where did you even get that knife!? Did you kill Katei and Erina?"
    new "你从哪儿弄来那把刀的！？你杀了 Katei 和 Erina 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:23288
    old "No. I haven't killed anyone."
    new "没有。我没杀任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:23289
    old "Don't lie. You have a knife which was definitely used to kill Erina.{w} You're trying to trick us, aren't you? You used the Sekimeiya to escape the tower, and then you entered again through the storeroom with that knife that you brought from the outside.{w} You traveled from the hallway B room, which is how you knew we found the Sekimeiya there.{w} The state we saw Akaro in... did you do that?"
    new "少骗人。你手里那把刀，分明就是杀死 Erina 的凶器。{w}你想骗我们，对吧？你用 Sekimeiya 逃出了塔，然后带着从外面弄来的那把刀，从储藏室重新进来。{w}你是从B走廊那间房穿越回来的——所以你才知道我们在那里找到了 Sekimeiya。{w}我们看到 Akaro 时他那副样子……也是你干的？"

    # game/script.rpy:23294
    old "Regarding where I found this knife... I just did. I'm not gonna tell you where, but I found it inside this building, poorly hidden."
    new "至于这把刀是从哪儿找到的……反正是找到了。具体在哪儿我不会说，但就在这栋楼里，藏得也不怎么高明。"

    # game/script.rpy:23295
    old "What...? And you mean to tell us that we never found it before?"
    new "什么……？你是说，我们之前居然一直没发现？"

    # game/script.rpy:23300
    old "Listen, here's a good question for you. I've seen Katei's and Erina's corpses. If I killed them, how come there's no blood on my clothes?"
    new "听好，我倒要问你们一个问题。Katei 和 Erina 的尸体我见过。如果是我杀的，那我衣服上怎么一点血都没有？"

    # game/script.rpy:23301
    old "I was taken aback. He was right: blood would've splashed onto the killer's clothes after killing both of them, but Sai's were completely clean."
    new "我愣了一下。他说得没错：连杀两人，凶手的衣服上不可能不溅到血，可 Sai 的衣服干干净净。"

    # game/script.rpy:23304
    old "Suddenly, a needle pierced my heart when I remembered something. ...The Shiroya who'd changed clothes."
    new "忽然，我想起一件事，心口像被针扎了一下。……那个换过衣服的 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:23309
    old "That doesn't mean anything. If you used the Sekimeiya to travel back in time after you killed them, it would have given you clean clothes from a past point, and the stained ones would have disappeared forever."
    new "那说明不了什么。你要是杀了人之后用 Sekimeiya 回到过去，它就会把过去那个时间点的干净衣服给你换上，沾血的那身则会永远消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:23310
    old "...She's right. You could've easily gotten rid of them like that."
    new "……她说得对。用这个办法，你轻易就能把血衣处理干净。"

    # game/script.rpy:23315
    old "Heh... That's wrong."
    new "呵……错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23317
    old "What you two just said... is wrong.{w} However, I didn't have to get rid of any clothes, seeing as I didn't kill anyone."
    new "你们俩刚才说的……都错了。{w}不过，我根本不需要处理什么衣服，因为我没杀过人。"

    # game/script.rpy:23319
    old "What exactly are we wrong about?"
    new "到底哪里说错了？"

    # game/script.rpy:23320
    old "As I said before, telling you anything wouldn't be smart."
    new "我说过了，什么都告诉你们可不聪明。"

    # game/script.rpy:23321
    old "Were we wrong? ...About what?{w} His clothes still had very faint traces of the smoke on them. If he had traveled outside the tower and then entered from the storeroom, there would've been no smoke on them. ...Was that wrong as well?"
    new "我们错了？……错在哪儿？{w}他衣服上还残留着极淡的烟味。如果他先前去过塔外，再从储藏室进来，衣服上就不该沾着烟味。……这一点也错了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:23324
    old "I didn't know how to object. After Katei and Erina died, it was unlikely anyone activated the Sekimeiya. How had it appeared inside the drawer? Either it teleported there, or someone deliberately left it inside. Going off how clumsily that drawer was shut, the latter sounded a lot more plausible."
    new "我不知该如何反驳。Katei 和 Erina 死后，不太可能有人启动过 Sekimeiya。那它怎么会出现在抽屉里？要么是被传送过去的，要么就是有人刻意放进去的。看那抽屉关得那么马虎，后一种可能听起来合理得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:23325
    old "Regardless, it was still shut, so nobody could have traveled after leaving the Sekimeiya there. The window for that explanation was incredibly tight—it had to have happened before that point or after the present time if the Sai we were talking to was the result of an upcoming time travel.{w} We also couldn't rule out the possibility that someone took the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet, used it, and placed it back inside."
    new "不管怎样，抽屉当时是关着的，所以把 Sekimeiya 留在那里之后，就不可能再有人穿越离开。这个解释能成立的时间窗口窄得惊人：事情只能发生在那之前；或者，如果我们面对的这个 Sai 是未来某次时间穿越的结果，那就发生在我们当下之后。{w}此外，也不能排除另一种可能：有人从展示柜里取出 Sekimeiya 用过，又放了回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:23330
    old "...Anyway, I wouldn't want to kill you two now since there's more stuff I want to think about. I'd still get out of my way if I were you, though."
    new "……总之，现在我还有别的事要想，不想杀你们俩。不过要是换作我，还是会识相地让开。"

    # game/script.rpy:23331
    old "You definitely have the key for the cabinet, right? You took it from the bedroom before escaping... Does that mean that Akaro never had it? It doesn't sound as if you two got along too well despite leaving together."
    new "展示柜的钥匙肯定在你手上吧？你逃走之前从卧室里拿走了……这么说，Akaro 从来没拿过钥匙？你们虽然是一起离开的，听起来关系却不怎么样。"

    # game/script.rpy:23336
    old "Atsuki, overcome your stupidity and move. Do you want to put her in danger?"
    new "Atsuki，收起你的蠢劲，让开。你想把她也拖进危险里吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:23337
    old "I don't want to move either. Giving the Sekimeiya to you can't be a good idea no matter what."
    new "我也不想让开。不管出于什么理由，把 Sekimeiya 交给你都不会是好事。"

    # game/script.rpy:23342
    old "I have a knife, for the love of God! You were scared out of your minds running away before. Where did your balls come from?"
    new "老天，我手里有刀啊！之前逃跑的时候你们吓得魂都没了。现在这胆量是从哪儿冒出来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:23343
    old "At this point, I'm pretty sure that you don't intend to use it."
    new "事到如今，我很确定你并不打算用它。"

    # game/script.rpy:23349
    old "Sai's lips curved into a grin.{w} Then, he kneeled and left the knife on the floor."
    new "Sai 嘴角一弯，笑了。{w}随后他蹲下身，把刀放在了地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:23350
    old "All right, let's play your game then."
    new "好啊，那就照你们的规矩来。"

    # game/script.rpy:23351
    old "What game?"
    new "什么规矩？"

    # game/script.rpy:23356
    old "You two don't understand anything. You think you do, and it's laughable.{w} Right. I don't want to use my knife because overpowering you physically right now would be a loss. I'll have to go one step further and show you how pathetic your resistance is."
    new "你们俩什么都不懂，却自以为都懂，真是可笑。{w}没错，我不想动刀，是因为现在靠武力制服你们反而是我输。我得再进一步，让你们看看自己的抵抗有多可悲。"

    # game/script.rpy:23360
    old "Without abandoning his unsettling smirk, he dashed out of the room, toward hallway B."
    new "他带着那抹令人发毛的笑，冲出了房间，朝B走廊奔去。"

    # game/script.rpy:23366
    old "I didn't understand anything, but Sai had a plan. Given what had happened the previous time, I hesitated to chase after him, but I immediately realized that was a mistake.{w} To prevent him from completely leaving our line of sight, I sprinted toward the door and looked down the hallway."
    new "我完全摸不着头脑，但 Sai 一定有计划。想起上次发生的事，我迟疑着不敢追上去，可随即意识到这是错的。{w}为了不让他彻底脱离视线，我冲向门口，望向走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:23377
    old "Before I got there, the loud noise of a door being slammed boomed out. By the time I arrived, all I saw was a bunch of closed doors with no indication of which one had created the noise."
    new "我还没跑到门口，一声摔门的巨响就炸了开来。等我赶到，眼前只有一排紧闭的门，看不出哪一扇是声音的来源。"

    # game/script.rpy:23380
    old "...He has to be inside one of them. No way he had time to get to hallway C or the lobby."
    new "……他一定在其中一间里。他不可能有时间跑到C走廊或大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:23381
    old "Going off what he said, I figured he would have created that noise to lure us out and make us mistakenly think that he was still in the hallway, but that couldn't be it—with such a brief window of time, he was definitely in one of those rooms."
    new "按他说的那些话推测，那声巨响多半是他故意弄出来引我们出去，好让我们误以为他还在走廊上。但不可能只是这样——时间那么短，他肯定就在其中一间房里。"

    # game/script.rpy:23389
    old "He must think we'll search for him, but he has something in mind... Do you want this just in case?"
    new "他一定算准了我们会来搜，心里肯定打着什么主意……你要不要拿着这个，以防万一？"

    # game/script.rpy:23390
    old "Shiroya had retrieved the knife from the floor. I understood her proposition, but I declined it."
    new "Shiroya 已经把刀从地上捡了起来。我明白她的意思，却没有接。"

    # game/script.rpy:23391
    old "If he wanted to harm us, he would've done so just now. He wants to trick us somehow."
    new "他真想伤我们，刚才就动手了。他是想用什么法子算计我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:23396
    old "But how...? He's in one of the rooms, so how would he be able to do anything?"
    new "可是怎么算计……？他就在某间房里，能做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:23399
    old "His goal was clearly to open the Sekimeiya cabinet, so there's a very simple way."
    new "他的目标显然就是打开 Sekimeiya 展示柜，所以办法很简单。"

    # game/script.rpy:23400
    old "It seems he understands how the Sekimeiya works better than us... and it's still possible another one exists.{w} If he entered the room where he knew the other Sekimeiya was, he could've gone back to the past. Maybe he thought both of us would chase behind him and he could immediately enter the event room from hallway A.{w} That's why it should be fine if you stay here, looking at the hallway. I'll open the doors while you make sure Sai doesn't leave and nobody enters from the other side."
    new "他似乎比我们更清楚 Sekimeiya 的运作方式……而且，很可能还有另一个。{w}如果他进了自己知道放着另一个 Sekimeiya 的房间，就能回到过去。他也许以为我们俩都会追在他身后，这样他就能立刻从A走廊进入活动室。{w}所以，你留在这里盯着走廊就好。我来开门，你负责看住 Sai，别让他跑掉，也别让任何人从另一头进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:23403
    old "Shiroya walked back and closed the hallway A door, hindering any entrance. She nodded, knowing we couldn't just ignore him."
    new "Shiroya 走回去关上了A走廊的门，堵住了那一侧的入口。她点了点头，也明白我们不能就这么放着他不管。"

    # game/script.rpy:23408
    old "Just watch out, okay? He dropped the knife to bait us into following him. He sounded pretty confident, and knowing Sai, he's got some plan..."
    new "你小心点，好吗？他扔下刀，就是想引我们追过去。他语气那么笃定，以 Sai 的性子，肯定有算计……"

    # game/script.rpy:23409
    old "I know... I'll be careful, but he still has to be here, and it's important to find him. Even though he gave it to us, the fact is we have his knife. If we find him, we can keep him in one place until we're out of here."
    new "我知道……我会小心。可他肯定还在这里，找到他很要紧。刀虽说是他自己丢给我们的，但现在确实在我们手上。只要能找到他，我们就能把他困在一个地方，直到离开这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:23414
    old "She agreed. I stepped out of the room, glancing around me as I put my shoes on. I was absolutely certain that one of the closed doors hid Sai behind it."
    new "她同意了。我走出房间，边穿鞋边环顾四周。我确信，那些紧闭的门中有一扇后面藏着 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:23415
    old "With how fast everything happened, it was also likely he hadn't gone to any room on the extremes of the hallway. However, I started with those to rule them out."
    new "事情发生得那么快，他多半也没跑到走廊两端的房间。不过我还是从那几间查起，好先排除掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:23419
    old "On full alert, I turned the doorknob of the cleaning room and pushed the door open."
    new "我绷紧神经，拧动清洁间的门把手，推开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:23424
    old "The empty space came into view, still missing the cart that used to occupy much of it. I knew he could've used a Sekimeiya to escape, so I briefly searched around for it. There were some shelves and buckets, but I doubted something as big as the Sekimeiya could be hidden there."
    new "那片空出来的地方映入眼帘，原本占去大半空间的手推车仍不见踪影。我想到他可能用 Sekimeiya 逃出去，便匆匆在四周搜了一遍。那里只有几排架子和几只桶，Sekimeiya 那么大，我想不至于藏得下。"

    # game/script.rpy:23425
    old "Before moving on, I saw something.{w} On top of one shelf, there was a key."
    new "正要离开时，我看到了某样东西。{w} 有个架子的顶上放着一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:23426
    old "Surprised, I jumped to grab it. In my hand was a small key I hadn't seen before, so I put it in my pocket."
    new "我心中一惊，纵身伸手去够。落到手里的是一把从没见过的小钥匙，我便把它揣进了口袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:23427
    old "I don't get it... This room has been searched before with the intention of finding the Sekimeiya, right? How come this key was never found?"
    new "想不通……这房间之前为了找 Sekimeiya 也搜过一遍吧？怎么这把钥匙一直没被发现？"

    # game/script.rpy:23430
    old "It was no time to wonder that, so I exited as soon as I determined nothing else was hidden out of sight."
    new "现在不是琢磨这些的时候。我确认暗处没再藏着别的东西，便退了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:23435
    old "The room in front of me, B6, was where we'd found the Sekimeiya."
    new "眼前这间是 B6，我们当初就是在那里找到 Sekimeiya 的。"

    # game/script.rpy:23439
    old "I entered it and looked in every cabinet and drawer. All of them were empty."
    new "我走进去，把每个柜子和抽屉都查看了一遍。里面全都空空如也。"

    # game/script.rpy:23443
    old "As soon as I set foot in the staff room, I remembered that a complete search couldn't be performed. What if Sai could open one of the lockers?"
    new "一踏进员工室，我才想起这里没法彻底搜。万一 Sai 打得开其中某个储物柜呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:23444
    old "Wait, no. That's fine."
    new "等等，不对。这不成问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:23445
    old "They can't be locked from the inside. Although they're big enough to contain a person, if Sai had the brilliant idea to hide in one, it must currently be unlocked."
    new "柜子没法从里面上锁。它们虽然大得能装下一个人，可要是 Sai 真觉得躲进其中一个是个好主意，那柜子现在肯定没锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:23446
    old "And if he used a Sekimeiya that he hid inside one, he needed to unlock it first. So after traveling, it would remain unlocked..."
    new "而如果他用的是藏在储物柜里的 Sekimeiya，那他也得先开锁。这样穿越之后，柜子应该还是没锁的……"

    # game/script.rpy:23449
    old "I had to try opening every single one. The higher compartments had three narrow slits I could barely put my fingers through. I used them to try pulling the doors toward me, sure that they'd open if they were unlocked."
    new "我只能逐个试着打开。上层的柜门上有三道窄缝，勉强能把手指伸进去。我便把手指伸进缝里，试着把柜门往自己这边拉，心想只要没上锁，门总能拉开。"

    # game/script.rpy:23453
    old "One locker opened: Naomi's. Only her coat was inside, and I made sure its pockets were empty. After that, no more doors budged."
    new "有一扇储物柜开了，是 Naomi 的。里面只挂着她的外套，我确认过口袋是空的。之后，再没有别的柜门动过。"

    # game/script.rpy:23456
    old "Not here either...{w} Unless he used the Sekimeiya and then it teleported itself away like he said happened earlier..."
    new "这里也没有……{w} 除非他用了 Sekimeiya，然后它像他先前说的那样自己传送走了……"

    # game/script.rpy:23462
    old "I entered the following crystal room, and after the same quick search, I confirmed neither Sai nor the Sekimeiya were inside."
    new "我走进下一间水晶展室，照旧匆匆搜了一遍，确认里面既没有 Sai，也没有 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:23463
    old "From the event room, Shiroya let me know that nothing had happened on her end. She was looking at hallway B to prevent Sai's escape while paying very close attention to the door behind her."
    new "Shiroya 从活动室那边告诉我，她那边没有动静。她一边盯着 B走廊，防止 Sai 逃走，一边留意着身后的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:23464
    old "Perhaps Sai could enter from it at any time, make it to the cabinet faster than Shiroya, and then overpower her. However, he willingly gave up his knife, and that was his best opportunity to do so."
    new "Sai 说不定随时会从那扇门进来，抢在 Shiroya 之前冲到展示柜前，再把她制住。可他却主动交出了刀，而那本来是他动手的最好机会。"

    # game/script.rpy:23468
    old "Next, I entered room B4. It exuded a sinister aura, exhibiting Naomi's and Erina's deaths. Trying to ignore my sudden heartache, I inspected every cabinet where Sai or the Sekimeiya could be.{w} As usual, they were all empty."
    new "接着我走进 B4房间。这里透着一股不祥的气息，Naomi 和 Erina 就死在此处。我强压下心头骤然的刺痛，把 Sai 或 Sekimeiya 可能藏身的展示柜一一查过。{w} 和之前一样，全是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:23473
    old "Just three more... We have to find something in one of these."
    new "只剩三间了……总得在其中一间里找到点什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:23477
    old "I continued by entering the room on my left. At first glance, it was another empty crystal room where nothing of importance had occurred."
    new "我接着走进左边那间。乍看之下，又是一间空荡荡的水晶展室，没出过什么要紧事。"

    # game/script.rpy:23478
    old "After looking through every cabinet, that sensation hadn't changed: yet again, a few spare gems were all I was able to find inside them."
    new "我把所有展示柜查完，那种感觉依旧没变：里面照旧只有几颗备用的宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:23482
    old "It was the same in the next one. It was full of uninteresting cabinets storing nothing but air and gemstones."
    new "下一间也是一样。满室的展示柜里除了空气就是宝石，没什么好看的。"

    # game/script.rpy:23486
    old "There's only one more... Could it be we left the correct one for the end?"
    new "只剩最后一间了……难道说，我们恰好把对的那间留到了最后？"

    # game/script.rpy:23487
    old "Shiroya looked unsure. She was constantly glancing behind her while giving Sai no time to escape hallway B."
    new "Shiroya 神情有些迟疑。她一次次回头张望，却始终没给 Sai 逃出 B走廊的空隙。"

    # game/script.rpy:23493
    old "I opened the door and stepped into the last crystal room. Nothing appeared different from the others. To prevent a sudden attack, I'd been getting used to immediately looking behind the doors. That first step was completed without an issue."
    new "我推开门，走进最后一间水晶展室。这里看上去和其余几间并无不同。为防突袭，我已经习惯了进门先看门后。这一步没有出任何岔子。"

    # game/script.rpy:23497
    old "Those cabinets were the sole remaining places where Sai could be. Starting from the right ones, I uncovered their lids one by one, progressively narrowing down the last options."
    new "那些展示柜是 Sai 仅剩的可能藏身之处。我从右边开始，逐个掀开柜盖，把最后几个可能逐一排除。"

    # game/script.rpy:23502
    old "And when I opened the last one, it was finally confirmed: Sai wasn't anywhere."
    new "掀开最后一个柜盖时，事情终于有了定论：Sai 哪儿都不在。"

    # game/script.rpy:23506
    old "Feeling defeated, I returned to hallway B and rejoined Shiroya."
    new "我满心挫败，回到 B走廊，与 Shiroya 会合。"

    # game/script.rpy:23513
    old "I don't get it... There's not much he could've done."
    new "我想不明白……他能做的事应该不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:23514
    old "He said the Sekimeiya could teleport itself after being used. Maybe that's why you didn't find it."
    new "他说过 Sekimeiya 用过之后会自己传送。也许你没找到它，就是这个原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:23515
    old "But... do you think that's what he did?"
    new "可是……你觉得他真会这么做吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:23516
    old "I mean, I've searched enough to be sure that he isn't in any of these rooms, but there might be a very good spot I've missed where he hid the Sekimeiya."
    new "我是说，我搜得够仔细，可以确定他不在这些房间里；不过也许我漏掉了某个绝佳的藏身处，他就是把 Sekimeiya 藏在了那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:23517
    old "But why would he do that? Does he really want to get his hands on the Sekimeiya in the cabinet when he knew where another one was?"
    new "可他为什么要那样做？明明知道另一个 Sekimeiya 在哪儿，他真会那么想去拿展示柜里的那个吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:23518
    old "And was his plan simply to use it, lure us out while he trusted his hiding spot, and enter the event room from hallway A? There's no way, right?"
    new "他的计划难道就是用它，把我们引出来，仗着藏的地方够隐蔽，再从 A走廊进活动室？这怎么想都不可能吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:23523
    old "Probably not... He knew one of us would stay here."
    new "大概不会……他知道我们总有一个会留下。"

    # game/script.rpy:23524
    old "Yeah. He left his knife behind to make us chase after him, but there's no way he thought both of us would go."
    new "是啊。他丢下刀，好让我们去追他，可他绝不可能以为我们两个都会去追。"

    # game/script.rpy:23527
    old "Do you think he had time to go to hallway C or the lobby?"
    new "你觉得他有时间跑去 C走廊或大厅吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:23528
    old "He wasn't very fast when he was chasing us, and I doubt he faked his speed just for this... I suppose we can't completely rule it out, but I didn't hear his footsteps in the distance."
    new "他追我们的时候跑得并不快，我不觉得他跑那么慢是故意装出来的……我想也不能完全排除，但我在远处没听见脚步声。"

    # game/script.rpy:23529
    old "Whatever Sai was planning... we had to stop it. He might've given up on killing us, but nothing guaranteed he hadn't simply held off on it after realizing something important."
    new "不管 Sai 在盘算什么……我们都得阻止他。他也许已经放弃杀我们，但也可能只是察觉到了什么要紧的事，才暂时没有动手。"

    # game/script.rpy:23530
    old "We need to search hallway A, but the lobby and hallway C are a problem.{w} Wait here, watching over this hallway and the other door like you were doing. I'll be back in a second."
    new "A走廊得搜一遍，可大厅和 C走廊是个麻烦。{w} 你守在这儿，照刚才那样看着这条走廊和另一扇门。我很快就回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:23542
    old "I took off toward the lobby. Nobody was there, and I made sure to check that Sai wasn't behind the columns and couch. It was unlikely for him to hide in the mechanical room, but I had to look."
    new "我朝大厅跑去。那里没有人，我还特意确认了柱子后和沙发背后都没有 Sai。他不太可能藏在机械室，但我还是得看一眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:23547
    old "I opened the door and headed down the stairs. It was going to be hard to conclude that nobody was hiding with the provided light, but I had to do it. If nothing else, I felt like I didn't have to be scared of sudden physical attacks."
    new "我推开门，走下楼梯。凭现有的光线，要断定里面没人并不容易，可我还是得查。别的先不说，至少我觉得不必担心会突然挨上一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:23553
    old "After some time, I was sure the room was uninhabited, and I didn't see the Sekimeiya either."
    new "过了一会儿，我确定这间屋子里没有人，也没看见 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:23558
    old "I headed back up, knowing what I'd do next."
    new "我心里清楚接下来该做什么，便沿楼梯返回。"

    # game/script.rpy:23566
    old "Instead of joining Shiroya through hallway B, I entered hallway A and opened the door to the event room."
    new "我没有从 B走廊过去与 Shiroya 会合，而是走进 A走廊，推开了活动室的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:23573
    old "It startled her, but she quickly realized it was me."
    new "她吃了一惊，但很快认出是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:23578
    old "Wait, don't come over. The lobby is empty, and from here, I can see hallway A, the event room, and the way to the other floors..."
    new "等等，别过来。大厅是空的，而且从这里能看到 A走廊、活动室，还有通往其他楼层的路……"

    # game/script.rpy:23579
    old "Do what I did from the other side. Check the bathrooms and come here through hallway A. If you do that, we'll have successfully isolated this hallway, and we'll be able to make sure nobody enters from floor 2."
    new "照我刚才的路线，从另一侧走一遍。检查洗手间，然后从A走廊过来。这样这条走廊就被我们彻底隔开了，也能确保没人从二楼进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:23584
    old "Got it."
    new "明白了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23588
    old "She disappeared from view, walking toward hallway C. For some seconds, I did what she'd been doing earlier: keep track of the event room and the hallway simultaneously."
    new "她朝C走廊走去，身影从视野里消失。有那么几秒，我学着她先前的样子，同时留意活动室和走廊的动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:23594
    old "As soon as she appeared from hallway C, I could stop focusing on the event room because nobody could've been behind us. I knew not to lower my guard, though, given Sai's evident confidence."
    new "她一从C走廊现身，我就不必再盯着活动室了——我们身后已经不可能有人。可看Sai那副笃定的样子，我知道不能就此松懈。"

    # game/script.rpy:23595
    old "I saw her trying to open the elevator door, but it wasn't there. Then, she sprinted toward me."
    new "我看见她试着打开电梯门，可电梯不在那里。紧接着，她朝我飞奔过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:23604
    old "...He wasn't in the bathrooms. I didn't find the Sekimeiya either."
    new "……洗手间里没有他。Sekimeiya也没找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:23605
    old "So, if he's still on this floor, he has to be inside a room in this hallway.{w} We'll do the same thing, then."
    new "那么，只要他还在这一层，就只可能藏在这条走廊的某个房间里。{w}那就照老办法再来一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:23612
    old "Shiroya came to my side, where she would stand while I entered every remaining room."
    new "Shiroya来到我身旁，之后我逐个进入剩下的房间时，她都会站在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:23621
    old "...That was, until a sound made us turn around."
    new "……直到一声响动让我们回过头去。"

    # game/script.rpy:23632
    old "All right.{w} What are you doing over there? Searching for me?"
    new "好吧。{w}你们在那头做什么？找我？"

    # game/script.rpy:23633
    old "...Next to the cabinet, Sai stood, the Sekimeiya between his hands. He hadn't teleported yet, and he was covering his skin under his shirt."
    new "……Sai就站在展示柜旁，Sekimeiya捧在双手之间。他还没传送，正用衬衫遮住自己的皮肤。"

    # game/script.rpy:23636
    old "With a smile, he closed the glass and let go of the curtain."
    new "他微微一笑，合上玻璃柜门，松开了遮布。"

    # game/script.rpy:23643
    old "What the fuck...? What did you just do?"
    new "搞什么……？你刚才做了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:23644
    old "Let me make something clear. If you try to approach me, I'll touch it immediately, and I'll disappear. Even though I'd go just a bit back in time, that's all I need."
    new "我把话说明白。你们要是敢靠近，我立刻碰它，然后消失。哪怕只是回到稍早一点的时间，对我也足够了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23649
    old "...All you need for what? You'd leave the Sekimeiya with us."
    new "……足够做什么？你一走，Sekimeiya可就留在我们手上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23650
    old "I don't care about that. I've definitely thought about what I'm doing, don't worry."
    new "那无所谓。我在做什么，自己早就想清楚了，不用担心。"

    # game/script.rpy:23652
    old "Even though it wasn't visible, as soon as he'd gotten the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet, it started to build up time and energy. I was able to see the cabinet key in his other hand, explaining how he'd been able to get it open so easily."
    new "虽然肉眼看不出来，但从他把Sekimeiya从展示柜里取出的那一刻起，它就开始积蓄时间与能量。我也看见他另一只手里握着展示柜的钥匙——难怪他能那么轻易地打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:23657
    old "What's with those faces? Are you that surprised to see me again?"
    new "都什么表情？再见到我，有这么吃惊吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:23658
    old "Don't be silly. You weren't in hallway B. You probably just traveled from the future and arrived someplace I'd already investigated."
    new "少装傻。你根本不在B走廊。你多半是从未来穿越回来，落在我已经查过的地方了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23663
    old "But I didn't do that at all. I haven't touched the Sekimeiya once since I last talked with you."
    new "可我根本没这么干。自从上次和你们说完话，我一次都没碰过Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:23664
    old "Don't lie. You had the other Sekimeiya hidden somewhere, and you activated it to go back to the past. You'll touch it again in the future, and you'll appear in one of the hallway B rooms I just checked. Maybe you just traveled some seconds into the past from one room to the other, making it all more simple. Am I wrong?"
    new "别撒谎。你把另一个Sekimeiya藏在某处，启动它回到了过去。未来的你还会再碰它一次，然后出现在我刚查过的B走廊某个房间里。说不定你只是从一个房间穿越回几秒之前，落到另一个房间，这样一来就简单多了。我说错了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:23669
    old "Didn't I just tell you that? Yes."
    new "我不是刚说过吗？没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:23671
    old "I also just said what my plan relies on: I must go back to the past, but I don't need to go too far. If I had another Sekimeiya hidden, what would the point of using this one be? I would just go back to the past with the other one I have, right?"
    new "我也刚说过我的计划靠的是什么：我必须回到过去，但不用回得太远。如果我另藏了一件Sekimeiya，那还用这一件做什么？直接拿手上那件回去不就行了？"

    # game/script.rpy:23677
    old "This is an actual question. If I know where another Sekimeiya is like you say, why would I not simply use that one?"
    new "我是认真在问。如果真像你说的，我知道另一件Sekimeiya在哪儿，那我为什么不干脆用那一件？"

    # game/script.rpy:23679
    old "I don't know! But enlighten us, how come you weren't anywhere if you didn't use the Sekimeiya?"
    new "我不知道！那你倒是说说，既然没用Sekimeiya，怎么会到处都找不到你？"

    # game/script.rpy:23682
    old "Oh, are you just trying to be funny? You said you haven't touched the Sekimeiya, but you simply got caught up in the range of a travel you knew you'd create after traveling, right? So you didn't actually \"touch\" it."
    new "哦，你这是在玩文字游戏吧？你说自己没碰过Sekimeiya，可你只是被自己穿越后明知会形成的范围卷了进去，对吧？所以你其实并没有「碰」它。"

    # game/script.rpy:23687
    old "You just jumped ten steps too far, Atsuki. It's baffling how easy it is to trick you.{w} I really just relied on a trick I felt could work, which you might discover eventually."
    new "Atsuki，你这步子迈得太大了。骗你竟然这么容易，真让人吃惊。{w}我不过是靠了一个自认为行得通的把戏，你最终也许能想明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:23688
    old "...What trick!?"
    new "……什么把戏！？"

    # game/script.rpy:23689
    old "I don't feel like telling you. Take my word for it, though—I did not travel with the Sekimeiya."
    new "我不太想说。不过你信我一句——我没有用Sekimeiya穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:23690
    old "There's no way. You weren't in hallway B. Your only way out was going to the past."
    new "不可能。你不在B走廊。你唯一的出路就是回到过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:23695
    old "*sigh*{w} Aren't you missing a really easy way I could've escaped?"
    new "唉……{w}你们是不是没想到，我本来有个特别简单的办法能脱身？"

    # game/script.rpy:23701
    old "Fine, I'll tell you. I don't need her cooperation any longer."
    new "算了，告诉你们。我已经不需要她配合了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23707
    old "Sorry, Shiroya, I'm nullifying our deal. Atsuki deserves to know what happened.{w} It was simple. Atsuki, the first room you went to was the cleaning room, right? You were close—I was in the staff room.{w} The moment you entered it, I left. In the hallway, Shiroya winked at me and let me escape. I feel awful keeping you in the dark, honestly."
    new "抱歉，Shiroya，我们的交易作废。Atsuki有资格知道真相。{w}事情很简单。Atsuki，你最先去的是清洁间，对吧？只差一点——我当时在员工室。{w}你进门的那一刻，我就离开了。在走廊里，Shiroya朝我眨了眨眼，放我走了。说真的，一直把你蒙在鼓里，我心里过意不去。"

    # game/script.rpy:23712
    old "What are you talking about!? Why would I let you go!?"
    new "你在说什么！？我凭什么放你走！？"

    # game/script.rpy:23717
    old "Feigning ignorance, huh? That's okay. You can keep lying to him for all I care."
    new "装傻是吧？无所谓。你尽管继续骗他，我不在乎。"

    # game/script.rpy:23718
    old "You're not gonna trick me, Sai. You used the Sekimeiya in some way."
    new "你骗不了我的，Sai。你肯定以某种方式用了Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:23723
    old "As if I'd ever side with you. You're a horrible person."
    new "我怎么可能和你一伙。你这个人坏透了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23728
    old "That hurts. I really thought we had something going."
    new "这话真伤人。我还真以为我们之间有点交情。"

    # game/script.rpy:23733
    old "I'm kidding, of course. I just used my invisibility cloak. Now I'll peace out and appear somewhere in the past. After I do what I need to do, I'll show up again, so you won't have to wait too long for me. From your perspective, I'll probably enter from the door as soon as I disappear. I bet a future version of me is waiting in hallway B for his cue to enter."
    new "当然是开玩笑。我只是用了隐身斗篷。现在我这就走人，在过去的某个地方现身。等我做完该做的事，还会再出现，所以你们不用等我太久。在你们看来，我大概会刚一消失就从门口走进来。我敢说，未来的我正待在B走廊，等着进去的时机呢。"

    # game/script.rpy:23734
    old "Stop! What do you even need to do? You said you didn't necessarily need to travel too far back. Why not?"
    new "等等！你到底要做什么？你说过不一定非得回到很远之前。为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:23739
    old "Perhaps you'll get something right for once if you keep thinking. I can definitely wait a little more."
    new "你接着想下去，说不定总有一次能猜对。我不介意再多等一会儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:23741
    old "He put the cabinet key in his pocket, signaling that he could use his free hand at any time to activate the Sekimeiya."
    new "他把展示柜的钥匙收进口袋，这无异于告诉我：他随时都能用空出来的那只手启动Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:23744
    old "Fuck! We can't let him travel. I'm not sure what he's doing, but he just has to go a few minutes back in time... He might need it to escape from us in hallway B. That must be what we're missing. He's just trying to mess with my head by accusing Shiroya."
    new "该死！不能让他穿越。我搞不清他要做什么，可只要回到几分钟前就够了……他也许需要靠这个在B走廊甩掉我们。我们漏掉的肯定就是这一点。他诬陷Shiroya，只是在扰乱我的思路。"

    # game/script.rpy:23745
    old "But if that's the case, is there a point in trying to stop him? He already escaped, so he's guaranteed to succeed."
    new "可如果是这样，拦他还有意义吗？他既然已经逃掉了，就说明他注定会成功。"

    # game/script.rpy:23746
    old "Wait, no. What am I thinking? When he took off toward hallway B, his goal was already to touch this Sekimeiya—he has another reason to use it, no matter what it is. It's still possible the travel he's about to perform will let him not be found, though."
    new "等等，不对。我在想什么？他往B走廊跑的时候，目标就已经是碰这个Sekimeiya了——他还有别的理由要用它，不管那是什么。不过，他接下来这次穿越，仍有可能让他不被人找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:23747
    old "I met Shiroya's eyes. She was at my right, and silently, she communicated to me that we had to stop him. He'd tried to kill me and had been holding a knife; whatever his intentions were, we had to assume they weren't great."
    new "我对上Shiroya的目光。她就在我右侧，无声地告诉我：必须拦住他。他拿着刀，还曾想杀我；不管他打的是什么主意，我们都只能往坏处想。"

    # game/script.rpy:23752
    old "No more questions?"
    new "没有别的问题了？"

    # game/script.rpy:23753
    old "We stood, looking at each other. No matter how much he waited or what he said, he would never be at risk."
    new "我们就这样面对面站着，彼此对视。无论他等多久、说什么，他都不会有半点危险。"

    # game/script.rpy:23756
    old "I'm all ears. I might just go already, though."
    new "我听着呢。不过，我也许马上就走。"

    # game/script.rpy:23763
    old "I didn't know what to say. I was trying to think of a way to get the upper hand."
    new "我不知道该说什么，只想着怎样才能占得上风。"

    # game/script.rpy:23770
    old "The seconds continued ticking, and most of them were filled with silence. Our disadvantage was too significant."
    new "时间一秒秒过去，大多数时候只有沉默。我们的劣势实在太大了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23771
    old "...Why are you not activating it?"
    new "……你为什么还不启动它？"

    # game/script.rpy:23776
    old "Throw me your guesses. Why am I not activating it? I had fun figuring my stuff out, but it's better if I can see how ignorant you still are."
    new "猜猜看吧。我为什么还不启动它？我挺享受把自己的事弄明白，不过能看看你们还多无知，倒更有意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:23777
    old "Why is he not activating it...? He said he didn't care about traveling shortly into the past, but what else could it be?"
    new "他为什么还不启动它……？他说过不在乎穿越到不久前的过去，那还能有什么别的原因？"

    # game/script.rpy:23780
    old "Yet again, silence engulfed us while Sai looked at ease, ready to touch the Sekimeiya at any moment."
    new "沉默再次笼罩了我们。Sai 却一脸从容，仿佛随时都会伸手触碰 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:23785
    old "Why are you so tense? I'm doing this to take care of one little thing, and you have no way to stop me, so instead of trying to do that, you can keep displaying how much you don't get."
    new "你们紧张什么？我只是要处理一件小事，你们根本拦不住我。既然这样，与其费劲阻止我，不如继续让我看看你们有多搞不清楚状况。"

    # game/script.rpy:23786
    old "I can assure you I'll accomplish what I want, so relax a bit. When I disappear, I'll show up immediately, and I won't try to do anything to the Sekimeiya. Until then, I'm not in a hurry."
    new "我可以保证，我想做的事一定会成，所以你们放松点。等我消失，我会立刻重新出现，也不会对 Sekimeiya 动手。在那之前，我不急。"

    # game/script.rpy:23787
    old "What the hell do you want, then?"
    new "那你到底想干什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:23788
    old "Don't you want to keep begging for my knowledge? I'm sure you're curious about a bunch of things."
    new "你们不是还想继续求我告诉你们吗？我确信你们对很多事都很好奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:23789
    old "You're the one who keeps refusing to answer. I bet you're trying to feel really smart."
    new "一直不肯回答的人是你。我看你就是想显得自己很聪明。"

    # game/script.rpy:23790
    old "Right. I'm so smart that I turn myself on. That's true, though. I suppose it's not fair if I won't answer anything.{w} Remember at the beginning? I had no issues sharing my thoughts with you, but that changed at one point. There's no way you're dense enough to not know when."
    new "没错，我聪明得连自己都要迷上自己了。不过这也是事实。要是什么都不回答，确实不太公平。{w}还记得一开始吗？那时我很乐意把自己的想法告诉你们，但后来某个时候变了。你们总不至于迟钝到连这都看不出来吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:23793
    old "What, when the Sekimeiya made me travel?"
    new "什么，你是说 Sekimeiya 让我穿越的那时候？"

    # game/script.rpy:23794
    old "We found out we were next to a time travel device, yes. Then, keeping everything to myself became the smarter option.{w} I did not in any way suspect what the Sekimeiya would be capable of, but I was expecting something to occur. I thought I'd have to be very perceptive to understand whatever could be going on, but everything happened in front of our eyes."
    new "是啊，我们发现身边就是一个时间穿越装置。从那之后，把一切藏在心里就成了更聪明的选择。{w}我完全没有想到 Sekimeiya 会有这种能力，但也预感到会出事。我原以为必须非常敏锐才能弄懂到底发生了什么，结果一切就明明白白地发生在眼前。"

    # game/script.rpy:23795
    old "What were you expecting? Xyn to attack?"
    new "你预料到什么了？Xyn 会袭击我们？"

    # game/script.rpy:23797
    old "Yeah, but that was fairly obvious. However, I suppose I came across {tip=traces}traces of the Sekimeiya{/tip} some time ago."
    new "是啊，不过那并不难猜。只是，我前阵子大概发现过 {tip=traces}Sekimeiya 的痕迹{/tip}。"

    # game/script.rpy:23803
    old "That's my answer. You were complaining I wasn't giving you any, so you have something to decipher if you please. That's a lot more fun than being straightforward for no reason."
    new "这就是我的回答。你刚才还抱怨我什么都不肯给，现在有东西可以慢慢琢磨了。总比无缘无故直说有意思得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:23804
    old "Then tell me, why did you try to kill me and then stop?"
    new "那你告诉我，你为什么想杀我，后来又停手了？"

    # game/script.rpy:23809
    old "It's not like I understand everything. I'm partly humoring you for the hell of it, but I'd also like to hear what you think. For old times' sake, give me your best deductions. Why do you think?"
    new "我又不是什么都懂。一半是闲得无聊逗你们玩，不过我也想听听你的想法。看在老交情上，拿出你最好的推理吧。你觉得是为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:23812
    old "I told you that I have no idea! Hearing that I didn't know why you were chasing us seemed to be what made you stop, so maybe you thought I did something I actually didn't."
    new "我告诉过你，我根本不知道！你好像是听到我说不知道你为什么要追我们，才停的手。所以，也许你以为我做了什么，其实我并没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:23813
    old "If you're telling the truth, that's enough of an answer. I suppose I have to think of a cryptic response from my point of view."
    new "如果你说的是真话，那也算回答了。看来我得从自己的角度想一个故弄玄虚的回答。"

    # game/script.rpy:23815
    old "I thought you'd overstepped, but it seems I was the one who had."
    new "我本以为是你越界了，看来越界的是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:23821
    old "You have no idea what I'm talking about. I understand, and it's great. I promise there's some meaning behind that, but don't think I'll be stupid enough to tell you anything undesirable.{w} Now, explain something for me. I thought about it a little, and I don't understand what you said regarding Akaro.{w} He came back up to the bedroom and opened the door with the key, which was later left in the original drawer—"
    new "你完全不知道我在说什么。我明白，这很好。我保证这话自有含义，但别以为我会蠢到把不该说的都告诉你们。{w}现在，给我解释一件事。我想了想，还是没搞懂你说的关于 Akaro 的事。{w}他回到楼上的卧室，用钥匙开了门，而那把钥匙后来被留在了原来的抽屉里——"

    # game/script.rpy:23823
    old "So you really grabbed it when you were chasing us? You wanted to trap us in the bedroom."
    new "所以你在追我们的时候，真的把钥匙拿走了？你想把我们困在卧室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:23833
    old "This is very confusing. Shut up for now."
    new "这太让人糊涂了。先给我闭嘴。"

    # game/script.rpy:23836
    old "What exactly did he say, and how did he escape?"
    new "他到底说了什么？又是怎么逃出去的？"

    # game/script.rpy:23837
    old "He said he didn't remember escaping in the first place. Then he left again, probably the same way you did."
    new "他说他根本不记得自己逃出去过。后来他又走了，大概和你离开的方式一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:23838
    old "I left out a lot of information purposely, and I didn't think he'd used the same method, but there was no way I'd give Sai an accurate response."
    new "我故意省略了很多信息。虽然我不觉得他用的是同一种方法，但无论如何，我都不会给 Sai 一个准确的回答。"

    # game/script.rpy:23843
    old "But where was the key left after he escaped? You retrieved it at the end and were able to open the door, so he didn't leave it outside, right?"
    new "可他逃出去之后，钥匙被留在哪儿了？你们最后取回了钥匙，还能打开门，所以他没有把钥匙留在外面，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:23849
    old "How intriguing. I just glossed over it when you mentioned his reappearance, but I'm not certain what to think anymore.{w} When you let him enter, you made sure he didn't have a key on his person, right?"
    new "真有意思。你提到他重新出现时，我没怎么细想，现在却不知道该怎么想了。{w}你们放他进来时，确认过他本人身上没有钥匙，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:23850
    old "Of course. We're not that stupid."
    new "当然。我们还没蠢到那种地步。"

    # game/script.rpy:23851
    old "Then, there's only one way he could've disappeared..."
    new "那么，他消失的方式就只剩下一种可能了……"

    # game/script.rpy:23852
    old "He let us know he wouldn't continue, but there was no doubt he was talking about the Sekimeiya."
    new "他表示不打算继续说下去，但毫无疑问，他说的就是 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:23857
    old "Where did you get this knife?"
    new "这把刀你从哪儿弄来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:23858
    old "No cryptic answer needed. I was honest earlier."
    new "这个不用故弄玄虚。我刚才说的是实话。"

    # game/script.rpy:23859
    old "You just found it, right?"
    new "你是刚捡到的，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:23860
    old "Good memory."
    new "记性不错。"

    # game/script.rpy:23861
    old "I wanted to ask about what he'd said regarding Shiroya's fate, but I couldn't bring myself to do it with her next to me."
    new "我想问他那些关于 Shiroya 命运的话，可她就站在我身边，我实在开不了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:23862
    old "Are you done?"
    new "问完了？"

    # game/script.rpy:23863
    old "I'll repeat an earlier question: what the fuck are you trying to do now?"
    new "我再问一遍之前的问题：你现在到底他妈想干什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:23868
    old "Hm...{w} I'm just finishing off your ignorance."
    new "嗯……{w}我只是来结束你们的无知。"

    # game/script.rpy:23874
    old "How did I know you'd respond with a stupid-sounding \"what\"? Did you not understand I'm purposely being unclear? Being told the answer is no fun. I'm sorry if you disagree."
    new "我怎么知道你会回一句傻乎乎的『什么』？你是没看出来我故意不说清楚吗？直接告诉你答案就没意思了。你要是不乐意，那就抱歉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:23877
    old "Why would I even assume you're not being misleading?"
    new "我凭什么认为你没在误导我？"

    # game/script.rpy:23878
    old "Why would you assume that? Naturally, you should keep it in mind, but understanding what I'm saying and then deciding whether to trust it is what I'd advise."
    new "你凭什么这么想？当然，这一点你该记在心里；不过我的建议是，先听懂我在说什么，再决定要不要信。"

    # game/script.rpy:23879
    old "Are you not going to touch the Sekimeiya?"
    new "你不打算碰 Sekimeiya 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:23884
    old "Are you that eager to see me disappear? I will, don't worry. It's been eleven minutes already, so I'd have no problem leaving now."
    new "你就这么急着看我消失？放心，我会的。已经过去十一分钟了，我现在走也没问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:23885
    old "...Where were you? Why did you not show yourself until now?"
    new "……你刚才在哪？为什么到现在才现身？"

    # game/script.rpy:23890
    old "I was here, searching for you."
    new "我一直在这儿找你。"

    # game/script.rpy:23891
    old "There's no way you didn't see us for so long."
    new "你不可能那么久都没看见我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:23892
    old "Well, it's not my problem if you're not content with my answers."
    new "你要是不满意我的回答，那也不关我的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:23893
    old "I fell quiet again. I had no idea how to interpret his attitude, but I wouldn't refuse to ask more questions if he had some of his own to respond with."
    new "我又沉默了。他这副态度究竟是什么意思，我毫无头绪；不过只要他还愿意回答，我也不会停止追问。"

    # game/script.rpy:23896
    old "Why did I not find you in hallway B?"
    new "为什么我在B走廊没找到你？"

    # game/script.rpy:23897
    old "Because you are incompetent."
    new "因为你没本事。"

    # game/script.rpy:23898
    old "Where were you, then?"
    new "那你到底在哪？"

    # game/script.rpy:23899
    old "In hallway B."
    new "B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:23900
    old "...{w}Who killed Katei?"
    new "……{w}是谁杀了 Katei？"

    # game/script.rpy:23901
    old "Either Akaro or Erina."
    new "不是 Akaro 就是 Erina。"

    # game/script.rpy:23902
    old "...Who killed Erina?"
    new "……是谁杀了 Erina？"

    # game/script.rpy:23908
    old "Me."
    new "我。"

    # game/script.rpy:23913
    old "I'm just kidding. It was Isla."
    new "开个玩笑。是 Isla。"

    # game/script.rpy:23914
    old "I'm just kidding. Either Akaro or Katei."
    new "开个玩笑。不是 Akaro 就是 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:23915
    old "I stopped caring about his behavior. Additionally, I'd found a reason to stall for time."
    new "我不再理会他这副态度了。况且，我已经找到了拖延时间的理由。"

    # game/script.rpy:23918
    old "You perfectly remember when we went up to the attic to get the lithium battery, right?"
    new "我们上阁楼去拿锂电池那件事，你记得一清二楚，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:23924
    old "How did you do that?"
    new "你是怎么做到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:23925
    old "I said you're incompetent, but at least you're doing your best, unlike the others."
    new "我说过你没本事，不过至少你还在尽力，不像其他人。"

    # game/script.rpy:23926
    old "Hm...?"
    new "嗯……？"

    # game/script.rpy:23927
    old "That's my answer. I suppose it just appeared impressive from your point of view."
    new "这就是我的回答。大概只是从你的角度看，才显得了不起吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:23928
    old "Okay, then who killed Naomi? Who's the culprit behind everything?"
    new "好，那 Naomi 是谁杀的？这一切幕后的凶手又是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:23933
    old "The culprit? Don't be silly.{w} And I'm not sure why you're asking me this when I recall saying over and over that Katei did it."
    new "凶手？别傻了。{w}我记得自己反复说过，是 Katei 干的，真不明白你为什么还要问我。"

    # game/script.rpy:23934
    old "Then... why the fuck were there two Naomis?"
    new "那……为什么会有两个 Naomi？"

    # game/script.rpy:23935
    old "That's a big one. I only have vague ideas, unfortunately, and none that I'm willing to share."
    new "这可是个大问题。可惜我只有些模糊的想法，而且哪条都不想说。"

    # game/script.rpy:23938
    old "You talk a lot, but you're not really saying anything. How did you escape from the bedroom?"
    new "你话是不少，可什么都没说。你是怎么从卧室里逃出来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:23943
    old "With this."
    new "用这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:23944
    old "He looked down at the Sekimeiya and signaled that it was his answer."
    new "他低头看向 Sekimeiya，示意那就是答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:23945
    old "What about this blood on the floor? Whose is it?"
    new "那地上这些血呢？是谁的？"

    # game/script.rpy:23947
    old "What about in the lobby? It should've been left while you were alone with Akaro."
    new "大厅里的呢？那应该是你和 Akaro 单独待着的时候留下的吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:23952
    old "You mean the one drop, right?"
    new "你是说那一滴，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:23953
    old "What else would I mean?"
    new "还能是哪滴？"

    # game/script.rpy:23958
    old "That's a great question, as you could only mean the one drop... We said I'd answer cryptically, right?"
    new "问得好，毕竟你能指的只可能是那一滴……我们说好了我会卖关子，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:23960
    old "If I'm right, that drop belongs to a person whose blood is not currently anywhere else, and they were one of the people who did not escape the attic's bedroom before Akaro and I did. Currently, that person is alive, and is found inside the tower. Furthermore, I estimate they're on one of the first four floors, standing up."
    new "如果我没猜错，那滴血属于一个人：他的血现在不在其他任何地方，而他也是没能在我和 Akaro 之前逃出阁楼卧室的人之一。这个人现在还活着，就在塔里。而且，我估计他就在前四层中的某一层，还站着。"

    # game/script.rpy:23963
    old "Also, their name starts with \"Shiroy\"."
    new "还有，这个人的名字以『Shiroy』开头。"

    # game/script.rpy:23969
    old "You have time to think."
    new "你有时间慢慢想。"

    # game/script.rpy:23970
    old "...Why would it be me? Did you actually see me?"
    new "……怎么会是我？你真的看见我了？"

    # game/script.rpy:23975
    old "This is the part where a lot of things get a little too confusing. I'm not fully certain about what I'm saying, but decently so. Nonetheless, what I said about your fate still stands, and I'm much more certain about it, so my condolences. It appears it won't be me who will kill you, though."
    new "接下来这段，很多事情会变得相当混乱。我没法完全确定自己说的话，但把握还不小。不过，关于你命运的判断依然成立，而且我对此更有把握，所以节哀。只不过，看来杀你的人不会是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:23976
    old "Why are you saying this...!?"
    new "你为什么要说这种话……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:23981
    old "Because I have eyes. That might sound unfair, though—you do too, but you don't understand. That's what I don't quite get.{w} Regardless, that's it. I'll touch the Sekimeiya and immediately appear from hallway B. I'll see you."
    new "因为我有眼睛。这话听着或许不公平——你也有眼睛，只是看不懂。这一点我倒是真不明白。{w}总之，就到这里。我去碰 Sekimeiya，然后立刻从B走廊出现。回见。"

    # game/script.rpy:23985
    old "Before he could finish that sentence, Shiroya and I dashed at him, reacting the way we'd prepared ourselves to."
    new "他话还没说完，我和 Shiroya 就朝他冲了过去，反应和事先准备好的一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:23990
    old "...Hm? What are you...?"
    new "……嗯？你们要做什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:23991
    old "Of course, we weren't going to stop him—we knew that. He was slightly taken aback, but he had more than enough time to touch the Sekimeiya before we got to him."
    new "当然，我们并不打算拦住他——我们清楚这一点。他稍稍一怔，但在我们赶到之前，他仍有充裕的时间碰到 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:23992
    old "However, we didn't need to touch it directly. Alongside the stored time, the range of the Sekimeiya had to be small. If we could enter it before he touched it, we'd travel the same amount of time as him. Then, in the recent past, we'd have one chance to stop or understand his actions."
    new "不过，我们并不需要直接碰到它。除了蓄积的时间，Sekimeiya 的作用范围也必定很小。只要在他触及之前进入范围，我们便能穿越与他相同长度的时间。这样一来，在不久前的过去，我们就有一次机会阻止他，或者弄清他的举动。"

    # game/script.rpy:23999
    old "As soon as he realized that was our plan, his face showed its first sign of uncertainty, and he rapidly moved his right arm to reach the Sekimeiya."
    new "他一看出这是我们的打算，脸上第一次显出犹疑，随即迅速抬起右臂去够 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:24000
    old "It should've been futile. The room wasn't very big, and our sprint had put us fairly close to him..."
    new "这本该是徒劳。房间并不算大，而我们一路冲刺，已经离他相当近了……"

    # game/script.rpy:24005
    old "However, when his skin made contact with the Sekimeiya, his entire figure disappeared in an instant."
    new "然而，他的皮肤刚一触到 Sekimeiya，整个人便在一瞬间消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24007
    old "In midair, the Sekimeiya turned gray, and when it hit the floor, the sound made it seem almost like it had broken. I stared at it, dumbfounded, while it rolled around for some long seconds."
    new "半空中，Sekimeiya 化成了灰色，落地时的声响几乎像是摔碎了。我怔怔地望着它在地上滚了好几秒。"

    # game/script.rpy:24008
    old "I guess we weren't fast enough..."
    new "看来我们还是慢了一步……"

    # game/script.rpy:24018
    old "I turned to my side.{w} Nobody was there."
    new "我转头看向身旁。{w}空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:24019
    old "Shiroya... wasn't there. I spun and saw that I was alone with the powered-off Sekimeiya."
    new "Shiroya……不在。我转过身，只剩我和已经熄灭的 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:24021
    old "What the fuck...?{w} Did the range reach her?{w} Why her but not me?"
    new "怎么回事……？{w}范围波及到她了吗？{w}为什么是她，不是我？"

    # game/script.rpy:24028
    old "I stood still and imagined where the three of us had been. ...Could the range have only missed me?"
    new "我立在原地，回想我们三人方才各自的位置。……难道范围恰好只漏掉了我？"

    # game/script.rpy:24029
    old "I think so...  She was at my right side, but directly faced Sai, unlike me."
    new "应该是……她当时在我右侧，却正面朝着 Sai，而我没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:24030
    old "It didn't directly prove it, but it would've made sense if the range was circular, probably spherical."
    new "这算不上直接证明，但如果范围是圆形的——多半还是球形——那就说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24037
    old "I'd been visualizing it that way already, and it seemed like it fit. The range must've been small, so perhaps only she had been in it."
    new "我本来就一直这样设想，如今看来也吻合。范围一定很小，所以当时在里面的，或许只有她。"

    # game/script.rpy:24040
    old "I didn't know how it worked—maybe your entire body had to be part of the range, or maybe only being partially hit was enough."
    new "我不知道它的判定方式——也许整个人都得落在范围内，也许只碰到一部分就足够。"

    # game/script.rpy:24050
    old "Transparent Reality"
    new "透明的现实"

    # game/script.rpy:24052
    old "Or... was there another reason? What if I was encompassed inside, but for some reason, I didn't travel?"
    new "又或者……另有原因？万一我其实也在范围之内，只是出于某种缘由没有穿越呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:24053
    old "I was very lost, and I began to have a hard time working with what had happened. Until then, a maximum of two people had traveled each time. Was that the maximum amount? Had I been excluded for another reason, maybe?"
    new "我完全摸不着头脑，渐渐理不清眼前的状况。在此之前，每次穿越的最多不过两人。这就是上限吗？还是说，我是因为别的原因被排除在外？"

    # game/script.rpy:24054
    old "But... why is nothing happening?"
    new "可是……为什么什么都没发生？"

    # game/script.rpy:24055
    old "Both of them just traveled to the past, so why haven't they arrived already? They must be somewhere..."
    new "他们俩刚刚穿越回过去，怎么到现在还没出现？他们肯定在某个地方……"

    # game/script.rpy:24060
    old "That was what Sai had said: a version of himself might've been waiting in hallway B.{w} I approached the door and looked through it. I saw a handful of open doors that I'd left that way, but no sign of life."
    new "Sai 是这么说的：另一个他也许正等在 B走廊。{w}我走到门边，透过门看去。有几扇门还像我离开时那样敞着，却不见半点人影。"

    # game/script.rpy:24064
    old "I turned around and looked at hallway A instead. While most of the doors were closed in its case, I still couldn't see anyone."
    new "我转身改看 A走廊。那边大多数门都关着，可同样看不到任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:24065
    old "Could something have happened that's preventing them from reappearing? They have to be in the tower, right?"
    new "会不会出了什么变故，让他们无法现身？他们总该还在塔里吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:24069
    old "I walked up to the Sekimeiya and kneeled next to it. Then, I placed my right hand on it and felt its cold and smooth surface. Once again, it had powered off after a travel, but it hadn't teleported itself away."
    new "我走到 Sekimeiya 旁跪下，把右手搭上去，掌心传来冰凉光滑的触感。它又一次在穿越后熄灭，却没有把自己传送走。"

    # game/script.rpy:24070
    old "I waited. I was banking on something being about to happen, so I stood still, glancing back and forth between the two doors and trying to shake away the bitter taste the conversation with Sai left in my mouth."
    new "我等着。我在赌接下来会发生些什么，于是静静站着，目光在两扇门之间来回游移，想把与 Sai 那番对话留在口中的苦涩甩掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:24072
    old "However, nothing was changing. I was getting worried, but I didn't know what to do.{w} After some minutes of standing up, I started to feel uncertain."
    new "可是，一切毫无变化。我越来越不安，却不知该如何是好。{w}站了几分钟后，心中开始动摇。"

    # game/script.rpy:24075
    old "Suddenly, the Sekimeiya turned white. I estimated about five minutes had passed since Sai and Shiroya vanishing, and the Sekimeiya had probably been storing energy for close to fifteen before their travel."
    new "忽然，Sekimeiya 变白了。我估计距离 Sai 和 Shiroya 消失才过了五分钟，而在他们穿越之前，Sekimeiya 大概已经蓄能将近十五分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:24076
    old "I looked at it intensely and had an idea. Could touching it while in the gray state prevent it from teleporting itself as soon as it turned white? I couldn't think of much else if Sai had been correct earlier."
    new "我紧盯着它，忽然冒出一个念头：如果在它呈灰色时触碰它，能不能让它在变白的那一刻无法自我传送？要是 Sai 先前所言不虚，我实在想不出别的解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:24077
    old "No, that doesn't make sense... When we traveled from the cleaning room, it fell in the buckets below the cleaning cart, and when the others found it, it was already white. Of course, I'd have to believe Sai's story to be sure, but nobody objected to it."
    new "不对，这说不通……我们从清洁间穿越那次，它掉进了清洁车下面的水桶里，等其他人找到它时，它已经是白色的了。当然，要确定这一点，我得先相信 Sai 的说法，可当时并没有人提出异议。"

    # game/script.rpy:24078
    old "I was really unsure about what to do. The silence had become unbearable in just those five minutes, and I couldn't understand why neither Sai nor Shiroya had returned."
    new "我实在拿不定主意。仅仅五分钟，这份寂静就已让人难以忍受，我不明白 Sai 和 Shiroya 为什么都还没回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:24083
    old "Like Sai had done, I put my hand under my sleeve and grabbed the Sekimeiya. Then, I placed it inside the cold cabinet that Sai left unlocked and scrolled the glass shut. I didn't lock it—I'd just felt the need to not leave it outside, and I knew Sai was the one who had the key anyway."
    new "我学着 Sai 的样子，把手缩进袖子里，拿起 Sekimeiya，放进 Sai 没上锁的冰冷展示柜，再把玻璃门拉上。我没有上锁——只是觉得不该把它留在外面，况且我知道钥匙在 Sai 手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:24086
    old "Afterward, I didn't know what to do. I felt a pressing atmosphere, as if I was the sole remaining being in that immense building."
    new "之后，我不知道该做什么。空气沉重得压在胸口，仿佛这栋巨大的建筑里只剩下我一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:24090
    old "Is it possible they appeared outside the tower...? Even though the distance traveled had to be short, the replicated location is an entirely different deal. Maybe that's what Sai meant when he said that he didn't care about how far he'd make it to the past, if he knew he'd appear outside regardless and was lying about immediately reappearing from hallway B."
    new "他们会不会出现在塔外……？就算穿越的时间跨度很短，复制的落点也完全是另一回事。也许 Sai 那句话就是这个意思——他说过不在乎自己会回到多远的过去；如果他明知自己无论如何都会落在塔外，那他说自己会立刻从 B走廊现身，就只是在撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:24091
    old "But it can't be that Sai's goal was to leave. He wouldn't willingly walk away from all of this. Unless he learned something very important that would've changed his mind, if he wanted to escape, it must be that he planned to eventually reenter through the storeroom..."
    new "但 Sai 的目的不可能是离开。他不会甘愿抛下这一切。除非他得知了什么足以改变主意的重要事情；倘若他真想脱身，那必定是打算之后从储藏室再进来……"

    # game/script.rpy:24092
    old "And what about the other Shiroya? She should be still here."
    new "那另一个 Shiroya 呢？她应该还在这里才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:24093
    old "Given the circumstances, she's sealed inside the tower. There's no way she could've left through the storeroom since no handle could be reattached to the door—opening it from the inside is pretty much out of the question."
    new "照这情形，她被封在塔里。她不可能从储藏室出去——那扇门已经装不回把手，想从里面打开几乎无从谈起。"

    # game/script.rpy:24094
    old "Using the Sekimeiya to escape should've been equally hard, though. While she could've taken it out of the cabinet while we went to the attic, it was still locked inside when we came back. She couldn't have appeared outside the tower because she couldn't have left it locked again."
    new "不过，想靠 Sekimeiya 逃出去，应该也同样困难。我们上阁楼那段时间，她本可以把它从展示柜里取出来，可我们回来时它仍锁在里面。她不可能出现在塔外，因为她没法再把它锁回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:24097
    old "I was just trying to reinforce the thought that I wasn't alone, acting as if it was impossible.{w} What if she'd appeared outside the tower, entered through the storeroom from the outside, and left the door open to leave after placing the Sekimeiya in the cabinet? It looked like motives behind actions had stopped mattering, so being sure about any detail had started to feel impossible."
    new "我只是在反复说服自己并非孤身一人，装作那根本不可能。{w}可万一她真的出现在塔外，从外面经储藏室进来，把 Sekimeiya 放进展示柜后又敞着门离开呢？行动背后的动机似乎早已不重要，任何细节都变得无法确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:24098
    old "The existence of that secret door made me anxious every time I thought about my situation. Not only did I not know if more people were around, but I also had no way to know if they would enter at any time. I didn't even know if the door led outside, if opening it from the other side was possible, or if anyone would be able to enter without being seen."
    new "一想到自己的处境，那扇暗门就让我坐立不安。我既不知道还有没有别人在，也无从得知他们会不会随时进来。我甚至不知道那扇门是否通向外面、能否从另一侧打开，也不知道有没有人能神不知鬼不觉地进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:24099
    old "But only being able to hear my own breath, more empty minutes passed."
    new "然而耳边只有自己的呼吸，空荡荡的几分钟又过去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24102
    old "What could be going on? Sai said he hadn't killed anyone, so could it be that the true culprit found them and that's why they haven't come back?"
    new "究竟出了什么事？Sai 说过他没有杀任何人，那会不会是真正的凶手找上了他们，所以他们才没回来？"

    # game/script.rpy:24103
    old "At some point, my anxiety had become overwhelming. I didn't know whether to fear Sai, a different, true culprit, or the sudden solitude itself."
    new "不知从何时起，我的不安已经压得人喘不过气。我分不清自己该害怕的是 Sai，是另一个真正的凶手，还是这突如其来的孤独本身。"

    # game/script.rpy:24109
    old "I walked out to hallway B and began to take automatic steps toward the lobby. I'd been trying not to leave the Sekimeiya behind, but since I hadn't been able to let the proposition of being alone sink in, I succumbed to the need to wander around."
    new "我走到 B走廊，脚步不由自主地朝大厅而去。我本想尽量不要把 Sekimeiya 留在身后，可「只剩我一人」这个念头始终压在心里，终究还是忍不住四处走动。"

    # game/script.rpy:24114
    old "I looked at the vast, empty lobby, and what felt like a metal ball started to make its way down my stomach. Every step I took was all I could hear."
    new "我望着空旷的大厅，仿佛有一颗铁球顺着胃往下坠。除了自己的脚步声，我什么也听不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:24120
    old "When I entered hallway A, I became convinced of it: Sai and Shiroya had escaped. That had to have been the meaning behind Sai's words, but it was impossible to know if I'd see them again before {time=21.}"
    new "走进 A走廊时，我总算确信了：Sai 和 Shiroya 已经脱身。Sai 那番话的意思必定如此，只是我无从知道，在 {time=21.} 之前还能不能再见到他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:24121
    old "Even the other Shiroya, whose existence seemed incredibly volatile, had hidden from me as her only action. Without a search partner, anyone could stay out of my view if they so desired."
    new "就连那个存在极不稳定的 Shiroya，唯一的举动也只是躲着我。没有同伴一起搜寻，任何人只要愿意，都能一直不出现在我的视野里。"

    # game/script.rpy:24133
    old "I continued walking toward hallway C, not even trying to find anyone. When I completed the full lap, I stepped into the event room and let out a sigh full of myriad emotions."
    new "我继续朝 C走廊走去，甚至没再想着找人。绕完一整圈后，我走进活动室，长叹一声，百感交集。"

    # game/script.rpy:24138
    old "I guess that... if I am alone, it wouldn't be that bad. I would only have to wait three hours to see Shiroya again."
    new "我想……如果只有我一个人，倒也没那么糟。只要等上三个小时，就能再见到 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:24139
    old "But if Sai wasn't a killer, they still have to be here. And I don't know what Sai's plan was, but it could still be in motion."
    new "可如果 Sai 不是凶手，就一定还在这里。我不知道 Sai 的计划是什么，但计划可能还在继续。"

    # game/script.rpy:24143
    old "Once again, I stood still and waited, leaning against the wall while a few more minutes of silence passed."
    new "我再次靠着墙站定，静静等着，沉默又过去了几分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:24154
    old "I walked up to the cabinet and uncovered the curtain."
    new "我走到展示柜前，掀开了盖在上面的遮布。"

    # game/script.rpy:24155
    old "Should I try to use it...?"
    new "要不要试着用一下……？"

    # game/script.rpy:24156
    old "Anything could determine the replicated location. Perhaps Sai knew that touching the Sekimeiya would bring him outside, so the same could apply if I do it now myself."
    new "任何细节都可能决定复制出的地点。也许 Sai 知道，只要碰一下 Sekimeiya 就会被带到外面；如果我现在这么做，或许也会一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:24157
    old "It wasn't too bad of an idea. If anything had gone wrong for them, I had the opportunity to reproduce it with the purpose of understanding what had happened."
    new "这主意倒不算坏。如果对方那边出了什么岔子，我正好可以重现一遍，弄清究竟发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:24163
    old "I opened the glass and rolled the cold Sekimeiya to my shirt. I knew I'd have to wait some time for it to gain energy, but it would only be a few minutes. Even if I couldn't conclude anything, I'd travel some time back, so I could retrieve the Sekimeiya as soon as I disappeared."
    new "我打开玻璃柜门，把冰冷的 Sekimeiya 卷进衬衫里贴住身体。我知道要等它蓄能，但只需几分钟。哪怕最后什么也推断不出，我也能回到过去一段时间，这样自己一消失，就能立刻取回 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:24170
    old "...{w}Out of the blue, I recalled something else.{w} Awkwardly, I put my free left hand in my right pocket and took out a key. I'd found it in the cleaning room just earlier, high on a shelf."
    new "……{w}忽然，我又想起了另一件事。{w}我用空着的左手别扭地伸进右边口袋，掏出一把钥匙。那是我刚才在清洁间找到的，就放在架子高处。"

    # game/script.rpy:24171
    old "Nothing on it indicated what it was for, as it looked like a simple key that could unlock any normal door. I gave it a good look, sensing that something was about to come to me."
    new "钥匙上没有任何标记能说明用途，看上去只是一把普通钥匙，能打开任何一扇寻常的门。我仔细端详着它，感觉有什么念头正要浮上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:24172
    old "Oh... Am I actually stupid?"
    new "哦……我难道是傻子吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:24173
    old "It looks a lot like the one for Naomi's locker. That's what it is, even though the color is slightly different."
    new "它和 Naomi 储物柜的那把很像。没错，就是那把，只是颜色稍有不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:24175
    old "I had no simple way to compare them since I'd gotten rid of the other one through the toilet."
    new "我已经把另一把钥匙冲进马桶了，没法再拿来简单比对。"

    # game/script.rpy:24176
    old "I remembered that her locker had potentially been opened while we were in the attic. Could that have been the key to that mystery?"
    new "我记得我们在阁楼时，她的储物柜可能被人打开过。这会不会就是解开那个谜团的钥匙？"

    # game/script.rpy:24185
    old "I shut myself in the staff room with the Sekimeiya since I wanted it to spend a few minutes out of the cabinet. I knew which locker was Naomi's, and as I thought, it was open.{w} I attempted to insert the key in the keyhole, but it didn't fully go in."
    new "我带着 Sekimeiya 进了员工室，关上门，好让它在展示柜外待上几分钟。我知道哪个是 Naomi 的储物柜，过去一看，果然开着。{w}我试着把钥匙插进锁孔，却插不到底。"

    # game/script.rpy:24186
    old "Huh, it's not the right one."
    new "咦，不是这把。"

    # game/script.rpy:24187
    old "It almost fits, though. Does it open another one?"
    new "不过几乎能对上。难道是开别的柜子？"

    # game/script.rpy:24188
    old "Eager to find out, I left the Sekimeiya on the floor and began to insert the key in every locker."
    new "我急于确认，便把 Sekimeiya 放在地上，开始把钥匙逐个插进每个储物柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:24189
    old "I started with the left ones and saw that the key would always enter partially. Some of them looked like they'd almost open, but I could never turn the key. I continued with the middle group and was met with the exact same result."
    new "我先从左边的柜子试起，钥匙每次只能插进去一截。有几个似乎差一点就能打开，可钥匙始终转不动。我又接着试中间一排，结果完全相同。"

    # game/script.rpy:24190
    old "I was about to sigh in disappointment, but when I tried to turn it after inserting it in the last one of the rightmost set, I heard a sudden, sharp sound. Understanding its meaning, I dragged the metallic door toward me and saw the interior of a new locker."
    new "我正要失望地叹气，可当我把钥匙插进最右侧最后一个柜子并试着转动时，忽然听见一声清脆的响动。我立刻明白那意味着什么，把金属柜门朝自己拉开，看见了这个柜子里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:24195
    old "However, its contents were painfully similar to Naomi's. There was nothing in the highest compartment, and a winter coat hung in the main one. As the biggest difference, a pair of brown, corduroy pants were folded on the bottom."
    new "可里面的东西却和 Naomi 的柜子像得令人无奈。最上层空着，主格里挂着一件冬季外套。最大的不同，是底层叠着一条棕色灯芯绒长裤。"

    # game/script.rpy:24197
    old "Even though they didn't seem to be much use, there was a chance someone left their phone in those clothes. I put the key back in my pocket, crouched to grab the pants, and held them up with one hand while I felt them."
    new "虽然这条裤子看上去没什么用，但也许有人把手机落在了衣服里。我把钥匙收回口袋，蹲下拿起裤子，用一只手提着，另一只手摸索起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:24201
    old "Not only was there not a phone, every pocket was completely empty and clean, making it seem like the pants had been recently bought. I determined that they belonged to a considerably sized adult, probably male. Since clothes had been left in the locker, it was more than likely that it belonged to a staff member who wore a uniform during work."
    new "里面不仅没有手机，每个口袋都空空荡荡、干干净净，像是刚买不久。我判断裤子属于一个体型相当魁梧的成年人，多半是男性。既然有便服留在柜子里，这个柜子很可能属于一名上班时穿制服的员工。"

    # game/script.rpy:24202
    old "I recalled Katei had told us that the employees used the room to store personal objects and to leave their uniforms before heading off. There was no uniform in the locker, so everything indicated that the owner had come to work that day."
    new "我想起 Katei 说过，员工会用这个房间存放私人物品，下班离开前也会把制服留在这里。柜子里没有制服，种种迹象都表明，柜子的主人那天来上过班。"

    # game/script.rpy:24205
    old "I knew that I'd found the key in the cleaning room, but something still felt iffy about that, preventing me from jumping to conclusions.{w} I folded the pants and put them inside before I grabbed the heavy coat."
    new "我知道钥匙是在清洁间找到的，可这件事总让我觉得哪里不对劲，不敢贸然下结论。{w}我把裤子叠好放回柜中，又拿起那件厚重的外套。"

    # game/script.rpy:24208
    old "It was pretty big, so I began to run my hand over its surface in search of anything I could find.{w} Almost immediately, I took something from a pocket."
    new "外套相当大，我开始用手在表面摸索，想找出些什么。{w}几乎立刻，我就从口袋里掏出了一样东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:24209
    old "It was a set of four keys with a dog-shaped keychain. I had nothing to use them for, and I didn't recognize any, so I put them back in the pocket. I continued searching for anything else and shortly confirmed that every other pocket was empty."
    new "那是一串四把钥匙，挂着狗形钥匙扣。这些钥匙我根本用不上，也一把都不认识，便放回口袋。我继续翻找，很快确认其余口袋全是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:24210
    old "But I continued feeling the surface of the coat because something had prompted my attention. I didn't know if I'd imagined it, but I thought I felt a minuscule bulge near the neck."
    new "但我仍在摸索外套表面，因为有个地方引起了我的注意。我不知道是不是自己多心，但领口附近似乎有一处极小的凸起。"

    # game/script.rpy:24211
    old "I kept going over the same spot until I was sure that I'd been right. Something very hard to notice was there.{w} Intrigued, I turned the cloth around and saw that part of the neck area was covered by a different type of material. I put my finger under it and found that the two layers allowed for a narrow cavity."
    new "我反复摸同一处，直到确信自己没有弄错。那里确实有一样极难察觉的东西。{w}我来了兴趣，把布料翻过来，发现领口一部分覆着另一种材质。我把手指探到下面，发现两层布料之间有一道狭窄的空隙。"

    # game/script.rpy:24212
    old "I drew my finger up to the spot where I'd felt the bulge, trying to find it on the opposite side."
    new "我把手指移到刚才摸到凸起的位置，试图从另一面找到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:24215
    old "There it is."
    new "就是这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:24216
    old "It felt cold and round. With my thumb, I managed to grab and extract it."
    new "那东西摸起来冰冷、圆润。我用拇指捏住，把它取了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:24217
    old "Oh, what the fuck? Isn't this...?"
    new "妈的，这不是……？"

    # game/script.rpy:24220
    old "A bug. That was what it looked like.{w} I'd never personally seen one, but it had a very similar shape to the ones I'd seen in television shows. It was circular, and on its surface was what looked like a microchip. By adding the location where I'd found it, I could only recognize it as a spying bug."
    new "窃听器。看上去就是那种东西。{w}我从没亲眼见过，但它的外形和电视节目里出现的非常相似。它是圆形的，表面有个像微型芯片的东西。再结合发现它的位置，我只能认定这是窃听器。"

    # game/script.rpy:24221
    old "Was a staff member being monitored? Could Xyn have planted a bug on a staff member to learn about the measures Ashiya were taking against them?"
    new "有员工正在被监视吗？难道是 Xyn 把窃听器装在某个员工身上，好掌握芦屋针对他们的对策？"

    # game/script.rpy:24222
    old "No, that doesn't make a ton of sense. They wouldn't plant it on clothes that are always left in this locker.{w} Could it be the inverse, then? Did Ashiya suspect they were part of Xyn?"
    new "不，这不太说得通。他们不会把窃听器装在这种一直留在柜子里的衣服上。{w}那么，反过来呢？难道是芦屋怀疑这名员工是 Xyn 的人？"

    # game/script.rpy:24226
    old "Even though the day's events had morphed into something nearly incomprehensible, they had started from Ashiya and Xyn's battle; it was foolish to think Xyn weren't involved in some way."
    new "尽管今天发生的一切已经变得几乎令人费解，但事情的起点是芦屋与 Xyn 的争斗；若以为 Xyn 与此事毫无关系，未免太天真了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24227
    old "And something had been cemented as reality: one of Ashiya's staff members was being monitored. I'd already seen the interior of Katei's and Naomi's lockers, the two staff members I was familiar with. Someone else must've owned that one."
    new "而且有一件事已经成了确凿的现实：芦屋的一名员工正受到监视。我已经看过 Katei 和 Naomi 的储物柜内部，这两个员工我都熟悉。这个柜子一定属于另一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:24228
    old "I looked at it closely, haunted by the truth behind it. Could someone have been hearing my movements in a completely safe space somewhere in Yushibana? If so, they might've realized the bug had been found, but I couldn't imagine they were listening to it at all times."
    new "我仔细端详着它，心头被它背后的真相压得发沉。是不是有人正待在丰花某个绝对安全的地方，听着我这边的动静？如果是这样，对方或许已经察觉窃听器被发现了，但我想他们不可能时时刻刻都在听。"

    # game/script.rpy:24231
    old "I put the coat back in the locker, but I didn't reattach the bug to it, mainly because it looked tricky to do. Instead, I left it in one of its pockets, knowing it'd be found by the police if I mentioned it to them."
    new "我把外套放回柜子，却没有把窃听器重新装回去，主要是因为装回去太麻烦。我把它留在其中一个口袋里，心想只要我向警方提起，他们自然会找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:24233
    old "I glanced down at the Sekimeiya. Since I had the key to a new locker, I could lock it inside and look around the entire building for Shiroya."
    new "我低头瞥了一眼 Sekimeiya。既然手上有了一个新柜子的钥匙，我就能把它锁进去，再把整栋楼搜一遍，找 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:24234
    old "No, I shouldn't do that. This could be part of someone's plan."
    new "不，不能这么做。这可能正是某个人计划中的一环。"

    # game/script.rpy:24237
    old "How can it be that this key was never found in the cleaning room with how much we've searched this floor? Doesn't it look like obvious bait to make someone believe they have a safe space to hide the Sekimeiya?"
    new "我们把这层楼搜了这么多遍，这把钥匙怎么可能一直在清洁间里没被发现？这难道不是明摆着的诱饵，让人以为有了个能安全藏 Sekimeiya 的地方？"

    # game/script.rpy:24238
    old "If the culprit, or let's say Sai, found the key well-hidden or had it somewhere, they could've duplicated it with the Sekimeiya. Then, they left it in the cleaning room and hoped someone would take the bait and keep the Sekimeiya in a locker they also had access to."
    new "如果凶手——干脆就说 Sai——找到这把藏得很好的钥匙，或者本来就有这把钥匙，就能用 Sekimeiya 复制一把。然后把复制品留在清洁间里，指望有人上钩，把 Sekimeiya 放进一个他同样能打开的柜子里。"

    # game/script.rpy:24239
    old "But it was all right. I intended to touch the Sekimeiya, so, I'd have time to search the building in the past. That way, I'd know for a fact that nobody could take it in the meantime."
    new "不过没关系。我本来就打算触碰 Sekimeiya，所以能回到过去，花时间搜完整栋楼。这样一来，我就能确定在此期间没人能把它拿走。"

    # game/script.rpy:24240
    old "I put my hand behind the cloth of my shirt and felt the Sekimeiya's surface. As I thought, it had begun to heat up."
    new "我把手伸进衬衫里，摸了摸 Sekimeiya 的表面。果然，它已经开始发热。"

    # game/script.rpy:24241
    old "I couldn't take my eyes off of it. Sai chose to leave it behind, which made his intentions feel impossible to understand."
    new "我的视线没法从它上面移开。Sai 选择把它留下，这让我完全无法理解他的意图。"

    # game/script.rpy:24242
    old "Ever since the time he'd escaped from the attic's bedroom, he had undoubtedly learned a few key details and found some attainable goals. ...A sudden thought confused me: if a culprit had been using the Sekimeiya to never be found and was responsible for all the deaths, why had they not targeted Sai?"
    new "自从他从阁楼的卧室逃走后，他无疑已经掌握了一些关键细节，也找到了几个可行的目标。……一个忽然冒出的念头让我困惑起来：如果凶手一直借助 Sekimeiya 让自己永远不被发现，而且所有死亡都是他造成的，那为什么没有对 Sai 下手？"

    # game/script.rpy:24245
    old "I had no idea, but thinking that Sai was the killer didn't fit very well either. Why had he spared my life earlier? Could he really have found a hidden knife we all missed? He even said it was poorly hidden and that he'd overstepped... What the hell did that mean?{w} \"Heh... That's wrong.\" Sai's voice played in my head.{w} \"What you two just said... is wrong.\""
    new "我毫无头绪，可认为 Sai 是凶手也同样说不通。他之前为什么放我一条生路？他真的找到了我们都没发现的藏刀吗？他甚至说那把刀藏得很拙劣，还说自己越界了……那到底是什么意思？{w}「呵……不对。」Sai 的声音在我脑中响起。{w}「你们俩刚才说的……错了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24246
    old "That had been in direct denial of Shiroya's claim: \"That doesn't mean anything. If you used the Sekimeiya to travel back in time after you killed them, it would have given you clean clothes from a past point, and the stained ones would have disappeared forever.\""
    new "那是在直接否定 Shiroya 的说法：「那说明不了什么。如果你杀了他们之后用 Sekimeiya 穿越回过去，它就会让你换上过去某个时间点的干净衣服，而沾了污渍的那套则会永远消失。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24247
    old "Should I take his word at face value and accept that he knows better than us?{w} What exactly is wrong about that? I can think of three different things."
    new "我该不该就这么信了他的话，承认他比我们更清楚内情？{w} 可这话究竟错在哪里？我能想到三种可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:24248
    old "He might've been referring to the part where his clothes would disappear forever. Perhaps they would appear somewhere, but that doesn't sound too likely.{w} Maybe he really meant that the Sekimeiya couldn't have achieved that, but there's no way we were wrong. We know such a thing could've occurred because the key to Naomi's locker was reconstructed in my pocket by traveling.{w} Did he maybe mean that he never could've achieved that under his own circumstances? Maybe he figured out what determines the replicated location, and he knew that given the way it works, the Sekimeiya would never have replicated a point in which his clothes were clean. Could that be it...?"
    new "他指的也许是衣服会永远消失这件事。那些衣服或许会出现在别的地方，但这听起来不太可能。{w} 又或者他真正的意思是，Sekimeiya 根本做不到这种事——可我们绝不可能弄错。钥匙就是证据：Naomi 储物柜的钥匙，就是在穿越中从我口袋里复现出来的。{w} 难道他想说的是，换作他自己的处境，他绝无可能做到？也许他已经弄清是什么决定了复现位置，并且知道按这套机制，Sekimeiya 绝不会复现出他衣服干净的那个时间点。会是这样吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:24251
    old "It was inscrutable. I had previously thought that the existence of the replicated location was something we'd finally deduced about the Sekimeiya's mechanics, and I'd been pretty confident about it. Sai could also have purely intended to taunt us and appear to have superior knowledge while we'd really been right on the mark."
    new "实在难以捉摸。我原以为，我们终于从 Sekimeiya 的运作机制里推断出了复现位置的存在，而且对此颇有把握。也有可能 Sai 纯粹是想挑衅我们，好显得他掌握的情报更高一筹，而实际上我们恰恰猜中了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24252
    old "Is there any travel we know has occurred that directly denies our theory?"
    new "有没有哪一次已知的时间穿越，能直接推翻我们的推论？"

    # game/script.rpy:24253
    old "I ran through every travel I knew about. Fairly quickly, I found an inconsistency."
    new "我在脑中把已知的每一次穿越都过了一遍。没过多久，就发现了一处矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:24256
    old "Oh, right, when I appeared in the security room and fell backward because the chair wasn't properly positioned for me to sit on it. The position where I appeared indicated that the replicated location was of me sitting on that chair, but I had never done that.{w} Oh, and the recording too. Of course, if it's legitimate, we assumed it was brought from the future. While there isn't a big issue, the way we were thinking the Sekimeiya worked doesn't make it that simple."
    new "哦，对了——那次我出现在监控室，椅子没摆在我能坐的位置，我整个人向后摔倒。我出现的位置表明，复现位置对应的是我坐在那把椅子上的样子，可我从没那样坐过。{w} 还有那段录音。当然，如果它是真的，我们之前一直推测它是从未来带回来的。这本身问题不大，但按照我们原先对 Sekimeiya 运作方式的理解，事情没这么简单。"

    # game/script.rpy:24257
    old "In a month from now, someone would have to hold the voice recorder. Then, farther in the future, that same person would have to go all the way back to today and have the time in which they held it as the replicated location.{w} It's not reasonable to rule that out, but it complicates everything a lot more.{w} But I can't just abandon that way of thinking about it. It can't be that you can bring any item you have to the past, or else the cleaning cart would've appeared with Shiroya in the attic."
    new "一个月后，得有人拿着那支录音笔。然后在更远的未来，同一个人还得一路回到今天，把他拿着录音笔的那段时间作为复现位置。{w} 这固然不能排除，但会让一切都复杂得多。{w} 可我也不能就此放弃这种思路。总不至于身上的任何东西都能带回过去吧——否则清洁车早该跟着 Shiroya 一起出现在阁楼里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24258
    old "How can we be wrong? There's no way we are...! We appeared in the attic exactly where we'd been prior to that point. That position was definitely based on a previous one, so we can't be completely wrong. However, there's the security room instance...{w} Like I thought back then, that can't be a random location... Sitting in front of the computer... Could it have been influenced by Katei's past position?{w} He was the one who sat on that chair a while before our travel, but why would this have mattered!?"
    new "我们怎么会错？绝不可能……！我们出现在阁楼时，位置正是之前待过的地方。那个位置绝对是基于先前的经历，所以我们的想法不可能全盘皆错。可监控室那一次……{w} 就像我当时想的，那不可能是个随意的位置……坐在电脑前……难道是被 Katei 之前的位置影响了？{w} 在我们穿越前不久，坐过那把椅子的人正是他，可这又有什么关系！？"

    # game/script.rpy:24263
    old "Sai was right. Something about what we'd said was wrong, but I didn't know what it was. It could've been a minor detail or a major contradiction."
    new "Sai 说得对。我们的话里确有错处，可我找不出是哪儿。也许只是一处细枝末节，也许是根本性的矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:24264
    old "I kneeled next to the Sekimeiya, ready to touch it. Sai had figured out a few things in a very short time, so I could do the same if I kept experimenting. The main purpose was to comprehend why Sai and Shiroya hadn't appeared, so I knew it was possible the travel wouldn't go smoothly."
    new "我在 Sekimeiya 旁边跪下，准备伸手触碰。Sai 在那么短的时间里就弄明白了几件事，只要我不断尝试，也能做到。眼下主要是想弄清 Sai 和 Shiroya 为什么没有出现，所以我也明白，这次穿越未必能顺利。"

    # game/script.rpy:24265
    old "I hesitated and had to take a moment to steady myself. I'd gotten used to sharing each travel with Shiroya, so doing it alone again like the first time was a bit imposing."
    new "我迟疑了一下，花了片刻才定下心神。每次穿越都有 Shiroya 同行，我已经习惯了；如今又要像第一次那样独自面对，多少有些令人发怵。"

    # game/script.rpy:24266
    old "I relaxed myself and let some more time pass. I estimated it was fifteen minutes since I'd gotten the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet, so I was about to travel just as far back as Sai and Shiroya had."
    new "我放松身体，又让时间过去了一阵。我估计把 Sekimeiya 从展示柜里取出来已有十五分钟，于是准备穿越到和 Sai、Shiroya 同样远的时间点。"

    # game/script.rpy:24268
    old "Remembering the loud crack the Sekimeiya made when it fell to the floor, I realized that grabbing it before activating it was a bad idea. I stopped touching the floor with my right hand and approached the unmoving Sekimeiya, determined to travel once more."
    new "想起 Sekimeiya 落到地上时发出的一声脆响，我意识到在激活前就抓住它可不是个好主意。我把右手从地面收回，走向纹丝不动的 Sekimeiya，下定决心再穿越一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:24281
    old "I found myself standing up in the middle of the event room, looking at the covered cabinet. That time, the instantaneous pain of the Sekimeiya's surface was interpreted by my brain as an electric shock moreso than a burn."
    new "我发现自己已经站在活动室中央，看着那个盖着布的展示柜。这一次，Sekimeiya 表面那瞬间的疼痛，比起灼伤，更像是被电了一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:24283
    old "...I won't be able to deduce much if I appear here, where I've been so many times. I was here just before I went to the staff room."
    new "……出现在这个我待过无数次的地方，怕是推断不出什么。我去员工室之前，正站在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:24284
    old "But I knew that the amount of time traveled was an entirely different matter. While I shouldn't have been too far back, nothing was for certain."
    new "但我知道，穿越的时间跨度完全是另一回事。我按理说不该回到太早的时候，可谁也无法确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:24285
    old "I was about to check inside the cabinet when a sound stopped me. Someone was still there."
    new "我正要往展示柜里看，一个声响让我停住了手。这里还有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:24289
    old "It had come from hallway A, so I cautiously went to check. What I saw was something I had been wholly unprepared to see."
    new "声音是从 A走廊传来的，我小心翼翼地过去查看。映入眼帘的景象，我毫无心理准备。"

    # game/script.rpy:24296
    old "It's... me. It's totally me."
    new "那是……我。真真切切是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:24297
    old "I saw my own back, walking away.{w} I immediately understood where I'd gone. Definitely more than fifteen minutes back, to the point where I'd circled around the crystal floor hallways."
    new "我看到了自己的背影，正往远处走。{w} 我立刻明白自己回到了什么时候，绝对不止十五分钟，而是一直回到了我绕着水晶层走廊打转的那段时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:24301
    old "When my past self disappeared toward hallway C, I calmly stepped out of the room. I knew I'd come from the other door and wouldn't see myself."
    new "过去的我朝 C走廊走远后，我才从容地走出房间。我知道自己是从另一扇门进来的，不会撞见自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:24304
    old "I see. So I went about twenty minutes into the past, and I can't precisely know what point the location was based on. Most likely a recent one, though."
    new "原来如此。我回到了大约二十分钟前，却无法确切知道复现位置依据的是哪个时间点。不过多半是最近的一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:24305
    old "With only that, I wasn't any closer to understanding anything. I could at least be sure that the time the Sekimeiya spent out of the cabinet was related to the distance traveled and that they weren't equal; more time was traveled than the Sekimeiya spent building up energy... at least at fifteen minutes and above."
    new "仅凭这些，我还是没弄明白多少。至少能确定一点：Sekimeiya 离开展示柜的时间与穿越的距离有关，但两者并不相等；穿越的时间比 Sekimeiya 蓄能的时间更长……至少在十五分钟以上是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:24306
    old "I put my hand in my right pocket and saw that I had the locker key. That meant the replicated location was restricted to the time where I'd been in the event room after I found it. I could make out that it wasn't Naomi's."
    new "我伸手探进右边口袋，摸到了储物柜的钥匙。这说明复现位置被限定在我找到钥匙之后、待在活动室的那段时间里。我认出那不是 Naomi 的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:24310
    old "In any case, I had a little while where I could move while my past self protected the Sekimeiya. As long as nothing happened to the present me, I'd be able to enter the staff room right after traveling from it."
    new "总之，趁着过去的我在看守 Sekimeiya，我有一小段时间可以自由行动。只要现在的我不出意外，等过去的我从员工室穿越离开，我就能紧跟着进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:24311
    old "I was almost intimidated by my past self, who was very close to me and putting conscious effort into hearing any noise. Until he shut himself in the staff room, I wouldn't be comfortable looking around for anyone. Then again, it was incredibly unlikely the Shiroya I was searching for was close by."
    new "过去的我就在不远处，还刻意竖起耳朵留意任何动静，几乎让我有些发怵。在他把自己关进员工室之前，我没法安心四处找人。话说回来，我要找的 Shiroya 也不太可能就在附近。"

    # game/script.rpy:24312
    old "So I decided to start going upstairs, feeling forced out by an old version of me I had been minutes prior. Fully comprehending how absurd it all was, I silently stepped to hallway C."
    new "于是我决定上楼，像是被几分钟前的那个自己赶了出去。我完全明白这一幕有多荒谬，默默走向 C走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:24321
    old "Something that I hadn't seen before caught my attention. It was the drop of blood Shiroya spotted next to the stairs. I looked at it closely and determined that it was just about done drying up."
    new "有样东西吸引了我的注意，是我先前没留意到的。那是 Shiroya 在楼梯旁发现的那滴血。我凑近细看，判断它快要干透了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24322
    old "This one has to belong to Sai. The others are too old to match the blood he had in his mouth, but this one fits perfectly."
    new "这滴一定是 Sai 的。其他几滴太久了，和他嘴里的血对不上，这一滴却完全吻合。"

    # game/script.rpy:24324
    old "Could he have traveled, replicated the blood in the past, and left older-looking drops? At that point, I had no idea, but I felt certain that something abnormal was behind all the drops we'd found."
    new "会不会是他穿越回过去，复制出了自己的血，留下那些看起来更陈旧的血滴？那时我毫无头绪，但我确信，我们找到的这些血滴背后必有异常。"

    # game/script.rpy:24325
    old "If I had to take Sai's word for it, the one in the lobby belonged to Shiroya, while he hadn't known about the one in the event room. It wasn't only that I didn't want to believe it, I also didn't know how that could be true. The other Shiroya hadn't looked injured at all during the brief moment I'd seen her, so I couldn't assume it came from her."
    new "若按 Sai 的说法，大厅里的那滴是 Shiroya 的，而活动室的那滴他并不知情。我不只是不愿相信，更想不通那怎么可能。我见到另一个 Shiroya 的那一瞬间，她身上没有任何受伤的迹象，所以我没法认定那滴血出自她。"

    # game/script.rpy:24329
    old "I walked up the stairs since I wanted to look through every floor. I thought about making my presence known by using the elevator, but I decided against it."
    new "我想把每一层都查看一遍，便沿着楼梯往上走。我一度想坐电梯，好让人知道我在这里，但最终还是打消了这个念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:24334
    old "I arrived on the second floor and felt, once again, a desolate atmosphere. I wasn't sure what my goal was anymore, but I looked around the bathrooms and offices."
    new "我来到二楼，又一次感到一股荒凉的气息。我已说不清自己的目的究竟是什么，却还是把洗手间和办公室都查看了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:24338
    old "If I was alone, I wanted to be sure about it. Every time I opened a door, I felt my heart resonating within me, remembering that it was possible I was about to find what the culprit had done to Sai and Shiroya."
    new "如果这里只有我一个人，我想确认这一点。每推开一扇门，我都能感到心脏在胸腔里怦怦直跳——我记起，门后也许就是凶手对 Sai 和 Shiroya 下手的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:24339
    old "I forcibly expelled that thought from my mind. There was no way Shiroya could suddenly die like that.{w} ...But as much as I tried to reassure myself of that, Miiya's abrupt end pressed down on the back of my head."
    new "我强行把这个念头赶出脑海。Shiroya 怎么可能就这么突然死了。{w} ……可无论我怎样安慰自己，Miiya 那突如其来的死始终压在我脑后。"

    # game/script.rpy:24343
    old "Only one thing backed me up: if the Shiroya with different clothes was a result of a future travel, the original Shiroya was definitely safe."
    new "只有一点支撑着我：如果那个衣着不同的 Shiroya 是未来某次穿越的结果，那么原本的 Shiroya 就一定平安无事。"

    # game/script.rpy:24344
    old "...After dealing with the second floor, I went to the third, finding my existence there surreal."
    new "……查看完二楼，我上到三楼，觉得自己的存在有种说不出的虚幻。"

    # game/script.rpy:24349
    old "Reluctant to find anything, I repeated the process above as my isolation intensified."
    new "我不愿找到什么，却还是重复着先前的流程，孤独感愈发深重。"

    # game/script.rpy:24354
    old "The fourth and fifth floors weren't any different. Was someone still deliberately hiding from me? If they were the killer, why didn't they just try to take me out?"
    new "四楼和五楼也没什么不同。还有人在刻意躲着我吗？若那人就是凶手，为什么不干脆对我下手？"

    # game/script.rpy:24355
    old "I was in the perfect defenseless position, so if anyone wanted to harm me, that was their best chance. Going off the fact that nothing had happened to me yet, I tried to stop myself from getting too paranoid."
    new "我正处于毫无防备的状态，谁想对我不利，这都是最好的机会。既然至今什么都没发生，我便努力让自己不要过分疑神疑鬼。"

    # game/script.rpy:24359
    old "As usual, I first glanced inside the floor 6 bathrooms to find out they were empty. Subsequently, I entered the three partitions, but I didn't see anyone either."
    new "照例，我先瞥了一眼六楼的洗手间，里面空无一人。接着我逐个进了三个隔间，同样没见到人。"

    # game/script.rpy:24363
    old "Lastly, I walked up to the attic's door to search through the final section of the tower."
    new "最后，我走向阁楼的门，准备查看塔里剩下的最后一处。"

    # game/script.rpy:24372
    old "{w=1.6}I instantly understood that I had forgotten a crucial detail.{w} I couldn't open the door since Shiroya had recently locked it. Not only that, she'd kept the key."
    new "{w=1.6}我立刻明白，自己遗漏了一个关键的细节。{w} 门打不开了——Shiroya 不久前刚把阁楼锁上，而且钥匙还留在她手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:24375
    old "This isn't good... I'm locked out of the attic."
    new "糟了……我被锁在阁楼外面了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24376
    old "Could it be they appeared inside and can't exit?"
    new "难道说他们出现在里面，却出不来？"

    # game/script.rpy:24378
    old "I knocked on the door and yelled Shiroya's name a few times, but there was no response."
    new "我敲了敲门，喊了几声 Shiroya，却没有回应。"

    # game/script.rpy:24379
    old "That doesn't make sense, though. If Shiroya appeared in the attic, her replicated location wouldn't yet have had the key, but Sai definitely would have appeared with it since he was able to chase us inside."
    new "可这说不通。如果 Shiroya 出现在阁楼，她复现的位置还不该有钥匙；但 Sai 身上一定带着钥匙，因为他当时能追着我们进阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:24380
    old "And even if neither of them has it, they'd still have the elevator. From the inside, they could freely call it and go down."
    new "再说，就算他们两个都没钥匙，也还有电梯。从里面就能自己叫电梯下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:24381
    old "Of course, unless it had been disabled somewhere. I hadn't been checking every elevator door, which I realized had been a mistake."
    new "当然，除非电梯在某处被人停用了。我一直没检查每层的电梯门，现在才意识到这是一个疏忽。"

    # game/script.rpy:24387
    old "I tried to open the door on the sixth floor, which proved that the elevator wasn't there. Calling it was a bad idea—it would prevent me from knowing where it was beforehand."
    new "我试着打开六楼的电梯门，结果证实电梯不在那里。把电梯叫过来不是个好主意——那样我就没法提前知道它停在哪儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24392
    old "I walked down to the fifth floor and once again attempted to open the elevator to no avail."
    new "我走到五楼，又一次试着打开电梯门，仍然打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:24397
    old "I circled the corridors to end up on the fourth floor, but the elevator wasn't there either. I felt like the next attempt would be correct—the third floor was where Shiroya and I had been intercepted."
    new "我沿着走廊绕到四楼，电梯也不在。我觉得下一次就该对了——三楼正是我和 Shiroya 被拦住的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:24402
    old "And, as I suspected, the door opened."
    new "果然，门开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24407
    old "It hasn't been used since then, I suppose. I wonder if Sai prepared something in case we used it to escape."
    new "看来从那以后就没人用过它。不知道 Sai 有没有设下什么防备，以防我们乘它逃走。"

    # game/script.rpy:24408
    old "Regardless, the door was closed, so it could have been called from the attic."
    new "不管怎样，门是关着的，所以电梯也可能是从阁楼叫上去的。"

    # game/script.rpy:24414
    old "It was as frustrating as it was frightening to think about. Had the culprit been in the attic and prevented them from leaving? I discarded that thought, wanting to believe they'd appeared outside the tower."
    new "光是想到这些，就既令人烦躁又令人害怕。难道凶手就在阁楼里，拦住了她们的去路？我甩开这个念头，宁愿相信她们出现在塔外。"

    # game/script.rpy:24415
    old "Did that really make sense, though? If Shiroya appeared outside the tower, her first move would be to tell the police about the secret door. They would have knocked it down from the outside as soon as she had disappeared."
    new "可这真的说得通吗？如果 Shiroya 出现在塔外，她首先要做的就是把暗门的事告诉警察。她一消失，警方就会从外面把门砸开。"

    # game/script.rpy:24416
    old "...No matter the case, with the key, the attic was a perfect place to hide from me."
    new "……无论如何，只要手里有钥匙，阁楼就是躲开我的绝佳去处。"

    # game/script.rpy:24417
    old "If the other Shiroya was still present and had it, it was possible I wouldn't see her in the next three hours. While her face and body were Shiroya's, I was having trouble accepting her as the same person. I'd only seen her for a couple of seconds, but her very existence felt alien, and even the Shiroya I was with thought they couldn't be one and the same."
    new "如果另一个 Shiroya 还在这里，而且钥匙在她手上，那接下来三个小时里我可能都见不到她。她的脸和身体明明是 Shiroya 的，我却很难把她当作同一个人。我只见过她两三秒，可光是她的存在就让我觉得格格不入；就连和我在一起的这个 Shiroya 也认为，她们不可能是同一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:24418
    old "I simply didn't know what to think. I'd done all I could on the office floors, and I had to accept that entering the attic would be impossible."
    new "我实在不知道该作何感想。办公楼层能做的我都做了，也只能接受进不去阁楼这个事实。"

    # game/script.rpy:24423
    old "I started to go back down, paying as much attention to my surroundings as possible. Soon, my quiet steps reached the last staircase, leading to the floor where my past self still was."
    new "我开始往回走，尽量留意四周的动静。不久，我放轻脚步来到最后一段楼梯前——那段楼梯通往过去的我所在的那一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:24427
    old "I knew I hadn't looked through every room below yet, but I still felt that task to be too perilous, knowing any sound could alert the Atsuki in the staff room."
    new "我知道下面还有房间没查完，可一想到任何响动都可能惊动员工室里的 Atsuki，我就觉得这差事太过冒险。"

    # game/script.rpy:24428
    old "Therefore, I decided to first look through hallway A, which Shiroya and I didn't have time to start before Sai reappeared. After that, I'd wait for my past self to disappear."
    new "于是我决定先去查 A走廊——Sai 上次重新出现之前，我和 Shiroya 还没来得及查那里。之后，我再等过去的我消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:24432
    old "I carefully walked down the stairs and directed myself toward the storeroom."
    new "我小心翼翼地走下楼梯，朝储藏室走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:24437
    old "I hadn't been in there since Sai and Shiroya traveled together, but there was no change that caught my eye. Knowing whether the door had recently opened was impossible."
    new "自从 Sai 和 Shiroya 一起穿越之后，我就没再进过那里，但眼前看不出任何变化。至于那扇门最近有没有开过，根本无从判断。"

    # game/script.rpy:24445
    old "As soon as I opened the next door, something stood out. One of the cabinets had its lid open and leaning on the wall. I frowned while trying to understand if that made sense."
    new "我刚打开下一扇门，就注意到一处异样。有个展示柜的盖子开着，斜靠在墙上。我皱起眉，想弄清这到底合不合理。"

    # game/script.rpy:24449
    old "Inside it was Isla. It was the cabinet where she'd been found. But I knew it had been closed the last time I was there."
    new "里面躺着的是 Isla。那正是她被发现时所在的展示柜。可我上次来的时候，它明明是合上的。"

    # game/script.rpy:24450
    old "And that was just before I saw Katei's death. I looked at every room, and there's no way I left this cabinet open."
    new "而且那还是在我目睹 Katei 死亡之前。每个房间我都看过，我不可能把这个展示柜敞着就离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:24451
    old "Was it a confirmation that someone else was still with me? Sai and the other Shiroya were the two likely candidates to have done it...{w} I was more confused than surprised. Why would someone have opened that cabinet... and left it open?"
    new "这是否说明还有别人和我一起待在这座塔里？最有可能动手的就是 Sai 和另一个 Shiroya……{w} 比起惊讶，我更觉得困惑。为什么会有人打开那个展示柜……还让它就这么敞着？"

    # game/script.rpy:24454
    old "There was no need to leave Isla's body on display, so I gingerly lowered the lid. I scanned the rest of the room, but I found nothing else of importance."
    new "没有理由把 Isla 的遗体就这么摆在外面，于是我小心地把盖子放下。我又扫视了房间其余的地方，没再发现什么要紧的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:24458
    old "Afterward, I proceeded with the search, my expectations of finding something suddenly higher."
    new "之后我继续搜查，心里忽然对能有所发现多了几分期待。"

    # game/script.rpy:24465
    old "But every room was empty. I still didn't want to make any accidental noise, so I only took a peek at them. I finished at the security room, where the scene of Katei's death appeared essentially unchanged."
    new "可每个房间都空无一物。我仍不愿不慎弄出声响，只探头看了一眼。最后我来到监控室，Katei 死时的现场看上去几乎没有变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:24476
    old "I moved the chair and looked at the computer, which displayed {time=18:24.} I felt that going back to the staff room at {time=18:30} was appropriate, but I didn't want to risk being too early."
    new "我挪开椅子，看向电脑，屏幕上显示着 {time=18:24.}。我觉得 {time=18:30} 再回员工室正合适，可又不想回去得太早。"

    # game/script.rpy:24477
    old "It wasn't exactly the most comforting room with the state Katei was in, but I decided to stay there for the remainder of the time since it gave me access to the computer's clock."
    new "Katei 那副样子摆在那儿，这房间实在算不上让人安心，但我还是决定剩下的时间就待在这里——至少能看着电脑上的时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:24478
    old "His face was under his desk, so I didn't have to look at it, and the unsettling smell of blood quickly became an afterthought. Standing straight and with a blank mind, I stiffly waited for the time to pass."
    new "他的脸埋在桌子底下，我不必看到，那股令人不适的血腥味也很快被我抛在脑后。我直挺挺地站着，脑子里一片空白，僵硬地等着时间流逝。"

    # game/script.rpy:24479
    old "...Until I remembered the chase from earlier.{w} I kneeled beside Katei and put my hand in the pocket where he'd kept most of his keys."
    new "……直到我想起先前的那场追逐。{w} 我在 Katei 身边跪下，把手伸进他平时放大部分钥匙的口袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:24480
    old "It's not here... the key to the bathrooms. All the others are, though. His killer must've picked it up, or maybe it was Sai, if they're not the same person. Regardless, it definitely would've been a bad idea to hide inside one."
    new "不在这里……洗手间的钥匙不见了。其他钥匙倒都还在。凶手多半把它拿走了；如果 Sai 和凶手不是同一个人，那拿走它的人也可能就是 Sai。不管怎样，躲进洗手间显然不是个好主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:24483
    old "Upon further inspection, I realized that the rusty key, which he'd kept in another pocket, was gone too."
    new "再一细看，我发现他放在另一个口袋里的那把生锈的钥匙也不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24484
    old "They also took that old-looking key... Was the person who originally dropped it in hallway A responsible for this?{w} Maybe that's not it. I've been thinking that someone could enter the tower through the storeroom, but if that key belonged to that door, maybe they'd need it from the outside. I'm not sure they would try picking it up to appear in the past with it because their replicated locations holding the key would all be inside the tower..."
    new "那把旧模样的钥匙也被拿走了……难道当初把它掉在 A走廊的人就是这一切的元凶？{w} 也许并非如此。我一直在想，有人可以从储藏室进入这座塔；可如果那把钥匙是开那扇门的，他们也许得从外面用它开门。我不确定他们会不会特意捡起那把钥匙、带着它回到过去，因为这样一来，他们持着钥匙的复制位置就全都在塔里面了……"

    # game/script.rpy:24485
    old "Unless I go back to thinking about thought-up loops, I guess. There could be something that would work.{w} The person who killed Katei took that rusty key and walked out of the tower through the storeroom door, which was open. That created a location outside the tower where they were holding the key that could be replicated. Then, they reentered and used the Sekimeiya to go back in time. In the past, they appeared outside the tower holding the key, so they were able to unlock the door and reenter with something they'd obtained outside—like a knife. They left the door open so that their past self could exit with the key and create the replicated location."
    new "除非我又回头去琢磨那种假想出来的循环。说不定真有什么办法行得通。{w} 杀死 Katei 的人拿起那把生锈的钥匙，从敞开的储藏室门走出塔外。于是，就产生了一个他们持着钥匙、位于塔外的位置，而这个位置可以被复制。接着，他们重新进塔，用 Sekimeiya 回到过去。在过去，他们持着钥匙出现在塔外，因此能够打开那扇门，带着从外面弄到的东西——比如一把刀——再走回来。他们故意没关门，好让过去的自己带着钥匙出去，造出那个复制位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:24486
    old "Would that work? The key isn't here, so I can't even attempt it. But if the culprit's plan was to leave with the Sekimeiya, they would've been able to achieve it very easily by doing this."
    new "这样行得通吗？钥匙不在手上，我连试都没法试。可如果凶手的目的是带着 Sekimeiya 离开，这么做就能轻易得手。"

    # game/script.rpy:24491
    old "I stood back up, trying not to meet Katei's eyes. When I glanced around the room again, I became aware of an obvious detail."
    new "我重新站起，尽量不去看 Katei 的眼睛。再次环视房间时，我注意到一个明摆着的细节。"

    # game/script.rpy:24492
    old "Hang on, this is strange."
    new "等等，有点不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:24493
    old "The computer's screen is lit, meaning that someone used it in the past fifty minutes. It was exactly {time=17} when we found Katei's body, so it's been far more than that."
    new "电脑屏幕亮着，说明过去五十分钟里有人用过它。我们发现 Katei 的尸体时正好是 {time=17}，到现在早就超过五十分钟了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24494
    old "I suppose Sai did say he saw Katei here. Unless someone else was here semi-recently, he saw it after us."
    new "说起来，Sai 确实说过他在这里见过 Katei。除非还有别人不久前也来过，否则他看到的就是我们离开之后的情形。"

    # game/script.rpy:24495
    old "What I found most strange was that the three screens looked identical to how they had at {time=17.}"
    new "最让我觉得奇怪的是，三块屏幕的样子和 {time=17.} 时一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:24497
    old "\"{time=10:04}: Camera(s) disabled and associated footage erased\". That same message was on the side I'd dragged it to, and behind it was the security camera program."
    new "「{time=10:04}: 摄像头已停用，相关录像已删除」。这条提示仍在我先前拖到的位置，它后面是监控摄像头的程序。"

    # game/script.rpy:24498
    old "I grabbed the mouse and clicked on its \"accept\" button. The program used a pretty complicated interface, and I didn't know what many things meant. As I'd seen before, there was a list of all the cameras on the left."
    new "我抓起鼠标，点了上面的「确认」按钮。这程序的界面相当复杂，很多东西我都不明白是什么意思。和之前看到的一样，左侧列着所有摄像头。"

    # game/script.rpy:24501
    old "When I looked at it again, I saw that one in particular was selected, named \"RECAM_12_01\". I brought the cursor over and tried to view it."
    new "再看一眼，我发现其中一个被选中了，名字是「RECAM_12_01」。我把光标移过去，试着查看它。"

    # game/script.rpy:24503
    old "But an error sound played, accompanied by the same message. \"{time=10:04}: {tip=camera}Camera(s) disabled and associated footage erased{/tip}\"."
    new "可随即响起一声报错音，跳出的仍是那条提示。「{time=10:04}: {tip=camera}摄像头已停用，相关录像已删除{/tip}」。"

    # game/script.rpy:24504
    old "It appeared we really couldn't look at the footage, but the message still felt like it too obviously incriminated Katei. I let go of the mouse and stepped aside from the computer."
    new "看来我们确实无法查看录像，但这条提示太明显地把嫌疑指向了 Katei。我松开鼠标，从电脑前退开。"

    # game/script.rpy:24505
    old "I tried to think if the selected camera meant anything, but I had nothing to work with. Instead, I did what I'd planned to do and managed to let go of my thoughts until the time came."
    new "我试着琢磨那个被选中的摄像头是否有含义，却毫无线索可依。于是我索性按原计划行事，努力放空思绪，一直等到那一刻到来。"

    # game/script.rpy:24512
    old "At {time=18:30}, I left the room. It was time to reunite with the Sekimeiya, so I went to hallway B through the event room."
    new "{time=18:30}，我离开房间。该去和 Sekimeiya 会合了，于是我穿过活动室前往 B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:24519
    old "The staff room was closed, like I'd left it. Warily, I stepped up to it and turned the knob."
    new "员工室的门关着，和我离开时一样。我警惕地走上前，转动门把手。"

    # game/script.rpy:24526
    old "I pushed the door open and saw the gray Sekimeiya on the floor.{w} Since everything had gone as expected, I entered, reclaiming my place as the sole Atsuki."
    new "我推开门，看见灰色 Sekimeiya 躺在地上。{w} 一切都在预料之中，我走了进去，重新做回唯一的我。"

    # game/script.rpy:24530
    old "I was relieved that nothing unexpected had occurred. I knew that I couldn't stop looking for Shiroya yet, so I picked up the Sekimeiya and put it in the newly accessible locker."
    new "没出什么意外，我松了口气。我知道还不能停下寻找 Shiroya，于是捡起 Sekimeiya，放进如今已经能打开的储物柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:24531
    old "It's good that I still have the key. If the replicated location was from earlier, I would've lost it. I shouldn't have traveled holding it, just in case."
    new "还好钥匙还在我手上。要是复制出的地点来自更早的时间点，我早就把它弄丢了。为了以防万一，我本就不该带着它穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:24537
    old "I left the Sekimeiya above and closed the door. Then, I proceeded to lock it so that I would be able to wander around without leaving it easily accessible."
    new "我把 Sekimeiya 留在上面的柜子里，关上门，又上了锁——这样我四处走动时，它就不会轻易落到别人手里。"

    # game/script.rpy:24538
    old "I quickly became indecisive. Perhaps it was smarter to bring it with me while I searched so that I had an emergency escape method."
    new "我很快又犹豫起来。也许搜查时把它带在身边更稳妥，万一情况紧急还能用它脱身。"

    # game/script.rpy:24539
    old "Having to constantly fear my death was disheartening, to say the least. While I decided, I sat next to the middle lockers. Maybe staying there was a better idea. I couldn't enter the attic, but it was clear that anyone remaining in the tower didn't want to show themselves."
    new "时时刻刻提防着自己会死，实在令人心灰意冷。我一边拿主意，一边在中间那排储物柜旁坐下。也许留在原地更好。阁楼我进不去，但留在塔里的人显然都不想露面。"

    # game/script.rpy:24542
    old "I felt I had to look through the hallway B rooms before deciding to stop. I prayed that Shiroya was safe, but I could only assume that she wasn't nearby anymore."
    new "我觉得在决定收手之前，总得把B走廊的房间都查一遍。我祈祷 Shiroya 平安，却只能认定她已经不在附近了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24543
    old "I might've already been in the tower for longer than the initially proposed twelve hours. Adding all the time I'd relived by traveling through time, I figured I was minutes away from meeting the mark."
    new "我在塔里待的时间，或许早已超过最初说好的十二小时。再把时间穿越中重复度过的那几段算进去，我估计自己离那个界限只剩几分钟了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24545
    old "Once again thoroughly regretting my choice to ever set foot inside that building, I stood up to make sure a nightmare didn't await in hallway B."
    new "我再一次为踏进这栋楼的选择深感后悔，却还是站起身，去确认B走廊里没有噩梦等着我。"

    # game/script.rpy:24546
    old "I had repeatedly considered that my hours in the tower were a dream. Had I already accepted the reality in which a time travel device existed? No matter what everything was leading to, would the world undergo a drastic change upon being exposed to the Sekimeiya? I'd wanted that day to be the first day of my new life with Shiroya... but was it set to be a turning point for every human being?"
    new "我不止一次想过，自己在塔里度过的这些时辰不过是一场梦。我是否已经接受了时间穿越装置确实存在的现实？无论这一切通向何处，世界在接触到 Sekimeiya 之后，是否会迎来剧变？我本希望那一天是我与 Shiroya 新生活的第一天……可它注定要成为全人类的转折点吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:24547
    old "The item I'd just locked away... What was it going to be responsible for? I felt like it had nearly broken when it fell in the event room, something that might honestly have been for the better."
    new "我刚刚锁起来的那件东西……往后会引出怎样的后果？它在活动室里摔落的时候，我总觉得它差一点就碎了——说实话，那样或许反倒更好。"

    # game/script.rpy:24552
    old "I was walking to the door when I turned to glance at the locker. The thought of breaking the Sekimeiya crossed my mind, but my eyes locked on one spot for another reason."
    new "我走向门口，途中回头看了一眼那排储物柜。砸碎 Sekimeiya 的念头一闪而过，可我的视线却被另一处吸住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24558
    old "...There was something on the floor—to the left of where I'd been sitting. I approached it and saw a small piece of paper, hastily folded."
    new "……地上有样东西——就在我刚才坐的位置左边。我走近一看，是张随手折起的小纸片。"

    # game/script.rpy:24560
    old "Naturally, I frowned. I didn't recognize it from anywhere in the tower."
    new "我自然皱起了眉。塔里任何地方都没见过这东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:24561
    old "I grabbed it and scanned its contents. A few lines of text had been written in black."
    new "我把它捡起来，扫了一眼上面的内容。几行黑字。"

    # game/script.rpy:24562
    old "But before I read it, I had already stopped breathing. A single peek made my hand begin to tremble and my thoughts collapse entirely."
    new "可还没等我读下去，我的呼吸就已经停了。仅仅瞥了一眼，我的手便开始发抖，思绪彻底崩塌。"

    # game/script.rpy:24578
    old "Fractal Freefall"
    new "分形自由落体"

    # game/script.rpy:24580
    old "One day, before the afternoon ended, you could see the figures of two young students on a bench, letting a cold breeze hit their faces while they looked at the park they'd grown to love."
    new "某一天，午后将尽，长椅上坐着两个年轻学生的身影，任凭冷风拂面，望着他们渐渐爱上的那座公园。"

    # game/script.rpy:24582
    old "They had been talking for a while, so they proceeded to quietly look at the younger kids run around, making good use of the last few minutes of sunlight."
    new "两人已经聊了一阵，便安静下来，看着更小的孩子们四处奔跑，尽情享受最后几分钟的阳光。"

    # game/script.rpy:24583
    old "They were a boy and a girl who had known each other for many years. For that reason, the level of trust they'd built allowed them to feel a peaceful warmth just by being next to each other."
    new "他们是一对相识多年的男孩和女孩。正因如此，彼此间建立的信任让他们只要待在对方身边，就能感到一种安宁的暖意。"

    # game/script.rpy:24584
    old "Soon, after the other kids left, they would do so as well. After walking down a few streets, one of the two would take a different turn to complete the day on their own."
    new "不久，别的孩子散去后，他们也会起身离开。走过几条街，两人中的一个会拐向另一条路，独自结束这一天。"

    # game/script.rpy:24591
    old "That was a routine they were happy with and felt lucky to share. The boy let his mind relax, looking at the sky as it began to darken. It would soon be the winter, and the temperature would attempt to hinder those moments.{w} That was why he did as much as he could to enjoy the scenery he'd been granted, hoping the girl at his side was doing the same."
    new "这样的日常让他们心满意足，也庆幸能一同分享。男孩放松下来，望着天色渐暗。冬天很快就要到了，气温会试图夺走这样的时刻。{w} 所以他尽可能多地去享受眼前这片景色，也希望身旁的女孩同样如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:24593
    old "Eventually, the silence was their cue to leave. Their gazes met again, confirming that it was time. They stood up from the bench and realized that they were much colder than they'd thought."
    new "终于，沉默成了该离开的信号。两人再次对上目光，确认时候到了。他们从长椅上站起，才发觉自己远比想象中要冷。"

    # game/script.rpy:24599
    old "They were about to stretch their limbs when an overwhelming light took over their sight. They lost control of their bodies and felt as if they were about to faint.{w} When they next opened their eyes, they were unable to recognize their surroundings."
    new "他们正要伸展四肢，一道铺天盖地的光吞没了视野。身体失去了掌控，仿佛随时会昏过去。{w} 等他们再次睁眼，四周已全然陌生。"

    # game/script.rpy:24608
    old "They were together, and they started to throw out questions to each other. Despite what they had experienced, they felt well physically."
    new "两人仍在一起，于是开始互相抛出一连串疑问。尽管经历了那样的事，他们的身体却没什么异样。"

    # game/script.rpy:24609
    old "The room where they found themselves had a haunting feeling to it; it was dark but spacious. Neither of them knew where they were, and they quickly saw that there wasn't a door in any of the walls."
    new "他们身处的房间透着一种说不出的诡异，昏暗却宽敞。两人都不知道自己在哪儿，也很快发现四面墙上都没有门。"

    # game/script.rpy:24610
    old "Their experience had felt so surreal that just by seeing that the other was still there, their hearts refrained from building up terror and panic. Trying to stay calm, they looked around the room to find any clue as to their whereabouts."
    new "方才的经历荒诞得像梦，光是看到对方还在身边，他们心里就没有生出恐惧与慌乱。他们努力镇定，环视房间，想找出能说明自己身在何处的线索。"

    # game/script.rpy:24611
    old "Very soon, the girl spotted a few words on the floor. When the boy read them, they could only share stares to see how the other had interpreted them."
    new "很快，女孩发现地上有几行字。男孩读过之后，两人只能对望，看彼此是怎么理解的。"

    # game/script.rpy:24620
    old "\"Both of you will spend one hundred years in this space. Once you exceed that time, you'll be brought back to your lives, but only one of you will keep your memories of your stay here.\""
    new "「你们二人将在这片空间里度过一百年。时间一满，你们便会被送回各自的人生——但你们之中，只有一个人能保留在这里的记忆。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24621
    old "They kept reading those ridiculous words, left in pink on the floor. Despite how nonsensical they sounded, they didn't question them. The room had two beds, no bathroom, and no kitchen. Not the conditions any human could live in."
    new "他们反复读着地上那几行粉色的、荒唐至极的字。哪怕听上去再不合常理，他们也没有去质疑。房间里有两张床，没有浴室，也没有厨房。这绝不是人能够活下去的条件。"

    # game/script.rpy:24622
    old "Close to the letters, they found another strange sentence. It said: \"Once a day, you can ask for an object to materialize, and the previous one will disappear. This is only as entertainment—so that your minds don't break.\""
    new "在那些字旁边，他们又发现了一句古怪的话：「一天一次，你们可以要求一件物品出现，前一件则会消失。这不过是消遣罢了——免得你们的精神崩溃。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24625
    old "Instead of laughing at it, the boy tried it out. The way he attempted it was by thinking about the object he wanted to create.{w} Instantly, in midair, a red ball appeared. After gravity made it bounce on the floor a few times, he was left speechless by the result of his thought."
    new "男孩没有把它当笑话，反而试着照做。他只是在脑中想象要造出的东西。{w} 半空中立刻出现了一个红球。重力让它在地上弹了几下，他望着自己念头化出的实物，一时说不出话。"

    # game/script.rpy:24626
    old "When he explained what had happened to the girl, they understood their fate would play out as predicted. They had to spend a hundred years in a bizarre world where their thoughts could materialize items but they themselves were restricted by the four walls of the room."
    new "他把经过讲给女孩听，两人便明白，命运确实会照那番话上演。他们要在一个诡异的世界里熬过一百年：念头能化出实物，他们自己却被这间房的四壁困住。"

    # game/script.rpy:24627
    old "So, the first thing they did was speak to each other. In their immediate future, it looked like a nightmare might've awaited them. Being trapped in a single room where they couldn't die sounded terrifying, but since they were together, they attempted to reassure each other by starting a pointless conversation about what had happened."
    new "于是他们做的第一件事，就是和对方说话。眼下看来，等待他们的或许是一场噩梦。被困在一间求死不得的房间里，听上去骇人，但既然两人在一起，他们便试着聊起方才发生的事，用这些无谓的交谈彼此安抚。"

    # game/script.rpy:24630
    old "When they realized it was working, the conversation stopped being forced. Neither of them looked particularly afraid, let alone terrified. They kept talking like they would every day after school, knowing what their future potentially held in store."
    new "发觉这法子奏效后，交谈便不再勉强。两人看上去都不怎么害怕，更谈不上惊恐。他们像每天放学后那样聊着，心里清楚未来可能等着他们的是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:24631
    old "The dreamlike setting they had been forced into didn't seem like much of a dream to them. Why had they been trapped? How were they going to survive for a hundred years? Why could their thoughts materialize objects? They knew all those questions were valid, but they simply accepted things for what they were."
    new "他们被迫置身于一个如梦般的场景，可对他们来说，这并不怎么像梦。为什么会被困在这里？要怎么熬过一百年？为什么念头能让物品成形？他们知道这些疑问都合情合理，却只是默默接受了现状。"

    # game/script.rpy:24632
    old "On the floor was the red ball, which had been the boy's first thought in response to the words he'd read. They weren't going to start playing with it, but something new every day sounded like a curious proposition that could keep them sane in the far future."
    new "地上的红球，是男孩读到那些话后冒出的第一个念头。他们并不打算拿它玩，但每天都有新东西出现，听起来倒是个新奇的主意，或许能在遥远的将来让他们保持清醒。"

    # game/script.rpy:24633
    old "They soon understood that there was no way to measure the time, so they'd have to count the days themselves, using the daily objects. It had been late in the day in their old world, and their physical tiredness had carried over. At one point, they decided to lie on the beds and quickly fell asleep."
    new "他们很快明白，这里没法计量时间，只能靠每天出现的那件东西，自己数着日子。在他们原来的世界，那时已是傍晚，身体的疲惫也一并带了过来。后来，他们决定躺到床上，很快就睡着了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24636
    old "Before doing so, the boy thought about what had happened. He was surprised not to feel many negative emotions nor the desire to go back to the real world. He couldn't call it being carefree, but he woke up well-rested nonetheless."
    new "入睡之前，男孩把发生的事又想了一遍。他惊讶地发现自己并没有多少负面情绪，也不怎么想回到现实世界。这谈不上无忧无虑，可他还是睡得很好，醒来时精神饱满。"

    # game/script.rpy:24641
    old "The ball was still on the floor, and they could only create a new object when it disappeared. Soon, when the girl woke up, they exchanged sleepy looks they'd rarely ever seen on each other before."
    new "红球还在地上，只有等它消失，他们才能造出新东西。不久女孩也醒了，两人睡眼惺忪地对视一眼，这副神情他们以前很少在对方脸上见到。"

    # game/script.rpy:24642
    old "It was still the first day, but they already felt comfortable. Accepting that nothing had been a dream, they started to talk and began a long bed-to-bed conversation."
    new "第一天还没过去，他们却已经安下心来。接受了这一切并非梦境之后，他们开口说话，开始了一场隔着两张床的长谈。"

    # game/script.rpy:24643
    old "Even when it ended, they didn't feel alone. That prevented them from seeing their future as grim."
    new "即便谈完，他们也不觉孤单。正因如此，他们没把未来想得多么黯淡。"

    # game/script.rpy:24647
    old "Three days later, nothing had changed. They were perhaps as far from home as any person could be, but they still found themselves able to produce any topic and talk naturally, appreciating that they had each other more than ever."
    new "三天过去，一切如旧。他们也许已经离家远得不能再远，却仍能随意找出话题自然地聊下去，也比以往任何时候都更庆幸身边有对方。"

    # game/script.rpy:24650
    old "They'd agreed they would trade off on deciding an object per day, but they quickly found that they didn't have many good ideas. The girl had always wanted a spinning egg chair, so she thought of one big enough to put her whole body in.{w} It turned out to be exactly as she'd wanted it, so she spent the full 24 hours inside with a joyful expression."
    new "两人说好每天轮流决定一件物品，可很快就发现彼此都没什么好点子。女孩一直想要一张旋转蛋椅，于是想了一张大到足以容下她整个身体的。{w} 它果然和她想要的一模一样，她便满脸欢喜地在里面待了整整二十四个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:24651
    old "The next day, the boy couldn't think of anything. He thought of trying to spawn food, curious to see what would happen, but after running down some failed ideas, he decided to call for the same chair."
    new "第二天，男孩什么也想不出来。他一度想变出食物，看看会发生什么，可几个念头接连落空之后，他决定还是要那张同样的椅子。"

    # game/script.rpy:24656
    old "It would soon be the girl's turn again. She was looking up at the red top of her chair while the boy stared at the room's ceiling in the same way. Suddenly, words vibrated through the air."
    new "很快又轮到女孩了。她仰头望着椅子的红色顶盖，男孩也同样望着房间的天花板。忽然，有话语声在空气中响起。"

    # game/script.rpy:24657
    old "\"I love you.\""
    new "「我喜欢你。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24658
    old "The girl peeked out from the chair in disbelief at what she'd heard. She saw the boy who had been her closest friend for so many years nonchalantly lying on his back."
    new "女孩不敢相信自己听到的，从椅子里探出头来。她看见那个男孩，他多年来一直是她最亲密的朋友，此刻正若无其事地仰躺着。"

    # game/script.rpy:24659
    old "But that was far from how he felt inside. He couldn't believe he'd said it. Just after those three days, her overwhelming presence had prevented him from holding back what he'd been wanting to say for years."
    new "可他心里远没有那样平静。他不敢相信自己真的说出口了。才过了三天，她那让人无法忽视的身影，就让他再也按不住多年来一直想说的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:24660
    old "He'd always wanted to tell her how much he enjoyed being with her and how thankful he was for it, but he never knew how to truly express his affection... That was why he'd grown sad, knowing that their relationship had been built with only implied trust and fondness."
    new "他一直想告诉她，和她在一起有多快乐，自己又有多感激，却始终不懂该如何真正表达这份心意……正因如此，他才会难过：他知道两人的关系只靠着心照不宣的信赖与好感维系着。"

    # game/script.rpy:24663
    old "For that reason, the first time he let his emotions burst out, they had automatically taken the form of those simple words. While he'd been wanting to say them for a long time, he wasn't scared the reception might've been negative. He'd simply never been able to bring himself to do it, justifying it as being disconnected.{w} As soon as their new reality had been presented to them, he'd understood that he couldn't spend all that time suppressing his honest and natural feelings."
    new "所以，当他第一次任由情感倾泻而出时，那份情感自然而然化成了那句简单的话。这句话他想说很久了，倒不怕会被拒绝。他只是始终迈不出那一步，只以「彼此还没到那一步」为由搪塞过去。{w} 而当新的现实摆在眼前，他便明白，自己不能在那漫长岁月里一直压抑这份坦率而自然的心意。"

    # game/script.rpy:24664
    old "And after saying it, his heart was pounding, like it was trying to break out of his body. He'd imagined the situation and many different outcomes, so he continued to look at the ceiling, awaiting whichever one would actually happen. He kept his mind as serene as possible in the eternity between confession and response—he was prevented from leaving the room even if he wanted to."
    new "说出口后，他的心脏狂跳，仿佛要从身体里蹦出来。他曾在脑中设想过这种场面和种种结局，于是继续盯着天花板，等待实际发生的那一种。在告白与回应之间那段漫长的永恒里，他竭力让心绪保持平静——毕竟就算想逃，他也离不开这间房。"

    # game/script.rpy:24666
    old "\"...Really? I definitely didn't think so. That's surprising.\"{w} She had a smile on her face and looked genuinely happy. Looking down and seeing it, the boy sighed in relief, knowing that no matter what would happen, he wouldn't regret having said it."
    new "「……真的吗？我可一点都没看出来。真叫人意外。」{w} 她脸上带着笑，看上去是真心高兴。看见那笑容，男孩松了口气——他知道，无论之后会怎样，他都不会后悔说出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:24669
    old "But as it turned out, that wasn't the end of it.{w} \"I've liked you for a long time too. I was pretty scared to say it.\"{w} Keeping the same smile, she let him know his feelings were shared."
    new "可事情并没有就此结束。{w}「我也早就喜欢上你了。一直怕得不敢说。」{w} 她带着同样的笑容，让他知道自己并非单相思。"

    # game/script.rpy:24670
    old "The boy wasn't sure how to feel or respond. He wasn't good with his own emotions, but if he'd looked at their situation from the outside, he would've thought that both of them liked each other. Despite that, he had never truly believed it."
    new "男孩不知该作何感受，也不知该怎么回应。他一向不擅长面对自己的情感，可若能以旁观者的眼光看他们俩，他一定会认为两人是互相喜欢的。尽管如此，他从未真正相信过这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:24671
    old "They managed to start up a conversation so that the mood didn't fade. There were many things they wanted to say and many questions to ask.{w} Since when, how much...? The girl knew her chair would soon disappear, so she left it for her bed, where they kept talking until they fell asleep."
    new "他们好不容易才重新聊了起来，好让气氛不至于冷下去。想说的话很多，想问的事也有很多。{w}从什么时候开始，又有多深……？女孩知道那把椅子很快就要消失，便从椅子上下来，爬上了床，两人一直聊到沉沉睡去。"

    # game/script.rpy:24676
    old "That was the beginning of the time they spent together. They had so many moments to reminisce about, and many things they wanted to do. The days began to pass, and the same uplifting atmosphere stayed with them."
    new "那便是两人共度时光的开端。值得回味的瞬间多得数不清，想做的事也有很多。日子一天天过去，那份轻快的气氛始终未曾散去。"

    # game/script.rpy:24677
    old "Once he'd made the necessary step, the boy started to open his heart, no longer restricting himself. Elated to see it, the girl responded the same way, strengthening the unbreakable bond they'd built over the years."
    new "迈出必要的一步之后，男孩开始敞开心扉，不再束缚自己。女孩见此欣喜，也以同样的方式回应，让两人多年间结下的牢固羁绊愈发深厚。"

    # game/script.rpy:24678
    old "One day, they kissed. It brought them peace in the already peaceful room, and it reminded them of the park they were so far from."
    new "有一天，他们接吻了。在这本就安宁的房间里，这一吻更添了几分平静，也让他们想起了那座遥不可及的公园。"

    # game/script.rpy:24681
    old "The chair kept getting brought back every so often. One day, the boy tried it and understood why the girl liked it so much.{w} Glad to see his liking of it, she joined him inside. They hadn't ever felt as close as that, but the relaxing sensation let them spend an entire silent day together, content to be living in the moment.{w} At one point, the girl got confused, thinking the 24 hours must've passed, but she realized that the boy had already silently prolonged the duration, so she continued resting her face next to his."
    new "那把椅子时不时就会被重新变出来。有一天，男孩也坐了上去，终于明白女孩为什么那么喜欢它。{w}见他喜欢，女孩高兴地钻进椅子里，和他挤在一起。两人从未感到如此亲密。而那种放松的感觉让他们安安静静地一起度过了一整天，谁也没有说话，满足于活在当下。{w}某一刻，女孩糊涂了，以为二十四个小时早已过去，随即发现男孩已经悄悄把时限延长了，便继续把脸贴在他旁边。"

    # game/script.rpy:24685
    old "Similar days continued until they had spent months together. Despite that, no second had felt stagnant. They continued to enjoy their stay, seeing in each other the same friend they'd always gone to school with."
    new "这样的日子不断延续，一晃便已共度数月。即便如此，也没有哪一秒是停滞的。他们依旧享受这段相处，在彼此身上看到的，仍是那个从上学起就熟识的朋友。"

    # game/script.rpy:24686
    old "Their relationship had surely surpassed the norm. They only truly had each other, but that had always been the case. Even after being secluded in that strange room for all that time, they could still talk casually about things in the normal world, making each other laugh and showing interest in what the other had to say."
    new "他们的关系无疑已超出了寻常。他们真正拥有的只有彼此，但这一点从来如此。即便在那间奇异的房间里与世隔绝这么久，他们仍能随口聊起外面世界的事，逗彼此发笑，认真听对方讲完每一句话。"

    # game/script.rpy:24689
    old "Since he'd broken out of his old mold, the boy had grown used to only voicing his true thoughts, like he'd always wanted to do.{w} Some days, they would try to materialize new objects. When it was his turn, he created a huge trampoline. He'd always found them fun, and he'd thought of generating one for a while. They let themselves loose and used it for hours, as if their bodies couldn't wear out."
    new "摆脱旧日的壳之后，男孩渐渐习惯只把真实的想法说出口——这正是他一直想做的事。{w}有些日子，他们会试着变出新的东西。轮到他时，他变出了一张巨大的蹦床。他向来觉得蹦床有趣，也早就想造一个。两人放开手脚玩了起来，在蹦床上跳了好几个小时，仿佛身体永远不会疲惫。"

    # game/script.rpy:24696
    old "At one point, they stopped creating new objects, knowing they could just be in the egg chair.{w} They were happy to live like that, but they knew there was a detail they'd barely talked about."
    new "到了某个时候，他们不再变出新的东西，因为只要待在蛋形椅里就足够了。{w}就这样过下去，他们很幸福，但他们清楚，有个细节两人几乎从未谈过。"

    # game/script.rpy:24697
    old "Permanently marked on the floor, next to where they were resting, were always the same words. \"Both of you will spend one hundred years in this space. Once you exceed that time, you'll be brought back to your lives, but only one of you will keep your memories of your stay here.\""
    new "两人休息处的地板上，始终刻着同样一段话，永远无法磨灭——「你们二人将在这个空间里度过一百年。时限一过，你们便会被送回各自的人生，但你们之中只有一人会记得在这里度过的时光。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24698
    old "They'd long since stopped keeping track of the days, aware that the final one would eventually come. They felt their sense of time had been altered since near the start, so they couldn't be sure they hadn't already spent years in that room."
    new "他们早已不再数着日子，心里清楚最后一天终会到来。从很早开始，他们就感觉自己的时间感已被改变，因此无法确定自己是否已经在那间房里度过了数年。"

    # game/script.rpy:24702
    old "\"Aren't you scared to lose your memories when we come back?\""
    new "「回去之后会失去记忆，你不怕吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:24703
    old "The girl responded quickly.{w} \"...Yes, but it'll be okay. We know how long we've liked each other for in the real world, so whoever remembers will just tell the other about it. There are so many things I want to do with you once we're back. Since one of us will remember, we can do all of them and more.\""
    new "女孩很快答道。{w}「……怕。不过没关系的。我们在现实世界里喜欢了对方多久，彼此都清楚，所以无论谁记得，只要告诉另一个人就好。回去之后，我想和你做的事多得很。既然总有一人会记得，那些事就都能做，还能做更多。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24704
    old "\"All right. Whoever keeps these memories will confess to the other as soon as we come back.\"{w} Then, they would live the life they'd been talking about for so long."
    new "「好。不管是谁留下了这些记忆，回去之后都要立刻向对方表白。」{w}然后，他们就要去过谈论了那么久的那种生活。"

    # game/script.rpy:24705
    old "That was their promise. They had grown to love that room and the relationship they'd forged thanks to it. It was just a prologue for the inevitable return, but both of them saw it as much more than that."
    new "那是他们的约定。他们渐渐爱上了那间房，也爱上了因它而生的这份关系。那不过是必然归途的序章，但两人都视它远不止于此。"

    # game/script.rpy:24710
    old "And, once again, time went on.{w} They didn't get tired of talking, of thinking, of caressing, and of living. They spent every second as if no time was passing."
    new "而时间，又一次向前流去。{w}谈话、思索、抚触、相伴度日——这些他们从不厌倦。每一秒都过得仿佛时间并未流逝。"

    # game/script.rpy:24713
    old "But, eventually, almost one hundred years had. They hadn't aged, and their physical condition hadn't deteriorated. Like they'd already done numerous times, they'd decided to bring a pool filled with water to the room, knowing how refreshing it was."
    new "然而，将近一百年终究还是过去了。他们没有衰老，身体状况也没有变差。和之前许多次一样，他们决定在房里变出一座注满水的泳池——他们知道那有多清凉畅快。"

    # game/script.rpy:24718
    old "Underwater, the round interior of the pool was the last thing they saw in that isolated reality. They had agreed never to say goodbye, and they couldn't have even if they wanted to. In the blink of an eye, the room didn't exist."
    new "在水下，泳池浑圆的内壁成了他们在那孤立现实中看到的最后景象。他们约定过绝不说再见，而即便想说，也说不出口。眨眼之间，那间房已不复存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:24735
    old "Next to a bench, a boy and a girl looked at each other. One was staring into the other's eyes, whereas the other had simply returned the gesture."
    new "长椅旁，一个男孩和一个女孩对望着。一个凝视着对方的眼睛，另一个只是回以同样的目光。"

    # game/script.rpy:24736
    old "\"Hm? What's up?\""
    new "「嗯？怎么了？」"

    # game/script.rpy:24738
    old "The boy froze. Was it really over? Did the girl in front of him really not remember anything of what they'd experienced together?"
    new "男孩僵住了。真的结束了吗？眼前这个女孩，真的对他们共同经历的一切毫无记忆？"

    # game/script.rpy:24739
    old "\"...Is anything wrong?\""
    new "「……出什么事了吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:24740
    old "He had no idea what to say, but his own words echoed in his mind: \"All right. Whoever keeps these memories will confess to the other as soon as we come back.\""
    new "他不知该说什么，只有自己说过的话在脑中回响：「好。不管是谁留下了这些记忆，回去之后都要立刻向对方表白。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24741
    old "\"Hey...? Did something happen?\""
    new "「喂……？出什么事了吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:24743
    old "\"N-Nothing, don't worry.\""
    new "「没、没什么，别担心。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24744
    old "With a slight frown, the girl shrugged and picked up her purse. \"We should go, then.\""
    new "女孩微微皱眉，耸了耸肩，拿起手提包。「那我们走吧。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24747
    old "He couldn't bring himself to say anything and simply stood still, petrified. He'd feared many times that he'd be the one to keep his memories, but the girl's words had kept giving him peace, letting him believe that it'd turn out fine either way."
    new "他一句话也说不出来，只是僵立在原地。他曾多次害怕自己会是那个保留记忆的人，可女孩的话总能让他安心，让他相信无论结果如何都会没事。"

    # game/script.rpy:24748
    old "\"Are you coming?\""
    new "「你不走吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:24749
    old "Still trying to find a place to fix his gaze on, the boy began to step forward. Something was preventing him from looking at her face."
    new "男孩还没找到该把目光放在哪儿，脚下却已经迈了出去。有什么东西让他无法去看她的脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:24752
    old "\"Whoever keeps these memories will confess to the other as soon as we come back.\"{w} What? No... he couldn't do that."
    new "「不管是谁留下了这些记忆，回去之后都要立刻向对方表白。」{w}什么？不……他做不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:24753
    old "He had spent one hundred years loving someone, but that wasn't the girl in front of him. He had come back—and the girl he'd loved had died. She only remained in his memories."
    new "他花了一百年去爱一个人，但那不是眼前这个女孩。他回来了——而他爱过的那个女孩已经死了。她只活在他的记忆里。"

    # game/script.rpy:24754
    old "He had spent one hundred years finally letting himself be who he was, without judgment, without even thinking about it. However, in an instant, that had been reversed. He had never opened himself emotionally; to the eyes of the girl in front of him, he was the same reserved person he'd always been."
    new "一百年里，他终于得以做回自己，不必顾虑旁人的评判，甚至不必刻意去想。可转眼之间，一切都被逆转了。他从未真正敞开心扉；在眼前的女孩看来，他仍是那个一贯内敛的自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:24755
    old "She approached him with a worried face. \"Are you okay?\"{w} He wasn't confused about what had happened. He understood it perfectly well, and the only thing he felt was emptiness. After nodding, he continued walking."
    new "她满脸担忧地凑近。「你没事吧？」{w}对发生的事，他并不困惑。他完全明白，心里只剩下空茫。他点了点头，继续往前走。"

    # game/script.rpy:24764
    old "He hadn't seen those streets for so long, but he still remembered every detail about them. They began to walk through the quietness of the night, hearing their footsteps on the asphalt."
    new "那些街道他已许久未见，可每一处细节仍记得清清楚楚。两人走进夜的寂静里，听着彼此的脚步声落在柏油路上。"

    # game/script.rpy:24765
    old "Next to the boy was his first friend, who he'd loved more than he'd ever thought he could. He knew his feelings were mutual, but how did that help? He'd always imagined that."
    new "走在男孩身旁的是他第一个朋友，他对她的爱远超自己曾经的想象。他知道她也有着同样的心意，可那又有什么用？他从前总以为那会有用。"

    # game/script.rpy:24766
    old "The inevitable sadness started to build up within him. He remembered how much of himself the girl had grown to know during those years, all the conversations they'd had, and every time they'd materialized something. He'd been told that their time together would end since the first day, but he couldn't believe all of that had simply happened and been lost."
    new "悲伤不可避免地在他心里积聚。他想起这些年里，女孩渐渐了解了他多少，想起他们所有的交谈，想起每一次凭空造出东西的时刻。从第一天起，他就被告知两人共处的时光终将结束，可他无法相信那一切就这样发生过，又这样消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24767
    old "And there was nothing he could do. He couldn't confess his love again, and for the first time, he doubted it."
    new "而他无能为力。他无法再一次表白爱意，也第一次对这份感情产生了怀疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:24768
    old "The two same barriers had come back: himself, and uncertainty. Not a second of those hundred years had mattered.{w} No, of course that was wrong. He'd have to cherish and remember the times they'd spent in that intimate room... because, in the real world, they would never happen."
    new "同样的两道屏障又回来了：他自己，以及不确定。那百年之中的每一秒都毫无意义。{w}不，当然不是这样。他必须珍惜并记住他们在那间亲密小室里度过的时光……因为在现实世界里，那些时光永远不会发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:24775
    old "The turn where they always saw each other off came."
    new "到了他们一向互相道别的那个路口。"

    # game/script.rpy:24776
    old "\"Are you sure you're okay?\""
    new "「你真的没事吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:24777
    old "\"Don't worry, I am.\""
    new "「别担心，我没事。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24778
    old "Looking a little sad, the girl smiled and waved.{w} Then, as they always did, both of them took different paths. ...And yet again, only one of them found it significant."
    new "女孩带着几分落寞笑了笑，挥了挥手。{w}随后，两人一如既往地各自走向不同的方向。……然而这一次，依旧只有一个人觉得这意味深长。"

    # game/script.rpy:24798
    old "That was a story I'd once written."
    new "那是我曾经写过的一篇故事。"

    # game/script.rpy:24799
    old "I'd always been prone to letting my imagination run wild, and sometimes I'd make up full little stories.{w} Unable to sleep one night, I'd thought of that one."
    new "我向来容易让想象信马由缰，有时还会编出完整的小故事来。{w}某个睡不着的夜里，我想到的便是这一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:24800
    old "It was a very shallow story, but that night, I'd felt the need to write it down, which I never tended to do. Of course, I'd never shown it to anyone, but every time I thought of it, a strong and bittersweet emotion would fill my brain."
    new "那是篇很浅薄的故事，可那晚我却觉得非写下来不可——我平时从不这样做。当然，我从未给任何人看过，可每次想起，一股强烈而苦涩的情绪便会涌满脑海。"

    # game/script.rpy:24802
    old "When I opened the piece of paper and read the four thin lines on it, every word of that story came back to me."
    new "当我展开那张纸，读到上面纤细的四行字时，那个故事的每一个字都回到了我脑中。"

    # game/script.rpy:24805
    old "\"Hello. I'm sorry that I have to write this.\""
    new "「你好。很抱歉，我不得不写下这些。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24806
    old "\"I still can't believe what happened. I haven't been able to stop crying, but I've always tried to tell myself that these things just occur.\""
    new "「发生的事，我至今仍无法相信。我的眼泪一直停不下来，可我总试着告诉自己，世事本就如此。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24807
    old "\"I know how selfish it is that I'm writing this, but I won't be able to live with myself if I don't.\""
    new "「我知道写这些有多自私，可如果不写，我无法原谅自己。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24808
    old "\"I need to say it.{w} I've always wanted to, and I can't believe I never will.{w} I love you.\""
    new "「我必须说出来。{w}我一直都想说，怎么也想不到竟会再没有机会。{w}我爱你。」"

    # game/script.rpy:24812
    old "My hand hadn't stopped trembling, and my heart began to catch up to it. What in the world was I reading?"
    new "我的手一直抖个不停，心跳也跟着越来越急。我读到的究竟是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:24813
    old "I'd jumped back to the story I'd written a couple of years prior for a very simple reason."
    new "我之所以会突然想起几年前写的那篇故事，理由很简单。"

    # game/script.rpy:24814
    old "The handwriting on the note was my own."
    new "那张纸条上的字迹，是我自己的。"

    # game/script.rpy:24815
    old "But it couldn't be. I'd never written that, and I never would. However, I knew very well the single thing that could've ever made that note a reality.{w} A voice played in my mind."
    new "可这不可能。我从没写过那样的东西，也绝不会写。然而我比谁都清楚，唯一能让那张纸条成真的，会是什么。{w} 一个声音在脑海里响起。"

    # game/script.rpy:24818
    old "\"Shiroya's fate is death.\"{w=2.8}{nw}"
    new "「Shiroya 的命运是死亡。」{w=2.8}{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:24822
    old "Those had been Sai's words, but they couldn't be true. I'd feared before that the day would come where I could no longer tell her how glad and thankful I was to have her, but there was no way I'd let it happen."
    new "那是 Sai 说过的话，可它不可能是真的。我曾害怕有一天会再也无法告诉她，有她在身边我有多庆幸、多感激；但我绝不会让那一天到来。"

    # game/script.rpy:24823
    old "No—it wouldn't happen. That note had my handwriting, but it didn't mean anything. I would never write it. Even if the worst happened at a later point, I wouldn't.{w} But... it existed. I had it in my hands."
    new "不——不会的。那张纸条上虽是我的字迹，却说明不了什么。我绝不会写下它。哪怕往后真出了最坏的事，我也不会写。{w} 可是……它确实存在。就在我手里。"

    # game/script.rpy:24824
    old "Where had it even come from!? I hadn't seen it on the floor, so had it been in my pocket and fallen while I'd been sitting? Or had someone left it there, knowing I'd come back?"
    new "它到底是从哪儿来的！？我先前没在地上看见它，难道是原本就在我口袋里，坐下时掉了出来？还是有人知道我会回来，特意放在那里？"

    # game/script.rpy:24828
    old "My heart rate alerted me of how anxious I was. My existence felt insignificant, but I still told myself I wouldn't let that reality happen."
    new "心跳提醒着我此刻有多焦躁。我的存在显得微不足道，但我仍对自己说，绝不让那样的现实成真。"

    # game/script.rpy:24835
    old "I burst through the door and was greeted once again by the desolate hallway B."
    new "我冲出门去，迎接我的又是那条荒凉的B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:24836
    old "I'd been tightly gripping the note, the thing I despised, with my right hand. I detested it and wanted to distance myself from it as much as I could, so I left it between the handrail and the wall to avoid touching it for even another second."
    new "我一直用右手紧攥着那张纸条——那东西我厌恶至极。我恨它，只想离它越远越好，于是把它塞进扶手与墙壁之间，不愿再多碰它一秒。"

    # game/script.rpy:24837
    old "Shiroya! Hey! Where are you!?"
    new "Shiroya！喂！你在哪儿！？"

    # game/script.rpy:24838
    old "I needed to see her and know that my fears wouldn't turn out true. We'd just lost Miiya, but I knew that I wouldn't ever be myself again if something happened to Shiroya."
    new "我必须见到她，确认我的恐惧不会成真。我们才刚失去 Miiya，可我知道，要是 Shiroya 出了什么事，我就再也不是原来的我了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24839
    old "Shiroya! Can you hear me!?"
    new "Shiroya！听得见吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:24845
    old "I opened the room in front of me and left it as soon as I saw it was empty. I kept crying out, impulsively exhausting myself as much as I could."
    new "我推开眼前的房门，见里面空无一人，转身就走。我不停地呼喊，凭着一股冲动把自己耗到极限。"

    # game/script.rpy:24846
    old "You're okay, right!? If you can hear me, please come out! Say something!"
    new "你没事吧！？听得见就快出来！说句话啊！"

    # game/script.rpy:24850
    old "Soon, my voice started to crack as I realized how close I was to the reality in which my oldest friend had died. Sai had spoken it like it was an absolute, and I'd found a note I wished I'd never read.{w} I kept telling myself that there had to be another meaning, but my shouts devolved into hopeless crying until I fell to my knees in the middle of the hallway."
    new "很快，我的嗓音开始嘶哑，因为我意识到自己离那个现实有多近——我最好的朋友已经死了。Sai 说出那话时犹如宣判，而我又捡到了一张宁愿从未读过的纸条。{w} 我不断告诉自己那一定另有含义，可呼喊渐渐变成绝望的哭嚎，最后我跪倒在走廊中央。"

    # game/script.rpy:24860
    old "I was so lost that I didn't consider the importance of the sound I'd heard. Footsteps... I suddenly processed it."
    new "我实在太茫然，竟没去细想那声音意味着什么。脚步声……我这才反应过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:24865
    old "Abruptly, I raised my head and turned to face the lobby."
    new "我猛地抬起头，转向大厅的方向。"

    # game/script.rpy:24869
    old "Lap Crossing"
    new "膝上横越"

    # game/script.rpy:24877
    old "There, I saw a slender figure looking at me.{w} It was Shiroya, her face near the breaking point. However, she wasn't the one I'd been thinking of. Her clothes were from the attic, and despite her expression, she felt wrong in a way I couldn't define."
    new "在那里，我看见一个纤细的身影正望着我。{w} 是 Shiroya，她脸上的神情几近崩溃。可她并不是我一直在找的那个人。她穿着阁楼里的衣服，尽管表情如此，她身上却有种说不清的不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:24883
    old "It seemed like she could disappear at any moment. Without taking my eyes off her, I stood up. She hadn't moved since we'd seen each other, so I began to warily approach her."
    new "她好像随时都会消失。我目不转睛地盯着她，站了起来。自从我们看见彼此，她就没动过，于是我警惕地朝她走过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:24887
    old "...Are you actually Shiroya?"
    new "……你真的是 Shiroya 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:24888
    old "When I'd been crying her name, I'd only been wanting to find her to be able to hug her tightly. After she'd suddenly appeared like that, though, I couldn't bring myself to go forth, unaware of whether I'd stopped myself or her overwhelming look had."
    new "呼喊她名字的时候，我只想找到她，紧紧抱住她。可她就这么突然出现之后，我却迈不开步子，说不清拦住我的是我自己，还是她那令人心悸的神情。"

    # game/script.rpy:24889
    old "As if she hadn't heard me, she continued to stare at my chest with a melancholic look."
    new "她像是没听见我的话，仍带着忧郁的神色凝视着我的胸口。"

    # game/script.rpy:24896
    old "Wh-Where were you? What's with those clothes?{w} Are you the same person who disappeared with Sai?"
    new "你、你刚才在哪儿？这身衣服是怎么回事？{w} 你就是和 Sai 一起消失的那个人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:24898
    old "After some seconds, she finally answered."
    new "过了几秒，她才终于开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:24903
    old "I-I'm sorry... I'm very confused too. ...I-I guess so, though."
    new "对、对不起……我自己也乱得很。……不过，大、大概是的。"

    # game/script.rpy:24904
    old "You guess so?{w} What do you mean? You remember everything, right?"
    new "你是猜的？{w} 你什么意思？你什么都记得吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:24905
    old "Right now..."
    new "现在……"

    # game/script.rpy:24907
    old "She stopped."
    new "她停住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24908
    old "Yes?"
    new "怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:24913
    old "She looked lost and glanced over my shoulder. When I realized she hadn't paused voluntarily, I turned around, thinking she might've seen something."
    new "她神情茫然，目光越过我的肩头。当我意识到她不是主动停下的，便转过身，以为她看见了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:24921
    old "I had failed to recognize the sound I'd been constantly anticipating. Footsteps were approaching."
    new "我一直在等那个声音，却始终没听出来。脚步声正在靠近。"

    # game/script.rpy:24922
    old "However, a person came with them. I could hardly believe my eyes until I understood that what I was seeing had already occurred before."
    new "然而，和脚步声一起出现的还有一个人。我几乎不敢相信自己的眼睛，直到我明白，眼前这一幕以前已经发生过。"

    # game/script.rpy:24928
    old "I'm glad to see you two are safe. I was a bit worried...{w} Wh-What's with those clothes? You weren't wearing them earlier, were you...?"
    new "看到你们俩平安无事，我就放心了。我原本还有点担心……{w} 这、这身衣服是怎么回事？你们先前穿的不是这个吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:24929
    old "I couldn't act shocked or even surprised. Erina, who had died, was behind us, quietly approaching. It looked like she'd come from hallway C."
    new "我没法表现出震惊，连一点惊讶都装不出来。已经死去的 Erina 就在我们身后，悄无声息地走近。看样子她是从C走廊过来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:24930
    old "Who the hell are you? Or even you... How can you two exist!?"
    new "你到底是什么人？还有你……你们俩怎么可能存在！？"

    # game/script.rpy:24941
    old "It was the same thing. The \"body double\" I'd gone on about earlier. Erina's had appeared, and next to me must've been Shiroya's."
    new "是同一回事。就是我先前反复说的那个「替身」。Erina 的替身出现了，那我身旁这个，想必就是 Shiroya 的替身。"

    # game/script.rpy:24942
    old "Where were you? How did you just appear out of nowhere!?"
    new "你刚才在哪儿？怎么会凭空冒出来！？"

    # game/script.rpy:24945
    old "The confused expression she responded with was more than frustrating. I tried to focus on breathing to keep myself together. Just by looking at her, I'd noticed two glaring details."
    new "她回应时那副困惑的神情，实在让人烦躁。我试着专注于呼吸，稳住自己。光是看着她，我就注意到两处扎眼的细节。"

    # game/script.rpy:24946
    old "She looked almost as if she was sedated and only partially conscious. Her voice and body movements gave off the same feeling, so it was clear that she wasn't in the best state, either physically or mentally."
    new "她看上去像是被麻醉了，意识只清醒一半。她的声音和动作也给人同样的感觉，显然她无论身体还是精神都不在状态。"

    # game/script.rpy:24948
    old "But the major point was her clothes. Her chest was covered by the same bloodstain I'd seen before, and so were her legs and the upper part of her face. I spotted the same scratches that indicated a fight, meaning that her body was identical to the one I'd seen."
    new "但关键在于她的衣服。她胸口沾着和我先前见过的一模一样的血迹，腿上和上半张脸也是如此。我看到了同样的、像是搏斗留下的抓痕，也就是说，她的身体和我见过的那具一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:24949
    old "What do you not understand? Did you just pop into existence at some point?"
    new "你哪里不明白了？你是从某个时候凭空冒出来的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:24954
    old "No... Why do you think that?"
    new "不……你为什么这么想？"

    # game/script.rpy:24960
    old "Have you looked at that room? Your body is there."
    new "你看过那个房间吗？你的身体就在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:24966
    old "What...? That one? It... can't be."
    new "什么……？那个房间？不……不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:24967
    old "She staggered and took a while to complete her sentence. Trying to overcome whatever her condition was, she walked to it. The door was already partially open, so she just had to push it the rest of the way."
    new "她踉跄了一下，好一会儿才把话说完。她像是要压住身体的不适，朝那扇门走去。门本来就半开着，她只要再推开一点就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:24972
    old "I knew you were lying. I-I can't be here, of course not..."
    new "我就知道你在说谎。我、我不能待在这里，当然不能……"

    # game/script.rpy:24976
    old "I didn't have to move. Through the door, I could see that Erina's body had disappeared. Next to Naomi was Erina's curtain, but it had been left on the floor with no trace of the corpse I'd attempted to dignify."
    new "我不用挪步。从门口望进去，就能看见 Erina 的尸体已经不见了。Naomi 身旁是盖过 Erina 的那块遮布，却被丢在地上，底下那具我本想为她留几分体面的遗体已不见踪影。"

    # game/script.rpy:24982
    old "...Shiroya, what the hell is happening? Answer my other questions. How can you exist when it shouldn't be possible? Did the same thing happen to Erina?"
    new "……Shiroya，到底出什么事了？先回答我别的问题。你明明不该存在，怎么会站在这里？Erina 也遇上了一样的事吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:24987
    old "To Erina? She should be dead, right?"
    new "Erina 吗？她应该已经死了，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:24990
    old "Shiroya left my side to look through the door and saw that Naomi's corpse was the single remaining one."
    new "Shiroya 从我身边走开，探头往门里看，发现只剩 Naomi 一具尸体了。"

    # game/script.rpy:24991
    old "Wait, the cross!"
    new "等等，那个十字！"

    # game/script.rpy:24994
    old "She was ahead of me, so I had the chance to look at the collar of her shirt, where I'd drawn a black cross."
    new "她走在我前面，我正好看得见她衬衫的领口——我画黑色十字的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:24996
    old "It's not there... I'm sure that's the spot where I marked it."
    new "不见了……我确定当初就是画在这个位置的。"

    # game/script.rpy:25003
    old "About Erina, I think what happened isn't what you think."
    new "关于 Erina，我想事情并不像你想的那样。"

    # game/script.rpy:25004
    old "That's probably right. I can't think of anything anymore."
    new "大概吧。我已经什么都想不出来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25010
    old "...Under those stained clothes, there's no wound, right?"
    new "……那身沾了血的衣服底下，并没有伤口，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:25015
    old "Erina looked at her own chest and was taken aback by all the blood she saw on herself."
    new "Erina 低头看向自己的胸口，被自己身上那片血迹吓了一跳。"

    # game/script.rpy:25016
    old "There never was one. The body you think disappeared is her."
    new "从来就没有什么伤口。你以为消失的那具尸体，就是她。"

    # game/script.rpy:25017
    old "Do you mean that she never died?"
    new "你的意思是，她根本没有死？"

    # game/script.rpy:25018
    old "She nodded.{w} If that was the case, it was painfully simple, and I'd failed to think about it because of all the overlapping thoughts I'd had on the matter. I'd been thinking about a replicated body who'd shared the stained blood but not any wound, while, sure enough, we'd never actually confirmed there'd been one.{w} And, of course, the blood. If it wasn't hers, there was another very clear candidate to consider."
    new "她点了点头。{w}若真是如此，答案简单得近乎残酷，我却因为心里翻来覆去的种种推测，始终没往这上面想。我一直在设想那是一具复制出来的身体，沾着同样的血迹，却没有任何伤口，可事实上，我们从未真正确认过她身上有伤。{w}还有那些血。既然不是她的，那就还有一个再明显不过的人选。"

    # game/script.rpy:25022
    old "A-Are you serious...?{w} Were you playing dead, then? Or just unconscious? It doesn't look like you feel very well."
    new "你、你说真的……？{w}那你是在装死？还是只是昏过去了？你的脸色看起来很差。"

    # game/script.rpy:25027
    old "I'm not sure... I remember I was drawn to this room, and then I think I blacked out."
    new "我也说不清……我记得自己像是被什么引到了这个房间，然后就没了意识。"

    # game/script.rpy:25028
    old "Drawn? By a noise?"
    new "被引过来？是听到什么声音了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25033
    old "N-No... Something stronger, but I'm not sure what, exactly. I don't know whose blood this is, but since I woke up, I've felt... groggy and numb."
    new "不、不是……是更强烈的东西，可我也说不准究竟是什么。我不知道这是谁的血，但醒来之后，我一直觉得……昏昏沉沉，浑身发麻。"

    # game/script.rpy:25034
    old "I... see."
    new "原来……如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:25035
    old "Would we have known she was alive if we'd felt her pulse, then? Her experience was enigmatic, but I understood that what had come afterward could've been a result of our mistaken assumption."
    new "那么，若是当时探过她的脉搏，我们就能知道她还活着吗？她的经历仍旧是个谜，但我明白，之后发生的一切，或许都源于我们自以为是的判断。"

    # game/script.rpy:25038
    old "Shiroya, do you remember finding her body as well? And you realized what really happened? ...You still haven't explained what you're doing here. Are you the same Shiroya who disappeared from the event room with Sai?"
    new "Shiroya，你也记得自己发现了她的尸体吗？然后就想通了真相？……你还没解释自己为什么会在这里。你就是那个和 Sai 一起从活动室消失的 Shiroya 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25039
    old "...I wish I could explain everything to you, but I still don't really know what happened."
    new "……我也希望能把一切都解释给你听，可我自己到现在都还没弄清发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:25044
    old "But, yes. I'm really glad to see you again."
    new "不过，没错。能再见到你，我真的很高兴。"

    # game/script.rpy:25045
    old "She smiled. It was her—the person I'd cried the name of. No matter how many questions surrounded her, she was okay..."
    new "她笑了。是她——那个我曾哭喊着名字的人。无论她身上还缠着多少疑问，至少她安然无恙……"

    # game/script.rpy:25046
    old "Wh-What's with those clothes, then? Why is the cross not on them? Why did you ignore me when we saw each other in the event room and when I kept shouting your name?"
    new "那、那你这身衣服又是怎么回事？为什么上面没有十字？在活动室碰面的时候，还有我拼命喊你名字的时候，你为什么都不理我？"

    # game/script.rpy:25051
    old "...Well, I—"
    new "……这个，我——"

    # game/script.rpy:25056
    old "Hey... I'm still confused, but I have a question."
    new "那个……我还是没搞明白，不过我有个问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:25062
    old "The Sekimeiya... does it really make you travel through time?{w} How does it work?"
    new "Sekimeiya……它真的能让人穿越时间吗？{w}是怎么做到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:25070
    old "If I understand it... touching it with your skin activates it, right? And you can go far into the past if it's out of the cabinet for a while."
    new "如果我没理解错的话……用皮肤碰它就会启动，对吧？而且它离开展示柜越久，就能回到越远的过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:25071
    old "That's... what I've been working under, yes."
    new "我……一直是这么认为的，没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:25076
    old "I looked at Shiroya in case she found something wrong with that, but she nodded, albeit uncertainly."
    new "我看向 Shiroya，想看看她是否觉得这说法有问题，她却点了点头，只是神色有些迟疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:25081
    old "I was thinking. Why don't I just go back in time to save Isla?"
    new "我在想，我为什么不干脆回到过去，去救 Isla 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:25086
    old "...{w}Neither of us knew how to answer. We'd concluded the past couldn't be altered, so that shouldn't have been possible."
    new "……{w}我们两人都不知道该如何回答。我们早已得出结论：过去无法改变，所以那本该是做不到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:25087
    old "In the bedroom, despite managing to act semi-composed, Erina had always looked sorrowful as she tried to hope that her daughter had somehow survived. However, the woman in front of us was different."
    new "在卧室里的时候，Erina 虽然勉强撑出几分镇定，却始终面带悲色，只能试着相信女儿或许还活着。可眼前这个女人不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:25092
    old "I don't know why I didn't think of it earlier. Someone killed her a few hours ago, so I just have to go to that time and prevent it.{w} But I couldn't find the Sekimeiya. I kept looking at Isla's face for a very long time, and she told me that she could be saved. Then, I saw a girl, and after that I heard you shouting."
    new "我不知道自己为什么没早点想到。她几小时前被人杀了，那我只要回到那个时间点阻止那件事就行了。{w}可我找不到 Sekimeiya。我盯着 Isla 的脸看了很久很久，她告诉我，她还有救。接着，我看见了一个女孩，之后便听到了你的喊声。"

    # game/script.rpy:25095
    old "...A girl? You saw Shiroya?"
    new "……女孩？你看见 Shiroya 了？"

    # game/script.rpy:25100
    old "Um...{w} I guess it couldn't have been anyone else.{w} ...It must have been Shiroya."
    new "嗯……{w}我想那也不可能是别人。{w}……一定是 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:25110
    old "I also saw what happened to Katei... It looked horrible. Did someone do that?"
    new "我还看见了 Katei 的遭遇……实在惨不忍睹。是有人下的手吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25111
    old "...It couldn't have been an accident.{w} But anyway, the Sekimeiya's not in the event room."
    new "……那不可能是意外。{w}不过话说回来，Sekimeiya 不在活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:25113
    old "Are you sure...?{w} Do you know where it could be? I really need to find it."
    new "你确定……？{w}你知道它可能在哪儿吗？我真的必须找到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:25114
    old "No. I suspect Sai or Akaro must've taken it."
    new "不知道。我猜是 Sai 或者 Akaro 把它拿走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25115
    old "I hated it, but I couldn't tell her where I'd hidden it. She couldn't accomplish anything by going to the past; she would just have to experience Isla's death a second time. However, we'd never seen that Erina in the past, so I could know for certain that she wouldn't travel."
    new "我很不愿这样，却不能告诉她我把东西藏在了哪里。就算回到过去，她也改变不了什么，只会再经历一次 Isla 的死。何况，我们在过去从未见过这个模样的 Erina，可见她终究不会真的穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:25120
    old "...{w}Are you lying?"
    new "……{w}你在骗我吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25121
    old "What? No, I'm not."
    new "什么？没有，我没骗你。"

    # game/script.rpy:25122
    old "She's been alive all this time. Could she have seen me bringing the Sekimeiya to the staff room...?"
    new "她一直都活着。会不会是她看见我把 Sekimeiya 带进员工室了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:25127
    old "The way you two reacted. You don't want me to save Isla, do you?"
    new "看你们俩那反应。你们不想让我去救 Isla，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:25132
    old "That's not it at all... Remember that Sai and Akaro took the cabinet key. They probably have the Sekimeiya."
    new "根本不是这样……你忘了，展示柜的钥匙是 Sai 和 Akaro 拿走的。Sekimeiya 多半在他们手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:25138
    old "Shiroya was backing me up. I didn't know why something about her still felt off, but I was starting to accept that it was actually her. We'd just have to clear things up to understand exactly what had happened, but she remembered disappearing with Sai. That meant she already knew I'd taken the Sekimeiya myself."
    new "Shiroya 在替我说话。我不知道为什么还是觉得她哪里不对劲，但也渐渐接受了眼前的她确实是本人。事情的来龙去脉只能之后再理清，可她记得自己曾和 Sai 一起消失。也就是说，她早就知道拿走 Sekimeiya 的人是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:25143
    old "But Erina didn't give in. It was clear that she didn't trust us after all, despite what we'd talked about in the attic. She went to the event room, so we quietly walked behind."
    new "可 Erina 没有让步。尽管在阁楼里谈过那些话，她终究还是不信任我们。她走向活动室，我们便悄悄跟在后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:25153
    old "I-I knew it! You were lying..."
    new "我、我就知道！你在撒谎……"

    # game/script.rpy:25159
    old "You didn't want me to look at the cabinet!"
    new "你就是不想让我看那个展示柜！"

    # game/script.rpy:25168
    old "Behind the curtain was the glass, and behind that, the Sekimeiya I'd just left in a locker rested on top of the cushion."
    new "遮布后面是玻璃罩，玻璃罩后面，我刚刚放进储物柜的 Sekimeiya 正稳稳搁在垫子上。"

    # game/script.rpy:25173
    old "Shiroya looked at me, confused. My words had led her to think that the cabinet would be empty."
    new "Shiroya 困惑地望着我。是我先前那番话让她以为展示柜里空空如也。"

    # game/script.rpy:25175
    old "It's... teleporting."
    new "它……在传送。"

    # game/script.rpy:25176
    old "I'm sure it just teleported from the locker to the cabinet."
    new "它一定是刚从储物柜传送到了展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:25177
    old "And of course, this is no coincidental place. It must've returned to its \"starting point\", or something similar; a place where it's cold."
    new "而且这地方绝非偶然。它多半是回到了自己的「起点」之类的地方——一个寒冷的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:25188
    old "Erina opened the glass and rolled the Sekimeiya into her purse, avoiding direct contact with it. Then, she immediately let the curtain fall again to make it clear that she wouldn't put it back in."
    new "Erina 打开玻璃罩，没有直接碰 Sekimeiya，而是把它弄进了自己的手袋。随后她立刻放下遮布，摆明不会再把它放回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:25196
    old "There was a long silence until the hallway A door opened. Wondering what else could happen, we turned to face it and saw someone stepping into the room."
    new "沉默持续了很久，直到 A走廊的门开了。我们心里揣度着还能出什么事，转头望去，只见有人走进了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:25203
    old "Uh..."
    new "呃……"

    # game/script.rpy:25205
    old "I wanted to yell at him as soon as I saw his face, but I was too fed up to do so. I looked around me and laughed internally, having gone so quickly from thinking that I was alone to sharing a room with three people. Received with silence, Sai approached the cabinet."
    new "一看到他的脸，我就想冲他吼，可我实在烦透了，连火都发不出来。我环视四周，心里暗自好笑——刚才还以为只剩自己一个，转眼间这房间里就挤了四个人。Sai 没得到任何回应，径直朝展示柜走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:25210
    old "What's up?"
    new "怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:25211
    old "...What the fuck are you even doing here? Did you succeed with that plan of yours?"
    new "……你他妈来这儿干什么？你那个计划成了？"

    # game/script.rpy:25216
    old "Oh, not quite, unfortunately. I thought Erina was dead. What's she doing with the Sekimeiya?"
    new "哦，遗憾，没成。我还以为 Erina 死了。她拿着 Sekimeiya 做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:25223
    old "You thought that too? No. I'm going to go to the past to save Isla."
    new "你也这么想？不。我要回到过去救 Isla。"

    # game/script.rpy:25228
    old "Huh. I doubt that. The past can't be changed."
    new "哼，我不信。过去是改不了的。"

    # game/script.rpy:25234
    old "That's nonsense! I'm going to the past, so I'll prevent Isla from dying. You've used the Sekimeiya before, right? How long do I need to wait to go enough hours back?"
    new "胡说！我回到过去，就能阻止 Isla 死去。你以前用过 Sekimeiya 吧？要等多久，才能回到好几个小时之前？"

    # game/script.rpy:25239
    old "Um... It should be about fifteen minutes, but I still find it unlikely you'll change anything."
    new "嗯……大概十五分钟吧。不过我还是觉得，你什么也改变不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25246
    old "Sai... where the fuck did you go? Were you in the attic?{w} Do you know where Shiroya went? I saw her disappear with you."
    new "Sai……你他妈到底去哪儿了？你在阁楼里？{w}你知道 Shiroya 去哪儿了吗？我看见她和你一起消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25251
    old "Isn't she next to you? What's with those clothes, anyway? Aren't they from there?"
    new "她不是就在你旁边吗？话说那身衣服是怎么回事？不是那儿来的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25257
    old "...They are."
    new "……是那儿来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:25262
    old "I see, they're definitely an improvement for you.{w} And just ignore me, Atsuki. I was busy sorting something out."
    new "原来如此，穿在你身上确实顺眼多了。{w}还有，别管我，Atsuki。我刚才正忙着理清一些事。"

    # game/script.rpy:25263
    old "Ever since Sai had entered, Shiroya hadn't taken her eyes off him. Immediately after that last sentence, her lips curled up into a smile for a second, and her eyebrows raised."
    new "自从 Sai 进门，Shiroya 的视线就没从他身上移开过。他话音一落，她的嘴角微微上扬了一瞬，眉毛也扬了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:25265
    old "More moments of silence followed. Erina still showed no signs of reconsideration, and we couldn't forcefully take the Sekimeiya from her.{w} Sai had nonchalantly said that fifteen minutes would be enough to go many hours back when I'd just traveled approximately twenty minutes after storing that amount of time. I looked at Erina's purse, where the Sekimeiya was getting hotter and hotter."
    new "随后又是一阵沉默。Erina 丝毫没有回心转意的迹象，我们也不能硬从她手里抢走 Sekimeiya。{w}Sai 轻描淡写地说，等上十五分钟就足以回到好几个小时之前；可我才刚蓄能十五分钟，却只穿越了大约二十分钟。我望向 Erina 的手袋，里面的 Sekimeiya 正越来越烫。"

    # game/script.rpy:25266
    old "Wait... that's...!"
    new "等等……那是……！"

    # game/script.rpy:25274
    old "Oh, right, I'd forgotten about this too."
    new "啊，对了，这个我也忘了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25275
    old "Still sounding groggy, she traced my gaze up to her purse and took out a small piece of paper."
    new "她声音仍带着睡意，顺着我的视线看向自己的手袋，取出一张小纸片。"

    # game/script.rpy:25280
    old "I found this just now. I tried to read it, but my head hurt a lot. Do you know what it is?"
    new "这是我刚捡到的。我想读，可头疼得厉害。你知道这是什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25287
    old "She handed it to me, and I snatched it away, gripping it tightly. My hands started trembling as soon as I glanced at the words again and saw those familiar letters."
    new "她把它递给我，我一把夺过，紧紧攥住。我再次瞥见上面的字，认出那些熟悉的字迹时，手立刻抖了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:25288
    old "I'd left it behind without thinking about it, but I couldn't let Shiroya read it. Despite how suspicious it looked, I immediately stored it in my pocket."
    new "我之前没多想，就把它留在那儿了，可绝不能让它被 Shiroya 看到。尽管这么做很可疑，我还是立刻把它塞进了口袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:25298
    old "H-Hey... What was that?"
    new "喂、喂……那是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:25299
    old "Shiroya and Erina both found it strange, but I couldn't let them read the note under any circumstances. Shiroya would easily recognize my handwriting, so I'd run away if necessary."
    new "Shiroya 和 Erina 都觉得奇怪，但无论如何我都不能让她们读到那张纸条。Shiroya 一眼就能认出我的字迹，必要时我会逃走。"

    # game/script.rpy:25300
    old "Don't mind me, like you said."
    new "就像你说的，别管我。"

    # game/script.rpy:25305
    old "You look pretty nervous. I saw something written there.{w} You were pretty in control of things when you pulled off that trick with the key earlier, so why is this getting you all worked up? Do you wanna hide it that badly?"
    new "你看起来挺紧张的。我可看见上面写着字。{w}刚才你耍钥匙那套把戏的时候，还一副胸有成竹的样子，怎么现在反倒急成这样？你就那么想把它藏起来？"

    # game/script.rpy:25307
    old "...{w}It's just a personal paper. It has nothing to do with you or the Sekimeiya."
    new "……{w}只是一张私人纸条，和你、和 Sekimeiya 都没有关系。"

    # game/script.rpy:25312
    old "Very intriguing, then."
    new "那就更耐人寻味了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25318
    old "He didn't push it further, but at my side, I saw a mix of confusion and sadness emanating from Shiroya."
    new "他没有再追问，可我身旁的 Shiroya 脸上，困惑与难过交织在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:25319
    old "It was understandable. I still didn't know what she'd gone through, but before entering the tower, we'd spent many days mourning our loss, our shared company being a silent healer. By saying it was a personal matter, I'd outright said I only wanted to hide it from her."
    new "这也难怪。我至今不清楚她经历过什么，但在进塔之前，我们一同度过了许多哀悼失去之人的日子，彼此的陪伴就是无声的慰藉。而我说那是私事，无异于明说我只想瞒着她一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:25320
    old "I'd never made it apparent I could've been hiding anything, no matter how small. I still had many more questions to ask her, but what would my response be if she ever inquired about it...?"
    new "我从未表露过自己藏着什么，哪怕是再小的东西。我还有好多话想问她，可万一她问起这件事，我又该如何回答……？"

    # game/script.rpy:25321
    old "When she saw that I had nothing else to say, she smiled bitterly and looked down at her feet."
    new "见我无话可说，她苦笑了一下，低下头看着自己的脚尖。"

    # game/script.rpy:25332
    old "So, did any of you see Miiya...?"
    new "那么，你们有谁看见 Miiya 了吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:25340
    old "Wh..."
    new "什……"

    # game/script.rpy:25345
    old "Who?"
    new "谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:25351
    old "You don't know her, right? I... I knew I wasn't going insane."
    new "你们不认识她吧？我……我就知道我没疯。"

    # game/script.rpy:25357
    old "H-How do you know that name?"
    new "你、你怎么会知道那个名字？"

    # game/script.rpy:25362
    old "She's the person I was with earlier, before I saw you two... It just came back to me. I don't know where she went, though."
    new "她就是我看见你们俩之前跟我在一起的那个人……我刚刚才想起来。不过我不知道她去了哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:25363
    old "What...{w} the fuck is going on?"
    new "这……{w}他妈到底是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:25368
    old "What's with that reaction? Don't you see she's just delirious?{w} She didn't die, but I have a pretty good idea of what happened to her. Say, did you hallucinate someone?"
    new "你这是什么反应？看不出来她只是在说胡话吗？{w}她没死，不过她身上发生了什么，我大致猜得到。话说回来，你是产生了幻觉，看见了某个人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25369
    old "That's not it. That's not just some name she made up."
    new "不是这样。那可不是她随口编出来的名字。"

    # game/script.rpy:25374
    old "Do you know this person, then?"
    new "那你们认识这个人？"

    # game/script.rpy:25380
    old "...We do, but Erina couldn't have seen her. She couldn't be here."
    new "……认识。可 Erina 不可能见到她。她不可能在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:25381
    old "Are you sure? She could've entered through the storeroom. She could've even traveled from the future since the Sekimeiya's bound to be exposed to the outside world."
    new "你确定？她也许是从储藏室进来的。甚至可能是从未来穿越过来的——Sekimeiya 迟早会暴露在外界面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:25382
    old "That's not what she means... She's not anywhere right now."
    new "她不是这个意思……她现在不在任何地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:25387
    old "Oh? Is she dead?{w} ...Wait, Miiya, you said...?"
    new "哦？她死了？{w}……等等，你刚才说 Miiya……？"

    # game/script.rpy:25394
    old "...No. She's with us. She has red hair, right?"
    new "……不。她跟我们在一起。她是红头发，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:25395
    old "Miiya's hair... was red.{w} I recalled Akaro's voice from the time he'd lost some of his memories. What he'd said almost implied that he knew what happened to Miiya and what we'd gone through."
    new "Miiya 的头发……是红色的。{w}我想起了 Akaro 失去部分记忆时的声音。他当时说的话，几乎暗示他知道 Miiya 遭遇了什么，也知道我们经历了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:25401
    old "...Did you actually see her? What did she say?"
    new "……你真的见到她了？她说了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:25402
    old "She told me her name, but she didn't look lost or anything. She knew me, too..."
    new "她告诉了我她的名字，可她看上去一点也不茫然。她还认得我……"

    # game/script.rpy:25405
    old "She just suddenly ran away, and I haven't seen her again. I definitely thought I hadn't seen her before, but I honestly wasn't sure."
    new "她突然就跑了，我再没见过她。我本来一直认定自己从没见过她，可说实话，我也拿不准。"

    # game/script.rpy:25407
    old "Is Miiya... here?"
    new "Miiya……在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:25408
    old "Is she alive? Are we going to succeed and save her somehow?"
    new "她还活着？我们真能想办法救下她吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25409
    old "As soon as I felt hope building up, I tried to contain it. That didn't make sense. Why would she have been in the tower? Why would she not have shown herself? There was no way Miiya was nearby, or anywhere."
    new "希望刚一升起，我便努力将它压了下去。这说不通。她怎么会在塔里？又为什么不肯露面？Miiya 不可能就在附近，也不可能在任何地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:25411
    old "I don't know how to interpret this. Did you all agree to make up this story for when I appeared?"
    new "我真不知道该怎么理解。你们是不是早就串通好，等我一出现就编出这套说辞？"

    # game/script.rpy:25417
    old "Well, I'm trying to figure things out myself and I thought I was close to understanding quite a bit, but now there's a bunch of shit I don't get, and it doesn't feel great."
    new "我自己也在琢磨这一切，本来以为已经快要弄明白不少事了，结果现在冒出一堆我搞不懂的鬼东西，感觉可不怎么好。"

    # game/script.rpy:25418
    old "I didn't ask, but it sounded like he wasn't only talking about the sudden appearance of an unknown person."
    new "我没有追问，但听他的口气，他在意的似乎不只是那个陌生人的突然出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:25423
    old "You did mean she died, right? Is saving her with the Sekimeiya not an option?"
    new "你刚才确实是说她死了吧？难道不能用 Sekimeiya 救她？"

    # game/script.rpy:25429
    old "Sai, shut the fuck up. If it was, I promise you that we would've done it."
    new "Sai，你他妈给我闭嘴。要是能救，我保证我们早就做了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25435
    old "Once again, there was silence. Shiroya looked pensive, but I had no clue what was going on inside her head. I basically understood nothing about her."
    new "又是一阵沉默。Shiroya 若有所思，可我完全猜不到她脑子里在想什么。我对她几乎一无所知。"

    # game/script.rpy:25436
    old "I couldn't assume that Erina had just hallucinated because she knew Miiya's name and appearance, but I also couldn't accept that she was inside the tower."
    new "Erina 知道 Miiya 的名字和相貌，我不能认定她只是产生了幻觉；可要我接受 Miiya 就在塔里，我也做不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:25437
    old "Did Erina just lie...?{w} How would she know about her? And why would she do that?"
    new "难道是 Erina 在撒谎……？{w}她怎么会知道 Miiya？又为什么要撒这种谎？"

    # game/script.rpy:25443
    old "It's probably been close to fifteen minutes already, right?"
    new "差不多快十五分钟了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:25450
    old "I'd say so."
    new "我看是。"

    # game/script.rpy:25451
    old "Sai looked at his watch."
    new "Sai 看了一眼手表。"

    # game/script.rpy:25456
    old "Yes, it's been almost fifteen minutes since I arrived."
    new "没错，从我到这里算起，快十五分钟了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25462
    old "Are you sure I'll go far enough back?"
    new "你确定我能回到足够早的时间？"

    # game/script.rpy:25468
    old "She died at around {time=14}, right? It should be enough, yes."
    new "她是在 {time=14} 前后死的吧？那应该够了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25469
    old "I understood the lies, but not the heartless way in which he was deceiving a mother into thinking she was close to saving her daughter. Regardless, it had probably been fifteen minutes already, so Erina would travel to the past if we didn't stop her."
    new "那些谎话我听得懂，却不懂他为何能如此无情，竟去骗一个母亲，让她以为自己马上就要救回女儿。无论如何，十五分钟大概已经到了——我们若不阻止，Erina 就会穿越回过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:25470
    old "That's strange. Once again, if she's about to travel to the past, how come her past self hasn't already appeared?{w} Of course, seeing her future self should be an impossibility, but why would she have decided not to show herself?"
    new "奇怪。还是那个问题，如果她马上就要穿越回过去，那过去的她为什么还没出现？{w}当然，她不可能见到未来的自己，可她为什么决定不露面呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:25475
    old "...Okay. I'm going, then. Are all of you coming with me?"
    new "……好。那我走了。你们都会跟我一起来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25476
    old "Don't worry, we're far enough from you."
    new "放心，我们离你够远。"

    # game/script.rpy:25480
    old "Sai stepped back a bit anyway."
    new "Sai 还是往后退开了一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:25485
    old "I understand. Well... goodbye for now."
    new "我明白。嗯……暂时再见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25493
    old "Earlier, Sai had traveled after storing energy for fifteen minutes—the same amount.{w} At that time, I hadn't traveled despite being next to Shiroya, so I knew how big the range would be. I stepped back too to be sure I wasn't included and wouldn't travel away from Shiroya."
    new "先前 Sai 蓄能十五分钟——同样长的时间——之后便穿越了。{w}那时我就在 Shiroya 身边，却没有被一起传走，所以我知道范围有多大。我也退开了几步，确保自己不在范围内，不会从 Shiroya 身边被传送走。"

    # game/script.rpy:25498
    old "In a solemn manner and keeping her eyes on us, Erina reached for the Sekimeiya with her left hand."
    new "Erina 神情肃穆，目光始终落在我们身上，左手伸向了 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:25499
    old "When she touched it, there was a change."
    new "她触到它的那一刻，变化出现了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25504
    old "Trampoline"
    new "蹦床"

    # game/script.rpy:25518
    old "Wait... what?"
    new "等等……什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:25519
    old "None of us could understand what had occurred."
    new "我们谁都不明白究竟发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:25525
    old "Erina didn't travel... Sai did."
    new "穿越的人不是 Erina……是 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:25533
    old "Why didn't it work!? Did Sai disappear?{w} Was everything that he said a lie...?"
    new "为什么没有生效！？Sai 消失了吗？{w} 难道他说的一切都是谎话……？"

    # game/script.rpy:25534
    old "I couldn't fathom it. What had happened defied everything we'd learned."
    new "我根本想不通。发生的一切，完全违背了我们之前知道的一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:25542
    old "Shiroya and I had been pretty close to Erina, but going off Sai's previous travel, the range shouldn't have been large enough to pick us up."
    new "我和 Shiroya 离 Erina 相当近，但按照 Sai 上次穿越的情况，范围应该不足以把我们卷进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:25543
    old "We'd been farther back than Sai, but why had he been the only one to travel? And what I'd thought earlier still applied: where had his past self been all that time?"
    new "我们站得比 Sai 更靠后，可为什么只有他穿越了？先前的疑问也依然没有答案：过去的他这段时间究竟在哪里？"

    # game/script.rpy:25550
    old "Admit it... Did you ever want me to save Isla? Were you... Were you involved in the first place!?"
    new "你就承认吧……你到底想没想过让我去救 Isla？你……你从一开始就掺和进来了吧！？"

    # game/script.rpy:25556
    old "You're wrong. We don't know how the Sekimeiya works, but this shouldn't have happened..."
    new "你错了。我们确实不知道 Sekimeiya 的原理，但这种事本不该发生……"

    # game/script.rpy:25557
    old "I don't get it! Is it all nonsense? Can we not figure out how it works because it just does whatever it wants?"
    new "我不明白！难道这一切都是无稽之谈？我们弄不懂它的规律，难道只是因为它想怎样就怎样？"

    # game/script.rpy:25558
    old "It's been pretty consistent up until now, so what's this shit...? Why did Erina not travel but Sai did when he was out of the range?"
    new "在此之前，它的表现一直相当有规律，那这次到底是怎么回事……？为什么 Erina 没有穿越，反倒是站在范围外的 Sai 穿越了？"

    # game/script.rpy:25559
    old "There's even another instance... The first time I traveled, I went twenty minutes back, meaning that the Sekimeiya had to have been storing energy for fifteen minutes. At the time, Sai was the closest person to me, and he was pretty much at the same distance he was from Erina just now, but he didn't travel then!"
    new "还有另一个例子……我第一次穿越时回到了二十分钟前，也就是说 Sekimeiya 当时已经蓄能十五分钟。那时离我最近的人是 Sai，他与我的距离，和刚才他与 Erina 的距离几乎一样，可那次他并没有穿越！"

    # game/script.rpy:25567
    old "No... I'm misinterpreting it."
    new "不……是我理解错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25568
    old "That has to be it... I assumed I knew what the range was since the conditions were identical to Sai's last travel."
    new "一定是这样……因为这次的条件和 Sai 上次穿越时完全相同，我就自以为已经知道了范围有多大。"

    # game/script.rpy:25569
    old "I didn't travel that time, but Shiroya did, even though she was next to me. That led me to think I was just barely out of range and that only she was included."
    new "那一次我没有穿越，待在我身边的 Shiroya 却穿越了。于是我误以为，自己只是恰好落在范围之外，只有她被包含在内。"

    # game/script.rpy:25570
    old "But that wasn't the case. I was also in range, and I didn't travel for another reason, just like how Erina didn't just now. It's what I thought: something prevented me from traveling, and it just happened again."
    new "但事实并非如此。我其实也在范围内，没有穿越，是另有原因，就像刚才的 Erina 一样。果然如我所想：有某种因素阻止了我穿越，而这一次，同样的情况又发生了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25571
    old "Just earlier, I told Sai that I saw Shiroya disappear with him. He must've realized that I hadn't traveled, so he set up the same conditions for Erina's travel and felt safe at a slightly farther distance than I was from him before. However, he just fell victim to my own misinterpretation. The previous time, the range was actually big enough to encompass me, but I didn't go anywhere..."
    new "刚才我告诉 Sai，我看见 Shiroya 和他一起消失了。他一定意识到我没有穿越，于是为 Erina 安排了相同的条件，还自认为站得比我上次离他稍远一点就安全了。可他偏偏栽在了我的误判上。上一次范围其实大到把我也包括了进去，我却哪儿也没去……"

    # game/script.rpy:25576
    old "And in the latest travel, the four of us might've been included while only Sai disappeared. What was the reason...? It couldn't be that only two people could travel anymore. Was there anything that would make sense?"
    new "而在最近这次穿越中，我们四个人可能都被包含在范围内，可消失的只有 Sai。原因究竟是什么……？总不可能变成一次只能有两个人穿越了吧。有没有什么解释能说得通？"

    # game/script.rpy:25583
    old "...Wait! Where did it go!?"
    new "……等等！它去哪了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:25584
    old "I quickly looked up and saw Erina's desperate eyes. She was staring at her purse."
    new "我连忙抬头，看见 Erina 一脸绝望。她正死死盯着自己的手提包。"

    # game/script.rpy:25585
    old "It's not here!"
    new "它不在里面！"

    # game/script.rpy:25586
    old "I was wrong. Sai wasn't the only thing to disappear—the Sekimeiya also had."
    new "我错了。消失的不只是 Sai——Sekimeiya 也不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25587
    old "It... teleported."
    new "它……传送走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25588
    old "I'd experienced it for the first time. The infamous teleportation we'd constantly thought about had revealed itself to us. Erina's travel activated it, taking Sai away in the process."
    new "这是我第一次亲身经历。那个令我们不断猜测、谈之色变的传送，终于现出了真容。Erina 的穿越触发了它，也把 Sai 一并带走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25589
    old "I remembered what had happened just minutes prior, so I took a few steps forward."
    new "我想起几分钟前发生的事，于是向前走了几步。"

    # game/script.rpy:25594
    old "When I was in front of the cabinet, I crouched and grabbed the bottom of the curtain. I raised it violently and kept it from falling again."
    new "来到展示柜前，我蹲下身，抓住遮布的下缘，猛地掀开，又按住不让它再垂落。"

    # game/script.rpy:25602
    old "Behind the glass was the Sekimeiya. It had traveled from Erina's purse to its initial cabinet."
    new "玻璃后面正是 Sekimeiya。它从 Erina 的手提包，回到了最初摆放它的那个展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:25607
    old "Atsuki, tell me... What do I need to do to travel through time?"
    new "Atsuki，告诉我……我到底要怎么做，才能穿越时间？"

    # game/script.rpy:25608
    old "Exactly what Sai and I told you. I don't know why it didn't work just now."
    new "就像我和 Sai 告诉你的那样。刚才为什么没生效，我也不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:25609
    old "And since this confirms that it can actually teleport, there's no way I still have the Sekimeiya in the locker."
    new "既然这已经证实它确实会传送，那我的储物柜里就不可能还留着 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:25610
    old "In fact, the teleportation probably caused the illusion from the start... The \"other\" Sekimeiya.{w} I'm not sure how it happened, but I bet it was the same one every time."
    new "实际上，那个假象很可能从一开始就是传送造成的……那个「另一个」Sekimeiya。{w} 我不清楚是怎么做到的，但我敢打赌，每次出现的都是同一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:25611
    old "Why is Sai not here already? ...Did he think of using the time he gained to do something?"
    new "Sai 怎么还没出现？……他是不是打算利用多出来的时间做些什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:25612
    old "He had likely gone about twenty minutes into the past, so he had time to think of a better course of action than rushing in as soon as possible."
    new "他大概回到了二十分钟前，因此有时间想出一个比立刻赶过来更好的对策。"

    # game/script.rpy:25617
    old "Realizing our confusion was sincere, Erina's face went pale, and she would've fallen backward if not for the wall behind her."
    new "Erina 看出我们是真的困惑，脸色顿时煞白，要不是背后有墙，她几乎就要向后瘫倒。"

    # game/script.rpy:25622
    old "Three towering questions just presented themselves to us, challenging everything up until this point."
    new "三个巨大的疑问摆在眼前，动摇了我们此前所有的认知。"

    # game/script.rpy:25623
    old "One: was the range really the same as the last time the Sekimeiya stored time for fifteen minutes?"
    new "第一：这次的范围，真的和上次 Sekimeiya 蓄能十五分钟时相同吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25624
    old "Two: why was Sai the only one to travel?"
    new "第二：为什么只有 Sai 穿越了？"

    # game/script.rpy:25625
    old "Three: why did the Sekimeiya instantly teleport away?"
    new "第三：为什么 Sekimeiya 会立刻传送离开？"

    # game/script.rpy:25629
    old "Regarding the range, we can't know how it actually functions. I've assumed it only starts to expand when time begins to be stored, but what if that's not the case? Could it also increase while the Sekimeiya's in the cabinet? Or what if the range from previous travels persists, for example?"
    new "至于范围，我们根本无法确定它究竟如何运作。我一直假定它只在开始蓄能时才会扩张，可万一并非如此呢？会不会 Sekimeiya 待在展示柜里时，范围也在扩大？又或者，前几次穿越留下的范围会一直保留下来？"

    # game/script.rpy:25630
    old "The second is the most confusing one. Erina, Shiroya, and I haven't traveled. There's no way we weren't included in the range, is there? At least not Erina, who touched the Sekimeiya...{w} But it only worked for Sai... There has to be a reason why we were excluded, but is it reasonable to think I can figure it out?"
    new "第二个疑问最令人费解。Erina、Shiroya 和我都没有穿越。我们不可能不在范围内吧？至少碰过 Sekimeiya 的 Erina 不会不在……{w} 可生效的偏偏只有 Sai……我们被排除在外一定有其原因，但我真能想明白吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25631
    old "What does this do to the concept of range? Now how can we be sure that it exists? Perhaps there's no range at all, and something else entirely determines who's included in the travel."
    new "这样一来，「范围」这个概念还成立吗？现在又怎么能确定它真的存在？也许根本没有什么范围，决定谁被卷入穿越的完全是别的因素。"

    # game/script.rpy:25632
    old "And, finally, why did the Sekimeiya disappear from Erina's purse?"
    new "最后，Sekimeiya 为什么会从 Erina 的手提包里消失？"

    # game/script.rpy:25633
    old "It's impossible that happens every time it's activated: it didn't disappear when Sai and Shiroya traveled."
    new "不可能每次启动都会这样：Sai 和 Shiroya 穿越时，它就没有消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:25634
    old "Without a doubt, this is the strangest travel so far. Those three questions might all be connected to one single misconception."
    new "毫无疑问，这是目前为止最古怪的一次穿越。那三个疑问，也许全都源于同一个误判。"

    # game/script.rpy:25635
    old "What are we supposed to do...? How am I supposed to understand this thing if it keeps breaking its own rules? How can I ever even hope to use it for anything?"
    new "我们该怎么办……？如果它不断打破自己的规则，我又怎么可能弄懂它？更别说指望用它做什么了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25641
    old "Can I... not save Isla? Why did it not work...?{w} Oh, of course.{w} What was I even thinking? Traveling to the past isn't possible.{w} You lied about it since the beginning, right? That's why it didn't work: it can't happen. I actually fell for it."
    new "我……救不了 Isla 吗？为什么没有生效……？{w} 啊，当然了。{w} 我到底在想什么？回到过去根本不可能。{w} 你从一开始就在骗我，对不对？所以才会失败：那根本不可能发生。我居然真的上当了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25642
    old "I was too lost to answer. Something had happened to Erina—that was for sure. She'd just witnessed Sai's disappearance but was accusing us of lying. It seemed that trying to explain ourselves wouldn't be much help."
    new "我一时茫然，不知该怎么回答。Erina 身上一定出了什么事——这点毋庸置疑。她明明亲眼看见 Sai 消失，却反过来指责我们在撒谎。看样子，再怎么解释也是白费。"

    # game/script.rpy:25643
    old "Just wait here. I'll be back in a second."
    new "在这里等我，我马上回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:25650
    old "Before she could react, I moved to hallway B. I needed to check the staff room."
    new "没等她有所反应，我已动身前往 B走廊。员工室那边，我得去确认一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:25655
    old "The locker where I'd hidden the Sekimeiya was directly to my right. I unlocked it with the key and opened the door."
    new "藏 Sekimeiya 的储物柜就在我右手边。我用钥匙开了锁，拉开柜门。"

    # game/script.rpy:25660
    old "The Sekimeiya wasn't there. Only the pants and the coat remained inside.{w} I closed the door and locked it again."
    new "Sekimeiya 不在里面。柜中只剩下裤子和外套。{w}我关上门，重新上了锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:25663
    old "I see... Shiroya was right, then. The other time, it did teleport away from Naomi's locker."
    new "原来如此……看来 Shiroya 说得没错。上一次，它确实是从 Naomi 的储物柜里传送走的。"

    # game/script.rpy:25668
    old "In hallway B, I saw Shiroya waiting for me next to the event room."
    new "来到 B走廊，我看见 Shiroya 在活动室旁等着我。"

    # game/script.rpy:25675
    old "...Did it disappear?"
    new "……它不见了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25681
    old "What else could've happened? I couldn't rule out another person having the key, but while I had room to construct a theory that didn't involve self-teleportation, it seemed pointless to do so."
    new "不然还能是怎么回事？我也无法排除另一个人持有钥匙的可能——可就算我还能设想出一套不涉及「自行传送」的解释，那也毫无意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:25682
    old "Had someone put another Sekimeiya in the cabinet after entering from hallway A and taken mine out of the staff room while we were in the event room? There was no way. Nobody else had been involved."
    new "难道是有人从 A走廊进来，把另一个 Sekimeiya 放进展示柜，又趁我们在活动室时，把我放在员工室的那个取走？不可能。这件事没有别人插手。"

    # game/script.rpy:25687
    old "Wh-What did you want to do?"
    new "你、你想做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:25688
    old "Oh, I'm just wondering about Sai's whereabouts because an extra version of him has existed somewhere in the past."
    new "哦，我只是在想 Sai 的下落。毕竟在过去某个时刻，还存在一个多出来的他。"

    # game/script.rpy:25693
    old "Did we never see him in so many hours?"
    new "这么多小时里，我们一次都没见到他吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25694
    old "\"So many hours\". Right, she thinks Sai went back to before Isla died. In reality, he went back about twenty minutes, if that's consistent.{w} ...Although she just went from saying time travel isn't possible to thinking it is again. She's more unstable than I thought."
    new "「这么多小时」……没错，她以为 Sai 回到了 Isla 死前的时候。可实际上，若前后一致的话，他只回溯了二十分钟左右。{w}……不过她刚才还说时间穿越不可能，转眼又觉得确有其事。她比我想的还要不稳定。"

    # game/script.rpy:25697
    old "...I'm not sure, but he has to be somewhere."
    new "……我不确定，但他总该在某个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:25698
    old "I was a little frustrated by Shiroya's continued silence. She was definitely thinking about what had happened, but she might've had information I wasn't aware of, and nothing she had revealed yet."
    new "Shiroya 一直沉默不语，让我有些焦躁。她肯定在琢磨发生了什么，可她手里或许握着我所不知的情报，却一点也没透露。"

    # game/script.rpy:25699
    old "The three of us were going over our thoughts when, suddenly, the door to the lobby opened."
    new "我们三人正各自梳理着思绪，大厅的门忽然开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25710
    old "There you are. What were you doing?"
    new "你在这儿啊。刚才都干什么去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:25713
    old "Something was strange, and it immediately became apparent. Sai had shown up from the lobby, so I was relieved to know that he wouldn't be unaccounted for. He, on the other hand, looked completely different."
    new "有什么不对劲，而且立刻就看出来了。Sai 从大厅走了进来，我松了口气，至少他不是下落不明。可他那副样子，却和平时判若两人。"

    # game/script.rpy:25714
    old "Wh...? What the fuck?"
    new "什……？搞什么鬼？"

    # game/script.rpy:25715
    old "I'd never seen him so confused. He'd tried to have the upper hand in every situation, but his face told the truth: he couldn't comprehend what he was seeing. From his point of view, something was very wrong."
    new "我从没见过他这么失措。以往无论什么局面，他都想占上风，可此刻他的表情出卖了他：眼前的一切，他根本看不懂。在他看来，一定有什么出了大问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:25722
    old "...!{w} Wh-Who the fuck are you? How are you here?"
    new "……！{w}你、你他妈是谁？怎么会在这儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:25728
    old "From the event room, a door opened. After everything that had just happened, when I saw who came out, I barely reacted."
    new "活动室那边，一扇门开了。刚才发生了那么多事，所以看清走出来的人是谁时，我几乎没什么反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:25733
    old "Whoa! What's this girl doing here!?"
    new "哇！这女孩怎么会在这里！？"

    # game/script.rpy:25734
    old "Those were the first words I'd heard from Akaro in hours. Recognizing the person who shared his bewilderment, he stood next to Sai while the three of us looked at each other in case someone understood what was occurring."
    new "这是我几个小时以来第一次听到 Akaro 开口。他看出 Sai 和自己一样满脸困惑，便站到 Sai 身旁；而我们三人面面相觑，盼着有人能明白究竟发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:25739
    old "Atsuki! Now you have to answer! Who is she?"
    new "Atsuki！这下你总该回答了吧！她是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:25745
    old "...Are you actually acting as if you don't recognize me?"
    new "……你们是真打算装作不认识我？"

    # game/script.rpy:25747
    old "Of course we don't!"
    new "我们当然不认识！"

    # game/script.rpy:25752
    old "Well... No.{w} Of course we do.{w} Aren't you... dead?"
    new "呃……不认识。{w}不对，当然认识。{w}你不是……死了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25755
    old "Again...!"
    new "又来了……！"

    # game/script.rpy:25756
    old "\"Shiroya's fate is death.\""
    new "「Shiroya 的命运是死亡。」{w=2.8}{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:25759
    old "\"I need to say it. I've always wanted to, and I can't believe I never will. I love you.\""
    new "「我必须说出来。{w}我一直都想说，怎么也想不到竟会再没有机会。{w}我爱你。」"

    # game/script.rpy:25760
    old "Nightmarish memories split my brain in half. It seemed like the world was abandoning all sense, warping into something completely repulsive."
    new "噩梦般的记忆几乎把我的脑袋劈成两半。这个世界仿佛正在抛弃一切常理，扭曲成某种令人作呕的模样。"

    # game/script.rpy:25761
    old "M-Me...? Why would I be dead?"
    new "我……？我怎么会死？"

    # game/script.rpy:25762
    old "And you too, Erina! I thought you'd died!"
    new "还有你，Erina！我还以为你死了！"

    # game/script.rpy:25770
    old "Wh...? Isn't that what you said earlier?"
    new "什……？你刚才不是这么说的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25771
    old "Earlier? What the hell are you talking about?"
    new "刚才？你在说什么鬼话？"

    # game/script.rpy:25772
    old "Before the conversation could escalate further, I had to ask a very important question which had been repeating throughout our imprisonment."
    new "在对话进一步失控之前，我必须问一个至关重要的问题，而这个问题从我们被困起就一直在脑中盘旋。"

    # game/script.rpy:25773
    old "Sai, what time is it?"
    new "Sai，现在几点？"

    # game/script.rpy:25778
    old "Uh...{w} it's {time=18:43.}"
    new "呃……{w}现在是{time=18:43.}"

    # game/script.rpy:25782
    old "{time=18:43.}..{w} That was about twenty minutes behind the real time I estimated. That meant Sai's replicated location after traveling had been twenty minutes prior, and his watch hadn't stopped working."
    new "{time=18:43.}……{w}这比我估算的真实时间慢了大约二十分钟。也就是说，Sai 穿越后所在的那个时间点，其实比现在早了二十分钟，而他的手表并没有停走。"

    # game/script.rpy:25789
    old "Why? Did you time travel?"
    new "怎么？你时间穿越了？"

    # game/script.rpy:25790
    old "N-No. I didn't."
    new "没、没有。我没穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:25795
    old "He's right, though. Are you a future version of Erina or something?"
    new "不过他说得对。你该不会是未来的 Erina 什么的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:25797
    old "Well, you're not dead after all, but we felt your pulse... In any case, I figured you would've come from the future. What even happened to you?"
    new "你毕竟没死，可我们当时分明摸过你的脉搏……总之，我原以为你是从未来过来的。你到底出了什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:25803
    old "Um... I can't remember much. I think someone hit my head, and I fell unconscious. I don't know what happened before that."
    new "那个……我记不太清了。好像有人打了我头一下，我就昏了过去。在那之前发生了什么，我也不清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:25808
    old "Yeah, that's about what we knew too. Sorry that we can't be of more use."
    new "嗯，我们知道的也就这些。抱歉，帮不上更多忙。"

    # game/script.rpy:25809
    old "I was losing it. I was about to explode. What the fuck was happening? Was it all a joke, deliberately constructed to destroy me?"
    new "我快要崩溃了，几乎要当场爆发。这他妈到底是怎么回事？难道这一切都是玩笑，是特意设计来摧毁我的？"

    # game/script.rpy:25814
    old "I don't get it either, but I'm glad you're safe. This means you're not guaranteed to end up dead, but you... What even is your name? How did you get here?"
    new "我也搞不懂，不过你平安就好。这说明你未必一定会死，可你……你到底叫什么名字？又是怎么到这儿来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:25821
    old "...I've been here since the start."
    new "……我从一开始就在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:25826
    old "That's not true."
    new "不对。"

    # game/script.rpy:25827
    old "It was the same thing. In the attic, an Akaro who claimed to only possess partial memories of events had appeared. Was Sai a victim of that as well?"
    new "又是同样的情形。在阁楼里，也曾出现过一个自称只记得部分事情的 Akaro。Sai 会不会也是这样？"

    # game/script.rpy:25832
    old "Hold on, though... Your name... I think I might actually remember that.{w} Shi... roya, was it? My memories are a little foggy."
    new "不过，等等……你的名字……我好像还真有印象。{w}Shi……roya，对吧？我的记忆有点模糊。"

    # game/script.rpy:25838
    old "She nodded, speechless."
    new "她无言地点了点头。"

    # game/script.rpy:25843
    old "I thought so. Like I said... I thought you'd died."
    new "果然。就像我说的……我以为你已经死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25849
    old "As you can see, I'm alive."
    new "如你所见，我活得好好的。"

    # game/script.rpy:25854
    old "Do you have a twin, by any chance?"
    new "你该不会有个双胞胎姐妹吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:25855
    old "What? No."
    new "什么？没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:25860
    old "But, then... It doesn't make any sense. I'm still really confused..."
    new "可是，那……这可就说不通了。我还是想不明白……"

    # game/script.rpy:25866
    old "What the fuck do you mean you're \"confused\"!? She just showed up like that! Did you enter through the storeroom?"
    new "你他妈在说什么「想不明白」！？她就是这么突然冒出来的！你是从储藏室进来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:25867
    old "I've been with you since {time=9}, Sai."
    new "Sai，从 {time=9} 起，我就一直和你们在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:25872
    old "That's a load of crap. Regardless, you'll definitely die. I'm sorry to tell you like that, but you're not making it easy for us. Atsuki, I know you know her."
    new "一派胡言。不管怎样，你肯定会死。很抱歉这样跟你说，可你实在让我们难办。Atsuki，我知道你认识她。"

    # game/script.rpy:25874
    old "...{w}I do, and she's telling the truth."
    new "……{w}我认识，而且她说的是实话。"

    # game/script.rpy:25877
    old "Are you just fucking with me? What's the point of lying so blatantly?"
    new "你他妈是在耍我吗？这么明目张胆地撒谎，有什么意义？"

    # game/script.rpy:25884
    old "He's... He's telling the truth. Shiroya's been with us the entire time."
    new "他……他说的是真的。Shiroya 一直都在我们身边。"

    # game/script.rpy:25889
    old "The entire time? Not even you have been here since {time=9}!"
    new "一直都在？连你都不是从 {time=9} 起就在这里的！"

    # game/script.rpy:25900
    old "Well, you get what I mean. You don't remember when you got attacked or where you came from very well, right?"
    new "行了，你懂我的意思。你既记不清自己是什么时候被袭击的，也不太记得自己是从哪儿来的，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:25908
    old "Of course, Erina and Isla have been here the whole time, {tip=clash}but not you{/tip}."
    new "当然，Erina 和 Isla 倒是一直都在，{tip=clash}可你不是{/tip}。"

    # game/script.rpy:25913
    old "It was settled. They had either gone completely insane or their plan was to make us go insane. After being told once again that Shiroya's fate was sealed, I continued to search for a method to refute it."
    new "结论已经很明显了。他们要么是彻底疯了，要么就是想逼我们发疯。Shiroya 的命运再一次被宣判为定局，而我继续寻找着推翻它的方法。"

    # game/script.rpy:25919
    old "...{w}Oh...!"
    new "……{w}啊……！"

    # game/script.rpy:25921
    old "I turned to look at her, but I couldn't make heads or tails of her expression. Her eyes fixed on a point in the distance, and that was all I knew. It had become a challenge just to know what anyone trapped in the tower was thinking."
    new "我转头看向她，却完全看不透她的神情。她的目光定在远处的某一点上——除此之外，我一无所知。到了这一步，哪怕只是想弄清困在这座塔里的某个人在想着什么，都成了难事。"

    # game/script.rpy:25922
    old "...Did you notice something?"
    new "……你发现了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:25927
    old "...{w}I... need to go somewhere."
    new "……{w}我……得去个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:25933
    old "I'm sorry, I need to go to the attic."
    new "抱歉，我得去阁楼一趟。"

    # game/script.rpy:25938
    old "She ran toward hallway C. There I stood, petrified, until she turned around to say one last thing."
    new "她朝 C走廊奔去。我僵立在原地，直到她回过头来，说出最后一句话。"

    # game/script.rpy:25943
    old "Please, don't follow me."
    new "请你别跟来。"

    # game/script.rpy:25946
    old "I could only stare at her eyes, in search of any compassion. Why was she being so cryptic?"
    new "我只能盯着她的眼睛，想从中找到一丝怜悯。她为什么要把话说得这样隐晦？"

    # game/script.rpy:25949
    old "With an apologetic look, she spun and sprinted off."
    new "她带着歉意的神情转过身，飞奔而去。"

    # game/script.rpy:25953
    old "\"Please, don't follow me.\" Why...? Why did she want to go alone...?{w} I was sure I looked devastated, but I was only trying to decipher the sudden change of behavior my oldest friend had undergone."
    new "「请你别跟来。」为什么……？她为什么非要独自前往……？{w}我想自己当时一定显得失魂落魄，可我只是想弄明白，我认识最久的那位朋友为什么会突然变成这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:25962
    old "Wow. Are we going to just let her go? Didn't you see how suspicious that was?"
    new "哇哦。我们就这么放她走了？你没看出那有多可疑吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:25968
    old "Well, that's fine. She's just gonna get herself killed somehow. It's already unavoidable."
    new "算了，无所谓。反正她总会以某种方式把自己害死。这已经是躲不掉的了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25969
    old "Why!? Why is she gonna die!?"
    new "为什么！？她为什么会死！？"

    # game/script.rpy:25970
    old "Did you hit your head and lose your memories? We know it will happen."
    new "你是撞到头失忆了？这件事我们早就知道了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25971
    old "How!? You seem pretty certain, so prove it!"
    new "怎么知道的！？你说得这么肯定，那就拿出证据来！"

    # game/script.rpy:25972
    old "You know we can't anymore."
    new "你也知道，我们已经做不到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:25973
    old "What the fuck does that mean!?"
    new "这他妈是什么意思！？"

    # game/script.rpy:25976
    old "Akaro looked at me as if he was witnessing a man who'd gone mad."
    new "Akaro 看着我，像是在看一个发了疯的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:25977
    old "What's with that look!? Where did you even go!? You just appeared again, out of nowhere!"
    new "你那是什么眼神！？你到底去哪儿了！？你怎么又凭空冒出来了！"

    # game/script.rpy:25983
    old "Huh...? It's you who appeared again."
    new "咦……？这次冒出来的又是你。"

    # game/script.rpy:25985
    old "I hit the wall, furious. Their responses were making my blood boil, like they were sneering at me."
    new "我气得一拳砸在墙上。他们的回应让我火冒三丈，仿佛在嘲笑我。"

    # game/script.rpy:25986
    old "You too, Sai! Did your memories also happen to get fucked? You traveled from the event room. Remember that?"
    new "Sai，连你也一样！你的记忆也被搞乱了吗？你是从活动室穿越过来的，还记得吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:25991
    old "...From the event room? No, I don't."
    new "……从活动室？不，我不记得。"

    # game/script.rpy:25992
    old "Have you two just lost it completely? Or this is a side effect of the Sekimeiya?"
    new "你们两个是彻底疯了吗？还是说，这是 Sekimeiya 的副作用？"

    # game/script.rpy:25997
    old "You can stop trying already. Since you sided with that girl, you made it clear you'll only spit out bullshit. I don't know what you're trying to pull, but you look pathetic.{w} She'll come back whenever she feels like, if she doesn't die in the process. Meanwhile, let's keep waiting for the shutter to open. I'd appreciate it if you told the truth, though. How did she get in?"
    new "省省吧。你既然站在那女孩那边，就已经表明你只会满嘴胡扯。我不知道你想耍什么花样，但你看起来真可悲。{w}只要她没死在半路，想回来时自然会回来。在这之前，我们继续等卷帘门打开吧。不过，你要是肯说实话，我会很感激。她是怎么进来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:26000
    old "She was with us from the beginning..."
    new "她从一开始就跟我们在一起……"

    # game/script.rpy:26005
    old "That's false. Since she seems to be with you, I really doubt you were stupid enough to make her enter through the storeroom. That's what's strange, but perhaps you did.{w} Let me see."
    new "不对。她看起来是和你一起的，所以我实在不觉得你会蠢到让她从储藏室进来。奇怪的地方就在这里，不过也许你真这么做了。{w}让我看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:26009
    old "Indifferent to my confusion and rage, Sai walked to hallway C."
    new "Sai 毫不在意我的困惑和怒火，朝 C 走廊走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:26022
    old "Instead of answering, he entered the storeroom.{w} Seconds later, he returned."
    new "他没有回答，径直走进储藏室。{w}几秒后，又折了回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:26029
    old "I just wanted to verify that she hasn't entered through the storeroom yet."
    new "我只是想确认她还没有从储藏室进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:26035
    old "...Have you thought of a plan to keep the Sekimeiya for yourself? Then, once you succeed, you'll eventually make her go back in time to appear inside the tower and take care of whatever your plan requires."
    new "……你是不是想好了计划，要把 Sekimeiya 据为己有？然后等成功之后，再让她穿越回过去，出现在塔里，完成你计划中需要她做的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:26036
    old "What are you even talking about...?"
    new "你到底在说什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:26041
    old "Maybe two of you weren't enough, I don't know. Although if that's what you did, you had to know you were sending her to die, even if she was already supposed to be dead. I don't get exactly what your idea is or how this all came to happen. It's a damn mess."
    new "也许你们两个人还不够，我也说不准。不过，如果你真这么做了，你总该知道这是在送她去死——哪怕她本来就注定要死。我搞不懂你到底打的什么主意，也搞不懂这一切怎么会变成这样。真是一团乱麻。"

    # game/script.rpy:26042
    old "Again, what the fuck are you talking about? What does \"maybe two of you weren't enough\" even mean?"
    new "你又他妈在说什么？「也许你们两个还不够」到底是什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:26043
    old "Of course, I'm assuming Miiya's in on it as well."
    new "当然，我猜 Miiya 也有份。"

    # game/script.rpy:26049
    old "I gave up. I approached the nearest wall and kneeled next to it, only capable of breathing. It was incomprehensible. Nonsense."
    new "我彻底放弃了。我挪到最近的墙边跪下，除了呼吸，什么也做不了。这一切根本无法理解。简直荒唐透顶。"

    # game/script.rpy:26057
    old "Not gonna keep trying to clear your name? I suppose it'd be futile with how obvious it is that this is your doing."
    new "不打算继续证明清白了？事情明摆着是你干的，再挣扎也是白费。"

    # game/script.rpy:26060
    old "...Okay, I'll ask. How do you know about Miiya?"
    new "……好吧，我问一句。你怎么知道 Miiya 的事？"

    # game/script.rpy:26061
    old "What? She's been here—"
    new "什么？她一直就在这里——"

    # game/script.rpy:26062
    old "That's it, ignore him from now on. He can't get out of the corner he's backed himself into."
    new "行了，从现在起别理他。他已经把自己逼进死角，出不来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26066
    old "...I covered my eyes with my arm, applying as much pressure against my face as I could. Who had decided to make me go through hell, and why had Shiroya left me behind!?"
    new "我用胳膊遮住眼睛，尽可能用力把手臂压在脸上。到底是谁让我受这种罪，Shiroya 又为什么把我丢下！？"

    # game/script.rpy:26067
    old "Letting out a casual laugh, Sai sat next to me."
    new "Sai 轻笑一声，在我身旁坐下。"

    # game/script.rpy:26068
    old "Aren't you going to follow her? It seemed really obvious that you gave her some kind of cue to leave, you know?"
    new "你不打算跟上去吗？当时你明显给了她某种暗示让她离开，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26071
    old "She just got this blank look and suddenly had to go... Was that all you could come up with? I gave you a little bit of credit earlier, but honestly, what happened to Erina could definitely have been all you."
    new "她刚才一脸茫然，突然就非走不可……你就想出这种办法？我先前还高看过你一点，可说实话，Erina 的事完全可能都是你干的。"

    # game/script.rpy:26072
    old "I pushed Sai aside with as much force as I could gather. If my mind had already broken, he was doing all he could to scatter all the pieces around."
    new "我攒足力气，一把将 Sai 推开。若说我的理智已经支离破碎，那他就是在拼命把碎片撒得到处都是。"

    # game/script.rpy:26073
    old "That's harsh. I suppose that's the only way you can defend yourself. We'll see what your plan amounts to soon.{w} Maybe not, actually. Maybe we'll just never see that girl again. At least not alive, of course."
    new "真狠啊。看来你也只能用这种方式自保了。很快就能看出你的计划究竟能成什么气候。{w}不过，也许不会。也许我们再也不会见到那女孩了。当然，至少不会活着见到她。"

    # game/script.rpy:26074
    old "Sai, I swear if you open your mouth again, I'm going to fucking break it."
    new "Sai，我发誓，你再敢张嘴，我就把你的嘴打烂。"

    # game/script.rpy:26075
    old "I get it, I get it. Let's wait as much as you want."
    new "知道了，知道了。你想等多久，我们就等多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:26078
    old "My vision was dark, partly covered by my arm. Standing up were Akaro and Erina, whose expressions I couldn't see."
    new "我的视野一片昏暗，有一部分被手臂遮住。Akaro 和 Erina 站在那儿，我看不清他们的表情。"

    # game/script.rpy:26079
    old "Beyond the meaning behind Sai's words and Akaro's appearance, I couldn't get my thoughts off Shiroya. Why had she left like that?"
    new "我顾不上细想 Sai 话里的意思和 Akaro 的出现，满脑子都是 Shiroya。她为什么要那样离开？"

    # game/script.rpy:26080
    old "She hadn't even promised me she'd return. I tried not to let Sai's voice loop in my head, but there was no stopping it."
    new "她甚至没有答应过我会回来。我努力不让 Sai 的声音在脑中盘旋，却根本拦不住。"

    # game/script.rpy:26081
    old "Was she going to die...? Would I write that note? ...No. Neither of those would happen."
    new "她会死吗……？那张字条会是我写的吗？……不。这两件事都不会发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:26082
    old "She wouldn't just leave like that if she thought there was a chance she would die. There had to be a good reason behind her actions."
    new "如果她觉得自己可能会死，就不会那么干脆地离开。她这么做一定有充分的理由。"

    # game/script.rpy:26086
    old "...Don't kill me, but hasn't it been a long time since she left? What do you think she's doing?"
    new "……先说好，别打我。她是不是已经走了挺久了？你觉得她现在在干嘛？"

    # game/script.rpy:26087
    old "Be quiet."
    new "闭嘴。"

    # game/script.rpy:26088
    old "Listen, she looked at me as well when she said not to follow her, so I'm being considerate by staying behind. I was just wondering if you had any idea."
    new "听我说，她说不许跟上去的时候也看了我一眼，所以我留在这里已经算很体贴了。我只是想知道你有没有什么头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:26091
    old "Sai was the least of my concerns. I barely put any thought into punching him, but before I did, I saw a conspicuous smile all over his face. It only faded momentarily, returning right after the blow."
    new "我当时最顾不上的人就是 Sai。我几乎没多想就朝他挥拳，但在动手之前，我看见他脸上挂着一个刺眼的笑容。那笑容只消失了一瞬，挨了我一拳后又立刻回到脸上。"

    # game/script.rpy:26094
    old "He didn't say anything, but he positioned himself back at my side. While I couldn't see him, his mere presence felt disgusting."
    new "他什么也没说，却又站回我身旁。虽然看不见他，但光是他在旁边就让我恶心。"

    # game/script.rpy:26097
    old "Not a single part left of me felt able to continue reasoning out what was happening. All I knew was that the last travel had been different and somehow led to Sai's behavior, with him being the only affected person."
    new "我已经没有半点心力再去想眼前发生了什么。我只知道，上一次穿越有些不同，而 Sai 的态度变化多半和这有关——受影响的人只有他一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:26098
    old "But even though I felt stuck, I couldn't stop time from ticking. Every second I spent sheltering myself from reality was another one I spent thinking that Shiroya might never come back."
    new "可就算我动弹不得，时间也不会停下。我每逃避现实一秒，心里的念头就多一分：Shiroya 也许再也不会回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26100
    old "Eventually, my attempts at calming down bore some fruit. Up until then, she and I had been making our way through the day together. The version of her that had just gone upstairs had experienced things I wasn't aware of, so she'd known that following along would've been a bad idea."
    new "总算，我让自己冷静下来的努力有了些效果。在那之前，我和她一直是一起度过这一天的。刚才上楼的那个她，经历过一些我并不知情的事，所以她清楚，再继续跟上去不会是什么好主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:26101
    old "However, what could she have gone to do, and why had she not explained it even vaguely? She simply left."
    new "可她究竟去做什么了？为什么连一句含糊的解释都没有？她就那样走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26102
    old "...She'd gone to the attic. The Sekimeiya was in the event room, so what could she have wanted to do up there?"
    new "……她去了阁楼。Sekimeiya 在活动室，那她上楼到底想做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:26105
    old "Do you remember anything else, Erina?"
    new "Erina，你还记得别的什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26106
    old "...I don't think so."
    new "……我想没有了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26107
    old "I think I might have an idea about who attacked you now."
    new "我大概知道是谁袭击你了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26109
    old "I wouldn't wanna get killed, though. Atsuki, sorry to bother you, but who do you think it was?"
    new "不过我可不打算把命搭进去。Atsuki，不好意思麻烦你，你觉得会是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:26110
    old "...{w}I don't know."
    new "……{w}我不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:26111
    old "...Not even the slightest idea?"
    new "……一点头绪都没有？"

    # game/script.rpy:26112
    old "What, are you going to say it was Shiroya?"
    new "怎么，你该不会想说是 Shiroya 吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:26113
    old "I would never say that. However, she's the most likely suspect, isn't she?"
    new "我可不会那么说。不过，她的嫌疑确实最大，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26114
    old "She isn't! Why the fuck is he saying that?"
    new "她才不是！他妈的，凭什么这么说？"

    # game/script.rpy:26115
    old "Because \"she could've traveled to the past and done it\"? That's bullshit! How is she more suspicious than anyone else?"
    new "就因为「她可能穿越回过去下了手」？胡说八道！她凭什么比别人更可疑？"

    # game/script.rpy:26118
    old "Hey, I know it could've been anyone, but it'd be a bit strange if it wasn't her. Although I only assumed you weren't guilty because I thought you wouldn't be so stupid."
    new "喂，我知道谁都可能下手，但如果不是她，反倒有些奇怪。至于我为什么认定你无罪——只是觉得你不至于蠢到那种地步。"

    # game/script.rpy:26119
    old "Does that make sense? I don't think she could've attacked her."
    new "这说得通吗？我不认为她会去袭击人。"

    # game/script.rpy:26120
    old "I do. After all, aren't you basing that on what Atsuki said?"
    new "我觉得说得通。说到底，你这判断不也是听 Atsuki 说的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26122
    old "Wait, you're right... Atsuki, tell me the truth. Was that what you did?"
    new "等等，你说得对……Atsuki，跟我说实话。你当时真的做了那种事？"

    # game/script.rpy:26123
    old "Shut the fuck up! I didn't do anything!"
    new "少他妈胡说！我什么都没干！"

    # game/script.rpy:26124
    old "Erina, I have a question. Did you kill Shiroya? That would explain almost everything."
    new "Erina，我有个问题。是你杀了 Shiroya 吗？那样的话，几乎所有事都能解释得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26125
    old "N-No...! Of course not...!"
    new "不、不是……！当然不是……！"

    # game/script.rpy:26126
    old "Right. I wonder... could this have worked...?"
    new "也对。我在想……这么做会不会行得通……？"

    # game/script.rpy:26129
    old "Every time I heard him, I repeated a mantra: listening to him was pointless. Not a single thing he was saying made any sense or had any value."
    new "每次听到他开口，我都在心里默念同一句话：听他说下去毫无意义。他说的每一句话都没道理，也没价值。"

    # game/script.rpy:26130
    old "Earlier, he'd tried to kill us but refused to tell us why. After undergoing a sudden change, he was acting aggressive toward me again... Was it only because he'd seen Shiroya, who he didn't remember or thought couldn't be alive?"
    new "先前他想杀我们，却不肯说明理由。经历那场突变之后，他又开始对我咄咄逼人……难道只是因为看见了 Shiroya——一个他毫无印象、甚至认为不可能活着的人？"

    # game/script.rpy:26131
    old "What about Akaro, who hadn't been anywhere for hours? What were they talking about regarding Erina? And how in the hell did they know about Miiya? Had the Sekimeiya just created an absurd clash of events and memories?"
    new "还有 Akaro 呢？他好几个小时都不见踪影。他们谈到 Erina 时究竟在说什么？又到底怎么会知道 Miiya 的事？难道是 Sekimeiya 把事件与记忆胡乱搅成了一团？"

    # game/script.rpy:26132
    old "I wanted to know what had happened to Shiroya and everyone in the tower. Sai's behavior toward me was light years different from how he'd treated me at the beginning, but he'd always operated logically. I wanted to know what had caused the immense change, but arguing with him was impossible."
    new "我想知道 Shiroya 和塔里所有人究竟遭遇了什么。Sai 如今对我的态度，与他最初待我时判若两人，可他做事一向合乎逻辑。我想弄清是什么造成了如此巨大的转变，却根本没法和他争辩。"

    # game/script.rpy:26133
    old "There were too many things I needed to understand. Questions had barraged me since {time=9}, and each one was more complex than the last. With the little time we had left, there was no way I could be optimistic and think that everything was magically going to be resolved."
    new "需要弄明白的事太多了。自从{time=9}起，疑问就接二连三地压过来，而且一个比一个复杂。剩下的时间如此有限，我根本无法乐观地相信一切会奇迹般迎刃而解。"

    # game/script.rpy:26136
    old "What Shiroya and I had gotten ourselves caught up in was out of our league. So I tried to push everything that didn't directly involve us away and focused on what I most wanted to decipher."
    new "我和 Shiroya 卷进的这摊事，早已超出我们的能力范围。于是我把与自身无直接关联的一切暂且搁下，专心去想我最想解开的那一环。"

    # game/script.rpy:26137
    old "Shiroya had gone to the past with Sai, probably about twenty minutes. However, an extra version of her had already been in the tower for much longer—since I'd seen her in the event room."
    new "Shiroya 和 Sai 去了过去，大概二十分钟。然而另一个她早已在塔里待了更久——从我还在活动室看见她时算起。"

    # game/script.rpy:26138
    old "Despite not knowing what that Shiroya had lived through, it was reasonable to assume it happened in the attic, which was locked and beyond my view. As such, she'd realized she had to go there."
    new "我不知道那个 Shiroya 经历了什么，但可以合理推测，那些事发生在阁楼里——那里锁着，我看不到里面。正因如此，她才明白自己非去那里不可。"

    # game/script.rpy:26141
    old "Wait... I'm not sure if this is strange, but it could be important."
    new "等等……我不确定这算不算奇怪，但也许很重要。"

    # game/script.rpy:26142
    old "\"Please, don't follow me.\""
    new "「求你了，别跟过来。」"

    # game/script.rpy:26143
    old "Yes, like Sai said, she directed that at everyone, but she was specifically looking at me. She didn't want me to follow her."
    new "嗯，就像 Sai 说的，那句话是对所有人说的，可她当时偏偏看着我。她不想我跟着她。"

    # game/script.rpy:26144
    old "However, how would I?"
    new "可我又怎么可能跟得过去？"

    # game/script.rpy:26145
    old "I can't enter the attic; she would have the key, if anyone."
    new "我进不了阁楼；要说谁有钥匙，那也只能是她。"

    # game/script.rpy:26146
    old "The way she looked at me... It was like she was telling me that if I followed her, I would hinder whatever she wanted to do.{w} But she was already in hallway C. If she really wanted me not to come along, all she had to do was use the elevator up to the attic and I'd have no way to chase her."
    new "她看我的眼神……像是在告诉我，如果我跟上去，就会妨碍她想做的事。{w}可她已经到了 C走廊。如果她真不想我跟着，只要乘电梯上阁楼，我根本没法追上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:26147
    old "So what does that mean? She thought I could've followed her to the attic if I'd just run behind her... That's the impression I get."
    new "那这又意味着什么？她觉得只要我追在她身后跑，就能一路跟到阁楼……我觉得她就是这个意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:26148
    old "If I'm right, that means I can enter the attic and she doesn't have the key for it. And somehow, she knew it was unlocked when I know it wasn't just minutes ago."
    new "如果我没猜错，这就说明我能进阁楼，而她手里没有钥匙。而且不知怎的，她知道阁楼没锁——可就在几分钟前，我明明还知道它是锁着的。"

    # game/script.rpy:26152
    old "...I'm sorry, but I can't keep staying here. Shiroya, maybe you've already accomplished what you wanted to do and I won't find you up there, but I need to find out what happened."
    new "……抱歉，我不能再留在这里了。Shiroya，也许你已经做完了想做的事，我上去也找不到你，但我必须弄清楚发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:26156
    old "What time is it?"
    new "现在几点？"

    # game/script.rpy:26157
    old "Is this all the time you needed to give her?{w} Let me see... It's {time=19:08.}"
    new "你给她留的时间就这么点？{w}我看看……现在是{time=19:08.}"

    # game/script.rpy:26159
    old "Time was moving quickly. The shutter would retract in an hour and a half, so I the only thing I could shoot for was being with Shiroya when it happened."
    new "时间过得飞快。一个半小时后卷帘门就会收起，我唯一能指望的，就是在那一刻陪在 Shiroya 身边。"

    # game/script.rpy:26160
    old "If you plan to go to the attic, don't think we'll let you go alone."
    new "你要是打算去阁楼，就别以为我们会让你一个人去。"

    # game/script.rpy:26168
    old "I stood up, ignoring him. He didn't hesitate to stand too, and it seemed Akaro and Erina were getting closer."
    new "我没理他，径自站起身。他也毫不迟疑地站了起来，而 Akaro 和 Erina 似乎也正靠过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:26170
    old "Do you have the attic key?"
    new "你有阁楼的钥匙？"

    # game/script.rpy:26175
    old "What? Of course I don't. Just go to the sixth floor and enter it."
    new "什么？我当然没有。上六楼，直接进去就是了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26176
    old "The elevator arrived soon after I'd called it, revealing that it had still been on a higher floor. When I opened the door, the other three each took a step forward to get in."
    new "我按下呼叫键后，电梯很快就到了，看来它一直停在上面的楼层。我打开门时，另外三人各自向前迈了一步，想要进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:26180
    old "Sai, you are out of your mind if you think you're getting in the same elevator as me. Back off."
    new "Sai，你要是以为能跟我坐同一部电梯，那你是疯了。退后。"

    # game/script.rpy:26185
    old "Going to make me walk all the way up? Awfully rude of you."
    new "要让我一路爬上去？你可真是够无礼的。"

    # game/script.rpy:26186
    old "My glare extended to Akaro, who I also refused to be close to. I knew he could overpower me if he wanted to, but he'd reiterated the claim that Shiroya would die, so I'd fight him even if it was pointless. He shrugged and moved aside."
    new "我的目光又转向 Akaro——我也不愿与他靠得太近。我知道他若愿意，轻易就能制住我，可他反复断言 Shiroya 会死，所以我哪怕徒劳也要与他抗争。他耸了耸肩，退到一旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:26191
    old "...We'll see you there, then. Hopefully, we find her easily."
    new "……那就在上面见了。希望我们能顺利找到她。"

    # game/script.rpy:26196
    old "It's fine. We'll make sure she doesn't come back down the stairs. But if we can't find her, you're not going to get away with keeping quiet."
    new "没关系。我们会盯着，不让她再从楼梯下来。可要是我们找不到她，你可别指望一直闭口不言就能了事。"

    # game/script.rpy:26201
    old "I didn't look at Erina, as I had nothing against her. She entered beside me, looking just as lost as usual."
    new "我没有看 Erina，因为我对她并没有什么敌意。她在我身旁走进电梯，神情还是一如既往地茫然无措。"

    # game/script.rpy:26211
    old "When the door closed, I pressed the floor 6 button and waited for the elevator to begin moving."
    new "门合上后，我按下六楼的按钮，等着电梯启动。"

    # game/script.rpy:26216
    old "We'd arrive faster than the other two, but I wasn't sure if we were going to find anything. Sai had mentioned that the attic's door would be open, so he might've been the one to leave it like that, assuming I could actually trust anything he said."
    new "我们会比那两人先到，但是否能找到什么，我心里没底。Sai 说过阁楼的门会开着；如果他的话可信，那门多半就是他特意留的。"

    # game/script.rpy:26217
    old "Erina was at my side next to the buttons, while I was leaning back against the opposite side. Her existence likely had more mystery behind it than I knew, but it was no time to worry about it. For some reason, she had reined in her hostility toward me."
    new "Erina 站在我旁边，靠着按钮那一侧；我则背倚着对面的厢壁。她身上的谜团多半比我知道的还要多，可眼下不是追究的时候。不知为何，她收敛了对我的敌意。"

    # game/script.rpy:26221
    old "Even Landscape"
    new "风景亦如是"

    # game/script.rpy:26227
    old "Ah!{nw}"
    new "啊！{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:26230
    old "W—{nw}"
    new "什——{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:26242
    old "The elevator stopped abruptly."
    new "电梯骤然停住。"

    # game/script.rpy:26243
    old "It couldn't have been going too fast, but as it ceased all movement, it propelled us upward, and we slammed to the floor."
    new "它原本算不上快，可彻底停下的那一刻，却把我们向上抛起，随即重重摔在地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:26250
    old "I felt my right hand burning. I looked at it and saw a cut."
    new "右手火辣辣地疼。我低头一看，手上多了一道口子。"

    # game/script.rpy:26251
    old "What!? You're bleeding!"
    new "什么！？你在流血！"

    # game/script.rpy:26253
    old "I could only process the intense pain coming from the wound. While I couldn't comprehend how it had happened, I understood that I had cut my hand with the handrail when our bodies lifted, as it had been right above me."
    new "我只能感觉到伤口传来的剧痛。怎么弄的，我一时想不明白，只记得身体被抛起来时，手正好撞在上方的扶手上，被划开了一道口子。"

    # game/script.rpy:26254
    old "Blood poured out and pain poured in equally. Overwhelmed, Erina tried to open the door."
    new "血往外涌，疼痛往里钻。Erina 慌了神，伸手去开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:26263
    old "What? We stopped on the third floor."
    new "怎么回事？电梯停在三楼了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26264
    old "I'd experienced that situation once already. Had we been intercepted again? The vast amount of blood leaving my body prevented me from thinking about it, and instead, I started to feel disoriented."
    new "这种情形我已经经历过一次。又被人截住了吗？大量失血让我无法细想，只觉得眼前开始发晕。"

    # game/script.rpy:26265
    old "Nobody's here! I... didn't press the button either!{w} We need to... stop the bleeding. We could use something from the attic!"
    new "这里没人！我……我也没按过按钮！{w}我们得先……止血。阁楼里应该有能用的东西！"

    # game/script.rpy:26266
    old "No way... It hurts so much... Fuck!"
    new "不会吧……好疼……该死！"

    # game/script.rpy:26267
    old "It wasn't too deep of a wound, but the bleeding would take a while to stop. I wouldn't pass out from it, so all I could think about was the intense pain."
    new "伤口不算深，可一时半会儿止不住血。这点血不至于让我昏过去，于是我满脑子只剩下那股剧痛。"

    # game/script.rpy:26268
    old "However, the one thought that came to me was what I needed. I had to get rid of the wound. It hurt way too much to spend the entire remaining time without medical assistance, and I needed to have a clear mind."
    new "然而，我想到的那个念头，正是我需要的。我必须让这道伤消失。这伤疼得厉害，要是一直得不到处理，剩下这段时间我根本熬不过去；而且我必须保持头脑清醒。"

    # game/script.rpy:26269
    old "I could accomplish that. I only had to travel back in time."
    new "我办得到。只要回到过去就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:26275
    old "Perhaps the pain blinded me, but without a second thought, I yanked the door inward and pressed the button to go back to the first floor."
    new "也许是疼痛冲昏了头，我想也没想，一把将门拉开，按下回一楼的按钮。"

    # game/script.rpy:26276
    old "What are you—"
    new "你要干——"

    # game/script.rpy:26281
    old "Her voice cut off, and I began to descend. It was fine; I'd only take a detour. After I got rid of the ridiculous pain that wouldn't let me think properly for a long time to come, I'd go up to find Shiroya. I could even go earlier."
    new "她的声音戛然而止，电梯开始下降。没关系，只是多绕一段路。等我把这疼得离谱、让我往后好长时间都没法好好思考的伤解决掉，再上去找 Shiroya 就行。说不定还能提前到。"

    # game/script.rpy:26282
    old "The single requirement was the Sekimeiya. I had to activate it and replicate an earlier position of myself without the wound, retrieving all of my lost blood in the process. I had to do it quickly so that there wouldn't be many possible locations to replicate after the wound."
    new "唯一的条件是 Sekimeiya。我必须启动它，把自己复制回受伤之前的位置，顺带把流失的血全部取回。而且必须尽快动手，免得受伤之后可供复制的位置越积越多。"

    # game/script.rpy:26285
    old "The doors opened, so I dashed out of the elevator as fast as I could, forcing my {tip=eyes}eyes shut{/tip} to suppress the pain."
    new "门一开，我便拼尽全力冲出电梯，{tip=eyes}闭上眼{/tip}强忍疼痛。"

    # game/script.rpy:26289
    old "I ran to the event room, a fair amount of blood dripping off my hand. I knew I'd have to wait a few minutes to activate it, but that was necessary. However, since I clearly didn't know much about how the replicated location operated, I could only hope it would actually work."
    new "我跑向活动室，手上的血一路滴落。我知道还得等上几分钟才能启动，但这一步省不得。只是我对复制位置的运作几乎一无所知，只能祈祷它真的管用。"

    # game/script.rpy:26295
    old "I felt the room was a bit colder than before... I uncovered the curtain."
    new "房间里似乎比先前冷了些……我掀开了遮布。"

    # game/script.rpy:26302
    old "...Why?"
    new "……为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:26304
    old "It wasn't there. Behind the glass, there was only a crimson cushion, and the glass {tip=cold2}wasn't fully shut{/tip}, which cooled my face while I stared in denial."
    new "它不在。玻璃后只剩一块深红色的垫子，玻璃{tip=cold2}没有完全合拢{/tip}，凉意拂在脸上，我却仍死死盯着，不肯相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:26305
    old "...Fuck! Do I have to search for it? Sai, Akaro, even Shiroya... they all could've taken it!"
    new "……该死！难道还得自己去找？Sai、Akaro，甚至连 Shiroya……谁都有可能把它拿走！"

    # game/script.rpy:26306
    old "It was all right... I tried to tell myself. I would've had to wait a few minutes before activating the Sekimeiya anyway. Since someone had removed it from the cabinet for me, I'd just have to spend that time searching for it, as it was already storing energy."
    new "没事的……我试着安慰自己。反正启动 Sekimeiya 之前也得等上几分钟。既然有人替我从展示柜里把它取了出来，我只要用这段时间去找它就行——它已经在蓄能了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26307
    old "But desperately searching by myself sounded overwhelming. I wouldn't stop losing blood any time soon, making me more and more tired. The pain wasn't going to suddenly fade, and there was no way I would be able to tolerate it until {time=21} on top of everything else."
    new "可要独自一人拼命寻找，光是想想就让人吃不消。血一时止不住，我只会越来越疲惫。疼痛也不会忽然消退，何况我还得一直忍到 {time=21}，这根本不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:26312
    old "I closed the glass and nervously stepped into hallway B, where I still found no trace of anyone. Slowly, I'd begun to perceive two things."
    new "我合上玻璃，忐忑地走进 B走廊，那里依旧不见半个人影。渐渐地，我意识到两件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:26314
    old "The strange smell felt {tip=smell2}very strong and prominent{/tip}. I wasn't sure that meant anything—I still didn't know where it was coming from or what it signified. However, it felt more noticeable than it had on previous occasions."
    new "那股怪味{tip=smell2}格外浓烈，很难忽视{/tip}。这究竟意味着什么，我也说不准——它的来源和含义我至今不明。只是比起先前几次，它明显得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:26317
    old "The second thing was a thought.{w} I knew I looked just like Erina had previously, so I found myself suddenly coming back to something she'd recently said."
    new "第二件是一个念头。{w}我知道自己此刻的样子和之前的 Erina 一模一样，于是忽然想起她前不久说过的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:26318
    old "\"That's nonsense! I'm going to the past, so I'll prevent Isla from dying.\" She had completely refused Sai's claim that the past couldn't be changed."
    new "「胡说！我就是要回到过去，阻止 Isla 死去。」Sai 说过去无法改变，她当时断然不信。"

    # game/script.rpy:26319
    old "My mind might've been clouded, but I started to doubt my past conclusions, feeling that Erina's words could hold some weight. I wanted to go to the past, so what if I changed it?"
    new "也许我的脑子已经不清醒了，但我开始怀疑自己从前的结论，觉得 Erina 的话未必没有道理。我想回到过去，那么，改变它又如何？"

    # game/script.rpy:26320
    old "Would the universe really not allow it? I had been working under that assumption, but that concept had begun to feel nonsensical to me. If I actively wanted to change the past, there was no way I couldn't do it, and I didn't particularly mind trying it."
    new "宇宙真的会不允许吗？我一直以此为前提行事，可这个说法如今想来却荒谬至极。若我真心想改变过去，就不可能做不到；试一试，我也不觉得有什么不妥。"

    # game/script.rpy:26325
    old "I entered the cleaning room and scanned it with my eyes. ...How would the universe stop me from changing what had been decided? I wanted to find out."
    new "我走进清洁间，四下扫视。……宇宙究竟会如何阻止我改变既定之事？我想亲眼看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:26329
    old "Many things around me pointed at the fact that Shiroya would die at one point, and even though she was alive, she had purposely left me in the dark. If I could deviate from that reality, I would. Fortunately, finding out if it was possible appeared to be fairly easy."
    new "我身边的许多迹象都指向一点：Shiroya 终有一死；她明明还活着，却有意把我蒙在鼓里。若我能偏离那个现实，我绝不会犹豫。所幸，要弄清这是否可行，似乎并不难。"

    # game/script.rpy:26334
    old "I looked at the crystal room B6, but the sheer number of cabinets was dizzying. I didn't have the strength to inspect all of them, so I backed off toward the staff room."
    new "我望向水晶展室 B6，可展示柜多得让人眼花。我没力气一一查看，只好退向员工室。"

    # game/script.rpy:26337
    old "When my mentality hadn't been to alter the past, everything had automatically played out as I'd once lived it. I wanted to see what would happen if I consciously attempted to alter the past through my actions."
    new "我没有改变过去的念头时，一切都自动按照我经历过的样子重演。我想看看，若我有意用自己的行动去改变过去，会发生什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:26338
    old "I'd already tried it once, but how could Sai's and Akaro's words make any sense? Weren't their realities completely different from mine? Had they traveled in time and altered the events they remembered? Was that why the effect had only worked on them while the reality I knew was completely different from theirs?"
    new "我已经试过一次了。可 Sai 和 Akaro 的说法又怎么解释得通？他们所经历的现实，难道与我的完全不同？会不会是他们自己穿越了时间，改变了自己记忆中的事件？难道这就是那效果只在他们身上生效、而我所知的现实与他们截然不同的原因？"

    # game/script.rpy:26339
    old "I couldn't tell if I was deluding myself or somehow not making sense, but I felt like I must've been able to change the past and that it had happened to other people while we'd coexisted in a single timeline. If nothing of consequence could come out of time travel, what was the point of it anyway?"
    new "我分不清自己是在自欺欺人，还是逻辑上哪里出了错。可我总觉得，过去一定可以被改变，而且就在我们共存于同一条时间线时，那样的事已经在别人身上发生过。若时间穿越带不来任何结果，那它又有什么意义？"

    # game/script.rpy:26340
    old "Perhaps it would complicate it all even further, throwing everything into even more disarray. But why would I care about that? I'd be able to change things anyway if that were the case. Not attempting it was stupid."
    new "也许这会让一切更复杂，把局面搅得更乱。可我又何必在乎？若真如此，我照样能改变事情。连试都不试，才是愚蠢。"

    # game/script.rpy:26345
    old "I could only open two lockers, so the task was far more bearable than checking inside every cabinet. I was already staggering, so I had very little hope of finding the Sekimeiya before I couldn't continue."
    new "我能打开的储物柜只有两个，比起逐个翻查展示柜，这差事轻松多了。我走路都已开始摇晃，能在撑不住之前找到 Sekimeiya 的希望实在渺茫。"

    # game/script.rpy:26348
    old "I opened Naomi's locker, but the Sekimeiya wasn't inside."
    new "我打开 Naomi 的储物柜，里面没有 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:26351
    old "The other one was locked, so I took out the key and unlocked it."
    new "另一个锁着，我便取出钥匙打开了锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:26356
    old "In the top compartment was the Sekimeiya."
    new "最上面一格里放着 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:26357
    old "I didn't care how strange that was. Had it teleported back? How could I know? I only wanted to use it so that I could think straight once again. As I was holding the key with my left hand, I extended my right one, mixing the pain of the wound with a burn that made my sight warp."
    new "它出现在这里有多么蹊跷，我已无心深究。是传送回来了吗？我又怎么会知道？我只想借它的力量，让自己的头脑重新清醒过来。我左手握着钥匙，伸出右手，伤口被牵动的剧痛与一阵灼烧感交织在一起，视线都随之扭曲。"

    # game/script.rpy:26364
    old "I was at the start of hallway B, looking toward C."
    new "我站在 B走廊的入口，望向 C走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:26367
    old "I stared at my hand."
    new "我盯着自己的手。"

    # game/script.rpy:26369
    old "The wound was still there, but next to no blood was pouring out of it, and it didn't hurt as much. I saw the scar that it had left, which would likely persist for many days. Furthermore, {tip=tired}I felt very tired{/tip}, but my mind was clearer."
    new "伤口还在，却几乎不再流血，疼痛也减轻了许多。它已经留下了一道疤，看样子会伴随我好些天。此外，{tip=tired}我感到极度疲惫{/tip}，头脑却比先前清醒。"

    # game/script.rpy:26371
    old "How's this possible? Why do I still have the wound...?"
    new "怎么可能？伤口为什么还在……？"

    # game/script.rpy:26372
    old "What time even is it?"
    new "现在到底是什么时候了？"

    # game/script.rpy:26379
    old "I began to walk toward the event room to check the time, but voices stopped me."
    new "我动身朝活动室走去，想确认时间，却被说话声拦住了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:26380
    old "I got close to the door and focused my hearing."
    new "我凑近门边，凝神细听。"

    # game/script.rpy:26384
    old "...just suddenly ran aw— ...honestly wasn't sure."
    new "「……就突然跑掉——……说实话，我也不确定。」"

    # game/script.rpy:26386
    old "I recognized the conversation. I'd arrived approximately a couple minutes before the point only Sai had traveled."
    new "我认出了这段对话。我抵达的时间，大约比只有 Sai 穿越到过的那个时间点早两分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:26388
    old "...to interpret thi— ...Did you all—"
    new "「……来解释这——……你们大家是——」"

    # game/script.rpy:26401
    old "I retreated and went to hallway A through the lobby."
    new "我悄悄退开，穿过大堂去了 A走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:26407
    old "The computer screens were still lit, so I walked up to them to check the exact time, trying to avoid the blood on the floor."
    new "电脑屏幕还亮着，我便走上前查看准确时间，同时小心避开地板上的血迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:26413
    old "{time=18:54}, precisely what I'd estimated. For a short time, at least, I could try to experiment and gain some form of knowledge, no matter how small. Feeling like I could trust my judgment a bit better than before, I stepped out and went over what I'd been thinking."
    new "{time=18:54}，与我的估算分毫不差。至少在这一小段时间里，我可以试着做些验证，获取些情报，哪怕再微不足道。我觉得自己比先前更能信任自己的判断了，于是走出门，重新梳理此前的想法。"

    # game/script.rpy:26420
    old "What if I open the door to the event room? It's completely in reach, and if I do it, I'll be changing the past..."
    new "要是我推开活动室的门呢？这完全做得到，而一旦做了，我就改变了过去……"

    # game/script.rpy:26421
    old "I was intrigued. I had to accept that nothing made sense to me. Given what I'd deduced, I shouldn't have kept the wound; I knew I was operating under numerous misconceptions. If I tried to change the past, the result had untold potential to point me in a more accurate direction."
    new "我来了兴致。我必须承认，眼下的一切我全然看不透。按我自己的推断，这道伤口本不该留下；可见我的认知里尽是谬误。若试着改变过去，结果说不定能为我指明更准确的方向。"

    # game/script.rpy:26422
    old "But it was scary. Did paradoxes exist? Would the world crumble if I changed what I'd already experienced?"
    new "可这也很可怕。悖论真的存在吗？若改动我已经历过的部分，世界会崩塌吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26423
    old "Maybe the universe was pressuring me into accepting what had been decided, but I didn't feel like the pressure was strong enough. I could make any change, and the only thing in my way was myself."
    new "也许宇宙正逼我接受既定的安排，可我觉得那份压力还不够强。任何改变我都做得出，唯一阻挡我的，只有我自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:26424
    old "However, I didn't want to go too many steps up. Perhaps I could change the past if I really wanted to, but what if I altered my own past actions? I would never end up traveling, so thinking that my existence could be immediately overwritten wasn't an unfounded fear."
    new "不过，我不想把步子迈得太大。若我真想，也许就能改变过去——可要是改动了过去的自己所做的事呢？那我就不会穿越了。所以，担心自己的存在会立刻被改写，并非杞人忧天。"

    # game/script.rpy:26425
    old "How could I attempt to change the past while making sure that I could still end up traveling in the same way?"
    new "怎样才能在改变过去的同时，确保自己仍会以同样的方式穿越？"

    # game/script.rpy:26428
    old "In a few minutes, Sai will appear in hallway B from the lobby while Akaro will suddenly show up from hallway A through the event room. Preventing their arrivals could still be too big of a change that might deny my travel from occurring."
    new "几分钟后，Sai 会从大堂出现在 B走廊，而 Akaro 则会穿过活动室，从 A走廊突然现身。阻止他们出现，恐怕仍是过大的变动，可能让我的穿越无法发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:26430
    old "But the more I thought about it, the more I realized that I had nothing else to alter that I could be sure I had definitely changed."
    new "可越想越觉得，除此之外，我再找不到别的事情可改，也没有任何一件能让我确定自己真的改过。"

    # game/script.rpy:26431
    old "It was extremely reckless, but I wanted to try it nonetheless. I wanted to understand what had happened to Shiroya and the rest of us. And although it sounded dangerous in theory, I felt no risk in play. The thought of one of my harmless actions freezing or eradicating the universe simply didn't seem right."
    new "这举动极其鲁莽，可我还是想试一试。我想弄清 Shiroya 和我们其他人身上究竟发生了什么。理论上听着危险，我却没觉得真有风险。要说我某个无伤大雅的举动会让宇宙冻结、甚至毁灭，我实在无法认同。"

    # game/script.rpy:26432
    old "So, I had an idea: a sound.{w} To start off, I could produce a loud sound I knew I hadn't heard. If I managed to make it happen, the past could be changed."
    new "于是，我有了个主意：制造一声响动。{w} 一开始，我可以先弄出一声我确定自己从未听过的巨响。只要能做到，就说明过去可以被改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:26439
    old "I walked up to the storeroom so that I'd be able to flee. I still didn't want my past self to see me, as the chances of a paradox occurring would certainly increase if it happened, and the single thing I wanted to know was whether reality could be reshaped."
    new "我走到储藏室旁，以便能随时逃走。我仍不愿让过去的自己看见我——一旦发生，出现悖论的可能性必然大增。而我想弄清的只有一点：现实能否被重塑。"

    # game/script.rpy:26443
    old "I twisted the knob on the door and pushed it open. It was fully in my reach: I could slam the door and generate a considerably loud sound that hadn't previously existed.{w} Was the universe about to black out? I'd shortly find out, as I really intended to do it."
    new "我拧开门把，推开门。这完全做得到：只要摔上门，就能造出一声此前从未有过的巨响。{w} 宇宙会就此陷入黑暗吗？很快便见分晓——我真的打算这么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:26444
    old "I was using my left hand since the right one still hurt. Perhaps the impact wouldn't be as strong, but there was no way it wouldn't be heard throughout the entire floor."
    new "我右手还疼，只能用左手。这一摔力道或许不够大，但整层楼绝不可能听不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:26445
    old "I remembered Sai's words in the event room: \"the past can't be changed\". He'd gotten to the same conclusion I had earlier, but had he tried it himself? There was no way to be certain without attempting it."
    new "我想起 Sai 在活动室里说过的话：「过去无法改变。」那正是我先前得出的结论。可他自己试过吗？不亲自动手，就无从确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:26448
    old "Am I making too big of a deal about this? I'm just going to make a sound..."
    new "我是不是把事情想得太严重了？不过是弄出点声响而已……"

    # game/script.rpy:26449
    old "I was hesitating. Was it the universe's prediction... that no sound would be heard?"
    new "我竟然在犹豫。难道是宇宙的预知……断定不会有任何声音响起？"

    # game/script.rpy:26450
    old "Feeling controlled, I moved my arm without thinking."
    new "我感到自己被人操控着，手臂不假思索地动了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:26456
    old "There... That's it! This is a new noise! One that we didn't hear."
    new "来了……成了！这是一声从未有过的响动！是我们当时没听见的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:26459
    old "I had to run away. The world hadn't frozen, and I was still alive. However, all that meant was that my existence was not a paradox. Letting my past self see me had an inherent problem: he'd know he'd end up traveling and doing what he'd seen, canceling out the freedom of my own actions."
    new "我得逃走。世界没有冻结，我也还活着。但这只能说明，我的存在不构成悖论。让过去的我看见我，本身就有个问题：他会知道自己终将穿越，并做出他亲眼所见之事——我行动的自由也就随之消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26460
    old "...However, that wasn't necessarily the case anymore, as the past version that could see me wouldn't be the same me anymore. He would be one who heard a sound I'd never experienced, so he might not have ended up traveling like I had."
    new "……不过，如今未必还是这样了。能看见我的那个过去的我，已经不再是我。他成了听过一声我从未听过的响动的人，因此未必会像我一样穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:26465
    old "I ran toward the stairs and quickly disappeared from view. I hadn't edited my memories at all. I still remembered the reality in which no sound had played.{w} It was a potentially massive problem; I could've created a reality in which two versions of myself existed permanently. If I'd separated myself from my past version who was on the crystal floor, he wouldn't ever travel and leave his place for me to occupy like what had been happening so far."
    new "我朝楼梯跑去，转眼便脱离了视线。我的记忆丝毫未变。我依然记得那个没有响起任何声音的现实。{w} 这或许是个大问题：我可能造出了一个两个我永久并存的现实。若我与留在水晶层的那个过去的我分开，他就永远不会穿越，也不会像至今这样腾出位置让我顶替。"

    # game/script.rpy:26471
    old "To understand every consequence, I'd have to wait. However, I'd already learned the most important piece of information: the past could be changed if I wanted it to. On the other hand, nothing would differ unless I intended it to."
    new "要弄清所有后果，只能等。但我已经掌握了最关键的一条情报：只要我愿意，过去就能被改变。反过来说，若非出于我的本意，什么都不会有所不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:26473
    old "I felt a piercing pain and looked at my hand. Running with clenched fists had slightly reopened the wound, and a small amount of blood was dribbling out. If I'd left some behind, it would create a trail to find my whereabouts.{w} I looked at the staircase and saw very little blood."
    new "一阵刺痛袭来，我看向自己的手。握着拳奔跑让伤口微微裂开，渗出些许血来。若一路滴落，便会留下追查我下落的血痕。{w} 我回望楼梯，只看到很少的血迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:26474
    old "The stronger pain was coming back, so I had to cover the wound. I couldn't go back down and use a curtain, and I didn't necessarily want to dirty the clothes in the attic. Instead, I entered the bathroom at my side, figuring a few strips of toilet paper would be enough."
    new "剧痛又涌了上来，我得把伤口包起来。总不能下楼去扯遮布，我也不太想弄脏阁楼里的衣服。于是我进了旁边的洗手间，想着几条厕纸应该足够。"

    # game/script.rpy:26481
    old "Toilet paper was far from appropriate or hygienic to cover wounds, but I had to use what I had at my disposal. I kept adding layers until no more blood could be seen. It took a while, but I managed to make it work."
    new "用厕纸包扎伤口，既不合宜也不卫生，可我手头只有这些。我一层层地裹上去，直到再看不见血迹。费了些工夫，总算勉强应付过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:26482
    old "I should probably stay here. I don't know if the sound I made was enough to cause a search on the crystal floor, but if it was, they'll find me no matter where I go. ...Hopefully, it didn't trigger one."
    new "我大概该留在这里。我不知道自己弄出的声响会不会引来对水晶层的搜查，但若真招来了，我躲到哪里都会被找到。……但愿没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:26483
    old "However, it's possible Shiroya will still suddenly go up, so if I pay attention, I'll hear her whether she uses the elevator or goes on foot."
    new "不过，Shiroya 仍有可能突然上楼。只要留心，无论她坐电梯还是走楼梯，我都能听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:26484
    old "I'm not sure I want to stop her, but I want to know what she went to do..."
    new "我不确定自己是否想拦住她，但我想知道她上去做什么……"

    # game/script.rpy:26486
    old "I waited after sitting down and slightly opening the door. It wasn't open enough to see outside, but I hoped I would hear footsteps through the gap."
    new "我坐下，把门稍微推开一条缝，静静等着。缝不够大，看不到外面，但我盼着能从那道缝隙里听见脚步声。"

    # game/script.rpy:26489
    old "I put my hand in my pocket. I wanted to get rid of the note through the toilet."
    new "我把手伸进口袋。我想把那张纸条用马桶冲掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:26491
    old "Strangely, I couldn't find it. It wasn't there, but I hadn't gotten rid of it."
    new "奇怪的是，我找不到它。口袋里没有，可我并没有把它丢掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:26492
    old "I checked all my pockets, but the note was gone."
    new "我把所有口袋都翻了一遍，纸条却不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26493
    old "I didn't drop it anywhere, did I? That must mean I didn't appear with it when I traveled."
    new "我没有把它掉在什么地方吧？也就是说，我穿越时，它并没有和我一起出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:26494
    old "Why, though? It was so strange. At least it had dematerialized for good, I supposed."
    new "可为什么呢？实在太奇怪了。至少它已经彻底消失了——我想是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:26498
    old "...Going off what I'd lived, Shiroya would be going upstairs in two to three minutes, but I had no guarantee that would repeat."
    new "……按我经历过的来看，再过两三分钟 Shiroya 就会上楼，但我无法保证这件事会重演。"

    # game/script.rpy:26501
    old "...It did not. Five minutes later, the elevator hadn't been used, and nobody had gone up or down the stairs. That was proof of my change."
    new "……但没有。五分钟过去，电梯没动过，楼梯上也没人上下。这就是我改变了过去的证据。"

    # game/script.rpy:26502
    old "I could change the past. I didn't blame myself for wrongly assuming the opposite for so long, but I'd proved that if I wanted to and was conscious of what I was doing, I could decide to alter history. To finally know with certainty was both terrifying and exhilarating."
    new "我能改变过去。长久以来我一直误以为相反，这也怨不得我；但我已经证明，只要自己愿意、并且清楚在做什么，我就能决定改写历史。终于能够确定这一点，既令人恐惧，又令人振奋。"

    # game/script.rpy:26503
    old "Less than two hours remained until {time=21.} The alarm had gone off at about {time=9:05}, and the automatic unlock was rapidly approaching. Was it enough time to try putting things into practice?{w} I still didn't know what consequences would truly come out of my change. Would I permanently have differing memories from the people around me? Would I have to coexist with another Atsuki?"
    new "距离 {time=21.} 还剩不到两个小时。警报大约在 {time=9:05} 响过，自动解锁的时刻正迅速逼近。这些时间够我试着付诸实践吗？{w}我仍不知道自己的改变究竟会带来什么后果。我会永远和身边的人拥有不同的记忆吗？我是否必须与另一个 Atsuki 共存？"

    # game/script.rpy:26504
    old "As soon as I found out, making use of time travel would become simple. Suddenly, I was presented with a dilemma."
    new "只要弄明白这一点，利用时间穿越就会变得轻而易举。突然间，我面前摆上了一道难题。"

    # game/script.rpy:26507
    old "Two hours remain until the front door presumably opens. In about thirty minutes is when I traveled to the past, but that might not happen anymore. This means that I could have the chance to let the Sekimeiya gather power until {time=21:05.}"
    new "距离前门开启大概还有两个小时。我穿越回过去，大约是在三十分钟后，但如今那件事或许不会再发生。也就是说，我或许有机会让 Sekimeiya 一直蓄能到 {time=21:05.}"

    # game/script.rpy:26508
    old "I'm not sure how far back I'd go. Leaving the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet for fifteen minutes resulted in twenty minutes traveled. Just now, I went back a little over forty, but I don't know how long the Sekimeiya was in the locker; it shouldn't have been there to begin with."
    new "我不确定自己会回到多早以前。让 Sekimeiya 离开展示柜十五分钟，换来的是二十分钟的穿越。刚才我回到了四十多分钟前，可我不知道 Sekimeiya 在储物柜里放了多久——它本来就不该在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:26509
    old "Meaning that I have no clue how much the distance traveled advances each minute out of the cabinet. If it goes at a consistent rate, two hours wouldn't make me travel incredibly far back. As it stands, I wouldn't appear two weeks ago."
    new "也就是说，我完全不知道它在展示柜外每多待一分钟，穿越的距离会增加多少。如果速率恒定，两个小时也不会让我回到太远的地方。照这样算，我不可能出现在两周前。"

    # game/script.rpy:26510
    old "But what if I did somehow? What if I could save Miiya this way and prevent that entire thing? Would another Atsuki get to live a carefree and ignorant life, unaware of today's events while I still had to exist?"
    new "可万一真能做到呢？万一我能用这个办法救下 Miiya，阻止那一切？会不会有另一个 Atsuki 过上无忧无虑、对今天的事毫不知情的日子，而我却还得继续存在下去？"

    # game/script.rpy:26513
    old "I had to understand how it worked before thinking of applications. If I did something like that, I'd leave behind everything. That included the note I'd found, Shiroya's strange behavior, and everything I'd been attempting to reason out. Of course, the result would more than justify it."
    new "我得先弄清它的原理，再谈怎么利用。真做出那种事，我就会抛下这里的一切——包括我找到的那张字条、Shiroya 古怪的举动，以及我一直试图理清的所有事情。当然，若真能成功，这一切都值得。"

    # game/script.rpy:26514
    old "I went back to a distant thought. Could it be that the shutter wasn't going to move at {time=21} so that the Sekimeiya would store enough time to grant a lengthy travel?"
    new "我又想起了先前的一个念头。卷帘门在 {time=21} 时不会动，会不会就是为了让 Sekimeiya 积蓄足够的时间，从而换来一次长距离的穿越？"

    # game/script.rpy:26515
    old "How would that be accomplished? I was thinking about making the recording a reality just because I'd heard it, but I wouldn't complain about the origin of events if I could achieve it. However, I still understood too little about the Sekimeiya to consider anything like that. Could I know that waiting a month would be enough just because that was the time I'd heard in the recording?"
    new "那要怎样才能做到？我仅仅因为听过那段录音，就想着要让它成真；不过只要能实现，我也不会去追究事情的起因。可我对 Sekimeiya 的了解还太少，根本无从设想这种事。难道就因为录音里听到的是那个时间，我就能断定等上一个月就够了？"

    # game/script.rpy:26516
    old "I let go of that idea. To begin with, I had no way of prolonging our stay, and as I'd previously considered, we couldn't survive for that long without food. Despite my important discovery, the recording still made no sense."
    new "我放弃了这个念头。首先，我没办法延长我们停留的时间；而且正如之前想过的，没有食物，我们撑不了那么久。尽管有了重要发现，那段录音依然说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:26519
    old "In reality, not many things did. I could run through the day's events and find continuous unexplained mysteries. Had someone been changing reality around us, resulting in inconsistent memories and different pasts? That felt too unknowable to consider, and there was virtually no way to know if it had happened."
    new "事实上，说得通的事本来就不多。把今天发生的事过一遍，处处都是悬而未解的谜团。是不是有人一直在改变我们周遭的现实，才造成记忆对不上、过去各不相同？这个念头太过难以揣测，而且几乎没有办法确认它是否真的发生过。"

    # game/script.rpy:26520
    old "The replicated location, the self-teleportation of the Sekimeiya... There were many unknown factors needed to construct a sound plan that involved changing the past."
    new "被复制出来的地点、Sekimeiya 自行传送……要想制订一个涉及改变过去的周全计划，未知因素实在太多。"

    # game/script.rpy:26521
    old "...I kept waiting, as I wanted to surpass the point I'd traveled from."
    new "……我继续等着，因为我想越过自己出发穿越的那个时刻。"

    # game/script.rpy:26528
    old "Minutes later, I thought that going up was probably a good idea. Someone had to have intercepted our elevator trip on the third floor, and it was very possible my change downstairs hadn't influenced their actions at all. If I went up, maybe I would see them."
    new "几分钟后，我觉得上楼大概是个好主意。当初一定有人在三楼拦下了我们的电梯，而我在楼下做的改变很可能根本没影响到那人的行动。上去的话，也许就能见到对方。"

    # game/script.rpy:26529
    old "Blood had stopped coming out of my wound, so I removed the toilet paper and flushed it. The sensation was uncomfortable, but it no longer hurt much. I still wasn't sure how I'd managed to injure myself like that, but if I didn't make abrupt motions with my arm, I could tolerate it easily."
    new "伤口已经不再流血，我便把卫生纸取下来冲掉了。那感觉不太舒服，但已经不怎么疼。我仍不清楚自己怎么会伤成那样，不过只要手臂不做突然的动作，倒也不难忍受。"

    # game/script.rpy:26536
    old "I walked up to the third floor. There was nobody in sight, so it was best to hide."
    new "我走上三楼。四下不见人影，最好先躲起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:26537
    old "It was possible they would flee if they saw me—I needed to approach them when I knew they were close to the elevator."
    new "对方看到我，也许会逃走——我得等到确定他们靠近电梯时再上前。"

    # game/script.rpy:26543
    old "I entered the second partition, as I estimated a few minutes were left until the time we'd been intercepted."
    new "我进了第二个隔间，估计离我们被拦截的时间还剩几分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:26544
    old "I'd been in the lower bathroom for about twenty minutes, so I'd have to wait a little more. Unfortunately, since it was highly unlikely Erina and I would still take the elevator at the same time, I wouldn't have a way to know if I'd missed my target."
    new "我在楼下洗手间待了大约二十分钟，所以还得再等一会儿。可惜，我和 Erina 已经几乎不可能再同时乘坐电梯了，我也没法知道自己有没有错过目标。"

    # game/script.rpy:26547
    old "Once again, the silence gave no indication of the ticking seconds. I waited for minutes moving back and forth between the second and third partitions, waiting for my cue to get out."
    new "寂静依旧，听不出分秒流逝。我在第二个和第三个隔间之间来回踱了几分钟，等着出去的时机。"

    # game/script.rpy:26552
    old "It wasn't coming. Would I hear their movements if someone was nearby? I felt I was really close to the time we'd been stopped on that floor."
    new "还是没有来。如果有人就在附近，我能听见动静吗？我觉得离我们当时在那层被拦下的时刻已经很近了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26558
    old "I left the offices. The corridor leading to the elevator was empty."
    new "我离开办公区。通往电梯的走廊空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:26559
    old "I kept staring at it, but I felt no trace of life."
    new "我盯着那里看了许久，却感觉不到一丝活人的气息。"

    # game/script.rpy:26563
    old "Had the impact of my action on the crystal floor been large enough to remove the existence of whoever had initially intercepted us? I turned around and peeked at the opposite hallway, where the stairs led to floor 2."
    new "我在水晶层的举动，影响是否大到让当初拦截我们的人根本不曾存在？我转过身，朝对面那条走廊瞥了一眼，那里的楼梯通往二楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:26567
    old "I felt no difference. If nobody was around, would I have to present myself downstairs and explain what I'd done?"
    new "我没有感到任何不同。如果周围真的没人，我是否该下楼现身，说明自己做了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:26577
    old "The elevator? I ran back and saw something I thought I couldn't see."
    new "电梯？我跑回去，看见了本以为绝不可能看见的景象。"

    # game/script.rpy:26586
    old "That's me...{w} and Erina, as well. I remember those movements."
    new "那是我……{w}还有 Erina。那些动作我记得。"

    # game/script.rpy:26587
    old "From a distance, I heard my own yells and saw blood pouring out of my hand..."
    new "远远地，我听见自己的喊叫，看见血从我手上涌出……"

    # game/script.rpy:26588
    old "It was repeating. Despite what I'd done, the scene played out just like I remembered it."
    new "它在重演。尽管我做了那些事，这一幕仍和我记忆中一模一样地展开。"

    # game/script.rpy:26592
    old "I backed off, knowing Erina would turn around and see an empty corridor. Then, abruptly, my past self closed himself in the elevator and left her outside, puzzled."
    new "我退开了，知道 Erina 转过身只会看到一条空荡的走廊。随后，过去的我突然把自己关进电梯，把她满腹疑惑地留在外面。"

    # game/script.rpy:26594
    old "...How's this possible? I know it was a small change, but how is it possible it all still led to this, occurring just like I remember it?"
    new "……这怎么可能？我知道那只是个小改动，可它怎么还会变成这样，一切都和我记忆里一模一样？"

    # game/script.rpy:26595
    old "I stepped out, my footsteps alerting Erina."
    new "我走了出去，脚步声惊动了 Erina。"

    # game/script.rpy:26601
    old "No Longer Anywhere"
    new "无处可寻"

    # game/script.rpy:26607
    old "What...? A-Atsuki!"
    new "什么……？A、Atsuki！"

    # game/script.rpy:26608
    old "I waved awkwardly and approached her."
    new "我有些尴尬地挥了挥手，朝她走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:26616
    old "It's not bleeding anymore... What did you do?"
    new "不流血了……你做了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:26617
    old "I used the Sekimeiya to travel to the past, and this time it worked. I wanted to get rid of the wound, but it simply stopped the bleeding, even though I'm not sure why."
    new "我用 Sekimeiya 穿越回了过去，这次成功了。我本想让伤口消失，结果它只是止了血，我自己也说不清为什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:26622
    old "Wait... What? There's no way."
    new "等等……什么？不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:26623
    old "No way what, exactly? That I traveled through time?"
    new "什么不可能？我穿越时间这件事吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26628
    old "Yes! How did you do it?"
    new "对！你是怎么做到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:26629
    old "By touching the Sekimeiya. What's wrong?"
    new "碰一下 Sekimeiya 就行。怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:26634
    old "Nothing... I'm just... a bit confused. Ignore me. I'm happy the wound got better."
    new "没什么……我只是……有点糊涂。别在意。伤口好了，我很高兴。"

    # game/script.rpy:26636
    old "I was a bit taken aback by her words. Was she the exact same Erina I remembered?"
    new "她的话让我有些意外。她还是我记忆里的那个 Erina 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26641
    old "Do you understand now why we stopped on this floor?"
    new "你现在明白我们为什么停在这一层了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26642
    old "Sorry, I don't. Are you sure you didn't hit the button accidentally?"
    new "抱歉，我不明白。你确定不是不小心按到了按钮？"

    # game/script.rpy:26643
    old "Yes...{w} Should we keep going up?"
    new "嗯……{w}要继续往上走吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26644
    old "Hang on... What do you remember?"
    new "等一下……你记得什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:26646
    old "Earlier, did we hear a loud door being slammed in hallway A?"
    new "刚才，我们是不是听到 A走廊传来很响的摔门声？"

    # game/script.rpy:26651
    old "...{w}When, exactly?"
    new "……{w}具体是什么时候？"

    # game/script.rpy:26652
    old "About 35 minutes ago."
    new "大概三十五分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:26658
    old "Uh...{w} I... don't know. My head is still a bit foggy, but I don't remember that."
    new "呃……{w}我……不知道。脑子还有点迷糊，可我不记得有过这回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:26663
    old "Why are you asking, though? Did we hear it?"
    new "不过你怎么突然问这个？我们听到了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26664
    old "...I'm not sure. We must have."
    new "……我不确定。应该是听到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26665
    old "It was bizarre. Why had we used the elevator to follow Shiroya when she never went up?"
    new "实在蹊跷。Shiroya 根本没上楼，我们为什么要坐电梯去追她？"

    # game/script.rpy:26666
    old "Did Erina not remember the sound because she hadn't heard it or because of her mental state?"
    new "Erina 不记得那声音，是因为她没听见，还是因为她当时的精神状态？"

    # game/script.rpy:26667
    old "Had realities... converged?"
    new "现实……重合了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26668
    old "Let's wait a second. Sai and Akaro should be coming, right?"
    new "先等一会儿。Sai 和 Akaro 应该会过来吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:26669
    old "That's what they said."
    new "他们是这么说的。"

    # game/script.rpy:26670
    old "I want to talk to them."
    new "我想和他们谈谈。"

    # game/script.rpy:26675
    old "She looked uncertain, but she didn't complain. I began to walk in circles, wondering what to make of the baffling result."
    new "她一脸茫然，却没有抱怨什么。我原地来回踱步，思索这个令人费解的结果。"

    # game/script.rpy:26682
    old "A minute later, nobody had come. It was absolutely enough time for Sai and Akaro to arrive at the third floor..."
    new "一分钟后，还是没人来。这点时间，怎么都够 Sai 和 Akaro 赶到三楼了……"

    # game/script.rpy:26683
    old "Wait here. I'll be back in a second."
    new "在这儿等着，我马上回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:26693
    old "Explaining myself would've been a waste of time, especially considering the condition she was in."
    new "解释也只是浪费时间，何况她现在是那个状态。"

    # game/script.rpy:26698
    old "I circled down the floors until I arrived at the last staircase, not seeing anyone along the way."
    new "我顺着楼梯一层层往下，一直走到最后一段，沿途一个人也没遇见。"

    # game/script.rpy:26708
    old "Hm...? Oh, it's you."
    new "嗯……？哦，是你啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:26709
    old "Through the gray door, I saw Sai. He didn't receive me with clear hostility, so I went down the staircase."
    new "透过那扇灰门，我看见了 Sai。他对我并没有明显的敌意，我便走下楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:26717
    old "...Where's Akaro?"
    new "……Akaro 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:26722
    old "Hell if I know. Why?"
    new "我哪知道。怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:26724
    old "Was that a result of my action? Akaro had come from hallway A, where I'd made the sound. Had that made him not appear?"
    new "这是我那番举动造成的吗？Akaro 本是从 A走廊过来的，声音也是我在那里弄出的。难道就因为这个，他才没有出现？"

    # game/script.rpy:26725
    old "...Are you alone?"
    new "……你一个人？"

    # game/script.rpy:26726
    old "Erina's above us.{w} By the way, about 35 minutes ago, did you hear the sound of a door closing coming from hallway A?"
    new "Erina 在上面。{w}对了，大概三十五分钟前，你有没有听到从 A走廊传来的关门声？"

    # game/script.rpy:26731
    old "What?{w} What kind of question is that?"
    new "啊？{w}这算什么问题？"

    # game/script.rpy:26734
    old "Just answer. Did you?"
    new "回答我就是了。听到了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26739
    old "...{w}{tip=lie}Yes{/tip}, why?"
    new "……{w}{tip=lie}听到了{/tip}，怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:26748
    old "Something caught my attention. On the floor of hallway C, there were new drops of blood, close to drying."
    new "有东西引起了我的注意。C走廊的地板上，落着几滴新血，眼看就要干了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26749
    old "Do you recognize these drops? Have they always been here?"
    new "这些血迹你认得吗？一直都在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:26755
    old "Oh, yes, I saw them before. Are they from that wound? What happened?"
    new "哦，认得，之前就见过。是那道伤流的血吗？出什么事了？"

    # game/script.rpy:26756
    old "When Erina and I had taken the elevator, those drops hadn't existed. There were too many of them to think I hadn't seen them.{w} Sai was definitely living in the reality I'd changed, but I wasn't sure the same could be said for Erina."
    new "我和 Erina 乘电梯经过时，那里还没有这些血迹。数量不少，我不可能没看见。{w}Sai 无疑活在我改变过的现实里，但 Erina 是否也一样，我就说不准了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26757
    old "I knew that was my blood and that I'd left it behind when I'd run away after slamming the door. As soon as I'd psyched myself up to alter the past, all my actions had surely been allowed to differ from what I'd experienced, including unconscious ones such as leaving blood behind."
    new "我知道那是我的血，是我摔门跑开时留下的。从我下定决心改变过去的那一刻起，我的一切行动就必然能够与原本的经历不同——包括留下血迹这类无意识的举动。"

    # game/script.rpy:26760
    old "I looked next to us, and as I thought, the other trail of blood was coming from the elevator. It was from the time I'd gone down after suffering the injury; the floor was proof of both realities at once."
    new "我看了看身旁，果然，另一道血迹来自电梯方向。那是我受伤之后下楼时留下的；这一层的地板，同时印证着两个现实。"

    # game/script.rpy:26766
    old "Are you just not going to answer me? Where's Shiroya, by the way? Is she in the attic?"
    new "你就打算一直不回答我？对了，Shiroya 呢？她在阁楼里？"

    # game/script.rpy:26769
    old "...Why would she be?"
    new "……她怎么会在那儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:26770
    old "What's with these questions? She's not with you, so I figured she might be somewhere we can't get to."
    new "你怎么净问些怪问题？她不在你身边，所以我才猜她可能待在我们进不去的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:26772
    old "Oh, right... The attic is locked, isn't it?"
    new "哦，对……阁楼是锁着的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:26773
    old "It was just a bit ago."
    new "刚刚才锁上的。"

    # game/script.rpy:26774
    old "But you have the key. That's how you entered it when you were chasing us."
    new "可钥匙在你手上。你追我们的时候，不就是用它进去的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26779
    old "...Excuse me? I don't have the key, no.{w} You can search me if you want. I don't have it."
    new "……你说什么？我没有钥匙。{w}不信可以搜我的身，我没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:26783
    old "It was all too confusing. Sai had suddenly undergone yet another change in behavior, and just like the previous ones, I couldn't make sense of it. Everything had become just as incomprehensible as I'd feared. I couldn't discern what I'd changed and what I hadn't."
    new "这一切太混乱了。Sai 的态度又突然变了，和之前几次一样，我完全摸不着头脑。事情到底还是变得像我担心的那样，让人没法理解。我分不清哪些是我改变的，哪些不是。"

    # game/script.rpy:26784
    old "Is there nobody else on the crystal floor?"
    new "水晶层上就没有别人了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26789
    old "There shouldn't be."
    new "按理说不该有。"

    # game/script.rpy:26790
    old "...{w}Let's go up, then. Shiroya might actually be in the attic."
    new "……{w}那就上去看看吧。Shiroya 说不定真在阁楼里。"

    # game/script.rpy:26795
    old "He shrugged and followed me up."
    new "他耸了耸肩，跟在我身后上了楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:26804
    old "On the way, we found Erina, who'd been waiting for my return. She didn't welcome us, and her eyes looked even more empty than before."
    new "半路上，我们碰见了正等我回来的 Erina。她没有欢迎我们，眼神比先前更加空洞。"

    # game/script.rpy:26812
    old "She also didn't reply to Sai's carefree greeting, opting to silently follow us. The attic door was three floors above."
    new "Sai 随口跟她打了声招呼，她也没有回应，只是默默跟在我们后面。阁楼的门还要再往上走三层。"

    # game/script.rpy:26822
    old "I told you. It's locked.{w} Do you not have the key?"
    new "我说过了，门锁着。{w}你没带钥匙？"

    # game/script.rpy:26823
    old "No... It's possible Shiroya does."
    new "没有……钥匙也许在 Shiroya 手里。"

    # game/script.rpy:26828
    old "Maybe she locked herself inside, then."
    new "那说不定是她自己锁在里面的。"

    # game/script.rpy:26829
    old "I remembered what I'd concluded earlier. Had I never been able to follow her into the attic?"
    new "我想起自己刚才得出的结论。难道我始终没能跟着她进阁楼？"

    # game/script.rpy:26830
    old "No matter what... I felt like Sai had to be lying. He had unlocked the door previously to chase us."
    new "无论如何……我都觉得 Sai 在说谎。之前他为了追我们，明明把这扇门打开过。"

    # game/script.rpy:26831
    old "Like we'd thought, he could've accomplished it by traveling inside and unlocking the door with our key, but since we'd still found it on the floor, it was very likely another one had been used."
    new "正如我们所料，他也可能先穿越进去，用我们的钥匙开了门；可既然那把钥匙还留在地上，他用的多半是另一把。"

    # game/script.rpy:26832
    old "If he was telling the truth, I thought that perhaps someone else had entered the attic while Sai had waited downstairs to ambush us..."
    new "如果他没说谎，那也许是有别人趁 Sai 守在楼下伏击我们的时候进了阁楼……"

    # game/script.rpy:26839
    old "Hey! Shiroya! Are you inside?{w} Why would you lock yourself in like this!?"
    new "喂！Shiroya！你在里面吗？{w}干嘛把自己锁在这种地方啊！？"

    # game/script.rpy:26840
    old "Was he just fucking around while he knew where the key was? Even if Shiroya was inside, why would she have chosen to stay hidden...?"
    new "他明明知道钥匙在哪儿，却还在这里演戏？就算 Shiroya 真在里面，她又为什么偏要躲着不出来……？"

    # game/script.rpy:26843
    old "Do what you said earlier and show me your pockets."
    new "照你刚才说的，把口袋翻给我看。"

    # game/script.rpy:26848
    old "Do you not trust me? I suppose I almost killed you. Sure."
    new "你信不过我？也难怪，我差点要了你的命。行吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:26858
    old "I'm just kidding, of course. ...Anyway, you can see all my pockets are empty."
    new "当然是开玩笑的。……总之，你也看到了，我所有口袋都是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:26863
    old "I sighed and did what I'd done in the bedroom. I felt his clothes until I could be sure that he wasn't hiding anything."
    new "我叹了口气，像在卧室里那样把他身上摸了一遍，确认他没有藏着东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:26866
    old "Are you sure she couldn't be anywhere else?"
    new "你确定她不可能在别的地方？"

    # game/script.rpy:26867
    old "We haven't searched the whole building, no, but she should still be here."
    new "我们确实没有搜遍整栋楼，但她应该还在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:26868
    old "Then she must be hiding intentionally, and there's nothing we can do about that."
    new "那她一定是故意躲着，我们也拿她没办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:26874
    old "Maybe she'll come out eventually... Let's go back down for now."
    new "说不定她迟早会出来……我们先下楼吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:26879
    old "I agree. She must not like you very much and prefers to be alone."
    new "我赞成。她多半不待见你，宁愿一个人待着。"

    # game/script.rpy:26883
    old "Wait, no. You're definitely lying."
    new "等等，不对。你肯定在骗人。"

    # game/script.rpy:26888
    old "Me? I don't ever lie."
    new "我？我可从来不撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:26889
    old "You don't have any keys on you. That proves you hid them, because you should have the cabinet key."
    new "你身上一把钥匙都没有，这正说明你把钥匙藏起来了。你本该带着展示柜钥匙的。"

    # game/script.rpy:26894
    old "The Sekimeiya cabinet's? Why would I?"
    new "Sekimeiya 展示柜的？我为什么要带那个？"

    # game/script.rpy:26895
    old "I saw it in your hand before you and Shiroya traveled!"
    new "你和 Shiroya 穿越之前，我亲眼看见它在你手里！"

    # game/script.rpy:26900
    old "Strangely, though, I don't have it. Check your sight too when you go check your hearing."
    new "可奇怪的是，我身上就是没有。等你哪天去检查听力，顺便把视力也一起查了吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:26910
    old "Before I could reply, the three of us were looking at the door. The lock clicked, the doorknob turned, and it began to open."
    new "我还没来得及开口，我们三人便一齐望向了那扇门。锁咔哒一响，门把手转动，门开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26920
    old "...!{w} You're all right!"
    new "……！{w}你们没事！"

    # game/script.rpy:26922
    old "From the other side of the door, Shiroya looked directly into my eyes as she panted in exhaustion."
    new "门那边，Shiroya 喘着粗气，直直望着我的眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:26928
    old "...Oh, she was actually inside. I'm glad we found you."
    new "……哦，原来她真在里面。能找到你真是太好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26934
    old "Wh-What!? He locked me in here!"
    new "什、什么！？是他把我锁在里面的！"

    # game/script.rpy:26940
    old "Me? That's funny. I locked you in, but the key's in the keyhole, right?"
    new "我？真有意思。是我把你锁进去的——可钥匙不就插在锁孔里吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26942
    old "It was her. Not the Shiroya who'd mysteriously chosen to leave by herself, but the one I'd been with the entire time. She had her normal clothes very slightly stained with smoke and still looked at me, glad to see me again."
    new "是她。不是那个莫名其妙独自离开的 Shiroya，而是一直和我待在一起的那个。她穿着平时的衣服，上面沾了些淡淡的烟痕，依旧望着我，很高兴能再见到我。"

    # game/script.rpy:26948
    old "Was he acting like he wanted to find me? He locked me in the bedroom!"
    new "他装得像是要来找我？明明是他把我锁在卧室里的！"

    # game/script.rpy:26949
    old "I'm sorry?"
    new "你说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:26955
    old "I've been here for almost two hours! He shut me in!"
    new "我在这里被关了快两个小时了！是他把我关起来的！"

    # game/script.rpy:26957
    old "So you chose to hole up in the attic and want to blame me for it... why, exactly?"
    new "也就是说，你自己躲进阁楼里，还想把账算在我头上……这又是为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:26963
    old "She hadn't stopped panting, and her voice was hoarse."
    new "她的喘息还没停下，嗓子也哑了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26969
    old "Yes... I just ran from the bedroom. I'm fine."
    new "嗯……我刚从卧室一路跑过来。我没事。"

    # game/script.rpy:26974
    old "Let's pretend I locked you in a bedroom. I'm not sure why I'd even do that, but how did you leave?"
    new "就当是我把你锁在卧室里好了。我也不清楚自己为什么要那么做，不过你是怎么出来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:26980
    old "...With the key."
    new "……用钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:26981
    old "But I thought I trapped you there?"
    new "可我不是把你困在里面了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:26987
    old "Yes, but not with the key! I know what you did!"
    new "是困住了，可你用的不是钥匙！你干了什么，我心里清楚！"

    # game/script.rpy:26992
    old "I became a witch and learned magic, huh? We can go with that if you don't want to tell the truth."
    new "我成了魔女，还学会了魔法，是吧？你要是不想说真话，那就当是这么回事好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:26998
    old "...W-Wait! Erina!"
    new "……等、等等！Erina！"

    # game/script.rpy:27007
    old "You're alive?"
    new "你还活着？"

    # game/script.rpy:27011
    old "I'm sorry if this sounds strange, but are you the same Shiroya who disappeared from the event room with Sai?"
    new "这话问出来或许有些奇怪，不过……你就是和 Sai 一起从活动室消失的那个 Shiroya 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:27017
    old "Hm? Yes, I've been here since then."
    new "嗯？是啊，从那之后我就一直待在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:27019
    old "I still didn't understand anything, but I was happy to be reunited with who I thought of as the real Shiroya. The other version of her was the one who had disappeared again, and she had told me that she was the same person. How she would come to exist, though—that, I didn't know."
    new "我依旧什么都不明白，但能和我心目中那个「真正的 Shiroya」重逢，我很高兴。另一个她又一次消失了，而她曾告诉我，她们是同一个人。只是她到底是怎么出现的，我就不知道了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27020
    old "We didn't check Erina's pulse, remember...?"
    new "我们没确认过 Erina 的脉搏，记得吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:27021
    old "O-Oh! Thank God, and sorry...{w} What's with the blood, though?"
    new "啊、啊啊！太好了……抱歉。{w}不过，你身上的血是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:27026
    old "I don't know. I got hit in the head, so my memories are a little fuzzy."
    new "我不知道。我头被撞了一下，记忆有些模糊。"

    # game/script.rpy:27032
    old "Oh. ...What time is it?"
    new "哦。……现在几点了？"

    # game/script.rpy:27038
    old "Hm... It's {time=19:40.}"
    new "嗯……现在是 {time=19:40.}"

    # game/script.rpy:27044
    old "It's so late... What happened while I was here? And your watch is working again?"
    new "都这么晚了……我在这里的时候都发生了什么？还有，你的表又能正常走了？"

    # game/script.rpy:27050
    old "Huh? Yes, of course."
    new "嗯？是啊，当然。"

    # game/script.rpy:27051
    old "I almost felt at peace. I'd changed reality in some way, but Shiroya had been unaffected up in the attic. She remembered all we'd done, and we'd be able to reach the end of the countdown together."
    new "我几乎感到一丝安心。我以某种方式改变了现实，可待在阁楼上的 Shiroya 却没有受到影响。她记得我们做过的一切，我们也能够一起走到倒计时的尽头。"

    # game/script.rpy:27052
    old "Wait, what's with your clothes? You were wearing different ones."
    new "等等，你的衣服怎么回事？刚才穿的不是这一身吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:27053
    old "Right. When we went to the past, we lost track of that Shiroya, but she still has to be around. I'm confused, though. Where did she come from?"
    new "对。我们去到过去之后，就跟丢了那个 Shiroya，可她一定还在某处。不过我还是想不通——她究竟是从哪里来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:27060
    old "\"When we went to the past\". I see. He was the only one to travel, but he thinks we all did. He thinks we all appeared separately in the past and that we've been unable to find Shiroya since then. I'm not completely sure why that would be his assumption, though."
    new "「我们去到过去」……原来如此。真正穿越的只有他一个人，他却以为我们都去了。他以为我们各自分散地出现在过去，而且从那之后一直找不到 Shiroya。只是他为什么会这样想，我还不完全明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:27061
    old "However, one thing is strange. Sai's watch reads {time=19:40}, which I'm pretty sure is the real time. That must mean he's synced it properly."
    new "不过，有一件事很奇怪。Sai 的表显示 {time=19:40}，我基本可以确定这正是真实时间。也就是说，他已经把表校准好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27064
    old "Can you come with me for a second?"
    new "能跟我来一下吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:27070
    old "Y-Yeah."
    new "好、好的。"

    # game/script.rpy:27075
    old "Can't you just talk openly here?"
    new "在这儿不能直接说吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:27076
    old "I ignored him and brought Shiroya down a floor."
    new "我没理他，带着 Shiroya 下了一层楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:27090
    old "You know Sai's lying, right? He really locked me in a bedroom and told me you died...! I was so worried."
    new "你知道 Sai 在撒谎吧？他真的把我锁在卧室里，还说你死了……！我担心得要命。"

    # game/script.rpy:27091
    old "What...? Don't worry, I believe you, even though I still don't understand Sai very much. I wanted to tell you about what just happened."
    new "什么……？放心吧，我相信你——虽然我到现在还是不太懂 Sai。我想跟你说说刚才发生的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:27097
    old "I think... the past can be changed somehow."
    new "我觉得……过去似乎是可以改变的。"

    # game/script.rpy:27102
    old "It can...? Did you try it?"
    new "真的能……？你试过了？"

    # game/script.rpy:27103
    old "I did, but I'm not sure what to make of the results."
    new "试过了，可结果让我有些拿不准。"

    # game/script.rpy:27104
    old "It's possible what I changed only affected some people. I definitely went back in time and altered the events I'd experienced. Sai recognizes the change, but I'm not sure Erina does."
    new "我改变的东西，可能只影响了一部分人。我确实回到了过去，改变了我经历过的那些事。Sai 记得这个变化，但 Erina 似乎并不记得。"

    # game/script.rpy:27105
    old "It felt like both realities met, leading into differing memories. That could be what happened to Akaro, when his version of events contradicted ours. Maybe someone made some change that didn't affect us, or maybe it didn't affect Akaro."
    new "感觉就像是两个现实交汇在一起，各自留下了不同的记忆。Akaro 那件事或许也是同样的情况——他经历的事情和我们所说的对不上。也许是有人做了什么改动，却没有波及我们；也可能那改动并没有波及 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:27110
    old "That sounds way too complicated... I'm not sure I follow, but you mean..."
    new "这也太复杂了……我没太听懂，不过你的意思是……"

    # game/script.rpy:27113
    old "If we go to the past, I'm pretty sure we could drastically change the way things played out. It's possible some people would still remember this reality, but the change should persist.{w} It's possible two realities just converged, but the real one comes from my change. It overlapped the last one despite some people potentially still remembering it."
    new "只要回到过去，我们肯定能大幅改变事情的走向。也许有些人仍会记得这个现实，但改动本身应该会保留下来。{w}两个现实也可能就这样汇合了，但真正的那个，来自我的改动。它覆盖了上一个现实，尽管有些人可能还记得那一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:27114
    old "Or was that really the case? I hesitated when I remembered the floor of hallway C. The two trails of blood, one from before the change and the other from after it, signified that we were living in a mix of both realities."
    new "可真的是这样吗？想到 C走廊的地面，我迟疑了。那两道血迹，一道来自改动之前，一道来自改动之后，说明我们正活在两个现实混合的状态里。"

    # game/script.rpy:27118
    old "The things I was saying sounded complicated, but in practice, all they meant was that the past could be changed if we consciously wanted it to. Lingering memories might've been an issue for unaffected people, making them think they were in the wrong reality, but that was a minor issue given what we could accomplish.{w} Of course, I wasn't fully aware of how it worked. I didn't know why some memories could remain or what determined the people who kept them, but factually altering history was all that mattered."
    new "我说的那些听起来复杂，实际上不过是——只要我们有意识地去做，过去就可以被改变。残留的记忆或许会给未受影响的人带来困扰，让他们以为自己身处错误的现实；但比起我们能达成的事，这只是小问题。{w}当然，我并不完全清楚其中的原理。我不知道为什么有些记忆会留存，也不清楚是什么决定了哪些人保留记忆；但只要事实上能改写历史，其他都无关紧要。"

    # game/script.rpy:27119
    old "Let's keep going."
    new "继续走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:27120
    old "We had some remaining time to try piecing together the information we needed. The Sekimeiya should've still been downstairs."
    new "我们还剩一些时间，可以试着把需要的情报拼凑起来。Sekimeiya 应该还在楼下。"

    # game/script.rpy:27121
    old "I last traveled from the staff room. Let's go there."
    new "我上一次是从员工室穿越的。我们去那儿吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:27130
    old "That was where we headed. On the way, I checked my pocket and saw I still had the locker key. Fortunately, the note was no longer there, although I still couldn't understand why."
    new "我们便朝那里走去。半路上，我摸了摸口袋，发现储物柜的钥匙还在。幸好，那张纸条已经不在了——尽管我仍不明白为什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:27132
    old "The note, the several mentions of Miiya, and Shiroya's death... Those occurred despite the factual reality, which is that Miiya is dead and Shiroya is alive."
    new "那张纸条、几次三番提到的 Miiya、还有 Shiroya 的死……这些都与真正的事实相抵触——事实上，死的是 Miiya，Shiroya 还活着。"

    # game/script.rpy:27137
    old "What's all this blood...?"
    new "这么多血是怎么回事……？"

    # game/script.rpy:27138
    old "It's mine. As you can see, I hurt my hand in the elevator. I don't even know why it stopped bleeding."
    new "是我的。如你所见，我在电梯里弄伤了手。连我自己都不知道它为什么止住了血。"

    # game/script.rpy:27139
    old "Does it hurt? That's kind of a lot."
    new "疼吗？流得还挺多的。"

    # game/script.rpy:27140
    old "Don't worry, it's fine..."
    new "别担心，没事的……"

    # game/script.rpy:27146
    old "When we stepped into the room, we saw that the locker was open. That made sense, as I hadn't closed it before traveling."
    new "走进房间时，我们看到储物柜是开着的。这也说得通，因为穿越前我并没有关上它。"

    # game/script.rpy:27152
    old "...!{w} It's gone."
    new "……！{w}不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27157
    old "Did you leave it in this locker? How?"
    new "你是把它留在这个储物柜里了？怎么会？"

    # game/script.rpy:27158
    old "I found the key in the cleaning room. I know how that sounds, but I guess no one needed a key to get it. I touched it with the locker open."
    new "钥匙是我在清洁间找到的。我知道这话听着离谱，但估计谁都不需要钥匙就能拿到它。我碰它的时候，柜门是开着的。"

    # game/script.rpy:27163
    old "Oh... Could anyone have taken it, then?"
    new "哦……那有没有可能被别人拿走了？"

    # game/script.rpy:27164
    old "It would've been easy, but I'm not completely sure. The door doesn't look like it moved, so it also could've teleported.{w} While you were in the attic, we saw that happen. I definitely witnessed the Sekimeiya teleport to its cabinet.{w} But Sai could've easily grabbed it. Akaro as well. I saw him, and he should still be here somewhere. It was before I changed the past, but all I did was draw attention to hallway A. There's no way that was enough to overwrite Akaro's existence."
    new "那本来很容易得手，但我也说不准。柜门看上去不像动过，所以它也可能是自己传送走的。{w}你在阁楼那会儿，我们见过这种事。我确实亲眼看见 Sekimeiya 传送进了它的展示柜。{w}但 Sai 完全可以顺手把它拿走，Akaro 也一样。我见过他，他应该还在这栋楼的某处。那是在我改变过去之前，可我只是把注意力引到了 A走廊。那点影响绝不可能抹掉 Akaro 的存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:27179
    old "I went to the event room. Earlier, I had suspected the Sekimeiya teleported inside the cabinet, but it wasn't there."
    new "我去了活动室。先前我怀疑 Sekimeiya 传送进了展示柜里，但它不在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:27184
    old "I'd hoped we'd find it. If we wanted to change the past, it was better if we traveled together so that both of us could keep the memory of our original reality."
    new "我本来还指望能找到它。如果真想改变过去，我们最好一起穿越，这样两个人都能保留原本现实的记忆。"

    # game/script.rpy:27190
    old "Like always, whether it teleported or someone hid it, it has to be nearby and in a place we can access. We can find it."
    new "和之前一样，不管它是自己传送走了，还是被人藏了起来，它一定就在附近，而且在我们进得去的地方。我们找得到。"

    # game/script.rpy:27191
    old "She was right. It was one of our first questions: \"why would someone hide the Sekimeiya if we'll find it no matter where it is?\" If it had been teleporting, that question would be obsolete."
    new "她说得对。这是我们最初就提出的问题之一：「既然不管 Sekimeiya 在哪儿，我们都会找到，那为什么还要把它藏起来？」如果它一直在传送，这个问题就不成立了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27192
    old "However, with the inclusion of the storeroom's hidden door, it was always possible a successful plan had already stolen it, and there were a few unreachable places, such as the remaining lockers."
    new "不过，既然储藏室里还有暗门，就始终存在一种可能：别人已经得手，把它偷走了。况且还有几处我们进不去的地方，比如其余那些储物柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:27193
    old "Oh, yeah, the Sekimeiya's gone. I was searching for it before we went up."
    new "哦，对，Sekimeiya 不见了。我们上楼之前，我就在找它。"

    # game/script.rpy:27198
    old "...I'm sure you were."
    new "……你当然找过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27204
    old "Sai entered from hallway A, alone."
    new "Sai 独自一人从 A走廊走了进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:27205
    old "There's not much time left... Let's wait for the shutter to open."
    new "没多少时间了……等卷帘门打开吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:27206
    old "What about the Sekimeiya?"
    new "Sekimeiya 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:27211
    old "Who knows? I couldn't find it, but why do you care?{w} Akaro might be responsible, and he could have taken it outside. If that happened, there's nothing we can do.{w} However, if it's still inside, the police will find it immediately, right? It can be hidden from us, but not from them."
    new "谁知道呢。反正我没找到。不过这跟你有什么关系？{w}说不定是 Akaro 干的，他可能已经把它带到外面去了。如果真是那样，我们也没办法。{w}不过，它要是还在楼里，警察一进来就能找到，不是吗？它能瞒过我们，却瞒不过他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:27218
    old "The hallway B door opened."
    new "B走廊的门打开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27224
    old "Erina, do you know where the Sekimeiya might be?"
    new "Erina，你知道 Sekimeiya 可能在哪儿吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:27229
    old "What...? No, I don't."
    new "什么……？不，我不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:27234
    old "Then none of us do. If it was deliberately hidden, I don't see the point in searching for it anymore."
    new "那就是谁都不知道了。如果它是被人故意藏起来的，我看再找下去也没有意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:27240
    old "You know where it is, right?"
    new "你知道它在哪儿，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:27241
    old "You're free to enlighten me. If I knew where it was, what would my endgame be? Hoping the police don't find it? There's no way that would happen.{w} Someone took it when we weren't around. That must mean they have the means to conceal it from both us and the police. Otherwise, hiding it is pointless."
    new "那你不妨告诉我。如果我知道它在哪儿，我到底图什么？指望警察找不到它？那绝不可能。{w}有人趁我们不在时拿走了它。那说明对方有办法把它藏得让我们和警察都找不到，否则藏起来根本没有意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:27242
    old "You say that, but it's been happening since this morning, and it was never hidden in a place the police wouldn't have inspected."
    new "话是这么说，可这种事从今早就一直在发生，而它从来没被藏在警察查不到的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:27250
    old "You could have a plan, too. When the police enter, as soon as they find the Sekimeiya, they'll activate it. That'll make everyone around it disappear, leaving a free path for you to retrieve it."
    new "你也可能另有打算。警察一进来，只要找到 Sekimeiya，就会触发它。它周围的人都会消失，正好给你让出一条路，让你把它拿走。"

    # game/script.rpy:27255
    old "Are you even listening to yourself? You think I want to steal the Sekimeiya? Sure, I wouldn't say no to having it, but that's not gonna work out.{w} First of all, they'd simply appear in the past. If a bunch of people time travel, the panic would ruin any kind of plan like that. At least a few people have to know what the Sekimeiya is capable of too, right? Why would they send the police to grab it if they know what touching it would do?"
    new "你自己听听这话像话吗？你觉得我想偷 Sekimeiya？是，我不介意把它弄到手，可那根本行不通。{w}首先，他们只会出现在过去。那么多人一起时间穿越，引发的恐慌足以毁掉这种计划。再说，总该有几个人知道 Sekimeiya 有什么能耐吧？他们若知道一碰它会发生什么，又怎么会派警察去拿？"

    # game/script.rpy:27260
    old "I think I agree with him... That wouldn't work."
    new "我觉得他说得有道理……那样行不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:27261
    old "Hiding the Sekimeiya is pointless, that's a fact. Incidentally, there's no place the police would ignore. What that means is that if the Sekimeiya's here, there's no reason to search for it. What I find most likely is that it's already outside, though."
    new "藏起 Sekimeiya 没有意义，这是事实。再说，这楼里没有哪个地方会被警察漏掉。也就是说，如果 Sekimeiya 还在这里，我们根本没必要去找。不过，我认为最可能的情况是它已经被带到外面去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27262
    old "...{w}All right. I agree, so let's just wait."
    new "……{w}好吧。我同意，那就等着吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:27267
    old "Shiroya gave me a dubious look, but I had to ignore it."
    new "Shiroya 用怀疑的眼神看了我一眼，我只能装作没看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:27272
    old "Perfect. We've had enough headaches, so let's go to the lobby."
    new "很好。头疼的事已经够多了，我们去大厅吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:27281
    old "I didn't actually agree at all, but more than an hour remained. If Sai was up to something, it was too early to try preventing it."
    new "我其实一点也不认同，但离时限还有一个多小时。若 Sai 真在打什么主意，现在就出手阻止还太早。"

    # game/script.rpy:27282
    old "Shiroya's look told me she was thinking the same. Closer to the deadline, we'd push for a building search. That way, if we found the Sekimeiya, Sai wouldn't have time to arrange anything else."
    new "Shiroya 的眼神告诉我，她也是这么想的。等临近最后期限，我们再推动全楼搜查。这样一来，就算找到 Sekimeiya，Sai 也没时间再布置别的了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27283
    old "I couldn't forget that Sai had tried to kill us. Under specific circumstances, he was willing to go that far."
    new "我忘不了 Sai 曾想杀我们。在特定情况下，他真会走到那一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:27286
    old "Part of me had to seriously consider that he was a Xyn plant. We had surmised early on that it was possible one of us trapped inside could be from Xyn, and Sai had sown chaos the entire time he'd been in the building, even if Katei was clearly suspicious anyway. It almost felt too obvious, given how completely unconcerned he was with the safety of others, and brandishing a knife at us didn't really earn him any points either."
    new "我不得不认真考虑一种可能：他是 Xyn 安插的内线。我们早就推测过，被困在楼里的人当中，可能有一个是 Xyn 派来的；而 Sai 从进楼起就一直在制造混乱，尽管 Katei 本来就明显很可疑。他对他人的安危毫不在意，这几乎显得太过明显；更别提他还朝我们亮过刀，这也没给他留下什么好印象。"

    # game/script.rpy:27287
    old "I had deeply wanted to find out whatever I could and expose anyone responsible for the attack... but that had rapidly become quite difficult given the way things had gone. Even with all the information I had, I couldn't definitely conclude that he was responsible. I simply didn't know enough."
    new "我原本非常想尽可能查明真相，把袭击的幕后责任人揪出来……但事情发展到这一步，要做到这点已经变得非常困难。即便握有这么多信息，我也无法断定他就是责任人。我知道的实在不够。"

    # game/script.rpy:27288
    old "What was for sure was that he was exactly the type of person to try to take the Sekimeiya for his own purposes, and I couldn't allow that. He'd been pissing me off the entire day, and after he'd almost killed me, there was no way I'd let him carry out any sort of plan if I could obstruct it. Additionally, I still wanted to find the Sekimeiya, and while it was out of the cabinet, it was storing the power we needed."
    new "唯一确定的是，他正是那种会为了一己目的去抢 Sekimeiya 的人，而我不能容许这种事发生。他这一整天都让我火大，何况他还差点杀了我；只要我能阻挠，就绝不会让他任何计划得逞。再说，我仍然想找到 Sekimeiya——它离开展示柜的这段时间里，一直在储存我们需要的能量。"

    # game/script.rpy:27289
    old "If the video from all of the cameras was salvageable, there'd be no problem nailing the actual culprit, but I couldn't let something happen in the meantime."
    new "如果所有摄像头的录像都还能恢复，揪出真凶自然不成问题，可我不能让这段时间里再出什么变故。"

    # game/script.rpy:27295
    old "I whispered to Shiroya."
    new "我低声对 Shiroya 说。"

    # game/script.rpy:27296
    old "...Did you lose the knife?"
    new "……那把刀你弄丢了？"

    # game/script.rpy:27301
    old "Surprisingly, she shook her head and showed me the inside of her purse."
    new "没想到，她摇了摇头，让我看她的手提包里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:27302
    old "What...? She still has it?"
    new "什么……？刀还在她手上？"

    # game/script.rpy:27303
    old "When she disappeared from the event room, she had it, but every possible replicated location of hers that held it was placed in the event room too, and that's obviously not where she appeared..."
    new "她从活动室消失时，刀还在她身上。而她所有可能带着刀的复制位置，也都集中在活动室；她出现的地方显然不是那里……"

    # game/script.rpy:27304
    old "Did you get it from Sai after you two appeared somewhere?"
    new "你们俩后来在某个地方出现时，是从 Sai 那里拿到刀的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:27309
    old "No... I still don't understand it either. Both of us appeared in the attic, and I already had it. I'd forgotten to mention it, but yeah, that doesn't make sense with how we thought the Sekimeiya worked."
    new "不是……我自己也一直没想通。我们两个都出现在阁楼，而那时刀已经在我身上了。我忘了提这件事，不过确实，这和我们原先理解的 Sekimeiya 运作方式对不上。"

    # game/script.rpy:27311
    old "It was the same as my wound. We'd had the Sekimeiya at our disposal for nearly eleven hours, and despite how much I'd gone over every detail, I was ashamed by how little we'd concluded."
    new "这和我身上的伤一样。将近十一个小时里，Sekimeiya 一直在我们手中，可我反复梳理了每一个细节，最终得出的结论却少得可怜，真让我羞愧。"

    # game/script.rpy:27325
    old "Okay, let's sit around and wait. I'm exhausted and just want to get out, so I hope nothing else happens. Whatever Xyn or the culprit are up to is no concern of ours anymore...{w} I have no idea what happened to Akaro, but I don't care. If he's behind this whole mess, he'll face the consequences."
    new "好了，我们就坐着等吧。我已经累坏了，只想出去，所以希望别再出什么事。Xyn 或者真凶想做什么，都跟我们无关了……{w}我不知道 Akaro 出了什么事，也不在乎。如果这一团乱麻是他搞出来的，他自会承担后果。"

    # game/script.rpy:27333
    old "The four of us sat next to each other on the left of the metal shutter. The entire day had been slow and dense, but it was true that very little time remained. We were nearing the end, and nothing but uncertainty awaited us."
    new "我们四人并排坐在金属卷帘门左侧。这一整天过得又慢又沉，但剩下时间确实不多了。终点将近，等着我们的只有未知。"

    # game/script.rpy:27334
    old "Exactly one hour and ten minutes. That's all we have to get through to reclaim our freedom."
    new "整整一小时十分钟。只要熬过这段时间，我们就能重获自由。"

    # game/script.rpy:27336
    old "One hour and ten minutes... Was there any guarantee that was even correct? I'd lost my sense of time many hours earlier, and while I knew the computer in the security room probably confirmed Sai's time, it was unreasonable to blindly believe it."
    new "一小时十分钟……可这个数字就一定准确吗？早在好几个小时前，我就已经失去时间感了。监控室的电脑大概印证了 Sai 所说的时刻，但盲目相信它未免草率。"

    # game/script.rpy:27340
    old "Nonetheless, if the time truly was {time=19:50}, the end of the lengthy tunnel was near. Would freedom really be found at its exit, or would a new stretch of confinement begin? We were approaching the time where the truth behind the supposed month-away recording would be settled."
    new "话虽如此，如果此刻真的是 {time=19:50}，那这条漫长的隧道也快到头了。出口处等着的真是自由吗？还是说，新的囚禁才刚要开始？那段号称过了一个月的录音，其真相也快水落石出了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27341
    old "Uncomfortably leaning against the wall, we attempted to relax our bodies. Given Sai's track record and what he was likely after, we wouldn't be there for long."
    new "我们别扭地靠在墙上，想让身体放松下来。照 Sai 以往的作风，以及他多半想要的东西来看，我们不会等太久。"

    # game/script.rpy:27342
    old "He'd used a knife against me once. If he opposed us, it was only fair to return the favor.{w} Sai hadn't been wrong in suspecting Katei at the start, seeing through his myriad lies. However, he was insane if he thought he'd done a good job of hiding his own. The overconfidence he'd sheltered himself behind would prove useless if it was seen through."
    new "他对我动过一次刀。若他站在我们的对立面，那我们以牙还牙也理所当然。{w}Sai 一开始就怀疑 Katei，看穿了他形形色色的谎言，这一点并没错。可他要是以为自己的谎瞒得漂亮，那简直是疯了。他拿过度自信当掩护，而那份自信一旦被看穿，就毫无用处。"

    # game/script.rpy:27343
    old "But, for the time being, we waited. If everything went smoothly until the search, that'd be ideal."
    new "不过眼下，我们只能等。只要到搜查开始前一切顺利，就再好不过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27352
    old "...Wait here. I'm going to the bathroom."
    new "……在这儿等着。我去趟洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:27355
    old "About half an hour later, Shiroya stood up. It confused me at first, but I soon realized that it was not yet the move we'd silently scheduled for later, as another forty minutes still remained."
    new "大约半小时后，Shiroya 站起身来。我起初有些不解，但很快明白，这还不是我们暗中约好稍后再做的事——离那会儿还有四十分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:27362
    old "Oh, all right."
    new "哦，好吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:27363
    old "Can't you wait?"
    new "你就不能忍一忍吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:27364
    old "No. Don't worry, though, I won't go anywhere else."
    new "忍不了。不过放心，我哪儿也不会去。"

    # game/script.rpy:27368
    old "She went off to hallway B. Once she disappeared, we continued with our blank looks."
    new "她往 B走廊去了。等她的身影消失，我们几个继续面无表情地待着。"

    # game/script.rpy:27374
    old "...{w}She'd better come back quickly."
    new "……{w}她最好快点回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:27375
    old "...Sai, I understand everything you said, but we should try to find the Sekimeiya."
    new "……Sai，你说的我都明白，可我们还是该去找 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:27377
    old "I-I need it... I can't just let Isla die."
    new "我、我需要它……我不能眼睁睁看着 Isla 死。"

    # game/script.rpy:27378
    old "...{w}Erina, it would be really bad if we searched for the Sekimeiya.{w} It's... difficult to say it, but if we do that, you'll begin to hope your daughter will be saved. I know it's harsh to hear, but it won't end well. We won't find it."
    new "……{w}Erina，我们要是去找 Sekimeiya，那可就糟透了。{w}这话……很难说出口，可一旦去找，你就会开始指望你女儿能得救。我知道听着残忍，但不会有好结果的。我们找不到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:27379
    old "...Didn't you lie earlier too? Regarding how it worked?"
    new "……你刚才不也撒了谎吗？关于它是怎么运作的。"

    # game/script.rpy:27380
    old "That wasn't a lie; I don't understand how the Sekimeiya works myself very well. I know I said you'd go far enough back, but something must've gone wrong."
    new "那不算撒谎。我自己也说不太清 Sekimeiya 是怎么运作的。我确实说过你能回到足够久以前，可一定是哪里出了差错。"

    # game/script.rpy:27383
    old "I also said I wouldn't travel, remember? That was something else I was wrong about. You didn't see it, but the travel encompassed me as well."
    new "我还说过我自己不会穿越，记得吧？这一点我也说错了。你们没看见，可那次穿越把我也卷了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:27384
    old "What? No, we did see. You were the only one to travel."
    new "什么？不，我们看见了。穿过去的只有你一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:27385
    old "...{w}What?{w} You had to have traveled as well, right?"
    new "……{w}什么？{w}你们肯定也穿越了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:27386
    old "She didn't. Only you did."
    new "她没有。只有你。"

    # game/script.rpy:27387
    old "I hadn't wanted to tell him, as keeping him in the dark felt smarter. However, I was curious to hear what he'd have to say in response."
    new "我本不想告诉他，让他蒙在鼓里似乎更稳妥。可我还是好奇他会怎么回应。"

    # game/script.rpy:27388
    old "...{w}That... doesn't make any sense, though. Are you telling the truth?"
    new "……{w}可这……根本说不通。你们说的是真话？"

    # game/script.rpy:27390
    old "Erina nodded as well. Sai stayed pensive for a long while, clearly puzzled by our experience."
    new "Erina 也点了点头。Sai 沉默着思索了很久，显然对我们的经历百思不解。"

    # game/script.rpy:27392
    old "W-Well, I suppose there's no point in thinking about it anymore. Understanding how the Sekimeiya works in such a short period of time might just be impossible."
    new "那、那什么……再想下去也没用了吧。想在这么短的时间里弄懂 Sekimeiya 的原理，恐怕根本办不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:27395
    old "He shrugged and seemingly gave up, but something about the whole situation still felt wrong. It seemed I'd overwritten the reality in which Sai and Akaro had talked to us in hallway B, and the Sai we were talking to had differing memories as a result."
    new "他耸了耸肩，看样子是放弃了，可整件事仍有哪里不对劲。看来是我覆盖掉了 Sai 和 Akaro 在 B走廊与我们交谈的那个现实，眼前这个 Sai 的记忆也因此有所不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:27396
    old "However, what kind of sense did they make? He was the only one to travel, meaning that he should have gone twenty minutes into the past. If so, where had that version of him been? If he'd been nearby, he would've known that we hadn't traveled, and he'd told me that he heard the sound I made in hallway A."
    new "可是这样想又哪里说得通？穿越的既然只有他，那他应该回到了二十分钟之前。若真如此，那时的他又在哪儿？如果他就在附近，就该知道我们没有穿越——而且他还跟我说过，他听见了我在 A走廊弄出的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:27397
    old "It was too labyrinthine. I couldn't understand that whole series of events in the slightest. Warping realities, altered memories, and time travel... Such a conglomeration was bound to be nonsensical."
    new "这太错综复杂了。那一连串事件，我一点也理不清。扭曲的现实、被改写的记忆，再加上时间穿越……这么多东西搅在一起，注定讲不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:27398
    old "And so I let it go. I wanted to know what had happened, but I was forced to accept it was beyond my comprehension. Perhaps the other Shiroya's appearance would go unexplained for the rest of my life."
    new "于是我放下了。我想知道究竟发生了什么，却不得不承认那超出我的理解。也许另一个 Shiroya 的出现，这辈子都不会有答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:27399
    old "...{w}But the real one hadn't come back after more than five minutes.{w} In addition, the other one had claimed to be the very same person, indicating that her origin point could still have been coming..."
    new "……{w}可真正的 Shiroya 过了五分多钟还没回来。{w}而且另一个她自称就是同一个人，那么她出发的时间点或许还没到……"

    # game/script.rpy:27406
    old "Stay here. I'll be back in a second."
    new "你们待在这儿。我马上回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:27410
    old "Really? Are you two just ripping off Katei?"
    new "真的假的？你们俩这是在学 Katei 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:27418
    old "I went to hallway B. From there, I could clearly see that nobody was in the women's bathroom."
    new "我去了 B走廊。从那儿一眼就能看清，女洗手间里没有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:27425
    old "How shocking, she's not there. Are you going to propose we search the whole building to find her?"
    new "真叫人吃惊，她不在。接下来你是不是要提议，把整栋楼翻个遍去找她？"

    # game/script.rpy:27427
    old "Could that have been her intention? To make us look everywhere? ...Wasn't it too early?"
    new "这会是她的用意吗？让我们到处去找她？……可这时候动手，未免太早了？"

    # game/script.rpy:27432
    old "Maybe she went to the bathrooms on floor 2, like Katei."
    new "也许她去了二楼的洗手间，就像 Katei 那样。"

    # game/script.rpy:27437
    old "You mean when Katei lied, and in reality, I was the one who went up? In his case, the excuse worked because Naomi's in the men's bathroom. No reason Shiroya would do the same."
    new "你是说 Katei 撒谎那次，其实上去的人是我？他那个借口能成立，是因为 Naomi 在男洗手间里。Shiroya 可没有理由照做。"

    # game/script.rpy:27441
    old "Sai walked up to the bathrooms and opened the closed door. Through it, we only saw Naomi's second body covered by the curtain."
    new "Sai 走到洗手间前，推开了那扇关着的门。门里只看见 Naomi 的第二具身体，被遮布盖着。"

    # game/script.rpy:27450
    old "Is this your genius plan? To act as if you're searching for Shiroya when your goal is to find the Sekimeiya?"
    new "这就是你的妙计？假装在找 Shiroya，其实是想找 Sekimeiya？"

    # game/script.rpy:27451
    old "That's not it at all... I don't know where she is."
    new "根本不是那么回事……我真的不知道她在哪儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:27452
    old "That can't be what she wants. She knew we could use the knife to force Sai into cooperating. By hiding, she'd be purposely removing it from the equation."
    new "这不可能是她想要的。她清楚我们能用那把刀逼 Sai 就范。她要是藏起来，反而是主动把这个筹码排除在外。"

    # game/script.rpy:27457
    old "Maybe you're right. After all, she could just use this time to search on her own.{w} And nobody else is around... There's no danger to fear.{w} By which I mean, she didn't want to go to the bathroom. She had something else in mind. Are you telling me you don't know what it is?"
    new "也许你说得对。毕竟，她完全可以趁这段时间自己去找。{w}而且周围没有别人……也没什么危险可担心。{w}我是说，她根本不是要去洗手间。她另有打算。你是想告诉我，你不知道那是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:27459
    old "No, but that can't be it."
    new "不，但那不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:27464
    old "What, then? Akaro came back out of nowhere and did something to her? Did she go to the past even though the Sekimeiya's probably gone? Why? And shouldn't she have come back if that had happened?{w} I told you I was hoping for a calm end to all this. Were you two the ones who hid the Sekimeiya after all?"
    new "那到底是怎么回事？Akaro 凭空冒出来，对她做了什么？还是说，Sekimeiya 明明很可能已经不在了，她却跑到了过去？为什么？真要是那样，她不是早该回来了吗？{w}我说过，我希望这一切能平平静静地收场。该不会，Sekimeiya 其实是你们两个藏起来的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:27465
    old "Stop it. I don't know what happened."
    new "别说了。我根本不知道发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:27468
    old "Shiroya! Are you here!?"
    new "Shiroya！你在这儿吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:27474
    old "How strange. She's not coming."
    new "真奇怪。她怎么没来。"

    # game/script.rpy:27480
    old "I went to the event room and verified that the cabinet was still empty. Nothing had changed there."
    new "我去了一趟活动室，确认展示柜里仍旧空空如也。那里没有任何变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:27481
    old "Could it really have been Akaro? Sai just sounded pretty confident when he said that nobody else is around, but he doesn't know of the reality in which Akaro appeared from hallway A."
    new "真的是 Akaro 吗？Sai 刚才说附近没有别人时语气相当笃定，可他并不知道 Akaro 从 A走廊出现的那段现实。"

    # game/script.rpy:27482
    old "From his point of view, Akaro has been missing for hours, ever since they escaped from the bedroom together.{w} Is that it, though? ...Or am I being tricked?"
    new "在他看来，两人一起逃出卧室之后，Akaro 已经失踪了好几个小时。{w}可真是这样吗？……还是说，我被人耍了？"

    # game/script.rpy:27483
    old "In the reality where Akaro appeared, Sai didn't seem surprised to see him.{w} ...There were plenty of other things that had to be different, though."
    new "在 Akaro 出现的那段现实里，Sai 见到他时似乎并不惊讶。{w}……不过，肯定还有许多别的不同之处。"

    # game/script.rpy:27494
    old "I kept calling her name in hallway A, but there was no response."
    new "我在 A走廊里一遍遍喊她的名字，却始终没有回应。"

    # game/script.rpy:27498
    old "And once again, nothing new caught my eye in the storeroom."
    new "储藏室里也一如既往，没有发现任何新东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:27506
    old "...Could she have gone up?"
    new "……她会不会上楼去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:27511
    old "She did leave the attic key in the door. Maybe she had some final business there."
    new "她确实把阁楼的钥匙留在了门上。也许她在那边还有最后一件事要办。"

    # game/script.rpy:27513
    old "I didn't like it at all. Why was Shiroya surrounded by so much mystery? After finding her again, I hadn't sensed anything strange about her, but had she still kept something important from me...?"
    new "我一点也不喜欢这样。Shiroya 身上为什么会有这么多谜团？重逢之后，我并没有觉得她哪里奇怪，可她是不是仍有什么事瞒着我……？"

    # game/script.rpy:27517
    old "Hesitating slightly, I directed myself toward the stairs."
    new "我略一迟疑，还是朝楼梯走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:27524
    old "Man, I get it's been a bizarre day. I didn't anticipate anything like this when I woke up, but there's no reason to drag things out."
    new "唉，我知道今天够离奇的。我醒来时可没想到会变成这样，但也没必要这么拖着吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:27525
    old "Sai, this has nothing to do with you or the Sekimeiya. We need to find Shiroya."
    new "Sai，这件事跟你和 Sekimeiya 都没有关系。我们得找到 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:27526
    old "*sigh* Yes, yes. You're just too stubborn."
    new "（叹气）好，好。你就是太固执了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27533
    old "There was no reason to take the elevator, so we walked up. On the second floor, I continued yelling her name, but we didn't so much as see her shadow."
    new "没理由坐电梯，我们便走了上去。到了二楼，我继续喊着她的名字，却连她的影子都没见着。"

    # game/script.rpy:27541
    old "We continued until we were in front of the attic. Sai was right—the key was still inserted."
    new "我们一路走上去，停在阁楼门前。Sai 说得没错——钥匙还插在锁孔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:27542
    old "I know it sounds like she and I are up to something, but we need to actually search for her thoroughly."
    new "我知道听起来像是我和她之间有什么名堂，但我们真的必须彻底搜寻她的下落。"

    # game/script.rpy:27547
    old "Who could've guessed? ...That's fine.{w} If she's still here, we'll find her."
    new "谁能想到呢？……算了。{w}如果她还在这栋楼里，我们会找到她的。"

    # game/script.rpy:27548
    old "...{w}I don't know if you have something in mind, but you two will stay together, making sure nobody can sneak past. Not Shiroya, not Akaro, and not someone who's hiding."
    new "……{w}我不知道你心里在打什么主意，不过你们两个待在一起，别让任何人溜过去。不管是 Shiroya、Akaro，还是哪个躲起来的家伙。"

    # game/script.rpy:27553
    old "...Sure.{w} But do understand that the Sekimeiya exists somewhere. Using it, it's possible to bypass any regular search by teleporting back to a recently inspected place. I doubt we have to worry about that, though."
    new "……行。{w}不过你要清楚，Sekimeiya 就在某个地方。用它传送回刚查过的地方，就能绕过任何常规搜查。但我想，这种事应该用不着担心。"

    # game/script.rpy:27564
    old "We went up the stairs. I looked at the floor of the living room, but I was unable to draw much from it. I could still recognize some of the very old footprints, but most of them were newer. It was at least clear that none had been left recently."
    new "我们上了楼。我查看起居室的地面，却没能看出多少线索。有些很早以前的脚印我还能认出来，但大多数都比较新。至少可以确定，没有一个是最近留下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:27572
    old "I went through the kitchen and entered the hallway."
    new "我穿过厨房，走进了走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:27573
    old "Just stay here while I look around."
    new "你们就待在这儿，我去四处看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:27578
    old "At your service."
    new "遵命。"

    # game/script.rpy:27584
    old "...I called the elevator. Seconds later, it arrived, empty except for the blood I'd left in it. Then, I proceeded to leave the door open, disabling it as an escape method."
    new "……我按了电梯。几秒后它到了，里面空无一人，只有我先前留下的血迹。随后我让电梯门一直敞着，让它没法再被当成逃跑路线。"

    # game/script.rpy:27592
    old "Wait, why isn't the handle attached? This is the room where we locked ourselves in."
    new "等等，门把手怎么没装上？这就是我们当初把自己反锁进去的那个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:27593
    old "Only the inner handle of the bedroom wasn't attached, and it was next to the door, in the hallway."
    new "只有卧室内侧的门把手没装上，就搁在门旁的走廊上。"

    # game/script.rpy:27598
    old "Oh, what...? I have no idea."
    new "呃，什么……？我完全不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:27604
    old "Whatever happened in the attic, it had taken place some time ago, as every room was vacant. I looked through the storeroom, the bathroom, and the two bedrooms. During that time, Erina and Sai made sure we could conclude the attic was empty."
    new "阁楼里不管发生过什么，都已是一段时间以前的事了，每个房间都空无一人。我查过储藏室、浴室和两间卧室。这期间，Erina 和 Sai 守在门口，让我们得以确认阁楼里确实是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:27608
    old "I glanced at the elevator and saw that the door hadn't closed. I felt confident in moving on, so we headed to the sixth floor."
    new "我瞥了一眼电梯，门还开着。既然可以放心往下查，我们便前往六楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:27619
    old "While Sai and Erina stayed outside the partitions, I looked through the three of them and then in the bathrooms. That made one more floor Shiroya wasn't on."
    new "Sai 和 Erina 留在隔间外，我把那三个隔间逐一查看，随后又进了洗手间。这样一来，又排除了一层楼——Shiroya 不在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:27626
    old "And quickly, those floors added up to six. One last time, the crystal floor was the final place to look through."
    new "很快，这样查过的楼层就凑够了六层。最后剩下的，便是水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:27632
    old "If she's here, I hope you admit what you're doing."
    new "如果她真在这儿，我希望你能坦白你到底在做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:27633
    old "Just stay put. I'll look through the rooms."
    new "待着别动。我去查看房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:27637
    old "I walked to the storeroom, but Erina's voice stopped me."
    new "我朝储藏室走去，却被 Erina 的声音叫住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27643
    old "W-Wait.{w} You said Shiroya wasn't in the women's bathroom, but you didn't mention this."
    new "等、等等。{w}你说 Shiroya 不在女洗手间里，可你没提这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:27650
    old "I stepped back. Erina had decided to inspect the bathroom herself out of either curiosity or distrust."
    new "我退开一步。不知是出于好奇还是怀疑，Erina 决定亲自查看洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:27651
    old "Don't move. I'll look myself."
    new "别动。我自己来看。"

    # game/script.rpy:27659
    old "I approached the doors and peeked inside. What Erina had noticed was the toilet: the water tank's lid had been removed, which we hadn't seen from hallway B."
    new "我走近门边，探头往里看。Erina 注意到的是马桶：水箱的盖子被取了下来，这一点从 B 走廊那边根本看不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:27666
    old "On a thin pipe, close to falling into the water, was the gray Sekimeiya."
    new "灰色 Sekimeiya 就搁在一根细水管上，几乎要掉进水里。"

    # game/script.rpy:27667
    old "Did she activate it?"
    new "是她启动的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:27670
    old "Touching it entailed no risk, so I put my left arm inside."
    new "碰它不会有任何风险，我便把左臂伸了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:27672
    old "I don't get it. It's been like ten minutes since she went to the bathroom. Even if she activated it, would it still be powered off...?"
    new "我不明白。她去洗手间已经有十分钟左右了。就算她启动过，它难道还会是关着的吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:27675
    old "I set the Sekimeiya on the floor and retrieved the tank lid, which was sitting between the toilet and the far wall. It was heavier than I expected, so I gently put it back in place."
    new "我把 Sekimeiya 放到地上，取回搁在马桶与对面墙壁之间的水箱盖。它比我想的重，我便小心地把它放回了原处。"

    # game/script.rpy:27680
    old "I walked out, holding the Sekimeiya with my hand. I had put my sleeve between it and my skin, preventing it from activating when it regained power."
    new "我用手拿着 Sekimeiya 走了出去。我把袖子垫在它和皮肤之间，以免它重新通电时启动。"

    # game/script.rpy:27686
    old "O-Oh...!"
    new "啊、啊……！"

    # game/script.rpy:27687
    old "The Sekimeiya's not in the tower anymore, right?"
    new "Sekimeiya 已经不在塔里了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:27692
    old "Isn't that it?"
    new "不就是那个吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:27693
    old "...Did you hide it in the water tank?"
    new "……你把它藏在水箱里了？"

    # game/script.rpy:27698
    old "Not me.{w} I honestly thought it must've left the building some time ago. I wonder why anyone would hide it.{w} However, it seems Shiroya activated it and went to the past. Maybe she knew where it would be if she hid it herself. It doesn't make a lot of sense that she's not here, though."
    new "不是我。{w}说实话，我以为它早就被带出这栋楼了。真不明白谁会把它藏起来。{w}不过，看来是 Shiroya 启动了它，去了过去。如果是她自己藏的，她或许知道它会出现在哪里。可她却不在，这就说不通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27699
    old "...{w}We still haven't searched the whole floor. I'll go leave the Sekimeiya in the event room, and we won't move it again."
    new "……{w}这一层还没搜完。我去把 Sekimeiya 放到活动室，之后谁都不再动它。"

    # game/script.rpy:27705
    old "...There's nothing else to find, is there? Do you seriously believe Shiroya will be here? We've already found the Sekimeiya."
    new "……已经没什么可找的了吧？你真觉得 Shiroya 会在这里？Sekimeiya 都已经找到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27706
    old "I stared at Sai's eyes, a little disconcerted. His voice sounded noticeably more nervous and tense than it had recently."
    new "我有些不安地注视着 Sai 的眼睛。他的声音明显比近来紧张、紧绷得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:27707
    old "...Is there something else to find here?"
    new "……这里还有别的东西要找吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:27712
    old "Hm? What would that be?"
    new "嗯？还能有什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:27713
    old "There was something hidden behind those words. Saying that was all he could do to try to prevent the search from concluding."
    new "那句话背后藏着什么。他能做的，也只是用这样一句话拖着，不让搜索就此收场。"

    # game/script.rpy:27714
    old "\"Shiroya's fate is death.\" His prediction hadn't yet become reality."
    new "「Shiroya 注定会死。」他的预言还没有成真。"

    # game/script.rpy:27715
    old "\"If she went to the past, why hasn't she shown herself yet?\" It was a very good question, and one which had already come up a handful of times."
    new "「如果她去了过去，为什么到现在还不现身？」这问题问得极好，而且已经被人提起过好几次了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27716
    old "...{w}Just keep waiting here."
    new "……{w}你就在这儿等着吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:27722
    old "I tried to ignore the insidious atmosphere around me and hesitantly moved to the event room."
    new "我努力不去在意周围那股隐隐作祟的气息，迟疑着走向活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:27730
    old "I lowered the glass of the cabinet. When I placed the Sekimeiya inside, I didn't have to wait long for it to turn white."
    new "我放下展示柜的玻璃罩。把 Sekimeiya 放进去后，没过多久，它就变成了白色。"

    # game/script.rpy:27737
    old "Hello. I just wanted to see what you were doing. I'll be outside this room to make sure you don't do anything with the Sekimeiya. Don't think Shiroya's actions aren't suspicious. I don't want her to come from the other hallway and grab it or something.{w} Don't worry, either. I'll stay in the hallway, and I won't get it out myself."
    new "你好啊。我只是想看看你在做什么。我会守在门外，确保你不会对 Sekimeiya 动什么手脚。别以为 Shiroya 的举动就没有可疑之处。我可不想让她从另一条走廊过来，一把把它抢走之类的。{w}你也不用担心，我会待在走廊里，不会自己去把它拿出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:27744
    old "I looked through the door and saw that Erina hadn't moved, so I didn't have any particular problem."
    new "我透过门望过去，见 Erina 没有动，也就没什么问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:27745
    old "Fine."
    new "随你。"

    # game/script.rpy:27750
    old "...I see you haven't locked the cabinet, huh?"
    new "……看来你没把展示柜锁上啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:27751
    old "We'll deal with that later."
    new "那事以后再说。"

    # game/script.rpy:27757
    old "I disregarded him and walked away. I knew how suspicious I sounded, but I had consciously avoided locking it."
    new "我没有理会他，转身走开。我知道自己这话听着多可疑，可我是有意不去锁的。"

    # game/script.rpy:27758
    old "It was very likely Sai had hidden the key somewhere and could open it anyway. Regardless, I didn't have it, and I wasn't sure if I wanted to activate the Sekimeiya again."
    new "Sai 很可能把钥匙藏在了某处，随时都打得开。何况钥匙本来就不在我手上，而我也说不准自己是否还想再启动一次 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:27759
    old "I had learned the past could be changed in some capacity. Shiroya had also sounded interested in exploring that further. If I locked the cabinet, I would be preventing myself from trying it ever again. Before considering it further, I wanted to find Shiroya and avoid erasing or modifying the version of her I knew."
    new "我已经知道，过去在某种程度上是可以改变的。Shiroya 似乎也有意继续探究这一点。要是我锁上展示柜，就等于断了自己再试一次的路。在进一步考虑之前，我想先找到 Shiroya，避免抹去或改变我所认识的那个她。"

    # game/script.rpy:27769
    old "I resumed the search and went to the storeroom. As expected, it was empty, and the far door hadn't budged."
    new "我重新开始搜索，去了储藏室。不出所料，里面空无一人，尽头那扇门也纹丝未动。"

    # game/script.rpy:27770
    old "If this ends and we don't find her, I'll just give up on the Sekimeiya."
    new "如果到最后还是找不到她，我就放弃 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:27771
    old "If she's not here, all I can hope is that she's outside, waiting."
    new "如果她不在这里，我只能指望她在外面等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:27772
    old "As had often happened, my thoughts derailed to the recording. The people mentioned in it were me, Sai, Akaro, Erina, and Isla."
    new "和之前常有的情况一样，我的思绪又转到了那段录音上。里面提到的人是我、Sai、Akaro、Erina 和 Isla。"

    # game/script.rpy:27773
    old "Isla was debatable, but the rest should've been available. Naomi and Katei had died, so it made sense they hadn't been mentioned. Shiroya didn't seem to be anywhere... Was it all a coincidence?"
    new "Isla 还说不准，但其余几个人当时应该都在。Naomi 和 Katei 已经死了，没被提到也说得通。Shiroya 好像哪儿都不见人影……这一切难道只是巧合？"

    # game/script.rpy:27778
    old "I entered room A5. We'd looked inside every cabinet fairly often, as they were potential hiding spots for people. The only time someone had been in one was that very room..."
    new "我走进水晶展室 A5。我们把每个展示柜都翻看过不少次，因为那都是可能藏人的地方。唯一一次真有人在里面，就是在这间展室……"

    # game/script.rpy:27782
    old "I did the same thing. There was no way Shiroya would be hiding in a cabinet, but I had to make sure no places were ignored. Furthermore, Akaro's disappearance was still up in the air."
    new "我也照做了一遍。Shiroya 不可能藏在展示柜里，但我不能漏掉任何一处。况且，Akaro 的下落至今仍不明。"

    # game/script.rpy:27785
    old "...Isla hadn't changed at all over those hours. Soon, I hoped, she could be brought to a much better place, outside the tower."
    new "……这几个小时里，Isla 一点变化也没有。我希望不久之后，就能把她带到塔外一个更好的地方去。"

    # game/script.rpy:27790
    old "The next few rooms were all empty. Sai hadn't moved from next to the event room, and he shrugged every time he saw that I continued to find nothing."
    new "接下来几间展室都没有人。Sai 一直待在活动室旁没动，每次看到我依旧一无所获，他就耸耸肩。"

    # game/script.rpy:27794
    old "I entered the last crystal room. After it, only the security room would remain."
    new "我走进最后一间水晶展室。剩下的就只有监控室了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27802
    old "The Last Bird"
    new "最后的飞鸟"

    # game/script.rpy:27806
    old "Next to a cabinet was Shiroya. She was leaning on it with a pained face."
    new "Shiroya 就在一个展示柜旁。她靠在展示柜上，一脸痛苦。"

    # game/script.rpy:27812
    old "A-Atsuki...?"
    new "A、Atsuki……？"

    # game/script.rpy:27820
    old "I frantically ran over to her. While I was relieved to see her, she didn't look well."
    new "我慌忙跑到她身边。见到她，我松了口气，可她看上去不太舒服。"

    # game/script.rpy:27821
    old "Are you okay...? What happened?"
    new "你没事吧……？发生什么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:27826
    old "I'm fine, yes... And I... don't know. I don't feel great."
    new "嗯，我没事……至于发生了什么，我……不知道。我有点不舒服。"

    # game/script.rpy:27827
    old "Wh-What? You don't know what happened?"
    new "什、什么？你不知道发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:27833
    old "I knew I heard you talking. Look who it is... What were you doing here?"
    new "我就说听见有人在说话。看看这是谁……你在这里做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:27838
    old "Sorry, my head's been hurting for a while."
    new "抱歉，我的头已经疼了好一会儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27839
    old "Do I look like I care? Why have you been in this room for so long?"
    new "我看上去像在乎吗？你为什么在这房间里待了这么久？"

    # game/script.rpy:27840
    old "I-I suddenly couldn't keep going..."
    new "我、我突然走不动了……"

    # game/script.rpy:27845
    old "Are you two for real? Is this the best you could think of?"
    new "你们两个是认真的吗？就编得出这种说法？"

    # game/script.rpy:27846
    old "Shut the fuck up! We didn't plan any of this!"
    new "闭嘴！这根本不是我们安排的！"

    # game/script.rpy:27847
    old "I'm not stopping. You found the Sekimeiya in the bathroom, right? Then you activated it."
    new "我不会善罢甘休。你们是在洗手间找到 Sekimeiya 的吧？然后就启动了它。"

    # game/script.rpy:27852
    old "Ah... Yes, that's right."
    new "啊……嗯，没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:27857
    old "What happened then?"
    new "后来发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:27862
    old "I don't remember. All I know is that I didn't find anyone, and I rested in this room."
    new "我记不清了。只记得我没找到任何人，就在这间房里歇了一会儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:27863
    old "And you're all right now? You're standing up just fine."
    new "那你现在没事了？看你站得也挺稳的。"

    # game/script.rpy:27864
    old "I just felt dizzy. I'm better now."
    new "只是有点头晕，现在好多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27868
    old "I looked over her body, and a subtle discomfort wormed its way into me. Perhaps I was making it up, but her face looked almost... worn out."
    new "我打量着她的身体，一丝说不清的不安悄悄爬上心头。也许是我多心了，可她的面容看上去几乎有些……憔悴。"

    # game/script.rpy:27874
    old "Well, I guess this means you accomplished whatever you wanted to do, right? I'm very happy to hear it."
    new "这么说，你想做的事已经办成了吧？听你这么说，我真替你高兴。"

    # game/script.rpy:27881
    old "The three of us stepped into hallway A. When Erina saw Shiroya, she approached us."
    new "我们三人走进了 A走廊。Erina 一看到 Shiroya，便朝我们走来。"

    # game/script.rpy:27889
    old "Shiroya... I'm glad you're all right. What happened to you?"
    new "Shiroya……你没事就好。到底出了什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:27895
    old "She chose the \"oh I'm so disoriented I can barely remember anything\" excuse, just like you did earlier. Don't even bother."
    new "她挑的借口是「我迷迷糊糊的，什么都记不清了」，跟你刚才一模一样。省省吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:27900
    old "H-Huh...?"
    new "诶、诶……？"

    # game/script.rpy:27901
    old "Do you only not remember what happened after you touched the Sekimeiya?"
    new "你只是不记得碰过 Sekimeiya 之后发生的事？"

    # game/script.rpy:27902
    old "I think so... Before that, we were waiting in the lobby, until I had to go to the bathroom."
    new "应该是……在那之前，我们一直在大堂等着，后来我去了趟洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:27903
    old "I see. Do you not know where the dizziness came from?"
    new "原来如此。你不知道头晕是怎么来的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:27908
    old "...{w}I don't know..."
    new "……{w}我不知道……"

    # game/script.rpy:27910
    old "I had no clue what to think. She looked sad; that was all I could perceive. Maybe she'd been attacked or had an accident. ...Perhaps it was an effect of the Sekimeiya."
    new "我完全不知道该作何感想。我只看得出来，她很难过。也许她遭到了袭击，也许是出了什么意外。……又或许，这是 Sekimeiya 造成的。"

    # game/script.rpy:27911
    old "Then, the sadness faded away, and in its place came a gentle smile."
    new "随后，那份哀伤淡了下去，取而代之的是一抹温和的笑容。"

    # game/script.rpy:27916
    old "Don't worry, I'm okay. There's not a lot of time left, right?"
    new "别担心，我没事。剩下的时间不多了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:27924
    old "It's {time=20:37.}"
    new "现在是 {time=20:37.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:27925
    old "See... It's almost time."
    new "你看……时间快到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:27926
    old "...Can you come here for a second?"
    new "……能过来一下吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:27931
    old "Y-Yes."
    new "好、好的。"

    # game/script.rpy:27937
    old "What, going to go rub your hands together now that your plan has succeeded?"
    new "怎么，计划得逞了，现在要去搓手庆祝了？"

    # game/script.rpy:27938
    old "What plan, Sai? Do you think we did this to find the Sekimeiya you didn't want us to find?{w} You understand that doesn't make any sense, right? She found it in the bathroom. What's the point of forcing a search to find it if she already identified where it was?"
    new "什么计划，Sai？你觉得我们做这些，是为了找出你不想让我们找到的 Sekimeiya？{w} 你自己也明白这说不通吧？她是在洗手间里发现它的。既然她已经确定了它在哪儿，那还强行搜查做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:27944
    old "...{w}Why is she faking, then?"
    new "……{w}那她为什么要装？"

    # game/script.rpy:27949
    old "I'm not. My head really doesn't feel good."
    new "我没装。我的头真的很难受。"

    # game/script.rpy:27951
    old "...I was ecstatic that we'd be able to stop dealing with Sai relatively soon. I sighed and walked back, bringing Shiroya to hallway C."
    new "……一想到很快就不用再跟 Sai 打交道，我心里就说不出的痛快。我叹了口气，转身带着 Shiroya 往 C走廊走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:27966
    old "Do you remember what we talked about before waiting in the lobby?"
    new "还记得我们在大堂等着的时候说过什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:27972
    old "I said the past could be changed, remember?"
    new "我说过，过去是可以改变的，记得吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:27977
    old "O-Oh, yes. But we didn't find the Sekimeiya in that locker, where it should've been."
    new "啊、对。可那个储物柜里本该有 Sekimeiya 的，我们却没找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:27978
    old "Yeah.{w} You traveled through time. Do you think you might've changed anything?"
    new "嗯。{w}你穿越过时间。你觉得有没有可能改变过什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:27983
    old "I really don't think so."
    new "我觉得真的没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:27984
    old "Well, right now, the Sekimeiya's in the cabinet, but I didn't lock it. There's only about thirty minutes left, but we can still use it."
    new "现在 Sekimeiya 就在展示柜里，不过我没上锁。只剩三十分钟左右了，但我们还来得及用。"

    # game/script.rpy:27990
    old "We might be able to change the past. If we travel together, we'll keep our memories of this reality. I'm not sure how it works yet, but I thought of something.{w} Sai's definitely suspicious of us, so I doubt he'll let us just waltz on in and take the Sekimeiya. Obviously, given the time left, it's very unlikely we'll go back far enough even if the Sekimeiya stores energy the whole time."
    new "我们或许能改变过去。只要一起穿越，我们就会保留这个现实的记忆。具体原理我还没弄明白，不过我想到了一个办法。{w}Sai 肯定在怀疑我们，他不可能就这么让我们大摇大摆地进去拿走 Sekimeiya。再说以剩下的时间来看，就算 Sekimeiya 一直在蓄能，我们也不可能回到足够远的过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:27996
    old "It could be a start, though. We'd go decently far into the past. Fifteen minutes sent me twenty minutes back, so every minute stored adds more than a minute."
    new "不过这至少能算个开头。我们能回到相当远的过去。蓄能十五分钟，让我回到了二十分钟前——也就是说，每蓄一分钟，回到的时间就不止一分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:27997
    old "By which I mean, we could go more than thirty minutes into the past and change it in a way so that we can begin storing time at the point we arrive. If we repeat this, we'll go even farther, and we'll be able to store a lot more time."
    new "我的意思是，我们可以回到三十多分钟前，在那里做出改变，好让我们一到达就开始蓄能。这样反复几次，就能越走越远，能蓄的时间也会越来越多。"

    # game/script.rpy:27998
    old "I'm not sure it'd work, but even though we can currently only store thirty minutes, we can keep doing this to maybe keep going back more and more."
    new "能不能成我也不敢保证，但现在我们一次只能蓄三十分钟，只要照这样重复下去，说不定就能一次次回到更早。"

    # game/script.rpy:28000
    old "How do we store thirty minutes without Sai noticing? I feel like this is feasible.{w} Remember how the cabinet works? We could unplug the cord, which would stop the temperature regulation."
    new "怎么才能瞒过 Sai 蓄满三十分钟？我觉得这事可行。{w}还记得展示柜的原理吗？只要拔掉电源线，温度调节就会停下。"

    # game/script.rpy:28001
    old "Then, even though it'd look normal, it'd actually be storing power. We can hide it in plain sight like that and activate it at the last second..."
    new "这样一来，它表面上看一切正常，实际上却在蓄能。我们可以就这样把它藏在明面上，等到最后一刻再启动……"

    # game/script.rpy:28007
    old "...N-No, let's not."
    new "……不、不要，还是算了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28008
    old "...{w}You don't want to try it...?"
    new "……{w}你不想试试吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:28009
    old "I don't. Everything is fine as it is right now."
    new "不想。现在这样已经很好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28010
    old "But...{w} we'll regret it. If we don't even try it, the time will come when we'll hate not having tried it."
    new "可是……{w}我们会后悔的。要是连试都不试，总有一天会恨自己当初为什么没试。"

    # game/script.rpy:28015
    old "No... That won't happen."
    new "不会的……不会有那一天。"

    # game/script.rpy:28016
    old "Why? That's not how you reacted the first time I proposed changing the past."
    new "为什么？我第一次提出改变过去的时候，你可不是这个反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:28021
    old "I know... I just thought about it more.{w} Let's wait until the time is up. We can end everything now.{w} We've been here for too long... I just want to get out.{w} Believe me, there's no need to do anything else."
    new "我知道……我只是又多想了一会儿。{w} 等到时间结束吧。我们现在就可以把一切做个了结。{w} 我们在这里待得太久了……我只想离开。{w} 相信我，没有必要再做别的了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28024
    old "I really didn't get it. I couldn't blame her for saying that, but every word felt distant."
    new "我实在不明白。她那样说，我怪不得她，可她的每一句话都显得那么遥远。"

    # game/script.rpy:28025
    old "...We just have to accept that Miiya died. Let's do what we said and try to be strong despite it."
    new "……我们只能接受 Miiya 已经死了。照我们说好的做吧，尽量坚强地撑过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:28026
    old "I know that Miiya died, but we can prevent it...!"
    new "我知道 Miiya 已经死了，可我们明明可以阻止这件事……！"

    # game/script.rpy:28031
    old "No. Let's stop, please..."
    new "不。到此为止吧，求你了……"

    # game/script.rpy:28032
    old "...Tell me, at least. Why did you change your mind?"
    new "……至少告诉我，你为什么改变主意了？"

    # game/script.rpy:28037
    old "...{w}To tell you the truth, I'm not even sure I'd want to do it even if we could."
    new "……{w}说实话，就算真能做到，我也说不准自己还想不想做。"

    # game/script.rpy:28038
    old "What does that mean...?"
    new "这是什么意思……？"

    # game/script.rpy:28043
    old "Most importantly, I just want to leave this place. We have to keep going with what we've got, and I'm sure it'll be fine.{w} This isn't a world where Miiya survives, so let's keep living the best we can."
    new "最重要的是，我只想离开这里。我们只能靠手头这些继续走下去，我相信不会有事的。{w} 这不是 Miiya 能活下来的世界，我们就尽力活下去吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:28044
    old "What the hell was up with that change of philosophy? I was too lost to know if I agreed at all."
    new "她这套想法怎么突然就变了？我完全摸不着头脑，根本不知道自己到底赞不赞成。"

    # game/script.rpy:28047
    old "However, I knew one thing. I also wanted to get out, and Shiroya was safe. ...Saving Miiya had been something of a dream rather than an actual goal. The main thing, the definitely achievable thing, was leaving with Shiroya, and it finally seemed within reach."
    new "不过，有一件事我很清楚。我也想离开，而 Shiroya 是安全的。……救 Miiya 与其说是实际目标，不如说更像一个梦。真正要紧、也确定能做到的，是和 Shiroya 一起离开，而这件事终于近在眼前了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28048
    old "Are you sure? I know it sounds like a stretch, but I still think my idea is worth considering."
    new "你确定吗？我知道这听起来有些勉强，但我还是觉得我的主意值得考虑。"

    # game/script.rpy:28049
    old "...I am, yes."
    new "……嗯，我确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:28050
    old "What about the Sekimeiya? Do you not want to try using it again?"
    new "那 Sekimeiya 呢？你不想再试着用它了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28055
    old "I definitely don't. I have no idea what will happen with it, but let's forget it exists if we can."
    new "绝对不想。我不知道再用它会发生什么，但能忘了它的存在就忘了吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:28058
    old "That was the end, then. I tried to think of something else to say to her, but I found nothing. If that was the life she wanted to keep living, opposing it would have been a breach of our friendship."
    new "那么，事情就到此为止了。我试着想些别的话对她说，却什么也想不出来。如果那是她想继续走下去的路，我若反对，反倒像是辜负了我们的情谊。"

    # game/script.rpy:28061
    old "What confused me was her change of heart. She'd been wanting to use the Sekimeiya to save Miiya up until it had actually become remotely possible..."
    new "让我困惑的是她的转变。她一直想用 Sekimeiya 救 Miiya，直到这件事终于有了一丝可能……"

    # game/script.rpy:28062
    old "What reason could there have been to not want to attempt it? Was she not fond of the idea of changing the cards we'd been dealt?"
    new "究竟是什么理由让她不愿尝试？难道她并不想改变命运发给我们的这副牌吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28063
    old "It had been a focus of my thoughts the entire day. Was I really going to give up so easily?"
    new "这件事我想了一整天。难道我真的就要这样轻易放弃吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28064
    old "I glanced at Shiroya's expression, which told me how serious she was. I could only be saddened and maybe a little disappointed, but logically speaking, I hadn't lost anything. Miiya was already dead before we went to the tower, and the reason we'd entered was to begin moving past it."
    new "我瞥了一眼 Shiroya 的神情，看得出她是认真的。我难免难过，或许还有些失望，可理智地说，我并没有失去什么。我们去塔之前，Miiya 就已经死了；我们进塔，本就是为了开始接受这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:28066
    old "...Let's go back to the lobby."
    new "……回大厅吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:28082
    old "The large room was empty. Shiroya walked up to the spot where we'd been sitting and returned to her previous position. I sat at her side, recalling the events we'd gone through. All my own recent experiences felt surreal, but I knew they had truly happened."
    new "宽敞的房间里空无一人。Shiroya 走到我们先前坐过的地方，回到原来的位置。我在她身旁坐下，回想我们经历的一切。最近发生在我身上的事都显得很不真实，但我清楚，它们确实发生过。"

    # game/script.rpy:28086
    old "I wonder where Erina and Sai went..."
    new "不知道 Erina 和 Sai 去哪儿了……"

    # game/script.rpy:28087
    old "Even if they're up to something, we just have to wait here."
    new "就算他们在打什么主意，我们也只能在这里等。"

    # game/script.rpy:28088
    old "Right..."
    new "是啊……"

    # game/script.rpy:28099
    old "However, Erina soon arrived from hallway B."
    new "不过，Erina 很快从 B走廊过来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28100
    old "...Here you are. I lost track of Sai at some point. Have you seen him?"
    new "……你们在这儿啊。我不知什么时候把 Sai 跟丢了。你们见到他了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28106
    old "I don't know where he is, then..."
    new "那我就不知道他去哪儿了……"

    # game/script.rpy:28110
    old "I saw her staring at the mechanical room. When I did, I also felt like something about it had changed. It hadn't been fully closed before, had it?"
    new "我看见她正盯着机械室。顺着她的目光看去，我也觉得那里似乎有什么变了。之前那扇门并没有完全关上，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:28111
    old "She looked away and came to sit by our side."
    new "她移开视线，来到我们旁边坐下。"

    # game/script.rpy:28115
    old "There's not much time left, right?"
    new "没剩多少时间了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:28116
    old "Less than half an hour."
    new "不到半小时了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28118
    old "Those twelve hours had felt so much longer. It was hard to believe they were coming to an end and that we could resume our normal lives after everything."
    new "那十二个小时显得漫长得多。很难相信这一切就要结束了，也很难相信经历这么多之后，我们还能回到原本的生活。"

    # game/script.rpy:28119
    old "There was nothing more to be said—not from someone as tired as me. I tried not to think about Sai and focused instead on keeping my mind blank."
    new "已经没什么可说的了——至少像我这样疲惫的人说不出什么。我尽量不去想 Sai，只让脑子保持一片空白。"

    # game/script.rpy:28123
    old "...We won't actually get out, right?"
    new "……我们其实出不去，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:28125
    old "We'll stay here for more than a month, won't we?"
    new "我们会在这里待上一个多月，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:28126
    old "There's no way. The exit will definitely open soon."
    new "不可能。出口很快就会开的。"

    # game/script.rpy:28127
    old "How can that be, though? In a month, Isla will be alive here, and I haven't saved her yet. If the shutter opens, that'll become impossible."
    new "可这怎么可能？一个月后，Isla 会在这里活着，而我还没救她。如果闸门打开，那就再也不可能了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28128
    old "...Every time similar things came out of her mouth, I went quiet. How was I supposed to answer that? I still didn't know what had happened to Erina, but her personality had noticeably shifted at one point. She hadn't yet recovered from her sedated appearance."
    new "……每次她说出类似的话，我都会沉默。那种话我该怎么回答？我仍不知道 Erina 身上发生过什么，但她的性格确实在某个时候明显变了。她还没有从麻醉后的那副样子里恢复过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:28129
    old "I know it might sound shallow, but it'll be fine.{w} If Isla is fated to be alive in the future, she will be no matter what you do. You'll see her again, right? That's what the recording predicted. Now, you just have to wait until that happens."
    new "我知道这话听起来可能很空泛，但会没事的。{w} 如果 Isla 注定在未来还活着，那不管你做什么，她都会活着。你还会再见到她，对吧？录音里就是这么预测的。现在，你只要等到那一天就好。"

    # game/script.rpy:28130
    old "...Do I have to wait a month to see her, then?"
    new "……那我得等上一个月才能见到她吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28134
    old "I couldn't get a read on Shiroya. Was she just trying to be optimistic to calm her down...?"
    new "我摸不透 Shiroya 的心思。她只是想表现得乐观些，好让 Erina 安心吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:28135
    old "Or was she actually considering that what we'd heard in the recording would occur in the future? I didn't think that was it—she also seemed to believe we were just about to leave the tower."
    new "还是说她真的认为，录音里那些话会在未来应验？我觉得不是——她似乎也相信我们马上就要离开塔了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28142
    old "Erina tried to accept what she'd heard, but after a couple minutes, it became clear that she couldn't be content with that alone."
    new "Erina 试着接受听到的话，可几分钟后，我清楚地看出，光是这样她没法安心。"

    # game/script.rpy:28143
    old "...I'll go find Sai. I don't like thinking about what he might be doing."
    new "……我去找 Sai。我不愿去想他可能在做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:28145
    old "At this point, why aren't we doing more than doubting him? There's been a culprit among us the whole time. Now, only four of us are left, and we didn't find Akaro. It can only be him, right?{w} Of us, he's the only one missing. I think he disappeared on purpose. I need to find him."
    new "都到这一步了，我们为什么除了怀疑他，就什么都不做？一直以来，犯人就在我们当中。如今只剩下四个人，偏偏找不到 Akaro。除了他还能是谁？{w}我们这些人里，只有他不见了。我觉得他是故意消失的。我必须找到他。"

    # game/script.rpy:28149
    old "She walked back to hallway B without giving us time to answer."
    new "她没等我们答话，便转身走回了 B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:28150
    old "Shiroya and I looked at each other, hesitant to react. We'd agreed to wait until {time=21:05}, so Erina's abrupt departure wasn't enough to disrupt that."
    new "我和 Shiroya 对视一眼，一时都没有动作。我们说好要等到 {time=21:05}，所以 Erina 忽然离开，也不足以让我们改变计划。"

    # game/script.rpy:28151
    old "I didn't like the thought of letting her and Sai both run free, but I let it go."
    new "一想到要放任她和 Sai 各自行动，我心里就不舒服，但最后还是算了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28161
    old "We were alone, and time kept passing. Three or four minutes later, Shiroya spoke."
    new "只剩我们两个人，时间一点点过去。三四分钟后，Shiroya 开口了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28165
    old "...{w}Hm..."
    new "……{w}嗯……"

    # game/script.rpy:28167
    old "...{w}How much time is left? Less than twenty minutes, right?"
    new "……{w}还剩多少时间？不到二十分钟了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:28169
    old "...{w}{w=0.7}Oh, I see."
    new "……{w}{w=0.7}哦，原来如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:28172
    old "Sorry, it's all fine. Ignore me."
    new "抱歉，没什么事。别在意。"

    # game/script.rpy:28173
    old "...{w}Wh-What?"
    new "……{w}怎、怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:28176
    old "I'm not going to ignore you. What is it?"
    new "我可不会当作没听见。到底怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:28178
    old "I was just a bit confused. It's nothing important."
    new "只是我有点想不通。不是什么要紧事。"

    # game/script.rpy:28179
    old "I was almost speechless. I didn't like agreeing with Sai, but I had to. Something about Shiroya wasn't right."
    new "我一时说不出话来。我不愿认同 Sai 的说法，却又不得不承认。Shiroya 身上确实有哪里不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:28180
    old "The convenient loss of memory, the sudden appearance in that room... She'd also changed completely when I'd mentioned using the Sekimeiya again and contradicted her own past self."
    new "恰巧失忆，又突然出现在那间房里……还有，当我提到再次使用 Sekimeiya 时，她的态度截然不同，甚至否定了过去的自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:28181
    old "Oh... You're still here?"
    new "哦……你们还在这儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:28187
    old "Yeah. Did you find Sai?"
    new "是啊。你找到 Sai 了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28188
    old "N-No.{w} Sorry to ask like this, but what time is it?"
    new "没、没有。{w}抱歉突然这么问，现在几点了？"

    # game/script.rpy:28189
    old "...{w}I'm sorry?"
    new "……{w}抱歉，你说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:28190
    old "It should be {time=20:50} soon."
    new "应该快到 {time=20:50} 了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28195
    old "...{w}R-Really...? Okay."
    new "……{w}真、真的吗……？好。"

    # game/script.rpy:28196
    old "This is starting to get ridiculous. What is up with you two?"
    new "这越来越离谱了。你们两个到底怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:28202
    old "I don't understand... Maybe you were right, Shiroya. We'll wait..."
    new "我不明白……也许你说得对，Shiroya。我们等着吧……"

    # game/script.rpy:28206
    old "Erina made her way to where she'd been sitting, but there was only so much I could ignore."
    new "Erina 回到原先坐着的地方，可我再也没法装作没看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:28207
    old "What the hell did you just do? \"What time is it\"? You might as well have said \"I just used the Sekimeiya, how far back did I go?\" right to my face."
    new "你到底做了什么？『现在几点了』？你这话，简直就等于当着我的面说『我刚用了 Sekimeiya，回到了多久以前』。"

    # game/script.rpy:28213
    old "She'd come from hallway B, so that was where I went. Shiroya and Erina followed me without saying anything."
    new "她是从 B走廊过来的，我便往那边走去。Shiroya 和 Erina 一言不发地跟在我身后。"

    # game/script.rpy:28221
    old "...And the Sekimeiya's not here. You didn't even put it back?"
    new "……而且 Sekimeiya 也不在这里。你连放都没放回去？"

    # game/script.rpy:28223
    old "You're wrong... I didn't do this."
    new "你误会了……不是我做的。"

    # game/script.rpy:28224
    old "Why did you ask for the time, then?"
    new "那你为什么要问时间？"

    # game/script.rpy:28225
    old "To know how much time was left."
    new "我想知道还剩多少时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:28227
    old "I'm telling the truth. I went to search for Sai, but I couldn't find him. I only meant to ask how much time I'd been gone."
    new "我说的是真的。我去找 Sai，但没找到他。我只是想问一下自己离开了多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:28231
    old "I closed the glass.{w} Erina had been gone for about five minutes. If she had actually traveled, a version of her that was still to touch the Sekimeiya existed somewhere."
    new "我合上了玻璃罩。{w}Erina 离开了大约五分钟。如果她真的穿越了，那么某个地方一定还有一个尚未触碰 Sekimeiya 的她。"

    # game/script.rpy:28232
    old "...Was everyone just a liar? She could've traveled, but Sai could've also easily hidden it himself. I hadn't locked the cabinet, so I didn't know what had happened."
    new "……难道每个人都在说谎？她可能真的穿越了，但也可能是 Sai 自己把它藏了起来。展示柜我没有上锁，究竟发生了什么，我无从得知。"

    # game/script.rpy:28233
    old "I felt disconcerted, frustrated, and even wary of Shiroya, who might've been hiding something from me."
    new "我心里发慌，烦躁不安，甚至对 Shiroya 起了戒心——她也许有什么事瞒着我。"

    # game/script.rpy:28243
    old "I noticed the brief instant in which Erina's expression showed surprise. She was still in hallway B, staring at her left."
    new "我注意到 Erina 脸上闪过一丝惊讶。她还站在 B 走廊里，盯着自己的左边。"

    # game/script.rpy:28244
    old "Did you see something?"
    new "你看到什么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:28253
    old "I walked up to her, but I found nothing that stood out in the hallway."
    new "我走到她身边，可走廊里并没有什么引人注意的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:28254
    old "I didn't see anything."
    new "我什么都没看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:28261
    old "I was getting mad. I wanted to get out with Shiroya more than anything, so what was with her continued silence?"
    new "我有些恼火。我最想的就是和 Shiroya 一起离开这里，她却一直沉默不语，这算什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:28262
    old "Do we just ignore this, then? Do we think the police can understand even a shred of what happened here?"
    new "那我们就这么视而不见？你觉得警察能搞明白这里发生的一丝一毫吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28264
    old "Or do we use these last minutes to find Sai and the Sekimeiya? If he took it, he must have something in mind, and as much as I want to get out, I'm not fond of letting him do as he pleases."
    new "还是说，用这最后几分钟去找 Sai 和 Sekimeiya？若是他拿走的，那他一定另有打算——我虽然一心想出去，却也不愿任由他为所欲为。"

    # game/script.rpy:28269
    old "Y-Yes... Maybe we should search for him."
    new "是、是啊……也许该去找找他。"

    # game/script.rpy:28275
    old "Search complete. You all did an amazing job this time."
    new "搜查结束。这次各位都干得很出色。"

    # game/script.rpy:28281
    old "Ah!"
    new "啊！"

    # game/script.rpy:28282
    old "Sai's face peeked in from hallway B, the lobby side."
    new "Sai 的脸从 B 走廊靠大厅那一侧探了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:28290
    old "Did I hear that the Sekimeiya's gone? We should've counted every time it happened since the start. What's this, the twelfth?"
    new "我是不是听说 Sekimeiya 不见了？我们早该从一开始就把每一次都数清楚。这回是第几次了，第十二次？"

    # game/script.rpy:28291
    old "And none of them were your doing, right?"
    new "而这些事，没一件是你干的，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:28296
    old "Not a single one. Of course, none of you did it this time either, right?"
    new "一件都没有。当然，这次你们谁也没动手，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:28298
    old "This sneaky Sekimeiya must keep teleporting away, making us doubt each other when, in reality, none of us would do something so dishonest as lying or taking it ourselves."
    new "这个狡猾的 Sekimeiya 一定是自己不停传送跑掉的，好让我们互相猜疑——可实际上，我们谁也不会做那种撒谎、偷拿东西的不光彩事。"

    # game/script.rpy:28299
    old "And you never chased us with a knife, right?"
    new "你也没拿刀追过我们，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:28301
    old "Did that happen? It's {time=20:51.} Let's go to the lobby."
    new "有这回事？现在 {time=20:51.}，去大厅吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:28302
    old "I'm being serious. You did try to kill me, and I still don't even know why."
    new "我是认真的。你确实想杀我，而我到现在都不知道为什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:28307
    old "Atsuki, are you stupid? How would I get a knife? There's no place to hide one, right?"
    new "Atsuki，你脑子没事吧？我上哪儿弄刀去？这里根本没有能藏刀的地方，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:28308
    old "That Sai was not the same one I'd punched. I clenched my fist, ready to do it for the first time again."
    new "这个 Sai 并不是我打过的那个人。我攥紧拳头，打算再像第一次那样给他一拳。"

    # game/script.rpy:28311
    old "Are you sure you didn't imagine it? I'm not stupid enough to kill someone, and there's no knife I could've used."
    new "你确定不是自己臆想出来的？我还不至于蠢到去杀人，况且我根本没有刀可用。"

    # game/script.rpy:28313
    old "I glanced at Shiroya's purse and gestured at her to open it."
    new "我瞥了一眼 Shiroya 的手提包，示意她打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:28318
    old "...Huh?{w} ...O-Oh."
    new "……哎？{w}……啊、哦。"

    # game/script.rpy:28320
    old "She unzipped it and showed me its contents."
    new "她拉开拉链，把包里的东西给我看。"

    # game/script.rpy:28322
    old "...{w}Where is it?"
    new "……{w}刀呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:28327
    old "...I don't know."
    new "……我不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:28328
    old "The knife wasn't there. She had traveled again, which might have gotten rid of it."
    new "刀不在。她又穿越了一次，也许正是这样才把刀弄没了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28333
    old "I'm sure the police will do a great job at figuring out what happened. Now, let's wait in the lobby."
    new "我相信警察一定能查清到底发生了什么。好了，我们去大厅等着吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:28342
    old "I went to hallway A. Someone had hidden the Sekimeiya one last time, right before the exit would open. I had no idea what purpose that served, but there had to be one."
    new "我去了 A走廊。有人在出口打开前，最后一次把 Sekimeiya 藏了起来。我不知道这么做有什么意义，但一定有原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:28346
    old "I walked up to the storeroom. Every time the Sekimeiya was hidden, we were able to find it. The last few minutes we had were enough to do it one more time."
    new "我走到储藏室前。每次 Sekimeiya 被藏起来，我们都找得到。剩下的几分钟，足够我们再找一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:28348
    old "You want to spend the remaining time doing this shit again? Go ahead."
    new "你又想把剩下的时间花在这种破事上？随你。"

    # game/script.rpy:28352
    old "I would. Once I felt the storeroom was empty, I moved on to the crystal room A5."
    new "我确实这么做了。断定储藏室里没有之后，我便转向水晶展室 A5。"

    # game/script.rpy:28355
    old "I'd hoped I wouldn't have to see Isla's face again, but there was no helping it."
    new "我本希望不必再见到 Isla，可这也是没办法的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:28360
    old "I kept going from room to room, meeting Sai's sneer in between. Behind him were Shiroya and Erina, completely neutral and unhelpful."
    new "我一间间找下去，不时撞见 Sai 那副讥笑。他身后是 Shiroya 和 Erina，两人面无表情，也不帮什么忙。"

    # game/script.rpy:28366
    old "I got to the security room and was assaulted by the stench of death again."
    new "到了监控室，那股死亡的气味又一次扑面而来。"

    # game/script.rpy:28370
    old "The computer screens were suspended, so I pressed a key to light them up, trying not to step on all the blood. The time displayed was {time=20:55}, which matched Sai's."
    new "电脑屏幕都黑着，我按了个键把它们点亮，同时尽量不踩到满地血迹。屏幕上显示的时间是 {time=20:55}，和 Sai 说的一致。"

    # game/script.rpy:28372
    old "Most of the drawers were filled with papers I'd never bothered to read. Something that caught my attention was that one was full of batteries, but they were too packed for the Sekimeiya to be in any of them. I looked inside the suitcase, but it was still empty."
    new "大多数抽屉塞满了我从没心思去读的文件。引起我注意的是，其中一个抽屉装满了电池，但塞得太紧，Sekimeiya 不可能藏在里面。我又看了看行李箱，里面依旧空无一物。"

    # game/script.rpy:28378
    old "However, before I left, I kneeled beside Katei's body. Under the desk was the computer tower. To look behind it, I held my breath and crawled up to it."
    new "不过离开前，我在 Katei 的尸体旁跪下。桌下放着电脑主机。为了看清主机后面，我屏住呼吸爬了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:28386
    old "There it was. The Sekimeiya glowed white, contrasting the obscured space between the desk and the wall."
    new "找到了。Sekimeiya 泛着白光，在书桌与墙壁之间那片昏暗里格外醒目。"

    # game/script.rpy:28390
    old "Making sure not to touch it with my skin, I dragged it out. It was scorching, so I had to hold it with the bottom of my shirt to leave the room with it."
    new "我小心不让皮肤碰到它，把它拖了出来。它烫得厉害，我只好用衬衫下摆裹着，才把它带出房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:28400
    old "...{w}You did it. Happy now?"
    new "……{w}你找到了。满意了？"

    # game/script.rpy:28408
    old "I made my way past the three and put it in the cabinet. Without a second thought, I locked it."
    new "我从三人身旁走过，把它放进展示柜，想都没想就上了锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:28415
    old "Given how hot it had been, Erina had some credibility. If she had just traveled from the future, the Sekimeiya shouldn't have been that hot, and she could no longer travel after our current point—the Sekimeiya would stay locked away until the police came. Knowing her actions could've altered reality, though, it wasn't for certain."
    new "从它烫成那样来看，Erina 的话有几分可信。如果她真是刚从未来穿越而来，Sekimeiya 不该这么烫；而过了我们当前的时间点，她再也无法穿越——Sekimeiya 会一直锁在那里，直到警察赶来。不过，她的举动有可能改变过现实，所以这也说不准。"

    # game/script.rpy:28416
    old "I don't know what you hoped to accomplish, but there you go. Now we can wait. Is that a problem for you?"
    new "我不知道你图什么，不过就这样吧。现在可以等了。这碍着你什么了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28421
    old "Not at all. Why would it be?{w} Oh, you still think I hid the Sekimeiya myself. Now you can see you're wrong. Let's go to the lobby, as I've been saying."
    new "当然不会。能有什么问题？{w}哦，你还以为是我把 Sekimeiya 藏起来的吧。现在你该明白自己错了。就像我一直说的，去大厅吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:28422
    old "...{w}All right."
    new "……{w}好吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:28433
    old "The four of us left the Sekimeiya behind and entered the lobby. In less than ten minutes, the metal shutter was supposed to open."
    new "我们四人把 Sekimeiya 留在原处，走进大厅。不到十分钟，金属卷帘门就该打开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28440
    old "We approached where we'd been sitting and reclaimed our places. Everything had been set up for our departure."
    new "我们回到先前坐的地方，各自归位。一切都已为离开准备好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28441
    old "I glanced at the three people next to me. Sai looked indifferent, while Erina appeared serious. At my right, I began to think Shiroya was a little tense."
    new "我扫了一眼身旁的三人。Sai 一脸漠然，Erina 神情严肃。至于我右边的 Shiroya，我渐渐觉得她有些紧绷。"

    # game/script.rpy:28442
    old "...{w}Hm? ...Is anything wrong?"
    new "……{w}嗯？……有什么事吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28443
    old "I don't know. Are you looking forward to leaving?"
    new "说不上来。你盼着出去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28444
    old "...Yes, I can't wait."
    new "……嗯，我已经等不及了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28446
    old "Her melancholic tone took me aback, leaving me without a reply."
    new "她语气里的那抹忧郁让我一怔，竟一时不知如何作答。"

    # game/script.rpy:28452
    old "Three people had died, and Akaro had vanished. Was he somehow still in the tower? It seemed that only four of us were minutes away from feeling the cold air rolling off the mountains."
    new "已经有三个人死了，Akaro 也消失了。他会不会还在塔里？看样子，再过几分钟，能感受到山间冷风的就只剩我们四个人了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28453
    old "Shiroya and I first entered the lobby when the night sky was above us, and in a few minutes, we would hopefully see it again. The countdown was leading toward the result of a battle only a few of us were aware of—what we'd been told about the alarm versus the recording we'd heard."
    new "我和 Shiroya 走进大厅时，头顶还是夜空，再过几分钟，但愿我们还能重新见到它。倒计时正指向一场较量的结果，而知道这场较量的只有我们几个人——一边是关于警报的那套说法，另一边是我们亲耳听到的录音。"

    # game/script.rpy:28454
    old "In just a few minutes, one would win. It would not take much time for us to become aware of our fate."
    new "只需再过几分钟，其中一方就会胜出。用不了多久，我们便会知晓自己的命运。"

    # game/script.rpy:28455
    old "Sai was the only remaining person who hadn't heard the recording and fittingly looked the most carefree. Perhaps he'd soon understand that his future was much more grim than expected."
    new "Sai 是唯一还没听过那段录音的人，看上去也恰好是最无忧无虑的那个。也许他很快就会明白，自己的未来远比预想的黯淡。"

    # game/script.rpy:28456
    old "Erina had lost her daughter and a fair chunk of her sanity. Understanding her thoughts had, at one point, become an impossible task, and I wasn't sure what she was hoping would happen next."
    new "Erina 失去了女儿，也失去了相当一部分理智。揣摩她的心思，早已成了不可能的事，我也说不准她接下来期盼着什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:28457
    old "One thing was certain: during those twelve hours, we hadn't figured anything out. There were too many things left unexplained—things that had eluded me and would most likely continue to do so."
    new "有一点可以肯定：那十二个小时里，我们什么也没弄明白。太多事悬而未解——那些事我始终弄不明白，而且多半会一直如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:28460
    old "Miiya wouldn't come back to life despite the inexplicable mentions of her. People had died for incomprehensible reasons. We'd been granted access to a time travel device and gotten nothing out of it."
    new "不管那些关于 Miiya 的提及多么令人费解，她终究不会复活。有人死于无法理解的原因。我们得到了接触时间穿越装置的机会，却一无所获。"

    # game/script.rpy:28461
    old "Even just minutes previously, the Sekimeiya had been hidden, and I had no idea why. I could barely grasp most of the day's events and definitely couldn't understand some others at all."
    new "就在几分钟前，Sekimeiya 还藏得好好的，我却不知道缘由。这一天发生的事，我大多只能勉强理解，还有一些则全然摸不着头脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:28462
    old "The inevitable outcome was right around the corner. The Sekimeiya had been part of murder cases and the smoke attack. It would soon make its way into the world, potentially leading to drastic changes."
    new "无可避免的结局近在眼前。Sekimeiya 牵涉进了那几起命案，还有那场烟雾袭击。它很快就要流入世间，说不定会引发剧变。"

    # game/script.rpy:28463
    old "Why had an object capable of time travel been in Ashiya Tower?"
    new "一件能够穿越时间的物品，为什么会出现在芦屋塔里？"

    # game/script.rpy:28464
    old "Thinking about the time we'd stepped into the building... We'd done that looking to overcome loss. Maybe that part had gone well."
    new "回想我们走进这栋大楼的时候……我们来此，是为了从失去中走出来。也许这一点，我们算是做到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28465
    old "Before that day, Shiroya had barely spoken for a week. Next to me, not much of that taciturn person remained... but I felt I understood her less than before."
    new "那天之前，Shiroya 整整一个星期几乎没怎么开口。此刻坐在我身边的她，那份沉默寡言已所剩无几……可我却觉得自己比从前更看不懂她了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28467
    old "In the past, I had never questioned her. I'd thought we'd known each other perfectly. That very thought was what allowed me to trust her even then, despite the oddness that seemed to emanate from her."
    new "从前，我从未怀疑过她。我以为我们彼此完全了解。正是这个念头，让我即便在她身上透出异样的时候，也仍然愿意相信她。"

    # game/script.rpy:28473
    old "What's the time?"
    new "现在几点了？"

    # game/script.rpy:28474
    old "...{time=21:00.} Only these last five minutes are left."
    new "……{time=21:00.}只剩最后五分钟了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28475
    old "No sound was coming through the shutter, but many people were surely on the other side of it. Police, Ashiya, and even townspeople. As soon as they saw Erina's bloody clothes, they would begin to understand what we had gone through."
    new "卷帘门那边没有传来任何声响，但门外一定挤着不少人。警察、芦屋，甚至镇上的居民。只要他们看到 Erina 那身血衣，就会渐渐明白我们经历了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:28476
    old "We'd probably be interrogated. We would become murder suspects, but we'd also see the streets of Yushibana again. After that, we'd be released, and Shiroya and I could go back home."
    new "我们大概会被审问。我们会成为杀人嫌疑人，但也会重新见到丰花的街道。之后我们会被放出来，我和 Shiroya 就能回家了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28477
    old "I didn't know what to expect in that regard. I'd never thought about it, but perhaps some people knew about the existence of the Sekimeiya, and once we showed our knowledge of it, we'd become a threat..."
    new "那方面会怎样，我也说不准。我从没想过这件事，但或许有些人知道 Sekimeiya 的存在；一旦我们表现出对它的了解，就会成为威胁……"

    # game/script.rpy:28478
    old "Or would the police not believe a word we said? It wasn't clear yet whether the cameras had been working. If someone's plan to steal the Sekimeiya was about to succeed, the outside world could end up never believing our story."
    new "又或者，警察根本不会相信我们说的任何一句话？摄像头是否还在工作，目前还不清楚。如果有人偷走 Sekimeiya 的计划即将得逞，外界也许永远不会相信我们的说法。"

    # game/script.rpy:28479
    old "We'd all been staring at the floor or our laps—a sign of our exhaustion and need to get out. I felt I heard a sound, so I abruptly looked up."
    new "我们一直盯着地板或自己的膝盖——那是精疲力竭、迫不及待想离开的表现。我似乎听见了什么声音，便猛地抬起头。"

    # game/script.rpy:28486
    old "There was nothing."
    new "什么也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:28487
    old "...{w}What?{w} Where's Erina?"
    new "……{w}什么？{w} Erina 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:28493
    old "That's a great question. Did she go somewhere?"
    new "这问题问得好。她是不是去哪儿了？"

    # game/script.rpy:28494
    old "The hallway doors were closed, and it seemed unlikely she could've left through one of them."
    new "走廊的门都关着，她不太可能从哪一扇出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:28500
    old "However, at our right was the mechanical room. She'd been the closest to it, and it was possible she'd silently made her way inside. I couldn't imagine why she would, and I glanced around the room to be sure she really wasn't with us."
    new "不过，我们右边就是机械室。她坐得离那儿最近，说不定已经悄无声息地进去了。我想不出她有什么理由这么做，便环视了一圈房间，确认她真的不在我们中间。"

    # game/script.rpy:28504
    old "You two didn't hear anything, right?"
    new "你们俩什么也没听见，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:28505
    old "...I didn't."
    new "……我没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:28506
    old "I looked into Shiroya's eyes, but she didn't do the same. Instead, she had the same nervous look from earlier."
    new "我望向 Shiroya 的眼睛，她却没迎上我的目光，脸上还是先前那副不安的神情。"

    # game/script.rpy:28509
    old "Then, she stood up."
    new "然后，她站了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:28515
    old "Don't forget what I said... I meant all of it.{w} Now stay here, and don't follow me."
    new "别忘了我刚才说的话……每一句我都是认真的。{w}现在待在这里，别跟过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:28516
    old "Wh—"
    new "等——"

    # game/script.rpy:28519
    old "Before I could finish, she took off."
    new "我话还没说完，她已经跑了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:28523
    old "She ran to hallway B and disappeared through it."
    new "她奔向B走廊，转眼消失在门后。"

    # game/script.rpy:28527
    old "My heart jumped, but I couldn't move."
    new "我心里猛地一跳，身体却动弹不得。"

    # game/script.rpy:28528
    old "My suspicion had been confirmed in the easiest way. That wasn't the Shiroya I knew."
    new "我的怀疑以最简单的方式得到了证实。那不是我所认识的 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:28529
    old "A flash came to me. Just earlier, I had looked at her purse."
    new "一道灵光闪过。就在刚才，我看过她的手提包。"

    # game/script.rpy:28530
    old "The knife wasn't there...{w} That's fine. That doesn't mean anything."
    new "刀不在里面……{w}没关系。那说明不了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:28531
    old "But... what else should have been in her purse?"
    new "可是……她的包里本来还该有什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:28532
    old "Her wallet, my keys, our identification, and the two tickets for today's event."
    new "她的钱包、我的钥匙、我们的证件，还有今天活动的两张门票。"

    # game/script.rpy:28533
    old "Right... I didn't realize it. At least two of those things were missing."
    new "对了……我居然没注意到。那些东西里，至少缺了两样。"

    # game/script.rpy:28534
    old "My keys weren't there, and neither were our tickets... However, there were keys. Did I recognize them...?"
    new "我的钥匙不在，门票也不在……不过，包里有钥匙。我认得那些钥匙吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:28541
    old "I turned my head to face Sai. Like me, he looked dumbfounded and remained immobilized by Shiroya's words."
    new "我转头看向 Sai。他和我一样目瞪口呆，被 Shiroya 那句话钉在原地动弹不得。"

    # game/script.rpy:28549
    old "The lights suddenly went out. Sai's face disappeared from sight as everything became dark."
    new "灯光骤然熄灭。四周陷入一片漆黑，Sai 的脸也从视野里消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28550
    old "S-Sai...?"
    new "S-Sai……？"

    # game/script.rpy:28554
    old "He was still there. We stood up, letting out heavy breaths."
    new "他还在那里。我们站起身来，喘着粗气。"

    # game/script.rpy:28555
    old "What the fuck happened...?"
    new "这他妈到底是怎么回事……？"

    # game/script.rpy:28556
    old "You're asking the wrong person."
    new "你问错人了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28557
    old "...{w}What time is it?"
    new "……{w}现在几点了？"

    # game/script.rpy:28558
    old "His watch gave off a faint blue light."
    new "他的手表泛着一层微弱的蓝光。"

    # game/script.rpy:28561
    old "Only two minutes left...? Why did the lights go off?"
    new "只剩两分钟了……？灯怎么灭了？"

    # game/script.rpy:28562
    old "Did you not notice that?"
    new "你没注意到吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28563
    old "Notice what?"
    new "注意到什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:28564
    old "A-Ah!"
    new "啊、啊！"

    # game/script.rpy:28570
    old "Erina's voice came from the right, sounding desperate and in pain."
    new "Erina 的声音从右边传来，听上去又慌又痛。"

    # game/script.rpy:28571
    old "Hey! What's going on? I-I think my finger is bleeding! Wh-Why are the lights off!?"
    new "喂！出什么事了？我、我的手指好像在流血！灯、灯怎么灭了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:28572
    old "Where were you!?"
    new "你刚才跑哪儿去了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:28573
    old "I'm serious! Did you not see a flashing light?"
    new "我说真的！你就没看见一道闪光吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28575
    old "Yes! I saw it too. For an instant, I saw a flashing light! I don't know what it was!"
    new "对！我也看见了。就一瞬间，有道光闪了一下！我不知道那是什么！"

    # game/script.rpy:28576
    old "Me too... After that, the lights went off."
    new "我也看见了……之后灯就灭了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28577
    old "What the fuck are you two talking about? I didn't see that."
    new "你们俩他妈的在说什么？我可没看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:28578
    old "A-And then my finger started hurting! It's seriously bleeding! What h-happened!?"
    new "然、然后我的手指就开始疼！真的在流血！到、到底怎么了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:28580
    old "No idea... but before the lights went off, Shiroya suddenly ran to hallway B."
    new "不知道……不过灯灭之前，Shiroya 突然跑去了 B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:28581
    old "Huh? Then... did she do this!?"
    new "咦？那……是她干的！？"

    # game/script.rpy:28582
    old "How would she!? And why the hell did you just leave!?"
    new "她怎么可能做到！？还有，你刚才到底为什么跑了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:28589
    old "My eyes had begun to adapt to the darkness, and thanks to a faint light coming from the reception desk, I could see the closest wall."
    new "眼睛渐渐适应了黑暗，借着前台透出的一点微光，我看得见离我最近的那面墙。"

    # game/script.rpy:28590
    old "Wait... Atsuki."
    new "等等……Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:28595
    old "Why's the shutter still there, then?"
    new "那卷帘门怎么还挡在那儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:28596
    old "It could be about to open. We don't know exactly the time the alarm went off. Maybe it was at {time=9:06.}"
    new "也许马上就会开了。警报究竟是在什么时候响的，我们并不清楚。说不定是 {time=9:06.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:28597
    old "We stared at it. It could open at any second."
    new "我们盯着它。它随时都可能打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:28599
    old "Lost in the darkness, we stood, hoping our rescue was seconds away."
    new "我们站在黑暗里，只盼着救援几秒后就会到来。"

    # game/script.rpy:28603
    old "I could very faintly see the metal surface of the shutter. It was still there, looking like the same imposing blockade it always had."
    new "我勉强能看清卷帘门的金属表面。它仍立在那里，一如既往，像一道令人生畏的屏障。"

    # game/script.rpy:28605
    old "No way..."
    new "怎么会……"

    # game/script.rpy:28606
    old "I'm pretty sure it should've opened already. It's been more than twelve hours."
    new "按理说早该开了。都过去十二个多小时了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28607
    old "...I-I knew it."
    new "……我、我就知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:28608
    old "What did you know?"
    new "知道什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:28612
    old "Erina kept silent, but we could hear her breathing.{w} Letting our hearts hammer our chests, we kept facing the sealed entrance, our promised freedom slipping away."
    new "Erina 沉默不语，可我们能听见她的呼吸。{w} 心脏在胸腔里狂跳，我们始终面对着紧闭的入口，那份承诺的自由正一点点溜走。"

    # game/script.rpy:28614
    old "{time=21:08.} What the fuck? Why is it still closed!?"
    new "{time=21:08.} 他妈的怎么回事？怎么还关着！？"

    # game/script.rpy:28618
    old "There it was. We had a winner."
    new "果然如此。答案揭晓了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28619
    old "That was the recording's prediction. The tower wasn't going to open then, and it wouldn't for a very long time."
    new "那正是录音里的预测。塔当时不会打开，而且在很长一段时间里都不会。"

    # game/script.rpy:28620
    old "How could it have happened? Why would the outside abandon us?"
    new "怎么会这样？外面的人为什么要抛下我们？"

    # game/script.rpy:28621
    old "This is Shiroya's fault! She knew something would happen!"
    new "都怪 Shiroya！她早就知道会出事！"

    # game/script.rpy:28627
    old "I found the open door to hallway B and went through it. It was completely dark, but a breeze lured me to the event room."
    new "我找到了通往 B走廊的那扇敞开的门，走了进去。里面一片漆黑，一缕微风把我引向活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:28632
    old "The room was cold. Had Shiroya run to get the Sekimeiya? I carefully walked to the cabinet, moved aside the curtain, and tried to open the glass."
    new "房间里很冷。Shiroya 是跑来拿 Sekimeiya 的吗？我小心地走到展示柜前，拨开遮布，试着打开玻璃罩。"

    # game/script.rpy:28633
    old "It should've been locked, but it wasn't. The glass was partially open, and I could put my hand inside."
    new "它本该锁着，却没有。玻璃罩半开着，我能把手伸进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:28637
    old "I felt the Sekimeiya's surface and confirmed it was still there. However, something had definitely been done to the cabinet."
    new "我摸到 Sekimeiya 的表面，确认它还在原处。但展示柜肯定被人动过手脚。"

    # game/script.rpy:28640
    old "Atsuki! Are you here? Why is it so cold?"
    new "Atsuki！你在吗？怎么这么冷？"

    # game/script.rpy:28641
    old "I am! Shiroya! Where did you go!?"
    new "我在！Shiroya！你去哪儿了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:28642
    old "There are no light switches anywhere, right?"
    new "哪里都找不到电灯开关，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:28644
    old "Is it a power outage...?"
    new "是停电了吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:28645
    old "It couldn't be. The temperature function of the cabinet was still working."
    new "不可能。展示柜的温控还在运作。"

    # game/script.rpy:28648
    old "The security room... The doors hadn't opened, but other functions might have come back, such as the internet connection."
    new "监控室……门虽然没开，但别的功能也许恢复了，比如网络连接。"

    # game/script.rpy:28652
    old "I dashed to the hallway and slammed my body into the door of the security room."
    new "我冲进走廊，用身体撞向监控室的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:28658
    old "What...!?"
    new "什么……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:28659
    old "I continued trying to push it open, but it wouldn't budge."
    new "我继续用力去推，门却纹丝不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:28660
    old "Don't tell me... Is the security room locked?"
    new "难道说……监控室锁上了？"

    # game/script.rpy:28663
    old "I-It is."
    new "是……是的。"

    # game/script.rpy:28664
    old "Can't we unlock it?"
    new "我们打不开吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28665
    old "Katei had the key, but his body is inside."
    new "钥匙在 Katei 手上，可他的身体就在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:28666
    old "It's {time=21:10}! There's no way the time is wrong...! Why is this still going?"
    new "都已经 {time=21:10} 了！时间不可能有错……！为什么还在继续？"

    # game/script.rpy:28667
    old "Sai, who'd been ignorant of the recording since the start, hadn't foreseen such an outcome. I used the last amount of strength I had to pathetically walk back to the lobby."
    new "Sai 从一开始就不知道那段录音，自然没料到会是这个结果。我用尽最后一点力气，狼狈地走回大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:28672
    old "The metal shutter was still there, proving something other than time would be needed to get rid of it."
    new "金属卷帘门依旧在那里，可见要让它消失，光靠时间是不够的。"

    # game/script.rpy:28673
    old "My body crumpled down; I couldn't keep going."
    new "我双腿一软，再也支撑不住。"

    # game/script.rpy:28674
    old "A month? What kind of joke was that? I couldn't bear one more second."
    new "一个月？这算什么玩笑？我一秒都熬不下去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28675
    old "Shiroya's words played back in my head. \"Don't forget what I said... I meant all of it.\""
    new "Shiroya 的话在脑中回响。「别忘了我说过的话……每一句都是真心的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:28676
    old "I laughed, alone. I didn't know where I was, what anything had become... none of it. Nothing we'd done had any meaning. We'd made it to the end of that impossibly long day for nothing."
    new "我独自笑了。我不知道自己身在何处，不知道一切都变成了什么样……什么都不知道。我们所做的一切毫无意义。我们熬过了那漫长得不可思议的一天，却什么也没换来。"

    # game/script.rpy:28677
    old "The words Shiroya had abandoned me with... Were they supposed to be reassuring?"
    new "Shiroya 抛下我时说的那些话……那算是安慰吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28681
    old "I tried to continue yelling her name, but my voice broke. She'd known what would happen and hadn't warned us. She'd kept waiting at our side, bolstering our hope, until she'd run away."
    new "我还想继续喊她的名字，喉咙却发不出声。她明明知道会发生什么，却没有警告我们。她一直守在我们身边，撑起我们的希望，最后却一走了之。"

    # game/script.rpy:28682
    old "Why...!? She would never have done that... I couldn't let a single day change my view of her."
    new "为什么……！？她绝不会做出这种事……我不能因为短短一天就改变对她的看法。"

    # game/script.rpy:28683
    old "But I couldn't help but despair. I wanted to leave. I wanted to be hit by the icy air and feel released. I wanted to talk to more people, even if they were the police."
    new "可我无法不绝望。我想离开这里。我想被冰冷的空气拍在脸上，好让自己松一口气。我想和更多人说话，哪怕对方是警察也好。"

    # game/script.rpy:28684
    old "And it wouldn't happen. Could we survive an entire month? Of course not...! Shiroya hadn't been mentioned in the recording, so would I not see her for weeks?"
    new "而这不可能实现。我们能撑过整整一个月吗？当然不能……！录音里没有提到 Shiroya，难道我要好几周都见不到她？"

    # game/script.rpy:28685
    old "Would the nightmare persist in the Sekimeiya's domain? It was too horrible of a thought to bear. People had died, and I still didn't know who, how, why..."
    new "这场噩梦会在 Sekimeiya 的领域里一直持续下去吗？这念头太可怕，我承受不住。有人死了，而我至今不知道是谁、怎么死的、为什么……"

    # game/script.rpy:28686
    old "The lights had gone out, so I followed their example. I closed my eyes, intensifying the darkness, before I felt once again how insignificant I was."
    new "灯已经灭了，我便也照做。我闭上眼睛，让黑暗更深一层，随后再一次感到自己是多么渺小。"

    # game/script.rpy:28700
    old "Chapter 1 Credits"
    new "第一章 制作人员"

    # game/script.rpy:28701
    old "As they feared, their time in Ashiya Tower wouldn't end yet."
    new "正如他们所担心的，他们在芦屋塔的日子还远未结束。"

    # game/script.rpy:28702
    old "The warning they'd received hadn't been enough to prepare them."
    new "他们得到的警告，不足以让他们做好准备。"

    # game/script.rpy:28703
    old "And their uncertain future threatened to be cruel."
    new "而他们那尚未确定的未来，恐怕会十分残酷。"

    # game/script.rpy:28704
    old "Since the mysteries had begun to stack up, they knew they couldn't withstand them."
    new "谜团接踵而至，他们清楚自己无力招架。"

    # game/script.rpy:28705
    old "Many details that sheltered the truth had been left ungrasped."
    new "许多掩盖着真相的细节，他们仍未能抓住。"

    # game/script.rpy:28706
    old "And they were ignorant to one important fact..."
    new "而他们还不知道一个关键的事实……"

    # game/script.rpy:28707
    old "Their lives had just been saved."
    new "他们的性命，刚刚才被救下。"

    # game/script.rpy:28708
    old "Nobody could imagine why the Sekimeiya had been exposed to them."
    new "没有人能想象，Sekimeiya 为何会暴露在他们面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:28709
    old "Nobody could imagine the beautiful labyrinth they were creating."
    new "没有人能想象，他们正在织就一座多么美丽的迷宫。"

    # game/script.rpy:28710
    old "A transparent labyrinth that engulfed its own creators."
    new "一座透明的迷宫，将它的创造者自身也吞没其中。"

    # game/script.rpy:28711
    old "A labyrinth that didn't hide truth anywhere."
    new "一座不会把真相藏在任何角落的迷宫。"

    # game/script.rpy:28712
    old "And whose walls could be broken."
    new "而它的墙壁，是可以被打破的。"

    # game/script.rpy:28713
    old "Every riddle, no matter how small, was accompanied by an answer."
    new "每一个谜题，无论多么微小，都有与之对应的答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:28714
    old "However, some of those answers weren't held by anyone."
    new "然而，其中有些答案，并不掌握在任何人的手中。"

    # game/script.rpy:28715
    old "Not by anyone inside the tower, that is."
    new "至少，塔内没有人掌握这些答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:28716
    old "...What about you?"
    new "……那么你呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:28717
    old "Inevitably, every riddle will be unfolded."
    new "所有的谜题，终将一一展开。"

    # game/script.rpy:28718
    old "Every detail will strengthen."
    new "每一处细节，都将得到印证。"

    # game/script.rpy:28719
    old "And meaning will arise."
    new "而意义，也将随之浮现。"

    # game/script.rpy:28720
    old "When the time comes, I wish you will be prepared."
    new "待到那时，希望你已做好准备。"

    # game/script.rpy:28721
    old "The peak was within reach, but it felt unattainable."
    new "顶峰近在咫尺，却又仿佛遥不可及。"

    # game/script.rpy:28722
    old "Was the reason the path taken?"
    new "原因是否就出在所走的那条路上？"

    # game/script.rpy:28723
    old "To climb to the top, others were essential."
    new "若想攀至顶峰，他人的助力不可或缺。"

    # game/script.rpy:28724
    old "Only then will the puzzle be laid out and every spot contain its proper piece."
    new "唯有如此，拼图才会铺展开来，每一处凹槽都嵌着对应的那块。"

    # game/script.rpy:28725
    old "Inside the dark tower, there was only one thing that could be taken for granted..."
    new "在那座漆黑的塔里，能够视为理所当然的只有一件事……"

    # game/script.rpy:28726
    old "The path to comprehension extended far past the one to freedom."
    new "通往理解的路，远比通往自由的路漫长得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:28763
    old "Lone Thread"
    new "孤帖"

    # game/script.rpy:28765
    old "Amidst the vast internet was a specific forum thread."
    new "茫茫网海之中，有一个论坛帖子。"

    # game/script.rpy:28766
    old "The date showed it had been written in the afternoon of November 24th, 2011. It contained two paragraphs."
    new "日期显示，它写于 2011 年 11 月 24 日下午，正文只有两段。"

    # game/script.rpy:28767
    old "I swear this is all the truth, I'm not messing around. I'm a bit scared, though, and I'm not sure what to do."
    new "我发誓这些都是真的，绝不是在胡闹。只是我有点害怕，不知道该怎么办。"

    # game/script.rpy:28768
    old "I think I just woke up from a really strange dream. It felt hyperrealistic, and I'm still shaking..."
    new "我想我刚从一个古怪的梦里醒来。那梦真实得过分，我现在还在发抖……"

    # game/script.rpy:28769
    old "I don't know if it means anything. Maybe it was a premonition, I'm not sure. However, I'd be careful on the 15th of next month."
    new "我不知道这有没有意义。也许是个预兆，我也说不准。不过，下个月 15 号还是小心为妙。"

    # game/script.rpy:28770
    old "If I don't say this anonymously, I'll be laughed at, or even fired... On the 15th, Ashiya will hold a big event in the tower, and there'll be a terrorist attack."
    new "要不是匿名，我说出来只会被人嘲笑，甚至可能被开除……15 号那天，芦屋会在塔里举办一场大型活动，届时会有恐怖袭击。"

    # game/script.rpy:28771
    old "It will be called... the Sekimeiya."
    new "那场袭击的名字叫……Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:28772
    old "Soon, maybe they will announce it. I don't think I'm a prophet or anything, but I'm still trying to calm down. This time, it felt too real to let it pass."
    new "他们也许很快就会公布。我不觉得自己是什么预言家，可我到现在还没法平静。这一次的感觉太真实了，我不能当作没发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:28775
    old "That's what I dreamed. It's so bizarre I still think it might've really happened. That's why I feel the need to post it, in case it actually means something."
    new "我梦到的就是这些。事情离奇得让我至今觉得它或许真的发生过。所以我才想发出来，万一它真有什么含义。"

    # game/script.rpy:28776
    old "Do not go to that event if it happens. Some people even got trapped inside, but I don't know what happened to them."
    new "那场活动要是真的办了，千万别去。有人甚至被困在了里面，可我不知道他们后来怎么样。"

    # game/script.rpy:28777
    old "I think something might be wrong with me... I don't know why, but I'm not home. I can hardly believe it's still the 24th, and I don't know what I'm doing at my parents' house."
    new "我觉得自己可能有点不对劲……不知为什么，我不在自己家里。真难相信今天还是 24 号，我也不知道自己怎么会在父母家。"

    # game/script.rpy:28778
    old "Sorry to rant about this, but I need to let it out somewhere. I've been suffering from a few mental issues, but nothing has been as bad as this. I've been living alone for two years while my condition has gotten worse and worse. I feel I can't continue on my own, and letting people around me know it might be a horrible idea."
    new "抱歉在这里倒苦水，可我总得找个地方说出来。我一直受着几种精神问题的困扰，但从没有哪次像现在这么糟。我独自生活了两年，状况却越来越差。我觉得自己撑不下去了，而让身边的人知道这些，或许是个糟糕透顶的主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:28779
    old "Anyway, maybe some of you will have some advice. I know posting here isn't the most effective thing, but it's very hard for me to talk about this out loud. Thank you for reading."
    new "总之，也许有人能给我些建议。我知道发帖不是最有效的办法，可要我当面把这些说出口，实在太难了。谢谢你读到这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:28784
    old "The thread gathered very few views and only a handful of replies. It had been posted on a nearly desolate subcategory dedicated to Yushibana events."
    new "这个帖子几乎无人问津，回复也寥寥无几。它发在一个专谈丰花活动的分区里，那里冷清得近乎荒废。"

    # game/script.rpy:28785
    old "Two days later came the last reply before the thread was locked. The foolish warning wasn't enough to prevent the incident, foreseen three weeks prior."
    new "两天后，帖子被锁定之前出现了最后一条回复。那条荒唐的警告，终究没能阻止那起三周前就已被预见的事件发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:28786
    old "When November came to an end, the thread had gathered 33 views. However, just one month later, it had grown to the thousands."
    new "11 月结束时，帖子的浏览量不过 33 次。然而仅仅一个月后，这个数字就攀升到了数千。"

    # game/script.rpy:28787
    old "The identity behind the poster was never released, but some figured it out."
    new "发帖人的身份始终没有公开，但有些人已经猜到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28788
    old "And the account wasn't used again, leaving many people wondering by themselves what had happened during the days leading to the 15th and on the fated, final one."
    new "那个账号从此再未使用，于是许多人只能各自猜想：临近 15 号的那几天，以及命中注定的最后一天，究竟发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:28803
    old "Crystallized"
    new "结晶"

    # game/script.rpy:28812
    old "Maxi was startled as Atsuki and Shiroya looked at each other. The sound they'd just heard brought with it a semblance of normalcy that they'd craved."
    new "Atsuki 和 Shiroya 对视时，Maxi 吓了一跳。刚才那声音带来了一丝久违的日常感，那正是他们一直想要的。"

    # game/script.rpy:28815
    old "Standing up from the sofa, Atsuki walked up to the front door of his house and did what he'd been waiting for all day."
    new "Atsuki 从沙发上起身，走到自家大门前，做了那件他等了一整天的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:28820
    old "Upon turning the handle and opening the door, he saw a figure he'd not seen in a long time. The same person he'd always known—he'd almost expected her to be uncomfortable or look out of sorts. Instead, he realized that he was the one who appeared that way."
    new "他转动门把，推开门，看见了一个许久未见的身影。还是他熟悉的那个她——他原以为她会显得不自在，或是气色欠佳。结果他反倒发觉，露出那副模样的人是自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:28825
    old "\"Hey.\"{w=0.5} After a long few seconds, Miiya put on a smile and made her way in."
    new "「嘿。」{w=0.5}沉默了好几秒，Miiya 才挂上笑容，迈步走进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:28827
    old "There, she saw Shiroya walking toward the door, nearly in disbelief at seeing her after so long."
    new "在那里，她看见 Shiroya 正朝门口走来，几乎不敢相信隔了这么久还能见到她。"

    # game/script.rpy:28832
    old "Miiya...! I'm glad to see you. It's been a while."
    new "Miiya……！见到你真好。好久不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28833
    old "Me too."
    new "我也是。"

    # game/script.rpy:28838
    old "She glanced at her surroundings, remembering the many times she'd been there in the past. On the floor, after recognizing Miiya, Maxi looked happy to see her too."
    new "她环顾四周，想起自己过去曾多少次来过这里。地上的 Maxi 认出她之后，也露出高兴的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:28847
    old "It really has been a while since we got together like this, yeah."
    new "像这样聚在一起，真的隔了好久了呢。"

    # game/script.rpy:28852
    old "...Yeah."
    new "……是啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:28857
    old "...It feels like it's been way longer. It's so strange to see other people here."
    new "……总觉得还要久得多。在这里看到别人，还真有些不习惯。"

    # game/script.rpy:28860
    old "Miiya bent down and scratched behind Maxi's ear, an action she'd picked up from Atsuki. Both he and Shiroya watched her wordlessly, unsure what they could say."
    new "Miiya 弯下腰，挠了挠 Maxi 的耳后——这个动作是她从 Atsuki 那里学来的。他和 Shiroya 都默不作声地看着她，不知该说些什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:28865
    old "Well, what have you two been up to?"
    new "那么，你们俩最近都在忙什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:28870
    old "Um... Not much, honestly. I haven't really talked to anyone from school in a while."
    new "嗯……老实说，也没什么。我已经有一阵子没和学校里的任何人说过话了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28875
    old "It's the same for me. No one's been around."
    new "我也一样。身边一个人都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:28878
    old "Miiya could easily recognize that they were both acting awkwardly, and the last thing she wanted after reaching out to Atsuki was for him to distance himself again."
    new "Miiya 一眼就看出两人都在别扭。她好不容易才向 Atsuki 伸出手，最不愿看到的就是他再一次与她拉开距离。"

    # game/script.rpy:28879
    old "Shame there aren't any good movies to go see. We could catch up that way."
    new "可惜没什么好电影可看。本来还能借着看电影叙叙旧。"

    # game/script.rpy:28884
    old "Ah, well, it's not like the theater here's that great anyway. I regret going every time."
    new "啊，反正这里的电影院也不怎么样。我每次去都后悔。"

    # game/script.rpy:28885
    old "Planning on moving to the big city so you can go to fancy theaters? I bet you want central heating too."
    new "打算搬去大城市，好去高档影院？我猜你还想要集中供暖吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:28890
    old "...I don't know. I'd rather not think about that, you know? It's not like living here is all bad or anything, but sometimes you just want... more."
    new "……我不知道。我不太想谈这个，你明白吗？住在这里也不是一无是处，只是有时候，你就是想要……更多。"

    # game/script.rpy:28891
    old "Oh, us bumpkins aren't good enough? I see how it is. I feel you, though. The last time I watched a movie there was almost a year ago, and it was horrible. A better catalog would be great."
    new "哦，我们这些乡巴佬不够格了？原来如此。不过我懂你的意思。我上次在那儿看电影是快一年前的事了，糟透了。上映的片子要是能好一些就好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28896
    old "Wait, is that the one you recommended to us? The one you said not to look up or read the premise of? We never ended up going, but I still had it on my mind."
    new "等等，就是你推荐给我们的那部？你说过别去查、也别看简介的那部？我们最后没去成，可我到现在还惦记着。"

    # game/script.rpy:28901
    old "Oh, did I? Very possible. It was one of a kind. I wouldn't even mind watching it again with you two, but I'll be shocked if it hasn't been discontinued."
    new "哦，我说过吗？很有可能。那片子独一无二。我甚至不介意陪你们再看一遍，不过它要是还没下映，我倒会吃惊。"

    # game/script.rpy:28906
    old "Hey, isn't it pretty cold in here? I'm pretty used to it outside, but I can never relax indoors if the temperature isn't just right."
    new "话说，这里是不是挺冷的？我在外面早就习惯了，可室内温度要是不合适，我怎么都放松不下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:28907
    old "Yeah, sorry. I've gotten into the habit of turning the heat on and then back off once it gets warm again."
    new "嗯，抱歉。我养成习惯了，开着暖气，等屋里暖起来又关掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:28912
    old "Maybe we can win the lottery and spring for a house with a sauna. If more than one of us enters, it's a sure thing."
    new "说不定我们能中彩票，然后买一栋带桑拿的房子。要是我们多几个人去买彩票，那肯定稳中。"

    # game/script.rpy:28917
    old "I wish."
    new "但愿如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:28918
    old "Oh, you do? I didn't figure you were the polygamous type."
    new "哦，是吗？我倒没看出来你还是一夫多妻那一型的。"

    # game/script.rpy:28923
    old "What!?"
    new "什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:28928
    old "She didn't mean it like that."
    new "她不是那个意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:28933
    old "Lighten up! Both of you are so stiff."
    new "放轻松点嘛！你们两个也太拘谨了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28939
    old "S-Sorry. It's just been a while. I'm not used to being around people."
    new "抱、抱歉。只是好久没这样了，我不太习惯和人相处。"

    # game/script.rpy:28940
    old "I actually passed by the lottery office just now and thought about giving it a shot, but I didn't want to be late. I was also really eager to see Maxi and Umi, you know? I've been thinking of getting a few cats, and I see that Umi's been eyeing me from under that couch, so maybe she wants to come with me. God, she's so cute."
    new "刚才我其实路过彩票站，还想着要不要去买一张，可又怕迟到。而且我也很想见 Maxi 和 Umi 嘛。我一直想养几只猫，刚才看见 Umi 从沙发底下盯着我看，说不定她也想跟我走呢。天哪，她真是太可爱了。"

    # game/script.rpy:28945
    old "I don't think so."
    new "我倒不这么觉得。"

    # game/script.rpy:28950
    old "I figured I'd just have to bribe my parents, but they've been more stubborn than usual. Apparently, both of them are a bit allergic, but they won't even let me just have them in my room. I've been trying to get a job, but I haven't had much luck yet."
    new "我本来想着，哄哄我爸妈就行了，可他们最近比平时还固执。听说他们俩都有点过敏，可连让我把猫养在自己房间里都不肯。我一直在找工作，可到现在还没什么着落。"

    # game/script.rpy:28955
    old "Where have you been looking anyway?"
    new "那你到底都在哪儿找的？"

    # game/script.rpy:28960
    old "Well..."
    new "这个嘛……"

    # game/script.rpy:28963
    old "They had many things to talk about, and Miiya's willingness to break the ice was much appreciated. Atsuki and Shiroya both viewed her as the missing link in their lives that had finally been restored."
    new "他们有许多话要说，而 Miiya 主动打破僵局，让他们十分感激。在 Atsuki 和 Shiroya 眼里，她就像他们生命中缺失已久、如今终于补上的一环。"

    # game/script.rpy:28964
    old "Hours went by thanks to all the things they wanted to let out. Their future decisions, what their past months had been like, and many more thoughts they'd been keeping to themselves."
    new "积压已久的话一吐为快，几个小时就这么过去了。将来的打算、过去几个月各自过得如何，还有许多一直藏在心里没说出口的念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:28965
    old "For Atsuki, talking about it was hard. He wanted to ignore some problems for a while instead of acknowledging them; deep down, however, he knew he couldn't do that forever. Miiya had given him an excuse to approach it."
    new "对 Atsuki 来说，谈这些并不容易。有些问题他宁愿先搁在一边，不去承认；可他心里清楚，终究不能一直这样下去。Miiya 恰好给了他一个去面对的借口。"

    # game/script.rpy:28966
    old "But as time went on, they realized they'd soon not have much to talk about or do together, and the mood began to sour. They weren't at school anymore, so talking about what their days had been like wasn't the same."
    new "可随着时间推移，他们发觉再过不久，彼此就没什么可聊、也没什么可一起做的了，气氛也随之沉了下来。毕竟他们已经不在学校了，聊起各自的日子，终究和从前不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:28969
    old "Oh, I found this on the way here."
    new "对了，我来的路上捡到了这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:28970
    old "Atsuki and Shiroya lifted their heads. Miiya was holding a gray flyer with wet stains from where the snow had fallen on it."
    new "Atsuki 和 Shiroya 抬起头。Miiya 手里拿着一张灰色的传单，上面有几处被雪打湿的痕迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:28975
    old "It says November 29th, so it was put up today. I found it on a streetlight close to here and thought it sounded interesting."
    new "上面写着 11 月 29 日，是今天才贴出来的。我在附近的路灯上看到的，觉得挺有意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:28980
    old "Isn't that the Ashiya logo?"
    new "那不是芦屋的标志吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:28981
    old "Oh, yeah. I know you two don't like them very much, but read what it says."
    new "哦，对啊。我知道你们俩不太喜欢他们，不过先看看上面写了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:28982
    old "Intrigued, Shiroya took the paper from her and read it out loud."
    new "Shiroya 来了兴致，从她手里接过传单，大声念了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:28987
    old "The Sekimeiya? ...On the third Thursday of next month, we will hold the largest event we have ever had the pleasure to put together in Ashiya Tower."
    new "The Sekimeiya？……下个月第三个星期四，我们将在芦屋塔举办迄今为止规模最大的一场活动。"

    # game/script.rpy:28988
    old "Make sure not to miss it, as we will show the rarest gemstone to have been found in recent years. Like every Thursday, the special visit will start at {time=9.}"
    new "届时将展出近年来发现的最稀有宝石，敬请不要错过。与每个星期四一样，特别参观将于 {time=9.} 开始。"

    # game/script.rpy:28991
    old "I thought that we could go before your birthdays."
    new "我想着，可以在你们生日之前去一趟。"

    # game/script.rpy:28997
    old "When they looked at each other, Atsuki and Shiroya knew they couldn't refuse. They'd never entered Ashiya Tower, and their families usually would've prevented them, but neither of them were personally against going once while their parents were overseas. Both of them also agreed that what they'd read sounded intriguing."
    new "Atsuki 和 Shiroya 对视一眼，便明白自己无法拒绝。他们从没进过芦屋塔，家里平时也不会允许，可他们本人并不反对趁父母还在国外时去一次。而且两人都觉得，传单上写的内容确实挺吸引人。"

    # game/script.rpy:28998
    old "Look, it says that if we want to attend, we should hurry up and buy the tickets from this website."
    new "你们看，上面说想去的话，得赶紧从这个网站上买票。"

    # game/script.rpy:29005
    old "Knowing what their answer would be, Miiya walked to the computer and input the URL. With Atsuki and Shiroya looking over her shoulders, the three pricey tickets were purchased."
    new "Miiya 早知道他们会怎么回答，便走到电脑前输入了网址。Atsuki 和 Shiroya 站在她身后看着屏幕，三张价格不菲的门票就这样买了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:29006
    old "It was money neither Shiroya nor Atsuki had intended to spend, but to them, it was worthwhile. The thought of going somewhere together even made them smile."
    new "这笔钱 Shiroya 和 Atsuki 原本都没打算花，可他们觉得值得。光是想到能一起去某个地方，就足以让他们露出笑容。"

    # game/script.rpy:29009
    old "They bought the tickets using Atsuki's payment details, but they all paid for their own. After that, they printed them."
    new "门票是用 Atsuki 的账户信息买的，不过钱是各付各的。买完之后，他们把票打印了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:29016
    old "There we go. I'm hoping they're not exaggerating. It said we'll go in groups of three, so we should be able to enter together."
    new "好了。但愿他们没在夸大其词。上面说会三人一组入场，这样我们应该能一起进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:29017
    old "Atsuki and Shiroya felt satisfied and appreciative of Miiya. She folded the papers and put them in a purse she'd long ago left in Atsuki's house, which brought back memories of all the times she'd worn it with them."
    new "Atsuki 和 Shiroya 心满意足，也对 Miiya 心存感激。她把纸叠好，收进一只很久以前就留在 Atsuki 家的手提包里。那只包让她忆起从前和他们在一起、常常带着它的那些日子。"

    # game/script.rpy:29026
    old "Atsuki's heater, once turned on, was comfortable, so they spent the entire time in his house until it felt appropriate to leave.{w} Miiya's parents informed her they'd made dinner for her, and Shiroya took it as her cue as well. After saying their goodbyes, Atsuki saw both girls leaving on different paths."
    new "Atsuki 家的暖气一开就很舒服，他们便一直待在他家里，直到该告辞的时候。{w} Miiya 的父母说给她做了晚饭，Shiroya 也顺势起身告辞。道别之后，Atsuki 目送两个女孩走向不同的方向。"

    # game/script.rpy:29027
    old "It hadn't been the most fun day they could recall, but at least Atsuki felt at peace, as it had been exactly what he'd needed after spending many months by himself."
    new "这一天算不上他们记忆中最快乐的一天，可至少 Atsuki 心里很平静——独自过了好几个月之后，他正需要这样一天。"

    # game/script.rpy:29030
    old "He went to sleep looking forward to the next day, when they'd agreed to meet again."
    new "他们已经约好第二天再见面，他便带着期待睡下了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29039
    old "It was the afternoon, and it had just started snowing. Phone in hand, Atsuki waited at the spot they'd settled on, close to the school they'd recently graduated from. He saw a flyer stuck on the bus stop, titled \"The Sekimeiya\", identical to the one Miiya had shown him."
    new "那是下午，雪刚开始下。Atsuki 拿着手机，在他们约好的地方等着，离他们不久前毕业的学校不远。他看见公交站牌上贴着一张传单，标题是「The Sekimeiya」，和 Miiya 给他看的那张一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:29041
    old "He saw Miiya approaching, and she sped up upon seeing him as well. Minutes later, Shiroya came from the same direction, and the three found themselves at a bus stop with a plastic roof, not having decided where to go next."
    new "他看见 Miiya 走了过来，她见到他后也加快了脚步。几分钟后，Shiroya 从同一个方向过来，三人就这样站在一个带塑料顶棚的公交站下，还没决定接下来要去哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:29050
    old "Unfazed by the snow, they walked toward a stone path, reminiscent of the days when they'd left school together."
    new "他们不把雪放在心上，朝一条石板路走去，那情景让人想起从前一起放学的日子。"

    # game/script.rpy:29059
    old "A few younger students could be seen in groups near benches, and some of their faces were recognizable. Like everyone else around them, they sat on one of the benches, their coats protecting them from the icy surface that remained after wiping off the snow."
    new "长椅附近能看到几群年纪更小的学生，其中有些面孔还很眼熟。他们也和周围其他人一样，在其中一条长椅上坐下；擦掉积雪后椅面仍然冰凉，好在有外套隔着。"

    # game/script.rpy:29068
    old "I kind of missed this routine."
    new "这种日常，我还真有点怀念。"

    # game/script.rpy:29069
    old "It's definitely something you get used to. I can't believe years start going by so quickly."
    new "这种事，肯定会习惯的。真没想到，一年一年竟然过得这么快。"

    # game/script.rpy:29070
    old "On the plus side, we don't have to deal with anything involving physics anymore. What a drag of a class."
    new "往好处想，我们再也不用碰物理了。那门课真是够折磨人的。"

    # game/script.rpy:29071
    old "Please don't remind me. I can't believe how many times Miss Mayuko pulled someone out into the hallway. Why be a teacher if you're going to act like that?"
    new "别提了。真不敢相信 Mayuko 老师把人叫到走廊上去过多少回。要是那副样子，还当什么老师？"

    # game/script.rpy:29072
    old "Yeah. You'd think you couldn't get away with that in such a small town. All of the parents should have been up in arms about it."
    new "是啊。按说在这么小的镇子上，这种事本该瞒不过去。家长们早该闹翻天了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29073
    old "Isn't that normal? I almost expect small towns like this to have murder cults all the adults initiate the kids into."
    new "这不算正常吗？我倒觉得这种小镇就该有杀人邪教，大人们一个个把孩子拉进去入教。"

    # game/script.rpy:29074
    old "Well, not mine. Unless they're part of a foreign chapter and making arrangements right now."
    new "反正我家没有。除非他们属于某个海外分会，现在正忙着张罗。"

    # game/script.rpy:29075
    old "Shiroya's parents and mine would definitely be in it together."
    new "Shiroya 的父母和我爸妈肯定是一伙的。"

    # game/script.rpy:29078
    old "Actually, they haven't tried to get you to move again, have they?"
    new "话说回来，他们没再劝你搬家吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:29081
    old "It's not constant, but sometimes, yeah. I feel guilty, but... a big part of me wants to be here. I don't like that my mom is being so pushy about it. At least she gets the message if I ignore the call or just outright tell her no, but after a couple of weeks, she'll try again."
    new "也不是一直催，但有时候确实会。我心里有愧，可是……我很大一部分还是想留在这里。我不喜欢我妈在这件事上逼得这么紧。要是我把电话晾着不接，或者干脆说不，她至少还能明白我的意思；可过不了几周，她又会再提。"

    # game/script.rpy:29082
    old "My parents both keep doing the same thing. Is it too strained for you?"
    new "我爸妈也一直这样。你会不会觉得太不自在了？"

    # game/script.rpy:29083
    old "It really is... My birthday's coming up, and she hasn't even mentioned it. I bet the only thing she's going to do for it is ask me to leave again. Like it's a gift for me."
    new "确实……我生日快到了，她却连提都没提。我看她唯一会做的，就是再让我搬出去。好像这就算送我的礼物了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29086
    old "Sorry. I shouldn't have brought it up."
    new "抱歉，我不该提这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:29087
    old "It's fine. I just wish she supported me living the way I want to, you know? It's not like I ever got bad grades or anything when we were in school. I proved I could take care of things."
    new "没事。我只是希望她能支持我按自己的想法生活，你懂吧？上学那会儿我也没拿过什么差成绩。我早就证明过自己能照顾好自己了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29088
    old "I'm not so sure. You remember, what was it, five years ago? You couldn't even look at a map and tell me where you were on it."
    new "我可不太确定。你还记得吗，大概是五年前吧？你连看地图都说不清自己在哪儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:29089
    old "That was different! It had never come up before. You can't hold that against me."
    new "那不一样！以前从没碰上过那种事。你不能拿这个揪着我不放。"

    # game/script.rpy:29090
    old "And what about that time we had to catalog local animals? You didn't even know where to start looking."
    new "那记录本地动物那次呢？你连该从哪儿找起都不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:29091
    old "Come on, Atsuki..."
    new "别这样，Atsuki……"

    # game/script.rpy:29092
    old "No, no, I want to hear this. Go on."
    new "别别，我想听。继续说。"

    # game/script.rpy:29095
    old "We were supposed to build a list of animals that lived around here. It was one of those big, year-long projects... Actually, you were here for that, weren't you?"
    new "我们当时要整理一份这附近动物的清单。是那种为期一年的大课题……说起来，你那时候也在吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:29096
    old "Yeah, but we didn't really know each other back then."
    new "在，不过那会儿我们还不怎么认识。"

    # game/script.rpy:29097
    old "Well, Shiroya had no clue what to do. We went out to the edge of town and looked for, well, anything. It was still fall then, and we actually stumbled into a bunch of lizards."
    new "Shiroya 完全不知道该怎么办。我们跑到镇子边上，四处找，什么都找。那时还是秋天，结果碰上了一群蜥蜴。"

    # game/script.rpy:29098
    old "Ooh, I bet she made her usual shocked face when she sees anything that moves."
    new "哦，我猜她只要看见会动的东西，就会露出她平时那副吓到的表情。"

    # game/script.rpy:29100
    old "God. You're not one to talk, Miiya."
    new "天哪，Miiya，你也好意思说我。"

    # game/script.rpy:29101
    old "The best part was that she, uh... panicked a bit and stepped on one of their tails. It popped right off, and she screamed."
    new "最精彩的是，她、呃……慌了神，一脚踩中其中一条尾巴。那尾巴啪地断开，她立刻尖叫起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:29104
    old "I didn't know their tails came off and grew back! It had never come up before!"
    new "我哪知道它们的尾巴会断掉还能长回来！以前根本没人提过！"

    # game/script.rpy:29105
    old "How can you not know that?"
    new "这你都不知道？"

    # game/script.rpy:29106
    old "I just didn't! You don't even see lizards once the cold hits."
    new "我就是不知道！天一冷，根本连蜥蜴的影子都见不着。"

    # game/script.rpy:29107
    old "I honestly thought you saw a bear or something."
    new "说实话，我还以为你看见了熊什么的。"

    # game/script.rpy:29108
    old "No way. I'd have left you for dead."
    new "怎么可能。真遇上熊，我肯定丢下你等死。"

    # game/script.rpy:29109
    old "Ice cold. Although black bears aren't that aggressive... usually."
    new "真冷血。不过黑熊也没那么有攻击性……通常吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:29110
    old "Yeah, I'd have been totally fine, and you would've regretted your betrayal. You've told me way too many things that I could use against you."
    new "是啊，我肯定一点事都没有，你迟早会后悔背叛我。你跟我说的那些事，够我拿来对付你了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29111
    old "Ooh, like what? You can tell me."
    new "哦？比如什么？说给我听听。"

    # game/script.rpy:29112
    old "A-Anyway, turned out that we completely misunderstood and tried to catch one too. Really, all we had to do was tell what kind of animal it was. Not the species, the, uh, genus."
    new "总、总之，后来才发现我们完全理解错了，还试着去抓一只。其实只要说出那是什么动物就行。不用具体到种，说出、呃，属就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:29113
    old "Yeah. I felt like an idiot."
    new "是啊。我当时觉得自己像个白痴。"

    # game/script.rpy:29114
    old "So you didn't catch a bear? Shame."
    new "所以你们没抓到熊？真可惜。"

    # game/script.rpy:29117
    old "I've known Shiroya long enough that it wouldn't surprise me. She's good with animals, but she needs a bit of time to warm up to them. I'm sure a bear would grow a liking to her fast."
    new "我认识 Shiroya 这么久，这种事也不会让我意外。她跟动物处得来，只是需要点时间才能放下戒心。熊肯定很快也会喜欢上她。"

    # game/script.rpy:29118
    old "Hmm."
    new "嗯。"

    # game/script.rpy:29119
    old "You think so? I'd probably just play dead and hope to survive."
    new "你觉得会吗？换作我，大概只能装死，祈祷能活下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:29120
    old "Well, you're always very sweet with Umi, and she seems to really like you. Honestly, I was a bit jealous of you in the past. If I didn't know better, I'd think you'd end up becoming a vet."
    new "你对 Umi 一直很温柔，她好像也很喜欢你。说实话，我以前还有点羡慕你。要不是我了解你，还真会以为你将来会当兽医。"

    # game/script.rpy:29121
    old "Me...? I doubt it, yeah. I stopped considering that when I was twelve.{w} That's so much school just to get your foot in the door. It's not like I want to end up being some boring office worker or something, but I want to have time for myself too..."
    new "我……？嗯，我看不会。我十二岁就不再考虑那条路了。{w}光是为了入行，就得读那么多年书。我也不是想最后变成什么无聊的上班族，可我也想要自己的时间啊……"

    # game/script.rpy:29122
    old "Could just find a nice rich guy and become a gold digger instead."
    new "干脆找个有钱的好男人，当拜金女算了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29123
    old "Heh. Yeah, I doubt that too."
    new "呵。是啊，那更不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:29124
    old "So do I. You should've seen her as a kid, Miiya. She didn't want anything to do with boys."
    new "我也这么觉得。Miiya，你真该看看她小时候什么样。她根本不想跟男生有任何来往。"

    # game/script.rpy:29125
    old "Except you?"
    new "除了你？"

    # game/script.rpy:29128
    old "Well... I didn't want anything to do with them either most of the time. For a while, both of us didn't have a great relationship with our classmates, so... we just kind of hung out with each other. I don't really know how it happened, but our parents definitely contributed to it too."
    new "这个……我大多数时候也不想跟男生扯上关系。有一阵子，我们俩跟同学相处得都不太好，所以……就不知不觉总待在一起。我也不太清楚事情是怎么变成这样的，不过双方父母肯定也推了一把。"

    # game/script.rpy:29129
    old "All the girls had their cliques, that's how. It's insane how they get in a town like this. One person says something bad about you and it spreads fast, even if it's not true. Most of them ended up maturing, fortunately, but it was really bad at the start. Atsuki was never like that, though."
    new "因为女生们各自都有小圈子，就是这么回事。在这种小镇上也能搞出那一套，真让人难以置信。只要有一个人说你坏话，不管是不是真的，很快就传开了。幸好大多数人后来都成熟了，但一开始真的很糟。不过你从来就不是那样的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:29130
    old "Well, I'd be an asshole if I was. You're right, though, things got a lot better after middle school, probably because everyone's too busy with doing well to pick fights."
    new "我要是那样，也太混账了。不过你说得对，初中以后情况好了很多，大概是因为大家都忙着各自上进，没空再找架吵了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29131
    old "I'm not so sure about that. Look at all the old farts here who go on and on about how terrible Ashiya is."
    new "我倒不觉得。你看看这儿那些老家伙，整天没完没了地说芦屋有多糟糕。"

    # game/script.rpy:29132
    old "As far as I'm concerned, both groups suck."
    new "要我说，两边都不是什么好东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:29133
    old "How moderate of you. A man after my own heart."
    new "你可真够中庸的。正合我意。"

    # game/script.rpy:29137
    old "They kept talking like that for quite some time, whiling away the day in the way that made them most comfortable. Existing with each other was enough for them."
    new "三人就这样聊了很久，用他们最舒服的方式消磨着这一天。只要彼此相伴，就已经足够了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29149
    old "Eventually, their coats were no longer able to protect them from the icy air. The short winter day came to an end as the sky began to darken.{w} Colliding with her own misty breath, Miiya stood up and asked whether they'd like to walk around to warm themselves up."
    new "终于，外套也挡不住刺骨的寒气。天色渐暗，短暂的冬日走到了尽头。{w}Miiya 站起身，呼出的白雾迎面扑来，问她们要不要走走暖暖身子。"

    # game/script.rpy:29150
    old "From Seeuta D'ella Park, they would usually head home. Instead, they headed in the opposite direction, toward the more rustic part of Yushibana, which bordered the surrounding mountain range."
    new "他们本应从希尤塔·德拉公园回家，却朝相反方向走去，往丰花更古朴的那一侧去。那一带紧邻周围的山脉。"

    # game/script.rpy:29155
    old "They weren't unfamiliar with it, but it was rare they'd end up there. It barely had shops, and most buildings were residences. However, the narrow brick streets adorned by the dim snow made it particularly cozy, quiet footsteps the only audible sound."
    new "他们对那里并不陌生，却很少会去。街上几乎没有店铺，建筑大多是住宅。可昏暗中，积雪覆在狭窄的砖路上，反倒让这里格外温馨；耳边唯一能听见的，只有轻轻的脚步声。"

    # game/script.rpy:29156
    old "Shiroya took out her phone and looked at the time: {time=20:27.} Aimlessly walking, they noticed the falling snow was getting lighter. People were entering their homes for the night, and some tire tracks had recently been carved into the snow."
    new "Shiroya 掏出手机看了看时间：{time=20:27.} 他们漫无目的地走着，注意到雪渐渐小了。人们陆续归家歇息，雪地上还新轧出了几道车辙。"

    # game/script.rpy:29165
    old "What's that?"
    new "那是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:29166
    old "Miiya had been living in Yushibana for many years, but she was well aware that the other two knew the town much better. She pointed at a bright window next to an opaque door, the view of its interior covered by a curtain."
    new "Miiya 在丰花住了很多年，却很清楚另外两人对这座小镇远比她熟悉。她指向一扇不透光的门，门旁有扇亮着灯的窗户，窗内景象被遮布挡着。"

    # game/script.rpy:29171
    old "I believe it's a jewelry shop. Maybe the owner lives here since there's a second level."
    new "我看是家珠宝店。既然有二楼，店主大概就住在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:29172
    old "And it's still open?"
    new "而且现在还开着门？"

    # game/script.rpy:29173
    old "Every lit window on the path had been high up, so that one stood out. In recent years, a few amateur jewelers had been appearing throughout Yushibana, selling the gemstones found in the nearby mountains."
    new "沿路亮着灯的窗户都在高处，唯独那一扇格外显眼。近几年，丰花一带陆续冒出几个业余珠宝商，兜售从附近山里捡来的宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:29178
    old "Timidly, Shiroya approached the door and tried to open it."
    new "Shiroya 怯生生地走到门前，试着推了推。"

    # game/script.rpy:29186
    old "Oh!{w=0.4} Hello, it's not usual I get a late visit. Are you searching for anything in particular?"
    new "哦！{w=0.4}你们好，这么晚还有客人上门，倒是少见。几位想找点什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:29191
    old "While the old man stepped out from behind the reception desk, Shiroya turned around to meet Atsuki's gaze. He simply shrugged."
    new "老人从柜台后面走出来，Shiroya 转身迎上 Atsuki 的目光。Atsuki 只是耸了耸肩。"

    # game/script.rpy:29196
    old "Noticing Miiya's look of interest, the owner addressed her, slowly bringing her inside."
    new "店主注意到 Miiya 一脸兴致，便开口招呼她，慢慢把她引进了店里。"

    # game/script.rpy:29200
    old "Anything that you see can be put on a necklace, earrings, or even a ring. Are you three looking to buy matching necklaces? Kids usually ask for that."
    new "你在这里看到的，都能镶成项链、耳环，甚至戒指。你们三个是想买一样的项链吧？小孩子一般都会提这个要求。"

    # game/script.rpy:29201
    old "N-Not really, no."
    new "也、也不是……"

    # game/script.rpy:29203
    old "The owner didn't give up, looking at Shiroya for her own answer. On both sides of his shirt was the logo of the shop: Musashi Gemstones."
    new "店主没有放弃，又看向 Shiroya，等她亲自回答。他衬衫两侧印着店里的标志：武藏宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:29214
    old "The three of them stepped farther into the shop and heard the door closing behind them, preserving the warmth. They saw that only a few ceiling lights were on and spotted a heater on the opposite side of the room."
    new "三人往店里走深了些，听见身后的门合上，暖气便留在了屋里。天花板上只亮着几盏灯，房间对面摆着一台取暖器。"

    # game/script.rpy:29216
    old "It was a modest shop with wooden shelves showcasing different kinds of colored stones, each with a price tag next to it."
    new "店面不大，木架上陈列着各色宝石，每块旁边都挂着价签。"

    # game/script.rpy:29217
    old "Even at my age, I regularly go to the two mountains behind us. I've found all that you see here, without exception."
    new "别看我上了年纪，还是常往后面那两座山跑。这儿摆的每一块，都是我亲手捡回来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:29218
    old "The shop was separated by the shelves, and the three found themselves under the obligation to look through them. It was evident that many of the pieces were of lesser quality than the others and were being showcased with hopes they'd eventually be sold."
    new "货架把店堂隔成几段，三人只得挨着架子一路看过去。看得出不少石头的成色不如其他，摆出来只是盼着哪天能卖出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:29221
    old "Being the most interested, Miiya started going through them, knowing she had enough money to buy one if it grabbed her attention. She kept in mind the ones she liked while she continued stepping farther into the shop."
    new "Miiya 兴致最高，开始逐一细看。她知道只要碰上中意的，自己的钱够买下一块。她一边往店里深处走，一边记下喜欢的几样。"

    # game/script.rpy:29228
    old "Shiroya had also seemed captivated by a couple of them, but Atsuki had quickly decided to wait near the entrance, doubting he'd have an interest in anything."
    new "Shiroya 似乎也有几块看中了，Atsuki 却很快打定主意在门口附近等着——他觉得自己不会对这里的东西动心。"

    # game/script.rpy:29229
    old "Don't you want to look at them? See here, I have put together a few wristbands of different colors, and I believe I still have one I'm sure would suit you very well."
    new "你不看看吗？瞧这儿，我串了几条不同颜色的手链，我记得还剩一条，肯定很适合你。"

    # game/script.rpy:29234
    old "When Atsuki looked at the first shelf, he had a quick change of heart. He saw two similar triangular stones in a shining dark blue—his favorite color."
    new "Atsuki 朝第一排货架望去，立刻改变了主意。他看见两颗形状相似的三角形宝石，闪烁着深蓝色的光——那正是他最喜欢的颜色。"

    # game/script.rpy:29235
    old "Do you like these? They're tanzanite, one of the most beautiful gems."
    new "看上这两颗了？这是坦桑石，数一数二漂亮的宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:29240
    old "Behind the shelf, Atsuki could hear the two girls who had come back to his life. He truly hoped things would stay as they were."
    new "隔着货架，Atsuki 能听见那两个重新回到他生命里的女孩的声音。他真心希望一切就这样保持不变。"

    # game/script.rpy:29245
    old "\"Can these be put in a pendant?\" Atsuki spoke in a quiet voice, with the idea to secretly buy matching pendants for them."
    new "「这两颗能做成吊坠吗？」Atsuki 压低声音问，心里盘算着偷偷给她们买一对一样的吊坠。"

    # game/script.rpy:29246
    old "Of course! Come here."
    new "当然可以！过来吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:29247
    old "The owner took both gems and crouched behind the reception desk. In no time, he fitted the two of them into pendants."
    new "店主接过两颗宝石，蹲到柜台后面。转眼工夫，他就把它们嵌进了吊坠。"

    # game/script.rpy:29248
    old "The price was affordable, so Atsuki paid it without saying a word."
    new "价钱不贵，Atsuki 二话不说就付了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29255
    old "The two girls hadn't heard him; Shiroya had stopped in the middle of the shop and was staring at a specific display. After her was Miiya, who'd seen almost everything on offer. She was close to a wooden door, which she believed must've led to a higher level where the old man lived."
    new "两个女孩都没听见他的话。Shiroya 在店中央停下脚步，正盯着某一处陈列出神。Miiya 跟在她后面，几乎把店里的东西都看了个遍，这时已走到一扇木门边。她猜想门后通向更高一层，老人就住在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:29264
    old "Miiya frowned. Upon entering, she'd barely noticed an odd smell which had become a little unpleasant. She couldn't help but feel as if she'd {tip=smell}smelled it before{/tip}, but she couldn't determine what it was."
    new "Miiya 皱起眉头。刚进门时几乎没在意的那股怪味，此刻已变得有些刺鼻。她不由得觉得自己{tip=smell}在哪儿闻过{/tip}，却怎么也想不起那是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:29271
    old "While the owner was putting both pendants in a bag, the door opened, making him quickly let go of them."
    new "店主正把两枚吊坠往袋子里装，门一开，他慌忙松了手。"

    # game/script.rpy:29273
    old "Hello. I'm sorry for coming earlier than arranged."
    new "你好。抱歉，比约定的时间早到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29274
    old "No, don't worry! I'm happy to see you."
    new "哪里的话，不妨事！见到你我很高兴。"

    # game/script.rpy:29279
    old "Atsuki saw the owner morphing his face into a big smile. Through the door came a man wearing an expensive-looking coat that covered most of his face. The owner took him to the reception table, where they began to talk in quiet voices."
    new "Atsuki 看见店主脸上立刻堆起夸张的笑容。门里进来一个男人，身上那件大衣一看就价格不菲，遮住了他大半张脸。店主把他领到柜台前，两人压低声音交谈起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:29284
    old "From the side, Atsuki heard the man speaking briefly. After a nod, the owner walked toward the opposite side of the room and came back after a minute, bringing a heavy-looking, small box."
    new "Atsuki 在一旁听见那男人简短地说了几句。店主点了点头，走向房间另一头，过了一分钟才回来，手里捧着一只看起来很沉的小盒子。"

    # game/script.rpy:29286
    old "\"I'm not done, give me a moment. Oh, and you're aware of what I discussed with Lei, right? The price will be double the usual.\" Those were the sole words Atsuki was able to make out, which made him think that something of high value was being traded. Then, the owner walked back toward the opposite side."
    new "「还没弄好，稍等一下。哦，我和 Lei 谈过的事，你是知道的吧？价钱要按平时的两倍算。」Atsuki 只勉强听清了这几句，不禁猜想他们是在交易什么贵重物品。随后，店主又朝房间另一头走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:29290
    old "In the meantime, the other man peeked inside the box and closed it again."
    new "与此同时，那男人朝盒子里瞥了一眼，又把它合上。"

    # game/script.rpy:29296
    old "Slightly curious, Atsuki glanced at the owner, walking toward Miiya."
    new "出于几分好奇，Atsuki 朝店主瞥了一眼，随后往 Miiya 那边走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:29306
    old "But in an instant, he couldn't spot him anymore, as a dense, dark smoke had invaded his field of vision."
    new "可就在一瞬间，浓黑的烟雾漫进视野，店主的身影再也看不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29311
    old "Behind him, he heard the sound of a door closing. Before he could put two and two together, he collapsed, incapable of movement."
    new "身后传来门合上的声响。他还没来得及想明白，身体便已不听使唤，倒了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:29312
    old "The entire narrow shop had been inundated by the sudden smoke. Out of the four people, none of them were able to resist falling unconscious during the brief instants where they could be alarmed."
    new "狭小的店堂转眼被突如其来的烟雾灌满。四个人只来得及惊惶片刻，便全都失去了意识。"

    # game/script.rpy:29324
    old "...ey!"
    new "……喂！"

    # game/script.rpy:29325
    old "Kid! Can you hear me!?"
    new "小子！听得见吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:29329
    old "Atsuki began to recognize a few words, and his eyes shot open. When he saw that he was still in the shop, he remembered having passed out."
    new "Atsuki 渐渐听清了几个字，猛地睁开眼。看清自己还在店里，他想起了自己昏过去的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:29330
    old "Battling a headache, he stood up and saw two unfamiliar men."
    new "他忍着头痛站起来，看见两个陌生的男人。"

    # game/script.rpy:29331
    old "What the hell happened here...!? Are you okay?"
    new "这儿到底出了什么事……！？你没事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:29332
    old "Atsuki didn't respond and instead peeked past one of the shelves."
    new "Atsuki 没有回答，只是从货架旁探出头去看。"

    # game/script.rpy:29339
    old "There were both blood and pieces of skin scattered across the farther walls. When he took one step forward, he saw a huge hole in the floor."
    new "远处的墙上溅着血，还有零碎的皮肉。他往前迈了一步，看见地板上破了个大洞。"

    # game/script.rpy:29344
    old "Wh-Where are the two girls that were here?"
    new "那、那两个女孩呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:29345
    old "Nobody replied. Not because they didn't want to answer, but because they didn't know. However, going off the blood, they felt they couldn't have responded regardless."
    new "没有人回答。不是不肯答，而是无人知晓。可看着那些血迹，他们觉得即便知道，也说不出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:29346
    old "Behind the two men, Atsuki spotted the owner, looking down at his feet. There was a streak of blood running across his face."
    new "在两个男人身后，Atsuki 看见了店主。他低着头，望着自己的脚边，脸上淌着一道血痕。"

    # game/script.rpy:29347
    old "Hey! Answer me...!"
    new "喂！回答我……！"

    # game/script.rpy:29348
    old "Th-There was an explosion a few minutes ago. That's all we know."
    new "几、几分钟前发生了爆炸。我们只知道这些。"

    # game/script.rpy:29351
    old "Atsuki rushed toward the hole and looked in it, but it was pitch-black. He couldn't see a thing."
    new "Atsuki 冲到洞口往里看，里面漆黑一片，什么也看不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:29355
    old "He could hardly believe his eyes. Shiroya and Miiya had been in the impact zone. Realistically, it was impossible they were alive, but Atsuki found himself rejecting the thought, refusing the gore spread around the shop."
    new "他几乎不敢相信自己的眼睛。Shiroya 和 Miiya 当时就在爆炸中心，按常理绝无生还可能；可 Atsuki 偏偏不肯接受这个念头，也不愿去看店里四溅的血迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:29356
    old "...We've called the police. They should be coming soon."
    new "……我们已经报警了，警察应该很快就到。"

    # game/script.rpy:29357
    old "What the hell is down here? How did the floor break like this?"
    new "这下面到底是什么地方？地板怎么会塌成这样？"

    # game/script.rpy:29358
    old "I came in and didn't see anyone because there was some smoke in the air. I thought the lights were off, so I flipped that switch. I instead turned off the lights, so I turned them back on. ...I think it caused a dust explosion."
    new "我进来的时候，空气里飘着些烟，一个人也没看见。我以为灯是关着的，就按了那个开关。结果反倒把灯关掉了，于是又开回来。……我想，大概是那样引发了粉尘爆炸。"

    # game/script.rpy:29359
    old "If there was gas in the air, turning on the light might've triggered one. They're powerful enough to take down walls, or this floor..."
    new "如果空气里有燃气，开灯就可能引爆。那种爆炸的威力足以掀翻墙壁，更别说这一层地板了……"

    # game/script.rpy:29360
    old "Atsuki denied what he was hearing as he kept staring at the blood surrounding the hole. The entire far side of the shop had basically disappeared. He stood, stunned, recalling the powered-off heater that had been in that corner despite the warmth."
    new "Atsuki 盯着洞口四周的血迹，怎么也不愿相信听到的话。店铺最里头那一侧几乎整个消失了。他怔怔地站着，想起那个角落里原本放着一台断电的取暖器——可屋里却一直是暖的。"

    # game/script.rpy:29366
    old "Very soon, the police appeared, followed by an ambulance. Atsuki explained what had happened, shaking every word out."
    new "很快，警察赶到了，救护车紧随其后。Atsuki 把经过讲了一遍，每个字都说得发颤。"

    # game/script.rpy:29367
    old "He had to be brought to the hospital where his parents used to work in case he'd suffered any damage from either the smoke or the explosion."
    new "因为担心烟雾或爆炸对他造成损伤，他被送去了父母曾经工作过的那家医院。"

    # game/script.rpy:29371
    old "Hours later, after asking continuously, he was told that below the store was a drainage channel where they'd found an unconscious person. However, only traces had been found of the other girl."
    new "几个小时后，在他反复追问之下，才有人告诉他：店铺下方是排水渠，他们在那儿发现了一名昏迷的人；至于另一个女孩，只找到了些许痕迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:29372
    old "The description confirmed to Atsuki that Shiroya was alive, and whose remnants those had been."
    new "从他们的描述里，Atsuki 确认了 Shiroya 还活着，也明白了那些痕迹属于谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:29373
    old "Unresponsive, Atsuki lay back, internally falling apart."
    new "Atsuki 毫无反应，只是向后躺倒，内心彻底垮了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:29380
    old "Shiroya was brought to the hospital. She was in a coma from having fallen so far down, but a nearby shelf had prevented the explosion from hitting her directly."
    new "Shiroya 被送进了医院。她从那么高的地方摔下去，陷入了昏迷，幸亏旁边有一排货架挡住了爆炸的正面冲击。"

    # game/script.rpy:29383
    old "The next day, the police released the details of the events. An individual had released smoke that had put four people to sleep. A short time later, a gas explosion had occurred. It had happened due to the shop's heater being of an older design—one which lacked a failsafe. The heater had burned through all the oxygen immediately surrounding it, which had extinguished its flame but allowed it to continue releasing gas."
    new "第二天，警方公布了事件的详情。有人释放了烟雾，使四个人陷入昏睡。不久之后，发生了燃气爆炸。起因是店里的取暖器型号老旧，没有安全保护装置。取暖器烧尽了周围紧挨着的氧气，火焰因此熄灭，燃气却仍在不断泄出。"

    # game/script.rpy:29384
    old "Given the size of the explosion, that must've happened before the smoke had been released. Then, as everyone had fallen unconscious, nobody had been able to recognize the artificial smell of the gas and ventilate the area, causing it to build up.{w} At {time=21}, when the lights had been turned on, the small spark had ignited that gas.{w} The two people farthest from the center of the blast hadn't been critically harmed, but they'd been sent to the hospital. One girl had entered a coma after falling through the broken floor and hitting her head, and the last girl, who'd been the closest to the heater, had died instantly."
    new "从爆炸的规模来看，燃气泄漏应该发生在烟雾释放之前。之后所有人都昏迷过去，没人辨得出燃气里添加的那股气味，也没人能够通风，燃气便越积越多。{w} 到了 {time=21}，灯光亮起的一刻，一点微小的火花就引燃了燃气。{w} 离爆炸中心最远的两个人没有受到致命伤害，但都被送进了医院。一个女孩从破裂的地板坠落，撞到头部，陷入昏迷；最后一个女孩离取暖器最近，当场身亡。"

    # game/script.rpy:29387
    old "The individual hadn't been caught, but their motive was unclear, as nothing had been stolen. Furthermore, it seemed the explosion itself had been an accident."
    new "释放烟雾的人始终没有落网，但由于没有丢失任何东西，其动机也不得而知。而且，爆炸本身似乎只是一场意外。"

    # game/script.rpy:29393
    old "Atsuki had gone to visit Shiroya, whose parents hadn't shown up. Looking at her resting face, he was unbelievably relieved that nothing had happened to her, but he couldn't process the fact that he'd never see Miiya again. Every time he remembered how happy she'd looked to be back with them, Atsuki's heart seemed to shatter once more."
    new "Atsuki 去医院看望 Shiroya，她的父母始终没有露面。望着她沉睡的脸，他庆幸得几乎不敢相信──她总算平安无事；可他也无法接受自己再也见不到 Miiya 了。每当他想起她重新回到他们身边时那副欢喜的模样，Atsuki 的心就像又碎了一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:29398
    old "Days later, Shiroya woke up without having suffered any lasting mental damage, and the two of them were able to go live together, trying to support each other after what had happened."
    new "几天后，Shiroya 醒了过来，脑部没有留下任何损伤。两人得以住到一起，在经历那一切之后彼此扶持着生活。"

    # game/script.rpy:29399
    old "The day before the 15th, the purse where Miiya had put the three tickets was still in view. They couldn't sleep and decided to walk to Ashiya Tower very early."
    new "十五号的前一天，Miiya 放了三张门票的那个钱包还摆在眼前。两人都睡不着，索性决定一大早就步行去芦屋塔。"

    # game/script.rpy:29400
    old "They looked at the night sky, knowing Miiya wasn't under it anymore. However, as they turned their eyes back to each other, both of them wanted to believe that loss could be overcome. They were still alive."
    new "他们望着夜空，知道 Miiya 已不在那片天空之下。然而，当两人把目光转回彼此身上时，都想要相信，失去是可以熬过去的。他们还活着。"

    # game/script.rpy:29401
    old "After a long wait, they approached the tower and were able to find shelter in it until the event began, the warmth inside a small comfort."
    new "漫长的等待之后，他们来到塔前，在塔里找到一处避风的地方，一直等到活动开始；里面的暖意算是些许慰藉。"

    # game/script.rpy:29438
    old "Grounded Strobe"
    new "接地闪光"

    # game/script.rpy:29442
    old "I'd never entered Ashiya Tower before, but after waiting inside for so long, I'd begun to feel familiar with those walls. More and more people had continued entering through the main door, lengthening the queue behind us."
    new "我以前从没进过芦屋塔，可在里面等了这么久，这些墙壁都让我觉得熟悉起来。人还在不断地从正门进来，我们身后的队伍越来越长。"

    # game/script.rpy:29448
    old "I glanced at my right and saw Atsuki's tired face. We'd been in silence for a long time, and I knew there wasn't much I could do to change that."
    new "我往右边瞥了一眼，看见 Atsuki 一脸疲惫。我们已经沉默了很久，我知道自己也没什么办法打破这种沉默。"

    # game/script.rpy:29449
    old "How tired are you?"
    new "你累得厉害吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:29454
    old "A bit... I'll be fine, though."
    new "有一点……不过没事的。"

    # game/script.rpy:29455
    old "Mingled with the tiredness was misery. Instead of looking back at me, he continued to stare at the rightmost column. Slightly frustrated, I awkwardly averted my eyes too."
    new "疲惫里还掺着苦涩。他没有回头看我，仍旧盯着最右边的那根柱子。我心里有些发闷，也尴尬地移开了视线。"

    # game/script.rpy:29460
    old "I'd known him for a very long time, and he looked like a completely different person. It seemed the distance between us would keep extending despite the reason why we'd come to that building."
    new "我和他认识那么多年，他却像是完全变了一个人。我们之间的距离似乎只会越拉越远，不管我们来这栋楼是为了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:29461
    old "The premise had been to prevent what had happened from disrupting our relationship, but I felt that achieving that was far out of my reach. In addition, I'd had to constantly shape my attitude around it, which I hated."
    new "我们的初衷是不让那件事影响到彼此的关系，可我觉得这远不是我办得到的。何况我还不得不时时围着这件事调整自己的态度，而这让我厌恶。"

    # game/script.rpy:29462
    old "I knew how bad of an idea showing my discontent would've been, so I kept it to myself and continued mirroring his face."
    new "我知道表露出不满会多糟糕，只好把它憋在心里，继续学着他的表情。"

    # game/script.rpy:29469
    old "Everyone who's waiting in line, please get your tickets out."
    new "排队等候的各位，请把门票准备好。"

    # game/script.rpy:29470
    old "The receptionist, who'd been sharing in the quietness, stood up and walked toward us with a barcode scanner."
    new "接待员此前也和我们一样安静，这时站起身，拿着条码扫描器朝我们走来。"

    # game/script.rpy:29471
    old "We were at the front of the line, so I handed her our two tickets. She hovered the machine over both barcodes until it released a quiet beep for each one."
    new "我们排在队伍最前面，我便把两张票递了过去。她把机器对准两个条码扫过，各发出一声轻响。"

    # game/script.rpy:29472
    old "There you go."
    new "给，拿好。"

    # game/script.rpy:29473
    old "She gave them back to me with a smile, and I put them in my purse."
    new "她笑着把票还给我，我收进了钱包。"

    # game/script.rpy:29474
    old "...Oh.{w} I'm glad to see you're back. I hope you enjoy the event."
    new "……哦。{w} 很高兴看到你回来。希望你玩得愉快。"

    # game/script.rpy:29481
    old "For the first time since we'd entered, she glanced at Atsuki's face before saying that."
    new "从我们进门起，她头一次看向 Atsuki 的脸，随后才说出那句话。"

    # game/script.rpy:29488
    old "What did she mean...? I've never been here."
    new "她什么意思……？我从没来过这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:29489
    old "I shrugged since she'd already moved on to the man at our side, but I imagined she'd probably confused him for someone else."
    new "她已经转向旁边那位男士了，我便耸了耸肩，心想她大概是把他认成别人了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29493
    old "There was still more than an hour left until {time=9}, when the front door would open. I'd stopped being curious about what we'd be shown as a result of the overbearing mixture of tiredness and coldness. I'd been paying attention to the brief conversations I could hear to stave off boredom, and they all kept detailing how strange the whole event was."
    new "距离正门开启的 {time=9} 还有一个多小时。疲惫和寒冷交织在一起，压得人没了脾气，我已经不再好奇他们究竟要给我们看些什么了。为了打发时间，我一直留意着周围零星的谈话，而那些话无一不在说这场活动有多奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:29494
    old "Standing up for so long was building up pain on the lower side of my back, so I had to force the thought of enduring it for over another hour out of my mind. I stretched my limbs and torso, trying to resist the urge to lie on the floor."
    new "站得太久，后腰已经开始发痛，我只得强迫自己别去想还得再撑一个多小时。我伸展手脚和腰背，竭力压住想直接躺到地上的念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:29498
    old "Shiroya...?"
    new "Shiroya……？"

    # game/script.rpy:29501
    old "I'd managed to leave my mind empty, but I abruptly turned around when I heard a quiet voice coming from my left. A man was crouching next to me, and when he stood up, I saw his older face underneath white hair."
    new "我好不容易让脑子空了下来，左边却传来一声轻微的呼唤，我猛地转过身。一个男人正蹲在我身旁，他站起身来，我才看清那一头白发下那张上了年纪的脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:29506
    old "Is this yours? I think you dropped it."
    new "这是你的吗？我想是你掉的。"

    # game/script.rpy:29507
    old "He showed me a ticket that must've fallen from my purse when I'd stretched my muscles. I nodded and put it back inside, all while unnerved by his stiff motions."
    new "他递给我一张票，大概是刚才我伸展身体时从钱包里掉出来的。我点点头，把它放回钱包，他的动作僵硬得让我心里发毛。"

    # game/script.rpy:29508
    old "...Thank you."
    new "……谢谢。"

    # game/script.rpy:29512
    old "After turning around, he spent a few seconds staying still until he walked toward the door on the left. He gripped the knob and opened it before slowly disappearing through it."
    new "他转过身去，在原地站了几秒，才朝左边那扇门走去。他握住门把手，推开门，慢慢消失在门后。"

    # game/script.rpy:29513
    old "We weren't supposed to enter yet, so given how nobody apprehended him, he had to be an employee. Atsuki's mood didn't seem to have improved at all, which only caused my own form of anxiety to emerge."
    new "现在还没到入场时间，既然没人拦他，他应该是工作人员。Atsuki 的情绪似乎一点也没有好转，这又让我心里生出另一种不安。"

    # game/script.rpy:29516
    old "I had no way to get rid of it, so all I did was stand up uncomfortably with no perception of what time it was."
    new "我无从排解，只能不自在地站着，连时间过了多久都感觉不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:29525
    old "After a long, lonesome wait, I began to feel more confident and calm. My posture didn't change, but reminding myself that everything would get much better had borne fruits."
    new "漫长而孤单的等待之后，我渐渐有了信心，心也静了下来。姿势虽然没有改变，但在心里反复告诉自己一切都会好得多，似乎真的起了作用。"

    # game/script.rpy:29526
    old "It must've already been {time=9}, because we were told we could advance through the left door if we weren't part of the event. Nobody did, though—everyone present was gathered behind us."
    new "应该已经 {time=9} 了，因为有人告诉我们，不参加活动的人可以从左边那扇门进去。可没人动身——在场的人都聚在我们身后。"

    # game/script.rpy:29535
    old "Sorry for the wait, everyone. We'll now begin the group entrances."
    new "抱歉，让各位久等了。现在开始分组入场。"

    # game/script.rpy:29536
    old "A blonde woman wearing a dark suit came out of our door. I recalled seeing her face in the lobby not much earlier."
    new "一名身穿深色套装的金发女子从我们这扇门里走了出来。我记得不久前才在大厅见过她。"

    # game/script.rpy:29537
    old "My name is Naomi. I'll be chaperoning today's guided visit."
    new "我是 Naomi。今天的导览由我带队。"

    # game/script.rpy:29538
    old "As you likely already know, groups of three will move forward in turns. Each visit is estimated to take approximately fifteen minutes."
    new "想必各位已经知道，三人一组，依次入场。每组参观大约十五分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:29539
    old "Addressing the multitude all at once, she glossed over the procedure and prohibitions. Once she was done, she looked over her glasses."
    new "她对着众人，把流程和禁止事项简要说明了一遍。说完，她从眼镜上方望了过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:29544
    old "Are you three the first group?"
    new "你们三位是第一组吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:29545
    old "I wasn't sure Atsuki had paid attention to her discourse, and the man at our side was visibly out of it. I opened my mouth so that we wouldn't waste more time."
    new "我不确定 Atsuki 有没有在听她讲话，而我们身旁那个男人显然心不在焉。为了不再耽搁时间，我开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:29546
    old "Yeah, we've been here for a while."
    new "对，我们在这儿等了好一会儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29547
    old "Perfect. Please follow me to the event room to be the first to see the Sekimeiya."
    new "很好。请随我去活动室，成为第一批见到 Sekimeiya 的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:29550
    old "Quietly, she turned around and walked through the door. All the chatter had faded away, so the three of us walked behind her, the sound of our footsteps filling up the space."
    new "她默然转身，走进了那扇门。四周的交谈声已经平息，我们三人跟在她身后，脚步声在空间里回响。"

    # game/script.rpy:29555
    old "On the other side was a long hallway with ornate decorations. There were a few open doors in both walls and a handrail linking all of them together."
    new "门后是一条装饰华丽的长走廊。两侧墙上开着几扇门，一道扶手沿着走廊，把几扇门连在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:29561
    old "The woman stepped up to a door in the middle of the left wall and opened it for us."
    new "那名女子走到左墙中间的一扇门前，替我们打开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:29568
    old "This is where we hold many of our events. Make your way inside."
    new "我们有许多活动都在这里举行。请进吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:29573
    old "I crossed gazes with the strange man, whose look and behavior felt out of place. He entered first and stared at the red curtain that was undoubtedly covering the gemstone we'd all come to see."
    new "我与那个古怪的男人对视了一眼，他的神情和举止都显得格格不入。他率先走了进去，盯着那块红色遮布——那后面无疑就是我们都来看的宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:29582
    old "Aside from the display case, the room was empty and only contained a security camera with a flickering green light."
    new "除了展柜，房间里空荡荡的，只有一个闪着绿光的监控摄像头。"

    # game/script.rpy:29583
    old "More people than I'd imagined were intrigued about the day's event. Personally, I was a little curious, so I'd proposed coming despite what had happened. Atsuki had immediately agreed to prove that he was strong enough to get through. Whether to me or himself, though, I didn't know."
    new "对今天的活动感兴趣的人比我想象中多。我自己也有些好奇，所以尽管发生了那些事，还是提议过来。Atsuki 立刻答应了，像是要证明自己足够坚强，能够撑过去。至于那是为了我，还是为了他自己，我不得而知。"

    # game/script.rpy:29591
    old "He was the last to enter, and Naomi closed the door. Then, she asked for our introductions before starting to build up anticipation. According to her, we were sharing space with something of incredible value which had been found in the surrounding mountains."
    new "他最后一个走进来，Naomi 关上了门。随后她让我们各自介绍，接着便开始渲染气氛。据她说，我们正与一件价值惊人的东西同处一室，那是在周围群山中发现的。"

    # game/script.rpy:29596
    old "Part of the experience is the touch, so I will open the glass and let you experience it yourselves. However, I must insist that you be gentle and keep your hands inside the cabinet at all times."
    new "这次体验的一部分就是亲手触摸，所以我会打开玻璃罩，让你们亲自感受。不过我必须强调，请务必轻柔，手自始至终都要放在展示柜内。"

    # game/script.rpy:29597
    old "She took out a keyring from her pocket and isolated one of the smaller keys, which she inserted in a keyhole next to the curtain."
    new "她从口袋里掏出一串钥匙，从中拣出一把较小的，插进遮布旁的锁孔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:29604
    old "I have a question."
    new "我有个问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:29605
    old "Hm? What is it?"
    new "嗯？请说。"

    # game/script.rpy:29606
    old "You keep mentioning how valuable the Sekimeiya is, but is there proof of that? The way you're explaining it, you don't even say what kind of gem it is, only that it's \"rare\"."
    new "你一直说 Sekimeiya 有多珍贵，可有什么证据？照你的说法，你连它是什么宝石都没讲，只说是「罕见」而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:29608
    old "But the value could've been arbitrarily created by Ashiya, as it's not being officially recognized as anything more than an unusual discovery."
    new "但这价值也可能是芦屋随意定出来的——官方至今只把它当作一件不寻常的发现而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:29610
    old "Well, I will let you decide that for yourself. As you said, it's not categorized because nobody was able to properly appraise it. That's all you need to be assured of its value."
    new "这个嘛，就请你自己判断吧。正如你所说，它之所以没有被归类，是因为没人能对它作出恰当的鉴定。你只需知道这一点，就足以相信它的价值了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29615
    old "I apologize for being skeptical, but you must be aware that Ashiya aren't exactly recognized for their fairness."
    new "恕我直言，我确实心存疑虑，但你想必也清楚，芦屋可并不以公正著称。"

    # game/script.rpy:29620
    old "Do you have a reason to say that?"
    new "你这么说，有什么根据吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:29621
    old "Yes, that everyone in the lobby sounded as skeptical as I am."
    new "有。大厅里那些人，听起来都跟我一样怀疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:29622
    old "Maybe seeing it for yourself will convince you."
    new "等你亲眼见到，或许就会信服了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29623
    old "That's what I'm hoping."
    new "我也希望如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:29629
    old "Atsuki and I listened to the conversation until Naomi crouched to grab the bottom of the curtain. The real value of the Sekimeiya wasn't what had piqued my curiosity, as I thought its appearance was what caused all the excitement."
    new "我和 Atsuki 一直听着他们的对话，直到 Naomi 蹲下身，抓住遮布的下摆。真正让我好奇的并不是 Sekimeiya 的价值——我以为，众人之所以兴奋，是因为它的外表。"

    # game/script.rpy:29635
    old "But Naomi's motion was cut off. Before she raised the curtain all the way up, my vision was obstructed by dense smoke that forced me to shut my eyes."
    new "但 Naomi 的动作被打断了。她还没把遮布完全掀开，浓密的烟雾就挡住了我的视线，我只好闭上眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:29640
    old "Ah...!"
    new "啊……！"

    # game/script.rpy:29643
    old "Instantly, I recognized I was rapidly losing control of my body, and I fell to the floor. Nobody responded to my yell, and Atsuki's desperate gasp was all I heard before silence reigned supreme."
    new "我立刻意识到自己正迅速失去对身体的控制，随即倒在地上。没有人回应我的喊声，我只听见 Atsuki 绝望的抽气声，随后一切归于死寂。"

    # game/script.rpy:29644
    old "Immobile on the floor, reality distanced itself from me. It was all too familiar of an experience, but before I could think about that any longer, I blacked out."
    new "我瘫在地上动弹不得，现实也离我越来越远。这种感觉太熟悉了，可我还没来得及细想，便失去了意识。"

    # game/script.rpy:29650
    old "...Hey!"
    new "……喂！"

    # game/script.rpy:29654
    old "Arcology"
    new "生态巨城"

    # game/script.rpy:29659
    old "The world vibrated. I saw Atsuki's hair next to my eyes, and his arm shook me while his entire figure was covered by a dark substance. When he saw I'd awakened, he backed off."
    new "世界在颤抖。Atsuki 的头发近在我眼前，他用手臂摇晃着我，整个人身上覆着一层暗色的东西。见我醒来，他退开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29663
    old "Do you feel okay?"
    new "你感觉还好吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:29664
    old "Uh, y— *cough*{w} *cough* *cough*{w} Wh-What happened? We're still here?"
    new "呃，对——*咳*{w} *咳* *咳*{w} 怎、怎么了？我们还在这儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:29665
    old "Mixing a nod with a shrug, he glanced at the drastically changed scenery. The smoke had tainted everything it touched, including ourselves, and the room had become very dark."
    new "他既点头又耸肩，瞥了一眼面目全非的四周。烟雾所及之处都被染上一层污浊，连我们身上也不例外，房间里已变得非常昏暗。"

    # game/script.rpy:29666
    old "Hh—{w} ...What the fuck is this...?"
    new "呃——{w}……这他妈是什么情况……？"

    # game/script.rpy:29668
    old "All I could do with my strength was look sideways, where I saw Akaro trying to sit up."
    new "我拼尽全力也只能侧过头，看见 Akaro 正试着坐起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:29672
    old "Where did N-Naomi go?"
    new "N-Naomi 去、去哪儿了？"

    # game/script.rpy:29673
    old "I don't know. She wasn't here when I woke up."
    new "我不知道。我醒来时她就不在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:29674
    old "Looks like she left through that door."
    new "看来她从那边那扇门走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29675
    old "Akaro managed to stand up and looked through it. Even though none of us had touched it, it was slightly open."
    new "Akaro 勉强站起身，从门缝往外看。我们没人碰过那扇门，它却微微敞开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:29677
    old "The left hallway was very dark too, and I could see the smoke had blocked the ceiling lights from illuminating it. Strangely, it didn't seem like anyone else was there."
    new "左侧走廊同样昏暗，烟雾挡住了天花板上的灯光，照不亮那里。奇怪的是，那边似乎没有其他人。"

    # game/script.rpy:29678
    old "In addition, none of us had discerned the origin of the smoke. As my mind started to get clearer, I began to process what had happened."
    new "而且，我们都没能辨明烟雾的来源。头脑渐渐清醒后，我才开始梳理刚才发生的一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:29682
    old "Did you hear the alarm before we fell unconscious?"
    new "我们昏过去之前，你听见警报了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:29687
    old "What alarm?"
    new "什么警报？"

    # game/script.rpy:29688
    old "My look told him I hadn't either. Apparently, shortly after I'd been knocked out, a wordless alarm had played."
    new "我的表情已经告诉他，我也没听见。看来我倒下没多久，警报就响过一阵，只是没有任何语音播报。"

    # game/script.rpy:29689
    old "It was fairly obvious: there'd been a terrorist attack. Fortunately, Atsuki and I were safe, although all of us were clearly unsettled by the solitude."
    new "答案显而易见：这里发生过恐怖袭击。所幸我和 Atsuki 都平安无事，只是四下空无一人，那份寂静显然让我们每个人都不安起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:29690
    old "We didn't know how long we'd been asleep or what had happened during that blank period of time. However, something stood out in the room."
    new "我们不知道自己昏睡了多久，那段空白里又发生了什么。不过，房间里有样东西格外扎眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:29691
    old "The three of us were staring at it, and I began to feel able to stand up."
    new "我们三人一同盯着它，我也渐渐觉得自己能站起来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29692
    old "Did someone do this to steal the Sekimeiya?"
    new "这是有人为了偷走 Sekimeiya 干的？"

    # game/script.rpy:29697
    old "Akaro shrugged, wondering the same thing. While Atsuki was still on the floor, I approached the curtain."
    new "Akaro 耸了耸肩，也在琢磨同一个问题。Atsuki 还在地上，我便走向那块遮布。"

    # game/script.rpy:29702
    old "I resumed Naomi's action and raised the curtain all the way up."
    new "我接着 Naomi 刚才的动作，把遮布整个拉了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:29708
    old "Oh, never mind. It's still here."
    new "啊，算了。它还在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:29709
    old "It is?"
    new "真的？"

    # game/script.rpy:29710
    old "I turned around and nodded. Akaro approached me and saw with his own eyes the egg-shaped object contained within the glass, on top of a smooth cushion."
    new "我回头点了点头。Akaro 走到我身边，亲眼看见了玻璃罩中那枚蛋形物件，它正安放在一方光滑的软垫上。"

    # game/script.rpy:29715
    old "Is this really it? I figured they were making a big deal out of nothing, but it's even more underwhelming than I thought."
    new "就是这个？我还以为他们是在小题大做，没想到比我想的还不起眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:29716
    old "It's glowing a little. Maybe that's why?"
    new "它好像微微发着光。也许就是因为这个？"

    # game/script.rpy:29721
    old "...I wonder where Naomi is. This seems pretty fishy."
    new "……不知道 Naomi 跑哪儿去了。这事怎么看都透着古怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:29725
    old "That there's nobody here. I know this seems like an attack, but you know what I said regarding Ashiya's reputation, right?"
    new "我是说这儿一个人都没有。我知道这看起来像袭击，可你还记得我说过芦屋的名声怎样吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:29726
    old "I find it hard to believe they'd set up so much advertisement just for this thing. I'm sure they had something in mind to use this event for. Maybe this was it."
    new "我不太相信他们做了这么多宣传，就为了这么个东西。他们办这场活动肯定另有打算。说不定就是这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:29727
    old "...I don't follow."
    new "……我没听懂。"

    # game/script.rpy:29732
    old "It happened right before we could see the Sekimeiya, and an employee left. Nobody entered yet, and we weren't moved. I have an idea of what's going on."
    new "事情偏偏发生在我们马上要看到 Sekimeiya 之前，而且还有一名员工离开了。没人进来过，我们也没被挪动。我大概猜到是怎么回事了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29733
    old "I'm sure they wanted to use this opportunity to pull out some countermeasure against Xyn, but I don't know what it really entailed. We probably got caught in the middle of it."
    new "他们多半是想借这个机会拿出对付 Xyn 的手段，至于具体是什么，我就不清楚了。我们大概是被卷了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:29734
    old "Akaro filled in Atsuki, who'd never heard of Xyn."
    new "Akaro 给从没听说过 Xyn 的 Atsuki 解释了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:29739
    old "...I still have trouble understanding what you're getting at."
    new "……我还是不太明白你到底想说什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:29744
    old "What does this situation scream to you?"
    new "这局面在你看来像什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:29746
    old "\"Failed robbery attempt\", right?"
    new "「抢劫未遂」，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:29747
    old "They might've purposely acted out a failed attack since they're desperate to publicly say they won once against Xyn. I'm immediately noticing a bunch of odd details that point to that."
    new "他们可能故意演了一出失败的袭击，因为他们急着向公众宣称自己赢过 Xyn 一次。我一眼就能挑出不少古怪的细节，都指向这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:29752
    old "Didn't you say they always attack during the night? Why would they do it during the day?"
    new "你不是说他们总在夜里动手吗？为什么这次选在白天？"

    # game/script.rpy:29753
    old "If anything, that points further at Xyn not being behind it, and a false flag is the possibility next in line. Let's see how much time has passed and why nobody else is here. If I'm wrong, the police or Ashiya should know."
    new "真要说的话，这反倒更说明幕后不是 Xyn，接下来可能就是有人自导自演。先看看过了多久，再看看这里为什么没有别人。要是我猜错了，警察或芦屋那边总该知道实情。"

    # game/script.rpy:29754
    old "I helped Atsuki stay up, and we brushed the remnants of smoke off ourselves. Both of us were extremely tired. The sudden turn of events felt almost surreal, but he still looked distant, almost divorced from reality."
    new "我扶着 Atsuki 站起来，两人拍掉了身上残留的烟尘。我们都累得不行。事情转变得太突然，几乎让人不敢相信，而他的神情依旧恍惚，像是和现实脱了节。"

    # game/script.rpy:29762
    old "It took a few seconds for us to walk normally, but the left hallway was as we'd seen through the door—completely desolate."
    new "我们过了几秒才恢复正常步伐，而左侧的走廊和从门里望见的一样——空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:29768
    old "We opened the opposite door and glanced at the right hallway, where we'd come from. It was in the same state as its parallel neighbor, indicating that whatever had happened was large-scale."
    new "我们打开对面的门，朝来时的右侧走廊望了一眼。那里与另一边同样空荡，可见发生的事波及范围不小。"

    # game/script.rpy:29770
    old "Is that a person?"
    new "那是个人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:29775
    old "Y-You're right. Hey! What the hell happened...!?"
    new "你、你说得对。喂！到底出什么事了……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:29778
    old "He sped up toward them, while I stopped."
    new "他加快脚步朝那边过去，我却停在了原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:29779
    old "Are you okay? I'm sorry I made you come here."
    new "你还好吗？抱歉，是我把你叫到这儿来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:29784
    old "No... Don't worry. None of this is your fault."
    new "不……别在意。那件事不是你的错。"

    # game/script.rpy:29785
    old "...It wasn't my fault, so I didn't push it. I sighed, a bit irritated, and passed it off as loosening myself up, like I'd been getting used to doing."
    new "……既然不是我的错，我也就没有再追问。我有些烦躁地叹了口气，像近来习惯的那样，只当是让自己放松一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:29792
    old "Next to the lobby door, we introduced ourselves to Erina and Sai, as well as Katei—the person I'd exchanged words with before. Sai, Erina, and her daughter had been the group behind us and fell unconscious while waiting in the hallway. Katei told us he worked in the tower as a security manager and that he was trying to piece together what had happened."
    new "在大厅门旁，我们向 Erina、Sai，还有先前和我说过话的 Katei 做了自我介绍。Sai、Erina 和她的女儿就是排在我们后面的那一组人，在走廊等候时也昏了过去。Katei 说自己在这座塔里担任安保主管，正设法弄清究竟发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:29797
    old "...Naomi was gone?"
    new "……Naomi 不见了？"

    # game/script.rpy:29798
    old "He looked down, worried."
    new "他垂下目光，忧心忡忡。"

    # game/script.rpy:29799
    old "I'd been suspecting her, but I can't believe I was right."
    new "我一直在怀疑她，没想到真被我猜中了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29804
    old "We have to find her. I'm almost certain she was behind the attack."
    new "必须找到她。我几乎可以确定，袭击就是她策划的。"

    # game/script.rpy:29809
    old "What do you mean, \"we have to find her\"? How can you even be sure she's still here?"
    new "「必须找到她」是什么意思？你又怎么确定她还留在这儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:29815
    old "Through the poor illumination, I was able to see many expressions lowering at once."
    new "昏暗的光线下，我看见好几个人的脸色同时一沉。"

    # game/script.rpy:29818
    old "Katei revealed the effects of the alarm Atsuki had heard. Although the trigger was unknown, it had sealed every method of escape for twelve hours."
    new "Katei 道出了 Atsuki 听到的那阵警报的作用。虽然不知是如何触发的，但它封锁了所有逃生手段，持续十二小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:29819
    old "Despite Akaro's insistence, Katei kept repeating that he wasn't allowed to reveal anything else, but he claimed he was unsure about other details."
    new "不管 Akaro 怎么追问，Katei 只是反复说自己无权透露更多，其余细节他也说不清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:29824
    old "I don't get what you're saying. The Sekimeiya wasn't stolen: it's still in that cabinet, so you can't just ignore the activation of the alarm."
    new "我不明白你在说什么。Sekimeiya 没被偷走，它还好端端地待在展示柜里，那警报响过的事总不能就这么不管吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:29825
    old "If that's true, I'm as clueless as you are."
    new "如果真是这样，那我和你一样摸不着头脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:29830
    old "What does it look like?"
    new "它长什么样？"

    # game/script.rpy:29835
    old "It's basically a big egg."
    new "基本上就是一颗大蛋。"

    # game/script.rpy:29840
    old "You're right. That's the Sekimeiya.{w} In case Naomi didn't warn you, the Sekimeiya must never be taken out of its cabinet. The temperature provided to it is essential to maintain it well. Did you keep it shut inside?"
    new "说得没错，那就是 Sekimeiya。{w} 也许 Naomi 没提醒过你们：Sekimeiya 绝不能从展示柜里拿出来。要妥善保存它，恒定的温度必不可少。你们一直把它关在柜里没动过吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:29848
    old "Hm... I wonder if the alarm halted the plan, or if Xyn intends to take it out once the time expires."
    new "嗯……不知道是警报打断了计划，还是 Xyn 打算等时限一过就把它取走。"

    # game/script.rpy:29853
    old "See what I told you two? He already believes Xyn are behind this. That could very well be Ashiya's intention."
    new "看吧，我不是跟你们俩说过吗？他已经认定这事是 Xyn 干的。这说不定正是芦屋的用意。"

    # game/script.rpy:29862
    old "Isla, whose mother hadn't stopped trying to bring her back to consciousness, opened her eyes and coughed a few times. After a few awkward seconds, Katei told her what had happened."
    new "Isla 的母亲一直在设法唤醒她，这时 Isla 终于睁开眼睛，咳了几声。尴尬的几秒钟过去后，Katei 把发生的事告诉了她。"

    # game/script.rpy:29863
    old "What...?{w} Why can't we leave?"
    new "什么……？{w} 为什么我们不能离开？"

    # game/script.rpy:29864
    old "The exit is blocked off, and so are all the windows above. It's to prevent thieves from escaping."
    new "出口被封住了，楼上所有窗户也一样。这是为了防止窃贼逃走。"

    # game/script.rpy:29866
    old "So a thief is here?"
    new "也就是说，这里有窃贼？"

    # game/script.rpy:29868
    old "Well, we don't think anything was stolen, so it's very possible something went wrong."
    new "这个嘛，我们觉得没有东西被偷，所以很可能是哪里出了差错。"

    # game/script.rpy:29869
    old "You're not giving us much to work with. What could've gone wrong?"
    new "你这样说，我们根本无从判断。到底是什么地方可能出问题？"

    # game/script.rpy:29870
    old "As I said, the system behind the alarm is new and has hardly been tested. Plenty of things could have."
    new "我说过了，警报背后的系统是新装的，几乎没做过测试。可能出问题的地方多的是。"

    # game/script.rpy:29871
    old "And you don't think the timing was way too precise for that?"
    new "你不觉得这个时机巧得不像差错吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:29872
    old "Let's go to the lobby. I'm curious about the blocked door."
    new "去大厅看看吧。我想看看那扇被封住的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:29877
    old "Interrupting the conversation, Sai stood up and told us to follow him. His intrigue was certainly shared, so we went through the door at our side."
    new "Sai 打断谈话，起身让我们跟他走。我们同样满心好奇，便穿过身旁的那扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:29888
    old "Behind it was the untouched lobby. Even though four lights had turned off, the middle one shined strongly at our eyes, causing all of us to grimace as we stared at the imposing shutter that had appeared in front of the exit. The only trace of all the people who'd been there was the janitor's bucket."
    new "门后是原封未动的大厅。四盏灯虽然熄了，中间那盏却仍亮得刺眼，我们全都眯起眼睛，望向出口前那道森然落下的卷帘门。先前聚在这里的人留下的痕迹，只剩清洁工的水桶。"

    # game/script.rpy:29894
    old "Forget what I said."
    new "当我没说。"

    # game/script.rpy:29895
    old "It was clearly impossible to take that down, completely keeping us shut inside."
    new "那东西显然没法弄下来，我们被彻底关在了里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:29897
    old "According to Katei, the remaining door in the lobby area led to a little basement below us that stored the boiler, and there was no feasible way to leave the building before it automatically opened. He also told us that the alarm had disabled the computer on the reception desk."
    new "据 Katei 说，大厅区域剩下的那扇门通向下方一间放锅炉的小地下室；卷帘门自动打开之前，没有任何办法离开这栋楼。他还告诉我们，警报让前台的电脑用不了了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29898
    old "We were rightfully frustrated, as it seemed all of us had gotten innocently trapped, and we weren't even sure why. Thankfully, though, everyone was keeping calm.{w} I was quite tired, which might have watered down my reaction to everything. It was hard to believe what I was experiencing was real, but I would most likely fall asleep somewhere well before the deadline."
    new "我们自然很烦躁——所有人似乎都无辜被困，连原因都不清楚。所幸大家还都保持冷静。{w} 我相当累，或许也因此对这一切反应迟钝。我很难相信眼前经历的一切是真的；不过离截止时间还早，我很可能在那之前就睡着了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29905
    old "The hallway door was slightly open, so someone went through it after the smoke was released, or else this hall would be stained as well."
    new "走廊的门虚掩着，说明烟雾放出后有人从那扇门出去过，否则这条走廊也会被染黑。"

    # game/script.rpy:29913
    old "Look, the one to the other hallway's open too. Was it you, Katei?"
    new "看，通往另一条走廊的门也开着。是你吗，Katei？"

    # game/script.rpy:29925
    old "Are all the windows this well blocked too?"
    new "所有窗户也都封得这么严实吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:29926
    old "They should be."
    new "应该都是。"

    # game/script.rpy:29931
    old "Do we have to spend the entire time isolated? Can we not even talk to the outside to understand what happened? This is ridiculous."
    new "我们就得一直这样被关着？连跟外界联系、弄清发生了什么都不行？太荒唐了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29937
    old "Oh, w—"
    new "哦，等——"

    # game/script.rpy:29943
    old "We can't, actually."
    new "其实，不行。"

    # game/script.rpy:29944
    old "I thought for a second we might've been able to, but I just realized the alarm's side effects made that impossible."
    new "我刚才有一瞬间以为或许可以，但随即想到，警报的副作用让这事办不到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:29950
    old "That's insane. Why would this alarm even be created that way?"
    new "简直离谱。这套警报为什么要设计成这个样子？"

    # game/script.rpy:29956
    old "I recall telling you I'm not allowed to disclose that."
    new "我记得跟你说过，这件事我不能透露。"

    # game/script.rpy:29961
    old "Is there footage from all the cameras that we could look at?"
    new "监控摄像头的录像能调出来看吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:29962
    old "No. The alarm made that impossible as well."
    new "不能。警报也让这没法做到。"

    # game/script.rpy:29973
    old "I apologize. I personally looked at every room on this floor, and I'm confident in saying we're the only people here. Right now, our priority is finding Naomi, who I suspect is hiding upstairs."
    new "抱歉。这一层每个房间我都亲自查看过，可以肯定这里只有我们几个人。眼下最要紧的是找到 Naomi——我怀疑她藏在楼上。"

    # game/script.rpy:29979
    old "Is there anything of importance you found while you investigated?"
    new "你查看的时候，有没有发现什么要紧的东西？"

    # game/script.rpy:29985
    old "Yes. The farthest crystal room in hallway A is the only other one in which the smoke was released. That's how we refer to the exhibition rooms, by the way."
    new "有。除这里之外，释放过烟雾的房间只有 A走廊最里面那间水晶展室。顺便说一句，我们平时就是这样称呼这些展室的。"

    # game/script.rpy:29990
    old "Huh? Smoke was released in another room? Why?"
    new "咦？另一个房间也放了烟雾？为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:29992
    old "Katei shook his head, indicating that he couldn't answer. As we had nowhere else to go, we were compelled to move over to it."
    new "Katei 摇了摇头，表示他无法回答。我们也没有别的地方可去，只好往那里走。"

    # game/script.rpy:30006
    old "A sturdy, gray door caught our attention first, and thanks to the map next to it, we learned that the security room was behind it. We could also see the basic layout of the floor we were on, named the crystal floor."
    new "首先映入眼帘的是一扇厚重的灰色门。多亏门旁的地图，我们才知道门后是监控室。地图上也标出了我们所在这一层的大致格局——这一层名为水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:30012
    old "As it says there, this is the security room, but we won't be able to access it. The door was locked by the alarm, and we have no means to open it."
    new "那上面写着这里是监控室，但我们进不去。警报把门锁上了，我们没办法打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:30016
    old "Forced to accept that, we kept walking toward the room Katei had indicated on the map, labeled A5."
    new "我们只得接受这一点，继续朝 Katei 在地图上指出的房间走去，那里标着 A5。"

    # game/script.rpy:30025
    old "The appearance of the narrow room perfectly replicated the hallways. Every curtain was stained black, and very little light let us see where we were."
    new "狭长的房间和走廊如出一辙。所有遮布都被熏成黑色，透进来的光少得可怜，勉强能看清四周。"

    # game/script.rpy:30028
    old "However, we were at least able to shine some light on the situation by revealing that the contents of all the cabinets had been removed, which Katei hadn't noticed. At first glance, we could tell it was a well-conceived plan."
    new "不过，我们至少也查明了情况：所有展示柜都被清空，而 Katei 先前并未察觉。只消一眼就能看出，这是一场精心策划的行动。"

    # game/script.rpy:30029
    old "Despite that, it was Sai who quickly proposed a different idea. The lack of gems in that room could've been a mere diversion, as it was too hard to believe something as important as the Sekimeiya hadn't been the target of a real robbery attempt."
    new "然而，Sai 很快提出了另一种看法。那间屋子里的宝石不翼而飞，或许只是障眼法；毕竟很难相信，像 Sekimeiya 这样重要的东西，竟然不是这场盗窃真正的目标。"

    # game/script.rpy:30036
    old "In the last and shorter hallway were the bathrooms, which nobody entered."
    new "最后一条走廊更短，里面有洗手间，谁都没有进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:30042
    old "What's in the staff room? Could we find a phone there?"
    new "员工室里有什么？会不会有电话？"

    # game/script.rpy:30047
    old "No. Every staff member has a personal locker, but we could only open mine, and I don't keep any devices inside."
    new "没有。每位员工都有自己的储物柜，但能打开的只有我自己那个，而且我不会在里面放任何设备。"

    # game/script.rpy:30056
    old "...There's a reason why I believe Naomi hid upstairs if she's part of this, like I suspect. Above us are five desolate floors full of offices. However, there's a seventh floor that we call the attic, or the Ashiya floor."
    new "……我怀疑 Naomi 也牵涉其中，若真是这样，我想她藏到楼上是有原因的。我们头顶上是五层空荡荡的办公室。不过还有第七层，我们称之为阁楼，也叫芦屋层。"

    # game/script.rpy:30057
    old "Katei explained the story behind its existence, and he left the most important detail for the end."
    new "Katei 讲起了它存在的来龙去脉，却把最重要的细节留到了最后。"

    # game/script.rpy:30062
    old "I don't have the key to access it—only Naomi does. She's the sole, trusted individual chosen to preserve its interior as well as possible, and she possesses the only key I know of."
    new "「能进去的钥匙不在我手上——只有 Naomi 有。她是唯一被选中的人，负责尽量维持里面的原貌；据我所知，钥匙也只有她有。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30067
    old "So she can stay inside for as long as she pleases."
    new "「这么说，她想在里面待多久都行。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30072
    old "That's right. If Atsuki is correct, and she was still in the event room when the alarm went off, she has to be hiding. Otherwise, she would've shown herself already. The attic makes the most sense for that."
    new "「没错。如果 Atsuki 说得对，警报响起时她还在活动室，那她一定躲起来了。否则她早该露面了。要躲，阁楼是最合理的地方。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30073
    old "I didn't find anyone else on this floor, so she's most certainly above. I doubt we'll be able to do anything if she's locked in the attic, but we have to do all we can to find her."
    new "「这一层我没找到别人，所以她多半在上面。如果她把自己锁在阁楼里，我们恐怕也无计可施，但总得尽力找到她。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30081
    old "A door was in the middle of the staircase. Katei was surprised to see it unlocked because it shouldn't have opened in the past few days. When we were about to walk up the stairs, Isla asked whether we could take the elevator instead."
    new "楼梯中间有一道门。Katei 见它没锁，有些意外——这几天这门本不该被打开过。我们正要上楼时，Isla 问能不能改坐电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:30084
    old "Indifferently, Sai tried to open its door, but it didn't budge."
    new "Sai 漫不经心地试着开门，门却纹丝不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:30085
    old "Katei told us what we needed to know about it. No key was necessary to access the other floors with it except for the attic, which required Naomi's special key."
    new "Katei 把该知道的都告诉了我们。乘它去其他楼层都不需要钥匙，唯独阁楼例外，要用 Naomi 那把特殊的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:30090
    old "However, it's not going to work."
    new "「不过，这行不通。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30096
    old "Right now, the elevator won't move if you call it. The alarm disabled it."
    new "「现在就算按了，电梯也不会动。警报把它停掉了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30104
    old "...I see. Sorry, Isla, but there's nothing we can do about that."
    new "「……是这样啊。抱歉，Isla，这点我们也没办法。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30109
    old "Aww."
    new "「唔——」"

    # game/script.rpy:30110
    old "Isla was displeased, but she was doing a fairly good job of not making a scene for a child her age. The wooziness left by unconsciousness probably played some part in that."
    new "Isla 一脸不满，但以她这个年纪的孩子来说，能忍住没闹起来已经算相当克制了。昏迷过后残留的昏沉大概也起了一些作用。"

    # game/script.rpy:30121
    old "The second floor looked absolutely nothing like the first. Varying shades of blue and gray surrounded us, emanating a far calmer atmosphere."
    new "二楼和一楼截然不同。深浅不一的蓝与灰将我们包围，气氛沉静得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:30122
    old "Our goal was to inspect the whole building. While we had Katei's guarantee that there was no one on the crystal floor, we knew nothing about the ones above it. However, assuming he was right about the attic, we wouldn't find Naomi anyway."
    new "我们的目标是查遍整栋楼。Katei 保证水晶层没有其他人，可楼上几层我们一无所知。不过，假如他关于阁楼的说法没错，我们照样找不到 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:30125
    old "We began with the bathrooms."
    new "我们从洗手间开始查。"

    # game/script.rpy:30129
    old "After those, we inspected the offices, occupying the main body of the floor. There were three office rooms separated by translucent walls, all containing powered-off computers."
    new "之后是占据楼层主体的办公室。三间办公室由半透明的隔墙分开，里面都摆着关机的电脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:30133
    old "Next, the blocked windows made us stop. Just like below, exiting by force was out of the question."
    new "接着，被封死的窗户让我们停下了脚步。和楼下一样，想强行出去根本不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:30137
    old "Lastly, we saw the corridor leading to the third floor."
    new "最后，我们查看了通往三楼的走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:30145
    old "It looked exactly like the second, with swapped staircases."
    new "这里和二楼一模一样，只是楼梯的位置左右对调了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30151
    old "We repeated the same process and concluded there was nothing to be found on it. Katei didn't have the login information for the computers, so our single way to measure the time was Sai's wristwatch. According to that, the time was {time=9:50.}"
    new "我们照同样的流程查了一遍，断定这层也一无所获。Katei 不知道电脑的登录信息，唯一能看时间的就只有 Sai 的手表。据表上显示，此刻是{time=9:50.}"

    # game/script.rpy:30161
    old "With Katei at the front, we stepped onto the fourth floor. While the bathrooms were being checked, I felt someone's hand on my shoulder."
    new "Katei 走在最前面，我们踏上了四楼。就在检查洗手间的时候，我感到有只手搭上了我的肩膀。"

    # game/script.rpy:30168
    old "Acid Rain"
    new "酸雨"

    # game/script.rpy:30170
    old "It was Atsuki's. He was at the back of the group, maintaining his predictable reserved attitude."
    new "那是 Atsuki 的手。他走在队伍最后，一如往常地沉默寡言。"

    # game/script.rpy:30171
    old "...Look at this. I found it in the staircase."
    new "「……你看看这个。我在楼梯里捡到的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30174
    old "What was surprising was seeing a silver key on the palm of his hand. It looked fairly modern, and not like one that would belong to any door nearby."
    new "让我吃惊的是，他摊开的掌心里躺着一把银色钥匙。钥匙样式相当新，不像附近哪扇门会用的。"

    # game/script.rpy:30175
    old "Oh, hm."
    new "「哦，嗯。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30185
    old "When I turned around to face the others, he stopped me."
    new "我转身面向其他人，他却叫住了我。"

    # game/script.rpy:30186
    old "I'd like to not tell them."
    new "「这事我想先别告诉他们。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30193
    old "At his signal, I walked down the stairs with him. Everyone else was either in the bathrooms or waiting next to them, so they didn't notice us."
    new "他朝我示意，我便随他下了楼。其他人不是在洗手间里，就是在旁边等着，没人注意到我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:30200
    old "This doesn't look like an ordinary key, so it should open a special door."
    new "「这不像普通钥匙，应该能开某扇特殊的门。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30201
    old "Oh, the attic's?"
    new "「哦，阁楼的？」"

    # game/script.rpy:30206
    old "I don't think so. Doesn't it remind you of the security room door?"
    new "「我觉得不是。你不觉得它像监控室那扇门的钥匙吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:30207
    old "Hm... I guess it does."
    new "「嗯……确实像。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30208
    old "I could be imagining things, but I think there are a few details Katei mentioned that don't make any sense."
    new "「也许是我想多了，不过 Katei 提到的几处细节，我觉得说不通。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30214
    old "And if this really opens the security room, it could confirm that.{w} Wasn't Katei in front of us all this time, checking the floor as if he was looking for something?"
    new "「如果这真能打开监控室，就能证实这一点。{w}这一路 Katei 不都走在最前面，一边查看地面，一边像在找什么东西吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:30215
    old "Is that so? I didn't pay attention."
    new "「是吗？我没留意。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30216
    old "It's possible he was trying to find this key, which he didn't tell us about. If it's related to the security room... it makes sense he would've kept it a secret since there are some inconsistencies there."
    new "「他也许一直在找的就是这把钥匙，却没跟我们提过。如果它和监控室有关……那地方本就有些矛盾之处，他瞒下不说也说得通。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30222
    old "While he walked around the floor, he filled me in on what he'd been suspecting. A few assertions Katei had made about the time of the attack contradicted each other."
    new "他一边在这一层走动查看，一边把心里的怀疑讲给我听。Katei 就袭击发生的时间说过几句话，前后互相矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:30223
    old "I was taken aback. Not by the idea that Katei was potentially lying, but because Atsuki had been thinking about all of it. During the previous days, he'd looked like a person whose life had been drained out of him. At that moment, he was completely serious, which made me consider that he thought the attack was related to what had happened two weeks earlier."
    new "我吃了一惊。不是因为他怀疑 Katei 可能在说谎，而是因为 Atsuki 竟一直在想这些。前几天他看上去就像被抽走了生气的人。此刻他却一脸认真，我不由得想，他是不是认定这场袭击和两周前的事有关。"

    # game/script.rpy:30224
    old "Realizing that he'd gone back to being someone I could have a conversation with, I decided to humor him and follow him downstairs. In truth, what he was saying made sense."
    new "意识到他又变回了那个能和我好好说话的人，我决定顺着他，跟他下楼。说实话，他讲的确实有道理。"

    # game/script.rpy:30225
    old "Katei specifically stated that the alarm shut the door to the security room. If he wanted to hide the existence of its key, it followed that we could open it despite whatever reason he had to prevent that."
    new "Katei 明确说过，是警报让监控室的门关上的。如果他有意隐瞒那把钥匙的存在，那么不管他出于什么理由不愿让我们打开，我们其实都打得开。"

    # game/script.rpy:30226
    old "Given that he worked inside it and seemed to expect the key to be on the floor of the office rooms, maybe he'd been the one to drop it and wasn't completely sure where it fell."
    new "考虑到他就在里面工作，而且似乎以为钥匙会掉在办公室的那几层，也许正是他自己弄丢的，并不确定究竟掉在了哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:30232
    old "One of Atsuki's points was undeniable: Katei had been surprised to hear Naomi was gone, but he later claimed that he inspected the entire lowest floor. He claimed to leave both doors in the lobby open while he searched, but all the crystal rooms he'd supposedly looked into were closed. It was an indication that he wanted to direct us upward, where he knew he could find his key..."
    new "Atsuki 有一点无可辩驳：Katei 听说 Naomi 不见时很吃惊，可后来又说自己查过最低那一整层。他声称搜查时把大厅的两扇门都敞着，可他说自己查过的那些水晶展室，门却全都关着。这正表明他想把我们往上引——他知道自己的钥匙就在上面……"

    # game/script.rpy:30237
    old "Also, I think he actually saw it, but he didn't say anything. He probably wanted to grab it when we moved on."
    new "「还有，我觉得他其实看见了，只是没吭声。他大概想等我们往前走之后再捡。」"

    # game/script.rpy:30253
    old "Hey...! Where are you two going?"
    new "喂……！你们两个要去哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:30261
    old "On the second floor, we turned around and saw Erina and Isla. They were alone and must have realized we'd left."
    new "上到二楼，我们回过头，看见 Erina 和 Isla。她们身边没有别人，想必已经发现我们走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30266
    old "...I found this key, and I'd like to know if it belongs to the security room."
    new "……我找到了这把钥匙，想知道它是不是监控室的。"

    # game/script.rpy:30274
    old "Without hesitating, Atsuki told Erina what his intent was, at which she looked a little surprised. After hearing that, she took Isla's hand and came with us. Isla didn't object, as it seemed the crystal floor was where she preferred to be."
    new "Atsuki 毫不犹豫地把自己的打算告诉了 Erina，她听后有些意外。随后，她牵起 Isla 的手跟了上来。Isla 没有反对——她似乎本来就愿意待在水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:30281
    old "If Katei had a reason to keep us away from the security room, we had no idea what it was. Atsuki was right to point out that he'd lied more than once—we couldn't trust that those lies were for the sake of confidentiality. We had no obligation to tell him what we were doing instead of just entering the room before he could think of a way to keep us out of it."
    new "如果 Katei 有什么理由不让我们进监控室，我们实在想不出那是什么。Atsuki 说得没错，他已经撒过不止一次谎——我们无法相信那些谎言都是为了保密。我们没义务向他说明自己在做什么，倒不如趁他还没想出拦我们的法子，直接进房。"

    # game/script.rpy:30291
    old "We were in front of the security room. The metallic door did resemble the key we'd found, and it was hard to believe they weren't a match."
    new "我们站在监控室门前。那扇金属门确实和我们捡到的钥匙很相配，很难相信两者不是一对。"

    # game/script.rpy:30292
    old "Atsuki inserted it in the keyhole and turned."
    new "Atsuki 把钥匙插进锁孔，拧了一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:30298
    old "Huh?{w} It enters all the way, but it's not unlocking it."
    new "咦？{w} 能整个插进去，锁却打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:30299
    old "The key was getting stuck in the middle of the turn, but as he'd said, it had to be the correct one. We stood behind him, confused."
    new "钥匙转到一半就卡住了，但正如他所说，这一定是正确的那把。我们站在他身后，一头雾水。"

    # game/script.rpy:30305
    old "That means the door is open, right?"
    new "那说明门本来就没锁，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:30310
    old "Atsuki looked down and met Isla's eyes. After considering her conclusion, he twisted the doorknob and pushed the door open."
    new "Atsuki 低头对上 Isla 的视线。他想了想她的结论，随后转动门把手，把门推开。"

    # game/script.rpy:30318
    old "You're right... What the hell? It wasn't even locked.{w} This was the right key, though..."
    new "你说得对……搞什么？门压根没锁。{w} 可这把钥匙明明是对的……"

    # game/script.rpy:30322
    old "From the hallway, we saw many lit screens in front of us illuminating a dim space. It seemed like a bit of smoke had leaked through the gaps of the door.{w} Slowly, we made our way in, wondering whether Katei had purposely lied or simply been incorrect."
    new "从走廊里望去，前方许多亮着的屏幕照亮了一间昏暗的屋子。似乎有些烟雾从门缝里渗了出来。{w} 我们慢慢走进去，心里琢磨 Katei 究竟是在故意撒谎，还是单纯说错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30330
    old "Katei said the alarm locked the door. You really think that was a lie to stop us from trying to open it...?"
    new "Katei 说警报把门锁上了。你真觉得那是为了不让我们试着开门而编的谎……？"

    # game/script.rpy:30335
    old "If that's it, he must have something to hide, probably on the computer."
    new "要真是这样，他肯定有事瞒着我们，八成就在那台电脑里。"

    # game/script.rpy:30337
    old "On top of the desk were three monitors. The one in the middle had its entire screen occupied by a messy program related to the security cameras, while both side monitors were only displaying the desktop."
    new "桌上摆着三台显示器。中间那台的整个屏幕被一个与监控摄像头有关的程序占满，界面杂乱；两侧的显示器则只显示着桌面。"

    # game/script.rpy:30344
    old "We got closer to them. There was a single chair in front of the middle screen that Atsuki gripped the back of.{w} He was going to sit on it, but he stopped short."
    new "我们走近了些。中间屏幕前只有一把椅子，Atsuki 握住了椅背。{w} 他正要坐下，却停住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30348
    old "We thought the lights had gone off until we saw only the screens had, which darkened the room considerably. The ones above, displaying the real time footage of the security cameras, were still working."
    new "我们还以为灯灭了，随即发现只是显示器黑了，房间因此暗了不少。上方那些显示监控实时画面的屏幕仍在工作。"

    # game/script.rpy:30354
    old "Did the computer shut down?"
    new "电脑关机了？"

    # game/script.rpy:30355
    old "The fans are still going. It probably entered sleep mode because it's been a while since anyone used it."
    new "风扇还在转。大概是太久没人用，进入休眠了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30365
    old "He grabbed the mouse, and as soon as he moved it, the three screens powered back on, showing the same images as before."
    new "他动了动鼠标，三块屏幕立刻重新亮起，画面和之前一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:30371
    old "Should I try to look at anything? We might get in trouble... If Katei's plan was to keep us out of this room, he won't be able to do so anymore."
    new "要不要我试着查点什么？我们可能会惹上麻烦……如果 Katei 本打算把我们挡在这间屋外，现在他可做不到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30372
    old "Maybe he wanted to find the key and lock the door before we realized it was open. You know, so we'd believe what he said about the alarm locking it."
    new "也许他想赶在我们发现门没锁之前找到钥匙，把门锁上。这样一来，我们就会相信他说的警报锁门那套话。"

    # game/script.rpy:30373
    old "Thanks to the taskbar, I noticed that a few programs were working in the background. Maybe something we couldn't see was hidden in one of them."
    new "我注意到任务栏上有几个程序在后台运行。也许其中一个程序里藏着我们看不见的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:30378
    old "Hey, isn't that weird?"
    new "喂，那是不是有点奇怪？"

    # game/script.rpy:30384
    old "Behind the chair, Erina was looking up at the live screens. They were showing different parts of the floor we were on, although a few of them displayed only a static, black image. According to Katei, that was due to the smoke covering them."
    new "椅子后面，Erina 正抬头看着实时监控屏。屏幕上显示着我们所在楼层的不同位置，不过有几块只呈现出一片静止的黑色。按 Katei 的说法，那是烟雾遮住了镜头。"

    # game/script.rpy:30385
    old "But after looking at them for a few seconds, we noticed the large inconsistency Erina had seen."
    new "可盯了几秒，我们就发现了 Erina 看到的那个明显破绽。"

    # game/script.rpy:30386
    old "Yeah, that one. It's showing hallway B."
    new "对，就是那块。它显示的是 B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:30391
    old "Wait, you're right. How is that possible...?"
    new "等等，你说得对。这怎么可能……？"

    # game/script.rpy:30393
    old "Hallway B was clearly visible through one of the monitors. Although a bit of smoke obstructed the view, it wasn't enough to block it completely. The angle was from a corner above the door to the lobby."
    new "其中一块显示器上，B走廊清晰可见。虽然有些烟雾遮挡视线，却不足以完全挡住画面。拍摄角度来自通往大厅那扇门上方的一个角落。"

    # game/script.rpy:30398
    old "That's basically where we fell unconscious. It's impossible the smoke didn't hit it as much as the other cameras. The difference is huge."
    new "那基本就是我们昏倒的地方。其他摄像头都被烟雾熏成那样，它不可能没受影响。差别太大了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30399
    old "Something must be wrong about this, then... This has to be the live footage since the ceiling and walls are covered by smoke."
    new "那这里面肯定有蹊跷……天花板和墙壁都覆着烟雾，这画面只可能是实时的。"

    # game/script.rpy:30406
    old "It followed that the difference had to be the camera itself. We turned around and stepped back into hallway A. The silence told us that nobody was close to us, but it was unlikely that would continue for very long. Erina closed the security room behind her, causing a loud noise."
    new "看来问题只能出在摄像头本身。我们转过身，退回 A走廊。四周一片寂静，说明附近没人，但这种安静多半持续不了多久。Erina 关上了监控室的门，发出很响的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:30411
    old "The covered cabinet still sat awkwardly in the event room, which we passed through to enter hallway B."
    new "那台罩着布的展示柜仍旧突兀地摆在活动室里；我们穿过活动室，进入 B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:30421
    old "It's that one."
    new "就是那个。"

    # game/script.rpy:30422
    old "In the left corner, above the lobby door, was a security camera with a flickering green light."
    new "大厅门上方左侧角落，有一台监控摄像头，绿光一闪一闪。"

    # game/script.rpy:30423
    old "All of us frowned. After all, it looked identical to the other ones, but with one very important distinction."
    new "我们全都皱起眉。毕竟它看上去和其他摄像头一模一样，却有一个极其重要的不同之处。"

    # game/script.rpy:30431
    old "There's almost no smoke on its lens... How's that even possible?"
    new "它的镜头上几乎没沾到烟雾……这怎么可能？"

    # game/script.rpy:30432
    old "The camera itself is obviously stained, so there's no way the lens wasn't hit directly by the smoke."
    new "机身明显沾着烟渍，镜头不可能没被烟雾直接熏到。"

    # game/script.rpy:30433
    old "Did someone clean it off?{w} I doubt anyone paid attention to this camera when we were here before, so we can't know how long it's been like this."
    new "有人擦过吗？{w} 之前我们在这儿的时候，恐怕没人注意过这台摄像头，所以也无从知道它这样多久了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30435
    old "If someone wiped off some of the smoke, it could only have been Katei or Naomi. I'm pretty sure Naomi was really knocked unconscious, so only Katei is left."
    new "如果有人擦掉了部分烟渍，那只能是 Katei 或 Naomi。我确定 Naomi 当时是真昏过去了，所以就只剩 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:30436
    old "M-Maybe Sai could have, if he faked waking up after me. I don't know how, though."
    new "也、也许是 Sai，如果他是在我之后假装醒来的。不过我不知道他怎么做到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:30437
    old "Why are you sure there's no one else here?"
    new "你为什么确定这里没有别人？"

    # game/script.rpy:30438
    old "A hidden person could've done it too, yeah..."
    new "也对，躲起来的人也可能做这种事……"

    # game/script.rpy:30439
    old "We haven't seen anyone else, Isla. It's too high to reach it normally, and I think removing all the smoke stuck there would take some time."
    new "我们没看见过别人，Isla。那地方太高，正常情况下够不到，而且我觉得要把上面沾的烟渍全擦掉得花不少时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:30442
    old "Maybe this is what Katei was hiding from us. I don't think we would have realized this lens was clean without going into the security room. It's black like the smoke, and there's very little light here."
    new "也许这就是 Katei 想瞒着我们的事。要不是进了监控室，我们恐怕不会发现这个镜头是干净的。它和烟雾一样黑，这里光线又很暗。"

    # game/script.rpy:30443
    old "Yeah, and we noticed as soon as we took one look inside. That might make more sense than him only wanting us to not use the computer. He could've just ordered us to not touch it."
    new "对，而且我们往监控室里一看就发现了。这比‘他只是不想让我们用电脑’更说得通。他大可直接命令我们别碰。"

    # game/script.rpy:30444
    old "Do you seriously think he's behind this?"
    new "你真觉得是他干的？"

    # game/script.rpy:30445
    old "I don't know, I just thought a few of his claims didn't make sense. Being a member of the security staff would let him pull some things off, though, so maybe."
    new "不好说。我只是觉得他有几处说法讲不通。不过他毕竟是安保人员，有些事确实办得到，所以也说不准。"

    # game/script.rpy:30446
    old "You two have to know about Xyn, right?"
    new "你们俩应该知道 Xyn 吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:30447
    old "Yeah, Akaro talked about them briefly."
    new "嗯，Akaro 简单提过。"

    # game/script.rpy:30448
    old "I'm sure everyone who's aware of them has assumed they're involved in this. I wouldn't rule out this whole thing being some complicated plan, so keeping this camera working might be what they want."
    new "知道 Xyn 的人，肯定都觉得这事和他们脱不了干系吧。我也不排除整件事都是他们布下的复杂计划，所以让这台摄像头继续运作，或许正合他们的意。"

    # game/script.rpy:30455
    old "We walked to hallway C with a few things to question the others about. It didn't seem like they were trying to find us, as we would have immediately heard them calling."
    new "我们带着几个想问他们的问题，往 C 走廊走去。他们似乎并没有在找我们，否则早该听见喊声了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30463
    old "When we arrived at the fourth floor, we still hadn't found anyone."
    new "到了四楼，我们仍然没见到任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:30472
    old "Did they keep going without us?"
    new "他们没等我们就先走了？"

    # game/script.rpy:30477
    old "I guess so."
    new "大概吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:30483
    old "The bathrooms, where we'd last seen them, were open and empty. We circled through the floor and arrived on the fifth one for the first time."
    new "我们最后见到他们的那几间洗手间门开着，里面空无一人。我们在这层绕了一圈，然后第一次上到了五楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:30487
    old "It didn't look different from the others, and we couldn't see anyone. We repeated the same route we had on the lower floors, reaching the last one we had access to."
    new "这里和其他楼层没什么两样，也不见人影。我们照着在下面几层走过的路线又走了一遍，来到了能进入的最高一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:30492
    old "The attic door should be here, so maybe they found a way to get in."
    new "阁楼的门应该就在这儿，也许他们找到了进去的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:30496
    old "We went to the opposite corridor, where we found the entrance to the next floor. Although it looked like a dead end at first, a gray door came into view when we got closer."
    new "我们走向对面的走廊，在那里找到了通往下一层的入口。起初看着像是死路，走近后才看见一扇灰色的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:30505
    old "Yeah, this must lead to the attic."
    new "嗯，这扇门一定通向阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:30507
    old "Upon turning the knob, Erina realized the door was locked, like we'd been told."
    new "Erina 转动门把手，发现门锁着——和之前听到的说法一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:30512
    old "It can't be that they're inside. Maybe they followed us down and we missed each other."
    new "他们不可能在里面吧。也许是跟着我们下了楼，两边正好错开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30518
    old "A little lost, we walked back and stood in front of the offices. We hadn't checked the last few since it had seemed unlikely the others would've still been looking through them."
    new "我们有些不知所措，便折回去，站在办公室前。最后几间还没查过——毕竟那几个人不太可能还在里面翻找。"

    # game/script.rpy:30522
    old "Atsuki and I checked the third partition and didn't find anyone. Then, we opened the two bathrooms, which were also vacant."
    new "我和 Atsuki 查看了第三间隔间，没找到人。接着又打开两间洗手间，同样空着。"

    # game/script.rpy:30526
    old "The same was repeated on the fifth floor with identical results."
    new "五楼又重复了一遍，结果一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:30531
    old "When we were walking down to the fourth, we stumbled upon someone going up."
    new "我们下楼去四楼时，正巧撞见有人往上走。"

    # game/script.rpy:30538
    old "Oh, here you are! I couldn't find you."
    new "啊，你们在这儿！我到处都找不到你们。"

    # game/script.rpy:30543
    old "Are you alone...?"
    new "你一个人……？"

    # game/script.rpy:30548
    old "I am. Where did you go? I was using the bathroom below and saw that nobody was still outside when I left."
    new "嗯。你们去哪儿了？我刚才在楼下用洗手间，出来时外面已经没人了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30555
    old "Huh? We found the key to the security room, so we went to the crystal floor. Katei and Sai didn't come with us, though."
    new "咦？我们找到了监控室的钥匙，就去了水晶层。不过 Katei 和 Sai 没跟我们一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:30560
    old "...I-I'm confused.{w} Why did you not wait for us? Did you actually open the security room?"
    new "……我、我有点糊涂了。{w}你们怎么不等我们？监控室真的打开了？"

    # game/script.rpy:30561
    old "Yes, that's why we'd like to find Katei."
    new "打开了，所以我们才想找到 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:30566
    old "...I see. I looked through the remaining floors since I imagined you all kept going up, but they were empty. I got to the Ashiya floor's door, which I couldn't open. After that, I walked back down to the crystal floor, but I haven't found anyone until now."
    new "……原来如此。我以为你们会一直往上，就把剩下的楼层都找了一遍，可全是空的。我到了通往芦屋那层的门，打不开。之后我又下到水晶层，直到现在才碰上人。"

    # game/script.rpy:30567
    old "It appeared we'd actually missed each other. Since we'd just looked through the floors above us, we kept descending."
    new "看来我们确实是彼此错过了。既然楼上的几层刚刚查过，我们便继续往下走。"

    # game/script.rpy:30585
    old "Oh, here you are! Where the hell did you go?{w} And where's Katei?"
    new "哦，你们在这儿！你们到底跑哪儿去了？{w}Katei 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:30586
    old "As soon as we stepped onto the third floor, we reunited with Sai, who rapidly approached us."
    new "我们刚踏上三楼，就遇上快步走过来的 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:30593
    old "You're alone too? ...We found the key to the security room and went to the crystal floor."
    new "你也是一个人？……我们找到了监控室的钥匙，就去水晶层了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30594
    old "Where did you find it?"
    new "在哪儿找到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:30599
    old "Atsuki saw it in this staircase."
    new "Atsuki 在这段楼梯上看到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:30604
    old "Huh, I see, and you went to check if it worked?"
    new "哦，这样啊。然后你们就去试钥匙管不管用？"

    # game/script.rpy:30605
    old "We nodded, awaiting his explanation."
    new "我们点点头，等着他解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:30610
    old "I suddenly saw you were all gone and didn't know if you'd walked down or toward the offices, but I figured I hadn't noticed you'd gone down the stairs.{w} ...I didn't find anyone when I went all the way down. I was gonna search through the first floor until I heard a sound coming from the stairs that I followed up here."
    new "我一转眼就发现你们全不见了，也拿不准你们是下楼了还是去了办公室那边，不过我猜是自己没留意你们下了楼梯。{w}……我一路走到下面，谁也没找到。本来打算把一楼搜一遍，后来听见楼梯那边有动静，就顺着声音上来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30616
    old "So we missed you on the crystal floor."
    new "看来我们是在水晶层错过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30617
    old "He shrugged."
    new "他耸了耸肩。"

    # game/script.rpy:30622
    old "I get what you're saying, though. You were able to open the security room."
    new "不过你的意思我明白了。你们把监控室打开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30623
    old "Before we could explain the more important details, another person appeared from the office corridor."
    new "我们还没来得及解释更重要的细节，办公室走廊那边又出来一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:30633
    old "Oh, here you are! I knew I'd probably missed you up here."
    new "啊，你们在这儿！我就猜是在楼上跟你们错过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30638
    old "Where were you?"
    new "你刚才在哪？"

    # game/script.rpy:30644
    old "I should be the one asking that. I got out of the bathroom and saw that nobody was waiting outside. There was no one on the upper floors, so I went back down. I thought that maybe all of you went down to the crystal floor for some reason."
    new "这话该我问才对。我从洗手间出来，发现外面没有人在等。楼上也找不到人，我就折了回去。我想你们会不会因为什么原因都下到水晶层去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30645
    old "It didn't seem like anyone was there, so I figured that I missed all of you inside the offices somewhere."
    new "那边似乎也没人，于是我又想，是不是在办公室那边跟你们错过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30651
    old "Hm... We probably passed each other when I was looking alone through the higher floors."
    new "嗯……大概是我一个人在上面几层找的时候，和你们擦肩而过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30657
    old "Well, why did you all leave...? Of course, nobody has seen Naomi, right?"
    new "话说回来，你们怎么都走了……？对了，没人见过 Naomi 吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:30662
    old "I'm curious about something. Why exactly is it that we can't enter the security room?"
    new "我有点好奇。监控室到底为什么进不去？"

    # game/script.rpy:30668
    old "The security room? Didn't I mention it? The alarm locked it."
    new "监控室？我没说过吗？警报把它锁上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30669
    old "And there's no way to undo that lock?"
    new "那锁没办法解除吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:30675
    old "That's surprising, seeing as they found the key and unlocked it."
    new "那倒奇怪了。他们可是找到了钥匙，还把门打开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30687
    old "Atsuki took the silver key out of his pocket and showed it to him."
    new "Atsuki 从口袋里取出那把银色钥匙，拿给他看。"

    # game/script.rpy:30688
    old "...What the hell? Of course I knew this key could unlock it, but where did you find it?"
    new "……怎么回事？这把钥匙能开那把锁，我自然知道。可你们是在哪儿找到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:30689
    old "In this staircase."
    new "就在这段楼梯上。"

    # game/script.rpy:30695
    old "That's very strange. There aren't many keys like this one, and I left mine inside the security room without thinking about it. That's why I thought we'd have no way to enter again."
    new "太奇怪了。这样的钥匙没有几把，我自己的那把随手留在了监控室里。所以我才以为，我们再也没法进去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30700
    old "But you said that you left after the alarm played, right? You would've had to unlock the door to get out if the alarm locked it."
    new "可你说过，你是在警报响过之后才离开的。要是警报把门锁上了，你出去的时候总得开锁吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:30706
    old "...No key is needed to unlock it from the inside, and after closing the door from the outside, it automatically locked itself again since I didn't disable many of the alarm's functions."
    new "……从里面开门不需要钥匙。从外面把门关上之后，它会自动重新上锁——警报的许多功能我都没关掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:30711
    old "I'm confused. Even though we found the key, we didn't use it to unlock the door. It was already unlocked."
    new "我糊涂了。钥匙是找到了，可我们没用它开门。门本来就没锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:30717
    old "...{w}Excuse me?{w} That's not how it was programmed to work.{w} Regardless, is that why you suddenly left? To see if you could open the security room?"
    new "……{w}你说什么？{w}程序可不是这么设定的。{w}话说回来，你们突然离开，就是为了试试能不能打开监控室？"

    # game/script.rpy:30724
    old "None of you are permitted to enter without my consent. Why was I not informed about the key?"
    new "没有我的允许，你们谁都不能进去。找到钥匙的事，为什么没人告诉我？"

    # game/script.rpy:30730
    old "I'm sure it was because of all the stuff you've said. I would've done the same thing. It appears the door being locked is just another false claim of yours."
    new "多半是因为你先前说的那一堆话。换作是我，也会这么做。看来门锁着也只是你的又一个谎话。"

    # game/script.rpy:30733
    old "What?{w} What is wrong with what I've said?{w} And that must've been a malfunction in the alarm. I had no way to confirm the lock was set when I left since the inner knob undoes it by itself, and I didn't check behind me to see if it locked automatically. It should have, but it appears it didn't."
    new "什么？{w}我说的话有什么问题？{w}那一定是警报出了故障。因为内侧的旋钮会自动开锁，我离开时没法确认门锁上了没有；我也没有回头确认它是否自动锁上了。本该锁上的，看来并没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:30738
    old "I suppose that's not too ridiculous."
    new "这说法倒也不算太离谱。"

    # game/script.rpy:30744
    old "...Wait a second. We can enter the security room! Why the hell are we talking about this!? Now we have a way to communicate with the outside. I said the alarm shut it down because I thought it locked the way in. We'll be able to look at the recorded footage as well!"
    new "……等等。我们能进监控室了！还在这儿扯这些干什么！？现在我们有办法和外界联络了。我说警报把它切断了，是因为我以为警报把入口锁死了。这下连录像也能看了！"

    # game/script.rpy:30750
    old "Oh, that's fantastic. Let's go, then."
    new "哦，那可太好了。那我们走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:30755
    old "Although, it wouldn't exactly have been the alarm to have cut off our access to it. It would've been your ineptitude for not bringing your key out with you."
    new "不过嘛，让我们进不去监控室的，与其说是警报，不如说是你自己没带钥匙，真够糊涂的。"

    # game/script.rpy:30761
    old "...I can't deny that. It was my mistake."
    new "……这我无法否认。是我的过失。"

    # game/script.rpy:30766
    old "And yet an identical key was found up here. We'll see if you can find yours inside the room."
    new "可这楼上偏偏又找到一把一模一样的。至于能不能在监控室里找到你那一把，就看你的了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30773
    old "Katei nodded slowly and began to walk back. When the conversation ceased and the rest of us followed in silence, I glanced over at Atsuki. His brief bout of investigation had been just that: brief. Emptiness was the only thing written on his face whenever he wasn't pursuing some thought."
    new "Katei 缓缓点头，转身往回走。谈话就此停下，我们默默跟在后面，我朝 Atsuki 瞥了一眼。他方才那阵追问，也就只有那么短短一阵。只要不是在琢磨什么，他脸上剩下的就只有一片空茫。"

    # game/script.rpy:30778
    old "Nobody next to him had a clue how he was feeling, and he'd decided to at least pass himself off as stable. His initiative from before had been a tad surprising, but it was clear that his mind was someplace else entirely."
    new "身旁没人知道他究竟是什么心情，而他自己至少打定主意要装出情绪稳定的样子。他刚才主动开口，让我有点意外，可谁都看得出，他的心根本不在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:30779
    old "With how strong those emotions were supposed to be, adopting a made-up expression of sorrow was pathetically easy. Out of recent habit, the sight of his face made my own a mirror, and I let my shoulders drop."
    new "那些情绪想必极为强烈，可要装出一副悲伤的模样，竟容易得可悲。近来我已习惯如此——一见到他的脸，我的神情便不由自主地变得和他一样，肩膀也随之垮下。"

    # game/script.rpy:30791
    old "We were walking down the stairs that led to the second floor when Sai's voice brought us to a halt."
    new "我们正沿通往二楼的楼梯往下走，Sai 的声音让我们停住了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:30799
    old "Katei, how many keys do you have?"
    new "Katei，你身上有几把钥匙？"

    # game/script.rpy:30800
    old "He turned around, staring at Sai uncertainly."
    new "他转过身，神色不安地盯着 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:30806
    old "That's not too hard of a question, is it?"
    new "这问题不算难吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:30807
    old "We understood the reason behind it. As soon as Katei began to walk down the stairs, conspicuous, metallic noises came from him."
    new "我们都明白他为什么这么问。Katei 刚一迈步下楼，身上就响起了格外分明的金属碰撞声。"

    # game/script.rpy:30808
    old "Earlier, you did have a few keys, but the sound you were making just now was significantly different. Like they'd doubled in number, even."
    new "之前你身上是带着几把钥匙，可你刚才弄出的动静明显不一样。听着简直像多了一倍。"

    # game/script.rpy:30813
    old "You're out of your mind."
    new "简直胡说八道。"

    # game/script.rpy:30818
    old "Perhaps, which is why I'm asking."
    new "也许吧，所以才要问。"

    # game/script.rpy:30823
    old "What exactly is the issue? I am entrusted with many keys so that my job goes smoothly."
    new "这到底有什么问题？为了工作顺利，我手上本就管着不少钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:30828
    old "Like I said, the issue is that it sounded like you have more now. Did you recently come across a few?"
    new "我说过了，问题在于刚才听着像多出了几把。你最近是不是又拿到了什么钥匙？"

    # game/script.rpy:30834
    old "I'm intrigued, then. Care to show them? Maybe I'm going insane."
    new "那我就更好奇了。拿出来看看？也许真是我发了疯。"

    # game/script.rpy:30839
    old "I'd rather not. These aren't keys visitors are supposed to have."
    new "还是不要了。这些不是访客该拿的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:30844
    old "Did you miss the word \"show\"? I'm not going to take any."
    new "你没听见我说的是『看看』吗？我又不会拿走。"

    # game/script.rpy:30846
    old "Seeing that he was against the request, Sai took two steps forward."
    new "见他摆明了不答应，Sai 向前迈了两步。"

    # game/script.rpy:30850
    old "Although it was Katei who looked down on him, with a quick motion, Sai rapidly snaked his hand in and out of Katei's deep pocket, where the metallic sound had come from."
    new "Katei 明明正俯视着他，Sai 却迅速把手探进 Katei 那只发出金属声的口袋深处，又马上抽了回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:30856
    old "With one finger, Sai was holding a keyring with four keys on it."
    new "Sai 用一根手指勾着一串钥匙，上面共有四把。"

    # game/script.rpy:30861
    old "I suppose these would make the noise. Why did you not want to show them to us?"
    new "发出响声的，应该就是这些了。你为什么不肯拿出来给我们看？"

    # game/script.rpy:30866
    old "Because I didn't feel like humoring your condescending attitude. Are you satisfied now?"
    new "因为我不想惯着你那副居高临下的样子。现在满意了？"

    # game/script.rpy:30867
    old "Hardly. What do they open? And what's this thing? ...Tape?"
    new "差远了。这些是开什么的？还有这个……是什么？……胶带？"

    # game/script.rpy:30869
    old "Stuck on the keyring was a dark, tiny piece of material. When he separated it from the keys, we identified it as duct tape, and it had smoke residue on it."
    new "钥匙串上粘着一小块深色的东西。他把它从钥匙上剥下来，我们才认出那是布基胶带，上面还沾着烟熏的痕迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:30870
    old "Wait, isn't that one...?"
    new "等等，那该不会是……？"

    # game/script.rpy:30871
    old "I grabbed the keys and looked at them on my palm."
    new "我抓起那串钥匙，摊在掌心端详。"

    # game/script.rpy:30879
    old "Yes, the Sekimeiya cabinet's. This is the keyring Naomi had."
    new "对，是 Sekimeiya 展示柜的。这就是 Naomi 拿的那串钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:30884
    old "Oh, wouldn't that explain it?"
    new "哦，那不就说得通了？"

    # game/script.rpy:30890
    old "Naomi's keyring? That's a big leap you're making. This is my own, with the same keys Naomi has."
    new "Naomi 的钥匙串？你这步子可迈得太大了。这是我自己的，上面的钥匙和 Naomi 那串一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:30897
    old "Yes, I am aware of the keys I'm given. This was the original set, in fact. Naomi was given a replica of it since her job was recently expanded."
    new "当然，发给我的钥匙我一清二楚。其实这一串才是最初配的那套，Naomi 拿的是照它复制的，因为她的职责范围最近扩大了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30902
    old "So, all these keys belong to you and you didn't find it just now."
    new "也就是说，这些钥匙全都是你的，你也不是刚刚才捡到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:30908
    old "You do understand there's a simple way to prove whether you're lying, right?"
    new "你应该明白，想证明你有没有撒谎，办法很简单吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:30915
    old "I see. You don't get it.{w} You're claiming these are yours, am I right? You didn't just come across Naomi whatsoever."
    new "我明白了，原来是你没搞明白。{w}你是说这串钥匙本来就是你的，对吧？你根本没碰见过 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:30921
    old "...You're being very irritating. How do you intend to prove whatever accusation you're making?"
    new "……你真是烦人。你打算怎么证明你提出的这些指控？"

    # game/script.rpy:30926
    old "It's not a definitive way, but earlier, you said that Naomi has the attic key and you don't."
    new "算不上铁证。不过你刚才说过，阁楼的钥匙在 Naomi 手上，你没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:30933
    old "So, if one of these keys opens the attic, we can confirm you're lying, which I was already fairly certain of. How does that sound?"
    new "那么，只要这串钥匙里有一把能打开阁楼，就能证明你撒了谎——虽然我本来就相当确定。你看如何？"

    # game/script.rpy:30938
    old "I think this one might fit in the keyhole we saw."
    new "我觉得这一把也许能插进我们看到的那个锁孔。"

    # game/script.rpy:30939
    old "This one? It's definitely the odd one out. I'm glad Naomi didn't keep it separated."
    new "这一把？确实和别的都不一样。还好 Naomi 没把它单独分出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:30940
    old "Sai turned around and started walking up the stairs. Even though going to the security room was a priority, nobody stopped him."
    new "Sai 转过身，沿着楼梯往上走。虽然去监控室才是当务之急，但没有人拦他。"

    # game/script.rpy:30941
    old "If he was right, and Katei had recently obtained that keyring, he knew exactly where Naomi was and had been given those keys after constructing the illusion that the attic was only accessible for her."
    new "如果 Sai 没猜错，而 Katei 最近才拿到那串钥匙，那就说明他对 Naomi 的下落一清二楚；他先制造出阁楼只有她能进的假象，之后才拿到那些钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:30951
    old "...What are you even trying to prove? There are quite a few things I'm simply not allowed to speak about."
    new "……你到底想证明什么？有些事根本不允许我说出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:30955
    old "As we were reaching the sixth floor, Katei's mumbles stopped Sai."
    new "我们快到六楼时，Katei 低声嘟囔了几句，让 Sai 停下了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:30961
    old "Are you implying that you didn't tell us you had the key for the attic so that we wouldn't try to access it?"
    new "你是想说，你瞒着没提自己有阁楼钥匙，就是为了不让我们去开那扇门？"

    # game/script.rpy:30966
    old "I'm implying that you're vastly overstepping."
    new "我是说，你管得太宽了。"

    # game/script.rpy:30971
    old "That might sound intimidating if you hadn't lied so much already."
    new "要不是你已经撒了这么多谎，这话说不定还真能唬住人。"

    # game/script.rpy:30972
    old "You are merely assuming that."
    new "那不过是你自己的臆测。"

    # game/script.rpy:30977
    old "Of course, I can't prove that the security room didn't stay open because of an error, so yeah, I will assume that was something you said to temporarily cover your ass."
    new "当然，我没法证明监控室一直开着不是故障所致。所以没错，我就当那句话是你临时找的借口。"

    # game/script.rpy:30982
    old "...You will end up regretting all this."
    new "……你迟早会为这一切后悔的。"

    # game/script.rpy:30988
    old "Sai ignored him and looked at his side, where the elevator was. He approached it and pressed the circular button, which Katei had assured us would do nothing earlier."
    new "Sai 没理他，转头看向一旁的电梯。他走过去，按下那个圆形按钮——先前 Katei 还向我们保证过，按了也不会有任何反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:30993
    old "I might as well check if the elevator is still working due to another error since it seems your claims can be ignored."
    new "既然你的话都可以不当回事，那我就顺便看看电梯是不是也因为别的故障还能用。"

    # game/script.rpy:31004
    old "...The elevator was disabled. That's much more unlikely to have gone wrong. If it was working for some reason, the button would light up when it arrived."
    new "……电梯处于停用状态。它出故障的可能性要小得多。要是它不知为何还能运行，到达时按钮会亮起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:31006
    old "...Do you remember the lights in the lobby? That was also caused by the alarm, so it appears the security room was the single exception."
    new "……你还记得大厅的灯吗？那也是警报造成的。看来监控室是唯一的例外。"

    # game/script.rpy:31012
    old "Sai accepted that Katei was probably right in that instance and kept walking."
    new "Sai 接受了 Katei 这次大概没说错，便继续往前走。"

    # game/script.rpy:31017
    old "After making it around the floor, we stood in front of the sturdy-looking door."
    new "绕了这一层一圈，我们停在了一扇看起来十分坚固的门前。"

    # game/script.rpy:31018
    old "I picked the key that seemed to fit and inserted it into the keyhole. After a turn, the door was unlocked.{w} Sai wasted no time in opening it and looking within."
    new "我挑了那把看起来对得上的钥匙，插进锁孔。一转，锁便开了。{w}Sai 毫不迟疑地推门张望。"

    # game/script.rpy:31023
    old "I will give you all a warning. Do not enter this place. This is a very special floor that must not ever be accessed by visitors."
    new "我警告你们所有人。不要进这个地方。这一层非常特殊，绝不能让访客进入。"

    # game/script.rpy:31028
    old "Let me tell you what's actually happening now. Given how likely it is that Naomi's in this place and you were planning to enter it freely, we're going to ignore your warning."
    new "不如我来说说现在到底是怎么回事。Naomi 很可能就在里面，而你自己本来也打算随便进出，所以你的警告我们就当没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:31029
    old "Once again, even though Katei looked around at everyone, nobody stepped forward to side with him."
    new "Katei 又一次环视众人，却依旧没有人站出来支持他。"

    # game/script.rpy:31030
    old "Naomi must be in this building, and if she hasn't shown herself yet, she must want to keep on hiding. You said you wanted to find her too, right? Regardless of whether the two of you are working together, she's probably here. We just confirmed the elevator's not working, so she's cornered."
    new "Naomi 一定就在这栋楼里。她到现在都没露面，说明她还想继续躲着。你说过你也想找到她，对吧？不管你们俩是不是串通好的，她多半就在这里。电梯刚刚确认不能用，她已无路可退。"

    # game/script.rpy:31035
    old "I can't believe what I'm hearing. Go ahead and screw yourselves over, but don't be surprised by the consequences."
    new "我真不敢相信自己的耳朵。你们非要自找麻烦就去吧，出了什么事别怪我没提醒。"

    # game/script.rpy:31038
    old "Without a second thought, Sai went past the door and began to climb up a dark staircase."
    new "Sai 想都没想，径直穿过门口，沿着一道昏暗的楼梯往上走。"

    # game/script.rpy:31049
    old "We followed behind him, forming a single-file line within the narrow space. Sai stopped at the top, in front of another closed door."
    new "我们跟在他身后，在狭窄的空间里排成一列。Sai 在顶端停下，面前又是一扇关着的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:31054
    old "After applying force to open it, we could make out the room in front of him. Atsuki and I were behind, so the three of us were first to see what was on the sofa."
    new "他用力一推，门开了，门后的房间出现在他眼前。Atsuki 和我在他身后，于是我们三人最先看清了沙发上的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:31061
    old "Whoa, what's that doing there? ...Is it the Sekimeiya?"
    new "哇，那东西怎么会在这儿？……是 Sekimeiya 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:31068
    old "We'd only described its appearance to the people who hadn't seen it, but a bright egg was exactly what was resting on the sofa."
    new "我们只向没见过它的人描述过它的样子，而沙发上放着的东西，正是一颗发亮的蛋。"

    # game/script.rpy:31069
    old "What? Was it brought here?"
    new "什么？是被人搬到这儿来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:31070
    old "Do you really see the Sekimeiya in there? Why are you not going in?"
    new "你们真的看见 Sekimeiya 在里面？那怎么还不进去？"

    # game/script.rpy:31075
    old "Wait. The floor has recent footprints on it, and someone was here not long ago."
    new "等等。地板上有新鲜的脚印，不久前有人来过这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:31076
    old "You don't say. If the Sekimeiya's there, someone had to have just brought it up.{w} Oh, that could be really bad...! It needs to be put in its cabinet immediately! Please, step aside."
    new "那还用说。Sekimeiya 要是在那儿，肯定是有人刚把它搬上去的。{w}哎呀，那可就糟了……！得马上把它放回展示柜！请让一让。"

    # game/script.rpy:31081
    old "...{w}Do you think these footprints make any sense?"
    new "……{w}你们觉得这些脚印说得通吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:31082
    old "He looked at the two of us.{w} I stared at the floor, trying to understand what he was getting at. A few seconds later, neither of us had responded."
    new "他看向我们两人。{w}我低头盯着地板，想弄清他究竟在指什么。几秒过去，我们谁也没有答话。"

    # game/script.rpy:31085
    old "It's a little hard to see. Maybe I'm misinterpreting them."
    new "不太看得清。也许是我看错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:31086
    old "Can you go in so we can see what you mean?"
    new "你能不能走进去一点，让我们看看你指的是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:31091
    old "Are you talking about the faded ones?"
    new "你说的是那些淡掉的脚印？"

    # game/script.rpy:31096
    old "Yeah. They don't continue, and not only those."
    new "对。它们到那儿就断了，而且不止那一组。"

    # game/script.rpy:31097
    old "Please, let me get through. The Sekimeiya has to be brought down...! I already told you how important that is."
    new "拜托，让我过去。Sekimeiya 必须搬下去……！它有多重要，我已经跟你们讲过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:31099
    old "I looked at the floor again. The fuzzy carpet had preserved the more recent footprints, so the movements of the person who'd been there were recorded. It didn't seem like there was a security camera anywhere, so the footprints were our only indication."
    new "我又看向地板。长毛地毯留下了较新的脚印，把来过这里的人的动向记录了下来。这里似乎哪里都没装监控，脚印便成了唯一的线索。"

    # game/script.rpy:31100
    old "There was a line of them going from our door to the sofa, and it looked like it had been traversed more than once. From the sofa, a single pair of footprints went to a door, and from there, they came back to where we were."
    new "有一串脚印从我们进来的门口延伸到沙发，那段路似乎不止走过一次。而从沙发那里，另一组脚印通向一扇门，随后又折回我们站的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:31101
    old "Sai took a large step forward, trying to cover up the least possible existing footprints. Atsuki and I did the same."
    new "Sai 迈开大步向前，尽量少踩到原有的脚印。Atsuki 和我也照做。"

    # game/script.rpy:31110
    old "You're right...! It's the Sekimeiya."
    new "你说得没错……！是 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:31113
    old "As soon as he saw it, he rushed over but stopped abruptly at the sofa."
    new "他一看见它便冲了过去，却在沙发前猛地停住。"

    # game/script.rpy:31118
    old "Oh...! It's pretty."
    new "哦……！真漂亮。"

    # game/script.rpy:31123
    old "Stop! None of you must touch it. That could make things even worse."
    new "住手！你们谁都不许碰它。那只会让情况更糟。"

    # game/script.rpy:31133
    old "It doesn't seem damaged to me. Is that not how it usually looks?"
    new "看起来不像坏了。它平时不是这个样子吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:31134
    old "Erina, Isla, and Akaro joined us on the left side, beside the footprints Katei had run over."
    new "Erina、Isla 和 Akaro 也来到我们左侧，站在 Katei 踩过的那片脚印旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:31135
    old "Are you sure it would damage it? Naomi said we could touch it."
    new "你确定这样会弄坏它？Naomi 说过我们可以碰的。"

    # game/script.rpy:31140
    old "Under normal circumstances, yes. Have you not heard what I've been saying? The cabinet downstairs provides it with a cold temperature. If you were to touch it with your bare skin, it would heat it up even more, and that could be dangerous."
    new "通常情况下，是的。我刚才说的话你们都没听进去吗？楼下的展示柜让它保持低温。要是直接用手去碰，它只会变得更热，那可能会有危险。"

    # game/script.rpy:31145
    old "So was it not you who left it here?"
    new "这么说，把它留在这里的人不是你吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:31150
    old "Wh-What!? Of course not!"
    new "什、什么！？当然不是！"

    # game/script.rpy:31155
    old "Well, your footprints are pretty much identical to the ones you just stepped on, and you had the key to enter."
    new "可是你的脚印和你刚踩过的那几枚几乎一模一样，而且你有进来的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:31160
    old "Katei frowned and looked at his feet. The footprints did look fairly recent, so it was easy to notice the resemblance."
    new "Katei 皱起眉，低头看向自己的脚。那些脚印确实相当新，相似之处一眼就能看出。"

    # game/script.rpy:31161
    old "That's ridiculous. Look at Akaro's. You can't tell me they're any different."
    new "荒唐。你看看 Akaro 的脚印。你敢说他的脚印有哪里不一样？"

    # game/script.rpy:31166
    old "And out of you two, who could've entered this place?"
    new "那你们两个人里，谁进得来这个地方？"

    # game/script.rpy:31171
    old "Neither of us, probably. To get the Sekimeiya here, I would've had to go to the crystal floor, up to the attic, and then back down. All without taking the elevator, and you all remember I appeared from below where you were. There's no way I would've had enough time.{w} Are you forgetting Naomi? She's the only person who could have left these footprints unless she gave her key to someone else. I can't believe she'd leave the Sekimeiya here. She knew full well about the cold it needs."
    new "我们俩多半都进不来。要把 Sekimeiya 搬到这儿，我得先去水晶层，再上到阁楼，然后再下来。全程还不能坐电梯——你们都记得吧，我是从你们下面那一层上来的。我根本不可能有那么多时间。{w}你们把 Naomi 忘了？除非她把钥匙交给了别人，否则这些脚印只可能是她留下的。我不信她会把 Sekimeiya 丢在这里。它需要低温，她比谁都清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:31172
    old "I really don't believe these are Naomi's. According to you, she could still be here, right? Where do these two doors go?"
    new "我实在不觉得这些脚印是 Naomi 的。按你的说法，她可能还在这里，对吧？这两扇门分别通向哪里？"

    # game/script.rpy:31177
    old "That one goes to the kitchen, and that's the hallway."
    new "那扇通向厨房，这扇通向走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:31182
    old "...{w}It's still visible: under the more recent footprints, there are other ones, much harder to notice and smaller in size. Like the rest, they go from the entrance to the sofa, where the Sekimeiya is."
    new "……{w}还看得出来：较新的脚印下面还压着别的脚印，更淡，也更小。和其余的脚印一样，它们从入口一直走到放着 Sekimeiya 的沙发。"

    # game/script.rpy:31188
    old "...Oh, you're right, that one's different."
    new "……哦，没错，这一枚不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:31189
    old "I would assume they're from when the Sekimeiya was left on the sofa, but that can't be it. It should have still been on the crystal floor then.{w} What bugs me is they don't seem to continue. Once they get to the sofa, they don't go anywhere else. I don't believe they go back to the door either, but I might be missing the returning ones. Now that Katei walked over them, it's even harder to tell.{w} It's still somewhat possible to distinguish the size and direction they're facing. Without a doubt, they don't belong to the same person who left the other ones. That's Katei, if you were wondering."
    new "我本来以为，这些脚印是 Sekimeiya 被放到沙发上时留下的，可这说不通。那时候它应该还在水晶层。{w}让我在意的是，这串脚印似乎没有延续下去。到了沙发之后，它们就没再往别处去。我觉得它们也没有回到门口，不过折返的那几枚也许被我漏掉了。何况 Katei 刚踩过一遍，现在更难分辨。{w}不过勉强还能看出大小和朝向。毫无疑问，它们和留下另外那些脚印的人不是同一个——顺带一提，那些是 Katei 的。"

    # game/script.rpy:31195
    old "What kind of movie are you making in your head?"
    new "你脑子里到底在编什么故事？"

    # game/script.rpy:31198
    old "You went to the sofa and probably placed the Sekimeiya there. Perhaps there was something else sitting on there that the previous person left behind. Then, you went through that hallway door, and you later came back to leave through the main door."
    new "你走到沙发那儿，大概把 Sekimeiya 放在了那里。也许沙发上原本还放着先前那个人留下的什么东西。然后你穿过走廊那扇门，之后又折回来，从大门离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:31203
    old "However, this doesn't make sense either. Going off the number of footprints, it seems like you went from the door to the sofa twice, but only once from the sofa to the hallway. What the hell happened there? You didn't jump to the kitchen, did you?"
    new "可这样也说不通。从脚印的数量看，你好像从门口到沙发走了两次，但从沙发到走廊只有一次。中间到底发生了什么？你总不会是一路跳到厨房去的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:31208
    old "This is the most preposterous thing I have ever heard! We have to go back down right now."
    new "这简直是我听过的最荒谬的话！我们得立刻下楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:31209
    old "I thought you wanted to find Naomi. Like I said, the older footprints don't seem to leave through the door, and the elevator doesn't work. That means she's probably still here."
    new "我还以为你想找到 Naomi。我说过了，那些旧脚印似乎没有从门口出去，电梯又不能用。也就是说，她多半还在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:31214
    old "This is a very small place. It shouldn't take more than half a minute to confirm it."
    new "这地方小得很。确认一下用不了半分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:31220
    old "...{w}By the way, what's this smell?"
    new "……{w}话说回来，这是什么味道？"

    # game/script.rpy:31226
    old "I was wondering that. It's a bit strong."
    new "我也在想。味道有点冲。"

    # game/script.rpy:31231
    old "I don't know. These rooms are pretty much abandoned, so it must be something from here. It's not that bad."
    new "不知道。这些房间基本没人用了，大概是这里本来就有的东西。也不算太难闻。"

    # game/script.rpy:31232
    old "Hm...{w} I feel like I've smelled it before, but I don't know where."
    new "嗯……{w}总觉得在哪儿闻过，可就是想不起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:31238
    old "Really?"
    new "真的？"

    # game/script.rpy:31239
    old "...I might be imagining it."
    new "……也许是我多心了。"

    # game/script.rpy:31242
    old "Sai tried to power on the TV, but it didn't seem functional. He opened the hallway door next, evidently unconcerned about stepping over the footprints any further."
    new "Sai 试着打开电视，但它似乎已经坏了。接着他推开走廊那扇门，显然已不在乎再多踩几脚那些脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:31247
    old "Well, let's see if Naomi's here. Come on."
    new "好吧，看看 Naomi 在不在。走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:31260
    old "Every room was quickly checked. The entire attic was arranged like a modest apartment, but it was well-preserved, probably thanks to Naomi."
    new "每个房间都很快查过一遍。整层阁楼布置得像一套简朴的公寓，但保养得很好，多半是 Naomi 的功劳。"

    # game/script.rpy:31265
    old "I finished at the higher level of the left bedroom. Aside from the bedrooms, there was only a bathroom, the kitchen, and an empty storage room with no light. Surprisingly, there were security cameras even in the bedrooms."
    new "最后查完的是左侧卧室的上层。除了几间卧室，这里只有一间浴室、厨房，还有一间没有灯光的空储藏室。没想到连卧室里都装着监控。"

    # game/script.rpy:31272
    old "And Naomi was nowhere to be found. To make sure she couldn't have left unseen, Katei and Akaro waited in the hallway and living room respectively. We could be certain the attic was empty by the time we arrived."
    new "而 Naomi 踪影全无。为了确保她没有趁人不备离开，Katei 和 Akaro 分别守在走廊和客厅。这样我们便敢肯定，我们上来时阁楼里是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:31277
    old "All of us reunited."
    new "我们重新聚到一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:31282
    old "I don't get it either. What the hell is Naomi doing...?"
    new "我也不明白。Naomi 到底在搞什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:31287
    old "You're right. It's bizarre, but only because of the footprints I pointed out.{w} You have Naomi's keyring, so you must know where she is. In addition, it seems like your own footprints did the same as hers at least one of the times they went from the entrance to the sofa."
    new "你说得对。事情确实蹊跷，但蹊跷之处只在于我指出的那些脚印。{w}Naomi 的钥匙串在你手上，你不可能不知道她在哪儿。而且你自己的脚印也和她的一样，至少有一次从玄关走到沙发后就断了。"

    # game/script.rpy:31292
    old "I will repeat myself. Those were not mine."
    new "我再说一遍。那些不是我留下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:31297
    old "Honestly, the question is there no matter who they belonged to. From the sofa, the only way to stop the footprints would be by jumping to the kitchen, which isn't carpeted."
    new "说实话，不管那些脚印是谁的，这个疑问都摆在那里。从沙发那里开始，要想让脚印断掉，唯一的办法就是跳到厨房去——厨房没铺地毯。"

    # game/script.rpy:31306
    old "Suddenly, he turned around and entered the hallway."
    new "他忽然转身，走进了走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:31312
    old "I peeked in and saw him walking toward the elevator."
    new "我探头望进去，见他正朝电梯走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:31313
    old "He grabbed its handle and tried to open it. Just like on the crystal floor, it didn't budge."
    new "他抓住门把手，试着拉开。和在水晶层时一样，门纹丝不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:31318
    old "I already checked if it was here."
    new "我已经查过它在不在这儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:31327
    old "Once some silent seconds had passed, he pressed the elevator button, sighing after nothing occurred."
    new "沉默了几秒，他按下电梯按钮，见毫无反应，叹了口气。"

    # game/script.rpy:31332
    old "This doesn't make any sense. Unless I misinterpreted it, the person who left the footprints should still be here. Maybe even two people.{w} Was it a trick in case we noticed them? What if the first person stayed on the sofa, and when Katei came, they exited through the main door, stepping over his footprints and taking advantage of the bigger shoe size?"
    new "这根本说不通。除非我看错了，否则留下脚印的人现在应该还在这里。也许还不止一个人。{w}难道那是为了防我们注意到脚印而设的障眼法？假设第一个人在沙发上没动，等 Katei 进来，他才从大门出去，利用 Katei 鞋码更大这一点，踩着他的脚印走。"

    # game/script.rpy:31333
    old "Everyone went quiet. To Sai, it probably seemed like we found what he was saying to be a bit of a reach."
    new "众人都沉默了。在 Sai 看来，我们大概都觉得他这番话有些牵强。"

    # game/script.rpy:31338
    old "...I know that still doesn't explain the set of Katei's footprints that didn't continue, but that could've been fabricated by him all at once if he wanted to make it seem like he walked to the sofa twice."
    new "……我知道，这仍解释不了 Katei 那组走到一半就断掉的脚印。可如果他想造成自己往沙发走了两趟的假象，那些脚印完全可以一次伪造出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:31339
    old "Nobody said anything in response. When he realized we were all staring at something, he turned around to find the spot but failed to notice anything important."
    new "没人接话。他意识到我们都在盯着某处，便回过头去找，却没看出什么名堂。"

    # game/script.rpy:31344
    old "What the hell are you all looking at?"
    new "你们到底在看什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:31348
    old "...The button. It lit up for a second, right?"
    new "……那个按钮。刚才亮了一下，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:31358
    old "It did."
    new "确实亮了。"

    # game/script.rpy:31366
    old "Again, he grabbed the handle and pulled it toward him."
    new "他又一次抓住把手，把门朝自己这边拉。"

    # game/script.rpy:31374
    old "We heard and saw the elevator opening. Pressing the button had brought it to the attic, and its interior was empty."
    new "我们听见电梯门开了，也看见了。按下按钮后，电梯上到了阁楼，里面空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:31379
    old "Oh, it's working! Now we can use it."
    new "哦，电梯能用了！这下我们可以坐它了。"

    # game/script.rpy:31384
    old "...Of course. They just left with the elevator. It has to be that.{w} Katei!"
    new "……原来如此。他们就是坐电梯走的。只能是这么回事。{w}Katei！"

    # game/script.rpy:31385
    old "We heard a sigh coming from the living room and subsequently footsteps approaching."
    new "客厅里传来一声叹气，接着是走近的脚步声。"

    # game/script.rpy:31391
    old "Oh, the elevator was here?"
    new "哦，电梯刚才在这层？"

    # game/script.rpy:31396
    old "No, the elevator was not here. I just called it, and it arrived."
    new "不，电梯刚才不在这里。是我刚把它叫上来，它才到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:31401
    old "What? That's not possible."
    new "什么？这不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:31402
    old "They all saw it. The elevator is working."
    new "他们都看见了。电梯确实能用。"

    # game/script.rpy:31403
    old "But it wasn't a few minutes ago. We just tested it."
    new "可几分钟前还不是这样。我们才试过。"

    # game/script.rpy:31404
    old "Could the alarm not have affected the attic's button?"
    new "警报难道没有影响到阁楼的按钮？"

    # game/script.rpy:31409
    old "...No, it did."
    new "……不，影响了。"

    # game/script.rpy:31410
    old "I believe you're lying again. After all, your footprints indicated that you escaped from here the same way the other ones did, and it could only have been with the elevator."
    new "我看你又在撒谎。毕竟你的脚印说明，你和另一组人是以同样的方式离开这里的，而除了电梯，没有别的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:31415
    old "I will choose to stop playing along with you. However, if the elevator is really working, I can only think of one explanation that makes sense.{w} ...That it was just enabled, minutes or seconds ago, while we were all here."
    new "我决定不再配合你了。不过，如果电梯真的能用，我只能想到一个说得通的解释。{w}……它是几分钟、甚至几秒前才刚被启用的，就在我们所有人都在场的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:31420
    old "Oh, I see. It just turned on magically. That tracks."
    new "哦，是这样。它自己就神奇地启动了。真是合情合理。"

    # game/script.rpy:31423
    old "Have you forgotten about Naomi again? She still has to be somewhere. Not only that, you left the security room open, and she might've had enough information to know how to revert some effects of the alarm."
    new "你又把 Naomi 忘了？她总还在这儿的某个地方。不止如此——你们离开时没关监控室的门，而她掌握的情报，或许足够让她知道怎么解除警报的部分效果。"

    # game/script.rpy:31424
    old "...{w}You're so stupid."
    new "……{w}你真是蠢得可以。"

    # game/script.rpy:31430
    old "Of course, if the elevator was enabled just now, Naomi, who most likely left the initial footprints, couldn't have escaped this place."
    new "当然，如果电梯是刚才才启用的，那最可能留下最初那组脚印的 Naomi，就不可能已经离开这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:31431
    old "However, you just said \"you left the security room open\"."
    new "可你刚才说的是『你们没关监控室的门』。"

    # game/script.rpy:31432
    old "Have you forgotten about the lie you told us earlier? You said that after closing the door of the security room, it would lock itself automatically."
    new "你忘了自己先前跟我们说的谎？你说监控室的门一关上，就会自动上锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:31433
    old "So, did you just assume they didn't close the door after leaving? Did you see it open, maybe?"
    new "那你凭什么认定他们离开时没关门？难道你亲眼看见门是开着的？"

    # game/script.rpy:31438
    old "I'm pretty sure we did close it when we left."
    new "我很确定我们走的时候是关了的。"

    # game/script.rpy:31442
    old "I know it was closed when I went back up—that's why I'm saying all this. And of course, it didn't lock itself automatically, which is why he said that you'd left it open, completely ignoring the contradictory claim he made earlier to cover his previous lie up."
    new "我上去的时候就看见门是关着的——所以我才说这些。而且它当然没有自动上锁，所以他才说你们没关门，完全不顾自己早先为了圆谎而说出的那番自相矛盾的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:31447
    old "I'm not sure why you sound so excited."
    new "我不明白你为什么这么来劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:31448
    old "So, am I wrong?"
    new "那么，我说错了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:31453
    old "You're on a wrong streak. We already determined earlier that the alarm underwent an error and didn't lock the security room after I left, did we not?{w} Why would I assume that it worked after they closed it? I figured the error probably repeated, and the door wouldn't have locked itself even if they closed it."
    new "你已经一错再错了。我们之前不是已经确认过，警报出了故障，所以我离开后监控室并没有上锁吗？{w}我为什么要以为他们关上门之后它就会正常上锁？我认为故障大概率会重演，就算他们关了门，门也不会自己锁上。"

    # game/script.rpy:31460
    old "I don't know what your problem is, but cut it out. As I said, Naomi might've just reenabled the elevator."
    new "我不知道你哪根筋不对，但别再这样了。我说过，可能只是 Naomi 把电梯重新启用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:31465
    old "How do you pretend to explain the footprints, then?"
    new "那脚印你又打算怎么解释？"

    # game/script.rpy:31466
    old "Hell if I know. I barely get what you're talking about, and I'm inclined to believe it's another delusion of yours."
    new "我怎么知道。你说的我压根听不懂，多半又是你的臆想。"

    # game/script.rpy:31469
    old "Now, for the love of God, let's go to the crystal floor. Naomi might be there, and the Sekimeiya needs to be put in the cabinet. We have to contact the outside as well."
    new "行了，看在老天的份上，先去水晶层吧。Naomi 可能在那儿，Sekimeiya 也得放回展示柜。我们还得跟外界联络。"

    # game/script.rpy:31470
    old "All right! We'll take the elevator!"
    new "好嘞！我们坐电梯去！"

    # game/script.rpy:31475
    old "Oh, not all of us will be able to at once. Only four people can use it."
    new "哦，可没法一次全上去。电梯最多坐四个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:31479
    old "As soon as she heard that, Isla rushed inside, dragging Erina by her shirt."
    new "一听这话，Isla 就拽着 Erina 的衣服冲了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:31480
    old "Me. I'm going. E-le-va-tor."
    new "我！我要坐！电——梯——"

    # game/script.rpy:31485
    old "You still have the attic key, right?"
    new "阁楼的钥匙还在你手上吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:31491
    old "We'll walk down, then. It's very important that this floor remains locked, even if Naomi has her own key. I don't want any of you coming in without my knowledge."
    new "那我们就走楼梯。这一层必须一直锁着，这点很重要——哪怕 Naomi 自己有钥匙。我不希望有谁瞒着我进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:31497
    old "Sure."
    new "行吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:31500
    old "Sai and Akaro entered the elevator."
    new "Sai 和 Akaro 进了电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:31505
    old "Hurry up and leave now. You won't be able to make it back up without the key. As you see, it is required to enable the floor 7 button. We won't leave until you're gone."
    new "快点走吧。没有钥匙你们就上不来了。你也看到了，七楼的按钮得用钥匙才能启动。你们不走，我们也不会走。"

    # game/script.rpy:31507
    old "Sai rolled his eyes and let go of the door. A few seconds later, Katei checked that the elevator had left. He spent a few seconds in thought before lightly pushing my and Atsuki's shoulders back."
    new "Sai 翻了个白眼，松开了门。几秒后，Katei 确认电梯已经离开。他思索了片刻，才轻轻把我和 Atsuki 的肩膀往后推了推。"

    # game/script.rpy:31513
    old "Since he had left the living room, Atsuki went there through the kitchen, confirming that the attic was empty, although it was clear that nobody had gone there just by looking at the floor's footprints."
    new "他离开客厅后，Atsuki 从厨房那边过去，确认了阁楼空无一人——不过光看地上的脚印，也知道没人上去过。"

    # game/script.rpy:31519
    old "Katei stared at the Sekimeiya for a few seconds. Then, he crouched to lift it up and held it in his hands using the long sleeves of his uniform."
    new "Katei 盯着 Sekimeiya 看了几秒，随后蹲下身将它抬起，隔着校服的长袖捧在手里。"

    # game/script.rpy:31526
    old "Let's go."
    new "走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:31537
    old "We carefully went down the dark staircase. Outside, I took the keyring out of my purse and locked the door."
    new "我们小心翼翼地走下昏暗的楼梯。到了外面，我从手袋里取出钥匙串，把门锁上。"

    # game/script.rpy:31542
    old "Through the silence, we descended. I caught a glimpse of Atsuki's face again. I'd been trying to avoid looking at it."
    new "在一片寂静中，我们往楼下走。我又瞥见了 Atsuki 的脸——那张脸我一直刻意不去看。"

    # game/script.rpy:31547
    old "Usually, I figured he would've taken Sai much more seriously, but he'd hardly appeared to care about what the guy said. His suspicion toward Katei wasn't the indicator I'd been waiting for."
    new "换作平时，他应该会把 Sai 的话当真得多，可这次他几乎没把那家伙说的话放在心上。他对 Katei 的怀疑，并不是我一直在等的那个迹象。"

    # game/script.rpy:31548
    old "How much longer would I have to play along for? Ever since she'd exited our lives, I'd kept telling myself that it would all eventually go back to how it was at the beginning. However, dealing with his attitude until then and with my parents in the background was way too frustrating."
    new "这样的戏我还要演多久？自从她离开我们的生活，我就一直告诉自己，一切迟早会回到最初的模样。可在那之前，既要忍着他的态度，背后还得应付我父母的事，实在令人烦躁。"

    # game/script.rpy:31551
    old "We were living in his house, which had been his immediate idea. If it weren't for that, I would've assumed his mental state wasn't going to get better any time soon and that he wanted to remain alone."
    new "我们住在他的房子里，这也是他当时马上提出的主意。要不是他这样做，我大概会以为他的精神状态短期内好不了，只想一个人待着。"

    # game/script.rpy:31555
    old "Behind Atsuki was Katei, who my focus switched to. His face was hardly a more pleasant sight, as it looked slightly distressed and in pain—traces that disappeared as soon as his eyes met mine. I had no clue what had happened during the attack, but plenty of things about him were iffy at best."
    new "Atsuki 身后是 Katei，我的目光转而落到他身上。他的脸色也谈不上好看，隐隐透着苦恼与痛楚——可当他的视线与我相接，那些痕迹便消失得无影无踪。袭击期间到底发生了什么，我毫不知情，但他身上可疑的地方实在不少。"

    # game/script.rpy:31570
    old "As soon as we began to step down the last staircase, we saw a few people in hallway A, who immediately gestured at us to hurry toward them."
    new "我们刚走下最后一段楼梯，就看见 A走廊里有几个人，他们一见我们便招手，催我们快点过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:31579
    old "Take a look at the security room."
    new "去看看监控室吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:31580
    old "Erina and Isla were next to its door, peering inside. Katei paid no mind to Sai and pushed open the door to the event room."
    new "Erina 和 Isla 站在门口往里张望。Katei 没理会 Sai，推开了活动室的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:31587
    old "With one hand, he raised the curtain, opened the glass, and put the Sekimeiya inside."
    new "他单手掀起遮布，打开玻璃门，把 Sekimeiya 放了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:31595
    old "Oh, give me the keys."
    new "哦，钥匙给我。"

    # game/script.rpy:31596
    old "I took them from my purse and handed them to him."
    new "我从手袋里取出钥匙，递给了他。"

    # game/script.rpy:31601
    old "This is a manual lock, right? Does it shut the cabinet without needing the key?"
    new "这是手动锁吧？不用钥匙也能把展示柜关上吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:31602
    old "Erina, Isla, and Akaro were looking from the door, indicating with their eyes that they'd found something."
    new "Erina、Isla 和 Akaro 从门口望过来，眼神示意有所发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:31607
    old "Yes. I was just going to lock it."
    new "嗯。我正要锁上。"

    # game/script.rpy:31611
    old "Atsuki turned a dial on the left side of the cabinet and verified that it could only be unlocked with a key identical to the one Naomi had used."
    new "Atsuki 转了转展示柜左侧的旋钮，确认只有用与 Naomi 那把相同的钥匙才能打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:31612
    old "Do not take it out under any circumstances. It's very likely Naomi brought it to the attic, so we need to find her as soon as possible."
    new "无论如何都不要把它取出来。它很可能是 Naomi 带上阁楼的，所以我们得尽快找到她。"

    # game/script.rpy:31617
    old "I bet you want to know what happened in the security room first."
    new "我猜你想先知道监控室出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:31622
    old "...What happened?"
    new "……出什么事了？"

    # game/script.rpy:31623
    old "Sai jerked his head, telling us to see for ourselves."
    new "Sai 把头一撇，示意我们自己去看。"

    # game/script.rpy:31631
    old "Awkwardly, Katei made his way to the hallway and walked up to the security room."
    new "Katei 有些不自在地走到走廊，来到监控室前。"

    # game/script.rpy:31637
    old "Wh—{w} Was it like this when you came?"
    new "什——{w} 你们来的时候就是这样？"

    # game/script.rpy:31638
    old "Yes. The elevator had been reenabled, so I wanted to go to the security room. This is how we found it."
    new "对。电梯恢复了，我本来想去监控室，结果一到就看见这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:31639
    old "Atsuki and I, who hadn't yet seen the problem, approached the room."
    new "我和 Atsuki 还没看出问题所在，就走近了那间房。"

    # game/script.rpy:31646
    old "It was very easy to tell what was wrong from the hallway. Every monitor was displaying a black screen, and the drone of the computer had ceased."
    new "站在走廊里就能一眼看出不对。每台显示器都是黑的，电脑的运转声也停了。"

    # game/script.rpy:31647
    old "...Did the computer stop working?"
    new "……电脑坏了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:31652
    old "There's still the ceiling light, so I assume so."
    new "顶灯还亮着，所以应该是吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:31658
    old "The computer did not stop working. It must've been turned off. The monitors above it won't display anything while the computer's off."
    new "电脑没坏，应该是被关掉了。电脑关着的时候，上面的显示器什么都不会显示。"

    # game/script.rpy:31661
    old "He walked into the room while everyone entered after him."
    new "他走进房间，众人也跟了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:31666
    old "However, after pressing the power button, there was no change."
    new "然而按下电源键后，毫无反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:31672
    old "What the hell...?"
    new "搞什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:31673
    old "Also, the door was closed, but not locked, just like you figured."
    new "还有，门是关着的，但没上锁，跟你猜的一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:31679
    old "I see... I have no idea what was done, but the computer couldn't have stopped working by itself."
    new "原来如此……不知道是谁动了手脚，但电脑不可能自己坏掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:31684
    old "You didn't do it?"
    new "不是你干的？"

    # game/script.rpy:31690
    old "Me...?"
    new "我……？"

    # game/script.rpy:31691
    old "Well, you were on this floor before you reunited with us, right?"
    new "毕竟你和我们会合之前，就在这一层待过，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:31697
    old "I was only here for a few seconds, unlike you all."
    new "我在这儿只待了几秒钟，不像你们。"

    # game/script.rpy:31702
    old "The computer was working when we left."
    new "我们离开时，电脑还能用。"

    # game/script.rpy:31703
    old "We could've used it for several things, so someone disabled it deliberately. Who had the chance to do that?"
    new "这台电脑本来能派上不少用场，所以是有人故意把它关掉了。谁有机会这么做？"

    # game/script.rpy:31706
    old "You, Akaro, Sai, or Naomi."
    new "你、Akaro、Sai 或 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:31707
    old "Katei glanced at Sai when I mentioned him, as he was under the impression he'd been with us when we went down."
    new "我提到 Sai 时，Katei 朝他瞥了一眼。看来 Katei 以为我们下楼时 Sai 也和我们在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:31712
    old "Yeah, you didn't hear that, but I wasn't with them the whole time. I didn't enter this room, though."
    new "对，你没听我说过——我并不是一直和他们在一起。不过我没进过这个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:31713
    old "What about Atsuki?"
    new "Atsuki 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:31714
    old "The four of us went together."
    new "我们四个人是一起去的。"

    # game/script.rpy:31722
    old "{tip=suspicion}...{/tip}"
    new "{tip=suspicion}……{/tip}"

    # game/script.rpy:31728
    old "So, from your point of view, we are the only people who could've entered this room after you left it with the computer running."
    new "那么，照你看来，你离开时电脑还开着，之后能进这个房间的就只有我们了。"

    # game/script.rpy:31729
    old "You might be ignoring something, though. Someone used this computer after we all met up again."
    new "不过，你可能忽略了一点：我们重新会合之后，有人用过这台电脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:31730
    old "The elevator was reenabled when we were in the attic, which means that Naomi turned off the computer after doing so and is still hiding. It makes sense because she knows what we could do with it."
    new "我们在阁楼时，电梯恢复了运行。也就是说，Naomi 先让电梯恢复，随后关掉了电脑，如今还躲着没现身。这说得通，因为她清楚我们能拿这台电脑做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:31735
    old "Would she really have any idea how to power on the elevator?"
    new "她真的知道该怎么启动电梯吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:31741
    old "Even if she didn't know in detail, it is fairly simple to work out. I imagine she was told about the alarm and its functions, after all."
    new "就算她不清楚细节，弄明白也不难。毕竟，我想有人跟她讲过警报和它的功能。"

    # game/script.rpy:31742
    old "I thought that made enough sense, except for one important detail."
    new "我觉得这话挺有道理，只是有一个重要细节说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:31743
    old "But if Naomi didn't want us to use this computer, why did she not power it off earlier?"
    new "可如果 Naomi 不想让我们用这台电脑，她为什么不早点关掉？"

    # game/script.rpy:31744
    old "Probably because she was in the attic. But most importantly, because she thought this room was locked, even though it remained open because the alarm failed to lock it."
    new "大概是因为她当时在阁楼。但最重要的是，她以为这房间锁着——警报没能锁门，房门其实一直开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:31747
    old "...If it's true that the alarm should've locked it after leaving, sure.{w} But even if it did malfunction, the only reason why we didn't enter before was because you'd left your key inside, right?{w} Normally, she would've expected you to bring it out and be able to open the door whenever. It doesn't make sense to say she cared about us using the computer because we should've been able to get in here right away, while it was still working."
    new "……如果警报本该在我们离开后把门锁上，那倒说得通。{w}可就算它真出了故障，我们之前没进来，唯一的原因也是你把钥匙落在了里面，对吧？{w}正常情况下，她会以为你把钥匙带出来了，随时都能开门。既然我们本来随时都能进来，而且那时候电脑还能用，那说她会在意我们使用电脑，就说不通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:31752
    old "I'd forgotten about that key. You said you left yours in this room, so where is it?"
    new "我都忘了那把钥匙。你说你的钥匙落在这房间里了，那它在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:31755
    old "Katei opened a drawer and took all of its papers out as he spoke."
    new "Katei 边说边拉开一个抽屉，把里面的文件全都取了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:31756
    old "It's possible she was keeping track of what we were doing from somewhere and knew that I hadn't unlocked the room yet. When she saw you'd opened it, you gave her an easy chance to power off the computer, even though I don't know how exactly she did it. I'm not sure why you're all having such a hard time believing me."
    new "她也许一直在某处留意我们的动向，知道我还没打开这个房间。你们把门一打开，就正好给了她关掉电脑的机会——尽管我不知道她具体是怎么做到的。我真不明白你们为什么就是不肯信我。"

    # game/script.rpy:31763
    old "I-It's not here..."
    new "不、不在这儿……"

    # game/script.rpy:31764
    old "Atsuki took the key he'd found out of his pocket."
    new "Atsuki 从口袋里掏出他找到的那把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:31770
    old "This must be your key, then."
    new "那这一定就是你的钥匙了。"

    # game/script.rpy:31771
    old "I guess so... But how the hell did it make it to the third floor?"
    new "应该是吧……可它到底是怎么跑到三楼来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:31772
    old "Katei took it from Atsuki's hand and left it in the same drawer he'd searched through."
    new "Katei 从 Atsuki 手里接过钥匙，又把它放回自己刚才翻过的那个抽屉里。"

    # game/script.rpy:31773
    old "Nobody answered him. Before, Atsuki had told me that he'd seen Katei staring at the floor on the higher levels of the building. If he'd known he needed to find the key somewhere, he must have deliberately withheld that, aware that the door had been left open."
    new "没有人回答他。之前 Atsuki 告诉过我，他在楼上几层看见 Katei 一直盯着地面。如果 Katei 早知道自己得去哪里找钥匙，那他一定是故意隐瞒了这件事——他清楚房门一直开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:31774
    old "Then, as soon as we'd managed to enter, someone had immediately taken the opportunity to power off the computer. The intentions of that person coincided with Katei's if Atsuki's theory was right."
    new "而我们刚得以进入房间，就有人立刻抓住机会关掉了电脑。若 Atsuki 的推测没错，那人的意图正与 Katei 不谋而合。"

    # game/script.rpy:31780
    old "What's clear is that whoever shut down the computer enabled the elevator before doing so..."
    new "有一点很清楚：不管是谁关掉了电脑，他都是在关掉之前先让电梯恢复运行的……"

    # game/script.rpy:31785
    old "And Katei's the one person who would definitely know how to do that."
    new "而 Katei 正是唯一一个肯定知道该怎么做的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:31791
    old "I agree that it seems strange Naomi would know how to accomplish that without having a lot of time to experiment."
    new "我也觉得奇怪：Naomi 没多少时间反复尝试，怎么会知道该怎么做？"

    # game/script.rpy:31792
    old "So, it could be that powering off the computer enabled the elevator at the same time. It shouldn't have been the case, but I can't rule it out with the lack of testing this alarm had."
    new "所以，也有可能是关掉电脑的同时让电梯恢复了运行。按理说不该如此，但这套警报几乎没经过测试，我不能排除这种可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:31798
    old "Go see whether the lobby's lights are working again. If they are, it's possible the alarm's secondary effects were reversed when the computer was turned off, as the way to disable them is very different from the main one, which blocks the exit."
    new "去看看大厅的灯是否恢复了。如果恢复了，那就有可能是关掉电脑时，警报的次要效果也被一并解除了——解除这些效果的方法，和解除封锁出口这一主要效果的方法大不相同。"

    # game/script.rpy:31799
    old "Even though the computer doesn't work, the camera system functions independently. I don't know if it was shut down, so it's possible the cameras are still recording and that we simply can't look at the footage."
    new "就算电脑坏了，摄像系统也是独立运行的。我不知道它有没有被关掉，所以摄像头可能还在录，只是我们看不了录像而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:31806
    old "I want to try a few things here and see if I can get the computer running again, so you can leave me be if you want. I will recommend once again that we find Naomi."
    new "我想在这儿试几件事，看能不能让电脑重新运行，你们想走的话不用管我。我再建议一次：我们得找到 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:31809
    old "After a light shrug, Sai spoke."
    new "Sai 轻轻耸了耸肩，开口道。"

    # game/script.rpy:31814
    old "Sure. We still haven't looked through this entire floor. If we can't find Naomi here, we'll have to search the entire building in more depth.{w} Oh, there's something else I meant to ask you. Inside the elevator, there's a stop button that's supposed to enable communication with the outside. Would that help us?"
    new "好。这一层我们还没搜完。要是在这儿找不到 Naomi，就只能把整栋楼再仔细搜一遍了。{w}对了，我还想问你一件事。电梯里有个停止按钮，按说能让里面的人与外界联络。那个能帮上忙吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:31815
    old "No, it won't. The alarm's effects may not have worked perfectly, but one of them was to disable that connection. If you press the button, you'll get locked inside until {time=21}, so I'd advise you not to do it."
    new "不，没用。警报的效果也许并不完美，但其中之一就是切断那种联络。你一旦按下按钮，就会被关在里面直到 {time=21}，所以我劝你别按。"

    # game/script.rpy:31820
    old "Hm, I see. I'm glad we didn't go for it, then."
    new "嗯，原来如此。幸好我们没去试。"

    # game/script.rpy:31824
    old "Sai moved to hallway A, and the others followed him. I was about to leave as well, but Katei's look stopped me."
    new "Sai 走向 A 走廊，其他人也跟着他去了。我也正要离开，却被 Katei 的眼神拦住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:31832
    old "Once he and I were alone, he spoke in a quiet whisper."
    new "等只剩我们两个人，他压低声音开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:31838
    old "How well do you know Atsuki? The two of you are friends, right?"
    new "你对 Atsuki 了解多少？你们是朋友吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:31840
    old "Oh, yeah..."
    new "啊，嗯……"

    # game/script.rpy:31841
    old "We hadn't spoken much, but we'd been together in the lobby and were the same age, so it made sense for him to assume that."
    new "我们没怎么说过话，不过一直待在大厅，年纪又相仿，他会这么想也正常。"

    # game/script.rpy:31842
    old "Do you trust him?"
    new "你信得过他吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:31848
    old "I don't know if you're working with him. If you are, I'm warning you to stop whatever you're doing, but if you aren't, I will tell you directly: he is lying."
    new "我不知道你是不是在和他合作。如果是，我劝你立刻收手；如果不是，那我就直说：他在撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:31849
    old "He's lying to you and everyone else. He was the one who brought the Sekimeiya to the attic."
    new "他骗的不只是你，是所有人。把 Sekimeiya 搬进阁楼的人就是他。"

    # game/script.rpy:31850
    old "No, he wasn't. I've been with him the entire time."
    new "不，不是他。我一直都和他待在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:31855
    old "Look, if you're actually unaware of whatever he's doing, make sure to keep an eye on him, and don't ever leave him alone. Make sure he can't ever take the Sekimeiya."
    new "听着，如果你真不知道他在做什么，那就盯紧他，别让他一个人待着。绝不能让他把 Sekimeiya 拿走。"

    # game/script.rpy:31857
    old "Internally, I laughed. Of course, suspecting Atsuki hadn't at all crossed my mind. Under normal circumstances, I might possibly have believed that he was messing around and something he'd done had been misinterpreted, but Katei had just outed himself as a liar."
    new "我在心里笑了一声。怀疑 Atsuki？这种念头我连想都没想过。换作平常，我或许会以为他只是在胡闹，某个举动被人误解了；可 Katei 刚刚亲口暴露了自己在撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:31858
    old "Out of curiosity, why are you saying he brought the Sekimeiya to the attic?"
    new "我有点好奇，你凭什么说是他把 Sekimeiya 搬进阁楼的？"

    # game/script.rpy:31863
    old "...I can't tell you that, but you can take my word for it. I am certain that he did."
    new "……这我不能说，但你信我就是了。我确信是他。"

    # game/script.rpy:31872
    old "I tried not to snort and walked out to hallway A. I didn't know what was up with Katei, but everything about him was questionable."
    new "我忍住没嗤笑出声，走到 A走廊。Katei 到底怎么回事，我弄不清楚，但他浑身上下都透着可疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:31873
    old "Why had he told me that? If it was all a lie, what did he plan to accomplish by telling me about it without even specifying any details? Even if he really did believe it, why would he have approached the person most likely to be working with his suspect?"
    new "他为什么要告诉我这些？如果全是谎话，他连一点细节都没讲，又想达到什么目的？就算他真的相信，又为什么偏要去找那个最可能和他怀疑的那个人联手的人？"

    # game/script.rpy:31874
    old "From all I could tell, the guy was a moron, plain and simple. At least Sai thought about what he said, even if he came across as a loose cannon."
    new "照我看，这家伙就是个彻头彻尾的蠢货。Sai 说话至少过脑子，哪怕他给人感觉像个随时会炸的火药桶。"

    # game/script.rpy:31875
    old "...I saw the others had gone to the lobby, so I joined them."
    new "……我看见其他人已经去了大厅，便也跟了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:31883
    old "Oh, the lights do work."
    new "哦，灯果然是好的。"

    # game/script.rpy:31889
    old "The four smaller lights were functioning again. However, that couldn't be taken as confirmation of anything since Katei had been the one to suggest checking them."
    new "那四盏较小的灯又亮了起来。但这说明不了什么——提议检查灯的正是 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:31893
    old "Without saying anything else, Sai walked to the other hallway."
    new "Sai 没再多说，径直走向另一条走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:31902
    old "Strangely, he went straight to the event room."
    new "奇怪的是，他直奔活动室而去。"

    # game/script.rpy:31908
    old "Terraformed"
    new "地球化"

    # game/script.rpy:31912
    old "Why did you come here?"
    new "你到这儿来做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:31917
    old "So Katei doesn't see me."
    new "免得被 Katei 看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:31919
    old "Nonchalantly, he put out his hand to Atsuki."
    new "他若无其事地向 Atsuki 伸出手。"

    # game/script.rpy:31924
    old "Do you want the keys?"
    new "你要钥匙？"

    # game/script.rpy:31938
    old "To unlock the cabinet."
    new "用来打开展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:31944
    old "What's the point? It could be dangerous for the Sekimeiya. Let's not cause problems we can avoid."
    new "这有什么意义？这对 Sekimeiya 可能有危险。能避开的麻烦，就别去招惹。"

    # game/script.rpy:31949
    old "I want to touch it, though..."
    new "可是……我想摸摸它。"

    # game/script.rpy:31954
    old "And there should be no problem with that. You said Naomi was gonna let you do it, but Katei made sure nobody would touch it.{w} You all understand he's been lying, don't you? And the Sekimeiya was brought to the attic, either by him or Naomi—the two people who should've known a higher temperature could be damaging."
    new "那就更不该有问题。你说过 Naomi 本来要让你摸的，是 Katei 非要保证没人碰得到它。{w} 你们都明白他一直在撒谎了吧？而且，Sekimeiya 是被搬进阁楼的——不是他，就是 Naomi，而这两个人本该最清楚温度过高会损坏它。"

    # game/script.rpy:31959
    old "That's pretty suspicious, right? I bet he exaggerated the need for the temperature so we wouldn't get it out. However, he took it out himself earlier and brought it to the attic."
    new "这很可疑吧？我敢说他夸大了温度的要求，好让我们不敢把它取出来。可他自己早些时候就把它取了出来，还搬进了阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:31966
    old "You don't think it was Naomi?"
    new "你不觉得是 Naomi 干的？"

    # game/script.rpy:31967
    old "The keyring that Atsuki has might be hers. Katei had to lie and say he had an identical one. That means it's pretty unlikely she was the one to move the Sekimeiya, so she probably can't access the attic at the moment."
    new "Atsuki 手里那串钥匙也许就是她的。Katei 不得不撒谎，说自己有一模一样的一串。也就是说，搬走 Sekimeiya 的人多半不是她，那么她此刻大概进不了阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:31972
    old "However, there's one thing I find incredibly strange, and I'm not sure why Katei hasn't tried to excuse it."
    new "不过，有一件事我觉得极不寻常，而 Katei 居然没打算为此辩解。"

    # game/script.rpy:31973
    old "A few minutes ago, he made you lock the attic, claiming he didn't want anyone entering it without his knowledge. Now, he said he was going to manually lock this cabinet so that nobody could open it."
    new "几分钟前，他让你把阁楼锁上，说是不想有人在他不知情的情况下进去。而现在，他又说他要亲手锁上这个展示柜，让谁都打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:31974
    old "But he didn't ask for the keyring and let Atsuki keep it. That's just plain contradictory, and not something he would ignore."
    new "可他没要回钥匙，还让 Atsuki 留着。这前后完全矛盾，而他不可能没注意到。"

    # game/script.rpy:31979
    old "You're actually right. He should've made sure to keep it for himself after locking the attic."
    new "说得确实有道理。锁完阁楼之后，他本该把钥匙留在自己手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:31984
    old "Which leads me to a single conclusion: Katei is, to put it politely, of low intelligence."
    new "所以我只得出一个结论：Katei 这个人，说得客气些，脑子不太好使。"

    # game/script.rpy:31989
    old "He might just be working with Naomi, who does have an identical set of keys. It's fair to assume he wanted the attic and this cabinet locked to give Naomi a way out. She can still unlock both of them, and by letting Atsuki keep the keys, he'll always be a possible suspect for Naomi's actions."
    new "也可能他就是在和 Naomi 合作，而她确实有一串一模一样的钥匙。我们可以合理推测，他要锁上阁楼和这个展示柜，是想给 Naomi 留一条退路。她照样能打开这两处；而钥匙留在 Atsuki 手里，Naomi 日后无论做了什么，他都永远是现成的怀疑对象。"

    # game/script.rpy:31990
    old "Otherwise, it doesn't make sense. He must know how hard it is to believe that the keyring Atsuki has isn't Naomi's and is taking advantage of that to make us think only Atsuki can use it."
    new "否则就说不通。他明知要让人相信 Atsuki 手中的钥匙并非 Naomi 的有多困难，便索性利用这一点，让我们以为只有 Atsuki 才能用那串钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:31995
    old "It sounds like he made up that the Sekimeiya had to be kept here for a reason, right? It was in the attic and nothing happened to it."
    new "听起来，所谓 Sekimeiya 必须放在这里的理由，是他编出来的吧？它明明在阁楼里待过，什么都没发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:31998
    old "Atsuki walked forward, unlocked the cabinet with the key, and scrolled open the glass."
    new "Atsuki 走上前，用钥匙打开展示柜，把玻璃罩滑开。"

    # game/script.rpy:32005
    old "This compartment is definitely kept pretty cold."
    new "这个隔间确实相当冷。"

    # game/script.rpy:32010
    old "That hardly matters. Take it out. There's something I'm especially curious about."
    new "那无关紧要。把它取出来。有件事我特别在意。"

    # game/script.rpy:32016
    old "Atsuki sighed and looked at the useless camera that wasn't recording him. With both hands, he grabbed the cushion and took it out. Then, he placed it on top of the cabinet, with the Sekimeiya resting in the middle."
    new "Atsuki 叹了口气，瞥了一眼那台毫无用处、根本没在拍他的摄像头。他双手捧住垫子，将它取出，放到展示柜顶上，Sekimeiya 就静卧在正中。"

    # game/script.rpy:32025
    old "He stepped back. Katei had made it clear he didn't want us to touch it, so Atsuki didn't lay a hand on it himself and simply allowed Sai to do so if he wished."
    new "他退后一步。Katei 明确说过不希望我们碰它，所以 Atsuki 自己没伸手，只是 Sai 想碰的话，就随他碰。"

    # game/script.rpy:32030
    old "Of course, nothing's happening to it."
    new "果然，什么都没发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:32035
    old "This is a bad idea, Sai."
    new "这主意可不妙，Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:32039
    old "Nobody was sure why he'd pushed back against Katei's orders so much, but Isla walked up to the cabinet and tried to reach the Sekimeiya with her arm."
    new "没人知道他为什么这样一再违抗 Katei 的命令，但 Isla 走到展示柜前，伸出手臂去够 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:32049
    old "You are here. I haven't been ab—"
    new "原来你们在这儿。我一直没法——"

    # game/script.rpy:32055
    old "What the hell...!? What are you doing!?"
    new "搞什么……！？你在干什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:32062
    old "Seeing his expression, Isla dashed away before Katei ran to the cabinet."
    new "Isla 一看他的神色，立刻抽身跑开，Katei 随即冲到展示柜前。"

    # game/script.rpy:32067
    old "I said many times how importa—"
    new "我反复说过多少遍，它有多重要——"

    # game/script.rpy:32075
    old "Nobody cut him off, but that sentence never finished."
    new "没有人打断他，可那句话终究没能说完。"

    # game/script.rpy:32081
    old "Whoa, what the fuck?"
    new "我靠，这他妈什么情况？"

    # game/script.rpy:32082
    old "We'd all seen the same thing. Katei had run toward the Sekimeiya and made to grab it. ...Then, his entire figure vanished from the room."
    new "我们全都看见了同一幕。Katei 朝 Sekimeiya 奔去，伸手就要抓它。……紧接着，他整个人从房间里消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32084
    old "At the same time, the Sekimeiya had turned gray, as if reacting to Katei's touch."
    new "与此同时，Sekimeiya 变成了灰色，仿佛对 Katei 的触碰起了反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:32085
    old "While we exchanged speechless looks, we saw Akaro staring through the hallway A door."
    new "我们面面相觑，说不出话来，只见 Akaro 怔怔地望着通往 A 走廊的那扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:32090
    old "...What the fuck did you just do?"
    new "……你他妈到底干了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:32100
    old "We approached it and saw Katei in the hallway, close to the security room."
    new "我们走近那扇门，看见 Katei 就站在走廊里，离监控室不远。"

    # game/script.rpy:32105
    old "Atsuki was in just as much disbelief as the rest of us. I thought I must've missed something, but Sai's question confirmed we'd all interpreted it the same way."
    new "Atsuki 和我们一样难以置信。我原以为自己漏看了什么，可 Sai 一问，我便明白我们理解得都一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:32110
    old "Did this man just teleport?"
    new "这人刚才是不是传送了？"

    # game/script.rpy:32111
    old "Like ours, Katei's eyes lacked comprehension, and he only let out some words seconds after the minimal echo had faded away."
    new "Katei 的眼神和我们一样茫然，直到那点微弱的回声散尽，他才开口说了几个字。"

    # game/script.rpy:32118
    old "I just...{w} traveled to the past."
    new "我刚刚……{w}回到了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:32128
    old "Traveled to the past? Is that what we're supposed to believe...?"
    new "回到过去？这就是要我们相信的说法……？"

    # game/script.rpy:32133
    old "Nobody could accuse Katei of a trick, as we'd all seen him disappear.{w} He was breathing heavily, and he started to move his arms, checking that his body worked as usual."
    new "没人能说 Katei 是在耍把戏，他消失的样子我们都亲眼看见了。{w}他呼吸粗重，抬了抬手臂，像是在确认身体还和往常一样听使唤。"

    # game/script.rpy:32138
    old "I know how it sounds, but that's what it felt like. No... what the hell just happened?{w} It did feel like I went back a few seconds, to when I was walking from the security room to the event room."
    new "我知道这话听着荒唐，可当时的感觉就是这样。不……刚才到底是怎么回事？{w}我确实觉得自己回到了几秒之前，回到我从监控室走向活动室的那一刻。"

    # game/script.rpy:32149
    old "He slowly returned to the event room and stared at the Sekimeiya, which had changed colors."
    new "他慢慢走回活动室，盯着已经变了颜色的 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:32154
    old "This thing is dangerous. Did it darken when I touched it? I know I felt it burning."
    new "这东西很危险。我一碰它就变暗了吗？我确实感觉到它烫得厉害。"

    # game/script.rpy:32158
    old "While nobody answered, he approached it and put it inside the cabinet with its cushion, avoiding direct contact with it."
    new "没人答话，他便走上前，连同垫子一起把 Sekimeiya 放回展示柜，始终避免直接碰到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:32166
    old "Wh-What the hell?{w} It turned white again."
    new "这、这是怎么回事？{w}它又变白了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32171
    old "Did you know this would happen?"
    new "你早就知道会这样？"

    # game/script.rpy:32172
    old "What? Of co—"
    new "什么？当然——"

    # game/script.rpy:32177
    old "This is why you insisted we couldn't get the Sekimeiya out of this cabinet, that we shouldn't touch it, and it's why you never touched it directly when you brought it down."
    new "怪不得你一口咬定不能让 Sekimeiya 离开这个展示柜，说我们不能碰它；也怪不得你把它带下来的时候，一次都没直接用手碰过。"

    # game/script.rpy:32182
    old "What are you talking about? I'm as confused as you are."
    new "你在说什么？我跟你一样莫名其妙。"

    # game/script.rpy:32184
    old "As he spoke, he manually locked the cabinet."
    new "他一边说，一边亲手把展示柜锁上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32189
    old "That thing just made you teleport out of the room, and either you or Naomi brought it to the attic. You knew what it would do. That's why the fucking footprints were so weird, like someone had disappeared right in front of the Sekimeiya!"
    new "那玩意儿刚刚把你传送出了房间，然后不是你、就是 Naomi 把它带到了阁楼。你早就知道它会做什么。所以那些鬼脚印才那么奇怪，就像是有人在 Sekimeiya 面前凭空消失了！"

    # game/script.rpy:32190
    old "The conversation began to sound utterly surreal, but Sai was making sense. If the Sekimeiya had really teleported Katei, it recontextualized a few things."
    new "这场对话越来越离奇，可 Sai 说得有道理。如果 Sekimeiya 真的把 Katei 传送走了，那么有些事就得重新解释了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32195
    old "What are you even accusing me of? I touched it and instantly found myself in the hallway. I have no clue how it happened. I can't even believe what I'm saying!"
    new "你到底在指控我什么？我一碰它，转眼就站在走廊里了。怎么发生的我一点头绪都没有。我自己都不敢相信自己说的话！"

    # game/script.rpy:32196
    old "I couldn't help but agree with Sai. Katei had rushed to the Sekimeiya as soon as he'd seen it above the cabinet, and he'd touched it with his own skin in his panic despite his previous caution on the top floor."
    new "我不得不承认 Sai 说得对。Katei 一看见 Sekimeiya 浮在展示柜上方就冲了过去，慌乱之下直接用手碰了它，而他在顶层时明明还那么谨慎。"

    # game/script.rpy:32201
    old "I came here after hearing voices to inform you that I hadn't been able to power the computer back on."
    new "我听见有人说话就过来了，本来是想告诉你们，电脑我还是没能重新启动。"

    # game/script.rpy:32202
    old "And, unbelievable as it seemed, it sounded like he was trying to change the subject."
    new "而且，虽然难以置信，他的话听起来像是在转移话题。"

    # game/script.rpy:32207
    old "...I still have more things to try, though. I know I've repeated myself quite a few times, but it's clear now that the Sekimeiya must be kept here."
    new "不过我还有别的办法可以试。我知道这话我已经说过好几遍了，但现在已经很清楚，Sekimeiya 必须留在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:32212
    old "You said it made you travel to the past, but you're just going to ignore that?"
    new "你刚说它让你回到了过去，现在就这么算了？"

    # game/script.rpy:32213
    old "I know I don't want to try it again... whatever might have really happened. I have very little information about the Sekimeiya, but this is no ordinary gem, as expected."
    new "不管到底发生了什么……我清楚自己不想再试第二次。关于 Sekimeiya 我知道得很少，但不出所料，这绝不是普通的宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:32218
    old "It has to stay here until the shutter opens. There's no way it isn't dangerous, and the cold temperature must keep it stable in some way. I wasn't given any information on why it's essential, but Naomi might know more about it, so we come back to the same point: we must find her."
    new "在卷帘门打开之前，它必须留在这里。它不可能没有危险，而这里的低温应该以某种方式让它保持稳定。没有人告诉过我它为什么必不可少，但 Naomi 也许知道得更多，所以问题又绕回原处：我们必须找到她。"

    # game/script.rpy:32221
    old "He walked toward us, and then to hallway A."
    new "他朝我们走来，随后走向 A走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:32222
    old "...If I manage to power the computer and cameras back on, that'll be the best way to find her."
    new "……如果我能让电脑和摄像头重新通电，那才是找到她的最好办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:32228
    old "Then, he walked to the security room and left our field of vision."
    new "随后，他走向监控室，消失在我们的视线里。"

    # game/script.rpy:32235
    old "What the fuck...? He did it again!{w} Does he think we're idiots? He walked away from a stone that made him teleport and didn't demand the keys!"
    new "搞什么……？他又来这一套！{w}他当我们是傻子吗？被一块石头传送走了，居然扭头就走，连钥匙都不要回去！"

    # game/script.rpy:32240
    old "You're right, yeah. If he wanted to keep it locked in this cabinet, he would've made sure to ask for those back."
    new "你说得对。他要真想把它锁在这个展示柜里，肯定会记得把钥匙要回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:32245
    old "He's definitely working with Naomi. Whatever it is, he isn't being truthful in the slightest."
    new "他肯定是和 Naomi 串通好的。不管图的是什么，他一句实话都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:32256
    old "Unlock it again."
    new "再开一次锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:32261
    old "Of course, after all that Katei had said, we could just take the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet again, and it was fairly stupid to think that we wouldn't. Without thinking about it, Atsuki undid Katei's lock."
    new "当然，听了 Katei 那一大通话，我们照样能把 Sekimeiya 再从展示柜里拿出来——觉得我们不会这么做，才是真的犯傻。Atsuki 想都没想，就解开了 Katei 的锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:32266
    old "He opened the glass and once again took out the cushion holding the Sekimeiya. The gemstone had gone back to glowing white, but Atsuki didn't place it anywhere. He looked at it curiously, with both of his hands occupied."
    new "他打开玻璃柜门，再次取出托着 Sekimeiya 的垫子。宝石已恢复成发亮的白色，Atsuki 却没有把它放到任何地方。他两手都占着，好奇地端详着它。"

    # game/script.rpy:32271
    old "...What, do we touch it?"
    new "……怎么，要我们碰它吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:32272
    old "Most of us looked skeptical or even embarrassed to try. Sai, who I'd imagined would be the first to attempt it, appeared hesitant."
    new "大多数人面露迟疑，甚至有些尴尬，谁也没有动手。我原以为会第一个尝试的 Sai，此刻也显得犹豫。"

    # game/script.rpy:32279
    old "We were staring at the Sekimeiya, when in an instant, the opposite door had become our focus. From behind the shut door to hallway B came a sound we had to confirm we'd heard."
    new "我们正盯着 Sekimeiya，下一瞬，对面那扇门却成了所有人目光的焦点。通往 B走廊的那扇关着的门后传来一声响动，我们必须确认自己没有听错。"

    # game/script.rpy:32284
    old "Naomi... it has to be her."
    new "Naomi……一定是她。"

    # game/script.rpy:32288
    old "We all got closer to the door, and Akaro opened it."
    new "我们一起走近那扇门，Akaro 将它打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:32297
    old "The hallway was empty, but it contained many doors none of us had entered yet."
    new "走廊里空无一人，但还有许多我们尚未进去过的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:32302
    old "It came from pretty close to the door, but it looks like she hid already."
    new "声音离门很近，不过看来她已经躲起来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32307
    old "Was she listening and ran away when she realized she'd been heard?"
    new "她是不是在偷听，发觉自己被人听见后就跑了？"

    # game/script.rpy:32308
    old "We'd left the way to the lobby open, but if Naomi had been sneaking up on us, it was possible she'd closed herself behind one of the multitude of doors we could see. If that was the case, we finally had a chance to confront her."
    new "我们没把通往大堂的门关上，但若 Naomi 是一路悄悄摸过来的，她很可能已经躲在我们眼前那许多扇门中的某一扇后面。若真是如此，我们总算有机会和她当面对峙了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32315
    old "We hadn't yet inspected the whole crystal floor, and we still had to locate her. The Sekimeiya rolled slightly on top of the cushion, which Atsuki laid on the floor next to him. Meanwhile, the rest of us opened door after door and briefly looked through each room."
    new "我们还没查遍整个水晶层，也还没找到她。垫子上的 Sekimeiya 微微滚动了一下，Atsuki 把垫子放在自己身旁的地板上。我们其余人则一扇接一扇地开门，匆匆查看每个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:32316
    old "All the crystal rooms were empty, and midway, we noticed that some of the cabinets could be opened to reveal spacious interiors. The staff room contained numerous lockers we couldn't open, and the small cleaning room had several cleaning products, a large cart, and some buckets. In the end, we hadn't found anyone in hallway B or in the bathrooms."
    new "所有水晶展室都空无一人；查到一半时，我们发觉有些展示柜可以打开，里面颇为宽敞。员工室里摆着不少打不开的储物柜，狭小的清洁间则放着几样清洁用品、一辆大推车和几只水桶。到头来，B走廊和洗手间里都没找到任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:32318
    old "But we knew we had heard a person, so we didn't stop there. While Atsuki continued looking through hallway B, we went down to the mechanical room, which was empty and somewhat foreboding."
    new "可我们确信自己听到的是人的动静，便没有就此罢手。Atsuki 继续搜索 B走廊，我们则下到机械室——那里空空荡荡，透着几分不祥。"

    # game/script.rpy:32319
    old "Katei was kneeling under the desk in the security room. We quietly ignored him and searched through hallway A's rooms. Again, every crystal room was identical except for the one that had been hit by the smoke. ...Like the storeroom, though, it was empty."
    new "Katei 正跪在监控室的桌子底下。我们没作声，只当没看见，转去查 A走廊的房间。水晶展室依旧间间一模一样，只有被烟雾波及的那一间不同。……可和储藏室一样，里面也是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:32328
    old "We knew Naomi had been very close to us, but we'd failed to find her, and we had to prioritize the Sekimeiya before extending the search to the higher floors. Exasperated, we returned to see Atsuki waiting on the spot where we'd last seen him."
    new "我们明知 Naomi 刚才近在咫尺，却没能找到她；在把搜索扩大到上层之前，我们得先顾好 Sekimeiya。我们又急又恼地折返回去，见 Atsuki 仍守在我们最后看见他的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:32334
    old "On the floor were the cushion and the Sekimeiya. When it was clear we hadn't found anyone, he looked at them."
    new "地板上放着垫子和 Sekimeiya。见我们空手而归，他便朝它们看去。"

    # game/script.rpy:32339
    old "Remember the smell from the attic? It might've come from the Sekimeiya. I started noticing it here some time ago."
    new "还记得阁楼里那股气味吗？说不定就是从 Sekimeiya 上来的。我前阵子在这里就已经开始闻到它了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32345
    old "Oh, huh."
    new "哦，这样啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:32350
    old "I'm going to touch it."
    new "我要碰它了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32352
    old "...I felt slight traces of tension for a second. Was it really possible he was about to travel through time? I didn't think I could really take that seriously, but seeing him about to try made me uncomfortable. It was almost laughable how all of us looked on in anticipation, trying to confirm whether we'd lost our minds or not.{w} His hand got closer and closer to the gem until no distance separated it from him."
    new "……有一瞬间，我隐隐感到一阵紧张。他真的就要穿越时间了吗？我原以为自己不会当真，可亲眼见他准备尝试，心里还是不安起来。我们所有人都满怀期待地望着，想确认自己究竟是不是疯了——那副样子几乎有些可笑。{w}他的手一点点靠近宝石，直到指尖贴上它，中间再没有一丝距离。"

    # game/script.rpy:32355
    old "As he touched it, he was instantly no longer touching it. Atsuki was gone, and the Sekimeiya turned gray."
    new "他碰上去的一瞬，手便已经不在那里了。Atsuki 消失了，Sekimeiya 变成了灰色。"

    # game/script.rpy:32361
    old "Oh...!"
    new "啊……！"

    # game/script.rpy:32365
    old "Everybody else was occupied with the realization that the Sekimeiya's powers were real, but I ran forward, perceiving another sound from hallway B."
    new "其他人还沉浸在对「Sekimeiya 的力量竟是真的」的震惊里，我却听出 B走廊又传来一声响动，当即跑了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:32375
    old "The door wasn't fully closed, so I opened it all the way. I'd heard a sound just as Atsuki had disappeared, and I knew someone was there."
    new "那扇门没有关严，我索性一把推开。就在 Atsuki 消失的那一刻，我听见了响动，知道那里有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:32380
    old "The instant I peeked around it, I saw him. Hesitantly glancing from hallway C was Atsuki, whose eyes pierced mine until he removed himself from behind the corner. Slowly, he began to walk up to me as I wondered what to say."
    new "我刚探头去看，就看见了他。Atsuki 正迟疑地从 C走廊那边望过来，目光直直落在我身上，随后才从墙角后走出。他慢慢朝我走来，我却不知该说什么好。"

    # game/script.rpy:32381
    old "So, i-it worked...? You went to the past?"
    new "那、那么……成功了？你回到过去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:32390
    old "Um... Y-Yes. I suppose so.{w} I can't... I can't believe it, though."
    new "嗯……是、是的。应该是吧。{w}可我……我还是不敢相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:32395
    old "Everyone else was petrified, suppressing their sheer shock, but I noticed that someone who should've been there was missing."
    new "其余人都愣在原地，强压着满心惊骇；我却发现，有个本该在场的人不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32399
    old "Is Sai not here?"
    new "Sai 不在吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:32407
    old "Oh, y-you're right. I don't think he's been here for a bit."
    new "哦，你、你说得对。他好像已经有一会儿不在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32413
    old "How is this possible...? I don't get it, but if you went to the past, why didn't you appear in this room? That's what happened to Katei."
    new "这怎么可能……？我实在想不通。可如果你真回到了过去，为什么没在这个房间里出现？Katei 当时就是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:32418
    old "Hm...{w} I don't think I traveled a few seconds through time, but actually minutes. About twenty, I'd say."
    new "嗯……{w}我想我穿越的不只是几秒，而是好几分钟。大概二十分钟吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:32424
    old "Oh, what? That long ago, we were still in the attic, right?"
    new "什么？那么早……我们还在阁楼里吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:32435
    old "Atsuki nodded, clearly disconcerted."
    new "Atsuki 点了点头，显然心神不宁。"

    # game/script.rpy:32436
    old "We could only look at the Sekimeiya, which was a different color than it should've been."
    new "我们只能盯着 Sekimeiya——它的颜色已经和本该有的样子不同了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32437
    old "L-Let me see."
    new "让、让我看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:32438
    old "He crouched again and placed his hand on it."
    new "他又蹲下身，把手放了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:32443
    old "It's not doing anything, and it's cold. ...It must do nothing when it's this color.{w} It's just a thought, but maybe I traveled farther because it spent more time out of the cabinet. When Katei touched it, it had barely been out for any time at all."
    new "它毫无反应，还是凉的。……变成这种颜色时，它应该就什么也做不了。{w}只是我的猜测——也许是因为它在展示柜外放的时间更长，我才穿越得更远。Katei 碰它的时候，它才刚从柜子里拿出来没多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:32450
    old "He grabbed the cushion with both hands and walked to the cabinet. Mere seconds after he put it back in its place, the Sekimeiya started glowing again."
    new "他双手捧起垫子，走到展示柜前。放回去不过几秒，Sekimeiya 又开始发亮了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32456
    old "This again."
    new "又来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32459
    old "We could only stare in confusion as he closed the glass. The keyring had been left in the keyhole, so he took it out before thinking about how to phrase what he wanted to say."
    new "我们只能困惑地看着他关上玻璃柜门。钥匙串还插在锁孔里，他先把它拔了出来，才斟酌着该怎么开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:32464
    old "...I still can't believe what just happened to me, but I think we should go along with what Katei said and leave this in the cabinet until we can leave."
    new "……我到现在还是不敢相信刚才发生在我身上的事。不过我觉得，还是照 Katei 说的做，在能离开之前把它留在柜子里吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:32465
    old "I frowned a little while he locked the cabinet with the wheel. He held out his arm to hand me the keyring, which I put in my purse without question, even though it confused me."
    new "他用转轮锁上展示柜时，我微微皱了皱眉。他伸手把钥匙串递给我，我虽然不解，还是没多问就放进了手袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:32470
    old "...I mean, what else would we do?"
    new "……不然还能怎么办？"

    # game/script.rpy:32471
    old "Atsuki didn't answer, but I imagined the way he'd internally responded to that question. A few days ago, I'd heard the words \"I wish I could go back in time\" coming out of his mouth. I couldn't believe he was actually going to casually leave the Sekimeiya locked away."
    new "Atsuki 没有回答，但我能想象他心里是怎么回应这个问题的。几天前，我亲耳听他说过「要是能回到过去就好了」。我实在不敢相信，他竟真打算就这样把 Sekimeiya 锁起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:32472
    old "Honestly, that would have been ideal. I'd been expecting a much different reaction, and I couldn't discard it entirely. He could've easily been trying to fool the others by giving the keys to me."
    new "说实话，那样倒是最理想。我原本以为他的反应会截然不同，可也没法完全排除那种可能。他完全可能是在把钥匙交给我，好借此骗过其他人。"

    # game/script.rpy:32476
    old "No one spoke up, probably only thanks to the fact that Sai wasn't around. Akaro had indicated he wasn't in hallway A either, so we had no idea if he was even nearby."
    new "没人开口，大概只是因为 Sai 不在场。Akaro 也说过 A走廊里没有他，所以我们根本不知道他是否还在附近。"

    # game/script.rpy:32477
    old "...Did you make the sound in hallway B earlier?"
    new "……刚才 B走廊的声响是你弄出来的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:32482
    old "Oh, yeah, I did. That was when I realized I had really traveled through time. I moved to the second floor fast enough to stay out of sight."
    new "哦，对，是我。那时我才意识到自己真的穿越了时间。我及时跑上二楼，才没被你们看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:32487
    old "That's just insane. ...Were we actually searching for you? Where the hell is Naomi, then?"
    new "这也太荒唐了。……那我们刚才找的人，难道是你？Naomi 到底跑哪儿去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:32498
    old "We stepped into the gloomy hallway A."
    new "我们迈步走进昏暗的 A走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:32504
    old "Actually, where is Sai? That's another good question."
    new "说起来，Sai 人呢？这倒也是个问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:32505
    old "I know he was with us when we searched this hallway."
    new "我记得搜这条走廊的时候，他还跟我们在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:32510
    old "Did he go somewhere...?"
    new "他是不是去哪儿了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:32513
    old "Annoyed, Akaro rapidly glanced through the doors."
    new "Akaro 烦躁地扫过一排房门。"

    # game/script.rpy:32519
    old "He's not here. Did you see what happened to him?"
    new "他不在这儿。你们看见他怎么了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:32520
    old "He directed that question at Atsuki, who'd gone several minutes to the past and remained hidden."
    new "这句话是问 Atsuki 的——他穿越回了数分钟前的过去，此刻仍藏在暗处。"

    # game/script.rpy:32526
    old "...No. I was on the second floor, so all I know is that he didn't go up."
    new "……没有。我一直在二楼，只知道他没有往上走。"

    # game/script.rpy:32527
    old "He's still here, then..."
    new "那么，他还在这栋楼里……"

    # game/script.rpy:32533
    old "Faint sounds had been coming from the security room, where Katei was. To confirm that he was alone, we walked up to the door."
    new "监控室里隐约传来些响动，Katei 就在里面。为了确认他是否独自一人，我们走到了门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:32539
    old "We could see him leaning back on the chair in defeat due to all the screens still being black."
    new "屏幕依旧一片漆黑，只见他颓然地靠在椅背上。"

    # game/script.rpy:32544
    old "...Oh, I haven't been able to fix anything. I apologize.{w} I am completely lost; I don't even know what the issue is. Everything is properly arranged and connected, so unless no electricity is reaching the outlets, I'm out of ideas."
    new "……唉，我什么也没修好，实在抱歉。{w}我完全摸不着头绪，连问题出在哪都不知道。所有线路都排布妥当、连接完好，除非是插座根本没通电，否则我也没辙了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32548
    old "He crouched and crawled under the desk, failing to realize that Sai wasn't with us. We approached him and silently stared while he kept repeating how confused he was from the floor."
    new "他蹲下身钻到桌子底下，全然没察觉 Sai 并不在我们当中。我们走上前，默默看着他趴在桌底，反复念叨自己有多糊涂。"

    # game/script.rpy:32552
    old "And you still haven't found Naomi... You were inspecting this floor just now, right?"
    new "那 Naomi 还是没找到……你们刚才是在查这一层吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:32557
    old "Yes. She wasn't here."
    new "对。她不在这层。"

    # game/script.rpy:32558
    old "That's very strange. She might have been able to keep dodging us, but there's no way that'll work for too long. There's no place where she could hide forever."
    new "这就怪了。她或许能一直躲着我们，可这样撑不了太久。这楼里没有哪处能让她永远藏下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:32559
    old "He crawled out and let himself fall back onto the chair, looking exhausted."
    new "他从桌底爬出来，一屁股跌回椅子上，满脸疲惫。"

    # game/script.rpy:32560
    old "Behind him, all of us kept silent. We were all digesting the fact that time travel had occurred right in front of us, but it didn't seem like Katei found that particularly relevant, as he only looked concerned about his computer."
    new "他身后，我们全都沉默着。方才时间穿越就发生在我们眼前，我们都还在消化这件事；可 Katei 似乎并不觉得这有多要紧，一心只挂念着那台电脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:32561
    old "I noticed that Atsuki was remaining by himself next to the door. I wouldn't have approached him, but I saw him staring curiously into the distance."
    new "我注意到 Atsuki 独自留在门边。本来不打算过去，却看见他正好奇地凝望远处。"

    # game/script.rpy:32568
    old "...Is there anything...{w} Oh, the elevator?"
    new "……有什么……{w}咦，电梯？"

    # game/script.rpy:32575
    old "As soon as I glanced at hallway C, I could see that the elevator's door was very slightly open."
    new "我朝 C走廊瞥了一眼，立刻看出电梯门微微开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:32580
    old "It's not closed, yeah."
    new "嗯，确实没关上。"

    # game/script.rpy:32582
    old "Akaro approached us with a frown, but Katei addressed it before he got far."
    new "Akaro 皱着眉走过来，还没走近，Katei 就先开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:32588
    old "Oh, it's been like that for a while. I noticed it when we walked down from the attic and figured the others purposely left it like that."
    new "哦，那样有一阵子了。我们从阁楼下来时就看见了，还以为是其他人故意留着的。"

    # game/script.rpy:32593
    old "We didn't."
    new "没有这回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:32594
    old "It must not have closed properly when you got off, then. I've seen it happen in the past."
    new "那多半是你们下电梯时没关严。以前也出现过这种情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:32599
    old "Hm, I see. I didn't notice it."
    new "嗯，原来如此。我倒没留意。"

    # game/script.rpy:32600
    old "Me neither.{w} ...Wait, I just remembered the hallway B camera. The one that had its lens completely clean."
    new "我也没注意。{w}……等等，我想起 B走廊那台监控了，就是镜头干干净净的那台。"

    # game/script.rpy:32601
    old "Going by their looks, Akaro and Katei didn't know what I was talking about."
    new "看他们的神情，Akaro 和 Katei 并不知道我在说什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:32608
    old "Excuse me...?"
    new "你说什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:32613
    old "Right, the one above the door to the lobby."
    new "对，就是大厅门上方那一台。"

    # game/script.rpy:32614
    old "Yeah, its footage was being displayed up there."
    new "嗯，它的画面刚才就显示在上面。"

    # game/script.rpy:32619
    old "Are you serious?"
    new "你说真的？"

    # game/script.rpy:32625
    old "Both of them hurried out of the room while the rest of us awkwardly stayed put."
    new "两人匆匆出了监控室，剩下我们几个留在原地，有些尴尬。"

    # game/script.rpy:32630
    old "Isla, clinging to her mother's legs, had become a little more relaxed. She inquisitively looked around, time travel evidently not much of a weight on her mind."
    new "Isla 抱着母亲的腿，稍稍放松了些。她好奇地四下张望，显然没怎么把时间旅行放在心上。"

    # game/script.rpy:32631
    old "During the silence, I approached the computer. I was slightly interested in its mysterious shutdown, but I didn't examine it too thoroughly."
    new "一片沉默中，我走到电脑前。对这莫名其妙的关机，我有些在意，却没有仔细查看。"

    # game/script.rpy:32638
    old "It didn't take the others long to return."
    new "没过多久，他们就回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32639
    old "You saw it, right?"
    new "你也看见了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:32643
    old "What the hell...? Was it cleaned?"
    new "怎么回事……？是被人擦过了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:32648
    old "There's no way we would know."
    new "我们怎么可能知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:32649
    old "We looked at Katei, who'd put his hand in one of his deep pockets but took it back out empty."
    new "我们朝 Katei 看去。他刚把手伸进一个深口袋，又空着手抽了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:32650
    old "...I don't have it anymore, but do you remember when—"
    new "……我已经没那东西了，不过你们还记不记得——"

    # game/script.rpy:32655
    old "Wait, where the hell is Sai?"
    new "等等，Sai 到底去哪了？"

    # game/script.rpy:32660
    old "...{w}After looking at each other, we let him know we'd recently lost track of Sai. Before Katei could get too alarmed, Akaro cut in."
    new "……{w}我们面面相觑，告诉他我们不久前就跟丢了 Sai。还不等 Katei 过于惊慌，Akaro 就插了话。"

    # game/script.rpy:32665
    old "What were you gonna say? We've already searched for Sai, and the Sekimeiya's locked in the cabinet."
    new "你刚才想说什么？Sai 我们已经找过了，Sekimeiya 也锁在展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:32670
    old "...{w}The duct tape, remember? Sai took out my keyring, and it had a piece of duct tape attached to it. That piece had smoke residue on it."
    new "……{w}胶带，记得吗？Sai 拿出我的钥匙串时，上面粘着一截胶带。那截胶带上留着烟熏的痕迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:32675
    old "We all remembered what he was talking about and began to understand why he'd brought it up."
    new "我们都记起了他说的那截胶带，也渐渐明白他为什么提起它。"

    # game/script.rpy:32680
    old "I know it was duct tape because one side was still sticky, which means that it was only hit on the front side. In other words, it was stuck somewhere when the smoke was released."
    new "我知道那是胶带，因为它有一面还带着黏性，说明只有正面被烟熏到。也就是说，烟散出来的时候，它正贴在某个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:32685
    old "Where did it even come from?"
    new "那东西到底是从哪来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:32687
    old "...{w}When I walked down to the crystal floor, searching for you, I found it hidden behind a handrail and put it in my pocket to inquire about it. That's when it got stuck to the keyring."
    new "……{w}我下到水晶层找你们的时候，发现它藏在扶手后面，就收进了口袋，打算之后再问。就是在那时，它粘到了钥匙串上。"

    # game/script.rpy:32693
    old "So it was placed on the lens of that camera, which prevented the smoke from hitting it. Afterward, it was removed..."
    new "这么说，是有人把它贴在那台监控的镜头上，挡下了烟雾；之后又把它取走了……"

    # game/script.rpy:32698
    old "I'm confused about a few things. Why would someone do that? They had to already know the smoke attack would happen."
    new "有几处我还不明白。为什么要这么做？做这事的人必然事先就知道会有人放出烟雾。"

    # game/script.rpy:32700
    old "And it was removed before we entered the security room."
    new "而且，它是在我们进入监控室之前就被取下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:32701
    old "Additionally, leaving it behind a handrail seemed strange. If they wanted to throw it away, flushing it down the toilet seemed ideal, as fingerprints could otherwise present a problem."
    new "再说，把它留在扶手后面也很奇怪。想处理掉的话，冲进马桶最保险，不然指纹容易惹麻烦。"

    # game/script.rpy:32702
    old "That logic led to the thought that Katei, who might have orchestrated the whole thing, had the opportunity to place the duct tape himself and keep it in his pocket, unaware that we'd find it. I opted not to speculate about that out loud and let everyone else come to the conclusions they wanted."
    new "顺着这个逻辑，我想到：整件事若真是 Katei 一手策划，他就有机会亲手把胶带放上去，再收进自己口袋，却没料到我们会找到它。我决定不把这个猜测说出口，让其他人各自得出他们想要的结论。"

    # game/script.rpy:32708
    old "In the end, Katei sighed and sat on his chair again."
    new "最后，Katei 叹了口气，又坐回了椅子上。"

    # game/script.rpy:32709
    old "What the hell is Naomi doing...? We can't even use the computer to figure anything out.{w} Do you all think Sai ran away on his own? Now we need to find both of them."
    new "Naomi 到底在搞什么……？连电脑都用不了，什么都查不出来。{w}你们真觉得 Sai 是自己跑掉的？现在倒好，两个人全得找。"

    # game/script.rpy:32714
    old "We lost track of him when we were searching this hallway, which would've been a good opportunity to sneak away. I have no idea why he'd do that, though."
    new "我们在这条走廊里搜寻的时候跟丢了他，那确实是个溜走的好机会。不过，我想不通他为什么要这么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:32715
    old "Once again, Katei pressed the computer's power button in frustration while looking at all the powered-off screens."
    new "Katei 又一次烦躁地按下电脑的电源键，目光扫过那些黑着的屏幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:32716
    old "Maybe now you can believe that he was the one up to something. I'm just trying to do my job."
    new "也许现在你们该相信，真正有鬼的人是他。我只是想做好分内的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:32718
    old "Whether they believed him or not, nobody spoke up for a while."
    new "无论他们信不信他，一时都没人开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:32719
    old "Even if two people had traveled through time, we all had our own reasons to keep still in the narrow room, prioritizing internal thoughts before going out to find the two missing people."
    new "即便确实有两个人经历了时间穿越，我们也都各有理由留在这间狭小的屋子里，先理清各自的心思，再出去找那两个失踪的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:32730
    old "We were still behind Katei's chair, awaiting any decision, when noise came from the door."
    new "我们还站在 Katei 的椅子后面，等着他拿主意，门口忽然传来响动。"

    # game/script.rpy:32739
    old "As we turned around, we saw Sai staring at us next to the unassertive Atsuki."
    new "我们回过头，只见 Sai 站在没什么底气的 Atsuki 身旁，正盯着我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:32745
    old "Wh-Where were you!?"
    new "你、你刚才去哪了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:32750
    old "Me? I just took a detour to the bathroom."
    new "我？只是绕路去了趟洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:32757
    old "Katei's smirk perfectly conveyed his reaction, but Sai ignored it. Instead, he slipped into the room."
    new "Katei 嘴角一撇，意思已经再明白不过，Sai 却视若无睹，侧身溜进了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:32767
    old "So, what are we doing here? You still can't fix your own computer?"
    new "所以，我们待在这儿干什么？你连自己的电脑都还修不好？"

    # game/script.rpy:32772
    old "What do you think?"
    new "你说呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:32773
    old "I think that we just found out we can travel to the past and are instead trying to fix a computer. Wouldn't it be a better idea to go back in time and see who did this?"
    new "我们刚发现能穿越回过去，结果却在这里修电脑。要我说，与其这样，不如回到过去，看看是谁干的，岂不更好？"

    # game/script.rpy:32774
    old "You really can't expect us to take you seriously."
    new "你总不能指望我们把你这话当真吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:32779
    old "Sai, what were you doing just now? You definitely weren't in the bathroom."
    new "Sai，你刚才到底在做什么？你绝对不在洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:32780
    old "Did you check all of them?"
    new "所有洗手间你都看过了？"

    # game/script.rpy:32781
    old "You have to give up on him. Whatever he was doing will be exposed eventually."
    new "别在他身上白费力气了。不管他刚才在搞什么，迟早都会露馅。"

    # game/script.rpy:32786
    old "Anyway, who has the keys now?"
    new "话说回来，钥匙现在在谁手上？"

    # game/script.rpy:32787
    old "I have them."
    new "在我这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:32788
    old "I see. ...Is there a reason why we're here?"
    new "这样啊。……我们待在这里，是有什么原因吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:32793
    old "No. We should try to find Naomi again."
    new "没有。我们得再去找 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:32794
    old "That's what I'm saying."
    new "我就是这个意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:32803
    old "Where Is The Mask"
    new "面具何在"

    # game/script.rpy:32805
    old "As Sai left the room, we all exchanged looks, wondering what his intentions really were. We began to disperse into hallway A behind him."
    new "Sai 走出房间时，我们彼此交换了个眼色，都在猜他究竟打什么主意。随后，我们跟在他身后，陆续走进 A 走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:32811
    old "Atsuki hadn't yet moved from the door, and his expression had gotten considerably murkier. I had no idea what it meant anymore, so I walked up to him."
    new "Atsuki 还站在门口没有动，脸色比刚才阴沉了不少。我已经完全看不懂那表情意味着什么，便朝他走了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:32819
    old "Is it going better?"
    new "好些了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:32824
    old "...Huh?{w} Sorry, I don't know. I just can't believe it. I really traveled through time."
    new "……啊？{w}抱歉，我也不知道。我只是……实在无法相信。我真的经历了时间穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:32825
    old "Well, I can't believe it either.{w} ...Are you sure you don't want to do it again?"
    new "其实我也无法相信。{w}……你确定不想再来一次？"

    # game/script.rpy:32830
    old "What? Travel through time?"
    new "什么？时间穿越？"

    # game/script.rpy:32832
    old "No, of course I do."
    new "不，我当然想再来一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:32838
    old "I'm trying to understand some things. I traveled a few minutes to the past, to the attic, which might make sense. I'm not sure if that's enough, though."
    new "我想弄明白几件事。我穿越到几分钟前的过去，回到了阁楼，这或许还说得通。但我不确定这样是否足够。"

    # game/script.rpy:32840
    old "...Oh, I see."
    new "……哦，原来如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:32841
    old "He didn't seem to even notice my reply. Since he'd gone quiet again, I walked away slowly."
    new "他似乎根本没注意到我回了话。见他再次沉默，我便慢慢走开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32850
    old "When Sai saw that, he approached me and spoke in a hushed tone so that his words reached only my ears."
    new "Sai 看到这一幕，便凑近我，压低声音，只说给我一个人听。"

    # game/script.rpy:32855
    old "You think Atsuki's hiding something, right?"
    new "你觉得 Atsuki 藏着什么事，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:32858
    old "You definitely know him, but you realized something he said didn't make sense."
    new "你肯定很了解他，不过也听出了他话里有不对劲的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:32859
    old "What the hell are you talking about?"
    new "你到底在说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:32860
    old "Am I wrong? He traveled to the past with the Sekimeiya—that much I know.{w} Then, he simply reunited with you guys. Am I missing something?"
    new "我说错了吗？他用 Sekimeiya 穿越回了过去——这点我知道。{w}然后，他就这么和你们会合了。我是不是漏掉了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:32861
    old "N-No? What are you getting at?"
    new "没、没有？你想说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:32866
    old "If I'm not missing anything, I don't know. However, he is hiding something, and apparently even from you.{w} I'm sure he'll want to use the Sekimeiya again, so if he doesn't tell you that, assume that he's lying and try to stop him."
    new "如果我没漏掉什么，那我也不知道。不过，他确实藏着事，而且显然连你也瞒着。{w}我敢肯定他还想再用 Sekimeiya，所以如果他没把这件事告诉你们，就认定他在撒谎，想办法拦住他。"

    # game/script.rpy:32870
    old "Trying his best to sound mysterious, Sai walked away. The two most suspicious people there had inquired about Atsuki, and once again, I could only laugh inwardly as I sighed outwardly."
    new "Sai 竭力装出神秘的样子，转身走开了。这里最可疑的两个人先后问起 Atsuki，我只能再次在心里发笑，表面却叹了口气。"

    # game/script.rpy:32873
    old "\"Try to stop him.\" They didn't need to tell me that, but I wouldn't do anything. In any case, given that I'd been told the same thing again, it was very possible Atsuki was actually trying to pull something off."
    new "「拦住他」——这话用不着他们提醒，可我什么都不会做。况且，同样的话我已经听了第二遍，Atsuki 说不定真在暗中搞什么名堂。"

    # game/script.rpy:32878
    old "If Naomi's really hiding, we'll never find her if we go in one group. Let's disperse ourselves through the building. There's no way we'll miss her if we do that."
    new "如果 Naomi 真躲起来了，大家一起行动绝对找不到她。我们分头搜遍整栋楼吧。这样就不可能漏掉她。"

    # game/script.rpy:32884
    old "What a good idea."
    new "真是个好主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:32890
    old "In the blink of an eye, Atsuki and I were the only remaining people in hallway A."
    new "转眼之间，A走廊里就只剩下我和 Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:32891
    old "Isla had dragged Erina into a crystal room, Akaro had disappeared off to hallway C, and Sai and Katei had gone up the stairs individually. Despite sharing a common objective, there was no coordination, and everyone had silently chosen their own path to take."
    new "Isla 把 Erina 拉进了水晶展室，Akaro 去了 C走廊后不见踪影，Sai 和 Katei 也各自上了楼。明明目的一致，却毫无协调，大家都默不作声地各走各的路。"

    # game/script.rpy:32892
    old "We were left a little puzzled, as everyone had walked away from the Sekimeiya which only I could take out of the cabinet. Was it because Atsuki told us he didn't want to use it? I couldn't exactly ask anyone."
    new "大家都离开了 Sekimeiya，可明明只有我能把它从展示柜里拿出来，我们不免有些摸不着头脑。是因为 Atsuki 说过不想用它吗？可我也没法去问谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:32900
    old "You're asking me? I don't know. I'm just tired."
    new "你问我？我不知道。我只是累了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32905
    old "Me too. You've been awake for longer, though."
    new "我也是。不过你醒着的时间比我长。"

    # game/script.rpy:32906
    old "I know."
    new "我知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:32907
    old "I suppose we could go to the attic. You have the key, right?"
    new "要不去阁楼吧。钥匙在你手上，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:32908
    old "Yeah, but we probably shouldn't go in alone, and splitting up to find Naomi won't work if half of us stay still."
    new "嗯，不过我们大概不该单独进去。再说，要是留一半人不动，分头去找 Naomi 也没用。"

    # game/script.rpy:32913
    old "I'm not sure it'd work anyway. If the exit closed as the alarm went off and she's hiding somewhere, she must be confident she won't be found. And if she's working with Katei, he's definitely confident we won't find her.{w} We've already been everywhere in this building, so I don't think it's essential that we keep looking for her. If she can be found, it'll happen eventually."
    new "反正我也不确定那样做有没有用。警报响起时出口已经关了，她既然正躲在某处，就一定有把握不会被人找到。要是她和 Katei 是一伙的，那 Katei 肯定也确信我们找不到她。{w}这栋楼里我们都已经找遍了，所以我觉得没必要继续找她。如果她真的能被找到，迟早也会找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:32915
    old "...What do you want, then?"
    new "……那你想做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:32920
    old "I want to go to the attic. I need to lie down for a bit."
    new "我想去阁楼。我得躺一会儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:32921
    old "We'd been told not to enter without Katei's consent, but he was the one who let us keep the keys. I hesitated, but I had no reason to object, so I just shrugged and headed over to the elevator."
    new "我们被告知未经 Katei 同意不得进入，但钥匙本来就是他让我们保管的。我犹豫了一下，却也没有理由反对，便耸耸肩走向电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:32927
    old "I noticed something had changed when I reached for the handle."
    new "我伸手去握门把时，察觉到有些不对。"

    # game/script.rpy:32928
    old "The door's not open anymore."
    new "门已经关上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32935
    old "Oh, yeah, it was earlier. {tip=perspective}Sai used it{/tip}."
    new "哦，对，刚才还开着。{tip=perspective}Sai 用过{/tip}。"

    # game/script.rpy:32937
    old "That makes sense.{w} ...And it's still here."
    new "说得通。{w}……而且它还停在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:32938
    old "There was no resistance when I tried to open the door, meaning that Sai had gotten off on the crystal floor."
    new "我试着开门时没遇到什么阻力，看来 Sai 是在水晶层下了电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:32944
    old "Atsuki nodded before stepping in. I took the keyring from my purse and inserted the attic key into the first keyhole. The light around the floor 7 button activated, and after pressing it, we began to ascend."
    new "Atsuki 点点头，先一步走进电梯。我从手提包里取出钥匙圈，把阁楼钥匙插进第一个锁孔。7楼按钮周围的灯亮了起来，我按下按钮，电梯开始上升。"

    # game/script.rpy:32949
    old "I didn't know what to think of Atsuki, but we were at least getting far away from the Sekimeiya, which felt as strange as everyone else having left. With dull eyes, he stared at the door until the trip ended. I just wished we'd gone to sleep the previous night."
    new "我不知道该怎么看待 Atsuki，但我们至少正在远离 Sekimeiya——而这件事竟和所有人都已经离开一样古怪。他目光呆滞，一直盯着电梯门，直到电梯停下。我只希望我们前一晚就睡了。"

    # game/script.rpy:32959
    old "I felt a little uncomfortable stepping onto the wooden floor, aware that there were about to be cameras pointed right at us. That sensation didn't seem to be shared by Atsuki, who directly approached the living room."
    new "踩上木地板时，我有些不自在，因为知道马上就会有摄像头正对着我们。Atsuki 似乎没有这种感觉，径直朝客厅走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:32966
    old "It doesn't look like anyone else has been here."
    new "看来没有别人来过这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:32970
    old "Plenty of footprints were still visible, and I figured Atsuki knew they were the same ones we'd seen before leaving."
    new "地上还留着不少脚印，我想 Atsuki 也知道，这些就是我们离开前看到的那些。"

    # game/script.rpy:32976
    old "Hey, hasn't the smell from earlier faded away a lot?"
    new "喂，之前那股味道是不是淡了很多？"

    # game/script.rpy:32977
    old "Oh, I think you're right."
    new "哦，好像确实如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:32982
    old "...I'm so exhausted... Even if we shouldn't be here, at least nobody will bother us, assuming Naomi really can't get in."
    new "……我太累了……就算我们不该待在这里，只要 Naomi 真的进不来，至少没人会来打扰我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:32985
    old "He walked down the hallway, sighing deeply. After choosing to open the right door, I heard him falling onto the bed."
    new "他沿着走廊走去，深深叹了口气。他打开右边那扇门，随后我听见他倒在了床上。"

    # game/script.rpy:32991
    old "I entered the room and recalled that there was only one bed. He was already lying face-down, all energy drained out of him. I stood by the door for a moment and then closed it after stepping in."
    new "我走进房间，想起这里只有一张床。他已经趴倒在床上，浑身的力气像是被抽干了。我在门口站了一会儿，才迈步进去，把门关上。"

    # game/script.rpy:32995
    old "I could've gone to the neighboring room, but I decided to go to the upper level instead."
    new "我本可以去隔壁房间，却决定到上面一层去。"

    # game/script.rpy:33001
    old "There, I shakily sat on one of the beds, finding my situation unnerving. My whole body was stiff, and my mind felt numb. After a while, I managed to lie down, and the mattress reminded my body how tired it was."
    new "我在那里颤巍巍地坐到一张床上，只觉得自己的处境令人不安。全身僵硬，脑子也麻木了。过了好一会儿，我才勉强躺下，床垫让身体重新意识到自己有多疲惫。"

    # game/script.rpy:33007
    old "I didn't fight the tiredness. Under foreign bed sheets, recorded by a camera on that forbidden floor, I pushed my consciousness away until it dissipated."
    new "我没有抗拒倦意。在那禁止进入的楼层上，摄像头记录着一切；我躺在陌生的床单下，任由意识一点点远去，直到彻底消散。"

    # game/script.rpy:33014
    old "When I woke up, I realized I must not have slept for very long, as I didn't feel like I had dreamed at all. I was still uneasy, and I hadn't turned off the light."
    new "醒来时，我意识到自己应该没睡多久，因为我完全不记得做过梦。我仍然心神不宁，而且灯也没关。"

    # game/script.rpy:33015
    old "While I didn't know the time, it was fairly likely that people were looking for us and couldn't get in the attic. I didn't care anymore; my back hurt, and I was just as tired as before. I slowly stood up and approached the light switch."
    new "我不知道现在几点，但很可能有人正在找我们，却进不了阁楼。我已经不在乎了；背很痛，人也和之前一样疲惫。我慢慢起身，走向电灯开关。"

    # game/script.rpy:33021
    old "But my hand stopped before touching it, and so did my whole body."
    new "可我的手还没碰到开关就停住了，整个人也僵在原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:33026
    old "...Did I just do this?"
    new "……这是我刚才弄的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33027
    old "I'd noticed something very important next to the bed."
    new "我注意到床边有样很重要的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:33028
    old "There was only one thing I did before falling asleep: look at my purse. I'd stared at it and then forced myself to look away, nervous that it was so out in the open."
    new "睡着前我只做过一件事：看了看自己的手提包。我盯着它看了一会儿，又强迫自己移开视线，担心它就这样暴露在外。"

    # game/script.rpy:33029
    old "Because if I'd fallen asleep, someone could've looked inside. ...And that was something that couldn't happen."
    new "因为一旦我睡着，就可能有人翻看里面。……而那种事绝不能发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:33033
    old "I crouched very slowly and then looked at it from the same position as before."
    new "我慢慢蹲下身，然后从之前那个位置看过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:33034
    old "It moved. It wasn't like that when I fell asleep."
    new "它动过。我睡着时不是这样的。"

    # game/script.rpy:33035
    old "The difference was minimal, but I noticed it immediately, and it was no mistake."
    new "差别很小，但我立刻就看出来了，绝不是错觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:33036
    old "No, did he...?{w} Or did I just poke it when I stood up?"
    new "不对，难道他……？{w}还是我起身时不小心碰到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:33037
    old "I widened the opening with my fingers and looked inside."
    new "我用手指把包口撑开，朝里面看去。"

    # game/script.rpy:33041
    old "Everything's here."
    new "东西都在。"

    # game/script.rpy:33043
    old "Nothing had been taken, but that didn't settle it."
    new "什么东西都没少，可这并不能让我安心。"

    # game/script.rpy:33044
    old "The keys were inside. If someone had gone through my purse, it was very likely those keys were the target, but they were far from my concern."
    new "钥匙还在里面。要是有人翻过我的包，那钥匙很可能就是目标，可我最担心的并不是这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:33045
    old "Atsuki and I should've been alone in the attic, which had both of its entrances locked.{w} I suddenly wasn't sensing my tiredness anymore. I grabbed my purse and approached the hatch."
    new "阁楼的两个入口都锁着，这里本该只有我和 Atsuki。{w}我忽然感觉不到倦意了。我抓起手提包，走向阁楼口。"

    # game/script.rpy:33046
    old "It was shut, so I slowly lifted it up."
    new "盖板关着，我慢慢把它掀开。"

    # game/script.rpy:33051
    old "...Are you awake?"
    new "……你醒着吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33058
    old "Uh,{w=0.4} yes...{w=0.5} I only slept for a few minutes and couldn't do it again."
    new "呃，{w=0.4}嗯……{w=0.5}我只睡了几分钟，后来就睡不着了。"

    # game/script.rpy:33059
    old "How do you know it was only a few minutes?"
    new "你怎么知道只过了几分钟？"

    # game/script.rpy:33063
    old "Huh? That's just what it felt like. Did you just wake up?"
    new "咦？我只是感觉没过多久。你才刚醒？"

    # game/script.rpy:33064
    old "I took a few seconds to reply while I climbed down the ladder. The light was turned on, and the sheets over him were in disarray."
    new "我顺着梯子往下爬，隔了几秒才回话。灯已经开了，他身上的被子乱作一团。"

    # game/script.rpy:33065
    old "Yeah, I don't know how long it's been."
    new "嗯，我也不知道过了多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:33071
    old "I spent a very long time trying to sleep again, so I think at least two hours."
    new "我花了很长时间想再睡着，所以我觉得至少过了两个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:33072
    old "Oh, really...?"
    new "哦，是吗……"

    # game/script.rpy:33076
    old "*yawn*{w} Yeah, and I don't think it'll happen. Are you still tired?"
    new "*哈欠*{w}对啊，不过我看是睡不着了。你还困吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33077
    old "No, I'm fine now."
    new "不困了，已经没事了。"

    # game/script.rpy:33079
    old "I felt as if part of my mind had cleared up. We'd seriously gotten trapped in the building, and Atsuki had traveled through time. ...Could that be true? Could that really have happened?"
    new "我感觉脑子清醒了一些。我们真的被困在了这栋楼里，而 Atsuki 真的穿越了时间。……会是真的吗？那种事真的可能发生吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33082
    old "He sat on the bed and stretched his arms."
    new "他坐在床上，伸了个懒腰。"

    # game/script.rpy:33083
    old "It was so absurd that I hadn't been able to react when I'd seen him teleport. It had all suddenly happened with no room for doubt, but what was going on? Only after waking up had I begun to comprehend how strange it was that he'd wanted to go to the attic."
    new "那太离奇了，亲眼看见他传送时，我根本反应不过来。事情发生得猝不及防，容不得半点怀疑，可这究竟是怎么回事？直到醒来之后，我才慢慢意识到，他当初想去阁楼这件事有多么蹊跷。"

    # game/script.rpy:33087
    old "Did you hear anything outside the bedroom?"
    new "卧室外面有听到什么动静吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33092
    old "No. We might really have the only key to this place."
    new "没有。这地方的钥匙，说不定真的只有我们手里这一把。"

    # game/script.rpy:33097
    old "Since I didn't want to ask, I approached the door. The chain wasn't set, so I turned the handle to see if he'd locked it."
    new "我不想开口问，便走到门边。门链没有挂上，我转动门把手，想确认他有没有上锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:33100
    old "The door opened smoothly, indicating that anyone could've made their way in."
    new "门毫无阻碍地开了，可见任谁都能进得来。"

    # game/script.rpy:33105
    old "Do you want to go back down? I was waiting for you to wake up. I'm not as tired anymore."
    new "你要下去吗？我一直在等你醒来。我已经没那么累了。"

    # game/script.rpy:33106
    old "...{w}Yeah, sure."
    new "……{w}嗯，走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:33107
    old "Was I being toyed with? The more seconds passed, the more I felt that way."
    new "我是不是被人耍了？时间一秒秒过去，这种念头越来越强。"

    # game/script.rpy:33110
    old "Atsuki stood up and silently walked to the hallway."
    new "Atsuki 站起身，一言不发地走向走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:33120
    old "Nobody crossed this carpet. I can hardly see the footprints anymore.{w} ...You have the key with you, right?"
    new "没人踩过这块地毯，脚印都快看不清了。{w}……钥匙你带着吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:33126
    old "Well, we should probably use the elevator again, so I don't think we'll need it."
    new "反正我们大概还是得坐电梯，应该用不上它吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:33132
    old "He tried to open the door, but he couldn't."
    new "他试着开门，却打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:33137
    old "I suppose someone called it while we were sleeping."
    new "大概是有人在我们睡着的时候把电梯叫走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:33138
    old "I leaned on the wall while he pressed the button. I was acting disinterested naturally, but I couldn't get the sight of my purse out of my head."
    new "他按下按钮，我靠在墙边。我装作毫不在意，可脑海里总挥不去瞥见手袋的那一幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:33145
    old "The silent orange light indicated the elevator's arrival. Atsuki pulled the door open, and we walked in."
    new "橘色的指示灯静静亮起，电梯到了。Atsuki 拉开梯门，我们走了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:33153
    old "The elevator began to descend toward the lowest floor—the destination that Atsuki had chosen."
    new "电梯开始往最底层下降——那是 Atsuki 选的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:33158
    old "I guess we'll have to apologize for going up, but we were really tired. I wonder if they found Naomi..."
    new "上楼这事，回头大概得道个歉，可我们当时实在是累坏了。不知道他们找到 Naomi 没有……"

    # game/script.rpy:33159
    old "Atsuki was resembling Katei more and more to me, and I didn't know if I could trust him.{w} Behind him was the red stop button, which Katei claimed would confine us inside until the alarm's effects automatically reverted."
    new "Atsuki 越来越像 Katei，我不知该不该信他。{w}他身后是红色的停止按钮，据 Katei 说，一旦按下，我们就会被关在里面，直到警报效果自动解除。"

    # game/script.rpy:33161
    old "But I didn't dare touch it, allowing the doors to open. After Atsuki pushed open the outer one, hallway C came into sight, just as barren as we remembered it."
    new "可我不敢去碰，任由梯门打开。Atsuki 推开外侧那道门后，C走廊映入眼帘，仍和我们记忆中一样空荡。"

    # game/script.rpy:33169
    old "Let's go to the security room. Maybe we can look at the time."
    new "去监控室吧。说不定能看到时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:33176
    old "The light was on, but no screens were. That meant that Sai's watch was still all we had."
    new "灯亮着，屏幕却全是黑的。看来还是只能靠 Sai 的手表。"

    # game/script.rpy:33182
    old "It hasn't been fixed... I can't hear anyone, but they should be somewhere on this floor."
    new "还没修好啊……我什么声音都听不到，不过他们应该就在这层的某处。"

    # game/script.rpy:33183
    old "Atsuki was ready to leave, but I couldn't help but feel iffy about the computer's shutdown. Katei was the only one who tried to fix it."
    new "Atsuki 已经打算走了，可电脑关机这件事总让我觉得不对劲。毕竟只有 Katei 试着修过它。"

    # game/script.rpy:33187
    old "Since we were alone, I crouched under the desk and stared at the mess of cables that Katei had been examining."
    new "趁四下无人，我蹲到桌子底下，盯着 Katei 之前检查过的那团乱麻似的线缆。"

    # game/script.rpy:33192
    old "After glancing back and forth, an oddity stood out."
    new "我来回看了几遍，发现了一处不对劲的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:33197
    old "Can you even see properly down there?"
    new "你在下面看得清吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33198
    old "Yes, and this cable isn't plugged in."
    new "看得清。这根线没插上。"

    # game/script.rpy:33200
    old "I don't know what it's for, but Katei said that everything was in place."
    new "我不知道它是干什么用的，可 Katei 说过，所有东西都放好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:33205
    old "Can you tell where it should go?"
    new "看得出它该插在哪儿吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33206
    old "The angle was uncomfortable on my neck, but I strained to look behind the computer tower and found a slot that could fit. Forced to use my left hand, I grabbed the cable and managed to plug it into the computer."
    new "那个姿势扭得脖子难受，我硬撑着往主机后面看，找到一个大小合适的插口。我只能用左手抓起线缆，总算把它插进了电脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:33207
    old "I don't know if that did anything, but it's plugged in now."
    new "不知道这样有没有用，反正现在插好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:33212
    old "I clambered out as Atsuki pressed the power button."
    new "我爬出来的时候，Atsuki 按下了电源键。"

    # game/script.rpy:33218
    old "A few seconds later, the system began to run."
    new "几秒后，系统启动了。"

    # game/script.rpy:33224
    old "The middle screen lit up, and a loading logo glowed."
    new "中间的屏幕亮了起来，浮现出发光的加载标志。"

    # game/script.rpy:33229
    old "I don't get it. Did Katei do this and hope we wouldn't look at the cables?"
    new "我想不通。难道是 Katei 故意这么干，赌我们不会去看线缆？"

    # game/script.rpy:33232
    old "I'd begun to gather hope, but it dissipated as soon as the computer turned off again."
    new "我刚燃起一丝希望，电脑却又一次关机，希望也随之落空。"

    # game/script.rpy:33233
    old "...Huh? Is it still not working?"
    new "「……嗯？还是开不了机吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:33234
    old "Confused, Atsuki powered it on one more time."
    new "Atsuki 满心疑惑，又按下了电源。"

    # game/script.rpy:33244
    old "The same thing happened: seconds after running, it automatically powered off."
    new "结果还是一样：开机不过几秒，它便又自动关机了。"

    # game/script.rpy:33247
    old "Atsuki looked under the desk in case he could spot the problem."
    new "Atsuki 看了看桌下，想找出问题所在。"

    # game/script.rpy:33248
    old "I don't see anything clearly wrong. Maybe the operating system got damaged."
    new "「看不出有什么明显的毛病。可能是操作系统坏了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33249
    old "I see... We need to tell the others about this—especially Katei."
    new "「原来如此……得把这件事告诉其他人，尤其是 Katei。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33254
    old "We were about to leave when Atsuki remembered what I'd said."
    new "我们正要离开，Atsuki 忽然想起了我刚才说过的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:33259
    old "Oh, wait. We might still be able to look at the time."
    new "「啊，等等。说不定还能看时间。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33266
    old "He walked back toward the computer and powered it on. While it was running, he looked at the screen and pressed one of the suggested keys. Then, the screen changed."
    new "他回到电脑前，重新开机。电脑启动时，他盯着屏幕，按下了提示中的某个键。紧接着，画面变了。"

    # game/script.rpy:33271
    old "I just accessed the BIOS. If I knew more about computers, I might be able to pinpoint the issue, but look here."
    new "「我刚进了 BIOS。要是再懂点电脑，也许能查出问题所在，不过你看这里。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33276
    old "In the top right corner, \"{time=13:16}\" was displayed in black digits."
    new "右上角用黑色数字显示着「{time=13:16}」。"

    # game/script.rpy:33279
    old "Oh, {time=13} already. I guess I did sleep for over two hours."
    new "「哦，都 {time=13} 了啊。看来我真的睡了两个多小时。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33280
    old "Ye—"
    new "「对——」"

    # game/script.rpy:33285
    old "...Did you hear that?"
    new "「……你听见了吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:33290
    old "He warily walked to the hallway A door and looked through it."
    new "他戒备地走到通往 A走廊的门前，向外张望。"

    # game/script.rpy:33303
    old "I think I heard something in the lobby."
    new "「我好像听见大厅那边有动静。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33307
    old "Seeing how cautious he was, I approached it myself."
    new "见他如此谨慎，我自己也走上前查看。"

    # game/script.rpy:33316
    old "Nobody was there."
    new "那里没有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:33317
    old "Still fazed by the imposing shutter, Atsuki walked forward a little."
    new "Atsuki 仍对那扇压迫感十足的卷帘门有些发怵，又往前走了几步。"

    # game/script.rpy:33322
    old "Did I imagine it...?"
    new "「是我听错了吗……？」"

    # game/script.rpy:33326
    old "Both other doors were shut. Atsuki circled the room at a slow pace and stopped to smell the air. Then, he continued his circle with a frown."
    new "另外两扇门都关着。Atsuki 缓步绕着房间走了一圈，停下来闻了闻空气，然后皱着眉继续绕。"

    # game/script.rpy:33327
    old "There's this open drawer. It wasn't like this before, was it?"
    new "「这个抽屉开着。之前不是这样的吧？」"

    # game/script.rpy:33332
    old "I moved over to him. Behind the reception desk, one of the drawers wasn't fully closed."
    new "我走到他身边。接待台后，有一个抽屉没有完全合上。"

    # game/script.rpy:33333
    old "Oh, no, I don't think so."
    new "「哦，不，我想之前并不是这样。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33334
    old "We looked inside and confirmed that there was nothing in it. Then, Atsuki proceeded to open all the other drawers."
    new "我们朝里看了看，确认里面空无一物。接着，Atsuki 把其余抽屉一一拉开。"

    # game/script.rpy:33339
    old "There's only papers in a few of them."
    new "「只有几个抽屉里放着文件。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33340
    old "That's strange. I honestly can't be sure it wasn't open before."
    new "「真奇怪。老实说，我也不确定它之前是不是关着的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33345
    old "Something else we'll have to ask."
    new "「又多了一件要问的事。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33350
    old "While walking toward hallway B, Atsuki noticed I still hadn't moved."
    new "Atsuki 往 B 走廊走的时候，注意到我还站在原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:33354
    old "Come back. You hear this faint buzz, right?"
    new "「回来。你听见这阵微弱的嗡嗡声了吧？」"

    # game/script.rpy:33364
    old "Yes. It's coming from below, right?"
    new "「嗯。是从下面传来的吧？」"

    # game/script.rpy:33365
    old "It's the boiler. I was thinking that it must be really annoying to work at this chair with this constant noise."
    new "「是锅炉。我在想，一直坐在这把椅子上工作，还得听着这没完没了的噪音，一定很烦人。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33366
    old "But then I thought that it might not have been as noticeable before. You didn't go to the mechanical room, but the rest of us did. I'm not sure it was audible from up here."
    new "「不过我又想，之前可能没这么明显。你没去机械室，但我们其他人都去了。我不确定在这上面能不能听见。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33372
    old "He looked at the door he'd not yet gone through."
    new "他看向那扇还没进去的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:33373
    old "Actually, I remember beginning to hear the sound as we were going down the stairs."
    new "「其实我记得，我们下楼梯的时候，我就开始听见那声音了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33380
    old "As soon as he opened it, the intensity of the sound strengthened. There was no light on the stairs, and they immediately made a sharp turn."
    new "他一开门，声音一下大了很多。楼梯上没有灯，往下没几步就急转了个弯。"

    # game/script.rpy:33381
    old "You think the boiler got louder, then?"
    new "「所以你觉得锅炉声变大了？」"

    # game/script.rpy:33382
    old "Oh, that's not what I meant."
    new "「哦，我不是这个意思。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33387
    old "After a few steps forward, I confirmed my assumption: the short door leading to the mechanical room was partially open."
    new "往前走了几步后，我确认了自己的猜测：通往机械室的那扇矮门半开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:33388
    old "It's this door. It was shut when we came, so the sound didn't reach us. I don't remember if we closed it when we left."
    new "「是这扇门。我们来的时候它关着，所以声音传不到我们那里。我不记得走的时候有没有把它关上。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33389
    old "Ah, I see. So at most, it means that someone went down here, but I'm sure they searched for us and Naomi. It's fine."
    new "「啊，原来如此。那顶多只能说明有人下去过，不过他们肯定是在找我们和 Naomi。没什么好担心的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:33390
    old "He began descending the stairs. If he'd really heard a sound coming from the lobby, it was possible someone was under us."
    new "他开始下楼。如果他真的听见大厅传来声响，那下面说不定真有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:33396
    old "After widening the gap of the door, he stepped into the basement room, which was constantly beset by the buzzing noise. I stopped behind him, waiting for my eyes to adjust to the illumination the faint light bulb offered."
    new "他把门缝推得更大，走进了那间始终被嗡嗡声笼罩的地下室。我在他身后停下，等着眼睛适应那盏昏暗灯泡的光。"

    # game/script.rpy:33397
    old "But even when that happened, the darkness still reigned. Atsuki started to walk slowly in order to comprehend where he was."
    new "可即便如此，黑暗依旧笼罩四周。Atsuki 缓缓迈开步子，想弄清自己身在何处。"

    # game/script.rpy:33405
    old "I-I don't think there's anyone here."
    new "这、这里好像没有别人。"

    # game/script.rpy:33406
    old "I could discern a few pieces of furniture that Atsuki had moved aside and the walls closest to me. Strangely, I felt relieved to hear there was nobody with us, even though we wanted to find the others."
    new "我能勉强辨认出 Atsuki 挪到一旁的几件家具，以及离我最近的墙壁。奇怪的是，听到这里没有别人，我竟松了口气——明明我们正是为了找其他人才来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:33411
    old "Wait, no."
    new "等等，不对。"

    # game/script.rpy:33417
    old "I thought we were about to leave, but that wasn't the case. I approached the dark blob Atsuki was next to until it was revealed to be a pile of chairs. Behind it, on the floor, was an abnormal, weak glow."
    new "我以为我们就要走了，事实却并非如此。我走近 Atsuki 身旁那团黑影，才看清那是一摞椅子。椅子后方的地板上，泛着一层异样的微光。"

    # game/script.rpy:33419
    old "The Sekimeiya. The gemstone we'd come to see and which possessed a mysterious power. Immobile on the floor, it resembled the ceiling light."
    new "是 Sekimeiya。我们专程来看的宝石，据说拥有神秘力量。它一动不动地躺在地板上，像天花板上那盏灯。"

    # game/script.rpy:33424
    old "Sai was right. Katei had the key, and he used it while we were in the attic."
    new "Sai 说得没错。钥匙在 Katei 手上，我们待在阁楼的时候，他用了那把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:33430
    old "I'm not sure why he'd hide the Sekimeiya, though."
    new "不过我不明白他为什么要藏起 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:33431
    old "I don't think it makes any sense. He would've had better places to hide it, like his locker."
    new "我也觉得说不通。他要藏，明明有更合适的地方，比如他自己的储物柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:33436
    old "You think so? We could force him to open it at any time, and it would be easily found after the exit opens."
    new "你这么想？我们随时都能逼他打开储物柜，而出口一开，那地方很容易就会被搜到。"

    # game/script.rpy:33439
    old "Atsuki crouched next to the Sekimeiya and stared at it."
    new "Atsuki 蹲在 Sekimeiya 旁，凝视着它。"

    # game/script.rpy:33441
    old "...Are you gonna use it?"
    new "……你打算用它？"

    # game/script.rpy:33451
    old "We don't know how long it's been here for, so it might not be a good idea."
    new "我们不知道它在这里放了多久，所以最好还是别轻举妄动。"

    # game/script.rpy:33457
    old "Well, if the time you travel depends on how long it spends out of the cabinet, you could go really far back."
    new "你想，如果穿越的时间长短取决于它离开展示柜多久，那你有可能一下子回到很久以前。"

    # game/script.rpy:33462
    old "Oh... Hm, I see."
    new "哦……嗯，原来如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:33465
    old "Once again, he went quiet. I had no idea what he was thinking, but I knew I didn't like it."
    new "他又一次沉默下来。我猜不透他在想什么，但我知道我不喜欢这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:33466
    old "Sai had warned me not to let Atsuki get his hands on the Sekimeiya, and I had no idea why. All I knew was that he was keeping some of his thoughts to himself, and I suspected he'd lied to me."
    new "Sai 曾警告我，别让 Atsuki 拿到 Sekimeiya，我不明白为什么。我只知道他有些想法藏在心里，而且我怀疑他对我撒了谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:33467
    old "He was concocting something—that I was sure of. Not only because I knew him, he'd outright admitted it to me."
    new "他在盘算着什么——这一点我确信不疑。不只是因为我了解他，他自己就直截了当地对我承认过。"

    # game/script.rpy:33473
    old "For once, the silence wasn't entirely pure. The mechanical room's noise was pervasive. Minutes after staring at the gemstone, Atsuki's hand hovered over it."
    new "难得这一次，沉默并不纯粹。机械室的声响无处不在。盯着那颗宝石看了几分钟后，Atsuki 把手悬在了它的上方。"

    # game/script.rpy:33479
    old "It's hot, the air around it."
    new "它周围的空气是热的。"

    # game/script.rpy:33480
    old "Oh, that's weird."
    new "哦，那可真是奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:33485
    old "When I touched it earlier, I felt a zap for an instant before I teleported. I have no idea how, but it heated up really fast. When I was holding the cushion from below, it went from cold to hot in a minute."
    new "我之前碰它的时候，传送前的一瞬间有种被电到的感觉。我不知道是怎么回事，但它升温非常快。我从下面托着坐垫的时候，它一分钟内就从冰凉变得烫手。"

    # game/script.rpy:33486
    old "I didn't know how to answer, but the bizarre situation sunk in even further. What the hell was the Sekimeiya, and what was it doing with us?"
    new "我不知道该怎么回答，只觉得这怪异的局面愈发压在心头。Sekimeiya 究竟是什么东西，它又想对我们做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:33487
    old "Are you going to use it to change the past?"
    new "你打算用它改变过去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33497
    old "That answer reinforced everything I'd been feeling. He couldn't not know. He knew exactly what his goal was, and I did too. So why was he acting so reserved?"
    new "这个回答印证了我一直以来的感觉。他不可能不知道。他清楚自己的目标是什么，我也清楚。那他为什么还要这样讳莫如深？"

    # game/script.rpy:33498
    old "But he didn't flesh out his answer, opting to resume his silence. Even though I couldn't see his face, his slow breathing told me all I needed to know."
    new "但他没有多说，只是重新陷入沉默。虽然看不见他的脸，他那缓慢的呼吸已经说明了一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:33499
    old "I might've pushed the issue further if something hadn't hit me."
    new "若不是忽然想到了什么，我或许会继续追问下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:33500
    old "When he teleported..."
    new "他传送的时候……"

    # game/script.rpy:33501
    old "After mentioning the time he'd touched the Sekimeiya, a glaring contradiction that I'd previously ignored reared its head."
    new "他提到碰过 Sekimeiya 之后，一个我先前视而不见的明显矛盾浮出了水面。"

    # game/script.rpy:33502
    old "You traveled to the attic, right?"
    new "你穿越回了阁楼，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:33511
    old "He's lying."
    new "他在撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:33512
    old "There's no way he traveled to the attic. Did he not realize that it doesn't make sense?"
    new "他绝不可能穿越回阁楼。他没意识到这根本说不通吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33513
    old "He said he traveled twenty minutes to the past. At that point, all of us were in the attic as well."
    new "他说自己回到了二十分钟前。那个时候，我们所有人也都在阁楼里。"

    # game/script.rpy:33514
    old "That's fine depending on where he appeared. It's not like he erased his past self, right? So if he appeared in one of the rooms after they'd been investigated, we wouldn't have seen him."
    new "这倒要看他在哪里现身。他并没有抹消过去的自己，对吧？所以，如果他出现在某个已经搜查完的房间，我们就不会看见他。"

    # game/script.rpy:33515
    old "But there's a big problem."
    new "但这里有个大问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:33518
    old "Where in the attic did you appear?"
    new "你出现在阁楼的哪个位置？"

    # game/script.rpy:33523
    old "Hm? In the kitchen, and I'm pretty sure that's because I went there before we left. It's something I was trying to figure out earlier."
    new "嗯？厨房。我想大概是因为在我们离开前，我去过那里。这一点我之前也一直在琢磨。"

    # game/script.rpy:33524
    old "Ah..."
    new "啊……"

    # game/script.rpy:33525
    old "No, he's lying."
    new "不，他在说谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:33526
    old "The only part of the attic where he could've appeared is the staircase at the entrance."
    new "阁楼里他可能出现的地方，只有入口处的楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:33527
    old "Every other place doesn't make sense. When we searched the whole floor, we made sure nobody could sneak past us. Katei waited in the corner of the hallway and Akaro in the living room."
    new "其他任何地方都说不通。我们搜查整层楼时，已经确保没人能从我们眼皮底下溜过去。Katei 守在走廊角落，Akaro 则在客厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:33528
    old "As Erina said, twenty minutes before the time he traveled, all of us were still in the attic and were about to leave. Atsuki, who had traveled, didn't deny that."
    new "正如 Erina 所说，在他穿越回过去之前二十分钟，我们都还在阁楼里，正准备离开。Atsuki 并没有否认这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:33531
    old "According to him, he appeared in the kitchen and then we left. That's not right."
    new "按他的说法，他出现在厨房，随后我们就离开了。这不对。"

    # game/script.rpy:33532
    old "For some reason, the elevator started functioning again, and Sai called it. Then he, Akaro, Erina, and Isla went to the crystal floor with it. However, Katei, Atsuki, and I left through the main door and locked it."
    new "不知为何，电梯又恢复了运行，Sai 把它叫了过来。随后他、Akaro、Erina 和 Isla 乘电梯去了水晶层。而 Katei、Atsuki 和我则从大门离开，并锁上了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:33533
    old "Atsuki, after appearing in the kitchen, would not have been able to leave the attic.{w} He couldn't have left through the staircase before us, because there were no footprints that started from the kitchen."
    new "Atsuki 出现在厨房之后，不可能离开阁楼。{w}他也无法赶在我们之前从楼梯离开，因为没有任何一串脚印是从厨房开始的。"

    # game/script.rpy:33534
    old "When we left, we locked the main door, but most importantly, we learned that when the three of us arrived at the crystal floor, Katei saw the door of the elevator slightly open."
    new "我们离开时锁上了大门，但最关键的是，我们得知：我们三人到达水晶层时，Katei 看见电梯门微微敞开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:33535
    old "How does he not understand that what he's saying is impossible? The elevator remained open on the crystal floor until a time after he'd already reunited with us. If he was in the attic, he couldn't have called it."
    new "他难道不明白自己说的根本不可能吗？电梯一直停在水晶层敞着门，直到他与我们会合之后才被关上。若他当时在阁楼里，就不可能把电梯叫过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:33539
    old "It just doesn't work. When we were in the security room, the elevator was still open, and it had to be either Sai or Naomi who finally closed it."
    new "这说不通。我们在监控室时，电梯还开着；最后把电梯关上的人，只可能是 Sai 或 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:33540
    old "Could it be that it wasn't the group of four who left the door open? ...Is it possible Atsuki used the elevator immediately after them, and it was actually him who didn't close it properly?"
    new "难道没关电梯门的不是那四个人？……有没有可能，Atsuki 紧跟着他们用了电梯，而真正没把门关好的人其实是他？"

    # game/script.rpy:33541
    old "I don't think he would've had enough time to call it back and go all the way down. ...And it's very unlikely the others wouldn't have seen him. It's even possible we would've heard the elevator going up and down from the offices."
    new "我认为他根本没时间把电梯叫回来，再一路下去。……况且其他人也不太可能没看见他。甚至我们在办公室时，都可能听见电梯上下的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:33544
    old "So, how did he leave the attic?"
    new "那么，他究竟是怎么离开阁楼的？"

    # game/script.rpy:33545
    old "It's not possible. He couldn't have. Both methods were unavailable."
    new "不可能。他做不到。两种方法都行不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:33546
    old "The only way would've been with the key that I have. Even if he somehow got out, maybe by Naomi unlocking the door, he should've mentioned that it was unlocked when it wasn't supposed to be. He's definitely lying."
    new "唯一的办法，就是用我手上的钥匙。就算他真的设法出去了——比如是 Naomi 把门打开了——他也该提到门当时没锁，而它本不该没锁。他肯定在撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:33548
    old "I became aware of the smell surrounding me, the one which almost seamlessly blended in. Its cold sensation had persisted in my nostrils since the first time we'd encountered it, so it hadn't immediately evident that it had strengthened again."
    new "我察觉到了弥漫在四周的气味，那股气味几乎与周围融为一体。自第一次遇到它起，那股冰凉感就一直留在我鼻子里，所以它再次变浓时，我没有马上意识到。"

    # game/script.rpy:33555
    old "...All right, I'll touch it. There's one thing I absolutely have to confirm."
    new "……好，我碰。有一件事我无论如何都要确认。"

    # game/script.rpy:33556
    old "And what is that?"
    new "是什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:33561
    old "Whether or not the past can be changed."
    new "过去究竟能不能被改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:33562
    old "...You think it can't?"
    new "……你觉得不能？"

    # game/script.rpy:33563
    old "I don't know; I wasn't able to change anything the last time. I have no idea how this will work.{w} I'll disappear from this room and appear somewhere else. If I try to change what I experienced, I don't know how the universe will react. Perhaps you won't notice any difference and I'll branch the world. Maybe this reality will instantly morph into the one I'm making."
    new "我不知道；上一次我什么也没能改变。这次会怎样，我完全没把握。{w}我会从这个房间消失，出现在别处。如果我试图改变自己经历过的事，我不知道宇宙会如何反应。也许你察觉不到任何异样，而我会让世界分岔；也许这个现实会瞬间变成我正在塑造的那一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:33567
    old "Despite how ridiculous he sounded, all he was really saying was that he was about to leave me there. That maybe I'd stay in the world he'd disappeared from while he went on to find his better reality."
    new "不管他说得多么荒唐，他真正想表达的，不过是他准备把我丢在这里。也许我会留在他消失的那个世界，而他则继续去寻找他那个更好的现实。"

    # game/script.rpy:33568
    old "It was annoying, and given everything else going on in my head, I simply shrugged. He would leave me behind with the Sekimeiya, which would be a great chance to fulfill Sai's request."
    new "这让人心烦，可脑子里还装着别的一堆事，我也只是耸了耸肩。他会把我留在 Sekimeiya 旁边，而这正是完成 Sai 所托的绝佳机会。"

    # game/script.rpy:33573
    old "...I was going to say that if the past can't be changed, I'll be above the stairs after I disappear, but there's no way that'll be the case. If I was there right now, I'd try to make a loud noise to change the past, so I have no clue what's about to happen."
    new "……我本来想说，如果过去无法改变，我消失后会出现在楼梯上方，但绝不可能如此。要是我现在就在那里，我会故意弄出很大的动静，试着改变过去；所以我完全猜不到接下来会发生什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:33575
    old "He didn't talk about it further. Finally, the hand that'd been teasing contact for so long dropped to touch the shining gem. Instantly, Atsuki's outline disappeared."
    new "他没有再多说。终于，那只悬了许久、始终若即若离的手落了下去，触上发光的宝石。刹那间，Atsuki 的轮廓消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:33580
    old "Ten Interloping Eyes"
    new "十双窥伺之眼"

    # game/script.rpy:33588
    old "Wh—!"
    new "什——！"

    # game/script.rpy:33589
    old "And with it, the darkness disappeared as well."
    new "黑暗也随之消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:33591
    old "I almost fell in place. Before I could crouch to grab the Sekimeiya, the door to the lobby was in front of me."
    new "我差点当场摔倒。还没等我蹲下去抓 Sekimeiya，通往大厅的门已经出现在我面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:33593
    old "I was in hallway A. While the illumination was poor, it wasn't comparable to the mechanical room, mostly thanks to the light coming from the event room."
    new "我在 A 走廊。这里光线昏暗，但还不像机械室那么暗，多半是靠活动室透出来的光。"

    # game/script.rpy:33597
    old "I had teleported; nothing else could've happened. I took one step forward and confirmed that my legs still worked."
    new "我只能是被传送了，不可能是别的情况。我向前迈出一步，确认双腿还能活动。"

    # game/script.rpy:33603
    old "A voice came from over my shoulders. I turned around and saw Atsuki, who'd stiffened."
    new "身后传来一个声音。我转过身，看见 Atsuki 僵立在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:33604
    old "D-Did I just appear out of nowhere?"
    new "我、我是刚刚凭空出现的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33605
    old "What...? No, that's what happened to me."
    new "什么……？不，突然出现的人是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:33606
    old "...Wait."
    new "……等等。"

    # game/script.rpy:33607
    old "Were you just in the mechanical room?"
    new "你刚才在机械室？"

    # game/script.rpy:33612
    old "Yes... I touched the Sekimeiya a second ago."
    new "是……我刚刚碰了 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:33613
    old "I showed up here as soon as you did that. Are we in the past...?"
    new "你刚碰完，我就出现在这里了。我们是在过去吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:33618
    old "...{w}It teleported you as well? How come that didn't happen the other times?{w} And both of us appeared here..."
    new "……{w}它把你也传送了？为什么之前几次没发生这种事？{w}而且我们两个都出现在这里……"

    # game/script.rpy:33620
    old "Hey! What the fuck...!? Where have you two been!?"
    new "喂！这他妈怎么回事……！？你们俩到底去哪儿了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:33624
    old "Sai emerged from the event room. Behind him was Erina, who looked surprised to see us."
    new "Sai 从活动室里出来。跟在他身后的是 Erina，她看到我们时露出惊讶的神色。"

    # game/script.rpy:33629
    old "...Has anything happened?"
    new "……发生什么事了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33630
    old "What...!? You've been gone for over two hours! Answer the question!"
    new "什么……！？你们已经消失两个多小时了！回答我的问题！"

    # game/script.rpy:33631
    old "Atsuki appeared wary, perhaps because Sai might have overheard what we'd been talking about."
    new "Atsuki 显得警惕起来，也许是因为 Sai 听到了我们刚才的谈话。"

    # game/script.rpy:33640
    old "We entered the event room. Isla was with them, and she looked a little sad, standing next to the cabinet with its empty interior exposed. The Sekimeiya was probably still in the mechanical room at that moment."
    new "我们走进活动室。Isla 也在他们当中，神情有些黯然，站在敞开的展示柜旁，柜内空空如也。那个时候，Sekimeiya 大概还在机械室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:33647
    old "We didn't get any sleep last night, so we were really tired and went to the attic. We woke up a few minutes ago."
    new "我们昨晚整夜没睡，实在撑不住，就去了阁楼。几分钟前才醒过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:33653
    old "What the fuck? You were sleeping? Why didn't you say anything!?"
    new "搞什么鬼？你们刚才在睡觉？怎么都不吭一声！？"

    # game/script.rpy:33658
    old "Because Katei wouldn't have let us."
    new "因为 Katei 不会同意的。"

    # game/script.rpy:33663
    old "...Excuse me?{w} Was Katei not with you?"
    new "……等等？{w}Katei 没和你们在一起吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33668
    old "What? No, he wasn't. We went alone."
    new "什么？没有。就我们俩去的。"

    # game/script.rpy:33674
    old "Where is he, then? We haven't seen him either, not for a long time."
    new "那他去哪儿了？我们也很久没见过他了。"

    # game/script.rpy:33675
    old "He wasn't with us."
    new "他没和我们在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:33680
    old "We thought the three of you were in the attic, which we couldn't enter."
    new "我们还以为你们三个在阁楼里，可我们进不去。"

    # game/script.rpy:33685
    old "It was just the two of us."
    new "只有我们两个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:33690
    old "...{w}What the fuck, then!?"
    new "……{w}那他妈的到底是怎么回事！？"

    # game/script.rpy:33695
    old "You don't have any idea where he went?"
    new "你们也不知道他去哪儿了？"

    # game/script.rpy:33700
    old "Well, we thought you three were locked up there, so we didn't search everywhere. We even thought Naomi could have been with you since she's still missing."
    new "我们以为你们三个被关在里面，就没到处搜。Naomi 到现在还下落不明，我们还以为她可能和你们在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:33704
    old "What about Akaro? Where is he?"
    new "Akaro 呢？他在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:33705
    old "No idea, but I saw him not too long ago. He's been here the whole time.{w} Do you still have the key to the attic?"
    new "不知道，不过刚才我还见过他。他一直都在这儿。{w}阁楼的钥匙还在你们手上吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33711
    old "...I see. That's good."
    new "……这样啊。那就好。"

    # game/script.rpy:33720
    old "Hold on. What happened to the Sekimeiya? Why is it not here?"
    new "等一下。Sekimeiya 怎么了？怎么不在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:33725
    old "We have no idea. We thought one of you came down to pick it up and brought it to the attic. The cabinet was locked, and none of us had the key to unlock it. If you two didn't take it out, Katei or Naomi must have another key."
    new "我们也不清楚。我们还以为是你们当中有谁下来把它取走，带去了阁楼。展示柜是锁着的，我们谁都没有钥匙。既然不是你们俩拿的，那肯定是 Katei 或 Naomi 另有一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:33730
    old "It's been gone from the cabinet for a while, but Akaro and I searched this floor and found it in a drawer in the lobby."
    new "它从展示柜里消失过一阵子。我和 Akaro 在这一层找过，最后在大厅的抽屉里找到了它。"

    # game/script.rpy:33731
    old "We put it back in here, and about twenty minutes ago, we realized it had been taken out again. Again, Katei or Naomi did that if it wasn't one of you."
    new "我们把它放回了这里，结果大约二十分钟前，我们发现它又被人拿走了。同样，如果不是你们俩，那就是 Katei 或 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:33736
    old "...{w}Oh, right, what time is it?"
    new "……{w}对了，现在几点了？"

    # game/script.rpy:33742
    old "...Hm,{w} it's {time=13:19.}"
    new "……嗯，{w}现在是 {time=13:19.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:33747
    old "He showed us his wristwatch. Immediately, Atsuki turned to face me."
    new "他把手表给我们看。Atsuki 立刻转向我。"

    # game/script.rpy:33750
    old "I knew why. At that moment, we had just walked down the stairs to the mechanical room. We'd been down there for a while, and then we had appeared in hallway A during the time we'd been in the security room."
    new "我知道他在想什么。就在那一刻，我们刚走下楼梯，进了机械室。我们在下面待了一阵子，之后却出现在了 A走廊，而那正是我们待在监控室的时段。"

    # game/script.rpy:33751
    old "Atsuki wanted to change the past, and he had the chance to do so. I doubted that he wanted to be seen by his past self, but making a loud noise would serve as a confirmation that the possibility existed. If nothing else, I'd be able to witness it too thanks to traveling with him."
    new "Atsuki 想改变过去，而眼下他正好有这个机会。我想他并不愿意被过去的自己看见，不过只要弄出足够大的声响，就足以确认这种可能确实存在。反正我是和他一起穿越的，至少也能亲眼见证。"

    # game/script.rpy:33752
    old "However, it was at that moment that a sound reached our ears."
    new "可就在那个时候，我们听见了动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:33760
    old "As we glanced at the hallway A door, the sound got louder. It didn't take much time for the door to open, revealing Akaro on the other side."
    new "我们朝 A走廊的门望去，声音越来越响。没过多久，门就开了，Akaro 出现在门后。"

    # game/script.rpy:33765
    old "Everyone present was surprised at the same time.{w} While Akaro hadn't expected to see me and Atsuki, we hadn't expected to see who he was with either."
    new "在场的人同时愣住了。{w}Akaro 没想到会见到我和 Atsuki，而我们也同样没想到他身边站着的是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:33770
    old "At his side was Katei, who had supposedly been missing for quite some time. He stared at us hesitantly, evidently anticipating our reaction."
    new "他身旁是 Katei，据说已经失踪好一阵子了。他迟疑地望着我们，显然在等着我们的反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:33776
    old "...H-Hey! What the fuck have you been doing!?"
    new "……喂、喂！你他妈到底在干什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:33779
    old "Remaining silent, Katei turned to the cabinet."
    new "Katei 一言不发，转头看向展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:33784
    old "You found them too...?"
    new "你们也找到了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:33791
    old "They said they were sleeping alone in the attic. ...Katei, what are you waiting for? Where the fuck have you been?"
    new "他们说他们俩是单独睡在阁楼里的。……Katei，你还愣着干什么？你他妈到底去哪儿了？"

    # game/script.rpy:33796
    old "...I've been here.{w} *sigh*"
    new "……我一直在这儿。{w}（叹气）"

    # game/script.rpy:33808
    old "I've been here this whole time. I didn't go anywhere."
    new "我一直都在这儿，哪儿也没去。"

    # game/script.rpy:33809
    old "Wh-What? Do you know how long it's been since we saw you?"
    new "什、什么？你知道我们有多久没见到你了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33816
    old "I'm being serious. Do you have any idea how long we've been looking around for you?"
    new "我是认真的。你知道我们找了你多久吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33822
    old "It's been almost {tip=hours}three hours{/tip}, I know. I couldn't have gone anywhere. I just came across Akaro ten minutes ago."
    new "已经快{tip=hours}三个小时{/tip}了，我知道。我根本不可能离开过这儿。我十分钟前才碰上 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:33829
    old "I saw him in hallway C and asked him the same thing. He said he'd been here looking for us. We went to the sixth floor to find you since I'd seen you there earlier and I didn't know where Erina and Isla were."
    new "我在 C走廊看见他，也问了同样的话。他说他一直在这儿找我们。我之前在六楼见过你们，又不知道 Erina 和 Isla 在哪儿，就和他上六楼找你们去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:33838
    old "I looked at Atsuki, who'd been quiet for a while. He was thinking about something, but was it along the lines of everyone showing up meaning that the past couldn't change? It still should've been as simple as going to the lobby."
    new "我看向已经沉默了好一会儿的 Atsuki。他在思索着什么——是在想，所有人都聚到这里，是不是就意味着过去无法改变？可这本来应该只是去一趟大厅那么简单。"

    # game/script.rpy:33843
    old "Where is the Sekimeiya? And did I hear that you two were sleeping in the attic...? Did I not tell you—"
    new "Sekimeiya 呢？还有，我刚才是不是听你们说，你们俩睡在阁楼里……？我不是跟你们说过——"

    # game/script.rpy:33844
    old "Shut up. What the fuck did that even mean?"
    new "住口。你那话到底是什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:33846
    old "You said that it's almost been three hours since we saw you. How the fuck do you even know that?"
    new "你说从我们见到你到现在已经快三个小时了。你他妈怎么会知道？"

    # game/script.rpy:33847
    old "What? I answered your question."
    new "什么？我不过是在回答你的问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:33852
    old "\"Almost three hours\" is awfully precise, and it's correct. If you truly were here, and for some reason didn't see anyone for three hours, would your sense of time be good enough to know that?"
    new "「快三个小时」——这个说法未免太精确，而且确实没错。就算你真的一直在这儿，又因为什么缘故三个小时没见到任何人，你的时间感能准到这个地步吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33857
    old "Are you doing this again...? Trying to blame me for anything you can?"
    new "你又来这一套……？只要能抓到点什么，就要往我头上推？"

    # game/script.rpy:33862
    old "You're a fucking liar! You haven't been here for hours! Where the fuck were you, and why are you back? The computer doesn't work, and I'm the only one with a watch. How did you accurately say that you've been gone for three hours!?{w} Hey, did Naomi have a watch? Does anyone remember?"
    new "你他妈在撒谎！你根本好几个小时都不在这儿！你到底去了哪儿，又为什么回来？电脑用不了，有手表的只有我一个。你怎么可能准确说出你已经离开了三个小时！？{w}喂，Naomi 有手表吗？有人记得吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33864
    old "The three members of the first group shrugged. Atsuki and I knew there was still a way to use the computer to know the time, but I didn't even get the chance to consider if we should mention it."
    new "第一组的三个人耸了耸肩。我和 Atsuki 都知道，还有办法用电脑查到时间，可我连考虑要不要提一句的机会都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:33869
    old "Wh...! Did you hear that!?"
    new "什……！你们听见了吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:33875
    old "Hear what?"
    new "听见什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:33876
    old "Didn't a sound come from the lobby?"
    new "大厅那边是不是有声音？"

    # game/script.rpy:33882
    old "...I didn't hear anything."
    new "……我什么都没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:33883
    old "Nobody had. Probably not even Atsuki, who took no time to exit the room."
    new "谁也没有听见。恐怕连 Atsuki 也没有——他几乎没在房里停留，转身就出了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:33893
    old "Our past selves still had to be in the mechanical room. If the past couldn't be changed, it meant that something would always prevent him from proceeding, but the arrival of Katei and Akaro hadn't conclusively proven it. Confused, the rest of us followed behind him and saw him opening the door to the lobby."
    new "过去的我们此时理应仍在机械室里。若过去无法改变，那就意味着总会有某种东西拦在他前面——可 Katei 和 Akaro 的出现，还不足以证明这一点。我们满心困惑地跟在他身后，看他推开了通往大厅的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:33894
    old "Once he opened that door, he didn't take even a step forward."
    new "门开了，他却一步也没有迈出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:33897
    old "Instead, he froze in place, and as he stopped gripping the knob, he turned his head back to us."
    new "他僵在原地，握着门把的手松了下来，回头看向我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:33898
    old "Who...{w} is this?"
    new "这……{w}这是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:33903
    old "We dashed to the door.{w} ...When we looked through it, we immediately realized that wasn't the only question to ask."
    new "我们冲到门口。{w}……往门里一看，便立刻明白，该问的远不止这一句。"

    # game/script.rpy:33904
    old "Ah! Isla, stay over there!"
    new "啊！Isla，你待在那边别动！"

    # game/script.rpy:33913
    old "A single body lay down on the floor over a vast pool of blood."
    new "一具尸体倒在地上，身下是一大片血泊。"

    # game/script.rpy:33915
    old "There was no meaning to be found. No smell of blood, no identity of the corpse, but a death that defied reason. Furthermore, the past had changed. Not because of the appearance of a body, but because of Erina's yell, which had spread throughout the crystal floor—a yell we hadn't heard while we'd been downstairs.{w} I immediately understood that someone had been killed. I'd gone over the concept of death many times in my mind, so I simply stared at that dreamlike scene before I was pushed aside."
    new "这一切毫无道理可言。没有血腥味，也辨不清死者的身份，只有一桩违背常理的死亡。而且，过去已经变了。改变的原因不是这具尸体的出现，而是 Erina 的那声喊叫——它传遍了水晶层，而我们在楼下时，谁也没有听见。{w}我立刻明白，有人被杀了。死亡这件事，我早就在心里翻来覆去想过很多次，所以只是怔怔地望着那如梦似幻的一幕，直到被人推开。"

    # game/script.rpy:33920
    old "Isn't he...!?"
    new "他不是……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:33921
    old "The shock had paralyzed everyone, and Katei was the first to snap out of it. He ran toward the body and turned it around, trying not to step on all the blood around it."
    new "所有人都惊得动弹不得，Katei 最先回过神来。他朝尸体跑去，把尸体翻过来，尽量不踩到四处的血迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:33926
    old "Wait, I recognize him too. Wasn't he there?"
    new "等等，我也认得他。他之前不就在那边吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:33927
    old "Sai pointed at the shutter, prompting me to remember that I also knew the man, who was dressed in a police uniform."
    new "Sai 指了指卷帘门，我这才想起自己也见过这个人——他穿着警察制服。"

    # game/script.rpy:33933
    old "Y-Yes... That's where I s-saw him, while we were waiting. Fuck."
    new "对、对……我们等着的时候，我就是在那里看、看见他的。妈的。"

    # game/script.rpy:33934
    old "Atsuki's voice cracked. He wouldn't take his eyes off the body."
    new "Atsuki 的声音都变了调，目光死死钉在那具尸体上。"

    # game/script.rpy:33941
    old "He's been here at the tower recently. I don't know his name, but he was investigating a possible terrorist attack."
    new "他最近常来塔里。名字我不知道，不过他一直在调查一起可能的恐怖袭击。"

    # game/script.rpy:33944
    old "Katei crouched and used two fingers to verify that there was no pulse."
    new "Katei 蹲下身，用两根手指探了探，确认已经没有脉搏。"

    # game/script.rpy:33950
    old "He didn't say it out loud."
    new "他没有说出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:33951
    old "This is a knife wound."
    new "是刀伤。"

    # game/script.rpy:33952
    old "The uniform on his chest had been pierced a single time, but the knife in question wasn't there."
    new "他胸前的制服只被刺穿了一处，可那把刀并不在现场。"

    # game/script.rpy:33958
    old "A knife...? How did this person get in? Look at the blood. ...This happened minutes ago."
    new "刀……？这人是怎么进来的？你看这血……才不过几分钟的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:33963
    old "He entered the same way Katei left."
    new "他是沿着 Katei 离开的那条路进来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:33965
    old "You've been missing for the last three hours. Just as you reappear, this person shows up dead. This is no coincidence."
    new "你失踪了整整三个小时。你刚一回来，这个人就出现在这里，已经死了。这绝不是巧合。"

    # game/script.rpy:33970
    old "What the hell are you talking about? How would I have left!?"
    new "你在胡说些什么？我怎么可能出得去！？"

    # game/script.rpy:33975
    old "I don't know. You remember the Sekimeiya, right? As you said, it's not in the cabinet right now, and you're an excellent candidate to have taken it out.{w} It's possible this man entered the tower after it was locked down, and if you did so too, your disappearance, your knowledge of the time, and this knife you're talking about... would all make sense."
    new "我不知道。你记得 Sekimeiya 吧？就像你说的，它现在不在展示柜里，最可能把它拿走的人就是你。{w}这个人有可能是在封锁之后才进塔的；如果你也是这样，那你失踪的那段时间、你对时间的了解，还有你口中的那把刀……就全都说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:33976
    old "I cannot believe what I'm hearing! I've been here the entire time! And I couldn't have unlocked the cabinet!"
    new "我真不敢相信自己的耳朵！我一直都在这儿！而且那个展示柜不可能是我打开的！"

    # game/script.rpy:33979
    old "Enraged, Katei pulled up the man's shirt and uncovered his waist."
    new "Katei 怒气冲冲地掀起那人的衬衫，露出他的腰部。"

    # game/script.rpy:33984
    old "Yes, look at this! This is why I thought it must've been a knife. It was his own!{w} He still has his baton, but his knife is gone. I personally saw that he had a knife right here a few days ago."
    new "对，你们看这里！我就是因为这个才认定凶器是刀。那是他自己的刀！{w}警棍还在，刀却不见了。几天前我亲眼看见，他的刀就挂在这个位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:33987
    old "He continued examining his clothes and pockets."
    new "他继续翻查那人的衣服和口袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:33992
    old "...Oh! He has a walkie-talkie!"
    new "……哦！他带着对讲机！"

    # game/script.rpy:33999
    old "Everyone's eyes widened until we saw Katei pressing every button and showing us its blank display."
    new "众人眼睛都睁大了。Katei 把按键逐个按了一遍，给我们看的只有空白的屏幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:34006
    old "Is it not working? Let me see."
    new "坏了吗？让我看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:34007
    old "Katei gave Akaro the device. After fiddling with it for a while, he noticed what was wrong."
    new "Katei 把对讲机递给 Akaro。他摆弄了一阵，才发现了问题所在。"

    # game/script.rpy:34012
    old "...There's a battery missing, and the cover isn't properly attached. There's also a crack here on the bottom, look."
    new "……少了一节电池，后盖也没盖好。底下这儿还有道裂缝，你看。"

    # game/script.rpy:34017
    old "These work with normal batteries?"
    new "这种对讲机用的是普通电池？"

    # game/script.rpy:34018
    old "Apparently, and this cover can be manually removed. Maybe they failed to break it by force and removed a battery instead."
    new "看样子是，而且这个后盖可以手动拆下来。也许对方硬砸不开，就干脆取走了一节电池。"

    # game/script.rpy:34023
    old "Are there batteries like these anywhere?"
    new "这座塔里有这种电池吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:34028
    old "No, I really don't think so..."
    new "没有，我想应该没有……"

    # game/script.rpy:34030
    old "He left the device on the floor."
    new "他把对讲机放在了地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:34040
    old "So the killer did this to prevent us from talking to people outside once again.{w} I have to assume that you still have not found Naomi, so instead of blaming me, consider that it's very possible this person has been here since we got trapped, and we didn't find him just like we couldn't find Naomi."
    new "所以凶手这么做，是为了再一次切断我们和外面的联系。{w}我只能认为你们还是没找到 Naomi——与其在这里怪我，不如想想：这个人很可能从我们被困起就一直待在塔里，我们找不到他，就像找不到 Naomi 一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:34042
    old "Okay, then you killed him?"
    new "好，那么是你杀了他？"

    # game/script.rpy:34047
    old "...{w}Don't say stuff like that. I didn't do this."
    new "……{w}别乱说话。人不是我杀的。"

    # game/script.rpy:34049
    old "...Then who did? It seems like it could've been anyone, but your story is by far the most questionable one. Do we really have to keep listening to this Naomi boogeyman schtick?"
    new "……那是谁？这里谁都可能下手，可你的说法偏偏最站不住脚。我们难道还要继续听你拿 Naomi 当鬼来吓人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:34056
    old "...Stop.{w} Akaro, is what you said earlier true? That you found Katei ten minutes before coming to the event room?"
    new "……等等。{w}Akaro，你刚才说的是真的吗？你说你是在来活动室之前十分钟找到 Katei 的？"

    # game/script.rpy:34061
    old "Uh... Yes, I don't know if it really was ten minutes, though."
    new "呃……是。不过我也不确定是不是真有十分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:34067
    old "What time is it right now?"
    new "现在几点？"

    # game/script.rpy:34073
    old "It's unlikely Katei did this, then. Six minutes ago, this hadn't happened yet."
    new "那么就不太可能是 Katei 做的了。六分钟前，这件事还没发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:34078
    old "...{w}Is that so? You two were talking in hallway A. Did you look at the lobby? I recall the door was shut."
    new "……{w}是吗？你们俩当时在 A走廊说话。你们看过大厅吗？我记得那扇门是关着的。"

    # game/script.rpy:34079
    old "We did."
    new "看过。"

    # game/script.rpy:34080
    old "He's right."
    new "他说得没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:34083
    old "At {time=13:17}, we'd walked down to the mechanical room, which meant that the man had died while we'd been under him."
    new "{time=13:17}，我们已经下到机械室，也就是说，那个男人死的时候，我们就在他脚下。"

    # game/script.rpy:34088
    old "...If you're not lying, then forget what I said. Everyone has an alibi, unless two or more people did it.{w} You two were together, Katei and Akaro were together, and me, Erina, and Isla were together."
    new "……如果你们没说谎，那就当我没说过。所有人都有不在场证明——除非凶手是两个人以上。{w}你们俩在一起，Katei 和 Akaro 在一起，而我、Erina 和 Isla 在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:34102
    old "We looked past the door, where Erina was crouching next to Isla, comforting her from a sight she hadn't seen. Despite that, she was burying her face in her arms."
    new "我们朝门里望去，Erina 正蹲在 Isla 身边安慰她，想让她避开那幅从未见过的景象。可即便如此，她还是把脸埋进了臂弯里。"

    # game/script.rpy:34116
    old "A dour mood had overtaken the entire group. I wasn't sure if it was because they had been exposed to death or because they feared the killer."
    new "阴郁的气氛笼罩了所有人。我不知道是因为他们直面了死亡，还是因为畏惧那个凶手。"

    # game/script.rpy:34117
    old "Atsuki's demeanor had changed the least, probably because it didn't have far to go anyway. Regardless, I had to put on the same appearance, and it came naturally after the previous two weeks. The death of that man meant nothing to me, and I was only a little intrigued. I'd always known I'd react like that, and while I knew I couldn't show it, I didn't feel it was necessarily problematic as long as nobody found out."
    new "Atsuki 的神情变化最小，大概是因为他本来也没什么起伏的余地。无论如何，我也得装出同样的样子，而经过前两周，这已经变得自然而然。那个男人的死对我而言毫无意义，我只觉得有几分好奇。我早就知道自己会是这种反应；我也明白不能表现出来，但只要没人发现，我并不觉得这有什么问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:34121
    old "So, it was actually Naomi...?"
    new "这么说，真的是 Naomi……？"

    # game/script.rpy:34126
    old "I have no idea how this man entered the tower. It's possible he was here from the beginning, or there could actually be a secret way in. It wouldn't surprise me given the track record this place has. However, he's a police officer, so whoever did this might've killed him just because of that."
    new "我完全不知道这个男人是怎么进到塔里的。也许他从一开始就在里面，也可能真有条秘密通道。考虑到这地方的过往记录，我也不会感到意外。不过，他是警察，所以下手的人或许正是冲着这一点才杀了他。"

    # game/script.rpy:34131
    old "I'm not sure how they took his knife or how we didn't hear a fight. In fact, I have no clue what happened.{w} None of us have blood on our clothes, which I suppose doesn't mean anything since it doesn't seem like much blood sprayed out, but I'll remind you all again that the Sekimeiya was hidden a while ago. All of us go back to having no alibi when everyone is able to go to the past."
    new "我不知道对方是怎么夺走他的刀的，也不知道我们为什么没听到打斗声。说实话，我完全不明白发生了什么。{w}我们身上都没有血迹——不过这大概说明不了什么，毕竟看起来并没有溅出多少血。但我要再提醒各位一次：Sekimeiya 早就被藏起来了。只要所有人都能回到过去，我们每个人的不在场证明就都不成立了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34136
    old "Are you joking? Do you think one of us will go to the past and kill him?"
    new "你在开玩笑吧？你觉得我们之中会有人回到过去杀了他？"

    # game/script.rpy:34141
    old "Well, you said Naomi still has a set of keys identical to yours. Whether or not that's true, we know of someone who does for sure."
    new "这个嘛，你说过 Naomi 手上还有一套和你一模一样的钥匙。不管这话是真是假，我们至少知道有一个人确实有。"

    # game/script.rpy:34146
    old "Multiple pairs of eyes faced me."
    new "好几道目光同时落在我身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:34147
    old "...I have it. We didn't hide the Sekimeiya, though."
    new "……钥匙在我这儿。不过 Sekimeiya 不是我们藏的。"

    # game/script.rpy:34152
    old "...And if we had, we wouldn't have needed it to do this because we're the ones who saw the lobby empty just minutes ago."
    new "……而且如果真是我们藏的，我们也不必靠它来做这件事——几分钟前亲眼看见大厅空无一人的，正是我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:34155
    old "That's right, which forces me to point out the topic you were discussing in hallway A.{w} \"I touched the Sekimeiya a second ago.\" Didn't those words come out of your mouth?"
    new "没错，所以我不得不提一提你们在 A走廊聊的那件事。{w}「我刚才碰了一下 Sekimeiya。」——这话不是从你嘴里说出来的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:34165
    old "They did. So you lied; you didn't see the lobby before I heard you since you appeared there from the future."
    new "确实说了。所以你在撒谎——你既然是从未来出现在那里的，就不可能在我听见你说话之前看到大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:34166
    old "...You're right, but we did see it before touching the Sekimeiya. It doesn't invalidate what we said."
    new "……你说得对。不过我们确实在碰 Sekimeiya 之前看过大厅。这并不影响我们说过的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:34167
    old "You're admitting it, good. Is this travel yet to happen?"
    new "你承认了，很好。那这次穿越还没发生吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:34172
    old "I think it just happened. I don't know if anything went differently this time, but we found the Sekimeiya in the mechanical room, so whoever took it hid it there."
    new "我想它刚刚发生了。我不知道这一次有没有哪里不同，但我们是在机械室找到 Sekimeiya 的，也就是说，拿走它的人把它藏在了那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:34177
    old "Below us...? And you appeared in the hallway..."
    new "在我们下面……？而你们却出现在走廊里……"

    # game/script.rpy:34182
    old "I'm confused. You found the Sekimeiya? ...And I don't get how you got to that conclusion, Sai. Atsuki appeared there from the future, so he's the only one who couldn't have been able to look at the lobby before you saw them, right?"
    new "我有点糊涂了。你们找到了 Sekimeiya？……而且我不明白你是怎么得出这个结论的，Sai。Atsuki 是从未来出现在那里的，所以在你们看到他们之前，唯一不可能看过大厅的人就是他，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:34183
    old "No, both of—"
    new "不，他们两个都——"

    # game/script.rpy:34188
    old "He stopped himself when he realized he'd made a mistake. His pause was what made Atsuki and me notice it."
    new "他意识到自己说漏了嘴，硬生生把话咽了回去。正是他的停顿，让我和 Atsuki 察觉到了异样。"

    # game/script.rpy:34193
    old "Oh...! You know exactly what happened, don't you?"
    new "哦……！你其实很清楚发生了什么，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:34203
    old "You overheard our conversation, when we said we had traveled together."
    new "你听到了我们的谈话，听到我们说是一起穿越的。"

    # game/script.rpy:34204
    old "Akaro thought only I appeared in the hallway, but you know both of us did. I touched the Sekimeiya, which made both of us travel at the same time."
    new "Akaro 以为只有我出现在走廊里，可你知道我们两个都出现了。我碰了 Sekimeiya，让我们两个同时穿越了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34209
    old "And you were about to say \"no, both of them traveled\". However, given the knowledge of the Sekimeiya you should have, that shouldn't be possible. After touching it, the Sekimeiya would power off, and it would take a while before anyone could activate it again.{w} Does that mean that you knew that was possible? You haven't explained much about what you did during the time we were in the attic."
    new "而你刚才差点说出「不，他们两个都穿越了」。可是，以你本该掌握的 Sekimeiya 知识来说，这本应是不可能的。碰过之后，Sekimeiya 就会关闭，要过一段时间才能再次启动。{w}这是否说明你早就知道那种情况有可能发生？我们待在阁楼的那段时间里你做了什么，你可没怎么解释过。"

    # game/script.rpy:34215
    old "...What are you talking about? I was gonna say that both of you traveled together because it's what you two said. I stopped myself when I realized that Akaro was right; it didn't make sense."
    new "……你在说什么？我本来要说你们俩是一起穿越的，因为这是你们自己说的。我说到一半停住，是因为意识到 Akaro 说得对——那根本讲不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:34220
    old "...No, I don't think so."
    new "……不，我看未必。"

    # game/script.rpy:34228
    old "Sai shook his head, disregarding Atsuki's accusation. Then, he walked to the mechanical room."
    new "Sai 摇了摇头，没有理会 Atsuki 的指责，随后走向机械室。"

    # game/script.rpy:34233
    old "So, you two traveled recently, right? Should we just ignore the fact that you avoided telling us the location of the Sekimeiya, if we're to believe you didn't hide it?"
    new "那么，你们俩最近穿越过，对吧？如果我们相信你们没有藏起 Sekimeiya，那你们一直不肯说出它的位置，这事就这么算了？"

    # game/script.rpy:34236
    old "He didn't wait for an answer before he began to descend the staircase. The door had been left slightly open by the two of us so that the darkness below was at least slightly alleviated."
    new "他没等回答，便沿着楼梯走了下去。我们两个给那扇门留了一条缝，好歹让下面透进了一点光。"

    # game/script.rpy:34239
    old "Atsuki shared dubious looks with the others at Sai sidestepping the issue, but there was no choice except waiting for him to return."
    new "Sai 这样回避问题，Atsuki 和其他人交换了怀疑的眼神，但也只能等他回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:34249
    old "You don't think he wanted to use the Sekimeiya, do you?"
    new "你觉得他不会是想用 Sekimeiya 吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:34260
    old "Atsuki walked to the door, worried about Sai's intentions, but he stopped himself short after a couple steps."
    new "Atsuki 担心 Sai 有什么企图，朝门口走了过去，但才迈出两步就停住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34265
    old "I was right. They're lying."
    new "我没说错。他们在撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:34266
    old "What? We aren't."
    new "什么？我们没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:34271
    old "Where is the Sekimeiya supposed to be, then?"
    new "那 Sekimeiya 应该在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:34272
    old "It was behind the pile of chairs."
    new "就在那堆椅子后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:34277
    old "Incorrect. There was nothing down there."
    new "不对。下面什么都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:34287
    old "You're all free to go see by yourselves."
    new "你们自己去看吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:34288
    old "I knew that couldn't be true. We'd most likely arrived at the lobby before we'd disappeared from the mechanical room, so the Sekimeiya had to still be there. If Sai was so blatantly lying, had he found a way to frame us?"
    new "我知道那不可能。多半是我们从机械室消失之前，就已经到了大厅，所以 Sekimeiya 一定还在那里。Sai 敢这么明目张胆地撒谎，难道他已经找到了栽赃我们的办法？"

    # game/script.rpy:34293
    old "Can you open that hip pack?"
    new "能把那个腰包打开吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:34298
    old "This? Sure. Do you think I have it...?{w} I'm being serious. I didn't find it, but it's possible I missed it. Go look."
    new "这个？行啊。你觉得东西在我身上……？{w}我说真的。我没找到，但也许是我漏看了。自己去看吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:34299
    old "Sai didn't have the Sekimeiya on him, so Atsuki accepted his suggestion and gestured at me to stay put."
    new "Sai 身上确实没有 Sekimeiya，Atsuki 便接受了他的提议，示意我留在原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:34305
    old "Everyone silently stood in anticipation next to the still-expanding pool of blood."
    new "所有人都沉默地站在仍在扩开的血泊旁，静静等待。"

    # game/script.rpy:34316
    old "Nothing, right?"
    new "什么都没有，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:34318
    old "Yeah, it's not there."
    new "嗯，不在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:34323
    old "You should've trusted me. Do you feel like changing your version of events now?"
    new "早该信我的。现在要不要改改你们的说法？"

    # game/script.rpy:34324
    old "No. We already told you what happened. The Sekimeiya should still be there."
    new "不改。发生了什么，我们已经说过了。Sekimeiya 本来就应该在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:34325
    old "What, did it disappear? Guess it wouldn't be that hard to believe."
    new "怎么，它自己消失了？倒也不是不能信。"

    # game/script.rpy:34326
    old "Sai had managed to switch roles as soon as he was put on the defensive, but it didn't seem to be bothering Atsuki much. Did he think that the past had been changed and that what was happening was the result? It didn't make a lot of sense to me."
    new "Sai 一被逼得转为守势，就立刻反客为主，可 Atsuki 似乎并不在意。他难道以为过去已经被改变，眼前的一切正是结果？我怎么想都想不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:34331
    old "What do you all think? It's not a good look to be caught lying like this, is it?"
    new "你们怎么看？这样被人当面拆穿撒谎，可不太好看吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:34335
    old "Don't you think that if we wanted to lie, we would've said that we found the Sekimeiya somewhere it was easy to steal?"
    new "你们不觉得吗？真要撒谎，我们大可以声称 Sekimeiya 是在一处很容易被人偷走的地方找到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:34336
    old "Hm, that's always too ineffective of an excuse."
    new "嗯，这种借口一向不太顶用。"

    # game/script.rpy:34341
    old "...This policeman either had a way to not be found for hours, or he had some way to enter the building. ...A-And... he..."
    new "……这个警察要么有办法在几个小时里一直不被发现，要么就有办法进入这栋楼。……而、而且……他……"

    # game/script.rpy:34343
    old "Atsuki blinked several times, almost like he was fighting back tears."
    new "Atsuki 连眨了几下眼，像是在忍着眼泪。"

    # game/script.rpy:34348
    old "Someone... killed him... and it's not easy for any of us to have done it. Finally, the Sekimeiya isn't where it should be.{w} Added to the fact that Naomi hasn't been found, you can't possibly think we did this, right?"
    new "有人……杀了他……而我们谁都不容易做到。还有，Sekimeiya 也不在该在的地方。{w}再加上 Naomi 至今不见踪影，你总不可能觉得这是我们干的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:34350
    old "You didn't?"
    new "不是你们？"

    # game/script.rpy:34351
    old "There's n-no way. I think Naomi's the first person to suspect. Not only has she managed to remain hidden, but she also might have the same keys that we have.{w} There are no cameras here, but we don't know if they're recording in the first place... You said you didn't inspect the whole building because you thought we were in the attic, right? We have to be missing something that the culprit is aware of. Could there be a place we're ignoring?"
    new "绝、绝对不可能。我觉得第一个该怀疑的就是 Naomi。她不仅一直藏得不见人影，而且可能拿着和我们一样的钥匙。{w}这里没有摄像头，可我们连它们有没有在录像都不知道……你说过，因为以为我们在阁楼，所以没有查遍整栋楼，对吧？我们肯定漏掉了凶手知道的某个东西。会不会有某个地方被我们一直忽略？"

    # game/script.rpy:34359
    old "...That's impossible."
    new "……不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:34360
    old "If not, then one of you did this. Naomi's disappearance should be enough proof that we're missing something, though."
    new "若不是这样，那就是你们当中有人下的手。不过，Naomi 的失踪已经足以证明我们漏掉了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:34365
    old "We have to find her or whoever else is here. It's almost guaranteed that this man was with us since this morning, and we didn't find him. I think that's much more likely than some hidden passage."
    new "必须找到她，或者找到还在这里的其他人。几乎可以肯定，这个人从今早就和我们待在同一栋楼里，我们却一直没发现他。比起有什么隐藏通道，我觉得这要合理得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:34366
    old "If it's neither of those, there's still an answer with the Sekimeiya. This policeman could've come from the future if he touched the Sekimeiya after {time=21}, and Naomi could've left the tower by going far to the past. We found the Sekimeiya in the attic and don't know where it is now."
    new "如果这两者都不是，那答案还可能出在 Sekimeiya 身上。这个警察若是在 {time=21} 之后碰过 Sekimeiya，就可能是从未来来的；Naomi 也可能远赴过去，就此离开了这座塔。我们在阁楼找到了 Sekimeiya，如今却不知道它在哪儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:34367
    old "We'll look everywhere. Not only could people still be hiding, but the Sekimeiya has to be somewhere too. I can't imagine the real person responsible doesn't know where."
    new "每个地方都要搜。不仅可能还有人藏着，Sekimeiya 也一定在某处。我不信真正的凶手会不知道它在哪儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:34372
    old "Go ahead and find Naomi for us."
    new "那就麻烦你去把 Naomi 找出来吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:34388
    old "It's certainly possible someone's on this floor. Don't move from here."
    new "这一层确实可能有人。你们待在这儿别动。"

    # game/script.rpy:34395
    old "He began by looking in the storeroom and then in the room in front. He probably didn't know about the fact that some cabinets could be opened up."
    new "他先去看了储藏室，又查了前面的房间。他大概不知道有些展示柜是可以打开的。"

    # game/script.rpy:34400
    old "Is he doing this by himself? Does he not trust us?"
    new "他打算一个人查？是不信我们吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:34401
    old "From hallway C, six pairs of eyes stared at him moving from room to room. He took a while in each one."
    new "C走廊里，六双眼睛注视着他一间间地查过去。他在每个房间里都要待上一阵。"

    # game/script.rpy:34407
    old "Did you hear that?"
    new "你们听见了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:34417
    old "No?"
    new "没有啊？"

    # game/script.rpy:34424
    old "I glanced at Sai and discerned that he definitely still suspected Atsuki of something."
    new "我瞥了 Sai 一眼，看得出他仍然在怀疑 Atsuki 什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:34425
    old "Atsuki exited from the farthest away crystal room and turned to us. Without saying anything, he entered the security room."
    new "Atsuki 从最远的那间水晶展室出来，转向我们。他一言不发，走进了监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:34426
    old "What the fuck is he doing?"
    new "他他妈在干什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:34431
    old "Do you think he's taking advantage of this to do something?"
    new "你觉得他是想趁这个机会做什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:34440
    old "I felt like I was watching everything unfold from the sidelines, oblivious as to what was really happening. For some reason, Atsuki hadn't revealed that we'd powered on the computer despite telling me that we would."
    new "我觉得自己像个局外人，看着事情一件件发生，却对真相一无所知。Atsuki 明明跟我说过，要告诉大家电脑已经开机，可不知为何，他始终没有说。"

    # game/script.rpy:34442
    old "When he left the security room, he looked at us again and finally addressed us."
    new "他走出监控室时又看了我们一眼，终于开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:34443
    old "Stay there! I'll look at the mechanical room again."
    new "待在那儿别动！我再去看看机械室。"

    # game/script.rpy:34444
    old "He disappeared from our sight.{w} Soon, we began to hear the same sound of doors opening coming from hallway B."
    new "他从我们视野里消失了。{w}很快，B走廊那边又传来了同样的开门声。"

    # game/script.rpy:34451
    old "Akaro and Sai went to look while the rest of us waited behind."
    new "Akaro 和 Sai 过去查看，我们其余的人留在原地等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:34457
    old "When he returned, it didn't seem like he'd found anything."
    new "他回来时，看上去一无所获。"

    # game/script.rpy:34463
    old "There's nobody here. I didn't find the Sekimeiya or any potential hiding spot we don't know of. If Naomi's here, she's somehow above us."
    new "这里没有人。我没找到 Sekimeiya，也没发现任何我们不知道的藏身之处。如果 Naomi 在这里，那她一定是躲在我们上面的哪一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:34469
    old "...Are you sure you were thorough? Do you know some cabinets have compartments inside? The Sekimeiya could be there."
    new "……你确定都仔细查过了？有些展示柜里面还有暗格，这你知道吗？Sekimeiya 说不定就藏在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:34470
    old "Yes, I looked in all of them."
    new "嗯，每一个我都看过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34475
    old "Even the ones with temperature regulation? Did you make sure to close them?"
    new "连那些带温控的也查了？都关严了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:34480
    old "Those too, yeah. It took me a bit to figure out how to open them."
    new "也查了。我琢磨了一会儿才弄明白怎么打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:34484
    old "Before moving on, Atsuki looked in both bathrooms. Finally, he grabbed the elevator's handle."
    new "继续走之前，Atsuki 又查看了两间洗手间。最后，他握住了电梯的门把手。"

    # game/script.rpy:34491
    old "The door opened, revealing the empty elevator."
    new "门开了，电梯里空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:34496
    old "...I'll keep it open so that it can't be used."
    new "……我让它一直开着，这样谁也坐不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34499
    old "All right. Let's go."
    new "好，走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:34504
    old "He started to go up the stairs, and I found myself following first again. After passing through the narrow, gray door, we stepped back onto the desolate second floor."
    new "他踏上楼梯，我发现自己又第一个跟了上去。穿过那扇窄小的灰门，我们重新回到荒凉的二楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:34510
    old "Atsuki opened both bathroom doors and quickly dismissed them."
    new "Atsuki 推开两间洗手间的门，匆匆扫了一眼，便不再理会。"

    # game/script.rpy:34515
    old "Hm, nothing."
    new "嗯，什么也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:34517
    old "I hated agreeing with Sai without knowing why, but he was right. It was hard not to think that Atsuki's attitude was odd."
    new "我讨厌自己不知怎么就认同了 Sai，可他说得没错。Atsuki 的态度确实古怪，很难不这么想。"

    # game/script.rpy:34521
    old "...It was really frustrating. I'd always been good at reading him, but while he walked toward the offices, I had no comprehension of what his thoughts were."
    new "……真让人烦躁。我一向很会看他的心思，可这一次，看着他走向办公室，我却完全猜不到他在想什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:34528
    old "Wait here."
    new "在这儿等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:34529
    old "Can I do it instead?"
    new "不如让我来？"

    # game/script.rpy:34534
    old "Huh? Yeah, sure."
    new "嗯？哦，好啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:34538
    old "His nonchalant reaction threw me off, but I opened the door without letting that show. It was his idea to look through the whole building, which was possibly why Sai distrusted him. However, my confusion went beyond that."
    new "他随口应下，反倒让我一愣，但我没有表露，径自推开了门。搜遍整栋楼本是他的提议，Sai 不信任他，或许就源于此。可我的困惑并不止于此。"

    # game/script.rpy:34543
    old "He'd openly told me about his intentions to change the past, so why did the sensation that he was hiding something still persist when he'd confided in me?"
    new "他明明坦率地告诉过我，他想改变过去。既然他对我交了底，为什么我还是觉得他有所隐瞒？"

    # game/script.rpy:34549
    old "I kept going over it as I opened drawers and looked behind the computers. Every time I thought that maybe it was all in my head, something else reinforced the opposite."
    new "我一边拉开抽屉、查看电脑后面，一边反复琢磨。每当我以为只是自己多心，就又有别的迹象证明并非如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:34551
    old "There weren't many places to look at, so I was soon done with the three partitions."
    new "能查的地方不多，三个隔间很快就看完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34558
    old "I didn't find anything."
    new "什么都没找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:34559
    old "You looked everywhere, right?"
    new "每个角落都看了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:34560
    old "It hit me that we were still alone."
    new "我这才意识到，这里始终只有我们两个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:34561
    old "Yes, but did the others not come with us?"
    new "看了。不过，其他人没跟我们一起来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:34566
    old "I think they stayed on the crystal floor and let us go by ourselves."
    new "他们大概留在水晶层了，让我们自己上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:34572
    old "Yes, and we should continue. We have to find something. Be it Naomi or the Sekimeiya."
    new "嗯，我们继续吧。总得找到点什么，不管是 Naomi 还是 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:34574
    old "I shrugged lightly before we moved up to the third floor."
    new "我轻轻耸了耸肩，随后我们上了三楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:34583
    old "There, the same process was repeated. He looked at the two bathrooms, and I handled the offices while he waited outside so that no one crossed the path."
    new "在三楼，同样的流程又走了一遍。他查看两间洗手间，我负责办公室；他等在门外，防止有人经过。"

    # game/script.rpy:34589
    old "Our repeated movements led to the first step on floor 4."
    new "我们就这样重复着，踏上了四楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:34597
    old "Let's see here... It's not possible she's not anywhere."
    new "看看吧……她总不可能凭空消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:34602
    old "Behind the glass, I started to look through the same places as below, all while wondering whether I'd report a result anyway."
    new "隔着玻璃隔断，我开始像楼下那样逐一翻查，心里却在琢磨，自己究竟会不会把结果说出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:34606
    old "I opened the door to the second partition and vanished from Atsuki's field of vision."
    new "我推开第二个隔间的门，从 Atsuki 的视野里消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34610
    old "There were only drawers that I questioned whether to keep checking. Midway through, I decided to push open the door to the last section."
    new "里面只有几个抽屉，我犹豫着还要不要继续翻。查到一半，我决定推开最后一间的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:34617
    old "I stared inside."
    new "我向里面看去。"

    # game/script.rpy:34618
    old "I kept doing so for many seconds, gripping the door's handle with my right hand.{w} One of the many thoughts that crossed my mind was if I should move."
    new "我就这样看了好几秒，右手始终握着门把手。{w} 脑中掠过许多念头，其中之一是：我该不该动。"

    # game/script.rpy:34619
    old "...Until I realized that it wasn't up to me. It hadn't been my choice not to move. However, my hand soon let go of the handle, and the door was shut again."
    new "……直到我意识到，这由不得我。不动并不是我的选择。可没过多久，我的手松开了把手，门又合上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34624
    old "When it did, I couldn't open it again. I stood next to it for a long time, during which I only focused on my breathing."
    new "门合上之后，我再也打不开了。我在门边站了很久，只留意着自己的呼吸。"

    # game/script.rpy:34628
    old "Eventually, I comprehended that I was still able to move, and I took a step back. Strangely, neither my vision nor my mind seemed to be blurry."
    new "良久，我才明白自己还能动，于是往后退了一步。奇怪的是，我的视线和脑子似乎都没有变得模糊。"

    # game/script.rpy:34629
    old "I looked at the opaque wall and discerned a few silhouettes belonging to the chairs on the other side. However, I couldn't open the door again, and I didn't want to."
    new "我望向那面不透明的隔板，隐约辨出另一侧几把椅子的轮廓。可是，我无法再打开那扇门，也不想打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:34630
    old "I'd developed an irrational fear of spiders early on in my life. Whenever I knew a spider was in a room, I'd freeze behind its door, unable to open it. That was the same sensation I felt as I slowly backed away."
    new "我从小就莫名其妙地怕蜘蛛。只要知道房里有蜘蛛，我就会僵在门外，怎么也不敢推门。此刻我缓缓后退，心里正是同样的感觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:34642
    old "Nothing again?"
    new "又是空的？"

    # game/script.rpy:34643
    old "I shook my head."
    new "我摇了摇头。"

    # game/script.rpy:34648
    old "If she's in the attic, she won't be able to take the elevator down, but this is very strange."
    new "要是她在阁楼，就没法坐电梯下来。可这也太奇怪了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34653
    old "We walked the path to the fifth floor until we reached the staircase."
    new "我们沿着通往五楼的通道往前走，一直到了楼梯口。"

    # game/script.rpy:34661
    old "...Are you all right?"
    new "……你没事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:34662
    old "...Huh?{w} Yes."
    new "……嗯？{w} 没事。"

    # game/script.rpy:34667
    old "You look zoned out. Are you tired?"
    new "你有点魂不守舍。累了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:34668
    old "A bit. It's okay."
    new "有点。不碍事。"

    # game/script.rpy:34669
    old "All right, but don't push yourself."
    new "好吧，不过别硬撑。"

    # game/script.rpy:34679
    old "I'll look myself, so wait here."
    new "我自己去看，你在这儿等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:34685
    old "I didn't voice any complaints. I just gave him a tiny nod.{w} Outside, I kept glancing left and right until Atsuki was done."
    new "我没有出声反对，只是轻轻朝他点了点头。{w} 到了外面，我一直左顾右盼，直到 Atsuki 查看完毕。"

    # game/script.rpy:34694
    old "...I don't really expect Naomi to be in these, but it all gets weirder every time we move on. Could a secret place that Katei doesn't know about exist...?"
    new "……我本来也没指望 Naomi 会藏在这些地方，可每往前走一步，事情就愈发古怪。真会有连 Katei 都不知道的隐秘之处吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:34696
    old "There's no way, right? If the answer is somehow a hidden spot, he must've made use of it as well."
    new "不可能吧？如果答案真是某处隐蔽的角落，那他自己肯定也早就利用过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34703
    old "One last identical floor remained, which we silently ascended to. I didn't know what emotion I'd been attacked by, but I wanted to see the others—the unknown people I'd met that day. I needed them as a temporary shelter, not continually being alone with Atsuki."
    new "还剩最后一层，与之前别无二致，我们默默走了上去。我不知道自己是被什么情绪缠住了，但我想见到其他人——那天遇见的那些陌生人。我需要他们暂时当我的避风港，而不是一直和 Atsuki 单独待在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:34708
    old "The sixth floor was empty as well."
    new "六楼同样空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:34718
    old "...{w}You have the key, right?"
    new "……{w}钥匙在你身上吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:34719
    old "I nodded and took the keyring out of my purse. With the right key, I unlocked the door."
    new "我点点头，从包里取出钥匙串，挑出对应的那把，打开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:34730
    old "Atsuki stood in front of the living room and looked at the floor."
    new "Atsuki 站在客厅前，低头看着地面。"

    # game/script.rpy:34735
    old "No recent footprints..."
    new "没有新留下的脚印……"

    # game/script.rpy:34744
    old "It'll be fine if you stay here. If I don't find anyone, I'm gonna be pretty confused."
    new "你留在这儿就好。要是一个人都找不到，我可就真懵了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34751
    old "...{w}I don't get it. Was Naomi never with us?{w} How is this possible? I know we've already been here for a long time, but that doesn't make it any less confusing. Where the hell is the Sekimeiya, also?"
    new "……{w}我搞不懂了。Naomi 难道从来就没跟我们在一起？{w}这怎么可能？我知道我们在这儿已经待了很久，可我还是一样摸不着头脑。还有，Sekimeiya 又到底在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:34757
    old "Let's just go back down. I hope they trust what we tell them.{w} ...We can't even take the elevator, damn it."
    new "先下去吧。希望他们会相信我们说的话。{w}……该死，连电梯都坐不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34764
    old "We walked down the stairs and left the attic, heading all the way back down."
    new "我们走下楼梯，离开阁楼，一路往下。"

    # game/script.rpy:34777
    old "For every floor we descended, the air got hotter, and my head number."
    new "每往下一层，空气就更热一分，脑袋也越发昏沉。"

    # game/script.rpy:34783
    old "Hearing different voices was like emerging from underwater. As my view of hallway C increased, so did the sound."
    new "听见别的声音，就像从水下浮了上来。C走廊在视野中一点点展开，声音也随之清晰。"

    # game/script.rpy:34784
    old "Where the hell are they?"
    new "他们到底在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:34788
    old "I listened intently and frowned."
    new "我凝神细听，皱起了眉。"

    # game/script.rpy:34792
    old "...The storeroom?"
    new "……储藏室？"

    # game/script.rpy:34799
    old "Oh. Well, I need to go to the bathroom. I'll be back."
    new "哦。那我去趟洗手间，很快就回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:34802
    old "I felt like he was looking at me oddly, but I didn't have time to point it out before he turned around."
    new "我觉得他看我的眼神有些异样，可我还没来得及开口，他就转身走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34806
    old "I headed to the open storeroom. Everyone was inside, but the room didn't look as I remembered it."
    new "我朝敞着门的储藏室走去。所有人都在里面，可房间的样子和我记忆中的并不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:34820
    old "Look at what we found, {tip=Tanya}Tanya{/tip}! There was a secret wall."
    new "快看我们发现了什么，{tip=Tanya}坦桑娅{/tip}！这里藏着一面暗墙。"

    # game/script.rpy:34826
    old "There you are. Where's Atsuki?"
    new "你来了。Atsuki 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:34827
    old "...He went to the bathroom."
    new "……他去洗手间了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34834
    old "I stepped in farther. The length of the room had increased, and with every step I took, the temperature lowered. The others were all gathered around another door."
    new "我又往里走了几步。房间比原先长了不少，每走一步，温度就低一分。其他人都聚在另一扇门前。"

    # game/script.rpy:34835
    old "What's this place...? Also, was that name supposed to refer to me?"
    new "这是什么地方……？还有，刚才那个称呼是在叫我吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:34840
    old "Tanya? Yes! It's because of tanzanite."
    new "坦桑娅？对呀！就是取自坦桑石嘛。"

    # game/script.rpy:34842
    old "I supposed it made perfect sense to her."
    new "她大概觉得这名字再自然不过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:34848
    old "...When we were going up, Akaro and I heard a sound behind us and saw that the storeroom wasn't shut, although nobody was here. However, I noticed that a spot on the wall wasn't dusty, which let me uncover this section."
    new "……我们上楼的时候，我和 Akaro 听见身后有响动，回头一看，储藏室的门没关，可里面并没有人。不过，我注意到墙上有一块地方没有积灰，这才发现了这一段墙。"

    # game/script.rpy:34849
    old "What the...? Why does this place exist?"
    new "怎么回事……？这里怎么会有这种地方？"

    # game/script.rpy:34850
    old "Tell her, Katei."
    new "Katei，你告诉她。"

    # game/script.rpy:34857
    old "I don't know.{w} I had no idea it existed."
    new "我不知道。{w}我根本不知道还有这么个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:34860
    old "What? H-How's that possible?"
    new "什么？这、这怎么可能？"

    # game/script.rpy:34866
    old "I am aware of how it sounds, but I'm the most surprised out of anyone."
    new "我知道这话听起来有多离谱，但所有人里最吃惊的就是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:34872
    old "Did you search the whole building?"
    new "你把整栋楼都查过了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:34878
    old "Even though there was nobody here, this door is locked."
    new "明明这里没有人，这扇门却锁着。"

    # game/script.rpy:34879
    old "I grabbed its handle and turned it. Indeed, it wouldn't budge."
    new "我握住门把手拧了拧，果然纹丝不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:34880
    old "You saw the door open after Atsuki closed it? Is that what you meant? So someone opened it before we moved up?"
    new "你是说，Atsuki 关上之后，你看见那扇门又开了？是这个意思吗？也就是说，在我们上楼之前，有人把它打开了？"

    # game/script.rpy:34886
    old "That's what we were discussing. This is obviously a spot anyone could have used to hide, but Sai doesn't believe someone left through it. He thinks someone came in. Otherwise, the door wouldn't have been left open, and nobody would've left while we were investigating."
    new "我们刚才就在说这个。这里显然是个谁都能用来藏身的地方，可 Sai 认为没人从这里出去过。他觉得是有人进来了。不然门不会就那么敞着，我们调查的这段时间里也不会有人离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:34887
    old "...But Atsuki had just finished looking through the whole floor."
    new "……可 Atsuki 才刚把那一层查过一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:34892
    old "Exactly."
    new "正是。"

    # game/script.rpy:34901
    old "What I think is that this door leads outside. The storeroom now stretches farther out than the crystal rooms, and it's a hidden locked door that would explain the policeman's appearance and Naomi's vanishing."
    new "我的判断是，这扇门通向外面。储藏室现在比水晶展室延伸得更靠外，而这扇上锁的暗门正好能解释警察为什么会出现在这里，以及 Naomi 为什么消失不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:34902
    old "W-Wait, really...? If a policeman entered, why did nobody else?"
    new "等、等等，真的吗……？既然警察能进来，为什么没有别的人进来？"

    # game/script.rpy:34903
    old "Who knows? Maybe the door was briefly unlocked when he got in, or maybe he was behind the plan like Naomi. Nonetheless, it appears the answer really was a hidden way outside."
    new "谁知道呢。也许他进来时，那扇门只是短暂地没有上锁；又或者，他也像 Naomi 一样是计划的幕后之人。无论如何，看来答案确实是一条通向外面的暗道。"

    # game/script.rpy:34908
    old "I'm sure people are in front of the entrance, but I wouldn't bet the entire building is surrounded. It could be possible to enter and leave from this side without being seen."
    new "我敢肯定入口处有人守着，但我不敢断言整栋楼都被包围了。从这一侧进出而不被看见，或许可行。"

    # game/script.rpy:34909
    old "...{w}Can we not do anything to open it?"
    new "……{w}我们就不能想办法打开它吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:34910
    old "My perception of our imprisonment had changed drastically. If we could open the door, I might've been able to escape, which I had started to want more than anything."
    new "我对我们被困在这里这件事的看法，已经完全变了。只要那扇门能打开，我也许就能逃出去——而逃出去，已是我最渴望的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:34915
    old "Would you or Atsuki know how to pick this lock? We've knocked and made noise, but there's no way we'll be heard from here, and the gaps aren't thin enough to see or slide anything through them."
    new "你或者 Atsuki 会开这种锁吗？我们敲过门，也弄出过动静，可这边根本不可能有人听见；门缝也太窄，既看不清里面，也塞不进东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:34917
    old "...I don't."
    new "……我不会。"

    # game/script.rpy:34922
    old "Well, you didn't find the Sekimeiya anywhere, right?"
    new "那么，你们到处都没找到 Sekimeiya，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:34928
    old "Then it's possible it's not here anymore. Even if this door doesn't lead outside, it's very likely the Sekimeiya was taken away. If we're supposed to trust what Atsuki said, that could be the entire motive behind the attack."
    new "那么，它有可能已经不在这里了。就算这扇门不通向外面，Sekimeiya 也很可能是被人带走了。如果 Atsuki 的话可信，这或许就是袭击背后的全部动机。"

    # game/script.rpy:34929
    old "That still doesn't make sense, though. I don't think anyone could've taken the Sekimeiya from the mechanical room."
    new "可这还是说不通。我不认为有人能从机械室把 Sekimeiya 带走。"

    # game/script.rpy:34934
    old "...{w}Well, this door might lead outside, and Katei keeps assuring us he didn't know about it. Even if he's lying, it must be a secret door that's hard to find.{w} There's grass on the sides of the tower, meaning that if this door opened outwardly, it would leave conspicuous marks on the grass and could be noticed. It probably opens inward instead."
    new "……{w}这扇门也许通向外面，而 Katei 一直坚称自己不知道有这扇门。就算他在撒谎，这扇门也必定很难被发现。{w}塔的两侧长着草，也就是说，如果这扇门向外开，就会在草地上留下明显的痕迹，容易被人察觉。所以它多半是向内开的。"

    # game/script.rpy:34941
    old "What the fuck is this...?"
    new "这他妈是什么东西……？"

    # game/script.rpy:34942
    old "There he is. Do you know how to pick a lock?"
    new "他来了。你会开锁吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:34943
    old "What? N-No?"
    new "什么？不、不会。"

    # game/script.rpy:34949
    old "What we'd talked about was reiterated to Atsuki, all while he wore an unchanging expression."
    new "我们把刚才谈过的内容向 Atsuki 复述了一遍，他的表情始终没有变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:34958
    old "Did you really not know about this?"
    new "你真的不知道这件事？"

    # game/script.rpy:34963
    old "I promise I didn't. I also don't think this door leads outside. There's no way I wouldn't have ever noticed it."
    new "我保证我不知道。我也不认为这扇门通向外面。真有这扇门的话，我不可能一直没注意到。"

    # game/script.rpy:34968
    old "And it makes sense that you didn't know about it if it doesn't lead outside?"
    new "那么，如果这扇门不通向外面，你不知道它也就说得通了？"

    # game/script.rpy:34973
    old "...I'm just speechless. This room is practically unused, but I can't believe this existed."
    new "……我简直无话可说。这个房间几乎没人用过，可我实在难以相信这里会有这种东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:34974
    old "...{w}Now a few things make sense, at least. As you said, nobody was found, so Naomi must've been here at some point."
    new "……{w}至少现在有几件事说得通了。就像你说的，到处都没找到人影，所以 Naomi 一定来过这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:34980
    old "Yes, yes. I'd like to advise you all on something.{w} I've made sure that if this door is opened again, I'll be able to tell."
    new "对，对。我想提醒各位一件事。{w}我已经做好了安排，只要这扇门再次被打开，我就能知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:34985
    old "...What? How?"
    new "……什么？怎么做到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:34986
    old "I'm not telling you that. One of you could potentially manage to open this, so I'd rather not give you any indication of what I've done."
    new "这我可不会说。你们之中说不定有人能打开这扇门，所以我不想透露自己做了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:34991
    old "We looked at the door curiously, but it was too dim to notice whatever Sai was talking about."
    new "我们好奇地打量着那扇门，可光线太暗，根本看不清 Sai 说的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:34996
    old "...I think that's fair. It wouldn't be wise to demand that you tell us."
    new "……我觉得这样很合理。硬要你说出来，并不是明智之举。"

    # game/script.rpy:34998
    old "Just trust me. I will know if the door opens. However, it's possible it won't and that the plan already finished after the Sekimeiya was brought outside."
    new "相信我就好。门一旦打开，我会知道。不过，也可能它不会再开——Sekimeiya 被带到外面之后，计划就已经结束了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35000
    old "Let's go to the attic."
    new "去阁楼吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:35001
    old "...To the attic? Why?"
    new "……去阁楼？为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:35002
    old "Do you think I'll believe you were walking around for hours and we didn't see you? You either went through this door or were in the attic."
    new "你觉得我会相信你四处转了几个小时，而我们却一次都没见到你？你要么穿过这扇门出去了，要么就待在阁楼里。"

    # game/script.rpy:35007
    old "He wasn't with us. We know that much."
    new "他没和我们在一起。这点我们很清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:35008
    old "You've said that before. I know."
    new "你之前就说过了。我知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:35013
    old "How do you intend to know whether I was there? I won't allow anyone in lightly."
    new "你打算怎么确认我有没有去过那里？我不会随随便便让任何人进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:35018
    old "No? Then how come they spent three hours sleeping there?"
    new "不行？那他们怎么会在那里睡了三个小时？"

    # game/script.rpy:35023
    old "...I haven't forgotten about that."
    new "……那件事我没忘。"

    # game/script.rpy:35028
    old "...{w}In the off chance Naomi's still in the tower, she's up there, being covered by the three of you. I want to go see it by myself, and I'm sure Akaro and Erina aren't content with your words alone."
    new "……{w}万一 Naomi 还在塔里，那她就在上面，正被你们三个包庇着。我要亲自去看看；而且我敢肯定，光凭你几句话，Akaro 和 Erina 也不会满意。"

    # game/script.rpy:35040
    old "...All right. After that, we will all slow down. I can't believe this door exists, but the truth is that Naomi and the Sekimeiya weren't found anywhere. Once this request of yours is fulfilled, we'll stay put somewhere and wait."
    new "……好吧。之后我们都会放慢脚步。我真不敢相信这扇门居然存在，可事实就是，哪里都找不到 Naomi 和 Sekimeiya。等你的这个要求满足了，我们就找个地方待着等。"

    # game/script.rpy:35045
    old "I agree with that. It's very likely the person who killed the policeman was Naomi or someone who could enter the tower again. For our safety, we'll have to stay together."
    new "我同意。杀害警察的人，很可能就是 Naomi，或者是能再次进入塔里的人。为了安全，我们必须待在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:35046
    old "That's fine."
    new "可以。"

    # game/script.rpy:35056
    old "The elevator was still open, but we couldn't all take it at once. We walked up together, our footsteps clearly conveying our presence."
    new "电梯还开着，可我们没法一次全都乘上去。于是一起走楼梯上去，脚步声清清楚楚地暴露了我们的行踪。"

    # game/script.rpy:35065
    old "Nobody had spoken again by the time we arrived at the attic's door, where everyone stopped."
    new "我们走到阁楼门前时，谁都没再说话，大家都停了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:35070
    old "Atsuki looked at me, and so did the others. It took me a few seconds to realize it was because I had the key, and when I did, I remembered we hadn't locked it when we'd left."
    new "Atsuki 看向我，其他人也一样。我过了几秒才反应过来，是因为钥匙在我手上；等我意识到这一点，又想起我们离开时并没有把门锁上。"

    # game/script.rpy:35074
    old "I stepped forward, sensing that Atsuki was trying to tell me to hide that fact so we didn't cause an unnecessary conflict with Katei."
    new "我向前迈了一步，察觉到 Atsuki 是在示意我把这件事瞒下来，免得和 Katei 发生不必要的冲突。"

    # game/script.rpy:35076
    old "My body was hiding the keyhole, so I inserted the key and turned it. It was already unlocked, but I casually pulled the door toward me and took the key back out."
    new "我的身体挡住了锁孔，我便把钥匙插进去转了转。门本来就没锁，我仍若无其事地把门往自己这边拉了拉，再把钥匙收了回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:35082
    old "Nobody called me out, as I'd easily looked nonchalant. I glanced upward and began to ascend the staircase."
    new "我装得若无其事，谁也没揭穿。我抬眼看了看，迈步走上楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:35092
    old "On the floor, traces of Atsuki and me could be noticed. Sai stared at them silently before walking in."
    new "地板上能看到我和 Atsuki 留下的痕迹。Sai 默默盯着那些痕迹，随后走了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:35097
    old "The elevator doesn't work, so stay here."
    new "电梯不能用，就待在这里吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:35101
    old "When Akaro and Katei arrived, they went with Sai, curious to see if anything was to be found.{w} The attic was composed of only a few rooms, so they made quick work of inspecting them."
    new "Akaro 和 Katei 到了之后，和 Sai 一起去查看，都想看看能不能找到什么。{w}阁楼只有几个房间，很快就查完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35106
    old "...I suppose it's possible someone's on one of the middle floors, but given we found the storeroom's secret door, I think it's much more likely that was how Naomi managed to escape."
    new "……中间某一层或许有人，但既然我们发现了储藏室的暗门，Naomi 多半就是从那里逃走的。"

    # game/script.rpy:35107
    old "Yes. You can stop suggesting we covered for Naomi since it wasn't our plan to go search alone."
    new "没错。你不用再暗示我们替 Naomi 打掩护了，单独去搜本来就不在我们的计划里。"

    # game/script.rpy:35112
    old "Hmhm.{w} I suppose we might as well stay here if we're gonna remain in one place."
    new "嗯哼。{w}反正总得待在一个地方，那就在这里吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:35117
    old "What? No, that's not a good idea."
    new "什么？不行，这可不是个好主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:35118
    old "Listen, this place has beds, and I don't want to sit on the floor for over six hours."
    new "听我说，这地方有床，我可不想在地板上坐六个多小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:35121
    old "After hearing that, Katei didn't immediately stop him, and Sai took his chance to go straight to a bedroom."
    new "听到这话，Katei 没有立刻拦他，Sai 便趁势径直走进了一间卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:35131
    old "Having beds and a sofa sounded good to everyone, so we stood in front of the two doors; Sai opened the right one."
    new "有床有沙发，对谁来说都是好事，于是我们走到两扇门前；Sai 推开了右边那扇。"

    # game/script.rpy:35136
    old "We've already been here, so given the circumstances, I can't order you all to leave. However, do understand how important it is that you don't damage or break anything."
    new "我们已经查过这里了，眼下这种情况，我也不会命令你们离开。不过请你们明白，不要损坏或打碎任何东西，这一点非常重要。"

    # game/script.rpy:35141
    old "You don't have to worry about that."
    new "这点你不用担心。"

    # game/script.rpy:35145
    old "Behind Sai, Akaro and Katei entered the bedroom. As each one had three beds, Erina entered the left one with Isla. Being the last two, Atsuki and I quietly made our way in as well."
    new "Akaro 和 Katei 跟在 Sai 身后进了卧室。因为每间房都有三张床，Erina 和 Isla 进了左边那间。我和 Atsuki 落在最后，也悄悄跟了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:35155
    old "Do you want to be down here or up top?"
    new "你想睡下面还是上面？"

    # game/script.rpy:35160
    old "Hm, I don't care."
    new "嗯，都无所谓。"

    # game/script.rpy:35161
    old "No? You can choose."
    new "无所谓？你可以自己挑的。"

    # game/script.rpy:35162
    old "...Either one is okay."
    new "……哪边都行。"

    # game/script.rpy:35163
    old "Well, what about you two?"
    new "那你们俩呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:35164
    old "Atsuki and I shrugged."
    new "Atsuki 和我耸了耸肩。"

    # game/script.rpy:35165
    old "Let's go up, then. You'll have a bed all for yourself."
    new "那就上去吧。这样你就能独占一张床了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35169
    old "Isla nodded and went up the ladder. From below, we heard them sitting on the two beds."
    new "Isla 点点头，顺着梯子爬了上去。我们在下面听见她们两人各自坐到一张床上。"

    # game/script.rpy:35171
    old "Do you feel all right?"
    new "你还好吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:35172
    old "...I see. Try to sleep if you can, then. Everything will go by much faster."
    new "……这样啊。那能睡就睡一会儿吧，睡着了时间会过得快得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:35178
    old "We were eavesdropping on them, but since they hadn't closed the hatch, it was their own fault. Atsuki and I sat on the single bed we had and lay back."
    new "我们确实是在偷听，可谁让她们没把盖板关上呢。Atsuki 和我坐到那张唯一的床上，躺了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:35181
    old "A killer had been with us in the tower—that was a guarantee. Going off of the atmosphere, it seemed everyone was trying to feel safe by staying together. It could also have been that they assumed the man was only killed because he was a policeman and the rest of us would be left alone."
    new "塔里确实有杀人凶手混在我们中间——这一点毋庸置疑。从气氛来看，大家似乎都想聚在一起求个安心。也可能他们以为，那名男子之所以被杀，只是因为他是个警察，剩下的人不会被牵连。"

    # game/script.rpy:35186
    old "Do you need a pillow?"
    new "要枕头吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:35187
    old "I'm fine."
    new "不用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35192
    old "After a deep sigh, Atsuki closed his eyes."
    new "Atsuki 长长地叹了口气，闭上了眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:35199
    old "Have you thought about what we talked about?"
    new "我们之前说的事，你想过了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:35201
    old "Regarding Akashic Park. I know I said we could wait until the summer, but we can go during the first week of January if you want."
    new "就是去阿卡西公园的事。我知道我说过可以等到夏天，不过你要是愿意，一月的第一周去也行。"

    # game/script.rpy:35203
    old "It's okay. I think it's better to wait."
    new "不用了。我觉得还是等一等比较好。"

    # game/script.rpy:35205
    old "Yeah, I don't like the cold. Let's go in the summer."
    new "嗯，我不喜欢冷天。夏天再去吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:35206
    old "I see, all right. I'm glad you made up your mind."
    new "这样啊，好吧。你能拿定主意，我就放心了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35210
    old "Silence."
    new "一片沉默。"

    # game/script.rpy:35217
    old "If I may..."
    new "恕我打扰一下……"

    # game/script.rpy:35223
    old "Out of nowhere, Sai burst in and walked to the drawer."
    new "Sai 忽然闯了进来，径直走向抽屉。"

    # game/script.rpy:35233
    old "Oh, I'm looking in these drawers for no reason whatsoever."
    new "哦，没什么理由，就是随便翻翻这些抽屉。"

    # game/script.rpy:35236
    old "Once he'd gone through all of them and the wardrobe, he went up the ladder."
    new "他把所有抽屉和衣柜都翻了一遍，然后爬上了梯子。"

    # game/script.rpy:35241
    old "By the sound he was making, he was doing the same with the wardrobe above."
    new "听那动静，他正在楼上把那个衣柜也翻了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:35246
    old "He soon came back and left without explaining himself."
    new "他很快又回来，什么也没解释就走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35250
    old "...At least he closed the door."
    new "……至少他把门关上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35251
    old "As soon as Sai left, Atsuki lay back. All I could assume was that he'd been looking for the Sekimeiya or something."
    new "Sai 一走，Atsuki 就躺了回去。我只能猜，他是在找 Sekimeiya 之类的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:35252
    old "I looked at my purse. Thankfully, he hadn't demanded to look in it, but knowing that it could happen at any moment made me very uneasy."
    new "我看了看自己的手提包。好在他没有要求检查，可一想到他随时都可能这么做，我就很不安。"

    # game/script.rpy:35253
    old "Sai had shut the hatch, so I could no longer hear Erina and Isla. At my left was Atsuki, resting face-up on a white pillow. That image of him with his eyes closed was one I'd started to get used to."
    new "Sai 关上了舱门，Erina 和 Isla 的声音再也传不过来。Atsuki 就在我左边，枕着白枕头仰面躺着。他闭着眼睛的样子，我已经渐渐看惯了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35254
    old "However, I could no longer think that his mind was completely blank. I knew for a fact that he was silently plotting something... and that it was basically guaranteed to work."
    new "可是，我再也没法认为他脑中一片空白了。我清楚得很，他正默不作声地盘算着什么……而且那几乎一定会成功。"

    # game/script.rpy:35256
    old "Whatever plan or conclusion he'd thought of, I wouldn't be able to stop it, so it was smarter to let him be. While I couldn't help but explore the idea of going to the past myself, I had no motivation to do so, and I didn't even know what to do if the chance ever presented itself."
    new "无论他想出了什么计划、得出了什么结论，我都阻止不了，倒不如由他去。虽然我也忍不住想过自己回到过去，却没有那份动力，甚至不知道真有机会摆在面前时该做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:35260
    old "...I began to hear voices coming from the other side of the door, but they were too muddled to understand."
    new "……门外开始传来说话声，但混在一起，听不清内容。"

    # game/script.rpy:35261
    old "When they faded away, I thought I'd finally be able to try resting."
    new "声音渐渐散去后，我想，总算能试着休息了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35264
    old "Sorry, I figured I'd let you know about this."
    new "抱歉，我想还是跟你们说一声比较好。"

    # game/script.rpy:35270
    old "I lifted my head slightly and saw him holding a note."
    new "我稍稍抬起头，见他手里拿着一张纸条。"

    # game/script.rpy:35271
    old "What does it say?"
    new "上面写了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:35276
    old "It was pretty hidden in the kitchen. I'll read it for you."
    new "藏得挺隐蔽的，就在厨房里。我念给你们听。"

    # game/script.rpy:35277
    old "\"Sir, I have done as you instructed, and I didn't spot any difference in the attic since Xyn's last attack. I believe it wasn't targeted. I've finished this month's preservations, but some paint has begun to wear off, so next month I'll attempt to fix that on my own. Until then, thank you for your trust and let me know if you have any new requests. Naomi\"."
    new "「先生，我已按你的吩咐照办。自 Xyn 上次袭击以来，阁楼里并没有任何变化，我想这里并非目标。本月的保养已经做完，不过有些漆面开始脱落，下个月我会试着自行修补。在那之前，感谢你的信任，若有新的吩咐请随时告知。Naomi」"

    # game/script.rpy:35278
    old "So it's a note that Naomi left for Ashiya."
    new "所以这是 Naomi 留给芦屋的纸条。"

    # game/script.rpy:35279
    old "That's what Katei said, she kept this attic in good condition. I appreciate that you let us know, even if it doesn't mean much to us."
    new "Katei 也说过，她一直把这间阁楼打理得很好。多谢你告诉我们，虽然这对我们没什么用处。"

    # game/script.rpy:35280
    old "No problem. I'd go tell Erina and Isla, but they seemed pretty sleepy."
    new "不客气。我本来也想去告诉 Erina 和 Isla，不过她们看起来困得不行。"

    # game/script.rpy:35281
    old "And we didn't?"
    new "难道我们就不困？"

    # game/script.rpy:35291
    old "I closed my eyes."
    new "我闭上了眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:35293
    old "The light was right above us, so I put my arm over my face as well."
    new "灯就在头顶，我也抬起手臂挡住脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:35295
    old "Finally, some time began to pass. I wasn't tired enough to fall asleep, but lying down was surprisingly relaxing. I kept breathing as deeply as I could, appreciating the silence."
    new "总算，时间开始流逝了。我还没困到能睡着的地步，可躺下来竟意外地放松。我尽量深呼吸，享受这份安静。"

    # game/script.rpy:35300
    old "Did you notice what Sai did?"
    new "你注意到 Sai 刚才的举动了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:35305
    old "...What do you mean?"
    new "……你是说？"

    # game/script.rpy:35307
    old "When he left, he walked toward the living room, and he hasn't come back yet."
    new "他离开的时候是往客厅方向走的，到现在还没回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:35308
    old "Oh... did he? I didn't pay attention."
    new "哦……是吗？我没留意。"

    # game/script.rpy:35310
    old "It's already been a few minutes. {tip=perspective2}Do you have any idea about where the Sekimeiya could be?{/tip}"
    new "已经过去好几分钟了。{tip=perspective2}你知道 Sekimeiya 可能在哪儿吗？{/tip}"

    # game/script.rpy:35311
    old "Me? No, not at all.{w} If it's not outside, it must be hidden pretty well..."
    new "我？不，完全没头绪。{w} 要是它不在外面，那一定藏得相当隐蔽……"

    # game/script.rpy:35313
    old "Yeah. I had a couple ideas for hiding spots."
    new "是啊。我倒是想到过几个可能藏东西的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:35314
    old "You didn't look at them when we searched?"
    new "我们搜的时候，你没去看过？"

    # game/script.rpy:35315
    old "...Well, no. One of them requires unscrewing a computer tower. I also thought that maybe one of the keys you have could open Naomi's locker. I doubt it was just hidden like that, especially since it seemed to disappear from the mechanical room. I'm not even sure anyone could've moved it."
    new "……嗯，没有。其中一个得把电脑主机拆开才行。我还想过，你手上的某把钥匙说不定能打开 Naomi 的储物柜。我不太相信它只是被随便藏起来了，何况它像是从机械室里凭空消失的。我甚至不确定有谁能把它搬走。"

    # game/script.rpy:35318
    old "I went quiet, wondering if the scheme I thought he was constructing was already in his head. He didn't seem to fully understand how the Sekimeiya worked."
    new "我没有作声，心里琢磨着：我觉得他正在盘算的那个方案，是不是早就在他脑中成形了。他似乎并没有完全弄懂 Sekimeiya 的运作方式。"

    # game/script.rpy:35323
    old "...He's still not back."
    new "……他还没回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:35326
    old "Do you want to go look for him?"
    new "你想去找他吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:35331
    old "...{w}I think we should. I doubt he knew where the Sekimeiya was since he was searching in this room as well, but nobody from the other room has followed him."
    new "……{w}我觉得该去。他刚才也在这屋里找过，应该不知道 Sekimeiya 在哪儿；可另一个房间的人也没有谁跟上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:35337
    old "I tried not to sigh and shut my eyes forcibly. The attic wasn't locked, so the thought of going through the building again was dreadful."
    new "我忍着没叹气，用力闭上眼。阁楼并没有上锁，可一想到又要在这栋楼里走上一圈，就觉得厌烦。"

    # game/script.rpy:35341
    old "I lifted my body up with both hands, all while thinking about how much I wanted to stay on that bed."
    new "我双手撑起身子，满脑子都是自己还想继续躺在那张床上的念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:35351
    old "Stay."
    new "留下。"

    # game/script.rpy:35354
    old "Go find Sai."
    new "去找 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:35357
    old "Wireframe"
    new "线框"

    # game/script.rpy:35368
    old "The huge mountain had a delicate structure. A single modification could collapse it beyond repair."
    new "那座巨大的山体结构精巧，只要改动一处，就可能彻底崩塌、无法复原。"

    # game/script.rpy:35369
    old "To prevent that, the structure could be partially frozen.{w} But that wasn't all. It could also be reshaped."
    new "为避免这种情况，可以先将结构局部冻结。{w} 不过，还不止这些。它也能被重新塑形。"

    # game/script.rpy:35376
    old "Reshaped in a way so that all would connect firmly and so that causality was maintained."
    new "重塑的方式，要让各部分牢固衔接，同时保住因果。"

    # game/script.rpy:35386
    old "Shiroya and Atsuki stayed in the attic. Sai had gone to the crystal floor, but they didn't follow him down."
    new "Shiroya 和 Atsuki 留在阁楼里。Sai 去了水晶层，他们却没有跟下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:35391
    old "Shiroya let out a sigh."
    new "Shiroya 叹了口气。"

    # game/script.rpy:35392
    old "They had no strength left, so they kept resting, trying to ignore what was happening around them."
    new "两人都已没了力气，便继续歇着，尽量不去理会周围发生的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:35398
    old "Closing their eyes on top of a bed would quickly begin to allow them to temporarily divorce from reality, and no noise prevented it."
    new "只要他们躺在床上合上眼，很快便能暂时脱离现实，而周围也没有任何声响来打扰。"

    # game/script.rpy:35399
    old "Very soon, both of them had abandoned consciousness."
    new "没过多久，两人便都失去了意识。"

    # game/script.rpy:35400
    old "For a long time, stillness persisted, and even if sound could have been sensed, there was none."
    new "长久的寂静持续着。即便侧耳倾听，也听不到任何声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:35407
    old "Atsuki woke up. His mouth was dry, and the ceiling light shined brightly on his eyes. Soon, though, he understood why he was awake."
    new "Atsuki 醒了。他口干舌燥，天花板上的灯刺眼地照着他的眼睛。不过，他很快就明白自己为什么会醒。"

    # game/script.rpy:35410
    old "Faint noises were sporadically reaching his ears. He looked down and saw Shiroya sleeping very close to him, but he refrained from alerting her."
    new "细微的声响断断续续传入耳中。他低下头，见 Shiroya 就睡在自己身旁，便没有出声叫醒她。"

    # game/script.rpy:35411
    old "His unconscious mind had taken the liberty of waking him up upon the smallest perception, so he waited warily to see if he could discern what the noises were."
    new "潜意识在察觉到一丝动静时便擅自把他唤醒，于是他警惕地等着，想辨清那究竟是什么声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:35412
    old "However, the answer revealed itself. After some quiet seconds, Atsuki saw the door's handle turning, and once it had opened, a recognizable figure behind it."
    new "然而答案自己出现了。安静了几秒之后，Atsuki 看见门把手转动；门一开，门后站着的是一个他认得的身影。"

    # game/script.rpy:35417
    old "Atsuki, Shiroya, come to the living room. I need to show you something."
    new "Atsuki，Shiroya，到客厅来。我有东西给你们看。"

    # game/script.rpy:35420
    old "Immediately after tossing out that mysterious request, Sai walked away."
    new "丢下这句没头没尾的话，Sai 转身就走。"

    # game/script.rpy:35424
    old "\"Hm...\" As Atsuki tried to process the almost surreal way in which Sai had shown up, Shiroya's moaning made him turn to her waking face."
    new "「嗯……」Atsuki 还没从 Sai 那近乎梦幻的现身里回过神来，Shiroya 的一声轻哼便让他转头看向她初醒的脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:35429
    old "Was that Sai...? What did he want?"
    new "刚才那是 Sai 吗……？他找我们做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:35434
    old "Did you hear him? He told us to go to the living room, that he had something to show us, and went back there."
    new "你听见他说的了吧？他让我们去客厅，说有事要给我们看，然后就先回去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35440
    old "Shiroya yawned, but she couldn't help the intrigue. Sai had only called for both of them, and nobody from the opposite bedroom could be heard."
    new "Shiroya 打了个哈欠，却还是按捺不住好奇。Sai 只叫了他们两人，对面卧室里也听不到任何动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:35445
    old "Then, as he hadn't come back, they forced their tired bodies to stand up and attentively walked to the hallway."
    new "随后，见他迟迟没有回来，两人强撑着疲惫的身体起身，小心翼翼地走向走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:35446
    old "The door to the living room was closed. Atsuki pushed it inward and hesitantly glanced in."
    new "客厅的门关着。Atsuki 把门向内推开，迟疑地朝里看了一眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:35451
    old "Sai wasn't there.{w} However, on the sofa, a recognizable shining egg lay, next to the many footprints that indicated someone had walked on that floor very recently."
    new "Sai 并不在那里。{w}可沙发上却放着一个眼熟的发光的蛋，旁边还有许多脚印，显然不久前有人在这块地板上走过。"

    # game/script.rpy:35457
    old "Sai, where the hell are you...?"
    new "Sai，你到底在哪儿……？"

    # game/script.rpy:35458
    old "Atsuki and Shiroya slowly stepped forward, confirming that he was neither there nor in the staircase. The Sekimeiya, presented without context, must have been what Sai had wanted to show them."
    new "Atsuki 和 Shiroya 缓缓走上前，确认他既不在这里，也不在楼梯那边。这个被不明不白放在这里的 Sekimeiya，想必就是 Sai 想让他们看的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:35459
    old "As Sai had seemingly vanished, both of them wondered whether he'd intended for them to activate it."
    new "Sai 像是凭空消失了，两人不由得猜想，他是不是想让他们启动它。"

    # game/script.rpy:35467
    old "That thought was denied when footsteps came from the hallway. Turning around, they saw Sai standing plainly in front of them."
    new "这个念头很快被打消——走廊里传来了脚步声。两人回过头，只见 Sai 就站在他们面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:35468
    old "Well, there it is. I brought it here from the crystal floor. It wasn't even well-hidden."
    new "喏，就是它。我从水晶层把它带了过来。它藏得也不算严实。"

    # game/script.rpy:35475
    old "He had found it. Nonetheless, what Atsuki and Shiroya wondered was why he'd brought it there."
    new "他确实找到了。可Atsuki和Shiroya想不通的是，他为什么把它带到这里来。"

    # game/script.rpy:35481
    old "I don't know how what I'm about to say will sound, but I think I have come to understand what this thing really does."
    new "我不知道接下来的话听起来会怎样，但我想，我大概已经弄明白这东西真正能做什么了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35492
    old "The Sekimeiya... Whatever it is, it can do much more than making one travel through time.{w} I don't think I should just explain to you two. I've had time to learn how it functions, and it's incredible."
    new "Sekimeiya……不管它是什么，它能做到的都远不止让人穿越时间。{w}我觉得不该只靠口头解释。我已经花时间摸清了它的运作方式，而它实在不可思议。"

    # game/script.rpy:35497
    old "Atsuki and Shiroya could hardly reply. Was Sai telling the truth? They'd found out the Sekimeiya had the power to make one travel back in time, but had they failed to notice the true extent of its capabilities?"
    new "Atsuki和Shiroya几乎答不上话。Sai说的是真的吗？他们确实已经知道Sekimeiya拥有让人回到过去的力量，可难道一直没察觉它究竟能做到什么地步？"

    # game/script.rpy:35504
    old "Speechless from the anticipation, they followed Sai to the hallway. He'd picked up the gemstone without making direct contact with it. There, everyone was called."
    new "两人期待得说不出话，跟着Sai来到走廊。他没有直接碰到那颗宝石，就把它拿了起来。到了走廊，他把所有人都叫了过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:35505
    old "Erina and Isla had fallen asleep; Akaro watched with concern, sitting on the lowest bed in the other bedroom. When everyone reunited in the hallway, Sai repeated the same thing he'd told Atsuki and Shiroya."
    new "Erina和Isla已经睡着了；Akaro坐在另一间卧室的最下铺，担忧地注视着。众人在走廊里会合后，Sai又把对Atsuki和Shiroya说过的话重复了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:35511
    old "\"What the fuck does that mean? What else can the Sekimeiya do?\" Akaro was the first to react strongly to such an assertion."
    new "「这他妈是什么意思？Sekimeiya还能做什么？」Akaro最先对这番话作出了强烈反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:35517
    old "That's what I will show you. However, I have my reasons to not explain what I don't want to."
    new "这一点，我会让你们亲眼看到。不过，我不想解释的部分，自有我的理由。"

    # game/script.rpy:35522
    old "Again, what the hell does that mean?"
    new "这又他妈是什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:35523
    old "It means that if, after this, you don't want to believe what I'm saying, it won't be my problem."
    new "意思是，这之后你们若仍不愿相信我说的话，那就与我无关了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35529
    old "Everyone was confused by Sai's attitude. What was he trying to accomplish, exactly?"
    new "Sai的态度让所有人都摸不着头脑。他究竟想做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:35534
    old "However, I'll make sure you believe me. The Sekimeiya's powers are much greater than you think."
    new "不过，我会让你们相信我的。Sekimeiya的力量远比你们想象的更强大。"

    # game/script.rpy:35540
    old "Sai opened the door to the right bedroom."
    new "Sai推开了右侧卧室的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:35545
    old "Just so nobody thinks I'm trying to pull something, you can check whether there's anything strange in this bedroom."
    new "为了不让你们以为我在耍什么花招，你们可以检查一下这间卧室里有没有什么异常。"

    # game/script.rpy:35550
    old "...What could there be?"
    new "……能有什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:35551
    old "I don't know, but it's so that you don't try to find objections later."
    new "我不知道。不过这样一来，你们之后就没法再挑毛病了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35557
    old "Even though nobody understood what exactly Sai was getting at, Shiroya, Atsuki, and Akaro followed his suggestion. Both levels of the bedroom were inspected, and nothing stood out."
    new "尽管没人明白Sai到底想说什么，Shiroya、Atsuki和Akaro还是照他的话做了。卧室上下两层都检查过了，没发现任何异常。"

    # game/script.rpy:35563
    old "All right, good. It seems you're all eager to see what this thing can do. Unfortunately, you won't see it directly. The cameras aren't recording, so nobody will."
    new "好，很好。看来你们都很想看看这东西能做什么。可惜，你们不会亲眼看到。摄像头没有在录像，所以谁都不会看到。"

    # game/script.rpy:35568
    old "Sai, still holding the glowing gem, took a couple steps into the bedroom and left it on the floor. Then, he approached the door and closed it from the inside."
    new "Sai 仍拿着那颗发光的宝石，往卧室里走了几步，把它放在地板上。随后，他走到门边，从里面把门关上。"

    # game/script.rpy:35572
    old "\"I will now lock the bedroom.\" From the other side of the door, Sai proceeded to set the chain. In the hallway, everyone exchanged dumbfounded looks."
    new "「我现在要把卧室锁上。」门的另一侧，Sai动手挂上了门链。走廊里，众人面面相觑，满脸错愕。"

    # game/script.rpy:35573
    old "Lastly, Sai locked the door with its key, which he got from one of the drawers."
    new "最后，Sai用从抽屉里翻出的钥匙锁上了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:35574
    old "I am about to touch the Sekimeiya to travel to the past."
    new "我这就去碰Sekimeiya，穿越回过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:35575
    old "Faint footsteps came from inside the bedroom, which very shortly ceased. The next thing they heard was a door opening behind them."
    new "卧室里传来轻微的脚步声，但很快就停了。紧接着，身后传来了开门声。"

    # game/script.rpy:35581
    old "There we go. Now the Sekimeiya's isolated inside. It will do everything by itself."
    new "好了。现在Sekimeiya被单独关在里面了。剩下的一切，它会自己完成。"

    # game/script.rpy:35582
    old "Sai had come from the opposite bedroom, where Atsuki and Shiroya had been sleeping."
    new "Sai是从对面卧室过来的，Atsuki和Shiroya之前就在那里睡觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:35583
    old "I traveled a few seconds to the past, from room to room."
    new "我穿越到了几秒前，从一间房来到了另一间房。"

    # game/script.rpy:35589
    old "...Wh-What the fuck are you even doing?"
    new "……你、你到底在搞什么鬼？"

    # game/script.rpy:35594
    old "Atsuki, why don't you search me?"
    new "Atsuki，来搜我的身吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:35599
    old "...Search you?"
    new "……搜身？"

    # game/script.rpy:35604
    old "Check that I have nothing on me. For the same reason."
    new "检查我身上有没有东西。理由和刚才一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:35609
    old "Atsuki gave a sigh of frustration but conceded."
    new "Atsuki无奈地叹了口气，还是照做了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35610
    old "Aside from the personal belongings in one of his back pockets, Sai didn't have anything else."
    new "除了一个后袋里的随身物品，Sai身上没有别的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:35613
    old "However, Atsuki noticed something."
    new "不过，Atsuki注意到了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:35618
    old "Is your watch not working?"
    new "你的表不走了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:35624
    old "It isn't. It stopped working earlier, unfortunately, so we won't be able to measure the time.{w} Anyway, I'm glad you're all following along. Now, Isla, mind telling me a number?"
    new "确实不走了。很遗憾，它早些时候就停了，所以我们没法计时。{w}总之，你们能跟得上就好。那么，Isla，能说一个数字吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:35630
    old "A number...? Why?"
    new "数字……？为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:35631
    old "You'll see."
    new "待会儿你就知道了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35632
    old "Hm, nine?"
    new "嗯，九？"

    # game/script.rpy:35637
    old "Nine? I was expecting a longer one, but that's fine."
    new "九？我还以为你会说个更长的数字呢，不过也行。"

    # game/script.rpy:35640
    old "Shiroya, say a letter."
    new "Shiroya，说一个字母。"

    # game/script.rpy:35646
    old "Huh...?{w} C."
    new "哎……？{w}C。"

    # game/script.rpy:35651
    old "Perfect. Now we have to wait."
    new "很好。接下来只能等了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35652
    old "Wait for what?"
    new "等什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:35653
    old "For the Sekimeiya to work. I bet you'd all assumed it had to be touched to activate it."
    new "等 Sekimeiya 起作用。我猜你们都以为，非得碰到它才能启动吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:35659
    old "...I don't think any of us are following. What will the Sekimeiya do, exactly?"
    new "……我看我们谁都没听明白。Sekimeiya 究竟会做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:35664
    old "Actually, I'm not completely sure myself. It can do anything, so we'll see.{w} Some time from now, it will make a sound. That'll tell us it's worked."
    new "说实话，我自己也不完全确定。它什么都能做，所以等着看吧。{w}过一阵子，它会发出一点声响。那就说明它起作用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35665
    old "\"Some time from now\"? Nobody understood yet what Sai was talking about or why he was doing anything they were seeing."
    new "「过一阵子」？还没人明白 Sai 在说什么，也不明白他为什么要做眼前这些事。"

    # game/script.rpy:35666
    old "It shouldn't take very long. If I'm right and understand how the Sekimeiya functions, it won't take many minutes."
    new "应该不会太久。只要我对 Sekimeiya 的运作方式没判断错，几分钟之内就会有结果。"

    # game/script.rpy:35669
    old "Since it was clear that Sai wouldn't explain himself further, everyone decided to continue humoring him and waited."
    new "Sai 显然不打算再多作解释，众人也只好继续顺着他，等了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:35670
    old "...What kind of sound would the Sekimeiya make? Everyone's senses had sharpened, but meanwhile, the silence was pure."
    new "……Sekimeiya 会发出怎样的声响？众人的感官都已绷紧，四下却静得彻底。"

    # game/script.rpy:35675
    old "Oh, I didn't mention it, but obviously, this door is now completely locked. Both the chain and the lock are in effect."
    new "对了，我还没提，不过显而易见，这扇门现在已经彻底锁死了。门链和门锁都生效了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35676
    old "A couple minutes had gone by when Sai pointed out that part of the setup."
    new "过了两三分钟，Sai 才提起这个布置。"

    # game/script.rpy:35682
    old "He grabbed the handle and tried to open the door to demonstrate that it wasn't possible."
    new "他握住门把手，试着开门，证明这确实打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:35687
    old "It doesn't matter much, but you can see that I'm not lying about this."
    new "这无关紧要，不过你们能看到，我在这点上没撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:35692
    old "Atsuki repeated what Sai had attempted and confirmed that the door couldn't be opened."
    new "Atsuki 照着 Sai 试了一遍，确认门确实开不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35699
    old "So, currently, we have no way to enter this roo—"
    new "所以，目前我们没有任何办法进入这个房——"

    # game/script.rpy:35704
    old "Oh, fuck. Actually, I might've overlooked something."
    new "操。等等，我好像漏了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:35708
    old "For the first time, Sai looked uncertain. He rapidly turned around and opened the opposite bedroom."
    new "Sai 第一次露出没把握的样子。他急忙转身，打开了对面那间卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:35709
    old "When he came back, he had a key in his hand."
    new "回来时，他手里多了一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:35714
    old "I forgot both bedrooms had a key. This one shouldn't work, though, right?"
    new "我忘了这两间卧室各有一把钥匙。不过这把应该开不了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:35715
    old "Nobody was sure."
    new "谁也说不好。"

    # game/script.rpy:35720
    old "Sai inserted the key into the keyhole, but he couldn't turn it."
    new "Sai 把钥匙插进锁孔，却拧不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:35725
    old "All right, it doesn't work. Good, so the lock is effective."
    new "行，开不了。很好，说明锁确实管用。"

    # game/script.rpy:35729
    old "After that brief interlude, the standby was resumed. It had been confirmed that they had no way to open the door, which told everyone that, somehow, it was going to open. Otherwise, the Sekimeiya would get stuck on the other side."
    new "这段小插曲过后，众人重新开始了等待。门确实打不开，这一点已经得到确认——也正因如此，大家反而明白，它总归会以某种方式打开。否则，Sekimeiya 就要被困在门的那一边了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35736
    old "...How much longer are we gonna wait?"
    new "……咱们还得等多久？"

    # game/script.rpy:35741
    old "You don't have much patience, do you? We're waiting for magic to occur, and it's only been a few minutes. The exact time, even I don't know."
    new "你还真是没耐心。我们等的可是奇迹发生，才过了几分钟而已。具体要等多久，连我也不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:35747
    old "It almost felt ridiculous, but they kept waiting, wondering if Sai was just messing with them. About ten minutes had gone by."
    new "这几乎显得有些荒唐，可他们还是等着，心里怀疑 Sai 是不是在耍他们。十来分钟就这么过去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35755
    old "\"There it is.\"{w} A metallic sound startled everyone but Sai. They stared at the locked door, as it had come from behind it."
    new "「来了。」{w}一声金属轻响，除 Sai 外所有人都被吓了一跳。他们盯着那扇锁着的门——声音正是从门后传来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:35763
    old "Hey, look. Didn't this change?"
    new "喂，看。这个是不是变了？"

    # game/script.rpy:35764
    old "Everyone looked at Sai's palm. A key was on it, but everyone recognized it looked slightly different than it had moments prior. It wasn't the wrong one anymore."
    new "众人看向 Sai 的掌心。那里躺着一把钥匙，可大家都看得出，它和片刻前不太一样了。它已经不再是那把开不了的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:35768
    old "...Are you just fucking with us? What, did the key appear in your hand out of nowhere?"
    new "……你他妈是在耍我们吧？怎么，钥匙凭空出现在你手里了？"

    # game/script.rpy:35773
    old "No, Akaro, that's not it. It modified the other key. That's one of the powers the Sekimeiya possesses. That sound was the cue that it did what I thought it would do."
    new "不，Akaro，不是那样。它把另一把钥匙改成了这样。这是 Sekimeiya 拥有的能力之一。那声响就是信号，说明它做的和我想的一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:35778
    old "Sai didn't give anyone else a chance to object, opting to insert the key into the keyhole. He swiftly turned it, and the door unlocked with a small click."
    new "Sai 没给其他人出言反对的余地，径直把钥匙插进锁孔。他利落地一拧，锁芯咔哒一声，门开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35785
    old "You remember the chain as well, right? Don't think that bypassing it is something the Sekimeiya isn't capable of."
    new "门链你们也记得吧？别以为绕过门链这种事，Sekimeiya 做不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:35786
    old "Once the main lock had been removed, Sai pushed the door open."
    new "主锁一解开，Sai 便推开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:35789
    old "No resistance prevented him from doing so; the chain wasn't set anymore."
    new "没有任何东西拦住他——门链没有扣上。"

    # game/script.rpy:35790
    old "As he kept slowly opening the door, everyone thought the same thing: Sai was putting on a show. Nobody knew why, but they'd come to understand him enough to be certain of that."
    new "他慢慢把门推开，众人心里想的都是同一件事：Sai 在演戏。没人知道原因，但他们已经足够了解他，可以确定这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:35794
    old "When the entire bedroom came into view, so did the most important thing inside. On the floor, where the Sekimeiya had been, there was only a square piece of paper."
    new "整间卧室出现在眼前，里面最重要的东西也一并看清。地板上原本放着 Sekimeiya 的位置，只剩一张方形纸片。"

    # game/script.rpy:35799
    old "Isla, do you mind going to pick that up?"
    new "Isla，能麻烦你去把它捡起来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:35802
    old "Curious, she took tiny steps into the room. She bent down to grab the paper and turned it around. Then, she read the black letters written on it."
    new "她满心好奇，小步走进房间，弯腰拾起那张纸，翻了过来，随后读出上面写着的黑色字迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:35807
    old "...9C. That's what it says."
    new "……9C。上面写着这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:35814
    old "...Is that it? Did the Sekimeiya hear the number and letter... and it materialized that?"
    new "……就这样？Sekimeiya 听到了数字和字母……然后就把它变出来了？"

    # game/script.rpy:35820
    old "Atsuki tried not to laugh. Not particularly because he found that unbelievable, but because of what Sai's entire charade had led to."
    new "Atsuki 忍着笑。倒不是因为他觉得这事难以置信，而是因为 Sai 这一整场戏最终造成了这样的结果。"

    # game/script.rpy:35825
    old "He took the liberty of going to the second level, where he didn't immediately see the Sekimeiya either, nor anything of importance."
    new "他自行上了二楼，在那里同样没立刻看到 Sekimeiya，也没看到任何要紧的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:35831
    old "You're all wondering where the Sekimeiya is, right? Don't worry, I'll tell you.{w} After it does something that requires more power than usual, it teleports to its cabinet. I'm not sure why yet, but it's what I learned.{w} You'll see. Follow me."
    new "你们都在想 Sekimeiya 到哪儿去了吧？别急，我告诉你们。{w}它完成一件比平时需要更多力量的事之后，就会传送到自己的展示柜里。原因我还不清楚，但这是我查到的。{w}你们看就知道了。跟我来。"

    # game/script.rpy:35836
    old "Sai exited the room. As his show hadn't ended, the rest followed him, still unsure how to feel."
    new "Sai 走出了房间。他的表演还没结束，众人便跟了上去，一时不知该作何感想。"

    # game/script.rpy:35850
    old "They walked to the crystal floor and entered the event room. When the cabinet was uncovered, they could clearly see what was inside. Not only that, but the cabinet was locked."
    new "一行人来到水晶层，走进活动室。展示柜的遮布一揭开，里面的东西便看得一清二楚。不仅如此，柜子还上了锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:35857
    old "There you have it. That's a glimpse of what the Sekimeiya can do."
    new "就是这么回事。刚才那一幕，不过是 Sekimeiya 能力的一角。"

    # game/script.rpy:35862
    old "...Why have you done all this, though?"
    new "……可你做这些，到底是为了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:35863
    old "Rather than being amazed, Atsuki asked what everyone had been wondering."
    new "Atsuki 没有惊叹，而是问出了所有人心中的疑问。"

    # game/script.rpy:35872
    old "To demonstrate all your misconceptions regarding the Sekimeiya. However, as I said, I didn't want to detail exactly how it works. That's why I did it in a way so that you could witness it without understanding it fundamentally."
    new "为了展示你们对 Sekimeiya 的种种误解。不过，就像我说的，我不想细说它的运作方式。所以我才用了这种办法——让你们亲眼看到，却无法从根本上看懂。"

    # game/script.rpy:35873
    old "This thing possesses immense power, and I can't reveal what I learned about it. We can't take it out of here again."
    new "这东西蕴藏着巨大的力量，我了解到的东西不能公开。我们不能再把它带出这里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35878
    old "...You said you demonstrated all our misconceptions, but I can easily think of a way you could've done this by simply traveling to the past."
    new "……你说你把我们所有的误解都演示了出来，可我不费力气就能想出办法：你只要穿越到过去，就足以做到这一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:35888
    old "Isn't it obvious? Now, all you have to do is activate the Sekimeiya.{w} If you really understand how it works, you can make it send you to the past and to the locked bedroom. There, you'll leave the piece of paper and make the noise we heard. Before we enter, you'll touch the Sekimeiya and vanish from the room, once again to the past.{w} That could be why you locked the door, so that we wouldn't open it immediately after hearing the noise. You definitely didn't prove that the Sekimeiya is able to materialize a piece of paper.{w} ...It's true that it might've teleported from the attic to this cabinet after that. That's the most believable part of what you're claiming, though."
    new "这不是明摆着的吗？现在你只要激活 Sekimeiya 就行。{w}如果你真懂它的原理，就能让它把你送回过去，送到那间上锁的卧室。你在那里留下纸条，弄出我们听到的声响。趁我们还没进门，你碰一下 Sekimeiya，从房间里消失，再次回到过去。{w}你锁门大概就是这个缘故——免得我们一听见声音就立刻开门。你根本没有证明 Sekimeiya 能凭空变出一张纸。{w}……在那之后，它确实有可能从阁楼传送到这个展示柜里。不过，这也是你那些说法里最可信的一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:35895
    old "Sai looked surprised."
    new "Sai 露出惊讶的神色。"

    # game/script.rpy:35900
    old "How about this, then? I will never touch the Sekimeiya again. I promise that."
    new "那这样如何？我不会再碰 Sekimeiya 一下。这一点我保证。"

    # game/script.rpy:35905
    old "...You promise?"
    new "……你保证？"

    # game/script.rpy:35910
    old "Yes. As I said, we should leave it in this cabinet and never take it out until the shutter opens. If I never touch it, I can't do what you're speculating."
    new "是。我说过了，我们应该把它留在展示柜里，在卷帘门打开之前绝不取出来。只要我不碰它，你推测的那些事我就做不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35915
    old "What will you do, then? Travel to the past without touching it? Maybe that's possible."
    new "那你打算怎么办？不碰它就能穿越到过去？说不定真能做到。"

    # game/script.rpy:35917
    old "No, no. You don't understand. I will never travel to the past again. Everything's already over, and the Sekimeiya did it all.{w} Listen, Atsuki. I can prove that what you said didn't happen. If it had, another version of myself would have to be somewhere in the tower right now. Let's confirm that version of me doesn't exist."
    new "不不，你没明白。我不会再穿越到过去了。一切都已经结束，都是 Sekimeiya 干的。{w}听好了，Atsuki。我可以证明你说的那些没有发生。如果真发生了，此刻塔里某处就该有另一个我。我们去确认一下，那个我并不存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:35922
    old "\"Wait.\" Shiroya objected.{w} \"I can think of another way, if we're supposed to believe what you're saying now.\""
    new "「等等。」Shiroya 出言反对。{w}「如果真要信你现在说的，我还能想出另一种办法。」"

    # game/script.rpy:35923
    old "\"Another way\". Underwhelmingly, what Sai had intended to be confirmation of the Sekimeiya's more extensive powers could be refuted with more than one method."
    new "「另一种办法」。Sai 本想借这一点确认 Sekimeiya 的力量更为广大，谁知能推翻它的办法不止一种，未免有些扫兴。"

    # game/script.rpy:35924
    old "It's possible you'll really never travel to the past again, but another version of you could.{w} I remember when you made Atsuki and me go to the living room. Back then, you weren't there, and you appeared from the hallway. What if that was already another version of you?{w} If you lured us out of the bedroom, your original version could go in there to hide under the bed. From there, you heard what we were talking about in the hallway, \"9C\".{w} That version of you will travel to the past and appear inside the bedroom, where you'll leave the note. Then, you'll use the Sekimeiya to go back to the past again, and you'll appear before us in the living room to play out the rest."
    new "也许你真的不会再穿越了，但另一个你却可以。{w}我记得你让 Atsuki 和我去客厅那次。当时你不在，是从走廊里出现的。那说不定已经是另一个你了？{w}要是你把我们引出了卧室，原本的你就能进屋，躲到床底下。你在那里听见了我们在走廊里说的「9C」。{w}那个你会穿越到过去，出现在卧室里，留下字条。然后你再用 Sekimeiya 回到过去，在客厅里出现在我们面前，把剩下的戏演完。"

    # game/script.rpy:35929
    old "Did you even hear me? If that's what happened, another version of myself should still exist somewhere! Let's see whether we can find him."
    new "你到底听没听我说话？如果真是那样，另一个我现在就该还在某处！我们去找找，看能不能找到他。"

    # game/script.rpy:35934
    old "Not necessarily. If that other version of yours got out from under the bed and hurried here when we saw the note, he could've already traveled to the past."
    new "未必。要是另一个你在我们看到字条的时候就钻出床底，赶到了这里，那他可能早已穿越回去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35939
    old "You're pissing me off a little. How about this? That didn't happen either."
    new "你有点惹火我了。那这样吧。那些也没发生过。"

    # game/script.rpy:35944
    old "And you can prove that? I'm not exactly sure what you did, but was it just to make us believe that you have a great understanding of the Sekimeiya and get us not to take it out of the cabinet again?"
    new "这你也能证明？我不太清楚你到底做了什么，但你的目的，不就是让我们相信你对 Sekimeiya 了如指掌，好让我们不再把它从展示柜里取出来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:35945
    old "Yes. You're not wrong about that."
    new "没错。这一点你说对了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35946
    old "Well, I can give you a third way you could've accomplished this by just traveling to the past."
    new "那好，我还能给你第三种做法——同样只需要你回到过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:35949
    old "Atsuki explained it with a casual voice."
    new "Atsuki 语气随意地解释起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:35950
    old "Like I said, what I could believe is that the Sekimeiya can teleport itself. If you really came to understand how that works...{w} I remember when you claimed you forgot about the key to the other bedroom, but I don't believe you really did. That could've easily been an excuse to disappear from our sight. After all, you asked to be searched, but only before you entered the other bedroom.{w} It's possible you got both keys from that room and initially only showed us one. However, it's also possible the Sekimeiya had teleported there.{w} You touched it and went to the past, to the right bedroom. You placed the note and touched the Sekimeiya before it teleported away. You went back in time and appeared in the second level of the left bedroom. This way, as soon as you entered it, the version of yours who'd already placed the note got out, and you showed us the wrong key when you'd already done everything."
    new "就像我说的，我能接受的是——Sekimeiya 能传送自己。如果你真的弄懂了它的运作方式……{w}我记得你说过忘了另一间卧室的钥匙，可我不信你真忘了。那很可能只是个借口，好从我们眼前消失。毕竟你主动让我们搜身，却偏偏是在进那间卧室之前。{w}你完全可能从那个房间里拿到两把钥匙，起初只拿出一把给我们看。不过，也有可能是 Sekimeiya 传送到了那里。{w}你碰了它，回到过去，到了右边那间卧室。你放下字条，趁 Sekimeiya 还没传送走，又碰了它。你回到过去，出现在左边卧室的二层。这样一来，你一走进卧室，那个已经放好字条的你便出来了；而你给我们看那把错钥匙的时候，其实一切都已经做完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:35953
    old "Aren't you forgetting something?"
    new "你是不是忘了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:35963
    old "The noise. How would I have done that?"
    new "那声响呢？那一步我又是怎么做到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:35968
    old "Oh, I see.{w} ...I said you traveled to the past before the Sekimeiya teleported away, which must have been before we heard the noise. However, there are two ways around this.{w} One, the Sekimeiya teleported itself to the past after you made the noise. That would solve it, if it's possible.{w} Two, the Sekimeiya teleported itself to the opposite bedroom and then back to the initial one. That's how you could've stayed there for longer and made the sound."
    new "哦，我明白了。{w}……我刚说你在 Sekimeiya 传送离开之前回到了过去，而那一定发生在我们听到声响之前。不过，这一点有两种绕开的办法。{w}其一，Sekimeiya 是在你弄出声响之后才把自己传送到过去的。只要这能做到，问题就解决了。{w}其二，Sekimeiya 先把自己传送到对面那间卧室，再传回原来那间。这样你就能在那里多待一阵，把声音弄出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:35973
    old "...How about this? That didn't happen either. You're just wrong.{w} In fact, I really did overlook that the other bedroom had a key as well. That was not part of what I intended to do."
    new "……那这样吧。那些也没发生。你就是想错了。{w}事实上，我确实没注意到另一间卧室也有钥匙。那并不在我原本的计划之内。"

    # game/script.rpy:35980
    old "\"I don't think so.\" Next, it was Akaro who objected."
    new "「我看未必。」这回反对的是 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:35981
    old "After all, your silly trick ended with \"the wrong key transformed into the correct one\". That couldn't have happened unless you had the wrong key, meaning you knew from the start you'd go to the other bedroom to pick it up."
    new "毕竟你那套把戏，最后就是「错的钥匙变成了对的钥匙」。你手里要不是那把错钥匙，这根本不可能发生——也就是说，你从一开始就知道自己要去另一间卧室取钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:35986
    old "God. That was not part of the plan at all! All I knew was that the right key would appear on me after the Sekimeiya's sound. I didn't know it would transform the wrong one."
    new "天哪。那根本不在计划之内！我只知道 Sekimeiya 响过之后，正确的钥匙会出现在我身上。我并不知道它会把那把错的变过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:35989
    old "That's very hard to believe."
    new "这话实在难以让人相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:35990
    old "Shiroya had one last input."
    new "Shiroya 最后又补了一句。"

    # game/script.rpy:35997
    old "I bet the way you locked the room from the inside was part of your trick too. You set the chain and then locked the door with the key.{w} That created the illusion that the Sekimeiya removed the chain, but it could've been as simple as you taking it out right after locking the door. It's not like we would've noticed."
    new "我敢说，你从里面锁门的手法也是把戏的一部分。你先挂上门链，再用钥匙锁门。{w}这样就造成了 Sekimeiya 取下门链的假象，可实际上，你完全可能只是锁完门之后把链子摘了下来。我们反正也注意不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:36002
    old "...I actually didn't think about that.{w} However, I didn't do it."
    new "……这一点我倒真没想到。{w}不过，我没有那么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:36003
    old "I also bet the reason behind the \"we have to wait for the Sekimeiya to make a sound\" was so you could properly time whatever you did. You had to wait a specific amount of time for it to function."
    new "我还敢说，你之所以讲「必须等 Sekimeiya 发出声响」，是为了让你做的每一步都能掐准时机。你得等上一段特定的时间，它才会生效。"

    # game/script.rpy:36008
    old "Incorrect."
    new "不对。"

    # game/script.rpy:36009
    old "And you can prove all of this?"
    new "这些你都能证明？"

    # game/script.rpy:36012
    old "By doing it again."
    new "再做一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:36019
    old "Annoyed, Sai asked for the key to the cabinet. Everyone was still intrigued, so they agreed to let him unlock it."
    new "Sai 被惹得心烦，开口要展示柜的钥匙。众人好奇心未消，便同意让他开锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:36023
    old "He picked up the Sekimeiya without touching it with his skin and left the room."
    new "他拿起 Sekimeiya 时没让皮肤直接碰到它，随后走出了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:36031
    old "Let's go back up."
    new "我们上去吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:36036
    old "You're going to do the same thing again? Can you not do it in the bathrooms?"
    new "你还要再来一遍？能不能别在浴室里做？"

    # game/script.rpy:36041
    old "I can, but that's not as aesthetic."
    new "可以，但那样就谈不上美感了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36046
    old "A few eyes rolled, but they followed Sai up to the attic. Once again, everyone was in front of the two bedroom doors."
    new "有几个人翻了个白眼，但还是跟着 Sai 上了阁楼。所有人又一次聚在那两扇卧室门前。"

    # game/script.rpy:36051
    old "Atsuki entered the right one and checked the drawer. The key wasn't there."
    new "Atsuki 走进右边那间，拉开抽屉查看。钥匙不在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:36057
    old "If the wrong key transformed into the right one, how come the original one isn't here?"
    new "要是那把错的钥匙变成了对的，那原来那把怎么不在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:36062
    old "Because we can't have two of the same, dumbass. Come here."
    new "因为同样的钥匙不可能有两把，蠢货。过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:36071
    old "So that you don't think any other self of mine is hiding nearby, go ahead and verify that."
    new "免得你以为我还有别的分身藏在附近，你去查就是了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36076
    old "You realize it could just appear after we search, right?"
    new "你该明白，它也可能等我们搜完之后才出现吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:36084
    old "Erina and Isla saw the rest dispersing through the attic and shortly coming back, claiming not to have found anyone."
    new "Erina 和 Isla 看着其余人散进阁楼各处，很快又陆续回来，都说没找到人。"

    # game/script.rpy:36089
    old "Repeating his past movements, Sai stepped into the right bedroom and placed the Sekimeiya on the floor, close to the door."
    new "Sai 重复着先前的动作，走进右边的卧室，把 Sekimeiya 放在靠近门口的地板上。"

    # game/script.rpy:36095
    old "There, he stood in silence."
    new "他站在那里，一言不发。"

    # game/script.rpy:36097
    old "What are you waiting for?"
    new "你在等什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:36102
    old "I'm thinking about the best way to do this so that you don't have a hundred excuses later."
    new "我在想怎么做才最妥当，免得你们事后又找出一百个借口。"

    # game/script.rpy:36104
    old "He remained in thought for a couple minutes. Then, looking composed, he walked to the door and closed it from the inside."
    new "他沉思了几分钟，随后神色自若地走到门边，从内侧把门关上。"

    # game/script.rpy:36109
    old "I will only set the chain this time so that Shiroya abandons her idiotic idea."
    new "这次我只挂上链条，好让 Shiroya 打消她那荒唐的念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:36110
    old "As Sai spoke, only one thought filled Atsuki's brain: \"I know what you want to do.\""
    new "Sai 说这话时，Atsuki 脑中只剩下一个念头：「我知道你想做什么。」"

    # game/script.rpy:36111
    old "He'd purposely left Sai a way out by ignoring one last way in which he could've achieved the same result."
    new "他故意忽略了最后一种能达成同样结果的办法，等于给 Sai 留了一条退路。"

    # game/script.rpy:36112
    old "Careful not to alert him, Atsuki walked to the light switch and turned off the light in the hallway."
    new "Atsuki 生怕惊动他，悄悄走到开关旁，关掉了走廊的灯。"

    # game/script.rpy:36115
    old "What he had in mind was very simple: Sai would fake his travel. He'd claim to be about to touch the Sekimeiya to lock the room from the inside and appear outside. However, he wouldn't actually touch it."
    new "他的想法很简单：Sai 会假装自己完成了穿越。他会声称要碰一下 Sekimeiya，从内侧锁上房间，然后出现在门外。可实际上，他根本不会去碰它。"

    # game/script.rpy:36116
    old "Instead, he would stay in the bedroom. That way, he would hear what was being talked about in the hallway."
    new "相反，他会留在卧室里，这样就能听见走廊上的人在说什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:36117
    old "At some point, after having written the note, he would touch the Sekimeiya and go minutes back to the past. He would appear somewhere in the attic and claim he'd just set the chain and traveled out of the room, when in reality he would have already left the note.{w} Then, he would ask for the specific number and wait out the time he'd spent in the bedroom before opening the door and finding the note."
    new "写好纸条之后，他会再碰一下 Sekimeiya，回到几分钟前。他会出现在阁楼的某处，声称自己刚挂好链条、从房间里穿越出来——可实际上，那时纸条早就放好了。{w}接着，他会问出那个具体数字，再等够他待在卧室里的那段时间，然后开门发现纸条。"

    # game/script.rpy:36121
    old "All right, it's set. Now I will touch the Sekimeiya and appear in the past, outside the bedroom."
    new "好，挂好了。现在我要碰一下 Sekimeiya，出现在过去，卧室门外。"

    # game/script.rpy:36122
    old "Atsuki gestured at everyone to keep quiet, and he'd also closed every other door in the hallway. By shutting off the light, he wanted to reveal Sai's trick."
    new "Atsuki 示意众人噤声，走廊上其余的每一扇门他也都关上了。他关掉灯，就是想揭穿 Sai 的把戏。"

    # game/script.rpy:36123
    old "He looked down. From under the door, light was seen, as the bedroom was illuminated. However, what Atsuki had achieved was highlighting Sai's shadow."
    new "他低下头。门缝下透出光来——卧室里亮着灯。可 Atsuki 这么一关灯，反倒把 Sai 的影子衬得更清楚了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36127
    old "His body was blocking the light from going through the entire gap. That was how Atsuki intended to expose him. If that shadow didn't instantly disappear, he could prove Sai hadn't teleported out of the bedroom."
    new "他的身体挡住了光，光没能从整条门缝透出来。Atsuki 正打算借此揭穿他：只要那道影子没有立刻消失，就能证明 Sai 并没有从卧室传送出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:36134
    old "Sai took two steps into the room, but his shadow was still acting as a barrier for the ceiling light. Atsuki wanted to verify Sai's bluff and quickly turn the light back on. He was certain that a future version of him was nearby after already placing the note.{w} If he could know what Atsuki was doing, it was possible his idea would retroactively fail. However, Atsuki was confident that'd still prevent Sai from completing his setup without a hole."
    new "Sai 往房里走了两步，影子依旧挡着顶灯的光。Atsuki 想验证他是否在虚张声势，便迅速把灯重新打开。他确信，Sai 未来的某个分身已经放好纸条，就在附近。{w}如果那个分身能知道 Atsuki 正在做什么，他的计划就有可能被追溯推翻。不过 Atsuki 相信，即便如此，也足以让 Sai 的布置留下破绽。"

    # game/script.rpy:36135
    old "Like the last time, after two steps, the sound faded. The Sekimeiya was on the floor, but near the door. Therefore, even though Sai had to crouch to activate it, his shadow would still be visible from the other side."
    new "和上次一样，脚步声在两步之后消失了。Sekimeiya 就放在地板上，但离门很近。所以，尽管 Sai 必须蹲下才能启动它，他的影子依然能从门外看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:36136
    old "Atsuki stared down. The gap was very thin, and certainly not big enough to see through. As such, using Sai's shadow was all he could do."
    new "Atsuki 低头盯着门缝。缝隙极窄，根本不足以看清里面。他能依靠的，也只有 Sai 的影子。"

    # game/script.rpy:36139
    old "Sai's steps were purposely audible. However, that time, they took longer to cease, and bigger gaps were between them. Before crouching, the shadow moved left and right, as if in thought. It seemed like Sai was conscious of his movements."
    new "Sai 的脚步声是故意让人听见的。可这一次，脚步声持续得更久，间隔也更长。蹲下之前，那道影子左右晃动着，像是在思索。看来 Sai 在刻意控制自己的动作。"

    # game/script.rpy:36144
    old "I'm about to touch it."
    new "我要碰了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36151
    old "But despite his confidence, Atsuki saw it unmistakably: the shadow disappeared in an instant. It hadn't moved away—it had vanished."
    new "然而，尽管他信心十足，Atsuki 却看得清清楚楚：那道影子瞬间消失了。它不是移开，而是凭空不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36154
    old "Disconcerted, Atsuki still managed to react properly. He dashed to the light switch and turned it on."
    new "Atsuki 心中一惊，却还是及时反应过来，冲到开关前把灯打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:36158
    old "Instants later, the door to the living room opened."
    new "片刻之后，通往客厅的门开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36165
    old "Oh, right. I appeared here this time since we just came from the crystal floor."
    new "哦，对了。这次我出现在这里，因为我们刚从水晶层过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:36173
    old "All right, let's do this again."
    new "好，我们再来一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:36178
    old "Atsuki tried not to look frustrated, as Sai didn't seem to have noticed what he'd attempted."
    new "Atsuki 竭力不露出挫败的神色，因为 Sai 似乎并没有察觉他刚才的举动。"

    # game/script.rpy:36184
    old "What Atsuki had tried made sense. He had assumed the least important part of Sai's show was what the trick had relied on. However, he'd been incorrect."
    new "Atsuki 的尝试并非没有道理。他以为这场表演里最不起眼的部分，正是戏法所依赖的关键。可他错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36185
    old "The only reason Sai had done that had been for the spectacle; to be able to claim that the Sekimeiya had unset the chain. In no way had that part been necessary to accomplish the result."
    new "Sai 那么做，只是为了做戏——为了能宣称 Sekimeiya 解开了链条。那一步对达成结果毫无必要。"

    # game/script.rpy:36186
    old "It had not been a deception. Right after setting the chain and locking the door, Sai had touched the Sekimeiya and traveled to the past, outside the bedroom. By doing that, he'd left both levels of the bedroom truly devoid of life.{w} That was why Atsuki's very first solution had been that Sai would, in the future, travel to the past again and appear inside the right bedroom after it had been locked."
    new "那并不是骗局。挂好链条、锁上门之后，Sai 立刻碰了 Sekimeiya，穿越到过去，落在卧室门外。这样一来，卧室的上下两层就真的空无一人。{w}正因如此，Atsuki 最先想到的解法是：Sai 会在之后再次穿越回过去，出现在上锁后的右边卧室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:36188
    old "Yet, that was also wrong. To make that note appear, Sai wouldn't travel back to the bedroom. As a matter of fact, he hadn't done it before they'd seen it either. Incidentally, nobody had, or ever would, as he'd worked alone."
    new "但这个想法同样是错的。为了让那张纸条出现，Sai 并不需要穿越回卧室。事实上，在他们看到纸条之前，他也没有这么做。顺带一提，别人既没做过，将来也不会做——因为这一切都是他独自完成的。"

    # game/script.rpy:36191
    old "So he was more frustrated than he looked by the way Atsuki had acted. He hated feeling like someone was being superior to him."
    new "所以，Atsuki 刚才的举动让他比表面看起来更恼火。他讨厌被人压过一头的感觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:36197
    old "Sai approached the door and grabbed its handle. When he turned it, a chain prevented him from opening the door."
    new "Sai 走到门边，握住门把手。一转之下，门链拦着，门打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:36198
    old "The chain is set, see? You didn't want me to also lock the door from the inside, so I'll do it from here."
    new "门链挂好了，看到了吧？你们不想让我从里面把门也锁上，那我就在这里锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:36199
    old "Sai made his left hand a fist and slowly opened it up as if it were a flower."
    new "Sai 左手握拳，又缓缓摊开，像一朵绽开的花。"

    # game/script.rpy:36200
    old "A key was on his palm."
    new "掌心里躺着一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:36205
    old "You're a clown."
    new "你个小丑。"

    # game/script.rpy:36211
    old "Am I, Akaro? Because you seem very interested to figure out how exactly the Sekimeiya works."
    new "哦？是吗，Akaro？可你看起来倒是很想弄清楚 Sekimeiya 到底是怎么运作的。"

    # game/script.rpy:36212
    old "What the fuck are you talking about?"
    new "你他妈在说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:36213
    old "Sai ignored him and inserted the key into the keyhole. Then, he turned it."
    new "Sai 没有理他，把钥匙插进锁孔，转动了一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:36219
    old "Why are you locking the door if it's already locked from the inside?"
    new "门已经从里面锁上了，你还上锁做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:36224
    old "Because the chain provides a gap you can see through. I don't want anyone seeing how the Sekimeiya writes on a note."
    new "因为挂上门链后会留出一道能往里看的缝隙。我不想让人看见 Sekimeiya 是怎么在纸上写字的。"

    # game/script.rpy:36231
    old "Don't worry. This time, I won't go anywhere. Let's do what we did before, then.{w} Isla, give me three numbers from one to nine."
    new "放心，这次我哪儿也不会去。那就照之前那样做吧。{w} Isla，从一到九里给我三个数。"

    # game/script.rpy:36237
    old "\"Hang on. I'll give you the three numbers.\" Atsuki didn't want to give him any way out."
    new "「等一下，三个数由我来给。」Atsuki 不想给他留任何余地。"

    # game/script.rpy:36242
    old "That's fine by me."
    new "我无所谓。"

    # game/script.rpy:36243
    old "But Atsuki didn't open his mouth. Just like Sai, he formed one fist, following with the other."
    new "但 Atsuki 没有开口。他像 Sai 一样，先握起一只拳头，再握起另一只。"

    # game/script.rpy:36244
    old "Then, he stuck out two fingers. Next, six, and finally, nine. Those had been his three numbers."
    new "接着，他伸出两根手指。然后是六，最后是九。这就是他给出的三个数。"

    # game/script.rpy:36249
    old "...{w}Oh, certainly, Atsuki.{w} We can do it like this."
    new "……{w}哦，当然可以，Atsuki。{w}那就这么办。"

    # game/script.rpy:36251
    old "Atsuki had done that to prevent something they'd mentioned earlier. If another version of Sai had appeared nearby, he could not have heard the numbers. All the doors were closed, so Atsuki's hands couldn't have been seen either."
    new "Atsuki 这么做，是为了防止他们先前提到过的那种情况。万一附近出现了另一个 Sai，他也听不到这几个数。门全都关着，Atsuki 的手同样不会被人看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:36252
    old "Now, do not speak about them or move in any way."
    new "现在，不要提到那几个数，也不要做出任何动作。"

    # game/script.rpy:36257
    old "Sai nodded as he smirked."
    new "Sai 嘴角一扬，点了点头。"

    # game/script.rpy:36268
    old "Do we also have to wait a random amount of time?"
    new "我们也要随便等上一段时间吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:36273
    old "A random amount of time? We'll see."
    new "随便等一段时间？看情况吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:36274
    old "Even if they weren't sure of the real reason, everyone next to Sai felt in some way that he was trying to deceive them. However, his attitude was beginning to feel imposing."
    new "即使说不清真正的缘由，围在 Sai 身边的每个人多少都觉得，他是在欺骗他们。然而，他的态度已渐渐透出一股压迫感。"

    # game/script.rpy:36275
    old "Did he truly want to leave the Sekimeiya in the cabinet? That couldn't be. So, then, what exactly had he figured out?"
    new "他真打算把 Sekimeiya 留在展示柜里？不可能。那么，他到底算出了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:36276
    old "Atsuki had asked for silence so that his three numbers wouldn't be transmitted to anyone within reach. Because of that, everyone waited silently, and for longer than before."
    new "Atsuki 要求大家保持沉默，好让他那三个数不会传到附近任何人耳中。于是众人都沉默地等着，比上一次等得更久。"

    # game/script.rpy:36277
    old "Ten minutes had gone by, and everyone started to realize that they'd surpassed the previous endpoint."
    new "十分钟过去了，众人渐渐意识到，他们已经超过了上次的终点。"

    # game/script.rpy:36289
    old "...54, 55, 56..."
    new "……54、55、56……"

    # game/script.rpy:36290
    old "Sai began to whisper very quietly so that only the people right next to him could hear him, puzzling them."
    new "Sai 开始极小声地低语，只有紧挨着他的人才听得见，这让他们摸不着头脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:36291
    old "...57, 58, 59...{w=0.9}{nw}"
    new "……57、58、59……{w=0.9}{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:36298
    old "Seventeen. I had to count internally since my watch doesn't work, but it's been seventeen minutes since we began to wait."
    new "十七分钟。我的表不走了，只能自己在心里数。从我们开始等起，已经过了十七分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:36304
    old "Seventeen minutes. 2 + 6 + 9.{w} Remember when you said I'd waited an arbitrary amount of time to time everything properly? I'm glad I can now be certain I understand exactly how to use the Sekimeiya."
    new "十七分钟。2 + 6 + 9。{w}你之前说，我是随意等了一段时间，才把时间点掐准的吧？好在现在我可以确定，我已经彻底弄清 Sekimeiya 该怎么用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36311
    old "Sai inserted the key into the keyhole and unlocked the door. When he tried to push it open, the chain didn't stop him, as it was no longer set."
    new "Sai 把钥匙插进锁孔，打开了门锁。他推门时，门链没有拦住他——门链早已没有扣上。"

    # game/script.rpy:36316
    old "The Sekimeiya unfastened the chain, right?"
    new "是 Sekimeiya 把门链解开的，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:36321
    old "Was it you?{w} Are you my accomplice who helped me do this? If not, I'm open to alternatives."
    new "是你吗？{w}你就是帮我做成这件事的共犯？若不是，我也愿意听听别的说法。"

    # game/script.rpy:36326
    old "Six pairs of eyes saw the identical scene. The Sekimeiya had disappeared, and a small piece of paper had appeared on the floor."
    new "六双眼睛看到了同一幕景象。Sekimeiya 消失了，地板上多出一小片纸。"

    # game/script.rpy:36328
    old "Isla walked over to it and picked it up."
    new "Isla 走过去，把它捡了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:36338
    old "She showed it to the others."
    new "她拿给其他人看。"

    # game/script.rpy:36339
    old "2969292692926696969292926292692996929692..."
    new "2969292692926696969292926292692996929692……"

    # game/script.rpy:36340
    old "The three numbers Atsuki had chosen filled up the entire surface of the paper."
    new "Atsuki 选的那三个数，密密麻麻写满了整张纸。"

    # game/script.rpy:36345
    old "Attempting not to look flustered, he made his way to the second level of the bedroom, but there was nothing of importance to be seen."
    new "他竭力不露出慌乱，走上卧室的上一层，但那上面没有任何要紧的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:36351
    old "Like before, after it was done, the Sekimeiya produced that sound and teleported to its cabinet on the crystal floor."
    new "和上次一样，事成之后，Sekimeiya 发出那个声音，传送回了水晶层上的展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:36355
    old "The second time, that claim was harder to believe, as they'd just come from there. On the way down, it was much more difficult for everyone to find an explanation for what Sai had done."
    new "这一次，那番说法更难让人相信了，毕竟他们刚从那里下来。下楼途中，大家更难想通 Sai 是怎么做到的了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36363
    old "When they arrived at the event room, they saw the same thing as before."
    new "到了活动室，他们看到的情景和之前一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:36368
    old "\"We didn't even lock it after we took it out, right?\" Atsuki noticed the arrow on the side of the cabinet was pointing to \"locked\"."
    new "「我们把它拿出来之后，根本没上锁吧？」Atsuki 注意到展示柜侧面的指针指向了「已上锁」。"

    # game/script.rpy:36373
    old "We didn't. It might be hard to take in, but the Sekimeiya did. That's what I intended to happen."
    new "确实没锁。这也许难以接受，但锁是 Sekimeiya 上的。这正是我想要的结果。"

    # game/script.rpy:36378
    old "...Are you just fucking joking? What's this, a magical stone that can do anything?"
    new "……你他妈是在开玩笑吧？这算什么，一块什么都办得到的神奇石头？"

    # game/script.rpy:36383
    old "You thought it could only make one go back in time? Would that be much better?"
    new "你以为它只能让人回到过去？那样就好接受多了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:36399
    old "However, there's still the principal way in which you could've accomplished this that only requires you traveling to the past."
    new "不过，还是有一个主要的办法，只需要你回到过去就能做到这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:36404
    old "Correct. It's possible that, in the future, I'll go back to the past and appear in the locked bedroom. Then, I'll write that note and touch the Sekimeiya, which will send me farther to the past."
    new "没错。有可能，将来的我会回到过去，出现在锁着的卧室里。然后写下那张字条，再触碰 Sekimeiya，让自己被送到更早的过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:36409
    old "But that will not happen. I purposely left this method possible so that you believe my intentions—that I sincerely don't want the Sekimeiya to be taken out of this cabinet again. ...That could go horribly."
    new "但那不会发生。我故意让这个办法始终可行，就是为了让你们相信我的意图——我是真心不希望 Sekimeiya 再被拿出这个展示柜。……否则后果会不堪设想。"

    # game/script.rpy:36412
    old "My wristwatch doesn't work anymore, and I don't know if I can fix it.{w} We have no other way to look at the time. It'll be hard, but we'll spend every minute left together so that I can't go to the past and explain this your way."
    new "我的手表不走了，也不知道能不能修好。{w}我们再没有别的办法看时间。这会很辛苦，但接下来的每一分钟，我们都要待在一起，这样我就无法回到过去，按你们说的那种方式解释这一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:36413
    old "Additionally, before that, we can search the whole tower to make sure the version of me that this method would've left behind doesn't exist."
    new "另外，在那之前，我们先把整座塔搜一遍，确认这个办法本该留下的那个我并不存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:36414
    old "Once this happens, you will understand. That there's no other way I could've done this but what I'm saying. This is only a glimpse of what the Sekimeiya's capable of. That... I'm sure of."
    new "等这一切发生，你们就会明白。除了我说的这个办法，我不可能有别的方式做到这件事。这不过是 Sekimeiya 能力的一角。这一点……我确信。"

    # game/script.rpy:36422
    old "Nobody could find words to reply with, let alone object with."
    new "没有人找得出话来回应，更别说反驳了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36427
    old "So, as Atsuki's way out still seemed to exist, they went with Sai's proposition. The seven floors of Ashiya Tower were inspected, and nobody was found. Not any other self of Sai, and not Naomi either."
    new "于是，既然 Atsuki 指出的那条路似乎仍然存在，他们便采纳了 Sai 的提议。芦屋塔的七层楼都查过一遍，一个人也没找到。没有另一个 Sai，也没有 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:36428
    old "Before the search had started, Sai had taken the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet and brought it with them, so nobody could've used it in the meantime."
    new "搜查开始前，Sai 已把 Sekimeiya 从展示柜里取出，随身带着，因此这段时间里谁也不可能用到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:36430
    old "...What if, after touching the Sekimeiya in the bedroom, Sai would appear outside the tower? Not even that would explain everything, and it could be avoided as long as they stayed with him."
    new "……万一 Sai 在卧室里碰到 Sekimeiya 之后，会出现在塔外呢？可就算那样，也解释不了所有事；而且只要一直跟他待在一起，就能避免这种情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:36434
    old "So, lastly, they had to wait. After locking the attic behind them, they sat on the floor of the event room. They positioned the curtain so that it wouldn't fall down, providing a constant view of the glass."
    new "于是，剩下的只有等待。他们锁好阁楼，在活动室的地板上坐下。他们把遮布摆好，免得它垂下来，好让自己始终看得见那面玻璃。"

    # game/script.rpy:36435
    old "The idea to save Miiya... didn't go anywhere. During the following hours, it was a surreal silence that everyone shared."
    new "救 Miiya 的念头……最终没有下文。接下来的几个小时里，众人只是共同守着一片近乎不真实的沉默。"

    # game/script.rpy:36436
    old "There were no tricks left. The few times anyone had to go to the bathroom, it was made sure nothing else happened. Finally, they'd managed to wait until {time=21}, keeping the cold in the cabinet sealed."
    new "再也没有别的办法了。有几次有人要去洗手间，众人也都确保没有别的事发生。最后，他们总算熬到了 {time=21}，而展示柜中的那股寒气始终被封存着。"

    # game/script.rpy:36442
    old "Noise came from the lobby. Without a doubt, the time had come."
    new "门厅里传来响动。毫无疑问，时间到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36446
    old "The police rushed in and found everyone sitting in the event room. They were hastily taken outside and put in a police car."
    new "警察冲了进来，发现所有人都坐在活动室里。他们被匆匆带出去，塞进了一辆警车。"

    # game/script.rpy:36447
    old "Without hesitation, Ashiya released a public statement."
    new "芦屋毫不犹豫地发布了公开声明。"

    # game/script.rpy:36448
    old "Nothing has been taken. Everything is safe, including the Sekimeiya."
    new "没有任何东西失窃。一切都安然无恙，包括 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:36456
    old "However, word began to circulate in the underworld:"
    new "然而，地下社会开始流传起这样一种说法："

    # game/script.rpy:36457
    old "Ashiya are lying. They do not have the Sekimeiya. We do."
    new "芦屋在撒谎。Sekimeiya 不在他们手上，在我们手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:36458
    old "\"We\" referred to Xyn."
    new "所谓「我们」，指的便是 Xyn。"

    # game/script.rpy:36459
    old "The more that rumor extended, the more it strengthened, as Xyn continually stated they were in possession of the Sekimeiya."
    new "流言传得越广，就越发坐实——因为 Xyn 一再声称 Sekimeiya 就在他们手中。"

    # game/script.rpy:36460
    old "The general consensus of the appearance is right: pure white and shaped like an egg. However, notice that Ashiya haven't shown the Sekimeiya since the incident. Why do you think they haven't?"
    new "对它的外形，公认的说法并没有错：通体纯白，形状如蛋。不过请注意，自那次事件以后，芦屋就再没展示过 Sekimeiya。各位想想，他们为什么不展示？"

    # game/script.rpy:36462
    old "It was a very fair question, which led everyone to be certain that, once again, Xyn had outsmarted Ashiya."
    new "这个问题问得很有道理，众人因此更加确信：Xyn 又一次棋高一着，把芦屋压了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:36463
    old "Nonetheless, a new question shortly arose."
    new "然而没过多久，又有一个新问题冒了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:36464
    old "\"Is Xyn going to prove it?\""
    new "「Xyn 会拿出证据吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:36469
    old "Weeks had gone by. Petitions to show the Sekimeiya bombarded Ashiya, but reaching Xyn wasn't as simple. Yet, after the initial statements, neither party had proven their ownership of the Sekimeiya."
    new "几周过去。要求展示 Sekimeiya 的呼声铺天盖地地涌向芦屋，可要联系上 Xyn 却没那么容易。而自最初的声明之后，双方都没能证明自己拥有 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:36470
    old "And, from one point onward, the Sekimeiya had become a myth. Neither Ashiya nor Xyn spoke again about the incredibly valuable gemstone they'd once claimed to possess."
    new "而从某一刻起，Sekimeiya 成了一个传说。无论芦屋还是 Xyn，都不再提起那颗他们曾声称拥有的无价宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:36471
    old "Only a handful of people were known to have witnessed the Sekimeiya by themselves during the time they'd been locked in Ashiya Tower. However, after being talked to, none of them had valuable information to share."
    new "据说，在他们被困于芦屋塔的这段时间里，亲眼见过 Sekimeiya 的只有寥寥数人。可问过之后，谁都没能提供有价值的信息。"

    # game/script.rpy:36472
    old "And still, many people thought they knew the truth. Many people thought that something must've happened during the twelve hours they'd spent shut away with the mysterious Sekimeiya, whose whereabouts were unknown."
    new "但仍有不少人自认知道真相。许多人相信，他们与那个下落不明的神秘 Sekimeiya 一同被关在塔里的那十二个小时中，必定发生过什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:36473
    old "After all, something must, in fact, have happened."
    new "毕竟，确实发生过什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:36474
    old "Something that had caused the disappearance of a female staff member who wouldn't be seen ever again."
    new "正是那件事，让一名女职员就此失踪，从此再没有人见过她。"

    # game/script.rpy:36475
    old "Ending: Altered Dichotomy"
    new "结局：Altered Dichotomy"

    # game/script.rpy:36506
    old "A Hole in the Earth"
    new "大地之洞"

    # game/script.rpy:36516
    old "...All right. ...Let's go."
    new "……好吧。……走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:36520
    old "I stood up slowly so that I didn't lose my balance. I waited a few seconds for my blood pressure to adjust and opened my eyes once the dizziness had faded."
    new "我缓缓起身，免得失去平衡。等了几秒，让血压缓过来，头晕退去之后才睁开眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:36525
    old "I'm sorry, I can go alone."
    new "抱歉，我一个人去就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:36526
    old "...No, don't worry."
    new "……不用，别在意。"

    # game/script.rpy:36527
    old "I forced a yawn before walking to the hallway, where all the doors were closed."
    new "我勉强打了个哈欠，才走向走廊。那里的每一扇门都关着。"

    # game/script.rpy:36536
    old "I'm pretty sure he didn't come back, at least."
    new "至少我敢肯定，他没回来过。"

    # game/script.rpy:36541
    old "Atsuki opened the other bedroom. Katei was lying on the bed while Akaro was farther back, sitting on the floor. As soon as they heard us, they faced us reflexively."
    new "Atsuki 打开了另一间卧室。Katei 躺在床上，Akaro 则靠里坐在地上。一听到我们的动静，两人便下意识地转向我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:36542
    old "...Uh, is Sai up top?"
    new "……呃，Sai 在上面吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:36547
    old "What? No, he isn't. Is he not with you?"
    new "什么？不在啊。他没跟你们在一起？"

    # game/script.rpy:36557
    old "...No? That's what we thought."
    new "……不在？我们还以为他跟着你们呢。"

    # game/script.rpy:36558
    old "I'm pretty sure he went down."
    new "我敢肯定他下去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36563
    old "...What the hell is that idiot doing?"
    new "……那蠢货到底在搞什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:36567
    old "Annoyed, Katei stood up, followed by Akaro. Behind us, we heard another sound."
    new "Katei 恼火地站起身，Akaro 也跟着起来。这时，身后又传来一声响动。"

    # game/script.rpy:36572
    old "...Did anything happen?"
    new "……出什么事了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:36573
    old "Erina was peeking down from the hatch of the other bedroom. Isla immediately appeared behind her, looking sleepy."
    new "Erina 正从另一间卧室地板上的开口往下探头。Isla 随即出现在她身后，一副没睡醒的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:36579
    old "Sai really doesn't want to leave us be. He's taking this as a joke."
    new "Sai 还真是没完没了。他根本把这事当成玩笑。"

    # game/script.rpy:36584
    old "What could he want, though? Does he not realize being alone could be dangerous?"
    new "可他到底想干什么？难道不知道一个人待着很危险？"

    # game/script.rpy:36585
    old "I don't think he trusted Atsuki's search. He might have wanted to verify it himself."
    new "我猜他并不相信 Atsuki 的搜查结果。也许他想亲自确认一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:36586
    old "I can't believe that kid. He's stepping over every line."
    new "真拿那小子没办法。他把规矩一条条都踩在脚下了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36602
    old "Are you two coming as well?"
    new "你们两个也一起来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:36603
    old "I'd rather that than stay alone. We should've all been in the same room. ...I'll go to the bathroom first."
    new "与其一个人待着，还不如跟你们一起。本来大家就该待在同一个房间里。……我先去趟洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:36609
    old "You're right about that."
    new "这话说得没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:36618
    old "He was the one who had allowed Sai to leave, but nobody said anything else until we got to the crystal floor. The center of the building had adopted a sinister aura, one that I could only tolerate as long as I wasn't alone."
    new "放 Sai 离开的正是他，可直到我们抵达水晶层，谁都没有再开口。建筑中央弥漫着一股不祥的气息，只要不是孤身一人，我勉强还受得住。"

    # game/script.rpy:36630
    old "What...? You all smell this too, right?"
    new "什么……？你们也都闻到了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:36635
    old "Yes, it's stronger here."
    new "嗯，这边的味道更重。"

    # game/script.rpy:36636
    old "Immediately, something else became clear: Sai had been there."
    new "随即，另一件事也变得清楚了：Sai 来过这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:36643
    old "A few doors in hallway A hadn't been closed. The same applied to hallway B, although not as many."
    new "A走廊有几扇门没关上。B走廊也是如此，只是数量少一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:36650
    old "Is he in any of them? Can you hear him?"
    new "他是在其中一间吗？听得到他的动静吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:36651
    old "There was no sound to be perceived. As I'd said, it was very possible he'd wanted to search through the floors, unable to believe Atsuki."
    new "听不到任何声响。正如我先前所说，他很可能是不肯相信 Atsuki，才想逐层搜一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:36654
    old "Akaro entered the cleaning room while Atsuki and Katei walked up to the closest crystal rooms. I didn't have it in me to look anywhere, so I stayed behind with Erina and Isla."
    new "Akaro 进了清洁间，Atsuki 和 Katei 则走向最近的水晶展室。我提不起劲去任何地方查看，便和 Erina、Isla 留在了原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:36656
    old "Everyone seemed tired, stressed, and burned out. I no longer cared a single bit about what Sai could've been doing. I waited passively until the three of them returned from the rooms they'd entered."
    new "每个人都是一副疲惫、紧绷、心力交瘁的样子。Sai 究竟在做什么，我已经一点也不在意了。我只是干等着，直到他们三人从各自进去的房间回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:36657
    old "However, when Katei came out of room B6, I questioned my vision again."
    new "可是，当 Katei 从 B6房间走出来时，我又一次怀疑起自己的眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:36660
    old "I wasn't hallucinating. Even though his outfit was white as well, I could see that he was holding the Sekimeiya, making little to no contrast."
    new "我没有看错。他的衣服同样是白的，可我仍看得出他手上拿着 Sekimeiya，两者几乎看不出区别。"

    # game/script.rpy:36665
    old "What the hell...!? This thing is seriously burning!"
    new "搞什么……！？这东西烫得厉害！"

    # game/script.rpy:36666
    old "He looked to be in pain even though his long sleeves were acting as protection for his skin."
    new "虽然长袖护着皮肤，但他看上去仍然痛得不轻。"

    # game/script.rpy:36671
    old "Oh, what? Was it there?"
    new "咦，什么？它就在那儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:36672
    old "Yes...! It was just stashed inside one of the cabinets."
    new "对……！就塞在其中一个展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:36677
    old "What? How come it wasn't found before, then?"
    new "什么？那之前怎么一直没被发现？"

    # game/script.rpy:36678
    old "I have no clue!"
    new "我怎么会知道！"

    # game/script.rpy:36683
    old "...I don't either."
    new "……我也不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:36685
    old "Atsuki appeared sincerely confused despite being the one who'd guaranteed the entire floor was empty. Suddenly, it was confirmed the Sekimeiya hadn't been taken out of the tower. It didn't come as a revelation—I'd never managed to believe it anyway."
    new "Atsuki 曾一口咬定这一层空无一物，此刻却显得真心困惑。Sekimeiya 并未被带出塔外——这一点突然得到了证实。可这算不上什么新发现，我本来就没真正相信过。"

    # game/script.rpy:36690
    old "I need to leave this thing somewhere."
    new "我得找个地方把这东西放下。"

    # game/script.rpy:36698
    old "He indicated for us to hurry into the event room. Anticipating his request, I took the keys out of my purse, failing to remember if the cabinet should've been locked or not."
    new "他示意我们赶紧进活动室。我料到他要什么，便从包里取出钥匙，却记不清那展示柜原本该不该上锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:36706
    old "Y—! You scared the fuck out of me!{w} Holy shit! What the fuck are you doing!? You almost hit me with the door!"
    new "哇——！吓死我了！{w} 搞什么啊！你到底在干什么！？门差点砸到我身上！"

    # game/script.rpy:36712
    old "Don't you think that's a better question for you? What are you doing!?"
    new "这话不是该我问你吗？你在干什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:36717
    old "I'm doing absolutely nothing."
    new "我什么都没干。"

    # game/script.rpy:36725
    old "We turned to Katei, who hadn't interrupted us. He was perplexed, staring at his empty hands."
    new "我们转头看向一直没插话的 Katei。他一脸茫然，盯着自己空空的两手。"

    # game/script.rpy:36730
    old "What's up with you?"
    new "你怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:36735
    old "...Where's the Sekimeiya?"
    new "……Sekimeiya 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:36740
    old "What? I have no—"
    new "什么？我根本没——"

    # game/script.rpy:36741
    old "I-It disappeared. I legitimately felt it disappear."
    new "它、它消失了。我真的感觉到它消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36749
    old "It disappeared from my hands just as Akaro opened the door! I was holding it!"
    new "就在 Akaro 开门的那一刻，它从我手里消失了！我明明拿着它！"

    # game/script.rpy:36754
    old "Whoa, what? Where was it?"
    new "等等，什么？它原本在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:36759
    old "...It was in one of the cabinets."
    new "……在其中一个展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:36760
    old "Did it just vanish? That's what we thought could've happened earlier, right?"
    new "就这么凭空消失了？之前我们不就觉得可能是这么回事吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:36766
    old "Sai spun and looked at the cabinet covered by the curtain. Then, he looked all around the room with a slight frown."
    new "Sai 猛地转身，望向那个盖着遮布的展示柜，然后微微皱眉，扫视了整个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:36768
    old "I was also moderately puzzled. Katei couldn't have been lying. He didn't have the Sekimeiya, it wasn't on the floor, and he couldn't have hidden it anywhere without us seeing it."
    new "我也有些困惑。Katei 不可能在撒谎。他手里没有 Sekimeiya，地上也没有，而我们都看着他，他也没法把它藏到别处。"

    # game/script.rpy:36773
    old "Did it teleport away, just like that? Is that it...?"
    new "难道它就那样传送走了？是这样吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:36774
    old "Katei stretched his hands, still appearing slightly pained."
    new "Katei 伸展了一下双手，脸上仍带着些许痛楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:36779
    old "Sai, answer this first. What were you doing here?"
    new "Sai，先回答这个。你在这里做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:36784
    old "What do you think I was doing? Searching for the Sekimeiya! Do you think I was crazy for doubting Atsuki now?"
    new "你说我在干什么？找 Sekimeiya 啊！现在你还觉得我怀疑 Atsuki 是胡思乱想吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:36789
    old "...{w}I didn't lie, though. I really didn't find the Sekimeiya when I looked for it."
    new "……{w}可我没有说谎。我找的时候，真的没找到 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:36794
    old "Well, it's great that you say that. Where the fuck is it now? Can it just be anywhere?"
    new "你说得倒好听。那它现在到底在哪儿？它难道哪儿都能出现？"

    # game/script.rpy:36800
    old "That shouldn't be the case, right? If it actually disappeared from the mechanical room, that means it appeared in the cabinet where Katei found it. That's not a random place."
    new "不该是那样吧？如果它真的从机械室消失了，那就说明它出现在了 Katei 找到它的那个展示柜里。那可不是随便什么地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:36814
    old "Sai walked to the single cabinet in the room and drew back the curtain. All we saw was a crimson cushion with nothing on it."
    new "Sai 走到房间里唯一的展示柜前，掀开了遮布。只见一块深红色垫子，上面空无一物。"

    # game/script.rpy:36820
    old "Oh, can you tell that the smell disappeared too?"
    new "对了，你们有没有察觉那股味道也消失了？"

    # game/script.rpy:36825
    old "Yeah... It did."
    new "嗯……确实没了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36830
    old "Everyone sniffed the air and realized that Erina was right."
    new "大家嗅了嗅空气，都发觉 Erina 说得没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:36835
    old "It might be gone. Did it disappear along with the Sekimeiya?"
    new "也许真的没了。它是和 Sekimeiya 一起消失的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:36840
    old "I don't know if I can't notice it anymore or if my brain is playing a trick on me."
    new "我不知道是真的闻不到了，还是脑子在骗我。"

    # game/script.rpy:36845
    old "It's at least less noticeable. And yes, you and Sai weren't there, but Atsuki said a while ago that the smell might be coming from the Sekimeiya."
    new "至少是淡了不少。没错，你和 Sai 当时不在场，不过 Atsuki 刚才说过，那股气味可能来自 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:36851
    old "Huh, how bizarre.{w} Are we supposed to look for it now? What the hell. At least we know not to let Atsuki do it."
    new "哈，真是怪事。{w}难道现在还得我们去找？搞什么鬼。至少我们知道不能让 Atsuki 去做。"

    # game/script.rpy:36864
    old "Could it have teleported to one of its previous pla—"
    new "会不会是传送回了它之前待过的某个地方——"

    # game/script.rpy:36870
    old "Hey... What the fuck happened there?"
    new "喂……那儿到底他妈怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:36875
    old "Atsuki was looking at the end of the hallway, where the elevator was."
    new "Atsuki 正望着走廊尽头，电梯就在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:36886
    old "We had to take one more step to see what had rightfully caught his attention."
    new "我们又往前走了一步，才看清究竟是什么吸引了他的注意。"

    # game/script.rpy:36891
    old "What!? Who did this!?"
    new "什么！？是谁干的！？"

    # game/script.rpy:36901
    old "The metallic panel with the elevator button had been ripped off."
    new "电梯按钮所在的金属面板被人撬掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36902
    old "While Katei looked enraged, the rest were speechless. We'd been in hallway C instants earlier."
    new "Katei 满面怒容，其余人则哑口无言。片刻之前，我们还在 C 走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:36908
    old "Naomi...? It can't be, right? She's not here anymore."
    new "Naomi……？不会吧？她已经不在这里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:36913
    old "She's not here? Are you still trusting Atsuki!?"
    new "她不在这儿？你居然还信 Atsuki！？"

    # game/script.rpy:36918
    old "I didn't lie! Go ahead and look for her!"
    new "我没说谎！你们尽管去找她啊！"

    # game/script.rpy:36923
    old "...Why would she take it off?"
    new "……她为什么要拆掉它？"

    # game/script.rpy:36928
    old "Probably so we can't call the elevator, right?"
    new "多半是想让我们没法叫电梯吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:36934
    old "But how?"
    new "可是怎么做到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:36939
    old "How? By unscrewing it, I suppose."
    new "还能怎么，把螺丝拧下来拆的呗。"

    # game/script.rpy:36940
    old "This was done just now. If the idea is to make us unable to use the elevator, it had to be done upstairs too. You all walked down from the attic, right? Maybe it's happening as we speak."
    new "这是刚刚弄的。如果目的是让我们没法用电梯，楼上也得照做。你们都是从阁楼走下来的吧？说不定这会儿正在动手。"

    # game/script.rpy:36943
    old "Sai ran up the stairs, as the person we were up against could've been in reach."
    new "Sai 冲上了楼梯，因为对方可能就在附近。"

    # game/script.rpy:36959
    old "Are you serious...? What the hell is this?"
    new "你认真的……？这到底搞什么鬼？"

    # game/script.rpy:36969
    old "Up to the sixth floor, every panel had been taken off. We'd just walked down through every floor, so it was undoubtable that it had happened very recently."
    new "一直到六楼，所有面板都被拆掉了。我们刚刚才一层层走下来，所以这肯定是刚发生不久的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:36977
    old "I'm not even sure anymore about what I said earlier. Has the smell really faded away? I think it's still here."
    new "我已经不确定自己刚才说的话了。那股气味真的散掉了吗？我觉得它还在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:36983
    old "...{w=0.7}Oh, give me the key."
    new "……{w=0.7}对了，把钥匙给我。"

    # game/script.rpy:36988
    old "Wait, we didn't lock it, did we?"
    new "等等，我们没锁门吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:36994
    old "You're right... I forgot to tell you to lock it because I was annoyed that Sai left."
    new "说得对……我因为 Sai 走了而心烦，忘了提醒你们锁门。"

    # game/script.rpy:36999
    old "Whoa, then someone's definitely in here. Is it time to have a talk with Naomi? I wonder if she knows we can enter."
    new "这么说，里面肯定有人。是不是该和 Naomi 谈谈了？不知道她知不知道我们能进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:37000
    old "I took the keys out of my purse and unlocked the door."
    new "我从包里取出钥匙，打开了门锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:37010
    old "The dark staircase appeared, challenging us to climb it. I was the first to open the door to the living room."
    new "幽暗的楼梯显现在眼前，仿佛在等着我们走上去。我率先推开了客厅的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:37020
    old "...{w}Excuse me?"
    new "……{w}等等。"

    # game/script.rpy:37026
    old "Just look at the floor."
    new "看看地板。"

    # game/script.rpy:37027
    old "I glanced down, and so did Atsuki. As Sai had pointed out, there was one major inconsistency."
    new "我低头看去，Atsuki 也照做。正如 Sai 所指出的，有一处明显不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:37032
    old "Are our footprints gone?"
    new "我们的脚印不见了？"

    # game/script.rpy:37037
    old "If you walked down, you definitely went across this carpet. These few aren't recent at all."
    new "既然走下来，就一定会经过这块地毯。这几个脚印根本不是最近留下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:37038
    old "Marked on the floor, traces of old footprints were discernible, but they couldn't be compared to all the ones we had left before leaving."
    new "地板上依稀能辨认出一些旧脚印，但和我们离开前留下的那些根本没法比。"

    # game/script.rpy:37047
    old "...This is impossible, right? Those marks couldn't have been erased."
    new "……这不可能吧？那些痕迹怎么可能被抹掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:37057
    old "You're right... I don't see my footprints anywhere."
    new "你说得对……我哪儿都看不到自己的脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:37063
    old "This goes way beyond me. We need to find whoever removed the panels, and now."
    new "这已经超出我的理解范围了。我们得立刻找出拆掉面板的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:37071
    old "We ran to the hallway, but something grabbed our attention immediately."
    new "我们跑向走廊，可立刻就有东西吸引了我们的注意。"

    # game/script.rpy:37080
    old "It's even been taken off here?"
    new "连这里的也被拆了？"

    # game/script.rpy:37085
    old "What the..."
    new "搞什么……"

    # game/script.rpy:37086
    old "Katei emerged from the kitchen and looked at the ridiculous state of things."
    new "Katei 从厨房里出来，看着这荒唐的一幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:37092
    old "Why the hell would anyone do this...? We can still access every floor."
    new "到底为什么要干这种事……？我们明明还是能去每一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:37097
    old "I was thinking the purpose could've somehow been to prevent us from entering the attic, but it doesn't make sense if the panel was removed here as well."
    new "我本来在想，目的或许是阻止我们进阁楼；可如果连这里的面板也被拆了，那就说不通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37103
    old "Naomi could be here. Let's make sure we aren't missing her."
    new "Naomi 可能就在这里。仔细找找，别漏了她。"

    # game/script.rpy:37111
    old "Most of us waited in the hallway while Atsuki, Akaro, and Sai inspected every room."
    new "多数人留在走廊等候，Atsuki、Akaro 和 Sai 则逐个房间查看。"

    # game/script.rpy:37117
    old "...Nobody's here."
    new "……这里没人。"

    # game/script.rpy:37122
    old "He's right this time."
    new "这次他说得没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:37128
    old "She's just somewhere downstairs, then."
    new "那她就在楼下某处了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37133
    old "There's one place we definitely need to check: the storeroom. I'll see if the door was opened.{w} The Sekimeiya disappeared out of nowhere, but who knows what else happened with that; your footprints were erased from the living room."
    new "有个地方必须查——储藏室。我去看看那扇门有没有被打开过。{w}Sekimeiya 凭空消失了，可谁知道除此之外还发生了什么。你们的脚印在客厅里被抹掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37134
    old "Everything was getting more unhinged. Somehow, the Sekimeiya hadn't been the primary layer of my thoughts, but that had to change. We had to figure out what we were in the middle of."
    new "一切都越发失控。说来也怪，Sekimeiya 的事竟没有占据我思绪的首要位置，但不能再这样下去了。我们必须弄清楚，自己究竟卷入了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:37137
    old "Atsuki went to the living room."
    new "Atsuki 去了客厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:37147
    old "The screwdriver I saw earlier is still in one of the drawers. ...Also, am I the only one who feels like it's {tip=cold}a little cold{/tip}?"
    new "我之前看到的螺丝刀还在其中一个抽屉里。……还有，只有我觉得{tip=cold}有点冷{/tip}吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37152
    old "Cold...?"
    new "冷……？"

    # game/script.rpy:37153
    old "Nobody else seemed to relate. Exposure to the outside air had chilled my bones early in the morning, and the tower couldn't seem to warm me up well, so I hadn't noticed any change."
    new "似乎没有别人有同感。清早在外头冻进骨子里的寒气还没散，塔里又似乎暖和不起来，所以温度有什么变化，我根本没察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:37154
    old "I guess it's just me."
    new "看来只有我这么觉得。"

    # game/script.rpy:37159
    old "Are you planning to search the whole tower again? Don't think we'll take your word for it this time."
    new "你打算把整座塔再搜一遍？这回可别指望我们会只凭你一句话就信。"

    # game/script.rpy:37168
    old "After disregarding him, Atsuki walked to the staircase. I followed behind him, intrigued."
    new "Atsuki 没有理会他，径直走向楼梯。我来了兴趣，跟在后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:37176
    old "I want to look at the time."
    new "我想看一下时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:37177
    old "...Oh. Why didn't you ask Sai?"
    new "……哦。你怎么不去问 Sai？"

    # game/script.rpy:37184
    old "I looked at his wristwatch, and it said it's {time=13:44.} I want to look at the computer's, though."
    new "我看了一下他的手表，上面显示 {time=13:44.} 不过我想再看看电脑上的时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:37190
    old "Do you know what could've happened with the footprints? That's so weird."
    new "你知道脚印到底是怎么回事吗？太奇怪了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37192
    old "Not at all, really. I think looking at the time could be an indicator, though."
    new "真的一点头绪都没有。不过我觉得，看看时间或许能成为一条线索。"

    # game/script.rpy:37193
    old "And regarding the elevator, I'm just as confused as everyone. I have no idea why anyone would want to make it so that we can't call it."
    new "至于电梯，我和大家一样莫名其妙。我完全想不通，为什么会有人故意让我们叫不了电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:37199
    old "It seems like nobody is following us...{w} What if this was done to keep the Sekimeiya inside the elevator, for example? That's kind of flawed, because they'd have to stop the elevator between two floors and then touch the Sekimeiya to do it. But doing it like that, it'd be stuck inside, and not even the buttons would help you.{w} And even if it could be called with the buttons, we'd have to find them first. That would make the Sekimeiya simply hidden there instead."
    new "看起来没人跟上来……{w}比方说，如果这么做是为了把 Sekimeiya 留在电梯里呢？可这说不通——他们得先把电梯停在两层之间，再碰到 Sekimeiya 才行。可那样一来，东西就困在电梯里了，就算有按钮也没用。{w}而且，就算用按钮能把电梯叫过来，我们也得先找到那些按钮才行。那样的话，Sekimeiya 就只是被藏在那儿罢了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37200
    old "He sounded a little disconcerted. When he went quiet, he stayed that way, looking to be deep in thought until we were on the crystal floor."
    new "他的语气有些不安。说完他便沉默下来，一路若有所思，直到我们抵达水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:37206
    old "I want to see if the BIOS's time matches Sai's wristwatch."
    new "我想看看 BIOS 的时间是不是和 Sai 的手表一致。"

    # game/script.rpy:37228
    old "What...? It's locked."
    new "怎么……？锁上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37229
    old "Locked? Only Katei had the key for this door, right?"
    new "锁上了？这扇门的钥匙不是只有 Katei 有吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37230
    old "Yes. Naomi might be able to enter the attic, but as far as we know, only Katei's key can lock this one."
    new "嗯。Naomi 或许能进阁楼，但据我们所知，能锁上这扇门的只有 Katei 的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:37236
    old "Actually, no. Remember what happened?"
    new "不对，等等。你还记得当时的情形吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37237
    old "I found the key in one of the staircases and we came here, but the door was unlocked to begin with. Then, Katei said his key he'd left inside wasn't there...{w} We assumed it was the same one, but maybe that was wrong. Maybe there were two keys, and one belonged to another employee. I'm not really sure it's that, though. It felt to me like Katei was scanning the floor for something. That's how I found the key in the first place."
    new "我在一处楼梯上捡到钥匙，然后我们来了这里，可那扇门本来就是开着的。后来 Katei 说，他留在里面的钥匙不见了……{w}我们以为那是同一把，但也许想错了。也许有两把钥匙，其中一把属于别的员工。不过我也不太确定是不是这样。当时我觉得，Katei 像是在地上找什么东西——我当初之所以能找到那把钥匙，也是因为留意到他在那样找。"

    # game/script.rpy:37238
    old "So..."
    new "那么……"

    # game/script.rpy:37244
    old "The computer doesn't work. We can't do anything in the security room but look at the time through the BIOS, and it was locked after we figured that out. Maybe it was done to hide the time from us."
    new "电脑坏了。在监控室里，除了通过 BIOS 看时间，我们什么都做不了；而我们刚弄明白这一点，门就被锁上了。也许这么做就是为了不让我们看到时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:37245
    old "No matter which key was used, anyone could've done it. Katei left the key in the drawer, and we all saw that. It should've been as easy as going to pick it up."
    new "不管用的是哪把钥匙，谁都能做到。Katei 把钥匙留在了抽屉里，这是我们亲眼所见。要去拿，本该轻而易举。"

    # game/script.rpy:37246
    old "We don't know how long the door's been locked for, though. I can't try to find a reason behind this when our fucking footprints disappeared from the attic."
    new "可我们不知道这扇门锁了多久。我们的脚印他妈的从阁楼里凭空消失了，这种时候我哪还有心思去追究这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:37250
    old "Irritated, he walked to the storeroom."
    new "他烦躁地走向储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:37251
    old "As he reached the door, Sai came down the stairs."
    new "他刚走到门口，Sai 就从楼梯上下来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37258
    old "Have you let Naomi free already?"
    new "你已经把 Naomi 放了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37263
    old "...I haven't even entered the room yet."
    new "……我还没进房间呢。"

    # game/script.rpy:37268
    old "Then hurry up."
    new "那就快点。"

    # game/script.rpy:37278
    old "Did we leave the movable wall in place?"
    new "我们把活动墙留在原位了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37279
    old "No, I don't think we did."
    new "没有，应该没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:37284
    old "Amazing."
    new "真行啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:37287
    old "Sai demonstrated how to get it to open, and the hidden portion of the room stretched before our eyes."
    new "Sai 示范了打开的方法，房间隐藏的那一部分随之在我们眼前展开。"

    # game/script.rpy:37295
    old "...It's gone."
    new "……不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37309
    old "You know what I'm talking about. The door was opened."
    new "你知道我说的是什么。门被打开过。"

    # game/script.rpy:37314
    old "Should we even trust you?"
    new "我们该信你吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37315
    old "Yes. The door was opened."
    new "该。门被打开过。"

    # game/script.rpy:37320
    old "What that means is that whoever removed the buttons must either be Naomi or the culprit, who can open this door. That's why believing you right now isn't very smart."
    new "也就是说，拆掉按钮的人要么是 Naomi，要么就是能打开这扇门的犯人。所以现在相信你，可不是什么明智之举。"

    # game/script.rpy:37321
    old "Ah."
    new "哦。"

    # game/script.rpy:37322
    old "I don't know what your deal is, but you left the attic without saying anything, and the elevator buttons were taken off as soon as we followed you."
    new "我不知道你到底想干什么，可你一声不吭就离开了阁楼，我们刚跟着你出来，电梯按钮就被人拆掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37328
    old "We don't even know what this \"mark\" of yours on the door is. You could be lying about it to make us think that someone else entered the tower and is responsible for what happened."
    new "我们根本不知道你留在门上的那个“标记”到底是什么。你完全可能是在这上面撒谎，好让我们以为有别人进了塔，该为发生的事负责。"

    # game/script.rpy:37329
    old "Thank you for openly voicing your suspicion, but turn around now. Both of you."
    new "谢谢你把怀疑直说出来。不过现在转过去吧，你们两个。"

    # game/script.rpy:37333
    old "So that I can leave the same mark in case it opens again. It's all we can do. Maybe we should always stay outside the storeroom."
    new "这样万一门再打开，我也能留下同样的标记。我们能做的也只有这个了。也许以后我们就该一直守在储藏室外。"

    # game/script.rpy:37335
    old "Go ahead. I won't do it until you turn around."
    new "转过去吧。你们不转身，我不会动手。"

    # game/script.rpy:37340
    old "We faced hallway B."
    new "我们面向B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:37342
    old "...Are you stupid? You can just turn around again at any second! Just go away."
    new "……你傻吗？你随时都能再转回来！快走开。"

    # game/script.rpy:37347
    old "I sighed and left. Outside, Akaro, Erina, and Isla were walking down the stairs."
    new "我叹了口气，走了出去。外面，Akaro、Erina 和 Isla 正沿着楼梯走下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:37353
    old "Is Sai here?"
    new "Sai 在吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37358
    old "...Yes. He says that the door was opened."
    new "……在。他说门被打开过。"

    # game/script.rpy:37365
    old "It was. I just put another mark on it."
    new "确实开过。我刚又留了一个标记。"

    # game/script.rpy:37366
    old "Really...? We looked through every floor on the way down, and we didn't find anyone."
    new "真的……？我们下来的路上把每一层都查过了，一个人也没找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:37368
    old "I didn't foolishly doubt my memories, but if that was true... Only the crystal floor remained."
    new "我没有蠢到去怀疑自己的记忆，可如果那是真的……那就只剩水晶层了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37375
    old "I believe he stayed in the attic."
    new "我想他留在阁楼了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37380
    old "Are you serious? Why would you leave him alone? Don't you remember he's very likely working with Naomi, who might have just reentered the tower?"
    new "你是认真的吗？为什么把他一个人留下？你难道忘了，他很可能在和 Naomi 联手，而 Naomi 说不定刚回到塔里？"

    # game/script.rpy:37381
    old "Unless she's already gone, there's only this floor left. The Sekimeiya has to be found as well."
    new "除非她已经走了，否则就只剩这一层了。再说，Sekimeiya 也非找到不可。"

    # game/script.rpy:37389
    old "Atsuki entered room A4. We saw him opening up the cabinets and inspecting their interiors."
    new "Atsuki 走进了 A4房间。我们看见他打开一个个展示柜，查看里面的情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:37396
    old "Does he still think we'll believe him?"
    new "他还以为我们会信他？"

    # game/script.rpy:37397
    old "As if a recording of the past were replaying, while we stared in silence, Atsuki kept silently moving."
    new "仿佛过去的一段录像正在重放。我们沉默地看着，Atsuki 则一言不发地继续走动。"

    # game/script.rpy:37403
    old "The doors..."
    new "那些门……"

    # game/script.rpy:37405
    old "They're all closed."
    new "全都关上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37410
    old "Wait, y-you're right...!{w} I left some of them open, didn't I?"
    new "等等，你、你说得对……！{w}我明明留了几扇没关，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:37415
    old "Oh, yes... Some of them were open."
    new "哦，对……是有几扇开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:37416
    old "Honestly, I think they were already like this when we left the event room."
    new "说实话，我觉得我们离开活动室的时候，它们就已经是这样了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37421
    old "We could only be dumbfounded as we followed Atsuki's mesmerizing movements. Something had happened around us, but it felt absurd to think we could know what. Atsuki backtracked toward the elevator and entered the room with the missing gems."
    new "我们只能目瞪口呆地跟在 Atsuki 身后，看他那些令人着迷的动作。周围分明出了事，但要说我们能弄明白是什么，也太荒唐了。Atsuki 折回电梯方向，走进了宝石失窃的那间水晶展室。"

    # game/script.rpy:37426
    old "The second time Atsuki came out of a room, he had the Sekimeiya between his hands. It had been in room A5."
    new "Atsuki 第二次走出房间时，双手捧着 Sekimeiya。它原本在 A5房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:37431
    old "Oh, shit, where was it?"
    new "噢，该死，它原本在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:37438
    old "Like Katei said, inside a cabinet."
    new "就像 Katei 说的，在一个展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:37445
    old "Is that where it teleported to...?"
    new "它就是传送到那里去了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:37450
    old "Hold on, is this normal?{w} Katei said it was burning when he was holding it, and it was hot when I had it too. Now it's not, though."
    new "等等，这正常吗？{w}Katei 说他拿着的时候，它烫得像在烧，我拿着时也很烫。可现在不烫了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37455
    old "Maybe it's not gonna do anything if you touch it now?"
    new "说不定现在碰它也不会有什么反应了？"

    # game/script.rpy:37461
    old "You could try it."
    new "你可以试试。"

    # game/script.rpy:37466
    old "...{w}I'd rather not. Let's leave it in the cabinet."
    new "……{w}还是算了。就把它留在展示柜里吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:37475
    old "What? That's not safe, Isla."
    new "什么？那可不安全，Isla。"

    # game/script.rpy:37480
    old "But now it should be fine, right?"
    new "可是现在应该没关系了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:37481
    old "Isla had been fairly quiet the entire time we'd been trapped, but I could see that some of her unease had receded. She was just a girl who wanted to see an exhibit."
    new "我们受困以来，Isla 一直相当安静，不过我看得出，她的不安已经消退了一些。说到底，她只是个想看看展品的小姑娘。"

    # game/script.rpy:37482
    old "I'm sorry, but I think touching it could be a pretty bad idea. It's, um... Your mom is right."
    new "抱歉，我觉得碰它恐怕很不妥。它，呃……你妈妈说得对。"

    # game/script.rpy:37487
    old "Hm. Okay..."
    new "嗯。好吧……"

    # game/script.rpy:37493
    old "She seemed a bit disappointed but gave up. Atsuki was free to go to the event room, so we all entered after him."
    new "她似乎有些失望，但还是作罢了。Atsuki 动身去了活动室，我们便都跟在他后面走了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:37502
    old "...The cabinet's not locked."
    new "……展示柜没锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:37507
    old "After scrolling open the glass, he placed the Sekimeiya inside and shut it again."
    new "他滑开玻璃罩，把 Sekimeiya 放进去，又合上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37509
    old "Once the glass separated it, Atsuki stood without facing us. We awkwardly waited behind him, thinking he had something to say, but all he ultimately did was lock the cabinet manually."
    new "玻璃合上后，它被隔在了里面，Atsuki 便背对着我们站着。我们有些尴尬地等在他身后，以为他有话要说，可他最后只是手动锁上了展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:37516
    old "Katei's there."
    new "Katei 在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:37523
    old "We looked through the door and saw him by the stairs, looking lost."
    new "我们透过门望去，见他站在楼梯旁，一副茫然若失的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:37530
    old "Here you are!"
    new "原来你们在这儿！"

    # game/script.rpy:37535
    old "We found the Sekimeiya in that room. It's in the cabinet now."
    new "我们在那个房间里找到了 Sekimeiya，现在它放在展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:37540
    old "Oh, that's good. It didn't disappear this time?"
    new "哦，那就好。这回它没消失？"

    # game/script.rpy:37545
    old "No, and I have a question. Where's the key to the security room?"
    new "没有。不过我有个问题——监控室的钥匙在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:37546
    old "That one...? I left it in the drawer next to the computer. You all saw it."
    new "那把钥匙……？我放在电脑旁的抽屉里了，你们都看见过的。"

    # game/script.rpy:37547
    old "That's what I thought. The security room is locked."
    new "果然如此。监控室锁着。"

    # game/script.rpy:37552
    old "Locked...?"
    new "锁着……？"

    # game/script.rpy:37558
    old "How do you know?"
    new "你怎么知道？"

    # game/script.rpy:37559
    old "Because I couldn't open the door?"
    new "因为我打不开门？"

    # game/script.rpy:37564
    old "...{w}But when I got here, you were in front of the storeroom. Does that mean you'd already tried to open the security room? Why was that your priority?"
    new "……{w}可我来的时候，你站在储藏室前面。这么说，你已经试过打开监控室了？为什么要先去那里？"

    # game/script.rpy:37571
    old "Sai walked to the door and confirmed that it couldn't be opened."
    new "Sai 走到门前，确认那扇门打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:37576
    old "I wanted to look at the time. I thought that maybe the computer had started working again."
    new "我想看看时间，以为那台电脑说不定又能用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37582
    old "Because our footprints disappeared? I'm not sure I follow that logic. Anyway, it's {time=13:50.}"
    new "就因为我们的脚印消失了？这个逻辑我可不太明白。总之，现在是 {time=13:50.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:37588
    old "W-Wait just a minute. Why would the security room be locked?"
    new "等、等一下。监控室为什么会被锁上？"

    # game/script.rpy:37594
    old "Anyone could've taken the key from the drawer. We all saw where you left it."
    new "谁都能从抽屉里拿走钥匙。我们都看见你把钥匙放哪儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37599
    old "What if someone's hiding inside?{w} Naomi...? Mind coming out?"
    new "要是有人躲在里面呢？{w}Naomi……？能出来一下吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37606
    old "I can't see anything through these gaps, but I mean, Katei's got a point; why would anyone lock this room?{w} The computer doesn't work, so unless it was done to prevent us from fixing it, I can't think of much else. There aren't that many more rooms to lock yourself up in. I can think of the bathrooms and the bedrooms, but I'm sure you'd feel much more secure behind this sturdy door."
    new "从这些缝隙里什么也看不清。不过，Katei 说得有道理——为什么会有人把这间房锁上？{w}电脑坏了，除非是为了不让我们修好它，否则我想不出别的理由。能把自己反锁起来的地方也没剩几处。洗手间和卧室倒是可以，可躲在这扇结实的门后，想必会安心得多吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:37613
    old "What the hell do we do, then?"
    new "那我们到底该怎么办？"

    # game/script.rpy:37614
    old "The Sekimeiya's in the cabinet, so unless it teleports itself to the security room, anyone in there is gonna have to come out eventually."
    new "Sekimeiya 在展示柜里。除非它自己传送到监控室去，否则躲在里面的人迟早得出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:37615
    old "Wait.{w} Is it me, or are we very stupid?"
    new "等等。{w}是我多心，还是我们真的很蠢？"

    # game/script.rpy:37620
    old "Likely you."
    new "多半是你。"

    # game/script.rpy:37625
    old "I just thought that the elevator would work as a place to hide in as well, but we haven't even tried to open it on every floor. Even though we can't call it, as long as it's not stuck between two floors, we should be able to open the door of the floor it's on."
    new "我刚想到，电梯也可以用来藏身。可我们甚至没在每一层试过打开它。虽然叫不来电梯，但只要它没卡在两层之间，它停在哪层，我们就能打开哪层的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:37626
    old "As expected, it's you. I tried that when I came down, and no doors opened."
    new "果然是你。我下楼时试过了，哪一层的门都没打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:37627
    old "...{w}You haven't, though. At least not on this floor."
    new "……{w}可你没试过。至少这一层没试。"

    # game/script.rpy:37632
    old "Hm, you're right. I saw you in front of the storeroom and it slipped my mind."
    new "嗯，你说得对。我看见你站在储藏室前，就把这事忘了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37633
    old "...And the elevator should be here, right? Were we the last ones to use it? If so, we got off on this floor."
    new "……而且电梯应该就在这一层吧？最后用电梯的是我们吗？如果是，那我们就是在这层下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:37643
    old "As Atsuki gripped the handle, I noticed that the door was closed. He had previously left it open to disable the elevator before searching through the higher floors.{w} When he tugged on it, the door didn't budge."
    new "Atsuki 握住门把手时，我才注意到门是关着的。他先前为了让电梯停运，特意把门敞着，然后才去搜查楼上几层。{w}他用力一拉，门却纹丝不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:37648
    old "Is it not on any floor, then? I suppose it could've moved."
    new "那它就不在任何一层了？也许它已经移动过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37653
    old "Well, I thought of this when I was walking down, so I didn't try to open it in the attic either. Did anyone?"
    new "嗯，我下楼的时候也想到了这一点，所以阁楼那层也没去试着开。有人试过吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37654
    old "Katei, Akaro, and Erina all shook their heads."
    new "Katei、Akaro 和 Erina 都摇了摇头。"

    # game/script.rpy:37655
    old "Isla?"
    new "Isla 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:37660
    old "No... I didn't."
    new "没有……我没试过。"

    # game/script.rpy:37666
    old "It would make sense if it was left there since the attic was locked. It didn't occur to us to open it because the button had been removed there as well."
    new "阁楼一直锁着，电梯停在那里也说得通。我们没想到去打开它，是因为那里的按钮也被拆掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37671
    old "Huh. Maybe we are stupid."
    new "哈。也许我们确实很蠢。"

    # game/script.rpy:37676
    old "I think it's very likely it is there. I have no idea what the purpose of this was, but we can access every floor. Even though it doesn't make a ton of sense, the reason behind removing all the panels could be to hide something in the elevator."
    new "我觉得它很可能就在那里。我完全想不通这么做有什么目的，但每一层我们都能到达。拆掉所有面板虽然不太合常理，可也许就是为了把什么东西藏在电梯里。"

    # game/script.rpy:37684
    old "As we were going up the stairs, we noticed Akaro staring at the wires coming out of the wall."
    new "我们上楼时，注意到 Akaro 正盯着从墙里伸出来的电线。"

    # game/script.rpy:37696
    old "I was just thinking that we should still be able to call the elevator if we cross two of these together. Katei, do you know what each wire is for?"
    new "我在想，要是把其中两根线接在一起，应该还是能把电梯叫下来。Katei，你知道每根线分别是做什么的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37702
    old "...No, but it's not going to—"
    new "……不知道。不过这样做不会——"

    # game/script.rpy:37703
    old "Katei cut himself off, and at that moment, his look changed."
    new "Katei 话说到一半停住了，神色也在那一刻变了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37708
    old "This elevator underwent maintenance a few times. We installed the stop button while aware Xyn could try using it for their plans, and I just remembered something the technician told me."
    new "这部电梯做过几次维护。我们装停止按钮的时候，也知道 Xyn 可能会为了他们的计划打电梯的主意。我刚刚想起技术员对我说过的一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:37709
    old "The elevator measures a resistance in the panel. If the circuit is open or the resistance isn't correct, the other lines are deactivated as a safety measure. This was, of course, another measure against Xyn."
    new "电梯会测量面板里的电阻。如果电路断开，或者电阻不对，其他线路就会作为安全措施被停用。当然，这也是为了防 Xyn。"

    # game/script.rpy:37714
    old "Crossing the wires won't work, but something is bothering me. If the intent was to disable the elevator, the culprit should have pushed the wires into the wall. But since they're sticking out, it feels like the culprit knows they're disabled."
    new "把线接在一起没用。但有件事让我在意。如果目的是让电梯停用，犯人本该把电线塞回墙里。可它们现在露在外面，感觉犯人知道这些线已经被停用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37719
    old "...Does anyone else know about this feature?"
    new "……还有别人知道这个功能吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37720
    old "I doubt it. The technician gave me the exact details when he was installing it months ago, but it was on a Sunday when the tower was closed. I have no idea who could have overheard."
    new "应该没有。几个月前技术员安装时跟我讲过具体的细节，但那天是周日，塔里闭馆。我想不出有谁会听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:37721
    old "...{w}Akaro attempted to cross the wires, but nothing happened."
    new "……{w}Akaro 试着把电线接在一起，但什么也没发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:37726
    old "This isn't normal. Katei is right, anyone with any electrical knowledge would've pushed the wires into the wall."
    new "这不对劲。Katei 说得对，懂点电学的人都会把电线塞回墙里。"

    # game/script.rpy:37734
    old "...What was the purpose behind it? That question drove us to run back up, hoping to make sense of what was occurring. Stepping up the stairs, I almost gagged at the sight of the walls surrounding me. I hated that damn building, and I no longer put any effort into repressing the deep, exasperated sigh that I let out."
    new "……那一切究竟是为了什么？这个疑问驱使我们跑回楼上，想弄清正在发生什么。踏上楼梯时，四周的墙壁让我几欲作呕。我恨透了那栋该死的楼，也不再费力压抑，只发出一声深长而烦躁的叹息。"

    # game/script.rpy:37745
    old "{w=1.3}We all stared at the door in shock. It was locked."
    new "{w=1.3}我们全都震惊地盯着那扇门。门锁着。"

    # game/script.rpy:37751
    old "Someone else is certainly in this building. I left the attic just now."
    new "这栋楼里肯定还有别人。我刚从阁楼出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:37752
    old "I took the keys out."
    new "我掏出那串钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:37757
    old "You mean that someone locked it while we were downstairs? Weren't all the floors inspected?"
    new "你是说，我们下楼的时候有人把门锁上了？所有楼层不是都检查过了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37758
    old "Maybe Atsuki was right. What if someone was in the elevator and got out as soon as I left? The inner buttons should still work."
    new "也许 Atsuki 说得对。要是有人藏在电梯里，等我一走就出来呢？电梯里面的按钮应该还能用。"

    # game/script.rpy:37759
    old "I inserted the bronze key in the keyhole and turned it counterclockwise."
    new "我把铜钥匙插进锁孔，逆时针拧了一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:37768
    old "Huh? ...I can't unlock it."
    new "咦？……我打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:37773
    old "What? How is that possible?"
    new "什么？怎么可能？"

    # game/script.rpy:37774
    old "He took the key and tried it himself."
    new "他接过钥匙，亲自试了试。"

    # game/script.rpy:37777
    old "Wh-Wh...!?{w=0.5} It won't open!"
    new "什、什么……！？{w=0.5} 打不开！"

    # game/script.rpy:37780
    old "Flustered, everyone gave it a shot, but the outcome didn't change. The key wasn't affecting the lock."
    new "众人慌了神，轮番试了一遍，结果却毫无变化。那把钥匙对锁根本不起作用。"

    # game/script.rpy:37785
    old "Katei, show us what you have on you. This is long overdue."
    new "Katei，把你身上的东西都掏出来给我们看看。早就该这样了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37791
    old "Can you stop with that? You were the last to leave the attic, and I have more than one reason to believe you might still have the key to enter it. Go ahead and show us that you don't."
    new "别来这套。你是最后一个离开阁楼的人，而且我有不止一个理由怀疑，进阁楼的钥匙还在你身上。那就证明给我们看，你没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:37796
    old "After a disappointed look, he conceded and showed us the contents of all his pockets. Then, Sai inspected him more closely and confirmed he wasn't hiding anything else."
    new "他露出失望的神情，随后还是让步，把所有口袋里的东西都掏给我们看。接着，Sai 又仔细检查了他一遍，确认他没有藏别的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:37799
    old "In one of Katei's deep pockets, two keys were found, which we recalled seeing in the past. According to him, they opened his locker in the staff room and the door between the first two floors."
    new "我们在 Katei 的一个深口袋里找到两把钥匙，印象里以前见过。按他的说法，这两把钥匙分别能打开员工室里他的储物柜，以及一楼和二楼之间的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:37805
    old "I hope you're content. I'm not even sure a key was used to lock this door, or else we could open it."
    new "希望你们满意了。我甚至不确定这扇门是不是用钥匙锁上的——不然我们早就能打开它了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37806
    old "The set of keys I'd had before ended up rotating back to me, so I stored it away again."
    new "先前那串钥匙转了一圈，最后还是回到我手里，我便又把它收了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:37811
    old "This is insane, then! How are we supposed to get in here?{w} Is Naomi really in the attic? How does she keep doing this!?"
    new "那这简直荒唐透顶！我们到底要怎么进去？{w} Naomi 真的在阁楼里吗？她到底是怎么一次次做到的！？"

    # game/script.rpy:37816
    old "It could easily be any person in the world since the storeroom door was opened."
    new "储藏室的门既然打开过，那谁都有可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:37821
    old "What? It was?"
    new "什么？已经开过了？"

    # game/script.rpy:37822
    old "Yeah, I checked, and my mark had disappeared."
    new "对，我检查过了，我留下的标记不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37829
    old "We can do one thing aside from thoroughly searching the places we can access yet again. We can try to open every elevator door."
    new "除了再把能进去的地方仔细搜一遍，我们还可以做一件事：把每扇电梯门都试着打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:37834
    old "...Have I not said that I've already done that?"
    new "……我不是说过已经做过了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37840
    old "Yeah. You said you'd forgotten to check the crystal floor's, but I can think of two reasons for that to be a lie."
    new "对。你说你忘了检查水晶层的电梯门，但我能想到两个理由，说明那句话是在说谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:37841
    old "One, you wanted to keep the idea of checking them to yourself.{w} Two, one of the previous doors had already opened, so you had no reason to keep checking them after that."
    new "其一，你不想让别人也想到去检查电梯门。{w} 其二，之前已经有一扇门打开过，从那以后你自然没理由再继续检查。"

    # game/script.rpy:37842
    old "*sigh*{w} Okay, sure. If there's currently someone in the attic, they might want to take the elevator down and back up at some point, so it's not a bad idea to keep confirming that it can't be accessed."
    new "唉……{w} 好吧，随你。如果现在真有人躲在阁楼里，他说不定什么时候会想坐电梯下来再上去，所以继续确认电梯没法用，倒也不是坏主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:37843
    old "Would we hear it if it was used?"
    new "要是有人用了电梯，我们能听见吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37848
    old "Yes. It does make an audible sound."
    new "会。电梯运行时有声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:37855
    old "Everyone looked drained. With what little energy we had left, we circled around the floor."
    new "所有人都显得精疲力尽。我们拖着仅剩的一点力气，在这一层绕了一圈。"

    # game/script.rpy:37864
    old "Atsuki grabbed the handle of the elevator and tried to open it."
    new "Atsuki 抓住电梯门把手，试着把它打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:37875
    old "Systemic Toxin"
    new "全身性毒素"

    # game/script.rpy:37878
    old "{w=0.7}\"I{w=0.1}s{w=0.1}l{w=0.1}a{w=0.1}! {w=0.5}D{w=0.1}o{w=0.1}n{w=0.1}'{w=0.1}t{w=0.1} {w=0.1}l{w=0.1}o{w=0.1}o{w=0.1}k{w=0.1}!{w=0.1}\"{w=1}{nw}"
    new "{w=0.7}「I{w=0.1}s{w=0.1}l{w=0.1}a{w=0.1}！{w=0.5}千{w=0.1}{w=0.1}万{w=0.1}{w=0.1}别{w=0.1}{w=0.1}看{w=0.1}{w=0.1}{w=0.1}」{w=1}{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:37885
    old "My heart shrank. When Atsuki's eyes met the interior, his body became rock solid. What we saw paralyzed him on the spot, his raspy breathing the only part of him not immobilized."
    new "我的心猛地一沉。Atsuki 的目光落到电梯里面的一瞬，整个人便僵得像块石头。眼前的景象让他当场动弹不得，只有沙哑的呼吸声证明他还没有彻底僵住。"

    # game/script.rpy:37886
    old "Hm...? Who is she?"
    new "嗯……？她是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:37887
    old "Stop!"
    new "停下！"

    # game/script.rpy:37888
    old "Erina pulled Isla into the stairwell, crouching down and speaking to her softly."
    new "Erina 把 Isla 拉进楼梯间，蹲下身，轻声对她说话。"

    # game/script.rpy:37889
    old "Not everyone knew they were witnessing a sight that defied reason. However, the way the two of us looked might have told them enough."
    new "并非所有人都意识到，自己目睹的景象根本不合常理。不过，我们两人的神情或许已经足以说明一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:37895
    old "It's her..."
    new "是她……"

    # game/script.rpy:37896
    old "She really was here, but..."
    new "她真的在这里，可是……"

    # game/script.rpy:37899
    old "Two bodies lay on the floor of the elevator. Buried in the back was Naomi, and next to her were all the elevator buttons and panels, piled up together."
    new "电梯地板上躺着两具躯体。靠里的是 Naomi，她身旁堆着电梯的按钮和面板。"

    # game/script.rpy:37900
    old "...Are they dead?"
    new "……他们死了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37901
    old "Immediately, Atsuki crouched. He softly grabbed an arm and pressed his finger to its wrist.{w} His own arm lost its strength and released its grip."
    new "Atsuki 立刻蹲下。他轻轻握住一条手臂，把手指按在手腕上。{w} 他自己的手臂却一下子没了力气，松开了手。"

    # game/script.rpy:37902
    old "Does he know her...?"
    new "他认识她……？"

    # game/script.rpy:37903
    old "I nodded."
    new "我点了点头。"

    # game/script.rpy:37904
    old "W-Wait... isn't she the girl who died... a few days ago?"
    new "等、等等……她不就是那个几天前……死掉的女孩吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37906
    old "Yes...! I remember her face from the news."
    new "没错……！我在新闻里见过她的脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:37908
    old "How do you know her?"
    new "你怎么会认识她？"

    # game/script.rpy:37910
    old "\"...She's an old friend of ours.\" I almost said that, but I kept it in."
    new "「……她是我们的一位老朋友。」这话我差点说出口，最后还是咽了回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:37913
    old "Well, what the fuck...? What is she doing here?"
    new "搞什么鬼……？她怎么会在这儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:37914
    old "So Atsuki's plan will... fail?"
    new "那么 Atsuki 的计划会……失败？"

    # game/script.rpy:37915
    old "Will he manage to save her, but she'll die again...?"
    new "他会成功救下她，但她还是会再死一次吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:37916
    old "No, what the hell is this even about? How could she have been saved? The past wasn't changed, was it? I still remember everything as it happened."
    new "不对，这到底是怎么回事？她怎么可能已经得救？过去并没有被改变吧？事情经过我记得清清楚楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:37920
    old "I staggered forward and slowly reached for the arm Atsuki had dropped."
    new "我踉跄着上前，缓缓伸向 Atsuki 放下的那条手臂。"

    # game/script.rpy:37922
    old "There was no pulse. Despite that, no part of her body indicated what had happened."
    new "没有脉搏。尽管如此，她全身上下都找不出任何能说明发生过什么的痕迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:37923
    old "...Her body wasn't found, right?"
    new "……她的遗体一直没有被找到，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:37926
    old "Oh...! This is how."
    new "啊……！原来是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:37927
    old "I bet this is what Atsuki's idea was. He was wondering whether the past could be changed or not."
    new "Atsuki 的主意应该就是这个。他一直在琢磨，过去究竟能不能被改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:37928
    old "Without changing the past, he still had a shot at saving her. By going to the 30th and taking her away before the explosion."
    new "即便不改变过去，他也仍有机会救下她——只要去三十层，在爆炸前把她带走。"

    # game/script.rpy:37929
    old "...Simply because her body wasn't found."
    new "……只因为她的遗体没有被找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:37931
    old "Does this mean that he'll still do it? Even though he's seen that she'll die anyway? But we already verified that the past could be changed, so why would he do it like this?"
    new "也就是说，他还是会去做？哪怕已经亲眼看到她无论如何都会死？可我们明明已经证实过去可以被改变，他为什么还要用这种办法？"

    # game/script.rpy:37935
    old "Nobody had words to interrupt the tragic scene. I stood up slowly and rubbed my eyes."
    new "面对这悲惨的一幕，没有人说得出话。我缓缓站起，揉了揉眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:37936
    old "...There's a little blood on the back of Naomi's head, forming that puddle. That's definitely a wound."
    new "……Naomi 后脑有一点血，积成了那摊。那绝对是个伤口。"

    # game/script.rpy:37937
    old "The questions didn't end there. We'd finally found Naomi, but she wouldn't be able to answer anything for us."
    new "疑问还不止这些。我们终于找到了 Naomi，可她已经什么都回答不了了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37938
    old "I apologize for asking this, but is it possible she has a phone on her?"
    new "抱歉问一句，她身上会不会带着手机？"

    # game/script.rpy:37939
    old "Awaiting any response, we looked at Atsuki. Facing away, I assumed he had some kind of focused expression, but the instant I caught a glimpse, I realized that was far from the truth. He looked broken and unresponsive all over again, forced to experience the same death a second time."
    new "我们看向 Atsuki，等着他开口。他背对着我们，我本以为他脸上会是某种凝神思索的神情，可只瞥了一眼便明白，事实全然相反。他又一次显得支离破碎、毫无反应，被迫第二次经历同一场死亡。"

    # game/script.rpy:37940
    old "...Can I look?"
    new "……我能看看吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37941
    old "Sai, you said you tried to open this door."
    new "Sai，你说你试着开过这扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:37942
    old "And I did. A few minutes ago, the elevator wasn't here. It must've been in the attic and got brought down just one floor so nobody heard it."
    new "我确实试过。几分钟前，电梯还不在这儿。它当时应该停在阁楼，只降了一层，好让人听不见动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:37945
    old "Are we supposed to believe that?"
    new "你觉得这种话我们会信？"

    # game/script.rpy:37946
    old "Of course? Someone just locked the attic as well, right? We're still missing the person who did this.{w} Someone killed Naomi. I have no idea what happened to this girl, but look behind Naomi's head and at the blood on the floor. Most of it is dry. She's been dead for a while; it wasn't her we were looking for."
    new "那当然？刚刚不也有人把阁楼锁上了吗？做出这些事的人，我们还没找到。{w} Naomi 是被人杀的。这女孩身上发生过什么，我完全不清楚，可你看看 Naomi 的后脑，再看看地上的血——大部分都干了。她死了有一阵子了，我们要找的人根本不是她。"

    # game/script.rpy:37948
    old "But why would anyone kill them?"
    new "可为什么会有人要杀她们？"

    # game/script.rpy:37949
    old "How the fuck would I know? Killing Naomi can have the same motive as the policeman—just because her presence was a potential threat. But this girl...? Knowing why she was killed is far from the main question."
    new "我他妈怎么知道？杀 Naomi 的动机可能和杀那个警察一样——只因为她在场就是潜在威胁。可这女孩……？她为什么被杀，根本不是眼下最要紧的问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:37950
    old "Atsuki, are you responsible for this? We know she died, but her body would look much worse if she'd been dead for days. Did you do something to bring her here?"
    new "Atsuki，这事是你做的吗？我们知道她死了，可要是已经死了好几天，遗体绝不会是这副样子。你是不是做了什么，把她弄到这里来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:37951
    old "Surprisingly, Atsuki shook his head very slowly."
    new "出乎意料，Atsuki 极缓慢地摇了摇头。"

    # game/script.rpy:37952
    old "No? You both know her, so there's no way her appearance isn't related to you. If someone got into the tower through the storeroom, could it be her?"
    new "不是？你们两个都认识她，她出现在这里，不可能跟你们无关。要是有人从储藏室溜进了塔里，会不会就是她？"

    # game/script.rpy:37953
    old "That time, there was no reaction."
    new "这一次，他毫无反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:37956
    old "Sai stepped forward and kneeled next to Atsuki. The first thing he did was check whether the body was truly dead."
    new "Sai 走上前，在 Atsuki 身旁跪下，首先确认那具身体是否真的已经死去。"

    # game/script.rpy:37957
    old "Then, he went from pocket to pocket while Atsuki observed his movements. It didn't take long to confirm she wasn't holding anything."
    new "接着，他逐个摸过口袋，Atsuki 则注视着他的动作。没过多久就确认，她身上什么也没带。"

    # game/script.rpy:37958
    old "Next, he leaned forward. The spotlight wasn't on Naomi, but she might have had something important."
    new "随后，他俯身凑近。聚光灯并没有照在 Naomi 身上，但她或许带着什么要紧的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:37959
    old "And she did. The inspection finished with a single result: a key that she had in her pocket."
    new "而她也确实带着。检查的结果只有一样东西：她口袋里的一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:37960
    old "It's the attic's."
    new "是阁楼的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:37961
    old "So it won't be any use. We already have it, and the attic is still inaccessible."
    new "那也没用。钥匙已经在我们手上了，阁楼照样进不去。"

    # game/script.rpy:37962
    old "What the hell are you talking about? We can take the elevator up with the key."
    new "你在说什么鬼话？有了钥匙，我们就能坐电梯上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:37963
    old "O-Oh! I completely ignored that.{w} ...Also, what I told you earlier was true. Naomi did have another copy of the keys."
    new "啊、哦！我完全没想到这一点。{w}……还有，我之前说的没错，Naomi 确实另有一套钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:37964
    old "The others aren't here, though. It's not the whole set."
    new "可其余的钥匙不在这儿。这一套并不全。"

    # game/script.rpy:37965
    old "Did they get separated?"
    new "是分开放了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37968
    old "We need to go to the attic. I don't know why the elevator was brought down, but the real culprit might be right above us."
    new "我们得去阁楼。我不知道电梯为什么会被降下来，但真正的凶手也许就在我们头顶上。"

    # game/script.rpy:37969
    old "Wait... we can't take the elevator with them inside."
    new "等等……电梯里有她们，我们不能就这么坐上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:37970
    old "At least one of us can."
    new "至少可以上去一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:37971
    old "That's not what I mean... We should take them out. They can't be inside an elevator until the police come."
    new "我不是这个意思……我们该把她们抬出来。在警察来之前，不能让她们留在电梯里。"

    # game/script.rpy:37972
    old "And that takes priority?"
    new "这比什么都优先？"

    # game/script.rpy:37973
    old "Of course!"
    new "当然！"

    # game/script.rpy:37980
    old "She's right. They should be taken to the lobby so that they're seen immediately when the door opens."
    new "她说得对。应该把她们移到大厅，这样电梯门一开，立刻就会被人看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:37981
    old "Erina had gone a few stairs down with Isla, but she'd clearly been listening to every word."
    new "Erina 和 Isla 已经往下走了几级台阶，可显然，她每句话都听进去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:37986
    old "Isn't that irresponsible? We're disrupting the scene."
    new "这难道不是不负责任吗？我们这是在破坏现场。"

    # game/script.rpy:37991
    old "Sai, they're right. Using the elevator would disrupt the scene as well, and I find it very unlikely they both died inside it."
    new "Sai，她们说得对。动用电梯同样会破坏现场，而且我很难相信她们两个是死在电梯里的。"

    # game/script.rpy:37992
    old "Do you agree with this, Atsuki?"
    new "Atsuki，你同意吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:37994
    old "It looked like he nodded as he stood up. Before anyone could interfere further, he pressed the floor 1 button and stepped aside to let the door close."
    new "他站起身，看上去像是点了下头。谁也没来得及再拦，他已经按下了一楼的按钮，退到一旁让电梯门合上。"

    # game/script.rpy:37995
    old "Then, without letting anyone see his face, he walked down the stairs."
    new "接着，他没让任何人看清自己的脸，沿楼梯走了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:37996
    old "Erina seemed like she was going to say something to us, but she kept it to herself. Behind her legs, Isla stared with wide eyes."
    new "Erina 似乎想对我们说些什么，最后还是咽了回去。Isla 躲在她腿后，睁大眼睛望着。"

    # game/script.rpy:38013
    old "Akaro opened the elevator on the crystal floor, and the same deathly image was reiterated. Then, my reaction was similar to the first time I'd seen a dead body."
    new "Akaro 在水晶层打开了电梯，那幅死亡的景象又一次重演。而我的反应，和第一次见到尸体时并无二致。"

    # game/script.rpy:38014
    old "They were really dead, but their corpses seemed as sterile as dolls. Nothing outwardly indicated their deaths. There was no smell and no substance; despite how tragic it was, the scene itself felt underwhelming."
    new "他们确实死了，尸体却洁净得像人偶，从外表看不出任何死因。没有气味，也没有实感；事情明明如此惨烈，眼前的景象却平淡得让人无从反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:38015
    old "After a long breath, Akaro grabbed the first body, making it look very light. When I looked at her face properly, I saw how much paler she was than normal. She was definitely dead, but I couldn't even see a trace of blood."
    new "Akaro 长长呼出一口气，才抓起第一具尸体，动作轻松得仿佛那躯体很轻。等我认真看清那张脸时，才发现她比平时苍白了太多。她确确实实已经死了，可我连一丝血迹都看不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:38016
    old "Nobody was going to lift the other one, so we stood in place while Akaro went and came back from the lobby. Quietly, he bent down to pick up Naomi and brought her there, the closest we could get to the outside world."
    new "没人肯去抬另一具，我们便都站在原地，看着 Akaro 往大厅去了一趟又回来。他不声不响地弯下腰，抱起 Naomi 带到那里——那是我们能抵达的、最接近外界的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:38017
    old "Inside the elevator, only remnants of blood, buttons inside their covers, and scattered screws remained."
    new "电梯里只剩下血迹的残痕、嵌在护盖里的按钮，以及散落的螺丝。"

    # game/script.rpy:38023
    old "Does anyone want to come to the attic?"
    new "有人愿意跟我去阁楼吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38028
    old "I will."
    new "我去。"

    # game/script.rpy:38032
    old "Nobody else answered, so both of them stepped into the elevator, dodging the tiny pool that had formed below Naomi's head. Sai still had the attic key and inserted it to enable the floor 7 button."
    new "再没有别人应答，于是两人避开了 Naomi 头下积起的那一小摊，走进电梯。阁楼的钥匙还在 Sai 手上，她插进去，七楼的按钮才恢复了作用。"

    # game/script.rpy:38036
    old "They closed the door and let the elevator bring them to the attic, the place the person we were searching for had sealed off.{w} I turned back and saw Atsuki walking to the lobby."
    new "他们关上电梯门，任由电梯把他们送往阁楼——那个我们正在追查的人封锁起来的地方。{w}我回过头，看见 Atsuki 正朝大厅走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:38039
    old "That was what it seemed like at first, anyway. On the way, he made a turn and entered the event room."
    new "至少一开始看上去是这样。走到半途，他却拐了个弯，进了活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:38046
    old "The Sekimeiya was still being kept in the cabinet."
    new "Sekimeiya 依旧收在展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:38052
    old "...Give me the key."
    new "……把钥匙给我。"

    # game/script.rpy:38057
    old "Of course, nothing had ended yet. The Sekimeiya had the power to change the past and additionally allow us to learn what had happened. I took the keyring out and personally unlocked the cabinet."
    new "当然，一切还没有结束。Sekimeiya 拥有改变过去的力量，还能让我们知晓曾经发生过什么。我掏出钥匙串，亲手打开了展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:38062
    old "He grabbed the cushion and placed it on top of the cabinet."
    new "他拿起垫子，搁在展示柜顶上。"

    # game/script.rpy:38066
    old "From hallway A, Akaro and Erina looked at him without being able to say anything. For a while, Atsuki stared at the gemstone."
    new "Akaro 和 Erina 站在 A 走廊，望着他，一句话也说不出来。Atsuki 对着那颗宝石凝视了好一阵。"

    # game/script.rpy:38067
    old "But he didn't wait long. Just a couple minutes later, he reached forward and placed his left hand on it."
    new "但他没有等太久。几分钟后，他便伸出手，把左手覆了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:38073
    old "...It's still not working...!{w} Wh-Why not? I'm doing the same thing."
    new "……还是不行……！{w}为、为什么？我明明做的是同样的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:38075
    old "Right. When we'd put it in the cabinet, the Sekimeiya hadn't been working. That issue persisted."
    new "没错。我们把 Sekimeiya 放进展示柜时，它就已经不能用了。这个问题一直没有解决。"

    # game/script.rpy:38080
    old "It's just cold..."
    new "只是凉冰冰的……"

    # game/script.rpy:38081
    old "He glanced back and saw that the two people who'd gone to the attic hadn't returned. After a pause, he placed the cushion back inside the cabinet."
    new "他回头看了一眼，去阁楼的两个人还没有回来。沉默片刻，他把垫子放回了展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:38085
    old "Interestingly, like the previous time, he stood in front of it for a while before turning the manual arrow."
    new "有意思的是，和上一次一样，他在柜前站了好一会儿，才转动手动箭头。"

    # game/script.rpy:38094
    old "They're back, coming from the stairs."
    new "他们回来了，是从楼梯上来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:38101
    old "Did you try to use the Sekimeiya?"
    new "你试过用 Sekimeiya 了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38107
    old "Nothing in the attic?"
    new "阁楼里什么都没有？"

    # game/script.rpy:38113
    old "There wasn't anyone. We only found this."
    new "一个人也没有。我们只找到了这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:38114
    old "In his hand was the key to the attic."
    new "他手中拿着的，是阁楼的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:38115
    old "This isn't the one that Naomi had. There was another one inserted in the inner lock of the door. That's why we couldn't open it from the outside."
    new "这不是 Naomi 手上那把。门内侧的锁孔里还插着另一把，所以我们从外面才打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:38120
    old "What? Another one?"
    new "什么？还有一把？"

    # game/script.rpy:38126
    old "Yes, a third one which shouldn't exist."
    new "对，第三把——一把本不该存在的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:38131
    old "I'm glad you brought that up, because I can now point out how that doesn't make sense. You're saying a third one shouldn't exist, but your keyring was supposed to have one, right? Are you and Naomi the only people with this key?"
    new "你提起这个正好，我可以指出这有多说不通。你说第三把本不该存在，可你的钥匙串上本来就该有一把，对吧？拥有这把钥匙的，只有你和 Naomi 两个人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38132
    old "...Correct. We're the only ones that I'm aware of."
    new "……没错。据我所知，只有我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:38135
    old "Let me remind you, I tried to open the elevator doors, and none of them opened. While the culprit could be someone who left and entered the tower, it's possible the people who came in through the storeroom were only the three victims, whose presences were harmful to the killer. Four of you were still in the attic when I went down."
    new "提醒你一句，每一层的电梯门我都试过，哪一层都没打开。凶手可能是从塔外进出的人，但也可能，从储藏室进来的只有那三名死者——他们的存在对凶手不利。而我下楼的时候，你们四个人都还在阁楼里。"

    # game/script.rpy:38140
    old "...Are you seriously accusing us of this?"
    new "……你是当真在怀疑我们？"

    # game/script.rpy:38145
    old "I'm not accusing anyone, but there weren't traces of anyone else in the attic, and the Sekimeiya is still here. It's moronic to pretend that none of you could move the elevator after I tried to open it."
    new "我没有怀疑谁。但阁楼里没有别人来过的痕迹，Sekimeiya 也还在这里。在我试过开电梯之后，还硬说你们当中没人动得了电梯，那就太蠢了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38150
    old "Then, likewise, it's very stupid to simply believe you! You wrongly claimed that no door had opened. You could've easily done that so that we wouldn't check them."
    new "单凭你一面之词就相信你，也同样蠢得可以！你谎称哪扇门都没开过，完全可能只是想让我们不去检查。"

    # game/script.rpy:38156
    old "I'm going up."
    new "我上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:38161
    old "Now you want to?"
    new "现在想去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:38168
    old "After ignoring Sai again, Atsuki walked to the staircase. As soon as we saw he wasn't going to take the elevator, the rest of us followed behind."
    new "Atsuki 又一次无视了 Sai，径直走向楼梯。我们一见他不是要坐电梯，便都跟在了后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:38181
    old "Did you lock the door on your way down?"
    new "你们下楼的时候锁门了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38189
    old "Katei inserted the single key and got the door to open. Atsuki didn't waste time before going up the stairs."
    new "Katei 把唯一那把钥匙插进去，打开了门。Atsuki 没有耽搁，立刻上了楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:38195
    old "Sai's and Katei's footprints were still visible, so we stepped directly inside of them. I figured Atsuki wanted to see the state of the attic for himself, as he went ahead to the hallway."
    new "Sai 和 Katei 的脚印还清晰可辨，我们便直接踩着那些脚印走。Atsuki 率先往走廊里去，我想他是要亲眼看看阁楼的情形。"

    # game/script.rpy:38197
    old "The people who hadn't taken the elevator dispersed through the rooms, and each verified that nothing stood out."
    new "没坐电梯的人分散到各个房间里，逐一确认没有异样。"

    # game/script.rpy:38203
    old "In the end, everyone ended up scattered through the floor. Erina and Isla sat on the sofa, Atsuki stood in the staircase, and the others remained in the right bedroom. Sai was sitting in front of the elevator, seemingly lost in thought. For many reasons, the mood was dark, and it was really burning me out."
    new "到头来，大家还是各自散在这一层的各处。Erina 和 Isla 坐在沙发上，Atsuki 站在楼梯口，其余的人留在右边的卧室。Sai 坐在电梯前，似乎正出着神。因为种种原因，气氛沉闷得厉害，我实在累得不行。"

    # game/script.rpy:38207
    old "I walked to the bedrooms and opened the left one. I needed to throw myself onto the bed and be alone for some time."
    new "我走到卧室那边，推开了左边那间。我只想扑到床上，一个人待一会儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:38227
    old "Crossover"
    new "交错"

    # game/script.rpy:38229
    old "I stood in the middle of the floor 3 corridor. I didn't want to see the others, so I'd been thinking to myself."
    new "我站在三楼走廊的正中。我不想见到其他人，便一直独自沉思着。"

    # game/script.rpy:38233
    old "As anyone could've been anywhere, all I wanted was to wait. I could perceive faint footsteps above me, signaling someone was on the fourth floor."
    new "谁也说不准谁在哪儿，我只想等着。头顶隐约传来脚步声，说明四楼有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:38234
    old "...Are they gonna come?"
    new "……他们会来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38235
    old "I approached a potted plant and sat next to it. I calmly felt the seconds pass, appreciating the sensation."
    new "我走到一盆绿植旁坐下，静静体会着时间一秒一秒过去的感觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:38239
    old "When someone finally arrived, it was from the staircase leading down. ...Atsuki."
    new "终于有人来了，是从下面的楼梯上来的。……是 Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:38240
    old "He jogged up to me, looking anxious and disturbed."
    new "他小跑着来到我面前，神情焦急而不安。"

    # game/script.rpy:38248
    old "A-Are you alone...!? Where are the others?"
    new "你、你一个人……！？其他人呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:38249
    old "...I am, and I don't know. What happened?"
    new "……是，我也不知道。出什么事了？"

    # game/script.rpy:38250
    old "You need to come down. Did anyone pass through this floor?"
    new "你得跟我下去。有人经过这一层吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38251
    old "I haven't seen anyone, no."
    new "没有，我没看见任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:38252
    old "He was pretty agitated, so I kept my composure and waited for him to tell me what had occurred. Everything about him gave away that he'd seen something frightful."
    new "他相当激动，我便沉住气，等他说出发生了什么。他的一举一动都表明他看见了什么可怕的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:38253
    old "We need to find everyone else..."
    new "得把其他人找齐……"

    # game/script.rpy:38254
    old "Are you gonna tell me what happened?"
    new "你到底说不说发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:38255
    old "I'm sorry... It's on the crystal floor, but we shouldn't separate anymore."
    new "对不起……在水晶层。不过我们不能再分开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38256
    old "He grabbed my hand and dashed toward the way he'd come."
    new "他抓住我的手，朝他来的方向跑去。"

    # game/script.rpy:38263
    old "You're scaring me... Don't tell me..."
    new "你别吓我……难不成……"

    # game/script.rpy:38276
    old "We ran around the second floor. When we got to the last staircase, Atsuki stopped and looked down. It wasn't visible yet."
    new "我们在二楼绕了一圈。到最后一处楼梯时，Atsuki 停下脚步向下望去。还看不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:38280
    old "I descended the steps until the crystal floor was visible through the open door."
    new "我沿着台阶往下走，直到从敞开的门里看到了水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:38288
    old "E-Erina...!"
    new "E、Erina……！"

    # game/script.rpy:38291
    old "Erina's body lay facing down over a vast pool of blood, traces of which started in the middle of the staircase. I didn't have to walk farther down to know she was dead."
    new "Erina 俯卧在一大片血泊里，血迹从楼梯中段一路延伸过来。不必再往下走，我也知道她已经死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38292
    old "Behind me, Atsuki hadn't yet stepped down. It was hard to meet his eyes; he looked only at the floor."
    new "我身后的 Atsuki 还没有走下台阶。我难以对上他的目光，他只看着地面。"

    # game/script.rpy:38294
    old "Damn it...! Where the hell are the others!? Still in the attic?"
    new "该死……！其他人到底在哪儿！？还在阁楼吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38295
    old "I-I think someone was on the floor above me at some point. Were you alone when you found her?"
    new "我、我好像有段时间感觉楼上有动静。你发现她的时候是一个人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38304
    old "I kept walking down while I silently wondered why he'd been alone. On the floor of hallway C, I pressed two fingers to Erina's body and waited for any perceptible movement."
    new "我一边往下走，一边暗自纳闷他怎么会是一个人。到了 C 走廊那层，我把两根手指按在 Erina 身上，等着感觉有没有动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:38305
    old "I've already checked..."
    new "我已经确认过了……"

    # game/script.rpy:38307
    old "She was truly dead. Erina, who'd been quietly following us around the entire day, was not alive anymore. It was such a bizarre sensation."
    new "她真的死了。这一整天都默默跟在我们身后的 Erina，已经没有了生命。那种感觉说不出的怪异。"

    # game/script.rpy:38308
    old "Where's Isla? Sh-She can't see this."
    new "Isla 呢？不、不能让她看到这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:38309
    old "I don't know where anyone is! They should be up above!"
    new "我哪知道他们在哪儿！应该都在上面吧！"

    # game/script.rpy:38310
    old "It's not possible for us to take the elevator, so let's walk up. We should come across someone."
    new "电梯是坐不成了，我们走上去吧。总会碰上人的。"

    # game/script.rpy:38312
    old "My heavy breathing was interrupting my words, and I didn't let my gaze stray from Erina. Being so close to her, I noticed that blood was coming out of the part of her head that hit the edge of a step."
    new "我喘得厉害，话都说不连贯，视线却始终没离开 Erina。靠得这样近，我才发现她头上撞到台阶边沿的地方还在渗血。"

    # game/script.rpy:38314
    old "H-Her killer should be here on this floor, but looking for them is way too dangerous. Like I said before, don't go alone anywhere anymore."
    new "杀、杀她的人应该就在这一层，可去找他实在太危险。我说过了，别再一个人行动。"

    # game/script.rpy:38315
    old "Yes, I know."
    new "嗯，我知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:38326
    old "We ran up the floors. On the fourth was Sai."
    new "我们一层层往上跑。四楼是 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:38327
    old "However, as it was essential to find everyone, we didn't explain fully and kept moving up."
    new "但找到所有人要紧，我们来不及细说，便继续往上。"

    # game/script.rpy:38335
    old "One floor higher was Katei. On the sixth, Akaro."
    new "再上一层是 Katei。到六楼，是 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:38340
    old "I saw that the attic key was inserted into the door. We all entered to find the missing person."
    new "我看见阁楼的钥匙插在门上。我们一齐走了进去，寻找那个还没找到的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:38346
    old "I stared at the floor's footprints—the proof that the past had changed. I had no idea how, but it was undeniable that it greatly had."
    new "我盯着地板上的脚印——那是过去被改写的证据。我不知道这是怎么发生的，但无可否认，过去已经大不一样了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38353
    old "When every room was looked into, the final result was alarming. Isla had not been found."
    new "所有房间都找过之后，结果令人心惊——Isla 还是没找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:38358
    old "Isla should be somewhere...! Where did you all see her last?"
    new "Isla 一定在什么地方……！你们最后一次看到她是在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:38363
    old "Only Isla? Then, what happened on the crystal floor..."
    new "只有 Isla？那水晶层那边到底出了什么事……"

    # game/script.rpy:38368
    old "Is it Erina...? Both of them were here not long ago."
    new "是 Erina 吗……？她们两个不久前还在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:38373
    old "Yes. They were sitting on the sofa when I left."
    new "嗯。我离开的时候，她们还坐在沙发上。"

    # game/script.rpy:38378
    old "In that case, they took the elevator. That was them."
    new "这么说，她们坐了电梯。那就是她们了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38379
    old "Was it up here?"
    new "是上到这一层了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38389
    old "So Isla could be in danger..."
    new "那 Isla 可能有危险……"

    # game/script.rpy:38397
    old "All of us ran back down. It was hard to believe anyone wasn't aware of what awaited them, but they had to see for themselves."
    new "我们全都跑下了楼。谁都清楚等着自己的是什么，可他们终究要亲眼确认。"

    # game/script.rpy:38408
    old "Shit...! Why the fuck would Erina be targeted...!?"
    new "该死……！为什么会有人对 Erina 下手……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:38409
    old "Everyone saw her dead body over the slowly growing pool of blood. Sai gently checked her pulse and confirmed it for everyone."
    new "所有人都看见她倒在缓缓扩大的血泊里。Sai 轻轻探了探她的脉搏，替大家确认了这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:38414
    old "Why is Isla not with her...? It couldn't be that..."
    new "为什么 Isla 不在她身边……？难道说……"

    # game/script.rpy:38415
    old "Th-There's no way.{w} ...Should I bring her to the lobby?"
    new "怎、怎么可能。{w}……要不要把她带到大厅去？"

    # game/script.rpy:38416
    old "To the lobby? Why?"
    new "带到大厅？为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:38417
    old "So she's with the others. Sorry, that was stupid of me. This time, this is actually where she died."
    new "这样她就能和其他人在一起了。抱歉，是我糊涂了。这次，她确实是死在这里的。"

    # game/script.rpy:38419
    old "I went quiet. I'd begun to form a small theory, but it appeared I was wrong. After that, I realized I had no idea what had actually happened."
    new "我沉默了。我原本隐约有了一个猜想，看来是想错了。紧接着我才意识到，对于究竟发生了什么，我根本毫无头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:38421
    old "Can we be sure she was killed? What if she fell off the stairs, which shocked Isla and made her run away?"
    new "能确定她是被人杀死的吗？也许她是从楼梯上摔了下来，Isla 受到惊吓才跑掉的？"

    # game/script.rpy:38422
    old "I doubt it. There's a button right here."
    new "我看不像。这里有一颗纽扣。"

    # game/script.rpy:38427
    old "I followed Sai's finger to one of the higher steps. We walked up and saw a silver button which had formerly been attached to Erina's turtleneck."
    new "我顺着 Sai 的手指看向较高的一级台阶。我们走上去，看见一颗银色纽扣——原先是钉在 Erina 高领毛衣上的。"

    # game/script.rpy:38432
    old "You mean this points to there being a fight?"
    new "你是说，这说明这里发生过争执？"

    # game/script.rpy:38437
    old "How else would it have ended up here?"
    new "不然它怎么会掉在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:38444
    old "Sai is right. This wasn't an accident, and I heard it. I-I was in the first partition of the second floor when I heard Erina.{w} Her voice hardly reached me, but the words I picked up were enough to understand what was happening. \"Don't lie! It can only be you. You killed them.\""
    new "Sai 说得对。这不是意外，我亲耳听到了。我、我当时在二楼的第一间隔间，听见了 Erina 的声音。{w}她的声音传到我这里已经很微弱，但我听到的那几句，足以让我明白发生了什么。「别骗人了！只可能是你。是你杀了他们。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38449
    old "What!? Then that's why someone killed her... She identified them."
    new "什么！？所以她才被人灭了口……她认出了对方。"

    # game/script.rpy:38454
    old "...{w}Is this true, Atsuki?"
    new "……{w}这是真的吗，Atsuki？"

    # game/script.rpy:38459
    old "Yes! I'm not lying."
    new "是真的！我没有说谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:38460
    old "Did you hear anything else?"
    new "还听到了别的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38465
    old "Y-Yes, a yell, I think, from Erina. Then, I ran here and saw her dead."
    new "听、听到了，好像是 Erina 喊了一声。然后我就跑到这里，看见她已经死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38469
    old "That means the killer is on this floor, right?"
    new "那凶手就在这一层了？"

    # game/script.rpy:38470
    old "Maybe when he found Erina, but not anymore. Whoever killed her could be anywhere. However, this changes things a lot."
    new "他发现 Erina 的时候也许还在，现在可说不准。杀她的人眼下可能在任何地方。不过，这让情况变了很多。"

    # game/script.rpy:38478
    old "Sai went to the storeroom and came back seconds later."
    new "Sai 去了储藏室，几秒后就回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38483
    old "The door hasn't been opened again..."
    new "那扇门没有再被打开过……"

    # game/script.rpy:38488
    old "Let me be clear. One thing would be possible: the real killer killed Erina. Then, they escaped from this floor immediately. If the real person behind all this killed Erina, the most likely thing is that they would've left through the storeroom so Atsuki never saw them. It's incredibly hard to believe they wouldn't have the key to unlock it."
    new "我说清楚一点。有一种可能是：真凶杀了 Erina，随即逃离了这层楼。如果幕后的人杀了 Erina，最有可能的做法就是从储藏室离开，这样 Atsuki 就绝不会撞见他们。很难想象他们手里会没有开那扇门的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:38489
    old "However, that didn't happen. Atsuki didn't find anyone when he ran here, and at this point, I seriously don't think the true culprit would've killed Erina and then hoped they wouldn't be found in a crystal room. ...So there's a second thing I could believe."
    new "但事情并不是这样。Atsuki 跑过来时没有撞见任何人；而且到了这一步，我不认为真凶杀了 Erina 之后，还能指望自己不会在水晶展室里被人发现。……所以还有第二种可能，我愿意相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:38490
    old "That they activated the Sekimeiya and disappeared from this floor."
    new "那就是他们发动了 Sekimeiya，从这层楼消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38493
    old "Sai seemed to have a point he was getting to, and so far, we were following along."
    new "Sai 似乎正一步步引向某个结论，而我们到目前为止都还跟得上。"

    # game/script.rpy:38498
    old "...Oh, I can tell if that happened."
    new "……啊，那个我倒是能判断。"

    # game/script.rpy:38510
    old "He made us follow him to the event room."
    new "他让我们跟着他去了活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:38522
    old "The glass hasn't been opened either. It's very likely they had the key, but the Sekimeiya wasn't used."
    new "玻璃也没有被打开过。他们很可能有钥匙，但 Sekimeiya 没有被使用。"

    # game/script.rpy:38543
    old "...{w}It's because of this thread that I detached from the curtain earlier."
    new "……{w}因为我之前从遮布上拆下了这根线。"

    # game/script.rpy:38544
    old "Atsuki explained what he'd done. The last time he'd closed the cabinet, he left a thin and short thread above the movable glass. That way, if anyone tried to get the Sekimeiya out, the thread would fall."
    new "Atsuki 解释了自己做过的事。上次他关上展示柜时，在可移动的玻璃上方留了一根又细又短的线。这样一来，只要有人试图取出 Sekimeiya，那根线就会掉落。"

    # game/script.rpy:38545
    old "It's in the position it was when I locked the cabinet the last time."
    new "它还停在我上次锁上展示柜时的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:38550
    old "So you ripped me off? I guess that removes this option."
    new "这么说，你是把我摆了一道？看来这个可能也排除了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38552
    old "We all saw the thread and understood that Atsuki was telling the truth. The cabinet hadn't opened, and according to Sai, neither had the storeroom door."
    new "我们都看到了那根线，明白 Atsuki 说的是实话。展示柜没有被打开，而按 Sai 的说法，储藏室的门也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:38563
    old "Katei, would there be a way to unlock the bathrooms from the outside if you were to lock yourself in? They have keyholes."
    new "Katei，如果有人把自己反锁在洗手间里，外面有办法打开吗？那些门上是有钥匙孔的。"

    # game/script.rpy:38564
    old "...Yes, actually. I'm not sure if I still have it, but most employees were given a key to unlock them."
    new "……其实，有的。我不确定钥匙还在不在我这儿，但大多数员工都分到过一把能打开它们的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:38565
    old "...So there's one last thing I believe the real culprit could've likely done."
    new "……所以，真凶最后很可能还有一种做法。"

    # game/script.rpy:38574
    old "Locking themselves in the security room. There's no way to open it from the outside."
    new "把自己锁进监控室。那扇门从外面打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:38579
    old "O-Oh, yeah. We can't check that, though."
    new "啊……对。可这一点我们查不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38582
    old "Sai ran to the door and tried to open it. ...It was still locked."
    new "Sai 跑到门边，试着开门。……门依旧锁着。"

    # game/script.rpy:38594
    old "It's true that we can't be sure nobody's currently in the security room, but it's unlikely. They can't keep shut in there after {time=21.}"
    new "确实不能保证此刻监控室里没人，但可能性不大。到了{time=21.}这个点，他们不可能还把自己关在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:38599
    old "Is there something you're trying to say?"
    new "你是想说什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38604
    old "Definitely. I'm trying to say that it wasn't the actual person we've been chasing who killed Erina, but rather the person she thought it was."
    new "当然。我想说的是——杀死 Erina 的并不是我们一路追查的那个人，而是她以为的那个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:38609
    old "Are you seriously saying this!? None of us would kill Erina!"
    new "你这话是认真的吗！？我们之中没有人会杀 Erina！"

    # game/script.rpy:38610
    old "Atsuki specifically heard \"Don't lie! It can only be you. You killed them.\" What I draw from that is that she thought otherwise. She thought one of us was the culprit, but there's no guarantee she was right."
    new "Atsuki 明明听见了那句『别骗我！只可能是你。人是你杀的。』由此我推断，她的看法正好相反。她认定凶手就在我们之中，可这未必就是对的。"

    # game/script.rpy:38611
    old "Sai's voice sounded serious. We had learned long ago that a killer was confined with us, and the look in everyone's eyes told me that they wanted to figure out who they were before they could become victims themselves."
    new "Sai 的语气很严肃。我们早就知道有个杀人凶手和我们关在一起，而此刻每个人的眼神都告诉我，他们想在自己成为下一个牺牲者之前弄清凶手是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:38616
    old "...I doubt she was wrong, given how it ended up."
    new "……可看最后的结果，我不觉得她判断错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38621
    old "Why? The voice came from the staircase, right? We figured there was some sort of scuffle because of that shirt button. This means there was a fight above the staircase between Erina and who she thought was the real culprit."
    new "为什么？声音是从楼梯那边传来的，对吧？因为那颗衬衫纽扣，我们推断那里发生过争执。也就是说，Erina 和她认定是真凶的那个人，在楼梯上方交了手。"

    # game/script.rpy:38626
    old "No matter who that person was, it could've easily ended with Erina falling or being thrown off the stairs. It doesn't matter if they killed anyone else beforehand."
    new "不管那个人是谁，结果都很可能是 Erina 摔下楼梯，或是被推下去。对方此前有没有杀过人，与此无关。"

    # game/script.rpy:38632
    old "B-But none of us could've done it."
    new "可、可是我们之中没人做得到啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:38633
    old "Wrong. You could have. However, we're already believing you by thinking this way."
    new "错了。你们谁都做得到。只不过，我们能这么想，就已经是在相信你们了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38634
    old "Right off the bat, the two main possibilities are that either the person behind every other death killed Erina or that Atsuki did. They could even be the same person. Technically, Isla could've too."
    new "首先，最主要的两种可能是：要么杀害其他人的那个凶手杀了 Erina，要么是 Atsuki 下的手。这两者甚至可能是同一个人。严格说来，Isla 也不是没有可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:38641
    old "You're insane."
    new "你疯了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38646
    old "It's possible she's still here, though. Frightening prospect, but we need to find her."
    new "不过，她有可能还留在这栋楼里。这念头很可怕，但我们必须找到她。"

    # game/script.rpy:38651
    old "Could she really be here? If she hasn't shown up, doesn't that mean...?"
    new "她真的会在这里吗？如果她一直没露面，那不就意味着……？"

    # game/script.rpy:38660
    old "Sai looked into the first rooms in hallway A. We stared at him, nearly immobile, only twitching every time a new door was opened. He went from door to door, narrowing his vision as he peered into each new room."
    new "Sai 查看了 A 走廊最前面的几间房。我们几乎动弹不得，只盯着他看；每开一扇新门，我们都不由得一颤。他一间一间看过去，眯起眼往每间房里瞧。"

    # game/script.rpy:38662
    old "After opening the farthest away crystal room—A1—Isla's head peeked out. We ran there, relieved to see her safe."
    new "等他打开最远端的水晶展室 A1，Isla 探出了头。我们跑过去，见她安然无恙，才松了口气。"

    # game/script.rpy:38671
    old "Wh-What are you doing here?"
    new "你、你怎么会在这儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:38676
    old "Hm? We were looking at the gems, and Mom said to stay in here."
    new "嗯？我们在看宝石呀，妈妈让我待在这里的。"

    # game/script.rpy:38686
    old "Yes, there's one I really like in this room."
    new "对呀，这间房里有一颗我特别喜欢的。"

    # game/script.rpy:38687
    old "We looked at each other, speechless. She didn't know what had happened."
    new "我们面面相觑，说不出话。她还不知道发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:38688
    old "After some uncountable stretch of silence, it became clear that none of us had the strength to say it."
    new "沉默了不知多久，最后我们明白了：谁也没有力气开口说出这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:38693
    old "So you haven't moved from here?"
    new "所以你就一直没离开这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:38694
    old "She nodded."
    new "她点了点头。"

    # game/script.rpy:38699
    old "Did you come here from the attic?"
    new "你们是从阁楼那边过来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:38702
    old "There were only quiet and devastated looks. Ignorant, Isla shrugged, slightly confused by our behavior."
    new "四下里只剩沉默与颓然的神情。Isla 对此一无所知，耸了耸肩，被我们的样子弄得有些困惑。"

    # game/script.rpy:38709
    old "Do you wanna see it? It's really pretty."
    new "你想看看吗？真的很漂亮哦。"

    # game/script.rpy:38715
    old "...We'll come see it in a bit."
    new "……我们待会儿再来看。"

    # game/script.rpy:38719
    old "With a smile, she walked to one of the uncovered curtains and admired a tiny, black stone displayed individually. Slowly, Sai shut the door to leave her in peace for as long as possible while she did as her mother had instructed."
    new "她笑着走向一块掀开的遮布，端详起单独陈列的一颗小小的黑色石头。Sai 缓缓合上门，好让她不被打扰地待着，照母亲的吩咐去做，能待多久就待多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:38728
    old "We'll be back in just a minute."
    new "我们马上就回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:38735
    old "We looked at hallway C, once again witnessing what Isla had no idea about. As we retreated, we heard Sai talking in a whisper."
    new "我们望向 C走廊，又一次看到了 Isla 毫不知情的那一幕。退开时，我们听见 Sai 压低了声音开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:38746
    old "You heard what Isla said, right? Before dying, Erina told her to stay in that room. She knew she was gonna confront the person she believed to be the killer, and she didn't want Isla to see it or interfere.{w} So now tell us, Atsuki: why did you say that none of us could've done it?"
    new "你们都听见 Isla 的话了吧？Erina 临死前让她待在那间房里。她知道要去质问那个自己认定的凶手，也不想让 Isla 看见，或者插手。{w}那么，Atsuki，你来说说：你为什么说我们之中没人做得到？"

    # game/script.rpy:38752
    old "Because I left the attic first. I walked down, but I... couldn't really bring myself to go to the crystal floor. That's why I stayed in the first partition of the second floor, thinking to myself...{w} From there, I would've seen anyone moving through floor 2."
    new "因为我最先离开阁楼。我往下走，可是……实在没勇气去水晶层。所以我留在二楼最前面那一段，心里想着……{w}从那里，二楼有谁走动我都能看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:38757
    old "But you didn't see Erina."
    new "可你没看见 Erina。"

    # game/script.rpy:38763
    old "Like you said earlier, Erina and Isla had to use the elevator to get here."
    new "就像你刚才说的，Erina 和 Isla 只能坐电梯上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:38768
    old "That's right. I heard the elevator once."
    new "没错。我听到过一次电梯的动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:38769
    old "I did too."
    new "我也听到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38775
    old "Yes, me too."
    new "嗯，我也是。"

    # game/script.rpy:38776
    old "Katei and I were the ones who brought it to the attic, and afterward, we left through the main door. This means it's very likely the elevator was moving down and arrived on the crystal floor."
    new "把电梯开到阁楼的是我和 Katei，之后我们是从正门离开的。也就是说，电梯很可能是往下走，停在了水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:38784
    old "Sai approached the elevator and opened it successfully. ...It had been left on the crystal floor."
    new "Sai 走到电梯前，顺利打开了门。……电梯果然停在水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:38785
    old "In addition, the panels haven't been attached yet, so there was no way to call it from here. The floor 1 button was pressed from the attic.{w} Which leaves the following way possible: someone took the elevator with Erina and Isla. That's how the killer could've gotten to the crystal floor without being seen. Did anyone see both of them taking the elevator?"
    new "另外，操作面板还没装上，没法从这里呼叫电梯。一楼的按钮是从阁楼按的。{w}于是只剩下一种可能：有人和 Erina、Isla 一同乘了电梯。凶手就是这样避开众人视线，来到了水晶层。有谁亲眼看到她们两个上电梯吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38789
    old "Every head shook."
    new "所有人都摇了摇头。"

    # game/script.rpy:38794
    old "We could ask Isla, but even if she says that no one else was with them, we can't blindly believe that. They could have threatened her."
    new "可以去问 Isla，但就算她说没有别人同行，我们也不能全信。对方完全可能威胁过她。"

    # game/script.rpy:38799
    old "What did everyone do, exactly?"
    new "各位具体都做了些什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:38809
    old "Atsuki began."
    new "Atsuki 开口了。"

    # game/script.rpy:38810
    old "{w=0.7}\"I'll repeat what I did. I was the first to leave the attic, and I went to the second floor. I spent several minutes there, during which I heard the elevator once.\"{w}\n\n\"Then, Erina's voice echoed to me, but it was very muddled. All I recognized was \"Don't lie! It can only be you. You killed them.\"\"{w}\n\n\"I ran down the staircase and found her dead. I didn't see or hear anyone else, so I ran back up to find you all.\""
    new "{w=0.7}「我把自己做过的事再说一遍。我第一个离开阁楼，去了二楼。在那里待了几分钟，其间听到过一次电梯的声音。」{w}\n\n「后来，Erina 的声音传到我耳边，但十分模糊。我只听清了『别撒谎！只可能是你。是你杀了他们。』」\n\n「我顺着楼梯跑下去，发现她已经死了。我没看见也没听见其他人，于是又跑上来找你们。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38811
    old "{w=0.4}\"Right. He found me first since I was on the third floor. I left the attic later than him and walked through the floors until I stayed on the third.\"{w}\n\n\"I just wanted to be alone for a bit, but I didn't feel like staying put somewhere. However, I ended up spending the most time on the third floor, where I heard the elevator. I spent some time in the offices and some outside.\"{w}\n\n\"Some minutes later, Atsuki came running from below.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「对。我在三楼，所以他先找到了我。我比他晚离开阁楼，一路走过几层，最后停在了三楼。」{w}\n\n「我只是想一个人待一会儿，又不想一直守在同一个地方。结果三楼成了我待得最久的地方，我就是在那里听见电梯的。我先在办公室里待了一阵，又到外面待了一阵。」{w}\n\n「几分钟后，Atsuki 从楼下跑了上来。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38815
    old "{w=0.4}\"So, you're already unable to prove you didn't take the elevator with Erina and Isla. Did anyone see you leaving through the main door?\""
    new "{w=0.4}「也就是说，你没法证明自己没有和 Erina、Isla 一起乘电梯了。有人看见你从正门出去吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:38816
    old "Nobody answered."
    new "没有人回答。"

    # game/script.rpy:38817
    old "{w=0.4}\"Can you prove you didn't go down with them?\""
    new "{w=0.4}「你能证明自己没有和她们一起下去吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:38818
    old "{w=0.4}\"No, but Atsuki saw me on the third floor immediately after he saw Erina.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「不能。但 Atsuki 一看见 Erina 的尸体，紧接着就在三楼看见了我。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38819
    old "{w=0.4}\"I don't think accomplices came into play, because it seems like Erina was killed after she accused someone of being the culprit. However, since you and Atsuki know each other, he could be covering for you.\"{w}\n\n\"Also, if you took the elevator with Erina and Isla, you could've used it to reach the third floor after killing her and sent it back to the crystal floor from there.\"{w}\n\n\"Remember when we sent it from the sixth floor to the crystal floor? We heard no noise. If at that point, Atsuki was already running down the staircase, he might not have heard you. Did you check the elevator when you found Erina?\""
    new "{w=0.4}「我不认为有共犯。Erina 是在指认凶手之后才被杀的。不过，你和 Atsuki 彼此认识，他有可能在替你遮掩。」{w}\n\n「还有，如果你和 Erina、Isla 一起乘了电梯，你完全可以在杀了她之后坐电梯去三楼，再把电梯送回水晶层。」{w}\n\n「还记得我们从六楼把电梯送到水晶层那回吗？我们什么都没听见。如果那时 Atsuki 已经在往楼下跑，他也许就听不到你的动静。你发现 Erina 的时候，检查过电梯吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:38822
    old "{w=0.4}\"That doesn't matter. I can confirm that she didn't take the elevator.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「那不重要。我可以确认，她没有乘电梯。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38823
    old "{w=0.4}\"You can, Katei?\""
    new "{w=0.4}「Katei，你能确认？」"

    # game/script.rpy:38824
    old "{w=0.4}\"Yes. That's because when I left the attic, only Erina, Isla, and Akaro remained. Everyone else had already left.\"{w}\n\n\"I looked everywhere to see who had left, and I also opened the elevator in the attic, as I thought of using it. However, I ended up walking out through the main door. Only Akaro could've taken the elevator with Erina and Isla.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「能。因为我离开阁楼时，留在里面的只剩 Erina、Isla 和 Akaro，其他人都已经走了。」{w}\n\n「我把各处看了一遍，确认谁已经离开，还打开了阁楼的电梯，因为我当时想过要乘它。可最后我还是从正门走了出去。能和 Erina、Isla 一起乘电梯的，只可能是 Akaro。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38826
    old "{w=0.4}\"I see. Well then, what did you do? I recall we found you on the fifth floor.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「原来如此。那么你做了什么？我记得我们是在五楼找到你的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38829
    old "{w=0.4}\"Precisely. That's where I was the entire time.\"{w}\n\n\"In the attic, I spent a few minutes in one of the bedrooms with Akaro. Soon, I noticed some people had left, so I checked to see who remained.\"{w}\n\n\"I was a bit angry people were entering and leaving the attic without my consent, so I went to find the people who had left.\"{w}\n\n\"However, I reached the fifth floor and recalled the two dead bodies. Most importantly, that a killer was around. That's what made me stop.\"{w}\n\n\"I had thousands of things to think about, and that's what I did. I went over the incident to see if there was any conclusion I could get to, but ultimately, I didn't move from there. I heard the elevator once, which was the only sound that reached my ears until you guys came.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「正是。我一直在那里。」{w}\n\n「在阁楼时，我和 Akaro 在其中一个房间里待了几分钟。不久我发觉有人离开了，就去确认还剩哪些人。」{w}\n\n「有人不经我允许就在阁楼里进进出出，我有些恼火，便去找那些离开的人。」{w}\n\n「可走到五楼，我又想起了那两具尸体，更重要的是，想起了凶手还在附近。我因此停下了脚步。」{w}\n\n「我要想的事太多了，就站在那里想。我把整件事从头到尾过了一遍，看能不能得出什么结论，但最终一步也没有挪。其间我听到过一次电梯的声音，那也是你们赶来之前我听到的唯一声响。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38832
    old "{w=0.4}\"That's fine by me, and I can confirm it: he's telling the truth.\"{w}\n\n\"The reason why I stayed on the fourth floor was different from everyone else's. It was because I quickly began to hear noise coming from the floor above me. More specifically, footsteps that I now know belonged to Katei.\"{w}\n\n\"I paid attention to see if there was anything I could figure out from them, but they simply kept going in circles, so it gave the impression that whoever was walking above me was either lost in thought or fairly nervous.\"{w}\n\n\"For most of the time, the sound of footsteps came directly from the third partition. However, during the last few minutes, they left it and started to come from outside the offices.\"{w}\n\n\"When I heard the elevator, I thought the person above me would come down. That never happened, though, and the footsteps never ceased. There was no time for Katei to do anything.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「我没意见，而且我可以作证：他说的是实话。」{w}\n\n「我留在四楼的理由和各位不同：我很快就听见楼上传来动静，准确地说，是脚步声——现在我知道那是 Katei 的。」{w}\n\n「我留心去听，想从中听出些什么，可那脚步声只是来回打转，给人的感觉是，楼上那个人不是在出神，就是相当紧张。」{w}\n\n「大部分时间里，脚步声都直接从第三个隔间那边传来。不过在最后几分钟，它离开了那里，开始从办公室外传来。」{w}\n\n「听到电梯时，我以为楼上的人会下来。可那人始终没下来，脚步声也一直没停。Katei 根本没有时间做别的事。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38833
    old "{w=0.4}\"I'm glad we settled this quickly. This also confirms that Sai is telling the truth. Everything that he said is correct, which means that he was on the fourth floor the whole time.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「这么快就说清楚了，很好。这也证实了 Sai 说的是实话。他说的每一点都对得上，也就是说，他一直都在四楼。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38836
    old "{w=0.4}\"Akaro, it's you left, and you understand your position, right?\""
    new "{w=0.4}「Akaro，剩下的人就是你了，你也明白自己的处境吧？」"

    # game/script.rpy:38837
    old "{w=0.4}\"Yes, but I don't have much to say. I left the attic when Erina and Isla were still sitting on the sofa. I'm pretty sure Katei is right and they were the two people remaining in the attic.\"{w}\n\n\"I knew most people had left, but the sixth floor was completely desolate. I also had quite a few things to think about, so I eventually sat where you found me and spent the whole time there. I actually didn't hear the elevator, but I was pretty far from it and not paying much attention.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「明白，不过我也没什么好说的。我离开阁楼时，Erina 和 Isla 还坐在沙发上。我想 Katei 说得没错，留在阁楼里的就是她们两个。」{w}\n\n「我知道大多数人都走了，六楼又空荡荡的。我也有不少事要想，最后就坐在你们找到我的地方，一直待到你们来。其实我没听见电梯的声音，不过我离得远，也没怎么留意。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38838
    old "{w=0.4}\"I have a question. Why didn't I hear your footsteps if I was directly below you?\""
    new "{w=0.4}「我有个问题。我就在你正下方，为什么没听见你的脚步声？」"

    # game/script.rpy:38839
    old "{w=0.4}\"That I can answer. Haven't you noticed? Akaro doesn't make much sound when he walks.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「这个我能回答。你没注意到吗？Akaro 走路几乎没什么声音。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38840
    old "That threw all of us off, but we confirmed it. Akaro walked around in front of us, and his footsteps were very quiet."
    new "这话让我们都愣了一下，不过我们随后确认了这一点。Akaro 在我们面前走了一圈，脚步声确实很轻。"

    # game/script.rpy:38843
    old "{w=0.4}\"I know what you're all thinking—I could've gone to the crystal floor with Erina and Isla. Of course, Isla could verify that didn't happen, but even if I'd managed to make it to the crystal floor, I couldn't have been found on the sixth.\"{w}\n\n\"According to Sai, Katei spent the last few minutes outside the offices, one floor below me. So if I'd killed Erina, I needed to either use the elevator or walk up to reach the sixth floor. Doing that without being found or heard would've been impossible.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「我知道你们在想什么——我可能和 Erina、Isla 一起去了水晶层。当然，Isla 可以证明没这回事；可就算我真到了水晶层，也不可能在六楼被发现。」{w}\n\n「按 Sai 的说法，最后几分钟 Katei 一直在办公室外，就在我下面一层。那么，如果是我杀了 Erina，我要么坐电梯，要么走楼梯上六楼。无论哪种，都不可能不被人看见或听见。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38844
    old "{w=0.4}\"Is that it, then? Was Atsuki right? None of us could've done it?\"{w}\n\n\"I'm not sure I can think of a way out that doesn't involve the Sekimeiya. We'll get there, though.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「那就是这样了？Atsuki 说对了？我们当中谁都做不到？」{w}\n\n「不借助 Sekimeiya 的话，我一时想不出别的解释。不过总会弄明白的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38845
    old "{w=0.4}\"I can think of one, I suppose.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「我倒能想出一个。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38846
    old "Everyone looked at me, but I only had a random, unlikely-sounding thought to let out."
    new "所有人都看向我，可我只有一个突然冒出来、听上去不太可能的念头要说出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:38849
    old "{w=0.4}\"I'm just saying that Sai and Katei could technically have done it, right? Their versions of events are just covering each other.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「我只是说，从道理上讲，Sai 和 Katei 也有可能是凶手，不是吗？他们各自的说法不过是互相打掩护。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38850
    old "{w=0.4}\"That's not true. Did you not hear what Akaro said? He said that when he left the attic, Erina and Isla were the only two people left. That means that Katei and I couldn't have gone to the crystal floor.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「不对。你没听见 Akaro 说的吗？他离开阁楼时，里面只剩 Erina 和 Isla 两个人。也就是说，Katei 和我根本不可能去水晶层。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38851
    old "{w=0.4}\"You could have. Erina and Isla used the elevator alone, from the attic. However, they got off on floor 4 or 5, where you two were. That way, you could've gotten to the crystal floor with a single elevator trip.\"{w}\n\n\"I don't mean to say I believe it to be the case, but I'm answering what you asked. Then, you could've taken the elevator back up while Atsuki and I were on the crystal floor, which we wouldn't have heard.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「有可能。Erina 和 Isla 从阁楼单独乘了电梯，但她们在四楼或五楼——也就是你们两人所在的地方——下了电梯。这样，你们乘一趟电梯就能到水晶层。」{w}\n\n「我不是说我相信事情就是这样，只是在回答你的问题。然后，趁 Atsuki 和我在水晶层的时候，你们可以再乘电梯上去，我们不会听见。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38852
    old "{w=0.4}\"I see. So then you could have also done this.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「原来如此。那么你也可能用同样的手法。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38853
    old "{w=0.4}\"Yes, which is why we should ask Isla. Once we rule that out, it seems like all of us have some sort of alibi.\""
    new "{w=0.4}「对，所以该去问 Isla。排除这种可能之后，我们每个人似乎都有不在场证明了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:38861
    old "Then, the final method.{w} Using the Sekimeiya in the future."
    new "那么，就剩最后一种手法了。{w}在未来使用 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:38862
    old "Atsuki confirmed it wasn't touched up until now, but someone can use it later on. They could invalidate everything we've thought of by just appearing in the crystal room from the future. However, I believe we can figure out whether that's the answer."
    new "Atsuki 已经确认，它直到现在都没被人碰过，但之后总有人可以用它。只要有人从未来出现在水晶展室，我们之前所有的推论就都白费了。不过，我想我们能查明答案是不是这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:38867
    old "Sai walked to the room where Isla was, so we followed him."
    new "Sai 走向 Isla 所在的房间，我们便跟了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:38871
    old "With what we'd talked about, could Erina's killer be identified? I didn't think so, but there was a chance I was failing to consider something."
    new "凭我们刚才说的这些，能找出杀害 Erina 的凶手吗？我觉得不能，但也许有什么是我没想到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:38891
    old "...How are you doing?"
    new "……你还好吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38896
    old "Hm? I'm fine."
    new "嗯？我很好。"

    # game/script.rpy:38901
    old "That's good. I have a question.{w} When you came from the attic, you used the elevator, right? Were you and Erina alone?"
    new "那就好。我有个问题。{w}你们从阁楼下来时乘的是电梯，对吧？当时只有你和 Erina 两个人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38912
    old "We were. Why do you ask?"
    new "只有我们两个。怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:38923
    old "E-Erina...! What are you doing here!?"
    new "E、Erina……！你怎么会在这里！？"

    # game/script.rpy:38933
    old "What am I doing...?"
    new "我在这里做什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:38942
    old "She was there, casually leaning against the line of cabinets. I could hardly believe what I was seeing, but there was no wariness in her eyes and not even a trace of blood near her."
    new "她就在那里，随意地靠在一排展示柜上。我几乎不敢相信自己的眼睛，可她眼里没有一丝警惕，身旁也看不到半点血迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:38948
    old "What's with those looks?"
    new "你们那是什么眼神？"

    # game/script.rpy:38953
    old "Do you not know what happened?"
    new "你不知道发生了什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:38958
    old "No? What?"
    new "不知道？出什么事了？"

    # game/script.rpy:38960
    old "Sai responded only by peering at Isla's curious face, which communicated to Erina that it was something her daughter couldn't hear. She stood up and came over to us, clearly oblivious."
    new "Sai 没有回答，只是看了看 Isla 那张写满好奇的脸。Erina 立刻领会到，这话不能让她女儿听见。她站起身，走到我们这边，显然对发生了什么毫不知情。"

    # game/script.rpy:38965
    old "Wait here, sweetie."
    new "在这儿等一下，宝贝。"

    # game/script.rpy:38982
    old "E-Erina... What happened since you two left the attic?"
    new "E、Erina……你们俩离开阁楼以后，出了什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:38987
    old "What does that mean? People were leaving, and Isla said she wanted to come down too since she still hadn't seen all the gems. I noticed she was trying to cheer herself up a little despite the... two bodies we found, so even though I didn't want to leave, I went with her just so that it took her mind off it."
    new "这话是什么意思？当时大家都要走，Isla 说她也想下楼，因为她还没有把所有的宝石都看完。我看出她是在强打精神——毕竟我们发现了那两具……尸体——所以哪怕我自己并不想离开，也还是陪她一起去了，好让她分分心。"

    # game/script.rpy:38993
    old "And you took the elevator?"
    new "然后你们坐了电梯？"

    # game/script.rpy:38998
    old "Yes, she wanted to. There was still a little bit of blood inside, but she insisted."
    new "嗯，是她想坐。电梯里还残留着一些血迹，可她非要坐。"

    # game/script.rpy:39008
    old "A-Are you going to tell me something?"
    new "你、你们是不是有什么话要跟我说？"

    # game/script.rpy:39009
    old "She'd noticed we all looked like we were staring at a ghost, and she began to look seriously unsettled herself."
    new "她察觉到我们一个个都像见了鬼似的盯着她，自己也开始明显不安起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:39014
    old "And you simply stayed in this room?"
    new "你们就一直待在这个房间里？"

    # game/script.rpy:39019
    old "There's potentially still a murderer around, and I especially didn't want to move around this floor or go to the lobby. I noticed Isla was focused on one of these gems, so I told her we'd stay here. I wasn't going to leave her alone unless we guaranteed we were safe."
    new "凶手可能还在附近，我尤其不想在这一层走动，更不想去大厅。我看 Isla 正专心盯着这些宝石中的一颗，就告诉她我们留在这里。除非能保证安全，否则我不会把她一个人丢下。"

    # game/script.rpy:39025
    old "So just earlier, when we talked to Isla, you were here?"
    new "那么刚才我们跟 Isla 说话的时候，你就在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:39030
    old "What? Yes, behind the door. I didn't know if you needed something, but of course I was inside."
    new "什么？对啊，就在门后。我不知道你们是不是有事，但我当然在屋里。"

    # game/script.rpy:39036
    old "Finally, Erina noticed where our lines of sight went and turned around."
    new "Erina 终于察觉我们在看什么，转过了身。"

    # game/script.rpy:39045
    old "There was no pause before the gasp came."
    new "她连半点停顿都没有，就倒吸了一口凉气。"

    # game/script.rpy:39050
    old "Ah...! That's...!"
    new "啊……！那是……！"

    # game/script.rpy:39052
    old "What's wrong...?"
    new "怎么了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:39054
    old "N-Nothing, please, stay there..."
    new "没、没什么，求你待在那儿别动……"

    # game/script.rpy:39066
    old "She approached the face-down body and recognized that it was no misinterpretation. Her clothes were the ones stained by blood, and the body was her own."
    new "她走近那具俯卧的尸体，确认自己没有看错。沾满血迹的正是她的衣服，而那具尸体就是她自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:39067
    old "Oh my God. This is... me? H-How can... There's no way!"
    new "天哪。这是……我？怎、怎么会……不可能！"

    # game/script.rpy:39068
    old "She broke down instantly. Before her was proof that she could soon die. Even though it had already happened, the Sekimeiya's existence allowed it to be a future event. Of course, that made everything even more strange. Would she travel to the past after coming up with a conclusion on who the killer was?"
    new "她当场就崩溃了。眼前的东西就是她可能很快就会死去的证明。事情明明已经发生，可由于 Sekimeiya 的存在，它也能成为未来的事件。当然，这让一切变得更加诡异。她会不会在推断出谁是凶手之后，穿越到过去？"

    # game/script.rpy:39069
    old "W-We know it happened a few minutes ago, but we have no idea what actually happened. We thought you'd left Isla in that room."
    new "我、我们知道那是几分钟前发生的，却完全不知道究竟出了什么事。我们还以为你把 Isla 留在那个房间里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39070
    old "She can't see this...!"
    new "不能让她看到这个……！"

    # game/script.rpy:39076
    old "Erina ran back and tightly gripped the doorknob."
    new "Erina 跑回去，死死握住门把手。"

    # game/script.rpy:39081
    old "Should we bring her... you... that body to the lobby?"
    new "要不要把她……把你……把那具尸体搬到大厅去？"

    # game/script.rpy:39086
    old "No, we'll have to go there eventually...! So much blood can't be removed either..."
    new "不，我们早晚都得去那儿……！而且那么多血也清不掉……"

    # game/script.rpy:39094
    old "Isla, I'm sorry, but we need to go back to the attic."
    new "Isla，对不起，我们得回阁楼去。"

    # game/script.rpy:39099
    old "Why? I want to stay here."
    new "为什么？我想待在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:39100
    old "Please, do me a favor and come with us."
    new "求你了，就当帮我个忙，跟我们走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:39102
    old "We perceived a tiny nod. Relieved, Erina crouched to pick her up and brought her to the staircase, covering her face on the way."
    new "我们看见她轻轻点了点头。Erina 松了口气，蹲下身把她抱了起来，一路遮着她的脸，带她走向楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:39111
    old "I'm not tired, and we can just take the elevator."
    new "我又不累，而且我们坐电梯就行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39112
    old "I thought you preferred being picked up. You can walk if you want."
    new "我还以为你喜欢被人抱着。想自己走也可以。"

    # game/script.rpy:39113
    old "Hm... No."
    new "嗯……不要。"

    # game/script.rpy:39114
    old "There we go."
    new "这样才对嘛。"

    # game/script.rpy:39115
    old "It seemed the surrealism wouldn't end any time soon. Everyone was glad to see Erina safe, but sheer bewilderment was even more dominant."
    new "看来这份荒诞一时半会儿还不会收场。看到 Erina 平安无事，大家都松了口气，可满腹的困惑还是占了上风。"

    # game/script.rpy:39116
    old "Even Atsuki, who I'd assumed would be out of it for the rest of our imprisonment, had proven otherwise. However, it made sense. After all, whatever his plan entailed was still bound to happen. That was unquestionable."
    new "我原以为 Atsuki 在接下来的囚禁日子里都会魂不守舍，可事实并非如此。不过这也说得通。毕竟，无论他的计划是什么，都注定会发生。这一点毋庸置疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:39122
    old "Once Erina and Isla disappeared from view, Sai opened the elevator."
    new "Erina 和 Isla 的身影一消失，Sai 就打开了电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:39128
    old "We should send the elevator to the attic. That'll be of use."
    new "我们该把电梯送到阁楼去。那样会派上用场。"

    # game/script.rpy:39129
    old "Oh, sure."
    new "哦，好啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:39130
    old "I unlocked the floor 7 button with the key and pressed it before stepping out. After that, we walked all the way up."
    new "我用钥匙解开了七楼按钮的锁，按下之后才走出电梯。随后，我们一路步行上楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:39137
    old "On the way, I had to stop to drink from a sink in one of the bathrooms. It wasn't exactly high quality water, but it somewhat satisfied my thirst, and after some of the others did the same, we arrived at the attic's door."
    new "半路上，我不得不停下来，在某个洗手间的水龙头下喝了点水。水质算不上好，但多少解了渴。其他几个人也照做之后，我们才来到阁楼门前。"

    # game/script.rpy:39147
    old "Eruption"
    new "爆发"

    # game/script.rpy:39150
    old "I thought you took the elevator."
    new "我以为你们是坐电梯上来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:39156
    old "We sent it up empty."
    new "我们让电梯空着上去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39157
    old "We saw Isla in the living room. Before Erina could join her, Sai grabbed her sleeve."
    new "我们看见 Isla 在客厅里。Erina 还没来得及走过去，Sai 就抓住了她的袖子。"

    # game/script.rpy:39160
    old "This is a very important question.{w} Who do you think the killer is?"
    new "这个问题非常重要。{w}你认为凶手是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:39165
    old "The killer? ...I have no idea."
    new "凶手？……我完全没有头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:39166
    old "I don't only mean the person behind whatever happened just now. I mean in general, ever since this morning."
    new "我说的不只是刚才那件事的幕后之人。我是说，从今天早上开始，这些事背后的凶手。"

    # game/script.rpy:39167
    old "I know, and that's what I answered."
    new "我知道，我也是这么回答的。"

    # game/script.rpy:39168
    old "According to Atsuki, he heard you accusing someone of being the killer. Once he ran to the crystal floor, he saw your body."
    new "据 Atsuki 说，他听见你指认某个人是凶手。等他跑到水晶层，看到的就是你的尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:39173
    old "Wh-What...? I don't know...! I don't have a clue who the killer could be! I don't know anything about this. Just... let me be with my daughter, please."
    new "什、什么……？我不知道……！我根本不知道凶手会是谁！这件事我一点都不清楚。求你们……让我和我女儿待在一起吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:39176
    old "She entered the room and followed Isla to the hallway."
    new "她走进房间，跟着 Isla 去了走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:39181
    old "Then maybe she actually saw the real culprit. Since it wasn't anyone she'd seen before, that was all she needed to know that it was them."
    new "那她说不定真的看见了真凶。因为对方不是她见过的任何一个人，光凭这一点，她就能认定那是凶手。"

    # game/script.rpy:39186
    old "You could be right. The Erina who died... she could've only come from the future."
    new "你说得也许没错。死去的那个 Erina……她只可能是从未来来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:39192
    old "So she had a better idea of who to suspect than she does right now?"
    new "也就是说，她当时比现在更清楚该怀疑谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:39193
    old "Yes, that's what I mean. I have no clue how this would work, though, or why she'd travel to the past. I suppose that tells us the Sekimeiya is bound to be used again in the future.{w} Technically, all Erina needs to do to be safe is not travel to the past. But she has to... or else what happened makes no sense."
    new "对，我就是这个意思。不过我想不通这到底是怎么做到的，也想不通她为什么要穿越到过去。我想，这至少说明未来一定还会有人使用 Sekimeiya。{w} 严格来说，Erina 只要不穿越到过去就能平安无事。可她非去不可……否则已经发生的事就说不通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39199
    old "Don't you find something strange? How come Erina didn't hear her own words if she was in hallway A? Isla should have too, right? Didn't you say that she yelled?"
    new "你不觉得奇怪吗？如果 Erina 当时在 A走廊，怎么会没听见自己的声音？Isla 也本该听见的吧？你不是说她大喊了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:39205
    old "Yes. Are you suspecting me again?"
    new "没错。你又在怀疑我了？"

    # game/script.rpy:39206
    old "Oh, no, actually. I meant to suspect Erina herself since she's another person who could've technically done this. Wouldn't that be just nuts? Suicide via murdering yourself.{w} Before you ask, I don't believe that happened, no, but it's a little strange."
    new "啊，不，其实不是。我是想说，Erina 本人也有嫌疑，毕竟严格来讲，她也是能做到这件事的人之一。那岂不是太荒唐了？自己杀自己，这也能算自杀吗。{w} 先别问，我也不信真有这种事，不过确实有点奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:39207
    old "It's not. The noise came from high in the staircase, so it had to go down and maybe through the door to reach where Erina and Isla were. Given there's less echo on the crystal floor, it makes sense they heard nothing."
    new "不奇怪。声音是从楼梯高处传来的，要传到 Erina 和 Isla 那里，得往下走，说不定还得穿过那道门。水晶层回音本来就小，她们什么都没听见也说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:39208
    old "That could be it.{w} Isla nodded when I asked her \"So you haven't moved from here?\"{w} She probably thought \"you\" meant her and Erina, so by answering yes, she meant neither of them left the room."
    new "有可能就是这样。{w} 我问她「你没离开过这里吧？」的时候，她点了点头。{w} 她大概把这句话里的「你」当成了她和 Erina 两个人，所以点头的意思是她们谁都没离开房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:39214
    old "You're insistent about this."
    new "你倒是咬住这一点不放。"

    # game/script.rpy:39224
    old "He sat on one of the steps."
    new "他在一级台阶上坐了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:39229
    old "Wondering whether he had something else to add evolved into a few minutes of silence."
    new "我正琢磨他是不是还有别的话要说，结果就这么沉默了几分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:39231
    old "I just have no idea what's happening here. Atsuki can keep denying it, but he's behind some of it, if not all."
    new "我只是完全搞不懂这里到底在发生什么。Atsuki 尽可以继续否认，但就算不是全部，其中也有几分是他搞的鬼。"

    # game/script.rpy:39237
    old "...Why do you think so?"
    new "……你为什么会这么想？"

    # game/script.rpy:39242
    old "You've been hiding something since right after we got trapped, and the girl who appeared in the elevator has to be related to you. Do you still deny that?"
    new "我们刚被困住不久，你就一直有事瞒着。电梯里出现的那个女孩也一定和你有关。你还要否认吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:39247
    old "...No, I don't. I'm aware it has to be my doing, but I haven't done anything. I don't know what I would do either, and the Sekimeiya doesn't work. I promise I'm much more confused than you are."
    new "……不，我不否认。我也明白那一定是我做的，可我什么都没做。我连自己会做什么都不知道，而且 Sekimeiya 根本用不了。我保证，我比你还要困惑得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:39248
    old "...{w}I don't think you did anything to Erina, and so far the four deaths could have a motive in common. The policeman could've entered through the storeroom, and then he was killed because he was a direct threat."
    new "……{w}我觉得 Erina 的事不是你做的。而且到目前为止，四起死亡可能出于同一个动机。那个警察也许是从储藏室进来的，随后因为构成直接威胁而被杀。"

    # game/script.rpy:39251
    old "The two in the elevator could have the very same motive: they were seen as threats. Both of them could've gone through the storeroom door as well since they weren't found until much later.{w} Finally, Erina might've confronted the killer. It could be that the four dead people were all seen as threats by the same person."
    new "电梯里那两个人也可能是出于同一个动机：他们被视为威胁。而且他们俩也可能是从储藏室的门进出的，毕竟过了很久才发现。{w} 最后，Erina 也许是当面撞上了凶手。或许这四名死者，全都是被同一个人视为威胁的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:39253
    old "This stupid storeroom door is what pisses me off the most. Are people really entering and leaving the tower without being seen? That's nonsense, right? But it's a fact that it was opened."
    new "最让我火大的就是这扇该死的储藏室门。真有人能进出这座塔还不被发现？这根本说不通吧？可它确实被打开过，这是事实。"

    # game/script.rpy:39259
    old "Remember what I said. There's no way it leads outside."
    new "记住我说过的。那扇门绝不可能通向外面。"

    # game/script.rpy:39260
    old "There's no way it doesn't. In fact, it's still incredibly likely you went through it."
    new "它不可能不通向外面。事实上，你从那扇门过去的可能性依然非常大。"

    # game/script.rpy:39265
    old "...I didn't! I never knew about it!"
    new "……我没有！我从来不知道有那扇门！"

    # game/script.rpy:39266
    old "Katei, if the culprit is just one of us, it's you. You disappeared for almost three hours and appeared right before the policeman did. Before the elevator opened on the sixth floor, I had already tried to open it, and it was you who stayed in the attic last. You could've moved the elevator from the attic to the sixth floor, and you could've also locked the attic from the inside."
    new "Katei，如果凶手就在我们之中，那只能是你。你消失了将近三个小时，又恰好在警察出现之前现身。六楼电梯门打开之前，我已经试过打开它了，而最后待在阁楼的人是你。你完全可以把电梯从阁楼移到六楼，也完全可以从里面把阁楼锁上。"

    # game/script.rpy:39269
    old "I did none of that...!"
    new "我一样都没做过……！"

    # game/script.rpy:39270
    old "What happened with Erina is what gives you the most benefit of the doubt. Right now, the people who could've killed Erina are Atsuki, Erina, Isla, the real culprit if they're none of us, and anyone who traveled from the future to the crystal floor."
    new "偏偏是 Erina 这桩事，最能替你洗脱嫌疑。照现在来看，可能杀死 Erina 的人有 Atsuki、Erina、Isla；如果真凶不在我们之中，那也包括真凶本人；此外还有任何从未来穿越到水晶层的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:39271
    old "If we rule out those last two options, our choices will diminish greatly, and it's possible we can, like I said earlier.{w} If someone traveled from the future and killed Erina, either they're still here or they left through the storeroom. Basically, if we can't find anyone and I confirm that the storeroom door didn't open, we can remove those possibilities."
    new "如果排除最后两种可能，范围就会大大缩小，而且就像我刚才说的，我们也许真能做到。{w} 如果有人从未来穿越回来杀了 Erina，那这个人要么还在这里，要么已经从储藏室离开了。总之，如果我们找不到任何人，而我又能确认储藏室的门没有开过，这些可能性就可以排除。"

    # game/script.rpy:39272
    old "That could be bypassed with the Sekimeiya by using it to travel to a place that's just been examined or outside the tower. However, Atsuki can confirm whether the cabinet was opened. I believe we have the circumstances here to accomplish a definitive search. Specifically, one where time travel isn't going to fuck us."
    new "用 Sekimeiya 可以绕过这种排查：直接传送到刚检查过的地方，或者塔外。不过展示柜有没有被打开过，Atsuki 能确认。我认为这里具备条件，可以做一次彻底的搜查。确切地说，是一次不会被时间穿越搅乱的搜查。"

    # game/script.rpy:39278
    old "So you're saying that if we don't find anyone, Atsuki is our man?"
    new "你是说，如果找不到人，那凶手就是 Atsuki？"

    # game/script.rpy:39283
    old "He, Erina, and Isla would become the only three people who could've done it. This is the conclusion all of us reached."
    new "那样的话，能做出这件事的就只剩他、Erina 和 Isla 三个人。这是我们所有人共同得出的结论。"

    # game/script.rpy:39289
    old "Let's do it, then."
    new "那就开始吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:39290
    old "Yes. I think your logic is right, but Atsuki can't be responsible."
    new "好。我认为你的推理没错，但 Atsuki 不可能是凶手。"

    # game/script.rpy:39295
    old "...Okay. If we do it well, no matter what the result is, it will strongly indicate something."
    new "……好吧。只要我们做得好，无论结果如何，都能有力地说明一些问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:39301
    old "We walked up to the living room. Through the hallway door, we saw Erina and Isla getting closer."
    new "我们走到起居室。透过走廊的门，能看见 Erina 和 Isla 越走越近。"

    # game/script.rpy:39308
    old "What's that...?"
    new "那是什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:39313
    old "Look what I found."
    new "看看我找到了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:39314
    old "With two hands, Isla was holding one of the bed sheets, folded up into a sphere. It was wrapped around something, and I could tell what Isla was going to say before she did."
    new "Isla 双手捧着一条床单，团成了一个球。里面裹着什么东西，而她还没开口，我就已经猜到她要说什么了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39316
    old "It's the Sekimeiya."
    new "是 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:39321
    old "What? The Sekimeiya's on the crystal floor."
    new "什么？Sekimeiya 明明在水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:39327
    old "No, I have it here. It was in the, um... wardrobe.{w} I knew I wasn't allowed to touch it, so I had to cover it with this."
    new "不对，它就在我这儿。它原本在，那个……衣柜里。{w} 我知道我不能碰它，所以只好用这个把它裹起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:39328
    old "Great. How did this thing even get up here?"
    new "好啊。这东西到底是怎么跑到楼上来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:39334
    old "Is that so? Let us see."
    new "是吗？我们看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:39335
    old "No... We need to put it in the cabinet, right?"
    new "不行……得把它放回展示柜里，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:39348
    old "...Is she telling the truth?"
    new "……她说的是实话吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:39354
    old "I don't know. She opened the wardrobe and grabbed the top bed sheet. When I stood up to see what she was doing, I couldn't see what she had."
    new "不知道。她打开衣柜，抽出最上面那条床单。我起身想看她在做什么，却看不清她手里拿着什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:39360
    old "There's no way it was brought here since we saw it in the cabinet, right? It could only have happened when we were talking to Isla, if there was a time where neither the staircase nor the elevator were being observed."
    new "既然我们看到它时它还在展示柜里，那它就不可能是在那之后被带过来的，对吧？唯一的可能，就是我们和 Isla 说话的那段时间——只要当时楼梯和电梯都没人盯着。"

    # game/script.rpy:39365
    old "It really may be teleporting. If the cabinet is empty and the thread is still there, it must have teleported out."
    new "它或许真的是靠传送移动的。既然展示柜空了、线还留在那里，那它一定是传送出去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39370
    old "I see, you're right.{w} Let's do what we were talking about on the way down. If we have the Sekimeiya while we search every floor, there's no way it'll be used to bypass us."
    new "原来如此，你说得对。{w}就按下楼时说的那样做。我们带着 Sekimeiya 逐层搜过去，就不可能有人靠它绕过我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:39376
    old "But shouldn't we hurry up...?"
    new "可是，我们是不是该快一点……？"

    # game/script.rpy:39382
    old "She's right."
    new "她说得对。"

    # game/script.rpy:39383
    old "You know how important it is that we do this properly. We'll be fast."
    new "你也知道，把这件事做稳妥有多重要。我们会尽快。"

    # game/script.rpy:39389
    old "Isla, we'll stay here while they go down."
    new "Isla，他们下去的时候，我们留在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:39394
    old "What? No. I'll keep the Sekimeiya safe."
    new "什么？不行。Sekimeiya 由我来保护。"

    # game/script.rpy:39399
    old "She tightened her arms around the ball, and Erina shut her eyes. On the way to the event room was the dead body Isla couldn't see."
    new "她把怀里的球抱得更紧，Erina 闭上了眼。通往活动室的路上，躺着 Isla 看不见的那具尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:39404
    old "You should do as your mother says. You can trust us to take good care of it."
    new "听你妈妈的话。交给我们，你尽可放心，我们会好好保管。"

    # game/script.rpy:39405
    old "I can do it better, and it's dangerous to be alone. That's what you said earlier."
    new "我能做得更好，而且一个人待着很危险。这是你刚才说的。"

    # game/script.rpy:39408
    old "It's fine, we'll go. After that, Isla, we're coming back up, okay?"
    new "算了，我们下去。Isla，之后我们会再上来，好吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:39415
    old "Isla looked genuinely happy to escort the Sekimeiya all the way down, but there was no chance Erina would let her finish the trip."
    new "Isla 看上去是真心高兴能一路护送 Sekimeiya 下去，但 Erina 绝不会让她走完全程。"

    # game/script.rpy:39418
    old "The elevator is here, and we can hear it if it's used. The intent is to make this perfect, and that won't be an issue either as long as we confirm it's empty before moving on."
    new "电梯就停在这儿，有人用我们也能听见。我们要的是做到万无一失，只要动身前确认里面没人，这一点也不成问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:39428
    old "We began to put that plan into effect. If one of us was the real culprit, they could purposely leave something, or someone, undiscovered. That was why all of us looked everywhere there was to look—so that everyone could agree with the result in the end."
    new "我们开始执行这个方案。如果凶手就在我们之中，他大可以故意漏掉某样东西、某个人。正因如此，所有能查的地方都由我们所有人一起查过——这样到最后，每个人都能认可这个结果。"

    # game/script.rpy:39429
    old "Since Isla had claimed she'd found the Sekimeiya in one of the wardrobes, it was possible something had gone unseen for a while. We didn't only look for people, but for anything."
    new "既然 Isla 说她是在某个衣柜里找到 Sekimeiya 的，那就说明有些东西可能很久都没被人注意到。我们要找的不只是人，也包括任何东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:39433
    old "Every floor had a place where someone could wait to prevent anyone else from passing. Erina and Isla took that job to make the search valid."
    new "每一层都有可以派人守着、拦住其他人通过的地方。为了让这次搜索站得住脚，Erina 和 Isla 负责把守。"

    # game/script.rpy:39436
    old "Doing all of it took a while, but on floor 3, the search hadn't gone any differently from the others; we still had zero results."
    new "全部做完花了不少时间，但三楼的搜索和其余几层并无不同，仍然一无所获。"

    # game/script.rpy:39443
    old "We were in front of the floor 2 offices, ready to move on to the last floor. We expected to be stopped on the way to the staircase, as Isla couldn't be allowed to walk down."
    new "我们来到二楼办公室前，准备前往最后一层。我们本以为会在去楼梯的途中被拦下，毕竟不能让 Isla 往下走。"

    # game/script.rpy:39444
    old "And yet our expectations were betrayed."
    new "然而，我们的预想落空了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39449
    old "Look at the elevator...!"
    new "快看电梯……！"

    # game/script.rpy:39458
    old "Next to the elevator, the metallic panel holding the button was properly attached."
    new "电梯旁，镶着按钮的那块金属面板已经完好地装了回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:39463
    old "Oh, what the fuck...? Weren't all the buttons inside it when we sent it up?"
    new "搞什么……？我们把电梯送上去的时候，按钮不是全都在里面吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:39464
    old "...I don't know. Maybe one had been taken out."
    new "……我不知道。也许有一个被取出来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39469
    old "It doesn't matter. Do not press it.{w} Someone is guaranteed to have been on the crystal floor, and their only way out is the storeroom. Just in case, we shouldn't bring the elevator here."
    new "无所谓。别按。{w}水晶层上肯定有人，而他们唯一的出口就是储藏室。为防万一，不能把电梯叫过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:39477
    old "Isla, give Akaro the Sekimeiya. It's too dangerous to go down."
    new "Isla，把 Sekimeiya 交给 Akaro。下去太危险了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39482
    old "H-Huh...? No."
    new "哎、什么……？不行。"

    # game/script.rpy:39483
    old "Sai was the first to walk down while Atsuki looked at both bathrooms. Meanwhile, Isla kept tightening her arms, reluctant to let go of the Sekimeiya."
    new "Sai 先走了下去，我则去查看两间洗手间。与此同时，Isla 把怀里的 Sekimeiya 越抱越紧，舍不得松手。"

    # game/script.rpy:39484
    old "Isla, this is important. You can't go down there."
    new "Isla，这很重要。你不能下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:39485
    old "...It's just to the event room."
    new "……只是去活动室而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:39490
    old "Erina, it's fine. You can both come."
    new "Erina，没关系。你们两个都来吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:39491
    old "Wh-What...? Not a chance."
    new "什、什么……？绝对不行。"

    # game/script.rpy:39492
    old "Look, just get down here. Don't argue."
    new "听我的，先下来。别争了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39501
    old "I looked through the door and understood what Sai meant. There was no blood. Not only that, I proceeded down, and there was no body anywhere."
    new "我透过门看过去，明白了 Sai 的意思。没有血。不止如此，我继续往下走，哪儿都找不到尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:39515
    old "Oh my God, this is ridiculous."
    new "天啊，这简直荒唐。"

    # game/script.rpy:39520
    old "Was it all removed?"
    new "全都被清理掉了？"

    # game/script.rpy:39521
    old "What, with a mop? Wouldn't stains be visible?"
    new "什么，用拖把拖的？那也该留下痕迹吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:39522
    old "The elevator button has been reattached here too."
    new "这里的电梯按钮也重新装上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39527
    old "I'll just go to the event room."
    new "我去活动室就是了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39537
    old "Wait...!"
    new "等等……！"

    # game/script.rpy:39540
    old "Erina dashed ahead of her and opened the door herself.{w} It didn't seem like there was anything inside."
    new "Erina 抢在她前面冲了过去，亲手推开门。{w}里面似乎什么也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:39551
    old "Whatever, put it in. Nobody can leave this floor without being seen, at least."
    new "算了，放进去吧。至少没人能在不被看见的情况下离开这一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:39567
    old "Wait, it's still here."
    new "等等，它还在。"

    # game/script.rpy:39572
    old "Huh... Really?"
    new "咦……真的？"

    # game/script.rpy:39573
    old "Atsuki had uncovered the cabinet, and the truth was plain to see: the Sekimeiya was still on its cushion."
    new "我揭开展示柜的遮布，真相一目了然：Sekimeiya 仍搁在垫子上。"

    # game/script.rpy:39581
    old "Oh...! There are two of them!"
    new "哦……！有两个啊！"

    # game/script.rpy:39582
    old "Isla rapidly unwrapped the sheet to prove that she hadn't lied."
    new "Isla 飞快地解开那块布，想证明自己没有撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:39589
    old "Hang on, it's not here. The thread I left."
    new "等等，不在这儿。我留下的那根线。"

    # game/script.rpy:39596
    old "It's not here...! The Sekimeiya!"
    new "没有……！Sekimeiya 不见了！"

    # game/script.rpy:39599
    old "Isla desperately looked all through the sheet, but the Sekimeiya wasn't there."
    new "Isla 急得把整块布翻了个遍，可 Sekimeiya 就是不在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:39604
    old "I promise I didn't lie! I had it here!"
    new "我发誓我没骗人！它本来就在这儿的！"

    # game/script.rpy:39605
    old "Atsuki crouched and felt the cloth."
    new "Atsuki 蹲下身，摸了摸那块布。"

    # game/script.rpy:39610
    old "Y-You didn't lie...! It's burning."
    new "你、你没骗人……！真的好烫。"

    # game/script.rpy:39615
    old "Yeah. It started to feel hot on the fourth floor."
    new "嗯。到四楼的时候就开始烫了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39620
    old "You felt it when the Sekimeiya was in the center...? I'll bet it was extremely hot, then. Also, the cabinet is still locked."
    new "你是说，Sekimeiya 在布中央的时候你就摸到热度了……？那它当时一定烫得厉害。还有，展示柜仍然锁着。"

    # game/script.rpy:39625
    old "...I-Is this what you're implying? That it was taken out of the cabinet since the thread is gone and then brought to the attic? Then, at some point, it teleported inside again?"
    new "……你、你是这个意思吗？线没了，说明有人把它从展示柜里拿出来，带到了阁楼。然后不知什么时候，它又传送了回去？"

    # game/script.rpy:39630
    old "I'm not implying anything, but that's what could've happened."
    new "我没想暗示什么，只是确实有这种可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:39635
    old "That doesn't make sense.{w} It really doesn't—the cabinet is locked. That would mean that whoever took the Sekimeiya out locked the cabinet while it was empty.{w} I have another idea. Let me take the Sekimeiya. Akaro and Katei, you watch the stairs."
    new "这说不通。{w}真的说不通——展示柜一直锁着。照这么说，拿走 Sekimeiya 的人还得在柜子空着的时候把它锁上。{w}我还有个想法。Sekimeiya 由我来拿。Akaro、Katei，你们盯着楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:39646
    old "Because the last time it wasn't working, remember? I can test if it is now without activating it."
    new "因为上次它没起作用，还记得吧？现在不用启动它，我也能试出它是否恢复正常。"

    # game/script.rpy:39656
    old "Is that really okay? We came here to leave it where it's safe."
    new "这样真的好吗？我们特地过来，就是为了把它放到安全的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:39661
    old "We need to understand what's happening. It must be done."
    new "我们得弄清到底发生了什么。这一步非走不可。"

    # game/script.rpy:39665
    old "After all that time, I still had the keyring, so I took it out and unlocked the cabinet."
    new "隔了这么久，钥匙串仍在我身上，我便取出来打开了展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:39674
    old "Sai grabbed the Sekimeiya with his sleeves, causing the curtain to fall, and put it in the middle of the sheet. He then closed the glass."
    new "Sai 隔着衣袖抓住 Sekimeiya，遮布随之落下。他把它放到布的中央，然后合上了玻璃。"

    # game/script.rpy:39676
    old "It was very cold, so let's see if that changes."
    new "它刚才冰得很，看看这样会不会有变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:39684
    old "He wrapped it around with one layer of the cloth and waited a few seconds with his hand over it."
    new "他用布裹了一层，把手覆在上面，等了几秒。"

    # game/script.rpy:39692
    old "...It is getting hot—definitely."
    new "……热起来了——确实热了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39697
    old "When Atsuki tried it, he agreed as well."
    new "Atsuki 试了一下，也这么说。"

    # game/script.rpy:39702
    old "All right, I'm sure there's someone on this floor. Don't take your eyes off the stairs. I'm not sure we'll find them, though."
    new "好，这一层肯定有人。盯紧楼梯，别移开视线。不过我不确定能不能找到人。"

    # game/script.rpy:39708
    old "Why do you say that?"
    new "为什么这么说？"

    # game/script.rpy:39716
    old "The last time, the Sekimeiya disappeared from my hands when I walked to the event room, and this time, it disappeared from within the sheet when we were walking to the event room. Could it be related to that?"
    new "上一次，我走向活动室的途中，Sekimeiya 从我手里消失了；这一次，我们走向活动室的途中，它又从布里消失了。会不会和这个有关？"

    # game/script.rpy:39722
    old "Back then, you said it was burning and you could hardly hold it. Is it possible it teleports when it gets too hot?"
    new "当时你说它烫得几乎拿不住。会不会是热到一定程度，它就会传送？"

    # game/script.rpy:39727
    old "And the next time we found it, it wasn't working. It could be that..."
    new "而下一次我们找到它时，它已经失灵了。会不会是因为……"

    # game/script.rpy:39729
    old "It's working now, but we can test it. If the outer layer of the sheet felt hot for Isla, it's possible that it making the sheet hot made it heat up even more quickly."
    new "它现在还能用，不过我们可以试一下。Isla 隔着布都能摸到烫，那也许是布被加热后反过来让它升温更快。"

    # game/script.rpy:39730
    old "Sai wrapped the Sekimeiya up completely once again."
    new "Sai 又把 Sekimeiya 严严实实地裹了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:39733
    old "Like this, I can't easily tell if the Sekimeiya's still in here or not."
    new "这样裹上，我就没法轻易判断 Sekimeiya 还在不在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39734
    old "We waited a bit, but ultimately, to know if it had disappeared, the ball would have to be unwrapped."
    new "我们等了一会儿，但要想知道它有没有消失，只能把布包打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:39739
    old "You remember when it disappeared the last time, right? Immediately after that, our footprints vanished from the attic..."
    new "你还记得上次它消失的时候吧？就在那之后，我们在阁楼的脚印也消失了……"

    # game/script.rpy:39741
    old "I suppose I can try leaving and entering this room, if that's what's doing it."
    new "如果进出房间就是原因，那我可以试着离开再进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:39744
    old "He picked up the sheet and went in and out of the door a couple times."
    new "他抱起布包，在门口进出几个来回。"

    # game/script.rpy:39750
    old "It seems that if it disappears, it appears somewhere close by. It might be impossible to understand what it's doing, though, and we can at least keep it locked up if we have it."
    new "看来它消失之后，会出现在附近的某处。不过它到底在做什么，我们恐怕弄不明白；至少东西在我们手上时，还能把它锁好。"

    # game/script.rpy:39762
    old "...There's no way I'm no longer holding it, right? It must still be in the center of the sheet. Let's just finish the search."
    new "……我怎么可能已经没拿着它了？它肯定还在布中间。先把搜查做完吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:39766
    old "Sai dropped the ball on the floor of hallway A, where he could view the staircase as well. He grabbed one edge of the sheet and began to unroll it."
    new "Sai 把球放到 A 走廊的地上，那里也能看见楼梯。他抓住布的一角，开始把布摊开。"

    # game/script.rpy:39770
    old "...I think it's still he—"
    new "……我觉得它还在里面——"

    # game/script.rpy:39776
    old "The sheet disappeared.{w} Between Sai's hands, not only had the sheet vanished, but also the Sekimeiya."
    new "那块布消失了。{w}Sai 两手之间，消失的不只是那块布，还有 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:39777
    old "It did happen again..."
    new "果然又发生了……"

    # game/script.rpy:39778
    old "I was able to see that the Sekimeiya was there. It disappeared when Sai touched it."
    new "我看得见 Sekimeiya 就在里面。是 Sai 一碰，它才消失的。"

    # game/script.rpy:39779
    old "But why is the sheet gone too...?"
    new "可为什么连布也不见了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:39780
    old "I couldn't touch it anymore because of how hot it was. That could be why it also disappeared—Isla was touching it when the Sekimeiya teleported the previous time."
    new "它烫得我已经没法碰了。布也跟着消失，也许就是这个缘故——上次 Sekimeiya 传送时，Isla 正碰着布。"

    # game/script.rpy:39782
    old "She couldn't have touched the Sekimeiya itself, though."
    new "不过她不可能碰到 Sekimeiya 本身。"

    # game/script.rpy:39783
    old "Wh—!{w} Oh my God, I almost had a heart attack!"
    new "什——！{w}天啊，我差点心脏停跳！"

    # game/script.rpy:39785
    old "The door! It fucking closed!"
    new "门！他妈的门关上了！"

    # game/script.rpy:39791
    old "Sai stood up rapidly and opened the event room, but he didn't see anyone."
    new "Sai 猛地起身打开活动室的门，却一个人也没看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:39796
    old "It didn't make a sound. ...Was it the Sekimeiya?"
    new "它没有发出任何声响。……难道是 Sekimeiya？"

    # game/script.rpy:39803
    old "Sai uncovered the cabinet's curtain, but that time, it was empty and still unlocked. I noticed that the hallway B door was slightly open—I thought that had changed too."
    new "Sai 掀开展示柜的遮布，可这一次里面空着，锁也依旧开着。我发现 B 走廊的门虚掩着——心想这处应该也变了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39808
    old "This is going way beyond me. If there's someone on this floor, let's just fucking find them.{w} I have no idea if we were right. Maybe if the Sekimeiya overheats, it teleports away, but only this time it happened when it was touched."
    new "这已经远远超出我的理解范围了。这层要是真有人，就他妈把人揪出来。{w}我根本不知道我们猜得对不对。也许 Sekimeiya 过热后就会传送离开，只是这一次，它是在被碰到时才传送的。"

    # game/script.rpy:39816
    old "Sai went straight to the storeroom and came back with the information we needed to know the most."
    new "Sai 径直去了储藏室，带回了我们最需要确认的消息。"

    # game/script.rpy:39821
    old "...It hasn't been opened again."
    new "……那扇门没有再开过。"

    # game/script.rpy:39822
    old "That made everyone even tenser. The chance to find the culprit was closer than ever."
    new "众人闻言越发紧张。离找到犯人，从来没有这么近过。"

    # game/script.rpy:39823
    old "Fuck... Let's hurry. The Sekimeiya might've appeared on this floor.{w} I didn't think this through. If someone's actually here, there's a chance it'll allow them to escape."
    new "妈的……动作快点。Sekimeiya 可能已经出现在这层了。{w}是我考虑不周。要是真有人在这儿，说不定反而会让对方有机会逃走。"

    # game/script.rpy:39826
    old "Like before, while Erina and Isla stayed outside, all of us went to inspect every individual room."
    new "和先前一样，Erina 和 Isla 留在外面，我们其余人则逐个房间查看。"

    # game/script.rpy:39834
    old "I was first to enter room A1. Within one of the cabinets, I found the Sekimeiya."
    new "我第一个走进 A1房间，在其中一个展示柜里找到了 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:39837
    old "I hesitated a little, but I had no reason to keep it to myself anymore, and it was going to be found anyway. I made sure not to touch it directly and brought it to the hallway."
    new "我迟疑了一瞬，但事到如今也没有再隐瞒的必要，况且它迟早会被找到。我刻意不直接触碰它，把它带到了走廊上。"

    # game/script.rpy:39846
    old "You found it? Thank God."
    new "找到了？谢天谢地。"

    # game/script.rpy:39851
    old "...Was it inside a cabinet again?"
    new "……又是在展示柜里找到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:39857
    old "It's not locked anymore."
    new "已经没锁了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39858
    old "We faced Sai and saw he'd opened the security room. When most of us ran in, we were met with the many powered-off screens."
    new "我们看向 Sai，发现他已经打开了监控室。我们多数人跑进去时，迎面是许多已经熄灭的屏幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:39866
    old "Sai pressed the computer's power button, and it started up."
    new "Sai 按下电脑的电源键，机器启动了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39872
    old "However, right after that, it automatically shut down."
    new "然而紧接着，它又自动关机了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39877
    old "What the hell? Is some piece of hardware not being detected?"
    new "搞什么？是不是有哪个硬件没被识别出来？"

    # game/script.rpy:39884
    old "Hey! Come to the lobby...!"
    new "喂！快来大厅……！"

    # game/script.rpy:39888
    old "Akaro's strained voice made us abandon the computer. Behind the door to the lobby, déjà vu was what awaited us."
    new "Akaro 的声音紧绷，我们只好丢下电脑。大厅门后等着我们的，是似曾相识的一幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:39898
    old "She's gone...! Again..."
    new "她不见了……！又不见了……"

    # game/script.rpy:39899
    old "Now two bodies have disappeared, and both of them were definitely dead. If they're not on this floor, I'm just lost."
    new "现在两具尸体都不见了，而且两人都确实死透了。要是这层楼里也找不到，我就彻底没辙了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39900
    old "Wait, no. I'm so stupid..."
    new "等等，不对。我真是蠢……"

    # game/script.rpy:39901
    old "What have you done?"
    new "你干了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:39902
    old "I know it looks like she vanished, but I think there's more to it.{w} Naomi and the policeman are still here, but do you remember when I brought both bodies to the lobby? I don't think the policeman was here."
    new "我知道她看上去像是凭空消失了，不过我觉得事情另有蹊跷。{w}Naomi 和那名警察还在这里，但你们还记得我把两具尸体搬来大厅的时候吗？我印象里，那名警察并不在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:39903
    old "...Excuse me?"
    new "……你说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:39904
    old "I think... I just placed them near the door and hardly paid attention. I think I didn't realize the policeman had disappeared. I remember this part of the floor being completely empty for the second I looked at it."
    new "我想……我当时只是把它们放在门边，几乎没多留意。我大概根本没意识到那名警察已经不见了。我只记得自己看过去的那一瞬间，这一片完全空着。"

    # game/script.rpy:39905
    old "We could hardly be surprised anymore, and there was very little reason to doubt Akaro."
    new "我们几乎已经见怪不怪，况且也没什么理由怀疑Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:39909
    old "So, the policeman disappeared and reappeared...? Let's make sure we can't find the other bodies before I go insane.{w} ...Oh wait, look at Naomi's head."
    new "也就是说，那名警察消失后又出现了……？先确认确实找不到其他尸体，免得我发疯。{w}……哦，等等，看Naomi的头。"

    # game/script.rpy:39910
    old "From the wound she had, quite a bit of blood was pouring out."
    new "从她的伤口里，正涌出相当多的血。"

    # game/script.rpy:39911
    old "Yes, more blood is coming out than before."
    new "没错，血比刚才流得更多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39912
    old "And it seems like it started just now, right? Otherwise, the pool on the floor would be much bigger."
    new "而且看起来是刚刚才开始流的，对吧？否则地上的血泊会大得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:39914
    old "You're right..."
    new "你说得对……"

    # game/script.rpy:39918
    old "Erina had kept Isla close to hallway C so that she wouldn't go near the lobby. Hammered by a thousand new questions, we confirmed there was nothing in the room below us. Afterward, I had something to say."
    new "Erina让Isla留在C走廊附近，免得她走近大厅。无数新疑问轮番袭来，我们还是确认了下方房间里空无一物。之后，我有一件事要说。"

    # game/script.rpy:39923
    old "The Sekimeiya isn't getting hotter yet. That's not normal, right?"
    new "Sekimeiya还没有变热。这不太正常，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:39928
    old "Oh, is it not working again?"
    new "哦，又失灵了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:39929
    old "Sai felt my sleeve and confirmed that it wasn't hot at all."
    new "Sai摸了摸我的衣袖，确认它一点都不热。"

    # game/script.rpy:39934
    old "It's just like before. After teleporting, it doesn't work."
    new "和之前一样。传送之后，它就不起作用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39939
    old "...Right."
    new "……嗯。"

    # game/script.rpy:39944
    old "We'll just leave it in the cabinet. We only have hallway B left."
    new "先把它放回展示柜吧。只剩B走廊了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39951
    old "Knowing that thinking about anything would be useless until every room was searched, we entered hallway B. There, the same procedure started."
    new "明知在把所有房间搜完之前想什么都是白费，我们还是走进了B走廊。在那里，同样的搜查又开始了。"

    # game/script.rpy:39956
    old "We moved in coordination from room to room, looking at every cabinet along the way. Rapidly, the number of remaining places decreased as we approached the bathrooms."
    new "我们分工配合，一个房间接一个房间地查，沿途不放过任何一个展示柜。随着我们接近洗手间，尚未搜查的地方迅速减少。"

    # game/script.rpy:39961
    old "Finally, there were none left. In no location had there been a person or either of the bodies that had vanished. In addition, according to Sai, the storeroom door hadn't opened again. The answer, no matter what it was, must've hinged on the Sekimeiya."
    new "最终，所有地方都搜遍了。哪里都没有人，消失的两具尸体也一具都没看到。此外，按Sai的说法，储藏室的门没有再开过。不管答案是什么，关键一定在Sekimeiya身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:39968
    old "...There's nothing else we can do. Even if there really is someone with us, they know how to not be found. It's very clear that whatever's been happening here is way over our heads."
    new "……我们已经无计可施了。就算真有人和我们同在这层，对方也知道如何藏得滴水不漏。很显然，这里发生的一切早已超出我们的理解。"

    # game/script.rpy:39974
    old "Sai felt my sleeve again. Failing to notice any heat, he touched the Sekimeiya, and nothing happened."
    new "Sai又摸了摸我的衣袖。没感觉到任何热度，他便碰了碰Sekimeiya，结果什么也没发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:39979
    old "Don't touch it again. Our priority at this point is just to make it out of here safely."
    new "别再碰它了。我们现在唯一要做的，就是平安离开这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:39980
    old "There was really no rebuttal to that. Since we'd been unable to figure anything out, a sensation lingered: if we truly were up against a real culprit, we were no match for them. And supposing multiple people had died due to being threats to that person, our single goal was not to become a threat ourselves."
    new "这话无从反驳。我们什么也没能查清，心里始终盘桓着一种感觉：若真是有个凶手在暗处，我们根本不是他的对手。而假如那几个人之所以丧命，是因为他们构成了威胁，那我们唯一的目标，就是别让自己成为威胁。"

    # game/script.rpy:39981
    old "We had just performed a perfect search. There was no room for anyone to be hiding, and as a result, there was absolutely nothing more we could do to fight back. We had to resign ourselves to passing the time and nothing more."
    new "我们刚刚完成了一次彻底的搜查。任何地方都藏不住人，也正因如此，我们再没有别的反击手段，只能认命地耗着时间，别无他法。"

    # game/script.rpy:39989
    old "Next to Erina and Isla was the elevator. We walked to it, following Sai."
    new "Erina 和 Isla 身旁就是电梯。我们跟着 Sai 走了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:39994
    old "The elevator was in the attic when we left, but I didn't count on the buttons getting reattached. I can think of one escape route.{w} We saw that the call button was there on the second floor. When we were inspecting the offices, perhaps they called the elevator. If it came from the attic, we wouldn't have heard it since we were on the same floor as the elevator.{w} Similarly, if they immediately took it to escape to another floor, we wouldn't have heard that either."
    new "我们离开的时候，电梯停在阁楼，可我没料到按键会被装回去。我倒是能想到一条逃跑路线。{w}在二楼那会儿，我们看见呼叫按钮还在。我们检查办公室的时候，对方也许叫了电梯。如果它是从阁楼下来的，我们跟电梯在同一层，不会听见动静。{w}同样，如果对方立刻乘电梯逃去了别的楼层，我们也一样听不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:39995
    old "N-No, that couldn't have happened."
    new "不、不会的，不可能发生这种事。"

    # game/script.rpy:40000
    old "No? What do you mean?"
    new "不会？你这话是什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:40001
    old "Someone was always watching the stairs and elevator since we came to the crystal floor, right?"
    new "我们到水晶层之后，楼梯和电梯一直有人看着，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:40007
    old "So look. The elevator is open."
    new "所以你看，电梯是开着的。"

    # game/script.rpy:40012
    old "Wh-What?{w} You're... right."
    new "什、什么？{w}你说得……没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:40013
    old "The door wasn't properly closed; a tiny gap was keeping it open."
    new "门没有完全关上，只留着一道细缝。"

    # game/script.rpy:40023
    old "There's nothing. All the buttons are gone. Even the blood is.{w} But I see what you mean. The elevator had to be here with the door open since we arrived, so if the culprit took it on the second floor, they got off here."
    new "什么都没有。按键全没了，连血迹也没了。{w}不过我明白你的意思。我们到这里时，电梯就已经停在这里，门也开着；那么如果凶手是在二楼搭上电梯的，他们就是在这层下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:40024
    old "...This doesn't make any sense. How did the elevator get here? If it came before us, we would've heard it."
    new "……这说不通。电梯是怎么到这里的？如果它比我们先到，我们不可能没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:40025
    old "Yeah, I can only think of the way I said. When we were on the second floor, our mystery person called it, which was imperceptible for us. They brought it here, left with all the panels, and kept the door open. ...That's the only thing that makes any sense, but it still doesn't explain how the hell they managed to not be found."
    new "是啊，我只能想到刚才说的那种可能。我们在二楼的时候，那个神秘人叫了电梯，我们毫无察觉。他把它带到这层，拆走了所有面板，还让门一直开着。……只有这一种解释站得住脚，可它还是没说明白，那人究竟是怎么做到不被发现的。"

    # game/script.rpy:40026
    old "I guess there's one way.{w} The Sekimeiya disappeared from the sheet Isla was carrying, right? And we found it inside the cabinet in the event room.{w} Even if the killer was here, they couldn't have escaped with the Sekimeiya because they would've left the cabinet glass open. I guess it's possible they found it somewhere else, and it teleported to the cabinet after they touched it. That's all I can think."
    new "我想，倒是有一种可能。{w}Isla 拿着的那张纸上，Sekimeiya 不是消失了吗？后来我们却在活动室的展示柜里找到了它。{w}就算凶手当时就在这层，也没法带着 Sekimeiya 逃出去，因为那样展示柜的玻璃就会是开着的。说不定他是在别处找到它的，一碰到，它就传送回了展示柜。我能想到的只有这些。"

    # game/script.rpy:40029
    old "Our conclusion didn't change. There was absolutely nothing we could do."
    new "结论没有改变。我们根本无计可施。"

    # game/script.rpy:40036
    old "We placed the Sekimeiya in the cabinet and locked it."
    new "我们把 Sekimeiya 放进展示柜，上了锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:40047
    old "Afterward..."
    new "那之后……"

    # game/script.rpy:40049
    old "I had the chance to go to the security room and saw Atsuki was already there. The time displayed on the BIOS was {time=15:45}, which was five minutes after locking up the Sekimeiya."
    new "我趁机去了趟监控室，Atsuki 已经在那里了。BIOS 上显示的时间是 {time=15:45}，距离我们锁上 Sekimeiya 已经过了五分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:40051
    old "Katei was drawn in by the open door when the computer had already been shut down. He said he wanted to get to the bottom of the issue, so we left him behind, working in his room."
    new "Katei 是被那扇敞开的门引过来的，那时电脑已经关机了。他说一定要把事情查个水落石出，我们便留他一个人在那间房里忙。"

    # game/script.rpy:40052
    old "Despite Erina saying that she and Isla would go back to the attic after we finished searching, they were still on the crystal floor. Two corpses had disappeared, and the search indicated that one of us was likely the culprit, so Erina had no problem accepting Isla's request to stay in room A1."
    new "Erina 说过，搜查结束后就和 Isla 回阁楼，可她们仍旧待在水晶层。两具尸体凭空消失，搜查又表明凶手很可能就在我们之中，于是 Erina 便爽快地答应了 Isla 的请求，一起留在 A1房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:40058
    old "It finally began to feel like our goal was waiting for the exit to unlock. For many minutes, nothing happened."
    new "终于，我们开始觉得目标就是等出口解锁。过了好几分钟，什么都没发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:40059
    old "Sai and Akaro were in the lobby, avoiding the sight of the blood flowing out of Naomi's head. Atsuki sat on the staircase in hallway C.{w} ...I roamed around the floor a couple of times, and none of those positions changed."
    new "Sai 和 Akaro 待在大厅，不去看 Naomi 头部流出的那片血迹。Atsuki 坐在 C走廊的楼梯上。{w}……我在这一层转了两圈，他们谁都没有挪动过位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:40061
    old "There were five hours left until {time=21}, and I'd never been good at waiting around. It didn't seem like anyone had more business with the Sekimeiya or any interest in continuing to argue. While that was the ideal scenario, having to simply wait began to stress me out."
    new "距离 {time=21} 还有五个小时，而我一向不擅长干等。看来没人再要动 Sekimeiya，也没人想继续争执下去。这本该是最好的局面，可只能干等着，反倒让我越来越烦躁。"

    # game/script.rpy:40063
    old "Over the span of an hour, I was the only person wandering around. Nobody said anything to me as they waited patiently."
    new "整整一个小时里，四处走动的只有我一个。其他人都在耐心等着，谁也没对我说什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:40072
    old "My body started to severely reject the repetitive colors of the walls, and going over all the gems had only been entertaining for so long. I walked to the staircase, where Atsuki was."
    new "墙上重复的颜色开始让我浑身难受，那些宝石看来看去也早就腻了。我走向 Atsuki 所在的楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:40075
    old "Apparently, he was there to keep an eye on the storeroom so that nobody could enter the building. Before I could say anything, he asked me to briefly take over for him as he attempted to use the Sekimeiya."
    new "看样子，他守在这里是为了盯住储藏室，不让任何人溜进楼里。我还没开口，他就请我替他看一会儿，说他要去试试 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:40080
    old "Silently, we unlocked the cabinet, but it didn't seem like the Sekimeiya had started working."
    new "我们一言不发地打开展示柜的锁，可 Sekimeiya 似乎并没有启动。"

    # game/script.rpy:40084
    old "I'm going to the attic."
    new "我去阁楼一趟。"

    # game/script.rpy:40085
    old "I didn't think anyone had left the crystal floor in a while, and even though staying with the rest was safer, we'd confirmed every floor was empty."
    new "这一阵子应该没人离开过水晶层；虽说跟大家一起待着更稳妥，可我们已经确认过，每一层都是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:40086
    old "...But it didn't make any sense. Who had removed the bodies? Who had messed with the elevator buttons? Who had opened the storeroom door?"
    new "……可这说不通。是谁搬走了尸体？是谁动了电梯的按键？又是谁打开了储藏室的门？"

    # game/script.rpy:40092
    old "Atsuki sounded hesitant at first, but he dropped it quickly. The tiredness was kicking in, and I missed letting the time pass on a bed."
    new "Atsuki 起初还有些迟疑，但很快就作罢了。疲惫涌了上来，我怀念起躺在床上任由时间流逝的感觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:40099
    old "I looked at the elevator, which I still found unsettling, and opened the door."
    new "我看向那部仍旧让我不安的电梯，拉开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:40104
    old "It was empty. There was nobody inside. No buttons, and no blood either..."
    new "里面空荡荡的，一个人也没有。按键不见了，血迹也不见了……"

    # game/script.rpy:40108
    old "I walked up instead. As I ascended the floors, the thought strengthened: what were we doing? Someone else was with us."
    new "我改走楼梯。一层层往上时，那个念头越来越强烈：我们到底在做什么？这栋楼里还多了一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:40112
    old "The button had been attached on the third floor."
    new "三楼的按钮已经被装了回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:40116
    old "...And on the fourth, on the fifth, on the sixth... I arrived at the attic door and noticed that the key was no longer inserted into the keyhole."
    new "……四楼也是，五楼、六楼也是……我走到阁楼门前，发现钥匙已经不在锁孔里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40120
    old "I turned the doorknob and opened the door slowly. It was still unlocked."
    new "我拧动门把，缓缓推开门。门依然没有上锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:40125
    old "I fixed my eyes on the floor of the living room. Our footprints were faded, and it didn't seem like anyone had been there recently."
    new "我盯着起居室的地板。我们的脚印已经变淡，最近似乎没人来过。"

    # game/script.rpy:40131
    old "Next to the elevator was a metallic panel with its button, exactly where it was designed to be. It only made my head feel more numb. Had someone really reattached all of them when we hadn't been looking?"
    new "电梯旁就是带按键的金属面板，装在它本该在的位置。这反而让我的脑袋更麻木了。难道真有人趁我们不注意，把按键全装了回去？"

    # game/script.rpy:40135
    old "...I approached both bedrooms. Even though I couldn't sense anyone around, I wasn't going to look."
    new "……我走近那两间卧室。虽然感觉不到有人，我还是不打算往里面看。"

    # game/script.rpy:40139
    old "I opened the left door and sat on the bed."
    new "我推开左边那扇门，坐到床上。"

    # game/script.rpy:40141
    old "There was no way I could feel comfortable. The uneasiness immobilized me for a long time until I was able to lie down."
    new "我怎么可能安心。那股不安让我僵坐了很久，才终于躺了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:40145
    old "I had my purse next to me, and that time, I shut the light off. That finally allowed me to close my eyes and hope that the next time I opened them, I could walk out of the tower."
    new "我把手提包放在身旁，这一次关掉了灯。这才总算能合上眼，盼着再睁开时，就能走出这座塔。"

    # game/script.rpy:40151
    old "I didn't realize I'd fallen asleep, but a noise caused me to wake up. Once I regained my senses, I sharpened them to try to distinguish what I'd heard, but nothing else reached me."
    new "我不知自己何时睡着的，一阵声响把我惊醒。回过神后，我凝神去辨认那是什么声音，却再没有别的动静传来。"

    # game/script.rpy:40158
    old "The situation repeated. I felt like I'd blinked in and out of existence, but the sound that woke me the second time was louder."
    new "同样的事情又发生了一次。我像是眨了眨眼，就从现实里消失又回来；但第二次把我惊醒的声音更响了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40159
    old "Next to me, the door opened."
    new "身旁的门开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40162
    old "Then the light came on. I had my face under the sheet, facing the wall. With no strength to react, I waited."
    new "接着，灯亮了。我的脸蒙在床单下，面朝墙壁。我连反应的力气都没有，只能等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:40165
    old "\"Are you awake?\"{w} It was Atsuki's voice."
    new "「你醒了吗？」{w}是 Atsuki 的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:40166
    old "I didn't want to reply, so I kept quiet, figuring that if he had something important to say, he'd try to wake me up."
    new "我不想回答，就没有作声，心想他若真有事，自然会来叫醒我。"

    # game/script.rpy:40172
    old "Instead, the light turned back off."
    new "结果，灯又灭了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40173
    old "Soon, so did I."
    new "很快，我也睡了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:40179
    old "The faintest sounds kept waking me up. They had started coming from above me."
    new "极细微的声响一再把我吵醒。那声音是从我上方传来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:40180
    old "Someone had gone up the ladder.{w} I tried not to mind it and keep sleeping."
    new "有人顺着梯子爬上去了。{w}我努力不去在意，继续睡。"

    # game/script.rpy:40182
    old "However, I felt almost rested, as if I'd slept for hours. Minutes after failing to sleep again, I stretched my limbs and yawned deeply."
    new "可我却觉得几乎已经睡足了，仿佛睡了好几个钟头。没能再睡着，过了几分钟，我伸展四肢，深深打了个哈欠。"

    # game/script.rpy:40186
    old "It was very dark, but my purse was still on the bed. I grabbed it, slowly sat up, and then stood."
    new "四周漆黑一片，手提包还在床上。我摸到包，慢慢坐起，然后站了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:40188
    old "I had no sense of space, but it wasn't unpleasant. It couldn't be too late in the day either—it was likely Atsuki or someone would come get me before the deadline, and Katei probably wouldn't be a fan of Ashiya entering the tower and finding someone sleeping in the attic."
    new "我分不清方位，却并不觉得难受。时间应该也不算太晚——多半会是 Atsuki 或谁在期限前来接我；而要是芦屋进了塔，发现有人睡在阁楼里，Katei 大概不会乐意。"

    # game/script.rpy:40194
    old "The Pond"
    new "池塘"

    # game/script.rpy:40198
    old "Out of nowhere, the light turned on. I found myself standing in the middle of the room, alone."
    new "灯光毫无征兆地亮了。我发现自己独自站在房间中央。"

    # game/script.rpy:40202
    old "...{w}Did you do that? Are you Atsuki?"
    new "……{w}是你开的？你是 Atsuki 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40203
    old "I looked at the ceiling, figuring someone above me had flipped the switch, but there was no response."
    new "我抬头望向天花板，以为上面有人按了开关，却没有回应。"

    # game/script.rpy:40206
    old "...ey! ...ere!?"
    new "……喂！……在哪儿！？"

    # game/script.rpy:40211
    old "Instead, a petrifying yell came from the door."
    new "取而代之的，是一声从门口传来的、令人毛骨悚然的喊叫。"

    # game/script.rpy:40213
    old "...oor! ...re you!?"
    new "……门口！……你在哪儿！？"

    # game/script.rpy:40214
    old "I stared at the closed door before slowly approaching, wondering if I was losing it."
    new "我盯着紧闭的门看了一会儿，才慢慢走过去，心里怀疑自己是不是要疯了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40218
    old "I turned the handle gently and peered into the hallway. The voice was coming from in front of me."
    new "我轻轻转动门把手，探头望向走廊。声音从正前方传来。"

    # game/script.rpy:40224
    old "I just heard you! Please, open the door!"
    new "我刚刚听到你的声音了！求你，把门打开！"

    # game/script.rpy:40225
    old "...How is this possible? It's her again."
    new "……怎么可能？又是她。"

    # game/script.rpy:40226
    old "I wasn't taken aback anymore or even afraid. I just wanted out."
    new "我已经不再吃惊，甚至也不害怕了。我只想出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:40229
    old "Between the two bedrooms, I wondered if I was being consciously punished. That couldn't be."
    new "站在两间卧室之间，我怀疑是不是有人故意在惩罚我。可这说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:40230
    old "But as much as I despised it, it was reality. Once again, the obvious laws of the world were being flagrantly defied."
    new "可无论我多么憎恶，这都是现实。世上显而易见的法则，又一次被明目张胆地践踏了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40231
    old "...You're still here, right? What are you planning?"
    new "……你还在那儿吧？你到底想干什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:40235
    old "Was she actually talking to me? I had no idea."
    new "她真的在跟我说话吗？我毫无头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:40240
    old "While I wanted to know what was happening, I knew I wouldn't try to open the door. Instead, concealing my presence as much as possible, I stepped back to the living room."
    new "我虽然想知道发生了什么，却也清楚自己不会去开门。于是我尽量不露痕迹，退回了客厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:40241
    old "I know you're here! At least answer!"
    new "我知道你在里面！至少应一声啊！"

    # game/script.rpy:40248
    old "I couldn't tell anymore if she was still yelling. I looked down and saw recent footprints going from the hallway to the staircase."
    new "我已经分辨不出她是否还在喊。低头一看，地上有一串新鲜的脚印，从走廊一直延伸到楼梯口。"

    # game/script.rpy:40254
    old "I gripped the handle and tried to open the door.{w} It was locked."
    new "我握住门把手，试着开门。{w}门锁着。"

    # game/script.rpy:40255
    old "From my purse, I took the keys out and got the door to open."
    new "我从提包里取出钥匙，把门打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:40261
    old "On the other side, I inserted the key into the keyhole again and rotated it."
    new "到了门外，我又把钥匙插进锁孔，转动了一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:40264
    old "I didn't know whether to keep going forward. The sixth floor felt desolate, and I had no objective. Perhaps not trying to find out what was happening was smarter."
    new "我不知道该不该继续往前走。六楼荒凉得厉害，我也没有明确的目的。也许不去追究发生了什么，才是更聪明的做法。"

    # game/script.rpy:40269
    old "However, someone had been above me in the bedroom, and they hadn't answered my question. That was what made me keep walking away from the door."
    new "可是，卧室上方确实有人，而且没有回答我的问题。正因为如此，我才继续朝远离那扇门的方向走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:40273
    old "I walked down the next staircase as the echo of my own footsteps accompanied me. If people were still waiting in the lobby, I could stay there."
    new "我走下下一段楼梯，只有自己的脚步声在回响。如果大厅里还有人等着，我就可以待在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:40274
    old "I hardly felt like I was alive as I descended the mirrored floors; the entire sequence of events felt like nothing more than a dream. I trudged through all of them until a gray door was in front of me."
    new "一层层镜像般的楼层在我脚下退去，我几乎感觉不到自己还活着；这一连串事情就像一场梦。我拖着步子走完所有楼层，直到一扇灰色的门出现在面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:40282
    old "Atsuki was no longer sitting on the lowest step behind it. Instead, there was a trail of fresh blood."
    new "门后最下面那级台阶上，Atsuki 已经不在了。取而代之的，是一道新鲜的血迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:40283
    old "The floor had a strange smell to it. It could've been the same one we'd smelled throughout the day, but I didn't think that was all."
    new "地面散发着一股怪异的气味。也许就是我们一整天闻到的那种，但我觉得不止于此。"

    # game/script.rpy:40287
    old "Cautiously, I walked to the lobby. The blood I'd seen shouldn't have been enough to cause someone to die, but there was an imposing, foreboding atmosphere permeating the crystal floor."
    new "我小心翼翼地走向大厅。我看到的那点血，本不至于让人丧命，可水晶层里弥漫着一股沉重而不祥的气息。"

    # game/script.rpy:40295
    old "...Nobody."
    new "……没有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:40297
    old "The two bodies had disappeared with almost all the blood, and only the shutter remained. Partially unable to believe it, I took timid steps toward the center of the lobby, where I saw that its emptiness was absolute."
    new "两具尸体连同几乎所有的血迹都不见了，只剩那道卷帘门。我半信半疑，怯生生地向大厅中央走了几步，才看清那里空得彻底。"

    # game/script.rpy:40301
    old "When I opened the hallway B door, the sensation was identical. Was it possible I was alone?"
    new "推开B走廊的门，感觉如出一辙。难道真的只剩我一个人了？"

    # game/script.rpy:40305
    old "The urge to find someone increased. I didn't want to go back to the attic despite knowing it was inhabited. I tried to uncoil my tightly wound muscles and opened my mouth."
    new "想找到人的念头越来越强烈。明知阁楼里有人，我却不想回去。我试着放松紧绷的身体，张开了嘴。"

    # game/script.rpy:40306
    old "...Hey! Is anyone there...!?"
    new "……喂！有人在吗……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:40310
    old "I received no answer, but one of the open doors grabbed my attention. It was the staff room's."
    new "没有人回应，但其中一扇开着的门吸引了我的注意。那是员工室的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:40317
    old "It stood out, as it was very slightly open."
    new "它格外显眼，因为门只开了一道很小的缝。"

    # game/script.rpy:40322
    old "I approached it, but once inside, I wasn't sure it'd been the right call."
    new "我走了过去，可进去之后，又不确定这是不是正确的选择。"

    # game/script.rpy:40323
    old "I stood still and smelled the air. It was somehow fairly strong, but it wasn't a particular smell anymore."
    new "我站定不动，嗅了嗅空气。那股味道莫名地浓，却已经说不上是什么气味了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40324
    old "Something Atsuki had said came to mind. One of the keys I had could belong to Naomi's locker. We hadn't tried that yet."
    new "我想起了 Atsuki 说过的话。我手上的钥匙里，有一把或许能打开 Naomi 的储物柜。这一点我们还没试过。"

    # game/script.rpy:40325
    old "If he was right, the possibility that a phone could be found was nonzero. I looked at the keys on my palm and figured the smallest one could fit in the lockers."
    new "如果他说得没错，那找到手机并不是完全没有可能。我看了看掌心里的钥匙，觉得最小的那把应该能插进储物柜的锁孔。"

    # game/script.rpy:40328
    old "I inserted it into the first one and tried to turn it. However, the whole locker shook, refusing to open."
    new "我将它插进第一个柜子的锁孔，试着转动。整个柜子却晃了起来，怎么也打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:40329
    old "Then, a metallic sound rang out right in front of me. Something had hit the locker from the inside."
    new "紧接着，一声金属撞击声就在我面前响起。有什么东西从里面撞上了柜门。"

    # game/script.rpy:40330
    old "I looked up and saw three slits in the door. Despite the darkness that should've existed behind them, I discerned a glow."
    new "我抬起头，只见柜门上开着三道细缝。缝隙后本该是一片漆黑，我却隐约辨出了一点微光。"

    # game/script.rpy:40331
    old "It could only have been one thing. Despite being filled with questions, my mind was blank. My hand was drawn to the shape that had begun to take form behind the dark lines, and through the narrow space, I made contact, hoping with all my might that I would be brought to the awaited time."
    new "那只能是那样东西。我满腹疑问，脑中却一片空白。暗色缝隙后，一个轮廓渐渐成形，我的手不由自主地伸了过去，穿过那道狭窄的空隙触碰到了它——我拼尽全力祈愿，愿自己能抵达那个等待已久的时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:40340
    old "However, hallway A was my next sight."
    new "然而，我看到的却是 A走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:40346
    old "{w=1.0}Then, I fell to the floor immediately after appearing."
    new "{w=1.0}可我刚一现身，便立刻跌倒在地。"

    # game/script.rpy:40352
    old "Disoriented and confused, I stood back up. I had no way to know how far I'd been sent."
    new "我晕头转向地爬起来，却根本无从知道自己被送到了多远的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:40357
    old "It mustn't have been too long; the hallway looked just as desolate as before. I walked ahead and opened the security room."
    new "应该没过太久——走廊看上去和先前一样荒凉。我向前走去，推开了监控室的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:40366
    old "An unexpected realization hit me instantly. Katei was dead—the stench of his blood had been secluded within the room."
    new "我立刻意识到了一件出乎意料的事。Katei 已经死了——他的血腥味一直被闷在这间屋里，久久不散。"

    # game/script.rpy:40370
    old "It seemed he had managed to get the computer back to work, its buzzing adding to the surrealness. I approached cautiously, trying not to breathe."
    new "看样子他设法让电脑重新运转了起来，机器的嗡鸣让这一切更显虚幻。我小心翼翼地靠近，尽量屏住呼吸。"

    # game/script.rpy:40375
    old "When I pressed a key, the three screens lit up, and on the middle one, I saw a message.{w} \"{time=10:04}: Camera(s) disabled and associated footage erased\"."
    new "我按下某个键，三块屏幕亮了起来，中间那块上显示着一行字。{w}「{time=10:04}：摄像头已停用，相关录像已删除」。"

    # game/script.rpy:40376
    old "...At {time=10:04}, the recordings were erased...?"
    new "……{time=10:04}，录像被删除了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:40378
    old "The screen also showed the time: {time=18:21.} Directly below it was Katei's head—the epicenter of all the blood. It was beyond doubt that he had been killed as well."
    new "屏幕上还显示着时间：{time=18:21.} 正下方就是 Katei 的头——一切血迹的中心。毫无疑问，他也已经遇害了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40379
    old "I recalled the person above me, in the bedroom. Who was that, and what had happened while I was asleep?"
    new "我想起了楼上卧室里的那个人。那是谁？我睡着的时候又发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:40385
    old "I left the room behind. From far away, I noticed that the blood I'd seen on the staircase wasn't there yet. Slowly, I directed myself to one of the closed doors in the hallway."
    new "我离开了那间房。远远地，我注意到自己先前在楼梯上见过的血迹，此刻还没有出现。我缓缓走向走廊上一扇关着的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:40389
    old "...Wait, that...?"
    new "……等等，那是……？"

    # game/script.rpy:40392
    old "High up, something caught my attention. Through the smoke, a circular, intermittent green light could be seen on one of the cameras. I spun in place and saw that many of them had it. I remembered that the last time I'd seen that light was very early in the morning."
    new "高处有什么东西引起了我的注意。透过烟雾，可以看到其中一台摄像机上有一个绿色圆形光点，忽明忽灭。我原地转身，发现许多摄像机上都有。我记得上一次看到那点光亮，还是清晨时分。"

    # game/script.rpy:40393
    old "...The computer. It reenabled the cameras. This really must mean that they weren't recording until now, right...?"
    new "……是电脑。它重新启用了摄像机。也就是说，它们到现在才开始录像，对吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:40398
    old "Hopeful, I entered one of the rooms. There was something else I had to see."
    new "我抱着一线希望走进一间展室。还有一样东西，我必须亲眼确认。"

    # game/script.rpy:40406
    old "The cabinet was covered by its curtain. If the Sekimeiya was behind it, it was possible someone else was soon to be on the crystal floor."
    new "展示柜仍盖着遮布。如果 Sekimeiya 就在遮布后面，说不定很快又会有别人出现在水晶层上。"

    # game/script.rpy:40412
    old "...It wasn't. The cabinet was completely empty. I let go of the curtain and stepped back, startled."
    new "……没有。展示柜里空空如也。我吓了一跳，松手放开遮布，后退了一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:40416
    old "Just next to my feet, I'd noticed there was a bit of blood. That made four places I'd seen some."
    new "就在我脚边，我注意到有一点血迹。这已经是我见到的第四处血迹了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40417
    old "I'd run away from the attic, but even if I wanted to go back, it was no guarantee anyone would be there at the moment."
    new "我从阁楼逃了出来，可就算想回去，此刻也未必有人还在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:40423
    old "Hallway B was still empty, but I understood my situation. Any room could've been hiding a new death."
    new "B走廊依旧空无一人，但我清楚自己的处境。任何一间房里，都可能藏着新的死亡。"

    # game/script.rpy:40424
    old "Now the staff room is closed, unlike many others... Is someone going to enter it soon?"
    new "现在员工室关着，和许多别的房间不一样……是不是有人很快就要进去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:40430
    old "I moved to the center of the hallway, dwarfed by its overwhelming walls. There, I felt genuinely scared for my life. Had I avoided being a target by going to the attic?"
    new "我走到走廊中央，四壁高耸，将我衬得格外渺小。站在那里，我真的很害怕自己会没命。我躲进阁楼，是否就此避开了成为目标？"

    # game/script.rpy:40431
    old "Unable to decide on whether to go back up, I remained paralyzed."
    new "要不要回到楼上，我迟迟拿不定主意，只能僵立在原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:40437
    old "...Who are you?"
    new "……你是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:40438
    old "E-Erina...! You scared me. Wh-What's with all that blood?{w} Wait, who am I? {tip=miiya}A-Are you...?{/tip}"
    new "Erina……！你吓死我了。你、你身上怎么这么多血？{w}等等，我是谁？{tip=miiya}你、你是……？{/tip}"

    # game/script.rpy:40445
    old "Who... are you? I don't think I've seen you before. How did you get here?"
    new "你……是谁？我好像从没见过你。你是怎么到这儿来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:40446
    old "I don't know what that means...! I'm Miiya, I've been here the whole time! Do you not remember?"
    new "我不明白你在说什么……！我是 Miiya，我一直都在这儿啊！你不记得了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40453
    old "M-Miiya...?{w} My head hurts a lot... I don't remember you."
    new "Miiya……？{w}我头很痛……我不记得你。"

    # game/script.rpy:40454
    old "What happened? Did you get hurt? Where are the others?"
    new "发生什么了？你受伤了吗？其他人呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:40455
    old "I got hit in the head, yes. And I don't know. I-I haven't seen anyone in a long time."
    new "对，我头上挨了一下。别人我不知道。我、我已经很久没见过任何人了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40456
    old "How did you get hit? You're covered in blood."
    new "怎么会挨打？你浑身都是血。"

    # game/script.rpy:40461
    old "I don't know... I was knocked out from behind."
    new "我不知道……我是从背后被人打晕的。"

    # game/script.rpy:40462
    old "What...? What happened to the bodies?"
    new "什么……？那些尸体呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:40470
    old "Naomi and the policeman. Did they disappear?"
    new "Naomi 和那个警察。他们不见了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40475
    old "Naomi...? No, the first one's there."
    new "Naomi……？不，第一个还在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:40480
    old "There? Why?"
    new "在这儿？为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:40485
    old "I approached the door."
    new "我走近那扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:40490
    old "On the floor, two curtains lay, one covering Naomi's body."
    new "地板上摊着两块遮布，其中一块盖在 Naomi 身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:40496
    old "See...?"
    new "看见了吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:40500
    old "Why was she brought here?"
    new "为什么把她搬到这儿来？"

    # game/script.rpy:40505
    old "What? Hasn't she been here since she died?"
    new "什么？她不是死后就一直在这儿吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40506
    old "No. We brought her to the lobby. Do you really not remember?"
    new "不是。我们把她搬到大厅去了。你真的不记得了？"

    # game/script.rpy:40512
    old "What about the policeman?"
    new "那个警察呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:40517
    old "Wh... What policeman?"
    new "警……警察？什么警察？"

    # game/script.rpy:40519
    old "She was definitely not mentally stable. The hit she'd suffered had clearly been grave, and going off the blood, it was likely she only survived due to luck. However, something told me that wasn't it. The dried-up blood on her... Could she have been the body that had disappeared?"
    new "她的神志显然并不清醒。她所受的那一击必定不轻，单看失血量，能活下来恐怕全凭运气。可我心里总觉得，真正的原因并非如此。她身上那片干涸的血迹……那具消失的尸体，会不会就是她？"

    # game/script.rpy:40520
    old "I stared at her and forced that thought out of my mind."
    new "我盯着她，硬生生把这个念头压了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:40524
    old "I looked around the room, figuring there wasn't much to learn from Erina. However, someone had tried to kill her, so my worries had been warranted."
    new "我环视了一圈房间，心想从 Erina 身上大概也问不出什么。但确实有人想杀她，我的担心并非多余。"

    # game/script.rpy:40525
    old "When I saw the camera, I realized that the green light wasn't there despite the lack of smoke. Then, my attention was grabbed by a temperature regulation wheel next to a cabinet."
    new "看到摄像头时我才发觉，这里明明没有烟雾，摄像头上的绿灯却没有亮。随后，我的目光被展示柜旁一个温度调节旋钮吸引过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:40530
    old "Why's that broken...?"
    new "这个怎么坏了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:40535
    old "Hm? Oh, yeah... I think that's how we found it."
    new "嗯？哦，对……我记得我们发现它的时候就是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:40539
    old "I walked over to it, frowning. How could the wheel have broken? It had been undamaged earlier."
    new "我皱着眉走过去。旋钮怎么会坏？先前它明明完好无损。"

    # game/script.rpy:40542
    old "The temperature was set to 0 °C. I grabbed the bottom of the lid and tried to lift it up. It was locked, so I had to unlock it the way I'd seen it done the last time we'd all searched."
    new "温度设在了 0 °C。我抓住盖子的下缘，试着把它抬起来。盖子锁着，我只好照上次大家一起搜查时见过的方式开锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:40549
    old "Oh, what...? It's the Sekimeiya. ...And the cabinet is super cold."
    new "噢，怎么……？是 Sekimeiya。……而且展示柜里冷得厉害。"

    # game/script.rpy:40550
    old "The Seki... But we already took it out..."
    new "Seki……可我们明明已经把它拿出来了啊……"

    # game/script.rpy:40553
    old "I don't understand you."
    new "我不明白你在说什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:40558
    old "It needs to be put in the cabinet. It could get damaged."
    new "得把它放回展示柜里，不然可能会损坏。"

    # game/script.rpy:40559
    old "Oh, y-yes."
    new "哦，对、对。"

    # game/script.rpy:40563
    old "I reached into the cabinet and picked up the Sekimeiya up without directly touching it.{w} It was considerably cold. I didn't think that touching it would send me far through time, but as it could've made me stay trapped in the building for longer, I decided I wouldn't do it again."
    new "我把手伸进展示柜，没让皮肤直接碰到 Sekimeiya，把它拿了起来。{w}它相当冰凉。我并不认为碰一下就会把我送到很远的过去，可那样有可能让我被困在这栋楼里更久，所以我决定不再碰它。"

    # game/script.rpy:40569
    old "...Why are you holding it like that?"
    new "……你为什么要那样拿着它？"

    # game/script.rpy:40570
    old "Do you not remember that either?"
    new "这件事你也不记得了？"

    # game/script.rpy:40575
    old "...{w}Oh, right...! It can send you to the past."
    new "……{w}哦，对了……！它能把人送到过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:40581
    old "I left to hallway B, unsettled by Erina's attitude, a part of me wondering if she was trying to deceive me."
    new "我动身前往 B 走廊。Erina 的态度让我很不安，心里有点怀疑她是不是想骗我。"

    # game/script.rpy:40590
    old "...Have you gone to the past?"
    new "……你去过过去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40593
    old "What? Y-Yes. I guess you really don't remember."
    new "什么？去、去过。看来你是真的不记得了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40598
    old "...I left the Sekimeiya in the cabinet."
    new "……我把 Sekimeiya 留在展示柜里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40601
    old "What did you do after?"
    new "之后你做了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:40602
    old "What does that mean?"
    new "这是什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:40607
    old "Did you change the past?"
    new "你改变了过去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40608
    old "To some degree. Why are you asking this?"
    new "算是改了一些。你为什么问这个？"

    # game/script.rpy:40613
    old "Then, this is how...!"
    new "那么，原来是这样……！"

    # game/script.rpy:40618
    old "When was the last time you saw the others?"
    new "你最后一次见到其他人是什么时候？"

    # game/script.rpy:40623
    old "...I don't remember."
    new "……我不记得了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40624
    old "...Oh, in the attic, I think. I haven't gone back."
    new "……哦，我想是在阁楼吧。我没再回去过。"

    # game/script.rpy:40625
    old "Why not? What about Isla?"
    new "为什么没回去？Isla 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:40630
    old "...I was with her until just now."
    new "……直到刚才，我还和她在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:40631
    old "What? That's not what you said before."
    new "什么？你刚才可不是这么说的。"

    # game/script.rpy:40632
    old "No...? I didn't say anything about her."
    new "不是……？我根本没提过她。"

    # game/script.rpy:40633
    old "You said you hadn't seen anyone in a while."
    new "你说你已经有一阵子没见过任何人了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40638
    old "O-Oh, I guess so. I didn't include her..."
    new "哦、哦，好像是。我没把她算进去……"

    # game/script.rpy:40639
    old "Why not? Where did you see her?"
    new "为什么不算？你是在哪儿见到她的？"

    # game/script.rpy:40644
    old "She's still in the same room."
    new "她还在原来那个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:40645
    old "What room?"
    new "哪个房间？"

    # game/script.rpy:40651
    old "We entered hallway A, and Erina brought me to the farthest crystal room."
    new "我们走进 A走廊，Erina 把我带到了最里面的那间水晶展室。"

    # game/script.rpy:40657
    old "In the center of the smoke-stained walls, one of the cabinets was open. Within it, Isla rested, with a pale and somewhat peaceful expression."
    new "在布满烟痕的墙壁中央，有一个展示柜敞开着。Isla 就躺在里面，面色苍白，神情甚至有几分安详。"

    # game/script.rpy:40658
    old "W-Wait, she's...?"
    new "等、等等，她……？"

    # game/script.rpy:40664
    old "I-I knew it. You weren't here all this time. It wasn't me."
    new "我、我就知道。这段时间你根本不在这里。不是我做的。"

    # game/script.rpy:40665
    old "Of course I've been here! What happened to her?"
    new "我当然一直在这里！她到底怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:40666
    old "Can't you see it? She was... killed. Was it you? You could have done it if it's true that you were here...!"
    new "你看不出来吗？她……是被杀的。是你做的吗？如果你真的一直在这里，那你完全做得到……！"

    # game/script.rpy:40667
    old "I don't know what you're talking about. Tell me directly. When did this happen?"
    new "我不知道你在说什么。直说吧，这事是什么时候发生的？"

    # game/script.rpy:40672
    old "It was... many hours ago. It's been hours...!"
    new "那是……好几个小时前的事了。已经过去好几个小时了……！"

    # game/script.rpy:40674
    old "...{w}That's not true. You're mistaken. It couldn't have been more than three hours ago."
    new "……{w}不对。你记错了。最多也就是三个小时前的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:40679
    old "N-No... It's been more than that."
    new "不、不是的……不止那么久。"

    # game/script.rpy:40681
    old "That wasn't right. I let go of the breath I'd been holding and looked at Isla again. It didn't seem like there was any blood around her, but her immobile face and chest were confirmation enough of her death."
    new "不对。我呼出一直憋着的那口气，再次望向 Isla。她身边似乎没有血迹，但那张不再有任何表情的脸和毫无起伏的胸口已经足以说明她死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40685
    old "Erina had gone quiet too, and she was making no effort at hiding how much she was trying to focus. However, the thoughts whirling through her head were indecipherable."
    new "Erina 也沉默下来，毫不掩饰自己正拼命集中注意力。可她脑中翻涌的念头，我一点也看不透。"

    # game/script.rpy:40687
    old "I waited, thinking she'd have something to say at any moment."
    new "我等着，以为她随时会开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:40689
    old "Was anyone else killed? I saw Katei's body in the security room."
    new "还有别人被杀吗？我在监控室看到了 Katei 的尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:40695
    old "...N-No. I don't think so."
    new "……没、没有。我想没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:40697
    old "So, the rest were in the attic. I was utterly confused, but that seemed to be the conclusion. It was possible I was sleeping up there at that moment as well."
    new "也就是说，其余人都在阁楼。我满心困惑，但结论似乎就是如此。说不定那一刻，我也正在上面睡着。"

    # game/script.rpy:40703
    old "Wha—!?{w=0.3} What are you doing!?"
    new "什——！？{w=0.3}你干什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:40708
    old "I still feel like I've never seen you before. ...Did you lock the cabinet?"
    new "我还是觉得从没见过你。……展示柜是你锁的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40709
    old "The cabinet...? No, I didn't."
    new "展示柜……？不，不是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:40710
    old "She had snatched the keys from my purse and was staring at them in her hand."
    new "她从我的手包里抢过钥匙，正盯着手里那串钥匙看。"

    # game/script.rpy:40715
    old "These keys... Why do you have them?{w} Is this one for the cabi—"
    new "这些钥匙……你怎么会有？{w}这一把是展示柜的——"

    # game/script.rpy:40720
    old "With a quick motion, I took them back, and she failed to react."
    new "我飞快地把钥匙夺了回来，她甚至没来得及反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:40721
    old "I don't get it! What do you—"
    new "我不明白！你到底——"

    # game/script.rpy:40722
    old "...iroya! Hey! Where are you!?"
    new "……iroya！喂！你在哪儿！？"

    # game/script.rpy:40723
    old "Atsuki...!{w} Did he see her?"
    new "Atsuki……！{w}他看到她了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40730
    old "I dashed out of the room, paying no mind to Erina's surprise."
    new "我顾不上 Erina 的惊讶，冲出了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:40732
    old "The voice was coming from hallway B. Did that mean she was down there as well?"
    new "声音是从 B走廊传来的。这么说，她也在下面？"

    # game/script.rpy:40736
    old "I rapidly reached the staircase and went up half of the way. From behind the gray door, I saw Erina's feet as she wandered in confusion."
    new "我快步走到楼梯口，上了半层。隔着灰色的门，我看见 Erina 的脚——她正茫然地来回踱步。"

    # game/script.rpy:40737
    old "—re okay, ri—!? If yo— ...me, ple— ...thing!"
    new "——没事吧，Shi——！？要是你——……听得见我，请——……说句话！"

    # game/script.rpy:40739
    old "The sound stopped soon after Erina followed it."
    new "Erina 循声而去，声音很快便停了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40741
    old "...Did that mean that she'd been found, or had Atsuki given up?"
    new "……这是说找到她了，还是 Atsuki 放弃了？"

    # game/script.rpy:40742
    old "As I'd noticed earlier, the trail of blood had disappeared from there too. That meant it was still to happen."
    new "正如我之前注意到的那样，那里的血迹也消失了。也就是说，那件事还没有发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:40743
    old "I began to slowly step down."
    new "我慢慢走下楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:40748
    old "I wondered what I'd be told if I showed myself, but it was hard to care about that with how much I wanted to know what the fuck was happening."
    new "我很好奇自己露面后他们会说些什么，可比起弄清到底他妈发生了什么，这点顾虑实在算不上什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:40753
    old "Erina wasn't there anymore. As I approached hallway B, the voices came back."
    new "Erina 已经不在了。我走近 B走廊，声音又传了过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:40760
    old "...earing them earlier, were you...?"
    new "……你刚才就听见了吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:40762
    old "What? ...Does he really not know why she's here?"
    new "什么？……他真不知道她为什么会在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:40763
    old "They sounded close to the lobby, but I didn't peek in."
    new "听声音他们就在大厅附近，但我没有探头去看。"

    # game/script.rpy:40764
    old "...not understand? Did— ...pop into existen—"
    new "……还不明白吗？难道——……凭空冒出来的——"

    # game/script.rpy:40765
    old "They opened a door. It must've been closer to me, as I started to understand them more easily. Erina was still clearly groggy, but I could make things out."
    new "他们打开了门。那扇门应该离我更近了，他们的话我渐渐听得清楚。Erina 显然还昏昏沉沉，不过我已经能分辨出个大概。"

    # game/script.rpy:40767
    old "What's with that tone of voice? When did she even get to know Erina?"
    new "这语气是怎么回事？她什么时候和 Erina 这么熟了？"

    # game/script.rpy:40768
    old "Erina even accused me of not being here previously, so why didn't she say that to her too?{w} She's the one who hasn't been here, and earlier, it sounded like she was locked in the attic. Did the person above me do that? And that still has yet to happen..."
    new "Erina 刚才还一口咬定我之前不在这里，那她怎么不对那个人也这么说？{w}明明不在场的是她，而且听刚才那番话，她像是被锁在阁楼里。是楼上那个人干的吗？而那件事到现在也还没发生……"

    # game/script.rpy:40772
    old "That was close to what she'd told me."
    new "这和她对我说过的差不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:40773
    old "...Are you the same Shiroya who disappeared from the event room with Sai?"
    new "……你就是和 Sai 一起从活动室消失的那个 Shiroya 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40774
    old "...I wish I could explain everything to you, but I still don't really know what happened.{w} But, yes. I'm really glad to see you again."
    new "……我也希望能把一切都解释给你听，可我自己也还不太清楚发生了什么。{w}不过，没错。能再见到你，我真的很高兴。"

    # game/script.rpy:40775
    old "While I didn't understand Atsuki's question, it was clear something had happened while I was asleep. It all sounded like she was alive and neither of them knew how that had come to occur."
    new "我不明白 Atsuki 的问题，但显然在我睡着的时候出了事。听起来她确实还活着，而他们两人都不知道这是怎么发生的。"

    # game/script.rpy:40782
    old "The Sekimeiya... does it really make you travel through time?"
    new "Sekimeiya……它真的能让人穿越时间吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40788
    old "Erina asked for the Sekimeiya, but it sounded like neither of them knew where it was. However, despite Erina's condition, we had brought it to the event room minutes earlier, so she wasn't satisfied when she was told it wasn't there."
    new "Erina 向他们要 Sekimeiya，可听那口气，两人似乎都不知道它在哪儿。然而，就在几分钟前，尽管 Erina 状况不佳，我们还是把它带进了活动室；所以听说东西不在那儿，她并不甘心。"

    # game/script.rpy:40790
    old "Their words continued to make no sense. I was the one who had the key."
    new "他们的话依旧让人摸不着头脑。钥匙明明在我手里。"

    # game/script.rpy:40792
    old "...They entered the event room. As soon as the door closed, it acted as a barrier for the sound inside."
    new "……他们进了活动室。门一关上，里面的声音就被隔断了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40797
    old "Once I was certain the hallway was empty, I stepped in."
    new "确认走廊里没人之后，我才走了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:40801
    old "I approached the door and placed my ear against it."
    new "我走到门边，把耳朵贴了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:40807
    old "I couldn't hear anything."
    new "什么也听不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:40809
    old "Did they leave?"
    new "他们走了？"

    # game/script.rpy:40810
    old "Finally, I heard a sound coming from the room. The opposite door had opened."
    new "终于，屋里传来了动静。对面那扇门开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40811
    old "...fuck— ...ing here?{w=0.4} ...succ— ...plan of—"
    new "……妈的——……在这儿？{w=0.4}……成功——……计划——"

    # game/script.rpy:40812
    old "This door is too thick to make anything out... It sounds like he's close to the cabinet."
    new "这扇门太厚，什么也听不清……听声音，他离展示柜很近。"

    # game/script.rpy:40814
    old "I recognized Sai's voice, but not what he said."
    new "我听出那是 Sai 的声音，却听不出他说了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:40815
    old "For as long as I stayed there, I didn't comprehend anything.{w} I knew I could be found out easily, but I wasn't against that. In fact, I considered opening the door, but I would listen from a distance for as long as I could."
    new "我在那儿待着的这段时间里，一句话也没听懂。{w}我知道自己很容易被发现，却并不抗拒。我甚至考虑过推门进去，但还是想尽量隔着距离多听一会儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:40823
    old "I silently entered the staff room. Then, I placed my ear against the left wall, which was directly next to the cabinet."
    new "我悄声进了员工室，随后把耳朵贴到左侧墙上——那面墙紧挨着展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:40826
    old "...as that?"
    new "……那是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:40828
    old "It was still hard to hear Sai, but the thin wall made Atsuki's voice interpretable."
    new "Sai 的声音依旧听不真切，但墙壁很薄，Atsuki 的话倒能辨清。"

    # game/script.rpy:40829
    old "It's just a personal paper. ...nothing to do with you or the Sekimeiya."
    new "只是一张私人纸条。……跟你和 Sekimeiya 都没有关系。"

    # game/script.rpy:40830
    old "Ve—"
    new "Ve——"

    # game/script.rpy:40838
    old "There...! Is she gonna say it?"
    new "来了……！她要说了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40844
    old "What's with— ...elirious?"
    new "搞什么——……说胡话？"

    # game/script.rpy:40846
    old "That's not it. ...not just some name she made up."
    new "不是那样。……那不是她随口编出来的名字。"

    # game/script.rpy:40847
    old "Do you kno—"
    new "你们认识——"

    # game/script.rpy:40849
    old "I couldn't process what I was hearing. Was I actually being punished? That insane possibility was only becoming more of a reality."
    new "我无法理解自己听到的一切。难道我真的在受罚？那个荒唐的可能性，正一点点变成现实。"

    # game/script.rpy:40853
    old "Oh? ...dead?"
    new "哦？……死了？"

    # game/script.rpy:40854
    old "Dead...?{w} Are they really talking about me?"
    new "死了……？{w}他们真的在说我吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40856
    old "What the fuck is this...? Of course I'm not dead!"
    new "这他妈算什么……？我当然没死！"

    # game/script.rpy:40858
    old "...right? ...saving with— ...kimeiya not—"
    new "……对吧？……用来救——……kimeiya 不——"

    # game/script.rpy:40861
    old "I was right there. I'd been right there the whole time...! What were they talking about!?"
    new "我就在那儿。我一直都在那儿……！他们到底在说什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:40862
    old "I didn't know whether I should have entered the room or not. I was a lot more hesitant, and it almost felt as if they knew that I was listening in on them."
    new "我不知道自己该不该进那个房间。我更犹豫了，甚至觉得他们仿佛知道我正在门外偷听。"

    # game/script.rpy:40863
    old "It's probably been— ...minutes already, right?"
    new "大概已经——……过了几分钟了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:40864
    old "...fifteen min—... arrived."
    new "……十五分钟——……到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:40870
    old "...I'm going, then. ...you coming with me?"
    new "……那我走了。……你要一起来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40871
    old "Is she about to touch the Sekimeiya...?"
    new "她这是要碰 Sekimeiya 了吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:40872
    old "...She said earlier she wanted to save Isla. Did they figure out how to use the Sekimeiya? They've only been there a few minutes..."
    new "……她刚才还说想救 Isla。是他们弄清楚了 Sekimeiya 的用法吗？可他们到那儿才不过几分钟……"

    # game/script.rpy:40873
    old "Was the past going to be changed? That could have already been happening."
    new "过去是不是就要被改写了？也许那早就在发生了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40874
    old "It was possible that the past had changed drastically while I'd been unconscious. Was I living in a world completely different from the one I'd gone to sleep in?"
    new "在我失去意识的这段时间里，过去也许已经发生了翻天覆地的改变。如今我所处的世界，还和我入睡前的那个世界相同吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40882
    old "I couldn't tell what had happened. Had Sai left, or had he time traveled?"
    new "我分不清到底发生了什么。Sai 是走了，还是穿越了时间？"

    # game/script.rpy:40883
    old "...you ever want me to save Isla? ...you involved in the first place!?"
    new "……你到底想没想过让我去救 Isla？……你是不是从一开始就掺和进来了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:40886
    old "Had nothing happened...? I'd been completely frozen for minutes, trying to pick up everything I could."
    new "难道什么都没发生……？我整个人僵在原地好几分钟，竭力捕捉着每一丝动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:40890
    old "...Wait! Where did it go!?{w} It's not here!"
    new "……等等！它去哪了！？{w} 不在这里！"

    # game/script.rpy:40892
    old "Oh...{w} Oh...!"
    new "啊……{w} 啊……！"

    # game/script.rpy:40893
    old "The Sekimeiya... teleported."
    new "Sekimeiya……传送走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40896
    old "It was activated, but they didn't vanish—only the Sekimeiya teleported. That's happened before..."
    new "它被启动了，但他们并没有消失——只有 Sekimeiya 传送走了。这种情况以前也发生过……"

    # game/script.rpy:40899
    old "They haven't experienced this before... Is that it?"
    new "他们以前没遇到过这种情况……是这样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40903
    old "That idea was the driving force that made me immediately turn around and dash to the door."
    new "正是这个念头，让我当即转身冲向门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:40906
    old "...!{w} It's closed...! I didn't close it."
    new "……！{w} 门关上了……！可我没关过啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:40908
    old "The Sekimeiya had seemingly vanished by itself. I'd just had an epiphany, but instead of trying to think everything through, I opened the door and ran to hallway C."
    new "Sekimeiya 似乎是自己凭空消失的。我刚刚灵光一闪，却顾不上细想，推开门便朝 C走廊奔去。"

    # game/script.rpy:40915
    old "There's still no blood here."
    new "这里还是没有血。"

    # game/script.rpy:40916
    old "And this door..."
    new "还有这扇门……"

    # game/script.rpy:40926
    old "Dismissing the elevator, I stepped up. There, I ran across the floor, releasing all my built-up energy. As soon as I reached the next staircase, I did the same."
    new "我放弃电梯，改走楼梯。踏上那层楼后，我在走廊里全力奔跑，将积攒的力气尽数倾泻而出。一到下一段楼梯，我又如法炮制。"

    # game/script.rpy:40930
    old "So that nothing would fall out, I held my purse tightly and continued running, planning on reaching the highest place in the building."
    new "为了不让东西掉出来，我紧紧按住手提包继续奔跑，打算一直跑到这栋楼最高的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:40934
    old "I didn't slow down, knowing that if I did, my exhaustion would catch up with me. I bolted up the fourth staircase and continued in a straight line."
    new "我知道一旦放慢脚步，疲惫就会追上来，于是始终没有减速。我冲上第四段楼梯，继续笔直向前。"

    # game/script.rpy:40939
    old "Delayed Reflection"
    new "迟来的倒影"

    # game/script.rpy:40945
    old "Whoa...!"
    new "呜哇……！"

    # game/script.rpy:40946
    old "Atsuki...!"
    new "Atsuki……！"

    # game/script.rpy:40947
    old "I stopped abruptly and almost fell down. If Atsuki was there, did that mean that I'd been right?"
    new "我猛地停住，差点摔倒。Atsuki 在那里——那是不是说明我猜对了？"

    # game/script.rpy:40948
    old "Wh-What happened?"
    new "怎、怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:40949
    old "I had to pant hoarsely before I could speak again. Meanwhile, I thought of the question I wanted to ask, realizing he hadn't found my presence strange."
    new "我喘了好一阵粗气，才终于能重新开口。趁这工夫，我理清了想问的话，也意识到他并没有觉得我出现在这里有什么奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:40950
    old "...Th-This might sound strange, but... wh-what's the last place where you saw me?"
    new "……这、这话可能有点奇怪……你最后一次见到我，是在哪里？"

    # game/script.rpy:40955
    old "The last place...? That's what I was gonna say. I saw you weren't sleeping anymore, so I was walking down to see if I could find where you'd gone."
    new "最后一次见到你……？这话该我说才对。我看你已经醒了，就下楼来找，想看看你去了哪儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:40956
    old "...{w}Then were you above me... in the bedroom?"
    new "……{w}那你刚才是在我上面……在卧室里？"

    # game/script.rpy:40962
    old "Oh, yes. Sorry, was I noisy? I just climbed down the ladder and saw you weren't there anymore."
    new "哦，对。抱歉，是我吵到你了吗？我刚从梯子爬下来，就发现你已经不在那儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:40965
    old "I couldn't believe it. It was him, the Atsuki I'd been with the whole day. However, on the crystal floor, there was another Atsuki—one who had said I couldn't be there."
    new "我几乎不敢相信。是他，是陪了我一整天的那个 Atsuki。可水晶层上还有另一个 Atsuki——那个说我不该出现在那里的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:40970
    old "...Anyway, what were you in such a rush for? And that question...?"
    new "……话说回来，你那么急是要干什么？还有刚才那个问题……"

    # game/script.rpy:40971
    old "...No, I was just going back up. I didn't realize you were in the attic too."
    new "……没什么，我只是正要回去。没想到你也在阁楼里。"

    # game/script.rpy:40982
    old "...Do you want to go up, then?"
    new "……那，要一起上去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:40983
    old "Yes, we can stay there."
    new "嗯，就在上面待着吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:40984
    old "Did you see anyone? They were all still waiting when I went to the attic."
    new "你看到别人了吗？我上阁楼的时候，他们都还等在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:40990
    old "I see.{w} ...It should already be pretty late, but you still have the cabinet key, right?"
    new "这样啊。{w} ……时间应该已经不早了，不过展示柜的钥匙还在你那儿吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:40999
    old "We walked up, but my heart hadn't slowed down yet. What kind of mess were we in? No matter the answer, the right call was ignoring it and trying to make the time pass without complications."
    new "我们顺着楼梯走了上去，我的心跳却迟迟没有平复。我们到底卷进了什么样的麻烦？无论答案是什么，最妥当的做法都是不去理会，让这段时间平平淡淡地过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:41008
    old "And yet I couldn't get the words out of my head. According to the people on the crystal floor, I should've been dead."
    new "可那些话始终在我脑海里挥之不去。按水晶层上那些人的说法，我本该已经死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41019
    old "Suddenly, a head appeared from around the office corridor. When we looked at each other, the three of us froze, everyone equally shocked."
    new "忽然，办公室走廊的拐角探出一个脑袋。视线相触的一瞬间，我们三个人都僵在原地，谁都一样震惊。"

    # game/script.rpy:41026
    old "It was Atsuki. A body identical to him, with his face and clothes, who had been waiting by the door to the offices. He looked at himself, speechless, and without moving an inch."
    new "那是 Atsuki。一模一样的身形，同样的面孔和衣着，一直守在通往办公室的门口。他望着自己，一句话也说不出，连半步都没有挪动。"

    # game/script.rpy:41027
    old "Hey, answer me! You really were here... Are you really me? What the fuck is going on!?"
    new "喂，回答我！你真的在这里……你真的是我吗？这到底是怎么回事！？"

    # game/script.rpy:41030
    old "For him, it must've been a surreal shock, but I looked at the bizarre scene with just as much confusion. Were there three versions of Atsuki in the building at once?"
    new "对他来说，眼前的一切一定像做梦一样不真实；而我看这场怪异的场面，同样满心困惑。这栋楼里同时存在三个 Atsuki？"

    # game/script.rpy:41035
    old "Finally, the person in front of us spoke."
    new "终于，面前的那个人开口了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41036
    old "...I didn't think you'd be here."
    new "……我没想到你会在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:41037
    old "Wh-What!? What does that mean!? You're me, right?"
    new "什、什么！？这话是什么意思！？你是我吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:41038
    old "...I am."
    new "……是。"

    # game/script.rpy:41039
    old "What the fuck is happening, then!? I thought it was impossible that we'd see each other. Was that wrong?"
    new "那这到底是怎么回事！？我原以为我们不可能碰面。难道我想错了？"

    # game/script.rpy:41040
    old "In a way, yes."
    new "某种意义上，是想错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41041
    old "What the fuck...? Tell me, then! What's going on!? How the fuck can you even exist!?"
    new "搞什么啊……？那就告诉我！到底发生了什么！？你到底是怎么存在的！？"

    # game/script.rpy:41042
    old "While I had no idea of how to interpret the scene, it was clear the Atsuki we'd bumped into had a higher understanding of what was happening. It didn't seem he found my existence strange either."
    new "我完全看不透眼前这一幕，但很明显，我们撞见的这个 Atsuki 对局势的了解要深得多。他似乎也不觉得我的存在有什么奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:41043
    old "...I'm sorry, I'm not sure how to answer that question."
    new "……抱歉，这个问题我不知道该怎么回答。"

    # game/script.rpy:41047
    old "I know exactly how you feel, I promise. I will tell you one thing, though, since we've already met: you shouldn't worry about anything."
    new "我完全明白你现在的感受，真的。不过既然我们已经碰上了，我就告诉你一件事：你什么都不用担心。"

    # game/script.rpy:41048
    old "I shouldn't worry? There's no way you're actually me, right?"
    new "不用担心？你根本不可能是真正的我吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:41049
    old "...I am. I promise, it will all be fine."
    new "……我就是。我保证，一切都会没事的。"

    # game/script.rpy:41050
    old "Wh-What...? How can you tell? And how would that even be possible!?"
    new "什、什么……？你怎么知道？而且这怎么可能！？"

    # game/script.rpy:41051
    old "I know how it sounds, but I genuinely don't have time to explain, and I'm not sure I could."
    new "我知道这话听起来很荒唐，但我真的没时间解释，也未必解释得清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:41052
    old "What does that even mean...!?"
    new "这算什么话……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:41053
    old "Look, we're the same person. Just trust me, or yourself, on this. Sincerely, everything should turn out fine."
    new "听着，我们是同一个人。这件事，你就信我，也就是信你自己。我说真的，一切都会顺利的。"

    # game/script.rpy:41055
    old "Those words almost broke the person at my side. He'd been told by himself that there was nothing to fear."
    new "这句话几乎击溃了我身旁的人。告诉他不用害怕的，正是他自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:41056
    old "You believe me, right? Like I said, I don't have much time."
    new "你信我，对吧？我说过，我时间不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:41057
    old "Emotional, Atsuki nodded."
    new "Atsuki 情绪激动地点了点头。"

    # game/script.rpy:41060
    old "But that c-can't be the case...! Shiroya... died again!"
    new "可、可这不可能啊……！Shiroya……又死了！"

    # game/script.rpy:41062
    old "Again? What do you mean?"
    new "又？你什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:41063
    old "Do you not know that? She was killed here, and her body disappeared from the lobby!"
    new "你不知道吗？她在这里被杀了，尸体却从大厅里消失了！"

    # game/script.rpy:41067
    old "The other Atsuki looked confused and deep in thought."
    new "另一个 Atsuki 面露困惑，陷入了沉思。"

    # game/script.rpy:41068
    old "You should believe what I say. I still don't fully understand how that works, but you have to trust me."
    new "你该相信我说的话。这到底是怎么回事，我还没完全弄明白，但你得信我。"

    # game/script.rpy:41069
    old "...You can't explain it? Then there's no way you're actually telling the truth, right?"
    new "……你解释不了？那你说的就不可能是真的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:41070
    old "I am. While I can't be fully confident about what I'm saying, I'll just ask you to believe me."
    new "是真的。虽然我对自己的话也没有十足把握，但我只能请你相信我。"

    # game/script.rpy:41072
    old "...Good. I suppose there's one thing you could do, then."
    new "……很好。既然如此，我想有件事你可以做。"

    # game/script.rpy:41074
    old "Wait here a second."
    new "在这儿等一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:41079
    old "He disappeared from where he'd come after giving me an intense gaze. I was right next to them, but I felt more distant than ever before."
    new "他深深地看了我一眼，随即从他来的地方消失了。我明明就站在他们旁边，却觉得自己从未如此遥远。"

    # game/script.rpy:41080
    old "...Was that a future version of you?"
    new "……那是未来的你吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:41081
    old "I-I have no idea."
    new "我、我不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:41082
    old "Then, is that true...? Will Shiroya be all right?"
    new "那他说的是真的吗……？Shiroya 会没事吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:41083
    old "...I don't know. I thought I'd try to use the Sekimeiya a bit later and go a few hours to the past... Th-That wouldn't be enough, but if I managed to keep doing that... That's the only idea I had, but I didn't even know if the Sekimeiya would work again."
    new "……我不知道。我本来打算过一阵子试着用 Sekimeiya，回到几个小时之前……那、那点时间根本不够，可要是能一直反复这么做……我只想到这个办法，可连 Sekimeiya 还能不能再用都不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:41084
    old "I see. ...Whoever that was, we have to put all our faith in him."
    new "原来如此。……不管那人究竟是谁，我们也只能把全部希望都寄托在他身上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41091
    old "He soon came back running. Between his hands was the Sekimeiya. It seemed like it might've teleported to the attic that time."
    new "他很快就跑了回来，双手捧着 Sekimeiya。看来这一次，它大概是传送到了阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:41093
    old "Take this, but don't touch it."
    new "拿好，但别用手碰它。"

    # game/script.rpy:41094
    old "Atsuki handed himself the Sekimeiya and received it, hiding his hands under his sleeves."
    new "Atsuki 把 Sekimeiya 交给另一个自己，对方接了过去，双手都藏在袖子里。"

    # game/script.rpy:41096
    old "You two should hurry back down. On the second floor, enter the second partition, leave the Sekimeiya {tip=floor}on the floor{/tip}, and wait there."
    new "你们俩赶紧下楼去。到二楼，进第二间隔间，把 Sekimeiya 放在{tip=floor}地上{/tip}，就在那儿等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:41098
    old "On the second floor?"
    new "二楼？"

    # game/script.rpy:41101
    old "Yes. From there, if anyone passes by, you should hear them. If you hear the elevator four times, you can go back down and place the Sekimeiya in its cabinet. Make sure that it isn't activated again."
    new "对。待在那里，只要有人经过，你们应该都能听见。要是听到电梯响四次，就可以下楼，把 Sekimeiya 放回它的展示柜里。务必确保它不会再被启动。"

    # game/script.rpy:41102
    old "However, it's possible that the first time, instead of hearing the elevator, you'll hear someone running up. If that happens, once you hear the elevator two times, you can go down and place the Sekimeiya in the cabinet."
    new "不过，第一次你们听到的可能不是电梯，而是有人跑上楼的脚步声。若是那样，等电梯响过两次，你们就可以下楼，把 Sekimeiya 放回展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:41105
    old "O-Okay, and... after that, you're saying everything will be fine, right?"
    new "好、好的，那……之后，你是说一切都会没事，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:41108
    old "Yes. Wait patiently with everyone on the crystal floor and make sure to get out safely. I'll pray with you for what will happen after that."
    new "对。和大家一起在水晶层耐心等着，务必平安离开。至于之后会发生什么，我会和你们一同祈祷。"

    # game/script.rpy:41109
    old "All... All right."
    new "好……好吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:41113
    old "Atsuki turned around and ran back, putting all his faith in himself. As he did, the second Atsuki pierced me with his eyes."
    new "Atsuki 转过身，把一切都托付给自己，跑了回去。就在那时，第二个 Atsuki 的目光锐利地落在我身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:41114
    old "Goodbye, Miiya."
    new "再见了，Miiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:41115
    old "In front of me, I saw a look I knew I'd seen before that day. However, he quickly turned it away from me, glancing downward."
    new "我在他脸上看到了那副神情，知道自己在那天之前见过。然而，他很快移开视线，垂下了眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:41116
    old "Goodbye."
    new "再见。"

    # game/script.rpy:41117
    old "Almost in a curious manner, I responded with only one word. Then, I turned around and started sprinting."
    new "我几乎带着几分好奇，只应了这一个词，随即转身拔腿奔了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:41128
    old "Atsuki and I ran all the way down until we reached the second floor. Out of breath, he held the door to the offices open, and we entered the second one."
    new "我和 Atsuki 一路跑下楼，来到二楼。他气喘吁吁地撑住办公室的门，我们进了第二间。"

    # game/script.rpy:41136
    old "He placed the Sekimeiya on the floor as instructed and stepped away from it."
    new "他照吩咐把 Sekimeiya 放在地上，随即退开。"

    # game/script.rpy:41142
    old "There's no way this can work—whatever's about to happen..."
    new "这怎么可能行得通——不管接下来会发生什么……"

    # game/script.rpy:41144
    old "...He didn't know she had died again. I had the idea that she could be saved by going to the past and hiding her since she wasn't found, but doesn't this mean that she'll end up here and be killed?"
    new "他不知道她又死了一次。我原以为，既然没人找到她，回到过去把她藏起来就能救她；可照现在这样，她岂不是终究会来到这里，然后被杀掉？"

    # game/script.rpy:41145
    old "Well, whoever that Atsuki was, he knew more than we do, and when you told him we'd found her dead, he still said it would be fine."
    new "不管那个 Atsuki 是谁，他知道的都比我们多。你跟他说我们发现她死了的时候，他不还是说会没事吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:41150
    old "That's true..."
    new "说得也是……"

    # game/script.rpy:41151
    old "Her body disappeared from the lobby even though we still remember it. Maybe that's what indicates that the past will be changed so she doesn't die here either."
    new "她的尸体从大厅消失了，可我们都还记得。也许这恰恰说明，过去会被改写，她也不会死在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:41152
    old "Would it work like this...?{w} It might. The proof that she's dead doesn't exist anymore."
    new "会是这样吗……？{w}也许吧。证明她死了的证据，如今已经不存在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41158
    old "He can't just be a future self of mine; that wouldn't make any sense. ...The way he came to exist might be how he'll try to save Shiroya, but I have no idea what it could be."
    new "他不可能只是未来的我，那样根本说不通。……他出现的方式，也许正是他打算用来救 Shiroya 的手段，可我完全猜不到那是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:41164
    old "I heard a faint, deep sound."
    new "我听见一声低沉而微弱的响动。"

    # game/script.rpy:41165
    old "...That's the elevator, right? This is the first time."
    new "……是电梯吧？这是第一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:41166
    old "Yeah. He said that he didn't have much time and was right in saying that the elevator would be used."
    new "嗯。他说自己时间不多，还说电梯会被用到——这一点他果然说对了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41167
    old "So we have to hear it three more times until we can leave."
    new "所以还得再听到三次，我们才能走。"

    # game/script.rpy:41170
    old "The second time came immediately."
    new "第二次紧跟着就来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41171
    old "...Oh. It went through twice because it was called and then used."
    new "……哦。先是有人叫电梯，然后坐了上去，所以它响了两次。"

    # game/script.rpy:41172
    old "Where should the elevator have been?"
    new "电梯本来应该停在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:41177
    old "It was in the attic the last time I checked, from the time I went there. If that was still the case, someone just went up."
    new "我上去那趟看过，它当时停在阁楼。要是之后没动过，那就是有人刚坐它上去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41178
    old "That must be it. It's just like he said, either the elevator would be used twice or someone would run up."
    new "一定是这样。就跟他说的一样——要么电梯被用两次，要么有人跑上楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:41181
    old "...So he knew someone would go to the attic, but not how."
    new "……也就是说，他知道有人会去阁楼，却不知道是怎么去的。"

    # game/script.rpy:41187
    old "And at some point, it will happen again.{w} We're supposed to hear the elevator two more times. That means it'll end up in the attic again."
    new "而且过一会儿，同样的事还会再发生一次。{w}我们还要再听到两次电梯声，也就是说，它最后还是会停在阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:41188
    old "...If you're saying that wasn't a future version of you, how is it possible he knew all this?"
    new "……你说那不是未来的你，那他怎么会知道这些？"

    # game/script.rpy:41193
    old "...{w}I don't know.{w} It doesn't make any sense, does it? The flow of time wouldn't work like that. It's impossible.{w} ...Also, he told us to wait safely and get out of the tower. There's no way I'll be able to use the Sekimeiya once we're outside, and that still wouldn't make any sense. Nothing does."
    new "……{w}我不知道。{w}这根本说不通，不是吗？时间的流动不会是这样的。不可能。{w}……还有，他让我们安心等着，然后离开这座塔。可一旦到了外面，我根本用不了 Sekimeiya，那样也还是说不通。没有一件事说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:41195
    old "He's right. But she's on the crystal floor, alongside a third Atsuki. It can't be that the world was changed so that she never died, because that Atsuki was surprised to see her too.{w} One of them was probably who went up to the attic, but what will come out of this? Will different versions of us remain? The other Atsuki didn't make it sound like that."
    new "他说得没错。可她就在水晶层，身边还有第三个 Atsuki。世界不可能被改写成她从未死过——那个 Atsuki 见到她时，同样一脸惊讶。{w}上楼去阁楼的，多半就是他们当中的一个，可这样又能得出什么结果？我们这些不同的版本会同时留下来吗？另一个 Atsuki 的说法听起来并不是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:41203
    old "...I should have been dead. Why?"
    new "……我本该已经死了。为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:41205
    old "{tip=dead}{i}I should be dead. Atsuki was right.{/i}{/tip} I should be, but I'm not."
    new "{tip=dead}{i}我本该已经死了。Atsuki 说得没错。{/i}{/tip}我本该死了，却没有死。"

    # game/script.rpy:41206
    old "...It can't be they were talking about that, can it?"
    new "……他们说的，不会就是这件事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:41207
    old "The answer had to revolve around the Sekimeiya's disappearance. Maybe, whenever that occurred, the changes made were applied to the world."
    new "答案一定与 Sekimeiya 的消失有关。也许它每次消失，那些改动就会作用在这个世界上。"

    # game/script.rpy:41208
    old "It had teleported to the attic, so if nothing else happened, the state of the world would stay as it was.{w} But there were so many things to iron out. Three Atsukis existed at once. She had appeared out of nowhere in front of one of them. Not all the disappeared corpses had reappeared alive."
    new "它传送到了阁楼，所以只要别的什么都没发生，世界的状态就会维持原样。{w}可需要理顺的地方太多了。三个 Atsuki 同时存在；她凭空出现在其中一个面前；消失的尸体也并非全都活着回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41209
    old "Was everything really going to resolve itself if we buried our heads in the sand until we could leave the building?"
    new "难道我们只要装作什么都没看见，一直等到能离开这栋楼，一切就真的会自行了结吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:41216
    old "...And the Sekimeiya was in the attic. Did it teleport there, or did he unlock the cabinet with a key of his own?"
    new "……而且 Sekimeiya 就在阁楼里。是它自己传送过去的，还是他用自己手上的钥匙打开了展示柜？"

    # game/script.rpy:41217
    old "I don't know, but I still have the keys. I should probably leave them somewhere before we get out."
    new "我不知道。不过钥匙还在我这儿。出去之前，最好还是找个地方处理掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:41223
    old "...Did we lock the cabinet the last time?"
    new "……上次我们锁展示柜了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:41224
    old "Oh, you're right. I said I'd go to the attic and we never locked it."
    new "啊，你说得对。我当时说要去阁楼，结果就没锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:41229
    old "So he just brought it up."
    new "所以他直接把它搬上去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41231
    old "...In fact, the Sekimeiya had moved twice before. Erina and I had found it in a cabinet in room B4, next to Naomi's moved body. In the future, it was in one of the lockers, and it wasn't Naomi's. We'd never seen which one was Katei's, so it might've been his."
    new "……其实，Sekimeiya 之前已经移动过两次。我和 Erina 是在 B4 房间的展示柜里发现它的，就在被移动过的 Naomi 的尸体旁边。而在未来，它被放在其中一个储物柜里，而且不是 Naomi 的柜子。我们从没见过哪个是 Katei 的，所以那很可能就是他的。"

    # game/script.rpy:41232
    old "It was all tied together. When I'd found the Sekimeiya in the staff room, there had been blood on the crystal floor. When Atsuki had seen that I was no longer sleeping, no yells had come from the opposite bedroom."
    new "这一切都串起来了。我在员工室找到 Sekimeiya 时，水晶层上有血迹。Atsuki 发现我已经不再沉睡时，对面卧室里也没有传来喊声。"

    # game/script.rpy:41233
    old "But there was no way to make sense of it. Had the blood on the crystal floor disappeared at the same time as the Sekimeiya? Even if so, it was all far too volatile, and I didn't know what had happened while I was asleep."
    new "可我还是理不出头绪。水晶层上的血迹，是和 Sekimeiya 一起消失的吗？就算如此，这一切变数也实在太多，我睡着的时候究竟发生了什么，我无从得知。"

    # game/script.rpy:41237
    old "A very important question came to mind."
    new "我忽然想到一个极为关键的问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:41238
    old "In the bedroom... did you turn on the light?"
    new "在卧室里……你开灯了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:41243
    old "Oh, yes, sorry. I didn't know you were there."
    new "啊，开了，抱歉。我不知道你在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:41244
    old "I mean later, when you were already above."
    new "我是说后来，你已经上楼之后。"

    # game/script.rpy:41249
    old "Hm? No, I didn't. I'm confused by what you mean.{w} I came down, and it seemed like you weren't there because I couldn't hear you. I did turn on the light to confirm it, but you were already gone. Is that what you meant?"
    new "嗯？没有。你这么说我倒糊涂了。{w}我下楼的时候听不到你的声音，以为你不在。我确实开灯确认过，可你已经走了。你问的是这个吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:41251
    old "...{w}Yes, sorry. I thought someone might have turned it on after you came."
    new "……{w}对，抱歉。我以为你下来之后，有人开过灯。"

    # game/script.rpy:41252
    old "I don't know. I didn't hear anything."
    new "我不知道。我什么都没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:41254
    old "What the hell, then?"
    new "那到底是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:41255
    old "I don't even know if turning off the light in the upper bedroom would've turned it off where I was anyway.{w} This doesn't make any sense...!"
    new "我甚至不确定，关掉楼上卧室的灯，会不会也把我那边的灯关掉。{w}这根本说不通……！"

    # game/script.rpy:41260
    old "I sat on one of the chairs. I couldn't be too frustrated—the outcome had already been guaranteed. We'd soon make it out, and she was probably going to magically revive."
    new "我在一把椅子上坐下。也不必太焦躁——反正结果早就注定了。我们很快就会出去，而她多半会像奇迹一样活过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:41261
    old "Oh, fuck..."
    new "妈的……"

    # game/script.rpy:41262
    old "I should leave the keys somewhere before we get out because they'll look at my purse..."
    new "出去之前，我得把钥匙放到别处，因为他们会翻我的包……"

    # game/script.rpy:41263
    old "And there was one more thing that couldn't be found."
    new "此外，还有一样东西不能被人找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:41264
    old "...It was fine. I'd just have to flush it down the toilet or something."
    new "……没关系。大不了冲进马桶里。"

    # game/script.rpy:41265
    old "I realized the contents of my purse could be seen from where it was on the floor, so I slowly moved it aside."
    new "我意识到包就这么放在地上，里面的东西会被人看见，便慢慢把它挪到一边。"

    # game/script.rpy:41266
    old "Wait...{w} ...Is it not here?"
    new "等等……{w}……不在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:41267
    old "I stared at my purse, baffled. Then, I grabbed it and took the keys out."
    new "我茫然地盯着自己的包，随后一把抓过来，把钥匙取了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:41268
    old "...Yeah, I'll leave these somewhere. I'd rather not be asked about why I had them."
    new "……嗯，我会找个地方把它们处理掉。我不想被人问起为什么带着这些钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:41269
    old "I'm sure it'd be fine anyway."
    new "反正我觉得不会有事。"

    # game/script.rpy:41273
    old "{tip=note}It wasn't there.{/tip} In my purse were the keyring, the tickets we'd bought for the event, our identification, and our keys."
    new "{tip=note}它不在那里。{/tip}我的包里只有钥匙串、我们为活动买的门票、证件，还有我们自己的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:41274
    old "Was it really taken while I was asleep...?"
    new "真的是在我睡着的时候被拿走的吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:41275
    old "There's no way."
    new "不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:41277
    old "Wait, no.{w} I bet I know what happened."
    new "等等，不对。{w}我想我知道是怎么回事了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41278
    old "It disappeared. That's it."
    new "它消失了。就是这么回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:41279
    old "At some point, it disappeared from my purse and from this world. That's what's been happening. As Atsuki said, in this world, there's no remaining proof that she's dead."
    new "不知什么时候，它从我的包里、从这个世界上消失了。一直都是这样。就像 Atsuki 说的，在这个世界里，已经没有任何能证明她死了的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:41280
    old "There was nothing else to care about. Knowing that, calmly waiting felt much more doable than before."
    new "再没有别的可担心的事了。想通这一点，静静等待也比先前从容得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:41281
    old "I remained sitting on that chair, unable to hear anything beyond Atsuki's breathing."
    new "我一直坐在那把椅子上，除了 Atsuki 的呼吸声，什么也听不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:41289
    old "It was many minutes later when we heard the elevator for the third time."
    new "又过了好几分钟，我们第三次听到了电梯的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:41294
    old "There it is...!"
    new "来了……！"

    # game/script.rpy:41295
    old "Let's see if we hear it again immediately."
    new "看看会不会马上又响一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:41298
    old "We did. Just a minute later, the fourth came."
    new "果然。仅仅一分钟后，第四次声响就传来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41303
    old "All right, let's go... Hopefully, nobody sees us."
    new "好，走吧……希望别被人看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:41309
    old "I opened the door, and Atsuki crouched to grab the Sekimeiya."
    new "我打开门，Atsuki 蹲下身去拿 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:41310
    old "How the fuck can it be this hot...!? It hurts to even get my fingers close to it."
    new "这玩意儿怎么会烫成这样……！？手指一靠近就疼。"

    # game/script.rpy:41315
    old "We heard an unexpected sound."
    new "我们听到了意料之外的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:41320
    old "Oh, what...?"
    new "咦，什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:41325
    old "We both listened more intently, and I could tell that we were hearing footsteps coming from the staircase leading down."
    new "我们两人都凝神细听，我听出那是从通往楼下的楼梯传来的脚步声。"

    # game/script.rpy:41330
    old "W-Wait, it should be fine, right...?"
    new "等、等等，应该没事吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:41335
    old "What the fuck...!? What are you doing here!?"
    new "搞什么鬼……！？你们在这里做什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:41336
    old "Sai saw me through the glass. Next to him was Akaro, even though his running hadn't been heard from inside."
    new "Sai 隔着玻璃看见了我。他身旁是 Akaro，尽管从里面听不到他跑动的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:41340
    old "Atsuki! Come here! I fucking see the Sekimeiya!"
    new "Atsuki！快过来！我他妈看见 Sekimeiya 了！"

    # game/script.rpy:41341
    old "What did you do...? You didn't stop on this floor, right?"
    new "你干了什么……？你没在这一层停下吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:41343
    old "Don't be stupid. He has the Sekimeiya. He probably used it."
    new "别装傻。Sekimeiya 就在他手上。多半是他用的。"

    # game/script.rpy:41350
    old "Do you mean that I just took the elevator?"
    new "你是说，刚才坐电梯的是我？"

    # game/script.rpy:41355
    old "Holy shit, man. Will this attitude stop?{w} Why were you waiting here? You knew we'd go up, right? Was your idea to make us chase you to then touch the Sekimeiya and wait here to sneak back down?"
    new "我靠，你这副态度有完没完？{w} 你守在这儿做什么？你早知道我们要上去吧？你是想引我们追过来，自己碰一下 Sekimeiya，然后守在这儿，好偷偷溜下去？"

    # game/script.rpy:41360
    old "...I didn't do any of that."
    new "……这些事我一件都没做过。"

    # game/script.rpy:41361
    old "He probably understood it. Another version of Atsuki had just used the elevator. That was why Sai was accusing him of touching the Sekimeiya."
    new "他大概已经明白了。刚才用电梯的是另一个 Atsuki，所以 Sai 才咬定他碰过 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:41362
    old "However, while he probably thought it was the version he'd spoken with, he was unaware of the other one who'd been on the crystal floor."
    new "可是，他多半以为那是与自己说过话的那个分身，并不知道还有另一个 Atsuki 曾待在水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:41367
    old "What now, then? What were you planning to do with that Sekimeiya? As I thought, you're also in on this plan, right?"
    new "那现在呢？你打算用那个 Sekimeiya 做什么？果然，你也参与了这个计划吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:41368
    old "Me...?{w} I don't even know what you're talking about."
    new "我……？{w} 我根本不知道你在说什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:41369
    old "Even though fainter, we perceived the same sound. The elevator had just been used."
    new "那声音虽轻，我们却听得分明。电梯刚刚被人用过。"

    # game/script.rpy:41374
    old "That was the elevator, and I bet I know who that is."
    new "是电梯。我敢说我知道是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:41379
    old "Who...?"
    new "谁……？"

    # game/script.rpy:41380
    old "Atsuki looked a little uncertain. There had been no mention of a fifth elevator sound."
    new "Atsuki 的神情有些迟疑。此前谁也没提过第五次电梯声。"

    # game/script.rpy:41382
    old "Who? The girl who I bet was supposed to meet with you two right now, after you'd made it down from here with the Sekimeiya. It's unfortunate you were too incompetent to handle such a simple plan."
    new "谁？就是那个女孩——我猜她本该在你们带着 Sekimeiya 从这层下去之后，这会儿来跟你们俩碰面。可惜你们太不中用，这么简单的计划都办砸了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41387
    old "...What?{w} I'm being serious. I have absolutely no idea what you're talking about. What girl?"
    new "……什么？{w} 我是认真的。我完全不知道你在说什么。什么女孩？"

    # game/script.rpy:41388
    old "I'm not sure what the idea behind this is, really. Were you actually able to open the storeroom door?"
    new "我真不明白这到底在打什么主意。你们居然真能打开储藏室的门？"

    # game/script.rpy:41393
    old "...{w}Answer me. What girl?"
    new "……{w} 回答我。什么女孩？"

    # game/script.rpy:41401
    old "What even was her name, Akaro?"
    new "她到底叫什么来着，Akaro？"

    # game/script.rpy:41408
    old "...Hm.{w} ...Shiroya, right?"
    new "……嗯。{w} ……Shiroya，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:41414
    old "The sixth time came. The elevator passed through our floor as Atsuki's eyes widened. He understood it immediately: she was already present."
    new "第六次来了。电梯经过我们这一层时，Atsuki 眼睛猛地睁大。他立刻明白了：她已经到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41419
    old "Oh, fuck... She realized you hadn't come and went back up."
    new "妈的……她发现你们没下来，又折上去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41425
    old "Sai sprinted toward the third floor."
    new "Sai 朝三层冲了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:41431
    old "Akaro! Go down and wait in front of the storeroom! It could've been sent empty!"
    new "Akaro！你下去，守在储藏室门口！说不定电梯是空着下去的！"

    # game/script.rpy:41438
    old "Akaro looked hesitant for a moment, but he followed Sai's order. In an instant, Atsuki and I were alone."
    new "Akaro 犹豫了一瞬，还是照 Sai 的吩咐去了。转眼间，就只剩我和 Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:41442
    old "What the hell? What do we do?"
    new "搞什么？我们怎么办？"

    # game/script.rpy:41447
    old "...{w}We should put the Sekimeiya in the cabinet and stay on the crystal floor. That's what we were told."
    new "……{w}照之前说的，我们得把 Sekimeiya 放进展示柜，待在水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:41455
    old "We ran behind Akaro.{w} I looked down and saw that there was still no blood on the floor or the staircase."
    new "我们跟在 Akaro 后面跑。{w} 我低头看去，地板和楼梯上依旧没有血迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:41462
    old "On the floor, below the elevator panel, there was a folded piece of paper. Atsuki and Akaro were ahead of me, so they didn't see me grabbing it and putting it in my purse."
    new "电梯按钮板下方的地板上，躺着一张折起的纸。Atsuki 和 Akaro 走在我前面，没看见我把它捡起来塞进手袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:41463
    old "Did it... not disappear after all?"
    new "那东西……终究没有消失？"

    # game/script.rpy:41466
    old "Akaro was in the storeroom, but I just followed behind Atsuki, completely lost for words. How the hell had that made it there?"
    new "Akaro 进了储藏室，我只默默跟在 Atsuki 身后，一句话也说不出来。那东西到底是怎么到这里的？"

    # game/script.rpy:41473
    old "The event room was empty."
    new "活动室里空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:41476
    old "I opened the unlocked empty cabinet, and Atsuki left the Sekimeiya inside. That time, he didn't forget to lock it."
    new "我打开没上锁的空展示柜，Atsuki 把 Sekimeiya 放了进去。这一次，他没有忘记上锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:41485
    old "We left the Sekimeiya in the cabinet."
    new "我们把 Sekimeiya 留在了展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:41497
    old "...We promise we don't know what you were talking about. Why did Sai say that it was Shiroya who'd taken the elevator? That's the... girl who died."
    new "……我们保证，真的不知道你在说什么。Sai 为什么说坐电梯的是 Shiroya？那是……死掉的那个女孩吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:41498
    old "So you remember now?"
    new "所以你现在想起来了？"

    # game/script.rpy:41503
    old "Did I not...? Of course I do. She was in the elevator and then disappeared from the lobby."
    new "我什么时候忘了……？当然记得。她进了电梯，随后就在大厅里消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41508
    old "That's right, but she was here just minutes ago and said she was going to the attic. That's why Sai believes you're responsible."
    new "没错。可几分钟前她还在这里，说要去阁楼。所以 Sai 才认定是你们干的。"

    # game/script.rpy:41509
    old "How many minutes ago?"
    new "几分钟前？"

    # game/script.rpy:41510
    old "I don't know, quite a few, and you were here too with the Erina who disappeared."
    new "我也说不准，总有几分钟了。而且你当时也在这里，和那个消失的 Erina 在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:41515
    old "The Erina who died...?"
    new "死掉的那个 Erina……？"

    # game/script.rpy:41519
    old "Yes. She had her clothes caked with dried blood. You two took the elevator up just now."
    new "对。她的衣服上结满了干涸的血。刚才就是你们俩坐电梯上来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:41520
    old "So the person who used the elevator the first time was her, and the second time it was Atsuki and Erina."
    new "那么第一次用电梯的人是她，第二次则是 Atsuki 和 Erina。"

    # game/script.rpy:41521
    old "I had met that version of Erina as well, and neither she nor Atsuki were the people we'd been with since that morning."
    new "那个模样的 Erina 我也见过。她不是我们从那天早晨起一直相处的人，Atsuki 也不是。"

    # game/script.rpy:41526
    old "That wasn't me. I'm being serious."
    new "那不是我。我说的是真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:41527
    old "He's right. We've been in the attic all this time and haven't seen anyone."
    new "他说得没错。我们一直待在阁楼里，谁都没见到。"

    # game/script.rpy:41532
    old "That's not easy to believe. You were hiding in the offices with the Sekimeiya."
    new "这可不太容易让人相信。你们可是和 Sekimeiya 一起躲在办公区的。"

    # game/script.rpy:41534
    old "It wasn't us who brought the Sekimeiya up. We found it in the attic. We also weren't hiding in the offices, we were searching them before coming back down."
    new "Sekimeiya 不是我们带上去的。我们是在阁楼里发现它的。我们也没有躲在办公区，是逐间查看之后才下来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:41540
    old "...I don't know.{w} I can't just assume you're lying after all that's happened."
    new "……我不知道。{w} 出了这么多事，我也不能就这么认定你在说谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:41546
    old "...Where are the others?"
    new "……其他人呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:41551
    old "Well, Katei should be in the security room, and I saw Erina and Isla hadn't left the crystal room they were in."
    new "嗯，Katei 应该在监控室；我还看见 Erina 和 Isla 一直没离开她们待的水晶展室。"

    # game/script.rpy:41557
    old "While Atsuki opened the door to the security room, I looked at the lobby."
    new "Atsuki 打开监控室门的时候，我朝大厅望了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:41565
    old "Naomi's corpse had returned there, and along with the policeman, they were lying on the floor in solitude. The wound on Naomi's head had stopped bleeding, so the pool below it had reached its limit."
    new "Naomi 的尸体又回到了那里，和那名警察一起孤零零地躺在地上。Naomi 头上的伤口已经不再流血，底下的血泊也不再扩大。"

    # game/script.rpy:41568
    old "The status of the room had gone back to normal after changing continuously. Was that the version the outside world would see?"
    new "房间的状态在不停变化之后又恢复了原样。外面的人看到的，会是这个样子吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:41571
    old "I looked to my right and saw Katei lying back on his chair in front of all the powered-off screens."
    new "我向右看去，Katei 正靠坐在椅子上，面前是一整排熄了屏的显示器。"

    # game/script.rpy:41578
    old "Oh, it's you two. It's been a while."
    new "哦，是你们俩。有阵子没见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41583
    old "...Yes, we just came back from the attic."
    new "……嗯，我们刚从阁楼回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:41584
    old "He wasn't dead below his desk, and it was clear he'd failed to fix the computer."
    new "他没有死在桌子底下，而且显然没能修好电脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:41589
    old "...How's this going?"
    new "……进展怎么样？"

    # game/script.rpy:41594
    old "I stopped a while ago. I have no idea what the issue is, so I'll need other people to look into it."
    new "我早就停手了。我完全看不出问题出在哪，只能等别人来查。"

    # game/script.rpy:41611
    old "When we opened the door in front, we saw the last two people. Isla was not lying face-up inside a dark cabinet, but instead ogling one of the uncovered glass displays."
    new "推开正前方的门，我们见到了最后两个人。Isla 并没有仰面躺在哪个昏暗的展示柜里，而是在打量一个掀去了罩子的玻璃展台。"

    # game/script.rpy:41617
    old "...Hello."
    new "……你们好。"

    # game/script.rpy:41618
    old "Erina stood up after seeing the two of us. There was no blood on her clothes, and she seemed pretty tired."
    new "Erina 看到我们两个后站了起来。她衣服上没有血迹，看上去相当疲惫。"

    # game/script.rpy:41628
    old "Oh, no. We weren't sure if you were still here."
    new "啊，没有。我们只是不确定你们还在不在。"

    # game/script.rpy:41629
    old "We've been here the whole time."
    new "我们一直都在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:41634
    old "That's good. The time is getting closer."
    new "那就好。时间快到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41649
    old "You said the Erina covered in blood was here too?"
    new "你说那个浑身是血的 Erina 也在这儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:41654
    old "Yes. She and the girl—the two dead bodies that disappeared. For a second, I thought they'd been alive the whole time, but that couldn't be it."
    new "对。她还有那个女孩——就是那两具消失的尸体。有一瞬间我还以为她们一直活着，可那不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:41659
    old "Wait, is that it...? Could it be that they were genuinely brought back to life?{w} But, no... If another version of me existed, it must be something completely different."
    new "等等，难道说……？难不成她们是真的死而复生了？{w} 不对……如果真有另一个我，那一定完全是另一回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:41664
    old "If that really wasn't you, then I'm really confused. According to him, that girl had been with us the entire day. Since this morning."
    new "如果那真的不是你，那我就彻底糊涂了。照他说的，那个女孩一整天都跟我们在一起。从今天早上开始。"

    # game/script.rpy:41670
    old "There was absolutely fucking nobody in the attic or anywhere."
    new "阁楼里也好，别处也好，他妈的连个人影都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:41674
    old "Sai came from the stairs and entered the storeroom, all while I considered how strange that assertion was. Had he simply failed to find the others?"
    new "Sai 从楼梯那边过来，进了储藏室。我一直在想，他这话也太奇怪了。难道他只是没找到其他人？"

    # game/script.rpy:41675
    old "Two different versions of Atsuki, the other Erina, and her too. They all should've been there. Something else still didn't make sense either."
    new "两个不同的 Atsuki、另一个 Erina，还有她，这些人都应该在那里才对。而且还有一件事说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:41676
    old "The elevator had been used two more times after the fourth. We knew who had used it the first four times and that everyone who should've been on the crystal floor was present. So, who had taken the final two trips and gone above us?"
    new "电梯在第四次之后又被用了两次。前四次是谁用的，我们心里有数，而且本该待在水晶层的人全都在场。那么，最后那两趟又是谁乘的，跑到了我们楼上？"

    # game/script.rpy:41682
    old "The door hasn't been opened again. ...Where's the Sekimeiya?"
    new "那扇门没有再被打开过。……Sekimeiya 在哪？"

    # game/script.rpy:41687
    old "In the cabinet."
    new "在展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:41693
    old "In the cabinet? Akaro, don't you understand that their friend could be here? She could've taken it already!"
    new "在展示柜里？Akaro，你难道不明白他们的朋友可能就在这儿？她说不定早就把它拿走了！"

    # game/script.rpy:41698
    old "Hey, I did what you said."
    new "喂，我可是照你说的做了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41701
    old "Offended, Sai hurried to the event room."
    new "Sai 一脸不快，匆匆赶往活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:41717
    old "Akaro explained to us what happened. That wasn't me, and we don't want to take it out of here again."
    new "Akaro 把事情经过告诉我们了。那不是我，而且我们也不想再把它带出这里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41722
    old "What did he say?"
    new "他怎么说？"

    # game/script.rpy:41727
    old "That both of them were sleeping in the attic and found the Sekimeiya there. Then, they came down, searching through every floor until we saw them."
    new "说他们俩在阁楼里睡觉，在那儿发现了 Sekimeiya。然后一路下来，一层一层地搜，直到被我们撞见。"

    # game/script.rpy:41732
    old "Is that what we're supposed to believe? That the people who have the key to the cabinet conveniently found it where they were, and that instead of hurrying to bring it back, they looked through the entire building with it?"
    new "这就是要我们相信的说法？拿着展示柜钥匙的人，恰好就在自己待的地方捡到了它，然后不急着送回来，反而带着它把整栋楼搜了一遍？"

    # game/script.rpy:41737
    old "...That's what happened.{w} Did you really not find anyone? Aren't you the one who says that I took the elevator up?"
    new "……事情就是这样。{w} 你真的一个人都没找到？不是你说我乘电梯上去了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:41738
    old "Yes. I'm only one person, though, so I couldn't really search optimally.{w} But it is possible there was nobody to find if the three people who should've been there merely traveled with the Sekimeiya, which, again, you happened to have."
    new "没错。可我只有一个人，没法搜得面面俱到。{w} 不过，要是本该在那里的三个人只是带着 Sekimeiya 走了——而它偏偏又在你手里——那找不到人也说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:41741
    old "I don't exactly know what happened, so what is it that you're accusing me of?"
    new "我并不清楚到底发生了什么，你到底在指责我什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:41746
    old "...{w}I'm accusing you of trying to execute a plan that might involve getting the Sekimeiya out of the tower. Of lying openly, and of working with that girl you know who didn't get trapped with us."
    new "……{w} 我是在指责你：你想执行一个把 Sekimeiya 弄出塔的计划；你公然撒谎；还跟那个你认识、但没跟我们困在一起的女孩串通。"

    # game/script.rpy:41751
    old "...I'm sorry, but I can't really take you seriously. I woke up a few minutes ago and have no idea what any of this is about. Since Akaro is backing you up, I guess it's true that the two missing bodies reappeared, but it seems they're gone again, right? Erina is with Isla two rooms over, and she looks totally okay.{w} Also, I already said that I don't want to take the Sekimeiya out of here again."
    new "……抱歉，我实在没法把你的话当真。我几分钟前才醒过来，根本不知道这些事是怎么回事。既然 Akaro 也站在你那边，那两具消失的尸体确实重新出现过，我承认；可她们似乎又不见了，对吧？Erina 就在隔了两个房间的地方和 Isla 待着，看上去一点事都没有。{w} 再说，我已经说过，我不想再把它带出去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41753
    old "Sai approached Atsuki and touched his sleeves."
    new "Sai走到Atsuki身边，碰了碰他的衣袖。"

    # game/script.rpy:41758
    old "It was working again, huh? Your shirt is burning."
    new "又生效了啊？你的衬衫都烧起来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41759
    old "But we didn't activate it, and we never will."
    new "可我们并没有启动它，以后也不会。"

    # game/script.rpy:41765
    old "However, if it's true that I was here and said things that didn't make sense...{w} You're right, I know that girl, Shiroya. She's an old friend of mine who... died two weeks ago. I don't have any idea why she was here today or how that's possible."
    new "不过，如果我当时真在这里，还说了些莫名其妙的话……{w}你说得对，我认识那个女孩，Shiroya。她是我的老朋友，两周前……去世了。我不知道她今天为什么会出现在这里，也不知道这怎么可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:41766
    old "You just said that the storeroom door hasn't opened again. And the elevator was used two times, right? If it's true that they were here... they must still be. And I can guarantee it because we had the Sekimeiya and didn't use it."
    new "你刚才说过，储藏室的门没有再开过。电梯被用过两次，对吧？如果他们真的来过这里……那他们一定还在这里。这点我可以保证，因为Sekimeiya一直在我们手上，我们并没有使用它。"

    # game/script.rpy:41772
    old "So we have to go find them. You were just one person looking around, so they could have dodged you. All of us together can find them. Then, we'll work out exactly what happened."
    new "所以我们必须去找他们。你只有一个人，他们完全可能避开你。大家一起找，一定能找到。然后我们再弄清楚到底发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:41780
    old "...Are you fucking serious?"
    new "……你他妈认真的？"

    # game/script.rpy:41785
    old "Now I'm sure. You're spewing an immense amount of bullshit out of that idiotic mouth of yours."
    new "现在我确定了。你那张蠢嘴里喷出来的，全是狗屁。"

    # game/script.rpy:41790
    old "I don't care how you did it, but you're right: they have to be here because the elevator was used again. I don't care if they traveled to the past or if they just avoided me."
    new "我不管你是怎么做到的，但你说得没错：电梯又被用过，所以他们一定还在这里。他们是穿越回了过去，还是单纯躲开了我，我都不在乎。"

    # game/script.rpy:41791
    old "I had a theory ready that entailed Shiroya waiting for the elevator sound on the second floor and activating the Sekimeiya so that you'd all travel. After all, what's most strange is that the Sekimeiya was on the second floor right after you took the elevator up."
    new "我原本准备好了一套推论：Shiroya在二楼等着电梯的声音，然后启动Sekimeiya，让你们所有人穿越。毕竟最蹊跷的是，你们刚乘电梯上去，Sekimeiya就出现在二楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:41792
    old "With all the waiting, you probably had a somewhat thought-out plan ready. However, that hardly matters. What matters is that you're not getting the chance to take the Sekimeiya out again."
    new "等了这么久，你大概也准备好了一套还算周密的计划。不过那都不重要。重要的是，我不会再给你把Sekimeiya带出去的机会。"

    # game/script.rpy:41805
    old "Did you think we'd all just go looking now? You're not moving from here."
    new "你以为我们现在会全体出动去找人？你哪儿也别想去。"

    # game/script.rpy:41810
    old "And how will you enforce that?"
    new "你打算怎么拦我？"

    # game/script.rpy:41811
    old "Don't you think Akaro easily could?"
    new "你觉得Akaro拦不住你？"

    # game/script.rpy:41826
    old "Neither of you are leaving this room. Give me the keys too."
    new "你们两个谁也别想离开这个房间。钥匙也交给我。"

    # game/script.rpy:41827
    old "I handed him the keyring, feigning a defeated face."
    new "我装出一副认输的表情，把钥匙串递给了他。"

    # game/script.rpy:41828
    old "Whatever the fuck you had planned with that girl won't happen as long as we stay here."
    new "不管你和那女的盘算着什么，只要我们还守在这儿，就别想得逞。"

    # game/script.rpy:41834
    old "Sai moved to hallway A and went to the storeroom."
    new "Sai 走到 A走廊，进了储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:41840
    old "It seems she didn't take the sole chance she had to escape. I'm not letting the storeroom out of my sight again, so the police will definitely catch this person who's supposedly dead."
    new "看来她并没有抓住唯一一次逃跑的机会。这次我不会再让储藏室离开我的视线，那个据说已经死了的人，一定会被警察抓住。"

    # game/script.rpy:41841
    old "At least one of them must be here, between Shiroya and Erina. However, it's probably both, and they're not going to show themselves."
    new "Shiroya 和 Erina 之中，至少有一个肯定在这里。不过多半是两个都在，而且她们不会自己露面。"

    # game/script.rpy:41846
    old "The best thing is that there's no need to search for them. The Sekimeiya is shut in here, so they can't activate it to escape. The storeroom is out of the question too. They're basically trapped."
    new "最省事的是，根本不用去找。Sekimeiya锁在这里，她们没法启动它逃走。储藏室更不用提。她们基本上已经无路可走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41847
    old "It's currently {time=19:32.} There's no need to search for them, but don't worry—they'll be found as soon as the police enter the building. If you really do want that, you're not opposed, right?"
    new "现在是{time=19:32.} 没必要去找她们，不过你放心——警察一进大楼，她们就会被找到。如果你真的希望那样，应该也不会反对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:41852
    old "...!{w} I still think we should find them because I want to understand what happened. If we find them, you'll believe all that I'm saying."
    new "……！{w}我还是觉得应该去找她们，因为我想弄明白到底发生了什么。找到她们，你就会相信我说的一切了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41857
    old "I see. Then we'll go ahead and believe it after {time=21}, when two versions of you are found."
    new "是吗。那就等{time=21}，等找到两个你之后，我们再相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:41862
    old "...If that's what you want, I'm fine with that too. I-I suppose we can wait here. There's not that much time left."
    new "……如果你坚持这样，我也没意见。那、那就等在这里好了。剩下的时间也不多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41872
    old "I think that's for the best too."
    new "我也觉得这样最好。"

    # game/script.rpy:41883
    old "It appeared it had been settled. After a few minutes, I was the first to sit on the floor, leaning on the dirty wall."
    new "事情似乎就这么定下来了。几分钟后，我第一个坐到地上，靠着脏兮兮的墙壁。"

    # game/script.rpy:41884
    old "Everyone in the room was silently on alert. Eventually, Sai's taunting attitude receded, and he started to look doubtful."
    new "房间里每个人都在默默戒备。到后来，Sai那副讥讽的态度渐渐收敛，脸上开始显出疑虑。"

    # game/script.rpy:41885
    old "However, {time=21} kept approaching at a steady pace, and nobody seemed against that. I wanted to get rid of the note in my purse, but I couldn't go to the bathroom to flush it away. When no one was looking at me, I stuffed it inside one of my shoes. The police would probably search us after we left, so my purse wasn't a good place to hide it."
    new "然而{time=21}仍在稳步逼近，似乎没有人反对。我想处理掉包里的那张纸条，却不能去洗手间把它冲掉。趁没人注意我，我把它塞进了一只鞋里。离开之后警察多半会搜身，放在包里并不稳妥。"

    # game/script.rpy:41888
    old "Katei left the security room and was told we were waiting together. For the last stretch of the day, he entered the dim room with us to maintain our protection of the Sekimeiya."
    new "Katei离开监控室，得知我们都在这里一起等着。这一天剩下的时间里，他也走进了这间昏暗的房间，和我们一同守着Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:41889
    old "No matter what the truth was, our shared distrust was palpable. Anyone could've been lying the entire day. Perhaps, after the police entered, we'd eventually learn all about what the people we'd gotten trapped with had done."
    new "无论真相如何，彼此间的猜忌都显而易见。这一整天，任何人都可能一直在说谎。也许等警察进来之后，我们终会弄清，这些和我们一同被困的人究竟做过些什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:41890
    old "I didn't think anything good could come of it. After all, there was a killer in the room."
    new "我不觉得那会有什么好结果。毕竟，这间屋子里有一个杀人凶手。"

    # game/script.rpy:41903
    old "Miiya and Atsuki had been told by another Atsuki that as long as they stayed on the crystal floor, everything should turn out fine."
    new "另一个 Atsuki 告诉过 Miiya 和 Atsuki，只要他们待在水晶层上，一切应该都会顺利。"

    # game/script.rpy:41904
    old "The mystery behind the people who had gone to the attic... Nobody could be certain what had happened to them."
    new "那些去了阁楼的人身上究竟藏着什么谜团……没有人能确定他们遭遇了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:41905
    old "Were they still in the tower? Or had Sai failed to find them because they had vanished?"
    new "他们还在这座塔里吗？还是说，他们其实已经消失了，所以 Sai 才找不到？"

    # game/script.rpy:41906
    old "It was possible that they were waiting near the event room. If that was the case, they would be found by the police."
    new "他们也许正在活动室附近等着。若真如此，警察一进来就会发现他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:41910
    old "A few of the people in the room had similar thoughts."
    new "房间里有几个人也抱着类似的念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:41911
    old "Should the less suspicious among them look for the others while everyone else waited in the event room? Given the amount of time left, it sounded risky and unnecessary."
    new "要不要让嫌疑较小的几个人去找其他人，其余人留在活动室等候？考虑到剩下的时间，这既冒险又没有必要。"

    # game/script.rpy:41913
    old "But Miiya kept thinking about one thing."
    new "但Miiya心里始终放不下一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:41922
    old "\"I want to search the building again.\""
    new "「我想再搜一遍大楼。」"

    # game/script.rpy:41925
    old "\"I want to stay in the event room.\""
    new "「我想留在活动室。」"

    # game/script.rpy:41928
    old "Finding Self"
    new "寻回自我"

    # game/script.rpy:41938
    old "As the time kept passing, Miiya's conflict grew."
    new "时间一点点过去，Miiya 内心的矛盾愈发深重。"

    # game/script.rpy:41939
    old "The Atsuki they'd spoken with had said that if they stayed together on the crystal floor, everything would turn out to be fine."
    new "他们之前对话的那个 Atsuki 说过，只要大家一同待在水晶层上，一切就不会有事。"

    # game/script.rpy:41940
    old "However, did that imply that if they were to scatter through the building, that guarantee would be voided?"
    new "可是，这是否意味着，一旦众人分散到楼里各处，那份保证便不再作数？"

    # game/script.rpy:41941
    old "Who had taken the last elevator trip? How did that Atsuki plan to accomplish what he'd said? ...Would anyone be found if they were to inspect every floor?"
    new "最后坐电梯的是谁？那个 Atsuki 打算怎么兑现他说过的话？……如果把每一层都查一遍，能找到人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:41948
    old "\"Can't you see already that we weren't lying?\" Miiya spoke."
    new "「我们没撒谎，你到现在还看不出来吗？」Miiya 开口道。"

    # game/script.rpy:41949
    old "Someone must definitely be here; that's not a question. If you think we want to leave this room empty as we search, someone can just stay here."
    new "这里肯定有人，这根本不用问。要是担心我们出去找人时这间屋子空着，留个人守着就行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:41954
    old "Atsuki threw her a frown. They had managed to keep everyone together, so what was with that sudden input?"
    new "Atsuki 皱起眉看了她一眼。好不容易才把大家聚在一起，她这时插这句话是什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:41959
    old "You didn't listen to me, did you? Neither of you will leave this room until the shutter opens. I'm sure there's a reason why you want us to look for whoever's here, and given what you just said, it might not be related to this room."
    new "你们根本没听我的话吧？卷帘门打开之前，你们两个谁都别想离开这间屋子。你们想让我们去找这里的某个人，肯定有你们的理由；而照你刚才那番话，那理由恐怕和这间屋子无关。"

    # game/script.rpy:41964
    old "What would that be? There's no harm in searching as long as someone stays behind. It can be you, if you want."
    new "什么理由？只要留人守着，去找一圈也没什么损失。你想的话，你留下也行。"

    # game/script.rpy:41965
    old "Atsuki joined in, baiting the same reaction as before."
    new "Atsuki 也插了进来，想再激出和刚才一样的反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:41970
    old "Stop it. We're not leaving. It's very late already, so there's no reason to at all."
    new "别闹了。我们哪儿也不去。都这么晚了，根本没有出去的理由。"

    # game/script.rpy:41973
    old "Then I'm going alone."
    new "那我就一个人去。"

    # game/script.rpy:41978
    old "What? No, you—"
    new "什么？不行，你——"

    # game/script.rpy:41984
    old "Miiya didn't give anyone a chance to object. She sprinted toward the hallway A door, and before Akaro had time to react, she ran to the stairs."
    new "Miiya 没给任何人反对的机会。她朝 A走廊的门冲去，Akaro 还没来得及反应，她已经跑到了楼梯口。"

    # game/script.rpy:41991
    old "What the fuck!? Stop! What the fuck are you doing!?"
    new "搞什么！？站住！你他妈到底想干什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:41997
    old "Sai's voice didn't reach Miiya, who had disappeared to the second floor. Everyone ran behind her, hesitant to go up, as her goal could've been to lure them away.{w} Meanwhile, Atsuki was lost and began to feel a despicable anxiety building up. Why was Miiya objecting to the only thing they had to do?"
    new "Miiya 已经跑上二楼不见踪影，Sai 的喊声没能传到她耳中。众人跟着追了过去，却迟迟不敢上楼——她说不定就是想把他们引开。{w} 另一边，Atsuki 茫然无措，心底渐渐涌起一股令自己都感到卑劣的焦躁。那明明是唯一该做的事，Miiya 为什么要反对？"

    # game/script.rpy:42003
    old "\"What's happening...?\" Erina peeked out of the crystal room after Sai had called the elevator."
    new "Sai 叫来电梯后，Erina 从水晶展室里探出头来。「出什么事了……？」"

    # game/script.rpy:42008
    old "Erina! Please, you and Isla stay in the event room! It's very important!"
    new "Erina！拜托，你和 Isla 待在活动室里！这很重要！"

    # game/script.rpy:42018
    old "Atsuki, you stop right here. I have no fucking idea what you're doing, but don't follow her!"
    new "Atsuki，你给我站住。我他妈根本搞不懂你在干什么，但不许跟她走！"

    # game/script.rpy:42021
    old "Knowing he was going to be physically stopped, Atsuki ignored Sai and dashed up the stairs. In his mind, he only wanted to stop Miiya and ensure that whatever she was doing didn't prove fatal."
    new "Atsuki 知道自己会被人拦下，索性不理 Sai，冲上了楼梯。他心里只有一个念头：拦住 Miiya，别让她正在做的事闹出人命。"

    # game/script.rpy:42027
    old "What the fuck...!? You two, follow him! Someone has to take the elevator. I'm doing it since I have the key to the attic."
    new "搞什么……！？你们两个，跟上他！电梯总得有人坐。阁楼的钥匙在我手上，我来坐。"

    # game/script.rpy:42036
    old "On the second floor, Akaro and Katei found Atsuki inside the partitions. Miiya had made it sound as if she'd wanted to search the whole building, so she could've been anywhere."
    new "在二楼，Akaro 和 Katei 在隔间里找到了 Atsuki。Miiya 说得像是要把整栋楼都搜一遍，那她此刻可能在任何地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:42042
    old "Atsuki, wait!"
    new "Atsuki，等等！"

    # game/script.rpy:42047
    old "I won't wait...! We have to find her; it's dangerous to be alone. Sai passed us by, so this is going to go quickly."
    new "不能等……！得找到她，一个人待着太危险了。Sai 已经超过我们了，找起来会很快。"

    # game/script.rpy:42048
    old "It didn't seem like Atsuki was lying. Both Akaro and Katei thought that he genuinely wanted to find Miiya as soon as possible."
    new "Atsuki 不像在撒谎。Akaro 和 Katei 都觉得，他是真心想尽快找到 Miiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:42049
    old "If they were to fight over it, and Miiya and Atsuki had something planned, it was possible that fighting itself was what would allow it to succeed."
    new "要是他们为此与他争执起来，而 Miiya 和 Atsuki 又早有安排，那这场争执本身说不定正是让计划得逞的关键。"

    # game/script.rpy:42055
    old "The three of them moved one floor higher with the condition that Atsuki wouldn't be left alone."
    new "三人又往上走了一层，前提是不让 Atsuki 单独行动。"

    # game/script.rpy:42062
    old "As long as the elevator wasn't used again, they were fairly certain that Miiya wouldn't be the only person found. They knew that it was very likely someone else was present on one of the floors."
    new "只要电梯不再被人使用，他们几乎可以肯定，被找到的人不会只有 Miiya。他们清楚，别的楼层里很可能还有人在。"

    # game/script.rpy:42063
    old "Atsuki and Akaro entered the three partitions of the third floor, but they were empty."
    new "Atsuki 和 Akaro 查了三楼的三个隔间，里面空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:42066
    old "The same occurred one floor above."
    new "再往上一层，结果也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:42069
    old "The fifth and the sixth were desolate as well. It should've been settled, then: there were at least five people in the attic."
    new "五楼和六楼同样空荡荡。到这一步，答案就该定下了：阁楼里至少有五个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:42070
    old "Miiya, Sai, Shiroya, another Atsuki, and a mysterious fifth person."
    new "Miiya、Sai、Shiroya、另一个 Atsuki，以及神秘的第五人。"

    # game/script.rpy:42075
    old "They approached the door to the attic, but someone came out of it first."
    new "他们走近通往阁楼的门，却有人先从里面走了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:42076
    old "It was Miiya."
    new "是 Miiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:42077
    old "When she saw the group, she stopped moving. As the three got closer, they saw there was blood on her forehead."
    new "她看见众人，脚步便停住了。三人走近后，才发现她额头上沾着血。"

    # game/script.rpy:42087
    old "Wh-What happened...!? Are you okay?"
    new "怎、怎么回事……！？你没事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:42093
    old "Uh, I don't know."
    new "呃……我不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:42098
    old "You don't know?"
    new "你不知道？"

    # game/script.rpy:42099
    old "Yes. ...I think I might've lost my memory."
    new "嗯。……我好像失忆了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42109
    old "Nobody responded. Instead, they waited, wanting to hear that it had been a joke."
    new "没有人接话。他们只是等着，盼着她接下来说这只是个玩笑。"

    # game/script.rpy:42110
    old "But that didn't happen. After a few silent seconds, Miiya lowered her eyebrows."
    new "可她没有。沉默了几秒，Miiya 蹙起了眉。"

    # game/script.rpy:42115
    old "I'm serious. I must've hit my head on these stairs."
    new "我是认真的。我大概是头撞在这楼梯上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42122
    old "She showed them what she was talking about. Just like they'd seen hours earlier on the crystal floor, the edge of one of the steps was covered in blood."
    new "她指给他们看自己说的地方。就像几小时前在水晶层看到的那样，其中一级台阶的边缘沾满了血。"

    # game/script.rpy:42123
    old "...Did you trip while running up, then?"
    new "……那你是在往上跑的时候绊倒了？"

    # game/script.rpy:42124
    old "I said that I don't know. It must be my blood, because it's fresh and I'm bleeding."
    new "我说了，我不知道。那应该是我的血，因为血还是新鲜的，我也确实在流血。"

    # game/script.rpy:42133
    old "W-Wait. Are you really saying that you lost your memory?"
    new "等、等等。你是说真的失忆了？"

    # game/script.rpy:42134
    old "Yes. Do you think I'm joking?"
    new "是。你觉得我在开玩笑？"

    # game/script.rpy:42135
    old "Atsuki, what the hell is this?"
    new "Atsuki，这到底是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:42140
    old "What? I have no idea. ...What exactly do you not remember?"
    new "什么？我怎么会知道。……你究竟是哪部分不记得了？"

    # game/script.rpy:42141
    old "I said that I don't remember anything."
    new "我说了，我什么都不记得。"

    # game/script.rpy:42144
    old "Nothing at all?"
    new "一点都不记得？"

    # game/script.rpy:42150
    old "You're joking. You hit your head and lost your memories, like in a damn movie?"
    new "你开玩笑吧。撞了下头就失忆，跟那种烂电影一样？"

    # game/script.rpy:42151
    old "Yeah. Memory loss is a real thing, and why are you all so defensive? Shouldn't you be worried?"
    new "是啊。失忆这种事真的存在。你们干嘛一个个都这么戒备？这种时候不是该担心我吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:42153
    old "Everyone was very hesitant. Could she really have been telling the truth? The fresh blood on the stairs was unquestionable."
    new "所有人都迟疑了。她说的会是真的吗？可楼梯上那道新鲜的血迹，不容置疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:42158
    old "So you don't remember anything in general? What about the date or who we are?"
    new "那你基本上什么都不记得了？今天是几号、我们是谁，也不知道？"

    # game/script.rpy:42163
    old "Again, no. Where are we?"
    new "还是不知道。这里是哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:42165
    old "Answering that was too ridiculous. However, if she was lying, what was the purpose?"
    new "要回答这个问题实在荒唐。可如果她在说谎，那又是为了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:42166
    old "They felt conflicted, but they had already noticed that Miiya seemed different. She had never looked at them like that, and her words felt colder than before."
    new "他们心里很矛盾，却早已察觉到 Miiya 有些不对劲。她从没用那样的眼神看过他们，说起话来也比从前冷淡。"

    # game/script.rpy:42169
    old "\"You're Miiya. Do you not know that either?\" Atsuki spoke."
    new "「你是 Miiya。连这个也不知道？」Atsuki 开口道。"

    # game/script.rpy:42174
    old "No. It's pretty strange. I don't know anything about myself, but I know how to speak. I suppose this is how this kind of memory loss works."
    new "不知道。说来也怪，我对自己一无所知，却还会说话。大概这种失忆就是这样吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:42179
    old "You really can't be telling the truth."
    new "你说的绝不可能是真话。"

    # game/script.rpy:42180
    old "Why not? Would I lie about this? My head does hurt a lot."
    new "为什么不可能？这种事有什么好骗人的？我的头确实很疼。"

    # game/script.rpy:42186
    old "If you hit your head and you're not lying, it should be short-term memory loss, right? Everything should slowly come back to you soon."
    new "如果你真是撞到了头，又没有撒谎，那应该是短期失忆吧？过一阵子，记忆应该会慢慢回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:42192
    old "Where are we, though? Why is there a camera there?"
    new "不过，这里到底是什么地方？那边为什么会有摄像头？"

    # game/script.rpy:42193
    old "...I doubt that's recording. Do you know what Ashiya Tower is? That's where we are."
    new "……那东西大概没在录。你知道芦屋塔吗？我们现在就在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:42194
    old "Hm... Not really, no."
    new "嗯……没听说过。"

    # game/script.rpy:42196
    old "It's a big building where we got trapped this morning. Do you not know any of that? There was an attack, and the exit closed."
    new "那是一栋大楼，今天早上我们就被困在了里面。这些你都不知道？当时有人袭击，出口被封了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42201
    old "Oh, really? So we can't leave?"
    new "哦，是吗？那我们出不去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:42202
    old "Atsuki, do you actually believe she's telling the truth?"
    new "Atsuki，你真觉得她说的是实话？"

    # game/script.rpy:42208
    old "I am telling the truth. Is memory loss that rare? I don't think so, right?"
    new "我说的是实话。失忆哪有那么少见？不至于吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:42213
    old "I wonder what Sai will have to say about this. He should be in the attic."
    new "不知道 Sai 会怎么说。他应该还在阁楼吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:42215
    old "...Someone else we got trapped with. Erina and Isla too, who are on the lowest floor. It's almost time for the exit to open, so you'll have to go straight to the hospital."
    new "……也是跟我们一起被困的人。还有 Erina 和 Isla，她们在最底层。出口快开了，你得直接去医院。"

    # game/script.rpy:42216
    old "Nobody could believe that what they were hearing was real. The timing felt too coincidental, and they knew that Miiya had run to the attic for a reason, intentionally going against what everyone else wanted."
    new "没有人敢相信，自己听到的这一切是真的。这个时机未免太巧，况且他们都知道，Miiya 跑去阁楼是有原因的——她是在刻意违逆所有人的意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:42217
    old "Do you think this might have anything to do with the Sekimeiya? A side effect, or something?"
    new "你觉得这会不会和 Sekimeiya 有关？副作用之类的？"

    # game/script.rpy:42222
    old "The what?"
    new "和什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:42227
    old "You really don't remember that either. What about the murders? You shouldn't be alone. Do you not remember Shiroya either?"
    new "你连那个也不记得了。那杀人案呢？你不能一个人待着。你也不记得 Shiroya 了？"

    # game/script.rpy:42232
    old "...Murders? Did someone die?"
    new "……杀人案？有人死了？"

    # game/script.rpy:42233
    old "Yes. A killer is with us."
    new "对。凶手就在我们当中。"

    # game/script.rpy:42234
    old "Really? And it could be anyone?"
    new "真的？而且谁都有可能是凶手？"

    # game/script.rpy:42239
    old "It's not so simple, but yes."
    new "没这么简单，不过……也可以这么说。"

    # game/script.rpy:42246
    old "Sai didn't take the elevator again, so he should still be in the attic. Maybe he found someone."
    new "Sai 又没坐电梯，应该还在阁楼。说不定他找到了什么人。"

    # game/script.rpy:42253
    old "It's very possible."
    new "很有可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:42254
    old "Someone? Do you mean the killer?"
    new "找到了人？你是说凶手？"

    # game/script.rpy:42259
    old "They stepped into the living room, but nothing could be heard."
    new "他们走进客厅，却什么声音也没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:42260
    old "Since the elevator was there, they didn't want to make noise."
    new "电梯就停在那里，他们不敢弄出声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:42261
    old "The door to the hallway was open, so they peeked through it. Immediately, they saw something."
    new "通往走廊的门开着，他们探头望去，立刻看见了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:42264
    old "One of the bedrooms was conspicuously open."
    new "其中一间卧室的门敞着，格外显眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:42265
    old "As soon as they looked inside, there were gasps."
    new "朝里一看，倒抽冷气的声音顿时响起。"

    # game/script.rpy:42271
    old "Sai's body lay facing down on the floor. His back had been pierced, apparent by the narrow hole in his shirt, which was soaked in blood."
    new "Sai 面朝下趴在地上，背上被刺穿了——衬衫上那个细小的破洞浸透了血，一看便知。"

    # game/script.rpy:42279
    old "Oh my God, no..."
    new "天哪，不会吧……"

    # game/script.rpy:42280
    old "The four people stared at the scene with wide eyes. ...Sai had been killed."
    new "四人瞪大了眼睛，怔怔望着眼前的景象。……Sai 死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42283
    old "Katei slowly crouched to grab the keyring, which had fallen from Sai's pocket. Having it on his person was what had allowed his death."
    new "Katei 缓缓蹲下身，拾起从 Sai 口袋里掉出的钥匙串。正是随身带着这串钥匙，才招来了他的杀身之祸。"

    # game/script.rpy:42290
    old "Then, they ran to the living room. His killer must've been there, hidden in one of the rooms. ...They couldn't let them escape."
    new "随后，他们奔向客厅。凶手一定就在那里，藏在某个房间里。……绝不能让他逃脱。"

    # game/script.rpy:42299
    old "You two wait here."
    new "你们两个留在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:42303
    old "The young pair was left behind in the living room while Akaro and Katei looked through the rooms, their heartbeats hammering in their chests."
    new "两个年轻人被留在客厅，Akaro 和 Katei 挨个房间查看，心怦怦狂跳。"

    # game/script.rpy:42306
    old "Atsuki's heart did the same as he slowly opened his mouth."
    new "我的心也跳得同样厉害，我缓缓开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:42311
    old "Are you telling the truth? Why did you want to go to the attic?"
    new "你说的是真的吗？为什么要去阁楼？"

    # game/script.rpy:42313
    old "He had noticed something."
    new "他察觉到了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:42314
    old "When they'd all stepped into the living room, he had looked at the floor. There, he'd seen recent footprints going from the stairs to the hallway... and then back."
    new "众人走进客厅时，他留意过地板。那里有新鲜的脚印，从楼梯通向走廊……然后又折返回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:42315
    old "He only wanted an explanation he could accept, but his question hardly garnered a reaction."
    new "他只想听到一个自己能接受的解释，可这一问几乎没有换来任何反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:42324
    old "Akaro and Katei confirmed that the elevator was present—and empty. Very carefully, they looked at the storeroom and then walked to the kitchen."
    new "Akaro和Katei确认电梯还在——里面空无一人。他们小心翼翼地查看过储藏室，又走向厨房。"

    # game/script.rpy:42329
    old "Lastly, only the two bedrooms remained. In the right one was Sai's lifeless body, but they couldn't find anyone else."
    new "最后只剩下两间卧室。右边那间躺着Sai的尸体，除此之外再找不到别人。"

    # game/script.rpy:42333
    old "The last place was the mirrored, opposite bedroom. Aside from its lack of a corpse, it was identical."
    new "最后一处是与之相对、格局如镜像的卧室。除了没有尸体，那里和先前那间一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:42339
    old "Baffled, they walked back to the living room. There, they saw Atsuki's dead body."
    new "他们满腹疑惑地回到客厅，看见了Atsuki的尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:42346
    old "Unlike Sai's, his body was facing the ceiling, but the same type of wound was present in his chest, blood rapidly flowing out of it. Neither of the men could believe what they were seeing."
    new "与Sai的尸体不同，他面朝天花板，胸口却是同样的伤口，鲜血正急速涌出。两个男人都不敢相信眼前所见。"

    # game/script.rpy:42347
    old "W-Was it her?"
    new "是、是她干的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:42348
    old "Miiya was nowhere to be found. Only after he had died did Atsuki's words begin to carry weight. In the end, they thought, he really hadn't been working with her."
    new "Miiya不见踪影。直到Atsuki死去，他的话才开始有了分量。他们想，他果然没有和她串通。"

    # game/script.rpy:42349
    old "Akaro and Katei couldn't move. A killer was near them, but where? Could it be that one of them had done it while they'd each looked at a different bedroom?"
    new "Akaro和Katei僵在原地。凶手就在身边，可究竟在哪里？难道是他们两人分头查看卧室时，其中一个动的手？"

    # game/script.rpy:42350
    old "...No. Miiya was the killer; they couldn't think anything else. If another person had done it, she would've yelled. If she had run away, she probably would've been heard. Therefore, the only possible conclusion was that she had killed Atsuki and walked away."
    new "……不。凶手只能是Miiya，他们想不出别的可能。若是别人下的手，她一定会叫喊；若是她逃走，他们多半会听见动静。所以，唯一的结论就是她杀了Atsuki，然后离开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42351
    old "Why? Such a question was irrelevant. If she had shown her true colors openly, everyone was in immense danger."
    new "为什么？这个问题已经无关紧要。她若公然露出真面目，所有人都将命悬一线。"

    # game/script.rpy:42358
    old "Akaro approached the elevator, but he couldn't open its door."
    new "Akaro走到电梯前，却打不开电梯门。"

    # game/script.rpy:42363
    old "It was brought down."
    new "有人把电梯降下去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42369
    old "They knew they had to hurry, but it wasn't so simple. As they ran down the stairs, the fear continually caused them to stagger."
    new "他们知道自己必须赶快，可事情没那么简单。跑下楼梯时，恐惧让他们不断踉跄。"

    # game/script.rpy:42372
    old "At any moment, their lives could be extinguished. They were trapped with a killer who had a weapon and had gone almost twelve hours without being caught. Would they be able to get through the last stretch?"
    new "他们的性命随时可能被夺走。他们与一名手持凶器、近十二个小时都未被抓住的凶手困在一起。这最后一段路，他们能撑过去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:42375
    old "An attack could've been waiting around any corner, but the thought of Erina and Isla pushed them onward."
    new "每个转角后都可能藏着袭击，但一想到Erina和Isla，他们便继续向前。"

    # game/script.rpy:42378
    old "However, as they sped down the stairs, they were oblivious to the nightmarish yells that resounded at the bottom of the tower."
    new "然而，他们疾奔下楼的途中，并未听见塔底回荡的那阵阵噩梦般的惨叫。"

    # game/script.rpy:42388
    old "Erina! Isla! Are you there!?"
    new "Erina！Isla！你们在吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:42393
    old "They ran to the open door. Through it, they saw exactly the image they had tried to forbid from entering their minds."
    new "他们冲向那扇敞开的门。透过门，他们看见的正是那幅一直不敢去想的景象。"

    # game/script.rpy:42398
    old "A mother and her daughter lay on the floor, their bodies no different from the two in the attic. Their torsos had been pierced, and blood was slowly spreading across the floor."
    new "一对母女倒在地上，与阁楼里的两人如出一辙。她们的躯干被刺穿，鲜血缓缓在地板上漫开。"

    # game/script.rpy:42399
    old "There's no way..."
    new "怎么可能……"

    # game/script.rpy:42400
    old "...Katei, you have the keys, right?"
    new "……Katei，钥匙在你身上吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:42402
    old "She must want everyone dead. We need to lock ourselves up somewhere, but get the Sekimeiya out! If we're attacked, we'll be able to escape by touching it."
    new "她一定是想把所有人都杀掉。我们得找地方把自己锁起来，但要先把Sekimeiya取出来！万一遭到袭击，只要碰到它就能逃掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:42403
    old "Agreeing that it was the best course of action, Katei ran to the cabinet and unlocked it."
    new "Katei也认为这是唯一的办法，便跑向展示柜，打开了锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:42405
    old "Moments later, the hallway B door opened."
    new "片刻之后，B走廊的门开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42416
    old "After a minute had gone by, a third body lay between Erina and Isla."
    new "一分钟过去，Erina和Isla之间多出了第三具尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:42417
    old "It was Akaro's. It had been pierced multiple times in the stomach, and no trace of life dwelled in it."
    new "那是Akaro。他的腹部被刺了数下，已经毫无生气。"

    # game/script.rpy:42418
    old "Next to the cabinet was the gray Sekimeiya."
    new "展示柜旁，是一个灰色 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:42429
    old "When the time came, the shutter opened and the police rushed into Ashiya Tower."
    new "时间一到，卷帘门开启，警察冲进了芦屋塔。"

    # game/script.rpy:42433
    old "In the lobby was the first indication of the bloodbath that had transpired. Dead eyes watched the officers from the floor, inviting them to a hell of corridors and blood."
    new "那场血洗的痕迹最先出现在大厅。死者空洞的眼睛从地板上望着警员，将他们引向一个满是走廊和鲜血的地狱。"

    # game/script.rpy:42440
    old "Afterward, many more bodies were found."
    new "此后，更多的尸体被找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:42441
    old "In the event room, Erina's, Isla's, and Akaro's."
    new "活动室里，是Erina、Isla和Akaro的。"

    # game/script.rpy:42442
    old "In hallway C, Miiya's.{w} On the first staircase, Katei's.{w} Close to them, thrown on the floor, was a screwdriver covered in more than one person's blood."
    new "C走廊里，是Miiya的。{w}第一段楼梯上，是Katei的。{w}在他们附近，地板上扔着一把螺丝刀，沾着不止一个人的血。"

    # game/script.rpy:42444
    old "In the attic, Atsuki and Sai rested."
    new "阁楼里，躺着Atsuki和Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:42445
    old "All of them were dead. In addition, it was confirmed that all of them had died instantly. That meant that they couldn't have killed each other.{w} However, the police raided the whole building and didn't find anyone else."
    new "所有人都死了。而且，经确认所有人都是当场死亡。这意味着他们不可能互相残杀。{w}然而，警方搜遍了整栋楼，没有发现其他人。"

    # game/script.rpy:42446
    old "Because before they had stepped into Ashiya Tower, not a speck of life had existed within it."
    new "因为在他们踏入芦屋塔之前，塔内已无一丝生命气息。"

    # game/script.rpy:42450
    old "The gray Sekimeiya was found next to the cabinet and placed inside it."
    new "灰色 Sekimeiya 在展示柜旁被发现，随后被放进了展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:42454
    old "In the attic, hidden in a drawer in the kitchen, a playback device was found. Curiously, one of the officers pressed the play button, but nothing seemed to happen. After fiddling with it, he determined that it was broken."
    new "阁楼里，厨房的抽屉中藏着一台播放设备。有名警员出于好奇按下播放键，却毫无反应。他摆弄了一阵，断定设备已经损坏。"

    # game/script.rpy:42459
    old "In the storeroom, the movable wall was discovered. When the police managed to open the door behind it, Sai's mark was removed."
    new "储藏室里，那面可以移动的墙被人发现。警方设法打开了墙后的门，Sai 留下的标记也随之被抹去。"

    # game/script.rpy:42461
    old "So, then, what had happened? Who had killed everyone? Every single person who had gotten trapped in the tower had been attacked by someone else."
    new "那么，究竟发生了什么？是谁杀死了所有人？被困在塔中的每一个人，都遭到了他人的袭击。"

    # game/script.rpy:42469
    old "An investigation went on for a very long time, but nobody had access to the swathes of information that they were missing."
    new "调查持续了许久，可大量缺失的信息，他们谁也无从获取。"

    # game/script.rpy:42470
    old "So when a conclusion was reached, it was impossible to feel that the truth had really been found."
    new "因此，即便最终得出了结论，也没人觉得真的找到了真相。"

    # game/script.rpy:42471
    old "The sudden, bloody spree was the final mystery of December 15th, 2011, which eluded the grasp of everyone who tried to solve it."
    new "那场突如其来的血腥杀戮，成了 2011 年 12 月 15 日最后的谜团，所有试图解开它的人都无从触及。"

    # game/script.rpy:42473
    old "Ending: Reward"
    new "结局：报偿"

    # game/script.rpy:42503
    old "Permafrost"
    new "永久冻土"

    # game/script.rpy:42516
    old "I didn't move from where I was. I only wanted to finally get out."
    new "我没有挪动半步，唯一的念头就是快点离开这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:42517
    old "However, when Sai had revealed the time, uncertainty had begun to creep in."
    new "然而，Sai 报出时间之后，我心里却渐渐生出了不安。"

    # game/script.rpy:42518
    old "It was {time=20.} The unbelievable day was coming to an end, but there was still something we were missing."
    new "已经是 {time=20.}。这难以置信的一天即将结束，可我们仍遗漏了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:42519
    old "The truth. We knew nothing about what had happened."
    new "真相。发生过什么，我们一无所知。"

    # game/script.rpy:42521
    old "Even though many of the strange things that had occurred felt at least theoretically possible to understand, when I tried to think about them, I couldn't."
    new "发生的许多怪事，至少理论上并非无从理解，可每当我想去深究，思绪便一片空白。"

    # game/script.rpy:42522
    old "Maybe the problem was that I couldn't be sure if I was right about anything, but technically, there was proof that untangling the day's events was possible."
    new "也许问题在于，我对任何判断都没有把握；可严格说来，已有证据表明，理清这一天的经过并非不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:42523
    old "The existence of the Atsuki we'd talked to was inexplicable, but the fact that he'd known what would happen and told us of a certain outcome proved that the truth was attainable."
    new "我们交谈过的那个 Atsuki，他的存在无法解释；但他知道将会发生什么，还说出了某种结局，这便证明真相是可以触及的。"

    # game/script.rpy:42524
    old "Despite that, as the seconds ticked along, the answers I tried to reach changed more and more."
    new "尽管如此，随着秒针一点点走动，我试图得出的答案也在不断变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:42527
    old "What would happen to me? ...I looked up to try to believe that nothing would, but I had no way to know."
    new "我会怎么样？……我抬起头，想让自己相信什么都不会发生，却无从知晓。"

    # game/script.rpy:42529
    old "At that moment, many people had to be on the other side of the shutter, and my parents were surely present among them. It was a given that we would be thoroughly questioned by the police and that an extensive investigation was to come."
    new "此刻，卷帘门外一定聚着许多人，我的父母想必也在其中。我们会被警方详细问话，随后还会有大规模的调查，这些都已是定局。"

    # game/script.rpy:42530
    old "And lastly, by an enigmatic version of Atsuki, we'd been assured that she would somehow come back."
    new "最后，那个谜一般的 Atsuki 还向我们保证过，她总会回来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:42533
    old "It didn't make any sense, but I had started to care less and less about that. She was alive, and it didn't seem like the fact that she had died twice mattered much. She would come back and maybe bring an explanation with her."
    new "这根本说不通，可我已经越来越不在意了。她还活着，而「她死过两次」这件事似乎也没什么大不了。她会回来，说不定还会带回一个解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:42534
    old "I'd never wished her any harm, but after her death, I'd realized that her absence was simply better. I didn't want her back."
    new "我从未想过要伤害她，可她死后我才发觉，她不在反而更好。我不希望她回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:42535
    old "Just as I'd been fond of Atsuki since years in the past, I'd never liked her constant presence. The me from two weeks earlier had shrugged off her disappearance, and the me stuck in the tower couldn't even care about her imminent return. It was all tiresome."
    new "我从多年前起就对 Atsuki 抱有好感，却也始终不喜欢她时刻陪在身旁。两周前的我对她的消失毫不在意，如今困在塔里的我，对她即将归来更是无动于衷。这一切都让人疲惫。"

    # game/script.rpy:42536
    old "Coming to the exhibit had ironically worked to bring her back, and it might've been for the better. Even though Atsuki had offered for me to stay with him temporarily, I'd never been sure he would have recovered without going to live with his parents."
    new "讽刺的是，来参观展览反倒促使她回来了，而这或许是件好事。Atsuki 虽然提出让我暂住在他那里，但我始终觉得，他若不是搬去和父母同住，未必能恢复过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:42537
    old "We had to accept we were leaving many questions behind, but there were plenty more in the outside world. Perhaps it wasn't a bad idea to consider finding a job somewhere else if I had the chance. I'd recently learned how much I despised acting differently than I felt, which was bound to persist if I didn't."
    new "我们不得不接受，还有许多疑问只能留在身后；可外面的世界里，疑问只会更多。若有机会，考虑去别处找份工作，或许也不是坏事。最近我才明白，自己有多讨厌表里不一；如果不走，这种日子肯定还会继续。"

    # game/script.rpy:42550
    old "...It's {time=20:33.}"
    new "……现在是 {time=20:33.}"

    # game/script.rpy:42562
    old "Atsuki, you wouldn't by chance have been telling the truth, would you?"
    new "Atsuki，你该不会……说的都是真的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:42567
    old "...I was."
    new "……是真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:42568
    old "...{w}Akaro, do you remember Erina? Do you think she had all her buttons?"
    new "……{w}Akaro，你还记得 Erina 吗？你觉得她当时脑子还正常吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:42573
    old "O-Oh... I didn't notice."
    new "啊……我、我没注意到。"

    # game/script.rpy:42574
    old "Me neither; I didn't consider it. I think she might've had all of them, though."
    new "我也没注意，压根没往这上面想。不过，我觉得她当时大概是正常的。"

    # game/script.rpy:42580
    old "...{w}I didn't lie about anything."
    new "……{w}我没有说过一句谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:42585
    old "If that's true, maybe we really should do what you proposed and go search again."
    new "如果真是这样，我们也许真该照你说的，再去搜一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:42590
    old "You think so?"
    new "你真……这么觉得？"

    # game/script.rpy:42596
    old "Isn't it too late for that? It's unlikely anything else will happen if we just stay here."
    new "现在是不是太晚了？就算我们留在这里，大概也不会再出什么事了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42601
    old "...{w}I suppose."
    new "……{w}说得也是。"

    # game/script.rpy:42602
    old "When I looked at the rest, I noticed that I wasn't the only person feeling nervous. All of them had their own worries and doubts about what was coming."
    new "我环顾其余几人，发现紧张的不止我一个。对即将发生的事，他们各有各的担忧与疑虑。"

    # game/script.rpy:42603
    old "Was it freedom that awaited? What would the world do when it found out about the Sekimeiya's powers? The answers were approaching."
    new "等待我们的是自由吗？一旦世人知道 Sekimeiya 的力量，世界会作何反应？答案正在逼近。"

    # game/script.rpy:42604
    old "Those last twenty minutes were holding the shutter in place. I was good at calming myself down, and that was all I could do."
    new "最后这二十分钟里，卷帘门依旧纹丝不动。我一向善于让自己镇定下来，而此刻能做的也唯有如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:42612
    old "The only movement in the room came from Atsuki bouncing his leg. I closed my eyes, wanting to leave the smoke-stained walls behind as soon as possible."
    new "屋里唯一的动静，是 Atsuki 在抖腿。我闭上眼睛，只想尽快离开这几面满是烟渍的墙。"

    # game/script.rpy:42620
    old "What was that?"
    new "刚才那是什么声音？"

    # game/script.rpy:42627
    old "It's coming from the lobby."
    new "声音是从大厅那边传来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:42634
    old "Five minutes later, we heard a rough sound. Upon stepping into hallway A, it became clear the lobby was the source."
    new "五分钟后，我们听到一阵刺耳的声响。走进 A走廊，立刻听出声音是从大厅传来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:42639
    old "Wait, isn't that...?"
    new "等等，那不是……？"

    # game/script.rpy:42642
    old "We walked to the door and opened it."
    new "我们走到门前，把门打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:42647
    old "What...!? It hasn't been twelve hours yet..."
    new "什么……！？还没到十二个小时啊……"

    # game/script.rpy:42650
    old "The shutter was withdrawing, the friction producing the sound we'd heard. Nothing mattered anymore: the faint light of the night had begun to cross the smooth glass of the exit door."
    new "卷帘门正缓缓收起，刚才那声响就是它摩擦发出的。别的一切都不再重要了——夜色的微光，已经越过出口门光滑的玻璃照了进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:42656
    old "Wh-Wha..."
    new "什、什么……"

    # game/script.rpy:42658
    old "N-Naomi...!"
    new "Na、Naomi……！"

    # game/script.rpy:42659
    old "What's ha...ppening?"
    new "到底……发生什么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:42668
    old "It's already time! Come on, Isla."
    new "时间到了！走吧，Isla。"

    # game/script.rpy:42683
    old "Perplexed, we stared at Naomi, who slowly raised herself off the floor. She seemed to be in pain, with a strong headache. As soon as she saw the blood below her, she understood it was hers and gasped."
    new "我们一时怔住，只是望着 Naomi。她慢慢地从地上撑起身子，似乎正忍着剧烈的头痛。可一看见身下的血迹，她便明白那是自己的血，倒抽了一口凉气。"

    # game/script.rpy:42688
    old "Oh...? Y-You're okay?"
    new "哦……？你、你没事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:42696
    old "The shutter retracted all the way. Behind the door, one of multiple dark silhouettes placed its hand on the handle."
    new "卷帘门完全收了起来。门后，几道黑影中的一人将手搭上了门把。"

    # game/script.rpy:42697
    old "But before it opened, Naomi looked at all of us, her eyes driving stakes into our bodies."
    new "可门还没打开，Naomi 便环视我们每一个人，目光像钉子般扎进我们身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:42698
    old "She opened her mouth, and her words were mixed with the sound of our freedom."
    new "她张开嘴，话音与我们重获自由的声响交织在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:42699
    old "Y-You...! You're a murderer!{w} And you! ...You're behind this attack!"
    new "你、你……！你是凶手！{w}还有你！……这场袭击是你策划的！"

    # game/script.rpy:42814
    old "Chapter 2 Credits"
    new "第二章 制作人员"

    # game/script.rpy:42815
    old "The moonlight glanced off the floor of the lobby."
    new "月光斜映在大厅的地面上。"

    # game/script.rpy:42816
    old "Eight pairs of eyes saw the outside world unveiled to them again as the door they'd entered through reopened."
    new "他们进来时走过的那扇门再次打开，八双眼睛重新看见外面的世界展现在眼前。"

    # game/script.rpy:42817
    old "At that instant, nothing else mattered."
    new "那一瞬间，别的都不重要了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42818
    old "The icy air they'd longed for was in reach. It was time for Ashiya Tower to be exposed."
    new "他们渴望的冰冷空气近在咫尺。该让芦屋塔的真相大白于天下了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42819
    old "After that long day, the final result—the world's truth—had been decided."
    new "漫长的一天过去，最终的结果——这个世界的真相——已经定下。"

    # game/script.rpy:42820
    old "Many policemen rushed inside the vast lobby."
    new "众多警察涌进宽敞的大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:42821
    old "They saw a group of people next to a door, but there was a more pressing matter."
    new "他们看见门边聚着一群人，但还有更要紧的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:42822
    old "Lying on the floor was a man wearing their own uniform."
    new "地上躺着一个身穿他们同款制服的男人。"

    # game/script.rpy:42823
    old "That juxtaposition of life and death signified the end of the Sekimeiya's play."
    new "生与死并置于此，意味着 Sekimeiya 的戏码就此落幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:42824
    old "For one side, it was time to gather questions. For the other, it was time to let them go."
    new "一方从此开始收集疑问，另一方则选择将它们放下。"

    # game/script.rpy:42825
    old "Everyone was taken outside, where they saw the stars had always been above them."
    new "所有人被带到外面，这才看见星空原来一直在他们头顶。"

    # game/script.rpy:42826
    old "But it was soon understood that the events of that day held uncountable mysteries."
    new "但人们很快明白，那一天发生的事藏着数不清的谜团。"

    # game/script.rpy:42827
    old "The entire building was raided, and nobody else was found."
    new "整栋建筑被彻底搜查，却再没找到任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:42828
    old "The Sekimeiya, believed to be the target of the attack, hadn't been taken."
    new "据信是袭击目标的 Sekimeiya，并未被人取走。"

    # game/script.rpy:42829
    old "A secret door existed in the storeroom, which they were sure the deceased policeman had gone through."
    new "储藏室里有一道暗门，他们确信那名死去的警察曾穿过它。"

    # game/script.rpy:42830
    old "However, it was locked."
    new "然而，暗门锁着。"

    # game/script.rpy:42831
    old "To most of the eight witnesses, that was of no consequence."
    new "对八名目击者中的大多数人而言，这都无关紧要。"

    # game/script.rpy:42832
    old "They had no choice but to value their freedom, and they didn't hold the keys to enough questions."
    new "他们别无选择，只能珍惜自己的自由；而足够多问题的答案，他们手里并没有钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:42833
    old "Safely escaping a killer's reach had to be enough for them."
    new "能从杀手手中平安脱身，对他们来说已经足够。"

    # game/script.rpy:42834
    old "Monetary compensation was given to some due to Ashiya's reckless security measures."
    new "由于芦屋方面安保措施草率，部分人获得了金钱赔偿。"

    # game/script.rpy:42835
    old "Others were held accountable for potential crimes such as murder and theft."
    new "另一些人则因涉嫌杀人、盗窃等罪名被追究责任。"

    # game/script.rpy:42836
    old "None of those eight would ever have the chance to fully learn what had happened that day in the tower."
    new "这八人再没有机会彻底弄清，那天塔中究竟发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:42837
    old "But they were aware of the Sekimeiya's powers."
    new "但他们知道 Sekimeiya 拥有怎样的力量。"

    # game/script.rpy:42838
    old "However, only two people spoke of them."
    new "然而，只有两个人谈起了这些力量。"

    # game/script.rpy:42839
    old "Naturally, their statements were ridiculed and interpreted as a laughable, coordinated attempt at cover."
    new "自然，他们的说法沦为笑柄，被当成一场可笑的、串通好的掩饰。"

    # game/script.rpy:42840
    old "In the distant future, the Sekimeiya would return to the tower."
    new "而在遥远的将来，Sekimeiya 还会回到这座塔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:42841
    old "Against the unbelievable claims of the guilty parties, no visitor's touch would allow a travel through time."
    new "与那些有罪之人令人难以置信的说法相反，任何访客的触碰都无法让人穿越时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:42842
    old "From then onward, the Sekimeiya would stay in the special cabinet, symbolizing Xyn's failure."
    new "自那以后，Sekimeiya 一直留在特制的展示柜中，成为 Xyn 失败的象征。"

    # game/script.rpy:42843
    old "There was a lingering question within two of the survivors."
    new "幸存者中有两人，心中始终悬着一个疑问。"

    # game/script.rpy:42844
    old "One isolated from the simple curiosity of the outside world."
    new "这疑问与外界那些单纯的好奇无关。"

    # game/script.rpy:42845
    old "It entailed the veracity of some words they'd heard."
    new "它关乎他们听过的某几句话是否属实。"

    # game/script.rpy:42846
    old "\"Everything should turn out fine.\""
    new "「一切都会好起来的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:42847
    old "Almost four days had passed."
    new "将近四天过去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42848
    old "But it didn't feel that long. It felt, to them, as if that promise had been made mere hours ago."
    new "可感觉上并没有那么久。对他们来说，那句承诺仿佛是几个小时前才许下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:42849
    old "Had it already turned out to be false?"
    new "那句话，已经落空了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:42850
    old "It was impossible to know."
    new "无从知晓。"

    # game/script.rpy:42851
    old "Had those words truly been said?"
    new "那些话，真的有人说过吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:42852
    old "That, too, was impossible to know."
    new "这同样无从知晓。"

    # game/script.rpy:42853
    old "Then, they learned."
    new "随后，他们明白了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42854
    old "They understood that they had been aided."
    new "他们明白，有人帮了他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:42855
    old "Who had it been? A divine presence?"
    new "那会是谁？是神明吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:42856
    old "There was nobody to thank, so their gratefulness didn't reach anyone."
    new "无人可谢，他们的感激也无从传达。"

    # game/script.rpy:42857
    old "But they knew that entity existed and that it had made possible the bright future ahead."
    new "但他们知道，那个人确实存在，正是那个人让眼前的光明未来成为可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:42858
    old "Atsuki's phone rang."
    new "Atsuki 的手机响了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42859
    old "On the screen, he saw a name he thought he'd never read again."
    new "屏幕上，是一个他以为再也不会看到的名字。"

    # game/script.rpy:42860
    old "He picked up as quickly as possible, and he heard a voice he thought he'd never hear again."
    new "他以最快的速度接起，听见了一个他以为再也听不到的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:42861
    old "\"A-Atsuki...? What the hell... happened to me?\""
    new "「A-Atsuki……？我到底……怎么了？」"

    # game/script.rpy:42921
    old "Sunrise"
    new "日出"

    # game/script.rpy:42927
    old "A handful of police cars had gathered at the entrance of Ashiya Tower, ensuring complete isolation of the inside."
    new "几辆警车聚在芦屋塔入口前，将大楼内部与外界彻底隔绝。"

    # game/script.rpy:42928
    old "That had gone on for hours, and Yushibana's citizens had continually extended the crowd behind the authorities. Thirteen police officers stood in front of them like sentinels."
    new "就这样过了好几个小时，丰花的市民不断在警戒线后聚拢，人群越排越长。十三名警察如哨兵般立在他们面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:42929
    old "A thick layer of metal had been covering the door of the building all day, and it had been many hours since communication with the inside had suddenly cut off."
    new "大楼的门一整天都被厚厚的金属封着，而与内部的联络突然中断，也已经过了好几个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:42930
    old "Next to the blocked entrance stood the people in charge of the operation. Suripo was told the time: in less than twenty minutes, the blockade would open. They had prepared for all possible outcomes."
    new "被封住的入口旁站着这次行动的负责人。有人向 Suripo 报了时间：不到二十分钟，封锁就会解除。他们已经为各种可能的结果做好了准备。"

    # game/script.rpy:42931
    old "Suripo had been there since the previous night, withstanding the constant noise of the curious and alarmed citizens and trying to converse with the stubborn Ashiya representative who had shown up in the morning. After breathing deeply, he approached one of the police cars."
    new "Suripo 从昨夜起就守在这里，一边忍受着好奇又惊慌的市民无休止的喧闹，一边设法与早晨赶来的那位固执的芦屋代表交涉。他深吸一口气，走向其中一辆警车。"

    # game/script.rpy:42934
    old "Kano, have you seen Vaisude recently?"
    new "Kano，你最近见过 Vaisude 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:42936
    old "The policeman under Suripo's orders frowned, realizing that he actually hadn't seen Vaisude in hours."
    new "受 Suripo 调遣的这名警察皱起眉头，这才意识到自己确实已经好几个小时没见过 Vaisude 了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42937
    old "I haven't. Did something happen to him?"
    new "没见过。他出什么事了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:42938
    old "He was in his car earlier, but I haven't managed to get in touch with him since. I saw he wasn't waiting in the car, and he didn't pick up when I tried to call him."
    new "他早些时候还在车里，可那之后我就一直联系不上他。我见他没在车里等，打电话也不接。"

    # game/script.rpy:42939
    old "Kano looked through his left window toward the car Vaisude had been in. It was next to the tower's entrance, and as he'd been told, nobody could be seen through its open windows."
    new "Kano 透过左侧车窗望向 Vaisude 待过的那辆车。车就停在塔的入口旁，正如事先被告知的那样，敞开的车窗里看不到任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:42940
    old "I apologize, but I don't know what he went to do. I haven't spoken to him all day."
    new "抱歉，我不知道他去做什么了。我一整天都没跟他说上话。"

    # game/script.rpy:42946
    old "Suripo walked away slowly, a little concerned. Days prior, Vaisude had been insistent in saying that an attack would occur on the morning of the 15th. However, he'd also kept saying that it was a hunch and that he didn't have proof of it."
    new "Suripo 缓缓走开，心里有些不安。几天前，Vaisude 一再坚称十五日早晨会发生袭击。但他也反复说那只是直觉，手上并没有证据。"

    # game/script.rpy:42947
    old "Furthermore, after their talk, Vaisude had told Suripo that he wouldn't come to work again. He wasn't directly under Suripo's command, but he knew Suripo had been in charge of Ashiya and Xyn's confrontation and that he knew about its details more than his actual boss."
    new "而且，那次谈话之后，Vaisude 还对 Suripo 说他不打算再来上班了。他并不直接归 Suripo 指挥，但他知道 Suripo 负责处理芦屋与 Xyn 的对峙，对其中细节的了解比自己的直属上司还多。"

    # game/script.rpy:42948
    old "On the morning of the 15th, two more police teams had been sent to Ashiya Tower to take control of the situation after the attack. At that time, Suripo had seen Vaisude in the team he'd always been part of."
    new "十五日早晨，又有两支警队被派往芦屋塔，在袭击后接管局面。那时，Suripo 在 Vaisude 一向所属的那支队伍里见过他。"

    # game/script.rpy:42950
    old "Suripo knew he might've had valuable information, having correctly foreseen the attack. However, in the past, he hadn't provided any, so Suripo hadn't prioritized going to question him. Later on, when he'd looked, he had been unable to find Vaisude."
    new "Suripo 知道他可能掌握着有价值的情报——毕竟他准确预见了那次袭击。然而过去他也从未提供过任何情报，所以 Suripo 没有优先去找他问话。后来再去寻他时，已经找不到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:42951
    old "After talking to his colleagues, they'd all claimed not to know his whereabouts either."
    new "问过他的同事，他们也都说不知道他的下落。"

    # game/script.rpy:42954
    old "Suripo was indecisive. If Vaisude had known about Xyn's attack, why had he only warned them that it would occur? He hadn't accomplished anything, as it had already been a well-known possibility.{w} And even if he'd been involved with Xyn in some way, the same question had to be asked."
    new "Suripo 犹豫不决。如果 Vaisude 早就知道 Xyn 会发动袭击，为什么他只是警告说袭击会发生？这毫无用处，因为那本来就是大家都知道可能发生的事。{w} 就算他与 Xyn 有什么牵连，同样的问题还是得问。"

    # game/script.rpy:42955
    old "His disappearance was suspicious. Had he gone off to act as a part of their plan, or had something happened to him? At no point had he told anyone about it, and nobody had seen him leaving."
    new "他的失踪很可疑。他是去参与他们的计划了，还是出了什么事？他自始至终没对任何人提起过，也没人看见他离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:42956
    old "Confident that those questions would be answered in the future, Suripo walked back to the shutter to continue waiting for {time=21:04}, when the entrance would open."
    new "Suripo 相信这些问题日后总有答案，便走回卷帘门前，继续等待 {time=21:04}，到那时入口就会开启。"

    # game/script.rpy:42962
    old "Near the back of the crowd, standing off by herself, was a lone blonde woman in a heavy coat. She repeatedly twisted a lock of her hair in one hand, murmuring quietly to herself as the people nearby continued their own louder musings."
    new "人群靠后的地方，独自站着一个穿厚外套的金发女人。她一只手反复捻着一缕头发，低声自语，而旁边的人们仍在高声议论。"

    # game/script.rpy:42963
    old "The smell around here... I wonder what's causing it. You can barely tell it's there, but it's persistent... Is it related?"
    new "这附近的气味……不知道是从哪来的。淡得几乎察觉不到，却一直散不掉……跟那件事有关吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:42964
    old "The conversation nearby turned to the topic of Xyn and their potential involvement. She went quiet, listening intently for any clues, but it was all information she'd heard within the past few minutes regurgitated once again. Her left foot tapped an unconscious rhythm on the ground."
    new "附近的谈话转到了 Xyn 以及他们是否可能参与其中的话题。她安静下来，仔细听着，想捕捉些线索，可那些内容她几分钟前才听过，如今又被翻来覆去地说了一遍。她的左脚不自觉地在地上打着拍子。"

    # game/script.rpy:42965
    old "She wasn't sure how she'd gotten involved in the events around the tower, but once she realized something unnatural was occurring, she couldn't ignore it. Curiosity drove her to appear outside, in spite of the persistent crowd of bored townspeople."
    new "她说不清自己是怎么卷进这座塔周边的事里的，但一旦察觉到有什么不合常理的事在发生，她就无法置之不理。好奇心驱使她来到这里，哪怕外面挤满了闲得发慌的镇民。"

    # game/script.rpy:42968
    old "Suripo turned back, surveying the crowd once more. In the darkness, her blonde hair and slight fidgeting stood out. His caution getting the better of him, he decided to approach, as she wasn't a resident of the town he'd ever seen before."
    new "Suripo 转过身，再次扫视人群。黑暗中，她的金发和细微的小动作格外显眼。谨慎占了上风，他决定过去搭话，因为他从没在镇上见过她。"

    # game/script.rpy:42969
    old "Excuse me. Would you be able to answer a couple of questions for me?"
    new "打扰一下。能回答我几个问题吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:42971
    old "Hello?"
    new "你好？"

    # game/script.rpy:42972
    old "H-Hmm? Do you... mean me, maybe...?"
    new "呃、嗯？你……是在问我吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:42973
    old "Yes. How long have you been here?"
    new "是的。你在这里待了多久了？"

    # game/script.rpy:42974
    old "Oh, ah... Only a little while, maybe an hour. I was... curious about the tower. What's happening inside. Like everyone else here is, of course."
    new "哦，啊……没多久，大概一个小时吧。我只是……对这座塔有些好奇，想知道里面到底发生了什么。当然，这里的其他人也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:42977
    old "A thin film of sweat formed on her forehead. It wasn't the first time she'd been questioned by a police officer, but being singled out still made her nervous. Within her coat, she rubbed her arms."
    new "她额上渗出一层薄汗。被警察问话已不是头一回，可这样被人单独拎出来，还是让她紧张。她在外套里搓了搓手臂。"

    # game/script.rpy:42980
    old "It's {tip=larles}Larles{/tip}. Just Larles is fine. I know it sounds odd, but it's normal where I'm from, I promise."
    new "我叫 {tip=larles}Larles{/tip}。叫我 Larles 就好。我知道听起来有点怪，但在我家乡这很正常，真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:42981
    old "Suripo couldn't place her accent. It had a particular sound to it that he'd never heard before, not even from any kind of shows or songs."
    new "Suripo 辨不出她的口音。那语调有种特别的味道，他从未听过，连电视节目或歌曲里也没有过。"

    # game/script.rpy:42982
    old "Would you happen to have any form of identification on you?"
    new "你身上带着什么身份证件吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:42983
    old "Trembling like a leaf in the chilly winter breeze, Larles withdrew an object from her interior coat pocket and tapped it a few times. She opened and presented it to Suripo, but her hand shook so thoroughly that he couldn't read it."
    new "Larles 在冬日寒风里抖得像片叶子，从外套内袋中取出一样东西，轻轻敲了几下。她翻开递给 Suripo，可手抖得太厉害，他根本看不清上面的字。"

    # game/script.rpy:42984
    old "Gently removing it from her grip, he took a closer look and flipped through it. A passport. Completely valid, as far as he could tell, with nothing remotely questionable about it. Her name matched what she claimed."
    new "他轻轻从她手中接过，凑近细看，又翻了几页。是一本护照。在他看来完全有效，没有半点可疑之处。上面的名字也与她所说的一致。"

    # game/script.rpy:42987
    old "Nodding slightly, Suripo handed it back to her. Instead of stowing it back in her pocket, Larles began to tap a consistent beat on it, trying to calm her nerves."
    new "Suripo 微微点头，把护照还给她。Larles 却没有收进口袋，而是开始有节奏地轻敲着它，想让自己镇定下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:42988
    old "Did you just move here?"
    new "你是刚搬来这里的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:42989
    old "I'm here on... business. Official business. I just, well, the tower was big news and it reminded me of one back where I'm from. That, and it seemed strange..."
    new "我是来……办事的。公事。只是，嗯，这座塔的事闹得很大，让我想起我家乡的一座塔。而且，这里似乎有些古怪……"

    # game/script.rpy:42990
    old "Strange how?"
    new "哪里奇怪？"

    # game/script.rpy:42991
    old "Well, um, everyone's talking about it, right? How strange it is for people to be trapped inside... I-I'm only in town for a little while. I can leave if you think I'm suspicious..."
    new "呃，那个……大家都在议论嘛。有人被困在里面，这事多蹊跷……我、我只是暂时来镇上办点事。要是你觉得我形迹可疑，我这就走……"

    # game/script.rpy:42992
    old "Suripo arched an eyebrow. She was certainly suspicious, but not in the way that a Xyn plant would be. She was too obvious, and clearly harmless in his eyes."
    new "Suripo 挑了挑眉。她确实可疑，但不像 Xyn 安插的内应。她太显眼了，在他眼里显然没有威胁。"

    # game/script.rpy:42995
    old "It's the most confusing thing I've ever seen... Why can't it be opened? I've been here a few times now, and nothing seemed out of place, but today there's a big event and no explaining it. Do the police know anything? Everyone around here is clueless like me..."
    new "我从没见过这么让人摸不着头脑的事……为什么打不开呢？这地方我来过好几次，一直没觉得哪里不对劲，偏偏今天出了这么大的事，谁也解释不了。警方查到什么了吗？附近这些人跟我一样，什么都不知道……"

    # game/script.rpy:42996
    old "I can't get into what we know and don't know in detail. I'm sure you understand."
    new "我们掌握了什么、还缺什么，恕我不能细说。这点你应该明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:42997
    old "Of course, yes. But don't you think there has to be some kind of supernatural component? Like maybe everyone inside time traveled and now they're in the past, at a time when nobody else is inside. Do we even know they're still in there? There's no way to see inside, right?"
    new "当然，我明白。可是你不觉得，这里面总得有点超自然的缘由吗？比方说，里面的人全都时间穿越了，如今待在过去的某个时刻，那时候楼里还没有别人。我们甚至能确定他们还在里面吗？从外面根本看不到里面的情况吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:42998
    old "Suripo blinked in disbelief. She claimed to be in Yushibana on some kind of business, but he didn't believe that. Her bringing up an outlandish topic like time travel most likely meant that she was with some kind of magazine or news company and trying to bait readers."
    new "Suripo 难以置信地眨了眨眼。她自称来丰花办事，他可不信。她扯出时间穿越这种荒诞的话题，多半是哪家杂志或报社的人，想套点东西回去博读者眼球。"

    # game/script.rpy:42999
    old "Where did you get this idea from?"
    new "你这想法是从哪儿听来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:43000
    old "Um, it was someone in the crowd who mentioned it, and I thought it made a lot of sense..."
    new "那个……是人群里有人这么说，我听着觉得挺有道理……"

    # game/script.rpy:43003
    old "Still wary, she gestured indiscriminately at the people around the building. They had formed small, isolated bubbles in places, continuing to increase in volume as the time approached."
    new "她仍心存戒备，随手朝楼周围的人群比了比。那些人三三两两凑成一个个孤立的小圈子，随着时间临近，说话声越来越大。"

    # game/script.rpy:43004
    old "I see. Have you noticed anyone around here doing anything questionable? Or what about them disappearing?"
    new "原来如此。你在这附近有没有看到什么人行为可疑？又或者，有没有人失踪？"

    # game/script.rpy:43005
    old "It was Suripo's subtle way of discerning if she'd seen Vaisude recently. He was still concerned about his location."
    new "这是 Suripo 不露声色的试探，想弄清她最近有没有见过 Vaisude。他对 Vaisude 的下落始终放心不下。"

    # game/script.rpy:43006
    old "No, sir, sorry to say. If I had seen anything out of place, I would have told all of you immediately. Promise! I don't want to get in your way at all, only find out the truth."
    new "没有，警官，很抱歉。要是我看见什么不对劲的，肯定马上告诉你们。我保证！我绝不想妨碍你们办事，只想知道真相。"

    # game/script.rpy:43007
    old "At that moment, Larles received a summons she could not ignore. She had known her time was short, but not that she wouldn't even be able to see the conclusion of the tower's mystery."
    new "就在这时，Larles 接到一道无法推辞的传唤。她早知道自己时间不多，却没想到连塔中谜团如何收场都看不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:43008
    old "Actually, I just got a call. I have to be going. Sorry, but would you mind if I took my leave?"
    new "其实，我刚接到一个电话，得走了。不好意思，我先告辞了，可以吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:43011
    old "Suripo sighed. She hadn't even pulled out a phone to check a call. He was no closer to an answer than he had been a few minutes ago, and he didn't expect such sudden excuses. Mentally, he made a note to check into her identity later, just in case his intuition was wrong, but she seemed unreliable at best."
    new "Suripo 叹了口气。她连手机都没掏出来看一眼。比起几分钟前，他的疑问依旧没有着落；对方这样突然推托，也出乎他的意料。他在心里记了一笔，回头要查查她的身份，以防自己的直觉出错——不过在他看来，她顶多算个靠不住的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:43012
    old "Well, thank you for your time. If you notice anything later on, please feel free to let us know."
    new "好吧，多谢你配合。之后要是发现什么，随时告诉我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:43013
    old "Suripo returned to his position. Larles fidgeted slightly, unsure that he had believed her. She didn't have any desire to confuse the locals and desperately wanted to see the shutter open. It was too unique for her to ignore."
    new "Suripo 回到了自己的岗位。Larles 有些坐立难安，拿不准他是否信了自己。她无意搅扰当地居民，只是一心盼着卷帘门打开。那景象太罕见了，她无法置之不理。"

    # game/script.rpy:43014
    old "But she was out of time. She couldn't afford to stay any longer. Sighing in resignation, she turned away from the building and began to walk. She had hoped that there was enough time to satisfy her curiosity, but it was inevitable."
    new "可她的时间已经用尽，再也耽搁不起。她无奈地叹了口气，转身离开那座大楼，迈步走开。她本指望还来得及满足好奇心，终究没能如愿，可这也是无可奈何的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:43015
    old "Larles made a promise to herself. Whenever she got the opportunity, she would return and determine the truth of that day with her own eyes. She couldn't get into the tower normally, but with enough preparation, it could be done."
    new "Larles 暗自立下誓愿：一旦有机会，她一定要回来，亲眼查明那一天的真相。寻常手段进不了那座塔，但只要准备充分，也并非做不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:43016
    old "Resolving herself, she vanished into the night."
    new "她下定决心，随即消失在夜色之中。"

    # game/script.rpy:43024
    old "Remember what I said. One of the people inside is a terrorist who will try something to steal the Sekimeiya. Any of the people here could be their comrade, and you must prioritize keeping their plan from succeeding."
    new "记住我说过的话。里面的人当中有一个恐怖分子，会设法偷走 Sekimeiya。这里在场的任何人都可能是他的同伙，你们首要的任务就是别让他们的计划得逞。"

    # game/script.rpy:43025
    old "You can stop saying that. I'm well aware of what could be going on."
    new "这话你不用再重复了。会出什么事，我心里有数。"

    # game/script.rpy:43026
    old "Lei wasn't a blood relative of Ashiya, but she'd been sent as their representative, speaking on their behalf, and had been giving the police any essential information.{w} From the get-go, she had stated that the process of stealing the Sekimeiya was underway despite Ashiya's public declarations, which were that Xyn's plan had immediately failed."
    new "Lei 并非芦屋家的血亲，却是作为他们的代表被派来的，替他们发言，并随时向警方提供必要的信息。{w} 她从一开始就声称，盗取 Sekimeiya 的计划正在推进——尽管芦屋对外宣称 Xyn 的计划已被当即挫败。"

    # game/script.rpy:43027
    old "It was almost {time=21}, and the winter sky had long ago darkened, bringing a sheer cold to everyone who'd kept waiting to witness the resolution of a long day."
    new "时间将近 {time=21}，冬日的天色早已黑透，彻骨的寒意笼罩着每一个仍在等着看这漫长一天如何收场的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:43032
    old "This smell again... What the hell is it?"
    new "又是这股味道……到底是什么鬼东西？"

    # game/script.rpy:43033
    old "Suripo wasn't sure either. Throughout the whole day, they'd sporadically noticed a strange smell next to the tower. However, they hadn't been able to identify its source, nor the smell itself."
    new "Suripo 也说不准。这一整天里，他们在塔附近不时闻到一股怪味，却既查不出源头，也辨不出那究竟是什么气味。"

    # game/script.rpy:43040
    old "{time=21} came. The crowd was kept back by the group of policemen in front of the tower, but even the officials were partially curious how the shutter would withdraw."
    new "{time=21} 到了。塔前的一队警察将人群拦在后面，可就连这些警员也多少有些好奇，那卷帘门究竟会如何收起。"

    # game/script.rpy:43041
    old "Speculation hadn't stopped. The widespread belief was that everything had been part of Xyn's plan and Ashiya had no way of stopping it. However, nobody could agree on how Xyn would actually do it."
    new "各种猜测始终没有停过。多数人相信，这一切都是 Xyn 计划的一环，芦屋根本无力阻止。可对于 Xyn 究竟会怎么做，谁也没有一致的看法。"

    # game/script.rpy:43042
    old "Multiple groups of those with similar views formed the crowd outside the tower. On one side was the simply curious portion. On the other, the older citizens were eagerly awaiting Ashiya's defeat, voicing their harsh thoughts on the family."
    new "塔外的人群按看法聚成了好几拨。一拨只是单纯来看热闹的；另一拨则是上了年纪的市民，他们迫不及待地想看芦屋家栽跟头，口中对这个家族的议论相当刻薄。"

    # game/script.rpy:43043
    old "It had become known that the exit was going to remain closed for twelve hours, and although the police had kept quiet, something had seemingly caused disorder among them less than an hour after the attack."
    new "外界已经得知，出口将持续封闭十二个小时。警方虽然守口如瓶，但袭击发生不到一小时，他们中间似乎就出了什么乱子。"

    # game/script.rpy:43044
    old "Additionally, the names of the trapped people had been released, but nobody had seen or heard of any of their relatives waiting outside for them."
    new "此外，被困者的姓名也已公布，但谁都没见着、也没听说有哪位亲属在外面等候。"

    # game/script.rpy:43045
    old "When the police stood up, everyone knew the time had come, and the flash of some cameras started to illuminate the dark exterior of the tower."
    new "警察站直身子，所有人都明白时候到了，几台相机的闪光开始照亮塔身昏暗的外壁。"

    # game/script.rpy:43049
    old "The last minutes were quiet. The police had been exchanging words, but they were too far from the crowd to be heard."
    new "最后几分钟一片安静。警察之间低声交谈着什么，但他们离人群太远，听不真切。"

    # game/script.rpy:43054
    old "Will this be enough people to apprehend everyone? We don't want something funny occurring."
    new "这么多人够不够把所有人一并拿下？可别出什么岔子。"

    # game/script.rpy:43055
    old "That's not a concern. Nobody will have a way to sneak anything out."
    new "不必担心。没人有办法把东西偷偷带出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:43056
    old "There were only a few seconds left. Nobody knew the exact time the shutter had closed, but they had determined it had been right about {time=9:04.}"
    new "只剩最后几秒。没人知道卷帘门关闭的确切时刻，但推算下来，大约就在 {time=9:04.}"

    # game/script.rpy:43060
    old "Finally, letting out a loud and hoarse noise, the heavy shutter began to rise until it fully disappeared from view. At the same time, some people in the crowd began to point up, where the same thing was happening to the covered windows."
    new "终于，沉重的卷帘门发出粗哑刺耳的声响，缓缓升起，直到完全消失在视野之外。与此同时，人群中有人抬手指向上方，那些原本封闭的窗户也同样打开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43065
    old "The door wasn't blocked anymore, and the bright lobby could be seen through it. Immediately, the policemen rushed in while Suripo's expectations remained unmet."
    new "大门不再被堵住，明亮的大厅透过门洞清晰可见。警察立刻冲了进去，Suripo 的期待却落了空。"

    # game/script.rpy:43066
    old "He'd been continuously told that someone would try to exit immediately with the Sekimeiya, and that they would need to be hastily detained. However, nobody could be seen inside."
    new "他一直被告知，会有人立刻带着 Sekimeiya 冲出来，必须当场将其扣下。可里面一个人影也看不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:43067
    old "Wh-What the fuck is this!?"
    new "这、这他妈是什么东西！？"

    # game/script.rpy:43071
    old "Before they could step into the tower, the team who'd rushed in was instantly taken aback, making brief eye contact with the confused multitude outside while covering their noses and grimacing."
    new "最先冲上前的那队人还没踏进塔内，就猛地怔住了。他们捂着鼻子，一脸痛苦，与外面那些不知所措的人群短暂地对视了一眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:43072
    old "...What's wrong!?"
    new "……怎么了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:43073
    old "There's something inside! It could be dangerous!"
    new "里面有东西！可能有危险！"

    # game/script.rpy:43074
    old "Everyone who'd stayed next to the door understood immediately. After it had opened, it hadn't taken much time for the smell they'd been noticing to drastically intensify. That confirmed it had been coming from within the tower, something they had previously discounted."
    new "守在门口的人立刻都明白了。门一开，那股先前就察觉到的气味没过多久便骤然浓烈起来。这证实了气味确实来自塔内——而这一点他们此前并没有当真。"

    # game/script.rpy:43075
    old "Twelve hours earlier, unidentified smoke had been released on the first floor of the tower. Right away, the possibility of it being poisonous had been presented.{w} However, they'd abandoned it as soon as the safety of the trapped individuals had been confirmed less than an hour later. Nonetheless, they'd prepared equipment such as masks just to be careful."
    new "十二小时前，塔的一层曾释放出不明烟雾，当时立刻有人提出它可能有毒。{w} 然而，不到一小时后被困者的安全得到确认，这个可能性便被搁置了。尽管如此，为稳妥起见，他们还是备好了口罩之类的装备。"

    # game/script.rpy:43076
    old "When they rushed to grab their equipment, the crowd began to show concern for the eight people trapped, whose figures hadn't yet appeared."
    new "当他们赶去取装备时，人群开始为被困的八个人担忧起来——那八个人的身影始终没有出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:43080
    old "I knew it! Didn't I tell you they were planning something!? You all better not let them get away with whatever they're trying to do!"
    new "我就知道！我不是说过他们在谋划什么吗！？你们可别让他们想干的事得逞！"

    # game/script.rpy:43081
    old "Everyone had retreated from the entrance as soon as it had been perceived as dangerous. That could well have been an opening for someone inside to escape, but no such thing occurred."
    new "一察觉到危险，所有人都从入口退开了。这本可以成为里面的人逃脱的良机，可这样的事情并没有发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:43082
    old "From a truck, the police took out protective suits alongside an optical gas imaging camera, as whatever had hit their noses had been invisible. The team ran back to the lobby and scanned the area with it."
    new "警察从一辆卡车上取出防护服，还有一台光学气体成像仪——毕竟钻进他们鼻子里的东西肉眼看不见。那队人又跑回大厅，用它扫描了整片区域。"

    # game/script.rpy:43084
    old "Look... There's definitely something inside."
    new "你看……里面肯定有什么东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:43086
    old "Everyone who looked at the image saw what appeared to be very dense gas occupying the entire hall. It looked white in the image, and it seemed to completely lack a source."
    new "看过图像的人都看到，一种极浓的气体充斥着整个大厅。图像里它呈白色，而且完全看不出是从哪里冒出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:43087
    old "The people in the back could see every movement, and they understood that the situation was being communicated through wireless devices."
    new "后方的人能看清每一个动作，也明白现场的情况正通过无线电设备传过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:43088
    old "The gas was unidentified, but they'd all inhaled some of it. However, even if it was toxic, the masks and suits would work as protection. Knowing that, the same team who'd tried to enter did so once again, hiding their faces behind the protective filters."
    new "那种气体成分不明，他们都已经吸入了不少。不过，就算有毒，面罩和防护服也足以自保。明白这一点后，先前尝试进入的那队人再度走了进去，把脸藏在防护面具后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:43093
    old "Look for the Sekimeiya in the cabinet! If it's empty, finding the Sekimeiya is the priority!"
    new "去展示柜找 Sekimeiya！要是柜子是空的，那就先把 Sekimeiya 找到！"

    # game/script.rpy:43094
    old "Lei had informed them of how the Sekimeiya looked and the necessity for cold temperature. Everyone who'd entered knew the Sekimeiya had to be immediately placed inside the cabinet, but after the precarious situation had been revealed, their focus was to secure everyone inside."
    new "Lei 已经告诉过他们 Sekimeiya 的外形，也说明过它必须处于低温之中。进入大楼的人都知道，一旦找到 Sekimeiya 就得立刻放进展示柜；可看出里面情况凶险之后，他们眼下的重点变成了先救出里面的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:43102
    old "Hey, look!"
    new "喂，快看！"

    # game/script.rpy:43105
    old "Five people had entered. Before they could disperse through the building, one alerted the others and pointed at the floor."
    new "进去的一共五个人。还没等他们在大楼里散开，其中一人忽然出声招呼同伴，抬手指向地面。"

    # game/script.rpy:43106
    old "There, they saw dried blood. Not a single soul was in the lobby awaiting their escape—there was only blood. A foreboding emotion ate at the edges of the men who'd gone in first."
    new "那里有干涸的血迹。大厅里没有半个人等着获救——只有血。最先进入的那几个人，心头被不祥的预感一点点啃噬。"

    # game/script.rpy:43109
    old "While everyone else waited impatiently, those five officers began to scatter, opening every room and trying to uncover every unseen spot. They knew the layout of the building and had been given a way to enter every place that could be locked."
    new "外面的人等得焦躁，那五名警员则分头散开，逐一打开每个房间，搜遍所有看不见的角落。他们熟悉这栋楼的布局，也拿到了能打开每一处上锁地方的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:43113
    old "One man confirmed that the mechanical room was barren and rushed back up to enter hallway B, its walls nearly as dark.{w} There, an old friend of his frantically tried to find the people who should've been trapped inside. A great deal of blood was on the floor toward the end of the hallway, which only compounded the officers' uneasiness."
    new "一名警员确认机械室里空无一物，便急忙折回，进入墙壁几乎同样漆黑的 B走廊。{w} 那里，他的一位老友正拼命寻找本该被困在里面的人。走廊尽头的地面上有大片血迹，令警员们越发不安。"

    # game/script.rpy:43114
    old "When he entered one of the crystal rooms on the right side, he saw the first person and stopped in place, turning around to confirm with the man behind him that what he was seeing was real."
    new "他走进右侧的一间水晶展室时看见了第一个人，随即僵在原地，回头向身后的人确认自己看到的是不是真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:43118
    old "In the opposite hallway was a longer trail of blood. The security room was the first place to be opened, so they didn't have to wait long to have their fears confirmed.{w} Then, in a deeper room, they saw an even more wretched nightmare."
    new "对面的走廊上，血迹拖得更长。监控室是最先被打开的房间，因此他们的恐惧没过多久便得到证实。{w} 随后，在更深处的一间房里，他们看见了更加凄惨的噩梦。"

    # game/script.rpy:43121
    old "However, when one of the bathrooms was opened, any comprehension they had instantly shattered."
    new "然而，当其中一间洗手间被打开时，他们先前的一切认知瞬间崩塌。"

    # game/script.rpy:43126
    old "They walked up the first staircase and saw a person standing there.{w} It was a girl with blue hair who looked a little disoriented."
    new "他们走上第一段楼梯，看见那里站着一个人。{w} 是个蓝头发的女孩，神情有些恍惚。"

    # game/script.rpy:43127
    old "Everyone rushed to her and confirmed her safety. Instead of hammering her with questions, being under the impression that the gas could've been toxic, one of the men escorted her to the lobby, where she was hit by the air she'd been longing for."
    new "众人立刻围上去，确认她平安无事。想到那气体可能有毒，他们没急着追问，其中一人将她护送到楼下大厅。到了那里，她终于呼吸到了渴望已久的空气。"

    # game/script.rpy:43131
    old "The search continued, as more people were yet to be found. However, when the police reached the attic's door, there had been no new discovery."
    new "还有不少人下落不明，搜索只能继续。然而，直到警方来到阁楼门前，也没有任何新的发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:43134
    old "One of them had been given that key after pressuring Ashiya. Once the highest level of the tower was unlocked, they rushed inside."
    new "其中一人向芦屋施压，才拿到了那把钥匙。塔顶层的门一开，他们便冲了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:43137
    old "Less than half a minute was needed to understand that three people were missing. However, even though they hadn't found anyone in the attic, they had spotted something else they'd been searching for."
    new "不到半分钟，他们就明白有三个人不见了。阁楼里虽然一个人也没找到，他们却发现了另一件一直在找的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:43143
    old "The entrance had been closed again to prevent the gas from escaping, and every bystander had shifted farther back after being informed of the possible danger."
    new "入口已被重新封闭，以防气体外泄；围观的人群得知可能有危险后，也都退得更远了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43144
    old "Suripo continued to wait for the arrival of his team, the only sound being the confused muttering of the crowd. At his side, Lei was visibly tense."
    new "Suripo 仍在等候自己的队伍赶到，耳边只剩下人群困惑的低语。身旁的 Lei 明显绷紧了神经。"

    # game/script.rpy:43152
    old "One of their men appeared from hallway A with a girl who seemed to be in pain."
    new "一名警员从 A走廊出来，身边跟着一个看上去正忍着疼痛的女孩。"

    # game/script.rpy:43153
    old "\"...Are you okay?\" Suripo asked.{w} The girl nodded faintly and looked away from him."
    new "「……你还好吗？」Suripo 问道。{w} 女孩轻轻点了点头，随即将视线移开。"

    # game/script.rpy:43154
    old "What's your name?"
    new "你叫什么名字？"

    # game/script.rpy:43160
    old "Shiroya."
    new "Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:43161
    old "I see. I'm really sorry you had to go through this."
    new "这样啊。让你遭遇这种事，实在抱歉。"

    # game/script.rpy:43164
    old "But the other policeman glared at Suripo, who didn't know what else was inside."
    new "可另一名警察瞪了 Suripo 一眼，而 Suripo 还不知道楼里究竟还有什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:43167
    old "Then, he walked to a car with Shiroya, where the eight people trapped inside were planned to be held."
    new "随后，他带着 Shiroya 走向一辆车——按计划，被困在里面的八个人将被安置在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:43169
    old "After five minutes of no development, a second policeman came back. Outside, he took his mask off, and the look in his eyes was enough to convey what he'd seen."
    new "五分钟过去，毫无进展，第二名警员回来了。他在外面摘下面罩，仅凭眼神就已说明了他看见的一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:43171
    old "Four of them are... dead. Counting everyone, there should be {tip=three}three left{/tip}."
    new "他们当中有四个……死了。全部算下来，应该还剩 {tip=three}三个人{/tip}。"

    # game/script.rpy:43174
    old "They were killed... But the others aren't anywhere inside. We haven't found the other three people who should be here."
    new "他们是被人杀的……可其他人根本不在楼里。本该在这儿的另外三个人，我们一个也没找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:43179
    old "Are you fucking serious? What about the Sekimeiya!?"
    new "你他妈说真的？那 Sekimeiya 呢！？"

    # game/script.rpy:43180
    old "Don't worry about that."
    new "这个不必担心。"

    # game/script.rpy:43182
    old "He explained that, in the attic, they'd found an egg-shaped white object that matched the Sekimeiya's description. Then, it had been brought to the cabinet downstairs as instructed."
    new "他解释说，他们在阁楼里发现了一件白色的蛋状物，与 Sekimeiya 的描述相符，已按指示送进楼下的展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:43188
    old "Then...! Someone got into the cabinet. This plan definitely revolved around the Sekimeiya, but it failed. That has to be it."
    new "那么……！有人动过展示柜。这个计划必定是围绕 Sekimeiya 展开的，可它失败了。一定是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:43189
    old "Lei looked relieved despite having been told about four casualties. However, Suripo still hadn't understood his subordinate."
    new "明明刚被告知死了四个人，Lei 却露出了松了口气的神情。Suripo 仍旧摸不透自己的这名部下。"

    # game/script.rpy:43192
    old "H-How is it possible the other three haven't been found? Are you sure you searched everywhere?"
    new "怎、怎么会找不到另外三个人？你确定每个地方都搜过了？"

    # game/script.rpy:43193
    old "Yes. Did you personally speak with all of them?"
    new "确定。你亲自和所有人都说过话吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:43194
    old "I did. They all told me their names. They have to be inside."
    new "问了。他们每个人都报了名字。他们一定还在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:43195
    old "Two more policemen came from the hallways and reported the same result. However, one of them inquired about something different."
    new "又有两名警员从走廊里出来，报告的结果并无二致。不过，其中一人问起了另一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:43196
    old "Is it possible they could have escaped? I saw a door in the storeroom I wasn't aware of."
    new "他们有没有可能逃出去了？储藏室里有一扇门，我以前根本不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:43205
    old "The man told them about the movable wall and about the door with a missing handle. Instead of entering to witness it by themselves, they walked to the left side of the building and estimated where the storeroom might've been."
    new "那名警员讲了自己见到的活动墙，还有那扇没有门把手的门。他们没有进去亲眼看，而是绕到建筑左侧，估摸储藏室大致在什么位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:43212
    old "After just a minute of searching, a faint outline had been found resembling a door. Furthermore, although it was exceptionally well-hidden, they saw a keyhole that meshed perfectly with the surface of the wall."
    new "只找了一分钟，他们就发现了一道隐隐约约的门形轮廓。而且，尽管它藏得极为巧妙，墙上还是有个与墙面完全齐平的钥匙孔。"

    # game/script.rpy:43217
    old "There's no way this is a door! No such thing exists in the storeroom!"
    new "这怎么可能是门！储藏室里根本没有这种东西！"

    # game/script.rpy:43218
    old "Suripo ignored her; there was obviously a door. However, it didn't explain anything."
    new "Suripo 没有理会她。门明明就在那儿，可这依然说明不了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:43219
    old "Nobody could've escaped through here. Very soon after the attack occurred, people started watching from both sides. And not just the civilians gathered out here, but also the police."
    new "没人能从这里逃出去。袭击发生后没多久，两边都有人盯着了。不光是聚在外面的市民，还有警察。"

    # game/script.rpy:43224
    old "Lei was astonished, as no such door should've existed. However, even though she couldn't trust that nobody could've escaped, she wasn't that concerned. After all, the well-being of the Sekimeiya had been confirmed. In the worst-case scenario, the Xyn members had fled."
    new "Lei 大为震惊，这样的门本不该存在。可她虽然不敢确信真的没人逃出去，却也不怎么在意。毕竟，已经确认 Sekimeiya 安然无恙。就算是最坏的情况，也不过是 Xyn 的人逃走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43227
    old "And given what I saw, nobody could've opened it from the inside. The handle had been removed, and there was no lock to pick."
    new "而且就我看到的情况，没人能从里面把它打开。门把手已经拆掉了，也没锁可撬。"

    # game/script.rpy:43228
    old "No... There's no way this leads inside the tower. It's impossible I wouldn't know about it."
    new "不可能……这里绝不可能通向塔内。没道理我会不知道有这种地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:43229
    old "We can determine that easily."
    new "这一点很容易确认。"

    # game/script.rpy:43230
    old "The keyhole looked old, and Suripo believed that opening it without the key would be doable. If it was rusty or had been frozen, it could've been impossible, but if it was in a decent state, it shouldn't have taken him very long."
    new "锁孔看上去已经有些年头，Suripo 认为不用钥匙也能把它打开。要是锁生了锈或者冻住了，那或许办不到；但若状态尚可，应该花不了他多少时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:43231
    old "He instructed his subordinate to run to his car, where he had a standard lock picking set. Once he received it, Suripo began to fiddle with the lock and quickly found that picking it was possible."
    new "他吩咐手下跑到自己车上，拿一套常用的开锁工具。东西到手后，Suripo 便拨弄起锁芯，很快发现这锁确实撬得开。"

    # game/script.rpy:43234
    old "This door is locked. We'd have to do this even if we had a handle."
    new "这扇门锁着。就算把手还在，我们也照样得撬锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:43235
    old "The other two looked at him, trying to suppress their own shivering. It wasn't from the cold alone—they'd learned that people had died, but also that some were missing. If the door led to a hidden room, the rest could've been inside."
    new "另外两人看着他，强压着自己的颤抖。这不只是因为寒冷——他们已经得知有人死了，也知道还有人下落不明。如果这扇门通向某个隐秘的房间，其余的人说不定就在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:43236
    old "The major part of the crowd was occupied with looking at the entrance, so they didn't pay much attention to the people who'd gone to the left side of the building. After a few short minutes, the lock clicked, and the door swung in."
    new "人群大半都盯着正门，因此没怎么留意绕到建筑左侧的几个人。短短几分钟后，锁咔哒一响，门向内开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43240
    old "There's no fucking way... How did I not know about this!? And how could Xyn!?"
    new "这他妈怎么可能……我怎么不知道有这种东西！？Xyn 又怎么可能知道！？"

    # game/script.rpy:43242
    old "The three of them saw the dark storeroom, with the wall that the other policeman had closed hiding the hallway door from view."
    new "三人看见了漆黑的储藏室，另一名警察合上的那面墙正好挡住了走廊的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:43244
    old "It was truly the storeroom. The peculiar smell started to become prominent once again, so they rushed back out and walked to the main entrance, wondering if that door had truly been used as a method of escape. It seemed it hadn't been possible to open from the inside, but the handle could've been removed by the people who hadn't escaped or while the door had been open."
    new "这里确实是储藏室。那股古怪的气味又浓了起来，于是他们连忙退出去，走向正门，心里琢磨那扇门是否真被人用来逃生。看来它没法从内侧打开，但把手可能是没能逃出去的人拆掉的，也可能是在门还开着时拆掉的。"

    # game/script.rpy:43248
    old "Outside the front door, they saw the final man who'd entered the building. All of them confirmed the same story: four people had died, and there was nobody else alive."
    new "正门外，他们见到了最后一个进入大楼的男人。所有人都证实了同样的说法：死了四个人，此外再无生还者。"

    # game/script.rpy:43251
    old "One of the victims is Naomi Cabca, who worked in the tower. However, two bodies that look exactly like her are inside. None of the people who got trapped shared her last name, correct?"
    new "其中一名死者是在塔里工作的 Naomi Cabca。可里面有两具和她长得一模一样的尸体。被困的人里没有谁跟她同姓，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:43252
    old "Suripo kept growing more confused and shook his head. Four of the people he'd talked to in the morning had died, which he still had trouble accepting. What the hell had happened in the tower?"
    new "Suripo 越发困惑，摇了摇头。早上还和他说过话的人里，有四个已经死了，他至今难以接受。塔里到底出了什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:43253
    old "I took images of the inside. The gas is present practically around the entire building in different quantities, but I wasn't able to find a source for it."
    new "我把里面的情况拍了下来。这气体几乎遍布整栋楼，只是各处浓度不同，但我找不到它的来源。"

    # game/script.rpy:43254
    old "What...? How's that possible?"
    new "什么……？这怎么可能？"

    # game/script.rpy:43256
    old "I also took pictures of the bodies."
    new "尸体的照片我也拍了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43259
    old "Suripo remembered the voice of the child he'd heard at the start of that long day after looking at her face. The pictures also encompassed all the blood found in the hallways and elevator.{w} Two of the bodies had the same face and clothing, which was incredibly odd, as nothing like that had been mentioned during the brief period of communication with those inside."
    new "看到她的脸，Suripo 想起了漫长的一天开始时听到的那个孩子的声音。照片里也拍下了走廊和电梯中所有的血迹。{w} 其中两具尸体面容与衣着完全相同，这怪异得离谱——先前与楼内的人短暂联络时，谁也没提过这样的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:43260
    old "These bodies must be taken out. We don't know what happened or what this gas is, but it's in the entire building. A proper investigation might not be able to occur for a while with these circumstances.{w} However, the security cameras have been recording since this all started. Save all the footage to a drive."
    new "这些尸体必须搬出来。我们既不知道发生了什么，也不知道这气体究竟是什么，可它弥漫了整栋楼。这样的情况之下，正式调查恐怕一时半会儿没法展开。{w} 不过，从事情开始到现在，监控一直在录。把所有录像都存进硬盘。"

    # game/script.rpy:43261
    old "The door had been closed again, but even then, they felt the smell was still present. They kept taking more steps back while the orders to analyze the gas were being sent."
    new "门已经重新关上，可即便如此，他们仍觉得那股气味还在。分析气体的命令下达时，他们不断向后退去。"

    # game/script.rpy:43262
    old "Suripo saw that one of his men was holding something."
    new "Suripo 看见一名手下拿着什么东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:43264
    old "Oh, it's something I found on the first floor. Take a look at it."
    new "哦，是我在一楼找到的东西。你看看吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:43269
    old "Suripo reached out and grabbed a tiny piece of paper. He began to read the words written on it out loud."
    new "Suripo 伸手接过一张小小的纸片，开始把上面的字大声念出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:43270
    old "Hello... I'm sorry that I have to write this."
    new "你好……很抱歉，我不得不写下这些。"

    # game/script.rpy:43271
    old "I still can't believe what happened. I haven't been able to stop crying, but I've always tried to tell myself that these things just occur."
    new "发生的事，我到现在还是不敢相信。眼泪一直停不下来，我却总试着告诉自己，世事本就如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:43272
    old "I know how selfish it is that I'm writing this, but I won't be able to live with myself if I don't."
    new "我知道这样写很自私，可若不写下来，我这一生都难以心安。"

    # game/script.rpy:43273
    old "I need to say it.{w} I've always wanted to, and I can't believe I never will.{w} I love you."
    new "我必须说出来。{w} 我一直都想说，却怎么也没料到，最后竟再没有机会。{w} 我爱你。"

    # game/script.rpy:43274
    old "Everyone who heard Suripo was bewildered."
    new "听见 Suripo 念出这些话的人，全都怔住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43275
    old "And then, when they understood that the events of that day contained innumerably more mysteries than they'd expected, as their only wish, they hoped that all the truth could be exposed."
    new "而后，当他们明白那一天发生的事所藏的谜团，比预想的多出无数倍时，他们唯一的愿望，就是希望所有真相都能被揭开。"

    # game/script.rpy:43285
    old "Self-Fulfillment"
    new "自我实现"

    # game/script.rpy:43299
    old "The sun had long ago set, letting the sheer cold prevail in the streets of Yushibana."
    new "太阳早已落山，彻骨的寒意笼罩了丰花的街道。"

    # game/script.rpy:43300
    old "Near the outskirts, the moon and a few light posts provided the only illumination. It was late, and everyone around was preparing to end their day."
    new "城郊一带，只有月亮和几盏路灯投下光亮。夜色已深，附近的人家都在准备结束这一天。"

    # game/script.rpy:43301
    old "Not one of them saw the figure of a young girl appearing by the entrance of a house, below a stone roof."
    new "没有人看见一个少女的身影出现在一栋房子的门口，就在石砌屋檐下。"

    # game/script.rpy:43307
    old "She found herself leaning against the cold wall and quickly looked down."
    new "她发觉自己正倚着一面冰冷的墙，随即低头看去。"

    # game/script.rpy:43308
    old "Light snow was falling, but she was still able to discern some of the footprints she'd once left."
    new "细雪纷飞，好在她还认得出几道自己从前留下的脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:43309
    old "Next to the wheel marks, she knew that what she was seeing were the imprints of three different pairs of shoes. One trail was hers, and the other two belonged to two of her friends."
    new "车轮的痕迹旁边，她看出那是三双不同鞋子踩出的脚印。一串是她自己的，另外两串属于她的两位朋友。"

    # game/script.rpy:43314
    old "She traced them with her eyes and followed them to a door in the middle of the street. Next to it was a modest window with a curtain concealing the interior."
    new "她顺着脚印望去，一直看到街道中段的一扇门。门旁有一扇不大的窗，窗帘遮住了屋内的光景。"

    # game/script.rpy:43315
    old "Light was coming from the other side, but it was very faint. Without wasting time, she dashed to the door and opened it."
    new "光从另一侧透出来，却十分微弱。她没有耽搁，快步冲到门前，推开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:43323
    old "She had appeared from the future. Instants earlier, she had been inside Ashiya Tower, on December 15th."
    new "她是从未来来的。就在片刻之前，她还待在 12 月 15 日的芦屋塔中。"

    # game/script.rpy:43324
    old "It was fifteen days before that time, so she knew what was soon to happen in the tiny store she'd hastily run to."
    new "此刻距那时还有十五天，所以她清楚，自己匆忙赶来的这间小店即将发生什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:43325
    old "At one point, her friend Atsuki had told her that it was possible to change the past. She firmly believed that she could make it happen herself."
    new "她的朋友 Atsuki 曾对她说过，过去是可以改变的。她坚信自己能够做到。"

    # game/script.rpy:43327
    old "She pulled open the door, planning to diverge the world from the one she knew."
    new "她拉开门，决意让这个世界偏离自己所熟知的那一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:43333
    old "Her field of vision was filled by lingering smoke. Knowing not to breathe in, she glanced down as the door closed behind her."
    new "视野里满是久久不散的烟雾。她屏住呼吸，在身后的门关上时低头看去。"

    # game/script.rpy:43334
    old "There, she saw the first two people who'd fallen unconscious. They had already escaped danger."
    new "她看见最先昏倒的那两个人。他们已经脱离了危险。"

    # game/script.rpy:43337
    old "She ran through the oppressive cloud and looked behind the stand of shelves."
    new "她穿过那令人窒息的烟雾，看向货架后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:43338
    old "On the floor was her own body. She recalled the time she'd seen the smoke appearing and been unable to resist the loss of consciousness."
    new "地板上躺着的是她自己的身体。她记起那时看见烟雾涌起，自己再也撑不住，失去了意识。"

    # game/script.rpy:43341
    old "She would be fine as well, so she stepped to the far side of the room."
    new "她也不会有事，于是走到了房间的另一头。"

    # game/script.rpy:43342
    old "As she did so, she couldn't help but briefly breathe the polluted air. She was afraid it would knock her out, but instead, she noticed something."
    new "就在那时，她还是短暂地吸进了一口污浊的空气。她担心自己会就此昏过去，却反而察觉到了一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:43343
    old "It was the smell from that day... And she knew what it was."
    new "那是那天闻到的气味……而她知道那是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:43344
    old "Behind the prominent stenches of the smoke and artificial gas, there was a third, hidden smell, present all around the shop. It was a possibility she'd already explored, so it didn't come as a surprise to her, but there was no time to think as she looked behind the last set of shelves."
    new "在烟雾和人工气体那股刺鼻的气味之下，还藏着第三种气味，若有若无地弥漫在整间店里。这种可能她早就想过，因此并不意外；但此刻没有时间多想——她朝最后一排货架后望去。"

    # game/script.rpy:43350
    old "She saw the last person. Her friend, Miiya, was unconscious on the floor, facing the ceiling. Just behind her was a powered-off heater, silently emitting the deadly gas that had once ended her life."
    new "她看见了最后一个人。她的朋友 Miiya 倒在地上，人事不省，脸朝着天花板。就在她身后，一台已经断电的取暖器正无声地吐出那股曾夺走 Miiya 性命的致命气体。"

    # game/script.rpy:43352
    old "The range of the explosion would not be large, so saving her friend was doable, and she was confident she'd succeed."
    new "爆炸的波及范围不会太大，救下朋友并非做不到，她也有把握成功。"

    # game/script.rpy:43354
    old "She kneeled and grabbed the shoulders of the unconscious girl. Then, she stepped back to drop her behind the shelves that would protect her."
    new "她跪下身，抓住昏迷女孩的双肩，随即向后退去，把她放到货架后面——那里能护住她。"

    # game/script.rpy:43357
    old "At that point, she was saved, but she kept moving back, so that the soon-to-break floor wouldn't swallow her. Once she was absent from all danger, the girl stood up and looked at her past self."
    new "到这一步，Miiya 已经得救了，但她仍继续后退，免得即将碎裂的地板把自己吞下去。彻底脱离危险之后，女孩才站起身，望向过去的自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:43358
    old "She didn't know the exact time, but her job hadn't ended yet.{w} She stepped up to her own shoulders and grabbed them. After lifting herself, she began to back up."
    new "她不知道确切的时间，但自己的任务还没有结束。{w} 她走上前，抓住另一个自己的双肩。扶起那个自己之后，她开始向后退去。"

    # game/script.rpy:43360
    old "Then, her heart suddenly skipped a beat."
    new "就在这时，她的心猛地漏跳了一拍。"

    # game/script.rpy:43361
    old "She turned around. She didn't see the door opening because a wooden shelf was blocking her sight, but soon after she heard its sound, the lights turned off."
    new "她转过身。木制货架挡住了视线，她没能看见门被推开，但紧接着听见了开门声，灯光便熄灭了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43364
    old "There was no time to react.{w} During the instants before the light came back on, the girl closed her eyes and attempted to cover her face with her arms."
    new "已经来不及反应。{w} 在灯光重新亮起前的那几瞬，女孩闭上眼，试图用双臂护住脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:43372
    old "The floor had shattered, and she found herself falling with the rubble, the deadly light shrinking within the familiar darkness."
    new "地板已经碎裂，她随着残骸一同坠落，那致命的光在熟悉的黑暗里越缩越小。"

    # game/script.rpy:43399
    old "Hex Ladder"
    new "六角阶梯"

    # game/script.rpy:43414
    old "We'd been in front of the queue for a long time, looking at the dull, wooden door that would soon open."
    new "我们在队伍最前端站了很久，一直望着那扇灰扑扑的木门——它很快就要开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43415
    old "I looked behind me and noticed that a lot of people were waiting. The entrance kept opening, sending icy breezes toward my neck."
    new "我回头看去，才发现身后排着许多人。入口一次次开启，冷风直往我脖颈上扑。"

    # game/script.rpy:43416
    old "I'd never seen the interior of Ashiya Tower before, and I'd never believed I'd ever enter it. The lobby felt empty despite all the people that had come due to the vast and dreary amount of space."
    new "我从未见过芦屋塔的内部，也从没想过自己会有走进去的一天。来的人明明不少，可大厅太空旷、太冷清，还是显得空空荡荡。"

    # game/script.rpy:43432
    old "I'd had my mind empty all day, with no capacity to hold a conversation. Atsuki knew that and kept restlessly glancing around."
    new "我一整天脑子里都空空的，根本没法跟人交谈。Atsuki 明白这一点，只是一直心神不宁地四下张望。"

    # game/script.rpy:43433
    old "I hated the way I'd become and silently apologized for putting him through even more pain. It was early in the morning, and we hadn't slept. Almost exhausted, I let my head drop and thoughtlessly stared at the floor."
    new "我厌恶自己变成这副样子，也在心里默默道歉——我又让他多受了一层苦。清晨尚早，我们一夜未睡。我几乎撑不住了，垂下头，茫然地盯着地面。"

    # game/script.rpy:43434
    old "During the previous week, I could hardly even claim to have been alive. The death of our friend had shaken me in a way I'd never expected."
    new "过去这一周，我几乎算不上还活着。朋友的死给了我从未想象过的打击。"

    # game/script.rpy:43435
    old "After lonesome months going over the most important decisions of my life, I'd considered Atsuki's call a breath of fresh air. What was the point in going to study abroad if it wasn't what I wanted the most? When I'd been at Atsuki's house, I'd felt embarrassed for not realizing before how straightforward the decision had always been."
    new "在孤独的几个月里反复掂量人生中最重要的几个决定之后，Atsuki 打来的那通电话让我如沐春风。出国留学若不是我最想要的，又有什么意义？在 Atsuki 家里时，我甚至为自己先前没看出这个决定一直如此简单而感到不好意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:43438
    old "But reality had hit me way harder just the next day. I'd finally decided on something, and it was rejected.{w} Why had Miiya died? It wasn't fair. The three of us were so happy that day, so why had it been Miiya's last?"
    new "可现实在第二天就给了我更沉重的一击。我好不容易做出了决定，却被生生驳回。{w} Miiya 为什么会死？这不公平。那天我们三个人那么开心，为什么那偏偏成了 Miiya 的最后一天？"

    # game/script.rpy:43439
    old "Of course, anyone could die at any point. I'd heard those words many times, but I had never really understood them."
    new "当然，谁都可能随时死去。这句话我听过许多遍，却从未真正明白它的分量。"

    # game/script.rpy:43440
    old "What if I'd died instead? What if Atsuki had? Why was I so selfishly sad that my future wouldn't be as I'd believed during that day? At the very least, she had been unconscious..."
    new "如果死的是我呢？如果是 Atsuki 呢？我为什么那么自私，只为自己的未来没能如那天所想而难过？至少，她是在毫无知觉中死去的……"

    # game/script.rpy:43441
    old "My thoughts were a mess, so I'd put what little willpower I had into keeping them blank. Otherwise, I'd keep replaying the span of time in which I'd awakened next to Atsuki and heard everything."
    new "我的思绪乱成一团，只好用仅剩的一点意志力让脑子保持一片空白。否则，我就会一遍遍回放醒来时躺在 Atsuki 身边、听到一切的那段时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:43447
    old "It wasn't easy to accept that the previous two weeks had actually happened, but I already considered them the two worst of my life. I'd known Atsuki for many years, and the person next to me was just a cast-off shell of his. I'd never seen him look so depressed."
    new "要我接受过去两周真的发生过，并不容易，但我已经认定那是我人生中最糟的两周。我认识 Atsuki 许多年了，可此刻在我身边的他，只剩下一具空壳。我从没见过他这么消沉。"

    # game/script.rpy:43448
    old "However, despite the impact everything had on me, I'd also been able to think positively. That was why we were in Ashiya Tower."
    new "不过，尽管这一切对我打击沉重，我仍能往好的方向想。我们之所以会站在芦屋塔，正是因为如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:43449
    old "We couldn't let Miiya's death take us down too. The three of us had spoken about missing the old days and about how hard the summer months had been. Even though it was just the two of us, Atsuki and I had wanted to come to Ashiya's event. We wanted to overcome everything together."
    new "我们不能让 Miiya 的死把我们也一起拖垮。我们三个人曾谈起过，有多怀念从前的日子，也说过这个夏天有多难熬。如今只剩两个人，Atsuki 和我还是想来参加芦屋的活动。我们想一起跨过这一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:43450
    old "But that wasn't fair. She didn't deserve that either... The mere thought of imagining a cheerful future without Miiya was heartbreaking."
    new "可这也不公平。她同样不该落得这样的下场……光是想象一个没有 Miiya 的快乐未来，就让人心碎。"

    # game/script.rpy:43451
    old "She typically hadn't shown much emotion, but I knew she'd had a good heart. I hated that after her death, I regretted not speaking to her enough... I hated how little I'd known about her despite how often the three of us had been together."
    new "她平时不怎么流露情绪，但我知道她心地很好。我恨自己直到她死后才后悔没能多和她说说话……我恨我们三个人明明常在一起，我对她的了解却那么少。"

    # game/script.rpy:43457
    old "...It couldn't have been fair that I regretted that only because she had died. And that, despite how broken I felt, the sadness her parents were experiencing didn't mean as much to me because I'd never talked to them."
    new "……我竟然只因为她死了才后悔这些，这算什么公道。还有，我明明痛苦得快要崩溃，可就因为从没和她父母说过话，他们承受的悲伤在我心里就没那么重。"

    # game/script.rpy:43458
    old "I knew how shallow and unreasonable some of my thoughts were, but that wasn't enough to put an end to them. Was I just selfish? ...I kept wondering if that was all."
    new "我知道自己有些念头既浅薄又不讲道理，可光知道这一点，并不足以让它们停下。我是不是只是自私？……我一遍遍地问自己，难道就只是这样而已吗。"

    # game/script.rpy:43468
    old "A woman had been talking about what we would do, and she was addressing us."
    new "一位女士一直在讲接下来的安排，此刻正对着我们说话。"

    # game/script.rpy:43469
    old "\"Yes.\" After a long wait, Atsuki answered with a plain and quiet voice."
    new "「是的。」等了好一会儿，Atsuki 才用平淡而安静的声音答道。"

    # game/script.rpy:43473
    old "Right. That day, Ashiya were showcasing a new discovery. I couldn't feel the intrigue I'd once faintly had, so after the two people at my side went through the door, I followed behind them with slow steps."
    new "是啊。那天，芦屋要展示一项新发现。我再也感受不到自己曾经隐约有过的兴致，身边两人穿过门后，我便拖着缓慢的步子跟在后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:43479
    old "On the opposite side was a long corridor, vast and completely lacking in comfort. I didn't see where the others had gone, but a few of the doors were open."
    new "门对面是一条很长的走廊，宽阔却毫无舒适感。我看不出其他人去了哪里，但有几扇门开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:43490
    old "I walked toward one of the doors, but it didn't seem like anyone was behind it."
    new "我朝其中一扇门走去，里面似乎没有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:43498
    old "I turned around, saddened to hear that question."
    new "我转过身，听到这个问题，心里一阵难过。"

    # game/script.rpy:43500
    old "I didn't regret having come at all. The part of me that could feel it was really glad Atsuki was still at my side."
    new "我一点也不后悔来这里。我内心里还能有所感触的那部分，真心庆幸 Atsuki 仍在我身边。"

    # game/script.rpy:43515
    old "It's all right. Thank you.{w} Let's continue, though. I was the one who wanted to come."
    new "没事的。谢谢你。{w}不过，我们继续走吧。当初想来的那个人是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:43524
    old "The woman called us from one of the rooms, and we shut ourselves inside it."
    new "那名女子从其中一间房里唤我们过去，我们进去后关上了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:43534
    old "Behind a velvet curtain was the gemstone we would be shown. After we introduced ourselves, we were told the basics behind its discovery and rarity, leading up to the cabinet containing it being unlocked."
    new "天鹅绒遮布后面，是即将展示给我们的宝石。我们自报姓名后，对方讲解了它的发现经过与稀有之处，最后打开了存放它的展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:43540
    old "But as the curtain rose, something else did. A dense and dark smoke filled my vision, and before I could realize that I should have held my breath, I fell to the floor."
    new "可遮布升起时，别的东西也跟着冒了出来。浓黑的烟雾充斥视野，我还没来得及意识到自己该屏住呼吸，便已倒在地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:43544
    old "My heart went wild, but I couldn't move any other part of my body. My mind flashed to the last time smoke had put me to sleep, and remembering what the outcome had been, I desperately tried to resist the urge to close my eyes."
    new "心脏狂跳不止，身体却动弹不得。我猛地想起上次被烟雾弄昏过去的情形，也记得那之后发生了什么，于是拼命抗拒闭上眼的冲动。"

    # game/script.rpy:43553
    old "That time, I didn't wake up in the hospital. I was in the same room as before. Immobile, I stared at the floor, my awareness gradually returning."
    new "那一次，我并没有在医院醒来。我还在先前那个房间里，动弹不得，只能盯着地板，意识渐渐恢复。"

    # game/script.rpy:43558
    old "I was relieved to see that both of us were okay. Akaro, the other man, was safe too, but we quickly saw that Naomi was gone."
    new "看到我们两人都没事，我松了一口气。另一名男子 Akaro 也安然无恙，可我们很快发现 Naomi 不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43564
    old "That was the beginning of a very long day. There had been an attack in the tower, and plenty of questions came with it. The first one was the origin of the smoke that had knocked us out."
    new "那是漫长一天的开端。塔里发生了袭击，随之而来的问题数不胜数。第一个问题就是：熏倒我们的那股烟雾究竟从何而来。"

    # game/script.rpy:43565
    old "There took place the first real conversation I'd had with Atsuki in days. We were forced to discuss what we'd been caught up in."
    new "那是我这些天来第一次真正与 Atsuki 交谈。我们被迫讨论起自己卷入的事件。"

    # game/script.rpy:43566
    old "And that was what we'd most needed. We hadn't talked about anything because we didn't have the strength to say what we wanted. The situation we ended up in forced us to talk to each other again.{w} When I noticed that we were speaking normally, I was grateful that coming to the tower had given us what we'd been looking for."
    new "而这正是我们最需要的。之前我们什么都没谈，是因为连说出心里话的力气都没有。我们最后落入的处境逼得我们又说起话来。{w} 当我发觉我们像平常一样交谈时，不禁心生感激：来到这座塔，竟让我们得到了苦苦寻求的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:43567
    old "However, the future that should've been waiting for us was challenged by the same thing that had made it attainable: the events that unfolded in Ashiya Tower."
    new "然而，本应等着我们的未来，却因芦屋塔里发生的一切而受到威胁——也正是这一切，让那个未来成为了可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:43578
    old "In the hallway, we met Erina, Isla, Katei, and Sai. There, we learned that we would spend twelve hours in the building due to an alarm that had been recently installed."
    new "在走廊里，我们遇见了 Erina、Isla、Katei 和 Sai。也是在那里，我们得知由于最近安装了警报，我们得在这栋楼里待上十二个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:43586
    old "It should've gone off whenever the Sekimeiya was stolen, but when we looked in its cabinet, that was immediately thrown into question."
    new "按理说，只要 Sekimeiya 被盗，它就该响起；可当我们查看存放它的展示柜时，这个前提立刻受到了质疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:43590
    old "From the security room, we contacted the outside, which clarified the outline of what had happened. After that, we were assaulted by question after question."
    new "我们在监控室里联系了外界，大致弄清了事情的经过。可那之后，一个接一个的问题便向我们袭来。"

    # game/script.rpy:43594
    old "The computer turned off out of the blue, leaving us unable to look at the recorded footage. Then, we looked for Naomi, who should've been somewhere in the building."
    new "电脑突然关了机，我们无法再查看监控录像。随后，我们去找 Naomi——她本该就在这栋楼里的某处。"

    # game/script.rpy:43598
    old "We separated into two groups and looked through the upper floors. There, we learned about the predictions Isla's friend had made."
    new "我们分成两组，搜查了上面几层。在那里，我们得知了 Isla 的朋友所作的预言。"

    # game/script.rpy:43602
    old "And that Naomi had come from the floors below, demanding to talk to Katei privately."
    new "还得知 Naomi 是从下面几层上来的，并要求与 Katei 单独谈谈。"

    # game/script.rpy:43610
    old "That was when Atsuki and I noticed the first signs of the underlying factor of our imprisonment. The elevator was brought up, but we couldn't find who'd boarded it."
    new "就在那时，Atsuki 和我第一次察觉到了困住我们的根本因素。电梯被叫了上来，我们却找不到搭上电梯的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:43618
    old "The reason... was time travel. The Sekimeiya, which we had come to see, possessed the power to send people through time. As ridiculous as it sounded, we had no choice but to accept it."
    new "原因……是时间穿越。我们前来参观的 Sekimeiya，拥有将人送往过去或未来的力量。听来虽荒诞，我们也只能接受。"

    # game/script.rpy:43619
    old "Was it true that everything happened for a reason? Had we been given the ability to undo the past after wishing for it? If so, there were two different, bright futures on the horizon."
    new "难道一切真的都有缘由？难道是我们许下愿望后，才被赐予了改写过去的能力？若果真如此，前方就有两个截然不同、却都光明的未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:43620
    old "We could leave the tower after moving past Miiya's death... or we could go to the past and save her. Just when it seemed the wound was beginning to heal, we were captivated by a slim hope."
    new "我们可以放下 Miiya 的死，离开这座塔……也可以回到过去救她。就在伤痛似乎开始愈合之际，一丝微弱的希望又攫住了我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:43621
    old "But it looked like the world might have been mocking us instead. We drew the conclusion that changing the past was likely not doable."
    new "可看来，世界或许只是在嘲弄我们。我们得出结论：改变过去多半行不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:43628
    old "Next to our two possible futures, there was something darker. It first appeared when we saw Naomi's body on the floor, devoid of life and soaked in blood."
    new "在我们那两个可能的未来之外，还有某种更黑暗的东西。它初次显现，是在我们看到 Naomi 倒在地上、毫无生气、浸在血泊中的尸体时。"

    # game/script.rpy:43629
    old "Trapped with us was a killer—a person who'd produced the same pain we'd felt before.{w} There had to be justice for Naomi, but we were unable to figure out the truth behind her death."
    new "与我们一同被困的还有一名凶手——一个曾让我们体会过同样痛苦的人。{w} 必须为 Naomi 讨回公道，可我们却查不出她死亡的真相。"

    # game/script.rpy:43630
    old "Something became clear very early on: when we could leave the building, everything would be much different from when we'd entered it."
    new "很早我们就明白：等我们能离开这栋楼时，一切都会和进来时大不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:43631
    old "Was one of the people who'd discovered Naomi's corpse responsible for her death? I despised that thought, but more than that, I despised whoever that person was."
    new "发现 Naomi 尸体的人里，会不会有一个就是害死她的凶手？我厌恶这个念头，但更厌恶那个人本身。"

    # game/script.rpy:43636
    old "We heard a sound that indicated someone else was around us, but we couldn't find anyone. It seemed that during the time we'd looked for the culprit, the elevator had moved in a strange way. Whatever they were doing kept happening right under our noses."
    new "我们听见某种声响，说明周围还有别人，却找不到任何人。看来就在我们寻找凶手的那段时间里，电梯曾以古怪的方式运行过。不管他们在做什么，这些事都一直发生在我们眼皮底下。"

    # game/script.rpy:43640
    old "And soon, we came across the bathrooms on the lowest floor. Inside the men's was Naomi's body.{w} Not the one we'd already found, but a different one. That confirmed what we'd all already imagined: in the tower with us, while the world couldn't see it, something beyond the bounds of possibility was taking place."
    new "不久，我们来到了最底层的洗手间。男洗手间里躺着 Naomi 的尸体。{w} 不是我们已经发现的那一具，而是另一具。这证实了我们所有人早已隐约想到的事：就在这座塔里，在我们身边，正发生着某种超乎常理的事，而外界对此一无所知。"

    # game/script.rpy:43646
    old "We managed to enter the attic thanks to one of the keys Naomi had. Up there, the footprints on the carpet informed us that such impossibilities extended to every place in the building."
    new "多亏 Naomi 持有的一把钥匙，我们才得以进入阁楼。上去之后，地毯上的脚印告诉我们，这类不可能之事已遍及楼内每一处。"

    # game/script.rpy:43650
    old "And lastly, inside Isla's purse, we found a greater harbinger of hopelessness than anything before it."
    new "最后，在 Isla 的手提包里，我们找到了一个比之前任何东西都更令人绝望的征兆。"

    # game/script.rpy:43651
    old "Would we spend more than a month in that building? As impossible as it sounded, that word didn't mean much anymore."
    new "我们难道要在这栋楼里待上一个多月？听来虽不可思议，但「不可能」这个词早已没多少意义了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43658
    old "Attempting to solve the smaller questions, Atsuki and I walked all the way down from the attic. There, I traveled through time for the first time, but it wasn't me who touched the Sekimeiya."
    new "为了解开那些较小的问题，Atsuki 和我从阁楼一路走了下来。在那里，我第一次经历了时间穿越，但触碰 Sekimeiya 的人并不是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:43663
    old "We began to learn more and more about how the time travel functioned, but the biggest blockade stood resolutely in place: the past wasn't changing."
    new "我们渐渐摸清了时间穿越的运作方式，可最大的障碍仍稳稳横在面前：过去并未改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:43667
    old "Some time later, we traveled again. We appeared in the attic, but we had to stay put in one of the bedrooms. We were very tired, so we both lay in the beds."
    new "又过了一阵，我们再次穿越。这次出现在阁楼，但只能待在其中一个卧室里。我们累得厉害，便都躺到了床上。"

    # game/script.rpy:43668
    old "Despite how disheartening it was, we were able to calmly talk about the Sekimeiya. I no longer believed that we had much hope of understanding it or using it to our advantage, but we could at least try."
    new "尽管这令人灰心，我们仍能平静地谈论 Sekimeiya。我已不抱多大希望能弄懂它或利用它，但至少还能试一试。"

    # game/script.rpy:43672
    old "And even that faint belief was thrown back in our faces. When we woke up, we found out that the Sekimeiya had taken Isla's life—that reality was truly as ruthless as we'd feared."
    new "可连那点微弱的信念也被狠狠打了回来。醒来后，我们发现 Sekimeiya 夺走了 Isla 的性命——现实果真如我们害怕的那样残酷。"

    # game/script.rpy:43676
    old "What had happened to her was shrouded in mystery, but the Sekimeiya had been the catalyst. At my side, I saw Erina's devastation and wondered if my own even came close."
    new "她遭遇了什么仍笼罩在谜团中，但 Sekimeiya 正是其中的催化剂。我看见身旁的 Erina 痛苦不堪，不禁想，我自己的悲痛是否及得上她分毫。"

    # game/script.rpy:43682
    old "After a long wait in the lobby, I found a hidden mechanism in the storeroom. Past a movable wall, there was a door without a handle that appeared to lead outside."
    new "在大厅里等了许久之后，我在储藏室发现了一个隐藏机关。在那面可移动的墙后，有一扇没有把手的门，看上去通向外面。"

    # game/script.rpy:43683
    old "But after what some of us had heard from the recorder, it wasn't possible to think that freedom was so close. Was it truly a single door away?"
    new "但听过录音笔里的那些内容后，我们没法再认为自由就近在眼前了。难道真的只隔着一扇门？"

    # game/script.rpy:43687
    old "Erina suggested locking ourselves up in a room. That was the best and safest way to reach the time limit. We chose one of the bedrooms in the attic and decided to stay there for the remaining hours."
    new "Erina 提议我们把自己锁在房间里。那是撑到时限的最佳、也最安全的办法。我们选了阁楼里的一间卧室，决定在那里度过余下的几个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:43691
    old "However, we didn't even last two hours before a wave of questions forced the lock open."
    new "然而，还没撑过两个小时，一连串疑问便逼得我们打开了门锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:43698
    old "I did my best to keep my mood positive, but every time I looked around me, I hated seeing where I was. I'd spent days avoiding the sun, and it had become what I wanted to see the most. On top of that, due to how little I'd slept, my head was constantly cloudy, and my body felt physically drained."
    new "我竭力让自己保持好心态，可每次环顾四周，我都厌恶自己所处的地方。这些天来我一直躲避阳光，它反而成了我最想见的东西。再加上我睡眠太少，脑子始终昏昏沉沉，身体也疲惫不堪。"

    # game/script.rpy:43702
    old "We had already accepted that the Sekimeiya wouldn't bring anything beneficial. It wouldn't let us change the past, and touching it would make us stay locked in the tower for longer. So I told Atsuki that we shouldn't do it again—the most important thing was making it out safely."
    new "我们早已接受 Sekimeiya 不会带来任何好处。它不会让我们改变过去，而触碰它只会让我们被困在这座塔里更久。所以我告诉 Atsuki，我们不该再这么做了——最重要的是平安离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:43707
    old "But all over the lowest floor was proof that the torment had continued, and when we opened the door to the security room, we saw that Katei, who'd been heavily suspected, had been killed as well."
    new "可最底层到处都留着折磨仍在持续的痕迹。我们打开监控室的门时，看到那个曾被重点怀疑的 Katei 也已经被杀了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43711
    old "In the opposite hallway was Erina's body, collapsed on the floor. Crushed from the sight, we walked to the center of the floor, wishing to be isolated so that we wouldn't become the next targets."
    new "对面走廊里，Erina 的尸体倒在地上。眼前的景象压得我们喘不过气，我们走到楼层中央，只求能独处，免得成为下一个目标。"

    # game/script.rpy:43718
    old "What made us leave was who Atsuki saw. According to him, he'd seen another version of me in the hallway."
    new "让我们离开的，是 Atsuki 看到的人。据他说，他在走廊里看见了另一个我。"

    # game/script.rpy:43722
    old "It didn't make sense. Who had he seen, and why? I didn't want to prolong our stay, but it seemed I had..."
    new "这说不通。他看见的是谁，又为什么会看见？我不想延长我们待在这里的时间，可看来我已经……"

    # game/script.rpy:43726
    old "When we took the elevator all the way down from the attic, we were intercepted. On the third floor, a sudden knife threatened to cut our lives short. Were we about to die too? There was no way we'd let that happen, so we ran as fast as we could."
    new "我们从阁楼乘电梯一路向下，半途却被人截住了。到三楼时，一把刀猝然袭来，险些要了我们的命。难道我们也要死了？绝不能让这种事发生，于是我们拼了命地奔逃。"

    # game/script.rpy:43730
    old "Through an exhausting chase, we heard the voice of our attacker. It was Sai, one of the people who'd been with us since that morning.{w} What had we done to be chased with a knife? His voice conveyed that attempting to ask that would be fatal."
    new "一场追逐耗尽了我们力气，我们也听清了追来者的声音——是 Sai，从那天早上起就一直和我们同行的人之一。{w} 我们究竟做了什么，竟招来持刀追杀？他的语气明明白白告诉我们：这话一旦问出口，就是死路一条。"

    # game/script.rpy:43735
    old "However, when the three of us ended up in the event room, his deadly gaze ceased."
    new "然而，当我们三人最终退进活动室时，他眼中的杀意便消散了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43740
    old "The moment he left the knife on the floor, our heart rates finally began to slow down. He revealed that he had to do something that required the use of the Sekimeiya in the cabinet."
    new "他把刀往地上一放，我们的心跳才终于慢慢平复下来。他说，自己有件事非做不可，而这件事需要用到展示柜里的 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:43748
    old "After we failed to find him in any of the rooms where he could've been, he managed to obtain the Sekimeiya and threatened to use it at any time. He made no effort at hiding that there was something he wanted to do upon activating it, so given what he'd done to us and that he had probably been behind some of the murders, we couldn't let him succeed."
    new "他可能藏身的房间我们逐一找过，却始终不见人影；而他已经拿到 Sekimeiya，还扬言随时都会动用。他毫不掩饰自己启动它之后有件事要办，再加上他先前对我们所做的一切，以及他多半与几起命案脱不了干系，我们绝不能让他得逞。"

    # game/script.rpy:43752
    old "While he continued taunting us, the range of the Sekimeiya increased. Minutes later, when he was about to touch it, Atsuki and I ran toward him to be encompassed in his travel."
    new "他一边继续出言挑衅，Sekimeiya 的覆盖范围一边在扩大。几分钟后，就在他即将触到它的一刻，我和 Atsuki 朝他冲了过去，好让自己被卷进他的穿越之中。"

    # game/script.rpy:43756
    old "Sai made contact with the Sekimeiya, but he didn't disappear. Only my surroundings did."
    new "Sai 碰到了 Sekimeiya，却没有消失。消失的只有我周围的一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:43761
    old "Karma"
    new "因果"

    # game/script.rpy:43775
    old "In front of me was Sai. Both of us had appeared in the right-hand bedroom of the attic.{w} When Sai's eyes met mine, he raised his eyebrows, hesitant to move."
    new "站在我面前的是 Sai。我们两人都出现在了阁楼右侧的卧室里。{w} Sai 与我目光相接，眉头一挑，迟迟没有动作。"

    # game/script.rpy:43780
    old "The knife almost fell from my grip, but I still held it in my right hand. I had picked it up in the event room when Sai purposely left it behind, and it didn't disappear after traveling."
    new "刀险些从手里滑落，但我仍用右手牢牢握着。这是 Sai 故意丢下后，我在活动室里捡起来的，穿越之后它也没有消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:43781
    old "What was it that you wanted to do?"
    new "你究竟想做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:43792
    old "He had reiterated many times that he had to go to the past to do something, but he didn't expect me to appear with him. I was in front of the door while he stared at the knife in my hand. If I didn't move, I could make sure to prevent whatever he wanted to do."
    new "他再三说过，自己必须回到过去办一件事，却没料到我会跟着他一起出现。我堵在门前，他则盯着我手里的刀。只要我不动，他就休想办成任何事。"

    # game/script.rpy:43796
    old "Then it's fine if we stay here, right? You only needed to travel to the past, so that shouldn't be a problem."
    new "那我们待在这里也没关系吧？你只要穿越到过去就够了，应该不碍事。"

    # game/script.rpy:43801
    old "Are you threatening me with that knife? You know these cameras are recording, don't you?"
    new "你是在拿那把刀威胁我？你知道这些摄像头都在录像吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:43802
    old "...We definitely only went some minutes into the past. We're going to spend them here until we get to the point we were at. Atsuki's not here, so he appeared somewhere else."
    new "……我们肯定只回溯了几分钟。在回到原本那个时刻之前，就在这里等着吧。Atsuki 不在这儿，看来他出现在别处了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43807
    old "You really are threatening me with a knife? How bizarre. I suppose we can stay here for a bit since that dumbass will probably search for us. I'm confused, though. Didn't really foresee this one."
    new "你还真拿刀威胁我？真是古怪。那就待在这儿一阵吧，反正那蠢货多半会来找我们。不过我倒是有点想不通，这一出我可没料到。"

    # game/script.rpy:43811
    old "What did you expect to happen?"
    new "你原本以为会发生什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:43812
    old "You can't really think I'll tell you anything while you have that pointed at me, right?"
    new "你不会真以为，刀尖指着我，我还会跟你说什么吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:43814
    old "I looked at the knife. Was I really threatening him...? He had chased us with it, and while it was fair, the thought of threatening someone with their own death was sickening."
    new "我看了看那把刀。我真的在威胁他吗……？他确实拿这把刀追过我们，以其人之道还治其人之身也无可厚非，可拿一个人的死来要挟他，终究令人作呕。"

    # game/script.rpy:43815
    old "...I'm confused. Why did we appear here? How is it possible that I appeared with the knife in the attic when I only had it in the event room?"
    new "……我不明白。我们为什么会出现在这里？可我明明是在活动室才拿到这把刀的，怎么可能带着它出现在阁楼？"

    # game/script.rpy:43820
    old "I recall telling you and Atsuki that you were wrong about what you said. You mean that you've never been in this bedroom with the knife, right?"
    new "我记得我跟你说过，也跟 Atsuki 说过，你们的说法是错的。你的意思是，你从没带着刀来过这间卧室，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:43826
    old "Maybe I was right and you were wrong, then."
    new "那也许是我对，你们错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43830
    old "Wait, what time is it?"
    new "等等，现在几点了？"

    # game/script.rpy:43840
    old "He looked at his wristwatch and sighed."
    new "他看了眼腕表，叹了口气。"

    # game/script.rpy:43841
    old "There's no current time."
    new "上面没显示当前时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:43843
    old "He showed me the tiny display from afar. It was blank."
    new "他从远处把小屏幕举给我看。上面一片空白。"

    # game/script.rpy:43844
    old "It stopped working? That's what Katei said happened earlier, right?"
    new "它坏了？之前 Katei 说的就是这个吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:43849
    old "Yes. It seems it wasn't the battery's problem, but the watch's. Even if it was working, it's unlikely it would display the real time anyway."
    new "嗯。看来问题不在电池，而在表本身。就算它还能走，显示的恐怕也不是真正的时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:43851
    old "Take a few steps back."
    new "往后退几步。"

    # game/script.rpy:43857
    old "...Just do it."
    new "……照做就是。"

    # game/script.rpy:43860
    old "He backed farther into the room without turning around. He could've run at me at any point, so I wanted to feel a little more secure."
    new "他没有转身，只是继续往房间深处退去。他随时都可能朝我扑来，我想让自己多一分安心。"

    # game/script.rpy:43864
    old "I walked to the drawer stand and opened the highest one while making sure Sai couldn't dash to the door."
    new "我走到抽屉柜前，一边拉开最上面那层，一边留意不让 Sai 有机会冲向门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:43867
    old "...Inside was the key to the bedroom. When we'd been running from Sai, we'd considered that he grabbed it to prevent us from locking ourselves inside, but it was still there."
    new "……里面是这间卧室的钥匙。被 Sai 追赶时，我们还以为他拿走钥匙，是为了不让我们把自己反锁在屋里，可它依旧在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:43873
    old "He saw me taking it out and frowned. Then, he began to slowly approach me."
    new "他看见我取出钥匙，眉头一皱，随即慢慢朝我靠近。"

    # game/script.rpy:43874
    old "Stop."
    new "站住。"

    # game/script.rpy:43879
    old "You wouldn't be thinking about locking me in here, right? That would be very mean."
    new "你该不会想把我锁在这里面吧？那可就太狠心了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43881
    old "That wasn't my intention. By attempting to trap him from outside, I would've given him a chance to push the door open and overpower me. That was why I wanted to lock the door from the inside, so that he couldn't simply rush to it and leave at any moment."
    new "我没这个打算。若想从外面把门锁死，反倒会给他推开门、反制我的机会。所以我才要从里面上锁，让他没法随时冲到门口一走了之。"

    # game/script.rpy:43887
    old "I inserted the key into the inner keyhole and turned it."
    new "我把钥匙插进内侧的锁孔，转动了一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:43893
    old "...You locked both of us in? Very courageous."
    new "……你把我们两个都锁在里面了？胆子不小。"

    # game/script.rpy:43894
    old "I dropped the key in my purse and zipped it. If Sai had been thinking about forcing his way out, that would make him less likely to attempt it."
    new "我把钥匙丢进手提包，拉上了拉链。Sai 若原本打算硬闯出去，这下也更不会轻易尝试了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43900
    old "I continued standing in front of the door, a little calmer than before."
    new "我仍旧守在门前，心绪比方才平静了些。"

    # game/script.rpy:43901
    old "For a while, Sai looked pensive and maybe even uncertain. Trying to decipher his thoughts had rarely proven useful."
    new "有一阵子，Sai 若有所思，甚至像是拿不定主意。想猜透他的心思，向来没什么用处。"

    # game/script.rpy:43902
    old "Are you going to tell me why you wanted to go to the past?"
    new "你打算告诉我，你为什么要回到过去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:43907
    old "Nope."
    new "不打算。"

    # game/script.rpy:43908
    old "Then are you fine staying here?"
    new "那你留在这里，没问题吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:43913
    old "...I suppose. This is all a little annoying."
    new "……算是吧。这一切实在有点烦人。"

    # game/script.rpy:43914
    old "...What are you thinking about? You seem pretty preoccupied."
    new "……你在想什么？看你一副心事重重的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:43915
    old "You want me to be honest? I'm thinking about whether I should kill you."
    new "你想听实话？我在想，要不要杀了你。"

    # game/script.rpy:43917
    old "That sent a chill through my body. He really had tried to kill Atsuki, and he was willing to kill me.{w} What we wanted was to leave the building safely, and by keeping Sai locked away, I'd intended to prevent more things from happening. ...I began to worry about my decision."
    new "我浑身一凉。他真的对 Atsuki 动过杀心，也真的愿意杀我。{w}我们只想安全离开这栋楼，我把 Sai 关起来，本是为了防止再出别的事。……想到这里，我开始怀疑自己的决定。"

    # game/script.rpy:43922
    old "Why do you look scared? You're the one with a knife."
    new "你怕什么？拿刀的人可是你。"

    # game/script.rpy:43928
    old "I suppose that was a little misleading. I'm not trying to kill you. As I said, I'm debating whether I should."
    new "刚才那话确实容易让人误会。我没打算杀你，只是像我说过的，在犹豫该不该动手。"

    # game/script.rpy:43929
    old "You remember what I said, right? You will die—that's a guarantee. Because I pretty much know it for a fact, I'm wondering whether I should make it happen myself.{w} Since I have confirmation of your death, it's very likely that if I try to push you into a wall, I'll kill you. I have no reason to think I'll end up safe, though. That knife you have is pretty scary, and I wouldn't want to be recorded."
    new "你还记得我说过的话吧？你会死——这是板上钉钉的事。我几乎可以肯定这一点，所以在想，要不要亲手让它成真。{w}既然我已经知道你会死，那只要我把你往墙上一推，很可能就真能要了你的命。不过我也没理由认为自己会平安无事。你手里那把刀挺吓人的，而且我不想被录下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:43930
    old "...Y-You're still saying that I'm going to die? Why...?"
    new "……你、你还说我一定会死？为什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:43931
    old "Because I've seen it. Are you really unaware that the blood in the lobby is yours?"
    new "因为我见过。大厅里那摊血是你的，你难道真不知道？"

    # game/script.rpy:43932
    old "It's not...! That wasn't my blood."
    new "不可能……！那不是我流的血。"

    # game/script.rpy:43937
    old "Then we go back to what I already said. I know what I'm saying for certain, but the details of it are a mystery to me.{w} I do feel bad for you. You were in a coma for a while, right? If I remember correctly, the name that was put out was yours. It's unfortunate that you'll die here after surviving that."
    new "那就回到我刚才说的。我很确定自己在说什么，可细节对我来说仍是个谜。{w}我确实有点同情你。你昏迷过一阵子吧？如果我没记错，当时对外公布的名单上写的是你的名字。好不容易挺过来，却要死在这里，实在可惜。"

    # game/script.rpy:43941
    old "I raised the knife to protect myself. The likelihood that he was telling the truth kept growing as he talked. Did that really mean that I was close to dying? Would it just be him who would do it? ...Or was he making it up to scare me?"
    new "我举起刀护住自己。随着他越说越多，我越发觉得他说的可能是真的。难道我真的已经离死不远了？动手的人一定是他吗？……还是说，这些只是他编来吓唬我的？"

    # game/script.rpy:43942
    old "I'd seen Atsuki's face when he'd been told about that supposed fate of mine. The way he'd looked, and nothing more, was enough motivation to fight for my life."
    new "Atsuki 被告知我那所谓的命运时，脸上的神情我看在眼里。光是那副神情，就足够让我拼死活下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:43947
    old "I'm trying to sympathize with you, but it's not easy when you're pointing that knife at me."
    new "我正试着体谅你，可你把刀指着我，这就很难办到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43948
    old "...Where did you even find this?"
    new "……这东西你到底是从哪儿找到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:43953
    old "Haven't I told you already? If you want to keep asking questions, don't repeat them."
    new "我不是已经说过了？要问就问点新的，别重复。"

    # game/script.rpy:43955
    old "His prediction that I would die had allowed him to assert control again, which was probably intentional. I tried to erase the worry from my face."
    new "他抛出我会死的预言，又重新掌控了局面——这多半是他有意为之。我努力不让不安显露在脸上。"

    # game/script.rpy:43960
    old "When I didn't say anything else, he went back to thinking. With a few steps of separation, we both stood, silently on alert."
    new "我不再开口，他便又陷入沉思。我们隔着几步距离相对而立，各自沉默地戒备着。"

    # game/script.rpy:43967
    old "Minutes later, nothing else had happened, but I'd realized one thing."
    new "几分钟过去，什么也没再发生，我却想明白了一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:43968
    old "We had gone some minutes to the past. Given that we hadn't heard anything around us, it was very likely we'd arrived at a time after Atsuki and I left the attic due to being chased."
    new "我们回到了几分钟前的过去。周围一直没有任何声响，我们抵达的时间点，很可能就在我和 Atsuki 被人追赶、离开阁楼之后。"

    # game/script.rpy:43969
    old "That meant that the entrance to the attic was locked, so if Atsuki hadn't also appeared inside, he had no way to reach us. I had no reason to think he would have appeared with the key."
    new "也就是说，阁楼的入口已经锁上了。如果 Atsuki 没有同样出现在里面，他就没办法来到我们这里。而我也没有理由认为他出现时会带着钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:43970
    old "I looked inside my purse and saw that the key to the attic was still inside. Just like the knife, it had appeared with me in the bedroom despite there being no possible location to be replicated that met those conditions..."
    new "我往手包里一看，阁楼的钥匙还在里面。和那把刀一样，它随我一同出现在了卧室里——尽管根本不存在符合条件的可复制地点……"

    # game/script.rpy:43977
    old "Hey, Shiroya, how much time do you think we traveled? It's not like we went an hour back, right? Twenty or thirty minutes, I'd say."
    new "喂，Shiroya，你觉得我们穿越了多久？总不至于往回跳了一个小时吧？我看也就二三十分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:43978
    old "He had taken a few steps closer without alerting me."
    new "他不知什么时候挪近了几步，我竟毫无察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:43979
    old "I-I don't know."
    new "我、我不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:43980
    old "Well, don't you think we've passed that threshold already? Shouldn't we get going?"
    new "那你不觉得我们早就过了那个时间点吗？我们是不是该走了？"

    # game/script.rpy:43982
    old "He wants to leave. Does that mean that he can still do what he wanted? It's not possible we went much farther back, is it...?"
    new "他想走了。这么说，他还能做他想做的事？我们总不可能穿越到太早的时候吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:43983
    old "Not going to say anything?"
    new "不说话了？"

    # game/script.rpy:43984
    old "I thought a bit more."
    new "我又想了想。"

    # game/script.rpy:43987
    old "I shouldn't believe anything that he says just because he sounds convincing. He's sounded convincing before at times when I knew for a fact he was lying."
    new "我不能因为他说得像那么回事就信他。以前他也有说得头头是道的时候，而我明明知道他是在撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:43988
    old "He knows more about how the Sekimeiya works but is refusing to say anything, so he has a reason to keep that to himself."
    new "他对 Sekimeiya 的运作知道得更多，却一个字也不肯说，可见他有理由把这些藏在心里。"

    # game/script.rpy:43989
    old "He definitely has something in mind, and maybe if he reveals it, whatever he's planning won't work. ...But I can make sure that it won't work as long as we stay here."
    new "他一定在盘算什么。也许只要他说出来，他的计划就成不了。……不过，只要我们留在这里，我就能确保它成不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43990
    old "The problem is Atsuki. If he could enter the attic, I could tell him what's happening without unlocking the door."
    new "问题在于 Atsuki。只要他能进阁楼，我就可以不开门把事情告诉他。"

    # game/script.rpy:43991
    old "If he didn't travel, around now is when he should start to search for us."
    new "如果他没有穿越，差不多就是这时候该开始找我们了。"

    # game/script.rpy:43992
    old "I couldn't decide. It was very possible that the force behind most of what had happened throughout the day was Sai. There wasn't a lot of time left until {time=21}, and if I could seclude him during that last stretch, we had the chance to leave safely."
    new "我拿不定主意。这一天里大半的事，背后很可能都是 Sai 在推动。离 {time=21} 已经不远，只要最后这段时间能把他隔离起来，我们就有机会平安离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:43995
    old "Naomi, Isla, Katei, and Erina have died. The people behind that had to be either Sai or Akaro."
    new "Naomi、Isla、Katei 和 Erina 都死了。幕后的人只可能是 Sai 或 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:43996
    old "And the recorder, which has contents that are practically impossible, could've been arranged with Sai, Akaro, and Isla. Not only that, but Sai had a knife, and he already proved to be a deadly threat to Atsuki and probably me. If we just stay here, he won't be able to harm him or use the Sekimeiya again."
    new "至于那支录音笔，里面的内容几乎不可能是真的，也许是 Sai、Akaro 和 Isla 一起安排的。不止如此，Sai 手里有刀，已经证明他对 Atsuki 是致命的威胁，对我多半也是。只要我们留在这儿，他就伤不了 Atsuki，也无法再动用 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:43997
    old "Of course, the recording itself was fabricated using the Sekimeiya. Sai knows the most about it, so he's the perfect person to be responsible for it. ...Why would he create that? Why would Isla have it?"
    new "当然，录音本身是用 Sekimeiya 造出来的。最了解它的人是 Sai，由他来动手再合适不过。……可他为什么要造出那种东西？为什么会在 Isla 手里？"

    # game/script.rpy:43998
    old "If he's been lying recently... Why would he say that I'll die or that the blood in the lobby is mine? That's impossible. That blood can't be mine, so why would he say it?{w} It matches with the recording because I wasn't mentioned once in it. Could it be that he's consistently trying follow a story that he's set up?"
    new "如果他最近一直在撒谎……那他为什么说我会死，说大厅里的血是我的？这不可能。那血不可能是我的，他为什么要这么说？{w}倒是和录音对得上——录音里一次都没提到我。难道他一直在照着自己编好的剧本走？"

    # game/script.rpy:43999
    old "And either way, I can't die as long as we stay here and I protect myself. Does that mean that if I decide to leave, Sai's claims become the truth?"
    new "再说，不管怎样，只要留在这里、护住自己，我就不会死。这是否意味着，一旦我决定离开，Sai 的说法就会成真？"

    # game/script.rpy:44004
    old "I can't decide. ...Because if Sai isn't the culprit, then it's Akaro, who could be anywhere, and then Atsuki would be up against him alone.{w} Both Akaro and Sai have acted suspicious in their own ways, and Sai sounded hostile toward him earlier. ...But that could easily be a trick since they escaped the bedroom together."
    new "我下不了决心。……因为如果凶手不是 Sai，那就是 Akaro；他可能在任何地方，而 Atsuki 就得独自面对他。{w}Akaro 和 Sai 各有各的可疑之处，Sai 之前对他也语带敌意。……可他们是一起逃出卧室的，那点敌意很可能只是演戏。"

    # game/script.rpy:44005
    old "On the other hand, if Akaro's the one we need to worry about, it's hard to imagine we'll be able to do anything to stop him even after leaving the bedroom."
    new "反过来说，如果真正要提防的是 Akaro，那么就算离开卧室，我也想不出我们能有什么办法拦住他。"

    # game/script.rpy:44006
    old "...So keeping Sai shut in here is the safest move. The only real problem is that I can't tell Atsuki what's happening unless he gets into the attic."
    new "……所以，把 Sai 关在这里才是最稳妥的。唯一的问题是，Atsuki 不进阁楼，我就没法把情况告诉他。"

    # game/script.rpy:44008
    old "...Hello?"
    new "……喂？"

    # game/script.rpy:44013
    old "...{w}I won't move."
    new "……{w}我不会走的。"

    # game/script.rpy:44018
    old "What? ...Why? That's not what you said earlier."
    new "什么？……为什么？你刚才可不是这么说的。"

    # game/script.rpy:44019
    old "You tried to kill Atsuki and threatened me. There's no way I'll just let you go."
    new "你试图杀了 Atsuki，还威胁过我。我怎么可能就这么放你走。"

    # game/script.rpy:44024
    old "Hey, aren't you the one currently threatening me?"
    new "喂，现在威胁我的人难道不是你吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:44031
    old "Are you sure you can do this? Will you kill me if I try to unlock the door and leave? Remember that you're being recorded."
    new "你确定自己下得了手？我要是开门离开，你会杀了我吗？别忘了，你正被录着。"

    # game/script.rpy:44033
    old "You shouldn't try it.{w} Also, I don't think the cameras are recording."
    new "你最好别试。{w}再说，我看那些摄像头根本没在录。"

    # game/script.rpy:44038
    old "I shouldn't? There's a time travel device downstairs, so I'm having trouble understanding why I shouldn't try to resist abandoning it."
    new "最好别试？楼下就摆着时间穿越装置，我可真想不通，自己为什么非得乖乖放弃它。"

    # game/script.rpy:44039
    old "Is that what you want? The Sekimeiya for yourself?"
    new "这就是你想要的？把 Sekimeiya 据为己有？"

    # game/script.rpy:44040
    old "It would be pretty stupid to deny that. I'm sure you wouldn't turn it away either."
    new "否认这一点才叫蠢。换成是你，也绝不会把它推开吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:44042
    old "I didn't want to humor him anymore."
    new "我不想再顺着他了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44044
    old "He didn't say anything else, so the quiet returned."
    new "他没再说什么，四下重归安静。"

    # game/script.rpy:44048
    old "Is that it? Have we decided that we'll spend the rest of our time in here? It should only be a bit more than two hours unless we went really far back, which wouldn't make sense."
    new "就这？我们真打算把剩下的时间都耗在这儿？除非我们回到了很久以前——可那说不通——否则应该只剩两个多小时才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:44053
    old "I'd spent a large amount of time standing up, so I sat on the bed. I took the strap of my purse from around my neck so that Sai wouldn't knock me down if he pulled on it and left it at my side."
    new "我已经站了很久，便在床上坐下。我把包带从脖子上取下，放到身侧，免得 Sai 一拽就把我连人带包拖倒。"

    # game/script.rpy:44054
    old "He paid no mind to it and kept looking at the floor."
    new "他对此毫不在意，依旧盯着地面。"

    # game/script.rpy:44055
    old "I still felt severely conflicted and worried about Atsuki's situation. Although the more I thought, the more I felt I couldn't let Sai free, and it was highly unlikely I could successfully lock him in from outside."
    new "我心里依然矛盾得厉害，也担心 Atsuki 的处境。可想得越多，越觉得不能放 Sai 走；而从外面把他锁在屋里，我又几乎做不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:44056
    old "Time kept moving in the silent attic. We must have been alone, as the lack of sound was overwhelming."
    new "寂静的阁楼里，时间仍在流逝。这里应该只有我们两个人——安静得让人透不过气来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44062
    old "Eventually, Sai stood up without opening his mouth. That was the first noise I'd heard in minutes, and I stared at him curiously."
    new "终于，Sai 一言不发地站了起来。那是几分钟里我听到的第一点动静，我好奇地望向他。"

    # game/script.rpy:44063
    old "He slowly stepped to the door with his empty hands raised."
    new "他举着空空的双手，慢慢走向门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:44065
    old "I saw him gripping the handle, and my heart sped up with uncertainty. However, when he tried to open the door, the lock prevented it."
    new "见他握住门把手，我的心因不安而狂跳。可他试着开门时，锁却纹丝不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:44071
    old "...Oh, it's locked. Right."
    new "……哦，锁着的。也对。"

    # game/script.rpy:44074
    old "By the way, you never reattached the chain, right?"
    new "话说回来，那条链子你一直没装回去吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:44075
    old "The chain? What are you talking about?"
    new "链子？你在说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:44084
    old "He shook his head and retreaded his steps."
    new "他摇摇头，沿着原路走了回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44085
    old "I saw his nonchalant look while I was still frowning."
    new "我还皱着眉，他却一脸若无其事。"

    # game/script.rpy:44086
    old "Did you just try to leave?"
    new "你刚才是不是想溜出去？"

    # game/script.rpy:44091
    old "Absolutely not."
    new "绝对没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:44092
    old "...{w}Is this how you and Akaro escaped the bedroom the last time? That was what Atsuki suspected."
    new "……{w}上次你和 Akaro 就是这么从卧室逃出去的？Atsuki 是这么怀疑的。"

    # game/script.rpy:44097
    old "By trying to open a locked door?"
    new "靠试着开一扇锁着的门？"

    # game/script.rpy:44098
    old "By opening it and then going back in time to unlock it. Did you wait until now to try it because it was unlikely it would've worked earlier?"
    new "先把它打开，再回到过去把锁解开。你拖到现在才试，是因为更早的时候多半行不通？"

    # game/script.rpy:44103
    old "You're incorrect."
    new "你猜错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44109
    old "He approached the drawer stand and took the screwdriver out of it."
    new "他走到抽屉柜前，从里面取出螺丝刀。"

    # game/script.rpy:44110
    old "...What's that for?"
    new "……拿那个做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:44115
    old "Don't worry, I don't want to use it as a weapon. Who reattached the handles?"
    new "放心，我没打算拿它当武器。这门把手是谁装回去的？"

    # game/script.rpy:44116
    old "...It was me and Atsuki, after everyone left."
    new "……大家都走了以后，我和 Atsuki 装的。"

    # game/script.rpy:44121
    old "You didn't do it right, then. From here, I noticed it was a little loose, and I just turned it to see if I was right. You didn't attach it properly."
    new "那就是装错了。我在这儿就看出它有点松，随手拧了一下，看看自己猜得对不对。你们没装好。"

    # game/script.rpy:44126
    old "I looked at the handle and didn't see anything wrong with it."
    new "我看了看把手，没看出哪里不对。"

    # game/script.rpy:44132
    old "Holding the screwdriver, Sai stepped to the door again. I moved back a little, afraid of the sharply pointed tool."
    new "Sai 拿着螺丝刀又走到门边。那东西尖得吓人，我往后挪了挪。"

    # game/script.rpy:44133
    old "He inserted it into one of the screws and removed it. Then, he unscrewed the one in the opposite corner while I stared, dumbfounded. I didn't know what he was doing, but messing with the handle wouldn't let him open the door."
    new "他把螺丝刀插进一颗螺丝，将它拧下；接着又去拧对角那颗。我目瞪口呆地看着。我不知道他在做什么，可摆弄门把手也开不了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:44134
    old "See? These two go in the bottom. You swapped them."
    new "看见没？这两颗应该装在下面。你们装反了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44135
    old "...What are you talking about? They're the same."
    new "……你在说什么？它们明明一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:44138
    old "He ignored me and unscrewed the last two, which dropped the handle to the floor."
    new "他没理我，把最后两颗也拧了下来，把手随之落到地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:44139
    old "No, they aren't. You don't understand much about screws, do you?"
    new "不，不一样。你对螺丝还真是一窍不通啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:44146
    old "I stood up."
    new "我站了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44147
    old "Move away. I don't know what you're trying to do, but stop."
    new "退开。我不管你想干什么，都给我停下。"

    # game/script.rpy:44153
    old "...I'm not trying to do anything, though. Do you not want me to attach it properly?"
    new "……可我什么都没打算做啊。你是不想让我把它装好吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:44154
    old "No. Step back."
    new "不行。退后。"

    # game/script.rpy:44159
    old "He sighed and backed off."
    new "他叹了口气，退开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44164
    old "...I guess I locked myself in even further."
    new "……看来我反倒把自己关得更死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44167
    old "He left the screwdriver in the drawer and looked at his feet, biting his lower lip."
    new "他把螺丝刀留在抽屉里，低头盯着自己的脚，咬着下唇。"

    # game/script.rpy:44171
    old "...I sat back on the bed."
    new "……我重新坐回床上。"

    # game/script.rpy:44178
    old "Soon after, out of nowhere, he sat on the other side of it."
    new "没过多久，他忽然在床的另一边坐下。"

    # game/script.rpy:44179
    old "Don't sit here."
    new "别坐这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:44184
    old "What? That's just rude. I'm tired."
    new "什么？你这也太没礼貌了。我累了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44185
    old "Stand up."
    new "起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44190
    old "*sigh* Fine."
    new "*sigh* 好吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:44197
    old "But instead of standing up, with a very quick motion, he extended his arm toward me. Startled, I looked down and saw he'd unzipped my purse."
    new "可他并没有起身，而是突然伸手过来。我一惊，低头一看，发现他已经拉开了我手提包的拉链。"

    # game/script.rpy:44203
    old "I stood up fast enough, tightly gripping my purse and the knife."
    new "我飞快地站起身，紧紧攥住手提包和刀。"

    # game/script.rpy:44208
    old "Well, damn it."
    new "啧……真该死。"

    # game/script.rpy:44209
    old "My heart quickly calmed down as I stared at his childish expression."
    new "看着他孩子气的表情，我的心跳很快便平复下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44212
    old "What the fuck are you doing...!?"
    new "你到底在搞什么……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:44213
    old "It was just a joke. I couldn't have left anyway since you have that knife with you."
    new "开个玩笑而已。反正刀在你手上，我也走不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44214
    old "...{w}You remember what you asked earlier, right? Yes, if you get close to me again, I will use the knife. Don't move again."
    new "……{w}你还记得我刚才说过什么吧？没错，你要是再靠近我，我就用刀。别再动了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44219
    old "All right. You can't even take a simple joke."
    new "行吧。连个玩笑都开不起。"

    # game/script.rpy:44222
    old "He let his body fall and lay on the bed, yawning while face-down."
    new "他任身子倒下去，趴在床上，打了个哈欠。"

    # game/script.rpy:44223
    old "...Stand up."
    new "……起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44224
    old "I don't think so. Sorry, I just wanted the bed for myself. You told me not to get close to you, so I won't. I'm tired—I said so earlier."
    new "我可不这么想。抱歉，我只是想独占这张床。你说过不让我靠近你，那我就不靠近。我累了——刚才就说过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44231
    old "I didn't care anymore. I approached the desk and sat on it, resting my back on my purse and protecting it against the wall."
    new "我已经不在乎了。我走到书桌边坐上去，把手提包垫在背后抵着墙。"

    # game/script.rpy:44234
    old "There you go. That's much better."
    new "这才对嘛。这样好多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44235
    old "He repositioned his face on the pillow and closed his eyes.{w} ...A couple of minutes later, he hadn't moved at all."
    new "他把脸在枕头上挪了挪，闭上眼睛。{w}……好几分钟过去了，他纹丝不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:44241
    old "I'd buried my face in my knees. What was happening outside the attic? A piercing pain had arisen in my chest, and there was no getting rid of it."
    new "我把脸埋进膝盖里。阁楼外面究竟发生了什么？胸口泛起一阵尖锐的痛，怎么也挥之不去。"

    # game/script.rpy:44242
    old "I began to heavily regret my decision when I considered the possibility that I wouldn't see Atsuki again. ...What if he had already been attacked?"
    new "一想到也许再也见不到 Atsuki，我便深深后悔起自己的决定。……万一他已经遭到袭击了呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:44245
    old "I raised my eyes and saw Sai still lying down."
    new "我抬眼看去，Sai 还躺着。"

    # game/script.rpy:44246
    old "There's no way he won't hear me if I try to leave, right...?"
    new "我要是想走，他不可能听不见吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:44248
    old "I jumped back a little when he moved. After a long yawn, he sat up and stretched his arms."
    new "他一动，我吓得往后缩了一下。他打了个长长的哈欠，坐起身来伸展双臂。"

    # game/script.rpy:44254
    old "He saw me staring at him but didn't react. Instead, he crouched to grab the handle from the floor, stood up, and turned around."
    new "他察觉我在盯着他，却毫无反应，只是蹲下身从地上捡起门把手，站起来转过身去。"

    # game/script.rpy:44257
    old "I heard a sound, but I didn't believe it. Regardless, the door opened, and Sai removed the key he'd inserted into the keyhole."
    new "我听到了响动，却不敢相信。不管怎样，门开了，Sai 从锁孔里拔出了他插进去的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:44263
    old "I didn't run to the door because I knew I was doomed. The handle was detached, so as soon as I stood up, Sai would close the door, locking me in behind him. Frozen, all I could do was ask what had happened."
    new "我没有冲过去，因为我知道自己已经完了。门把手已经拆掉，只要我一站起来，Sai 就会把门关上，把我反锁在里面。我呆立原地，只能开口问他这是怎么回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:44269
    old "You really didn't see that I took the key from your purse? You thought I'd only unzipped it? I have it right here."
    new "你真没看见我从你包里拿走了钥匙？你以为我只是拉开了拉链？钥匙就在我这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:44270
    old "I couldn't believe it, but he had the key in his left hand. While I processed what he'd said, his smile widened."
    new "我不敢相信，可钥匙确实在他左手上。我还在琢磨他的话，他脸上的笑意却更深了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44271
    old "W-Wait... Is this why you removed the handle?"
    new "等、等等……你拆掉门把手就是为了这个？"

    # game/script.rpy:44276
    old "Of course. Otherwise, it's unlikely I could've repaid the favor and locked you in. I figured it was only fair. I can't believe you didn't realize I wanted the bed for myself just to be closer to the door than you. You're not very smart, are you?"
    new "当然。不这样，我哪能还你一手，把你锁在里面？我觉得这才算公平。你竟然没发现，我要独占这张床，只是想比你离门更近一点。你还真是不太机灵啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:44277
    old "Sai, what are you—"
    new "Sai，你这是——"

    # game/script.rpy:44282
    old "Now, goodbye. I have things to do."
    new "那么，再见了。我还有事要办。"

    # game/script.rpy:44294
    old "From the hallway, I heard Sai locking the door. That didn't matter, because even if he left it unlocked, I had no way to leave."
    new "我听见 Sai 在走廊里锁上了门。这也无所谓了，就算他不锁，我也出不去。"

    # game/script.rpy:44298
    old "Still trying to wrap my head around what had happened, I stood up slowly and approached the door."
    new "我还没弄明白到底发生了什么，就慢慢起身走向门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:44302
    old "I couldn't open it. It was exactly the same way all of us had previously locked ourselves in that very bedroom. Sai had left with the handle and the key, so I knew I had no way to get out."
    new "我打不开。这和我们之前把自己反锁在那间卧室里时一模一样。Sai 带着门把手和钥匙走了，我知道自己再也出不去。"

    # game/script.rpy:44303
    old "No... Now Atsuki's definitely in danger."
    new "不行……这样 Atsuki 肯定有危险了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44305
    old "Sai...! Come back! Just for a second...!"
    new "Sai……！回来！就一下……！"

    # game/script.rpy:44307
    old "There was no response. The attic felt just as desolate as when Sai had been there.{w} I noticed that I still had the knife in my hand. I slid it through the gap of the door, trying to push open the latch."
    new "没有回应。阁楼和 Sai 在时一样冷清。{w}我这才发觉手里还握着刀，便把它从门缝里探进去，想顶开门闩。"

    # game/script.rpy:44308
    old "I frantically moved my arm up and down, but it simply got stuck in the middle."
    new "我拼命地上下晃动手臂，刀却卡在中间，纹丝不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:44313
    old "Sai...!"
    new "Sai……！"

    # game/script.rpy:44322
    old "I knew he wouldn't come back. Trying to calm my nerves, I sat on the bed."
    new "我知道他不会回来了。我坐到床上，想让心绪平静下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44323
    old "I'm sure he used the elevator because he shouldn't be able to leave through the main door. That means the attic is still locked. Not even he should be able to enter again once he leaves."
    new "他一定是坐电梯走的，因为他应该没法从正门出去。也就是说，阁楼还锁着。就算是他，出去之后应该也没法再进来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44324
    old "Or maybe that's not right. ...When Atsuki and I locked ourselves in the attic, Sai was able to come in anyway."
    new "不对，也许不是这样。……当初我和 Atsuki 把自己锁在阁楼里，Sai 还不是照样进来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44326
    old "Is there nothing I can do...? I can't take this door down."
    new "难道我真的无计可施……？这扇门我拆不掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:44331
    old "I tried to go over ways to leave, but I couldn't think of anything. All at once, the overwhelming stress came back."
    new "我试着想各种脱身的办法，却一无所获。铺天盖地的压力一下子又涌了上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44335
    old "My hand began to hurt, so I stopped pounding on the door. There was no way for me to reach anyone or for anyone to reach me. Inside a locked building, on a locked floor, I was trapped in that locked room."
    new "手开始疼了，我只好不再砸门。我联系不上任何人，也没有人能联系到我。锁死的大楼，锁死的楼层，我困在这间锁死的房里。"

    # game/script.rpy:44339
    old "I realized I hadn't gone to the higher level of the bedroom. I climbed up the ladder, but I couldn't find anything. The only traces of life were the messy sheets from the time we'd been waiting there."
    new "我这才想起自己还没去过卧室的上层。我爬上梯子，却什么也没找到。唯一能看出有人待过的痕迹，就是我们在那里等候时弄乱的床单。"

    # game/script.rpy:44343
    old "Would I have to spend two hours there? I could only feel the piercing pain strengthening, threatening to eventually leave me breathless."
    new "难道要我在这里待上两个小时？我只觉得那阵刺痛越来越强，仿佛终将逼得我喘不过气来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44344
    old "I have the only key to the attic Katei mentioned. ...There's no way the police won't have another one, right...?"
    new "Katei 提过的那间阁楼，钥匙只有我这一把。……警察总不可能没有备用钥匙吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:44345
    old "...At least I have the knife, so Sai won't be able to use it, and he said he didn't want to harm Atsuki anymore."
    new "……至少刀在我手上，Sai 用不了。而且他说过，不想再伤害 Atsuki 了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44349
    old "Why did we have to come here...? We should've just stayed home..."
    new "我们为什么非要来这儿……？待在家里就好了……"

    # game/script.rpy:44350
    old "I hated it, but I couldn't avoid thinking about the worst possibilities. The thought of losing my two friends in as many weeks was unbearable."
    new "我讨厌这样，却又无法不去想最坏的可能。两周之内连失两位朋友，这念头我实在承受不住。"

    # game/script.rpy:44351
    old "Every time I managed to calm my thoughts, they returned, more and more terrifying. It was impossible for me to fall asleep, and the pain in my chest increased if I tried to lie down."
    new "每次好不容易让思绪平静下来，那些念头又会卷土重来，而且一次比一次可怕。我根本睡不着，一躺下胸口就疼得更厉害。"

    # game/script.rpy:44352
    old "I spent the time thinking miserably in front of the door, the persistent fear that I might've let the killer run free with Atsuki unprotected eating away at me."
    new "我就守在门前，满心凄苦地想着。那份挥之不去的恐惧不断啃噬着我：也许是我放走了凶手，让 Atsuki 失去了保护。"

    # game/script.rpy:44359
    old "Even after what I'd already experienced, the way I felt then was far beyond anything I'd ever known. If I could describe Miiya's death as an earthquake, I was experiencing one an order of magnitude higher."
    new "即便已经历过那么多，我那时的感受仍远超以往任何一次。如果 Miiya 的死算一场地震，那我此刻承受的，震级要高出整整一个数量级。"

    # game/script.rpy:44360
    old "It hadn't been easy to accept her death, and I, of course, still hadn't moved past it. But it was incomparable. Knowing for a fact that a friend had died was far less of a strain than fearing that a friend could be about to die."
    new "接受她的死并不容易，我当然也至今没能走出来。但两者不可同日而语。确知朋友已经死去，远不如担心朋友可能即将死去那样煎熬。"

    # game/script.rpy:44361
    old "Both were horrific, but only one of them involved fear, and Atsuki being in danger potentially due to my own failure only made it worse. I imagined that if any kind of hell existed, the way I felt while alone in that room must have come close."
    new "两者都可怕，但只有后者带着恐惧；而 Atsuki 身陷险境，还可能是我自己的失误造成的，这让一切更加难熬。我想，若世上真有地狱，我独自待在那间房里时的感受，大概也与之相去不远。"

    # game/script.rpy:44362
    old "...o that? ...uki?"
    new "……那样做？……uki？"

    # game/script.rpy:44366
    old "I looked back abruptly the moment a voice reached my ears. More than ten minutes had passed when I perceived that sound coming from directly behind the door."
    new "一听到声音，我猛地回过头。等我察觉那声音是直接从门后传来时，已经过了十多分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:44367
    old "Hey! Are you there!?"
    new "喂！你在吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:44369
    old "Was that Sai...? Nobody else could've entered the attic."
    new "那是 Sai 的声音……？除了他，没人能进得了阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:44370
    old "Open the door! Who are you!?"
    new "开门！你是什么人！？"

    # game/script.rpy:44373
    old "There was no response."
    new "没有回应。"

    # game/script.rpy:44374
    old "I didn't imagine it, right?"
    new "我没有听错吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:44375
    old "I hadn't—there was another sound. The other bedroom opened."
    new "我没听错——又是一声响。另一间卧室的门开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44382
    old "Once again, there was no response."
    new "依旧没有回应。"

    # game/script.rpy:44383
    old "Is Sai ignoring me? Either that, or someone traveled to the attic."
    new "Sai 是在无视我吗？还是说，有人穿越到了阁楼？"

    # game/script.rpy:44388
    old "I breathed hoarsely before letting out more exhausted yells."
    new "我沙哑地喘了口气，又精疲力竭地喊了几声。"

    # game/script.rpy:44391
    old "He just walked away...!"
    new "他就这么走开了……！"

    # game/script.rpy:44392
    old "Please! At least say something!"
    new "求你了！至少说句话！"

    # game/script.rpy:44396
    old "Rather than exert myself any further, I simply focused my hearing. It made no difference."
    new "我不再白费力气，只是凝神细听。可结果还是一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:44397
    old "What are you doing!? Please, come back!"
    new "你在干什么！？求你了，回来！"

    # game/script.rpy:44402
    old "What is he doing...?"
    new "他到底在做什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:44405
    old "Hey...!"
    new "喂……！"

    # game/script.rpy:44408
    old "All I could hear were my desperate breaths."
    new "耳中只剩自己急促的呼吸声。"

    # game/script.rpy:44409
    old "Did he only now leave the attic, then?"
    new "难道他这时才离开阁楼？"

    # game/script.rpy:44414
    old "I defeatedly fell on the bed."
    new "我颓然倒在床上。"

    # game/script.rpy:44417
    old "Soon, my vision began to fade. I'd drained some of the scarce energy I had."
    new "没过多久，视野开始模糊。我本就所剩无几的力气，又被耗去了一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:44418
    old "Thankfully, the inside of my head had gone numb, so I could finally stop thinking. The lancing pain in my chest intensified, but I was able to withstand it."
    new "幸好脑子里已经麻木，我终于能停下思考。胸口的刺痛一阵阵加剧，我却还忍得住。"

    # game/script.rpy:44419
    old "Minutes were passing by, but it didn't feel like it. I didn't close my eyes or try to relax. The only thing I could feel was despair."
    new "时间一分一秒地过去，我却毫无实感。我没有闭眼，也没有试着放松。唯一能感受到的，只有绝望。"

    # game/script.rpy:44424
    old "Uh... What the fuck?"
    new "呃……搞什么鬼？"

    # game/script.rpy:44428
    old "A new voice. That time, it came from the room I was in, and I recognized it."
    new "又传来一个声音。这次是从我待的房间里传来的，而且我认得这声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:44435
    old "I lifted my head without thinking and saw Sai standing in the middle of the bedroom. As soon as he saw me, he dashed toward the door, but I rapidly stood up as I grabbed the knife next to me."
    new "我不由自主地抬起头，看见 Sai 站在卧室中央。他一见到我，立刻朝门口冲去，而我也迅速起身，抓起了身旁的刀。"

    # game/script.rpy:44441
    old "H-Hey, chill with that."
    new "喂、喂，把那玩意儿放下。"

    # game/script.rpy:44445
    old "He stepped back while I tried to understand what was happening."
    new "他后退了一步，而我还在试图弄清发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:44446
    old "Did I really travel to this goddamn bedroom? That's just unfortunate.{w} What's with that look? You're still here? How long has it been? ...I guess I just trapped myself."
    new "我还真穿越到这种鬼卧室来了？真是倒霉透顶。{w}你那是什么表情？你还在这儿？过了多久了？……看来我是把自己给困住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44449
    old "I cleared my throat, feeling unable to speak."
    new "我清了清嗓子，却发现说不出话。"

    # game/script.rpy:44450
    old "...D-Did you just travel from the future?"
    new "……你、你是从未来穿越过来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:44455
    old "Yeah, maybe. How long have you been here?"
    new "算是吧。你在这里待了多久？"

    # game/script.rpy:44457
    old "I looked at his wristwatch, but the display was still blank."
    new "我看向他的手表，表盘上依旧一片空白。"

    # game/script.rpy:44458
    old "Do you have the key?"
    new "钥匙在你手上吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:44463
    old "...The key? No.{w} Answer my question. How long has it been since I left?"
    new "……钥匙？没有。{w}先回答我。我离开之后过了多久？"

    # game/script.rpy:44464
    old "I don't know, maybe half an hour! Show me what you have!"
    new "我不知道，大概半小时吧！把你身上的东西都拿出来给我看！"

    # game/script.rpy:44470
    old "I approached him slowly, staying at a distance that prevented him from grabbing the knife. If he still had the key he'd snatched from my purse, I had to leave immediately."
    new "我慢慢靠近他，始终保持着让他够不到刀的距离。他要是还拿着从我包里抢走的钥匙，我就必须马上离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:44475
    old "Don't you get that it's impossible I still have the key? It's like you said a while ago.{w} I just appeared in the middle of this bedroom, looking at the door. Obviously, that coordinate is from the time you were in front of the door, pointing the knife at me. At that point, I didn't have the key yet."
    new "你还不明白吗，我不可能还拿着那把钥匙。就像你刚才说的。{w}我一出现就在这间卧室中央，面朝门口。显然，那个坐标对应的是你站在门口拿刀指着我的时候。那时候我还没拿到钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:44476
    old "...Just show me your pockets."
    new "……把口袋都翻出来给我看。"

    # game/script.rpy:44481
    old "Sure. I can do that."
    new "行，没问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:44482
    old "...Start with your hip pack."
    new "……先从腰包开始。"

    # game/script.rpy:44483
    old "My hip pack? Of course."
    new "腰包？好啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:44484
    old "He unzipped it. Inside, I noticed a key that he hadn't had in the past."
    new "他拉开拉链。里面有一把钥匙，而过去他身上并没有这把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:44489
    old "Hey, it's not for this bedroom."
    new "喂，这可不是这间卧室的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:44490
    old "He handed it to me."
    new "他把钥匙递给我。"

    # game/script.rpy:44493
    old "This is for the bathrooms, right? Did you kill Katei?"
    new "这是洗手间的钥匙吧？你杀了 Katei？"

    # game/script.rpy:44498
    old "I wouldn't do that to him. It would be like punching a kid for getting into the cookies, they don't know better. Anyway, let's continue."
    new "我怎么会对他下手。那就像小孩偷吃饼干就揍他一顿一样，小孩子懂什么。总之，继续吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:44502
    old "I left the bathroom key on the drawer stand. Then, Sai placed a hand on the right pocket of his pants and highlighted the outline of a key. Following that, he took it out."
    new "我把洗手间的钥匙放在抽屉柜上。接着，Sai 把手按在裤子右口袋上，让钥匙的轮廓透出来，随后把它掏了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44507
    old "It was the key to the Sekimeiya cabinet."
    new "那是 Sekimeiya 展示柜的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:44512
    old "He kept it and continued by putting his hand in his left pocket."
    new "他收起钥匙，又把手伸进左边的口袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:44513
    old "No. ...Stop."
    new "不。……停下。"

    # game/script.rpy:44519
    old "Show me everything you have in the other pocket."
    new "把另一个口袋里的东西全拿出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44520
    old "What? I just showed what I had."
    new "什么？我不是已经把东西都拿出来了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:44521
    old "...Do it."
    new "……照做。"

    # game/script.rpy:44523
    old "He put his hand inside the right pocket and brought out another key."
    new "他把手伸进右边的口袋，又掏出一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:44529
    old "Oh, shit. Isn't this the key to this very bedroom?"
    new "糟了。这不就是这间卧室的钥匙吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:44531
    old "Give it to me."
    new "给我。"

    # game/script.rpy:44537
    old "...Fucking Atsuki. How did he get me with this?"
    new "……该死的 Atsuki。他居然用这个摆了我一道。"

    # game/script.rpy:44538
    old "I left the key on the drawer stand and looked at Sai sternly."
    new "我把钥匙放到抽屉柜上，严厉地盯着 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:44539
    old "That's the key to the other bedroom.{w} Take your hand out of the pocket."
    new "那是另一间卧室的钥匙。{w}把手从口袋里拿出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44545
    old "Turn it inside out."
    new "把口袋翻过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44547
    old "Hesitantly, he did so.{w} One last key remained inside."
    new "他犹豫着照做了。{w}里面还剩最后一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:44552
    old "What the fuck? What were these doing in my pocket?"
    new "搞什么鬼？这些东西怎么会在我的口袋里？"

    # game/script.rpy:44553
    old "So he had the key because he touched the Sekimeiya with it, just like how I appeared here with the knife because I had it when I traveled. ...Atsuki and I were definitely wrong."
    new "所以钥匙在他身上，是因为他碰 Sekimeiya 时带着它；就像我出现在这里时还拿着刀，也是因为我穿越时正拿着它。……我和 Atsuki 确实都猜错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44563
    old "Hm... You can't expect me to give you anything when you're pointing at me with that scary knife."
    new "嗯……你拿着那么吓人的刀指着我，还指望我乖乖把东西交出去？"

    # game/script.rpy:44565
    old "I'm not approaching you to give you anything."
    new "我走近你，可不是为了给你什么东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:44566
    old "Then just throw it!"
    new "那就扔过来！"

    # game/script.rpy:44571
    old "I've had too many awkward moments trying to do that."
    new "我试过好几回，每次都弄得很尴尬。"

    # game/script.rpy:44572
    old "Sai, throw me the key."
    new "Sai，把钥匙扔给我。"

    # game/script.rpy:44578
    old "All right, we'll do the following."
    new "行，那我们这样办。"

    # game/script.rpy:44581
    old "He turned around and began to quickly climb up the ladder."
    new "他转过身，顺着梯子飞快地爬了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:44582
    old "What are you doing!? Come down!"
    new "你干什么！？下来！"

    # game/script.rpy:44583
    old "I didn't even have time to consider following him. Seconds after he had disappeared from view, he jumped back down to where I was."
    new "我还没来得及考虑要不要跟上去。他从我视线里消失不过几秒，就又跳回了我面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:44588
    old "He extended both of his hands. They were empty."
    new "他摊开双手，手里空空如也。"

    # game/script.rpy:44589
    old "This is how I'm giving you the key. I left it up there so that you can obtain it without me getting close to that pointy knife."
    new "钥匙我就这么给你。我把它放在上面了，这样你来拿的时候，我就不必靠近那把尖刀。"

    # game/script.rpy:44590
    old "...What? No. Go get it."
    new "……什么？不行。你去拿。"

    # game/script.rpy:44593
    old "Well, that's not happening."
    new "那不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:44596
    old "...What are you trying to do? Do you still have it and want me to go up so you can leave?"
    new "……你到底想干什么？钥匙还在你身上，想让我上去，好自己脱身？"

    # game/script.rpy:44597
    old "Oh, not at all. I'm not like that."
    new "哦，怎么会。我不是那种人。"

    # game/script.rpy:44599
    old "I can show you my pockets if you want."
    new "你要是想看，我可以把口袋翻给你看。"

    # game/script.rpy:44600
    old "He showed the contents of all his pockets, and except for a single key, they were identical to the time we'd all showed our possessions."
    new "他把每个口袋里的东西都掏了出来。除了一把钥匙，其余和上次大家各自亮出随身物品时一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:44605
    old "Yeah, I also have the attic key, but I guess that doesn't matter much to you.{w} Are you happy now? Do you think I might have it in my hair? It's pretty messy today. Maybe in one of my shoes?{w} Don't worry, I left it up top."
    new "没错，阁楼的钥匙也在我这儿，不过这对你大概没什么意义吧。{w}现在满意了？你觉得我会把钥匙藏在头发里？我今天头发确实挺乱的。说不定在鞋里？{w}放心，我把它留在上面了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44606
    old "He kept clearing places where he might've hidden the key on himself until I was forced to accept that he didn't have it anymore."
    new "他接连排除掉身上可能藏钥匙的地方，我最后不得不承认，钥匙确实已经不在他身上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44609
    old "Anywhere else?"
    new "还有哪里要看？"

    # game/script.rpy:44611
    old "What is he doing...!? Could he have hidden it somewhere in this section of the bedroom and I didn't realize?"
    new "他到底在干什么……！？难道他早就把钥匙藏在这半边卧室的某处，只是我没察觉？"

    # game/script.rpy:44612
    old "Wait in that corner."
    new "到那个角落等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:44617
    old "No problem."
    new "没问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:44621
    old "He approached the empty corner of the room and leaned back with a carefree face. I glanced all around, thinking about whether he could've left the key anywhere before climbing up the ladder. I knew I hadn't seen anything, but I couldn't trust it."
    new "他走到房间那个空着的角落，一脸无所谓地靠了下来。我环视四周，想着他爬上梯子之前会不会把钥匙落在什么地方。我知道自己什么都没看见，却还是不敢放心。"

    # game/script.rpy:44622
    old "Indecisive, I looked through the few places I could think of where a key could've been hidden. The bed, the wardrobe, the drawers... I didn't find it anywhere, as it was impossible he had hidden it to begin with."
    new "我犹豫不决，把能想到的几个可能藏钥匙的地方都翻了一遍。床上、衣柜、抽屉……哪里都没有。本来他也不可能把钥匙藏在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:44628
    old "...What are you even searching for? I just left it there, below the bed."
    new "……你到底在找什么？就放在那儿，床底下。"

    # game/script.rpy:44629
    old "Then go get it!"
    new "那你去拿啊！"

    # game/script.rpy:44634
    old "I don't want to."
    new "我不想。"

    # game/script.rpy:44640
    old "I walked up to him slowly, running out of breath."
    new "我一步步走到他面前，喘得厉害。"

    # game/script.rpy:44645
    old "Whoa, what's with that face? You wouldn't be thinking of killing me in front of those cameras when I'm just trying to give you a key, would you?"
    new "哇，你这什么表情？我不过是来给你送钥匙，你该不会想在摄像头底下把我杀了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:44647
    old "Why don't you go up first and then I follow you?"
    new "不如你先上去，我再跟着你？"

    # game/script.rpy:44652
    old "I'm way too tired to climb this ladder again."
    new "再爬一趟这梯子，我可累得受不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44654
    old "He wants me to go up so that he can leave me behind again. How, though...!?"
    new "他想让我先上去，好再把我甩掉。可是，他究竟要怎么做……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:44659
    old "You should believe me. If you hurry up, you might be fast enough to save him."
    new "你该相信我。动作快一点，说不定还来得及救他。"

    # game/script.rpy:44665
    old "I came from the future, remember? I'm not exactly sure how far back I went, but it's possible Atsuki hasn't died yet."
    new "我是从未来来的，还记得吗？我拿不准自己回到了多久以前，不过 Atsuki 说不定还没死。"

    # game/script.rpy:44666
    old "...{w}You're lying."
    new "……{w}你在骗人。"

    # game/script.rpy:44667
    old "Me? I haven't lied all day."
    new "我？我今天可一句谎话都没说过。"

    # game/script.rpy:44668
    old "No, you are..."
    new "不对，你分明在撒谎……"

    # game/script.rpy:44673
    old "Am I? Are you sure...? I just found him dead, but I don't even know what happened to him. I guess it was Akaro."
    new "是吗？你确定……？我只是发现他死了，连他到底出了什么事都不知道。大概是 Akaro 干的吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:44679
    old "No, it didn't matter that he could've been lying or that it was unlikely the past could be changed. Before I could keep thinking, I was hastily climbing the ladder."
    new "不，他可能在说谎，过去也可能无法改变，这些都不重要了。还没等我继续想下去，我已经慌忙爬上了梯子。"

    # game/script.rpy:44683
    old "I crouched next to the bed and looked under it. It was dark, so I had to wait for my vision to adjust."
    new "我在床边蹲下，朝床底看去。里面很暗，我只好等眼睛适应。"

    # game/script.rpy:44684
    old "Bye!"
    new "再见啦！"

    # game/script.rpy:44689
    old "I didn't react. I just kept looking at the floor, where there was nothing."
    new "我没有反应，只是继续盯着地板，那里什么都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:44694
    old "I crawled back out and stood up, unable to raise my head. I glanced down through the hatch and saw the empty bedroom with the door closed."
    new "我爬了出来，站直身子，却抬不起头。我透过阁楼入口往下瞥了一眼，只见空荡荡的卧室，门关着。"

    # game/script.rpy:44695
    old "He was... lying. He had to have been."
    new "他在……撒谎。他一定是在骗我。"

    # game/script.rpy:44697
    old "I couldn't move. I didn't know what had happened, but all my energy was directed at denying what Sai had said."
    new "我浑身动弹不得。我不知道发生了什么，但满脑子都在拒绝相信 Sai 的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:44706
    old "Once I got back down, I examined the door and saw that nothing about it had changed. There was still no way to open it."
    new "回到下面后，我察看那扇门，发现它毫无变化，仍旧打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:44710
    old "I didn't knock on the door or yell. I just sat down, staring at my lap."
    new "我没有敲门，也没有喊叫，只是坐下来，盯着自己的膝头。"

    # game/script.rpy:44711
    old "It kept happening. Every time I thought I couldn't feel more miserable, I did."
    new "这种事接连不断。每次我以为自己不可能更难受了，却总能再难受几分。"

    # game/script.rpy:44712
    old "During the minutes I sat paralyzed on the floor, I didn't perceive any sound. Once again, I was alone in the attic."
    new "瘫坐在地的那几分钟里，我没有听见任何声音。阁楼里又只剩下我一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:44713
    old "And so I began to think that perhaps I didn't want to leave. If what waited for me outside was what I'd been told, it was better to stay inside."
    new "于是我渐渐觉得，也许我并不想离开。如果外面等着我的一切真如他所说，那还不如留在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:44715
    old "Fortunately, that thought was what let me snap out of it."
    new "幸好，正是这个念头让我清醒过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44716
    old "No, I need to leave. Was Sai able to leave without the key? There's no way, right? He was just able to hide that he had it."
    new "不行，我得离开。Sai 没有钥匙也能出去吗？不可能吧？他只是藏得好，让我没察觉钥匙在他手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:44721
    old "I stood up and tried to think rationally. There was nothing around that indicated what he'd done."
    new "我站起身，努力冷静思考。周围没有任何迹象表明他做了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:44722
    old "There was nothing under the bed, so he was just lying about leaving the key there. He only wanted me to go up so he could lock me in again."
    new "床底下什么都没有，所谓把钥匙留在那儿，只是他编的谎话。他不过是想让我上楼，好再把我锁起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44723
    old "The key I'd left on the stand was still there. I knew it wasn't the right one, but I tried to use it anyway."
    new "我留在架子上的那把钥匙还在。明知不是这一把，我还是试了试。"

    # game/script.rpy:44727
    old "...The door didn't unlock."
    new "……门没有开。"

    # game/script.rpy:44728
    old "I did all I could to dispel the fog in my mind and think about what had happened. I had to leave urgently, and if there was a way out, I needed to find it."
    new "我竭力驱散脑中的迷雾，回想究竟发生了什么。我必须尽快离开，只要还有出路，就得把它找出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:44733
    old "I went up to the second level and looked below the bed again. Without a doubt, there was nothing there."
    new "我爬上二层，又查看了一遍床下。毫无疑问，那里什么都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:44734
    old "He closed the door when he left, so he definitely opened and left through it...!"
    new "他走的时候把门关上了，所以他一定打开过门，就是从那儿出去的……！"

    # game/script.rpy:44735
    old "Is it possible he opened it without the key? That shouldn't be it."
    new "有没有可能他不用钥匙就打开了门？应该不会。"

    # game/script.rpy:44736
    old "The way he could've left the bedroom the very first time... by opening the door, going to the past, and unlocking it... That shouldn't have been possible either because there was no handle to open it from the inside even if it had been unlocked from the outside."
    new "他第一次离开卧室的方法……打开门，回到过去，再从里面开锁……这也不可能，因为就算从外面把锁打开了，内侧也没有可以转动的把手。"

    # game/script.rpy:44737
    old "Is it possible that he approached the door, saw it open, traveled to the past, and opened it from the outside to let himself leave? Could he have known enough about the Sekimeiya to pull that off?"
    new "有没有可能，他来到门前，见门开着，便穿越到过去，从外面把门打开，好让自己出去？他对 Sekimeiya 的了解，足以做到这一步吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:44742
    old "If so, I might have been able to do it myself. I climbed down and stared at the door."
    new "若真是如此，我自己或许也做得到。我爬下去，盯着那扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:44745
    old "It wasn't opening. ...Was that not possible?"
    new "门没有开。……难道这样不行？"

    # game/script.rpy:44746
    old "It hadn't worked for Atsuki when he tried it. Maybe it really wouldn't ever occur."
    new "Atsuki 试的时候也没有成功。也许这种事根本不会发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:44749
    old "I tried to think more about it. How could I open the door?"
    new "我试着再往深处想。我到底该怎么打开那扇门？"

    # game/script.rpy:44753
    old "For even longer, I stood still, mustering all my remaining mental strength to figure out how to escape."
    new "我在原地站得更久，用尽余下的心力，思索脱身的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:44758
    old "...How had Sai done it? Had he used the key? If so, how?"
    new "……Sai 究竟是怎么做到的？他用了钥匙吗？如果是，又是怎么用的？"

    # game/script.rpy:44762
    old "Did I let him do this?"
    new "是我给了他可乘之机吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:44768
    old "This is it. There's no way it's not."
    new "就是这样。绝不会有错。"

    # game/script.rpy:44769
    old "As soon as I thought back on one thing, the way Sai had escaped appeared in my head."
    new "我一想起某件事，Sai 脱身的方法便浮现在我脑中。"

    # game/script.rpy:44770
    old "When he appeared in the middle of the bedroom... Of course, he even said it.{w} That location belonged to the time I'd been blocking his path to the door.{w} That's how he escaped the first time. At that point, the key to the bedroom was already in his pocket, which is why he had it when he appeared from the future. Atsuki said it too, that he grabbed it when he was chasing us.{w} But, for some reason, there was another key in the drawer. At some point, the key got duplicated."
    new "他出现在卧室中央的时候……对，他自己也说过。{w}那个坐标对应的，是我挡住他去路、不让他靠近门口的那段时间。{w}他第一次就是这样逃出去的。那时卧室的钥匙已经在他口袋里，所以他从未来出现时才会带着钥匙。Atsuki 也说过，他追我们的时候把钥匙抢走了。{w}可是不知为何，抽屉里还有另一把钥匙。就在某个时刻，钥匙变成了两把。"

    # game/script.rpy:44771
    old "The time he snatched the key from my purse... it only felt like he unzipped it. That's all he did. He tricked me into thinking that he'd grabbed the key, when in reality he left with one he had from the beginning. ...Did he just make me think I was trapped?"
    new "他从我包里抢钥匙的那一次……我只感觉他拉开了拉链，仅此而已。他让我以为他拿走了钥匙，其实他带走的，是他一开始就有的那一把。……难道他只是让我以为自己被困住了？"

    # game/script.rpy:44775
    old "I looked at the desk. That was where I'd left my purse a while ago."
    new "我望向书桌。刚才我把手提包放在了那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:44776
    old "And the only place in this bedroom I didn't search... was in my own purse, where he knew the other key still was."
    new "而这间卧室里唯一没被我搜过的地方……就是我自己的手提包，他知道另一把钥匙还在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:44780
    old "I approached it and looked inside. Of course, the key was missing."
    new "我走过去往里看。钥匙果然不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:44781
    old "...He just wanted me to go up so he could grab the key from my purse. It's still unzipped."
    new "……他只是想让我上楼，好从我的包里拿走钥匙。拉链还开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:44785
    old "I set my eyes on the hatch and rapidly made my way up the ladder."
    new "我望向阁楼入口，迅速攀上梯子。"

    # game/script.rpy:44790
    old "If I'm right, the other key must be somewhere here in the second level. He just hid it better to trick me."
    new "如果我猜得没错，另一把钥匙一定就在这二层某处。他不过是藏得更隐蔽，好骗过我。"

    # game/script.rpy:44794
    old "There weren't many places to look through. I frantically went through all of them in search of a very small key."
    new "能翻的地方并不多。我发疯似的逐一翻遍，只为找一把很小的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:44795
    old "As soon as I started unzipping the leftmost mattress, a metal key fell to the floor."
    new "我刚拉开最左边那张床垫的拉链，一把金属钥匙便掉到了地板上。"

    # game/script.rpy:44802
    old "I breathed deeply before picking it up and clambering down."
    new "我深吸一口气，捡起钥匙，爬了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:44806
    old "I grabbed my purse, ran to the door, and inserted the key. It finally opened, and I saw the walls of the hallway."
    new "我抓起手提包，冲到门前，把钥匙插了进去。门终于开了，我看到了走廊的墙壁。"

    # game/script.rpy:44811
    old "I sped toward the living room while I stored the knife in my purse and took the attic key out."
    new "我快步赶往客厅，一边把刀收进手提包，一边取出阁楼的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:44815
    old "The most recent footprints there were definitely Sai's, which went to the staircase. I rapidly followed them down."
    new "那里最新的脚印无疑是 Sai 留下的，一路通向楼梯。我急忙顺着脚印下楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:44832
    old "He's okay. Sai was just lying. Thank God."
    new "他没事。Sai 刚才只是在撒谎。谢天谢地。"

    # game/script.rpy:44833
    old "I panted, suddenly realizing that I was out of breath."
    new "我喘着气，这才发觉自己已经上气不接下气。"

    # game/script.rpy:44861
    old "I couldn't look at Sai anymore. No matter whether he was the person behind everything, I hated him and the unquestionable malice behind his actions. However, {time=21} was very close, and creating more conflicts would only be a problem."
    new "我再也无法直视 Sai。不管他是不是这一切的幕后之人，我都厌恶他，也厌恶他所作所为背后那份不容置疑的恶意。可距离 {time=21} 已经很近了，再起冲突只会徒增麻烦。"

    # game/script.rpy:44891
    old "I suddenly processed what I was seeing without tunnel vision and saw Erina next to them, her clothing coated in dried blood."
    new "我忽然不再只盯着眼前那一处，看清了站在他们身旁的 Erina——她的衣服上沾满了干涸的血迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:44904
    old "I... see.{w} We didn't check Erina's pulse, remember...?"
    new "原来……如此。{w}我们当时没确认 Erina 的脉搏，你还记得吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:44905
    old "O-Oh! Thank God, and sorry..."
    new "啊、啊啊！太好了，对不起……"

    # game/script.rpy:44906
    old "After thinking incorrectly for so long, I felt immensely relieved. Despite all that had happened, those of us who were still alive, including Erina, had to make it out."
    new "误会了这么久，我一下子如释重负。不管发生了多少事，包括 Erina 在内，我们这些还活着的人都必须活着出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:44910
    old "What's with the blood, though?"
    new "不过你身上的血是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:44931
    old "I waited for a response, but nobody gave one. Had the version of me that Atsuki saw reappeared...?"
    new "我等着有人接话，却谁也没有出声。难道 Atsuki 看到的那个我，又出现了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:44949
    old "Atsuki ignored him and brought me to the fifth floor."
    new "Atsuki 没理他，把我带到了五楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:44976
    old "Those few words made me drop everything I had assumed. After what we'd experienced, was it actually possible for us to undo what had already happened?"
    new "短短几句话，就推翻了我此前所有的判断。经历了这些之后，我们真的有可能挽回已经发生的事吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:44977
    old "It's possible what I changed only affected some people. I definitely went back in time and altered the events I'd experienced. Sai recognizes the change, but I'm not sure Erina does.{w} It felt like both realities met, leading into differing memories. That could be what happened to Akaro, when his version of events contradicted ours. Maybe someone made some change that didn't affect us, or maybe it didn't affect Akaro."
    new "我改变的东西，也许只影响了部分人。我确实回到了过去，改动了我们经历过的那些事。Sai 记得这变化，Erina 却未必。{w} 感觉就像两个现实撞在了一起，记忆也随之分岔。Akaro 那时大概也是这样——他记得的经过和我们不一样。也许有人做了某种改变，却没影响到我们，又或者只是没影响到 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:44987
    old "So then... We just have to want to change the past? Is that the only requirement?"
    new "那么……我们只要想改变过去就行？只有这一个条件？"

    # game/script.rpy:44988
    old "If we travel to the point Isla died, we can overwrite her death...?"
    new "如果我们穿越到 Isla 死去的那一刻，就能改写她的死……？"

    # game/script.rpy:44989
    old "I'd long ago decided I wouldn't touch the Sekimeiya again, but the most fundamental reason was that we'd concluded it wasn't possible to alter the past."
    new "我早就决定不再碰 Sekimeiya 了，而最根本的理由，是我们已经断定过去无法更改。"

    # game/script.rpy:44990
    old "I recalled my own selfishness and how much I despised it. If we were able to undo what had happened but chose not to, that was infinitely worse."
    new "我想起自己那份自私，想起自己有多厌恶它。明明能挽回已经发生的事，却选择袖手旁观，那要恶劣无数倍。"

    # game/script.rpy:44991
    old "Let's keep going.{w} I last traveled from the staff room. Let's go there."
    new "继续走吧。{w} 我上一次是从员工室穿越的。就去那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:44998
    old "We walked all the way down. In the reality where we were, many people had died. Even if changing the past was doable, how much could we really deviate from it?"
    new "我们一路往下走。在我们所处的这个现实里，已经死了很多人。就算过去确实可以改变，我们又能偏离多少？"

    # game/script.rpy:44999
    old "That didn't matter. As long as we could prevent the suffering I'd felt for at least one person, we had to do it."
    new "那都无关紧要。哪怕只能让一个人免于我体会过的那种痛苦，我们也非做不可。"

    # game/script.rpy:45000
    old "We slowly reached the crystal floor. On the way down, I noticed that the smell hanging around us all day was getting stronger."
    new "我们慢慢下到水晶层。下楼途中，我察觉到整日萦绕在周围的那股气味越来越浓。"

    # game/script.rpy:45023
    old "We entered the staff room, and I saw that a new locker was open."
    new "我们进了员工室，我看见又有一个储物柜开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:45048
    old "We went to the event room and saw the empty cabinet. Once more, we wanted to find the Sekimeiya that someone might have hidden."
    new "我们去了活动室，看见了空荡荡的展示柜。我们又一次想去寻找可能被人藏起来的 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:45049
    old "Since that morning, a recurring question had been why anyone would hide the Sekimeiya when it could easily be found. I'd thought of many possible answers, but if the past could be changed, it had always been a flawed question."
    new "从那天早上起，有个问题一直反复出现：Sekimeiya 明明这么容易找到，为什么会有人把它藏起来？我想过很多种可能的答案，可如果过去真的可以改变，这个问题本身就站不住脚。"

    # game/script.rpy:45050
    old "Of course, if anyone was directing things toward a future they wanted, they wouldn't want anyone to deviate things on their own with the Sekimeiya."
    new "当然，如果有人正把事情引向自己期望的未来，自然不希望别人用 Sekimeiya 擅自改变走向。"

    # game/script.rpy:45054
    old "Was that person Sai, who knew the most about the Sekimeiya? Had an unknown person really orchestrated everything behind the scenes? I couldn't believe how fast I'd changed my mind and how much I wanted to find the Sekimeiya. Was it possible we could leave the tower in a world where I hadn't spent those two hours in that bedroom?"
    new "会是 Sai 吗？那个对 Sekimeiya 最了解的人？难道真有个身份不明的人在幕后操纵着一切？我不敢相信自己的态度转变得这么快，也不敢相信自己竟这么想找到 Sekimeiya。我们有没有可能离开这座塔，去到一个我并没有在那间卧室里度过那两小时的世界？"

    # game/script.rpy:45055
    old "I was taking Atsuki's word, but if we found the Sekimeiya, determining whether the past could be changed should've been simple. However, we had concluded before that it wasn't possible because it had already been attempted. A ton of things implied that."
    new "我是信了 Atsuki 的话。可只要找到 Sekimeiya，弄清过去能不能改变本该很简单。然而我们先前已经断定那不可能——因为早就有人试过。有太多迹象都指向这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:45056
    old "I wanted to erase the painful hours we'd all spent in the tower. But if that was possible, what if we could stay there for a whole month? There would be much more we could undo."
    new "我想抹去我们在这座塔里度过的那些痛苦时光。可如果这真能做到，那要是我们能在那里待上整整一个月呢？能挽回的就会多得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:45057
    old "The exit was near. In two hours, we were bound to learn about the future we'd be stuck with."
    new "出口近了。再过两小时，我们注定会知道自己将困在怎样的未来里。"

    # game/script.rpy:45075
    old "Who knows? I couldn't find it, but why do you care?"
    new "谁知道呢？我是没找到，可你关心这个做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:45076
    old "Akaro might be responsible, and he could have taken it outside. If that happened, there's nothing we can do."
    new "说不定是 Akaro 干的，他可能已经把它带到外面去了。真是那样，我们就无能为力了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45081
    old "However, if it's still inside, the police will find it immediately, right? It can be hidden from us, but not from them."
    new "不过，要是它还在楼里，警察马上就能找到，不是吗？它可以瞒过我们，却瞒不过他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:45104
    old "He must be the one who's been taking it all this time, and he's definitely had a reason. He doesn't want us to search for it so that he can keep it where he has it."
    new "一直以来拿走它的肯定就是他，而且他一定有理由。他不想让我们去找，好把东西留在自己藏的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:45109
    old "You're free to enlighten me. If I knew where it was, what would my endgame be? Hoping the police don't find it? There's no way that would happen.{w} Someone took it when we weren't around. That must mean they have the means to keep it out of ours and the police's sights. Otherwise, hiding it is pointless."
    new "那就请你说给我听听。要是我知道它在哪儿，我图的是什么？指望警察找不到？那根本不可能。{w} 有人趁我们不在的时候把它拿走了。这说明对方有办法让它既躲过我们，也躲过警察。否则，藏起来毫无意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:45110
    old "Of course, that's only assuming the past can't be changed. With how much Sai's proven to know about the Sekimeiya, there's no way he's not aware of whether it can do that or not."
    new "当然，这都是以过去无法改变为前提。Sai 对 Sekimeiya 的了解已经显露无遗，他绝不可能不知道它能不能做到这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:45152
    old "All right. I agree, so let's just wait."
    new "好吧。我同意，那就等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:45159
    old "I frowned as I looked at him, but he avoided meeting my eyes and glanced back at Sai instead."
    new "我皱起眉看着他，他却避开我的视线，把目光转回 Sai 身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:45167
    old "Is this a bluff to waste time...?"
    new "这是在虚张声势拖延时间吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:45168
    old "If we want to go to the past, we want the Sekimeiya to spend a while out of the cabinet, which we accomplish by doing what Sai wants for a while. Eventually, we can find it, just like we have every time we've extensively looked for it."
    new "想要回到过去，就得让 Sekimeiya 在展示柜外待上一段时间；按 Sai 说的做一阵子，正好能达到这个目的。到最后总能找到它，就像我们每次大费周章去找时一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:45172
    old "Atsuki whispered to me."
    new "Atsuki 低声对我说。"

    # game/script.rpy:45178
    old "I shook my head and showed him my purse, still unzipped."
    new "我摇摇头，把还敞着口的包给他看。"

    # game/script.rpy:45212
    old "There was no reason to humor Sai anymore. I didn't believe for a second he wasn't lying. We sat on the left of the shutter without saying a word."
    new "再没有理由顺着 Sai 了。我压根不信他，他肯定在撒谎。我们一言不发，在卷帘门左侧坐下。"

    # game/script.rpy:45213
    old "He had needed to leave the bedroom to finish up a part of his plan. He admitted that himself, so there was no way he simply wanted to get out of the tower while unaware of the Sekimeiya's whereabouts."
    new "他亲口承认，自己是为了完成计划的一环才离开卧室。所以，在不知道 Sekimeiya 下落的情况下，他不可能只是想逃出塔去。"

    # game/script.rpy:45214
    old "It can't be that he's not the same Sai, right...? No... Even though his watch is working, he definitely knows what happened in the bedroom."
    new "他总不可能是另一个 Sai 吧……？不……尽管他的表还在正常走，卧室里发生的事他肯定清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:45219
    old "We waited for a long time."
    new "我们等了很久。"

    # game/script.rpy:45220
    old "It was the ideal thing to do. If we were able to find the Sekimeiya, we would do it after it had gathered enough energy. If finding it wasn't possible, we were calmly going through the final stretch."
    new "这是最稳妥的做法。只要能找到 Sekimeiya，就等它蓄够能量再动手；要是根本找不到，我们就平静地度过最后这段路。"

    # game/script.rpy:45221
    old "If the recording was real, then we would either not find the Sekimeiya or changing the past would turn out to be impossible. However, I was convinced it was fake. No matter why it existed, it couldn't have been legitimate."
    new "如果那段录音是真的，那我们要么找不到 Sekimeiya，要么改变过去根本不可能。但我确信那是假的。不管它为何存在，都不可能是真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:45222
    old "I spent some time going over all the possible outcomes. What if the Sekimeiya was in one of the temperature regulation cabinets, not gathering any heat?"
    new "我花了一阵子，把各种可能的结果都过了一遍。要是 Sekimeiya 就放在某个控温展示柜里，一点热量都蓄不到呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:45223
    old "If changing the past was possible, that was still fine. We could go a short time back, get it out of the cabinet, and progressively extend the distance traveled."
    new "就算改变过去是可行的，那也无妨。我们可以先回到不久前，把它从展示柜里取出来，再一点点拉长回溯的距离。"

    # game/script.rpy:45228
    old "Sai continued to update us with the time. We'd spent 25 minutes sitting down."
    new "Sai 仍不断向我们报时。我们坐下已经二十五分钟了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45229
    old "Is it possible Sai's trying to trick us again?"
    new "Sai 会不会又在骗我们？"

    # game/script.rpy:45230
    old "What if he knows what we want to do? If he does, he could have set his wristwatch back a while to make it seem like we have more time. Did he anticipate things enough to have also edited the computer's time?"
    new "万一他知道我们想做什么呢？要是他知道，他大可以把手表往回拨一段，让我们以为时间还多。他既然连这一步都料到了，会不会连电脑上的时间也一并改过？"

    # game/script.rpy:45231
    old "...The shutter could open at any moment."
    new "……卷帘门随时都可能打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:45241
    old "I'd been needing to go for a while, and I had to before walking through the whole building. According to Sai, there were forty minutes left, but we couldn't trust that. Once I came back, we had to find the Sekimeiya."
    new "我早就想去洗手间了，而且待会儿要穿过整栋楼，必须先解决。按 Sai 的说法还剩四十分钟，可那不能信。等我回来，我们就得去找 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:45248
    old "I knew he'd insist on stopping me, so I went over to the hallway B door."
    new "我知道他一定会拦我，便朝 B走廊的门走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:45255
    old "I entered the left bathroom."
    new "我进了左边的洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:45261
    old "Huh...!?"
    new "咦……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:45264
    old "I jumped instantly, feeling my back burn."
    new "我一下子跳开，后背一阵灼痛。"

    # game/script.rpy:45265
    old "The tank... was burning."
    new "水箱……是烫的。"

    # game/script.rpy:45266
    old "I knew what that had to mean. I grabbed the top with both hands and lifted it up."
    new "我知道这意味着什么。我双手抓住盖子，把它掀了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:45271
    old "The Sekimeiya was on top of a pipe, touching the side I'd leaned on. It was well-balanced, positioned so that it didn't fall into the water."
    new "Sekimeiya 就搁在一根管子上，贴着我刚才靠过的那一侧。它放得极稳，不至于掉进水里。"

    # game/script.rpy:45272
    old "How hot does it have to be for the heat to reach the other side...? And I still feel the burn."
    new "它得烫到什么程度，热量才能透到这一侧来……？我后背现在还火辣辣的。"

    # game/script.rpy:45276
    old "But here it is... And it's working for sure."
    new "可它就在这里……而且肯定还在运转。"

    # game/script.rpy:45278
    old "The past could be changed. Were those words true?"
    new "过去可以改变。那句话是真的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:45279
    old "If so, I knew I could go really far back."
    new "若果真如此，我知道自己可以回到很早之前。"

    # game/script.rpy:45280
    old "Should I tell them? ...Was it even Sai who left it here? He knew where I was going."
    new "该告诉他们吗？……真的是 Sai 把这东西留在这里的吗？他知道我会去哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:45281
    old "...{w}Atsuki wanted to find the Sekimeiya and change the past. If I told him, I knew he would activate it. However, I wasn't sure I wanted that."
    new "……{w}Atsuki 想找到 Sekimeiya，改变过去。我若告诉他，他一定会启动它。可我并不确定自己是否想这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:45282
    old "His desire was to erase the deaths we'd experienced, but that wouldn't occur if he changed the past. He would still remember them, and how would it even work? Would he be stuck in a world with another self of his?"
    new "他想抹去我们经历过的那些死亡，可改变过去并不能做到这一点。他仍会记得一切。而且这到底是如何运作的？他会不会被困在某个世界里，与另一个自己共存？"

    # game/script.rpy:45283
    old "If he went to the past and changed things, he would end up personally suffering for it and would remember everything. If I did that instead... he wouldn't."
    new "若是他回到过去改变一切，最终受苦的是他自己，所有记忆也会留在他身上。换成我这样做……他就不会。"

    # game/script.rpy:45286
    old "We didn't know where Akaro was, but he or Sai had the best chance of being behind everything. If I went to tell the others that I'd found the Sekimeiya, it was very possible Sai would purposely always stay in range. He could then prevent the changes we wanted."
    new "我们不知道 Akaro 在哪里，但幕后之人最可能不是他就是 Sai。如果我去告诉其他人我找到了 Sekimeiya，Sai 极有可能故意一直留在范围内。那样他就能阻止我们想做的改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:45287
    old "And ultimately, it was a fact that they'd all said they talked to a self of mine I wasn't aware of. Would that end up being myself despite me being sure that it couldn't be the case?"
    new "而且说到底，他们所有人都说过，自己曾和一个连我自己都不知道的「我」说过话，这是事实。尽管我确信那不可能，可最后会不会就是我自己？"

    # game/script.rpy:45288
    old "If so, then I wouldn't be able to change the past. I was in the reality where that other self of mine appeared."
    new "若真是如此，我就无法改变过去。我正身处那个「另一个我」出现过的现实里。"

    # game/script.rpy:45292
    old "I hovered my hand over the gem and felt the imposing heat around it, repelling me. I realized I couldn't breathe properly due to the strange smell from all day. It was at its greatest intensity yet, reaching oppressive levels."
    new "我把手悬在宝石上方，只觉周围热浪灼人，逼得我无法靠近。那股弥漫了一整天的怪味让我呼吸不畅——此刻浓烈到了极点，几乎令人窒息。"

    # game/script.rpy:45293
    old "With my left hand under my coat, I lifted the Sekimeiya out of the tank. Its heat was burning me through the cloth, but I resisted the intense pain."
    new "我用左手隔着外套，把 Sekimeiya 从槽中提了出来。热量透过布料灼烧着我，我硬生生忍住了这股剧痛。"

    # game/script.rpy:45296
    old "This is the last chance we have to save anyone. Maybe saving Miiya is impossible, but I'm holding the possibility to erase Erina's suffering, Isla's, Naomi's, or even Katei's. If that works, nothing should be undoable, and then I could tell Atsuki what I've done and work together with him to save Miiya."
    new "这是我们救人的最后机会了。也许救不了 Miiya，但我有可能抹去 Erina、Isla、Naomi，甚至 Katei 的痛苦。只要成功，就没有什么不能挽回。到那时，我就能告诉 Atsuki 我做过什么，再与他一起救 Miiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:45297
    old "I still knew he wanted to change the past, and maybe he didn't want to get rid of the memories he had. Who was I to decide that by myself and effectively erase the Atsuki I knew in that moment...?"
    new "我知道他仍想改变过去，也许他并不想舍弃自己拥有的记忆。我凭什么擅自做这样的决定，把此刻我认识的那个 Atsuki 抹去……？"

    # game/script.rpy:45298
    old "But I couldn't hesitate. If I chose not to activate the Sekimeiya, I might not have been able to live with myself. I couldn't accept acting only in my own self-interest."
    new "但我不能犹豫。若我选择不启动 Sekimeiya，我恐怕无法原谅自己。只为自己打算，我做不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:45302
    old "I lowered my right hand slowly, toward the harmless-looking gem. I shut my eyes and gritted my teeth in pain, pushing through the burning aura until I made contact with the Sekimeiya."
    new "我缓缓放下右手，伸向那颗看似无害的宝石。我闭上眼，咬牙忍痛，顶着灼热的气浪往前，直到触到 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:45313
    old "At that point, Shiroya disappeared from the bathroom."
    new "就在那一刻，Shiroya 从盥洗室里消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45316
    old "She also disappeared from the crystal floor and from Ashiya Tower. She went much farther through time than she had expected."
    new "她也从水晶层消失了，从芦屋塔消失了。她穿越的时间，远比她预想的要远。"

    # game/script.rpy:45320
    old "The oblivious people who remained in the lobby would soon realize that something had happened and would search for the missing Shiroya through all seven floors..."
    new "那些还留在大厅、毫不知情的人很快就会察觉出了事，然后会搜遍七层楼，寻找失踪的 Shiroya……"

    # game/script.rpy:45329
    old "Liquid Canvas"
    new "流动的画布"

    # game/script.rpy:45342
    old "—Wha—{w=1} ...Ow.{w=0.8} Where... is this?"
    new "——什——{w=1} ……好痛。{w=0.8} 这里……是哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:45343
    old "I felt my body lying on cold stone. I opened my eyes, but I couldn't see a thing."
    new "我感到自己躺在冰冷的石地上。睁开眼，却什么都看不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:45344
    old "Is this still the tower...?"
    new "这里还是塔里……？"

    # game/script.rpy:45345
    old "I tried to stand up, but my whole body hurt. When I moved, I realized I was wearing different clothes under my coat and that the air was much colder."
    new "我想站起来，全身却疼得厉害。一动之下才发现，外套底下的衣服换了，周围的空气也冷得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:45346
    old "Ah...! What...!?"
    new "啊……！怎么……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:45347
    old "I suddenly felt a throbbing pain in my head that stopped all my movements. It wasn't only my head—there wasn't a single part of my body that didn't hurt."
    new "一阵抽痛猛地袭上头部，让我动弹不得。不只是头——我全身上下没有一处不疼。"

    # game/script.rpy:45349
    old "I stayed still, hoping the unbearable headache would fade away. In the meantime, my vision began to adjust a little."
    new "我一动不动，盼着那难以忍受的头痛快点退去。这时，视线渐渐适应了一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:45355
    old "I couldn't see light anywhere, but I was still able to make out the space around me."
    new "四下不见一丝光亮，我却仍能辨出周围的空间。"

    # game/script.rpy:45356
    old "Is this underground...?"
    new "这是地下……？"

    # game/script.rpy:45357
    old "That was all I could really tell, but when I looked up, I understood where I was."
    new "我能确定的仅止于此，可抬头一看，便明白了自己身在何处。"

    # game/script.rpy:45358
    old "The ceiling is broken, and there's a bit of light... That's where I fell from."
    new "天花板破了，透进一点光……我就是从那里掉下来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:45360
    old "I was in some kind of channel, directly below the gem shop we'd gone to that day."
    new "我在一条像是通道的地方，就在那天我们去过的那家宝石店正下方。"

    # game/script.rpy:45361
    old "Bewildered, I tried to think. However, an immense headache was still numbing my mind."
    new "我茫然地想理清头绪，可剧烈的头痛仍让脑子一片麻木。"

    # game/script.rpy:45362
    old "...Did I appear here? From the tower?"
    new "……我是出现在这里的？从那座塔？"

    # game/script.rpy:45363
    old "I didn't think that was it. I remembered traveling from the bathroom on the crystal floor, but something was amiss."
    new "我觉得不是。我记得自己是从水晶层的盥洗室穿越的，可总有什么不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:45364
    old "Every time I'd gone through time, I'd instantly appeared somewhere. That time, I'd woken up on the ground, and my whole body hurt. ...Had there been something in between, then? It felt like there had to have been, but my mind was too foggy to know."
    new "以往每次穿越，我都是在某处瞬间出现。这一次却是在地上醒来，浑身都疼。……难道中间还夹着什么？总觉得一定有过，可脑子一片混沌，想不明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:45368
    old "Where am I? How far back did I go?"
    new "我在哪里？回到了多久以前？"

    # game/script.rpy:45369
    old "Under the thick, brown coat I usually wore, I identified the clothes I was in. They were the ones I'd woken up with in the hospital—the ones I'd worn the day Miiya died."
    new "在我常穿的厚棕色外套下面，我认出了自己身上的衣服。那是我在医院醒来时穿的衣服——Miiya 死去那天我穿的那一身。"

    # game/script.rpy:45370
    old "I kept trying to push my mind for an answer, but I had no idea what had happened. When I finally collected myself somewhat, I noticed that I had my purse around my shoulder. I unzipped it and felt the interior with my hand."
    new "我拼命想让脑子给出答案，却完全不知道发生了什么。等稍稍镇定下来，我才发觉挎包还挂在肩上。我拉开拉链，伸手探了探里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:45371
    old "...The knife isn't here. Why did I not travel with it this time?"
    new "……刀不在。这次为什么没跟着一起穿越过来？"

    # game/script.rpy:45372
    old "Wait, this...!"
    new "等等，这是……！"

    # game/script.rpy:45373
    old "I retracted my hand, gripping a familiar object. After fiddling with it, a rectangular light appeared in front of me."
    new "我收回手，掌中握着一件熟悉的东西。摆弄几下，一片长方形的光在眼前亮起。"

    # game/script.rpy:45374
    old "It was my phone. The time displayed was {time=21:10}, but I only wanted to look at the date. I navigated deeper into the settings menu to access the current date. Then, I stared at the screen, reading it over and over."
    new "是我的手机。屏幕上的时间显示为 {time=21:10}，但我只想看日期。我往设置菜单更深处翻，找出当前日期，然后盯着屏幕，一遍又一遍地看。"

    # game/script.rpy:45375
    old "November 30th."
    new "11月30日。"

    # game/script.rpy:45379
    old "Wait... that... doesn't make any sense."
    new "等等……这……说不通啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:45380
    old "November 30th? Did I go fifteen days to the past?"
    new "11月30日？我回到了十五天前？"

    # game/script.rpy:45383
    old "That day, at that time, I was already in a coma. I'd fallen from that ceiling up there, and I woke up in a hospital room days later."
    new "那一天的那个时候，我已经昏迷了。我从上面那处天花板掉下来，几天后才在病房里醒来。"

    # game/script.rpy:45384
    old "I looked around me, but I didn't see anyone else."
    new "我环顾四周，不见其他人。"

    # game/script.rpy:45385
    old "If that's where I am... has my old body already been taken to the hospital? But why does my whole body hurt? This has never happened before..."
    new "如果真是这样……那我原来那具身体是不是已经被送去医院了？可我全身为什么这么疼？这以前从没发生过……"

    # game/script.rpy:45386
    old "My mind felt really clouded. After touching the Sekimeiya, I'd woken up in that sewer. I hadn't instantly appeared there, so I didn't fully understand what had happened."
    new "我脑中一片混沌。碰过 Sekimeiya 之后，我就在那条下水道里醒了过来。我并非瞬间出现在那里，所以并不完全明白发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:45388
    old "Could I have overwritten my past self since I touched the Sekimeiya while willing to change the past?"
    new "难道是因为我触碰 Sekimeiya 时怀着改变过去的念头，才覆盖了过去的自己？"

    # game/script.rpy:45393
    old "I tried to stand up, but a sudden, piercing headache made me collapse to the ground. My cheek hit cold stone again, and the faint light slowly vanished."
    new "我想站起来，脑袋却猛地一阵刺痛，整个人又跌回地面。脸颊再次贴上冰冷的石头，微弱的光也缓缓消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45396
    old "I wanted to move, but none of my muscles responded. My entire body was sore, like I'd received countless punches. Even the scarce willpower to reopen my eyes left me, as if I'd exhausted all my energy in an instant."
    new "我想动，可全身肌肉都不听使唤。身体酸痛得像挨了无数拳。就连重新睁开眼的最后一点意志也消散了，仿佛所有力气在刹那间被抽干。"

    # game/script.rpy:45397
    old "My senses dulled—the world darkened—my coat tightly enveloped me—{w} And then it was gone.{w} The cold and pain disappeared too, leaving me floating in the middle of nowhere."
    new "我的感官渐渐迟钝——世界暗了下去——外套紧紧裹住我——{w} 然后，那一切都消失了。{w} 寒冷与疼痛也一并退去，只剩我漂浮在虚无之中。"

    # game/script.rpy:45398
    old "There was no sound. I was conscious, but I didn't know where I was or why I was there. My awareness became a single, thin stream devoid of thought."
    new "四周没有一点声音。我意识清醒，却不知道自己身在何处，又为何会在这里。我的意识只剩一缕细流，空无一念。"

    # game/script.rpy:45399
    old "The stressful events of the tower disappeared, and the tension I'd been holding in for the previous weeks vanished. A great sense of relief washed over me."
    new "塔中那些令人心力交瘁的事全都远去了，前几周一直积压在心里的紧张也烟消云散。一阵巨大的解脱感涌遍全身。"

    # game/script.rpy:45403
    old "No, I was on the ground in an underground tunnel. That fleeting notion sparked into my brain multiple times, but it was never enough to disrupt the silence."
    new "不对，我正躺在地下隧道的地面上。这个念头一次次在脑中闪过，却始终不足以打破那片寂静。"

    # game/script.rpy:45404
    old "The world was consumed by my growing existence until eventually I was the only thing in it. Perhaps it had always been like that. For longer than time itself, I drifted aimlessly."
    new "我的存在不断蔓延，吞没了整个世界，到最后，其中仿佛只剩下我。也许一直都是如此。我漫无目的地漂荡，久得仿佛超过了时间本身。"

    # game/script.rpy:45407
    old "Who was I? I was surprised to feel curious about that question. The nothingness had become the only thing I knew, so the tiniest vestige of uncertainty was enough to bring me into disarray."
    new "我是谁？我竟对这个问题生出了好奇，连自己都感到意外。虚无已成了我唯一认得的东西，因此哪怕只剩一丝不确定，也足以让我方寸大乱。"

    # game/script.rpy:45411
    old "A distant figure began to take shape in the darkness, and it grew until I became one with it."
    new "远处，一道身影在黑暗中渐渐成形，越来越大，直到与我融为一体。"

    # game/script.rpy:45416
    old "That's... me.{w} ...And there's Atsuki.{w} Not from now, but when we were still children. Laughing. Playing. Having fun."
    new "那是我……{w} ……还有 Atsuki。{w} 不是现在的我们，而是我们还小的时候。笑着，玩着，那么开心。"

    # game/script.rpy:45417
    old "Hey, Shiroya! Check this out!"
    new "喂，Shiroya！快看这个！"

    # game/script.rpy:45418
    old "He handed me a small flower with dark purple petals, contrasting with the white world surrounding us."
    new "他递给我一朵小花，深紫色的花瓣与周围白茫茫的世界形成鲜明对比。"

    # game/script.rpy:45419
    old "So pretty! I'm sure Danny would love it!"
    new "好漂亮！Danny 一定会喜欢的！"

    # game/script.rpy:45420
    old "I gingerly placed the flower on the stuffed tiger's head, then held it up to my face."
    new "我小心翼翼地把花放到老虎玩偶头上，然后把老虎玩偶举到面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:45421
    old "Wow! It looks so good on you, doesn't it?"
    new "哇！这朵花戴在你头上真好看，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:45422
    old "Without missing a beat, the boy in front of me spoke up."
    new "我面前的男孩没有半分迟疑，立刻开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:45423
    old "I'm sure it would look nicer on you."
    new "戴在你头上肯定更好看。"

    # game/script.rpy:45424
    old "He took the flower off the toy and began fidgeting with my shirt.{w} When he was done, I couldn't help but smile."
    new "他把花从玩偶头上取下来，在我衣襟上摆弄起来。{w} 等他弄完，我忍不住笑了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45429
    old "Seamlessly, the world changed. We were riding on our bikes down the streets of Yushibana.{w} ...And then we were drinking hot chocolate after playing in the snow. One after another, fond memories played in my vision, and I once again became a child."
    new "世界悄然变换，衔接得毫无痕迹。我们骑着自行车，穿行在丰花的街道上。{w} ……转眼间，我们又在雪地里玩过之后喝起了热巧克力。那些温暖的回忆一幕接一幕在眼前浮现，我又变回了孩子。"

    # game/script.rpy:45430
    old "I wasn't just experiencing memories, I also created new scenarios. We'd always wanted to hang out in the big cities, and that had become possible."
    new "我不只是在重温回忆，也在创造新的场景。我们一直想去大城市里玩，而如今，这竟也成了可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:45436
    old "The innocent pleasure dimmed softly as the world faded back to nothing. I couldn't object or resist, as if I was a baby on the verge of awareness."
    new "那份纯真的快乐悄然黯淡，世界也随之褪回虚无。我无法反对，也无法抗拒，仿佛只是一个刚刚萌生意识的婴儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:45438
    old "After an eternity, my mind reawakened. Another figure appeared far in the distance."
    new "仿佛过了永恒那么久，我的意识才再度苏醒。远处又出现了一道身影。"

    # game/script.rpy:45445
    old "...Miiya.{w} I liked her as a friend, but...{w} When did it get so complicated?{w} She was gone. But even when she was alive, things didn't feel completely right. Myriad moments of before her death flowed into my mind. We were smiling and laughing in all of them, but as I watched us from above, I just wondered if she'd ever actually considered me a friend. We had spent time together, but I wasn't sure what it had meant."
    new "……Miiya。{w} 我对她的喜欢，是朋友之间的那种，可是……{w} 事情是什么时候变得这么复杂的？{w} 她已经不在了。可就算她活着的时候，一切也并非全然对劲。她生前的无数瞬间涌入脑海。每一个瞬间里，我们都在笑；可当我从上方望着我们时，我只想知道，她究竟有没有真正把我当成朋友。我们曾一起度过许多时光，可那究竟意味着什么，我并不确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:45446
    old "She joined our little world and warped it into something different. Not better, not worse, just different. And her departure made it very different once again."
    new "她走进了我们的小小世界，把它扭曲成了另一副模样。说不上更好，也说不上更坏，只是不同了。而她的离去，又让一切变得截然不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:45452
    old "We had access to a time travel device. We had no idea how it worked, but could we use it to rescue her?{w} Did I... even want to rescue her?"
    new "我们手上有时间穿越装置。我们完全不知道它如何运作，但能不能用它救她？{w} 我……真的想救她吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:45453
    old "Of course I did. Anything to bring us back to a sense of \"normal\". Anything to bring back the happier days."
    new "当然想。只要能让我们重新找回「正常」的感觉，我什么都愿意做。只要能回到那些更快乐的日子。"

    # game/script.rpy:45454
    old "Were the days with Miiya better than the days without her? Yes, but... why? Why was it all so messy?"
    new "有 Miiya 的日子，真的比没有她的日子更好吗？是的，可是……为什么？为什么一切都成了一团乱麻？"

    # game/script.rpy:45455
    old "My existence folded in on itself. A momentary jolt, a sense of disorientation, running around in the darkness."
    new "我的存在仿佛向内塌陷。一阵短暂的冲击，一片天旋地转，我在黑暗中四处打转。"

    # game/script.rpy:45456
    old "Was the Sekimeiya a blessing or a curse? An object that reworked the flow of time. An object that kept us confined in the past..."
    new "Sekimeiya 究竟是恩赐，还是诅咒？一件能改写时间流向的物体，一件把我们困在过去的物体……"

    # game/script.rpy:45460
    old "My senses dulled again. I kept drifting in the dark and gentle abyss. Or maybe I wasn't drifting at all. I realized I didn't know anything."
    new "我的感官又变得迟钝了。我不断漂荡在黑暗而温柔的深渊里。又或者，我根本不曾漂荡。我意识到自己什么都不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:45462
    old "I felt a cold breeze as the darkness began to lift. Part of me wanted to stay there forever, wrapped in black."
    new "黑暗开始退去时，我感觉到一阵冷风。我心底有一部分仍想永远留在那里，被那片黑色裹住。"

    # game/script.rpy:45463
    old "The sensation of possessing a body gradually came back to me. My limbs existed again.{w} In an instant, I became acutely aware of a pain in my cheek. I was resting on a pebble."
    new "拥有身体的感觉渐渐回来了。我的四肢重新有了实感。{w} 刹那间，我清楚地感到脸颊一阵疼痛——原来我正压在一颗小石子上。"

    # game/script.rpy:45467
    old "I looked around me, the faint light illuminating the sewer. My eyes were wet, almost as if I'd been crying."
    new "我环顾四周，微弱的光照出下水道的轮廓。眼眶是湿的，几乎像刚刚哭过。"

    # game/script.rpy:45468
    old "I'm... still underground. What just happened?"
    new "我……还在地底下。刚才到底发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:45469
    old "My head throbbed relentlessly while I came to terms with the realization that I'd fallen unconscious. After so long, I tried to move my arm and received a faint response."
    new "脑袋一阵阵抽痛，我慢慢接受了自己刚才昏过去的事实。过了好一会儿，我试着动了动胳膊，才得到一点微弱的回应。"

    # game/script.rpy:45470
    old "Right... I just traveled from the tower. It's November 30th... Again."
    new "对……我刚从塔里穿越过来。今天是 11 月 30 日……又回到了这一天。"

    # game/script.rpy:45471
    old "I exhaled deeply, pulling myself together. That dream, if it could be called that, was almost like the coma I'd been in once already, a haze of half-concepts. It was almost frightening how lost I'd gotten in it.{w} I remembered fragments of it, but the question of whether I wanted to save Miiya was still vividly present in my mind."
    new "我深深呼出一口气，让自己镇定下来。那场梦——如果那也能叫梦的话——几乎像我此前经历过的那次昏迷，是一团由半成形念头组成的迷雾。我在其中迷失得如此之深，事后想来几乎有些后怕。{w} 我只记得一些碎片，但「我是否想救 Miiya」这个问题，仍鲜明地留在脑海中。"

    # game/script.rpy:45472
    old "...Of course I want Miiya to live. What kind of question is that? And what would Atsuki do without her?"
    new "……我当然希望 Miiya 活着。这算什么问题？要是没有她，我又该怎么办？"

    # game/script.rpy:45473
    old "I rested for a bit longer, trying to drive off those intrusive thoughts, until I was eventually able to sit up. I was still lost in the dark, so I pulled out my phone and looked at the time. It was {time=21:34.}"
    new "我又歇了一会儿，试图驱散那些侵入脑中的念头，直到终于能坐起身。四周仍是一片黑暗，我辨不清方向，只好掏出手机看时间。屏幕上显示 {time=21:34.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:45476
    old "It's only been about thirty minutes..."
    new "才过了大约三十分钟……"

    # game/script.rpy:45477
    old "I laboriously stood up and took some mindless steps. I couldn't feel anything around me except the hard concrete. I supposed it wasn't a sewer that I was in since it didn't really smell at all, but I had no idea what it was."
    new "我费力地站起来，漫无目的地挪了几步。周围除了坚硬的水泥，我什么都感觉不到。这里几乎闻不到异味，我想应该不是下水道，可这到底是什么地方，我毫无头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:45478
    old "Wait... What am I supposed to do now? Can I really change the past? What the hell is this? Did I appear two weeks into the past, but mere minutes too late to save Miiya? It can't be, right...? Why would I have gone so far back?"
    new "等等……我现在该怎么办？我真的能改变过去吗？这到底是怎么回事？我是回到了两周前，却偏偏晚了几分钟，没能救下 Miiya？不会吧……？我为什么要回到那么早的时候？"

    # game/script.rpy:45479
    old "Completely perplexed, I walked forward, toward the darkness. It wasn't possible to reach the hole above me, so I had to hope I could walk out of there."
    new "我满心困惑，朝着黑暗走去。头顶那个洞口够不到，我只能寄希望于顺着这里走出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:45482
    old "After a few steps, I ran into a wall. The darkness should've been terrifying, but I wasn't scared. I needed to get out of there and hope I could find out where I was."
    new "走了几步，我撞上了一堵墙。这样的黑暗本该令人恐惧，我却并不害怕。我必须离开这里，也希望能弄清自己身在何处。"

    # game/script.rpy:45483
    old "I flipped open my phone, but the light from the screen wasn't enough to illuminate the path ahead. After feeling the space, I knew there were two tunnels in front of me, one much larger than the other."
    new "我翻开手机，屏幕的光却照不亮前方的路。我伸手摸索了一番，才知道面前有两条通道，一条比另一条宽得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:45484
    old "I could only go through one, so I kept walking toward the one that seemed wide and dry."
    new "我只能选一条，便朝着那条显得宽敞干燥的继续走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:45490
    old "If I can change the past... can I prevent the attack in the tower from happening? I can at least prevent Atsuki and myself from going there, but would this really work?"
    new "如果我能改变过去……是不是就能阻止塔里那场袭击？至少能让我和 Atsuki 不去那里，可这样做真的有用吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:45491
    old "What would happen to me? I've already thought of this, but if I change the past, would I remain in a world with another version of myself?"
    new "那我自己又会怎样？这问题我早已想过——若我改变了过去，我还会留在一个存在着另一个我的世界里吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:45492
    old "And if I can do that, should I? Instead of trying to travel back one more time and save Miiya in the first place?"
    new "就算真能做到，我该这么做吗？还是该再穿越一次，从一开始就救下 Miiya？"

    # game/script.rpy:45496
    old "...{w}The darkness had become absolute. On that day, the Sekimeiya must've been somewhere. As Ashiya's announcement had already been made public, they were probably keeping it somewhere in the tower."
    new "……{w}黑暗已彻底吞没了一切。那一天，Sekimeiya 一定就在某处。既然芦屋的声明早已公开，他们多半把它存放在塔内的某个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:45497
    old "I walked for minutes, every individual step feeling surreal, and the bright image of the screen frozen in my mind. November 30th..."
    new "我走了好几分钟，每一步都恍如梦境，屏幕上那明亮的画面仍定格在脑海里。11月30日……"

    # game/script.rpy:45498
    old "I kept going, hugging the wall next to me. At one point, the path began to slant up, making every step tougher."
    new "我贴着身旁的墙壁继续前行。走着走着，通道开始向上倾斜，每一步都愈发吃力。"

    # game/script.rpy:45499
    old "...How do I get out of here? Should there be a ladder somewhere?"
    new "……我要怎么出去？这附近应该会有梯子吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:45500
    old "For an entire day, I'd grown used to hearing the echo of my own footsteps with no other sound. I wasn't in that tower anymore, but the sensation was identical."
    new "整整一天下来，我已经习惯了四下无声、只听见自己脚步的回音。我已不在那座塔里，感觉却一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:45504
    old "I slowly increased my pace. I was so close to finally being outside again."
    new "我渐渐加快脚步。终于快要重新回到外面了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45505
    old "The tunnel was a straight path, seemingly unending. After walking for a while, I started to feel a little desperate."
    new "通道笔直延伸，仿佛没有尽头。走了一阵，我心里渐渐生出一丝绝望。"

    # game/script.rpy:45506
    old "Was I going toward an exit, or was I completely lost? I couldn't see anything that distinguished where I was."
    new "我是在走向出口，还是早已彻底迷了路？眼前没有任何东西能让我辨认方位。"

    # game/script.rpy:45507
    old "I was too dedicated to my path to turn around and go the other way. It almost felt like there would be a monster waiting behind me if I did. I could only keep moving, almost like I was in a dream of an ever-lengthening corridor."
    new "我太执着于这条路，已无法回头另走他途。仿佛只要转身，身后就会有怪物等着。我只能不停往前走，就像在梦里走过一条越走越长的走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:45516
    old "Finally, that sensation ended. I located a ladder and climbed out of the channel's end. Around me was a grassy field covered in snow, the sky firmly situated above me. It was real."
    new "那感觉终于结束了。我找到一架梯子，从通道尽头爬了出去。四周是一片覆雪的草地，天空稳稳地悬在头顶。这一切都是真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:45521
    old "I couldn't fathom the image. In front of me, I saw Yushibana, entirely still. A chilly breeze forced me to shrug my coat higher and cover my neck."
    new "眼前的景象让我一时难以置信。前方是丰花，一片寂静。冷风袭来，我只好把大衣往上拢了拢，遮住脖子。"

    # game/script.rpy:45522
    old "I'd been trapped for hours in a building I could see the faintest outline of on the horizon, but that wasn't all. Seeing Yushibana below me brought a relief I hadn't known was possible. Seeing that I'd been released, all my questions fell away."
    new "我被困在那栋建筑里好几个小时，如今它在地平线上只剩一个模糊的轮廓。但还不止这些。俯望着下方的丰花，我感到一种从未有过的宽慰。看到自己终于脱身，所有疑问都烟消云散了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45524
    old "I didn't know why I was atop that hill or what had happened to me. All I knew in that moment was a soaring sense of liberty. I was actually free."
    new "我不知道自己为何会站在那座山丘上，也不知道自己经历了什么。那一刻我唯一感受到的，是一种昂扬的自由感。我真的自由了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45530
    old "I looked inside my purse again and saw keys."
    new "我又翻了翻手提包，看见了钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:45531
    old "These belong to my apartment. They're not Atsuki's.{w} ...The tickets aren't here either."
    new "这是我公寓的钥匙，不是 Atsuki 的。{w}……票据也不在。"

    # game/script.rpy:45534
    old "I pushed off the snow on the stone that formed the tunnel and sat on it. Every part of my body still hurt, especially my back."
    new "我拂去通道口那块石头上的积雪，坐了上去。全身各处都还在作痛，尤其是后背。"

    # game/script.rpy:45535
    old "I was breathing calmly, observing the silent town. From there, I could see the entirety of Yushibana. Close to me was the school I'd gone to and a familiar park next to it."
    new "我平稳地呼吸着，打量着这座寂静的小镇。从这里能望见整个丰花。离我最近的是我念过的学校，旁边还有那座熟悉的公园。"

    # game/script.rpy:45536
    old "There was no way to really be sure, but I assumed that the tunnel I'd gone through was part of some kind of drainage system. It sloped down the hill into the center of town, and I couldn't think of any other function for it than collecting water that would otherwise flood."
    new "我无法确证，但猜想自己走过的通道属于某种排水系统。它顺着山坡向下，通向镇中心；除了汇集原本会漫出来的水，我想不出它还有别的用途。"

    # game/script.rpy:45537
    old "...It didn't really matter. I was out. The drainage channel, or whatever it was, hadn't swept me away or drowned me. That long tunnel was a path to salvation. I didn't know the true state of the world I was looking down on, but all by myself, I was finally able to experience peace."
    new "……这些都不重要了。我出来了。那条排水道也好，别的什么也罢，终究没有把我冲走，也没有把我淹死。那条漫长的通道，是通往救赎的路。我不知道自己俯瞰的这个世界究竟是什么样子，但独自一人，我终于得以体会片刻安宁。"

    # game/script.rpy:45544
    old "Forcing myself to move, I stood up and began to descend a thin path that started from the tunnel."
    new "我勉强撑起身，沿着从通道口延伸出去的一条窄径往山下走。"

    # game/script.rpy:45550
    old "I sensed my boots pressing on the snow until I was down the hill. Upon turning around, I saw the trail of footprints that I'd left. ...As bizarre as it was, I looked at them as proof that I was really there."
    new "我感受着靴子踩在雪上的触感，一路走下山坡。回头望去，只见身后留下了一串脚印。……说来古怪，我却把它们当作自己确实来过这里的证明。"

    # game/script.rpy:45551
    old "My phone showed {time=21:48}, and I was behind my school, where I'd rarely ever been at such a time."
    new "手机显示{time=21:48}，我正站在学校后面——这个时间，我几乎从未来过这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:45554
    old "Much farther in the distance, I could see the top of the only structure that rivaled Ashiya Tower's height."
    new "更远的地方，我能看见那座唯一可与芦屋塔比肩的建筑顶端。"

    # game/script.rpy:45555
    old "The hospital... Is that where I am right now? Or am I being brought there?"
    new "医院……我现在就在那里吗？还是说，我正被送往那里？"

    # game/script.rpy:45556
    old "I couldn't comprehend yet how the travel had worked, but I walked around the school and found myself in the park we'd been at that very day."
    new "我还弄不明白这次穿越究竟是如何发生的，但我绕过学校，来到了那天我们待过的那座公园。"

    # game/script.rpy:45563
    old "I started to hear faint voices around me and saw dark silhouettes next to one of the benches. Of course, I wasn't alone in the town."
    new "我渐渐听见周围传来隐约的人声，还看见一张长椅旁有几道深色的身影。当然，镇上并不只有我一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:45564
    old "Unaware of where I was headed, I followed the steps we'd taken at a time that felt like a distant past."
    new "我不知道自己要去哪里，只是循着我们当初走过的路线前行。那段时光，如今已像是遥远的过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:45570
    old "Tall, round lights illuminated the rustic part of Yushibana. That day, we'd just happened to end up at a modest shop, but the present me deliberately walked to it."
    new "高大的圆形路灯照亮了丰花古旧的那一片街区。那天我们只是偶然走进一家不起眼的小店，如今的我却特意朝它走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:45571
    old "What will happen if they see me? There's gotta be someone there. ...That's bound to change the past, right?"
    new "要是被他们看见，会怎么样？那里肯定有人。……那一定会改变过去，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:45574
    old "I remembered all the narrow streets. No light could be seen through almost any window, and most of the footprints still on the ground ended at various doors."
    new "那些狭窄的街道我都记得。几乎每扇窗里都透不出灯光，地上残留的脚印大多止于各家门前。"

    # game/script.rpy:45580
    old "I looked from the final turn and stared at where the shop had been."
    new "我从最后一个拐角望去，凝视着那家小店原本所在的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:45582
    old "In front of the door were two people talking to each other. One of them wore a suit, and the other wore casual clothes for the cold."
    new "门前有两个人正在交谈。一个穿着西装，另一个穿着御寒的便装。"

    # game/script.rpy:45583
    old "I don't recognize either of them."
    new "这两个人我都不认得。"

    # game/script.rpy:45585
    old "Should I step forward? What would they ask me, and how would I answer anything?"
    new "我该上前吗？他们会问我什么，我又该怎么回答？"

    # game/script.rpy:45589
    old "I chose to stay still. If the past could be changed, that wasn't the way to do it."
    new "我选择按兵不动。如果过去真的能改变，也不该用这种方式。"

    # game/script.rpy:45590
    old "Next to them was the window that had once grabbed our attention. I couldn't hear anything they were saying, but they hadn't sensed me either."
    new "他们旁边就是那扇曾经吸引我们目光的橱窗。我听不见他们在说什么，他们也没有察觉到我。"

    # game/script.rpy:45592
    old "Not long after, the man in a suit walked away. The other person saw him off and stayed where he'd been. That gave me the chance to look at his face."
    new "没过多久，穿西装的男人离开了。另一个人目送他走远，仍留在原处。这让我有机会看清他的脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:45593
    old "Oh... It's the owner of the shop."
    new "哦……是那家店的老板。"

    # game/script.rpy:45594
    old "The other man was walking toward me, so I backed off toward another path to avoid being seen."
    new "另一个男人正朝我这边走来，我连忙退向另一条小路，以免被发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:45600
    old "I suddenly bumped into a car camouflaged by the dark. In the sky, the moon was hardly visible, not helping things. Fortunately, the snow on the ground told me where I was every step."
    new "我忽然撞上了一辆隐没在夜色里的车。天上的月亮几乎看不见，也没帮上什么忙。幸好地上的积雪让我每走一步都能辨清方位。"

    # game/script.rpy:45602
    old "I seemed to be the only person there, so I kept going until I arrived at a road full of wheel marks."
    new "那里似乎只有我一个人，我便一直往前走，直到来到一条布满车轮印的道路上。"

    # game/script.rpy:45607
    old "The streets were wider, and a couple walked by me. After so long, there was life around me, and the strain on my shoulders slowly faded away."
    new "街道变得更宽阔了，一对情侣从身旁走过。隔了这么久，身边终于又有了活人的气息，压在肩头的紧绷也一点点松了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:45608
    old "...Should I just go home?"
    new "……我是不是该直接回家？"

    # game/script.rpy:45609
    old "Atsuki was also brought to the hospital, and I was there for a week. I have the keys, so I really can just do that."
    new "Atsuki 也被送进了医院，我在那里待了一周。钥匙就在我手上，真的可以直接回家。"

    # game/script.rpy:45610
    old "For what purpose was I in the past, standing next to a lonesome streetlight? I knew I had to do something. I could change history... But sleep was the only thing on my mind. My body still felt battered and weakened."
    new "我身处过去，站在一盏孤零零的路灯旁，究竟是为了什么？我明白自己必须做点什么。我可以改变历史……可眼下我满脑子只想着睡觉。身体仍像被碾过一样，虚弱无力。"

    # game/script.rpy:45611
    old "Getting to my bed was my priority. Everything else had become a background concern, as there was nothing I could do right then."
    new "当务之急是回到床上。其他事都先放到一边——反正此刻我什么也做不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45612
    old "Why am I so tired? I feel different from when I was in the tower. ...Is it because this is how I was at this time on November 30th?"
    new "我怎么会这么累？和在塔里时完全不一样。……是因为11月30日的这一刻，我本来就是这个状态吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:45615
    old "My apartment was close by, and I needed to rest. At that time of night, nobody should've been there."
    new "公寓就在附近，我需要休息。这个时间点，那里不该有任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:45619
    old "The cold was starting to get to me, so I tightened my coat around my shoulders as I walked. Taking my time, I observed my surroundings as I walked, all of them covered in the same white layer of snow."
    new "寒气渐渐渗进身体，我边走边把大衣裹紧。脚步不急，我一路打量着四周——目之所及，都覆着同样一层白雪。"

    # game/script.rpy:45620
    old "What will I do...? I can only hope that I'll understand everything better tomorrow, but I should have enough time to think about it. If I'm right... my parents aren't even in Japan, I'm about to spend a week in the hospital, and then I'll go to live with Atsuki. I can just be at my apartment until the 15th comes again."
    new "我该怎么办……？只能指望明天能把一切想得更明白些，好在时间还算充裕。如果我没记错……父母根本不在日本，我接下来要在医院待上一周，之后会去和 Atsuki 同住。那么在15日再次到来之前，我只要待在公寓里就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:45621
    old "But then what? Should I try to make us not go to the tower? How would I attempt to prevent the attack from happening? Even if Atsuki and I don't go, there are people who will die.{w} And in both cases, I'm giving up on going to the past again to save Miiya. If the past can be changed, I can't just leave her to die."
    new "可那之后呢？难道要设法让我们别去那座塔？我又要怎么阻止那场袭击？就算我和 Atsuki 不去，也还是会有人死。{w} 而无论走哪条路，我都等于放弃再次回到过去救 Miiya。既然过去可以改变，我就不能眼睁睁看着她死去。"

    # game/script.rpy:45622
    old "But this is still really scary. At the time I change the past, I'll be stuck in a world with another self of mine, and I won't be the original.{w} The me that Atsuki saw in the event room... will it really be me? Will I decide that I don't want to change the past just so that I keep living in a world where I'm the only version of myself? I wouldn't do that, would I?"
    new "可这仍然叫人心惊。等我改变过去的那一刻，我就会被困在一个还有另一个自己的世界里，不再是原来的那一个。{w} Atsuki 在活动室看到的那个我……真的会是我吗？我会不会为了继续待在一个只有我这个版本的世界里，就决定不去改变过去？我不会做出这种事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:45630
    old "Arriving home, I saw a few people talking to each other. They had no idea I was from the future. Of course, nobody knew about the Sekimeiya's powers yet."
    new "快到家时，我看见几个人正聚在一处说话。他们全然不知我来自未来。当然，那时还没有人知道 Sekimeiya 拥有怎样的力量。"

    # game/script.rpy:45631
    old "...How is that actually possible? The Sekimeiya has already been announced as a discovery, so why will they let the public touch it with what it can do? Did Ashiya not know about that? I have no idea where it even came from."
    new "……这怎么可能？Sekimeiya 已经作为一项发现公开了，可它有这样的力量，他们怎么还让公众碰它？难道芦屋并不知道这件事？我连它究竟从哪来都毫无头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:45632
    old "In the past, all those questions still had no answers. I turned toward a narrower street full of apartment blocks and looked far ahead."
    new "在过去，这些问题都还没有答案。我拐进一条狭窄些的街，两旁尽是公寓楼，目光投向街道深处。"

    # game/script.rpy:45637
    old "I stopped in the middle of it and went up a white, metallic staircase. On the way, I took my keys out and walked to a door below a \"C\" plate."
    new "我在街心停下，走上白色的金属楼梯。途中掏出钥匙，走到一扇挂着「C」字门牌的房门前。"

    # game/script.rpy:45639
    old "I stood in front of it and tried to sharpen my hearing."
    new "我立在门前，竖起耳朵细听。"

    # game/script.rpy:45641
    old "I can't hear anything..."
    new "什么也听不见……"

    # game/script.rpy:45642
    old "A little nervous, I inserted the key into the keyhole and kept it there for a while. Finally, I decided to turn it, making little noise."
    new "我有些紧张，把钥匙插进锁孔，停在那里好一会儿。最后还是转动了它，尽量不发出声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:45643
    old "Should I try to be silent? If I'm somehow in here, do I want to not be heard? What would I even do if I see myself? I can't go anywhere else."
    new "我该尽量不出声吗？如果这屋里真的还有另一个我，我会希望自己不被听见吗？要是撞见自己，我又能怎么办？反正我无处可去。"

    # game/script.rpy:45645
    old "I opened the door slowly."
    new "我缓缓推开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:45653
    old "The faint light of the night illuminated the way in, and I took a hesitant step forward."
    new "夜色里透进微光，照亮了门内的路，我迟疑着迈出一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:45657
    old "Naturally, I knew where the light switch was, so I reached out to it while I glanced around. When the ceiling lit up, I saw the same entrance I'd seen countless times before."
    new "电灯开关在哪，我自然一清二楚，于是一边伸手摸过去，一边环视四周。天花板亮起来后，映入眼中的是见过无数次的玄关。"

    # game/script.rpy:45658
    old "Next to the door, I saw my reflection in the mirror. I looked a lot better than I'd imagined, probably because the body I was in hadn't made it to December yet."
    new "门旁的镜子里映出我的身影。气色比我想象中好得多——大概因为这具身体还没撑到12月吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:45659
    old "I closed the door and stood in the middle of the room, not much warmer. I still felt uneasy, so instead of taking off my shoes, I opened the door to the living room."
    new "我关上门，站在屋子中央，并没暖和多少。心里仍不安稳，便没脱鞋，直接推开了通往客厅的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:45668
    old "There was a large window with its blinds closed, and in the center of the room, a wooden table on top of a green carpet. Everything looked like it had when I'd left on the 30th."
    new "大窗的百叶帘拉着，房间正中，一张木桌摆在绿色地毯上。一切都和我30日离开时一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:45669
    old "I really was at home. There was an old TV on top of a low stand that I rarely used due to the poor signal, and colored cushions were scattered all over the floor."
    new "这里确实是我的家。矮柜上摆着一台旧电视，信号太差，我很少开；彩色的坐垫散落了一地。"

    # game/script.rpy:45672
    old "Next to me was the door to the kitchen. In the sink were the few dishes I hadn't washed, and in a corner was the laundry I hadn't finished. That day, I'd been really looking forward to meeting Atsuki and Miiya, and although we hadn't ended up doing much, I'd been excited to go."
    new "身旁是通往厨房的门。水槽里泡着几只没洗的碗碟，角落里堆着没洗完的衣物。那天我满心期待着去见 Atsuki 和 Miiya，虽然最后也没做什么，出门时却是兴致勃勃的。"

    # game/script.rpy:45675
    old "...I walked back and opened the other door in the entryway."
    new "……我折回去，打开了玄关里的另一扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:45679
    old "After lighting up the short hallway, I stepped to the first door. My bedroom was behind it."
    new "短廊的灯亮起后，我走到第一扇门前。那后面是我的卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:45682
    old "Farther back were the last three doors. One led to my parents' bedroom, the other to the bathroom, and the last was a guest room with a small bed."
    new "再往里是最后三扇门。一扇通父母的卧室，一扇通浴室，最后一扇后面是摆着小床的客房。"

    # game/script.rpy:45683
    old "I'd been storing things in the guest room since it'd been unused for so long, cramming a bookcase full. Recently, my drive to read had dropped off, but I still kept my favorites front and center."
    new "客房闲置已久，早被我拿来堆东西，书架塞得满满当当。最近看书的劲头淡了，可最喜欢的那些，仍摆在最显眼的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:45684
    old "Nothing was out of place. Everything I'd put in there hadn't moved even slightly."
    new "没有任何异样。我放在那里的东西，一丝一毫都没动过。"

    # game/script.rpy:45689
    old "There really is nobody here."
    new "这里真的一个人都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:45690
    old "It was the same modest apartment I'd always lived in, but it seemed like I'd last been there a very long time in the past.{w} I'd left a trail of slick, snowy footprints, so I went to the entrance and dropped my boots beside the door."
    new "这还是我住惯的那间朴素公寓，可上一次待在这里，仿佛已是极为遥远的过去了。{w} 我留下一串湿滑的雪脚印，于是回到玄关，把靴子脱在门边。"

    # game/script.rpy:45699
    old "I entered my bedroom and draped my wet coat on a chair. My headache had been weakening, but many of my muscles were still sore."
    new "我走进卧室，把湿外套搭在椅子上。头痛已经减轻了些，肌肉却仍酸痛不已。"

    # game/script.rpy:45701
    old "I couldn't even tell if I was hungry, and my thirst was dwarfed by how tired I was. I left my purse next to the bed and fell on it with the clothes I'd been wearing."
    new "我连自己饿不饿都分辨不出，口渴也被疲惫压得不见踪影。我把手提包丢在床边，衣服都没换就扑倒在床上。"

    # game/script.rpy:45707
    old "I closed my eyes on top of the large pillow and gradually wormed my way under the blankets."
    new "我趴在大枕头上闭上眼，一点点挪进被窝。"

    # game/script.rpy:45709
    old "I was exhausted, but I didn't fall asleep immediately. There were too many things I had to think about."
    new "我筋疲力尽，却没能立刻睡着。要想的事情太多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45710
    old "I'd just spent more than twelve hours sealed inside Ashiya Tower, so the sensation of my bed was far beyond welcome. However, it seemed I had suddenly arrived on the day where everything started."
    new "我刚在封闭的芦屋塔里熬过十二个多小时，能重新躺回床上，舒服得简直难以言喻。可看样子，我是一下子落到了这一切开始的那一天。"

    # game/script.rpy:45711
    old "In the distance of the town must've been Atsuki, crying about the possibility of losing his two closest friends. Somewhere else, other people were surely thinking about the attack they'd orchestrate on December 15th."
    new "在小镇远处的某个地方，Atsuki 想必正为可能失去两位挚友而哭泣。而在别处，也一定有人正在盘算着12月15日要发动的那场袭击。"

    # game/script.rpy:45712
    old "I soon felt like I should've turned on the heater, but I couldn't get out of bed. My mind went through most of the events I'd been caught up in, and I still didn't reach a single conclusion. I had wanted to change the past, but comfortable as I was beneath two blankets, that was comparable to moving a mountain by hand."
    new "我很快觉得该去开暖气了，却怎么也起不了床。我把卷入其中的那些事在脑中过了一遍又一遍，却仍没得出任何结论。我明明想改变过去，可裹着两层毯子实在舒服，真要去做，简直如同徒手移山。"

    # game/script.rpy:45719
    old "Huh—"
    new "咦——"

    # game/script.rpy:45720
    old "A sound reached my covered ears and woke me up. I was frightened at first, but I quickly realized it had come from outside."
    new "有声响透过被子传进我耳朵，把我惊醒。我起初吓了一跳，随即明白是从外面传来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:45724
    old "And it didn't stop."
    new "而且一直没停。"

    # game/script.rpy:45725
    old "...Fireworks?"
    new "……烟花？"

    # game/script.rpy:45726
    old "Hearing fireworks in Yushibana was rare, but it was the start of the holiday season."
    new "在丰花能听到烟花声实属少见，不过，节日季已经开始了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45727
    old "I removed my head from under the blankets and paid attention to the sound. While it wasn't close to where I was, brief sparks of light could be seen through the window."
    new "我把头从被子里探出来，仔细听那声音。那声音离我并不近，但透过窗户能看见零星闪动的光。"

    # game/script.rpy:45728
    old "I knew the air was still chilly, but I braced myself and pushed the blankets aside."
    new "我知道屋里还冷，还是咬咬牙，把被子掀开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45729
    old "I sat up and looked at my phone. It was {time=1:06.}{w} When I looked behind me, I saw the large screen of glass turning orange momentarily, reflecting the distant light."
    new "我坐起身，看了眼手机。时间是{time=1:06.}{w}回头望去，只见那面巨大的玻璃屏一瞬间染上橘色，映着远方的光。"

    # game/script.rpy:45736
    old "...They really are fireworks. I never hear them here because the police always shut them down, but I bet someone sneaked some into town and wanted to celebrate the holidays."
    new "……真的是烟花。我在这儿从没听过烟花声，因为警察总会来制止。不过，准是有人偷偷带了些进城，想庆祝节日吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:45739
    old "I couldn't help but feel as if they were welcoming me, although I knew the truth was far from that."
    new "明知事实远非如此，我却不由得觉得，那烟花像是在迎接我。"

    # game/script.rpy:45740
    old "I was in a coma, so I'd never truly heard or seen those fireworks. There was nothing I wanted more than to view them with Atsuki and Miiya, but that couldn't happen."
    new "那时我昏迷不醒，从未真正听过、看过那场烟花。我最想的就是和 Atsuki、Miiya 一起看，可那终究不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:45741
    old "Would it be possible to change the past so that it could?"
    new "改变过去，就能让它成真吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:45745
    old "The past is really changing, though."
    new "不过，过去确实正在改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:45746
    old "It had already been changed. That I was seeing those fireworks was the proof."
    new "过去早已被改变过了。我能看见这场烟花，就是证明。"

    # game/script.rpy:45747
    old "I was allowed to live through what I'd missed out on—the two weeks where I hadn't lived."
    new "我得以重新经历自己错过的那些日子——那我不曾活过的两周。"

    # game/script.rpy:45749
    old "I simply stared at the distant lights. My eyelids were drooping, but I didn't want to stop watching."
    new "我只是凝望着远处的灯火。眼皮渐渐发沉，我却不愿移开视线。"

    # game/script.rpy:45756
    old "The fireworks didn't last much longer. After a few minutes, the stronger ones went off, and they all calmly ceased."
    new "烟花没有持续太久。几分钟后，更猛烈的那几发也放完了，一切便悄然平息。"

    # game/script.rpy:45759
    old "I dropped back onto the bed, still with no energy to turn on the heater or put on warmer clothes. That time, I fell asleep almost instantly."
    new "我重新倒回床上，依旧提不起力气去开暖气，也懒得添件厚衣。这一次，我几乎立刻就睡着了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45767
    old "I opened my eyes."
    new "我睁开眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:45775
    old "Fresh Start"
    new "全新的开始"

    # game/script.rpy:45777
    old "I wasn't in the attic. I was in my own bedroom, facing the pillow I'd evidently rolled off of."
    new "我不在阁楼，而是在自己的卧室里，脸贴着枕头——看来我是从枕头上滚下来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:45778
    old "The whole room was lit, sunlight streaming through the window. With my face still under the blankets, I closed my eyes again, not yet wanting to face the cold."
    new "整间屋子都亮着，阳光从窗口倾泻进来。脸仍蒙在被子里，我又闭上了眼，还不想去面对那股寒气。"

    # game/script.rpy:45783
    old "The first day of December...{w} Miiya's not here anymore, I'm in the hospital, and Atsuki's probably at his house.{w} Or, I guess I'm actually in my bed."
    new "十二月一号……{w}Miiya 已经不在了，我在医院，Atsuki 大概在他家。{w}不对，我现在其实躺在自己床上。"

    # game/script.rpy:45784
    old "I vividly remembered parts of a dream I'd just had. We'd all still been in the tower, and while the details escaped my grasp, it had entailed a messy conflict with the Sekimeiya."
    new "刚才那个梦的片段，我记得清清楚楚。我们还在塔里，细节已经记不清了，只记得那是一场与 Sekimeiya 之间混乱的冲突。"

    # game/script.rpy:45786
    old "Out of nowhere, I realized I'd been lying in bed for a while without doing anything.{w} ...It had happened so quickly. It felt like just minutes ago I'd been waiting with everyone in the lobby."
    new "不知怎的，我忽然发觉自己已经躺了好一阵，什么都没做。{w}……事情发生得太快了。仿佛几分钟前，我还在大厅里和大家一起等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:45787
    old "I'd been distressed in the tower, so why was I acting like nothing had happened? Was it just because I'd traveled to the past? Because there were two blank weeks ahead of me, and there was no reason to go over things I'd worried about once already? That logic didn't make a lot of sense."
    new "在塔里时我明明那么痛苦，如今为何像个没事人一样？难道只因为我回到了过去？因为眼前还有空白的两个星期，所以没必要再去想已经烦恼过的事？这道理说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:45788
    old "I'd gone to the past to change it, and I hadn't known how far I'd go. Since I was in the hospital at the time, as long as I went to Atsuki's house, I'd be changing the past. If he saw two versions of myself, he would have to believe anything I said."
    new "我回到过去，是为了改变它，只是不知道自己究竟能走到哪一步。既然那时的我正躺在医院，只要我去了 Atsuki 家，过去就已经改变。要是他看见两个我，无论我说什么，他都只能相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:45789
    old "But I didn't rush out of bed, and I probably knew the real reason why. It was sheer burnout."
    new "可我并没有急着下床，真正的原因，我大概也心知肚明——纯粹是心力耗尽了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45792
    old "In a way, it was similar to how I'd felt before meeting up with Atsuki and Miiya, the period when I had absolutely no idea what to do with myself. I'd gone nowhere and done nothing for an amount of time I couldn't measure. I had lost track of days, existing solely in my apartment."
    new "某种意义上，这和与 Atsuki、Miiya 重逢之前的感觉很像——那时我完全不知道自己该做什么。我哪儿也不去，什么也不做，日子过得一片模糊，只是待在公寓里活着。"

    # game/script.rpy:45793
    old "It had been a major depressive episode at the very least, but getting back together with not only one friend, but two, was the remedy for that. That was what I'd thought, anyway."
    new "至少那是一次严重的抑郁发作，而与朋友重聚——不是一个，而是两个——便是它的解药。反正我那时是这么想的。"

    # game/script.rpy:45794
    old "...Miiya had died, and I'd entered a coma. If I'd been living in a haze before, it evolved into a thick fog at that point. I was a shell of a person for a while, thinking almost exclusively about dangerously dark things. I was grateful that Atsuki hadn't given up on me entirely for everything I'd put him through."
    new "……Miiya 死了，我也陷入了昏迷。如果说之前我只是活在迷雾里，那时便成了伸手不见五指的大雾。有很长一段时间，我只是一具空壳，脑子里几乎只剩危险的黑暗念头。我那样折腾他，Atsuki 却没有彻底放弃我，我对此心怀感激。"

    # game/script.rpy:45795
    old "But it was a distinctly different situation. Rather than falling deeper into dysfunction, I had obtained a goal after going so far into the past. An abstract one, but a goal nonetheless."
    new "可这次的情形截然不同。我没有陷得更深，反而在回到这么远的过去之后，得到了一个目标。虽然抽象，但终究是个目标。"

    # game/script.rpy:45799
    old "I kept lying there until my remaining tiredness dissipated. I knew I had to do something, but I didn't know what."
    new "我继续躺着，直到残余的倦意散尽。我知道自己必须做点什么，却不知道究竟该做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:45800
    old "I gathered the strength to sit up and looked at the window. Going off the strong light, I had slept for quite a few hours."
    new "我攒起力气坐起身，望向窗外。看这光线的强度，我应该已经睡了好几个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:45801
    old "My purse was next to the bed, so I grabbed my phone."
    new "手提包就放在床边，我从中取出手机。"

    # game/script.rpy:45802
    old "{time=12:43.}..{w} It's late."
    new "{time=12:43.}……{w}都这么晚了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45803
    old "As the buildings in Yushibana weren't very tall, I was able to see a good deal of the snow-covered town from my room. It wasn't snowing, and the sky was pretty clear. From behind the window, I felt as if I was aware of the fate of the entire town, even though what I knew was only related to a modest fraction of all those buildings."
    new "丰花的建筑都不算高，从我的房间能望见大片积雪覆盖的城镇。雪已经停了，天空相当晴朗。隔着窗户，我仿佛知晓了整座城镇的命运——尽管我所知道的，只涉及那些建筑中很小的一部分。"

    # game/script.rpy:45808
    old "The icy air quickly got to me, so I went to the hallway, carefully walking on the wooden floor so that I wouldn't stagger."
    new "刺骨的寒气很快逼了上来，我便走向走廊，在木地板上小心迈步，免得脚步踉跄。"

    # game/script.rpy:45811
    old "I reached the heater, which I'd normally only turn on during the nights since my parents were the ones who paid for my expenses and I didn't want to risk upsetting them."
    new "我走到暖气前。平时我只在夜里才开，毕竟我的开销都由父母承担，我不想惹他们不快。"

    # game/script.rpy:45812
    old "This will be fine, right? Nobody's supposed to be living here, but I doubt it'll be noticed that gas and water were used."
    new "这样应该没问题吧？这房子本该没人住，不过就算用了煤气和水，大概也不会有人注意到。"

    # game/script.rpy:45813
    old "I hesitated a little, but I needed to get rid of the oppressive cold. Seconds after I turned the heater on, it let out a buzzing sound from the pipes running behind the wall."
    new "我犹豫了一下，可实在受不了这股压人的寒意。暖气开了不过几秒，墙后管道里便传出嗡嗡的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:45814
    old "I guess even if someone does notice, it'll be at the end of this month or maybe after that. It should be okay."
    new "就算真有人发现，估计也要到月底，或者更晚。应该不要紧。"

    # game/script.rpy:45817
    old "I had a water bottle on the table. I never liked drinking tap water, so I always spent a bit of my monthly money on bottled water. Filters just weren't enough."
    new "桌上放着一瓶水。我一向不爱喝自来水，所以每个月总会花点钱买瓶装水。光靠滤水器并不够。"

    # game/script.rpy:45818
    old "I didn't bother pouring it in a glass. The hours I'd spent in Ashiya Tower no longer applied to my body, but I was extremely thirsty."
    new "我懒得倒进杯子。在芦屋塔里度过的那几个小时，已经不算在我这具身体上了，可我实在渴得厉害。"

    # game/script.rpy:45819
    old "To avoid grocery shopping too often, I usually had a cabinet packed with supplies. I would refill it at the beginning of every month, which was why it was almost empty. I looked inside and grabbed a bag of mixed nuts. As expected, they weren't very good, as they had sat in the cabinet all month, but I ate all of them almost instantly due to how hungry I was."
    new "为了少跑几趟超市，我平时总把橱柜塞满存粮。每月初补一次货，所以现在里面几乎空了。我翻了翻，拿出一袋混合坚果。果然，放了一整月，味道已经不太好，可我饿得厉害，三两口就吃了个精光。"

    # game/script.rpy:45823
    old "I walked to the living room, almost like it was routine. The blinds were keeping the space dim, but I rarely bothered raising them."
    new "我几乎是习惯性地走向客厅。百叶窗让屋里显得昏暗，不过我很少会去拉开。"

    # game/script.rpy:45826
    old "After going to the bathroom, I stood in front of my wardrobe, wondering which clothes to change into. I'd lived alone for many months already, so I started the day as if it were a normal one."
    new "去过洗手间后，我站在衣柜前，琢磨该换哪身衣服。独自生活已有好几个月，我便像平常一样开始了这一天。"

    # game/script.rpy:45829
    old "Is it worth trying to make it seem like nobody's been here?"
    new "要不要费心装出没人住过的样子？"

    # game/script.rpy:45830
    old "I don't know how, but if the past can be changed, I'm planning on doing it. There shouldn't be a huge need to hide my stay."
    new "我不知道该怎么做，但只要过去能改变，我就打算去改。应该没必要大费周章地隐瞒我在这儿住过。"

    # game/script.rpy:45831
    old "...Or is that right? Could it be that while I was in the hospital and at Atsuki's house, another version of me was already living here? There's no way, is there? That would mean that everything will happen as I remember it."
    new "……真是这样吗？会不会在我住院、待在 Atsuki 家的时候，另一个我就已经住在这里了？不至于吧？若真如此，就意味着一切都会按我记忆中的样子发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:45832
    old "If the past will only change if I consciously make it, it shouldn't matter whether I was already living here in the reality I know. After all, I didn't come home for the purpose of changing the past."
    new "如果过去只有在我有意识地去改变时才会变，那在我所知的现实里，我是否早就住在这里，也就无关紧要了。毕竟，我回家来并不是为了改变过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:45833
    old "If it's like this, and I intend to say that up until I decide to change history, everything could play out exactly as it once did, it should be confirmation that I'll be able to safely stay here until the 15th."
    new "若真是如此，只要我认定——在我决定改变历史之前，一切都会照旧上演——那就足以证明，我可以安稳地在这里住到十五号。"

    # game/script.rpy:45834
    old "There's nothing that makes it an impossibility, so it could be that I always lived here and that I'm not changing the past yet. My parents never called me to say that someone was living at my place, and I never learned about it otherwise before the 15th, so I can secretly stay here, right? No contradictions."
    new "没有任何理由说这不可能，所以也可能我一直就住在这里，而此刻的我还没有改变过去。父母从没打电话说有人住在我的住处，十五号之前我也没从别处听说过这事，那我偷偷住在这里也没问题吧？没有矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:45835
    old "I had no clue if it would work like that, but worrying about it felt pointless. I chose some casual clothes to put on and stepped back to the living room."
    new "我不知道事情是否真会这样，但干着急也无济于事。我挑了几件便服换上，又回到客厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:45840
    old "...{w}And now what?"
    new "……{w}那么，接下来呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:45841
    old "Even though I had spent a long while living alone in that apartment, I'd always had plenty of things to think about, all of which I'd ended up pushing aside."
    new "我在那间公寓独自住了很久，本来一直有不少事要想，可到头来全被我搁在了一边。"

    # game/script.rpy:45844
    old "I wouldn't, by chance, remember a lottery winning combination, would I...?"
    new "我该不会……碰巧记得彩票的中奖号码吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:45845
    old "...The only reason why I hadn't thought that seriously was because I knew I didn't. Sai had mentioned using the Sekimeiya to win the lottery, but it wasn't actually that crazy of an idea."
    new "……我没往这上面认真想，唯一的原因就是我知道自己根本不记得。Sai 提过用 Sekimeiya 中彩票，可这主意其实也没那么离谱。"

    # game/script.rpy:45846
    old "I didn't think it was greedy, either. In fact, what felt selfish was not taking the chance when it was provided."
    new "我也不觉得这算贪心。真要说自私，反倒是机会摆在眼前却不去用。"

    # game/script.rpy:45847
    old "If I could change the past, I would go back in time again, because that would allow Miiya to be saved. That meant I simply had to remember a winning number before that point. That would create the possibility of a perfect future."
    new "只要过去能改，我就愿意再穿越一次时间，因为那样就能救下 Miiya。也就是说，我只要在那一刻之前想起中奖号码就够了。这样一来，一个完美的未来便有了可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:45849
    old "Was I simply daydreaming in a hellish world? As long as the past could be changed, it didn't seem so. That future certainly felt attainable."
    new "我这是在人间地狱里白日做梦吗？只要过去还能改变，这似乎就不算。那样的未来，确实让人觉得触手可及。"

    # game/script.rpy:45853
    old "Where is the Sekimeiya right now? Ashiya should have it somewhere, but they must be protecting it from Xyn, so there's no way I could touch it."
    new "Sekimeiya 现在在哪儿？应该就在芦屋那里，可他们一定防着 Xyn，我根本碰不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:45854
    old "...Wait, no. That might not be the case."
    new "……等等，不对。也许并非如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:45855
    old "Katei and Suripo explained it to us. The Sekimeiya is merely bait for Xyn to get trapped in the tower. So it's definitely there right now."
    new "Katei 和 Suripo 跟我们解释过。Sekimeiya 不过是把 Xyn 引上钩、把他们困在塔里的诱饵。所以它现在一定就在塔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:45856
    old "They also said that the mechanism to trigger the alarm is based on the cabinet being forced open. Also, Xyn never attacked before the 15th."
    new "他们还说，警报的机制是：展示柜一旦被强行打开就会触发。而且 Xyn 在十五号之前从没发动过袭击。"

    # game/script.rpy:45857
    old "Doesn't that mean that I can change the past by going there during the night and forcing the cabinet open? It's probably not in the event room yet, but it must be somewhere unavailable to the public."
    new "那不就意味着，我只要夜里过去把展示柜强行撬开，就能改变过去？它大概还没摆进活动室，但一定放在外人进不去的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:45858
    old "If I break it open, the alarm will lock me inside, and someone else will be locked in the security room. According to Katei, he hadn't been taking the night shifts recently, so it'll probably be someone else. Will they buy that I'm a Xyn member?"
    new "我要是把它撬开，警报会把我锁在里面，同时另一个人会被锁在监控室。按 Katei 的说法，他最近没值夜班，那多半是别人。对方会相信我是 Xyn 的人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:45860
    old "It sounded pretty dangerous. That could've been a way to travel to the past again, but if it didn't work, I would be caught by the police, ruining everything."
    new "听起来相当危险。这或许能成为再次穿越到过去的一条路，可万一不成，我就会被警察抓住，一切全毁。"

    # game/script.rpy:45863
    old "Why were there times where touching the Sekimeiya didn't do anything? What if it just won't work before the 15th, which is why nobody noticed its powers?"
    new "为什么有时碰到 Sekimeiya 也毫无反应？会不会它在十五号之前根本不起作用，所以一直没人察觉它的力量？"

    # game/script.rpy:45864
    old "Even if the main entrance of the building is locked, assuming the storeroom door did lead to the outside, I could maybe enter through it.{w} ...There's no way I could take the entire cabinet out without triggering the alarm. Someone would be looking at the cameras, and I don't even know where the cabinet is."
    new "就算大楼正门锁着，假如储藏室的门真能通到外面，我也许还能从那里进去。{w}……可我不可能不触发警报就把整个展示柜搬出去。总会有人盯着监控，何况我连展示柜在哪儿都不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:45865
    old "...But to begin with, why did I go so far into the past? I still don't get that."
    new "……可话说回来，我为什么会跑到那么早的过去？这一点我至今想不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:45866
    old "The Sekimeiya was in the water tank, but it couldn't have been there for very long. According to Atsuki, he hid it in one of the lockers a while before that. ...Is it possible it gathered a lot of energy for another reason?"
    new "Sekimeiya 是在水箱里，可它不可能在那里待很久。按 Atsuki 的说法，他在那之前一段时间才把它藏进其中一个储物柜。……有没有可能，它是因为别的原因积蓄了大量能量？"

    # game/script.rpy:45867
    old "Even thinking about it in my living room, there were many things I didn't know about the Sekimeiya. If I could be sure such a plan could work, and I knew how to go days into the past, saving Miiya should've been fairly simple."
    new "就算只是坐在客厅里想，我也清楚自己对 Sekimeiya 还有很多不了解的地方。若我能确定这个计划行得通，又知道该怎么回到好几天前，救下 Miiya 本该是相当简单的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:45869
    old "There's no way that I'll let everything happen exactly as it did already just so that I have a guarantee that the Sekimeiya will work, right...?"
    new "我总不可能为了确保 Sekimeiya 能生效，就任由一切照原样重演一遍吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:45872
    old "The unknown version of me that had been seen in the tower still haunted me, but that couldn't be it."
    new "塔里那个来历不明的我始终让我耿耿于怀，但原因不会是这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:45873
    old "No. If I were to do that, I would also prevent Atsuki and myself from going. That's completely out of the question."
    new "不行。真那么做，我和 Atsuki 就不会去了。这绝对不行。"

    # game/script.rpy:45874
    old "...I wasn't even sure about my situation. My appearance in that dark tunnel was different from all the other times. Instead of teleporting instantly, I had awakened, so I still felt like there was something I was missing."
    new "……连我自己的处境都说不清楚。我出现在那条漆黑隧道里的方式，和以往任何一次都不同。我不是瞬间被传送过去，而是醒过来的，所以我总觉得还有些关键的东西没弄明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:45875
    old "We thought about this once, didn't we? That maybe traveling very far through time would make your memories foggy. Could that be why I feel this way? Is there something that I can't remember...?"
    new "我们以前想过这种可能吧？穿越的时间跨度太大，记忆也许会变得模糊。我现在这样，会不会就是这个缘故？是不是有些事我想不起来了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:45877
    old "I wasn't sure. If there were some memories missing, I had no idea how to get them back."
    new "我无法确定。就算真有什么记忆缺失，我也不知道该怎么找回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:45882
    old "I stood up from the carpet and went to my room."
    new "我从地毯上站起身，走向自己的房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:45885
    old "My purse was still next to my bed. I picked it up and put on my coat. Then, I walked to the doorway, where I'd left the keys I'd appeared with."
    new "手提包还放在床边。我拿起包，穿上外套，然后走到玄关——我出现时带着的那串钥匙就搁在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:45889
    old "I wanted to go outside. If it really was the first day of December, and what I'd thought of applied, there should've been no issue with that. Nobody would be aware that I couldn't be walking in the streets."
    new "我想出门。如果今天真是十二月一日，而我想到的那点也成立，那出门应当毫无问题。没有人会知道，我本不该出现在街上。"

    # game/script.rpy:45894
    old "I put on my boots and opened the door. As expected, the air enclosed by all the mountains was overwhelmingly cold, but I really wanted to go out. On the snow were my footprints from the previous day, and some others ending at the nearby apartments."
    new "我穿上靴子，推开门。群山环绕之下，空气果然冷得逼人，可我还是很想出去。雪地上留着昨天的脚印，还有另一些延伸到附近公寓门口的足迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:45895
    old "It was very rare for me to want to leave the house without knowing why. I usually only went outside with some purpose in mind."
    new "我很少会莫名其妙就想出门。平时只有带着目的，我才会走到外面去。"

    # game/script.rpy:45896
    old "It was true that a lot of responsibility was weighing on me, but I didn't feel pressured. The freedom to make choices allowed me to remain relaxed to some degree."
    new "确实有沉重的责任压在我身上，我却没觉得有多大压力。正因为还能自己选择，我多少保持了从容。"

    # game/script.rpy:45897
    old "I looked at my purse. My wallet was inside it, containing the same amount of money I'd counted before leaving to meet Atsuki and Miiya—not that much."
    new "我看了眼手提包。钱包就在里面，里面的钱和我去见 Atsuki、Miiya 之前数过的一样多——并不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:45902
    old "I closed the door and walked down the stairs. I lived close to the outskirts, and there usually weren't many people around. That wasn't too different that day, as only a handful of people were slowly walking on the sidewalk, wearing overcoats and exhaling misty breaths."
    new "我关上门，走下楼梯。我住在靠近郊区的地方，平时人就不多。那天也差不多，只有寥寥几个人在人行道上慢慢走着，裹着大衣，呼出团团白气。"

    # game/script.rpy:45903
    old "Maybe I really should've thought about where to go before leaving."
    new "也许我出门之前，真该先想好要去哪儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:45907
    old "I walked toward the center of Yushibana, every street looking identical due to the coating of snow. There were a few parked cars and a bunch of footprints on the ground, but the environment felt pretty desolate. Everyone was inside."
    new "我朝丰花中心走去，积雪覆盖之下，每条街看上去都一模一样。地上停着几辆车，还有一片杂乱的脚印，可四周相当冷清。大家都待在屋里。"

    # game/script.rpy:45908
    old "Everything in the immediate vicinity was residential, so I kept thinking about where to go."
    new "附近一带全是住宅，我一路都在琢磨该往哪里去。"

    # game/script.rpy:45909
    old "I guess I don't have to go anywhere. I could just come back when I get tired.{w} This is only for today, though. I seriously need to decide on what to do."
    new "算了，也不必非去哪里。累了直接回来就好。{w}不过仅限今天。我确实得认真想好接下来该怎么办。"

    # game/script.rpy:45910
    old "There were enough citizens in Yushibana that it wasn't very common to know people on the street. That was what allowed me to be unafraid of being recognized and questioned about being in the hospital."
    new "丰花的居民够多，在街上碰见熟人并不常见。也正因为这样，我才敢放心出门，不怕被人认出，质问我怎么不在医院。"

    # game/script.rpy:45911
    old "...Should I go to the tower? What would I even do?{w} And what else is there in town? The library? How long has it been since I went there? Too long, honestly..."
    new "……要去塔那边吗？去了又能做什么？{w}再说镇上还有别的地方可去吗？图书馆？我多久没去过了？老实说，真的太久了……"

    # game/script.rpy:45912
    old "I could try to eat something."
    new "也可以去吃点东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:45916
    old "It had also been a while since I'd eaten anything outside. I always had to use my money well and cook at home."
    new "我也很久没在外面吃过饭了。钱一向要精打细算，我总是在家自己做。"

    # game/script.rpy:45917
    old "I guess I can do whatever I want with the money that I have. It's been duplicated."
    new "我想怎么花手头的钱都行，反正这钱是多出来的一份。"

    # game/script.rpy:45918
    old "I had my purse next to me when I woke up in the hospital, so the original money is there. ...And I'm thinking about winning the lottery."
    new "我在医院醒来时，手提包就在身边，所以原本那份钱还在那儿。……而我居然还在盘算着中彩票。"

    # game/script.rpy:45923
    old "I arrived at the busier section of Yushibana, where I immediately saw a lot more people. Looking all around, I saw that not many stores were open."
    new "我走到丰花比较热闹的地段，人一下子多了起来。环顾四周，开门的店铺却没几家。"

    # game/script.rpy:45924
    old "This might not be a good idea. I've been to all these places at some point."
    new "这也许不是个好主意。这些地方我或多或少都去过。"

    # game/script.rpy:45925
    old "Is it possible that being recognized could be problematic? Would I be changing the past if I accidentally see someone who knows I should be in the hospital?"
    new "被人认出来会不会出问题？要是不小心撞见一个知道我该待在医院的人，我是不是就改变了过去？"

    # game/script.rpy:45926
    old "There's no way what happened wasn't on the news. Even people who don't know me could recognize me."
    new "那件事不可能不上新闻。就算不认识我的人，也可能认出我来。"

    # game/script.rpy:45928
    old "Nothing should happen. If someone sees it as a big issue, then the past has been changed, but that seems very unlikely. And there's no way anything would happen to me. ...Even if I'm found out, it won't make getting to the Sekimeiya any harder."
    new "应该不会出什么事。要是有人把这当成大问题，那就说明过去已经被改变——可这种事几乎不可能发生。而且我更不可能出什么事。……就算被人发现，也不会让我更难接近 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:45929
    old "What would I do, though? I wouldn't want to let Atsuki know. I already traveled to the past alone, going against what the Atsuki in the tower said."
    new "可万一被发现了，我该怎么办？我不想让 Atsuki 知道。毕竟我已经违背了塔里那个 Atsuki 的话，独自穿越到了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:45933
    old "Was I being selfish again? ...Potentially hindering any attempt to save Miiya?"
    new "我是不是又自私了？……甚至可能妨碍到救 Miiya 的行动？"

    # game/script.rpy:45934
    old "I hadn't personally seen the past change yet. Only Atsuki had said that it was possible, and even he hadn't known the full specifics behind it. The worst scenario simply seemed to be me having to use the Sekimeiya on the 15th, taking advantage of the attack."
    new "过去被改变这种事，我还没有亲眼见过。说它有可能的只有 Atsuki，就连他也不清楚其中的具体缘由。最坏的情况，无非是我必须在十五号那天利用那场袭击的机会动用 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:45939
    old "I turned toward a narrower street. As expected, Ina Café was open. It was pretty rare for it to be closed."
    new "我拐进一条更窄的街道。果然，伊娜咖啡馆还开着门。这家店很少歇业。"

    # game/script.rpy:45940
    old "The barista there definitely knows me, and I need to understand better where I am. ...How will someone who knows me react if they see me on this day?"
    new "那家店的咖啡师肯定认识我，而我也得先弄清自己究竟身在何处。……一个认识我的人，在这一天看见我，会是什么反应？"

    # game/script.rpy:45941
    old "I walked to the entrance, finally making up my mind. Through the glass, I saw that the interior was empty and Darfee was wiping down one of the tables. It had been a long time since I'd been there, but there was a time in my life where I frequented the place, enjoying the calm atmosphere."
    new "我终于下定决心，走到店门口。透过玻璃看去，店里空无一人，Darfee 正在擦拭一张桌子。我已经很久没来过这里，但曾有一段日子常来光顾，享受那份安静的氛围。"

    # game/script.rpy:45943
    old "On the ground was a square carpet to clean the snow off my shoes. I used it before opening the door and hesitantly walking in, immediately feeling the warm temperature."
    new "地上铺着一块方形地毯，用来蹭掉鞋上的雪。我先在上面踩了踩，才推开门，迟疑地走进去，暖意立刻扑面而来。"

    # game/script.rpy:45952
    old "Darfee didn't turn around yet, so I looked at what was on the menu. Like in the past, there were light drinks and meals, as well as alcoholic beverages closer to the night."
    new "Darfee 还没转过身来，我便先看了看菜单。和从前一样，有清淡的饮品和简餐，临近夜晚还会供应酒类。"

    # game/script.rpy:45954
    old "Hello."
    new "你好。"

    # game/script.rpy:45955
    old "He suddenly turned around."
    new "他猛地转过身来。"

    # game/script.rpy:45959
    old "{tip=ha}Ha—{/tip}"
    new "{tip=ha}哈——{/tip}"

    # game/script.rpy:45965
    old "Yeah. It's been a while."
    new "嗯，好久不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:45968
    old "Oh my God! Y-You're all right!"
    new "天哪！你、你没事了！"

    # game/script.rpy:45969
    old "...So you know what happened. I am, yes."
    new "……看来你知道发生了什么。是的，我没事。"

    # game/script.rpy:45972
    old "Of course! You were on the news!"
    new "当然知道！你都上新闻了！"

    # game/script.rpy:45973
    old "I managed a bitter smile in response to his relieved expression."
    new "面对他如释重负的神情，我只能回以一个苦笑。"

    # game/script.rpy:45978
    old "I'm so glad you were released so quickly! How are you?"
    new "你能这么快出院，真是太好了！现在感觉怎么样？"

    # game/script.rpy:45979
    old "Makes sense. I'm supposed to be in a coma."
    new "也难怪。按说这个时候，我还该昏迷不醒才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:45980
    old "I'm okay. I was released yesterday. Fortunately, nothing major happened to me."
    new "我没事。昨天刚出院。幸好没受什么重伤。"

    # game/script.rpy:45981
    old "That's really good to hear. If you came to relax and try to forget things, we don't have to talk about it."
    new "听你这么说，我就放心了。如果你是来放松、想把事情忘掉的，那我们就不提这些了。"

    # game/script.rpy:45982
    old "...It's fine. You don't have to worry."
    new "……没关系，你不用顾虑我。"

    # game/script.rpy:45985
    old "Are you sure? I can't imagine what it must be like to lose someone close to you at your age. I'm so sorry."
    new "真的吗？你这个年纪就失去亲近的人，我实在难以想象那是什么滋味。真的很抱歉。"

    # game/script.rpy:45987
    old "...{w}Thank you."
    new "……{w}谢谢你。"

    # game/script.rpy:45988
    old "Do you have any idea what happened? A lot of details weren't published."
    new "你知道到底发生了什么吗？很多细节都没有公开。"

    # game/script.rpy:45989
    old "Unfortunately, no. It all happened suddenly, and we were just caught up in it."
    new "很遗憾，不知道。一切发生得太突然，我们只是被卷了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:45992
    old "He looked down, very clearly pitying me."
    new "他垂下目光，那份怜悯再明显不过。"

    # game/script.rpy:45995
    old "Do you want coffee? I'm sorry, I don't have much else right now."
    new "要喝咖啡吗？抱歉，现在店里也没什么别的。"

    # game/script.rpy:45996
    old "N-No, I don't think I need any right now."
    new "不、不用了，我想我现在不需要。"

    # game/script.rpy:45999
    old "Are you sure? I can make you the Kalitsu Special."
    new "真的不要？我可以给你做一杯 Kalitsu 特调。"

    # game/script.rpy:46000
    old "...What is that?"
    new "……那是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:46001
    old "It's nothing. That's the special."
    new "没什么，就是所谓的「特调」。"

    # game/script.rpy:46004
    old "He cracked a halfhearted smile, obviously trying to cheer me up. I tried to return the look, but I wasn't sure if my own smile was visible or not."
    new "他勉强扯出一丝笑，显然是想让我打起精神。我也想回他一个笑容，却不知道那笑有没有真的挂在脸上。"

    # game/script.rpy:46005
    old "I looked behind the glass cover, where a few pastries remained."
    new "我看向玻璃罩后面，那里还剩着几块点心。"

    # game/script.rpy:46008
    old "...I'm a bit hungry. I could go for this."
    new "……我有点饿了。就要这个吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:46009
    old "I pointed at one covered with dried chocolate."
    new "我指了指其中一块裹着干硬巧克力的。"

    # game/script.rpy:46010
    old "Of course. Give me a second."
    new "好，稍等。"

    # game/script.rpy:46013
    old "...He moved behind the bar, removed it with metallic tongs, and put it on a small plate, which he placed in front of me."
    new "……他走到吧台后，用金属夹子夹起那块点心，放进小碟子里，摆到我面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:46016
    old "Here. Don't worry about asking for anything else."
    new "给。还想要什么尽管开口，别客气。"

    # game/script.rpy:46017
    old "Thank you."
    new "谢谢。"

    # game/script.rpy:46020
    old "I bit into it—I was hungrier than I'd thought."
    new "我咬了一口——我比自己以为的还要饿。"

    # game/script.rpy:46022
    old "What will happen when he realizes that I'm still in the hospital? I haven't heard anything about Darfee in a while, so if everything were to happen as I remember, he shouldn't do anything. I really don't like having to lie to him, though."
    new "等他发现我其实还躺在医院里，会怎么样呢？我已经很久没有 Darfee 的消息了。如果一切都像我记得的那样发生，他应该不会做什么。只是，我实在不喜欢这样骗他。"

    # game/script.rpy:46023
    old "I kept eating while he washed the few dishes left."
    new "他洗着剩下的几只盘子，我则继续吃着。"

    # game/script.rpy:46027
    old "You're done? Do you want another one?"
    new "吃完了？要不要再来一块？"

    # game/script.rpy:46028
    old "I'm okay, but thank you."
    new "不用了，谢谢你。"

    # game/script.rpy:46031
    old "All right. I'm seriously happy to see you, though. I couldn't believe it when I saw your face on the news."
    new "好吧。不过说真的，见到你我很高兴。在新闻上看到你的脸时，我简直不敢相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:46032
    old "...Me too. Sorry for not coming around in a while."
    new "……我也是。抱歉，这么久没来看看你。"

    # game/script.rpy:46035
    old "Don't worry about that. Are your parents here?"
    new "这有什么好道歉的。你父母在这边吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:46039
    old "Darfee had to be in his late thirties, but he was a good friend of my parents, who'd actually brought me there for the first time. I hadn't spoken to him that many times, but I figured he was familiar enough with me, as he'd known me since I was a kid."
    new "Darfee 应该快四十了，却和我父母是至交——第一次带我来这里的，正是他们。我和他说话的机会不算多，但我想他对我足够熟悉，毕竟从我小时候起就认识我了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46040
    old "They aren't."
    new "他们不在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:46043
    old "No? Will they come soon? They will, right?"
    new "不在吗？他们很快就会来吗？会的，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:46044
    old "...I don't know. As of now, they'll stay overseas."
    new "……我不知道。目前他们会留在国外。"

    # game/script.rpy:46045
    old "He looked puzzled and disappointed. In fact, I did know that they wouldn't come. Even after waking from my coma, they would only talk to me through phone calls. ...Too busy with administrative work, of course."
    new "他一脸困惑，又难掩失望。其实我很清楚他们不会来。就算我从昏迷中醒来，他们也只通过电话和我说话。……当然，是行政事务太忙。"

    # game/script.rpy:46046
    old "That's right. What will even happen now? Two identical copies of my phone exist. How will calls work?"
    new "没错。那现在到底会怎样？有两部一模一样的手机。电话打进来又该怎么算？"

    # game/script.rpy:46047
    old "I suppose it doesn't matter. If both phones react when they call me, I'll just have to not pick up. If only mine rings, the past would be changing."
    new "算了，大概也无所谓。他们打来的时候两部手机都响，我不接就是。要是只有我这部响，那就说明过去正在改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:46053
    old "Do come here any time you want. You're more than welcome."
    new "想来随时都可以来。非常欢迎。"

    # game/script.rpy:46054
    old "...I will. I just wanted to leave my home today."
    new "……我会的。今天只是不想待在家里。"

    # game/script.rpy:46057
    old "I completely understand. That's good for you to do."
    new "我完全理解。出来走走对你挺好。"

    # game/script.rpy:46059
    old "I think I will have coffee."
    new "那还是来杯咖啡吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:46062
    old "Absolutely. How do you want it?"
    new "当然。想要什么样的？"

    # game/script.rpy:46063
    old "...It's pretty late for coffee, actually. I'm not sure, anything that's not too strong, and without milk or sugar."
    new "……不过这个点喝咖啡确实有点晚了。我也说不好，别太浓就行，不加奶，也不加糖。"

    # game/script.rpy:46064
    old "As always. Give me a second."
    new "还是老样子。稍等。"

    # game/script.rpy:46067
    old "He grabbed a short, transparent glass and filled it halfway."
    new "他取来一只矮身透明玻璃杯，倒了半杯。"

    # game/script.rpy:46070
    old "Do you want it alongside anything?"
    new "要配点什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:46071
    old "He pointed at some bottles higher up."
    new "他指了指上层架子上的几个瓶子。"

    # game/script.rpy:46074
    old "Those have alcohol, right?"
    new "那些是酒，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:46076
    old "...Then no. I've never had any of that."
    new "……那不用了。我从来没喝过酒。"

    # game/script.rpy:46077
    old "I understand, but maybe you should. Last thing I wanna do is make an alcoholic out of you, but it doesn't hurt in small quantities."
    new "我明白，不过你或许该尝尝。我最不想做的就是把你变成酒鬼，但少量喝一点并无坏处。"

    # game/script.rpy:46078
    old "It's okay. I'd prefer not to."
    new "不用了。我还是不想喝。"

    # game/script.rpy:46081
    old "He nodded and filled it all the way up. I was kind of surprised he offered—I wasn't old enough to drink, and I could have gotten away with technically barely breaking the law, but I wasn't in the mood anyway."
    new "他点点头，把杯子斟满。他会开口请我喝酒，让我有些意外——我还没到能饮酒的年纪，真要喝了也只是勉强算违法，也不会有人追究；只是我本来也没那个心情。"

    # game/script.rpy:46083
    old "He left the glass next to the empty plate. As usual, it was overly hot."
    new "他把杯子放在空盘子旁边。和往常一样，烫得厉害。"

    # game/script.rpy:46084
    old "I stretched my hands behind my back and looked around me. I was the only person there."
    new "我把双手背到身后伸了伸，环顾四周。店里只有我一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:46090
    old "A newspaper..."
    new "一份报纸……"

    # game/script.rpy:46091
    old "A few seats away, there was an open newspaper that someone had probably started reading and left behind. I pinched it and pulled it toward me."
    new "隔着几个座位，有一份摊开的报纸，大概是有人读到一半就丢下的。我捏住一角，把它拉了过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:46092
    old "It should say today's date."
    new "上面应该写着今天的日期。"

    # game/script.rpy:46093
    old "I looked at the top right corner, and, as expected, there was the date."
    new "我看向右上角，日期果然印在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:46094
    old "...It really is December 1st."
    new "……真的是十二月一日。"

    # game/script.rpy:46095
    old "Is this new?"
    new "这是新的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:46096
    old "The newspaper? Yes."
    new "报纸吗？对，是新的。"

    # game/script.rpy:46099
    old "I brought it closer and looked at the pages for current news. It was Yushinews, so events from Yushibana were highlighted."
    new "我把它拉近了些，翻到时事版面。报头是 Yushinews，所以丰花一带的消息被特别标注出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:46100
    old "Miiya and I must appear somewhere in here."
    new "这上面一定有 Miiya 和我的消息。"

    # game/script.rpy:46102
    old "I flipped the pages toward the start, as I felt it should've been important enough to put it at the beginning. When I got to the initial two, I stopped myself."
    new "我往前翻，觉得那件事够重要，理应放在开头。翻到最前两页时，我停了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:46104
    old "The category was \"November\", and there were many brief articles. The last one was titled \"Gas Explosion Late at Night\"."
    new "栏目是「十一月」，里面有许多短讯。最后一条的标题是「深夜煤气爆炸」。"

    # game/script.rpy:46106
    old "I read the tiny letters next to a black and white picture of the shop."
    new "店铺的黑白照片旁印着细小的字，我读了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:46109
    old "\"Miiya Moiromo, a twenty-year-old girl, is the only casualty of a local gas explosion that occurred in the evening of November 30th. Shiroya Mirana, another young girl nineteen years of age, was gravely injured and immediately sent to the hospital. Her condition is critical, although she wasn't directly hit by the explosion.\""
    new "「十一月三十日晚间，本地发生一起煤气爆炸，二十岁的女孩 Miiya Moiromo 是唯一的死者。另一名十九岁的女孩 Shiroya Mirana 身受重伤，被立即送往医院。她虽然并未直接受到爆炸冲击，情况仍然危急。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46110
    old "\"The incident occurred when an unknown individual released smoke that caused four people inside to lose consciousness. The other two were too far from the range to receive any serious injuries. While everyone was unconscious, a heater depleted its surrounding oxygen after its flame went out, and when a visitor turned on the lights, an immediate explosion of short radius but intense force occurred.{w} It killed the first victim instantly and broke the floor of the shop. The second girl, Mirana, was protected by the furniture next to her but fell through the broken floor.\""
    new "「事发时，一名身份不明者释放烟雾，致使店内四人失去意识。其余两人距离较远，未受重伤。众人昏迷期间，一台取暖器在火焰熄灭后耗尽了周围的氧气；一名来客开灯时，随即发生了爆炸，波及范围不大，威力却极强。{w} 第一名遇难者当场死亡，店铺的地板也被炸裂。另一名女孩 Mirana 因身旁家具的遮挡而免于冲击，却从破裂的地板坠落。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46113
    old "It happened just like I remember."
    new "和我记得的一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:46114
    old "And it doesn't even say why the incident happened.{w} ...Right, on the 15th, when smoke knocked us out for the second time, I thought that both incidents must have been caused by the same people. That would be Xyn."
    new "而且报道里根本没提事故的原因。{w} ……对了，十五号那天，烟雾第二次把我们熏晕时，我就觉得这两起事件一定是同一伙人干的。那应该就是 Xyn。"

    # game/script.rpy:46115
    old "...{w}Wait, it actually is this. I'm not wrong.{w} It was caused by Xyn. That's why no further details got published.{w} That's what Katei told us. Xyn had already tried to steal the Sekimeiya once, but they failed. They almost caught the person behind it, but since they ended up escaping, it wasn't published that they'd been from Xyn."
    new "……{w}等等，原来就是这个。我没记错。{w} 的确是 Xyn 造成的。所以才没有公布更多细节。{w} 这是 Katei 告诉我们的。Xyn 早就试图偷走 Sekimeiya 一次，但失败了。他们差点抓到幕后的人，可对方最后还是逃了，所以报道里没有说这是 Xyn 所为。"

    # game/script.rpy:46116
    old "Oh, of course... In the attic, I knew I recognized that smell. I smelled it in that shop. ...That's what happened there. Xyn tried to steal the Sekimeiya before it was brought to Ashiya Tower.{w} The Sekimeiya was in the shop, and for some reason, Xyn didn't succeed."
    new "啊，原来如此……在阁楼里，我就觉得那股气味在哪儿闻过。我在那家店里闻到过。……那里发生的就是这么回事。Sekimeiya 被送进芦屋塔之前，Xyn 就想把它偷走。{w} 当时 Sekimeiya 就在那家店里，而不知为何，Xyn 没能得手。"

    # game/script.rpy:46117
    old "That made sense as the outline of what had occurred, but it didn't mean anything to me aside from the fact that Miiya's life had been taken during an attempt to steal a gemstone."
    new "事情的大致经过是说得通的；可对我来说，它只意味着一件事——Miiya 是在一次宝石盗窃中丧命的。"

    # game/script.rpy:46118
    old "At that point, did Xyn know what the Sekimeiya would do, or did they attempt to steal just another simple gem that Ashiya had? The advertising had just started."
    new "那时候，Xyn 知道 Sekimeiya 有什么用处吗？还是说，他们只是想偷走芦屋家的又一颗普通宝石？毕竟宣传才刚开始。"

    # game/script.rpy:46121
    old "I huffed, deeply frustrated.{w} I began to drink the coffee, and as I scanned the pages, more concise articles came into view."
    new "我重重吐了口气，满心烦躁。{w} 我一边喝着咖啡，一边扫视报纸，更多简短的报道映入眼帘。"

    # game/script.rpy:46122
    old "I read the title of one higher up on the page."
    new "我读了页面上方另一篇报道的标题。"

    # game/script.rpy:46124
    old "\"Unknown Man Escapes from Prison Cell\".{w} Intrigued by the premise, I read the body of the article."
    new "「不明男子逃离牢房」。{w}这个标题勾起了我的兴趣，我接着往下读正文。"

    # game/script.rpy:46125
    old "\"In the afternoon of November 24th, the camera of a prison cell recorded a prisoner escaping from it.\""
    new "「11月24日下午，一间牢房的监控摄像头拍下了一名囚犯从牢中逃脱的画面。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46126
    old "What...? Is it talking about a prison here?{w} I don't think there's a proper one in Yushibana, so maybe it's just talking about holding cells in the police department."
    new "什么……？说的是这里的监狱吗？{w}丰花应该没有正规的监狱，大概指的是警局里的拘留室吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:46129
    old "\"The identity of that person remains unknown. They were dressed as a prisoner, but no footage shows who they were or how they ended up in that cell. The corridor they were in was unprotected, as nobody should've been inside the cell. By the time the footage recording them was noticed, they'd already disappeared.{w} The cell itself was unlocked, supposedly due to being vacant. There was no security in that area, so it is possible the individual left the entire building. Their identity and the way they got to that cell are under investigation, but no method to reach it such as a hidden passage between cells was found to exist.\""
    new "「该人物的身份至今不明。其人身着囚服，但没有任何影像拍到此人是谁，又是如何进入那间牢房的。此人所在的走廊无人看管，因为那间牢房本不该有人。等到拍下此人的录像被人注意到时，他早已不见踪影。{w}牢房本身没有上锁，据称是因为当时空置。那一带没有任何安保措施，因此此人有可能已经离开整栋建筑。关于其身份以及进入牢房的方式仍在调查中，但并未发现牢房之间存在暗道之类的进入途径。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46130
    old "What the hell?{w} I never heard about this. I guess I don't really watch or read the news."
    new "怎么回事？{w}我从没听说过这件事。也难怪，我本来就不怎么看新闻。"

    # game/script.rpy:46131
    old "Next to the paragraph was a picture. It showed a still black and white image of the footage, which displayed the bars protecting the cell. The door was open, and the man could be seen leaving it. However, due to the high angle, his face couldn't be seen, and the single detail to go off of was his short, dark-looking hair."
    new "那段文字旁边配着一张照片，是录像的黑白截图，画面里是牢房的栅栏。门开着，能看到那个男人正从里面走出来。然而由于拍摄角度很高，他的脸看不清，唯一能辨认的细节只有那一头深色短发。"

    # game/script.rpy:46132
    old "This person supposedly appeared in a cell, huh? I guess there are many unsolved mysteries I could solve by factoring in the Sekimeiya. Who's to say it hasn't been used in crimes before it made its way to Ashiya...?"
    new "这个人算是凭空出现在牢房里吧？只要把 Sekimeiya 算进去，大概有不少悬案都能解开。在它被送到芦屋塔之前，谁又能保证它没被用于犯罪呢……？"

    # game/script.rpy:46138
    old "I downed the rest of my coffee. It wasn't supposed to be strong, and I didn't feel any reaction from it. At one point, coffee had stopped always having a positive effect on me, and sometimes it would do more harm than good, so I'd stopped drinking it frequently."
    new "我把剩下的咖啡一饮而尽。这咖啡本来就不浓，我也没觉得有什么反应。不知从什么时候起，咖啡不再总是对我有好处，有时反而弊大于利，我便不再常喝了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46141
    old "You're done? Do you want anything else?"
    new "喝完了？还要点别的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:46143
    old "I stood up from the stool and looked at my purse."
    new "我从高脚凳上起身，看了看自己的钱包。"

    # game/script.rpy:46146
    old "You're not going to try to pay me, are you? Don't even think about it."
    new "你不会还想付钱吧？想都别想。"

    # game/script.rpy:46147
    old "Oh... Are you sure?"
    new "啊……你确定吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:46150
    old "Of course, and come back any time you feel like it. I'm serious when I say that I was really glad to see you, and I'm relieved to see that you're all right."
    new "当然。你想来就随时来。我说真的，见到你我真的很高兴；看到你平安无事，我也就放心了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46151
    old "Okay. I really appreciate it."
    new "好。真的太谢谢你了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46154
    old "I don't want to stick my nose in your business, but I think you should talk to your parents. I can do it if you prefer. I can't believe they haven't come."
    new "我本不想多管闲事，不过我觉得你该和父母谈谈。你要是愿意，我替你去说也行。他们居然一直没来，我真是不敢相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:46155
    old "...Don't worry, I have been talking to them. I think I prefer to be alone, though."
    new "……别担心，我一直在和他们联系。不过，我还是想一个人待着。"

    # game/script.rpy:46156
    old "Is that so...? I see."
    new "是这样吗……？我明白了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46166
    old "I smiled and walked to the entrance. Seeing the desolate street from such a warm place made for a very pleasant contrast."
    new "我笑着走向门口。从这样温暖的地方望出去，看那条萧索的街道，这种反差让人心里很舒服。"

    # game/script.rpy:46167
    old "...Bye."
    new "……再见。"

    # game/script.rpy:46170
    old "I'll see you. There are a lot of things I want to talk to you about, so come back when you want. As you can see, we're not even closed on Sundays, so it can be any day. I wish you the best to get through this."
    new "再见。我有很多话想跟你说，想来的话随时过来。你也看到了，我们连周日都不休息，哪天都行。希望你能顺利熬过这一关。"

    # game/script.rpy:46179
    old "I nodded and left the shop.{w} Did I look like a person burying a lot of pain? To be talking casually and smiling only one day after Miiya's death, I assumed that was the only explanation to Darfee."
    new "我点点头，离开了店里。{w}我看起来像是个把痛苦深埋心底的人吗？Miiya 才去世一天，我就能谈笑自如——在 Darfee 眼里，恐怕也只有这一个解释吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:46180
    old "I unconsciously picked a side and walked away."
    new "我下意识地选了街道的一边，走了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:46181
    old "Everything around me, existence itself, felt calm. I still wondered how that was possible. Only days previously, I'd questioned whether I would even speak again. Just what had happened to me?"
    new "周围的一切，甚至存在本身，都显得平静。我仍不明白这怎么可能。就在几天前，我还在怀疑自己是否还能再开口说话。我究竟是怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:46182
    old "It wasn't that I didn't feel that pain as my own anymore or that I simply expected Miiya's death to be overwritten. After all, even if I did erase it, my memories wouldn't go away. Had all the terrible events afterward outweighed it, made it insignificant? How did that make sense?"
    new "并不是我不再觉得那痛苦是自己的，也不是我单纯指望 Miiya 的死会被改写。毕竟，就算我真的抹去了它，我的记忆也不会随之消失。难道是之后接连发生的惨事压过了它，让它变得无足轻重？这又怎么可能说得通？"

    # game/script.rpy:46183
    old "No matter the reason why I felt so tranquil, I liked it. Being able to feel any kind of comfort was a welcome change, even if the future was uncertain, and even if it all still revolved around the Sekimeiya."
    new "不管我为何如此平静，我都喜欢这份平静。哪怕未来仍不确定，哪怕一切依旧围绕着 Sekimeiya，能感到哪怕一丝安慰，也是难得的转变。"

    # game/script.rpy:46190
    old "I went back to Ramon street. In the center of Yushibana, it was the largest one, ending at the town hall. No cars could go through it, and it was where you could usually see the most people."
    new "我回到了拉蒙街。它是丰花中心最宽阔的一条街，一直通到市政厅。街上不通车辆，平时也是人最多的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:46191
    old "It was Sunday, so it made sense that most places were closed. I'd thought of going to the tower earlier, but that wasn't even possible, as it closed on Sundays.{w} While I thought about what to do next, my legs automatically turned me toward a branching street."
    new "今天是周日，多数店铺关门也理所当然。我本打算早些去芦屋塔，可那根本行不通，因为塔周日不开放。{w}我一边想着接下来做什么，双腿却已经自行把我带向了一条岔路。"

    # game/script.rpy:46195
    old "I didn't know whether to stop myself, so I continued. I hadn't really intended to go any direction in particular, but it was a path I'd taken before."
    new "我不知道该不该停下脚步，于是索性继续往前走。我并没有特别想去哪里，只是这条路我以前走过。"

    # game/script.rpy:46196
    old "As opposed to the wider street, that one was only lined by residences, and it led to a one-way road, just as I remembered it."
    new "和那条宽阔的大街不同，这条路两旁只有住宅，尽头是一条单行道，和我记忆中一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:46201
    old "After ignoring two branching paths, I turned toward Enric avenue. From both sidewalks grew tall, skinny trees covered by the snow, elegantly draping over the path. It was a pretty place to live in, situated on the opposite side of Yushibana from my apartment."
    new "走过两个岔口之后，我拐向了恩里克大道。两侧人行道上长着细高的树，枝头覆着雪，优雅地垂在路面上方。这里住起来很舒服，风景也好，跟我的公寓隔着丰花一东一西。"

    # game/script.rpy:46203
    old "I couldn't bring myself to walk any farther, and I only stared into the distance from the corner. I was looking at Atsuki's house."
    new "我再也迈不动步子，只是站在街角望向远处。我看的是 Atsuki 的家。"

    # game/script.rpy:46204
    old "Near it, I could discern some people outside of their own houses, but Atsuki's was still."
    new "附近几户人家门前隐约有人，唯独 Atsuki 家毫无动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:46205
    old "I don't think I should let myself be seen..."
    new "还是别让人看见我比较好……"

    # game/script.rpy:46206
    old "I hadn't had any reason to go there, but I knew that if Atsuki saw me, I'd end up explaining everything that had happened. While a part of me wanted to do that, it wasn't strong enough to force me."
    new "我本没有理由去那里，可我知道，一旦被 Atsuki 看见，我就得把发生的一切都解释一遍。虽然我心里有一部分想这么做，但那点念头还不足以推我上前。"

    # game/script.rpy:46208
    old "Is there light...?"
    new "有灯光吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:46209
    old "The road had very few wheel marks, and no cars were allowed to park. I crossed it to get a little closer."
    new "路面上几乎看不到车辙，这里也不准停车。我穿过马路，靠近了一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:46215
    old "Yeah. He's in the living room."
    new "嗯，他在客厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:46216
    old "Through his window, it was possible to see the light on the opposite side."
    new "透过他那扇窗，能看到对面房间亮着灯。"

    # game/script.rpy:46217
    old "After waking up from my coma, he'd told me that he'd only left his house to go to the hospital, and that he'd otherwise spent all his time miserable."
    new "我从昏迷中醒来后，他告诉过我，那段时间他除了去医院，几乎不出家门，其余时候都过得很痛苦。"

    # game/script.rpy:46218
    old "I knew how he was feeling on the other side of the glass, and if I simply showed myself, I could help him. So then, why did that not feel like the best idea?"
    new "我清楚玻璃另一边的他是什么心情，只要我露个面，就能帮到他。那么，为什么我并不觉得这是最好的办法？"

    # game/script.rpy:46219
    old "I surreptitiously approached the door, wondering if it was simply because I would ideally overwrite time anyway. Since I planned to change the past, was there no need to make the reality I was in better?"
    new "我悄悄走近门口，心想，是不是因为反正我迟早要改写时间。既然我打算改变过去，那还有必要让眼前的现实好过一些吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:46220
    old "It also meant that if everything were to somehow play out as I remembered, the Atsuki I'd been with had always known that I'd traveled to the past and hadn't mentioned it so that it could happen. How likely was that, honestly?"
    new "这也意味着，如果一切真的照我记忆中的样子发展，那么一直和我在一起的那个 Atsuki 早就知道我穿越回了过去，却为了让它成真而只字未提。老实说，这有多大可能？"

    # game/script.rpy:46227
    old "I got startled as soon as I peeked through the bars of his front gate. I hadn't seen Maxi sitting in front of the wooden door, where there was no snow."
    new "我从他家院门的栅栏缝里探头望进去，当即吓了一跳——Maxi 正坐在木门前没有积雪的地方，我先前竟没看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:46228
    old "He seemed afraid for an instant when he saw me, but then he ran to me, squeezing his head through the bars."
    new "他看见我的瞬间似乎有些害怕，但随即朝我跑来，把头从栅栏缝里挤了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:46229
    old "It's just me. Do you know that I should be in the hospital? What are you doing here? It's very cold."
    new "是我。你知道我本该待在医院里吧？你怎么在这儿？天这么冷。"

    # game/script.rpy:46230
    old "I looked up as I petted him. I knew Atsuki wouldn't look through the window since Maxi tended to bark whenever other dogs passed by anyway."
    new "我一边抚摸他，一边抬起头。我知道 Atsuki 不会往窗外看——反正只要有别的狗经过，Maxi 就会叫个不停。"

    # game/script.rpy:46231
    old "I figured Umi was inside the house. Both of them had a hole in the door to enter and exit through."
    new "我想 Umi 应该在屋里。门上开着一个洞，他们俩都能从那里进出。"

    # game/script.rpy:46232
    old "If nothing changes, what will happen on the 15th? I still don't understand what was up with the recording.{w} Could it really be that the exit will be locked for a month? If so, the police should take care of these two, right...?"
    new "如果什么都没改变，15号那天会怎么样？我到现在还是不明白那段录音到底是怎么回事。{w}出口真的会被锁上一个月吗？真是那样的话，警察总该会照顾这两个家伙吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:46235
    old "I looked at Maxi's face as he happily stared back at me. If I remembered well, he was eight and had been born on May 26th."
    new "我看着 Maxi 的脸，他也高兴地回望着我。我没记错的话，他已经八岁，生日是5月26日。"

    # game/script.rpy:46236
    old "What if Atsuki was wrong and the past can't be changed? I could change it by ringing the doorbell right now, but that's not something I want to do."
    new "万一 Atsuki 说错了，过去根本改变不了呢？我现在按响门铃就能改变过去——可我不想那么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:46237
    old "...Doesn't me constantly not wanting to do things that change the past indicate that it can't change?"
    new "……我一直不愿做那些会改变过去的事，这不正说明过去根本改变不了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:46239
    old "What if I leave a note saying that I'm fine?"
    new "如果我留张字条，说我没事呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:46240
    old "That didn't sound like a good idea either. There was no way Atsuki would read it and assume that I'd traveled to the past. Although he would then tell me after I woke up, so it would guarantee a change."
    new "这主意听起来也不怎么样。Atsuki 看到字条，绝不可能想到我穿越到了过去。不过这样一来，等我醒来他总会告诉我，改变也就成了定局。"

    # game/script.rpy:46244
    old "When will I be able to tell whether things can change or not? There should be something I could do to confirm it."
    new "我什么时候才能弄清事情到底能不能改变？总该有什么办法能证实这一点吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:46245
    old "And I suppose that if it can't happen in the end, it's a given that the version of me they saw on the 15th will end up being me."
    new "而如果真的改变不了，那他们15号见到的那个我，到头来自然也就是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:46246
    old "Could it be that I'll have failed to conclude whether I can change the past even by the 15th? If I haven't been able to touch the Sekimeiya by then, I'll go to the tower. It just doesn't make sense that I would let everything repeat..."
    new "难不成直到15号，我还是没能弄清自己究竟能不能改变过去？要是到那时还碰不到 Sekimeiya，我就去那座塔。我总不能眼睁睁看着一切重演吧……"

    # game/script.rpy:46247
    old "I could prevent the recording from occurring so that Maxi and Umi aren't in danger. What if I decide to be the one who removed the handle in the storeroom and keep it so that I can leave at any time? Would that make any sense...?"
    new "我可以阻止那段录音发生，这样 Maxi 和 Umi 就不会有危险。要是我决定由自己拆下储藏室的门把手，自己留着，好随时能离开呢？这样行得通吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:46252
    old "I stepped away from the door."
    new "我从门前走开。"

    # game/script.rpy:46257
    old "Don't worry. I'll be back soon."
    new "别担心，我很快就回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:46258
    old "I kept walking back, but Maxi didn't take his eyes off me until I'd disappeared from his view."
    new "我一步步往后退，Maxi 却始终盯着我，直到我从他视野里消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:46267
    old "One of Atsuki's neighbors was looking at me too, and she waved at me from a distance. I knew I'd seen her before, so I awkwardly returned the gesture. She opened her mouth to say something brief, but I couldn't hear her."
    new "Atsuki 的一位邻居也在看我，隔着一段距离朝我挥了挥手。我知道自己以前见过她，便有些拘谨地挥手回应。她张嘴说了句简短的话，但我听不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:46269
    old "I waited to see if she'd repeat herself, but it didn't seem like she'd realized I hadn't heard her."
    new "我等了一会儿，看她会不会再说一遍，可她似乎并没察觉我没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:46274
    old "...{w}I don't know enough about what happened these days to do something and actually be sure I've changed the past. At least not in a non-drastic way, like by speaking to Atsuki. I could go to my hospital room and draw something on my face that I didn't wake up with..."
    new "……{w}这些天发生的事，我知道得还不够多，就算做点什么，也没法确定自己真的改变了过去。至少，像找 Atsuki 说话这种不激烈的办法，我没法靠它来确认。我可以回病房，在脸上画点醒来时本来没有的东西……"

    # game/script.rpy:46277
    old "I walked all the way down the street until I was back at the wider Ramon."
    new "我沿着街道一路走去，回到了拉蒙街较为宽阔的那一段。"

    # game/script.rpy:46278
    old "I seriously need to know if I'm going to be able to change what happened, and pretty urgently too. If it's not possible, then every attempt I make at getting to the Sekimeiya before the 15th is automatically bound to fail."
    new "我真的很想知道自己到底能不能改变已经发生的事，而且得尽快知道。如果根本改不了，那我在15号之前为了接触到 Sekimeiya 所做的一切尝试，注定都会失败。"

    # game/script.rpy:46279
    old "The time Katei said that someone from Xyn had tried to steal the Sekimeiya... There's no way I'll be the person behind that, right? Would he have said so if he'd known about it? I guess if the past can't be changed and someone did attempt to steal the Sekimeiya on the 30th, I have a guarantee that I won't be caught because he didn't mention that."
    new "Katei 说过，Xyn 那边有人试图偷走 Sekimeiya……那个人总不会是我吧？他要是知道内情，还会那样说吗？我想，如果过去确实改不了，而30号那天真有人去偷 Sekimeiya，那反倒能保证我不会被抓——因为他没提过这种事。"

    # game/script.rpy:46282
    old "A lot more people than I remembered were walking up and down the stone path. As usual, most of the snow had been removed so it didn't hinder anyone."
    new "石板路上来往的人比我记忆中要多得多。和往常一样，积雪大多已被清走，不会碍着谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:46283
    old "I tended not to like being in that busy street, but I wanted to appreciate people simply existing around me. Most of them were slightly hunched over to feel warmer, wearing scarves around their necks."
    new "我向来不太喜欢待在那条热闹的街上，但此刻我想好好感受身边这些人的存在。他们大多微微缩着身子取暖，脖子上围着围巾。"

    # game/script.rpy:46284
    old "I was still a little hesitant. At any point, someone could've asked me about the hospital. I could recognize a few people I'd seen before, and I wasn't sure if I was imagining the stares I felt."
    new "我心里仍有些迟疑。随时都可能有人问起我住院的事。人群里有几张脸我认得，而落在身上的视线，我也说不准是不是自己多心。"

    # game/script.rpy:46285
    old "Are they actually looking at me? There's no way it's because I'm supposed to be at the hospital, right...?"
    new "他们真的在看我吗？总不会是因为我本该待在医院里吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:46286
    old "I looked back, but the feeling had disappeared. I thought to myself that I was probably just pointlessly worried about that."
    new "我回头看了看，那种感觉却消失了。我暗想，大概只是自己白担心一场。"

    # game/script.rpy:46292
    old "I was directing myself back home. The cold would soon become hard to bear, and I was a little tired. Nonetheless, going outside had been as pleasant as I'd thought it would be."
    new "我正往家走。寒气很快就要变得难以忍受，我也有些累了。尽管如此，这趟外出还是像我预想的那样令人舒畅。"

    # game/script.rpy:46293
    old "On my way to the drier roadway, I'd passed plenty of people living their own lives. Evidently, the time had only stopped for me and Atsuki."
    new "走向较为干燥的车道途中，我从许多过着自己日子的人身边经过。显然，时间只在我和 Atsuki 这里停住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46294
    old "I'd left the center of Yushibana, so my surroundings felt a lot less lively. Due to the temperature, the sky was devoid of birds, and seeing other animals wasn't common. Walking on the snow became a lot harder, but I'd grown used to it more every year."
    new "我已离开丰花的中心，四周冷清了许多。天冷，空中看不到鸟，别的动物也不常见。在雪上走要吃力得多，可我一年比一年习惯了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46296
    old "I saw something wrapped around a streetlight and approached it warily."
    new "我看见路灯上缠着什么东西，便小心地走了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:46298
    old "\"The Sekimeiya\".{w} It was a flyer marked by the touch of many snowflakes. I'd seen it before, but I didn't want to look at it."
    new "「The Sekimeiya」。{w}那是一张传单，上面留着不少雪花落过的痕迹。我以前见过它，却不愿去看。"

    # game/script.rpy:46299
    old "...I walked away, my eyes locked on my feet."
    new "……我走开了，目光落在自己的脚上。"

    # game/script.rpy:46307
    old "...What if I draw something on the door of my apartment? I know that when I went home after waking up in the hospital, I didn't see anything. I think that was on the 8th, when I came home and just slept before calling Atsuki."
    new "……要是我在自己公寓的门上画点什么，会怎么样？我记得出院回家那天，门上什么都没有。那应该是8号，我回到家就睡了，之后才给 Atsuki 打电话。"

    # game/script.rpy:46308
    old "It's very possible that the past will only change if I intend my actions to cause a change. This means that everything I've done up until now could've always happened. If I put something on my door with the intent to change the past, that could prove it can happen."
    new "很有可能，只有当我抱着改变过去的目的去做一件事，过去才会改变。也就是说，我到现在做过的每件事，或许原本就发生过。如果我带着改变过去的意图在门上留下点什么，就能证明过去确实可以被改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:46309
    old "I guess it wouldn't be absolute, though. I could only be sure if it's still there on the 8th. It wouldn't be an instant confirmation."
    new "不过这也算不上绝对。只有到了8号，看到那东西还在，我才能确定。这不是立刻就能验证的。"

    # game/script.rpy:46310
    old "One of the purposes of changing the past is to prevent Atsuki and myself from going to the tower. What if I send a warning to him saying not to go? If that ends up being all I'll be able to do, I shouldn't let Erina and Isla go either, but I don't know where they live."
    new "改变过去的目的之一，就是阻止我和 Atsuki 去那座塔。要是我给他发个警告，叫他别去呢？如果到头来我能做的只有这些，那我也不能让 Erina 和 Isla 去，可我不知道她们住在哪儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:46316
    old "I got my keys ready and put aside my musings until I got to the staircase of my apartment."
    new "我把钥匙准备好，暂时把这些念头搁到一边，直到走到公寓的楼梯口。"

    # game/script.rpy:46319
    old "I went up and unlocked the door. As soon as I opened it, the inner temperature hit me, and I remembered I'd left the heater going."
    new "我上了楼，打开门锁。门一开，屋里的热气扑面而来，我这才想起取暖器一直开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:46322
    old "Just in case, I shouldn't have it on very often."
    new "保险起见，还是别老开着它。"

    # game/script.rpy:46323
    old "After closing the door, I left my boots on the floor, my coat on a wooden hanger, and went to turn the heater off."
    new "关上门后，我脱下靴子放在地上，大衣挂上木衣架，然后去把取暖器关掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:46328
    old "Sky Signals"
    new "天空信号"

    # game/script.rpy:46330
    old "I was beginning to feel a little dubious and nervous about Atsuki's assertion. Did the Sekimeiya really have the power to let someone alter the past?"
    new "我开始对 Atsuki 的说法有点怀疑，也感到有些紧张。Sekimeiya 真的拥有让人改变过去的力量吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:46332
    old "...I'll find out right now. I just need to decide that my next action will change history."
    new "……我现在就来验证。只要打定主意，让下一个举动改变历史就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:46334
    old "Wait... that would be very thoughtless."
    new "等等……那也太欠考虑了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46335
    old "I'd thought of calling Atsuki's phone for a second and then hanging up. As long as I did that, the past would change. He'd never told me about a call like that."
    new "我想到一个主意：拨通 Atsuki 的电话，响一下就挂断。只要这么做，过去就会改变。他可从没跟我提过这样一通电话。"

    # game/script.rpy:46336
    old "But I couldn't do it. It would tell him that I'd woken up, and then he'd find out otherwise. I hadn't thought it through."
    new "可我不能这么做。那样一来他就知道我醒了，别的也会跟着暴露。我还没想周全。"

    # game/script.rpy:46337
    old "Is there anything else I could do to get the same result...?"
    new "还有没有别的办法，能得到同样的结果……？"

    # game/script.rpy:46339
    old "Oh, I can call my parents. When I talked to them on the phone, they definitely would have told me about receiving a call from my phone on December 1st."
    new "对了，我可以打给父母。之前和他们通电话时，他们肯定会跟我提起十二月一日接到过我手机来电的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:46342
    old "All right, so should I just consciously aim to change the past?"
    new "好吧，那我只要刻意去改变过去就可以了？"

    # game/script.rpy:46343
    old "This won't get me into trouble, right...? They'll simply call the hospital, and nobody will understand what happened."
    new "这不会给我惹上麻烦吧……？他们无非是打到医院去问问，谁也不会明白到底发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:46344
    old "I took the phone from my purse and looked at the screen. It was almost {time=15.}"
    new "我从手提包里取出手机，看了看屏幕。时间快到 {time=15.} 了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46345
    old "I went to the contacts list, selected my mom, and pressed the call button."
    new "我打开通讯录，选中妈妈的号码，按下了拨号键。"

    # game/script.rpy:46346
    old "The signal usually wasn't great, so I got closer to the window. Immediately after the first beep, I heard a voice."
    new "这里的信号一向不好，我便走到窗边。第一声提示音刚响过，就传来了人声。"

    # game/script.rpy:46349
    old "Shiroya...! How are you!?{w} I'm so glad you called! We were so worried!"
    new "Shiroya……！你怎么样！？{w}你能打来真是太好了！我们担心死了！"

    # game/script.rpy:46350
    old "My mom's voice came through the speaker, her disturbance making her sound a little distorted."
    new "妈妈的声音从听筒里传出来，她情绪激动，声音有些失真。"

    # game/script.rpy:46351
    old "Hello...! Are you there? What happened? You're okay, right?"
    new "喂……！你在听吗？出什么事了？你没事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:46353
    old "I didn't want to speak, so I pressed the red button and cut the call, surprised to feel a sharp heartache as I did so."
    new "我不想开口，便按下红色按键挂断了电话。那一瞬间，胸口竟传来一阵尖锐的痛楚，让我有些意外。"

    # game/script.rpy:46355
    old "I see. The past can be changed. Atsuki was right."
    new "原来如此。过去是可以改变的。Atsuki 说得没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:46359
    old "A call request appeared, \"Mom\" listed as the name."
    new "屏幕上跳出来电请求，名字显示为「妈妈」。"

    # game/script.rpy:46362
    old "I didn't pick it up and simply waited it out."
    new "我没有接，只是任它一直响到停止。"

    # game/script.rpy:46365
    old "No other call came afterward."
    new "之后再也没有来电。"

    # game/script.rpy:46366
    old "They must've called the hospital."
    new "他们一定是打去医院了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46367
    old "I let out a nervous breath and closed my phone."
    new "我紧张地吐出一口气，合上了手机。"

    # game/script.rpy:46372
    old "...{w}Why did I travel so many days back? That doesn't make sense. Were we wrong, and the time the Sekimeiya spent out of the cabinet wasn't what influenced the time traveled?"
    new "……{w}为什么我会回到这么多天以前？说不通。难道我们弄错了，影响穿越时长的并不是 Sekimeiya 离开展示柜的时间？"

    # game/script.rpy:46373
    old "It's not possible that it spent enough time in the water tank to send me here. Either way, what's important is that I can replicate it."
    new "它待在水箱里的时间，不可能长到足以把我送到这里。不管怎样，重要的是这个现象我能重现。"

    # game/script.rpy:46374
    old "Before the 15th, if I'm not able to get the Sekimeiya, I can change the past and prevent Atsuki and myself from going to the tower. The 15th is the only time where I'm guaranteed to be able to touch the Sekimeiya."
    new "如果在十五号之前我拿不到 Sekimeiya，我也可以改变过去，让 Atsuki 和我都别去那座塔。而十五号，是我唯一确定能接触到 Sekimeiya 的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:46375
    old "There'll be the attack, and people will fall unconscious, probably except the attacker. If that period of time isn't enough, I'll have twelve hours to use it, during which people will get trapped again.{w} If it comes down to it, I might have to think of how to take advantage of what happened. When the smoke went off, there were many places that weren't hit..."
    new "到时候会发生袭击，除袭击者之外的人大概都会失去意识。如果那段时间还不够，我还有十二个小时可以利用，那期间人们会再次被困住。{w}真到了那一步，我或许得想想怎么利用当时发生的事。烟雾弹炸开的时候，还有很多地方没有被波及……"

    # game/script.rpy:46376
    old "Since the past can be changed... Even though the Sekimeiya must currently be in the tower to bait an attack from Xyn, it's possible that I'll be caught by the police if I try to go and touch it before the 15th. ...Just which option is better?"
    new "既然过去可以改变……虽然为了引出 Xyn 的袭击，Sekimeiya 现在必须放在塔里，但如果我在十五号之前去碰它，很可能会被警察抓住。……到底选哪条路更好？"

    # game/script.rpy:46379
    old "At least if I get trapped by myself on a night before the 15th, the only person trapped with me will be the person in the security room. I only need to learn how to jump days into the past, which should be a lot more feasible if there aren't seven other people there."
    new "至少，如果我在十五号之前的某个夜晚自己一个人被困住，和我一起被困的就只有监控室里的那个人。我只需要学会怎么跳回几天前，如果没有另外七个人在场，这应该容易得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:46381
    old "...I really appeared just minutes too late to save Miiya. That's ridiculous."
    new "……我偏偏晚了那么几分钟才出现，没能救下 Miiya。简直荒唐。"

    # game/script.rpy:46382
    old "And instead of appearing instantly, I felt like I woke up. ...When I touched the Sekimeiya in the water tank, the heat around it was clearly a lot stronger than every other time. So the heat it releases is related to the distance traveled, but the way it increases might be different from what we thought."
    new "而且我不是凭空出现的，感觉更像是醒了过来。……我碰到水箱里的 Sekimeiya 时，它周围的热度明显比之前任何一次都强得多。也就是说，它释放的热量与穿越的距离有关，但增长的方式或许和我们想的不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:46384
    old "...I should probably try to eat something."
    new "……我大概该吃点东西了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46388
    old "I went to the kitchen. I didn't like cooking and I wasn't great at it, but I'd lately gotten used to making my own food, as I didn't have many alternatives."
    new "我走进厨房。我不喜欢做饭，也不擅长，但最近已经习惯了亲自动手，毕竟没有别的选择。"

    # game/script.rpy:46389
    old "When I'd been living at Atsuki's house, I'd only eaten by heating up prepared food that I couldn't afford. I opened the fridge, and as expected, there wasn't much to choose from. I was hungry due to walking around in the cold, so I wasn't picky."
    new "住在 Atsuki 家那阵子，我都是把现成的饭菜热一热凑合吃，那些东西我自己是买不起的。我打开冰箱，里面果然没什么可挑的。在冷风里走了那么久，我早就饿了，也顾不上挑剔。"

    # game/script.rpy:46390
    old "A bit of meat remained in a plastic tray. I really only kept buying it because my parents used to.{w} I grabbed it and looked at my side. Thankfully, the frying pan was clean."
    new "塑料托盘里还剩一点肉。我之所以一直买它，只是因为父母以前常买。{w}我端起托盘，又看了看旁边。还好，平底锅是干净的。"

    # game/script.rpy:46391
    old "I usually avoided using oil because the sizzling always startled me, and as a result, I'd basically stopped caring about eating things that were plain. I ignored the full bottle and heated up the empty pan for a few seconds. Then, I carefully placed the last pieces of meat on it and took a step back as they cooked."
    new "我平时尽量不用油，那滋啦作响的声音总把我吓一跳，久而久之，也就不在乎吃的东西有没有味道了。我没去碰那瓶满满的油，先把空锅烧了几秒，然后小心翼翼地把最后几块肉放进去，退开一步等它们煎熟。"

    # game/script.rpy:46394
    old "After staring from a few steps back for a while, I used chopsticks to flip the chunks of meat around, forcefully ungluing them from the surface. I added salt and spice powder, garnished them the best I could, and cut it all up. The meal looked exactly like every other time I'd prepared it, and I brought it to the living room."
    new "我站在几步远的地方看了一阵，才用筷子把肉块翻过来，用力将粘在锅底的部分剥开。撒上盐和香料粉，尽量装点得像样些，再全部切碎。成品和我每一次做的一模一样，我把它端到了客厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:46401
    old "I left the plate on the table and sat on a cushion."
    new "我把盘子放在桌上，在坐垫上坐下。"

    # game/script.rpy:46406
    old "This doesn't even make sense. Where are the others?"
    new "这根本说不通。其他人到底在哪里？"

    # game/script.rpy:46407
    old "I thought of something that should've come to mind much sooner."
    new "我想到了一件早该想到的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:46408
    old "Atsuki, Erina, Sai, and maybe Akaro. A bunch of people who must have been outside the tower too. Where are they?"
    new "Atsuki、Erina、Sai，或许还有 Akaro。这些人当时应该也在塔外。他们现在在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:46409
    old "I've been assuming I traveled alone, but that doesn't make any sense if we were at least right about one thing. If the range of the Sekimeiya was related to how far you went, there's no way the lobby wasn't included given that I traveled more than two weeks to the past."
    new "我一直假设只有我一个人穿越了，可只要我们的判断有一点是对的，这就不成立。如果 Sekimeiya 的范围与穿越的距离有关，那我回到了两周多以前，大堂绝不可能不在范围之内。"

    # game/script.rpy:46410
    old "...Where are they? I had to have made someone else travel with me, and everyone should've appeared at the same time that I did... but I'm also not sure I was immediately aware right after touching the Sekimeiya and passed out for a little while, so who knows when that would be?"
    new "……他们在哪里？我一定把别人也一起带了过来，大家应该和我同时出现……可我也不确定，碰过 Sekimeiya 之后自己是不是立刻就清醒了，还是昏迷了一小会儿，所以谁知道那会是什么时候？"

    # game/script.rpy:46411
    old "Was our understanding of the range incorrect too? If the range equaled the size of a crystal room when we traveled less than an hour... traveling fifteen days must have meant it extended far outside the tower."
    new "难道我们对范围的理解也错了？如果穿越不到一小时时，范围相当于一间水晶展室……那穿越十五天，范围必定已经延伸到塔外很远的地方了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46414
    old "I grabbed a slice of meat and brought it to my mouth."
    new "我夹起一片肉送进嘴里。"

    # game/script.rpy:46416
    old "It's not good at all."
    new "一点也不好吃。"

    # game/script.rpy:46417
    old "The taste was weird, but the spice did its job at obfuscating it."
    new "味道很怪，但香料总算起了作用，把它盖了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:46418
    old "...Ashiya and the police were right outside the tower. If they traveled to the past, I'm sure information about that would be widespread. There's no way a bunch of people traveling through time wouldn't create an uproar."
    new "……芦屋的人还有警察就在塔外。如果他们也被送到了过去，消息肯定会传得满天飞。一大群人穿越时间，绝不可能悄无声息。"

    # game/script.rpy:46419
    old "I appeared late on November 30th, where I'd been on that day. When we were in the tower, we thought about going ten minutes back but appearing where we'd been five minutes before traveling.{w} Did something like that happen again? Maybe I appeared at {time=21:10} where I'd been at {time=21:00}, so my old self wasn't there anymore. If I showed up exactly where I was at the time, I would've replaced my old self, and now I know that didn't happen."
    new "我是在十一月三十日的深夜出现，位置是当天自己待过的地方。我们在塔里的时候曾推测，穿越回十分钟前，却会出现在穿越前五分钟所在的位置。{w}难道这次也是这样？也许我在 {time=21:10} 出现在自己 {time=21:00} 待过的地方，所以原来的我已经不在那里了。如果我恰好出现在当时自己所在的位置，就会取代过去的我——而现在我知道，并没有发生这种事。"

    # game/script.rpy:46420
    old "We definitely know that the location you appear is based on a past one. If multiple people from Ashiya or the police were sent to the past, they might have all appeared in the same area, like their workplace."
    new "我们至少确定一点：出现的位置取决于过去的某个位置。如果芦屋和警察有多人被送到过去，他们也许都出现在同一片区域，比如他们工作的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:46423
    old "Even if I tried to explain it like that, it didn't make a ton of sense. The range had to be immense, not just big enough to encompass the policemen right outside."
    new "就算这样解释，也还是说不通。那个范围一定大得惊人，绝不只是大到能把门外的警察都包进去而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:46424
    old "...I ate more, trying not to chew much. I wasn't sure if the meat was bland or just plain tasted bad, so I could avoid finding out by not biting into it."
    new "……我又吃了一些，尽量少嚼。我分不清那肉是没味道还是本身就难吃，索性不去咬，也就不会知道了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46425
    old "I bet we just were mistaken about the range as well. Or maybe it wasn't necessarily that. Maybe the range and the time the Sekimeiya spent out of the cabinet were related... that'd still make some sort of sense."
    new "说不定我们连范围也弄错了。也可能并非如此。也许范围和 Sekimeiya 离开展示柜的时间有关……这么说倒也勉强讲得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:46426
    old "Because again, when I touched it, it couldn't have been there for too long. And the range couldn't have been that large either, so the question should only be why I went so many days into the past."
    new "毕竟我碰它的时候，它不可能已经在那里搁了太久。范围也不可能那么大，那问题就只剩下：我为什么会回到那么多天以前。"

    # game/script.rpy:46427
    old "What if it's just random? We kinda let go of that thought because we didn't want it to be true, but it would make enough sense."
    new "万一它本来就是随机的呢？我们多少是因为不愿它成真才放下了这个念头，可它其实挺说得通的。"

    # game/script.rpy:46432
    old "I stopped eating. The aftertaste was getting worse, and the hunger had somewhat faded."
    new "我不再吃了。嘴里的余味越来越难受，饥饿感倒是退了几分。"

    # game/script.rpy:46433
    old "This could be really bad."
    new "这下可能真的糟了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46434
    old "If I was the only person who traveled, then everything I've thought should still apply. On the other hand, if a bunch of other people went with me and there's no news about it, I have no idea what will happen."
    new "如果穿越的只有我一个人，那我之前推断的那些应该都还成立。可要是还有一大群人和我一起穿越，事后却又毫无消息，那我就完全说不准会发生什么了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46435
    old "Xyn members from the future could be here. They would know about the incident and about the secret alarm. And if they do, they know what to expect and would alter their plans on the 15th."
    new "来自未来的 Xyn 成员也可能在这里。他们会知道那起事件，也知道那个秘密警报。如果真是这样，他们就知道会发生什么，15 号的计划也会随之改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:46436
    old "Even if Ashiya members or the police are here from the future, as long as they somewhat understand what happened, there's no guarantee the events of that day will happen again."
    new "就算芦屋的人或警察是从未来回来的，只要他们对当时的情况略知一二，那一天的事就未必会重演。"

    # game/script.rpy:46437
    old "...{w}If Sai also traveled, there's no way he won't try to steal the Sekimeiya before then, when nobody else seemed aware of its powers. I didn't consider that more people could be here with the same intentions that I have, aside from the original Xyn plan."
    new "……{w}如果 Sai 也穿越了，在那之前还没有旁人知道 Sekimeiya 的力量，他绝不会放过偷走它的机会。除了 Xyn 原本的计划之外，我从没想过还会有别人抱着和我一样的打算来到这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:46438
    old "I bit my lip. If more people had traveled from the future, anyone could change the past, significantly obstructing me."
    new "我咬住嘴唇。如果从未来穿越过来的人不止一个，谁都能改写过去，这会大大妨碍我。"

    # game/script.rpy:46447
    old "My phone insistently vibrated against the table. It was another incoming call."
    new "手机在桌上不停震动，又是一通来电。"

    # game/script.rpy:46448
    old "I leaned in to look at the tiny screen on its back."
    new "我俯身去看机身背面那块小屏幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:46449
    old "My mother again... I imagine she was told I still haven't woken up."
    new "又是母亲……多半是有人告诉她我还没醒。"

    # game/script.rpy:46451
    old "I let the ringing continue, but it stopped very quickly."
    new "我任由它响着，铃声却很快就停了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46452
    old "Huh..."
    new "咦……"

    # game/script.rpy:46453
    old "Did she just hang up?"
    new "她这就挂了？"

    # game/script.rpy:46455
    old "Maybe not. Right now, my original phone should be next to me in the hospital. If the call showed up on both devices, it's possible someone picked it up from there and it stopped ringing here."
    new "也许不是。此刻，我原本那部手机应该就放在医院里我的床边。如果两边的手机同时收到来电，也许有人在那里接了起来，这边的铃声才随之停下。"

    # game/script.rpy:46463
    old "I let myself fall back on the floor and waited to see if she'd call again."
    new "我顺势又倒回地板上，等着看她会不会再打来。"

    # game/script.rpy:46472
    old "There had been no new calls, and I hadn't sat back up. I'd been lying there for quite a while, so hunger started to claw at me again."
    new "再没有新的来电，我也没有重新坐起。就这么躺了好一阵，饥饿感又涌了上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:46473
    old "I'd looked through my food supplies that morning, so I knew no instant noodles were left. I lay there for a while, with no strength to stand."
    new "早上我把存粮翻过一遍，知道泡面已经吃完了。我又躺了一会儿，连站起来的力气都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:46476
    old "Should I go buy something? I don't mind spending the money that I have."
    new "要不要出去买点吃的？手头的钱花掉些也无所谓。"

    # game/script.rpy:46477
    old "...Wait, I can't. It's Sunday."
    new "……等等，不行。今天是星期天。"

    # game/script.rpy:46479
    old "I sighed, both frustrated and relieved."
    new "我叹了口气，既懊恼，又松了口气。"

    # game/script.rpy:46481
    old "I kept staring at the ceiling, noticing the sky turning dark through the gaps of the blinds. Thankfully, even though people lived on the other side of the walls, they tended to be very silent."
    new "我继续盯着天花板，透过百叶窗的缝隙看见天色渐渐暗下去。好在一墙之隔虽然住着人，却一向安静得很。"

    # game/script.rpy:46485
    old "My phone vibrated again, even more briefly than before."
    new "手机又震了一下，比刚才还短。"

    # game/script.rpy:46488
    old "...{w}I finally got up, supporting my body with one arm. As I did so, I realized what that had been."
    new "……{w}我终于用一只手臂撑起身子。就在起身的时候，我明白那是什么了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46489
    old "Oh, it's just gonna be that message."
    new "哦，原来是那条短信。"

    # game/script.rpy:46490
    old "I picked up my phone and flipped it open. As I'd thought, the expected message was on the screen, so I dismissed it with a button."
    new "我拿起手机翻开盖子。果然是那条预料之中的短信，我按了一下键把它关掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:46491
    old "\"Today at {time=9:51}, a deposit of ¥20,000 was transferred into your bank account. This will be reflected in 3 to 4 business days.\"{w} The time showed {time=17:57.}"
    new "「今天 {time=9:51}，你的银行账户存入 ¥20,000。此笔款项将在 3 至 4 个工作日内到账。」{w} 屏幕上的时间是 {time=17:57.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:46493
    old "I received that message on the first day of every month, with the monthly money my parents and I had agreed on. It said the payment had been confirmed in the morning, but it was normal for me to receive the message many hours later."
    new "每月一号我都会收到这条短信，那是父母和我约好的生活费。上面说款项在早上就已确认，可我往往要过好几个小时才收到消息，这也很平常。"

    # game/script.rpy:46495
    old "I remember seeing that message days after I woke up, so it just appeared on both phones. Either that, or back then I hadn't been living here and now it only appeared on this one..."
    new "我记得醒来后过了几天才看到那条短信，看来当时两部手机都收到了。又或者，那时我还没住在这里，所以现在它才只出现在这一部上……"

    # game/script.rpy:46497
    old "I could use this money if I need to. I didn't buy anything when I was staying at Atsuki's house, and I definitely didn't check my recent transactions, so it shouldn't be noticed if I take it."
    new "需要的话，这笔钱我可以动用。住在 Atsuki 家时我什么都没买，也肯定没去查过最近的交易记录，所以就算取了也不会有人察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:46500
    old "I yawned. Despite lying down for a while, I felt lethargic."
    new "我打了个哈欠。躺了这么久，身子却依旧发沉。"

    # game/script.rpy:46501
    old "It was still somewhat early, and the hunger had fully returned. However, I didn't feel like eating anything I had, and even less so like making it myself."
    new "时间还算早，饥饿感已经彻底回来了。可家里现有的东西我一样都不想吃，更懒得自己动手做。"

    # game/script.rpy:46504
    old "I went to drink some water and left the plate in the sink. The lingering warmth of the heater had almost disappeared, so I turned it back on."
    new "我去喝了点水，把盘子留在水槽里。暖炉的余温几乎散尽了，我又把它打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:46505
    old "I guess I'll buy more food tomorrow. If it's possible that more people traveled to the past with me, and I intend to try to find the Sekimeiya before the 15th, I should do it as soon as possible, before anyone else who's possibly here can beat me to it."
    new "明天再多买些吃的吧。假如真有可能还有别人和我一起回到了过去，而我又打算在 15 号之前找到 Sekimeiya，那就得尽快行动，赶在其他可能也在这里的人之前。"

    # game/script.rpy:46510
    old "Even with the heater on, I had to sleep with nightwear during the winter. I was tired enough to go to bed, so I put it on."
    new "冬天就算开着暖炉，睡觉也得穿睡衣。我累得只想上床，便换上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46515
    old "No light was coming from the window. The sun had set very early, giving me the impression that it was already time to sleep."
    new "窗外透不进一丝光。太阳落得极早，让我觉得已经到了该睡觉的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:46518
    old "I lowered the blinds, which I'd forgotten to do the previous night."
    new "我拉下百叶窗——昨晚忘了拉。"

    # game/script.rpy:46521
    old "Then, I turned off the light and made my way under the blankets in the dark."
    new "然后我关了灯，在黑暗里钻进被窝。"

    # game/script.rpy:46523
    old "As always, I left my phone on the bedside table next to me so that I could check the time after waking up or to set an alarm.{w} I hugged the pillow and closed my eyes."
    new "和往常一样，我把手机放在床头柜上，方便醒来后看时间或设闹钟。{w}我抱住枕头，闭上眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:46525
    old "It had been a pretty messy day. Aside from the arriving from the future aspect, I'd had many similar days that year."
    new "这一天过得乱七八糟。撇开从未来回来这件事不谈，那一年里我也有过很多差不多的日子。"

    # game/script.rpy:46526
    old "The reason why I'd been able to relax and enjoy the tranquility was probably simple. My preoccupations were much different from the usual."
    new "我之所以能放松下来，享受这份安宁，原因大概很简单：我操心的事和平时大不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:46529
    old "Those days were bound to end. I'd eventually have to find a job or study far from home. The weeks without obligations were ideal, but the feeling of wasting them was what made them stressful. I'd rarely been able to feel so calm, even though I still had very serious concerns on my mind.{w} I hated thinking about it, but what would I do in the future? My parents wouldn't keep sending me money for many more months, so what job could I find? I was only a little interested in studying medicine, but I didn't want to move, and I'd have to spend years and years pursuing it. Of course, it was expensive too, so I felt I had to completely discard the idea."
    new "这样的日子终究会结束。我迟早得去找工作，或者离家去读书。无所事事的几周本该是理想的，可那种虚度光阴的感觉反倒让人心焦。我很少能像这样平静，尽管心里仍压着极重的顾虑。{w}我一想到这些就厌烦，可将来到底要做什么呢？父母不会再连着几个月给我汇钱了，那我能找到什么工作？我对学医只有那么一点兴趣，却又不想搬家，而且要为此耗上好几年。当然，学费也很贵，所以我觉得只能彻底打消这个念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:46530
    old "What I had to do was very important. I had to erase Miiya's death and make sure Atsuki wouldn't go to the tower. If I could travel to the past and win the lottery, I would do it. It wasn't an answer I'd ever imagined, but it was perfect."
    new "我该做的事非常重要。我要抹去 Miiya 的死，还要确保 Atsuki 不会去那座塔。只要能回到过去、中一次彩票，我就会去做。这答案我从前从未设想过，却完美无缺。"

    # game/script.rpy:46532
    old "...It's almost perfect. There's this huge problem."
    new "……几乎完美无缺。只是还有一个天大的问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:46533
    old "The past can be changed, but the way it happens... even if I am able to save Miiya, two versions of myself will remain."
    new "过去可以改变，但改变的方式……就算我救下 Miiya，也仍然会留下两个我。"

    # game/script.rpy:46534
    old "...{w}I have to assume that's how it'd work. It's the most logical answer, isn't it? Neither of us would blink out of existence."
    new "……{w}只能这么想了吧。这是最合逻辑的答案，不是吗？我们谁都不会凭空消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:46542
    old "What would I do? Claim my lottery prize and go live on the other side of the world while the other version of me stays with Atsuki and Miiya?"
    new "那我该怎么办？去领我的彩票奖金，跑到世界另一头过日子，让另一个我留在 Atsuki 和 Miiya 身边？"

    # game/script.rpy:46543
    old "I don't want that. It sounds ridiculous too."
    new "我不想那样。而且听起来也太荒唐了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46544
    old "Is there even a solution here?"
    new "这件事到底有没有解法？"

    # game/script.rpy:46545
    old "I suddenly felt the same way I did every time I thought about my future. Neither answer was any good at all."
    new "我忽然又有了每次思考未来时的那种感觉。两个答案都糟糕透顶。"

    # game/script.rpy:46548
    old "There's no way around it, right? I couldn't just show up in front of the three of them and explain everything, could I...?"
    new "躲不过去的，对吧？我总不能就这么出现在他们三个面前，把事情全盘托出吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:46549
    old "In a reality after saving Miiya, the Sekimeiya would still exist, and it's not like its existence could stay a secret. I have no idea what would happen."
    new "在救下 Miiya 之后的那个现实里，Sekimeiya 依然存在，而它的存在也不可能一直保密。之后会发生什么，我完全无法预料。"

    # game/script.rpy:46550
    old "I guess that if I can get to the Sekimeiya before the 15th, I could get it again after Miiya is safe. At the very least, if I had it, that'd prove that I'm right, and nobody else could steal it from Ashiya later on. ...I doubt I'd be questioned if I appear in front of another version of myself, though."
    new "我想，只要能在 15 号之前拿到 Sekimeiya，等 Miiya 平安之后我就能再把它取回来。至少只要手里有它，就能证明我是对的，之后也没有谁能从芦屋手上把它偷走。……不过，我要是出现在另一个自己面前，大概也不会被盘问吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:46558
    old "Excavation"
    new "发掘"

    # game/script.rpy:46562
    old "Is it morning?"
    new "天亮了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:46568
    old "I looked at the window behind me. Through the upper gaps of the blinds, faint light was entering the bedroom."
    new "我回头看向身后的窗户。微光从百叶窗上方的缝隙里透进卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:46569
    old "I'd slept well, and likely for a long time."
    new "我睡得很沉，大概也睡了很久。"

    # game/script.rpy:46571
    old "One day closer to the 15th. I'm just in a countdown."
    new "离 15 号又近了一天。我只是在倒数而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:46573
    old "I wonder where the Sekimeiya is now. If Xyn has already failed to steal it once, are they already planning their daylight attack?"
    new "不知道 Sekimeiya 现在在哪里。如果 Xyn 已经偷过一次却失败了，他们是不是已经在计划白天动手了？"

    # game/script.rpy:46577
    old "I sat up and leaned against the pillow. The room was still pleasantly warm, a luxury I appreciated."
    new "我坐起身，靠在枕头上。房间里依旧暖得舒服，这份奢侈让我很受用。"

    # game/script.rpy:46578
    old "I reached for my phone to look at the time.{w} It showed {time=9:07}, confirming how long I'd slept."
    new "我伸手拿起手机看时间。{w}屏幕上显示 {time=9:07}，看来我这一觉睡了很久。"

    # game/script.rpy:46579
    old "...Katei said that the Sekimeiya had been found recently on a nearby mountain. Could that be true, though? Was a stone with time traveling powers on a mountain next to Yushibana?"
    new "……Katei 说 Sekimeiya 是不久前在附近的山上被发现的。可那是真的吗？一颗拥有时间穿越之力的石头，就躺在丰花旁边的山上？"

    # game/script.rpy:46580
    old "It doesn't even make sense. The place he described would have been close to where Atsuki and I used to go as kids. That place is mostly ignored nowadays because it lacks caves. If the Sekimeiya was found there, it shouldn't have been inside the mountain."
    new "这根本说不通。他描述的那个地方，就在我和 Atsuki 小时候常去的那一带附近。那里如今几乎没人会去，因为没有洞穴。如果 Sekimeiya 是在那儿被发现的，它就不该在山体里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:46582
    old "That's really strange, though. It's been snowing a lot recently... If the Sekimeiya was simply sitting around, it would've been deep under the snow."
    new "可这真的很奇怪。最近雪下得那么多……如果 Sekimeiya 只是随便搁在那儿，早就被埋在厚厚的雪下了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46583
    old "...So either Katei's story was false, or the Sekimeiya had been recently left there and wasn't completely buried by the falling snow when someone found it."
    new "……那么，要么 Katei 说的是假话，要么就是 Sekimeiya 不久前才被放到那里，被人发现时还没有被落雪完全掩埋。"

    # game/script.rpy:46586
    old "Neither option makes much sense. Why would it be put there? It's rare for anyone to go up there, so maybe they expected it to not be found. But that's insanely coincidental."
    new "两种可能都不太说得通。为什么要把东西放在那种地方？很少有人会上那儿去，也许对方就是算准了不会被人发现。可这也太巧了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46587
    old "Just a few days ago, where was the Sekimeiya? I can't seriously think that it was on that mountain for all the years I've lived here."
    new "就在几天前，Sekimeiya 在哪里？我在这里住了这么多年，总不能真以为它一直待在那座山上吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:46588
    old "What exactly is the likelihood that it was left there recently? Maybe there actually could be a reason behind that."
    new "它是最近才被放在那里的可能性究竟有多大？说不定这背后真有什么缘由。"

    # game/script.rpy:46589
    old "I languidly reached for my phone again and opened it. On the screen was an icon that I hadn't clicked on for a very long time. It said \"browser\"."
    new "我懒洋洋地又伸手拿起手机，解了锁。屏幕上有一个我很久没点开过的图标，上面写着「浏览器」。"

    # game/script.rpy:46590
    old "My phone could connect to the internet at all times. It was extremely slow, and I never used it. Before my parents had left, we had local internet access, but they shut it down once they took their laptop away."
    new "我的手机随时都能联网。只是速度慢得离谱，我从来不用。父母离开之前，家里本来有本地网络，可他们把笔记本电脑带走后，就把网也停了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46591
    old "I pressed the button and waited for a white screen to load. I had to look away from the glaring brightness, falling back onto the pillow."
    new "我按下那个按钮，等着一片白屏加载出来。刺眼的白光让我不由得移开视线，重新倒回枕头上。"

    # game/script.rpy:46595
    old "Weeks ago, who had the Sekimeiya? If someone had it, is it possible it was already given that name? I don't think Katei mentioned who named it. ...If I recall correctly, he said that it was found on the 27th, and Ashiya announced the event on the 29th, three days ago."
    new "几周之前，Sekimeiya 在谁手上？就算有人拿着它，它当时就已经叫这个名字了吗？Katei 好像没提过是谁给它取的名。……如果我没记错，他说它是 27 号被发现的，而芦屋在 29 号、也就是三天前公布了那场活动。"

    # game/script.rpy:46596
    old "If I search for the word \"Sekimeiya\", I'll probably just find mentions of Ashiya's announcement. I wonder if I could find an instance of that word from before the 29th."
    new "只要搜索「Sekimeiya」这个词，多半只能搜到芦屋公告的相关报道。不知道能不能找到 29 号之前就出现过这个词的记录。"

    # game/script.rpy:46601
    old "The search engine loaded, and I considered what to type into it."
    new "搜索引擎加载完毕，我斟酌着该往里输入什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:46602
    old "Is it possible I'll find traces of the people who want to steal it? I wonder... if what happened on the 30th was an attempt to steal the Sekimeiya, even though it wasn't publicly stated, could there be any mention of this somewhere online?"
    new "我会不会找到那些想偷走它的人留下的痕迹？我在想……如果 30 号发生的事就是有人企图偷走 Sekimeiya，虽然官方没有明说，网上会不会有哪里提到过？"

    # game/script.rpy:46603
    old "I knew Ashiya's announcements would cover up what I wanted to find, so I set the results of the search to be ordered by oldest first, to truly find the first recorded instance of the word. I typed \"Sekimeiya\" and pressed the search button."
    new "我知道芦屋的公告会把我想找的东西盖住，于是把搜索结果按时间从旧到新排序，好找出这个词最早被记录下来的那一次。我输入「Sekimeiya」，按下搜索键。"

    # game/script.rpy:46608
    old "The white screen returned with a slowly-filling blue bar on top, which I patiently watched finish."
    new "又是白屏，顶端一条蓝色的进度条缓缓填充，我耐着性子看它走完。"

    # game/script.rpy:46609
    old "I lost myself in anticipation, forgetting to even blink. Just when had the word \"Sekimeiya\" been recorded for the first time? I doubted I would find valuable information about Xyn, but that shouldn't have been out of the question either."
    new "我满心期待，连眨眼都忘了。「Sekimeiya」这个词最早是什么时候被记录下来的？我不指望能找到关于 Xyn 的有用信息，可那也并非全无可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:46613
    old "The results all appeared at once. I glanced at all of them hastily, reading common page titles in blue reporting Ashiya's announcement on the 29th."
    new "结果一下子全冒了出来。我匆匆扫过，蓝色的标题大同小异，都是报道芦屋 29 号那场公告的页面。"

    # game/script.rpy:46614
    old "...Wait, what's this?{w} ...The Sekimeiya incident might happen soon...?"
    new "……等等，这是什么？{w}……Sekimeiya 事件或许即将发生……？"

    # game/script.rpy:46615
    old "It was the very first entry. Below it, in gray, I read the creation date."
    new "那是列表最顶端的一条。它下方有一行灰色小字，是发布日期。"

    # game/script.rpy:46616
    old "Written on the 24th of November... Did I find it?"
    new "发布于 11 月 24 日……难道我找到了？"

    # game/script.rpy:46620
    old "I pressed down once to highlight the text and then clicked on \"OK\". Once again, the screen turned white and began to slowly load the page."
    new "我按了一下，把那段文字选中，再点下「确定」。屏幕再一次变白，开始慢慢加载页面。"

    # game/script.rpy:46621
    old "There'd been a brief preview below the title, but I'd advanced before reading it fully. However, it seemed that whoever wrote it was pretty disconcerted."
    new "标题下方本来有一小段预览，可我还没读完就点了进去。不过看得出来，写这段话的人相当心神不宁。"

    # game/script.rpy:46622
    old "I waited for the screen to transition, blocking out anything else in my field of view. Meanwhile, I looked at the URL of the website and recognized it as a well-known forum used worldwide."
    new "我等着页面跳转，视线里再容不下别的东西。趁这工夫，我看了眼网址，认出那是一个全球知名的论坛。"

    # game/script.rpy:46623
    old "The loading speed seemed much slower that time, and I worried it would just hang. I held my breath every time the progress bar froze."
    new "这次加载似乎慢得多，我担心它会直接卡死。进度条每停一下，我都屏住呼吸。"

    # game/script.rpy:46626
    old "The screen turned gray, and the header of the website appeared. Instants later, the rest of its contents popped up in a flash."
    new "屏幕转成灰色，网站的页眉浮现出来。转眼间，其余内容也唰地一下全部显示出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:46628
    old "I relaxed my eyes, the darker screen reducing the strain. Then, I attempted to read the two blocks of text below the title, displayed in minuscule letters."
    new "屏幕暗了下来，眼睛不再那么吃力，我也松弛下来。随后，我试着去读标题下方那两段小得可怜的文字。"

    # game/script.rpy:46631
    old "\"I swear this is all the truth, I'm not messing around. I'm a bit scared, though, and I'm not sure what to do. I think I just woke up from a really strange dream. It felt hyperrealistic, and I'm still shaking...\""
    new "「我发誓，我说的全是真的，绝不是在开玩笑。不过我有点怕，也不知道该怎么办。我想我刚从一个怪梦里醒来。那感觉真实过头了，我现在还在发抖……」"

    # game/script.rpy:46632
    old "\"I don't know if it means anything. Maybe it was a premonition, I'm not sure. However, I'd be careful on the 15th of next month. If I don't say this anonymously, I'll be laughed at, or even fired... On the 15th, Ashiya will hold a big event in the tower, and there'll be a terrorist attack.\""
    new "「我不知道这有没有意义。也许那是个预兆，我也说不准。不过，下个月 15 号还是小心为妙。要不是匿名，我说这些只会被人笑话，甚至会被炒鱿鱼……15 号那天，芦屋会在塔里举办一场大型活动，到时候会有恐怖袭击。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46633
    old "\"It will be called... the Sekimeiya.\""
    new "「它会被称为……Sekimeiya。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46634
    old "\"Soon, maybe they will announce it. I don't think I'm a prophet or anything, but I'm still trying to calm down. This time, it felt too real to let it pass.\""
    new "「也许过不了多久，他们就会公布。我并不觉得自己是什么预言家，可我到现在还在设法让自己冷静下来。这一次的感觉太真实了，我没法当作没发生过。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46635
    old "Speechless, I scrolled the page down so that I could read the entirety of the following paragraph."
    new "我说不出话来，只能把页面往下滚，好把接下来那一整段读完。"

    # game/script.rpy:46638
    old "\"That's what I dreamed. It's so bizarre I still think it might've really happened. That's why I feel the need to post it, in case it actually means something. Do not go to that event if it happens. Some people even got trapped inside, but I don't know what happened to them.\""
    new "「这就是我梦到的。太离奇了，我至今都觉得那可能真的发生过。所以我才想把它发出来，万一它真有什么意义。如果那个活动真的办了，千万别去。有人甚至被困在了里面，可他们后来怎么样，我不知道。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46639
    old "\"I think something might be wrong with me... I don't know why, but I'm not home. I can hardly believe it's still the 24th, and I don't know what I'm doing at my parents' house.\""
    new "「我觉得自己可能出了什么问题……不知为什么，我不在自己家里。我几乎无法相信现在还是24号，也不知道自己为什么会在父母家。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46640
    old "\"Sorry to rant about this, but I need to let it out somewhere. I've been suffering from a few mental issues, but nothing has been as bad as this. I've been living alone for two years while my condition has gotten worse and worse. I feel I can't continue on my own, and letting people around me know it might be a horrible idea.\""
    new "「抱歉在这里倒这些苦水，可我总得找个地方说出来。我一直有些精神方面的毛病，但从没像这次这么严重。我独自生活了两年，状况却越来越糟。我觉得一个人撑不下去了，而让身边的人知道这件事，也许是个糟糕透顶的主意。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46641
    old "\"Anyway, maybe some of you will have some advice. I know posting here isn't the most effective thing, but it's very hard for me to talk about this out loud. Thank you for reading.\""
    new "「总之，也许有人能给我点建议。我知道发在这里未必有什么用，可要我当面对人讲这些，实在很难开口。谢谢你读到这里。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46646
    old "That was where it ended. I looked at the username on the post and read \"7md_ag\"."
    new "帖子到这里就结束了。我看向发帖人的用户名，读出了「7md_ag」。"

    # game/script.rpy:46648
    old "Astonished, I read through it all again."
    new "我震惊不已，又从头读了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:46650
    old "...{w}Who is this?{w} There's no way it's from the people who organized the attack. The Sekimeiya hadn't been given to Ashiya yet, and they wouldn't know people will get trapped since the alarm's existence was supposed to be a secret."
    new "……{w}这是谁？{w}这绝不可能是策划那场袭击的人发的。Sekimeiya 当时还没交到芦屋手上，而且警报的存在本该是秘密，他们不可能知道有人会被困在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:46651
    old "Could it be that someone from Ashiya posted this? If not, they must not have seen it, because it reveals that someone knew about the alarm. ...Even though Ashiya didn't have the Sekimeiya on the 24th, is it possible this person knew they'd obtain a gem to use as bait and what they'd name it?"
    new "难道是芦屋的人发的？若不是，那他们一定没看到这帖子——它暴露了有人知道警报的事。……24号那天芦屋还没拿到 Sekimeiya，可这个人会不会早就知道他们会得到一颗宝石用作诱饵，甚至连名字都猜到了？"

    # game/script.rpy:46652
    old "...There's no way. This can only be one thing.{w} ...Someone who traveled from the future—from the 15th. If it's not that, whoever posted this knew about the Sekimeiya's powers."
    new "……不可能。那就只剩下一种解释。{w}……有人从未来穿越而来——从15号。若非如此，发帖的人就是知道 Sekimeiya 的力量。"

    # game/script.rpy:46655
    old "\"I can hardly believe it's still the 24th, and I don't know what I'm doing at my parents' house.\" Did they appear there from the future...?"
    new "「我几乎无法相信现在还是24号，也不知道自己为什么会在父母家。」难道这个人是从未来出现在那里的……？"

    # game/script.rpy:46656
    old "\"Some people even got trapped inside, but I don't know what happened to them.\"{w} ...If I'm right, this person must have been outside of the tower. They knew some of us had gotten trapped, but not what was happening inside. Then, before {time=21}, they traveled to the past."
    new "「有人甚至被困在了里面，可他们后来怎么样，我不知道。」{w}……如果我猜得没错，这个人当时就在塔外。他知道我们中有人被困住了，却不知道里面发生了什么。然后在 {time=21} 之前，他穿越回了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:46657
    old "I thought about that for a while. Was it possible such a thing had happened?"
    new "我琢磨了一阵。这种事真的可能发生吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:46658
    old "If they were outside the tower and suddenly traveled, did people see that? Did someone from inside the building travel to the 24th and bring this person with them?{w} That can't be, right? It's the same thing I thought about regarding my own travel. It would've had an immense range, and it would've picked up so many more people, including me."
    new "如果他在塔外，又突然穿越了，有人看见了吗？会不会是楼里的人穿越到24号，把他一起带了过去？{w}不可能吧？我对自己那次穿越也是这么想的。那范围会大得离谱，还会把更多的人卷进来，包括我在内。"

    # game/script.rpy:46659
    old "Maybe I have this wrong. If the recording was genuine, the exit wouldn't have unlocked after {time=21.} That could be why this person doesn't know what happened to us, and they could've traveled after the 15th. Maybe when they did, nobody else was outside the tower, and that's why only one person traveled."
    new "也许是我弄错了。如果那段录音是真的，出口在 {time=21.} 之后就不会解锁。这或许就是这个人不知道我们遭遇了什么的原因，而他可能是在15号之后才穿越的。也许他穿越的时候，塔外再没有别人，所以才只有他一个人穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:46662
    old "I got really confused. None of my ideas seemed very reasonable."
    new "我越想越糊涂。哪一个推测都站不住脚。"

    # game/script.rpy:46663
    old "Does this confirm that what we thought about the range was completely wrong? Now it's not only my travel that doesn't make sense."
    new "这是否说明我们对范围的判断完全错了？如今说不通的，已经不只我那次穿越了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46664
    old "There's no way this person knew all this without being present on the 15th. Even if they somehow knew what would happen, what's the reason to post it online? The only people who would know about the alarm ahead of time would be Xyn members or Ashiya, two groups that would never publicly post this. Traveling from the future and posting it makes far more sense."
    new "这个人若没在15号那天在场，绝不可能知道这些。就算他不知怎么预知了会发生什么，又有什么理由把它发到网上？能提前知道警报的，只有 Xyn 的人和芦屋；而这两方都绝不会公开贴出这种东西。相比之下，从未来穿越回来再发帖，要合理得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:46667
    old "I read it one more time, and what they described sounded exactly like they had been sent fairly far back in time."
    new "我又读了一遍。他描述的情形，分明就是被送回了相当久远的过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:46668
    old "But if that's it, who made that travel happen? Whoever did would've disappeared from the tower.{w} ...Was it Akaro?{w} When we left the attic's bedroom, we found the Sekimeiya powered off in a hallway B room. After that time, I didn't see Akaro again, and he could've touched it. ...Also, the rest of us but Sai were in the attic, so maybe that's why we didn't travel alongside Akaro."
    new "可若真是这样，那次穿越又是谁触发的？触发的人本该从塔里消失。{w}……是 Akaro 吗？{w}我们离开阁楼那间卧室时，发现 Sekimeiya 在 B走廊的一个房间里，已经关掉了。那之后我就再没见过 Akaro，他有机会碰到它。……而且，除了 Sai，我们几个当时都在阁楼里，也许正因如此才没跟着 Akaro 一起被传送走。"

    # game/script.rpy:46669
    old "But... much later, Atsuki said that he'd seen him.{w} ...Maybe I'm wrong. If the range isn't an obstacle, anyone could've gone so far back. Then, they either could've reentered through the storeroom or been inside since that morning."
    new "可是……很久之后，Atsuki 说他见过那个人。{w}……也许我错了。如果范围不是障碍，那谁都有可能回到那么早的过去。那样的话，这个人要么是从储藏室重新进来的，要么从那天早上起就一直待在楼里。"

    # game/script.rpy:46670
    old "It's also possible the Sekimeiya was taken out through the storeroom at some point, and that's how this person traveled without affecting anyone nearby."
    new "也有可能 Sekimeiya 在某个时候被带出了储藏室，这个人正是借此穿越，才没有波及附近的任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:46674
    old "...{w}If this person was outside the tower and went to the past alongside someone who activated the Sekimeiya, would they have thought that they'd experienced a hyperrealistic dream? That sounds pretty strange, but I suppose there aren't many more interpretations. They don't exactly seem to have a record of being mentally stable..."
    new "……{w}如果这个人当时在塔外，跟着某个启动 Sekimeiya 的人一起回到了过去，他会不会就以为自己做了一场无比真实的梦？这听起来很荒唐，但除此之外恐怕也没有多少解释。毕竟从帖子里看，他的精神状态本来就算不上稳定……"

    # game/script.rpy:46675
    old "So did this thread always exist? Did the event still occur when the Sekimeiya's existence had been foreseen days before its announcement because nobody saw this? Did this person not try to make waves once it was announced...?"
    new "那么这个帖子是一直就存在的吗？早在公布之前好几天，就有人预见了 Sekimeiya 的存在，事件却照样发生了——是因为没人看到这帖子吗？还是说，等消息公布之后，这个人并没有试图闹出什么动静……？"

    # game/script.rpy:46676
    old "I tried to keep scrolling down and realized that the page was larger than I'd thought."
    new "我继续往下滚，才发现这页面比我想的要长。"

    # game/script.rpy:46678
    old "Below the initial post was a short reply.{w} \"Yeah, right? If you can see the future, do me a favor and PM me tomorrow's lottery numbers. That'd be sick. I'd make a nice long reservation at that comfy Damski resort place, always wanted to go.\""
    new "原帖下面是一条简短的回复。{w}「可不是嘛？你要是能看见未来，就帮个忙，私信我明天的彩票号码。那可太爽了。我要在 Damski 那家舒服的度假村订一间长住房，我一直想去。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46680
    old "...The poster was \"IloveAgathodaemon\". I went down farther and saw another reply by the original poster."
    new "……发帖人叫「IloveAgathodaemon」。我继续往下翻，又看到一条楼主自己的回复。"

    # game/script.rpy:46682
    old "\"I'm telling the truth. I've cooled off, but I still feel like I shouldn't be here. I am not the crazy one. I just spoke to my parents, and they also said I shouldn't be here. There is no way it's the 24th. I can't believe any of this.\""
    new "「我说的是真话。我已经冷静下来了，可我还是觉得自己不该在这里。不是我疯了。我刚跟父母谈过，他们也说我不该在这里。现在绝不可能是24号。这一切我都没法相信。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46685
    old "The next reply had been posted one day later. Below it, the dated entry showed it had been sent on the 25th of November, at {time=20.}"
    new "下一条回复是一天之后发的。下面标着的日期显示，它发送于11月25日 {time=20.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:46686
    old "\"But where's my lottery number? I was excited to go buy my ticket. I don't know if you're just bored, but there's not much time until the 15th. Don't worry. I promise you I won't go if what you're saying happens.\""
    new "「可我的彩票号码呢？我还兴冲冲地准备去买呢。我不知道你是不是只是无聊，但离15号可没多少时间了。放心吧，如果真像你说的那样，我保证不去。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46687
    old "Next, a third person had left a comment. Their name was \"RentALiver\"."
    new "接着，第三个人留了言。名字是「RentALiver」。"

    # game/script.rpy:46689
    old "\"Are you someone from Sasameyuki? Is this what you all do now? If this event at the skyscraper is actually announced, it'll confirm I'm right. Are you trying to scare people off from going? I bet you're not even from Yushibana.\""
    new "「你是 Sasameyuki 的人吧？你们现在都干这种事了？如果那栋高楼的活动真的公布了，就证明我没说错。你是想吓唬别人别去吗？我看你根本就不是丰花的人。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46691
    old "I frowned and tried to remember what I knew about that name."
    new "我皱起眉，努力回想关于这个名字我知道些什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:46692
    old "Is that a company Ashiya had a conflict with? ...That has to be it. They're not from Yushibana, which must be why this person's saying that."
    new "是跟芦屋有过冲突的那家公司吗？……一定是了。对方不是丰花的人，这人多半就是因为这个才那么说。"

    # game/script.rpy:46696
    old "There was another reply posted early on the 26th by the original poster."
    new "26号一早，楼主又发了一条回复。"

    # game/script.rpy:46697
    old "\"I am from Yushibana. It's where I am right now. I just came back from my parents', but my memories of the days leading up to the 15th only intensified. It's impossible I dreamed all that. I really have no idea what happened to me.\""
    new "「我就是丰花的人。我现在就在这儿。我刚从父母家回来，可我对15号之前那几天的记忆反而越来越清晰。那不可能只是一场梦。我真的不知道自己身上发生了什么。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46698
    old "...A picture?"
    new "……一张照片？"

    # game/script.rpy:46699
    old "Below that comment, there was an attached picture that just finished loading. It was from high up, and you could see the tower in the distance, its surroundings all lightly covered by snow."
    new "那条评论下面附着一张刚加载完的照片。拍摄位置很高，远处能看到那座塔，四周覆着一层薄雪。"

    # game/script.rpy:46700
    old "This was taken in Yushibana. I see, they posted this to show that they live here."
    new "这是在丰花拍的。原来如此，他贴这张照片是为了证明自己住在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:46701
    old "I scrolled down more and came to a yellow line of text saying \"This topic has been locked. You cannot post a new reply.\""
    new "我又往下滚，看到一行黄色的字：「本帖已锁定，无法发表新回复。」"

    # game/script.rpy:46703
    old "This is all there is..."
    new "就这些了……"

    # game/script.rpy:46706
    old "This person definitely traveled from the 15th. They even said their memories end there, so that's the day they went to the past."
    new "这个人确实是从15号穿越过来的。他甚至说自己的记忆就断在那里，可见他就是那天回到过去的。"

    # game/script.rpy:46707
    old "It doesn't make sense, though. How did that happen...?"
    new "可这说不通啊。到底是怎么发生的……？"

    # game/script.rpy:46708
    old "And did this thread change the past, or did it always exist and the incident occurred anyway?"
    new "还有，这个帖子究竟是改变了过去，还是它一直就存在，而事件照样发生了？"

    # game/script.rpy:46709
    old "It seems so strange... What if Xyn gets in touch with this person after Ashiya announces the Sekimeiya event, and that's how they'll learn about the alarm? That'd be a paradox, but maybe it's possible."
    new "太奇怪了……万一芦屋公布 Sekimeiya 的活动之后，Xyn 联系上这个人，就这样得知警报的事呢？那就成悖论了，但也未必不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:46710
    old "I selected the username \"7md_ag\" and pulled up the profile."
    new "我选中了用户名「7md_ag」，打开了个人主页。"

    # game/script.rpy:46712
    old "The page loaded much more quickly. A history of the account activity appeared before me, but unfortunately, they hadn't posted anything after their last reply."
    new "这次页面加载得快多了。账号的活动记录出现在眼前，可惜在最后那条回复之后，他再没发过任何东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:46719
    old "I felt a little dizzy after reading all of that, probably thanks to not having eaten much the previous day. Sapped of energy, I got out of bed and steadied myself."
    new "读完这些，我有些头晕，多半是前一天没吃多少东西的缘故。身上提不起劲，我下了床，站稳身子。"

    # game/script.rpy:46723
    old "I picked out some fresh clothing and stepped to the bathroom."
    new "我挑了几件干净衣服，走进浴室。"

    # game/script.rpy:46728
    old "...I still don't have anything to eat."
    new "……家里还是一点吃的都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:46729
    old "I could feel the demands of my stomach. Given the unpleasant meat I'd cooked, it wanted something actually edible."
    new "我能感觉到胃在抗议。想想自己之前煎的那两块难吃的肉，它现在想要点真正能入口的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:46730
    old "It's really early... I should just go to the grocery store. Better watch out for no low-quality cuts of meat before I buy them, though..."
    new "确实还早……干脆去趟超市吧。不过买肉之前得看清楚，别挑到那种劣质肉……"

    # game/script.rpy:46731
    old "Sidnoc was a grocery close to my apartment that I visited often, and that was my target for the time being. I knew I wouldn't be able to think properly before eating something filling."
    new "Sidnoc 是离我公寓不远的一家超市，我常去，眼下就打算去那儿。我知道，不先吃点顶饱的东西，脑子根本转不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:46734
    old "I drank some chilly bottled water and approached the heater."
    new "我喝了几口冰凉的瓶装水，走到暖气旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:46735
    old "I guess I can leave it on. I'll be really cold once I come back."
    new "就让它开着吧。回来的时候肯定冷得够呛。"

    # game/script.rpy:46739
    old "I grabbed my purse in the living room. In the entrance, I made sure I wasn't forgetting anything and picked up my keys. I had my wallet too, so I put on the boots and coat I'd left next to the door."
    new "我在客厅拿上手提包，到玄关确认没落下东西，又拿起钥匙。钱包也在身上，我便穿上放在门边的靴子和大衣。"

    # game/script.rpy:46746
    old "It wasn't snowing that day either, and my street seemed empty.{w} I went down the stairs and walked ahead. The direction was the same I'd taken the previous day, but Sidnoc was located before the center of Yushibana."
    new "那天也没有下雪，我那条街看上去空无一人。{w}我走下楼梯，往前走。方向和前一天一样，只是 Sidnoc 位于丰花中心之前。"

    # game/script.rpy:46749
    old "I recognized the wide tire marks on the snow. Once a week, a garbage truck would pass through my street to collect the grouped-up cans farther ahead."
    new "我认出了雪地上那几道宽轮胎印。每周会有一次垃圾车开过我家这条街，收走前面集中堆放的垃圾桶。"

    # game/script.rpy:46750
    old "I guess the lady at the store also knows me."
    new "看来店里那位女士也认得我。"

    # game/script.rpy:46751
    old "I didn't know her name, or if she was the owner of the place or just a cashier, but she was usually there when I went. I wondered if she'd say anything, as I'd never really spoken to her."
    new "我不知道她叫什么，也不知道她是店主还是普通收银员，但每次去她几乎都在。我从没和她好好说过话，不知道她会不会提起什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:46755
    old "Normally, after leaving my house with the heater on, the outside would feel very cold. It was a little bit warmer than I expected, so I kept a steady pace."
    new "家里开着暖气，出门时外面照例冷得刺骨。今天却比预想的暖一些，我便不紧不慢地走着。"

    # game/script.rpy:46758
    old "I saw more clouds above me, as white as the ground. ...After walking for a bit, I still hadn't seen anyone on the street."
    new "抬头望去，天上的云多了起来，白得和地面一样。……走了一段，街上仍不见半个人影。"

    # game/script.rpy:46760
    old "...After firmly pressing down on the snow with a step, I brought myself to a halt."
    new "……我一脚重重踩进雪里，停住了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:46761
    old "Still looking upward, I was staring at the structure that reached higher than the others. I'd seen it throughout my entire life, but I'd only recently entered it for the first time."
    new "我依旧仰着头，望着那栋比周围都高的建筑。它从我记事起就在那里，可我直到最近才第一次走进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:46762
    old "I remembered having been told before that it was visible from any place in Yushibana, and I'd just seen it was the truth."
    new "我记得以前听人说过，在丰花任何地方都能望见它——刚才一看，果然不假。"

    # game/script.rpy:46763
    old "I guess when we were inside of it, all of Yushibana could see us."
    new "这么说，我们待在里面的时候，整个丰花都能看见我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:46764
    old "From where I was, I could only see a few of the higher windows, but it was enough to notice that there were no shutters covering them."
    new "从我这儿只能看见高处的几扇窗，但也足够看出，那些窗上并没有卷帘遮着。"

    # game/script.rpy:46765
    old "I looked at it for a while, my mind blank. It seemed there was no light on the other side of the windows. As Katei had said, nobody had been recently working on those floors."
    new "我望着它出了会儿神，脑中一片空白。窗后似乎没有一丝灯光。正如 Katei 所说，那些楼层最近都没人用过。"

    # game/script.rpy:46772
    old "I shook it off and kept going. I was already pretty close."
    new "我甩开这些念头，继续往前走。已经离得不远了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46773
    old "As I got closer to the busier center of town, more and more tire marks crisscrossed the snow. I could see the shop ahead of me, and I shortly arrived in front of it."
    new "越靠近热闹的镇中心，雪地上的轮胎印就越交错密布。那家店已经出现在前方，我很快就走到了门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:46779
    old "...Good morning."
    new "……早上好。"

    # game/script.rpy:46780
    old "I walked past her. The streets had been desolate, but I saw someone I didn't recognize picking up cereal in an aisle."
    new "我从她身边走过。街上冷冷清清，店里却有个陌生的面孔在货架前挑麦片。"

    # game/script.rpy:46781
    old "...She didn't say anything."
    new "……她什么也没提。"

    # game/script.rpy:46782
    old "I figured not everyone had seen the news, and even if she had, she didn't have to mention it. I knew where everything was, so I kept walking as I wondered what to get."
    new "我想，不是每个人都看到了那则新闻；就算看了，也未必非要提起。店里的东西我熟，便一边走一边想着买些什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:46783
    old "I really wanted to use my time well, and I never felt like cooking. I stopped in front of the stand full of instant food."
    new "我实在想好好利用时间，也从来懒得做饭。我在摆满速食的货架前停下。"

    # game/script.rpy:46786
    old "I'll get tired of these if it's the only thing I buy. ...They're all instant noodles."
    new "要是只买这些，很快就会吃腻。……可这里全是泡面。"

    # game/script.rpy:46787
    old "I frowned a little, but there was nothing to worry about. On the 8th, I'd gone home from the hospital, but it had been late, and I'd eaten a little before leaving. I didn't think I'd checked the kitchen where I could've seen my food supply."
    new "我微微皱眉，不过也没什么好担心的。八号那天我从医院回家，时间已经很晚，出门前也吃过一点。我记得自己回来时并没查看过厨房，不然就能知道家里还剩多少吃的。"

    # game/script.rpy:46788
    old "And even if I did, I could simply be changing the past now."
    new "就算看过，也无非是现在正在改变过去罢了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46789
    old "It keeps occurring, though. I went to buy food without the intention to change the past, and it happened to match what I already lived through once. Maybe it really is correct that everything will happen as it did if I don't purposely think about changing anything."
    new "可这种事一再发生。我出来买吃的，并没有改变过去的打算，结果却恰好和已经经历过的那一次吻合。也许那种说法确实没错：只要我不刻意去想改变什么，一切就会按原样发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:46790
    old "But that also doesn't make complete sense. I've already made one change by calling my mom, so now \"everything\" can't really happen as it did as long as I don't intend otherwise. Down the line, more things are bound to differ..."
    new "但这也不全说得通。我已经给妈打了一通电话，改变了一件事。既然如此，「只要我没有别的打算，一切就会照旧」也就站不住脚了。往后，肯定还会有更多地方不一样……"

    # game/script.rpy:46793
    old "I sighed, picked up a few packs of instant noodles without any special flavoring, and wandered around the shop."
    new "我叹了口气，拿起几包没有特别调味的泡面，在店里转了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:46796
    old "I hadn't grabbed a cart, so I soon found myself carrying noodles, cookies, milk, chips, almonds, and my favorite cereal bars."
    new "我没推购物车，很快就发现自己怀里抱着泡面、饼干、牛奶、薯片、杏仁，还有我最喜欢的麦片棒。"

    # game/script.rpy:46797
    old "...I should get meat too."
    new "……还得买点肉。"

    # game/script.rpy:46798
    old "I felt a little reluctant to buy more after the two nasty pieces I'd eaten."
    new "吃过那两块难吃的肉之后，我有点不太情愿再买。"

    # game/script.rpy:46800
    old "I stared through the transparent door of the fridge. I didn't feel like looking at the eggs, so I scanned the scarce meat that was there."
    new "我隔着冷柜的透明门往里看。懒得去看鸡蛋，便把所剩不多的肉扫了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:46802
    old "I guess I just have to heat these up."
    new "这些大概只要热一下就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:46803
    old "I lifted up the top and grabbed some prepared meat. I knew I'd seen the same brand at Atsuki's house."
    new "我掀开柜盖，拿了几份调理好的肉。我记得在 Atsuki 家里见过同一个牌子。"

    # game/script.rpy:46804
    old "Careful not to let anything fall, I stepped up to the cashier and dropped everything on the conveyor belt. It would all last me a few days, but not until the 15th."
    new "我小心不让东西掉下来，走到收银台前，把它们一股脑放到传送带上。这些够我吃上几天，但撑不到十五号。"

    # game/script.rpy:46808
    old "She quietly scanned all the items."
    new "她一声不响地把所有东西都扫了码。"

    # game/script.rpy:46809
    old "It'll be ¥2,739 total."
    new "一共 2,739 日元。"

    # game/script.rpy:46810
    old "Ah, give me a plastic bag too, please."
    new "啊，再给我一个塑料袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:46811
    old "...Here."
    new "……给。"

    # game/script.rpy:46812
    old "I grabbed my wallet, but I knew I barely didn't have enough cash to pay for everything.{w} I took out my credit card instead and handed it to her."
    new "我掏出钱包，可我知道身上的现金差一点点不够付全款。{w}于是我改拿信用卡，递给她。"

    # game/script.rpy:46813
    old "She inserted it into a tiny device and asked me to put in my PIN."
    new "她把卡插进一个小机器里，让我输入密码。"

    # game/script.rpy:46814
    old "1{w=0.4}9{w=0.2}9{w=0.3}1.{w=0.3} I pressed \"okay\" and waited a few seconds."
    new "1{w=0.4}9{w=0.2}9{w=0.3}1.{w=0.3} 我按下「确认」，等了几秒。"

    # game/script.rpy:46817
    old "After she handed me the receipt, I put everything in the bag and walked out."
    new "她递来收据后，我把东西都装进袋子，走出了店门。"

    # game/script.rpy:46821
    old "The other shopper had left at some point, but the outside was as devoid of life as before."
    new "不知什么时候，另一名顾客已经走了；外面依旧空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:46824
    old "I retreaded my footprints to make it home. I'd already done what I wanted, so I moved slower, trying not to exhaust the minimal energy I still had."
    new "我沿着来时的脚印往家走。想办的事已经办完，我便放慢脚步，尽量不耗尽所剩无几的力气。"

    # game/script.rpy:46828
    old "I took the keys out while I went up the stairs. Opening the door caused the heat stored inside to leak out, so I moved in quickly."
    new "我一边上楼，一边掏出钥匙。门一开，屋里积存的暖意便向外散，我赶紧闪身进屋。"

    # game/script.rpy:46832
    old "I left the bag on the floor to take off my coat and shoes and brought it to the kitchen."
    new "我把袋子搁在地上，脱下外套和鞋，再提着它进了厨房。"

    # game/script.rpy:46835
    old "Except for a portion of noodles, I stored everything in a low cabinet and the fridge. I didn't have any way to obtain hot water, so I put some in a pot and placed it on the gas stove. I tended to cook with bottled water because I didn't particularly trust tap water. Fortunately, I still had plenty of bottles left."
    new "除了一份面条，其余东西我都收进了矮柜和冰箱。我没法直接弄到热水，便往锅里倒了些水，放到燃气灶上。我做饭一向用瓶装水，因为不太信得过自来水。幸好剩下的瓶装水还很多。"

    # game/script.rpy:46836
    old "After grabbing the chopsticks, I waited for the water to boil. It didn't need to get overly hot, so as soon as tiny bubbles began to form on the surface of the pot, I turned off the stove and poured the water in a bowl with the noodles and other ingredients."
    new "我拿好筷子，等水烧开。水不用烧得太烫，水面刚冒出细小的气泡，我就关掉灶火，把水倒进盛着面条和配料的碗里。"

    # game/script.rpy:46837
    old "Within five minutes, they would be cooked. As usual, I brought the bowl to the living room and left it on the table."
    new "五分钟之内就能泡熟。我照例把碗端到客厅，放在桌上。"

    # game/script.rpy:46842
    old "I hadn't turned on the light, so the only illumination came from outside. I felt much more comfortable not having my window exposed to anyone outside of it, and the lighting was preferable anyway."
    new "我没开灯，屋里只有外面透进来的光。窗外的人看不到室内，这让我自在得多，况且这样的光线也更合我意。"

    # game/script.rpy:46845
    old "Nonetheless, I still turned on the ceiling light to force myself to be more awake."
    new "尽管如此，我还是打开了顶灯，逼自己清醒一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:46848
    old "I tried to simply wait for the noodles to cook, but it was hard not to remember what I'd read."
    new "我想干脆等着面泡好，可脑子里总忍不住回想刚才读到的内容。"

    # game/script.rpy:46849
    old "...Who had written those posts, and where had they been on the 15th? Since they'd traveled back, on that day, two versions of them should have existed simultaneously."
    new "……那些帖子是谁写的？15号那天，那个人又在哪里？既然对方回到了过去，那一天就该同时存在着两个他。"

    # game/script.rpy:46850
    old "My mind clouded as soon as I tried to think about it, so I knew it was a bad idea trying to get anywhere before eating."
    new "刚试着去想，脑子就乱成一团，所以我知道，吃饭前再怎么想也是白费。"

    # game/script.rpy:46853
    old "I poked the noodles with the chopsticks, but I had to wait a little more."
    new "我用筷子戳了戳面条，还得再等一会儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:46857
    old "Enough time had probably passed, so I brought some to my mouth."
    new "时间应该差不多了，我便夹起一些送进嘴里。"

    # game/script.rpy:46859
    old "...They were good, and not too hot either, so I continued."
    new "……味道不错，也不烫嘴，我便继续吃。"

    # game/script.rpy:46860
    old "The issue with those packets of ramen was that there wasn't much in them. It only took me about a minute to finish."
    new "这种袋装拉面的毛病就是分量太少，我大约一分钟就吃完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46862
    old "I tried not to wolf it down so fast, but it had at least been what I'd needed, because my mind started regaining some focus soon after beginning to eat."
    new "我尽量不狼吞虎咽，不过至少这碗面正是我需要的——刚吃没多久，脑子就清醒了一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:46867
    old "Maybe I could try to figure out who posted that thread."
    new "也许可以试着查清那个帖子是谁发的。"

    # game/script.rpy:46868
    old "When I got that idea, I put the noodles on hold and walked to my bedroom."
    new "冒出这个念头后，我暂且放下筷子，走回卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:46871
    old "My phone was still next to the pillow, so I grabbed it and flipped it open."
    new "手机还放在枕头边，我拿起来翻开。"

    # game/script.rpy:46872
    old "7md_ag's profile was still there. As I walked back to the living room, I pressed the \"return\" button."
    new "7md_ag 的个人资料页还在。我一边走回客厅，一边按下「返回」键。"

    # game/script.rpy:46876
    old "I left the phone on the table and continued eating. As soon as the page loaded, I navigated to the bottom of it."
    new "我把手机搁在桌上，继续吃面。页面一加载完，我就翻到最下方。"

    # game/script.rpy:46877
    old "Yeah, this picture... I could try to pinpoint where it was taken from."
    new "嗯，这张照片……也许可以查出拍摄的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:46878
    old "The angle was from a little high up, so it was likely taken through an apartment window.{w} In Yushibana, most apartments didn't have different floors, so it was likely that if I simply found the place it'd been taken from, I could also find out who lived there."
    new "拍摄角度略高，很可能是透过某间公寓的窗户拍的。{w}丰花的大多数公寓都只有一层，所以只要找到拍摄地点，或许就能查出住在那里的住户。"

    # game/script.rpy:46879
    old "Actually, no... I know this street. That's where there are a few slightly higher buildings, so they should have more than one floor. ...This is close to Atsuki's house."
    new "等等，不对……这条街我认识。那里有几栋稍高的楼，应该不止一层。……这里离 Atsuki 家很近。"

    # game/script.rpy:46880
    old "I ate the remaining noodles, scratching the bottom of the bowl so that none were left behind."
    new "我吃掉了剩下的面，还把碗底刮得干干净净，一根不剩。"

    # game/script.rpy:46883
    old "...Would knowing who this person is be useful? ...It might be."
    new "……查清这个人是谁，会有用吗？……也许会有。"

    # game/script.rpy:46884
    old "I'm not sure how much I can do. I really doubt I could stop the incident from happening myself, but I should try to learn as much as I can about it. ...What really happened on the 15th? There were a lot of strange things about the attack."
    new "我不确定自己能做多少。我实在不觉得自己能阻止那起事件发生，但至少该尽量多了解一些。……15号究竟发生了什么？那次袭击有太多蹊跷之处。"

    # game/script.rpy:46885
    old "There's also the chance the person who posted the thread is someone I know. Assuming I manage to travel back in time again, it's definitely possible that they'll still go all the way back as long as the incident occurs. It shouldn't even matter if Atsuki and I don't go.{w} I'll definitely have to go to the tower before the 15th. I guess the best I can hope for is that I'll be able to touch the Sekimeiya and go far enough back to save Miiya. Most likely, the biggest issue right now is not knowing how to make myself go so far back again."
    new "发帖人也可能是我认识的人。假设我还能再次穿越回过去，只要那起事件发生，对方完全有可能仍旧一路穿越回过去。即使我和 Atsuki 不去，应该也无所谓。{w}我无论如何都得在15号之前去一趟芦屋塔。我能指望的最好结果，大概就是碰触 Sekimeiya，并回到足够早的过去救下 Miiya。眼下最大的问题，恐怕是我不知道怎样才能让自己再次回到那么早的过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:46886
    old "But if I can pull that off, alongside saving Miiya, the ideal scenario would be to obtain the Sekimeiya myself. What if I go many days into the past, before the 27th? I could find the Sekimeiya on the mountain, which would save Miiya and prevent the incident from happening."
    new "但如果真能做到，最理想的情况，就是在救下 Miiya 的同时，由我拿到 Sekimeiya。要是我回到许多天前，回到27号之前呢？我可以在山上找到 Sekimeiya，这样既能救下 Miiya，也能阻止那起事件发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:46887
    old "...I suppose Ashiya would find a replacement for the Sekimeiya to bait Xyn, but that doesn't really matter as long as people don't get trapped with something that causes time travel. That could outright stop any deaths from happening just by itself."
    new "……我想芦屋会找一个 Sekimeiya 的替代品来引诱 Xyn；但只要不会有人和会引发时间穿越的东西一起被困住，那也无妨。单凭这一点，或许就能彻底避免死亡。"

    # game/script.rpy:46891
    old "I walked to the kitchen and left the bowl in the sink. I still felt hungry, so I took the chocolate cookies I'd bought out of the cabinet."
    new "我走到厨房，把碗放进水槽。肚子还饿，我便从柜子里拿出买来的巧克力饼干。"

    # game/script.rpy:46894
    old "If I find the person behind the thread, maybe I could speak to them. They could still have important information if they merely traveled from outside the tower. It's also possible other people will try to get in touch with them now that the Sekimeiya has been announced officially."
    new "如果能找到发帖人，也许我可以和对方谈谈。哪怕对方只是从塔外穿越回来的，也可能掌握重要信息。而且 Sekimeiya 已经正式公布，说不定还会有别人想联系对方。"

    # game/script.rpy:46895
    old "There were a number of reasons why discovering their identity would potentially be useful. If even one of them was correct, that was enough."
    new "查清对方身份可能有用，理由不止一个。只要其中一条站得住脚，就足够了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46896
    old "Should I go there and knock on the door, hoping it's the right one...?"
    new "我该不该直接过去敲门，指望没找错地方……？"

    # game/script.rpy:46897
    old "We gave our names to Suripo when we talked to him, so this person could potentially recognize mine. Would it be a good idea to say that I've experienced the same thing as them...?"
    new "我们和 Suripo 交谈时说过名字，对方也许能凭名字认出我。要不要直接说，我和对方有过同样的经历……？"

    # game/script.rpy:46898
    old "I lay back on the carpet, a bit indecisive."
    new "我躺回地毯上，一时拿不定主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:46903
    old "I also keep thinking that before the 15th, if I haven't been able to use the Sekimeiya, I'll prevent Atsuki and myself from going to the tower. How exactly do I plan to do that...?"
    new "我也一直在想，如果在15号之前还是用不上 Sekimeiya，我就得阻止自己和 Atsuki 去芦屋塔。可我究竟打算怎么阻止……？"

    # game/script.rpy:46904
    old "...There's no way writing an anonymous note would be enough."
    new "……光写一张匿名纸条，肯定不够。"

    # game/script.rpy:46905
    old "Oh, actually, it should be simple.{w} When I woke up in the hospital, it was the afternoon of the 8th, and Atsuki was there. So I know for a fact that he'll be out at that time."
    new "啊，其实应该很简单。{w}我在医院醒来时是8号下午，Atsuki 就在那里。所以我确定，那个时间他不在家。"

    # game/script.rpy:46906
    old "I could go to his house then and take the tickets we bought. The three of them should be in the purse Miiya used, and the pamphlet advised people to hurry before they ran out. There were so many people at the tower when the shutter closed that I bet they sold out, too. We didn't look at those tickets again until the 14th, so that'll definitely be too late to buy new ones."
    new "到时我可以去他家，把我们买的票拿走。三张票应该在 Miiya 用过的钱包里；宣传册也提醒过人们要趁票卖完前赶快买。卷帘门落下时，塔里人那么多，我敢说票早就卖光了。我们直到14号才又去看那些票，所以那时再想买新票，肯定已经太迟。"

    # game/script.rpy:46907
    old "I should be able to enter his house when he's out. I know where he keeps a hidden key close to his door just in case he ever forgets his inside. If it's not there anymore, I might be able to open the window of his bedroom as long as the shutter isn't down. He doesn't usually lock it."
    new "他不在家时，我应该进得去。我知道他在门附近藏了一把备用钥匙，以防哪天把钥匙忘在屋里。要是钥匙已经不在了，只要卷帘窗没放下，我也许能打开他卧室的窗户。他通常不锁窗。"

    # game/script.rpy:46912
    old "I spent a while lying down, but I began to feel really curious about the mysterious forum poster, wondering if there'd been an ulterior reason behind their text."
    new "我在地上躺了一阵，却对论坛上那个神秘发帖人越发好奇，忍不住去想对方写下那些话是否另有隐情。"

    # game/script.rpy:46916
    old "I put my phone in my purse and prepared to leave."
    new "我把手机放进手提包，准备出门。"

    # game/script.rpy:46917
    old "My boots and coat were where I'd just left them, so I put them on and stepped out, then headed down the stairs."
    new "靴子和外套还搁在我刚才放下的地方。我穿上它们出了门，走下楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:46922
    old "I knew approximately where to go. Once I was at the street where the picture had been taken, I expected to be able to look at it and determine the exact building I was searching for."
    new "大致该往哪儿走，我心里有数。只要到了拍照的那条街，我想我就能对照照片，找出自己要找的那栋楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:46923
    old "I could take different paths to make it to the opposite side of the town, but I simply walked as if I was going to Atsuki's house."
    new "要去镇子的另一头，本可以绕别的路，我却只是照着去 Atsuki 家的方向走。"

    # game/script.rpy:46927
    old "His house and Ashiya Tower were both in the distance, but they were also on opposite sides. The tower was right in front of the mountains, whereas Atsuki's house was near the road to leave Yushibana."
    new "他家与芦屋塔都在远处，方向却正好相反。塔就立在山前，Atsuki 家则靠近离开丰花的那条路。"

    # game/script.rpy:46931
    old "As always, the center of the town felt much more lively. At a crosswalk hidden by the snow, a car waited for people to cross. That time, instead of going with them to Ramon street, I went directly to Enric avenue."
    new "镇中心一如既往，比别处热闹得多。一处被积雪盖住的斑马线前，一辆车停下来等行人通过。这次我没有跟着人群去拉蒙街，而是直接去了恩里克大道。"

    # game/script.rpy:46934
    old "I chose not to walk past Atsuki's house and kept moving ahead. If I wasn't mistaken, the street I was going to was called Ampla, and it was parallel to Enric."
    new "我选择不经过 Atsuki 家门前，径直往前走。如果没记错，我要去的那条街叫安普拉街，与恩里克大道平行。"

    # game/script.rpy:46938
    old "Wait a second."
    new "等等。"

    # game/script.rpy:46939
    old "Thinking about the movements I'd made the previous day, an important connection arose in my mind."
    new "回想前一天的行程，一个重要的关联忽然浮上心头。"

    # game/script.rpy:46943
    old "The forum thread had been posted on November 24th. I'd read about that date in the newspaper."
    new "论坛上的帖子发布于 11 月 24 日。而那个日期，我在报纸上读到过。"

    # game/script.rpy:46944
    old "Also in the afternoon of November 24th, a camera had recorded a prisoner escaping from a cell. No one had any idea how they'd even gotten in there."
    new "同样在 11 月 24 日下午，监控拍到一名囚犯从牢房里逃了出去。可谁也不知道那人究竟是怎么进去的。"

    # game/script.rpy:46945
    old "...Was I actually right? Was it the Sekimeiya's teleportation?"
    new "……我真的猜对了？那是 Sekimeiya 的传送？"

    # game/script.rpy:46946
    old "If the person who posted the forum thread was outside the tower on the 15th, like I thought, someone touched the Sekimeiya from inside. So both of them appeared at the very same time on November 24th."
    new "如果发帖的人真如我所想，15 日那天在塔外，那么塔内便有人触碰了 Sekimeiya。于是这两个人在 11 月 24 日同时现身。"

    # game/script.rpy:46947
    old "It fit perfectly. Someone else who'd been caught up in that travel had appeared inside a vacant prison cell."
    new "一切正好对得上。另一个被卷入那次穿越的人，出现在了一间空牢房里。"

    # game/script.rpy:46948
    old "...Was it the person who touched the Sekimeiya or someone else who was waiting outside?"
    new "……是碰到 Sekimeiya 的那个人，还是当时在外面等候的另一个人？"

    # game/script.rpy:46949
    old "The article said they were dressed as a prisoner. This must mean that the position they appeared in was based on a time they were jailed, right? ...Had one of us in the tower been in prison in the past?"
    new "报道说那人一身囚犯打扮。也就是说，他现身的位置取决于他被关进牢里的那个时间，对吧？……难道当时在塔里的人中，有谁过去坐过牢？"

    # game/script.rpy:46952
    old "I attempted to visualize the picture next to the article."
    new "我试着在脑中回想报道旁的那张照片。"

    # game/script.rpy:46953
    old "It had been taken from the ceiling, so measuring the person's height with it was very hard. Since it had been in black and white, I couldn't discern the color of their hair either, so all I knew was that they were a man with short and dark hair."
    new "照片是从天花板俯拍的，很难据此判断那人的身高。又因为是黑白照，连发色也看不出来——我只知道他是个留着深色短发的男人。"

    # game/script.rpy:46954
    old "It's not possible it was a police officer waiting outside. If that was the case, they wouldn't have appeared dressed up as a prisoner. Just going off that fact, it's incredibly likely it was one of us who were inside the building."
    new "等在外面的那个人不可能是警察。真要是警察，出现时也不会是一身囚犯打扮。光凭这一点，那人极可能就是当时在楼里的某个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:46955
    old "So... someone else who got trapped and knows about the Sekimeiya's powers is here, in the past with me. This is what I was afraid of."
    new "这么说……还有一个和我一样被困住、也知道 Sekimeiya 力量的人，跟我一起待在这个过去。我最怕的就是这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:46956
    old "I bit my lip and tried to keep walking.{w} I'd already thought of the negative implications of that, but I had to start seriously worrying about them."
    new "我咬住嘴唇，继续往前走。{w}那些糟糕的可能我早就想到过，只是如今不得不认真对待了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46957
    old "If they'd been in prison before, their reason to be in the tower had to be stealing the Sekimeiya. Everyone there with me understood at least the basics of what it could do, so now that person must be entirely aware of the fact that they're in the past..."
    new "如果那个人过去坐过牢，那他进塔的目的只可能是偷 Sekimeiya。当时和我一起在塔里的人，多少都了解它的基本能力，那么那个人现在一定清楚自己身处过去……"

    # game/script.rpy:46958
    old "...They have the ability to change the past and know about Ashiya's alarm. At any point, I could hear the news that the Sekimeiya has been stolen before the 15th."
    new "……他有改变过去的能力，也知道芦屋的警报。随时都可能传来消息，说 Sekimeiya 在 15 日之前就被偷走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46961
    old "I tried to calm myself down, but it wasn't easy. If Xyn, or anyone, stole the Sekimeiya, the incident on the 15th wouldn't happen. The deaths of that day would be erased, but an alternate outcome like that came with its own problems."
    new "我试着让自己冷静下来，却没那么容易。如果 Xyn 或别的什么人偷走了 Sekimeiya，15 日的事件就不会发生。那天丧命的人会被抹去，可这样的另一种结局也有它自己的麻烦。"

    # game/script.rpy:46962
    old "I wouldn't be able to save Miiya, and I would remain in a world with two versions of myself. The only way to make the latter work would become impossible as well, as I wouldn't be able to go back in time with any winning lottery number."
    new "我就救不了 Miiya，而且会一直留在一个有两个自己的世界里。而唯一能让两个我并存的办法，也会落空——我没办法带着中奖号码回到过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:46963
    old "Does this pretty much mean that I have to go to the tower as soon as possible, find the Sekimeiya, and somehow activate it to go days back?{w} That could easily go wrong in so many ways...!{w} What if I stay in front of the tower permanently to see what Xyn do with the Sekimeiya once they steal it?{w} This could also very easily end up being a mistake, and there's no way I could do it."
    new "这基本上就是说，我得尽快赶到塔里，找到 Sekimeiya，然后想办法启动它，回到几天前？{w}这中间随便哪个环节都可能出岔子……！{w}又或者，我干脆一直守在塔前，看 Xyn 偷走 Sekimeiya 之后会拿它做什么？{w}这同样极可能是个错误的决定，而且我根本做不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:46964
    old "...Is it likely that whoever traveled to the 24th thinks the past can't be changed? If so, they'll be afraid to attempt to steal it before the 15th, and they'll try to do it on that day with the information they have, just like I was thinking of doing."
    new "……那个穿越到 24 日的人，有没有可能也认为过去无法改变？若真如此，他就不敢在 15 日之前动手去偷，而是会带着手上的情报，在那一天动手——和我原本的打算一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:46965
    old "I guess I can hope that's the case."
    new "但愿如此吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:46968
    old "I'd left my apartment to figure out who 7md_ag was, so I did my best to let go of those worries for the moment and reach my target street."
    new "我出门本是为了查清 7md_ag 是谁，于是暂时放下那些忧虑，朝目标街道走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:46975
    old "...Well, it should be this one."
    new "……嗯，应该就是这条了。"

    # game/script.rpy:46976
    old "I took my phone out and looked at its screen.{w} Then, I peered into the distance, toward the tower."
    new "我掏出手机看了看屏幕。{w}随后抬眼望向远处的塔。"

    # game/script.rpy:46977
    old "Yeah, it has to be this street."
    new "没错，一定是这条街。"

    # game/script.rpy:46978
    old "The structures around me were slightly taller than in most of Yushibana, and the number of windows showed that they had several floors."
    new "周围的建筑比丰花多数地方都要高些，从窗户的数量看得出都有好几层。"

    # game/script.rpy:46979
    old "I kept walking to get closer to where I thought the picture had been taken from."
    new "我继续往前走，靠近我推测的拍摄地点。"

    # game/script.rpy:46981
    old "Hm...{w} Around here?"
    new "嗯……{w}就在这附近？"

    # game/script.rpy:46982
    old "I looked at the building behind me. The picture could've been taken from any of those windows."
    new "我回头打量身后那栋楼。照片可能是从其中任何一扇窗户拍下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:46985
    old "Oh... Is it actually this building?"
    new "哦……难道就是这栋楼？"

    # game/script.rpy:46986
    old "There was something that made it stand out. Next to the door, there was a sign with three words on it."
    new "有样东西让它格外显眼。门旁挂着一块牌子，上面写着三个词。"

    # game/script.rpy:46988
    old "\"Apartment for sale\"."
    new "「公寓出售」。"

    # game/script.rpy:46989
    old "I guess that doesn't have to mean anything."
    new "不过，这未必说明什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:46990
    old "But I frowned a little. While I didn't know which apartment was the one for sale, light could be seen on the other side of the four windows above the door."
    new "我却微微皱起眉。虽然不知道出售的是哪一间，但门上方那四扇窗户后面，都透着灯光。"

    # game/script.rpy:46991
    old "The entrance was locked, and I couldn't see anyone nearby. Next to the door, below the sign, was a panel with four numbers and four buttons to press."
    new "入口上了锁，附近也看不到人影。门旁牌子下方有一块面板，上面标着四个房号，配着四个按钮。"

    # game/script.rpy:46992
    old "Should I try to ring the bell...? It could be any of the four.{w} If the person from the forum is someone I know, maybe I could recognize their voice."
    new "要不要按门铃试试……？四户里哪一户都有可能。{w}如果论坛上那个人是我认识的，说不定能听出声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:46997
    old "I felt pretty hesitant, wondering what to say after ringing."
    new "我有些犹豫，不知道按了门铃后该说什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:46998
    old "Do I ask for a name and just say that I made a mistake if I don't recognize them? ...What if they live with someone else who answers instead?"
    new "先问对方姓名，听不出来就说自己弄错了？……可要是同住的人接了，又该怎么办？"

    # game/script.rpy:46999
    old "I looked at the sign again."
    new "我又看了一眼那块牌子。"

    # game/script.rpy:47000
    old "...There's a phone number. Maybe I should call it instead."
    new "……上面有个电话号码。也许我该打电话过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47001
    old "Would I be told information about the previous resident...? Could it be that the person I'm looking for decided to move out immediately, afraid of what they thought was a grave mental issue?"
    new "对方会告诉我前任住户的信息吗……？会不会我要找的人以为自己精神出了严重问题，吓得立刻搬走了？"

    # game/script.rpy:47002
    old "Given the way their posts had been written, that wasn't unthinkable. Maybe they'd just decided to move somewhere else, and that was why someone still seemed to be living behind every window at that moment."
    new "从他们那些帖子的措辞来看，这倒也不是不可能。也许他们只是决定搬到别处去了，所以此刻每扇窗后才会让人觉得还有人住着。"

    # game/script.rpy:47005
    old "Still holding the phone, I pressed the call button and dialed the numbers on the wall.{w} 1989-1815-251...{w=0.6} I started to hear the high-pitched beeps."
    new "我仍拿着手机，按下通话键，拨出墙上写的那串号码。{w} 1989-1815-251……{w=0.6} 听筒里响起尖锐的提示音。"

    # game/script.rpy:47007
    old "A little half-hearted, I waited with the phone on my ear."
    new "我有些提不起劲，把手机贴在耳边等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:47010
    old "Oh, hey.{w} ...I'm calling for an apartment I see for sale at Ampla."
    new "哦，你好。{w}……我是想问问在 Ampla 看到的那套出售的房子。"

    # game/script.rpy:47011
    old "Ah, great! You're the first person to be interested, but the interior there is well-maintained, and it's in a very good area. Are you from here?"
    new "啊，太好了！你是第一个来问的人。房子里面保养得很好，地段也相当不错。你是本地人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47013
    old "That's great.{w} ...Are you perhaps at the address right now?"
    new "那太好了。{w}……你现在是不是就在房子那儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:47014
    old "Yes. I'm looking at it."
    new "对，我正看着呢。"

    # game/script.rpy:47015
    old "I can see you from my window. Wait a second, I'll come out."
    new "我从窗户就能看见你。稍等一下，我这就出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:47016
    old "O-Oh, all right."
    new "哦、哦，好的。"

    # game/script.rpy:47020
    old "He hung up, so I stood still nervously, failing to see anyone behind a window."
    new "他挂了电话，我只好紧张地站在原地，可怎么也看不出哪扇窗后有人影。"

    # game/script.rpy:47024
    old "I didn't have to wait long for a door farther back to open.{w} A middle-aged man came out and shuffled up to me."
    new "没过多久，靠里的一扇门开了。{w}一个中年男人走出来，拖着步子来到我面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:47027
    old "Hello! What's your name?"
    new "你好！请问怎么称呼？"

    # game/script.rpy:47029
    old "I see. Glad to meet you. I'm Cecal Fray."
    new "明白了，幸会。我叫 Cecal Fray。"

    # game/script.rpy:47030
    old "He bowed enthusiastically and turned to the sign."
    new "他热情地鞠了一躬，然后转身走向那块牌子。"

    # game/script.rpy:47033
    old "It hasn't been up for sale very long, but I'm sure it'll be purchased quickly. Would you like to see the inside? Since you're here, I'm assuming you've not seen the pictures on the website."
    new "房子挂牌出售还没多久，但我相信很快就会有人买下。你想进去看看吗？既然你都到这儿了，我猜你还没看过网站上的照片吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:47034
    old "I haven't, and yeah, I'd like to. Isn't someone currently inside, though? There's light coming from all the windows."
    new "确实没看过，好，我想看看。不过现在里面不是还住着人吗？每扇窗户都透着灯光。"

    # game/script.rpy:47037
    old "Ah! Yes, you're perceptive. The previous resident is currently preparing to move out. We agreed he could receive visits while he's still here. Don't worry, it'll be vacant quite soon."
    new "啊！你观察得真仔细。之前的住户正在准备搬走。我们说好了，他还住在这里的时候可以接待看房的人。请放心，很快就会空出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:47039
    old "I didn't know what to say, but I couldn't back off."
    new "我不知道该说什么，但也不能就这样退缩。"

    # game/script.rpy:47040
    old "...I'm sorry to ask this, but why is he leaving? Did he have an issue with the apartment?"
    new "……不好意思问一句，他为什么要搬走？是这房子有什么问题吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47041
    old "Oh, not at all. Evidently, he wanted to go live with his parents. I've spoken to him personally. He's well-mannered and intelligent, no problems on my end, but it seems he's not well, so he couldn't keep living by himself."
    new "哦，完全没有。听说他想搬去和父母一起住。我亲自跟他谈过，他很有礼貌，人也聪明，我这边没发现任何问题；只是他状态似乎不太好，没法继续独自生活了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47042
    old "...It is him."
    new "……是他。"

    # game/script.rpy:47043
    old "I looked up, but I still couldn't see anyone through the glass."
    new "我抬头望去，可隔着玻璃依旧看不见任何人影。"

    # game/script.rpy:47046
    old "...He's not well? I'm sorry for asking. ...Is he gonna be okay?"
    new "……他状态不好？抱歉多问了。……他会没事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:47047
    old "Yes, you shouldn't worry. I'm not sure exactly what the issue is, but he was very recently at his parents' house, preparing to move. He seemed fine to me when we spoke briefly. I didn't want to pry, though."
    new "会的，你不必担心。具体是什么情况我也不太清楚，不过他前不久还去了父母家，为搬家做准备。我们简短交谈时，他看起来一切正常。只是我也不好多问。"

    # game/script.rpy:47048
    old "Ah, I'm glad."
    new "啊，那就好。"

    # game/script.rpy:47049
    old "He had two keys on his palm and used one to unlock the entrance.{w} I saw a gray hall with stairs leading up."
    new "他掌心里握着两把钥匙，用其中一把打开了大门。{w}我看见一个灰色的门厅，里面有通往楼上的楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:47053
    old "I think he implied he had some kind of mental disorder, but I'm not really well-informed. He called me in late November saying that someone had broken into his house."
    new "他话里的意思，好像是自己有某种精神方面的疾病，不过我也不太了解详情。十一月下旬他打电话给我，说有人闯进了他家。"

    # game/script.rpy:47055
    old "...Wait, really? Did they take anything?"
    new "……等等，真的？有丢东西吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47056
    old "No, that's what I'm saying. Soon after, he called again, assuring me that he'd imagined it and not to worry, but that he'd still move out."
    new "没有，我说的就是这个。没过多久他又打来，说那是他自己想多了，让我别担心，但他还是要搬走。"

    # game/script.rpy:47059
    old "I followed him up the stairs with a pensive frown."
    new "我皱着眉，若有所思地跟着他上楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:47064
    old "He stopped in front of the first door, which had an \"A\" above it.{w} Instead of unlocking it himself, he rang the bell."
    new "他在第一扇门前停下，门上标着「A」。{w}他没有自己开锁，而是按响了门铃。"

    # game/script.rpy:47068
    old "I started to feel nervous. Would the person about to open the door recognize me? ...Would I recognize him?"
    new "我开始紧张起来。即将开门的那个人会认出我吗？……我又会认出他吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47069
    old "I heard footsteps approaching, and the door jittered. In one motion, I saw the face of the person I'd been searching for."
    new "脚步声由远及近，门轻轻晃了一下。就在那一瞬间，我看清了那张我一直在找的脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:47080
    old "...No, I don't think I know him."
    new "……不，我应该不认识他。"

    # game/script.rpy:47085
    old "Ah, good morning.{w} ...Well, I guess it's close to noon already.{w} Are you coming to see my apartment?"
    new "啊，早上好。{w}……不过看样子都快中午了。{w}你是来看房的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47087
    old "Come in, then. It's a very nice place. I've really enjoyed living here."
    new "那就请进吧。这地方很不错，我一直住得很舒心。"

    # game/script.rpy:47088
    old "I didn't take my eyes off his face, but all I could conclude was that I'd never seen him before. He wore a sympathetic smile, and his voice sounded kind."
    new "我一直盯着他的脸，却只能得出一个结论：我从没见过他。他脸上挂着温和的笑，声音也很亲切。"

    # game/script.rpy:47095
    old "I stepped in timidly, unaware of where to set my eyes. Following the agent, or landlord, whoever he was, I entered the living room."
    new "我怯生生地走进去，不知该把目光放在哪里。跟着那个中介——也可能是房东，管他是谁——我进了客厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:47098
    old "The furniture won't be taken away. You'll notice the heating is working just fine, but sunlight makes it inside all day too.{w} You might've noticed that there's no elevator below, but fortunately, you only have to go up a single set of stairs."
    new "家具不会搬走。你也看到了，暖气运行良好，而且一整天都有阳光照进来。{w}你可能已经注意到楼下没有电梯，不过好在只需要爬一层楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:47099
    old "...Yeah. I like it."
    new "……嗯，我喜欢。"

    # game/script.rpy:47100
    old "I wasn't necessarily lying. Everything looked clean and neatly arranged."
    new "这话倒也不算违心。屋里的一切都干净整洁，摆放得井井有条。"

    # game/script.rpy:47101
    old "Great! ...You'll see how spacious the rooms are. There are two of them."
    new "太好了！……你来看看房间有多宽敞。一共有两间。"

    # game/script.rpy:47104
    old "I kept following behind, still thinking about what he'd said in the staircase."
    new "我跟在后面，心里还想着他在楼梯间说过的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:47107
    old "He called saying that someone had broken in, but later retracted that."
    new "他打电话说有人闯进他家，后来又把这话收回了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47112
    old "I looked back at the man, who was just tagging along in silence."
    new "我回头看向那个男人，他一言不发地跟在后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:47113
    old "...He must know what will happen."
    new "……他一定知道会发生什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:47114
    old "Someone broke into this place a few days ago... He appeared at his parents' house on the 24th, and later on, he replied again from this apartment, when he took that picture."
    new "几天前，有人闯进了这里……他在24号出现在父母家，后来又从这间公寓回了消息——那张照片就是那时拍的。"

    # game/script.rpy:47118
    old "Did he break into his own house...? If he appeared at his parents' without the keys, that could have happened. Maybe he did have them and his original self noticed someone had entered."
    new "难道是他闯进了自己家……？如果他没带钥匙就出现在父母家，那倒说得通。又或者他其实带着钥匙，是原来的自己发现有人进来过。"

    # game/script.rpy:47119
    old "...There are more possible explanations. What if it was the version from the future who noticed his original self when he made it back home and thought he was a thief? ...Then, he figured out what had happened and called to say he'd just imagined it."
    new "……还有其他可能的解释。如果是来自未来的那个他回到家，撞见了原来的自己，还把他当成了小偷呢？……后来他弄清了原委，才打电话说自己看错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47122
    old "Do you like it?"
    new "你觉得如何？"

    # game/script.rpy:47123
    old "He opened the door to a bedroom."
    new "他推开一扇卧室的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:47124
    old "...Yeah. That's a big bed."
    new "……嗯。床很大。"

    # game/script.rpy:47125
    old "As I said, everything you see is a fixture. It's part of the package."
    new "就像我说的，你看到的家具都是固定的，属于配套的一部分。"

    # game/script.rpy:47126
    old "That's good."
    new "那挺好。"

    # game/script.rpy:47128
    old "So, if I'm right at all, two versions of him must currently exist. ...Is the one right here the one who traveled from the future? Is it possible they've seen each other? Surely that would be changing the past."
    new "那么，如果我猜得没错，现在一定同时存在两个他。……眼前这个是从未来来的那个吗？他们有没有可能见过面？那肯定就是在改变过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47132
    old "...Here's the other room. It's a little smaller, but it can also work as a bedroom if anyone stays over."
    new "……这边是另一个房间。稍微小一点，不过要是有人留宿，也能当卧室用。"

    # game/script.rpy:47134
    old "The room was pretty messy, and it stored different kinds of objects and old devices.{w} My attention was quickly directed to a framed picture."
    new "房间里相当杂乱，堆着各式各样的物件和旧设备。{w}我的目光很快被一个相框吸引过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47135
    old "I leaned forward to take a better look at it. I could see the man who lived in the apartment in front of someone a little older than him."
    new "我凑近了些，想看得更清楚。照片里，住在这间公寓的男人站在一个比他稍年长的人身旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:47136
    old "...A police uniform."
    new "……警服。"

    # game/script.rpy:47137
    old "They were both dressed as police officers, and the background was a simple white wall."
    new "两人都穿着警服，背景只是一面白墙。"

    # game/script.rpy:47141
    old "You have the bathroom right here."
    new "浴室在这边。"

    # game/script.rpy:47143
    old "I looked through the door and saw a bathroom similar to mine. The structure of the apartment was similar to my own, but everything felt more taken care of, and the rooms were slightly larger."
    new "我朝门里望去，看见一间和我那里相似的浴室。这间公寓的格局与我那间相仿，但处处更显用心，房间也稍大一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:47146
    old "When we'd seen all of them, we ended up at the front door."
    new "看完全部房间，我们回到了玄关。"

    # game/script.rpy:47147
    old "I know we haven't spoken about price—I can be a bit flexible. Right now, the set price is ¥42,000 a month, but you'll need to make an initial deposit of ¥126,000.{w} How does that sound?"
    new "我知道我们还没谈过价钱——这方面我可以稍微通融。目前的定价是每月 ¥42,000，不过首次需要缴纳 ¥126,000 的押金。{w}你觉得怎么样？"

    # game/script.rpy:47148
    old "If only. ...Maybe after I win the lottery."
    new "哪有这个闲钱。……大概得等我中了彩票才行。"

    # game/script.rpy:47152
    old "Hm... I certainly liked this place. It's a big decision, though...{w} I'll have to think about it."
    new "嗯……我确实挺喜欢这里。不过这是个大决定……{w}我得再考虑考虑。"

    # game/script.rpy:47153
    old "...Of course. Keep in mind more people are likely to be interested."
    new "……当然。不过还请留意，对这房子感兴趣的人恐怕不少。"

    # game/script.rpy:47154
    old "I know. I'll try to make up my mind quickly and call you. I've got your number saved now."
    new "我知道。我会尽快做决定，然后给你打电话。你的号码我已经存好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47155
    old "All right. I'll await your call, Shiroya. It was a pleasure."
    new "好的。那我就等你的电话了，Shiroya。今天很荣幸。"

    # game/script.rpy:47156
    old "...Likewise."
    new "……我也是。"

    # game/script.rpy:47161
    old "I was about to bow, but the wide eyes of the man holding the door froze me before I could."
    new "我正要鞠躬，可扶着门的男人睁大了双眼，让我一下子僵在原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:47170
    old "Also frozen, the man's eyes pierced mine until I forcibly ripped my gaze away and completed the bow."
    new "那男人也同样僵着，目光直直地刺向我。我硬生生移开视线，才把躬鞠完。"

    # game/script.rpy:47171
    old "...Did he react to my name?"
    new "……他是对我的名字起了反应吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47180
    old "G-Goodbye."
    new "再、再见。"

    # game/script.rpy:47181
    old "Goodbye. I hope to see you again."
    new "再见。希望能再见到你。"

    # game/script.rpy:47182
    old "The other man wasn't saying anything, so I slowly stepped away, unsure whether that look had been a reaction to my name or if he'd had it from the beginning. It seemed both of them would stay there, so I left by myself."
    new "另一个男人始终没有开口，我便慢慢退开。那眼神究竟是因我的名字而起，还是从一开始就是那样，我无从判断。看样子两人都会留在原处，我便独自离开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47187
    old "As soon as I turned around, I was met with the same sensation.{w} The door to the outside closed, and I saw a man walking up the stairs. The look he gave muddled my mind, instantly making me doubt everything I'd just determined."
    new "刚一转身，同样的感觉又袭了上来。{w}通往外面的门关上，我看见一个男人正走上楼梯。他投来的目光搅乱了我的心绪，让我瞬间怀疑起刚才得出的所有结论。"

    # game/script.rpy:47189
    old "It was the very same look as the other man's, down to the piercing pause.{w} When time continued, he stepped up and unlocked the opposite door, quietly shutting it behind him without saying a word."
    new "那眼神和另一个男人如出一辙，连那令人窒息的停顿都分毫不差。{w}时间重新流动，他走上楼梯，打开对面那扇门的锁，一言不发地轻轻带上。"

    # game/script.rpy:47192
    old "...What the hell? What was that?"
    new "……搞什么？那到底是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:47193
    old "He'd been skinny and a little older, but I hadn't recognized him either, so I simply stood still, wondering which of those two stares had been given by 7md_ag."
    new "他身形瘦削，年纪稍长，可我也认不出他是谁，只能干站着，心里琢磨那两道目光里究竟哪一道来自 7md_ag。"

    # game/script.rpy:47195
    old "...Was it just that he was surprised to see someone he'd never seen in this building?"
    new "……难道只是因为他在这栋楼里见到一个从未见过的人，才会感到意外？"

    # game/script.rpy:47196
    old "Had I only overreacted internally? It had seemed bizarre to me, but maybe I'd just misinterpreted the second look due to seeing it immediately after the first."
    new "难道只是我自己在心里反应过度？我觉得那眼神很古怪，但也许只是因为刚看过第一道目光，才误读了第二道。"

    # game/script.rpy:47199
    old "...I went down the stairs and opened the door in a haze of confusion."
    new "……我混混沌沌地下了楼，推开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:47205
    old "Outside, I merely stood still, trying to sort out my thoughts."
    new "到了外面，我只是站着不动，试图理清思绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:47206
    old "The first man must be the forum poster. What I was told about him fits perfectly."
    new "第一个男人一定就是论坛上发帖的那个人。我听到的关于他的描述完全吻合。"

    # game/script.rpy:47209
    old "I walked away, intending to take the second stare out of my mind and telling myself that I'd really overreacted to it."
    new "我迈步离开，想把第二道目光从脑中抹去，并告诉自己确实是反应过度了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47210
    old "...I guess it doesn't really matter. It was one of them for sure, and I didn't recognize either of them."
    new "……算了，这大概无关紧要。那人肯定是他们两个之一，而我谁都没认出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:47211
    old "It's much more likely it was the first guy because of that framed picture. He was one of the police officers outside the tower, so I was right. He was suddenly picked up by a travel that was activated within the building."
    new "从那张装在相框里的照片来看，多半是第一个男人。他就是塔外那些警察中的一个，所以我没猜错。他是被楼内启动的一次穿越突然带走的。"

    # game/script.rpy:47212
    old "...But he is a policeman. Is he not going to try to prevent the attack from happening somehow? If he made that call saying there was no actual burglar, he must understand enough of what happened to him. He has to know he's in the past."
    new "……可他毕竟是警察。难道他不打算设法阻止那场袭击吗？既然他打电话说并没有真正的入侵者，那他对发生在自己身上的事，应该已经明白得够多了。他一定知道自己身处过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47216
    old "Lost in thought, I arrived at Ramon.{w} In contrast to the early morning, the street was fairly busy, partially thanks to the good weather. I recognized a group of kids years younger than me, so I avoided even looking at them."
    new "我一路沉思，不觉已到了拉蒙街。{w}与清晨不同，这条街相当热闹，多半是天气晴好的缘故。我认出几个比我小上好几岁的孩子，索性连看都不往那边看。"

    # game/script.rpy:47217
    old "And like I thought, two versions of him must currently exist. I can't be sure I just talked to the one aware of the incident."
    new "而且正如我所料，此刻世上必定存在两个他。我刚说过话的那一位，未必就是知道那起事件的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:47218
    old "But the stare stuck in my mind strongly implied he was."
    new "但那个留在我记忆里的眼神，分明在说：他就是。"

    # game/script.rpy:47219
    old "I wondered whether to go home. I'd accomplished my goal, even though I couldn't draw much from it. I hadn't recognized the person known as 7md_ag, but I felt confident that the solution to the forum thread was a police officer who'd traveled through time."
    new "我犹豫着要不要回家。目的算是达成了，收获却寥寥无几。我并没有认出那个叫 7md_ag 的人，但我确信，论坛那帖的答案就是一名穿越了时间的警察。"

    # game/script.rpy:47220
    old "Maybe I should've tried to talk to him. ...But I doubt he would tell me anything new, and I'd very much rather not say what I'm doing here."
    new "或许我该试着跟他搭话……不过他恐怕也说不出什么新东西，而我实在不愿解释自己为何会在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:47221
    old "With that out of the way, I was forced to go back to my previous thoughts. What could I do about the person who'd probably traveled with him to the prison cell?"
    new "这件事暂且了结，我又不得不回到先前的思虑上。那个很可能与他一同穿越到牢房的人，我究竟该如何应对？"

    # game/script.rpy:47226
    old "I wandered around slowly, hoping something would come to mind.{w} ...Knowing that the future I was envisioning could have been destroyed at any moment caused a hollow anxiety to form in my chest. It was the same one I'd felt after Miiya died."
    new "我缓缓地四处闲逛，盼着能想到些什么。{w}……一想到自己所设想的未来随时可能被摧毁，胸口便涌起一阵空洞的不安。那感觉，和 Miiya 死后我曾有过的一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:47227
    old "At least I was pretty sure that I was in the best place to sort it all out. Not inside an oppressive, enclosed building, but free in Yushibana."
    new "至少我相当确定，这里才是理清一切的最佳地点。不是在那座压抑封闭的楼里，而是在自由自在的丰花。"

    # game/script.rpy:47228
    old "When I thought about it more, it was almost worse, in a way. Miiya had died instantly, and I'd been forced to confront that reality instantly. Similarly, in Ashiya Tower, the attack had been instant and all the consequences of it had been fairly quick to follow."
    new "再细想下去，换个角度看，这反而更糟。Miiya 死得猝然，我也被迫当场面对那一切。芦屋塔里的袭击同样发生在一瞬之间，其后果也紧随其后，来得极快。"

    # game/script.rpy:47229
    old "But what I was doing then, walking around town and slowly gathering information... was not the same. If I didn't save Miiya through my actions, all I was really doing was letting things slowly play out, gradually getting worse."
    new "可我现在做的——在镇上四处走动、慢慢搜集情报——却全然不同。若不能靠自己的行动救下 Miiya，我实际做的只是任事情缓缓演变，一点点地坏下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47231
    old "Distracting myself from that was the best I could do in the meantime, while I decided whether taking action was really the wisest thing to do. I buried that creeping dread as deep as I could and returned to thinking about the man in the apartment."
    new "在我权衡究竟是否该出手之前，能做的也只有借此分神。我把那份悄然蔓延的恐惧尽量深埋，转而又去想公寓里的那个男人。"

    # game/script.rpy:47234
    old "The thread had said that he'd appeared at his parents' house on the 24th. I found myself going back to that."
    new "帖子里说，他是在24号出现在父母家的。我的思绪又绕回了这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:47235
    old "And his parents said that he shouldn't have been there. That contradicts what I thought yesterday regarding my own travel."
    new "而他父母说，他本不该出现在那里。这与我昨天对自己那次穿越的推测相矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:47236
    old "I thought that on the 30th, I appeared underground at {time=21:10} where I'd been only minutes prior. Plenty of travels that happened in the tower can fit that idea, but there were already some that didn't, and neither does this one."
    new "我原以为，30号那天我在{time=21:10}出现在地下，而那正是我几分钟前待过的地方。塔里发生的许多次穿越都能套用这个说法，但已经有些对不上，这一例同样不符。"

    # game/script.rpy:47237
    old "If his parents said that he shouldn't have been there on the 24th, it can't be that it was a coordinate mere minutes away from the point he appeared.{w} But of course, his parents' house isn't a random position. It definitely had to have been based on one from his past."
    new "既然他父母说他24号本不该在那里，那就不可能是他出现前几分钟所在位置的那个坐标。{w}不过话说回来，他父母家也并非随意选定的位置。那必定取自他过去的某个地点。"

    # game/script.rpy:47239
    old "Admittedly, thinking about that was frustrating. I'd gone over similar thoughts so many times, but it didn't seem like reaching a conclusion was feasible, and especially not when I couldn't know if the Sekimeiya was consistent."
    new "平心而论，想这些只会令人烦躁。类似的念头我已反复琢磨过许多遍，却似乎根本得不出结论，何况我连 Sekimeiya 是否自洽都无从知晓。"

    # game/script.rpy:47244
    old "Orbit Crash"
    new "轨道崩毁"

    # game/script.rpy:47248
    old "I stopped myself in the middle of the street."
    new "我在街心停下了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:47251
    old "Ahead of me, I saw something I recognized.{w} The very same stare I'd just been given."
    new "前方，我看见了似曾相识的一幕。{w}正是方才落在我身上的那种眼神。"

    # game/script.rpy:47252
    old "...Someone else who I didn't recognize had suddenly looked at me like that, but when I noticed it, they were looking somewhere else."
    new "……又一个素不相识的人忽然那样看向我，可等我察觉时，对方已把目光移向别处。"

    # game/script.rpy:47253
    old "...Am I just imagining it? Am I just paranoid after the first time?"
    new "……是我多心了吗？还是刚才那一次让我神经过敏了？"

    # game/script.rpy:47259
    old "I spun around me, and after a full circle, my heart hammered once.{w} All around, I'd seen people fixing their eyes on me."
    new "我原地转了一圈，整整一圈之后，心脏猛地一跳。{w}四周的人，全都直勾勾地盯着我。"

    # game/script.rpy:47262
    old "I spun once again, more slowly."
    new "我又转了一圈，这一次慢了许多。"

    # game/script.rpy:47265
    old "Afterward, I closed my eyes. I hadn't seen a single person looking at me the second time."
    new "随后我闭上眼。第二次转身时，我没有看见任何人在看我。"

    # game/script.rpy:47266
    old "I have to be making it up."
    new "一定是我自己瞎想的。"

    # game/script.rpy:47270
    old "The thin white trees came back to me, but I was slightly dizzy. I surveyed my surroundings again, and everyone was only looking straight ahead as they walked across the ground."
    new "细白的树影又浮现在眼前，我却有些眩晕。我重新环视四周，行人都只是目视前方，走在路上。"

    # game/script.rpy:47273
    old "It couldn't be that they know I should be in the hospital, right?"
    new "总不会是他们知道我本该待在医院里吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:47274
    old "That thought made me feel a little uncomfortable, so I stepped away."
    new "这念头让我有些不安，我便迈步走开。"

    # game/script.rpy:47275
    old "It's gotta be just me. Nobody's looking now. ...Even if that was the case, it shouldn't matter."
    new "肯定只是我多心。现在根本没人在看。……就算真是那样，也不该有什么关系。"

    # game/script.rpy:47276
    old "But it still made me uneasy, so I walked toward a narrower branching street which was much less crowded."
    new "可我还是觉得不自在，便朝一条狭窄的岔路走去，那里人要少得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:47280
    old "I advanced without thinking about where I was going. Eventually, I turned around and still saw no one looking back at me."
    new "我也不去想方向，只管往前走。到最后回头一看，依旧没有人看我。"

    # game/script.rpy:47281
    old "I'm going the wrong way if I want to go home, though."
    new "不过，要回家的话，我这方向可走反了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47285
    old "I moved to the end of the street. There, the atmosphere was completely calm, similar to how things had been that morning.{w} Slightly ahead of me was the school I'd always gone to, in front of the end of the mountain range."
    new "我走到街的尽头。那里气氛一片宁静，与今早的情形颇为相似。{w}前方不远处，就是我读了多年的学校，坐落在山脉尽头前面。"

    # game/script.rpy:47286
    old "I kept moving forward, accepting my own improvised detour."
    new "我接受了这临时起意的绕路，继续向前。"

    # game/script.rpy:47291
    old "Past the corner, I saw a green bus I hadn't noticed beforehand. Making no noise, it crossed my view and disappeared as it curved away."
    new "转过街角，我看见一辆先前没留意到的绿色巴士。它悄无声息地从我眼前驶过，拐了个弯便消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47292
    old "It wasn't common to see a bus like that in Yushibana. Since it had been green, I knew it had come from outside the town. There were local buses as well, but they were blue and took very few paths."
    new "在丰花，这样的巴士并不常见。既然是绿色的，我就知道它是从镇外开来的。本地也有巴士，不过是蓝色的，而且线路极少。"

    # game/script.rpy:47293
    old "I crossed the road, stepping on the recent wet tracks."
    new "我横穿马路，踩过刚刚留下、还湿着的车辙。"

    # game/script.rpy:47299
    old "I shortly arrived at the entrance to my school. The tunnel I'd come out of two days earlier was very close by."
    new "不多时，我便到了学校门口。两天前我走出来的那条隧道就在近旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:47300
    old "And of course, Seeuta D'ella Park too. Like every year, it would spend a few months covered by snow."
    new "当然，还有 Seeuta D'ella 公园。和往年一样，它会有好几个月被积雪覆盖。"

    # game/script.rpy:47301
    old "Without a clear purpose in mind, I strolled over to it, surrounded by pure silence."
    new "我没什么明确的目的，就这样信步走了过去，四周一片寂静。"

    # game/script.rpy:47306
    old "I could see people in the distance, too tiny to recognize.{w} I'd pretty much circled around Yushibana, and it was fairly smaller than the perception of it I'd always had."
    new "远处能望见人影，小得辨不清面容。{w}我几乎绕着丰花走了一圈，它比我向来以为的要小上不少。"

    # game/script.rpy:47310
    old "I could make it home without crossing the center again, so I headed toward the path I'd often taken after classes.{w} However, I abruptly forced my legs to stop."
    new "不必再穿过镇中心也能到家，于是我走向放学后常走的那条路。{w}然而，我猛地停下脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:47316
    old "...Am I just stressed out?"
    new "……只是我太紧张了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47319
    old "I kept walking, shrugging off whatever was up with me.{w} But I soon had to stop again."
    new "我甩开心里那点莫名的异样，继续走着。{w}可没过多久，又不得不停下。"

    # game/script.rpy:47325
    old "...Perhaps I'd sharpened my senses during the hours I'd spent on edge in the tower."
    new "……也许，是在塔里提心吊胆的那几个小时，把我的感官磨得过于敏锐了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47326
    old "Nobody seemed to be behind me, but something inside me told me otherwise.{w} The first time, I'd turned around after stopping and hadn't seen anyone. The second, I hadn't sensed anything, but I wanted to make sure."
    new "身后似乎没有人，可我心底有种感觉，告诉我并非如此。{w}第一次，我停下脚步回头，谁也没看见。第二次，我什么都没察觉到，却还是想确认一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:47328
    old "Have I hit the point of thinking that I'm being followed? ...I should just make it home."
    new "我已经疑心到自己被人跟踪的地步了吗？……总之，先回家吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:47331
    old "I continued walking around the rim of Yushibana, slightly on alert."
    new "我沿着丰花外围继续走着，多少留了几分警惕。"

    # game/script.rpy:47338
    old "The sound of my footsteps was all I picked up. I looked at the sky and noticed the dense white clouds."
    new "耳边只听得见自己的脚步声。我抬头看天，望见层层叠叠的白云。"

    # game/script.rpy:47339
    old "...In the park, I'd felt like there was movement behind me as soon as I'd started to walk. With how likely it was that I'd been mistaken, I was sure I was more nervous than I thought."
    new "……在公园时，我刚迈开步子，便感觉身后有动静。那多半是我多心，可我还是确信，自己远比想象中紧张。"

    # game/script.rpy:47341
    old "The third time I stopped myself, I didn't just look back."
    new "第三次停下脚步时，我不只是回头看了一眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:47345
    old "I turned around and ran toward the way I'd come."
    new "我转过身，朝来时的方向跑去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47346
    old "I didn't immediately see anyone. Seconds later, I'd covered quite a bit of distance, and nobody had come into view yet."
    new "我没有立刻看见任何人。几秒过去，我已跑出好一段路，视野里却依旧没有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:47348
    old "But when I looked down, my heart sank like a stone."
    new "可低头一看，我的心顿时沉了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47352
    old "Footprints.{w} They weren't mine, and I hadn't seen them seconds earlier. They came from the park hugging the edge and then disappeared toward faraway trees."
    new "脚印。{w}那不是我留下的，几秒前我也根本没看见。它们是从紧贴着边缘的公园那头延伸过来的，随后消失在远处的树丛间。"

    # game/script.rpy:47353
    old "...Was I not imagining anything? Am I actually being followed...?"
    new "……难道这一切都不是我的错觉？我真的被人跟踪了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:47354
    old "The footprints were too big to be my own, and I noticed a detail that reinforced my fear."
    new "那些脚印太大，不可能是我的。我还注意到一个细节，让恐惧又加深了一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:47357
    old "As soon as they turned toward the trees, the distance between each step increased."
    new "它们一转向树丛方向，每一步的间距就变大了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47358
    old "...Did they run away the moment I looked back?"
    new "……难道是在我回头的那一刻逃走的？"

    # game/script.rpy:47359
    old "It had become more than just paranoia. I turned around to my previous path and sped up considerably."
    new "这已经不只是我多心了。我转回原来的方向，明显加快了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:47364
    old "...Who would follow me, though? Is it someone else who traveled to the past?"
    new "……可是谁会跟踪我呢？难道是另一个时间穿越者？"

    # game/script.rpy:47365
    old "I couldn't think of many possibilities. I knew the past wasn't guaranteed to repeat, but even if someone who knew me had seen me, they wouldn't have run away as soon as I'd noticed them."
    new "我想不出太多可能。我知道过去未必会重演，可就算认识我的人看见了我，也不会在我一察觉时就立刻逃走。"

    # game/script.rpy:47369
    old "The path was mostly straight until my apartment. It wasn't too cold, so I didn't slow down.{w} On the way, I crossed paths with a neighbor of mine. Naturally, her footprints didn't match the ones I'd seen..."
    new "回公寓的路大半笔直。天不算太冷，我也就没有放慢脚步。{w}路上，我遇见了住在附近的邻居。她的脚印自然和我看见的那些对不上……"

    # game/script.rpy:47373
    old "I slowed down when I got to the metallic staircase and unlocked my door. I glanced all around me before opening it, and I didn't see anyone."
    new "走到金属楼梯前，我放慢脚步，打开门锁。开门前，我环顾四周，一个人也没看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:47377
    old "I panted for a bit, the comforting warmth helping me to calm down. After some time, I shrugged off my coat and boots."
    new "我喘了一阵，屋里的暖意让我慢慢平静下来。过了一会儿，我脱下外套和靴子。"

    # game/script.rpy:47380
    old "I really didn't like having to feel wary even in my apartment, but I couldn't shake it."
    new "我很不喜欢连在公寓里都得提心吊胆，可这种感觉怎么也甩不掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:47381
    old "Was it possible I was mistaken? I couldn't really put into words why I'd felt someone had been behind me, so I tried to believe that I'd made it all up."
    new "会不会是我弄错了？我说不清自己为什么觉得身后有人，只好试着相信这一切都是我的错觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:47382
    old "The ground had been covered in footprints. Even if the ones I'd seen had looked more recent than the others, that didn't prove anything."
    new "地上满是脚印。即使我看见的那串看起来比别的更新鲜，也证明不了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:47384
    old "...Why would anyone follow me?{w} To confirm that it was me because I should be in the hospital? ...It wouldn't be to hurt me, right?{w} ...If it was someone from Xyn who traveled to the past, would I actually be seen as a threat to them? If they know I should be in the hospital, they could figure out that there are two of me and I came from the future."
    new "……为什么会有人跟踪我？{w}是因为我本该待在医院，所以来确认我的身份？……应该不会是来伤害我的吧？{w}……如果对方是来自 Xyn 的时间穿越者，我会被他们当成威胁吗？只要他们知道我本该住院，就能推断出有两个我，而且我是从未来来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:47385
    old "I had a building headache, and I'd been sweating profusely for a while. I thought about turning off the heater, but I chose to try loosening up instead."
    new "我的头痛越来越重，也已经出了一身汗。我想过关掉暖气，但最后还是决定先放松一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:47389
    old "I went to the kitchen. If I could eat something, that'd give me something to do and allow me to trust my own judgment a bit more."
    new "我走进厨房。吃些东西的话，既能有点事做，也能让我更相信自己的判断。"

    # game/script.rpy:47390
    old "I took the prepped meat from the fridge. I didn't have a microwave, so I still had to use the stove. The frying pan was dirty from the last time, so I listlessly poured dish soap on a sponge and scrubbed the pan before rinsing it."
    new "我从冰箱里取出备好的肉。家里没有微波炉，只能用炉灶。平底锅上次用完还没洗，我无精打采地往海绵上挤了些洗洁精，把锅刷干净，再冲了冲。"

    # game/script.rpy:47391
    old "...I dried it with a hanging towel and put it on the burner with the food.{w} I knew not to turn the intensity all the way up or it would burn easily. I stood in front of the pan, focusing only on evenly heating the meat."
    new "……我用挂着的毛巾把锅擦干，放到炉灶上，再放入肉。{w}我知道火不能开到最大，否则很容易烧焦。我站在锅前，只专心把肉均匀加热。"

    # game/script.rpy:47392
    old "Seconds later, I turned it around with a knife and waited a bit longer for it to be done."
    new "几秒后，我用刀把它翻了个面，又等了一会儿，好让它熟透。"

    # game/script.rpy:47393
    old "Only one bowl was still clean, so I used it to bring the food to the living room."
    new "只剩一个碗还干净，我就用它把食物端到了客厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:47403
    old "The pieces were small, so I didn't have to cut them. I quickly brought one into my mouth."
    new "肉块很小，不用再切。我很快夹了一块送进嘴里。"

    # game/script.rpy:47404
    old "...The inside's still a little cold, but the taste isn't bad. Unfortunately, I probably have no future as a fry cook."
    new "……里面还有点凉，不过味道不坏。只可惜，我大概没有当煎肉厨师的前途。"

    # game/script.rpy:47405
    old "Well, actually, maybe that's fortunate...?"
    new "不过，真要说起来，说不定这也算件好事……？"

    # game/script.rpy:47406
    old "...{w}I should just try not to think about it too much. Even if I was being followed, what's most important is still that the Sekimeiya could be taken before the 15th."
    new "……{w}还是别想太多了。就算真有人跟踪我，最重要的仍然是 Sekimeiya 可能会在 15号之前被夺走。"

    # game/script.rpy:47407
    old "...And if I try to enter the tower during the night and I'm caught before I can trigger the alarm, it could all fail.{w} My main two worries are not knowing where the Sekimeiya is and not knowing how to travel a lot of days back in time."
    new "……再说，要是我夜里进塔，还没触发警报就被抓住，一切就可能全盘失败。{w}我最担心的两点，一是不知道 Sekimeiya 在哪里，二是不知道怎么回到许多天之前。"

    # game/script.rpy:47408
    old "I could go to the tower during the day and try to find the cabinet. If it's there, I know the mechanism behind the alarm will already be working, so I could try to consciously change the past the following night by entering the tower and forcing the cabinet open. I suppose it's possible it already is in the event room if nobody's allowed in for now.{w} There wasn't a camera in the storeroom, so maybe I could see if the handle of the hidden door is still there and if it really leads outside.{w} Using that hidden section is my best bet to make it to the tower during the night. I could either try to enter it from the outside or wait behind the movable wall during the day, where I won't be found before the tower closes."
    new "我可以白天先去塔里，试着找到展示柜。如果它还在，我就知道警报背后的机关已经启动了，那么第二天夜里，我就能有意识地改变过去——进塔，强行撬开展示柜。既然现在不许人进入，展示柜也可能已经被移到活动室了。{w}储藏室里没有摄像头，所以我可以去看看暗门的把手还在不在，以及那扇门是否真的通向外面。{w}我要进塔，最靠谱的办法就是利用那个隐蔽区域。要么从外面设法进去，要么白天躲在可移动墙壁后面——这样在塔关闭之前，不会有人发现我。"

    # game/script.rpy:47411
    old "So, the other issue is the truly concerning one."
    new "那么，另一个问题才是真正让人担心的。"

    # game/script.rpy:47412
    old "I would break open the cabinet and activate the alarm. That would lock me in the tower with the person in the security room."
    new "我会撬开展示柜，触发警报。这样一来，我就会和监控室里的人一起被困在塔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:47413
    old "However, even though we had to spend twelve hours inside, that wouldn't necessarily repeat. They explained to us that there was a way to open the exit before the maximum time. Both the security member and Ashiya can work together to remove the shutter."
    new "不过，就算我们必须在里面待满十二个小时，那种情况也未必会重演。他们跟我们解释过，在达到最长时间之前，有办法打开出口。监控室的人和芦屋可以合力拆下卷帘门。"

    # game/script.rpy:47414
    old "On the 15th, this system didn't appear to be working for either of them... I can't be sure the same will happen before that day, though. What if interfering with the mechanism was part of the attack? If so, it's very possible it'll still work properly before the 15th."
    new "15号那天，这套系统对他们两人似乎都没有起作用……可我无法确定在那天之前是否也会如此。万一干扰机关本就是袭击的一环呢？若真是这样，15号之前它很可能还能正常运作。"

    # game/script.rpy:47415
    old "I can't assume I'll have half a day to experiment with the Sekimeiya. To avoid being seen through the cameras, I could go to a place without them. The attic would be locked, so there wouldn't be many options."
    new "我不能指望自己能有半天时间拿 Sekimeiya 做试验。为了避开摄像头，我可以去没有摄像头的地方。阁楼应该锁着，能选的地方并不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:47416
    old "There, assuming the person in the security room doesn't leave, I could try to mess with the Sekimeiya. Maybe I'll touch it and appear somewhere that's being recorded, though.{w} If that's seen from the security room and I don't reply to whatever I'm told by the guard, it's incredibly likely they'll go ahead and unlock the exit."
    new "在那里，只要监控室里的人不离开，我就能试着摆弄 Sekimeiya。不过，也许我一碰它，就会出现在有摄像头拍摄的地方。{w}如果监控室看见了这一幕，而我又对守卫的话毫无回应，他们极有可能直接去解锁出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:47420
    old "I kept eating the last slices."
    new "我继续吃着剩下的几片。"

    # game/script.rpy:47421
    old "...Even though the handle of the hidden door was removed, since the door had two holes, we were able to deduce that the handle used to have a keyhole. So even if the handle is still there, I'll probably need the key in order to open it."
    new "……虽然暗门的把手被拆掉了，但门上留有两个孔，我们因此推断，那个把手原本是带钥匙孔的。所以，就算把手还在，我大概也得有钥匙才能打开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:47422
    old "But if I see that I can open the door, it's possible I'll have a good way out.{w} During the night, I could enter the tower through that door and quickly go to the Sekimeiya cabinet to trigger the alarm. Then, as soon as possible, I could leave with the Sekimeiya through the storeroom."
    new "但如果我确认自己能打开那扇门，说不定就有了一条很好的退路。{w}夜里，我可以从那扇门进塔，迅速赶到放 Sekimeiya 的展示柜前触发警报。然后，尽快带着 Sekimeiya 从储藏室离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:47423
    old "If nobody's watching that side of the building and I hide my face from the cameras, I could bring it home and experiment with it here..."
    new "如果大楼那一侧没有人盯着，而我也能避开摄像头，不让脸被拍到，我就能把它带回家，在这里慢慢试验……"

    # game/script.rpy:47424
    old "This doesn't sound like it has drawbacks, and it only requires that the storeroom door actually leads outside and that I can open it."
    new "听起来没什么坏处，只要储藏室那扇门确实通向外面，而且我能打开它就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:47425
    old "...{w}But did that bring serious risks? Even if I was later found outside, I could touch the Sekimeiya and go to the past before my identity was given away. Although I would lose the Sekimeiya."
    new "……{w}可这样做真就没有严重风险吗？就算之后在外面被人发现，我也能赶在身份暴露之前碰到 Sekimeiya，回到过去。代价是会失去 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:47426
    old "Why does the hidden area in the storeroom even exist? It's possible Katei lied when he said he didn't know about it. If Ashiya were completely aware of it, there's no way they'll allow it to be opened."
    new "储藏室里为什么会有那样一块隐蔽区域？Katei 说自己不知道，也许是在撒谎。要是芦屋那边完全知情，他们绝不可能允许那地方被打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:47430
    old "Wait...{w} there might be a way to solve the problem of not being able to figure out why I went so many days to the past."
    new "等等……{w}我一直想不通自己为什么会回到那么多天前，可这个问题或许有办法解决。"

    # game/script.rpy:47431
    old "It makes sense that the time the Sekimeiya spent out of the cabinet was a factor to determine the time traveled, even if there's more to it. After all the time I spent in the tower, what I can be almost certain of is that one minute stored comes out to more than one minute traveled."
    new "决定穿越时间长短的因素里，Sekimeiya 离开展示柜的时长应该算一项，哪怕还有其他条件。在塔里待了这么久，我几乎可以肯定：蓄能一分钟，换来的穿越时间不止一分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:47432
    old "If I can't open the storeroom door, I could still make it inside the tower during the night if I wait in the section past the movable wall, assuming someone else who knows about it doesn't check it.{w} After that, I could activate the alarm and leave the Sekimeiya out of its cabinet for a really long time."
    new "要是打不开储藏室的门，我也能趁夜里留在塔内——只要躲在活动墙后面的那块区域，而且知道那里的人不会过来查看。{w}之后触发警报，让 Sekimeiya 长时间留在展示柜外就行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47436
    old "How would I prevent the exit from opening early? I'd be talked to from the security room, so maybe I could reply and act as if I really am from Xyn.{w} Could I try to negotiate for hours or somehow convince them not to open the exit prematurely?"
    new "怎么才能阻止出口被人提前打开？监控室那边一定会跟我通话，我或许可以答话，装成 Xyn 的人。{w}能不能设法拖上几个小时，或者想办法说服他们不要提前开门？"

    # game/script.rpy:47437
    old "If I could think of something to say so that they keep me there, I could be in hallway A all the time.{w} Assuming twelve hours pass, I could run to touch the Sekimeiya just before the deadline. And if at least one stored minute means two minutes traveled, I would go 24 hours into the past. As long as I can make it to the previous night, to a time before the tower is open to the public, I could change the past and repeat the process.{w} I could progressively go days back without understanding how to travel such a long distance at once."
    new "只要能想出说辞把他们拖住，我就能一直待在 A走廊。{w}等十二个小时过去，赶在时限前跑回去碰 Sekimeiya。如果蓄能一分钟至少能穿越两分钟，我就能回到二十四小时之前。只要回到前一晚、回到塔还没对外开放的时刻，我就能改变过去，再把这套流程重来一遍。{w}这样一天天往回退，哪怕我始终不明白怎样才能一次穿越那么长的距离。"

    # game/script.rpy:47441
    old "While I considered my options further, I went to the kitchen and left the bowl in the sink."
    new "我一边继续盘算着各种办法，一边走进厨房，把碗搁进水池。"

    # game/script.rpy:47445
    old "...Is this a good idea? I'm not sure I could pull it off."
    new "……这办法真行得通吗？我没把握能做成。"

    # game/script.rpy:47446
    old "There are issues too. The person in the security room could see that the Sekimeiya's outside the cabinet and demand that I put it back, knowing that the refrigeration is essential to keep it safe.{w} And if one minute stored doesn't come out to two or more minutes traveled, I could appear during daytime, so I couldn't repeat the process until the same night I started from in the first place."
    new "问题也不少。监控室的人一看到 Sekimeiya 不在展示柜里，就会明白制冷对它有多要紧，然后要我把东西放回去。{w}而且，万一蓄能一分钟换不来两分钟以上的穿越时间，我就会出现在白天，那样非得等到与出发时同样的夜晚，才能再走一遍流程。"

    # game/script.rpy:47447
    old "...{w}What would even happen if I went back to the 30th and could save Miiya? Where would I stay?"
    new "……{w}就算我真回到 30 号、救下了 Miiya，之后又会怎样？我住哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:47448
    old "Since the past would greatly change, the current version of me who traveled from the 15th would very likely be overwritten.{w} Even if my original self still goes to the hospital on the 30th, that me wouldn't go to live with Atsuki, so I'd instantly have to figure out what to do in a world with two versions of myself."
    new "过去被大幅改写，从 15 号穿越而来的这个我，多半会被覆盖掉。{w}即便原本的我在 30 号仍会去医院，那个我也不会再去和 Atsuki 同住，于是我立刻就得在这个有两个我的世界里想好该怎么办。"

    # game/script.rpy:47449
    old "That aspect of the loose plan I had still brought me nothing but regret. As much as it was undeniable that saving Miiya would be the ideal outcome, it really wouldn't mean that to me. I was the one whose entire existence would be like a foreign body."
    new "这个尚不成形的计划，光是想到这一层，就让我只剩下悔意。救下 Miiya 固然是无可否认的最好结局，可对我而言并不是。会被看作异物的，是我这整个存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:47453
    old "...Oh, I don't actually think this can work.{w} If the Sekimeiya really was in that shop on the 30th, as long as it wasn't immediately brought to the tower, there could be a point where I couldn't keep progressively going one day back at a time. There'd eventually be no Sekimeiya in the tower to travel with."
    new "……唔，这办法恐怕行不通。{w}如果 30 号那天 Sekimeiya 确实还在那家店里，只要它没被立刻送进塔里，早晚有一天我会退到无处可退——塔里根本没有 Sekimeiya 可供穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:47454
    old "And there's something else... I only thought of this idea assuming I can't open the storeroom door or that it doesn't lead outside. If I wanted to trap myself during the night, I would need to enter the tower before it closes and wait in the hidden segment of the storeroom."
    new "还有一点……我这个主意，是建立在打不开储藏室的门、或者那扇门不通向外面这一前提上的。要想夜里把自己关在塔里，我得赶在闭馆前进去，躲在储藏室那块隐蔽区域里等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:47455
    old "If I can only go one day back at a time, I'll eventually reach Sunday, when the tower is closed and I can't get in. The last possible night where I could do this would be Monday—tonight.{w} ...So Miiya died on a Saturday, and I can't save her if I don't figure out why I went so far back."
    new "一次只能往回退一天的话，迟早会退到星期日——那天塔闭馆，我根本进不去。能动手的最后一晚就是星期一，也就是今晚。{w}……也就是说，Miiya 死在星期六，而我要是弄不清自己为什么回到那么久以前，就救不了她。"

    # game/script.rpy:47463
    old "In the end, no matter how much I thought in the living room of my house, I had to go to the tower.{w} During the day, I had to try to find the Sekimeiya and check the status of the storeroom door so that I could determine the best course of action."
    new "说到底，我坐在自家客厅里想得再多，也还是得去一趟塔。{w}白天我必须设法找到 Sekimeiya，再看看储藏室那扇门的情况，才能定下最妥当的做法。"

    # game/script.rpy:47464
    old "I rested my head on one of the pillows. After recalling the footprints in the snow, I felt reluctant to leave my apartment again."
    new "我把头靠在枕头上。想起雪地里的那些脚印，我又不愿再走出这间公寓了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47465
    old "I would leave, just not immediately... I closed my eyes, overwhelmed by all the doubts I had."
    new "要走，但不是现在……我闭上眼睛，满腹疑虑压得我喘不过气。"

    # game/script.rpy:47472
    old "I stood up and turned off the lights."
    new "我站起身，把灯关了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47482
    old "I heard a faint sound.{w} After suddenly raising my head, I noticed it was coming from next to me."
    new "我听见一点细微的声响。{w}猛地抬起头，才发现声音是从旁边传来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:47487
    old "I reached for my purse and took my phone out."
    new "我伸手去摸手提包，把手机取了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:47489
    old "The number calling me was displayed on the back screen. I read it a couple times, wondering if I recognized it."
    new "来电号码显示在背面的小屏上。我看了好几遍，想着自己是否认得这个号码。"

    # game/script.rpy:47490
    old "I don't think I've ever been called by this number."
    new "这个号码应该没给我打过电话。"

    # game/script.rpy:47491
    old "Since there was no name below it, it wasn't on my contacts list."
    new "号码下面没有名字，说明它不在我的通讯录里。"

    # game/script.rpy:47492
    old "It's also not the number I just called earlier."
    new "也不是我刚才打出去的那个号码。"

    # game/script.rpy:47493
    old "They hadn't hung up yet, so I debated what to do."
    new "对方还没挂断，我一时拿不定主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:47494
    old "...Should I pick up? It doesn't seem like anyone has in the hospital."
    new "……要接吗？医院那边好像一直没人接。"

    # game/script.rpy:47496
    old "It was rare for me to receive a strange call. Given my situation, I hesitantly pressed the \"accept\" button."
    new "我很少接到陌生来电。眼下这情形，我还是迟疑着按下了「接听」。"

    # game/script.rpy:47503
    old "O-Oh, you picked up. Good.{w} Hey there."
    new "啊……你接了，太好了。{w}那个，你好。"

    # game/script.rpy:47504
    old "I frowned, unable to recognize the relieved-sounding voice."
    new "那声音听着像是松了口气，我却听不出是谁，皱起了眉。"

    # game/script.rpy:47505
    old "Are you Shiroya...?"
    new "请问是 Shiroya……吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47506
    old "Huh? Yes. ...Who are you?"
    new "嗯？是我。……请问你是哪位？"

    # game/script.rpy:47508
    old "You were at my place earlier, remember? My name's Vaisude."
    new "你之前来过我那儿，还记得吗？我叫 Vaisude。"

    # game/script.rpy:47509
    old "Ah... from the apartment? Are you the one who's currently living there?"
    new "啊……你是公寓那边的人？现在住在那里的是你吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47510
    old "Yes. I'm sorry to suddenly call you like this. I got your number from Cecal's phone."
    new "是我。突然打给你，真不好意思。号码是我从 Cecal 的手机里找到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:47511
    old "What...? Why?"
    new "什么……？为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:47512
    old "I asked that, but I figured I already knew the answer. He had recognized me."
    new "我这么问了，但心里已经知道答案了。他认出我了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47516
    old "I just need to ask this first. You were in Ashiya Tower during the terrorist attack on December 15th, right?"
    new "有件事我想先确认。12 月 15 号那起恐怖袭击的时候，你在芦屋塔里，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:47517
    old "...{w}December 15th? What are you talking about?"
    new "……{w}12 月 15 号？你在说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:47518
    old "Wh-What? You know all about it, right? That's why you came to my place."
    new "什、什么？你明明什么都知道吧？不然你怎么会到我那儿去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47519
    old "...{w}I do, yeah. I was there."
    new "……{w}是啊，我知道。我就在现场。"

    # game/script.rpy:47520
    old "There was no reason to keep hiding it."
    new "事到如今，也没必要再瞒下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47521
    old "I see. I knew I wasn't wrong."
    new "原来如此。我就知道自己没猜错。"

    # game/script.rpy:47524
    old "There's a reason why I'm calling you. ...I don't know how this will sound, though."
    new "我打电话给你，是有原因的。……只是不知道这话说出来，听起来会是什么样。"

    # game/script.rpy:47525
    old "...What is it?"
    new "……什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:47526
    old "...Do you know... what I experienced? You read my thread from November, didn't you? That's how you found my apartment."
    new "……你知道……我经历了什么吗？你读过我十一月发的那个帖子，对吧？你就是那样找到我公寓的。"

    # game/script.rpy:47527
    old "What did you experience?"
    new "你经历了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:47528
    old "Exactly what I wrote about...! From the 15th of December, I suddenly appeared on the 24th of November!"
    new "就是我写的那样……！12 月 15 号那天，我一下子就出现在了 11 月 24 号！"

    # game/script.rpy:47529
    old "Once again, there was no reason to deny it. Since I'd shown up at his place days before the 15th and been one of the people to get trapped, from his perspective, it was fair to conclude that I'd also traveled through time."
    new "这一次，我仍然没有理由否认。我早在 15 号之前几天就出现在他家，而且也是被困在塔里的人之一。在他看来，自然会推断我也经历了时间穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:47530
    old "...I see. You're right. I also traveled back in time."
    new "……原来如此。你说得对。我也回到了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47531
    old "Wh— R-Really...!?{w} So that is what happened! How, though!?"
    new "什——真、真的吗……！？{w} 原来是这么回事！可到底是怎么做到的！？"

    # game/script.rpy:47534
    old "I breathed steadily, wondering what to say."
    new "我平稳地呼吸着，思量着该怎么开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:47535
    old "...I don't know. I'm confused as well."
    new "……我不知道。我也一样困惑。"

    # game/script.rpy:47536
    old "I didn't want to reveal the Sekimeiya's powers, as I'd been fearing someone could get to it before me."
    new "我不愿暴露 Sekimeiya 的力量，因为我一直担心有人会抢在我之前拿到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:47537
    old "You don't know...? Something happened inside the tower, right? How is it possible that I appeared in November like that!?"
    new "你不知道……？塔里一定发生了什么，对吧？我怎么可能就那么出现在十一月！？"

    # game/script.rpy:47538
    old "I'm telling the truth. I don't know. I also suddenly traveled through time when I was in the tower, but I don't know why. I'm kinda glad to know I wasn't the only one, though."
    new "我说的是实话。我真的不知道。我在塔里的时候也突然经历了时间穿越，原因同样不明。不过，知道不止我一个人这样，我多少安心了些。"

    # game/script.rpy:47539
    old "S-So, time traveling really is possible...! I was so scared I'd lost it completely!{w} Do you really not know anything about what happened?"
    new "那、那么说，时间穿越真的存在……！我还一直怕是自己彻底疯了！{w} 你对当时发生的事，真的一点都不知道吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47540
    old "...I don't. I went to the event with a friend, and we all got knocked out by smoke that came out of nowhere. I know I traveled to the past, but not anything about what happened in that place."
    new "……不知道。我和一个朋友去参加活动，不知从哪里冒出来的烟雾把我们都熏晕了。我知道自己回到了过去，可那个地方究竟发生了什么，我一无所知。"

    # game/script.rpy:47543
    old "What the hell...? I don't get it. ...How's that possible? A lot more people had to have come with me, right?"
    new "怎么会……？我不明白。……这怎么可能？肯定还有很多人跟我一起被送回来吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:47545
    old "It's possible, but I don't know. You're the first one I've come across."
    new "有可能，但我不知道。你是我遇到的第一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:47546
    old "Whoa... This is unreal."
    new "天哪……简直难以置信。"

    # game/script.rpy:47547
    old "...I know. I can still hardly believe it."
    new "……是啊。我到现在也几乎无法相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:47548
    old "Why didn't you say anything to me? Isn't that why you came to my place?"
    new "那你为什么什么都没跟我说？你来我家，不就是为了这个吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47549
    old "Yeah, I'm sorry... I didn't know what to say.{w} It was hard to ask out of nowhere if you'd traveled through time."
    new "嗯，抱歉……我不知道该怎么开口。{w} 突然问你有没有经历时间穿越，这话实在很难说出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:47550
    old "Ah, I understand. The same thing happened to me."
    new "啊，我明白。我也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:47554
    old "He kept going after a pause."
    new "他顿了顿，又接着说下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47555
    old "Then what will happen in two weeks? Do you think it will repeat?"
    new "那两周之后会怎样？你觉得还会重演吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47556
    old "It's very possible, but I'm not sure everything will be identical."
    new "很有可能，但是否一切都一模一样，我说不准。"

    # game/script.rpy:47557
    old "Yeah, that wouldn't make sense. I have no idea how it'll come to occur, but it'll happen again. People will travel to the past. I can't believe it."
    new "是啊，那样就说不通了。我不知道它会以什么方式发生，但它一定会再来一次。会有人被送回过去。真难以置信。"

    # game/script.rpy:47558
    old "...I'm as confused as you are."
    new "……我和你一样想不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:47563
    old "...{w}So, are you okay now? I figure getting caught in that attack and suddenly traveling through time was hard on you. I know I didn't take it well."
    new "……{w}那么，你现在还好吗？被卷进那场袭击，又突然经历时间穿越，我想这对你来说一定很难熬。我自己就接受不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47564
    old "I am. Don't worry about me.{w} But I do have a question. Did you let your past self see you?"
    new "我还好。不用为我担心。{w} 不过我有个问题。你有没有让过去的自己看到你？"

    # game/script.rpy:47565
    old "My past self? No... I didn't, but I-I did see him.{w} I came back to my place on the 25th of November, and in the afternoon, I saw myself coming back from work. I got scared when I heard the sound, so I escaped without being seen.{w} When I started to understand what had happened to me, I managed to avoid problems pretty easily by staying at home before the evening or at my parents'."
    new "过去的我？没有……我没让他看见，倒是我、我确实看见了他。{w} 我是在十一月二十五日回到自己住处的，那天下午，我看见自己下班回来。听到动静时我吓坏了，趁没被发现赶紧躲开。{w} 等渐渐弄明白自己身上发生了什么，我只要在傍晚前待在家里，或者去父母那边，就能很轻松地避开麻烦。"

    # game/script.rpy:47566
    old "...So, since it wasn't his intention to change the past, he didn't."
    new "……也就是说，既然他并无改变过去的意图，过去也就没有被改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:47567
    old "I'm incredibly relieved I was right, you really can't imagine it. I'm still going to move, but I'm so glad I can stop doubting what I felt sure of."
    new "我没猜错，这让我如释重负，你根本想象不到。我还是要搬家，但能不再怀疑自己原本确信的事，我真的很高兴。"

    # game/script.rpy:47568
    old "...That's good to hear. I'm sure everything will be all right."
    new "……那就好。一切都会好起来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:47569
    old "Yeah, I think so too."
    new "嗯，我也这么想。"

    # game/script.rpy:47572
    old "You're with the police, right? I saw a picture in your apartment."
    new "你是警察吧？我在你公寓里看到过一张照片。"

    # game/script.rpy:47573
    old "Yes, but I'm afraid I won't work there much longer.{w} ...Honestly, I have been told in the past I'm not always mentally stable. I'm relieved that it's not at the point I'd feared, but staying at my job would be very irresponsible... and dangerous. ...I didn't share it at first, but I think that just made it worse, so I've already accepted my condition."
    new "是的，不过恐怕我在那里也干不了多久了。{w}……说实话，以前就有人说过，我的精神状态并不总是稳定。我很庆幸情况还没到我所害怕的地步，但继续留在那个岗位上会非常不负责任……也很危险。……我一开始没把这件事说出来，可我觉得那样反而更糟，所以我已经接受了自己的状况。"

    # game/script.rpy:47574
    old "I winced sympathetically at what he was saying. His voice still sounded very calm, but there was a definite trace of sadness in it. It didn't seem like he wanted to specify any details, so I didn't ask for them."
    new "听着他的话，我心里不由得一紧。他的声音依旧很平静，却分明透着一丝哀伤。他似乎并不想细说，我也就没有追问。"

    # game/script.rpy:47575
    old "...I'm sorry. I hope it gets better once you move out."
    new "……抱歉。希望搬走之后，情况会好一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:47576
    old "Thank you. I do as well."
    new "谢谢。我也这么希望。"

    # game/script.rpy:47582
    old "You were still working with the police up until the 15th, right?"
    new "你直到十五日都还在警局工作，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:47583
    old "I was, yes."
    new "是的，没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:47584
    old "In that case, is there something you know about the attack? ...Do you know what could've happened?"
    new "既然如此，关于那次袭击，你知道些什么吗？……你知道可能发生了什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47585
    old "Oh, I'm sorry. I don't know anything.{w} It was a highly entertained possibility that Xyn could've been planning something, but I don't know anything beyond that."
    new "哦，抱歉。我什么都不知道。{w} 当时局里颇为认真地考虑过 Xyn 是否在谋划什么，除此之外，我就一无所知了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47586
    old "I see. That's fine."
    new "原来如此。没关系。"

    # game/script.rpy:47587
    old "...Sorry, I'd love to give you more information. Ashiya quickly put out a statement about their version of what had happened, but nobody really believed it. We thought that something in the security system went wrong because Ashiya were having problems unlocking the way in and the communication with the interior suddenly cut."
    new "……抱歉，我也希望能给你更多信息。芦屋很快就发布了他们那个版本的事件声明，可没人真的相信。我们当时认为安保系统出了问题，因为芦屋那边一直打不开入口，和内部的通讯也突然中断了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47588
    old "Yeah, that's what happened inside as well, but we couldn't figure out what caused it."
    new "嗯，里面也是这样，可我们查不出原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:47589
    old "I see... I apologize for not being more helpful."
    new "这样啊……没能帮上更多忙，实在抱歉。"

    # game/script.rpy:47590
    old "Don't worry, I wanted to ask just in case."
    new "别在意，我只是想以防万一问一句。"

    # game/script.rpy:47593
    old "I wasn't sure whether asking my next question was the right call, but I had to know."
    new "我不确定接下来这个问题该不该问，但我必须弄清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:47594
    old "Oh, something else. I don't mean to be rude or anything, but were you in Seeuta D'ella earlier?"
    new "哦，还有件事。我没有冒犯的意思，只是刚才你是不是在修塔·德埃拉公园？"

    # game/script.rpy:47595
    old "...The park? No. Why...?"
    new "……公园？没有。怎么了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:47597
    old "I thought I might've seen you there. Was I wrong?"
    new "我好像在那儿见过你。是我看错了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47598
    old "...Yes. I'm still at my apartment."
    new "……嗯。我还在公寓里。"

    # game/script.rpy:47600
    old "I was mistaken, then."
    new "那是我认错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47601
    old "Yeah, it wasn't me."
    new "嗯，你看见的不是我。"

    # game/script.rpy:47602
    old "...I see, sorry."
    new "……这样啊，抱歉。"

    # game/script.rpy:47603
    old "I didn't want to push it, but I still halfway doubted him."
    new "我不想追问下去，可心里仍半信半疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:47606
    old "It's fine. I guess this was all I called you for, but thank you for telling me the truth. Hearing that really was a relief."
    new "没关系。我打电话给你，大概也就是为了这件事。不过谢谢你跟我说实话，听你这么说，我确实松了口气。"

    # game/script.rpy:47607
    old "I'm glad. ...Do you think you'll be okay?"
    new "那就好。……你觉得自己撑得住吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47608
    old "I will. I'm not sure what I'll do now, knowing what happened, but I'll manage. I hope you will too. Is there anything else you want to know?"
    new "会的。知道真相以后，我还没想好接下来该怎么办，不过总有办法。希望你也一样。你还有别的想知道的事吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47609
    old "Uh...{w} yes.{w} Do you know exactly when you traveled through time on the 15th?"
    new "呃……{w}有。{w}你知道自己15号是几点穿越的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47610
    old "The time? ...It might've been close to {time=16}, I think."
    new "时间？……我想，大概快到{time=16}的时候吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:47612
    old "Hm...{w} I don't know, then. I traveled hours later, so I don't know what to think."
    new "嗯……{w}那我就不知道了。我是在几个小时后才穿越的，实在想不明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:47613
    old "...That's unbelievable. I just can't wrap my head around it."
    new "……真难以置信。我实在想不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:47614
    old "I know..."
    new "是啊……"

    # game/script.rpy:47617
    old "Can you think of anything else that could be of use? I'd really like to help understand what happened. This is way too crazy."
    new "你还能想到别的有用的线索吗？我真的很想帮忙弄清楚到底发生了什么。这件事太离谱了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47618
    old "...{w}I don't think so, no."
    new "……{w}没有了，我想不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:47619
    old "I see... Do call me if you think of anything, then. Even though we still can't understand anything, at least now I can be somewhat at ease."
    new "这样啊……那你要是什么时候想到了，一定要打给我。虽说我们还是什么都没弄明白，至少现在我多少能安心一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:47620
    old "...Okay. I will."
    new "……好。我会的。"

    # game/script.rpy:47621
    old "And if you realize something or can think of what happened, please tell me. I would really appreciate that."
    new "还有，如果你弄明白了什么，或者想起了当时的情况，也请告诉我。我会很感激的。"

    # game/script.rpy:47624
    old "After a few seconds, he said goodbye, and the call ended."
    new "几秒后，他道了别，通话便结束了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47627
    old "...So that's that."
    new "……事情就这样了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47632
    old "I left my phone on the floor and rested my head back on the pillow. I'd briefly looked at the time, which had shown {time=16:58.}"
    new "我把手机搁在地板上，又把头靠回枕头。刚才我瞥过一眼时间，显示是{time=16:58.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:47633
    old "I'm glad all that makes more sense now. ...It's probably fine that I revealed I traveled through time.{w} At {time=16} we were in the attic, and I think Sai and Akaro had already escaped from the bedroom... I might've been right with what I thought before."
    new "现在总算理清了不少，我也安心了。……我透露了自己穿越过时间，应该没关系吧。{w}在{time=16}的时候，我们还在阁楼里，我记得 Sai 和 Akaro 已经逃出卧室了……我之前想的说不定没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:47634
    old "I forgot to ask, but Xyn definitely didn't approach him. It seems that all the information he could give them would be the very basic details behind the alarm, although I really doubt he would. He knows he's in the past, so if someone approaches him asking questions without knowledge of what happened on the 15th, it'll be easy to conclude they're not good people."
    new "我忘了问，不过 Xyn 肯定没有去找过他。看来他能透露给他们的，最多也只是报警背后那些最基本的情况——虽然我实在怀疑他会说。他知道自己在过去，所以如果有人跑来问他，却对15号发生的事一无所知，他很容易就会判断对方不怀好意。"

    # game/script.rpy:47635
    old "It didn't sound like he was taking it that badly, though. I guess he'll be at his parents' house from now on. If everything were to repeat, his original self would still live in his apartment until the 15th, when he'd travel to the past."
    new "不过听他的语气，倒也没那么难以承受。我想他接下来会待在父母家吧。如果一切重来一遍，原本的他会一直住在公寓里，直到15号才回到过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47636
    old "I figured I didn't have to think too hard about it, so after wondering if there was anything else important I could ask him, I shut my eyes and buried my face in my pillow."
    new "我想自己不必在这件事上钻得太深。琢磨过还有没有别的要紧事该问他之后，我合上眼，把脸埋进枕头里。"

    # game/script.rpy:47648
    old "A while later, I went to the hallway. I tended not to enjoy taking showers during the winter, but as the heater had been working all day, it felt like a good idea. ...And I just wanted to do something."
    new "过了一会儿，我走到走廊。冬天我向来不太爱淋浴，但暖气开了一整天，这时洗个澡感觉倒也不错。……而且，我单纯想找点事做。"

    # game/script.rpy:47649
    old "Technically, I'd showered two days earlier, on the 30th. I went to my bedroom and selected the clothes I usually slept in."
    new "严格说来，两天前的30号我才洗过澡。我回卧室挑了一套平常睡觉穿的衣服。"

    # game/script.rpy:47652
    old "I had a bathtub in the bathroom, as my apartment wasn't big enough to have a dedicated room for it. I wasn't good at taking short showers, so I generally opted to take baths and avoid using up all the hot water."
    new "我的公寓没有大到能单独隔出浴室，所以浴缸就装在卫生间里。我不擅长速战速决地淋浴，通常干脆泡澡，也免得把热水用光。"

    # game/script.rpy:47653
    old "I turned on the water and waited for it to heat up as I left my nightwear ready."
    new "我打开水龙头等水烧热，同时把睡衣摆好。"

    # game/script.rpy:47662
    old "I opened the door and stepped out. Thanks to the heater, the hallway felt cold in a pleasant way."
    new "我推门出来。多亏暖气，走廊里的凉意反倒让人觉得舒服。"

    # game/script.rpy:47664
    old "How much time had I spent there? I'd tried to keep my mind empty, but it wasn't easy, especially after Vaisude's call.{w} As usual, the bath had been relaxing, but it also made me more tired."
    new "我在里面待了多久？我试着什么都不去想，可这并不是件容易事，尤其是 Vaisude 那通电话之后。{w}和平时一样，泡澡让人放松，却也让我更疲惫了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47665
    old "I didn't usually like how my hair looked after using the hair dryer, so I only used a towel, leaving it slightly wet. I'd tried not to soak it too much since I had to sleep soon, but that hadn't worked out, and I wasn't sure where the dryer even was."
    new "我向来不喜欢用吹风机吹过之后头发的样子，所以只用毛巾擦了擦，头发还带着点湿。想到马上就要睡觉，我本打算尽量别把头发弄得太湿，结果并没做到，而且我连吹风机放在哪儿都不清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:47668
    old "No sunlight was left. I approached my phone and glanced at the time.{w} {time=19:19.} The previous day, I'd gone to sleep very early, so my body was demanding that I repeat the schedule."
    new "外面已经没有日光。我走到手机旁看了一眼时间。{w}{time=19:19.} 前一天我睡得很早，身体似乎正催着我照同样的作息再来一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:47669
    old "...I'm not sure this is gonna go well if I'm going to spend the entire night in the tower soon."
    new "……过不了多久就得在塔里过上一整夜了，现在这样下去，可不一定撑得住。"

    # game/script.rpy:47672
    old "I'd had a pretty sad thought in the bathtub. My birthday was on the 19th of December, and Atsuki's was on the 21st. Earlier that year, the three of us had celebrated Miiya's, but it could end up being the first year I could remember where Atsuki and I wouldn't be together those two days."
    new "泡澡时，我想到了一件挺难过的事。我的生日是12月19日，Atsuki 的是21日。今年早些时候，我们三个人还一起给 Miiya 庆祝过生日，可这一年说不定会成为我记忆中第一次，Atsuki 和我在那两天没能一起过生日。"

    # game/script.rpy:47673
    old "If we'd continued in the tower and the exit hadn't opened, we would've spent them locked inside. I was already moving the world away from that reality... The thought of having to miss those days was pretty disheartening, even if they would technically happen with another version of me present."
    new "如果我们留在塔里，出口又没打开，我们就会在那两天里被困在塔内度过。而我已经在让这个世界远离那种现实……一想到可能错过那两天，我还是很失落，哪怕从某种意义上说，另一个版本的我也照样会经历它们。"

    # game/script.rpy:47674
    old "But I knew I wouldn't let myself be tricked. I wouldn't abandon the wish to save Miiya because of that. If I did, spending our birthdays together wouldn't mean anything anymore."
    new "但我知道，我不会让自己被这种事动摇。我不会因此放弃救 Miiya 的愿望。否则，就算一起过生日，也再没有意义了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47676
    old "Yawning, I brought my phone to my bedroom. Sometimes, I got pretty hungry after bathing, but I really just wanted to lie down. ...The time had been passing so fast since I'd made it home."
    new "我打了个哈欠，把手机拿回卧室。泡完澡有时会挺饿，可我实在只想躺下。……自从回到家，时间过得真快。"

    # game/script.rpy:47681
    old "I turned off the hallway light and walked to my bed. The blinds were still down, so I turned off the light there too and covered myself with the blankets, their soft touch highlighted after the bath."
    new "我关掉走廊的灯，走到床边。百叶窗还拉着，我便也关了房里的灯，再裹上被子。刚泡过澡，被褥的柔软触感格外分明。"

    # game/script.rpy:47685
    old "I'm gonna wake up on December 3rd..."
    new "等我醒来，就是12月3日了……"

    # game/script.rpy:47686
    old "...Atsuki's probably suffering by himself in his house. ...Or maybe he's in the hospital. This is about the time I woke up on the 8th, and he was there."
    new "……Atsuki 现在大概正一个人在家里受苦吧。……又或者躺在医院里。我8号醒来的时候，差不多也是这个时间，那时他就在医院。"

    # game/script.rpy:47687
    old "No matter what I do, things won't ever be the same, will they?"
    new "不管我做什么，事情都再也回不到原样了，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:47688
    old "I have to go to the tower tomorrow, don't I...? That'll tell me which options I have.{w} Assuming I'm able to find the cabinet, what would I choose? If I can't decide now, how will I be able to decide tomorrow?"
    new "明天我必须去塔里，对吧……？去了就能知道我有哪些选择。{w}假如我真能找到展示柜，我该选什么？现在都决定不了，明天又怎么可能决定得了？"

    # game/script.rpy:47691
    old "I was so comfortable in my bed that it was almost impossible to believe that, within a few hours, I might have been living in a world where I wouldn't really be myself.{w} Instead, I could end up in a prison cell. The choices I had weren't just freeing, they were daunting."
    new "躺在床上的舒适感让我几乎无法相信，再过几个小时，自己也许就会活在一个不再真正是自己的世界里。{w}又或者，最终落得身陷牢房的下场。眼前的选择固然让我感到自由，却也令人望而生畏。"

    # game/script.rpy:47692
    old "...{w}If I changed the past, I would pretty much be sacrificing myself. It's already changed in a very minor way, but that might not matter.{w} Even if I can't ever use the Sekimeiya again, if I simply prevent Atsuki and myself from going to the tower on the 15th, the other version of me will never travel through time, so both of us will persist.{w} ...That is assuming I don't get dematerialized by a paradox. Since the past can be changed, I should probably not be worried about that. Hopefully."
    new "……{w}如果我改变过去，就等于牺牲我自己。过去确实已经发生了很细微的改变，不过那也许无关紧要。{w}就算我再也用不了 Sekimeiya，只要阻止 Atsuki 和我在15号去塔里，另一个我就不会去穿越时间，两个我都能继续存在。{w}……前提是我不会被悖论抹消。既然过去可以改变，我大概不必担心这一点。但愿如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:47693
    old "It was just so frustrating to think about. Like in the bathroom, I forced the thoughts away and tried to breathe calmly."
    new "光是想到这些就令人烦躁不已。就像在洗手间时那样，我强压下这些念头，试着平稳地呼吸。"

    # game/script.rpy:47704
    old "Mutual Reject"
    new "相互拒绝"

    # game/script.rpy:47710
    old "I looked at my window. It was still pretty early, as I couldn't see light through the gaps."
    new "我朝窗户望去。缝隙间不见光亮，天色还早。"

    # game/script.rpy:47712
    old "It seemed I'd woken up as early as I'd gone to sleep. I felt well-rested, so I sat up instead of lounging around."
    new "看来我睡下得早，醒来也早。我感觉睡得很足，于是没有赖床，直接坐了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:47713
    old "I'd realized that the time I had left was potentially scarce, and it felt like a long, long time since I'd appreciated ordinary days so much. ...I didn't want them to end any time soon, so I got out of bed right away."
    new "我意识到，自己剩下的时间也许不多了；而我已经很久没有像这样珍惜平常的日子。……我不想让这样的日子这么快结束，于是立刻下了床。"

    # game/script.rpy:47717
    old "The time was {time=7:45.}{w} I set the phone back on the table while a glimpse of the dream I'd just had returned to me."
    new "时间已是{time=7:45.}{w}我把手机放回桌上，方才梦中的些许片段又浮上心头。"

    # game/script.rpy:47721
    old "I wasn't able to piece it together properly, but I knew it had been very similar to the one from two nights prior. I had been in the tower, working through an infinite cascade of headaches caused by the Sekimeiya."
    new "我没能把梦境的片段拼凑完整，但我知道，它和两天前夜里的那个梦十分相似。梦中的我在塔里，被 Sekimeiya 引发的一波接一波的头痛折磨着。"

    # game/script.rpy:47722
    old "Hm... maybe it's a little interesting that I'm dreaming about this."
    new "嗯……我会梦见这种事，倒也有点意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:47723
    old "The body I'm currently in was never in the tower. The part of me that's causing these dreams traveled alongside my consciousness from the 15th."
    new "我现在这具身体从未进过塔。让我做这些梦的，是随意识一同从15号穿越而来的那一部分。"

    # game/script.rpy:47724
    old "I was no expert on how dreams worked, and there wasn't much I could really glean from that anyway."
    new "我对梦的机制并不了解，再说，就算了解，也从中得不出多少有用的线索。"

    # game/script.rpy:47725
    old "Actually, wait a second. I went fifteen days back in time, but mentally, I still aged those fifteen days. I'm not sure exactly how old my body actually is after doing that, but wouldn't that mean that my birthday is technically on December 4th from now on instead? So, tomorrow."
    new "等等。我穿越回了十五天前，但精神上又确实度过了这十五天。这样一来，我这具身体究竟算几岁，我也说不准；不过照理说，从今以后我的生日岂不是要变成12月4日了？也就是明天。"

    # game/script.rpy:47726
    old "Huh. I'm just going to ignore that. It seems easier."
    new "哈。我还是别去想这件事了，这样似乎更省心。"

    # game/script.rpy:47729
    old "I stood up as I stretched my limbs and walked to the wardrobe while rubbing my eyes. Sleeping so long would actually tire me out sometimes, but I felt completely rested."
    new "我站起来伸了伸四肢，一边揉着眼睛一边走向衣柜。有时睡得太久反而会让人疲倦，但我此刻只觉得神清气爽。"

    # game/script.rpy:47733
    old "The radiators had been emitting heat for a long time, so the temperature was very pleasing."
    new "暖气已经开了很久，室温十分宜人。"

    # game/script.rpy:47737
    old "I took some time to drink water and eat a few almonds. For some reason, I felt the impulse to go out, just like the first day."
    new "我花了一点时间喝水，又吃了几颗杏仁。不知为何，我忽然很想出门，就像第一天那样。"

    # game/script.rpy:47738
    old "I tried to open the door and check the temperature, but it didn't open smoothly. When I peeked out, I understood why."
    new "我试了试开门，想看看外面的温度，门却不好推开。探头一看，我便明白了缘由。"

    # game/script.rpy:47744
    old "...It's snowing. The sun is rising from behind the mountains, too."
    new "……下雪了。太阳也从山后升起来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47745
    old "It wasn't very dense snow, and only a bit of it had piled in front of the door. It didn't feel unbearably cold, so I stepped back in to go grab my phone and put on my coat."
    new "雪不算大，门前只积了薄薄一层。外面并不冷得难受，我便退回屋里，去拿手机、穿上外套。"

    # game/script.rpy:47749
    old "I remembered the footprints from the previous day again. I didn't want to let them intimidate me, so I discarded the thought. Despite that, I knew that finding out who was responsible for them, if I could, was a fairly good idea."
    new "我又想起了前一天的那些脚印。我不想被它们吓住，于是把这个念头压了下去。尽管如此，我也清楚，若有机会查明那是谁留下的，倒很值得一试。"

    # game/script.rpy:47757
    old "I stepped out but stopped myself as I was walking down the stairs."
    new "我走出门，却在走下楼梯时停住了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:47758
    old "Maybe it's too early. ...It's also colder than I thought."
    new "也许太早了。……而且比我想象中更冷。"

    # game/script.rpy:47759
    old "I didn't want to turn around so soon, so I kept going down, taking a few uncertain steps.{w} There was nobody outside. I was the only person I could see being hit by the falling snow."
    new "我不想这么快就折返回去，便继续往下走，脚步有些迟疑。{w}外面空无一人。放眼望去，被落雪打着的只有我一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:47760
    old "I put on the heavy hood and began to make distance from my apartment."
    new "我戴上厚重的兜帽，朝远离公寓的方向走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47770
    old "I'd previously wandered around Yushibana without a purpose, but the weather no longer made that a good idea. If I decided not to turn back, I had to actually go somewhere."
    new "以前我也曾在丰花漫无目的地闲逛，但眼下的天气已经不适合这么做。既然不打算回头，我就得真正去一个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:47771
    old "It's so early, though. ...Should I just go to the tower?"
    new "可现在也太早了。……我该不该直接去塔里？"

    # game/script.rpy:47773
    old "I didn't change direction, well aware that a part of me didn't want to go back there."
    new "我没有改变方向，心里很清楚，自己有一部分并不想回到那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:47774
    old "Would I only go when I'd made up my mind? If so, that would never happen.{w} My whole life, I'd always avoided getting near that building. After the hellish day I'd spent there, that resistant part of me had only gotten stronger."
    new "我难道非得等下定决心了才会去吗？要真是这样，就永远去不成了。{w}我这一辈子都在避开那栋建筑。我在那里熬过地狱般的一天后，心里抗拒的那一面只会更强。"

    # game/script.rpy:47775
    old "Last night, I decided I'd go today, though. I really should...{w} I should, because if I don't, Miiya's fate could be set in stone at any time."
    new "不过昨晚我已经决定，今天就去。我确实该去……{w}必须去，否则 Miiya 的命运随时都可能再无转圜余地。"

    # game/script.rpy:47776
    old "I'd once thought that it already had been set in stone, even after learning about the Sekimeiya. Even with all the dilemmas I had, the impulse to go outside took priority over them. It was a strange, new sensation, and I hoped it would persist. Going to the tower would remove the faint traces of freedom I was feeling."
    new "我曾以为，即便得知了 Sekimeiya 的存在，一切也早已尘埃落定。尽管心中有种种两难，想出门的冲动却压过了它们。这是一种陌生而新鲜的感觉，我希望它能一直持续下去。可一旦去了塔里，我此刻感到的那一丝自由便会消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:47782
    old "...The streets were completely desolate. I'd gotten pretty far without noticing it, absorbed by the same persistent quandary."
    new "……街上荒凉至极。我沉浸在那个挥之不去的难题里，不知不觉已经走出了很远。"

    # game/script.rpy:47783
    old "Am I just afraid of being alone in a world where Miiya's alive? I don't even think I'm that concerned about getting caught by the police.{w} Right now, I'm all by myself, and I don't dislike it like I have in the past. ...It's probably because I know it's not indefinite, though."
    new "我难道只是害怕独自待在这个 Miiya 还活着的世界里吗？我甚至不觉得自己有多担心被警察抓到。{w}此刻我孤身一人，却不像过去那样讨厌这种感觉。……不过这大概是因为我知道，这种状态不会一直持续下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47784
    old "If that's all it is, couldn't I just go talk to Atsuki? If I explain everything to him, both of us could travel to the past and save Miiya. Another version of both of us would remain, but I wouldn't have to be by myself."
    new "如果只是这样，我直接去找 Atsuki 谈谈不就行了？只要把一切解释清楚，我们两个就能穿越回过去，救下 Miiya。那样还会留下另一个版本的我们两人，但至少我不必独自一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:47785
    old "He would probably agree to it..."
    new "他大概会答应吧……"

    # game/script.rpy:47787
    old "But by traveling from the tower alone, I'd willingly avoided that already. ...Hadn't I traveled to the past precisely to also erase Atsuki's pain, so that he wouldn't have to remember everything?"
    new "然而，我独自去塔里穿越，其实就已经主动避开了这条路。……我回到过去，不正是为了也抹去 Atsuki 的痛苦，让他不必记得这一切吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47798
    old "At once, I realized that the sight in front of me was not one I'd seen before."
    new "我马上意识到，眼前的景象我从没见过。"

    # game/script.rpy:47799
    old "A foggy Ramon street extended far ahead of me, but only a handful of people were walking, covering their heads due to the snow. I had never seen it so devoid of life.{w} The entire area had begun to be coated by a thin layer of whiteness. I'd gotten there early enough to witness it before it was manually removed."
    new "雾气弥漫的拉蒙街在眼前延伸开去，路上只有零星几个人，因为下雪都遮着头。我从没见过这里如此人烟稀少。{w}整片街区已经覆上了一层薄薄的白色。我到得够早，才赶在有人清扫之前见到这一幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:47803
    old "I crossed the empty road. On the other side, I looked around me and saw that every shop was closed."
    new "我穿过空荡荡的马路。到了对面，我环顾四周，发现所有店铺都关着门。"

    # game/script.rpy:47804
    old "For a while, I didn't move. It was such an unusual sight that I had to wonder if it made any sense."
    new "我呆立了片刻。眼前的景象太过反常，我不禁怀疑这究竟是否合乎常理。"

    # game/script.rpy:47807
    old "It's... never been like this, has it?"
    new "这里……从来没有这样过吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:47809
    old "Everything was closed, and there were so few people... It was hard to think I was at the same place as always."
    new "所有店铺都关着，人又这么少……很难相信这里还是我平时熟悉的那个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:47810
    old "Even the times I went to school through Ramon, there were a lot more people, right? It was also around this time of day."
    new "就算是我走拉蒙街去上学的时候，路上的人也多得多吧？而且差不多也是这个时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:47811
    old "I was heading to Ina Café, but I started to doubt it'd be open, as nothing else was."
    new "我本来要去伊娜咖啡馆，可别处都关着门，我也不禁怀疑它是否营业。"

    # game/script.rpy:47815
    old "That didn't feel right. I didn't think I'd ever seen it closed, not even on any special holiday."
    new "这不太对劲。我记得自己从没见过它歇业，哪怕是特别的节日也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:47816
    old "It was at a branching street farther up, so I kept going, assuring myself that it would be up and running."
    new "那家店在更前面的一条岔路上，我继续往前走，一边安慰自己：它肯定照常开着门。"

    # game/script.rpy:47817
    old "Sometimes, I'd seen people out walking their dogs so early in the morning, but the snow made that impossible. When someone finally passed me by, I glanced at their face, and it didn't seem like they found the state of their surroundings strange."
    new "平日里这么早，我也见过有人出来遛狗，可今天下了雪，就不可能了。好不容易有人从我身边经过，我抬眼看了看对方的脸，那人似乎并不觉得周围有什么奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:47818
    old "I got more and more confused. ...Was the lack of people normal? Perhaps the few memories I had of my morning trips to school were mistaken.{w} I was sure of one thing, though. When I'd taken Ramon street to go to classes, it had been to stop by Ina and eat something. While I couldn't be sure about the other places, I knew that not once had Ina been closed."
    new "我越来越困惑。……街上没人，是正常的吗？也许我早上上学的那点记忆本来就不可靠。{w} 但有一件事我很肯定。我走拉蒙街去上课，是为了顺路去伊娜吃点东西。别的地方我不敢说，可伊娜从来没有关过一天门。"

    # game/script.rpy:47819
    old "Starting to get impatient, I accelerated toward Costa, the small street I'd always turned to."
    new "我有些按捺不住，加快脚步朝 Costa 走去——那是我总拐进去的小街。"

    # game/script.rpy:47829
    old "When it finally came into view, I raised my head, letting the falling snow collide with my face. Soon, Ina came up, and I slowed down."
    new "等它终于出现在视野里，我抬起头，任落雪打在脸上。很快，伊娜到了跟前，我放慢了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:47837
    old "...It really is closed."
    new "……真的关门了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47838
    old "I stared at it from a distance. It shouldn't have been that strange, but a surrealness similar to the one I'd felt in the tower started to creep into the edges of my mind."
    new "我远远地望着它。这本不该有多奇怪，可一种在塔里感受过的、近乎超现实的异样感，开始悄悄爬上心头。"

    # game/script.rpy:47839
    old "I wasn't wrong, though. I've never seen it closed before."
    new "可我没记错。我以前从没见过它关门。"

    # game/script.rpy:47840
    old "I could be sure of that since there was an emblem of a coffee mug on the shutter that I was certainly seeing for the first time."
    new "这一点我有把握——卷帘门上印着的咖啡杯图案，我绝对是第一次见到。"

    # game/script.rpy:47842
    old "I continued getting closer without looking away. As I did, I thought of a time Darfee had said they didn't close a single day of the year."
    new "我目不转睛地盯着它，继续靠近。走着走着，我想起 Darfee 曾说过，这家店全年一天都不休息。"

    # game/script.rpy:47843
    old "...Could he be sick?"
    new "……会不会是他病了？"

    # game/script.rpy:47844
    old "No, that's not it. ...Everything else is closed too."
    new "不对，不是这样。……别的店也都关着。"

    # game/script.rpy:47845
    old "I tried to think of a reason, but I couldn't. The lack of people and open stores... Something about Yushibana was off."
    new "我试着找个理由，却想不出来。没人，也没开门的店……丰花有什么地方不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:47848
    old "I got to the shutter and tried to find a note explaining why it was closed. But there was nothing."
    new "我走到卷帘门前，想找一张说明停业原因的告示。可什么都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:47849
    old "...I took my phone out and looked at the time. It was {time=7:59.}"
    new "……我掏出手机看了看时间。{time=7:59.}"

    # game/script.rpy:47850
    old "It's possible he recently started to open later. That'd be weird, because students usually buy pastries here on the way to school."
    new "也许他最近改成晚点开门了。可这说不通，学生上学路上一般都会来这儿买点心。"

    # game/script.rpy:47851
    old "The classes started at {time=8:00}, and I'd always been under the impression that Ina opened half an hour earlier.{w} I stepped under a thin stone roof to shield myself from the snow."
    new "课是 {time=8:00} 开始，而在我印象里，伊娜总是提前半小时开门。{w} 我站到一道窄窄的石檐下躲雪。"

    # game/script.rpy:47853
    old "I was lost, not knowing what to think. ...Surely Yushibana would soon look as it always had."
    new "我茫然无措，不知道该想些什么。……丰花很快就会变回平时的样子吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:47862
    old "I'd spent a couple of minutes crouching down under the roof, almost afraid of the silent street."
    new "我在檐下蹲了好几分钟，几乎有些害怕这条寂静的街。"

    # game/script.rpy:47864
    old "...Wait. There's nobody here.{w} Why did I not see anyone going to school?"
    new "……等等。这里一个人都没有。{w} 我怎么没看见有人去上学？"

    # game/script.rpy:47865
    old "I didn't understand. That didn't make sense."
    new "我不明白。这说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:47866
    old "Classes had to be starting, but everything around me was deserted."
    new "课马上就要开始了，可我周围空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:47867
    old "I used to see a few people going to school when I went through the center. Why have I not seen anyone?"
    new "以前我穿过中心区的时候，总能看见几个学生去上学。为什么今天一个都没见到？"

    # game/script.rpy:47868
    old "I hadn't gone to school in months. Had something changed? The schedule, maybe? Some emergency? Was December 3rd a holiday I wasn't aware of? ...I couldn't be sure of anything, as I'd spent the entire time in a coma."
    new "我已经好几个月没去学校了。是有什么变了吗？作息时间？还是出了什么紧急情况？十二月三日该不会是什么我不知道的假日吧？……这些我全都无法确定——那段时间我一直昏迷不醒。"

    # game/script.rpy:47872
    old "What was wrong...!? No matter how much I looked around me, the absence of people wasn't normal, and even if there were no classes for some reason, Ina should have been open."
    new "到底是怎么回事……！？不管我往哪儿看，街上一个人都没有，这太不正常了；就算今天因为什么原因不上课，伊娜也应该开着门。"

    # game/script.rpy:47873
    old "I stared at the snow piling on the ground. Beyond my safe place, the white curtain extended ahead, almost like a cloud."
    new "我望着地上的积雪越积越厚。在我这个小小的避雪处之外，白色的雪幕一直向前延伸，几乎像一片云。"

    # game/script.rpy:47874
    old "I didn't have gloves, so I tended to keep my hands warm in the pockets of my coat. Snow had slipped its way inside, and the cold ate at my fingers."
    new "我没戴手套，一向把手揣在大衣口袋里取暖。雪不知何时钻了进去，寒气一点点啃噬着我的手指。"

    # game/script.rpy:47877
    old "I didn't know what to do. There was nowhere I could go, and the temperature was imposing, rapidly becoming oppressive as soon as I'd stopped moving."
    new "我不知该怎么办。我无处可去，而寒气逼人；一停下脚步，冷意便迅速压了上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:47878
    old "...I should just go home."
    new "……我还是回家吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:47879
    old "I hung my head. I'd been feeling fine when I left my apartment, but the atmosphere outside was completely unwelcoming, repelling me."
    new "我垂下头。出门时我还没觉得有什么，可外面的气氛冷得拒人，像在把我往回推。"

    # game/script.rpy:47880
    old "So I stubbornly stayed there. Perhaps the mornings in Yushibana had become a lot more empty than before, but I knew it wouldn't be like that all day. Shortly, Ramon would fill up as always, practically bustling by comparison."
    new "于是我固执地留在原地。也许丰花的早晨比从前冷清了许多，但我知道不会一整天都这样。再过一会儿，拉蒙街就会像往常一样热闹起来，相比之下简直称得上熙熙攘攘。"

    # game/script.rpy:47884
    old "I clenched my hands and shuffled my feet repeatedly. The cold was sapping my energy bit by bit, so I had to keep confirming that I was capable of movement."
    new "我攥紧双手，反复跺着脚。寒冷正一点点抽走我的力气，我必须不断确认自己还能动弹。"

    # game/script.rpy:47885
    old "I knew I wasn't wrong. Ahead of Ina was a clothing store that had always been open at that time, but I could see it was closed as well. The Yushibana I was in didn't make sense. It was abnormal."
    new "我知道自己没弄错。伊娜前面有一家服装店，这个时间向来都是开着的，可我看得出来，它也关了门。我所在的这个丰花不合常理。它不正常。"

    # game/script.rpy:47893
    old "How long had I been there? I was too cold to curl my fingers around my phone."
    new "我在这里待了多久？冷得连手指都蜷不起来，握不住手机。"

    # game/script.rpy:47894
    old "What am I doing...? I need to go home."
    new "我在做什么……？我该回家了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47895
    old "Remembering the heater, I almost stood up. However, looking at my right, I noticed that some people had arrived at Ramon. It didn't feel normal yet, but it was getting there."
    new "想起家里的暖气，我几乎要站起来。可往右边一看，我发现拉蒙街上已经有了几个人影。虽说还谈不上正常，但总算渐渐有了样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:47896
    old "I just had to wait a little more. At any point, one of the shops had to open, and I could enter it to eat something."
    new "我只要再多等一会儿。总有一家店会开门，到时我就能进去吃点东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:47898
    old "Would that really happen? Everyone I could see walked ahead individually, either hidden behind an umbrella or disappearing into the distance without looking anywhere else."
    new "真会这样吗？我能看见的人都各自向前走着，不是躲在伞下，就是头也不回地消失在远处。"

    # game/script.rpy:47906
    old "I turned abruptly to a nearby sound.{w} An old man was walking toward me from the wider street."
    new "身旁传来响动，我猛地转过头。{w} 一位老人正从宽阔的街道那边朝我走来。"

    # game/script.rpy:47907
    old "He hadn't seen me, and his tired eyes stared ahead as he walked through his own breath. I forced my body to stand up and stepped out from under the roof."
    new "他没有看见我，疲惫的双眼望着前方，一边走一边穿过自己呼出的白气。我勉强撑起身子，从檐下走了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:47912
    old "...A-Ah, I'm sorry..."
    new "……啊、啊，抱歉……"

    # game/script.rpy:47913
    old "\"Oh?\"{w} He suddenly noticed I'd addressed him and focused his expression, trying to hear my voice."
    new "「哦？」{w} 他这才注意到我在跟他说话，神情一凝，侧耳来听我的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:47914
    old "Um... is it normal that everything is closed? Shouldn't Ina be open already?"
    new "那个……所有店都关着，这正常吗？Ina不是早该开门了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47915
    old "...Huh? I-Ina...?"
    new "……嗯？I、Ina……？"

    # game/script.rpy:47916
    old "He frowned and looked at the shutter."
    new "他皱起眉头，望向卷帘门。"

    # game/script.rpy:47919
    old "I've never been there, but it's true that it's usually open.{w} You think it should be?"
    new "我没进去过，不过那家店平常确实开着。{w} 你觉得它现在该开门了？"

    # game/script.rpy:47920
    old "Yes. I think so.{w} It's not only Ina, though. Everything's closed."
    new "是的，我想是这样。{w}不过不止Ina，所有店都关着门。"

    # game/script.rpy:47922
    old "...He looked all around him."
    new "……他环顾四周。"

    # game/script.rpy:47923
    old "Hm, that's true. I don't think they should be closed today, so you probably only have to wait a little more. It's still pretty early."
    new "嗯，说得也是。今天按理说不该关门的，所以你大概再等一会儿就好。现在还早得很。"

    # game/script.rpy:47927
    old "He was about to drop it, but I insisted before he kept walking."
    new "他似乎打算就此打住，我却没等他迈步，又追着问了一句。"

    # game/script.rpy:47928
    old "But... aren't there far fewer people around than usual? It's Tuesday, right? There's no reason why that'd be the case."
    new "可是……街上的人比平时少了很多吧？今天才周二，按理说不该这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:47930
    old "Fewer people...? You think so?"
    new "人少……？你这么觉得？"

    # game/script.rpy:47932
    old "After a bit, he shook his head."
    new "过了一会儿，他摇了摇头。"

    # game/script.rpy:47933
    old "Like I said, it's very early in the morning."
    new "我说了，现在天刚亮没多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:47934
    old "...{w}Maybe I'm wrong. ...It's just the impression I got."
    new "……{w}也许是我弄错了。……只是我有这种感觉罢了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47935
    old "He shrugged and gave a short, dry laugh before nodding his head and parting."
    new "他耸了耸肩，干笑了一声，点点头便走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47939
    old "I'd felt before that I was being a little paranoid. Was that all it was...?"
    new "我以前就觉得自己有些疑神疑鬼。难道真的只是这样……？"

    # game/script.rpy:47943
    old "I stepped back, shaking a bit of snow off my head. Maybe I'd internally exaggerated things, but I didn't think my memories were off."
    new "我往后退了一步，抖掉头上的雪。也许是我把事情想得太严重了，但我不觉得自己的记忆出了错。"

    # game/script.rpy:47944
    old "...I should just wait, then—that's all. At some point, nobody will be able to say it's too early for the stores to be closed."
    new "……那就等着好了——只能这样。再等一阵，总不会有人再说这个点关门太早了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47945
    old "I'd been below that short roof for some minutes, and while I couldn't stay there for much longer, there was nowhere else to take shelter. However, the thought of going all the way home before eating anything was intimidating."
    new "我在那片矮檐下已经站了几分钟，虽说不宜久留，却也没有别处可避雪。可要空着肚子一路走回家，光是想想就让人发怵。"

    # game/script.rpy:47956
    old "There's definitely more people than before. ...It's all fine."
    new "人确实比刚才多了。……没事的。"

    # game/script.rpy:47957
    old "Minutes earlier, I'd been considerably anxious due to the state of Yushibana. ...And I'd just made it up. That was all I could think it was."
    new "几分钟前，我还为丰花的景象心神不宁。……结果全是我自己编出来的。我只能这么想。"

    # game/script.rpy:47958
    old "I couldn't be relieved yet, because all around me, I could only see shutters. Only after one of them moved would any remaining doubt dissipate."
    new "可我还不能安心，因为放眼望去，全是落下的卷帘门。非得等到其中一扇动起来，剩下的疑虑才会消散。"

    # game/script.rpy:47959
    old "I leaned against the cold wall, questioning myself. ...It was such a horrible feeling."
    new "我靠在冰冷的墙上，反复问自己。……那种感觉真是糟透了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47969
    old "Very soon, I heard a loud grinding sound."
    new "没过多久，我听见一阵刺耳的摩擦声。"

    # game/script.rpy:47973
    old "I turned to the mug symbol and saw it rising, uncovering the dim interior through the glass."
    new "我朝那个杯子图案望去，只见它正缓缓升起，露出了玻璃后昏暗的店内。"

    # game/script.rpy:47974
    old "Darfee was inside with a ring of keys in his hand. He unlocked the door and pushed the shutter all the way up.{w} I approached nervously before he noticed me."
    new "Darfee 就在里面，手里拿着一串钥匙。他打开门锁，把卷帘门一直推到了顶。{w}我趁他还没注意到我，忐忑地走上前去。"

    # game/script.rpy:47979
    old "...!{w} Shiroya! What are you doing here so early?"
    new "……！{w}Shiroya！你怎么这么早就来了？"

    # game/script.rpy:47980
    old "...I was waiting for you to open. I really wanted to go somewhere, for some reason.{w} I thought you opened at {time=7:30}, though."
    new "……我在等你开门。不知怎么的，今天特别想出门。{w}不过我记着你 {time=7:30} 开门才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:47983
    old "...You're right, I'm sorry if I'm late. Have you been waiting for a while?"
    new "……你说得对，来晚了，抱歉。等很久了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:47985
    old "I've been here a bit, but don't worry."
    new "等了一会儿，不过没关系。"

    # game/script.rpy:47986
    old "...Well, now I feel bad. Come in... You must be really cold."
    new "……这可让我过意不去了。进来吧……你一定冻坏了。"

    # game/script.rpy:47994
    old "I went through the transparent door, lightly tapping the snow off my shoes. I was glad that everything was all right. I couldn't understand if something strange had really just happened, but the warmth alleviated my worries."
    new "我穿过透明的门，轻轻跺掉鞋上的雪。一切平安无事，这让我松了口气。刚才是否真的发生了什么怪事，我仍然想不明白，但屋里的暖意冲淡了我的不安。"

    # game/script.rpy:48002
    old "Sorry, it'll take a bit for the heat to get going."
    new "抱歉，暖气还得过一会儿才热得起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:48003
    old "That's fine. ...It's much better than outside."
    new "没关系。……比外面好多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:48007
    old "I stepped farther in and looked at the multitude of pastries behind the glass as I removed my hood. Meanwhile, Darfee grabbed a few chairs from a pile in the corner and put them beside the tables."
    new "我往里走了几步，一边摘下兜帽，一边望着玻璃柜里琳琅满目的糕点。Darfee 则从角落里的一摞椅子中抽出几把，摆到桌边。"

    # game/script.rpy:48010
    old "What do you want? These are all recently baked."
    new "要哪个？这些全是刚烤好的。"

    # game/script.rpy:48011
    old "I pointed at the same chocolate-covered one I'd had before, unaware of its name. I'd heard before that eating warm pastries wasn't healthy and to always wait for them to cool off, but I was too hungry to care."
    new "我指了指之前吃过的那种裹着巧克力的，尽管并不知道它叫什么名字。以前听过一种说法，刚出炉的糕点趁热吃对身体不好，要放凉了再吃，可我饿得顾不了这些。"

    # game/script.rpy:48014
    old "I eagerly waited while Darfee went behind the counter, biting in immediately after the tiny plate was placed in front of me."
    new "Darfee 绕到柜台后面，我满心期待地等着。小碟子刚一放到我面前，我立刻咬了一口。"

    # game/script.rpy:48017
    old "Darfee looked pretty busy preparing everything. He got two batches of bread out of the oven and placed them in the usual spot."
    new "Darfee 忙着准备各样东西。他从烤箱里取出两盘面包，放到惯常的位置上。"

    # game/script.rpy:48018
    old "...I'll need a coffee too."
    new "……再给我来一杯咖啡。"

    # game/script.rpy:48021
    old "The same way?"
    new "和上次一样？"

    # game/script.rpy:48023
    old "All right. Give me a moment."
    new "好，稍等一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:48026
    old "I'd felt completely rested after waking up, but that had drastically changed.{w} Staring at the wood, I kept biting the pastry, its warmth permeating my body."
    new "刚起床时我还觉得精神十足，如今却已大不相同。{w}我盯着木纹桌面，一口口咬着糕点，暖意渐渐渗进身体。"

    # game/script.rpy:48029
    old "Darfee put an empty cup below the coffee machine and filled it up."
    new "Darfee 把一只空杯放到咖啡机下面，接满了咖啡。"

    # game/script.rpy:48032
    old "Do you want to sit at a table?"
    new "要不要坐到桌边去？"

    # game/script.rpy:48036
    old "I looked behind me. Next to the low tables was the wide window, intercepting soft flakes of snow."
    new "我回头看去。矮桌旁是一扇宽大的窗，细软的雪花正落在窗上。"

    # game/script.rpy:48037
    old "Yeah. I'll sit there."
    new "嗯，我就坐那边。"

    # game/script.rpy:48038
    old "I'd already finished up the pastry, so I grabbed the cup by its rim and carefully brought it to the closest table."
    new "糕点已经吃完了，我捏着杯沿，小心地把咖啡端到最近的那张桌子。"

    # game/script.rpy:48042
    old "I sat on one of the two chairs, its angle allowing Ramon to be seen.{w} ...What had I been going on about? There were a number of pedestrians walking with an umbrella above them."
    new "我在两把椅子中的一把上坐下，这个角度正好能望见拉蒙街。{w}……我刚才都在胡思乱想些什么？路上有不少行人，头顶撑着伞。"

    # game/script.rpy:48043
    old "I touched the glass with a finger, feeling again how cold it was outside. With the other hand, I gripped the hot coffee tightly, a stark contrast. Then, I slowly brought it to my lips."
    new "我用一根手指碰了碰玻璃，再一次感到外面有多冷。另一只手紧紧握着滚烫的咖啡，冷热对比分明。然后，我慢慢把杯子送到唇边。"

    # game/script.rpy:48044
    old "...!{w=0.5} It's burning.{w} It's a lot less hot when I make it at home."
    new "……！{w=0.5}烫死了。{w}我自己在家冲的，可没这么烫。"

    # game/script.rpy:48045
    old "I placed it back down, Darfee still arranging everything properly behind the counter."
    new "我把杯子放回去，Darfee 还在柜台后有条不紊地整理着东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:48055
    old "I waited a bit for the coffee to cool off and started to drink it."
    new "我等咖啡稍微凉了些，才端起来喝。"

    # game/script.rpy:48056
    old "I finished it in a few sips.{w} Seconds later, I began to notice a faint headache, a frequent side effect coffee had on me."
    new "几口便见了底。{w}不过几秒，一阵隐隐的头痛就泛了上来——这是咖啡常给我带来的副作用。"

    # game/script.rpy:48059
    old "...Do you have any water?"
    new "……有水吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:48060
    old "Water? Yeah, of course."
    new "水？有，当然有。"

    # game/script.rpy:48061
    old "Darfee's head peeked out from under the counter, and he filled up a glass with a bottle of water. I stood to grab it from the other side and drank it in hopes of alleviating the pain."
    new "Darfee 从柜台底下探出头来，拿起一瓶水倒满了一杯。我起身从另一头接过，喝了下去，盼着能压住那阵疼。"

    # game/script.rpy:48064
    old "...The effect was almost immediate, and the pleasant change of temperature refreshed my mouth."
    new "……几乎立刻见效，温度一变，口中顿时清爽了许多。"

    # game/script.rpy:48065
    old "I reclined in the chair, still a little rattled."
    new "我靠回椅背，心里还有些发虚。"

    # game/script.rpy:48072
    old "I turned my head to the door after hearing it open. A man I hadn't seen outside entered the café and stepped up to the bar with moist footsteps."
    new "听见开门声，我转头看向门口。一个刚才在外面没见过的男人走进咖啡馆，脚步带着湿意，来到吧台前。"

    # game/script.rpy:48073
    old "\"What'll it be?\" Still looking a little busy, Darfee addressed him while he scanned the wooden trays behind the counter."
    new "「要点什么？」Darfee 似乎还在忙，一边问他，一边打量着柜台后面的木托盘。"

    # game/script.rpy:48074
    old "I'll have two loaves of spelt bread."
    new "我要两条斯佩尔特小麦面包。"

    # game/script.rpy:48075
    old "This one?"
    new "这一种？"

    # game/script.rpy:48076
    old "The man nodded, and Darfee packed both loaves into a thin bag that he handed over.{w} \"What else?\""
    new "男人点点头，Darfee 把两条面包装进一只薄袋子递过去。{w}「还要别的吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:48077
    old "That's all."
    new "就这些。"

    # game/script.rpy:48078
    old "It'll be ¥280, then."
    new "那就算 280 日元。"

    # game/script.rpy:48080
    old "\"Thank you.\" After being handed a few coins, Darfee bowed, and the man quietly walked out."
    new "「谢谢。」Darfee 接过几枚硬币，躬身道谢，男人便悄无声息地走了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:48086
    old "Following that, more people began to enter."
    new "那之后，进来的客人渐渐多了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:48087
    old "I saw everyone come in and out from my chair. Most of them had come to buy bread, which had almost run out already."
    new "我坐在椅子上，看着人来人往。多数人是来买面包的，而面包眼看就要卖光了。"

    # game/script.rpy:48088
    old "It was hard to believe the place would evolve throughout the day, becoming a bar in the evening. Everyone had instantly left without sitting anywhere, as the chairs and stools were primarily used later in the day.{w} The café was open the entire day on every day of the week. However, even though Darfee was the main person behind it, I'd frequently seen members of his family behind the counter. He couldn't do it all himself."
    new "很难想象这地方会在一天里变样，到了傍晚就成了酒吧。客人都是买完就走，谁也没坐下——椅子凳子多半是留给晚些时候用的。{w}咖啡馆一周七天，整天营业。可虽说这里主要靠 Darfee 操持，我也常看见他的家人站在柜台后。他一个人忙不过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:48091
    old "Once a few minutes had gone by without any new customers, Darfee addressed me."
    new "几分钟过去，没有新客人进门，Darfee 便跟我搭起话来。"

    # game/script.rpy:48096
    old "You've been here a while. Do you want anything else?"
    new "你在这儿待了好一阵子了。还要点别的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:48098
    old "...Hm.{w} I don't think so.{w} I'm still hungry, but I don't really want another pastry."
    new "……嗯。{w}不用了。{w}我还饿着，可实在不想再吃一块点心。"

    # game/script.rpy:48101
    old "That's fine.{w} ...Have you talked to your parents?"
    new "也好。{w}……跟你父母联系过了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:48102
    old "...Yeah, I called my mom the other day.{w} ...We talked a bit, but they're gonna stay where they are. I already mentioned that's also what I prefer."
    new "……嗯，前几天给我妈打过电话。{w}……聊了几句，他们还是打算留在那边。我也说过，这样正合我意。"

    # game/script.rpy:48105
    old "...Are you sure about that? Is it that you want to be alone or that you don't want your parents to come?"
    new "……你确定？是你想一个人待着，还是不想让父母回来？"

    # game/script.rpy:48106
    old "...{w}I think I prefer being alone, at least at home."
    new "……{w}我想我还是更喜欢一个人，至少在家里是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:48107
    old "I can understand that. I'm glad you're okay, but I suppose I can't really accept they won't come back. I was really shocked when I learned they'd moved away without you."
    new "我能理解。你没事，我很欣慰，可他们要是不回来，我实在没法坦然接受。听说他们撇下你搬走了，我真是吃了一惊。"

    # game/script.rpy:48110
    old "I didn't know what else to say. He realized I was looking a little down and changed the subject."
    new "我不知道还能说什么。他看出我有些低落，便换了话题。"

    # game/script.rpy:48113
    old "Well, I'm happy you came back already. You were there very early, though."
    new "总之，你这么快就回来了，我很高兴。不过，你来得可真早。"

    # game/script.rpy:48114
    old "I went to sleep pretty early too, and for some reason, I felt like going out somewhere again."
    new "我也睡得很早，不知怎么的，又忽然想出门走走。"

    # game/script.rpy:48115
    old "You should've at least grabbed an umbrella. But it's impressive how strong you are."
    new "至少也该带把伞。不过你身子骨倒挺硬朗。"

    # game/script.rpy:48116
    old "He smiled gently at me."
    new "他朝我温和地笑了笑。"

    # game/script.rpy:48117
    old "Oh, right, I guess he isn't aware that I'm still in the hospital. There's no reason he would know that without calling my parents.{w} Will he find out on the 8th...? I don't know what I'll say if he does."
    new "啊，对了，他大概还不知道我还在住院。他又没给我父母打过电话，本来也没理由知道。{w}到了 8 号，他会知道吗……？到时候我该说什么，自己也不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:48122
    old "So what have you been doing these last couple of days?"
    new "这两天你都在做些什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:48123
    old "...{w}Not much. I went to Atsuki's house yesterday, and I was there for a while."
    new "……{w}没做什么。昨天去了 Atsuki 家，待了好一阵子。"

    # game/script.rpy:48126
    old "Atsuki's house? You think being there helps you?"
    new "Atsuki 家？你觉得待在那儿对你有帮助？"

    # game/script.rpy:48127
    old "...I think so, yeah."
    new "……我想是有的。"

    # game/script.rpy:48129
    old "He looked saddened too, but I hadn't lied. I wasn't entirely certain how I was able to feel so tranquil at home by myself, but I suspected that if Atsuki hadn't invited me to his house from the hospital in the first place, I wouldn't have been able to bear it. The pain we'd felt from Miiya's death had practically hung in the air at his house, but we'd been able to withstand it together."
    new "他的神情也黯淡下来，可我并没有说谎。独自待在家里为什么能那样平静，我自己也说不清；但我猜，要是当初 Atsuki 没有把我从医院叫到他家，我怕是撑不住的。Miiya 的死带来的那份痛几乎弥漫在他家的空气里，可我们两个人一起，终究熬了过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:48132
    old "I don't want to put any pressure on you, but I'm curious if you have an idea about what you'll do. Last I heard, you were considering studying medicine, right?{w} ...Sorry, maybe this isn't a good time to ask these questions."
    new "我不想给你压力，只是想知道你心里有没有个打算。上次听你说，你在考虑学医，对吧？{w}……抱歉，也许现在不该问这些。"

    # game/script.rpy:48135
    old "Don't worry... I don't know, though.{w} I don't even know anything about medicine. It's just one of the few areas I think I could find interesting, but I'm not sure I want to keep studying. I think it's a lot more likely I'll try to find a job."
    new "别在意……不过，我自己也没想好。{w}我对医学本来就一无所知，只觉得那大概是我少数几个能提起兴趣的领域，可要不要继续读书，我也说不准。更有可能的是，我会去找份工作。"

    # game/script.rpy:48136
    old "Is that so? I was thinking that I wouldn't at all mind letting you work here a few hours a week. Would you be interested? It'd give you something to do, and you wouldn't have to depend exclusively on your parents."
    new "是这样吗？我倒觉得，让你每周来这儿干几个小时的活也没什么。有兴趣吗？这样你手头有点事做，也不必完全依靠父母。"

    # game/script.rpy:48137
    old "That offer came out of nowhere, and I was left a little shocked."
    new "这话来得突然，我一时有些发怔。"

    # game/script.rpy:48138
    old "Um... I don't know.{w} Maybe.{w} I'll think about it. Can I? I really appreciate it, though."
    new "呃……我不知道。{w}也许吧。{w}让我想想，可以吗？不过真的很谢谢你。"

    # game/script.rpy:48141
    old "Of course, this isn't a decision you have to rush, and it's an offer that isn't going anywhere, so tell me if you think it'd be good for you."
    new "当然，这事不用急着定，这个提议也一直有效。你要是觉得对你合适，就告诉我。"

    # game/script.rpy:48143
    old "Admittedly, if that had been proposed to me before December, I might've accepted immediately, as I'd been desperately lacking an actual path to take.{w} But part of me just wanted the days to continue. It was a selfish and impossible wish, but the two days of December I'd redone had possessed a calmness I'd rarely known despite my own paranoia."
    new "说实话，这话要是放在十二月之前对我说，我大概会一口答应——那时的我正急需一条实实在在的路。{w}可我心里有一部分，只盼着这样的日子能一直延续下去。这个愿望自私，也不可能实现；而在我重新度过的那两天里，尽管满心猜疑，却有一种我极少体会过的安宁。"

    # game/script.rpy:48149
    old "Someone opened the door, so Darfee had to attend them."
    new "有人推门进来，Darfee 只得去招呼。"

    # game/script.rpy:48152
    old "I looked through the glass. At Ramon, I could see a person dressed in a green uniform removing the snow on the ground. Some was still falling, but it had become too light to build up."
    new "我透过玻璃望去。拉蒙街上，一个穿绿色制服的人正在清扫地上的积雪。雪还在下，却已细得积不起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:48154
    old "After my brief talk with Darfee, I'd taken notice of something. Everything that I'd been worrying about for months had become meaningless."
    new "与 Darfee 简短交谈之后，我留意到一件事：这几个月来我一直忧心的一切，都已变得毫无意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:48155
    old "Technically, at the moment, none of that mattered anymore. Studying medicine, moving away, getting a job... All of that would be irrelevant if I traveled to the past again or if I modified history.{w} It would all have been for nothing. I would strive to prevent the death of a friend, isolating myself in a world where not a single thing of what I'd constantly worried about would occur."
    new "严格来说，此刻那些都已无关紧要。学医、搬离这里、找工作……只要我再次穿越回过去、改写历史，这一切便毫无意义。{w}全都付诸东流。我会一心阻止朋友的死，把自己封闭起来，活在一个我所担忧的种种都不会发生的世界里。"

    # game/script.rpy:48156
    old "...And I would really try to do it. Sitting on that chair, I'd sporadically feel a sharp pain in my chest. A pain warning me that it could've been my last visit to Ina and my last real day in Yushibana. Any day could have been my last one before needing to take action."
    new "……而且我真会那样做。坐在那把椅子上，胸口时而无端一阵刺痛。那痛楚像在警告我：这也许是我最后一次来伊娜咖啡馆，是我在丰花最后一个真正意义上的日子。在不得不行动之前，任何一天都可能是我的最后一天。"

    # game/script.rpy:48159
    old "I'd come to massively appreciate the odd serenity I could feel. For that reason, if the end of the countdown was that close, I'd try to prolong it a little bit more."
    new "我对这份奇异的宁静越来越珍惜。正因如此，若倒计时真的已近在眼前，我只想再多拖延一会儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:48160
    old "And since all I wished for was the calmness I felt, I remained on that chair where it existed, witnessing the outside world move through the glass."
    new "既然我所求的只是这份平静，我便一直坐在那把留住这份平静的椅子上，隔着玻璃看外面的世界流转。"

    # game/script.rpy:48168
    old "Letting the time pass was what I most and least wanted. I stayed there, glancing out and believing it was the best way to use the time I still had."
    new "任时间流逝，是我最想、也最不愿做的事。我留在原处，偶尔向外瞥一眼，相信这就是用掉余下时间的最好方式。"

    # game/script.rpy:48169
    old "Darfee noticed that, as he didn't resume the conversation once the silence had returned."
    new "Darfee 察觉到了这一点——沉默重新降临后，他再没有开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:48172
    old "There was nothing else I thought I could do on December 3rd. The only thing that remained was going to the tower and learning what would come next."
    new "12月3日这天，我想不出还能做别的什么。剩下的只有去那座塔，看看接下来会发生什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:48173
    old "Before that, there was only an optional step. It was deciding.{w} I still had the ability to choose. It wasn't true that going to the tower was essential for that."
    new "而在那之前，只有一个可选的步骤——做出决定。{w}我仍然有权选择。去塔里并不是做出选择的必要条件。"

    # game/script.rpy:48174
    old "No matter what I'd find there, deciding whether to change the past or not was possible, even though I'd done my best to believe that I'd never choose the latter.{w} After all, I'd touched the Sekimeiya to change the past, and it would've been for nothing if I later decided not to."
    new "无论在那里发现什么，我都仍有办法决定是否改变过去——尽管我一直极力让自己相信，我绝不会选择不改变过去。{w}毕竟，我触碰 Sekimeiya 就是为了改变过去；若到头来决定放手，那一番举动岂非白费。"

    # game/script.rpy:48175
    old "But perhaps that was wrong. I couldn't think anymore that touching the Sekimeiya would've been for nothing even if I decided not to alter history. The days I was living through did mean something to me."
    new "但也许我想错了。即便最终决定不去改写历史，我也不该认定触碰 Sekimeiya 是徒劳。我正在度过的这些日子，对我而言确实有意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:48179
    old "...What would actually happen if I step aside and choose not to go to the tower again? I don't think that'd actually be so simple either.{w} Late on the 15th, I disappeared from the tower, leaving the others behind. If everything happens as it did, Atsuki will try to travel to the past himself, and the problem of the recording will come back in full force."
    new "……如果我抽身而退，选择不再去那座塔，究竟会发生什么？我想事情也不会那么简单。{w}15日深夜，我从塔里消失，把其他人留在那里。若一切照旧发生，Atsuki 就会自己尝试穿越回过去，而录音的问题也会卷土重来。"

    # game/script.rpy:48180
    old "There really wasn't a single good option, so maybe deciding simply wasn't possible."
    new "确实没有一个好选项，也许根本无从决定。"

    # game/script.rpy:48181
    old "Instead of trying to determine which of the choices I had was better, would attempting to find a new one serve any purpose?"
    new "与其去权衡手中哪个选择更好，试着再找出一个选择，又有什么意义？"

    # game/script.rpy:48182
    old "There's just... nothing else, is there?"
    new "只是……再没有别的路了，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:48186
    old "There'd always been a concealed alternative that I'd been aware of, but it was so unthinkable that I'd chosen to immediately dismiss it."
    new "一直有一个我早就知道的隐藏选项，只是它太过不可想象，我才刚一想到就立刻打消了念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:48187
    old "If I didn't change the past, Miiya would stay dead, and so would the people who'd died in the tower. It was even possible Atsuki would too if the exit didn't open after twelve hours. At that point, I could try to enter the building through the storeroom or make the police do so, but if that door didn't actually lead outside, the recording had a chance to occur a month later."
    new "如果我不改变过去，Miiya 就永远活不过来，塔里死去的那些人也是。若十二小时后出口没有打开，连 Atsuki 都可能同样丧命。到那时，我也许可以试着从储藏室进入大楼，或者让警方从那里进去；可如果那扇门并不通向外面，那段录音就仍可能在一个月后成为现实。"

    # game/script.rpy:48188
    old "Even though I'd changed the past by calling my mother, that wouldn't necessarily prevent the events of the 15th from occurring—the version of me in the hospital at that moment could still travel back in time the same way I had.{w} I knew that could be wrong. If I still went back in time after my mom told me about the call she got when I was in the hospital, I wouldn't ever try to change the past by calling her. The distinction between that Shiroya and me already somewhat existed."
    new "即便我曾给母亲打过电话、改动了过去，也未必能阻止15日的事件发生——那一刻躺在医院里的那个我，仍可能像我当初一样回到过去。{w}但我知道这也未必。如果母亲告诉过我，我住院时她接到过那通电话，而我仍然回到了过去，那我就绝不会再试图通过给她打电话改变过去。那个 Shiroya 与我之间，某种程度上已经有所不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:48191
    old "So if that's not the case, and I further change the past, the only negative is that the self of mine currently in the hospital will stop being me, and I'll have to abandon my current life. I'm... not really sure I could do that."
    new "那么，如果情况并非如此，而我又进一步改写过去，唯一的坏处就是此刻在医院里的那个我将不再是我，而我也必须舍弃现在的人生。我……不确定自己真能做到。"

    # game/script.rpy:48192
    old "Then yes, of course, there was a way to prevent that from happening.{w} Upon changing the past, the problematic variable was solely the other version of myself. Therefore, by removing that variable, I'd have everything I wanted.{w} ...But that wasn't something I could seriously consider.{w} That possibility simply didn't exist.{w=0.8}{nw}"
    new "那么，当然，确实有办法阻止这件事发生。{w}一旦改变过去，成问题的变量就只剩下另一个自己。既然如此，只要消除这个变量，我想要的一切便都能得到。{w}……但这不是我能认真考虑的事。{w}那种可能根本不存在。{w=0.8}{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:48196
    old "I'd spent a very long time beside that glass as it was marked by unending snow. I was getting alarmingly hungry, but for as long as I stayed there, I would be fine."
    new "我在那扇玻璃旁坐了很久，外面的雪一直下个不停，玻璃上满是雪痕。饥饿已到了令人发慌的地步，但只要还留在这里，就不会有事。"

    # game/script.rpy:48197
    old "Through the glass and the whirls of white, I was able to see the sun. It had reached the center of the sky."
    new "透过玻璃与纷飞的雪片，我望见了太阳。它已经升到天空正中。"

    # game/script.rpy:48198
    old "I continued staring through it, watching the part of Yushibana that had become as lively as always."
    new "我继续透过玻璃望去，看着丰花那一带又恢复了一如往常的喧闹。"

    # game/script.rpy:48206
    old "That was until I recognized something in the distance."
    new "直到我认出远处的一样东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:48212
    old "Axis Ropeway"
    new "Axis 索道"

    # game/script.rpy:48214
    old "I stood up from the chair, realizing that I had forgotten something."
    new "我意识到自己忘了某件事，从椅子上站起身来。"

    # game/script.rpy:48215
    old "...I'll be leaving. How much is it?"
    new "……我要走了。多少钱？"

    # game/script.rpy:48218
    old "What? You still think that you have to pay?"
    new "什么？你还觉得自己非付钱不可？"

    # game/script.rpy:48219
    old "Just tell me. I'll feel bad about coming so often if I don't pay."
    new "你就说吧。来得这么勤还不付钱，我心里过意不去。"

    # game/script.rpy:48222
    old "That's mean...{w} It's ¥300."
    new "真伤人……{w}300日元。"

    # game/script.rpy:48223
    old "I took my wallet out and paid with the exact amount."
    new "我掏出钱包，付了正好的数目。"

    # game/script.rpy:48224
    old "Thank you. Sorry for leaving so suddenly, but I need to be somewhere."
    new "谢谢。抱歉突然就走，我还有地方要去。"

    # game/script.rpy:48227
    old "Don't worry. You know you can come back any time."
    new "别在意。你知道的，随时都可以再来。"

    # game/script.rpy:48228
    old "I nodded and left, flipping up my hood."
    new "我点点头，拉起兜帽，转身离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:48234
    old "I walked directly to Ramon street. In the distance, I had recognized a purse.{w} ...After staring at it for a few seconds, I knew exactly where I'd seen it."
    new "我径直走向拉蒙街。远处，我认出了一只手提包。{w}……盯着它看了几秒，我便想起在哪儿见过它。"

    # game/script.rpy:48239
    old "I dashed toward the direction it had been. Right above the purse, an umbrella was covering the face of its owner."
    new "我朝它刚才所在的方向奔去。手提包上方，一把伞遮住了持包人的脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:48240
    old "But that didn't matter. I knew that purse. While identical ones could exist, I'd recognized it as... Isla's."
    new "但那无关紧要。我认得那只包。就算有一模一样的，我也认得出，那是……Isla 的。"

    # game/script.rpy:48243
    old "I ran to the street the umbrella had turned to. Even though I hadn't seen the face of the person holding it, that umbrella was lower to the ground than all the others..."
    new "我跑向那把伞拐进去的街道。虽说没看清撑伞人的脸，可那把伞比周围所有的伞都低……"

    # game/script.rpy:48244
    old "I started moving faster as I reached an area with less snow stuck to the pavement. Ramon was pretty crowded, so I wasn't sure if anyone had been walking beside that umbrella, but I'd recalled something else I'd entirely forgotten about."
    new "走上积雪较少的路面后，我加快了脚步。拉蒙街上人不少，我不确定有没有人和那把伞并肩而行，但我又想起了一件被自己忘得干干净净的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:48245
    old "Isla's friend... That's right. They must be here."
    new "Isla 的朋友……对了。那个人一定就在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:48246
    old "A sudden wave of bleariness crashed through my head, demanding me to slow down, but I didn't stop until I'd arrived at the dimmer street I'd seen the umbrella at."
    new "一阵突如其来的眩晕冲上头顶，逼我放慢脚步，可我一路没停，直到走到我看见那把伞的那条昏暗街巷。"

    # game/script.rpy:48253
    old "I couldn't see anyone.{w} There were multiple doors on both sides and more branching paths farther ahead."
    new "我看不到任何人。{w}两侧有好几扇门，前方还有更多岔路。"

    # game/script.rpy:48254
    old "I don't know what happened to me this morning, but today's definitely a school day. ...If that was really Isla, it could've actually been her \"friend\", right?{w} Was I correct, and her identity was Isla herself?"
    new "不知道今天早上我到底是怎么了，但今天确实是上学的日子。……如果那真是 Isla，那说不定其实是她的「朋友」？{w}我猜得对吗？那个人的身份就是 Isla 本人？"

    # game/script.rpy:48255
    old "That thought had seemed a little strange in the tower for a number of reasons.{w} She couldn't have gone back in time to repeat exactly what she'd lived through, but I had since learned that a long travel like that could've happened without needing to store energy for a month."
    new "在塔里时，这个念头因为种种原因显得有些奇怪。{w}她不可能回到过去，把经历过的日子原样重演一遍；但后来我得知，那样的长途穿越并不需要蓄能一个月也能实现。"

    # game/script.rpy:48257
    old "I looked down. From there onward, snow still covered the ground. As a result, I was able to see a pair of footprints, smaller and less faded than the rest, disappearing ahead."
    new "我低下头。从这里往前，地面仍覆着雪。因此我看见了一对脚印——比其余的都要小，也都要清晰，一路延伸到前方，消失不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:48258
    old "I stepped forward, careful not to lose track of them. The buildings weren't casting dark shadows on the ground, so I was able to follow them without mixing them up."
    new "我迈步向前，小心不跟丢。建筑物没有在地面投下浓重的阴影，所以我能一路追下去，不至于认错。"

    # game/script.rpy:48263
    old "I went all the way down the street, where the footprints turned to the right.{w} Once again, I was close to Atsuki's house, but the marks on the ground deviated from it. There was still no indication of them ending, and I wasn't able to see anyone farther ahead."
    new "我一路沿着街道走到尽头，脚印在那里向右拐去。{w} 我又一次来到 Atsuki 家附近，可地上的痕迹却偏离了那里。脚印仍没有到头的迹象，前方也望不见半个人影。"

    # game/script.rpy:48264
    old "I'd been trying to go fast, but once again, the footprints turned to the right and I couldn't spot the umbrella."
    new "我本想走得快些，可脚印又一次向右拐去，那把伞始终不见踪影。"

    # game/script.rpy:48269
    old "Isn't this a dead end?"
    new "这不是死路吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:48270
    old "Like I thought, that turn brought me to a short street filled with houses. That meant the footprints had to end at a door."
    new "果然如我所料，那个拐弯把我带到一条短短的小街，两旁尽是住家。也就是说，脚印一定停在了某扇门前。"

    # game/script.rpy:48275
    old "And they did. When I lifted my head, I saw a house, the trail ending at its entrance."
    new "果然如此。我抬起头，一栋房子映入眼帘，那道痕迹止于它的门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:48279
    old "Does Isla live here?{w} ...Should I ring the bell?"
    new "这里是 Isla 的家吗？{w} ……我该按门铃吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:48284
    old "Instead, I warily stepped back, as letting myself be seen had some worrying implications."
    new "我没有按，反而警惕地后退了一步——被人看见，后果实在令人不安。"

    # game/script.rpy:48285
    old "Even if I'd just seen an Isla who'd traveled from the future, while the original one was likely to not be home, it was very possible Erina was. She'd told us that she once found out Isla hadn't gone to school, so there was nothing stopping her from being inside right then."
    new "即便我刚见到的只是从未来穿越而来的 Isla，原本那个 Isla 多半不在家，Erina 却很可能会在。她说过，她曾发现 Isla 没去上学，所以此刻她人在屋里也毫不奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:48286
    old "Whether I ring the bell or not... that's the same as finally deciding whether to change the past or not."
    new "按不按门铃……就等于最终决定要不要改变过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:48287
    old "I'd like to know who Isla's friend is, and if it really is herself, I might learn something very important from her. However, it's also possible Erina will see me, which will change things pretty drastically..."
    new "我想知道 Isla 的朋友究竟是谁；如果真是她自己，我或许能从她口中得知极重要的事。可与此同时，我也可能被 Erina 撞见，那事情就会天翻地覆……"

    # game/script.rpy:48290
    old "I looked at the building from behind a car. I couldn't see light through any of the windows, and nobody else was close by."
    new "我躲在一辆车后面打量那栋房子。没有一扇窗透出灯光，附近也没有别人。"

    # game/script.rpy:48291
    old "I needed to make up my mind, but it was impossible...! If I pressed the button next to the door, the rest of my life might have gone up in smoke."
    new "我必须下定决心，可这根本做不到……！只要按下门旁的那个按钮，我的余生说不定就会化为泡影。"

    # game/script.rpy:48292
    old "Is it true that the past will only change if I want it to? If so, I could try to ring without that being my intention, but that's so risky. I don't know how it works...!"
    new "过去真的只在我希望它改变时才会改变吗？如果是这样，我大可以试着不带这个意图去按铃，可这太冒险了。我根本不知道其中的原理……！"

    # game/script.rpy:48296
    old "I felt my heart racing as I worried about making any rushed action."
    new "我害怕自己一时冲动做出什么，心脏怦怦直跳。"

    # game/script.rpy:48297
    old "Should I just watch from here and try to observe who the friend is?{w} Maybe I should just leave. I know where Isla lives now, so I can try to prevent them from going to the tower on the 15th.{w} That might be best."
    new "还是说，我该在这里守着，看看那位朋友究竟是谁？{w} 也许我干脆离开算了。我已经知道 Isla 住在哪里，可以设法阻止她们在十五号那天去塔里。{w} 那样或许最好。"

    # game/script.rpy:48299
    old "If I were to do that, and Isla's friend is really herself, she'd end up in the same situation as me, stuck in a world with two versions of her.{w} What will happen after that? How would the world even take it? If they don't go to the tower, Isla won't be able to travel to the past. Will that simply not matter, and both of them will continue to live?{w} If her existence gets overwritten, mine will be too, right?"
    new "可要是我真那么做，而 Isla 的朋友确实就是她自己，那她就会落到和我一样的境地——被困在一个同时存在两个自己的世界里。{w} 之后会怎样？世界又承受得住吗？如果她们不去那座塔，Isla 就无法穿越到过去。难道这根本无关紧要，两个人都能继续活下去？{w} 可要是她的存在被覆盖，我的存在不也会一样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:48300
    old "How was I supposed to reason any of that out when I knew nothing about what would happen?"
    new "我对将会发生什么一无所知，又怎么可能理得清这些？"

    # game/script.rpy:48301
    old "Time was passing with no progress being made. Every time I questioned what to do, the same fundamental bifurcation emerged; I needed to know what I wanted."
    new "时间一点点流逝，事情却毫无进展。每当我自问该怎么办，总会面临同一个根本的分岔；我必须弄清自己究竟想要什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:48305
    old "Can I not do it? Is it actually impossible to decide?"
    new "难道我做不到吗？难道真的无法做出决定？"

    # game/script.rpy:48306
    old "It shouldn't be, right? Even if I don't like any of the choices, there has to be one I prefer.{w} If they're all equally bad, then I can just choose one to stick to, can't I? I can just decide my entire life like that."
    new "不该如此吧？就算没有哪个选项让我满意，总该有一个我更中意的。{w} 要是它们一样糟，那我随便挑一个坚持到底不就行了？我的人生就可以这样定下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:48308
    old "I need to do it, and this is when. I'm stretching out the time I have too much, and I could end up immensely regretting it at any point."
    new "我必须做出决定，就是现在。我拖得太久了，随时都可能追悔莫及。"

    # game/script.rpy:48309
    old "I just have to decide now. Even if I wish I'd made another choice later, I can't know that now. So I just need to make the decision based on what I feel at this moment."
    new "现在就必须决定。就算日后会后悔当初该选另一个，此刻的我也无从知晓。既然如此，我只能凭此刻的心意来选。"

    # game/script.rpy:48314
    old "But even after thinking all that, I didn't move from behind the car. My thoughts were in complete disarray."
    new "可即便想完了这些，我仍没有从车后挪开半步。思绪乱成一团。"

    # game/script.rpy:48316
    old "I finally stepped out and inspected the dark windows. If I didn't care about changing the past again, trying to reach Isla's friend was the right call."
    new "我终于走了出来，打量着那些昏暗的窗户。如果我不在乎再次改变过去，那么设法找到 Isla 的朋友才是正确的选择。"

    # game/script.rpy:48317
    old "But of course I cared. I couldn't suddenly press a button that would influence my whole life."
    new "可我当然在乎。我不可能贸然按下那个会影响我一生的按钮。"

    # game/script.rpy:48325
    old "I looked at the way I'd come from.{w} Nobody was there."
    new "我回头望向来路。{w} 空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:48326
    old "I could see my footprints coming toward me, so I quietly traced them, peeking at the previous street."
    new "我能看见自己的脚印一路延伸过来，便顺着脚印悄悄回望，窥探先前的那条街。"

    # game/script.rpy:48332
    old "Again, nobody was in sight."
    new "依旧不见半个人影。"

    # game/script.rpy:48334
    old "I had felt the same sensation as the day before. I didn't know if I'd noticed a sound or a movement, but my head had suddenly turned to that corner.{w} I looked at the ground, but many footprints were there, and due to the falling snow, it was hard to tell which were recent."
    new "我又有了和昨天相同的感觉。我分不清自己是听见了声响还是看到了动静，头却猛地转向了那个角落。{w} 我低头看地面，那里脚印杂乱，加上落雪不停，很难分辨哪些是新的。"

    # game/script.rpy:48335
    old "Is it just me? ...It's not, right?{w} Yesterday, someone was definitely following me. Did I only imagine it this time?"
    new "是我的错觉吗？……不是吧？{w} 昨天确实有人在跟踪我。这一次难道只是我多心了？"

    # game/script.rpy:48340
    old "I looked left and right, confirming I was alone."
    new "我左右张望，确认四下无人。"

    # game/script.rpy:48341
    old "I still felt that Vaisude might have followed me, but he wouldn't do it again..."
    new "我仍觉得可能是 Vaisude 跟了过来，可他不会再做这种事了吧……"

    # game/script.rpy:48342
    old "Could it be Isla...?{w} No, the footprints I saw yesterday belonged to an adult."
    new "会是 Isla 吗……？{w} 不对，昨天我看到的脚印分明属于一个成年人。"

    # game/script.rpy:48343
    old "I tried to compose myself and walked farther into the street."
    new "我定了定神，继续朝街道深处走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:48344
    old "I should just leave. I'm not gonna be able to ring the bell."
    new "我还是走吧。这门铃，我终究按不下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:48345
    old "I felt a deep unease at the concept of someone watching me from a distance. I couldn't understand why they would, and it put even more pressure on me."
    new "一想到有人可能在远处盯着我，我就深感不安。我不明白对方为何要这样做，这让我更加喘不过气。"

    # game/script.rpy:48346
    old "I was still fairly hungry and far from my apartment, but if I went home in a straight line, I'd have to go through all the deserted streets before getting back to the center.{w} I didn't want to do that if someone was observing me in secret."
    new "我还挺饿的，离家又远，可要是径直回家，就得先穿过那一整片冷清的街巷，才能回到市中心。{w} 若真有人在暗中窥视我，我可不想走那条路。"

    # game/script.rpy:48351
    old "I was close to the outskirts, so instead of going back, I kept on ahead."
    new "我已经靠近城郊，索性没有折返，继续向前走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:48357
    old "When the curved street came to an end and the short houses stopped, the sight to the tall mountains was wide open. I was at the start of the mountain range, close to the valley that led out of Yushibana."
    new "弯曲的街道走到尽头，低矮的房屋也到了头，高耸的山峦豁然展现在眼前。我已来到山脉的起点，离那条通往丰花之外的山谷不远了。"

    # game/script.rpy:48358
    old "I hadn't seen anyone yet, and there were barely any footprints around. If I'd been followed again, I had surely gone the opposite way."
    new "我始终没见到半个人影，周围也几乎没有脚印。若这次又被人跟踪，那我肯定已经走了相反的路。"

    # game/script.rpy:48359
    old "I spun in place, confirming again that nobody was there. I doubted anyone was watching me based on where I was. The only place they could be hiding was within some covered windows fairly far away."
    new "我原地转了一圈，再次确认无人。以我现在的位置，我不觉得会有人盯着我。对方若真要藏身，也只能躲进远处那些拉着窗帘的窗户后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:48360
    old "Noticing the slight weight on my head, I shook off the snow piled on it. Then, I kept walking, my boots sinking deeply into the snow."
    new "察觉头顶多了些分量，我甩掉积在那里的雪，继续往前走，靴子深深陷进雪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:48366
    old "The path outlining Yushibana was not well-maintained. Tall weeds dominated it, unfazed by the snow. I'd learned to avoid coming back from Atsuki's house through that route, as it tended to be hard to traverse."
    new "环绕丰花的那条小路疏于打理，高高的杂草占了上风，全然不惧积雪。我早就学会避开这条路，从 Atsuki 家回来时不走它，因为它向来难走。"

    # game/script.rpy:48367
    old "Ahead of me, I saw a thin path going up the mountain. Like the entire hill, it was coated in snow, but the lack of grass peeking up highlighted the way."
    new "前方有一条细窄的小径通向山上。它和整座山坡一样覆着白雪，只因没有杂草冒头，反倒显出了路的轮廓。"

    # game/script.rpy:48368
    old "I reached the split and instinctively took the path up the large mountain."
    new "来到岔路口，我下意识地走上了通往大山的那条路。"

    # game/script.rpy:48376
    old "Due to another impulse, I found myself climbing the steep path, leaving behind the straight and plain one. I knew it would level out soon and lead home despite taking longer."
    new "又是一时冲动，我撇下那条笔直平坦的路，沿陡坡向上爬去。我知道这条路很快便会平缓下来，虽然绕远，终究还是通向家里。"

    # game/script.rpy:48377
    old "All around me, I could only see dried bushes covered in white and tall trees scattered around. I knew the mountains were frequently visited, but I couldn't make out any indications of people having been there."
    new "四下望去，只能看见覆着白雪的枯灌木，还有零星散布的高大树木。我知道这座山常有人来，却看不出任何有人涉足的痕迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:48382
    old "I'd turned to that path due to the conversation I'd had with Atsuki in one of the hallway A crystal rooms. It had been so long since both of us had taken that path, but walking up all by myself was still somehow familiar."
    new "我之所以走上这条路，是因为曾在 A走廊的一间水晶展室里和 Atsuki 交谈过。我们俩已经很久没走过这条路了，可独自一人爬上来，竟仍觉得有种说不出的熟悉。"

    # game/script.rpy:48383
    old "Would we ever go up together again? That was also something I had to choose."
    new "我们还有机会一起上去吗？这也是我必须做出的选择。"

    # game/script.rpy:48388
    old "The wind was noticeably stronger higher up. The terrain there was plain, and the way branched out.{w} Higher still was the entrance to the caves, whereas the path to the right would take me close to home."
    new "越往高处，风明显越强。那里地势平坦，道路分了岔。{w}再往上便是洞穴入口，而右边的路则能通到我家附近。"

    # game/script.rpy:48389
    old "I turned around to witness the sight I'd earned."
    new "我转过身，去看这份辛苦换来的景色。"

    # game/script.rpy:48398
    old "The entirety of Yushibana covered by snow... The sight was as pleasant as it had always been, intensified by the moving curtain of falling flakes, which appeared much denser from above."
    new "整个丰花都被雪覆盖……这景象一如往常那样令人心旷神怡，而纷纷扬扬的落雪如帘幕般流动，从高处看去更显密集，又为它添了几分韵味。"

    # game/script.rpy:48399
    old "I looked at the way I'd come from, but even from that position, I wasn't able to see anyone. Only when I peered at the center of town was I able to notice the tiny movements of people on the streets."
    new "我望向来时的路，可即便站在这个位置，也看不见半个人影。直到凝神望向镇中心，才辨出街上行人细小的动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:48400
    old "There wasn't a place I couldn't see. The hospital was close to where I was, most of its windows covered from within. In the distance, the Zubesout Trash Disposal looked like a perfect circle, appearing as elegant as every other place thanks to the snow."
    new "没有哪里是我看不到的。医院就在离我不远的地方，大部分窗户从里面遮了起来。远处，Zubesout 垃圾处理场看上去是个完美的圆形，积雪让它和其他地方一样显得雅致。"

    # game/script.rpy:48401
    old "And of course, close to it, Ashiya Tower. It was rare to see the top of it, but the snow almost made it blend in completely."
    new "当然，还有近旁的芦屋塔。平时很难看清塔顶，可积雪几乎让它彻底隐没在一片白茫茫之中。"

    # game/script.rpy:48402
    old "I looked down to its entrance. I could just barely make it out despite the distance and whirls of snow, but there was no shutter in place."
    new "我俯视它的入口。隔着这段距离和漫天飞雪，我只能勉强看清，但那里并没有卷帘门。"

    # game/script.rpy:48405
    old "Despite the harsh wind hitting my face, I kept watching with both hands in my pockets, trying not to let the snow fall inside."
    new "寒风扑在脸上，我双手插在口袋里，仍一直望着，免得雪落进口袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:48406
    old "A very important decision still needed to be made, and even ignoring that decision was its own decision. Was there going to be a better time? As soon as I asked myself that, I knew the answer."
    new "还有一个极其重要的决定等着我去做，而即便对它置之不理，本身也是一种决定。还会有更合适的时机吗？这个问题刚在心里浮现，我就知道了答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:48407
    old "Would I try to alter the fate of the town, trapped in a shrouded sequence of events revolving around a magical gemstone?"
    new "我要不要去改变这座小镇的命运？它被一连串事件困住了，而那些事都围绕着一颗魔法宝石，笼罩在迷雾之中。"

    # game/script.rpy:48408
    old "Would I try to save Miiya and the people I'd met that day at the cost of my own normal life? Even if I succeeded, I would have to keep on living in circumstances I couldn't even fathom."
    new "我要不要拿自己平静的生活作代价，去救 Miiya 和那天遇见的那些人？就算成功了，我也得在无法想象的处境里继续活下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:48409
    old "I had felt like I'd been living in a mire, and when I was finally pulled out of it, I lost everything. The incident in the tower had only made things worse, and I'd finally been saved from it only to be subsequently forced into destroying my own life as the \"right\" answer."
    new "我总觉得自己一直陷在泥沼里，而当我终于被拉出来时，却失去了一切。塔里那起事件只是让一切更糟；我好不容易从中脱身，转头却又被迫把毁掉自己的人生当作「正确」的答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:48413
    old "I didn't know if I could accomplish it, but the choice was about whether to try it. I could be caught by the police or be beaten to the punch by someone else from the future. If the latter happened, I was letting it happen by not acting. It was my own fault.{w} It was all a mess, and there was no way not to make it one. I wanted to talk to Miiya again, but even if I saved her, that wouldn't happen.{w} She hadn't deserved to die, so I could trade positions with her. I wouldn't even be doing it for some twisted form of recognition, as nobody would know what had happened—my other self would exist in my place, and I'd step aside."
    new "我不知道自己能否做到，但这个选择的关键只在于要不要去尝试。我可能被警察抓住，也可能被另一个来自未来的人抢先一步。若是后者，那就等于我袖手旁观、任由它发生，是我自己的错。{w}一切都乱成一团，而且无论如何都注定会乱。我想再和 Miiya 说说话，可就算救了她，这也办不到。{w}她本不该死，那么我可以和她互换位置。我这么做甚至不是为了某种扭曲的认可——没有人会知道发生了什么；另一个我会取代我的位置，而我退到一旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:48414
    old "I looked at the tower, knowing the Sekimeiya was inside.{w} Who else in that town knew about what had happened on the 15th? I wished I could know that."
    new "我望着那座塔，知道 Sekimeiya 就在里面。{w}这座镇子上，还有谁知道15号那天发生了什么？我真希望能知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:48415
    old "I just have to go in, find where the Sekimeiya is, and check if I can open the door in the storeroom. I just have to do that, determine what I can do, and enter again during the night."
    new "我只要进去，找到 Sekimeiya 在哪里，再确认自己能否打开储藏室的门。做完这些，弄清自己能做什么，然后夜里再进去一趟就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:48416
    old "But that wasn't the problem. I would only go back to the tower after knowing whether I truly wanted the past to change."
    new "可问题不在这里。只有在弄清自己是否真的想让过去改变之后，我才会再回那座塔。"

    # game/script.rpy:48417
    old "So, would I attempt to alter the hellish world I'd experienced at the cost of the life I'd always had, or would I give up on using the Sekimeiya again, accepting the cards we'd been dealt to create the best future we had at hand?"
    new "那么，我是要拿自己一直以来的生活作代价，去改变那个我亲身经历过的地狱般的世界；还是放弃再次使用 Sekimeiya，接受已经拿到的牌，尽力创造眼前最好的未来？"

    # game/script.rpy:48425
    old "Step aside and wait out the days."
    new "退到一旁，等这些日子过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:48427
    old "Try to change the past."
    new "试着改变过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:48432
    old "Mirage"
    new "蜃景"

    # game/script.rpy:48449
    old "That was the answer. She wasn't disappointed in herself or sad about what would come. ...Shiroya was relieved to know that she'd made a decision."
    new "那就是答案。她没有对自己失望，也没有为即将到来的一切感到悲伤。……知道自己已经做出了决定，Shiroya 反倒松了口气。"

    # game/script.rpy:48450
    old "She didn't know what would happen from there. Would Ashiya Tower be locked up for an entire month? If so, then it seemed hard to believe the storeroom door would work to free the remaining people."
    new "她不知道接下来会发生什么。芦屋塔会被封锁整整一个月吗？若真如此，就很难指望储藏室的门能把剩下的人放出来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:48451
    old "What that meant was that she had a few days for herself. Immediately after that, Shiroya didn't know what shape the future would take, but she believed that she and Atsuki would get through it. Her goal was solely to enjoy the remaining time she had.{w} Despite that, seeing a bustling street while she walked down the mountain, she only felt empty."
    new "这意味着，她还有几天属于自己的时间。之后会变成什么样，Shiroya 无从知晓，但她相信自己和 Atsuki 能撑过去。她的目标只是好好享受剩下的时光。{w}然而，下山途中望着熙熙攘攘的街道，她心里却只觉得空落落的。"

    # game/script.rpy:48454
    old "At least, that was hypothetically what would have happened. However, it simply wasn't to be."
    new "至少，那只是假想中会发生的情形。然而，事情偏偏没有那样发展。"

    # game/script.rpy:48458
    old "More precisely, her surroundings at that moment didn't remotely resemble a mountain."
    new "准确说来，她此刻身处的环境与山间没有半点相似之处。"

    # game/script.rpy:48464
    old "They were dark and eerie. The person closest to her was someone she'd never spoken with."
    new "四周幽暗而诡异。离她最近的那个人，她从未与对方说过话。"

    # game/script.rpy:48465
    old "Why...?"
    new "为什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:48466
    old "This world has not been frozen, but modified for convenience and familiarity. Ordinarily, this shape would be unlikely to be constructed, but it is needed to emphasize certain aspects."
    new "这个世界并没有被冻结，而是为了方便和熟悉做了改动。通常来说，这样的形态不太可能被构造出来，但为了突出某些方面，它又是必要的。"

    # game/script.rpy:48467
    old "...Where is Shiroya now, and how did she get there?"
    new "……Shiroya 现在在哪里？她又是怎么到那儿的？"

    # game/script.rpy:48481
    old "Shiroya had traveled fifteen days through time and found herself underground."
    new "Shiroya 穿越了十五天的时间，最后发现自己身处地下。"

    # game/script.rpy:48482
    old "Her decision would end up being not to attempt to change history, never entering Ashiya Tower again. Naturally, at this point, she didn't know that."
    new "她最终的决定，是不去尝试改变历史，从此再也不踏进芦屋塔。当然，此时的她还不知道这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:48486
    old "After exiting the inclined tunnel, she saw the entirety of Yushibana, the sun long since fallen behind the horizon."
    new "走出那条倾斜的隧道后，丰花全城尽收眼底，太阳早已落到地平线之下。"

    # game/script.rpy:48491
    old "She wandered through the dim streets, arriving at the shop where the explosion had occurred. Feeling extremely beaten down and ultimately unaware of what had happened, she walked to her apartment."
    new "她在昏暗的街道上漫无目的地走着，来到那家发生爆炸的店铺前。她心力交瘁，也始终不知道究竟发生了什么，就这样走回了自己的公寓。"

    # game/script.rpy:48496
    old "She had been in the tower only minutes ago, where she'd discussed using the Sekimeiya one more time with the hope that the past could really be changed. At home, however, she hurried to her bed, where she lay with the clothes that had been dampened so long ago."
    new "几分钟前她还在塔里，谈论着再一次使用 Sekimeiya，指望过去真的能够改变。可一回到家，她便匆匆扑到床上，穿着那身许久以前就被打湿的衣服躺下。"

    # game/script.rpy:48503
    old "The next day, she felt the urge to leave her apartment. It was noon, as she'd slept for a very long time. Outside, though, what would happen? Would anyone call her out for having come from the future?"
    new "第二天，她很想走出公寓。她睡了很久，醒来已是正午。可到了外面，又会怎样？会不会有人指责她是从未来回来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:48507
    old "She wandered mindlessly, witnessing the life that had once disappeared around her."
    new "她漫无目的地游荡，看着周遭曾经消失的生活重新回到眼前。"

    # game/script.rpy:48510
    old "And she ended up at the entrance to Ina Café, where she would surely be recognized. However, she suddenly stopped when a note stuck to the shutter caught her notice."
    new "最后，她来到了伊娜咖啡馆门前——在那里她一定会被认出来。然而，贴在卷帘门上的一张纸条忽然吸引了她的注意，她停住了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:48511
    old "It was on top of the drawing of a coffee mug she'd never seen. She got closer and read what it said."
    new "纸条贴在一幅她从未见过的咖啡杯图案上方。她凑近去看上面写了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:48514
    old "\"We apologize, but due to personal matters, we will be closed most days of the week. We hope this will only last for a short time.\""
    new "「很抱歉，因个人事务，本店一周的大部分日子暂停营业。希望这只是暂时的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:48515
    old "Shiroya could hardly believe what she'd read. In many years, she'd never seen Ina closed, and even though the note was written in plural, she knew the person who'd written it had to be the one who worked there almost every day."
    new "Shiroya 几乎不敢相信自己读到的东西。这么多年，她从没见过伊娜咖啡馆关门；尽管纸条上用的是复数措辞，她也知道写这张纸条的，一定是那个几乎每天都在店里工作的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:48516
    old "Was it the universe's warning, telling her that she wasn't allowed to be seen? Perhaps Darfee seeing her would have created an impossibility that the universe had prevented."
    new "这是不是宇宙给她的警告，告诉她不该被人看见？也许 Darfee 见到她会造成某种不可能，宇宙便把它阻止了。"

    # game/script.rpy:48517
    old "After staring at the note for a long time, she walked away. Hesitant to step into the busy crowd, she went the opposite way, wondering about the cause of Darfee's absence."
    new "盯着那张纸条看了许久，她才转身离开。她不愿走进熙攘的人群，便朝相反的方向走去，心里想着 Darfee 究竟为何不在。"

    # game/script.rpy:48520
    old "She hadn't visited the café in a long time, so she didn't know how long that note had been there. No matter the reason, she felt a little worried for Darfee, who'd always been kind to her."
    new "她很久没来过这家咖啡馆，所以不知道那张纸条贴了多久。无论原因是什么，她都有些担心 Darfee——那个人一向待她很亲切。"

    # game/script.rpy:48524
    old "Just what should she do...? She hadn't eaten much, so her head started to feel a little cloudy."
    new "她究竟该怎么办……？没吃多少东西，脑袋渐渐有些发昏。"

    # game/script.rpy:48525
    old "Distracted, she jumped when a sudden noise came from behind her."
    new "她正心神不宁，身后冷不防传来一声响，惊得她浑身一颤。"

    # game/script.rpy:48529
    old "She turned around and saw a still car in the middle of the road. Its driver burst out and dashed to the front.{w} \"Oh my God! Are you okay!? Hey...!\""
    new "她回过头，只见路中央停着一辆一动不动的车。司机冲下车，直奔车头。{w}「天哪！你没事吧！？喂……！」"

    # game/script.rpy:48530
    old "From farther ahead, Shiroya stared, terrified. However, a parked car prevented her from seeing what was on the snowy asphalt."
    new "Shiroya 在更前方，惊恐地望着这边，可一辆停着的车挡住了她的视线，她看不见积雪的柏油路面上是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:48532
    old "\"What the fuck!? I barely tapped him! Don't fucking tell me...!\"{w} What had happened wasn't a mystery; Shiroya was stunned into immobility. As a handful of bystanders ran to the car, she desperately wished that no one's life had been lost."
    new "「妈的！？我不过轻轻撞了他一下！别他妈告诉我……！」{w}出了什么事并不难猜；Shiroya 吓得动弹不得。几个路人朝车边跑去，她拼命祈祷没有人因此丧命。"

    # game/script.rpy:48535
    old "Hey! ...Say something!{w} Come on! Say something!"
    new "「喂！……说句话啊！{w}拜托，说句话啊！」"

    # game/script.rpy:48536
    old "Those anguished cries continued ceaselessly and kept drawing nearby people in, forming a circle."
    new "那凄厉的喊声一刻不停，不断把附近的人引过来，渐渐围成一圈。"

    # game/script.rpy:48537
    old "A few of them had phones by their ears, detailing the emergency to the proper officials with the hopeless voice of the driver in the background. Given the way everyone was acting, there was only one conclusion to draw."
    new "有几个人把手机贴在耳边，向有关部门说明情况，背景里混着司机绝望的喊声。看众人的反应，结论只有一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:48538
    old "You've gotta be fucking kidding! ...Hey! Wake up!{w} Man! He just ran out in front of me! There was no way I could've stopped in time!{w} Come on, say something! Please!"
    new "「你他妈开什么玩笑！……喂！醒醒啊！{w}老天，是他自己冲到车前的！我根本来不及刹车！{w}快啊，说句话！求你了！」"

    # game/script.rpy:48539
    old "H-He's right, I saw it too. He suddenly crossed the road.{w} It looked like he started running when he saw her."
    new "「他、他说得对，我也看见了。那个人突然横穿马路。{w}好像一看见她就跑了起来。」"

    # game/script.rpy:48540
    old "Out of nowhere, everyone turned to face the petrified Shiroya."
    new "众人忽然齐齐转向僵立在那里的 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:48542
    old "She stared back at the onlookers for long seconds, none of them moving."
    new "她与围观的人群对视了好几秒，谁也没有动。"

    # game/script.rpy:48545
    old "Finally, after she processed what she'd heard, she stepped forward and looked beyond the parked car."
    new "终于，她明白过来，向前迈出几步，朝那辆停着的车后方望去。"

    # game/script.rpy:48550
    old "Sure enough, she knew the person lying on the snow who was being forcefully shaken by his shoulders."
    new "果然，她认得那个躺在雪地上、正被人抓着肩膀使劲摇晃的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:48551
    old "Of course she did. On top of all the bright blood soaking into the snow was the person she knew most well. The person she'd gone to the tower with, and her last friend."
    new "她当然认得。鲜红的血浸透了积雪，躺在血泊中的，是她最熟悉的人——曾与她一同前往芦屋塔的人，也是她最后的朋友。"

    # game/script.rpy:48553
    old "So when she saw his empty eyes, the sound of her heart thudding echoed inside her own body. Red and white blended into one, the entire world appearing drenched in his blood."
    new "于是，当她看见他空洞的双眼时，自己擂鼓般的心跳声在体内回响。红与白融成一片，仿佛整个世界都被他的血浸透了。"

    # game/script.rpy:48554
    old "It was absurd to think that scene made any sense. That thought barely managed to cross her mind."
    new "眼前这一幕，怎么可能说得通。这个念头只勉强掠过她的脑海。"

    # game/script.rpy:48555
    old "She hadn't wished the past to change at all, so why had it changed in the worst way possible?"
    new "她从未希望过去发生任何改变，可过去为什么偏偏以最坏的方式改变了？"

    # game/script.rpy:48562
    old "Soon, an ambulance came, but everyone was already aware it was futile.{w} The body was quickly placed on a stretcher and injected with a substance. Losing no time, he was brought in through the rear door of the vehicle, and it sped away."
    new "不久，救护车赶到了，但所有人都明白已经无济于事。{w} 遗体很快被抬上担架，注射了某种药剂。救护人员片刻不停，从车尾门把遗体送进车内，车子随即疾驰而去。"

    # game/script.rpy:48563
    old "A swarm of people surrounded the bloodstain left behind, and they started to talk loudly as soon as the ambulance left."
    new "一群人围住了留下的血迹，救护车刚一离开，他们便大声议论起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:48564
    old "On the ground, the broken driver stared downward. A few steps back, Shiroya did the same thing, rejecting what she'd witnessed."
    new "司机瘫在地上，低头呆望着。几步之外，Shiroya 也低着头，不愿相信眼前发生的一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:48565
    old "She had recently been forced to accept the cruelty of reality, but she hadn't been prepared for the same thing to happen again.{w} She denied it. She told herself that she'd mistaken his face or that everyone had failed to notice he'd still been alive. ...If everything was a dream, it would resolve all of her problems at once."
    new "近来她已经被迫接受了现实的残酷，却还没准备好面对同样的事再次发生。{w} 她不愿承认。她告诉自己，是她认错了他的脸，或是所有人都没发现他其实还活着。……如果这一切都是梦，那她的所有问题便能一并解决。"

    # game/script.rpy:48574
    old "Shiroya heard someone addressing her. It had happened before when they'd noticed she knew the victim, but she hadn't replied. For that reason, she'd been left alone for a while."
    new "Shiroya 听见有人在问自己。之前也有人发现她认识死者，问过她同样的话，但她没有回答，所以有一阵子没人再来打扰她。"

    # game/script.rpy:48575
    old "Answer me. What's your name?"
    new "「回答我。你叫什么名字？」"

    # game/script.rpy:48576
    old "But that voice persisted. When Shiroya moved her head, she saw a police officer staring at her with a serious expression."
    new "可那个声音仍不依不饶。Shiroya 转过头，看见一名警察正神情严肃地盯着她。"

    # game/script.rpy:48577
    old "...Sh-Shiroya.{w} Mirana."
    new "「……Sh、Shiroya。{w}Mirana。」"

    # game/script.rpy:48578
    old "You'll have to come with us."
    new "「你得跟我们走一趟。」"

    # game/script.rpy:48579
    old "...Wh-Wha—"
    new "「……什、什么——」"

    # game/script.rpy:48580
    old "Grabbed by the wrist, she was dragged to a police car with its door open."
    new "有人抓住她的手腕，把她拽向一辆敞着门的警车。"

    # game/script.rpy:48581
    old "Sit here."
    new "「坐这儿。」"

    # game/script.rpy:48585
    old "The officer closed the door from the outside. Immediately, another officer opened the front door and sat in the driver seat."
    new "警察从外面关上车门。紧接着，另一名警察打开前门，坐进驾驶座。"

    # game/script.rpy:48586
    old "Shiroya had no strength to question anything, so when the engine started up and they began to drive away, she could only gaze at the fading group of people who'd seen the same thing she had."
    new "Shiroya 连质问的力气都没有。引擎发动，车子驶离原地，她只能望着那群渐渐远去的人——那些和她看到同样一幕的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:48594
    old "Days passed, and still confined, she remained unable to comprehend a single piece of what had happened."
    new "几天过去，她仍被看管着，对所发生的一切还是完全无法理解。"

    # game/script.rpy:48611
    old "It was many days later when Shiroya stepped on the snow again."
    new "很多天后，Shiroya 才再次踏上雪地。"

    # game/script.rpy:48612
    old "She had learned it with certainty: Atsuki had died on that day, instantly."
    new "她已经确知：Atsuki 就在那一天当场身亡。"

    # game/script.rpy:48613
    old "The incident of the 15th had already occurred, and in the distance, she could see Ashiya Tower.{w} It had been a while ago when she'd touched the Sekimeiya in the bathroom, but she hadn't set foot in that building again."
    new "15日的事件早已发生，远处能望见芦屋塔。{w} 她在洗手间触碰到 Sekimeiya 已是许久之前的事，自那以后，她再没有踏进过那栋楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:48614
    old "And she wouldn't. It didn't matter anymore."
    new "她也不会再踏进去了。一切都已经没有意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:48615
    old "She didn't know where to find the Sekimeiya or what had happened to her life. The day she opened the door to her apartment again... was January 11th of 2012."
    new "她不知道 Sekimeiya 的下落，也不知道自己的生活究竟出了什么变故。她再次推开公寓房门的那天……是2012年1月11日。"

    # game/script.rpy:48621
    old "What had happened on the 15th of December? She had heard about it."
    new "12月15日究竟发生了什么？她听说过那件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:48625
    old "At {time=21}, the main shutter had unlocked. However, nobody had been found alive inside."
    new "{time=21}，主卷帘门解锁了。然而，里面没有发现任何生还者。"

    # game/script.rpy:48626
    old "Two people had been found dead. Their names were Naomi Cabca and Isla Majutsu.{w} Drops of blood that hadn't belonged to them had been found on the floor, but the whereabouts of the remaining people were a mystery. After raiding the building, the police had failed to find them."
    new "有两具尸体被发现，分别是 Naomi Cabca 和 Isla Majutsu。{w} 地板上还找到了不属于她们的血迹，但其余人的下落仍是个谜。警方突入大楼搜查后，始终没能找到他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:48627
    old "It had been soon confirmed that more people should've been there. Counting everyone who'd scanned their tickets in the entrance, the names of the people who hadn't evacuated were Atsuki Hakutoki, Shiroya Mirana, Sai Yomiya, Akaro Esata, and Erina Majutsu.{w} What had happened to them? It was impossible they had left the building during their twelve hours of imprisonment, as the whole structure had been observed from the outside since that morning."
    new "很快便确认，本该有更多人在里面。根据入口处所有验票记录，未撤离者分别是 Atsuki Hakutoki、Shiroya Mirana、Sai Yomiya、Akaro Esata 和 Erina Majutsu。{w} 他们究竟遭遇了什么？从那天早晨起，整栋建筑便一直处于外部监视之下，因此他们不可能在被困的十二小时里离开大楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:48630
    old "The police concluded that Isla Majutsu, the second victim, had died many hours after {time=9.}{w} Yet, they had very few clues as to what had occurred. Almost all the recorded footage had been erased, and what remained was useless. The belongings of the two victims contained nothing of importance, and neither did any place in the building.{w} That only made things more confusing, because despite the belief of many citizens, nothing else had been stolen beyond the gemstones that had been found in the morning."
    new "警方断定，第二名死者 Isla Majutsu 是在 {time=9.} 之后数小时才死去的。{w} 然而，关于究竟发生了什么，他们掌握的线索寥寥无几。几乎所有监控录像都被抹去，剩下的也毫无用处。两名死者的遗物中没有重要物品，大楼各处也同样一无所获。{w} 这反而让事情更加扑朔迷离：许多市民相信失窃的不只是宝石，但除了早上发现的那批宝石之外，并没有其他东西失窃。"

    # game/script.rpy:48636
    old "But there was another reason why the investigation was majorly hindered."
    new "但调查之所以严重受阻，还有一个原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:48639
    old "When the entrance opened, the authorities detected a gas present in the interior, especially prominent on the lowest floor. As a safety measure, they quickly locked the main access to the building to analyze what the substance was."
    new "入口打开时，当局检测到建筑内部存在一种气体，尤其在底层最为浓重。出于安全考虑，他们迅速封锁了大楼的主要通道，以分析这种物质。"

    # game/script.rpy:48641
    old "After analysis, identifying the substance hadn't been possible. Once that information propagated, the handling of the situation became much more delicate, as neither the gas nor its source had been recognized."
    new "分析之后，仍无法辨明那是什么物质。消息传开后，事态的处理变得更加棘手，因为那种气体及其来源都无人认得。"

    # game/script.rpy:48644
    old "This was the first public statement:{w} \"Five people who were trapped in Ashiya Tower on the 15th are still to be found. The deaths of Naomi Cabca and Isla Majutsu are being investigated. However, access to Ashiya Tower is strictly prohibited, as a potentially dangerous gas was found within it in high quantities.{w} While investigating the motive behind the attack is not the highest priority, aside from the gemstones found immediately after the authorities secured the situation, no other valuable items were found to be missing, indicating that theft may not have been the goal.\""
    new "这是首次公开声明：{w}「15日被困在芦屋塔的五人至今下落不明。Naomi Cabca 与 Isla Majutsu 的死亡正在调查中。然而，由于楼内发现了大量可能具有危险性的气体，芦屋塔严禁进入。{w} 虽然查清袭击动机并非当务之急，但除了当局控制现场后立即发现的宝石之外，没有发现其他贵重物品失窃，这表明盗窃或许并非目的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:48654
    old "Shiroya couldn't see the walls of her apartment without feeling her heart shrinking. When she finally went back, she wondered what she was supposed to do."
    new "一看见公寓的墙壁，她的心便不由得揪紧。终于回到这里时，她也不知道自己究竟该做些什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:48655
    old "She had spoken to her parents over the phone, and she'd been forced to speak about Atsuki's death and everything the police had asked her. Even though she'd been released without being considered guilty of anything, she hadn't been able to answer any questions about the attack on the 15th."
    new "她和父母通过电话，不得不提起 Atsuki 的死，也不得不把警方问过她的事说给他们听。虽然她最终获释，也没有被认定犯有任何罪行，但关于15日那场袭击，她连一个问题都回答不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:48656
    old "Lately, she'd had to talk a lot, but when she found herself at home, she didn't think she had the ability to produce a single sound."
    new "最近她不得不说了很多话，可一回到家里，她觉得自己连一点声音都发不出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:48660
    old "The pillows were still scattered in her living room. The last time she'd been there, she'd managed to feel hopeful, but that felt so distant that it was hard to believe decades hadn't passed."
    new "客厅里的靠枕仍散落着。上一次待在这里时，她还能生出几分希望，可那份感觉已遥远得让人难以相信，这中间竟然没隔几十年。"

    # game/script.rpy:48661
    old "Shiroya didn't know what the point of returning was. She had lost everything."
    new "Shiroya 不知道自己回来还有什么意义。她已经失去了一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:48669
    old "It was the next day. She had slept and eaten, but it couldn't be said she'd done so for any particular reason.{w} The miserable way she felt... it was all too familiar to her, but the difference in potency was immense."
    new "已是第二天。她睡过，也吃过东西，但很难说这么做是出于什么理由。{w} 那种凄惨的心境……她再熟悉不过，可这次的程度之强，却远非往日可比。"

    # game/script.rpy:48670
    old "That day, she became aware of something she hadn't been told yet."
    new "那天，她得知了一件此前没人告诉过她的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:48673
    old "After turning on the television, she learned about the current situation in Yushibana."
    new "打开电视后，她知道了丰花如今的状况。"

    # game/script.rpy:48678
    old "It wasn't a secret that a large portion of the citizens was opposed to the presence Ashiya had built. Due to Ashiya Tower, Yushibana had undergone a drastic change throughout the recent years."
    new "大部分市民反对芦屋在此建立的势力，这早已不是秘密。因为芦屋塔，丰花这几年经历了剧变。"

    # game/script.rpy:48679
    old "Perhaps the old activities of what had once been called the Ashiya family weren't as widely known, but what was a commonly shared fact was that when the tower had shifted into a personal exposition center, a new wave of people had taken over the town."
    new "芦屋家族过去的所作所为或许并不广为人知，但众所周知的是，当那座塔变成私人展览中心后，新一批人涌入了这座城镇。"

    # game/script.rpy:48680
    old "That was the fundamental dispute in Yushibana. The older citizens, aware of the way Ashiya had once been, were becoming outnumbered by the recent influx of people Ashiya had brought, who supported the now-corporation due to financial reasons and were ignorant of its roots.{w} After the 15th of December, the backlash Ashiya had received had been enormous. Through their poor security measures, they'd let two people be killed, and they hadn't publicly responded well to the ordeal, blinded by their battle against Xyn."
    new "这正是丰花最根本的矛盾。熟知芦屋昔日作风的老一辈市民，人数正逐渐被芦屋近来引入的大批外来者超过；这些人出于经济上的理由支持如今这家企业，却对其根源一无所知。{w} 12月15日之后，芦屋遭受的声讨极为猛烈。由于安保措施不力，他们让两人丢了性命，而他们被与 Xyn 的争斗蒙蔽了双眼，面对这场变故也没能在公众面前妥善应对。"

    # game/script.rpy:48681
    old "Unlike previously, the protests were so strong and visible that the supportive part of Yushibana joined in as well. Everything Ashiya had done to combat Xyn was being revealed, so the older citizens took the chance to expose all they knew about Ashiya's past, and rumors about the missing people and the unknown gas continued to circulate."
    new "与以往不同，这次的抗议声势浩大、随处可见，连丰花那些支持芦屋的人也加入了进来。芦屋为对抗 Xyn 所做的一切正被逐一揭露，老一辈市民便借机公开他们所知的芦屋往事；有关失踪者与不明气体的传言也愈传愈烈。"

    # game/script.rpy:48685
    old "All Ashiya kept saying was that they were still investigating what had happened—that they would find the missing people and expose those working as part of Xyn. Then, the tower would quickly open again.{w} However, everyone knew that nobody had entered that building since the 15th due to the unknown gas, so those statements were seen as a haphazard, lacking defense."
    new "芦屋只是一再声称，他们仍在调查发生了什么，会找到失踪者，也会把为 Xyn 效力的人揪出来。随后，塔会很快重新开放。{w} 然而人人都知道，自15日以来，由于不明气体，没人进过那栋楼，因此这些说辞被视为草率而站不住脚的辩解。"

    # game/script.rpy:48686
    old "Where were the remaining people? Why had they not been in the tower?{w} One of them had died in a car accident, and another one had been unable to explain anything to the police. It didn't make sense; they should've been in the tower, late on the 15th. ...And what about the other three? They hadn't been found anywhere."
    new "其余的人在哪里？他们为什么不在塔里？{w} 其中一人死于车祸，另一人面对警方的询问什么也解释不清。这说不通；15日深夜，他们本该在塔里。……那另外三人呢？哪里都找不到他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:48693
    old "Soon, Ashiya went quiet. After days spent repeating themselves, it seemed they'd chosen to drop the subject entirely."
    new "不久，芦屋沉默了。连续几天重复同一套说辞之后，他们似乎决定彻底不再提这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:48694
    old "The news had been covered all over the nation and had even reached overseas. When it was noticed that Ashiya had stopped defending themselves from harsh criticism, it was assumed they'd concluded they were done for."
    new "这则新闻传遍全国，甚至传到了海外。人们注意到芦屋不再为自己辩护、抵挡猛烈的批评，便猜测他们已经认定自己走投无路了。"

    # game/script.rpy:48695
    old "And that was correct. The next time an executive of Ashiya was seen, they were recorded exiting the tower, loading covered boxes onto a truck."
    new "而事实正是如此。下一次有人看见芦屋的高层时，他们正走出塔楼，把蒙着布的箱子搬上卡车，这一幕被拍了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:48696
    old "Later that day, from her apartment, Shiroya saw that scene being broadcast."
    new "当天稍晚，Shiroya 在公寓里看到了这一幕的播出。"

    # game/script.rpy:48700
    old "So, is it true that you're abandoning the tower? It's been speculated you're selling it. Is that correct? What do you have to say about all the employees you left without a job?"
    new "那么，你们放弃这座塔的消息属实吗？外界猜测你们正打算出售它，是这样吗？对于那些被你们丢下、失去工作的员工，你有什么要说的？"

    # game/script.rpy:48701
    old "There was no reply from the Ashiya member."
    new "那名芦屋成员没有回答。"

    # game/script.rpy:48702
    old "The police haven't said anything else about the supposed gas that's inside. Is that not a concern anymore?"
    new "警方对于里面据称存在的气体没有再作任何说明。你们已经不再担心这件事了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:48703
    old "On the video, the snow was starting to melt in the background. The reporter tried to get the man to answer again, but she couldn't get him to speak."
    new "视频里，背景中的积雪开始融化。记者又试着让那名男子回答，却始终没能让他开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:48707
    old "Shiroya reached out to pet Maxi. In the corner, Umi's eyes seemed to be fixed on the screen, her dark fur camouflaged in the dim room."
    new "Shiroya 伸手去摸 Maxi。角落里，Umi 的眼睛似乎一直盯着屏幕，她深色的毛在昏暗的房间里几乎看不出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:48711
    old "The screen morphed into static, the audio going with it. As the signal was very poor, it was frequently interrupted."
    new "屏幕化作一片雪花，声音也随之中断。信号极差，画面时断时续。"

    # game/script.rpy:48712
    old "Staring at the television, Shiroya felt traces of motion sickness. Was it due to the rapidly flashing screen? It almost didn't seem that way."
    new "Shiroya 盯着电视，泛起了几分晕眩。是因为屏幕闪得太快吗？似乎又不尽然。"

    # game/script.rpy:48713
    old "Long ago, evolution had developed motion sickness. When one's sight blurred, as they could've been poisoned, they would react by vomiting to expel the poison. Shiroya was unsure if the static just made her feel that way or if her entire life had been poisoned."
    new "很久以前，进化造就了晕眩反应。当视线变得模糊时，人可能以为自己中了毒，便会用呕吐把毒物排出。Shiroya 说不清，究竟是那片雪花让她有了这种感觉，还是她整个人生都已中了毒。"

    # game/script.rpy:48714
    old "Alone in her apartment, she didn't look away until the signal resolved.{w} When it did, someone else was speaking about the same topic, but very far from the tower."
    new "她独自待在公寓里，信号恢复前一直没有移开视线。{w} 信号恢复时，另一个人正在谈论同一件事，但那人离塔楼很远。"

    # game/script.rpy:48715
    old "...ya tower was bought. We don't have the details yet, but it appears the building is not theirs anymore. They just finished taking out anything of worth inside, so Ashiya's quietly leaving their old property behind."
    new "……芦屋塔被买下了。具体情况我们还不清楚，但看样子那栋楼已经不再属于他们。他们刚把里面值钱的东西全部搬走，芦屋就这样悄悄舍弃了旧日的产业。"

    # game/script.rpy:48718
    old "It became known that someone had offered to buy the tower from Ashiya, and they had accepted due to their awful position. In the blink of an eye, Ashiya, which had been seen as a source of power and wealth within Yushibana, had entirely vanished.{w} Who had been the buyer, however? It didn't seem that information was widely available."
    new "人们得知，有人向芦屋提出买下这座塔，而芦屋因处境糟糕而接受了。转眼之间，曾在丰花被视为权势与财富象征的芦屋便彻底消失了。{w} 可买家究竟是谁？这条信息似乎并未广泛流传。"

    # game/script.rpy:48719
    old "Despite what many people felt in regards to Ashiya, a large portion of the citizens in Yushibana engaged in business with them, so the group falling to pieces brought hardship. Would the tower's new owner put the building to a similar use?"
    new "尽管许多人对芦屋心存不满，丰花仍有很大一部分市民与他们有生意往来，因此芦屋的瓦解也带来了困苦。塔的新主人会把这栋建筑用于类似的用途吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:48720
    old "If not, it was very likely someone else from Yushibana would, as there were a variety of shops and attractions related to the gemstones in the surrounding mountains. As long as those shops could still sell gems, at least a few of them would avoid disaster."
    new "如果新主人不这么做，丰花很可能会有别人来接手，因为周边山里有各种与宝石相关的店铺和景点。只要这些店铺还能卖出宝石，至少其中一部分就能免于灾祸。"

    # game/script.rpy:48724
    old "But what would happen was soon revealed."
    new "但事情很快便有了答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:48725
    old "The news finally came out: the building that had been Ashiya's for so many years would disappear."
    new "消息终于公布：那栋多年来属于芦屋的建筑将不复存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:48726
    old "That began to shine a bit of light on the situation. The demolition of the tower was something one part of Yushibana had always wished for. The structure that clearly didn't belong with the others—the one they'd all seen rapidly increasing in height throughout the years..."
    new "这让局势稍微明朗了一些。拆掉这座塔，正是丰花一部分人长久以来的愿望。那座与周围格格不入的建筑——这些年来，所有人都看着它迅速拔高……"

    # game/script.rpy:48727
    old "Why had it been purchased just to be demolished? Had it been to follow that old, unattainable demand that Ashiya disappear? Did they hope the rumors still tied with that building would vanish so that something entirely new could be built? There was only speculation on those topics throughout Yushibana, and nothing more."
    new "为什么买下它只是为了拆掉？是为了满足那个陈旧而难以实现的诉求，让芦屋消失吗？还是希望与那栋楼相关的传言就此散去，好建起全然不同的东西？整个丰花对此只有猜测，再无别的。"

    # game/script.rpy:48735
    old "Weeks had passed, but any answers remained staunchly concealed. However, a date had already been appointed: on October 4th, the building would be destroyed."
    new "数周过去，答案依旧被牢牢掩藏。然而日期已经定下：10月4日，那栋建筑将被拆除。"

    # game/script.rpy:48736
    old "It was a tall and wide structure, so demolishing it wasn't simple. As no buildings were directly next to it, though, there was little danger to any of the surroundings."
    new "那栋建筑又高又宽，拆除并不简单。不过，由于没有建筑紧挨着它，对周边一带几乎没有危险。"

    # game/script.rpy:48737
    old "At some point, the unanswered questions had almost faded. Who had caused the incident on the 15th of December? Who had killed the two victims? Where were the remaining people? Given the blood that had been found, the worst had been assumed by all."
    new "不知从什么时候起，那些未解的疑问几乎淡去了。12月15日的事件是谁造成的？两名死者是谁杀的？其余的人又在哪里？鉴于现场发现了血迹，所有人都已作了最坏的设想。"

    # game/script.rpy:48745
    old "After so long, there was a reason why Shiroya and her cat had their heads out their window.{w} It was October 4th, and the sight they were beholding would no longer exist the following day."
    new "过了这么久，Shiroya 和她的猫之所以探出窗外，是有原因的。{w} 今天是10月4日，而他们眼前的景象，到了明天便不复存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:48746
    old "In the distance, the building stretching past the others was soon to fall. It could've been dangerous to get close to it, so many people were also watching from within their houses. Some of them were about to have a familiar view returned to them. Others, like Shiroya, could hardly imagine what a Yushibana without Ashiya Tower would be like."
    new "远处，那栋高出其他建筑的楼即将倒下。靠近它可能有危险，因此许多人也在自家屋里观望。有些人即将重新见到熟悉的景色。另一些人，比如 Shiroya，则几乎无法想象没有芦屋塔的丰花会是什么样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:48747
    old "At {time=12}, the demolition would begin. There'd been no correspondence from Ashiya in months. The facts behind the unknown gas and the deaths within the tower were still shrouded in darkness.{w} The interior of the building had been investigated a few times after the 15th, but nothing useful had been figured out. Ashiya had removed everything of value, so after it was verified by the new owner, the demolition seemed to pose no risk aside from the dust it would scatter across the hill behind the tower."
    new "到了{time=12}，拆除便会开始。芦屋已经几个月没有任何联络。不明气体与塔内死亡事件背后的真相，仍笼罩在黑暗之中。{w} 15日之后，楼内被调查过几次，却始终没能查出什么有用的东西。芦屋已将值钱之物尽数搬走，经新主人确认后，此次拆除除了会让尘土散落到塔后的山丘上，似乎不会造成其他风险。"

    # game/script.rpy:48749
    old "A minute before the appointed time, many pairs of eyes looked on from behind windows all over town."
    new "约定时间前一分钟，整座城镇的许多双眼睛都在窗后注视着。"

    # game/script.rpy:48757
    old "With a faint, deep sound, the building had abruptly fallen. In a second, a huge, brown cloud of dust was all that Shiroya could see on the other side of Yushibana."
    new "伴随一声低沉的闷响，那栋建筑骤然倒下。转眼间，Shiroya 在丰花另一头能看见的，只剩一大团棕色的尘雾。"

    # game/script.rpy:48758
    old "It didn't seem like it had reached any of the nearest houses. Instead of waiting for it to dissipate, Shiroya shut the window and walked out of her bedroom."
    new "尘土似乎没有蔓延到最近的房屋。Shiroya 没有等它散去，便关上窗，走出了卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:48763
    old "Cleaning up the debris would be a long process, and while there was no news about what would happen afterward, the procedure would start a week from that day."
    new "清理废墟将是一个漫长的过程。尽管之后会如何还没有消息，但清理工作将从那天算起一周后开始。"

    # game/script.rpy:48771
    old "Shiroya returned in the afternoon. She'd gotten used to having the television on while she was at home. She'd never done that prior to everything that had happened to her, but it brought her some small form of solace to have any noise at all in her barren set of rooms."
    new "Shiroya 在下午回来了。她已经习惯在家时开着电视。在经历这一切之前，她从不会这么做，但如今，空荡荡的房间里哪怕有一点声响，也能给她些许慰藉。"

    # game/script.rpy:48775
    old "She'd set the volume low because the sporadic static would be hard on her ears otherwise."
    new "她把音量调得很低，否则时不时响起的杂音会刺得她耳朵难受。"

    # game/script.rpy:48777
    old "The bright screen projected light onto the ceiling. When the color drastically changed, Shiroya lifted her head."
    new "明亮的屏幕将光投在天花板上。屏幕颜色骤然一变时，Shiroya 抬起了头。"

    # game/script.rpy:48781
    old "She raised her entire body next. On the screen was a man speaking into a microphone.{w} She grabbed the remote and increased the volume, staring at the text beneath him."
    new "她随即直起了身子。屏幕上是一个对着话筒讲话的男人。{w}她抓起遥控器调高音量，目光落在男人下方的文字上。"

    # game/script.rpy:48782
    old "She had to read it a few times to comprehend it."
    new "她读了好几遍才看明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:48786
    old "\"The last three people who were trapped in Ashiya Tower found dead\"."
    new "「被困芦屋塔的最后三人已确认死亡」。"

    # game/script.rpy:48787
    old "In the corner of the screen was an image of the piled debris. Shiroya focused her hearing and began to process the deep voice of the reporter."
    new "屏幕一角是瓦砾堆积的画面。Shiroya 凝神倾听，仔细辨认记者低沉的嗓音。"

    # game/script.rpy:48788
    old "...en they started to be removed, the first body was found. It was that of Akaro Esata."
    new "「……开始清理之后，第一具遗体被发现了。是 Akaro Esata。」"

    # game/script.rpy:48789
    old "A video began to play in the background. It showed people removing the debris and a pixelated red blob in the middle."
    new "背景开始播放一段视频。画面里有人正在清理瓦砾，中央是一团打了马赛克的红色物体。"

    # game/script.rpy:48790
    old "Another one was quickly found afterward, belonging to Sai Yomiya. Finally, when almost all the debris had been removed, Erina Majutsu's body was found.{w} The three bodies were heavily crushed, and it's believed some parts of them weren't found."
    new "「紧接着又发现了另一具，属于 Sai Yomiya。最后，当瓦砾几乎清理殆尽时，Erina Majutsu 的遗体也被找到了。{w}三具遗体都严重压毁，据信还有部分残骸未能找到。」"

    # game/script.rpy:48792
    old "Shiroya listened in disbelief. She'd always known that when she'd touched the Sekimeiya, Atsuki, Erina, Sai, and Akaro had been in the lobby. Atsuki had died in a car accident, but the others had all disappeared. A long time ago, Shiroya had concluded that Atsuki must've traveled through time after her."
    new "Shiroya 难以置信地听着。她一直清楚，就在她触碰 Sekimeiya 的那一刻，Atsuki、Erina、Sai 和 Akaro 都在大厅里。Atsuki 死于车祸，其余几人却全部下落不明。很久以前，Shiroya 就已断定，Atsuki 一定是在她之后穿越了时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:48793
    old "But this... What kind of sense did it make? The censoring prevented her from confirming the bodies' faces, but given their descriptions, it didn't seem like that would've been possible regardless."
    new "可这件事……又该怎么解释？马赛克让她无法确认遗体的面容，但单从报道的描述来看，即便没有打码，恐怕也辨认不出。"

    # game/script.rpy:48797
    old "As of now, what happened is unknown. While the bodies were severely smashed, they were not fully decomposed. It has been determined that they died the day of the demolition.{w} However, the possibility of the demolition itself causing their deaths has been thoroughly refuted. It was properly verified that nobody was in the building before the impact, and that's not the only reason.{w} The three bodies were below all the rubble. If the building had really fallen on them, their condition would be even worse. Strangely, some of the body parts that were recovered are practically intact, despite the state of most others.{w} There was no dust discovered on the bodies—neither inside their clothes nor in their mouths. For this reason, the situation is being handled very carefully, as the truth behind it might be appalling.{w} It has been considered that the bodies were disposed of within the rubble following the demolition since they couldn't have been directly hit by it. However, given how deep they were and the absence of blood around them, that was immediately discarded as well.{w} Even though the abundance of the unidentified old gas has disappeared, around the three bodies was where the last remaining traces were found.{w} This is an extremely delicate case that has carried unsolved questions with it all year. Now that everyone who was trapped in the building has been found, the authorities will do all they can to figure out what happened on that day."
    new "「截至目前，事情经过仍不清楚。遗体虽然严重损毁，却并未完全腐烂。现已确定他们死于拆除当天。{w}不过，拆除本身导致他们死亡的可能性已被彻底排除。事前已经确认，爆破前建筑物里没有人，而且这还不是唯一的理由。{w}三具遗体位于所有瓦砾之下。若建筑物真的压在他们身上，遗体的状况只会更糟。奇怪的是，尽管大部分残骸损毁严重，找到的部分肢体却几乎完好无损。{w}遗体上没有发现灰尘——衣服里、嘴里都没有。正因为如此，这起案件才被处理得如此谨慎，因为背后的真相可能令人震惊。{w}有人推测，既然遗体不可能是被直接砸中的，那就是在拆除之后被人丢进瓦砾堆里的。然而考虑到遗体埋藏之深、周围又没有血迹，这一推测也立即被排除了。{w}尽管大量不明旧气体已经消散，最后残留的痕迹正是在这三具遗体周围发现的。{w}这桩极其棘手的案件，整整一年都悬而未决。如今被困于建筑物内的人已全部找到，当局将竭尽全力查明那一天究竟发生了什么。」"

    # game/script.rpy:48923
    old "Chapter 3 Credits (Forsaken Relay)"
    new "第三章 制作人员名单（Forsaken Relay）"

    # game/script.rpy:48924
    old "Shiroya turned off the television."
    new "Shiroya 关掉了电视。"

    # game/script.rpy:48925
    old "After months of dwelling on the incident, the reporter's words released her."
    new "几个月来她一直为那起事件耿耿于怀，而记者的话却让她解脱了。"

    # game/script.rpy:48926
    old "It was over."
    new "一切都结束了。"

    # game/script.rpy:48927
    old "The remaining hope she'd been carrying was gone."
    new "她心中残存的最后一点希望，也终于消散。"

    # game/script.rpy:48928
    old "She wouldn't see the people she'd been with that day again, and she wouldn't learn what had happened to them."
    new "那天与她共处的人们，她再也见不到了，也无从得知他们究竟遭遇了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:48929
    old "Over time, she'd come to accept that the time when the three had reunited had been but a second farewell."
    new "随着时间流逝，她渐渐接受了：三人重逢的那一刻，不过是一场再度的告别。"

    # game/script.rpy:48930
    old "Shiroya stepped out of her apartment one more time to visit the snowless world."
    new "Shiroya 又一次走出公寓，去看那个无雪的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:48931
    old "The sky above her didn't feel the same as it once had, but it was still there."
    new "头顶的天空已不似从前，但它依然在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:48932
    old "She had somewhere to go."
    new "她有个地方要去。"

    # game/script.rpy:48933
    old "Earlier that day, she'd tried to walk there and stopped halfway."
    new "那天早些时候，她曾试着走过去，却在半路停下了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:48934
    old "Surrounded by green, she inhaled a familiar aroma."
    new "置身绿意之间，她嗅到一缕熟悉的气息。"

    # game/script.rpy:48935
    old "She wanted to know if an offer she'd received long ago was still valid."
    new "她想知道，很久以前收到的那份邀请是否仍然算数。"

    # game/script.rpy:48936
    old "Finally hoping for something, she wished it wasn't too late."
    new "她终于又有了期盼，只愿一切都还来得及。"

    # game/script.rpy:48937
    old "And as she saw the last person who remained from her old life, she learned that she hadn't waited too long."
    new "而当她见到旧日生活中仅剩的那一个人时，她才知道自己并没有等太久。"

    # game/script.rpy:48938
    old "It wouldn't make her happy."
    new "这不会让她幸福。"

    # game/script.rpy:48939
    old "And it would probably not make her less lonely."
    new "大概也不会让她少一分孤独。"

    # game/script.rpy:48940
    old "But the fact that she wanted it regardless was enough to know that she had to do it."
    new "但即便如此她仍想要，这便足以说明她非做不可。"

    # game/script.rpy:48941
    old "The next day, she had a reason to get up and fondly remembered the last time she'd awoken in high spirits."
    new "第二天，她有了起床的理由，也怀念起上一次带着好心情醒来的情形。"

    # game/script.rpy:48942
    old "The three gruesome bodies beneath the rubble..."
    new "瓦砾下那三具惨不忍睹的遗体……"

    # game/script.rpy:48943
    old "That mystery was nowhere close to being solved."
    new "那桩谜团远未解开。"

    # game/script.rpy:48944
    old "There had been no new information from Ashiya."
    new "芦屋那边再没有传来新的消息。"

    # game/script.rpy:48945
    old "They had vanished completely, and with them the route to any remaining answers."
    new "他们彻底消失了，通往余下答案的线索也随之断绝。"

    # game/script.rpy:48946
    old "The plain terrain where the tower had once been..."
    new "高塔曾经矗立的那片空地……"

    # game/script.rpy:48947
    old "After years of the building's increasing height, nothing else would rise there."
    new "那座建筑曾年复一年地越建越高，此后那里再不会有任何东西拔地而起。"

    # game/script.rpy:48948
    old "It didn't take long for that place to become a thing of the past."
    new "没过多久，那个地方就成了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:48949
    old "And for that inexplicable day to be merely a memory."
    new "那个无从解释的日子，也不过成了一段回忆。"

    # game/script.rpy:48950
    old "Once years had gone by, Shiroya's surroundings were different."
    new "数年过去，Shiroya 身边的一切都已不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:48951
    old "She wasn't far from Yushibana, but she didn't live there anymore."
    new "她离丰花并不远，却已不住在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:48952
    old "Every time she looked at both animals still at her side, she remembered the person who'd always been with her."
    new "每当她看到仍陪在身边的这两只动物，就会想起那个一直陪伴着她的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:48953
    old "He was someone she'd never forget and someone who didn't exist anymore."
    new "她永远不会忘记那个人，而那个人也已不复存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:48954
    old "Holding a packed, green folder, she laughed along with someone who'd never stepped into her hometown."
    new "她拿着一个塞得鼓鼓的绿色文件夹，和一个从未踏进过她故乡的人一起笑了。"

    # game/script.rpy:48955
    old "She explained the events of one particular December 15th as if they had happened long, long ago."
    new "她讲起某一个 12 月 15 日发生的事，仿佛那已是极其遥远的往事。"

    # game/script.rpy:48956
    old "Leaving out crucial details, she maintained a natural voice as she thought back on that egg-shaped stone."
    new "她略去关键细节，回想那颗蛋形的石头时，语气依旧自然。"

    # game/script.rpy:48957
    old "Was she the last person who remembered its powers?"
    new "记得它力量的人，是否只剩她一个了？"

    # game/script.rpy:48958
    old "...She really was the same person who'd once stepped into that tower, and the only survivor of that day."
    new "……她确实还是当年走进那座塔的那个人，也是那一天唯一的幸存者。"

    # game/script.rpy:48999
    old "Ending: Forsaken Relay"
    new "结局：Forsaken Relay"

    # game/script.rpy:49021
    old "Tethered"
    new "牵系"

    # game/script.rpy:49030
    old "I would... change the past. I had a way to save Miiya, Atsuki, Isla, Katei, Naomi, Erina..."
    new "我会……改变过去。我有办法救 Miiya、Atsuki、Isla、Katei、Naomi、Erina……"

    # game/script.rpy:49031
    old "I had traveled from the 15th to change the past alone, and even though I hadn't been aware of what would happen, I had considered the outcome with my other self."
    new "我是为了改变过去，才独自一人从15日穿越而来的。尽管并不清楚会发生什么，我仍与另一个自己一同推演过结局。"

    # game/script.rpy:49033
    old "Looking at the small town had finally brought me to lean toward an option. I'd decided to do my best to change the past, as the possible consequences didn't outweigh what good could be achieved."
    new "望着这座小镇，我终于倾向了其中一个选择。我决定尽力去改变过去——可能付出的代价，终究抵不上能换来的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:49034
    old "But the tower I could see far in the distance... I still couldn't go there."
    new "然而远处那座塔……我依旧去不了那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:49037
    old "The day I'd enter that building again would likely be the last day of my normal life, and even though I'd decided, the thought could still freeze me in place."
    new "再次踏进那栋大楼的那一天，多半就是我正常生活的最后一天。尽管已经下定决心，光是想到这一点，我仍会僵在原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:49038
    old "I wanted the days I had to persist, but that couldn't happen. My life in Yushibana was likely soon to end, and I could choose the length of the last stretch."
    new "我希望眼前的日子能一直延续下去，但那不可能。我在丰花的生活大概很快就要结束，而最后这段路能走多长，我可以自己决定。"

    # game/script.rpy:49039
    old "If I saved Miiya, I wouldn't show myself to her, Atsuki, and the other me, even though I didn't know yet what I would do."
    new "就算救了 Miiya，我也不会在她、Atsuki，还有另一个我自己面前现身——尽管那时还不知道自己究竟要做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:49040
    old "So the issue to solve was the possibility of a knowledgeable enemy who could change the past on their own and steal the Sekimeiya before the 15th."
    new "所以，真正要解决的问题是：敌人有可能知晓内情，能自行改变过去，抢在15日之前夺走 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:49041
    old "I couldn't do much to combat that aside from rushing in, which I found far too risky. So I settled on another course of action and accepted that I would take it."
    new "除了贸然闯入，我几乎没有别的手段应对，而那实在太冒险。于是我另定了一条路，并说服自己接受它。"

    # game/script.rpy:49042
    old "Thursday was two days away.{w} Every Thursday morning, an event would be held in the tower. That was the day I chose to step into the building for the second time and find the Sekimeiya that was surely confined inside."
    new "距离周四还有两天。{w}每逢周四上午，塔里都会举办活动。我选中了那一天，第二次踏进那栋大楼，去找必定被关在里面的 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:49046
    old "I tried to breathe properly. If I wasn't beaten to it, I only had one more day that I'd chosen to give myself, hopelessly refusing to let them end so soon.{w} And the very next one, I'd go to the tower in the morning and think about the best way to act. Then, I'd put that into effect that very night."
    new "我试着让呼吸平稳下来。如果没人抢先一步，留给自己的日子就只剩一天了——我仍在徒劳地不肯让这些日子这么快结束。{w}而到了再下一天，我会一早前往那座塔，思考最合适的行动方式。然后，当晚就付诸实施。"

    # game/script.rpy:49047
    old "What would the event be? I knew Atsuki had read the upcoming ones and said that only one seemed interesting in late January."
    new "会是什么活动？我记得 Atsuki 看过近期的活动安排，说一月底只有一场还算有意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:49048
    old "There, people will probably ask about the Sekimeiya. It might even be held in the event room."
    new "那里多半会有人问起 Sekimeiya。活动说不定就在活动室举行。"

    # game/script.rpy:49049
    old "We had bought entrance tickets for the 15th many days prior, but when we'd waited in the lobby, I'd heard people trying to buy them at the reception desk. They'd all been sold out, but if you could buy the tickets directly there, it was probably common to do so on the day of less important events."
    new "我们在许多天前就买好了15日的入场券，可在门厅等候时，我听见有人在接待处求购。票早已卖光，不过既然能直接在那里买票，遇上不太重要的活动当天再买，大概也很常见。"

    # game/script.rpy:49050
    old "And if there are none left, I'll just pay for a normal visit. Joining whatever special event will happen isn't essential."
    new "要是票卖完了，我就按普通参观付钱进去。参不参加那场特别活动，并不重要。"

    # game/script.rpy:49064
    old "I had to stop staring ahead. The strong wind kept whipping snow into my face, and prickling pains chipped at the corners of my eyes."
    new "我不得不移开直视前方的目光。强风不断把雪刮到脸上，细密的刺痛一下下扎着眼角。"

    # game/script.rpy:49065
    old "Scanning the ground, I took the path that circled Yushibana."
    new "我扫视着地面，走上了环绕丰花的那条路。"

    # game/script.rpy:49071
    old "The way wasn't perfectly even, and traversing the dense snow was difficult. I had to take the next path leading down, but I couldn't easily see it in the distance due to its identical color."
    new "路面并不平整，积雪又厚，走起来十分吃力。我得走前面那条向下的岔路，可它和周围的雪一个颜色，隔着这段距离很难看清。"

    # game/script.rpy:49072
    old "My stomach was demanding food, and the cold was becoming too prominent to bear. Protecting my head with my hood, I advanced steadily, knowing where I was headed for once."
    new "胃里饿得难受，寒意也渐渐逼人难耐。我用兜帽护住头，稳步前行——这一次，我难得清楚地知道自己要去哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:49073
    old "I was close to home. Even though I was going slow, I knew there wasn't much distance between both trails down."
    new "我已离家不远。尽管走得慢，我也知道两条下山小路之间并没有多长距离。"

    # game/script.rpy:49074
    old "I'd been glancing up here and there, but it was hard to recognize the narrow entrance to Yushibana I was going toward."
    new "我时不时抬眼张望，却很难认出前方那处通往丰花的狭窄入口。"

    # game/script.rpy:49080
    old "At last, I saw the absence of brown at my right.{w} As I thought, it extended all the way down, leading to a dirt road close to my home."
    new "终于，我看到右侧有一片地方不再是褐色。{w}果然，那条路一直向下延伸，通往我家附近的一条土路。"

    # game/script.rpy:49081
    old "I stepped down the steep path, careful not to trip. Slowly, I descended until there was concrete below the snow and composed myself. The wind was noticeably weaker closer to the ground, so I raised my head again."
    new "我踏上陡峭的小路，小心不让自己绊倒。缓缓下行，直到积雪下面露出混凝土，才稳住心神。贴近地面风明显小了许多，我便重新抬起头。"

    # game/script.rpy:49085
    old "The narrow path soon became a sidewalk where a couple of cars were parked. Like I'd seen from above, nobody seemed to be on the outskirts."
    new "狭窄的小路很快接上了人行道，那里停着几辆车。正如我在高处所见，城郊似乎一个人也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:49086
    old "I was less than two minutes away from home. My apartment was one block farther, but I had to walk a bit."
    new "我离家已不到两分钟。公寓就在再往前一个街区，不过还得走上一段。"

    # game/script.rpy:49095
    old "Is someone behind me again?"
    new "又有人在我背后？"

    # game/script.rpy:49096
    old "I could see the metallic staircase far ahead, but I debated whether to stop."
    new "远处已能看见那道金属楼梯，我却在犹豫要不要停下。"

    # game/script.rpy:49097
    old "No, yesterday that didn't work. They'll just run away."
    new "不行，昨天那样没用。对方只会跑掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:49099
    old "Should I pass by my apartment? What if they want to know where I live?"
    new "要直接走过公寓吗？万一对方就是想知道我住哪儿呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:49100
    old "I started to feel a little nervous. Had I actually felt someone behind me once more, or was it paranoia...? I just needed to go home.{w} I looked by my feet."
    new "我开始有些不安。究竟是真的又感觉到身后有人，还是我多心了……？我只要回家就好。{w}我低头看了看脚边。"

    # game/script.rpy:49101
    old "I could circle this block, and if new footsteps are here when I'm back, I'll know I'm not making anything up."
    new "我可以绕这个街区一圈。回来时若多了新的脚印，就说明我没有胡思乱想。"

    # game/script.rpy:49106
    old "I didn't change my pace, but I avoided even looking at my apartment. I'd just made a very important decision, but I felt indecisive again."
    new "我没有改变步伐，却连看都不愿看一眼公寓。明明刚做了一个十分重要的决定，此刻却又动摇起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:49107
    old "Even if I confirm that I'm right, what would I do? ...Ignore it?"
    new "就算确认了我是对的，我又能怎样？……装作不知道？"

    # game/script.rpy:49108
    old "I'd have to go home anyway."
    new "反正我总归要回家的。"

    # game/script.rpy:49110
    old "Up ahead, the only way to see my back would be from directly behind me. If I suddenly turn around at the end and someone is watching me, I should see them as well."
    new "再往前，想看到我的背影，就只能从我的正后方看。如果我在尽头突然回头，而有人正盯着我，那我也该能看见对方。"

    # game/script.rpy:49111
    old "I bit my lip and kept walking. I couldn't make any motions that indicated I thought someone was behind me or they'd be able to escape again. If someone was there, I just needed to know who it was."
    new "我咬住嘴唇，继续往前走。任何暗示我察觉身后有人的举动都不能做，否则对方又会逃掉。假如真有人跟着，我只想知道那是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:49117
    old "I managed to feel a bit of sweat forming on my palms despite the overwhelming cold. Depending on who it was, I might have had to act sooner than I expected."
    new "天冷得厉害，手心竟还是渗出了一点汗。对方是谁还不清楚，我或许不得不比预想中更早出手。"

    # game/script.rpy:49118
    old "I had passed my apartment. If someone was really looking at me, would the curtain of snow conceal them? If they turned fast enough, identifying them would likely be impossible."
    new "我已经走过了公寓。若真有人在注视着我，雪幕会不会把对方遮住？只要对方转身够快，多半就认不出是谁了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49119
    old "...{w}I was close to the end of the street, where it curved into another one. If someone was watching me from behind at that moment, they had to be in eyeshot."
    new "……{w}我快到街的尽头了，那里街道拐向另一条路。此刻若有人在我身后窥视，就一定在视线范围内。"

    # game/script.rpy:49125
    old "But I instinctively turned around before I'd planned."
    new "可还没等我按计划行动，身体已经本能地转了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:49128
    old "A sudden sound had broken the silence far behind me. And as I'd feared, the falling snow was blurring the image."
    new "一声突兀的响动从身后远处打破了寂静。而正如我担心的那样，纷落的雪让眼前一片模糊。"

    # game/script.rpy:49129
    old "Frowning, I sprinted back the way I'd come, toward a blue smudge way ahead."
    new "我皱起眉，沿来路奔回去，朝前方远处那一抹蓝色冲去。"

    # game/script.rpy:49130
    old "Is that...?"
    new "那是……？"

    # game/script.rpy:49131
    old "It immediately became visible. It was a police officer.{w} ...But that wasn't all, so I didn't stop."
    new "那一抹蓝色立刻清晰起来。是一名警察。{w}……但还不止如此，所以我没有停下脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:49132
    old "Before getting there, I understood what had happened. Next to the officer was a police car, and they'd just closed the back door after making someone else get in."
    new "还没跑到跟前，我就明白发生了什么。警察身旁停着一辆警车，他刚让别人上了车，随后关上了后座车门。"

    # game/script.rpy:49139
    old "Oh...! ...What's wrong?"
    new "哦……！……怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:49140
    old "I panted breathlessly, my hands on my knees. A sudden dizziness invaded me, almost causing me to fall."
    new "我双手撑膝，上气不接下气。一阵眩晕猝然袭来，险些让我栽倒。"

    # game/script.rpy:49142
    old "I nodded and slowly looked up. Instead of responding, I stared at the window of the car. The glass was tinted, so I couldn't see the interior of the vehicle."
    new "我点点头，慢慢抬起视线。我没有答话，只是盯着那辆车的车窗。玻璃贴了膜，看不见车内。"

    # game/script.rpy:49143
    old "S-Sorry, did you just arrest someone?"
    new "对、对不起，你刚才是在抓人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49144
    old "Hm? Yes. What's the matter?"
    new "嗯？是啊。有什么问题吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49147
    old "...{w}I... was feeling like someone was following me just now. Could it have been this person?"
    new "……{w}我……刚才一直觉得有人在跟着我。会不会就是这个人？"

    # game/script.rpy:49148
    old "The man frowned and took out a tiny scrapbook."
    new "男人皱起眉，掏出一本巴掌大的记事本。"

    # game/script.rpy:49150
    old "Mine...?{w} ...It's Shiroya Mirana."
    new "我的……？{w}……我叫 Shiroya Mirana。"

    # game/script.rpy:49152
    old "He looked at me and silently wrote on the paper.{w} Then, he suddenly smiled, completely shifting his expression."
    new "他看了我一眼，默默在纸上写着什么。{w}随后忽然露出笑容，神情为之一变。"

    # game/script.rpy:49153
    old "I see. You can stop worrying, then. If you think you were being followed, there's nothing to be afraid of."
    new "原来如此。那你可以放心了。就算真觉得被人跟踪，也不必再害怕。"

    # game/script.rpy:49154
    old "Wh-What...? Can you let me see their face?"
    new "什、什么……？能让我看看那个人的脸吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49155
    old "He looked at the black window."
    new "他望向那扇漆黑的窗。"

    # game/script.rpy:49156
    old "No. I'm not allowed to do that."
    new "不行。我不能这么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:49157
    old "...What about their name or the reason for arresting them?"
    new "……那名字呢？或者抓人的理由？"

    # game/script.rpy:49158
    old "You can stop worrying—believe me. Right now, I'm not allowed to tell you any of that, but just wait for when it's made public."
    new "放心好了，相信我。眼下这些我一样都不能说，等正式公布吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:49161
    old "I tried to produce some way of coercing him into telling me more, but I couldn't come up with anything."
    new "我本想找些话逼他再多说几句，却怎么也想不出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:49162
    old "I have to hurry. Don't hesitate to contact us if you feel you're being followed again, but I don't think you'll be having any more problems."
    new "我得走了。要是再觉得被人跟踪，别犹豫，联系我们。不过我想，你应该不会再遇上麻烦了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49165
    old "The man nodded with a sympathetic smile and opened the door to the driver side, quickly shutting it again. Then, the car began to move and soon disappeared toward the direction I'd just run from."
    new "男人点点头，带着几分同情的笑意拉开驾驶座一侧的车门，又迅速关上。车子随即启动，很快朝我刚跑来的方向消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49172
    old "I looked by my feet. The tire marks came from far away, and next to them was a group of footprints."
    new "我看向脚边。轮胎印从远处延伸而来，旁边还有一串脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:49173
    old "These are mine. I looked at the ground earlier specifically for this.{w} ...And these were definitely not here before."
    new "这些是我的。我之前特意看过地面，就是为了这个。{w}……而这些印子，之前绝对没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:49174
    old "They're the policeman's, though."
    new "不过，这些是那个警察的。"

    # game/script.rpy:49176
    old "I kept looking down, trying to find a third pair of footprints."
    new "我一直低头查看，想找出第三个人的脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:49177
    old "There had to be a third pair right there, but I suddenly remembered the strange smile the officer had. Something felt odd about him."
    new "第三个人的脚印本该就在这里，可我忽然想起那名警官古怪的笑容。他身上有点不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:49182
    old "Wait, these."
    new "等等，是这些。"

    # game/script.rpy:49186
    old "After taking a few steps forward, I noticed the trail of footprints coming from the same direction as the tire tracks."
    new "向前走了几步，我注意到一串脚印，和轮胎印来自同一个方向。"

    # game/script.rpy:49187
    old "It must be these since they end where the car was.{w} They also resemble the ones I saw yesterday."
    new "一定是这些——脚印正好停在车子原先停着的地方。{w}而且和我昨天见过的很像。"

    # game/script.rpy:49191
    old "I kept following them in reverse, hoping they would lead somewhere. However, I immediately realized that wouldn't work.{w} The more I walked, the more the footprints faded due to the falling snow. Soon, I could hardly even make out their shape."
    new "我顺着脚印一路往回追，希望能追到什么地方。可很快就明白这行不通。{w}雪还在下，我越往前走，脚印就越淡，没多久便几乎辨不出形状。"

    # game/script.rpy:49195
    old "...I was right."
    new "……我没猜错。"

    # game/script.rpy:49196
    old "I stopped myself, stress and relief pulling me from both sides."
    new "我停下脚步，一边是紧张，一边是安心，两相拉扯。"

    # game/script.rpy:49197
    old "The person who was following me was arrested... Maybe I was right that they were someone else who traveled from the 15th. Depending on what happened, just that alone could've led to their arrest."
    new "跟踪我的人被抓走了……也许我猜得没错，那确实是另一个从15号穿越过来的人。看当时的情形，单凭这一点，就足以让他被抓。"

    # game/script.rpy:49198
    old "What mattered was that someone who potentially wanted to steal the Sekimeiya was out of the picture. Being able to feel a little calmer in that regard was immensely beneficial."
    new "重要的是，一个可能想偷走 Sekimeiya 的人已经出局。光是能在这方面稍微安心一点，就已经很值得了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49199
    old "...And he said that their identity would be made public. When's that gonna be, though? Assuming everything up until the 15th repeats itself, it won't be before that day, right? Otherwise, someone who went to the tower would've known a future self of theirs had been arrested."
    new "……他还说，那人的身份会公开。可什么时候公开呢？假设直到15号为止的一切都会重演，那肯定不会早于那天吧？否则，去过塔的人早该知道未来的自己被逮捕了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49202
    old "I didn't know what to think, but it seemed someone had really identified me and been following me. Added to their arrest, assuming that they'd traveled from the future seemed the most likely scenario."
    new "我不知道该怎么想，但看来确实有人认出了我，还一路跟着我。再加上那人被抓，推测他是从未来穿越而来，似乎是最合理的解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:49206
    old "I turned around. My apartment was right there."
    new "我转过身。公寓就在眼前。"

    # game/script.rpy:49207
    old "I could barely keep myself standing anymore. I approached the staircase while I grabbed the keys and staggered my way to the front door."
    new "我已经快站不住了。我摸出钥匙，走到楼梯口，摇摇晃晃地挪向家门。"

    # game/script.rpy:49208
    old "I lightly shook off the snow on me and turned the key clockwise."
    new "我轻轻抖落身上的雪，把钥匙顺时针一转。"

    # game/script.rpy:49217
    old "...How long had the heater been on? The change in temperature was more drastic than it had ever been."
    new "……暖气开了多久？温度的变化比以往任何一次都剧烈。"

    # game/script.rpy:49218
    old "I hurriedly closed the door and left my coat and boots behind. I wanted to drop to the floor, but I managed to make it to the kitchen."
    new "我赶紧关上门，外套和靴子都扔在原地。我恨不得直接瘫在地上，却还是撑到了厨房。"

    # game/script.rpy:49223
    old "I knew I still had the instant noodles I'd bought, so I grabbed the bowl I'd used last time, then washed and filled a pot."
    new "我记得买来的泡面还有剩，便拿出上次用过的碗，洗净锅子，接上水。"

    # game/script.rpy:49224
    old "Once the water began to boil, I dropped the noodles in and watched them slowly spread out."
    new "水一开，我把面下进去，看着它慢慢散开。"

    # game/script.rpy:49225
    old "It would take three minutes to cook. Meanwhile, I sipped water and tried to compose myself."
    new "要煮三分钟。趁着这段时间，我小口喝水，试着让自己平静下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:49226
    old "I hadn't been able to eat in the tower, and I'd kept going for hours and hours there, but the cold outside in wintertime Yushibana was a real problem for me. I kept underestimating the importance of a reasonable surrounding temperature."
    new "在塔里我一口东西都没吃，还一连奔波了好几个小时，可冬日丰花户外的寒气实在要命。我总是一次次没意识到，周围温度合不合适有多重要。"

    # game/script.rpy:49228
    old "Someone following me had only thrown me further into disarray. I couldn't put into words why I'd felt again that they'd been watching me, but it was possible their goal had really been to learn where I lived. I was far beyond the point of assuming they only wanted to confirm who I was."
    new "有人跟踪我，只让我更加心乱。我说不清为什么又觉得有人在盯着我，但对方的目的很可能真是摸清我住在哪里。我早就不认为他们只是想确认我的身份了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49232
    old "I removed most of the water from the pot and dropped the noodles in the bowl, garnishing it as I had before. The meal looked pretty ordinary, but I eagerly brought it to the living room."
    new "我倒掉锅里大半的水，把面盛进碗里，照上次那样加了配料。卖相平平无奇，我却迫不及待地端进了客厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:49235
    old "I ate some. They were hot and a bit stiff, but I kept going."
    new "我吃了几口。面热腾腾的，有点硬，可我还是继续往下吃。"

    # game/script.rpy:49239
    old "I eventually slowed down. Curiously, I took out the phone from my purse and looked at the time."
    new "后来我放慢了速度。出于好奇，我从包里掏出手机，看了眼时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:49240
    old "{time=16} already... I was outside for so many hours."
    new "都已经 {time=16} 了啊……我在外面待了那么多个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:49241
    old "The person who was just arrested... Could they have been from Xyn?{w} If so, that's a new occurrence, because we were told that no members had been caught yet."
    new "刚才被捕的那个人……会不会是 Xyn 的人？{w} 要真是，那倒是新情况，因为我们听说还没有成员落网。"

    # game/script.rpy:49242
    old "Were they someone I'd been with in the tower? ...It was frustrating that I hadn't been able to see their face."
    new "那人会不会是和我一起在塔里待过的人？……没能看清对方的脸，实在叫人不甘心。"

    # game/script.rpy:49243
    old "I figured there was no point in getting hung up on it, so I kept eating as I thought back on what was most important."
    new "我心想，为这件事纠结也没用，于是继续吃面，一边回想最要紧的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:49246
    old "It'll be Thursday in just two days... I'm giving myself tomorrow to enjoy, but I'm not sure that's what I want anymore. I'll probably just be nervous all day."
    new "再过两天就是周四了……我原本打算把明天留给自己好好享受，可我已经不确定那还是不是自己想要的了。大概一整天都会心神不宁吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:49248
    old "On Thursday morning... finding the Sekimeiya and checking the door in the storeroom shouldn't take too long. After that, there are more important matters."
    new "周四早上……找到 Sekimeiya、确认储藏室的门，应该花不了太久。之后还有更要紧的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:49249
    old "I'll change the past drastically for the first time by going to Atsuki's house and taking the tickets we bought.{w} Later, I can go to Isla's house and either attempt to talk with whoever her friend really is or try to prevent them from going on the 15th in the same way."
    new "我要第一次大幅改变过去：去 Atsuki 家，把我们买好的票取走。{w} 之后再去 Isla 家，试着和她那位朋友——不管对方究竟是谁——谈谈，或者用同样的办法，阻止她们在 15 号去。"

    # game/script.rpy:49250
    old "That could be really important, because if I get caught by the police or I'm not able to find the Sekimeiya, at least I'll guarantee that the four of us don't go to the event."
    new "这一步或许至关重要：就算我被警察抓住，或者找不到 Sekimeiya，至少也能保证我们四个人不会去参加那个活动。"

    # game/script.rpy:49251
    old "I'm not too sure what would happen then. It's pretty likely the two initial groups to get trapped would merely consist of different people, but I can't do anything about that."
    new "那样一来会发生什么，我也说不准。最初被困住的两组人，很可能只是换成另外一批人，可这我也无能为力。"

    # game/script.rpy:49255
    old "I'd entirely cleaned out the bowl, so I brought it to the kitchen and picked up a pair of cereal bars."
    new "碗里的东西被我吃得一干二净，我便把碗端到厨房，顺手拿了两根谷物棒。"

    # game/script.rpy:49258
    old "Then, I had a thought I hadn't fully considered before."
    new "就在这时，一个我此前从未认真想过的念头冒了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:49259
    old "Could this be a bad idea...?"
    new "这会不会是个坏主意……？"

    # game/script.rpy:49260
    old "Assuming I'm not able to find the Sekimeiya in the tower, should I really try to prevent any of us from going there? That might screw it all up."
    new "假设我在塔里找不到 Sekimeiya，那我真该设法让我们都不去那里吗？那样说不定会把一切搞砸。"

    # game/script.rpy:49261
    old "Right now, the 15th is the failsafe in case I can't find the Sekimeiya beforehand. If I let everything repeat, I'll be able to touch it again on that day.{w} Hell, I could see where the recorder even came from, or even stay there for a month, depending on whether it's real or not."
    new "眼下，如果我事先找不到 Sekimeiya，15 号就是我的保障。只要让一切照旧重演，我那天就能再次碰到它。{w} 说不定还能弄清录音笔究竟从何而来，甚至在那里待上一个月——就看那是不是真的了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49262
    old "But if Atsuki, Isla, Erina, and I don't go to the event, it will all be considerably different.{w} What if something causes the attack to fail?{w} What if Katei and Ashiya are able to unlock the exit this time?"
    new "可要是 Atsuki、Isla、Erina 和我都不去参加活动，一切就会大不相同。{w} 万一某个变故让袭击失败了呢？{w} 万一这次 Katei 和芦屋能打开出口呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:49263
    old "That would get rid of the only guaranteed time where getting the Sekimeiya again will be possible.{w} So, if I don't find it anywhere on Thursday, maybe waiting until the 15th is the best call."
    new "那样一来，唯一能确定再次拿到 Sekimeiya 的时机就没了。{w} 所以，如果周四我哪儿都找不到它，也许等到 15 号才是上策。"

    # game/script.rpy:49266
    old "I discarded that idea at the start of all this for a reason. If I let the incident happen like it once did, where really is the proof that the past can change? It would mean that the version of myself Atsuki saw really was just me in the future."
    new "我一开始就否掉这个念头，是有理由的。若我让那起事件照原样重演，又哪里还有证据证明过去能够改变？那岂不是说明 Atsuki 见到的那个我，真的只是未来的我而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:49267
    old "But that's not the case anymore. This is what I hadn't considered yet."
    new "但如今情况已经不同了。这正是我先前没有考虑到的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:49268
    old "If I don't change anything else until the 15th and everything actually repeats, I won't have to enter the tower again."
    new "如果我在 15 号之前不再改动任何事，而一切真的重演，我就不必再进那座塔了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49269
    old "Now I know something very important. At close to {time=16}, a very long travel took place, and it reached through the walls of the tower...{w} Could I place myself in that range, or would I be arrested?"
    new "现在我知道了一件非常重要的事。接近 {time=16} 时发生过一次跨度极大的穿越，甚至穿透了塔的墙壁……{w} 我能让自己落进那个范围里吗？还是说我会被抓起来？"

    # game/script.rpy:49270
    old "Even though everyone close to the building will know that someone with my name is inside, would they recognize my face? All I'd have to do would be spot Vaisude and get very close to him at {time=16.}"
    new "虽说靠近大楼的人都会知道有个和我同名的人在里面，可他们认得我的脸吗？我只需找到 Vaisude，在 {time=16.} 时贴近他就行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49271
    old "That would make me travel to the 24th of November. This would be the best possible outcome.{w} I'd make it far enough to be the first person to find the Sekimeiya in the mountains, stop all of this at the source, and save everyone."
    new "那样我就会穿越到 11 月 24 日。这将是再好不过的结果。{w} 我能走得更远，成为第一个在山里找到 Sekimeiya 的人，从源头阻止这一切，救下所有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:49272
    old "Exploring what to do those days seemed like a foolish dream, but I thought about it for a bit. I'd been living in my apartment on the 24th, so if I actually wanted to go that far back, I'd have to seriously plan it out."
    new "去设想那几天该怎么过，宛如一场愚蠢的梦，但我还是想了一会儿。24 号那天我还在自己的公寓里，所以真要回到那么早，就得认真筹划一番。"

    # game/script.rpy:49275
    old "It sounded great in concept, but I couldn't help but think it was an impossible avenue."
    new "听起来很美，可我不禁觉得这条路根本走不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:49276
    old "How would I get close to Vaisude without getting arrested? I could call him again to more accurately determine the time he'd traveled, but it was unlikely it would be that precise."
    new "我要怎么靠近 Vaisude 又不被抓？我可以再给他打个电话，更准确地确定他穿越的时间，但恐怕不会那么精确。"

    # game/script.rpy:49277
    old "I still had no idea why we'd found two Naomis, but I hated the idea of letting that repeat even if I'd be letting it happen again so that I could stop it later. In addition, even though it seemed like a given, I couldn't assume that large travel would still happen."
    new "我仍然不明白为什么会出现两个 Naomi，但一想到让这件事重演，我就满心抗拒——哪怕我是为了日后阻止它才故意让它再发生一次。再说，那场大规模穿越看似理所当然，我也不能就这么断定它仍会发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:49278
    old "I didn't think Vaisude had lied, but I'd somewhat changed history when I'd called my mom, and I didn't know what extra changes that implied. Furthermore, I had no idea if someone else would change the past differently; the butterfly effect could've easily prevented the {time=16} travel from happening."
    new "我不觉得 Vaisude 撒了谎，可我给妈妈打电话时已经多少改变了历史，不知道这还牵连出哪些变化。更何况，我根本不清楚别人会不会以别的方式改变过去；蝴蝶效应轻而易举就能让 {time=16} 的那次穿越不再发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:49279
    old "If that was the case, would the Vaisude I'd spoken to exist in the world I was in? While I couldn't answer that, I was inclined to think that he would, and that his travel would merely not repeat due to the change."
    new "若真如此，和我通话的那个 Vaisude 还会存在于我所在的这个世界吗？这我答不上来，但我倾向于认为他仍会存在，只是由于这一改变，他的穿越不会再重演了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49294
    old "I opened my eyes after a while. I saw the familiar ceiling I'd been staring at before, but the illumination had slightly changed."
    new "过了好一阵，我睁开眼。映入眼帘的还是先前一直盯着的那片熟悉的天花板，只是光线稍稍变了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49295
    old "Turning to the window, I noticed the sun was setting."
    new "我转头看向窗外，发现太阳正在西沉。"

    # game/script.rpy:49300
    old "I had been going to sleep very early, so I was pretty tired. However, there was something I had to do that I didn't want to leave for the next day.{w} I'd been yawning and stretching on the floor, but I felt I had a bit of time before going to bed."
    new "最近我睡得很早，所以这会儿已经相当疲倦。可有件事我必须去做，不想拖到第二天。{w} 我躺在地板上打着哈欠、伸着懒腰，不过感觉离上床还有一点时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:49303
    old "Since doing it on Thursday might have been a bad idea, I stood up and went to the entrance."
    new "拖到周四去做也许不妥，于是我站起身，走向玄关。"

    # game/script.rpy:49312
    old "The sky had gotten a lot darker, and the icy air almost changed my mind.{w} I quickly put my coat and boots back on, checked that everything was in my purse, and stepped out after turning off the lights."
    new "天色已暗了许多，冰冷的空气差点让我打退堂鼓。{w} 我赶紧重新穿上外套和靴子，确认包里的东西都在，关灯后出了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:49316
    old "Snow was still falling, but it was much lighter, like in the morning. I wondered whether to turn back to grab an umbrella, but I didn't intend to be out for too long, and it didn't seem like the snow was picking up at all."
    new "雪还在下，但比先前小多了，就像早上那样。我犹豫要不要折回去拿把伞，可我没打算在外面待太久，雪看起来也丝毫没有变大的意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:49321
    old "I went down the stairs and began to walk. ...I looked at the ground, where neither the tire tracks nor the footprints were visible anymore."
    new "我下了楼梯，迈步向前。……我低头看去，地上的车辙和脚印都已不见了踪影。"

    # game/script.rpy:49328
    old "It was remarkable how different the periphery was compared to the center of the town. After some minutes, I'd only seen a handful of people quietly wandering with an umbrella, but the many lit windows all around gave away the presence of life."
    new "这一带和镇中心真是判若两地。走了几分钟，我只见到零星几个人撑着伞静静走过，可四周亮着的一扇扇窗子却透出鲜活的人气。"

    # game/script.rpy:49332
    old "I reached the lonely crosswalk leading to Ramon and saw the wide street ahead, illuminated by many faint streetlights. Home to many stores, it looked like an entrance to a different town, its wet stone occupied with passersby."
    new "我来到那条通往拉蒙街的冷清人行横道前，望见前方宽阔的街道，被许多昏黄的路灯照着。那里店铺林立，宛如通往另一座小镇的入口，湿漉漉的石板路上行人往来。"

    # game/script.rpy:49333
    old "It's late, but I think it should be open..."
    new "虽然晚了，不过我想应该还开着……"

    # game/script.rpy:49334
    old "I continued up the path, waiting for my destination to come into sight. While I'd never entered it, I recalled seeing it open at that hour."
    new "我沿着路继续往前走，等着目的地出现在视野里。那地方我从未进去过，但我记得这个点它还开着门。"

    # game/script.rpy:49339
    old "...It should be that."
    new "……应该就是那家。"

    # game/script.rpy:49340
    old "Ahead and still in Ramon was what looked like a blue storefront with white letters above it. It read \"Ishimaru\"."
    new "前方仍是拉蒙街，可以看见一家蓝色店面，上方挂着白字招牌，写着「Ishimaru」。"

    # game/script.rpy:49341
    old "I stood in front of its door. The interior was lit, and a woman was sitting behind a transparent wall. Nonetheless, I felt a bit reluctant to step in."
    new "我站在店门前。里面亮着灯，一位女子坐在透明的隔墙后面。尽管如此，我还是有些踌躇，不想迈进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:49342
    old "There was something about the situation that felt too surreal. I couldn't feel bad about myself, though, because what I was doing was a necessary step."
    new "此情此景实在有些不真实。不过我也不能因此自怨自艾——我这一步是非走不可的。"

    # game/script.rpy:49349
    old "I pulled the door open and entered the small space, protected from the cold once more. The woman smiled warmly at me as I approached."
    new "我推开门，走进这方小店，再一次把寒冷挡在门外。我走近时，那位女子朝我温和地笑了笑。"

    # game/script.rpy:49350
    old "Good afternoon. You'd like to try your luck?"
    new "下午好。你是想来碰碰运气吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49352
    old "Perfect. Have you come here before? I don't think you have."
    new "好的。你以前来过吗？我想应该没有吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:49355
    old "...No, I have. I came a while ago, but I'd forgotten to check if I'd won anything until now."
    new "……不，我来过。之前来过一次，只是一直忘了来核对有没有中奖。"

    # game/script.rpy:49356
    old "Ah, I see. What would you like, then?"
    new "啊，原来如此。那么你想查点什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:49357
    old "I thought about how to phrase the few questions I had."
    new "我在心里琢磨着，该怎么把想问的几个问题说出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:49360
    old "The number I had was for December 1st, I believe. I wonder, by the way, how long would it be valid for?"
    new "我记得我买的那组号码是十二月一日的。对了，请问它的有效期有多久？"

    # game/script.rpy:49361
    old "Oh, it's still valid, don't worry. They last a whole year.{w} Anyway, December 1st? Let me see."
    new "哦，还来得及，不用担心，有效期整整一年。{w} 话说回来，十二月一日是吧？我看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:49362
    old "I hadn't been sure what day to say, but I hadn't wanted to ask for the previous day's. If I went back to November, I'd change the past in a considerable way. Then, the butterfly effect could affect what I was doing.{w} I knew each digit of a winning lottery number was manually drawn every time, so if I changed the past and made it back to the same day, it was entirely possible the latest winning number would differ. A mere millisecond of difference could result in a different draw. I'd chosen December 1st because it was the next day after Miiya's death, and I didn't know how far back I'd end up being able to go."
    new "我拿不准该报哪一天，却又不愿问前一天的开奖结果。若回到十一月，过去就会被大幅改动，随之而来的蝴蝶效应也可能波及我眼下要做的事。{w} 我知道中奖号码的每一位都是人工摇出来的，所以只要改动过去、再回到同一天，最新的中奖号码完全可能变掉——哪怕只差一毫秒，摇出的结果也会不同。我选十二月一日，是因为那是 Miiya 死后的第二天，而我不清楚自己究竟能回到多久以前。"

    # game/script.rpy:49365
    old "After looking at a computer screen for a few seconds, the woman voiced a number."
    new "那女人盯着电脑屏幕看了几秒，报出了一串数字。"

    # game/script.rpy:49368
    old "December 1st... I'm assuming you bought a standard Lotus-6 combination, correct?"
    new "十二月一日……我猜你买的是标准的 Lotus-6 组合，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:49371
    old "On December 1st, the number drawn was 30-05-12-31-15-26, and the bonus number was 24."
    new "十二月一日开出的号码是 30-05-12-31-15-26，特别号码是 24。"

    # game/script.rpy:49374
    old "...Ah, I don't think that was it. It would've been great to win on the first attempt."
    new "……啊，好像不是这组。要是第一次就中了，那该多好。"

    # game/script.rpy:49375
    old "Do you have the ticket? You might've won one of the secondary prizes if any of the last numbers coincide."
    new "你带着彩票吗？只要尾号有对上的，说不定能中个次级奖项。"

    # game/script.rpy:49376
    old "...I didn't bring it, no. I'm sure none match, though."
    new "……没有，我没带。不过我确定一个都没对上。"

    # game/script.rpy:49377
    old "I see. That's unfortunate.{w} Do you want to try again?"
    new "这样啊，那真是可惜。{w} 你要再买一组吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49379
    old "Maybe. I have a couple questions, though. I've always been curious about this."
    new "也许吧。不过我想先问几个问题，这些事我一直挺好奇的。"

    # game/script.rpy:49382
    old "Would I be able to ask for a specific number that I want?"
    new "我可以指定自己想要的号码吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49383
    old "Yes, that's possible. We tend to sell packs of five different combinations, but you can also choose the numbers you want if it's what you prefer."
    new "可以。我们通常是五组不同号码打包出售，不过如果你愿意，也可以自己挑号码。"

    # game/script.rpy:49384
    old "All right.{w} How much would I have won if all the digits matched?"
    new "好的。{w} 要是数字全对，能中多少钱？"

    # game/script.rpy:49385
    old "Let me see...{w} The main prize money of December 1st was ¥917,999,011.{w} It's even higher now. Nobody's won the jackpot in a while."
    new "我看看……{w} 十二月一日的头奖金额是 917,999,011 日元。{w} 现在更高了，已经有一阵子没人中头奖。"

    # game/script.rpy:49386
    old "Oh, wow. I'm not sure what I'd do with so much money."
    new "哇……这么多钱，我都不知道该怎么花。"

    # game/script.rpy:49387
    old "Some people say it's unlucky to win that much. It has ruined people's lives."
    new "有人说中这么大一笔钱反而不吉利，这钱毁掉过别人的人生。"

    # game/script.rpy:49388
    old "30-05-12{w=0.3}-31-15-26{w=0.4}--24...{w=1} 30-05-12-31-15-26{w=0.3}--24..."
    new "30-05-12{w=0.3}-31-15-26{w=0.4}--24……{w=1} 30-05-12-31-15-26{w=0.3}--24……"

    # game/script.rpy:49389
    old "Yeah, I would be very overwhelmed."
    new "是啊，我大概会不知所措吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:49392
    old "I don't remember: how much does buying a number cost?"
    new "我记不清了，买一组号码要多少钱？"

    # game/script.rpy:49393
    old "It's just ¥200."
    new "只要 200 日元。"

    # game/script.rpy:49394
    old "I see. ...Is it possible to buy a number that will be played the same day you buy it?"
    new "原来如此。……能不能买当天就开奖的号码？"

    # game/script.rpy:49395
    old "Yes, but only before {time=17.} You don't have to worry about this today since the next Lotus-6 will be held on the 5th, this Thursday."
    new "可以，不过得在 {time=17.} 之前买。今天不用着急，下一期 Lotus-6 是这周四（5号）开奖。"

    # game/script.rpy:49397
    old "Ah, I understand. I think I'll come back, then. I'd like to think about the number I want."
    new "啊，我明白了。那我改天再来吧，我想好好想想选哪组号码。"

    # game/script.rpy:49398
    old "That's perfectly fine. I hope you're right on the mark."
    new "当然可以。祝你一击即中。"

    # game/script.rpy:49402
    old "Me too.{w} I'm sorry for having so many questions, but if I won, would my identity have to be revealed?"
    new "我也希望如此。{w} 抱歉问了这么多，不过如果我中了奖，身份会被公开吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49403
    old "Oh, no, Japanese law doesn't enforce that."
    new "哦，不会，日本法律没有这样的规定。"

    # game/script.rpy:49404
    old "...And how long would I have to wait to receive the money?"
    new "……那奖金要等多久才能到手？"

    # game/script.rpy:49405
    old "No more than two weeks. You'd be able to choose whether to receive the full amount at once or monthly. You wouldn't have to worry about taxes, either."
    new "最多两周。你可以选一次性领取全额，也可以按月领取，税也不用操心。"

    # game/script.rpy:49406
    old "Thank you! I was always curious about this."
    new "谢谢！这些事我一直很好奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:49407
    old "I'm glad I could help. I'll see you next time."
    new "能帮上忙就好。那下次见。"

    # game/script.rpy:49409
    old "I bowed and walked out."
    new "我行了一礼，走出店门。"

    # game/script.rpy:49417
    old "I began to walk down the street, repeating the numbers mentally. While writing them down was a good idea, I had to ensure I could memorize them, because it was likely any written note would disappear if I traveled far to the past again, just like the knife had."
    new "我沿着街道往前走，边走边在心里默念那串号码。写下来固然稳妥，但我必须确保自己记得住，因为若再次穿越到遥远的过去，任何写下的字条多半都会像那把刀一样消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:49418
    old "I'll probably just get in big trouble. Within two weeks, I'd receive the money in my bank account, so I'd probably have to take out the money before the other me notices what happened..."
    new "搞不好只会惹上大麻烦。两周之内，钱就会打进我的账户，所以我大概得赶在另一个我发现之前把钱取出来……"

    # game/script.rpy:49419
    old "For that, I'd have to duplicate my bank card or try to take it out of the other me's purse.{w} What would I do if I saw that so much money was added and immediately taken from my account? If it was investigated, security cameras would probably see me in the bank."
    new "为此，我得复制一张银行卡，或者设法从另一个我的钱包里把卡拿出来。{w} 换作是我，看到账户里突然多了一大笔钱、转眼又被人取走，会怎么做？要是有人查起来，监控多半会拍到我在银行里的身影。"

    # game/script.rpy:49420
    old "Maybe not taking everything would be a good idea. If I leave a part for the other me, would she keep quiet...? I'm not sure what I would do myself in that situation, honestly."
    new "也许不把钱全部取走比较好。如果给另一个我留下一部分，她会不声张吗……？说实话，换成我自己处在那种境地，我也不知道会怎么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:49423
    old "I could hardly take those thoughts seriously. ...Had I really assumed that I'd try to go live far away all by myself?"
    new "这些念头，我实在没法当真。……难道我真的以为自己会独自远走他乡、在那里生活下去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49425
    old "She also said that she'd never seen me there before. I suppose that means that there currently is no me who bought that number after going to the past. Of course, that will only happen when history is greatly altered, so it isn't the case yet."
    new "她还说以前从没在那里见过我。看来，眼下并不存在一个回到过去、买下那组号码的我。当然，那要等历史被大幅改动之后才会发生，所以现在还不是那样。"

    # game/script.rpy:49428
    old "30-05-12-31-15-26--24..."
    new "30-05-12-31-15-26--24……"

    # game/script.rpy:49436
    old "I still felt a little unsure. Would the number stay the same if I changed the past even a little bit...?"
    new "我心里仍有些没底。哪怕只把过去改动一点点，那组号码还会一样吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:49437
    old "On December 1st, I will already have changed the past. However, I guess that if I travel to days before the 30th, I'll be able to obtain the Sekimeiya myself and redo this in a way so that the past only changes when I buy the number. I guess the past wouldn't even have to change in that instance. Buying the ticket wouldn't contradict any previous experiences."
    new "到了十二月一日，我早已改变了过去。不过我想，如果能穿越到三十日之前，我就能亲自拿到 Sekimeiya，把整件事重新安排，让过去只在我买下号码的那一刻才发生改变。那样的话，过去甚至根本不必改变——买下那张彩票，也不会与任何已有的经历相矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:49439
    old "A bit of snow was still falling, but it was hard to see it without looking at the streetlights. Yawning as I went, I walked back over my own steps until I arrived at my apartment."
    new "雪还在零星地落着，若不往路灯下细看，几乎分辨不出。我一路打着哈欠，踩着来时的脚印走回公寓。"

    # game/script.rpy:49447
    old "I stepped in, leaving my coat and boots behind as usual. I thought of trying to eat something else, but I was too tired to bother, and nothing I had was appetizing anyway."
    new "我进了门，照例脱下外套和靴子。本想再吃点别的，可实在懒得费那个劲，何况家里也没有一样能勾起胃口的。"

    # game/script.rpy:49451
    old "I changed into the same nightwear and turned off the light in the entrance."
    new "我换上那套睡衣，关掉了玄关的灯。"

    # game/script.rpy:49452
    old "I took a piece of paper and a pen out of a drawer. Just in case, I wrote down the winning combination."
    new "我从抽屉里取出纸笔，为防万一，把那串中奖号码记了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:49453
    old "After that, I straightened up my blankets and buried myself underneath them, leaving my phone by the side of my bed."
    new "之后我整理好被子，钻了进去，把手机搁在床边。"

    # game/script.rpy:49457
    old "...Mom hasn't tried to call me again. I wonder what happened with that."
    new "……妈妈没再打来过电话。也不知道那件事后来怎么样了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49458
    old "Once again, I found myself comfortably lying on my soft mattress while another version of myself was suffering in the hospital."
    new "我再一次舒舒服服地躺在柔软的床垫上，而另一个我却在医院里受苦。"

    # game/script.rpy:49459
    old "I moreso felt bad for the me I was, who only had two last opportunities to appreciate the touch of that old bed."
    new "我反倒更替现在的自己难过——能再感受那张旧床触感的机会，只剩最后两次了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49467
    old "...What was it?"
    new "……是什么来着？"

    # game/script.rpy:49468
    old "I felt my head hurt a bit, but I tried to recall the winning combination before looking at the bedside table."
    new "头有点发疼，但我还是先努力回想那串号码，然后才望向床头柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:49469
    old "30{w=0.2}-05{w=0.1}-12{w=0.2}-31{w=0.4}-15{w=0.1}-26{w=0.8}--24...{w} I'm pretty sure that was it."
    new "30{w=0.2}-05{w=0.1}-12{w=0.2}-31{w=0.4}-15{w=0.1}-26{w=0.8}--24……{w} 应该就是这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:49471
    old "I felt like I'd only slept for the blink of an eye, as I vividly remembered the thoughts I'd had in the evening. I looked up, still covering my eyes with the bed sheets."
    new "仿佛只睡了一眨眼的工夫，昨晚的念头却还清清楚楚。我抬起头，被子仍蒙着眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:49477
    old "Saving Reverie"
    new "拯救幻梦"

    # game/script.rpy:49479
    old "...I shuffled the blankets aside. I'd gotten too used to the feeling of waking up to a warm room. It was almost more pleasant than being covered in softness."
    new "……我把被子掀到一边。我已经太习惯醒来时满屋的暖意，那感觉几乎胜过被褥裹身的柔软。"

    # game/script.rpy:49480
    old "I didn't want to spend a long time in bed, so I pushed myself to get up."
    new "我不想在床上赖太久，便硬撑着起了身。"

    # game/script.rpy:49483
    old "I raised the blinds, filling the bedroom with light. Behind the glass was the still image of a white Yushibana with the sun already up."
    new "我拉起百叶窗，光线顿时灌满卧室。玻璃窗外，朝阳已升，丰花一片雪白，像一幅静止的画。"

    # game/script.rpy:49484
    old "The snow had ceased during the night, and a bit of fog was all that remained, especially prominent in the distant mountains. It was a beautiful and peaceful thing to see, but I felt some deep strain as well."
    new "雪在夜里停了，只余下薄薄的雾气，远山一带尤为明显。那景致宁静而美，我心里却隐隐绷着一根弦。"

    # game/script.rpy:49485
    old "My phone showed {time=9:57.} I had no plans for the day, but it was a very special one. Like usual, I stepped to the bathroom and rubbed my eyes."
    new "手机显示 {time=9:57.} 今天没有任何安排，却是格外特殊的一天。我照常走进卫生间，揉了揉眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:49491
    old "I still had two cereal bars left. I tossed the wrappers in the trash and started to eat them as I tiredly stretched my arms."
    new "麦片棒还剩两根。我把包装纸丢进垃圾袋，一边倦倦地伸着胳膊，一边吃了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:49496
    old "I'd been nervously pacing as I ate them and stopped myself as soon as I realized it.{w} I didn't have anything to do, and repeatedly going over the same thoughts was only stressful. I'd decided to spend my final free day in as relaxing of a manner as I could manage, but I couldn't let myself keep worrying about losing precious time."
    new "吃着吃着，我才察觉自己一直不安地来回踱步，便立刻停住。{w} 我无事可做，反复琢磨同一件事只会徒增压力。我早已决定，最后一个自由的日子要尽量过得轻松，可又没法不去担心白白耗掉时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:49499
    old "I went back to my bedroom and looked at the wardrobe to pick something to change into."
    new "我回到卧室，望着衣柜挑选要换的衣服。"

    # game/script.rpy:49500
    old "I stared at what I had. I'd been selecting random clothes for the past few days, but I found myself thinking a little harder about it.{w} I had a blue hoodie that I really liked in mind, but I couldn't find it, so I ended up grabbing a long-sleeved orange shirt instead."
    new "我盯着柜里的衣物。这几天我都是随手抓一件，这回却不由自主地多琢磨了几分。{w} 我惦记着一件很中意的蓝色连帽衫，可怎么也找不到，只好拿了件橙色长袖衬衫。"

    # game/script.rpy:49502
    old "My laundry basket was nearly full. The previous day's clothes were there, and it had been a while since I'd washed them."
    new "洗衣篮快满了。昨天的衣服都在里面，距上次洗衣已经有些日子。"

    # game/script.rpy:49506
    old "Doing the laundry most certainly didn't matter anymore, but I dragged the basket to the kitchen nonetheless. The washing machine was there, next to another basket which was close to full."
    new "洗衣服这事早已毫无意义，我还是把篮子拖去了厨房。洗衣机就在那里，旁边另有一只同样快满的篮子。"

    # game/script.rpy:49507
    old "I tended to prioritize washing what I left in my bedroom, but I still had the blue hoodie in mind, so I rifled through both piles."
    new "我惯常先洗卧室里那一篮，可心里还惦记着蓝连帽衫，便在两堆衣服里都翻了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:49509
    old "I wasn't able to find it with a cursory inspection, but I didn't want to empty both baskets just for that, so I began to fill the washer."
    new "粗略翻找并没有找到，我也不愿为一件衣服把两篮全倒出来，便开始往洗衣机里装。"

    # game/script.rpy:49510
    old "The machine wasn't too spacious, so I could only pick out part of the basket. Once I'd filled it with the top half, I pushed the round door shut and poured in a bit of laundry detergent."
    new "洗衣机容量不大，一篮只能装下一部分。我把上半篮装了进去，推上圆形舱门，再倒了些洗衣液。"

    # game/script.rpy:49511
    old "I had a number of clothes at home that I'd accumulated throughout the years, but since they were all on the cheap side, I didn't trust using hot water. When I pressed the big blue button, \"30:00\" appeared in red digits on the screen and began to count down."
    new "家里这些年攒下不少衣服，可件件都便宜，我不敢用热水洗。按下那个蓝色大按钮后，屏幕上浮出红色的「30:00」，开始倒数。"

    # game/script.rpy:49516
    old "I grabbed the lighter bucket and brought it back to my bedroom, where it was more convenient."
    new "我拎起较轻的那只桶，拿回卧室，在那里收拾起来更方便。"

    # game/script.rpy:49521
    old "I ended up sitting on the carpet. I was trying to calm my nerves, but as soon as I made any attempt to stop thinking, it became incredibly difficult."
    new "最后我在地毯上坐了下来。我试着让心神安定，可越是想停下思绪，就越是艰难。"

    # game/script.rpy:49522
    old "I wanted to go out again, somewhere. Staying still, the mess of emotions inside me was uncontrollable."
    new "我想再出门去，去哪儿都好。就这样干坐着，心里翻涌的情绪根本压不住。"

    # game/script.rpy:49523
    old "Does it even matter, though? I can go to Ina, but it's not fair to say goodbye to someone without them knowing it, and I'd just be so sad without being able to say why..."
    new "可这又有什么意义？我可以去伊娜，但瞒着对方道别并不公平，而且连理由都说不出口，只会让我难过得要命……"

    # game/script.rpy:49525
    old "Then, the past would change, and that'd be overwritten anyway."
    new "再说，过去一旦改变，那些也都会被覆盖掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:49526
    old "...I really tried to keep my mood pleasant. It was possible I wouldn't find the Sekimeiya the next day, and even after traveling, I could go to Ina Café before the 30th to reach a time that wouldn't be deleted."
    new "我真的很努力想让心情保持愉快。也许第二天找不到 Sekimeiya；就算穿越之后，我也可以在30日之前去伊娜咖啡馆，进入一段不会被抹去的时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:49527
    old "The time had been passing far too fast, so I rested my head on a pillow, knowing that would slow it down. I stayed there for a few minutes and listened to the washer work. Even if doing the laundry didn't matter, my clothes could get moldy if they stayed inside for too long..."
    new "时间流逝得太快了，我把头靠到枕头上，知道这样能让它慢下来。我就那样待了几分钟，听着洗衣机运转的声响。洗衣服虽已无关紧要，可衣服闷在里面太久也会发霉……"

    # game/script.rpy:49533
    old "I heard it running from the living room. When the intensity increased, I knew the spin-dry had begun and that only a few minutes were left. I went to check."
    new "我在客厅就听得见它运转。响动一大，我便知道脱水开始了，只剩几分钟。我过去看了看。"

    # game/script.rpy:49536
    old "I could see the meshed clothes rapidly spinning behind the glass, and the countdown approaching the last three minutes."
    new "隔着舱门玻璃，能看见缠搅在一起的衣物飞速旋转，倒计时也快到三分钟了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49537
    old "I watched the seconds tick until four zeros filled the screen. Then, I grabbed the plastic handle and opened the door. I placed a blue bucket below it and dropped the compact, wet mess of clothes in it."
    new "我盯着秒数跳动，直到屏幕上剩下四个零。随后我抓住塑料把手打开舱门，把蓝桶放在下面，将那团紧实潮湿的衣服塞了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:49543
    old "I dragged it to the wardrobe as well. I didn't have a dryer, so since the outside was freezing, I had to use a foldable washing line with the help of the heater."
    new "我把它也拖到衣柜旁。家里没有烘干机，外面又天寒地冻，只能靠取暖器，用折叠晾衣架来晾。"

    # game/script.rpy:49544
    old "I made room on the floor and opened it up, proceeding to grab the pieces and hang them individually."
    new "我在地板上腾出地方，撑开晾衣架，接着一件件拿起来挂好。"

    # game/script.rpy:49545
    old "They weren't too wet, so I kept crouching and using as few of my scarce clothespins as possible.{w} I took out a pretty blue and white shirt. I figured that I was still pretty tired since I thought I'd left it out of the washer due to the bad memories it brought, but I still hung it properly and kept going."
    new "衣服不算太湿，我便一直蹲着，尽量少用那些本就不多的衣夹。{w} 我取出一件漂亮的蓝白衬衫。我大概还是很累，竟以为自己是因为它带来的那些糟糕回忆，才没把它放进洗衣机。但我还是把它好好挂上，继续干活。"

    # game/script.rpy:49548
    old "I was done fairly quickly and looked at the neatly-hung laundry that would likely never be used. I turned around, looking down at my feet until I got to the front door."
    new "没多会儿就晾完了。我望着那一排多半再也用不上的衣服，转过身，低着头一路走到玄关。"

    # game/script.rpy:49552
    old "I'd been going outside without a defined reason, and I felt obligated to do it again. Spending the entire day inside would have been too difficult."
    new "我这些天出门都没什么明确理由，可还是觉得该再出去一趟。整天闷在屋里，实在熬不住。"

    # game/script.rpy:49553
    old "I got ready to leave and recalled I'd left my purse in my bedroom, so I went to grab it along with my phone."
    new "我做好出门的准备，想起钱包落在卧室，便回去连同手机一起拿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49559
    old "I was about to reach for the front door, but I walked to the kitchen instead, remembering the garbage bag where I'd thrown the cereal bar wrappers. It was almost full, so I made a knot with the bands and returned."
    new "我正要伸手开门，却又想起装麦片棒包装的垃圾袋，便拐进厨房。袋子快满了，我把抽绳打了个结，再回到门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:49563
    old "I pushed away a bit of snow that had accumulated on the ground, just like most of the neighboring apartments had."
    new "我把地上积的薄雪推到一边，附近人家大多也是这么做的。"

    # game/script.rpy:49566
    old "The cold was still biting, but I'd come to expect it by that point. Stepping with satisfying crunches, I went down the stairs. The sky had cleared completely, and the street seemed especially bright. I walked the opposite way as usual, toward the garbage bins."
    new "寒气依旧刺骨，可我早已习惯。脚下踩着雪，发出舒服的咯吱声，我走下楼梯。天空彻底放晴，街道显得格外明亮。我朝与平日相反的方向，往垃圾桶那边走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:49570
    old "They were at the very end of the street, past the curve that could be seen in the distance."
    new "它们就在街道的最尽头，在远处那道弯的后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:49573
    old "I threw the bag in the bin for combustibles and started to walk toward the center of Yushibana."
    new "我把袋子扔进可燃垃圾箱，随后朝丰花的中心走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:49579
    old "As opposed to the previous day, my first view of Ramon was the crowded street it had always been. After crossing the road, I walked near the left buildings until I was on the thinner path."
    new "与昨天不同，我第一眼看到的拉蒙街，还是它向来那副熙攘模样。穿过马路后，我贴着左侧的建筑走，一直走到那条较窄的小路。"

    # game/script.rpy:49582
    old "Of course, Ina was open. I saw the large screen of glass and Darfee behind the counter, seemingly texting with his phone."
    new "伊娜咖啡馆当然开着。我望见那面巨大的玻璃屏，还有柜台后的 Darfee，他似乎正在用手机发消息。"

    # game/script.rpy:49592
    old "...Oh, hey! I'm glad to see you've taken a liking to this place again."
    new "……哦，是你啊！很高兴你又喜欢上这地方了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49597
    old "I stepped up to the bar. Like the previous day, there was no one inside at that time."
    new "我走到吧台前。和昨天一样，那个时间店里没有别的客人。"

    # game/script.rpy:49600
    old "How are you?"
    new "你还好吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49602
    old "I'm okay."
    new "还好。"

    # game/script.rpy:49603
    old "I must have looked a little worse than before. I figured he thought it was just due to Miiya's death, but there was much more affecting me than solely that."
    new "我看起来一定比之前更憔悴了些。我猜他只当是 Miiya 的死让我变成这样，可压在我心上的远不止那一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:49604
    old "Do you want one of these?"
    new "要来一个吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49605
    old "He pointed at the pastries I'd been eating across the past couple of days."
    new "他指了指我这两天一直在吃的那种点心。"

    # game/script.rpy:49606
    old "...Yeah, I'm hungry."
    new "……嗯，我饿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49610
    old "He grabbed a small plate from below the counter and placed it in front of me with the pastry. I bit into it, a little bit tired of eating the same thing repeatedly, but glad that I at least had the option."
    new "他从柜台下取出一个小碟子，连点心一起放到我面前。我咬了一口——同样的东西连着吃有点腻，但至少还有得选，我挺高兴。"

    # game/script.rpy:49613
    old "Going to sit at the same place again?"
    new "还是要坐老位子？"

    # game/script.rpy:49617
    old "I turned to the table he was pointing to.{w} As I spun, something caught my eye."
    new "我朝他指的那张桌子转过身去。{w}就在转身的一瞬，有什么东西映入了我的眼帘。"

    # game/script.rpy:49618
    old "There was a TV close to the entrance. It was muted, but I could see a reporter speaking into a microphone.{w} I recalled the words of the police officer."
    new "入口附近有台电视，没开声音，但能看见一名记者正对着话筒讲话。{w}我想起了那名警察说过的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:49619
    old "I will, yeah."
    new "嗯，我会的。"

    # game/script.rpy:49623
    old "I grabbed the plate and stepped back, but I sat on the opposite chair from last time so that I could see the screen."
    new "我端起碟子退开，却坐到了上次那张椅子对面的位子上，好让自己能看见屏幕。"

    # game/script.rpy:49626
    old "Would it be announced today...? That seems unlikely."
    new "今天就会公布吗……？不太可能吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:49628
    old "But as soon as I sat on the chair, I read the white text at the bottom of the screen, which had just changed from a different headline."
    new "可我刚一坐下，就看清了屏幕底部那行白色文字——它刚刚才从另一条标题换成了现在这一条。"

    # game/script.rpy:49631
    old "Stopping Power"
    new "停止作用"

    # game/script.rpy:49633
    old "\"Xyn member caught for the first time yesterday in Yushibana\"."
    new "「Xyn 成员昨日在丰花首次落网」。"

    # game/script.rpy:49634
    old "I had to read it two more times. That didn't make sense."
    new "我又读了两遍。这说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:49635
    old "...Can you turn the volume up, please?"
    new "……能麻烦你把声音调大吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49636
    old "Darfee looked at the TV, and when he read what it said, he did as I asked despite his own surprise."
    new "Darfee 看向电视，读清上面的字之后，尽管自己也吃了一惊，还是照我说的做了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49637
    old "Before he did, the image changed. That time, I immediately recognized what I saw, but once again, it didn't make any sense."
    new "还没等他调，画面就换了。这一次，我一眼就认出了画面里的东西，可它同样说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:49638
    old "What the hell...? ...Wasn't that in the newspaper?"
    new "搞什么……？……那不是报纸上的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49639
    old "The voice of the reporter began to reach us, and when it did, the image had transitioned once again.{w} For a second, it had been a short video recorded from a security camera. It showed a prison cell and a person in prison clothing hard to recognize due to the high angle."
    new "记者的声音开始传到我们耳中，也就在这时，画面再一次切换了。{w}刚才那一瞬，屏幕上是一段监控摄像头拍下的短片：一间牢房，一个穿着囚服的人，由于拍摄角度太高，难以辨认。"

    # game/script.rpy:49642
    old "...ested yesterday in a lonely street of Yushibana. He is believed to be a member of the criminal group Xyn, but his identity is unknown."
    new "……昨日在丰花一条僻静的街上被捕。据信他是犯罪组织 Xyn 的成员，但身份尚不明确。"

    # game/script.rpy:49644
    old "I tried to give meaning to those words, but I couldn't. The brief footage had been almost identical to the picture from the newspaper, and they were saying that the man's identity was unknown, just like in that article."
    new "我试着弄清这些话的意思，却怎么也想不通。刚才那段简短的影像，和报纸上的照片几乎一模一样；而他们说这个人的身份不明，正和那篇文章里写的一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:49645
    old "An interrogation is taking place, and the police are actively attempting to identify the suspect. This is likely to be the first member of the group to be caught, so the situation is being properly taken care of."
    new "审讯正在进行，警方正在积极查明嫌疑人的身份。这很可能是该组织首次有成员落网，相关情况正在妥善处理。"

    # game/script.rpy:49646
    old "After those words, the reporter bowed, and an ad began to play."
    new "说完，记者鞠了一躬，随后开始播放广告。"

    # game/script.rpy:49650
    old "I looked at Darfee, who appeared confused as well. Before he could say anything, I stood up and approached a table next to the counter."
    new "我看向 Darfee，他似乎也一头雾水。没等他开口，我便起身走向吧台旁的一张桌子。"

    # game/script.rpy:49651
    old "I'd seen a pile of newspapers there before, and it hadn't moved. Immediately, I saw that the one I'd read was still there, facing down. I opened it and rushed to the first two pages."
    new "之前我在那里见过一叠报纸，一直没被动过。我立刻看出，自己读过的那份还在，正面朝下。我把它翻开，急忙翻到前两页。"

    # game/script.rpy:49656
    old "It's here—what was just shown looked exactly like this picture."
    new "在这儿——刚才电视上放的，和这张照片一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:49660
    old "Darfee was looking at me with a serious face, and I brought the newspaper to him."
    new "Darfee 一脸严肃地看着我，我把报纸递了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:49661
    old "Sorry, I might be going insane, but I could've sworn I'd seen that before. Wasn't it exactly like this?"
    new "抱歉，我可能有点神志不清了，但我敢肯定以前见过那个。不就是这个样子吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49664
    old "U-Uh..."
    new "呃、嗯……"

    # game/script.rpy:49665
    old "He looked at the article I was pointing to and narrowed his eyebrows further."
    new "他看着我指的那篇文章，眉头皱得更紧了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49670
    old "Y-You're right... It's the same cell, but this says it's from November 24th."
    new "你、你说得对……是同一间牢房，可这里写着是 11 月 24 日。"

    # game/script.rpy:49671
    old "Didn't the person also look the same?"
    new "那个人看起来不也一样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49674
    old "Did he...? I couldn't get a good look at him, but I can't in this picture either."
    new "有吗……？我没能看清他的脸，这张照片也看不清。"

    # game/script.rpy:49675
    old "He began to read the text."
    new "他开始读正文。"

    # game/script.rpy:49676
    old "I never learned about this... On November 24th, a prisoner escaped from a cell.{w} But Xyn isn't mentioned here even though they also said the identity of the person wasn't known.{w} ...How's that possible? They don't know the identity of someone they arrested?"
    new "这件事我从没听说过……11 月 24 日，一名囚犯从牢房里逃走了。{w}可这里没提到 Xyn，尽管同样说此人的身份不明。{w}……这怎么可能？人都抓到了，还不知道是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:49680
    old "I looked back at the TV, but it was still only ads."
    new "我回头看向电视，屏幕上仍只有广告。"

    # game/script.rpy:49681
    old "Yeah, it's strange. My mind immediately went to this article, but there's probably no correlation. Every cell must be recorded from this angle, so to me it seemed like they were the same."
    new "是啊，真奇怪。我一下子就想到了这篇文章，不过大概没什么关联。每间牢房应该都是从同一个角度拍的，所以在我看来才像是同一间。"

    # game/script.rpy:49684
    old "Ah, it could be that."
    new "啊，说不定真是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:49691
    old "I sat on the chair again. Of course, it was no coincidence."
    new "我又坐回椅子上。当然，这并非巧合。"

    # game/script.rpy:49692
    old "The person who'd been arrested had been following me, meaning that it was very likely they had come from the future. Then, the person from the article had appeared in the cell on the 24th, a day I knew for a fact people had arrived at from the 15th."
    new "被捕的那个人一直在跟踪我，可见他极可能来自未来。而报道中的那人，是在24日出现在牢房里的；我确切知道，曾有人从15日穿越到那一天。"

    # game/script.rpy:49693
    old "What the hell was going on, then? Could they have been the same person? A few days earlier, they'd appeared in that cell. The previous day, they'd been arrested.{w} What kind of coincidence was that? Had he been sent to the same cell? Had the police not realized that he was the person who'd escaped on the 24th? And why was his identity unknown if they thought he was a Xyn member?"
    new "那么，究竟发生了什么？会不会是同一个人？几天前，那人出现在那间牢房里；而昨天，他又被捕了。{w}这算什么样的巧合？他是被关进了同一间牢房吗？警方难道没发现，他就是24日逃掉的那个人？可既然他们认为他是Xyn成员，为什么又不知道他的身份？"

    # game/script.rpy:49696
    old "I was baffled, but an important piece of the puzzle came back to me. Once again, it was what Katei told us."
    new "我一时理不清头绪，但拼图中重要的一块又浮现在脑海里。又是Katei对我们说过的那件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:49697
    old "Xyn had attempted to steal the Sekimeiya once before the 15th. They failed, and while the police had the chance to catch a Xyn member, they escaped.{w} I couldn't remember the exact way it was phrased, but that had happened once before the 15th..."
    new "Xyn曾在15日之前试图偷走Sekimeiya。他们失败了，警方本有机会抓住一名Xyn成员，却还是让对方逃掉了。{w}我记不清原话是怎么说的，但15日之前确实发生过这样一件事……"

    # game/script.rpy:49698
    old "What is the connection between the article and this arrest...?"
    new "那篇报道和这次逮捕之间，到底有什么联系……？"

    # game/script.rpy:49699
    old "I couldn't help but feel that something was incredibly backward. The resemblance between both events was undeniable. Even Darfee immediately noticed it, unaware of the extra links I knew regarding the person and the Sekimeiya's travel."
    new "我不由得觉得，有什么地方完全反了。两件事的相似之处无可否认。连Darfee都立刻注意到了，只是他并不知道我还掌握着那人与Sekimeiya穿越之间的额外关联。"

    # game/script.rpy:49700
    old "They caught a Xyn member for the first time.{w} ...But they'll escape before the 15th. Katei and the article prove that."
    new "他们第一次抓住了一名Xyn成员。{w}……但在15日之前，那人会逃掉。Katei和那篇报道都能证明这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:49701
    old "It couldn't be so straightforward because the article discussed an event from November 24th. While both events couldn't be the very same, they couldn't be separate either."
    new "事情不可能这么简单，因为报道讲的是11月24日的事。两件事虽然不可能是同一件，却又不可能彼此无关。"

    # game/script.rpy:49703
    old "I ate what remained of the pastry, trying to clear the cloudy confusion that had arisen in my mind. Behind both of those events was the Sekimeiya—that by itself already gave away that something unnatural was at work."
    new "我吃掉剩下的点心，想把脑中那片混沌驱散。两件事背后都有Sekimeiya——单凭这一点，就已经说明有某种超乎常理的东西在起作用。"

    # game/script.rpy:49709
    old "There's something crucial that I can't ignore.{w} In both cases, someone ended up in a prison cell. I don't know if the same person was caught both times, but it's very likely they came from the future. So, anything regarding them could differ from the reality I know."
    new "有一点至关重要，我不能忽略。{w}两起事件里，都有人被关进了牢房。我不知道两次被抓的是不是同一个人，但那人极有可能来自未来。所以，任何与他有关的事，都可能和我所知道的现实不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:49710
    old "The Xyn member who traveled from the 15th could've already changed this. If he got arrested after traveling in this reality, there would be a second Xyn member caught after the first time—the person from the future who was following me."
    new "从15日穿越来的Xyn成员可能已经改变了这一点。若他在这个现实中穿越后被捕，那就会是在第一次之后被抓的第二名Xyn成员——也就是那个从未来来、跟踪我的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:49711
    old "...{w}Trying to work it all out, I'd locked up."
    new "……{w}我试图理清这一切，脑子却僵住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49712
    old "Wasn't there something else Katei said? ...That Ashiya or the police chose not to reveal that they'd almost caught a Xyn member before they'd escaped."
    new "Katei是不是还说过别的？……芦屋或警方选择不公开他们差点抓到一名Xyn成员、但最终还是让对方逃掉的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:49713
    old "Doesn't this fit all too well with the article? If both events are connected, the fact that the person in the cell was a Xyn member must match as well. However, in the article, that wasn't revealed. ...Could that be the original event that Katei told us about?{w} That person escaped and managed to get to the tower. After that, they traveled to the past and got caught again when they were following me. Somehow, the police still didn't know their identity, but this time it was revealed that they were a Xyn member."
    new "这和那篇报道未免也太吻合了吧？如果两件事有关联，那么牢房里那人是Xyn成员这一点也应该对得上。可报道里并没有提到这一点。……Katei说过的原本那起事件，会不会就是这个？{w}那个人逃掉后设法到了塔里，之后又穿越回过去，在跟踪我时再次被抓。不知为何，警方仍然不知道他的身份，但这一次，他是Xyn成员的事被公开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49718
    old "That's right. This must be a change made by a person who traveled from the 15th. After all, someone from Xyn was just revealed to have been caught, which never happened in our reality."
    new "没错。这一定是从15日穿越而来的人造成的改变。毕竟，刚刚公开了一名Xyn成员被捕的消息，而在我们的现实里，这种事从未发生过。"

    # game/script.rpy:49719
    old "...But what I just came up with doesn't make sense either."
    new "……可我刚想到的这套说法也说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:49720
    old "It doesn't make sense if the person from the 24th really teleported to the cell. Which must have happened, given what I know happened to Vaisude..."
    new "如果24日那个人真的是被传送到牢房的，那就说不通了。可我知道Vaisude身上发生了什么，所以这一定发生过……"

    # game/script.rpy:49721
    old "If whoever that person was traveled to the cell from the 15th, they couldn't have been the same person to be caught yesterday, because the second arrest must be a new event.{w} Could it be that history was changed, but I still remember the one that both I and that man came from because I also traveled from it?"
    new "不管那人是谁，既然他是从15日穿越到牢房的，他就不可能是昨天被抓的同一人，因为第二次逮捕必定是新增的事件。{w}难道说，历史真的被改写了，而我和那个男人都来自原来的历史——因为我也是从那里穿越来的，所以还记得它？"

    # game/script.rpy:49726
    old "I noticed a mistake I'd made."
    new "我察觉到自己犯了一个错误。"

    # game/script.rpy:49727
    old "On the 24th, it's very likely a Xyn member appeared in a cell from the future. Now that I think of it, though, it can't be that he was actually caught and then escaped while Ashiya decided not to reveal he was from Xyn."
    new "24日，极有可能是一名Xyn成员从未来出现在了牢房里。可仔细一想，他不可能真的是被抓到后又逃走，芦屋也不可能决定不公开他是Xyn成员。"

    # game/script.rpy:49728
    old "That doesn't match because Katei said they were caught after trying to steal the Sekimeiya before the 15th. It hadn't even been found on the 24th."
    new "这说不通，因为Katei说过，他们是在15日之前试图偷走Sekimeiya后被捕的。可24日时，Sekimeiya甚至还没被找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:49732
    old "I had very little information, so I looked at the screen when I heard the news had come back. Unfortunately, they began to talk about a different topic, and Darfee quickly turned down the volume and looked at me."
    new "我掌握的信息太少，所以听到新闻重新开始播放时，便看向屏幕。可惜他们很快又聊起了别的话题，Darfee也立刻调低音量，转头看向我。"

    # game/script.rpy:49739
    old "Nonetheless, it was probably a good thing. A member from Xyn who'd traveled from the 15th had been caught, and since that had been revealed, there was no reason to think he would escape. It was an event that hadn't occurred when we'd originally stepped into the tower."
    new "不过，这大概是件好事。一名从15日穿越来的Xyn成员被捕了，而且这件事已经公开，按理说他就没有理由再逃掉了。这是我们最初进入塔里时未曾发生的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:49740
    old "Piecing all the details together with what I knew seemed almost impossible, as no possibility made total sense."
    new "要结合我所知道的一切来拼凑所有细节，几乎是不可能的，因为没有哪一种可能完全说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:49742
    old "Hm... I did wonder before why he appeared in a jail cell on the 24th.{w} From the 15th, it's very likely he'd appear somewhere he'd been before in the past."
    new "嗯……我之前就纳闷过，他为什么会在24日出现在牢房里。{w}从15日穿越的话，他极有可能出现在自己过去曾待过的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:49743
    old "And now this could fit. If the arrest from yesterday always occurred, the position on the 24th could be based on today."
    new "而现在这就对得上了。如果昨天的逮捕一直都会发生，那么他24日出现的位置，也许就是以今天为基准确定的。"

    # game/script.rpy:49745
    old "But then questions like how he was in the tower on the 15th or why he was following me start to crop up."
    new "可这样一来，又冒出新的疑问：他15日怎么会在塔里，又为什么跟踪我？"

    # game/script.rpy:49748
    old "I slowed down, sensing a headache. No matter what the truth was, it was messy."
    new "我感到一阵头痛，思路也慢了下来。不管真相是什么，事情都乱成一团。"

    # game/script.rpy:49749
    old "What was the link between both events? Which one was new, and which one had always happened? Regardless of the arrangement I tried, something always seemed to get in the way."
    new "两件事之间究竟有什么联系？哪一件是新增的，哪一件又是一直存在的？无论我怎么排列组合，总有什么地方卡着说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:49750
    old "And when I'd calmed down internally, one option seemed more plausible than the others."
    new "等我内心平静下来，便觉得其中一种可能比其他几种更站得住脚。"

    # game/script.rpy:49753
    old "I believed that the 30th of November was the day somebody attempted to steal the Sekimeiya. That was probably correct since nobody was caught and no connection to Xyn was made. Katei would've been talking about this."
    new "我原本认为11月30日就是有人试图偷走Sekimeiya的日子。这个判断大概没错，因为那时没人被捕，也没有查出与Xyn的关联。Katei说的应该就是这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:49754
    old "On the 15th, a Xyn member traveled to the 24th and appeared in an unlocked cell. Due to that, he was able to escape."
    new "15日，一名Xyn成员穿越到了24日，出现在一间没有上锁的牢房里。正因如此，他才能逃掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:49755
    old "After following me, he was caught yesterday. That changed the past because no Xyn member had been caught yet on the 15th."
    new "后来他跟踪我，在昨天被捕。这改变了过去，因为在15日时，还没有任何Xyn成员被捕。"

    # game/script.rpy:49756
    old "What's iffy about this? That their identity was unknown, that the cell could've been the same one...?{w} The fact that they appeared in a cell on the 24th might also be a contradiction—they wouldn't have been there before traveling. I feel like there are more problems, but I don't know how to identify them."
    new "这套说法哪里有问题？他的身份不明，那间牢房又可能是同一间……？{w}他24日出现在牢房里这一点也可能自相矛盾——穿越之前，他根本不可能在那里。我感觉还有更多问题，却说不清具体是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:49757
    old "...But if this is what happened, Xyn must be in disarray. Someone from their group was arrested when they're all still free. Could this make them rethink their attack? That could be bad.{w} Maybe Ashiya won't care about using the Sekimeiya as bait now that a Xyn member's been caught, but the event should still happen..."
    new "……可如果事情真是这样，Xyn内部一定乱作一团。他们组里有人被抓，其他人却还都逍遥法外。这会不会让他们重新考虑袭击计划？那就糟了。{w}如今有Xyn成员被捕，芦屋也许不会再在意拿Sekimeiya当诱饵，但那件事仍然应该会发生……"

    # game/script.rpy:49761
    old "Oh, one thing definitely is strange, though.{w} On the 24th, the police weren't able to identify the person who appeared in the cell. But he was arrested in the street yesterday, and that policeman almost seemed like he knew that it was a good arrest to make.{w} That doesn't make any sense. That man was in the tower on the 15th, so if the police were fine with arresting him yesterday, it follows they would've also arrested him immediately on the morning of the 15th."
    new "哦，不过有一点确实很奇怪。{w}24日，警方没能查明出现在牢房里的人的身份。可他昨天在街上被捕，那名警察几乎像是知道这次抓对了人。{w}这完全说不通。那个男人15日就在塔里，如果警方昨天愿意逮捕他，那他们15日一早也该立刻逮捕他才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:49762
    old "...Could it be that didn't happen because he entered the tower through the storeroom? And, if what happened on the 24th somehow made the police arrest him yesterday, wouldn't they have said that he'd been the one who had appeared in the cell on the 24th?"
    new "……之所以没发生，会不会是因为他是从储藏室进入塔里的？还有，如果24日发生的事以某种方式促使警方昨天逮捕了他，那他们难道不会说，他就是24日出现在牢房里的那个人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49763
    old "Whatever the case, it seemed like an enigma that I probably had to put aside. It was at least good that the person following me had been caught. It could only have been beneficial to my plan."
    new "看来这个谜团我大概只能先放到一边。至少跟踪我的人被抓了，这点是好事。这对我的计划只会有利。"

    # game/script.rpy:49769
    old "Are you thinking about the news?"
    new "你在想那条新闻吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49770
    old "Darfee addressed me after I'd been in thought for a few minutes."
    new "我沉思了几分钟后，Darfee开口问我。"

    # game/script.rpy:49771
    old "A bit. It just threw me off."
    new "有点。刚才那消息让我有些措手不及。"

    # game/script.rpy:49774
    old "I see. Well, it's good that someone from that group finally got caught."
    new "原来如此。不过，那个组织终于有人被抓，倒是件好事。"

    # game/script.rpy:49775
    old "Yeah, I agree."
    new "嗯，我也这么觉得。"

    # game/script.rpy:49782
    old "The past had certainly changed in front of me. I wasn't in the same reality I knew, so letting everything repeat to remain as the only me was not an option anymore."
    new "过去确实已在我眼前改变。我身处的现实，已不是我熟悉的那个了；让一切重演、好让自己仍是唯一的我，这条路再也走不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:49783
    old "There was still the major worry that the Sekimeiya could be stolen at any moment. Even if someone from the future had been removed from the equation, that didn't completely rule out the possibility."
    new "不过，最大的隐忧仍然存在——Sekimeiya 随时可能被人偷走。就算来自未来的某个人已经被排除在外，这种可能也依然存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:49784
    old "As a matter of fact, the Sekimeiya could have already been stolen. How did the police know that the person they'd caught was with Xyn? Was it because he'd already taken it? The thought of that sent a chill down my spine."
    new "事实上，Sekimeiya 说不定早已被偷走了。警察怎么会知道他们抓到的那个人和 Xyn 有关？难道是因为他已经得手了？想到这里，我脊背一阵发凉。"

    # game/script.rpy:49789
    old "...Do you know about the Sekimeiya?"
    new "……你知道 Sekimeiya 的事吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49792
    old "Huh? ...What do you mean?"
    new "咦？……你指的是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:49793
    old "Ashiya's event."
    new "芦屋的那场活动。"

    # game/script.rpy:49794
    old "Hm? Yeah, of course."
    new "嗯？当然知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:49795
    old "Well, nobody stole the Sekimeiya, right...?"
    new "那个……Sekimeiya 并没有被偷，对吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:49798
    old "The Sekimeiya...? N-No. ...As far as I know, at least."
    new "Sekimeiya……？没、没有。……至少据我所知是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:49800
    old "All right, I just wanted to make sure since I haven't been paying attention to the news."
    new "那就好，我只是想确认一下，最近都没怎么看新闻。"

    # game/script.rpy:49805
    old "He looked a little concerned, so I turned to the window. Did he think it was bad I had my thoughts elsewhere after a friend of mine had died? I doubted it, but that was the impression his look gave me."
    new "他看上去有些担心，我便转头望向窗外。他是觉得，朋友刚去世，我却心不在焉，很不好吗？我想他应该不是这个意思，可他的神情给我的感觉正是如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:49806
    old "I stared out the window. I could only see the narrow street, as opposed to the moving Ramon. ...Just what had happened to the world I knew?"
    new "我凝视着窗外。能看见的只有那条狭窄的街道，而不是移动的拉蒙街。……我熟悉的那个世界，究竟出了什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:49809
    old "At that point, it was best to focus on what still mattered."
    new "眼下，最该做的还是把心思放在真正要紧的事上。"

    # game/script.rpy:49820
    old "With no snow falling, there'd been hardly any movement outside. A few people had come to buy the remaining bread, but time seemed to have stilled for a while."
    new "雪停了，外面几乎没什么动静。有几个人来买走了剩下的面包，但时间仿佛静止了一阵子。"

    # game/script.rpy:49823
    old "I stood up from the chair and informed Darfee that I'd be heading out."
    new "我从椅子上起身，告诉 Darfee 我该走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49826
    old "All right, Shiroya. Have a good day. It'll be ¥150."
    new "好，Shiroya，路上小心。一共 ¥150。"

    # game/script.rpy:49828
    old "I took out three coins from my wallet and handed them to him. He mirrored my smile but not the underlying sadness behind it."
    new "我从钱包里掏出三枚硬币递给他。他也对我露出了同样的微笑，但笑容背后没有我那份悲伤。"

    # game/script.rpy:49830
    old "I'll see you."
    new "回头见。"

    # game/script.rpy:49833
    old "...I walked out of the door and stepped onto the snow again."
    new "……我走出门，再次踏上雪地。"

    # game/script.rpy:49843
    old "I made some distance from Ina, brooding all the while. I had a hard time accepting that it might have been my last visit."
    new "我离开伊娜咖啡馆，走出一段路，一路心事重重。这或许是我最后一次来这里，这个念头让我难以接受。"

    # game/script.rpy:49863
    old "I'd been slowly walking down Ramon when I stopped myself to stare at a street branching off on the other side."
    new "我沿着拉蒙街慢慢走着，忽然停下脚步，望向对面一条岔出去的小路。"

    # game/script.rpy:49866
    old "I'd taken that path many times to get to Atsuki's house, so I soon realized I was nervously biting my lip again."
    new "我去 Atsuki 家时常走那条路，所以很快就意识到，自己又不自觉地咬起了嘴唇。"

    # game/script.rpy:49867
    old "I didn't have anywhere to go in more ways than one. A huge change in history had occurred—I'd never go back to the world I knew."
    new "无论从哪层意义上说，我都已无处可去。历史发生了巨大的改变——我再也回不到我熟悉的那个世界了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49868
    old "That meant that making sure Atsuki and I couldn't go to the event had become an even higher priority. It no longer had a downside."
    new "这意味着，确保我和 Atsuki 去不成那场活动，已经成了更加优先的事。而这件事已经没有任何坏处了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49873
    old "...I'd decided the previous day that I'd do it on Thursday, but that was potentially a bad idea. I didn't know when Atsuki would leave his house, and waiting in front of it all day wasn't something I wanted to do."
    new "……昨天我决定在周四动手，可那或许不是个好主意。我不知道 Atsuki 什么时候会出门，而且我也不想在他家门口守上一整天。"

    # game/script.rpy:49874
    old "After all, if it got too late, I'd have to ring the bell and face him.{w} ...I didn't think I could do that."
    new "毕竟，要是拖得太晚，我就得按门铃去面对他。{w}……我想我做不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:49877
    old "I only had one job: setting up a future that was perfect for everyone but me, then walking away from it. I couldn't fight that anymore."
    new "我只有一件事要做：铺好一个对所有人都完美、唯独没有我的未来，然后从那里抽身离去。这一点，我已经无力违抗。"

    # game/script.rpy:49878
    old "I crossed the street and walked through the narrower one, arriving at a part of Yushibana I'd always found pretty."
    new "我穿过马路，走进那条更窄的街道，来到丰花一处我一直觉得很漂亮的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:49884
    old "At other times of the year, you could see the green leaves beneath the snow of the tall trees. The road was still white, but it was almost immaculate. I slowly crossed to the opposite sidewalk."
    new "要是在一年中的其他时节，还能透过高树的积雪看见绿叶。路面依旧一片雪白，却几乎纤尘不染。我慢慢走到对面的人行道。"

    # game/script.rpy:49885
    old "Atsuki's house was there. Before I got too close, a sharp pain in my chest stopped me."
    new "Atsuki 的家就在那里。还没等我走近，胸口的一阵剧痛便让我停住了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:49886
    old "...Would I really never enter it again?{w} Could I really have been mere minutes away from going in and out of that door for the last time?"
    new "……我真的再也不会踏入那栋房子了吗？{w}难道我真的只差几分钟，就要最后一次进出那扇门了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49887
    old "I had a hard time believing it."
    new "我实在难以相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:49888
    old "I ran up to the gate before that hesitation could take hold of me completely."
    new "趁那份迟疑还没彻底将我抓住，我跑到大门前。"

    # game/script.rpy:49892
    old "...I looked through the bars. Maxi wasn't in front of the door anymore, but his small paws had left imprints in the snow around it."
    new "……我透过栅栏往里看。门口已经不见 Maxi，但它小小的爪印还留在周围的雪地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:49893
    old "He is here."
    new "他在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:49894
    old "There was light behind a curtain. With no guarantee that Atsuki wouldn't see me, I stepped behind a tree."
    new "窗帘后透出灯光。我无法确定 Atsuki 会不会看见我，便躲到了树后。"

    # game/script.rpy:49895
    old "I really didn't want to be seen. If I talked to Atsuki, I was afraid that I would lose any resolve I had."
    new "我实在不想被他看见。要是和 Atsuki 说上话，我怕自己仅剩的那点决心也会烟消云散。"

    # game/script.rpy:49896
    old "I can't just stay here all day, waiting for him to leave. I don't even know if he will."
    new "总不能在这儿守一整天，等他离开。我甚至不知道他到底会不会出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:49897
    old "There was a last resort available. Since I knew where he kept an extra house key, just behind the gate, I could try to enter the house and silently grab Miiya's purse, which had been left in the living room."
    new "还有最后一个办法。我知道他把备用钥匙放在哪儿——就在大门后头，所以我可以设法进屋，悄悄拿走 Miiya 落在客厅的手提包。"

    # game/script.rpy:49898
    old "Not now, though. If it wasn't a coincidence that he was in the hospital when I woke up, he should leave at some point."
    new "但现在不行。我醒来时他正好在医院，如果那不是巧合，那他迟早会出门的。"

    # game/script.rpy:49899
    old "...Would he leave if I called him from my phone and quickly hung up?"
    new "……如果我用手机打给他，再马上挂断，他会出门吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49900
    old "...{w}I decided against that again."
    new "……{w}我再次打消了这个念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:49904
    old "...{w}Should I just wait here...?"
    new "……{w}难道真要在这里一直等下去……？"

    # game/script.rpy:49905
    old "I crossed back to the other side of the road and surveyed the door from afar. I looked around; it appeared I was the only person there."
    new "我回到马路对面，远远地打量那扇门。环顾四周，这条街上似乎只有我一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:49906
    old "Most of the trees there were too thin to cover me, so there was nowhere I could safely watch from."
    new "那一带多数树木都太细，遮不住我，我找不到能安心监视的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:49907
    old "I glanced at a corner far ahead. I'd be able to see the window from there."
    new "我瞥了一眼前方远处的转角。从那里应该能看到那扇窗。"

    # game/script.rpy:49910
    old "Slightly hesitant, I walked to it and peered at his house. As I'd thought, I'd be able to see him leaving while still being out of sight."
    new "我略微犹豫，还是走了过去，打量着 Atsuki 的房子。果然如我所料，我既能看见他出门，又不会被发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:49911
    old "There was something a bit worrying that I also noticed, however. It was the trail of footprints I'd left."
    new "不过，我也注意到另一件让人有些不安的事。那是我在地上留下的一串脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:49912
    old "...Will he notice the trail going behind the tree?"
    new "……他会注意到那串通向树后的脚印吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49913
    old "It seemed unlikely that he'd think it was suspicious, but he could find me by following them with his eyes."
    new "他大概不会觉得可疑，但只要顺着脚印看过去，说不定就能发现我。"

    # game/script.rpy:49914
    old "I'll just have to be careful."
    new "只能多加小心了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49918
    old "...But no matter what I thought, I was uncomfortable. I couldn't take my eyes off his house, and I didn't particularly enjoy the thought of spending my last real day in Yushibana spying on Atsuki."
    new "……可无论怎么想，我心里都不舒服。视线始终离不开他的房子；而且，想到自己要在丰花度过的最后一个真实的日子里监视 Atsuki，我实在高兴不起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:49919
    old "I need to do it, though."
    new "但我非做不可。"

    # game/script.rpy:49923
    old "I hid myself and leaned against the dark, cold wall.{w} Suddenly, I recognized what I was looking at."
    new "我藏好身子，靠在昏暗冰冷的墙边。{w}忽然，我认出了眼前的景象。"

    # game/script.rpy:49926
    old "I'd seen that very street the previous day, when I'd been following Isla."
    new "我昨天跟踪 Isla 的时候见过这条街。"

    # game/script.rpy:49927
    old "That's right... There's no reason not to do the same with Isla since I might know where she lives as well."
    new "对了……既然我可能也知道Isla住在哪儿，没理由不对她也这么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:49931
    old "Leaving Enric behind, I walked until a crossing street turned to the right. There was the entrance to the dead end I'd been at."
    new "我离开恩里克大道，一直走到一条向右拐的横街。我先前到过的那条死路的入口就在眼前。"

    # game/script.rpy:49934
    old "I stared at the short house where the small footprints had ended the previous day. I couldn't see any light coming from inside, and nobody was around me."
    new "我望着那栋矮小的房子。昨天，那串小脚印就停在了那里。屋里看不到一点灯光，我周围也不见人影。"

    # game/script.rpy:49935
    old "Faded footprints were scattered all over the ground, and some ended at that front door. I placed myself behind the same black car as before to avoid being right in the middle of the path."
    new "地上散落着浅浅的脚印，有几道止于那扇前门。我躲到上次那辆黑色轿车后面，免得自己正好站在路中间。"

    # game/script.rpy:49936
    old "I wondered what to do. Changing the past no longer felt like an obstacle, so I was free to decide on anything."
    new "我琢磨着接下来该怎么办。改变过去已经不再是障碍，我可以自由地做任何决定。"

    # game/script.rpy:49937
    old "Isla should be at school, but I don't know about Erina, and I don't know if anyone else lives here. ...How the hell can I take their tickets for the event when I don't even know where they're keeping them?"
    new "Isla现在应该在学校，但Erina就说不准了，我也不知道这里还住着谁。……连她们把票放在哪儿都不清楚，我到底要怎么把活动门票弄到手？"

    # game/script.rpy:49938
    old "...{w}I considered two important facts: in the attic, Erina had implied they'd bought the tickets pretty early. That meant they were likely to already have them."
    new "……{w}我想到两个要紧的事实。在阁楼里，Erina曾暗示她们的票买得相当早。也就是说，票多半已经在她们手上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49939
    old "Secondly, before locking ourselves in the bedroom, everyone's possessions had been looked at. While tickets for the event had been found on almost everyone who'd been a visitor, none had been in Erina's purse."
    new "第二，在我们把自己锁进卧室之前，所有人的随身物品都被检查过。几乎每个来访者身上都搜出了活动的门票，可Erina的钱包里一张也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:49940
    old "They were probably inside Isla's, then. Could they already be there...?"
    new "那么票多半在Isla的包里。说不定现在就已经在了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:49943
    old "The pressure of being in a crucial moment was getting to me. I stepped out and slowly approached the door."
    new "身处关键时刻的紧张感压得我喘不过气。我从藏身处走出来，慢慢靠近那扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:49946
    old "If Erina and Isla didn't go to the tower, different people would in their place. It was overwhelmingly likely that as long as Ashiya had the Sekimeiya, people would get trapped in that building. However, Isla's fate could be averted."
    new "如果Erina和Isla不去那座塔，就会有别的人顶替她们。只要芦屋还握着Sekimeiya，几乎可以肯定，总会有人被困在那栋楼里。不过，Isla的命运或许还能改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:49947
    old "...And I could change the past. When I was in front of the door, I stared at the tiny white bell at its side."
    new "……而我可以改变过去。站在门前，我盯着门边那只小小的白色门铃。"

    # game/script.rpy:49948
    old "Erina and Isla don't know me. I can just press it."
    new "Erina和Isla都不认识我。直接按下去就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:49949
    old "But what about Isla's friend? What was the truth behind that...? Is someone else really living here with them?"
    new "可Isla的那位朋友呢？那背后的真相究竟是什么……？真的还有别人和她们住在一起吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49950
    old "My arm reached out and touched the cold doorbell almost unconsciously, like it was another organism."
    new "我的手臂几乎不由自主地伸了出去，碰到冰冷的门铃，仿佛它自己是个活物。"

    # game/script.rpy:49951
    old "But really, what should I say...? I suppose that'll vary depending on who opens the door."
    new "可话说回来，我该说什么才好……？这大概得看开门的是谁了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49952
    old "I'd seen no light inside, so maybe nobody would. I firmly rang the doorbell."
    new "屋里没有灯光，也许根本不会有人来开门。我用力按下了门铃。"

    # game/script.rpy:49959
    old "...Is there actually nobody here?"
    new "……难道真的没人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49960
    old "A day earlier, the small footprints had ended at the door, and it was close to the same time of the day that it had been."
    new "一天前，那串小脚印就止于这扇门前，而现在的时刻也和那时差不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:49965
    old "I suspected I knew what the reason was."
    new "我隐约猜到了原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:49966
    old "Isla! Are you here...!?{w} It's me, Shiroya!"
    new "Isla！你在吗……！？{w}是我，Shiroya！"

    # game/script.rpy:49973
    old "There was no reply."
    new "没有回应。"

    # game/script.rpy:49974
    old "Is she out again?"
    new "她又出门了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49975
    old "I'd wondered about it already, but my intention was to take the tickets from Erina and Isla. If I did that, Isla couldn't travel to the past... so her \"friend\" might no longer have existed."
    new "这事我先前就琢磨过，但我的打算是从Erina和Isla手里拿走那些票。一旦得手，Isla就无法穿越到过去……那么她的那位「朋友」或许也就不复存在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49976
    old "But I'd seen her from the café during school hours. That had to be an Isla who'd traveled from the future.{w} Why had she been out of her house? I figured she wouldn't have wanted to show herself anywhere, which was why she wasn't opening the door."
    new "可是，我在上课时间从咖啡馆里看见过她。那一定是从未来穿越而来的Isla。{w}她为什么会走出家门？我猜想，她不愿在任何地方露面，所以才不肯开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:49977
    old "Isla, are you here?"
    new "Isla，你在吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:49980
    old "I knocked on the door lightly, but it didn't seem like I'd be answered."
    new "我轻轻敲了敲门，但看起来不会有人应门。"

    # game/script.rpy:49981
    old "The mystery behind Isla's friend was nowhere near solved. If their real identity was an Isla who'd come from the future, why hadn't she prevented herself from going to the event? My intention was to do just that, so my unease grew. Plenty of things about Isla had been questionable when looking back at it, but the voice recorder and her friend's existence were the biggest ones."
    new "Isla那位朋友的谜团远未解开。如果此人的真实身份是从未来归来的Isla，那她为什么不阻止自己去参加那场活动？我要做的恰恰就是这件事，所以心里的不安愈发浓重。回头细想，Isla身上可疑之处不少，其中最让人耿耿于怀的，便是那支录音笔和她这位朋友的存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:49985
    old "I'd been standing there for a while, and nothing had changed. Part of me wanted to give up, but the idea of her friend purposely not opening the door was one I didn't like at all."
    new "我在那儿站了好一阵子，情况没有丝毫变化。我多少有点想放弃，可一想到她的朋友是故意不开门，我就很反感。"

    # game/script.rpy:49988
    old "Wh...!?"
    new "什……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:49993
    old "Suddenly, the door opened wide and I saw the dark interior."
    new "门忽然大开，我看见里面一片昏暗。"

    # game/script.rpy:49994
    old "There was nobody there. I'd simply tried to open the door and succeeded."
    new "门里空无一人。我只是试着推了推门，没想到真的开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:49995
    old "...It was unlocked?"
    new "……门没锁？"

    # game/script.rpy:49997
    old "I'd grabbed the handle to make some noise, and I'd accidentally pushed forward.{w} I didn't move. I kept staring inside until I was sure it was vacant. Then, I lightly pushed the door a bit more and took a careful step in."
    new "我本来只是握住门把手想弄出点声响，却一不小心把它推开了。{w}我没有动，只盯着屋里看，直到确定里面空无一人。然后，我又轻轻把门推开一些，小心翼翼地迈了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:49998
    old "I scanned the area and immediately noticed a wide assortment of items on the ground. Toys, dolls, coloring books, and markers. In the corner was a pile of laundry, and the walls had a few faded scribbles on them, as if someone had tried to wash them away. There were also pictures of a child at various stages of growth, and her mother was occasionally in the shot with her."
    new "我扫视四周，立刻注意到地上散落着各式各样的东西。玩具、人偶、涂色本和马克笔。角落里堆着待洗的衣物，墙上有几道褪了色的涂鸦，像是有人试图把它们擦掉。墙上还挂着照片，记录着一个孩子不同成长阶段的样子，其中几张里她的母亲也和她在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:50002
    old "I opened the entryway closet in search of the purse and was faced with a few women's and girls' jackets. Scattered in the closet were clothes you wouldn't typically see when visiting someone's house.{w} An apron with the name of a local restaurant, a uniform for a factory worker, and a cap branded with the logo of a convenience store."
    new "我打开玄关的柜子想找那只包，映入眼帘的却是几件女人和女孩的外套。柜子里还零散挂着几件一般做客时不会见到的衣服。{w}一条印着本地餐馆名字的围裙、一套工厂工人的制服，还有一顶印着便利店标志的帽子。"

    # game/script.rpy:50003
    old "I didn't have to search for long. Right inside was the purse Isla had been wearing."
    new "我没费多少工夫就找到了。Isla 之前挎着的手提包就在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:50004
    old "Without hesitation, I looked inside."
    new "我毫不迟疑地往里看去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50005
    old "The most important issue was resolved immediately—the recorder wasn't there. I saw a pack of tissues and small sunglasses, but no tickets either."
    new "最要紧的事立刻有了答案——录音笔不在里面。里面有一包纸巾和一副小墨镜，却也没有门票。"

    # game/script.rpy:50006
    old "Wait, this is strange. When we found the recorder, I looked at this purse, and the tickets weren't there either. ...Were they in Isla's pockets?"
    new "等等，有些不对劲。我们找到录音笔的时候，我看过这个手提包，里面同样没有门票。……难道是放在 Isla 的口袋里了？"

    # game/script.rpy:50008
    old "I felt a sudden chill and looked at my sides. Nobody was there, but that in itself was very strange..."
    new "我忽然一阵发冷，转头看向身旁。四周没有人，可这本身就很不对劲……"

    # game/script.rpy:50009
    old "Why... is this purse here? Yesterday, the reason why I recognized Isla was precisely because she was wearing the purse outside. If she's outside right now, why is her purse here?"
    new "为什么……这个手提包会在这里？昨天我之所以认出 Isla，正是因为她挎着这个包走在外面。如果她此刻就在外面，包又怎么会在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:50012
    old "There was some kind of creeping, unknown dread at my back, but I immediately rationalized it away."
    new "一股莫名的恐惧沿着后背悄悄爬上来，我却立刻给自己找了个合理的解释，把它压了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50013
    old "...The person I saw yesterday was likely Isla's \"friend\". She was wearing her purse, and she isn't here right now."
    new "……我昨天见到的人，多半是 Isla 的「朋友」。她当时挎着那个手提包，此刻却不在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:50014
    old "This purse belongs to the original Isla who's at school. If that's it, this makes a lot of sense."
    new "这个手提包是原本那个还在学校的 Isla 的。如果真是这样，那就说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50016
    old "But why was the door unlocked? Was it a normal thing for them? ...And why would the other Isla be going anywhere during the day?"
    new "可门为什么没锁？这对她们来说是平常事吗？……而且，另一个 Isla 为什么会在白天出门？"

    # game/script.rpy:50017
    old "The chance to take their tickets was there. Instead of focusing on specifics, I just had to take that simple action."
    new "拿走她们门票的机会就摆在眼前。我不必再纠结细节，只要完成这个简单的动作就好。"

    # game/script.rpy:50018
    old "And when I let go of the purse, I noticed I'd missed a lower pocket."
    new "而当我松开手提包时，才发现自己漏掉了下面的一个口袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:50021
    old "I unzipped it and narrowed my eyes. All I saw were two folded pieces of paper that I easily recognized."
    new "我拉开拉链，眯起眼睛。里面只有两张折起来的纸，我一眼就认了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:50022
    old "I grabbed them with two fingers and unfolded them, confirming they were the event tickets."
    new "我用两根手指把它们夹出来展开，确认正是活动门票。"

    # game/script.rpy:50025
    old "I didn't give it another thought before dashing out and closing the door."
    new "我没有再多想，冲出门外，顺手把门关上。"

    # game/script.rpy:50031
    old "I froze up, realizing how suspicious I looked. I instinctively crumpled the tickets in my fist, but nobody was around to see me."
    new "我僵在原地，这才意识到自己看起来有多可疑。我下意识把门票攥成一团，但周围并没有人看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:50032
    old "I breathed deeply and began to walk away, calm and nonchalant. I had prevented it; I wasn't in my world anymore, but Isla wouldn't die."
    new "我深吸一口气，若无其事地走开。我已经阻止了那件事；这里不再是我的世界，但 Isla 不会死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50038
    old "What would happen with Isla? If two versions of her really existed, then it seemed they'd both permanently persist in a single reality. However, I'd already decided once that was the better option, so I'd just put her in the same situation as me."
    new "Isla 会怎么样？如果真有两个她同时存在，那她们似乎都会永久留在同一个现实里。不过，我早就认定那已是更好的选择，所以只是让她落得和我一样的处境。"

    # game/script.rpy:50043
    old "I soon made it back to Enric avenue. From the same corner, I saw light behind Atsuki's window."
    new "我很快回到了恩里克大道。从同一个街角望去，Atsuki 的窗户后亮着灯。"

    # game/script.rpy:50044
    old "I stared at it for a bit, but I gave up after a short while. I just wanted to go home and wait for tomorrow to come."
    new "我盯着那点灯光看了一会儿，没多久便放弃了。我只想回家，等着明天到来。"

    # game/script.rpy:50045
    old "I'd always liked walking through that street, but I turned around and moved to Ramon as I stepped through the thin, parallel path."
    new "我一向喜欢走那条街，但这次我转过身，穿过那条窄窄的平行小径，朝拉蒙街走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50048
    old "...Tomorrow, I'll definitely have to take our tickets, no matter how. It might not be as much of a priority as I thought, though.{w} If I find the Sekimeiya in the tower and enter it during the night, I'll either travel through time or be caught by the police. If I travel through time, taking our tickets won't matter since I'll change the past. ...And if I get caught by the police, there's no way Atsuki won't learn about it. I'm not sure what would happen to my other self, but I doubt she and Atsuki would just go to the tower on the 15th."
    new "……明天，我无论如何都得把我们的门票拿到手。不过，这件事也许没有我以为的那么要紧。{w}如果我在塔里找到 Sekimeiya，并在夜里进入其中，要么完成时间穿越，要么被警察抓住。若能穿越成功，拿门票也就没有意义，因为我会改变过去。……而要是被警察抓住，Atsuki 不可能不知道。我不清楚另一个我会怎样，但我不觉得她会在 15 号那天和 Atsuki 一起去塔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:50051
    old "I would still do it, just in case. For the time being, I simply kept going over the lottery numbers in my head, slowly approaching my apartment. When I was getting close, I saw the footprints I'd left earlier, but again, it seemed that the previous day's weren't there. ...However much my steps left impressions, it was clear that they were all bound to eventually fade."
    new "以防万一，我还是会去做。眼下，我只是在脑中反复默念着彩票号码，慢慢朝公寓走去。快走到时，我看见了先前留下的脚印，但和之前一样，前一天留下的脚印似乎已经不在了。……无论我的脚印留下多深的痕迹，终究都会消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:50059
    old "Of course, it was warm inside my apartment again. I shrugged off my coat almost immediately."
    new "公寓里果然还是那么暖和。我几乎立刻就把外套脱了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:50060
    old "I looked at my phone. It was {time=14:04.}{w} There was nothing else I wanted to do for the day, so I went to the kitchen after a long pause."
    new "我看了一眼手机，时间显示 {time=14:04.}{w} 今天已经没有别的事想做了，过了好一会儿，我才走向厨房。"

    # game/script.rpy:50063
    old "As much as I disliked the idea of eating noodles again, I had nothing else. I didn't want to go buy food again because I'd just feel like I was doing something else in Yushibana for the last time. Like the day before, I washed the only pot I had and boiled a bit of water before dropping a stiff block of noodles in it."
    new "我虽然很不想再吃面，却也没有别的可吃。我不想再去买吃的，因为那只会让我觉得自己又要在丰花最后一次做某件事。和前一天一样，我把唯一的一口锅洗了洗，烧了一点水，然后丢进一块硬邦邦的面饼。"

    # game/script.rpy:50065
    old "I waited for them to be cooked, sparingly moving them with two new chopsticks. When four minutes had passed, I poured most of the liquid out and let the noodles fall into a bowl."
    new "我等着面煮好，偶尔用一双新筷子拨弄几下。四分钟过去后，我倒掉大半汤汁，把面盛进碗里。"

    # game/script.rpy:50069
    old "I knew exactly what their taste would be before I began to eat. It was really getting old, but I powered through."
    new "还没动筷，我就知道它会是什么味道。实在吃腻了，我还是勉强吃了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50073
    old "The bowl was empty, and I could hardly tell I'd just eaten. I tried to lie on the floor, but it was a bit uncomfortable for my stomach. Instead, I grabbed the bowl and brought it back to the kitchen."
    new "碗空了，我却几乎感觉不到自己刚吃过东西。我试着躺到地板上，可胃里有些难受。于是我拿起碗，把它端回厨房。"

    # game/script.rpy:50076
    old "I placed it in the sink and opened the cabinet with the food I'd bought. After inspecting it briefly, I indifferently closed the wooden door."
    new "我把它放进水槽，打开装着买来食物的橱柜。草草看了一眼后，我漠然关上木门。"

    # game/script.rpy:50077
    old "I was about to drop the packaging of the noodles into the trash, but I remembered I'd thrown out the bag earlier. I took the roll out of a drawer and placed a new, empty bag in the corner. I thought back on the tickets and looked inside my purse. I'd left both of them there, so I threw them in the garbage as well."
    new "我正要把面条的包装袋丢进垃圾桶，却想起垃圾袋早就被我扔掉了。我从抽屉里取出一卷垃圾袋，在角落里放了一个新的空袋。想到门票，我又看了看自己的手提包。两张票都还留在里面，于是我把它们也扔进了垃圾桶。"

    # game/script.rpy:50081
    old "I went back to sit on one of the scattered cushions. As much as I felt incredibly overwhelmed, I was out of things to think about. Eventually, I dropped on the floor and emptily let time pass."
    new "我回去坐到其中一个散落的坐垫上。尽管心里压得几乎喘不过气，我却已经没什么可想的了。最后，我索性倒在地板上，茫然地任时间流逝。"

    # game/script.rpy:50089
    old "It was surreal to think the walls around me, which I'd seen for so many years, could soon disappear forever. There was so much uncertainty."
    new "想到这些看了许多年的墙壁也许很快就会永远消失，总觉得不真实。未知的东西实在太多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50090
    old "No matter what awaited... my future was going to be miserable. Every scenario led to roughly the same thing."
    new "无论前方等着我的是什么……我的未来都注定凄惨。每一种可能，最终都殊途同归。"

    # game/script.rpy:50091
    old "...How was it going to be anything better than terrible? I would either get caught by the police or have to keep on living with sketchy money I wasn't even sure I knew how to obtain."
    new "……它又怎么可能比“糟糕”好到哪儿去？我要么被警察抓住，要么只能靠来路不明的钱继续活下去——而我甚至不确定自己能不能弄到那些钱。"

    # game/script.rpy:50092
    old "I'd have no proper identity and no idea how to get a new one or do anything else... There's no way this will work, and the other version of me will live her life completely clueless, maybe until she finds out she was arrested somewhere."
    new "我没有正式身份，也不知道该怎么弄到新身份，或者还能做什么……这条路根本行不通。而另一个我会一无所知地过她的日子，也许直到某天发现自己在什么地方被捕了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50093
    old "Even if none of those options occur... if I can't go back in time again, but I also don't get caught... What the hell happens then? I'd just have to explain everything to Atsuki and myself. ...What would my thoughts have been if another version of myself appeared like that during the impact of Miiya's death?"
    new "就算这些情况都没发生……如果我无法再次回到过去，却也没有被抓住……那到底会怎样？我就只能把一切向 Atsuki 和另一个我解释清楚。……如果在 Miiya 死去的冲击中，另一个版本的我突然这样出现，我当时会怎么想？"

    # game/script.rpy:50096
    old "There really wasn't a good possible way it could all end. Even though I'd chosen the sole path that could save Miiya, achieving it was actually no guarantee."
    new "这件事无论怎么收场，都不会有好的结果。即便我选了唯一可能救下 Miiya 的那条路，也并不能保证真能走到终点。"

    # game/script.rpy:50097
    old "At this time tomorrow, I'll already have been in the tower, and I'll be thinking about the best way to act. If I can't pull things off in the night, what the hell will I say to the police? They'll immediately realize another me is in the hospital."
    new "明天的这个时候，我已经身在塔里，正琢磨着最妥当的行动方式。如果夜里没能成事，我到底该怎么跟警察说？他们立刻就会意识到另一个我正躺在医院里。"

    # game/script.rpy:50098
    old "I wonder what would happen if I revealed what the Sekimeiya can do. They'd have to believe me due to my existence.{w} And then what? Would they let me go with no real identity of my own? Would the Sekimeiya be kept a secret? If so, there's no chance I'd be able to live anything akin to a normal life.{w} Honestly, maybe getting caught by the police would be better... Or, if I'm able to save Miiya, I could reveal myself, and they'd decide what to do."
    new "如果我说出 Sekimeiya 能做到什么，会怎么样？我的存在本身就是证据，他们不信也得信。{w}然后呢？他们会让我这个没有真正身份的人离开吗？Sekimeiya 的事会被保密吗？如果是那样，我根本不可能过上任何正常生活。{w}说实话，也许被警察抓住反而更好……或者，如果我能救下 Miiya，我可以自己现身，让他们决定怎么处置我。"

    # game/script.rpy:50099
    old "...{w}I realized I'd just thought that and pitied myself. I'd been feeling sporadic senses of liberty the past few days after being shut away for so long, so the fact that I'd seen an outcome deprived of any freedom as acceptable was just disheartening."
    new "……{w}我意识到自己刚冒出这种念头，便不由得可怜起自己来。被关了那么久之后，这几天我偶尔能感到一点自由；可即便如此，我居然觉得一个毫无自由可言的结局也可以接受，这实在令人心灰意冷。"

    # game/script.rpy:50100
    old "It was undoubtedly absurd that I'd held off from going to the tower for so long. My hesitation could have doomed me at any point. I was just selfish. I wanted those tranquil days to continue despite knowing they couldn't—being in my living room was proof enough of that..."
    new "我拖了这么久还不去塔里，实在荒唐。我的犹豫随时都可能让我万劫不复。我只是自私罢了。明知那些平静的日子不可能继续，我却还是想留住它们——此刻待在客厅里，就是最好的证明……"

    # game/script.rpy:50103
    old "It appeared to just be misfortune that what I wanted was the single thing that definitely couldn't happen. Ironically, there was no going back. The important decision had already been made, and I was only stalling out the clock."
    new "我所渴望的，偏偏是唯一绝不可能发生的事，这看来只能归咎于不幸。讽刺的是，已经没有回头路了。重要的决定早已做出，我不过是在拖延时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:50104
    old "My mind hadn't changed, and if I went back to the time I'd decided, the result wouldn't differ. It had been clear from the beginning that there was no win-win situation."
    new "我的心意没有改变，就算回到当初做决定的那一刻，结果也不会有什么不同。从一开始就很清楚，根本不存在两全其美的选择。"

    # game/script.rpy:50105
    old "It wasn't possible to go back to my old world, not even with the Sekimeiya."
    new "我回不到原来的世界了，就算借助 Sekimeiya 也不行。"

    # game/script.rpy:50106
    old "If I traveled days through time, I wouldn't be able to let everything play out as it once had anymore. There were people who'd traveled from the 15th and changed history... In the blink of an eye, the world I'd always lived in had distanced from me so much that it was no longer reachable."
    new "如果我穿越回几天前，就再也没有办法让一切照原来的样子发展。已经有人从 15 号穿越回来，改变了历史……转眼之间，我一直生活的世界已经离我如此遥远，再也触不可及。"

    # game/script.rpy:50107
    old "So, with no room for doubt, attempting to save Miiya was what I had to do. I needed to figure out a way to travel days through time once more and save her. If I took the Sekimeiya before November 27th, that'd be the best I could do. ...And then, after that would come a new decision, almost as important as the last."
    new "所以，毫无疑问，我必须去救 Miiya。我得想办法再穿越一次时间，回到几天前救她。如果能在 11 月 27 日之前拿到 Sekimeiya，那已经是我能做到的最好了。……而在那之后，还会有一个几乎和上次同样重要的新决定。"

    # game/script.rpy:50114
    old "After lying on the floor for so long, my nervousness gradually dissipated. There was no way I'd be able to calm myself the next day, but the beige walls of my living room were oddly relaxing."
    new "在地板上躺了这么久，紧张感也渐渐散去。到了明天，我绝不可能这样平静，但客厅那米色的墙壁却莫名让人放松。"

    # game/script.rpy:50115
    old "Maybe I really was spending my last hours there, as unbelievable as it felt. I was in a situation I didn't think anyone else had ever been in, and I was the one who had chosen to go through it alone. But I was at a point where I really had to believe in my decisions, and I was confident in thinking that giving myself that last day had been the right thing."
    new "也许我真的要在这里度过最后的几个小时了——尽管这令人难以置信。我觉得从来没有人经历过我这样的处境，而且是我自己选择独自面对的。但事到如今，我只能相信自己的决定；我也确信，给自己留下最后一天是正确的。"

    # game/script.rpy:50116
    old "I couldn't keep the myriad of thoughts from circling through my mind, but they eventually faded into the background. Time advanced, the light slowly abandoning the room."
    new "无数念头在脑中盘旋，挥之不去，但最终都退到了意识边缘。时间推移，光线也一点点从房间里退去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50126
    old "...{w}What the hell was I thinking?"
    new "……{w}我到底在想什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:50127
    old "I'd had to keep so many things in mind that I couldn't really be surprised I'd made such a large oversight."
    new "要留意的事太多，犯下这么大的疏漏，我其实也不该感到意外。"

    # game/script.rpy:50128
    old "I took Isla's and Erina's tickets to prevent them from going to the tower on the 15th. It sounded like a good idea because they could've sold out quickly...{w} I completely ignored that they could simply print them out again. ...I don't think they'd have to buy new ones."
    new "我拿走了 Isla 和 Erina 的票，是为了阻止她们在15号去芦屋塔。当时觉得这主意不错，因为票很可能很快售罄……{w} 却完全忽略了她们只要重新打印一份就行。……我想她们应该不用再买新票。"

    # game/script.rpy:50129
    old "I sighed, exasperated. I'd never had a printer, so I hadn't thought it through. I knew Atsuki and I hadn't checked our tickets until the 14th, but we would've been able to print new ones if they hadn't been there."
    new "我无奈地叹了口气。我从来没有过打印机，所以根本没往这方面想。我知道我和 Atsuki 直到14号才查看门票，可要是票不在，我们本可以重新打印。"

    # game/script.rpy:50130
    old "How the hell do I do this, then? Unless Erina and Isla don't notice that their tickets are gone until they're in the tower, they can just go anyway.{w} At least in the case of Atsuki and myself, it was seeing our tickets that made us decide to go through with attending the event, so we might actually not go if I do take them."
    new "那我到底该怎么做？除非 Erina 和 Isla 一直到进了芦屋塔才发现票没了，否则她们照样可以去。{w} 至少对我和 Atsuki 来说，是看到票之后才决定去参加活动的，所以如果我把票拿走，我们说不定真就不会去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50133
    old "I really didn't want to think very hard about it, but I wasn't too worried. If I got caught by the police, Atsuki and I probably wouldn't go to the event, but if I wasn't able to find the Sekimeiya, I'd have to think of something else. Maybe a note wasn't a horrible idea, or I could break his printer. There had to be at least one way to stop Atsuki and me from going."
    new "我实在不愿多想，但也没有太过担心。要是我被警察抓住，我和 Atsuki 大概就去不成活动了；可要是我找不到 Sekimeiya，就得另想办法。留张字条或许也不算坏主意，或者我还可以弄坏他的打印机。总该有办法阻止我和 Atsuki 去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50134
    old "And Erina and Isla... If I'm not able to travel, I could just try to talk to them again, but I'm not sure what I'd say. I wonder if they'd accuse me of stealing their tickets if I suddenly show up warning them not to go."
    new "还有 Erina 和 Isla……要是时间穿越行不通，我就只能再试着和她们谈谈，可我不确定该说什么。如果我突然出现，警告她们别去，她们会不会怀疑是我偷了票？"

    # game/script.rpy:50135
    old "I'd think about that tomorrow, after getting inside the tower."
    new "等明天进了芦屋塔再想吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:50139
    old "I hadn't moved in too long, and I'd begun to feel tired. The sun was setting, so my body was requesting that I sleep at the same time it had gotten accustomed to."
    new "我太久没有动弹，倦意开始涌上来。太阳正在落山，身体也到了习惯的入睡时间，催我睡下。"

    # game/script.rpy:50141
    old "It seemed laughable to think I'd be able to fall asleep. I could try to quell the onslaught of my thoughts, but there was no getting rid of them."
    new "现在想睡着，简直可笑。我可以试着压住纷涌的思绪，却根本赶不走它们。"

    # game/script.rpy:50142
    old "Once again, the same sharp pain hit me when I thought that it could have been my last night in that apartment. If I managed to go back in time the next day, it really was possible I'd never rest in my bed again."
    new "一想到那也许是我在那间公寓度过的最后一夜，同样的刺痛便再度袭来。如果明天我真的成功回到过去，我或许再也不会躺在那张床上休息了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50143
    old "I already thought of this, but I shouldn't take it lightly. How exactly am I going to get in the tower tomorrow night if I'm getting tired at this time?"
    new "这事我早就想过了，可也不能掉以轻心。这个时间就开始犯困，明晚我到底要怎么进芦屋塔？"

    # game/script.rpy:50144
    old "I'd enter the tower with a plan in mind. It could entail staying there for the entire duration or rushing out of the building with the Sekimeiya. While I wasn't sure yet, I didn't want to blow it due to a lack of sleep, and simply drinking coffee to stay awake had backfired numerous times."
    new "我会带着计划进入芦屋塔。也许是在里面一直待到结束，也许是拿到 Sekimeiya 后冲出大楼。具体怎么做还没定，但我不想因为睡眠不足而功亏一篑；光靠喝咖啡硬撑，已经失败过很多次了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50149
    old "I thought of placing the clothes I'd washed into the wardrobe, but I just couldn't bring myself to do it. There was nothing I could do but keep lying down, awaiting the time where I'd force myself into bed."
    new "我想过把洗好的衣服放进衣柜，却实在提不起劲。我什么也做不了，只能继续躺着，等自己狠下心爬上床。"

    # game/script.rpy:50156
    old "But a while later, that time hadn't come. While I was tired, I couldn't manage to stand up, as that would mean finally abandoning the life I had."
    new "可过了好一阵，那个时候也没有来。我明明累了，却站不起身——因为站起来，就意味着彻底舍弃我现在的生活。"

    # game/script.rpy:50157
    old "...If I stayed on the floor, it would mean the last night in my bed had already happened, and for some reason, I preferred that."
    new "……如果我继续躺在地板上，就意味着在床上的最后一夜已经过去了。不知为何，我宁愿如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:50163
    old "Sleep Paralysis"
    new "睡眠瘫痪"

    # game/script.rpy:50168
    old "I managed to stand up, but only to turn off the light."
    new "我好不容易站起身，却只是为了关灯。"

    # game/script.rpy:50169
    old "The room had become fully dark. I couldn't tell how much time had passed since I had looked away from the small, red light on the TV."
    new "房间已经完全暗下来。自从我移开视线、不再看电视机上那点红色小灯，也不知过了多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:50171
    old "However, I knew it had been a while. My head rested on a cushion, and the feel of the carpet was comforting. Even though I had no blanket, the heater allowed me to remain in the middle of the floor, contacting the table with my back."
    new "不过我知道，已经过了不少时间。我的头枕在靠垫上，地毯的触感也让人安心。虽然没有被子，但暖气让我能一直躺在地板中央，后背挨着桌子。"

    # game/script.rpy:50172
    old "But I hadn't fallen asleep. I had only sensed time passing, my vivid trains of thought infinitely spiraling into chaotic repetition."
    new "可我并没有睡着。我只是感觉到时间在流逝，鲜明的思绪无限盘旋，陷入混乱的重复。"

    # game/script.rpy:50181
    old "That became mentally exhausting. I just wanted to fall asleep, but it didn't seem like it would ever happen."
    new "这让我精神上疲惫不堪。我只想睡着，却似乎怎么都做不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:50182
    old "The absolute silence had persisted for what felt like hours. At one point, I realized that I'd fallen asleep just for my awareness to instantly return."
    new "死一般的寂静仿佛持续了好几个小时。有那么一刻，我发觉自己刚睡着，意识却又立刻回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50183
    old "That might've happened a few more times. However, I still felt as if I'd been awake the whole time, desperately trying to lose consciousness."
    new "这种情况也许又发生过几次。可我仍觉得自己一直醒着，拼命想让自己失去意识。"

    # game/script.rpy:50194
    old "Was the sun going to rise at any point? I had to go to the tower in the morning so that I had enough time until the next night."
    new "太阳到底还会不会升起？我必须在早上去芦屋塔，这样离第二天夜里还有足够的时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:50195
    old "...I thought of setting an alarm, but I couldn't briefly sleep and be drowsy on such an important day."
    new "……我想过设个闹钟，但在这么重要的日子，我不能只睡一小会儿就昏昏沉沉的。"

    # game/script.rpy:50199
    old "I'd been thinking about grabbing my phone for a while until I finally extended my arm and felt around the surface of the table. I dragged my phone toward me and shut my eyes tightly as I flipped it open."
    new "我惦记着去拿手机，过了好一阵才终于伸出手，在桌面上摸索。我把手机拖到面前，翻开它时紧紧闭上了眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:50200
    old "Soft, blue light soaked through my eyelids, prompting me to raise them. Then, I stared at the upper corner and waited for my blurry vision to fade."
    new "柔和的蓝光透过眼睑，我这才睁开眼。随后我盯着屏幕上方，等待模糊的视线慢慢清晰。"

    # game/script.rpy:50207
    old "It's so late..."
    new "都这么晚了……"

    # game/script.rpy:50208
    old "...Next to the numbers, I saw the words \"No service\"."
    new "……数字旁边，我看到了「无服务」几个字。"

    # game/script.rpy:50210
    old "I didn't think I'd seen them before, but I closed my phone to combat an abrupt headache."
    new "我印象里从没见过这几个字，可突然一阵头痛，我只好合上了手机。"

    # game/script.rpy:50213
    old "After that, I dropped my head back on the pillow, starting to seriously worry."
    new "之后我把头重新埋回枕头里，心里开始真正担忧起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:50215
    old "There was no way I'd be in time for the event that would start in four hours. ...At least that wasn't too important."
    new "四个小时后活动就要开始，我绝不可能赶上了。……不过那至少不算太要紧。"

    # game/script.rpy:50216
    old "But it didn't feel like I'd ever fall asleep. When I had, I'd immediately reawakened, and once I'd seen the light of my phone, I couldn't get it out of my mind."
    new "可我总觉得自己根本睡不着。就算睡着了，也会立刻醒来；而看到手机屏幕的光之后，那件事就一直在我脑子里，怎么也赶不走。"

    # game/script.rpy:50217
    old "The entrance fee on the 15th had been pretty expensive... I believed I had enough money in my wallet, but if not, I still had the option of buying a normal visit."
    new "15号的入场费相当高……我觉得钱包里的钱应该够，就算不够，也还能买普通参观票。"

    # game/script.rpy:50220
    old "I rolled onto my back. Being there was getting unbearable."
    new "我翻了个身，仰面躺着。再这样待下去，我快要受不了了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50221
    old "Most of my stress had faded a long while ago, but that still hadn't been enough to fall asleep. The impression that I was wasting any of my time was intrusive."
    new "大部分压力很久以前就散去了，可那还是不足以让我入睡。那种自己正在浪费时间的念头，怎么都挥之不去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50225
    old "I finally sat up and noticed that I really wasn't tired. After a short time, my constricting headache started to fade."
    new "我终于坐起身，发觉自己确实一点也不困。过了一会儿，那种发紧的头痛也开始消退。"

    # game/script.rpy:50226
    old "I grabbed my phone again. It was {time=5:30.}"
    new "我又拿起手机。时间是 {time=5:30.}"

    # game/script.rpy:50228
    old "On the 15th, we'd gone to the tower during the night because we hadn't been able to fall asleep. ...It was still very early, though."
    new "15日夜里，我们睡不着，便去了塔那边。……不过，那时候还早得很。"

    # game/script.rpy:50231
    old "If I go before sleeping, I could come back later and rest until the afternoon. If I'll have to spend a long time in the tower the next night, that'll help me not be exhausted."
    new "趁睡前先去一趟，之后回来还能休息到下午。要是明晚得在塔里待很久，这样也不至于累垮。"

    # game/script.rpy:50232
    old "It was doubtful I'd be able to sleep after coming back, when I'd finally be aware of the crucial details I needed.{w} But since it was likely Atsuki wouldn't be at home late in the day, I didn't think it was a terrible idea."
    new "等我回来，终于弄清了那些关键细节，恐怕就更睡不着了。{w}不过，Atsuki 白天晚些时候多半不在家，所以这主意也不算太糟。"

    # game/script.rpy:50236
    old "There was no way I'd be able to lie back down again after sitting up, let alone sleep. I'd been on that carpet for so many hours."
    new "坐起身后，我再想躺回去已是不可能，更别提睡着。我已经在那块地毯上待了好几个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:50237
    old "I was still a bit dizzy, but I managed to carefully stand in the darkness and step out of the room."
    new "头还有些晕，但我还是在黑暗中小心地站起身，走出了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:50243
    old "More than three hours remained until {time=9}, when the tower's halls would open to the public. On the 15th, though, Atsuki and I had been in the lobby since much earlier."
    new "距离 {time=9} 塔内对外开放还有三个多小时。可15日那天，我和 Atsuki 也很早就在大堂里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50244
    old "I didn't know if it was a bad idea, but I grabbed my coat and stepped into the pair of boots on the floor. I gripped the door and slowly pushed it open."
    new "不知道这算不算个坏主意，我还是抓起外套，踩进地上的那双靴子。我扶住门，慢慢把它推开。"

    # game/script.rpy:50260
    old "The air was frigid as usual, but I couldn't feel any wind. A multitude of stars filled the dark sky, unmatched by the row of streetlights across the closest walkway. Not a soul could be seen, and the imposing atmosphere made me reconsider going out so early."
    new "空气一如既往地寒冷，却感觉不到一丝风。漆黑的夜空缀满繁星，近处步道旁那排路灯根本无法与之相比。四下不见人影，肃穆的气氛让我不禁重新考虑，这么早出门是否妥当。"

    # game/script.rpy:50261
    old "I stepped forward, the snow stiff beneath my feet. I couldn't make out that layer of white anywhere but directly underneath the lights."
    new "我向前迈步，脚下的积雪硬邦邦的。除了灯光正下方，别处都看不出那层白色。"

    # game/script.rpy:50262
    old "I had my purse with me, so I closed the door and descended the stairs, purposely avoiding the frozen handrail."
    new "我带着手提包，顺手关上门，走下楼梯，刻意不去碰冻住的扶手。"

    # game/script.rpy:50269
    old "I looked in the direction of the tower. However, for once, I couldn't see it."
    new "我朝塔的方向望去。可这一次，我竟看不见它。"

    # game/script.rpy:50270
    old "There was no chance I'd get lost, so I started to walk toward its location. As the tower was on the outskirts, the streetlights soon ceased, making me hug walls to know where I was."
    new "我不可能迷路，便朝它所在的方向走去。塔位于郊外，路灯很快就不见了，我只好贴着墙走，借以辨认自己的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:50272
    old "It wasn't very far, and despite the eerie scenery, I was glad I'd left my apartment. I had to be in the tower in the morning, and I knew its entrance opened far before {time=9.} A receptionist had been there when we'd arrived, so I could try to buy tickets for the event and think about questions I wanted to ask."
    new "路并不远。四周景色虽有些诡异，我还是庆幸自己出了公寓。早上我得进塔，也知道入口在 {time=9.} 之前很早就会开放。我们到的时候，前台已经有人了，所以我可以试着买活动门票，顺便想想自己想问的问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:50279
    old "I kept walking, hoping I was getting closer. I could hardly see anything a few steps ahead, and as all lights had disappeared, I had to confirm the sensation of movement by looking at the ground."
    new "我继续往前走，盼着自己正在靠近。前方几步外几乎什么都看不清，周围又没了灯光，我只能低头看地面，确认自己确实在移动。"

    # game/script.rpy:50281
    old "I started to see more of the round light bulbs in the distance. I knew what it meant. That was the plaza in front of Ashiya Tower."
    new "远处渐渐出现更多圆形的灯泡。我知道那意味着什么——那是芦屋塔前的广场。"

    # game/script.rpy:50284
    old "I got closer and closer until I started to perceive the lights' quiet buzz. Then, I followed the path with my eyes, ending where the tower stood."
    new "我越走越近，直到开始听见灯光细微的嗡鸣。随后，我顺着小径望去，视线尽头便是塔所在的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:50292
    old "There it was. The immense building in the form of a huge shadow that covered the many stars behind it. I slowly got closer to it, interspersing the hum of the lights with sharp steps."
    new "它就在那里。庞大的建筑化作一道巨大的影子，遮住了身后的漫天繁星。我慢慢靠近，脚步声一下一下，夹在灯光的嗡鸣之间。"

    # game/script.rpy:50296
    old "However, before I expected to, I hit a wall."
    new "然而，比我预想得更早，我撞上了一堵墙。"

    # game/script.rpy:50297
    old "...It was the wall of the tower, which I suddenly hit with my foot. Startled, I felt it with my hand, expecting a cold stone."
    new "……是塔的外墙，我的脚突然撞了上去。我吓了一跳，伸手去摸，以为会碰到冰冷的石头。"

    # game/script.rpy:50298
    old "But I touched something else entirely. My fingers felt a smooth, glassy surface, and as I stared at it with confusion, my vision adjusted just enough to understand where I was."
    new "可我摸到的完全不是石头。指尖触到一片光滑的玻璃般的表面；我困惑地盯着它，眼睛渐渐适应，才勉强弄清自己身在何处。"

    # game/script.rpy:50305
    old "...It was the door. No thick shutter was there either, as I could recognize the floor of the lobby a step beyond the glass."
    new "……是门。那里同样没有厚重的卷帘门；隔着玻璃，我认出了一步之外大堂的地面。"

    # game/script.rpy:50306
    old "I wondered to myself why I'd been surprised and immediately concluded that it was because there was no light. I'd suddenly hit the glass with no warning since the lights behind it weren't turned on."
    new "我暗自纳闷自己为何会吃惊，随即明白过来——是因为没有光。玻璃后方的灯没开，我才毫无预兆地撞了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50309
    old "Instead of putting my hand back in my pocket, I grabbed my phone. The screen displayed {time=5:48.} Then, I hesitantly gripped the handle of the door and tried to open it.{w} Like it seemed, it was locked."
    new "我没有把手放回口袋，而是掏出手机。屏幕上显示 {time=5:48.}。随后，我迟疑地握住门把手，试着开门。{w}果然，门锁着。"

    # game/script.rpy:50312
    old "I stepped back carefully, trying to get a feel for my surroundings.{w} ...And all I determined was that I was completely alone."
    new "我小心地后退几步，想感受一下周围的环境。{w}……结果只确定了一件事：我完全是一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:50319
    old "On the 15th, that door had been highlighted by the warm light behind it, and we'd entered it at {time=6.}"
    new "15日那天，那扇门被背后的暖光照亮，我们是在 {time=6.} 进去的。"

    # game/script.rpy:50320
    old "That time was very close, but I began to wonder whether that had been a special occasion. Maybe they'd anticipated people would come very early and that was why the tower had been open at {time=6.}"
    new "那个时间已经很近了，但我开始怀疑那天是不是特殊情况。也许他们预料到会有人很早就来，所以塔才在 {time=6.} 就开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:50321
    old "...Over three hours were left until {time=9.} When would the entrance open? I had no way to know how long I'd have to wait."
    new "……距离 {time=9.} 还有三个多小时。入口什么时候才会开？我根本不知道要等多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:50325
    old "I leaned on the icy metal of a nearby streetlight, the cold penetrating to my back. The light made my misty breath visible, emphasizing the harsh cold even further. Without a doubt, I wouldn't be able to stay there for long."
    new "我靠在附近路灯冰冷的金属杆上，寒意直透后背。灯光照出我呼出的白雾，愈发显出天气的严寒。毫无疑问，我在这里撑不了多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:50329
    old "I didn't take my eyes off the entrance, but I could hardly see it from where I'd moved to. As I waited outside, I knew people were behind the wall. At the very least, I knew someone was in the security room, waiting for a sudden attack that could come at any moment."
    new "我的视线没离开入口，可从站的地方已经很难看清它。在外等待时，我知道墙后有人。至少，监控室里有人正守着，防备随时可能到来的突袭。"

    # game/script.rpy:50334
    old "I stood, covering my neck as much as I could. The ring of lights let me see slightly ahead in every direction, but past them, there was only darkness."
    new "我站着，尽量遮住脖子。那一圈灯光让我能看清四周稍远一点的地方，可灯光之外只有黑暗。"

    # game/script.rpy:50335
    old "I figured something had to happen soon, but even if I wanted to, I didn't feel capable of turning back. If I moved again, I wouldn't be able to withstand the temperature, and physical fatigue was beginning to set back in."
    new "我想总该有点动静了，可即便想回去，我也觉得自己走不回去。再走动的话，这温度我是撑不住的，而且身体的疲惫又开始涌上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:50343
    old "When I felt like I'd been there for some time, I slowly took my hand out of my fuzzy coat, and with my thumb, I flipped open my phone to look at the time again."
    new "觉得自己已经待了许久，我才慢慢把手从毛绒外套里抽出来，用拇指翻开手机，又看了一眼时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:50344
    old "{time=6:03.}..{w} It had only been a few minutes, and the words \"No service\" were still there."
    new "{time=6:03.}..{w}才过了几分钟，屏幕上依旧显示着「无服务」。"

    # game/script.rpy:50345
    old "I'd also looked at my phone on the 15th, before we'd been asked to leave them behind with the guards. By {time=6:03}, we'd already been allowed to step in."
    new "15日那天，在他们要求我们把手机交给警卫保管之前，我也看过手机。到 {time=6:03} 时，我们已经获准进去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50346
    old "How much longer do I have to be here...? Is the tower not going to open until {time=9}?"
    new "我还要在这里待多久……？塔难道要等到 {time=9} 才开门吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:50347
    old "I was still staring at the building. Any moment, the light behind the glass could turn on. Maybe someone would come and unlock it from the outside. ...There was no way it would remain closed for three more hours."
    new "我仍盯着那栋建筑。玻璃后的灯随时可能亮起。也许有人会来，从外面把门打开。……它不可能还要再关三个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:50354
    old "Without needing to look at my phone, I knew the time was passing glacially. The few minutes I'd been there had already felt much longer."
    new "不用看手机我也知道，时间走得极慢。我到这里不过几分钟，却已经觉得过了很久。"

    # game/script.rpy:50355
    old "...Somehow, they had also passed very quickly. Had I really been there for more than twenty minutes? I felt as if even my mind had frozen through, a complete opposite from the spiraling mess it'd been at home."
    new "……可不知为何，它们又过得飞快。我真的在这里待了二十多分钟吗？我感觉连脑子都冻住了，和在家时那团不停打转的混乱截然相反。"

    # game/script.rpy:50356
    old "I wanted to close my eyes and slowly sit on the ground. Everything around me was dark enough that it wouldn't have made much difference, and it almost felt like my body was gradually sliding down the streetlight anyway."
    new "我想闭上眼睛，慢慢坐到地上。周围已经足够黑，坐不坐下其实没多大差别；而且我几乎觉得，自己的身体本来就在沿着路灯杆慢慢往下滑。"

    # game/script.rpy:50357
    old "I hoped I was retaining enough of my scarce strength to be able to walk into the building when the time came. I still believed that the lights would suddenly turn on, but I hadn't sensed a thing since I'd stopped moving."
    new "我希望自己还留着一丝力气，等时候到了还能走进那栋楼。我仍相信灯光会突然亮起，可自从停下脚步，我就再没察觉到任何动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:50363
    old "When I looked at the time again, it was {time=6:28.} Once more, it seemed as if the last half hour had happened in an instant, while the next one would last an eternity."
    new "我再看时间，已经是 {time=6:28.}。又一次，过去半小时仿佛只在一瞬，而接下来的半小时却会漫长得像永远。"

    # game/script.rpy:50364
    old "Why was nothing happening? Even though it was so early, why was I alone? On the 15th, the group of people waiting for the event had begun hours before it started. Had that never been the case before?"
    new "为什么一点动静都没有？明明这么早，为什么只有我一个人？15日那天，等着活动开始的人群在开始前好几个小时就已经聚起来了。难道以前从未有过这种情况？"

    # game/script.rpy:50365
    old "Even so, when would the door open? It was horrible not knowing how long I'd have to be there for."
    new "即便如此，门究竟什么时候才开？不知道自己还要在这里待多久，实在太难熬了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50367
    old "...The woman who was at the reception desk should come at any time. She was here so early, and so were the guards."
    new "……前台那位女士应该随时会来。她来得那么早，警卫也是。"

    # game/script.rpy:50368
    old "Oh, Katei too. ...He said he'd been taking the daily shifts recently.{w} Uh... did he say when he started? ...It should also be well before {time=9.}"
    new "对了，还有 Katei。……他说自己最近每天都在值班。{w}呃……他说过几点开始吗？……应该也远在 {time=9.} 之前。"

    # game/script.rpy:50378
    old "I couldn't do anything but keep waiting. I desperately needed that door to open, and I had only managed to stay out in the cold for so long because I believed it would."
    new "我除了继续等，什么也做不了。我太需要那扇门打开了；正因为相信它会开，我才能在寒风中撑到现在。"

    # game/script.rpy:50380
    old "I tried to move my right hand, but I couldn't feel the soft touch of my pocket anymore. ...Was something really going to happen?"
    new "我试着动了动右手，却再也感觉不到口袋里那柔软的触感。……真的会发生什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:50381
    old "It was hard to breathe properly, and the sporadic, soft wind began to feel painful. The harsh electric sound, which I'd thought to be minor upon arriving, was practically blaring."
    new "我连呼吸都不顺畅了，偶尔拂来的微风也渐渐变得刺骨。刚到这里时还以为很轻的电流声，此刻几乎震得耳朵发疼。"

    # game/script.rpy:50391
    old "I had been there for an hour, and not a thing had changed. I blanched at the thought of waiting for two more hours, but the longer it went on, the sooner I thought it had to end."
    new "我已经在那里待了一个小时，周围毫无变化。一想到还要再等两个小时，我便脸色发白；可拖得越久，我越觉得它总该有个尽头。"

    # game/script.rpy:50392
    old "The night had stretched out for so long that my eyes were beginning to close on their own. I just wanted to lie in my bed..."
    new "夜晚漫长得仿佛没有尽头，我的眼皮开始不由自主地往下合。我只想躺回自己的床上……"

    # game/script.rpy:50393
    old "The last stretch would not be any easier on me. Soon, Ina would open, but there was no way I could walk there. The temperature inside the tower was regulated, and that was where I needed to be."
    new "最后这段路也不会轻松多少。再过不久，Ina 就要开门了，可我根本走不到那里。塔内温度恒定，那才是我该待的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:50397
    old "The same wait continued until {time=7} came. The time I'd spent could've been summarized in a blink, as each second had been identical."
    new "同样的等待一直持续到 {time=7}。这段时光几乎一眨眼就能概括，因为每一秒都没有任何分别。"

    # game/script.rpy:50398
    old "When would something happen...!? I wanted to sleep and know where the Sekimeiya was. I just needed to step into the tower, but why was it not open already? I had hit the point of real, pressing fear."
    new "到底什么时候才会有事发生……！？我想睡觉，想知道 Sekimeiya 在哪里。我只需要走进那座塔，可它为什么还没开门？我陷入了一种真切而急迫的恐惧。"

    # game/script.rpy:50399
    old "I couldn't think straight. That small plaza was the only illuminated place I could see, and I had to be as close to the entrance as I could."
    new "我无法正常思考。那片小广场是我能看见的唯一亮处，我必须尽可能靠近入口。"

    # game/script.rpy:50404
    old "...{w}I looked up, but I couldn't see anything past the dark, monolithic slab of the building.{w} I hadn't moved in so long that turning my head was painful. I had to do it slowly, but I managed to see the stars."
    new "……{w}我抬起头，视线却被那栋黑色巨碑般的建筑挡得严严实实。{w}我太久没动，连转头都疼。我慢慢转过头，终于看见了星星。"

    # game/script.rpy:50411
    old "...Wait...{w} Am I crazy...?"
    new "……等等……{w}我是不是疯了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:50412
    old "It was the same starry sky. Just like everything below it, nothing had changed above."
    new "仍是那片星空。和下方的一切一样，上方也毫无变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:50413
    old "What...? This doesn't make any sense.{w} Where's...{w} the sun?"
    new "什么……？这根本说不通。{w}太阳……{w}去哪了？"

    # game/script.rpy:50415
    old "I stared up with wide eyes. The dark sky looked just as it had when I'd left my apartment."
    new "我瞪大双眼仰望天空。那片夜色，和我离开公寓时一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:50418
    old "Then, speechless, I looked back at my phone.{w} {time=7:04.}"
    new "随后，我无言地低头看向手机。{w} {time=7:04.}"

    # game/script.rpy:50421
    old "I don't understand... It's like the world has stopped moving.{w} No service... Why? Why does my phone have no service!?"
    new "我不明白……就好像整个世界都停止运转了。{w}没有信号……为什么？手机为什么没有信号！？"

    # game/script.rpy:50427
    old "I'd witnessed the sun rising from behind the mountains countless times. But at that moment, no hint of light peeked out from over them. It was {time=7} already, so why was Yushibana still covered in darkness?"
    new "我曾无数次见过太阳从山后升起。可此刻，山际没有透出一丝光亮。明明已经 {time=7} 了，丰花为什么还笼罩在黑暗里？"

    # game/script.rpy:50428
    old "I'd felt that time might not have been passing since I'd leaned on that streetlight. Astonished, I forced myself to step forward and spun.{w} Nothing at all had changed."
    new "从我靠上那盏路灯起，我就觉得时间也许没有在流动。我惊愕不已，强迫自己迈步向前，又转过身去。{w}一切都没有丝毫改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:50430
    old "There was no meaning I could think of. After all, no matter how certain I felt, it was impossible that everything had just stopped. Inevitably, the sun would rise, obliterating the night."
    new "我想不出这有什么含义。毕竟，不管我多么确信，一切都不可能就这么停下来。太阳终究会升起，将夜色彻底驱散。"

    # game/script.rpy:50431
    old "But with each second that seemingly passed, the more I doubted any had. I'd spent what seemed like eons convinced the lights in the lobby would turn on at any moment, and they still hadn't."
    new "可那些看似流逝的每一秒，都让我越发怀疑时间是否真的在走。我仿佛熬过了漫长的纪元，始终认定大厅的灯随时会亮起，可它们一直没有亮。"

    # game/script.rpy:50432
    old "What was I waiting for? The tower should've opened already. Without a doubt, the sun should've begun to rise already.{w} ...Waiting had become my only protest, but time staunchly refused to advance to the next day."
    new "我究竟在等什么？塔早就该开了。太阳也早该升起了，绝不会有错。{w}……等待成了我唯一能做的抗争，可时间顽固地不肯走到第二天。"

    # game/script.rpy:50437
    old "There was nothing else I could do. I wanted to fall back into my bed and feel the warmth of my apartment, but my legs wouldn't be able to carry me far from that undefined plaza."
    new "我已无计可施。我想倒回床上，感受公寓里的暖意，可我的双腿根本走不出那片模糊不清的广场。"

    # game/script.rpy:50438
    old "Two days before then, I'd also felt like the world had something wrong with it, but everything had solved itself in the end. Was the same thing happening again? How long had I waited then for normalcy to return?"
    new "两天前，我也曾觉得这世界出了什么毛病，但最后一切都自行解决了。现在又是同样的情况吗？那一次，我等了多久才恢复正常？"

    # game/script.rpy:50439
    old "There was no way I was in the wrong, like I'd thought the other day. Nobody was there; everything felt still, and it had even since I'd arrived. I was alone among nothingness. The light above me was a star, and everything for light years around was the void."
    new "不可能像我前几天以为的那样，是我自己有问题。周围空无一人，一切都凝滞不动，从我到这里起便是如此。我独自一人，置身虚无。头顶的光是一颗星，而周围数光年之内尽是虚空。"

    # game/script.rpy:50440
    old "I hugged my body even tighter. I'd been convinced the cold would end at some point, but it continued without end, eroding me. Would {time=9} be no different? I could no longer tell myself it was impossible."
    new "我把身体抱得更紧了。我原本相信寒冷总会有尽头，可它无休无止地延续，不断侵蚀着我。{time=9} 到来时，难道也会一样吗？我已经无法再对自己说那不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:50444
    old "My eyes remained locked to the sky. I was terrified, desperately wishing that I was back in my room, but simultaneously overcome with curiosity. Both of those conflicting feelings locked me in place."
    new "我的目光始终钉在天空上。我害怕极了，拼命希望自己已经回到房间，可同时又被好奇心攫住。两种彼此冲突的情绪把我牢牢钉在原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:50445
    old "It didn't make any sense. Where was the light, the people, or the real world? Traveling through time with the Sekimeiya, as insane as it had been, was at least clearly traveling through time. I had no idea what I was experiencing in front of the tower. It had no name, no concept."
    new "这根本说不通。光在哪里，人又在哪里，真实的世界在哪里？用 Sekimeiya 穿越时间，虽说疯狂，至少还明确是在穿越时间。可我在塔前所经历的究竟是什么，我毫无头绪。它没有名字，也没有概念。"

    # game/script.rpy:50446
    old "I had to go back home. Even though I felt almost unable to walk, I was only a few minutes away, and every second I waited slightly reduced the energy I had to go back."
    new "我必须回家。尽管我几乎连路都走不动，但家离这里只有几分钟路程；而我每多等一秒，回去的力气便少一分。"

    # game/script.rpy:50448
    old "Even so, I was hypnotized by that unchanging sky. Was there an explanation behind the state of the world, or was it another question without an answer?"
    new "即便如此，我仍被那片一成不变的天空摄住了心神。世界为何会变成这样，其中是否另有解释？还是说，这又是一个没有答案的问题？"

    # game/script.rpy:50453
    old "Time was certainly advancing, but I couldn't make out even a hint of a white outline. The sun was nowhere to be seen—not the faintest trace of it."
    new "时间确实在前进，可我却连一道白色轮廓都看不清。太阳踪影全无，连一丝痕迹都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:50456
    old "If the world had frozen, would it ever unfreeze? If so, then the next question was whether I'd get to see that happen."
    new "如果世界已经冻结，它还会有解冻的一天吗？若有，接下来的问题便是，我是否能看到那一刻。"

    # game/script.rpy:50459
    old "I couldn't believe my legs were still supporting my weight. There was nowhere to sit except the slick ground itself. Wanting to confirm how much time had passed, I painfully lowered my neck to look at my phone."
    new "我简直不敢相信双腿还撑得住身体的重量。除了湿滑的地面，没有别的地方可坐。我想确认已经过了多久，便忍着疼低下头去看手机。"

    # game/script.rpy:50461
    old "{time=7:30.}..{w} \"{tip=phone}No service{/tip}\".{w} That time, I slowly moved my finger up to the call button.{w} It was freezing, but it still registered my touch. The moment I pressed it, I called my mother's number."
    new "{time=7:30.}……{w}「{tip=phone}无服务{/tip}」。{w}这一次，我慢慢把手指移向通话键。{w}我的手指冻得发僵，屏幕却仍能感应到触碰。我按下去的瞬间，拨出了母亲的号码。"

    # game/script.rpy:50464
    old "...{w}A quiet, robotic voice came out of the speaker."
    new "……{w}听筒里传来一道平静而机械的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:50465
    old "We couldn't connect to the line."
    new "无法接通。"

    # game/script.rpy:50466
    old "Immediately, a beep played, indicating that the call had been cut."
    new "紧接着，一声提示音响起，表示通话已被切断。"

    # game/script.rpy:50467
    old "I entered something like a state of shock, unable to move the phone away from my ear. Something was very wrong—I could no longer believe anything else. The place I was at that moment was not the real world."
    new "我像是一下子陷入了震惊，手机贴在耳边，怎么也移不开。一定出了很严重的问题——这一点我已无法再怀疑。我此刻所在的地方，不是真实的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:50475
    old "I'd gone back to looking at the sky. Where could I be if not in the real world? Was I in a dream after I'd finally fallen asleep on that soft carpet?"
    new "我又抬头望向天空。若不在真实的世界，我又能在哪里？难道我终于在那块柔软的地毯上睡着，此刻正身处梦中？"

    # game/script.rpy:50476
    old "Usually, verifying that would've been very simple. However, as I could hardly feel my skin anymore, even after pinching my hand, I wasn't able to conclude it was reality."
    new "平时要确认这一点，本该很简单。可我几乎已经感觉不到自己的皮肤，即使掐了手，也无法断定这就是现实。"

    # game/script.rpy:50478
    old "No, it was reality. The minimal sensation had been enough to confirm that. When we'd been in the tower, I'd felt almost the same way regarding how dreamlike everything was. Was there, then, an explanation behind an unmoving world?"
    new "不，这是现实。那一点微弱的触感已经足够证明。之前在塔里时，面对那种如梦似幻的一切，我也有过几乎相同的感受。那么，一个静止不动的世界，背后会有解释吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:50479
    old "Who could possibly interpret anything about that explanation if it existed in the first place? Hadn't I been the only person to notice it two days earlier? After all, it felt as if I was the root cause. The world wasn't permitting me to enter the next day even though it already should have started."
    new "就算真有解释，谁又能解读得了？两天前注意到这件事的，不就只有我一个人吗？毕竟，我觉得自己才是根源。明明新的一天早该开始，世界却不允许我踏入。"

    # game/script.rpy:50486
    old "If that was it, was there anything I could do? There were precisely zero ideas that came to mind about what was happening to me or how I could resolve it."
    new "若真是如此，我又能做什么？我遭遇了什么、该怎么解决，我脑子里连一点头绪都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:50487
    old "And there was no fleeing either. If abandoning the idea of going to the tower would advance everything to the next day, there was no solution."
    new "而且我也逃不掉。如果放弃去塔里就能让一切推进到第二天，那就根本无解。"

    # game/script.rpy:50488
    old "...I could still somewhat feel my hand. What was clear was that staying still was getting me nowhere."
    new "……我的手还勉强有些感觉。唯一清楚的是，继续待在原地不会有任何结果。"

    # game/script.rpy:50489
    old "Still gripping my phone, I took it out again. According to it, time had definitely been passing, as it showed {time=7:35.}"
    new "我仍紧攥着手机，又把它举到眼前。屏幕上显示着 {time=7:35.}，看来时间确实一直在流逝。"

    # game/script.rpy:50492
    old "Making sure I could still move my legs, I stepped closer to the building. Immediately, the bricks that formed the front wall became visible."
    new "我确认双腿还能活动，便朝那栋建筑走近一步。紧接着，正面墙的砖块便出现在眼前。"

    # game/script.rpy:50499
    old "The lobby looked as it had earlier, the tower just as unchanging as its surroundings. I stepped to the left, trying to make out the reception desk. Even though it was very dark, I was sure nobody was there."
    new "大厅还是先前的样子，整座塔和四周一样，没有任何变化。我向左挪步，想辨认前台的位置。尽管光线极暗，我也能肯定那里没有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:50500
    old "I had little to no force left in the motion, but I grabbed the handle again and tried to push."
    new "我几乎使不上力气，却还是再次抓住门把手，试着推了推。"

    # game/script.rpy:50502
    old "It didn't budge at all."
    new "门纹丝不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:50504
    old "The Sekimeiya was close to me, somewhere behind that door. If the world had frozen in place, wasn't it the perfect opportunity to obtain it?"
    new "Sekimeiya 离我很近，就在那扇门后的某处。既然世界已经静止，这难道不是拿到它的绝佳机会吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:50505
    old "I couldn't sense a single living thing anywhere, so there was no need to devise a plan. I just had to find the Sekimeiya and hope that after using it, things would fix themselves."
    new "我察觉不到任何活物的气息，因此也不必费心谋划。我只需找到 Sekimeiya，然后指望用过之后，一切能自行恢复。"

    # game/script.rpy:50508
    old "So I continued stepping away from the door until no light remained in front of me."
    new "于是我一步步远离那扇门，直到眼前不再剩下任何光亮。"

    # game/script.rpy:50514
    old "I walked forward, following the rough wall with my arm. It continued for a short while, but I soon lost it. When that happened, I turned to the right, and something cold hit my shins."
    new "我向前走去，手臂贴着粗糙的墙壁。墙面延伸了一小段，我很快便摸不到了。就在那时，我转向右边，有什么冰凉的东西撞上了我的小腿。"

    # game/script.rpy:50515
    old "It was grass, covered with snow that I shook off before it could stick to me."
    new "那是草，上面盖着雪。我趁雪还没沾到身上，就把它抖掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50516
    old "Then, I put out my right hand and walked ahead, tracing the wall with my bare fingers."
    new "随后，我伸出右手，用裸露的手指贴着墙壁向前摸索。"

    # game/script.rpy:50524
    old "I'd gone around to the left side of the building, having considered the possibility of another way in."
    new "我绕到了建筑左侧，想着或许还有别的入口。"

    # game/script.rpy:50525
    old "Going to the storeroom wasn't the only way to determine if that door really connected to the outside. ...It was completely dark, and the surface of the building was like a block of ice. However, if there was a door somewhere in it, I believed I could find it."
    new "要确认那扇门是否真的通到外面，并非只有去储藏室这一条路。……四周一片漆黑，建筑表面冷得像一整块冰。可只要墙上真有门，我相信自己就能找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:50526
    old "Would I be able to open it if I did? It didn't sound likely, but there was a chance I could enter, and I no longer feared the possibility of someone seeing me through the cameras. Staying outside was far more intimidating."
    new "就算找到了，我能打开吗？听起来希望不大，但总有机会进去。况且，我已不再害怕有人从监控里看见我。待在外面反而可怕得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:50527
    old "I really was exhausted, and the tall grass made the path harder to get through. However, as it was fully dark, I had to be very attentive."
    new "我确实已经筋疲力尽，高高的草丛又让路更难走。可四周一片漆黑，我不得不格外留心。"

    # game/script.rpy:50528
    old "With my forefinger, I slowly traced a line through the wall, attempting to discern the thinnest gap that could've outlined a door."
    new "我用食指贴着墙面缓缓划动，想找出哪怕最细小的接缝——也许那会是一扇门的轮廓。"

    # game/script.rpy:50530
    old "The cold surface was uneven and bumpy, so I rapidly lost all hope. If there was a door somewhere, I wouldn't find it so easily even if I could roughly tell where the storeroom was. As I walked, the fear of passing out began to grow inside me."
    new "冰冷的墙面高低不平，我很快就彻底失去了希望。假如某处真有门，即便我能大致判断储藏室的位置，也不会这么容易找到。我一边走，一边越来越害怕自己会晕倒。"

    # game/script.rpy:50534
    old "Out of nowhere, the wall ended, and I found myself at the back of the tower. In front of me, I could no longer see the stars, as an invisibly dark mountain extended just ahead."
    new "墙壁忽然到了尽头，我发现自己已经来到塔的背面。眼前再也看不见星星，因为一座黑得辨不出轮廓的山就横在前方。"

    # game/script.rpy:50535
    old "I turned around and felt the wall again with my left hand. Eyes closed, I started to retrace my steps, feeling an awful mix of negative emotions."
    new "我转过身，用左手重新摸到墙面。我闭上眼，顺着原路往回走，各种负面情绪在心头搅成一团。"

    # game/script.rpy:50540
    old "But I suddenly stopped when I remembered something from the day we'd been inside that immense building.{w} If that door had really led to the wall I was at, there was a way I could find it."
    new "但我忽然停下脚步，因为我想起那天待在那座巨大建筑里时发生的一件事。{w}如果那扇门真的通到我面前的这面墙，我就有办法找到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:50541
    old "I tried to forcefully press my hand against the wall. Naturally, nothing happened."
    new "我试着用力把手按在墙上。当然，什么也没有发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:50542
    old "If a door was there, it must've been made or covered with the same bricks as everywhere else. However, when we'd been in the storeroom, we had shaken the door from the inside, and it had made a rattling sound.{w} ...If the other side was the wall, then shaking it from the outside would produce the same sound."
    new "如果那里真有一扇门，它一定和其他地方一样，用同样的砖块砌成或覆盖着。不过，我们待在储藏室里的时候，曾从里面摇晃过那扇门，它发出了咔嗒咔嗒的响动。{w}……如果门的外侧就是这面墙，那么从外面摇晃它，应该也会发出同样的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:50545
    old "With no light bulbs around, all sound had disappeared, and during the winter, it was rare to hear insects at night. But the silence felt far too unnatural to be justified."
    new "周围没有灯光，一切声响都已消失，而冬夜里本来也难得听见虫鸣。可这寂静实在太过反常，绝非季节所能解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:50546
    old "I took one step forward and softly hit the wall with a fist. All it produced was an instant, dry noise, and no part of the wall moved in the slightest."
    new "我向前迈了一步，用拳头轻轻敲了敲墙。发出的只有一声短促而干涩的闷响，墙面纹丝未动。"

    # game/script.rpy:50547
    old "I recalled the width of the door and that I was definitely close to the storeroom. After the next step, I repeated the same tired motion, and the result was identical."
    new "我回忆着那扇门的宽度，也确定自己离储藏室已经很近。又迈出一步后，我重复了一遍同样疲惫的动作，结果毫无二致。"

    # game/script.rpy:50548
    old "Then, I stepped again and hit the wall."
    new "接着，我又迈了一步，敲向墙面。"

    # game/script.rpy:50554
    old "Was that it...?"
    new "是这里吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:50555
    old "The sound had been different. To confirm it, I hit the same spot, trying to apply a bit more strength I wasn't sure I had."
    new "刚才的声音不一样。为了确认，我敲了敲同一个地方，还想再多使些力气，尽管不确定自己是否还有余力。"

    # game/script.rpy:50560
    old "The sound I heard was different.{w} Speechless, I extended my arm to the wall and pushed. When I did, I felt it move."
    new "我听到的声音变了。{w}我一时无言，伸手抵住墙面推去，竟感觉到它动了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50562
    old "What...? Did I open it?"
    new "什么……？我把门推开了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:50569
    old "Bridge"
    new "桥"

    # game/script.rpy:50572
    old "After so long, that was what made my heart speed up. I felt the edges and confirmed the outline of a door.{w} Akaro had been right after all. That door in the storeroom was the only thing blocking our way out."
    new "折腾了这么久，让我心跳骤然加快的竟是这一点。我摸到边缘，确认了门的轮廓。{w}Akaro 果然没说错。储藏室里那扇门，正是挡住我们出路的唯一障碍。"

    # game/script.rpy:50573
    old "...{w}I'd gotten it to open easily just by pushing it. However, it had opened inwardly, which was why we hadn't been able to do it in the storeroom."
    new "……{w}我只轻轻一推，门就开了。可它是朝内开的，所以我们在储藏室里才打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:50579
    old "I stepped toward the door. I couldn't see a thing, but when I felt the inner walls, I immediately identified them: I was back in the storeroom on the tower's crystal floor."
    new "我朝门里迈了一步。眼前什么也看不见，但一摸到内侧的墙壁，我立刻认了出来：我回到了塔的水晶层，正站在储藏室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:50580
    old "But I couldn't move. The fear of someone being in the security room resurfaced. If I walked forward and got caught, that was the end of everything."
    new "可我却迈不动脚步。一想到监控室里可能有人，恐惧便再次袭来。要是我继续往前走，被人抓到，那就全完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50581
    old "The door was covered by bricks, and its gaps were incredibly thin. When I felt it from the inside, I noticed something very important."
    new "那扇门被砖块覆盖着，缝隙细得几乎察觉不到。当我从内侧摸到它时，发现了一件至关重要的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:50582
    old "Oh... There's no handle. It was already gone that morning."
    new "啊……没有门把手。那天早上就已经不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50583
    old "More importantly, that meant that if I closed the door, I wouldn't be able to open it from the inside."
    new "更重要的是，这意味着我一旦把门关上，就没法从里面打开它。"

    # game/script.rpy:50591
    old "I walked deeper into the narrow entrance, leaving it open. There hadn't been much wind outside, so I didn't think it would close on its own.{w} Immediately, I hit another wall. It was what concealed the area I was in."
    new "我任由门开着，沿着狭窄的入口往里走。外面风不大，我想它应该不会自己关上。{w}紧接着，我又撞上了一面墙。正是它挡住了我所在的这片区域。"

    # game/script.rpy:50595
    old "It was in its regular position, separating both sides of the storeroom. I put my hand on it and felt it around the right edge, where the opening mechanism was."
    new "它仍在原位，把储藏室分隔成两边。我把手放上去，沿着右缘摸索，那里应该是开启装置的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:50597
    old "From that side, the little aperture was noticeable to the touch. When I dragged the wall open, however, I couldn't see any difference, as there was no light beyond it."
    new "从这一侧摸过去，能察觉到那个小小的开口。可当我把那面墙拉开时，却看不出任何变化——另一侧没有一丝光亮。"

    # game/script.rpy:50601
    old "I took another cautious step and felt a soft texture. I really was in the storeroom. What I was making contact with was the damaged couch we'd seen next to the wall."
    new "我又小心翼翼地迈了一步，摸到一种柔软的触感。我确实在储藏室里。我碰到的是我们之前见过的那张破损沙发，它就靠在墙边。"

    # game/script.rpy:50602
    old "I couldn't see anything, but I knew the door to hallway A was in front of me. ...Was it open or closed? While I couldn't know that, what I did know was that the lights were off on the other side."
    new "我什么也看不见，但我知道通往A走廊的门就在前方。……那扇门是开是关？这我无从得知，但我能确定，门另一侧的灯是灭的。"

    # game/script.rpy:50608
    old "There was no camera in the storeroom, but as soon as I opened the next door, I would be recorded. ...The question was whether the security room was vacant or not."
    new "储藏室里没有摄像头，可只要我打开下一扇门，就会被拍下来。……问题在于，监控室里究竟有没有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:50610
    old "...{w}I didn't know what to do. Of course, there had to be someone in the security room, but there simultaneously couldn't be—the world had frozen.{w} What would happen if I was seen? I couldn't claim to have randomly found the hidden door."
    new "……{w}我不知道该怎么办。按理说，监控室里一定有人；可与此同时，又不可能有人——世界已经静止了。{w}要是被人看见，会怎么样？我总不能说自己碰巧发现了暗门。"

    # game/script.rpy:50611
    old "But the chance I had was perfect. The tower seemed lifeless, so I could find the Sekimeiya and leave. ...If it was true that nobody was there, I could even set off the alarm and let the Sekimeiya store time for twelve hours, as there wouldn't be anyone in the security room to complete the deactivation process."
    new "但我眼前的机会再好不过。整座塔似乎空无一人，我可以找到 Sekimeiya 再离开。……如果那里确实没人，我甚至可以触发警报，让 Sekimeiya 储存十二小时的时间，因为监控室里不会有人来完成解除流程。"

    # game/script.rpy:50613
    old "Ultimately, I reached my arm toward the door. The day would evidently never begin, so between attempting to walk back home and trying to obtain the Sekimeiya, the decision had already been made."
    new "最终，我把手伸向那扇门。白昼看来永远不会到来，所以在走回家和设法拿到 Sekimeiya 之间，我早已做出了选择。"

    # game/script.rpy:50618
    old "I felt a metallic knob and turned it. Once more, after opening a door, the darkness persisted."
    new "我摸到一个金属门把，转动了它。门开后，黑暗依旧。"

    # game/script.rpy:50624
    old "I couldn't see hallway A, but I knew I was there. I was immediately certain that I wasn't in a dream due to my senses.{w} It was the smell. The same strange smell that had characterized the building on that long day tinged the air again."
    new "我看不见 A走廊，却知道自己正站在那里。感官让我立刻确信，这不是梦。{w}是那股气味。在那个漫长的一天里，弥漫整栋楼的奇异气味，此刻又飘散在空气里。"

    # game/script.rpy:50625
    old "But I knew it wasn't the scent of the building itself. On the evening of the 15th, I'd identified the real source.{w} The Sekimeiya. When we'd been close to it, the smell had strengthened, and when we'd been farther from it, it had always been weaker."
    new "可我知道，那并非建筑本身的气味。15日傍晚，我已经找出了真正的源头。{w}是 Sekimeiya。我们靠近它时，气味就变浓；离得远了，便总是淡下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50626
    old "As I'd thought, the Sekimeiya had to be there, somewhere in the building. ...And going off the intensity, it was close."
    new "果然，Sekimeiya 就在这栋楼里的某处。……而且从气味的浓淡来看，它离我很近。"

    # game/script.rpy:50629
    old "I hadn't taken another step into the hallway, but I'd been there for some seconds and nothing had occurred. Then, I realized that my impression had been incorrect. After opening the door, there had been a subtle change I'd taken a bit to notice."
    new "我还没有再往走廊里迈出一步，就这样站了几秒，什么也没有发生。随后我意识到，自己的感觉错了。开门之后，确实有过某种细微的变化，只是我一时没有察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:50631
    old "A tiny green light could be seen high up, slowly flickering. It belonged to a security camera."
    new "高处有一点微弱的绿光，缓缓明灭。那是监控摄像头。"

    # game/script.rpy:50632
    old "We'd never learned the true meaning behind those lights. Did they indicate that I was being recorded or something else? Was my figure being displayed in the security room?"
    new "我们始终没弄清那些灯光究竟意味着什么。它表示画面正在录制，还是别的什么？我的身影此刻是否正显示在监控室的屏幕上？"

    # game/script.rpy:50633
    old "Everything was cold and still. The only remaining movement was from that inanimate light."
    new "一切都冰冷而静止。唯一还在动的，只有那点没有生命的灯光。"

    # game/script.rpy:50640
    old "The security room had to be soulless, but I couldn't believe it. Even though that belief was close to proven, I couldn't accept it. Slowly, I began to take silent steps toward the metallic door."
    new "监控室里一定空无一人——可我不愿相信。这个念头几乎已被证实，我却仍无法接受。我放轻脚步，慢慢朝那扇金属门走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50646
    old "An occurrence from the 15th was repeating. In just the short time I'd been there, the smell had blended in, becoming harder and harder to notice despite its prior strength."
    new "15日的一幕正在重演。我才站了这么一会儿，那股气味便已融入四周，明明先前那么浓，如今却越来越难察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:50648
    old "...The first time we noticed this smell, wasn't Katei confused about it too? ...But if it came from the Sekimeiya, he should've smelled it during the previous two weeks..."
    new "……我们第一次注意到这股气味时，Katei 不也觉得很奇怪吗？……可如果气味来自 Sekimeiya，那他之前那两周里就应该闻到过才对……"

    # game/script.rpy:50658
    old "I hit the wall at my side, failing to walk in a straight line. Carefully, I continued to move until I felt a doorknob.{w} It was the security room's, so I gently gripped it."
    new "我走不直，撞上了身侧的墙。我谨慎地继续摸索，直到碰到一个门把。{w}那是监控室的门把，我轻轻握住了它。"

    # game/script.rpy:50660
    old "I had to see it with my own eyes. Was nobody on the other side? It couldn't be. Ashiya had been anticipating Xyn's attack, so why would nobody be stationed at the cameras?"
    new "我必须亲眼确认。门后真的没有人吗？不可能。芦屋早已料到 Xyn 会袭击，又怎会不派人守着监控？"

    # game/script.rpy:50662
    old "But I knew the room would be empty because I hadn't been seen. When I slowly opened the door, nothing but darkness waited for me."
    new "可我知道里面空无一人，因为没有人看见我。我缓缓推开门，等着我的只有黑暗。"

    # game/script.rpy:50667
    old "There was nobody inside. I knew there were many monitors in front of me, but none of them were on."
    new "里面没有人。我知道面前排列着许多显示器，却没有一台亮着。"

    # game/script.rpy:50670
    old "It was unbelievable. Why had all life vanished from the world? Why had all the surrounding lights gone dark when electricity still flowed?"
    new "难以置信。为什么世上所有生命都消失了？明明还有电，为什么四周的灯全都灭了？"

    # game/script.rpy:50674
    old "I walked into the room as I recognized a red light near the floor, doubting whether the button it belonged to still functioned."
    new "我走进房间，注意到贴近地面有一点红光，却不确定它对应的按钮还能不能用。"

    # game/script.rpy:50678
    old "I reached out and felt around in front of me. When I touched the chair, I moved it aside and crouched next to the light."
    new "我伸手在面前摸索。摸到椅子后，我把它挪开，在那点红光旁蹲下。"

    # game/script.rpy:50682
    old "I pressed the button softly."
    new "我轻轻按下按钮。"

    # game/script.rpy:50689
    old "A whirring sound came from my side. Following it, one of the screens turned on."
    new "身侧传来一阵嗡鸣。循着声音望去，其中一块屏幕亮了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:50693
    old "The computer had powered on, and a single monitor displayed a loading bar. At last, I could see the dim walls around me, the blue light projecting onto them. Without a doubt, I was the only person there."
    new "电脑启动了，一台显示器上显出进度条。幽蓝的光投在墙上，我终于能看清四周昏暗的墙壁。毫无疑问，这里只有我一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:50694
    old "Soon, the bar filled and was replaced by an authentication screen. I remembered that Katei had entered a long ID and password, so there was no chance I could access it."
    new "进度条很快填满，随即跳出了身份验证界面。我记得 Katei 输入过一长串 ID 和密码，我不可能进得去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50695
    old "I'd confirmed I was alone, as ridiculous as it seemed. I was about to walk out when the messiness of the room caught my attention."
    new "我证实了自己确实孤身一人，尽管这听起来荒唐。我正要转身离开，却被房间里的凌乱吸引了注意。"

    # game/script.rpy:50696
    old "The objects on the desk were scattered around, and almost all the drawers were partially open."
    new "桌上的东西散落各处，几乎所有抽屉都半开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:50700
    old "...What had happened? On the 15th, when we'd stepped inside for the first time, the room had looked considerably different."
    new "……发生过什么？15日我们第一次走进这里时，房间的样子和现在差得很远。"

    # game/script.rpy:50702
    old "Had someone tried to find something? ...I began to feel uneasy."
    new "是有人在找什么东西吗？……我心里开始不安起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:50703
    old "Oh... {w}This is...!"
    new "哦……{w}这是……！"

    # game/script.rpy:50704
    old "Glancing at the many open drawers, I saw something next to a pile of files.{w} I pulled the heavy compartment open and tried to reach the bottom with a finger."
    new "我扫过那些半开的抽屉，在一叠文件旁看见了什么。{w}我拉开沉重的抽屉，用手指往最里面探去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50712
    old "...A brown key, large and rusty. After putting it in front of the light, I confirmed it was the one I suspected."
    new "……一把褐色的钥匙，个头不小，已经生锈。我把它凑到光前，确认正是我猜想的那一把。"

    # game/script.rpy:50713
    old "It's the key we found on the floor of hallway A... We later thought it could've been for the storeroom door."
    new "这是我们在A走廊地上捡到的那把钥匙……后来我们还猜，它可能是储藏室的门钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:50714
    old "And... it was in the security room."
    new "而它……竟然在监控室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:50715
    old "There'd been a few reasons to think that the person who dropped the key was one of the culprits behind the attack."
    new "我们曾有几个理由认为，掉下这把钥匙的人就是袭击的幕后黑手之一。"

    # game/script.rpy:50718
    old "And at that moment, when it was essential for the cameras to be monitored, nobody was in the security room."
    new "而在那个最需要盯着监控的时刻，监控室里却一个人也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:50720
    old "Was there a reason after all? ...Could the frozen world have merely been an illusion?"
    new "难道真有原因？……这个凝固的世界，莫非只是幻觉？"

    # game/script.rpy:50726
    old "There were many things that made me uneasy, so I walked to the door. My breathing had begun to accelerate."
    new "太多事情让我不安，我走向门口，呼吸已经开始急促。"

    # game/script.rpy:50727
    old "The key was still in my hand. It was potentially an essential part of the culprit's plan, so I took it with me, accepting that the past could change. If there was no copy of it, it wouldn't be found in hallway A anymore, and the entire attack could fail depending on its importance."
    new "钥匙仍在我手里。它或许是凶手计划中不可或缺的一环，所以我还是带走了它，哪怕过去可能因此改变。如果没有备用钥匙，它就再也不会出现在A走廊；而整场袭击会不会因此失败，就要看它有多重要了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50735
    old "I felt around the lobby door until I found its knob."
    new "我摸索着找到大厅门的门把。"

    # game/script.rpy:50743
    old "I could see a red light by the reception desk, but it wasn't enough to illuminate the lobby, even with the streetlights shining faintly from beyond the glass.{w} I questioned it again. Why was the entire floor dark when I'd been able to turn on the computer?"
    new "前台那边有一点红光，可即便玻璃外透进微弱的路灯光，也照不亮大厅。{w}我又一次起了疑。既然我能打开电脑，为什么整层楼都是暗的？"

    # game/script.rpy:50747
    old "From the inside, the exterior door wasn't fully transparent, but it was enough to see that the sun hadn't risen yet. It seemed entirely futile to think about that."
    new "从内侧看，大门并非完全透明，但也足够看清太阳还没有升起。在这件事上多想，似乎毫无意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:50748
    old "But if there really was a reason behind it, the mirrored stillness of the tower had the same cause. I could attempt to grasp it from that angle."
    new "可若这背后真有缘由，那么塔中这如出一辙的死寂也出自同一个原因。我或许可以从这里入手。"

    # game/script.rpy:50749
    old "Disoriented, I walked across the smooth floor with my arm out. Where was the Sekimeiya? If Ashiya's intent was to make Xyn break open the cabinet, it couldn't be well-hidden."
    new "我失去方向感，伸着手臂走过光滑的地面。Sekimeiya 在哪里？如果芦屋的本意是让 Xyn 撬开展示柜，那它不可能藏得太深。"

    # game/script.rpy:50750
    old "There was a room below me. There'd been nothing in the storeroom, so the mechanical room was a rational place to store the cabinet.{w} But more importantly, I knew that the light breakers were there. There were no switches on the walls, so if the breakers were on, I would have no idea why the tower was still dark."
    new "我下方还有一个房间。储藏室里空无一物，那么把展示柜放在机械室也合情合理。{w}但更重要的是，我知道照明断路器就在那里。墙上没有任何开关，所以如果断路器是开着的，我就更不明白这座塔为何仍是黑的。"

    # game/script.rpy:50758
    old "I followed the surface of the desk around. There, I searched across the wall until I'd taken hold of a door."
    new "我沿着桌面摸过去，又顺着墙面一路摸索，直到握住一扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:50762
    old "A tenebrous staircase led down from the other side of that door. I descended it, carefully placing each of my steps."
    new "门后是一道向下延伸的幽暗楼梯。我一级一级，小心地走了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50767
    old "It wasn't as narrow as I recalled. The cabinet would have fit if brought down. After I made the sharp turn below, I felt the following door, which I accidentally opened with my knee."
    new "这里没有我印象中那么窄。要是把展示柜搬下来，应该也放得下。我在下面转过那个急弯后，摸到了下一扇门，膝盖一碰，竟把它顶开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50772
    old "...The bulb was no longer emitting any light, but the difference was minimal. I knew the space was filled with furniture, so I gingerly stepped to the wall with the circuit breakers."
    new "……灯泡已经不再发亮，可差别也不大。我知道这屋里堆满了家具，便小心地朝装着断路器的那面墙挪过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50773
    old "I hit the plastic panel with my arm. Naturally, I couldn't see the state of the switches, so I hoped what I had at hand would be enough."
    new "我用手臂撞了一下塑料面板。开关的状态自然看不见，我只能指望手头这点光够用。"

    # game/script.rpy:50774
    old "I took out my phone and placed its screen in front of the panel."
    new "我掏出手机，把屏幕凑到面板前。"

    # game/script.rpy:50776
    old "The breakers were right behind it, so the faint light was enough to let me see the direction they were pointing to. I slowly panned the phone across the plastic surface, taking a look at all of them."
    new "断路器就在面板后方，微弱的光足以让我看清它们的朝向。我举着手机，让屏幕慢慢扫过塑料面板，把每一个都看了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:50777
    old "They were all pointing up."
    new "它们全都朝上。"

    # game/script.rpy:50781
    old "...So, like with the sun, there was no reason behind the lack of light within the tower. It didn't make any sense, but I put my phone away and reached my arm back up."
    new "……看来和太阳一样，塔里为什么没有光，也找不出任何原因。完全说不通。我收起手机，重新把手往上探。"

    # game/script.rpy:50783
    old "When my phone had hit the plastic, I'd heard a metallic sound. As the ceiling was very low, I had no problem reaching the top of the panel."
    new "刚才手机撞上塑料面板时，我听见了一声金属响。天花板很低，我毫不费力就够到了面板顶端。"

    # game/script.rpy:50785
    old "Two cold objects were there."
    new "那里有两个冰凉的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:50786
    old "I grabbed them with two fingers and opened my palm. Even though I couldn't see anything, I could identify their shape."
    new "我用两根手指捏住，摊开手掌。虽然什么都看不见，光凭形状也认得出是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:50788
    old "I took my phone back out and directed its light at what I was holding."
    new "我又掏出手机，把光打向手里的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:50791
    old "{tip=keys}Two more keys{/tip}.{w} Once they were illuminated, I recognized them as well."
    new "{tip=keys}又是两把钥匙{/tip}。{w} 灯光一照，我也认出了它们。"

    # game/script.rpy:50792
    old "Wait... This is the attic's."
    new "等等……这是阁楼的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:50794
    old "But that wasn't all, because the other one was unmistakably the Sekimeiya cabinet's."
    new "可不止如此——另一把毫无疑问是 Sekimeiya 展示柜的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:50797
    old "I... just have to find the cabinet, then...! I can just unlock it. I don't have to break it open."
    new "那我……只要找到展示柜就行了……！直接开锁就好，用不着硬撬。"

    # game/script.rpy:50798
    old "Why the hell had those keys been there? Both of them were supposed to have few or no replicas and be carefully protected."
    new "那两把钥匙怎么会出现在那种地方？它们本该几乎没有复制品，而且一直被小心保管着。"

    # game/script.rpy:50799
    old "Nothing made any sense. How many mysteries layered around the Sekimeiya? ...I began to question what to do."
    new "一切都说不通。围绕着 Sekimeiya，究竟叠了多少层谜团？……我开始犹豫该怎么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:50800
    old "...I have to hurry and find the cabinet, but then what? Should I try to trigger the alarm or just silently unlock it and take the Sekimeiya?"
    new "……得赶紧找到展示柜，可找到之后呢？是设法触发警报，还是悄无声息地开锁，把 Sekimeiya 拿走？"

    # game/script.rpy:50801
    old "I'd been recorded by cameras, so even though I had the cabinet key, shutting down the tower sounded like a fine idea. However, anyone who knew about the secret door could enter at any point."
    new "监控已经拍到了我，所以哪怕手里有展示柜的钥匙，让整座塔停摆听上去也不错。可只要有人知道暗门，随时都能进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:50802
    old "If the rusty key is really for that door, I could try to lock it from the inside..."
    new "要是那把生锈的钥匙真是那扇门的，我或许可以从里面把它锁上……"

    # game/script.rpy:50808
    old "I tried to move, but the obstacles in the room didn't make it easy. Could the cabinet have been there? While it seemed like a good place, neither the lobby nor the mechanical room had cameras."
    new "我试着挪动，可满屋的障碍让行动十分艰难。展示柜会不会就在这里？这地方看着倒合适——大堂和机械室都没有装监控。"

    # game/script.rpy:50812
    old "There were chairs and tables on the floor, so I had to move some aside to get to every part of the room. Even though it was impossible for anyone to be there, I kept trying to be silent and failing as I scattered things that I couldn't see."
    new "地上横着桌椅，我只好把它们挪开，才能查遍房间的每个角落。明知不可能有人，我还是尽量不出声，却总在碰倒看不见的东西时弄出响动。"

    # game/script.rpy:50814
    old "After a while, I knew the cabinet wasn't there."
    new "过了一会儿，我确定展示柜不在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:50818
    old "I had no idea if I needed to hurry or not, so I went up the staircase without wasting any more time."
    new "我不知道需不需要赶时间，干脆不再耽搁，上了楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:50825
    old "I stepped back into the lobby. ...Where would the Sekimeiya have been? There were a couple of places I knew to prioritize over the others."
    new "我回到大堂。……Sekimeiya 会被放在哪里？有几处地方，我知道该优先去看。"

    # game/script.rpy:50829
    old "I walked to hallway B, hitting the hard column with my shoulder."
    new "我朝 B走廊走去，肩膀撞上了坚硬的柱子。"

    # game/script.rpy:50833
    old "The green lights on the cameras were still there, but my legs moved automatically, recalling the steps needed to reach the place called the event room."
    new "监控上的绿灯依旧亮着，而我的腿已经不自觉地迈开，凭着记忆朝那间活动室走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50834
    old "Was it set up as it had been the 15th? Finding out would be simple, and if the cabinet wasn't there, my last idea was the room in front of it, B4, where the cabinets with temperature regulation were."
    new "那里还是 15 号那天的布置吗？确认一下便知。展示柜若不在，我最后的去处就是正对面的 B4——那间放着温控展示柜的屋子。"

    # game/script.rpy:50845
    old "After I'd taken a few steps, I turned around.{w} Through the door, I was peering back into the lobby."
    new "走了几步，我回过头。{w} 隔着门，我朝大堂里张望。"

    # game/script.rpy:50848
    old "My heart sped up all by itself while I scrambled to understand why my line of sight was completely black."
    new "眼前一片漆黑，我慌忙想弄清缘由，心却不听使唤地越跳越快。"

    # game/script.rpy:50849
    old "I could see nothing but darkness, and that didn't make any sense...{w} Because from there, I should've been able to see the lights of the reception desk."
    new "除了黑暗，我什么都看不见，这根本说不通……{w} 因为站在这里，本该能看见前台那边的灯光。"

    # game/script.rpy:50850
    old "What... happened?"
    new "到底……发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:50851
    old "I closed and opened my eyes a few times, wondering if I was the problem."
    new "我闭上眼又睁开，反复了几次，怀疑是不是自己出了问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:50859
    old "There it was."
    new "光又出现了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50861
    old "Stunned, I stared at it. I hadn't moved at all, so I didn't understand. I really wanted to doubt my eyes, but the light had suddenly come back."
    new "我怔怔地盯着那里。我一步都没动，实在想不通。真希望是自己看错了，可灯光确确实实又回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50862
    old "And even though I could see it beyond the door, my heart hadn't slowed down. It was the same sensation as when I'd turned around while being tailed in the snow."
    new "明明隔着门已经看见了光，我的心跳却仍未平复。那感觉，和当初在雪地里被人尾随、回头张望时一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:50867
    old "There was only silence."
    new "四周只有寂静。"

    # game/script.rpy:50871
    old "I backed away slowly without taking my eyes off the light."
    new "我目不转睛地盯着那片光，缓缓后退。"

    # game/script.rpy:50876
    old "And eventually, the wall covered it as I kept approaching the door at my right."
    new "我一步步退向右侧的门，那片光终于被墙壁遮住。"

    # game/script.rpy:50880
    old "I found the doorknob and opened the way to the bridge between the hallways."
    new "我摸到门把手，推开门，走向两条走廊之间的连廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:50886
    old "It was... cold.{w} As soon as I took a step in, I perceived a decrease in temperature."
    new "很……冷。{w} 我刚踏进一步，就感到温度降了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:50890
    old "What is this...?"
    new "这是怎么回事……？"

    # game/script.rpy:50891
    old "I couldn't believe I was able to feel any colder. However, after opening that door, the change had been instant."
    new "我原以为自己不可能再觉得冷了。可门一开，寒意便骤然袭来。"

    # game/script.rpy:50895
    old "As I approached the place where the cabinet had been, the temperature continued to decrease."
    new "我朝原先摆放展示柜的位置走去，温度仍在不断下降。"

    # game/script.rpy:50902
    old "...It is here."
    new "……就在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:50906
    old "In the middle of the wall, I felt the cold touch of a curtain. I raised it as fast as I could, forcing my hand into a claw grip."
    new "在墙壁正中，我摸到一层冰凉的遮布。我尽可能快地把它掀起，一只手已屈成爪形。"

    # game/script.rpy:50908
    old "And when it was out of the way, I didn't have to wonder what was behind it. There was a faint glow, making the crimson texture beneath it visible."
    new "遮布一掀开，我就不必再猜后面是什么了。那里透出微弱的光，映出底下深红的纹理。"

    # game/script.rpy:50909
    old "I couldn't believe it. The Sekimeiya was there, but what had happened in that place? With my free hand, I reached in to verify if the cabinet was open."
    new "难以置信。Sekimeiya 就在眼前，可这地方究竟发生过什么？我用另一只手伸进去，确认展示柜是不是开着的。"

    # game/script.rpy:50913
    old "As I'd thought, the glass wasn't properly closed. That was why the entire room felt chilly."
    new "果然，玻璃门没有合严。难怪整个房间都透着寒意。"

    # game/script.rpy:50914
    old "I had to decide what to do, but I couldn't think straight. ...I had the Sekimeiya at hand—I didn't even need the key that I'd found."
    new "我必须拿定主意，脑子却乱成一片。……Sekimeiya 就在手边——我甚至用不上找到的那把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:50915
    old "I felt the glass with my hand. The gap wasn't big enough to get it through, so I tried to scroll it farther down."
    new "我伸手摸了摸玻璃。缝隙不够大，没法把它取出来，我便试着把玻璃门再往下滑。"

    # game/script.rpy:50918
    old "...I couldn't move it. It seemed to be stuck in place."
    new "……推不动。像是卡住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50919
    old "Why is it not opening...? It can't be locked."
    new "为什么打不开……？总不会是上了锁吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:50920
    old "I kept applying force and noticed that it was moving a little. Before I could reach the Sekimeiya, though, I let go of the glass."
    new "我继续用力，发现它挪动了一点。可还没等我够到 Sekimeiya，我就松开了玻璃。"

    # game/script.rpy:50924
    old "I stared at the cushion around the Sekimeiya. My first impression had been mistaken, as it wasn't just crimson."
    new "我盯着 Sekimeiya 周围的衬垫。最初那一眼看错了——那并不只是深红色。"

    # game/script.rpy:50925
    old "Is that... white?"
    new "那是……白色？"

    # game/script.rpy:50926
    old "It appeared to be stained by a substance, but I couldn't tell what it was."
    new "像是被某种东西染上的，可我辨不出那是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:50927
    old "Frowning, I kept trying to push open the glass."
    new "我皱起眉，继续用力推玻璃门。"

    # game/script.rpy:50929
    old "...Is it cracked?"
    new "……裂了？"

    # game/script.rpy:50930
    old "The surface felt rough, as if it had been damaged."
    new "表面摸上去很粗糙，像是受过损伤。"

    # game/script.rpy:50934
    old "Wh—{w=0.3}{nw}"
    new "什——{w=0.3}{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:50937
    old "A loud noise invaded my ears right as I got the glass unstuck."
    new "玻璃刚松动，一声巨响就钻进了我耳朵。"

    # game/script.rpy:50938
    old "Is that the alarm...!? Why!?{w} Did I just break it!?"
    new "是警报……！？为什么！？{w} 难道是我弄坏的！？"

    # game/script.rpy:50939
    old "I'd never heard that sound, but it had to be the same one that played when we were trapped.{w} I started to lose control of my nerves. What was happening? I'd triggered it after doing something to the cabinet, and I couldn't see what."
    new "我从没听过这个声音，但那一定是当初我们被困时响起的同一个。{w} 我渐渐慌了神。到底出了什么事？我动了展示柜，警报才响的，可我看不清自己到底动了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:50940
    old "I stood still, praying for the sound to disappear. I was being locked in, but nobody was in the security room, and I'd left the storeroom door open.{w} As I stood, I perceived a fainter and rougher sound coming from the lobby. It was the shutter, closing automatically."
    new "我僵在原地，只盼那声音快点消失。我正被关在里面，可监控室里没有人，储藏室的门我也一直敞着。{w} 就在我站着的时候，我听见大厅方向传来一阵更闷、更粗粝的响声。是卷帘门，正在自动落下。"

    # game/script.rpy:50949
    old "The silence came back, but I still couldn't get it together."
    new "寂静重新降临，我却还是没能镇定下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:50950
    old "Of course, the past had changed—the alarm had been activated before the 15th. ...But why?"
    new "果然，过去被改写了——警报在15号之前就响过。……可为什么会这样？"

    # game/script.rpy:50951
    old "...I looked at the Sekimeiya, still faintly glowing. I should've had enough time to escape with it, and I didn't know if the world would return to normal on its own."
    new "……我望向仍在微微发光的 Sekimeiya。我本该有足够的时间带着它逃走；而世界会不会自行恢复原状，我无从得知。"

    # game/script.rpy:50952
    old "I put my hand through the opening and immediately stopped."
    new "我把手探进缝隙，随即停住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:50953
    old "It didn't make any sense, but I was too exhausted to react. The inside of the cabinet, which I expected to be the coldest part of the room, was hot. In fact, as I got closer to the Sekimeiya, I felt a hot aura reminiscent of the one in the water tank."
    new "这毫无道理，可我已疲惫得做不出反应。我原以为展示柜内部是整间屋子最冷的地方，那里却是热的。越靠近 Sekimeiya，那股热意越明显，让我想起水箱里的那种感觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:50956
    old "Wait...!{w} Does this mean that I can travel really far back again?{w} Why, though...!? The cabinet shouldn't allow it."
    new "等等……！{w} 这么说，我又能穿越到很久以前了？{w} 可为什么……！？这个展示柜不该有这种力量。"

    # game/script.rpy:50957
    old "I raised my hand and felt the freezing air that the cabinet was releasing."
    new "我抬起手，感到展示柜正往外散着刺骨的寒气。"

    # game/script.rpy:50958
    old "...{w}I touched the white stain on the cushion and knew I hadn't been mistaken; something was there."
    new "……{w}我摸上衬垫上的白色污渍，知道自己没看错；那里确实沾着东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:50959
    old "It was considerably hot, and it felt as if something had dried on the cloth. As I moved my hand around it, I noticed it was in abundance, whatever it was."
    new "那东西烫得厉害，摸上去像是有什么液体干结在布面上。我在周围来回摸索，发现不管那是什么，数量都不少。"

    # game/script.rpy:50960
    old "What was it...? I couldn't tell, but there were also tiny pieces with a rocky texture scattered across the cushion."
    new "那到底是什么……？我辨不出来，不过衬垫上还散落着一些碎石般的小颗粒。"

    # game/script.rpy:50962
    old "My fingers felt something different and tried to grab it. It was larger than the strange substance above it."
    new "指尖触到了别的东西，我试着把它捏住。它比上面那层奇怪的物质要大些。"

    # game/script.rpy:50963
    old "What the hell is this...?{w} A card?"
    new "这到底是什么……？{w} 一张卡片？"

    # game/script.rpy:50966
    old "Its texture and form resembled one, but it was pretty small. I took it out of the cabinet and felt its hot touch, painfully confused."
    new "质地和形状都像卡片，只是小得很。我把它从展示柜里取出来，入手滚烫，心里越发困惑。"

    # game/script.rpy:50967
    old "It was stained like the cushion, but I couldn't tell what it was. ...I grabbed my phone and shined its faint light on the object."
    new "它和衬垫一样沾着污渍，我看不出那是什么。……我掏出手机，用微弱的灯光照向那东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:50969
    old "Just like I'd thought, it was a very tiny card. On it, a single word was written."
    new "果然，是一张极小的卡片。上面写着一个词。"

    # game/script.rpy:50971
    old "{tip=card}XYN{/tip}."
    new "{tip=card}XYN{/tip}。"

    # game/script.rpy:50972
    old "A chill ran down my spine. They had been there."
    new "我后背一阵发凉。他们来过这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:50973
    old "But why...? They shouldn't have attacked until the 15th. Was it as I'd feared? Had one of the members traveled from the 15th, changing history with an early attack?"
    new "可为什么……？他们本该等到15日才动手。难道真被我料中了？是其中一人从15日穿越回来，提前发动袭击、改写了历史？"

    # game/script.rpy:50974
    old "I stared at the Sekimeiya... Most importantly, why was it still there if Xyn had already attacked?"
    new "我盯着那个 Sekimeiya……最要紧的是，Xyn 明明已经发动过袭击，它为什么还留在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:50977
    old "I had so many questions and no faith that any would be answered. I began to move my hand toward the glow inside the cabinet."
    new "疑问堆积如山，我却已不指望有谁能给出答案。我抬起手，朝展示柜里那团光伸去。"

    # game/script.rpy:50978
    old "The searing air around it was all I could be sure of. It was ridiculously hot, completely overpowering the cabinet's icy interior. My frozen hand penetrated the barrier of hot air—the temperature was all I needed to know the Sekimeiya's energy was comparable to when it had been in the water tank."
    new "我唯一能确定的，是它周围的空气灼热逼人。那热度高得离谱，把展示柜里的寒气彻底压了下去。我冻僵的手探进那层热气——仅凭温度，我就知道 Sekimeiya 的能量和它还在水箱里时不相上下。"

    # game/script.rpy:50979
    old "Would touching it bring back life to the world? From the 15th, I'd gone fifteen days back. It didn't matter that I'd have nowhere to stay; I would have time to work all those matters out. I just had to go back in time and root out the problem by obtaining the Sekimeiya before anyone else did."
    new "碰上去，世界真能重新活过来吗？我从15日一路退了十五天。即便无处安身也无妨，我有的是时间把这些事慢慢理清。我只需要回到过去，赶在所有人之前拿到 Sekimeiya，把问题连根拔起。"

    # game/script.rpy:50980
    old "My hand, cold as it was, began to burn painfully. I was so close to the Sekimeiya and to leaving behind yet another reality.{w} I shut my eyes, mustering up the will to move my hand farther. I expected that by the next time I opened them, my surroundings would have morphed entirely."
    new "我的手本就冰凉，此刻却开始灼痛。Sekimeiya 近在咫尺，我又要把一个现实抛在身后了。{w}我闭上眼，硬起心肠把手再往前探。我以为，等我再次睁眼时，周遭的一切定已彻底换了模样。"

    # game/script.rpy:50988
    old "River"
    new "河流"

    # game/script.rpy:50991
    old "The light... had come back. But I was in the lobby."
    new "光……回来了。可我却站在大厅里。"

    # game/script.rpy:50992
    old "Where is this...?"
    new "这是哪儿……？"

    # game/script.rpy:50993
    old "I turned around slowly."
    new "我缓缓转过身。"

    # game/script.rpy:51010
    old "H—{w} You...!"
    new "H——{w}你……！"

    # game/script.rpy:51011
    old "We both looked shocked to see each other. At that time, I saw the shutter and the powered-off lights. Those were the effects of the alarm."
    new "我们俩都一脸震惊地看着对方。这时我才注意到落下的卷帘门和熄灭的灯。那是警报启动后的结果。"

    # game/script.rpy:51012
    old "A-Are you Shiroya...?"
    new "你、你是 Shiroya……？"

    # game/script.rpy:51013
    old "What? Y-Yes. Where are we? I just appeared here."
    new "什么？是、是我。这是什么地方？我刚才突然就出现在这儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51014
    old "I couldn't believe it was him. I'd thought seeing him again wasn't possible. However, the look he gave me seemed full of suspicion. His eyes were piercing mine, and he appeared wary."
    new "我几乎不敢相信眼前就是他。我原以为，再见他一面已是不可能的事。可他看我的眼神却满是怀疑，眼睛直勾勾地盯着我，一副戒备的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:51015
    old "I felt my body and noticed my heart skip a beat. I was wearing different clothes, ones I'd washed the day before.{w} As soon as the world had unfrozen, so had I. I could move my hand without it cramping, as if the time I'd spent outside had been erased. ...And when I did, I realized I wasn't tired anymore."
    new "我低头看了看自己，心跳漏了一拍。身上换成了另一套衣服，是前一天刚洗过的那身。{w}世界一解冻，我也随之解冻了。手能活动，不再僵得抽筋，仿佛我在冻结中度过的那些时间已被一笔勾销。……而等我活动起手脚，才发现疲惫感也一并消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51019
    old "W-Wait, that..."
    new "等、等等，那个……"

    # game/script.rpy:51023
    old "I followed his eyes toward the hallway B door. When I gave it a closer look, I saw the crucial detail I'd missed.{w} Its edges were dark. I'd seen it before, so I didn't have to wonder what it meant."
    new "我顺着他的视线望向B走廊的门。再仔细一看，我才发现了先前漏掉的关键之处。{w}门边发黑。这景象我见过，不必再猜它意味着什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:51024
    old "...It's the smoke, right?"
    new "……是烟雾吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:51029
    old "Y-Yes, but doesn't it look different?"
    new "是、是的，可你不觉得样子不太一样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:51035
    old "I'm not sure where we are. I just appeared here too."
    new "我也不清楚这是哪儿。我也是突然出现在这里的。"

    # game/script.rpy:51038
    old "As he said that, he approached the door. Unlike mine, his clothes were the ones he'd worn on the 15th, but they were clean."
    new "说着，他朝门走去。他穿的衣服和我的不同，是15日那天穿的那身，却干干净净。"

    # game/script.rpy:51040
    old "A sound that came from hallway B made Atsuki stop."
    new "B走廊里传来一声响动，Atsuki 顿时停住了脚。"

    # game/script.rpy:51041
    old "A door had closed. He went still, trying to stay silent, and I did the same."
    new "是有扇门关上了。他僵在原地，屏息不动，我也照做。"

    # game/script.rpy:51043
    old "A few seconds later, he kept going and grabbed the knob. When he opened the door, I couldn't believe what I saw."
    new "几秒后，他继续前行，握住了门把手。门一开，我简直不敢相信自己的眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:51052
    old "Oh, fuck. Don't breathe."
    new "操。别吸气。"

    # game/script.rpy:51054
    old "No light filled the hallway; only a dark fog did. Without a doubt, it was the same smoke that had knocked us out, although its density seemed much lower."
    new "走廊里没有一丝光，只有一片昏黑的雾。毫无疑问，就是熏倒我们的那种烟雾，只是浓度似乎低了许多。"

    # game/script.rpy:51055
    old "Right next to us were three people on the floor: Erina, Isla, and Sai, who had all just lost consciousness."
    new "就在我们旁边，地上躺着三个人：Erina、Isla 和 Sai，都是刚刚失去意识的。"

    # game/script.rpy:51061
    old "A-Are we on the morning of the 15th?"
    new "我、我们是在15日的早上？"

    # game/script.rpy:51062
    old "After staring at the scene with perplexity, Atsuki's face slowly turned to me, and he spoke in a quiet voice."
    new "Atsuki 茫然地盯着眼前这一幕，随后才慢慢把脸转向我，压低了声音开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:51068
    old "...Are you really Shiroya? The real one?"
    new "……你真的是 Shiroya？本人？"

    # game/script.rpy:51069
    old "What does that mean...!? Who else would I be?"
    new "这话什么意思……！？我还能是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:51074
    old "...What do you remember? Please, tell me everything."
    new "……你记得些什么？拜托，全都告诉我。"

    # game/script.rpy:51075
    old "What!? I-I don't know what you mean! We got trapped here, and a bunch of things happened!"
    new "什么！？我、我不明白你在说什么！我们被困在这儿，出了好多事！"

    # game/script.rpy:51076
    old "What happened? How did you end up here?"
    new "出了什么事？你怎么会到这儿来？"

    # game/script.rpy:51077
    old "H-Huh? A lot of things! Do you remember everything? Late into the day, we were in the lobby, and I went to the bathroom. There, I activated the Sekimeiya and appeared on the 30th of November, below that gem shop.{w} Then... a few days later, I entered the tower and touched the Sekimeiya. That's how I just appeared here."
    new "啊？很、很多事！你全都记得吗？那天很晚了，我们在大厅，我去了洗手间。就在那儿，我启动了 Sekimeiya，出现在11月30日，就在那家宝石店的下方。{w}然后……过了几天，我进了塔，碰到了 Sekimeiya。于是我就出现在了这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:51080
    old "That was why... the image my brain was receiving didn't make any sense. How could it be real? How could that have been the start of December 15th?"
    new "原来如此……难怪我脑子里看到的画面怎么也说不通。那怎么可能是真的？那怎么会是12月15日刚开始的时候？"

    # game/script.rpy:51085
    old "W-Wait, that's all...? What about appearing after you'd gone to the bathroom? Do you remember that?"
    new "等、等等，就这些……？那你上完洗手间之后突然现身那件事呢？你记得吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:51086
    old "What? N-No...? I found the Sekimeiya in the toilet's water tank and went a long way into the past."
    new "什么？不、不记得……？我在马桶的水箱里找到了 Sekimeiya，然后回到了很久以前。"

    # game/script.rpy:51091
    old "...{w}Are you really... the real Shiroya? I don't really understand what you're telling me."
    new "……{w}你真的是……Shiroya本人吗？你说的话我实在听不明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:51092
    old "I didn't either. Had he just appeared there at the same time as me? Didn't that mean that he'd been encompassed by the range of my travel?"
    new "我也一样。难道他是和我同一时刻出现在那里的？那岂不是说，他落进了我穿越的波及范围？"

    # game/script.rpy:51098
    old "Wait a second. That sound from before was a door, right? It sounded like it came from the right wall."
    new "等一下。刚才那声响是门吧？听起来是从右边那面墙传来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:51099
    old "...I think so."
    new "……应该是。"

    # game/script.rpy:51104
    old "It had to be that one, then."
    new "那就只能是那一扇了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51105
    old "He pointed at one of the doors, and I understood why he'd said that."
    new "他指向其中一扇门，我立刻明白了他为什么这么说。"

    # game/script.rpy:51110
    old "That's where Naomi died and where I traveled for the first time. If the smoke was just released, someone might have just been there because it's where the temperature regulation cabinets are."
    new "Naomi 就是死在那里，我也是在那儿第一次穿越的。如果烟雾是刚放出来的，那么刚才很可能有人就在那里——温控展示柜就放在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:51111
    old "...{w}I didn't know what to say, but he was the Atsuki I'd been with that day. How was I talking to him? Hadn't his existence been overwritten...?"
    new "……{w}我不知道该说什么。可他确实是那天陪在我身边的 Atsuki。我怎么可能还在跟他说话？他的存在不是已经被覆盖了吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:51112
    old "I think we just heard the culprit. I have no idea why we're here, but only a few people should be conscious at this time."
    new "我想，我们刚才听到的就是犯人。为什么会在这里，我完全不清楚，但这个时间还醒着的人应该没几个。"

    # game/script.rpy:51118
    old "He gestured at me to follow him and not breathe. Before I could react, he was dashing toward that door, so I did the same, covering my face with an arm."
    new "他示意我跟上，还让我屏住呼吸。我还没来得及反应，他已经朝那扇门冲了过去，我也只好照做，用手臂遮住脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:51122
    old "While I still trailed behind, he looked at me and seemed to frown. However, he ended up going through the door."
    new "我还落在后面，他回头看了我一眼，似乎皱了皱眉，但最后还是穿过了那扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:51131
    old "The crystal room was empty, and every cabinet had its curtain neatly in place. If the sound had come from there, someone had just left."
    new "水晶展室里空无一人，每个展示柜的遮布都整齐地垂着。如果刚才的声响是从这里传出来的，那就说明有人刚刚离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:51132
    old "Atsuki closed the door carefully so that his voice wouldn't be heard."
    new "Atsuki 小心地把门关上，免得说话声传出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:51138
    old "Did you see the door to the lobby?"
    new "你看到通往大厅的门了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:51139
    old "...What about it?"
    new "……那扇门怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:51140
    old "We just left it open."
    new "我们刚才走的时候没关。"

    # game/script.rpy:51141
    old "Oh. Does that matter?"
    new "哦。有什么关系吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:51146
    old "You remember, right? When we met everyone else, Sai pointed out that it was open, and Katei said he did that. I'm pretty sure it looked exactly the way we just left it."
    new "你还记得吧？我们和其他人会合时，Sai 说那扇门开着，Katei 则说那是他弄的。我敢肯定，当时那扇门的样子和我们刚才离开时一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:51148
    old "I see what you mean, but please answer one thing for me. Why are we here? Did something happen after I traveled to the past?"
    new "我明白你的意思，但请你先回答我一个问题。我们为什么会在这里？我穿越到过去之后，是不是出了什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:51152
    old "He looked down."
    new "他低下了头。"

    # game/script.rpy:51153
    old "Are you telling me the truth? Do you not know what happened after?"
    new "你说的是真话？之后发生了什么，你真的不知道？"

    # game/script.rpy:51154
    old "I don't...! I just told you. I appeared on the 30th of November.{w} I stayed at my apartment while my past self was in the hospital, and a few days later, I entered the tower.{w} I have no idea what happened there, though. The Sekimeiya was already in the cabinet, and I touched it since nobody was in the security room. After that, I appeared in the lobby with you. Now we're here."
    new "我不知道……！我不是刚说了吗。我是在11月30日出现的。{w}过去的我住院时，我一直待在自己的公寓里；几天后，我进了芦屋塔。{w}不过塔里发生了什么，我完全不清楚。Sekimeiya 那时已经在展示柜里了，我见监控室里没人，就伸手碰了它。之后，我便和你一起出现在大厅里。再然后，就是现在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:51160
    old "As soon as he took what I was saying as sincere, his way of looking at me changed entirely. I finally felt like the person in front of me was the Atsuki I'd wanted to be back with."
    new "他把我说的当真之后，看我的眼神彻底变了。我终于觉得，眼前的人就是我盼着能回到身边的那个 Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:51165
    old "Wait, you said you traveled to the 30th? Did you try to save Miiya?"
    new "等等，你说你时间穿越到了30日？你试过去救 Miiya 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:51166
    old "I couldn't... I appeared too late for that, but I did change the past—"
    new "我没能……我出现得太晚，已经来不及了，但我确实改变了过去——"

    # game/script.rpy:51167
    old "I had to cut that sentence short. The past had changed, hadn't it? If that was the case, how could the same incident have been starting again? How was it possible we'd left the lobby door open exactly like we'd seen it in that morning, and how could Atsuki have possessed the memories of that long day? How the hell was I back there...!?"
    new "我不得不把话咽了回去。过去明明已经改变了，不是吗？若真是如此，同一场事件怎么可能再度开始？我们怎么会恰巧把大厅的门留成那天早上看见的样子，Atsuki 又怎么可能拥有那漫长一天的记忆？我到底为什么会回到那里……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:51175
    old "I'm trying to understand what you've said..."
    new "我在试着理解你说的这些话……"

    # game/script.rpy:51176
    old "Don't worry, even I don't understand anything of what I lived through. I'm not lying, though."
    new "别担心，连我自己都搞不懂我经历的那些事。不过我没有撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:51177
    old "...Then I'm not sure it would help if I told you what happened after you left.{w} Another version of you was there, but it wasn't you, right?"
    new "……那我不确定，告诉你你离开之后发生了什么，会不会有帮助。{w}当时还有另一个你也在场，但那不是你，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:51178
    old "N-No. I have no idea who that was."
    new "不、不是的。我根本不知道那到底是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:51183
    old "Well, we weren't able to leave when the time came. I'm not sure what happened, why, or how, but the lights went off, and we couldn't get out.{w} ...You remember the recording, right?{w} It was real."
    new "结果，时间一到，我们却没能离开。发生了什么、为什么会这样、又到底是怎么发生的，我都不清楚，但灯灭了，我们也出不去。{w}……你还记得那段录音吧？{w}那是真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:51186
    old "Wait, what...?"
    new "等等，什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:51191
    old "Yes, it did happen. It wasn't a trick.{w} It still doesn't make any sense, though. I can't wrap my head around what happened.{w} You said that you touched the Sekimeiya in the event room days before the 15th, right?"
    new "对，那确实发生过。不是骗人的把戏。{w}可我还是完全想不通，怎么也理不清发生了什么。{w}你说过，15日的前几天，你在活动室里碰过 Sekimeiya，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:51197
    old "I see. What the fuck, then...? I don't get anything.{w} I thought I got caught up in your travel and both of us appeared in front of the hallway B door, the location where we were on the morning of the 15th."
    new "我明白了。那他妈到底是怎么回事……？我完全搞不懂。{w}我本来以为，自己被卷进了你的时间穿越，两个人才会一起出现在B走廊门前——也就是15日早上我们所在的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:51198
    old "But that makes no sense...! And look at my clothes, I wasn't wearing these on the 15th!"
    new "但这根本说不通……！而且你看看我的衣服，15日那天我穿的可不是这身！"

    # game/script.rpy:51199
    old "Only my purse and coat matched what I'd worn on that day."
    new "我全身上下，只有手提包和大衣跟那天一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:51204
    old "You're right, actually. Were you wearing them when you touched the Sekimeiya?"
    new "说起来，你说得对。你碰 Sekimeiya 的时候，穿的就是这些吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:51205
    old "I shook my head and followed Atsuki's line of sight as soon as I saw he'd noticed something. We approached one of the cabinets."
    new "我摇了摇头。看到 Atsuki 似乎注意到了什么，我便顺着他的目光望去。我们朝其中一个展示柜走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:51210
    old "...That's where the Sekimeiya was, right?"
    new "……Sekimeiya 原本就放在那里，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:51215
    old "Yes, and look at the wheel."
    new "对，而且你看看那个转轮。"

    # game/script.rpy:51219
    old "It said 0 °C."
    new "上面显示着 0 °C。"

    # game/script.rpy:51220
    old "It's set to be cold... Oh, and it's not damaged yet. Wasn't this the one with a crack?"
    new "温度设得很低……哦，而且它还没损坏。这个不就是有裂痕的那个吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:51225
    old "Yes... it was."
    new "对……就是它。"

    # game/script.rpy:51226
    old "I stared while Atsuki peeked behind the cabinet to unlock it. He raised it alongside the curtain, and I stepped beside him to look inside."
    new "我盯着那边，Atsuki 探头到展示柜后面开锁。他把遮布连同柜门一起掀了起来，我走到他身旁往里看。"

    # game/script.rpy:51231
    old "Wh-What?{w} I...{w=0.4} don't get it."
    new "什、什么？{w}我……{w=0.4}不明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:51235
    old "The Sekimeiya. It was there, emitting a bright white in the middle of the empty cabinet."
    new "是 Sekimeiya。它就在那里，在空荡荡的展示柜中央散发着耀眼的白光。"

    # game/script.rpy:51239
    old "Someone left it in here."
    new "有人把它留在了这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:51240
    old "Yes, which is what I don't get. When we woke up, it was in the event room, still in its cabinet."
    new "对，这正是我想不通的地方。我们醒来的时候，它明明还在活动室的展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:51241
    old "You're... right."
    new "你说得……没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:51242
    old "Seemingly overwhelmed, Atsuki covered his hand with his sleeve and brought the Sekimeiya out."
    new "Atsuki 似乎有些不知所措，用袖子裹住手，把 Sekimeiya 拿了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:51248
    old "It's set to 0 °C, but the cabinet isn't cold at all."
    new "温度设的是 0 °C，可展示柜一点也不冷。"

    # game/script.rpy:51249
    old "It could've been set just now, so it didn't have enough time to cool off."
    new "也可能是刚刚才设好的，所以还没来得及变冷。"

    # game/script.rpy:51254
    old "God, the Sekimeiya is burning, though...!"
    new "天哪，Sekimeiya 却烫得厉害……！"

    # game/script.rpy:51255
    old "As soon as I heard that, I extended my arm, startling Atsuki. I shook my head—I didn't want to make contact. I only wanted to feel the air around it."
    new "一听这话，我立刻伸出手臂，把 Atsuki 吓了一跳。我摇了摇头——我不是想碰它，只想感受一下它周围的空气。"

    # game/script.rpy:51256
    old "Sorry, when I touched it in the bathroom, its surroundings were incredibly hot. ...I can feel the heat, but it's nothing like then.{w} Do you know more about how the Sekimeiya works?"
    new "抱歉，我在浴室里碰到它的时候，它周围烫得吓人。……现在也能感觉到热，但和那时完全不能比。{w} 关于 Sekimeiya 的原理，你还知道些什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:51261
    old "I know nothing, and even less with what you've told me."
    new "我什么都不知道，听你这么一说，反倒更糊涂了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51262
    old "It's working, so if we're really at the start of the incident, wouldn't touching it put us outside?"
    new "它现在有反应了。如果我们真的回到了事件刚开始的时候，碰它一下，不就能把我们送到外面去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:51267
    old "M-Maybe. That's what I was thinking. It should be hot enough for that."
    new "也、也许吧。我也是这么想的。热度应该足够了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51268
    old "The real state of the world was unknown. I had no idea where we were or what was beyond the walls of the tower. However, if touching the Sekimeiya would send us far enough to escape it, it would guarantee the real Atsuki would still exist even if I couldn't comprehend his return."
    new "世界的真实状况，我无从得知。我们身在何处、塔墙之外又是什么，我毫无头绪。可只要触碰 Sekimeiya 能把我们送到足够远的地方、脱离这一切，就等于保证了：哪怕我弄不明白他是怎么回来的，真正的 Atsuki 也依然存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:51271
    old "Let's touch it."
    new "碰吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:51273
    old "Atsuki nodded and moved closer while I stared at the Sekimeiya, wishing I was moments away from never seeing it again."
    new "Atsuki 点了点头，走上前来。我凝视着 Sekimeiya，只盼再过片刻，就再也见不到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:51275
    old "When his hand touched it, the Sekimeiya disappeared.{w} That was all I'd wanted. However, nothing else did."
    new "他的手一碰到，Sekimeiya 便消失了。{w} 这正是我唯一所求。可除此之外，什么也没有发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:51282
    old "We were in the same crystal room. We hadn't even moved. Speechless, I stared at his hands and the floor in search of the stone that had vanished."
    new "我们还站在同一间水晶展室里，连一步都没挪动。我一时说不出话，只能盯着他的手和地面，寻找那块消失的石头。"

    # game/script.rpy:51284
    old "Th-This is what happened before. It teleported, and we didn't travel."
    new "这、这就是之前发生过的事。它传送走了，我们却没有穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:51286
    old "That had escaped my mind a long time ago. ...The Sekimeiya's teleportation.{w} What caused it...!? Would it sometimes reject a travel? If so, why had it happened then...!?"
    new "这件事我早就抛到脑后了。……Sekimeiya 的传送。{w} 究竟是什么触发了它……！？难道它有时会拒绝时间穿越？若真是如此，那当时又为什么发生了传送……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:51289
    old "Wait, n-no... I-It can't be that."
    new "等等，不、不对……不、不可能是那样。"

    # game/script.rpy:51290
    old "That time, it was Atsuki who followed my petrified eyes. As soon as he took a glance at the cabinet, he almost fell from the shock."
    new "这一次，轮到 Atsuki 顺着我僵住的目光看去。他只往展示柜瞥了一眼，就惊得差点跌倒。"

    # game/script.rpy:51294
    old "Wh-What the fuck...? It didn't fall, right?"
    new "搞、搞什么……？它没掉下来吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:51295
    old "I shook my head.{w} The lid that Atsuki had just opened... The instant the Sekimeiya disappeared, it had closed without producing a sound. And that wasn't all. Over it, the velvet curtain covered it perfectly, making the cabinet look like every other one in the room."
    new "我摇了摇头。{w} Atsuki 刚刚打开的那个盖子……就在 Sekimeiya 消失的瞬间，无声无息地合上了。而且不止如此。天鹅绒遮布严严实实地罩着它，让那展示柜看上去和房间里其他柜子一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:51296
    old "Did we actually travel through time? ...Are we at a point before I opened it?"
    new "我们真的穿越了时间？……现在是在我打开它之前？"

    # game/script.rpy:51302
    old "A distinct sound entered our ears, and we turned to the door. ...Someone was running through the hallway."
    new "一阵清晰的声响传入耳中，我们转向门口。……有人正跑过走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:51306
    old "Could he have been right? As we ran to the door, I wondered. ...Were the walls of the hallway bright and elegant or dark and dirty? At the same time, we gripped the knob and burst through the door."
    new "他会不会说对了？跑向门口时，我心里这样想。……走廊的墙壁是明亮雅致，还是昏暗肮脏？与此同时，我们握住门把，猛地推门冲了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:51313
    old "Immediately, we were forced to cover our faces. It didn't make any sense, but the smoke was still there. The sound of footsteps at least couldn't have been a mistake, so after our initial surprise, we looked both ways."
    new "我们立刻不得不捂住口鼻。这根本说不通，可烟雾仍旧弥漫。至少脚步声不会听错，最初的惊愕过后，我们朝两边望去。"

    # game/script.rpy:51315
    old "...We couldn't see anyone, but the sound hadn't faded away. It seemed they'd run to hallway C."
    new "……一个人也看不见，声音却还没有远去。看来那人跑向了 C走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:51319
    old "Atsuki tugged my sleeve, telling me to follow. It was likely the culprit was there—the one who'd just left the Sekimeiya behind. But I hesitated a bit, frowning as I kept staring at the lobby side. Were my eyes playing tricks on me?"
    new "Atsuki 拽了拽我的袖子，示意我跟上。那个人多半就在那里——刚刚丢下 Sekimeiya 的家伙。可我还是迟疑了一下，皱着眉，目光一直停在通往大厅的那一侧。是眼睛在骗我吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:51325
    old "...Covering our faces, we chased behind the sound. Very little smoke remained, so it was easy to avoid breathing it until we got to the clean hallway."
    new "……我们捂着口鼻，追着那声音而去。残留的烟雾已经不多，一路上很容易避开，直到跑进干净的走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:51330
    old "The footsteps were quickly dissipating in the distance. We looked at each other to verify that we'd both heard them going up the stairs."
    new "脚步声正迅速在远处消散。我们对视一眼，确认彼此都听见了——那声音是往楼上去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51334
    old "We bolted to them and were met with the gray door, fully open. Early on the 15th, Katei had acted surprised to see it unlocked, but where was he at that moment if not running up the floors?"
    new "我们飞奔过去，迎面便是那扇敞开着的灰色门。15号一早，Katei 见它没上锁时还装出惊讶的样子；可此刻，他若不是正往楼上跑，又会身在何处？"

    # game/script.rpy:51342
    old "We stepped onto the second floor. It was a scene I'd thought I wouldn't see again, causing my face to unconsciously screw up in disgust."
    new "我们踏上了二楼。这幅景象我原以为再也不会见到，脸不自觉地因厌恶而皱了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:51346
    old "I couldn't believe I was circling those floors once more, but as I did, my mind went back to the door to the lobby. After leaving the crystal room, it had looked more open than before.{w} That was strange, because as Atsuki said, the way we'd left it was just like how it was that morning, before Sai opened it all the way."
    new "没想到我竟又一次在这些楼层里打转。一路跑着，我的思绪却回到了通往大厅的那扇门上。离开水晶展室时，它看上去比先前敞得更开。{w} 这很奇怪，因为正如 Atsuki 所说，我们离开时的样子，就和那天早上 Sai 把它完全推开之前一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:51347
    old "However, the most important detail was higher up, above the three sleeping bodies. I hadn't been able to give it a good look, but the camera's lens had seemed to reflect the light of the crystal room.{w} Then, I'd looked at the other lenses and thought that they more clearly had smoke on them."
    new "不过，最关键的一处细节在更高处，就在那三个熟睡的人上方。当时我没能看仔细，但那台摄像头的镜片似乎映着水晶展室的光。{w} 后来我又看了看其他镜头，觉得它们上面的烟迹更明显一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:51353
    old "As we sprinted as fast as we could, I was amazed by the energy I had. Before touching the Sekimeiya, I'd had difficulty even staying steady."
    new "我们拼尽全力飞奔，我惊讶于自己竟还有这样的力气。触碰 Sekimeiya 之前，我连站稳都很吃力。"

    # game/script.rpy:51354
    old "I had no idea who we were following, but Naomi and Katei were the likely choices. Why were they running up? It had all happened at once after we'd touched the disappearing Sekimeiya. What the hell was that about?"
    new "我不知道我们追的究竟是谁，最有可能的就是 Naomi 和 Katei。他们为什么要往楼上跑？这一切都是在我们碰过 Sekimeiya、它消失之后一下子发生的。到底是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:51355
    old "Atsuki once told me he'd seen it teleport to its cabinet. That seemed to resolve the doubt from earlier—it had just teleported to the event room, which was why it was there when we woke up.{w} The important question was what else the disappearance implied. The cabinet's reversion to its previous state revealed a secondary effect."
    new "Atsuki 曾说过，他见过它传送回自己的展示柜里。这似乎解开了先前的疑问——它只是传送到了活动室，所以我们醒来时它才会在那里。{w} 真正重要的是，这次消失还意味着什么。展示柜恢复成先前的样子，说明另有一重附带效应。"

    # game/script.rpy:51362
    old "After a while, the mesh of footsteps began to sound distorted. We were on the third floor, and I tried to sharpen my hearing."
    new "跑了一阵，交错的脚步声开始变得有些失真。我们已经到了三楼，我努力让耳朵听得更清楚些。"

    # game/script.rpy:51363
    old "...What exactly was I hearing? The footsteps ahead, mine, and Atsuki's.{w} Why did it sound as if there were more?{w} The echo could've been messing with me, but it seemed as if another pair of footsteps was running just behind us."
    new "……我到底听到了什么？前面的脚步声、我自己的脚步声，还有 Atsuki 的。{w} 可为什么听上去不止这些？{w} 也许是回音在作弄我，但仿佛另有一双脚步，正紧跟我们身后奔跑。"

    # game/script.rpy:51368
    old "We hadn't let out a single word since leaving the crystal floor. When we stepped on the sixth, a sound dominated the air."
    new "离开水晶层之后，我们一句话也没说过。踏上六楼时，一个声响压过了四周的一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:51379
    old "As we'd feared, only one door could've closed, found on the other side of the floor."
    new "正如我们所担心的，唯一可能关上的那扇门，就在这一层的另一端。"

    # game/script.rpy:51385
    old "We didn't slow down until the attic's entrance was in front of us. Panting, Atsuki grabbed the doorknob, but he couldn't get it to open."
    new "直到阁楼的入口出现在眼前，我们才停下脚步。Atsuki 喘着气抓住门把，却怎么也打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:51390
    old "Damn it...!"
    new "可恶……！"

    # game/script.rpy:51395
    old "It was locked. As we stared in defeat, I realized nobody was trying to catch up to us, so I took the time to sort out my thoughts."
    new "门锁着。我们颓然地盯着它，我这才发觉，并没有人追上来。于是我趁这段时间理了理思绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:51397
    old "I suddenly remembered something and looked at my waist. My purse was still there, so I unzipped it and looked inside. Immediately, I took something out and showed it to Atsuki."
    new "我忽然想起了什么，低头看向腰间。手提包还在，我拉开拉链往里看，随即取出一样东西，递到 Atsuki 面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:51402
    old "What...!? Why do you have it!?"
    new "什么……！？你怎么会有这个！？"

    # game/script.rpy:51403
    old "I... don't know... I found it when I entered the tower, in the mechanical room. I found the rusty key in a drawer in the security room as well, but... how is it possible I still have them when my clothes completely changed?"
    new "我……不知道……这是我进塔的时候，在机械室里找到的。生锈的钥匙也是在监控室的抽屉里找到的，可是……我的衣服明明全变了，这两样东西怎么还会在我身上？"

    # game/script.rpy:51407
    old "It didn't make any sense, but I could open the attic. I inserted the key into the keyhole without wasting any more time.{w} When it unlocked, I slowly pushed the door open."
    new "这毫无道理，可我确实能打开阁楼。我不再耽搁，把钥匙插进锁孔。{w} 锁一开，我缓缓推开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:51417
    old "The dim staircase extended beyond us. Instead of rushing up, we stepped forward silently, as the person we'd been chasing couldn't know that we had a key, and the elevator had been disabled by the alarm."
    new "昏暗的楼梯在我们面前向上延伸。我们没有急着冲上去，只是无声地迈步前行，因为我们追赶的人不可能知道我们手里有钥匙，而电梯早在警报响起时就被停用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51421
    old "At the front, I began to ascend the stairs, the light of the living room slowly creeping in."
    new "我走在最前面，开始上楼梯，起居室的灯光渐渐透了进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:51425
    old "The next door was open. As I reached the top, I extended my neck past it."
    new "下一扇门开着。我走到楼梯顶端，伸长脖子朝门里看去。"

    # game/script.rpy:51427
    old "Then, I saw who was there.{w} Naomi."
    new "接着，我看清了里面的人。{w}是 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:51429
    old "Her back was facing me, as she was staring at an open black suitcase on the sofa."
    new "她背对着我，正盯着沙发上敞开的黑色行李箱。"

    # game/script.rpy:51430
    old "I turned around to let Atsuki know."
    new "我转过身，想告诉 Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:51439
    old "I was confused. It was considerably dark, but I couldn't even make out his figure."
    new "我有些困惑。四周很暗，我连他的轮廓都看不清。"

    # game/script.rpy:51440
    old "...Are you here?"
    new "「……你在这里吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:51441
    old "I whispered in the quietest voice I could muster, but I received no response."
    new "我把声音压到最低，轻轻问了一句，却没有得到任何回应。"

    # game/script.rpy:51446
    old "Puzzled, I slowly went down the steps, careful not to hit him. However, by the time I reached the door, I hadn't sensed him yet."
    new "我心里纳闷，慢慢走下台阶，小心不碰到他。可一直走到门口，我依旧没有察觉到他的存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:51448
    old "Sunken Vessel"
    new "沉没的容器"

    # game/script.rpy:51450
    old "What...? Did he leave!?"
    new "「什么……？难道他走了！？」"

    # game/script.rpy:51452
    old "I gripped the doorknob and pushed on the door."
    new "我握住门把手，推了推门。"

    # game/script.rpy:51455
    old "...{w}It didn't make any sense. It was ridiculous to think that it could. However, the door was locked."
    new "……{w}这说不通。指望它说得通，本身就荒唐。可门确实锁上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51457
    old "I didn't even try to think it over. With the key in my hand, I unlocked the door and opened it all the way."
    new "我根本没去细想。手里握着钥匙，我直接开了锁，把门彻底推开。"

    # game/script.rpy:51465
    old "The vast corridor was vacant."
    new "宽阔的走廊里空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:51475
    old "My whisper didn't reach anyone."
    new "我的低语没有传到任何人耳中。"

    # game/script.rpy:51476
    old "Did he leave...? There's no way. He couldn't have locked the door."
    new "「他走了……？不可能。他不可能把门锁上。」"

    # game/script.rpy:51477
    old "I couldn't hear anything above the stairs, but Naomi was there. I knew Atsuki hadn't stepped ahead of me, though."
    new "楼梯上方我听不到任何动静，但 Naomi 就在那里。不过我知道，Atsuki 并没有走到我前头。"

    # game/script.rpy:51478
    old "What had just happened...? I hadn't heard anything, but someone locked the door. ...With my guard up, I walked to the corridor with the offices."
    new "刚才究竟发生了什么……？我什么声音都没听见，门却被锁上了。……我提高警惕，走向有办公室的那条走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:51487
    old "It didn't feel like anyone was there."
    new "感觉不到有人在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:51488
    old "I couldn't have missed the sound of the door locking. I would've also heard Atsuki's movements, and he wouldn't have suddenly left me...!"
    new "上锁的声音我不可能漏掉。Atsuki 的动静我也该听得见，而且他不会突然丢下我……！"

    # game/script.rpy:51489
    old "It was unbelievable. That was an Atsuki who couldn't exist anymore, but he'd been there!"
    new "难以置信。那本该是不可能再存在的 Atsuki，可他刚才就在那里！"

    # game/script.rpy:51493
    old "I kept circling the floor, carefully scanning it.{w} He couldn't have faded out of existence just like that—the door proved something else had happened."
    new "我在这一层来回走动，仔细扫视每个角落。{w}他不可能就这样凭空消失——那扇锁上的门说明另有蹊跷。"

    # game/script.rpy:51494
    old "Naomi was in the attic. I'd seen a black suitcase in front of her, which had to be the one we found the first time we entered that place..."
    new "Naomi 就在阁楼里。我看见她面前有一只黑色行李箱，那一定是我们第一次进入那个地方时发现的那只……"

    # game/script.rpy:51498
    old "I went down the stairs, wanting to believe Atsuki was still somewhere."
    new "我走下楼梯，心里愿意相信 Atsuki 还在某个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:51502
    old "...Could it have been due to the Sekimeiya, which had disappeared from our sight? If he had somehow traveled through time, I wanted to believe he was nearby."
    new "……会不会是因为那个从我们眼前消失的 Sekimeiya？如果他以某种方式穿越了时间，我愿意相信他就在附近。"

    # game/script.rpy:51508
    old "It was the morning of the 15th. ...Why? How had I ended up back on that day?"
    new "那是十五日的早晨。……为什么？我怎么又回到了那一天？"

    # game/script.rpy:51509
    old "Those events should've been erased completely, so why were they repeating?{w} ...Maybe it didn't matter if I really had returned to my world. I would soon learn if everything I'd experienced would happen again."
    new "那些事本该被彻底抹去，为什么又在重演？{w}……也许不管我是不是真的回到了自己的世界，都已经不重要了。我很快就能知道，自己经历过的一切会不会再来一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:51510
    old "...It really wouldn't make any sense if it did. The smoke had just been released. It appeared Naomi hadn't suffered from the effects of the smoke and escaped to the attic with a suitcase."
    new "……如果真会重演，那就太不合理了。烟雾才刚放出来。看来 Naomi 没有受到烟雾影响，带着行李箱逃到了阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:51511
    old "Could that long day actually happen again? Not only was I there, but so was an Atsuki who'd experienced it too. ...How many times had we searched the whole building? It was impossible I could avoid being spotted by all those searches."
    new "那样漫长的一天真的会再来一次吗？不只是我，连经历过那一天的 Atsuki 也在这里。……我们曾把整栋楼搜过多少遍？那么多轮搜索，我不可能一次都没被撞见。"

    # game/script.rpy:51512
    old "...The events that followed would soon diverge from what I knew. The past would be changed, which was something that should have already happened."
    new "……接下来发生的事很快就会和我所知道的不一样了。过去会被改写，而那本就是早该发生的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:51519
    old "...Who had returned the world to that state? What had the Sekimeiya really been doing to us? As I proceeded down the floors, I simply wished to reunite with the Atsuki I'd been separated from twice."
    new "……是谁让世界回到了那个状态？Sekimeiya 究竟对我们做了什么？我一路往下走，只希望能与那个和我失散过两次的 Atsuki 重逢。"

    # game/script.rpy:51520
    old "...{w}Wait!"
    new "……{w}等等！"

    # game/script.rpy:51521
    old "I quickly rifled through my pockets, but they were empty. Then, I stared at my purse in disbelief."
    new "我急忙翻遍口袋，里面却空空如也。随后，我难以置信地盯着自己的手提包。"

    # game/script.rpy:51522
    old "...Why isn't my phone here?{w} Why...? I had it when I touched the Sekimeiya, and the keys that I found in the mechanical room are still here with the one for my apartment. Why the hell is only my phone gone!?"
    new "……我的手机怎么不在这里？{w}为什么……？碰 Sekimeiya 的时候它还在，机械室里找到的钥匙、还有我公寓的钥匙，也都还在这里。凭什么偏偏只有手机不见了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:51525
    old "It was laughable, as if we were being toyed with. My phone, which I needed the most, was the sole item in my purse that hadn't appeared with me."
    new "简直可笑，仿佛有人在戏弄我们。我最需要的手机，偏偏是包里唯一没能跟着我一起过来的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:51526
    old "But of course, there was another major difference: my clothes. Aside from my coat, they weren't the ones I'd been wearing when I touched the Sekimeiya."
    new "当然，还有另一处明显的不同：我身上的衣服。除了外套，这些并不是我触碰 Sekimeiya 时穿的那一身。"

    # game/script.rpy:51527
    old "Wait, that's not right. Not all the keys are here.{w} I have the attic's and the rusty key, but not the cabinet's. Why? Why didn't that one travel with me!?"
    new "等等，不对。钥匙并没有全在这里。{w}阁楼的钥匙和那把生锈的钥匙都在，唯独没有展示柜的钥匙。为什么？为什么偏偏那一把没有跟着我一起过来！？"

    # game/script.rpy:51528
    old "It was the only one missing, but why? What the hell was different about it!?"
    new "唯独少了那一把，可这是为什么？它究竟有什么不同！？"

    # game/script.rpy:51537
    old "I returned to the crystal floor, searching for the Atsuki I'd just been talking to. Both of us had been disconcerted to be back there, and I couldn't stomach the thought of reliving the same twelve hours."
    new "我回到水晶层，寻找刚才还在和我说话的 Atsuki。我们俩都为回到这里而心神不宁，一想到要把同样的十二个小时再过一遍，我就无法忍受。"

    # game/script.rpy:51538
    old "Was the Sekimeiya a sentient being deciding our fate? It almost seemed malicious, but I had to use it to finally break free. I knew plenty of days could be traveled at a time, so we just had to touch it. But when we'd tried that, our travel had failed."
    new "难道 Sekimeiya 有自我意识，在替我们决定命运？它几乎像是怀有恶意，可我必须借助它才能真正脱身。我知道一次可以穿越很多天，所以我们只要触碰它就行。可我们真的试过，那次穿越却失败了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51539
    old "What was the reason, then? Why were we forced to stay? Part of me wanted to know the answers to such heavy questions, and part of me wanted to have never even known they existed."
    new "那原因究竟是什么？我们为什么被迫留在这里？我一半想知道这些沉重问题的答案，另一半却宁愿自己从来不知道它们存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:51547
    old "I stepped down. The walls ahead looked different than they had minutes prior, as the smoke had rapidly dried up on them."
    new "我迈步下楼。眼前的墙壁和几分钟前看到的不一样了——墙上的烟迹已经迅速干了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51548
    old "Oh, the suitcase isn't here..."
    new "咦，手提箱不在这儿……"

    # game/script.rpy:51549
    old "I hadn't noticed that when we'd run up."
    new "刚才跑上来的时候，我竟没注意到。"

    # game/script.rpy:51553
    old "It was the beginning of the incident. There were probably next to no people who were conscious, but it was possible someone had faked being knocked out. As I silently walked to hallway B, I couldn't help but wonder what I'd witness."
    new "那是事件的开端。当时醒着的人大概寥寥无几，但也可能有人装作昏迷。我默默走向B走廊，心里忍不住猜想，自己究竟会看到什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:51559
    old "They're already up."
    new "他们已经起来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51560
    old "I hid myself as well as I could, staring at the dark end of the hallway. I could see Erina and Sai checking up on Isla, who was still unconscious."
    new "我尽可能藏好身子，凝视着走廊昏暗的尽头。Erina和Sai正在照看仍昏迷不醒的Isla。"

    # game/script.rpy:51561
    old "The three of us should definitely be in the event room, then."
    new "这么说，我们三个这会儿应该都在活动室里才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:51562
    old "But there was no trace of the Atsuki I'd just been with, and I had no idea what could've happened to him."
    new "可刚才还和我在一起的Atsuki却不见踪影，我完全不知道他出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:51565
    old "The camera..."
    new "摄像头……"

    # game/script.rpy:51566
    old "It was very hard to see from so far away, but it wasn't reflecting anything."
    new "隔着这么远很难看清，但它一点反光都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:51567
    old "Did I imagine the lens being clean?"
    new "难道镜头干净只是我的错觉？"

    # game/script.rpy:51568
    old "And strangely, behind the three of them, the door to the lobby looked just like it had right before we'd run up. Had it actually moved since Atsuki and I had gone through it? I hadn't the faintest idea. Questioning reality and myself had become roughly equivalent concepts."
    new "奇怪的是，在他们三人身后，通往大厅的那扇门和我们跑上来之前一模一样。自从我和Atsuki穿过它之后，它当真移动过吗？我毫无头绪。怀疑现实与怀疑自己，如今已几乎是同一回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:51570
    old "...If Atsuki's still here, both of us will try to stay away from the group, so we should find each other quickly."
    new "……如果Atsuki还在这里，我们俩都会尽量避开人群，所以应该很快就能碰到对方。"

    # game/script.rpy:51571
    old "Was he there, though? ...Or had he disappeared entirely? I couldn't tell which option the locked attic door pointed to."
    new "可他真的在这里吗？……还是说，他已经彻底消失了？阁楼的门锁着，我看不出这究竟意味着哪一种。"

    # game/script.rpy:51573
    old "There was nothing I could do. I had no idea if the Sekimeiya had teleported to its cabinet, and I couldn't leave through the storeroom. Still unable to believe the sight of those dark walls, I stared from a distance, waiting for the imminent, unending day to begin."
    new "我无计可施。不知道Sekimeiya是否已经传送回了展示柜，我也无法从储藏室离开。望着那片漆黑的墙壁，我依旧觉得难以置信，只能远远等待那即将开始、漫无止境的一天。"

    # game/script.rpy:51577
    old "I heard a door opening and saw three people slowly emerging from the event room. They were Atsuki, Akaro, and myself, stained by the dry substance."
    new "我听见开门声，看见三个人从活动室里缓缓走出来。是Atsuki、Akaro，还有我自己，身上都沾着干涸的污渍。"

    # game/script.rpy:51578
    old "Speechless, I saw my old self slowly walking to the others, facing the dark floor. Once they all saw each other, they began to speak."
    new "我无言地望着过去的自己缓步走向另外两人，目光落在昏暗的地面上。三人彼此照面之后，便开口交谈起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:51579
    old "Their voices were too quiet to understand, but I knew what they were saying. I really was at the start of that day."
    new "他们的声音太轻，听不清内容，可我知道他们在说什么。我真的回到了那一天的开头。"

    # game/script.rpy:51582
    old "But wait.{w} Where's Katei...?"
    new "可是等等。{w}Katei人呢……？"

    # game/script.rpy:51583
    old "There was no tall figure in a uniform next to them. ...When we'd left the event room for the first time, he'd already been there with the other group."
    new "他们身旁没有那个身穿制服的高个子身影。……当初我们第一次走出活动室时，他已经和另一群人待在那里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51585
    old "I verified that I wasn't mistaken. Katei was nowhere to be seen."
    new "我反复确认，自己没有看错。Katei确实不见踪影。"

    # game/script.rpy:51590
    old "Then... this isn't the start of the day we know. Everything is bound to differ.{w} ...Could Katei have seen me here, which made him hesitant to show himself?"
    new "那么……这就不是我们所知道的那一天的开始了。一切肯定会变得不一样。{w}……会不会是Katei看见我在这里，才迟迟不肯现身？"

    # game/script.rpy:51591
    old "Just what had happened to the world...!? Where exactly was I, and how had I ended up there!? Failing to know such fundamentals made my head spin."
    new "这个世界究竟出了什么事……！？我到底身在何处，又是怎么来到这里的！？连这些最基本的事都弄不明白，我的脑子一阵发晕。"

    # game/script.rpy:51592
    old "So, everything will be different. It's gotta be because I'm here, and the first time I wasn't. None of what happened is guaranteed to repeat."
    new "也就是说，一切都会不一样了。这一定是因为有我在，而第一次我并不在场。发生过的事，没有一件注定会重演。"

    # game/script.rpy:51593
    old "The Atsuki I'd just been with couldn't exist anymore, but he couldn't have disappeared because of something I'd done! After all, I would've vanished with him."
    new "刚才和我在一起的Atsuki不可能继续存在了，但他绝不可能是因为我做了什么才消失的！毕竟，若真是那样，我也会随他一起消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:51594
    old "I really wanted to find him again and get out. I'd tried to internalize that I'd never talk to him again, but I'd evidently failed, as I could feel relief while the people near the entrance met each other for the first time."
    new "我真的很想再找到他，一起逃出去。我本已努力让自己接受再也无法和他说话的事实，可显然没能做到——看着入口附近的几人初次相遇，我竟感到一阵安心。"

    # game/script.rpy:51595
    old "For some reason, I had seen him again, and he had to still be somewhere. It was possible to break free with him, something that seemed impossible for the longest time. We were not in our original world, so even though we'd be stuck with different versions of ourselves, that really didn't matter."
    new "不知为何，我又见到了他，那么他一定还在某处。和他一起逃离，这件事曾经看似遥不可及，如今却有了可能。我们已经不在原本的世界，即便要和不同版本的自己共处，那也无所谓。"

    # game/script.rpy:51599
    old "I couldn't tell what they were talking about, but they would soon search the whole building. That meant I would eventually be discovered."
    new "我听不清他们在说什么，但他们很快就会搜遍整栋楼。那意味着，我迟早会被发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:51600
    old "I looked at my clothes. What the hell would I say if I was found? They'd immediately notice I wasn't the same person—I had less smoke on me, and my clothes were different."
    new "我低头看了看自己的衣服。要是被发现，我到底该怎么解释？他们一眼就能看出我不是同一个人——我身上沾的烟尘更少，衣服也不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:51606
    old "I'd had a fairly absurd thought.{w} \"I can enter the attic, so what if I put on the clothes from up there and make up an excuse like being too cold or that my clothes were itchy due to the smoke?\""
    new "我冒出一个相当荒唐的念头。{w}「既然我能进阁楼，那不如换上那边的衣服，再编个借口，比如太冷了，或者说烟尘弄得衣服发痒？」"

    # game/script.rpy:51607
    old "Of course, that brought my mind to the self of mine Atsuki had once seen. According to him, she had been wearing clothes from the attic."
    new "当然，这也让我想起了Atsuki曾经见过的那个我。据他说，她穿的正是阁楼里的衣服。"

    # game/script.rpy:51608
    old "...This wouldn't make any sense."
    new "……这说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:51609
    old "I'm not in that reality anymore. The person Atsuki saw can't be me. ...It's impossible."
    new "我已经不在那个现实里了。Atsuki看见的人不可能是我。……绝不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:51610
    old "I had no idea how the universe worked. Was it remotely possible for me to go back to that world? It shouldn't have been, but if I could, I wanted to finish that circle."
    new "我完全不懂这个宇宙的运作方式。我还有哪怕一丝可能回到那个世界吗？本不该有机会，可如果能回去，我想把那个循环走完。"

    # game/script.rpy:51611
    old "Once, I'd willingly abandoned that reality, but I had slowly learned that it was a mistake. What I still had there was not something I could leave behind."
    new "我曾经主动舍弃了那个现实，后来才慢慢明白那是个错误。那里还有我无法割舍的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:51614
    old "Didn't it work like this a few times on the 15th...?"
    new "15号那天，不也有好几次是这种情况吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:51615
    old "If I go to the attic and put on clothes from the wardrobe, what would the reason be? To hope I'll end up in that reality again, where a version of me with those clothes existed? ...Doesn't that not make sense? Like Atsuki and I talked about, it's an event with no origin, a paradox."
    new "要是我去阁楼，从衣柜里取出衣服换上，理由又能是什么？是盼着自己再次落入那个现实——那个现实里有一个穿着这身衣服的我吗？……这不是说不通吗？就像我和Atsuki讨论过的，那是一个没有起因的事件，是悖论。"

    # game/script.rpy:51616
    old "But the reason I just thought about changing my clothes was to conceal myself as part of this reality, not just to complete a loop where it already happened. Would I have thought of this even if I didn't know about the version of me Atsuki saw?"
    new "可是我刚想到换衣服，本是为了让自己融入这个现实、不被人识破，而不只是为了补全一个早已发生过的循环。如果我根本不知道Atsuki见过的那个我，还会想到这个办法吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:51618
    old "Naomi was just in the attic. On the 15th, we found two dead versions of her, but that doesn't have to repeat. My original world should be long gone..."
    new "Naomi刚才就在阁楼里。15号那天，我们发现了两个死去的她，但那一幕未必会重演。我原本的世界应该早已不在了……"

    # game/script.rpy:51619
    old "But right now, I'm not there, and I can get the clothes that me was wearing. ...If they lead me back to that reality, it would explain why we still found them in the attic when we ran up. They had never been taken out."
    new "可现在我不在那里，而我能拿到那个我身上穿的衣服。……如果那些衣服能把我带回那个现实，那也就能解释，为什么我们跑上来时，它们还在阁楼里。它们从未被取走。"

    # game/script.rpy:51625
    old "The elevator was supposedly disabled, so I started going up on foot."
    new "电梯据说已经停用，我只好步行上楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:51636
    old "The attic door was still unlocked."
    new "阁楼的门依然没有上锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:51637
    old "It was me who unlocked it. On the 15th, we couldn't get it to open when we came across it because Naomi had shut herself inside.{w} ...Since it hasn't been locked again, she must not have left yet."
    new "打开锁的人是我。15号那天，我们走到这里时打不开门，因为Naomi把自己关在了里面。{w}……既然门没有再被锁上，说明她还没有离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:51641
    old "I slowly ascended the steps, unsure what to think of Naomi."
    new "我缓步拾级而上，心里拿不准该怎么看待 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:51642
    old "Was she behind the attack? ...Someone would soon try to kill her, but what was their motive?"
    new "袭击是她一手策划的吗？……很快就有人要取她性命，可动机究竟是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:51644
    old "I could see the light of the living room through the slightly open door. When I went still, the attic felt completely soulless."
    new "半掩的门后透出客厅的灯光。我一停下脚步，整间阁楼便静得没有一丝生气。"

    # game/script.rpy:51648
    old "I finally took a glance at the room."
    new "我这才朝房间里看了一眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:51650
    old "...I couldn't see anyone, so I had to step a little closer. When I did, it made no difference."
    new "……我看不见任何人，只好再走近些。走近之后，依旧什么也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:51654
    old "Naomi wasn't there anymore. Just a few minutes ago, she had been standing on the carpet, looking at the suitcase, which had remained open on the soft cushion."
    new "Naomi 已经不在那里了。就在几分钟前，她还站在地毯上，望着那只敞开的行李箱——它仍搁在柔软的坐垫上。"

    # game/script.rpy:51660
    old "Were my eyes deceiving me? ...Perplexed, I stepped onto the carpet."
    new "是我看错了吗？……我满心困惑，踏上了地毯。"

    # game/script.rpy:51661
    old "I recalled the first time I'd set foot inside. Back then, an identical suitcase had been on that couch, but it was empty. That wasn't the case at the moment."
    new "我想起初次踏进这里的情景。那时那张沙发上放着一只一模一样的行李箱，却是空的。眼下并非如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:51666
    old "There was not only one Sekimeiya in it, but a second. One of them was gray, and the other shined faintly."
    new "里面不止有一个 Sekimeiya，而是两个。其中一个是灰色的，另一个泛着微弱的光。"

    # game/script.rpy:51671
    old "As I was staring at them, the disabled one became white."
    new "我正盯着它们，那个失效的忽然变成了白色。"

    # game/script.rpy:51672
    old "Why...? Why are there two?"
    new "为什么……？为什么会有两个？"

    # game/script.rpy:51673
    old "I hovered my hand over the one on the right. It was hard to notice, but I definitely felt a warm aura. I could touch it and travel right there."
    new "我把手悬在右边那个上方。那感觉很难察觉，但我确实感到一股温热的波动。只要碰它一下，我就能当场穿越过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:51677
    old "I couldn't fathom the sight. Why was there another Sekimeiya next to it?{w} I knew from what Atsuki told me that two had existed at one point..."
    new "我无法理解眼前的景象。为什么它旁边还有另一个 Sekimeiya？{w} 听 Atsuki 说过，曾经一度存在过两个……"

    # game/script.rpy:51678
    old "...And it appeared they had since the very start. How had a second one come to exist? I only knew that just before I'd entered the room, one of them had been activated."
    new "……而且看来从最初起就是两个。第二个究竟是怎么出现的？我只知道，就在我进房间前不久，其中一个被启动过。"

    # game/script.rpy:51679
    old "Naomi must've touched it, and she appeared somewhere else."
    new "一定是 Naomi 碰了它，才会出现在别的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:51680
    old "I looked down at the carpeted floor. Naomi's footprints ended exactly where I was. However, I couldn't help but feel something was wrong."
    new "我低头看向铺着地毯的地面。Naomi 的脚印正好止于我站立之处。可我总觉得有哪里不对。"

    # game/script.rpy:51682
    old "Isn't this... the opposite of what we saw?"
    new "这岂不是……跟我们看到的正好相反？"

    # game/script.rpy:51683
    old "When we all entered the attic, her footprints began at the suitcase.{w} Now, they end at it, and I already mixed mine with hers."
    new "我们大家一起进阁楼时，她的脚印是从行李箱那里开始的。{w} 现在却止于行李箱，而且我的脚印已经和她的混在一起了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51686
    old "I forced myself to drop it. No matter why, two Sekimeiya were in front of me. I nervously stared at them, knowing Naomi could be anywhere."
    new "我强迫自己不再去想。不管原因如何，眼前确实有两个 Sekimeiya。我紧张地注视着它们，心里清楚 Naomi 可能身在任何地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:51687
    old "One of them was supposed to be on the crystal floor, and duplicating it had never sounded possible. However, it was very evident its powers went far beyond the mere time travel we'd once learned about."
    new "其中一个本该在水晶层，而复制它这种事从来都无从设想。然而很明显，它的力量远不止我们先前所了解的时间穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:51688
    old "Would they let me travel, or would that be denied again? I faltered, desperately trying to make up my mind."
    new "它们会让我穿越，还是会再一次拒绝我？我迟疑不决，拼命想拿定主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:51690
    old "Why had Atsuki suddenly disappeared...!? He had to still exist..."
    new "Atsuki 为什么会突然消失……！？他肯定还在才对……"

    # game/script.rpy:51691
    old "I wasn't in our reality, but was it really possible to return to it...? If I traveled to the past right then, even outside of the tower, that Atsuki would likely not be there."
    new "我已不在我们那个现实中，可真的还能回去吗……？就算我此刻穿越到过去，即便是在塔外，那个 Atsuki 恐怕也不会在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:51692
    old "...The world is being constantly changed, and not only by me. To be back together outside, we'd need to travel to the past at the same time."
    new "……世界无时无刻不在被改变，而且不止是我在改。要在外面重逢，我们必须同时穿越到过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:51695
    old "It made me want to tear my hair out. Was there really a reason why I was at the beginning of the incident? ...Would I be sent back to my reality if I merely followed some sort of destiny?"
    new "这让我几欲抓狂。我被送到事件的开端，难道真有什么缘由？……只要我顺着某种命运走下去，就能被送回自己的现实吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:51697
    old "These two Sekimeiya... This could be good."
    new "这两个 Sekimeiya……说不定能派上用场。"

    # game/script.rpy:51698
    old "The existence of an extra one isn't known, and Naomi just traveled somewhere thinking she left the attic locked. I can hide one of them, and the group won't be aware of the one I have even if they enter the attic."
    new "多出来的那个，没人知道它的存在；Naomi 刚刚穿越去了别处，还以为自己把阁楼锁好了。我可以藏起其中一个，这样就算其他人进了阁楼，也不会察觉我手上这个。"

    # game/script.rpy:51699
    old "After that, I just have to find Atsuki and bring him to the Sekimeiya that'll a lot of energy. That's how we'll be able to leave."
    new "之后，我只要找到 Atsuki，把他带到蓄满能量的那个 Sekimeiya 旁边。这样我们就能离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:51700
    old "Who knew about that second Sekimeiya? Was it only Naomi? On the 15th, she had appeared from the lower floors, asking to talk to Katei privately. Maybe that was where she ended up after she vanished from the attic."
    new "有谁知道第二个 Sekimeiya 的存在？只有 Naomi 吗？15 号那天，她从下面几层上来，要求和 Katei 单独谈谈。也许她从阁楼消失之后，去的就是那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:51701
    old "I could be sure the previously gray one worked, so I grabbed it, avoiding direct contact. I knew very well about the lack of good hiding spots, so I considered where to leave it."
    new "先前那个灰色的必定能用，于是我避开直接接触，把它拿了起来。我很清楚这里缺少合适的藏匿之处，便开始盘算该把它放到哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:51706
    old "I had personally found the hidden area in the storeroom, and it was possible Katei knew about it. Because of that, somewhere in the attic immediately seemed like the best option."
    new "储藏室里的隐蔽处是我亲自发现的，而 Katei 也可能知道那里。正因如此，阁楼里的某个地方立刻成了最好的选择。"

    # game/script.rpy:51710
    old "...I entered the rightmost bedroom."
    new "……我走进了最右边的那间卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:51715
    old "Keeping my hands off the gem, I opened the wardrobe. Once I looked inside, I remembered the two pieces of clothing Atsuki had pointed at.{w} They were a white shirt and a dark gray pair of pants, larger than what I usually wore. There was nothing else to put on."
    new "我不去碰那颗宝石，打开了衣柜。往里一看，我想起了 Atsuki 指过的那两件衣服。{w} 一件白衬衫，一条深灰色长裤，尺码都比我平时穿的大。除此之外再无别的可穿。"

    # game/script.rpy:51719
    old "I looked around me, wondering where to leave the Sekimeiya. Since I had to find Atsuki, I couldn't stay with it, but there weren't many places in the attic that could conceal things for long. The best I could think to do was crouch next to the bed and let the Sekimeiya roll up to the wall underneath it."
    new "我环顾四周，琢磨该把 Sekimeiya 放在哪里。既然得去找 Atsuki，我就不能守着它，可阁楼里能长久藏住东西的地方并不多。想来最好的办法，就是蹲在床边，让 Sekimeiya 滚到床底靠墙的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:51720
    old "The door to the attic was still unlocked, so I had to hurry. I took off my coat and grabbed both pieces of clothing, sensing a bizarre surrealness as I put them on. Would that mere action guarantee my return to that world? There was nothing else I could do to aim for that.{w} ...Had the me that Atsuki had seen really been me after all?"
    new "阁楼的门还没上锁，我必须抓紧。我脱下外套，抓起那两件衣服换上，隐约感到一种荒诞的不真实感。仅仅这样做，就能保证我回到那个世界吗？除此之外，我再没有别的办法可以尝试。{w}……Atsuki 见到的那个我，终究真的是我吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:51727
    old "I tied my coat and old clothing around my waist together and exited the room."
    new "我把外套和换下的旧衣一并系在腰间，走出了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:51731
    old "The other Sekimeiya still sat on the sofa. What would happen to it? Would anyone find it before the rest entered the attic?{w} We had only been able to come in thanks to the keys on Naomi's dead body. Someone in the tower had to be plotting her death right then, so I needed to find her and see if I could prevent that."
    new "另一个 Sekimeiya 仍放在沙发上。它会怎么样？会不会在其他人进阁楼之前就被发现？{w} 我们能进来，全靠 Naomi 尸体上的钥匙。塔里此刻一定有人在密谋取她性命，所以我必须找到她，看看能否阻止。"

    # game/script.rpy:51740
    old "I locked the door with my key. Then, going down the floors, I thought about something Atsuki had said after we'd met again."
    new "我用自己的钥匙锁上门。随后在下楼时，我想起了重逢后 Atsuki 说过的一句话。"

    # game/script.rpy:51744
    old "He claimed the recording was real.{w} What the hell did that even mean? Did they really spend an entire month here? There's no way."
    new "他硬说那段录音是真的。{w} 那到底是什么意思？他们真的在这里待了整整一个月？绝不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:51745
    old "What had happened after my travel? The eyes he'd looked at me with had first been filled with suspicion, but why...? Who could I have been if not the \"real Shiroya\"?"
    new "我穿越之后，究竟发生了什么？他最初看我的眼神满是怀疑，可那是为什么……？如果我不是「真正的 Shiroya」，我又是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:51747
    old "It's going to be quite a few hours until the time he saw me with these clothes in hallway B. Will I be there by that time somehow?"
    new "距离他在 B走廊看见我穿这身衣服，还有好几个小时。到那时，我会以某种方式出现在那里吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:51748
    old "I knew my goals were slightly contradictory. After all, that reality wasn't where the Atsuki I was searching for was. However, if I really got there, I could show myself to the others as soon as I traveled to the past from the bathroom. Then, I would suddenly be the original me again."
    new "我知道自己的目标有些自相矛盾。毕竟，我要找的 Atsuki 并不在那个现实里。可如果我当真回到那里，只要从浴室穿越到过去，就能立刻出现在其他人面前。那样一来，我便又会突然变回原本的我。"

    # game/script.rpy:51755
    old "I went down the multiple staircases, feeling the odd touch of my new clothes. When I got to the last one, I noticed voices coming from hallway C."
    new "我走过一重又一重楼梯，新衣服贴在身上的触感格外陌生。走到最后一段时，我听见 C走廊传来人声。"

    # game/script.rpy:51756
    old "They quickly faded, and I realized the group was moving to hallway B. I silently looked past the gray door."
    new "声音很快远去，我意识到那群人正转向 B走廊。我默默地朝那扇灰门外面望去。"

    # game/script.rpy:51763
    old "Katei's still not with them.{w} There's no way they talked to the outside.{w} Why is Katei not showing himself? He still has to be here, doesn't he...?"
    new "Katei 还是没跟他们在一起。{w}他们绝不可能跟外界联系过。{w}可 Katei 为什么迟迟不现身？他一定还在这里，不是吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:51764
    old "I could hear doors opening, the sound of them searching through hallway B. I knew they'd soon go up the floors, so if I wasn't careful, I could easily be found. The storeroom and the attic were the only somewhat unreachable places."
    new "我能听见一扇扇门被推开，那是他们在 B走廊搜查的动静。我知道他们很快就会往楼上走，若不留神，轻易就会被他们发现。眼下勉强算得上难以抵达的地方，只有储藏室和阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:51765
    old "Where could Atsuki be!? Is it possible he went to the past and was teleported outside the tower?{w} ...Even if that happened, would he not have entered it again? I suppose not if the incident had already started."
    new "Atsuki 到底在哪里！？会不会是他去了过去，结果被传送到了塔外？{w}……就算真是那样，他难道不会重新进去吗？除非那时事件已经开始了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51772
    old "When I was sure hallway C was empty, I stepped down and silently walked to A."
    new "确认 C走廊里空无一人后，我才走下台阶，不声不响地朝 A走廊走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:51777
    old "Eventually, as I'd expected, the group came closer again."
    new "最终，正如我所料，那群人又靠近了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51781
    old "To avoid being seen, I hid myself in one of the crystal rooms which had just been investigated, A5. It was the one that had been hit by the smoke, and I could see the gems were still missing."
    new "为了不被发现，我躲进了他们刚刚查过的一间水晶展室 A5。这正是被烟雾波及的那一间，我能看出，里面的宝石仍然不见踪影。"

    # game/script.rpy:51786
    old "..ake— ...evator?"
    new "……坐——……电梯？"

    # game/script.rpy:51790
    old "I recognized all their voices, and the conversation they were having was fairly familiar to me."
    new "他们的声音我都认得，此刻的谈话内容我也相当熟悉。"

    # game/script.rpy:51791
    old "...em to be worki—"
    new "……好像……能用了——"

    # game/script.rpy:51793
    old "After noticing the elevator wasn't functioning, they loudly went up the stairs. As Katei wasn't with them, their pace was much quicker, and they didn't consider the unlocked door to floor 2 odd."
    new "发现电梯用不了之后，他们便大声说着话上了楼梯。少了 Katei，他们的脚步快了许多，也没觉得通往二楼的门没锁有什么奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:51794
    old "...And they didn't find the suitcase in hallway C."
    new "……而且，他们没在 C走廊发现那只手提箱。"

    # game/script.rpy:51795
    old "On that day, we'd been beset with questions from the word go. Who discarded that suitcase? ...What caused the computer's shutdown?"
    new "那一天，我们从一开始就被重重疑问缠住。是谁丢下了那只手提箱？……电脑又是为什么关机的？"

    # game/script.rpy:51802
    old "After some time had passed, I exited the room. Was Atsuki there as well, hiding like I was?"
    new "过了一阵子，我走出房间。Atsuki 是不是也在这儿，和我一样躲着？"

    # game/script.rpy:51806
    old "Still puzzled by Katei's absence, I went to check the live camera feed. I assumed the monitors were working."
    new "我仍想不通 Katei 为何不在，便去查看监控的实时画面。我以为监视器还在运作。"

    # game/script.rpy:51810
    old "The door wasn't opening."
    new "门打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:51811
    old "It's locked...? Why?"
    new "锁上了……？为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:51812
    old "As soon as I asked myself that, I knew the answer: the alarm had locked it."
    new "这个念头刚一浮起，答案也随之而来：是警报把门锁上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51813
    old "...And Katei hasn't unlocked it yet. I guess this proves he wasn't in the security room during the attack."
    new "……而 Katei 到现在都还没解锁。看来这足以证明，袭击发生的时候，他并不在监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:51814
    old "Or... could it be he's currently still inside?"
    new "又或者……他其实现在还在里面？"

    # game/script.rpy:51826
    old "Only the shutter was in the lobby. At that time, no blood had been spilled yet, and the shining floor remained spotless."
    new "大厅里只有那道卷帘门。那时还没有流过血，光可鉴人的地面依旧一尘不染。"

    # game/script.rpy:51834
    old "Aside from the darker tone, the case was identical in hallway B. I looked up at the closest camera and confirmed every part of it had been covered by the smoke."
    new "除了色调更暗，B走廊的情况如出一辙。我抬头望向最近的那台摄像头，确认它整台都被烟雾笼罩了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51839
    old "At first glance, nobody else was on the crystal floor."
    new "一眼望去，水晶层上再没有别人。"

    # game/script.rpy:51842
    old "...Atsuki?{w} Are you here...?{w} Atsuki!"
    new "……Atsuki？{w}你在这儿吗……？{w}Atsuki！"

    # game/script.rpy:51845
    old "I felt like my voice was audible across the entire crystal floor, but nobody was drawn to it."
    new "我觉得自己的声音应该传遍了整个水晶层，却没有谁循声而来。"

    # game/script.rpy:51848
    old "Naomi had to be somewhere too, but I wasn't sure she'd show herself to me. As I didn't want to be in the middle of the hallway, I walked toward a place I had to check."
    new "Naomi 应该也在某处，只是我不确定她愿不愿现身见我。我不想一直站在走廊中央，便朝一处非查不可的地方走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:51855
    old "I entered the storeroom and rapidly closed the door behind me. The fake wall was keeping the larger corridor hidden, so I carefully felt it for the opening mechanism."
    new "我进了储藏室，飞快地关上了身后的门。那面假墙遮住了外侧较宽的通道，我小心地摸索，寻找打开它的机关。"

    # game/script.rpy:51859
    old "After finding it, I slid it to the back and opened it with ease."
    new "摸到机关后，我将其向后一推，门便应手而开。"

    # game/script.rpy:51863
    old "I shut myself in. I couldn't believe that secret passage hadn't had any relevance during the day. It served some kind of purpose, and it was likely someone else still in the tower knew about it. I couldn't feel completely safe there."
    new "我把自己关了进去。真没想到，这条暗道在那一天里竟毫无用武之地。它总归有某种用途，而塔里可能还有别人也知道它。待在这里，我也无法彻底安心。"

    # game/script.rpy:51864
    old "After shutting myself in, the complete darkness returned."
    new "关上门后，四周又陷入一片漆黑。"

    # game/script.rpy:51868
    old "I stepped up to the final door, aware of where it led."
    new "我走到最后一扇门前，心里清楚它通向哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:51870
    old "...{w}What...?"
    new "……{w}什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:51873
    old "I couldn't see anything, so I'd blindly felt its surface with one hand. ...Something else was there."
    new "我什么也看不见，只好伸出一只手在门板上摸索。……那里还有别的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:51876
    old "This is the handle...! It hasn't been taken off!"
    new "这是门把手……！它还没被拆掉！"

    # game/script.rpy:51877
    old "I gripped the freezing metal and turned it downward."
    new "我握住冰凉的金属，往下一转。"

    # game/script.rpy:51881
    old "Immediately, the door smoothly moved toward me, allowing bright light to illuminate the gloomy walls."
    new "门随即平稳地朝我这边滑开，明亮的光线照亮了昏暗的墙壁。"

    # game/script.rpy:51885
    old "Before the gap widened, I hastily closed it again. I'd seen white grass at my feet and the surrounding mountains above. The door... was not locked."
    new "在门缝扩大之前，我慌忙又把它关上。我已看见脚下白色的草，还有上方环抱的群山。这扇门……没有上锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:51889
    old "Has the handle not been removed yet...? ...Or did it never happen this time?"
    new "把手还没被拆下来……？……还是说，这一次根本没发生过那件事？"

    # game/script.rpy:51890
    old "Puzzled, I tried to understand why stepping out of the building was possible.{w} ...On the 15th, the handle had been taken off. When I'd entered the tower during the night, it had already been gone. So how could it possibly have been attached right then?"
    new "我满腹疑惑，想弄清为什么此刻竟能走出这栋楼。{w}……15 号那天，把手已经被拆掉了。我夜里进塔的时候，它早就不在了。既然如此，它此刻怎么会还装在上面？"

    # game/script.rpy:51891
    old "There was a line of reasoning that made a bit of sense.{w} In the morning of that day, we had found a rusty key on the floor of hallway A. ...It was a key I had in my purse at that very moment."
    new "有一条思路勉强说得通。{w}那天早上，我们在 A走廊的地上捡到过一把生锈的钥匙。……而此刻，那把钥匙正躺在我的手包里。"

    # game/script.rpy:51892
    old "After feeling its rough surface, I took it out and inserted it into the keyhole. Upon turning it, I successfully locked the door."
    new "我摸着那粗糙的表面，把它取出来插进锁孔。一转之下，门便锁上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51896
    old "It really was for this door, then..."
    new "看来，它果然是这扇门的钥匙……"

    # game/script.rpy:51897
    old "And we had found it very early on. It was likely that the handle had been gone since the start."
    new "而且我们很早就捡到了它。这么看来，把手多半从一开始就不在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51898
    old "Why would it have been removed so early? Of course, to prevent us from leaving.{w} ...But how would anyone have done that? After all, the alarm was supposed to be a secret. We didn't even learn what really triggered it."
    new "何必那么早就把它拆掉？当然是为了不让我们离开。{w}……可又有谁能做到？毕竟警报本该是秘密，我们连它究竟因何触发都没弄明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:51899
    old "Whoever took it off knew about the alarm in addition to the secret door's existence. Normally, I would assume that the door was always taken into consideration for whatever the attack entailed..."
    new "拆掉把手的人不仅知道暗门的存在，还知道警报的事。照理说，我会认为无论这场袭击是什么来头，这扇门从一开始就被考虑在内了……"

    # game/script.rpy:51900
    old "But the fact that it was open just now contradicts that, especially because when I entered the tower through it, the handle was already gone."
    new "可刚才门是开着的，这就说不通了——何况我当初从那扇门进入塔里时，把手就已经不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51903
    old "I see. ...The handle was removed days before the 15th, but this didn't repeat this time, so the door is unlocked. Someone who traveled far to the past must have removed the handle, aware of the alarm and secret door thanks to their future knowledge.{w} But... did they see the handle removed before they traveled and then remove it in the past, making it a loop with no start...?"
    new "原来如此。……那个世界的把手在15日之前好几天就被拆掉了，这次却没有重演，所以门没有锁。一定是有人穿越到很久以前，拆下了把手——凭着来自未来的知识，他知道警报，也知道暗门。{w}可是……会不会是他穿越之前见过把手被拆，于是回到过去亲手拆掉了它，这样就形成了一个没有起点的循环……？"

    # game/script.rpy:51904
    old "In any case, this isn't that same world. In this one, the handle wasn't taken off days in advance by anyone. I'm not sure what the cause of these differences is, but there is another major one that must be related."
    new "总之，这里不是那个世界。在这个世界里，没有人提前几天拆掉把手。这些差异因何而生，我还说不清，但另有一处重大的不同，必定与此相关。"

    # game/script.rpy:51905
    old "...Katei's absence. I don't think he's in the building right now.{w} In the past, I found the key for this door in his security room. On the 15th, we found it in hallway A, where I bet he dropped it. ...I wonder why he didn't go back for it.{w} Was Katei responsible for all this? That doesn't make a ton of sense, but he had this key. He was ready to leave through this door because he knew the alarm would go off and block every other method of escape. If someone hadn't removed the handle in the past, we might never have even seen him."
    new "……Katei 不在了。我想他现在并不在这栋楼里。{w}在那个世界，我是在他的监控室里找到这扇门的钥匙的。15日那天，我们在 A走廊捡到了它，我猜是他掉在那里的。……不知他为什么没有回去捡。{w}这一切都是 Katei 做的吗？这么说不太说得通，可钥匙确实在他手上。他早就准备从这扇门离开，因为他知道警报会响，其他所有逃路都会被封死。若不是有人在过去拆掉了把手，我们恐怕根本见不到他。"

    # game/script.rpy:51910
    old "So what happened here?"
    new "那这里究竟发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:51911
    old "Did he leave right after the smoke was released? I wonder what this plan was really about, then, because Naomi ran up with the Sekimeiya. ...Well, with two of them."
    new "他是在烟雾放出后立刻离开的吗？那这场计划到底是为了什么？毕竟 Naomi 是带着 Sekimeiya 跑上来的。……准确地说，是两个。"

    # game/script.rpy:51912
    old "I still had no clue what the attack actually was. I didn't know who was innocent and who wasn't. However, that wasn't the most important thing."
    new "那场袭击究竟是什么，我依然毫无头绪。谁无辜、谁有罪，我也分不清。可是，这些都不是最要紧的。"

    # game/script.rpy:51913
    old "...What should I do now?"
    new "……我现在该怎么办？"

    # game/script.rpy:51914
    old "Everyone can leave. Katei's not here, so they must not know what happened or how long they'll have to be here for."
    new "所有人都可以离开。Katei 不在这里，所以他们一定不知道发生了什么，也不知道自己还要在这里待多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:51915
    old "...Was Katei behind all the deaths? Did he kill Naomi? ...If he did, they should all be safe. But I don't know what Naomi's intentions are, and Katei also ended up dying in our world."
    new "……那些人的死都和 Katei 有关吗？Naomi 是他杀的吗？……如果是，那其他人应该都安全了。可我不知道 Naomi 究竟想做什么，而 Katei 在我们的世界里最后也死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51919
    old "But it wasn't so simple. If everyone left just like that, I wouldn't return to that world. The only way that could happen was by still being in the tower in the afternoon."
    new "但事情没有这么简单。如果所有人就这样离开，我就回不到那个世界了。而要回去，唯一的办法就是下午还留在这座塔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:51920
    old "...What if Atsuki wasn't with me anymore? If everyone left, I'd finally cement a world with an extra version of myself."
    new "……要是 Atsuki 已经不在我身边了呢？如果所有人都走了，这个世界就会就此固定下来，从此多出一个我。"

    # game/script.rpy:51921
    old "How would it happen? How would I ever return to that world? Just as I didn't know that, I had no clue how I'd ended up where I was."
    new "那要怎样才能做到？我究竟怎样才能回到那个世界？就像我不知道答案一样，我也不知道自己是怎么落到如今这一步的。"

    # game/script.rpy:51922
    old "It was possible the world would morph as the hours went on. People would learn about time travel and eventually go back in time. Upon altering the past, the world's status would shift.{w} It was a mystery how the changes were applied, but I didn't think it was impossible that I could get to where I wanted merely by letting the hours pass."
    new "随着时间推移，世界也许会发生变化。人们会得知时间穿越，最终回到过去。一旦过去被改写，世界的状态也会随之改变。{w}这些变化如何生效，至今仍是个谜，但我并不觉得，光等着时间过去，我就一定到不了我想去的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:51923
    old "...I knew where two Sekimeiya were, and while it was possible I could leave with them, it was incredibly risky—I had no way to know whether traveling to the past was still a good idea."
    new "……我知道两个 Sekimeiya 在哪里。虽然我可以带着它们离开，但风险极大——我无法判断穿越回过去是否还是个好主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:51933
    old "I turned around and walked toward the wall.{w} ...I thought I'd heard a sound coming from the hallway."
    new "我转过身，朝墙走去。{w}……我好像听见走廊那边有动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:51935
    old "...I held my breath, staying as close to the wall as possible. The storeroom was uncomfortably cold, so I didn't directly touch the tile."
    new "……我屏住呼吸，尽量贴着墙。储藏室里冷得让人难受，所以我没有直接碰到瓷砖。"

    # game/script.rpy:51940
    old "Had I been mistaken, or had someone crossed the hallway? After focusing my hearing, I hadn't heard anything else."
    new "是我听错了吗？还是有人从走廊上走过？我凝神细听，却再没听见别的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:51944
    old "...If it was the group, I figured they would be talking and have audible footsteps. Unless I'd imagined it, it was either one or two people."
    new "……如果是那一群人，我想他们应该会说话，脚步声也应该听得见。除非是我幻听，否则那动静只可能来自一两个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:51945
    old "...Could it have been Atsuki? I began to debate what to do."
    new "……会是 Atsuki 吗？我开始盘算该怎么办。"

    # game/script.rpy:51946
    old "He knows about this place. If it's him, he should come here eventually."
    new "他知道这个地方。如果是他，迟早会来这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:51950
    old "I'd been rigidly on alert for a couple of minutes. If someone was close to me, I wasn't perceiving them."
    new "我已经绷紧神经戒备了好几分钟。就算有人靠近我，我也察觉不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:51951
    old "...That was until an abrupt yell came. A faint but shrill yell that instantly pierced my chest."
    new "……直到一声突如其来的喊叫响起。那声音微弱却尖锐，瞬间刺穿了我的心口。"

    # game/script.rpy:51954
    old "Seconds later, a door was shut."
    new "几秒之后，一扇门被关上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51957
    old "It had paralyzed me on the spot. Staring at the darkness, I kept replaying the brusque, feminine yell that had immediately lapsed into silence."
    new "那声音让我僵在原地。我盯着眼前的黑暗，脑中反复回响着那声短促的女声喊叫——刚响起，便戛然而止。"

    # game/script.rpy:51958
    old "I had to rush out of the storeroom. That yell was full of nothing but despair, and someone was still there.{w} I wanted to deny I'd even heard it, but I forced myself to move."
    new "我必须立刻冲出储藏室。那声喊叫里只有绝望，而那个人还在外面。{w}我恨不得当作自己什么都没听见，却还是逼着自己动了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:51965
    old "I opened the wall and very slowly stepped forward. Then, I placed my hand on the hallway doorknob. It was dangerous, but I desperately wanted to see that I'd been wrong."
    new "我推开暗墙，极缓慢地迈出脚步。随后，我把手搭在通往走廊的门把手上。这很危险，可我只想亲眼确认自己听错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51969
    old "The hallway seemed completely empty. I distinctly felt the sensation that nobody else was there, but I knew that couldn't be the case."
    new "走廊看上去空无一人。我清楚地感觉到旁边没有任何人，但我知道事情不可能是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:51970
    old "The door that had closed... All of them were, but my legs began to walk toward one in particular."
    new "那扇被关上的门……这里的门全都关着，可我的双腿却朝其中一扇走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:51974
    old "I realized how fast my heart had gotten when I gripped the door, and once I opened it, that only intensified."
    new "握住门把手时，我才发觉自己的心跳得有多快；门一打开，它跳得更厉害了。"

    # game/script.rpy:51985
    old "I hadn't been wrong, but the sight I saw wasn't what I expected."
    new "我没有听错，但眼前的景象出乎我的意料。"

    # game/script.rpy:51986
    old "There were two bodies lying on the floor. The room was dim, but I instantly identified them."
    new "地板上躺着两具躯体。房间里光线昏暗，我却一眼认出了他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:51987
    old "There couldn't be a more terrifying sight. While my hands trembled and I began to step back, a fate that had been once stated replayed like a record."
    new "世上不会有比这更可怕的光景。我双手发抖，开始后退，而曾经有人告诉过我的那个命运，就像唱片一样重放起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:51988
    old "...On the floor was my own body, facing me with blank eyes. It had been my own anguished yell that I'd heard.{w} Next to it was Naomi, her head dripping blood beneath one of my arms."
    new "……地板上躺着我自己的躯壳，空洞的双眼正对着我。刚才听到的那声痛苦的喊叫，原来是我自己发出的。{w}旁边是 Naomi，她的头在我的一条手臂下，鲜血不断滴落。"

    # game/script.rpy:51995
    old "Without making noise, I closed the door. Someone was still present—someone who had killed me."
    new "我悄无声息地关上了门。还有人在——那个杀了我的人还在。"

    # game/script.rpy:51998
    old "I couldn't let myself be seen. A sudden dizziness invaded me as I glanced back and forth between both sides of the corridor. Trying not to lurch, I reached the storeroom again."
    new "绝不能被人看见。我朝走廊两端来回张望，一阵眩晕忽然袭来。我竭力不让自己踉跄，重新回到了储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:52006
    old "Behind the wall, I let out a long breath, that merciless image still burned into my retinas."
    new "躲到墙后，我长长地吐出一口气，那幅无情的画面仍烙在我的视网膜上。"

    # game/script.rpy:52008
    old "I... had been killed."
    new "我……已经被人杀死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52009
    old "How had that happened...? Even though the body I'd seen wasn't mine, my own could barely support itself either."
    new "这怎么会发生……？明明看到的那具躯壳不是我的，我自己的身体却也几乎撑不住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52010
    old "Who... had done it? If Katei wasn't in the tower, very few options remained. ...I'd even been wrong about Naomi's safety, as she'd fallen victim next to me."
    new "是……谁干的？如果 Katei 不在塔里，剩下的可能就寥寥无几了。……连 Naomi 的安危我都料错了，她就在我身旁一同遇害。"

    # game/script.rpy:52011
    old "I had to think straight—it was crucial not to lose myself. The person who had killed Naomi the first time must've targeted me as well... but why...!? And who had it been...!?"
    new "我必须理清头绪——绝不能在这里失去自我。第一次杀死 Naomi 的人，一定也把我当成了目标……可为什么……！？那个人又是谁……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:52014
    old "There was no sound I could pick up. The closing door had been the last time I'd perceived someone's presence."
    new "我捕捉不到任何声音。关门声过后，我就再也没有察觉到有人的存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:52020
    old "I had to calm myself down. The world I was in wouldn't remain.{w} It would be entirely modified until it warped into the day I'd lived through. That would erase my death."
    new "我必须让自己冷静下来。我所处的这个世界不会一直保持原样。{w}它会被彻底改写，直到变成我亲身经历过的那一天。那样一来，我的死就会被抹去。"

    # game/script.rpy:52021
    old "That... had to happen. I didn't know how, or why, but it had to."
    new "那……一定会发生。我不知道它会以何种方式、出于什么原因发生，但它一定会来。"

    # game/script.rpy:52022
    old "Atsuki... The new one. Where is he?"
    new "Atsuki……新来的那个。他在哪里？"

    # game/script.rpy:52023
    old "My heart wouldn't slow down. Atsuki was going to see my body soon. ...Just thinking about that made it hard to breathe."
    new "我的心跳怎么也慢不下来。Atsuki 很快就会看到我的尸体。……光是想到这一点，我就喘不过气。"

    # game/script.rpy:52025
    old "Miiya had just died. I couldn't let him see me dead too, or he might have given up entirely instead of fighting. I didn't want to imagine the brief thoughts going through my own head before dying either, but I couldn't stop imagining them."
    new "Miiya 刚刚才死。我不能让他再看到我也死了，否则他也许会彻底放弃，不再抗争。我也不愿去想自己临死前脑中闪过的那些念头，可那些念头偏偏挥之不去。"

    # game/script.rpy:52029
    old "Two Sekimeiya were in the attic. Trying to undo what had happened was possible."
    new "阁楼里有两个 Sekimeiya。要挽回已经发生的事，并非不可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:52030
    old "Everyone was above me, and as the elevator didn't work, I couldn't rush up. I hadn't wanted to travel through time, but Atsuki couldn't see that I'd died, no matter if it could be reversed later."
    new "所有人都在我楼上，电梯又不能用，我没法冲上去。我本来不想穿越时间，可无论事后能否逆转，我都不能让 Atsuki 看到我死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52032
    old "Was the killer close to me? If I was found, I would become a target. They would have no issue killing me twice. Even though I hadn't heard anything again, they could've been quietly staying somewhere."
    new "凶手会不会就在我附近？一旦被发现，我就会成为目标。再杀我一次，对方也不会犹豫。虽然之后我没再听到任何动静，但对方也许正悄无声息地藏在某处。"

    # game/script.rpy:52033
    old "It was someone who wanted to kill me since this morning. I have to figure out who it was so that I can be careful later or in case I travel to the past again."
    new "从今天早上起，就有人想杀我。我得弄清楚那是谁，之后才能多加小心，也以防我再次回到过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:52037
    old "Why had I separated myself from the others? In the morning, I had been careful not to remain alone or with people I didn't trust."
    new "我为什么要和大家分开？早上我还那样小心，既不落单，也不和不信任的人待在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:52038
    old "I was unbearably terrified, so I froze behind the wall. Paralyzed by fear, I was unable to leave that place.{w} I had to go to the event room and move the bodies to where I was so that they wouldn't be found. If the killer noticed me, however, everything would be over."
    new "我害怕得几乎无法承受，整个人僵在墙后。恐惧令我动弹不得，我无法离开那个地方。{w}我必须去活动室，把尸体搬到我这里来，免得被人发现。可一旦凶手注意到我，一切就完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52039
    old "So I stayed there, hopelessly regretting all that had happened. The temperature in that part of the building wasn't regulated at all, so the cold seeped into me, but even that had stopped being perceived by my body. ...Nothing was until footsteps finally broke the silence again."
    new "于是我留在原地，无望地懊悔着已经发生的一切。那一带的温度无人调节，寒气一点点渗进身体，可连这份寒冷，我的身体也已感觉不到。……直到脚步声再次打破寂静，我才又有了知觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:52045
    old "It had been a few minutes. Suddenly, faint voices came from the hallway. I immediately knew the group had returned.{w} I couldn't even hesitate. Without wasting time, someone ran past, toward the event room. Then, a voice came from there."
    new "过了几分钟，走廊里忽然传来隐约的人声。我立刻明白，是他们回来了。{w}我根本来不及犹豫。有人一刻不停地跑了过去，奔向活动室。紧接着，那边传来了声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:52047
    old "...s not here!"
    new "……不在这儿！"

    # game/script.rpy:52048
    old "It was Sai. It appeared the storeroom door, being lower quality than the rest, let sound pass easily. But Sai's words weren't the ones I'd expected.{w} Upon hearing that, everyone else ran to the room."
    new "是 Sai。看来储藏室的门比别处单薄，声音很容易透过来。可 Sai 说的话出乎我的意料。{w}其他人一听到，全都朝活动室跑去。"

    # game/script.rpy:52049
    old "...ou serious? The three of them must've taken it!"
    new "……认真的？肯定是他们三个人拿走的！"

    # game/script.rpy:52050
    old "...What? Have they not seen the bodies?{w} \"The three of them\". Naomi, myself, and someone else went down at some point. This third person must be the killer..."
    new "……什么？他们没看到尸体吗？{w}「他们三个人」。Naomi、我，还有另一个人，都在某个时候下过楼。这第三个人，一定就是凶手……"

    # game/script.rpy:52051
    old "...hy! We need to find them!"
    new "……为什么！得赶紧找到他们！"

    # game/script.rpy:52052
    old "...That voice was Isla's. Puzzled, I still managed to comprehend what had happened. The bodies had been removed, but the Sekimeiya had been taken. They didn't seem to have noticed any blood on the floor, so it had been quickly cleaned as well.{w} However, something didn't make sense.{w} \"The three of them must've taken it!\" Erina said that. If only those three were possible suspects, the whole group saw the Sekimeiya in the cabinet before going up.{w} ...How was that possible? I had just seen two in the attic..."
    new "……那是 Isla 的声音。我满心困惑，却还是勉强理清了状况。尸体被移走了，Sekimeiya 也被拿走了。他们似乎没注意到地板上有血，看来是被人迅速清理干净了。{w}可是有一点说不通。{w}「肯定是他们三个人拿走的！」这话是 Erina 说的。如果只有那三个人有嫌疑，那就意味着大家上楼之前，都看到了展示柜里的 Sekimeiya。{w}……这怎么可能？我明明才刚在阁楼里看到两个……"

    # game/script.rpy:52057
    old "Shiroya! ...Are you here!?"
    new "Shiroya！……你在这里吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:52060
    old "...e has to be here."
    new "……她一定在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:52061
    old "Hey! Shiroya...!"
    new "喂！Shiroya……！"

    # game/script.rpy:52062
    old "Atsuki's voice increased in volume; he was getting closer."
    new "Atsuki 的声音越来越响，他正一步步走近。"

    # game/script.rpy:52063
    old "Who have I heard? ...Atsuki, Erina, Isla, Sai. ...Is only Akaro left?"
    new "我听到了哪些人的声音？……Atsuki、Erina、Isla、Sai。……只差 Akaro 了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:52064
    old "As soon as I thought that, a fifth voice came from the hallway."
    new "我刚这么想，走廊里就传来了第五个人的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:52067
    old "Here you are! You need to come up!"
    new "你在这儿！快上楼来！"

    # game/script.rpy:52068
    old "That's Akaro..."
    new "是 Akaro……"

    # game/script.rpy:52069
    old "What happened!?"
    new "出什么事了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:52070
    old "Just come with me! You'll see!"
    new "跟我来就是了！你一看就明白！"

    # game/script.rpy:52071
    old "I could tell he was near the staircase. When everyone heard that, they followed his sudden order and ran up, demanding an explanation. In the blink of an eye, empty silence returned to the crystal floor."
    new "我听得出他就在楼梯附近。听到这道突如其来的命令，大家便跑上楼去，一边追问缘由。转眼间，水晶层又恢复了空荡荡的寂静。"

    # game/script.rpy:52075
    old "...Was he the one who'd killed me? Unless someone had traveled from the future, I saw no other conclusion."
    new "……杀我的人是他吗？除非有人从未来穿越而来，否则我想不出别的结论。"

    # game/script.rpy:52076
    old "I knew next to nothing about Akaro. He had been shrouded in uncertainty the entire day. At some point, he even disappeared for hours, and Atsuki only saw him once after that."
    new "我对 Akaro 几乎一无所知。这一整天，他都让人捉摸不透。他甚至一度消失了好几个小时，那之后 Atsuki 只见过他一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:52077
    old "Had he always been Naomi's killer? ...Why had he never killed me, though? What had led to my own death?"
    new "杀死 Naomi 的人一直都是他吗？……可他又为什么从未对我下手？我的死，又是怎么造成的？"

    # game/script.rpy:52079
    old "Reality had to change. No matter how, the other world had to be brought back. ...Was that truly possible? Would it occur out of nowhere?"
    new "现实必须改变。不管用什么办法，都必须让那个世界回来。……真的能做到吗？它会毫无征兆地发生吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:52081
    old "I continued to wait in that secret corridor. If the bodies had been moved but not brought to my hiding spot, it was very likely the culprit wasn't aware of it."
    new "我继续在那条隐蔽的走廊里等着。尸体被移走了，却没有被搬到我藏身的地方——如此看来，凶手很可能并不知道这个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:52082
    old "...I began to worry. If Akaro was the killer, why get everyone to rush upstairs? It had always been so hard to figure out the culprit's intentions, but I at least knew it was odd that he'd been above the group when he was supposed to be on the crystal floor."
    new "……我开始不安起来。如果凶手是 Akaro，他为什么要把所有人都叫上楼？凶手的意图一向难以揣测，但至少有一点很奇怪：他本该在水晶层，却出现在众人上方。"

    # game/script.rpy:52088
    old "Once a few silent minutes had passed, a sudden sound met my ears."
    new "寂静的几分钟过去后，一个突如其来的声响传入我耳中。"

    # game/script.rpy:52090
    old "What was that...?"
    new "那是什么声音……？"

    # game/script.rpy:52091
    old "It was a single metallic sound, one which I couldn't identify."
    new "那是一声金属响，我分辨不出是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:52092
    old "...I heard nothing for a few brief moments, but then there was a follow-up."
    new "……短暂的几秒里没有别的动静，随后又响了一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:52093
    old "Wait, did the elevator just open? Then what was that first sound?"
    new "等等，刚才是电梯开了吗？那第一声响又是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:52094
    old "I focused my hearing as much as I could. I couldn't be sure, but both sounds had come from where the elevator was."
    new "我竭力竖起耳朵。虽然不能确定，但两声响都是从电梯那个方向传来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:52097
    old "I let more time pass, but nothing else came."
    new "我又多等了一阵，别的声音却始终没有传来。"

    # game/script.rpy:52098
    old "I was sure I hadn't been mistaken. Someone had just been there."
    new "我确信自己没有听错。刚才那里确实有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:52099
    old "I had to stay where I was. Something was happening, but the person I'd heard had made very little noise on purpose. I couldn't let myself be noticed by them."
    new "我必须待在原地。显然是出了什么事，而我听到的那个人刻意把声响压得极低。绝不能让他发现我。"

    # game/script.rpy:52104
    old "There was another long while where nothing was heard from the storeroom, but once again, the silence was eventually broken when sound came from the staircase."
    new "储藏室那边又安静了很久，最后是楼梯处传来的声响打破了沉寂。"

    # game/script.rpy:52105
    old "Here too! What the fuck!?"
    new "这边也是！搞什么鬼！？"

    # game/script.rpy:52106
    old "They have to be somewhere."
    new "他们总得在某个地方吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:52107
    old "Shiroya! Where are you...!?"
    new "Shiroya！你在哪儿……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:52108
    old "I told you! I don't know what the fuck they're doing, but they're hiding from us!"
    new "我说过了！我不知道他们到底在搞什么名堂，但他们就是在躲着我们！"

    # game/script.rpy:52109
    old "Shiroya isn't doing anything! It has to be Naomi!{w} Shiroya! If you're here, please come out!"
    new "Shiroya什么都没做！一定是Naomi！{w}Shiroya！你要是在这儿，就出来吧！"

    # game/script.rpy:52111
    old "What was I hearing? It was clear something had happened, but I couldn't discern what."
    new "我听到的到底是什么？显然出了事，可我听不出究竟发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:52114
    old "There's no way we won't find them if we split up. Atsuki, if you don't want to believe it, I invite you to find her."
    new "分头去找，总能找到他们。Atsuki，你要是不肯信，那就自己去找她。"

    # game/script.rpy:52115
    old "I don't care if you're lying or not! She wouldn't do this!"
    new "我不管你是不是在说谎！她不会做这种事！"

    # game/script.rpy:52116
    old "Listen to me! Not only is she hiding with Naomi, but you're incredibly suspicious! They're obviously doing this shit for a reason, but we won't find them if we don't split up."
    new "你听我说！不只是她跟Naomi一起躲了起来，你自己也相当可疑！他们这么干显然是有原因的，但不分头行动就找不到人。"

    # game/script.rpy:52117
    old "He's right. They must have the Sekimeiya, so this has to be part of their plan."
    new "他说得没错。Sekimeiya肯定在他们手上，这一定是他们计划的一部分。"

    # game/script.rpy:52118
    old "What plan!? She has no plan!"
    new "什么计划！？她根本没有什么计划！"

    # game/script.rpy:52119
    old "Then where is she? If she's not involved, why would Naomi do that?"
    new "那她在哪儿？如果她跟这件事无关，Naomi为什么要那么做？"

    # game/script.rpy:52121
    old "...I don't know!"
    new "……我不知道！"

    # game/script.rpy:52122
    old "I could tell it was Atsuki who began to open the hallway doors. After loudly opening the storeroom's, he rapidly moved on."
    new "我听得出是Atsuki开始一扇扇打开走廊的门。他用力拉开储藏室的门之后，又快步走开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52123
    old "Shiroya! Holy shit, please!"
    new "Shiroya！求你了！"

    # game/script.rpy:52127
    old "It sounded like everyone was dispersing. Some of them went back up while others joined Atsuki. ...They were searching for two dead people."
    new "听声音，众人似乎都散开了。有人回到楼上，也有人跟着Atsuki。……他们在找两个已死的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:52131
    old "The noise moved to the other hallway and eventually quieted. I couldn't understand what they were saying anymore, but I didn't think anything had been found."
    new "声响移到了另一条走廊，最后渐渐静了下来。我已经听不清他们在说什么，但想来什么也没找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:52132
    old "Everyone was scattered around, and as people went up the stairs, the silence returned again."
    new "众人四散开来，随着一些人走上楼梯，寂静再度降临。"

    # game/script.rpy:52133
    old "...Where could the bodies have been hidden? Is it possible the security room was opened?"
    new "……尸体能藏在哪儿？难道监控室被打开了？"

    # game/script.rpy:52134
    old "Naomi had possessed the key to the attic, so her killer could've obtained it. But how would both bodies have been brought up when the elevator didn't work?"
    new "阁楼的钥匙在Naomi手上，凶手很可能就是从她那里弄到的。可电梯当时不能用，两具尸体又是怎么被搬上去的？"

    # game/script.rpy:52135
    old "I could notice a couple people still wandering nearby. Katei wasn't there, so their knowledge of the attic was limited."
    new "我留意到还有几个人在附近走动。Katei不在，他们对阁楼的了解也就有限。"

    # game/script.rpy:52137
    old "Once some time had passed, most of them ended up back on the crystal floor. In hallway C, they were discussing what could've happened after not finding anything."
    new "过了一阵，大多数人又回到了水晶层。他们一无所获，正在C走廊讨论究竟发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:52138
    old "...es, they have to be on the Ashiya floor. That's why this was done.{w} The elevator wasn't working earlier, so they prevented us from using it as soon as it was up and running again."
    new "……没错，他们一定在芦屋层。所以他们才搞了这一出。{w}电梯之前一直不能用，他们就是不想让电梯一恢复就被我们用上。"

    # game/script.rpy:52139
    old "...roya is not doing this...! She must have been locked in there."
    new "……Shiroya不会做这种事……！她一定是被关在里面了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52143
    old "...ound it!"
    new "……找到了！"

    # game/script.rpy:52144
    old "Akaro shouted from a distance, shutting down the conversation. When he spoke again, he had run down the stairs."
    new "Akaro从远处喊了一声，打断了对话。他再开口时，已经跑下了楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:52146
    old "Look! It was on the fourth floor!"
    new "看！在四楼！"

    # game/script.rpy:52147
    old "Huh. Where?"
    new "嗯？在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:52148
    old "In one of the drawers! I looked through all of them. That's where they hid it."
    new "在一个抽屉里！每个抽屉我都翻过了。他们就把它藏在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:52149
    old "That's weird. They must be on the Ashiya floor, right? Why would they hide the Sekimeiya outside of it?"
    new "那倒奇怪了。他们应该就在芦屋层吧？为什么要把Sekimeiya藏到别的地方去？"

    # game/script.rpy:52150
    old "Hell if I know, but you were right. Their plan was to take the Sekimeiya. Now that we found it, we have to hold on to it until this situation is resolved."
    new "我哪知道，不过你说对了。他们的计划就是夺走Sekimeiya。既然我们找回来了，就得一直守着，直到这件事解决。"

    # game/script.rpy:52151
    old "So what are you saying we should do?"
    new "那你到底想让我们怎么做？"

    # game/script.rpy:52152
    old "If we stay in a room, whatever they're trying won't work. They won't be able to get the Sekimeiya again, and none of us will leave it alone. Don't think you're in the clear, either."
    new "只要我们都待在一个房间里，他们想做什么都成不了。他们别想再拿到Sekimeiya，我们也不会让它离开视线。你也别以为自己就洗脱嫌疑了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52153
    old "I'm telling you that Shiroya isn't part of this...! I have no idea what Naomi wanted, but she brought her to the attic! There's no way I'm staying anywhere without finding her!"
    new "我都说了，Shiroya跟这件事无关……！我不知道Naomi想干什么，但她把Shiroya带去了阁楼！找不到她，我绝不会留在原地！"

    # game/script.rpy:52154
    old "I think we should do what Akaro says, Atsuki. If you're right, there's nothing we can do. No matter what their intent is, they're screwed if we stay with the Sekimeiya."
    new "Atsuki，我觉得该照Akaro说的做。如果你说得对，那我们也没别的办法。不管他们打的什么主意，只要我们守着Sekimeiya，他们就完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52155
    old "I'm not going to just sit around! We need to find her!"
    new "我才不会干坐着！我们得找到她！"

    # game/script.rpy:52158
    old "...{w}Was Akaro the killer? When he proposed staying somewhere, an idea came to mind."
    new "……{w}难道Akaro就是凶手？他一说找个地方守着，我心里就浮起一个念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:52159
    old "Nobody had been found, so the Atsuki I'd briefly reunited with was likely nowhere. I knew he didn't have the key to the attic, so if he was elsewhere, they would've seen him."
    new "谁都没有被找到，看来我先前短暂重逢过的那个自己，此刻多半哪儿都不在。我知道他没有阁楼钥匙，所以他要是在别处，他们应该早就看见他了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52160
    old "Atsuki, you need to listen to us. If what you're saying is true, we're out of options. However, the Sekimeiya has already been taken once, and they're the only people who could've done this. Even if someone else got trapped, the reality is the same. Whatever plan they have won't work now, so cooperate with us."
    new "Atsuki，你听我们的。如果你说的是真的，那我们确实别无他法。可Sekimeiya已经被夺走过一次，而能做这事的只有他们。就算还有别人被困住，事实也不会改变。不管他们有什么计划，如今都行不通了，所以配合我们吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:52161
    old "I mean, you're free not to. You can keep searching around, but it's evident they're hidden someplace we can't access. Until we can leave, we have to stay somewhere. Splitting ourselves up might just be what they need."
    new "当然，你不愿意也没人拦你。你可以继续到处找，但他们显然躲在我们去不了的地方。在能离开之前，我们总得待在某个地方。我们一旦分开，说不定正好合了他们的意。"

    # game/script.rpy:52162
    old "You're all insane! We don't know how long that'll take! Naomi's the one who did this, so we have to find Shiroya right now!"
    new "你们都疯了！谁知道那要耗到什么时候！这件事是Naomi干的，我们必须现在就去找到Shiroya！"

    # game/script.rpy:52164
    old "Akaro had found the Sekimeiya. Was it the one he hid? If he hadn't lied about its whereabouts, it wasn't either of the two I'd seen."
    new "Akaro找到了Sekimeiya。那是他藏起来的那个吗？如果他在藏匿地点上没说谎，那就不是我见过的那两个之一。"

    # game/script.rpy:52167
    old "They were sure someone else had to be in the building, and that definitely had something to do with the metallic sound I'd heard after everyone went upstairs. Something had happened while they'd been together, so from their point of view, someone else was there and took the Sekimeiya."
    new "他们确信楼里一定还有别人，而这必然和众人上楼后我听到的那声金属响有关。他们待在一起的时候出过事，所以在他们看来，是另一个人在场，拿走了Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:52168
    old "But it wasn't me or Naomi. Could it have been Katei, or was he long gone? ...There was one last explanation."
    new "但动手的不是我，也不是 Naomi。会是 Katei 吗？可他早已不在了吧？……还剩最后一种解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:52169
    old "The time travel nobody was yet aware of. If someone had traveled to the past, it would've created the illusion of another person. On top of that, Akaro was holding the very thing that allowed that time travel."
    new "那是尚未有人察觉的时间穿越。若有人回到过去，就会造成凭空多出一个人的错觉。更何况，Akaro 手里拿着的，正是让这种时间穿越得以成立的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:52170
    old "We shouldn't leave it in the event room again. We have to hide it from them, just in case."
    new "不能再把它留在活动室了。以防万一，我们得把它藏好，别让他们找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:52171
    old "Akaro's voice distanced as he spoke, and everyone followed him to hallway B. From the other side, I could still hear Atsuki's muddled refusal."
    new "Akaro 边说边往外走，声音渐渐远了，众人跟在他身后走向 B 走廊。从另一头，我仍能听见 Atsuki 含混的拒绝。"

    # game/script.rpy:52175
    old "...On my end, I had made up my mind. I slowly opened both doors in front of me and stepped out of the storeroom."
    new "……而我这边，已经下定了决心。我缓缓推开面前的两扇门，走出了储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:52182
    old "Akaro and Sai were insistent about staying in a crystal room. Their actions in the other world had been vastly different, especially Sai's."
    new "Akaro 和 Sai 坚持要待在水晶展室里。他们在另一个世界的举动截然不同，尤其是 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:52183
    old "It didn't seem like the bodies could've been in the attic, so it was possible Atsuki would find them if he searched hard enough. He was against staying in a room with everyone before finding me. That was one of the reasons I abandoned my hiding spot.{w} I couldn't leave him alone, even if I wished the world would change. If he couldn't find me, he would suffer alone for hours. ...Even so, as I saw the hallway, I kept trembling. I really wanted to talk to him as if nothing had happened."
    new "那两具尸体应该不在阁楼里，只要 Atsuki 找得够仔细，说不定就会发现。在找到我之前，他不肯和大家一起待在房间里。这也是我放弃藏身之处的原因之一。{w}我没法把他一个人丢下，哪怕我心里盼着世界就此改变。要是他找不到我，就会独自煎熬好几个小时。……可即便如此，一望见走廊，我还是止不住发抖。我真的很想装作什么都没发生，去和他说说话。"

    # game/script.rpy:52184
    old "Nobody heard the sound of my steps. Who had killed me and Naomi? That question also brought me to leave the storeroom.{w} If it wasn't anyone in hallway B, I wouldn't be safe staying by myself. If it was one of them, I would be safe as long as we were all together, and it was possible I could determine who was responsible.{w} As long as nothing tricky happened, we would remain in one place. If I made sure that continued, it was a good way to let the time advance until the afternoon. It would almost guarantee that the interior of the tower remained calm."
    new "没有人听见我的脚步声。究竟是谁杀了我和 Naomi？这个问题也促使我离开了储藏室。{w}若凶手不在 B 走廊这些人里，我独自待着并不安全；若凶手就在他们之中，只要大家待在一起，我便性命无虞，说不定还能查出是谁下的手。{w}只要不出什么岔子，我们就会一直待在同一个地方。我若能盯住这一点，正好可以让时间一点点推进到下午，塔内几乎就能确保平安无事。"

    # game/script.rpy:52185
    old "I was also curious to know what had been happening. When I turned to hallway C, I instantly understood what the sound I'd heard really was."
    new "我也想知道外面究竟在发生什么。转头望向 C 走廊的那一刻，我立刻明白刚才听见的声音到底是什么了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52190
    old "Oh... The panel was taken off..."
    new "啊……面板被人拆下来了……"

    # game/script.rpy:52194
    old "The elevator button wasn't there. Only wires coming out of the wall remained where the metallic panel had been."
    new "电梯按钮不见了。原本金属面板的位置，只剩下从墙里伸出的几根电线。"

    # game/script.rpy:52199
    old "Sh-Shiroya!"
    new "Sh、Shiroya！"

    # game/script.rpy:52203
    old "I suddenly turned to face Atsuki and ran to him, my heart rate increasing as I approached."
    new "我猛地转身朝 Atsuki 跑去，越靠近，心跳越快。"

    # game/script.rpy:52210
    old "Wh-Where were you!? I've searched everywhere!"
    new "你、你跑哪儿去了！？我把能找的地方都找遍了！"

    # game/script.rpy:52212
    old "When the others saw me, they dashed over. In the meantime, I thought of what to say, hating the need to lie."
    new "大家一见到我，就急忙跑了过来。我在心里琢磨着该说什么，又讨厌自己不得不撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:52217
    old "What the fuck are those clothes?"
    new "你这身衣服他妈的是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:52221
    old "N-Naomi gave them to me. ...I told her I was cold and that my old clothes were a bit itchy."
    new "是、是 Naomi 给我的。……我跟她说我冷，原来的衣服穿在身上有点扎。"

    # game/script.rpy:52226
    old "What the fuck? Where is she!?"
    new "什么鬼？她人在哪儿！？"

    # game/script.rpy:52227
    old "I-I don't know... We went to the highest floor, but she suddenly disappeared. I think she locked herself in there."
    new "我、我不知道……我们去了最高层，她突然就不见了。我想她是把自己锁在里面了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52232
    old "Are you serious? What did she want?"
    new "你说真的？她到底想干什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:52233
    old "Huh...? What do you mean?"
    new "诶……？你指什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:52234
    old "I'd been looking at the floor, stuttering as I made everything up. ...When I finally looked at the rest, I noticed what greatly stood out from them."
    new "我一直低着头，一边结巴，一边把谎话编下去。……等我终于抬头看向其余的人时，才注意到其中有一处格外扎眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:52240
    old "...Akaro's eyes. They couldn't believe what they were seeing, and his body was solid as a rock. I needed nothing else to know who my killer was."
    new "……是 Akaro 的眼睛。那双眼睛里写满了难以置信，他的身体僵得像块石头。不必再看别的，我已经知道杀我的人是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:52241
    old "In his hands was a glowing Sekimeiya. However, I immediately saw something I assumed nobody had realized.{w} His sleeve was between it and his skin. He was purposely avoiding contact with it."
    new "他手里握着一个发光的 Sekimeiya。然而，我立刻发现了一处大概谁都没注意到的细节。{w}他的袖子隔在它和自己的皮肤之间——他是故意不去碰它。"

    # game/script.rpy:52246
    old "...What did Naomi have to tell you, I mean."
    new "……我是说，Naomi 到底要跟你说什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:52247
    old "I... don't know. She didn't tell me anything. Can you explain what happened there? Why is the elevator button gone?"
    new "我……不知道。她什么都没跟我说。倒是这边出了什么事，你能说明一下吗？电梯按钮为什么不见了？"

    # game/script.rpy:52248
    old "...Slow down. What do you mean she didn't tell you anything? She asked to talk to you and Akaro privately. Did she never follow up on that?"
    new "……你先别急。什么叫她什么都没跟你说？她明明说过要跟你和 Akaro 单独谈谈。后来她没再提过这事？"

    # game/script.rpy:52250
    old "N-No. ...I told her I was cold, and she gave me this."
    new "没、没有。……我只跟她说了我冷，她就把这个给了我。"

    # game/script.rpy:52256
    old "I see. That's also what Akaro said. That you two suddenly disappeared."
    new "原来如此。Akaro 也是这么说的，说你们两个突然就不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52257
    old "Y-Yes, sorry."
    new "是、是的，对不起。"

    # game/script.rpy:52262
    old "That's when we heard the elevator, then. Did Naomi activate it?"
    new "那么，我们听见电梯声就是那时候了。是 Naomi 启动的？"

    # game/script.rpy:52263
    old "...You heard it?"
    new "……你们听见了？"

    # game/script.rpy:52268
    old "Yes, it passed through the fourth floor twice. We thought it couldn't have been the elevator since it wasn't working, but it had to be."
    new "嗯，它两次经过四楼。我们本来觉得电梯坏了，不可能是它，可看来只可能是电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:52269
    old "I see. I don't know why, but it worked when Naomi called it."
    new "这样啊。我也不知道为什么，但 Naomi 一按，电梯就能用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52274
    old "...It did? After that, we all came here and saw that the Sekimeiya had been stolen. Did neither of you do that?"
    new "……真的？之后我们都赶到这里，发现 Sekimeiya 被人偷了。你们两个都没动过它？"

    # game/script.rpy:52275
    old "Wait, wh-what? No. We never went there.{w} In the attic, she gave me these, and when we left, she suddenly ran back and locked herself inside."
    new "等等，你、你说什么？没有。我们根本没去过那里。{w}在阁楼里，她把这些给了我，我们出来之后，她突然又跑回去，把自己锁在了里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:52276
    old "I really hated lying like that. Naomi had been killed, and I was setting her up as the culprit. Meanwhile, Akaro's body hadn't moved in the slightest."
    new "我实在厌恶这样撒谎。Naomi 已经遇害，我却把罪名安在了她头上。而另一边，Akaro 的身体纹丝未动。"

    # game/script.rpy:52279
    old "It seemed they had accepted my claims. They were absurd, especially the clothing part since I was colder than before, but Naomi was already suspicious to them, so they seemed to believe what I was saying."
    new "看来他们接受了我这套说辞。这些话本就荒唐，尤其是衣服那部分——我明明比之前更冷了——但他们对 Naomi 本就心存疑虑，似乎就信了我的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:52280
    old "...Really, though, what happened to the button...?"
    new "……不过，那个按钮到底是怎么回事……？"

    # game/script.rpy:52285
    old "...When we saw that the Sekimeiya was gone, Akaro told us to run upstairs. He'd been searching for you two, and we missed him when he was in the offices.{w} On the fourth floor, the panel had been ripped off. We went up and saw that they were gone on the fifth and sixth as well. Sai tried to open the doors, but the elevator wasn't there.{w} By the time we ran all the way down, it had happened on the first three floors too, and the elevator wasn't there either."
    new "……我们发现 Sekimeiya 不见了之后，Akaro 就叫我们往楼上跑。他一直在找你们俩，我们在办公室那一带和他错过了。{w}四楼的面板已经被撬了下来。我们再往上，五楼、六楼也一样。Sai 试着开门，可电梯不在那里。{w}等我们一路跑到楼下，底下三层也成了这样，电梯同样不在。"

    # game/script.rpy:52286
    old "Yeah. We heard it moving two more times when we were going down. If you're telling the truth, I guess that was Naomi."
    new "对。我们下楼的时候又听见它动了两次。你要没说谎，那应该就是 Naomi 了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52287
    old "I am... I don't know what she did after she locked herself up, but I've been looking for you until now..."
    new "我没说谎……她把自己锁起来之后做了什么，我不知道，但我一直在找你们……"

    # game/script.rpy:52288
    old "In any case, it doesn't matter. We found the Sekimeiya, and we'll stay with it in a room until we can leave so that it isn't stolen again."
    new "总之，那都不重要了。Sekimeiya 已经找回来了，在能离开之前，我们就守在一间屋子里看着它，免得再被偷走。"

    # game/script.rpy:52299
    old "Only one door was open in hallway B."
    new "B走廊上只有一扇门敞着。"

    # game/script.rpy:52300
    old "...Was that where you were going?"
    new "……你们是要去那间屋子？"

    # game/script.rpy:52307
    old "Finally, Akaro spoke. From the storeroom, I'd noticed his voice sounded rougher and sharper than I remembered, but that seemed to have disappeared.{w} When I looked at him, he turned around and walked to that room."
    new "Akaro 终于开口了。我在储藏室里就注意到，他的嗓音比我记忆中更粗更尖，可这会儿那种感觉似乎已经消失了。{w}我看向他时，他转过身，朝那间屋子走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:52310
    old "I thought we should leave the Sekimeiya here. ...Naomi can open the other cabinet, and just like it, I noticed these can get cold too."
    new "我想，Sekimeiya 就放在这里吧。……另一个展示柜 Naomi 能打开，而且我注意到，这些柜子跟那个一样，也是会变冷的。"

    # game/script.rpy:52314
    old "That was why the room had caught my attention. It was room B4, where we'd found the first Naomi and where the Sekimeiya had been hidden."
    new "那间屋子之所以引起我的注意，原因就在这里。那是 B4 房间——我们找到第一个 Naomi 的地方，也是 Sekimeiya 原先被藏起来的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:52319
    old "It's bigger too, so I think it's a good idea."
    new "而且这个也更大一些，我觉得这样挺好。"

    # game/script.rpy:52328
    old "Once again, without looking at us, Akaro walked into the room and raised the lid of a cabinet, undoing the back lock. After placing the Sekimeiya inside, he rotated the two temperature wheels."
    new "Akaro 又一次看也不看我们，径直走进房间，掀起一个展示柜的盖子，解开了后侧的锁。他把 Sekimeiya 放进去，随后转动了两个温度旋钮。"

    # game/script.rpy:52331
    old "...I set it to 5 °C. Let's just leave it in here."
    new "……我设成了 5 °C。就放在这里吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:52334
    old "Everyone entered while I narrowed my eyes. Katei wasn't there, so he hadn't repeatedly warned them not to get the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet. Despite that, Akaro had gone out of his way to keep it in a cold space."
    new "众人陆续进来，我眯起了眼。Katei 不在，所以没能再三叮嘱他们别把 Sekimeiya 拿出展示柜。可即便如此，Akaro 还是特意把它保存在低温的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:52335
    old "He had knowledge of the Sekimeiya—the way he held it was the giveaway. He had to be the one who had stolen it, not just the killer. Atsuki and I had seen the temperature set to 0 °C more than once, and Akaro specifically set it to 5 °C, so there was no way he didn't know about that requirement.{w} ...The temperature of the Sekimeiya's display cabinet wasn't visible, so I wondered what it was."
    new "他了解 Sekimeiya——看他拿它的手法就明白了。他一定就是偷走它的人，而不只是凶手。我和 Atsuki 不止一次见过温度被设在 0 °C，而 Akaro 特意把它设成 5 °C，他不可能不知道这个要求。{w}……Sekimeiya 展示柜的温度从外面看不到，我有些在意那究竟是多少。"

    # game/script.rpy:52336
    old "Nobody was questioning Akaro's bizarre actions. Perhaps it was normal only I was seeing them as such. Similarly, as nobody was questioning what I'd said, I made my way in and sat on the floor, leaning against a cabinet."
    new "没有人质疑 Akaro 那些古怪的举动。也许觉得古怪的只有我一个。同样，也没有人质疑我说过的话。我走进房间，靠着展示柜坐到地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:52341
    old "Atsuki sat to my left. Most strain had disappeared from his face, but I could only feel like I was lying to him. The person he'd entered the building with had been killed, something I could hardly believe."
    new "Atsuki 坐在我左边。他脸上的紧绷褪去了大半，可我只觉得自己在骗他。和他一起走进这栋楼的人死了，这件事我至今难以相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:52342
    old "How had everything taken that turn...? I didn't want to be there. I wanted to be back home or in the lobby, about to leave with Atsuki. I was foolish to hope anything would get better by simply waiting."
    new "事情怎么会变成这样……？我不想待在这里。我想回到家，或者待在大厅，正准备和 Atsuki 一起离开。指望光靠等待就能让一切好转，是我太天真了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52344
    old "The door closed. Sai sat in front of it, blocking the exit. He was insistent about not leaving, and as he looked at me from the opposite end of the room, I could still sense his suspicion."
    new "门关上了。Sai 坐在门前，堵住了出口。他执意不肯离开；他从房间另一头望过来，我仍能感到他的怀疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:52345
    old "Lastly, when I least expected it, Akaro approached us. ...I glanced at him, but his eyes didn't meet mine.{w} Then, he sat to my right, between me and the cabinet containing the Sekimeiya."
    new "最后，在我最没料到的时候，Akaro 朝我们走来。……我瞥了他一眼，他却没有与我对视。{w}随后他在我右边坐下，就坐在我和放着 Sekimeiya 的展示柜之间。"

    # game/script.rpy:52346
    old "For long seconds, I nervously waited for him to say something while he stared at his lap. In the end, when he raised his head, all he did was exhale a long-held breath before staring back down."
    new "有好几秒，我紧张地等着他开口，而他一直低头看着自己的膝盖。最后他抬起头，只是吐出一口憋了很久的气，又低下头去。"

    # game/script.rpy:52358
    old "Simulation Therapy"
    new "模拟疗法"

    # game/script.rpy:52366
    old "A while later, the single sound within the room had been that of Isla's steps. She continually walked from cabinet to cabinet."
    new "过了一阵，房间里唯一的声响就是 Isla 的脚步声。她不停地从一个展示柜走到另一个展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:52372
    old "Oh...! Look at this one!"
    new "哦……！快看这个！"

    # game/script.rpy:52377
    old "Erina followed her daughter around the room and mimicked her sounds of amazement."
    new "Erina 跟着女儿在房间里转，也学着她发出惊叹声。"

    # game/script.rpy:52378
    old "Wow, the swirls on it are so pretty!"
    new "哇，上面的纹路好漂亮！"

    # game/script.rpy:52382
    old "Gleefully, they circled the room until they'd observed all the gems."
    new "她们兴高采烈地绕了一圈，把每颗宝石都看了个遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:52383
    old "The last time, all of us had looked at the gems, so the situation clearly differed.{w} Atsuki hadn't so much as shifted one of his legs since we'd come in. I'd wanted to talk to him, but I hadn't expected he would act that way. Before entering the tower, he and I had spoken very little. That gradually changed during the day, but the Atsuki next to me looked just like he had at his house."
    new "上一次来的时候，我们所有人都去看那些宝石了，眼下的情形显然不同。{w}自从进来，Atsuki 连腿都没挪过一下。我本想和他说话，却没料到他会是这副样子。进塔之前，他和我说的话少得可怜。这一天里，这种情况才渐渐有了改观，可坐在我身边的 Atsuki，那副模样和在他家里时一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:52387
    old "...Oh, let me see that, Isla."
    new "……哦，让我看看那个，Isla。"

    # game/script.rpy:52392
    old "Everyone looked at her purse, where I was staring. I'd just realized there was something very important to check."
    new "大家都顺着我的目光看向她的手提包。我刚刚意识到，有一样非常要紧的东西必须确认。"

    # game/script.rpy:52397
    old "These? They're sunglasses!"
    new "这个吗？是太阳镜！"

    # game/script.rpy:52398
    old "Sunglasses in the winter? Isn't that a little strange?"
    new "冬天戴太阳镜？是不是有点奇怪？"

    # game/script.rpy:52399
    old "Nope! They block the sun reflecting off the snow. Here, try them on."
    new "才不会！它们能挡住雪地反射的阳光。来，你戴上试试。"

    # game/script.rpy:52400
    old "She came closer and handed them to me."
    new "她走近几步，把眼镜递给了我。"

    # game/script.rpy:52401
    old "Hm... They're too small for me, but I'm sure they fit you perfectly."
    new "嗯……对我来说太小了，不过你戴一定正合适。"

    # game/script.rpy:52402
    old "She put them on with a big grin."
    new "她咧嘴一笑，把眼镜戴上。"

    # game/script.rpy:52407
    old "It's okay! You can try again when I'm bigger."
    new "没关系！等我长大一点，你再试一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:52408
    old "...The recorder isn't there. I don't get it."
    new "……录音笔不在里面。真搞不懂。"

    # game/script.rpy:52409
    old "From farther away, Erina smiled at us. I couldn't help but feel that I'd never seen her look that way in the other world."
    new "远处的 Erina 朝我们微笑。我忍不住想，在另一个世界里，我从没见过她这副神情。"

    # game/script.rpy:52413
    old "Isla took off her glasses and ran across the room. I had no idea what to think of her, the recording, or her friend. I knew she had died once, though. If we stayed put, that was much less likely to repeat."
    new "Isla 摘下眼镜，跑着穿过房间。我不知道该如何看待她、那段录音，还有她的朋友。可我知道她死过一次。只要我们不乱走，那样的事就不太可能重演。"

    # game/script.rpy:52418
    old "For a while, Isla's quiet footsteps punctuated the silence as she moved to each cabinet. She'd already looked through all of them, but staying still seemed to be difficult for her. Erina simply followed her daughter's movements with her eyes."
    new "有一阵子，Isla 轻轻的脚步声一下一下地打破寂静，她一个接一个地走过展示柜。每个柜子她都已经看过了，可要她待在原地似乎很难。Erina 只是用目光跟着女儿的身影。"

    # game/script.rpy:52419
    old "When I noticed that the silence had gone on for longer than usual, I glanced back up. It took me a bit to spot Isla in front of the cabinet with the Sekimeiya."
    new "等我发觉这阵安静持续得比平时更久，便抬起头来。过了一会儿，我才看见 Isla 站在放着 Sekimeiya 的展示柜前。"

    # game/script.rpy:52420
    old "She was staring at it with a piercing gaze, her figure completely rigid. Out of nowhere, her right hand began to reach for the lid, moving almost imperceptibly."
    new "她死死盯着它，整个人僵直不动。忽然，她的右手几乎难以察觉地朝柜盖伸去。"

    # game/script.rpy:52421
    old "But before she made contact with it, Akaro noticed what I was looking at."
    new "可还没等她碰到，Akaro 就注意到了我在看什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:52424
    old "Hey, Isla, what are you doing? The Sekimeiya shouldn't be taken out of there."
    new "喂，Isla，你在干什么？Sekimeiya 不能从里面拿出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:52429
    old "...Why not?"
    new "……为什么不行？"

    # game/script.rpy:52430
    old "I already explained. I put it somewhere cold, like it was in the event room. Naomi told us not to take it out of the cabinet, so it's better to keep it shut."
    new "我已经解释过了。我把它放在了低温的地方，和它在活动室时一样。Naomi 说过不能把它拿出展示柜，所以还是关着比较好。"

    # game/script.rpy:52431
    old "I won't take it away. I just want to look at it again."
    new "我不会拿走。我只是想再看一眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:52432
    old "You have plenty of other gems to look at. I know you came to the tower for the Sekimeiya, but it's a lot more boring than all the other stones in this room."
    new "这里有那么多别的宝石可以看。我知道你是冲着 Sekimeiya 来的，可它比这房间里的任何一块石头都无趣得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:52433
    old "Hmph."
    new "哼。"

    # game/script.rpy:52436
    old "Disappointed, Isla turned around. She continued going from cabinet to cabinet, and every once in a while, she'd glare at Akaro from a distance."
    new "Isla 失望地转过身。她继续在各个展示柜之间来回走动，时不时从远处瞪 Akaro 一眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:52438
    old "Once she had circled around the room, she was once again in front of the cabinet with the Sekimeiya."
    new "等她绕完一圈，又回到了放着 Sekimeiya 的展示柜前。"

    # game/script.rpy:52443
    old "But it was glowing, right? Ash, um... Ashiya said that it was the rarest discovery of the century! What if it has super... um, supernatural powers?"
    new "可它会发光，对吧？Ash——呃，芦屋说它是本世纪最稀有的发现！说不定它有什么超……呃，超自然的力量呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:52444
    old "Don't be silly. You don't know much about Ashiya, do you?"
    new "别说傻话了。你对芦屋了解得不多吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:52449
    old "I do! I hear about them all the time!"
    new "我了解！我天天都能听到他们的事！"

    # game/script.rpy:52450
    old "Heh, yeah, but I'll give you some advice. Don't trust anything Ashiya say. You wouldn't like to know how they obtained some of the gemstones you were looking at."
    new "呵，是吗。那我给你个忠告：别信芦屋说的任何话。你刚才看的那些宝石，有些是怎么弄到手的，你知道了可不会高兴。"

    # game/script.rpy:52455
    old "Hmm?"
    new "嗯？"

    # game/script.rpy:52458
    old "Unprompted, Isla sat next to Akaro, demanding a detailed explanation."
    new "没人叫她，Isla 就自己坐到 Akaro 旁边，要他详细讲讲。"

    # game/script.rpy:52464
    old "...They've never been known for their decent practices. That's the best way I can put it. I guess kids nowadays aren't very in touch with their history."
    new "……他们做事的手段从来都算不上正派。我只能这么说。看来现在的孩子对自己的历史都不太了解啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:52465
    old "Upon seeing that Isla had sat with us, Erina came over too."
    new "见 Isla 在我们身旁坐下，Erina 也走了过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:52470
    old "You mean they're not good people?"
    new "「你的意思是，他们不是好人？」"

    # game/script.rpy:52471
    old "Ah, I've told her about this before. It's why I had reservations about bringing her here."
    new "「啊，这事我以前跟她说过。所以我才犹豫要不要带她来。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52476
    old "Huh? I don't remember that."
    new "「咦？我不记得有这回事。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52481
    old "Well, at least in the past they weren't. Right now, it's a bit harder to say, but God only knows what the reason behind today's event was."
    new "「至少过去还算不上。至于现在，就不好说了。不过今天这场活动背后究竟图个什么，只有天知道。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52486
    old "What did you mean before? How have they gotten all these gems?"
    new "「你刚才那话是什么意思？他们哪来这么多宝石？」"

    # game/script.rpy:52491
    old "Do you know anything about gemstones? There are many types. Geodes, for example, look like normal rocks on the outside but are fractal-like on the inside. Ashiya push themselves to have an event every week and change the displayed gemstones often, so in the past they've displayed fake geodes."
    new "「你了解宝石吗？种类多得是。就说晶洞吧，外表看着跟普通石头没两样，切开后内部却布满晶簇。芦屋每周都要办活动，展出的宝石也常换，所以以前就拿假晶洞充过数。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52492
    old "People love looking for extraterrestrial gems—materials that came from space. I bet you that if any of the ones here are supposedly one of those, they were found in one of the mountains you see every day."
    new "「人们总爱寻找天外来的宝石——那些来自太空的东西。我敢打赌，这里要真有哪颗号称是天外来的，八成也是从你天天看得见的那几座山里捡来的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52497
    old "I can't give you proof of this, but some of them are lab-created too. Ashiya can't trick everyone, but it clearly works favorably for them. For a while, they displayed a Verdelite Tourmaline labeled as a Chrome Tourmaline, which is much rarer. They're easily distinguished if you have a magnet, but they look very similar if you only have your eyes."
    new "「我拿不出证据，不过其中有些也是实验室里合成的。芦屋骗不了所有人，可这么做显然对他们有利。有一阵子，他们把绿碧玺标成铬碧玺展出——后者稀有得多。有块磁铁就很容易分辨，可光凭眼睛看，两者几乎一模一样。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52501
    old "Oh...! You know a lot about this!"
    new "「哇……！你懂得真多！」"

    # game/script.rpy:52502
    old "Not as much as you would imagine. It's hard not to hear about these things, really. Of course, I'm not surprised the Sekimeiya doesn't seem to be anything special."
    new "「没你想的那么多。这种事，想不听都难。当然，那个 Sekimeiya 看起来没什么特别，我一点也不意外。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52507
    old "Even if it's not, we would have to pay a fortune if we broke it. Akaro's right, it's better to leave it be."
    new "「就算它真没什么特别，弄坏了我们也赔不起。Akaro 说得对，还是别碰为好。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52517
    old "I didn't want Isla to object, so I attempted to change the topic, and the appearance of her house was the first thing that came to my mind."
    new "我不想让 Isla 出言反驳，便试着转移话题，第一个浮上脑海的就是她家的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:52520
    old "She must be a handful. I bet she leaves a mess at home."
    new "「这孩子肯定不好带。我猜她在家把屋子弄得一团糟吧。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52521
    old "She's got her moments, but we manage. She's all I've got, after all."
    new "「她是有闹腾的时候，不过我们还应付得来。毕竟我就只有她了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52522
    old "Akaro's expression softened. I knew he had to be hiding a lot, but it was hard to think even his appearance was insincere."
    new "Akaro 的神情柔和下来。我知道他一定藏着许多事，可很难想象连他的模样都是装出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:52527
    old "I see. That must be difficult. Say, Isla, how's school going? Shouldn't you be there right now?"
    new "「原来如此。那一定很辛苦。对了，Isla，学校怎么样？这个时间你不是该在学校吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:52532
    old "Yes, but Mom let me skip classes! I like having a day off because not everyone there is nice."
    new "「嗯！不过妈妈让我请假了！我喜欢放假，因为学校里不是每个人都好相处。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52533
    old "Some kids are mean to you?"
    new "「有小孩欺负你？」"

    # game/script.rpy:52538
    old "Well, Amelie never lets me play with them, and everyone does what she says."
    new "「Amelie 从来不许我跟她们一起玩，而且大家都听她的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52543
    old "Ah, is that so? Well, I'll come talk with Amelie once we're out. I had to deal with people like her when I was your age too."
    new "「哦，是这样啊。行，等我们出去了，我去找 Amelie 谈谈。我像你这么大的时候，也应付过她这种人。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52547
    old "Really? My teacher already tried, but Amelie didn't change at all."
    new "「真的吗？老师已经找她谈过了，可 Amelie 一点都没变。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52552
    old "Don't worry. If she continues, we'll have another talk."
    new "「别担心。她要是还这样，我们就再谈一次。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52557
    old "Isla grinned at the thought of a big, scary man like Akaro intimidating her school enemy. Meanwhile, Erina watched over them from above with melancholic eyes."
    new "一想到像 Akaro 这样高大吓人的男人会去镇住她在学校里的对头，Isla 就咧嘴笑了。而 Erina 从高处望着他们，眼里带着几分忧郁。"

    # game/script.rpy:52558
    old "Mom, Mister Akaro is a nice man. Can he be my new daddy?"
    new "「妈妈，Akaro 先生是个好人。他能当我的新爸爸吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:52560
    old "...You want him to be your dad? What do you think he'll say when he sees your bedroom?"
    new "「……你想让他当你爸爸？你说，他要是看见你的房间会怎么说？」"

    # game/script.rpy:52565
    old "Huh? I'll clean it! I promise!"
    new "「咦？我会收拾干净的！我保证！」"

    # game/script.rpy:52566
    old "You always say that. It stays clean for three days, and then you forget about your promise."
    new "「你每次都这么说。干净三天，然后就把保证忘到脑后了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52571
    old "Not this time! You'll never remind me again!"
    new "「这次不一样！以后你再也不用提醒我了！」"

    # game/script.rpy:52574
    old "Sweetie, you know how much work being in charge of you is, right? Do you really want to put that on him?"
    new "「宝贝，你知不知道照顾你有多费心？你真想把这份担子推给他？」"

    # game/script.rpy:52575
    old "I-I'm not that bad!"
    new "「我、我才没那么糟！」"

    # game/script.rpy:52581
    old "...It sounded like it was Akaro's time to chime in, but he kept quiet, looking somewhere else."
    new "……这种时候本该轮到 Akaro 接话了，他却一声不吭，视线飘向别处。"

    # game/script.rpy:52585
    old "His lack of input abruptly ended that topic, so Isla stood up. Instead of returning to the cabinet with the Sekimeiya, she continued romping around the room."
    new "他不接话，话题就此断了，Isla 便站了起来。她没有回到放着 Sekimeiya 的展示柜旁，而是继续在房里跑来跑去。"

    # game/script.rpy:52589
    old "It took a while, but eventually, she calmed down and sat a bit away."
    new "过了好一阵，她才安静下来，在稍远的地方坐下。"

    # game/script.rpy:52591
    old "...Time passed, and everyone kept to themselves. Sai still leaned against the door, looking nowhere but the floor. It probably hadn't been long enough for the others to get to know his personality and why the way he was acting was unusual."
    new "……时间一点点过去，大家都各待各的。Sai 依旧倚着门，目光只落在脚下的地板上。其他人跟他相处的时间大概还不够长，既摸不清他的性子，也看不出他这副样子有多反常。"

    # game/script.rpy:52592
    old "I realized I no longer had the pendant I'd worn on the 15th. It didn't seem like anyone had noticed, but I would have no excuse if someone did."
    new "我这才意识到，自己15号戴的那条吊坠不见了。似乎没人注意到，可一旦有人问起，我找不出任何说辞。"

    # game/script.rpy:52602
    old "...So Naomi hasn't shown up.{w} Did she not say anything when she locked herself inside the top floor?"
    new "「……Naomi 还是没露面。{w} 她把自己关在顶层的时候，什么都没说吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:52603
    old "Finally, Akaro spoke again. His voice was quiet, and the steely look in his eyes from before we'd entered the room was completely gone."
    new "Akaro 终于又开口了。他的声音很轻，进这间屋子之前眼里那股冷硬的神色已经荡然无存。"

    # game/script.rpy:52604
    old "No, she didn't... I don't know what got into her, but I assume she wanted to do whatever she did to the elevator.{w} I guess while we're here, there's nothing she can do anymore."
    new "「没有，她什么都没说……我不知道她是怎么了，不过我猜，她大概想照对电梯那样再来一遍。{w} 既然我们待在这儿，她应该也翻不出什么花样了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52609
    old "I understand."
    new "「我明白了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52616
    old "Out of curiosity, are you the girl who fell into a coma two weeks ago? I think I saw your name on the news."
    new "「顺便问一句，你就是两周前陷入昏迷的那个女孩吧？我好像在新闻上看到过你的名字。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52617
    old "Uh, y-yes. ...That was me."
    new "「呃，是、是的。……就是我。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52618
    old "Although he was speaking quietly, Atsuki heard that too and looked at Akaro curiously."
    new "尽管他压低了声音，我也听见了，好奇地看向 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:52619
    old "Damn, that must've been a scare. It's good to see you're all right now."
    new "「天哪，那一定吓坏了吧。看到你现在没事，我就放心了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52627
    old "There was an explosion close to here, right? Didn't someone die, and {tip=gan}a person{/tip} was sent to the hospital?"
    new "「这附近发生过一场爆炸，对吧？好像有人死了，还有{tip=gan}一个人{/tip}被送进了医院？」"

    # game/script.rpy:52628
    old "Y-Yes... A friend of ours died. Two people were hospitalized."
    new "「是、是的……我们的一个朋友死了，两个人住了院。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52633
    old "...Oh.{w} I'm very sorry.{w} I can't imagine what that would be like at your age. I thought earlier that something about you two looked off. I'm really sorry for bringing it up."
    new "「……哦。{w} 实在抱歉。{w} 你们这个年纪经历这种事，我实在想象不出有多难受。刚才我就觉得你们俩有点不对劲。真不该提这事，对不起。」"

    # game/script.rpy:52635
    old "It's all right. Don't worry about it."
    new "没关系，别放在心上。"

    # game/script.rpy:52636
    old "Atsuki said what I'd been about to.{w} Then, Akaro gave us a look of pity. I could only wonder why he'd said any of that."
    new "我正要开口，Atsuki 却先说了出来。{w}随后，Akaro 投来怜悯的目光。我实在不明白他为什么要说那些话。"

    # game/script.rpy:52642
    old "I did lose someone very close to me a long time ago too. I don't imagine this is something you want to hear from a person you don't know, but all I wish now is that I hadn't thought that much about it.{w} At the time, I thought I'd be disrespecting the dead if I tried to get over it, but that nearly ate me alive.{w} I guess you're already doing much better than me if you're here. Thinking too hard about these things when they just happened can be pure torture."
    new "我很久以前也失去过一个很亲近的人。我知道这话从一个素不相识的人嘴里说出来，你们可能不爱听，但我现在只希望自己当初没有想那么多。{w}当时我觉得，如果试着放下，就是对死者的不敬，可那种想法差点把我整个人吞掉。{w}你们现在能来到这里，已经比我强多了。事情刚发生时想太多，纯粹是折磨。"

    # game/script.rpy:52647
    old "The worst part is trying to convince yourself that there's some meaning in it. Sometimes, bad things just happen because they happen, and that's all there is to it. I wanted to believe there was a greater plan, but..."
    new "最难受的是，你硬要说服自己这一切总归有意义。有些坏事发生了就是发生了，仅此而已。我也曾想相信冥冥之中自有安排，可是……"

    # game/script.rpy:52652
    old "Anyway, the important thing is that you're both still alive. Finding any meaning in that is up to you. Just living and moving past it is enough."
    new "总之，要紧的是你们两人都还活着。至于能否从中找到什么意义，那要看你们自己。只要活下去，跨过这一关，就够了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52656
    old "...I agree. That's why we came here."
    new "……我同意。我们正是为此才来这里的。"

    # game/script.rpy:52657
    old "Atsuki spoke where I couldn't. Akaro being supportive was something I hadn't expected in the slightest, especially given that I was sure he'd killed me."
    new "我说不出口的话，Atsuki 替我说了。我万万没想到 Akaro 会这样宽慰我们——尤其在我确信他曾杀过我之后。"

    # game/script.rpy:52658
    old "I know people can't choose a way to react, and I shouldn't be giving any advice. ...It's much easier said than done, but if you can, don't regret anything that you did."
    new "我知道人没法选择怎么反应，也轮不到我来提什么建议。……说来容易做来难，但只要做得到，就别为自己做过的任何事后悔。"

    # game/script.rpy:52674
    old "Atsuki looked at me with sorrowful eyes. When I nodded, he went back to staring at his lap."
    new "Atsuki 用悲伤的眼神望着我。我点了点头，他便重新低下头，盯着自己的膝盖。"

    # game/script.rpy:52675
    old "...And you? I'm sorry, we shouldn't have come."
    new "……你呢？抱歉，我们本不该来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:52676
    old "Don't be. I'm still glad we're here, and don't worry about me. I'm fine."
    new "别道歉。我还是庆幸我们来了。别担心我，我没事。"

    # game/script.rpy:52678
    old "I smiled, but he didn't look up again."
    new "我笑了笑，他却再没抬起头。"

    # game/script.rpy:52683
    old "Isla had finished her most recent survey of the cabinets and was sitting in the middle of the room. I looked at the ceiling, where the camera was, and noticed that no green light flickered below the lens."
    new "Isla 刚又检查了一遍展示柜，正坐在房间中央。我抬头看向天花板上的摄像头，发现镜头下方没有绿灯闪烁。"

    # game/script.rpy:52693
    old "I saw Sai looking at his wristwatch."
    new "我看见 Sai 在看手表。"

    # game/script.rpy:52698
    old "How long have we been trapped for?"
    new "我们被困了多久了？"

    # game/script.rpy:52699
    old "Uh... almost two hours. It's {time=11.}"
    new "呃……快两个小时了。现在是 {time=11.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:52704
    old "Two hours...? How much longer do we have to be here? This is getting ridiculous."
    new "两个小时……？我们还得在这儿待多久？这也太离谱了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52705
    old "It's really strange. I wonder if they're having issues opening the shutter."
    new "真奇怪。会不会是他们那边打不开卷帘门？"

    # game/script.rpy:52706
    old "In any case, it has to unlock at any moment."
    new "不管怎样，门随时都可能开。"

    # game/script.rpy:52713
    old "...If only we had waited like that the first time. Nobody knew about the Sekimeiya's powers. That was likely why the time had been passing so smoothly."
    new "……要是第一次我们也这样等下去就好了。那时没人知道 Sekimeiya 的力量，或许正因如此，那段时间才过得如此平静。"

    # game/script.rpy:52718
    old "Of course, nobody but Akaro. The way he had held it hadn't been a coincidence. ...I didn't know why, but aware of its powers, his intention was to keep us shut in a room while the Sekimeiya was with us.{w} Did he know about the twelve hour limit? ...Or was the reason tied to the other Sekimeiya that I'd seen? I still potentially had one hidden in the attic."
    new "当然，除了 Akaro。他握着它的方式绝非偶然。……我不知道原因，但他既然知道它的力量，那他的意图就是趁 Sekimeiya 还在我们这里时，把我们关在房间里。{w}他知道十二小时的时限吗？……还是说，原因与我见到的另一个 Sekimeiya 有关？阁楼里我可能还藏着一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:52719
    old "He was the killer who'd hidden his victims' bodies. He had conjured the illusion that Naomi was still alive thanks to the Sekimeiya.{w} ...Next to me, he hadn't opened his mouth again. He knew that I was lying and must've seen me as a threat, but his brief conversation with us had left me dazed."
    new "他就是那个藏匿受害者尸体的凶手。他借 Sekimeiya 之力，制造出 Naomi 还活着的假象。{w}……坐在我身旁的他再没开过口。他知道我在撒谎，一定也把我视作威胁，可他方才那几句简短的交谈，却让我心神恍惚。"

    # game/script.rpy:52724
    old "Everyone was quiet. For a long time, all we heard was Isla fidgeting with her sunglasses and sporadic sighs."
    new "所有人都沉默着。很长一段时间里，耳边只有 Isla 摆弄墨镜的细响，和时不时的叹息。"

    # game/script.rpy:52725
    old "I tried to keep excess thoughts to a minimum. I couldn't understand the strange world I'd suddenly been sent to, so to stave off exhaustion, my mind had remained empty for a while."
    new "我尽量不让多余的念头冒出来。我搞不懂自己怎么突然被丢进这个陌生的世界，为了不让自己累垮，我索性让脑子空了一阵子。"

    # game/script.rpy:52730
    old "...It's {time=13.}"
    new "……现在是 {time=13.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:52731
    old "Sai read the time out loud every half hour. Rather than comforting us, it made things drag on. I'd gotten pretty tired again just by sitting down for so long."
    new "Sai 每半小时就报一次时间。这非但没让人安心，反倒使等待更加漫长。光是坐这么久，我就又累得不行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52737
    old "After a while, Sai spoke again."
    new "过了一会儿，Sai 又开口了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52742
    old "*sigh*{w}{w=0.7} ...I'm going to the bathroom."
    new "唉……{w}{w=0.7}我去趟洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:52745
    old "Everyone watched him stand up, but the silence remained as he left the room. We'd been sitting for a long time, so it wasn't reasonable to stop him."
    new "所有人都看着他起身，可他离开房间后，沉默依旧。我们已经坐了那么久，拦着他也没有道理。"

    # game/script.rpy:52750
    old "Sai had been practically parked in front of the door, but the atmosphere hadn't changed with him gone. The concern began when a few minutes passed without him returning."
    new "Sai 几乎一直守在门口，但他走后，气氛也没有变化。几分钟过去，他仍没回来，不安这才开始蔓延。"

    # game/script.rpy:52751
    old "I'd immediately considered the possibility that he had an ulterior motive, but everyone else took longer to reach that conclusion."
    new "我立刻想到他可能另有目的，其他人却过了好一阵才想到这一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:52758
    old "...Where exactly did Sai go?"
    new "……Sai 到底去哪儿了？"

    # game/script.rpy:52759
    old "Do you think he was lying? It's been a long time since he left."
    new "你觉得他是在骗我们？他走了好久了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52760
    old "Don't think about him. If he doesn't want to come back, it's not our problem."
    new "别管他。他自己不想回来，那就不关我们的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:52762
    old "Could Akaro and Sai have been working together? What the hell were they doing, then...?"
    new "Akaro 和 Sai 会不会是一伙的？那他们到底在做什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:52768
    old "What if something happened to him?"
    new "万一他出了什么事呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:52769
    old "Don't be ridiculous. Do you think Naomi attacked him? We would've heard that."
    new "别胡思乱想。你觉得是 Naomi 袭击了他？那动静我们不可能听不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:52771
    old "I don't trust him. I think he might be trying to make us search for him so that we leave the room."
    new "我不信他。我看他是想引我们去找他，好让我们离开这个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:52772
    old "...Really? I don't think that makes much sense."
    new "……是吗？我觉得这说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:52773
    old "Forget about him. No matter why he left, staying here is the right call."
    new "别管他了。不管他为什么离开，留在这里才是正确的选择。"

    # game/script.rpy:52782
    old "It eventually became clear Sai wasn't coming back. He'd left with our only method to measure the time, but it felt like almost half an hour had passed."
    new "时间一久，谁都明白 Sai 不会回来了。他带走了我们唯一能计时的手段，可感觉上已经过了将近半小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:52788
    old "Seriously, what the fuck is happening? It's been hours."
    new "说真的，这他妈到底是怎么回事？都过去好几个小时了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52790
    old "Nobody responded."
    new "没有人应声。"

    # game/script.rpy:52791
    old "Still next to me, Atsuki and Akaro patiently waited. On the floor lay a tired Isla, while Erina's face showed the most worry."
    new "Atsuki 和 Akaro 仍守在我身旁，耐心地等着。疲惫的 Isla 坐在地上，而 Erina 脸上的担忧最为明显。"

    # game/script.rpy:52797
    old "Simultaneously, Atsuki and I looked at the ceiling."
    new "我和 Atsuki 同时抬头看向天花板。"

    # game/script.rpy:52798
    old "...Did you hear something?"
    new "……你们听见什么了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:52800
    old "...What are you talking about?"
    new "……你们在说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:52801
    old "It sounded like someone just walked above us. And did you not hear sounds coming from the crystal floor a few minutes ago?"
    new "刚才好像有人在咱们头顶上走。还有，几分钟前水晶层那边传来的声音，你没听见？"

    # game/script.rpy:52802
    old "What? I didn't hear that."
    new "什么？我没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:52803
    old "Erina hadn't noticed anything either."
    new "Erina 也什么都没察觉到。"

    # game/script.rpy:52808
    old "Everyone was on alert, but the sound had been very brief, immediately engulfed by the silence again."
    new "所有人都警觉起来，可那声音极短，转瞬又被寂静吞没。"

    # game/script.rpy:52812
    old "However, just a few minutes later, it repeated."
    new "然而只过了几分钟，那声音又响了一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:52815
    old "Th-There! Did you hear it?"
    new "就、就是现在！听见没有？"

    # game/script.rpy:52818
    old "We all nodded that time."
    new "这一次，我们都点了头。"

    # game/script.rpy:52819
    old "Someone's on the second floor."
    new "有人在二楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:52820
    old "Didn't it sound like more than one person?"
    new "听起来不像只有一个人吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:52821
    old "...More than one?"
    new "……不止一个？"

    # game/script.rpy:52822
    old "My mind jumped to the other Atsuki. ...Was he still there?{w} We listened with rapt attention, but there was nothing else to hear."
    new "我脑中立刻闪过另一个 Atsuki。……他还在那里吗？{w} 我们屏息凝神地听着，却再没听到别的动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:52824
    old "It took less time to repeat than before, and when it did, we were sure more than one person was outside our room."
    new "这次间隔比之前更短，等声音再响起时，我们已能确定，门外不止一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:52830
    old "It's Sai and Naomi. ...What the fuck are they doing?"
    new "是 Sai 和 Naomi。……他们到底在搞什么鬼？"

    # game/script.rpy:52835
    old "Erina grimaced at his language but opted not to reprimand him."
    new "Erina 听到这粗话皱了皱眉，却没有开口责备他。"

    # game/script.rpy:52836
    old "It has to be them. There's no way we missed anyone."
    new "只能是他俩。我们不可能漏掉什么人。"

    # game/script.rpy:52837
    old "Don't think about leaving. Whatever they're doing won't matter as long as we're here.{w} It's not our business either. They're the ones who could be committing a crime."
    new "别想着出去。不管他们在做什么，只要我们还待在这里，他们做什么都没用。{w} 这事也不关我们的事。真要有人犯法，也是他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:52844
    old "We didn't move, but during the following minutes, the same faint sound of footsteps was heard two more times."
    new "我们没有动，可接下来的几分钟里，同样轻微的脚步声又响了两次。"

    # game/script.rpy:52845
    old "Whoever they were, they'd been moving through the building. At one point, it seemed as if a sound came from the crystal floor itself, but I didn't mention that."
    new "不管那是谁，他们一直在楼里走动。有一次，那声音似乎就来自水晶层，但我没有说出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:52846
    old "...Who was there? Akaro had reiterated that Naomi and Sai were trying to lure us out, but my curiosity went beyond that."
    new "……那边到底是谁？Akaro 反复说 Naomi 和 Sai 是想引我们出去，可我的好奇不止于此。"

    # game/script.rpy:52847
    old "Unmistakably, more than one person was moving around. However, Naomi couldn't have been included. I knew she was dead."
    new "毫无疑问，来回走动的绝不止一个人。但其中不可能有 Naomi。我知道她已经死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52848
    old "Then who was the other person? With everything seemingly unchanging, my need to know had only grown larger. Could it have been Atsuki? I didn't think so. Had Katei been there the whole time? I didn't think so either.{w} ...Was it someone who'd traveled through time?"
    new "那么另一个人是谁？周围的一切看起来毫无变化，我想知道答案的念头反而越来越强。会是 Atsuki 吗？我觉得不像。Katei 会不会一直就在那里？我也不这么认为。{w} ……难道是某个穿越时间而来的人？"

    # game/script.rpy:52852
    old "Whoever it was, they hadn't been heard in a while."
    new "不管那人是谁，已经有一阵子没听到动静了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52857
    old "...What time is it now? Are we going to be here all day?"
    new "……现在几点了？我们要在这里耗上一整天吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:52859
    old "It was getting unbearable even for me, who knew when the supposed end was."
    new "连我这个知道所谓终点何时到来的人，也快要撑不住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52866
    old "Erina walked a few steps. I thought she only wanted to stretch her body again, but that wasn't it."
    new "Erina 走了几步。我以为她只是想再活动一下身体，但并不是。"

    # game/script.rpy:52874
    old "...I have to go to the bathroom.{w} Do you need to go too, Isla?"
    new "……我得去趟洗手间。{w} Isla，你也要去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:52880
    old "She shook her head.{w} At the same time, the rest of us looked on with skepticism after what had happened with Sai."
    new "她摇了摇头。{w}与此同时，因为 Sai 之前的事，我们其余人也都带着怀疑看着她。"

    # game/script.rpy:52885
    old "Don't worry, it shouldn't matter if only one of us leaves. I doubt I'll come across Sai or Naomi, but I'll be right back."
    new "别担心，只出去一个人应该没关系。我想我不会碰上 Sai 或 Naomi，很快就回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:52899
    old "...But she wasn't.{w} After a little while, we realized the same thing had occurred."
    new "……可她并没有回来。{w} 过了一会儿，我们意识到同样的事又发生了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52900
    old "And since she'd left, the sporadic sounds had returned. Someone had walked above us and on the crystal floor, but all of those noises were faint."
    new "而且自从她离开，零星的响声又回来了。有人在我们头顶走过，也有人在水晶层走动，但那些声音都很轻。"

    # game/script.rpy:52905
    old "Eventually, even Isla began to look concerned, quietly staring at the empty door."
    new "到最后，连 Isla 也露出了不安的神色，静静地盯着空无一人的门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:52910
    old "When Sai didn't come back, it was natural to assume it was his choice. The case wasn't the same with Erina."
    new "Sai 没有回来，自然可以认为那是他自己的选择。Erina 就不一样了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52911
    old "Someone was there—someone who shouldn't have been there. Had they prevented both people from coming back to us...?"
    new "那里有人——一个本不该在那里的人。难道是那人让两个人都回不来……？"

    # game/script.rpy:52912
    old "I couldn't take it anymore. Once again, the sounds had momentarily stopped, but I had to know who else was in the building. As I was convinced Akaro had been my killer, I didn't fear leaving the room anymore."
    new "我再也忍不下去了。响声又一次暂时停了，可我必须知道楼里还有谁。既然我认定杀我的人是 Akaro，那离开这个房间也没什么好怕的了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52918
    old "I'll go too."
    new "我也去。"

    # game/script.rpy:52923
    old "H-Huh?"
    new "诶、诶？"

    # game/script.rpy:52924
    old "I'll come back, though. Sorry, we've been here for too long."
    new "不过我会回来的。抱歉，我们在这里待得太久了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52929
    old "Before he could object, I walked to the door. I didn't exactly want to leave Atsuki behind, but I had no choice.{w} I hadn't missed Akaro's sudden frown, but he kept his mouth shut as I passed by Isla."
    new "没等他出言反对，我已经走向门口。我并不想丢下 Atsuki，但别无选择。{w}Akaro 骤然皱眉，这我没有漏看；可我从 Isla 身旁经过时，他始终没有开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:52937
    old "I looked both ways. Nothing about the hallway appeared immediately odd, but the darkness was imposing."
    new "我左右张望。走廊乍看之下并无异样，可那片黑暗却给人一种压迫感。"

    # game/script.rpy:52941
    old "The lobby door was open. Drawn to it, I tried not to make a sound."
    new "大堂的门开着。我像被它引着一般走过去，尽量不发出声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:52953
    old "What the hell!?"
    new "这到底是怎么回事！？"

    # game/script.rpy:52954
    old "Both bodies were there, near the hallway A door. Like before, my own looked at the ceiling with empty eyes, while drops of blood had stained the floor beneath Naomi's head.{w} In addition, all the ceiling lights were on, even the ones that the alarm had disabled and weren't working in the morning."
    new "两具尸体都在，就在 A走廊门口附近。和先前一样，我自己的那具尸体睁着空洞的双眼望着天花板，Naomi 头下的地板则被滴落的血染红了。{w}此外，天花板上的灯全亮着，连早晨因警报而失效、本该不亮的那些也亮了。"

    # game/script.rpy:52958
    old "I knew Sai had once tried to kill us, but those bodies couldn't have been his doing alone. Recalling the faint sounds I'd heard from inside the room, I slowly stepped to the other door."
    new "我知道 Sai 曾经想杀我们，但那两具尸体不可能都是他一人下的手。回想起刚才从房间里隐约听到的声响，我慢慢朝另一扇门走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:52959
    old "The bodies had been moved to the lobby, and there was no way the other Atsuki would've done that. Unable to look at them up close, I hurried out."
    new "尸体已经被搬到了大堂，另一个 Atsuki 绝不可能这么做。我无法凑近去看那两具尸体，只能匆匆离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:52967
    old "No way."
    new "不可能……"

    # game/script.rpy:52970
    old "Someone was far ahead, next to the staircase.{w} A pool of blood extended around a third fallen body, lying in the illuminated zone."
    new "前方远处有个人影，就在楼梯旁。{w}第三具尸体倒在灯光照亮的区域，身下漫开一摊血。"

    # game/script.rpy:52978
    old "Erina. What's happening...!?"
    new "Erina……到底发生什么了……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:52979
    old "My heart dropped like a stone. I looked away from her body, but I had to fight back tears."
    new "我的心猛地沉了下去。我移开视线，不忍再看她的尸体，却还是得强忍住眼泪。"

    # game/script.rpy:52980
    old "Had the killer been outside all along?{w} It was too overwhelming—I couldn't bear it anymore. But the next thing I heard was footsteps from hallway B, causing my heart to drop even further."
    new "难道凶手一直就在外面？{w}这一切太沉重，我再也承受不住。可紧接着，B走廊传来的脚步声让我的心又往下沉了一截。"

    # game/script.rpy:52989
    old "I ran as fast as I could, but I was too late. All I saw was Atsuki's figure disappearing into the lobby."
    new "我拼命跑去，却还是晚了一步。只看见 Atsuki 的身影消失在大堂里。"

    # game/script.rpy:52993
    old "I clenched my fists, desperately thinking about what to do. He had already seen both bodies, but there'd been no audible reaction."
    new "我攥紧拳头，拼命想着该怎么办。他已经看见了那两具尸体，却一点动静也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:52994
    old "Suddenly, someone else came out of the crystal room. Before I hid myself behind the wall, I was able to see Akaro."
    new "忽然，又有人从水晶展室出来。我赶在躲到墙后之前，看清了那是 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:52998
    old "What now...!? Do I have to hide again?"
    new "现在又怎么了……！？我还得再躲一次吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:52999
    old "Everything had gone down the drain so fast. I felt unable to move, as if my racing heart was using all my energy."
    new "一切转眼间全都完了。我连动都动不了，仿佛狂跳的心脏已经抽干了我全部力气。"

    # game/script.rpy:53000
    old "...Hey! Where the fuck are all of you!?"
    new "……喂！你们他妈都死哪去了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:53009
    old "I looked at the hallway again."
    new "我又朝走廊看去。"

    # game/script.rpy:53010
    old "As soon as I did, I saw Akaro coming out of the event room."
    new "这一看，正好看见 Akaro 从活动室里出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:53014
    old "Then, he began to get closer."
    new "接着，他开始朝这边靠近。"

    # game/script.rpy:53015
    old "He might notice me if I try to leave."
    new "我要是现在出去，说不定会被他看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:53022
    old "Did he enter... the staff room?"
    new "他进了……员工室？"

    # game/script.rpy:53023
    old "I'd heard Akaro's short steps and then a door closing."
    new "我听见 Akaro 短促的脚步声，随后是一道门关上的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:53024
    old "...But before I could think about it, I realized Atsuki was in hallway A, slowly approaching Erina."
    new "……可还没等我细想，就发现 Atsuki 正在 A走廊里，慢慢朝 Erina 走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:53028
    old "I had nowhere to hide. As a last-ditch effort, I darted to the bathrooms, which I could see were empty."
    new "我无处可藏。走投无路之下，我冲进洗手间——我能看见里面空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:53035
    old "I slowly closed the door of the women's and locked it with the inner latch."
    new "我慢慢关上女洗手间的门，用内侧的插销锁好。"

    # game/script.rpy:53036
    old "I can stay here. Katei was the one who had the key."
    new "我可以待在这里。钥匙在 Katei 手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:53037
    old "Soon after I heard Atsuki's steps reach Erina's body, they ran up the stairs."
    new "没过多久，我听见 Atsuki 的脚步声来到 Erina 的尸体旁，随即又跑上了楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:53038
    old "What is he doing? Does he want to find whoever else is in the building?"
    new "他在干什么？是想找出楼里其余还活着的人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53039
    old "From Atsuki's point of view, only Sai or an extra person could've killed the three of them. My body wore different clothes, but there was no way he'd care about that while unaware of what the Sekimeiya could do."
    new "在 Atsuki 看来，能杀死那三个人的，只可能是 Sai 或某个多出来的人。我的尸体穿着不同的衣服，可他既然不知道 Sekimeiya 能做什么，就不可能去在意这种事。"

    # game/script.rpy:53040
    old "I hated thinking about it. He'd found me dead, and I couldn't even imagine what I would've felt in his place."
    new "我不愿去想这件事。他看见我死了，我甚至无法想象，若换成我，会是什么感受。"

    # game/script.rpy:53041
    old "Once his steps had disappeared, I continued to pay attention so that I could hear what was happening in hallway B."
    new "等他的脚步声消失后，我仍留心听着，想弄清 B走廊里有什么动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:53046
    old "But nothing did. Since Akaro had shut himself in a room, I'd heard no new movement."
    new "可什么也没发生。自 Akaro 把自己关进房间后，我就再没听到新的动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:53048
    old "Is he still there? ...What about Isla?"
    new "他还在那儿吗？……Isla 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:53050
    old "Could the door have been preventing the sound from reaching me?{w} No. I'd heard Atsuki going up the stairs."
    new "难道是门挡住了声音，才传不到我耳中？{w}不，我连 Atsuki 上楼的声音都听见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53051
    old "...And why did he only call for us once? He immediately went quiet."
    new "……再说，他怎么只喊了我们一次？喊完就立刻没了声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:53053
    old "I didn't know where Akaro was, but the time when Atsuki had seen the me in different clothing was slowly approaching. I just had to wait a bit more to see whether my hopes had been in vain."
    new "我不知道 Akaro 在哪里，但 Atsuki 见到穿着另一身衣服的我的那一刻，正慢慢逼近。我只需再等一会儿，就能知道自己的希望有没有落空。"

    # game/script.rpy:53057
    old "How's this possible? Where did everyone go?"
    new "这怎么可能？人都去哪儿了？"

    # game/script.rpy:53058
    old "I'd been in the bathroom for several minutes, but the impossible silence hadn't ceased. We'd heard sounds from the crystal room. Someone had to be there. ...Why was everything so quiet, then?"
    new "我在洗手间里待了好几分钟，那份反常的死寂却始终没有消散。我们明明听到水晶展室传来声响，那里一定有人。……可为什么四周这么安静？"

    # game/script.rpy:53060
    old "...Should I go to the storeroom?"
    new "……我该去储藏室看看吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53062
    old "I unlocked the door. I had the chance to go back there, so I slowly opened the way out."
    new "我拧开门锁。既然有机会回到那里，我便缓缓推开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:53073
    old "Is there really nobody here?"
    new "这里真的一个人都没有？"

    # game/script.rpy:53074
    old "The silence persisted once I stepped out. I'd wanted to run straight to the storeroom, but I noticed that all the doors in hallway B were closed."
    new "走出门外，寂静依然。我本想直奔储藏室，却发现 B走廊的每一扇门都关着。"

    # game/script.rpy:53075
    old "What about Isla? She can't see Erina's body."
    new "Isla 怎么办？不能让她看到 Erina 的尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:53085
    old "I approached room B4 as soon as a thought came to mind."
    new "我刚冒出这个念头，便走向 B4房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:53089
    old "After a deep breath, I twisted the doorknob."
    new "深吸一口气，我拧动了门把手。"

    # game/script.rpy:53095
    old "Undertow"
    new "暗流"

    # game/script.rpy:53097
    old "She's not here.{w} Oh... I was right."
    new "她不在这里。{w} 哦……我猜对了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53101
    old "The cabinet where the Sekimeiya had been was open. I stepped up to it and glanced inside."
    new "原本放着 Sekimeiya 的展示柜敞开着。我走上前，朝里面看了一眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:53103
    old "The Sekimeiya was still there, and its color was white. After staring at it for a while, I reached inside and took it out, protected by my long sleeves."
    new "Sekimeiya 还在里面，通体白色。我盯着它看了一会儿，才隔着长袖伸进去把它拿了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:53107
    old "It's cold.{w} ...They must've traveled, though. That's why the sounds stopped."
    new "好冰。{w} ……不过，他们一定是穿越走了，所以声音才停下。"

    # game/script.rpy:53108
    old "...But where were they? I was clueless.{w} Why had the Sekimeiya been touched, and why had it allowed someone to travel? The temperature in the cabinet was frigid."
    new "……可他们去了哪里？我毫无头绪。{w} Sekimeiya 为什么会被人碰过，又为什么会让人穿越？展示柜里冷得刺骨。"

    # game/script.rpy:53113
    old "I walked to the hallway and then to the staff room."
    new "我走到走廊，又去了员工室。"

    # game/script.rpy:53117
    old "Holding the Sekimeiya with one hand, I opened the door."
    new "我一只手拿着 Sekimeiya，推开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:53123
    old "He's not here. I'm pretty sure this is where he went."
    new "他不在这里。我很确定他来了这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:53124
    old "I... should bring the Sekimeiya to the storeroom."
    new "我……得把 Sekimeiya 带去储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:53128
    old "Without thinking twice, I ran to hallway A."
    new "我想都没想，便朝 A走廊跑去。"

    # game/script.rpy:53132
    old "I looked both ways to confirm that nobody was there and gripped the doorknob."
    new "我左右张望，确认四下无人，才握住门把手。"

    # game/script.rpy:53136
    old "My jaw dropped, and I stared at the lobby. Its door had been left open."
    new "我目瞪口呆，怔怔地望着大厅。大厅的门竟然敞开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:53140
    old "Were my eyes betraying me? As I got closer, I knew that I hadn't imagined it."
    new "是我看错了吗？走近之后，我才明白那不是错觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:53149
    old "Where's Naomi...?"
    new "Naomi 呢……？"

    # game/script.rpy:53152
    old "Only my own corpse remained on the floor. Although the red pool of Naomi's blood was still next to it, the body it belonged to wasn't there."
    new "地板上只剩我自己的尸体。旁边 Naomi 的那摊血还在，可血的主人却不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53153
    old "The sensation that had once faded came back, reminding me of where I was. Inexplicable mysteries were bound to occur on December 15th."
    new "曾经淡去的感觉又回来了，提醒我此刻身在何处。12月15日，注定会有无法解释的怪事发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:53156
    old "I turned around; trying to think it through was useless. Even though I didn't know what I was waiting for, it was clear anything could happen, so going back to my own world wasn't far-fetched."
    new "我转过身。再怎么想也无济于事。虽然不知道自己还在等什么，但既然什么都可能发生，回到自己的世界也不足为奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:53160
    old "I entered the hidden part of the storeroom and dropped the Sekimeiya on the floor. Glowing in the darkness, its temperature was noticeably higher than after I'd taken it out of the cabinet."
    new "我走进储藏室里隐蔽的那一侧，把 Sekimeiya 放在地上。它在黑暗中发着光，温度明显比我刚从展示柜里取出时更高。"

    # game/script.rpy:53166
    old "When I least expected it, a crucial piece of the puzzle fell into place."
    new "偏偏在我最没想到的时候，最关键的一块拼图归位了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53167
    old "Wait, of course...! How did I not realize this earlier?"
    new "等等，原来如此……！我怎么早没想到？"

    # game/script.rpy:53175
    old "I left the storeroom. If what had been in the lobby was a pool, near the staircase, Erina's body lay on a sea of blood.{w} ...That Erina, below the broken elevator... We had never spoken to her. That was because she had died."
    new "我离开储藏室。如果说大厅里的只是一小摊，那么楼梯附近，Erina 的尸体就躺在一片血海之中。{w} ……那个倒在损坏的电梯下方的 Erina……我们始终没能和她说上话。因为她早已死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53176
    old "...Did it make any sense? My idea was muddled, but I was sure it was on the right track."
    new "……这说得通吗？我的思路还很混乱，但我确信方向没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:53180
    old "I had to make sure of something. ...I had to make sure Akaro and Isla weren't anywhere."
    new "我必须确认一件事。……必须确认 Akaro 和 Isla 哪儿都不在。"

    # game/script.rpy:53185
    old "Even though an immense amount of things didn't add up, I thought I'd found one of the keys. As I bolted up the stairs, details reinforced that thought."
    new "尽管还有太多事情对不上，我仍觉得自己找到了其中一把钥匙。我飞奔上楼，一个个细节也印证着这个念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:53186
    old "It's gotta be later than {time=15.} That fits perfectly.{w} And... the drop of blood that Atsuki and I saw in the lobby... It was exactly where Naomi's body left it before vanishing."
    new "现在肯定已经过了 {time=15.}。这样就全对上了。{w} 还有……我和 Atsuki 在大厅看到的那滴血……它的位置，正是 Naomi 的尸体消失前留下它的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:53196
    old "When I reached the offices, I stopped myself abruptly. There was something on the floor."
    new "到了办公区，我猛地停住脚步。地板上有什么东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:53197
    old "Another Sekimeiya...?{w} Could this be the one I hid?"
    new "另一个 Sekimeiya……？{w} 难道是我藏起来的那个？"

    # game/script.rpy:53201
    old "I hovered my hand over it. An aura of heat surrounded it, so it was functional as well."
    new "我把手悬在它上方。一股热气环绕着它，看来它同样还能用。"

    # game/script.rpy:53202
    old "When I picked it up, I felt that it was even hotter than I'd thought. Thanks to the thick clothes from the attic, I was able to bring it with me."
    new "拿起来才发现，它比我以为的还要烫。多亏从阁楼拿的厚衣服，我才能把它带上。"

    # game/script.rpy:53206
    old "...Did Atsuki see it? This had to be here for a while."
    new "……Atsuki 看到了吗？这东西应该已经在这儿放了很久。"

    # game/script.rpy:53214
    old "Running up the floors, I saw that every elevator panel had been taken off. Had Akaro been responsible for that? I had no clue anymore."
    new "我一路往上跑，发现每层电梯的操作面板都被拆了下来。是 Akaro 干的吗？我已经毫无头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:53218
    old "Eventually, I reached the attic's door. Every floor had been vacant, but the attic couldn't be."
    new "我终于来到阁楼门前。每一层都空无一人，可阁楼不可能是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:53221
    old "It was open, so I could see the narrow staircase ahead.{w} Why? Why wasn't the door locked anymore? Furthermore, the key was inserted in the outer keyhole."
    new "门开着，前方的窄梯一览无余。{w}为什么？门为什么不再上锁了？不仅如此，外侧的锁孔里还插着钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:53227
    old "Many footprints were pressed into the carpet. It didn't make any sense, but I didn't care. I also saw that the suitcase was no longer on the sofa.{w} As soon as I stepped into the living room, I heard a noise coming from one of the bedrooms."
    new "地毯上印着许多脚印。这说不通，可我已经不在乎了。我还发现沙发上的行李箱不见了。{w}刚踏进客厅，我便听见某间卧室里传来响动。"

    # game/script.rpy:53231
    old "I'd hidden the Sekimeiya there hours earlier. When I got closer, I could make out the sound better, and I locked up."
    new "几个小时前，我把 Sekimeiya 藏在了那里。走近之后，声音听得更真切，我顿时僵在原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:53237
    old "Atsuki was crying. I could see his torso on top of the bed, twitching rhythmically."
    new "Atsuki 在哭。我看见他趴在床上，上半身正有节奏地抽动着。"

    # game/script.rpy:53238
    old "He had seen the dead bodies—my own death.{w} I was still alive, though."
    new "他看见了那些尸体——看见了我的死。{w}可我还活着。"

    # game/script.rpy:53239
    old "I recalled what Sai had told us a long time in the past. According to him, the drop of blood in the lobby was mine.{w} He'd been wrong, hadn't he? It was Naomi's.{w} In that case, why had he said that? And why had he been both right and wrong about my fate?"
    new "我想起很久以前 Sai 对我们说过的话。据他所说，大厅里那滴血是我的。{w}他弄错了，不是吗？那是 Naomi 的。{w}既然如此，他为什么要那么说？而对于我的命运，他又为何既说对了，又说错了？"

    # game/script.rpy:53243
    old "I stepped back, careful not to make a sound. Perhaps I was a monster for that, but it was the only thing I could do."
    new "我向后退去，不敢发出一点声音。也许正因如此，我才像个怪物，可我别无他法。"

    # game/script.rpy:53247
    old "Atsuki had learned that the me of his world had died. I wanted to go back to mine, so I couldn't show myself and disappear on him again."
    new "Atsuki 已经知道，他那个世界的我已经死了。我想回到自己的世界，所以我不能现身，再从他眼前消失一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:53252
    old "Aside from Atsuki and me, the whole tower was empty. How could that be, though? Where were Akaro and Isla?"
    new "除了 Atsuki 和我，整座塔空无一人。可这怎么可能？Akaro 和 Isla 到哪儿去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:53257
    old "The answer to that question was one I already knew.{w} They were in my world. They were the proof that going back was possible."
    new "这个问题的答案，我其实早已知道。{w}他们在我那个世界里。他们就是能回去的证明。"

    # game/script.rpy:53258
    old "At the point I was, an Akaro had appeared in the attic. His memories had differed from ours, and there had been a major distinction between us—he didn't know Katei."
    new "在我所在的那个时间点，阁楼里曾出现过一个 Akaro。他的记忆与我们不同，而他跟我们之间有一个关键区别——他不认识 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:53259
    old "It had taken me a while to process it, but everything he said had started to make sense. The events he described were the ones I'd just lived through.{w} He'd sympathized with us, and he'd been surprised to hear we'd found Naomi's body but not that she'd died. After all, he had killed her in the world I was in, hadn't he?"
    new "我花了一阵子才理清，但他说的话渐渐都说得通了。他描述的，正是我刚刚经历过的事。{w}他对我们表示同情；听说我们找到了 Naomi 的尸体，他很吃惊，但听说她已经死了却并不意外。毕竟，在我所在的那个世界里，杀死她的人正是他，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53282
    old "And Isla... What the hell happened to her?{w} At the same time that Akaro appeared, Erina swore she heard Isla just outside the bedroom."
    new "还有 Isla……她到底出了什么事？{w}就在 Akaro 出现的同时，Erina 坚称听见 Isla 就在卧室门外。"

    # game/script.rpy:53288
    old "Then, the last person, Sai... Where was he?"
    new "那么，最后一个人，Sai……他在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:53289
    old "The Sai who chased us with a knife... Who was he?{w} ...The one who left the crystal room a while ago is the one who had the chance to see my body in the lobby. Is that where he made a mistake?"
    new "那个拿着刀追我们的 Sai……他到底是谁？{w}……刚才离开水晶展室的那个人，才有可能在大厅看见我的尸体。他是不是就在那儿搞错了？"

    # game/script.rpy:53295
    old "I went back to the storeroom and moved behind the wall."
    new "我回到储藏室，绕到墙后。"

    # game/script.rpy:53298
    old "After dropping the Sekimeiya, I shifted my focus to the one I'd left there earlier."
    new "放下 Sekimeiya 后，我把注意力转向之前留在这儿的另一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:53299
    old "How did they reach that world? There can only be one answer: with the Sekimeiya."
    new "他们是怎么到达那个世界的？答案只有一个：靠 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:53300
    old "The cabinet was open, so they touched the Sekimeiya. Even Sai could've touched the other one after leaving the room."
    new "展示柜开着，所以他们碰过 Sekimeiya。就算是 Sai，离开房间后也可能碰过另一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:53301
    old "That's what brought them there. It has to be.{w} How did I even get here in the first place? It was by touching the Sekimeiya. ...And why did Atsuki disappear from this world? I'd bet it happened when Naomi touched the Sekimeiya."
    new "就是它把他们送到了那里。一定是这样。{w}那我自己最初又是怎么来到这里的？是因为碰了 Sekimeiya。……还有，Atsuki 为什么会从这个世界上消失？我猜，是在 Naomi 碰 Sekimeiya 的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:53304
    old "So then, why would it send me to another world as opposed to making me travel through time?"
    new "那么，它为什么把我送去另一个世界，而不是让我穿越时间？"

    # game/script.rpy:53305
    old "I didn't know that. It didn't make any sense. However, I could be confident it would work. It had already been proven."
    new "我不知道。这毫无道理。但我确信它会奏效——这一点早已得到证实。"

    # game/script.rpy:53306
    old "After all, Atsuki had seen me on the crystal floor wearing the clothes I was wearing that very second. If I touched the Sekimeiya, I was guaranteed to go back."
    new "毕竟，Atsuki 曾在水晶层看见我，穿着与我此刻一模一样的衣服。只要我碰 Sekimeiya，就必定能回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:53308
    old "I didn't waste any more time. The darkness highlighted two glows, but my hand only approached one. It was the one I believed Akaro and Isla used."
    new "我不再多耽搁。黑暗中有两处微光格外醒目，我的手却只伸向其中一处。我相信那就是 Akaro 和 Isla 用过的。"

    # game/script.rpy:53310
    old "Before I realized it, the glow disappeared in an instant of brief heat."
    new "还没等我反应过来，那点微光便带着短暂的热意消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53311
    old "Did it power off...?"
    new "是断电了吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:53312
    old "I extended my hand more and understood that wasn't the case. ...It hadn't just powered off. The Sekimeiya wasn't there anymore."
    new "我把手再往前探，才知道并非如此。……不只是断电。Sekimeiya 已经不在那里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53316
    old "I tried to find the other one, but I couldn't. The darkness had become absolute yet again, and as I smelled the air, I felt I noticed a difference."
    new "我试着去找另一个，却找不到。四周又陷入彻底的黑暗，我嗅了嗅空气，似乎察觉到了什么不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:53317
    old "Did it work? I didn't teleport."
    new "成功了吗？我没有被传送走。"

    # game/script.rpy:53318
    old "I touched the walls around me. I was still in the storeroom."
    new "我摸了摸四周的墙壁。我仍在储藏室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:53319
    old "Oh!"
    new "啊！"

    # game/script.rpy:53323
    old "I stood up and took off to the door at the end of the corridor. When I hit it, I frantically felt its surface with my hand."
    new "我站起身，冲向走廊尽头的那扇门。一到门前，我就慌忙伸手在门板上摸索。"

    # game/script.rpy:53328
    old "It's not here! The handle's gone!"
    new "不在这里！门把手不见了！"

    # game/script.rpy:53329
    old "I had... made it back. I really had."
    new "我……回来了。我真的回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53335
    old "I dropped to the floor, exhausted and overwhelmed. There were so many things that I didn't understand, but I'd been right about the most important one. I closed my eyes, letting out short breaths until they slowed down."
    new "我瘫坐在地上，筋疲力尽，心绪翻涌。有太多事我仍不明白，但最关键的那一点，我猜对了。我闭上眼，急促的呼吸渐渐平缓下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:53342
    old "Transformative Interference"
    new "转化性干涉"

    # game/script.rpy:53346
    old "What do I want to do now...?"
    new "我现在想做什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:53347
    old "I wasn't safe in the storeroom anymore. The handle was gone, so everyone should have known about the hidden section. It appeared I had two options to choose from."
    new "储藏室已不再安全。门把手没了，那处暗藏的空间想必人人都已知道。看来我只有两条路可选。"

    # game/script.rpy:53348
    old "How did the world function? Even though I'd changed the past, I'd gone back to a reality that I'd long thought erased. Just that fact made me doubt it was possible to alter history."
    new "这个世界究竟是如何运作的？我明明改变了过去，却回到了一个我早已认定被抹消的现实。单是这一点，就让我怀疑历史是否真能被改写。"

    # game/script.rpy:53349
    old "However, I had to think it was possible. I could do it right that moment. If I showed myself, I would change the events I'd experienced. And that was what I had to choose."
    new "可我得相信这是可能的。此刻我就能做到。只要我现身，就能改变我经历过的那些事。这就是我必须做的选择。"

    # game/script.rpy:53350
    old "Whether to change the past or not. ...Did both options make sense?"
    new "要不要改变过去。……这两个选择都说得通吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53353
    old "If I let everything repeat, the current version of myself will travel from the bathroom. That will let me take her place once again. ...I'd have to let Katei die for that."
    new "如果我让一切重演，现在这个我就会从洗手间那边穿越过来。那样我就能再一次取代她。……可为了这个，我就得让 Katei 死去。"

    # game/script.rpy:53354
    old "And still, to do it, I couldn't merely stay put. I had to purposely let Atsuki see me to seal the start and end of the loop."
    new "而且，要做到这一点，我不能只是按兵不动。我必须故意让 Atsuki 看见我，好让这条循环的首尾闭合。"

    # game/script.rpy:53355
    old "...Will that be how it'll work in the end?"
    new "……到头来，一切真会变成那样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53356
    old "If I divert the events from the ones I remember, two versions of me will persist. It might also erase the Atsuki I met this morning, or myself, depending on what the consequences will be..."
    new "如果我让事情的走向偏离记忆中的样子，就会出现两个我。这或许还会抹消今早遇见的那个 Atsuki，也可能抹消我自己——要看后果如何……"

    # game/script.rpy:53360
    old "Like I'd wanted, I had eventually returned to my target world by just waiting. The proper circumstances had aligned to fulfill what had to happen. If I just waited a while longer, I would arrive at the truth of Atsuki seeing me."
    new "如我所愿，我只是等待，最终还是回到了目标世界。该发生的事，条件都已齐备。只要再等上一阵，我就能查明 Atsuki 看见我的那个真相。"

    # game/script.rpy:53364
    old "I didn't know the exact time, so I got as close to the hallway as possible."
    new "我不知道确切的时间，只好尽量靠近走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:53366
    old "...I can't really hear anything."
    new "……什么也听不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:53367
    old "Hm...{w} I'm pretty sure someone should be here, no matter what time it is."
    new "唔……{w}不管是什么时候，这里按理都该有人才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:53368
    old "We didn't look at the storeroom again when we left the attic, did we...? I might really be able to stay here undiscovered."
    new "我们离开阁楼的时候，没有再去看储藏室吧……？说不定我真能一直躲在这里，不被人发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:53369
    old "Had I always been there all along? I had a lot of trouble visualizing exactly what had happened."
    new "我难道一直都在那里？当时究竟发生了什么，我实在很难想象。"

    # game/script.rpy:53370
    old "Trying to perceive any sound, I continued pressing my ear against the wall."
    new "我继续把耳朵贴在墙上，想捕捉任何声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:53375
    old "...Once again, that led into minutes of silence, and as they kept passing, my concern only strengthened."
    new "……又是一连几分钟的死寂，时间越久，我越是不安。"

    # game/script.rpy:53376
    old "Was I really in the same place? Maybe the handleless door hadn't been the proof I thought."
    new "我真的还在同一个地方吗？也许那扇没有把手的门，并不能像我以为的那样证明什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:53377
    old "This is probably the time we were locked in the attic, but we know things happened down here while we were above. ...What's with the complete silence, then?"
    new "现在大概就是我们被关在阁楼里的那段时间。可我们知道，我们在上面的时候，下面确实发生过什么。……那怎么会静成这样？"

    # game/script.rpy:53378
    old "The Akaro who appeared in the bedroom... He has to be the one I was with just now. If that's correct, Isla was actually in the attic as well when Erina heard her."
    new "出现在卧室里的那个 Akaro……一定就是刚才和我在一起的那个。若果真如此，Erina 听见 Isla 的时候，她其实就在阁楼里。"

    # game/script.rpy:53379
    old "So then, what happened to them? Why did we never find Isla, and why did Akaro disappear?"
    new "那么，他们后来怎样了？为什么我们始终没找到 Isla，Akaro 又为什么会消失？"

    # game/script.rpy:53381
    old "We had left Akaro in the lower level of the bedroom. A while later, he disappeared. Furthermore, the chain hadn't been removed."
    new "我们把 Akaro 留在了卧室下层。过了一阵，他就消失了。而且，锁链并没有被取下。"

    # game/script.rpy:53382
    old "There was a simple explanation—disappearing with the Sekimeiya."
    new "解释很简单——用 Sekimeiya 就能消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:53387
    old "When the ominous silence had gone on for a while, I decided to open the door in front of the wall."
    new "那不祥的寂静持续了一阵，我决定打开面前那面墙上的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:53392
    old "...Hallway A.{w} Immediately, I noticed something that differed."
    new "……A走廊。{w}我立刻察觉到了异样。"

    # game/script.rpy:53395
    old "The elevator button is in place."
    new "电梯按钮重新装上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53396
    old "Is it correct that if I don't intend to change the past, it won't? If so, that'll be very convenient."
    new "只要我没有改变过去的打算，过去就不会改变，是这样吗？若真如此，那就太方便了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53397
    old "I mean, I have proof that I'll still be here hours later, so I can do whatever I want as long as I don't purposely change the past."
    new "毕竟，我有证据证明几小时后我仍会在这里。所以只要不刻意改变过去，我做什么都行。"

    # game/script.rpy:53401
    old "I went up the staircase. ...Could Isla have been in the attic?"
    new "我走上楼梯。……Isla 会不会就在阁楼里？"

    # game/script.rpy:53402
    old "I had to see it with my own eyes. I had to confirm I was back there."
    new "我必须亲眼看看，必须确认自己回到了那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:53407
    old "I reached the attic's door. Next to every elevator on the way up, the metallic panels had been properly attached."
    new "我来到阁楼门前。一路上每部电梯旁，金属面板都装得好好的。"

    # game/script.rpy:53416
    old "I looked at the floor of the living room. Even though it had changed considerably, there were still recent footprints, and the empty suitcase was back on the sofa."
    new "我看向客厅的地板。虽然变化不小，上面却仍有新鲜的脚印，那只空行李箱也回到了沙发上。"

    # game/script.rpy:53421
    old "I stared by my feet after stepping in and remembered something Atsuki had once said."
    new "走进屋里，我低头盯着脚边，想起 Atsuki 曾说过的一句话。"

    # game/script.rpy:53429
    old "A-Are these Isla's? They can't be, right? And I think they're a bit too big."
    new "这、这些是 Isla 的吗？不会吧？而且我觉得有点太大了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53440
    old "I couldn't make any sound. Slowly, I stepped to the hallway and saw all that I needed to see."
    new "我发不出任何声音。我慢慢挪到走廊，眼前的一切已经足够说明问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:53445
    old "There's no handle here either..."
    new "这里也没有门把手……"

    # game/script.rpy:53446
    old "That could've only meant one thing. As I stood there, we were all behind that door."
    new "那只可能意味着一件事。我站在那里时，我们所有人都在那扇门后。"

    # game/script.rpy:53447
    old "So, is Isla here?"
    new "那么，Isla 在这里吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53448
    old "Like we'd once done, I took off my boots to reach the other bedroom while making the least amount of noise."
    new "像我们之前那样，我脱下靴子，尽可能不出声地走向另一间卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:53457
    old "So was the kitchen."
    new "厨房也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:53461
    old "And the storeroom."
    new "储藏室也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:53465
    old "...She's not here."
    new "……她不在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:53467
    old "...{w}I put on my boots and closed the door."
    new "……{w}我穿上靴子，关上了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:53468
    old "Then what the hell happened to her? Did she—"
    new "那她到底出了什么事？难道她——"

    # game/script.rpy:53469
    old "Hold on.{w} That's it. ...That's what happened!"
    new "等等。{w}就是这样。……原来是这样！"

    # game/script.rpy:53470
    old "The identity of Isla's friend...{w} I had finally figured it out."
    new "Isla 那位朋友的身份……{w}我终于想通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53471
    old "Isla had died, so how could she have been alive within a month? Atsuki had already stated that the recording was no trap."
    new "Isla 明明已经死了，怎么可能在一个月之内还活着？Atsuki 也说过，那段录音不是陷阱。"

    # game/script.rpy:53472
    old "There were many things I had learned. Vaisude revealed that there was a large travel at around {time=16.} That was how he had appeared on the 24th of November, and it happened to fit with the approximate date Isla's friend had appeared."
    new "我已经弄清了许多事。Vaisude 透露，{time=16.} 前后曾发生过一次大规模的穿越。正因如此，他才会在 11 月 24 日出现，而这也恰好与 Isla 的朋友出现的大致日期相符。"

    # game/script.rpy:53473
    old "And that's not all. This also explains another mystery: Akaro's disappearance."
    new "而且不止如此。这还解开了另一个谜团：Akaro 的消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:53476
    old "There's someone else who appeared on the 24th of November. The person who escaped from a prison cell, who I really have to assume was Akaro."
    new "11 月 24 日还有另一个人出现。那个从牢房里逃出来的人——我只能认为，那就是 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:53477
    old "At {time=16}, there was a very large travel, and everyone who got caught up in it appeared on the 24th of November. Three people who traveled were Vaisude, Isla, and Akaro."
    new "在{time=16}，发生过一次规模极大的时间穿越，所有被卷入其中的人都在 11 月 24 日出现。穿越的三人是 Vaisude、Isla 和 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:53478
    old "The Akaro who appeared in the cell wasn't the same Akaro we originally met in the morning. In a way, that explains some of the questions I had.{w} Didn't Atsuki say that he'd seen Akaro once again? That was the version of him who escaped the bedroom with Sai.{w} Why did he appear in prison, and what did he do later? I don't know, but at this point I have no doubt Akaro was the Xyn member trapped with us."
    new "出现在牢房里的 Akaro，并不是我们早上最初见到的那个 Akaro。从某种意义上说，这解释了我心里的几个疑问。{w} Atsuki 不是说过，他又见到过 Akaro 一次吗？那是和 Sai 一起逃出卧室的那个他。{w} 可他为什么出现在牢房，之后又做了什么？我不知道，但到了这一步，我已毫不怀疑——和我们一起被困住的 Xyn 成员就是 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:53479
    old "And that's how both Islas met. ...Earlier, when we were in the bedroom, Erina's and Isla's behavior seemed different. That's because in that world, her \"friend\" never appeared.{w} This is the solution to Atsuki's problem. After going to the past, she didn't recreate what she had lived through. For her, that was happening for the first time."
    new "两个 Isla 就是这样相遇的。……先前在卧室时，Erina 和 Isla 的举止有些反常。那是因为在那个世界里，她的「朋友」始终没有出现。{w} 这也解开了 Atsuki 的疑问。回到过去之后，她并没有重演自己经历过的一切。对她来说，那些事都是第一次发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:53482
    old "When I thought about it, all the things we'd heard about her friend made sense."
    new "这么一想，我们听过的那些关于她那位朋友的话，就全都说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53483
    old "\"She said that if we stayed calm in one place, nobody would be hurt.\"{w} That's exactly what we did. We stayed in a crystal room, and Isla never saw any of the dead bodies."
    new "「她说，只要我们安静地待在一个地方，就不会有人受伤。」{w} 我们也确实这么做了。我们一直待在某个水晶展室里，Isla 从未见过任何尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:53484
    old "\"She said that even though she didn't know how it would end or how long we'd stay here for, she'd wait for me at home.\"{w} I see. The reason she didn't know how it would end was because she traveled to the past in the middle of the day, and she didn't know how long we'd stay because Katei hadn't been there to explain the alarm."
    new "「她说，虽然她不知道事情会怎样结束，也不知道我们要在这里待多久，但她会在家里等我。」{w} 原来如此。她不知道事情会怎样结束，是因为她在白天就穿越回了过去；她不知道我们要待多久，是因为当时 Katei 不在，没人解释那阵警报。"

    # game/script.rpy:53485
    old "It makes sense. Isla was told that seven people would get trapped and that it'd be three men and four women. That's just because the other Isla wasn't counting Katei."
    new "这就说得通了。有人告诉 Isla，会有七个人被困住，三男四女。那只是因为另一个 Isla 没有把 Katei 算进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:53488
    old "There was one last thing Isla had told us. Her friend assured her that she would get to touch the Sekimeiya.{w} The Isla I'd just been with had touched it. In the crystal room, she asked about it, but Akaro told her not to. When he left Isla alone, I'm sure she took advantage of it. That was why the cabinet was open and why both of them appeared in the world I was in."
    new "Isla 还告诉过我们最后一件事。她的朋友向她保证，她一定能亲手碰触 Sekimeiya。{w} 我刚才见到的那个 Isla 就碰过它。在水晶展室里，她问起过它，Akaro 却不许她碰。等 Akaro 留下她一个人时，她一定抓住了机会。所以展示柜才会开着，两人也才会出现在我所在的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:53489
    old "There's only one thing I find strange... If she appeared in this world in that room, she would've noticed that a curtain had appeared on the floor with Naomi's corpse under it. ...Did she see it?"
    new "只有一件事让我觉得奇怪……如果她是在那个房间里出现在这个世界的，那她应该会注意到地上多了一块遮布，下面就盖着 Naomi 的尸体。……她看见了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53490
    old "Hm... the Sekimeiya was inside the cabinet, so she had to climb inside to touch it. If she changed worlds inside the cabinet, she would have shut herself in there, because it's locked in this world. I wonder what exactly happened."
    new "嗯……Sekimeiya 当时在展示柜里，她得钻进去才碰得到。如果她是在展示柜里切换了世界，那她就等于把自己关在了里面——在这个世界里，柜子是锁着的。到底发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:53491
    old "And when did the recording come into play in all of this...?"
    new "还有，那段录音又是在什么时候牵扯进这整件事的……？"

    # game/script.rpy:53495
    old "A sound came from the hallway."
    new "走廊那边传来声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:53496
    old "Did they open the door...?"
    new "是他们把门打开了吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:53497
    old "Someone was there, but I could only hear footsteps."
    new "有人在那里，但我只听得见脚步声。"

    # game/script.rpy:53502
    old "I made sure not to move, but I couldn't discern who it was."
    new "我刻意一动不动，却分辨不出那人是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:53503
    old "It has to be us. ...We just left the bedroom."
    new "一定是我们。……我们才刚离开卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:53507
    old "They're still there."
    new "他们还在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:53508
    old "The sound wasn't reaching well where I was. There had been brief periods of silence, but I could tell the hallway was not empty."
    new "我这边听得不太清楚。中间有几段短暂的沉寂，但我能感觉到走廊里并不是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:53511
    old "Soon, the dry footsteps faded away."
    new "不久，那干涩的脚步声渐渐远去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53512
    old "...Did they leave? That wasn't only one person."
    new "……他们走了吗？刚才可不止一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:53517
    old "I should go back to the crystal floor."
    new "我得回水晶层去。"

    # game/script.rpy:53521
    old "I didn't like the idea of staying in the attic, but I could've been seen if I went all the way down."
    new "我不想一直待在阁楼里，可要是一路走下去，说不定会被人看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:53525
    old "No matter who that was, I can probably make it down before them."
    new "不管那是谁，我大概都能抢在他们前面下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:53526
    old "I tried to open the elevator, but it didn't budge. Then, as soon as I pressed the button, I felt a spark in my mind."
    new "我试着打开电梯，门却纹丝不动。可就在我按下按钮的瞬间，脑中仿佛有什么一闪。"

    # game/script.rpy:53528
    old "Whoa, what the hell...?{w} Did this happen again?"
    new "哇，怎么回事……？{w} 又来了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53529
    old "Dumbfounded, I stared at the button until it lit up orange."
    new "我愣愣地盯着按钮，直到它亮起橙色的光。"

    # game/script.rpy:53533
    old "Inside the elevator, I pressed the lowest button."
    new "进了电梯，我按下最底层的按钮。"

    # game/script.rpy:53540
    old "While I descended the building, I reeled from confusion. ...What had just happened?"
    new "电梯下行时，我脑子里一片混乱。……刚才究竟发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:53548
    old "...I opened the door on the crystal floor and made a quick dash to the storeroom."
    new "……我打开水晶层的门，快步冲向储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:53555
    old "I paid my utmost attention behind the door. What was about to happen was very important."
    new "我在门后全神贯注地留意着。接下来要发生的事至关重要。"

    # game/script.rpy:53557
    old "There it is!"
    new "来了！"

    # game/script.rpy:53558
    old "Someone appeared from the staircase."
    new "有人从楼梯口出现了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53559
    old "...It's more than one person. It has to be the same people who just left the attic."
    new "……不止一个人。一定是刚刚离开阁楼的那几个。"

    # game/script.rpy:53560
    old "That meant it had to be us. It had to be us... Atsuki and me."
    new "那就是说，一定是我们。一定是我们……Atsuki 和我。"

    # game/script.rpy:53561
    old "Was that me? I just heard a voice."
    new "那是我吗？我刚才听到了说话声。"

    # game/script.rpy:53562
    old "I wasn't sure, but they didn't speak again. Instead, they got closer to where I was."
    new "我不确定，但他们没有再出声，而是朝我这边靠近了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53563
    old "And as the sound of their footsteps increased, they quickly decreased. Then, they opened a door. ...I had to think it was the event room's."
    new "脚步声一点点变大，随即又迅速变小。接着，有人打开了门。……我想那一定是活动室的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:53566
    old "What the hell...? It has to be us, but it doesn't make sense."
    new "怎么回事……？那一定是我们，可这说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:53567
    old "Something else had to happen, so I waited for it."
    new "一定还会发生别的事，所以我继续等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:53572
    old "I waited... for something that didn't happen."
    new "我等了……可什么也没等到。"

    # game/script.rpy:53573
    old "Nobody else came from the staircase side. In fact, ever since the footsteps had crossed the hallway, I hadn't heard anything."
    new "楼梯那边再没有人过来。事实上，自从脚步声穿过走廊之后，我就再没听到任何动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:53575
    old "In just a few minutes, I began to doubt what had been confirmed. I doubted I really was back in that world."
    new "才过了几分钟，我就开始怀疑刚才还确定无疑的事。我怀疑自己是不是真的回到了那个世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:53582
    old "I glanced at hallway A. Nobody was there, but I believed it was easy to confirm where I was."
    new "我瞥了一眼 A走廊。那里空无一人，但我相信要确认自己身在何处并不难。"

    # game/script.rpy:53586
    old "Cautiously, I walked to the lobby door. I opened it slowly, creating the tiniest gap."
    new "我小心翼翼地走到大厅门口，缓缓推开门，只留下一道极细的缝隙。"

    # game/script.rpy:53595
    old "As I'd thought, something was wrong."
    new "果然，有什么地方不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:53599
    old "It was completely empty. My own body had disappeared even though a single drop of blood remained near the door."
    new "里面空无一物。门边只剩一滴血，我自己的身体却不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53600
    old "Why... Why is nobody here?"
    new "为什么……为什么这里一个人都没有？"

    # game/script.rpy:53616
    old "I went to the event room, where the door had been left open. ...The display cabinet was empty."
    new "我去了活动室，门仍敞着。……展示柜里已经空了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53617
    old "There's no chance I'm not back, is there?"
    new "我总不可能没回来吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:53624
    old "I had to be, and a way to be sure was in hallway B. But something else grabbed my attention as soon as I stepped in."
    new "我肯定回来了，而确认这一点的方法就在 B走廊。可我刚踏进去，另一样东西便吸引了我的目光。"

    # game/script.rpy:53628
    old "A door was open. It belonged to the farthest crystal room, B6."
    new "有扇门开着。那是走廊尽头的水晶展室 B6。"

    # game/script.rpy:53632
    old "I approached it slowly and soon saw what was behind it."
    new "我慢慢走近，很快就看清了门后的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:53641
    old "The Sekimeiya was just inside the room. Its color was white, and nobody was there."
    new "Sekimeiya 就在门内，通体白色，周围不见人影。"

    # game/script.rpy:53644
    old "I could only frown as I walked up to it. That was the place we had traveled from after leaving the attic. Many things indicated I was in that world."
    new "我皱着眉头走上前。这里正是我们离开阁楼后出发的地方。许多迹象都表明我就在那个世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:53645
    old "But not all. There was something that wasn't right, and it was baffling."
    new "但并非所有迹象都如此。有什么地方对不上，让我百思不解。"

    # game/script.rpy:53646
    old "So there are two Sekimeiya here as well...?"
    new "这么说，这里也有两个 Sekimeiya……？"

    # game/script.rpy:53648
    old "That had to be right, and no matter what was happening, keeping one was a good idea. Still rattled, I picked it up."
    new "应该没错。不管正在发生什么，手里有一个总归稳妥。我心神不定，却还是把它拿了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:53651
    old "The headache was coming back, so I left quickly and directed myself to the room I'd wanted to inspect."
    new "头痛又犯了，我赶紧离开，走向那间想查看的房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:53655
    old "B4, where I'd been for hours. When I opened the door, I found what I expected on the other side."
    new "B4，我在那里待了好几个小时。推开门，门后的景象和我预想的一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:53661
    old "Naomi was on the floor, under a curtain. There were bloodstains near her and on the wall, too."
    new "Naomi 倒在地上，身上盖着遮布。她身旁和墙上都有血迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:53663
    old "Just what the hell is happening?{w} The Sekimeiya I have right now is the one we touched in that crystal room, right...?"
    new "到底发生什么事了？{w}我现在手里这个 Sekimeiya，就是我们在那间水晶展室里碰过的那个，对吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:53664
    old "I just took it, so that's why we didn't find it later. ...Instead, we found it in a drawer.{w} That must not have been the same one. ...Is that it?"
    new "是我刚刚把它拿走了，所以后来才找不到。……结果，我们却在抽屉里发现了一个。{w}那一定不是同一个。……是这样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53665
    old "The structure of those events didn't make sense. There was a major contradiction."
    new "这一连串事情根本说不通，其中有个极大的矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:53669
    old "...I approached one of the cabinets. Its side wheel was damaged."
    new "……我走近其中一个展示柜。侧面的轮子已经损坏。"

    # game/script.rpy:53671
    old "It's the same cabinet we saw that day.{w} ...Actually, I should keep the Sekimeiya here. I was thinking of bringing it to the storeroom, but that could be risky depending on what happened."
    new "这就是我们那天看到的那个展示柜。{w}……说起来，我还是把 Sekimeiya 留在这里吧。我本来想把它带到储藏室，但万一出了什么状况，那样做可能很危险。"

    # game/script.rpy:53672
    old "After all, why had I traveled back to that world? Due to an idea I'd had, I didn't want to stay near the Sekimeiya. For the same reason, I had to turn the wheel."
    new "毕竟，我为什么会回到那个世界？因为当时心里冒出一个念头：我不想待在 Sekimeiya 旁边。出于同样的理由，我必须转动那个轮子。"

    # game/script.rpy:53673
    old "Akaro set it to 5 °C, but that must not have been enough, because the Sekimeiya still worked when Isla touched it. ...We found it set to 0 °C, so that might be better."
    new "Akaro 把它设成了 5 °C，但显然不够，因为 Isla 碰到 Sekimeiya 时，它仍然生效了。……我们发现它被设成 0 °C，那样也许更保险。"

    # game/script.rpy:53678
    old "I still couldn't easily believe what I was thinking. ...Had everything really happened as I thought?"
    new "我仍然很难相信自己想到的这个结论。……一切真的都如我所想的那样发生了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53679
    old "I knew I had to be wrong about something, so what made the most sense... was that I was mistaken about what time it was."
    new "我知道自己一定在某处弄错了，而最合理的解释……是我把时间弄错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53680
    old "...After all, I had used the elevator."
    new "……毕竟，我乘过那部电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:53681
    old "In the attic, I'd been so distracted that I hardly considered the elevator would be audible. In fact, while I'd thought about it, I'd been blinded by the assumption that if I didn't mean to change the past, everything would repeat, and I was at no risk of being seen."
    new "在阁楼时，我心神不宁，几乎没想过电梯的声音会传出去。事实上，我虽然想到过这件事，却被一个假设蒙蔽了：只要我无意改变过去，一切就会照原样重演，我也绝不会被人发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:53682
    old "If everything did happen the same way, it was guaranteed that I wouldn't be found. Therefore, using the elevator to go to the crystal floor was safe. That had been my unconscious thought process."
    new "如果一切确实照原样发生，那我必定不会被人发现。所以，乘坐电梯前往水晶层是安全的。这就是我下意识的思路。"

    # game/script.rpy:53683
    old "But it had generated a logical issue in my mind."
    new "但这让我的推理出现了一个逻辑矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:53686
    old "Who had caused the noises I'd heard in the attic? I'd assumed that was the time we'd left the bedroom."
    new "我在阁楼听到的声响是谁弄出来的？我一直以为，那是我们离开卧室时发出的。"

    # game/script.rpy:53687
    old "But what had happened after that?"
    new "可在那之后，又发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:53688
    old "Atsuki and I went down to the crystal floor and then to the event room. That's what I heard from the storeroom just now."
    new "我和 Atsuki 下到水晶层，然后去了活动室。这是我刚才在储藏室听到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:53689
    old "Then, we found the Sekimeiya in room B6. We touched it and traveled through time."
    new "然后，我们在水晶展室 B6 找到了 Sekimeiya。我们碰了它，于是穿越了时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:53690
    old "We appeared back in the bedroom, and then we went to the lobby before our original versions arrived on the crystal floor. We determined that we'd gone five minutes to the past."
    new "我们回到了卧室，随后赶在原本的我们抵达水晶层之前去了大厅。我们判断自己回到了五分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:53691
    old "However, that didn't make any sense."
    new "然而，这根本说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:53697
    old "The elevator was another key detail to those events.{w} After leaving the attic's bedroom for the first time, we had heard the elevator twice on the office floors."
    new "电梯也是这些事件中的另一个关键细节。{w}第一次离开阁楼的卧室后，我们在办公楼层听到了两次电梯声。"

    # game/script.rpy:53698
    old "Then, when we traveled five minutes to the past, I pressed the button in the attic. That's why we thought it was us who called it from the attic and took it down."
    new "然后，在我们穿越回五分钟前时，我在阁楼按下了按钮。所以我们才以为，是我们从阁楼叫了电梯，然后乘它下去的。"

    # game/script.rpy:53699
    old "And just now, when I called the elevator, I thought \"Did this happen again? Did I once again call the elevator without realizing that I was going to produce the sound I'd already heard?\""
    new "而刚才，我叫电梯时还在想：「这件事是不是又发生了一次？我是不是又一次叫了电梯，却没意识到自己正要弄出那早已听过的声响？」"

    # game/script.rpy:53700
    old "That was wrong, though. It couldn't have happened \"again\" because both elevator trips were the very same."
    new "可那不对。它不可能「又」发生一次，因为那两趟电梯根本就是同一趟。"

    # game/script.rpy:53701
    old "After Atsuki and I touched the Sekimeiya and appeared in the bedroom, I called the elevator, producing the sound we heard before traveling. Now, right after the old versions of us went down, I called the elevator, producing the sound we heard."
    new "我和 Atsuki 碰过 Sekimeiya、出现在卧室后，我按了电梯，发出了我们穿越前听到的声响。而这一次，就在过去的我们下去之后，我又按了电梯，发出了我们听到的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:53702
    old "Which one was right, and which one was wrong? Only one was the truth."
    new "哪一个才对，哪一个才错？真相只有一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:53707
    old "That was the reason why I was skeptical about my surroundings. I was in that world, but there had to be something I was mistaken about.{w} If it was the time of day, everything made sense. If the sounds I'd heard in the attic hadn't belonged to our past selves, there was no contradiction."
    new "正因如此，我才对周围的环境心存怀疑。我确实身处那个世界，但一定有什么地方被我弄错了。{w}如果错的是时间，一切就都说得通。如果我在阁楼听到的声响并非来自过去的我们，那就不存在矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:53708
    old "But was that it...? It didn't seem likely. From the storeroom, I was pretty sure I'd heard my own voice. That would've been when we'd checked the elevator to confirm that it arrived on the crystal floor."
    new "可真是那样吗……？似乎不太可能。在储藏室里，我很确定听见了自己的声音。那应该是我们去确认电梯是否抵达水晶层的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:53709
    old "If I just caused the sound we heard that day, then what the hell happened after we appeared in the bedroom?"
    new "如果那天我们听到的声响正是我刚才弄出来的，那我们出现在卧室之后到底发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:53710
    old "Just a few minutes prior, I'd confirmed nobody was in the lobby. ...But the versions of us who had touched the Sekimeiya in B6 were supposed to be there."
    new "就在几分钟前，我还确认过大厅里空无一人。……可碰过 B6 那个 Sekimeiya 的我们，本该就在大厅里。"

    # game/script.rpy:53711
    old "Who had caused the elevator noises? No matter which one was correct, the other interpretation was completely wrong."
    new "电梯的声响究竟是谁弄出来的？无论哪一种解释是对的，另一种解释都完全错误。"

    # game/script.rpy:53715
    old "I'd been trying to combat my headache to understand what had happened. Even though both versions of things made perfect sense separately, it was impossible to reconcile them."
    new "我一直强忍着头痛，想弄清发生了什么。两种说法各自都完美成立，却无论如何也无法调和。"

    # game/script.rpy:53716
    old "...In the storeroom, I touched the Sekimeiya and the world around me changed. Could something like that have happened when we touched it in room B6?"
    new "……在储藏室里，我碰了 Sekimeiya，周围的世界就变了。我们在水晶展室 B6 碰它时，会不会也发生了同样的事？"

    # game/script.rpy:53717
    old "That seemed like it could make sense, but there was another problem. Atsuki had seen me after that point. That implied he was still in the same world."
    new "这似乎说得通，可还有另一个问题：在那之后，Atsuki 见过我。也就是说，他仍留在这个世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:53722
    old "I'd been caught up sorting everything out in my head when I heard someone just outside the door."
    new "我正忙着在脑中理清头绪，忽然听见门外有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:53726
    old "...Who's that?"
    new "……谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:53727
    old "The sound only intensified, and soon, the door opened. When I saw who was there, I rushed over."
    new "声响越来越大，很快，门开了。看清来人是谁，我立刻冲了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:53735
    old "Erina...! A-Are you—"
    new "Erina……！你、你还好——"

    # game/script.rpy:53739
    old "Before I could finish, she fell to the floor.{w} Her clothes were soaked in blood, and her expression was vacant. I moved to shake her shoulder, but she didn't respond."
    new "话还没说完，她便瘫倒在地。{w} 衣服浸透了血，神情空洞。我伸手去摇她的肩膀，她却毫无反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:53743
    old "Wh-What happened...?"
    new "怎、怎么回事……？"

    # game/script.rpy:53747
    old "Disconcerted, I closed the door. I didn't want to be heard, and I wasn't sure who else was there. However, I calmed myself down when I recalled what had happened."
    new "我心里一慌，关上了门。我不想让人听见，也说不准还有谁在。但一想起先前发生的事，我便冷静下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:53751
    old "Right... Okay. She's not dead."
    new "对了……还好。她没死。"

    # game/script.rpy:53752
    old "That was the room where we'd found her, and she had fallen in the same position. I placed a finger on her neck and felt the pulse we'd missed."
    new "这正是我们发现她的那个房间，而她倒下的姿势也与当时相同。我把手指搭上她的脖颈，摸到了那时被我们漏掉的脉搏。"

    # game/script.rpy:53753
    old "She said she got hit in the head, but who did it...? All this blood can't be hers."
    new "她说自己头部挨了一下，可动手的是谁……？这么多血不可能都是她的。"

    # game/script.rpy:53754
    old "Who could've hit Erina? ...Akaro, Sai, and Katei. However, no one else but Katei had lost that much blood."
    new "会是谁对 Erina 下的手？……Akaro、Sai，还有 Katei。可除了 Katei，没人流过这么多血。"

    # game/script.rpy:53755
    old "...The blood is fresh. ...Katei's already dead, then."
    new "……血还没干。……看来 Katei 已经死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53756
    old "I was once again lost. Everything was repeating, which meant that I hadn't been mistaken. What I'd heard in the attic was really us leaving the bedroom."
    new "我又一次陷入迷茫。一切都在重复，说明我没有弄错。我在阁楼里听到的，确实是我们离开卧室的动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:53760
    old "I doubted what to do. Sai and Akaro could've been very close by.{w} In the other world, Akaro had killed me, and in the one I was in, Sai would soon chase us with a knife. No matter what, I couldn't let myself be seen, so going to the storeroom was dangerous."
    new "我一时拿不定主意。Sai 和 Akaro 很可能就在附近。{w} 在另一个世界里，Akaro 杀了我；而在我所处的这个世界，Sai 很快就会拿刀来追我们。无论如何，我都不能被人看见，所以去储藏室太冒险了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53761
    old "Katei and Erina left the attic together. They might've been attacked at the same time by Akaro or Sai."
    new "Katei 和 Erina 是一起离开阁楼的。她们也许同时遭到了 Akaro 或 Sai 的袭击。"

    # game/script.rpy:53763
    old "So, what about us? Where were our past selves?"
    new "那么，我们呢？过去的我们又在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:53764
    old "According to my memories, we should have been in the lobby when I'd peeked into it, so I couldn't blindly trust what I remembered in that regard."
    new "按照我的记忆，我朝大厅里张望时，我们应该就在里面；可在这件事上，我不能盲目相信自己的记忆。"

    # game/script.rpy:53767
    old "Maybe I should go to the storeroom anyway. If everything will play out the same, I can be sure I won't be seen."
    new "也许我还是该去储藏室。如果一切都会照原样重演，那我就能确定自己不会被人看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:53769
    old "Wait, no.{w} I don't have to."
    new "等等，不对。{w} 我没必要去。"

    # game/script.rpy:53770
    old "I thought a little ahead. When we'd found Erina, we failed to realize that she was alive. Due to the shock, we'd barely stepped into the room."
    new "我稍微往前想了一下。我们发现 Erina 时，并没有意识到她还活着。因为太过震惊，我们几乎没走进房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:53771
    old "I could leave, but given what I knew, I didn't have to. If I stayed next to the door when it opened, our past selves wouldn't see me. It was better not to move."
    new "我本可以离开，但以我现在所知，没有这个必要。只要门开时我待在门边，过去的我们就看不见我。还是不要动为好。"

    # game/script.rpy:53779
    old "I waited next to the door. From there, the whole floor seemed silent."
    new "我在门边等着。待在那里，整层楼听上去一片寂静。"

    # game/script.rpy:53780
    old "Erina had completely passed out. She hadn't moved an inch, and as the seconds passed, I kept wondering where Atsuki and the other me were."
    new "Erina 彻底昏了过去，一动不动。时间一点点过去，我一直在想 Atsuki 和另一个我究竟在哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:53781
    old "I didn't get it. Was I not properly remembering what had happened...?{w} I looked up at the camera. Was I being recorded in two different places simultaneously?"
    new "我不明白。难道是我记错了当时的情形……？{w} 我抬头望向摄像头。难道我同时被两个不同的地方拍下来了？"

    # game/script.rpy:53782
    old "What...?{w} The green light still isn't there. That's odd..."
    new "什么……？{w} 绿灯还是没亮。真奇怪……"

    # game/script.rpy:53784
    old "The Sekimeiya was in my hands. I'd gotten distracted, so I hadn't left it in the cabinet. However, I'd also noticed something else that was strange, which had made me very reluctant to follow through with that."
    new "Sekimeiya 还在我手上。我方才走了神，没将它放回展示柜。可我也察觉到了另一处不对劲，因此迟迟不愿把它放回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:53788
    old "I didn't have to wait long before I heard a door opening. It sounded like someone had come from the lobby."
    new "我没等多久，便听见一扇门开了。听动静，像是有人从大厅那边过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:53789
    old "Again, it's more than one person. ...Are they gonna go to the bathrooms?"
    new "又是好几个人。……他们是要去洗手间吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53790
    old "They did.{w} Then, another door was opened. ...I knew it was the staff room's."
    new "果然如此。{w} 接着，又有一扇门打开了。……我知道，那是员工室的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:53791
    old "It really is us. What the hell, then?"
    new "真是我们。那到底是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:53792
    old "...et the Se—{w} ...has to be—"
    new "……拿到 Sekimeiya——{w} ……一定得——"

    # game/script.rpy:53793
    old "It is. That was Atsuki."
    new "没错。那是 Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:53794
    old "I remember what we did... After checking that Naomi's locker was still open, we found the Sekimeiya in a drawer in room B6. We brought it to the event room, and then we found Katei and Erina."
    new "我记得我们做过什么……确认 Naomi 的储物柜还开着后，我们在 B6 房间的抽屉里找到了 Sekimeiya。我们把它带到活动室，随后发现了 Katei 和 Erina。"

    # game/script.rpy:53798
    old "As predicted, the steps eventually moved to the event room."
    new "不出所料，脚步声最终朝活动室移去。"

    # game/script.rpy:53799
    old "If I'm not mistaken, they'll come here soon."
    new "如果我没记错，他们很快就会来这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:53800
    old "My tension grew, but I had to be fine as long as I didn't make noise. Meanwhile, I kept wondering what to do with the Sekimeiya that I had. ...I could be sure there had always been two of them, as we had just locked one in its cabinet."
    new "我越来越紧张，但只要不发出声响，应该就不会有事。与此同时，我一直在想手里这个 Sekimeiya 该怎么办。……我已经能确定，它始终有两个；毕竟我们刚刚把其中一个锁进了展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:53801
    old "There was no remaining doubt in my mind that I was right, so I waited. After finding Katei, it hadn't taken us very long to come across Erina."
    new "我心中已不再怀疑自己的判断，于是继续等着。发现 Katei 之后，我们没过多久就遇上了 Erina。"

    # game/script.rpy:53802
    old "And that was reflected by the sound behind the door. Mere minutes after it faded, the lobby door opened again."
    new "门外传来的声响正印证了这一点。声音消失不过几分钟，大厅的门又开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53803
    old "I knew full well the desolate atmosphere we'd experienced as we'd looked in every room. After that repeated, they opened the door next to me, and I was forced to relive the shock of seeing Erina's bloodied body through their sharp gasps."
    new "我太清楚逐一查看每个房间时那种荒凉的感觉了。那一切重演之后，他们打开了我身旁的门；听着他们猛然倒抽冷气的声音，我又被迫重温了看到 Erina 浑身是血时的震惊。"

    # game/script.rpy:53807
    old "Atsuki took two steps forward, and I heard my past self crumple down. Hidden behind the door, I held my breath."
    new "Atsuki 向前走了两步，我听见过去的自己瘫坐下去。我躲在门后，屏住了呼吸。"

    # game/script.rpy:53809
    old "Slowly, Atsuki turned around. I couldn't see it, but I felt the despair that came from him."
    new "Atsuki 缓缓转过身。我看不见他的神情，却能感到他身上透出的绝望。"

    # game/script.rpy:53811
    old "Before they left, Atsuki detached the curtain from the cabinet closest to him and covered Erina with it."
    new "离开之前，Atsuki 从离他最近的展示柜上扯下遮布，盖在了 Erina 身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:53813
    old "I exhaled. I may have been in the same world I'd come from originally, but there were loads of things I didn't understand."
    new "我吐出一口气。我或许仍身处最初的那个世界，但有太多事情我还不明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:53820
    old "So now what?"
    new "那现在该怎么办？"

    # game/script.rpy:53821
    old "The Sekimeiya entailed a dilemma. I wanted to leave it behind, but that potentially created its own problem."
    new "Sekimeiya 让我陷入了两难。我想把它留下，可这么做本身又可能埋下新的隐患。"

    # game/script.rpy:53822
    old "Oh...! This is what happened!"
    new "啊……！原来是这么回事！"

    # game/script.rpy:53823
    old "When I thought ahead, the answer to a persistent question was finally answered."
    new "顺着这个思路往前推，一个萦绕已久的问题终于有了答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:53824
    old "I... I just trapped myself."
    new "我……我竟然把自己困住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53825
    old "I'd been going one step at a time, so I hadn't realized a direct result of what I'd done."
    new "我一直都是一步一步来的，所以没意识到自己做的事已经直接造成了这个结果。"

    # game/script.rpy:53828
    old "After finding Erina, we went to the event room, and Atsuki sat next to the hallway A door."
    new "找到 Erina 后，我们去了活动室，Atsuki 则坐到了 A走廊的门旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:53829
    old "I finally understood... The reason why he'd seen me, and why that would repeat."
    new "我终于明白了……他为什么会看见我，又为什么那一幕会重演。"

    # game/script.rpy:53830
    old "I'm trapped. As soon as I leave this room, Atsuki will hear and see me. ...That's what woke him up."
    new "我被困住了。只要一离开这间房，Atsuki 就会听到动静、看见我。……他就是这么醒来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:53831
    old "...And I had to leave. If I stayed there for much longer, a search would eventually find me. That wasn't all—I knew Erina would soon regain consciousness herself, and I had a reason to think Sai would search the room I was in fairly soon. ...I had to leave, and as soon as I did, I would force our past selves out of the event room."
    new "……而我必须离开。再在那里待下去，迟早会有人搜到这里。不止如此——我知道 Erina 很快也会醒来，而且我有理由认为，Sai 用不了多久就会来搜我所在的房间。……我必须离开；而我一走，就会把过去的我们从活动室里逼出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:53836
    old "I had a Sekimeiya with me, so teleporting out was an option. But it was one I couldn't risk, because I refused to leave the world I was in again."
    new "我身上带着 Sekimeiya，传送离开本来也是个选择。但我不能冒这个险，因为我不愿再次离开自己所在的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:53839
    old "In the event room, I had fallen asleep very quickly. I'd been dead tired that day.{w} I felt a similar exhaustion at that moment. I'd been in the tower for many hours already, but they'd fortunately been much less dense."
    new "在活动室里，我很快就睡着了。那天我实在疲惫不堪。{w}此刻我也感到相似的倦意。我已经在塔里待了好几个小时，但好在这些时间远没有那天那么紧凑。"

    # game/script.rpy:53840
    old "After I leave, Atsuki will call for me, and I won't appear."
    new "我离开之后，Atsuki 会喊我，但我不会出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:53841
    old "Unbelievable as it seemed, that aligned with what I wanted, so it made sense for it to occur. I could watch what had happened from a distance, and there was something I was curious about."
    new "虽然难以置信，但这正合我意，所以它会发生也合乎情理。我能够从远处旁观已经发生的事，而且有一件事让我好奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:53842
    old "There was yet another reason—it would've caused a problem that I was finally sure existed.{w} I couldn't interact with my old self. It was the same thing we'd considered with Isla. If my past self met the future me and tried to keep everything exactly the same, she'd have to replicate precisely what she'd seen me do. Every word, every movement. No human was capable of that.{w} It was crucial not to be seen by both her and Atsuki."
    new "还有一个原因：那样做会引发一个我如今终于确定存在的问题。{w}我不能和过去的自己接触。这和当初我们与 Isla 讨论过的是同一回事。如果过去的我遇见了未来的我，还想让一切保持原样，她就必须把看见我做的每件事都分毫不差地复现出来——每一句话、每一个动作。没有人能做到这一点。{w}绝不能让过去的我和 Atsuki 同时看见我。"

    # game/script.rpy:53847
    old "A certain time was approaching. There was something I'd been avoiding thinking about."
    new "某个时刻正在逼近。有一件事，我一直不愿去想。"

    # game/script.rpy:53848
    old "On that mountain, I made a decision...{w} To change the past and save everyone. Miiya, Isla, Erina, Katei, Naomi..."
    new "在那座山上，我下定了决心……{w}要改变过去，救下所有人。Miiya、Isla、Erina、Katei、Naomi……"

    # game/script.rpy:53849
    old "While that reality seemed distant, it was as close as ever. The time I'd found the Sekimeiya in the water tank would soon come. At that point, the Sekimeiya had shot me quite far through time, even though I didn't know why."
    new "那个现实看似遥远，此刻却前所未有地近。我在水箱里发现 Sekimeiya 的时刻很快就要到来。那时，Sekimeiya 把我抛到了相当遥远的时间点，我却不明白缘由。"

    # game/script.rpy:53850
    old "...When I go to the bathroom, I just have to stop my old self. ...That should let the Sekimeiya store even more energy, so if I touch it later, I'll go to November again. To a time before Miiya died."
    new "……等我去洗手间时，只要拦住过去的自己就行。……这样一来，Sekimeiya 应该能蓄积更多能量；之后我再碰它，就会回到十一月。回到 Miiya 死前的时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:53851
    old "That was all I had to do. If I changed the past in just the right way, accomplishing what I'd decided was well within reach."
    new "我要做的仅此而已。只要把过去改得恰到好处，实现我定下的目标并非难事。"

    # game/script.rpy:53855
    old "And yet... I didn't know what to do.{w} Hadn't I also decided that going to the past was a mistake?"
    new "然而……我却不知道自己该做什么。{w}我不是也认定过，回到过去是个错误吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53856
    old "If I didn't interfere, my past self would travel, and I would become myself again. I could just leave with Atsuki..."
    new "如果我不插手，过去的我就会完成穿越，而我也能重新变回我自己。我大可以就这样和 Atsuki 一起离开……"

    # game/script.rpy:53857
    old "But is that even the case...? Would that really be possible?"
    new "可事情真是这样吗……？那样真的可行吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53858
    old "The Atsuki from this morning said that the recording was real. We won't simply leave at {time=21.}"
    new "今早的 Atsuki 说那段录音是真的。到了 {time=21.}，我们不会就这么离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:53859
    old "And that wasn't all. He was suspicious of me and asked if I was the real Shiroya.{w} ...Why? What happened after I went back in time?"
    new "而且还不止如此。他起了疑心，问我是不是真的 Shiroya。{w}……为什么？我回到过去之后，到底发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:53860
    old "Up until then, my safety had been guaranteed because Atsuki had seen me late into the day. Beyond that point, I couldn't be confident about anything. On top of that, it was a fact that I'd never been mentioned in the recording."
    new "在那之前，我的安全一直有保障，因为 Atsuki 直到那天很晚都还见过我。过了那个时间点，我就什么都不敢确定了。更何况，录音里从头到尾都没提过我。"

    # game/script.rpy:53861
    old "I also recalled that I'd been seen again later, wearing the clothes from the attic. That had only been briefly mentioned, so I didn't know what it was about."
    new "我还想起，后来我又被人看见过，穿着从阁楼拿来的衣服。那件事只被简单提过一句，所以我并不知道究竟是怎么回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:53866
    old "I looked down. When the Sekimeiya had begun to get too hot, I'd left it on the floor.{w} It was a bit difficult to decide what to do with it."
    new "我低下头。Sekimeiya 开始烫得厉害时，我把它放在了地板上。{w}要怎么处置它，我还有些拿不定主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:53867
    old "My intention was to leave it in that cold cabinet, but I think something's odd about that."
    new "我本打算把它放进那个冰冷的展示柜里，但我觉得这件事有些不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:53868
    old "...Once I leave, our past selves will go to the attic. While they're returning, the elevator will be intercepted and Sai will chase them."
    new "……我一离开，过去的我们就会去阁楼。等他们回来时，电梯会在半途被截下，Sai 会去追他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:53869
    old "They'll all end up in the event room, where Sai's attitude will flip. Something we didn't figure out was how he managed to not be found in hallway B when Atsuki searched through every room."
    new "他们最后都会到活动室，而 Sai 的态度会在那里突然转变。我们当时没想通的是，Atsuki 把每个房间都搜遍了，他究竟是怎么在 B走廊里躲过搜查的。"

    # game/script.rpy:53870
    old "If I left the Sekimeiya in that cabinet, that would've given him a way out. He could've disappeared by touching it. That was why I'd thought that he might've been about to investigate the room and find out that a Sekimeiya was there."
    new "如果我把 Sekimeiya 留在那个展示柜里，就等于给了他一条脱身之路。他只要碰它一下，就能消失。正因如此，我才觉得他可能正准备查看那个房间，并发现那里有 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:53871
    old "At that point, another Sekimeiya was in the event room. If there are only two, the only way Sai could've disappeared from one of these rooms is with the Sekimeiya that I have now."
    new "那时，活动室里还有另一个 Sekimeiya。如果总共只有两个，那么 Sai 想从这些房间中的某一间消失，唯一的办法就是借助现在我手上的这个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:53872
    old "I would keep it cold, so he'd have to take it out, wait for Atsuki to investigate the other rooms, and touch it as soon as this one was about to be searched in order to get away."
    new "我会让它保持低温，这样他就得先把它取出来，等 Atsuki 查完其他房间，再趁这间即将被搜的时候碰它一下，借此脱身。"

    # game/script.rpy:53875
    old "But it's not so straightforward, because according to Atsuki, he looked in every cabinet. If that's what happened, he should've seen the Sekimeiya."
    new "但事情没这么简单，因为据 Atsuki 说，他检查过每一个展示柜。若真是如此，他本该看到 Sekimeiya 才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:53876
    old "Is it possible it teleported after Sai used it...? I'm not sure about that anymore."
    new "会不会是 Sai 用过之后，它自己传送走了……？这一点我已经无法确定了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53879
    old "...{w}That was what seemed odd. Up until that point, everything I'd done that had matched with what I'd already lived through contained a purpose. The clothes, showing myself, the elevator... I hadn't repeated anything without a reason.{w} So then, what was going on? Would I leave the Sekimeiya there to give Sai a way to escape? ...Simply to avoid changing the past?"
    new "……{w}奇怪的地方就在这里。在那之前，我做的每一件事，凡是与已经经历过的过去吻合的，都有它的目的。衣服、现身、电梯……我重复任何一件事都有理由。{w}那么，到底是怎么回事？我难道会把 Sekimeiya 留在那里，只为了给 Sai 一条脱身之路？……仅仅为了不改变过去？"

    # game/script.rpy:53880
    old "It was weird. Because I had realized it, I had no reason to leave the Sekimeiya in that cabinet. Even though I wanted to hide it far from me, it didn't have to be in hallway B.{w} I didn't want to leave the Sekimeiya there. Aside from the fact that it would be consistent with my experiences, it would only bring negative consequences."
    new "这很奇怪。既然我已经意识到了这一点，就没有理由再把 Sekimeiya 留在那个展示柜里。我固然想把它藏到离自己远点的地方，但未必非要放在 B走廊。{w}我不想把 Sekimeiya 留在那里。除了这样能和我经历过的事对得上之外，这么做只会带来坏处。"

    # game/script.rpy:53881
    old "But didn't that mean Sai would still manage to hide anyway? After all, I wouldn't {i}not{/i} be doing it to change the past; disregarding my own interests purely to be consistent with what I'd already experienced wasn't how everything had worked so far.{w} That was what I was curious about and what I wanted to observe from a distance. How was Sai going to escape detection?"
    new "可这不就说明，Sai 到头来还是会藏起来吗？毕竟，我做这件事并不是为了{i}不{/i}改变过去；一味为了和已经经历过的事保持一致，就不顾自己的利益——到目前为止，事情并不是这样运作的。{w}这正是我好奇、也想从远处观察的地方。Sai 究竟要怎么逃过搜查？"

    # game/script.rpy:53890
    old "Helix"
    new "螺旋"

    # game/script.rpy:53893
    old "The more I thought about it, the more I believed that leaving the Sekimeiya in the cabinet wasn't the call."
    new "我越想越觉得，把 Sekimeiya 留在展示柜里并非上策。"

    # game/script.rpy:53894
    old "When I was sure, I looked at the door. It hadn't been properly closed, so I widened the gap without making a noise."
    new "下定主意后，我看向房门。门没有完全关好，我便悄无声息地把缝隙推大了一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:53902
    old "...It was as I'd thought. I could see Atsuki sleeping next to the hallway A door."
    new "……果然如我所想。我看见 Atsuki 睡在 A走廊门边。"

    # game/script.rpy:53903
    old "I took one step forward."
    new "我向前迈出一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:53914
    old "Immediately, Atsuki's eyes opened. Raising his head, he stared right at me."
    new "Atsuki 立刻睁开了眼。他抬起头，直直地盯住我。"

    # game/script.rpy:53921
    old "I turned and walked down the hallway to reach the storeroom."
    new "我转身沿走廊走向储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:53925
    old "It really had been me. At that time, I had denied it completely, but the person Atsuki saw was the same me, in a sense."
    new "那的确是我。当时我完全否认了这一点，但从某种意义上说，Atsuki 看见的人就是我自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:53933
    old "From inside the storeroom, I heard Atsuki slowly walking. He circled the floor until he was back at the event room."
    new "我在储藏室里听见 Atsuki 缓慢的脚步声。他绕着这一层走了一圈，最后又回到了活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:53934
    old "Next, they would go to the security room to check the time before going to the attic."
    new "接下来，他们应该会先去监控室确认时间，然后再上阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:53935
    old "...Something had just caught my eye."
    new "……刚才有什么东西引起了我的注意。"

    # game/script.rpy:53936
    old "The green light was on the hallway's camera..."
    new "走廊的摄像头上亮着绿灯……"

    # game/script.rpy:53942
    old "It was ridiculous. ...I was, in fact, but I didn't want to be seen. Such a nonsensical prediction had turned out true."
    new "太荒谬了。……我确实在，只是不想被人看见。那样荒唐的预测，竟然成真了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53944
    old "Our old selves walked to the stairs to reach the attic. As soon as they were gone, I left as well."
    new "过去的我们走向楼梯，上了阁楼。他们刚一消失，我也离开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:53949
    old "I'd left the Sekimeiya on the crystal room floor, as I hadn't wanted to be seen with it."
    new "我不想被人看见自己拿着 Sekimeiya，就把它留在了水晶展室的地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:53950
    old "Oh. Don't tell me it's already gonna be gone.{w} ...Is this how Sai managed to disappear?"
    new "哦。别告诉我它已经不见了。{w}……Sai 就是这样消失的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53955
    old "That made a lot of sense, so I sped up. Could he have grabbed it so fast?"
    new "这么一想，倒也合情合理，我便加快了脚步。他能那么快就把它拿走吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53964
    old "No. ...It's still here."
    new "不。……它还在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:53966
    old "It was behind the door, where I'd left it. Carefully, I picked it up."
    new "它就在门后，正是我放下的地方。我小心地把它捡了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:53971
    old "Where should I put it...?"
    new "该放在哪里好……"

    # game/script.rpy:53976
    old "Thinking about it, I walked to hallway C, where a sudden sound startled me."
    new "我一边想着，一边走向 C走廊，忽然一阵声响吓了我一跳。"

    # game/script.rpy:53985
    old "I retreated immediately.{w} ...In hallway A, I'd just seen Sai. He hadn't seen me in return, but something was very odd.{w} He'd been exiting the storeroom with a knife in his hand and was visibly shocked after looking at the stairs, where there was nothing."
    new "我立刻退了回去。{w}……刚才在 A走廊，我看见了 Sai。他没有看到我，可有件事很不对劲。{w}他手里握着刀，正从储藏室里出来，朝楼梯那边看了一眼——那里什么都没有，他却明显吃了一惊。"

    # game/script.rpy:53990
    old "Slowly, I kept stepping back until I reached the lobby."
    new "我一步步缓缓后退，一直退到了大堂。"

    # game/script.rpy:53996
    old "The sound of his footsteps came from hallway B. Then, he started to open doors."
    new "他的脚步声从 B走廊传来。接着，他开始一扇扇地开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:53997
    old "Did he notice me?"
    new "他发现我了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:53998
    old "With his free hand, he'd been touching his mouth. He was the Sai who had chased us, and he was about to intercept the elevator with us inside."
    new "他另一只手一直按在嘴上。他就是追赶过我们的那个 Sai，正打算把载着我们的电梯截住。"

    # game/script.rpy:53999
    old "He's the one who said I would die. ...It's the Sai who locked me in the attic."
    new "说我会死的人就是他。……就是那个把我关进阁楼的 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:54003
    old "When he started getting closer, I approached hallway A."
    new "等他开始靠近，我便往 A走廊那边靠过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:54008
    old "That way, I avoided being seen as I returned to hallway C."
    new "这样一来，我回到 C走廊时就不会被看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:54009
    old "Sai appeared from the lobby and started to open doors in hallway A as well."
    new "Sai 从大堂出来，也开始一扇扇打开 A走廊的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:54010
    old "What the hell is he doing...? It seems like he's being silent on purpose."
    new "他到底在干什么……？看上去，他是故意不出声的。"

    # game/script.rpy:54014
    old "I knew he'd soon go up the floors, so I circled back to hallway B."
    new "我知道他很快就会上楼，便绕回 B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:54019
    old "My heart rate was increasing. I couldn't feel safe anymore. ...Why had Sai said that I would die, and why had he chased us with a knife?"
    new "我的心跳越来越快，再没有半点安全感。……Sai 为什么说我会死？又为什么提着刀追我们？"

    # game/script.rpy:54020
    old "His intentions were unfathomably enigmatic. However, I didn't think he'd declared my death because he'd already killed me. At one point, he'd stated that he'd be the one to kill me if he had to."
    new "他的用意深不可测。不过，我不觉得他是因为已经杀了我，才说我会死。他曾经说过，若真有必要，他会亲自动手杀我。"

    # game/script.rpy:54021
    old "And the knife he was holding... Where had he gotten it from? There was something to consider."
    new "还有他手里那把刀……是从哪里弄来的？这事值得琢磨。"

    # game/script.rpy:54022
    old "I'd seen him exiting the storeroom, but he was searching through hallway A. ...So, he'd been in the storeroom before inspecting its hallway."
    new "我看见他从储藏室出来，可他却在查看 A走廊。……也就是说，他先进了储藏室，之后才去查看 A走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:54023
    old "...Could he have come from the outside door? It can't be, can it? But it would explain the knife and how he was in the storeroom right after I left it."
    new "……他会不会是从外面那扇门进来的？不可能吧？可这样一来，刀的事，还有我前脚离开储藏室、他后脚就在里面的事，就都说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54033
    old "I heard something behind me and quickly hid myself in the cleaning room."
    new "身后传来动静，我赶紧躲进了清洁间。"

    # game/script.rpy:54034
    old "Who was that?"
    new "那是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:54035
    old "Someone had been in hallway B. When I considered it, I concluded it had to be Erina."
    new "刚才 B走廊里有人。我仔细想了想，断定那只能是 Erina。"

    # game/script.rpy:54036
    old "I froze, wondering if she could've seen me. I still had the Sekimeiya, but I really didn't want to activate it."
    new "我僵在原地，担心她是否看见了我。Sekimeiya 还在我手上，可我实在不想启动它。"

    # game/script.rpy:54039
    old "It seemed I hadn't been seen. I couldn't hear her, but she wasn't coming."
    new "看来她没看见我。我听不见她的声音，她也没有过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:54041
    old "I didn't know what was happening, so I had to stay there. For a while, nothing happened at all."
    new "我不知道外面发生了什么，只能待在这里。好一阵子，什么动静也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:54045
    old "That changed when someone started to get closer. The steps came from hallway C."
    new "直到有人靠近，情况才有了变化。脚步声是从 C走廊传来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:54047
    old "Are they coming over here? That's someone else, right?"
    new "是朝这边来了吗？那应该是另一个人吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:54048
    old "The sound got louder until it was coming from right behind the door.{w} However, the steps kept going."
    new "声音越来越近，最后已经到了门后。{w}然而那脚步没有停，继续往前走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54049
    old "This way of walking... It's got to be Sai."
    new "这种走法……一定是 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:54050
    old "Was he circling the floor again? He'd come from hallway C and disappeared toward the lobby side."
    new "他又在绕这一层吗？他从 C走廊过来，又朝大堂那个方向去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54051
    old "...{w}It didn't sound like he'd looked into all the rooms again, so I didn't understand."
    new "……{w}听这动静，他不像是把每个房间都又看了一遍，我不明白为什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:54053
    old "When the silence returned, it stayed for even longer."
    new "四周又安静下来，而且这次持续得更久。"

    # game/script.rpy:54054
    old "Did he go upstairs already?"
    new "他已经上楼了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:54055
    old "What about Erina? That must've been her, but where is she now...?"
    new "Erina 呢？刚才一定是她，可她现在在哪儿……？"

    # game/script.rpy:54060
    old "I thought about what would happen next in detail."
    new "我在脑中仔细推演了接下来会发生什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:54061
    old "Our past selves are in the attic, and they'll try to come back here soon. ...I guess I get how the chase started.{w} I think Sai was searching for someone while holding that knife. I don't know why, but it's very possible he wanted to find Atsuki."
    new "过去的我们还在阁楼，很快就会设法回到这里。……追捕是怎么开始的，我大概明白了。{w} Sai 当时握着那把刀，像是在找什么人。原因我不清楚，但他很可能是在找我。"

    # game/script.rpy:54062
    old "The elevator's on this floor, and Sai went up to search for Atsuki. When we called the elevator from the attic, he was on the third floor and heard it.{w} He probably figured it was empty, especially if he knew it was on the crystal floor. From his perspective, someone called it from the attic and was about to go back down."
    new "电梯停在这一层，而 Sai 上楼去找我了。我们从阁楼叫电梯的时候，他正在三楼，听见了动静。{w} 他大概以为电梯里没人——尤其如果他早就知道电梯停在水晶层。在他看来，是有人从阁楼叫了电梯，正要坐它下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:54063
    old "That's how he intercepted us. Seconds after he heard it, he called it from the third floor, knowing someone would be inside. ...If he was looking for someone in particular, that might be why he wasn't right outside when we opened the door."
    new "他就是这么拦住我们的。听见动静几秒后，他就从三楼叫了电梯，明知里面有人。……如果他要找的是某个特定的人，那我们开门时他不在门外，也就说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54064
    old "...How did the chase go down, though? We locked ourselves in the attic, but somehow he had another key to open it.{w} We thought we couldn't try to lock ourselves in a bedroom because he took the key, but it was still in the drawer when he and I teleported in there later.{w} But that's not all. I found out Sai had the keys to both bedrooms in his pocket, and he even frowned when he saw one was in the drawer. That must be why he didn't take it to trap us... Did he think it wouldn't be there because he'd already taken it?"
    new "……可那场追捕到底是怎么回事？我们把自己锁进了阁楼，他却不知从哪弄到另一把钥匙把门打开。{w} 我们以为不能躲进卧室上锁，是因为钥匙被他拿走了，可后来他和我传送到那里时，那把钥匙还躺在抽屉里。{w} 不止如此。我发现 Sai 口袋里两间卧室的钥匙都在，而且他看到抽屉里那把时还皱了眉。所以他没拿走钥匙来困住我们，多半就是这个原因……他是不是以为那钥匙早被自己拿走了，不该还留在那儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:54069
    old "After trying to escape, we'll all end up in the event room."
    new "逃跑失败之后，我们所有人都会聚到活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:54070
    old "I should be able to stay here and leave when that happens."
    new "我只要待在这里，等那时候再离开就好。"

    # game/script.rpy:54072
    old "I tried to loosen up. The cleaning cart was gone, so there was room on the floor to nervously walk in circles."
    new "我试着让自己放松些。清洁车已经推走了，地板空出一块，正好够我焦躁地来回踱步。"

    # game/script.rpy:54076
    old "...They should be here soon. The chase didn't go on for that long."
    new "……他们快到了。追捕并没有持续太久。"

    # game/script.rpy:54077
    old "I had to attentively listen for our arrival, but my heartbeat wouldn't let me focus."
    new "我必须凝神听我们过来的动静，可心跳声让我根本没法集中注意力。"

    # game/script.rpy:54078
    old "It was late into the day. {time=21} was close to two hours away, and I'd touched the Sekimeiya in the bathroom a while before that."
    new "天色已经晚了。距离 {time=21} 还有将近两个小时，而我在此前不久刚在洗手间碰过 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:54079
    old "The most important time was approaching, and I had no idea what to do."
    new "最关键的时刻越来越近，我却完全不知道该怎么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:54084
    old "I perceived the faint, running steps I'd known would come. We were going to the event room."
    new "我听见了那阵预料之中的微弱奔跑声。我们要去活动室了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54085
    old "Shortly after they faded, the same sound repeated, and it quickly approached me.{w} It was Sai. He had appeared from hallway B, running into Atsuki."
    new "脚步声刚远去不久，同样的声音又响了起来，并且迅速朝我逼近。{w} 是 Sai。他从 B走廊出现，一头撞上了我。"

    # game/script.rpy:54086
    old "To avoid being heard, he slowed down momentarily until he bumped against Atsuki."
    new "为了不让人听见，他稍稍放慢速度，直到撞上我才停下。"

    # game/script.rpy:54088
    old "They'll... be in the event room for a while. I should be able to leave now."
    new "他们……会在活动室待上一阵子。我现在应该可以走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54089
    old "I couldn't stay there, or else Atsuki would see me. Nervously, I turned the doorknob and slowly opened the door."
    new "我不能留在原地，否则会被我自己看见。我紧张地转动门把，慢慢推开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:54096
    old "The event room was open, and I could faintly hear our voices. I carefully slipped to hallway C."
    new "活动室的门开着，隐约能听见我们的说话声。我小心翼翼地溜到 C走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:54102
    old "I'll be fine here."
    new "我待在这里没事。"

    # game/script.rpy:54103
    old "...It won't take much for Sai to run out. Is it a good idea to try to see where he went?"
    new "……用不了多久 Sai 就会跑出来。去看看他往哪边跑了，这样妥当吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:54104
    old "\"If I don't intend to change the past, it won't change.\" As long as that notion was correct, I could peek out from where I was, knowing I wouldn't be seen."
    new "「只要我不打算改变过去，过去就不会改变。」只要这个前提成立，我就可以从原地探出头去，而不必担心被人看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:54105
    old "...He didn't have enough time to go to hallway C, did he...?"
    new "……他根本没时间跑到 C走廊吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:54106
    old "I didn't think so, and even if he had, his reappearance still wouldn't make sense."
    new "我不觉得他去了。而且就算他真去了，后来重新出现也说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:54108
    old "The Sekimeiya was getting too hot, urging me to drop it, but I resisted. So close to it, it was undeniable that it had been the emitter of the strange smell."
    new "Sekimeiya 越来越烫，几乎在逼我松手，我仍强忍着。靠得这么近，那阵古怪气味的来源毫无疑问就是它。"

    # game/script.rpy:54109
    old "While I awaited Sai's next move, I looked around me, wondering where Erina and Akaro were."
    new "我一边等着 Sai 的下一步动作，一边环顾四周，心想 Erina 和 Akaro 究竟在哪。"

    # game/script.rpy:54113
    old "Prepared to react, I stood in place. I couldn't hear us from there, but I knew I'd notice Sai's escape."
    new "我站在原地，随时准备应变。那个位置听不见我们的声音，但 Sai 一旦逃出来，我一定能察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:54114
    old "...Then it happened. He dashed out of the event room, his swift steps reaching me."
    new "……接着，他冲出了活动室，急促的脚步声传到我耳中。"

    # game/script.rpy:54115
    old "As fast as I could, I looked at the hallway."
    new "我立刻朝走廊望去。"

    # game/script.rpy:54125
    old "Confused, I hid myself before Atsuki saw me. Then, I glanced at the Sekimeiya.{w} ...I still had it."
    new "我一头雾水，趁 Atsuki 还没看见我，先藏了起来。随后我瞥了一眼 Sekimeiya。{w} ……它还在我手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:54126
    old "I don't get it. Why was he not found?"
    new "我不明白。他为什么没被发现？"

    # game/script.rpy:54127
    old "Sai had sprinted straight ahead, shutting himself inside room B4, where I'd just been.{w} Could there have been a third Sekimeiya? If not, his disappearance couldn't be explained."
    new "Sai 一路直冲，把自己关进了水晶展室 B4——那正是我刚才待的地方。{w} 难道还有第三个 Sekimeiya？若非如此，他的消失就无法解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:54132
    old "...Ah, no.{w} I think I know what he did."
    new "……啊，不对。{w} 我想我知道他做了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:54133
    old "At once, I understood what had happened. Sai had merely been playing with us. He hadn't lied about that."
    new "我顿时明白了是怎么回事。Sai 只是在耍我们。这一点他并没有说谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:54134
    old "...{w}It was absurd, but given his grin, I was sure it was the right answer. Something we'd told him had allowed him to pull it off."
    new "……{w}这太荒唐了，可一想到他那个笑容，我就确信答案正是如此。是我们告诉他的某件事，让他办成了这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:54147
    old "...No. I haven't killed anyone."
    new "没有。我没杀任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:54159
    old "We told him Erina died, but he knew the truth.{w} Before, when he was looking through the floor, he came across Erina. After that, she woke up and left the room. When I was in the cleaning room, Sai walked through the hallway again. Maybe he was drawn to the sound and saw Erina was gone.{w} In short, he knew she hadn't died and that she wasn't in that room anymore."
    new "我们告诉他 Erina 死了，可他知道真相。{w} 之前他在这一层搜寻时，撞见了 Erina。之后她醒了过来，离开了房间。我待在清洁间的时候，Sai 又从走廊经过。也许他是被声音引过去，发现 Erina 不见了。{w} 总之，他知道她没有死，也知道她已经不在那个房间了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54160
    old "That was how he'd thought of a way to outsmart us, just like he said. He ran to that crystal room and covered himself with the curtain to make Atsuki think Erina was still beneath it. ...That was his trick."
    new "他就是这样想出骗过我们的办法的，正如他所说。他跑进那间水晶展室，用遮布把自己盖住，让 Atsuki 以为 Erina 还在下面。……这就是他的把戏。"

    # game/script.rpy:54163
    old "I waited for Atsuki to enter the cleaning room and slowly stepped away."
    new "我等 Atsuki 走进清洁间，然后慢慢走开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54169
    old "We didn't have time to search this hallway, so I won't be found here."
    new "我们没时间搜这条走廊，所以我在这里不会被发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:54174
    old "I returned to the secret section of the cold storeroom. It was around the time Sai and I had traveled to the attic, so I'd soon have no understanding of what would happen below."
    new "我回到冷藏储藏室的秘密区域。时间差不多是 Sai 和我去阁楼的时候，所以很快我就对楼下发生的事一无所知了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54178
    old "After a few seconds, I looked down at the glowing gem. The strong heat around the Sekimeiya seemed to have lessened."
    new "几秒后，我低头看向那颗发光的宝石。Sekimeiya 周围灼人的高温似乎消退了一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:54179
    old "...Did it cool down a little?{w} It's still pretty hot, so it's not like I put it in the cold cabinets. That's weird."
    new "……它好像凉了一点？{w} 可还是挺烫的，我又没把它放进冰冷的展示柜里。真奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:54182
    old "It didn't matter. I knew I had to think. I had to come to a final conclusion..."
    new "那都无所谓了。我知道自己必须思考，必须得出一个最终的结论……"

    # game/script.rpy:54183
    old "But it was impossible. The time was rapidly approaching, and it didn't seem like I'd make a decision I wouldn't regret forever."
    new "可我做不到。时间正迅速逼近，而我恐怕终究做不出一个不会让自己抱憾终生的决定。"

    # game/script.rpy:54187
    old "While the minutes kept passing, it didn't feel like they were to me. I was firmly trapped, with very little time left."
    new "时间一分一秒地过去，可在我心里却仿佛停滞了。我被牢牢困住，剩下的时间已经不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:54188
    old "I hadn't heard our past selves in some time, so it was likely we'd already traveled."
    new "我已经有一阵子没听到过去的我们了，看来我们多半已经完成穿越了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54190
    old "Someone was walking in hallway A. Since I didn't know who it was, that meant my past self wasn't there anymore."
    new "A走廊里有人走动。既然我不知道那是谁，就说明过去的我已经不在那里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54191
    old "Who was it? It could've been Atsuki, Erina, or Akaro. Even though Sai had escaped from the attic, I didn't think it could've been him yet unless he traveled to the past."
    new "会是谁？Atsuki、Erina，还是 Akaro？Sai 虽然已经逃出了阁楼，但除非他穿越到过去，否则应该还不可能是他。"

    # game/script.rpy:54195
    old "Soon, identical-sounding steps passed by. They headed up the stairs."
    new "不久，一阵听起来一模一样的脚步声经过，朝楼梯上去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54196
    old "They just left the floor. ...I wonder if it was Atsuki."
    new "他们刚离开这一层。……不知道那是不是 Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:54198
    old "I wanted to leave, and that was a good time. I hadn't been able to get rid of the Sekimeiya, and I had the opportunity to leave it in the cold."
    new "我想出去，而此刻正是好时机。我一直没能把 Sekimeiya 脱手，如今正好有机会把它留在寒冷的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:54205
    old "I couldn't see or hear anyone, so I stepped to the event room and slowly looked through the door."
    new "我看不到也听不到任何人，于是走到活动室，慢慢从门口往里看。"

    # game/script.rpy:54211
    old "It was empty. Most importantly, the Sekimeiya wasn't on the floor, which meant someone had been there after our travel."
    new "里面空无一人。最重要的是，Sekimeiya 并不在地上——这说明在我们穿越之后，有人来过这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:54212
    old "...It was probably Atsuki."
    new "……多半是 Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:54216
    old "I moved to hallway B and walked to the crystal room in front."
    new "我转到B走廊，走向前方的水晶展室。"

    # game/script.rpy:54222
    old "Next to Naomi's body, the red curtain lay by itself. Without wasting time, I did what I'd planned earlier and left the Sekimeiya sealed away in the very first cabinet where we'd found it. When I closed it, a sound indicated it had locked automatically.{w} The wheel appeared damaged, but it still worked, so I was able to set the temperature to 0 °C."
    new "Naomi 的尸体旁，红色遮布孤零零地落在地上。我没有耽搁，按先前想好的做法，把 Sekimeiya 封进我们最初发现它的那个展示柜里。关上柜门时，一声轻响表明它已自动上锁。{w} 转盘看上去有损坏，但还能用，我便把温度设成了 0 °C。"

    # game/script.rpy:54230
    old "Hm, it might not be a good idea to go back."
    new "嗯，回去恐怕不是个好主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:54231
    old "Atsuki told me that he searched for me. If he comes from the stairs while I'm in the storeroom, I won't be able to leave before I'm found. ...If I'm here, I can avoid being seen by circling the hallways, like I did earlier with Sai."
    new "Atsuki 说过他找过我。要是我在储藏室里，而他正好从楼梯过来，我根本来不及离开就会被发现。……待在这里的话，我可以像刚才躲开 Sai 那样，绕着走廊走，避开别人的视线。"

    # game/script.rpy:54232
    old "I realized something. Up until then, there'd been reasons to avoid being seen. At the point I had reached, however, it wouldn't mean that much."
    new "我忽然意识到一件事。此前我躲避别人的目光，总有种种理由；可到了现在这一步，被看见与否已经没那么要紧了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54233
    old "My past self is in the attic, so as long as she can't see me, it shouldn't matter. ...I can be a bit calmer about that, then."
    new "过去的我在阁楼里，只要她看不到我，应该就没事。……既然如此，我倒是可以稍微安心一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:54234
    old "Technically, I was guaranteed to be seen again—it was what I'd been told.{w} Not knowing what would happen was a little nerve-wracking, but Sai had been one person to see me. There was a bit of time left until that could happen, as he'd been in the attic for a while."
    new "严格来说，我注定还会被人看见——这是别人告诉过我的。{w} 不知道会发生什么，多少让人心里发紧，不过 Sai 就是会看见我的人之一。距离那一刻还有些时间，毕竟他在阁楼里待了好一阵子。"

    # game/script.rpy:54241
    old "...Where the hell are Erina and Akaro?{w} It's been so long since anyone saw Akaro. The one who came to the bedroom wasn't the same one who left with Sai. ...I know he's here, though."
    new "……Erina 和 Akaro 到底跑哪去了？{w} 已经这么久没人见过 Akaro 了。来卧室的那个，并不是跟 Sai 一起离开的那个。……可我知道他就在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:54242
    old "I waited, expecting to hear someone at any point. Until then, the floor seemed deserted."
    new "我等着，以为随时会听见有人过来。而在那之前，这一层似乎空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:54250
    old "It was minutes later when I turned to the lobby. I felt like I'd heard someone there."
    new "过了好几分钟，我才转向大厅。我好像听见那边有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:54252
    old "Is there anyone there? I expected them to come from the stairs."
    new "那边有人吗？我以为会有人从楼梯过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:54253
    old "Seconds passed, and I hadn't heard anything else."
    new "几秒过去，再没有别的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:54257
    old "...I could've been mistaken, so I slowly stepped to the door."
    new "……也许是我听错了，于是我慢慢走向门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:54264
    old "...No one."
    new "……没人。"

    # game/script.rpy:54268
    old "Had I imagined it...? I entered, drawn once again by the blood ahead. Without a doubt, it was where the bigger pool had been earlier."
    new "是我幻听了吗……？我走了进去，又一次被前方的血迹引了过去。毫无疑问，那里正是先前那摊较大的血迹所在的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:54274
    old "...!{w} I didn't imagine it this time. There's someone in hallway A."
    new "……！{w} 这次不是错觉。A走廊里有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:54275
    old "I retreated slowly."
    new "我慢慢退了回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:54284
    old "Wait. There's someone in hallway B as well...!"
    new "等等，B走廊里也有人……！"

    # game/script.rpy:54286
    old "I doubted what to do as I approached the mechanical room."
    new "我走到机械室前，心里拿不定主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:54290
    old "...I see. This is why I'll be seen. I can't enter either hallway, so as soon as someone comes here, they'll find me. It'll probably happen even if I go down."
    new "……原来如此。这就是我会被看见的原因。两条走廊我都进不去，只要有人来到这里，就会立刻发现我。就算我下楼，恐怕也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:54294
    old "...{w}My only move was to wait. When I thought about it, I realized that being found wasn't so bad."
    new "……{w}我能做的只有等。仔细想想，被人发现其实也不算太糟。"

    # game/script.rpy:54295
    old "As long as Atsuki was one of the people I'd heard, I could stop worrying about my well-being. If I was with him until my past self left the attic, I knew Sai and Akaro wouldn't be a threat because Atsuki hadn't said that something had happened to me."
    new "只要我听到的人里有 Atsuki，我就不必再担心自己的安危。只要跟他待在一起，直到过去的我离开阁楼，Sai 和 Akaro 就不会构成威胁——毕竟 Atsuki 从没说过我出过什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:54296
    old "But what would I tell him...? No matter how much I wanted to talk to him, what could I possibly say...?"
    new "可是，我该跟他说什么……？无论我多么想和他说话，又能说些什么呢……？"

    # game/script.rpy:54297
    old "The Atsuki from this morning... where is he?{w} Will I ever find him again? ...He was a future version of the Atsuki here, but how will everything lead into what happened? How will he end up at the beginning of this day?"
    new "今天早晨的 Atsuki……他在哪里？{w} 我还能再见到他吗？……他是这里那个 Atsuki 的未来版本，可这一切究竟是怎样一步步变成后来那样的？他又怎么会在这一天刚开始时出现？"

    # game/script.rpy:54298
    old "After my past self traveled to November, could I stay with Atsuki? Even though it was possible the exit wouldn't open, could I just stay with him? According to him, a Shiroya who wasn't the \"real Shiroya\" would appear. ...Was it possible for me to change reality in a way so that wouldn't occur...?"
    new "等过去的我穿越到十一月之后，我能留在 Atsuki 身边吗？就算出口有可能打不开，我也能就这样陪着他吗？据他说，会出现一个不是「真正的 Shiroya」的 Shiroya。……我能不能改变现实，让那种事不再发生……？"

    # game/script.rpy:54299
    old "...The end was very uncertain, even more than the first time I'd gone through it. I didn't know what would happen, what I would do, or what I could do."
    new "……结局悬而未决，比我第一次经历时还要不确定。我不知道会发生什么，不知道自己会做什么，也不知道自己能做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:54303
    old "...{w}It didn't seem like anything was happening. I'd been expecting either door to open, but a few still minutes had already passed."
    new "……{w}似乎什么都没发生。我一直等着哪扇门被打开，可寂静的几分钟已经过去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54304
    old "I know I didn't imagine it. There was someone in both hallways. I guess it's just a matter of time since I know for a fact I'll be seen."
    new "我确定那不是错觉。两条走廊里都有人。既然我确信自己会被看见，那也只是时间问题了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54306
    old "Hm...{w} could it be that I have already been seen? What if I didn't know about it, but it already happened?"
    new "嗯……{w} 会不会其实我已经被看见了？也许我并不知道，但那件事早已发生？"

    # game/script.rpy:54307
    old "It didn't seem likely that I'd just be ignored, but I had no way to know. No matter what, there was nothing else I could do but stay in place."
    new "我不太可能就这样被人无视，但我也无从确认。无论如何，除了待在原地，我别无他法。"

    # game/script.rpy:54315
    old "...roya!{w=0.7} Hey!{w=0.5} Wher— ...you!?"
    new "……roya！{w=0.7} 喂！{w=0.5} 你在哪—— ……你！？"

    # game/script.rpy:54316
    old "Wh—{w} Atsuki?"
    new "什——{w} Atsuki？"

    # game/script.rpy:54318
    old "What's happening...?"
    new "这是怎么回事……？"

    # game/script.rpy:54320
    old "Like a sharp needle, Atsuki's voice pierced into my chest. The pain in those words wasn't one I'd heard before."
    new "Atsuki 的声音如尖针般刺进我的胸口。那话语里透出的痛楚，是我从未听过的。"

    # game/script.rpy:54325
    old "In the sudden manner they'd started, the shouts faded with a wail. Then, in their place came a shrill cry."
    new "喊声来得突然，去得也突然，最后化作一声哀号。紧接着，取而代之的是一阵尖利的哭喊。"

    # game/script.rpy:54326
    old "Atsuki was sobbing like a broken person."
    new "Atsuki 泣不成声，整个人都垮了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54330
    old "With a trembling hand, I grabbed the knob."
    new "我伸出手，颤抖着握住门把。"

    # game/script.rpy:54337
    old "As I pulled the door open, I saw Atsuki on the floor. He wasn't just crying—he was shaking. He was a wreck."
    new "我拉开门，只见 Atsuki 瘫坐在地上。他不只是在哭——整个人都在发抖，已经彻底崩溃了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54338
    old "H-Hey..."
    new "喂、喂……"

    # game/script.rpy:54339
    old "...My hoarse voice didn't reach him.{w} Gently, and trying not to stagger, I took a step forward."
    new "……我沙哑的声音没能传到他耳中。{w}我尽量不让自己踉跄，轻轻向前迈了一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:54343
    old "When he saw me, he gathered himself enough to stop shaking and warily stood up."
    new "看到我，他勉强压下颤抖，警惕地站起身来。"

    # game/script.rpy:54353
    old "...{w}I didn't know what to say. When his eyes pierced into mine, any words I could have prepared flew out of my mind."
    new "……{w}我不知道该说什么。他的目光直直刺过来，我事先想好的话全都想不起来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54355
    old "The same person...? I'm not. Not in the sense he means."
    new "同一个人……？不是。至少不是他说的那个意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:54356
    old "It felt like my voice was stuck in my throat, and my thoughts were all over the place. ...Had that exact conversation always happened while I'd been in the attic?"
    new "我的声音像卡在喉咙里，思绪也乱成一团。……我待在阁楼的时候，这段对话每次都会发生吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:54361
    old "I stopped myself. From hallway C, a figure approached."
    new "我打住了话头。有人正从 C走廊那边走来。"

    # game/script.rpy:54375
    old "...It was Erina. The look in her eyes and her way of walking had cut me off.{w} When Atsuki turned around, he hardly reacted, so I was unsure if he already knew what had happened to her."
    new "……是 Erina。她的眼神和走路的姿态让我把话咽了回去。{w}Atsuki 回过头，却几乎没什么反应，我拿不准他是否已经知道她出了什么事。"

    # game/script.rpy:54392
    old "It was the Erina we'd assumed was dead. Her clothes were stained with blood, and she appeared to be groggy."
    new "那是我们以为早已死去的 Erina。她的衣服上沾满血迹，人看上去昏昏沉沉的。"

    # game/script.rpy:54394
    old "In response to that, Erina slowly knitted her brow."
    new "听了这话，Erina 慢慢皱起眉头。"

    # game/script.rpy:54425
    old "I stepped to the door. Of course, Erina's body was no longer there."
    new "我走到门口。果然，Erina 的尸体已经不在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54444
    old "I nodded. When we found Erina, the shock of Katei's death was still affecting us. We hadn't checked to confirm her death because we hadn't even doubted it."
    new "我点了点头。发现 Erina 的时候，我们还沉浸在 Katei 之死的打击中。我们从未怀疑过她是否已死，自然也没有去确认。"

    # game/script.rpy:54470
    old "I had no idea what that was about. I'd been in the room when she had appeared, but I hadn't sensed anything like that."
    new "我完全不明白那到底是怎么回事。她出现的时候我就在房间里，却什么也没感觉到。"

    # game/script.rpy:54477
    old "I smiled and felt a wave of relief. It didn't matter that I didn't know why I was there again—those words had been the most sincere of my life."
    new "我笑了，心里一阵释然。自己为何又回到了这里，已经不重要——那句话，是我这辈子说得最真心的一句。"

    # game/script.rpy:54510
    old "He looked at me in case I had an objection. Even after everything that had happened, that still should've been correct, so I nodded uncertainly."
    new "他看向我，像是在等我有异议。事到如今，那按理说依然没错，我便迟疑地点了点头。"

    # game/script.rpy:54521
    old "Atsuki and I looked at each other, and I wondered about her proposition. What would happen if Erina changed the past? What would happen to the world and to us?"
    new "我和 Atsuki 面面相觑，心里琢磨着她的提议。如果 Erina 改变了过去，会怎么样？世界会怎样，我们又会怎样？"

    # game/script.rpy:54526
    old "I don't know why I didn't think of it earlier. Someone killed her a few hours ago, so I just have to go to that time and prevent it."
    new "真奇怪，我怎么早没想到。几个小时前有人杀了她，那我只要回到那个时间，阻止这件事就行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54527
    old "Saving Isla was something I could do. It should've been possible, given what I knew."
    new "救 Isla，我做得到。据我所知，这事应该能成。"

    # game/script.rpy:54528
    old "But I couldn't find the Sekimeiya. I kept looking at Isla's face for a very long time, and she told me that she could be saved. Then, I saw a girl, and after that I heard you shouting."
    new "可是我没找到 Sekimeiya。我盯着 Isla 的脸看了很久很久，她对我说，她还能得救。然后我看见一个女孩，再之后，就听见你在喊。"

    # game/script.rpy:54539
    old "Oh, she did? I wonder if she's talking about the time before she fell unconscious, when I was in the crystal room with her."
    new "哦，是这样吗？不知道她说的是不是她昏过去之前、我和她一起待在水晶展室的那段时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:54553
    old "I knew where one was, but I couldn't bring myself to say it. Once again, the decision of whether to change the past had to be made, and I couldn't do it."
    new "我知道其中一个在哪儿，却怎么也说不出口。又一次，我必须决定是否要改变过去，而我做不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:54564
    old "...{w}Is he not? Who has the Sekimeiya Sai and I traveled with?{w} ...If he does, I understand why he'd lie. Right now, he believes the past can't be changed."
    new "……{w} 真的没在说谎吗？Sai 和我一起穿越时用的那个 Sekimeiya，如今在谁手上？{w} ……如果在他那儿，我明白他为什么要说谎。眼下他相信过去是无法改变的。"

    # game/script.rpy:54565
    old "Actually, that's right. He changed his mind on that before I got out of the attic. He said he'd changed the past."
    new "其实，确实如此。我还没离开阁楼的时候，他就已经改变看法了。他说他改变过过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:54566
    old "I frowned. ...What exactly was going to happen?"
    new "我皱起眉。……接下来究竟会发生什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:54578
    old "It seemed Erina was seeing through us. Discontent, she walked to the event room."
    new "看来 Erina 已经看穿了我们的心思。她一脸不快，往活动室走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:54598
    old "The Sekimeiya's here... Did Atsuki leave it in the cabinet? I don't think he would have."
    new "Sekimeiya 就在这里……是 Atsuki 把它留在展示柜里的吗？我觉得他不会这么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:54603
    old "I looked at him. As I'd thought, he was visibly confused—the Sekimeiya shouldn't have been there."
    new "我看向他。果然，他一脸困惑——Sekimeiya 本不该在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:54609
    old "Erina opened the glass and rolled the Sekimeiya into her purse, not wanting to touch it for the time being. Following that, she immediately let the curtain fall back down."
    new "Erina 掀开玻璃罩，把 Sekimeiya 拨进手袋里，暂时不想让皮肤碰到它。随后，她立刻把遮布放了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:54612
    old "After a long silence, the hallway A door opened. When we looked over, someone was stepping into the room."
    new "漫长的沉默之后，A走廊的门打开了。我们望过去时，有人正走进房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:54623
    old "It was Sai. He had already escaped from the attic."
    new "是 Sai。他已经从阁楼逃出来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54674
    old "\"Sorting something out\". I couldn't help but react, as I knew he had just locked my past self in the attic."
    new "“理清一些事”。听他这么说，我忍不住有了反应——他明明才把过去的我锁进阁楼，这事我再清楚不过。"

    # game/script.rpy:54695
    old "Out of nowhere, Erina took out a piece of paper from her purse and handed it to Atsuki. I saw some black letters on it, but I didn't recognize what it was.{w} Immediately, he stashed it in his pocket."
    new "Erina 冷不防从手提包里抽出一张纸，递给 Atsuki。纸上写着些黑色的字，可我认不出那是什么。{w}他立刻把它塞进了口袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:54728
    old "...A personal paper? I didn't think I'd seen it before.{w} When I glanced at him, he immediately looked away, leaving me a little surprised."
    new "……私人纸条？我印象里从没见过。{w}我朝他瞥了一眼，他立刻把视线移开，让我有些意外。"

    # game/script.rpy:54762
    old "What...? What just happened?"
    new "什么……？刚才发生什么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:54763
    old "That's not possible. How could she have seen Miiya!?"
    new "不可能。她怎么会见过 Miiya！？"

    # game/script.rpy:54794
    old "That was the biggest blow I'd been dealt in a long time. I'd grown to think I partially understood what had happened, but a few words were enough to shatter everything.{w} What did it mean? Could it have been another prediction from the world? Had my own decision been handed to me, confirming that I would save Miiya?{w} There was no way—that didn't make sense. If I'd changed the past, many more things would've differed as well."
    new "这是很久以来我受到的最重的一击。我原以为自己已经大致弄懂了发生的事，可几句话就足以把这一切击得粉碎。{w}那到底意味着什么？难道又是世界给出的某种预示？还是说，我自己的决定已经被提前摆在了我面前，等于确认我会去救 Miiya？{w}不可能——这说不通。如果我真改变了过去，该有更多事情随之不同才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:54803
    old "She told me her name, but she didn't look lost or anything. She knew me, too...{w} She just suddenly ran away, and I haven't seen her again. I definitely thought I hadn't seen her before, but I honestly wasn't sure."
    new "她告诉了我她的名字，可她看起来并不像迷了路。她还认识我……{w}后来她突然就跑了，我再也没见到她。我本来确实觉得自己从没见过她，可说实话，我也不太确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:54804
    old "...{w}There was no way to make sense of what she was saying. It seemed the structure of the world had been warped beyond comprehension."
    new "……{w}她说的这些话根本无从理解。就好像这个世界的结构已经被扭曲到无法想象的地步。"

    # game/script.rpy:54836
    old "Was Atsuki right? I didn't know anymore—I'd never known. Saving Miiya alongside everyone else was supposed to be possible, because traveling days to the past could soon occur. How did that tie into what Erina said, though? There was no longer anything that made sense."
    new "Atsuki 说得对吗？我已经不知道了——从来就没知道过。把 Miiya 和其他所有人一起救下，本该是可行的，因为穿越回几天前的过去很快就会实现。可这和 Erina 说的话又怎么对得上？如今已经没有一件事说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54853
    old "I'd say so. Yes, it's been almost fifteen minutes since I arrived."
    new "我看是。对，从我到这里算起，已经快十五分钟了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54883
    old "Sai had kept lying to Erina, claiming fifteen minutes was long enough to go hours back. However, I couldn't be entirely sure that was impossible.{w} As she got her hand closer to her purse, the three of us stepped back. Given what we knew about the range, we were outside of it."
    new "Sai 一直对 Erina 撒谎，说十五分钟就足以回到好几个小时之前。可我也不能完全确定那绝无可能。{w}她的手一点点靠近手提包，我们三人齐齐后退。按我们所知的作用范围，我们已经在范围之外了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54884
    old "But I was concerned. Were we highly mistaken about how the range worked? I didn't stop retreating until Erina's hand contacted the Sekimeiya."
    new "可我还是担心。我们对作用范围的理解，会不会错得离谱？我一直退到 Erina 的手碰到 Sekimeiya 才停下。"

    # game/script.rpy:54887
    old "And when it did, something I hadn't even imagined occurred."
    new "而就在那一刻，发生了我连想都没想过的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:54892
    old "Sai was the only person to disappear."
    new "只有 Sai 一个人消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54902
    old "I was speechless. Erina had touched the Sekimeiya, and we'd been farther away than Sai. It didn't make any sense why he was the only one to vanish."
    new "我一时语塞。碰到Sekimeiya的是Erina，而我们站得比Sai还远。为什么唯独他消失了，我完全想不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:54908
    old "It was almost laughable. We'd always been so far from the truth."
    new "这几乎让人发笑。我们一直离真相那么远。"

    # game/script.rpy:54915
    old "No matter what I thought, it didn't make sense. I couldn't even come up with a baseless explanation."
    new "不管我怎么想，都理不出头绪。连毫无根据的解释，我也想不出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:54922
    old "Erina's wide eyes were fixed on her purse. ...It was empty."
    new "Erina瞪大了眼睛，死死盯着自己的手提包。……里面空空如也。"

    # game/script.rpy:54923
    old "Wait, what...?{w} The Sekimeiya disappeared?"
    new "等等，什么……？{w} Sekimeiya不见了？"

    # game/script.rpy:54928
    old "Perplexed, Atsuki walked to the cabinet. When he raised the curtain, we saw the Sekimeiya sitting comfortably behind the glass."
    new "Atsuki一脸困惑地走向展示柜。他掀起遮布，只见Sekimeiya安安稳稳地待在玻璃后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:54929
    old "Did it... teleport to the cabinet? This has to be what Atsuki talked about."
    new "它……传送回展示柜了？这肯定就是Atsuki说过的那种情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:54940
    old "No... That's not it."
    new "不……不是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:54941
    old "The Sekimeiya didn't teleport. ...That's wrong."
    new "Sekimeiya并没有传送。……这种说法不对。"

    # game/script.rpy:54942
    old "I thought back on what had just happened."
    new "我回想了一遍刚刚发生的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:54949
    old "\"Erina opened the glass and rolled the Sekimeiya into her purse, not wanting to touch it for the time being. Following that, she immediately let the curtain fall back down.\""
    new "Erina打开玻璃罩，暂时不想碰到Sekimeiya，便把它拨进了自己的手提包。随后，她立刻把遮布放了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:54955
    old "\"Perplexed, Atsuki walked to the cabinet. When he raised the curtain, we saw the Sekimeiya sitting comfortably behind the glass.\""
    new "Atsuki一脸困惑地走向展示柜。他掀起遮布，只见Sekimeiya安安稳稳地待在玻璃后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:54961
    old "She didn't close the glass before lowering the curtain, but it's closed right now anyway. ...The Sekimeiya didn't teleport."
    new "她放下遮布之前并没有关上玻璃，可现在玻璃却是关着的。……Sekimeiya没有传送。"

    # game/script.rpy:54964
    old "I looked at the floor, and my heart skipped a beat. There was no drop of blood."
    new "我看向地面，心脏猛地一跳。那里没有一滴血。"

    # game/script.rpy:54965
    old "Then, the reason why only Sai disappeared..."
    new "那么，只有Sai消失的原因……"

    # game/script.rpy:54981
    old "Before we could react, Atsuki went to hallway B. I left Erina behind and saw him entering the staff room."
    new "我们还没回过神，Atsuki已经走向B走廊。我把Erina留在原地，看着他走进了员工室。"

    # game/script.rpy:54986
    old "Oh, was I right? ...But I don't get it. The Sekimeiya shouldn't have been in the cabinet."
    new "哦，我猜对了？……可我还是不明白。Sekimeiya本来不该在展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:54991
    old "He promptly came back out."
    new "他很快就出来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:54995
    old "I see. So it is as I thought."
    new "原来如此。果然跟我想的一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:55029
    old "Sai appeared from the lobby."
    new "Sai 从大厅那边出现了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55036
    old "On his face, there was only shock. I saw it very well, as his eyes were boring a hole through me."
    new "他满脸只剩震惊。他两眼直直盯着我，像要把我看穿一样，我看得清清楚楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:55043
    old "Before I recovered from hearing that, someone came from the event room."
    new "还没等我从刚才那句话中回过神，就有人从活动室走了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:55053
    old "It was Akaro, and I understood. It was the time when Atsuki had seen him again; it wasn't happening for the first time."
    new "是 Akaro。我明白了——这是我再次见到他的那一刻，这样的事已经不是第一次了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55068
    old "Dead? ...When did I die? Did it happen again?"
    new "死了？……我什么时候死的？难道又发生了一次？"

    # game/script.rpy:55077
    old "...There was no question. That Sai wasn't the same person we'd just been with."
    new "……毫无疑问。那个 Sai 并不是刚才和我们在一起的那个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:55128
    old "...What? How could that possibly not be true?"
    new "……什么？这怎么可能不是真的？"

    # game/script.rpy:55134
    old "I nodded, puzzled."
    new "我有些困惑，点了点头。"

    # game/script.rpy:55159
    old "...I'm going to die? That's not true. It has to be another false fate, spawned the same way as the other."
    new "……我会死？不会的。那一定是又一个虚假的命运，产生的方式和先前那个一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:55189
    old "Well, you get what I mean. You don't remember when you got attacked or where you came from very well, right?{w} Of course, Erina and Isla have been here the whole time, but not you."
    new "总之，你明白我的意思。你不太记得自己什么时候遭到袭击、又是从哪里来的，对吧？{w}当然，Erina 和 Isla 一直在这里，可你不是。"

    # game/script.rpy:55195
    old "The Sekimeiya had disappeared as soon as Erina touched it. In the storeroom, the same thing had happened to me."
    new "Erina 一碰到 Sekimeiya，它便消失了。在储藏室里，我也遇到过同样的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:55202
    old "I looked around, wondering where I was."
    new "我环顾四周，想弄清自己身在何处。"

    # game/script.rpy:55213
    old "Above the door to the lobby, a camera focused its lens on us. Unlike all the others, no smoke was on its smooth surface."
    new "大厅门上方的摄像头把镜头对准了我们。与其余的摄像头不同，它光滑的镜面上没有沾上烟尘。"

    # game/script.rpy:55214
    old "And the green light isn't there.{w} It's... that world. The one from this morning."
    new "而且绿灯也没有亮。{w}这是……那个世界。今天早上的那个。"

    # game/script.rpy:55216
    old "Then, that Atsuki... Is he here? When Naomi touched the Sekimeiya, I'm sure he stayed behind."
    new "那么，那个 Atsuki……他在这里吗？Naomi 碰到 Sekimeiya 的时候，我肯定他留在了那边。"

    # game/script.rpy:55241
    old "Before he could say anything, I took off for hallway C."
    new "他还没来得及开口，我已经朝 C走廊跑去。"

    # game/script.rpy:55252
    old "There was a reason I had to do that."
    new "我这么做，是有原因的。"

    # game/script.rpy:55253
    old "The Atsuki from that morning... It was very possible he was somewhere, and I really wanted to find him again."
    new "今天早上的那个 Atsuki……他很可能就在某处，我真的很想再见到他。"

    # game/script.rpy:55254
    old "The attic had been where we'd parted, but I had to go alone. He was a future version of the Atsuki I'd just been with."
    new "我们是在阁楼分开的，但这一趟我必须独自前往。他是刚才和我在一起的 Atsuki 的未来之身。"

    # game/script.rpy:55255
    old "I'd concluded that two versions of the same person could never interact with each other because it was a real paradox devoid of origin. ...And paradoxes were impossibilities. If Atsuki came with me, it would guarantee I'd never find his future self. In the world we were in, it was very possible the door to the attic had been open, how we'd left it."
    new "我得出的结论是：同一个人的两个版本绝不可能彼此接触，因为那将是没有源头的真正悖论。……而悖论不可能存在。若 Atsuki 与我同去，我便注定找不到他的未来之身。在我们所处的这个世界里，通往阁楼的门很可能还像我们离开时那样敞开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:55256
    old "Going by myself, I could find him. He was the future version of the Atsuki I'd just been with.{w} I'd just told him I was going there, so if his future self was in that world, I knew he would be waiting."
    new "独自前去，我才能找到他。他是刚才那个 Atsuki 的未来之身。{w}我刚对他说过我要去阁楼，所以只要他的未来之身在这个世界，我知道他一定在等。"

    # game/script.rpy:55257
    old "And it would let me verify my conclusion—that there was no past self of mine locked in a bedroom."
    new "而且，这也能验证我的结论——并没有过去的我被锁在某间卧室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:55265
    old "When I confirmed I wasn't being followed, I exhaled in relief. I tried to open the elevator, but it wasn't there."
    new "确认没人跟来后，我松了口气。我试着打开电梯门，可电梯不在。"

    # game/script.rpy:55266
    old "...I should use it. If he's on another floor, he'll at least hear me."
    new "……得用它才行。他要是就在别的楼层，至少能听见我这边的动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:55267
    old "I pressed the button and waited for the elevator."
    new "我按下按钮，等着电梯上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:55273
    old "Once it had come, I stepped inside. The \"7\" button wasn't available, but I still had the key to the attic.{w} After getting it out of my purse, I enabled the button and pressed it to start ascending."
    new "电梯到了，我走进去。「7」楼的按钮无法按下，可阁楼的钥匙还在我手上。{w}我从手提包里取出钥匙，解除了按钮的锁定，按下它，电梯开始上行。"

    # game/script.rpy:55278
    old "On the way, my anticipation compounded, my heartbeat meshed with the slight friction of the ropes above."
    new "上升途中，我的期待越积越重，心跳与头顶钢索轻微的摩擦声交叠在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:55284
    old "Upon arriving, I slowly opened the door, revealing an empty hallway."
    new "到了之后，我缓缓推开门，门外是一条空荡的走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:55288
    old "I stepped out and walked to the turn. As soon as I looked ahead, it was settled: my past self wasn't there, and both bedrooms were open."
    new "我走出电梯，来到拐角。一望向前方，事情便已明了：过去的我并不在那里，两间卧室的门都开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:55289
    old "...But where was Atsuki? It didn't seem like anyone was there."
    new "……可 Atsuki 在哪里？看上去这里没有别人。"

    # game/script.rpy:55294
    old "I headed to the living room and looked at the floor."
    new "我走向客厅，低头看向地板。"

    # game/script.rpy:55295
    old "These footprints... They're very recent."
    new "这些脚印……还很新。"

    # game/script.rpy:55296
    old "Then, a sound came from the stairs. Fixing my eyes on the door, I noticed it was approaching."
    new "这时，楼梯那头传来声响。我盯住门，听出那声音正一步步靠近。"

    # game/script.rpy:55297
    old "And finally, it opened.{w} The person behind it... Were they the one I wanted to see?"
    new "终于，门开了。{w}门后的人……是我想见的人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:55306
    old "There you are... You did come.{w} I'd forgotten you had the key to the attic."
    new "你来了……你真的来了。{w}我都忘了，阁楼的钥匙在你手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:55307
    old "Are you... the Atsuki from this morning?"
    new "你是……今天早上的那个 Atsuki？"

    # game/script.rpy:55312
    old "Yeah. I'm glad I wasn't wrong."
    new "嗯。还好我没猜错。"

    # game/script.rpy:55313
    old "Y-You knew I would be here, right? You remembered what happened."
    new "你、你知道我会来，对吧？你还记得发生过的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:55314
    old "He nodded.{w} That was it. I'd finally found him. We just had to stay together from that point on."
    new "他点了点头。{w}就是这样。我终于找到他了。从今往后，我们只要待在一起就好。"

    # game/script.rpy:55315
    old "What had happened after I'd traveled didn't matter anymore. As long as I stayed with Atsuki, we would be together at {time=21}, which he had lived through once already."
    new "我穿越之后发生了什么，已经不重要了。只要和 Atsuki 待在一起，到了 {time=21}，我们就会在一起——那个时刻，他已经经历过一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:55316
    old "I was so relieved, and he looked the same. However, there was something else on his face. ...I felt it was exhaustion."
    new "我如释重负，他看上去也一样。可他的脸上还带着别的什么。……我觉得那是疲惫。"

    # game/script.rpy:55319
    old "Have you been here all this time? When you disappeared this morning, I tried to find you, but I was in another world, right?"
    new "你一直待在这里吗？今天早上你消失之后，我想去找你，可那时我已经在另一个世界了，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:55324
    old "I... think so. I learned a lot of things. It's been longer than you think since I saw you."
    new "我……想是吧。我弄清了很多事。我上次见你，已经是很久以前的事了，比你想象的要久得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:55325
    old "What do you mean? You said the recording was real, right? What happened at {time=21}? And why did both of us appear at the start of today?"
    new "什么意思？你说过那段录音是真的，对吧？{time=21} 到底发生了什么？还有，为什么我们两个都出现在今天刚开始的时候？"

    # game/script.rpy:55330
    old "...Why did we travel to this morning?{w} I know the answer now."
    new "……我们为什么会穿越到今天早上？{w}现在我知道答案了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55336
    old "I remember what you told me. You said you traveled to the 30th of November, and that a few days later, you touched the Sekimeiya in the tower. Is that right?"
    new "我记得你跟我说过的话。你说你穿越到了 11 月 30 日，几天之后，在塔里碰了 Sekimeiya。是这样吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:55337
    old "Y-Yes. That's when I appeared with you in the lobby."
    new "是、是的。我就是在那时和你一起出现在大厅的。"

    # game/script.rpy:55342
    old "No, that's wrong. I know what happened to you."
    new "不，不对。我知道你身上发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:55343
    old "For a moment, I was lost. What did that mean? ...What had happened to me?"
    new "我一时茫然。那是什么意思？……我身上究竟发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:55344
    old "You didn't go to November... You went to the future."
    new "你没有去 11 月……你去的是未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:55349
    old "...Wh-What? No I didn't. I went two weeks to the past."
    new "……什、什么？不可能。我明明是穿越回了两周前。"

    # game/script.rpy:55354
    old "I don't know why you think that, but I believe you went to the future.{w} You said that you entered the tower in early December. I believe that was the 5th of January instead."
    new "我不知道你为什么会这么想，但我相信你去的是未来。{w}你说过，你是在 12 月初进入塔里的。我认为那其实是 1 月 5 日。"

    # game/script.rpy:55355
    old "The 5th of January? That doesn't make any sense."
    new "1 月 5 日？这根本说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:55356
    old "It didn't... make any sense. ...Did it?{w} The days I'd spent in my apartment. That had been in December, hadn't it?"
    new "这根本……说不通。……对吧？{w}我在公寓里度过的那几天，那明明是十二月的事，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:55361
    old "Like I said, the recording was real. On the 5th of January, we were in the tower. That's why I appeared with you in the lobby when you touched the Sekimeiya."
    new "我说过了，录音是真的。一月五日那天，我们就在塔里。所以你碰到 Sekimeiya 的时候，我才会和你一起出现在大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:55362
    old "N-No. No. How would I have gone to the future? There's no way."
    new "不、不会的。不可能。我怎么可能去到未来？绝无可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:55363
    old "With the Sekimeiya. There were two of them."
    new "靠的是 Sekimeiya。当时有两个。"

    # game/script.rpy:55366
    old "I... know. I saw that too. What do you mean, though?"
    new "我……知道。那个我也看见了。可你这话是什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:55371
    old "I've thought about everything that happened. There always were two Sekimeiya, but only one of them made us go to the past. The other one made us go to the future instead."
    new "发生过的每件事我都想过了。始终有两个 Sekimeiya，但把我们送往过去的只有一个。另一个，则把我们送去了未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:55377
    old "The one in the water tank sent you to the future, but that wasn't the first time. ...It wasn't the first time you'd traveled forward in time. There were others."
    new "水箱里的那个把你送到了未来，但那并不是第一次。……你并非第一次穿越到未来。之前还有过好几次。"

    # game/script.rpy:55378
    old "I was at a loss for words. That couldn't be the truth; it didn't make sense.{w} But... if it had happened before...{w} Earlier, when our past selves had traveled to the attic... I'd pressed the elevator button two times, and only one of them could've caused the sound we'd heard. If we'd appeared in the future instead, that solved it.{w} We'd immediately thought we'd traveled just a few minutes to the past because the handle in the bedroom had been reattached and our footprints were still visible in the living room, but that would've been the case a few minutes into the future too. Was that really possible, though? Wouldn't we have noticed a ton of contradictions?"
    new "我一时说不出话来。这不可能是真的，根本说不通。{w}可是……如果以前真的发生过……{w}先前，过去的我们穿越到阁楼的时候……我按了两次电梯按钮，其中只有一次可能造成我们听到的声响。若我们其实是出现在未来，那就说得通了。{w}我们之所以当即认定自己只回到了几分钟前，是因为卧室的门把手已经装了回去，客厅里也还留着我们的脚印；可若是前往几分钟后的未来，这些同样成立。然而，这真的可能吗？那么多矛盾，我们难道会毫无察觉？"

    # game/script.rpy:55388
    old "This will have no impact whatsoever, so answer as you see fit. Where did Shiroya travel?"
    new "这不会有任何影响，你照自己的判断回答就好。Shiroya 去了哪里？"

    # game/script.rpy:55395
    old "So you read a story where Shiroya had traveled to the past."
    new "也就是说，你读到的故事里，Shiroya 去到了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:55396
    old "In reality, she did travel to the future, and just like you, she never realized it."
    new "而实际上，她去的是未来。和你一样，她始终没有察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:55397
    old "However, everything around her pointed at the truth that she failed to notice. She felt free after so long, which prevented her from realizing that she was still trapped."
    new "然而，她身边的一切都指向那个她没能察觉的真相。久违的自由让她没有意识到，自己其实仍被困在其中。"

    # game/script.rpy:55398
    old "That was due to her narrow field of view. Just like her, depending on the way things were looked at, you would've been told an entirely different story."
    new "这是因为她视野狭窄。就像她一样，看待事情的角度不同，你也会听到一个截然不同的故事。"

    # game/script.rpy:55399
    old "But there's no shame in that. Both of them are just as valid."
    new "但这没什么好羞耻的。两者都同样成立。"

    # game/script.rpy:55402
    old "Every mystery has been accompanied by the key to unlock it. Shiroya went to the future. That's why the days of the week didn't match December, when the 15th was a Thursday.{w} That's why it wasn't snowing when she stepped out of the drainage channel. That's why, as soon as she got home, she heard fireworks celebrating the new year."
    new "每一个谜团都伴随着解开它的钥匙。Shiroya 去的是未来。正因如此，星期才对不上十二月——那个月的十五日是星期四。{w}正因如此，她走出排水渠时天上没有下雪。也正因如此，她一回到家，就听见了庆祝新年的烟花声。"

    # game/script.rpy:55403
    old "But one time, Darfee told her she could drink alcohol. Given her birthday, that meant she was already twenty years old and legally allowed to drink."
    new "但有一次，Darfee 告诉她可以喝酒了。按她的生日推算，那意味着她已满二十岁，到了法定饮酒年龄。"

    # game/script.rpy:55405
    old "There have been countless keys, but some of them have been much smaller than you might think. However, know they're there and hunt for them. The time where your success will be measured will come, and now it is very close."
    new "钥匙数不胜数，其中有些远比你想象的要细小。但只要知道它们就在那里，就去把它们找出来。检验你成败的时刻终将到来，而如今已近在眼前。"

    # game/script.rpy:55407
    old "So you read a story where Shiroya had traveled to the future."
    new "也就是说，你读到的故事里，Shiroya 去到了未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:55408
    old "That was the truth. Everything around her pointed to it, yet she failed to notice it. She felt free after so long, which prevented her from realizing that she was still trapped."
    new "那才是真相。她身边的一切都在说明这一点，她却没能察觉。久违的自由让她没有意识到，自己其实仍被困在其中。"

    # game/script.rpy:55424
    old "{cps=80}In the living room,{w=0.4} Shiroya thought to herself.{nw}"
    new "{cps=80}客厅里，{w=0.4}Shiroya 独自想着心事。{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:55425
    old "{cps=80}Everything she'd experienced...{w=0.4} How could it have happened in January?{nw}"
    new "{cps=80}她经历的一切……{w=0.4}怎么会发生在一月呢？{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:55426
    old "{cps=80}It seemed impossible at first,{w=0.3} but she soon realized it wasn't.{w=0.7} Even if that was the case, {w=0.2}though,{w=0.2} there were many questions to answer.{nw}"
    new "{cps=80}起初看来不可能，{w=0.3}但她很快明白并非如此。{w=0.7}不过，{w=0.2}即便如此，{w=0.2}仍有很多疑问需要解答。{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:55427
    old "{cps=80}...So...{w=0.4} what now?{w=0.7} What will happen at {time=21}?{nw}"
    new "{cps=80}那么……{w=0.4}接下来呢？{w=0.7}{time=21}会发生什么？{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:55428
    old "{cps=80}It'll be fine.{w=0.4} We'll be able to leave.{nw}"
    new "{cps=80}没事的。{w=0.4}我们能出去的。{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:55429
    old "{cps=80}Finally,{w=0.3} Shiroya breathed a sigh of relief,{w=0.4} but it was cut short by words she didn't expect.{nw}"
    new "{cps=80}终于，{w=0.3}Shiroya 松了口气，{w=0.4}却被一句意料之外的话打断了。{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:55430
    old "{cps=80}This isn't over yet,{w=0.2} though.{w=0.5} We have to do one more thing.{nw}"
    new "{cps=80}不过，{w=0.2}这事还没完。{w=0.5}我们还得再做一件事。{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:55431
    old "{cps=80}Shiroya peered at him,{w=0.4} wondering just what he meant.{nw}"
    new "{cps=80}Shiroya 打量着他，{w=0.4}不明白他究竟是什么意思。{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:55432
    old "{cps=80}...{w=0.1}W{w=0.1}e{w=0.8} are going to save Miiya.{nw}"
    new "{cps=80}……{w=0.1}我{w=0.1}们{w=0.8}要去救 Miiya。{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:55433
    old "That wasn't the end for them."
    new "对他们来说，事情并没有就此结束。"

    # game/script.rpy:55434
    old "But only the final step was left."
    new "可剩下的，只有最后一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:55435
    old "How could that goal be achieved?"
    new "这个目标要怎么才能实现？"

    # game/script.rpy:55436
    old "Shiroya wondered that as she awaited Atsuki's next words."
    new "Shiroya 一边这样想着，一边等着 Atsuki 继续说下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:55437
    old "Miiya, who had been seen in the tower... How would she be saved?"
    new "曾在塔里出现过的 Miiya……究竟要怎样才能得救？"

    # game/script.rpy:55438
    old "Shiroya had thought about it for countless hours."
    new "这个问题，Shiroya 已经想了不知多少个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:55439
    old "But a way to save Miiya had always meant her own death."
    new "可每一次，救 Miiya 的办法都意味着她自己会死。"

    # game/script.rpy:55440
    old "She'd never believed it had been possible... to truly decide between the two worlds."
    new "在两个世界之间真正做出抉择……她从不相信这能做到。"

    # game/script.rpy:55441
    old "Would Atsuki come with her?"
    new "Atsuki 会和她一起走吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:55442
    old "If they abandoned their world together, maybe it would be bearable."
    new "若两人一同舍弃自己的世界，或许还能忍受。"

    # game/script.rpy:55443
    old "But she soon learned that he wouldn't."
    new "可她很快就明白，他不会。"

    # game/script.rpy:55444
    old "And that, though it had seemed impossible, there had always been a path toward a desirable outcome."
    new "也明白了，尽管看似不可能，通往理想结局的路其实一直都在。"

    # game/script.rpy:55474
    old "That wasn't the end for them.\n{color=#000}But only the final step was left.{/color}"
    new "对他们来说，这还不是终点。\n{color=#000}剩下的，只有最后一步。{/color}"

    # game/script.rpy:55476
    old "That wasn't the end for them.\nBut only the final step was left."
    new "对他们来说，这还不是终点。\n剩下的，只有最后一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:55482
    old "How could that goal be achieved?\n{color=#000}Shiroya wondered that as she awaited Atsuki's next words.\nMiiya, who had been seen in the tower... How would she be saved?{/color}"
    new "那个目标要如何才能实现？\n{color=#000}Shiroya 一面等着 Atsuki 开口，一面思索着。\n那个在塔里被人看到的 Miiya……她究竟要怎么救？{/color}"

    # game/script.rpy:55484
    old "How could that goal be achieved?\nShiroya wondered that as she awaited Atsuki's next words.\n{color=#000}Miiya, who had been seen in the tower... How would she be saved?{/color}"
    new "那个目标要如何才能实现？\nShiroya 一面等着 Atsuki 开口，一面思索着。\n{color=#000}那个在塔里被人看到的 Miiya……她究竟要怎么救？{/color}"

    # game/script.rpy:55486
    old "How could that goal be achieved?\nShiroya wondered that as she awaited Atsuki's next words.\nMiiya, who had been seen in the tower... How would she be saved?"
    new "那个目标要如何才能实现？\nShiroya 一面等着 Atsuki 开口，一面思索着。\n那个在塔里被人看到的 Miiya……她究竟要怎么救？"

    # game/script.rpy:55493
    old "Shiroya had thought about it for countless hours.\n{color=#000}But a way to save Miiya had always meant her own death.\nShe'd never believed it had been possible... to truly decide between the two worlds.{/color}"
    new "这件事，Shiroya 已经想了无数个钟头。\n{color=#000}可要救 Miiya，代价从来都是她自己的性命。\n在两个世界之间真正做出抉择……她从不相信这能做到。{/color}"

    # game/script.rpy:55495
    old "Shiroya had thought about it for countless hours.\nBut a way to save Miiya had always meant her own death.\n{color=#000}She'd never believed it had been possible... to truly decide between the two worlds.{/color}"
    new "这件事，Shiroya 已经想了无数个钟头。\n可要救 Miiya，代价从来都是她自己的性命。\n{color=#000}她从不相信……自己真的能在两个世界之间做出抉择。{/color}"

    # game/script.rpy:55497
    old "Shiroya had thought about it for countless hours.\nBut a way to save Miiya had always meant her own death.\nShe'd never believed it had been possible... to truly decide between the two worlds."
    new "这件事，Shiroya 已经想了无数个钟头。\n可要救 Miiya，代价从来都是她自己的性命。\n她从不相信……自己真的能在两个世界之间做出抉择。"

    # game/script.rpy:55503
    old "Would Atsuki come with her?\n{color=#000}If they abandoned their world together, maybe it would be bearable.\nBut she soon learned that he wouldn't.\nAnd that, though it had seemed impossible, there had always been a path toward a desirable outcome.{/color}"
    new "Atsuki 会和她一起走吗？\n{color=#000}倘若两人一同舍弃自己的世界，或许还能承受。\n但她很快便知道，他不会。\n而她也明白了，尽管看似毫无可能，通往理想结局的路其实一直都在。{/color}"

    # game/script.rpy:55505
    old "Would Atsuki come with her?\nIf they abandoned their world together, maybe it would be bearable.\n{color=#000}But she soon learned that he wouldn't.\nAnd that, though it had seemed impossible, there had always been a path toward a desirable outcome.{/color}"
    new "Atsuki 会和她一起走吗？\n倘若两人一同舍弃自己的世界，或许还能承受。\n{color=#000}但她很快便知道，他不会。\n而她也明白了，尽管看似毫无可能，通往理想结局的路其实一直都在。{/color}"

    # game/script.rpy:55507
    old "Would Atsuki come with her?\nIf they abandoned their world together, maybe it would be bearable.\nBut she soon learned that he wouldn't.\n{color=#000}And that, though it had seemed impossible, there had always been a path toward a desirable outcome.{/color}"
    new "Atsuki 会和她一起走吗？\n倘若两人一同舍弃自己的世界，或许还能承受。\n但她很快便知道，他不会。\n{color=#000}而她也明白了，尽管看似毫无可能，通往理想结局的路其实一直都在。{/color}"

    # game/script.rpy:55509
    old "Would Atsuki come with her?\nIf they abandoned their world together, maybe it would be bearable.\nBut she soon learned that he wouldn't.\nAnd that, though it had seemed impossible, there had always been a path toward a desirable outcome."
    new "Atsuki 会和她一起走吗？\n倘若两人一同舍弃自己的世界，或许还能承受。\n但她很快便知道，他不会。\n而她也明白了，尽管看似毫无可能，通往理想结局的路其实一直都在。"

    # game/script.rpy:55531
    old "Failure"
    new "失败"

    # game/script.rpy:55543
    old "In the attic, Atsuki sobbed on top of a bed. He'd seen Shiroya's dead body. She had been killed, next to Naomi."
    new "阁楼里，Atsuki 趴在床上痛哭。他看见了 Shiroya 的尸体。她被人杀害，就倒在 Naomi 身旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:55544
    old "Atsuki couldn't believe the world had suddenly taken such a turn. Shiroya couldn't have possibly died mere days after Miiya. He had been hopeful the previous night—it was absurd for him to think that he was in reality."
    new "世界竟会突然变成这样，Atsuki 无法相信。Miiya 才走了没几天，Shiroya 怎么可能也死了。昨晚他还满怀希望——现在要他把这一切当作现实，实在太荒唐了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55545
    old "But his tears conveyed what he already knew. He would never speak to Shiroya again."
    new "可泪水已经说出了他早已明白的事。他再也无法和 Shiroya 说话了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55546
    old "He had run up the floors after seeing the body. The attic should've been locked, but that hadn't been the case. After failing to find who he'd been searching for, Atsuki had collapsed onto the bed."
    new "看到尸体后，他一口气跑上了楼。阁楼本该锁着，门却没有锁。要找的人始终没找到，Atsuki 最终倒在了床上。"

    # game/script.rpy:55549
    old "Meanwhile, the tower... was almost empty. Only one other person was in the building with Atsuki."
    new "而此时，塔里……几乎空无一人。整栋建筑里，除了 Atsuki，只剩一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:55550
    old "That person was Sai."
    new "那个人就是 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:55559
    old "Puzzled, he stepped into hallway B. ...What had just happened?{w} Out of nowhere, the Sekimeiya had disappeared."
    new "他满腹疑惑，走进了 B走廊。……刚才究竟发生了什么？{w} Sekimeiya 竟凭空消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55561
    old "He wondered if he'd traveled through time. Even though he hadn't touched the Sekimeiya, something peculiar had occurred."
    new "他怀疑自己是不是经历了时间穿越。明明没有碰过 Sekimeiya，怪事却发生了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55565
    old "When he looked around him, his confusion intensified. Naomi wasn't in the bathroom."
    new "他环顾四周，心里愈发困惑。Naomi 不在洗手间里。"

    # game/script.rpy:55568
    old "Then, he saw the bloody corpse next to the stairs. Erina had died. Going off of the blood, it seemed she'd hit her head on the stairs and tumbled down."
    new "接着，他看见了楼梯旁那具满是鲜血的尸体。Erina 死了。从血迹来看，她像是头部撞上楼梯，一路滚了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:55569
    old "Sai saw something else. There was no longer a green light on the security cameras. Did that mean they weren't recording?{w} Without a doubt, he wasn't where he'd been a minute ago."
    new "Sai 还注意到了另一件事。监控摄像头上的绿灯不亮了。这意味着摄像头没在录像吗？{w}毫无疑问，他已经不在刚才那个地方了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55576
    old "Sai had recently learned valuable information regarding the Sekimeiya; he was confident he knew more than everyone else. However, he had no clue what had just happened."
    new "Sai 最近掌握了关于 Sekimeiya 的重要情报，他自信比谁都了解内情。然而，刚才发生的事，他却毫无头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:55577
    old "He took his time looking through the crystal floor. Someone might've been there, and perhaps the Sekimeiya as well."
    new "他不紧不慢地查看着水晶层。或许那里有人，说不定 Sekimeiya 也在。"

    # game/script.rpy:55580
    old "He stared into a crystal room. It was where they'd found Naomi's first corpse, but she had also vanished from there, and the velvet curtain, which had been laid on top of her, was attached to its original cabinet."
    new "他朝一间水晶展室里望去。那里正是他们最初发现 Naomi 第一具尸体的地方，可她的尸体也从那儿消失了；原本盖在她身上的天鹅绒遮布，已经重新罩回原来的展示柜上。"

    # game/script.rpy:55583
    old "Deep in thought, Sai walked to room A5, where Isla had died. Lifting up the cabinet's lid, he verified her body was gone as well."
    new "Sai 沉思着走到 Isla 死去的水晶展室 A5。他掀起展示柜的盖子，确认她的尸体也不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55587
    old "When he looked at the lobby, he was met with Shiroya's immobile body. Next to her was a puddle of blood, and her eyes showed that no life remained within them.{w} Shiroya had been killed... By who, though? ...Sai didn't find anything important among her belongings."
    new "他望向大厅，映入眼帘的是 Shiroya 一动不动的身体。她身旁积着一摊血，双眼已经毫无生气。{w}Shiroya 是被杀的……可凶手是谁？……Sai 也没从她的随身物品里找到任何要紧的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:55588
    old "Again, he wondered. Where was he...? The corpses he knew of had vanished, while Shiroya and Erina, who should've been in the attic, had been killed.{w} What did the silence mean? Where was Atsuki and everyone else...? His wristwatch wouldn't help him figure any of that out, so he headed to the security room."
    new "他又一次问自己：这里到底是哪儿……？他所知道的那些尸体都不见了，本该待在阁楼的 Shiroya 和 Erina，反倒被人杀死。{w}这片寂静意味着什么？Atsuki 和其他人都在哪里……？光看手表也想不明白这些，于是他朝监控室走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:55596
    old "But the door was locked."
    new "可是门锁着。"

    # game/script.rpy:55597
    old "Had Katei locked it? That seemed strange.{w} Sai wanted to know the time. The bodies vanishing indicated that he was in the past, but the truth couldn't have been so simple.{w} The future, perhaps? Had the earlier crimes been covered up? ...Sai wasn't sure what to think."
    new "是 Katei 锁的吗？这未免奇怪。{w}Sai 想知道现在几点。尸体消失，说明他回到了过去，可真相不可能这么简单。{w}也许是未来？先前那些命案都被掩盖了？……Sai 想不明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:55602
    old "Then, he looked at the elevator, frowning in consternation. The button was gone...{w} Nonetheless, when he tried to open the door, it budged."
    new "随后，他望向电梯，困惑地皱起眉。按钮不见了……{w}可他试着开门，门却动了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55608
    old "Inside it was blood and a pile of metallic panels."
    new "里面是血迹，还有一堆金属板。"

    # game/script.rpy:55614
    old "It was a long time later when Sai stepped into the attic. He hadn't found anyone else, and only the last floor remained. He immediately noticed that the suitcase was gone from the sofa."
    new "过了很久，Sai 才踏进阁楼。他始终没找到其他人，只剩最后一层还没查看。他立刻注意到，沙发上的手提箱不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55615
    old "But Atsuki's sobs began to reach his ears. His cries came in broken bursts, muffled by the pillow."
    new "这时，Atsuki 的哭声传进了他耳中。那哭声断断续续，被枕头捂得发闷。"

    # game/script.rpy:55621
    old "Sai noticed that one of the bed sheets was gone. When Atsuki heard him, his head immediately turned and he saw him approaching through his bleary vision.{w} Then, Atsuki's fist flew. If Sai hadn't reacted fast enough, the blow would've broken his jaw."
    new "Sai 注意到床上少了一条被单。Atsuki 听见他的声音，猛地转过头，透过模糊的泪眼看见他走近。{w}紧接着，Atsuki 的拳头挥了过来。若不是 Sai 反应够快，这一拳会打断他的下巴。"

    # game/script.rpy:55627
    old "Wh-What the fuck!?"
    new "你、你他妈发什么疯！？"

    # game/script.rpy:55630
    old "Sai felt his tongue. It was bleeding."
    new "Sai 动了动舌头，发现它正在流血。"

    # game/script.rpy:55635
    old "Before he could process it, Atsuki struck again. When Sai saw Atsuki's fist had barely missed its full impact, he realized it could've easily just killed him.{w} ...After all, from Atsuki's perspective, Sai had to be the murderer."
    new "他还没反应过来，Atsuki 又打了一拳。Sai 看出这一拳并未完全打实，否则轻易就能要了他的命。{w}……毕竟在 Atsuki 眼里，凶手只能是 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:55636
    old "Everyone had stayed in a crystal room, and Sai had been the first to leave. Only Naomi should've been outside, but she had been one of the victims.{w} Then, Erina had left, and she had been killed as well. Lastly, after Shiroya's departure, she'd instantly been met with the same fate.{w} It was only Sai who could've done that; the one still alive, who had willingly not returned."
    new "所有人都待在各自的水晶展室里，而 Sai 是第一个出去的。外面本该只有 Naomi 一人，她却成了死者之一。{w}接着 Erina 也出去了，同样被杀。最后，Shiroya 一出去，立刻遭遇了相同的命运。{w}能做到这些的只有 Sai——只有他还活着，并且有意没有回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:55637
    old "However, Atsuki wasn't aware of where he was. He wasn't aware of what the Sekimeiya truly were, as he had never witnessed their powers."
    new "但 Atsuki 并不知道自己身在何处。他也从未亲眼见过 Sekimeiya 的力量，不知道它们究竟是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:55642
    old "When Atsuki's third strike came, it was immediately returned. In Sai's hand was a knife that slashed Atsuki's shirt."
    new "Atsuki 第三拳刚挥出，就立刻挨了一记回击。Sai 手里握着一把刀，刀锋划破了 Atsuki 的衬衫。"

    # game/script.rpy:55649
    old "That confirmed it to him: Sai was the killer. He had just tried to make Atsuki his fourth victim."
    new "这下他确信无疑：Sai 就是凶手。他刚才还想让 Atsuki 成为第四个牺牲者。"

    # game/script.rpy:55651
    old "He felt a chill up his spine. He couldn't die there, not after Shiroya's death, but he wasn't a match against Sai's knife.{w} Before he could swing again, Atsuki ran out of the room."
    new "后背窜起一阵寒意。Shiroya 已经死了，他绝不能也死在这里——可他敌不过 Sai 手里的刀。{w} 没等对方再次挥刀，Atsuki 便逃出了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:55659
    old "You're not gonna fucking run away!"
    new "你他妈休想逃！"

    # game/script.rpy:55660
    old "Sai wouldn't let him go—not after he'd tried to kill him out of nowhere. On top of that, he was aware of a few things.{w} Nobody else was in the tower. Murders had occurred. The cameras didn't seem to be working. He had a knife.{w} ...He had been handed the perfect circumstances to finally know what killing a person was like."
    new "刚才对方毫无征兆地对他痛下杀手，Sai 怎么可能放他走。更何况，他清楚几件事。{w} 塔里没有其他人。已经出了命案。摄像头似乎没在工作。而他手里有刀。{w} ……一切都为他备好了，只等他亲手弄清楚杀人是什么滋味。"

    # game/script.rpy:55661
    old "When he'd cut his shirt, Sai had discerned fear within Atsuki's eyes. He had run away, but there weren't many places where he could hide.{w} Sai had enjoyed Atsuki's presence in the tower, and he was poised to enjoy it even more. Thanks to the knife he had, he could hunt him down."
    new "刚才划破 Atsuki 衬衫时，Sai 从他眼里看出了恐惧。Atsuki 虽然跑了，能藏身的地方却不多。{w} 塔里有 Atsuki 作伴，Sai 原本就乐在其中，如今更是兴味盎然。有这把刀在手，他大可以像追捕猎物一样把他找出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:55662
    old "And at the same time, he felt enraged. Atsuki had almost killed him; he'd almost suffered a sudden, clueless, and pathetic death.{w} His confusion toward the world was gone. In the blink of an eye, Sai's thoughts had shifted drastically."
    new "与此同时，他也怒不可遏。Atsuki 差点杀了他；他险些就这样不明不白地突然送命，死得既荒唐又窝囊。{w} 他原本对这个世界的困惑已经一扫而空。眨眼之间，Sai 的想法已经彻底转向。"

    # game/script.rpy:55667
    old "He grabbed the key to the bedroom. Strangely, it wasn't where he'd left it, but in its original drawer."
    new "他拿起卧室的钥匙。奇怪的是，钥匙不在他原先放的地方，而是回到了原本的抽屉里。"

    # game/script.rpy:55670
    old "Then, he grabbed the one in the other bedroom and removed its chain with a screwdriver. With that, Atsuki had very few places to hide."
    new "接着，他又取了另一间卧室的钥匙，用螺丝刀卸下上面的链子。这样一来，Atsuki 能藏身的地方就更少了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55675
    old "The key to the attic had been in the door, and Sai had grabbed it. That meant Atsuki couldn't lock himself inside. The two remaining options Sai could think of were the security room and a bathroom, which could both be bypassed with Katei's keys."
    new "阁楼的钥匙本来插在门上，已经被 Sai 拔走了。也就是说，Atsuki 没法把自己反锁在里面。Sai 能想到的剩下两个去处，是监控室和一间浴室；这两处都能用 Katei 的钥匙打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:55680
    old "He began to search for him, aware that Atsuki could attack first.{w} In the living room, he saw footprints running out, yet he cautiously looked through the whole floor to confirm Atsuki wasn't still there."
    new "他开始搜寻 Atsuki，心里清楚对方可能先一步动手。{w} 客厅里有一串向外跑去的脚印，但他仍旧谨慎地把整层楼查了一遍，确认 Atsuki 没有藏在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:55689
    old "Coming out of the partitions, Sai stared at both bathrooms. He noticed only one of them was closed."
    new "从隔间出来后，Sai 盯着两间浴室。他发现只有一间的门关着。"

    # game/script.rpy:55696
    old "I see, so you're here."
    new "原来如此……你在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:55699
    old "Atsuki, open the door."
    new "Atsuki，开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:55704
    old "Atsuki!{w} I bet you want to know what happened to Shiroya. Open, you stupid moron!"
    new "Atsuki！{w} 你八成想知道 Shiroya 出了什么事吧。快开门，你这个白痴！"

    # game/script.rpy:55710
    old "...Oh, I see.{w} You're not answering...{w} because you're already dead."
    new "……哦，我明白了。{w} 你不回答……{w} 是因为你已经死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55711
    old "Sai grinned. In the storeroom on the crystal floor, he had found both Sekimeiya.{w} He'd had a reason to hide one while leaving the other there, but what mattered was that he had access to both.{w} That bathroom was where Atsuki had hidden. If Sai went to the past, he could wait for him inside. Hence, on the other side of the door, Atsuki must've already been dead, and a future version of Sai must've been waiting for his past self to leave."
    new "Sai 咧嘴一笑。在水晶层的储藏室里，他找到了两个 Sekimeiya。{w} 他藏起其中一个、把另一个留在原处，自有理由；但真正重要的是，两个 Sekimeiya 他都能拿到。{w} Atsuki 就藏在那个浴室里。只要 Sai 回到过去，就能先一步进去等他。所以，门后的 Atsuki 肯定已经死了，而未来的 Sai，一定正等着过去的自己离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:55716
    old "Briskly, Sai ran all the way down. He didn't know which of the two Sekimeiya to activate, but it didn't matter."
    new "Sai 快步一路跑下楼。他不知道该启动两个 Sekimeiya 中的哪一个，但这无所谓。"

    # game/script.rpy:55723
    old "Behind the storeroom's wall, Sai hurried to the glowing gemstone, knowing it had been there a long time."
    new "在储藏室的墙后，Sai 快步走向那颗发光的宝石；他知道它已经在那里很久了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55736
    old "Atsuki had been in the bathroom on floor 6 since Sai had gone down. He had no idea how much time had passed, but the silence hadn't wavered once."
    new "自从 Sai 下楼以后，Atsuki 就一直待在六楼的浴室里。他不知道过了多久，但四周的寂静始终没有一丝变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:55737
    old "How long had it been...? Perhaps two hours.{w} No matter the time, for Atsuki, it had felt like a still instant; Atsuki's mind had been consumed by the persistent image of Shiroya's corpse."
    new "到底过了多久……？也许两个小时。{w} 但不管是多久，在 Atsuki 的感受里都只像一瞬；Shiroya 的尸体一直在脑海中挥之不去。"

    # game/script.rpy:55738
    old "...Why had Sai not come back? Had he killed everyone else...?{w} Atsuki was incapable of shedding more tears. He'd been in the tower almost the entire day, and he didn't know if the exit would ever unlock."
    new "……Sai 为什么还没回来？他是不是把其他人都杀了……？{w} Atsuki 已经流不出眼泪了。他在这座塔里待了将近一整天，也不知道出口究竟还会不会解锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:55740
    old "He wanted to leave the bathroom. Putting a firm end to Sai—that desire spurred him onward."
    new "他想离开浴室。彻底了结 Sai——正是这份念头推着他往前走。"

    # game/script.rpy:55741
    old "What if the police couldn't prove what he'd done? Exploring that thought for a second almost broke Atsuki."
    new "如果警方拿不出证据证明 Sai 的所作所为呢？光是稍一动这个念头，Atsuki 就几乎承受不住。"

    # game/script.rpy:55742
    old "He had to find Sai before the police... but he was wielding a knife, and Atsuki didn't know where he was."
    new "他得赶在警察之前找到 Sai……可对方拿着刀，他也不知道 Sai 究竟在哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:55745
    old "...Finally, Atsuki was able to reach the doorknob. He didn't think he had decided, but he couldn't stay there anymore."
    new "……终于，Atsuki 的手碰到了门把手。他并不觉得自己已经下定决心，但他无法再待在这里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55753
    old "Sai hadn't been waiting for him outside. The floor was as desolate as it had sounded."
    new "Sai 并没有在门外等他。整层楼果然如方才听见的那般死寂。"

    # game/script.rpy:55756
    old "Atsuki had heard him going down the stairs hours before. The red around his eyes had mostly faded, and they were otherwise empty. Slowly, he descended to the fifth floor."
    new "几小时前，Atsuki 听见他下了楼。Atsuki 眼周的红肿已经褪去大半，眼神空茫茫的。他缓缓下到五楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:55760
    old "But the Sai he was searching for wasn't there. He wasn't anywhere in that building."
    new "但他要找的 Sai 不在那里。整栋楼里都不见他的踪影。"

    # game/script.rpy:55765
    old "When he arrived at the lowest floor, he was drawn to the open storeroom beyond Erina's lifeless body. There, he learned of its secret."
    new "他来到最底层。Erina 那具毫无生气的尸体后方，储藏室的门敞开着，他不由自主地朝那里走去。在那里，他发现了储藏室的秘密。"

    # game/script.rpy:55772
    old "The movable wall was open, showing the way to the hidden corridor. Behind it, a strange light came from the floor."
    new "活动墙敞开着，露出通往隐藏走廊的路。墙后，地板上透出一缕奇异的光。"

    # game/script.rpy:55774
    old "Atsuki didn't react, but he crouched beside it."
    new "Atsuki 没有任何反应，却蹲在了那道光旁边。"

    # game/script.rpy:55779
    old "When he placed his finger on it, he retracted it immediately. He'd been burned, and before he could be surprised, the lights went out. Both the faint glow and the room's; the movable wall had closed."
    new "他的手指刚碰上去，便立刻缩了回来。他被烫到了；还没等他吃惊，灯就灭了。微光与室内的灯光同时熄灭，活动墙已经合上。"

    # game/script.rpy:55782
    old "Astonished, Atsuki looked back. The wall was in place, and where there'd been a soft glow before, there was nothing."
    new "Atsuki 吃惊地回头。墙已经恢复原位，先前泛着微光的地方如今空无一物。"

    # game/script.rpy:55785
    old "He stood up and walked into the darkness. Immediately, he encountered a door that he couldn't open: its handle was missing."
    new "他站起身，走进黑暗，立刻碰到一扇打不开的门——门把手不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55788
    old "He stepped back to the wall that had closed. It didn't seem to have a handle either, and he couldn't get it to open.{w} For an instant, Atsuki thought he'd been trapped, but he soon felt the area that allowed him to open the hidden wall."
    new "他退回到那面已经合上的墙前。它似乎也没有把手，他怎么也打不开。{w} 有那么一瞬，Atsuki 以为自己被困住了，但很快摸到了能打开这面暗墙的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:55794
    old "In the hallway, Atsuki stared at the stairs in fright.{w} What was happening to him? Erina had just been there, hadn't she? Yet she no longer was, and the sea of blood there had been reduced to a single droplet."
    new "走廊里，Atsuki 惊恐地盯着楼梯。{w} 他到底怎么了？Erina 刚才明明还在那里，不是吗？可她现在不见了，那片血海也只剩下一滴血。"

    # game/script.rpy:55800
    old "When he looked at the other side, the sensation persisted. The event room had been open before he'd entered the storeroom, but it wasn't anymore."
    new "他转向另一侧，那种异样感仍未消退。他进入储藏室之前，活动室的门原本开着，现在却关上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55803
    old "Nobody was in it, but the same glow lay on the floor near the cabinet. That was when Atsuki understood what it had been: the Sekimeiya."
    new "里面空无一人，但展示柜附近的地板上泛着同样的微光。直到这时，Atsuki 才明白那是什么：Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:55806
    old "As he crouched next to it, he shivered slightly at both the temperature of the room and how odd everything was. Could the Sekimeiya really have disappeared when he'd touched it? And why had he been burned? He still felt it on his finger."
    new "他在那道光旁边蹲下，既因房间的温度，也因这一切太过诡异，微微打了个寒颤。Sekimeiya 真的会在他碰到时消失吗？他又为什么会被烫到？指尖的痛感仍未消退。"

    # game/script.rpy:55810
    old "Carefully, he reached out to it with his left hand.{w} Again, as soon as he contacted it, the gemstone disappeared and he felt a painful burn."
    new "他小心翼翼地伸出左手，探向它。{w} 又是刚一触碰，宝石便消失不见，随即一阵灼痛袭来。"

    # game/script.rpy:55817
    old "Atsuki was lost. Was he delusional? ...He couldn't convince himself that was impossible, but he'd seen it clearly: the gemstone had vanished."
    new "Atsuki 茫然失措。难道是幻觉？……他无法说服自己那不可能发生，可他看得清清楚楚：宝石确实消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55818
    old "He looked around, almost beginning to cry again in desperation. Hopefully, Shiroya's corpse had also been a hallucination, but he couldn't bring himself to verify it."
    new "他环顾四周，绝望得几乎又要哭出来。他多希望 Shiroya 的尸体也只是幻觉，却始终没有勇气去确认。"

    # game/script.rpy:55824
    old "He staggered to hallway B. Perhaps Akaro and Isla were still in that room."
    new "他踉跄着走向 B 走廊。也许 Akaro 和 Isla 还在那个房间里。"

    # game/script.rpy:55828
    old "They weren't. The room was empty."
    new "他们不在。房间里空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:55831
    old "The lobby door wasn't closed, but Atsuki quickly looked away. Instead, he went to hallway C, wondering if Erina had truly disappeared."
    new "大厅的门没有关，但 Atsuki 飞快地移开了视线。他转而走向 C 走廊，想确认 Erina 是否真的消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55835
    old "...She had. She really wasn't there."
    new "……是的，她确实消失了。她真的不在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:55845
    old "Atsuki had failed to notice another change earlier: the elevator button. ...It was attached where it should have been on the wall."
    new "先前还有一处变化，Atsuki 没有留意到：电梯按钮。……它装回了墙上原本该在的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:55846
    old "He pressed it softly, causing the burn on his fingertip to prickle painfully.{w} Long seconds later, the button's outline flashed orange."
    new "他轻轻按下按钮，指尖的烫伤立刻刺痛起来。{w} 漫长的几秒过去，按钮的轮廓闪起了橙光。"

    # game/script.rpy:55848
    old "Hesitantly, Atsuki tried to open the door."
    new "Atsuki 犹豫片刻，试着去开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:55861
    old "At {time=21:04}, the shutter opened.{w} A group of policemen had been in front of it, awaiting that time. As soon as the glass came into view, they saw the figure of a young girl lying next to a puddle of blood."
    new "{time=21:04}，卷帘门升了起来。{w} 一队警察早已守在门外，等的就是这一刻。玻璃一露出来，他们便看见一个少女倒在血泊旁的身影。"

    # game/script.rpy:55862
    old "However, they couldn't rush in. An unknown gas was quickly detected inside the building."
    new "然而他们无法立刻冲进去。楼内很快检测出一种不明气体。"

    # game/script.rpy:55866
    old "When they were prepared, the team raided Ashiya Tower.{w} The girl in the lobby was young and had blue hair. She didn't have an open wound, so the blood next to her was strange."
    new "准备妥当后，队伍冲进了芦屋塔。{w} 大厅里的少女年纪尚轻，一头蓝发。她身上没有外伤，身旁那摊血便显得蹊跷。"

    # game/script.rpy:55870
    old "On the other side of the door was another body. Along with a much larger pool of blood, an older woman was found. She had hit her head on a step, dying instantly."
    new "门的另一侧还有一具尸体。旁边是一大片血迹，死者是一名年长女性。她的头撞在台阶上，当场毙命。"

    # game/script.rpy:55871
    old "What exactly had happened during the twelve hours when the tower had been sealed off? The officers were speechless as they stared at the corpses.{w} However, that was nothing compared to what awaited in hallway B."
    new "塔被封锁的这十二个小时里，究竟发生了什么？警官们盯着那些尸体，说不出话来。{w} 然而，和 B 走廊里等着他们的景象相比，这根本不算什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:55877
    old "Dimly lit, its entire floor was red. It took a moment for the first officer to realize that it was blood, not lighting.{w} Then, when he saw its source, the wind was knocked out of him.{w} He froze, knowing that would be the most gruesome image he'd ever see—the sad remains of what had once been a human being."
    new "走廊光线昏暗，整片地面却是红的。走在前头的警官愣了一瞬，才明白那是血，不是灯光。{w} 等他看清血的源头，胸口猛地一窒，气都提不上来。{w} 他僵在原地，知道那会是他这辈子见过最惨烈的画面——曾经活生生的一个人，如今只剩凄惨的残骸。"

    # game/script.rpy:55878
    old "In the middle of the hallway, by the door of a crystal room in the right wall, was the origin of the blood.{w} It wasn't a body. It was only half of one."
    new "走廊中央，右侧墙壁上一间水晶展室的门口，正是血迹的源头。{w} 那不是一具尸体，只是半具。"

    # game/script.rpy:55879
    old "The other half was beyond the door, as it had split it in two."
    new "另外半具在门后——尸体被那扇门从中间截成了两半。"

    # game/script.rpy:55880
    old "The officer stared at it while his heart hammered. It looked like a young man."
    new "警官死死盯着，心脏狂跳。那看上去是个年轻男子。"

    # game/script.rpy:55888
    old "They raised the curtain to the Sekimeiya cabinet. As Ashiya had feared, it was empty."
    new "他们拉开 Sekimeiya 展示柜的遮布。正如芦屋所担心的，柜中空空如也。"

    # game/script.rpy:55889
    old "Lei had let them know about the Sekimeiya's appearance and about the necessity for cold. They knew the Sekimeiya were two identical egg-shaped stones."
    new "Lei 已告知他们 Sekimeiya 的外观，以及必须低温保存。他们知道，Sekimeiya 是两颗一模一样的蛋形石头。"

    # game/script.rpy:55892
    old "It didn't take long for them to be found. One was in the storeroom, behind a secret wall. The other had been hidden inside a crystal room in hallway B. As instructed, an officer brought them to their cabinet, but he felt something strange. Through his protective suit, he noticed one of the stones was hot. The other, however, was not."
    new "没过多久，两颗石头就被找到了。一颗在储藏室里，藏在一道暗墙之后；另一颗被藏进 B走廊的一间水晶展室。一名警官遵照指示将它们送回展示柜，却察觉出异样。隔着防护服，他感到其中一颗石头是热的，另一颗却没有温度。"

    # game/script.rpy:55896
    old "Even when the police climbed to the highest floor, no one else had been found."
    new "警察一直搜到最高一层，也没有再发现任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:55902
    old "The team exited and reported their findings. Three people had been found dead, zero alive."
    new "队伍撤出，报告了搜查结果：发现三名死者，没有生还者。"

    # game/script.rpy:55903
    old "It didn't make sense; at least five were missing. Thanks to the entrance tickets, they knew the names of the people who hadn't been found outside."
    new "这说不通——至少还有五个人下落不明。多亏了门票记录，他们知道那些没在塔外找到的人姓甚名谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:55904
    old "While the citizens learned the tragic events that had transpired, the bodies were identified.{w} The girl in the lobby was Shiroya Mirana.{w} The woman beside the stairs was Erina Majutsu.{w} And the body split in two was Sai Yomiya's."
    new "就在市民们得知这场惨剧的同时，尸体也完成了身份确认。{w} 大厅里的少女是 Shiroya Mirana。{w} 楼梯旁的女性是 Erina Majutsu。{w} 而那具被劈成两半的尸体，是 Sai Yomiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:55906
    old "There was a secret corridor in the storeroom that Ashiya didn't know about. When the police learned it led outside, a single conclusion was drawn: the missing people had left through it minutes after the attack. Since then, all sides of the tower had been observed."
    new "储藏室里有一条连芦屋也不知道的暗道。警方查明它通往塔外后，只得出一个结论：失踪的人在袭击发生几分钟后便从那里离开了。自那以后，塔的四面都处于监视之下。"

    # game/script.rpy:55907
    old "So... what had happened inside? Who had killed those three people?"
    new "那么……塔里究竟发生了什么？是谁杀了那三个人？"

    # game/script.rpy:55913
    old "The building was raided a second time. If someone was still there, they had to be found immediately. Every possible spot was inspected."
    new "大楼遭到第二次搜查。若还有人留在里面，必须立刻找到。每一处可能的地方都被查了个遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:55916
    old "On the crystal floor, a member of the team entered the elevator. Blood and metallic panels were on the floor, but his attention went higher."
    new "水晶层上，一名队员走进了电梯。地板上留着血迹和金属板，但他的目光投向了更高处。"

    # game/script.rpy:55919
    old "It was the only remaining place in the tower. With the tools he'd been given, he unlocked the hatch on the ceiling to look into the narrow elevator shaft."
    new "那是塔里最后一处尚未搜查的地方。他用配发的工具打开天花板的检修口，向狭窄的电梯井里望去。"

    # game/script.rpy:55927
    old "When he pulled his head up through it, he saw a face before his eyes.{w} It was that of a young, unconscious boy. Blood issued from his mouth in a thin stream."
    new "他把头探进去，一张脸便出现在眼前。{w} 那是个昏迷的少年。血从他嘴里细细地流出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:55928
    old "The officer placed his hand under the boy's nose; he was still breathing. He gently shook his shoulder, but there was no response."
    new "警官把手探到少年鼻下——还有呼吸。他轻轻晃了晃少年的肩膀，却没有回应。"

    # game/script.rpy:55929
    old "He was unsure how to safely remove the boy from where he was or how he'd even gotten there in the first place. The full extent of his injuries was also an unknown factor."
    new "他不确定怎样才能把少年安全地弄出来，也不明白少年究竟是怎么进去的。伤势到底有多重，同样无从判断。"

    # game/script.rpy:55930
    old "He called for help, and a team of men slowly and gingerly extricated the boy shortly afterward."
    new "他呼叫支援，随后一队人小心翼翼、一点一点地把少年救了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:55937
    old "Atsuki Hakutoki. That was the name of the person who'd been found above the elevator.{w} Hours after his rescue, he regained consciousness. At first, he sounded devastated due to the death of his close friend. However, as he continued to be questioned, his answers only grew stranger."
    new "Atsuki Hakutoki——这是在电梯上方被发现的人的名字。{w} 获救数小时后，他恢复了意识。起初，他因挚友的死而显得悲痛欲绝。然而问话继续下去，他的回答却越来越离奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:55938
    old "He didn't know how he'd ended up in the elevator shaft, and the events he described didn't make sense. According to him, the missing people had been in the building for hours, which the police rejected immediately, as there was no way they would have been able to escape through the secret door."
    new "他不知道自己是怎样落进电梯井的，他所描述的事情也说不通。按他的说法，那些失踪的人已在楼里待了好几个小时；警方当即否定了这一说法——他们绝无可能从暗门逃出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:55939
    old "He didn't have a valid explanation for any of the deaths. No clues at the crime scenes pointed to their truth, and no video footage had been recorded. Quickly, the possibility that Atsuki was lying was presented—only he could've committed those murders.{w} He must've been lying: none of what he'd said could be the truth. However, nobody could be completely sure. Sai's death... It hadn't been natural.{w} How would Atsuki have killed him? How would anyone have killed him like that? And how would Atsuki have ended up unconscious above the elevator?"
    new "对于任何一桩死亡，他都给不出合理的解释。现场没有任何线索能印证他的说法，也没有录下任何影像。很快，有人提出了 Atsuki 在说谎的可能——那些命案只可能是他做的。{w} 他一定在撒谎：他说的话不可能有半句是真的。然而，谁也无法完全确定。Sai 的死……绝非寻常。{w} Atsuki 怎么可能杀得了他？又有谁能用那种方式杀他？而 Atsuki 又怎么会昏迷在电梯上方？"

    # game/script.rpy:55940
    old "And, admittedly, there was a point of truth to Atsuki's words: the blood in the lobby.{w} Next to Shiroya's body, there'd been a puddle of blood, which was confirmed not to match with any of the bodies present.{w} Could it really have been... Naomi's? The corpse Atsuki swore had disappeared...?"
    new "而且，不得不承认，Atsuki 的话里有一点是真的：大厅里的血。{w} Shiroya 的尸体旁有一摊血，经确认，并不属于在场的任何一具尸体。{w} 那真的会是……Naomi 的血吗？那具 Atsuki 坚称已经消失的尸体……？"

    # game/script.rpy:55947
    old "The backlash Ashiya received was immense. They had allowed a tragedy to unfold on their own property."
    new "芦屋承受的责难铺天盖地。一场惨剧竟在他们自己的地盘上上演。"

    # game/script.rpy:55948
    old "After the attack, the tower didn't open again. Containing countless mysteries and an unknown gas, it was closed indefinitely."
    new "袭击之后，塔再也没有开放。它里面藏着数不清的谜团和一种不明气体，因此被无限期封闭了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55949
    old "And eventually, Ashiya's voice faded. There was nothing they could do anymore."
    new "最终，芦屋的声音也沉寂了下去。他们再也无能为力。"

    # game/script.rpy:55958
    old "Many weeks had passed since December 15th. Lonely, Atsuki looked at the sky through the glass of a window."
    new "自12月15日以来，已经过去了许多个星期。Atsuki 孤身一人，透过窗玻璃望着天空。"

    # game/script.rpy:55959
    old "He could not yet believe what his life had become, and imagining the worst years ahead of him, he could only cry."
    new "他还无法相信自己的人生已变成这副模样；想到前方那些最糟糕的年月，他唯有落泪。"

    # game/script.rpy:55960
    old "The sky he saw... He wasn't happy he could still see it. He wanted it to disappear."
    new "他看见的那片天空……他并不高兴自己还能看见它。他更希望它消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:55963
    old "And it did."
    new "然后，它真的消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55971
    old "Through the glass of a window, the cloudy sky could be seen.{w} However, no one was there to see it."
    new "透过窗玻璃，能望见阴云密布的天空。{w} 然而，已经没有人站在那里看它了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55977
    old "Around the country, some people had the opportunity to witness the disappearance of countless citizens.{w} Speechless, they walked to where everyone had been... In the blink of an eye, the streets had become desolate, and even some cars had disappeared."
    new "在全国各地，有些人亲眼看见了无数市民的消失。{w} 他们说不出话，走向众人原本所在的地方……眨眼之间，街道已变得空荡荒凉，连一些汽车也不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55978
    old "The news was heard across the world: every being within an immense radius had vanished—almost a third of Japan was gone."
    new "消息传遍了世界各地：一片广阔范围内的所有生灵都已消失——日本将近三分之一的地方不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:55983
    old "It was humanity's most shocking event ever recorded. In a mere instant, millions of people disappeared without a trace. What had occurred was far beyond anyone's understanding."
    new "这是人类有史以来记录到的最令人震骇的事件。仅仅一瞬之间，数百万人消失得无影无踪。所发生的一切，远远超出了任何人的理解。"

    # game/script.rpy:55985
    old "You might know what was in the center of that radius."
    new "你也许知道，那片范围的中心是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:55989
    old "A little town on the foot of a mountain range, called Yushibana."
    new "一座山脚下的小镇，名叫丰花。"

    # game/script.rpy:55990
    old "...Then, everyone traveled through time. That must be what you're thinking."
    new "……然后，所有人都穿越了时间。你一定是这么想的吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:55992
    old "However, not one of the people who disappeared reappeared anywhere. The instant they vanished, their existence was {tip=disappearance}erased forever{/tip}."
    new "然而，那些消失的人，没有一个重新出现在任何地方。就在他们消失的那一瞬，他们的存在便{tip=disappearance}被永远抹去了{/tip}。"

    # game/script.rpy:56011
    old "First Cause Dilemma"
    new "第一因困境"

    # game/script.rpy:56017
    old "Airun was covered by a vast cape of snow. During the winter, Calliant were the only flowers that had survived the climate, and they encompassed its entire spectrum of flora."
    new "艾伦山覆盖着广袤的白雪，宛如一件雪之斗篷。冬日里，卡利安特花是唯一熬过这般气候的花，也构成了山上植物的全部。"

    # game/script.rpy:56018
    old "A member of a large range, the mountain extended behind Yushibana, its perpetual snowy top reaching higher than the others."
    new "这座山是一条漫长山脉的一部分，横亘在丰花镇后方，终年积雪的山顶高过其余诸峰。"

    # game/script.rpy:56020
    old "Years had passed since it had last been visited. It had long ago been said that only its neighbors were holders of innumerable gemstones."
    new "上一次有人造访，已是许多年前的事。很早以前就有说法称，只有与它相邻的几座山才蕴藏着数不清的宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:56022
    old "On its base, different species of Calliant peeked through the snow. After so long, however, they were accompanied by something else."
    new "山脚下，数种不同的卡利安特花从雪中探出头来。然而时隔如此之久，它们身旁还多了别的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:56023
    old "Human footprints. Marked on the ground, they wandered about."
    new "地上留着人类的脚印，杂乱地在雪中散开。"

    # game/script.rpy:56026
    old "Far from them, a man walked on the snow. His name was Gan, and in the distance, he could see the mountains he'd often traveled through."
    new "在远离那些脚印的地方，一个男人踏雪而行。他名叫 Gan，远远就能看见那几座他经常翻越的山。"

    # game/script.rpy:56027
    old "It was the first time he'd brought his equipment to Airun. He'd always been curious to know whether the common belief about it being devoid of value was true."
    new "这是他头一回带着工具上艾伦山。人们都说这座山毫无价值，他一直好奇这说法究竟是真是假。"

    # game/script.rpy:56028
    old "And, after hours, he had verified it. He hadn't found any caves, and the surface had been harder to traverse than Airun's neighbors."
    new "几个小时后，他证实了这一点。他没找到任何洞穴，这里的地面也比艾伦山邻近的几座山更难走。"

    # game/script.rpy:56029
    old "Disappointed, he walked back before the sun set. He'd been out all day, and he was exhausted."
    new "他失望地在日落前折返。在外奔波了一整天，人早已疲惫不堪。"

    # game/script.rpy:56034
    old "He was walking down a narrow path when something caught his eye."
    new "他正沿一条窄路走着，忽然有什么东西映入眼帘。"

    # game/script.rpy:56037
    old "He'd already crossed the treeline, so tall trees were surrounding him. He stopped himself when he noticed an opening between two of them."
    new "他早已越过林线，四周尽是高大的树木。瞥见两棵树之间有道缺口，他停下了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:56038
    old "Intrigued, he walked over to it, and as he got closer, he realized what it was."
    new "他起了兴致，朝那边走去，靠近时才看清那是什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:56041
    old "An entrance to a vast field of grass, enclosed by the trees that hid it from view.{w} However, what truly stood out was farther ahead."
    new "那是一片开阔草地的入口，四周的树木将它遮得严严实实。{w}然而，真正惹眼的还在更远处。"

    # game/script.rpy:56042
    old "There was a wooden cabin. In the corner of the field, it lay covered in white."
    new "草地一角立着一座木屋，覆着一层白雪。"

    # game/script.rpy:56045
    old "Speechless, he was drawn to it.{w} The grass was tall, and it had almost been concealed by the snow. Slowly making his way inward, Gan didn't take his eyes off the cabin."
    new "他说不出话，脚步却不由自主地朝那里挪去。{w}草长得很高，几乎被雪盖住。Gan 缓缓向里走，目光始终没有离开那座木屋。"

    # game/script.rpy:56046
    old "He'd never heard about it, and it looked abandoned. Many questions came to him, but they all suddenly vanished."
    new "他从没听说过这个地方，木屋看着也早已废弃。许多疑问涌上心头，却又忽然散得一干二净。"

    # game/script.rpy:56047
    old "He looked at the ground. On top of the snow, he'd almost missed something that easily blended in."
    new "他低头看向地面。雪地上有个东西几乎和雪融为一体，他差点就错过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56049
    old "Was it... an egg? He crouched by its side and felt its surface. Strangely, no snow was on it."
    new "那是……一颗蛋？他蹲下身，摸了摸它的表面。奇怪的是，上面一点雪也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:56050
    old "When he touched it, his face was one of amazement. It was incredibly smooth, but it was heavier than it looked. He'd never seen anything like it in his life."
    new "他伸手一摸，满脸惊讶。它光滑得不可思议，分量也比看上去重得多。这样的东西，他这辈子从没见过。"

    # game/script.rpy:56051
    old "What was it, and why was it there? Gan didn't care and was eager to bring it home."
    new "这究竟是什么，又怎么会出现在这儿？Gan 顾不上多想，只想赶快把它带回家。"

    # game/script.rpy:56052
    old "It looked like a gemstone, but it hadn't been underground. Content to have found something, he kept walking toward the cabin."
    new "它看着像颗宝石，却并没有埋在地下。总算有所收获，他心满意足，继续朝木屋走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:56056
    old "The door was open, so he took a look inside.{w} A few spiders had set up shop there. Most of them had died out during the winter, but their webs still decorated the room."
    new "门开着，他便探头往里看。{w}几只蜘蛛在此安了家。它们大多没能熬过冬天，蛛网却仍装点着屋子。"

    # game/script.rpy:56057
    old "Gan didn't dare look down into the storeroom. The last thing he wanted was for some large spider still living down there to be disturbed by him."
    new "Gan 没敢往下面的储藏室张望。他可不希望惊动还住在那儿的大蜘蛛。"

    # game/script.rpy:56058
    old "As he'd expected, it didn't seem like anyone had been there in a long time."
    new "果然如他所料，这里看上去很久没人来过了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56062
    old "The 27th of November was a Sunday. That was why Gan had chosen it to go to Airun."
    new "十一月二十七日是星期天。Gan 正是挑了这个日子去艾伦山。"

    # game/script.rpy:56066
    old "Late into the day, he arrived at home. With one hand, he unlocked his front door."
    new "天色已晚，他才回到家，单手打开了前门的锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:56072
    old "He stepped into his shop, Musashi Gemstones.{w} He left his discovery on a stand and hurried to turn on the heater. Then, he grabbed the phone and dialed a number he had memorized."
    new "他走进自己的店，武藏宝石。{w}他把发现的东西搁在展台上，忙去打开取暖器，随后抓起电话，拨出一个记熟的号码。"

    # game/script.rpy:56076
    old "Lei! I'm sorry to call you so late. Is this a good time?"
    new "Lei！这么晚打扰你，实在抱歉。现在方便说话吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:56077
    old "What do you want?"
    new "什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:56078
    old "I just found something that will interest you. You have to see it."
    new "我刚找到一样你一定会感兴趣的东西。你得亲眼看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:56079
    old "Is it about a gemstone?"
    new "跟宝石有关？"

    # game/script.rpy:56080
    old "Y-Yes, but it's not a normal one. I found it on Airun, and it's unlike any I've seen."
    new "是、是的，可不是寻常货色。我在艾伦山找到的，从没见过那样的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:56081
    old "...Is that so?{w} If you're not exaggerating, you might be in luck."
    new "……是吗？{w}要是你没夸大其词，说不定你走运了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56082
    old "I'm not. I'm certain this would fit perfectly in the tower."
    new "我没有夸大。这东西放进芦屋塔里，绝对再合适不过。"

    # game/script.rpy:56083
    old "Is it all right if I come tomorrow? I want to speak to you about something."
    new "我明天过去一趟，可以吗？有些事想跟你谈谈。"

    # game/script.rpy:56084
    old "Yes, that's perfectly fine."
    new "当然可以，没问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:56085
    old "I'll be there in the afternoon, then."
    new "那我下午到。"

    # game/script.rpy:56086
    old "Thank you! I'll be waiting.{w} Good night."
    new "谢谢！我等你。{w}晚安。"

    # game/script.rpy:56091
    old "The call cut off.{w} Gan pumped his fist in relief. It had been a while since he'd struck a deal with Ashiya."
    new "电话挂断了。{w}Gan 松了口气，挥了挥拳头。他已经很久没和芦屋做成生意了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56092
    old "He sat on his chair. He was tired, and he had to think about what he'd say the next day."
    new "他在椅子上坐下。人很疲惫，可明天该说些什么，他还得好好想想。"

    # game/script.rpy:56098
    old "A while later, he raised his head. He had noticed something.{w} A smell he hadn't perceived before was in his shop."
    new "过了一会儿，他抬起头，察觉到了异样。{w}店里弥漫着一股先前没有的气味。"

    # game/script.rpy:56099
    old "He couldn't discern what it was, but he slowly walked over to the gem he'd brought."
    new "他分辨不出那是什么味道，脚步却慢慢挪向带回来的那颗宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:56100
    old "Was it the source? He got close to it, but he suddenly retreated."
    new "气味的源头是它吗？他凑近了些，却又猛地退开。"

    # game/script.rpy:56101
    old "Then, carefully, he placed his hand on it."
    new "随后，他小心翼翼地伸手覆了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:56102
    old "...{w}It was hot. Very hot.{w} Why? It had been cold before. Why had its temperature changed?"
    new "……{w}很烫。烫得厉害。{w}怎么会？之前明明还是凉的。温度为什么会变？"

    # game/script.rpy:56103
    old "Concerned, he grabbed it.{w} He examined it closely, but there was no explanation for the temperature change. What could've caused that? And most importantly, would it ward Ashiya off from buying it?"
    new "他心里不安，把宝石拿了起来。{w}他仔细端详，却找不出温度变化的原因。究竟是什么让它变热的？更要紧的是，芦屋会不会因此不肯买下它？"

    # game/script.rpy:56107
    old "He stepped out of his shop. Outside, it had remained cold."
    new "他走出店门。屋外依旧寒冷。"

    # game/script.rpy:56108
    old "And soon after he did, the gem cooled down. In the blink of an eye, the warmth around it had faded."
    new "他刚出去没多久，宝石就凉了下来。转眼之间，它散出的温热便消失殆尽。"

    # game/script.rpy:56109
    old "Was it the surrounding temperature? No matter what, it hadn't seemed normal."
    new "是因为周围的温度吗？无论如何，这东西都不寻常。"

    # game/script.rpy:56112
    old "In awe, Gan stepped back in, letting the heat make contact with the gem."
    new "Gan 满心惊异，又走回店里，让室内的热气接触到宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:56113
    old "Immediately, he noticed the change. The smooth surface began to heat up exponentially."
    new "他立刻察觉到变化。光滑的表面开始急剧升温。"

    # game/script.rpy:56114
    old "What did he have in his hands, exactly? How was such a rapid change in temperature occurring?"
    new "他手里拿的到底是什么？温度怎么会升得如此之快？"

    # game/script.rpy:56115
    old "And would Ashiya be against taking such a thing? Gan began to worry."
    new "而这样的东西，芦屋会不会不肯收？Gan 开始担忧起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:56116
    old "He remembered that a long time ago, Ashiya had sold him storage cabinets, and one of them had been equipped with temperature regulation. Biting his lip, he went to his storage room."
    new "他想起很久以前，芦屋卖过几台展示柜给他，其中一台配有温控装置。他咬了咬嘴唇，走向储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:56125
    old "One of the dusty cabinets had a wheel on its side. He dragged it close to an outlet and plugged it in."
    new "那些积满灰尘的展示柜里，有一个侧面装着旋轮。他把它拖到插座旁，接上了电源。"

    # game/script.rpy:56126
    old "The temperature in Yushibana was around 0 °C. Matching it, he rotated the wheel and brought the gemstone there."
    new "丰花的气温大约在0 °C。他把旋轮转到相同的温度，把宝石放进了柜子。"

    # game/script.rpy:56127
    old "After leaving it inside, he waited for the temperature to stabilize."
    new "把宝石放进去后，他等着温度稳定下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:56128
    old "And when it had, he touched the gemstone one more time.{w} All warmth was long gone, and the smell had also faded."
    new "等温度稳住了，他又碰了一次那颗宝石。{w}温热早已散尽，那股气味也淡了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56129
    old "It was bizarre, but Gan's mind went again to Ashiya. What would they say about something so peculiar...?"
    new "事情实在离奇，可 Gan 又想起了芦屋。碰上这么古怪的东西，他们会怎么说呢……？"

    # game/script.rpy:56132
    old "Tired, he went to his bedroom. He knew he would fall asleep instantly."
    new "他累坏了，回到卧室。他知道自己一躺下就会睡着。"

    # game/script.rpy:56133
    old "He was still in his mountain equipment—jacket, hat, and gloves—so he hurried to take them off."
    new "他身上还穿着上山那套行头——外套、帽子、手套——便赶紧脱了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:56141
    old "The next day, Lei came to visit Gan, who had been preparing what to say."
    new "第二天，Lei 来找 Gan，而 Gan 早已想好了说辞。"

    # game/script.rpy:56142
    old "After a warm welcome, she was brought to the Sekimeiya—that was the name Gan had chosen for the gemstone."
    new "寒暄过后，他把她带到 Sekimeiya 那里——那是 Gan 给这颗宝石起的名字。"

    # game/script.rpy:56146
    old "As soon as Lei saw it, she let him know Ashiya were interested in buying it. It had taken a lot less convincing than Gan had expected."
    new "Lei 一看到它，便告诉他芦屋有意买下。要说服她，比他预想的容易得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:56147
    old "Lei let him know the reason. Ashiya had been searching for a unique gemstone, and the one he'd found would serve that purpose well."
    new "Lei 说明了缘由。芦屋一直在寻找一颗独一无二的宝石，而他找到的这颗正好合用。"

    # game/script.rpy:56148
    old "Gan and Lei had long ago agreed on a standard starting sum per gemstone, which Gan couldn't pass on. However, he hadn't yet mentioned what he'd found out about the Sekimeiya."
    new "Gan 和 Lei 早就约定过每颗宝石的标准起价，这一步 Gan 不能略过。不过，他还没提起自己发现的关于 Sekimeiya 的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:56152
    old "Yesterday, I noticed the heater's temperature might've damaged it. That's why I've got it cold right now."
    new "昨天我发现暖气的温度可能把它弄坏了。所以现在让它保持低温。"

    # game/script.rpy:56153
    old "Oh, it's cold in there?"
    new "哦？里面是冷的？"

    # game/script.rpy:56154
    old "...Yes. I advise you to do the same. The lower temperature seemed to immediately alleviate the problem. It's currently set to 0 °C."
    new "……是的。我建议你们也这么做。温度降下来之后，问题似乎立刻就缓解了。现在设的是0 °C。"

    # game/script.rpy:56155
    old "That's fine. We can do that."
    new "好，没问题。我们可以照办。"

    # game/script.rpy:56156
    old "Good. Just in case, I would suggest you not touch it while it's not refrigerated. It's delicate, so I wouldn't risk it."
    new "那就好。保险起见，我建议在没冷藏的时候不要碰它。它很娇贵，我不想冒这个险。"

    # game/script.rpy:56157
    old "Lei silently nodded.{w} Gan took a deep breath. If Ashiya did what he had instructed, there would be no problem."
    new "Lei 默默点了点头。{w}Gan 深吸一口气。只要芦屋照他说的做，就不会出问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:56158
    old "We'll deal with the paperwork, then. You know the usual.{w} We'll be here this Wednesday. Is {time=21} a good time? Sorry if it's too late, we're pretty overloaded."
    new "那手续就由我们来办。老规矩，你知道的。{w}我们这周三过来。{time=21}方便吗？要是太晚了很抱歉，我们实在忙不过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:56159
    old "Yes, any time is fine. I'm still open at that hour, so I'll have everything prepared."
    new "可以，几点都行。那个时间我店里还开着，我会把一切都准备好。"

    # game/script.rpy:56160
    old "Perfect."
    new "那就好。"

    # game/script.rpy:56166
    old "Both of them bowed, and Lei calmly exited his shop."
    new "两人互相鞠了一躬，Lei 从容地走出他的店。"

    # game/script.rpy:56176
    old "When Gan woke up, he didn't open the shop. He'd been thinking that something else could've been on that mountain."
    new "Gan 醒来后没有开店。他一直在想，那座山上或许还有别的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:56177
    old "The gemstone he'd found... Why had it been there? Snow had fallen days prior, so why had none been on it?{w} Had someone dropped it there? Someone who knew about that place?"
    new "他找到的那颗宝石……为什么会出现在那里？几天前下过雪，它上面为什么一点雪也没沾？{w}是有人把它掉在那里的吗？一个知道那个地方的人？"

    # game/script.rpy:56178
    old "Ashiya paid well, so Gan hadn't stopped thinking about going back to that grassy field... Was it possible he had missed something?"
    new "芦屋出手阔绰，Gan 一直在琢磨要不要再回那片草地……会不会自己漏掉了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:56184
    old "When he spotted the familiar opening between the trees, Gan deviated from the narrow path."
    new "望见树丛间那道熟悉的缺口，Gan 便离开了那条窄路。"

    # game/script.rpy:56187
    old "Once more, he saw the short cabin. It was two days later, so his footprints had almost fully disappeared."
    new "他又一次看到了那座低矮的小屋。已经过去两天，他的脚印几乎全消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56189
    old "He scanned the terrain, slowly stepping forward. He noticed something and hurried over to it."
    new "他缓步向前，扫视着四周。他发现了什么，便急忙赶了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:56191
    old "A section of white stood out, but it wasn't snow. He approached and slowly reached down."
    new "一片白色格外显眼，但那不是雪。他走上前，慢慢俯下身，伸出手。"

    # game/script.rpy:56194
    old "It was another gemstone, identical to the one he'd found."
    new "那是另一颗宝石，和他找到的那颗一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:56199
    old "Gan searched through the entire field, but he found nothing else."
    new "Gan 把整片草地都搜了一遍，却再没找到别的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:56204
    old "At home, he called Lei and told her about his latest discovery. When she heard it looked the same, she sounded interested."
    new "回到家，他打电话给 Lei，说了这次的发现。听说那颗宝石长得一模一样，她似乎很感兴趣。"

    # game/script.rpy:56205
    old "However, there was an issue: Ashiya had already revealed the Sekimeiya's existence. On that day, the primary announcements had been made."
    new "然而，有一个问题：芦屋已经公开了 Sekimeiya 的存在。就在那天，初步公告已经发布。"

    # game/script.rpy:56206
    old "You know what? This might be great.{w} You remember what I told you, don't you?{w} We're keeping the details of the Sekimeiya a secret, and this could be something perfect to reveal on the day of the event. We'll buy both of them."
    new "你知道吗？这也许是件大好事。{w}你还记得我跟你说过的吧？{w}Sekimeiya 的细节我们一直保密，而这件事正好可以在活动当天公布。我们两颗都要了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56207
    old "There were many things Lei hadn't told Gan, but that was the truth. If Xyn didn't make their move before the 15th, Ashiya could justify part of the build-up on the existence of two identical, paired gemstones."
    new "Lei 有很多事没告诉 Gan，但这句话是真的。只要 Xyn 在15号之前没有动作，芦屋就可以用这两颗一模一样的成对宝石，为部分造势给出合理的解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:56208
    old "That is why, until that day, most people who uttered the words \"the Sekimeiya\" weren't aware they were referring to two gemstones at once."
    new "因此，直到那一天为止，说出「Sekimeiya」这个词的人，大多并不知道自己指的是两颗宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:56237
    old "Corrosion Fatigue"
    new "腐蚀疲劳"

    # game/script.rpy:56241
    old "In a small town encircled by mountains, a house stood out from the others. It was surrounded by an empty field, and it was often referred to as a mansion."
    new "在群山环抱的小镇上，有一栋房子格外醒目。它四周是一片空旷的荒地，人们常称它为宅邸。"

    # game/script.rpy:56242
    old "Nobody truly knew the family who lived in it, but the numerous nasty rumors about them were known by all.{w} For a long time, they were believed to be secretly authoritarian. However, crimes had recently started to be linked back to them."
    new "住在里面的是怎样一家人，没人真正了解，但关于他们的种种恶毒传言却无人不知。{w}长久以来，人们都认为他们暗地里独断专横。可近来，开始有案件被追查到他们头上。"

    # game/script.rpy:56248
    old "When the afternoon came, a swarm of students exited the single school in town. It was starting to get cold, so most of them walked home."
    new "到了下午，镇上唯一一所学校涌出一群学生。天气渐渐冷了，大多数人步行回家。"

    # game/script.rpy:56253
    old "In the mansion's living room, a thirteen-year-old boy named Kyuuka sat on a large sofa. It was his favorite spot, the most comfortable place in his own world. Idly, just passing the time, he watched whatever was on television by himself."
    new "宅邸的客厅里，一个叫 Kyuuka 的十三岁男孩坐在一张大沙发上。那是他最喜欢的位置，是他自己世界里最舒服的地方。他独自看着电视上随便播着什么，闲散地打发时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:56254
    old "Most days, he would come home from school and do that. In the past, he had sometimes played with friends, but he had distanced himself from them as time went on."
    new "大多数日子，他放学回家后都是这样。从前他偶尔还会和朋友一起玩，可随着时间推移，他和他们疏远了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56255
    old "Solitude was his preference. The lesson he had taught himself from years of exposure to others was that they weren't worth his time, and so once in a while, he wouldn't go to school for the simple reason that it was too much of a bother."
    new "他偏爱独处。多年来与别人打交道，他自己得出的结论是：他们不值得他费时间。所以，他偶尔会嫌上学太麻烦，干脆不去。"

    # game/script.rpy:56257
    old "His parents were upstairs. He had, over time, picked up on what their \"business\" entailed, but the details were neither accessible nor relevant to him."
    new "他的父母在楼上。久而久之，他也隐约察觉到他们的「生意」是做什么的，但细节他既接触不到，也与己无关。"

    # game/script.rpy:56264
    old "Kyuuka heard the door open. When he glanced over, he saw his older brother stepping in with a girl he'd never seen before."
    new "Kyuuka 听见门开了。他瞥了一眼，见哥哥正走进来，身边跟着一个他从没见过的女孩。"

    # game/script.rpy:56266
    old "She's a friend of mine. I'm just going to show her the house."
    new "我的朋友。我带她参观一下房子。"

    # game/script.rpy:56267
    old "Without saying a word, she was brought upstairs. Kyuuka saw it as none of his concern at all. In his eyes, she was either somebody related to his parents' business or just another source of entertainment for his brother."
    new "她一言不发，被带上了楼。Kyuuka 觉得这事同自己毫无关系。在他眼里，她要么和父母的生意有关，要么只是哥哥又一个消遣的对象。"

    # game/script.rpy:56272
    old "When night had come, he hadn't seen anyone else."
    new "直到入夜，他再没见过其他人。"

    # game/script.rpy:56276
    old "After making his own food, Kyuuka walked to his bedroom. He couldn't easily fall asleep with things being so noisy, so he covered himself with the sheets."
    new "自己做了点吃的之后，Kyuuka 回了卧室。四下这般吵闹，他很难入睡，便裹上了被子。"

    # game/script.rpy:56284
    old "The next evening, watching television as usual, he saw a familiar face. A girl had disappeared in the town where he lived."
    new "第二天傍晚，他照例看着电视，屏幕上出现了一张熟悉的面孔。他居住的镇上，有一名少女失踪了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56286
    old "Kyuuka wasn't remotely surprised. They didn't operate in shadows; there was no need to do so."
    new "Kyuuka一点也不意外。他们行事从不遮遮掩掩，也没那个必要。"

    # game/script.rpy:56287
    old "...She was the daughter of someone with strong ties to the town's leadership. That made sense. His brother was just carrying out something that was both productive and fun for him."
    new "……她是镇上掌权者亲信的女儿。这就说得通了。哥哥只是在做一件对他而言既有好处又有趣的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:56294
    old "Hours later, his older brother came down from upstairs. He looked cheerful and left after silently waving to Kyuuka."
    new "几个小时后，哥哥从楼上下来。他一脸愉快，默默朝Kyuuka挥了挥手，便出门了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56295
    old "He'd learned the girl's name: Anora. It made no difference. Regardless of her name, she was locked in the same room as always.{w} Soon, he heard plaintive cries coming from above."
    new "他知道了那名少女的名字：Anora。这并没有什么不同。不管她叫什么，都还是像往常一样被锁在那个房间里。{w} 不久，楼上传来凄楚的哭喊声。"

    # game/script.rpy:56296
    old "Kyuuka responded by turning up the volume."
    new "Kyuuka把电视音量调大了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56297
    old "Eventually, his brother came back with some bags he hadn't left with."
    new "后来，哥哥回来了，手里提着几个他出门时没带的袋子。"

    # game/script.rpy:56305
    old "A day had passed with no minute full of silence. In the living room, Kyuuka tried to ignore the muffled noise. Whenever those situations occurred, he went to school just to get away from it for a while, but he had to come home eventually."
    new "一天过去，没有哪一分钟是安宁的。Kyuuka待在客厅里，尽量不去理会那阵沉闷的动静。每次遇上这种情形，他都会去学校躲上一阵，可终究还是要回家。"

    # game/script.rpy:56306
    old "He didn't like it. He knew that girl was suffering, and he didn't want that.{w} However, he wouldn't talk his brother out of it, and he didn't want to annoy him. Furthermore, the room upstairs was always locked, and he couldn't bring himself to let anybody know."
    new "他不喜欢这样。他知道那个女孩正在受苦，他并不想看到这种事。{w} 可他不会去劝哥哥收手，也不想惹他心烦。再说，楼上的房间总是锁着，他实在没法鼓起勇气告诉别人。"

    # game/script.rpy:56307
    old "She hadn't done anything to deserve it, presumably. Few of the people his brother brought home gave him that impression. He didn't think of himself as a bad person, and would have helped her if he could, but that was a mere notion. It wasn't realistic enough for him to act on."
    new "她大概也没做过什么该遭这份罪的事。哥哥带回家的人里，几乎没人让他觉得活该如此。他不认为自己是个坏人，如果有能力，他也愿意帮她——可那不过是个念头，还不足以让他真的去做。"

    # game/script.rpy:56308
    old "That was why he'd always stayed aside, quietly sitting on that sofa."
    new "所以他一向置身事外，只是安静地坐在那张沙发上。"

    # game/script.rpy:56309
    old "But his mind suddenly changed when he saw something he hadn't seen in a long time."
    new "然而，当他看见一样久违的东西时，想法忽然变了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56314
    old "It was a key.{w} When his brother had gone up loaded with what he'd bought, he'd left his keys in the keyhole."
    new "是一把钥匙。{w} 哥哥抱着一堆买回来的东西上楼时，把钥匙忘在了锁孔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:56315
    old "Kyuuka silently stood up and walked over. He looked back, confirming his brother wasn't coming."
    new "Kyuuka无声地起身，走了过去。他回头望了一眼，确认哥哥没有下楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:56316
    old "Then, he detached one of the keys from the ring and stored it in his pocket."
    new "然后，他从钥匙串上取下一把，收进了口袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:56321
    old "Beyond the wooden ceiling, she continued to yell. On some level, such barbarism disgusted Kyuuka. He was getting tired of it."
    new "木天花板的另一边，她仍在叫喊。这种野蛮行径让 Kyuuka 有些恶心。他也快受够了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56322
    old "Sighing, he lay on his side to muffle the sound entering at least one of his ears. He'd endured louder, and for longer."
    new "他叹了口气，侧身躺下，好让至少一只耳朵少听见些声音。比这更响、更久的，他都忍过。"

    # game/script.rpy:56323
    old "Part of him really did wish to take action for once, whether it was from the presence of the key or not. It had been ages since he'd had a conversation with his brother, but at some point, a part of him had come to revile his sibling."
    new "他心底确实有一部分想真的行动一次，不论是不是那把钥匙的缘故。他已经很久没和哥哥说过话，但不知从什么时候起，他心里开始厌恶这个兄长。"

    # game/script.rpy:56324
    old "He asked himself a question. Was it worth doing something?"
    new "他问自己：值得去做吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:56328
    old "Answering that was difficult for Kyuuka. He didn't like people. They were rude, selfish, and just too much effort to deal with. If any of them had cared about him, he might have thought differently."
    new "Kyuuka很难回答这个问题。他不喜欢跟人打交道。他们粗鲁、自私，应付起来又太费力气。若是有人曾真正关心过他，他或许会有别的想法。"

    # game/script.rpy:56329
    old "On the other hand, he knew that he'd barely tried to speak to anyone in a long time, and his brother wasn't exactly deserving of anyone's attention, let alone approval."
    new "可另一方面，他也清楚自己很久没有主动和谁说过话了；而哥哥这样的人，本就不值得谁来关心，更谈不上认可。"

    # game/script.rpy:56330
    old "His parents and his brother—his whole family—was composed of deplorable individuals. He saw himself as different. It wasn't his choice to hurt people, and he would have actively stopped it if he could."
    new "父母和哥哥——他的整个家——尽是可鄙之人。他觉得自己与他们不同。伤害别人从来不是他的选择，若有能力，他也会主动去阻止。"

    # game/script.rpy:56331
    old "So, given the fact that he could, it only made sense to do so. When he thought about it like that, he came to a decision."
    new "既然他做得到，那就理应去做。这样一想，他便下了决心。"

    # game/script.rpy:56337
    old "The next day, Kyuuka stayed home. As soon as his parents left the house, he went up the stairs."
    new "第二天，Kyuuka留在家里。父母一出家门，他便上了楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:56341
    old "The phone was there. Quietly, he dialed the police's number.{w} When they picked up, he anonymously revealed Anora's whereabouts, claiming to have heard yells coming from the house. Then, before his brother could hear him, he slipped back to his sofa."
    new "电话就在那里。他悄悄拨了报警电话。{w} 接通后，他匿名说出了Anora的下落，只说自己听见那栋房子里传出喊叫声。随后，趁哥哥还没察觉，他又溜回了沙发上。"

    # game/script.rpy:56345
    old "There was no way out for his brother. He hadn't asked about the missing key, so thanks to that, he knew Anora would be found."
    new "哥哥已无路可逃。他没有问起那把不见的钥匙，也正因如此，Kyuuka知道Anora一定会被发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:56346
    old "Many years earlier, Kyuuka's parents had added a secret to their house. An entrance, or exit, nobody would notice. Kyuuka had seen it being used a handful of times."
    new "许多年前，Kyuuka的父母给这栋房子添了一个秘密。一处谁也不会留意的入口——或者说出口。Kyuuka曾见它被用过几次。"

    # game/script.rpy:56347
    old "The rumors about the mansion were known by the whole town. The first time that someone had disappeared, the police had quickly shown up.{w} Yet, thanks to that well-hidden exit, Kyuuka's brother had avoided being caught."
    new "这栋宅子的传闻，全镇无人不知。第一次有人失踪时，警察很快就赶来了。{w} 可凭着那处藏得极深的出口，Kyuuka的哥哥躲过了抓捕。"

    # game/script.rpy:56348
    old "Kyuuka knew that when the police appeared, his brother would try to escape with the girl. However, with the key that he had taken, that would be impossible."
    new "Kyuuka知道，警察一到，哥哥一定会带着那个女孩一起逃。可钥匙已经被Kyuuka拿走，他就不可能逃了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56354
    old "Hey, Kyuuka. What was that?"
    new "喂，Kyuuka。刚才那是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:56355
    old "His brother had appeared from upstairs. Internally panicking, Kyuuka responded."
    new "哥哥从楼上下来了。Kyuuka心里一惊，应道。"

    # game/script.rpy:56356
    old "What was what?"
    new "什么什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:56357
    old "I heard a noise. Did you want to come see or something?"
    new "我听见有动静。你是想上来看一眼还是怎么？"

    # game/script.rpy:56358
    old "...No. It was the TV."
    new "……没有。是电视。"

    # game/script.rpy:56359
    old "Ah, ah, okay. You have some free time though, right? Want to learn the works? Job training."
    new "啊，啊，这样。不过你现在有空吧？想不想学学这一行的门道？就当上岗培训。"

    # game/script.rpy:56360
    old "No. I'm tired, so maybe later."
    new "不了。我累了，以后再说吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:56361
    old "You say that every time. Oh well. I'll get back to it. If you don't want to learn the family business, you'd better go to school more. Keep your grades up. Hehe."
    new "你每次都这么说。算了。我回去继续了。你要是不想学家里的生意，那就多去学校，成绩别落下。嘿嘿。"

    # game/script.rpy:56364
    old "He went back upstairs. A few minutes had passed since Kyuuka had gotten off the phone. He'd accidentally alerted his brother, but that danger was gone. All he had to worry about from that point on was looking like an accomplice."
    new "他回了楼上。Kyuuka挂掉电话才过了几分钟。他刚才不慎惊动了哥哥，可那点风险已经过去。从现在起，他唯一要担心的，是自己看起来像个同伙。"

    # game/script.rpy:56370
    old "Barely seconds after his brother had gone back to the room, a sharp sound came from it."
    new "哥哥回房不过几秒，房里便传出一声尖锐的响动。"

    # game/script.rpy:56374
    old "No more yelling. No more anything. It was silent. A horrible feeling like being submerged in icy water overtook Kyuuka."
    new "喊声停了。什么声音都没有了。一片死寂。一种如被冰水浸没般的恶寒攫住了Kyuuka。"

    # game/script.rpy:56375
    old "His brother had a gun. He knew that. What he didn't know was why he would just shoot the girl."
    new "哥哥有枪，这他知道。他不知道的是，哥哥为什么就这样把那个女孩打死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56376
    old "The police were coming, and there was absolutely no chance his brother escaped with anything less than a murder charge. He deserved no less, but for him to kill her so suddenly was unthinkable. He hadn't given that impression at all a few seconds earlier."
    new "警察马上就到，哥哥绝无可能脱身，至少也要背上一桩杀人罪。他罪有应得，可这样突然就把人打死，实在难以想象。几秒钟之前，他可一点也没露出那种迹象。"

    # game/script.rpy:56377
    old "Kyuuka stood up and stepped up the stairs, eyeing the door warily. Each of his footsteps was carefully placed to prevent a repeat of being detected."
    new "Kyuuka站起身，走上楼梯，警惕地盯着那扇门。每一步都落得极轻，免得再被察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:56382
    old "The door wasn't locked. He gingerly nudged it open, not afraid that he'd see something worse than what he had before, but afraid that he might be shot by reflex."
    new "门没有上锁。他小心地把门推开，不是怕看见比先前更糟的景象，而是怕对方条件反射般开枪。"

    # game/script.rpy:56385
    old "The body of Kyuuka's brother was on the floor, completely immobile. There was no doubt in his mind that he was dead."
    new "Kyuuka的哥哥倒在地上，一动不动。他心里很清楚，他已经死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56386
    old "Something connected in his mind. His brother hadn't gone up just to shoot her right away. She had shot him. His noise had been the distraction that allowed her to escape confinement and get a weapon."
    new "他忽然把整件事串联了起来。哥哥上楼，并不是为了立刻开枪杀她。是她先开枪打死了哥哥。是他弄出的动静引开了哥哥的注意，让她得以挣脱束缚，拿到武器。"

    # game/script.rpy:56387
    old "The girl wasn't in the usual chair he used. Around it was an untied rope, and bloodstains much older than the ones surrounding Kyuuka's brother."
    new "那个女孩不在哥哥常用的那把椅子上。椅子周围散着解开的绳索，还有血迹，比Kyuuka哥哥身边那些陈旧得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:56388
    old "But Kyuuka didn't see her anywhere. The girl had vanished. Bewildered, he stepped into the room."
    new "可Kyuuka哪里都没看见她。女孩不见了。他满心困惑，走进了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:56393
    old "In an instant, she emerged from behind the door and shoved a gun up to his face. The barrel took up almost his entire field of vision."
    new "刹那间，她从门后闪出，把枪抵到他脸上。枪口几乎占满了他的整个视野。"

    # game/script.rpy:56394
    old "He couldn't think of a thing to say. No longer feeling like he was sinking, he felt nothing."
    new "他一句话也想不出来。那种不断下沉的感觉已经消失，剩下的只有一片空白。"

    # game/script.rpy:56395
    old "Give m-me one reason... not to... shoot you too."
    new "给、给我一个理由……让我不……不把你也打死。"

    # game/script.rpy:56396
    old "...{w}I called the police. They're on their way right now."
    new "……{w}我报警了。他们正在赶来的路上。"

    # game/script.rpy:56397
    old "Wh-What...? When?"
    new "什、什么……？什么时候？"

    # game/script.rpy:56398
    old "A few minutes ago."
    new "就在几分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:56399
    old "Her hand was shaking violently, and beyond the metal barrel, Kyuuka could see her face."
    new "她的手抖得厉害。越过那截金属枪管，Kyuuka 看清了她的脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:56400
    old "One of her eyes was missing, and the pain, dulled as it must have been, was getting to her. Adrenaline couldn't keep her going against exhaustion forever."
    new "她的一只眼睛已经没了。痛觉想必早已麻木，可那份痛楚仍在折磨着她。只靠肾上腺素硬撑，她终究敌不过疲惫。"

    # game/script.rpy:56401
    old "Why... Why wouldn't you c-call them earlier!? You were h-here... when I got here!"
    new "为、为什么……你为什么不早点叫他们！？我来的时、时候……你明明就在这里！"

    # game/script.rpy:56403
    old "He didn't say anything for a few seconds. The wrong response could've killed him."
    new "他沉默了几秒。答错一句话，就可能要了他的命。"

    # game/script.rpy:56406
    old "It was clear that she was completely unstable. She had lost so much blood that her actions were slightly sluggish as well."
    new "她显然已经完全失控。失血过多，连动作也变得有些迟缓。"

    # game/script.rpy:56407
    old "Do you know what he would have done if I'd called the police earlier? What he did to you, but worse."
    new "你知道我要是早点报警，他会做出什么吗？他会把对你做过的事再做一遍，而且变本加厉。"

    # game/script.rpy:56410
    old "Y-You didn't do anything! You let him... You let him do this!"
    new "你、你什么都没做！你就那么看着他……看着他做出这种事！"

    # game/script.rpy:56411
    old "...The police will be here in a few minutes. You're safe."
    new "……警察几分钟后就到。你安全了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56412
    old "I don't believe you!"
    new "我不信你！"

    # game/script.rpy:56413
    old "Kyuuka considered for a moment. He didn't have a good way to escape. Entering the room blindly had been a mistake for him."
    new "Kyuuka 权衡了一瞬。他找不出什么好的退路。贸然闯进这间屋子，本就是他的一步错棋。"

    # game/script.rpy:56414
    old "He had believed that even if she was just like everyone else, not worth caring about, it would be a good thing to put a stop to what his brother was doing to people. And it could have ended up costing him.{w} All Kyuuka had accomplished was getting him killed and putting himself in a dangerous position."
    new "他原以为，哪怕她和旁人没什么两样、不值得在意，能阻止哥哥再害人，总归是件好事。可这念头本可能让他自己付出性命。{w}到头来，Kyuuka 做到的，不过是害得哥哥丢了命，也把自己推入了险境。"

    # game/script.rpy:56415
    old "There was only one course of action he could take at that moment, and it happened almost automatically."
    new "那一刻，他能做的只有一件事，而且几乎是下意识地做了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:56422
    old "After repeatedly knocking, the police forced the door open."
    new "反复敲门无果后，警察强行撞开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:56426
    old "Drawn by the smell of blood and gunpowder, they immediately located the room where two corpses lay. A man and the kidnapped girl were on the floor."
    new "循着血腥与火药的气味，他们很快找到了躺着两具尸体的房间。一名男子和那名被绑架的少女倒在地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:56429
    old "Immediately, the entire mansion was secured, but nobody else was found."
    new "整座宅邸随即被封锁，但再没找到其他人。"

    # game/script.rpy:56439
    old "The next day, the news was published: Anora, the girl who'd disappeared, had been found dead high on a mountain. One of her eyes had been gouged out, and the other had a bullet through it. A bewildered Kyuuka read that article."
    new "第二天，新闻登了出来：失踪的少女 Anora 被发现死在山上。她的一只眼睛被剜去，另一只则中了一枪。Kyuuka 满心茫然地读完了那篇报道。"

    # game/script.rpy:56443
    old "That day, he came back home and realized that his parents were there.{w} As usual, he had no idea what they would say."
    new "那天他回到家，才发现父母也在。{w}和往常一样，他完全猜不到他们会说些什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:56447
    old "Before they saw him, his parents looked terribly sad. However, when he appeared, relief spread through them."
    new "他还没露面时，父母脸上的悲伤浓得化不开。可他一出现，那份悲色便化作了如释重负。"

    # game/script.rpy:56448
    old "His parents didn't talk about what had happened. While he found it strange, Kyuuka couldn't bring himself to utter a word about it either."
    new "父母对发生过的事只字不提。Kyuuka 觉得奇怪，可他自己也开不了口，半个字都没说出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:56456
    old "Kyuuka would be the family's final generation. That was something he was sure of."
    new "Kyuuka 会是这个家族的最后一代。这一点他确信无疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:56457
    old "However, even that was stripped away. On paper, at least. After what had happened with his brother, his last name carried a heavy stigma, and so his parents took action."
    new "可就连这一点也被剥夺了。至少在纸面上如此。哥哥的事之后，这个姓氏背负了沉重的污名，父母于是采取了行动。"

    # game/script.rpy:56458
    old "He was released from that family. Then, he kept secretly living in that mansion until he was given a new place in the center of the town."
    new "他被那个家族除名。此后，他一直偷偷住在宅邸里，直到在镇中心得到了一处新的住处。"

    # game/script.rpy:56459
    old "If nothing else, he appreciated that his job wasn't nearly as dirty as it could have been—and that he had some peace and quiet."
    new "至少有一点让他庆幸：这份工作远没有那么肮脏，而且他还能落得几分清静。"

    # game/script.rpy:56474
    old "Molehill"
    new "鼹鼠丘"

    # game/script.rpy:56478
    old "The lights turned on in the tower.{w} The lobby door opened, and a man stepped into the hallway."
    new "塔内亮起了灯。{w}大厅的门打开，一名男子走进走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:56479
    old "It was Katei, who had recently changed into his working uniform. Ready to begin his morning shift, he entered the security room."
    new "是 Katei，他刚换好工作制服，正准备开始早班，走进了监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:56489
    old "His colleague Cou was ready to leave. After greeting each other, Katei sat on his chair."
    new "同事 Cou 正准备下班。两人打过招呼，Katei 在椅子上坐下。"

    # game/script.rpy:56492
    old "Over the phone, he'd learned Xyn had attacked again. It had happened on the 24th, and it had started during his own shift.{w} On that Thursday, there had been an event in the tower where many gemstones had been replaced. The next night, they had all been taken."
    new "他在电话里得知，Xyn 又动手了。事情发生在 24 号，而且就始于他自己的班次。{w}那个星期四，塔里办过一场活动，许多宝石被替换。第二天夜里，它们全被劫走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56493
    old "Long ago, his job had started to exclusively revolve around Xyn. Ashiya had been outsmarted repeatedly, and every countermeasure they designed was continually bypassed.{w} It was Katei's job to put an end to those incidents. However, his thoughts on Ashiya were far from positive. He'd worked in the tower for years, and he knew information that eluded public knowledge."
    new "很久以前，他的工作就开始只围着 Xyn 打转。芦屋屡屡被人算计，他们设计的每一项对策都被不断绕过。{w}终结这些事件，正是 Katei 的职责。但他对芦屋的评价绝谈不上正面。他在塔里工作多年，知道许多外界无从得知的内情。"

    # game/script.rpy:56494
    old "He was fully aware that none of his superiors belonged to the Ashiya family anymore. It had been long ago when the corporation had lost all ties to their actual bloodline."
    new "他很清楚，自己的上司里没有一个人还属于芦屋家族。这家公司早已与真正的血脉断绝了关系。"

    # game/script.rpy:56499
    old "Katei stared at the three monitors in front of him, and as he moved the cursor toward a folder, his heart began to race."
    new "Katei 盯着面前的三台显示器。当他把光标移向一个文件夹时，心跳陡然加快。"

    # game/script.rpy:56500
    old "Xyn had circumvented their measures multiple times, but that hadn't been all. Camera footage had been erased, and they'd taken advantage of the rare times when the security room had been empty."
    new "Xyn 不止一次绕过了他们的防线，事情还不止于此。监控录像被人抹去，而对方正是趁着监控室难得无人的时候下的手。"

    # game/script.rpy:56501
    old "Katei knew someone close to them worked for Xyn. There was no other explanation anymore."
    new "Katei 知道，他们身边有人替 Xyn 做事。事到如今，已经没有别的解释了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56502
    old "There were many candidates he had considered, but they'd all looked clean. As he approached a hidden folder, he wondered again who it was. A few places in the tower weren't fitted with cameras, but trying to catch Xyn on video had long ago started to feel like a futile effort."
    new "他考虑过的可疑对象不少，可每一个看上去都毫无问题。靠近那个隐藏文件夹时，他又一次想：到底会是谁？塔里有几处没有安装摄像头，但想靠录像抓住 Xyn，他早就觉得是徒劳。"

    # game/script.rpy:56503
    old "Katei had ruminated on something for quite a while. He wanted to use the places without cameras to catch the infiltrator."
    new "有件事 Katei 已经盘算很久了。他想利用那些没有摄像头的区域，揪出混进来的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:56504
    old "Before arriving at the tower, he'd been told that footage of hallway A had been erased. That was why he'd been nervous all morning."
    new "来塔里之前，他听说 A走廊的录像被抹掉了。所以整个上午他都心神不宁。"

    # game/script.rpy:56507
    old "But he had to be careful. Opening that folder might've been a bad idea."
    new "但他必须小心。打开那个文件夹，也许并不是个好主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:56508
    old "How had Xyn erased the footage? It had always happened during times when the security room was vacant, but Katei thought that was off. Most recently, it had happened when he'd been out, but he didn't think anyone would've had enough time to remove the footage."
    new "Xyn 究竟是怎么抹掉录像的？每次出事，监控室都恰好无人，可 Katei 觉得这不对劲。最近这次发生在他外出期间，但他并不认为有谁来得及删除录像。"

    # game/script.rpy:56509
    old "Could that computer have been infected? Like he'd done in the past, he spent the entire morning cleaning it up as much as he could."
    new "那台电脑会不会中了病毒？像以前那样，他花了一整个上午，尽可能地把它清理干净。"

    # game/script.rpy:56512
    old "And when he was done, he sent the folder to an e-mail address that he had created at home."
    new "做完之后，他把那个文件夹发送到自己在家注册的电子邮箱。"

    # game/script.rpy:56519
    old "That evening, he hurried to his personal computer. He'd been wondering all day if his plan had worked."
    new "那天傍晚，他匆匆赶到自己的电脑前。一整天他都在想，自己的计划究竟有没有奏效。"

    # game/script.rpy:56520
    old "He hadn't spoken to anyone about it. There was no way Xyn had known about it."
    new "他没对任何人提起过。Xyn 不可能知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:56523
    old "Finally, he logged into his account and downloaded the folder."
    new "终于，他登录账户，下载了那个文件夹。"

    # game/script.rpy:56524
    old "Inside it, there was a long video."
    new "里面是一段很长的视频。"

    # game/script.rpy:56525
    old "The day before Xyn's attack, he'd been forced to momentarily rush out of the security room. During that time, part of the footage had been erased."
    new "Xyn 动手的前一天，他不得已临时冲出了监控室。就在那段时间里，一部分录像被抹掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56526
    old "Katei had been waiting for that to happen. That was why, when he'd dashed out of the security room, he hadn't closed its door."
    new "Katei 一直在等那一刻到来。正因如此，他冲出监控室时，才没有把门关上。"

    # game/script.rpy:56527
    old "The footage from hallway A had been erased, but had Xyn accounted for Katei's idea? During that time, another camera had been recording part of the hallway."
    new "A走廊的录像已经被抹掉，但 Xyn 有没有算到 Katei 这一手？在那段时间里，另一台摄像头录下了走廊的一部分。"

    # game/script.rpy:56528
    old "The computer's webcam, tucked behind one of the monitors. It spent most of the time turned off, but that time, it had been recording the hallway through the open door.{w} Katei had pressed a button behind the camera to begin the recording, and it wasn't a new device in the tower. There was no way Xyn had learned of his plan."
    new "那是电脑的摄像头，藏在其中一台显示器后面。它平时大多关着，可那一次，它正透过敞开的门，录下走廊里的情形。{w} Katei 按下了摄像头背后的按钮开始录像，而这并不是塔里新添的设备。Xyn 不可能得知他的计划。"

    # game/script.rpy:56531
    old "Katei played the video, his trembling hand advancing it to the time he'd left the room. That had been the only time of the day when he hadn't monitored hallway A, so Xyn must've wanted to hide those few seconds."
    new "Katei 播放录像，颤抖的手把进度拖到他离开房间的那一刻。那是他当天唯一没有盯着 A走廊的时候，所以 Xyn 想遮掩的，一定就是那几秒。"

    # game/script.rpy:56532
    old "The time was before {time=9.} When Katei saw his face disappearing from the video, he let go of the mouse.{w} Then, he saw all he needed to see.{w} Through hallway A, someone he knew passed by. They were pushing a cleaning cart."
    new "时间停在 {time=9.} 之前。看到自己的脸从画面中消失，Katei 松开了鼠标。{w} 随后，该看的他都看到了。{w} 一个他认识的人推着清洁推车，从 A走廊经过。"

    # game/script.rpy:56533
    old "That was what Xyn had wanted to hide. Finally, he knew the identity of the infiltrator.{w} Ido, the janitor."
    new "Xyn 想遮掩的就是这个。他终于知道了潜入者的身份。{w} 清洁工 Ido。"

    # game/script.rpy:56534
    old "...But he still didn't know what had happened. Gemstones had been stolen from one of the rooms, but that hadn't happened until the following night. Yet, when they'd gone through the available footage, nobody had entered that room at the time of the attack."
    new "……可他依旧不知道究竟发生了什么。有一个房间的宝石被盗，但那要到第二天夜里才发生。然而，他们查遍手头能用的录像，袭击发生时并没有人进过那个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:56535
    old "Had they been moved? Katei stared at the cleaning cart, wondering if they'd been inside it. If that was the case, they could've immediately been taken out. However, during the time of the attack, Ido hadn't been in the building."
    new "宝石事先被转移了吗？Katei 盯着那辆清洁推车，想着它们是否曾藏在里面。若真是如此，它们本可以立刻被运出去。可袭击发生的时候，Ido 并不在楼里。"

    # game/script.rpy:56536
    old "There was something else of value Katei learned. The footage of some cameras had been erased while he was out of the security room. However, as he'd suspected, nobody had entered it before his return."
    new "Katei 还发现了另一件有价值的事。他离开监控室期间，有几台摄像头的录像被抹掉了。然而，正如他所料，在他回来之前，没人进过监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:56544
    old "Katei had started working in the tower decades ago, and many years were still ahead of him. He had worked on the building's security before the security room had been constructed, but that hadn't always been his job."
    new "Katei 几十年前就开始在塔里工作，前头还有好些年要熬。监控室建成之前，他就做过这栋楼的安保，不过安保并不是他一直以来的工作。"

    # game/script.rpy:56545
    old "When he looked at the future, he hated it. He loathed the thought of working there for even another year."
    new "想到未来，他只觉得憎恶。哪怕再多在这里干一年，他都无法忍受。"

    # game/script.rpy:56546
    old "He had no respect for Ashiya, and there was nothing about what the company had become that he identified with. He had seen the building change over the years to the point where it simply didn't feel the same."
    new "他对芦屋毫无敬意，公司变成如今这副模样，也没有任何让他认同的地方。多年来，他看着这栋楼一点点改变，到最后，这里已经全然不是从前的感觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:56547
    old "Since Xyn had reared their head in pursuit of Ashiya, some concepts had become tempting to Katei."
    new "自 Xyn 冒头、盯上芦屋以来，有些念头对 Katei 而言变得格外诱人。"

    # game/script.rpy:56550
    old "During his night shifts, he was sometimes the only person in the building. He had given plenty of thought to taking out Ashiya's collection of gemstones."
    new "值夜班时，他有时是楼里唯一的人。他无数次想过把芦屋收藏的宝石弄走。"

    # game/script.rpy:56551
    old "It should've been simple. It had happened before, so he could claim that the security footage had suddenly been erased and that he hadn't seen anything through the monitors."
    new "这本该很简单。以前也出过这种事，他大可以声称监控录像突然被抹掉，而他在监视器里什么也没看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:56552
    old "But that was too dangerous. Xyn seemed to know everything that happened in that place. What if they exposed Katei as being responsible? Would they dislike being impersonated? He was worried they would threaten him too.{w} And even if none of that happened, Katei didn't know what he'd do with those gems."
    new "但那太危险了。那地方发生的任何事，Xyn 似乎都了如指掌。万一他们揭穿此事是 Katei 所为呢？他们会容忍有人冒充自己吗？他担心自己也会遭到他们的威胁。{w} 就算这些都没发生，Katei 也不知道自己拿到那些宝石后能怎么办。"

    # game/script.rpy:56553
    old "After everything, Katei didn't think it was fair that he had to keep working there; he couldn't bear the thought of staying in that place for much longer. His parents had died, and he wouldn't be able to support himself for too long if he left his job. ...It wasn't fair.{w} After Xyn's first attack, his mind had produced various scenarios that gave him what he wanted."
    new "事到如今，Katei 觉得继续留在那里工作，对他并不公平；一想到还要在那地方待很久，他就无法忍受。父母已经去世，他若辞了工作，也撑不了多久。……这不公平。{w} Xyn 第一次袭击之后，他脑中就冒出过种种设想，每一种都能让他得偿所愿。"

    # game/script.rpy:56564
    old "When the morning came, Katei had slept very little. He'd wanted to find a Xyn member for so long, and he was confident he finally had.{w} Months ago, he'd come up with a tempting plan. However, it was fairly large scale, so he'd been very hesitant to set it into motion."
    new "天亮时，Katei 几乎没怎么睡。他找 Xyn 成员已经很久了，如今终于确信自己找到了一个。{w} 几个月前，他想出一个诱人的计划。可那计划规模不小，他一直迟迟不敢动手。"

    # game/script.rpy:56568
    old "He left his house earlier than usual. On the way, he called Lei. She was the only person he'd always been confident wasn't part of Xyn, as she wanted to catch them more than anyone else."
    new "他比平时更早出门。路上，他给 Lei 打了电话。她是他唯一始终确信与 Xyn 无关的人，因为没有人比她更想抓住 Xyn。"

    # game/script.rpy:56570
    old "Katei? What do you want?"
    new "Katei？有什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:56571
    old "I would like to talk to you later. It might not be a good idea to do it in the tower, so if I can meet you outside before my shift starts, that'd be great."
    new "我想晚些时候和你谈谈。在塔里说恐怕不合适，如果能在上班前到外面见一面，那就太好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56572
    old "Is it important?"
    new "重要吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:56574
    old "I understand. I will be there as soon as I can."
    new "我知道了。我会尽快赶过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:56580
    old "Outside the tower's entrance, Katei and Lei met. Furtively, they stepped aside."
    new "在塔的入口外，Katei 和 Lei 碰了面。两人悄悄走到一旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:56594
    old "I've had this idea for some time. If we're ever going to do something like this, it's right now."
    new "这个念头我盘算很久了。真要做这种事，现在就是最好的时机。"

    # game/script.rpy:56595
    old "After hearing that, Lei frowned. Meanwhile, Katei thought of the best way to phrase what he'd wanted to say for months."
    new "听到这话，Lei 皱起了眉。Katei 则在琢磨，该如何把憋了几个月的话说得最妥当。"

    # game/script.rpy:56600
    old "It's evident Xyn has a way to be in the tower without being seen, even when we're prepared. I believe we have to stop trying to see them while they're attacking."
    new "很明显，就算我们有所防备，Xyn 也有办法潜入塔里不被发现。我认为，我们不能再一味想着在他们袭击时当场看见他们了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56605
    old "When we added locks to the cabinets, they were able to unlock them and even broke some of them. It was a while ago, but remember what we thought? We removed those locks to prevent future damage and because that would incite Xyn to easily come back, so we'd be able to catch them."
    new "我们给展示柜加锁时，他们不仅能打开，甚至弄坏了几把。那是之前的事了，还记得我们当时怎么想的吗？我们撤掉那些锁，一是免得他们再来破坏，二是这样做会诱使 Xyn 轻易再来，我们才好抓住他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:56606
    old "We added an alarm to be alerted that cabinets were opened, but it didn't go off when they attacked. At this point, I find it impossible to believe they can't externally access the computer. I've looked into it many times, but that has to be true."
    new "我们加了警报，好知道展示柜被打开，可他们袭击时警报没有响。事到如今，要说他们无法从外部访问电脑，我实在无法相信。我查过很多次，但这一点肯定没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:56611
    old "Do you think we should change out the computer entirely?"
    new "你觉得我们该把整台电脑换掉吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:56616
    old "No. Access to our computer can't be all they have. If we change it, they'll immediately know they lost that information, which could be bad. I would also not be able to protect the new computer at all times.{w} I have an idea. If I develop the mechanism behind a new alarm at home, it's possible they won't be able to bypass it.{w} I think this is what we should do so that they don't think we're suspicious of anything involving our computer setup.{w} Once I set up the software for this at home, I'll bring it to the tower's computer. If I do it well, it's unlikely they'll notice it."
    new "不行。他们不可能只有进入我们电脑这一种手段。若把电脑换掉，他们立刻就会知道自己失去了那条情报渠道，那可能会坏事。而且我也没法时时刻刻守着新电脑。{w} 我有个主意。要是我在家里先把新警报的机关做出来，他们也许就绕不过去了。{w} 我认为就该这么做，这样他们也不会察觉我们对电脑相关的布置起了疑心。{w} 等我在家里把配套软件准备好，再装到塔里的电脑上。只要做得够稳妥，他们不太可能发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:56621
    old "...I see. I think that's worth doing."
    new "……我明白了。这值得一试。"

    # game/script.rpy:56622
    old "Me too, but we have to be smart. If this works, we have to catch them.{w} We can't screw this up. If they really activate the alarm, they might still have a method of escape. We have to make sure that won't be possible."
    new "我也这么想，但必须做得聪明。若计划奏效，我们就一定要抓住他们。{w} 绝不能搞砸。就算他们真的触发了警报，也还可能有逃跑的办法。我们得确保他们无路可逃。"

    # game/script.rpy:56632
    old "I can build it so that when the alarm is activated, any exits will close. As soon as they open a cabinet, they will be stuck in the tower.{w} I have thought a lot about this. They have attacked during times I was in the security room, so we'll make sure one of us is always there. If the mechanism also locks that door, we will trap the attacker."
    new "我可以把它做成这样：警报一触发，所有出口都会关闭。他们只要打开展示柜，就会被困在塔里。{w} 这件事我想了很久。他们之前几次动手时，我都待在监控室，所以我们得保证总有一人守在那里。如果机关也能把那扇门锁上，就能把袭击者困住。"

    # game/script.rpy:56635
    old "...Do you think this could work?"
    new "……你觉得这能行吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:56640
    old "It must. They have always attacked during the night, so I'm confident it will go smoothly."
    new "一定行。他们一向在夜里动手，我相信会顺利的。"

    # game/script.rpy:56645
    old "For the first time in what seemed like forever, Lei thought that one of Katei's ideas had real promise."
    new "仿佛隔了许久许久，Lei 第一次觉得 Katei 的某个主意确实有成功的希望。"

    # game/script.rpy:56646
    old "How would the exits be locked, though?"
    new "可是出口要怎么锁上？"

    # game/script.rpy:56651
    old "That's what I can't handle. If I use the old system, I can have the mechanism ready for tomorrow. The installation would have to be done during the night, though, when no one else is here.{w} It will be independent of the computer, so Xyn shouldn't learn about it. I believe it's possible they're receiving the camera's feed, but the lobby isn't recorded, so they won't see it."
    new "难就难在这里。若沿用旧系统，我明天就能把机关准备好。不过安装只能安排在夜里、楼里没别人的时候。{w} 它会独立于电脑，Xyn 应该不会知道。他们可能收得到摄像头的画面，但大厅没有录像，所以他们看不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:56652
    old "But what about the windows? Shouldn't they be shut as well?"
    new "可窗户呢？窗户不也得关上吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:56653
    old "...You're right—that would be seen. I wouldn't like to disable the camera system because they could learn something is being done under their noses.{w} Nothing happens on the higher floors during the night. I can modify the system from home as well to disable those cameras and loop a still image of the floors, then quickly install the modification on the tower's computer. I doubt Xyn will look at that footage, but if they do, they shouldn't notice the cameras were stopped."
    new "……你说得对，关窗会被看见。我不想关掉摄像系统，那样他们可能会察觉有人就在他们眼皮底下动手脚。{w} 夜里楼上不会有什么事。我也可以在家里改系统，关掉那些摄像头，让楼层的静止画面循环播放，然后尽快把改动装到塔里的电脑上。Xyn 未必会去看那段录像，就算看了，应该也看不出摄像头已经停了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56661
    old "However, we can't do it like the last time. Altering every cabinet to trigger the alarm is something that could easily be noticed, and it would take a long time."
    new "不过，不能照上次那样做。把每个展示柜都改得能触发警报，太容易被发现了，而且耗时很长。"

    # game/script.rpy:56666
    old "That's true, but it's what we would have to do."
    new "确实，可我们也只能这么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:56671
    old "We can draw them to a specific cabinet. Do you remember when we obtained the Nomdaid? It was targeted by Xyn immediately.{w} If we procure something of that caliber, Xyn won't be able to resist a repeat. That will be the cabinet we'll need to alter, and since it won't be one currently displayed, we can modify it before they know it exists."
    new "我们可以把他们引到某个特定的展示柜。还记得我们拿到诺姆达伊德的时候吗？Xyn 立刻就盯上了它。{w} 若再弄到一件那种级别的东西，Xyn 一定忍不住故技重施。要改的就是那个展示柜；既然它现在还不会展出，我们就能在他们知道它存在之前先动手改好。"

    # game/script.rpy:56676
    old "Lei nodded thoughtfully. Katei's plan could definitely work."
    new "Lei 若有所思地点了点头。Katei 的计划确实行得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:56677
    old "I see. I will try to find a good fit for that."
    new "我明白了。我会试着找一件合适的。"

    # game/script.rpy:56680
    old "Perfect. We should hurry up before they attack again.{w} If I'm not mistaken, the event for the 15th of next month was hindered. It was going to be a guided tour to cover the last wave of gems, but that can't be done anymore."
    new "很好。得赶在他们下次动手之前抓紧时间。{w}如果我没记错，下个月15号的活动已经受阻。原定要办一场导览，介绍最后一批宝石，现在办不成了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56685
    old "That's right. It's canceled as of now."
    new "没错。目前已经取消了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56686
    old "When you find a suitable gemstone, announce it'll be shown on that Thursday. This way, if Xyn doesn't attack beforehand, we'll still solve that problem."
    new "等找到合适的宝石，就宣布它将在那个周四展出。这样一来，即便Xyn没有提前动手，这个问题也能解决。"

    # game/script.rpy:56687
    old "That's a very good idea. I'll do that."
    new "这个主意很好。就这么办。"

    # game/script.rpy:56692
    old "Katei nodded slowly. That was what he'd needed the most.{w} The 15th was a Thursday, and also the middle point of the month. That meant that it was the day his work shift would change. In the first half of the month, Katei worked during the night, and in the second half, he worked during the morning.{w} Up until the 15th, he'd be in the tower all night, ready for Xyn's attack. However, he'd also learned Xyn made daylight moves. So, if the attack didn't happen before the 15th, Katei would be present during the event."
    new "Katei缓缓点头。这正是他最需要的东西。{w}15号是周四，也正好是月中，也就是说，那天他的班次会调换。上半月Katei值夜班，下半月值早班。{w}15号之前，他整夜都会守在塔里，等着Xyn来袭。不过他也已经知道，Xyn会在白天下手。所以，袭击若没在15号之前发生，Katei就能出现在活动上。"

    # game/script.rpy:56696
    old "I will do my best to find something appropriate. When it's ready, we'll put it in a prepared cabinet, and you will enable the system on the tower's computer."
    new "我会尽力找一件合适的。准备好之后，我们把它放进预留的展示柜，然后由你在塔里的电脑上启用系统。"

    # game/script.rpy:56702
    old "Why don't we do it differently? Why not make it so that opening the cabinet locks the room it's in, as opposed to the entire building?"
    new "不如换个做法。让展示柜一打开就封锁它所在的房间，而不是整栋楼，怎么样？"

    # game/script.rpy:56707
    old "No. That could go wrong. Altering those doors is much more likely to be noticed, and if someone inside the room was quick, they could get out before being trapped."
    new "不行，那样容易出岔子。改动那些门更容易被人察觉，而且房里的人动作够快的话，还可能在封死之前逃出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:56708
    old "Katei's voice was stern. He couldn't waver in initiating the plan."
    new "Katei的语气很严厉。启动这个计划时，他不能有半点动摇。"

    # game/script.rpy:56713
    old "You think so? I was thinking about a mechanical lock, not a shutter."
    new "你这么想？我考虑的是机械锁，不是卷帘门。"

    # game/script.rpy:56714
    old "That wouldn't work. They could keep the door open and put a hard object between it and the wall to prevent it from locking. I'm aware my idea is more complex, but we can't risk this."
    new "那行不通。他们可以让门一直开着，在门和墙之间塞个硬东西，门就锁不上。我知道我的办法更复杂，但我们不能冒这个险。"

    # game/script.rpy:56719
    old "All right, we'll talk about it further.{w} I will let Cou know about this when he leaves, and I'll speak to Wis. Is that fine?"
    new "好，我们再详谈。{w}Cou走的时候我会把这件事告诉他，也会跟Wis说一声。这样可以吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:56725
    old "Katei nodded after a pause. Cou and Wis were the first people he'd personally investigated, as they shared his job. He couldn't be completely certain, but he really didn't think they were part of Xyn.{w} Katei's shift was about to start, so he bowed and stepped into the tower. As he walked to the security room, he sighed, relieved Lei hadn't put more pressure on him.{w} That would've prevented what he had in mind. It was something only he could do, and it was thanks to a key that had once saved him."
    new "Katei停顿了一下，才点了点头。Cou和Wis跟他做着同样的工作，是他最先亲自调查的两个人。他无法完全确定，但他实在不觉得他们是Xyn的人。{w}Katei的值班时间快到了，他鞠了一躬，走进塔里。走向监控室时，他松了口气——幸好Lei没有进一步向他施压。{w}否则他心里盘算的事就行不通了。那件事只有他能做到，靠的是一把曾经救过他的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:56741
    old "It was the 6th of December. Katei had been shut in the security room for a few hours."
    new "那是12月6日。Katei已经把自己关在监控室里好几个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:56742
    old "He was staring at the screens, knowing Xyn's attack could come at any time."
    new "他盯着屏幕，知道Xyn随时可能动手。"

    # game/script.rpy:56745
    old "Suddenly, an alarm blared. Immediately, he knew they were in the building.{w} But he didn't understand how that could be. Through the monitors, he couldn't see anyone anywhere."
    new "忽然，警报大作。他立刻明白，他们已经进楼了。{w}可他不懂这怎么可能。他把监控画面全看了一遍，哪里都不见人影。"

    # game/script.rpy:56746
    old "Ah, I see. The security system was hacked. It almost worked."
    new "啊，原来如此。安防系统被入侵了。差一点就成功了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56747
    old "Katei smirked. Before the alarm ceased, he found the anomaly in the system. Xyn had sabotaged it without being noticed."
    new "Katei冷笑一声。警报还没停，他就找出了系统里的异常。Xyn在无人察觉的情况下动了手脚。"

    # game/script.rpy:56749
    old "When Katei fixed the problem, all the screens updated, and through one, he saw a man in the event room. He looked disconcerted, desperately glancing around him."
    new "Katei排除故障后，所有画面都刷新了，其中一格画面显示活动室里有个男人。他神色慌张，正拼命四下张望。"

    # game/script.rpy:56750
    old "Katei moved the microphone close to his mouth and turned it on. When he spoke, his voice played everywhere in the building."
    new "Katei把麦克风移到嘴边，打开开关。他一开口，声音便传遍整栋楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:56751
    old "We knew you would come. The gemstone in front of you was all we needed to draw you here."
    new "我们早就知道你会来。你面前那颗宝石，就足以把你引到这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:56756
    old "The man looked up, trying to find the source of the audio. Because his face was covered, Katei couldn't tell who he was."
    new "男人抬起头，想找出声音的来源。他的脸被遮住了，Katei认不出他是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:56757
    old "Unfortunately, you have been trapped. You won't be able to leave this building."
    new "可惜，你已经被困住了。你出不了这栋楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:56760
    old "When he heard that, the man ran to the lobby. He disappeared from Katei's sight, but he soon reappeared, dashing toward the staircase."
    new "听到这话，男人朝大厅跑去。他从Katei的视野里消失，但很快又出现了，正冲向楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:56761
    old "It's futile. The way to the second floor is locked, and the elevator has been disabled."
    new "没用的。通往二楼的通道已经锁死，电梯也停用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56762
    old "The man ignored Katei's voice and took out a key."
    new "男人没有理会Katei的声音，掏出一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:56763
    old "Oh, Xyn even has that key? I'm impressed."
    new "哦，Xyn连那把钥匙都有？真让我佩服。"

    # game/script.rpy:56764
    old "With it, he unlocked the door protecting the next floor. However, when he saw the windows, he slowed down, unable to accept it."
    new "他用它打开了通往上一层的门。然而看到那些窗户时，他的脚步慢了下来，无法接受眼前的事实。"

    # game/script.rpy:56768
    old "Haha, it's useless! All the windows have been sealed. You cannot escape."
    new "哈哈，白费力气！所有窗户都封死了。你逃不掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:56771
    old "The man didn't give up. Instead, he turned around and ran to where Katei was."
    new "男人没有放弃，反而转身朝Katei所在的方向跑去。"

    # game/script.rpy:56774
    old "He arrived at the security room, slamming into the door behind Katei."
    new "他冲到监控室，狠狠撞上Katei身后的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:56779
    old "This door is perfectly shut. You will not open it."
    new "这扇门关得严严实实。你打不开的。"

    # game/script.rpy:56784
    old "Finally, the man seemed to give up. After a few seconds of silence, he stepped back and fell defeatedly to the floor."
    new "终于，男人似乎放弃了。沉默了几秒，他后退一步，颓然跌坐在地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:56785
    old "Now you understand your position.{w} When the alarm played, Ashiya were notified. They will be here in less than ten minutes.{w} Before that, there's something I want to tell you."
    new "现在你明白自己的处境了。{w}警报响起时，芦屋那边已经收到通知。不出十分钟他们就会赶到。{w}在那之前，我有件事要告诉你。"

    # game/script.rpy:56786
    old "Slowly, the man looked up, once again trying to determine where Katei's voice was coming from."
    new "男人缓缓抬头，又一次想辨明Katei的声音从哪里传来。"

    # game/script.rpy:56791
    old "It is not possible for me to unlock the exit. For that, Ashiya's input is needed.{w} However, I know of a secret way out."
    new "出口不是我一个人能解锁的，那需要芦屋那边介入。{w}不过，我知道一条秘密的出路。"

    # game/script.rpy:56795
    old "When Katei said that, the man stood back up. Had his hearing failed him?"
    new "听到这话，男人又站了起来。是他听错了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:56796
    old "In this building, there's a hidden door. I have also hidden the key you'll need to unlock it somewhere here.{w} If you don't waste time, you can leave before Ashiya comes.{w} This alarm has never been activated before. I will tell them that a malfunction set it off. If nobody's found when the building is unlocked, they will believe my word.{w} If you want that, there are two conditions you must agree on.{w} You have stolen from us countless times—it is undeniable that Xyn must be a wealthy group. For your liberty, you will provide me with 50 million yen. I believe that is a fair sum.{w} Secondly, you must reveal your identity in front of the cameras.{w} I know you, Xyn. I know a lot more than you think.{w} Ido is the mole; I know where you gather, and I've investigated many of you.{w} Just like I know you, you know me. For that reason, if anything were to happen to me, this recording and all the information I have will be immediately exposed.{w} Do you agree to these conditions?"
    new "这栋楼里有一扇暗门。开它需要的钥匙，我也藏在了这里的某处。{w}只要你抓紧时间，就能在芦屋赶到之前离开。{w}这道警报以前从未响过。我会告诉他们，是设备故障触发了它。解锁之后若没找到人，他们会信我的话。{w}如果你想这样，就得答应我两个条件。{w}你们从我们这里偷过无数次东西——不可否认，Xyn必定是个财力雄厚的组织。为了你的自由，给我五千万日元。我认为这个数目很公道。{w}第二，你必须在镜头前露脸。{w}我了解你，Xyn。我掌握的比你想象的多得多。{w}Ido是内鬼；我知道你们在哪儿聚集，也调查过你们中的不少人。{w}就像我了解你一样，你也了解我。正因如此，若我出了什么事，这段录音和我手上的所有情报都会立刻公开。{w}这些条件，你答应吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:56797
    old "The loud voice faded with static. Before the silence could grow uncomfortable, the man nodded.{w} Then, he slowly took off his mask."
    new "洪亮的声音在杂音中渐渐消失。还没等沉默变得尴尬，男人就点了点头。{w}然后，他缓缓摘下面罩。"

    # game/script.rpy:56799
    old "B-{w=0.2}Brother?"
    new "哥……{w=0.2}哥？"

    # game/script.rpy:56809
    old "When Katei saw his brother's face, he snapped out of his daydream."
    new "看到哥哥的脸，Katei才从白日梦里回过神来。"

    # game/script.rpy:56810
    old "It was going to work; Lei hadn't suspected him at all. After going over his plan and stepping into the security room, he reassured himself."
    new "这计划行得通，Lei丝毫没起疑。他把计划在心里过了一遍，走进监控室，又给自己打了打气。"

    # game/script.rpy:56818
    old "Katei got home and took something out of a drawer. He finally had a use for it."
    new "Katei回到家，从抽屉里取出一样东西。它终于能派上用场了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56824
    old "All staff members were often checked despite their positions, and they had to leave their phones behind before beginning their work.{w} That was the reason Katei had set an alarm so early."
    new "无论职位高低，员工都常被抽查，上班前还必须把手机留在外面。{w}正因如此，Katei才把闹钟定得那么早。"

    # game/script.rpy:56826
    old "Before the sun had risen, he was outside the tower."
    new "太阳还没升起，他已经站在了塔外。"

    # game/script.rpy:56835
    old "A while later, he showed himself in the lobby to begin his shift."
    new "过了好一阵，他才出现在大厅，开始当班。"

    # game/script.rpy:56843
    old "Once hours had passed, he left the security room and walked down the hallway.{w} He entered the storeroom, leaving it shortly after."
    new "几个小时过去，他离开监控室，沿着走廊走去。{w}他进了储藏室，没多久又出来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56844
    old "He had seen Ido cleaning those hallways countless times. He knew Ido was given multiple keys, which he often had at the front of the cleaning cart.{w} Katei waited for Ido to exit the building. Snow had just stopped falling, and Ashiya always wanted to keep the plaza outside the tower free of any buildup."
    new "他无数次见过Ido打扫那几条走廊。他知道Ido手上有好几把钥匙，平时总放在清洁车的前头。{w}Katei等到Ido离开大楼。雪刚停，而芦屋一向要求塔外的广场保持整洁，不留积雪。"

    # game/script.rpy:56847
    old "That was when Katei walked to the cleaning room. The cart was there—Ido didn't always bring it with him, so he examined it carefully. However, he was surprised to find what he wanted on one of the shelves instead. It was the key he needed."
    new "就在这时，Katei 走向清洁间。推车就放在那里——Ido 并不总把它随身带着，于是他仔细查看了一番。没想到，他要找的东西反而放在架子上。那正是他需要的那把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:56850
    old "He brought it to the staff room. There, he unlocked Ido's locker. Every day, Ido would change into a white uniform, leaving his normal clothes behind."
    new "他把钥匙带到员工室，打开了 Ido 的储物柜。Ido 每天都会换上白色制服，把自己的便装留在柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:56853
    old "His coat, which he always wore, was hanging inside. As fast as he could, Katei took the tiny device he'd retrieved in the storeroom and attached it to the coat's neck, where it'd be close to Ido's mouth."
    new "他平日总穿的那件外套就挂在里面。Katei 以最快的速度取出在储藏室拿到的小装置，装到外套的领口处——那里离 Ido 的嘴最近。"

    # game/script.rpy:56859
    old "When he got back to the security room, he tested it to see if it was working."
    new "回到监控室后，他试了试装置是否正常运作。"

    # game/script.rpy:56862
    old "What he had attached to Ido's clothes was linked to a tiny playback device. He took it out, and when he pressed the record button, a flat line appeared on the screen, indicating it was receiving audio feed."
    new "他装在 Ido 衣服上的东西与一台小型回放设备相连。他把设备取出来，按下录音键，屏幕上便浮现出一条平直的波形，说明它正在接收音频信号。"

    # game/script.rpy:56863
    old "The internal storage of the device would quickly run out, so he had inserted a large SD card in the back. Katei pressed the play button, and soft static began to come out of the speaker. Nothing else played, but he knew that nothing was making any sound in the staff room."
    new "设备自带的存储很快就会写满，所以他在背面插了一张大容量 SD 卡。Katei 按下播放键，扬声器里传出轻柔的电流杂音。除此之外什么都没有，但他知道，员工室里本就没什么会发出声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:56866
    old "He couldn't risk leaving the tower with the device, and he had to go to the storeroom only when it was absolutely necessary. When the hallways were empty, he went back to the staff room and left the device in his locker."
    new "他不能冒险带着设备离开塔，只有到了万不得已的时候才会去储藏室。等走廊里空无一人，他才回到员工室，把设备放回自己的储物柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:56882
    old "The next day, he listened to what had been recorded. The waveform highlighted the noisy moments, but after minutes of perusing, he realized nothing of importance was there.{w} After Ido's job had ended, he'd walked home and hadn't left again until the next morning."
    new "第二天，他听了录下的内容。波形图上标出了几处嘈杂的时段，可他仔细翻看了几分钟，终于确认其中没有任何要紧的东西。{w} Ido 下班后便走回了家，直到第二天早上都没有再出门。"

    # game/script.rpy:56888
    old "From there, all Katei had to do was wait for Lei to do her job."
    new "接下来，Katei 只需等 Lei 把她那一部分做完。"

    # game/script.rpy:56889
    old "The following day was a Sunday. Even though the tower was closed, Katei still had to work in it."
    new "第二天是周日。塔虽然闭馆，Katei 仍旧得在里面上班。"

    # game/script.rpy:56890
    old "Alone on the crystal floor, Katei skimmed through the newest audio. Once again, it seemed nothing substantial had been recorded."
    new "Katei 独自待在水晶层，快速过了一遍最新的录音。这一次，似乎依旧没有录到任何实质内容。"

    # game/script.rpy:56898
    old "On Monday the 28th, he stepped into the building. Very few days of his morning shift remained.{w} He listened to what the bug had recorded, and yet again, he hadn't obtained anything valuable. It appeared Ido was always at home."
    new "28 日星期一，他走进大楼。他上早班的日子已经所剩无几。{w} 他听了窃听器录下的内容，还是没能得到任何有价值的线索。看来 Ido 一直待在家里。"

    # game/script.rpy:56899
    old "Could he have been mistaken? What if Ido wasn't with Xyn?{w} Perhaps that wasn't it. Maybe they were too careful, and spying on them like that was never going to work."
    new "难道他判断错了？万一 Ido 与 Xyn 并无关系呢？{w} 又或者并非如此。也许对方太过谨慎，靠这种办法监视根本行不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:56900
    old "Katei was hesitant. He didn't have a lot of time, and his will was wavering."
    new "Katei 犹豫了。时间所剩不多，他的决心也开始动摇。"

    # game/script.rpy:56906
    old "That afternoon, he received Lei's call."
    new "那天下午，他接到了 Lei 的电话。"

    # game/script.rpy:56907
    old "Hello. I believe I found what we needed."
    new "你好。我想我找到我们要的东西了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56908
    old "...You found a special gemstone?"
    new "……你找到那种特别的宝石了？"

    # game/script.rpy:56909
    old "Yes. I just went to see it, and I think it'll fit what we need.{w} Apparently, Gan found it yesterday on Airun. It's a white, egg-shaped stone, bright and smooth, that he called the \"Sekimeiya\"."
    new "是的。我刚去看过，应该正合我们的需要。{w} 听说 Gan 昨天在艾伦山找到了它。那是一块白色的蛋形石头，光洁明亮，他把它叫作「Sekimeiya」。"

    # game/script.rpy:56910
    old "Good. Anything should work as long as we advertise it like the last time.{w} I have finished doing my part, by the way."
    new "很好。只要像上次那样宣传，什么都行。{w} 顺便说一句，我这边已经做完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56911
    old "The alarm system's done? Perfect. We'll have the Sekimeiya on the 30th, so we might want to install the alarm the night before."
    new "警报系统做好了？太好了。Sekimeiya 30 号就能到手，我们最好在前一晚把警报装上。"

    # game/script.rpy:56921
    old "Katei began to get very worried. If Ido wasn't part of the group, he had to know. He wondered if he could do something with the information Lei had just given him."
    new "Katei 越来越担心。他必须弄清 Ido 到底是不是那伙人。他琢磨着，能不能利用 Lei 刚告诉他的消息做点什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:56922
    old "Katei's lone hunt had begun far in the past. He had looked into most employees and had conversed with all of them. Although he hadn't determined anything at the time, that might've ended up being useful, as Ido wouldn't find it strange if Katei suddenly talked to him."
    new "Katei 独自追查已经很久了。他调查过大部分员工，也和每个人都谈过话。当时虽没查出什么，如今却可能派上用场——毕竟 Katei 突然找 Ido 搭话，也不会显得奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:56925
    old "He had to make sure he wasn't mistaken, so he briefly exited the security room and walked to the lobby."
    new "他得确认自己没有判断错，于是暂时离开监控室，走向大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:56934
    old "Hey. How's it going?"
    new "嗨，最近怎么样？"

    # game/script.rpy:56935
    old "Ido turned to Katei and bowed with a jolly expression."
    new "Ido 转向 Katei，满脸笑容地鞠了一躬。"

    # game/script.rpy:56936
    old "Everything has been going good, thank you for asking. How about you?"
    new "一切都好，谢谢关心。你呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:56941
    old "...I don't think I can say the same, unfortunately. You know what happened on the 24th. We're doing our best to catch Xyn, but we're as lost as ever."
    new "……很遗憾，我可没法这么说。24 号的事你也知道。我们正尽全力追查 Xyn，却始终毫无头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:56942
    old "Is that so...? I hope you can figure them out soon."
    new "是这样吗……？但愿你们能早日查个水落石出。"

    # game/script.rpy:56947
    old "Me too, but we're in a bit of a hurry. The event for the 15th was changed. We're going to pick up a valuable gemstone this Wednesday, and you probably remember what happened the last time an event of this caliber was about to be held. ...We have to catch them before that day."
    new "我也这么希望，不过我们的时间有点紧。15 号的活动改了。这周三我们要去接收一颗贵重的宝石，上次办这种规模的活动之前出了什么事，你大概还记得吧。……我们必须在那个日子之前抓住他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:56948
    old "Oh, really? I hadn't heard about that."
    new "哦，真的吗？这事我还没听说。"

    # game/script.rpy:56953
    old "Yeah, it's called the Sekimeiya, apparently, and it was found yesterday. We're handling everything with utmost care, but we're worried Xyn might attack at any moment. Keep an eye out for me, and mention anything you think is suspicious."
    new "是啊，据说它叫 Sekimeiya，昨天才被找到。我们处处小心，可还是担心 Xyn 随时会动手。帮我多留意着点，发现什么可疑的就告诉我。"

    # game/script.rpy:56954
    old "Oh, absolutely. I'm sorry to hear the situation is this bad, but I trust you'll catch them soon."
    new "哦，那是当然。听说情况这么糟，我很遗憾，不过我相信你们很快就能抓到他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:56959
    old "...Thank you.{w} I have to go now. *sigh*"
    new "……谢谢。{w} 我得走了。*叹气*"

    # game/script.rpy:56962
    old "Ido bowed again as Katei walked to the reception desk."
    new "Katei 走向前台时，Ido 又鞠了一躬。"

    # game/script.rpy:56975
    old "The Copse"
    new "树丛"

    # game/script.rpy:56981
    old "You did a good job, Atase."
    new "你做得很好，Atase。"

    # game/script.rpy:56982
    old "Behind a short chair, Atase's boss congratulated him. As he did, however, Atase knew he must've been called there for a different reason."
    new "矮椅后面，Atase 的上司向他道贺。可就在道贺时，Atase 明白，自己被叫来这里肯定还有别的原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:56983
    old "Thank you. I'm glad everything went well."
    new "谢谢。事情顺利就好。"

    # game/script.rpy:56984
    old "Yes, me too.{w} How was it?"
    new "嗯，我也这么想。{w} 情况如何？"

    # game/script.rpy:56985
    old "How? It was simple, of course.{w} I had to spend a long time in the tower, but it went as we'd expected."
    new "怎么做到的？当然很简单。{w} 我在塔里耗了很久，但一切都如我们所料。"

    # game/script.rpy:56986
    old "Good. I verified that we received everything. It seems nothing went wrong."
    new "很好。我确认过，东西全都收到了。看来没有出任何差错。"

    # game/script.rpy:56987
    old "...Yes. It went smoothly."
    new "……是的。一切顺利。"

    # game/script.rpy:56989
    old "Atase's boss stared into his eyes.{w} Why? Why was he being tested like that?"
    new "Atase 的上司直直盯着他的眼睛。{w} 为什么？为什么要这样试探他？"

    # game/script.rpy:56992
    old "Is that all you have to say?"
    new "你要说的就这些？"

    # game/script.rpy:56993
    old "Y-Yes. Am I missing something?"
    new "是、是的。我漏了什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:56994
    old "If it's as you said, no."
    new "如果你说的都是实话，那就没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:56995
    old "...{w}Is this why you called me?"
    new "……{w} 你叫我来就是为了这个？"

    # game/script.rpy:56996
    old "Yes. You can go now."
    new "是的。你可以走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:56998
    old "Atase was confused. He'd been surprised to have been called four days after the assignment, but his boss's attitude had left him even more fazed."
    new "Atase 满心困惑。任务结束四天后忽然被叫来，本就让他意外，而上司的态度更叫他摸不着头脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:57001
    old "...I'll go, then."
    new "……那我先走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57002
    old "His boss didn't show the slightest sign of movement. After a long pause, Atase stood up."
    new "上司纹丝不动。过了好一会儿，Atase 才站起身来。"

    # game/script.rpy:57006
    old "Suddenly, five knocks reverberated through the small space."
    new "忽然，五下敲门声在这狭小的空间里回荡开来。"

    # game/script.rpy:57007
    old "Go ahead."
    new "进来吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:57008
    old "The door opened, and the outline of a thin man appeared. Hesitantly, he looked into the room, worried he was a disturbance."
    new "门开了，一道瘦削的身影出现在门口。他迟疑地向房里张望，像是怕自己打扰了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:57009
    old "What do you want, Ido?"
    new "什么事，Ido？"

    # game/script.rpy:57010
    old "...There's something I have to tell you."
    new "……有件事，我得告诉你。"

    # game/script.rpy:57011
    old "Speak, then."
    new "说吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:57012
    old "I have been told Ashiya will pick up a... notable gem this Wednesday."
    new "有人告诉我，芦屋这周三会去取一颗……很了不得的宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:57013
    old "Who told you that?"
    new "谁说的？"

    # game/script.rpy:57014
    old "Katei Kuiji, from security. He compared it to the situation with the Nomdaid."
    new "安保部的 Katei Kuiji。他还把它和诺姆达伊德那次的事相提并论。"

    # game/script.rpy:57018
    old "He said they'll show it on the 15th; the event is going to be changed."
    new "他说会在 15 号公开展出，活动内容也要变动。"

    # game/script.rpy:57019
    old "What else did he say?"
    new "还说了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:57020
    old "...That they're working very hard to catch us before that day, handling the situation with utmost care and having a lot of trouble with it.{w} The gemstone was found yesterday on Airun, and it's called the Sekimeiya."
    new "……说他们正全力争取在那天之前抓住我们，对这件事处理得极为谨慎，也为此颇费周折。{w}那颗宝石是昨天在艾伦山找到的，名字叫 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:57022
    old "Anything else?"
    new "还有别的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57023
    old "...No."
    new "……没有了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57024
    old "Why were you told this?"
    new "为什么要告诉你这些？"

    # game/script.rpy:57025
    old "I don't know. I think he was venting, honestly. I've worked there since years before the first attack, so I believe I'm considered trustworthy. We had a brief conversation this morning."
    new "我不知道。老实说，我觉得他只是在发牢骚。第一次袭击的好几年前我就在那里做事了，大概因此才被当成信得过的人。今天早上我们聊了几句。"

    # game/script.rpy:57030
    old "Thank you for letting us know immediately, and do so again in the future.{w} You may go now."
    new "多谢你立刻来告知，今后也照这样办。{w}你可以走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57034
    old "After Ido left the room, Atase's boss looked pensive for some time before inquiring what Atase's thoughts were.{w} Atase had been the most involved in Ashiya-related manners; as such, his superior was curious to know his thoughts on what they'd heard."
    new "Ido 离开房间后，Atase 的上司沉思了片刻，才问他有什么想法。{w}与芦屋相关的事务，Atase 一向参与最多，因此上司很想听听他对刚才那番话的看法。"

    # game/script.rpy:57035
    old "They must expect an attack is imminent, so I'm sure they have something prepared."
    new "他们一定料定袭击就在眼前，想必已经做好了准备。"

    # game/script.rpy:57036
    old "Of course.{w} Three days ago, our access to the tower's computer was terminated. It's unlikely we were detected, though, so they're repeating the same preemptive actions.{w} Infecting the computer again is not a priority. They must be paying close attention to it, and if they found out a way to identify us, we can't risk notifying them of the moment we regained access."
    new "当然。{w}三天前，我们对塔内电脑的访问被切断了。不过我们不太可能已经暴露，他们只是在重复同样的防范措施。{w}再次入侵电脑不是当务之急。他们现在一定盯得很紧，万一他们已经找到锁定我们的办法，我们一恢复访问就等于通知了他们，这个险不能冒。"

    # game/script.rpy:57039
    old "...{w}I have a thought.{w} The computer was cleaned, so they're evidently preparing something in the tower. However, we have very early information about the event they're preparing. If we want to make a move, it might be a good call to do it before they actually retrieve the gem on the 30th."
    new "……{w}我有个想法。{w}电脑被清理过，说明他们显然在塔里准备着什么。不过那场正在筹备的活动，我们早就拿到了情报。如果要动手，赶在他们 30 号真正取回宝石之前，也许是个好时机。"

    # game/script.rpy:57040
    old "What? That would be disastrous.{w} Did you not listen to Ido? He was told they're handling the situation extremely carefully. And he was told about a few key details.{w} Ashiya are hunting for a spy. If we take advantage of the information Ido was given, we're handing them his identity."
    new "什么？那会闯下大祸。{w}你没听 Ido 说吗？对方告诉过他，这件事他们处理得极为谨慎，还透了几处关键细节。{w}芦屋正在清查内鬼。我们要是利用 Ido 得到的情报，就等于把他的身份拱手送出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:57041
    old "...{w}You're right. That's a bad idea."
    new "……{w}你说得对。这主意不妥。"

    # game/script.rpy:57043
    old "...{w}You can leave now. I'll think about this."
    new "……{w}你先出去吧。这件事我再想想。"

    # game/script.rpy:57045
    old "Atase gave his boss a slow nod and walked out of the room."
    new "Atase 缓缓向上司点头，走出了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:57061
    old "Katei's heart rapidly pounded his chest. He had landed his first hit."
    new "Katei 的心脏在胸腔里狂跳。他的第一击得手了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57062
    old "Ido was part of Xyn, and Ashiya's bait had sunk into their pond. Shaking, Katei combed through the rest of the recording, but it didn't contain anything else of relevance."
    new "Ido 是 Xyn 的人，芦屋抛下的诱饵已经沉进了他们的水塘。Katei 双手发颤，把余下的录音逐一听完，却再没发现任何有用的内容。"

    # game/script.rpy:57068
    old "The door to the security room opened."
    new "监控室的门开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57069
    old "We have made the primary announcement of the Sekimeiya. We won't have it until tomorrow, but there's no way an issue will come up with Gan."
    new "Sekimeiya 的初步公告已经发出。它要到明天才能到手，不过 Gan 那边不会出问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:57070
    old "That's good. We have to build it up as early as possible, and we always announce the events well in advance."
    new "很好。造势要越早开始越好，我们的活动一向都提前很久公布。"

    # game/script.rpy:57080
    old "Jiro had called Atase again. When he stepped into the room, he was gestured to sit in front of the table."
    new "Jiro 又把 Atase 叫了过来。他刚进门，就被示意坐到桌前。"

    # game/script.rpy:57082
    old "Have you heard about it?"
    new "你听说了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57083
    old "Ashiya's announcement?"
    new "芦屋的公告？"

    # game/script.rpy:57084
    old "Yes. They have revealed the existence of the Sekimeiya, and the details match what Ido was told.{w} I think your idea is now worth considering."
    new "对。他们公开了 Sekimeiya 的存在，细节与 Ido 听到的完全吻合。{w}我看你那个主意，现在值得考虑了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57085
    old "Right. Now that the information is out, we won't be linked to Ido."
    new "芦屋那边说，明天会自己来取，而不是让人送过来。这就说明货源已经确定，而且出自丰花。东西是27号被发现的，芦屋明天就能拿到手，可见它眼下就在这里。{w} 与芦屋有往来的固定卖家不多，只有几位业余收藏家，挖到什么都会想卖给他们。如果东西是27号发现的，而芦屋昨天就已经知道能拿到，那多半是有人发现后立刻打电话通知，指望他们买下。{w} 27号是周日，正是 Gan 关店去山洞的日子。发现它的人极有可能就是他。而且这东西在芦屋拿到之前就已经有了名字——这种事他以前也干过。"

    # game/script.rpy:57086
    old "They think we'll attack the tower as usual. As you said, they cleaned up their computer, so what they're preparing has to entail the building.{w} We know Ashiya will obtain the Sekimeiya tomorrow, but we could've investigated for this information after the announcement."
    new "他们认为我们会照旧袭击那座塔。正如你所说，他们清理了电脑，那么他们准备的事必然与这栋楼有关。{w}芦屋明天就会拿到 Sekimeiya，其实这些信息，等公告出来后再查也能查到。"

    # game/script.rpy:57087
    old "And we still need to do that. We don't know where the Sekimeiya currently is or what it looks like."
    new "而且我们仍然得去查。Sekimeiya 现在在哪里、长什么样子，我们都还不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:57088
    old "No. We know enough."
    new "不。我们知道的已经够多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57091
    old "Ashiya said they will pick it up tomorrow as opposed to having it brought. We know that means the source is established and from Yushibana. It was found on the 27th, so that Ashiya will already have it tomorrow confirms it's currently here.{w} There are a few established points in contact with Ashiya, but not many. There are a couple of amateur collectors that try to sell all their findings to them. If it was found on the 27th and Ashiya already knew they would obtain it yesterday, it's likely they were immediately called about it in hopes they'd buy it.{w} The 27th is a Sunday, the day Gan closes his shop to go to the caves. It's highly possible it was him who found it. It was also given a name before Ashiya obtained it, which is something he has done in the past."
    new "芦屋那边说，明天会自己来取，而不是让人送过去。这就说明货源已经确定，而且出自丰花。东西是27号被发现的，芦屋明天就能拿到手，可见它眼下就在这里。{w} 与芦屋有往来的固定卖家不多，只有几位业余收藏家，挖到什么都会想卖给他们。如果东西是27号发现的，而芦屋昨天就已经知道能拿到，那多半是有人发现后立刻打电话通知，指望他们买下。{w} 27号是周日，正是 Gan 关店去山洞的日子。发现它的人极有可能就是他。而且这东西在芦屋拿到之前就已经有了名字——这种事他以前也干过。"

    # game/script.rpy:57093
    old "...I understand. We don't know how it looks, though.{w} Should Ido try to obtain that information?"
    new "……我明白了。不过，我们还不知道它长什么样。{w} 要不要让 Ido 去打听一下？"

    # game/script.rpy:57095
    old "Jiro took a cellphone out of a drawer."
    new "Jiro 从抽屉里取出一部手机。"

    # game/script.rpy:57096
    old "Let's try this."
    new "那就试试这个办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:57097
    old "With a serious expression, Jiro dialed a number and put the cellphone close to his ear."
    new "Jiro 神情严肃，拨通一个号码，把手机贴到耳边。"

    # game/script.rpy:57102
    old "Am I calling Musashi Gemstones?"
    new "请问是武藏宝石吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57103
    old "You are."
    new "是的。"

    # game/script.rpy:57104
    old "Glad to speak with you. I'm Zane, from Ashiya.{w} I'm calling you to confirm that I'll come tomorrow at {time=14.}"
    new "很高兴和你通话。我是芦屋的 Zane。{w} 打电话来是想确认一下，我明天 {time=14.} 过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:57105
    old "...{time=14}? I was told it'd be at {time=21.}"
    new "……{time=14}？我听到的说法是 {time=21.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:57106
    old "...Oh,{w} really?{w} My mistake, I was looking at the wrong page.{w} You're right, it'll be at {time=21.} Is that still all right?"
    new "……啊，{w}是吗？{w} 抱歉，是我看错了页面。{w} 你说得对，是 {time=21.}。这样安排还方便吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57107
    old "Yes, I'll be here."
    new "方便，我会在店里。"

    # game/script.rpy:57108
    old "Perfect. That was all, then."
    new "那就好。没有别的事了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57112
    old "It appears you have a new job tomorrow."
    new "看来你明天有新任务了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57120
    old "The plan was simple.{w} Atase had to pass himself off as an Ashiya member. In order to not be easily recognizable in the future, his figure had to be slightly disguised, and he knew how to change his voice."
    new "计划很简单。{w} Atase 要冒充芦屋的人。为了以后不容易被认出来，他的外形得稍微伪装一下；声音方面，他也有办法改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:57126
    old "On November 30th, snow began to fall. Xyn had been preparing their move, and Ashiya did the same."
    new "11月30日，雪开始飘落。Xyn 一直在为行动做准备，芦屋那边也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:57127
    old "Minutes before {time=21}, a car parked outside Musashi Gemstones. Atase emerged from inside it, wearing a long coat.{w} Stepping into the snow, he approached the bright window, leaving the prints of a new pair of shoes behind."
    new "{time=21} 前几分钟，一辆车停在武藏宝石门外。Atase 穿着长外套，从车里下来。{w} 他踏进雪中，朝那扇明亮的橱窗走去，身后留下一串新鞋的脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:57131
    old "He wasn't even close to calm. If Gan had told Ashiya about the call he'd received, they might've been waiting for Xyn's arrival."
    new "他一点也不镇定。如果 Gan 把接到的那通电话告诉了芦屋，对方可能早已在等着 Xyn 上门。"

    # game/script.rpy:57132
    old "Slowly, he pushed open the door, a wave of warm air hitting his guarded face."
    new "他缓缓推开门，一股暖风扑面而来，拂过他戒备的脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:57141
    old "Inside the shop, he saw a young man near the entrance, who only glanced at him emptily. Avoiding eye contact, Atase stared behind his shoulders.{w} Gan rushed over to the door after hearing the sound."
    new "店里靠近门口的地方有个年轻人，只淡淡地瞥了他一眼。Atase 避开视线，把目光投向那人身后。{w} Gan 听到动静，匆匆赶到门边。"

    # game/script.rpy:57144
    old "Gan's face shaped into a big smile. Then, he brought Atase to the reception desk."
    new "Gan 脸上堆起大大的笑容，随后把 Atase 领到接待台前。"

    # game/script.rpy:57149
    old "I'd like to see the Sekimeiya."
    new "我想看看那个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:57150
    old "Yes. I have prepared everything. Wait here."
    new "好。都准备好了。请你稍等。"

    # game/script.rpy:57151
    old "Gan walked away and shortly came back. He held a small, brown box between his hands and handed it over to Atase. During the time it couldn't be in the cold, he had made sure the Sekimeiya's temperature wouldn't go through the box."
    new "Gan 走开片刻便回来了，双手捧着一只棕色的小盒子，递给 Atase。这东西不能受冻，他事先已经确保 Sekimeiya 的温度不会透过盒子散失。"

    # game/script.rpy:57152
    old "I'm not done, give me a moment. Oh, and you're aware of what I discussed with Lei, right? The price will be double the usual."
    new "我还没弄完，稍等一下。对了，我和 Lei 谈过的事，你知道吧？价钱会是平常的两倍。"

    # game/script.rpy:57158
    old "Surprisingly, Gan walked away again. As he did, Atase peeked into the box and saw an egg-shaped stone, glowing faintly. That must have been the Sekimeiya."
    new "没想到 Gan 又走开了。趁这工夫，Atase 往盒里瞥了一眼，看见一块蛋形的石头，泛着微弱的光。那想必就是 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:57159
    old "That was his time—he had it.{w} As he'd discussed with his boss, Gan had to be paid before leaving, so Atase couldn't simply step out of the shop. If he ran away, Gan would try to chase him and would immediately call Ashiya and the police, and it was possible he'd see their car. Atase slowly took something out of his large pocket."
    new "这就是机会——东西已经到手。{w} 按他和上司说好的，离开前必须先付钱，所以 Atase 不能就这么走出店门。要是他跑了，Gan 会追出来，还会立刻通知芦屋和警察，说不定还会看见他们的车。Atase 慢慢从大衣口袋里取出一样东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:57169
    old "A grenade that would rapidly disperse smoke through the shop, knocking out everyone who inhaled it."
    new "那是一枚烟雾弹，能在店里迅速散开浓烟，让吸入的人当场昏倒。"

    # game/script.rpy:57174
    old "As soon as he activated it, he dashed to the door, colliding with the light falling snow. A curtain blocked the view through the window, so no one could see what had happened from outside."
    new "他一启动，便冲向门口，一头撞进飘落的细雪里。橱窗被遮布挡着，外面的人看不到店里发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:57175
    old "Without slowing down, Atase ran to the car. He had seen the immense cloud of smoke appearing before his eyes, and Gan had been farther into the room. There was no way he'd avoided being knocked unconscious."
    new "Atase 没有放慢脚步，直奔汽车。他亲眼看见浓烟在眼前涌起，而 Gan 站的位置更靠里。那人不可能没被熏倒。"

    # game/script.rpy:57179
    old "Faiten, another member of Xyn, had opened the car door. Atase rapidly stepped in and hurried to close it."
    new "Xyn 的另一名成员 Faiten 已经打开了车门。Atase 迅速钻进车里，急忙把门关上。"

    # game/script.rpy:57181
    old "Go! I'm pretty sure he was hit, but Ashiya could come at any time!"
    new "走！他应该中招了，但芦屋的人随时可能到！"

    # game/script.rpy:57182
    old "Faiten accelerated as fast as he could. The vehicle took off at a speed far beyond the legal limit, almost running over an old man past the first turn."
    new "Faiten 全力加速。车子以远超限速的速度冲了出去，转过第一个弯时险些撞上一位老人。"

    # game/script.rpy:57196
    old "At the appointed time, Lei gripped the handle of the door, ahead of a notary from Ashiya."
    new "约定的时间到了，Lei 握住门把手，身后跟着芦屋派来的公证人。"

    # game/script.rpy:57201
    old "When she laid eyes inside the shop, a thin darkness hindered her sight.{w} Confused, she placed a finger on the light switch next to the door, but that turned off all remaining light.{w} Immediately, she flipped it back."
    new "她朝店里望去，视线被一层薄薄的黑暗挡住了。{w} 她有些困惑，伸手按向门旁的电灯开关，却把仅剩的光也关掉了。{w} 她立刻又按了回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:57211
    old "Both she and the notary were taken aback by the loud noise."
    new "一声巨响，她和公证人都吓了一跳。"

    # game/script.rpy:57216
    old "Astonished, they looked through the door and saw that the opposite part of the shop had disappeared. Their hearts almost stopped when they saw blood and human flesh on the edges of the hole."
    new "两人惊愕地朝门里看去，只见店铺的另一侧已经不见了。看到洞口边缘的血迹和血肉，他们的心脏几乎停跳。"

    # game/script.rpy:57218
    old "It had been Xyn. As Lei stared at the scene, she found no other option.{w} They had never taken their attacks to such an extent before, but she knew they were responsible.{w} How? How had they learned about the time and place of the Sekimeiya's tradeoff? Had her phone been hijacked?"
    new "是 Xyn 干的。Lei 盯着眼前的景象，想不出别的可能。{w} 他们以前从没把袭击闹到这种地步，但她知道是他们干的。{w} 可他们是怎么知道的？怎么会知道 Sekimeiya 交易的时间和地点？她的手机被人动了手脚吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57220
    old "On the floor were Gan and a boy she didn't know. However, someone else had been farther ahead. ...Someone had just died, and she couldn't fathom it."
    new "地上躺着 Gan 和一个她不认识的少年。可还有一个人倒在更里面。……刚刚有人死了，她怎么也接受不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57221
    old "...Are you two okay?"
    new "……你们两个没事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:57222
    old "The man beside Lei began to shake both bodies.{w} Soon, Gan, who had inhaled a lesser amount of the smoke thanks to the shelves, opened his eyes, obstructing the blood from flowing down.{w} In disbelief, he told Lei about what had happened, stuttering as he stared at the broken floor."
    new "Lei 身旁的男人开始摇晃地上的两人。{w} 没过多久，Gan 睁开了眼睛——多亏有货架挡着，他吸入的烟较少——血也没再往下淌。{w} 他难以置信地把发生的事讲给 Lei 听，一边盯着破碎的地板，一边结结巴巴地说着。"

    # game/script.rpy:57223
    old "While an ambulance was being called, Lei's phone was also by her ear, linked to the police."
    new "有人叫救护车的同时，Lei 也把手机贴在耳边，和警察通着电话。"

    # game/script.rpy:57230
    old "I'm telling you they just escaped! They're in a vehicle—I see their tire marks outside the shop!{w} They must be found immediately! They just stole an incredibly valuable gemstone!"
    new "我说了，他们刚跑掉！他们开着车——店外还有轮胎印！{w} 必须马上找到他们！他们刚抢走了一颗极其贵重的宝石！"

    # game/script.rpy:57238
    old "When the boy woke up, he stood in a daze. Then, staggering forward, he stared at the back of the shop with desperate eyes."
    new "男孩醒来后，怔怔地站在原地。随后他踉跄着向前，用近乎绝望的目光望向店铺深处。"

    # game/script.rpy:57245
    old "There was silence. Nobody knew the answer, but they didn't think they could have spoken even if they had."
    new "一片沉默。没人知道答案；就算知道，他们也不觉得自己说得出口。"

    # game/script.rpy:57261
    old "It went well. We're on the way."
    new "「很顺利。我们正在路上。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57262
    old "Faiten and Atase were driving away. Just in case, they couldn't go straight to their boss."
    new "Faiten 和 Atase 驱车离开。为防万一，他们不能直接去见老板。"

    # game/script.rpy:57263
    old "The dim streets of Yushibana were empty, but the snow prevented them from going as fast as they wanted to. They had to be careful not to let the wheel marks show their destination.{w} When he had calmed down, Atase lifted the box's lid."
    new "丰花昏暗的街道上空无一人，积雪却让他们没法把车开得像预想中那么快。他们得小心，别让车轮印暴露目的地。{w} 等心绪平复下来，Atase 掀开了盒盖。"

    # game/script.rpy:57264
    old "He saw one of the Sekimeiya. It had to be what Ashiya had announced, as Atase had never seen a gemstone like it."
    new "他看见了其中一颗 Sekimeiya。那应该就是芦屋公布过的那颗——Atase 从未见过这样的宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:57270
    old "Out of the blue, they heard a siren behind them.{w} Through the rearview mirror, they could see a police car approaching."
    new "突然，身后传来警笛声。{w} 他们从后视镜里看见一辆警车正逼近。"

    # game/script.rpy:57271
    old "Wh-What!?{w} Stop! Don't keep going!"
    new "「什、什么！？{w} 停车！别再开了！」"

    # game/script.rpy:57277
    old "Pale, Faiten pulled over to the right. He couldn't muster a word—he slowly looked at the box on Atase's lap.{w} Had Ashiya set a trap for them?"
    new "Faiten 脸色发白，把车靠向右侧。他一句话也说不出来，只是缓缓看向 Atase 膝上的盒子。{w} 是芦屋设下的圈套吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57278
    old "...Don't tell me there's a tracker in that box."
    new "「……别告诉我那盒子里装了追踪器。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57279
    old "What? No, I didn't see anything."
    new "「什么？没有，我什么也没看到。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57282
    old "A police officer knocked on their door, demanding they open it."
    new "一名警察敲了敲车门，命令他们把门打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:57291
    old "What's the problem?"
    new "「有什么问题吗？」"

    # game/script.rpy:57292
    old "We were notified your vehicle almost ran over someone at Maura. Two people saw you going at a much faster speed than the limit allowed."
    new "「我们接到通报，说你们的车在莫拉差点撞到人。有两个人看到你们以远超限速的速度行驶。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57293
    old "...Oh, is that so? Sorry, I don't remember how fast I was going."
    new "「……哦，是吗？抱歉，我不记得自己当时开得多快。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57295
    old "The officer paused as he smelled the air.{w} ...Inside the vehicle, both men frowned. What was he doing?"
    new "警察停了下来，嗅了嗅空气。{w}……车内，两个男人都皱起了眉。他在做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:57297
    old "Hand me your license, please."
    new "「请把驾照给我。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57298
    old "Faiten took out a few documents from the glove compartment and handed them to the officer."
    new "Faiten 从手套箱里取出几份证件，递给警察。"

    # game/script.rpy:57300
    old "Step out of the vehicle."
    new "「下车。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57301
    old "S-Sure."
    new "「好、好的。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57306
    old "...This is a screening device. Please take a breath test."
    new "「……这是检测仪。请对着它吹一口气。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57310
    old "After a minute, the officer looked at the result.{w} It said \"zero\"."
    new "一分钟后，警察看了看结果。{w} 上面显示「零」。"

    # game/script.rpy:57311
    old "There are no traces of alcohol on you."
    new "「你身上没有酒精反应。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57312
    old "Of course. I would never drink before driving."
    new "「当然。我开车前从不喝酒。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57313
    old "...{w}You can get back in the vehicle.{w} Please, make sure you don't drive over the speed limit."
    new "「……{w}你可以回车里了。{w} 请务必不要超速。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57314
    old "Yes, I'm sorry. If I went over it, I promise that I didn't notice."
    new "「好的，抱歉。要是我超速了，我保证自己当时真没察觉。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57318
    old "Faiten stepped into the car. As he did so, the officer received a radio call.{w} Trying to hide his haste, Faiten asked if he could get going."
    new "Faiten 坐回车里。就在这时，警察接到了无线电呼叫。{w} Faiten 掩饰着自己的急切，问他能不能走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57319
    old "With his hand, the officer indicated to hold off."
    new "警察抬手示意他稍等。"

    # game/script.rpy:57326
    old "Suddenly, the officer's look changed.{w} Both men noticed he was staring at the brown box.{w} Then, the officer saw something else. On Atase's attire, there was an Ashiya logo."
    new "忽然，警察的神色变了。{w} 两人都注意到，他正盯着那个棕色盒子。{w} 紧接着，警察又发现 Atase 的衣服上印着芦屋的标志。"

    # game/script.rpy:57327
    old "What's in that box?"
    new "「那盒子里装的是什么？」"

    # game/script.rpy:57328
    old "In this one? A present for my girl."
    new "「这个？给我女朋友的礼物。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57330
    old "...Should I? It's snowing, and I wouldn't like it to get dirty."
    new "「……有这个必要吗？外面正下着雪，我可不想把它弄脏。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57331
    old "Please give me that box."
    new "「请把那个盒子给我。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57333
    old "Slowly, Faiten took it and handed it to the officer.{w} He lifted the lid, and his eyes didn't waver."
    new "Faiten 缓缓拿起盒子，递给警察。{w} 警察掀开盒盖，目光没有丝毫动摇。"

    # game/script.rpy:57334
    old "Both of you step out of the vehicle."
    new "「你们两个都下车。」"

    # game/script.rpy:57335
    old "Faiten and Atase looked at each other. Then, after a pause, Faiten extricated his lower body from below the dashboard.{w} The officer never expected the car to accelerate as he did.{w} It was Atase's foot that pressed down the accelerator. Immediately, the officer ran to his car as he yelled for them to stop."
    new "Faiten 和 Atase 对视一眼。停顿片刻后，Faiten 把腿从仪表盘下方抽了出来。{w} 警察完全没料到车子会突然加速。{w} 是 Atase 踩下了油门。警察立刻奔向自己的车，一边大喊让他们停车。"

    # game/script.rpy:57343
    old "Later into the night, a handful of men were in Musashi Gemstones.{w} Everyone had been ordered to leave, and the scene had been preserved as well as possible."
    new "夜深之后，武藏宝石店里还留着几个人。{w} 所有人都被命令离开，现场也尽可能保持原样。"

    # game/script.rpy:57344
    old "Atsuki Hakutoki and Gan had been sent to the hospital. Their physical condition was fine, but they'd have to spend the night there."
    new "Atsuki Hakutoki 和 Gan 已被送往医院。两人身体没有大碍，但得在医院过一夜。"

    # game/script.rpy:57347
    old "Under the shop was a channel sheltered from the icy air. There had been two more people inside at the time of the explosion. One of them had fallen through the floor, whereas the other had died on the spot."
    new "店铺底下有一条通道，寒气侵不进去。爆炸发生时，里面还有两个人。其中一人从塌陷的地板坠落下去，另一人则当场死亡。"

    # game/script.rpy:57348
    old "Shiroya Mirana had hit her head after falling from high up and entered a coma. As soon as the paramedics had reached that place, she had been taken to the hospital too.{w} A few people were scattered around where her body had fallen."
    new "Shiroya Mirana 从高处摔下时撞到了头，陷入昏迷。急救人员赶到后，她也被送往医院。{w} 在她坠落的位置周围，零散地站着几个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:57351
    old "The forensic team. They were investigating the scene and had confirmed that the missing girl, Miiya Moiromo, had died."
    new "是鉴识小组。他们正在勘查现场，并已确认失踪的女孩 Miiya Moiromo 已经死亡。"

    # game/script.rpy:57352
    old "Something else had fallen with the rubble. An open box, identical to the one Atase had received.{w} Its lid had burst open on impact, and its contents had rolled away. A handful of people had seen the shining, egg-shaped stone within the darkness, but nobody had been allowed to touch anything. Its faint shine highlighted the drop of blood that had arced across its surface."
    new "还有一样东西和瓦砾一同坠落——一只盒子，和 Atase 收到的那只一模一样。{w} 盒盖在撞击中弹开，里面的东西滚了出去。有几个人在黑暗中看见了那颗发亮的蛋形石头，但谁都不准碰任何东西。它幽微的光映照着溅在表面的一道血痕。"

    # game/script.rpy:57353
    old "When a woman from the forensic team felt the gem for the first time, she was taken aback. ...It was very hot.{w} Ashiya had quickly learned that only one of the Sekimeiya had been taken and asked the investigation team to return the fallen one. However, as it was related to the incident, it had to be inspected by them first."
    new "鉴识小组的一名女成员第一次摸到那颗宝石时，吃了一惊。……它烫得厉害。{w}芦屋很快得知只有一颗 Sekimeiya 被拿走，便要求调查组归还掉落的那颗。可由于它与案件有关，必须先由调查组检查。"

    # game/script.rpy:57355
    old "The woman grabbed the box and shut it inside. Then, gripping a flashlight with her tight latex gloves, she kept searching around the place."
    new "女人拿起盒子，把宝石关在了里面。随后，她戴着紧绷的乳胶手套握着手电筒，继续在原地搜寻。"

    # game/script.rpy:57364
    old "When midnight hit, it was December."
    new "午夜降临时，已经是十二月了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57370
    old "Katei's night shift had begun. Before entering the security room, he had spoken to Lei."
    new "Katei 的夜班开始了。进监控室之前，他先和 Lei 说了几句话。"

    # game/script.rpy:57371
    old "Xyn had attacked the gem shop. However, for the first time, their plan had failed due to external factors; the Sekimeiya would be returned to Ashiya."
    new "Xyn 袭击了宝石店。然而这一次，他们的计划头一回因为外部因素而落了空；Sekimeiya 即将被送回芦屋。"

    # game/script.rpy:57372
    old "How had Xyn learned about the location? Katei didn't know, but it didn't matter.{w} The preparations for his plan had been completed, so he needed Xyn to attack again. It wasn't in Ashiya's interests to pursue the attack of the 30th any further. As if nothing had happened, the Sekimeiya plan needed to continue as devised."
    new "Xyn 是怎么查到那个地点的？Katei 不得而知，但这已无关紧要。{w}他计划的准备工作已经就绪，所以他需要 Xyn 再动一次手。继续追查 30 日那起袭击，对芦屋没有好处。要像什么都没发生过一样，让 Sekimeiya 计划按原定方案继续推进下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:57381
    old "When the stillness had gone on for a while, Katei listened to the latest recording.{w} Nothing related to Xyn was there. Since Ido had told them about the Sekimeiya, the recordings had been nothing but uneventful."
    new "静默持续了一阵，Katei 听了最新的录音。{w}里面没有半点与 Xyn 相关的内容。自从 Ido 向他们提起 Sekimeiya 之后，录音就一直平淡无奇。"

    # game/script.rpy:57382
    old "The SD card behind the device had been swapped out. If the device was ever found in the tower, Katei didn't want the information he had to be revealed; he needed it for himself.{w} It was a small card that wouldn't be questioned, so he could easily leave the building with it. After listening to Xyn's brief meeting, he had saved the recording on his own computer, inserting a new, empty card in the recording device."
    new "装置背面的 SD 卡已经换过了。万一这装置在塔里被人发现，Katei 不希望自己掌握的情报暴露出去；那份情报他还有用。{w}那不过是张小卡，不会有人起疑，他能轻易带着它离开大楼。听完 Xyn 那场简短会议的录音后，他把录音存进了自己的电脑，再往录音装置里换上一张空白的卡。"

    # game/script.rpy:57393
    old "At home, Lei hadn't calmed down yet. A young girl had died in Musashi Gemstones, and she'd learned the initial details."
    new "在家里，Lei 还没能平静下来。武藏宝石有个小女孩死了，她已经得知了初步情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:57395
    old "Xyn had impersonated Ashiya. Yet again, they had possessed confidential information to carry out their plan."
    new "Xyn冒充了芦屋的人。他们又一次掌握了机密情报，才得以实施计划。"

    # game/script.rpy:57396
    old "However, they hadn't known about the second Sekimeiya. After being given one, they had released a potent gas in the small shop which had put everyone to sleep."
    new "可他们并不知道还有第二个 Sekimeiya。拿到其中一个后，他们在小店里释放了强效气体，让所有人都昏睡过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:57397
    old "The girl's death hadn't been part of Xyn's plan. It had been the result of a common domestic accident, but Xyn had made it possible."
    new "女孩的死并不在 Xyn 的计划之中。那本来只是一起普通的家庭意外，却因 Xyn 才得以发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:57398
    old "The Sekimeiya Xyn had stolen was being brought back to Ashiya, but the other one, which had fallen through the shop's floor, had been taken by the forensics. Lei had insisted that it be returned and kept cold; Gan had warned her about the temperature, but she had been told she would have to wait 36 hours."
    new "Xyn 偷走的 Sekimeiya 正被送回芦屋，可另一个从店内地板掉下去的，已被鉴识人员取走。Lei 坚持要把它取回并冷藏保存；Gan 提醒过她温度的问题，但对方告诉她必须等上 36 个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:57408
    old "You fucked up badly."
    new "你们捅的篓子可不小。"

    # game/script.rpy:57410
    old "Atase and Faiten had explained the events to his boss. They'd managed to slip away and safely arrived at the meeting place."
    new "Atase和Faiten已经向老板说明了经过。他们设法脱身，平安抵达了会合地点。"

    # game/script.rpy:57411
    old "Jiro looked stern. He wasn't a man to grow uncontrollably angry, but his eyes showed how displeased he was."
    new "Jiro神情严峻。他不是那种会任由怒火失控的人，但眼里已写满了不快。"

    # game/script.rpy:57412
    old "Are you convinced you won't be tracked here?"
    new "你确定他们不会追到这里来？"

    # game/script.rpy:57413
    old "Absolutely.{w} The car is parked quite a ways away, but the police will find it soon. We have to give it up."
    new "确定。{w}车停在很远的地方，但警察很快就能找到。那辆车只能放弃了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57414
    old "...{w}Have you learned what happened?"
    new "……{w}出的事，你们听说了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57416
    old "Wh-What do you mean?"
    new "什、什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:57417
    old "Someone died in Musashi. There was a gas explosion after you left."
    new "武藏宝石那边死了人。你们走后，那里发生了燃气爆炸。"

    # game/script.rpy:57418
    old "Both lackeys looked at each other, lost for words."
    new "两个手下面面相觑，说不出话来。"

    # game/script.rpy:57419
    old "I-It can't be. We didn't do anything."
    new "不、不可能。我们什么都没做。"

    # game/script.rpy:57422
    old "Watch the news tomorrow. You knocked everyone out, so no one noticed the heater was busted and leaking gas. When Ashiya entered, there was an explosion. You killed a civilian. Someone else was sent to the hospital in a coma."
    new "明天看看新闻吧。你们把所有人都弄晕了，所以没人发现取暖器坏了，正在漏气。芦屋的人一进门，就发生了爆炸。你们害死了一个平民。还有一个人被送进医院，陷入昏迷。"

    # game/script.rpy:57423
    old "Do you understand? This is a major fuck up. Xyn does {i}not{/} get involved in murder cases."
    new "听明白了吗？这次篓子捅大了。Xyn{i}绝不{/}插手命案。"

    # game/script.rpy:57424
    old "...That wasn't our fault, though. We did as planned."
    new "……可那不是我们的错。我们都是按计划行事的。"

    # game/script.rpy:57425
    old "You're right. All you did was draw the police to you and lose the Sekimeiya. You both should've been arrested, but now you're going to land us all in hot water."
    new "说得对。你们做的，不过是把警察引到自己身上，再把Sekimeiya弄丢。你们俩本该被抓进去，可现在你们要把我们全都拖下水。"

    # game/script.rpy:57426
    old "...{w}I don't think I'll be recognized."
    new "……{w}我想不会有人认出我吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:57427
    old "Atase, shut up. You might be done for already."
    new "Atase，闭嘴。你也许已经完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57431
    old "I'm going to ask you the same thing I did once already. Did everything truly go as planned on the 24th?"
    new "有件事我之前已经问过你了，现在再问一遍。24号那天，一切真的都按计划进行吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57432
    old "Y-Yes. Why are you asking this again?"
    new "是、是的。为什么又问这个？"

    # game/script.rpy:57433
    old "That afternoon, an unidentified person escaped from a prison cell. I was later called and told that you were seen near that place, wearing the same clothes as them."
    new "那天下午，有个身份不明的人从牢房里逃了出来。后来有人打电话给我，说你被人看到在那附近，穿的衣服和那人一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:57434
    old "Wait, what!? That wasn't me! I was in the tower at that time!"
    new "等等，什么！？那不是我！那会儿我正在塔里！"

    # game/script.rpy:57435
    old "You say that, but we erased those records.{w} I don't know what the fuck is going on with you, but what just happened isn't acceptable. Now you're being hunted for causing a death, and the police pulled you over. Both of you are basically sacrificial lambs at this point."
    new "你嘴上这么说，可那些记录已经被我们抹掉了。{w}我不知道你身上到底出了什么鬼名堂，但刚发生的事没法交代。现在你因为闹出人命被追捕，警察还拦了你们的车。到这一步，你们两个基本上就是弃子。"

    # game/script.rpy:57436
    old "Atase couldn't believe what he was hearing. He'd been part of Xyn for many years, and he'd never been told something like that."
    new "Atase不敢相信自己的耳朵。他在Xyn里待了这么多年，从没听过这样的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:57439
    old "...Then what should we do?"
    new "……那我们该怎么办？"

    # game/script.rpy:57440
    old "You have to be quiet. Wait, and when you're arrested, you stay quiet."
    new "你们要闭嘴。等着，被抓了也闭嘴。"

    # game/script.rpy:57441
    old "Come on, we won't say anything, but isn't there something you can do?"
    new "别这样，我们什么都不会说，可你就不能想想办法吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57442
    old "Something I can do? What do you want, to go live in a different country?"
    new "想办法？你们想怎样，跑到国外去生活吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57444
    old "Why would I help you two? You allowed our first failure against Ashiya. I'm not sticking my neck out here. Anything involving you from now on will be exceptionally problematic."
    new "我凭什么帮你们？对芦屋的第一次失手，就是你们造成的。我不会替你们冒险。从今往后，跟你们沾边的任何事都会麻烦得要命。"

    # game/script.rpy:57449
    old "...What about the Sekimeiya?"
    new "……那Sekimeiya呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:57450
    old "What about it?"
    new "那又怎样？"

    # game/script.rpy:57451
    old "Are we... gonna do anything else about it?"
    new "我们……还要再做些什么吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57453
    old "Jiro didn't have an immediate answer for that question."
    new "Jiro一时答不上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:57454
    old "Did you see it?"
    new "你见到它了？"

    # game/script.rpy:57455
    old "I did. I was surprised by how it looked.{w} It honestly looks like an egg made of marble, and I think it was shining a little."
    new "见到了。它的样子让我吃了一惊。{w}说实话，看着就像一颗大理石做的蛋，好像还微微发着光。"

    # game/script.rpy:57456
    old "...An egg? How big was it?"
    new "……蛋？多大？"

    # game/script.rpy:57457
    old "A bit more than the length of this finger, I'd say."
    new "大概比这根手指长一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:57461
    old "Jiro was pensive for a while. His plan had been so close to working, but he couldn't blindly throw out a new move."
    new "Jiro沉思了片刻。他的计划曾那么接近成功，可眼下不能贸然再出新招。"

    # game/script.rpy:57462
    old "Go home for now.{w} Atase, I want you here tomorrow at {time=14.}"
    new "先回家去吧。{w}Atase，明天{time=14.}我要在这里见到你。"

    # game/script.rpy:57463
    old "...Okay. I'll be here."
    new "……好。我会来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:57467
    old "Both men knew not to push the issue, so they slowly stepped out of the room."
    new "两人都明白不该再追问下去，便缓缓退出了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:57475
    old "Atase got home late into the night. He'd lived alone for years, so he had nobody to wake up.{w} The first thing he did was look up the recent news."
    new "Atase 回到家时已是深夜。他独居多年，不必担心吵醒谁。{w}他做的第一件事，就是查看最近的新闻。"

    # game/script.rpy:57476
    old "As he'd been told, he came across an article from the 24th of November. Someone had escaped from a prison cell, but the story was enigmatic.{w} It hadn't been him; as he'd said, he had been in Ashiya Tower at the time. However, he couldn't help but feel that the man in the attached picture did strangely resemble him."
    new "他照吩咐去找，找到了一篇11月24日的报道。有人从牢房里逃了出来，但报道写得语焉不详。{w}那并不是他；正如他所说，当时他人在芦屋塔。然而，他不由得觉得，报道所附照片里的那个男人，确实与他莫名地相像。"

    # game/script.rpy:57480
    old "When the sun rose, Atase still hadn't managed to fall asleep."
    new "直到太阳升起，Atase 始终没能睡着。"

    # game/script.rpy:57481
    old "The latest news was posted online, and he didn't have to search for what he wanted. The highlighted article said: \"Twenty-year-old girl dies by gas explosion in Yushibana\"."
    new "最新消息已经发布到网上，他想找的内容根本不用费心去搜。首页醒目的那篇报道写着：「丰花一名二十岁少女死于煤气爆炸」。"

    # game/script.rpy:57482
    old "His eyes locked onto the headline painfully, and he was unable to clear his suddenly clogged throat. It was the first time his actions had killed someone.{w} When he read that two friends of the girl had been there, a cold hollow expanded within his chest. He vividly remembered how he'd received the death of a close friend of his years ago. It hadn't been his intention, but he had created that pain for someone else, and a friend of the girl he'd killed was in grave danger as well.{w} It was the last thing he'd ever wanted to happen. However, his mind kept going to what his boss had said. It was true—his situation was volatile."
    new "他的目光痛苦地钉在那行标题上，喉咙骤然堵住，怎么清也清不开。这是他第一次因自己的行动害死了人。{w}读到少女的两位朋友当时也在场，一股冰冷的空洞在他胸腔里扩散开来。他清楚地记得，多年前得知挚友死讯时，自己是什么感受。他并非有意，却让别人承受了同样的痛楚；而他害死的那个少女的朋友，如今也身陷险境。{w}这是他最不愿发生的事。可是，他脑中反复响起上司说过的话。的确——他的处境随时可能生变。"

    # game/script.rpy:57483
    old "He frowned as he finished reading the article.{w} He went over it again to confirm he hadn't been mistaken, but there was no mention of Xyn or their plan."
    new "读完报道，他皱起了眉。{w}他又从头看了一遍，确认自己没有看错，可文中只字未提 Xyn，也没提到他们的计划。"

    # game/script.rpy:57484
    old "Why...? There was no way Ashiya didn't think Xyn had been behind it. However, they hadn't been mentioned, nor had the Sekimeiya..."
    new "为什么……？芦屋不可能想不到是 Xyn 干的。可是报道里既没有提到他们，也没有提到 Sekimeiya……"

    # game/script.rpy:57496
    old "Initial Singularity"
    new "初始奇点"

    # game/script.rpy:57502
    old "The appointed time came. Atase had been able to get a bit of sleep, and he sat in front of his boss after a silent nod."
    new "约定的时间到了。Atase 总算睡了一会儿，他沉默地点了下头，坐到上司对面。"

    # game/script.rpy:57503
    old "We're going to wait for Ido to come. He'll be here soon."
    new "我们等 Ido 过来。他马上就到。"

    # game/script.rpy:57505
    old "Ashiya haven't stopped talking about this Sekimeiya, and it was found two days before its announcement. Like you said, they're doing something in the tower, I have no doubt—that's why our name wasn't on the news."
    new "芦屋那边一直在议论这个 Sekimeiya，而它是在公布前两天才被发现的。正如你说的，他们肯定在塔里动了手脚，我毫不怀疑——所以我们才没上新闻。"

    # game/script.rpy:57506
    old "...Yes, that's very likely. I also noticed that."
    new "……嗯，很有可能。我也注意到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57507
    old "A surprising amount of people have echoed Ashiya. It appears the Sekimeiya event is gaining a lot of traction. There's been a great deal of interest in it."
    new "附和芦屋说法的人多得惊人。看来 Sekimeiya 的活动声势越来越大，外界的兴趣相当浓厚。"

    # game/script.rpy:57508
    old "Do you remember what Ido was told? Katei Kuiji's information was real, and he said they're doing their best to catch us before the 15th. They were sending the Sekimeiya to the tower, expecting our attack before the event."
    new "还记得 Ido 打听到的话吗？Katei Kuiji 的情报是真的，他说他们正竭尽全力要在15号之前抓住我们。他们把 Sekimeiya 送进塔里，就是料到我们会在活动之前动手。"

    # game/script.rpy:57514
    old "There was a knock at the door."
    new "门外传来敲门声。"

    # game/script.rpy:57515
    old "\"Enter.\"{w} Ido stepped in, sensing the tense atmosphere. Then, he sat beside Atase."
    new "「进来。」{w}Ido 推门而入，察觉到了屋内的紧张气氛，随后在 Atase 身旁坐下。"

    # game/script.rpy:57516
    old "Did you get it?"
    new "拿到了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57517
    old "...Yes. I didn't think I would, but I have what you asked for."
    new "……拿到了。我本来没抱希望，不过你要的东西我带来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:57518
    old "The tower's janitor put his hand in his pocket and slowly took out a rectangular piece of paper.{w} It was a photograph. He handed it to his boss, who stared at it intensely."
    new "这位塔里的清洁工把手伸进口袋，缓缓取出一张长方形的纸。{w}那是一张照片。他把它递给上司，上司目不转睛地盯着它。"

    # game/script.rpy:57519
    old "You were right. It looks like an egg made of marble."
    new "你说得没错。它看起来就像一颗大理石做的蛋。"

    # game/script.rpy:57520
    old "When he showed it to Atase, he saw the same gemstone that had been inside the box. It was shut behind glass, and the wall in the background was from inside the tower."
    new "他把照片给 Atase 看，Atase 认出那正是曾装在盒子里的那块宝石。它被锁在玻璃后面，背景里的墙是塔里的。"

    # game/script.rpy:57521
    old "Y-You took a picture of it? Isn't that risky as hell?"
    new "你、你拍了照片？这风险也太大了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:57522
    old "That's what I thought too, but it went well."
    new "我也这么想，不过结果还算顺利。"

    # game/script.rpy:57525
    old "Xyn had figured out a way to sneak tiny devices into the tower. That was the reason they'd chosen Ido as their associate.{w} Staff members were frequently inspected upon arrival, especially after Xyn's first attacks. However, the janitor's job entailed the maintenance of the tower's plaza. By bringing the cleaning cart outside of the building and using a different Xyn member to drop the desired device in it, they had managed to slip a small camera into the tower."
    new "Xyn 摸索出了一套把微型装置带进塔里的办法。他们也正因此才选中 Ido 做内应。{w}员工每次进塔都要接受频繁的检查，Xyn 最初的几次袭击之后更是如此。不过清洁工的工作包括维护塔前的广场。他们先把清洁车推到楼外，再由另一名 Xyn 成员把需要的装置丢进车里，就这样把小巧的摄像头带进了塔。"

    # game/script.rpy:57526
    old "How did you do it, though?"
    new "可你是怎么做到的？"

    # game/script.rpy:57531
    old "The Sekimeiya was brought to the event room, and it was inside a cabinet. I hoped it would be out of all the security cameras' sight at some point, but that wasn't the case.{w} I wanted to use the cart to cover my hands so that I wouldn't be seen taking the picture, but it was easier than that.{w} Entering the event room was forbidden to the public, but I stepped in to clean it. As soon as I did, Katei Kuiji entered too—his night shift was about to end. It was very fortunate because a long curtain covered the Sekimeiya. He asked if I was curious about it and offered to let me see it."
    new "Sekimeiya 被送进了活动室，放在展示柜里。我原本指望它总有一刻会避开所有监控摄像头的视野，可并没有。{w}我本想用清洁车挡住双手，好让人看不出我在拍照，但实际比这还容易。{w}活动室禁止公众进入，不过我是进去打扫的。我刚进去，Katei Kuiji 也跟着进来了——他的夜班快结束了。运气实在好，因为有一块长遮布盖着 Sekimeiya。他问我好不好奇，还说可以让我看看。"

    # game/script.rpy:57536
    old "...{w}Is that so?{w} What did he say this time?"
    new "……{w}是这样吗？{w}他这次都说了些什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:57537
    old "He seemed to want to make small talk. I believe he doesn't suspect me.{w} He had a key for the cabinet, and he said they'd only made one for the event so that Xyn wouldn't be able to unlock it.{w} He even used it to open the cabinet and let me touch the Sekimeiya. It was pretty smooth and felt like cold marble.{w} It was kept refrigerated because it can apparently get damaged otherwise. He didn't say much else of importance, but he kept reiterating that they're hard at work upgrading their security measures to catch us."
    new "他似乎只是想闲聊几句。我看他并不怀疑我。{w}他有一把展示柜的钥匙，说为了这次活动只配了一把，好让 Xyn 打不开柜子。{w}他甚至用那把钥匙打开柜子，让我摸了摸 Sekimeiya。它相当光滑，摸起来像冰凉的大理石。{w}它一直冷藏保存，据说否则会受损。别的要紧话他没多说，只是一再强调他们正加紧升级安保措施，好抓住我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:57539
    old "...What the hell is that man doing?"
    new "……那家伙到底在干什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:57540
    old "I don't know, but when he left, I knew nobody was going to be in the security room for a very short time. That's when I took the picture. ...Just in case the footage is ever reviewed, I still did it covered by the cart, so I'll only be seen uncovering the curtain again."
    new "我不知道，不过他离开时，我知道监控室会有一小段时间没人。我就是那时候拍的照片。……为防万一录像被人回看，我拍照时还是用清洁车挡着，所以录像里最多只会看到我再次掀开遮布。"

    # game/script.rpy:57541
    old "Jiro's eyes had a glint to them. He knew they couldn't take things lightly."
    new "Jiro 眼中闪过一丝锐光。他知道此事不能掉以轻心。"

    # game/script.rpy:57544
    old "Do you know what the upgraded security measures he talked about could be?"
    new "你知不知道他说的升级安保可能是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:57545
    old "No. He didn't elaborate, and I haven't noticed any difference."
    new "不知道。他没有细说，我也没察觉出任何变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:57546
    old "It's strange. You said the cabinet where the Sekimeiya is can be locked and unlocked with a single key. When they did that in the past, we broke them open, so they must've accounted for that.{w} When they linked an alarm to the cabinets, we disabled it remotely thanks to our access to their computer. Given what you've said, it's likely they're doing something similar, and that's why they cleaned their entire system. However, infecting it again to intercept what they're doing might be what they're waiting for."
    new "奇怪。你说过，放 Sekimeiya 的那个展示柜只用一把钥匙就能开关。以前他们也是这么做的，结果被我们撬开了，所以他们肯定考虑过这一点。{w}后来他们给展示柜连上警报，我们靠着侵入他们的电脑远程关掉了。照你说的来看，他们很可能在做类似的事，所以才清理了整个系统。不过，我们若为了截获他们的动向而再次感染系统，说不定正是他们等着我们做的。"

    # game/script.rpy:57551
    old "A long time ago, Xyn had the chance to manually install a piece of software they'd created on Ashiya's computer. Thanks to the cleaning cart, they'd brought a storage device inside, and by keeping it in Ido's locker, they'd waited for the chance they'd needed. When the security staff was drawn out of their room, Ido had the chance to boot it up in their system."
    new "很久以前，Xyn 曾有机会亲手把他们制作的软件装进芦屋的电脑。他们靠清洁车把一个存储设备带进塔内，藏在 Ido 的储物柜里，等待时机。等到安保人员被引开、离开监控室的那一刻，Ido 便得以在那台电脑上启动它。"

    # game/script.rpy:57552
    old "Despite Xyn's knowledge in the field, creating an undetectable malicious program wasn't simple. Because of that, the application they placed on the computer was a harmless one. That allowed it to stay hidden, only booting up for instants at a time.{w} Its purpose was to check a path on the cloud owned by Xyn. If it contained a file, it would be downloaded and executed. However, if the file had already been downloaded once, the process wouldn't be repeated.{w} That remote method allowed Xyn to gain access to Ashiya's computer. They knew about their security system, but a malicious file couldn't remain undetectable for long. By shuffling it every few days, however, they had kept their connection to the computer for months."
    new "尽管 Xyn 在这方面颇有本事，要写出一个无法被检测的恶意程序却并不简单。因此，他们装在电脑上的程序是无害的。正因如此，它才能一直隐藏，每次只启动一瞬。{w}它的用途是检查 Xyn 名下云端的一个路径。若那里有文件，它就会下载并执行。不过，若该文件已经下载过一次，这个过程就不会重复。{w}靠这种远程手段，Xyn 得以访问芦屋的电脑。他们了解对方的安保系统，可恶意文件瞒不了太久。于是他们每隔几天就换一次文件，就这样让与那台电脑的连接维持了数月。"

    # game/script.rpy:57555
    old "It entailed a risk. If the server file was found at any given time, reverse tracking Xyn could've been feasible. To prevent that, they had made sure their file wouldn't ever be automatically detected, but their connection to Ashiya had been cut a few days previously. They knew the computer had undergone a thorough cleanup that had managed to erase Xyn's file in the process.{w} However, what about the application that had been manually installed months ago? Had it been erased too?"
    new "这其中也有风险。只要服务器上的文件在某一刻被发现，顺藤摸瓜追查 Xyn 并非不可能。为防万一，他们确保自己的文件永远不会被自动检测到，但几天前，他们与芦屋电脑的连接还是断了。他们知道那台电脑经过了彻底清理，Xyn 的文件也在过程中被抹去。{w}可是，几个月前手动安装的那个程序呢？它是否也被一并清除了？"

    # game/script.rpy:57556
    old "Jiro feared the reason behind the computer's cleanup. If their original application was still present within the computer, they could infect it again by putting up a new file on the path. What Jiro didn't like was the thought that Ashiya were monitoring every change.{w} While the file itself couldn't be detected as malicious, they might've committed a manual cleanup to assure it or anything similar would be deleted. Then, if Xyn remotely downloaded a new one, its appearance would be noticed, and although it wouldn't be detected as malicious, Ashiya could be sure Xyn had sent it."
    new "Jiro 担心的是电脑被清理背后的原因。假如他们原先的程序还留在电脑里，只要在云端路径上放一个新文件，就能再次感染它。让 Jiro 不安的是，芦屋或许正在监视每一次变动。{w}文件本身虽不会被判定为恶意，他们却可能特意做了一次人工清理，以确保它或类似的东西被删掉。这样一来，如果 Xyn 远程下载了新文件，文件的出现就会被察觉；即便不被判为恶意，芦屋也能确定是 Xyn 送进来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:57557
    old "He had come up with a test. To know if their original application was still there, he put up a different file on the path. Upon execution, it would send a request to a web server before deleting itself.{w} The request had been received, so Jiro knew infecting Ashiya's computer again was possible. However, he was considerably hesitant about doing it."
    new "他想出了一个试探的办法。为了确认原先的程序是否还在，他在那个路径上放了一个不同的文件。它一旦被执行，就会向一台网络服务器发送请求，然后自行删除。{w}请求已经收到，Jiro 由此知道再次感染芦屋的电脑是可行的。然而，他迟迟下不了决心。"

    # game/script.rpy:57562
    old "The event will be on the 15th, but until then, it seems the Sekimeiya will be in the event room, merely locked inside a cabinet. Nothing we can do should involve breaking it open.{w} It'll be there for two weeks; they definitely expect our attack, and they think it'll happen during any night.{w} You said the cabinet looks different than all the others, right? It was prepared specifically for this, and the computer was cleaned up. I'll repeat that Katei Kuiji said their intent is to catch us before the 15th.{w} There's one more thing that caught my attention. You were told that they'd only made one key for the day of the event. This means the key will be used on the 15th."
    new "活动在15号举行。在那之前，Sekimeiya 似乎会一直放在活动室，就锁在展示柜里。我们无论做什么，都不该走撬柜子这条路。{w}它要在那里放两个星期；他们显然料到我们会动手，而且认为会在某一个夜里发生。{w}你说过，那个展示柜和别的都不一样，对吧？它是为这次活动专门准备的，电脑也清理过了。我再重复一遍，Katei Kuiji 说他们的打算是在15号之前抓住我们。{w}还有一点让我在意。你听说他们只为活动当天配了一把钥匙。这意味着那把钥匙会在15号用上。"

    # game/script.rpy:57563
    old "Oh, yes. He said he'd let me be the first to touch it and warned me to be very gentle."
    new "啊，对。他说会让我第一个摸它，还叮嘱我要非常小心。"

    # game/script.rpy:57564
    old "The first to touch it. So they'll let visitors feel it during the event. That confirms that they'll unlock the cabinet, which we can't and shouldn't try to do."
    new "第一个摸它。这么说，活动期间他们会让参观者亲手触摸。那就证实了他们会打开柜子——而这正是我们不能、也不该去尝试的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:57565
    old "Both subordinates were paying close attention and slowly understood what Jiro was getting at."
    new "两名部下都听得聚精会神，渐渐明白了 Jiro 的意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:57568
    old "If we're going to attack, there are many reasons why it should be on the very day of the event. Now that Ashiya are putting so much effort into this, we can't follow along with their expectations.{w} ...And there's another important reason why we shouldn't try to steal the Sekimeiya any day before the 15th.{w} Since the announcement, Ashiya haven't stopped building excitement for this mysterious gemstone; they're likely being excessive on purpose. Today, the Sekimeiya's value is already greater than yesterday's. Every day it's kept as a mystery, Ashiya are artificially inflating its value.{w} On the 15th, the Sekimeiya's value will be the highest it can be. That is when we want it."
    new "既然要动手，就有很多理由说明该选在活动当天。芦屋现在投入了这么多心力，我们偏不能顺着他们的预想来。{w}……而且还有一个重要的理由，说明我们不该在15号之前的任何一天去偷 Sekimeiya。{w}自公布以来，芦屋一直在为这块神秘宝石造势，恐怕是故意做得过头。今天 Sekimeiya 的价值已经超过昨天。它每多神秘一天，芦屋就在人为地抬高它的价值。{w}到15号，Sekimeiya 的价值会达到顶点。那才是我们下手的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:57570
    old "...How would we actually get it, though? It will always be guarded when the cabinet's open, and there's a security camera in the room."
    new "……可我们究竟要怎么拿到它？柜子打开的时候，它一定有人看守，而且活动室里还装着监控摄像头。"

    # game/script.rpy:57573
    old "Ashiya are supposedly raising the scale of their measures. So should we.{w} You're right. When the cabinet is unlocked, we won't easily be able to access the Sekimeiya. But when it's locked, there's no way we will.{w} It is possible we could acquire the single key they have, but that's not exactly likely, and it would pretty much reveal Ido. This is why I'm willing to prioritize my first idea.{w} I asked you to bring a picture of the Sekimeiya because I found Atase's description of it interesting. It was supposedly found on Airun, that derelict mountain. I find that very hard to believe.{w} Where did Gan find it? There are no caves there, and like Ashiya are saying, this is far from a typical gemstone.{w} Doesn't it look too good to you? Its shape isn't natural if it's supposed to be a stone formed over the years. There's something about this story that is off."
    new "听说芦屋正在扩大戒备规模。我们也得跟上。{w} 你说得对。展示柜解锁时，我们没法轻易接近 Sekimeiya；可它锁着的时候，我们更无从下手。{w} 拿到他们那把唯一的钥匙并非不可能，但希望不大，而且几乎等于把 Ido 暴露出去。所以我愿意优先考虑最初那个方案。{w} 我让你带 Sekimeiya 的照片来，是因为 Atase 对它的描述让我很感兴趣。据说它是在艾伦山那座荒山上被发现的。我很难相信这种说法。{w} Gan 究竟是在哪里找到它的？那里根本没有洞穴，而且正如芦屋所说，这远不是寻常宝石。{w} 你不觉得它好得过分了吗？如果它真是经年累月形成的石头，这个形状就太不自然了。这个故事里总有什么地方不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:57577
    old "It was found right after our latest attack, and right as the computer was cleaned up. What I believe is that the emergence of this gemstone is directly related to us.{w} Both of you compared it to marble, and it glows faintly. Added to its shape, vague origin, and the lack of details Ashiya are providing, I can't help but feel this was deliberately organized... As if the Sekimeiya was handcrafted to draw us to the focus of their upgraded security."
    new "它是在我们最近一次袭击之后、电脑刚被清理干净时被发现的。我认为，这颗宝石的出现与我们直接相关。{w} 你们两个都把它比作大理石，而且它会发出微弱的光。再加上它的形状、含糊的来历，以及芦屋提供的信息少得可怜，我忍不住觉得这一切是刻意安排的……就好像 Sekimeiya 是被人手工做出来，专门把我们引向他们加强戒备的核心。"

    # game/script.rpy:57578
    old "Do you mean that they made the Sekimeiya?"
    new "你的意思是，Sekimeiya 是芦屋造出来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:57579
    old "That is irrelevant. However, if they did, it would've been simple. They crafted a material of a single color into a simple shape. There are some that glow like this, and luminous paint would achieve the same effect.{w} It doesn't matter if the gemstone in this picture was fabricated. Ashiya are giving it real value. However, what I've said could be of immense use to us.{w} Ido, it felt like marble, right? We can have its dimensions, and the color and form aren't an issue. Do you know that molding marble is fairly simple?"
    new "那无关紧要。不过，如果真是他们做的，那做起来也简单。把单一颜色的材料做成一个简单的形状就是了。确实有些东西会这样发光，用夜光涂料也能达到同样的效果。{w} 照片里这颗宝石是不是伪造的并不重要。芦屋赋予了它真实的价值。不过，我刚才说的那些，对我们可能大有用途。{w} Ido，它摸起来像大理石，对吧？我们能拿到它的尺寸，颜色和形状也不成问题。你知道大理石塑形其实相当简单吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57580
    old "...What are you saying? That we could replicate the Sekimeiya?"
    new "……你在说什么？我们能复制 Sekimeiya？"

    # game/script.rpy:57581
    old "We easily could."
    new "这并不难。"

    # game/script.rpy:57584
    old "...I see. So we could sell it as the real Sekimeiya."
    new "……我明白了。所以我们可以把它当成真正的 Sekimeiya 卖出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:57585
    old "Of course not. That would eliminate all our credibility.{w} I said this as a solution to Ido's question—how to obtain the real Sekimeiya.{w} On the 15th, if we take it while the cabinet's unlocked, it will be noticed immediately. The real problem is taking it out of the building.{w} We replace it with ours, and Ido takes it out with the cleaning cart."
    new "当然不是。那会把我们的信誉彻底毁掉。{w} 我这么说，是为了回答 Ido 的问题——如何拿到真正的 Sekimeiya。{w} 15 日那天，如果趁展示柜解锁时取走它，立刻就会被发现。真正的问题在于怎么把它带出大楼。{w} 我们用仿制品把它换掉，再由 Ido 用清洁推车运出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:57586
    old "Do you really think we could swap them? How would that not be noticed?{w} Also, doesn't this create the same problem? If we managed to replace it with a similar-looking stone, how would we demonstrate we have the real one? If we sold it, Ashiya would claim to still have it."
    new "你真觉得我们能把它们换掉？怎么可能不被发现？{w} 而且，这不会带来同样的问题吗？就算我们成功换上一颗外观相近的石头，又怎么证明真品在我们手上？如果我们把它卖了，芦屋照样会宣称 Sekimeiya 还在他们那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:57587
    old "We could easily demonstrate it. And not only to assert our credibility, but also to let Ashiya know their measures have failed again.{w} I know who could do this for us: my good friend Cevin Neneco. I have an idea of how to account for this, but I'll need to think more about it.{w} Your other question, how the swap wouldn't be noticed... That has an easier answer."
    new "证明起来并不难。而且不只是为了保住我们的信誉，也要让芦屋知道，他们的戒备又一次失败了。{w} 我知道谁能替我们办这件事：我的好朋友 Cevin Neneco。关于怎么解释这件事，我有个想法，但还得再仔细想想。{w} 你另一个问题——掉包怎么会不被发现……这个答案比较简单。"

    # game/script.rpy:57590
    old "We'd have to do it when the cabinet is open. However, we can't be seen either in person or from the security room.{w} There is a way. The same thing we used last time, a smoke grenade."
    new "必须趁展示柜打开时动手。可我们不能被人亲眼看到，也不能让监控室看到。{w} 有办法。和上次一样，用烟雾弹。"

    # game/script.rpy:57591
    old "...D-Do you want to release that in the tower?"
    new "……你、你是要在塔里放那个东西？"

    # game/script.rpy:57596
    old "The event will consist of guided visits for three people at once, and it will start at {time=9.}{w} Like always, at that time, the floor will be almost empty. That's when we make our move—before anyone knows what the Sekimeiya is. We know the people who show up earliest get in earliest. Atase, you will be there first."
    new "活动会以导览形式进行，每次三人，从 {time=9.} 开始。{w} 和往常一样，那个时段楼层里几乎没人。我们就趁那时候动手——赶在任何人知道 Sekimeiya 是什么之前。我们知道最早到的人会先进去。Atase，你会第一个进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:57600
    old "Intimidated by his boss's words, Atase stared hesitantly. He hadn't heard the entire plan yet, but it already sounded dangerous."
    new "Atase 被上司的话镇住了，迟疑地望过去。他还没听完整个计划，却已经觉得危险重重。"

    # game/script.rpy:57601
    old "Ido will be there too. Once you're inside, he will secretly give you a small grenade that he'll bring in the previous day with the cleaning cart. When the event begins, it'll go off in front of the Sekimeiya, and it'll knock everyone out. The smoke will rapidly rise up, so to avoid inhaling any, you'll immediately throw yourself to the floor.{w} The cabinet will be unlocked, which will give you the chance to swap the Sekimeiya. Ours will be in the cleaning cart, and so that you don't have to go back to the lobby, Ido will leave it in the cleaning room. After that, you'll keep acting as if you fell unconscious.{w} In the end, despite the attack, Ashiya will think they still have the Sekimeiya, so, the following day, Ido will be able to take the real one out."
    new "Ido 也会在那里。你一进去，他就会悄悄把一枚小烟雾弹交给你——那是他前一天用清洁推车带进来的。活动开始时，它会在 Sekimeiya 前引爆，把所有人熏得昏过去。烟雾会迅速上升，所以为了不吸入，你要立刻扑倒在地。{w} 展示柜那时会解锁，你就有机会掉包 Sekimeiya。我们的仿制品会放在清洁推车里；为了不让你再跑回大厅，Ido 会把它留在清洁间。之后，你要继续装作昏倒。{w} 最后，尽管遭受袭击，芦屋仍会以为 Sekimeiya 还在自己手里，于是第二天，Ido 就能把真品带出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:57604
    old "Wait a second... Wh-Why do I have to do this? Shouldn't Ido be the one? This could go horribly wrong!"
    new "等一下……为、为什么是我？不该让 Ido 去吗？这事要是出了岔子，后果不堪设想！"

    # game/script.rpy:57605
    old "No. At the time of the event, Ido has no reason to be in the event room. Furthermore, it's likely the people present will be investigated, which could lead Ashiya to find the real Sekimeiya in the cart before we can obtain it.{w} This could go wrong, sure, but it can work. However, see it as a chance I'm giving you.{w} You screwed up badly. Not only should you redeem yourself to us, but to yourself. If you're found, you will be seen as a killer. Make sure this plan works before you think of asking for our help again."
    new "不行。活动开始后，Ido 没有理由待在活动室里。而且，在场的人很可能会被调查，那样芦屋说不定会在我们拿到真品之前，就从推车里找到真正的 Sekimeiya。{w} 这事确实可能出岔子，但也能成功。不过，把它当成我给你的机会。{w} 你犯下大错。你不仅该向我们、也该向你自己赎罪。一旦被发现，你就会被当成杀人犯。先确保这个计划成功，再考虑向我们求助。"

    # game/script.rpy:57606
    old "W-Will you offer help if this goes well?"
    new "如、如果事情顺利，你们会帮我吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57607
    old "That's something you will have to ask again after the 15th. Until then, you're still nothing but trouble for us—disposing of you is what we should do. ...Do you understand why it is essential that this is not a failure?"
    new "那要等 15 日之后，你再来问。在那之前，你对我们来说依旧只是麻烦——按说我们该把你处理掉。……你明白为什么这件事绝不能失败了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57611
    old "...{w}I don't even get what you said, though. I'll still be recorded if I do this."
    new "……{w}可我还是没听懂你刚才说的。我这么做，不还是会被拍下来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57612
    old "No. The smokescreen will cover you. We'll make sure it works as a barrier for the camera."
    new "不会。烟雾会遮住你。我们会确保它足以挡住摄像头。"

    # game/script.rpy:57613
    old "But what about the hallway!? I'll be seen going to the cleaning room!"
    new "可走廊怎么办！？我去清洁间的时候会被看到的！"

    # game/script.rpy:57614
    old "That is one reason why smoke should also be released there.{w} Like in every guided visit, everyone else will be in the lobby. If smoke appears in both hallways, everyone will quickly evacuate, as they'll be worried about it being poisonous or there being a fire. Then, the exit will be guarded to make sure nobody runs out with stolen gems.{w} Katei Kuiji will be in the security room, so due to the smoke, he won't be able to leave it without falling unconscious, and he won't see what's happening in the building.{w} When everyone is knocked out, you will go to the cleaning room and obtain our fake. It is essential that you do this first to make sure no one sees you. You will leave your smoke grenade in the cart and subsequently go back to swap the gemstones."
    new "这也是为什么那里也得释放烟雾。{w} 每次导览参观时，其他人都会待在大厅。如果两条走廊都出现烟雾，大家都会赶紧撤出去，因为他们会担心烟雾有毒，或者发生了火灾。随后，出口会有人把守，确保没人带着偷来的宝石跑出去。{w} Katei Kuiji 会在监控室，所以烟雾一出现，他只要离开监控室就会昏倒，也就看不到楼里发生了什么。{w} 等所有人都昏过去，你就去清洁间取出我们的赝品。你必须先做这件事，确保没人看见你。把你的烟雾弹留在推车里，然后再回去掉包宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:57619
    old "...Who will set off the smoke outside the event room, though?"
    new "……可是，活动室外的烟雾由谁来触发？"

    # game/script.rpy:57620
    old "Nobody will. Setting up a timer is the easiest thing in the world. We know when they have to go off: at {time=9:04.}"
    new "不需要人。装个定时器再简单不过。我们知道它们该在什么时候启动：{time=9:04.}"

    # game/script.rpy:57621
    old "No, we don't...! The event will begin at {time=9}, but we don't know when the cabinet will be unlocked!"
    new "不，我们不知道……！活动确实在 {time=9} 开始，可我们不知道展示柜什么时候才会解锁！"

    # game/script.rpy:57622
    old "That doesn't matter. Ido has seen the key and how to use it. If the smoke goes off before the cabinet is unlocked, the guide will be knocked out, and they will have the key on their person."
    new "那不重要。Ido 见过那把钥匙，也知道该怎么用。如果烟雾在展示柜解锁前就启动，导览员会被熏昏，而钥匙就在他身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:57623
    old "And where exactly will the smoke bombs be in the hallways?"
    new "那烟雾弹在走廊里究竟要放在哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:57624
    old "Don't you remember? We can use the handrails.{w} Behind them, the small grenades will be hidden, and it works perfectly for us. The cameras in the hallways are placed to focus on the doors, so there are parts of the handrails that aren't visible.{w} When Ido is cleaning, he can secretly place a grenade and slide it toward a point of the handrail that's being recorded. We will need two per hallway, and it'll seem like anyone could've placed them the previous day."
    new "不记得了吗？我们可以利用扶手。{w} 小烟雾弹藏在扶手后面，对我们来说正合适。走廊的摄像头都对着门，因此扶手有些位置拍不到。{w} Ido 打扫时，可以悄悄放下一枚烟雾弹，再把它滑到会被摄像头拍到的扶手位置。每条走廊需要两枚，看上去就像前一天谁都有可能放进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:57628
    old "Finally, both subordinates understood how serious their boss was and broke into a sweat. As they took off and draped their heavy attire on the back of their chairs, they began to process each step of what they would be performing."
    new "两名下属终于明白上司有多认真，不由得冒出了冷汗。他们脱下厚重的外套搭在椅背上，开始逐一琢磨接下来要执行的每一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:57630
    old "...And that's not all. There's something else we'll do that will divert suspicion from Ido.{w} After all, if this works, we still wouldn't be in the clear. After suffering such a major attack, will Ashiya really believe nothing was stolen? If they're careful, they might not believe it and end up finding the real Sekimeiya.{w} So, we will give them a reason to believe it.{w} Their focus will be on the Sekimeiya; that's what they expect to be targeted, and the measures they're taking clearly involve it, as proven by the new cabinet and it only having one key. Targeting a different room will be much less problematic.{w} In the morning, before the event, the cameras will be monitored. However, there are more cameras than monitors, and only the hallways and a few crystal rooms are displayed at once, correct, Ido?"
    new "……还不止这些。我们还要做一件事，把怀疑从 Ido 身上引开。{w} 毕竟，就算计划成功，我们也还没完全脱身。遭到这么大规模的袭击后，芦屋真的会相信什么都没丢吗？如果他们谨慎些，或许不会信，最后还是会找到真正的 Sekimeiya。{w} 所以，我们要给他们一个相信的理由。{w} 他们的注意力会放在 Sekimeiya 上；那才是他们预期会被下手的目标，而他们采取的戒备显然也围绕着它——新的展示柜和只有一把钥匙就是证明。相比之下，去针对另一个展室，麻烦会小得多。{w} 早上活动开始前，监控会有人盯着。但摄像头比监视器多，同一时间只会显示走廊和少数几个水晶展室，对吧，Ido？"

    # game/script.rpy:57631
    old "...Yes. I've never seen the smaller one in hallway A being displayed. It's normally just the hallway."
    new "……对。我从没见过 A走廊里那台较小的摄像头被调出来。平时只显示走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:57634
    old "Exactly. This means that if you put all the gems there into a case, you won't be seen. We would usually never do this, as it makes you the only suspect, but this isn't an issue this time.{w} The curtains aren't raised until {time=9:10}, so you'll leave all of them down. You'll also leave the case in the room, in the corner beneath the camera, so that we can have a visitor be there when the smoke is released, crouching right as it happens. If they keep their head near the floor as they exit the tower with the case, they won't fall unconscious.{w} Two minutes after the smoke has been released, he will attempt to flee. This will make Ashiya think their expectations were subverted and that the failed attack had that room as its final target.{w} ...I doubt Faiten will be willing to take this job under any circumstances, but I'll find the right person without telling them the full extent of the plan."
    new "正是如此。也就是说，只要你把那里的宝石全装进箱子，就不会被拍到。平时我们绝不会这么做，因为那样你就成了唯一的嫌疑人，但这次没关系。{w} 遮布要到 {time=9:10} 才拉起，所以你把它们全放下。你还要把箱子留在那个房间里，放在摄像头下方的角落。这样烟雾释放时，我们可以安排一名访客正好在场，并在那一刻蹲下。只要他带着箱子离开塔时把头贴近地面，就不会昏过去。{w} 烟雾释放两分钟后，他会尝试逃走。这会让芦屋以为他们的预想落空了，以为那场失败的袭击最终针对的其实是那个房间。{w} ……我怀疑 Faiten 无论如何都不肯接这活，但我会找到合适的人，并且不把计划的全部内容告诉他。"

    # game/script.rpy:57635
    old "Since the reason behind doing this is passing off that room as the target, the smoke will need to be released there as well, so that's where Ido will leave the last grenade."
    new "既然这么做是为了让那个房间看起来像真正的目标，烟雾也得在那里释放，所以最后一枚烟雾弹就由 Ido 留在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:57636
    old "...But, what...? I'm very confused. All of this will be recorded."
    new "……可是，什么……？我完全糊涂了。这些全都会被拍下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:57639
    old "Yes.{w} Before, I said that infecting the computer again could be risky. While that is true, it won't be an issue if we take the proper measures.{w} When the smoke is released, I will infect the computer remotely. While Katei is overwhelmed by the attack, it'll take me a few seconds to erase the saved footage of the previous 24 hours. Then, I will immediately disconnect our access so that we can't be tracked.{w} This will work in four different ways.{w} It will remove the footage that incriminates Ido.{w} It will remove the footage showing the source of the smoke in the event room.{w} It will make them think we had to remove the hallways' footage to hide who placed the grenades there, when that's not actually needed.{w} And lastly, it will hide that we can access the computer at any time, because they might think we were able to erase the footage thanks to the commotion of the attack.{w} ...This is it. This is what we'll do, and how we'll nab the Sekimeiya."
    new "是的。{w} 我之前说过，再次侵入电脑可能有风险。确实如此，但只要措施得当，就不会出问题。{w} 烟雾释放时，我会远程侵入电脑。趁 Katei 被袭击弄得手忙脚乱，我只要几秒钟就能抹掉过去 24 小时的录像。然后我会立刻断开我们的访问，让他们无法追踪。{w} 这会起到四个作用。{w} 删掉会让 Ido 暴露的录像。{w} 删掉显示活动室烟雾来源的录像。{w} 让他们以为我们必须删掉走廊录像来隐藏放置烟雾弹的人，而实际上那并非必要。{w} 最后，还能掩盖我们可以随时访问电脑这一点，因为他们可能会以为，我们是趁袭击造成的混乱才删掉录像的。{w} ……就是这样。这就是我们的做法，也是我们夺得 Sekimeiya 的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:57641
    old "Once the plan is a success, we'll get it out of the building with the cart. However, how do we let Ashiya know their Sekimeiya is fake? Whatever the best answer is, it relies on the crafting process.{w} You said the Sekimeiya's kept pretty cold. There aren't many chemical reactions that occur at low temperatures, but perhaps we could make use of one to damage the Sekimeiya after a couple of days of exposure.{w} If not, then a mere timed reaction would suffice, one that would break our Sekimeiya and leave behind a card with our name."
    new "计划成功后，我们就用推车把它运出大楼。可是，怎么让芦屋知道他们的 Sekimeiya 是赝品？不管最终用哪种办法，关键都在制作工艺。{w} 你说过，Sekimeiya 存放的环境相当冷。低温下能发生的化学反应不多，但也许我们可以利用其中一种，让 Sekimeiya 在暴露几天后受损。{w} 如果不行，单纯的定时反应也够了——让我们的 Sekimeiya 碎裂，并留下一张写有我们名号的卡片。"

    # game/script.rpy:57654
    old "When Katei saw the busy waveform, he knew his bait had been effective.{w} Since Xyn had attacked the gem shop, Ido hadn't spoken to his boss. Katei had wanted to know Xyn's position after their failure, so he had given Ido information about the Sekimeiya to report to his group."
    new "看到那密集的波形时，Katei 就知道自己的诱饵奏效了。{w} 自从 Xyn 袭击宝石店后，Ido 一直没和上司说过话。Katei 想知道 Xyn 在失败后的动向，于是把关于 Sekimeiya 的情报交给 Ido，让他转告他所属的组织。"

    # game/script.rpy:57660
    old "At a low volume, he listened to the audio in his dim office. The second time, the conversation was a lot more substantial.{w} Katei thrilled internally; an overwhelming amount of details were being revealed to him. He finally knew many of Xyn's secrets that had tormented him for so long.{w} He heard Xyn design their plan, even though the end sounded muffled. Ashiya's lure wouldn't work; there would be no attack before the 15th, and most importantly, Katei could no longer follow through with his scheme.{w} Xyn would attack during the daytime. The alarm wouldn't be activated, and Katei's voice could be heard by other people. In addition, even if the alarm was activated, Katei wouldn't be able to offer a Xyn member a quick escape, as the outside of the building wouldn't be deserted."
    new "他把音量调得很低，在昏暗的办公室里听着录音。第二次，对话内容充实了许多。{w} Katei 内心一阵狂喜；无数细节正展现在他面前。他终于得知了许多折磨他已久的 Xyn 秘密。{w} 他听见 Xyn 设计计划，尽管结尾部分听起来含混不清。芦屋的诱饵不会奏效；15 日之前不会有袭击，而最重要的是，Katei 再也无法实施自己的计划。{w} Xyn 会在白天发动袭击。警报不会启动，而 Katei 的声音可能被其他人听见。此外，就算警报启动，Katei 也无法帮 Xyn 成员迅速脱身，因为大楼外不会空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:57663
    old "However, there was something else Katei realized: Xyn were right. The Sekimeiya's value was already much higher than what Ashiya had expected.{w} To incentivize Xyn's attack, Ashiya had been building an air of mystery around the gemstone, which had rapidly expanded. Until the 15th, the Sekimeiya's worth would be far higher than everything else Ashiya had ever possessed.{w} Katei didn't feel pressured. He had very valuable information, and he had learned that the concept of his plan could still be executed, albeit differently. He could anonymously threaten Ido with the audio, but that would give away Katei's source of information, and unlike after his previous plan, Xyn wouldn't be indebted to him. As such, he decided to change his way of thinking for the time being."
    new "不过，Katei 还意识到了另一件事：Xyn 说得对。Sekimeiya 的价值早已远超芦屋的预期。{w} 为了诱使 Xyn 出手，芦屋一直在给这颗宝石营造神秘气氛，而这种气氛迅速膨胀。到 15 日为止，Sekimeiya 的价值会远远高过芦屋拥有过的任何东西。{w} Katei 并不觉得有压力。他掌握了极有价值的情报，也明白了自己计划的构想仍可实行，只是方式要变。他可以用录音匿名威胁 Ido，但那会暴露 Katei 的情报来源；而且与上次计划之后不同，Xyn 不会因此欠他人情。于是，他决定暂且改变思路。"

    # game/script.rpy:57664
    old "The Sekimeiya... he could obtain it himself and postpone the idea of blackmailing Xyn. He had the key to the cabinet and a trump card he'd saved for years—the storeroom's secret.{w} Before Katei's parents had died, the building had undergone severe expansions. The secret corridor had always remained a hidden part of the lowest floor, but nobody who knew about it remained.{w} Naturally, Katei had tested it already to deduce whether Xyn were aware of its existence. He had easily been able to confirm it had never opened during their attacks."
    new "Sekimeiya……他可以亲自拿到它，把勒索 Xyn 的念头暂时搁下。他手里有展示柜的钥匙，还有一张藏了多年的王牌——储藏室的秘密。{w} 在 Katei 的父母去世之前，这栋大楼经历过大规模扩建。那条秘密通道一直是底层不为人知的一部分，但知道它的人已经都不在了。{w} 当然，Katei 已经试探过，想推断 Xyn 是否知道它的存在。他很容易就确认，在 Xyn 的历次袭击中，那条通道从未被打开过。"

    # game/script.rpy:57667
    old "How could Katei take the Sekimeiya out of the tower? Despite all he knew, it wasn't a simple task.{w} He couldn't act out a fake Xyn attack when he didn't have the night shift: if he entered through the storeroom, he would be seen from the security room.{w} He could take action when he had the night shift. He could bring the Sekimeiya to the storeroom and claim Xyn had erased the security footage. But would such a thing be believable?{w} He wasn't worried that Xyn could threaten him anymore—he had the upper hand in that battle, as he could expose a good deal about them. Yet, Katei's story would be too convenient. His alarm would have to be somehow bypassed, and Katei would have to let them escape."
    new "Katei 要怎么把 Sekimeiya 带出塔？尽管他知道这么多，这仍不是件容易的事。{w} 不值夜班时，他无法伪造一场 Xyn 的袭击：如果他从储藏室进去，就会被监控室看到。{w} 他可以在值夜班时动手。他可以把 Sekimeiya 带到储藏室，声称 Xyn 删掉了监控录像。可这种说法会有人信吗？{w} 他已经不再担心 Xyn 能威胁自己——在这场较量中他占了上风，因为他能揭发 Xyn 的许多事。可是，Katei 的说法会显得太过凑巧。警报总得被绕过，而且 Katei 还得放他们逃走。"

    # game/script.rpy:57668
    old "What if he activated the alarm by forcing open the cabinet? Then, when the exit unlocked, no Xyn member would be found in the building, and the Sekimeiya would've magically disappeared.{w} There was only one way Katei could make that work: by saying he had seen someone escaping toward the storeroom. However, he didn't want to reveal the existence of the hidden door yet.{w} There was no smooth story that let Katei weasel out. He didn't want to be investigated by Ashiya or Xyn, but every scenario sounded iffy and had him as an easy suspect.{w} That was until he realized that the perfect moment existed.{w} A moment where he wouldn't be the only suspect, and where his story would be believed without doubt: the day of the event."
    new "如果他用强行打开展示柜的方式触发警报呢？那么出口解锁时，楼里不会找到任何 Xyn 成员，而 Sekimeiya 则会像变魔术一样消失。{w} 要让这套说法成立，Katei 只有一个办法：声称自己看见有人朝储藏室方向逃走了。但他还不想暴露暗门的存在。{w} 没有哪套说辞能让 Katei 顺利脱身。他不想被芦屋或 Xyn 调查，可每一种情形都漏洞百出，让他很容易成为嫌疑人。{w} 直到他意识到，完美的时机确实存在。{w} 在那个时机里，他不会成为唯一的嫌疑人，而他的说法也会被毫无疑问地采信：活动当天。"

    # game/script.rpy:57673
    old "The day when Xyn would be in the tower, and when Katei would be in the security room. He could use their own attack against them to obfuscate his involvement."
    new "那一天，Xyn 会在塔里，而 Katei 会在监控室。他可以借 Xyn 的袭击来掩盖自己参与其中。"

    # game/script.rpy:57674
    old "He knew what would happen and what Xyn's actions would be. He immediately thought of a way to take advantage of them."
    new "他知道将会发生什么，也知道 Xyn 会如何行动。他立刻想到了利用他们的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:57675
    old "The Sekimeiya cabinet had been designed to trigger the alarm upon being minimally damaged. At {time=9:04}, a vast cloud of smoke was going to be released in the event room. Even though the cabinet could be unlocked, the mere damage of the smoke could set off the alarm.{w} In any case, if the alarm went off at that time, it wouldn't be questioned: a real attack would've triggered it, so it would've served its function."
    new "Sekimeiya 的展示柜被设计成只要轻微受损就会触发警报。到 {time=9:04}，活动室里将释放出大片烟雾。即使展示柜可以解锁，烟雾本身造成的损伤也可能触发警报。{w} 无论如何，如果警报在那个时候响起，不会有人质疑：真正的袭击本就会触发它，所以它也算尽到了职责。"

    # game/script.rpy:57676
    old "Katei had designed the system, and he knew Xyn didn't have access to the tower's computer. If he altered the system to automatically activate the alarm at that time, no one would know.{w} He could trap Xyn in the tower and commandeer the rest of their plan himself. In addition, Katei had another reason to trigger the alarm: to aid Xyn before his intervention. The only way their plan could fail was if people from the outside quickly raided the building despite the smoke. That was something the alarm could prevent."
    new "这套系统是 Katei 设计的，他知道 Xyn 无法访问塔里的电脑。如果他改动系统，让警报在那个时候自动触发，不会有人知道。{w} 他可以把 Xyn 困在塔里，并亲自接管他们计划的剩余部分。此外，Katei 触发警报还有另一个理由：在他介入之前先帮 Xyn 一把。他们的计划唯一可能失败的地方，就是外面的人不顾烟雾迅速冲进大楼。而警报恰好能阻止这种事。"

    # game/script.rpy:57679
    old "Katei's initial idea was promising, and he could develop it further.{w} Xyn would disable the hallway A cameras, where the security room and the storeroom were. That meant that before the attack, Katei could quickly go to the lobby to discuss what to do during the event with the police. That would be the last recording of hallway A.{w} Upon seeing the smoke, everyone would rapidly evacuate, unaware that the alarm was soon to be activated. Then, during the chaos, Katei would reenter the hallway."
    new "Katei 最初的想法很有前景，而且他还能进一步完善。{w} Xyn 会关掉 A走廊的摄像头，而监控室和储藏室都在那边。这意味着，在袭击发生前，Katei 可以迅速去大厅，与警察商量活动期间该如何应对。那会成为 A走廊的最后一段录像。{w} 一看到烟雾，所有人都会迅速疏散，没人知道警报即将启动。随后，在混乱之中，Katei 会重新进入走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:57680
    old "That would no longer be caught by the cameras. As he'd heard Xyn's discussion, he knew that by crawling, he would avoid falling unconscious.{w} He knew what Atase's movements would be—the alarm wouldn't influence them. He would go to the cleaning room, so Katei had the opportunity to take the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet if it was unlocked. If it wasn't, he'd go take it from the cleaning cart after Atase finished his job."
    new "这样便不会再被摄像头拍到。他听过 Xyn 的商议，知道只要匍匐爬行，就能避免失去意识。{w} 他清楚 Atase 的行动会如何展开——警报不会改变那些步骤。Atase 会去清洁间，因此只要展示柜未上锁，Katei 就有机会取出 Sekimeiya。若柜子锁着，他就等 Atase 做完清洁，再从清洁车里取走。"

    # game/script.rpy:57681
    old "Then, he could rapidly go to the storeroom and leave the Sekimeiya behind the movable wall. Lei had told him it couldn't be kept at a warm temperature, but the storeroom's corridor was colder than the rest of the tower due to its lack of insulation and air conditioning.{w} Lastly, he would leave using his unique key. Everyone would be in front of the entrance, so he wouldn't be seen stepping out of the building. Then, he would appear from behind them, as if he had evacuated, which hallway A's camera would corroborate."
    new "接着，他可以迅速前往储藏室，把 Sekimeiya 留在可移动墙后面。Lei 告诉过他，Sekimeiya 不能保存在温暖的环境中；储藏室的走廊没有隔热层，也没有空调，因此比塔内其他地方更冷。{w} 最后，他会用自己的专属钥匙离开。所有人都会聚在入口前，所以没人会看见他走出大楼。然后，他会从人群后方现身，仿佛自己也是刚撤离出来，而 A走廊的摄像头会印证这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:57685
    old "Nobody would be in the security room, so after twelve hours, the shutter would open. Then, someone inside the building would be guaranteed to be a member of Xyn and responsible for triggering the alarm."
    new "监控室里不会有人，因此十二小时后，卷帘门会打开。届时，楼内必定会有一个 Xyn 成员，而警报正是由他触发的。"

    # game/script.rpy:57686
    old "However, nobody would know the Sekimeiya had been stolen because Xyn's fake would remain inside, and nobody would suspect Katei of having any involvement, as he couldn't have. Not even Xyn would suspect him."
    new "然而，没人会知道 Sekimeiya 已被偷走，因为里面会留着 Xyn 制作的赝品 Sekimeiya；也没人会怀疑 Katei 参与其中，因为他根本不可能参与。就连 Xyn 也不会怀疑到他头上。"

    # game/script.rpy:57687
    old "And in the future, he could retrieve the real Sekimeiya from the storeroom without an issue."
    new "而日后，他可以毫无阻碍地从储藏室取回真正的 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:57700
    old "Everything was finally in motion, and the long wait for the day of the event began.{w} Ashiya, Xyn, and Katei. Each of those three parties had their own unique agenda."
    new "一切终于开始运转，接下来便是对活动当日的漫长等待。{w}芦屋、Xyn、Katei——三方各有各的盘算。"

    # game/script.rpy:57701
    old "Every night, Ashiya expected Xyn's attack. However, Katei knew it wouldn't happen yet and kept mentally rehearsing his plan."
    new "每晚，芦屋都在等着 Xyn 动手。然而 Katei 知道那还不会发生，只是在脑中反复演练自己的计划。"

    # game/script.rpy:57702
    old "Meanwhile, Xyn received their replica of the Sekimeiya.{w} Ido, who had seen, touched, and measured the original, confirmed there was no glaring difference between the two, and that unless Ashiya had foreseen a replica being created, it would work."
    new "与此同时，Xyn 收到了他们制作的 Sekimeiya 仿制品。{w} Ido 见过、摸过并测量过真品，确认两者没有明显差异；除非芦屋早已预料到会有人仿制，否则这件复制品足以奏效。"

    # game/script.rpy:57707
    old "As the days approached, Ashiya realized Xyn were likely to not fall for their trap, and as Xyn had predicted, the Sekimeiya continued to grow more valuable in the eyes of the world.{w} Ashiya hadn't fully prepared the event yet, so a trusted employee of theirs was chosen to plan out the guided visits."
    new "随着日期临近，芦屋意识到 Xyn 很可能不会中自己布下的圈套；而正如 Xyn 所料，Sekimeiya 在世人心中的价值持续攀升。{w}芦屋尚未完全准备好活动，于是选了一名信得过的员工来筹划导览参观。"

    # game/script.rpy:57708
    old "Atase was under a lot of pressure. He had to make sure the plan was a success, and if he executed what had been laid out perfectly, the odds would be in his favor."
    new "Atase 承受着巨大的压力。他必须确保计划成功；只要把安排好的步骤执行得天衣无缝，胜算就会站在他这边。"

    # game/script.rpy:57709
    old "All the preparations had been made. Slowly, the days of December ticked up to the 15th."
    new "所有准备都已完成。十二月的日子一天天过去，最终到了十五日。"

    # game/script.rpy:57737
    old "However, nobody expected what would happen on that day."
    new "然而，那一天发生的事，没有人预料得到。"

    # game/script.rpy:57738
    old "Eight people were trapped in Ashiya Tower, but they weren't alone. That was the catalyst of the construction of a mountainous maze.{w} Who reached its peak? It wasn't everyone who began the climb."
    new "八个人被困在芦屋塔中，但他们并不孤单。这一切，成了筑起一座层叠如山之迷宫的契机。{w} 谁攀上了峰顶？开始攀登的人，并非都能抵达。"

    # game/script.rpy:57739
    old "You are lucky enough to have access to all its sides, but what about the peak?{w} Three parties formed the mountain's base, unaware of how high it would go."
    new "你足够幸运，能接触到它的每一面，可峰顶呢？{w} 三方构成了这座山的底座，却不知道它会升到多高。"

    # game/script.rpy:57761
    old "Xyn"
    new "Xyn"

    # game/script.rpy:57765
    old "Katei"
    new "Katei"

    # game/script.rpy:57769
    old "Ashiya"
    new "芦屋"

    # game/script.rpy:57773
    old "Continue"
    new "继续"

    # game/script.rpy:57777
    old "Contrition"
    new "悔悟"

    # game/script.rpy:57788
    old "When the tower opened, Atase was the only person waiting outside. He wore light attire despite the cold."
    new "芦屋塔开门时，在外等候的只有 Atase 一人。天这么冷，他却穿得很单薄。"

    # game/script.rpy:57795
    old "He bowed at the receptionist and stepped in slowly. A man walked up to him, asking for his ticket. After showing it and confirming that he didn't have a phone, he stepped to the hallway B door."
    new "他向接待员鞠了一躬，缓缓走入。一名男子迎上来，请他出示门票。他出示了门票，又确认自己没有带手机，然后走到 B 走廊门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:57798
    old "It was very early in the morning. For a while, all he heard was the receptionist shuffling a bunch of papers behind the desk."
    new "此时清晨尚早。有好一阵子，他耳中只有接待员在柜台后翻动一叠文件的窸窣声。"

    # game/script.rpy:57805
    old "The next person he saw was Ido. Without looking over, he casually made his way to the hallway.{w} It took him a while to come back. When he did, his clothes were different, and he was carrying a cleaning bucket."
    new "他见到的下一个人是 Ido。Ido 没往他这边看，若无其事地走向走廊。{w} 过了好一阵，Ido 才回来。回来时已换了一身衣服，手里提着清洁桶。"

    # game/script.rpy:57810
    old "Atase was relieved. Nothing had happened, so Ido's part of the plan had gone well. He didn't have the cleaning cart, as it was waiting for Atase with the fake Sekimeiya."
    new "Atase 松了口气。什么都没发生，说明 Ido 负责的那部分计划进展顺利。Ido 没有推清洁车，因为那辆车正载着赝品 Sekimeiya，等着 Atase 去取。"

    # game/script.rpy:57815
    old "Idly mopping the floor, Ido got close to Atase. That was when he dropped a tiny grenade in his pocket. At that point, everything was ready—the action was poised to begin."
    new "Ido 漫不经心地拖着地，慢慢靠近 Atase，趁机把一颗小巧的手雷丢进他的口袋。到这一刻，一切已准备妥当——行动一触即发。"

    # game/script.rpy:57827
    old "Atase turned around when he heard something at his back. Two more people were by the entrance: a boy and a girl."
    new "身后传来动静，Atase 转过身。入口处又多了两个人：一个少年和一个少女。"

    # game/script.rpy:57828
    old "Out of nowhere, Atase felt a sudden wave of heat. ...He had seen the boy before.{w} In Musashi Gemstones, he had been the first to be hit by the smoke. Atsuki Hakutoki was his name, and he'd been safely discharged from the hospital."
    new "没来由地，Atase 感到一阵燥热。……他见过那个少年。{w} 在武藏宝石，少年是第一个被烟雾波及的人。他叫 Atsuki Hakutoki，后来已平安出院。"

    # game/script.rpy:57834
    old "Atase swiftly looked away. On that day, his face had been disguised, but what if he was recognized? He stared at the floor as they walked closer to him, clenching his fists tightly."
    new "Atase 立刻移开视线。那天他易过容，可万一被认出来呢？两人越走越近，他死死盯着地面，攥紧了拳头。"

    # game/script.rpy:57839
    old "...{w}He had to avoid eye contact; the boy next to him had lost someone, and it had been his fault.{w} He had taken a glance at the girl as well. Although he hadn't seen her before, the eyes below her red hair looked identical to the boy's."
    new "……{w}他不能和对方对上视线；身旁那个少年曾失去过一个人，而那是他的过错。{w} 他也瞥了少女一眼。他从未见过她，可红发下的那双眼睛，和少年一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:57845
    old "{time=9:00} was distant. Long before it, police officers arrived outside the tower.{w} Atase's rough facial description must've been known. He didn't think he'd be recognized, but he couldn't bring himself to look back."
    new "距离{time=9:00}还早。远在那之前，警察就已抵达塔外。{w} Atase 的大致长相想必已经被人掌握。他觉得自己不会被认出，可还是不敢回头。"

    # game/script.rpy:57846
    old "All at once, a wave of people flooded in. Faint chatter took over the silence, but none of it reached Atase. He had to look calm and know exactly what to do.{w} He saw someone he knew outside the lobby. However, that person didn't know who Atase was. His job was to take out a suitcase at {time=9:06.}"
    new "忽然间，人潮涌了进来。细碎的交谈声取代了寂静，却没有一句落进 Atase 耳中。他必须显得镇定，而且清楚自己该做什么。{w} 他看见大厅外有一个认识的人。但那人并不知道 Atase 是谁。他的任务是在{time=9:06.}取出手提箱。"

    # game/script.rpy:57847
    old "Ido had left through the opposite hallway a while ago. When he came back, he started to mop the floor a second time."
    new "Ido 不久前从另一侧的走廊离开了。回来之后，他又开始拖地。"

    # game/script.rpy:57849
    old "Slowly, the time kept passing.{w} After Ido was done with the little plaza, he entered again, mopping the new snowy footprints and the already shining floor."
    new "时间缓缓流逝。{w} Ido 把小广场拖完后，又走了进来，擦去新留下的雪水脚印，也拖过本就发亮的地面。"

    # game/script.rpy:57850
    old "For a while, he kept doing that. He had to stay there, as he knew what was soon to happen in the hallways."
    new "有一阵子，他一直重复着这些动作。他必须留在那里，因为他知道走廊里很快会发生什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:57858
    old "Atase's heart skipped a beat. Behind him, he'd heard the voice of Katei Kuiji. However, that name..."
    new "Atase 心跳漏了一拍。身后传来的是 Katei Kuiji 的声音。可是，那个名字……"

    # game/script.rpy:57865
    old "Atase's head slowly turned to the girl.{w} She wasn't Shiroya. That was the name of the girl whose memory pressed down on his shoulders."
    new "Atase 缓缓转头看向那个少女。{w} 她不是 Shiroya。Shiroya 是另一个少女的名字，关于她的记忆一直沉沉压在他肩上。"

    # game/script.rpy:57867
    old "Who was that, then?{w} Atase would soon learn."
    new "那么，她是谁？{w} Atase 很快就会知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:57874
    old "At {time=9}, the door to hallway B opened. Through it came Naomi Cabca, who gave a brief explanation of the event.{w} It was time. Only four minutes were left."
    new "到了{time=9}，B走廊的门打开了。Naomi Cabca 从门后走来，简短地说明了活动内容。{w} 时间到了。只剩下四分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:57891
    old "Quietly, the three people at the front of the line stepped into the hallway and were drawn to the room in the middle."
    new "队伍最前面的三人悄无声息地走进走廊，被引向中段的房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:57896
    old "A single cabinet was there, covered by a velvet curtain. It was a sight Atase had seen before through a picture."
    new "那里只摆着一座展示柜，上面罩着天鹅绒遮布。这样的景象，Atase 曾在照片上见过。"

    # game/script.rpy:57904
    old "All right. It would be helpful if you could tell me your names so that I know how to address you."
    new "好。方便的话，请告诉我你们的名字，我好知道该怎么称呼。"

    # game/script.rpy:57905
    old "I'm Miiya Moiromo."
    new "我是 Miiya Moiromo。"

    # game/script.rpy:57906
    old "That was her name. It was one Atase remembered. Miiya Moiromo had been in the shop as well, but she hadn't been hit by the impact of the explosion."
    new "原来是这个名字。Atase 记得这个名字。Miiya Moiromo 当时也在那家店里，只是没有受到爆炸冲击的波及。"

    # game/script.rpy:57911
    old "\"Akaro Esata\". For the first time in hours, Atase opened his mouth, voicing the name that had been on his ticket."
    new "「Akaro Esata」。几个小时以来，Atase 第一次开口，说出了票上那个名字。"

    # game/script.rpy:57916
    old "...Atsuki Hakutoki."
    new "……Atsuki Hakutoki。"

    # game/script.rpy:57926
    old "Naomi began to explain the story behind the Sekimeiya. As she did, Atase wondered if any bit of truth was coming out of her mouth."
    new "Naomi 开始讲起 Sekimeiya 背后的故事。Atase 一边听着，一边在心里琢磨：她嘴里能有几分真话？"

    # game/script.rpy:57928
    old "She took out a keyring. After inserting a small one into the cabinet, she unlocked it."
    new "她取出一串钥匙，拣出一把小钥匙插进展示柜，打开了锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:57935
    old "Atase suppressed his nervousness as best he could. The cabinet had been unlocked, so the plan was very close to succeeding. However, a few seconds still remained until {time=9:04.}"
    new "Atase 竭力压住紧张。展示柜已经解锁，计划离成功只差一步。可距离 {time=9:04.} 还剩几秒。"

    # game/script.rpy:57936
    old "He attempted to slow Naomi down. She had been about to raise the curtain and let them touch the gemstone. If that happened before the smoke was released, the Sekimeiya could be hit by it, which could later reveal that the clean one was Xyn's fake."
    new "他设法拖住 Naomi。她正要掀起遮布，让他们去摸那颗宝石。若在烟雾放出之前掀开，Sekimeiya 就可能沾上烟尘，日后便会暴露出那颗干净的宝石其实是 Xyn 的赝品。"

    # game/script.rpy:57956
    old "After a pause, Naomi shook her head and crouched beside the cabinet. When she raised the curtain, a huge cloud of smoke rose with it, coming from the grenade Atase had taken out of his pocket."
    new "顿了顿，Naomi 摇了摇头，蹲到展示柜旁。她掀起遮布的瞬间，一大团烟雾随之涌起——那是 Atase 从口袋里掏出的烟雾弹散出的。"

    # game/script.rpy:57967
    old "Before anyone could resist, Atase had already fallen to the floor. Looking down and covering his nose, he avoided having his consciousness fade."
    new "还没等任何人反应过来，Atase 早已伏倒在地。他低下头、捂住口鼻，不让自己失去意识。"

    # game/script.rpy:57969
    old "Once everyone plummeted down, a sudden, unsettling silence consumed the room.{w} What was happening outside? Had everyone evacuated? Had the gems been brought out in the suitcase? For a few seconds, Atase had to wait to make sure nobody remained conscious."
    new "众人相继倒下后，一阵令人不安的死寂笼罩了房间。{w}外面究竟发生了什么？人都撤走了吗？宝石已经装进手提箱带出去了吗？Atase 不得不等上几秒，确认没有一个人还醒着。"

    # game/script.rpy:57970
    old "He heard someone running through hallway A. It must have been the man with the gemstones, but why? Two minutes hadn't passed yet."
    new "他听见有人从 A走廊跑过。那应该是带着宝石的那个男人，可为什么？两分钟明明还没到。"

    # game/script.rpy:57976
    old "Atase's eyes widened. What the hell was that sound?"
    new "Atase 睁大了眼睛。那到底是什么声音？"

    # game/script.rpy:57978
    old "He waited, wondering what was happening. ...Had the plan been a failure?"
    new "他等着，不知道外面出了什么事。……计划失败了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:57981
    old "After a few seconds, the loud noise faded. However, Atase could not hear anything else outside the room."
    new "几秒之后，巨响渐渐平息。可除此之外，Atase 再听不到房外有任何动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:57984
    old "When he looked up, he couldn't believe he was in the same place. Very little light was being cast from the ceiling, and the walls had become dark."
    new "他抬起头，简直不敢相信自己还在同一个地方。天花板上透下的光所剩无几，墙壁也已暗了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:57985
    old "The three people who'd been with him were lying on the floor. Once he knew he could move, he silently stepped to hallway B."
    new "刚才和他在一起的三个人都躺在地上。确认自己能动了之后，他悄无声息地走向 B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:57991
    old "Again, it was hard to believe it was the same place as before. However, nobody was there.{w} Covering his face, Atase dashed to the cleaning room."
    new "又一次，他难以相信这里和之前是同一个地方。可一个人也没有。{w}Atase 捂住脸，奔进清洁间。"

    # game/script.rpy:57997
    old "There was light; almost no smoke had gone through the door.{w} Occupying most of the space, the cart sat in the room. Without hesitating, he dropped the smoke grenade inside it."
    new "里面亮着灯，几乎没有什么烟穿过门缝。{w}那辆推车占去了大半个房间。他没有犹豫，把烟雾弹丢进车里。"

    # game/script.rpy:57998
    old "The fake Sekimeiya was there. However, Atase couldn't touch it with his bare hands, or he would leave smoky fingerprints on it. He took it with the clean sleeves of his shirt and brought it to the hallway, crouching so that the remaining smoke wouldn't make contact with it."
    new "赝品 Sekimeiya 就在那里。可 Atase 不能赤手去碰，否则会在上面留下带烟的指纹。他用干净的衬衫袖子裹住它，拿到走廊上，又蹲下身，免得残留的烟雾沾到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:58003
    old "Back in the event room, he walked to the cabinet. Like Naomi had been about to do, he raised the curtain."
    new "回到活动室，他走向展示柜，像 Naomi 刚才要做的那样掀起了遮布。"

    # game/script.rpy:58010
    old "...{w}H-Huh?"
    new "……{w}怎、怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:58011
    old "He stopped cold, suddenly bewildered. Two glowing stones were in front of him."
    new "他猛地僵住，一时不知所措。眼前竟有两颗发光的石头。"

    # game/script.rpy:58012
    old "Why? He couldn't comprehend what he was seeing.{w} Had there been two Sekimeiya?"
    new "怎么会？他无法理解眼前的景象。{w}难道 Sekimeiya 有两个？"

    # game/script.rpy:58013
    old "Atase had to rush, but he didn't know what to do. If he took both gemstones, Xyn's plan would never work.{w} Dumbfounded, he reached for one of the two; he could only replace a single one."
    new "Atase 必须抓紧时间，却不知该怎么办。若把两颗宝石都拿走，Xyn 的计划就绝不可能成功。{w}他怔怔地伸手去拿其中一颗——他只能换掉一颗。"

    # game/script.rpy:58014
    old "He felt a screen of glass that he was able to slide open. Then, without placing his fingers on it, he took a gemstone out, swapping it with his.{w} Still in awe, he closed the glass and dropped the curtain down."
    new "他摸到一块可以滑开的玻璃。随后，他尽量不让手指碰到宝石，把其中一颗取出来，换成了自己带来的那颗。{w}他仍满心惊愕，合上玻璃，放下遮布。"

    # game/script.rpy:58020
    old "He ran back with the gem in his hands. After locating the door, he moved into hallway B and silently went to the cleaning room."
    new "他捧着宝石跑回去。找到门后，他进入 B走廊，悄声来到清洁间。"

    # game/script.rpy:58024
    old "He dropped the Sekimeiya next to the grenade, and once he was done, Atase rushed back to the event room."
    new "他把 Sekimeiya 放在烟雾弹旁边。做完这些，Atase 便急忙赶回活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:58031
    old "He made sure to close the door and stepped to the spot where he'd fallen down."
    new "他特意关好门，走回自己先前倒下的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:58032
    old "However, the darkness prevented him from noticing something.{w} Naomi was no longer there."
    new "然而黑暗让他没能察觉到一件事。{w}Naomi 已经不在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58036
    old "While Atase lay down, he heard sounds around him: the floor wasn't empty."
    new "Atase 躺下时，听见四周有响动：这一层并非空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:58037
    old "Just what was happening? Everything started to become stranger when nobody entered where he was."
    new "究竟出了什么事？他待在那里，没人进来，情况却开始变得越来越奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:58039
    old "His job was to stay there, and that was what he did."
    new "他的任务就是待在那里，而他也照做了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58042
    old "...{w}But he couldn't make sense of it. Why weren't they being rescued?"
    new "……{w}可他怎么也想不通。为什么没人来救他们？"

    # game/script.rpy:58047
    old "Wh—{w=0.4} *cough*"
    new "什——{w=0.4}*咳*"

    # game/script.rpy:58048
    old "The boy woke up.{w} That was the start of a very long day.{w} During the previous weeks, Atase had come up with countless outcomes. However, the real one was far from any he'd devised."
    new "那个少年醒了。{w}漫长的一天由此开始。{w}在此之前的几周里，Atase 设想过无数种结果。可真正发生的那一种，与他所设想的任何一种都相去甚远。"

    # game/script.rpy:58051
    old "They were trapped. The alarm he'd heard had removed all methods of escape.{w} When he learned Naomi had left the event room before his return, he had to hide his fear. ...Could she have noticed Atase's absence upon awakening?"
    new "他们被困住了。他听到的那阵警报封锁了所有逃生的手段。{w}得知 Naomi 在他回来之前就已离开活动室时，他只能把恐惧藏起来。……她会不会一醒来就发现 Atase 不见了？"

    # game/script.rpy:58054
    old "That was one of his initial questions, but they didn't stop piling up. Atase would have to spend twelve hours in that building until he could leave."
    new "这只是他最初的疑问之一，可问题却接二连三地堆积起来。Atase 要在这栋楼里待满十二个小时才能离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:58055
    old "He didn't know how worried he had to be or what had triggered the alarm. Even though the building was full of cameras, he knew not to be afraid of them.{w} He was told the internet connection had been cut by the alarm. In the meantime, Xyn couldn't remotely access the computer. However, he knew his group well. According to Katei, at {time=21}, the connection would come back, and Xyn would immediately erase all the recorded footage."
    new "他不知道自己该有多担心，也不知道是什么触发了警报。楼里到处都是摄像头，可他清楚不必怕它们。{w} 他听说警报切断了网络连接，Xyn 一时无法远程访问电脑。不过，他很了解自己的同伴。按 Katei 的说法，到了 {time=21}，连接就会恢复，Xyn 会立刻抹掉所有录像。"

    # game/script.rpy:58056
    old "He recalled the conversation he'd had with his boss word by word; he knew how important it was for him not to fail.{w} Therefore, despite the unforeseen alarm, Atase had only one priority: to make the plan a success."
    new "他逐字回想与上司的那番对话，清楚自己绝不能失手。{w} 所以，尽管警报来得意外，Atase 也只有一个目标：让计划成功。"

    # game/script.rpy:58066
    old "Inside Out"
    new "里外翻转"

    # game/script.rpy:58075
    old "It was almost time."
    new "时候快到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58082
    old "Upon arriving at the tower, Katei had listened to the latest recording. As he'd hoped, Ido and his boss had talked one last time and gone over their movements.{w} Katei took out the SD card—he couldn't allow that audio to be heard by anyone else. As he didn't want the card on his person either, he hid it in the security room."
    new "一到芦屋塔，Katei 就先听了最新那段录音。正如他所期望的，Ido 和他的上司最后谈了一次，核对了双方的行踪。{w} Katei 取出 SD 卡——那段音频绝不能让其他人听到。他也不愿把卡带在身上，便把它藏进了监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:58083
    old "The time was rapidly approaching, and he didn't have the opportunity to go back to the staff room. While he tried to remain calm, he hid the voice recorder as well. Although the large device could've been found if Ashiya searched, he knew the SD card wouldn't be, which was all that mattered.{w} Through the monitors, Katei saw the first group approaching the event room. He had to act."
    new "时间越来越近，他已经没机会回员工室了。他竭力保持镇定，把录音笔也藏了起来。那东西个头不小，芦屋那边若仔细搜查，或许能找到，但 SD 卡不会——这才是关键。{w} 透过监视器，Katei 看见第一批人正走向活动室。他必须行动了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58087
    old "Even though nobody was seeing him, he approached the hallway nonchalantly. During the previous days, he'd kept coming up with good excuses to get out of the security room at that time."
    new "尽管没人看见他，他还是若无其事地朝走廊走去。前几天，他一直在为那个时间点离开监控室想合适的借口。"

    # game/script.rpy:58093
    old "Hallway A was empty, but as soon as Katei entered it, so did someone else. From the lobby came a man with long hair who he'd never seen before.{w} Paying no attention to Katei, he walked forward."
    new "A走廊空无一人，可 Katei 刚走进去，就有另一个人也进了走廊。从大厅走来一个他从未见过的长发男人。{w} 那人看都没看 Katei，径直向前走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:58094
    old "Behind the handrails, Katei knew the grenades were concealed. However, he couldn't look at them because that footage was going to be reviewed."
    new "Katei 知道栏杆后面藏着烟雾弹。可他不能朝那边看，因为这段录像之后会被人查看。"

    # game/script.rpy:58095
    old "Katei couldn't get distracted. Keeping his expression natural, he stepped into the lobby."
    new "Katei 不能分神。他表情自然地迈步走进大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:58103
    old "The room was full of people. All the visitors formed a line behind hallway B, while police officers conversed with Ashiya's guard.{w} Dote and Asfu, Katei's co-workers, greeted him with a smile. Their job was to uncover the cabinets in most of the crystal rooms, but they knew very few people there that day wanted to see those."
    new "大厅里挤满了人。参观者都在B走廊后面排队，警察则与芦屋的警卫交谈。{w} Katei 的同事 Dote 和 Asfu 笑着向他打招呼。他们的职责是掀开大部分水晶展室里展示柜的遮布，但他们知道，今天在场的人里几乎没有谁想看那些东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:58104
    old "One more person reacted to Katei's arrival: the janitor. However, only Katei noticed it, as Ido looked away immediately."
    new "还有一个人对 Katei 的到来有所反应：那个清洁工。但只有 Katei 察觉到了，因为 Ido 立刻移开了目光。"

    # game/script.rpy:58105
    old "...{w}Nobody was looking at him, and he didn't want to walk away from the door. As if waiting for the conversation to end, he stared at the police as they talked."
    new "……{w}没有人看着他，他也不想离开门边。他盯着交谈中的警察，像是在等那番对话结束。"

    # game/script.rpy:58106
    old "Katei's plan wasn't guaranteed to work, but he wasn't at risk. Once the smoke was released, the chance to step back into the hallway might not have existed. If someone gestured at Katei to evacuate, he couldn't turn around.{w} However, it didn't matter; he wouldn't be blamed for the attack, and Xyn's plan would still fail. Furthermore, he could attempt to sneak away outside and then reenter the building through the storeroom anyway."
    new "Katei 的计划未必成功，但他本人不会有危险。烟雾一旦释放，他也许就再没机会回到走廊里了。要是有人示意他撤离，他就不能回头。{w} 不过这无所谓；袭击不会算到他头上，Xyn 的计划照样会失败。再说，他大可以先悄悄溜到外面，再从储藏室绕回楼里。"

    # game/script.rpy:58110
    old "The time passed faster than Katei had imagined. All of a sudden, he noticed the light in hallway A disappear."
    new "时间过得比 Katei 预想的快。忽然间，他注意到A走廊的灯光消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58111
    old "Wh-What's this!?"
    new "这、这是什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:58117
    old "Smoke! Something happened in the hallway!"
    new "烟雾！走廊里出事了！"

    # game/script.rpy:58118
    old "Someone opened the door in front of the crowd. In an instant, a plume of smoke invaded the lobby, and the door was forcibly shut again."
    new "有人当着众人的面推开了门。刹那间，一股浓烟涌入大厅，门又被强行关上。"

    # game/script.rpy:58119
    old "It's in both hallways!"
    new "两条走廊都有！"

    # game/script.rpy:58122
    old "Katei felt a shock going through his body: that was the moment. In the blink of an eye, everyone had turned around toward the exit, while both police officers were alerting their superiors.{w} As quickly as he could, Katei dashed into the hallway and dropped to his hands and knees."
    new "Katei 浑身一震：就是现在。眨眼间，所有人都转身朝出口看去，两名警察则在向上级报告。{w} Katei 用最快的速度冲进走廊，双手双膝着地趴了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:58127
    old "On the floor, someone almost crashed onto him. A person he couldn't distinguish through the veil of smoke rapidly crawled to the lobby, slamming the door shut behind them."
    new "有个人在地上，差点撞到他身上。隔着烟雾，他看不清那人的模样，只见对方飞快地爬向大厅，反手把门重重关上。"

    # game/script.rpy:58132
    old "Suddenly, Katei could only hear his heartbeat. That person was undoubtedly the man he'd seen entering the hallway, but he couldn't be heard anymore. Only faint yells could."
    new "忽然间，Katei 只听得见自己的心跳。那个人无疑就是他先前看见走进走廊的男人，可现在已经听不到他的动静了，只剩隐约的喊声。"

    # game/script.rpy:58135
    old "That was until a loud alarm rang through the building. Immediately afterward, a rough sound came from the lobby, along with stronger yells. The shutter was closing."
    new "直到刺耳的警报响彻整栋楼。紧接着，大厅传来粗重的声响，喊声也愈发响亮。卷帘门正在落下。"

    # game/script.rpy:58139
    old "And just like that, Katei's plan was set in motion. He had trapped himself, but nobody had realized it."
    new "就这样，Katei 的计划开始运转。他把自己困在了里面，却没有一个人察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:58140
    old "He'd seen the floor through the cameras: it was very likely only him and Atase were conscious. With utmost care, he slowly crawled toward the event room."
    new "他通过摄像头看过那一层的情况：很可能只有他和 Atase 还清醒着。他小心翼翼地慢慢朝活动室爬去。"

    # game/script.rpy:58143
    old "From outside, he heard a sound: Atase was standing up. Amidst the pure silence, Katei heard him going to the cleaning room."
    new "门外传来声响：Atase 站起来了。在一片死寂中，Katei 听见他走向清洁间。"

    # game/script.rpy:58145
    old "That was Katei's chance to open the door slightly. When he did, he saw the floor of the event room, but all the bodies were too far away to be distinguished."
    new "这正是 Katei 把门推开一条缝的机会。门一开，他看见了活动室的地面，可那些倒在地上的人都离得太远，分不清是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:58146
    old "Through the gap, he stared. He knew the darkness would prevent Atase from noticing him, and there was something he had to see.{w} Days earlier, he had uncovered the cabinet's curtain. ...He had seen two identical Sekimeiya lying atop the cushion.{w} Although he'd gotten scared at first, Xyn hadn't planted a fake yet—he knew Ashiya had two identical gemstones."
    new "他透过门缝盯着里面。他知道黑暗里 Atase 不会察觉到他，而且有件事他必须看清。{w} 几天前，他曾掀开展示柜的遮布。……他看见两个一模一样的 Sekimeiya 躺在垫子上。{w} 起初他确实吓了一跳，但 Xyn 还没有把赝品放进去——他知道芦屋手上有两块一样的宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:58147
    old "Xyn would only be able to replace one, but Katei had the chance to obtain both. He merely had to observe from the hallway to learn which one got replaced."
    new "Xyn 只能换掉一个，而 Katei 有机会把两个都弄到手。他只要在走廊里盯着，就能知道被换掉的是哪一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:58152
    old "It only took Atase a few seconds to come back. When he did, he approached the cabinet while holding a glowing stone."
    new "Atase 只离开了几秒就回来了。他一回来，便拿着块发光的石头走向展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:58153
    old "Despite the darkness, once he uncovered the curtain, Katei was able to perceive Atase's shock. Two gemstones were contained in the cabinet."
    new "尽管四周昏暗，遮布一掀开，Katei 仍能感觉到 Atase 的震惊。展示柜里放着两块宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:58154
    old "He was completely still until he reached for one of them. After taking out the rightmost one, Atase placed his own inside.{w} He ran back without wasting even a second."
    new "他僵立不动，直到伸手去拿其中一个。Atase 取出右边那个，把自己带来的放了进去。{w} 他一秒都没耽搁，转身跑了回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:58156
    old "That was Katei's moment. Overwhelmed by his unrelenting heartbeat, he rushed to the cabinet, covering his nose as he looked down."
    new "轮到 Katei 了。心脏狂跳不止，几乎要将他淹没，他冲到展示柜前，捂着鼻子低头看去。"

    # game/script.rpy:58160
    old "Admittedly, there was a small difference between them, but he knew the gem on the left was the valuable one. After taking it out, he hurriedly dropped the curtain as if nothing had happened."
    new "平心而论，两块之间有些细微差别，但他知道左边那块才是真正值钱的。取出它之后，他匆匆放下遮布，装作什么都没发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:58164
    old "He reentered the hallway. Everything was going as planned, but his frantic breaths refused to steady."
    new "他重新回到走廊。一切都在按计划进行，可他的呼吸急促得怎么也平复不下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:58165
    old "The other Sekimeiya would be in the cleaning cart. Katei only had to be in the tower for a few more seconds.{w} Hallway C was still being recorded, so he skittered to the lobby. However, on the way, he abruptly stopped himself."
    new "另一块 Sekimeiya 应该在清洁推车里。Katei 只需在塔里再待几秒。{w} C走廊仍在录像范围之内，于是他快步溜向大厅。可走到半路，他猛地停住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58167
    old "He stared at his hands in confusion. ...What had happened? There was no glow there.{w} It didn't make any sense: he could feel the Sekimeiya's touch, but it didn't look like it was there."
    new "他困惑地盯着自己的双手。……怎么回事？那里没有光芒。{w} 这说不通：他分明能感觉到 Sekimeiya 的触感，却看不出它就在手里。"

    # game/script.rpy:58172
    old "Bewildered, he stepped toward the light in the lobby, and once it illuminated his hands, he saw what had happened: the Sekimeiya was no longer white.{w} Puzzled, he looked around him. A metal shutter was covering the exit, but somehow the gemstone in his hands was more bizarre."
    new "他满心惶惑，朝大厅的光亮走去。光线照到手上时，他才看清发生了什么：Sekimeiya 不再是白色的了。{w} 他困惑地环顾四周。出口被一道金属卷帘门封住了，可不知为何，手里的宝石更让他觉得诡异。"

    # game/script.rpy:58173
    old "He looked at it with concern at the same time that he recalled Lei's words. It was essential for the Sekimeiya to remain in a cold space, and it couldn't be touched outside the cabinet."
    new "他忧心忡忡地看着它，同时想起 Lei 说过的话。Sekimeiya 必须保存在低温环境中，而且不能在展示柜外触碰。"

    # game/script.rpy:58174
    old "Had he damaged it? A nervous sweat broke out across his body. He lightly held the Sekimeiya with his suit instead so that he wouldn't directly contact it."
    new "是自己弄坏它了吗？一阵紧张的冷汗冒了出来。他改用自己的西装轻轻裹住 Sekimeiya，免得直接碰到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:58180
    old "The view of hallway B was identical: not much could be seen a few steps ahead."
    new "B走廊的景象也一样：往前几步就什么都看不清了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58181
    old "Atase had surely left the cleaning room already. Slowly, Katei turned its doorknob."
    new "Atase 肯定早就离开清洁间了。Katei 缓缓转动了门把手。"

    # game/script.rpy:58185
    old "The cart was there. Inside it, Katei saw the second Sekimeiya. Unlike the one between his hands, it still glowed dimly."
    new "推车就在那里。Katei 在里面看见了第二个 Sekimeiya。与手里那个不同，它仍散发着微弱的光。"

    # game/script.rpy:58186
    old "He reached his right arm inside and took out the other Sekimeiya without touching it directly.{w} Amazed, Katei stared at it. He couldn't know if the cloth of his shirt had made a difference, but its glow hadn't vanished that time."
    new "他伸出右臂探进去，没有直接触碰就取出了另一个 Sekimeiya。{w} Katei 惊讶地盯着它。他无从判断是不是衬衫的布料起了作用，但这一次，它的光芒没有消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:58192
    old "But the amazement quickly morphed into stupefaction. The Sekimeiya was hot."
    new "可惊讶很快变成了惊愕。Sekimeiya 是热的。"

    # game/script.rpy:58193
    old "He couldn't believe it, but there was no mistaking it: the Sekimeiya that had been in the cart was clearly warmer than everything around it. Why...? Was it also due to the absence of cold?"
    new "他不敢相信，可事实确凿无疑：原本在推车里的那个 Sekimeiya，明显比周围的一切都温暖。为什么……？也是因为缺少低温吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:58197
    old "Katei had to ignore it—he was running out of time. After stepping back into the hallway, he went inside the storeroom."
    new "Katei 只能不去管它——时间不多了。他退回走廊，进了储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:58201
    old "He knew the secret mechanism very well. Entering the secret corridor, he placed both Sekimeiya on a suitcase lying open on the floor. He had left it there to be able to leave with the gemstones in the future."
    new "他对这个隐秘的机关再熟悉不过。走进秘密通道，他把两个 Sekimeiya 放在地上敞开的行李箱里。那是他特意留在这里的，好让自己日后能带着宝石离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:58205
    old "Finally, he felt the last door, and as he did, he wondered. Would anyone see him? It couldn't be; he anticipated that everyone was in front of the main door."
    new "终于，他摸到了最后一道门。就在那时，他心里嘀咕起来：会不会有人看见他？应该不会。他料想所有人都聚在大门前面。"

    # game/script.rpy:58211
    old "...{w}Wh-What?{w} Wh-Where is it!?"
    new "...{w}什、什么？{w}在、在哪儿！？"

    # game/script.rpy:58212
    old "Petrified, Katei kept going through all his pockets.{w} The key wasn't there.{w} There was no way out for him without it. Desperately, he looked at all the keys he had, but none of them had the particular rust he most wanted to feel."
    new "Katei 僵在原地，把全身上下的口袋翻了个遍。{w}钥匙不在。{w}没有那把钥匙，他根本无路可逃。他急切地翻看手里所有的钥匙，却没有一把带着他最想摸到的那种锈迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:58217
    old "He realized that he must have dropped it.{w} He didn't keep it with the others, and he'd verified that he had it in the security room. Therefore, he'd dropped it in hallway A, when he'd been crawling toward the event room. Since his pocket had been so close to the floor, he hadn't noticed the sound of it falling out."
    new "他意识到钥匙一定是掉在路上了。{w}那把钥匙他从不与其他钥匙放在一起，而且在监控室里还确认过自己带着它。那么，就是在他爬向活动室时掉在了A走廊。{w}口袋离地面那么近，钥匙滑出去的声音他自然没能听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:58222
    old "F-Fuck! No!"
    new "混、混蛋！不可能！"

    # game/script.rpy:58226
    old "Tightening his fist, he went back to the hallway. It was drenched in darkness, but the key had to be somewhere."
    new "他攥紧拳头，回到走廊。四下浸透了黑暗，可钥匙一定就在某处。"

    # game/script.rpy:58232
    old "He moved to the wall he'd crawled next to and repeated the action, scanning the entire surface."
    new "他来到先前爬行时贴着的那面墙边，重复了一遍刚才的动作，把整面墙细细扫过。"

    # game/script.rpy:58236
    old "Although he'd lost many precious seconds, he found it camouflaged under the smoke. He'd been trying to make very little noise, but he couldn't care about that anymore. As fast as he could, he ran back to the storeroom."
    new "虽然耽误了不少宝贵的时间，他还是找到了那把被烟雾掩住的钥匙。此前他一直尽量不发出声响，如今也顾不得这些了。他以最快的速度跑回储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:58244
    old "He stopped before the secret exit. A bright, grassy field was outside it, and he was so close to seeing it.{w} He located the keyhole and inserted the chilly key into it."
    new "他在暗门前停下。门外是一片明亮青翠的草地，只差一步就能看见。{w}他摸到锁孔，把冰凉的钥匙插了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:58254
    old "It wasn't turning. The door wasn't opening."
    new "钥匙转不动。门打不开。"

    # game/script.rpy:58261
    old "No. There's no way. Why is it..."
    new "不可能。怎么会这样。为什么……"

    # game/script.rpy:58264
    old "Something was preventing him from turning the key, and no matter how much he tried, it didn't budge. Such a thing had never happened to him before."
    new "有什么东西卡住了钥匙，无论他怎么用力，它都纹丝不动。这样的事他从未遇到过。"

    # game/script.rpy:58271
    old "They... Did they learn about this door?"
    new "他们……难道他们发现了这扇门？"

    # game/script.rpy:58275
    old "Subsumed by the darkness, Katei fell to his knees in defeat. The last method of escape, which he'd held as a trump card for years, had betrayed him.{w} The situation only became worse for him when he turned around.{w} There was nothing there."
    new "黑暗吞没了 Katei，他绝望地跪倒在地。他多年来一直当作最后王牌的退路，到头来背叛了他。{w}可当他转过身时，情况更糟。{w}那里什么都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:58278
    old "H-Huh?{w} Where are... the Sekimeiya?"
    new "咦、咦？{w}Sekimeiya 呢……？"

    # game/script.rpy:58280
    old "The two telltale glows weren't there. When he crawled to where the suitcase should've been, he saw that it had vanished as well."
    new "那两团标志性的光芒不见了。他爬到行李箱本该在的地方，发现箱子也已消失无踪。"

    # game/script.rpy:58283
    old "On the floor, Katei was consumed by a wave of cold fear. He'd been outsmarted—there was no other explanation."
    new "趴在地上的 Katei 被一阵冰冷的恐惧吞没。他被人算计了——除此之外没有别的解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:58284
    old "Two doors blocked his view into hallway A, but he was scared to leave. Xyn must've been there."
    new "两道门挡住了他望向 A走廊的视线，可他又不敢离开。Xyn 一定就在那边。"

    # game/script.rpy:58285
    old "Katei waited. Were they going to come now that they'd defeated him?"
    new "Katei 等待着。既然对方已经击败了他，现在会过来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:58287
    old "What were they going to do? Would Katei's name be exposed? ...Those were the only thoughts he could formulate."
    new "他们会怎么做？他的名字会不会暴露？……他脑子里只剩下这些念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:58291
    old "Katei looked up. He had heard a brief sound."
    new "Katei 抬起头。他听见了一声轻响。"

    # game/script.rpy:58292
    old "Someone was in the hallway.{w} Slowly, he rose and stepped out of the secret corridor, then gripped the doorknob."
    new "走廊里有人。{w}他缓缓起身，走出秘密通道，握住了门把手。"

    # game/script.rpy:58296
    old "Hallway A was still dark, but a bit more light had begun to pass through the smoke cover. That was how he saw a human figure walking to the lobby as it carried his suitcase."
    new "A走廊依旧昏暗，但已有微光透过烟雾。借着这点光，他看见一个人影提着他的行李箱，正朝大厅走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:58297
    old "It was Naomi, one of the people he was certain had fallen unconscious. Given the conversations he'd heard, Katei knew she wasn't working with Xyn."
    new "那是 Naomi——他本以为肯定已经昏迷的几个人之一。从听来的那些对话判断，Katei 知道她没有和 Xyn 一伙。"

    # game/script.rpy:58298
    old "In an instant, he ran up behind her. He had to talk to her before everyone woke up.{w} However, as soon as she heard his movements, Naomi sprinted away to escape him."
    new "他立刻追到她身后。必须赶在所有人醒来之前和她谈一谈。{w}然而 Naomi 一听到他的动静，便猛地跑起来，想要甩开他。"

    # game/script.rpy:58309
    old "When Katei set foot in the lobby, Naomi was nowhere to be seen. The hallway B door was slightly closed, but he couldn't rush. She could easily have been hiding behind the desk or in the room below."
    new "Katei 踏进大厅时，Naomi 已不见踪影。B走廊的门半掩着，但他不能贸然冲过去。她完全可能藏在柜台后，或是楼下那间房里。"

    # game/script.rpy:58314
    old "He stepped forward slowly. His goal was to find Naomi as soon as possible—to learn how much she knew, what had happened, what she intended to do, and to retrieve the suitcase."
    new "他缓步向前。当务之急是尽快找到 Naomi——弄清她知道多少、发生了什么、她打算怎么做，还要夺回行李箱。"

    # game/script.rpy:58318
    old "But Katei didn't make it far before he turned back to the door. He heard running footsteps on the other side of the hallway."
    new "可 Katei 没走几步便转身回到门边。他听见走廊另一头传来奔跑的脚步声。"

    # game/script.rpy:58322
    old "He peered into the hallway, but the dark cloud prevented a clear line of sight. Despite that, he was able to see that someone was there, and they began to go up the stairs.{w} He ran without thinking. He had to stop Naomi no matter how much panic assaulted him."
    new "他朝走廊里张望，烟雾却挡住了视线。尽管如此，他还是看出那边有人，而且正往楼上走。{w}他想都没想就跑了过去。无论心里多么慌乱，他都必须拦下 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:58328
    old "The gray door was unlocked. That was all he needed to confirm that it was Naomi who'd gone up."
    new "灰色的门没有上锁。这就足以确认上楼的是 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:58331
    old "He stepped onto the second floor—the echoing sound of footsteps was clearly audible. They were still running, so he had to pursue them."
    new "他踏上二楼——脚步声在楼道里回响，清晰可闻。对方还在跑，他必须追上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:58334
    old "His life depended on it. He put all his strength into his legs and ran, disregarding everything else his body demanded. Rest and oxygen could wait."
    new "这关乎他的性命。他把全身的力气都集中在双腿上，拼命奔跑，身体的其他需求一概不管。休息和氧气都可以等。"

    # game/script.rpy:58338
    old "The stairs toward the fourth floor were before him. He maintained the highest speed possible, but he already knew everything was over. No matter what, the plan he'd crafted would never succeed."
    new "通往四楼的楼梯就在眼前。他维持着极限速度，却已经明白一切都完了。无论怎样，他精心筹划的计划都不可能成功了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58346
    old "Before reaching the top, he tripped on a step."
    new "还没到顶，他便在台阶上绊了一跤。"

    # game/script.rpy:58347
    old "He intercepted the fall with his wrist, but he couldn't immediately stand back up."
    new "他用手腕撑住了这一跌，却没能马上站起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:58348
    old "F-Fuck!"
    new "混、混蛋！"

    # game/script.rpy:58349
    old "When he did manage to rise, he was about to keep running. However, he realized that was a bad idea."
    new "好不容易站起来，他正要继续跑，却意识到那是个糟糕的主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:58350
    old "Wait, shit...! She's going to the attic!"
    new "等等，糟了……！她要去阁楼！"

    # game/script.rpy:58351
    old "Finally, he understood how doomed he was. He couldn't open the attic, where Naomi would lock herself with the suitcase. Continuing to go up was a futile waste of time."
    new "他终于明白自己已无力回天。阁楼他打不开，而 Naomi 会带着行李箱把自己锁在里面。再往上追，只是白白浪费时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:58357
    old "In total disarray, Katei turned around. ...How much did Naomi know? Had she identified Katei...?"
    new "Katei 心乱如麻地转过身。……Naomi 到底知道多少？她有没有认出 Katei……？"

    # game/script.rpy:58363
    old "What was he supposed to do...? Overwhelmed, he tried to think of a course of action."
    new "他该怎么办……？他只觉得喘不过气，努力思索着下一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:58364
    old "More people were on the crystal floor. He had to act as if he'd gotten trapped like everyone else, but there were many things he had to take care of."
    new "水晶层上还有其他人。他必须装作和众人一样被困在这里，可又有很多事等着他处理。"

    # game/script.rpy:58369
    old "His hands trembled as he walked back down. He balled them into fists and slowly released them.{w} The trembling stopped, but he was internally collapsing. Attempting a calming breath, he walked to the crystal floor, where he began to look around as if he'd been innocently imprisoned."
    new "下楼时他的双手一直在抖。他握紧拳头，又缓缓松开。{w}颤抖止住了，内心却在崩塌。他试着吸一口气让自己镇定，然后走向水晶层，摆出一副无辜被困的模样四处张望。"

    # game/script.rpy:58379
    old "Tachyon Rotation"
    new "快子旋转"

    # game/script.rpy:58392
    old "Naomi's eyes opened in pain. Before them was a pair of shoes."
    new "Naomi 在疼痛中睁开眼。眼前是一双鞋。"

    # game/script.rpy:58393
    old "She recognized them, but not the scenery behind them. ...Where was she?"
    new "鞋她认得，鞋后面的景象却陌生。……这里是哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:58394
    old "A sharp sound refocused all of her senses.{w} She was in the event room, and there had just been an attack in the tower.{w} After getting that far, she almost gasped. Those shoes belonged to Katei, and what she'd heard was the cabinet opening."
    new "一声锐响，把她的感官全部拉了回来。{w}她在活动室，塔里刚刚发生过一场袭击。{w}想到这里，她险些倒吸一口气。那双鞋是 Katei 的，而她听见的，是展示柜开启的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:58395
    old "While she was still processing that information, the steps began to depart.{w} She had to stop him. At once, Naomi considered the possibility that Katei had been responsible for the smoke.{w} Her head hurt, and her limbs took a few seconds to respond. However, she was able to force her body up."
    new "她还来不及理清这些，脚步声已经要远去了。{w}她必须拦住他。几乎同时，Naomi 想到烟雾也许正是 Katei 放的。{w}她的头很痛，四肢过了好几秒才听使唤，但她还是硬撑起了身体。"

    # game/script.rpy:58396
    old "Speechless, she saw two people who she'd just met on the floor. Their names were Atsuki and Shiroya.{w} But what about the third person...? Another man had been with them, and Naomi couldn't find him."
    new "她一时说不出话，只看见地上躺着刚认识不久的两个人——Atsuki 和 Shiroya。{w}可第三个人呢……？他们身边本来还有个男人，Naomi 却找不到他。"

    # game/script.rpy:58399
    old "She grabbed her glasses from the floor. Immediately, her sight blackened, as the smoke had covered the lenses. Trying not to inhale what lingered of it in the air, she slowly staggered to hallway A, wondering how long she'd been asleep and cleaning her glasses with her sleeves."
    new "她从地上抓起眼镜。镜片被烟熏黑，眼前顿时一暗。她屏住呼吸，尽量不吸入空气中残留的烟雾，一边用袖子擦着镜片，一边踉跄走向 A走廊，心里琢磨着自己究竟昏睡了多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:58404
    old "Six people had fallen unconscious. When the smoke was released, Naomi had been looking at the cabinet; out of all of them, she'd been the farthest from the source, as everyone else had been next to a grenade.{w} Atase had faked his unconsciousness, meaning that in the event room, Naomi's was the only adult body to be knocked out. Added to the lesser quantity of smoke that she inhaled, she would've been the first to awaken.{w} Because of that, when Katei stepped next to her ears, she was brought back to reality minutes before everyone else."
    new "昏过去的一共六个人。烟雾释放时，Naomi 正站在展示柜旁；所有人里她离源头最远，因为其他人身边都有一颗烟雾弹。{w}Atase 是装的，也就是说，活动室里真正被放倒的成年人只有 Naomi 一个。再加上她吸入的烟雾更少，她本该是最先醒来的。{w}正因如此，当 Katei 的脚步声在她耳边响起时，她比其他人早了几分钟回到现实。"

    # game/script.rpy:58410
    old "She couldn't believe the appearance of the hallway. Like in the event room, a dark, sticky coating was everywhere, blocking out the light. Thanks to hallway C's ceiling light, though, she was able to see the storeroom closing."
    new "走廊的样子让她难以置信。和活动室一样，到处覆着一层黏腻的黑色物质，把光都挡住了。多亏 C走廊的顶灯，她才看见储藏室的门正在合上。"

    # game/script.rpy:58411
    old "It had been Katei, hadn't it...? She'd spoken to him a few times, but she'd never gotten a specific impression of him."
    new "那是 Katei 吧……？她和他说过几次话，却对他没什么具体印象。"

    # game/script.rpy:58414
    old "Approaching the storeroom, Naomi hoped she'd been mistaken. Katei should've been in the security room, so perhaps he was acting against the attack by protecting the target.{w} Outside the door, she heard a noise."
    new "Naomi 走向储藏室，希望是自己看错了。Katei 本该待在监控室，也许他正在应对袭击、保护目标。{w}走到门外，她听见了动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:58415
    old "What was it...? It sounded like a door was being forced open, but that didn't make any sense."
    new "那是什么声音……？听着像是有人在撬门，可这怎么也说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:58416
    old "When it stopped, Naomi heard the person approaching and sharply burst to her side out of fear of being attacked."
    new "声音一停，Naomi 听见那人正朝这边走来，她怕遭到袭击，猛地闪到一旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:58420
    old "...It was Katei. However, he didn't see Naomi, and instead, he rushed back into the darkness."
    new "……是 Katei。但他没有看见 Naomi，而是转身冲回了黑暗里。"

    # game/script.rpy:58426
    old "As soon as Naomi peeked inside the vacant room, her mouth dropped.{w} What the hell was she seeing? The wall was open..."
    new "Naomi 往空无一人的屋里一探头，顿时目瞪口呆。{w}她到底看见了什么？墙竟然敞开着……"

    # game/script.rpy:58427
    old "All doubts vanished from her mind: Katei was behind the attack. A corridor extended beyond the wall—one she'd never known about. As much as she couldn't believe it, it explained a lot of things."
    new "她心里再无怀疑：袭击是 Katei 干的。墙后延伸出一条走廊——一条她从未听说过的走廊。尽管难以置信，很多事却因此说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58428
    old "Then, she took notice of a glow on the floor. ...The Sekimeiya."
    new "这时，她注意到地上有微光。……是 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:58429
    old "Concealing her footsteps, she approached the faint light. It was in a suitcase, and it appeared both gemstones were there. Slowly, she closed it and brought it out of the room."
    new "她放轻脚步，走近那点微光。它装在一只手提箱里，两颗宝石似乎都在里面。她缓缓合上箱子，把它带出了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:58436
    old "Although she couldn't see anyone, she was able to perceive Katei nearby. He was there, in the hallway.{w} Wishing not to be seen, she sprinted toward hallway C."
    new "她看不见任何人，却能感觉到 Katei 就在附近。他就在走廊里。{w}为了不被他发现，她朝 C走廊奔去。"

    # game/script.rpy:58439
    old "Before she could breathe steadily, she heard Katei getting closer. Without moving her eyes, Naomi continued to take slow steps back."
    new "她还没喘匀气，就听见 Katei 越靠越近。Naomi 目光紧盯着那边，一步步缓缓后退。"

    # game/script.rpy:58441
    old "But Katei wasn't coming for her. He simply reentered the storeroom."
    new "可 Katei 不是冲她来的。他只是又走进了储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:58443
    old "That was when Naomi finally thought about how strange everything was. What was that silence? What had happened after she'd lost consciousness?"
    new "直到这时，Naomi 才意识到一切都透着古怪。那份寂静是怎么回事？她昏过去之后，究竟发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:58444
    old "From where she was, she could see that hallway B looked the same. Something of large scale had happened, so why was nobody else there?"
    new "从她站的地方望过去，B走廊看起来也一样。出了这么大的事，怎么一个人都没有？"

    # game/script.rpy:58445
    old "She felt frozen, and clueless as to what to do. ...At least, she had retrieved the Sekimeiya."
    new "她僵在原地，完全不知该如何是好。……至少，Sekimeiya 已经到手了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58448
    old "She had to leave. The exit was on the other side of the hallways, but she could only see a dark void."
    new "她必须离开。出口在走廊的另一头，可她望过去只看见一片黑暗。"

    # game/script.rpy:58449
    old "Was someone else there? She hesitated, scared to surround herself with the darkness."
    new "那边还有别人吗？她犹豫了，不敢让自己没入黑暗。"

    # game/script.rpy:58453
    old "Holding tightly onto the suitcase, she took a step forward. A thin fog obscured her vision, but the lobby door shortly came into view."
    new "她紧紧抓住手提箱，向前迈出一步。薄雾模糊了视线，但大厅的门很快出现在眼前。"

    # game/script.rpy:58454
    old "However, alarm bells went off in her head. Someone was behind her, running at full speed."
    new "然而她脑中警铃大作。有人在她身后，正全速奔来。"

    # game/script.rpy:58455
    old "She couldn't look back. With the scarce energy she had, she went through the door."
    new "她不敢回头，用仅剩的力气穿过了那扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:58466
    old "Her eyes went wider than ever before. A metal shutter was in front of the door.{w} It didn't make any sense, but she didn't have time to think. She had to keep running."
    new "她的眼睛睁得比以往任何时候都大。门前是一道金属卷帘。{w}这根本说不通，但她没有时间思考，只能继续跑。"

    # game/script.rpy:58472
    old "Covering her face, she ran through hallway B. When she returned to where she'd been, she confirmed she wasn't being chased anymore."
    new "她捂着脸跑过B走廊。回到刚才的位置时，她确认已经没人追来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58473
    old "She couldn't leave the building. It was ridiculous, but a huge piece of metal she'd never seen was blocking the way out. If Katei was the one who'd run behind her, there was only one place where she'd be safe."
    new "她出不去了。说来荒唐，一块她从未见过的大金属板堵住了出路。如果身后追她的人就是 Katei，那她能安全待着的地方只有一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:58477
    old "She tried to open the elevator, but it wasn't on that floor.{w} She couldn't wait for it, so she took out her keys and dashed up the stairs."
    new "她试着打开电梯，可电梯不在这一层。{w}她等不起，便掏出钥匙，冲上楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:58480
    old "She unlocked the gray door, but she couldn't waste time locking it behind her; if her pursuer was Katei, he had that key as well."
    new "她打开了那扇灰门的锁，却顾不上回身锁门——如果追她的人是 Katei，那把钥匙他也有。"

    # game/script.rpy:58483
    old "She didn't slow down. Once she was on the third floor, a sound alerted her: she was being chased again."
    new "她没有放慢脚步。到了三楼，一个声响让她警觉起来：又有人在追她。"

    # game/script.rpy:58484
    old "Through the many floors of the tower, her goal was to make it to the attic. The Sekimeiya bounced inside the suitcase, and Naomi gripped the key without stopping once."
    new "她穿过塔中一层又一层，目标就是阁楼。Sekimeiya 在手提箱里颠动，Naomi 一刻不停地攥着钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:58489
    old "At last, the final floor was in sight, and nobody was behind her."
    new "终于，最后一层近在眼前，身后已经没有人了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58492
    old "With the key, she locked the door behind her."
    new "她用钥匙反锁了身后的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:58494
    old "She had made it; Katei wouldn't be able to reach that place. Panting, she went up the narrow staircase."
    new "她成功了，Katei 到不了那个地方。她喘着气，走上狭窄的楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:58498
    old "Naomi stepped to the sofa, where she dropped her keys and the suitcase. Exhausted, she took a moment to catch her breath. The bright living room looked nothing like the lowest floor.{w} When she opened the case, she saw both identical gemstones. Even though she'd brought them to safety, she'd been told the cabinet's temperature was essential for their well-being."
    new "Naomi 走到沙发前，把钥匙和手提箱放下。她筋疲力尽，缓了好一会儿才把气喘匀。明亮的客厅和最底层看起来完全不像同一个地方。{w}她打开箱子，两颗一模一样的宝石都在。尽管她已经把它们带到了安全之处，但有人告诉过她，展示柜的温度对宝石至关重要。"

    # game/script.rpy:58502
    old "Something was strange. The interior of the suitcase was very hot. Naomi felt around in it and gripped it tightly, unable to comprehend why it had heated up so much."
    new "有些不对劲。手提箱里面烫得厉害。Naomi 伸手进去摸索，紧紧握住，怎么也不明白它为什么会变得这么烫。"

    # game/script.rpy:58513
    old "Wh-What!?"
    new "什、什么！？"

    # game/script.rpy:58514
    old "Out of nowhere, both of the Sekimeiya vanished.{w} Astonished, Naomi stared at the empty suitcase. She had felt one of their white surfaces for an instant before both had disappeared."
    new "两颗 Sekimeiya 凭空消失了。{w}Naomi 惊愕地盯着空荡荡的箱子。就在它们消失的前一瞬，她还摸到过其中一颗白色宝石的表面。"

    # game/script.rpy:58516
    old "She couldn't comprehend what had occurred; it wasn't possible. They couldn't have disappeared.{w} ...However, they weren't there anymore."
    new "她无法理解发生了什么；这不可能。它们不可能凭空消失。{w}……可它们确实已经不在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58517
    old "Wha...!"
    new "怎……！"

    # game/script.rpy:58518
    old "Then, she noticed something else was gone: her keys, which she'd left next to the suitcase."
    new "接着，她发现还有别的东西不见了：她放在手提箱旁的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:58519
    old "She questioned her own memories. She had just left the keyring there, hadn't she...?{w} Or had she left it in the keyhole?{w} Speechless, she peeked down the stairs."
    new "她开始怀疑自己的记忆。自己刚才明明把钥匙串放在那儿了……？{w}还是说，插在锁孔里了？{w}她哑然无语，探头朝楼梯下张望。"

    # game/script.rpy:58523
    old "It... wasn't there. But it wasn't on the sofa either.{w} She couldn't understand. How could her keys have disappeared with the Sekimeiya? It was utterly nonsensical.{w} She'd looked through the sofa, the suitcase, and all her pockets; they really weren't anywhere."
    new "钥匙……不在那儿。可沙发上也没有。{w}她想不通。钥匙怎么会跟 Sekimeiya 一起消失？这根本说不通。{w}沙发、行李箱、所有口袋她都翻遍了，就是哪儿都找不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:58529
    old "Wondering if she'd gone insane, Naomi walked to the hallway. She knew the layout of the attic well, and she was sure she was alone."
    new "Naomi 怀疑自己是不是疯了，走到走廊上。阁楼的布局她再熟悉不过，而她确信这里只有自己一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:58530
    old "She'd intended to keep the Sekimeiya in a safe place, but somehow, she'd failed. Completely lost, she wondered what to do.{w} More people were on the crystal floor, and they could have already woken up."
    new "她本想把 Sekimeiya 藏到稳妥的地方，结果却不知怎么没能做到。她茫然无措，不知该如何是好。{w}水晶层上还有不少人，他们或许已经醒了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58533
    old "However... she couldn't leave. Without the key, she couldn't unlock the door she'd just locked, so she pressed the elevator button.{w} ...But nothing happened."
    new "可是……她走不了。钥匙不在手上，刚锁上的门就打不开，于是她按下电梯按钮。{w}……然而毫无反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:58534
    old "Naomi couldn't believe her situation, but no matter how much she thought about it, she didn't think she was wrong about what had happened: she'd seen the Sekimeiya disappear before her eyes, so the same must have happened with the keys."
    new "Naomi 不敢相信自己的处境，可无论怎么回想，她都不觉得自己记错了：她亲眼看着 Sekimeiya 在眼前消失，钥匙想必也是同样的情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:58535
    old "...What had happened in the tower? Had she been hallucinating everything since she'd fallen unconscious? She simply couldn't accept that she'd trapped herself in the attic."
    new "……塔里到底出了什么事？难道自从昏过去之后，所见的一切都是幻觉？她居然把自己困在了阁楼里——这实在让她无法接受。"

    # game/script.rpy:58536
    old "But she had. Alone on the highest floor of the tower, Naomi had no method of escape."
    new "可事实就是如此。Naomi 独自困在塔的最高一层，无路可逃。"

    # game/script.rpy:58548
    old "---"
    new "---"

    # game/script.rpy:58559
    old "And so began the day."
    new "这一天，就这样开始了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58560
    old "How did it end, however?"
    new "可是，它又是如何结束的？"

    # game/script.rpy:58578
    old "Bioluminescent"
    new "生物荧光"

    # game/script.rpy:58604
    old "{w=0.6}My body crumpled down; I couldn't keep going."
    new "我双腿一软，再也支撑不住。"

    # game/script.rpy:58611
    old "I tried to continue yelling her name, but my voice broke. She'd known what would happen and hadn't warned us. She'd kept waiting at our side, bolstering our hope, until she'd run away.{w} Why...!? She would never have done that... I couldn't let a single day change my view of her."
    new "我还想继续喊她的名字，喉咙却发不出声。她明明知道会发生什么，却什么都没提醒我们。她一直守在我们身边，为我们打气，直到最后独自逃走。{w}为什么……！？她不可能做出这种事……我不能因为这一天就改变对她的看法。"

    # game/script.rpy:58619
    old "I—{w=0.4}Isla?{w=0.5} Where...?"
    new "我——{w=0.4}Isla？{w=0.5}这是哪儿……？"

    # game/script.rpy:58620
    old "Erina's voice came from the hallway."
    new "Erina 的声音从走廊传来。"

    # game/script.rpy:58621
    old "Sh-She's not here!"
    new "她、她不在这儿！"

    # game/script.rpy:58623
    old "Where is she...!?"
    new "她人在哪儿……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:58625
    old "Sai sounded confused too, near the end of hallway A."
    new "A走廊尽头也传来 Sai 的声音，听起来同样困惑。"

    # game/script.rpy:58626
    old "She's not here? Could she mean...?"
    new "她不在这儿？难道是……"

    # game/script.rpy:58627
    old "I mustered the strength to scramble back out of the lobby."
    new "我勉强聚起力气，踉跄着退出了大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:58634
    old "Look! She isn't in the cabinet!"
    new "你看！她不在展示柜里！"

    # game/script.rpy:58639
    old "I entered the crystal room. Although I knew its walls were stained dark, I couldn't differentiate them from the rest.{w} I stepped to the cabinet where Isla rested and reached my hand inside.{w} ...She wasn't there."
    new "我走进水晶展室。我知道墙上染着大片暗色，却分不清那些痕迹和周围有什么不同。{w}我走向 Isla 躺着的展示柜，把手伸了进去。{w}……她不在。"

    # game/script.rpy:58644
    old "Y-You're right...{w} She was here just minutes ago."
    new "你、你说得对……{w}几分钟前她明明还在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:58645
    old "What the fuck? Did Shiroya take her out?"
    new "搞什么鬼？是 Shiroya 把她带出去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:58646
    old "...What? Why would she do that?"
    new "……什么？她为什么要那么做？"

    # game/script.rpy:58647
    old "I'm sure you can explain why she did everything else."
    new "别的事情你都能解释，这一件想必也不在话下吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:58649
    old "What if she was saved? That could be it, right?"
    new "说不定她被人救走了？也有这种可能吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:58651
    old "Well, something just happened. That's for sure."
    new "总之，刚刚肯定出了什么事。这一点错不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58658
    old "I followed Sai out.{w} Utterly lost, we went to check the bathrooms."
    new "我跟着 Sai 走了出去。{w}我们全无头绪，只好去查看洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:58664
    old "Man, what the fuck is this?"
    new "喂，这他妈到底是怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:58665
    old "Naomi isn't here either..."
    new "Naomi 也不在这儿……"

    # game/script.rpy:58670
    old "We ran to the crystal room where we'd found her first body.{w} It wasn't there. The curtain wasn't on the floor either."
    new "我们跑到当初发现她那具遗体的水晶展室。{w}遗体不见了。地上的遮布也不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58674
    old "...Did all the bodies disappear? In that case, Katei's must not be in the security room either, but why the hell is it locked?"
    new "……所有遗体都不见了？那样的话，Katei 的遗体应该也不在监控室里了，可那扇门到底为什么锁着？"

    # game/script.rpy:58675
    old "And it wasn't only the bodies. We had thought that if the exit didn't unlock at {time=21}, we would let the others listen to the recording. However, that could no longer happen; the recorder itself had certainly vanished alongside Isla."
    new "而且不见的不只是遗体。我们本来打算，如果到了 {time=21} 出口仍未解锁，就让其他人听那段录音。可这件事已经办不到了——录音笔一定也和 Isla 一起消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58682
    old "Atsuki, when the lights went out, did you really not see anything?"
    new "Atsuki，灯灭的时候，你真的一点都没看见？"

    # game/script.rpy:58683
    old "I... didn't see anything, no."
    new "我……确实什么都没看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:58684
    old "Then why did Erina and I see a flashing light? It lasted an instant, but I find it really strange that it didn't happen to you."
    new "那为什么我和 Erina 都看见了一道闪光？只有一瞬间，可偏偏你没看见，我实在觉得奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:58685
    old "I don't know. I have no idea...!"
    new "我不知道。我完全不知道……！"

    # game/script.rpy:58687
    old "Why was I the only one to not see that...? Could that indicate what happened?{w} Shiroya ran to hallway B and told us to not follow her. Was she going to the Sekimeiya in the cabinet?{w} Then, out of nowhere, the lights went off, and the shutter remained unmoving."
    new "为什么只有我没看见……？那会不会恰好说明了什么？{w} Shiroya 跑向 B走廊，还叫我们别跟过去。她是要去取展示柜里的 Sekimeiya 吗？{w} 紧接着灯光毫无征兆地熄灭，卷帘门也始终没有动。"

    # game/script.rpy:58688
    old "What the fuck had happened? Shiroya's face had looked the opposite of malicious, so why would she have done anything harmful? She couldn't have trapped us there for an entire month...!"
    new "到底出了什么事？Shiroya 当时的表情绝无半分恶意，又怎么会做出伤人的事？她不可能把我们困在这里整整一个月……！"

    # game/script.rpy:58691
    old "Erina was behind us, and she sounded like she was in pain. Although we couldn't see it, it appeared her finger had started bleeding out of nowhere."
    new "Erina 就在我们身后，声音听着很痛苦。虽然看不见，但她的手指似乎不知怎的开始流血了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58692
    old "Erina, before the lights went off, you went to the mechanical room, right?"
    new "Erina，灯灭之前，你去过机械室，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:58693
    old "...{w}Y-Yes."
    new "……{w}是、是的。"

    # game/script.rpy:58695
    old "...I thought maybe someone was there. We still have to find Akaro."
    new "……我想着说不定会有人在。我们还得去找 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:58697
    old "There's no way you believe her, right?"
    new "你总不会信她吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:58698
    old "...{w}The light breakers are there. Did you turn them off? What the hell happened to your finger?"
    new "……{w}照明断路器就在那儿。是你关的吗？你的手指到底怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:58699
    old "What!? How would I have done that? They're locked up, and there's still electricity. The cameras are working."
    new "什么！？我怎么可能做得到？那些都锁着，而且现在还有电。摄像头也还在运转。"

    # game/script.rpy:58700
    old "I glanced at the ceiling of the hallway, where the faint green lights of the cameras could be seen."
    new "我朝走廊天花板瞥了一眼，那里能看见摄像头微弱的绿光。"

    # game/script.rpy:58701
    old "A-And I don't know, but it really hurts! Did you just hear that? A drop of blood fell to the floor, but I can't see what kind of injury I have!"
    new "而、而且我也不知道怎么回事，可真的很疼！你们刚听见了吗？有一滴血落到地上了，我却看不见自己伤成什么样！"

    # game/script.rpy:58705
    old "You could've only turned off the breakers that control the light, right?"
    new "你能关掉的，也只有控制照明的那几个断路器吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:58706
    old "Go check them! You'll see that I didn't touch any!"
    new "你们去查啊！查过就知道，我一个都没碰！"

    # game/script.rpy:58707
    old "Did the light go off in the mechanical room?"
    new "机械室里的灯也灭了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:58709
    old "Then how are we supposed to check them!? We can't see anything!"
    new "那我们还怎么查！？什么都看不见！"

    # game/script.rpy:58710
    old "Doesn't your wristwatch give off some light?"
    new "你的手表不是会发光吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:58711
    old "Do you think this is gonna do anything!?"
    new "你觉得这点光能管用吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:58712
    old "Sai lit his watch's blue screen, but it didn't illuminate anything in front of it."
    new "Sai 点亮手表蓝色的屏幕，可那点光连眼前都照不亮。"

    # game/script.rpy:58714
    old "Is Shiroya still here? ...Is she currently listening to us?"
    new "Shiroya 还在这里吗？……她此刻是不是正听着我们说话？"

    # game/script.rpy:58715
    old "\"Don't forget what I said... I meant all of it.\"{w} If she's not here anymore, then who did this? It can't be just a coincidence that Erina left our side minutes before the shutter was going to open."
    new "「别忘了我说过的话……每一句我都是认真的。」{w} 如果她已经不在了，那这事又是谁做的？卷帘门就要打开的前几分钟，Erina 偏偏离开了我们身边，这不可能只是巧合。"

    # game/script.rpy:58718
    old "A month in the tower... That was impossible. There was no way that fate awaited us, but merely thinking about it was almost enough to make me lose my grip on reality."
    new "在塔里待上一个月……绝无可能。我们绝不会有那样的下场，可光是想到这一点，我就几乎要分不清现实了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58719
    old "I couldn't stand it anymore. I wanted to know what was happening...! I wanted to know what had been going on since the start!"
    new "我再也忍受不下去了。我想知道究竟发生了什么……！我想知道从最开始到现在，到底都在发生些什么！"

    # game/script.rpy:58720
    old "\"Now stay here, and don't follow me.\"{w} Why!? Why did I have to stay there!? Leaving the tower with Shiroya was the only thing I wanted—it was the only thing both of us wanted!"
    new "「待在这里，别跟过来。」{w} 为什么！？为什么我非得留在那儿不可！？和 Shiroya 一起离开这座塔，是我唯一的心愿——也是我们两人唯一的心愿！"

    # game/script.rpy:58721
    old "...Are the other floors going to be like this too?"
    new "……别的楼层也会是这样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:58722
    old "You're asking as if I have a clue."
    new "你问得好像我知情似的。"

    # game/script.rpy:58727
    old "We trudged along, bit by bit. In hallway C, Sai tried to open the elevator."
    new "我们一点一点往前挪。到了 C走廊，Sai 试着打开电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:58729
    old "It's not here."
    new "电梯不在这儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:58730
    old "He found the button on the wall and pressed it.{w} A while later, it still hadn't lit up."
    new "他摸到墙上的按钮，按了下去。{w} 过了好一会儿，按钮依旧没有亮起。"

    # game/script.rpy:58731
    old "Unless it's open on another floor, the elevator is disabled too.{w} I didn't want to use it, though. Let's take the stairs."
    new "除非它停在别的楼层开着门，否则电梯也不能用了。{w} 不过我本来也不想坐它。走楼梯吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:58734
    old "...Wh-What the...?{w} What happened to the lights?"
    new "……怎、怎么回事？{w} 灯怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:58735
    old "That voice..."
    new "这个声音……"

    # game/script.rpy:58737
    old "I turned around to where it had come from."
    new "我转过身，朝声音传来的方向望去。"

    # game/script.rpy:58741
    old "Whose voice was it?"
    new "那是谁的声音？"

    # game/script.rpy:58742
    old "What do you think? What are the remaining mysteries that you have solved?"
    new "你怎么看？剩下的谜题里，你已经解开了哪些？"

    # game/script.rpy:58743
    old "Perhaps you would like to prove yourself as well. You will have the chance to do that.{w} Show that the peak is also awaiting you—that the keys you were given were put to use."
    new "或许你也想证明自己。你会有这个机会的。{w} 去证明顶峰同样在等着你——证明交到你手上的那些钥匙都已派上用场。"

    # game/script.rpy:58752
    old "Exactly, Akaro's return. That was what the voice signified."
    new "正是如此，Akaro 的归来。那声音所代表的就是这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:58753
    old "From here on out, you'll be able to submit your own answers for the mysteries of this story and show what you've solved. At the end, you'll have access to the total number of correct answers, but your performance won't influence the story. Best of luck."
    new "从现在起，你可以就本故事的谜题提交自己的答案，展示你已经解开了什么。到最后，你可以得知答对的总数，但你的表现不会影响故事本身。祝你好运。"

    # game/script.rpy:58755
    old "Unfortunately, that is incorrect. Don't worry, though, as this is just the beginning."
    new "很遗憾，这个答案是错的。不过不必担心，这才刚刚开始。"

    # game/script.rpy:58763
    old "A-Akaro! Is that you?"
    new "A-Akaro！是你吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:58764
    old "Huh? Yes! ...Where am I!?"
    new "啊？是我！……我在哪儿！？"

    # game/script.rpy:58765
    old "What the fuck do you mean!? We haven't seen you in hours!"
    new "你他妈什么意思！？我们好几个小时没见到你了！"

    # game/script.rpy:58767
    old "What? What time is it? We're still in the tower, right?"
    new "什么？现在几点了？我们还在塔里吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:58768
    old "Of course we are, and it's past {time=21}! The shutter didn't open!"
    new "我们当然还在，而且现在已经过了{time=21}！卷帘门没有打开！"

    # game/script.rpy:58769
    old "W-Wait, what!? That can't be...!"
    new "等、等等，什么！？这怎么可能……！"

    # game/script.rpy:58770
    old "Cut it out! Where the fuck have you been!?"
    new "少来这套！你他妈到底去哪了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:58771
    old "What does that mean!? I just touched the Sekimeiya and appeared here!"
    new "什么意思！？我只是碰了一下 Sekimeiya，就出现在这里了！"

    # game/script.rpy:58774
    old "Where? When did you touch it?"
    new "在哪？什么时候碰的？"

    # game/script.rpy:58775
    old "U-Uh... it was..."
    new "呃、那个……是在……"

    # game/script.rpy:58776
    old "Spit it out! Was it after we escaped from the attic's bedroom? I don't even give a shit anymore!"
    new "快说！是在我们从阁楼卧室逃出来之后吗？我他妈已经不在乎了！"

    # game/script.rpy:58778
    old "You son of a bitch! He punched me in the stomach!{w} I was knocked out, and when I woke up, I couldn't even stand up straight!"
    new "你这王八蛋！他朝我肚子打了一拳！{w}我被打昏过去，醒来后连站都站不直！"

    # game/script.rpy:58779
    old "...I told him to tell me where he put the Sekimeiya since I knew he had it. I just touched it on the crystal floor, and the lights went off."
    new "……我知道 Sekimeiya 在他手上，就叫他告诉我放在哪里。我只不过在水晶层碰了一下，灯就灭了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58780
    old "Are you saying that you traveled forward in time? You're a fucking liar."
    new "你是想说，你穿越到了未来？你他妈就是在撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:58781
    old "I'm not lying!"
    new "我没撒谎！"

    # game/script.rpy:58782
    old "My mind was worn out, but what Akaro was saying didn't make sense. I had seen him earlier, before Shiroya had run up to the attic."
    new "我脑子已经累得不行了，可 Akaro 的话怎么也说不通。我之前见过他，就在 Shiroya 跑上阁楼之前。"

    # game/script.rpy:58785
    old "I don't care if you don't believe me, just tell me what the fuck happened! Why are the lights off, and where is everyone else!?"
    new "你们不信也无所谓，先告诉我到底他妈发生了什么！为什么灯灭了，其他人又都去哪了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:58786
    old "You were gone for six hours! Do you think I'm gonna believe that nonsense!? Katei died, and God knows where Shiroya is!"
    new "你消失了六个小时！你觉得我会信这种鬼话！？Katei 死了，Shiroya 也不知去向！"

    # game/script.rpy:58787
    old "Wait, what!? Katei was killed...?"
    new "等等，什么！？Katei 被杀了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:58789
    old "What about Isla?"
    new "Isla 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:58791
    old "I-Isla...? Y-You... know what happened, right...?"
    new "Isla……？你、你……知道发生了什么吧……？"

    # game/script.rpy:58792
    old "Yes, but she was here again!{w} Sai, why did you go quiet!? You saw her as well!"
    new "对，可她又在这里了！{w}Sai，你怎么不说话了！？你也看见她了！"

    # game/script.rpy:58793
    old "...{w}I don't know what happened.{w} She was alive when we left the attic. We talked to her, but she didn't remember anything about what had happened. After this son of a bitch knocked me out, I wasn't able to find her again."
    new "……{w}我不知道发生了什么。{w}我们离开阁楼时，她还活着。我们跟她说过话，可她对之前发生的事一点印象都没有。这个王八蛋把我打昏之后，我就再也没找到她。"

    # game/script.rpy:58796
    old "What...!? You never said that! That means she's alive! The recording was right—she'll be here!"
    new "什么……！？你从没说过这些！那说明她还活着！录音里说的是真的——她会来的！"

    # game/script.rpy:58797
    old "What recording?"
    new "什么录音？"

    # game/script.rpy:58798
    old "...{w}Can you please answer me? Why are the lights off!? There's no way it's {time=21.}"
    new "……{w}能不能回答我？灯到底为什么灭了！？现在不可能是{time=21.}吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:58799
    old "Sai stabbed his wristwatch with one finger."
    new "Sai 伸出一根手指点了点自己的腕表。"

    # game/script.rpy:58800
    old "It's {time=21:12}, dumbass! And we don't know what happened! The lights went off just minutes before the shutter was gonna open, and we have no idea why!"
    new "现在是{time=21:12}，蠢货！而且我们也不知道发生了什么！卷帘门本来再过几分钟就要打开，灯却灭了，我们根本不知道为什么！"

    # game/script.rpy:58801
    old "That's not all that happened. The dead bodies disappeared too. It wasn't just the light."
    new "出的事还不止这些。尸体也消失了。不只是灯灭了而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:58802
    old "That was why Akaro's story was unbelievable. Had he traveled... to the future? Was that possible?{w} Even if it was, his appearance didn't make sense. Something had happened at {time=21} that went against the normal flow of time. I didn't think that Akaro could've simply traveled forward in time to appear where we were."
    new "正因如此，Akaro 的话才令人难以置信。他穿越时间去了未来？这种事可能吗？{w}就算可能，他的出现也说不通。{time=21}时一定发生了什么违背正常时间流动的事。我不认为 Akaro 只是单纯穿越到了未来，然后出现在我们面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:58805
    old "Wait a second! What the fuck are...{w} these clothes?"
    new "等一下！这他妈是……{w}什么衣服？"

    # game/script.rpy:58807
    old "I'm not wearing the clothes I was wearing before! What the fuck!?"
    new "我穿的不是之前那身衣服！搞什么鬼！？"

    # game/script.rpy:58808
    old "Speechless, we stepped over to his voice. Once I felt the texture of his shirt, I realized it wasn't the one he'd been wearing before."
    new "我们一时无言，循着他的声音走近。摸到他衬衫的布料后，我才发现那确实不是他先前穿的那件。"

    # game/script.rpy:58809
    old "Ah, the Sekimeiya changed your clothes. Is that right?"
    new "啊，是 Sekimeiya 给你换了衣服。是这意思吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:58810
    old "Th-That's what happened! They just changed!"
    new "就、就是这样！衣服自己变了！"

    # game/script.rpy:58811
    old "You're several galaxies out of your mind if you think we'll believe anything that you're saying. What the fuck is your goal?"
    new "你要是觉得我们会信你这些鬼话，那你脑子都飞出银河系了。你他妈到底想干什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:58812
    old "Are they yours?"
    new "那是你的衣服？"

    # game/script.rpy:58813
    old "These clothes...?{w} I... think so. They're not the ones I had on, though!"
    new "这些衣服……？{w}我……应该是吧。可这不是我原来穿的那套！"

    # game/script.rpy:58815
    old "I had no idea what to believe. Had the Sekimeiya made Akaro travel to the future? Had it swapped his clothing...? I couldn't rule anything out as impossible, but it wasn't easy to trust him."
    new "我不知道该相信什么。是 Sekimeiya 让 Akaro 穿越到了未来吗？连他的衣服也一并换掉了……？我无法排除任何可能，可要信任他并不容易。"

    # game/script.rpy:58818
    old "If he was telling the truth... who was the Akaro I'd seen? His existence had gradually gotten harder to comprehend."
    new "如果他说的是真话……那我先前见到的 Akaro 又是谁？他的存在正变得越来越难以理解。"

    # game/script.rpy:58819
    old "You're really saying the shutter is still there...?{w} We're in hallway C, right?"
    new "你是说，卷帘门真的还在……？{w}这里是 C走廊，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:58820
    old "Hugging the wall, Akaro walked to the lobby."
    new "Akaro 贴着墙，朝大厅走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:58822
    old "It is... It really is still here.{w} Is it actually after {time=21}? What the fuck do we do, then!?"
    new "确实……卷帘门确实还在。{w}现在真的过了{time=21}吗？那我们他妈该怎么办！？"

    # game/script.rpy:58823
    old "What the fuck do you think we can do!? Nothing!"
    new "你觉得我们他妈还能怎么办！？什么都做不了！"

    # game/script.rpy:58824
    old "Despite being aware of another option for so long, there was another choice. We had the Sekimeiya.{w} We could travel through time. According to Akaro, he had traveled hours forward, so nothing said we couldn't escape the tower with it.{w} The reason I hadn't explored that option yet was what Shiroya had said. Due to her, I wasn't sure that trying to escape from the dark tower was what I had to do. However, Sai and Akaro weren't even discussing the Sekimeiya. Supposedly, Akaro had just appeared, and he hadn't even asked about its whereabouts."
    new "明明早就知道还有另一条路，却始终没有去选它。我们手上有 Sekimeiya。{w}我们可以穿越时间。据 Akaro 所说，他曾穿越到数小时之后，那么靠它逃出塔也并非不可能。{w}我之所以一直没有考虑这条路，是因为 Shiroya 的那番话。因为她，我不确定自己是否应该设法逃出这座黑暗的塔。可 Sai 和 Akaro 却连提都没提 Sekimeiya。按理说，Akaro 才刚刚现身，甚至没有问过它在哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:58825
    old "And... you said Shiroya is gone? What happened to her?"
    new "还有……你说 Shiroya 不见了？她出了什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:58826
    old "We don't know! If you're not behind whatever just happened, it must be her! She ran away before the lights went out and said not to follow her. She should be somewhere."
    new "我们不知道！如果刚刚发生的事不是你搞的，那就一定是她！灯灭之前她跑掉了，还叫我们别跟过去。她应该还在什么地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:58829
    old "Sai, you've reiterated that you know more about the Sekimeiya than us, and you haven't fundamentally denied what Akaro said. Does that mean that traveling to the future is possible?"
    new "Sai，你一再强调自己比我们更了解 Sekimeiya，也没有真正否定 Akaro 的说法。这是否意味着，穿越到未来是可能的？"

    # game/script.rpy:58830
    old "...I don't know. Even if it was, would you really believe the nonsense he's spewing?"
    new "……我不知道。就算真是那样，你会信他那些胡话？"

    # game/script.rpy:58831
    old "You're the one spewing nonsense! Why would the exit not unlock!? One of you killed Katei, right? Who was it!?{w} And what, the bodies disappeared? Have you searched for them? We know the Sekimeiya doesn't make them vanish, right? Is it even in the cabinet?"
    new "说胡话的是你吧！出口怎么会解不开锁！？Katei 是你们当中某个人杀的，对不对？到底是谁！？{w} 还有，尸体消失了？你们找过没有？Sekimeiya 不会让人凭空消失，这我们总该知道吧？它到底在不在展示柜里？"

    # game/script.rpy:58832
    old "...Yes.{w} And we were planning to search through the higher floors. We don't even know if the lights went off up there, but the elevator doesn't work, and the security room is locked for some reason."
    new "……是。{w} 况且我们本来就打算搜上面几层。上面灯有没有灭，我们也不清楚，可电梯用不了，监控室不知怎么还锁着。"

    # game/script.rpy:58833
    old "What...? I'm really going to lose it. I have no idea how I've gone through all of this without losing it already."
    new "什么……？我真要疯了。我都不知道自己是怎么撑到现在还没疯的。"

    # game/script.rpy:58834
    old "Shut the fuck up! If you're telling the truth, we've been here twice as long as you!{w} Let's just go up. We can hope there's still light somewhere."
    new "你他妈闭嘴！如果你说的是真的，我们在这儿待的时间是你的两倍！{w} 先上去再说。只能指望哪儿还亮着灯。"

    # game/script.rpy:58842
    old "That put the discussion on pause. I couldn't believe my legs were still obeying me, but I proceeded up the stairs.{w} Was there anything to find? ...Shiroya? Maybe Isla...? I had moved beyond taking things for granted."
    new "争论就此打住。我的腿居然还听使唤，连我自己都不敢相信，可我还是顺着楼梯往上走。{w} 能找到什么吗？……Shiroya？也许是 Isla……？我已经不敢再把任何事当作理所当然。"

    # game/script.rpy:58846
    old "Once we went through the gray door, we saw that the darkness would likely persist."
    new "穿过那扇灰门之后，我们看出黑暗多半还要延续下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:58851
    old "Did the lights really go out everywhere?"
    new "灯真的全都灭了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:58852
    old "Seems so."
    new "看来是。"

    # game/script.rpy:58853
    old "Even if there's something to find, there's no way we can find it."
    new "就算真有什么线索，这种黑灯瞎火也根本找不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:58854
    old "And if someone else is here, they're staying away from us on purpose. We should go all the way up first."
    new "而且要是这里还有别人，那人就是故意躲着我们。我们先一路走到顶再说。"

    # game/script.rpy:58855
    old "We went around the floor without entering the offices. Our steps echoed loudly in comparison to the more muffled corridors on the first floor."
    new "我们绕着这一层走了一圈，没有进办公室。比起一楼那些沉闷的走廊，这里的脚步声回荡得格外响。"

    # game/script.rpy:58860
    old "Gripping the handrail, we went up the stairs step by step.{w} On the third floor, I wondered if we would even be able to step into the attic. Perhaps Sai had a second key, but the original one should've been in the inner keyhole, and it could've already been taken."
    new "我们抓着扶手，一级一级往上走。{w} 到了三楼，我开始担心我们究竟进不进得了阁楼。也许 Sai 还有另一把钥匙，可原来那把应该插在内侧的锁孔里，说不定已经被人取走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58866
    old "We were all disheartened. Silently, we arrived on the sixth floor, though we could only know because we'd counted the stairwells."
    new "所有人都泄了气。我们默默走到了六楼，全靠数着楼梯间才知道到了哪一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:58873
    old "The door's unlocked."
    new "门没锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:58874
    old "Sai opened the door to the attic, but we didn't see anything ahead of us."
    new "Sai 推开了阁楼的门，可我们眼前什么也看不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:58875
    old "The key's still inserted here. ...It doesn't seem like there's light above, though."
    new "钥匙还插在这儿。……不过上面好像也没灯。"

    # game/script.rpy:58881
    old "We stepped up the narrow staircase. At the top, we confirmed no light was on the final floor either."
    new "我们踏上狭窄的楼梯。到了顶上一看，最上层同样没有灯。"

    # game/script.rpy:58883
    old "Fuck, man. Do we really have to stay in the dark?"
    new "操。难不成我们真得一直摸黑待着？"

    # game/script.rpy:58884
    old "As if having light would be that much better."
    new "说得好像有灯就能好多少似的。"

    # game/script.rpy:58885
    old "...Hang on."
    new "……等等。"

    # game/script.rpy:58889
    old "I stepped forward, toward the table."
    new "我朝桌子走了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:58890
    old "After fiddling with a cable, I pressed a switch."
    new "我摆弄了一阵电线，按下了开关。"

    # game/script.rpy:58899
    old "Oh, the lamp!"
    new "啊，那盏灯！"

    # game/script.rpy:58900
    old "It works, thank God. I wasn't sure if it would, but it'll do."
    new "谢天谢地，还能用。我本来也没把握，不过够用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58907
    old "I looked at everyone and almost fell back. It took me a second to notice that the man behind Erina was Akaro. Not only were his clothes different, but also his hair—he was hardly recognizable."
    new "我转头看向众人，差点向后跌倒。过了片刻我才认出，站在 Erina 身后的男人是 Akaro。不光衣服换了，连头发也不一样——几乎认不出他来。"

    # game/script.rpy:58913
    old "Oh my God! Th-The tip of my finger is cut! L-Look how much blood I'm losing!"
    new "天啊！我、我的指尖割破了！你、你看看我流了多少血！"

    # game/script.rpy:58914
    old "Erina looked inside her purse and brought out bandages. Grimacing from the sight of the blood, she covered her finger with them."
    new "Erina 翻找手提包，取出了创可贴。看到血，她皱起眉，还是把手指包上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58921
    old "The bedrooms... had a lamp as well, right?"
    new "卧室里……也有台灯吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:58927
    old "Thanks to them, we were able to light up the bedrooms, and by opening the doors, the hallway, kitchen, and bathroom were slightly illuminated as well."
    new "多亏这些灯，卧室亮了起来；门一开，走廊、厨房和浴室也透进了些光。"

    # game/script.rpy:58931
    old "Two of those places contained a minor indication that shed light on their situation, but in a third one was the biggest clue."
    new "其中两处各有一点细微的迹象，能说明他们的处境；而第三处藏着的，才是最大的线索。"

    # game/script.rpy:58940
    old "Precisely. It was in the kitchen."
    new "正是。就在厨房。"

    # game/script.rpy:58941
    old "Initially, Atsuki noticed that the footprints they'd just left in the living room were the only ones. It was very strange; fainter ones should've been there."
    new "起初，Atsuki 注意到客厅里只有他们刚踩出的脚印。这非常奇怪——本该还有更浅的脚印才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:58942
    old "Then, he saw that the inner handle of the right bedroom was unattached, like it had been minutes prior."
    new "接着，他发现右侧卧室内侧的门把手脱落了，像是几分钟前才掉下来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:58944
    old "In the living room, Atsuki noticed that the footprints they'd just left were the only ones. It was very strange; fainter ones should've been there."
    new "在客厅里，Atsuki 注意到地上只有他们刚留下的脚印。这非常奇怪——本该还有更浅的脚印才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:58945
    old "He frowned and moved on, unaware that another place held a much stronger clue."
    new "他皱了皱眉，继续往前走，却不知道另一处还藏着更确凿的线索。"

    # game/script.rpy:58946
    old "Then, he saw that the inner handle of the right bedroom was unattached, like it had been minutes prior.{w} Confused, he stepped out."
    new "接着，他发现右侧卧室内侧的门把手脱落了，像是几分钟前才掉的。{w} 他满心疑惑，退了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:58948
    old "There was nothing in the storeroom that indicated where they were."
    new "储藏室里没有任何能说明他们身处何处的线索。"

    # game/script.rpy:58949
    old "In the living room, however, Atsuki noticed that the footprints they'd just left were the only ones. It was very strange; fainter ones should've been there."
    new "然而在客厅里，Atsuki 注意到地上只有他们刚留下的脚印。这非常奇怪——本该还有更浅的脚印才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:58952
    old "There was nothing in the bathroom that indicated where they were."
    new "浴室里没有任何能说明他们身处何处的线索。"

    # game/script.rpy:58956
    old "In the right bedroom, Atsuki noticed that the inner handle was unattached, like it had been minutes prior.{w} He had seen that in the living room, the footprints they'd just left had been the only ones. It was very strange; fainter ones should've been there as well."
    new "在右侧卧室里，Atsuki 发现内侧的门把手脱落了，像是几分钟前才掉的。{w} 他先前在客厅已经看到，地上只有他们刚留下的脚印。这非常奇怪——本该还有更浅的脚印才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:58957
    old "Confused, he stepped out, unaware that another place held a much stronger clue."
    new "他满心疑惑，退了出来，却不知道另一处还藏着更确凿的线索。"

    # game/script.rpy:58963
    old "That glass..."
    new "那只杯子……"

    # game/script.rpy:58964
    old "There was a glass next to the sink.{w} I recognized it—when I'd been with Shiroya, I had tried to drink tap water. It had tasted terrible, and I'd set it aside."
    new "水槽边放着一只杯子。{w} 我认得它——和 Shiroya 在一起的时候，我曾试着喝自来水。那水难喝得要命，我就把杯子搁到了一边。"

    # game/script.rpy:58965
    old "After that time, I had seen the glass again. But there was a major distinction between that glass and the one I was looking at."
    new "那之后，我又见过那只杯子。可那只杯子和眼前这一只，有个很大的不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:58966
    old "Specifically, it had since become empty."
    new "确切地说，是那只杯子里已经空了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58967
    old "H-Hey, guys! Come to the kitchen."
    new "喂、喂，大家！到厨房来一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:58974
    old "Everyone entered."
    new "所有人都走了进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:58976
    old "Did any of you pour out the water in this glass?"
    new "你们谁把这只杯子里的水倒掉了？"

    # game/script.rpy:58988
    old "Everyone denied it with confusion."
    new "所有人都一脸困惑地否认了。"

    # game/script.rpy:58989
    old "I left it here a few hours ago, and it was filled with water. I don't think it moved either."
    new "几个小时前我把它放在这儿，里面装满了水。我想它也没被人动过。"

    # game/script.rpy:58994
    old "So it vanished on its own?"
    new "那就是它自己消失了？"

    # game/script.rpy:59000
    old "Sai frowned."
    new "Sai 皱起了眉。"

    # game/script.rpy:59001
    old "What, did it evaporate?"
    new "怎么，蒸发了？"

    # game/script.rpy:59002
    old "Water evaporates at any temperature that doesn't freeze it, right?"
    new "只要没结冰，水在任何温度下都会蒸发吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:59007
    old "Atsuki, we're indoors. The air isn't moving, and it's not hot at all. It could take a month for the water in a glass to evaporate."
    new "Atsuki，我们是在室内。空气不流动，也一点都不热。一杯水要蒸发掉，说不定得花上一个月。"

    # game/script.rpy:59008
    old "...A month?"
    new "……一个月？"

    # game/script.rpy:59011
    old "I silently stared back at Sai, wondering if he was thinking what I was."
    new "我默默回望着 Sai，心想他是不是和我想到了一处。"

    # game/script.rpy:59017
    old "...What, do you think we traveled into the future? A month into the future?"
    new "……怎么，你觉得我们穿越到未来了？一个月后的未来？"

    # game/script.rpy:59022
    old "Beside me, Erina's eyes were wide. Could that have been the truth behind the recording's prediction?"
    new "身旁的 Erina 瞪大了眼睛。录音里的预言，真相莫非就是这个？"

    # game/script.rpy:59025
    old "Sai, is traveling to the future possible?"
    new "Sai，穿越到未来有可能吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:59030
    old "...{w}It is, I'm pretty sure."
    new "……{w}有可能，我很确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:59031
    old "And you said something happened before the lights went out, right? I didn't see it, but could we have traveled forward right as Shiroya ran away?"
    new "你还说灯灭之前发生过什么，对吧？我没看见，不过会不会就在 Shiroya 跑掉的那一刻，我们穿越到了未来？"

    # game/script.rpy:59032
    old "A month into the future? The Sekimeiya couldn't have had enough energy to make that happen, right?"
    new "一个月后的未来？Sekimeiya 不可能有足够的能量做到这种事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:59033
    old "...{w}But there are no other footprints in the living room. The ones we left just a while ago should be visible.{w} And there's no way we went to the past because the handle in the right bedroom is on the floor."
    new "……{w}可客厅里没有别的脚印。我们刚才留下的那些，本来应该还看得见才对。{w}而且我们也不可能回到过去——右边卧室的门把手还掉在地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:59038
    old "You think the shutter would still be in place after a month?"
    new "你觉得过了一个月，卷帘门还会好好地在那儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:59039
    old "Well, it is..."
    new "呃，它确实还……"

    # game/script.rpy:59046
    old "Everyone was deep in thought, seriously entertaining the possibility I was presenting."
    new "所有人都陷入沉思，认真思考我提出的这个可能性。"

    # game/script.rpy:59047
    old "There are plenty of things unaccounted for.{w} Who activated this future travel, and why? Why did we go so far into the future?{w} Why are the lights off?{w} What was the flash Erina and I saw? And why did it not feel like we traveled? We didn't change places, did we?"
    new "解释不通的地方还多着呢。{w}是谁启动了这次未来穿越，目的又是什么？为什么一下子去了那么远的未来？{w}为什么灯是灭的？{w}我和 Erina 看到的那道闪光是什么？还有，为什么我们完全没有穿越的感觉？我们并没有换地方，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:59048
    old "Sai was right. If we were in the future, all of those questions had to be answered.{w} However, others would be resolved.{w} Spending a month in the tower without any source of food was no longer necessarily a problem."
    new "Sai 说得对。如果我们真的身处未来，那些问题就都必须有答案。{w}可反过来，另一些问题也会迎刃而解。{w}在没有任何食物来源的塔里待上一个月，也就不再必然是死局了。"

    # game/script.rpy:59049
    old "Akaro, do you want to change up your account a little?"
    new "Akaro，你的说法要不要稍微改一改？"

    # game/script.rpy:59054
    old "No. I don't know where we are, but it's where I appeared after touching the Sekimeiya you had hidden."
    new "不改。我不知道这里是哪儿，但我碰了你藏起来的那个 Sekimeiya 之后，就出现在了这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:59059
    old "Ah, right."
    new "啊，也对。"

    # game/script.rpy:59066
    old "Well, there's nothing else in the attic."
    new "算了，阁楼里也没别的东西了。"

    # game/script.rpy:59067
    old "No matter what's happening, we should just stay somewhere. We can't do anything else..."
    new "不管发生了什么，我们也只能先待在某个地方。别的什么都做不了……"

    # game/script.rpy:59068
    old "Yeah, let's go shack up somewhere for a few dozen more hours just in case the shutter opens some day. Who knows if Shiroya is gonna send us another month forward a minute before they unlock, though.{w} I'm starving, by the way. Think I'll pass out any time now."
    new "是啊，那就找个地方再窝上几十个小时，万一哪天卷帘门开了呢。不过话又说回来，谁知道 Shiroya 会不会在他们开锁前一分钟，又把我们送到一个月之后。{w}顺带一提，我快饿死了。感觉随时都会昏过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:59075
    old "Before anyone could reply, Sai departed to the living room.{w} He was followed by everyone but me."
    new "还没等人答话，Sai 已经往客厅去了。{w}除了我，所有人都跟了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:59082
    old "If something like that is what happened, Shiroya knew about it...{w} She didn't say anything about it—only that she meant everything she'd said."
    new "如果真是那样，Shiroya 是知道的……{w}可她一个字也没提，只说她说过的每句话都是认真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:59083
    old "How could she have even known we'd end up in this situation? If it was her who made this happen, then why? And how...!?"
    new "她怎么会知道我们会落到这种境地？如果这一切是她造成的，那又是为了什么？又是怎么做到的……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:59084
    old "Is it really possible that we're in the future? There's not even a guarantee we're one month forward. We could've gone a year into the future; no point after the water evaporated can be concretely determined."
    new "我们真的有可能身处未来吗？甚至连是不是刚好过了一个月都无法保证。说不定已经过了一年。水蒸发之后究竟过了多久，根本无法确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:59085
    old "And the security room is locked, so we can't see the date on the computer.{w} Is this what Shiroya wanted? Did she want this to happen for a reason...?{w} Everything she said in hallway C... She already knew about this."
    new "而且监控室锁着，看不到电脑上的日期。{w}这就是 Shiroya 想要的结果吗？她让这种事发生，是有什么原因……？{w}她在C走廊说的那些话……她早就知道会这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:59090
    old "I ran my fingers through my hair as I walked to the right bedroom. The inner handle was in the hallway, and the sheets were messy."
    new "我一边用手捋着头发，一边走向右边的卧室。内侧的门把手搁在走廊上，床单也乱着。"

    # game/script.rpy:59091
    old "What happened to the real Shiroya...? To the one who went to the bathroom.{w} Did she touch the Sekimeiya in the water tank? If so, where is she now? Could she eventually have become the other Shiroya...?"
    new "真正的 Shiroya 后来怎么样了……？去洗手间的那一个。{w}她碰过水箱里的 Sekimeiya 吗？如果碰过，她现在又在哪儿？她会不会最终变成了另一个 Shiroya……？"

    # game/script.rpy:59092
    old "It was the most frustrating thing in the world. But although I hated the thought of them, Shiroya's final words were kindling a bit of hope within me."
    new "世上再没有比这更令人恼火的事了。可尽管这些念头让我厌恶，Shiroya 最后说的那番话，还是在我心里燃起了一点希望。"

    # game/script.rpy:59093
    old "...How the hell would we even have traveled to the future!? Sai said it's possible, and I doubt he was lying."
    new "……可我们到底是怎么穿越到未来的！？Sai 说这有可能，我想他没在骗人。"

    # game/script.rpy:59094
    old "Is it random, like the replicated location?{w} I suppose it can't be random if someone made us travel forward in time deliberately, but what exactly caused it?"
    new "难道像复制出来的地点一样，是随机的？{w}可如果是有人刻意让我们穿越到未来，那就不该是随机。那么，究竟是什么触发了它？"

    # game/script.rpy:59100
    old "I lay on the bed. I was exhausted, and my parched throat demanded a drink, an urge I knew wouldn't relent any time soon."
    new "我躺倒在床上。浑身疲惫，干渴的喉咙直嚷着要喝水——我知道这股渴意一时半会儿不会消退。"

    # game/script.rpy:59103
    old "Why did we have to step into the tower in the first place? I didn't have the will to push that thought away anymore."
    new "我们当初为什么非得走进这座塔不可？我已经没有力气再把这样的念头赶开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:59113
    old "The door opened a few minutes later. I looked over and saw everyone coming in from the hallway. They seemed just as tired as me as they stepped in slowly. Closing the door would've trapped us, so they left it open."
    new "几分钟后，门开了。我转头望去，见众人正从走廊里鱼贯而入，脚步迟缓，看上去和我一样疲惫。门若关上，反倒会把我们锁死在里面，他们便索性让它敞着。"

    # game/script.rpy:59116
    old "Akaro sat on the bed, making a deep noise."
    new "Akaro 坐到床上，发出一声低沉的闷哼。"

    # game/script.rpy:59124
    old "Well... What do we do now?"
    new "那么……现在怎么办？"

    # game/script.rpy:59135
    old "This conversation...!"
    new "这段对话……！"

    # game/script.rpy:59137
    old "A tingling dread began at the tips of my fingers and wormed its way deeper inward. I glanced at Erina, and she looked like no more than a ghost."
    new "一阵发麻的恐惧从指尖升起，一点点往里钻。我瞥了眼 Erina，她脸色惨白，形同幽灵。"

    # game/script.rpy:59145
    old "Before we even heard the sound, Erina and I turned to the door.{w} Then, it opened further, followed by gasps."
    new "还没听见声响，我和 Erina 就已转头望向门口。{w}紧接着，门又开大了些，随之响起几声惊呼。"

    # game/script.rpy:59153
    old "From the door, Isla looked at all of us. She seemed to be searching for something.{w} However, she paid no mind to our perplexed faces and kept scanning the room."
    new "Isla 站在门口，目光逐一扫过我们。她像是在找什么。{w}可她对我们的满脸困惑视若无睹，仍旧扫视着房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:59162
    old "Out of nowhere, she staggered forward and began to cry painfully."
    new "她冷不防踉跄着向前，随即痛苦地哭了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:59166
    old "She'd pushed the door with both hands, and her left was holding a device—one that I'd seen before. She twitched as she gripped it tightly, sobbing uncontrollably."
    new "她双手推开门，左手握着一件东西——那东西我见过。她浑身一颤，把它攥得更紧，哭得不能自已。"

    # game/script.rpy:59173
    old "Isla..."
    new "Isla……"

    # game/script.rpy:59174
    old "Almost afraid she would disappear, Erina tentatively approached her."
    new "Erina 像是怕她会忽然消失，试探着走近她。"

    # game/script.rpy:59178
    old "Realizing that she was corporeal, she embraced her daughter as she fell to her knees."
    new "确认她确有实体后，她双膝一软跪下，将女儿拥入怀中。"

    # game/script.rpy:59179
    old "On the floor, both of them wept.{w} The recording... it had always been genuine. I finally understood its context, but even that understanding brought an immense number of questions along with it."
    new "两人就那样跪坐在地上痛哭。{w}那段录音……从来都是真的。我终于明白了它的来龙去脉，但明白之后，反而冒出了更多疑问。"

    # game/script.rpy:59185
    old "Isla... Where were you? What have you been doing?"
    new "Isla……你之前在哪儿？都做了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:59190
    old "Through her sobs, she managed to repeat her question."
    new "她抽泣着，又问了一遍方才那句话。"

    # game/script.rpy:59191
    old "What happened to me?"
    new "我到底怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:59192
    old "Wh-What do you mean!? You should be the one answering that!"
    new "你、你这话什么意思！？该回答的是你才对吧！"

    # game/script.rpy:59193
    old "N-No! Not to me! To Isla!{w} Why isn't she here!?"
    new "不、不是！不是问我！是问 Isla！{w}她为什么不在这里！？"

    # game/script.rpy:59198
    old "Everyone was speechless. However, I knew that wasn't the Isla the others were thinking of."
    new "众人都说不出话来。可我知道，她问的并不是大家心里想的那位 Isla。"

    # game/script.rpy:59201
    old "Do you mean to your friend?"
    new "你说的是你那位朋友？"

    # game/script.rpy:59206
    old "She gave me an intense look and nodded."
    new "她目光灼灼地看向我，点了点头。"

    # game/script.rpy:59209
    old "When she saw I couldn't answer, her face broke even further, and she buried it in Erina's chest."
    new "见我说不出话，她脸上的神情愈发崩溃，把脸埋进了 Erina 怀里。"

    # game/script.rpy:59210
    old "This is the friend we were told about. She's searching for the Isla we knew.{w} I have no idea how this came to happen, but this Isla is the person that \"my\" Isla mentioned."
    new "她就是那个被提到的朋友。她在找我们认识的那个 Isla。{w}我不知道事情怎么会变成这样，但这位 Isla，就是「我那个」Isla 说过的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:59217
    old "Their sobs continued for a long time. Although they weren't understood, nobody could interrupt them."
    new "两人的哭声持续了很久。尽管没人听得懂其中的缘由，却也没人忍心打断。"

    # game/script.rpy:59218
    old "But, as soon as they began to peter out, Sai spoke."
    new "可哭声刚渐渐平息，Sai 便开了口。"

    # game/script.rpy:59223
    old "Isla, this is very important.{w} What day is it? Do you know that?"
    new "Isla，这件事很要紧。{w}今天是几号？你知道吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:59228
    old "She looked up at him and managed to muster a date."
    new "她抬头看向他，勉强报出了一个日期。"

    # game/script.rpy:59235
    old "Correct. January 5th, 2012."
    new "没错。2012 年 1 月 5 日。"

    # game/script.rpy:59244
    old "January 5th of 2012... So we did go about three weeks into the future."
    new "2012 年 1 月 5 日……看来我们确实往未来跳了大约三周。"

    # game/script.rpy:59245
    old "Wh-What about Shiroya... Is she here?"
    new "那、那 Shiroya 呢……她在这里吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:59246
    old "Shiroya...? We don't know where she is.{w} Do you? Should she be here?"
    new "Shiroya……？我们不知道她在哪儿。{w}你知道吗？她应该在这里吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:59251
    old "After a long pause, Isla nodded faintly."
    new "沉默了许久，Isla 轻轻点了点头。"

    # game/script.rpy:59256
    old "Sweetie, how did you get here? And why do you have that in your hands?"
    new "宝贝，你是怎么到这儿来的？手里又为什么拿着那个东西？"

    # game/script.rpy:59264
    old "With her glistening eyes, Isla looked at the device she was holding. It was the one that had played the recording. Of course, that meant the conversation in the bedroom had just been recorded."
    new "Isla 泪光盈盈地看向手中的装置。正是它播放了那段录音。也就是说，卧室里的那场谈话，刚刚被录了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:59272
    old "I... saw him hiding it in the living room."
    new "我……看到他把这个藏在客厅里。"

    # game/script.rpy:59279
    old "Everyone looked at Sai, who smiled playfully."
    new "众人齐齐看向 Sai，他却促狭地笑了笑。"

    # game/script.rpy:59284
    old "So she did.{w} I actually found that in the security room a while ago. I didn't know what it was for until I found something else, a bug Atsuki hid in a coat pocket in one of the lockers."
    new "果然如此。{w}其实那东西是我先前在监控室找到的。起初我不知道它有什么用，后来又发现了另一样东西——Atsuki 藏在某个储物柜外套口袋里的窃听器。"

    # game/script.rpy:59285
    old "Wait, what? I didn't hide that! It was already there."
    new "等等，什么？那不是我藏的！本来就在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:59290
    old "How did you even open that locker?"
    new "那个储物柜你到底是怎么打开的？"

    # game/script.rpy:59291
    old "The key was in the cleaning room."
    new "钥匙在清洁间里。"

    # game/script.rpy:59292
    old "...Really? Well, unfortunately, I found the bug late into the day, but I figured the device I'd found earlier could receive its audio.{w} I thought this was a good occasion to use it, what with Akaro's story being questionable as hell. His clothes changed, and he was out of the tower for a long time. That's why I just placed the bug on him and started recording. I wanted to know if he had a way to exit the building."
    new "……真的？唉，不巧的是，我发现窃听器时这天已经过去大半了。不过我想，之前找到的那台设备应该能接收它的音频。{w}Akaro 的说辞疑点太多，我觉得正好可以借此一用。他的衣服换了，又离开塔很长时间。所以我就把窃听器放到他身上，开始录音。我想知道他有没有离开这栋楼的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:59297
    old "Wh-What!? Where is it!?"
    new "什、什么！？在哪儿！？"

    # game/script.rpy:59302
    old "Calm down. Did you really not realize it? It's behind your neck.{w} To be honest, I was also curious about something else. I've still got no explanation for a lot of things that occurred, and I've thought for a while that one of us might travel far to the past to carry out their plan. If that person happened to be Akaro, I hoped that when I pressed the play button, two recordings would show up at once. That would've immediately exposed him, but it didn't happen. I suppose that doesn't matter anymore since he's aware of the bug."
    new "冷静点。你真没察觉到？就在你脖子后面。{w}说实话，我还有另一件事想弄清楚。发生的许多事我至今都解释不了，而且我早就想过，我们之中或许有人会穿越到很久以前去执行自己的计划。如果那个人恰好是 Akaro，我希望按下播放键时能同时出现两段录音，那样就能当场揭穿他——可惜没有。不过既然他已经知道窃听器的事，这些也无所谓了。"

    # game/script.rpy:59309
    old "After frantically feeling his neck, Akaro was able to remove it."
    new "Akaro 慌忙摸向自己的脖子，总算把它取了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:59319
    old "I see. So this is how the conversation was recorded. But... why did Isla have it on the morning of the 15th? Is it going to travel to the past?"
    new "原来如此。这段对话就是这么录下来的。可是……为什么 15 日早上录音笔会在 Isla 手里？它是要穿越到过去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:59324
    old "While Erina's trembling hand stroked Isla's hair, she noticed something other than the recorder."
    new "Erina 一边用颤抖的手抚着 Isla 的头发，一边注意到了录音笔之外的另一件东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:59325
    old "What are you hiding, sweetie?"
    new "你在藏什么呢，乖孩子？"

    # game/script.rpy:59331
    old "Erina's voice sounded concerned, and I knew why. Isla's right hand was a fist; she was holding something.{w} But she shook her head in fear."
    new "Erina 的声音里透着担忧，我知道缘由。Isla 的右手握成拳，手里攥着什么。{w}可她却害怕地摇了摇头。"

    # game/script.rpy:59336
    old "Come on, open it. What do you have there?"
    new "来，张开手。你手里是什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:59337
    old "Erina had told us about it: during the two weeks before the event, Isla had sometimes hidden something in her fist. It appeared that had been Isla's friend, who still refused to open her hand."
    new "Erina 曾跟我们提过：事件前的两周里，Isla 有时会把什么东西攥在拳头里。看来她攥着的正是她的那位朋友，可她仍旧不肯张开手。"

    # game/script.rpy:59342
    old "However, Isla's remaining strength was negligible. Erina gently forced her hand open until we saw her palm."
    new "然而 Isla 已没剩下多少力气。Erina 轻轻掰开她的手，露出了掌心。"

    # game/script.rpy:59371
    old "Wet from her tears, her fingertip had a {tip=burn3}burn{/tip}."
    new "她的指尖沾着泪水，上面有一处{tip=burn3}灼伤{/tip}。"

    # game/script.rpy:59372
    old "Wh-What is this...?"
    new "这、这是怎么回事……？"

    # game/script.rpy:59377
    old "I don't know... but it doesn't hurt..."
    new "我不知道……可是不疼……"

    # game/script.rpy:59378
    old "Did you get burned? When?"
    new "你是被烫到了吗？什么时候？"

    # game/script.rpy:59383
    old "Isla didn't reply. It didn't seem like she was sure."
    new "Isla 没有回答。她自己似乎也说不准。"

    # game/script.rpy:59384
    old "Isla, I believe that it's January 5th, but please tell us why you're here. What happened to you?"
    new "Isla，我相信今天是 1 月 5 日，但请你告诉我们，你为什么在这里。你身上发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:59385
    old "It was clear nobody wanted to question why she was alive; no matter the answer, it had to be the Sekimeiya's doing."
    new "显然，没有人想追问她为什么还活着；无论答案是什么，那都只能是 Sekimeiya 的手笔。"

    # game/script.rpy:59386
    old "I...{w} I followed her steps."
    new "我……{w}我是跟着她的脚步来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:59387
    old "Her steps...?"
    new "她的脚步……？"

    # game/script.rpy:59388
    old "Th-There was a hidden door outside. That's how I entered th-the storeroom."
    new "外、外面有一扇暗门。我就是从那儿进了储、储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:59393
    old "Wait, what!?{w} Is that door open!?"
    new "等等，什么！？{w}那扇门开着吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:59394
    old "N-No. It clo—"
    new "没、没有。它关——"

    # game/script.rpy:59399
    old "Before she could finish, Sai and Akaro ran out of the room. Then, even Erina hurried to pick Isla up and leave. They were all going straight to the door to see if they could open it."
    new "她话还没说完，Sai 和 Akaro 就冲出了房间。紧接着，连 Erina 也匆匆抱起 Isla 离开。他们全都径直赶往那扇门，看能不能打开它。"

    # game/script.rpy:59405
    old "Once again, I was the only one left behind, trying to get to a final thought."
    new "又一次，只剩我一个人留在原地，努力想得出一个最终结论。"

    # game/script.rpy:59408
    old "Isla followed \"her steps\"... and she thought Shiroya had to be here. Does that mean Shiroya recently entered from the storeroom?"
    new "Isla 跟着「她的脚步」……而且认定 Shiroya 一定在这里。这么说，Shiroya 最近是从储藏室进来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:59410
    old "Wait a second...{w} I might understand our misconception.{w} Somehow, we traveled days into the future, and the shutter was still here. That's what led us to think it never opened."
    new "等等……{w}我大概明白我们错在哪里了。{w}不知怎么，我们穿越到了几天之后，而闸门还留在原处。我们因此以为它从没打开过。"

    # game/script.rpy:59411
    old "That's not it, though...! It actually opened minutes after we vanished from the 15th.{w} Long after that, it was closed again. That's why the security room is locked and the elevator isn't working. Those are the alarm's effects—we were trapped for a second time. That's why the corpses are gone!"
    new "可事实并非如此……！其实就在我们从 15 日消失几分钟后，它打开过。{w}很久之后，它才再次关闭。所以监控室才锁着，电梯也不动了。这都是警报造成的——我们第二次被困在了里面。尸体不见了也是因为这个！"

    # game/script.rpy:59412
    old "This means the exit should still unlock within twelve hours... But will it be that easy...? Will we be allowed to leave this time?"
    new "也就是说，出口应该还是会在十二小时内解锁……可会这么顺利吗……？这一次，我们会被允许离开吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:59416
    old "Why are the lights off, though? Why was nobody in the security room? Why was the attic unlocked? And why was the alarm activated again?"
    new "可是为什么灯是灭的？为什么监控室里没有人？为什么阁楼没锁？还有，为什么警报又启动了？"

    # game/script.rpy:59417
    old "Why did we travel days into the future? Why didn't it feel like we traveled? Why did Shiroya enter the tower on January 5th?"
    new "我们为什么会穿越到几天之后？为什么一点穿越的感觉都没有？Shiroya 为什么会在 1 月 5 日进入塔里？"

    # game/script.rpy:59418
    old "We arrived on this day when, from our point of view, the lights went off. The alarm was activated before then, so it felt as if the shutter never withdrew..."
    new "我们觉得自己是在灯光熄灭的那一刻来到这一天的。警报在此之前就已启动，所以感觉就像闸门从未升起过……"

    # game/script.rpy:59419
    old "When? What's the deadline this time?"
    new "什么时候？这次截止到什么时候？"

    # game/script.rpy:59420
    old "And was it Shiroya? Whoever it was, they were here recently."
    new "还有，那人是 Shiroya 吗？不管是谁，那个人最近确实来过这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:59421
    old "...{w}Hm. Someone had to be here."
    new "……{w}唔。一定有人来过这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:59422
    old "Oh.{w} I know when it happened! I can't believe I didn't realize it, but it happened immediately before our arrival on this day!"
    new "啊。{w}我知道那是什么时候了！真不敢相信我居然没意识到——那件事就发生在我们抵达这一天的前一刻！"

    # game/script.rpy:59429
    old "Someone had been there right as the group had appeared on January 5th.{w} Atsuki knew that thanks to the last time he'd been in..."
    new "就在一行人 1 月 5 日出现的那一刻，那里已经有人了。{w}Atsuki 之所以知道，是因为他上一次待在里面的时候……"

    # game/script.rpy:59436
    old "Not the lobby."
    new "不是大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:59438
    old "Not the hallways."
    new "也不是走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:59440
    old "You realized it, didn't you?"
    new "你已经察觉了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:59442
    old "Not the attic."
    new "也不是阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:59447
    old "I was so overwhelmed that I didn't notice it. When I went to the event room..."
    new "我那时太慌乱了，根本没注意到。我去活动室的时候……"

    # game/script.rpy:59452
    old "\"The room was cold. Had Shiroya run to get the Sekimeiya? I carefully walked to the cabinet, moved aside the curtain, and tried to open the glass.\""
    new "「房间里很冷。Shiroya 是跑去拿 Sekimeiya 了吗？我小心地走到展示柜前，拨开遮布，试着打开玻璃。」"

    # game/script.rpy:59453
    old "\"It should've been locked, but it wasn't. The glass was partially open, and I could put my hand inside.\""
    new "「它本该是锁着的，却没有。玻璃半开着，我可以把手伸进去。」"

    # game/script.rpy:59454
    old "\"I felt the Sekimeiya's surface and confirmed it was still there.\""
    new "「我摸了摸 Sekimeiya 的表面，确认它还在里面。」"

    # game/script.rpy:59459
    old "I only realized the Sekimeiya was in the cabinet when I felt it! That means it wasn't glowing!"
    new "我是摸到之后，才发现 Sekimeiya 就在展示柜里！也就是说，它当时没有发光！"

    # game/script.rpy:59460
    old "Although it was kept cold, the Sekimeiya was powered off. It had been used moments prior!{w} How can it be that it was powered off within the cabinet? When the cold hit it, it always regained its glow immediately.{w} The glass was partly open, cooling down the whole room. Was it due to that single detail?{w} Or was it something else? If I'm not mistaken, the longer the travel, the longer the Sekimeiya spends powered off..."
    new "虽然一直被冷藏，Sekimeiya 却处于断电状态。它不久前刚被用过！{w}怎么会在展示柜里就断了电？每次一遇冷，它总会立刻重新亮起。{w}玻璃半开着，整个房间都冷了下来。是因为这个吗？{w}还是另有原因？如果我没记错，穿越的时间跨度越长，Sekimeiya 断电的时间就越久……"

    # game/script.rpy:59462
    old "I'd been under the impression that using the Sekimeiya would be futile; I hadn't known that the shutter wouldn't be there in the past, so I'd figured traveling through time would only make a bigger mess of things."
    new "我一直以为使用 Sekimeiya 也无济于事；我不知道过去并没有那道卷帘门，所以认定时间穿越只会把事情搅得更乱。"

    # game/script.rpy:59463
    old "I didn't know what I had to do in order to travel forward in time, but if I simply traveled enough time back to appear before our arrival, I could meet the person who had secretly trapped us in January."
    new "我不知道该怎么穿越到未来，但只要往回穿越得足够远，回到我们抵达之前，就能见到那个在一月暗中把我们困住的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:59471
    old "I walked out of the bedroom.{w} Everyone else had already gone down."
    new "我走出卧室。{w}其他人都已经下楼了。"

    # game/script.rpy:59475
    old "I left through the staircase and went around the sixth floor by hugging the right wall."
    new "我从楼梯间出去，贴着右侧墙壁在六楼绕行。"

    # game/script.rpy:59480
    old "Attentively walking through the darkness, I reached the crystal floor.{w} I heard knocks and voices coming from the storeroom; it appeared Isla hadn't thought to keep the door open. Perhaps she hadn't been aware of the missing handle.{w} Without making a sound, I slowly tiptoed to the event room."
    new "我小心地穿过黑暗，来到水晶层。{w}储藏室那边传来敲击声和人声；看来 Isla 没想到要让门开着。也许她并不知道门把手不见了。{w}我悄无声息，慢慢踮脚走向活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:59485
    old "The air was still cold, and when I raised the curtain, the Sekimeiya's glow appeared before me."
    new "空气依旧寒冷。我掀开遮布，Sekimeiya 的光芒便出现在眼前。"

    # game/script.rpy:59492
    old "It's still here... I'm a little surprised."
    new "它还在……我有点意外。"

    # game/script.rpy:59493
    old "The glass wasn't closed, so I could reach it easily. Without directly touching it, I took the Sekimeiya out."
    new "玻璃没有合上，我很容易就够到了。我没有直接碰到它，就这样把 Sekimeiya 取了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:59497
    old "I just want to go a little while back. It should be simple.{w} This room is pretty cold, so it might not be a good idea to stay here if I want the Sekimeiya to gather energy."
    new "我只想回到不久之前。这应该很简单。{w}这房间太冷了，想让 Sekimeiya 积蓄能量的话，待在这里恐怕不合适。"

    # game/script.rpy:59502
    old "I walked to the hallway and entered room B5, which wasn't in range of the lower temperature. Then, I left the gemstone on the floor."
    new "我走到走廊，进了 B5房间——那里不在低温波及的范围内。随后我把宝石放在了地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:59503
    old "With how dark it is, even if the others search for me, I'll be hard to find."
    new "光线这么暗，就算其他人来找我，也很难发现我。"

    # game/script.rpy:59504
    old "The lights went off when Sai's watch read {time=21:03.} I need to arrive before that point, and now his watch must say almost {time=21:20.}{w} I need to leave the Sekimeiya here..."
    new "Sai 的手表显示 {time=21:03.} 时，灯灭了。我必须在那之前抵达，而现在他的表应该快到 {time=21:20.} 了。{w}我得把 Sekimeiya 留在这里……"

    # game/script.rpy:59511
    old "If I wait for 10 minutes, I doubt I'll be able to go back 30 minutes at {time=21:30.}"
    new "如果等上 10 分钟，到 {time=21:30.} 时，我恐怕没法回到 30 分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:59513
    old "If I wait for 15 minutes, I doubt I'll be able to go back 35 minutes at {time=21:35.}"
    new "如果等上 15 分钟，到 {time=21:35.} 时，我恐怕没法回到 35 分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:59515
    old "If I wait for 20 minutes, I doubt I'll be able to go back 40 minutes at {time=21:40.}"
    new "如果等上 20 分钟，到 {time=21:40.} 时，我恐怕没法回到 40 分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:59517
    old "35 minutes is probably too much."
    new "35 分钟大概太多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:59518
    old "I'd say for about 25 minutes, so that at {time=21:45} I can travel 45 minutes back. I think that's it, based on all the travels, and especially everything that I just learned.{w} I don't have a way to measure the time by myself, though."
    new "我看等 25 分钟左右正好，这样到 {time=21:45} 时，我就能回到 45 分钟前。根据之前所有的穿越，尤其是刚刚弄明白的这些，我想就是这样。{w}只是我没法自己计时。"

    # game/script.rpy:59522
    old "Hm...{w} I can't measure the real time, but I might have a way to measure minutes."
    new "嗯……{w}我没法知道确切时间，但或许有办法计量分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:59523
    old "The security room is locked, so I don't think there's anything on the crystal floor that isn't Sai's watch. There are a bunch of computers on the office floors, but I need access information to look at the time.{w} I can only think of the kitchen in the attic.{w} The refrigerator was working, so the oven should be too. There's still electricity, so I should be able to count the minutes that pass with that."
    new "监控室锁着，水晶层上除了 Sai 的手表，我想不出还有什么能看时间。办公楼层倒是有一堆电脑，可要查看时间就得有登录信息。{w}我能想到的就只有阁楼的厨房了。{w}冰箱还在运转，烤箱应该也没问题。电还没断，用它来数分钟应该可行。"

    # game/script.rpy:59530
    old "Faint voices were still coming from the storeroom. Like before, I ascended the stairs without making noise."
    new "储藏室那边仍隐约传来说话声。和先前一样，我悄无声息地上了楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:59535
    old "I arrived at the kitchen and kneeled in front of the oven. When I pressed the \"on\" button, a round light lit up red."
    new "我来到厨房，在烤箱前跪下。按下「on」键后，一个圆形指示灯随即亮起红光。"

    # game/script.rpy:59536
    old "I set the lowest possible temperature and rotated the timer toward 22 minutes. Immediately, a quiet buzz indicated that it had begun to count down."
    new "我把温度调到最低，又将定时器拧到 22 分钟。紧接着一阵轻微的嗡鸣响起，表示它已经开始倒计时。"

    # game/script.rpy:59540
    old "I closed the door and walked back to the bedroom, where I lay on the same bed."
    new "我关上门，回到卧室，躺回同一张床上。"

    # game/script.rpy:59544
    old "Unless the Sekimeiya's found, this should work. I'll come across whoever set this up, and most importantly, I'll appear before the alarm does anything."
    new "只要 Sekimeiya 没被人发现，这计划应该能成。我会碰上设下这一切的人，而最重要的是，我会赶在警报响起之前现身。"

    # game/script.rpy:59545
    old "Was I going against Shiroya's wishes? I couldn't care anymore. If it was her, I needed to know why she'd done everything."
    new "我这是在违背 Shiroya 的意愿吗？可我已经不在乎了。如果那个人真是她，我必须知道她为什么要做这一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:59550
    old "I didn't let myself fall asleep. A number of minutes had passed, and nobody had come back up."
    new "我没让自己睡着。好几分钟过去了，始终没人上楼来。"

    # game/script.rpy:59554
    old "I reentered the kitchen. Less than two minutes remained on the timer."
    new "我再次走进厨房。定时器上只剩下不到两分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:59555
    old "In front of the oven, I watched the indicator rotate until it finished with a beep."
    new "我守在烤箱前，看着指示盘转动，直到它「嘀」的一声停下。"

    # game/script.rpy:59556
    old "I can go now."
    new "现在可以走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:59560
    old "I pressed the \"off\" button and went down the stairs."
    new "我按下「off」键，走下楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:59565
    old "Two floors down, I stopped abruptly. The others were making their way up.{w} I took a step aside and hushed my breathing. Unaware that I was there, they passed me by."
    new "下了两层，我猛地停住脚步。其他人正往上走。{w}我侧身让到一旁，屏住呼吸。他们没察觉到我，就从我身旁经过。"

    # game/script.rpy:59566
    old "Once the sounds of their movement had faded, I kept going down."
    new "等他们的动静渐渐远去，我才继续下楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:59576
    old "The Sekimeiya was still behind room B5's door.{w} I felt it through my sleeve and instantly determined that it had built up considerable energy. I had to quickly withdraw my hand to avoid harm."
    new "Sekimeiya 还在 B5 展室的门后。{w}隔着袖子，我立刻感觉到它已经积蓄了相当多的能量。为了不被伤到，我赶紧把手缩了回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:59577
    old "This should be enough, but I wonder if it'll work as I want it to."
    new "这些应该够了，只是不知道能不能如我所愿。"

    # game/script.rpy:59578
    old "I was certain 25 minutes had passed since I'd taken it out of the cabinet. Without hesitation, I rapidly forced my hand through the wall of heat until I contacted the smooth stone."
    new "我确信，把它从展示柜里取出来之后，已经过去了 25 分钟。我不再犹豫，迅速把手探进那团灼热里，直到碰到它光滑的表面。"

    # game/script.rpy:59588
    old "...{w}Did I... change places?"
    new "……{w}我……换了个地方？"

    # game/script.rpy:59589
    old "I spun; the darkness around me was identical."
    new "我转过身，四周的黑暗毫无二致。"

    # game/script.rpy:59590
    old "Wait! The shutter isn't here!"
    new "等等！卷帘门不在了！"

    # game/script.rpy:59595
    old "I stared in awe. I could see a streetlight within the night, illuminating the snow around it. I was in the lobby of the tower; a light from the reception desk confirmed that."
    new "我愕然地望着。夜色中能看见一盏路灯，照亮了周围的雪。我身处塔的大厅——接待台透出的灯光证实了这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:59596
    old "It did work...! The alarm hasn't gone off yet!"
    new "成功了……！警报还没响！"

    # game/script.rpy:59601
    old "However, when I tried to open the door, it was still locked. I had also been assaulted by a wave of tiredness and wished to lie down.{w} Suddenly, a sharp sound echoed in my ears. ...Had it come from hallway B?"
    new "然而，我试着开门时，门依旧锁着。同时一阵强烈的倦意袭来，让我只想躺下。{w}忽然，一声尖锐的声响在耳边回荡。……是从 B 走廊传来的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:59604
    old "Someone's there."
    new "有人在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:59608
    old "Was it Shiroya? Slowly, I moved closer."
    new "是 Shiroya 吗？我慢慢靠近。"

    # game/script.rpy:59613
    old "...{w}I stopped still. No sound could be heard anymore.{w} I didn't know what to do, and I was more than a little afraid. If that was the person who'd killed everyone, I was finally in real danger—the recording had guaranteed my safety for a long time, but it had become a past event, and the promise of my well-being had expired."
    new "……{w}我僵在原地。四周再听不到任何声响。{w}我不知所措，心里不止一点害怕。如果那就是杀死了所有人的凶手，我终于真正身处险境了——那段录音曾在很长一段时间里保证我的安全，可它已经成了过去的事，那份保我平安的承诺也早已失效。"

    # game/script.rpy:59616
    old "Huh?{w} What...?"
    new "咦？{w}什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:59617
    old "Though I couldn't see it, I looked at my hand. It hadn't hurt for a while, but it was where I'd suffered a painful injury in the elevator."
    new "虽然什么也看不见，我还是看向自己的手。它已经有一阵子不疼了，可那正是我在电梯里受过重伤的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:59624
    old "Amazed, I opened and closed it in succession. I could feel the injury was gone."
    new "我惊讶地把手张开又握起。能感觉到伤已经不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:59625
    old "Why...? I traveled to the past with it before, and it didn't disappear!"
    new "为什么……？我以前也用它穿越到过去，伤却没有消失啊！"

    # game/script.rpy:59626
    old "It must've had to do with the replicated location, but my attention was again taken by resuming footsteps."
    new "这大概跟那个被复制出来的地点有关，但重新响起的脚步声又把我的注意力引了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:59628
    old "Are they Shiroya's...?"
    new "那是 Shiroya 她们的……？"

    # game/script.rpy:59629
    old "I couldn't deny it, but I wasn't sure either."
    new "我无法否认，可也不敢确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:59630
    old "I think they just entered the event room. ...Are they planning to travel through time? The alarm will probably be activated from there."
    new "她们好像刚进了活动室。……难道打算时间穿越？警报多半会从那里被触发。"

    # game/script.rpy:59632
    old "I'm not sure what the best course of action is. Should I change the past to prevent the alarm from going off? That could be dangerous."
    new "该怎么做才最好，我也拿不准。要不要改变过去，阻止警报响起？那样做可能很危险。"

    # game/script.rpy:59637
    old "I could hear faint sounds, but I couldn't make them out. Trying to quickly come to a conclusion, I waited helplessly from a distance."
    new "隐约能听见些声响，却辨不出内容。我想尽快得出结论，却只能在远处无计可施地等待。"

    # game/script.rpy:59638
    old "Oh, wait...!"
    new "啊，等等……！"

    # game/script.rpy:59639
    old "If this is Shiroya, she came in from the storeroom! Isla seemed like she entered the tower by following her steps.{w} If Isla was able to enter from the outside, the door was open. I might be able to leave right now...!"
    new "如果这是 Shiroya，那她就是从储藏室进来的！Isla 似乎就是顺着她的踪迹进了塔。{w} 既然 Isla 能从外面进来，说明那扇门开着。我现在说不定就能出去……！"

    # game/script.rpy:59640
    old "I tried not to panic. Freedom was potentially in reach, but I couldn't let myself be noticed."
    new "我努力不让自己慌起来。自由也许近在眼前，但我绝不能被人察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:59643
    old "Fuck! That's the alarm!"
    new "该死！是警报！"

    # game/script.rpy:59648
    old "A loud sound came from behind me. When I turned around, I saw the streetlight beyond the glass disappearing. The shutter was beginning to cover it, and before I knew it, it was no longer visible."
    new "身后传来一声巨响。我回过头，只见玻璃外的路灯正在消失。卷帘门缓缓将它遮住，转眼便再也看不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:59651
    old "No, it doesn't matter! It's not gonna lock the other exit!"
    new "不，不要紧！另一个出口不会被锁上的！"

    # game/script.rpy:59655
    old "I stepped back, placing my feet on the floor as slowly as I could. Then, feeling the wall, I walked to the next door."
    new "我向后退去，尽可能缓慢地把脚放到地上。随后摸着墙壁，走向下一扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:59661
    old "Hallway A extended beyond me. Was the other person still there? I couldn't hear anything."
    new "A走廊在我前方延伸。那个人还在吗？我什么都听不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:59665
    old "I didn't want to run in case the door was closed. I stepped to the left wall and walked as I counted the rooms."
    new "我怕门是关着的，所以不敢跑。我靠到左墙边，一边数着房间一边往前走。"

    # game/script.rpy:59669
    old "One,{w=0.6} two,{w=0.6} three,{w=0.6} four,{w=0.6} five."
    new "一，{w=0.6}二，{w=0.6}三，{w=0.6}四，{w=0.6}五。"

    # game/script.rpy:59670
    old "This one has to be the storeroom's! It's not even closed!"
    new "这扇肯定就是储藏室的门！居然都没关上！"

    # game/script.rpy:59672
    old "When I looked through it, I saw a light. It was very faint, but it illuminated the narrow walls slightly."
    new "透过门缝望去，里面有光。那光十分微弱，却稍稍照亮了狭窄的四壁。"

    # game/script.rpy:59676
    old "Are those... the stars...?"
    new "那是……星星……？"

    # game/script.rpy:59681
    old "Sheer Intent"
    new "纯粹意志"

    # game/script.rpy:59694
    old "H—"
    new "啊——"

    # game/script.rpy:59695
    old "From behind, I heard a voice that made me jump."
    new "身后传来一个声音，吓了我一跳。"

    # game/script.rpy:59701
    old "You...!"
    new "你……！"

    # game/script.rpy:59702
    old "It was her, wearing clothes I hadn't seen in a long time."
    new "是她，身上穿着我许久未见的衣服。"

    # game/script.rpy:59709
    old "Both of us just appeared here? The Sekimeiya was activated, and the range reached to the storeroom..."
    new "我们两个都是突然出现在这里的？Sekimeiya 被激活，范围一直延伸到了储藏室……"

    # game/script.rpy:59710
    old "Hold on, isn't that...?"
    new "等等，那不就是……？"

    # game/script.rpy:59713
    old "Behind her was the hallway B door, and on its edges was the dark outline caused by the smoke. However, it didn't look dry yet."
    new "她身后是通往 B走廊的门，门边留着一圈被烟熏出的黑色痕迹。可那痕迹看上去还没干透。"

    # game/script.rpy:59717
    old "She looked back and realized the same. And most of the ceiling lights were off, like they had been in the morning..."
    new "她回头一看，也察觉到了同样的事。而且天花板上的灯大半都熄着，和早上那时一样……"

    # game/script.rpy:59733
    old "Could we have been back at the beginning? Before asking anything else, I got closer to the hallway.{w} A sound from the other side caused me to stop; a door had closed."
    new "难道我们回到了起点？我还没来得及多问，便朝走廊走近。{w} 对面传来一声响，我立刻停住——有扇门关上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:59735
    old "It seemed like nobody was coming, so I slowly continued until I gripped the knob. Then, when I looked through the door, a dark plume clouded my vision."
    new "似乎没人过来，我便慢慢向前，直到握住门把手。透过门缝望去，一团黑雾模糊了视线。"

    # game/script.rpy:59742
    old "Erina, Isla, and Sai were on the floor. It was the start of the incident."
    new "Erina、Isla 和 Sai 倒在地上。事件就是从这一刻开始的。"

    # game/script.rpy:59743
    old "I couldn't believe it. I'd been so close to escaping, but it hadn't been permitted. I had no idea what was ahead of me anymore, but the tower held me in its grip like a python.{w} I lowered my head and saw my own hand. Exposed to the light, I could see the injury was still gone.{w} Then, I noticed something else—I wasn't hungry or tired anymore. Those sensations had also disappeared."
    new "我简直无法相信。明明只差一步就能逃出去，却终究没能如愿。前方还会发生什么，我全然不知，而这座塔像蟒蛇一样死死缠住我。{w} 我低下头，看见自己的手。借着光，我看出那道伤依然不见踪影。{w} 接着我又发现了一件事——我不再饥饿，也不再疲惫。那些感觉同样消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:59749
    old "I turned around warily. Shiroya was there, but I still felt that something about her was different. She didn't feel like the person I'd entered the tower with."
    new "我警惕地转过身。Shiroya 就在那里，可我总觉得她有些不对劲。她不像那个和我一起进塔的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:59775
    old "She gave me a disoriented stare, as if she had no idea why I was so skeptical."
    new "她茫然地看着我，似乎不明白我为什么这样怀疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:59785
    old "It had to be that one, then.{w} That's where Naomi died and where I traveled for the first time. If the smoke was just released, someone might have just been there because it's where the temperature regulation cabinets are."
    new "那就只能是那扇门了。{w}Naomi 就是在那儿死的，也是我第一次穿越时间的地方。如果烟雾是刚刚放出来的，那说不定有人刚去过那里——毕竟控温展示柜就放在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:59786
    old "Were we really at the beginning, just like that? It didn't make any sense; if we had always been present, we would've been found on many occasions.{w} Were we going to change the past? I really wanted Shiroya to be telling the truth. If she was, we would get through everything, but I knew she had withheld the truth from me before."
    new "我们真的就这么回到了最初？这说不通——如果我们一直都在，早就该被人撞见很多次了。{w}我们是要改变过去吗？我真心希望 Shiroya 说的是实话。如果她说的是真的，我们就能挺过一切；可我知道，她以前也瞒过我。"

    # game/script.rpy:59793
    old "I couldn't hesitate. The real culprit, the person who had removed the storeroom's handle, could have been present. Low to the ground, I scurried to the crystal room.{w} I turned to Shiroya, who was following me. At that point, I noticed something intriguing, but I couldn't stop there."
    new "我不能犹豫。真正的犯人——那个卸下储藏室门把手的人——可能就在那里。我压低身子，快步溜向水晶展室。{w}我回头看向跟在身后的 Shiroya。那一刻，我注意到一件耐人寻味的事，却没法停下脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:59802
    old "We entered the room, and I closed the door behind us."
    new "我们进了展室，我关上身后的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:59816
    old "...I see what you mean, but please answer one thing for me. Why are we here? Did something happen after I traveled to the past?"
    new "……我明白你的意思，不过请先回答我一件事。我们为什么会在这里？我回到过去之后，是不是出了什么事？"

    # game/script.rpy:59826
    old "I didn't know what to think. While I was aware such lengthy travels were possible, what she was saying didn't sound right. Had she traveled to the future from early December? Why had we appeared at the same time, then?"
    new "我不知道该怎么想。我虽然知道跨越这么长时间的穿越是可能的，但她说的还是不太对劲。她是从 12 月初穿越到未来的吗？那我们又为什么会在同一时刻出现？"

    # game/script.rpy:59827
    old "But it was impossible for me to think she was lying; her voice sounded as sincere as always.{w} When I'd activated the Sekimeiya from room B5... had I perhaps traveled to the first days of December?{w} I was stumped. If she was telling the truth, I couldn't explain what had happened to me."
    new "可要我认定她在说谎，我做不到——她的声音一如既往地真诚。{w}当我在水晶展室 B5 启动 Sekimeiya 时……莫非我穿越到了 12 月初？{w}我陷入了困惑。如果她说的是真的，那我就无法解释自己身上发生的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:59836
    old "She cut herself off, as if doubting what she was saying."
    new "她话说到一半就停住了，似乎对自己说的话也起了疑心。"

    # game/script.rpy:59851
    old "Yes, it did happen. It wasn't a trick.{w} It still doesn't make any sense, though. I can't wrap my head around what happened."
    new "对，那确实发生了。不是障眼法。{w}可我还是想不通。这件事我怎么想也想不明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:59854
    old "You said that you touched the Sekimeiya in the event room days before the 15th, right?"
    new "你说过，你在15日的前几天，在活动室碰过Sekimeiya，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:59867
    old "As she shook her head, my attention was grabbed by a cabinet I recognized."
    new "她摇了摇头，而我的目光被一个熟悉的展示柜吸引了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:59885
    old "I unlocked its lid, and both of us looked inside."
    new "我打开了锁，掀开盖子，我们两人一起朝里面看。"

    # game/script.rpy:59890
    old "Wh-What?{w} I...{w} don't get it."
    new "什、什么？{w}我……{w}不明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:59891
    old "The Sekimeiya was there."
    new "Sekimeiya 就在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:59897
    old "I took the Sekimeiya out. Although the cabinet had been set to 0 °C, it wasn't cold, likely because it had been recently set. In contrast, the Sekimeiya was burning, forcing me to double layer the cloth of my sleeves."
    new "我把 Sekimeiya 取了出来。展示柜的设定温度是 0 °C，柜内却一点也不冷，大概是刚设好不久的缘故。反倒是 Sekimeiya 烫得厉害，我只好把袖子叠成两层。"

    # game/script.rpy:59905
    old "Shiroya reached out to me, and I reflexively jumped back a bit. She didn't do anything, however."
    new "Shiroya 朝我伸出手，我下意识往后缩了一下。她却并没有做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:59918
    old "Once again, the chance to escape had appeared right in front of me. Was it finally a genuine opportunity?"
    new "逃脱的机会又一次出现在眼前。这一次，难道终于是真的？"

    # game/script.rpy:59923
    old "I nodded and got close to her. Slowly, my hand reached for the Sekimeiya in defiance of the burning aura around it.{w} However, the instant I contacted the gemstone, it vanished."
    new "我点点头，凑近她身边。手顶着那股灼人的热浪，慢慢伸向 Sekimeiya。{w} 可就在指尖触到宝石的一瞬间，它消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:59931
    old "The Sekimeiya wasn't there anymore. We hadn't appeared anywhere else either, as I could still feel the burn on my fingers."
    new "Sekimeiya 已经不在那里了。我们也没有出现在别的地方——指尖的灼痛还留着。"

    # game/script.rpy:59938
    old "I couldn't believe it. All we wanted was to leave that place, but it was a hope constantly rebuilt only to be repeatedly crushed."
    new "我简直不敢相信。我们一心只想离开这里，可这份希望总是一次次重新燃起，又一次次被碾碎。"

    # game/script.rpy:59948
    old "I followed Shiroya's eyes and almost fell back from the shock. The cabinet was shut, and the curtain neatly covered it again."
    new "我顺着 Shiroya 的目光看去，惊得差点向后跌倒。展示柜已经合上，遮布也重新整整齐齐地遮住了它。"

    # game/script.rpy:59951
    old "She denied it; the cabinet had closed without making a sound.{w} Could we have traveled back in time to a point before I'd unlocked it? In that case, why hadn't we teleported?"
    new "她摇头否认——展示柜是无声无息地合上的。{w} 难道我们穿越到了我打开它之前？可那样的话，为什么没有被传送？"

    # game/script.rpy:59955
    old "Suddenly, we turned to the door. Someone was running through the hallway."
    new "忽然，我们齐齐转向门口。有人正从走廊上跑过。"

    # game/script.rpy:59959
    old "As they did, we ran to grab the doorknob."
    new "我们当即冲过去抓住门把。"

    # game/script.rpy:59964
    old "A bit of smoke remained in the air, and nobody could be seen. It didn't seem like we'd gone to the past."
    new "空气里还残留着些许烟雾，视野中空无一人。看来我们并没有回到过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:59966
    old "However, those rapid footsteps were still audible in the distance. It had to be the person responsible for our imprisonment...!{w} We ran behind the sound, covering our faces."
    new "可是远处仍能听见那急促的脚步声。那一定就是把我们关在这里的人……！{w} 我们掩住脸，循着声音追了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:59971
    old "They had gone up the stairs, and the gray door was unlocked. We went up, hearing the echoing steps far ahead. If they were going to the attic, we couldn't slow down."
    new "对方上了楼梯，那扇灰门没有上锁。我们跟上去，远远听着回荡的脚步声。如果那人要去阁楼，我们就不能慢下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:59982
    old "When we got to the sixth floor, the crack of a door closing resounded through the air. We hadn't been fast enough."
    new "我们赶到六楼时，一声关门声在空中回荡。我们还是慢了一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:59992
    old "As expected, the attic door was locked.{w} Had it been Naomi? She was the one with the key."
    new "果然，阁楼的门锁上了。{w} 是 Naomi 吗？钥匙在她手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:59997
    old "Frustrated, I looked at Shiroya, who had a key in her hand."
    new "我懊恼地看向 Shiroya，却见她手里正拿着一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:60002
    old "I frowned along with her, as it sounded unbelievable. She hurried to unlock the door and revealed the narrow staircase."
    new "我也跟着皱起眉，这话实在难以置信。她急忙开了门，露出里面狭窄的楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:60013
    old "Barely any light illuminated the steps. Following Shiroya, I began to silently ascend them."
    new "台阶上几乎没有光。我跟在 Shiroya 身后，无声地往上走。"

    # game/script.rpy:60016
    old "When she reached the top, Shiroya peeked through the small gap between the door and wall.{w} Then, she turned to me."
    new "到了顶端，Shiroya 从门与墙之间的细缝往里窥看。{w} 随后，她转向我。"

    # game/script.rpy:60023
    old "Your perception of what occurred is gravely mistaken. Before Atsuki, Shiroya's figure vanished."
    new "你对当时情形的认知错得离谱。在 Atsuki 眼前，Shiroya 的身影先消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60029
    old "But before she could face me, she disappeared."
    new "可她还没来得及转过身来面对我，就消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60032
    old "What!? Did she travel!?"
    new "什么！？她穿越了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:60036
    old "I ran up the stairs and looked through the door."
    new "我冲上楼梯，透过门缝看去。"

    # game/script.rpy:60041
    old "But something was on the sofa that left me dazed. Two Sekimeiya were there, and one of them was powered off.{w} Next to them, I saw a set of keys. ...It was Naomi's."
    new "可沙发上的东西让我怔住了。那里放着两个 Sekimeiya，其中一个已经关闭。{w} 旁边还有一串钥匙。……是 Naomi 的。"

    # game/script.rpy:60044
    old "Was Naomi here? Did she touch that Sekimeiya, teleporting Shiroya away?"
    new "Naomi 来过这里？是她碰了那个 Sekimeiya，把 Shiroya 传送走了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60048
    old "Naomi and Shiroya had disappeared. However, Atsuki didn't know something else had too."
    new "Naomi 和 Shiroya 都消失了。然而 Atsuki 并不知道，还有一样东西也一并消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60054
    old "Yes. Atsuki didn't see the suitcase Naomi had been holding; both Sekimeiya lay alone on top of the sofa's cushion."
    new "是的。Atsuki 没有看见 Naomi 原本提着的手提箱；两个 Sekimeiya 孤零零地摆在沙发坐垫上。"

    # game/script.rpy:60056
    old "It was the suitcase that Naomi had been holding. Atsuki saw both Sekimeiya lying alone on top of the sofa's cushion."
    new "消失的是 Naomi 原本提着的手提箱。Atsuki 只看见两个 Sekimeiya 孤零零地摆在沙发坐垫上。"

    # game/script.rpy:60061
    old "Why are there two Sekimeiya...? Were there two from the beginning? Is this really why Sai had one in his hip pack once...?"
    new "为什么会有两个 Sekimeiya……？从一开始就有两个？Sai 那次腰包里带着一个，难道就是因为这个……？"

    # game/script.rpy:60062
    old "Where the hell did Shiroya appear? Could she be back on the crystal floor?"
    new "Shiroya 到底被传送到哪里去了？会不会又回到了水晶层？"

    # game/script.rpy:60066
    old "I took a step back, hesitant to walk into the living room. My footprints would stay on the floor, and we'd never seen them."
    new "我退后一步，迟迟不敢走进客厅。我的脚印会留在那里，而我们从未见过那些脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:60067
    old "Wait, no... Shiroya couldn't have gone to the past.{w} If she had, she would've shown up immediately after her disappearance, right?{w} Could she have gone to the future...? Is that really possible?"
    new "等等，不对……Shiroya 不可能回到过去。{w} 如果去了过去，她应该刚一消失就立刻出现，不是吗？{w} 难道她去了未来……？那种事真的可能吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60068
    old "Or what if she went far enough to the past to appear outside the tower? The range picked her up, but not me. It was likely not a very lengthy travel, I'm just not sure how much I can trust the range."
    new "又或者，她回到足够久远的过去，出现在了塔外？重叠范围把她带走了，却没有带上我。这次穿越的时间大概不算长，只是我实在拿不准这个范围有多可靠。"

    # game/script.rpy:60069
    old "...And Naomi was definitely here. Why did she run up to the attic with the Sekimeiya, just to travel through time?{w} She didn't know we'd unlocked the way in, so she might think she locked the Sekimeiya in here.{w} ...Which is strange. After all, the attic was locked when we first came across the door."
    new "……而且 Naomi 确实来过这里。她带着 Sekimeiya 跑上阁楼，难道就是为了穿越时间？{w}她不知道我们已经打开了入口，说不定以为把 Sekimeiya 锁在这里就安全了。{w}……可这说不通。毕竟我们第一次撞见那扇门时，阁楼还是锁着的。"

    # game/script.rpy:60072
    old "I don't get it...! The Sekimeiya disappeared from the crystal room, and immediately, Naomi was bringing two of them up. At the same time, another one must've been in its original cabinet.{w} What the hell happened before we woke up? How many Sekimeiya are there...?"
    new "我完全想不通……！Sekimeiya 刚从水晶展室消失，Naomi 转眼就搬了两个上去。而与此同时，原本的展示柜里应该还有一个。{w}我们醒来之前究竟发生了什么？Sekimeiya 到底有几个……？"

    # game/script.rpy:60073
    old "It was enigmatic. Naomi had to still be in the tower, but if Shiroya also was, why had she not come back?"
    new "实在令人费解。Naomi 一定还在塔里；可如果 Shiroya 也在，她为什么没有回来？"

    # game/script.rpy:60074
    old "Could they both have gone to the past, but only Naomi reappeared in the tower?"
    new "难道两人都去了过去，却只有 Naomi 重新出现在塔里？"

    # game/script.rpy:60078
    old "Suddenly, I realized I had to go back downstairs and found myself bolting out of the attic."
    new "我猛然意识到自己必须下楼，等回过神时，人已经冲出了阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:60081
    old "The storeroom...! Now I know it leads outside, and its handle must've been taken off at this time. If it was Naomi, I might get there before it happens!"
    new "储藏室……！我现在知道那里通向外面，而在这个时间，门把手应该已经被拆掉了。如果动手的是 Naomi，我也许能赶在那之前到！"

    # game/script.rpy:60085
    old "Shiroya could no longer have been in the building, but perhaps she was outside. As another chance to escape presented itself, I found myself gathering foolish hope once more."
    new "Shiroya 不可能还留在楼里了，但或许就在外面。逃脱的机会又一次摆在眼前，我竟又生出几分可笑的期待。"

    # game/script.rpy:60091
    old "Almost no smoke hung in the air, and I could hear people on the same floor. I was not the only person there, but my only interest was the room I ran to."
    new "空气里几乎没有烟雾，还能听见同层有人声。这层楼不止我一个人，可我唯一在意的，只有自己奔向的那个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:60096
    old "In the storeroom, I rapidly shut myself behind the secret wall and approached the door."
    new "一进储藏室，我便飞快地缩到暗墙之后，随即朝那扇门走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:60099
    old "In the dark, I felt it for its handle."
    new "黑暗中，我摸索着寻找门把手。"

    # game/script.rpy:60105
    old "It is here! I can leave!"
    new "在这里！我能出去了！"

    # game/script.rpy:60106
    old "I couldn't believe it, but I gripped the handle and turned it with all my might."
    new "我几乎不敢相信，却还是握住把手，用尽全力转动。"

    # game/script.rpy:60113
    old "You've gotta be kidding me. It's locked..."
    new "开什么玩笑。锁上了……"

    # game/script.rpy:60114
    old "Wait, no, of course it is! That's why it was ripped off, so that we couldn't unlock it with the key that we found!"
    new "等等，不对，当然是锁着的！所以才有人把把手拆掉——好让我们没法用捡来的那把钥匙开门！"

    # game/script.rpy:60119
    old "I ran back to the hallway. We'd found the rusty key on the floor, in front of the event room."
    new "我跑回走廊。那把生锈的钥匙，我们是在活动室门前的地上捡到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:60120
    old "If I get it and unlock the door, I'll definitely be changing the past, won't I? The police might even see me and set everyone free."
    new "只要拿到它打开门，我肯定会改变过去吧？说不定警察甚至会看到我，把所有人都放了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60121
    old "All of that no longer mattered. The real Shiroya had likely appeared somewhere, and I had a definite avenue of escape. I wasn't even aware of the possible consequences that would come, so I couldn't care about them. They were abstract things, and escaping was concrete."
    new "这些都已无关紧要。真正的 Shiroya 很可能已经出现在某处，而我也确实有了一条退路。往后会有什么后果，我根本无从知晓，自然也顾不上。那些东西太过空泛，逃出去才是实实在在的。"

    # game/script.rpy:60129
    old "Where the fuck is it...!? It was right here."
    new "该死的，钥匙去哪了……！？明明就在这儿的。"

    # game/script.rpy:60130
    old "There was very little light, but I couldn't see the key anywhere."
    new "光线很暗，可无论往哪儿看，都不见钥匙的影子。"

    # game/script.rpy:60132
    old "What the fuck!? I just want to leave!"
    new "搞什么鬼！？我只想离开这里！"

    # game/script.rpy:60133
    old "I didn't want to accept it, but the key wasn't there."
    new "我不愿相信，可钥匙确实不在。"

    # game/script.rpy:60134
    old "Was it not dropped yet?"
    new "难道是还没被丢到这里吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60141
    old "Although it was ridiculous, I went back to the chilly storeroom. It was a bit of a gamble, but the culprit had to arrive there relatively soon to detach the handle."
    new "明知荒唐，我还是回到了阴冷的储藏室。这多少是在赌，但拆把手的人应该很快就会来。"

    # game/script.rpy:60142
    old "...{w}Wait, is that right?{w} Will the culprit really come in here...?"
    new "……{w}等等，真是这样吗？{w}那个人真的会进这里来……？"

    # game/script.rpy:60143
    old "When we found the secret wall, a single set of fingerprints was on it, meaning that it had been opened one time in the recent past. I swear I just saw those same fingerprints right now... Does that mean that nobody will come until our past selves find the mechanism?{w} Alternatively, what if they come from outside and won't touch the other side of the wall?{w} ...This doesn't make any sense, though. How is it possible we only saw one set of fingerprints? What about the ones I left just now?"
    new "我们发现暗墙的时候，上面只有一组指纹，说明前不久它被人打开过一次。可我刚才分明看见了同一组指纹……这是不是说，在过去的我们找到机关之前，根本不会有人来？{w}又或者，对方是从外面进来的，根本不会碰到墙的另一面？{w}……可这说不通。怎么可能只有一组指纹？我刚才留下的那些又算什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:60146
    old "Did it mean that the past had changed? Was everything going to happen differently?"
    new "这是不是说，过去已经改变？一切都会变得不一样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60147
    old "...And where in the world is Shiroya? If she somehow went to the future, she'll definitely come here when she appears.{w} Is it possible she's outside and won't tell the police just so she can avoid changing the past...?"
    new "……还有，Shiroya 究竟在哪里？如果她去了未来，那她出现时一定会来这里。{w}会不会她就在外面，只是为了不改变过去，才不去告诉警察……？"

    # game/script.rpy:60148
    old "The key isn't in the hallway, the handle hasn't been taken off, I left extra fingerprints, and two Sekimeiya are in the attic. This cannot be the same morning. After all, if I'd been here since the start, I would've been found."
    new "走廊里没有钥匙，把手还没被拆下，我留下了多余的指纹，阁楼里还放着两个 Sekimeiya。这绝不可能是同一个早晨。毕竟，如果我从一开始就在这里，早就被人发现了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60149
    old "So what exactly is going to happen? Is everything gonna be different?{w} What about our past selves? If the past was changed somewhere, I'm no longer the other Atsuki who's currently here."
    new "那么接下来到底会发生什么？一切都会变得不一样吗？{w}过去的我们又该怎么办？如果某处的过去已经被改变，我就不再是此刻待在这里的那个我了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60150
    old "I had to stay in the storeroom, merely hoping Shiroya would come. I had no desire to go back to the attic either; the Sekimeiya would clearly never aid us, and I didn't want anyone to slip into the storeroom while I wasn't present."
    new "我只能留在储藏室，一心盼着 Shiroya 出现。我也不想再回阁楼去：Sekimeiya 显然帮不上我们任何忙，而我不在的时候，万一有人溜进储藏室就糟了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60151
    old "What the hell is all of this!? When I finally found Shiroya, she suddenly disappeared! There's no way I'm going to spend twelve more hours here from the start, and I have no idea what the fuck is even going to happen! How did everything turn into this so quickly!?"
    new "这到底算怎么回事！？好不容易找到 Shiroya，她却突然消失了！我才不要从头开始，又在这里耗上十二个小时，而且我压根不知道接下来还会发生什么鬼事！怎么就变成这样了！？"

    # game/script.rpy:60155
    old "I took a moment to recenter. Panicking wasn't going to get me anywhere."
    new "我花了一会儿才定下神来。慌张解决不了任何问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:60156
    old "...Didn't Shiroya say that she found the rusty key in a security room drawer? What if it was her who changed the past?"
    new "……Shiroya 不是说过，她是在监控室抽屉里找到那把生锈的钥匙吗？万一改变过去的人就是她呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:60157
    old "If she grabbed it days ago, it wouldn't be in hallway A now.{w} And if the world changed independent of her actions, could the key currently be in the security room? I can't try to find it before everyone wakes up because the alarm locked the room..."
    new "如果几天前她就拿走了钥匙，那现在它就不会在 A走廊。{w}可要是世界的改变与她的行动无关，钥匙此刻会不会就在监控室里？警报把监控室锁上了，我没法赶在大家醒来之前去找……"

    # game/script.rpy:60158
    old "The key was in the security room days ago... Katei was surely who dropped it, then."
    new "几天前钥匙还在监控室……那么掉钥匙的人一定是 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:60166
    old "It was earlier than I'd anticipated when sound came from the hallway.{w} From the lobby side, a group of people approached where I was."
    new "走廊里传来动静，比我预想的要早。{w}一群人从大厅那边朝我这边走来。"

    # game/script.rpy:60168
    old "Huh...? Is that everyone?{w} This isn't what we did. We went to the security room the first time we stepped into this hallway."
    new "咦……？所有人都来了？{w}我们可不是这么做的。第一次踏进这条走廊时，我们是先去了监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:60169
    old "However, the steps went to the crystal room in front of me."
    new "可那些脚步却走向了我前方的水晶展室。"

    # game/script.rpy:60170
    old "That's the room where the gemstones were stolen. Why did they go there without entering the security room first?"
    new "宝石就是在那间展室被盗的。他们为什么连监控室都不进，就直接去了那里？"

    # game/script.rpy:60171
    old "From behind the wall, I was able to pick up a voice. It was Sai's, although I couldn't make out the words."
    new "隔着墙，我隐约听见了说话声。是 Sai 的声音，只是听不清在说什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:60172
    old "Do they know what happened there? Why, though? That's so strange."
    new "他们知道那里发生过什么吗？可他们为什么要去那儿？太奇怪了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60173
    old "They left the room not long after and walked closer to the stairs."
    new "没过多久，他们便离开那间屋子，朝楼梯这边走来。"

    # game/script.rpy:60174
    old "That's Katei talking, isn't it?"
    new "那是 Katei 在说话吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:60175
    old "I focused as much as I could to understand what he was saying."
    new "我竭力集中精神，想听清他在说什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:60178
    old "...elevator won't move— ...arm disabled it."
    new "……电梯动不了了——……警报把它停掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60179
    old "...Sorry, Isla, but there's no—"
    new "……抱歉，Isla，可是没有——"

    # game/script.rpy:60181
    old "What the hell? This is entirely different from what we experienced."
    new "搞什么？这跟我们经历过的完全不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:60182
    old "Everyone went up the stairs, leaving behind the bizarre silence."
    new "所有人都上了楼梯，只留下那片诡异的寂静。"

    # game/script.rpy:60183
    old "They didn't even unlock the security room, so I can't go see if the key's there!"
    new "他们连监控室都没打开，我根本没法去看钥匙在不在里面！"

    # game/script.rpy:60184
    old "It was evident there had been a change in history, but where? I hadn't willingly changed the past, so someone else must have... Why had it had such a particular effect on me, though? Did I possess memories of the past reality because I'd traveled from it...?"
    new "历史确实被改动过了，可改在了哪里？我并没有主动去改变过去，那么做这件事的只能是别人……可为什么偏偏对我产生了这样的影响？我之所以还留有原来那段现实的记忆，是因为我从那里穿越而来……？"

    # game/script.rpy:60185
    old "That didn't quite make sense, but I knew the answer wouldn't be simple regardless."
    new "这说不通，但我也清楚，答案本就不会简单。"

    # game/script.rpy:60189
    old "...Is that it? Did a person alter reality, or is what happened something else...?"
    new "……就这样？改变现实的是某个人，还是说，实际情况另有所指……？"

    # game/script.rpy:60190
    old "But most importantly, what was I supposed to do? I had no idea. Nothing was guaranteed."
    new "可最关键的是，我接下来该做什么？我毫无头绪，也没有任何一件事能有把握。"

    # game/script.rpy:60191
    old "If the past has already changed, no matter what I do, I'll have no direct relation to the Atsuki who just went up. ...That means my priority should be to find Shiroya, who's in the same position as me.{w} Where could she be? If she traveled through time and another deviation occurred, she might not exist in this world anymore."
    new "如果过去已经被改变，那无论我再做什么，都和刚才上楼的那个 Atsuki 没有直接关系了。……也就是说，我该优先去找和我处境相同的 Shiroya。{w}她会在哪儿？如果她穿越了时间，之后又发生了一次偏差，她或许已经不存在于这个世界了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60192
    old "Assuming that was actually the case, was finding her conceivable in the first place? I couldn't even know that, seeing as I was already neck-deep in the nonsensical."
    new "就算真是如此，找得到她吗？连这一点我都无从判断——毕竟我早已陷进一堆荒唐之中。"

    # game/script.rpy:60196
    old "Once again, I didn't have to wait very long before I heard some of the others come back."
    new "又一次，我没等多久就听见几个人回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60197
    old "Who's that? It's not everyone who went up."
    new "是谁？刚才上楼的人没全回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:60198
    old "Quietly, they walked past the storeroom."
    new "他们悄无声息地从储藏室外走过。"

    # game/script.rpy:60201
    old "Following them, another person came from the stairs, crossing in front of the storeroom.{w} A few seconds later, someone else did too, but they didn't enter hallway A."
    new "紧跟着，又有一个人从楼梯过来，从储藏室门前走过。{w}几秒后，另一个人也一样走过，却没有进 A走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:60204
    old "What the hell is happening here...!? Why is everyone silently walking around on their own!?"
    new "这到底是怎么回事……！？为什么每个人都一声不响地各走各的！？"

    # game/script.rpy:60205
    old "At some point, someone briefly entered the storeroom and left without saying anything. After listening for a few minutes, everything occurred in reverse. Several footsteps went up the stairs in a small group. A bit later, I heard a single person going up, followed by another shortly after that."
    new "不知什么时候，有人短暂地进了储藏室，又一言不发地离开。又听了几分钟，一切便反过来重演了一遍。几个人结伴上了楼梯。过了一会儿，我听见一个人独自上楼，紧接着又是一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:60206
    old "...{w}What the fuck just happened!? Is everyone gone again?"
    new "……{w}刚才到底发生什么了！？所有人又都不见了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60211
    old "Nothing else could be heard on the crystal floor, but I had no idea what any of those people had done or who they were."
    new "水晶层上再听不到别的动静，可那些人都做了什么、又是谁，我全然不知。"

    # game/script.rpy:60212
    old "The silence continued for some time, and eventually, I was tempted to step out. Multiple people had walked toward the security room, but I didn't know if they'd entered it."
    new "寂静持续了好一阵，我终于有些想出去看看。好几个人都朝监控室的方向走过，可我不知道他们有没有进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:60213
    old "Was one of them Katei? Nobody seems to be here, so I could go check if it's unlocked."
    new "那些人里会不会有一个是 Katei？这里似乎没人了，我可以去看看门有没有开。"

    # game/script.rpy:60218
    old "I slipped out of the secret corridor and opened the way out just a crack."
    new "我从暗道里溜出来，把出口推开一道细缝。"

    # game/script.rpy:60221
    old "Nobody was in hallway C."
    new "C走廊里空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:60225
    old "I slowly moved the other way."
    new "我缓缓往另一个方向挪动。"

    # game/script.rpy:60229
    old "When I tried to open the security room, I found it to be unlocked."
    new "我试着推监控室的门，发现它没有上锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:60235
    old "Oh... all the screens are off.{w} It looks like the same thing that happened to us, where they all shut down at the same time. It seems it occurred again despite all the differences."
    new "哦……所有屏幕都黑着。{w}看起来和我们那时一样，全部同时熄掉了。看来尽管情况处处不同，这件事还是照样发生了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60239
    old "I couldn't waste time, so I hurried over to the drawers."
    new "我不能再耽搁，赶紧奔向那几个抽屉。"

    # game/script.rpy:60240
    old "I doubt it's still here.{w} What's most likely is that Katei has—"
    new "我看它多半已经不在了。{w}最有可能的是，Katei 已经——"

    # game/script.rpy:60245
    old "I cut myself off. The key was there, deep within a drawer."
    new "我把话咽了回去。钥匙就在那里，躺在抽屉深处。"

    # game/script.rpy:60246
    old "Although I could no longer be certain that leaving the tower was what I had to do, I couldn't help but feel a brief thrill at the prospect."
    new "虽然我已经无法确定离开塔是不是我该做的事，可一想到这个可能，心里还是忍不住一阵兴奋。"

    # game/script.rpy:60250
    old "Was the universe going to allow it for once? Back in the storeroom, I pressed my hand against the hidden door, nearly out of breath."
    new "这一次，世界总该容许了吧？回到储藏室，我把手按在暗门上，几乎喘不上气。"

    # game/script.rpy:60256
    old "The handle was there, and so was the keyhole. I inserted the key, which confirmed it was the right one."
    new "把手在，钥匙孔也在。我把钥匙插进去，确认正是这一把。"

    # game/script.rpy:60262
    old "...Really? Is leaving this place simply not possible?"
    new "……真的吗？难道离开这里根本就是不可能的？"

    # game/script.rpy:60265
    old "It wasn't working. Although the key was the right one, it wasn't unlocking the door."
    new "打不开。钥匙明明是对的，门锁却纹丝不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:60267
    old "This is absurd. What the fuck am I supposed to do!?{w} Do I wait half a day here, hoping Shiroya will just appear and the exit will open?{w} And then what? Two versions of us remain forever? ...This is insane! There has to be something we can do."
    new "这太荒唐了。我到底该怎么办！？{w}难道我要在这里等上半天，指望 Shiroya 自己出现、出口自己打开？{w}然后呢？我们两个就永远这样并存下去？……简直疯了！总该有我们能做的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:60268
    old "...{w}I had the rusty key, so an old thought came back to me."
    new "……{w}手里握着那把生锈的钥匙，一个旧的念头又浮了上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:60274
    old "\"Unless I go back to thinking about thought-up loops, I suppose. There could be something that would work.{w} The person who killed Katei took that rusty key and walked out of the tower through the storeroom door, which was open. That created a location outside the tower where they were holding the key that could be replicated. Then, they reentered and used the Sekimeiya to go back in time. In the past, they appeared outside the tower holding the key, so they were able to unlock the door and reenter with something they'd obtained outside—like a knife. They left the door open so that their past self could exit with the key and create the replicated location.\""
    new "「除非我又回头去琢磨那种假想出来的循环。说不定真有什么办法行得通。{w}杀死 Katei 的人拿起那把生锈的钥匙，从敞开的储藏室门走出了塔。于是，塔外就有了一个他持着钥匙的地点，而这个地点可以被复制。接着，他重新进塔，用 Sekimeiya 回到过去。在过去，他拿着钥匙出现在塔外，因此能打开门，带着从外面弄到的东西——比如一把刀——重新进来。他故意让门开着，好让过去的自己带着钥匙出去，造出那个复制地点。」"

    # game/script.rpy:60280
    old "Could I pull off something like that, after all?"
    new "说到底，这种事我做得成吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60281
    old "I still have no idea how the replicated location works, but I could try it. I'll step out and spend a long time outside holding the key. After that, I'll come back in and travel to the past as many times as needed to appear outside holding the key so that I can unlock the door and let my past self out. I can't really construct it in a cleaner way."
    new "我到现在也不明白复制地点是怎么运作的，但可以试一试。我先走出去，带着钥匙在外面待上很久。之后再回到里面，反复回到过去，直到我拿着钥匙出现在塔外，打开门，把过去的自己放出去。我实在想不出更干净的做法了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60285
    old "I stepped out of the secret area so that another self of mine could unlock the door without alerting me. My knocks from before would be their cue to do it."
    new "我走出暗间，好让另一个我能在不惊动我的情况下打开门。我之前敲门的声音，就是给他们的信号。"

    # game/script.rpy:60292
    old "Great. I'm just gonna be here all my life."
    new "好啊。看来我这辈子都得耗在这儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60293
    old "I knew that feeling all too well. My plan had failed, but I couldn't know why. For all I knew, it was viable, but if the police or civilians were observing the surroundings of the tower, that was one of countless ways it would be blocked. It was possible I wouldn't have been able to unlock the door from outside either."
    new "那种滋味我再熟悉不过。计划失败了，可我不知道原因。说不定它本来就行得通，但如果警察或平民正在监视塔的四周，那也不过是无数种让它失败的情况之一。也有可能，我在外面同样打不开那道门。"

    # game/script.rpy:60301
    old "I sat down, defeated."
    new "我颓然坐下。"

    # game/script.rpy:60302
    old "I stayed on the cold floor, waiting for the door to open. It seemed the last hope that remained entailed being able to leave at {time=21.}{w} Was that going to happen, or was I going to wait another twelve hours just to be faked out again?"
    new "我坐在冰冷的地板上，等着门打开。仅剩的最后一点指望，似乎就是能在 {time=21.} 出去。{w}那会成真吗？还是说我又要再等上十二个小时，到头来再一次空等一场？"

    # game/script.rpy:60303
    old "...And would the secret door ever open? Would I ever see the Shiroya I'd just been with again?"
    new "……还有，那道暗门会打开吗？我还能再见到刚才和我在一起的 Shiroya 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60304
    old "I didn't bother thinking; there was nothing else I felt compelled to solve, as the march of time alone would decide everything. Soon after I rested my jaw on my knees, I heard people returning to the crystal floor."
    new "我懒得再去想。反正时间流逝自会决定一切，我也没有别的非解决不可的事。我把下巴搁在膝盖上没多久，就听见有人回到了水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:60305
    old "I knew everyone was outside, but I didn't want to show myself. If I had to wait all day again, I would do it peacefully—alone."
    new "我知道所有人都在外面，却不想露面。如果还要再等上一整天，那我就安安静静地一个人等。"

    # game/script.rpy:60306
    old "When I stashed the key in my pocket, I noticed something else: another key had disappeared. ...The one that opened the locker that wasn't Naomi's.{w} When had it disappeared? I had only just realized it, but it was a result of one of my last two travels."
    new "我把钥匙塞进口袋时，又注意到一件事：另一把钥匙不见了。……就是那把开另一个储物柜的钥匙——不是 Naomi 的那个。{w}它是什么时候不见的？我直到现在才发现，但这一定是我最近两次穿越中的某一次造成的。"

    # game/script.rpy:60312
    old "I heard faint voices sporadically, but I had no real idea of what was happening in the building. Once some time had passed, only occasional footsteps met my ears."
    new "隐约的人声时断时续，但楼里究竟在发生什么，我毫无头绪。过了一阵，传进耳朵里的便只剩零星的脚步声。"

    # game/script.rpy:60313
    old "My body began to feel noticeably chilled, so I tried to cover myself well. Shiroya wasn't coming—that was very clear. ...Was Naomi present, though? I hadn't heard anything regarding her."
    new "身上明显冷了起来，我尽量把自己裹紧。Shiroya 不会来了——这一点再清楚不过。……可 Naomi 在吗？关于她，我什么也没听到。"

    # game/script.rpy:60314
    old "...{w}What about the Sekimeiya? During the prolonged silence, I considered trying to find it. Assuming two existed, obtaining a single one wasn't too hard. Nobody knew about the hidden section I was in, so I could conceal it there."
    new "……{w}那 Sekimeiya 呢？漫长的沉默里，我也动过找找看的念头。如果存在两个，弄到一个并不算难。没人知道我藏身的这处暗间，正好可以把它藏在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:60315
    old "But I knew that would only complicate things further. Escaping the building by touching the Sekimeiya couldn't be possible; when that was supposed to occur, the Sekimeiya vanished instead.{w} What the hell had happened at that time? Why had the cabinet's state reverted? Without a thorough understanding of the Sekimeiya's powers, I couldn't begin to use it."
    new "但我知道，那只会让事情更复杂。想靠触碰 Sekimeiya 逃出这栋楼根本行不通——真到了那一刻，Sekimeiya 却消失了。{w}那时候究竟发生了什么？展示柜的状态为什么会恢复原样？不把 Sekimeiya 的力量彻底弄清楚，我根本无从使用它。"

    # game/script.rpy:60316
    old "So I stayed there, ignorant to the actual time.{w} ...However, I could tell that a few hours had passed."
    new "于是我待在那里，不知道实际过了多久。{w}……不过，我大致能判断已经过了几个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:60317
    old "It had been a while since I'd heard anyone's voice. Only individual steps had crossed the hallway here and there."
    new "很久没听到人声了，只有零星的脚步偶尔穿过走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:60322
    old "Hey! ...the fuck...! Where have you—"
    new "喂！……搞什么……！你跑到哪——"

    # game/script.rpy:60324
    old "I looked at the door. It was Sai's voice, which I hadn't heard in a long time."
    new "我望向门的方向。那是 Sai 的声音，我已经很久没听到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60329
    old "There was no immediate response that I could hear, but I remained attentive. Had Sai seen someone who hadn't been there for a long time? My mind immediately went to Naomi."
    new "我没有立刻听到任何回应，但仍旧留心听着。Sai 是不是看到了某个许久没露面的人？我脑中立刻想到 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:60330
    old "I wasn't able to properly distinguish anything else, but I could at least tell that a group was in the hallway. I'd only understood Sai due to his volume."
    new "别的话我分辨不清，但至少能听出走廊里有一群人。只是因为 Sai 嗓门大，我才听懂了他的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:60335
    old "A few minutes later, even those faint signs of life faded out."
    new "几分钟后，连那点微弱的动静也消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60336
    old "Are they not there anymore...?"
    new "他们已经不在了吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:60337
    old "It didn't seem so. Leaning against the wall, I attempted to think about nothing."
    new "似乎确实不在了。我靠着墙，努力什么都不去想。"

    # game/script.rpy:60341
    old "Minutes later, a couple sets of footsteps approached from the far end of the hallway. As always, my eyes instinctively turned to the door."
    new "几分钟后，几道脚步声从走廊尽头传来，越来越近。我像往常一样，目光不由自主地转向门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:60343
    old "It's certainly po— ...on this floor. Don't move fro—"
    new "肯定就在——……这一层。别走开——"

    # game/script.rpy:60344
    old "...Was that me?"
    new "……那是我吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60347
    old "...{w}What?"
    new "……{w}什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:60355
    old "Was that Miiya...? ...I must be mistaken."
    new "那是Miiya……？……多半是我听错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60356
    old "Suddenly, the storeroom door opened, and I had to fight to contain my panic.{w} It appeared my past self was looking for something, as he quickly moved on to the next crystal room."
    new "突然，储藏室的门开了，我拼命压住心里的惊慌。{w}看来过去的我正在找什么，很快又转向了下一间水晶展室。"

    # game/script.rpy:60357
    old "It was her, wasn't it...? It was only one word, but wasn't that her voice...?"
    new "是她吧……？虽然只听见一个词，可那不就是她的声音吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:60358
    old "While it seemed impossible, her existence in the tower had been mentioned before. Erina, Sai, and Akaro had all claimed to have seen her."
    new "尽管难以置信，但此前确实有人提过她在塔里。Erina、Sai和Akaro都说过自己见过她。"

    # game/script.rpy:60359
    old "Is she there, on the other side of the door?"
    new "她就在门那边吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60360
    old "Multiple people emerged from the lobby side and stopped in hallway C. Meanwhile, I could hear doors being opened."
    new "好几个人从大厅那头过来，停在了C走廊。与此同时，我能听见开门的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:60364
    old "...you hear that?"
    new "……你听见了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60368
    old "What are they doing? Searching for the Sekimeiya?"
    new "他们在做什么？在找Sekimeiya吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60370
    old "Stay the—{w=0.4} ...look at the mechani—"
    new "待在那儿——{w=0.4}……你看机械室——"

    # game/script.rpy:60371
    old "That was my voice again."
    new "又是我自己的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:60375
    old "I think they moved over to hallway B."
    new "他们好像挪到B走廊去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60379
    old "...right. Let's go."
    new "……好。走吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:60380
    old "And now they're going up."
    new "现在他们上楼了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60385
    old "I emerged from the hidden area so that I could hear a little bit better. It seemed everyone was walking up the stairs.{w} Had I actually heard Miiya? If she was there, I had to see her."
    new "我从藏身处走出来，好听得更清楚些。看来所有人都上楼了。{w}我真的听到Miiya了吗？如果她就在那里，我一定要见到她。"

    # game/script.rpy:60389
    old "I closed the secret wall. I assumed everyone's backs were facing me, so I peeked out from behind the door. If Miiya was with them, I didn't mind being seen, but half of me thought my mind had played a trick on me."
    new "我合上暗墙，料想众人都背对着我，便从门后探出头去。如果Miiya和他们在一起，我不介意被发现；可我心里有一半觉得，那不过是自己听岔了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60396
    old "Most of them had turned past the gray door; I could only see Sai's legs slowly disappearing."
    new "大部分人已经拐过那扇灰门，我只看见Sai的腿慢慢消失在门后。"

    # game/script.rpy:60400
    old "I approached the stairs, hoping I could watch them from a distance. However, all of a sudden, Sai stopped."
    new "我走近楼梯，想远远看他们一眼。可Sai忽然停住了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:60404
    old "Had he heard me? I stepped aside reflexively."
    new "他听见我了？我下意识地往旁边一闪。"

    # game/script.rpy:60405
    old "...What's up?"
    new "……怎么了？"

    # game/script.rpy:60406
    old "Akaro, why is that door open?"
    new "Akaro，那扇门怎么开着？"

    # game/script.rpy:60407
    old "Shit. They noticed me."
    new "糟了，他们发现我了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60412
    old "As their suspicion grew, I stepped back several times. By the time they came back down, I was in hallway B."
    new "他们起了疑心，我连退了好几步。等他们折返下来时，我已经退到了B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:60413
    old "Sai and Akaro approached the storeroom and were followed by Katei, Erina, and Isla."
    new "Sai和Akaro朝储藏室走来，Katei、Erina和Isla跟在后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:60414
    old "...What about Miiya? Is she not here?{w} My past self isn't either..."
    new "……Miiya呢？她不在这里吗？{w}过去的我也不在……"

    # game/script.rpy:60415
    old "I couldn't see what was happening from where I was, but suddenly, I heard gasps."
    new "从我这里看不到发生了什么，可忽然传来了几声倒抽冷气的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:60424
    old "I got closer and shut my eyes in regret when I saw what they were looking at. They had found the secret corridor."
    new "我走近几步，看清他们正盯着什么，懊恼地闭上了眼。他们发现了那条秘密通道。"

    # game/script.rpy:60425
    old "What the fuck do I do now...? There's nowhere else to hide."
    new "我他妈现在该怎么办……？已经没有别的地方可躲了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60429
    old "I looked around in desperation. I could never hide in a bathroom, as Katei would unlock it.{w} I saw the elevator was open; it was working, and the others had definitely been in the process of searching the whole building."
    new "我绝望地环顾四周。洗手间根本藏不了——Katei 会把门打开。{w} 我看到电梯开着，还能运行，而其他人显然正在搜查整栋楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:60431
    old "Did I really mishear that? Was that not Miiya...?{w} Where is my other self, then? What about the past Shiroya? She isn't here either."
    new "难道我真的听错了？那不是 Miiya……？{w} 那另一个我在哪里？过去的 Shiroya 呢？她也不在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:60436
    old "I moved to the event room, an easy bridge between the hallways."
    new "我转移到活动室。那里连接着各条走廊，行动很方便。"

    # game/script.rpy:60443
    old "Just to check, I uncovered the curtain. The Sekimeiya wasn't there."
    new "为确认一下，我掀开遮布。Sekimeiya 不在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:60446
    old "I'm not gonna spend hours trying to hide from everyone. If I'm discovered, I'll explain what happened to me."
    new "我没打算花上几个小时躲着所有人。真被发现了，我就把发生在我身上的事解释清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:60452
    old "At least a few of them were still in the storeroom, discussing what they'd found. Some minutes later, I was surprised by the sound of someone walking through hallway A."
    new "至少还有几个人留在储藏室里，讨论着他们的发现。几分钟后，我听到有人穿过 A 走廊的脚步声，吃了一惊。"

    # game/script.rpy:60457
    old "What was strange was that they'd come from the lobby side. They'd come out of a crystal room to my left."
    new "奇怪的是，那人是从大厅那边过来的。他是从我左边的一间水晶展室里走出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:60458
    old "Was someone in there...?"
    new "里面有人吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:60459
    old "Whoever it was had walked to the storeroom, but all the voices I could make out were too muffled."
    new "那个人已经走到储藏室去了，可我能分辨出的说话声都太模糊。"

    # game/script.rpy:60463
    old "Eventually, I stopped sensing people in the hallway."
    new "最后，我感觉走廊里已经没有人了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60464
    old "...Did they go anywhere?"
    new "……他们是去了什么地方吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60468
    old "Just in case, I left through the other side."
    new "为保险起见，我从另一侧离开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60472
    old "Yeah, they're not there anymore.{w} Where did they go? There's no way they opened the door out, is there?"
    new "嗯，人已经不在了。{w} 到底去了哪里？总不可能把通向外面的门打开了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:60477
    old "They hadn't. It was still locked."
    new "没有。门还锁着。"

    # game/script.rpy:60478
    old "Maybe they continued going up...?"
    new "也许他们继续往上走了……？"

    # game/script.rpy:60482
    old "I stared at the crystal rooms in hallway A. There was only one farther ahead on the same wall as the event room: A1."
    new "我盯着 A走廊里的水晶展室。再往前，和活动室同一侧的只剩一间：A1。"

    # game/script.rpy:60486
    old "That person... Did they come out of here?"
    new "那个人……是从这里出来的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60492
    old "It was a little strange. After all, I knew the floor had just been inspected, and since the others had been about to go up, it was likely they hadn't found whatever they'd been searching for."
    new "这有点奇怪。毕竟我知道这一层刚被检查过，而其他人正要上楼，看来他们并没有找到自己在找的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:60493
    old "I hadn't heard anyone entering the room, so if someone had left it, they had definitely done so after spending a while inside. That was what I found odd."
    new "我没听见有人进过这间展室；既然如此，如果有人从里面出来，那一定是在里面待了好一阵子。我觉得奇怪的就是这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:60497
    old "The curtains were raised, showing that the cabinets had recently been looked into. Curious, I went ahead and opened them."
    new "遮布被拉了起来，说明展示柜最近被人查看过。我出于好奇，也上前打开了柜门。"

    # game/script.rpy:60505
    old "I was surprised to find out my suspicion had been on the mark. A Sekimeiya was inside one of the cabinets."
    new "让我意外的是，我的猜测竟然没错。其中一个展示柜里放着一个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:60508
    old "What the hell...? So someone managed to hide it despite the search."
    new "怎么回事……？竟然有人能在搜查时把它藏起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:60512
    old "I knew an identical gemstone existed, so I went through the remaining cabinets until I was confident that it was the only Sekimeiya in the room."
    new "我知道还有一颗一模一样的宝石，于是把剩下的展示柜逐一查过，直到确信这间展室里只有这一个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:60520
    old "...Should I take it? Now that I can't stay in the storeroom, it might be useful to keep it."
    new "……要拿走吗？既然我不能再待在储藏室，带在身上也许有用。"

    # game/script.rpy:60521
    old "Unsure, I reached in to grab it, and as I took it out, I was reminded of an unexplained problem."
    new "我犹豫着伸手去拿；把它取出来时，又想起了一个没弄明白的问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:60522
    old "...It's not hot at all.{w} That means it's not currently working, but it should be."
    new "……一点都不烫。{w} 也就是说它现在没有在运作，可按理说应该正在运作。"

    # game/script.rpy:60523
    old "This is what happened sometimes. The Sekimeiya remained cold outside the cabinet, and touching it didn't do anything."
    new "以前也出现过这种情况。Sekimeiya 放在展示柜外时一直是凉的，碰它也没有任何反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:60524
    old "Hm... Could it be that out of the two Sekimeiya, only one works?"
    new "嗯……会不会两个 Sekimeiya 中只有一个能用？"

    # game/script.rpy:60525
    old "That sounded like a plausible idea, but it was denied by the time a Sekimeiya had appeared inactive in Sai's hip pack.{w} It was useless, and I didn't want to give myself another headache trying to resolve it. I put it back where I'd found it."
    new "这猜测看似合理，但以前 Sai 腰包里的 Sekimeiya 也出现过毫无反应的情况，这个说法就站不住了。{w} 它没用，我也不想为弄清它再头疼一次。我把它放回了原处。"

    # game/script.rpy:60528
    old "I wonder who hid it here, though."
    new "不过，会是谁把它藏在这里的呢。"

    # game/script.rpy:60535
    old "Where do I even go?"
    new "我到底该去哪儿？"

    # game/script.rpy:60536
    old "The tower was being inspected, so I figured the least likely places to be revisited were the bathrooms on floor 2."
    new "整座塔正在被搜查，我想二楼洗手间应该是最不可能被再次检查的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:60540
    old "I shut myself inside one."
    new "我把自己关进其中一间。"

    # game/script.rpy:60542
    old "I'll definitely be found eventually no matter where I stay."
    new "无论我躲在哪儿，迟早都会被找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:60543
    old "Was that voice really Miiya's? I need to know that.{w} It couldn't have been anyone else. If it wasn't my imagination, it was the real Miiya."
    new "那真的是 Miiya 的声音吗？我必须确认这一点。{w} 不可能是别人。如果不是我的错觉，那就是真正的 Miiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:60544
    old "I had no idea why she would be there, but if she was, that was the biggest question of them all."
    new "我不知道她为什么会在那里，可如果她真的在那里，那就是所有疑问中最大的一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:60545
    old "It's likely they'll all come back down. If she's here, I'll be able to see her.{w} She wasn't with the others in the storeroom, though. My past self and Shiroya were missing too..."
    new "他们多半都会下来。如果她在这里，我就能看见她。{w} 可她并不在储藏室那群人里。过去的我和 Shiroya 也不见了……"

    # game/script.rpy:60549
    old "They haven't come back yet. I have to assume they have access to the attic."
    new "他们还没回来。看来他们应该是能进阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:60550
    old "I decided that if nobody came after a while, I would quietly go up to see if I could find everyone.{w} But soon after that resolution, I thought I might've heard someone just outside the bathroom, separated from the rest."
    new "我决定，如果过了一会儿还没人来，就悄悄上楼看看能不能找到大家。{w} 可刚下定决心，我就觉得洗手间外似乎有人，和其余人分开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60552
    old "Did someone go to the crystal floor?"
    new "有人去水晶层了？"

    # game/script.rpy:60556
    old "I went out and walked halfway down the stairs."
    new "我走出去，沿楼梯下到一半。"

    # game/script.rpy:60559
    old "Through the gray door, I saw Sai in hallway A, going from room to room."
    new "透过灰色的门，我看见 Sai 在 A 走廊里，正一间间地查看。"

    # game/script.rpy:60560
    old "What the hell is he doing now?{w} And what the hell is everyone else doing, letting him roam around freely?"
    new "他他妈在干什么？{w} 其他人又是怎么回事，竟然让他自由行动？"

    # game/script.rpy:60561
    old "Was he the person who came out of that crystal room? If he traveled through time, he could've been there and in the storeroom at the same time.{w} But everyone had to see that person when they left A1. They would've reacted at seeing two of one person, and I guess it would've been a paradox..."
    new "他是不是那个从水晶展室里出来的人？如果他用了时间穿越，就可能同时待在那里和储藏室。{w} 但那人离开 A1 时，大家肯定都看见了。看到同一个人出现两个，他们不可能没有反应——我想那会形成悖论……"

    # game/script.rpy:60564
    old "This is strange. He's likely searching for the Sekimeiya, which means he didn't hide it in that cabinet. However, a search just happened, so why is he doing this? Does he not trust the results?"
    new "奇怪。他多半是在找 Sekimeiya，也就是说，他没有把它藏进那个展示柜。可是刚刚才搜查过，他为什么还这么做？是不相信搜查结果吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60565
    old "I guess that's not all. There must be another Sekimeiya somewhere..."
    new "看来还不止这些。别处一定还有另一个 Sekimeiya……"

    # game/script.rpy:60571
    old "I stepped away. I could still hear him moving downstairs, but the others were my concern."
    new "我走开了。楼下还能听见他走动的声响，但我更在意的是其他人。"

    # game/script.rpy:60575
    old "I kept waiting in the bathroom."
    new "我继续在洗手间里等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:60579
    old "If Sai sneaked away, they'll notice it pretty quickly. He probably came down to search for himself, and he might find the Sekimeiya I saw."
    new "Sai 要是偷偷溜走，他们很快就会察觉。他多半是自己下楼来搜，说不定会发现我看见的那个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:60580
    old "I wonder what he'll do if he actually does. It wasn't working, so he won't be able to activate it."
    new "真让他找到了，他会怎么做呢。那个已经失效，他也启动不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60581
    old "The sound of his movements no longer reached me. Bemused by the fact that I could still be patient, I waited for something to happen."
    new "他的动静再也传不到我这边。我居然还沉得住气，自己都觉得意外，就这样等着事情发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:60582
    old "I don't know what Sai's intentions could be. Surely he still has to learn everything about the Sekimeiya, but what is his ultimate goal? ...He was trying to achieve something all day, and I have no idea what."
    new "我不知道 Sai 究竟有什么打算。他必然还要弄清与 Sekimeiya 有关的一切，可他最终想达成什么？……他一整天都在设法做成某件事，我却毫无头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:60586
    old "Is that someone above me...?"
    new "上面有人……？"

    # game/script.rpy:60587
    old "For a second, I could discern footsteps coming from the ceiling."
    new "有一瞬，我隐约听出天花板那边传来脚步声。"

    # game/script.rpy:60588
    old "Is it the others...?"
    new "是其他人吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:60589
    old "The sound grew clearer: a group of people was coming down.{w} Once they went down the stairs, I slowly opened the door."
    new "声音渐渐清晰：一群人正往下走。{w}等他们下了楼梯，我才慢慢推开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:60594
    old "I couldn't see anyone in hallway A."
    new "A走廊里看不见任何人。"

    # game/script.rpy:60595
    old "They're not in hallway C either?"
    new "C走廊也没有？"

    # game/script.rpy:60596
    old "...any of the—{w} Can you he—"
    new "……这些里面有没有——{w}你听得见——"

    # game/script.rpy:60597
    old "Akaro's voice came from hallway B. From the stairs, I didn't have a good angle to observe."
    new "Akaro 的声音从 B走廊传来。我站在楼梯上，角度不好，看不真切。"

    # game/script.rpy:60598
    old "I chose not to step down. If I was more patient, I would see them from afar without showing myself."
    new "我决定不下去。再多等一会儿，我就能不露面，从远处看清他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:60602
    old "the hell...! ...seriously burning!"
    new "搞什么……！……烫得要命！"

    # game/script.rpy:60603
    old "Wait, did Katei find a Sekimeiya in hallway B?"
    new "等等，Katei 在 B走廊找到了一个 Sekimeiya？"

    # game/script.rpy:60604
    old "...it there?"
    new "……它在那边？"

    # game/script.rpy:60605
    old "And that's me. My past self is with them this time.{w} ...Where the hell is Sai, though?"
    new "那是我。这次和他们在一起的是过去的我。{w}……可 Sai 到底跑哪去了？"

    # game/script.rpy:60607
    old "...either."
    new "……我也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:60609
    old "...eed to leave this—"
    new "……得离开这里——"

    # game/script.rpy:60610
    old "They're walking away."
    new "他们走开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60611
    old "The sound of their footsteps was fading, when all of a sudden, a sharp sound split the air."
    new "脚步声渐渐远去，忽然，一声脆响划破了空气。"

    # game/script.rpy:60612
    old "What was that...? It came from hallway B too."
    new "那是什么声音……？也是从 B走廊传来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:60620
    old "I couldn't hear the others anymore. After waiting a bit behind the door, I stepped down cautiously."
    new "其他人的声音已经听不见了。我在门后又等了一阵，才小心翼翼地下了楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:60624
    old "It sounded like something fell to the floor..."
    new "听上去像有什么东西掉在了地上……"

    # game/script.rpy:60625
    old "It didn't seem like anyone was still there. After that sound, the crystal floor's characteristic silence had arisen."
    new "似乎已经没人在了。那声响过后，水晶层特有的寂静又笼罩下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:60629
    old "Keeping myself hidden, I peeked into hallway B.{w} Nobody was there, but I saw what had hit the floor next to the event room."
    new "我藏起身形，朝 B走廊里张望。{w}那里空无一人，但我看见了掉在活动室旁地上的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:60633
    old "Snowmelt"
    new "融雪"

    # game/script.rpy:60642
    old "It was a Sekimeiya."
    new "那是一个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:60643
    old "...What just happened? Did they touch it, so it fell when they disappeared?"
    new "……刚才到底怎么回事？是他们碰了它，消失时它才掉下来？"

    # game/script.rpy:60644
    old "That doesn't make sense, though..."
    new "可这说不通啊……"

    # game/script.rpy:60651
    old "...They wouldn't necessarily have come back here. Especially since they could've traveled to the future."
    new "……他们未必会回到这里。何况他们也可能穿越到了未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:60652
    old "What was strange was its color. It was white, and if they'd touched it, it would've been gray."
    new "奇怪的是它的颜色。它是白色的；要是他们碰过，就会变成灰色。"

    # game/script.rpy:60654
    old "Even though the Sekimeiya didn't work for me earlier, it could've been working now. It could also be another Sekimeiya."
    new "早先我碰它时它已经失效，此刻却可能正在运作。也可能这根本是另一个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:60657
    old "Its color... It's white.{w} If they had touched it, it would be gray."
    new "颜色……是白的。{w}要是被他们碰过，就该是灰色了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60659
    old "...Would it have teleported if they'd activated it? Not necessarily; it didn't when Sai and Shiroya traveled from the event room."
    new "……如果他们启动了它，它会传送过去吗？未必；Sai 和 Shiroya 从活动室穿越时，它就没跟过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:60664
    old "I approached it while scanning the area around me. Then, I felt it through my sleeve."
    new "我一边留意四周，一边走近，然后隔着衣袖碰了碰它。"

    # game/script.rpy:60666
    old "Damn, it's super hot, just like Katei said. There's no way they activated it."
    new "可恶，烫得厉害，和 Katei 说的一样。他们绝不可能启动过它。"

    # game/script.rpy:60667
    old "They had to have been going to the event room, so I opened its door."
    new "他们一定是往活动室去了，所以我打开了那扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:60671
    old "When I did, I hit something on the other side."
    new "门一开，我撞上了对面的什么东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:60680
    old "It was another Sekimeiya. However, it was powered off."
    new "又是一个 Sekimeiya。不过，它已经停用了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60681
    old "Oh, what?"
    new "哦？怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:60682
    old "...What happened? They touched this one instead?{w} Hang on, is this the one I found in the cabinet? If it's not working now, that means it was previously working."
    new "……怎么回事？他们碰的是这一个？{w}等等，这是我在展示柜里找到的那个吗？它现在失效，说明之前是能用的。"

    # game/script.rpy:60685
    old "The empty cabinet was uncovered..."
    new "空荡荡的展示柜露了出来……"

    # game/script.rpy:60691
    old "I went to room A1."
    new "我去了水晶展室 A1。"

    # game/script.rpy:60696
    old "Inside the same cabinet from before, a third Sekimeiya rested."
    new "先前那个展示柜里，静静躺着第三个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:60697
    old "What the hell...? There are three of them?"
    new "怎么回事……？居然有三个？"

    # game/script.rpy:60700
    old "I felt it through my sleeve as well. As I'd expected, it was cold."
    new "我也隔着衣袖碰了碰。果然，是凉的。"

    # game/script.rpy:60701
    old "So this one doesn't work?"
    new "这么说，这个不能用？"

    # game/script.rpy:60705
    old "Frowning, I went back to the event room. Two functional Sekimeiya were on the floor, close to each other."
    new "我皱着眉回到活动室。地板上放着两个还能用的 Sekimeiya，彼此相距不远。"

    # game/script.rpy:60707
    old "A vague idea had formed in my head during the hours I'd been waiting."
    new "等待的那几个小时里，脑中隐约浮起一个念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:60708
    old "Was I... right?"
    new "我……猜对了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60709
    old "Where was everyone? If they had traveled through time, where were they?"
    new "其他人呢？如果他们真的穿越了时间，人又在哪里？"

    # game/script.rpy:60710
    old "Wait, I have to see if I can find them. This is critical."
    new "等等，我得设法找到他们。这是关键。"

    # game/script.rpy:60714
    old "Focused on my thoughts, I walked through the crystal floor."
    new "我满脑子想着事情，穿行在水晶层中。"

    # game/script.rpy:60721
    old "Atsuki suspected that perhaps..."
    new "我猜想，或许……"

    # game/script.rpy:60729
    old "Is nobody here? ...What about Sai? Did he disappear with everyone else?"
    new "没人吗？……Sai 呢？他也跟其他人一起消失了？"

    # game/script.rpy:60733
    old "I had to look above too, so I grabbed both functional Sekimeiya and went up the stairs."
    new "楼上也得看看，于是我拿起两个还能用的 Sekimeiya，走上楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:60738
    old "I reached the attic and saw that the door was open. However, the key wasn't in the keyhole."
    new "到了阁楼，我发现门开着。可钥匙并不在锁孔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:60744
    old "Recent footprints were in the living room, but I couldn't hear anyone moving around."
    new "客厅里留着新鲜的脚印，却听不到有人走动的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:60749
    old "I looked in the kitchen, the bathroom, the storeroom, both bedrooms... They were all empty."
    new "我找过厨房、浴室、储藏室，还有两间卧室……全都空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:60753
    old "I... don't think the people who were in hallway B are currently here."
    new "我觉得……之前在B走廊的那些人，现在应该不在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:60757
    old "I sat on the sofa. The Sekimeiya I'd seen weren't there anymore, likely because they were the same ones I was holding."
    new "我在沙发上坐下。先前见过的那些 Sekimeiya 已经不见了，多半是因为它们就是我手上这两个。"

    # game/script.rpy:60762
    old "This world... it's clearly not the one I started in. Many things are happening differently."
    new "这个世界……显然不是我最初所在的那个。很多事情的走向都不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:60763
    old "I thought that maybe the past changed at some point. This would've led into the countless deviations I've noticed.{w} ...But there's something about this world that I recognize."
    new "我原以为，是过去在某个时刻被改变了。我察觉到的那些数不清的偏差，大概就由此而来。{w}……可这个世界里，有一点让我觉得熟悉。"

    # game/script.rpy:60764
    old "And, if I'm really recognizing something from this world, there's no way it was created after the first time I visited it."
    new "而且，如果那真是我认出的、属于这个世界的东西，那它绝不可能是在我第一次踏入这个世界之后才出现的。"

    # game/script.rpy:60767
    old "What Atsuki recognized from this world was..."
    new "Atsuki 在这个世界里认出的，是……"

    # game/script.rpy:60775
    old "Not the storeroom handle; he never saw it before his appearance in this world."
    new "不是储藏室的门把手——他来到这个世界之前，从未见过它。"

    # game/script.rpy:60777
    old "What I recognized from that world was Miiya's existence."
    new "我从那个世界里认出的，是 Miiya 的存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:60778
    old "Even though I haven't been able to see her, what I heard was her voice. I can't doubt that.{w} When that happened, everyone was there. In other words, Miiya's existence wasn't something anyone found strange—not even my past self."
    new "虽然我没能看见她，但我听到的是她的声音，这一点毋庸置疑。{w}那时所有人都在场。也就是说，Miiya 的存在对谁来说都不奇怪——包括过去的我。"

    # game/script.rpy:60779
    old "A while ago, Erina claimed she saw Miiya, but her reaction to that was appropriate. She said she didn't think Miiya had been in the tower before."
    new "刚才 Erina 说看见了 Miiya，但她的反应很自然。她说她以为 Miiya 之前并不在这座塔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:60780
    old "However, the same thing didn't occur shortly after that."
    new "可没过多久，同样的情形却不再出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:60801
    old "Sai and Akaro acted as if Miiya's existence was normal.{w} And that's not all. Akaro disappeared after that point, and when he appeared with different clothes after {time=21}, he said he hadn't been present at the last time I'd seen him."
    new "Sai 和 Akaro 的表现，就好像 Miiya 的存在理所当然。{w}不仅如此。那之后 Akaro 就消失了，而 {time=21} 过后，他换了一身衣服出现，还说，我最后一次见到他的时候，他并不在场。"

    # game/script.rpy:60802
    old "In addition, Sai's attitude at that time was different from how he behaved afterward."
    new "再者，Sai 当时的态度，和他后来的举止也不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:60804
    old "So, when did that happen? When did Miiya's existence become normal for the world?"
    new "那么，那是什么时候的事？从什么时候起，Miiya 的存在对这个世界来说变得理所当然了？"

    # game/script.rpy:60811
    old "When that happened, he and Shiroya appeared in the attic. At that point, though, Miiya's existence wasn't yet normal."
    new "那件事发生时，他和 Shiroya 出现在阁楼。不过在那个时候，Miiya 的存在还没有变得寻常。"

    # game/script.rpy:60813
    old "When that happened, he appeared in the event room. At that point, though, Miiya's existence wasn't yet normal."
    new "那件事发生时，他出现在活动室。但在那个时候，Miiya 的存在仍算不上寻常。"

    # game/script.rpy:60816
    old "Erina, Sai, Shiroya, and I were in the event room. At that point, everyone was surprised to hear Erina mention Miiya."
    new "Erina、Sai、Shiroya 和我当时都在活动室。听到 Erina 提起 Miiya，所有人都吃了一惊。"

    # game/script.rpy:60817
    old "When Erina touched the Sekimeiya, that changed. Both Sai and Akaro, who came from outside the room, found Miiya's existence to be an expected thing."
    new "Erina 碰到 Sekimeiya 之后，情况就变了。从室外进来的 Sai 和 Akaro，对 Miiya 的存在毫不意外。"

    # game/script.rpy:60818
    old "Once again, that's not all. There was another major change."
    new "而且还不止这些。还有一处重大的变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:60824
    old "It was Shiroya's existence. Sai and Akaro were shocked when they saw her, and perfectly in line with that, I haven't seen her here."
    new "那就是 Shiroya 的存在。Sai 和 Akaro 见到她时都愣住了，而我在这里也确实没见过她。"

    # game/script.rpy:60825
    old "...When Erina touched the Sekimeiya, something major occurred. I'm sure of that. The Sekimeiya had some hidden effect all this time."
    new "……Erina 碰到 Sekimeiya 的那一刻，发生了某种重大的事。这一点可以肯定。那个 Sekimeiya 一直以来都潜藏着某种效果。"

    # game/script.rpy:60826
    old "That effect occurred when Erina touched it. That was definitely the strangest travel of them all."
    new "那效果就在 Erina 触碰它时发动了。那无疑是所有穿越中最离奇的一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:60827
    old "Three major questions arose: why did Erina, Shiroya, and I not travel, but Sai did?{w} Why did the Sekimeiya teleport instantly back to its cabinet?{w} Why was the range bigger than it should've been?"
    new "三个疑问随之浮现：为什么 Erina、Shiroya 和我没有穿越，Sai 却穿越了？{w}为什么 Sekimeiya 会瞬间传送回展示柜？{w}为什么范围比应有的更大？"

    # game/script.rpy:60828
    old "Now I'm aware of a factor that I didn't consider at the time, which could be the answer to what happened."
    new "如今我意识到一个当时未曾考虑的因素，或许它正是那件事的答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:60836
    old "I don't believe Miiya's existence is the answer to those questions."
    new "我不认为 Miiya 的存在能解答那些疑问。"

    # game/script.rpy:60837
    old "It must be the second Sekimeiya."
    new "一定是第二个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:60839
    old "I don't believe traveling to the future is the answer to those questions."
    new "我不认为前往未来能解答那些疑问。"

    # game/script.rpy:60842
    old "The second Sekimeiya..."
    new "第二个 Sekimeiya……"

    # game/script.rpy:60843
    old "Before Erina touched the Sekimeiya, when we entered the event room, Shiroya and I were confused to see the Sekimeiya in the cabinet.{w} In my case, it was because I'd recently hidden it.{w} ...Specifically, in a locker in the staff room."
    new "Erina 触碰 Sekimeiya 之前，我们走进活动室时，Shiroya 和我看到展示柜里的 Sekimeiya，都感到困惑。{w} 我之所以困惑，是因为我不久前才把它藏起来。{w}……准确地说，是藏进了员工室的一个储物柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:60844
    old "When I saw it in the cabinet, I thought it must've teleported to its \"original place\", or where the cold temperature was.{w} The reality was..."
    new "看到它出现在展示柜里时，我以为它一定是传送回了“原本的位置”，也就是温度较低的地方。{w} 可事实却是……"

    # game/script.rpy:60851
    old "That's not it."
    new "不是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:60852
    old "...I don't think it was the same Sekimeiya. However, the one I hid in the staff room was working, and the one in the cabinet, which Erina touched, was working as well."
    new "……我觉得那不是同一个 Sekimeiya。可是，我藏在员工室的那个仍在运作，展示柜里 Erina 碰过的那个也同样在运作。"

    # game/script.rpy:60853
    old "So, I think that what I believe to be the main key to most of those questions is..."
    new "所以我想，那些疑问的关键，多半就在……"

    # game/script.rpy:60860
    old "Erina touched the Sekimeiya, but that shouldn't matter."
    new "Erina 碰过 Sekimeiya，但这一点应该无关紧要。"

    # game/script.rpy:60861
    old "The answer might be the location of both Sekimeiya."
    new "答案或许在于两个 Sekimeiya 所在的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:60863
    old "I'm not sure the Sekimeiya that was activated was the reason."
    new "我不确定被启动的那个 Sekimeiya 是不是原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:60866
    old "The location of the Sekimeiya... One was near the cabinet, and the other was in a locker."
    new "Sekimeiya 的位置……一个在展示柜附近，另一个在储物柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:60868
    old "How many people were in range? ...Actually, I don't think that has any relevance after all."
    new "当时有多少人在范围内？……不，仔细想来，那应该无关紧要。"

    # game/script.rpy:60869
    old "The answer might be the position of both Sekimeiya."
    new "答案或许在于两个 Sekimeiya 所在的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:60870
    old "The one in the event room spent fifteen minutes outside the cabinet. Meanwhile, as I had touched the one in the staff room at around {time=18:30}, it should've gathered power there for almost half an hour."
    new "活动室里的那个在展示柜外待了十五分钟。与此同时，我大约在 {time=18:30} 碰过员工室里的那个，所以它应该已经在那里蓄能将近半小时了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60878
    old "The range of the Sekimeiya Erina touched probably looked like this.{w} However, the hidden factor that I didn't account for..."
    new "Erina 碰过的那个 Sekimeiya，范围大概是这样。{w} 然而，还有一个我当时没考虑到的隐藏因素……"

    # game/script.rpy:60883
    old "...Was the Sekimeiya in the staff room.{w} It was in the rightmost set of lockers, and given the time it had been there, I imagine its range extended halfway through the event room."
    new "……就是员工室里的那个 Sekimeiya。{w} 它在最右侧的那排储物柜里；按它在那儿放的时间来算，它的范围应该已经覆盖到活动室的一半了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60887
    old "...{w}If this is what was special about that travel, then what happened to us?{w} Sai did travel because he was only within range of Erina's Sekimeiya. However, the rest of us didn't teleport through space or time."
    new "……{w}如果那次穿越的特殊之处就在这，那我们又经历了什么？{w} Sai 确实穿越了，因为他只在 Erina 那个 Sekimeiya 的范围内。可我们其余人并没有在空间或时间上传送。"

    # game/script.rpy:60897
    old "Instead, what changed was the world around us.{w} The Sekimeiya didn't teleport back to the cabinet—that was a mere illusion."
    new "真正改变的，是我们周围的世界。{w} Sekimeiya 并没有传送回展示柜——那不过是错觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:60902
    old "Then, I quickly went to check the locker and found out the Sekimeiya I'd hidden there was gone. That only contributed to the same illusion."
    new "随后我急忙去查看储物柜，发现藏在那里的 Sekimeiya 不见了。而这也只是加深了同一个错觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:60903
    old "I might be mistaken somewhere, but I don't think that was still the same world.{w} However, what happened later? We did reunite with the Sai who'd traveled in the event room, didn't we?{w} Similarly, Akaro and the other Sai weren't found again. It was as if we'd gone back to our world."
    new "也许我在某处弄错了，但我觉得那已经不是同一个世界。{w} 可是后来呢？我们确实和那位在活动室里穿越的 Sai 重逢了，不是吗？{w} 而 Akaro 和另一个 Sai 也再没被找到。就好像我们回到了自己的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:60910
    old "I wonder... Does that hypothesis solve every mystery surrounding that travel?{w} What about the range? It was bigger than previous fifteen-minute travels, wasn't it?{w} ...Two functional Sekimeiya existed.{w} If their ranges overlapped, the Sekimeiya's effect wouldn't just be time travel.{w} I think that could be right. It's not an idea that can only be applied in that instance."
    new "我在想……那个假设能解开围绕那次穿越的所有谜团吗？{w} 范围又该怎么解释？它比以往十五分钟的穿越更大，不是吗？{w}……当时有两个能运作的 Sekimeiya。{w} 如果它们的范围发生重叠，Sekimeiya 的效果就不只是时间穿越了。{w} 我觉得这有可能。这个想法不只适用于那一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:60911
    old "Where is everyone? The Sekimeiya was just activated when both of them were close to each other on the crystal floor, and it doesn't seem like the others are still in this tower.{w} How did I get to this world? Could it really be the same one we briefly visited?{w} This morning, Shiroya and I witnessed the Sekimeiya teleport. But that isn't what's been going on—the Sekimeiya isn't teleporting. It only appears that way because the entire world is changing."
    new "大家都去哪了？两个 Sekimeiya 在水晶层上彼此靠近时，其中一个刚被启动，而其他人似乎已经不在这座塔里了。{w} 我是怎么来到这个世界的？难道这真的是我们短暂造访过的那个世界？{w} 今天早晨，Shiroya 和我亲眼看见 Sekimeiya 传送。可事情并不是这样——Sekimeiya 并没有在传送。它看起来是这样，只是因为整个世界都在改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:60914
    old "When it happened, we found the Sekimeiya inside a cabinet in room B4. It's very possible the other one was hidden nearby.{w} That's why Naomi was running to the attic with both Sekimeiya immediately after it disappeared.{w} We chased her up, but in the attic's staircase, Shiroya disappeared.{w} When I looked at the living room, both Sekimeiya were next to each other, and one of them was gray. As a result, neither Naomi nor Shiroya are here."
    new "那件事发生时，我们在 B4房间的展示柜里发现了 Sekimeiya。另一个很可能就藏在附近。{w} 所以它一消失，Naomi 就带着两个 Sekimeiya 跑向阁楼。{w} 我们追了上去，可就在阁楼的楼梯上，Shiroya 消失了。{w} 我看向客厅时，两个 Sekimeiya 并排放在一起，其中一个已经变成灰色。结果，Naomi 和 Shiroya 都不在这里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60915
    old "Lastly, though... this would answer the question of how Naomi's corpse appeared two times.{w} If Naomi touched the Sekimeiya and the world around her changed, she would've appeared in the attic. Her keys had been left behind, so she had no way to leave.{w} That's what happened. That's what we saw on the floor of the living room. That's why we found Naomi dead twice.{w} The Naomi that Shiroya disappeared with was one of the two bodies that we found dead. ...Does this mean that version of Shiroya was there since the beginning?"
    new "最后……这也能解释 Naomi 的尸体为何会出现两次。{w} 如果 Naomi 触碰了 Sekimeiya，周围的世界随之改变，她就会出现在阁楼里。她的钥匙被留在了原地，所以她没法离开。{w} 事情就是这样。那就是我们在客厅地板上看到的情景。也正因如此，我们才会两次发现 Naomi 死去。{w} 和 Shiroya 一起消失的那个 Naomi，就是我们发现的两具尸体之一。……这是否意味着，那个 Shiroya 从一开始就在那里？"

    # game/script.rpy:60922
    old "\"The Naomi that Shiroya disappeared with was one of the two bodies that we found dead.\""
    new "“和 Shiroya 一起消失的那个 Naomi，就是我们发现的两具尸体之一。”"

    # game/script.rpy:60923
    old "That is..."
    new "那就是……"

    # game/script.rpy:60931
    old "Unfortunately, it is not correct. While it's understandable for Atsuki to have made that mistake, I thought perhaps you had realized the flaw."
    new "很遗憾，这不对。Atsuki 犯这个错情有可原，不过我原以为你已经看出破绽了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60933
    old "Indeed, it is incorrect. While it's understandable for Atsuki to have made that mistake, I figured you would've realized the flaw."
    new "确实不对。Atsuki 会犯这个错可以理解，但我本以为你已经看出破绽了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60937
    old "...So, if I activate the Sekimeiya right now, will I go back to the other world?"
    new "……那么，如果我现在启动 Sekimeiya，我会回到另一个世界吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60938
    old "When Shiroya disappeared, she wasn't in the living room yet, meaning that she didn't leave any footprints..."
    new "Shiroya 消失时，她还没有进客厅，也就是说她没有留下任何脚印……"

    # game/script.rpy:60939
    old "I wondered earlier how I'd be here for twelve hours without being found when the searches we executed would've found me. Of course, in this world, this doesn't apply. Everyone is gone."
    new "我之前还在想，既然我们展开的搜索应该能找到我，我怎么可能在这里待了十二个小时还没被发现。当然，在这个世界里，这并不适用。所有人都不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:60940
    old "Where are they, though? Am I really correct in what I'm thinking?{w} Everyone who was in hallway B is no longer in this world. If that is the case, are they in the world I came from?"
    new "可是，他们去哪了？我的想法真的正确吗？{w} 原本在B走廊的所有人都不在这个世界了。如果是这样，他们是在我来的那个世界吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60941
    old "Is that possible? ...It might be, but it doesn't feel right. After all, if this is the world where I was when Erina touched the Sekimeiya, Sai and Akaro must eventually come back."
    new "有这种可能吗？……也许有，可总觉得不对。毕竟，如果这里就是 Erina 触碰 Sekimeiya 时我所在的世界，那么 Sai 和 Akaro 终究会回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:60944
    old "It was a speculative mess, especially because I couldn't prove anything. However, the fundamental basis that I was working with seemed correct."
    new "那只是一团乱糟糟的推测，何况我什么都证明不了。不过，我所依据的基本前提似乎没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:60945
    old "What exactly were the body double mysteries? I can't understand Shiroya's case at all, and I'm not sure about Sai's.{w} Isla's, though... Could her \"friend\" have been the Isla from this world?"
    new "那些替身之谜究竟是怎么回事？Shiroya 的情况我完全想不通，Sai 的我也说不准。{w} 但 Isla 的……她那位“朋友”会不会就是这个世界的 Isla？"

    # game/script.rpy:60946
    old "\"From this world\"... I don't know what the hell to think, and that's mostly due to the most blatant example: the second Akaro.{w} The Akaro who had different memories and disappeared from the bedroom. Did he come from a different world in the way that I'm thinking?{w} If so, he couldn't have been the Akaro from this world because he didn't know who Katei was, but he did know Shiroya."
    new "“来自这个世界”……我根本不知道该怎么想，而这多半是因为最明显的例子：第二个 Akaro。{w} 那个记忆不同、从卧室里消失的 Akaro。他是不是以我所想的那种方式，来自另一个世界？{w} 若是如此，他就不可能是这个世界的 Akaro，因为他不认识 Katei，却认识 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:60951
    old "Now, what have you been thinking all this time? Do you have your own answers?"
    new "那么，你一直以来都在想些什么？你自己有答案了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:60952
    old "First off, what is the explanation behind that Akaro?"
    new "首先，那个 Akaro 究竟该怎么解释？"

    # game/script.rpy:60960
    old "Correct.{w} A world beyond Atsuki's knowledge."
    new "正确。{w} 那是 Atsuki 认知之外的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:60963
    old "The explanation is a world beyond Atsuki's knowledge."
    new "答案在于 Atsuki 认知之外的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:60964
    old "So, where did that Akaro come from?{w} Could he have come from a world without Katei?{w} If that's it, though, this is too fucking confusing! Could changing worlds bring me to any kind of world? There could be infinite worlds, and the Sekimeiya could act as random bridges between them!"
    new "那么，那个 Akaro 是从哪来的？{w} 他会不会来自一个没有 Katei 的世界？{w} 可要真是这样，这也太他妈让人糊涂了！世界切换会把我带到任何一种世界吗？世界也许有无数个，而 Sekimeiya 可能在它们之间随机架起桥梁！"

    # game/script.rpy:60966
    old "Now, tell him. Although he can't hear you, tell him why he's wrong."
    new "现在，告诉他。就算他听不见，也要告诉他错在哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:60975
    old "Yes. Only three different worlds exist."
    new "没错。不同的世界只有三个。"

    # game/script.rpy:60976
    old "How did you know that, though? How could you be sure of such a powerful assertion?"
    new "不过，你是怎么知道的？这么笃定的判断，你怎么能保证？"

    # game/script.rpy:60978
    old "No. The answer is three."
    new "不。答案是三。"

    # game/script.rpy:60979
    old "Now that you know, perhaps you have an idea of how you could've asserted that fact."
    new "既然你已经知道了，或许也明白自己本来能怎样断定这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:60990
    old "...Why is it proven that there are not infinite worlds? Why can't a fourth one exist?"
    new "……凭什么说世界不是无限的？为什么不能存在第四个？"

    # game/script.rpy:60991
    old "Because the three worlds loop. Congratulations."
    new "因为三个世界构成了循环。恭喜。"

    # game/script.rpy:60992
    old "That is the essential core of the universe you've witnessed. Through the Sekimeiya, the link between three worlds looped. The three sides of the mountain spun around, leading to a single peak."
    new "这就是你所见证的宇宙的核心本质。借助 Sekimeiya，三个世界之间的联结形成了循环。山的三个侧面旋转交汇，最终归于同一座峰顶。"

    # game/script.rpy:60995
    old "It is because the three worlds loop. That is the essential core of the universe you've witnessed.{w} Through the Sekimeiya, the link between three worlds looped. The three sides of the mountain spun around, leading to a single peak."
    new "因为三个世界构成了循环。这就是你所见证的宇宙的核心本质。{w} 借助 Sekimeiya，三个世界之间的联结形成了循环。山的三个侧面旋转交汇，最终归于同一座峰顶。"

    # game/script.rpy:60998
    old "But that doesn't answer all the questions, does it? Why only three worlds?"
    new "但这并不能解答所有疑问，不是吗？为什么偏偏只有三个世界？"

    # game/script.rpy:61000
    old "Atsuki correctly figured out the Sekimeiya's core secret.{w} In each world, two Sekimeiya existed. When one was activated, the active range sent anyone encompassed in it through time.{w} However, if both ranges overlapped, whoever found themselves present within both were not transported through time and space, but through worlds."
    new "Atsuki 准确解开了 Sekimeiya 的核心秘密。{w} 每个世界里都存在两个 Sekimeiya。激活其中一个时，生效范围会将范围内的人送往另一段时间。{w} 然而，若两个范围发生重叠，同时处在两者之中的人便不会被送往另一个时间，而是会被送往另一个世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:61001
    old "This effect is called a world switch, although the full extent of the name might not make a lot of sense to you yet.{w} Like everything about the Sekimeiya, the world switch hid many secrets of its own. Of course, you may have figured some of them out with the tools you were given."
    new "这种现象被称为世界切换，不过这个名称的全部含义，你现在或许还无法完全理解。{w} 如同 Sekimeiya 的一切，世界切换本身也藏着许多秘密。当然，凭借手中的工具，你可能已经解开了其中一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:61009
    old "There is one world in which only Atsuki is found alive in the tower. He is suspected of having been behind multiple crimes, but his life is suddenly cut short as he looks through a window."
    new "有一个世界里，塔中唯一被找到的活人是 Atsuki。他虽被怀疑是数起案件的主谋，却就在望向窗外时突然丧命。"

    # game/script.rpy:61010
    old "That world will be called \"A\"."
    new "那个世界就称为“A”。"

    # game/script.rpy:61014
    old "If that world is \"A\", then the world in which everyone survived and left the tower..."
    new "如果那个世界是“A”，那么那个所有人都幸存下来、离开塔的世界……"

    # game/script.rpy:61020
    old "No. That world is \"C\"."
    new "不。那个世界是“C”。"

    # game/script.rpy:61023
    old "\"B\" is the world in which the recorder was present. At {time=21}, Atsuki, Sai, and Erina weren't able to escape."
    new "“B”是录音笔所在的世界。到了 {time=21}，Atsuki、Sai 和 Erina 没能逃出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:61025
    old "Exactly. It is \"C\"."
    new "没错，就是“C”。"

    # game/script.rpy:61028
    old "Then, \"B\" is the world in which the recorder was present. At {time=21}, Atsuki, Sai, and Erina weren't able to escape."
    new "那么，“B”就是录音笔所在的世界。到了 {time=21}，Atsuki、Sai 和 Erina 没能逃出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:61032
    old "By world switching from world A, people were brought to..."
    new "从 A世界发生世界切换后，众人被带到了……"

    # game/script.rpy:61038
    old "Yes. This is the way the worlds looped."
    new "对。世界就是这样循环起来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:61040
    old "Incorrect. The answer is \"B\"."
    new "不对，答案是“B”。"

    # game/script.rpy:61041
    old "You've seen a few instances of full loops. Miiya's group went from their own world, C, to world A. From world A they went to world B, and then from world B they went back to world C.{w} Shiroya, after traveling from January 5th to December 15th, went from world B to world C with Atsuki. In the attic, she went from world C to world A with Naomi, and she finally returned alone to world B. The order is A - B - C - A."
    new "你已经见过几次完整的循环。Miiya 一行人从她们所在的 C世界前往 A世界。接着从 A世界到 B世界，再从 B世界回到 C世界。{w} Shiroya 从1月5日穿越到12月15日后，与 Atsuki 一同从 B世界来到 C世界。在阁楼里，她又和 Naomi 从 C世界到了 A世界，最后独自返回 B世界。顺序是 A - B - C - A。"

    # game/script.rpy:61042
    old "Worlds A and C were drastically different, as the worlds followed an intrinsic progression with each other. However, as strange as it might seem, there was only a single degree of separation between C and A."
    new "A世界与 C世界截然不同，因为各个世界之间遵循着一种内在的递进关系。然而，说来奇怪，C 与 A 之间却只隔了一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:61051
    old "There is, isn't there? I'm sure you can find instances that didn't follow that order—all of which had something in common."
    new "确实有，不是吗？我相信你能找到一些不按这个顺序发生的例子——它们都有共同点。"

    # game/script.rpy:61053
    old "You don't think so? Can you not find any instances that didn't follow that order?{w} They do exist. If you find them, perhaps you'll notice what they had in common."
    new "你不这么认为？难道找不到不按这个顺序发生的例子吗？{w} 那样的例子确实存在。只要找出来，或许你就会注意到它们的共同点。"

    # game/script.rpy:61057
    old "The incident at the tower happened in all three worlds, but the outcome was vastly different.{w} Why?"
    new "塔中的事件在三个世界里都发生过，结果却大相径庭。{w} 为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:61058
    old "The major difference in world A..."
    new "A世界的主要差异在于……"

    # game/script.rpy:61064
    old "In world A, many people died. The major difference from the beginning was Katei's absence."
    new "在 A世界，许多人丧命。从一开始，最大的不同就是 Katei 不在。"

    # game/script.rpy:61066
    old "The major difference from the beginning was Katei's absence."
    new "从一开始，最大的不同就是 Katei 不在。"

    # game/script.rpy:61068
    old "In world A, only one Naomi was found. The major difference from the beginning was Katei's absence."
    new "在 A世界，只找到了一个 Naomi。从一开始，最大的不同就是 Katei 不在。"

    # game/script.rpy:61071
    old "Katei put his plan into action: he put both real Sekimeiya in the suitcase he had prepared and moved to the secret door in the storeroom."
    new "Katei 开始执行他的计划：他把两个真正的 Sekimeiya 装进准备好的手提箱，然后来到储藏室的暗门前。"

    # game/script.rpy:61072
    old "He felt the handle, but he quickly realized he had dropped the key in the hallway."
    new "他摸到门把手，却很快意识到钥匙掉在了走廊里。"

    # game/script.rpy:61075
    old "While he was searching for it, Naomi found the suitcase and took it."
    new "就在他寻找钥匙时，Naomi 发现了手提箱，把它拿走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61078
    old "Then, when Katei found the key, he attempted to unlock the secret door."
    new "随后，Katei 找到钥匙，试图打开暗门。"

    # game/script.rpy:61082
    old "And he did. He was able to leave."
    new "他成功了，得以离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:61087
    old "But he didn't step out. He saw the Sekimeiya had been taken before hearing Naomi's movements. His plan had been very close to succeeding, so he panicked."
    new "但他没有迈出去。还没听到 Naomi 的动静，他就发现 Sekimeiya 已被拿走。计划本来只差一点就能成功，他因此慌了神。"

    # game/script.rpy:61090
    old "He ran behind her desperately, but Naomi had a safe place: the attic."
    new "他拼命追在她身后，但 Naomi 有一个安全的去处：阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:61093
    old "He chased her up, but he recognized that going all the way was a mistake. He could never enter the final floor."
    new "他一路追上去，却意识到一直追到顶是个错误。他根本进不了最顶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:61094
    old "He tripped in the staircase leading to the fourth floor and distractedly walked back without realizing he'd dropped yet another key."
    new "他在通往四楼的楼梯上绊了一跤，心神恍惚地往回走，浑然不觉自己又掉了一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:61102
    old "The security room's."
    new "监控室的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:61104
    old "That isn't right. Katei didn't have that key.{w} He dropped the security room's."
    new "不对。Katei 没有那把钥匙。{w} 他掉的是监控室的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:61106
    old "That isn't right. He dropped the security room's."
    new "不对。他掉的是监控室的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:61107
    old "You remember that Atsuki found it there, but that didn't happen in world A, did it? That was in world C.{w} You might know who found the key in world A. It was Akaro. Although many things were different, Atsuki only came across it in world C because Katei had been staring at the floor, and he wasn't there in world A."
    new "你记得是 Atsuki 在那里发现了钥匙，但这件事并没有发生在 A 世界，对吧？那是在 C 世界。{w} 你也许知道 A 世界里是谁发现了钥匙：Akaro。虽然许多事情都不一样，但 Atsuki 之所以会在 C 世界偶然发现钥匙，是因为 Katei 当时一直盯着地板看，而 A 世界里没有 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:61109
    old "His mind threatening to collapse in on itself, Katei realized his only option was to escape from the building as quickly as possible."
    new "Katei 的精神几乎要崩溃，他明白自己只有一条路：尽快逃出这栋建筑。"

    # game/script.rpy:61113
    old "He left through the storeroom before the others woke up. Outside, he was fast enough to meet up with everyone else who'd evacuated. He knew the floor 2 cameras had recorded him, but he was confident he could take care of that at {time=21.}"
    new "其他人醒来之前，他从储藏室离开了。到了外面，他跑得够快，追上了其他已经疏散出来的人。他知道二楼的监控拍到了自己，但有把握在 {time=21.} 处理好。"

    # game/script.rpy:61118
    old "Meanwhile, in world C, everything happened similarly. However, when Katei attempted to unlock the storeroom door, he couldn't. Something prevented him from doing so.{w} Like in world A, he heard Naomi's movements and chased her up, dropping the key in the same staircase."
    new "与此同时，C 世界里的一切也大致相同。然而，Katei 试图打开储藏室的门时却没能成功。有什么东西阻碍了他。{w} 就像在 A 世界一样，他听见 Naomi 的动静后追了上去，又在那段楼梯上掉了钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:61121
    old "...So, what about world B? What happened to the security room key in that world?"
    new "……那么 B 世界呢？监控室的钥匙在那个世界怎么样了？"

    # game/script.rpy:61126
    old "The truth is that Katei didn't drop it."
    new "其实，Katei 并没有丢掉那把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:61127
    old "How is that possible? Why did that differ between worlds?"
    new "怎么可能？为什么不同世界会有这种差异？"

    # game/script.rpy:61128
    old "The answer is tied to something else that only occurred in B."
    new "答案与另一件只在 B 世界发生的事有关。"

    # game/script.rpy:61134
    old "...It was the handle's removal.{w} In world B, Katei went to the secret door, ready to leave. However, he immediately felt it with his hand: the handle wasn't there."
    new "……问题出在门把手上。{w} 在 B 世界，Katei 来到暗门前，准备离开。然而他伸手一摸，立刻察觉：门把手不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61135
    old "He couldn't believe it—he had been outsmarted. Speechless, he froze in place."
    new "他不敢相信——自己竟被人抢先一步。他一句话也说不出，僵在原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:61136
    old "Of course, as the keyhole had been in the handle, he couldn't even attempt to unlock the door. That is why he didn't notice that he'd dropped the rusty key in hallway A, and it's why Naomi didn't have the chance to take his suitcase."
    new "钥匙孔本就开在把手上，他连试着开锁都做不到。也正因如此，他没察觉自己把生锈的钥匙掉在了 A 走廊；也正因如此，Naomi 才没机会拿走他的手提箱。"

    # game/script.rpy:61139
    old "He understood that he would have to stay in the tower, but he didn't immediately give up. Xyn's Sekimeiya was still in the event room, and perhaps he could make use of it.{w} Katei sighed deeply, trying to figure out who could've known about the storeroom's secret."
    new "他明白自己只能留在塔里，却没有就此放弃。Xyn 的 Sekimeiya 还在活动室，或许还能派上用场。{w}Katei 深深叹了口气，思索着究竟有谁会知道储藏室的秘密。"

    # game/script.rpy:61142
    old "Before anyone could see him, he went to a crystal room in hallway B; he had been told that refrigeration was essential to keep the Sekimeiya stable."
    new "趁没人看见，他去了 B 走廊的一间水晶展室；他听说过，要让 Sekimeiya 保持稳定，冷藏必不可少。"

    # game/script.rpy:61143
    old "He had independently learned that Ashiya had two identical Sekimeiya, but it wasn't public knowledge. Hence, abusing Xyn's plan still seemed feasible: he could keep a Sekimeiya for himself as long as Ashiya found Xyn's fake in the cabinet. That was why he left each Sekimeiya inside different cabinets in room B4."
    new "他私下打听到，芦屋手上有两个一模一样的 Sekimeiya，但这件事并未公开。因此，他觉得仍可把 Xyn 的计划反过来利用：只要芦屋在展示柜里找到 Xyn 的赝品，他就能私吞一个 Sekimeiya。正因如此，他把两个 Sekimeiya 分别放进了水晶展室 B4 的两个展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:61147
    old "He came to the conclusion that it was a good idea to let the suitcase be found. As he disposed of it, he heard a sound coming from the crystal room he'd just been in."
    new "他断定，让人发现那只手提箱反倒有利。就在他处理手提箱时，听见自己刚离开的水晶展室传来声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:61150
    old "He ran there and saw one of the Sekimeiya on the floor: Atsuki and Shiroya had just world switched to world C."
    new "他跑回去，看见其中一个 Sekimeiya 落在地上：Atsuki 和 Shiroya 刚刚切换到了 C 世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:61151
    old "He couldn't comprehend it. The Sekimeiya was gray, but nobody was there. Nobody could've escaped after he'd heard the sound."
    new "他无法理解。那是个灰色 Sekimeiya，可现场空无一人。他听到声音之后，不可能有人已经逃掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:61154
    old "Yet, one of the cabinets was open...{w} It was impossible anyone had been there, and the cabinet's temperature hadn't even cooled off yet. He hurriedly put the Sekimeiya back in, still trying to process what could've happened."
    new "然而，有一个展示柜敞开着……{w}刚才不可能有人在那里，柜里的温度甚至还没降下来。他匆匆把 Sekimeiya 放回去，脑中仍在琢磨究竟发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:61157
    old "When he left the room, he saw Erina's group on the floor of the hallway. She was moving slightly, so Katei felt trapped. He didn't want her to wake up and see him leaving.{w} Slowly, he walked over and crouched beside the three incapacitated people."
    new "他走出展室，看见 Erina 一行人倒在走廊的地上。她微微动着，Katei 顿时觉得自己被困住了。他不愿她醒来时撞见自己离开。{w}他缓缓走过去，在那三个失去意识的人身旁蹲下。"

    # game/script.rpy:61163
    old "So, doesn't this beg the same question? Why was the handle taken off in B?"
    new "那么，这不就引出同一个问题了吗？B世界的门把手为什么会被卸下来？"

    # game/script.rpy:61164
    old "To begin with, who do you think was responsible for that?"
    new "那么首先，你觉得是谁干的？"

    # game/script.rpy:61172
    old "Yes. It was Akaro A."
    new "没错。是 Akaro A 干的。"

    # game/script.rpy:61174
    old "That's not right.{w} The person who removed the secret door's handle in world B was Akaro A."
    new "不对。{w}在B世界卸下暗门把手的人，是 Akaro A。"

    # game/script.rpy:61176
    old "He was the main person behind the attack. In his world, however, Xyn were outsmarted.{w} The alarm Xyn didn't know about went off, and the Sekimeiya Akaro had hidden in the cleaning cart was taken."
    new "他是这次袭击的主谋。然而在他的世界里，Xyn 却反遭算计。{w}Xyn 并不知道的警报响了，Akaro 藏在清洁车里的 Sekimeiya 也被人拿走。"

    # game/script.rpy:61179
    old "Who had been responsible? For a while, Akaro had no idea."
    new "那究竟是谁干的？有一阵子，Akaro 毫无头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:61182
    old "However, eventually, he world switched to B with Isla."
    new "不过，他最终还是和 Isla 一起世界切换到了B世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:61193
    old "In that world, he was surprised to find out the attic was unlocked, and even more so to see that everyone was taking shelter inside a bedroom.{w} There, he learned about two things: Katei's presence in the tower and the existence of the storeroom's secret.{w} Naturally, he knew who Katei Kuiji was, but he shouldn't have been there. Akaro had suspected someone from Ashiya had hindered their plan, so he was internally taken aback when he heard details about that world's events."
    new "在那个世界，他惊讶地发现阁楼没有上锁，更惊讶的是所有人都在一间卧室里避难。{w}在那里，他得知了两件事：Katei 就在塔里，以及储藏室藏有一道暗门。{w}他自然知道 Katei Kuiji 是什么人，但那人本不该出现在那里。Akaro 一直怀疑是芦屋的人妨碍了他们的计划，所以听到那个世界里那场事件的细节时，他心里暗暗一惊。"

    # game/script.rpy:61203
    old "Soon, that Akaro traveled to the past and appeared on the 24th of November. You remember what Shiroya thought, don't you?"
    new "不久之后，那个 Akaro 穿越到过去，出现在了11月24日。你还记得 Shiroya 当时是怎么想的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:61204
    old "Out of nowhere, he appeared in a detention cell, but he was able to leave it. Then, he realized he was in the far past.{w} He recalled the times Katei had chosen to speak to Ido: he must've been who had interfered with Xyn's plan."
    new "他毫无征兆地出现在一间拘留室里，却顺利离开了。随后他意识到，自己身处遥远的过去。{w}他回想起 Katei 几次主动找 Ido 说话的情形：干扰 Xyn 计划的人，一定就是他。"

    # game/script.rpy:61207
    old "Katei hadn't been in the tower, yet everyone had eventually claimed he'd been there since the start. It wasn't hard to suspect the truth.{w} However, Akaro still couldn't believe what he'd done. In the tower, desperate to fulfill Xyn's plan..."
    new "Katei 本不在塔里，可到头来所有人都说他从一开始就在。要猜到真相并不难。{w}然而，Akaro 仍不敢相信自己做了什么。在塔里，他为了完成 Xyn 的计划不惜一切……"

    # game/script.rpy:61208
    old "How had Shiroya come back to life? ...And she had clearly been aware of what he'd done.{w} Why had she not said anything, then? Akaro had no idea why she had come back, but he had been next to her and Atsuki for hours; he'd seen how they'd turned out after he'd caused the death of their friend."
    new "Shiroya 是怎么死而复生的？……而且她显然知道他做过什么。{w}那她为什么一句都没说？Akaro 完全不明白她为何会回来，但他曾在 Shiroya 和 Atsuki 身边待了好几个小时；他亲眼看到，在自己害死他们的朋友之后，两人变成了什么样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:61209
    old "At first, when he appeared in November, Akaro thought of what to do. He could take advantage of it—he knew what would happen.{w} Yet his remorse soon overcame him. His greatest wish was to walk away, and he had the opportunity to do so. The plan was going to be a failure, but he was no longer in his world. Perhaps he could let his other self take the blame while he tried to atone for his actions..."
    new "刚出现在11月时，Akaro 还在盘算该怎么办。他本可以利用这一切——他知道接下来会发生什么。{w}可愧疚很快压过了这个念头。他最大的心愿就是一走了之，而现在他正好有这样的机会。计划注定要失败，但他已不在自己的世界里。或许他可以让另一个自己去背这个罪责，而自己设法赎罪……"

    # game/script.rpy:61215
    old "Of course, due to a certain perspective you've viewed, you know that's not what happened."
    new "当然，从你先前看到的某个视角来看，你知道事情并没有那样发展。"

    # game/script.rpy:61223
    old "In any case, Akaro's actions significantly changed the start of world B's incident. Katei didn't know he'd dropped the rusty key, and Naomi didn't run to the attic with the suitcase."
    new "总之，Akaro 的举动大大改变了B世界那场事件的开端。Katei 不知道自己弄丢了生锈的钥匙，Naomi 也没有拎着手提箱跑向阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:61226
    old "In worlds A and C, however, the same thing occurred. In the attic, Naomi touched the Sekimeiya and world switched.{w} When Naomi A touched it, she appeared in world B. Her keys remained in world A, and the elevator was disabled. Until that changed, she was trapped up there.{w} From her point of view, both Sekimeiya disappeared, as she brought the suitcase along as one of her possessions."
    new "然而在A世界和C世界，发生的是同一件事。Naomi 在阁楼触碰到 Sekimeiya，世界切换了。{w}Naomi A 触碰它时，出现在B世界。Naomi A 的钥匙留在了A世界，电梯也无法使用。在情况改变之前，她一直被困在上面。{w}在她看来，两个 Sekimeiya 都消失了，因为她是把手提箱当作随身物品一起带过来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:61231
    old "However, Naomi C's outcome was different.{w} She world switched to world A, and the range encompassed Shiroya as well.{w} Even though the attic was locked, they weren't trapped. Not only did Shiroya have the key, but so did Naomi: although she'd changed worlds, she grabbed the keys Naomi A had left behind, unaware they were no longer hers."
    new "但 Naomi C 的结果不同。{w}她世界切换到了A世界，重叠范围也把 Shiroya 包含了进去。{w}尽管阁楼上了锁，她们却没有被困住。Shiroya 有钥匙，Naomi 也有：她虽已换了世界，却顺手拿上了 Naomi A 留下的钥匙，并不知道那已不属于她。"

    # game/script.rpy:61233
    old "In addition, she brought the suitcase along too, but the Sekimeiya Naomi A had used were both still there. As both Naomis world switched at exactly the same time, for Naomi C, it only seemed as though the Sekimeiya she'd touched turned gray, even though it was the one Naomi A had activated.{w} Instinctively, what she did was touch the other Sekimeiya, unable to believe her finger had changed a gem's color. When she did, she traveled through time: since one of the Sekimeiya was powered off, there was no world switch."
    new "此外，她也把手提箱带了过来，但 Naomi A 用过的两个 Sekimeiya 都还在原处。由于两个 Naomi 是在同一瞬间切换世界的，在 Naomi C 看来，就只是自己碰过的那个 Sekimeiya 变成了灰色，尽管那其实是 Naomi A 激活的那一个。{w}她无法相信自己的手指能让宝石变色，便本能地去碰了另一个 Sekimeiya。这一碰，她穿越了时间：因为其中一个 Sekimeiya 已经断电，所以没有发生世界切换。"

    # game/script.rpy:61240
    old "Although these beginning sequences evolved into drastically different days, some of the differences between worlds came from before the 15th."
    new "这些开端虽然发展成了截然不同的几天，但世界之间的某些差异，早在15日之前就已经存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:61241
    old "Isla's friend only existed in world B. In the other worlds, Isla hadn't been assured everything would go smoothly; nobody had told her she'd be able to touch the Sekimeiya. Hence, her mood was more dampened, and Erina's was lighter."
    new "Isla 的朋友只存在于B世界。在其他世界，没人向 Isla 保证一切都会顺利，也没人告诉她可以触碰 Sekimeiya。因此她情绪更低落，Erina 反倒轻松些。"

    # game/script.rpy:61242
    old "Sai sniffed out that something would occur on the day of the event. However, only in world B was he certain—he had read a forum thread that foretold what would unfold in the tower. In that world, he was much more active from the start."
    new "Sai 察觉到活动当天会出事。但只有在B世界，他才确信无疑——他读过一篇论坛帖子，预告了塔中将会发生什么。在那个世界，他从一开始就活跃得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:61243
    old "In world A, Akaro couldn't see Katei as his enemy, so his attitude toward the others was rougher and sterner.{w} In addition, the article detailing his escape from prison only existed in world B."
    new "在A世界，Akaro 无法把 Katei 视为敌人，所以他对待其他人的态度更加粗暴严厉。{w}此外，详细报道他越狱的那篇文章只存在于B世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:61244
    old "In world C, Katei's Sekimeiya were taken by Naomi, so his priorities were very different. In world B, Katei had to step up to Erina's group, while in world C, he saw room A5 by himself before everyone else regained consciousness."
    new "在C世界，Katei 的 Sekimeiya 被 Naomi 拿走了，所以他的当务之急就截然不同了。在B世界，Katei 不得不挺身面对 Erina 一行人；而在C世界，他趁其他人还没恢复意识，独自去查看了水晶展室 A5。"

    # game/script.rpy:61248
    old "Do you think there's a relation between all these changes?"
    new "你觉得这些变化之间有关联吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:61254
    old "There certainly is one: they were all caused by someone from another world."
    new "当然有关联：它们全都出自另一个世界来的人之手。"

    # game/script.rpy:61256
    old "That's it. They were caused by someone from another world."
    new "正是如此。这些变化都是另一个世界来的人造成的。"

    # game/script.rpy:61258
    old "No, they had an origin. The actual relation is that they were all caused by someone from another world."
    new "不，它们是有源头的。真正的关联在于，它们全都是另一个世界的人造成的。"

    # game/script.rpy:61262
    old "Up to the 24th of November, all the worlds were identical.{w} You might be familiar with the many-worlds interpretation. According to it, every choice splits the world, leading into infinite worlds which are infinitely different."
    new "在11月24日之前，所有世界都完全相同。{w}你或许听说过多重世界诠释。照这种说法，每一个选择都会分裂世界，衍生出无穷多个彼此千差万别的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:61263
    old "In these three worlds, the initial difference came in November of 2011, and it was caused due to someone who had world switched from another world.{w} In other words, there was no change that wasn't influenced by another world—if zero world switches had occurred, each of the three worlds would've remained identical."
    new "在这三个世界中，最初的差异出现在2011年11月，起因是有人从另一个世界切换而来。{w}换句话说，任何变化都受到另一个世界的影响——假如一次世界切换都不曾发生，这三个世界至今仍会完全相同。"

    # game/script.rpy:61264
    old "Only they caused reality to differ. It was the world switches that shaped this maze—a maze whose walls could be broken."
    new "正是它们让现实出现了差异。是这些世界切换造就了这座迷宫——一座墙壁可以被打破的迷宫。"

    # game/script.rpy:61266
    old "There are numerous enigmas around the world switch. Perhaps you have some lingering questions.{w} When Akaro A appeared in world B, the storeroom had been sealed by his future self. However, in part, that helped him go back in time and seal it. Doesn't that seem contradictory? If he had appeared in a world without a sealed storeroom, he wouldn't have been able to go back and seal it... You might find a number of similar cases.{w} For that, you can look at the people who world switched and the way they shaped their new world. If the answer escapes you, that's where you will find it, alongside the real form of the world switch."
    new "围绕世界切换，还有许多谜团。你或许仍有疑问。{w}当 Akaro A 出现在B世界时，储藏室已经被他未来的自己封上了。然而在某种程度上，正是这一点促使他回到过去将其封上。这看上去岂不自相矛盾？如果他出现的那个世界里储藏室并没有被封锁，他就无法回去把它封上……类似的情形你或许还能找出不少。{w}为此，你可以去看看那些发生过世界切换的人，以及他们如何塑造自己的新世界。若你想不出答案，那里便藏着答案，也藏着世界切换的真实面貌。"

    # game/script.rpy:61283
    old "I couldn't just think that infinite worlds existed. After all, it was possible I was going back and forth between two.{w} The first time, Erina had brought us to a different world, but we had eventually returned. When we'd later traveled back to that morning, Shiroya and I had changed worlds, but I suspected that we'd appeared in the same one again. That was why thinking that infinite worlds existed was a bit of a leap."
    new "我不能就此认定存在无穷多个世界。毕竟，我也可能只是在两个世界之间来回。{w}第一次，Erina 把我们带到了另一个世界，但最后我们还是回去了。后来我们穿越回那天早晨时，Shiroya 和我切换了世界，可我怀疑我们又一次落在了同一个世界。所以说，断言存在无穷多个世界，还是有些操之过急。"

    # game/script.rpy:61284
    old "I looked at both Sekimeiya. If I touched one, would the world around me really change?"
    new "我看着那两个 Sekimeiya。如果碰其中一个，身边的世界真的会改变吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:61285
    old "What about the range, the replicated location, the time traveled, and all that nonsense?"
    new "那重叠范围、复制的位置、穿越的时间，还有那一堆乱七八糟的东西呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:61289
    old "I stepped into the kitchen."
    new "我走进了厨房。"

    # game/script.rpy:61290
    old "...Can the refrigerator act like the cold cabinet?"
    new "……冰箱能当那种冷藏展示柜用吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:61294
    old "I opened it and put my hand inside. While it was cold, the temperature didn't seem as low as the Sekimeiya cabinet's."
    new "我打开冰箱，把手伸了进去。里面确实冷，但温度似乎不如放 Sekimeiya 的展示柜那么低。"

    # game/script.rpy:61295
    old "There was a regulation mechanism inside, so I changed it to the coldest setting."
    new "里面有调节装置，我就把它调到了最冷的一档。"

    # game/script.rpy:61298
    old "I shut a Sekimeiya inside the refrigerator for a few seconds.{w} When I took it out, I felt it through my shirt."
    new "我在冰箱里放了一个 Sekimeiya，关上门，等了几秒。{w}取出来时，我隔着衬衫感受它的温度。"

    # game/script.rpy:61299
    old "It did work. It was pretty hot before, and now it's not."
    new "确实有效。刚才还烫得很，现在已经不热了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61300
    old "So, as long as I keep a Sekimeiya in here, I might not be encompassed within two ranges."
    new "也就是说，只要我一直把一个 Sekimeiya 放在里面，也许就不会同时落入两个范围。"

    # game/script.rpy:61301
    old "I wasn't confident the concept of range I was working with was correct, though."
    new "不过，我自己所设想的「范围」这一概念是否正确，我并没有把握。"

    # game/script.rpy:61302
    old "I put both Sekimeiya inside to hopefully reset them. A few seconds later, I took one out and set it on the countertop."
    new "我把两个 Sekimeiya 都放了进去，指望它们能借此重置。几秒后，我取出一个，放在流理台上。"

    # game/script.rpy:61303
    old "Theoretically, it should begin to gather energy now, so I'll travel a short distance if I touch it soon."
    new "理论上，它现在应该开始蓄能了。如果我马上碰它，大概只会移动一小段距离。"

    # game/script.rpy:61305
    old "I counted up to a minute in my head. Then, I touched the Sekimeiya on the marble."
    new "我在心里数满一分钟，然后碰了碰大理石台面上的那个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:61309
    old "...{w}Hm? What just happened?"
    new "……{w}嗯？刚才怎么回事？"

    # game/script.rpy:61310
    old "I was still in the kitchen, but I had teleported less than a step backward."
    new "我仍在厨房里，只是传送到了身后不到一步的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:61311
    old "Huh? The Sekimeiya is powered off just where I touched it."
    new "咦？Sekimeiya 就在我碰它的地方停止运作了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61312
    old "Does that mean I traveled to the future? I think I only went a few seconds through time, and there's no past self of mine here."
    new "难道说，我穿越到了未来？我记得只往前跳了几秒，而且这里也没有过去的我。"

    # game/script.rpy:61313
    old "The Sekimeiya was gray, indicating that I was at a point after my travel. Surprised, I realized I really had traveled forward in time."
    new "那个 Sekimeiya 是灰色的，说明我此刻身处穿越之后的时间点。我这才惊觉，自己真的穿越到了未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:61314
    old "What was the difference? Why didn't I travel to the past?"
    new "差别在哪里？为什么我没有穿越到过去？"

    # game/script.rpy:61315
    old "And the location where I appeared... Why was it right next to where I touched the Sekimeiya?{w} It's as if I only moved a tiny bit because I only went a few seconds to the future."
    new "还有我出现的位置……为什么恰好就在我碰 Sekimeiya 的地方旁边？{w}就好像因为我只往未来走了几秒，所以也只移动了一点点。"

    # game/script.rpy:61316
    old "Hm...{w} I have an idea, but I don't think I can test it."
    new "嗯……{w}我有个想法，不过恐怕没法验证。"

    # game/script.rpy:61318
    old "Wait, no, maybe I can."
    new "等等，不对——也许能验证。"

    # game/script.rpy:61319
    old "As soon as I put the Sekimeiya in the refrigerator, it regained its white color. However, I ignored that and ran to the staircase."
    new "我刚把 Sekimeiya 放进冰箱，它就恢复了白色。但我没有理会，径直朝楼梯跑去。"

    # game/script.rpy:61326
    old "It appeared the crystal floor was still empty, but I couldn't know for certain."
    new "水晶层看上去还是空的，可我没法确认。"

    # game/script.rpy:61330
    old "Quietly, I walked to the security room."
    new "我放轻脚步，走向监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:61334
    old "All the screens were still black, but they weren't my focus. I began to look everywhere I could."
    new "所有屏幕仍是黑的，但我的注意力不在屏幕上。我开始四处翻找。"

    # game/script.rpy:61335
    old "Sai said he found the voice recorder here, but perhaps he hasn't yet. I might be able to get it in this world."
    new "Sai 说过他是在这里找到录音笔的，不过也许现在还没找到。在这个世界里，我也许能先拿到手。"

    # game/script.rpy:61336
    old "And I did. Behind one of the monitors on the wall, I found the device that had been in Isla's purse."
    new "我果然找到了。在墙上某台显示器背后，我摸到了那支原本在 Isla 包里的录音笔。"

    # game/script.rpy:61339
    old "When I pressed the \"record\" button, a line appeared on the screen. Above it, numbers began to count the recorded seconds."
    new "我按下「录音」键，屏幕上出现了一条线。线的上方，数字开始累计已录的秒数。"

    # game/script.rpy:61340
    old "There was no saved recording this time..."
    new "这一次没有已保存的录音……"

    # game/script.rpy:61341
    old "That wasn't strange. After all, the recorder in Isla's purse had to have traveled from the future, while the one in the security room was the original one.{w} However, my intention wasn't to record anything. I wanted to use the device as a timer that I could hold."
    new "这并不奇怪。毕竟 Isla 包里的那支是从未来穿越而来的，监控室里的这一支才是原本的那支。{w}可我要的并不是录音。我只想把它当作可以随身带着的计时器。"

    # game/script.rpy:61349
    old "Back in the attic, I entered the kitchen again. Both Sekimeiya were still in the refrigerator, but I didn't want to take one out yet."
    new "回到阁楼，我又走进厨房。两个 Sekimeiya 都还在冰箱里，但我还不想取出其中一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:61350
    old "Instead, I powered on the oven and set it to finish after ten minutes."
    new "我转而打开烤箱，把定时设为十分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:61353
    old "Then, at the same time that the oven began to count down, I pressed the record button. Immediately, the seconds began to count up on the device's screen."
    new "接着，在烤箱开始倒计时的同时，我按下录音键。录音笔屏幕上的秒数随即开始递增。"

    # game/script.rpy:61354
    old "With this setup, I can know the amount of time I'm traveling."
    new "这样一来，我就能知道自己穿越了多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:61357
    old "I held the recorder in my hand so that it would always be in my possession. When the oven's timer showed nine minutes, the device had hit one minute."
    new "我把录音笔握在手里，确保它一直在我手上。烤箱的计时器显示还剩九分钟时，录音笔刚好走到一分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:61358
    old "Meanwhile, I thought back on the many travels I'd experienced, wondering if there was any idea I could apply to every single one."
    new "与此同时，我回想自己经历过的那些穿越，琢磨有没有哪条规律能适用于每一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:61362
    old "When three minutes had been recorded, I took the Sekimeiya I'd last used out of the refrigerator and left it on the countertop."
    new "录音笔走到三分钟时，我把上次用过的那个 Sekimeiya 从冰箱里取出，放在流理台上。"

    # game/script.rpy:61363
    old "So, it's started gaining energy after three minutes have gone by."
    new "也就是说，过了三分钟，它才开始蓄能。"

    # game/script.rpy:61364
    old "I didn't stop staring at the ticking timer. A few seconds later, I brought my hand close to the Sekimeiya. I didn't touch it yet, though. I had to make sure I did so at the appropriate time."
    new "我目不转睛地盯着跳动的计时器。几秒后，我把手凑近那个 Sekimeiya，却没有碰它。我必须等到合适的时机再动手。"

    # game/script.rpy:61366
    old "Above the Sekimeiya, my hand patiently hovered. As soon as the recorder and the oven hit five minutes, I touched it."
    new "我的手悬在 Sekimeiya 上方，耐心地等着。录音笔和烤箱同时走到五分钟的那一刻，我碰了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:61369
    old "Once again, I'd hardly moved through space: I was still in the kitchen, staring at the Sekimeiya. However, it was gray, meaning that I was in the future."
    new "这一次我几乎还是待在原地：人还在厨房，仍盯着那个 Sekimeiya。可它是灰色的，说明我身处未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:61370
    old "Immediately, I looked at the oven. Its timer indicated that four minutes and fifteen seconds still remained.{w} Right after that, I glanced at my own hand, eager to look at my timer.{w} The device was there."
    new "我立刻去看烤箱，计时显示还剩四分十五秒。{w}紧接着，我低头看向自己的手，急着看自己的计时器。{w}录音笔还在手里。"

    # game/script.rpy:61377
    old "4:15... It's the same time!"
    new "4:15……两边一样！"

    # game/script.rpy:61380
    old "But while the device's screen changed to 4:16, the oven's timer went to 4:14.{w} Like before, the recorder kept counting up, whereas the oven counted down."
    new "可录音笔的屏幕跳到 4:16 时，烤箱的计时却变成了 4:14。{w}和刚才一样，录音笔在递增，烤箱在倒数。"

    # game/script.rpy:61382
    old "I touched the Sekimeiya at the five-minute mark and went 45 seconds into the future. That's a little odd—the Sekimeiya gathered energy for two minutes. The times it gathered energy for fifteen minutes, we went twenty minutes through time."
    new "我在计时走到五分钟时碰了 Sekimeiya，向未来跳了四十五秒。这有点奇怪——它只蓄了两分钟的能量。可之前它蓄能十五分钟时，我们穿越了二十分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:61383
    old "The most important thing, though... is that although I went 45 seconds to the future, the recorder seems to have gone 45 seconds backward in time."
    new "不过最关键的是……我虽然往未来走了四十五秒，录音笔却似乎往过去退回了四十五秒。"

    # game/script.rpy:61384
    old "That must mean... that the replicated location was from 45 seconds before I touched the Sekimeiya."
    new "也就是说……被复制的位置，是我碰 Sekimeiya 前四十五秒所在的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:61388
    old "That left me thinking, but the train of thought was interrupted by the Sekimeiya. It turned white a few seconds after my reappearance."
    new "我正想得出神，思绪却被 Sekimeiya 打断了。我重新出现几秒后，它就变回了白色。"

    # game/script.rpy:61389
    old "This is strange too. It took almost two minutes to power back on, but it spent about five minutes powered off when Sai and Shiroya disappeared from the event room."
    new "这一点也很奇怪。它花了将近两分钟才重新启动，可 Sai 和 Shiroya 在活动室消失那次，它停止运作了大约五分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:61390
    old "I had to do it again.{w} I turned off the oven and erased the recording. Next, I set the oven to five minutes and pressed the device's record button at the same time.{w} I left the Sekimeiya in the refrigerator until two minutes had elapsed. Then, thirty seconds later, when the recorder displayed 2:30, I touched the gem again."
    new "我得再来一次。{w}我关掉烤箱，删除了录音。接着，我把烤箱设成五分钟，同时按下录音笔的录音键。{w}我让 Sekimeiya 在冰箱里放了两分钟。等过了三十秒，录音笔显示 2:30 时，我再次碰了它。"

    # game/script.rpy:61391
    old "The immediate result was the same: I appeared in the kitchen, pretty much where I'd already been standing. I looked at both timers at once.{w} The two of them showed \"2:21\", yet the device's timer kept ticking up while the oven's counted down."
    new "眼前的结果还是一样：我出现在厨房，差不多就在原先站立的地方。我同时看了两个计时。{w}两边都显示「2:21」，可录音笔的计时仍在递增，烤箱的却在倒数。"

    # game/script.rpy:61392
    old "What the fuck? Again, I went nine seconds to the future, but the location I appeared in was from nine seconds before touching the Sekimeiya.{w} Is this it? Does traveling to the future X amount of time replicate the location in space you were at X amount of time in the past?{w} What about traveling back, though? I've gone to the future three times in a row!"
    new "这他妈是怎么回事？又是这样——我向未来跳了九秒，落点却是我触碰 Sekimeiya 之前九秒所在的位置。{w}难道说，向未来穿越 X 秒，复制出来的就是你 X 秒前所在的空间位置？{w}可要是向过去穿越呢？我都已经连着三次跳往未来了！"

    # game/script.rpy:61395
    old "The only idea I had was to use the other Sekimeiya, so I put the one I'd been using in the refrigerator."
    new "我能想到的唯一办法，就是换另一个 Sekimeiya 试试。于是我把一直用的那个放进了冰箱。"

    # game/script.rpy:61396
    old "I set up the same conditions with the oven's timer at five minutes as I began a new recording."
    new "我按同样的条件把烤箱定时器设为五分钟，同时开始新的录音。"

    # game/script.rpy:61397
    old "That time, when two minutes had elapsed, I took the other Sekimeiya out. Thirty seconds later, I activated it."
    new "那一次，等过了两分钟，我取出另一个 Sekimeiya。三十秒后，我启动了它。"

    # game/script.rpy:61401
    old "The result was almost identical. I appeared in the kitchen, very close to where I'd been."
    new "结果几乎一模一样。我出现在厨房里，离原先的位置很近。"

    # game/script.rpy:61402
    old "However, someone was in front of me. It was my past self."
    new "但我面前站着一个人。是过去的我。"

    # game/script.rpy:61403
    old "I remained completely still, just like a deer caught in headlights. The back of my own head was in front of my eyes."
    new "我僵在原地，动也不动，活像被车灯照住的鹿。眼前正是我自己的后脑勺。"

    # game/script.rpy:61404
    old "But it didn't remain there for long. Quickly, my figure disappeared, revealing the powered-off Sekimeiya."
    new "可那身影没有停留多久。转眼间，我的身影消失了，露出已经停止运作的 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:61408
    old "I see... I just traveled through time, and the Sekimeiya's range was so small that it didn't pick me up again. It does seem like I went nine seconds to the past.{w} It's probably due to the Sekimeiya I used: this one makes you travel to the past, while the other sends you to the future."
    new "原来如此……我刚刚完成了时间穿越，而 Sekimeiya 的范围太小，没能再次把我卷进去。看来我确实是回到了九秒前。{w}原因大概出在我用的这个 Sekimeiya 上：这个让人穿越到过去，另一个则把人送往未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:61409
    old "The oven's timer was at 2:25, so I hurried to look at the voice recorder as I thought about it.{w} I had gone nine seconds to the past, so upon appearing, the oven's timer would've been at 2:39. Then, I had waited out the nine seconds needed for my past self to disappear, and five extra seconds had elapsed since. Before the oven's timer counted down to 2:24, I looked at the device between my hands."
    new "烤箱定时器显示 2:25，我一边琢磨，一边急忙去看录音笔。{w}我是回到了九秒前，所以刚出现时，烤箱定时器应该停在 2:39。之后我等到过去的自己消失，用掉九秒，又过了五秒。趁烤箱定时器还没跳到 2:24，我看向手中的录音笔。"

    # game/script.rpy:61418
    old "The screen is blank! What the hell!?{w} Why? I can't know where this location is from!"
    new "屏幕一片空白！搞什么鬼！？{w}为什么？这样一来，我根本没法知道这个位置是从哪儿来的！"

    # game/script.rpy:61419
    old "Traveling nine seconds to the future put me where I'd been nine seconds in the past!{w} Wouldn't traveling to the past put me—{w} ...{w}where I'd be nine seconds in the future.{w} And I'm still here, exactly where I appeared."
    new "向未来跳九秒，会把我送到九秒前我所在的地方！{w}那向过去跳，不就会把我送到——{w}……{w}九秒后我会在的地方吗？{w}而我仍待在原地，正是我出现的位置，一动没动。"

    # game/script.rpy:61420
    old "But then why is the screen..."
    new "可既然如此，屏幕为什么……"

    # game/script.rpy:61421
    old "Wait,{w} no.{w} It might make sense."
    new "等等，{w}不对，{w}也许说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:61428
    old "Let's say the Sekimeiya is touched at time {b}t{/b}. In this case, {b}t{/b} is 2:30.{w} {b}X{/b} will refer to the travel time, which is nine seconds."
    new "假设在时刻 {b}t{/b} 触碰 Sekimeiya。这里 {b}t{/b} 是 2:30。{w}再设 {b}X{/b} 为穿越时间，也就是九秒。"

    # game/script.rpy:61429
    old "Let's assume that traveling {b}X{/b} seconds to the past copies your state {b}X{/b} seconds after touching the Sekimeiya. What would the time on the device be upon appearing?"
    new "假设向过去穿越 {b}X{/b} 秒，复制的是你触碰 Sekimeiya 后 {b}X{/b} 秒时的状态。那么出现时，设备上的时间是多少？"

    # game/script.rpy:61433
    old "{b}t+X{/b}, or 2:39.{w} Then {b}2X{/b} seconds would pass to reach the future state."
    new "应是 {b}t+X{/b}，也就是 2:39。{w}可要抵达那个未来状态，还得再经过 {b}2X{/b} 秒。"

    # game/script.rpy:61437
    old "The timer would read {b}t+3X{/b}, or 2:57, but that contradicts the past position.{w}  The timer at arrival would have to be {b}t+3X{/b}."
    new "定时器会读到 {b}t+3X{/b}，即 2:57，但这与过去的位置不符。{w}照此推算，抵达时的定时器读数只能是 {b}t+3X{/b}。"

    # game/script.rpy:61441
    old "But nothing stops this from continuing. Another {b}2X{/b} seconds would be added..."
    new "但没有什么能让它停下。还会再叠加 {b}2X{/b} 秒……"

    # game/script.rpy:61456
    old "The recorder's time would add up infinitely, and eventually its battery would run out."
    new "录音笔上的时间会无限累加，电池迟早耗尽。"

    # game/script.rpy:61462
    old "This can't make sense, though.{w} If the replicated location is one that occurs after touching the Sekimeiya, we would die."
    new "可这样根本说不通。{w}如果复制出的位置是触碰 Sekimeiya 之后才会出现的，那我们不就死定了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61463
    old "Just like with the recorder's timer, my age would've increased by a few seconds repeatedly, making me die instantly upon traveling to the past."
    new "就像录音笔的计时一样，我的年龄也会一次又一次地叠加几秒，向过去穿越的瞬间就会死掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:61464
    old "If the device aged in a loop until it ran out of batteries, its appearance would've changed too. It would've degraded, probably even disintegrated into nothing."
    new "如果设备在循环中不断老化，直到电池耗尽，它的外观也会跟着改变。它会变得老旧，甚至可能彻底崩解，什么都不剩。"

    # game/script.rpy:61467
    old "However, isn't this what happened... to Sai's watch?{w} Not only to Sai, but to a Sai who I have to assume traveled to the past. When I saw him, he should've been in the attic, so he'd come from the future. Later, I learned his watch had stopped working again."
    new "然而……Sai 的手表，不正是这样吗？{w}而且不只是 Sai，而是那个我不得不认定曾穿越到过去的 Sai。我见到他时，他本该待在阁楼，可见他是从未来回来的。后来我得知，他的手表又停了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61469
    old "If he appeared five minutes in the past where he would be ten minutes after his appearance... the time on his watch would've increased by ten minutes infinitely, and the battery would've eventually stopped working.{w} There's no way it would've lasted thousands of years, though, so what the hell?{w} And why would the watch's inner mechanism add up the looped time while its outer appearance wasn't affected?"
    new "如果他出现在五分钟前，而那个位置正是他出现十分钟后会在的地方……那手表上的时间就会以十分钟为单位无限累加，电池迟早撑不住。{w}可它绝不可能撑上几千年，这到底是怎么回事？{w}况且，为什么只有手表的内部机件在累加循环的时间，外表却毫无变化？"

    # game/script.rpy:61475
    old "...The recorder isn't working anymore, so I can't keep testing."
    new "……录音笔已经坏了，我没法再继续测试。"

    # game/script.rpy:61476
    old "Wait, no. I can make it work again if what I've concluded is correct.{w} After all, just minutes ago, I was holding it when it worked. I just have to replicate that location, which should be easy. I only have to travel a couple minutes to the future."
    new "等等，不对。只要我的推论没错，我就能让它重新工作。{w}毕竟就在几分钟前，我拿着它的时候它还是好的。我只要复制出那个位置就行，这应该不难。我只需要向未来跳几分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:61477
    old "That was what I did. I put the broken recorder in a drawer and traveled to the future. When I appeared, I was holding the device. The timer on its screen said 1:35, as it was still working."
    new "我就这么做了。我把坏掉的录音笔放进抽屉，然后穿越到了未来。出现时，我手里正拿着那支录音笔。屏幕上的计时显示 1:35，它还在正常工作。"

    # game/script.rpy:61478
    old "This is definitely how traveling to the future works, then..."
    new "看来穿越到未来的原理，确实就是这样……"

    # game/script.rpy:61479
    old "But what about traveling to the past? Did all those travels work like this as well?"
    new "可穿越到过去呢？之前那几次也都是这样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:61487
    old "The first time I went to the past, I appeared in the lobby, right in front of the hallway A door. I later determined I'd gone about twenty minutes to the past."
    new "第一次回到过去时，我出现在大厅，就在 A走廊门前。后来我推算出，我大约回到了二十分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:61488
    old "So, twenty minutes after the point I touched the Sekimeiya...{w} I was in the lobby, right in front of the hallway A door. I was watching the hallway while the others looked through every room."
    new "也就是说，在我触碰 Sekimeiya 之后二十分钟……{w}我就在大厅里，站在 A走廊门前。当时其他人逐个房间搜查，我则守着走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:61489
    old "Seriously...? Is this what's been happening?"
    new "真的假的……？难道一直都是这样？"

    # game/script.rpy:61493
    old "Later, Shiroya and I traveled about forty minutes to the past. I appeared in the security room, sitting down. However, the chair wasn't there to support me, so I fell to the floor."
    new "后来，我和 Shiroya 一起回到了大约四十分钟前。我出现在监控室里，还保持着坐姿。可那把椅子并不在那里，我一下子摔到了地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:61496
    old "Forty minutes after the time we touched the Sekimeiya... I really was in the security room, looking at the computer. Sai had just run away from me, and I even looked at the time. I was there from {time=12:18} to {time=12:31.}"
    new "在我们触碰 Sekimeiya 之后四十分钟……我确实待在监控室里，盯着电脑。那时 Sai 刚从我这逃走，我还看过时间。从 {time=12:18} 到 {time=12:31.}，我一直都在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:61503
    old "Even Shiroya... She said she'd appeared in the second floor offices, and when we reunited outside the security room, she'd just been searching for me through every floor starting from the top. Both of us had just been in the locations we'd appeared."
    new "就连 Shiroya 也是……她说她出现在二楼的办公室，我们在监控室外会合时，她正从顶层开始一层层往下找我。我们两个当时都正好待在自己出现的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:61510
    old "I could hardly believe it, but I finally knew the logic behind what had agonizingly eluded me: the replicated location."
    new "我几乎不敢相信，可我终于弄明白了那个一直让我百思不得其解的东西——复制的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:61511
    old "But hang on... Does this mean that every time we touched the Sekimeiya and appeared in a location we recognized, we'd gone to the future? ...It's only traveling to the future that replicates a past coordinate you've been at."
    new "可等等……难道说，每次我们触碰 Sekimeiya 后出现在一个我们认得出的地方，其实都是去了未来？……只有穿越到未来，才会复制你曾经待过的过去坐标。"

    # game/script.rpy:61512
    old "This is absurd, though! It doesn't even make sense!"
    new "这也太荒唐了！根本说不通！"

    # game/script.rpy:61513
    old "Why the hell did I appear in the security room in the past!? Because I was later in the security room? That's nonsense!"
    new "我到底为什么会出现在过去的监控室！？就因为后来我会待在监控室？胡说八道！"

    # game/script.rpy:61514
    old "Why the security room? If I had appeared in the attic, for example, I would've been somewhere else eighty minutes later! I was only in the security room in the future because it's where I appeared in the past!"
    new "为什么偏偏是监控室？比方说，如果我出现在阁楼，那八十分钟后我就在别的地方了！我在未来之所以会待在监控室，只因为那是我在过去出现的位置！"

    # game/script.rpy:61515
    old "Why couldn't I have appeared on another continent? Then I would've been there in the future and made it come true!"
    new "为什么我不能出现在另一块大陆？那样未来的我就会在那儿，让它成真！"

    # game/script.rpy:61516
    old "It's nonsense! What's actually determining where we appear?{w} Something must be. We appeared inside the tower every single time."
    new "荒唐！到底是什么决定了我们出现的位置？{w}一定有什么在决定。每一次，我们都出现在塔内。"

    # game/script.rpy:61529
    old "Shiroya and Atsuki had spent a long time in the elevator. Thanks to the stop button, they had managed to escape from Sai."
    new "Shiroya 和 Atsuki 在电梯里耗了很久。多亏了停止按钮，两人才得以从 Sai 手中逃脱。"

    # game/script.rpy:61530
    old "But Shiroya soon noticed something was happening to Atsuki. He looked pale, and his breathing had sped up."
    new "可 Shiroya 很快发觉 Atsuki 有些不对劲。他脸色苍白，呼吸也急促起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:61533
    old "Shiroya stared at her lap, worried about Atsuki's thoughts. Did he, perhaps, think they wouldn't be able to leave?"
    new "Shiroya低头望着自己的膝头，担心Atsuki心里在想什么。他会不会以为他们根本出不去？"

    # game/script.rpy:61538
    old "The silence went on for a long time."
    new "沉默持续了很久。"

    # game/script.rpy:61539
    old "Eventually, Shiroya experienced some relief. Atsuki had closed his eyes, and he didn't appear to be as stressed. Mirroring him, Shiroya closed her eyes too."
    new "到后来，Shiroya稍稍松了口气。Atsuki已经闭上眼，看上去不像先前那样紧绷。她跟着他，也合上了眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:61542
    old "Minutes later, both pairs of eyes shot open at the same time, and Shiroya couldn't believe what she saw."
    new "几分钟后，两人同时睁开了眼，而Shiroya不敢相信眼前的景象。"

    # game/script.rpy:61543
    old "A knife was buried in Atsuki's chest.{w} She looked directly into his eyes, but only silence filled the elevator—neither of them could bring themselves to utter a word."
    new "一把刀插在Atsuki的胸口。{w}她直直望进他的眼睛，电梯里却只有沉默——两人谁都说不出一句话来。"

    # game/script.rpy:61544
    old "Then, Shiroya looked at the hand gripping the knife. She followed it up to an arm and then a shoulder.{w} Finally, she traced it to Sai's face."
    new "随后，Shiroya看向握着刀的那只手。视线顺着手臂上移，越过肩膀，{w}最后落在Sai的脸上。"

    # game/script.rpy:61545
    old "But that sight didn't last long. Immediately after killing his first victim, Sai felt the urge to have a second. With a frantic motion, the knife sliced Shiroya's chest."
    new "然而那一幕没有持续多久。Sai刚杀掉第一个人，立刻又涌起再杀一个的冲动。他疯狂挥刀，划开了Shiroya的胸口。"

    # game/script.rpy:61546
    old "Before she could process the scene, Shiroya's body fell beside Atsuki, their blood pooling together in the elevator."
    new "还没等她反应过来，Shiroya的身体已倒在Atsuki身旁，两人的血在电梯里汇成一摊。"

    # game/script.rpy:61552
    old "Of course, you know this never occurred."
    new "当然，你知道这一切从未发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:61553
    old "If it had, though... how would it have come to happen?"
    new "可若真发生过……那又是怎么发生的呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:61554
    old "Sai stared at both bodies momentarily. However, he didn't immediately understand that he was trapped."
    new "Sai怔怔地看了两具尸体片刻，却没有立刻意识到自己已被困住。"

    # game/script.rpy:61555
    old "Atsuki had pressed the stop button, so Sai couldn't leave the elevator."
    new "Atsuki按下了停止按钮，Sai无法离开电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:61556
    old "He couldn't move either—two bodies were on the floor. Eventually, when the replicated location took place, Sai was exactly where he'd appeared."
    new "他也动不了——两具尸体就躺在地上。最终，复现地点生效时，Sai仍待在他出现时的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:61558
    old "But... why? He was able to be there in the future because he had appeared there in the past. {tip=saielevator}Why had that been the location where he'd appeared?{/tip} Why not somewhere else?"
    new "可是……为什么？他之所以能在未来待在那里，是因为他过去曾在那里出现。{tip=saielevator}可为什么偏偏是那个地方？{/tip}为什么不是别处？"

    # game/script.rpy:61560
    old "Maybe you have a good idea."
    new "或许你已经有了答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:61569
    old "I had no idea. It seemed to make no sense at all."
    new "我毫无头绪。这怎么看都说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:61570
    old "But what the hell would happen now if I travel to the past?{w} Let's say I travel two minutes back and appear in the kitchen. Will it be guaranteed that I'll be in the kitchen four minutes later?"
    new "可如果我穿越回过去，现在到底会怎样？{w}假设我回到两分钟前，出现在厨房。那么四分钟后，我是否就一定会待在厨房？"

    # game/script.rpy:61571
    old "What if I don't want to? What if I decide to leave?{w} Does the location where I appear force me to be somewhere in the future? That makes even less sense!"
    new "要是我不愿意呢？要是我决定离开呢？{w}难道我出现的地点，还能逼我未来必须待在某个地方？这更说不通！"

    # game/script.rpy:61572
    old "I frowned, curious. What would actually happen? I had never traveled with knowledge of how the replicated location worked, but it seemed like having that knowledge alone would break the rule—I would no longer replicate the location in the future through some weird, unconscious fate."
    new "我皱起眉，心生好奇。实际会发生什么？以前穿越时，我从不知道复现地点是怎么运作的，但光是知道这一点，似乎就足以打破规律——我不会再因为某种诡异而无意识的命运，在未来复现那个地点。"

    # game/script.rpy:61573
    old "I mean, if I do appear in the kitchen, can I refuse to be there in the future? Can I risk doing that just out of curiosity?{w} What if it's the universe's rule? Would I end up not trying to go against it out of fear of what might happen, which would confirm the impossibility of being in a paradoxical location?"
    new "我是说，假如我真出现在厨房，难道我能拒绝未来待在那里吗？仅仅出于好奇，我就敢冒这个险吗？{w}万一这是宇宙定下的规律呢？我会不会因为害怕后果而不敢违逆，结果反倒坐实了「不可能待在悖论地点」这件事？"

    # game/script.rpy:61574
    old "That's pretty similar to not attempting to change the past just in case it's not possible, but it can't be fought, can it?"
    new "这和「以防万一改变不了，就干脆不去尝试改变过去」差不多，可这种事根本没法抗拒，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:61575
    old "...And yet it doesn't make sense. Why would I purposely be somewhere just because it's where I appeared in the past?"
    new "……可还是说不通。凭什么只因为我过去曾出现在某处，就要刻意待在那里？"

    # game/script.rpy:61579
    old "...I wonder. Can I maybe take advantage of it?"
    new "……不过，说不准。我能不能反过来利用这一点？"

    # game/script.rpy:61580
    old "It doesn't seem fair that figuring out how it works would be a detriment if I intend to travel back. Until now, the rule has been consistent through mere fate, but it wouldn't be the same if I was aware of it as it happened."
    new "如果我打算回到过去，弄懂它的运作方式反倒成了阻碍，这未免太不公平。一直以来，这条规律都只是靠命运维持着一致；可要是我在事情发生时就清楚这一点，就不会是这样了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61581
    old "A way to put the knowledge into practice... Maybe, as long as I have accurate knowledge..."
    new "一个能把这份知识用于实践的办法……或许，只要我的认知足够准确……"

    # game/script.rpy:61582
    old "I put the Sekimeiya that had sent me to the past in the refrigerator. After I waited a bit, I took it back out."
    new "我把送我回到过去的那个Sekimeiya放进冰箱，等了一会儿，再取出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:61583
    old "I set the timer and waited half a minute. Then, I brought my hand toward its glow."
    new "我设好计时，等了半分钟，然后把手伸向它的光芒。"

    # game/script.rpy:61584
    old "All right. Will you send me to the living room?"
    new "好。你会把我送到客厅去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:61590
    old "That was where I appeared: in the middle of the room."
    new "我出现的地方正是那里：房间正中央。"

    # game/script.rpy:61591
    old "And so I waited. I had traveled nine seconds to the past, so the only mandatory rule was that I had to be there after eighteen seconds.{w} ...But I didn't wait there because the universe had forced me to—I did it so that my request could be fulfilled."
    new "于是我就在那里等着。我回到了九秒之前，唯一必须满足的规则，就是十八秒后我得待在那里。{w}……不过我留在那里，并非宇宙强迫，而是为了让自己的请求得以成立。"

    # game/script.rpy:61595
    old "Eighteen seconds later, I was still there."
    new "十八秒后，我仍在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:61597
    old "Before touching the Sekimeiya, I had thought of what would happen. I had thought that eighteen seconds after appearing in the past, I would be in the living room.{w} Of course, if that was the case, it implied I would appear in the living room, so it was what had happened. Then, to make it possible, I'd remained there, exactly where I'd imagined myself appearing."
    new "在碰Sekimeiya之前，我已经想过会发生什么。我心想，回到过去后过十八秒，我会待在客厅。{w}当然，若真如此，那就意味着我会出现在客厅，事情也确实就是这样发生的。而为了让这一切成立，我就一直待在那里——正是我想象中自己出现的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:61598
    old "I see. So this is the opposite of useless."
    new "原来如此。那这可不是没用，恰恰相反。"

    # game/script.rpy:61599
    old "It's like the thought-up loops that I came up with. As long as the loop is in my head before touching the Sekimeiya, and as long as it can be executed, it will work.{w} \"As long as it can be executed\". Didn't I just travel from the 5th of January to the 15th of December?"
    new "这就像我自己设想出来的那些循环。只要在碰Sekimeiya之前，循环已经在我脑中成形，而且它能够被执行，就会成立。{w}「只要能够被执行」——我不就刚从1月5日穿越到了12月15日吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:61600
    old "I went 21 days into the past, and my knowledge of the replicated location came after the travel but before the location is replicated in the future. What the hell happens now?{w} I appeared in the lobby; does that confirm that I'll be alive in the future?"
    new "我回到了二十一天前；而我对复现地点的了解，是在穿越之后、那个地点在未来复现之前才有的。现在到底会怎样？{w}我出现在了大堂；这是否就能确认，未来我还活着？"

    # game/script.rpy:61601
    old "Doesn't this travel genuinely force me to be in the lobby on the day—"
    new "这次穿越不就真的强迫我那天必须待在大堂——"

    # game/script.rpy:61602
    old "...{w}I went 21 days to the past.{w} 21 days after January 5th is a Thursday, January 26th..."
    new "……{w}我回到了二十一天前。{w}1月5日往后二十一天，是1月26日，星期四……"

    # game/script.rpy:61605
    old "There was something there. That wasn't some random day.{w} Shiroya and I had talked with Miiya about it. We had said that we would go back to the tower on the 26th if we liked it the first time."
    new "那天确实有些特别。那并不是随便哪一天。{w}我和Shiroya曾经跟Miiya聊起过。我们说过，如果第一次玩得尽兴，26号就再去一次塔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:61607
    old "Miiya had died because of the Sekimeiya—without the Sekimeiya's existence, the explosion wouldn't have occurred, and Miiya would've kept on living. Ashiya held an event in the tower every Thursday, and on January 26th, a Thursday, an event that had grabbed our attention would take place.{w} If the Sekimeiya hadn't existed, we would've been in the tower on January 26th. Even after Miiya's death, if no travels had taken place, it was feasible that Shiroya and I would've returned to continue healing and moving forward. But from what I understood, our reason for returning would be different—to satisfy a travel that had already happened."
    new "Miiya是因Sekimeiya而死的——若Sekimeiya不曾存在，那场爆炸就不会发生，Miiya也会继续活下去。芦屋每周四都会在塔里举办活动，而1月26日正是星期四，那天会有一场吸引我们注意的活动。{w}若Sekimeiya不存在，1月26日我们本就会在塔里。即便Miiya死后、没有任何穿越发生，我和Shiroya也很有可能回到那里，继续疗伤、继续向前走。但据我所知，我们回去的理由会不一样——为了满足一次已经发生过的穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:61608
    old "What was the exact truth hidden behind that? I didn't know, but it confirmed again that the locations where we appeared were in no way random."
    new "那背后究竟藏着怎样的真相？我不知道，但这再次证实了：我们出现的地点绝非随机。"

    # game/script.rpy:61611
    old "This means that I can pretty much teleport anywhere I want, doesn't it?{w} I just have to think about where I'll be in the future. The limit is that the location has to be possible to reach in a set time. Is that it?"
    new "也就是说，我几乎能传送到任何想去的地方，对吧？{w}我只要想好自己未来会在哪里就行。限制只在于，那个地点必须能在规定时间内抵达。是这样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:61615
    old "I went to the kitchen and briefly put the Past Sekimeiya in the refrigerator. Once it had stored energy for thirty seconds, I touched it."
    new "我去了厨房，把过去Sekimeiya放进冰箱里待了一会儿。等它蓄能三十秒后，我碰了它。"

    # game/script.rpy:61619
    old "Once more, I appeared in the living room, where I'd wanted to appear.{w} I looked at my hands, but they were empty."
    new "我再一次出现在客厅，也就是我想出现的地方。{w}我看了看自己的手，手上空无一物。"

    # game/script.rpy:61620
    old "I see. I guess that was too nonsensical to work."
    new "原来如此。看来那太荒唐了，自然不会成立。"

    # game/script.rpy:61621
    old "Before touching the Sekimeiya, I had thought that I'd be in the living room with a chocolate bar in my hands. By appearing there with the chocolate, I would be able to have it in the future so that it could appear in the past.{w} Presumably, that hadn't worked because I could never have obtained that chocolate in the span of those seconds, so I went back to the kitchen after I waited the proper amount of time."
    new "在碰Sekimeiya之前，我想的是：我会出现在客厅，手里拿着一块巧克力。只要我带着巧克力出现在那里，未来我就能拥有它，好让它出现在过去。{w}大概正因为在那几秒之内我根本不可能拿到那块巧克力，这招才没有奏效。于是等够时间后，我又回到厨房。"

    # game/script.rpy:61626
    old "Once again, I touched the Past Sekimeiya after it had gathered energy for thirty seconds."
    new "等过去Sekimeiya完成三十秒蓄能，我再一次碰了它。"

    # game/script.rpy:61630
    old "After I appeared in the living room, I looked at my hands.{w} I was holding a pen."
    new "出现在客厅后，我看了看自己的手。{w}手里握着一支笔。"

    # game/script.rpy:61631
    old "I looked next to the television and saw the same pen."
    new "我看向电视机旁，那里放着同一支笔。"

    # game/script.rpy:61632
    old "I see... This does work."
    new "原来如此……这样确实可行。"

    # game/script.rpy:61633
    old "Before touching the Sekimeiya, I'd thought that I would appear in the living room, and that during those eighteen seconds, I would go grab the pen. That was why I had appeared with it.{w} However, I already had the pen. I didn't have to go get it; I could simply stay where I'd appeared so that I could appear with it."
    new "在触碰 Sekimeiya 之前，我以为自己会出现在客厅，然后在那十八秒里去拿笔——正因为这样，我才会带着笔出现。{w} 可笔本来就已经在我手上了。我根本不必去拿，只要一直待在自己出现的位置不动，就能带着它出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:61634
    old "Eighteen seconds went by, and I didn't step away from where I'd appeared."
    new "十八秒过去，我一步也没有离开自己出现的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:61635
    old "So, even though I never obtained the pen myself, I was able to appear with it solely because I could have obtained it. I effectively duplicated the pen, but I can't spawn objects that don't exist or I can't feasibly obtain before the future coordinate, like the chocolate. And this only happened because I thought of my actions before touching the Sekimeiya."
    new "也就是说，我本人压根没拿到过那支笔，只因为「本可以拿到」，就能带着它一起出现。我等于把那支笔复制了一份；但不存在的东西，或者在未来坐标之前根本不可能到手的东西——比如那块巧克力——就没法凭空弄出来。而这一切之所以成立，只因为我在触碰 Sekimeiya 之前就已经想好了自己要做的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:61638
    old "It was a fascinating concept, and an incredibly strong one. Simply by having awareness of a single rule, the Sekimeiya had grown drastically more useful."
    new "这个概念很有意思，也强得惊人。仅仅是意识到这样一条规则，Sekimeiya 的用处就一下子大了许多。"

    # game/script.rpy:61639
    old "If I touch the Past Sekimeiya while I'm holding the pen now, I'll appear with it in the past. However, that's possible only as long as I have it in the proportional future."
    new "如果我现在拿着笔去触碰 过去Sekimeiya，我就会带着它出现在过去。但前提是：在与之对应的未来，我仍然持有它。"

    # game/script.rpy:61640
    old "So when I touch the Sekimeiya, if I either think that I'll let go of the pen before the time expires or otherwise wouldn't have it, I won't appear with it. I would be instantly annihilating the pen without having to actually get rid of it. Even though I should appear with it, I wouldn't."
    new "所以，触碰 Sekimeiya 时，只要我认定自己会在时间结束前松手，或者认定自己届时不会持有它，我就不会带着它出现。这样一来，我不必真的把笔丢掉，就能让它当场湮灭。明明本该带着它出现，结果却没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:61647
    old "Exactly. On January 5th, Shiroya traveled to December 15th and noticed that out of the things she'd been holding, only her phone had disappeared."
    new "正是如此。1月5日，Shiroya 穿越到12月15日，随后发现：自己原本拿着的东西里，只有手机不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61648
    old "Why?{w} She appeared in the lobby of the tower, and the future coordinate was January 26th. I'm sure you haven't forgotten that phones are strictly prohibited in the tower: she couldn't have been there with it in the future, so she appeared without it in the past."
    new "为什么？{w} 她出现在塔的大厅，而未来坐标是1月26日。想必你还记得，塔内严禁携带手机：在未来，她不可能带着手机待在那里，所以她在过去出现时，手机也就不在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61649
    old "You might have realized that the same thing happened to the \"XYN\" card, which she didn't think about, and her clothes. Unlike Atsuki, she didn't appear with the ones she'd been wearing. ...That's still strange, isn't it?"
    new "你可能已经想到了，那张她根本没放在心上的「XYN」卡，还有她身上的衣服，也是同样的情况。和 Atsuki 不同，她出现时穿的不是原先那一套。……这仍然很奇怪，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:61651
    old "The knife disappeared from Shiroya's purse when she traveled to the future because she didn't have it in the past, so it would've been impossible for her to appear with it."
    new "Shiroya 穿越到未来时，小刀从她的手包里消失了，因为她在过去并没有带着它，也就不可能带着它出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:61652
    old "But on January 5th, when she traveled to December 15th, she noticed that out of the things she'd been holding, only her phone had disappeared. She didn't think about it, but the \"XYN\" card did as well, and her clothes had changed."
    new "可是1月5日她穿越到12月15日时，发现手里拿着的东西中，只有手机不见了。她并未留意，但那张「XYN」卡同样消失了，她的衣服也变了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61655
    old "The cleaning cart disappeared when Shiroya traveled to the future because she didn't have it in the past, so it would've been impossible for her to appear with it."
    new "Shiroya 穿越到未来时，清洁推车消失了，因为她在过去并没有推着它，也就不可能带着它出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:61662
    old "This is pretty insane. I can't believe the mechanics actually followed some rules."
    new "这简直离谱。没想到这套机制居然真的遵循着某种规则。"

    # game/script.rpy:61663
    old "I was overwhelmed by the number of things I was learning, but I didn't want to focus on a single detail. I didn't know if anyone else would come back at some point, and there were plenty of aspects I was wondering about."
    new "一下子学到这么多东西，我有些应接不暇，但我不想只盯着某一点。我不知道会不会有别人在某个时候回来，而且还有不少地方让我挂心。"

    # game/script.rpy:61664
    old "How much can I figure out with what I know? Was Sai aware of all this? He had a wristwatch, so I bet it would've been a lot easier for him to learn some of it.{w} There were two Sekimeiya since this morning, but what about the third one? Does that one never work...?"
    new "凭我现在知道的东西，能推出多少？Sai 清楚这些吗？他有一只手表，要弄明白其中几件事，想必比我容易得多。{w} 从今天早上起就有两个 Sekimeiya，那第三个呢？它难道永远不会启动……？"

    # game/script.rpy:61665
    old "And one made us travel back in time, while the other sent us forward.{w} If I know the time someone appeared in the future, I can know that's where they were in the past—there are many ways to apply all of this.{w} I wonder... When someone travels to the past, if I think that I'll bring them somewhere in the future, would I make them appear there in the past? Could the origin be in my mind even though I'm not the one traveling?"
    new "而且，一个让我们回到过去，另一个把我们送往未来。{w} 只要知道某人出现在未来的时刻，就能知道他在过去身处何处——这些信息能派上很多用场。{w} 我在想……如果有人要穿越到过去，而我认定自己会在未来把他带到某个地方，那他在过去是不是就会出现在那里？即便穿越的人不是我，原点也可能出在我的意识里？"

    # game/script.rpy:61671
    old "I tried to calm down a bit and went to the kitchen. It was better to answer the larger questions first."
    new "我让自己稍微冷静下来，走进厨房。还是先弄清更重要的问题为好。"

    # game/script.rpy:61672
    old "Wait a second. I can duplicate anything obtainable, can't I?"
    new "等等。只要东西能到手，我就能把它复制出来，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:61673
    old "We wondered whether duplicating the Sekimeiya was possible, but it doesn't appear to be the case. When it's activated, it doesn't count as something you possess, and it stays behind."
    new "我们曾怀疑 Sekimeiya 能否被复制，看来答案是否定的。它启动时不算你持有的东西，会留在原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:61674
    old "Now I'm certain that the Sai with the broken wristwatch came from the future, and he had a Sekimeiya in his hip pack. He acted as if he didn't know it was there, so perhaps that was the truth."
    new "现在我确定了：那个手表坏掉的 Sai 来自未来，他的腰包里有一个 Sekimeiya。他表现得好像并不知道那东西在里面，说不定那确实是实话。"

    # game/script.rpy:61675
    old "Maybe he appeared with it. An important detail is that it was inactive.{w} If he hid a powered-off Sekimeiya in his hip pack in the future, it's possible he appeared with it in the past."
    new "也许他是带着它一起出现的。关键的一点是，它当时处于关闭状态。{w} 如果他在未来把一个关掉的 Sekimeiya 藏进腰包，那他穿越回过去时就有可能带着它出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:61676
    old "Trying it was simple. First, I used the Past Sekimeiya to travel nine seconds to the past."
    new "验证起来很简单。我先用 过去Sekimeiya 穿越到九秒之前。"

    # game/script.rpy:61681
    old "In the living room, I waited eighteen seconds before I reentered the kitchen."
    new "我在客厅里等了十八秒，才重新走进厨房。"

    # game/script.rpy:61682
    old "The Sekimeiya will now spend a little while powered off."
    new "这样一来，Sekimeiya 会有好一阵子处于关闭状态。"

    # game/script.rpy:61686
    old "I took the Future Sekimeiya out of the refrigerator and grabbed the disabled Past Sekimeiya.{w} Half a minute later, I left it on the countertop and touched the Future Sekimeiya."
    new "我从冰箱里取出 未来Sekimeiya，再拿起那个已经无法使用的 过去Sekimeiya。{w} 半分钟后，我把它放在台面上，触碰了 未来Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:61687
    old "I appeared in the kitchen nine seconds in the future. Then, I glanced at my hands."
    new "我出现在了九秒后的厨房。然后，我低头看了看自己的双手。"

    # game/script.rpy:61693
    old "It was there. Still gray, I had it in my hands."
    new "它就在那里。它仍是灰色的，正握在我手中。"

    # game/script.rpy:61694
    old "Did I really duplicate it...?"
    new "我真的把它复制出来了吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:61695
    old "I looked at the marble, where I'd left the Past Sekimeiya before traveling."
    new "我望向那张大理石台面——穿越之前，我把 过去Sekimeiya 放在了那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:61696
    old "What!? It's not there!"
    new "什么！？它不在那儿！"

    # game/script.rpy:61698
    old "The Future Sekimeiya was where I'd touched it, and it was gray. That proved I'd traveled to the future. However, the original Past Sekimeiya was gone: I hadn't duplicated it."
    new "未来Sekimeiya 仍在我触碰它的地方，颜色是灰的。这证明我确实穿越到了未来。可是，原本那个 过去Sekimeiya 却不见了——我并没有把它复制出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:61699
    old "What the hell? Can the Sekimeiya not be duplicated?{w} It seems like the original one disappeared when I appeared with it in the future and disallowed the duplication. There's no way anyone came and took it during the nine seconds I wasn't here, right?"
    new "搞什么？难道 Sekimeiya 无法被复制？{w} 看来，当我带着它在未来出现时，这次复制便不成立，原本那一个也就消失了。总不可能有人趁我不在的那九秒里把它拿走吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:61703
    old "It was bizarre, but the fact that I'd appeared with it was notable. It had counted as one of my past possessions."
    new "这很离奇，但我能带着它一起出现，这一点值得注意。它确实算作了我过去持有的物品之一。"

    # game/script.rpy:61704
    old "While I was thinking, the Past Sekimeiya powered on."
    new "就在我思考的时候，过去Sekimeiya 启动了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61705
    old "It's still working.{w} I wonder if the fact that it was powered off mattered at all."
    new "它还能用。{w} 不知道「处于关闭状态」这一点到底有没有影响。"

    # game/script.rpy:61706
    old "I repeated the same process but held the powered Past Sekimeiya with my sleeves for half a minute.{w} Then, I left it in the refrigerator to avoid overlapping ranges and went nine seconds to the future."
    new "我把同样的流程重做了一遍，只是这次隔着袖子，握了那个启动中的 过去Sekimeiya 半分钟。{w} 随后，为了避开重叠范围，我把它放进冰箱，再穿越到九秒之后。"

    # game/script.rpy:61708
    old "...{w}I didn't appear with the Sekimeiya. My hands looked to be holding something that wasn't there."
    new "……{w}我没有带着 Sekimeiya 出现。我的双手维持着握着什么东西的姿势，可手里空无一物。"

    # game/script.rpy:61709
    old "I opened the refrigerator and saw the Past Sekimeiya where I'd just left it."
    new "我打开冰箱，看见 过去Sekimeiya 就放在我刚放下的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:61710
    old "So it did matter that it wasn't active. When it isn't, its powers fade temporarily, and it acts as a normal object."
    new "看来它没有启动，这一点确实有影响。未启动时，它的力量会暂时消退，变得和普通物品一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:61711
    old "What would happen if I did the reverse of this? Wouldn't the past change?{w} If I go to the past holding the powered-off Future Sekimeiya, I would appear with it in the past, so the \"original\" one would disappear. That means that I couldn't hold it anymore when I'm traveling to the past, thereby changing it."
    new "如果把顺序反过来，会怎么样？过去不就会被改变吗？{w} 如果我拿着关闭状态的 未来Sekimeiya 回到过去，我就会带着它在过去出现，那么「原本」那一个就会消失。也就是说，我穿越回过去时不可能还拿着它——过去就这样被改写了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61714
    old "I tried it out of curiosity. Holding the Future Sekimeiya that I'd powered off, I went nine seconds to the past."
    new "出于好奇，我试了一次。我拿着那个被我关掉的 未来Sekimeiya，穿越到九秒之前。"

    # game/script.rpy:61718
    old "In the living room, however, I didn't have the Future Sekimeiya between my hands."
    new "然而，我人在客厅，两手之间却没有 未来Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:61719
    old "It didn't work? I thought that I would stay here for eighteen seconds with the Sekimeiya, so that's strange."
    new "没成功？我明明想着要带着 Sekimeiya 在这里待上十八秒，这就奇怪了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61720
    old "Suddenly, I heard a sound coming from the kitchen. It scared me at first, but I immediately understood what it was.{w} Nine seconds later, I entered through the door."
    new "忽然，厨房里传来一阵声响。我起初被吓了一跳，但马上就明白那是什么了。{w} 九秒后，我从门口走了进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:61724
    old "The disabled Sekimeiya was on the floor. It hadn't disappeared alongside my past self."
    new "那个已经失效的 Sekimeiya 躺在地板上。它并没有随过去的我一同消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:61725
    old "Why, though? I don't get it.{w} ...Wait, no, I might have an idea."
    new "可是为什么？我想不通。{w}……等等，不对，我或许有点头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:61732
    old "I think it's due to the infinite loop concept I thought of.{w} If I had appeared with the powered-off Future Sekimeiya in the past, eighteen seconds later, it would've been closer to powering on. Once the infinite loop is applied, the Sekimeiya could've never appeared powered off, and when it's powered on, it doesn't count as a normal object. I believe that's why it didn't travel."
    new "我想，这跟先前设想的无限循环有关。{w}如果断电的 未来Sekimeiya 随我一同出现在过去，那么十八秒之后，它就更接近通电了。一旦套用无限循环，Sekimeiya 就绝不可能以断电状态出现；而通电状态下，它又不算普通物体。我认为这就是它没有穿越的原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:61733
    old "...What exactly would happen if I wait in the middle of the living room for a few seconds, move the sofa to where I'd been standing, and then travel to the future?"
    new "……如果我站在客厅中央等上几秒，把沙发挪到我刚才站的位置，再穿越到未来，究竟会发生什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:61734
    old "My appearance would collide with the sofa, but what would that do? Would I overwrite part of the sofa? Would it cut off my legs and kill me?"
    new "我出现时会与沙发相撞，可那会造成什么后果？我会覆盖掉沙发的一部分吗？还是沙发会截断我的双腿，要了我的命？"

    # game/script.rpy:61735
    old "It's too risky to test that, but I have no idea what the result would be. After all, I've been appearing where there is air, and it seems I'm overwriting it, or else it would also kill me."
    new "拿这个做实验太危险了，可我完全猜不到结果。毕竟我每次出现的位置都有空气，看样子是我把空气覆盖掉了，否则空气同样会要了我的命。"

    # game/script.rpy:61736
    old "The case might be different if I appear on top of a solid object, though."
    new "不过，如果我出现在某个固体物体上面，情况也许就不一样了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61743
    old "Indeed. That is the fate Sai A met."
    new "正是。那便是 Sai A 所遭遇的命运。"

    # game/script.rpy:61745
    old "Incorrect. That is the fate Sai A met."
    new "不对。那才是 Sai A 遭遇的命运。"

    # game/script.rpy:61749
    old "In his world, he was the first person to leave room B4, in which everyone waited."
    new "在他的世界里，所有人都在 B4房间等待，而他是第一个离开那里的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:61750
    old "After his departure, he never came back. He was never again seen alive."
    new "他离开之后，再没有回来。从此没人见过活着的他。"

    # game/script.rpy:61753
    old "Unaware of what awaited him, he touched the Future Sekimeiya that had been hidden in the attic."
    new "他并不知道等待自己的是什么，伸手碰了那个藏在阁楼里的 未来Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:61757
    old "For a prolonged period of time, he had been sitting against a door in a crystal room. However, when he appeared there in the future, that door had been opened..."
    new "他曾在水晶展室里靠着一扇门坐了很久。然而当他于未来出现在那里时，那扇门已经被人打开了……"

    # game/script.rpy:61765
    old "I've been figuring all of this out, but I still don't fully understand the most important aspect: the amount of time traveled.{w} I've been repeatedly traveling nine seconds through time, so it has to be consistent as well."
    new "这些我已经一点点理清了，可最关键的一点仍没弄明白：穿越的时间长度。{w}我反复穿越的都是九秒，那它也应该是一致的才对。"

    # game/script.rpy:61766
    old "Thirty seconds stored equals nine seconds traveled. Two minutes stored equals 45 seconds traveled.{w} There's already an indication here: each stored second turns into more amount of time traveled than the previous. In the first case, each second stored added 0.3 seconds traveled. In the second case, each second stored added 0.37 seconds traveled."
    new "蓄能三十秒，穿越九秒；蓄能两分钟，穿越 45 秒。{w}这里已经有迹象了：每多蓄一秒，换算出的穿越时间都比前一秒更多。第一种情况，每蓄一秒增加 0.3 秒；第二种情况，每蓄一秒增加 0.37 秒。"

    # game/script.rpy:61767
    old "And it's evident this keeps going—fifteen minutes stored led into twenty minutes traveled. In that case, each second stored added 1.3 seconds.{w} Earlier, keeping the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet for 25 minutes made me travel about 45 minutes to the past. That's a pretty noticeable increase. Each stored second would've counted for 1.8 seconds traveled."
    new "而且很明显，这个趋势还在延续——蓄能十五分钟，穿越二十分钟。这样算下来，每蓄一秒等于 1.3 秒。{w}之前我把 Sekimeiya 放在展示柜外二十五分钟，结果穿越到了约四十五分钟前。增幅相当明显，每蓄一秒已经相当于 1.8 秒的穿越时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:61770
    old "So the more time it's gathered, the larger the increase is. It's exponential.{w} The difference between five and ten minutes is very little compared to the difference between twenty and 25. For a while, the numbers will be low, but there'll be a point where they suddenly become immense.{w} Once the Sekimeiya has been out of the cabinet for 35 minutes, how much will one stored second equal to?{w} ...What about after an hour?"
    new "也就是说，蓄能越久，增幅越大。这是指数级的。{w}五分钟到十分钟的差距，跟二十分钟到二十五分钟的差距相比微不足道。起初数值会很低，但总有一刻会突然变得极其庞大。{w}Sekimeiya 离开展示柜三十五分钟后，蓄一秒会等于多少？{w}……那一小时之后呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:61771
    old "There's an indication that I'm correct about this: Akaro and Shiroya.{w} They traveled days through time, and so did I. Akaro said he touched the Sekimeiya while we were in the attic's bedroom, so it's very possible it stored energy for a long time."
    new "有件事可以证明我猜得没错：Akaro 和 Shiroya。{w}他们穿越了数日之久，我也是。Akaro 说，我们还在阁楼卧室时他碰过 Sekimeiya，所以它很可能已经蓄能了很长时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:61772
    old "In any case, the increase of the time traveled is not gradual. However, I think something might be."
    new "无论如何，穿越时间的增长不是渐进的。不过我认为，有另一样东西或许是渐进的。"

    # game/script.rpy:61779
    old "The range. That's what all the travels indicate."
    new "重叠范围。所有的穿越都指向这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:61780
    old "Although I still don't fully comprehend it, I believe it must work under a gradual increase. Otherwise, when Akaro and Shiroya traveled days through time, we would've traveled as well."
    new "虽然我还没完全弄懂它，但我认为它的变化一定是渐进的。否则 Akaro 和 Shiroya 穿越了数天，我们也该一起穿越了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61782
    old "There is something else that could follow a similar progression, which is the time it spends recovering.{w} No matter the amount of time traveled, the Sekimeiya always spends a while gray. However, the amount of time stored seems to gradually add to the guaranteed amount."
    new "还有另一样东西也可能呈现类似的渐进变化，那就是它的恢复时间。{w}无论穿越多久，Sekimeiya 总会维持一段灰色状态。不过，蓄能的时长似乎会一点点累加到那段保底时间上。"

    # game/script.rpy:61786
    old "There's gotta be a formula behind the amount of time traveled that always applies."
    new "穿越的时长背后一定有一个始终成立的公式。"

    # game/script.rpy:61787
    old "What could it be? A formula that increases the amount each second adds as more seconds have passed...{w} If I could figure it out, I could use the Sekimeiya to appear at any point in time."
    new "会是什么公式？蓄能秒数越多，每秒换算出的时长也跟着增加的公式……{w}如果能解出来，我就能用 Sekimeiya 出现在任何时间点。"

    # game/script.rpy:61788
    old "Thankfully, if it doesn't change over time, I could do small-scale tests to figure out what exactly would occur at a larger scale; observing the difference between 30, 31, 32, 33, 34, and 35 stored seconds might be all I need to understand what one hour of stored time would cause."
    new "好在只要公式不随时间改变，我就能用小规模实验推知大规模的结果；只要比较蓄能 30、31、32、33、34、35 秒之间的差异，或许就足以弄清蓄能一小时会带来什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:61789
    old "But my way to measure time isn't precise, and I can't measure decimals. I might need a calculator too, and I don't know if there'd be one here in the attic."
    new "可我计时的方式并不精确，也量不出小数。也许还需要计算器，而我不知道这阁楼里有没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:61792
    old "Why was I so preoccupied with the idea? Was it due to mere curiosity?{w} No. That wasn't all. At some point, I had realized it."
    new "我为什么对这件事如此执着？只是出于好奇吗？{w}不，不只是这样。在某个时候，我已经意识到了这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:61793
    old "While locked in the tower for twelve hours, I'd spent a long time trying to figure out if saving Miiya was possible. And I knew, at that moment, that it was.{w} However, those thoughts had all faded from my mind some time previously. Shiroya had caused me to abandon the idea of saving her.{w} But I'd learned that wasn't the real Shiroya, and it made a lot of sense—she would never have said that. She had wanted to save Miiya just like me and had been prepared to do it once I'd told her it was possible."
    new "被困在塔里的那十二个小时，我花了很长时间思考救下 Miiya 是否可行。而在那一刻，我已经知道这是可行的。{w}然而那些念头，早在之前某个时候就从我脑中消散了。是 Shiroya 让我放弃了救她的想法。{w}可我已经知道那不是真正的 Shiroya——这样一切都说得通了，她绝不会说出那种话。她和我一样想救 Miiya，只要我告诉她可行，她早就做好了准备。"

    # game/script.rpy:61794
    old "Had I truly heard Miiya earlier? ...That voice continually replayed in my head, but I couldn't understand the circumstances around it."
    new "我先前真的听到了 Miiya 的声音吗？……那个声音在我脑中反复回响，可我理不清它究竟是怎么来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:61797
    old "I don't know how reasonable this is. After a while of storing time, being off by even a single decimal would result in a substantial difference..."
    new "我不知道这个办法有多可靠。蓄能时间一长，哪怕只差一个小数位，结果也会天差地别……"

    # game/script.rpy:61798
    old "Even if I analyze repeated short travels to the future, it might take me a really long time to come up with an accurate equation with just these two timers."
    new "就算反复分析短时间穿越到未来的情况，光靠这两个计时器要推出准确的公式，恐怕也得花上很久。"

    # game/script.rpy:61799
    old "I had no idea how long I'd be alone in the tower, but I couldn't afford to spend hours perfecting a formula. I didn't even know if it was consistent in the first place."
    new "我不知道自己还要在塔里独自待多久，但耗上几个小时去打磨一个公式，我耗不起。何况我连它是否始终一致都还不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:61801
    old "My mind went back to a thought I'd had long in the past. When I'd originally conceived of thought-up loops, I'd also considered a particular scenario."
    new "我想起了很久以前有过的某个念头。最初构思假想循环的时候，我也曾设想过一种特定的情形。"

    # game/script.rpy:61806
    old "\"Depending on how it works, the possibilities could be limitless. There's even a higher step to reach.\""
    new "看它如何运作，可能性也许无穷无尽，甚至还有更高的一层可以抵达。"

    # game/script.rpy:61807
    old "\"It's considerably different, but it follows along with a few things I thought about earlier, regarding the date displayed on Sai's watch.\""
    new "「这跟之前大不一样，却和我早先关于 Sai 手表上那个日期的几点想法对得上。」"

    # game/script.rpy:61808
    old "\"Out of the countless examples, could you go back in time, trade information with someone, write it all down, and leave it all on a note that you'd see before traveling through time?\""
    new "在无数例子中，有没有这样一种：你回到过去，和某人交换信息，把一切写下来，全部留在一张便条上，让自己在时间穿越前看到？"

    # game/script.rpy:61809
    old "\"You'd read the note and go back to the past. However, since you would already know the contents of it, you'd have no reason to exchange the information—all you'd have to do is leave behind the note you'd read so that you could read it before traveling.\""
    new "你读到那张便条，然后回到过去。可既然你已经知道上面的内容，就没有理由再去交换信息——你只需把读过的那张便条留下，让自己在穿越前读到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:61810
    old "\"The note itself would be a paradox that you caused, but was the past truly changed? Was a past in which you exchanged information truly overwritten? ...Or did it never exist in the first place?\""
    new "那张便条本身会是你造成的悖论，但过去真的被改变了吗？那个你曾交换信息的过去，真的被覆盖了吗？……还是说，它从一开始就不存在？"

    # game/script.rpy:61811
    old "\"...If Sai's watch got to \"9999-12-31\" by spending infinite time in a loop, did the pasts in which the time counted up to that date really exist in any capacity?\""
    new "……如果 Sai 的手表是在循环中度过了无限时间才走到「9999-12-31」，那么那些让表上的时间累积到那个日期的过去，到底有没有以任何形式存在过？"

    # game/script.rpy:61817
    old "...Would something like that actually be possible?"
    new "……这种事真的可能发生吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:61818
    old "I don't have the time needed to find an equation that lets me calculate time values for the Sekimeiya, but as long as it's possible to find, could I use something like this to obtain it?"
    new "我没有时间去推导一条能算出 Sekimeiya 时间数值的公式，但只要它确实可以被找到，我能不能用这种办法把它弄到手？"

    # game/script.rpy:61819
    old "How long would it take me to find it? Maybe two hours of monitoring innumerable travels?"
    new "找到它需要多久？也许要花两个小时，盯着无数次穿越？"

    # game/script.rpy:61820
    old "If I extrapolate my old scenario to this, it would look something like... going two hours back in time, spending them working to find the formula, and noting it down on a piece of paper that I would hide inside a drawer. Before traveling two hours back, I would find the note, and in the past, as I would already know the formula, I would just have to write it down and leave it in the drawer."
    new "把旧设想套用到这件事上，大概会是这样……回到两小时前，用这两个小时推导公式，再把它记在纸上，藏进抽屉。而在穿越回两小时之前，我会先找到那张纸条；回到过去后，既然我已经知道公式，只需把它写下来放进抽屉即可。"

    # game/script.rpy:61821
    old "But this isn't applicable, because if I go two hours back, I won't have access to the Sekimeiya. I've been testing with them, so if I go back and use them, I'll be changing the past, and the note will not be written in my current reality."
    new "但这行不通，因为回到两小时前，我就拿不到 Sekimeiya 了。我一直在用它们做实验，如果回去之后继续使用，就等于改变了过去，那张纸条也就不会出现在我当前的现实里。"

    # game/script.rpy:61824
    old "But what if I change it up a little?"
    new "不过，如果我稍作改动呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:61825
    old "Let's say I take the Past Sekimeiya out of the refrigerator. Two minutes later, I touch it and go 45 seconds back. I'm not even sure if this first travel would be needed, but it might be."
    new "假设我把 过去Sekimeiya 从冰箱里拿出来。两分钟后，我碰它一下，回到 45 秒前。我还不确定这第一次穿越有没有必要，但也许有。"

    # game/script.rpy:61826
    old "Then, 45 seconds later, my original self will disappear, and I'll spend two hours testing with both Sekimeiya to come up with the right formula. Once I have it, I'll go back in time to a point before I traveled the 45 seconds and write down the formula."
    new "接着，45 秒之后，原本的我会消失，而我将用两个小时，拿两个 Sekimeiya 反复试验，推出正确的公式。一旦得到公式，我就回到进行那 45 秒穿越之前的某个时刻，把公式写下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:61827
    old "Before traveling the 45 seconds, I'll read the note with the formula. Then, 45 seconds in the past, I'll write it down so that my original self can see it.{w} Would this allow me to spend two hours finding the formula without actually having to waste that time?"
    new "在穿越那 45 秒之前，我会先读那张写着公式的纸条。然后回到 45 秒前，把它写下来，好让原本的我能看到。{w}这样一来，我岂不是能花两个小时找出公式，却又不必真的耗掉那两个小时？"

    # game/script.rpy:61828
    old "There was no point in assuming an answer because it was easy to test. I readied myself to perform the loop and started to store time with the Past Sekimeiya.{w} However, when I looked at the drawer where I wanted the note to be hidden, it was empty."
    new "凭空假定答案没有意义，因为这件事一试便知。我做好准备，要执行这个循环，便用 过去Sekimeiya 开始蓄能。{w}然而，当我看向那个准备用来藏纸条的抽屉时，里面空无一物。"

    # game/script.rpy:61831
    old "Huh, okay. ...Why did it not work?"
    new "咦，好吧。……可为什么没成功呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:61832
    old "The success of the loop required the existence of hypothetical events. In reality, if I had seen the note, I would never have spent two hours working to find the formula—those events would only have existed in a hypothetical history. Once their result was known, their existence would've become unneeded."
    new "循环要成立，假想事件就必须存在。可在现实中，如果我已经看到了那张纸条，就绝不会再花两个小时去推公式——那些事只会存在于一段假想的历史里。一旦结果已知，它们也就没有存在的必要了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61833
    old "Am I mistaken, then? Is this concept just unworkable?{w} That can't be. It's the same thing as the recorder powering off when I go to the past: the hypothetical realities in which it progressively loses battery need to exist in order for it to appear without power in the real one."
    new "那么是我想错了？这套思路根本行不通？{w}不可能。这跟我回到过去时录音笔会断电是一个道理：它必须在那些假想现实里一点点耗尽电量，才能在真正的现实中以没电的状态出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:61834
    old "Although I didn't fully understand that, as the recorder not degrading physically still didn't make sense to me."
    new "只是我并未完全想通——录音笔本身没有任何损耗，这一点我始终无法理解。"

    # game/script.rpy:61835
    old "What if it didn't work because two hours wouldn't have been enough to determine the formula? Or what if, during those two hours, people would've shown up and I would've been unable to continue and go to the past to leave the note behind?"
    new "会不会是因为两个小时根本不够推出公式？又或者，那两个小时里有人来了，我无法继续，也没法回到过去把纸条留下？"

    # game/script.rpy:61838
    old "If two hours wouldn't have been enough, what about ten? What if it would've taken me more than twenty hours to refine the formula until it was consistent with every travel?"
    new "两个小时不够，那十个小时呢？要把公式修正到与每一次穿越都吻合，说不定得花上二十多个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:61839
    old "The tower will open at {time=21}, so assuming no one else comes, even in a hypothetical world, I would only have until {time=21} to experiment... Actually, probably way less than that, because to travel to the past and appear in the tower, I'd have to be inside it hours after {time=21.}"
    new "塔要到 {time=21} 才会开放，所以假设没有别人来，即便在假想世界里，我也只能在 {time=21} 之前做实验……不，实际时间恐怕还要短得多，因为要回到过去并出现在塔内，我得在 {time=21.} 之后好几个小时还待在塔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:61841
    old "...But assuming I had all the time I needed, would I be able to use a hypothetical world to my advantage? Could I make use of countless hours without actually spending any?{w} ...I considered that there might've been a way to test it."
    new "……不过，假如时间充裕，我能不能把假想世界利用起来？能不能用掉无数个小时，而现实中一个小时都不必花？{w}……我想，或许有办法验证这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:61842
    old "I took the Past Sekimeiya out and pressed \"play\" on the recorder. Following that, I went to the living room with the Past Sekimeiya and the recorder and closed the door to the kitchen."
    new "我取出 过去Sekimeiya，按下录音笔的播放键。随后，我带着 过去Sekimeiya 和录音笔去了客厅，关上了通往厨房的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:61846
    old "I had to think very thoroughly about it. Instead of using a single hypothetical world, what if I used multiple at once by making it recursive?"
    new "这件事得想得非常透彻。与其只用一个假想世界，不如让它们层层嵌套，一次动用许多个？"

    # game/script.rpy:61851
    old "...{w}If I touch the Sekimeiya when fifteen minutes have passed, I'll go twenty minutes to the past.{w} But before I touch it, I'll open the door to the hallway and find a notepad from the bedrooms on the floor. Depending on what it says, I'll do one of three things."
    new "……{w}等过了十五分钟，我再去碰 Sekimeiya，就会回到二十分钟前。{w}不过在碰它之前，我要先打开通往走廊的门，看看地上有没有从卧室拿来的笔记本。看上面写着什么，我再决定做三件事中的哪一件。"

    # game/script.rpy:61852
    old "1: If it has a formula written down, I'll go twenty minutes to the past, obtain the notepad, write the formula down, and leave it in the hallway."
    new "一：如果上面写着公式，我就回到二十分钟前，拿到那本笔记本，把公式抄下来，再放回走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:61853
    old "2: If I don't find a notepad, I'll go twenty minutes to the past, and using the Future Sekimeiya in the kitchen, I'll start to work toward finding the formula. Before twenty minutes pass, I'll obtain a notepad from the bedrooms, and in the top left corner of the first page, I'll write a \"1\" along with the progress I made in those twenty minutes. Then, I'll leave it in the hallway."
    new "二：如果没找到笔记本，我就回到二十分钟前，用厨房里的 未来Sekimeiya 开始推算公式。二十分钟结束前，我从卧室取来一本笔记本，在第一页左上角写上一个“1”，再写下这二十分钟里取得的进展，然后把笔记本留在走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:61854
    old "3: If I find a notepad that doesn't contain the formula, it will have my current progress along with a number in the top left corner of the first page, which will indicate the amount of iterations that have occurred so far.{w} I'll go back to the past, and using the information I read in the notepad, I'll start working to find the formula. Before the twenty minutes pass, I'll write down the updated progress in a notepad from the bedrooms, increase the number I saw in the top left corner by one, and then leave the notepad in the hallway."
    new "三：如果找到的笔记本上没有公式，那上面会写着我当前的进展，第一页左上角还有一个数字，代表到目前为止已经重复了多少轮。{w}我就回到过去，依据笔记本上读到的内容继续推算公式。二十分钟结束前，我把更新后的进展写进一本从卧室拿来的笔记本，再把左上角的数字加一，然后把笔记本留在走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:61858
    old "This makes use of infinite time. By repeatedly using these twenty minutes across multiple hypothetical worlds, I can carry my progress over until the formula is found. I'm able to compress years' worth of calculations into a single twenty-minute loop."
    new "这样就能动用无限的时间。借助多个假想世界把这二十分钟反复重演，我就能不断累积进展，直到找出公式。数年的计算，可以压缩进一个二十分钟的循环里。"

    # game/script.rpy:61859
    old "Since all the worlds will collapse into a final result, I'll always find the real formula behind the hallway door if this is viable; actions 2 and 3 are only for the hypothetical worlds."
    new "既然所有世界最终都会收敛成一个结果，那么只要这套办法可行，我打开走廊那扇门时，看到的就一定是真正的公式；第二、第三种做法只发生在假想世界里。"

    # game/script.rpy:61860
    old "As another final point, if the number in the top left corner exceeds, say, a billion, then I can be confident no answer exists."
    new "最后还有一点：如果左上角的数字超过十亿这样的量级，那我就基本可以确定，这道公式根本无解。"

    # game/script.rpy:61861
    old "...{w}I realized the plan had a small flaw."
    new "……{w}我意识到，这个计划有一个小小的漏洞。"

    # game/script.rpy:61862
    old "But if in the real world, I open the hallway door and find no notepad, I'll think that the plan hasn't worked and won't go through with the first loop. In the same way, the first hypothetical version of me, instead of assuming that he's about to start the first iteration, would assume that the plan is flawed and wouldn't start the sequence. If I want this to work, I'll have to execute the first loop in the instance that I don't find a notepad in the hallway right now.{w} This is okay, because even though the plan wouldn't work for me, I'd have to resort to trying to find the formula manually in the real world. Executing the first loop would work toward that, and it would make the plan succeed if the concept is valid."
    new "可如果我在现实世界里打开走廊的门，什么笔记本都没找到，我就会认定计划失败，也不会去走第一轮。同样，第一个假想中的我也不会认为自己正要开始第一轮，而会断定计划有破绽，从而不肯启动这一连串循环。要让计划成立，我必须在此时此刻——在走廊里没有找到笔记本的这一刻——照样执行第一轮。{w}这没关系，因为即便这套计划对我无效，我在现实中也只能靠手工去推公式。执行第一轮正是在为此铺路；而只要那个构想成立，计划就会因此成功。"

    # game/script.rpy:61870
    old "Thirteen minutes had passed."
    new "十三分钟过去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61873
    old "I hadn't heard anything in the attic; if another version of me had been ready to pass the formula on to me, he'd been very quiet."
    new "阁楼里一点动静也没有。就算有另一个我正等着把公式交给我，他也安静得很。"

    # game/script.rpy:61874
    old "Still completely clueless as to whether it would work, I approached the hallway."
    new "我仍然完全不知道这办法行不行，就这样朝走廊走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:61881
    old "My mouth dropped to the floor. Flashes of a certain bedroom popped in my mind, a normal occurrence after seeing my own messy handwriting."
    new "我目瞪口呆。某个卧室的画面在脑海里一闪而过——每次看见自己潦草的字迹，都会这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:61882
    old "A notepad was beside my feet, containing a large string of numbers on the first page. Upon closer inspection, it was definitely a formula—far from a clean one."
    new "脚边放着一本笔记本，第一页写着一长串数字。凑近一看，那无疑是一条公式——只是远谈不上工整。"

    # game/script.rpy:61883
    old "This is really it. It actually worked...!"
    new "就是这个。居然真的成了……！"

    # game/script.rpy:61884
    old "All the pages after the first one were completely empty. There was no number on the top left, so I didn't know how many iterations had been needed to reach it, but its complexity was evident."
    new "第一页之后全是空白。左上角没有数字，所以我不知道一共重复了多少轮才得到它，但它的复杂程度一目了然。"

    # game/script.rpy:61885
    old "So Shiroya and Akaro weren't lying... Touching the Sekimeiya after an hour of stored time will really send you weeks through time, and I can calculate the exact amount."
    new "看来 Shiroya 和 Akaro 没有说谎……蓄能一个小时之后再碰 Sekimeiya，真的会把人送到几个星期之外，而且我还能算出具体的数值。"

    # game/script.rpy:61889
    old "Before that, though, I had to travel to the past. Less than twenty seconds remained until the fifteen-minute mark. When the timer hit it, I touched the Past Sekimeiya."
    new "不过在那之前，我得先回到过去。距离十五分钟还差不到二十秒。计时一到，我便碰了 过去Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:61894
    old "As expected, I appeared in the hallway, right next to the kitchen, which was closed. I had gone twenty minutes back, but the Past Sekimeiya had only stored energy for fifteen. During the first five minutes, I had no access to the kitchen because my past self was there. In the hypothetical loops, that time would've been used to check the progress made until the previous iteration."
    new "不出所料，我出现在走廊上，就在关着门的厨房旁边。我回到了二十分钟前，可 过去Sekimeiya 只蓄了十五分钟的能量。最初五分钟里我进不了厨房，因为过去的我还在里面。在假想的循环中，这段时间本该用来查看截至上一轮取得的进展。"

    # game/script.rpy:61898
    old "I went to the right bedroom and took a notepad from a drawer. I recalled all the numbers that had comprised the formula and wrote them down."
    new "我走进右边的卧室，从抽屉里取出一本笔记本，把构成公式的那些数字一一回忆出来，写在了上面。"

    # game/script.rpy:61902
    old "Then, I silently approached the hallway and left the notepad next to the living room."
    new "然后，我悄无声息地走到走廊，把笔记本放在客厅旁边。"

    # game/script.rpy:61903
    old "This is crazy. I wonder how much time was spent to reach this equation. It feels like an instant result for my real self, so I could even use something like this to brute force the computer passwords downstairs."
    new "简直是疯了。不知道为这条公式花了多少时间。对现实中的我来说，结果却像凭空得来的一样——用这种办法，我甚至可以硬破楼下电脑的密码。"

    # game/script.rpy:61904
    old "I stood in silence until I heard my past self leaving the kitchen."
    new "我一声不响地站着，直到听见过去的我离开厨房。"

    # game/script.rpy:61910
    old "The Future Sekimeiya's in the refrigerator..."
    new "未来Sekimeiya 在冰箱里……"

    # game/script.rpy:61911
    old "I had a slight doubt. I understood the formula, but a certain factor wasn't part of it."
    new "我心里还有一点疑问。公式我看懂了，但其中少了一个因素。"

    # game/script.rpy:61912
    old "Is that really it? Is there no other influential factor?"
    new "真的就这些？没有别的变量会影响结果？"

    # game/script.rpy:61913
    old "I stepped over to the sink and set the plug for the drain. Then, I filled it with water very slowly so that I didn't make noise. Once it reached the top, I took the Future Sekimeiya out and put it in the water."
    new "我走到水槽边，堵好排水口，然后极慢地放水，以免发出声响。等水满到边缘，我取出 未来Sekimeiya，把它放进水里。"

    # game/script.rpy:61914
    old "I set the oven to count for ten minutes. When only five had passed, I put my hand in the water and touched the Sekimeiya."
    new "我把烤箱定时十分钟。只过了五分钟，我就把手伸进水里，碰了 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:61915
    old "I appeared in the kitchen and immediately saw the disabled Future Sekimeiya under the water. Then I looked at the oven and saw the amount of time I'd gone to the future.{w} The timer was at 4:31, immediately ticking down to 4:30."
    new "我出现在厨房，立刻看见水里那个已经停摆的未来Sekimeiya。接着我看向烤箱，看看自己往未来跳了多久。{w}计时器显示 4:31，转眼就跳成了 4:30。"

    # game/script.rpy:61916
    old "29 seconds. I have gone 29 seconds forward.{w} So I was right. There's another factor:{w} the temperature."
    new "29 秒。我向前跳了 29 秒。{w}果然，我没猜错。还有一个因素：{w}温度。"

    # game/script.rpy:61919
    old "The water is at room temperature, and the Sekimeiya spent five minutes in it. I should've definitely gone more than 29 seconds forward."
    new "水是常温的，而 Sekimeiya 在里面泡了五分钟。按理说，我向前跳的时间绝不止 29 秒。"

    # game/script.rpy:61920
    old "But the heat capacity of water is four times the air's, meaning that it heats up four times slower.{w} It appears a temperature higher than the cabinet lets the Sekimeiya store energy and become hot. Of course, that heats up the air around it.{w} Then, that same air makes the Sekimeiya even hotter, leading into the infinite increase of energy."
    new "可水的比热是空气的四倍，升温速度也就慢四倍。{w}看来，只要周围温度高于展示柜内部，Sekimeiya 就能蓄能并升温。它当然也会把周围的空气加热。{w}而这些空气又让它更热，如此循环，能量便无止境地增长。"

    # game/script.rpy:61921
    old "This is why the water's different heat capacity changes things. Because water heats up four times slower, five minutes submerged in it is the same as 75 seconds outside it. So I only traveled 29 seconds. I'm sure the hypothetical versions of me thought about this too when they were coming up with the equation, but it's not really part of it, it just modifies the result."
    new "水的比热不同，结果也就变了。水升温慢四倍，泡上五分钟，只相当于在外面放了 75 秒。所以我只跳了 29 秒。假想中的我在推公式时想必也考虑过这一点，但它并不算公式的一部分，只是对结果作修正。"

    # game/script.rpy:61922
    old "Finally, this answers the last question regarding that time Erina touched the Sekimeiya."
    new "最后，这也解开了 Erina 那次碰 Sekimeiya 留下的最后一个疑问。"

    # game/script.rpy:61930
    old "Why were we encompassed within Erina's range? The Sekimeiya had spent fifteen minutes outside the cabinet, and based on the previous identical travel, we should've been outside of it."
    new "为什么我们会落在 Erina 的范围内？Sekimeiya 离开展示柜已经有十五分钟，按照先前那次相同的穿越来看，我们本应处在范围之外。"

    # game/script.rpy:61938
    old "\"Erina opened the glass and rolled the Sekimeiya into her purse, avoiding direct contact with it.\""
    new "「Erina 打开玻璃罩，把 Sekimeiya 拨进她的手提包，避免直接碰到它。」"

    # game/script.rpy:61939
    old "That's why. For those fifteen minutes, the Sekimeiya was in her purse.{w} That led to the opposite situation as the water. The air inside the purse couldn't easily escape, so it heated up faster than outside it. That is the reason why the range was bigger.{w} And Sai, the only person who actually traveled through time, would have been sent more than twenty minutes."
    new "原来如此。那十五分钟里，Sekimeiya 一直在她的手提包里。{w}这就和水里的情形正好相反。包里的空气不易散出，升温比包外更快。范围之所以更大，原因就在这里。{w}而真正穿越了时间的只有 Sai，他应该被送去了二十多分钟之外。"

    # game/script.rpy:61940
    old "I wonder how much of an effect this had on the travels. When the Sekimeiya was in the other cabinets, for example, did it heat up faster? Their interiors are wide, but I'm sure there was an imperceptible difference."
    new "不知道这对那些穿越有多大的影响。比如说，Sekimeiya 放在别的展示柜里时，升温是否也会更快？那些柜子内部空间宽敞，但肯定存在着难以察觉的差异。"

    # game/script.rpy:61949
    old "Maybe you noticed the instances where this property was a factor in play."
    new "或许你已经注意到，有几处情形正是这个特性在起作用。"

    # game/script.rpy:61950
    old "Earlier, did you wonder why Shiroya world switched alongside Naomi? She was in the staircase while the Sekimeiya were on the sofa, and they had recently been taken out of the cabinet."
    new "先前你有没有想过，Shiroya 为什么会和 Naomi 一同发生世界切换？她当时在楼梯间，Sekimeiya 则放在沙发上，不久前才从展示柜里取出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:61951
    old "As you might guess, it was Katei's tight suitcase that let the Sekimeiya gain power faster than normal."
    new "你应该也猜到了，正是 Katei 那只塞得严严实实的行李箱，让 Sekimeiya 蓄能的速度比平时更快。"

    # game/script.rpy:61959
    old "That... might be everything. Although I could be wrong on details that I can't verify, I can apply the time formula as long as I touch the Sekimeiya outside the water and in this room. The temperature in the attic doesn't feel different from everywhere else, but I should stay here."
    new "大概……就是这些了。有些细节我无从验证，或许会有出入，但只要在这间房里、不隔着水触碰 Sekimeiya，我就能套用时间公式。阁楼和别处的温度感觉不出差别，不过我还是应该留在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:61960
    old "I heard myself in the living room stepping to the hallway. Soon after, that me touched the Sekimeiya and went back in time."
    new "我听见客厅里的自己走向走廊。紧接着，那个我便触碰了 Sekimeiya，回到了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:61964
    old "I retrieved the Past Sekimeiya and the recorder, then stepped back into the kitchen."
    new "我取回 过去Sekimeiya 和录音笔，随后走回厨房。"

    # game/script.rpy:61968
    old "I put both Sekimeiya in the refrigerator and took out the Past Sekimeiya as I began a new recording."
    new "我把两个 Sekimeiya 都放进冰箱，又取出 过去Sekimeiya，开始新一轮录音。"

    # game/script.rpy:61972
    old "I moved to the hallway; I had appeared right outside the kitchen, so I had to be there in twenty minutes. By leaving the door open, I could make sure the Future Sekimeiya was safe in the refrigerator."
    new "我走向走廊。我出现的位置就在厨房门外，所以二十分钟后我必须待在那里。只要把门敞着，我就能确认 未来Sekimeiya 在冰箱里安然无恙。"

    # game/script.rpy:61973
    old "...Is there anything else? Is there any mystery that I can't explain?"
    new "……还有别的吗？还有什么我解释不了的谜团吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:61974
    old "In the storeroom, I'd sporadically thought about the long series of events that had gone on during the twelve-hour span of time. A few ideas had come to me, but I had to seriously think about everything with what I'd learned."
    new "在储藏室里，我断断续续地回想过那十二个小时里接连发生的种种。心里也冒出过几个念头，但我必须结合已经掌握的一切，认真把事情从头想一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:61985
    old "At {time=9}, the smoke was released in the tower, beginning the attack that trapped us inside. What triggered the alarm? Was anyone aware of the Sekimeiya's powers? I'm still not sure about the details behind it, but it's a lot clearer now."
    new "{time=9}，塔内释放了烟雾，那场把我们困在里面的袭击就此开始。警报是谁触发的？有人知道 Sekimeiya 的力量吗？背后的细节我仍不清楚，但现在已经明朗了许多。"

    # game/script.rpy:61990
    old "While we were asleep, someone hid the Sekimeiya in room B4 and turned on the temperature regulation.{w} Was it Naomi? In this world, she ran up to the attic with them."
    new "我们睡着的时候，有人把 Sekimeiya 藏进了 B4房间，还打开了温度调节。{w}是 Naomi 吗？在这个世界里，是她带着它们跑上了阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:61991
    old "There's also Katei. He wasn't in the security room, and he has to be who dropped the rusty key in hallway A.{w} Beyond the truth of the attack, the third Sekimeiya, the one that doesn't work, was the only one inside the cabinet when we woke up. When Isla touched it, nothing happened to her."
    new "还有 Katei。他不在监控室，A走廊里那把生锈的钥匙一定是他掉的。{w}除了袭击的真相之外，还有一点：我们醒来时，展示柜里只剩下第三个 Sekimeiya，也就是那个失效的。Isla 碰了它，却什么也没有发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:61995
    old "We went to the security room and contacted the outside. That's when we had the call with Suripo, who told us about the story behind Ashiya and Xyn."
    new "我们去了监控室，与外界取得联系。就是那时和 Suripo 通了话，他告诉了我们芦屋与 Xyn 之间的往事。"

    # game/script.rpy:61998
    old "Before it ended, Sai turned off the monitor next to him. However, the whole computer immediately powered off too."
    new "通话结束前，Sai 关掉了他身旁的显示器。可整台电脑也随之立刻断电了。"

    # game/script.rpy:61999
    old "Who did that, and why? At this point, I believe there's an answer far more likely than the others."
    new "是谁做的，又为了什么？事到如今，我认为有一个答案远比其他的更有可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:62007
    old "I think it was Katei. The person who was sitting in front of the computer.{w} When it happened, we were about to look at the recorded footage. That would've revealed that he hadn't been in the security room and who knows what else."
    new "我想是 Katei。就是坐在电脑前的那个人。{w}当时我们正要查看录下的画面。那会揭穿他根本不在监控室，天知道还会带出什么别的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:62008
    old "He probably wanted to use Sai's trick to his advantage. We were all focused on the screen that went black, so nobody saw him pressing the power button below the desk. Due to his timing, he tried to make it seem as if both things had the same cause."
    new "他大概是想借 Sai 那一手为自己所用。我们全都盯着黑掉的屏幕，没人看见他在桌下按电源键。他挑准了时机，想让两件事看起来出自同一个原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:62009
    old "The first thing he did was crouch under the desk and check the wires. He said nothing was wrong behind the computer, but I think that what he did was disconnect a cable. Then, when he repeatedly pressed the power button, the computer didn't turn on."
    new "他做的第一件事是蹲到桌下检查线路。他说电脑后面没有问题，但我认为他其实是拔掉了一根线。接着，他反复按电源键，电脑却没有开机。"

    # game/script.rpy:62010
    old "However, he couldn't leave it like that. If we explained what had happened to the police, they would immediately notice the disconnected cable, and no one would believe a word Katei said. So, after he acted like he'd been trying to figure out the issue for a long time, he reconnected the cable and the computer was able to power back on."
    new "可他不能就这么放着不管。要是我们向警察说明经过，他们一眼就会发现那根被拔掉的线，就没人会信 Katei 说的话了。于是，他装模作样地查了很久，才把线接回去，电脑也得以重新开机。"

    # game/script.rpy:62013
    old "I don't think that's all he did, though. During all the time he was below the desk, he unplugged the camera system from the computer. Later into the day, I realized the drive that stored the recorded footage wasn't being detected."
    new "不过，我觉得他做的还不止这些。他待在桌下的那段时间里，把监控系统从电脑上拔了下来。那天稍晚，我才意识到存着录像的硬盘根本没有被识别。"

    # game/script.rpy:62014
    old "And even that wasn't all. We tried to communicate with the outside a second time, but upon inputting his credentials, an \"Access Denied\" message appeared.{w} Why? I'm not completely sure why he would've done that, but he could've purposely entered an incorrect password to prompt that message. Perhaps there was a reason why he couldn't allow a second call, but he must've done that. After all, there's no way Ashiya would've been the ones to cut our single method of communication."
    new "而且事情还不止这些。我们第二次尝试与外界联络，输入他的账号信息后，却弹出了「拒绝访问」的提示。{w}为什么？我并不完全确定他为什么要这样做，但他很可能故意输错密码，好让那行提示出现。也许出于某种原因，他不能让第二次通话打通，而这事一定是他做的。毕竟，芦屋那边绝不可能自己切断我们唯一的联络方式。"

    # game/script.rpy:62015
    old "...He wasn't in the security room when the smoke went off, but one of the things he said was that he'd tried to do his part of removing the shutter and that the system hadn't let him.{w} That didn't actually happen, but Suripo told us that a similar error was affecting Ashiya. Since Katei knew or lied about it without experiencing it, it follows he was probably the cause behind it. He didn't want the exit to open before the time limit.{w} Therefore, there was something he had to do before the time expired, and deleting the saved footage was likely part of that.{w} When we were done, we left him alone in the security room. That was the time we later learned footage had been erased; he used it to briefly reconnect the system and delete what he didn't want us to see."
    new "……烟雾弥漫的时候，他并不在监控室，但他说过一句话：他试过拆下自己负责的那部分卷帘门，系统却没让他操作。{w}这件事其实并没有发生，可 Suripo 告诉过我们，芦屋那边也出现了类似的故障。既然 Katei 没亲身经历却能知道这件事，或者干脆是在撒谎，那么他很可能就是造成这起故障的人。他不想让出口在时限之前打开。{w}也就是说，在时限结束前，他有非做不可的事，而删除已存的录像多半就是其中一环。{w}我们办完事之后，把他一个人留在了监控室。后来我们才知道，录像正是在那段时间被抹掉的——他利用那段时间短暂地接回系统，删掉了他不想让我们看到的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:62021
    old "We looked through the crystal floor, but we didn't find Naomi. Then, we separated into two groups to look through the other floors. Erina, Isla, Shiroya, and I took the elevator up to the sixth floor."
    new "我们找遍了水晶层，却没有找到 Naomi。随后我们分成两组，去其他楼层搜寻。Erina、Isla、Shiroya 和我乘电梯上了六楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:62030
    old "On the fifth floor, before Isla told us about her friend, we heard the elevator. Since we had left it on the sixth, and the other group only heard it once, it had to have been going down."
    new "在五楼，Isla 讲起她那位朋友之前，我们听见了电梯的动静。我们把电梯留在了六楼，而另一组只听到一次声响，那么它只能是在往下走。"

    # game/script.rpy:62040
    old "It was the Naomi who'd ended up trapped in the attic. When she appeared there, the elevator wasn't working, but she must have eventually tried it again after Katei reenabled it."
    new "那就是最终被困在阁楼里的 Naomi。她出现在那里时，电梯还无法使用，但等 Katei 重新启用电梯后，她一定又试着坐过一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:62041
    old "From the sixth floor, the elevator went to the attic. Of course, we didn't hear that.{w} Then, that Naomi used it to go all the way down."
    new "电梯从六楼开到了阁楼。当然，我们并没有听见。{w}随后，那个 Naomi 又乘着它一路下到了底层。"

    # game/script.rpy:62047
    old "It was soon after when we found Naomi's first corpse in the hallway B crystal room."
    new "没过多久，我们就在 B 走廊的水晶展室里发现了 Naomi 的第一具尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:62054
    old "I don't think that was the Naomi who'd taken the elevator, though. The elevator moved after one Naomi had already appeared, and her set of keys was on the first dead body."
    new "不过，我觉得那并不是乘坐电梯的 Naomi。电梯启动时，已经有一个 Naomi 现身了，而她的那串钥匙就在第一具尸体身上。"

    # game/script.rpy:62058
    old "That was likely the Naomi from our world. She appeared in front of the others and asked to talk to Katei privately. Later, the Naomi in the attic went down."
    new "那多半是来自我们世界的 Naomi。她出现在众人面前，要求和 Katei 单独谈谈。之后，阁楼里的那个 Naomi 下了楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:62059
    old "But after we waited, Katei came back alone, saying Naomi hadn't wanted to come back."
    new "可我们等了许久，Katei 独自回来了，说 Naomi 不愿意回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:62060
    old "If she was still down there, we couldn't let her keep escaping. Shiroya and I waited in front of the elevator while the others went down to make sure we'd find her.{w} Suddenly, we heard the elevator going up."
    new "如果她还在下面，我们就不能再让她这样一次次脱身。Shiroya 和我守在电梯前，其他人则下楼去，确保能找到她。{w}忽然，我们听见电梯升了上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:62063
    old "We thought that was Naomi, but we didn't find anyone where the elevator would've stopped. The reason was that my past self was the person who used it."
    new "我们以为是 Naomi，可电梯该停下的地方却没有半个人影。原因在于，使用电梯的是过去的我。"

    # game/script.rpy:62066
    old "And while we were discussing what could've happened, Akaro came running. The Sekimeiya had vanished from the cabinet for the first time."
    new "就在我们讨论究竟出了什么事的时候，Akaro 跑了过来。Sekimeiya 第一次从展示柜里消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62071
    old "Everyone was waiting near the stairs when we arrived. Shiroya and I saw the empty cabinet in the event room, but the priority was still Naomi—she had to be there."
    new "我们赶到时，大家都等在楼梯附近。Shiroya 和我看到了活动室里空掉的展示柜，但当务之急仍是 Naomi——她一定就在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:62074
    old "Making sure nobody could leave, room B4 was eventually looked into. That's where we found her corpse."
    new "为了确保没人能离开，我们最终查看了 B4房间，并在那里发现了她的尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:62082
    old "Someone coming from the future could've killed her, but I'm inclined to think it was actually Katei.{w} It happened in the room where the Sekimeiya were hidden, and in this world, Naomi didn't bring them there. That makes me think it was Katei who did."
    new "从未来过来的人也可能杀了她，但我更倾向于认为动手的就是 Katei。{w}事情发生在藏匿 Sekimeiya 的那间房里，而在这一世界，把 Sekimeiya 带过去的人并不是 Naomi。所以我才会认为是 Katei 干的。"

    # game/script.rpy:62095
    old "Naomi appeared from the second floor. She had been watching the group from a distance just in case she could gather information such as Katei's potential accomplices. Finally, she mustered the courage to confront them."
    new "Naomi 从二楼现身。她一直在远处观察众人，以便尽可能收集情报，比如 Katei 有没有潜在的同伙。最后，她鼓起勇气，走到了他们面前。"

    # game/script.rpy:62096
    old "She requested to talk to Katei privately; she represented Ashiya, so she couldn't let the others hear such a bold accusation against one of their workers if it was possible an explanation existed. However, she knew Katei had taken the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet."
    new "她要求和 Katei 单独谈谈。她代表的是芦屋，只要事情还有解释的余地，就不能让旁人听见她对公司员工做出这样大胆的指控。然而，她清楚 Katei 把 Sekimeiya 从展示柜里取了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:62101
    old "Without speaking a word, they walked to the crystal floor. There, Naomi brought Katei to the room she'd seen him leave."
    new "两人一言不发地走向水晶层。到了那里，Naomi 把 Katei 带进了她曾看见他走出来的那间房。"

    # game/script.rpy:62105
    old "The Sekimeiya had to be there. Naomi asked him to unlock all the cabinets and saw two of them lying inside."
    new "Sekimeiya 一定就在那里。Naomi 让他把所有展示柜都打开，只见里面躺着两个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:62111
    old "Raising her voice, she demanded an explanation while Katei kept quiet. He knew how bad the situation was: Naomi would bring about his doom. She would ruin everything."
    new "她提高嗓门，要他解释清楚，Katei 却一言不发。他清楚处境有多糟：Naomi 会让他万劫不复，会把一切毁于一旦。"

    # game/script.rpy:62112
    old "He didn't bother making flimsy excuses. He explained everything he'd done, hoping she would sympathize with him. He had worked in Ashiya Tower all his life; he couldn't take it anymore. He'd only wanted to free himself from the life he'd lived."
    new "他懒得编那些站不住脚的借口，索性把自己做过的事一一说了出来，希望她能体谅。他一辈子都在芦屋塔里工作，实在熬不下去了。他只是想从这样的日子里脱身。"

    # game/script.rpy:62118
    old "When she discarded Katei's justification, it was his voice that rose. There was no way he would let his life end like that."
    new "她驳回了 Katei 的辩解，这回轮到他提高嗓门了。他绝不可能让自己的生命就这样结束。"

    # game/script.rpy:62124
    old "The truth was out, so Katei attempted a bribe. If they obtained the Sekimeiya, both of them could work together to trade it off.{w} Immediately, Naomi refused—she was Ashiya's most trusted employee.{w} The third step was a threat. With a calm voice, Katei let her pick between Ashiya or her own safety. He needed her to stay quiet, and starting immediately; she knew two real Sekimeiya existed.{w} However, as Katei's words were dismissed again, he finally wavered. He had been acting stern, but that was far from reality. Inwardly, Katei burned with rage toward Naomi."
    new "真相已经败露，Katei 便试着收买她。要是拿到 Sekimeiya，两人就能联手把它转手卖掉。{w}Naomi 当即拒绝——她可是芦屋最受信任的员工。{w}第三步，他改用威胁。Katei 用平静的语气让她在芦屋和自己的安危之间做选择。他必须让她立刻保持沉默；她已经知道有两块真正的 Sekimeiya。{w}然而，她再次拒绝，他终于动摇了。他一直摆出强硬的样子，其实那全是装出来的。内心深处，Katei 对 Naomi 已是怒火中烧。"

    # game/script.rpy:62128
    old "After a sudden step forward, Katei dashed at her.{w} She had enough time to react and defend herself, but she was no match for him. After an abrupt scuffle, Katei dragged her to the wall and knocked her out. Before her death, Naomi let out a yell that only reached a single pair of ears outside the room: her own."
    new "Katei 猛然踏前一步，朝她扑了过去。{w}她有足够的时间反应，也出手自卫，但根本不是他的对手。一阵短促的扭打之后，Katei 把她拖到墙边，打昏了她。临死之前，Naomi 发出了一声喊叫，而门外听见这声音的只有一双耳朵——她自己的。"

    # game/script.rpy:62132
    old "From above, Katei stared at Naomi's body, unaware that a cabinet's temperature wheel had been damaged. Seconds later, he finally checked her breathing. ...There was none.{w} But all wasn't lost. Earlier, he had turned off that room's camera. He had known that he would have to take one of the Sekimeiya away eventually, so he had preemptively disabled the video.{w} But although he hadn't been recorded, he knew he was the only possible suspect."
    new "Katei 居高临下地望着 Naomi 的尸体，没有察觉展示柜的温度转盘已被撞坏。几秒之后，他才去探她的呼吸。……已经没有了。{w}但事情还没有到山穷水尽的地步。早些时候，他已经关掉了那间房的摄像头。他早就知道自己迟早要带走一块 Sekimeiya，因此提前让监控失效了。{w}可是，尽管没有被拍下来，他也清楚自己是唯一可能的嫌疑人。"

    # game/script.rpy:62136
    old "...That was until he heard a sudden sound that forced him out of the room. Outside, he saw Atsuki's lone figure.{w} Katei rapidly stepped aside; he couldn't afford to be seen. However, Atsuki had just been recorded by the cameras, so there was another potential culprit to build a narrative against.{w} Before he walked back up, Katei thought about what he had to say. He had killed someone else after all those years, and he could find another way out."
    new "……直到一阵突如其来的声响把他逼出了房间。到了外面，他看见了 Atsuki 孤零零的身影。{w}Katei 迅速闪到一旁，绝不能让人看见自己。不过，Atsuki 刚刚被摄像头拍了下来，也就是说，还有一个可以拿来做文章的可疑对象。{w}在往回走之前，Katei 盘算着该说些什么。时隔这么多年，他又杀了人，而他还能另寻出路。"

    # game/script.rpy:62141
    old "When Naomi's body was found, Atsuki's eyes landed on the damaged wheel. It had stopped the temperature regulation, so the Sekimeiya made him travel to the past. However, the Sekimeiya lying in the neighboring cabinet was still kept cold, so no world switch occurred."
    new "Naomi 的尸体被发现时，Atsuki 的目光落在了那个损坏的转盘上。温度调节因此停止，Sekimeiya 便把他送回了过去。不过，躺在隔壁展示柜里的那块 Sekimeiya 仍然保持着低温，所以没有发生世界切换。"

    # game/script.rpy:62152
    old "There, I traveled to the past for the first time, and twenty minutes later, I walked right back to where everyone had seen me disappear."
    new "就在那里，我第一次穿越到了过去，二十分钟后，我又走回了众人看见我消失的那个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:62155
    old "The Sekimeiya turned gray, so we brought it to its cabinet in the event room, where it became white again.{w} We heard a sound coming from outside. After all, someone else was still lurking within the tower—the Naomi who took the elevator down. The corpse had stopped our search, and we'd never looked into every room."
    new "那块 Sekimeiya 变成了灰色，我们便把它送回活动室里它原本的展示柜，它在那里又变回了白色。{w}我们听见外面传来声响。毕竟，塔里还藏着另一个人——乘电梯下楼的 Naomi。那具尸体让我们中断了搜索，我们始终没有把每一间房都查遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:62158
    old "But we couldn't let her escape, so we separated into two groups to look at both hallways. Katei, Erina, Isla, and I looked at hallway A, while Shiroya, Akaro, and Sai looked at hallway B. Despite that, we didn't find her."
    new "可我们不能让她逃掉，于是分成两组，分别查看两条走廊。我和 Katei、Erina、Isla 查看 A走廊，Shiroya、Akaro 和 Sai 则去 B走廊。即便如此，我们还是没找到她。"

    # game/script.rpy:62162
    old "When we finished, Sai reiterated his distrust for Katei and refused to believe that Naomi hadn't been found in the rooms he'd investigated."
    new "搜查结束后，Sai 再次表示不信任 Katei，也不肯相信 Katei 查过的那些房间里真的找不到 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:62163
    old "Sai wanted to confirm it for himself, which led him to enter the storeroom. There, he found a Sekimeiya."
    new "Sai 想亲自确认，便走进了储藏室。在那里，他发现了一块 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:62166
    old "Had it been taken already? We went to the event room, and it was in fact gone from the cabinet.{w} Who hid it in the storeroom? That question ate at me."
    new "难道它已经被人拿走了？我们赶到活动室，展示柜里果然空了。{w} 是谁把它藏进了储藏室？这个问题始终缠着我不放。"

    # game/script.rpy:62175
    old "I believe I now understand what happened.{w} To get the Sekimeiya out of the event room's cabinet, the key was necessary, and it was with Naomi's corpse in room B4. That means someone who investigated hallway B must have taken it to unlock the cabinet.{w} However, none of them had the chance to hide it in the storeroom without being seen by the people who'd investigated hallway A. That's why it didn't make sense."
    new "我想，我现在明白发生了什么。{w} 要把 Sekimeiya 从活动室的展示柜里取出来，必须用到钥匙；而钥匙就在 B4 房间里 Naomi 的尸体旁。也就是说，搜查 B走廊的人当中，必定有人取走钥匙打开了展示柜。{w} 可搜查 A走廊的人一直盯着，他们之中没人有机会把 Sekimeiya 藏进储藏室而不被发现。所以这件事才说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:62176
    old "The answer is that..."
    new "答案就是……"

    # game/script.rpy:62187
    old "I don't believe two people worked together. The issue was caused by a misconception."
    new "我不认为有两个人合谋。问题出在一个误解上。"

    # game/script.rpy:62189
    old "I entertained the thought that Sai had it in his hip pack, but I saw clearly when he entered the room that he didn't have the Sekimeiya yet."
    new "我曾设想，Sai 会不会把它放在腰包里；可他进房间时我看得清清楚楚，他那时还没有 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:62190
    old "It wasn't the same Sekimeiya. The first mystery regarding its whereabouts already pointed at the truth that more than one Sekimeiya existed.{w} ...After all, when Sai left the storeroom, he made me touch it, and nothing happened.{w} It was definitely the third Sekimeiya—the one that had disappeared from the event room the first time. The Past Sekimeiya was in room B4 since we'd regained consciousness, so we never actually found the one that disappeared first."
    new "那不是同一块 Sekimeiya。最初关于它下落的谜团，其实早已指向一个事实：Sekimeiya 不止一块。{w} ……毕竟，Sai 离开储藏室时让我碰过它，却什么也没发生。{w} 那肯定就是第三块 Sekimeiya——最初从活动室消失的那一块。自我们醒来后，过去Sekimeiya 就一直在 B4 房间里；也就是说，我们从未真正找到最初消失的那一块。"

    # game/script.rpy:62196
    old "Who hid the third Sekimeiya in the storeroom? That happened before Shiroya, Akaro, and I walked down from the sixth floor.{w} I don't believe it was Katei because he's likely the one who hid the two working Sekimeiya. If he wanted to also hide the third, which was originally in the event room, he would have done so while we were asleep.{w} I don't believe the other Naomi would have wanted to leave it there either."
    new "是谁把第三块 Sekimeiya 藏进了储藏室？那是发生在我、Shiroya 和 Akaro 从六楼下来之前的事。{w} 我不认为是 Katei。藏起那两块还能用的 Sekimeiya 的人，多半就是他。若他还想连原本放在活动室的第三块也一并藏起来，趁我们睡着时动手就行了。{w} 我也不认为另一个 Naomi 会愿意把它留在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:62197
    old "There's one last likely candidate: Sai."
    new "最后还有一个可能的人选：Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:62198
    old "After Katei said that Naomi didn't want to return, the others investigated the crystal floor while Shiroya and I waited next to the elevator on the fourth floor. We were told exactly what happened."
    new "Katei 说 Naomi 不愿意回来后，其他人去搜查水晶层，而我和 Shiroya 留在四楼的电梯旁等候。有人把事情的经过原原本本告诉了我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:62204
    old "Sai guarded hallway A from the stairs while Katei guarded hallway B and the lobby.{w} As the hallway B rooms were inspected, Sai could've gone to the event room to take the gemstone and hide it in the storeroom."
    new "Sai 守住楼梯口，负责盯 A走廊；Katei 则守着 B走廊和大厅。{w} 在 B走廊的房间被逐一检查时，Sai 本有机会去活动室取走宝石，再把它藏进储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:62205
    old "Then, he let the others discover that it had disappeared and asked Akaro to go find us."
    new "随后，他让其他人发现东西不见了，又让 Akaro 来找我们。"

    # game/script.rpy:62214
    old "When they came and told me what had happened, I thought you two had to get down here. Since we're dealing with this situation, I found it appropriate to join up and make sure nothing slipped away."
    new "他们过来告诉我出了什么事时，我就觉得你们俩该下来了。既然事情已经变成这样，我觉得还是汇合起来比较妥当，免得再有什么从眼皮底下溜走。"

    # game/script.rpy:62222
    old "Why would he have done that?{w} ...At that point, we hadn't learned about the Sekimeiya's powers yet.{w} During the morning, Sai's attitude was different from how it was later. He often talked with me about what he thought and was visibly enjoying what was happening around him. When did that change, exactly?{w} I believe it was when we found out about time travel. He became a lot more reserved and hard to read. If he hid the Sekimeiya so early, his motive likely aligned to his original attitude."
    new "他为什么要那么做？{w} ……那时我们还没弄清 Sekimeiya 的力量。{w} 那天早上，Sai 的态度和后来截然不同。他常跟我谈起自己的想法，也看得出他很享受身边发生的事。他究竟是什么时候变的？{w} 我想，是在我们得知时间穿越之后。他变得沉默许多，让人看不透。若他在那么早的时候就藏起了 Sekimeiya，动机多半与他最初的态度有关。"

    # game/script.rpy:62223
    old "The event room and hallway A weren't being recorded. He chose the storeroom, another place without cameras. Later on, he acted as if he'd found it there, so I don't think his intention was to keep it.{w} Did he do it for fun, or did he have a better reason? In any case, it's likely he already knew that he would point the finger at Katei, who he immediately accused."
    new "活动室和 A走廊都没有监控。他选了同样没有摄像头的储藏室。后来他又装出是在那里发现它的样子，所以我觉得，他并不打算把它留在手里。{w} 是出于好玩，还是另有更充分的理由？无论如何，他恐怕早就知道自己会把矛头指向 Katei——毕竟他一开口便指控了 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:62224
    old "So, going back a little, when we found the Past Sekimeiya in room B4, we thought it was the one that disappeared from the event room. After putting it in the cabinet, we split up and searched both hallways for the person who'd made a sound. During that time, the Past Sekimeiya was hidden somewhere else while the third Sekimeiya was in the storeroom."
    new "那么，稍微往前回溯一下：我们在 B4 房间发现过去Sekimeiya 时，还以为它就是活动室里消失的那个。把它放回展示柜后，我们分头去两条走廊寻找发出声响的人。就在那段时间里，过去Sekimeiya 被藏到了别处，而第三个 Sekimeiya 则在储藏室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:62231
    old "It must've been Sai again. The only choices were the people in hallway B."
    new "那一定又是 Sai。可选的人只有当时在 B走廊的那几个。"

    # game/script.rpy:62232
    old "I was told Shiroya and Akaro looked through the rooms while Sai watched the hallway like I did. We had to make sure the person we were searching for was found, so the search took a while. During the time Shiroya and Akaro were inside the crystal rooms, Sai had the chance to pick up the key in room B4, take the Sekimeiya from the event room, and then hide it somewhere in hallway B.{w} After that, he slipped the cabinet key into Shiroya's purse as soon as possible."
    new "我听说，Shiroya 和 Akaro 逐个查看房间时，Sai 像我一样守在走廊里。为了确保能找到那个人，搜查花了不少时间。在 Shiroya 和 Akaro 进入水晶展室期间，Sai 有机会去 B4 房间取走钥匙，从活动室拿走 Sekimeiya，再把它藏到 B走廊的某处。{w} 之后，他又尽快把展示柜的钥匙塞进了 Shiroya 的手袋。"

    # game/script.rpy:62233
    old "By acting like he'd found the Sekimeiya in the storeroom, he removed any potential blame from himself.{w} I didn't really think about it, but he said we couldn't trust Katei's search and never ended up looking at all the other rooms Katei went through."
    new "他装出在储藏室里发现 Sekimeiya 的样子，让自己摆脱了可能受到的怀疑。{w} 我当时没怎么细想，但他说过不能相信 Katei 的搜查，最后也没有把 Katei 查过的其余房间逐一查看。"

    # game/script.rpy:62236
    old "And still, I'm sure there's another reason Sai did that.{w} I don't know why, but everyone thought only one Sekimeiya existed. By finding the one that didn't work, he made sure we wouldn't search for the one he had hidden."
    new "不过，我确信 Sai 那么做还有另一个理由。{w} 不知为何，所有人都以为只存在一个 Sekimeiya。他找出那个无法使用的，正是为了让我们不去寻找他藏起来的那个。"

    # game/script.rpy:62237
    old "I see... That must be the answer to that question.{w} \"Why is the Sekimeiya being hidden when it can easily be found?\"{w} I wonder who knew the truth. I wonder who knew that three Sekimeiya existed.{w} The people who did kept hiding them because leaving the third one in the event room cabinet meant no one would look for others. The quality of their hiding spots hardly mattered—we just found one Sekimeiya and thought that was it. Maybe they were often poorly hidden precisely so that we'd find one and stop the search before coming across another."
    new "原来如此……那个问题的答案一定就是这个。{w} 「为什么 Sekimeiya 明明很容易就能找到，却总被人藏起来？」{w} 我想知道，究竟是谁知道真相。是谁知道存在三个 Sekimeiya。{w} 知情者之所以一再把它们藏起来，是因为只要把第三个留在活动室展示柜里，我们便不会再去寻找其他 Sekimeiya。藏得是否妥当并不重要——我们只要找到一个 Sekimeiya，就会以为只有这一个。说不定它们之所以常常被藏得很草率，正是为了让我们找到一个后就此收手，不会撞见另一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:62244
    old "Akaro knew it from the beginning, and Sai learned it shortly after. They knew two real Sekimeiya existed alongside Xyn's fake. For twelve hours, they had a plan in mind: to keep one of the real Sekimeiya hidden."
    new "Akaro 从一开始就知道，Sai 也在不久后得知。他们知道，除了 Xyn 造的赝品之外，还有两个真正的 Sekimeiya。整整十二个小时里，他们心里盘算着一个计划：把其中一个真正的 Sekimeiya 藏起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:62245
    old "If that was achieved, Ashiya would find two Sekimeiya, and they wouldn't search for the second real one. That was how they intended to pull it off and why they didn't want anyone else to know the truth. The Sekimeiya were hidden countless times, but the intent was rarely to keep them from being found."
    new "只要成功，芦屋方面就只会找到两个 Sekimeiya，不会再去寻找第二个真品。他们正是想借此成事，也正因如此，才不愿让旁人知道真相。Sekimeiya 曾被藏起过无数次，但藏起来的目的很少是为了不让人找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:62251
    old "We still hadn't found the Naomi who'd made the sound, which meant that she had successfully escaped upstairs. That's why we searched through the higher floors.{w} Shiroya and I stayed on the fifth, and although we didn't hear anything, something strange happened with the elevator."
    new "我们始终没找到那个发出声响的 Naomi，这说明她已经成功逃到楼上。所以我们才去搜查更高的楼层。{w} 我和 Shiroya 留在五楼，虽然我们什么声音都没听见，电梯却出了怪事。"

    # game/script.rpy:62255
    old "Sai heard it three times. Based on that, it started from the crystal floor, which was not where we'd last left it..."
    new "Sai 听见了三次。照此推断，电梯是从水晶层开始动的，可我们最后并没有把电梯停在那里……"

    # game/script.rpy:62256
    old "I don't believe Sai lied. Something happened during that time."
    new "我不认为 Sai 说了谎。那段时间里，一定发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:62259
    old "That's because in the event room, we heard another sound. It was the bathroom's door closing."
    new "因为我们在活动室里又听到了一声响。那是洗手间的门关上的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:62262
    old "Then, inside it, we found Naomi's second body.{w} However, I later traveled forty minutes to the past and appeared on the crystal floor before we'd all come back down."
    new "随后，我们在里面发现了 Naomi 的第二具尸体。{w} 可后来，我却穿越回四十分钟前，出现在我们所有人下楼之前的水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:62266
    old "I kept a close eye on the bathroom, but nothing happened until Naomi entered it..."
    new "我一直紧盯着洗手间，可直到 Naomi 走进去，什么也没发生……"

    # game/script.rpy:62271
    old "First of all, why was Naomi not found? We inspected every floor but the attic. As I now understand the attic's footprints, I don't believe that Naomi went back there. Especially because she didn't have the key to unlock it."
    new "首先，为什么没找到 Naomi？除了阁楼，我们把每一层都搜过了。我现在已经看懂阁楼里的那些脚印了，所以不认为 Naomi 回去过。何况她也没有阁楼的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:62272
    old "Somehow, the search failed to find her.{w} A different person stayed on each floor, so it's possible one wasn't investigated—the floor the person who used the elevator was supposed to guard.{w} ...Erina and Isla were on the second floor. Sai was on the third floor. Akaro was on the fourth floor. Shiroya and I were on the fifth floor. Katei was on the sixth floor."
    new "不知为何，搜查没能找到她。{w} 每一层都安排了不同的人留守，所以也许有一层根本没被搜查——就是本该由乘电梯的人守着的那一层。{w} ……Erina 和 Isla 在二楼。Sai 在三楼。Akaro 在四楼。我和 Shiroya 在五楼。Katei 在六楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:62279
    old "The strongest candidate to consider is Akaro."
    new "最可疑的人是 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:62283
    old "We told him we'd left the elevator on the fifth floor, but for some reason, it was originally below Sai. If he called it from the fourth, Sai would've heard it."
    new "我们告诉过他，电梯停在五楼；可不知为何，它最初却停在 Sai 所在楼层的下方。若他从四楼叫电梯，Sai 应该会听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:62284
    old "Then, he used it to go to the crystal floor... Why, though?{w} I can't help but remember that it was him who proposed this arrangement. He wanted us to stay separated between different floors, leaving the crystal floor vacant."
    new "然后，他乘电梯去了水晶层……可他为什么要这么做？{w} 我不由得想起，提出这种安排的人正是他。他希望我们分散在不同楼层，好让水晶层空着。"

    # game/script.rpy:62289
    old "Later, he would've gone back to the fourth floor, and finally, he would've sent it to the fifth, where it was supposed to be. Shiroya and I wouldn't have noticed that.{w} It definitely ended up there: Sai confirmed it when he called it from the crystal floor."
    new "之后，他再返回四楼，最后把电梯送回它本该停在的五楼。我和 Shiroya 不会察觉。{w} 电梯确实回到了那里：Sai 从水晶层叫电梯时，就确认了这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:62290
    old "I don't get it, though. Why would Akaro do that? He knew his trips up and down could be heard, didn't he?{w} And Erina and Isla didn't hear the elevator even once. I suppose it's possible Akaro stopped on floor 2 and then used the elevator to the crystal floor if he knew that wouldn't be heard, but if that happened, surely he would've done the same on floor 3 so that Sai wouldn't hear him either..."
    new "可我还是不明白。Akaro 为什么要那么做？他明知道自己乘电梯上下会被人听见，不是吗？{w} 而且 Erina 和 Isla 一次也没听见电梯声。我也想过，如果 Akaro 知道这样不会被听见，他或许会先停在二楼，再乘电梯去水晶层；可如果真是这样，他在三楼时也该照做，免得被 Sai 听见才对……"

    # game/script.rpy:62299
    old "Akaro had seen that one of the real Sekimeiya had been hidden in a cabinet with a damaged temperature wheel. It had changed colors, so he knew it wasn't the one Xyn had created."
    new "Akaro 曾看到，其中一块真正的 Sekimeiya 被藏在温度转盘损坏的展示柜里。它已经变了颜色，所以他明白那不是 Xyn 造的那一块。"

    # game/script.rpy:62303
    old "Naomi A was going up the floors ahead of them, but she stopped on the fourth when she realized that was where Akaro would remain. She wanted to collect herself enough to talk to him; her shock at what Katei had done hadn't faded at all. ...However, before she did, he was gone."
    new "Naomi A 先他们一步往楼上走，却在四楼停下——她意识到 Akaro 会留在那里。她想让自己镇定下来，好去跟他谈谈；Katei 做的事仍让她震惊不已。……然而，还没等她开口，他已经不在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62306
    old "Akaro had a bad feeling. Something very strange was happening with the Sekimeiya, so he needed to see the cleaning cart for himself. When he did, he saw that the one he'd hidden was actually gone."
    new "Akaro 有种不祥的预感。Sekimeiya 的情况十分古怪，他必须亲眼看看清洁推车。等他去看时，才发现自己藏起来的那一块竟然不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62309
    old "Who had taken it? Not only the one in the cart, but also one of the two Akaro had left in the event room before lying on the floor. Silently, Akaro continued watching Katei, but it could've been Naomi as well.{w} Katei was acting like only one Sekimeiya existed, and Akaro didn't know the reason. It was rational to conclude that one of them being in a cold cabinet indicated the other was as well."
    new "是谁拿走的？不只是推车里的那一块，就连 Akaro 躺到地上之前留在活动室的两块中也少了一块。Akaro 默不作声地继续观察 Katei，但拿走它的也可能是 Naomi。{w} Katei 的举动仿佛只存在一块 Sekimeiya，而 Akaro 不知道其中缘由。既然有一块被放进了低温展示柜，那另一块很可能也在同样的地方，这么想才说得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:62313
    old "During the previous search, he had looked through that room. He knew there was another cabinet that had been set to 0 °C.{w} The other real Sekimeiya was there, and it was all he needed. He only had to keep one hidden, but there weren't many places he could think of."
    new "在先前那次搜查中，他查看过那个房间。他知道那里还有另一个设定为 0 °C 的展示柜。{w} 另一块真正的 Sekimeiya 就在里面，而这正是他需要的。他只要藏起一块就够了，可一时也想不出多少合适的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:62314
    old "He took the Future Sekimeiya out of the cabinet. When he did, it turned gray immediately, but nothing happened to him. Did it really have time travel powers? He had a hard time believing that, but it had just changed colors before him."
    new "他把 未来Sekimeiya 从展示柜里取了出来。刚一拿出，它就立刻变成了灰色，可他身上什么也没发生。它真的拥有时间穿越的力量吗？他实在难以相信，可它刚刚就在他眼前变了颜色。"

    # game/script.rpy:62321
    old "In a rush, he chose to hide it in the men's bathroom. Inside the water tank seemed like a good idea."
    new "匆忙之下，他决定把它藏进男洗手间。水箱里面似乎是个不错的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:62330
    old "When I was staring at the bathroom door, Naomi appeared from the other side of hallway C. She likely came from above.{w} She was the Naomi who'd appeared in the attic, but her actions differed from the Naomi who'd been killed. Why? Why didn't she ask to talk to Katei? What was she doing, exactly, moving around through the building?"
    new "我正盯着洗手间的门时，Naomi 从 C 走廊的另一头走了出来。她多半是从楼上下来的。{w} 她就是那个出现在阁楼里的 Naomi，可她的举动却和被杀死的那个 Naomi 不同。为什么？她为什么没有要求见 Katei？她在楼里四处走动，究竟是在做什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:62336
    old "\"Akaro's description of Naomi's face fell short of her actual expression. She was visibly terrified, breathing heavily, moving oddly, and stopping in place every few seconds.\""
    new "「Akaro 对 Naomi 神情的描述，远不及她真实的样子。她显然惊恐万分，呼吸急促，动作怪异，每隔几秒就停在原地。」"

    # game/script.rpy:62337
    old "When I saw her face, there was no doubt in me that she'd seen her own dead body. She was avoiding being found, perhaps because she knew what her killer had done to her."
    new "看到她的脸时，我毫不怀疑，她已经见过自己的尸体。她躲着不让人找到，也许是因为她知道凶手对自己做了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:62338
    old "What was she doing, then? When she made the sound and when she walked to that bathroom..."
    new "那么，她到底在做什么？在她发出声响时，在她走向那间洗手间时……"

    # game/script.rpy:62340
    old "I'm not sure, but... she was killed right there. Naomi said a few words before her body was pulled in."
    new "我不太确定，不过……她就是在那里遇害的。尸体被拖进去之前，Naomi 说了几句话。"

    # game/script.rpy:62349
    old "When Naomi entered the bathroom... someone else was there."
    new "Naomi 走进洗手间时……里面还有别人。"

    # game/script.rpy:62352
    old "Then, when I approached it, my footsteps were audible: her killer slammed the door shut and locked it."
    new "接着我朝洗手间走去，脚步声被里面的人听见了——凶手猛地关上门，上了锁。"

    # game/script.rpy:62355
    old "However, they couldn't have left before the point we all unlocked the door. They absolutely had to have disappeared from the bathroom."
    new "可是，在我们所有人打开门锁之前，对方不可能离开。那个人绝对是从洗手间里凭空消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62358
    old "How? When I inspected it by myself a bit later, no Sekimeiya was there. I don't believe it was taken out before that point either."
    new "怎么做到的？稍后我独自进去查看时，里面根本没有 Sekimeiya。我也不认为它在此之前被人拿走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62359
    old "When that Naomi was killed, the third Sekimeiya was still in the event room. It's very likely the other two were hidden somewhere on the crystal floor."
    new "那个 Naomi 被杀时，第三个 Sekimeiya 还在活动室。另外两个很可能就藏在水晶层的某处。"

    # game/script.rpy:62360
    old "Did someone travel through time, bringing along Naomi's killer? If that's what happened, unless the Sekimeiya was on the second floor, I would've traveled too."
    new "是有人带着杀害 Naomi 的凶手一起穿越时间了吗？若真是如此，除非那个 Sekimeiya 在二楼，否则我也该跟着穿越了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62361
    old "I think the answer is different. I believe the Sekimeiya was inside the bathroom even though I didn't find it."
    new "我想答案并非如此。我认为 Sekimeiya 当时就在洗手间里，只是我没有发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:62366
    old "After killing Naomi, her killer activated it. I had already run away, so I didn't travel."
    new "杀害 Naomi 后，凶手启动了它。我已经跑开了，所以并没有跟着一起穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:62367
    old "They traveled to the future. After all, I'm pretty sure the Past Sekimeiya was in one of hallway B's crystal rooms, which is where Shiroya and I later traveled from.{w} Maybe I should've pieced together the reason why no Sekimeiya was found in the bathroom..."
    new "凶手穿越到了未来。毕竟，我很确定 过去Sekimeiya 就在 B 走廊的某间水晶展室里，而我和 Shiroya 后来正是从那里出发穿越的。{w}或许我早该想到，为什么洗手间里找不到任何 Sekimeiya……"

    # game/script.rpy:62371
    old "A while later, right after I couldn't find anything inside, I heard a sound coming from hallway A. It was Sai."
    new "过了一会儿，我在里面什么也没找到，就听见 A 走廊那边传来声音。是 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:62378
    old "He had traveled from the future, and in his hip pack was a disabled Sekimeiya that he didn't know about."
    new "他是从未来穿越过来的，腰包里还放着一个关闭状态的 Sekimeiya——他自己并不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:62379
    old "He appeared with it—if that was the Future Sekimeiya, the one in the bathroom would've disappeared! It would have instantly teleported. I should've made that connection."
    new "他是带着它出现的——如果那就是 未来Sekimeiya，洗手间里的那个应该已经消失了！它会瞬间传送走。我早该把这两件事联系起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:62387
    old "So, the person who traveled to the future... who was it? Who killed Naomi?{w} Knowing all of that, the answer has to be Akaro..."
    new "那么，那个穿越到未来的人……究竟是谁？是谁杀了 Naomi？{w}既然已经知道这些，答案只能是 Akaro……"

    # game/script.rpy:62388
    old "When I approached the bathroom, the door was slammed. I knew the whole floor was about to be inspected, so I ran up the stairs."
    new "我靠近洗手间时，门被猛地关上了。我知道整层楼很快会被搜查，于是跑上了楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:62391
    old "Then, eventually, the others walked up—they'd found the attic key."
    new "后来，其他人终于走了上来——他们找到了阁楼钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:62394
    old "As soon as I could, I went back down. I tried to find Akaro, who had suddenly disappeared from the group. ...But I couldn't."
    new "一有机会，我便回到楼下。我想找到突然从队伍里消失的 Akaro……却怎么也找不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:62397
    old "I stopped myself when I saw the bathroom's door. It looked identical to how we'd seen it with the group when we found Akaro behind it, and I realized it had been me who'd left it like that. I concluded that no one else would touch the door."
    new "看见洗手间的门时，我停下了脚步。那扇门的样子，和我们一群人发现 Akaro 躲在门后时看到的一模一样；我这才意识到，让门保持那副样子的正是我自己。于是我断定，不会再有别人去碰那扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:62398
    old "And it never happened. I watched from a distance for minutes, and when the group came from the attic, Akaro was already there. I can only think he teleported inside.{w} Why didn't he leave, though?"
    new "而那种情况始终没有出现。我在远处观察了好几分钟，等众人从阁楼下来时，Akaro 已经在那里了。我只能想到，他是传送进去的。{w}可他为什么没有离开？"

    # game/script.rpy:62403
    old "That's gotta be due to the mental state we found him in. He looked out of it and unresponsive, likely because he had just killed a second Naomi who couldn't have existed.{w} After locking the door, he touched the Sekimeiya in the bathroom and went some amount of minutes into the future. Seeing as he appeared in the bathroom, it makes me think it was him who hid the Sekimeiya there in the past. That's why he knew where it was and why he rapidly activated it in an attempt to escape."
    new "那一定跟他被发现时的精神状态有关。他看上去神志恍惚、毫无反应，大概是因为他刚刚杀死了本不该存在的第二个 Naomi。{w}锁上门后，他碰了洗手间里的 Sekimeiya，时间穿越到了若干分钟之后。既然他出现在洗手间里，我便觉得，过去把 Sekimeiya 藏在那里的人就是他。所以他才知道它在哪里，也才会为了逃跑而迅速启动它。"

    # game/script.rpy:62409
    old "But that doesn't explain the whole set of events. After we found Naomi's second body, we suddenly lost track of Akaro. We even looked all over the floor, but he wasn't anywhere, and Erina said he hadn't gone up."
    new "但这还解释不了整件事。我们发现 Naomi 的第二具尸体后，Akaro 忽然不见了踪影。我们甚至把整层楼都找遍了，却哪儿都没有他；Erina 也说他并没有上楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:62410
    old "The only explanation for all of this is that he traveled to the past. Later, he even admitted to having touched the Sekimeiya.{w} That makes a lot of sense. If Sai hid it in the crystal room that Shiroya and I later traveled from, we would've gone much more than forty minutes into the past."
    new "这一切唯一的解释，就是他时间穿越到了过去。后来他甚至承认自己碰过 Sekimeiya。{w}这样就说得通了。如果 Sai 把它藏在了那间水晶展室——我和 Shiroya 后来就是从那里穿越到过去的——那我们回到的时间就会远远早于四十分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:62411
    old "That makes me think that Akaro saw through Sai. Maybe he was aware that more than one Sekimeiya existed.{w} If that was the case, from his point of view, only Sai could've hidden the Past Sekimeiya. He knew the one we found in the storeroom wasn't the same one, so it wouldn't have been too hard to find out where it was. I remember that Shiroya found it quickly because she noticed a slight bump in one of the gem cabinets."
    new "这让我觉得，Akaro 看穿了 Sai。也许他知道 Sekimeiya 不止一个。{w}若果真如此，在他看来，能藏起过去Sekimeiya 的人就只有 Sai。他知道我们在储藏室找到的那个并不是同一个，因此要查出它藏在哪里并不算难。我记得 Shiroya 很快就找到了它，因为她注意到其中一个宝石展示柜有轻微的凸起。"

    # game/script.rpy:62412
    old "He traveled to the past, which is why we didn't find him. I'm not sure what led him to do it, but that reset the Sekimeiya's timer, allowing Shiroya and I to only travel forty minutes back when we found it."
    new "他时间穿越到了过去，所以我们才找不到他。我不清楚他为什么这么做，但那次穿越重置了 Sekimeiya 的计时，使我和 Shiroya 找到它时，只回到了四十分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:62418
    old "Later, Akaro said that upon touching the Sekimeiya, he teleported. However, he assured us he hadn't traveled through time.{w} He said he'd seen us searching through the floor, but he was probably referring to the search from minutes prior."
    new "后来，Akaro 说他一碰到 Sekimeiya 就传送了。但他向我们保证自己并没有时间穿越。{w}他说看见我们在楼层里搜寻，可他指的应该是几分钟前的那次搜查。"

    # game/script.rpy:62423
    old "Specifically, when we went up the floors and the three elevator trips happened. It's also the time where he I think he stored the Future Sekimeiya in the bathroom, so seeing his past self might have drawn him there."
    new "具体来说，就是我们逐层上楼、电梯往返三次的那段时间。我想，他也是在那个时候把未来Sekimeiya 藏进了洗手间；所以看见过去的自己，也许把他引到了那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:62424
    old "I don't know why he killed Naomi, but this has to be the truth. ...Was murdering her the cause of the state we found him in?{w} When we saw him, the first thing he did was ask Sai for the time, and when he heard it, he said that he hadn't traveled through time—that he'd only teleported."
    new "我不知道他为什么要杀 Naomi，但真相一定就是这样。……杀害她，是不是就是我们发现他时那副状态的原因？{w}我们见到他时，他做的第一件事就是向 Sai 询问时间；听到答案后，他说自己并没有时间穿越——只是传送了而已。"

    # game/script.rpy:62425
    old "Wouldn't this explain it?{w} He went minutes to the past. I could probably calculate the exact amount, but that seems unnecessary.{w} There, he killed Naomi and immediately went to the future when he heard me approaching the bathroom.{w} If both travels were similar in length, upon being told the current time, he would've thought that he hadn't traveled through time at all, especially because he appeared in the bathroom when he went to the future. He barely moved, so there was no way he'd earlier gone to the past...{w} But there seemed to be more to it than that. Akaro's voice seemed deeper in denial."
    new "这样不就解释得通了吗？{w}他时间穿越到了几分钟前。具体是几分钟，我大概算得出来，但似乎没这个必要。{w}他在那里杀了 Naomi，随后一听见我走近洗手间，就立刻时间穿越到了未来。{w}如果两次时间穿越的时长差不多，那么当他被告知当前时间时，就会以为自己根本没有时间穿越——尤其因为他穿越到未来后又出现在了洗手间里。他几乎没挪动过位置，所以怎么也想不到自己先前竟去了过去……{w}但事情似乎不止如此。Akaro 的声音里，那种否认的意味更深。"

    # game/script.rpy:62435
    old "In the bathroom, when the door opened, what Akaro last expected was to see Naomi lying on the floor again.{w} He had been incredibly worried that she'd seen him missing in the event room. If that had happened, she was a massive threat."
    new "洗手间的门打开时，Akaro 最不愿看到的，就是 Naomi 又一次躺在地上。{w}他一直极为担心她发现他不在活动室。若真如此，她便是极大的威胁。"

    # game/script.rpy:62436
    old "However, out of nowhere, she had appeared dead in a room. Akaro, much to his own disgust, was relieved by that."
    new "然而，她竟不知从哪里出现，死在了房间里。让 Akaro 自己都感到厌恶的是，他居然因此松了一口气。"

    # game/script.rpy:62437
    old "Yet, for some reason, it hadn't ended there. Once he had progressed to different worries, Naomi had appeared dead a second time.{w} Akaro had no idea what was happening inside the tower. He only wanted his plan to succeed in order to have a future ahead of him."
    new "可不知为何，事情并没有就此结束。当他转而担忧起别的事情时，Naomi 又一次死在了他眼前。{w}Akaro 完全不知道塔里正在发生什么。他只想让自己的计划成功，好给自己留下一线未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:62442
    old "Why was the bathroom suddenly empty? Where had her body gone? ...Could he really have gone to the past? The last time, the Sekimeiya had merely changed colors when he'd touched it, but that time, he appeared in hallway C."
    new "洗手间为何突然空了？她的尸体去了哪里？……难道他真的时间穿越到了过去？上一次他碰到 Sekimeiya 时，它只是变了颜色；可那一次，他却出现在了 C走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:62449
    old "The third time he saw Naomi's face, her eyes were staring into his. It couldn't be real; he doubted the stability of his own mind.{w} When her mouth opened, the words Akaro had been dreading entered his ears. She knew he had left the event room, and she knew that he'd been concealing it."
    new "第三次看见 Naomi 的脸时，她的双眼正死死盯着他。那不可能是真的；他开始怀疑自己的神志是否还清醒。{w}当她开口时，Akaro 最害怕听到的话钻进了耳朵。她知道他离开过活动室，也知道他一直在隐瞒这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:62453
    old "Akaro lost himself in desperation. Naomi should've been dead—he couldn't comprehend how she'd come back. After a single, abrupt motion, she was on the floor, unresponsive."
    new "Akaro 在绝望中失去了理智。Naomi 明明已经死了——他无法理解她怎么会回来。他猛地一动，她便倒在地上，没有了反应。"

    # game/script.rpy:62454
    old "Immediately after that, Akaro heard footsteps approaching from the hallway. He was barely able to make them out over the violent drumming in his ears. As fast as he could, he slammed the door and frantically looked around him."
    new "紧接着，他听见走廊里传来逼近的脚步声。耳中擂鼓般的轰鸣几乎盖过了一切，他只能勉强分辨出那声音。他以最快的速度砰地关上门，惊慌地环顾四周。"

    # game/script.rpy:62466
    old "When I realized one of the keys the first Naomi had was the attic's, we went there for the first time."
    new "当我意识到第一个 Naomi 带着的其中一把钥匙是阁楼钥匙时，我们第一次去了那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:62469
    old "Sai pointed out that Naomi's footprints didn't make sense, and we found an empty suitcase on the sofa. ...It was the same one we saw in hallway C—it had come from another world alongside Naomi."
    new "Sai 指出 Naomi 的脚印对不上，而我们又在沙发上发现了一只空行李箱。……那正是我们在 C走廊见过的那只——它随 Naomi 一起从另一个世界而来。"

    # game/script.rpy:62470
    old "That's likely where she was keeping the Sekimeiya. To change worlds, both had to be powered on, so they didn't travel with Naomi. That's why the suitcase was empty, and it's why it wasn't in the attic in this world."
    new "她很可能把 Sekimeiya 放在了那里。要切换世界，两个都必须处于启动状态，所以它们没有随 Naomi 一起完成切换。因此行李箱是空的，这个世界的阁楼里才会没有它。"

    # game/script.rpy:62474
    old "And now that I think about it, someone reacted differently to both suitcases.{w} Katei."
    new "现在回想起来，有个人对两只行李箱的反应并不一样。{w}Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:62478
    old "Before we entered the attic, when Katei went to grab the bathroom key, he brought the suitcase in hallway C to the security room. But he never did that for the one in the attic."
    new "我们进阁楼之前，Katei 去拿洗手间钥匙时，把 C走廊的那只行李箱带到了监控室。可阁楼里的那只，他却从没这样处理过。"

    # game/script.rpy:62479
    old "Why...? That makes me think it's because Naomi brought it up there. That one wasn't a threat to him because he didn't know anything about it."
    new "为什么……？我猜是因为那只行李箱是 Naomi 带上去的。他对它一无所知，所以它对他不构成威胁。"

    # game/script.rpy:62487
    old "We didn't find anything else of importance in the attic, so we went down to find Akaro. He was in a crystal floor bathroom and told us to leave him there for a while."
    new "我们在阁楼里没再找到其他重要的东西，便下楼去找 Akaro。他在水晶层的洗手间里，让我们把他一个人留在那儿待一会儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:62491
    old "We ended up going back to the top... and in one of the bedrooms, I noticed the voice recorder in Isla's purse."
    new "最后我们又回到了顶层……在其中一间卧室里，我注意到 Isla 手提包里的录音笔。"

    # game/script.rpy:62499
    old "Now I know a lot more about the audio that we heard, but why was it there? Why did it travel to the past?"
    new "现在我对我们听到的那段录音了解得更清楚了，可它为什么会在那里？又为什么会回到过去？"

    # game/script.rpy:62501
    old "Can I figure that out? How did the recorder from the future end up on December 15th?"
    new "我能弄清这件事吗？来自未来的录音笔，怎么会出现在十二月十五日？"

    # game/script.rpy:62513
    old "Thinking about it, it's very unlikely the device traveled to December 15th.{w} Isla said it was impossible someone dropped it in her purse, which means it was there when she entered the tower."
    new "仔细想想，这支录音笔几乎不可能是穿越到十二月十五日的。{w}Isla 说过，不可能有人把它丢进她的手提包，也就是说，她进塔时它就已经在里面了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62514
    old "If that's the case, why did she have it before December 15th?"
    new "若真是如此，她在十二月十五日之前为什么会有它？"

    # game/script.rpy:62515
    old "I think... I know the answer.{w} It has to be due to her \"friend\"."
    new "我想……我知道答案了。{w}一定和她的「朋友」有关。"

    # game/script.rpy:62516
    old "Now I know that her friend was a version of her from another world. She met with our Isla quite a while before December 15th. She knew about the attack, so she traveled to the past at some point."
    new "现在我知道了，她的「朋友」是来自另一个世界的她。那个人早在十二月十五日之前很久，就与我们这边的 Isla 见过面。她知道袭击的事，所以在某个时候穿越到了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:62517
    old "Apparently, when Sai and Akaro escaped from the attic, they met with \"Isla\". Even Erina heard her from the bedroom. She was dead at that point, so she probably wasn't the same Isla we'd been with.{w} Despite that, we never found her after we left the bedroom, so one explanation is that she traveled to the past at around that time."
    new "听说 Sai 和 Akaro 从阁楼逃出来时，遇见了「Isla」。连 Erina 都在卧室里听见了她的声音。可她当时已经死了，所以那多半不是与我们待在一起的那个 Isla。{w} 尽管如此，我们离开卧室后始终没再找到她，所以有一种解释是：她大约在那个时候穿越回了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:62518
    old "She went many days into the past, and the location where she appeared had to be identical to where she'd be in the proportional future. That means days after December 15th."
    new "她回到了许多天前的过去，而她出现的地点，必须与她在相对应未来时间点所在的位置完全一致。也就是说，对应的未来时间是十二月十五日之后的几天。"

    # game/script.rpy:62522
    old "So, what happened to the device after it recorded the audio? Isla saw Sai hiding it, and she ended up with it.{w} If the replicated location was from a time where she still had it in the future, she would've appeared with it in the past."
    new "那么，那支录音笔录下音频之后，又发生了什么？Isla 看见 Sai 把它藏了起来，最后东西落到了她手上。{w} 如果复制的地点对应的是她未来仍然持有录音笔的那个时间，那么她回到过去时就会随身带着它。"

    # game/script.rpy:62523
    old "Isla's \"friend\" had the recorder days before the event; that's how it got to the past. ...Why was it inside our Isla's purse, then?"
    new "Isla 的「朋友」在事件发生前几天就拿到了录音笔；它就是这样去了过去。……可既然如此，它为什么会在我们这个 Isla 的手提包里？"

    # game/script.rpy:62524
    old "I can't know that, but it's likely the recorder appeared inside her friend's purse. Then, both Islas tried to hide the existence of the \"friend\" from Erina.{w} Two identical purses were in the past. There was probably a mix-up at some point, like the original Isla mistakenly taking the wrong purse on the day of the event for some reason."
    new "这一点我无法确定，但录音笔很可能就是出现在她朋友的手提包里。随后，两个 Isla 都试图向 Erina 隐瞒「朋友」的存在。{w} 过去有两只一模一样的手提包。中途大概发生过一次拿错，比如原本的 Isla 因为某种缘故，在事件当天误拿了另一只包。"

    # game/script.rpy:62530
    old "I don't think I need to know exactly how it came to happen, but it had to be Isla's friend who caused the recording to exist in the past."
    new "我觉得不必弄清它究竟是如何发生的，但让那段录音存在于过去的人，一定是 Isla 的朋友。"

    # game/script.rpy:62531
    old "After we listened to it, Shiroya and I left the attic alone. Going down the floors, we came across Akaro, who kept walking up. Then, on the crystal floor, we saw that the Sekimeiya we left in the event room was no longer there.{w} Someone took the third Sekimeiya out of the cabinet. ...Who would've wanted to do that?{w} At first glance, Akaro seemed to be the only candidate. However, I know someone else was there."
    new "听完之后，我和 Shiroya 独自离开了阁楼。我们逐层往下时，遇到了正往上走的 Akaro。接着，在水晶层，我们发现留在活动室的 Sekimeiya 已经不见了。{w} 有人把第三个 Sekimeiya 从展示柜里取走了。……谁会想这么做？{w} 乍看之下，Akaro 似乎是唯一的人选。可我知道，当时还有另一个人在。"

    # game/script.rpy:62536
    old "Shiroya and I found the Past Sekimeiya in a hallway B crystal room, unaware that it wasn't the same one that had just disappeared. That's most likely where Sai chose to hide it a while earlier.{w} What stands out to me is that he chose a room with functional cameras after previously leaving it in the storeroom. I wonder if he was forced to or if he had a reason, because it happened when we were searching both hallways..."
    new "我和 Shiroya 在 B走廊的一间水晶展室里找到了过去Sekimeiya，却不知道它并非刚刚消失的那一个。那多半是 Sai 早些时候选择的藏匿之处。{w} 让我在意的是，他先前把东西留在储藏室，这次却选了一间监控仍在运作的展室。我不知道他是迫不得已，还是另有理由——毕竟那件事发生在我们同时搜索两条走廊的时候……"

    # game/script.rpy:62537
    old "It had been there since the previous time the Sekimeiya had disappeared, so it's worth noting that it wasn't found when we looked for Akaro, especially since he would've left the glass open after traveling.{w} ...Recalling how that search went, though, I'm pretty sure I get why that happened."
    new "早在 Sekimeiya 上一次消失时，它就已经在那里了。因此，我们寻找 Akaro 时没有发现它，这一点值得注意——尤其是 Akaro 穿越之后，柜子的玻璃本该敞开着。{w} ……不过回想那次搜索的经过，我大致明白为什么会这样了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62540
    old "We activated it and went forty minutes to the past. Thanks to that travel, we learned about the existence of the range."
    new "我们启动了它，回到了四十分钟前的过去。也多亏那次穿越，我们才得知重叠范围的存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:62544
    old "After appearing in the security room, I witnessed what happened to the second Naomi. Then, I heard someone in hallway A: Sai."
    new "我出现在监控室后，目睹了第二个 Naomi 的遭遇。接着，我听见 A走廊里有人——是 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:62547
    old "He was supposed to be in the attic. It's indisputable that he traveled through time. Due to his wristwatch, I'm sure he came from the future."
    new "他本应在阁楼里。他穿越了时间，这一点毋庸置疑。从他的手表来看，我确信他来自未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:62548
    old "Much later, he admitted to remembering the time I'd seen him, so it was definitely the same Sai who told the people in the attic not to follow us.{w} The way he traveled to the past confused me for a while. That's because he was surprised to see me; he didn't know I'd also traveled. If he traveled after Shiroya and I returned to the attic, he would've had to fake his surprise upon seeing me."
    new "很久以后，他承认自己记得我见到他的那一次，所以在阁楼里叫大家不要跟下来的那个人，肯定就是他。{w} 他回到过去的方式让我困惑了一阵。因为他见到我时很惊讶；他不知道我也穿越了。如果他是在我和 Shiroya 回到阁楼之后才穿越，那见到我时的惊讶就只能是装出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:62572
    old "How did he travel before Shiroya and I returned? The others said he was there the whole time.{w} ...Is that really the case, though?{w} Shiroya told me what she heard when she was listening to them."
    new "他究竟是怎样在我和 Shiroya 回来之前完成穿越的？其他人说他一直待在那里。{w} ……可真是这样吗？{w} Shiroya 把她旁听他们谈话时听到的内容告诉了我。"

    # game/script.rpy:62587
    old "That was all Sai needed to trick the others.{w} Everyone went to the bathroom, so when it was his turn, he could've gone to the crystal floor. He had hidden the Past Sekimeiya, so he traveled after us when it had already gathered a lot of energy.{w} There was something curious about Sai's behavior. He kept insisting that he hadn't traveled to the past, and he was in a rush. He tried to run away from me twice.{w} That's probably because he had to be ready to go back to the attic. As soon as his past self \"went to the bathroom\", he returned as if nothing had happened, which made the others say that he never left the attic."
    new "对 Sai 来说，骗过其他人只需要做到这一点。{w} 所有人都去了洗手间，所以轮到他时，他就能去水晶层。他事先藏好了过去Sekimeiya，所以等到它积蓄起大量能量后，才在我们之后穿越了。{w} Sai 的行为有一点奇怪。他一直坚称自己没有回到过去，而且显得很匆忙。他两次想从我面前逃走。{w} 这大概是因为他必须准备好回到阁楼。等他过去的自己一“去洗手间”，他便若无其事地回来了，所以其他人才会说，他从没离开过阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:62588
    old "I don't know about the actual specifics. Shiroya said it was possible she missed him when she was inspecting the office rooms, but when we returned to the attic, we didn't see Sai's footprints in the living room...{w} That's strange, since I don't think he could've taken the elevator back up. The key was in the attic's door, and he wouldn't have appeared with it, so he couldn't have activated the floor 7 button. Furthermore, it should have been disabled in the attic anyway."
    new "具体经过我并不清楚。Shiroya 说，她在检查办公室时可能漏看了他，可我们回到阁楼后，并没有在客厅里看到 Sai 的脚印……{w} 这很奇怪，因为我不认为他能乘电梯上去。钥匙插在阁楼门上，而他穿越时不可能带着钥匙出现，所以无法按下七楼的按钮。况且，七楼按钮在阁楼里本来就该是禁用状态。"

    # game/script.rpy:62592
    old "I'm not sure if this is exactly what happened, but maybe when Shiroya was in the attic, Sai, claiming to go to the bathroom, sent the elevator to the crystal floor and called it. Then, he went to the bathroom.{w} Afterward, he took the elevator down. If Shiroya was still in the attic, she wouldn't have heard it. Sai traveled to the past, and that's where I met up with him.{w} Entering the elevator on the crystal floor and waiting for his past self to call it was one route back to the attic."
    new "我不确定事情是否真是这样。不过，也许 Shiroya 在阁楼时，Sai 借口去洗手间，把电梯送到水晶层，再把它叫回来。随后，他去了洗手间。{w} 之后，他乘电梯下楼。如果 Shiroya 当时还在阁楼，就不会听见电梯的声音。Sai 穿越到了过去，我就是在那里遇见他的。{w} 回到阁楼的一条路线，就是先在水晶层进入电梯，等过去的自己把电梯叫上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:62593
    old "I don't know if his plan went this far or if I'm missing something else...{w} Maybe he did all of this just so he wouldn't be analyzed for what he wanted to do. He set it up so that Shiroya and I would be much easier to suspect."
    new "我不知道他的计划是否周密到了这一步，还是我漏掉了别的什么……{w} 也许他做这一切，只是为了不让人看穿他真正的目的。他故意把局面弄成我和 Shiroya 更容易被怀疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:62596
    old "But again, what about the cameras? They would've recorded him going down.{w} Later, he voiced his thoughts regarding that—he didn't think the recorded footage would ever see the light of the day. As far as he and the rest of us knew, the killer had willingly recorded themselves committing crimes."
    new "可话说回来，监控呢？它们应该拍到了他下楼。{w} 后来他谈到过这一点——他认为那些录像永远不可能公之于众。据他和我们所有人所知，凶手是自愿录下自己犯罪过程的。"

    # game/script.rpy:62597
    old "What was it he wanted to do? He'd hidden a functional Sekimeiya, so I bet he wanted to know whether he'd really travel through time with it.{w} He took the third Sekimeiya away from the cabinet even though it was him who found it for us..."
    new "他到底想做什么？他藏起了一个还能用的 Sekimeiya，所以我猜，他是想知道自己是否真能靠它穿越时间。{w} 明明是他替我们找到了第三个 Sekimeiya，却把它从展示柜里拿走了……"

    # game/script.rpy:62598
    old "And the Future Sekimeiya... He appeared with it in his hip pack. I think he was genuinely surprised about that."
    new "还有未来Sekimeiya……他出现时，它就在他的腰包里。我想他对此是真的感到意外。"

    # game/script.rpy:62599
    old "Then, when he ran away from me, he hid the Past Sekimeiya somewhere else. He knew I'd traveled through time, meaning that I was aware of its whereabouts."
    new "后来他从我面前逃走时，把过去Sekimeiya 藏到了别处。他知道我穿越过时间，也就明白我清楚它被藏在哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:62603
    old "There is one detail I'm still struggling to understand."
    new "还有一个细节，我始终没能想通。"

    # game/script.rpy:62604
    old "The screen on his wristwatch was blank. The fundamental answer behind that has to be the replicated location upon traveling to the past."
    new "他手表上的屏幕是一片空白。其根本原因，一定与穿越回过去时复制出的地点有关。"

    # game/script.rpy:62605
    old "But, even if the watch looped through time infinitely and didn't just crumble into dust, why did the date go up to the year 9,999? There's no chance the battery would've lasted that long, and it was swapping it for a new one that let the watch work again."
    new "可就算那块表在时间里无限循环，而不只是一下子碎成灰，日期又为什么会一直走到 9,999 年？电池不可能撑那么久，而它后来能重新运转，正是因为换了新电池。"

    # game/script.rpy:62606
    old "The answer to that is clear: it's because a new battery was added before the location to be replicated took place in the future. Thanks to that, if the watch looped infinitely, the addition of the new battery would let each instance add up more time without the battery ever running out."
    new "答案很清楚：因为在未来那个待复制的地点形成之前，新电池就已经被装了进去。正因如此，如果表无限循环，新电池的加入就会让每一次循环都累加更多时间，而电池永远不会耗尽。"

    # game/script.rpy:62607
    old "However, this brings about another issue. Why didn't the watch work in the past?{w} After all, it worked again when we added the new battery. This means that minutes later, during the future location, the watch should've been working. It seems to be an impossibility that it wasn't working in the past, given both locations are supposed to be the same."
    new "然而，这又引出了另一个问题：为什么表在过去无法运转？{w} 毕竟我们装上新的锂电池后，它就恢复了。这意味着，几分钟后、也就是处于未来那个地点时，表本应正在运转。可既然两个地点理应相同，它在过去却无法运转，这实在说不过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:62608
    old "...Is there an answer to this? One that makes sense?"
    new "……这件事有答案吗？一个说得通的答案？"

    # game/script.rpy:62617
    old "If Sai traveled a second time before the future location, the battery would've instantly run out. However, I have no reason to believe that occurred. I think the answer could be something else."
    new "如果 Sai 在未来那个地点形成之前又穿越了一次，电池应该会立刻耗尽。但我没有理由相信发生过这种事。我认为答案可能在别处。"

    # game/script.rpy:62619
    old "If Sai swapped back the batteries before the future location, it would explain the broken watch in the past. However, I have no reason to believe that occurred. I think the answer could be something else."
    new "如果 Sai 在未来那个地点形成之前把电池换了回去，那就能解释表在过去为何无法运转。但我没有理由相信他这么做过。我认为答案可能在别处。"

    # game/script.rpy:62620
    old "Now that I think more about it, it could be due to the lithium battery itself.{w} It was in the attic, a place that's been abandoned for many years. It was, I have to assume, a battery that the Ashiya family had when they lived there."
    new "再仔细想想，问题也许出在锂电池本身。{w} 它一直放在阁楼里，那地方已经废弃多年。我只能推测，那是芦屋家还住在这里时留下的电池。"

    # game/script.rpy:62624
    old "Lithium batteries discharge something like 2%% of their capacity every month. When we put it in the watch, it was probably almost entirely discharged."
    new "锂电池每个月大约会损失 2%% 的电量。我们把它装进手表时，它大概已经几乎耗尽。"

    # game/script.rpy:62625
    old "The small energy it had was enough to let the loop cap the timer at 9,999, but it also ran out before the future location."
    new "它剩下的那点电量，足以让循环把计时器封顶在 9,999，但也会在未来那个地点形成之前耗尽。"

    # game/script.rpy:62626
    old "We eventually learned that, in the lobby, Sai asked Katei for another lithium battery. At that point, I don't actually think he should've traveled through time again. That happened because the battery we'd obtained from the attic had already run out."
    new "后来我们得知，Sai 曾在大厅向 Katei 又要了一块锂电池。按说到了那时，他本不该再次穿越时间。之所以会这样，是因为我们从阁楼拿到的电池已经耗尽了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62627
    old "...{w}But does this really make sense, or am I missing something crucial? I just remembered...{w} Sai must have synced his watch to the computer after we saw the \"9,999\" date since it was working when Shiroya and I returned to the attic. The time would always have been set to that specific point before reaching the end of the loop, so it couldn't have kept counting up..."
    new "……{w}可这真的说得通吗？还是我漏掉了什么关键之处？我刚刚想起来……{w} 在我们看到「9,999」这个日期之后，Sai 一定把手表与电脑同步过了——毕竟我和 Shiroya 回到阁楼时，它已经能正常显示。在循环结束之前，时间应该总会被设定到那个特定时刻，所以不可能一直往上累加……"

    # game/script.rpy:62628
    old "Would the date have been able to reach \"9,999\" anyway? In the end, I'm not really sure I understand how that happened."
    new "话说回来，日期真的有可能走到「9,999」吗？到头来，我还是不太明白那究竟是怎么发生的。"

    # game/script.rpy:62639
    old "...After Shiroya and I reunited outside the security room, we went back to the attic, where we were told we'd been downstairs for fifty minutes. ...There, Sai's watch displayed the current time, but that was because he had seen it in the security room."
    new "……我和 Shiroya 在监控室外会合后，回到了阁楼，却被告知我们已经在楼下待了五十分钟。……在那里，Sai 的手表显示着当前时间，但那是因为他在监控室里看过时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:62640
    old "We explained everything. Most importantly, the Sekimeiya had disappeared from the event room. That's why we went to the crystal floor."
    new "我们把一切解释了一遍。最重要的是，活动室里的 Sekimeiya 不见了。我们正是因此才去了水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:62646
    old "When we got there, Sai was already gone."
    new "我们赶到时，Sai 已经不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62649
    old "We were fast enough to see him in front of the cleaning room, where he'd hidden a Sekimeiya.{w} I thought something then..."
    new "我们赶得够快，正好看见他站在清洁间前——他把一个 Sekimeiya 藏在了那里。{w} 当时我心里冒出一个念头……"

    # game/script.rpy:62652
    old "\"Shiroya was looking around while I questioned Sai's ambiguous action. If he'd concealed the Sekimeiya in that room, I wasn't sure why he left upon realizing that we'd seen him. He had the opportunity to give up, but instead, he left for hallway C.\""
    new "「Shiroya 在四处查看，而我则在琢磨 Sai 那个意味不明的举动。他既然把 Sekimeiya 藏在了那间房里，我不明白他发现我们看见他之后为什么还要离开。他本有机会就此放弃，却还是去了 C走廊。」"

    # game/script.rpy:62653
    old "He likely wanted to travel through time, probably because he knew we were about to search the floor. But even though we'd seen him, he still had another Sekimeiya hidden somewhere else. In fact, at that point, he should've known where all three of them were, and he went toward hallway A..."
    new "他多半是想穿越时间，大概是因为知道我们马上就要搜查这一层。可尽管我们已经看见了他，他还有另一个 Sekimeiya 藏在别处。事实上，那时他应该已经知道它们三个都在哪里，却还是朝 A走廊去了……"

    # game/script.rpy:62656
    old "And out of nowhere, I teleported. Shiroya saw the Sekimeiya's glow within the cleaning cart and made both of us appear in the attic."
    new "紧接着，毫无征兆地，我被传送了。Shiroya 看见清洁车里 Sekimeiya 发出的光，就让我们俩一起出现在了阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:62665
    old "At the time, we thought we'd gone to the past. That's not what happened, though.{w} We recognized our locations—we'd been there half an hour before we'd traveled. That means we went half an hour to the future."
    new "当时我们以为自己回到了过去，其实并非如此。{w}那些地方我们都认得——正是穿越前半小时我们待过的地方。也就是说，我们往未来跳了半个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:62670
    old "The staircase door is open, so this is past the time we unlocked the attic. There are a bunch of footprints next to the door, but I don't see ours. This must mean that you and I haven't gone down yet.{w} These are probably the ones that we left after going back up, when we found Akaro in the bathroom. We're not before that point since there are too many."
    new "楼梯间的门开着，说明现在已经过了我们打开阁楼的时间。门边有一堆脚印，可我没看到我们的。这么说，我们还没下楼。{w}这些多半是我们重新上楼之后留下的，也就是发现 Akaro 在洗手间那会儿。脚印这么多，说明现在不会早于那一刻。"

    # game/script.rpy:62671
    old "That was a big misinterpretation.{w} We were told what caused those footprints. It was the search that occurred after Isla went missing; the ones Shiroya and I had left were long buried.{w} They were all slightly faded too. There was no chance we'd just traveled a few seconds back, which led me to be pretty certain of the time."
    new "那是个天大的误判。{w}后来我们才知道那些脚印是怎么来的——是 Isla 失踪后众人搜索时踩出来的；我和 Shiroya 的脚印早被埋住了。{w}而且所有脚印都略微褪了色。我们不可能只往回穿越了几秒，正因如此，我才对时间相当有把握。"

    # game/script.rpy:62676
    old "How is that possible, though?{w} We heard a sound coming from the bedroom where we'd been. Who the hell was that? Nobody should've been there, right?"
    new "可这怎么可能？{w}我们听见声音从刚才待过的那间卧室传来。到底是谁？那里不该有人的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:62679
    old "We hid ourselves, thinking we were escaping the sight of our past selves. ...It appears that didn't actually occur."
    new "我们躲了起来，以为是在避开过去的自己。……可实际上，那似乎并没有真的发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:62682
    old "And in the second level of the opposite bedroom, both of us fell asleep.{w} When we woke up, we had no idea how long we'd been there for. That's why, when we were told the time, we thought we'd slept for quite a while. In reality, the main reason a lot of time had passed was because we'd gone to the future."
    new "而在对面卧室的第二层，我们两个都睡着了。{w}醒来后，我们根本不知道已经过了多久。所以后来有人告诉我们时间，我们才以为睡了很久。实际上，时间过去这么久，主要是因为我们跳到了未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:62689
    old "I couldn't believe it. We'd really misunderstood so many things."
    new "我简直不敢相信。我们竟把那么多事情都理解错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62693
    old "When we woke up, we had no idea what transpired on the crystal floor. Tired and still uneasy about our nonexistent past selves, we went to the living room."
    new "醒来时，我们对水晶层上的情况一无所知。我们拖着疲惫的身子，心里还为那根本不存在的过去的自己感到不安，走向客厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:62700
    old "\"We were used to looking at the footprints in front of the door, but that was no longer possible. The door was closed, and the movement of it had erased every single footprint nearby, creating an empty arc.\""
    new "我们原本习惯先看看门前的脚印，现在却看不到了。门已经关上，它转动的轨迹把附近的脚印抹得一干二净，只留下一道空荡荡的弧。"

    # game/script.rpy:62702
    old "\"Even though the motion of the door wiped out the nearby marks, there were many around the entire room. They were much fainter than the last time I'd seen them, but I was still able to recognize that new ones existed.\""
    new "门的转动虽然抹去了近处的痕迹，但整个房间里还留着许多。它们比我上次见到的淡了不少，可我还是能辨认出，其中有些是新留下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:62703
    old "The new footprints weren't from the time we walked to the crystal floor. ...Who did they belong to?"
    new "那些新脚印不是我们走向水晶层时留下的。……它们属于谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:62705
    old "...That was simple to solve—the remaining few gaps in that puzzle were all part of the same piece."
    new "……这倒不难。那道谜题里剩下的几处空白，其实都出自同一块拼图。"

    # game/script.rpy:62712
    old "When we came down, we saw that the cleaning cart had disappeared. What was strange was that the Sekimeiya was in one of the buckets which had been below it.{w} But that wasn't the Future Sekimeiya; it wasn't working.{w} Why was the third Sekimeiya there? Had it also been in the cart when we'd traveled? Shiroya said something else was there, but would the third Sekimeiya not have disappeared with the cart? ...And she said it was a dark object.{w} I'm not sure, but I think I can guess what happened to the Future Sekimeiya."
    new "下楼时，我们发现清洁车不见了。奇怪的是，Sekimeiya 就在原本位于车下的一个水桶里。{w}可那不是未来Sekimeiya，它没在工作。{w}第三个 Sekimeiya 怎么会在这儿？我们穿越时它也在车上吗？Shiroya 说当时那里还有别的什么，可第三个 Sekimeiya 不是该跟车一起消失吗？……而且她说那是个深色的东西。{w}我没有把握，不过未来Sekimeiya 的去向，我大概猜得到。"

    # game/script.rpy:62720
    old "When Shiroya used it, the Future Sekimeiya remained in the cleaning room, but we only found the third Sekimeiya, which we decided to leave in Naomi's locker before going to the lobby."
    new "Shiroya 使用它的时候，未来Sekimeiya 留在了清洁间，可我们只找到了第三个 Sekimeiya；我们决定把它放进 Naomi 的储物柜，然后去大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:62728
    old "There, Sai explained what happened while we were absent."
    new "在那里，Sai 说明了我们不在时发生的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:62729
    old "He pointed out the fact that he was the first person to enter the cleaning room after our disappearance. Since we had followed him there, he knew it was possible we'd traveled."
    new "他指出，我们消失之后，第一个进入清洁间的人就是他。既然我们当时是跟在他后面去的，他就知道我们有可能已经穿越了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62742
    old "\"Sai, showing the strongest reaction, approached the room while letting out a conspicuous grunt.{w} He opened the door and stayed still for some time. Then, he entered the small space. Before the others had time to wonder what he was doing, he exited and told them that it was empty.\""
    new "反应最大的是 Sai，他闷哼一声，走向那间房。{w} 他推开门，在门口一动不动地站了好一会儿，随后才走进那个狭小的空间。其他人还没来得及琢磨他在做什么，他就已经出来，说里面空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:62743
    old "The powered-off Sekimeiya was there, and he put it in his hip pack. That's why he had appeared with it in the past...{w} In the cleaning room, the others were distracted by the missing cart, and Sai pointed out the third Sekimeiya in the bucket.{w} I'm still having trouble understanding the cause behind some of these details, though. He was only able to obtain the Future Sekimeiya like that because he had appeared with it and had hidden it in the cleaning room... This seems to be an event with no origin, so perhaps it's an indication that something else happened on top of it."
    new "那个已经断电的 Sekimeiya 就在里面，他把它收进了腰包。所以他才会带着它出现在过去……{w}在清洁间里，其他人都在为不见的清洁车分神，Sai 则指出了水桶里的第三个 Sekimeiya。{w}不过这些细节背后的原因，我到现在还是没想明白。他能那样拿到未来Sekimeiya，是因为他曾带着它出现，并把它藏在了清洁间……这件事似乎没有起因，或许说明还有别的事情叠在它上面。"

    # game/script.rpy:62751
    old "\"It was Sai who first questioned its status, as it somewhat contradicted a few things they'd concluded earlier. It was white, instead of the gray color they thought it'd become after teleporting two people and a whole cleaning cart.\""
    new "「最先对它的状态起疑的是 Sai，因为这和之前的几点结论有些出入。它是白色的，而不是他们以为的灰色——按说传送了两个人再加一整辆清洁车，它应该变灰才对。」"

    # game/script.rpy:62759
    old "Akaro saw us enter and never leave the cleaning room—they knew we traveled through time. However, there was another disappearance.{w} Katei's."
    new "Akaro 看见我们进了清洁间就再没出来——他们知道我们穿越了时间。可还有另一起失踪。{w}Katei 的失踪。"

    # game/script.rpy:62760
    old "The remaining people searched through every room on the crystal floor, but they didn't find us.{w} When they were about to go up, Isla walked to room A5. That's when she fell into a cabinet and disappeared."
    new "剩下的人把水晶层的每个房间都搜了一遍，却没有找到我们。{w}就在他们准备上楼时，Isla 走到了水晶展室 A5。她就是在那里跌进展示柜，消失不见的。"

    # game/script.rpy:62761
    old "...I wonder what happened.{w} The cabinet she looked into is one that can be seen from the stairs, where she and Erina were waiting.{w} During the period Sai and Akaro investigated the rooms, I'm sure Sai quickly disposed of the Future Sekimeiya. That makes me think Isla saw him do that through the door's gap..."
    new "……她身上到底发生了什么？{w}她看的那台展示柜，从楼梯那边正好看得见，而她和 Erina 当时就在楼梯那儿等着。{w}在 Sai 和 Akaro 查看房间的那段时间里，Sai 肯定很快就把未来Sekimeiya 处理掉了。这么一想，Isla 会不会是透过门缝看见了……"

    # game/script.rpy:62763
    old "What happened to her, though? I don't really have any good idea."
    new "可她究竟出了什么事？我实在没什么头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:62766
    old "The situation around her death was inscrutable, so I thought further ahead for the time being."
    new "她的死实在蹊跷，我只好暂且把思绪放到更后面的事上。"

    # game/script.rpy:62771
    old "When the others saw Isla disappeared, they were unable to find a Sekimeiya in room A5's cabinet.{w} I'd bet it was powered off, and there was very little light. Since Sai knew the Sekimeiya was there, it wouldn't surprise me if he grabbed it immediately before the others saw it. I'm not sure about that, though."
    new "其他人见 Isla 消失，就在水晶展室 A5 的展示柜里找过，却没找到 Sekimeiya。{w}我猜它已经断电，周围光线又很暗。Sai 既然知道 Sekimeiya 在那里，他赶在别人看清之前立刻把它拿走，也不奇怪。不过这点我没有把握。"

    # game/script.rpy:62774
    old "Everyone thought Isla had to be somewhere in the building. That made them search through every floor, but nobody was found."
    new "大家都认定 Isla 一定还在楼里某处。于是他们搜遍了每一层，却一个人也没找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:62775
    old "Isla wasn't found. Katei wasn't found. Shiroya and I weren't found.{w} Of course, we weren't found because we were in the process of traveling to the future. What about Katei, though?"
    new "Isla 没被找到，Katei 没被找到，我和 Shiroya 也没被找到。{w}我们没被发现，自然是因为正穿越到未来。可 Katei 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:62783
    old "I don't think Katei could've been found either."
    new "我想 Katei 同样不可能被找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:62787
    old "Before we traveled to the future, we saw Sai in front of the cleaning room."
    new "在穿越到未来之前，我们看见 Sai 站在清洁间门前。"

    # game/script.rpy:62788
    old "\"I wasn't sure what Sai planned to do, but we'd seen him standing in front of the door. Shiroya and I entered while Katei continued toward hallway C in pursuit of him.\""
    new "我不知道 Sai 打算做什么，但我们确实看见他站在门前。Shiroya 和我进了那间屋子，Katei 则继续朝 C走廊追去。"

    # game/script.rpy:62795
    old "When we traveled to the future, Katei was actually very close to us. We went half an hour forward, so I'm sure the range picked him up."
    new "我们穿越到未来时，Katei 其实离我们很近。我们向前跳了半小时，那个范围一定把他一起卷了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:62801
    old "Half an hour earlier, he, Shiroya, and I were in the attic, so that's where we appeared in the future. Katei was in the rightmost bedroom.{w} He suddenly teleported there and left the room, disoriented. He's the one we heard approaching the door when we were in the hallway and who left the newer footprints in the living room."
    new "半小时前，他、Shiroya 和我都在阁楼，所以我们在未来出现的地方就是阁楼。而 Katei 当时在最右边那间卧室。{w}他忽然被传送到那里，神志恍惚地走出房间。我们躲在走廊时听见有人走近门，客厅里那些较新的脚印也是他留下的。"

    # game/script.rpy:62807
    old "After failing to find anyone, Erina, Akaro, and Sai gave up and moved back to the lobby.{w} There was only silence for a long time until they heard a sound from hallway A."
    new "找了一圈毫无收获，Erina、Akaro 和 Sai 只好作罢，回到大厅。{w}此后很长一段时间只剩寂静，直到 A走廊那边传来声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:62811
    old "It was Katei. He had walked down after appearing in the bedroom, and Shiroya and I were about to fall asleep."
    new "是 Katei。他在卧室现身之后一路走了下来，那时我和 Shiroya 正要睡过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:62819
    old "\"Sai shot the first question, and an immediate answer came that left the three of them unsatisfied.\""
    new "先开口的是 Sai，回答来得也快，却让三人都不满意。"

    # game/script.rpy:62832
    old "Then, they looked into the cabinet where Isla had disappeared.{w} She was there, already dead. The Sekimeiya, meanwhile, was nowhere to be found."
    new "随后，他们去查看 Isla 消失的那个展示柜。{w}她就在里面，人已经死了。而那个 Sekimeiya 却怎么也找不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:62833
    old "After they waited in the lobby again, Shiroya and I appeared. We told them they hadn't found us because we'd been sleeping in the attic."
    new "他们又在大厅等了一阵，我和 Shiroya 才出现。我们告诉他们，之所以没被找到，是因为我们一直在阁楼睡觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:62843
    old "This only made sense from our point of view, but Sai never denied it.{w} Why? There's no way he really didn't look at the upper levels, is there?{w} Perhaps that was the first indication he had that traveling to the future was possible, and he consciously chose not to let us know. Since he should've been in hallway C when Katei disappeared, I wonder if he turned around and realized what had happened to him too."
    new "这番话只有站在我们的立场才说得通，可 Sai 始终没有反驳。{w}为什么？他总不可能真的没看卧室上层吧？{w}也许正是那时，他第一次察觉到穿越到未来的可能，于是刻意不让我们知道。Katei 消失时，他应该就在 C走廊，我猜他是不是回过头，也明白了发生在 Katei 身上的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:62850
    old "In any case, when we went to see Isla with our own eyes, there was a major distinction: the Sekimeiya was there, emitting a faint glow."
    new "总之，等我们亲眼去看 Isla 时，有一个很大的不同：那个 Sekimeiya 就在那里，发着幽幽的微光。"

    # game/script.rpy:62851
    old "What the hell happened? That Sekimeiya was working, and we had hidden the third one in Naomi's locker. ...How did that one appear back in the cabinet?"
    new "究竟发生了什么？那个 Sekimeiya 明明还在运作，而第三个被我们藏进了 Naomi 的储物柜。……它怎么又回到了展示柜里？"

    # game/script.rpy:62858
    old "I don't get it. I don't know what happened to Isla.{w} Is there a whole other factor that I'm missing about this? Did something else occur that I don't know about?"
    new "我不明白。我不知道 Isla 到底出了什么事。{w} 难道这件事里还有我完全没想到的另一层因素？是不是还发生了别的、我一无所知的事？"

    # game/script.rpy:62859
    old "Isla disappeared from the cabinet, but how? Did she go to the future? ...The Future Sekimeiya should've been powered off since we had just used it.{w} Even if that happened, did she reappear in that same cabinet, where she'd gone to look?{w} Why, though? She wasn't there in the past, was she? And why did she die?"
    new "Isla 从展示柜里消失了，可这是怎么做到的？她去了未来吗？……未来Sekimeiya 应该已经断电了，因为我们刚用过它。{w} 就算真是那样，她难道会重新出现在她刚才查看的那个展示柜里吗？{w} 可为什么？过去那里并没有她，对吧？而且她为什么会死？"

    # game/script.rpy:62860
    old "Right, she yelled before falling in. What the hell does that mean? Did she go to the past?{w} Before, Sai had kept walking toward hallway A—perhaps he put the Future Sekimeiya where he had the past one, for whatever reason. Since the future one should've been powered off, Isla would've actually traveled back in time and not changed worlds. I can't know if the search took long enough for it to power back on, though."
    new "对，她掉进去之前喊了一声。那到底是什么意思？她去了过去吗？{w} 之前 Sai 一直朝 A走廊走去——也许他不知出于什么原因，把未来Sekimeiya 放到了原本放着过去Sekimeiya 的位置。既然未来Sekimeiya 应该已经断电，Isla 就应该是穿越回了过去，而不是发生了世界切换。不过，我没法确定那场搜索持续的时间是否足够让它重新启动。"

    # game/script.rpy:62861
    old "But... that still doesn't make sense, does it? If she saw herself, what happened to her other body? Why the hell was it even there? And if both Sekimeiya were active, she should've changed worlds... Also, I know Sai could only put one in his hip pack, so the other would've been seen."
    new "可是……这仍然说不通，对吧？如果她看见了自己，那她的另一具身体又怎么了？那具身体究竟为什么会出现在那里？而且，如果两个 Sekimeiya 都处于启动状态，她应该已经发生世界切换了……另外，我知道 Sai 的腰包里只能装下一个，所以另一个一定会被人看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:62862
    old "Most importantly, the Sekimeiya reappeared in that cabinet later. ...Did someone do this?{w} Or was it all an accident that didn't involve a murder?"
    new "最重要的是，后来 Sekimeiya 又出现在了那个展示柜里。……是有人动了手脚吗？{w} 还是说，这一切都只是意外，与谋杀无关？"

    # game/script.rpy:62870
    old "It's possible someone killed her, but who? Who would've had a motive to do that? Who could've done that?{w} There was a whole search, and the Future Sekimeiya had just been used. It's possible a killer with an elaborate plan carried this out, but that's completely out of place."
    new "也许有人杀了她，可那个人是谁？谁会有这种动机？又有谁能做到？{w} 当时我们展开了全面搜索，而未来Sekimeiya 也刚被用过。一个精心谋划的凶手或许能办到，但这完全不合常理。"

    # game/script.rpy:62871
    old "...I don't believe she was killed. Her cause of death was one of the strangest details."
    new "……我不认为她是被杀的。她的死因是最离奇的细节之一。"

    # game/script.rpy:62876
    old "It's tough, isn't it?"
    new "很棘手，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:62877
    old "What happened to Isla? Under the right circumstances, touching the Sekimeiya ended her life.{w} It wasn't an instant result, however. The complexity of what occurred might be a bit more involved than what you're imagining, as no world switches factored in."
    new "Isla 出了什么事？在特定条件下，触碰 Sekimeiya 结束了她的生命。{w} 不过，这并不是瞬间发生的结果。其中经过也许比你想象的更复杂一些，因为此事并没有涉及世界切换。"

    # game/script.rpy:62878
    old "The cabinet, both Sekimeiya, everyone's actions... Everything contributed to allow Isla's tragic demise."
    new "展示柜、两个 Sekimeiya、每个人的行动……这一切共同导致了 Isla 的惨死。"

    # game/script.rpy:62879
    old "This riddle will be left all to you, but know something:{w} when Isla looked into the cabinet for the first time, she saw the body of a young girl. It was her own, but that was far from her interpretation.{w} Inside the cabinet, she saw the image of her friend. Her mind and body both teetered on the edge, and she screamed as she toppled into that sarcophagus of a cabinet."
    new "这个谜题就全留给你了，但你要知道一件事：{w} 当 Isla 第一次往展示柜里看时，她看见了一具年轻女孩的尸体。那其实是她自己，可她的理解却完全不是这么回事。{w} 她在展示柜里看见的是自己朋友的影像。她的身心都濒临崩溃，尖叫着跌进了那个宛如石棺的展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:62887
    old "But if she wasn't killed, I don't know what could've happened... There are too many aspects that I don't get."
    new "可如果她不是被杀的，我就不知道还能发生什么了……我想不明白的地方实在太多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62888
    old "It was frustrating. I'd had the information to solve everything so far, but I was lost when it came to Isla's death."
    new "这实在令人不甘。此前的一切，我都有足够的信息可以解开，可一碰到 Isla 的死，我就毫无头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:62889
    old "I wish I could know what happened to her. She died right there, and she never revived. The Isla in the future wasn't the same person..."
    new "我真想知道她到底出了什么事。她就这样死在那里，再也没有醒来。未来的 Isla 并不是同一个人……"

    # game/script.rpy:62891
    old "I looked at the voice recorder. The minutes had been ticking along, so I felt slightly rushed."
    new "我看了看录音笔。时间一分一秒地过去，我不由得有些着急。"

    # game/script.rpy:62892
    old "I hated having to move on, but her death seemed to be surrounded by too many questions for me to solve."
    new "我很不愿就此放下，可她的死似乎笼罩着太多疑问，我实在无从解开。"

    # game/script.rpy:62900
    old "Afterward, we simply stayed in the lobby.{w} It didn't look like any of us had the strength to stand again, but that changed when Katei and Sai left out of the blue."
    new "之后，我们只是留在大厅里。{w} 我们似乎谁都没有力气再站起来，可 Katei 和 Sai 忽然离开后，情况就变了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62901
    old "Both of them said they went to the bathroom, but it's clear that's not what happened."
    new "两人都说自己去了洗手间，但显然事情并非如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:62903
    old "When I thought about it, I realized I could draw a solid conclusion."
    new "仔细一想，我发现自己能得出一个确切的结论。"

    # game/script.rpy:62906
    old "The Sekimeiya that appeared next to Isla's dead body was working..."
    new "出现在 Isla 尸体旁的那个 Sekimeiya 正在运转……"

    # game/script.rpy:62913
    old "I think it was the Past Sekimeiya."
    new "我想那是过去Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:62917
    old "That's because I put it in the Sekimeiya cabinet, and when we locked ourselves in the attic, it was still there."
    new "因为是我把它放进了存放 Sekimeiya 的展示柜，而我们把自己锁进阁楼时，它还在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:62918
    old "We were told that when Sai and Akaro escaped, Akaro forced Sai to tell him where he'd stashed one of the Sekimeiya. At that point, he touched it and appeared in January, meaning that the one in the event room was the Past Sekimeiya."
    new "我们听说，Sai 和 Akaro 逃跑时，Akaro 逼 Sai 说出他把其中一个 Sekimeiya 藏在了哪里。随后他碰了那个 Sekimeiya，出现在了一月，也就是说活动室里的那个是过去Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:62919
    old "And there is something strange about this. If I'm right, Sai hid the Future Sekimeiya immediately after Isla's disappearance. This means that when Akaro touched it, it had already gathered energy for a ridiculously long time. A lot more than what I believe he needed to travel 21 days."
    new "这里有一点很奇怪。如果我没猜错，Isla 消失后，Sai 立刻就把 未来Sekimeiya 藏了起来。也就是说，Akaro 碰到它时，它积蓄能量的时间已经长得离谱，比我估计他穿越 21 天所需的能量多出太多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62923
    old "After Katei and Sai left the lobby, Shiroya and I came across an empty cabinet in room B4 that was set to 0 °C. That's what reset the stored time."
    new "Katei 和 Sai 离开大厅后，Shiroya 和我在 B4 房间发现了一个空展示柜，温度设定为 0 °C。正是它重置了蓄积的时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:62925
    old "I'm not sure what happened exactly. Maybe Katei found the Sekimeiya and put it somewhere cold, but Sai saw that and removed it. The cabinet would've taken a bit to cool off, but a few minutes had passed..."
    new "我不确定具体发生了什么。也许是 Katei 找到了 Sekimeiya，把它放到了某个寒冷的地方，而 Sai 看见后把它拿走了。展示柜冷却需要一些时间，但当时已经过去了几分钟……"

    # game/script.rpy:62929
    old "After that, Shiroya discovered the storeroom's movable wall and the door with no handle."
    new "在那之后，Shiroya 发现了储藏室里的可移动墙壁，还有那扇没有门把手的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:62932
    old "At the time, I was certain that secret place had been used by the culprit to escape the multiple searches we did."
    new "当时我确信，那个秘密之处曾被犯人用来躲避我们的数次搜查。"

    # game/script.rpy:62938
    old "I don't think it was ever used by anyone who didn't want to be seen, though.{w} I saw a single set of fingerprints, identical to the ones I saw this morning. ...Since this morning, no one had opened that door from the hallway."
    new "不过，我不觉得有谁为了不让人看见而用过那里。{w} 我只看到了一组指纹，和今早见到的那组一模一样。……从今早到现在，没有人从走廊那边打开过那扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:62940
    old "Katei had the rusty key, and it fits the keyhole of that door. He definitely knew of its existence."
    new "Katei 手里有那把生锈的钥匙，而它正好能插进那扇门的锁孔。他肯定知道那扇门的存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:62944
    old "And immediately after that, Erina proposed that we confine ourselves. That's what led us to wait in the attic's bedroom, leaving the Past Sekimeiya behind in the event room."
    new "紧接着，Erina 提议我们把自己关起来。于是我们便在阁楼的卧室里等待，把 过去Sekimeiya 留在了活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:62949
    old "That marked the halfway point of our imprisonment. From there, though, everything only got crazier."
    new "那时，我们被囚禁的时间刚过去一半。可从那之后，一切却变得越来越疯狂。"

    # game/script.rpy:62952
    old "Despite our efforts, Sai and Akaro managed to escape. I wouldn't be surprised if they left the way I imagined it, with a thought-up loop."
    new "尽管我们努力了，Sai 和 Akaro 还是设法逃走了。就算他们像我想象的那样，靠一个凭空想出来的循环离开了，我也不会觉得意外。"

    # game/script.rpy:62955
    old "I attempted to replicate that idea, but it didn't work. At the time, I thought of a number of reasons that could've prevented my success, but now I can think of even more."
    new "我试着照那个思路做过，却没有成功。当时我就想到了不少可能让我失败的原因，而现在能想到的更多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62956
    old "First off, at some point, Akaro traveled days into the future. It's possible that even the Isla from another world traveled days into the past. If I'd walked to the crystal floor, maybe I would've been involved in one of those travels."
    new "首先，Akaro 曾在某个时候穿越到了数天之后。就连另一个世界的 Isla，也可能穿越到了数天之前。如果我当时走到水晶层，也许就会被卷进其中一次穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:62957
    old "Secondly, my idea was to leave, travel to the past, unlock the door, and reenter the bedroom immediately after my departure. That meant that my future location would've been in the bedroom, so I wouldn't have been able to appear outside it in the past."
    new "其次，我的设想是离开、穿越到过去、打开门，再在我离开之后立刻回到卧室。可这意味着我未来的位置会在卧室里，所以我不可能在过去的卧室外出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:62958
    old "Lastly, my plan entailed using the Sekimeiya we had hidden in Naomi's locker. It was the third Sekimeiya, so I highly doubt it would've ever worked."
    new "最后，我的计划要用到我们藏在 Naomi 的储物柜里的那个 Sekimeiya。那是第三个 Sekimeiya，所以我很怀疑这个计划根本行不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:62968
    old "After both of them left, an Akaro with different memories showed up. Even another Isla was there."
    new "他们两人离开后，一个拥有不同记忆的 Akaro 出现了。甚至还有一个 Isla 也在场。"

    # game/script.rpy:62969
    old "What happened outside the bedroom? I only have Akaro's version.{w} He touched the Sekimeiya Sai had hidden, and went to the fu—"
    new "卧室外到底发生了什么？我只有 Akaro 的说法。{w} 他碰了 Sai 藏起来的那个 Sekimeiya，然后去了未——"

    # game/script.rpy:62972
    old "Wait, what the fuck? This doesn't make any sense."
    new "等等，搞什么鬼？这根本说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:62982
    old "...More than twenty minutes had passed, so it was safe to step back into the kitchen."
    new "……二十多分钟已经过去，现在回到厨房应该安全了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62983
    old "How did I not think this through? There's no way we went to January 5th.{w} For that, we should've been in the tower 21 days before the 15th."
    new "我怎么没想通这一点？我们不可能去了一月五日。{w} 若真是那样，我们在 15 日的 21 天前就应该在塔里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:62984
    old "Akaro's clothes changed. I can't rule out that he was in the tower in the past. Our clothing didn't change, though. I certainly wasn't here in the past, so if I traveled 21 days to the future, I should've appeared far outside the tower."
    new "Akaro 的衣服变了。不能排除他过去曾在塔里。可我们的衣服没有变化。我过去肯定不在这里，所以如果我穿越到了 21 天后的未来，就应该出现在离塔很远的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:62990
    old "That broke my entire train of thought. It was a major contradiction regarding what I'd concluded."
    new "这一下把我整条思路都打断了。这和我先前的结论严重矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:62991
    old "What happened at the end of the day?"
    new "那天最后发生了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:62992
    old "21 days before the 15th... That was November 24th.{w} I was not in the tower at that time."
    new "15日往前推21天……就是11月24日。{w}那时我并不在塔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:62993
    old "I wonder what would happen if now I travel back in time to that day and go to the tower. ...I don't think that would explain it either."
    new "如果我现在穿越回那一天，再去塔里，会怎么样呢？……我想，那也解释不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:62994
    old "Needless to say, that won't happen. It would mean that Sai and Erina would have to be there as well..."
    new "不用说，那也不可能发生。若真如此，Sai 和 Erina 当时也得在那里……"

    # game/script.rpy:63000
    old "What the hell is this? How is it possible that we traveled to January 5th?"
    new "这到底是怎么回事？我们怎么可能穿越到1月5日？"

    # game/script.rpy:63001
    old "Is there another way? Could anything explain this...?"
    new "还有别的可能吗？有什么能解释这一切……？"

    # game/script.rpy:63002
    old "I thought about our last minutes in the tower, right before {time=21.}{w} What exactly had caused the travel?"
    new "我回想着我们在塔里的最后几分钟，就在 {time=21.} 之前。{w}究竟是什么引发了那次时间穿越？"

    # game/script.rpy:63003
    old "One of the Sekimeiya was kept cold in the event room, which means that it was likely the Past Sekimeiya. The Future Sekimeiya must have been somewhere else, and it made us travel through time."
    new "其中一个 Sekimeiya 被冷藏在活动室，所以它很可能是过去Sekimeiya。未来Sekimeiya 想必在别处，正是它让我们穿越了时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:63004
    old "But the replicated locations don't make any sense...!"
    new "可那些被复制出来的地点根本说不通……！"

    # game/script.rpy:63011
    old "I had to think about everything that had happened during the last segment of the day.{w} When I did, a possibility came to mind."
    new "我不得不把那天最后一段时间里发生的一切重新想一遍。{w}想着想着，一个可能性浮上心头。"

    # game/script.rpy:63024
    old "We were definitely on December 15th. The call with Suripo should confirm that. Then, given Isla's words and the evaporated water, I'm certain that we arrived on January 5th."
    new "我们当时无疑是在12月15日。和 Suripo 的通话应该能证明这一点。那么，结合 Isla 的话和那些蒸发的水，我可以确定，我们抵达的是1月5日。"

    # game/script.rpy:63025
    old "By simply thinking about what happened during the last stretch, an obvious problem immediately comes up: we shouldn't have been able to travel 21 days through time."
    new "只要回想最后那段时间发生的事，一个明显的问题便立刻浮现：我们本来不可能穿越21天的时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:63028
    old "A bit after {time=20:30}, we found the powered-off Sekimeiya in the water tank, and we left it in the cold cabinet."
    new "过了 {time=20:30} 不久，我们在水箱里找到了那个断电的 Sekimeiya，并把它留在了冷藏展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:63034
    old "Then, we found Shiroya in a hallway A crystal room. I don't know who she really was, but she convinced me to wait in the lobby for the shutter to open."
    new "接着，我们在A走廊的一间水晶展室里找到了 Shiroya。我不知道她究竟是谁，但她说服我在大堂等卷帘门打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:63041
    old "Something I felt iffy about occurred then. Erina left, saying she was going to search for Sai. Later, when she came back, it sounded like she'd traveled through time."
    new "那时发生了一件让我觉得不对劲的事。Erina 说要去寻找 Sai，便离开了。后来她回来时，听起来像是穿越了时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:63045
    old "The Sekimeiya wasn't in the cabinet. I couldn't stand it anymore. I felt like everyone was lying to me."
    new "展示柜里的 Sekimeiya 不见了。我再也无法忍受。我觉得所有人都在骗我。"

    # game/script.rpy:63048
    old "I searched hallway A by myself and found a Sekimeiya in the security room."
    new "我一个人搜了A走廊，在监控室里找到了一个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:63049
    old "What's strange is that the Sekimeiya was scalding; it didn't make sense for Erina to have recently used it.{w} That makes me think it wasn't the same Sekimeiya that had just disappeared from the cabinet."
    new "奇怪的是，那个 Sekimeiya 烫得灼手；如果 Erina 前不久刚用过它，实在说不通。{w}这让我觉得，它并不是刚从展示柜里消失的那一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:63054
    old "After I found the Sekimeiya in the water tank, something about Sai also seemed off."
    new "我在水箱里找到 Sekimeiya 之后，Sai 也有些不对劲。"

    # game/script.rpy:63068
    old "\"I stared at Sai's eyes, a little disconcerted. His voice sounded noticeably more nervous and tense than it had recently.\""
    new "我有些不安地注视着 Sai 的眼睛。他的声音明显比之前更紧张，也更紧绷。"

    # game/script.rpy:63071
    old "He knew there was something left to be found—the Sekimeiya in the security room. He didn't care that we found one, but he was worried we would find the second one..."
    new "他知道还有东西没被找到——监控室里的那个 Sekimeiya。我们找到一个，他并不在意；他担心的是我们会找到第二个……"

    # game/script.rpy:63077
    old "What's most important is that after I found it in the security room, I put it in the cabinet. But mere minutes later, we supposedly traveled to January 5th."
    new "最重要的是，我在监控室里找到它后，把它放进了展示柜。可仅仅几分钟后，我们却似乎穿越到了1月5日。"

    # game/script.rpy:63080
    old "This seems impossible. One Sekimeiya had just been taken out of the cabinet while the other one had just been left inside. There was no time to build up the necessary energy to travel 21 days through time."
    new "这似乎不可能。一个 Sekimeiya 刚被拿出展示柜，另一个又刚被放进去。根本来不及积蓄足够能量，完成21天的时间穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:63081
    old "If the Future Sekimeiya was put in a hot place during those minutes, it could've gathered enough energy. However, that wouldn't explain the replicated location: I wasn't in the tower on November 24th.{w} So there is necessarily an answer that explains both mysteries at once."
    new "如果 未来Sekimeiya 在那几分钟里被放到高温处，它或许能积攒足够的能量。可那解释不了被复制的地点：11月24日我并不在塔里。{w}因此，一定存在一个能同时解释这两个谜团的答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:63082
    old "Could it really be what I'm imagining...?{w} Before the exit unlocked, the Future Sekimeiya was activated. I believe the location where that happened is a very important detail."
    new "难道真如我所想……？{w}出口解锁前，未来Sekimeiya 被启动了。我认为，它被启动的地点是个非常关键的细节。"

    # game/script.rpy:63090
    old "It was in the mechanical room. That's where the Future Sekimeiya was at {time=21.}{w} And it was Erina who activated it. She was in the mechanical room when the lights went off."
    new "它就在机械室。{time=21.} 时，未来Sekimeiya 正是在那里。{w}而启动它的正是 Erina。灯灭的时候，她就在机械室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:63094
    old "She still wanted to go to the past; she never stopped saying that. It was her last chance to do so.{w} Before then, she used the Sekimeiya we left in the cabinet. However, when she came back to the lobby and asked us the time, she had gone to the future instead. Based on what happened later, that had to be the Future Sekimeiya."
    new "她仍想回到过去，这话她一直挂在嘴边。那是她最后的机会。{w}在此之前，她用过了我们留在展示柜里的那个 Sekimeiya。可当她回到大堂、问我们时间时，她其实是去了未来。结合后来发生的事，那个必定是未来Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:63095
    old "Even so late into the day, Sai was still trying to keep the Sekimeiya hidden. He knew one was in the security room, and when Erina traveled to the future, it was his chance to take care of the other."
    new "即便一天已经这么晚了，Sai 仍在设法藏住 Sekimeiya。他知道有一个在监控室，而 Erina 穿越到未来时，正是他处理另一个的机会。"

    # game/script.rpy:63096
    old "Erina came back, asking for the time. That's when we went to the event room and saw the empty cabinet."
    new "Erina 回来问时间。也正是那时，我们去了活动室，看见展示柜空了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63103
    old "\"I noticed the brief instant in which Erina's expression showed surprise. She was still in hallway B, staring at her left.\""
    new "我注意到 Erina 脸上闪过一丝惊讶。她还站在 B走廊里，盯着自己的左边。"

    # game/script.rpy:63110
    old "\"I walked up to her, but I found nothing that stood out in the hallway.\""
    new "我走到她身边，可走廊里并没有什么引人注意的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:63113
    old "...What she saw was Sai going through the mechanical room. That's where he left the Future Sekimeiya."
    new "「……她看到的是 Sai 穿过机械室的身影。他就是在那儿留下了未来Sekimeiya。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63135
    old "But that's not all. Before, Erina noticed the mechanical room had been opened. That makes me think Sai was down there and came out when we went to the event room.{w} He knew I'd purposely left the cabinet unlocked. If he later hid the Sekimeiya in the mechanical room, he was probably scoping it out ahead of time."
    new "「但不止如此。Erina 之前就注意到机械室被人打开过。这让我觉得，Sai 当时就在下面，趁我们去活动室时溜了出来。{w}他知道我故意没锁展示柜。若他后来把 Sekimeiya 藏进机械室，那他多半事先就踩过点了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63143
    old "After that, Sai didn't waver as I looked through hallway A. He knew I would find one Sekimeiya, but not the one he'd just hidden."
    new "「之后，我在 A 走廊搜寻时，Sai 没有半点动摇。他知道我会找到一个 Sekimeiya，但不会是他刚藏起来的那个。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63146
    old "Once I put the Past Sekimeiya in the cabinet, all of us, including Shiroya, went back to the lobby and kept waiting where we'd been before."
    new "「我把过去Sekimeiya 放进展示柜后，我们所有人——包括 Shiroya——都回到大堂，继续在原先的位置等待。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63149
    old "Erina didn't speak once. She knew the Sekimeiya Sai had hidden was still under us, and she was waiting for it to gather energy."
    new "「Erina 一句话也没说。她知道 Sai 藏起来的那个 Sekimeiya 仍在我们脚下，她在等它积蓄能量。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63152
    old "Before the exit unlocked, she disappeared from beside us—she went down to activate the Sekimeiya one final time."
    new "「出口解锁前，她从我们身边消失——她下去了，要最后启动一次 Sekimeiya。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63153
    old "And she did. The ceiling of the mechanical room is very low, so the range encompassed us too, the people sitting right above it."
    new "「她确实这么做了。机械室的天花板很低，所以作用范围也覆盖到了我们——我们正好坐在上面。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63158
    old "Why did we go to January 5th, though? If that was the case, the range should've picked up everyone who'd been waiting outside the tower.{w} ...Somehow, Shiroya knew the travel would occur, and she ran away from us to avoid being involved..."
    new "「可我们为什么会去到1月5日？若真是如此，范围理应把等在塔外的所有人都卷进来才对。{w}……Shiroya 不知怎的知道会发生时间穿越，为了不被牵扯进来，才从我们身边逃开了……」"

    # game/script.rpy:63159
    old "But why? Why 21 days into the future?{w} On the surface, it seems like Erina activating the Sekimeiya would never result in that. However... I think I can tell what the answer is by simply running through what would've happened after she touched it."
    new "「可为什么？为什么会是二十一天之后的未来？{w}乍看之下，Erina 启动 Sekimeiya 无论如何都不会造成那样的结果。不过……只要顺着她触碰之后会发生什么推演一遍，我想我就能看出答案。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63165
    old "Sai frequently told us the current time. When Erina made us travel to the future, the Sekimeiya had gathered power for about fifteen minutes. At that point, we already knew that would result in roughly twenty minutes traveled."
    new "「Sai 经常向我们报时。Erina 让我们穿越到未来的时候，Sekimeiya 已经蓄能了大约十五分钟。而那时我们已经知道，蓄能到这个程度，大约会穿越二十分钟。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63168
    old "So, we traveled twenty minutes to the future.{w} What would the locations have been?"
    new "「于是，我们穿越到了二十分钟后的未来。{w}那么，出现的位置又会是哪里？」"

    # game/script.rpy:63171
    old "Twenty minutes before the travel, Sai was in the mechanical room while Erina and I were in the lobby, sitting in the same spot."
    new "「穿越发生前二十分钟，Sai 在机械室，而 Erina 和我在大堂，坐在同一个位置上。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63172
    old "What occurred relied on Sai's location upon appearing.{w} By that point, I had also learned that fifteen minutes stored resulted in five minutes of the Sekimeiya's recovery phase. After Erina touched the Sekimeiya, it spent five minutes off and then gathered energy for fifteen more minutes until we appeared."
    new "「接下来会发生什么，取决于 Sai 出现时所在的位置。{w}到那时我也已经明白：蓄能十五分钟，换来的是 Sekimeiya 五分钟的恢复期。Erina 触碰 Sekimeiya 之后，它先停摆了五分钟，随后又蓄能十五分钟，直到我们出现。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63175
    old "When we appeared, Sai was in the mechanical room, where he would hide the Sekimeiya. So the instant we appeared, he activated it again.{w} ...I'm not sure how that happened fluidly, but I can think of a couple things that make a lot of sense.{w} Immediately, we went twenty more minutes to the future, and when we appeared, the Sekimeiya had gathered energy for another fifteen minutes."
    new "「我们出现时，Sai 正在机械室——他后来藏 Sekimeiya 的地方。于是就在我们出现的瞬间，他又一次启动了它。{w}……我不知道这一切为何能衔接得如此顺畅，不过我能想到几种说得通的解释。{w}紧接着，我们又穿越到了二十分钟后的未来，而我们出现时，Sekimeiya 已经又蓄能了十五分钟。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63179
    old "That time, the locations were from the time Erina had touched the Sekimeiya. In other words, she was in the mechanical room while Sai and I were in the lobby.{w} So, we went twenty more minutes to the future."
    new "「那一次，位置取的是 Erina 触碰 Sekimeiya 时的情形。也就是说，她在机械室，而 Sai 和我在大堂。{w}于是，我们又穿越到了二十分钟后的未来。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63180
    old "It's incredibly unlikely that the time matched up exactly and perfectly replicated the instant in which we had appeared twenty minutes before. However, it's possible that location was what we defaulted to, as it was the closest location in which we \"existed\". That's all I can really assume there."
    new "「时间恰好完全对上，还完美复现了我们二十分钟前出现的那一刻，这几乎不可能。不过，也许我们只是默认落在了那个位置——因为那是我们「存在」过的最近的位置。这一点，我只能这样推测。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63181
    old "Again, when we appeared, it was Erina who instantly reactivated the Sekimeiya. This created a never-ending chain of twenty minutes jumping forward."
    new "同样地，我们一出现，就是 Erina 立刻再次启动了 Sekimeiya。于是形成了一条每二十分钟向前跳一次、仿佛永无止境的链条。"

    # game/script.rpy:63201
    old "Only two locations alternated: the one in which Sai was in the mechanical room, and the one in which Erina was. Meanwhile, I was in the lobby regardless.{w} This explains why I didn't see the sudden, instant flashing they talked about."
    new "交替的只有两个位置：一个是 Sai 在机械室的情形，另一个是 Erina 在机械室的情形。而不管哪种情况，我都在大堂。{w}这就解释了为什么我没看见他们说的那种突如其来的瞬间闪光。"

    # game/script.rpy:63202
    old "For some reason, on January 5th, the tower was empty. Katei told us once that the lights turn off every night and are manually turned on in the morning. So, if nobody was in the tower in the morning, the lights would've remained off.{w} However, before all the lights turned off permanently, every twenty minutes, Sai and Erina alternated between being in the lobby and in the mechanical room. Although it lasted an instant each time, due to the darkness in the mechanical room and the light in the lobby, they perceived a \"flashing light\"."
    new "不知为何，1月5日那天，塔里空无一人。Katei 曾告诉我们，灯每晚都会熄灭，早上再手动打开。所以如果早上塔里没有人，灯就会一直关着。{w}然而，在所有灯彻底熄灭之前，每隔二十分钟，Sai 和 Erina 就会在大堂与机械室之间交替。尽管每次只有一瞬，但机械室一片漆黑、大堂亮着灯，于是他们便觉得看到了「闪光」。"

    # game/script.rpy:63208
    old "On January 5th, the chain stopped. I don't know why, but we broke free of it, effectively traveling 21 days into the future."
    new "到了1月5日，这条链断了。我不知道原因，但我们确实挣脱了它，实际穿越到了二十一天后的未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:63209
    old "And the final location was from when Erina was in the mechanical room, which is why it didn't feel like we changed places. And... since she would've appeared and activated the Sekimeiya instantly in the previous location, that must mean it overlapped with part of her body upon arriving. That's why she started bleeding at the end of the chain. The tip of her finger was missing."
    new "而最终的位置，取自 Erina 在机械室的那一刻，所以我们才没有觉得换了地方。还有……既然她会在前一个位置出现并立刻启动 Sekimeiya，那说明抵达时，Sekimeiya 与她身体的一部分发生了重叠。所以她才会在链条终结时开始流血。她少了一截指尖。"

    # game/script.rpy:63214
    old "...Did all that really happen? And none of us realized it..."
    new "……这一切真的发生过吗？而我们谁都没有察觉……"

    # game/script.rpy:63215
    old "It explained things, but I still had a few doubts. Why had the tower been empty on January 5th? Why had the chain not gone on infinitely?"
    new "这样确实解释得通，但我仍有几处疑问。1月5日那天，塔里为什么空无一人？这条链又为什么没有无限延续下去？"

    # game/script.rpy:63216
    old "So Akaro actually was in the tower on November 24th. ...His hair was longer and a different color."
    new "那么，Akaro 确实在11月24日到过塔里。……他的头发更长，颜色也不一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:63218
    old "He traveled to the future while we were in the attic, but there's something I'm confused about."
    new "我们在阁楼的时候，他穿越到了未来，但有一点我怎么也想不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:63219
    old "If I'm right, and the version of Isla who was there ended up being the \"friend\", she likely traveled before we left the bedroom. We weren't there for too long of a time, though, and we'd left the Past Sekimeiya in the cabinet."
    new "如果我没猜错，当时在场的那个 Isla 后来成了那位「朋友」，那她很可能是在我们离开卧室之前就穿越了。可我们在那里待的时间并不长，而且我们把 过去Sekimeiya 留在了展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:63220
    old "Akaro traveled to the future after he and Sai escaped, but since Isla was still there, she went to the past afterward.{w} Would there have been enough time to store the needed energy to go so far back?"
    new "Akaro 和 Sai 逃脱之后，Akaro 穿越到了未来；而 Isla 当时仍在原地，随后便去了过去。{w}要回到那么远的过去，所需能量来得及蓄够吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:63226
    old "The reason she was able to go many days back was..."
    new "她能回到那么多天以前，原因是……"

    # game/script.rpy:63233
    old "Actually, yes. It was due to a bed sheet that the world C group had obtained in world A. When it was brought to world B, they wrapped it around the Past Sekimeiya and world switched back to world C. However, the sheet remained around the Sekimeiya in world B.{w} When it powered back on, the sheet was still very hot. That's why it took a short time to reach the needed amount of energy."
    new "没错，那是因为 C世界那组人在 A世界拿到了一条床单。他们把床单带到 B世界，裹在 过去Sekimeiya 上，然后世界切换回 C世界。然而，那条床单留在了 B世界的 Sekimeiya 上。{w}当它重新启动时，床单还很烫。所以它才在很短的时间里蓄够了所需的能量。"

    # game/script.rpy:63235
    old "That's wrong. It was due to a bed sheet that the world C group had obtained in world A. When it was brought to world B, they wrapped it around the Past Sekimeiya and world switched back to world C. However, the sheet remained around the Sekimeiya in world B.{w} When it powered back on, the sheet was still very hot. That's why it took a short time to reach the needed amount of energy."
    new "不对。那是因为 C世界那组人在 A世界拿到了一条床单。他们把床单带到 B世界，裹在 过去Sekimeiya 上，然后世界切换回 C世界。然而，那条床单留在了 B世界的 Sekimeiya 上。{w}当它重新启动时，床单还很烫。所以它才在很短的时间里蓄够了所需的能量。"

    # game/script.rpy:63245
    old "When Akaro and Sai escaped from the bedroom, Sai was forced to reveal the location of the Future Sekimeiya and was immediately knocked out."
    new "Akaro 和 Sai 从卧室逃出时，Sai 被迫说出了 未来Sekimeiya 的位置，随即被打晕。"

    # game/script.rpy:63250
    old "Isla A was there and heard it as well. Worried, she tried to get a response from the unconscious Sai, which only one person heard from the bedroom. Giving up, she went down in an attempt to prevent Akaro from damaging the Sekimeiya."
    new "Isla A 也在场，同样听到了。她放心不下，试着从昏迷的 Sai 那里得到回应，而卧室里只有一个人听见了这动静。她最终放弃，下楼去阻止 Akaro 破坏 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:63255
    old "She found it powered off in one of the hallway B crystal rooms; Akaro was already gone. She knew the event room cabinet was equipped with temperature regulation, so she carried it there."
    new "她发现它已停止运转，躺在 B走廊的一间水晶展室里；Akaro 早已不见踪影。她知道活动室的展示柜装有温控装置，便把它搬了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:63259
    old "But after that, on the floor of hallway A, she found a sheet covering yet another Sekimeiya."
    new "可在那之后，她在 A走廊的地板上发现一条床单，底下盖着另一个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:63260
    old "Confused, she felt its surface, instantly vanishing from that place with the sheet. Immediately, she found herself on November 24th."
    new "她满心疑惑，伸手摸了摸它的表面，随即连同床单一起从原地消失了。转眼之间，她已身处11月24日。"

    # game/script.rpy:63263
    old "Someone else disappeared as well: Akaro A.{w} The bedroom where everyone stayed was directly above the event room, so the range reached him. From a locked bedroom, he appeared in an unlocked prison cell. That was when a policeman outside the building suddenly appeared 21 days in the past."
    new "同时消失的还有另一个人：Akaro A。{w}大家住的卧室就在活动室正上方，所以他也被卷了进去。他从上锁的卧室，出现在没上锁的牢房里。也就在那时，楼外的一名警察突然穿越到了二十一天前。"

    # game/script.rpy:63271
    old "Sai woke up. He was near the elevator, so Isla's travel had missed him and the people in the upper level of the bedroom."
    new "Sai 醒了过来。他就在电梯附近，所以 Isla 的那次穿越没有波及他，也没有波及卧室上层的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:63275
    old "Disoriented, he walked to the event room and found out the others had left both Sekimeiya behind for him."
    new "他昏昏沉沉地走到活动室，发现其他人把两个 Sekimeiya 都留给了他。"

    # game/script.rpy:63276
    old "He still had to complete his plan: to get out of the bedroom, he had to travel to the past."
    new "他还得完成自己的计划：要想离开卧室，就必须穿越到过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:63281
    old "Once he was done, Sai had both Sekimeiya for himself. Eager to resolve the doubts he had, he brought them both to a room—B6."
    new "事情办妥之后，两个 Sekimeiya 都落到了 Sai 手里。他急于解开心中的疑问，便把两个都带进了一间房——B6。"

    # game/script.rpy:63282
    old "Unfortunately for him, he was only able to resolve his two major concerns before the world around him changed."
    new "可惜，他只来得及弄清两个最大的疑问，周围的世界就变了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63290
    old "When we left the bedroom... we quickly found out the third Sekimeiya had disappeared from Naomi's locker."
    new "我们离开卧室后……很快就发现，第三个 Sekimeiya 从 Naomi 的储物柜里不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63294
    old "Who the hell did that? There's no way it teleported out.{w} ...Did anyone else have the key after all?"
    new "到底是谁干的？它绝不可能自己传送出去。{w}……难道还有别人也有钥匙？"

    # game/script.rpy:63302
    old "Yes, it was Akaro A."
    new "没错，是 Akaro A 干的。"

    # game/script.rpy:63304
    old "It was Akaro A."
    new "是 Akaro A。"

    # game/script.rpy:63306
    old "You might remember he world switched while he was in the staff room, and he had Naomi A's keys."
    new "你或许还记得，他在员工室的时候发生了世界切换，而他当时带着 Naomi A 的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:63307
    old "While he waited in room B4, he wondered if he had access to that locker, and when he went to confirm it, he saw someone had hidden a Sekimeiya there."
    new "他在 B4 房间等候时，心想自己能不能打开那个储物柜，便去确认，结果发现有人在那里藏了一个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:63308
    old "Mystified, he took it out with no comprehension that he was no longer in his own world."
    new "他大惑不解，把它取了出来，全然不知自己已经不在原来的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:63314
    old "...I wonder who it was. Maybe Sai, somehow."
    new "……会是谁呢。也许，是 Sai 用了什么办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:63318
    old "After that, Shiroya and I found a Sekimeiya on the floor of a hallway B room, B6."
    new "在那之后，我和 Shiroya 在 B走廊的 B6房间地板上发现了一个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:63324
    old "When we touched it, I'm pretty sure we went to the future..."
    new "我们一碰到它，我敢肯定，我们去了未来……"

    # game/script.rpy:63327
    old "We appeared where we'd been ten minutes before, so we went ten minutes to the future."
    new "我们出现在十分钟前所在的位置，也就是说，我们穿越到了十分钟后的未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:63330
    old "We thought we'd gone to the very recent past because the footprints we'd just left looked recent. Since we went shortly into the future, that didn't change."
    new "我们以为自己是回到了很近的过去，因为我们刚留下的脚印看起来还很新。既然只是穿越到稍后的未来，这一点自然没有变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:63333
    old "And then, we concluded we'd gone five minutes to the past because we thought that we'd taken the elevator and caused the trip we heard before traveling. Instead, someone else used it from the attic after we left the bedroom..."
    new "接着，我们又断定自己回到了五分钟前，因为我们以为乘电梯的是自己，穿越前听到的响动正是我们造成的。可实际上，那是别人在我们离开卧室之后从阁楼用了电梯……"

    # game/script.rpy:63337
    old "On the crystal floor, we went to the lobby because our past selves hadn't gone there. Who did we hear if not ourselves? There was someone moving through the hallways."
    new "在水晶层，我们去了大堂，因为过去的我们并没有去过那里。若不是我们自己，那听到的究竟是谁？当时有人在走廊里走动。"

    # game/script.rpy:63338
    old "\"We heard an indistinct sound coming from hallway A, made by a door.\""
    new "A走廊那边传来一阵模糊的响动，是门发出的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:63340
    old "\"We waited, and seconds later, the same sound came from hallway B. Unmistakably, a closing door had created it.\""
    new "我们等着，几秒之后，B走廊也传来同样的声音。毫无疑问，那是门被关上的响动。"

    # game/script.rpy:63347
    old "There aren't many people I can think of. Sai, Erina, Katei, and maybe the other Shiroya..."
    new "我能想到的人不多。Sai、Erina、Katei，也许还有另一个 Shiroya……"

    # game/script.rpy:63348
    old "But given the movements, I might know who it was..."
    new "但从行动路线来看，我或许能猜到那是谁……"

    # game/script.rpy:63349
    old "And that Shiroya... How the hell did she get there...!?"
    new "可那个 Shiroya……她到底是怎么到那里的……！？"

    # game/script.rpy:63350
    old "Was she the Shiroya from this morning? Did she appear in the attic with Naomi and spend the whole day in the tower?"
    new "她就是今早那个 Shiroya 吗？她和 Naomi 一起出现在阁楼，然后在塔里待了整整一天？"

    # game/script.rpy:63351
    old "It can't be. We would've seen her, and what the hell was the deal with her clothes!? Or anything that she said!"
    new "不可能。那样的话我们应该会看见她。而且她那身衣服到底是怎么回事！？还有她说的那些话！"

    # game/script.rpy:63352
    old "She was the same Shiroya I'd been with. She remembered what we'd done. ...That's all I get."
    new "她就是我认识的那个 Shiroya。她记得我们做过的事。……我能确定的只有这些。"

    # game/script.rpy:63357
    old "When we returned to room B6, the Sekimeiya we used wasn't there. Since we'd gone to the future, someone had time to take it away."
    new "我们回到 B6房间时，用过的那个 Sekimeiya 已经不见了。既然我们去了未来，就有人趁这段时间把它拿走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63360
    old "Instead, we found one in a cabinet drawer. It was considerably hot, so it was there for a long time."
    new "结果，我们在展示柜的抽屉里找到了一个。它还相当烫，看来已经在那里放了很久。"

    # game/script.rpy:63365
    old "But we decided not to activate it and brought it to its cabinet."
    new "但我们决定不启动它，把它送回了展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:63374
    old "If they had touched it, though, what would've happened? It has been a while since you asked for that."
    new "不过，如果他们碰了它，会发生什么？你问起这件事，已经过了好一阵子了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63375
    old "Atsuki would've gone many hours back in time. The lights would not yet have turned on, and he would've found himself in the lobby."
    new "Atsuki 会被送回好几个小时之前。那时灯还没亮，他会发现自己身处大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:63376
    old "You remember, right? He spent a long time in the staff room. Eventually, after the light was turned on in the morning, he was killed by Ido, who had the suitcase ready to prepare the attack."
    new "你记得吧？他在员工室里待了很久。最后，早晨灯亮之后，他被 Ido 杀害了；Ido 早已备好手提箱，准备发动袭击。"

    # game/script.rpy:63377
    old "Before his eyesight failed, Atsuki saw four people he recognized."
    new "在视力丧失之前，Atsuki 看见了四个他认识的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:63385
    old "\"Two men, a woman, and a girl.\""
    new "「两个男人、一个女人，还有一个女孩。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63386
    old "One was Shiroya. She was naturally encompassed by the range when Atsuki touched the Sekimeiya.{w} However, she didn't appear in the lobby with him. Strangely, she appeared in a bathroom on the crystal floor, and when she left, she was seen from the security room and addressed through the microphone."
    new "其中一人是 Shiroya。Atsuki 触碰 Sekimeiya 时，她自然也被纳入了范围。{w} 然而，她并没有和他一起出现在大厅。奇怪的是，她出现在水晶层的一间洗手间里；她出来之后，有人在监控室看见她，用麦克风对她喊话。"

    # game/script.rpy:63388
    old "Atsuki recognized Ido and Suripo as well: he had seen both of them during the long wait before the event."
    new "Atsuki 也认出了 Ido 和 Suripo：在活动开始前那段漫长的等待里，他见过这两人。"

    # game/script.rpy:63389
    old "The last person was Erina. She had been alive in room B4 next to Atsuki and Shiroya and appeared in the mechanical room."
    new "最后一个人是 Erina。她原本在 Atsuki 和 Shiroya 隔壁的 B4房间里，之后出现在了机械室。"

    # game/script.rpy:63390
    old "However, she had been unconscious. Therefore, despite appearing in the past, she took a while to awaken."
    new "不过，她当时还在昏迷。所以，尽管人已经出现在过去，她还是过了好一会儿才醒来。"

    # game/script.rpy:63396
    old "Two impossibilities prevented this from happening. One was the butterfly effect."
    new "有两个不可能的因素，让这件事没能发生。其一是蝴蝶效应。"

    # game/script.rpy:63401
    old "Precisely. Atsuki died."
    new "正是如此。Atsuki 死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63403
    old "There should've been a world switch, but this is tied to the butterfly effect. After all, the Future Sekimeiya was between another Shiroya's hands, and that version of Shiroya couldn't have existed if they had gone to the past."
    new "本来应该发生世界切换，但这与蝴蝶效应相关。毕竟，未来Sekimeiya在另一个 Shiroya 手里，而如果他们去了过去，那个 Shiroya 就不可能存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:63405
    old "Shiroya could have existed, but not Atsuki. That is because he died."
    new "Shiroya 可能还存在，Atsuki 却不可能——因为他死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63406
    old "Perhaps that problem helped you figure out the Sekimeiya's mechanics. Because Atsuki died, he could never have appeared in the lobby—he wouldn't have been there in the future."
    new "也许正是这个问题让你弄清了 Sekimeiya 的机制。Atsuki 既然死了，就不可能出现在大厅——未来也不会有他。"

    # game/script.rpy:63407
    old "However, there's something to recognize: he had a wound on his right hand, and in the darkness, he saw that he had a key shaped like the one for Naomi's locker. ...It was Ido's instead, though; his appearing location was where he would've ended up traveling to the future in a chain of travels."
    new "不过，有一点值得注意：他右手上有伤，而且在黑暗中，他发现自己拿着一把钥匙，形状和 Naomi 储物柜的钥匙一样。……但那其实是 Ido 的；他出现的位置，正是他在连锁传送中前往未来时会落脚的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:63418
    old "...That was when we found Katei dead in the security room."
    new "……就是在那个时候，我们发现 Katei 死在监控室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:63428
    old "When Katei walked out of the bedroom, Erina followed close behind.{w} She didn't believe Atsuki and Shiroya had killed Isla. ...Sai and Akaro had been with her the entire time."
    new "Katei 走出卧室时，Erina 紧跟在后。{w} 她不相信是 Atsuki 和 Shiroya 杀了 Isla。……毕竟 Sai 和 Akaro 一直和她在一起。"

    # game/script.rpy:63431
    old "However, Katei had been missing during that time, and he hadn't explained himself.{w} She didn't trust him at all; he'd been lying all day. ...He had faked going to the bathroom to take advantage of Isla's death."
    new "然而，那段时间 Katei 一直不见踪影，也从没解释过自己的去向。{w} 她完全无法信任他；他整天都在撒谎。……他借口去洗手间，正是为了利用 Isla 的死。"

    # game/script.rpy:63438
    old "On the lowest floor, when Erina uttered his name, he turned around slowly."
    new "在最底层，Erina 叫出他的名字时，他缓缓转过身。"

    # game/script.rpy:63443
    old "A single question was asked. \"Where were you when we couldn't find you?\""
    new "她只问了一句：「我们找不到你的时候，你在哪里？」"

    # game/script.rpy:63444
    old "Katei realized the meaning behind that. Erina suspected him of causing Isla's death.{w} He sighed quietly and then spoke."
    new "Katei 明白这句话背后的意思。Erina 怀疑 Isla 的死是他造成的。{w} 他轻轻叹了口气，然后开口。"

    # game/script.rpy:63449
    old "I don't know exactly. When I was walking behind Sai, I suddenly appeared in the attic."
    new "我不清楚具体是怎么回事。我走在 Sai 后面的时候，突然就出现在了阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:63455
    old "It's the truth. It likely happened when Shiroya and Atsuki touched the Sekimeiya, remember?"
    new "这是真的。大概就是 Shiroya 和 Atsuki 触碰 Sekimeiya 的时候发生的，你还记得吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:63456
    old "Why didn't you say this before!? And that doesn't tell me anything! Why didn't we find you!?"
    new "你之前为什么不说！？这根本说明不了什么！我们为什么没找到你！？"

    # game/script.rpy:63461
    old "Katei stared into Erina's eyes. Her voice had never sounded so harsh."
    new "Katei 直视着 Erina 的眼睛。她的声音从未如此尖锐。"

    # game/script.rpy:63464
    old "I said I experienced the teleportation, and I am telling you the truth. I was beyond confused when I appeared there.{w} When I came down, the three of you were in the lobby."
    new "我说过，我经历了传送，我说的都是实话。我出现在那里时，完全不知所措。{w} 我下楼时，你们三个人都在大厅里。"

    # game/script.rpy:63465
    old "Although Erina wavered, she quickly dismissed Katei's claim as nonsense."
    new "Erina 虽然有过片刻动摇，但很快就把 Katei 的话斥为无稽之谈。"

    # game/script.rpy:63470
    old "You're not even making sense! You were hiding in the storeroom, weren't you?"
    new "你这话根本说不通！你就是躲在储藏室里，对不对？"

    # game/script.rpy:63475
    old "What? No! There are cameras in hallway C. What I'm saying will be proven."
    new "什么？没有！C走廊里有摄像头。我说的话会得到证实。"

    # game/script.rpy:63480
    old "...I don't believe it. The cameras aren't recording."
    new "……我不信。摄像头根本没有在录像。"

    # game/script.rpy:63485
    old "Yes they are! Don't you see the light!?"
    new "在录！你没看见指示灯吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:63487
    old "Katei saw nothing but hostility in Erina's face. Enough to appear as a threat.{w} Did she really think he had killed Isla? He didn't know anything about what had happened to her, but there was a way he could prove his innocence."
    new "Katei 在 Erina 脸上只看到敌意，那几乎已经算是一种威胁。{w} 她真的以为是他杀了 Isla 吗？他对 Isla 的遭遇一无所知，不过，他有一个办法能证明自己的清白。"

    # game/script.rpy:63490
    old "...You still haven't explained anything. Why didn't you say this earlier, and why didn't we find you?"
    new "……你还是什么都没解释清楚。为什么之前不说？我们又为什么没找到你？"

    # game/script.rpy:63491
    old "Erina had no idea what to believe. No one else could've harmed Isla, but who would have? Why would anyone have done that to her daughter? Part of her wanted to abandon everything and just stop thinking altogether, placidly waiting the month it would take her daughter to return."
    new "Erina 不知道该相信什么。除了他，没人能伤害 Isla——可那又会是谁？谁会那样对待她的女儿？她心底有一部分想抛下一切，索性什么都不再想，就这样平静地等上一个月，等女儿回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:63496
    old "...I'm not lying. Maybe I can prove myself."
    new "……我没有撒谎。也许我能证明自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:63499
    old "Katei started walking to the security room, gesturing at Erina to come with him."
    new "Katei 朝监控室走去，示意 Erina 跟上。"

    # game/script.rpy:63509
    old "It has been a long time since I've checked. Perhaps the security system is working again, just like what happened to the computer."
    new "我很久没检查过了。也许监控系统又恢复了，就像那台电脑一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:63512
    old "In silence, Katei kneeled under the desk while Erina watched expectantly."
    new "Katei 一言不发地跪到桌下，Erina 满怀期待地看着他。"

    # game/script.rpy:63513
    old "Again, there doesn't seem to be anything wrong with this."
    new "这一次，看上去同样没什么问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:63518
    old "As he stood up, he nonchalantly took a rusty key out of his pocket and left it in a drawer."
    new "他站起身，若无其事地从口袋里取出那把生锈的钥匙，随手搁进了抽屉。"

    # game/script.rpy:63519
    old "This time, I won't forget to keep it somewhere safer."
    new "这次我不会忘记把它放到更安全的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:63524
    old "...Katei sat on his chair and started up the three screens. As Erina stepped forward, he pressed the \"archived footage\" button."
    new "……Katei 在椅子上坐下，启动了三块屏幕。Erina 上前一步时，他按下了「存档录像」的按钮。"

    # game/script.rpy:63530
    old "O-Oh! I-It's working!"
    new "哦、噢！能、能用了！"

    # game/script.rpy:63531
    old "A list of cameras appeared on the screen. Erina read them without so much as a twitch."
    new "屏幕上出现了一列摄像头编号。Erina 逐一扫过，连眉头都没动一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:63534
    old "Look! I'll show you that I was telling the truth!"
    new "看！我这就证明给你看，我说的都是真话！"

    # game/script.rpy:63535
    old "When Katei selected one, a video of hallway C came up, mainly focusing on the bathrooms. Frustrated, Katei used the time bar to skip ahead."
    new "Katei 选中其中一个，C走廊的录像随即播出，镜头主要对着洗手间一带。Katei 有些不耐烦，拖动时间条往后快进。"

    # game/script.rpy:63541
    old "Here! I'm about to disappear!"
    new "就这儿！我马上就要消失了！"

    # game/script.rpy:63542
    old "Coming from hallway B, Sai stepped into C. Katei followed behind, and out of nowhere, his body vanished."
    new "Sai 从B走廊走进C走廊，Katei 跟在后面，忽然之间，他的身体凭空消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63547
    old "See! That's when I appeared in the attic!"
    new "瞧见没！就是那时候，我在阁楼里出现了！"

    # game/script.rpy:63548
    old "After he selected another camera and fast-forwarded further, Katei appeared from the second floor and entered hallway A."
    new "他选了另一个摄像头，又往后快进了一段——Katei 从二楼走出，进了A走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:63553
    old "Just like I said, I wasn't here when she disappeared! I have no idea what happened to her, but I didn't lie!"
    new "就像我说的，她消失的时候我根本不在这儿！她出了什么事我完全不知道，可我没撒谎！"

    # game/script.rpy:63561
    old "...Did you kill Naomi?"
    new "……Naomi 是你杀的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:63566
    old "Huh? Of course I didn't!"
    new "啊？当然不是我！"

    # game/script.rpy:63567
    old "Show me what happened."
    new "把当时的经过放给我看。"

    # game/script.rpy:63572
    old "...{w}After a brief pause, Katei moved the cursor to a different camera.{w} He was calm. He knew very little incriminating footage was located in those folders."
    new "……{w}短暂停顿后，Katei 把光标移到了另一个摄像头上。{w}他很镇定。那些文件夹里几乎没有对他不利的录像，这一点他再清楚不过。"

    # game/script.rpy:63578
    old "Once he clicked on room B4's camera, a message appeared on the screen.{w} \"{time=10:04}: Camera(s) disabled and associated footage erased\"."
    new "他刚点开 B4房间的摄像头，屏幕上就弹出一行字。{w}「{time=10:04}：摄像头已停用，相关录像已删除」。"

    # game/script.rpy:63583
    old "Wh-What!?{w} The killer erased it! H-How!?"
    new "什、什么！？{w}是凶手删掉的！他、他怎么办到的！？"

    # game/script.rpy:63588
    old "...{w}{time=10:04}? Isn't that when we left you here?"
    new "……{w}{time=10:04}？那不就是我们把你留在这儿的时候吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:63589
    old "Huh? It might be, but why does that matter!? The system wasn't working for me at the time!"
    new "啊？也许是吧，可那又能说明什么！？那时候系统对我根本用不了！"

    # game/script.rpy:63595
    old "You killed Naomi, right?"
    new "Naomi 是你杀的，对吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:63601
    old "Katei hung his head. He'd failed to remember the deletion time would be displayed."
    new "Katei 垂下了头。他忘了，删除时间会被显示出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:63604
    old "...I would never kill a person."
    new "……我绝不会杀人。"

    # game/script.rpy:63605
    old "You d-did. And not only Naomi, right?"
    new "你、你就是杀了她。而且不止 Naomi 一个，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:63610
    old "You're wrong! I promise I didn't do anything!"
    new "你错了！我发誓，我什么都没做！"

    # game/script.rpy:63611
    old "Katei's excuses were poor; he wasn't trying anymore. Even if he convinced Erina, he was done for, as the deletion time pointed straight at him."
    new "Katei 的辩解苍白无力，他也不再费心。就算说动了 Erina，他也完了——删除时间明明白白指着他。"

    # game/script.rpy:63612
    old "His mind was someplace else entirely. He couldn't let that message be seen."
    new "他的心思早已飘到了别处。那行字，绝不能让她们看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:63613
    old "He had already ended someone's life for his own sake. If he was quick, he could get himself out of there. ...And there were many more suspects than the first time."
    new "为了自己，他已经夺走了一条人命。只要动作够快，他就能从这里脱身。……何况这一次，嫌疑人比上次多得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:63616
    old "Katei turned around, ready to deliver a sudden blow, but he didn't expect the one that came first."
    new "Katei 转过身，准备冷不防地出手，却没想到先挨打的反而是自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:63625
    old "After a sharp collapse, Katei's body was on the floor, splashed with its own blood."
    new "Katei 猛地倒下，身体摔在地板上，溅满了自己的血。"

    # game/script.rpy:63626
    old "Next to him was Erina. Katei's fist had contacted her head, and she had also fallen on top of the blood."
    new "他身旁是 Erina。Katei 那一拳正中她的头，她也倒在了那摊血上。"

    # game/script.rpy:63630
    old "Only one of them was alive."
    new "两人之中，只有一个还活着。"

    # game/script.rpy:63635
    old "Erina suddenly awakened and saw Katei's blurry outline."
    new "Erina 猛然醒转，眼前是 Katei 模糊的轮廓。"

    # game/script.rpy:63636
    old "She had killed him. She remembered what had happened. However, she could hardly keep herself steady."
    new "她杀了他。她记得发生了什么。可她几乎站都站不稳。"

    # game/script.rpy:63637
    old "She was unable to tell how much time had passed. The seconds had suddenly cut off for her, but she had to get out of there. Once she was able to stand, she walked to the door."
    new "她说不清究竟过了多久。她的时间感骤然中断了，但她必须离开这里。等能站起来后，她便朝门口走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:63647
    old "She couldn't see anyone in the hallway, but the end was a bright blob. Suddenly, she felt the need to go somewhere."
    new "走廊里看不到人影，尽头只有一团亮光。她突然觉得自己需要去某个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:63650
    old "She approached the event room. Inside, a single drop of Katei's blood dripped off her."
    new "她走到活动室。室内，一滴 Katei 的血从她身上落下。"

    # game/script.rpy:63653
    old "Paying it no mind, she slowly walked out through the other door."
    new "她没有在意，从另一扇门慢慢走了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:63660
    old "She walked in a straight line. Then, beyond a door, she saw a body beneath a curtain."
    new "她笔直地走着。随后，在一扇门后，她看见遮布底下躺着一具尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:63661
    old "She had... avenged her. Naomi could at least rest in peace."
    new "她总算……替她报了仇。Naomi 至少可以安息了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63664
    old "Someone closed the door behind her, but she didn't hear it. ...Only two other people did, and they mistook it as their own action."
    new "有人在她身后关上了门，她没有听见。……听见的只有另外两人，而他们都以为那是自己关的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:63674
    old "...I think I can imagine what happened.{w} We then found Erina's body, but she was still alive, and after we were in the event room for a while, the other Shiroya woke me up."
    new "……我大概能想象出经过。{w}之后我们发现了 Erina，但她还活着；我们在活动室待了一阵，另一个 Shiroya 把我叫醒了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63678
    old "Why the hell was she there? And why did we not find her before? Did she avoid the searches with the Sekimeiya, knowing all of them were coming?"
    new "她到底为什么会出现在那种地方？我们之前为什么没找到她？难道她早就知道所有人都会来搜，靠着 Sekimeiya 躲了过去？"

    # game/script.rpy:63679
    old "She really must have been the Shiroya who disappeared with Naomi..."
    new "她果然就是和 Naomi 一起消失的那个 Shiroya……"

    # game/script.rpy:63685
    old "We couldn't find her, but suddenly, Sai attacked us.{w} I don't get that either...! Why did he want to kill us, and where did he even get that knife from!?"
    new "我们没找到她，Sai 却突然袭击了我们。{w}这一点我也想不通……！他为什么想杀我们？那把刀又是从哪儿来的！？"

    # game/script.rpy:63693
    old "What the fuck did that even mean?"
    new "那话到底他妈是什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:63699
    old "Before that point, he seemed to slow down when it became clear that I didn't know why he was chasing us. ...He snapped out of it suddenly, though."
    new "在那之前，当他发现我根本不知道他为什么追我们时，他的脚步似乎慢了下来。……不过，他很快就猛地回过神来。"

    # game/script.rpy:63708
    old "\"Pensively, Sai glanced around the room. Suddenly, in visible shock, his whole body went one step backward.\""
    new "「Sai 若有所思地环顾房间。忽然，他像是受了什么惊吓，整个人向后退了一步。」"

    # game/script.rpy:63709
    old "Sai saw the security camera behind Atsuki."
    new "Sai 看见了 Atsuki 身后的监控摄像头。"

    # game/script.rpy:63710
    old "Earlier, Sai had experienced his first world switch. It was Atsuki A who he thought he'd been chasing."
    new "先前，Sai 经历了第一次世界切换。他本以为自己追的人是 Atsuki A。"

    # game/script.rpy:63711
    old "He realized Atsuki B didn't seem to know what had occurred and that he hadn't been crying, but it was the camera's green light that stopped him, as it otherwise would've been possible for that Atsuki to be a future version of the one who'd punched him.{w} In world A, Sai had noticed the green lights were gone; the cameras hadn't been recording. When he unknowingly returned to world B, he even saw the message on the computer that matched with the lack of green lights."
    new "他意识到，Atsuki B 似乎并不知道发生了什么，而且也没有哭过；但真正让他停下的是摄像头的绿灯——否则，那个 Atsuki 也可能是打过他的那个人的未来版本。{w}在 A世界，Sai 注意到绿灯已经熄灭，摄像头并没有在录像。后来他在不知不觉中回到 B世界时，甚至看到了电脑上的那条消息，正好与绿灯熄灭的情况吻合。"

    # game/script.rpy:63712
    old "However, when he saw the green light again, he understood he'd been recorded chasing behind Atsuki and Shiroya with a knife. If he killed them, he would be the culprit."
    new "然而，当他再次看到绿灯时，他明白了：自己拿着刀追赶 Atsuki 和 Shiroya 的样子已经被录了下来。如果他杀了他们，他就是凶手。"

    # game/script.rpy:63713
    old "Sai didn't believe that footage would see the light of the day, but he couldn't risk his own life. As a result, he abandoned all intentions to use his knife as soon as that green light entered his eyes."
    new "Sai 不相信那段录像会有重见天日的一天，但他不能拿自己的命去赌。因此，那道绿灯一映入眼中，他就彻底放弃了动刀的念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:63718
    old "Sai began to think about what he'd experienced. The Sekimeiya had disappeared from room B6, where Atsuki and Shiroya had found one..."
    new "Sai 开始回想自己的经历。Sekimeiya 是从 B6房间消失的，Atsuki 和 Shiroya 正是在那里找到了一个……"

    # game/script.rpy:63719
    old "They hadn't known yet that two existed: they thought the Sekimeiya had teleported to a drawer, meaning they might've missed that the Future Sekimeiya was still in that room."
    new "他们当时还不知道存在两个：他们以为 Sekimeiya 是传送到了某个抽屉里，因此很可能没有注意到未来Sekimeiya 仍留在那个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:63726
    old "Atsuki looked through every room in the hallway B and didn't find it after Sai had evaded detection there. He thought he could simply go twenty minutes back and obtain it before Atsuki's inspection, like he'd planned before dashing out of the event room."
    new "Sai 在 B走廊躲过搜查后，Atsuki 把 B走廊的每个房间都找了一遍，却没有找到。Sai 以为自己只要回到二十分钟前，赶在 Atsuki 检查之前拿到它就行——这本来就是他冲出活动室之前盘算好的计划。"

    # game/script.rpy:63727
    old "But... what had he experienced? Where was the Atsuki who'd been crying in the attic?"
    new "可是……他经历过的那些究竟是什么？那个在阁楼里哭泣的 Atsuki 又去了哪里？"

    # game/script.rpy:63728
    old "Sai had seen a dead body in the lobby near a pool of blood: Shiroya's.{w} Why was it not there anymore? Why had the pool of blood diminished?"
    new "Sai 曾在大厅里看见 Shiroya 的尸体倒在血泊旁。{w}为什么尸体现在不见了？为什么血泊也变少了？"

    # game/script.rpy:63729
    old "He didn't know, but he'd seen Shiroya dead. Her fate had to be death, but Sai couldn't explain the body's disappearance yet."
    new "他不知道原因，但他确实看见 Shiroya 死了。她注定会死，可 Sai 还无法解释尸体为何消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:63730
    old "She would end up dead... Someone would kill Shiroya. Sai just had to work out the structure of events."
    new "她最终会死……有人会杀死 Shiroya。Sai 只需要理清事件的脉络。"

    # game/script.rpy:63743
    old "He ran away and managed to hide in hallway B. I'm not sure what he did, but when he unlocked the cabinet, we spoke to him for a while. ...He was pretty confident that Shiroya would die and that the blood in the lobby was hers."
    new "他逃走了，设法躲进 B走廊。我不清楚他做了什么，但他打开展示柜后，我们和他说了一会儿话。……他很确信 Shiroya 会死，大厅里的血也是她的。"

    # game/script.rpy:63744
    old "...And that's when he and Shiroya disappeared from the event room."
    new "……也就在这时，他和 Shiroya 从活动室里消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63756
    old "...Because it would've sent him to the future. He wanted to go to the past, and he knew the Sekimeiya in the cabinet was what he needed."
    new "……因为那一个会把他送到未来。他想去的是过去，而他知道展示柜里的那个 Sekimeiya 才是他需要的。"

    # game/script.rpy:63757
    old "When he touched it, he and Shiroya appeared in the attic, which was inaccessible for me.{w} I'm not sure what happened there, but Shiroya told me Sai locked her in a bedroom."
    new "他一碰到它，就和 Shiroya 一起出现在了我进不去的阁楼里。{w}我不清楚那里发生了什么，但 Shiroya 告诉我，Sai 把她锁在了一间卧室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:63762
    old "On the crystal floor, I was able to open another locker..."
    new "在水晶层，我得以打开另一个储物柜……"

    # game/script.rpy:63763
    old "Why did I find its key in the cleaning room? Why didn't we find it before that point?"
    new "为什么我会在清洁间找到它的钥匙？为什么在那之前，我们始终没找到？"

    # game/script.rpy:63767
    old "It should've been noticed plenty of times, when people were looking for the Sekimeiya. Maybe you realized that Akaro always went out of his way to look at that room before the cart disappeared."
    new "在人们寻找 Sekimeiya 的时候，它本该被注意到很多次。也许你早就发现，Akaro 总会在推车消失前特意去看那个房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:63772
    old "...From the staff room, I used the Sekimeiya and appeared twenty minutes in the past, in the event room. I used that time to search through the upper floors, but I had locked myself out of the attic.{w} I ended up in the security room without finding anyone, but Erina had to be somewhere, likely with Miiya..."
    new "……我从员工室使用了 Sekimeiya，出现在二十分钟前的活动室。我利用那段时间搜遍了楼上几层，却把自己锁在了阁楼外。{w}最后我到了监控室，谁也没找到；但 Erina 一定在某个地方，很可能和 Miiya 在一起……"

    # game/script.rpy:63773
    old "Many questions were eclipsed by a much bigger one: the note that I'd found on the floor of the staff room."
    new "我在员工室地板上捡到的那张纸条，让其他许多疑问都显得次要了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63774
    old "I touched the Sekimeiya and went twenty minutes to the past. Then, when I returned to the staff room, I found that note. It's very likely it fell from my pocket when I sat on the floor."
    new "我碰了 Sekimeiya，回到了二十分钟前。后来我回到员工室时，发现了那张纸条。很可能是我坐在地上时从口袋里掉出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:63775
    old "I never wrote it. What the fuck was it doing in my pocket? I don't believe anyone else left it on the floor.{w} Wait, no. This doesn't even make sense.{w} Nobody could've put it in my pocket, so what I must assume is that I appeared with it when I traveled to the past."
    new "我从没写过它。它他妈怎么会在我口袋里？我不相信是别人把它丢在地上的。{w}等等，不对。这根本说不通。{w}没人能把它塞进我的口袋，所以我只能认为，是我回到过去时把它一起带过去的。"

    # game/script.rpy:63776
    old "From the staff room, I traveled and appeared in the event room. That makes sense—forty minutes later, we were all there when Erina was about to activate the Sekimeiya."
    new "我从员工室穿越，出现在了活动室。这说得通——四十分钟后，我们所有人都在那里，而 Erina 正要启动 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:63784
    old "\"Still sounding groggy, she traced my gaze up to her purse and took out a small piece of paper.\""
    new "她声音仍有些昏沉，顺着我的视线看向自己的手袋，取出一张小纸片。"

    # game/script.rpy:63794
    old "\"She handed it to me, and I snatched it away, gripping it tightly. My hands started trembling as soon as I glanced at the words again and saw those familiar letters.\""
    new "她把它递给我，我一把夺过，紧紧攥住。我再次瞥见上面的字，认出那些熟悉的字迹时，手立刻抖了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:63795
    old "Erina found the note I threw away. When I took it, I immediately put it in my pocket so that the others wouldn't see it. That's why I appeared with it in the event room forty minutes earlier..."
    new "Erina 捡到了我丢掉的那张纸条。我接过它后，立刻塞进口袋，免得被其他人看见。所以四十分钟前，我才会带着它出现在活动室……"

    # game/script.rpy:63796
    old "However, this is illogical. Where is its origin?{w} I appeared with it and I threw it away. Then, Erina found it and gave it to me, which is why I appeared with it. ...It doesn't have a beginning."
    new "可是，这不合逻辑。它的起点在哪里？{w}我带着它出现，又把它丢掉。然后 Erina 捡到它，交给我，所以我才带着它出现。……它根本没有开端。"

    # game/script.rpy:63797
    old "I must have something backward. Otherwise, it doesn't make any sense."
    new "我一定是哪里想反了。否则，这根本说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:63806
    old "Hm... I assumed Erina found the note where I'd discarded it, behind the handrail in hallway B.{w} But she only said \"I found this just now.\""
    new "嗯……我以为 Erina 是在我丢掉纸条的地方——B走廊的栏杆后面——捡到它的。{w}可她只说了「这是我刚才找到的」。"

    # game/script.rpy:63807
    old "If she found it somewhere else, it makes sense. She gave it to me and I gripped it tightly, which is why I appeared with it in the past and saw it roughly folded. Then, I left it behind the handrail, and it remained there."
    new "如果她是在别处找到的，那就说得通了。她把它交给我，我紧紧攥住，所以回到过去时它才会跟着我出现，而我看到它时，它是被草草折过的。后来我把它留在栏杆后面，它就一直留在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:63808
    old "Maybe this is it. After all, there's only one explanation behind that note—it came from another world."
    new "也许就是这样。毕竟，那张纸条只有一个解释——它来自另一个世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:63809
    old "...And Erina told us what happened right before that point. She met Miiya."
    new "……而 Erina 告诉了我们那之前不久发生的事。她遇见了 Miiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:63810
    old "Could Miiya have had that note...? Did I really write it in another world?"
    new "那张纸条会不会在 Miiya 手上……？难道真是我在另一个世界写下的？"

    # game/script.rpy:63811
    old "Why was she there, and where did she go?"
    new "她为什么会在那里？后来又去了哪里？"

    # game/script.rpy:63812
    old "I put my hand in my pocket, but the note wasn't there. It had disappeared at some point."
    new "我把手伸进口袋，纸条却不在里面。不知什么时候，它已经消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63813
    old "Right. The next time I traveled to the past, I didn't appear with it.{w} But... why? I should have."
    new "对了。下一次我回到过去时，它没有跟着我出现。{w}可是……为什么？明明应该跟着的。"

    # game/script.rpy:63815
    old "Although that was what it seemed like, concluding why it had vanished was relatively simple."
    new "虽然看起来是那样，但它为什么会消失，其实并不难想明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:63818
    old "Oh, it's like I thought earlier. I had the note when I traveled to the past. From the staff room, I appeared in hallway B and then slammed the storeroom door to create a new noise. After that, I waited in the bathroom on the second floor.{w} There, I put my hand in my pocket because I wanted to flush the note away. However, it wasn't there.{w} That's why I didn't appear with it. I wanted to flush it away, so if I had, I wouldn't have held the note in the future, and I never could've appeared with it."
    new "哦，就像我之前想的那样。我回到过去时，身上带着那张纸条。我从员工室出发，出现在 B走廊，然后用力摔上储藏室的门，制造出新的响声。之后，我在二楼的洗手间里等着。{w}在那里，我把手伸进口袋，因为我想把纸条冲掉。可是它不在。{w}所以它才没有跟着我出现。我想把它冲掉；要是我真那么做了，未来的我手上就不会有那张纸条，我也就不可能带着它出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:63819
    old "These details... I wonder how many I missed.{w} Now that I think about it, something similar happened that very same travel.{w} When I touched the Sekimeiya, I had the locker key in my hand. However, when I returned to the staff room with Shiroya, I had it in my pocket. I still appeared with it in the past, but it was in my pocket."
    new "这些细节……不知道我漏掉了多少。{w}现在回想起来，就在那一次穿越里，也发生过类似的事。{w}我碰到 Sekimeiya 时，手里拿着储物柜钥匙。可是当我和 Shiroya 回到员工室时，钥匙却在我的口袋里。我回到过去时仍然带着它，只不过它是在口袋里。"

    # game/script.rpy:63820
    old "...That's because if I'd appeared with it in my hand, I would've then put it in my pocket. That redundant action was canceled, and I simply appeared with it already inside.{w} Along the same line of thought, I didn't go to the bathroom many times, did I? I didn't feel the need to.{w} Maybe that happened due to my travels—if I'd felt that urge upon going back, I would've gone to the bathroom. Then, in the replicated location, that wouldn't have been needed anymore. My bladder just automatically emptied without me noticing."
    new "……因为如果我出现时手里拿着它，之后也会把它放进口袋。结果那个多余的动作没有发生，我出现时它已经在口袋里。{w}同理，我去洗手间的次数其实并不多，对吧？因为我并不觉得有必要。{w}也许这是穿越造成的——如果我在回去时产生了那种冲动，我就会去洗手间。而在复制出的地点，也就不再需要去了。我的膀胱只是在我没注意时自行排空了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63824
    old "...There certainly are mysteries I still can't solve. Maybe I can, but I'm failing to do so."
    new "……确实还有一些我解不开的谜。也许我解得开，只是没能做到。"

    # game/script.rpy:63825
    old "Miiya's existence, Shiroya's..."
    new "Miiya 的存在，Shiroya 的……"

    # game/script.rpy:63833
    old "In the event room, when Erina activated the Sekimeiya, the world around us changed, and Sai was the only one to travel through time."
    new "在活动室里，Erina 启动 Sekimeiya 的那一刻，周围的世界随之改变，而穿越时间的只有 Sai 一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:63842
    old "Atsuki had hidden the Past Sekimeiya in Ido's locker, so Sai went to the future."
    new "Atsuki 把 过去Sekimeiya 藏进了 Ido 的储物柜，所以 Sai 去了未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:63843
    old "He had just been in the attic's bedroom, so he reappeared there with Shiroya. That is how he unintentionally locked himself in that room."
    new "他之前就在阁楼的卧室里，于是便和 Shiroya 一同在那里现身。就这样，他无意间把自己锁进了那间屋子。"

    # game/script.rpy:63852
    old "When that happened, Shiroya was with us, but her clothes were different... She had appeared before me when I'd cried her name..."
    new "当时，Shiroya 虽然和我们在一起，但衣服却不同……我喊出她名字的时候，她就那样出现在我眼前……"

    # game/script.rpy:63853
    old "That was the real Shiroya, but what happened to her? How did she get there?"
    new "那的确是真正的 Shiroya，可她究竟出了什么事？又是怎么到那里的？"

    # game/script.rpy:63854
    old "Was she the Shiroya from this morning, the one who'd traveled to the pa—"
    new "她就是今早那个 Shiroya 吗？那个穿越到过去——"

    # game/script.rpy:63865
    old "Her words came back to me. She had told me that she'd traveled to November 30th."
    new "她的话又浮现在我脑海里。她曾对我说，自己穿越到了11月30日。"

    # game/script.rpy:63866
    old "Wait, what the hell...? There's a major contradiction with that."
    new "等等，这到底怎么回事……？这样说起来，可就有一个天大的矛盾了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63877
    old "She said that she appeared below the gem shop... but that can't be. She wouldn't have appeared there if she'd gone from December 15th to November 30th."
    new "她说自己出现在宝石店下方……可那不可能。如果她是从12月15日回到11月30日，根本不会出现在那个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:63878
    old "That location was exactly where she was on November 30th.{w} The only way for her to appear there is if she went fifteen days into the future.{w} ...To December 30th."
    new "那个地方，正是她11月30日所在之处。{w} 她要出现在那里，唯一的可能就是穿越到了十五天后的未来。{w}……也就是12月30日。"

    # game/script.rpy:63879
    old "...Could she really have gone to the future? Did that occur without her realizing it?{w} Right, I didn't think about it earlier, but the Sekimeiya that sent us repeatedly to January 5th at {time=21:00} was the one that Shiroya activated in the bathroom."
    new "……她真的去了未来吗？难道连她自己都没有察觉？{w} 对了，我之前一直没想到——那个在{time=21:00}一次次把我们送往1月5日的 Sekimeiya，正是 Shiroya 在浴室里启动的。"

    # game/script.rpy:63880
    old "I couldn't know what had happened, but just the location where she'd appeared spelled it out clearly."
    new "我无从知道究竟发生了什么，可她现身的地点本身就已经说明了一切。"

    # game/script.rpy:63887
    old "Wait, this is why..."
    new "等等，原来是因为这个……"

    # game/script.rpy:63889
    old "It's why the chain of travels forward stopped on January 5th! It's gotta be!"
    new "正因如此，这一连串向前的穿越才会停在1月5日！一定是这样！"

    # game/script.rpy:63890
    old "Shiroya traveled to the future. She went to December 30th. Then, like she told me, she entered the tower through the storeroom days later—on January 5th."
    new "Shiroya 穿越到了未来，去的是12月30日。然后，就像她告诉我的那样，几天之后——1月5日，她从储藏室进了塔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:63891
    old "She didn't tell me exactly what she did, but I know she was in the mechanical room. She told me that she found the attic key there.{w} So she was looking for something, and without realizing it, she moved the Future Sekimeiya in the mechanical room. The next time that all of us appeared, nobody instantly activated the next travel, so we stopped on the 5th. That has to be it!"
    new "她没细说自己做了什么，但我知道她去过机械室。她说过，阁楼的钥匙就是在那儿找到的。{w} 也就是说，她当时在找东西，却无意间挪动了机械室里的未来Sekimeiya。等我们所有人下一次现身时，没有人立刻启动下一段穿越，所以我们才停在了5日。一定是这样！"

    # game/script.rpy:63897
    old "I looked at the voice recorder."
    new "我看向录音笔。"

    # game/script.rpy:63900
    old "58:42. It's almost been an hour already."
    new "58分42秒。已经快一个小时了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63901
    old "I didn't have much time."
    new "剩下的时间不多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63908
    old "...Although it once seemed impossible, saving Miiya from the explosion should be simple. Very soon, if I touch the Sekimeiya, I'll be sent back to a point before she died.{w} ...Then, I could stop it. I could change the past."
    new "……把 Miiya 从爆炸中救下，曾经看来毫无可能，如今却应该很简单。再过不久，只要我触碰 Sekimeiya，就会被送回她死去之前的时间点。{w}……那样，我就能阻止它。我就能改变过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:63909
    old "That would create the world that we want—the one we thought we'd have on that day."
    new "那样一来，就能创造出我们想要的世界——那个我们以为在那一天本该拥有的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:63910
    old "...But there's still a big problem. If I do that, I can't live in it. Two versions of myself would remain."
    new "……但还有一个大问题。若真这么做，我便无法活在那个世界里。那里会留下两个我。"

    # game/script.rpy:63911
    old "That had previously been a theoretical problem I hadn't needed to confront. However, it was the truth; although that world was attainable, it had no room for its creator."
    new "这个问题从前只是理论上的，我无须面对。可它的确是事实：那个世界纵然可以抵达，却容不下它的创造者。"

    # game/script.rpy:63912
    old "Given all I'd concluded, I could think of a slight workaround."
    new "综合种种推论，我想到一个勉强的变通办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:63913
    old "I could create that world and then leave it..."
    new "我可以创造出那个世界，然后从中离开……"

    # game/script.rpy:63917
    old "If I'm right, and touching the Sekimeiya when both ranges overlap will send me to the other world, I could do that after saving Miiya.{w} If it worked, although I'd end up in my original world, I would've at least facilitated the best one's existence."
    new "如果我的推测没错，在两个范围重叠时触碰 Sekimeiya 就能被送往另一个世界，那我大可在救下 Miiya 之后这么做。{w} 若真能成功，纵然我最后会回到原本的世界，至少也让那个最好的世界得以存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:63918
    old "But I don't get what's happening right now. Why was Miiya in the tower?{w} If I did what I'm thinking, I would make sure our past selves don't go to the event, as that would put them in danger again. So, then, why is Miiya here? ...And why have I not seen Shiroya anywhere?"
    new "可眼前的一切，我仍旧想不通。Miiya 为什么会在塔里？{w} 若我按计划行事，一定会设法让过去的我们不去参加那场活动，免得他们再次陷入危险。既然如此，Miiya 又怎会在这里？……还有，为什么我到处都见不到 Shiroya？"

    # game/script.rpy:63919
    old "...That time before {time=21}, why did Shiroya say that she didn't want to save Miiya? It couldn't have been the real Shiroya, but I can't figure out a reason."
    new "……{time=21}之前的那一次，Shiroya 为什么说不想救 Miiya？那不可能是真正的 Shiroya，可我想不出其中的缘由。"

    # game/script.rpy:63920
    old "...However, as I'd thought, doing what I'd proposed myself was simple. I only had to touch the Sekimeiya when the device displayed 65 minutes and 20 seconds.{w} As I could plan out the loop before executing it, there was a best-case scenario that I'd thought up."
    new "……不过，正如我所料，执行自己的方案并不难。只要在装置显示65分20秒时触碰 Sekimeiya 即可。{w} 我可以在执行之前把循环安排妥当，也想好了一套最理想的情形。"

    # game/script.rpy:63921
    old "I would appear on November 24th. That's 21 days before now, and it'll be January 5th in 21 days. Basically, if I think about what I'll do on January 5th, I can plan my arrival on November 24th."
    new "我会在11月24日现身。那是现在的21天前，而再过21天就是1月5日。换句话说，只要先想好1月5日该做的事，我就能安排自己在11月24日出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:63924
    old "After November 30th, once everything is done, I could touch the Sekimeiya to go to our previous world. There, I know I'll be able to use the Sekimeiya on January 5th after we break free from the chain of travels.{w} ...If I plan this out so I obtain both Sekimeiya on the 5th, I can appear with them on November 24th, which will allow me to use them immediately after the 30th."
    new "等到11月30日之后、一切尘埃落定，我可以触碰 Sekimeiya，回到我们原先的世界。在那里，等我们挣脱穿越的连锁，我知道自己能在1月5日使用 Sekimeiya。{w}……只要我事先安排妥当，让自己在5日那天拿到两个 Sekimeiya，就能带着它们出现在11月24日，这样在30日之后便能立刻动用。"

    # game/script.rpy:63925
    old "What I can't be sure of is that doing so will bring me to the world I was in. It could send me anywhere else."
    new "唯一无法确定的是，这么做是否真能让我回到原先所在的世界。也可能被送到别的什么地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:63926
    old "If that happens, though, won't it be the world where Shiroya is? The Shiroya who disappeared from this world earlier today?"
    new "可若真是那样，会不会正好是 Shiroya 所在的世界？就是今天早些时候从这个世界上消失的那个 Shiroya？"

    # game/script.rpy:63927
    old "...Would that be consistent? Even though I would've altered this world, would I be sent to the same place where she went?"
    new "……这样说得通吗？纵使我改变了这个世界，难道就会被送到她去的同一个地方？"

    # game/script.rpy:63928
    old "I had no idea where Shiroya was, but I remembered the time I'd told her that changing the past was possible. Without a doubt, she wanted Miiya to be saved, and the opportunity to accomplish it was finally real. Even with all that I'd concluded, I found myself entirely lost, merely aware that Miiya's death was reversible."
    new "Shiroya 身在何处，我毫无头绪；但我记得自己曾告诉她，过去是可以改变的。她无疑希望 Miiya 得救，而实现这一点的机会终于真正摆在眼前。尽管已经推演出这一切，我仍旧茫然无措，只知道 Miiya 的死可以挽回。"

    # game/script.rpy:63932
    old "If touching the Sekimeiya doesn't send me to our world, what that might mean is that on January 5th, I won't be able to have them. Then, I wouldn't appear with them on November 24th, so I suppose I'll know as soon as I travel."
    new "若触碰 Sekimeiya 后没能回到我们的世界，那或许意味着1月5日那天我拿不到它们。这样一来，我也就不会带着它们出现在11月24日——看来，穿越的那一刻就能知道答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:63933
    old "If that happens, I'll have to wait until December 15th to change worlds during the incident."
    new "若真是如此，我就只能等到12月15日，趁那场事件发生时切换世界了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63934
    old "...{w}Was it a flawed plan? I went over it again, and I didn't think so. I intended to change history. There was no option to check a note a future self of mine would leave behind to assure my success.{w} Saving Miiya was achievable. I'd dearly wished for that, hoped it was possible, been denied, and arrived at a real chance for it. It was a surreal thought, but there was no longer a reason to doubt it."
    new "……{w}这个计划有破绽吗？我又推敲了一遍，并不觉得有。我本就打算改写历史。我也没办法查看未来的自己会留下什么字条，来确认这次行动能否成功。{w} 救下 Miiya 是可以做到的。我曾那样殷切地盼望、相信它有可能，也曾被现实否定，如今终于等到了真正的机会。这念头仿佛不真实，却再没有理由去怀疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:63935
    old "Once it was created, I would let that world continue to exist by leaving it.{w} Would it be possible to find the Shiroya I'd been with? If so, would we be able to return to our world? Assuming we could do that, there would be nothing else to wish for."
    new "一旦那个世界被创造出来，我便以离开的方式让它继续存在下去。{w} 我能找到曾与我相伴的那个 Shiroya 吗？若能找到，我们还能回到原本的世界吗？倘若这一切都能实现，那便再无所求了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63938
    old "But I still can't wrap my head around Miiya's existence in the tower. Does that conflict with what I'm aiming for?{w} How was she here? If I save her, I know I'll make sure none of us go to the tower. How is it possible that she was here all day?"
    new "可 Miiya 为何会在塔里，我始终想不明白。这与我追求的目标相冲突吗？{w} 她怎么会在这里？如果我救了她，我一定会确保我们谁都不去那座塔。既然如此，她又怎么可能一整天都待在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:63940
    old "I don't understand it, but it shouldn't be an issue regardless.{w} On top of that, I can't be content with just knowing that she was in the tower. I still need to act."
    new "我不明白，但无论如何，这应该都不成问题。{w} 再说，光是知道她曾在塔里，并不能让我安心。我还得动手去做。"

    # game/script.rpy:63941
    old "The note I found in my pocket could've come from Miiya. Erina said that she saw her minutes before we traveled to the world where she existed...{w} That note implied only one thing: Shiroya's death. If that world was this very same one I'm in, and Miiya came from it, could that be why I haven't seen Shiroya...? Is it because she's not here at all?"
    new "我口袋里那张字条，或许是 Miiya 写的。Erina 说过，就在我们穿越到那个有她存在的世界之前几分钟，她还见过 Miiya……{w} 那张字条只暗示了一件事：Shiroya 的死。若那个世界正是我现在身处的这个世界，而 Miiya 也来自那里，这会不会就是我见不到 Shiroya 的原因……？因为她根本就不在这里？"

    # game/script.rpy:63945
    old "If I'm able to appear on November 24th with both Sekimeiya, I'll be able to freely travel back through time just in case there's any issue I can't foresee the first time around."
    new "只要我能带着两个 Sekimeiya 出现在11月24日，就能随意穿越回过去，以防第一次行动中出现我无法预料的变故。"

    # game/script.rpy:63946
    old "I exhaled slowly. I was ready to act. Even though the true shape of the universe was impossible to comprehend, I knew enough to be confident in myself."
    new "我缓缓吐出一口气。我已做好准备，可以行动了。宇宙的真实面目固然无法参透，但我知道的已经足够，足以让我相信自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:63947
    old "And no matter what, it would lead to a result. No matter what it was, an outcome would arise from the labyrinthine structure that had formed around me."
    new "无论如何，行动都会带来结果。无论结果是什么，那个在我周围形成的迷宫般的结构，终将给出一个答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:63948
    old "I can do it, can't I? I can easily appear on November 24th. It has to be that day because it's proportional to January 5th.{w} I don't think anyone's still in the tower right now, so the range should only affect me."
    new "我能做到的，不是吗？让我出现在11月24日并不难。必须是那一天，它与1月5日正好对应。{w} 现在塔里应该没有别人了，重叠范围只会影响我一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:63949
    old "The time on the screen was 62:37. I'd taken the Past Sekimeiya out of the refrigerator as I'd pressed record, so I didn't have a lot of time to waste."
    new "屏幕上的时间是62分37秒。按下录音键时，我已经把 过去Sekimeiya 从冰箱里取了出来，剩下的时间并不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:63952
    old "In the past, I won't be able to stay at my house. That means I'll need money to stay somewhere else."
    new "回到过去后，我不能住在自己家里。也就是说，我需要钱去别处落脚。"

    # game/script.rpy:63953
    old "...But that's not an issue. What I figured out earlier will help me here."
    new "……不过这不是问题。之前想通的那些，正好能派上用场。"

    # game/script.rpy:63954
    old "In November, I could very easily obtain the money my past self has saved. However, I'd like to avoid doing that so I don't cause any issues.{w} Instead, I can just duplicate it. I can take that money, which will allow me to have it on January 5th. Then, I'll appear with it on November 24th, so it won't be necessary to obtain it from my past self."
    new "到了十一月，想拿到过去的自己存下的那笔钱很容易。但我不想节外生枝，所以还是别那么干。{w} 不如直接复制一份。我拿走复制出来的钱，就能在一月五日拥有它；再带着它出现在十一月二十四日，就不用从过去的自己手里取了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63955
    old "Of course, to have it on January 5th, I have to not spend it. There's another way to solve this—just duplicate it again."
    new "当然，要在一月五日拿到它，我就不能把它花掉。要解决这个问题还有另一个办法——再复制一次就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:63959
    old "My body shook with anticipation, jittering all the way down to my fingertips. I was closer to leaving the tower than I had been in what felt like eons."
    new "我因期待而浑身发颤，连指尖都在抖。我从未像此刻这样接近离开这座塔，仿佛已经等了千万年。"

    # game/script.rpy:63960
    old "On January 5th, if I'm able to get the Sekimeiya, that will happen inside the tower around the morning, after the point I traveled to the past. Since it's currently the afternoon, I'll appear at close to midnight on the 25th."
    new "一月五日，如果我能拿到 Sekimeiya，那会发生在塔内，时间大约是早晨，就在我穿越回过去之后。现在还是下午，所以我将在二十五日接近午夜时现身。"

    # game/script.rpy:63961
    old "...That's perfect."
    new "……太合适了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63964
    old "I stopped thinking and stepped closer to the Sekimeiya."
    new "我不再多想，朝 Sekimeiya 走近一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:63967
    old "64:47. The seconds were rapidly going up."
    new "64:47。秒数正飞快地往上跳。"

    # game/script.rpy:63969
    old "65. Only twenty more seconds."
    new "65。只剩二十秒了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63970
    old "The aura of heat around the Sekimeiya had compounded immensely, but my senses were honed in on the timer. I barely registered the temperature."
    new "Sekimeiya 周围的热浪已积聚得极其浓烈，但我的全部感官都锁在计时器上，几乎感觉不到温度。"

    # game/script.rpy:63972
    old "65:15,{w=1} 16, {w=1}17,{w=1} 18..."
    new "65:15，{w=1} 16，{w=1}17，{w=1} 18……"

    # game/script.rpy:63981
    old "Lucid Dream"
    new "清醒梦"

    # game/script.rpy:63984
    old "65:19. That was the last number my eyes saw before my sight blackened."
    new "65:19。这是我在眼前一黑之前看到的最后一个数字。"

    # game/script.rpy:63985
    old "...Where—"
    new "……这里是——"

    # game/script.rpy:63986
    old "Touching the Sekimeiya brought back the darkness. However, I immediately discerned where I was: the place where I'd thought I'd appear."
    new "碰到 Sekimeiya，黑暗再度降临。但我立刻辨出了自己身在何处——正是我预想会现身的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:63992
    old "It's the lobby. Since there's no light, it must be nighttime."
    new "是大厅。一点光都没有，看来是夜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:63993
    old "There was something on my lap, and I knew what it was. A suitcase. It was open, and both Sekimeiya were in it."
    new "腿上放着什么东西，我知道那是什么——一只手提箱。箱盖敞着，两个 Sekimeiya 都在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:63994
    old "It worked...! The Sekimeiya are here!{w} This is everything I need to confirm this'll work!{w} I'll go back to my world, and on January 5th, I'll be able to get both Sekimeiya!"
    new "成功了……！Sekimeiya 就在这里！{w} 有这些，就足够证实这个计划可行了！{w} 我回到自己的世界，到了一月五日，就能把两个 Sekimeiya 都拿到手！"

    # game/script.rpy:63995
    old "I could feel that my clothing hadn't changed. When I looked around me, I saw the sight I'd been longing for: the sky. As my vision adjusted, the multitude of stars above me took shape. The shutter, the barrier to the outside, was gone."
    new "我能感觉到自己的衣服没有变。环顾四周，我看见了那个朝思暮想的景象——天空。视线渐渐适应，头顶的繁星显出轮廓。那道隔开外界的卷帘门，不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:63996
    old "I stood up, speechless, and haltingly walked over to the door."
    new "我无言地站起身，一步一顿地走向门口。"

    # game/script.rpy:64004
    old "I could see snow on the ground, illuminated by a handful of streetlights. It was right there, behind a screen of glass."
    new "我能看见地面上的积雪，被几盏路灯照亮。它就在那里，只隔着一层玻璃。"

    # game/script.rpy:64008
    old "I placed my hand on the handle and gently pushed.{w} The door didn't open. As I'd expected, it was locked.{w} I couldn't go to the storeroom because the hallway cameras would record me..."
    new "我把手放在门把上，轻轻一推。{w} 门没有开。果然锁着。{w} 我不能去储藏室，走廊的摄像头会拍到我……"

    # game/script.rpy:64009
    old "I put my hand in my pocket, hoping I would feel cold metal."
    new "我把手伸进口袋，盼着能摸到冰凉的金属。"

    # game/script.rpy:64010
    old "Yes! It's here!"
    new "太好了！在这里！"

    # game/script.rpy:64011
    old "It was a keyring with a dog-shaped keychain—the one I'd found in the coat of a staff member, which I could obtain on January 5th. Since it had been in the clothes that staff member had worn when entering the tower, it was possible one of the keys unlocked the door. Appearing with it guaranteed that one would."
    new "那是一串挂着狗形钥匙扣的钥匙——就是我在一月五日拿到的那串，原本放在一名员工的外套里。既然钥匙串是在那名员工进塔时穿的衣服里找到的，其中一把钥匙就有可能打开这扇门。只要我带着它出现，就必定有一把能打开这扇门。"

    # game/script.rpy:64012
    old "There were four keys, and one was bigger than the others. Once I found the keyhole below the handle, I inserted it."
    new "一共四把钥匙，其中一把比别的都大。我找到门把下方的锁孔，把它插了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64013
    old "When it turned, my shoulders dropped, unable to believe the truth. I could set foot outside that place."
    new "钥匙一转，我双肩一松，几乎不敢相信这是真的——我可以踏出那个地方了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64020
    old "And when the door opened, I did so without thinking. I was no longer in the building; there was snow around me, and I was holding the Sekimeiya. Most importantly, I had a plan I could enact successfully."
    new "门一开，我便不假思索地跨了出去。我已经不在那栋楼里了；四周是雪，手里握着 Sekimeiya。最重要的是，我有了一个可以顺利执行的计划。"

    # game/script.rpy:64021
    old "A lone key was in my pocket, isolated from the set—the rusty key I'd obtained in the security room. And in my other pocket, I found money."
    new "口袋里有一把单独的钥匙，是从那串上取下来的——就是我在监控室拿到的生锈钥匙。另一个口袋里，我摸到了钱。"

    # game/script.rpy:64023
    old "I could only stand there, feeling the cold air hit my face."
    new "我只能站在原地，任冷风扑在脸上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64024
    old "I couldn't believe I'd really been able to walk out. I'd gotten far too used to being stopped. A faint buzz hummed around me, fading into the night. I took a step forward and was assaulted by tiredness."
    new "我竟然真的走了出来，简直难以置信。被拦下太多次，我早已习惯了。耳边隐约有一阵嗡鸣，渐渐消散在夜色里。我向前迈出一步，疲惫顿时涌了上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:64025
    old "So this is how I'll be on January 5th... I feel exhausted."
    new "原来一月五日的我是这个样子……累得不行。"

    # game/script.rpy:64026
    old "And I had to go somewhere. The cold was rapidly getting to me, and a full night was still ahead."
    new "而且我得找个去处。寒气正迅速侵入身体，而整夜还长着呢。"

    # game/script.rpy:64029
    old "...Where do I go? There's a motel in the center of town, but I'm not sure it'll be open."
    new "……我该去哪儿？镇中心有家汽车旅馆，但不确定还开着没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:64030
    old "I kept a replica of my keys outside my house, so I could silently sneak into my parents' room and stay there without alerting my own self. That wasn't something I wanted to do if I could help it."
    new "我在家门外藏了一副备用钥匙，这样就能悄悄溜进父母的房间落脚，不会惊动我自己。但若非万不得已，我并不想这么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:64032
    old "I suppose I'll have to see."
    new "看来只能去看看了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64036
    old "I turned around and saw a large shadow covering the stars. It was the tower, looking even bigger than I recalled."
    new "我回过头，看见一片巨大的黑影遮住了星空。那是塔，比我记忆中还要高大。"

    # game/script.rpy:64038
    old "With the same key I'd used to leave, I locked the front door."
    new "我用刚才离开时用的那把钥匙，把前门锁上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64043
    old "...Once I'd taken a few steps, all light was gone. Fortunately, I could navigate the streets without a problem."
    new "……走出几步之后，四下里就一片漆黑了。好在这些街道我熟得很，走起来毫无困难。"

    # game/script.rpy:64044
    old "I walked, unable to hear any sounds beyond my own steps. As I got closer to the center, more faint lights dotted the streets. Soon, I stepped into the widest street and approached a building I'd never been to."
    new "我一路走着，除了自己的脚步声，什么都听不见。越靠近镇中心，街上零星的灯火就越多。不久，我踏上最宽的那条街，走向一栋从未去过的建筑。"

    # game/script.rpy:64048
    old "There was a sign above the door. It read \"Eagle Motel\"."
    new "门上挂着一块招牌，写着「鹰旅馆」。"

    # game/script.rpy:64049
    old "Is it closed? I don't see anyone."
    new "关门了吗？一个人都看不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:64050
    old "There was a bell near it, so I pressed it."
    new "旁边有个门铃，我按了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64054
    old "I waited, wondering if the sound had reached anyone."
    new "我等着，心想那铃声有没有传到谁耳中。"

    # game/script.rpy:64055
    old "It took me a while to discern that a tall man was approaching me. He turned on the lights and opened the door from the inside, his eyes showing that he'd been about to fall asleep."
    new "过了好一会儿，我才看出有个高个子男人正朝我走来。他打开灯，从里面开了门，眼神迷迷糊糊的，像是刚要睡着。"

    # game/script.rpy:64059
    old "S-Sorry. Would it be possible for me to spend the night here?"
    new "抱、抱歉。能让我在这里住一晚吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:64060
    old "...You don't have a reservation?"
    new "……你没有预订？"

    # game/script.rpy:64061
    old "No... Something just came up, and I have nowhere to stay."
    new "没有……临时出了点事，我实在无处可去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64062
    old "We have spare rooms, but it's ¥8,000 a night."
    new "有空房，不过一晚 ¥8,000。"

    # game/script.rpy:64063
    old "That's fine. I might have to stay a few days."
    new "没问题。我可能得在这儿住上几天。"

    # game/script.rpy:64064
    old "I suddenly looked down at myself and noticed that my clothes still had very faint traces of smoke on them, although, I thought, not identical to how they'd been before traveling."
    new "我忽然低头看了看自己，发现衣服上还残留着极淡的烟味——不过我记得，和穿越前并不完全一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:64071
    old "I paid one night's rate and was given two keys—one for the front door and another for a bedroom."
    new "我付了一晚的房费，拿到两把钥匙——一把开大门，一把开客房。"

    # game/script.rpy:64074
    old "My attention was immediately grabbed by a digital clock on the table. It was {time=22:54} on November 24th, a Thursday."
    new "桌上的电子钟立刻吸引了我的目光。上面显示着 11 月 24 日，星期四，{time=22:54}。"

    # game/script.rpy:64075
    old "...I can't believe it. I traveled three weeks to the past."
    new "……真不敢相信。我竟然回到了三周前。"

    # game/script.rpy:64076
    old "Within the tower, anything had seemed possible, but with the effect reflected in the real world, my mind couldn't accept it."
    new "在塔里时，仿佛什么都可能发生；可当结果真真切切地出现在现实世界，我却怎么也接受不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64077
    old "Both Sekimeiya were in the suitcase, and the smell of the tower still hung around me."
    new "两个 Sekimeiya 都在手提箱里，我身上还留着塔里的气味。"

    # game/script.rpy:64078
    old "The room was linked to a bathroom with a shower and a kitchen. I had a lot of things to think about, but my body dropped on the bed, giving me no chance to do so."
    new "房间连着带淋浴的浴室和一间厨房。我有很多事要想，可身体一沾到床，就再没有力气想下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64082
    old "Wait!{w} The money... I have to duplicate it."
    new "等等！{w}钱……我得把钱复制出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:64083
    old "I'd paid for a single night, so I had to duplicate that amount and then the entire sum. I got out of bed and approached the suitcase."
    new "我只付了一晚的钱，得先复制出一晚的数额，再把整笔钱复制出来。我下了床，走到手提箱前。"

    # game/script.rpy:64084
    old "They've been outside for so long, I'm sure they don't have a lot of energy. I should be able to touch one without the range reaching anyone else here.{w} I wonder which is the future one. If I touch the past one, I'll just appear in the bathroom and stay there until my past self leaves."
    new "它们在外面放了这么久，能量肯定不多了。我碰其中一个，范围应该不会波及到这里的其他人。{w}不知道哪个才是通往未来的。要是碰到过去那个，我只会出现在浴室里，一直待到过去的我离开为止。"

    # game/script.rpy:64085
    old "I'd undressed before getting in bed since the room was warm. If I replicated my past location, the money I'd been holding would duplicate.{w} I placed the suitcase on the bed and separated both gemstones. Then, I touched one of them in the center of the room."
    new "房间很暖和，我上床前就把衣服脱了。只要重现我过去所在的位置，我手里的钱就会复制出来。{w}我把手提箱放到床上，将两个宝石分开，然后在房间中央碰了其中一个。"

    # game/script.rpy:64094
    old "My vision went dark, but I could hear something. ...I wasn't alone."
    new "眼前一黑，我却听得见动静。……这里不止我一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:64096
    old "Wait, is this...?"
    new "等等，这里是……？"

    # game/script.rpy:64099
    old "My bedroom. Not the motel's, but the one in my house. When I glanced at the source of the sound, I saw my own body sleeping in my bed."
    new "我的卧室。不是旅馆的房间，是我家里的那间。我朝声音的来源看去，只见自己正躺在床上睡着。"

    # game/script.rpy:64100
    old "What!? Why am I here...?"
    new "什么！？我怎么会在这里……？"

    # game/script.rpy:64101
    old "I slowly stepped back, unable to take my eyes off myself. It was November; that self of mine hadn't yet reunited with Shiroya and Miiya. By the time I reached the door, I started to understand what had happened."
    new "我慢慢后退，目光却离不开那个自己。现在是十一月，那个我还没有和 Shiroya、Miiya 重逢。一直退到门口，我才渐渐明白发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:64105
    old "My clothes changed... I went to the future."
    new "衣服变了……我去了未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:64106
    old "I think I traveled farther than I expected. Maybe the Sekimeiya were gathering energy inside the suitcase even though the outside was so chilly. I must have traveled more than fifteen minutes through time, so the replicated location was from a time before I appeared in the lobby, when I was about to sleep in my old world."
    new "看来我穿越得比预想中更远。外面明明这么冷，Sekimeiya 或许还是在手提箱里积攒了能量。我穿越的时间跨度肯定超过十五分钟，所以重现的位置才落在我出现在大堂之前——那是我还在原来的世界里准备睡觉的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:64107
    old "Trying to prevent myself from being noticed, I approached the front door. ...It seemed I had replicated my body on November 24th, and it was fortunate I'd appeared when I'd already fallen asleep."
    new "我尽量不惊动那个自己，摸向大门。……看来我重现的是 11 月 24 日的身体，幸好现身的时机正好是我已经睡着之后。"

    # game/script.rpy:64110
    old "I felt the handle and opened the door. The sky brimmed with stars, and my clothes were no longer protecting me from the freezing air. I had left the motel bedroom empty, so I ran there."
    new "我摸到门把手，推开了门。夜空满是繁星，身上的衣服却已挡不住刺骨的寒气。旅馆的房间还空着，我一路跑了回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64111
    old "Once again, I had to ring the bell to enter. To my surprise, an older woman opened the door."
    new "我又一次按响门铃才进去。没想到开门的是一位年长的女人。"

    # game/script.rpy:64114
    old "Sorry, I had to go out for a bit. Where's the man from before?"
    new "抱歉，我出去了一趟。刚才那位男士呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:64115
    old "Oh, old Stanley? He sticks to a strict sleep schedule. Next time, don't ring the bell, just knock. He gets mean when you wake him up. Along with you now."
    new "哦，你说老 Stanley？他的作息很规律。下次别按门铃，敲门就行。把他吵醒，他脾气可不好——这下连你也要挨骂了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64121
    old "The Sekimeiya was still on the bed. There was no doubt it was the future one, as the clock showed {time=23:29.}"
    new "Sekimeiya 还在床上。钟上显示着 {time=23:29.}，毫无疑问是通往未来的那个。"

    # game/script.rpy:64122
    old "...I didn't change worlds, so the range of the other Sekimeiya didn't reach me. I hope nobody else traveled with me."
    new "……我没有切换世界，另一个 Sekimeiya 的范围也就没有波及到我。但愿没有别人跟着我一起穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:64123
    old "I sat on the bed and panted, each inhalation bringing lancing pain. I was even more tired than before, and it took me a second to process why. The replicated location had been from when the past me was about to go to sleep."
    new "我坐在床上喘息，每吸一口气都像被针扎。我比先前更累了，愣了一下才想明白其中缘由——我出现的位置，是过去的我正要入睡时的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:64124
    old "...I didn't actually duplicate the money."
    new "……钱其实没能复制成功。"

    # game/script.rpy:64125
    old "My old clothes were beside the bed, but I had to reset the Sekimeiya before attempting it again.{w} I sat up and walked to the kitchen."
    new "原先的衣服就在床边，不过我得先把 Sekimeiya 重置，才能再试一次。{w}我坐起身，走向厨房。"

    # game/script.rpy:64129
    old "Oh, there's a refrigerator here."
    new "哦，这里有冰箱。"

    # game/script.rpy:64132
    old "It was running, so I knew it would work to cool off the Sekimeiya. After putting both of them inside, I grabbed the money from the pocket of my other pants."
    new "冰箱在运转，正好可以用来冷却 Sekimeiya。我把两个都放进去，然后从另一条裤子的口袋里取出钱。"

    # game/script.rpy:64139
    old "I took the Future Sekimeiya back out and waited a few seconds. Subsequently, I left the money on the floor and felt the surface of the gemstone."
    new "我把 未来Sekimeiya 重新取出来，等了几秒，随后把钱放在地板上，伸手触碰宝石表面。"

    # game/script.rpy:64141
    old "My sight hardly changed, but I knew I'd teleported. I was holding the stack of money, and the original bills were on the floor. I could use them while I kept the duplicated ones until January 5th."
    new "视野几乎没有变化，但我知道自己已经传送了。我手里握着一叠钱，原先的那几张仍留在地板上。我可以先花掉原钞，把复制出来的钱留到 1 月 5 日。"

    # game/script.rpy:64142
    old "I have to duplicate a night's worth too since I already paid for it."
    new "那一晚的房钱我已经付了，也得照样复制一份出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:64147
    old "The Future Sekimeiya was still powered off. I reset it to repeat the process, and once I'd duplicated the full amount of money, I left both Sekimeiya in the refrigerator again."
    new "未来Sekimeiya 仍处于关闭状态。我重置了它，重复同样的步骤，等整笔钱都复制好，又把两个 Sekimeiya 一起放回冰箱。"

    # game/script.rpy:64152
    old "I fell to the bed. I didn't bother taking off my clothes the second time since they were a lot lighter than before."
    new "我扑倒在床上。第二次我懒得脱衣服了，毕竟身上这身比之前轻多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64160
    old "Before I knew it, I could see the sun through the window."
    new "不知不觉间，阳光已经照进窗来。"

    # game/script.rpy:64161
    old "I looked at the clock, trying to remember where I was.{w} {time=10:09}, November 25th. It all came back to me when I saw those blurry numbers."
    new "我看向时钟，努力回想自己身在何处。{w} {time=10:09}，11 月 25 日。看清那串模糊的数字，一切才重新涌回脑海。"

    # game/script.rpy:64162
    old "I quickly got out of bed and checked the Sekimeiya in the refrigerator."
    new "我连忙下床，去查看冰箱里的 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:64166
    old "It doesn't seem like the Sekimeiya heat up inside, so they're fine here."
    new "Sekimeiya 放在里面好像不会发热，搁在这儿没问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:64167
    old "November 25th. On this day... I hadn't even received Miiya's call yet. Right now, I was at home all alone."
    new "11 月 25 日。这一天……我连 Miiya 的电话都还没接到。这个时候，我还一个人待在家里。"

    # game/script.rpy:64171
    old "I felt a little dizzy, so I put on my original clothes and walked out of the room to a cafeteria I'd seen downstairs."
    new "我有些头晕，便换上原来的衣服，走出房间，去了之前在楼下看到的那间餐厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:64172
    old "Fortunately, I had enough money to cover all the days I needed.{w} Once I felt rested, I went back up."
    new "幸好身上的钱足够付清这些天的房费。{w}歇够了，我才回到楼上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64177
    old "I sat on the bed and went over what I would do."
    new "我坐在床上，把接下来要做的事在脑中过了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:64178
    old "...I'm in the past of the world where Miiya was alive. If I don't change the past, will she not die? ...Or was she in the tower for another reason?"
    new "……我回到了 Miiya 还活着的那个世界的过去。如果我不去改变过去，她是不是就不会死？……还是说，她进塔另有原因？"

    # game/script.rpy:64179
    old "I have the Sekimeiya, so maybe I should see what happens on the 30th and then go to the past. I can't risk the plan getting ruined due to a difference in the events that I'm not aware of."
    new "我有 Sekimeiya，也许该先看看 30 号会发生什么，再回到过去。我不能冒险让计划因为某个我没察觉到的变故而泡汤。"

    # game/script.rpy:64180
    old "If what happened on the 30th repeats, why would Miiya have been in the tower? ...Is there an explanation for that?"
    new "如果 30 号的事会重演，那 Miiya 当初为什么会进塔？……这一点有解释吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:64181
    old "The concept of different worlds I have is rough, but I was thinking of something..."
    new "我对不同世界的理解还很粗浅，不过我在想一件事……"

    # game/script.rpy:64182
    old "If I save Miiya, my plan was to go back to my initial world. I can't stay in this one. That would allow this world to exist, at the very least..."
    new "我的计划是救下 Miiya 之后，回到最初的世界。我不能留在这个世界里。至少这样，这个世界还能继续存在……"

    # game/script.rpy:64183
    old "But after saving her, I could travel to the other world with Miiya, which would result in the same effect. The other world would end up with her, while this one wouldn't."
    new "但救下她之后，我也可以带着 Miiya 一起前往另一个世界，效果并无不同。那样一来，另一个世界会有她，这个世界则没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:64184
    old "I couldn't bring myself to do that. ...I had already accepted Miiya's death once.{w} Even if I was able to bring her to our world, would that truly be better? I would just create avoidable pain in another."
    new "可我做不到。……Miiya 的死，我已经接受过一次。{w} 就算我能把她带回我们的世界，那真的更好吗？我不过是在另一个世界里制造本可避免的痛苦罢了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64187
    old "But I believe it's possible the Miiya in the tower came from a different world—from one in which she didn't die. That would explain why she was there with no influence of mine."
    new "但我认为，塔里的那个 Miiya 有可能来自另一个世界——一个她并没有死的世界。这样就能解释她为何会在那里，且与我的干预无关。"

    # game/script.rpy:64188
    old "Everything regarding other worlds was too hypothetical. I had to stick to what I'd planned."
    new "其他世界的事，说到底都只是假想。我只能按原定计划行事。"

    # game/script.rpy:64189
    old "...I'll make sure she doesn't die. I'll make this world into the one we wanted. In the end, I'll have to abandon it, but at least I'll know it exists."
    new "……我会确保她不会死。我会让这个世界变成我们想要的样子。到最后，我不得不舍弃它，但至少我会知道，它存在过。"

    # game/script.rpy:64190
    old "After November 30th, I'll go back in time and prevent her death. After that, I'll change worlds, hopefully arriving in the one I was in."
    new "11月30日之后，我会回到过去，阻止她的死亡。然后我会切换世界，希望能回到我原本所在的那个世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:64191
    old "If that works, I won't want to change the past any further. My goal will be to find the real Shiroya, who I'm sure will be there at one point. Maybe when she disappeared with Naomi, or maybe when she was in the tower with different clothes. Once I make it there, we can leave together."
    new "如果一切顺利，我就不再改动过去了。我的目标是找到真正的 Shiroya，她必定会在某个时刻出现。也许是她和 Naomi 一同消失的时候，也许是她穿着不同的衣服待在塔里的时候。只要到达那里，我们就能一起离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:64200
    old "That will work."
    new "这样能行。"

    # game/script.rpy:64202
    old "That will not work."
    new "这样行不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:64208
    old "...It would work. Atsuki was sure of it."
    new "……会成功的。Atsuki 对此深信不疑。"

    # game/script.rpy:64209
    old "He had to dispel his doubts and be confident he would succeed. There were five days until the 30th, but there was nothing he could do until then."
    new "他必须打消疑虑，坚信自己会成功。距离30日还有五天，可在那之前，他什么也做不了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64210
    old "He didn't leave the motel. It had all the food he needed and a bedroom to sleep in."
    new "他没有离开鹰旅馆。这里有足够的食物，也有能睡觉的房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:64211
    old "While the final day approached, he made sure the Sekimeiya worked. He traveled a few minutes through time and confirmed that all he'd learned still applied."
    new "随着最后一天临近，他确认 Sekimeiya 仍能运作。他做了几分钟的时间穿越，证实自己先前掌握的一切依然成立。"

    # game/script.rpy:64221
    old "November 30th came. Atsuki was still in that room, although it would soon be his time to act."
    new "11月30日到了。Atsuki 仍待在那间房里，不过很快就轮到他行动了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64222
    old "He didn't take his eyes off the clock. At {time=21}, he could hardly breathe, remembering what had once happened."
    new "他的视线一刻也没离开时钟。到了 {time=21}，回想起曾经发生过的事，他几乎无法呼吸。"

    # game/script.rpy:64223
    old "...It must've already occurred by that point. Miiya was likely dead."
    new "……到那个时刻，事情想必已经发生了。Miiya 多半已经死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64224
    old "He hated that it had been allowed to repeat, but otherwise his plan could've been hindered. Even though the time had passed, he couldn't go to the shop for fear of being recognized."
    new "他痛恨那件事竟被允许重演，可若不如此，他的计划或许就会受阻。时间虽然已经过去，他仍不敢去那家店，怕被人认出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:64225
    old "...He had to wait until the morning news to know if everything had repeated as he'd once experienced it."
    new "……他只能等到早间新闻，才能知道一切是否如他经历过的那样重演了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:64232
    old "He stared at the ceiling all night. The moment the sun rose, he went to the cafeteria and turned on the television."
    new "他盯着天花板看了整夜。太阳一升起，他就去了餐厅，打开电视。"

    # game/script.rpy:64233
    old "His eyes bored holes into the screen, waiting for the news to begin. Once it did, a mass of headlines were shown at once."
    new "他死死盯着屏幕，等着新闻开始。新闻一开播，一大批标题便同时出现在屏幕上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64234
    old "...{w}He didn't see it. None of them had been about a gas explosion in Yushibana."
    new "……{w}他没有看到。没有一条是关于丰花煤气爆炸的。"

    # game/script.rpy:64235
    old "It couldn't be. There was no way that wouldn't have made the local news."
    new "不可能。那样的事，本地新闻不可能不报。"

    # game/script.rpy:64236
    old "He kept changing the channel, but there was no mention of what should have happened the previous night."
    new "他不停地换台，可昨晚本该发生的事，却没有半点消息。"

    # game/script.rpy:64237
    old "Had he made a mistake? When that thought occurred to him, he dashed out of the motel."
    new "难道是自己哪里出了差错？这个念头一冒出来，他便冲出了鹰旅馆。"

    # game/script.rpy:64242
    old "He ran toward the stone buildings as fast as the snow allowed him."
    new "他朝着那些石头建筑跑去，雪地里能跑多快就跑多快。"

    # game/script.rpy:64246
    old "When he reached the street, he was able to see it in the distance: there was light in Musashi Gemstones.{w} He didn't stop running. He burst through the door and gaped at the owner in disbelief."
    new "跑到那条街上时，他远远就看见了：武藏宝石里亮着灯。{w} 他没有停下脚步，一把推开门，难以置信地瞪着店主。"

    # game/script.rpy:64250
    old "Oh, you're back! What's with the rush?"
    new "哦，你回来了！怎么这么急？"

    # game/script.rpy:64258
    old "He looked at the far side of the shop. The floor was intact."
    new "他望向店铺深处。地板完好无损。"

    # game/script.rpy:64263
    old "D-Did anything happen yesterday?"
    new "昨、昨天发生什么事了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:64264
    old "Hm? What do you mean?"
    new "嗯？你指什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:64269
    old "N-No?"
    new "没、没有？"

    # game/script.rpy:64270
    old "I don't know what you mean. What are you talking about?"
    new "我不明白你的意思。你在说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:64271
    old "After seeing the undamaged shelves, there was a question Atsuki had to ask."
    new "看到那些毫发无损的货架后，Atsuki 不得不问一个问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:64276
    old "What about th-the Sekimeiya?"
    new "那、那 Sekimeiya 呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:64277
    old "The Seki... How do you know about that name!? I was planning to use it in the future!"
    new "Seki……你怎么会知道这个名字！？我可是打算以后再用的！"

    # game/script.rpy:64282
    old "Atsuki bolted out of the shop, ignoring the owner's shouts. He ran to a nearby bus station, where he'd met Shiroya and Miiya on that final day."
    new "Atsuki 不顾店主在身后叫喊，冲出了店铺。他跑向附近的公交站——最后那天，他就是在那里遇见 Shiroya 和 Miiya 的。"

    # game/script.rpy:64286
    old "There was nothing there. Atsuki recalled having seen a flyer with the words \"The Sekimeiya\" stuck on the post."
    new "那里什么都没有。Atsuki 记得，柱子上曾贴着一张写着「The Sekimeiya」的传单。"

    # game/script.rpy:64287
    old "Next, he ran to his own house."
    new "接着，他跑向自己家。"

    # game/script.rpy:64291
    old "Th-There's light in the windows... I'm not in the hospital."
    new "窗、窗户里有灯光……我没有住院。"

    # game/script.rpy:64292
    old "He couldn't believe it. The explosion hadn't happened."
    new "他不敢相信。爆炸没有发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:64293
    old "Why? And what next? He had no idea what to do, so he stood paralyzed."
    new "为什么？接下来又该怎么办？他完全不知道该做什么，只能僵立在原地。"

    # game/script.rpy:64294
    old "However, that was what he'd wanted. He hadn't done anything, but the result had been the same."
    new "可这正是他想要的结果。他什么都没做，结果却完全一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:64298
    old "Speechless, he waited in front of his house."
    new "他无言地等在自己家门前。"

    # game/script.rpy:64300
    old "Light snow began to fall, but he kept watching his window. He could see a figure behind it, similar to his own."
    new "细雪开始飘落，他的目光却始终不离那扇窗。窗后能看见一个人影，身形与他相仿。"

    # game/script.rpy:64301
    old "He realized he'd been there for hours when his front door opened. ...It really was his own self, with an expression he'd personally long since abandoned."
    new "直到家门打开，他才意识到自己已站在那里几个小时了。……出来的确实是他自己，脸上带着一种他早已不再流露的神情。"

    # game/script.rpy:64306
    old "He didn't hide, but it didn't seem like he'd been seen. He saw his own body walking ahead, so he followed him."
    new "他没有躲，对方似乎也没有看见他。他眼看着自己的身体向前走去，便跟了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64312
    old "Eventually, they reached Seeuta D'ella Park. Miiya and Shiroya were there, waving at him."
    new "最终，他们来到了 Seeuta D'ella 公园。Miiya 和 Shiroya 就在那里，正朝他挥手。"

    # game/script.rpy:64313
    old "It was what he'd most wanted. Those days were continuing beyond November 30th."
    new "那正是他最期盼的事。那些日子越过11月30日，仍在继续。"

    # game/script.rpy:64314
    old "But there was something more pressing within Atsuki's mind."
    new "然而，Atsuki心中还有更迫切的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:64316
    old "It didn't make sense. It was a world... that didn't make sense."
    new "这说不通。这个世界……根本说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:64317
    old "Ending: Impossible Perfection"
    new "结局：无法企及的完美"

    # game/script.rpy:64346
    old "Will this work...?"
    new "这样真的能行吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:64347
    old "The most delicate part is altering the story of this world. When I changed the past, it was clear the result wasn't straightforward."
    new "最棘手的地方，在于改写这个世界的来龙去脉。我上次改变过去时，结果显然没那么简单。"

    # game/script.rpy:64348
    old "It almost created a mesh of realities. Some people kept their memo—"
    new "那几乎把几个现实织成了一张网。有些人还保留着记忆——"

    # game/script.rpy:64350
    old "The sudden realization shattered all my thoughts."
    new "那一瞬间的醒悟，将我所有的思绪击得粉碎。"

    # game/script.rpy:64351
    old "No... What am I thinking?{w} ...I didn't change the past at all."
    new "不……我在胡思乱想什么？{w}……我根本没有改变过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64352
    old "I decided I'd try to change the past after I suffered that strange injury in the elevator... I used the Sekimeiya to travel more than half an hour to the past."
    new "我是在电梯里受了那道奇怪的伤之后，才决定试着改变过去的……我用Sekimeiya穿越到了半个多小时以前。"

    # game/script.rpy:64358
    old "\"I began to walk toward the event room to check the time, but voices stopped me.\""
    new "我动身往活动室走去，想确认时间，却被说话声拦住了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:64359
    old "\"I got close to the door and focused my hearing.\""
    new "我凑近门边，凝神细听。"

    # game/script.rpy:64361
    old "\"I recognized the conversation. I'd arrived approximately a couple minutes before the point only Sai had traveled.\""
    new "我听出了这段对话。我到达的时间，比只有Sai穿越到的那个时间点早了两三分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:64366
    old "It was a couple minutes before Sai disappeared in front of us us. That is to say, a couple minutes before we changed worlds."
    new "那是在Sai从我们眼前消失之前的两三分钟。也就是说，是在我们切换世界之前的两三分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:64375
    old "To change the past, I produced a sound in hallway A. ...A sound we never heard."
    new "为了改变过去，我在A走廊弄出了一点声响。……一个我们从未听见的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:64376
    old "When I slammed the door, I thought I'd changed the past because we hadn't heard that sound in the event room. But... the reason we didn't hear it was because we'd gone to a different world."
    new "我摔上门时，以为过去已经被我改写——因为我们在活动室里没听到那声响。可是……我们没听到，原因是我们去了另一个世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:64381
    old "And in that world, I ended up taking the elevator up to follow Shiroya.{w} That had to be when we came back. For some reason, we went back to our world.{w} That's what that injury signified—the elevator stopped abruptly because it wasn't moving in our world, and I cut myself with the handrail as my body overlapped with it."
    new "而在那个世界里，我为了追Shiroya，坐上了电梯。{w}我们一定就是在那时回来的。不知为何，我们回到了自己的世界。{w}那道伤就是这个意思——电梯在我们这个世界里本就没有运行，所以骤然停住，我的身体与扶手重叠，被割伤了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64387
    old "\"It couldn't have been going too fast, but as it ceased all movement, it propelled us upward, and we slammed to the floor.\""
    new "电梯不可能开得太快，可就在它彻底停下的瞬间，却把我们向上抛起，重重摔在地板上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64388
    old "\"...!\""
    new "……！"

    # game/script.rpy:64389
    old "\"I felt my right hand burning. I looked at it and saw a cut.\""
    new "右手火辣辣地疼。我低头一看，只见一道伤口。"

    # game/script.rpy:64391
    old "\"I could only process the intense pain coming from the wound. While I couldn't comprehend how it had happened, I understood that I had cut my hand with the handrail when our bodies lifted, as it had been right above me.\""
    new "我脑中只剩伤口传来的剧痛。它是怎么来的，我一时想不明白，但我知道，那是身体被抛起时，手被正上方的扶手割伤的。"

    # game/script.rpy:64399
    old "And that was the exact world we'd been in before: the Past Sekimeiya was back in the staff room, where I'd hidden it. It didn't teleport back there.{w} Akaro was gone, and Sai was once again the person we'd been with in the event room. Also, the blood I would leave on the staircase was surely already there."
    new "而那正是我们先前待过的世界：过去Sekimeiya回到了员工室，就在我藏它的地方。它不是被传送回去的。{w}Akaro不见了，活动室里和我们在一起的又变回了Sai。还有，我之后会留在楼梯上的血迹，那时想必已经在那里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64403
    old "\"The doors opened, so I dashed out of the elevator as fast as I could, forcing my eyes shut to suppress the pain.\""
    new "门一开，我便拼命冲出电梯，紧闭双眼强忍疼痛。"

    # game/script.rpy:64408
    old "...{w}So, when I went back in time and produced that \"new\" sound... I didn't actually change anything. When I slammed the door, the event room was already empty.{w} And then, despite the difference I would've caused, Erina and I still got out of the elevator on the third floor."
    new "……{w}也就是说，我穿越回过去，弄出那声「新」的响动……其实什么都没改变。我摔门的时候，活动室已经空了。{w}而后来，尽管我本该造成一些差异，Erina和我还是在三楼走出了电梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:64409
    old "I thought I had created an incomprehensible mess of memories, but now I understand. It seemed like only Sai remembered the effect of my change because he was the only person there when I slammed the door. ...For him, the blood in the hallways was always there, whereas for Erina and me, it wasn't before we took the elevator."
    new "我原以为，自己把记忆搅成了一团无法理解的乱麻，现在总算明白了。似乎只有Sai记得我那番改动的影响——因为我摔门时，在场的人只有他。……对他来说，走廊里的血迹从一开始就在；可我和Erina上电梯之前，那里并没有血。"

    # game/script.rpy:64416
    old "\"I looked next to us, and as I thought, the other trail of blood was coming from the elevator. It was from the time I'd gone down after suffering the injury; the floor was proof of both realities at once.\""
    new "我看向身旁，果然，另一道血迹是从电梯那边延伸出来的。那是我受伤后下楼时留下的；这片地板同时印证了两个现实。"

    # game/script.rpy:64424
    old "What the hell? This means that I still have no idea if the past can be changed!"
    new "搞什么？这么说，过去究竟能不能改变，我还是毫无头绪！"

    # game/script.rpy:64425
    old "No... there's no way, is there? All that must mean is that it's not possible. It wasn't changed a single time. When I produced the Sekimeiya's travel formula, I made use of hypothetical worlds all different from each other, but the real one never changed..."
    new "不……不可能吧？这一切只能说明，过去改不了。一次都没改变过。我在生成Sekimeiya的穿越公式时，用的都是彼此不同的假想世界，而真正的世界从未改变过……"

    # game/script.rpy:64426
    old "I was out of my mind when I tried it with the storeroom door. I could travel to the past and close a door I've seen open, but if the past can't be changed, the explanation for that could be that I'd die of a sudden heart attack or something like that!"
    new "我真是疯了，才会拿储藏室的门做试验。我可以穿越回过去，关上一扇我见过开着的门；可如果过去无法改变，那解释就只可能是——我会猝死于心脏病之类的原因！"

    # game/script.rpy:64427
    old "There's no other way to know but to try it, though. ...And doing so is incredibly risky."
    new "可除此之外，没有别的办法能确认。……而这么做，风险大得惊人。"

    # game/script.rpy:64428
    old "Now what!? Technically, I could never die after traveling to the past, or else there'd be no future location to replicate.{w} Would I die by touching the Sekimeiya, then? There's no way to verify any of this...!"
    new "那又该怎么办！？严格说来，穿越回过去之后，我根本不可能死，否则就没有未来的位置可供复制了。{w}那么，我会因为触碰Sekimeiya而死吗？这些根本无从验证……！"

    # game/script.rpy:64429
    old "I was suddenly stuck, with no way to know whether what I wanted to accomplish was achievable. At the very least, my past travels seemed to confirm that I'd be alive on January 5th and January 26th."
    new "我一下子卡住了——我想做的事究竟能不能成，我无从得知。至少，我以往的那些穿越似乎证明，我在1月5日和1月26日都还活着。"

    # game/script.rpy:64433
    old "Is there a way to increase or decrease the chance that it's possible to change the past? Outright confirming it seems like it's off the table."
    new "有没有办法提高或降低改变过去的可能性？直接去证实，看来是行不通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64438
    old "I went to the kitchen, where I had both Sekimeiya."
    new "我去了厨房，两个Sekimeiya都收在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:64439
    old "I grabbed them and determined which one was the past one."
    new "我拿起它们，分辨出哪一个来自过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64440
    old "...What can I really do to check this?"
    new "……到底该怎么做，才能验证这一点？"

    # game/script.rpy:64442
    old "There was a salt shaker next to the stove."
    new "炉灶旁边有一个盐瓶。"

    # game/script.rpy:64443
    old "...I think this is all I can do."
    new "……看来只能这样了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64444
    old "I left it on the floor of the bedroom. Then, I stepped back to the kitchen and closed the door."
    new "我把它放在卧室地板上，随后退回厨房，关上了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:64448
    old "I waited a few minutes, thinking about what I would do. Once I was certain, I took out the Past Sekimeiya and looked at the bedroom."
    new "我等了几分钟，盘算着接下来该怎么做。拿定主意后，我取出过去Sekimeiya，望向卧室。"

    # game/script.rpy:64451
    old "The salt shaker was no longer on the floor. It was on the rightmost nightstand, next to a bunch of salt scattered around."
    new "盐瓶已经不在地板上了。它现在在最右侧的床头柜上，旁边散落着一摊盐。"

    # game/script.rpy:64453
    old "I looked at it intensely; I'd known it was going to be there."
    new "我紧紧盯着它；我早就知道它会在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:64457
    old "Then, I waited a bit before I touched the Sekimeiya in the kitchen. When I did, I went a few minutes back in time."
    new "接着，我稍等片刻，才去碰厨房里的那件Sekimeiya。一碰之下，我回到了几分钟之前。"

    # game/script.rpy:64464
    old "I appeared in the bathroom.{w} Silently, I glanced at the bedroom."
    new "我出现在浴室里。{w}我默不作声地朝卧室瞥了一眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:64467
    old "The salt shaker was on the floor, next to the closed door. I picked it up and slowly brought it to the nightstand."
    new "盐瓶在地板上，就在关着的门边。我把它捡起来，慢慢放到床头柜上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64469
    old "...There was no salt on it. Its wooden surface was perfectly clean."
    new "……上面没有盐。木质表面干干净净。"

    # game/script.rpy:64471
    old "So far, I've experienced both what occurs when you travel to the past with no intentions to change it and when you travel to the past with intentions to specifically not change it. What I don't know is what happens when you travel to the past wanting to change it—when all your actions have that intent."
    new "到目前为止，我经历过两种回到过去的情况：一种是无意改变过去，另一种是刻意不让过去改变。我不知道的是，若怀着改变的念头回去——若每个举动都带着这个意图——又会发生什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:64472
    old "...This might be a safe way to finally know."
    new "……也许，这样就能安全地弄清楚了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64473
    old "I gripped the salt shaker and held it over the nightstand."
    new "我握住盐瓶，把它举到床头柜上方。"

    # game/script.rpy:64474
    old "If I shake my hand, a bunch of salt will fall out. I've already seen a pattern of the scattered salt. However, my intention is not to repeat it. I want the past to change—I wish for that pattern to differ."
    new "只要我一抖手，盐就会撒落一片。那散开的形状我已经见过。但我并不想重演它。我希望过去发生改变——希望那形状与我所见的不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:64478
    old "Abruptly, I shook my hand, releasing countless bits of salt."
    new "我猛地一抖手，无数盐粒撒落下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:64479
    old "What would happen was not my call. I wanted the past to change, so if that was possible, I hoped the pattern would be different. If it wasn't possible, although I wouldn't do it on purpose, the pattern would be the same one I'd seen. The decision of whether the past would change was not mine; the universe would let me know instead. When my hand stopped still, I stared down."
    new "结果如何，不由我决定。我希望过去改变，所以若真能改变，我盼着那形状会有所不同。若改变不了，那形状便会与我见过的一模一样——当然，我并非有意要它如此。过去变不变，不是我所能决定的，宇宙自会给我答案。手停下后，我低头望去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64482
    old "...It was identical. Every last bit of salt had ended up exactly where I'd seen it despite my wishes to change history."
    new "……分毫不差。尽管我盼着改写历史，每一粒盐却都落在我见过的位置上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64484
    old "I could blow on it; I could make it change. However, that's impossible. Anyone who would blow on it wouldn't have made it here in the first place."
    new "我可以吹一口气，让它变样。可那不可能。会去吹散它的人，根本走不到这一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:64485
    old "With my head down, I walked back to the bathroom."
    new "我垂着头，走回浴室。"

    # game/script.rpy:64491
    old "Soon, my past self came out of the kitchen. He saw the salt pattern and went back in time."
    new "不一会儿，过去的我从厨房走了出来。他看见那摊盐的形状，便穿越回了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64493
    old "...It's funny. I thought I would appear in the bedroom instead, but I appeared in the bathroom."
    new "……真有意思。我原以为自己会出现在卧室，结果却出现在浴室。"

    # game/script.rpy:64494
    old "...Because I had no urge to leave. I had no idea what to do after that."
    new "……因为我当时不想离开。那之后该做什么，我毫无头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:64512
    old "Eventually, I had to go eat something. When I got back, I sat on the bed, unable to clear my mind."
    new "最后，我还是得去吃点东西。回来后，我坐在床上，脑子里乱成一团。"

    # game/script.rpy:64516
    old "...And when I went to sleep, I was just as lost. The past couldn't be changed, so there was no point to anything."
    new "……入睡时，我依旧茫然。过去无法改变，那么一切都没有意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:64526
    old "I got up wearing the same clothes. With a persistent feeling of impotence, I went down to the cafeteria."
    new "我穿着同一身衣服起身。那股无力感挥之不去，我下楼去了食堂。"

    # game/script.rpy:64533
    old "After everything I'd been through, saving Miiya was still impossible. However, I had seen her in the tower. That was the wild card, and it was what confused me the most."
    new "经历了这一切，我依旧救不了 Miiya。可是，我在塔里见过她。那是唯一的变数，也是最令我困惑的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:64534
    old "Had she really come from another world? ...Had her existence been another mere illusion? I did all I could to refuse that."
    new "她真的来自另一个世界吗？……还是说她的存在也不过是又一场幻觉？我竭尽全力不肯承认这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:64535
    old "If there was something I was sure of, it was that it wasn't up to me. It was evident the universe itself was what decided the outcome of everything."
    new "若说有哪一点是我确定的，那便是这一切不由我做主。万事的结果皆由宇宙本身裁定，这一点再清楚不过。"

    # game/script.rpy:64536
    old "A large part of my plan had been ripped to shreds, but the last bit was still in my mind. I could reunite with Shiroya. We could go back to our world and leave together."
    new "我的计划大半已被撕得粉碎，可最后一步仍留在我心里。我能与 Shiroya 重逢。我们可以回到自己的世界，一起离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:64537
    old "For that, I could change worlds at that very moment, but I knew everything would repeat. So in the world I was in, on December 15th, Miiya would be in the tower. ...I had to see that with my very own eyes."
    new "为此，我此刻就能切换世界，但我知道一切都会重演。所以，在我所处的这个世界，12月15日那天，Miiya 会出现在塔里。……我必须亲眼确认。"

    # game/script.rpy:64548
    old "{time=12:43.} November 28th..."
    new "{time=12:43.}11月28日……"

    # game/script.rpy:64549
    old "I hadn't left the motel once. I mustered the will to get up and lethargically exited the room."
    new "我一次也没离开过旅馆。好不容易提起劲起身，我拖着沉重的步子出了房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:64552
    old "It'll happen in two days. Am I really not going to do anything just because I've convinced myself that there's no point?"
    new "再过两天就要发生了。难道就因为我说服自己毫无意义，就真的什么都不做？"

    # game/script.rpy:64553
    old "It wasn't just that. I knew there was no point, and I didn't want to live through it again."
    new "不只是这样。我知道毫无意义，也不想再经历一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:64557
    old "When I came back up, all I could do was fall on the bed again."
    new "回到楼上，我只能再一次倒回床上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64558
    old "I shouldn't change worlds now. I have to wait here..."
    new "现在不能切换世界。我得在这里等……"

    # game/script.rpy:64559
    old "But there are many days left until the 15th. It's November 28th, so the Sekimeiya were found just yesterda—"
    new "可离15日还有好几天。今天是11月28日，那么 Sekimeiya 是昨天才被发现——"

    # game/script.rpy:64561
    old "Wait.{w} This is wrong...{w} That can't be the case...!"
    new "等等。{w}不对……{w}不可能这样……！"

    # game/script.rpy:64565
    old "I ran to the kitchen, but I stopped myself before I opened the refrigerator."
    new "我冲向厨房，却在打开冰箱前停住了手。"

    # game/script.rpy:64566
    old "No, I shouldn't open it. I have to think this through first."
    new "不，不能打开。我得先把这件事想清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:64567
    old "I entirely failed to consider this! Katei told us the Sekimeiya were found on November 27th..."
    new "我竟然完全没想到这一点！Katei 说过，Sekimeiya 是在11月27日被发现的……"

    # game/script.rpy:64568
    old "That's impossible, though! I have them right here!"
    new "可这不可能！它们明明就在我手上！"

    # game/script.rpy:64569
    old "In the attic, when I made a Sekimeiya travel with me, I couldn't duplicate it—the original one disappeared as soon as I appeared. Only one version of each can exist!"
    new "在阁楼时，我带着 Sekimeiya 一起穿越，却无法复制它——我一现身，原本那个就消失了。每个 Sekimeiya 都只能存在一个版本！"

    # game/script.rpy:64570
    old "So, when I appeared with them on the 24th, the ones on the mountain must've disappeared. It's already the 28th, and there's no way they were found yesterday!"
    new "所以，24日我带着它们现身时，山上的那些一定已经消失了。现在都28日了，它们绝不可能昨天才被发现！"

    # game/script.rpy:64574
    old "I stared at the shut door. The Sekimeiya had to be inside, but the past couldn't be changed. I couldn't witness its interior before thinking, as I hadn't actually seen the Sekimeiya since three days prior."
    new "我盯着紧闭的冰箱门。Sekimeiya 一定在里面，可过去无法改变。在理清头绪之前，我不能去看里面的情形——毕竟我已经三天没见过 Sekimeiya 了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64575
    old "If I opened the door and either saw them there or didn't see them there, it would be a fact locked in place. Not knowing for sure whether they were there or not was far smarter."
    new "一旦打开门，无论看见它们在还是不在，都会成为既定的事实。不确认它们到底在不在，反而更明智。"

    # game/script.rpy:64576
    old "It doesn't make any sense. I know the incident will occur on the 15th, so the Sekimeiya had to have been found."
    new "这说不通。我知道事件会在15日发生，所以 Sekimeiya 肯定已经被找到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64577
    old "The event was announced tomorrow, on the 29th. That can't happen if the Sekimeiya aren't found on the 27th."
    new "活动明天就会公布，也就是29日。如果 Sekimeiya 没在27日被发现，这件事就不可能发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:64578
    old "However, it would happen. It had to, or else everything would've been entirely different on the 15th."
    new "可是它确实发生了。它非发生不可，否则15日的一切就会截然不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:64579
    old "The tower had to be shut on the 15th, and I had to be there. ...That was how I could find Miiya and the real Shiroya."
    new "15日那天，塔一定会封闭，我也一定会在场。……只有这样，我才能找到 Miiya 和真正的 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:64580
    old "But I had the Sekimeiya. If that had removed the ones on the mountain, the butterfly effect would surely be immense.{w} That was why I had to consider a certain question and why I hadn't opened the refrigerator. ...Was there a way for the Sekimeiya to have been found the day before?"
    new "但我手里有 Sekimeiya。若因此让山上的那些消失，蝴蝶效应必然巨大。{w}所以我必须考虑一个问题，也才没有打开冰箱。……有没有可能，Sekimeiya 确实在前一天被发现了？"

    # game/script.rpy:64584
    old "...Is there any chance? If they were found, they can't be here anymore. Similarly, if they're here, they couldn't have been found.{w} Is it impossible...? That can't be..."
    new "……有这种可能吗？若它们被发现了，就不可能还在这里。同样，若它们还在这里，就不可能被发现过。{w}难道真的不可能……？不会的……"

    # game/script.rpy:64585
    old "There was one important fact: I knew where the Sekimeiya had been found. Katei had described an area that matched with a place I knew very well."
    new "有一个关键事实：我知道 Sekimeiya 是在哪里被发现的。Katei 描述的那片区域，和我非常熟悉的一个地方对得上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64586
    old "If they're here right now... I could travel to the past and appear with them again as long as I know I'll have them in the future. Then, I could leave them on the mountain before the 27th."
    new "如果它们此刻就在这里……只要我确定未来能拿到它们，我就能再次带着它们回到过去。这样，我就能在27日之前把它们留在山上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64587
    old "That doesn't work, though! The past would be changing. If I ever appear with them in the past, the ones in here would disappear, and I wouldn't be able to travel in the first place."
    new "可这样行不通！那等于改变过去。只要我带着它们在过去现身，这里的这些就会消失，那我从一开始就无法穿越了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64588
    old "It's... not possible. They couldn't have been found yesterday!{w} But the past can't change, can it? Does that mean they're not in the refrigerator anymore? If I never open it, should I assume that they made it to the mountain somehow?"
    new "这……不可能。它们不可能昨天就被发现了！{w}可过去是无法改变的，不是吗？那是不是说，它们已经不在冰箱里了？如果我始终不打开，是不是就该认定，它们以某种方式回到了山上？"

    # game/script.rpy:64589
    old "What if... someone traveled to the past after I did, holding the Sekimeiya? That's a way they could've disappeared from here."
    new "如果……有人在我之后带着 Sekimeiya 穿越回了过去呢？那样它们确实可能从这里消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:64590
    old "Was something like that what I had to assume? How the hell had the Sekimeiya even ended up on that mountain...? And why had they even gotten to Ashiya Tower given their powers?"
    new "难道我只能作这样的假设？Sekimeiya 究竟是怎么跑到那座山上去的……？凭它们的力量，又怎么会落到芦屋塔里？"

    # game/script.rpy:64594
    old "I recalled precisely what Katei had told us."
    new "我清楚记得 Katei 对我们说过的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:64613
    old "What he pointed at was the third Sekimeiya. The one that didn't work..."
    new "他指的是第三个 Sekimeiya。也就是那个没能起作用的……"

    # game/script.rpy:64614
    old "Where the hell did that one come from? There were three Sekimeiya since that morning."
    new "那一个到底是从哪儿来的？从那天早上起，就已经有三个 Sekimeiya 了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64615
    old "What really happened on the 27th? Were those three Sekimeiya found? And was that really the same place Shiroya and I used to go to?"
    new "27 日到底发生了什么？那三个 Sekimeiya 真的被找到了吗？还有，那真的是我和 Shiroya 以前常去的地方吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:64616
    old "...It can't be that only the third Sekimeiya was found. When Katei told us that story, he was definitely talking about all the Sekimeiya; they were all found by the same person. However, Katei never mentioned any other Sekimeiya existing that entire day. ...And I'm sure that he and Naomi knew about it."
    new "……不可能只找到了第三个 Sekimeiya。Katei 跟我们讲那段话时，说的肯定是所有 Sekimeiya；它们都是被同一个人找到的。可是，那一整天 Katei 都没提过还有别的 Sekimeiya 存在。……而且我敢肯定，他和 Naomi 都知道这件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:64617
    old "So, technically, I might have a way to make Katei's words into reality—that a Sekimeiya was found on the 27th. I only have to assume that he avoided saying when the others were."
    new "所以，严格来说，我也许有办法让 Katei 的话成真——确实有一个 Sekimeiya 是在 27 日被找到的。只要假设他刻意没说另外几个是什么时候被发现的就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:64618
    old "If the first one was found on the 27th, this makes sense."
    new "如果第一个是在 27 日找到的，那就说得通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64619
    old "There was another assumption I had to make: that I was no longer in possession of the Future Sekimeiya."
    new "我还得作出另一个假设：未来Sekimeiya 已经不在我手里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64621
    old "Finally, when the loop I had to make was in my head, I was ready to open the door."
    new "最后，等我把必须完成的因果循环在脑中理清，便准备开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:64628
    old "...A single Sekimeiya was there."
    new "……里面只有一个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:64630
    old "It's the Past Sekimeiya. This is all I can do to fix my mistake."
    new "是过去Sekimeiya。为了弥补我的过错，我只能做到这一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:64631
    old "I took it out as I glanced at the clock."
    new "我一边把它取出来，一边瞥了眼时钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:64634
    old "I could still go to the past. I could make it back to the 27th."
    new "我还能回到过去。还能回到 27 日。"

    # game/script.rpy:64635
    old "Once there, I had to take the Future Sekimeiya out of the refrigerator and bring it to the mountain so that it'd be found on that day."
    new "到了那里，我得从冰箱里取出未来Sekimeiya，带到山上，让它在那天被人发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:64636
    old "Then, after the point I travel, the Past Sekimeiya will have to be left there too. It'll be found after the 27th, but that doesn't contradict anything that we were told."
    new "然后，在我穿越到的时间点之后，我也得把过去Sekimeiya留在那里。它会在 27 日以后被发现，这跟我们听过的说法并不矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:64639
    old "The temperature in the motel wasn't the same as the tower's, so the amount of time I had to store was different."
    new "旅馆里的温度和塔里不一样，所以我需要蓄能的时间也不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:64640
    old "Fortunately, the formula was the same, so after I noted down how far I traveled after storing two minutes, I knew how long I had to wait to make it a day back."
    new "幸运的是，规律并没有变。我记下蓄能两分钟后能穿越多远，也就算出了要回到一天前需要等多久。"

    # game/script.rpy:64641
    old "It was a little over half an hour, but I couldn't touch it there due to the large range that would form."
    new "需要等半个多小时，但在那里不能碰它，因为会形成很大的重叠范围。"

    # game/script.rpy:64642
    old "...I'm certain it still gathers energy outside if it's in the suitcase, because when I touched the Sekimeiya after arriving here, I traveled a lot farther into the future than expected."
    new "……我敢肯定，就算把它装在箱子里，它仍会继续蓄能。因为我到这里后一碰 Sekimeiya，向未来穿越的距离就比预想远得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:64643
    old "I put the Sekimeiya and the clock inside the suitcase before walking down the stairs with the motel keys."
    new "我把 Sekimeiya 和时钟放进箱子，然后拿着旅馆钥匙下了楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:64648
    old "Below, I stepped out of the motel for the first time and walked toward one of the tallest mountains I could see past the buildings."
    new "到了楼下，我第一次走出旅馆，朝越过建筑望得见的最高的几座山峰之一走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64653
    old "I kept going until Airun's slope was before me, close to Ashiya Tower. Far in the past, there had been a path up the mountain, but I could no longer distinguish it."
    new "我一直走到 Airun 的山坡前——那里离芦屋塔很近。很久以前，这座山上曾有一条小路，可如今我已经辨认不出了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64654
    old "When I stepped up, my feet sank deep into the snow. The layer there was much thicker, and it showed clear signs of human presence."
    new "我一脚踏上去，脚便深陷雪中。这里的积雪厚得多，还留有明显的人迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:64657
    old "Soon, the trees began to cast many shadows around me, but I hadn't lost track of where I was. My legs continued moving autonomously until the sun was visible again."
    new "很快，树木在身边投下重重阴影，我却仍清楚自己身在何处。双腿仿佛自有意识般继续向前，直到阳光重新出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:64663
    old "This place..."
    new "这个地方……"

    # game/script.rpy:64664
    old "A vast field surrounded by trees. It had been quite a few years since I'd been there, as evidenced by the tall grass that had grown in."
    new "一片被树林环抱的广阔空地。我已经有好几年没来过这里了，丛生的高草便是明证。"

    # game/script.rpy:64665
    old "This is where the Sekimeiya were found. I can't believe it.{w} How is that even possible? This was our special place..."
    new "那几个 Sekimeiya 就是在这里被发现的。真不敢相信。{w}这怎么可能？这里明明是我们最特别的地方……"

    # game/script.rpy:64666
    old "I trudged along and arrived at a cabin tucked next to the treeline."
    new "我深一脚浅一脚地走过去，来到一间紧挨着林边的小木屋。"

    # game/script.rpy:64671
    old "Now this place hasn't changed much..."
    new "这里倒是没怎么变……"

    # game/script.rpy:64672
    old "Who had been the last person to open that door? The inside looked exactly like the cabin in my memories. After taking a look around, I noticed something thrown away in a corner."
    new "上一个打开这扇门的会是谁？屋里和我记忆中的木屋一模一样。环顾一圈后，我注意到角落里有个被丢弃的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:64674
    old "It was a stuffed tiger, much smaller than I recalled. It didn't seem damaged, and it looked at me with the same smile as always. Sitting on the wood, it appeared to be waiting for Shiroya to come back and put him in the small pocket of her school bag, from where he would peek out at the vast mountain landscape."
    new "那是一只老虎玩偶，比我记忆中小得多。它看起来没有破损，仍带着一如既往的笑容望着我。它坐在木头上，仿佛在等 Shiroya 回来，把它放进书包的小口袋里，好从那里探出头，眺望辽阔的山景。"

    # game/script.rpy:64678
    old "...I stepped back out, opened the suitcase, and looked at the clock. It was {time=14:03.}"
    new "……我重新走到屋外，打开箱子，看了看时钟。时间是 {time=14:03.}"

    # game/script.rpy:64680
    old "After that, I tested how far I'd travel if I kept the Sekimeiya in the suitcase for two minutes."
    new "之后，我测试了一下：把 Sekimeiya 在箱子里放两分钟，能穿越多远。"

    # game/script.rpy:64686
    old "I appeared inside the cabin, next to the door. When I looked outside, I saw myself in the middle of the field.{w} 35 seconds later, I disappeared."
    new "我出现在木屋里，就在门边。朝外望去，我看见自己站在空地中央。{w}三十五秒后，那个我便消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64689
    old "So I'll have to keep it in the suitcase for about forty minutes. I want to make it to yesterday morning."
    new "看来得让它在箱子里待上四十分钟左右。我要回到昨天早上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64692
    old "The Sekimeiya was on the grass, next to the suitcase and the clock. I put it inside at {time=14:05.}"
    new "Sekimeiya 就放在草地上，旁边是箱子和时钟。我在 {time=14:05.} 把它放了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64696
    old "I had to leave the suitcase there. Surprisingly, the cabin made for a good shelter from the cold."
    new "我不得不把箱子留在那里。没想到这间木屋还挺能御寒。"

    # game/script.rpy:64697
    old "It had a bed and a hatch in the floor, leading to an empty basement. There was much less dust than I had imagined, but I busied myself wiping it off."
    new "屋里有一张床，地板上还有个通往空地下室的活板门。灰尘比我预想的少得多，但我还是忙着把灰擦掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:64702
    old "I couldn't get over the fact that the Sekimeiya had been found there, but perhaps I was too full of myself for thinking that it could've been anything more than a coincidence."
    new "Sekimeiya 竟然会在那里被发现，我一直难以释怀。不过，也许是我太把自己当回事，才会觉得这不只是巧合。"

    # game/script.rpy:64703
    old "I spent the last stretch sitting on a bed. I could see the suitcase through the window, and at {time=14:43}, I stood up."
    new "最后那段时间，我一直坐在床上。透过窗户能看见那只箱子。到 {time=14:43}，我站起身来。"

    # game/script.rpy:64704
    old "I grabbed the clock and walked outside."
    new "我抓起时钟，走了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64707
    old "I'll have to touch it as soon as I open the suitcase."
    new "一打开箱子，我就得立刻碰到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:64708
    old "I locked my eyes on those numbers. As soon as {time=14:45} appeared, I opened it."
    new "我死死盯着那些数字。{time=14:45} 一出现，我便打开了箱子。"

    # game/script.rpy:64710
    old "That time, when my right hand reached for the Sekimeiya, my left one gripped the suitcase's handle."
    new "这一次，我右手伸向 Sekimeiya，左手同时握住了箱子的提手。"

    # game/script.rpy:64717
    old "In an instant, the sun disappeared. I was in the motel, and seconds later, I noticed the faint noise surrounding me."
    new "转眼间，太阳消失了。我回到了旅馆，几秒后，才注意到周围那阵微弱的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:64719
    old "It was my own self sleeping. When I glanced at the clock, I saw the red numbers I'd expected: {time=7:01.} November 27th."
    new "睡在那里的正是我自己。我瞥了一眼时钟，红色数字正如我所料：{time=7:01.}11月27日。"

    # game/script.rpy:64720
    old "I felt the motel keys in my pocket, and my hands weren't empty. One was holding the suitcase, while the other had a replica of the clock. However, its screen was blank."
    new "我摸了摸口袋里的旅馆钥匙，两只手也都不是空的。一只手提着行李箱，另一只手拿着那台时钟的复制品。只是它的屏幕一片空白。"

    # game/script.rpy:64721
    old "This again..."
    new "又是这一幕……"

    # game/script.rpy:64722
    old "I'd held them when I touched the Sekimeiya so that they wouldn't remain on the field. Only the Past Sekimeiya had been left there so that it was found later."
    new "触碰 Sekimeiya 的时候，我把这些东西都握在手里，免得它们留在空地上。我只把 过去Sekimeiya 留在了那里，好让后来的人发现它。"

    # game/script.rpy:64726
    old "I stepped to the kitchen without making noise. When I opened the refrigerator, I saw both Sekimeiya."
    new "我悄无声息地走到厨房。打开冰箱时，两个 Sekimeiya 都在里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:64729
    old "I grabbed the one on the left—the Future Sekimeiya."
    new "我拿起左边的那个——未来Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:64730
    old "...I suppose I have to hurry. I didn't see the Future Sekimeiya in the field, which means that it'll be taken today."
    new "……看来我得抓紧了。空地上没有 未来Sekimeiya，也就是说，它今天就会被人取走。"

    # game/script.rpy:64731
    old "I put it in the suitcase and walked out."
    new "我把它放进箱子，走了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64738
    old "The sun was beginning to rise. I took the same route back to Airun."
    new "太阳刚刚升起。我沿着原路返回艾伦山。"

    # game/script.rpy:64740
    old "I walked up, carving a path through the trees. Eventually, I stopped myself and looked back."
    new "我一路往上，在树丛间开出一条路。走了一段后，我停下脚步，回头望去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64742
    old "...I'm leaving the traces of footprints I saw."
    new "……我留下的，正是我见过的那些脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:64745
    old "I kept going up until I arrived at the field, covered by the shadows cast by the tall trees. Before I got to the cabin, I took the Sekimeiya out and left it on the ground."
    new "我继续向上，终于来到那片空地——高树的影子笼罩着它。还没走到小屋，我就取出 Sekimeiya，放在地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64746
    old "I'm sure I would've seen it if it had still been here."
    new "要是它还在那儿，我不可能没看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:64749
    old "Oh, it's a lot dustier in here...{w} I suppose that makes sense; I have to stay until I can return to the motel."
    new "哦，这里的灰可真多……{w}也难怪，我得一直待到能回旅馆的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:64750
    old "I had to spend a full night inside. I'd done it in the past, but a story from earlier in 2011 made me feel a little unnerved at the prospect..."
    new "我得在这里面待上整整一夜。这样的事我以前也做过，可2011年早些时候听来的一个故事，让我一想到这一夜就心里发怵……"

    # game/script.rpy:64751
    old "It'll be fine. It's not so cold that I'm going to freeze, and it's only one night."
    new "不会有事的。还没冷到会把我冻坏，何况只有一晚。"

    # game/script.rpy:64755
    old "It was nothing new. I just had to wait there like I'd been doing in the motel."
    new "这也没什么新鲜的。我只要像在旅馆里那样，在那里等着就行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64756
    old "Strangely, the cabin made it easy. The memories all came to me as I stared at the little tiger on the floor. I didn't want to take him with me—Shiroya and I would come back for the one in our world. After a while, I removed the dust from all the wooden furniture, doing my best not to breathe in."
    new "奇怪的是，待在小屋里反而容易熬过去。我盯着地上那只小老虎，往事一件件涌上来。我不想把它带走——属于我们那个世界的那一只，我和 Shiroya 会回来取的。过了一会儿，我把所有木制家具上的灰都擦掉，尽量屏着呼吸。"

    # game/script.rpy:64757
    old "The clock I had wasn't working, so I had to rely on the sun to know the time. Before it set, what I'd been expecting finally happened."
    new "我手上那台钟不走了，只能靠太阳判断时间。太阳还没落山，我一直等着的事终于发生了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64758
    old "Through the window, I saw an old man emerging from the trees. He slowly got closer, stunned by the place he'd discovered."
    new "透过窗户，我看见一个老人从林中走出来。他慢慢靠近，显然被眼前这处地方惊住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64759
    old "When I saw his face, I recognized him. He was the owner of Musashi Gemstones."
    new "看清他的脸时，我认出了他——武藏宝石的店主。"

    # game/script.rpy:64760
    old "He stopped in the middle of the field. He crouched down, and I saw the Sekimeiya between his gloves."
    new "他在空地中央停下，蹲下身去。我看见他戴着手套的双手之间夹着 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:64761
    old "...What the hell is going to happen with it? I know it'll be discovered that cold temperature is needed for it, but will it really be brought to Ashiya with no one having an understanding of its powers?"
    new "……这东西之后到底会怎么样？我知道人们会发现它需要低温保存，可难道在没人理解它力量的情况下，它真的会被送到芦屋去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:64763
    old "Wait... is he coming in here?"
    new "等等……他要进来？"

    # game/script.rpy:64771
    old "The door to the cabin opened. Keeping my mouth shut, I waited until it closed again."
    new "小屋的门开了。我没有出声，一直等到门重新关上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64773
    old "Once it did, I emerged from below. I could see the man walking away through the window."
    new "门一关上，我便从下面钻了出来。透过窗户，能看见那老人正往远处走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64775
    old "...That's it, then. Everything happened as intended. Of course, the past didn't change."
    new "……这样就算结束了。一切都按计划发生了。当然，过去并没有改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:64776
    old "I sighed faintly before falling back on the bed."
    new "我轻轻叹了口气，往后倒在床上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64777
    old "...I'm getting really hungry, and I don't have water either."
    new "……我饿得厉害，连水也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:64780
    old "At the very least, I became tired fairly quickly. Soon, light stopped coming through the window, disappearing along with my awareness."
    new "至少我很快就困了。不久，窗外不再透进光亮，我的意识也随之沉了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64787
    old "It was the third time I'd woken up on November 28th of 2011. I felt exhausted, and I had to walk all the way down the mountain path again."
    new "这是我第三次在2011年11月28日醒来。我浑身疲惫，还得再沿着山路一路走下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64788
    old "I should go as soon as possible, seeing as I still have some energy. ...I need to eat and use the bathroom too."
    new "趁现在还有点力气，我该尽快动身。……我还得吃饭，还得去趟洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:64792
    old "Yawning, I put the clock in the suitcase and drowsily moved through the rows of trees. The sun was well past the mountains, so I'd slept for a long time.{w} I entered the streets of Yushibana and walked to Eagle Motel."
    new "我打着哈欠把时钟放进箱子，昏昏沉沉地穿过一排排树。太阳早已越过山头，看来我睡了很久。{w}我走进丰花的街道，朝鹰旅馆走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64797
    old "I quickly looked at the time: it was {time=10:29.}"
    new "我赶紧看了一眼时间：{time=10:29.}"

    # game/script.rpy:64798
    old "There's still a while until my past self comes to the cafeteria, so I can be there until then."
    new "距离过去的自己来餐厅还有一段时间，在那之前我可以一直待在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:64801
    old "It was an open buffet, so nobody would be surprised by my eating habits when I came back down. I took my time, only accepting that I was full once about an hour had passed."
    new "这里是自助餐，等会儿我再下楼，也没人会对我吃的量感到奇怪。我慢慢吃，过了大约一个小时，才觉得自己吃饱了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64803
    old "I waited, hidden from view, until my past self came down. Soon after I left, I reappeared from the stairs, holding the suitcase and wearing an uneasy expression."
    new "我躲起来等着，直到过去的自己下楼来。过去的我离开后不久，又从楼梯上重新出现，提着行李箱，脸上带着不安的神色。"

    # game/script.rpy:64804
    old "Finally I could go back up. I unlocked the bedroom and staggered in."
    new "我终于可以回楼上了。我打开卧室门锁，踉跄着走进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64809
    old "...I don't have the Sekimeiya anymore. Now I can only change worlds on December 15th."
    new "……Sekimeiya 已经不在我手上了。现在，我只能等到12月15日才能切换世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:64810
    old "I'd had them sitting in the refrigerator for so long without using them. It was undeniable that I could've obtained anything with them; Sai had once talked about winning the lottery with ease.{w} But I hadn't worried about that because of the single guarantee I possessed: on January 5th, I would have both Sekimeiya."
    new "它们就那么一直放在冰箱里，这么久我都没用过。不可否认，有它们在，我什么都弄得到；Sai 还说过，用它们中彩票轻而易举。{w}可我并不为此担心，因为我握着一个绝对的保证：1月5日，两个 Sekimeiya 都会在我手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:64811
    old "I can't rest easy for today just yet. In the afternoon, I have to make sure to be in possession of the keys, clock, and suitcase. Otherwise, they would've disappeared when I touched the Sekimeiya on Airun."
    new "今天还不能就此松懈。下午我必须确保钥匙、时钟和行李箱都在我手上。否则，我在艾伦山触碰 Sekimeiya 的时候，它们就会消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:64820
    old "Two days passed. It was November 30th, a day that would never fade from my memory. The Sekimeiya event had been announced the previous day, so everything would happen in the same way."
    new "两天过去了。到了11月30日——这一天，我永远不会忘记。Sekimeiya 的展出消息前一天就已公布，所以一切都会照原样发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:64825
    old "I didn't leave the room. By the time the evening came, I was stuck in a loop of reliving the explosion and its aftermath, shaking my head to drive those thoughts away, and having them return not long after."
    new "我没有离开房间。到了傍晚，我陷进了循环：一遍遍重温那场爆炸和之后的一切，摇头把念头赶走，没多久它们又回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64826
    old "...And there was nothing I could do to stop it. If I'd tried to, I would have failed miserably."
    new "……而我无力阻止。就算真去试，也只会一败涂地。"

    # game/script.rpy:64827
    old "I attempted to close my eyes, doubting I would ever fall asleep."
    new "我试着闭上眼，却不觉得自己能睡着。"

    # game/script.rpy:64838
    old "{time=7:11.} December 1st.{w} I'd gotten new batteries for the clock and confirmed it was accurate. I gingerly rubbed my eyes, grateful that I'd at least been able to sleep a little."
    new "{time=7:11.}12月1日。{w}我给时钟换了新电池，确认它走得准。我轻轻揉了揉眼睛，庆幸自己至少还睡了一会儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:64839
    old "When I fully regained my senses, I quickly got up and dashed out of the room."
    new "等我彻底清醒过来，便立刻起身，冲出房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:64842
    old "...The news. I need to see what happened."
    new "……新闻。我得看看发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:64843
    old "I had a fact to work with—Miiya would exist on December 15th. Nervous at what I'd find, I intently watched the television."
    new "我手上有一条可以依据的事实——12月15日，Miiya 还会存在。我忐忑不安，紧盯着电视。"

    # game/script.rpy:64844
    old "The news was just starting. Before I could think, I saw text scrolling horizontally."
    new "新闻刚刚开始。我还没来得及细想，就看见一行字横向滚动过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64845
    old "\"Gas explosion in Yushibana\".{w} At a low volume, a reporter began to talk about it."
    new "「丰花发生瓦斯爆炸。」{w} 记者低声开始了报道。"

    # game/script.rpy:64848
    old "Last night, a gas explosion occurred at a gem shop in Yushibana. An unknown individual released smoke that knocked four people unconscious, and some time later, the explosion occurred due to a gas heater that had depleted its surrounding oxygen.{w} Given the size of the explosion, the flame had been out before the smoke's release. Since everyone present was unconscious, nobody was able to recognize the artificial smell of the gas, which had no way to leave the enclosed space. At {time=21}, when the lights were turned on, the presence of smoke and gas caused a dust explosion."
    new "昨晚，丰花的一家宝石店发生瓦斯爆炸。一名不明身份者释放烟雾，导致四人昏迷；其后，一台耗尽了周围氧气的瓦斯暖炉引发了爆炸。{w} 从爆炸的规模来看，在烟雾释放之前，火焰便已熄灭。由于在场者全部昏迷，没人能察觉出瓦斯那股人工气味，而封闭的空间又让瓦斯无处散去。{time=21}，灯光亮起时，积聚的烟雾与瓦斯引发了粉尘爆炸。"

    # game/script.rpy:64849
    old "The blast hit two young girls who'd fallen unconscious, nineteen and twenty years of age. One of them was taken to the hospital after falling through the broken floor, but her condition is stable, as she was shielded by a shelf. The body of the other girl has not yet been found, but the chances that she is alive are slim."
    new "爆炸波及两名昏迷的年轻女孩，一个十九岁，一个二十岁。其中一人从炸裂的地板坠落，被送往医院，但因为有货架挡住，伤势稳定。另一人的遗体尚未找到，生还的可能十分渺茫。"

    # game/script.rpy:64850
    old "The other two people, a nineteen-year-old boy and the owner of the shop, were far enough from the heater that they avoided major damage.{w} The identity of the person who released the smoke is being investigated, as is their motive. Despite the outcome, it is unlikely that the explosion was intentional, and nothing has been reported as stolen."
    new "另外两人——一名十九岁的少年和店主——离暖炉较远，避开了严重的伤害。{w} 释放烟雾者的身份与动机仍在调查。尽管结果如此，爆炸多半并非蓄意为之，也没有任何失窃的报告。"

    # game/script.rpy:64854
    old "...{w}I see. This is before they found her jaw. I don't even know why I thought I could expect anything else."
    new "……{w}原来如此。现在还没到找到她下颌骨的时候。我都不知道自己凭什么觉得会有别的结果。"

    # game/script.rpy:64855
    old "After hearing everything again, my heart dropped into a black abyss. It almost felt like I'd been told the news for the first time again.{w} ...I really was powerless. The immense power I'd been able to wield meant nothing."
    new "再次听完这一切，我的心沉入了漆黑的深渊。几乎又像是头一次听到这个消息。{w}……我果然无能为力。我曾能驾驭的那股庞大力量，此刻毫无意义。"

    # game/script.rpy:64865
    old "Over two weeks were left until the 15th. Miserable, I shut myself in the bedroom. Knowing what was coming wasn't enough—I wound up isolating myself from the world in the exact same way I had the first time."
    new "距离十五日还有两周多。我郁郁寡欢，把自己关在卧室里。光知道将要发生什么并无用处——我最终还是像第一次那样，把自己与世界隔绝开来。"

    # game/script.rpy:64866
    old "I wanted to see Shiroya. My thoughts were a mess, but all the uncertain possibilities ahead of me made me listless."
    new "我想见 Shiroya。脑子里乱作一团，可前方那些不确定的可能，让我提不起半点精神。"

    # game/script.rpy:64877
    old "The next time I stepped out of the motel was on December 9th, a Friday. Late in the evening, there was a place I wanted to go."
    new "我再次走出鹰旅馆，是在十二月九日，星期五。那天深夜，有个地方我想去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64878
    old "On the 15th, I would be able to use the Sekimeiya again. It was mandatory for me to be there and that the past would repeat."
    new "到了十五日，我就能再次使用 Sekimeiya。我必须到场，过去也必须重演。"

    # game/script.rpy:64879
    old "However, naturally, I couldn't be in the lobby with everyone else. ...I had to enter the other way."
    new "可是，我自然不能和别人一起待在大厅里。……我得从另一处进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:64884
    old "Ashiya Tower was before me. I could see people through the door and light behind all the windows."
    new "芦屋塔就在眼前。透过大门能看见人影，每扇窗后都亮着灯。"

    # game/script.rpy:64885
    old "The Sekimeiya have to be inside. Ashiya are waiting for Xyn's attack."
    new "Sekimeiya 一定在里面。芦屋家正等着 Xyn 来袭。"

    # game/script.rpy:64886
    old "If I found them, perhaps I could change worlds before the incident, even though that wasn't my goal."
    new "如果找到它们，我也许能在事件发生前就切换世界——尽管那并非我的目的。"

    # game/script.rpy:64887
    old "...I felt the rusty surface of a key in my pocket. I would have to use it to enter the tower without being seen."
    new "……我摸到口袋里一把钥匙生锈的表面。进塔时要不被人发现，我只能靠它。"

    # game/script.rpy:64893
    old "Before that, I stepped into the lobby. After being checked for any devices, I approached the reception desk and bought an entry pass to the hallways."
    new "在那之前，我先走进了大厅。接受完随身设备的检查，我走到前台，买了一张通往各走廊的通行证。"

    # game/script.rpy:64896
    old "I wanted to enter the tower in case I could pinpoint the Sekimeiya's location. I was curious to know if both had been found."
    new "我想进塔，好确认 Sekimeiya 的位置。我也好奇，两件是不是都已经找到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64897
    old "However, I was met with a \"Forbidden Entry\" sign on the door to the event room."
    new "然而，活动室的门上却挂着「禁止入内」的牌子。"

    # game/script.rpy:64898
    old "As expected, they're being kept in here.{w} I shouldn't bother checking inside. That could bring me problems, and there's no way only one was found anyway..."
    new "果然，它们被收在这里。{w} 我不该多此一举进去查看。那只会给我惹麻烦，而且怎么可能只找到一件……"

    # game/script.rpy:64899
    old "I knew the cameras around me were displaying my image in the security room. Katei shouldn't have been there, but someone was watching my movements."
    new "我知道，四周的摄像头正把我的影像送进监控室。Katei 应该不在那里，可总有人在盯着我的一举一动。"

    # game/script.rpy:64900
    old "...I wonder if whoever's in the security room also knows about the storeroom's secret."
    new "……不知道监控室里的人，是否也知道储藏室的秘密。"

    # game/script.rpy:64903
    old "As if I was visiting the place normally, I entered a few crystal rooms and looked through their cabinets. All the gemstones were the same as on the 15th."
    new "我装作寻常参观的样子，进了几间水晶展室，逐一查看展示柜。里面的宝石和十五日那天毫无二致。"

    # game/script.rpy:64907
    old "Then, as I went through hallway A, I stopped myself before the storeroom. I opened its door curiously and peeked inside."
    new "随后，我沿 A走廊走过，在储藏室前停下了脚步。我好奇地推开门，朝里面张望。"

    # game/script.rpy:64910
    old "I wanted to see if my key would unlock the door. When I'd been in the tower, it hadn't unlocked that exit from the inside. I closed the door behind me and rapidly opened the secret wall."
    new "我想确认这把钥匙能不能打开那扇门。上次在塔里时，它没能从内侧打开那个出口。我关上身后的门，迅速推开暗墙。"

    # game/script.rpy:64914
    old "The handle was there, and with the rusty key inserted into the keyhole, a rough turn unlocked it."
    new "把手还在。我把生锈的钥匙插进锁孔，用力一转，锁开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64918
    old "The door opened. Through a small gap, I could see the snowy grass next to the tower."
    new "门开了。透过一道窄缝，我看见塔旁覆着白雪的草地。"

    # game/script.rpy:64921
    old "I frowned, but I couldn't waste time. As if nothing had happened, I stepped back to the hallway."
    new "我皱起眉，却不能再耽搁。我若无其事地退回走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:64926
    old "The few people there didn't seem to mind me, so I walked back to the lobby."
    new "那里只有寥寥几个人，似乎都没在意我，我便回到了大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:64927
    old "Why did it not work on the 15th? No matter how much I tried, the lock wouldn't budge..."
    new "十五日那天为什么打不开？不管我怎么试，那把锁都纹丝不动……"

    # game/script.rpy:64928
    old "Whatever the reason was, it had worked in my favor. Katei hadn't been able to escape, and if he had, when the others found the door, they would've been able to get out too. With things like that, I wouldn't have been able to figure out the mechanics behind the Sekimeiya."
    new "不管原因是什么，这对我来说都是好事。Katei 没能逃出去；要是他逃走了，等其他人发现那扇门，他们也能出去。那样的话，我就没法弄清 Sekimeiya 背后的机制了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64929
    old "I couldn't be calm, though. If the key wouldn't work on the 15th, perhaps I wouldn't be able to enter the tower."
    new "可我心里仍不安稳。要是十五日那天钥匙不管用，我也许就进不了塔。"

    # game/script.rpy:64934
    old "I haven't seen you here before, have I? Have you taken a look at this?"
    new "我以前没在这里见过你吧？这个你看过了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:64937
    old "I was about to step out when a voice called for me.{w} It was the receptionist, who held out a green paper that I recognized."
    new "我正要出门，有人叫住了我。{w} 是前台的那位，她递来一张我认得的绿色传单。"

    # game/script.rpy:64938
    old "...The Sekimeiya event, right? I've heard about it, yes."
    new "……是 Sekimeiya 的活动吧？我听说过。"

    # game/script.rpy:64939
    old "I'm glad you have. Have you decided if you'll come back?"
    new "很高兴你听说过这件事。你决定好要再来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:64940
    old "...I might."
    new "……也许吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:64941
    old "Fantastic! I'll see you there, then."
    new "太好了！那就到时候见。"

    # game/script.rpy:64943
    old "...Huh."
    new "……哦。"

    # game/script.rpy:64947
    old "I grabbed the flyer as she waved. By the time I stepped out of the building, the sun was completely gone. Only the cold was left, and nobody was outside."
    new "她挥着手，我接过了传单。等我走出大楼，太阳已经完全落山。外面只剩寒冷，一个人也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:64949
    old "I walked to the left side of the building, hearing the woman's words replay in my mind."
    new "我绕到大楼左侧，那女人的话在脑中反复回响。"

    # game/script.rpy:64952
    old "...I did see her. I remember that."
    new "……我确实见过她。这一点我记得。"

    # game/script.rpy:64955
    old "I went to the wall where the secret door was. Stepping on the tall grass, I felt the surface of the wall carefully until I was next to the storeroom."
    new "我走向藏有暗门的那面墙，踩着高高的野草，仔细摸索墙面，一直摸到储藏室旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:64957
    old "This is the door. I can see the keyhole too."
    new "就是这扇门。锁孔也看得见。"

    # game/script.rpy:64958
    old "I had left it slightly open, so it was easy to find. With the key, I verified that I could lock and unlock it from the outside."
    new "刚才我让它留了一条缝，所以很容易找到。我用钥匙试过，从外面能锁上，也能打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:64961
    old "...It works. I should be able to enter through it as long as it still works on the 15th..."
    new "……没问题。只要十五日那天还能用，我应该就能从这里进去……"

    # game/script.rpy:64968
    old "I walked away with the uneasiness that the receptionist's words had caused."
    new "前台那番话让我心里不安，我就这样离开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64969
    old "I'll see you there, then."
    new "那就到时候见。"

    # game/script.rpy:64971
    old "When Shiroya and I stepped into the tower, she didn't react to me at all. We were there extremely early and spent hours in the lobby, but it was as if she'd never seen me. That makes sense, of course—in that world, she hadn't."
    new "我和 Shiroya 走进芦屋塔时，她对我毫无反应。我们到得极早，在大厅里待了好几个小时，可她却像从没见过我。当然，这也难怪——在那个世界里，她确实没见过我。"

    # game/script.rpy:64972
    old "But in this one, when Shiroya and I enter the tower, the receptionist won't react the same way, will she? ...Because of the brief conversation we just had."
    new "可在这个世界，我和 Shiroya 走进芦屋塔时，前台那位应该就不会是同样的反应了吧？……毕竟我们刚刚才说过那几句话。"

    # game/script.rpy:64973
    old "Didn't that mean... that I'd changed the past? I had changed something that I'd experienced in the other world."
    new "那不就意味着……我改变了过去？我改变了在另一个世界里亲身经历过的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:64977
    old "...I began to walk somewhere."
    new "……我迈开步子，走向某处。"

    # game/script.rpy:64978
    old "Of course, this world isn't identical. What happened on the 15th was different, but none of that was related to my presence, was it?"
    new "当然，这个世界并不完全相同。15号发生的事不一样，可那些事都跟我在不在场无关，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:64979
    old "...There might've been a big mistake in my reasoning."
    new "……我的推理也许有个很大的错误。"

    # game/script.rpy:64980
    old "Why was I not able to change the salt pattern? ...Because I had already seen it. In that sense, the past couldn't be changed."
    new "为什么我改不了盐的图案？……因为我已经看过它了。从这个意义上说，过去无法改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:64981
    old "However, in this world, I never did experience the wait in the lobby before the hallway doors opened. I could've caused that event to differ from my world's, but I never truly changed this world's history."
    new "可是在这个世界里，我从未经历过走廊门打开前在大厅等候的那段时光。我本可以让那件事与我的世界有所不同，但我终究没有真正改变这个世界的历史。"

    # game/script.rpy:64987
    old "I came to a very familiar street. It was my own, and I could see my house far ahead."
    new "我走到一条再熟悉不过的街道。那是我家所在的那条街，远远就能看见我的房子。"

    # game/script.rpy:64988
    old "There was light behind two of the windows."
    new "有两扇窗后透出灯光。"

    # game/script.rpy:64989
    old "...{w}Our sleep schedule was all over the place. I spent most nights awake."
    new "……{w}我们的作息彻底乱了。大部分夜晚我都醒着。"

    # game/script.rpy:64990
    old "I couldn't see my own outline, but I remembered staring through that window every night. For that reason, the image I'd always seen was still engraved in my mind."
    new "我看不见自己的轮廓，但我记得自己每晚都从那个窗口望出去。正因如此，我早已看惯的那幕景象仍深深刻在脑海里。"

    # game/script.rpy:64994
    old "I got closer to my house, hiding myself behind the gate."
    new "我朝自己家走近，藏到院门后面。"

    # game/script.rpy:64995
    old "A lot of snow had piled up on it. Without thinking twice, I shook it all off."
    new "门上积了厚厚的雪。我想也没想，就把雪全抖掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:64997
    old "...{w}I was right. I changed my past, but not the past of the Atsuki from this world. In my memories, the snow piled on the gate never fell."
    new "……{w}我猜对了。我改变的是我自己的过去，而不是这个世界的 Atsuki 的过去。在我的记忆里，门上那堆积雪从未落下。"

    # game/script.rpy:64998
    old "No rule had changed. I hadn't erased what I'd lived through. What had once happened couldn't be reversed."
    new "规则没有改变。我经历过的事并没有被抹去。已经发生过的，无法倒转。"

    # game/script.rpy:64999
    old "However... I truly had power in the world I was in. It was a real second chance. I couldn't change my own past, but I had just changed the other Atsuki's past."
    new "然而……在我身处的这个世界里，我确实拥有力量。那是真正的第二次机会。我改变不了自己的过去，可就在刚才，我改变了另一个 Atsuki 的过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:65000
    old "I'd thought that everything would happen as the universe had decided—that my input would always be meaningless. ...But that wasn't the case. I had taken an action all by myself and changed something."
    new "我原以为一切都会依照宇宙既定的轨迹发生——我的所作所为永远毫无意义。……可事实并非如此。我凭自己的意志采取行动，改变了一些东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:65006
    old "I locked up. Did that mean that I could've saved Miiya? If I hadn't waited in the motel, could I have prevented her death?"
    new "我僵住了。那岂不是说，我本可以救下 Miiya？如果我没有在旅馆里干等，是不是就能阻止她的死？"

    # game/script.rpy:65007
    old "Even if that was the case, I had already failed. I had failed to do it, and it was irreversible."
    new "即便真是如此，我也已经失败了。我没能做到，而这一切已无可挽回。"

    # game/script.rpy:65008
    old "Because I had seen the news. I had witnessed history of the world I was in, so it was no longer any different from my own. I'd had a chance, and I'd failed to notice it."
    new "因为我看到了那条新闻。我亲眼见证了自己所处世界的历史，它便与我的世界再无分别。机会曾在我眼前，我却没有察觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:65009
    old "The reporter had spelled out my negligence. I hadn't acted, so nothing had changed."
    new "那名记者的报道，把我的疏忽摊在了明处。我没有行动，所以什么都没有改变。"

    # game/script.rpy:65011
    old "No, that can't be..."
    new "不，不会的……"

    # game/script.rpy:65012
    old "It's the same case. Even though I have seen the news, in this world, I've never seen any physical indication that Miiya is dead. That was the biggest barrier in my world, and it doesn't exist here. The news report is the only real obstacle, and it's a crossable one."
    new "情况是一样的。虽然我看过那条新闻，但在这个世界，我从未亲眼见到任何能表明 Miiya 已死的实物证据。在我的世界里，那曾是最大的障碍，而这里并不存在。新闻报道是唯一真正的阻碍，而它是可以越过的。"

    # game/script.rpy:65018
    old "I no longer had the Sekimeiya. I couldn't travel back to the 30th."
    new "我已经没有 Sekimeiya 了，没法回到30号。"

    # game/script.rpy:65019
    old "However, if I could... Miiya's death could be averted without the need to change the past. It isn't yet an impossibility..."
    new "不过，如果我做得到……不必改变过去，也能避免 Miiya 的死。这还不是没有可能……"

    # game/script.rpy:65020
    old "And I knew everything that I'd lived through would repeat, so I could be certain that on the 15th, I would have the Sekimeiya for myself."
    new "而且我知道，我经历过的一切都会重演，所以我能确定，到了15号，Sekimeiya 会落到我手里。"

    # game/script.rpy:65022
    old "...Finally, it made sense, and my eyes went wide. The reason why Miiya had been in the tower... I understood everything, as it all aligned with what I had to do."
    new "……终于，一切说得通了，我睁大了眼睛。Miiya 会出现在塔里的原因……我全都明白了，一切都与我必须做的事吻合。"

    # game/script.rpy:65031
    old "I arrived at the motel, where I could be isolated from the world. Until I was certain about everything, I couldn't look at the news. Everything had to be in my head before the result was given to me."
    new "我来到旅馆，在这里能避开外界。在把一切想清楚之前，我不能看新闻。必须先在脑子里把整件事过一遍，才能去看结果。"

    # game/script.rpy:65041
    old "Oubliette"
    new "遗忘地牢"

    # game/script.rpy:65046
    old "The last days passed quickly. It was about to be December 15th once again."
    new "最后这几天过得很快。12月15日又要到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65047
    old "I knew what I wanted to do, and I knew it would work."
    new "我知道自己想做什么，也知道那会成功。"

    # game/script.rpy:65048
    old "The end was still murky. I had to go back to my world, and I couldn't know how smoothly that would go until the time came. However, I had prepared extra steps before that point."
    new "最后会怎样还不清楚。我必须回到自己的世界，能不能顺利，不到那一刻没人知道。不过在那之前，我已经多准备了几步。"

    # game/script.rpy:65049
    old "In the tower, more than one person had been a killer. Someone had caused the attack, trapping all of us there. Despite all that, the security cameras weren't reliable enough to prove anything. I couldn't stand the thought of letting those criminals run free after everything was over."
    new "在塔里，凶手不止一个人。有人发动了那场袭击，把我们所有人困在那里。可即便如此，监控摄像头也不足以作为确凿证据。一想到一切结束后那些凶手还能逍遥法外，我就无法忍受。"

    # game/script.rpy:65050
    old "For that, I had obtained two things."
    new "为此，我准备了两样东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:65059
    old "In one hand, I had an empty USB drive. In the other, I had a roll of tape."
    new "一手是空白的U盘，另一手是一卷胶带。"

    # game/script.rpy:65061
    old "In one hand, I had an empty USB drive. In the other, I had duct tape."
    new "一手是空白的U盘，另一手是一卷胶带。"

    # game/script.rpy:65062
    old "While we'd been unconscious, someone had hidden the Sekimeiya in a hallway B crystal room. Perhaps there was more of the attack that they wanted to keep hidden."
    new "趁我们昏迷的时候，有人把 Sekimeiya 藏进了 B走廊的一间水晶展室。也许那场袭击里，还有更多他们想隐瞒的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:65063
    old "I'd thought of a way to expose what they'd kept as a well-hidden secret."
    new "我想到了一个办法，能揭穿他们藏得极深的秘密。"

    # game/script.rpy:65070
    old "I stepped out of the motel when the sun had already risen. I couldn't be in the tower too early, or I'd conflict with what I needed."
    new "太阳升起后，我才走出旅馆。我不能太早去塔里，不然会和我该做的事起冲突。"

    # game/script.rpy:65071
    old "Basically all smoke residue had faded from my clothing, and I'd left the suitcase and my clothes from the 24th in the bedroom before departing. On the way, I grew nervous. ...Was it going to work?"
    new "衣服上几乎已经闻不到烟味了。出发前，我把行李箱和24号那天穿的衣服留在了卧室里。路上，我越来越紧张。……会顺利吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:65072
    old "Had I overlooked something? Was there anything crucial I was missing?"
    new "我是不是漏掉了什么？有没有什么关键的东西被我忽略了？"

    # game/script.rpy:65073
    old "In the world I was in, I could save Miiya. I knew that for sure. My uncertainty went further than that."
    new "在我身处的这个世界里，我能救下 Miiya。这一点我很确定。我的不安并不止于此。"

    # game/script.rpy:65074
    old "The news and the note I'd read in the tower... They signified the real problem."
    new "那条新闻，还有我在塔里读到的那张字条……那才是真正的问题所在。"

    # game/script.rpy:65075
    old "How would it be solved...? I'd only been able to come up with a vague idea."
    new "那该如何解决……？我只想到一个模糊的方向。"

    # game/script.rpy:65076
    old "I could see the tower in the distance. I still hadn't shaken off that unsettling feeling, but I knew it wouldn't disappear until everything was settled."
    new "远远的，已经能看见那座塔。那份不安仍未散去，但我知道，在一切尘埃落定之前，它不会消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:65081
    old "People were by the entrance. I could see Suripo and the line of civilians from that day. However, the left wall was unguarded."
    new "入口处有人。我看得见 Suripo，还有那天排成长队的平民。不过，左侧的墙边没人看守。"

    # game/script.rpy:65084
    old "I surreptitiously approached it. Immediately, what I'd been very curious to see was apparent."
    new "我悄悄靠近，立刻看清了自己一直想确认的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:65085
    old "It really is there..."
    new "真的在那里……"

    # game/script.rpy:65086
    old "The rusty key was inserted in the outer keyhole."
    new "生锈的钥匙插在外侧的锁孔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:65087
    old "Really? Does this really make sense?"
    new "真的吗？这真的说得通吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:65088
    old "The reason why I hadn't been able to unlock that door from the inside... I had thought that if an identical key was on the opposite side, I might not have been able to turn it from the inside.{w} I wanted it to be there. I needed it to remain outside so that the door wouldn't be unlocked from the inside... so that Katei couldn't escape and so that the others couldn't leave when they found the door.{w} But... why was that key there? If it was just there because I'd known it would be there, that didn't really satisfy me."
    new "我一直没能从内侧打开那扇门，原因就在这里……我原先猜想，如果对面插着一把一模一样的钥匙，从里面或许就拧不动了。{w} 我希望那把钥匙在那里。我需要它留在门外，这样门就无法从内侧打开……Katei 便逃不出去，其他人发现那扇门时也走不了。{w} 可是……那把钥匙为什么会插在那里？若说只是因为我早就知道它会在那儿，这个理由并不能让我满意。"

    # game/script.rpy:65089
    old "...Am I supposed to assume that I'll leave it here the next time? Then, to still have it in the future, I'd have to get the key that Shiroya had."
    new "……难道说，下一次我也会把钥匙留在这里？那样一来，为了在未来仍然持有它，我就必须拿到 Shiroya 那把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:65092
    old "That had to be the answer. It meant that a future self of mine was already in the tower... But it was a bit hard to swallow. I would just be leaving the key behind to explain why I hadn't been able to unlock the door. If that was it, maybe there was more to it that I was missing, as the origin of the idea was unknown to me."
    new "答案只能是这样。也就是说，未来的我已经在这座塔里了……可这实在难以接受。我留下那把钥匙，仅仅是为了解释自己为何打不开那扇门。若果真如此，或许还有我没想到的地方——这个念头从何而来，我至今毫无头绪。"

    # game/script.rpy:65093
    old "Despite the universe apparently deciding the outcomes of things by itself, actual ideas that went into effect had consistently originated from a human mind. I still thought that had to be the case, but it wasn't like I had a better explanation ready for the key."
    new "虽说这个宇宙似乎会自行决定事情的结果，但真正生效的念头，无一例外都源自人心。我仍然认为理应如此——只是关于那把钥匙，我也拿不出更好的解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:65100
    old "I locked the door while it was open and stepped into the storeroom. Once inside, I was able to close the door behind me, leaving it locked. It was fortunate—and guaranteed—that the door worked like that, and once again, I wondered why the hell it existed in the first place."
    new "我趁门还开着先上了锁，然后走进储藏室。进去后，我从内侧把门带上，门还是锁着的。这扇门能这样运作，既幸运又理所当然——我又一次忍不住想，这扇门究竟为什么会存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:65101
    old "I still had the rusty key in my pocket, but when I tried to use it from the inside, it wouldn't budge. As long as the other one was inserted, opening the door from the inside would be impossible."
    new "生锈的钥匙仍在我口袋里，可当我试着从里面转动它时，它纹丝不动。只要另一把还插在外面，这扇门就无法从内侧打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:65106
    old "I got closer to the hallway. It would very soon be {time=9.}"
    new "我朝走廊靠近。马上就要到{time=9.}了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65107
    old "Katei won't be in the security room... Nobody will see me getting out of here.{w} I'll be recorded. Maybe the footage will actually be seen by the police. ...That doesn't matter, though."
    new "Katei 不在监控室……没人会看见我从这里出去。{w} 不过我会被拍下来。也许那段录像真会落到警察手里。……那也无所谓了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65108
    old "I paid the utmost attention for any sound to use as a cue."
    new "我全神贯注，留意着任何可以当作信号的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:65112
    old "There it was. As soon as I heard footsteps, I opened the door."
    new "来了。一听到脚步声，我立刻打开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:65116
    old "When I glanced toward the lobby, I saw two people. One was Katei, who'd just left the security room. The other was a man I'd never seen. He saw me exiting the storeroom, but he paid no mind as he kept approaching."
    new "我朝大厅那边一瞥，看见两个人。一个是刚离开监控室的 Katei，另一个是我从没见过的男人。他看见我从储藏室出来，却毫不在意，继续朝这边走来。"

    # game/script.rpy:65117
    old "I couldn't afford to waste time either. Casually, I walked to hallway C."
    new "我也没时间耽搁。我装作若无其事，走向 C走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:65121
    old "I made it just in time to see the event room closing. The first group was there.{w} I had very little time; the second group would appear at any moment."
    new "我赶得及时，看见活动室的门正在合上。第一批人已经进去了。{w} 我的时间所剩无几，第二批随时都会出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:65125
    old "Fortunately, I was done in less than a minute. It had gone as smoothly as I'd hoped."
    new "幸好不到一分钟我就办完了，一切顺利得如我所愿。"

    # game/script.rpy:65126
    old "I'd wanted to record the movements through hallway B. In our world, Katei had hidden both Sekimeiya in room B4. I knew things wouldn't be identical, but I hoped the truth would be recorded nonetheless."
    new "我想拍下 B走廊里的动静。在我们那个世界，Katei 把两件 Sekimeiya 都藏进了 B4 展室。我知道情形不会完全一样，但仍旧盼着真相能被录下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:65127
    old "Near the lobby, one of the security cameras viewed the entire hallway. It was high up, but I'd foreseen that problem. Thanks to the handrail and the corner, I'd been able to reach its lens."
    new "大厅附近有一台监控摄像头能俯瞰整条走廊。它装得很高，但这个问题我早有预料。靠着扶手和墙角，我够到了它的镜头。"

    # game/script.rpy:65132
    old "With the seconds I had left, I sprinted toward hallway C. I had to be somewhere during the attack."
    new "趁着还剩几秒，我朝 C走廊冲去。袭击发生时，我总得待在某个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:65136
    old "The security room."
    new "监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:65137
    old "I knew the alarm would lock it. If that happened, Katei could be fast enough to erase the footage I wanted to preserve.{w} However, I could avoid that by staying inside. He had told us once that the door could be unlocked from the inside without the need for the key."
    new "我知道警报一响，那扇门就会自动上锁。若真如此，只要 Katei 手脚够快，就能把我想要保住的录像抹掉。{w} 不过，只要我待在里面，就能避免这一点。他曾经告诉过我们，那扇门从内侧打开并不需要钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:65142
    old "When I looked at all the monitors, I felt like a needle was piercing my chest."
    new "看着满墙的监视器，我只觉得一根针直刺胸口。"

    # game/script.rpy:65144
    old "...Miiya is here. She's wearing the tanzanite pendant..."
    new "……Miiya 在这里。她戴着那条坦桑石吊坠……"

    # game/script.rpy:65145
    old "She and I were in the event room with Akaro. And... Shiroya was nowhere to be seen.{w} I couldn't believe it. No matter how much I stared at the footage, I couldn't believe that she was really a room away.{w} And the cabinet covered by that crimson curtain... Which Sekimeiya were there?"
    new "我和她，还有 Akaro，都在活动室里。而……Shiroya 却不见踪影。{w} 我不敢相信。无论盯着画面看多久，都不敢相信她就在一室之隔的地方。{w} 还有那个罩着深红遮布的展示柜……里面放的是哪几个 Sekimeiya？"

    # game/script.rpy:65146
    old "Every monitor displayed different locations on the crystal floor except for one. One of the screens was covered by tape.{w} I kept my eyes peeled with anticipation. It was about to happen again. I would see that dense smoke appearing out of nowhere, and my vision would blacken."
    new "只有一块屏幕例外，其余每块都显示着水晶层上的不同位置。那块屏幕被胶带贴住了。{w} 我屏息凝神，紧盯着屏幕。那件事又要发生了。我会看见浓烟凭空涌出，随后眼前一黑。"

    # game/script.rpy:65154
    old "All at once, it happened, and I finally confirmed the truth."
    new "一切骤然发生，我终于确认了真相。"

    # game/script.rpy:65155
    old "Did the smoke come from Akaro!?"
    new "烟是从 Akaro 那边冒出来的！？"

    # game/script.rpy:65156
    old "That was how it had seemed. In an instant, all the cameras hit by the smoke displayed a black screen."
    new "看上去正是如此。一瞬间，被烟雾笼罩的摄像头全部变成了黑屏。"

    # game/script.rpy:65157
    old "It was Akaro. He was the one who released it."
    new "是 Akaro。烟就是他放的。"

    # game/script.rpy:65158
    old "When Shiroya and I had appeared on that morning after traveling from January 5th, we'd been able to avoid falling unconscious by looking down as we'd run through the smoke. Akaro had to have thrown himself to the ground immediately to avoid inhaling it, as it had quickly risen to the ceiling.{w} I had to act again while I still could, but I waited a few seconds so that the exit to the outside would close."
    new "从 1 月 5 日穿越过来的那个早上，Shiroya 和我一出现，就一边跑过烟雾一边低头，才没有晕过去。烟雾很快升到了天花板，Akaro 想必是立刻趴到了地上，才没吸进去。{w} 我必须趁自己还能行动时再动手，可我还是等了几秒，好让通往外面的出口关上。"

    # game/script.rpy:65163
    old "Then I opened the door slowly, crouching and covering my face. The smoke was there, but I was very close to the lobby."
    new "我蹲下身，掩住口鼻，缓缓推开门。烟雾还在，但这里离大厅已经很近。"

    # game/script.rpy:65164
    old "Is someone here...?{w} Is it Katei?"
    new "有人吗……？{w} 是 Katei 吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:65165
    old "I didn't want them to hear me, so I took off my shoes. I could hear a person crawling on the floor, but when I opened my eyes, I only saw a dark silhouette near the wall."
    new "我不想让他们听见我的动静，于是脱掉了鞋。我能听见有人在地上爬动，可睁开眼时，只看见墙边一团模糊的黑影。"

    # game/script.rpy:65168
    old "The alarm... It's even louder than I remember."
    new "警报声……比我记得的还要响。"

    # game/script.rpy:65173
    old "Unable to breathe, I took a silent step toward the light. I was in time to see the shutter locking in place and the smaller lights turning off."
    new "我憋着气，无声地朝光亮处迈出一步。正好看见卷帘门落下锁死，小灯随之熄灭。"

    # game/script.rpy:65177
    old "In hallway B, most of the smoke had already gotten stuck to the ceiling."
    new "B走廊里，大半烟雾已经聚在天花板附近。"

    # game/script.rpy:65181
    old "Aside from the second group, nobody seemed to be there yet. Protecting my face, I reached for the camera's lens and removed the piece of tape."
    new "除了第二批人，似乎还没有别人到场。我护住脸，伸手够到摄像头的镜头，把胶带撕了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:65187
    old "I returned to the security room as fast as I could. Someone had still been in hallway A, but I didn't think they'd noticed me. I still had my shoes in my hand."
    new "我以最快的速度赶回监控室。A走廊里还有人，但我想对方没有注意到我。我手里还提着鞋。"

    # game/script.rpy:65188
    old "I noticed the deadbolt was sticking out of the door. The alarm had just locked it, but since I'd left it open, I was able to step back in, and I used the inner handle to close it again."
    new "我注意到门上的插销伸在外面。警报刚才已经把门锁上了，但因为门一直开着，我才能侧身进去，然后握住内侧的把手把门重新带上。"

    # game/script.rpy:65190
    old "I looked at the monitors as I put them on. The one that had been covered by tape showed the dark hallway instead. Its screen was being assaulted by the remaining smoke, but it wasn't enough to conceal the entire image."
    new "我一边穿鞋，一边看向监视器。原先被胶带贴住的那块屏幕，此刻映出昏暗的走廊。残存的烟雾不断扑向镜头，但还不至于把整个画面遮住。"

    # game/script.rpy:65191
    old "In front of the computer, I clicked on the program that managed the cameras. From there, I accessed the archived footage."
    new "我在电脑前点开管理摄像头的程序，从那里调出了存档的录像。"

    # game/script.rpy:65192
    old "...It's all here, but Katei will try to hide it. In this world, the computer was shut down too."
    new "……全都在这里。但 Katei 会想办法把它藏起来。在这个世界里，电脑也被关掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65195
    old "On the screen, the culprits finally came to light.{w} Akaro came out of the event room and looked both ways."
    new "屏幕上，罪魁祸首终于显露出来。{w} Akaro 从活动室里走出，左右张望。"

    # game/script.rpy:65196
    old "...He did fake his unconsciousness. What is he planning to do...?"
    new "……他果然是装晕。他到底想做什么……？"

    # game/script.rpy:65197
    old "Once he confirmed he was alone, he walked to the cleaning room. From there, he went back to the event room, holding a glowing object between his hands."
    new "确认四下无人之后，他走向清洁间。再回到活动室时，他双手捧着一件发光的物体。"

    # game/script.rpy:65198
    old "What the hell...? Is that a Sekimeiya?{w} No, I know what that must be. ...The third Sekimeiya. That's what the plan was about."
    new "搞什么……？那是 Sekimeiya？{w} 不，我知道那是什么。……第三个 Sekimeiya。原来那个计划打的是这个主意。"

    # game/script.rpy:65199
    old "A few seconds later, he came back out. I couldn't see his hands, but he walked back to the cleaning room again."
    new "几秒后，他又出来了。我看不见他手里拿着什么，但他再次走回了清洁间。"

    # game/script.rpy:65200
    old "...This is why only the third Sekimeiya was there when we woke up.{w} When does Katei come into the picture, though?"
    new "……难怪我们醒来时，那里只剩第三个 Sekimeiya。{w} 可 Katei 又是什么时候插进来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:65201
    old "I didn't have to wait very long to find out. After Akaro had returned to the event room, Katei appeared from the lobby.{w} Keeping his head down, he stepped to the cleaning room."
    new "我没等多久就知道了。Akaro 回到活动室之后，Katei 从大厅那边出现了。{w} 他低着头，走进了清洁间。"

    # game/script.rpy:65202
    old "Was he working with Akaro?"
    new "他和 Akaro 是一伙的？"

    # game/script.rpy:65203
    old "I was bewildered. He came out almost immediately with two Sekimeiya and walked back to the lobby."
    new "我一时愣住。他几乎立刻就出来了，手里拿着两个 Sekimeiya，走回了大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:65206
    old "He must be going to the storeroom, but he won't be able to escape with the Sekimeiya."
    new "他应该是去储藏室了，但就算带着 Sekimeiya，也逃不掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:65207
    old "I'd caught the two culprits behind the attack on video. Feeling the rush, I inserted the USB drive into the computer."
    new "我拍下了袭击事件中两名犯人的影像。心头一阵激荡，我将U盘插进电脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:65208
    old "Once I located the file corresponding to that camera, I saved it on the drive."
    new "找到那台摄像头对应的文件后，我把它存进了U盘。"

    # game/script.rpy:65209
    old "With this, I can bring it to the other world too."
    new "有了这个，我也能把它带到另一个世界去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65210
    old "I knew Katei would try to erase the saved footage, so I created a hidden folder on the computer where I copied the file."
    new "我知道 Katei 会试图删掉保存的录像，所以在电脑上建了一个隐藏文件夹，把文件复制了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:65211
    old "...And I hope the police will find it in this world."
    new "……但愿这个世界的警察能找到它。"

    # game/script.rpy:65214
    old "Perhaps something else of value would be recorded, but I preferred to cut it short."
    new "或许还能录下别的有价值的东西，但我还是决定到此为止。"

    # game/script.rpy:65215
    old "...After all, I soon heard someone running outside the security room. Then, that person appeared in hallway B."
    new "……毕竟没过多久，我就听见监控室外有人跑过。紧接着，那个人出现在 B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:65216
    old "It was Naomi. She ran all the way down holding Katei's suitcase, and as she disappeared, another door opened.{w} From room B4, Shiroya and I appeared—Naomi had drawn us out. Then, Shiroya stared at the camera intensely, as if she was looking directly at me. Before I could even process it, they ran behind the sound, quickly vanishing from the frame."
    new "那是 Naomi。她提着 Katei 的手提箱一路跑下楼，就在她消失时，另一扇门开了。{w} Shiroya 和我从 B4房间走出来——是 Naomi 把我们引出来的。随后，Shiroya 死死盯着摄像头，仿佛正透过镜头看着我。还没等我理清头绪，他们便循着声响跑向后方，转眼消失在画面里。"

    # game/script.rpy:65217
    old "Huh, what? Did she notice something about the camera? She didn't tell me about it, but I remember having to tug her shirt so that she'd follow me."
    new "咦，什么？她察觉到摄像头有什么不对了吗？她没跟我提过这事，但我记得当时还得拽她的衣角，她才肯跟我走。"

    # game/script.rpy:65218
    old "And what was Naomi's role? Given how likely it was that Katei had killed her once, she might have intercepted him after resisting the smoke."
    new "那 Naomi 又扮演了什么角色？既然 Katei 很可能已经杀过她一次，她或许是在撑过烟雾之后截住了他。"

    # game/script.rpy:65221
    old "I saw us going up the stairs in hallway C, so I changed the cameras. They were all assigned random numbers, but I managed to display the second floor through a camera that'd been showing a crystal room."
    new "我看见我们正在 C 走廊上楼梯，便切换了摄像头。这些摄像头的编号全是随机分配的，但我还是设法用一台原本对着水晶展室的摄像头调出了二楼画面。"

    # game/script.rpy:65222
    old "With Naomi in the lead, our past selves ran all the way up."
    new "由 Naomi 带头，过去的我们一路跑了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:65223
    old "Oh, is that Katei...?"
    new "哦，那是 Katei……？"

    # game/script.rpy:65224
    old "He was tailing us, but he collapsed at the stairs two floors above. When he stood up, it seemed like he'd given up on catching us, and with his eyes shut tight, he slowly walked back down."
    new "他一直跟在我们后面，却在上面两层的楼梯处倒下了。等他重新站起，似乎已经放弃追我们，紧闭着双眼慢慢走了下去。"

    # game/script.rpy:65226
    old "I looked at the sixth floor, where Naomi unlocked the attic. She stepped in, shortly followed by me and Shiroya."
    new "我看向六楼，Naomi 在那里打开了阁楼的锁。她走了进去，我和 Shiroya 紧随其后。"

    # game/script.rpy:65228
    old "...Is Katei gonna come here? I should leave."
    new "……Katei 会来这里吗？我该走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65229
    old "I made the monitor display the initial crystal room again and stepped out."
    new "我让监视器重新显示最初的水晶展室，然后走了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:65235
    old "I went to the lobby, but a clear problem was about to arise."
    new "我来到大厅，可一个明显的问题就要出现了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65236
    old "My past self is going to go to the storeroom very soon, so I can't stay there again."
    new "过去的我很快就要去储藏室了，所以我不能再待在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:65237
    old "If I'm remembering correctly, in this world, the group didn't go to the security room after waking up. ...I can't risk staying there, though."
    new "如果我没记错，在这个世界里，一行人醒来后并没有去监控室。……不过，我也不能冒险待在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:65238
    old "I kept cleaning the smoke off me. It had touched me again, so I likely looked similar to how I had in the morning."
    new "我不断擦去身上的烟雾。它又沾到了我身上，所以我现在的样子大概和早上差不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:65245
    old "Katei was the first to return. At a slow pace, he scanned the floor."
    new "Katei 是第一个回来的。他不紧不慢地扫视着这一层。"

    # game/script.rpy:65246
    old "...I just remembered when he said he'd used the security room's microphone while we were unconscious. That really was a blatant lie, which Akaro immediately realized if they weren't working together. Also, Katei will probably be confused when he finds out the security room's unlocked."
    new "……我刚想起来，他说过在我们昏迷时用过监控室的麦克风。那根本是明目张胆的谎言——除非他们本就是一伙的，否则 Akaro 当场就会识破。还有，等 Katei 发现监控室没锁，大概会摸不着头脑。"

    # game/script.rpy:65250
    old "I stayed behind the reception desk. Once Katei was next to Erina's group, someone else had come down."
    new "我躲在前台后面。等 Katei 走到 Erina 一行人身边时，又有一个人下来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65251
    old "My past self, who went straight to the storeroom. I was unable to find the rusty key in hallway A, so I stayed inside."
    new "那是过去的我，径直走向储藏室。我在 A走廊没能找到生锈的钥匙，于是留在了里面。"

    # game/script.rpy:65252
    old "...What was going to happen? I'd hidden in the storeroom for hours, but I knew the way things played out would be vastly different from my world's set of events."
    new "……接下来会发生什么？我在储藏室里躲了好几个小时，但我知道事情的走向会和我那个世界截然不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:65253
    old "Eventually, everyone would disappear, and after that, my past self would bring both Sekimeiya to the attic to experiment with them..."
    new "最终，所有人都会消失；在那之后，过去的我会把两个 Sekimeiya 带到阁楼去做实验……"

    # game/script.rpy:65254
    old "I had to hold on until that point, when the Sekimeiya would be within reach again."
    new "我必须撑到那一刻，等 Sekimeiya 再次变得触手可及。"

    # game/script.rpy:65255
    old "I didn't want to be found, but I knew it could happen. The Atsuki originally from that world wasn't a past self of mine—him seeing me wouldn't be a contradiction."
    new "我不想被人发现，但也知道这并非不可能。那个世界原本的 Atsuki 并不是我的过去之身——他看到我，也不会构成矛盾。"

    # game/script.rpy:65259
    old "The seconds began to tick by. I had no place where I could safely stay, so I had to keep moving, my whole objective being to smoothly return to one particular point."
    new "时间一分一秒地过去。我没有可以安全停留的地方，只能不断移动，而我的全部目标，就是顺利回到某个特定的时间点。"

    # game/script.rpy:65260
    old "I couldn't travel forward in time to speed up the process because I hadn't been in the tower in the proportional past. However, I doubted I would have been willing to do that anyway.{w} ...To skip that last time I had... where Miiya existed. When I heard her voice, I couldn't stop myself from getting closer to the door."
    new "我无法穿越到未来去加快进程，因为在对应的过去，我并没有待在塔里。不过，就算能这么做，我大概也不会愿意。{w}……毕竟，那会跳过我拥有的最后一段…… Miiya 还在的时光。听到她的声音时，我还是忍不住朝门口靠近。"

    # game/script.rpy:65264
    old "...ou okay? I'm so—"
    new "……你还好吗？我真是太——"

    # game/script.rpy:65268
    old "Don't worry. No— ...our fault."
    new "别担心。不——……是我们的错。"

    # game/script.rpy:65269
    old "She was there. It was proof that my effort wasn't worthless. But I couldn't even see her."
    new "她就在那里。这证明我的努力没有白费。可我却连看都看不到她。"

    # game/script.rpy:65270
    old "...Aware that they could come to the lobby at any point, I walked away."
    new "……我知道他们随时可能来到大厅，于是转身离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:65277
    old "After learning that they'd been trapped, the group saw the shutter for the first time. Then, once they stepped into hallway A, they directed themselves to the dark crystal room, A5."
    new "得知自己被困后，一行人第一次看到了卷帘门。随后，他们一踏进 A走廊，便径直朝昏暗的水晶展室 A5 走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:65278
    old "It wasn't what we'd done. ...They weren't surprised to see its stained walls."
    new "这和我们当初不同。……看到墙上那些污迹，他们并不意外。"

    # game/script.rpy:65279
    old "And the security room, which should've been their priority, had been ignored completely."
    new "而本应成为他们首要目标的监控室，却被完全忽略了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65281
    old "Oh, huh. The suitcase isn't here this time.{w} Naomi ran up to the attic with it, and I didn't see it. But the Sekimeiya were on the sofa. It has to be that the suitcase was brought to our world as well, which is why we saw two."
    new "哦，咦？这次手提箱不在这里。{w} Naomi 提着它跑上了阁楼，可我没看见它。不过 Sekimeiya 在沙发上。一定是手提箱也被带到了我们的世界，所以我们才会看到两个。"

    # game/script.rpy:65288
    old "Unable to use the elevator, they all walked up the stairs."
    new "电梯用不了，他们便全都走楼梯上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:65290
    old "I could follow them. It was good to know what their movements would be and the events that were bound to unfold. In the future, I could put that information to use."
    new "我可以跟上去。弄清他们的行动和注定会发生的事，总归有好处。将来，这些情报或许能派上用场。"

    # game/script.rpy:65291
    old "I had already noticed that Katei's behavior and the things he was saying were different. The group was going up to find Naomi, who had locked herself in the attic. Unknown to them, Shiroya and I had unlocked it, and Naomi was no longer in the building."
    new "我已经察觉到 Katei 的言行与以往不同。一行人正上楼去找 Naomi——她把自己锁在了阁楼里。可他们不知道，Shiroya 和我已经打开了阁楼的锁，而 Naomi 早已不在楼里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65298
    old "On the second floor, the group looked through the offices. As expected, nothing was found, and they moved on to the third floor."
    new "在二楼，一行人逐个查看了办公室。不出所料，什么也没找到，于是他们又上了三楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:65302
    old "The same occurred upstairs."
    new "楼上也是一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:65306
    old "I followed them when they were going to the fourth, but all of a sudden, someone walked back down while I was following them."
    new "他们上四楼时，我跟了上去；可才跟到一半，忽然有人掉头下楼了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65310
    old "I couldn't run all the way down, so I was only able to enter the first partition."
    new "我没法一路跑下楼，只能躲进第一间隔间。"

    # game/script.rpy:65314
    old "That's me and Miiya...!"
    new "那是我和 Miiya……！"

    # game/script.rpy:65315
    old "From behind a desk, I saw them walking beyond the glass, which greatly muddled their voices."
    new "我躲在办公桌后，看见他们从玻璃另一侧走过，声音也因此变得十分模糊。"

    # game/script.rpy:65316
    old "Before I could breathe, Erina and Isla came down as well. They appeared to be following the other two."
    new "我还没来得及喘口气，Erina 和 Isla 也下来了。看那样子，她们是在跟着先前那两个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:65318
    old "...Was that it? No one else seemed to be coming.{w} Why had they gone down alone? As I wondered that, a fifth person came from the upper floor."
    new "……就这些？似乎不会再有别人下来了。{w} 他们为什么独自下楼？我正想着，第五个人从楼上走了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:65319
    old "Akaro. He looked deep in thought as he walked.{w} While I was still fazed, the sixth person appeared. Sai trailed behind Akaro as he disappeared beyond the glass."
    new "Akaro。他边走边沉思。{w} 我还没回过神，第六个人出现了。Sai 跟在 Akaro 身后，一同消失在玻璃那头。"

    # game/script.rpy:65322
    old "...What the hell are they doing?{w} I remember this. When I was in the storeroom, everyone came back on their own. I heard different footsteps walking beyond the wall."
    new "……他们到底在干什么？{w} 这一幕我记得。我待在储藏室的时候，所有人都是自己回来的。我听见墙外传来不同的脚步声。"

    # game/script.rpy:65323
    old "I kept waiting. After all, someone was missing."
    new "我继续等着。毕竟，还少一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:65324
    old "Where's Katei? Why is he the only person who hasn't come down?"
    new "Katei 呢？怎么只有他还没下来？"

    # game/script.rpy:65325
    old "I couldn't hear anything. Was he still above me?"
    new "什么声音也听不到。他还在楼上吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:65329
    old "Assuming that he wasn't coming, I slowly emerged from the partition. Why in the world had they left Katei alone? Trying not to reveal my presence, I approached the staircase and went up to the fourth floor."
    new "我猜他不会下来了，便慢慢从隔间里走出来。他们怎么就把 Katei 一个人丢下了？我尽量不让人发现，走到楼梯口，上了四楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:65334
    old "...There he was. I saw him walking toward the offices, looking a little disoriented."
    new "……他在那儿。我看见他朝办公室那边走去，神情有些恍惚。"

    # game/script.rpy:65338
    old "Instead of inspecting them, he kept going up to the fifth floor."
    new "他没有去查看那些办公室，径直上了五楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:65339
    old "Was he going to the attic? If so, why had everyone else gone down?"
    new "他要去阁楼？若真如此，其他人又为什么全都下楼了？"

    # game/script.rpy:65346
    old "From the second floor, I looked down as I kept myself hidden. I could see that someone was in the security room based on the light coming out of it."
    new "我躲在二楼，朝下望去。监控室里透出灯光，看来里面有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:65347
    old "Then, the event room opened, and I could see a single person's lower legs."
    new "接着，活动室的门开了，我只能看见一个人的小腿。"

    # game/script.rpy:65348
    old "Those were Sai's shoes. It seemed everyone was separated, so I couldn't keep going down."
    new "那是 Sai 的鞋。看来众人散在各处，我没法再往下走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65349
    old "Let me guess. The Sekimeiya is about to have disappeared from the cabinet."
    new "让我猜猜。展示柜里的 Sekimeiya 马上就要消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65353
    old "I entered the offices again and stepped into the second so that I wouldn't be seen through the glass."
    new "我又进了办公室，躲进第二间，免得被人隔着玻璃看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:65359
    old "As soon as I did so, I caught a glimpse of Katei. He was walking toward the crystal floor."
    new "我刚躲好，就瞥见了 Katei。他正朝水晶层走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:65360
    old "What the hell? Did he not see me?"
    new "怎么回事？他没看见我吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:65361
    old "He walked past without looking at me. However, his timing left me confused. ...It was like he'd been waiting for me to step aside."
    new "他从我身边走过，看都没看我一眼。可这个时机让我很困惑。……就好像他一直在等我让开。"

    # game/script.rpy:65362
    old "I couldn't see his hands since they were held to his side, away from me, and he was likely just in the attic... It hasn't been very long, though."
    new "他的手放在背对我的那一侧，我看不见，而他刚才大概只是去了阁楼……可这也没过多久啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:65365
    old "I didn't care about it anymore. When they had switched worlds, everyone had been alive. That was what mattered."
    new "我不再去想这些。他们切换世界的时候，所有人都还活着。这才要紧。"

    # game/script.rpy:65372
    old "At that time, everyone was alive..."
    new "那个时候，所有人都还活着……"

    # game/script.rpy:65373
    old "However, what about later? The first time we'd changed worlds was still in my memories."
    new "可是后来呢？我们第一次切换世界的情形，我还记得清清楚楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:65374
    old "When Erina touched the Sekimeiya in the event room, was the world we appeared in this one? ...Did everyone come back, or was it an entirely different world?"
    new "Erina 在活动室里碰到 Sekimeiya 的时候，我们出现的地方就是这个世界吗？……是所有人都回来了，还是那根本是另一个世界？"

    # game/script.rpy:65375
    old "It's gotta be this one, right? Miiya was alive, and we were told Shiroya was the one who died. For them, she hadn't been in the tower yet."
    new "只能是这个世界吧？Miiya 还活着，而且他们说死的是 Shiroya。在他们那边，她那时还没进塔。"

    # game/script.rpy:65376
    old "When I remembered it, something else I'd heard made me grimace."
    new "想到这里，我又记起听过的另一句话，不禁皱起眉头。"

    # game/script.rpy:65394
    old "...Was that the fate lying in wait in the world I was in? Was it not going to be one free of suffering...?"
    new "……这就是我所在的世界里等着我的命运吗？这个世界终究不能免于痛苦吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:65397
    old "People came from below. It sounded like it was the group of four: my other self, Miiya, Erina, and Isla. Ignoring the three partitions, they walked up.{w} I could hear their steps above me, but they rapidly faded. ...Their destination was likely the attic."
    new "楼下有人上来了。听动静是那四个人：另一个我、Miiya、Erina 和 Isla。他们没理会那三处隔间，径直往上走。{w} 我能听见头顶的脚步声，可很快就远去了。……他们多半是去阁楼了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65403
    old "Then, just as I remembered it, a single person came from the crystal floor and proceeded to walk up, their steps hardly audible. That was repeated two more times, until the number of people who'd left the crystal floor was seven. Everyone had been completely unconcerned with the offices and gone straight up."
    new "接着，和我记忆中一样，一个人从水晶层上来，继续往上走，脚步声轻得几乎听不见。如此又重复了两次，从水晶层离开的人一共是七个。所有人都完全没理会那些办公室，径直上楼去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65405
    old "...They're all above me again, then."
    new "……那么，他们又全都在我上面了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65406
    old "I waited in case someone else was yet to appear. A while later, nobody had come, so I cautiously left."
    new "我等着，怕还有谁没出现。过了好一阵也没人来，我才小心翼翼地离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:65412
    old "What were they all doing? What had caused those bizarre movements...?"
    new "他们到底在做什么？那些古怪的举动是怎么回事……？"

    # game/script.rpy:65413
    old "Once again, I had to stop myself when I heard distant voices."
    new "又一次，我听见远处传来说话声，只好停下脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:65414
    old "...ese would make the noise. Why did you not wa—"
    new "……这些会弄出声响。你为什么不等——"

    # game/script.rpy:65420
    old "Oh...! I left the duct tape in the security room!{w} It sounds like Katei found it."
    new "啊……！我把那卷胶带落在监控室了！{w} 听这意思，是 Katei 找到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65422
    old "They kept going up. They wanted to see whether one of the keys Katei had would unlock the attic."
    new "他们继续往上，想试试 Katei 手里的某把钥匙能不能打开阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:65427
    old "It did. Once it was unlocked, everyone walked in."
    new "果然打开了。锁一开，所有人都走了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:65428
    old "He had the keys. That means he got the keyring that Naomi left behind.{w} Since the attic was locked just now, he definitely locked it while he was up here before."
    new "钥匙在他手上。也就是说，他拿到了 Naomi 落下的那串钥匙。{w} 刚才阁楼还是锁着的，那就肯定是他先前待在上面时锁上的。"

    # game/script.rpy:65429
    old "I couldn't get closer, so I waited behind. Some minutes later, I heard the elevator once."
    new "我没法再靠近，只好在后面等着。过了几分钟，电梯响了一声。"

    # game/script.rpy:65431
    old "...What? Is it working?{w} They just tried it on this floor, and it wasn't..."
    new "……什么？电梯能用了？{w} 他们刚刚在这层试过，明明还不行……"

    # game/script.rpy:65432
    old "While I frowned, I heard people walking out of the attic."
    new "我正皱着眉，就听见有人从阁楼里走了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:65437
    old "I abandoned my thoughts and hid inside the offices, which was all I could do to avoid detection."
    new "我抛开思绪，躲进办公室里——要避开他们的目光，我也只能如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:65438
    old "From there, I saw the people who were walking down.{w} Myself, Miiya, and Katei."
    new "我从那里看见了往下走的几个人。{w} 我自己、Miiya，还有 Katei。"

    # game/script.rpy:65439
    old "The Sekimeiya..."
    new "那个 Sekimeiya……"

    # game/script.rpy:65440
    old "Katei was behind them, holding a white Sekimeiya in his hands. Although the two at the front weren't seeing it, pain was written clear across his face."
    new "Katei 走在他们后面，双手捧着一个白色的 Sekimeiya。走在前面的两人看不见，可他脸上分明写满了痛苦。"

    # game/script.rpy:65441
    old "He's purposely avoiding touching it with his skin! He must be in pain because the Sekimeiya's gathered energy since it was taken out of the cabinet! I bet he can barely hold it."
    new "他故意不让皮肤碰到它！Sekimeiya 从展示柜里取出来后一直在蓄能，他现在肯定很痛！我看他快拿不住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65442
    old "They disappeared from my sight. It seemed that the maximum number of occupants, four people, had taken the elevator down."
    new "他们从我眼前消失了。看样子，他们坐电梯下去了，正好四个人，满员。"

    # game/script.rpy:65443
    old "...Why did he only have one Sekimeiya? What about the other one?"
    new "……为什么他只有一个 Sekimeiya？另一个呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:65444
    old "Once there was some distance between us, I went down the floors myself."
    new "等和他们拉开一段距离，我才自己逐层下楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:65449
    old "They're all in the security room. That means the computer's already shut down."
    new "他们全都在监控室。也就是说，电脑已经关掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65450
    old "...Katei has to be responsible. I don't know why they didn't all go to the security room immediately, but this is the same thing he did in the other world."
    new "……这一定是 Katei 干的。我不知道他们为什么没有立刻全都赶去监控室，但他在另一个世界就是这么做的。"

    # game/script.rpy:65452
    old "A while later, the group went to the lobby. I was able to hear that they'd moved to hallway B, but any distinct sounds quickly faded."
    new "过了一会儿，一行人去了大厅。我听出他们转到了 B 走廊，但具体的声音很快就听不清了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65453
    old "...Did they enter a room?"
    new "……他们进房间了？"

    # game/script.rpy:65460
    old "The indistinct sound was coming from the event room. They'd most likely left the Sekimeiya in the cabinet."
    new "那模糊的声音是从活动室传来的。他们多半是把 Sekimeiya 留在了展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:65461
    old "It was soon after when they experienced something unnatural for the first time that day."
    new "没过多久，他们就在那天第一次遇上了不合常理的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:65462
    old "Katei's shout was cut short. Then, voices of incredulity came from hallway A."
    new "Katei 的喊声戛然而止。紧接着，A 走廊传来难以置信的惊呼。"

    # game/script.rpy:65466
    old "...at the fuck?"
    new "……什么鬼东西？"

    # game/script.rpy:65467
    old "What— ...just do?"
    new "你——……做了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:65468
    old "...this man just teleport?"
    new "……这家伙刚才传送了？"

    # game/script.rpy:65469
    old "A sudden sentence I didn't expect came."
    new "突然传来一句我完全没料到的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:65473
    old "The reality of their situation was told to them. Naturally, it wasn't something anyone could easily accept."
    new "有人把实情告诉了他们。当然，这不是谁都能轻易接受的。"

    # game/script.rpy:65474
    old "...Why did Katei say that? He just touched the Sekimeiya and appeared in hallway A. ...Why did he immediately say that he'd traveled to the past?"
    new "……Katei 为什么会那么说？他明明只是碰了一下 Sekimeiya，就出现在 A 走廊。……为什么他立刻就说自己穿越到了过去？"

    # game/script.rpy:65475
    old "I didn't understand. In my world, he had been completely opposed to the idea of time travel existing for a very long time."
    new "我不明白。在我的世界里，他很长一段时间都坚决否认时间穿越的存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:65483
    old "Despite what had happened, Katei made them shut the Sekimeiya away before walking to the security room."
    new "尽管出了这样的事，Katei 还是让他们把 Sekimeiya 收好，然后走向监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:65484
    old "The others remained inside the event room. Wanting to know what they were saying, I approached it slowly."
    new "其他人留在了活动室里。我想知道他们在说什么，便慢慢靠近。"

    # game/script.rpy:65488
    old "...efinitely working with Naomi. ...isn't being tru—"
    new "……肯定和 Naomi 是一伙的。……不可能是真——"

    # game/script.rpy:65489
    old "Unlock i—"
    new "打开它——"

    # game/script.rpy:65490
    old "The door wasn't fully shut, but it was difficult to hear what they were saying. I still managed to understand that they had the key to unlock the cabinet."
    new "门没有完全关上，可他们的说话声还是很难听清。不过我总算听明白，他们手里有打开展示柜的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:65491
    old "...do we touch it?"
    new "……我们要碰它吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:65492
    old "That's me."
    new "那是我的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:65497
    old "I realized I'd made a sound. In an attempt to hear better, I'd revealed my presence."
    new "我意识到自己出了声。为了听得更清楚，反倒暴露了行踪。"

    # game/script.rpy:65509
    old "When they opened the door, I was already in hallway C. I'd been able to react fast enough."
    new "等他们打开门，我已经在 C 走廊了。我的反应还算够快。"

    # game/script.rpy:65510
    old "They started coming out to find who'd been there. A little nervous, I retreated to the second floor."
    new "他们出来找刚才待在那里的人。我有些紧张，退到了二楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:65517
    old "...They're looking into every room. I bet they think Naomi made the sound."
    new "……他们在逐个查看每个房间。多半是以为那声音是 Naomi 发出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:65518
    old "I started to get a bit worried, but the sound stopped. They weren't continuing to the other floors."
    new "我开始有些担心，声音却停下了。他们没有继续往别的楼层去。"

    # game/script.rpy:65522
    old "When I looked down, I saw they were back in the event room."
    new "我往下一看，见他们已经回到了活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:65526
    old "I stepped forward slowly, making sure not to reveal myself again. They had just learned about time travel, so I really wanted to hear what was happening."
    new "我放轻脚步往前走，以免再次暴露。他们刚知道时间穿越这回事，我实在很想听听那边的情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:65527
    old "...What is my other self thinking?{w} What is he thinking now that he's witnessed time travel for the first time? The events of November 30th... Did they occur as I imagine? If so, I don't have to wonder."
    new "……另一个我在想什么？{w}第一次亲眼见到时间穿越，他现在作何感想？11月30日发生的事……是否和我设想的一样？若是如此，我也无需多想了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65528
    old "It seemed Katei was still in the security room, so I got closer to hallway B."
    new "看来 Katei 还在监控室，我便向 B 走廊靠近了一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:65536
    old "All of a sudden, the cleaning room opened. I stepped aside immediately, but I was able to see who'd been there."
    new "清洁间的门忽然开了。我立刻闪到一旁，但还是看见了里面的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:65537
    old "...Sai. His footsteps grew fainter as he walked to the event room."
    new "……是 Sai。他往活动室走去，脚步声渐渐远去。"

    # game/script.rpy:65543
    old "However, when I glanced at the hallway, he wasn't there."
    new "可是，等我再看走廊时，他已经不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65549
    old "He was gone. His disappearance stunned me long enough that I didn't react to a door opening."
    new "他消失了。我愣了好一会儿，连门开了都没反应过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:65552
    old "By the time I realized what had happened, I was staring into Miiya's eyes. She looked at me from the event room with a curious frown."
    new "等我回过神来，已经和 Miiya 四目相对。她站在活动室里，皱着眉，好奇地望着我。"

    # game/script.rpy:65554
    old "Should I get closer...?"
    new "我要再靠近一点吗……"

    # game/script.rpy:65555
    old "I could hardly believe that I was seeing her alive and well. Strangely, her look didn't seem to share the same puzzlement."
    new "我几乎不敢相信她还活着，就站在我眼前。奇怪的是，她的神情里并没有同样的困惑。"

    # game/script.rpy:65560
    old "I took a step forward, unable to take my eyes off her."
    new "我向前迈了一步，目光无法从她身上移开。"

    # game/script.rpy:65568
    old "...What?{w} Did the other Atsuki just touch the Sekimeiya?"
    new "……什么？{w}另一个我刚才碰了 Sekimeiya？"

    # game/script.rpy:65570
    old "Um... Y-Yes. I suppose so."
    new "呃……是、是的。应该是吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:65571
    old "I see. That's why Sai disappeared as well."
    new "原来如此。难怪 Sai 也不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65572
    old "I can't... I can't believe it, though."
    new "可是……我还是不敢相信。"

    # game/script.rpy:65589
    old "He, Katei, and the other Atsuki were missing. The group seemed equally perplexed about Sai's and my own disappearance."
    new "他、Katei，还有另一个 Atsuki 都不见了。大家似乎也同样想不通 Sai 和我怎么会消失。"

    # game/script.rpy:65590
    old "...They think I'm the Atsuki who just disappeared. If he traveled to the past, I should leave before he's back."
    new "……他们把我当成了刚才消失的那个人。如果他穿越回了过去，我最好赶在他回来之前离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:65593
    old "Given what I saw, Katei traveled just a few seconds through time. He must have touched the Sekimeiya as soon as it was removed from the cabinet."
    new "照我看到的情况，Katei 只穿越了几秒钟。他肯定是在 Sekimeiya 刚被拿出展示柜的时候就碰到了它。"

    # game/script.rpy:65594
    old "I don't think I traveled a few seconds through time, but actually minutes. About twenty, I'd say."
    new "我觉得自己穿越的不是几秒，而是好几分钟。我看有二十分钟左右。"

    # game/script.rpy:65595
    old "I recalled the time they'd unlocked the cabinet again. If the other Atsuki had just touched it, his experience surely resembled what I was describing."
    new "我想起他们后来再次解锁展示柜的那次。如果另一个 Atsuki 正是在那时候碰到了它，那他的经历应该和我描述的差不多。"

    # game/script.rpy:65599
    old "As I nodded, the air around me felt somehow dense. The situation was so surreal that I could hardly believe I was really there."
    new "我点了点头，只觉得周遭的空气莫名凝滞。眼前的情形太过离奇，我几乎不敢相信自己真的身在此处。"

    # game/script.rpy:65608
    old "I saw the Sekimeiya near the hallway B door, sitting on top of its cushion. It was clearly gray."
    new "我看见 Sekimeiya 就在 B走廊门边，放在它的垫子上，颜色分明是灰的。"

    # game/script.rpy:65610
    old "I placed my hand on it."
    new "我把手放了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:65618
    old "While everyone observed me, I put the Sekimeiya in the cabinet. In mere seconds, its white color returned."
    new "趁大家打量我的时候，我把 Sekimeiya 放回了展示柜。短短几秒，它又变回了白色。"

    # game/script.rpy:65632
    old "The keyring was inserted in the cabinet, so I gave it to Miiya after locking the wheel manually."
    new "钥匙串还插在展示柜的锁孔里，我手动把转轮锁好后，才把它交给 Miiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:65633
    old "I doubt they'll actually do that, but it'd be best if they did. If the Sekimeiya stays in here, all those tragedies won't happen."
    new "我很怀疑他们到底会不会照做，不过那样最好。只要 Sekimeiya 留在这里，那些惨剧就都不会发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:65676
    old "Akaro looked through multiple doors, but he didn't find Sai."
    new "Akaro 接连查看了好几扇门，都没找到 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:65690
    old "We heard faint sounds coming from the security room."
    new "监控室那边传来隐约的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:65695
    old "...Only Katei was there. While everyone entered, I stayed near the hallway, ready to leave at any time."
    new "……里面只有 Katei。大家进去的时候，我留在走廊附近，随时准备动身。"

    # game/script.rpy:65700
    old "...Oh, I haven't been able to fix anything. I apologize."
    new "……唉，我什么都没能修好。实在抱歉。"

    # game/script.rpy:65701
    old "He's doing the same thing as in my world."
    new "他做的事，和我那个世界一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:65702
    old "I am completely lost; I don't even know what the issue is. Everything is properly arranged and connected, so unless no electricity is reaching the outlets, I'm out of ideas."
    new "我完全摸不着头脑，连问题出在哪儿都不知道。线路排布、连接都好好的，除非是插座根本没通电，否则我真没别的办法了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65705
    old "Katei crouched under the desk, inspecting things once again."
    new "Katei 蹲在桌子底下，又把各处检查了一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:65718
    old "I kept looking at the staircase, wondering where the other Atsuki was. I was sure he had appeared in the past with Sai, but it was unusual that he hadn't shown himself yet.{w} The door to the lobby was open. As it was likely he was on a higher floor, I wanted to leave as soon as I saw him returning."
    new "我一直望着楼梯，心里想着另一个我在哪儿。他应该和 Sai 一起出现在了过去的这个时间点，却迟迟不露面，这很反常。{w}通往大厅的门开着。他多半在更高的楼层，我打算一看到他回来就立刻离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:65721
    old "Wait a second. Am I falling for it again?{w} Katei touched the Sekimeiya and appeared in hallway A. He had just been there, as he'd walked from the security room to the event room.{w} He appeared in a past location! He could've gone to the future."
    new "等等。我是不是又上当了？{w}Katei 碰了 Sekimeiya，然后出现在 A 走廊。他刚刚才经过那里——从监控室走到活动室。{w}他出现在了过去的地点！可他也可能是去了未来啊。"

    # game/script.rpy:65723
    old "I could see the cabinet in the event room from where I was. What was inside it at that moment was the Future Sekimeiya."
    new "从我站的位置能看见活动室里的展示柜。那一刻放在里面的，是未来Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:65725
    old "The only reason they think we went to the past is due to what Katei said. \"I just... traveled to the past.\""
    new "他们认定我们去了过去，唯一的依据就是 Katei 那句话。『我只是……穿越到了过去。』"

    # game/script.rpy:65726
    old "Why the hell did he say that!? He was carefully holding the Sekimeiya without touching it with his skin, so he knew about its powers...{w} If he had traveled to the past before, it's very likely that's what he assumed just happened again. He went a couple seconds to the future, so he couldn't notice his own misinterpretation. Unless he lied on purpose, I guess."
    new "他到底为什么要那么说！？他小心地捧着 Sekimeiya，不让皮肤碰到它，可见他知道它的力量……{w}如果他以前穿越到过去过，那他很可能会以为这次也是如此。可他其实是去了几秒后的未来，所以察觉不到自己判断错了。除非——他是故意撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:65733
    old "Miiya saw that I'd been looking ahead. When she followed my line of sight, she noticed the elevator wasn't properly closed."
    new "Miiya 见我一直望着前面，便顺着我的视线看过去，发现电梯没关好。"

    # game/script.rpy:65755
    old "Me neither."
    new "我也没注意。"

    # game/script.rpy:65756
    old "I wonder what I should do. I can't change my version of what happened, but the other Atsuki didn't travel to the past. ...Neither did Sai. That's why they're not back yet."
    new "我该怎么办才好。我这边发生的事我改变不了，可另一个我没有穿越到过去……Sai 也一样。所以他们到现在还没回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:65757
    old "What I said still applies, though. They went about twenty minutes to the future. That's when they'll return."
    new "不过我先前的说法依然成立。他们去了大约二十分钟后的未来，到那时就会回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:65762
    old "...Wait, I just remembered the hallway B camera. The one that had its lens completely clean."
    new "……等等，我想起 B 走廊那台摄像头了。就是镜头上干干净净的那台。"

    # game/script.rpy:65763
    old "Oh, they did notice it."
    new "哦，他们确实注意到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65779
    old "Yeah, and the footage was being displayed up there."
    new "嗯，而且画面就显示在上面。"

    # game/script.rpy:65785
    old "That makes sense. When they went to the security room, the computer wasn't disabled yet."
    new "这就说得通了。他们去监控室的时候，电脑还没被停掉。"

    # game/script.rpy:65789
    old "Katei and Akaro ran out of the room to confirm what we were saying."
    new "Katei 和 Akaro 跑出房间，去确认我们说的话。"

    # game/script.rpy:65810
    old "Katei was told that Sai had recently vanished. Before he could begin to spit out more of his nonsense, Akaro forced him to hold off."
    new "有人告诉 Katei，Sai 刚刚不见了。他还没来得及再吐出一堆胡话，就被 Akaro 拦住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65833
    old "Hidden behind the handrail? I think it fell to the floor when I was here. He probably found it when he was unplugging some cables."
    new "藏在扶手后面？我记得我在这儿的时候它掉到了地上。大概是他拔线缆的时候捡到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:65835
    old "I'd been quiet for a while, so I decided to speak. My voice came out rougher than I intended."
    new "我沉默了一会儿，才决定开口。声音比我预想的要沙哑。"

    # game/script.rpy:65836
    old "So it was placed on the lens of that camera, which prevented the smoke from hitting it. Afterward, it was removed...{w} I'm confused about a few things. Why would someone do that? They had to already know the smoke attack would happen."
    new "所以它是被贴在那台摄像头的镜头上，挡住了烟。之后又被取下来……{w}有几件事我想不通。谁会这么做？他一定事先就知道会有人放烟。"

    # game/script.rpy:65843
    old "Katei sighed, dramatically sitting on his chair."
    new "Katei 叹了口气，夸张地坐回自己的椅子上。"

    # game/script.rpy:65846
    old "Katei, clearly agitated, pressed the computer's power button again while looking at all the blank monitors."
    new "Katei 明显焦躁不安，一边盯着满墙漆黑的显示器，一边又按了一下电脑的电源键。"

    # game/script.rpy:65850
    old "None of us responded. For some reason, everyone looked tired. It seemed no one had the will to go find Sai."
    new "谁都没有应声。不知为何，每个人看上去都很疲惫，似乎谁也没力气去找 Sai。"

    # game/script.rpy:65851
    old "I remained quiet along with them, but that was because I was counting the seconds. I figured it had been close to twenty minutes since the other Atsuki and Sai had disappeared."
    new "我也和他们一样沉默，但我是在数着秒。我估摸着，另一个我和 Sai 已经消失快二十分钟了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65852
    old "The empty screens were the only place anyone was looking. That was all I needed to silently escape, retreating until I was safely in the lobby."
    new "所有人的目光都落在那些空白的屏幕上。这已足够让我悄悄脱身，一路退到门厅里才停下。"

    # game/script.rpy:65865
    old "Nobody noticed that I'd left. Soon after my departure, Sai and the other Atsuki returned."
    new "没人察觉我离开了。我走后不久，Sai 和另一个 Atsuki 就回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65869
    old "I wondered what would happen next. Would they realize what had occurred? Two Sekimeiya had been hidden somewhere, and just like in my world, their very existence was concealed."
    new "不知道接下来会怎样。他们会发现发生了什么吗？两个 Sekimeiya 被藏在了某处，和我所在的世界一样，它们的存在本身被隐瞒了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65870
    old "During the time I'd been hiding in the storeroom, there was an extended period of complete silence; I'd only heard sporadic footsteps every now and then."
    new "我躲在储藏室里的那段时间，有很长一阵子一点声音都没有，只偶尔传来几声零星的脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:65874
    old "Although my perspective had grown wider, that was all that happened. However, I was able to understand it better from a distance, keeping my presence a secret thanks to the layout of the floor."
    new "虽然我的视野开阔了些，但也仅此而已。不过，多亏了这一层的布局，我能藏住身形，从远处反倒看得更清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:65878
    old "The people in the security room split up. Atsuki, Miiya, Sai, and Katei went up the stairs. For a very long time, Atsuki and Miiya didn't come back."
    new "监控室里的人散了。Atsuki、Miiya、Sai 和 Katei 上了楼梯。Atsuki 和 Miiya 很久都没有回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:65879
    old "Meanwhile, although calmness seemed to permeate the crystal floor, that was far from the truth."
    new "与此同时，水晶层看似一片平静，实则远非如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:65880
    old "Sai and Katei had returned. Everyone who I knew was on the crystal floor wanted the Sekimeiya. Not just the one in the cabinet, but the two hidden ones as well."
    new "Sai 和 Katei 回来了。据我所知，水晶层上的每个人都想要 Sekimeiya。不只是展示柜里那一个，还有藏起来的那两个。"

    # game/script.rpy:65881
    old "I saw it with my own eyes. When Katei thought no one was watching, he took the Future Sekimeiya. The cabinet was locked, so he had a spare key."
    new "我亲眼看见了。Katei 趁没人注意，取走了未来Sekimeiya。展示柜是锁着的，说明他另有一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:65882
    old "Then, he brought it to room B4. Strangely, like in the previous world, he chose not to hide it in the storeroom's secret area."
    new "随后他把它带去了水晶展室 B4。奇怪的是，和上一个世界一样，他没有把它藏进储藏室的秘密之处。"

    # game/script.rpy:65883
    old "At that point, I realized that I'd been mistaken. I wasn't the only one to notice Katei."
    new "那一刻我才明白自己错了。注意到 Katei 的，并不只有我。"

    # game/script.rpy:65884
    old "After he left, it was Akaro who entered that room, hiding the Sekimeiya behind his back as he stepped out."
    new "他离开之后，进那间房的人是 Akaro——出来时，他把 Sekimeiya 藏在身后。"

    # game/script.rpy:65887
    old "They both wanted to obtain all the Sekimeiya, and it became evident that Akaro and Katei weren't working together. Along with Sai, they continued silently working toward their objective."
    new "两个人都想拿到所有的 Sekimeiya，而 Akaro 与 Katei 显然并非同伙。再加上 Sai，三人各自沉默地朝着自己的目标行动。"

    # game/script.rpy:65888
    old "At one point, Erina and Isla remained in one of hallway A's crystal rooms, while the other Atsuki and Miiya were likely in the attic. It was hard to decipher everyone's goal, but all I wanted was to let the minutes keep passing without interruptions."
    new "有那么一阵，Erina 和 Isla 待在 A走廊的一间水晶展室里，另一个 Atsuki 和 Miiya 则多半在阁楼。我摸不清每个人究竟想做什么，只希望时间就这么一分一分过去，不被打断。"

    # game/script.rpy:65893
    old "It had been a while since Katei had entered one of the crystal rooms. ...I knew one of the Sekimeiya was there."
    new "Katei 进那间水晶展室已经有一阵子了。……我知道那里放着一个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:65897
    old "Had he activated it? I looked through the door and saw an open cabinet. Inside, there was a gray Sekimeiya."
    new "他启动它了吗？我从门口望进去，只见展示柜敞着，里面放着一个灰色 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:65898
    old "I figured that he would've traveled more than an hour through time, and the fact that I hadn't seen him yet seemed to imply he'd gone to the future."
    new "我估计他穿越的时间超过了一个小时。既然到现在都没见到他，那他多半是去了未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:65903
    old "It appeared Katei was out of the picture, but Sai and Akaro were still around. When I saw them, they were looking for Katei, but they located the Future Sekimeiya instead."
    new "看来 Katei 已经出局了，但 Sai 和 Akaro 还在。我看见他们时，他们正在找 Katei，结果却找到了未来Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:65904
    old "Since they were together, neither one revealed their true colors, and they brought it to its cabinet."
    new "两人同行，谁也没有露出真面目，只把它送回了属于它的展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:65905
    old "...However, as expected, it was Akaro who later took it out again."
    new "……可后来把它再次取出来的，果然还是 Akaro。"

    # game/script.rpy:65910
    old "I was witnessing a bizarre play. No matter how many details I was missing, their movements felt ridiculous. I considered that they might have been relocating the Sekimeiya so early in the off chance the shutter opened before the deadline."
    new "我像是在看一出荒诞的戏。不管我漏掉了多少细节，他们的举动都显得可笑。我猜想，他们之所以这么早就把 Sekimeiya 挪来挪去，是防备着卷帘门在期限之前就打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:65914
    old "The same thing repeated. The Sekimeiya was found in one of the drawers in the lobby. That time, when they brought it to the cabinet, I heard what they were saying."
    new "同样的一幕又重演了。有人在门厅的一个抽屉里找到了那个 Sekimeiya。这回他们把它送回展示柜时，我听见了他们的谈话。"

    # game/script.rpy:65915
    old "They were blaming the people who'd disappeared. Although they themselves were responsible, Katei, the other Atsuki, and Miiya were the hidden culprits according to their narrative. It appeared they had locked themselves up in the attic."
    new "他们在指责那些消失的人。明明该负责的是他们自己，可照他们的说法，Katei、另一个 Atsuki 和 Miiya 才是藏在暗处的元凶——那几个人似乎把自己关进了阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:65919
    old "Of course, the Sekimeiya didn't remain in the cabinet for long. However, as I saw it being brought to the lobby, a sound in hallway A caught my ear."
    new "当然，那个 Sekimeiya 没在展示柜里待多久。可是，就在我看着它被送回门厅时，A 走廊里传来一个声音，引起了我的注意。"

    # game/script.rpy:65926
    old "The other Atsuki and Miiya were back. I saw them in the security room.{w} I didn't understand what they'd been doing. ...Why would they have locked themselves in the attic? And why had they returned?{w} Suddenly, a sound drew them to the lobby."
    new "另一个 Atsuki 和 Miiya 回来了。我看见他们进了监控室。{w}我不明白他们此前在做什么。……他们为什么要把自己关在阁楼里？又为什么回来了？{w}忽然，一个声响把他们引向了门厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:65927
    old "...I had already been in the tower for hours. I didn't think a lot of time was left until they would all vanish from the bottom floor."
    new "……我在塔里已经待了好几个小时。恐怕没剩多少时间，他们就会从底层全部消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65928
    old "I'd tried to keep my distance from everyone, but seeing Miiya again made me slowly approach the entrance area."
    new "我一直尽量与所有人保持距离，可是再次见到 Miiya，我不由得慢慢朝入口那边走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:65933
    old "I stood next to the far door. ...Were they on the other side of it? I couldn't hear anyone."
    new "我站在最里面那扇门旁。……他们就在门后吗？我什么都听不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:65934
    old "Instead, the faint voices I heard came from the event room."
    new "我听见的微弱人声，其实来自活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:65937
    old "I was instantly alarmed. If they looked at the hallway, I would be seen.{w} I couldn't go to the lobby, and walking back could lead to me being noticed."
    new "我顿时警觉起来。只要他们往走廊这边看一眼，就会发现我。{w}我不能去门厅，往回走也可能被人注意到。"

    # game/script.rpy:65938
    old "...Wait. Erina and Isla aren't there anymore."
    new "……等等。Erina 和 Isla 已经不在那儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65941
    old "The door of room A1 was slightly open. It made me gasp at first, but I quickly saw that the room was empty."
    new "水晶展室 A1 的门虚掩着。我起初吓了一跳，但很快就看清房里空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:65942
    old "...Are they the ones in the event room, then?"
    new "……那活动室里的人，就是她们了？"

    # game/script.rpy:65946
    old "I didn't have time to think, so I stepped in."
    new "我顾不上多想，便走了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:65953
    old "I stayed tense by the door, unaware of whether I could leave. Someone was in the event room, and I didn't know their identity."
    new "我紧绷着身子守在门边，不知道自己能不能出去。活动室里有人，而我却不知道那是谁。"

    # game/script.rpy:65954
    old "...However, I couldn't hear anything from the lobby. Maybe they were no longer there."
    new "……可门厅那边毫无声响。也许他们已经不在那儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65958
    old "I got closer to the wall and tried to listen through it."
    new "我凑近墙壁，想隔着墙听个究竟。"

    # game/script.rpy:65966
    old "I didn't want to leave without being sure, but my fear was that Erina and Isla would return."
    new "不确认清楚，我不想就这么走开，可我又怕 Erina 和 Isla 会回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:65967
    old "I could hear sporadic sounds, likely coming from the event room. They kept me trapped behind that door for minutes until I noticed someone walking on the other side."
    new "断断续续的声响，多半来自活动室。那声音害得我躲在那扇门后好几分钟，直到察觉有人在另一侧走动。"

    # game/script.rpy:65968
    old "Their faint steps went off to the lobby, which let me release the breath I'd been holding."
    new "轻微的脚步声朝门厅远去了，我这才把憋着的那口气吐出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:65969
    old "When I put my ear against the wall, the area still sounded vacant. That time, though, I knew for sure that someone was there."
    new "我把耳朵贴上墙壁时，那一带听上去依旧空荡荡的。可这一次，我确信那里有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:65975
    old "I focused intently. Suddenly, I heard an unexpected voice."
    new "我屏息凝神。忽然，一个意想不到的声音传了过来。"

    # game/script.rpy:65977
    old "...ou there?"
    new "……有人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:65979
    old "What?{w} ...Who is that?"
    new "什么？{w}……那是谁？"

    # game/script.rpy:65980
    old "...es! ...ower!"
    new "……对！……塔里！"

    # game/script.rpy:65981
    old "I was shocked. That voice didn't belong to anyone who should've been in the tower."
    new "我吃了一惊。那声音不属于任何本该待在塔里的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:65984
    old "I turned my head abruptly. ...Had someone just come out of the security room?{w} I was fairly sure I'd sensed that, but I kept paying attention to the lobby."
    new "我猛地转过头。……刚刚是有人从监控室出来了吗？{w}我几乎确定自己察觉到了动静，却还是继续留意着门厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:65987
    old "The next time I heard it, the intensity of the voice was higher."
    new "再次听到时，那声音更响了些。"

    # game/script.rpy:65988
    old "Hey! ...there!"
    new "喂！……那边！"

    # game/script.rpy:65989
    old "That was enough to let me confirm who it was."
    new "这一声就足够让我确认那是谁了。"

    # game/script.rpy:65990
    old "Suripo...! That's him!"
    new "Suripo……！是他！"

    # game/script.rpy:65994
    old "It was absurd for him to be inside, but I couldn't worry about it. I had to concentrate on what was happening behind the wall."
    new "他出现在塔里实在荒唐，可此刻我顾不上这些。我必须专心听墙后的动静。"

    # game/script.rpy:65996
    old "Someone ran. That was all I could make out.{w} Then, a noise like someone collapsing."
    new "有人跑了起来。我只分辨得出这些。{w}紧接着，传来一声像是有人倒下的响动。"

    # game/script.rpy:66000
    old "...{w}What? Is he gone?"
    new "……{w}怎么回事？他不见了？"

    # game/script.rpy:66001
    old "The next thing I heard didn't come from the direction of the lobby. It came from the wall behind me."
    new "接下来我听到的声音并不是从大厅方向来的，而是从我身后的墙壁那边传来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:66004
    old "Is... someone there?"
    new "有……有人吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:66005
    old "Behind it should've been one of hallway B's crystal rooms, B1."
    new "那面墙后面，应该是B走廊的一间水晶展室，B1。"

    # game/script.rpy:66006
    old "...But, again, that was the last sound I heard before silence enveloped the building once more."
    new "……然而，那同样是我听到的最后一点声响。之后，整栋建筑再度陷入沉寂。"

    # game/script.rpy:66012
    old "I hadn't been mistaken. I'd heard Suripo's voice coming from the lobby."
    new "我没有听错。从大厅传来的确实是 Suripo 的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:66013
    old "Could the shutter have unlocked? There was no way. I knew the tower would be sealed off for quite a while longer."
    new "难道是卷帘门解锁了？不可能。我很清楚，这座塔还要封闭很长一段时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:66014
    old "How? How the hell was that Suripo? How did he get in?"
    new "怎么会？那怎么可能是 Suripo？他是怎么进来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:66015
    old "Did he enter through the storeroom?{w} No. What am I thinking? My past self is currently there."
    new "难道是从储藏室进来的？{w}不对。我在想什么？过去的我此刻就在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:66016
    old "I wanted to see it with my own eyes, but I couldn't afford to leave; I didn't know where anyone was."
    new "我真想亲眼看看，可我不能离开——我根本不知道其他人都在哪儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:66022
    old "Hallway A sounded empty as well, but I remained in that room. A short time later, faraway sounds made it clear I wasn't alone. I continued to bide my time in the hope that everyone else would congregate and I'd be able to slip away."
    new "A走廊那边听上去也没有人，但我仍旧守在那间屋里。没过多久，远处传来的动静让我明白，这里并不只有我一个人。我继续耐着性子等待，盼着其他人聚到一处，好让我能趁机溜走。"

    # game/script.rpy:66026
    old "After a few minutes had passed, a sudden gasp caused my eyes to shoot wide open. Miiya was behind the door, and I could hear myself as well."
    new "几分钟后，一声突如其来的惊呼让我猛地睁大了眼睛。Miiya 就在门后，我也听见了自己的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:66027
    old "Oh...!{w} D-Did I just appear out of nowhere?"
    new "啊……！{w}我、我是刚刚凭空出现的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:66033
    old "...{w}It teleported you as well? How come that didn't happen the other times?"
    new "……{w}连你也一起传送了？为什么之前几次没发生这种事？"

    # game/script.rpy:66034
    old "And both of us appeared here..."
    new "而且我们两个都出现在这里……"

    # game/script.rpy:66038
    old "That's Sai. I'm pretty sure he's in the event room."
    new "是 Sai。他应该就在活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:66041
    old "So this is the first time they've seen Miiya and the other Atsuki since they went upstairs."
    new "也就是说，自从 Miiya 和另一个我上楼之后，这是他们第一次见到我俩。"

    # game/script.rpy:66042
    old "They were in the security room earlier, though. They weren't seen because they traveled to the future. The Future Sekimeiya was brought to the lobby, and they activated it. They just appeared in front of the security room, where they were in the past."
    new "不过他们之前确实在监控室。之所以没人看见，是因为他们穿越到了未来。未来Sekimeiya 被带到了大厅，他们启动了它。于是他们直接出现在监控室门前——那正是他们过去待的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:66046
    old "They were in the event room, but I couldn't pick up anything.{w} That was until Sai yelled."
    new "他们就在活动室，可我什么也听不清。{w}直到 Sai 大吼了一声。"

    # game/script.rpy:66052
    old "Akaro's voice came from the hallway."
    new "Akaro 的声音从走廊里传来。"

    # game/script.rpy:66053
    old "...ere sleeping alo— ...you been?"
    new "……一个人睡——……去哪儿了？"

    # game/script.rpy:66055
    old "Oh...! Katei's here again!"
    new "哦……！Katei 又出现了！"

    # game/script.rpy:66056
    old "...here this whole time. I didn't go anywhere."
    new "……一直在这儿。我哪儿也没去。"

    # game/script.rpy:66057
    old "His words suddenly connected the dots. I understood what had happened."
    new "他的话忽然把一切串了起来。我明白了究竟发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:66058
    old "...Right. Katei went to the future a while ago. The range was large, so I bet it barely reached outside the tower.{w} It reached far enough to include Suripo, and they went far forward in time.{w} The locations match. Before the attack, Suripo was in the lobby, near the front door. At the time, Katei was still in the security room. That's where they appeared just now.{w} Those locations are from a time before the smoke was released; Katei's clothes should have no smoke on them. They were pretty clean anyway, so I doubt anyone would notice that."
    new "……没错。Katei 刚才去了未来。范围很大，我猜它勉强延伸到塔外。{w}但已经远得把 Suripo 也包了进去，于是他们一起跳到了很久之后。{w}位置也对得上。袭击发生前，Suripo 就在大厅靠近正门的地方；而当时 Katei 还在监控室。他们刚才正是在那里出现的。{w}那些位置对应的时间都在烟雾释放之前，所以 Katei 的衣服上不该沾到烟。再说那身衣服本来就挺干净的，我想没人会注意到。"

    # game/script.rpy:66062
    old "Katei and Akaro had entered the event room, so I gave up on understanding what they were saying."
    new "Katei 和 Akaro 已经进了活动室，我也就放弃了听清他们在说什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:66063
    old "Where the hell is Suripo now, though!?"
    new "可 Suripo 现在到底在哪儿！？"

    # game/script.rpy:66064
    old "Where was he when I was in the attic experimenting with the Sekimeiya? Did he change worlds as well?"
    new "我在阁楼试验 Sekimeiya 的时候，他又在哪里？他也切换了世界吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:66069
    old "Wh...! ...you hear that!?"
    new "什……！……你听见了吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:66071
    old "My own voice shouted those words. I frowned, as I hadn't heard anything."
    new "那是我自己的声音在喊。我皱起眉，因为我什么也没听见。"

    # game/script.rpy:66072
    old "Everyone came out of the event room and approached the lobby."
    new "众人纷纷走出活动室，朝大厅走来。"

    # game/script.rpy:66075
    old "Oh, Suripo's still there."
    new "哦，Suripo 还在那儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:66076
    old "...It was the next person to talk who left me in a daze."
    new "……而接下来开口的那个人，让我彻底怔住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66082
    old "That terror in my voice... It was easily recognizable."
    new "我声音里的那股恐惧……任谁都听得出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:66083
    old "Don't tell me..."
    new "难道说……"

    # game/script.rpy:66086
    old "They all stepped in."
    new "他们全都走了进来。"

    # game/script.rpy:66090
    old "...een here at the tower recently. I don't know his name, but he was inves— ...attack."
    new "……他最近一直在塔里。我不知道他叫什么，不过他一直在调查——……袭击。"

    # game/script.rpy:66091
    old "...{w}This is a knife wound."
    new "……{w}这是刀伤。"

    # game/script.rpy:66092
    old "No way... A knife wound?"
    new "怎么可能……刀伤？"

    # game/script.rpy:66093
    old "I couldn't believe what I was hearing. Suripo had been killed? ...I'd never looked at the lobby."
    new "我不敢相信自己听到的话。Suripo 被杀了？……我始终没往大厅那边看过一眼。"

    # game/script.rpy:66094
    old "You've been missing for the last three hours. Just as you reappear— ...no coincidence."
    new "你消失了整整三个小时。偏偏就在你重新出现的时候—— ……绝非巧合。"

    # game/script.rpy:66096
    old "I cannot believe what I'm hearing! I've been here the entire time!"
    new "我简直不敢相信自己的耳朵！我一直都在这儿！"

    # game/script.rpy:66097
    old "Yes, look at this! This is why I thought it must've been a knife. It was his own!"
    new "对，你看看这个！所以我才觉得一定是刀伤。那是他自己的刀！"

    # game/script.rpy:66098
    old "...his knife is gone. ...saw that he had a knife right here—"
    new "……他的刀不见了。……我明明看到这里有一把刀——"

    # game/script.rpy:66099
    old "Wait... the knife was Suripo's?"
    new "等等……那把刀是 Suripo 的？"

    # game/script.rpy:66100
    old "If that's the case, the knife Sai chased us with... Where the hell did he get it from?"
    new "如果是这样，那 Sai 追我们时拿的那把刀……他到底是从哪儿弄来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:66105
    old "They found a walkie-talkie on him, but it seemed it had been damaged, and its battery was missing."
    new "他们在他身上找到了一台对讲机，但似乎已经损坏，电池也不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66106
    old "This happened just now. When I heard him talking, he was having a conversation with the policemen outside."
    new "事情就发生在刚才。我听见他说话的时候，他正在和外面的警察对话。"

    # game/script.rpy:66107
    old "Who the hell would've killed Suripo immediately after seeing him? I distinctly remembered that someone had entered the lobby seconds before I'd heard his voice."
    new "究竟是谁，一见到 Suripo 就立刻下了杀手？我清楚地记得，在我听见他的声音前几秒，有人走进了大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:66108
    old "And breaking the walkie-talkie... Was that done so that the group couldn't communicate with the outside, or was it done so that Suripo couldn't keep talking to them?"
    new "还有砸坏对讲机……是为了让他们无法和外界联系，还是为了让 Suripo 没法继续说下去？"

    # game/script.rpy:66109
    old "Listening to the conversation, I grew a bit more confused.{w} According to the other me, Suripo hadn't been dead six minutes previously, so nobody could've killed him."
    new "听着他们的对话，我越发糊涂了。{w}按另一个我的说法，六分钟前 Suripo 还没死，那就不可能有人杀他。"

    # game/script.rpy:66110
    old "But that's wrong. He was dead six minutes ago.{w} Why is he saying that? ...Six minutes ago, I bet that version of me was already traveling to the future. There's no way he saw the lobby. Miiya's agreeing with him, though."
    new "可那不对。六分钟前他就已经死了。{w}他为什么这么说？……六分钟前，那个我那时应该已经在往未来穿越了，根本不可能看到大厅。可 Miiya 却附和他。"

    # game/script.rpy:66113
    old "As I kept listening, I understood that their misinterpretation was the same—they thought they had gone to the past. If that was the case, none of them could have killed Suripo."
    new "继续听下去，我明白了他们的误解如出一辙——都以为自己回到了过去。若真是如此，他们谁都不可能杀死 Suripo。"

    # game/script.rpy:66114
    old "This doesn't make sense, though. Sai just said it's {time=13:23.}"
    new "可这说不通。Sai 刚才说现在是 {time=13:23.}"

    # game/script.rpy:66115
    old "That's what led Atsuki to say that Suripo was alive six minutes ago. At {time=13:17}, they'd seen the lobby was empty."
    new "正因如此，Atsuki 才会说六分钟前 Suripo 还活着。{time=13:17} 的时候，他们看到大厅空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:66116
    old "For that to make sense, the other Atsuki had to know the time before traveling to the future. But if he knew the time before traveling, hearing the time Sai gave should've revealed that they went to the future."
    new "要说得通，另一个 Atsuki 必须在穿越前就知道时间。可如果他穿越前就知道，听到 Sai 报出的时刻，就该明白自己是去了未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:66118
    old "...{w}Oh!{w} That's not actually right!"
    new "……{w}啊！{w}不对，其实不是这样！"

    # game/script.rpy:66121
    old "At {time=13:17}, the lobby was empty. That was before they traveled to the future, and somehow, they knew what the time was. They just said that they touched the Sekimeiya in the mechanical room."
    new "在 {time=13:17}，大厅还是空的。那是在他们穿越到未来之前，而他们不知怎么就知道了当时的时刻。他们刚才说，他们在机械室碰了 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:66122
    old "More than twenty minutes have passed since I saw them in the security room, which was right after the Future Sekimeiya was taken out of the cabinet. Since they reappeared in hallway A, they went ten minutes to the future once the Sekimeiya had gathered power for ten minutes. Something like that."
    new "我在监控室看到他们时，未来Sekimeiya 刚从展示柜里取出，到现在已经过了二十多分钟。既然他们重新出现在 A走廊，那就是 Sekimeiya 蓄能十分钟后，他们向未来跳了十分钟。大概是这么回事。"

    # game/script.rpy:66123
    old "Atsuki and Miiya appeared at around {time=13:37.} The key to this is Sai's wristwatch."
    new "Atsuki 和 Miiya 大约在 {time=13:37.} 现身。关键就在 Sai 的手表上。"

    # game/script.rpy:66124
    old "Earlier, Sai traveled to the future with Atsuki, which I deduced was almost twenty minutes to the future. So, ever since they appeared, Sai's watch has been more than half an hour behind. I'm sure that contributed to them thinking they'd gone to the past the first time."
    new "先前 Sai 和 Atsuki 一起穿越到未来，我推断差不多是往前跳了二十分钟。所以他们现身之后，Sai 的表一直慢了大半个小时。他们第一次误以为回到了过去，肯定也是这个原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:66125
    old "Sai just said it's {time=13:23}, but his watch is still behind. The computer isn't on, so he's not going to recognize that.{w} That's what's making Atsuki and Miiya think they've gone to the past again. They think they appeared back at {time=13:23} and that Suripo has just been killed."
    new "Sai 刚才说现在是 {time=13:23}，可他的表还是慢的。电脑没开，他也没法察觉。{w}正因为这样，Atsuki 和 Miiya 才以为又回到了过去——他们以为自己回到了 {time=13:23}，而 Suripo 刚刚遇害。"

    # game/script.rpy:66130
    old "Sai went to the mechanical room, where he was told the Future Sekimeiya was. However, he came back claiming he hadn't found it."
    new "Sai 去了机械室——据说未来Sekimeiya就在那里。可他回来说没找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:66131
    old "...was right. They're lying."
    new "……说得没错。他们在撒谎。"

    # game/script.rpy:66132
    old "I see. They said that the point they traveled to the past just happened. That means the Future Sekimeiya should've still been there."
    new "原来如此。他们说自己穿越回过去的那个时间点刚刚才发生。那就是说，未来Sekimeiya当时应该还在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:66133
    old "In reality, it wouldn't surprise me if Suripo's killer took it several minutes ago. When the killer entered the lobby, the door to the mechanical room could easily have been left open by Miiya and the other Atsuki."
    new "实际上，就算凶手几分钟前把它拿走了，我也不意外。凶手进大厅的时候，机械室的门很可能是 Miiya 和另一个 Atsuki 没关上的。"

    # game/script.rpy:66134
    old "They went down and found the Sekimeiya. Then, after they came back up, Suripo was there."
    new "他们下楼找到了 Sekimeiya。然后回到楼上，Suripo 就在那儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66136
    old "Atsuki walked down the stairs to look for himself. Soon, he returned, admitting that the Sekimeiya was no longer there."
    new "Atsuki 亲自下楼去看了一趟。没多久他就回来，承认 Sekimeiya 已经不在那儿了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66140
    old "Added to the fact that Naomi hasn't been found, you can't possibly think we did this, right?"
    new "再加上 Naomi 至今下落不明，你总不会觉得是我们干的吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:66142
    old "There's n-no way. I think Naomi's the first— ...ot only has she managed to remain hidden, but she also might have the same keys that we have."
    new "绝、绝不可能。我想 Naomi 才是头号嫌疑人——……她不但一直藏得好好的，手里可能还有和我们一样的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:66143
    old "There are no cameras here, but we don't know if they're recording in the first place... —idn't inspect the whole building because you thought we were in the attic— ...have to be missing something that the culprit is aware of. Could there be a place we're ignoring?"
    new "这里没有摄像头，可我们也不清楚它们到底有没有在录像。你没把整栋楼查遍，是因为你以为我们在阁楼。我们一定漏掉了凶手知道的地方——会不会有某个被我们忽略的角落？"

    # game/script.rpy:66148
    old "We have to find her or whoever else is here. It's almost guara— ...since this morning, and we didn't find him. ...more likely than some hidden passage."
    new "我们必须找到她，或者还在这栋楼里的其他人。几乎可以肯定——他从早上起就在这里，我们却一直没发现他。这比什么隐藏通道更有可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:66149
    old "If it's neither of those, there's still an answer with the Sekimeiya. This policeman could've come from the future if he touched the Sekimeiya after {time=21}, and Naomi could've left the tower by going far to the past. We found the Seki— ...where it is now."
    new "如果这两样都不是，那还有 Sekimeiya 这个解释。如果这名警察是在 {time=21} 之后碰过 Sekimeiya，那他可能是从未来来的；而 Naomi 也许穿越到了很远的过去，从而离开了这座塔。我们找到了 Seki——……知道它现在在哪里。"

    # game/script.rpy:66156
    old "The hallway A door opened, and they walked down to the far end. I got closer while being careful not to make any noise."
    new "A走廊的门开了，他们一路走到走廊尽头。我小心不发出声响，慢慢靠近。"

    # game/script.rpy:66160
    old "...possible someone's on this floor. Don't move—"
    new "……这层楼可能有人。别动——"

    # game/script.rpy:66161
    old "Wait. Are they really gonna search this whole floor?"
    new "等等。他们真要把整层都搜一遍？"

    # game/script.rpy:66162
    old "Oh, what am I even saying!? Of course!"
    new "哎呀，我在说什么啊！？当然会啊！"

    # game/script.rpy:66163
    old "My past self is about to leave the storeroom! I came out in the middle of a search."
    new "过去的我马上就要从储藏室出来了！偏偏是在搜查途中出来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:66164
    old "As soon as I comprehended my situation, I began to hear doors opening."
    new "我刚弄明白自己的处境，就听见各处响起开门的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:66165
    old "What the fuck? They're going to find me!"
    new "搞什么啊？他们会找到我的！"

    # game/script.rpy:66167
    old "No. I wouldn't be found. I knew that."
    new "不。我不会被找到的。这一点我很清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:66168
    old "I didn't want to be found. The time where everyone would disappear was very close. However, the steps in the hallway unnerved me all the same."
    new "我并不想被找到。所有人消失的时刻已近在眼前。可走廊里的脚步声仍旧让我心神不宁。"

    # game/script.rpy:66171
    old "There was no way to avoid it. I couldn't hide anywhere."
    new "躲是躲不掉的。我无处可藏。"

    # game/script.rpy:66172
    old "The Sekimeiya aren't here. I don't know where the future one is, but the past one is in hallway B."
    new "Sekimeiya 不在这儿。未来那个在哪我不知道，不过过去那个在B走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:66173
    old "A door opened very close to the room I was hiding in."
    new "我藏身的房间附近，一扇门打开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66174
    old "I could hear cabinets being opened. Then, footsteps came toward me.{w} The doorknob shook slightly, and the door slowly opened."
    new "我听见展示柜一个接一个打开，接着脚步声朝我这边来了。{w}门把手轻轻一晃，门缓缓开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66182
    old "I saw my own body stepping in. As he approached one of the cabinets, I knew there was only one thing I could do."
    new "我看见自己的身体走了进来。当他走近其中一个展示柜时，我明白自己只能做一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:66183
    old "This is very imp—"
    new "这非常重要——"

    # game/script.rpy:66188
    old "Wha—"
    new "什——"

    # game/script.rpy:66189
    old "He turned around with a startled gasp. His reaction was even more drastic when he saw me."
    new "他吃了一惊，倒吸一口气转过身来。看到我时，他的反应更加激烈。"

    # game/script.rpy:66190
    old "Wh-What!? Who are you!?{w} Are you... me?"
    new "什、什么！？你是谁！？{w}你是……我？"

    # game/script.rpy:66191
    old "I nodded, although it wasn't the entire truth."
    new "我点了点头，尽管那并不完全是实话。"

    # game/script.rpy:66192
    old "This is very important. Stay here until the search is finished."
    new "这件事非常重要。待在这里，等搜查结束。"

    # game/script.rpy:66196
    old "He couldn't fathom what he was seeing. However, he had already traveled through time. What was being presented was simply a request that he could take for granted—the way he saw it, there was no reason not to trust what he himself was saying."
    new "他无法理解眼前所见。可他已经亲身经历过时间穿越。眼前这请求，在他看来理所当然——既然话出自他自己之口，就没有理由不信。"

    # game/script.rpy:66197
    old "W-Wait, why!? Why are you here!?"
    new "等、等等，为什么！？你怎么会在这儿！？"

    # game/script.rpy:66198
    old "Be quiet! It's so that I'm not found, and just trust me, please."
    new "小声点！这样我才不会被人发现。相信我，拜托了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66199
    old "...{w}He nodded. It was the same thing I would've done."
    new "……{w}他点了点头。换成我也会这么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:66203
    old "I took a deep breath. Then, hesitantly, I approached the cabinets."
    new "我深吸一口气，随后迟疑地走向展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:66206
    old "I had to look through them so that the noise of looking through rooms continued."
    new "我得继续翻查这些柜子，让搜查房间的动静别停。"

    # game/script.rpy:66210
    old "Right, the third Sekimeiya's here. I'd forgotten that it was brought here before Erina and Isla came to this room.{w} This is the cabinet where my past self will see it. That means that the person who left this room was the Atsuki from this world."
    new "对了，第三个 Sekimeiya 在这里。我忘了它是在 Erina 和 Isla 来这个房间之前就被搬过来的。{w}过去那个我会看到它的，就是这个展示柜。也就是说，离开这个房间的人，是这个世界的 Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:66217
    old "I acted as if I hadn't found anything. When I was done, I walked to the door before glancing at Atsuki. From the despondent look in his eyes, I could tell that he was in a worse place mentally than I had been during the incident. He... I... looked horrible. Maybe he really was the Atsuki who'd written that note."
    new "我装作什么都没找到。查完后，我走到门口，回头看了 Atsuki 一眼。他眼中那份消沉让我明白，他的精神状态比我经历那起事件时还要糟。他……我……看起来糟透了。也许他真的是写下那张纸条的 Atsuki。"

    # game/script.rpy:66225
    old "The whole group was in hallway C."
    new "一行人都在C走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:66226
    old "As if nothing had happened, I walked to the security room first."
    new "我若无其事地先走向监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:66230
    old "I'd been able to camouflage myself in addition to something else.{w} If I hadn't been there, the Sekimeiya would've been found, but I could prevent that."
    new "除了另一件事，我还隐藏了自己的行踪。{w}如果我不在，Sekimeiya 就会被人发现，但我能避免这种情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:66231
    old "Just so that nothing else would happen, I could avoid \"finding\" them. It was better if no one used them during the time that remained."
    new "为了不再节外生枝，我可以避开，不去把它们“找出来”。剩下的时间里，最好谁也别用它们。"

    # game/script.rpy:66238
    old "When I stepped into the lobby, I saw Suripo's body on the floor. Blood covered both him and the tiles, evidently caused by the knife wound I'd heard them discussing."
    new "我一走进大厅，就看见 Suripo 倒在地上的尸体。血浸透了他，也染红了地砖——显然就是他们之前议论的那处刀伤造成的。"

    # game/script.rpy:66239
    old "I still couldn't believe it; I hadn't expected that at all. Everyone else was alive, but Suripo's corpse had suddenly appeared in the lobby..."
    new "我仍然不敢相信，这完全出乎我的意料。其他人全都还活着，Suripo 的尸体却突然出现在大厅里……"

    # game/script.rpy:66243
    old "I didn't like doing it, but I crouched down and verified he was dead. Then, to avoid being suspected, I went to the mechanical room as if I was searching through the floor normally."
    new "我并不想这么做，但还是蹲下身确认他已经死了。随后，为了不惹人怀疑，我照常装作搜查这层楼，走向机械室。"

    # game/script.rpy:66249
    old "I began with hallway B. Immediately, I found a Sekimeiya in the first room, B1."
    new "我从B走廊开始。第一个房间B1里，我立刻就发现了一个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:66252
    old "I felt the hot air around it. It had been powered on for a while already."
    new "我感觉到它周围的热气。它已经启动好一阵子了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66253
    old "This is the Future Sekimeiya.{w} When I was in the other crystal room, I heard someone here. After killing Suripo, this is where his killer left the Future Sekimeiya."
    new "这是未来Sekimeiya。{w}我在另一间水晶展室时，听见这边有人。杀了 Suripo 之后，凶手就把未来Sekimeiya 留在了这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:66261
    old "It wasn't until I entered the very last crystal room, B6, that I found the Past Sekimeiya. I had to quickly withdraw my hand. The air surrounding it was even hotter."
    new "直到走进最后一间水晶展室 B6，我才找到过去Sekimeiya。我不得不赶紧把手缩回来——它周围的空气更热。"

    # game/script.rpy:66279
    old "I knew how suspicious what I was saying was. Some people knew the Sekimeiya were in the rooms I'd just investigated, but I didn't care."
    new "我知道自己这番话有多可疑。有人知道我刚刚查过的那些房间里就有 Sekimeiya，可我并不在意。"

    # game/script.rpy:66290
    old "Before proceeding, I looked at both bathrooms and opened the elevator."
    new "继续之前，我查看了两间洗手间，又把电梯门打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:66296
    old "I went up first, as I couldn't bring myself to look into anyone's eyes."
    new "我先一步上了楼，因为我实在不敢去看任何人的眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:66322
    old "Miiya entered the partitions. I'd really just talked to her as if she had never died..."
    new "Miiya 走进了隔间。我刚刚居然还那样跟她说话，就好像她从未死过一样……"

    # game/script.rpy:66323
    old "But I'd been able to see that she was suffering too. The world we were in wasn't yet what it could be.{w} I dug my fingernails into my palm, telling myself that the result would be worth everything."
    new "可我也看得出来，她同样在痛苦。我们所处的世界，还不是它应有的样子。{w} 我把指甲掐进掌心，告诉自己，只要结果如愿，一切就都值得。"

    # game/script.rpy:66339
    old "Right now, the others have just found the secret area in the storeroom. My past self is already out of there."
    new "此刻，其他人刚刚发现储藏室里的秘密区域。过去的我已经离开那里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66345
    old "We went to the third floor, which was empty. Then, quietly, we walked up the stairs again."
    new "我们去了三楼，那里空无一人。随后我们又放轻脚步，走上了楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:66355
    old "When Miiya came out of the offices, I was about to keep going, but she was looking down at the floor."
    new "Miiya 从办公室里出来时，我正要继续往前走，却见她低头看着地面。"

    # game/script.rpy:66357
    old "She shook her head."
    new "她摇了摇头。"

    # game/script.rpy:66364
    old "We headed to the staircase."
    new "我们走向楼梯间。"

    # game/script.rpy:66384
    old "Her mood seemed to have suddenly changed. She appeared a little disoriented, so I decided to look through the fifth floor offices while she stayed outside."
    new "她的情绪似乎突然变了，人也有点恍惚，于是我决定让她留在外面，自己进去查看五楼的办公室。"

    # game/script.rpy:66391
    old "...I don't really expect Naomi to be in these, but it all gets weirder every time we move on. Could a secret place that Katei doesn't know about exist...?{w} There's no way, right? If the answer is somehow a hidden spot, he must've made use of it as well."
    new "……我其实并不指望 Naomi 会藏在这些地方，可我们每往前走一步，事情就越是古怪。会不会有一处连 Katei 都不知道的秘密地点……？{w} 这不可能吧？如果答案真是什么隐蔽的地方，他没道理不利用。"

    # game/script.rpy:66392
    old "She didn't reply, opting to continue looking down instead. It made my stomach turn. She was alive, and I was sure she was pushing herself to be strong, but her sudden change had made it evident how hard it was."
    new "她没有回答，只是继续低着头。我心里一阵发紧。她确实还活着，我也知道她一直在强撑，可她刚才那瞬间的变化，还是把这份艰难暴露得一清二楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:66394
    old "...I felt like there was something else buried in her eyes. I didn't know if I was imagining it, but I grimaced and kept moving forward."
    new "……我总觉得她眼底还藏着别的什么。我不知道那是不是自己的错觉，只是绷着脸继续往前走。"

    # game/script.rpy:66402
    old "She nodded and took the keyring out of her purse."
    new "她点点头，从手提包里取出钥匙串。"

    # game/script.rpy:66407
    old "No recent footprints...{w} It'll be fine if you stay here. If I don't find anyone, I'm gonna be pretty confused."
    new "最近没有脚印……{w} 你待在这儿就好。要是我一个人都找不到，可就真搞不懂了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66411
    old "I went through every room. As expected, they were all empty."
    new "我把每个房间都查了一遍。果然，全是空的。"

    # game/script.rpy:66422
    old "She didn't have anything to say. We went all the way back down, but that awkward silence hung around me the entire time."
    new "她一句话也没说。我们一路走回楼下，那股尴尬的沉默却始终缠绕着我。"

    # game/script.rpy:66448
    old "I had to leave. The real Atsuki would soon reappear.{w} But it was hard to turn around. Miiya was right there in front of me—a friend who I'd thought I'd never see again, and who I might have been looking at for the very last time."
    new "我必须离开。真正的我很快就会出现。{w} 可要我转身，实在太难了。Miiya 就站在我面前——这个我以为再也见不到的朋友，也许此刻就是最后一面。"

    # game/script.rpy:66454
    old "As I walked to the bathroom, I noticed she was going to the storeroom. I stopped myself once she was inside."
    new "我走向洗手间时，看见她正往储藏室去。等她进去后，我停住了脚步。"

    # game/script.rpy:66458
    old "I approached it, intrigued as to what they were talking about."
    new "我凑近了些，好奇他们在说些什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:66459
    old "They'll go to the attic pretty soon. I can listen in without being seen."
    new "他们很快就要去阁楼了。我可以躲着听，不会被发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:66463
    old "I saw that they were all next to the secret door. I hid inside the crystal room at its left."
    new "我看见他们都聚在暗门旁边，便躲进了左侧的那间水晶展室。"

    # game/script.rpy:66469
    old "I approached the wall and put my ear against it."
    new "我走近墙边，把耳朵贴了上去。"

    # game/script.rpy:66473
    old "...ut Atsuki had just finished looking through the whole floor."
    new "……可 Atsuki 才刚把整层楼查过一遍。"

    # game/script.rpy:66475
    old "I can hear them well enough."
    new "他们说的话，我听得一清二楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:66478
    old "They kept talking about the door. I knew it led outside, but it hadn't opened since that morning."
    new "他们一直在谈论那扇门。我知道它通向外面，可它从那天早上起就再没打开过。"

    # game/script.rpy:66479
    old "Finally, the other Atsuki returned."
    new "终于，另一个 Atsuki 回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66485
    old "He was told about the discovery. Sai had noticed the storeroom was open while he was going up the stairs."
    new "有人把这一发现告诉了他。Sai 上楼时注意到储藏室开着。"

    # game/script.rpy:66491
    old "Yes, yes. I'd like to advise you all on something."
    new "好，好。我想提醒各位一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:66492
    old "I've made sure that if this door is opened again, I'll be able to tell."
    new "我已经做了安排，这扇门如果再被打开，我就能知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:66496
    old "What is this about...?"
    new "这到底是怎么回事……？"

    # game/script.rpy:66511
    old "In the off chance Naomi's still in the tower, she's up there, being covered by the three of you. I want to go see it by myself, and I'm sure Akaro and Erina aren't content with your words alone."
    new "万一 Naomi 还在塔里，那她就在上面，正被你们三个包庇着。我要亲自去看看；而且我敢肯定，光凭你们几句话，Akaro 和 Erina 也不会满意。"

    # game/script.rpy:66515
    old "They left the storeroom and the crystal floor."
    new "他们离开了储藏室，离开了水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:66517
    old "The rest happened as I'd already experienced it."
    new "接下来的事，和我已经经历过的一模一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:66518
    old "I stayed in that room until my past self went up. I'd chosen to hide in one of the second floor bathrooms, an unlikely place to be revisited."
    new "我在那间房里一直待到过去的我上楼。我选了二楼的一间洗手间藏身——那地方不太可能有人再去。"

    # game/script.rpy:66523
    old "I went to hallway B. I knew Sai would be the first one to return and that he'd look through the hallway A rooms."
    new "我去了 B走廊。我知道 Sai 会第一个回来，也知道他会逐一查看 A走廊的房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:66525
    old "It happened even sooner than I recalled. Evidently discontent with my search, he walked from room to room.{w} He didn't care about the third Sekimeiya; he'd been the one to leave it there. When he came to hallway B, I was already in a room in hallway A."
    new "一切来得比我记忆中的更早。他显然对我先前那番搜寻并不满意，一间一间地走了过去。{w}他并不在意第三个 Sekimeiya——把它留在那里的正是他自己。等他来到 B走廊时，我已经待在 A走廊的一间房里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66526
    old "I just had to wait.{w} Sai would find the Future Sekimeiya and bring it to the event room. Then, the others would find the Past Sekimeiya and walk to the event room."
    new "我只需要等着。{w}Sai 会找到未来Sekimeiya，把它带到活动室。随后，其他人会找到过去Sekimeiya，走进活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:66527
    old "The Future Sekimeiya would be activated in the event room—it was the one that had been gray, and I was far enough from its range. That would leave me alone in the tower with my past self."
    new "未来Sekimeiya 会在活动室启动——那正是先前呈灰色的那一个，而我所处的位置离它的覆盖范围足够远。这样一来，塔里就只剩我和过去的我。"

    # game/script.rpy:66542
    old "Picture Frame"
    new "画框"

    # game/script.rpy:66546
    old "I'm sure everything has taken shape in your mind, but I wonder what shape that is."
    new "我想，一切在你脑中都已成形，只是不知那形状如何。"

    # game/script.rpy:66547
    old "You remember this world, don't you? In it, many things weren't what they seemed."
    new "你记得这个世界吧？在这里，许多事物都不是表面看上去的样子。"

    # game/script.rpy:66548
    old "Its real shape is the last key you will need to reach the peak."
    new "它真正的形状，是你抵达顶峰所需的最后一把钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:66562
    old "Two people waited in the lobby. {time=9:00} was approaching."
    new "大厅里有两个人等着。快到 {time=9:00} 了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66563
    old "At that point, you may have realized something was wrong. Shiroya wasn't there; Miiya was occupying her place.{w} However, her name was spoken before the doors opened."
    new "那时，你或许已经察觉到有什么不对。Shiroya 并不在那里，占据她位置的是 Miiya。{w}然而，在门打开之前，有人叫出了她的名字。"

    # game/script.rpy:66568
    old "\"I'd managed to leave my mind empty, but I abruptly turned around when I heard a quiet voice coming from my left. A man was crouching next to me, and when he stood up, I saw his older face underneath white hair.\""
    new "「我好不容易让脑中一片空白，却忽然听见左侧传来一个低低的声音，便猛地转过身去。一个男人蹲在我身旁；他站起来时，我看见白发之下那张更显年长的脸。」"

    # game/script.rpy:66574
    old "Katei said Shiroya's name..."
    new "Katei 念出了 Shiroya 的名字……"

    # game/script.rpy:66583
    old "\"He showed me a ticket that must've fallen from my purse when I'd stretched my muscles. I nodded and put it back inside, all while unnerved by his stiff motions.\""
    new "「他给我看了一张票，多半是我活动身体时从包里掉出来的。我点点头，把它放回包里，同时被他僵硬的动作弄得心神不宁。」"

    # game/script.rpy:66588
    old "Everyone brought an identification card to verify their own tickets. Of course, the tickets had everyone's names on them. Katei read Shiroya's name and called for her."
    new "每个人都带了身份证件，用来核对自己的票。当然，票上都写着各自的名字。Katei 读到 Shiroya 的名字，便叫了她。"

    # game/script.rpy:66589
    old "Miiya was there with her own purse, which contained three tickets. When she stretched, one fell out, meaning that her purse hadn't been closed. In world B, when Shiroya opened her purse, she unzipped it—the tickets couldn't have fallen from her purse, as it was closed since long before {time=9.}"
    new "Miiya 也在场，她的包里装着三张票。她一活动身体，就有一张掉了出来，说明她的包当时没合上。而在 B 世界，Shiroya 打开包时是先拉开拉链的——票不可能从她的包里掉出来，因为那只包早在 {time=9.} 之前就一直合着。"

    # game/script.rpy:66590
    old "Hopefully, it was enjoyable to catch any of these details. However, although Shiroya's absence could be reasoned out, it wouldn't be surprising if your gut told you something was wrong before that. For everyone who'd gotten trapped in the tower, Shiroya was a girl who had died weeks ago."
    new "希望你在捕捉这些细节时，多少觉得有趣。不过，Shiroya 的缺席固然能靠推理得出，但在那之前，直觉就已经告诉你哪里不对劲，这也不足为奇。对所有被困在塔里的人来说，Shiroya 是个几周前就已经死去的女孩。"

    # game/script.rpy:66597
    old "When the group went up the floors, Atsuki found the key for the security room. Everyone splitting up created the chances for individuals to accomplish what they needed."
    new "众人逐层往上时，Atsuki 找到了监控室的钥匙。正因为大家分头行动，各人才有了机会去做自己需要做的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:66605
    old "The next time they reunited, Sai noticed the sound of keys coming from Katei's pocket. ...They were louder than they'd been before."
    new "众人再次会合时，Sai 注意到 Katei 的口袋里传来钥匙的响声。……那声音比之前更响了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66606
    old "When Katei was confronted, he showed them a set of keys belonging to Naomi. However, that's when he himself noticed something."
    new "被众人质问时，Katei 拿出一串属于 Naomi 的钥匙。可也就在这时，他自己察觉到了异样。"

    # game/script.rpy:66614
    old "There were two identical keyrings in his pocket. That had made the metallic noise even easier to perceive."
    new "他的口袋里有两串一模一样的钥匙。正因如此，金属碰撞的声响才格外清晰。"

    # game/script.rpy:66615
    old "At that point, Katei had traveled to the past one time. Upon appearing, he hadn't realized that the keyring Naomi had left behind suddenly appeared in his pocket.{w} Then, when he came across it, he put it inside. In that way, he came into possession of two copies."
    new "那时，Katei 已经穿越到过去一次。他出现时，没有察觉 Naomi 遗落的那串钥匙忽然出现在自己口袋里。{w}后来他偶然摸到它，便把它收了起来。就这样，他手上有了两串。"

    # game/script.rpy:66616
    old "When Sai made him reveal it, he didn't know a second one remained in his pocket. That fact was what shaped Katei's actions."
    new "当 Sai 逼他交出来时，他并不知道口袋里还留着一串。正是这一点，决定了 Katei 之后的行动。"

    # game/script.rpy:66617
    old "In this world, he insisted the attic should be kept locked, and he made sure the Sekimeiya cabinet would always be. That way, he could unlock them with his secret set, setting up Atsuki and Miiya, who had the other one, as the only possible culprits."
    new "在这个世界里，他坚持阁楼应当上锁，也设法让装着 Sekimeiya 的展示柜始终锁着。这样一来，他就能用自己藏起的那串钥匙打开它们，把持有另一串钥匙的 Atsuki 和 Miiya 变成唯一可能的犯人。"

    # game/script.rpy:66618
    old "Sai thought of a way to know whether that set was Naomi's: if one of the keys opened the attic, Katei's lie would be exposed."
    new "Sai 想出了辨明那串钥匙是否属于 Naomi 的办法：只要其中一把能打开阁楼，Katei 的谎言就会败露。"

    # game/script.rpy:66624
    old "Before they got there, he decided to test if something else Katei had said was invalid too. On the sixth floor, he attempted to call the elevator, which should've been disabled.{w} They waited, but it never came."
    new "到达那里之前，他决定再验证 Katei 的另一句话是否同样站不住脚。在六楼，他试着呼叫本该被停用的电梯。{w}他们等了许久，电梯始终没有上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:66630
    old "However, at that point, the elevator was already working again."
    new "然而那个时候，电梯其实已经恢复运行了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66634
    old "The first time Katei traveled to the past, he walked to the crystal floor. He saw an Atsuki from another world, which later made him question what everyone was saying."
    new "Katei 第一次穿越回过去时，走到了水晶层。他看见了来自另一个世界的 Atsuki，这让他后来对众人的说法起了疑心。"

    # game/script.rpy:66637
    old "Most importantly, he saw people leaving the security room, which had strangely been unlocked. That was his opportunity to shut the computer down. Since he was alone and hadn't told everyone about the cameras' green lights, in this world, he was able to power off the entire security system too as opposed to just one camera."
    new "最重要的是，他看见有人从监控室里出来——那扇门不知为何没有上锁。这正是他关掉电脑的机会。由于他独自一人，也没把摄像头绿灯的事告诉任何人，在这个世界里，他得以切断整套监控系统的电源，而不只是关掉一台摄像头。"

    # game/script.rpy:66644
    old "Later, when Sai called the elevator, Katei had already enabled it because he had found the attic key. However, it didn't come."
    new "后来 Sai 呼叫电梯时，Katei 因为找到阁楼钥匙，已经重新启用了电梯。可电梯却没有上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:66651
    old "Katei suddenly froze up; would they notice their mistake?"
    new "Katei 猛然僵住：他们会察觉到失误吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:66657
    old "The orange light never appeared—the elevator was already there, and you might recall that was the case in world B as well."
    new "橙色指示灯始终没有亮起——电梯早就在那一层了，你或许还记得，B世界里也是同样的情况。"

    # game/script.rpy:66662
    old "And not only that. Atsuki from world B was spying on the group, and when they entered the attic, he was on the sixth floor. He heard the elevator, but only once—when Isla, Erina, Sai, and Akaro took it down. Since it was called from the attic and Atsuki B only heard it once, it was originally on the sixth floor."
    new "不仅如此。B世界的 Atsuki 当时正在暗中监视众人，他们进入阁楼时，他就在六楼。他只听到过一次电梯的声响——那是 Isla、Erina、Sai 和 Akaro 乘电梯下楼的时候。既然电梯是从阁楼呼叫的，而 Atsuki B 只听到一次，说明它起初就在六楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:66665
    old "Either way, nobody saw through his ruse, and thanks to that, Katei was able to set up a stronger illusion later on."
    new "无论如何，没人识破他的计策，也正因如此，Katei 之后才得以布下更牢固的假象。"

    # game/script.rpy:66673
    old "When everyone entered the attic, they saw the strange footprints on the floor. They led to the sofa, where the Future Sekimeiya was."
    new "众人进入阁楼时，看见地板上有奇怪的脚印，一路延伸到沙发——未来Sekimeiya 就放在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:66674
    old "Most people believed the Sekimeiya should've been on the crystal floor. If that was the case, someone had to have brought it up very recently, but it didn't seem possible for them to have left the attic."
    new "大多数人认为 Sekimeiya 本该在水晶层。若真是如此，就一定是有人刚刚把它搬了上来，可那人似乎不可能从阁楼脱身。"

    # game/script.rpy:66677
    old "That made Sai call the elevator, and it actually did arrive."
    new "于是 Sai 呼叫了电梯，而这一回它真的来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66678
    old "That was the feint Katei aimed for—that the elevator had just been enabled. That someone had been in the security room after they'd all stepped into the attic."
    new "这正是 Katei 想要的误导——让人以为电梯刚刚才被启用，以为在众人踏入阁楼之后，有人去过监控室。"

    # game/script.rpy:66681
    old "Following that, when everyone saw that the computer had lost power, what he said was reinforced; it must have happened after they had tried to call the elevator on the sixth floor."
    new "紧接着，众人发现电脑断了电，他的话就更显得可信——那一定发生在他们在六楼呼叫电梯之后。"

    # game/script.rpy:66684
    old "At the same time, the Sekimeiya had disappeared from the cabinet. From their perspective, it had been brought to the attic.{w} However, Sai knew the truth. Just like in worlds A and B, he had quickly hidden the fake Sekimeiya when everyone had split up, so the one they'd retrieved from the attic was different."
    new "与此同时，展示柜里的 Sekimeiya 不见了。大家以为它被搬到了阁楼。{w}可 Sai 知道真相。和在 A世界、B世界一样，他在众人分头行动时迅速藏起了赝品 Sekimeiya，所以他们从阁楼取回的那一个，已经换成了别的东西。"

    # game/script.rpy:66691
    old "That was when everyone else learned about time travel. Right before their eyes, Katei went to the future."
    new "就在这时，其他人第一次得知了时间穿越。Katei 就在他们眼前去了未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:66696
    old "Atsuki reeled. He had to learn more about the Sekimeiya. He stayed close to it, and when the crystal floor had been inspected, he touched it."
    new "Atsuki 内心震动。他必须弄清 Sekimeiya 的底细。他寸步不离地守在旁边，趁水晶层接受检查时，伸手碰了它。"

    # game/script.rpy:66703
    old "He went minutes to the future, but he wasn't alone. Sai had specifically gone to find the fake Sekimeiya he'd hidden, wondering whether it was still there, as well as whether it shared the same powers he'd witnessed. As he was returning to the event room from hallway B, he traveled with Atsuki."
    new "他去了几分钟后的未来，但他并非独自一人。Sai 特意去找自己藏起来的赝品 Sekimeiya，想确认它是否还在原处，又是否拥有他亲眼见过的那种力量。就在他从 B走廊返回活动室时，他和 Atsuki 一起穿越了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66704
    old "Atsuki appeared in the attic, which was locked. The elevator had been left open on the crystal floor, so he couldn't leave through it either.{w} However, Sai appeared on the crystal floor since his group had left the attic earlier. He realized the elevator was open and allowed Atsuki to leave."
    new "Atsuki 出现在上了锁的阁楼里。电梯被留在水晶层，门还开着，所以他也无法借电梯离开。{w}而 Sai 则出现在水晶层，因为他的同伴们早些时候已经离开了阁楼。他发现电梯是开着的，便让 Atsuki 得以脱身。"

    # game/script.rpy:66705
    old "When they met, they thought they'd gone minutes to the past, although neither of them spoke about it. Atsuki recalled Sai had gone missing, so finding him in the past wasn't strange.{w} His misinterpretation arose due to Sai's watch, which had ended up minutes behind. When they returned to the others, they saw that everyone was in the security room."
    new "两人相遇时，都以为自己回到了几分钟前，尽管谁也没有说出口。Atsuki 记得 Sai 曾经失踪，所以在过去遇见他并不奇怪。{w}他之所以判断错误，是因为 Sai 的手表慢了整整几分钟。等他们回到其他人身边，才发现众人都在监控室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:66713
    old "\"As we turned around, we saw Sai staring at us next to the unassertive Atsuki.\""
    new "「我们回过头，就看见 Sai 站在没什么底气的 Atsuki 身旁，注视着我们。」"

    # game/script.rpy:66725
    old "Sai wasn't exactly aware of how blatant his lie was. According to his watch, he should've been missing for very little time, but it had been much longer than he thought since he'd vanished. He didn't reveal what had happened to him, and because of that, he was the only person aware of the Sekimeiya's range."
    new "Sai 并未意识到自己这谎撒得有多拙劣。按他的手表，他失踪的时间本该很短，可他消失之后实际过去的时间远比他想的长。他没有说出自己的遭遇，也正因如此，他是唯一知道 Sekimeiya 作用范围的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:66736
    old "Hours later, Suripo's dead body suddenly appeared. There's one last thing to settle."
    new "几小时之后，Suripo 的尸体突然出现。还有最后一件事需要理清。"

    # game/script.rpy:66745
    old "Naomi still hadn't been found, and it seemed like nobody else could've committed the crime without having traveled through time. That belief led to a whole search with no result."
    new "Naomi 依旧下落不明，而如果不考虑时间穿越，似乎再没有别人能犯下那桩案子。抱着这样的想法，众人搜遍了各处，却一无所获。"

    # game/script.rpy:66748
    old "Something very important was found, though: the storeroom's secret corridor."
    new "不过，他们找到了一样极其重要的东西——储藏室的秘密通道。"

    # game/script.rpy:66749
    old "Upon its discovery, you likely noticed that someone's actions differed from world B's."
    new "在它被发现之后，你大概已经注意到，某人的举动与 B 世界时不同。"

    # game/script.rpy:66754
    old "In world C, Sai did something to know whether the door was opened from that point on. That did not happen in world B."
    new "在 C 世界，Sai 做了些布置，好知道那扇门此后有没有被打开过。这件事在 B 世界并没有发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:66755
    old "The reason was the piece of duct tape they'd all seen. It had reminded Sai of his favorite novel, which made him think of setting up a check on that door."
    new "原因就是众人都见过的那截胶带。它让 Sai 想起了自己最爱的小说，于是动了给那扇门做记号的念头。"

    # game/script.rpy:66758
    old "After that, everyone ended up in the attic, where they hoped they could calmly spend the rest of their isolation in the bedrooms."
    new "之后，众人回到了阁楼，希望能在卧室里安然度过剩下的隔离日子。"

    # game/script.rpy:66759
    old "Of course, that wouldn't happen. It was Sai who soon tried to go back down unnoticed."
    new "当然，事情没能如愿。很快，Sai 就试图不声不响地下楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:66764
    old "What if Atsuki and Miiya hadn't alerted everyone to his departure?"
    new "如果 Atsuki 和 Miiya 没有把他离开的事告诉众人，又会怎样？"

    # game/script.rpy:66773
    old "\"Shiroya and Atsuki stayed in the attic. Sai had gone to the crystal floor, but they didn't follow him down.\""
    new "「Shiroya 和 Atsuki 留在阁楼。Sai 去了水晶层，但他们没有跟下去。」"

    # game/script.rpy:66778
    old "\"Shiroya let out a sigh.\""
    new "「Shiroya 叹了口气。」"

    # game/script.rpy:66779
    old "\"They had no strength left, so they kept resting, trying to ignore what was happening around them.\""
    new "「他们已经没有力气，只能继续休息，尽量不去理会周围发生的事。」"

    # game/script.rpy:66784
    old "Indeed, your choice made Miiya become Shiroya.{w} The world changed drastically. The butterfly effect amplifies even a single unwitting change."
    new "的确，正是你的选择让 Miiya 变成了 Shiroya。{w} 世界因此发生了剧变。蝴蝶效应会把哪怕一处无心造成的改变无限放大。"

    # game/script.rpy:66785
    old "In that world, Miiya couldn't have been saved. However, you wanted to know what would've happened if Sai was let loose. That caused Miiya to be replaced by Shiroya."
    new "在那个世界里，Miiya 本来无法得救。可你想知道，若放任 Sai 自由行动，事情会变成什么样。于是 Miiya 被 Shiroya 取代了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66786
    old "That was one of numerous changes, alongside..."
    new "那不过是众多变化之一，此外还有……"

    # game/script.rpy:66793
    old "\"Six pairs of eyes saw the identical scene.\"{w} Exactly, it was Katei's absence. The storeroom's door hadn't been locked, so he'd been able to leave before everyone awakened. In that world, nobody had told the group about keeping the Sekimeiya cold."
    new "「六双眼睛看到了完全相同的一幕。」{w} 没错，问题就出在 Katei 不在场。储藏室的门没有上锁，他才能在众人醒来前离开。那个世界里，没有人告诉过众人要让 Sekimeiya 保持低温。"

    # game/script.rpy:66795
    old "\"Six pairs of eyes saw the identical scene.\"{w} It was Katei's absence. The storeroom's door hadn't been locked, so he'd been able to leave before everyone awakened. In that world, nobody had told the group about keeping the Sekimeiya cold."
    new "「六双眼睛看到了完全相同的一幕。」{w} 问题正是 Katei 不在场。储藏室的门没有上锁，他才能在众人醒来前离开。那个世界里，没有人告诉过众人要让 Sekimeiya 保持低温。"

    # game/script.rpy:66799
    old "Sai roamed free for a long time, and on the crystal floor, he had access to both Sekimeiya. With his watch, he was able to figure out the basic mechanics behind traveling to the past and future."
    new "Sai 长时间自由行动。在水晶层上，他能接触到两个 Sekimeiya。借助手表，他弄清了前往过去与未来的基本机制。"

    # game/script.rpy:66801
    old "That's how he came up with a plan to remain with the Sekimeiya."
    new "他因此想出了一条能继续留在 Sekimeiya 身边的计策。"

    # game/script.rpy:66804
    old "What did he do? When he came back up, he showed everyone what the Sekimeiya were capable of. Right now, you understand them a lot more than at that time."
    new "他做了什么？重新回到上层后，他向大家展示了 Sekimeiya 的能力。比起那时候，你如今对它们的了解已经深了许多。"

    # game/script.rpy:66805
    old "...However, you might still have trouble figuring out what Sai did. He had to pull out something fairly clever to trick everyone."
    new "……不过，你或许还是弄不清 Sai 做了什么。他为了骗过所有人，当时不得不用上相当高明的手段。"

    # game/script.rpy:66806
    old "If you ever want to go back and attempt to see through his scenario, I hope you're able to beat him."
    new "如果你日后想回去试着识破他的布局，希望你能赢过他。"

    # game/script.rpy:66813
    old "In reality, Atsuki and Miiya brought everyone to the crystal floor in an attempt to find Sai. Before he was seen, the Past Sekimeiya was found in room B6.{w} Sai was in the event room, and he suddenly heard people approaching. Hoping it would let him escape, he touched the Future Sekimeiya."
    new "实际上，Atsuki 和 Miiya 为了寻找 Sai，把大家带到了水晶层。还没等人看见他，过去Sekimeiya 就在水晶展室 B6 被发现了。{w} 当时 Sai 正在活动室，忽然听见有人靠近。他指望借此脱身，便碰了未来Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:66815
    old "Atsuki and Miiya brought everyone to the crystal floor in an attempt to find him. Before he was seen, the Past Sekimeiya was found in room B6.{w} Sai was in the event room, and he suddenly heard people approaching. Hoping it would let him escape, he touched the Future Sekimeiya."
    new "Atsuki 和 Miiya 为了找他，把大家带到了水晶层。还没等人看见他，过去Sekimeiya 就在水晶展室 B6 被发现了。{w} Sai 当时在活动室，忽然听见有人靠近。他指望借此脱身，便碰了未来Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:66823
    old "He thought he was safe as soon as he touched it, but the door still burst open."
    new "他本以为一碰到那东西就安全了，门却还是猛地被撞开。"

    # game/script.rpy:66840
    old "\"We turned to Katei, who hadn't interrupted us. He was perplexed, staring at his empty hands.\""
    new "「我们转头看向 Katei。他刚才没有插话，此刻正困惑地盯着自己空空的双手。」"

    # game/script.rpy:66868
    old "Both had disappeared, as a world switch had been triggered. Oblivious, they found themselves in world A."
    new "两个 Sekimeiya 都消失了，因为触发了世界切换。他们浑然不觉，已经身处 A 世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:66869
    old "\"Sai spun and looked at the cabinet covered by the curtain. Then, he looked all around the room with a slight frown.\""
    new "「Sai 转过身，看向被遮布罩住的展示柜。随后，他微微皱眉，环视了一圈房间。」"

    # game/script.rpy:66870
    old "\"I was also moderately puzzled. Katei couldn't have been lying. He didn't have the Sekimeiya, it wasn't on the floor, and he couldn't have hidden it anywhere without us seeing it.\""
    new "「我也有些困惑。Katei 不可能在撒谎。Sekimeiya 不在他手上，也不在地上；他更不可能当着我们的面把它藏到别处。」"

    # game/script.rpy:66871
    old "Out of nowhere, the cabinet was covered by its curtain. However, that was nothing compared to what awaited in hallway C."
    new "不知何时，展示柜又被遮布罩住了。然而，与 C 走廊里等着他们的景象相比，这根本不算什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:66875
    old "The panel to call the elevator was gone.{w} ...All of them were. They had been ripped off on every floor."
    new "呼叫电梯的面板不见了。{w} ……所有面板都不见了，每一层的都被拆掉了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66902
    old "In the living room, their footprints had disappeared."
    new "客厅里，他们的脚印已经消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66904
    old "And Katei was the lucky person who found the Future Sekimeiya in the open refrigerator. ...Opening it had been the last thing Sai A would ever do."
    new "而 Katei 就是那个幸运儿，在敞开的冰箱里发现了未来Sekimeiya。……打开冰箱，成了 Sai A 此生做的最后一件事。"

    # game/script.rpy:66910
    old "Atsuki wanted to look at the BIOS's time, but the security room was locked. In addition, Sai realized the mark he'd left in the storeroom was gone. ...He was convinced someone had opened it, so he marked it again."
    new "Atsuki 想查看 BIOS 的时间，但监控室锁着。另外，Sai 发现自己留在储藏室里的记号不见了。……他认定有人打开过那里，于是又做了一次标记。"

    # game/script.rpy:66911
    old "Of course, that was far from the truth, but it made them believe that someone else had entered the tower."
    new "当然，事实远非如此，但这让他们相信，确实有别人进过塔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:66916
    old "The next time they attempted to enter the attic, it was locked again."
    new "下一次他们想进阁楼时，门又锁上了。"

    # game/script.rpy:66917
    old "\"We all stared at the door in shock. It was locked.\""
    new "「我们全都震惊地盯着那扇门。门锁着。」"

    # game/script.rpy:66919
    old "The truth behind that was the secret keyring Katei still had. Long before he'd traveled to the future, he'd left it in the security room so that he couldn't be found with it. He'd been able to retrieve it when he'd appeared there."
    new "真相是，Katei 还带着那串秘密钥匙。早在他穿越到未来之前，就把钥匙留在了监控室，免得有人发现钥匙在他身上。后来他出现在监控室时，才把钥匙取了回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:66920
    old "He'd left the key inserted in the door because he knew what had happened with the elevator: it was in the attic despite the panel having vanished.{w} Inside, he'd found that world's attic key. He could keep everyone from entering the highest floor by locking the door in.{w} He left it by bringing the elevator to the sixth floor; he could keep it there as a hidden way up. Since he had his set of keys, he could always access the attic through the elevator he'd prepared."
    new "他把钥匙插在门上没有拔走，因为他知道电梯出了什么状况：面板明明已经消失，电梯却仍停在阁楼。{w} 在阁楼里，他找到了那个世界的阁楼钥匙。只要把门反锁，就能让众人无法进入顶层。{w} 他离开时把电梯叫到六楼停住，留作一条隐藏的上楼通道。由于他带着自己的那串钥匙，他随时都能通过准备好的电梯进入阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:66927
    old "But... it was found when Atsuki attempted to open it.{w} Inside, there were the bodies of Naomi C and Shiroya A."
    new "可是……Atsuki 试着打开它时，它还是被发现了。{w} 里面躺着 Naomi C 和 Shiroya A 的尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:66940
    old "The shock was natural. Naomi hadn't been seen for hours, and Shiroya had supposedly died weeks ago. It was undeniable that her existence was related to Atsuki and Miiya."
    new "他们如此震惊也很自然。Naomi 已经好几个小时不见踪影，而 Shiroya 据说几周前就死了。她的存在与 Atsuki 和 Miiya 有关，这一点无可否认。"

    # game/script.rpy:66941
    old "But nobody knew what had happened to the two women, and all they could do was bring them to the lobby."
    new "但没人知道这两名女子遭遇了什么，他们能做的只有把她们搬到大厅。"

    # game/script.rpy:66943
    old "With the elevator, the group was able to reach the attic again, where they found the single key in its inner keyhole."
    new "借助电梯，众人再次来到阁楼，在里侧锁孔里发现了那把唯一的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:66951
    old "...Over thirty minutes later, a new dead body was found near the hallway C stairs."
    new "……三十多分钟后，C走廊的楼梯附近又发现了一具尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:66958
    old "It was Erina A's."
    new "那是 Erina A 的尸体。"

    # game/script.rpy:66959
    old "Erina C, who they'd been with, was in room A1 with Isla. Meanwhile, the world A group was waiting in room B4. After Sai, Erina had been the second person to leave."
    new "和他们在一起的 Erina C，此刻正与 Isla 待在 A1房间。与此同时，A世界的一行人正在 B4房间等候。Sai 之后，第二个离开的人便是 Erina。"

    # game/script.rpy:66961
    old "\"Don't lie! It can only be you. You killed them.\""
    new "「别撒谎！只可能是你。是你杀了她们。」"

    # game/script.rpy:66971
    old "Everyone saw Erina's body atop a pool of blood. Someone had just killed her, and Atsuki had heard her words before dying. ...She had confronted who she'd thought was the killer.{w} However, it quickly became clear that nobody could've easily committed the crime. Everyone stated what they'd been doing."
    new "所有人都看见了躺在血泊中的 Erina 的尸体。她才刚被人杀害，Atsuki 听到了她临死前的话。……她曾当面质问那个她认定的凶手。{w} 然而，很快就查清，没有人能轻易犯下这桩罪行。众人也纷纷说出了自己当时在做什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:66975
    old "Atsuki said that after being the first to leave the attic, he'd spent a few minutes on the second floor. He said that at one point, he heard the elevator once.{w} Miiya said that she'd left second and remained on the third floor until Atsuki ran up from below, letting her know what had happened.{w} Sai and Katei claimed to have been above them, and their versions of events seemed to confirm each other.{w} Akaro claimed to have left the attic last when Erina and Isla had still been sitting on the sofa, and that afterward, he'd stayed on the sixth floor alone."
    new "Atsuki 说，他最先离开阁楼，之后在二楼待了几分钟。他说中间有一刻听到过电梯的动静。{w}Miiya 说自己是第二个离开的，一直待在三楼，直到 Atsuki 从楼下跑上来，告诉她出了事。{w}Sai 和 Katei 声称当时他们在上面，两人的说法似乎互相印证。{w}Akaro 说自己是最后离开阁楼的，那时 Erina 和 Isla 还坐在沙发上，之后他便独自留在六楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:66976
    old "The elevator was on the crystal floor. Since the panels hadn't been reattached, the \"1\" button must've been pressed from the attic.{w} It seemed like nobody could've performed a murder simply. The only way to get to the crystal floor after Atsuki's departure would've been by riding in the elevator with Erina and Isla. However, if that had happened, they couldn't have ended up above Atsuki when he'd gone to find everyone; nobody had seen them walking up, and the elevator hadn't been heard again."
    new "电梯停在水晶层。既然面板还没装回去，那个「1」按钮只能是从阁楼按的。{w}看来没人能轻而易举地完成这场谋杀。Atsuki 离开之后，想上水晶层，唯一的办法就是和 Erina、Isla 一同乘电梯。可若是那样，等 Atsuki 去找大家时，他们就不可能出现在他上方——没人看见他们走上去，电梯也没有再响过。"

    # game/script.rpy:66977
    old "There were three main options in everyone's minds, and one was correct."
    new "每个人心里都有三个主要可能，其中只有一个是对的。"

    # game/script.rpy:66984
    old "Atsuki hadn't been lying; everything he said was the truth."
    new "Atsuki 没有撒谎，他说的每句话都是真的。"

    # game/script.rpy:66985
    old "People they didn't know about were present in the building—the world A group. However, none of them had left room B4."
    new "楼里还有他们不知道的人——A世界的那群人。可那些人谁也没有离开过 B4房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:66986
    old "The answer had to be the Sekimeiya. Someone would travel through time and kill Erina."
    new "答案只能是 Sekimeiya。有人会穿越时间，杀死 Erina。"

    # game/script.rpy:66987
    old "For them, that seemed like a fickle solution; there was no way to prove it. If that was the case, unless the culprit had already escaped, they had to search for them."
    new "他们觉得这答案虚无缥缈，也无从证实。若果真如此，除非凶手早已逃出去，否则就只能去搜捕凶手。"

    # game/script.rpy:66988
    old "However, for you, that solution might seem odd."
    new "不过，你可能会觉得这个答案很奇怪。"

    # game/script.rpy:66991
    old "You know what happened in that world. The Past Sekimeiya was in room B4 with the world A group.{w} It was in the cabinet where Akaro had put it, and it wasn't activated until he and Isla world switched to world B."
    new "你知道那个世界发生了什么。过去Sekimeiya 和 A世界的人一起留在 B4房间。{w}它就在 Akaro 放进去的那个展示柜里，直到他和 Isla 世界切换到 B世界，它才被启动。"

    # game/script.rpy:66994
    old "After that, what happened to it? Shiroya B found it and was able to world switch to world B. Later on, Sai B found it was well and world switched back to world B.{w} Lastly, Atsuki A found it and also world switched to world B."
    new "那之后它又怎样了？Shiroya B 找到了它，得以世界切换到 B世界。后来，Sai B 也找到了它，再次世界切换回 B世界。{w}最后，Atsuki A 找到它，同样世界切换到了 B世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:67001
    old "That was it. The Past Sekimeiya from world A wasn't activated ever again."
    new "到此为止。A世界的过去Sekimeiya 再也没有被启动过。"

    # game/script.rpy:67004
    old "So then, who killed Erina? How did her killer show up before her and push her off the stairs?"
    new "那么，究竟是谁杀了 Erina？凶手又是怎样出现在她面前，把她推下楼梯的？"

    # game/script.rpy:67010
    old "Her killer couldn't have world switched before her. After all, they would've had to appear from world C, where Atsuki was experimenting with the Sekimeiya in the attic."
    new "凶手不可能在她之前切换世界。毕竟，那样一来他们只能来自 C世界——那里 Atsuki 正在阁楼里试验 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:67012
    old "The Past Sekimeiya couldn't have been used to carry out her murder. The key to solving it was the Future Sekimeiya."
    new "这场谋杀不可能借助过去Sekimeiya 完成。解谜的关键在于未来Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:67015
    old "It was the one that Katei had found in the kitchen refrigerator. He hid it somewhere in the attic, which he locked, intending to keep it away from the others."
    new "那正是 Katei 在厨房冰箱里找到的那一个。他把它藏在阁楼某处，并锁上阁楼，想让它远离其他人。"

    # game/script.rpy:67016
    old "Before the world C group arrived in world A, only one person had touched the Future Sekimeiya: Sai A. However, he immediately died where he arrived. In other words, nobody from world A could've killed Erina."
    new "在 C世界的人抵达 A世界之前，只有一个人碰过未来Sekimeiya：Sai A。可他一到就死了。换言之，A世界的人不可能杀死 Erina。"

    # game/script.rpy:67017
    old "Before her death, the world C group had been on the crystal floor; anyone who traveled to the future could've appeared there, bypassing Atsuki's view."
    new "她死之前，C世界的人都待在水晶层；任何穿越到未来的人都能出现在那里，避开 Atsuki 的视线。"

    # game/script.rpy:67018
    old "But that wouldn't have been all. After appearing there, they would've had to make it above him, and such a thing didn't seem simple. No Sekimeiya could've been activated on the crystal floor, and the elevator never went back up."
    new "但事情不止如此。出现在那里之后，他们还得绕到他上方，而这绝非易事。水晶层上不可能启动任何 Sekimeiya，电梯也再没上去过。"

    # game/script.rpy:67025
    old "People were leaving, and Isla said she wanted to come down too since she still hadn't seen all the gems. I noticed she was trying to cheer herself up a little despite the... two bodies we found, so even though I didn't want to leave, I went with her just so that it took her mind off it."
    new "大家陆续离开了，Isla 说她也想下楼，因为她还没把宝石看完。我看出她是在强打精神——毕竟我们发现了……两具尸体。所以尽管我并不想走，还是陪她一起下去，好让她分散些心思。"

    # game/script.rpy:67026
    old "\"People were leaving\". Erina and Isla were on the sofa then, and from their point of view, not everyone had left the attic."
    new "「大家陆续离开了」——那时 Erina 和 Isla 正坐在沙发上，从她们的位置看，并不是所有人都离开了阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:67033
    old "There's only one person who could've done it."
    new "能做到这件事的，只有一个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:67039
    old "\"I walked to the bedrooms and opened the left one. I needed to throw myself onto the bed and be alone for some time.\""
    new "「我走到几间卧室前，打开了左边那间。我需要扑到床上，独自待上一阵。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67044
    old "\"I stood in the middle of the floor 3 corridor. I didn't want to see the others, so I'd been thinking to myself.\""
    new "「我站在三楼走廊中央。我不想见到其他人，就一直独自想着心事。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67045
    old "\"As anyone could've been anywhere, all I wanted was to wait. I could perceive faint footsteps above me, signaling someone was on the fourth floor. I approached a potted plant and sat next to it. I calmly felt the seconds pass, appreciating the sensation.\""
    new "「谁都可能在任意位置，我只想等着。我能隐约听到头顶的脚步声，说明有人在四楼。我走到一盆绿植旁，在它旁边坐下。我平静地感受着时间一秒秒流逝，也享受这种感觉。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67052
    old "\"He was pretty agitated, so I kept my composure and waited for him to tell me what had occurred. Everything about him gave away that he'd seen something frightful.\""
    new "「他相当激动，我便保持镇定，等他说出发生了什么。他的一举一动都说明他看见了什么可怕的东西。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67058
    old "\"Erina's body lay facing down over a vast pool of blood, traces of which started in the middle of the staircase. I didn't have to walk farther down to know she was dead.\""
    new "「Erina 的尸体俯卧在一大片血泊中，血迹从楼梯中段一路延伸过来。无需再往下走，我也知道她已经死了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67065
    old "\"I kept walking down while I silently wondered why he'd been alone. On the floor of hallway C, I pressed two fingers to Erina's body and waited for any perceptible movement.\""
    new "「我继续往下走，心里默默想着他为何独自一人。在 C走廊的地面上，我伸出两根手指搭在 Erina 身上，等着感受她还有没有动静。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67067
    old "\"My heavy breathing was interrupting my words, and I didn't let my gaze stray from Erina. Being so close to her, I noticed that blood was coming out of the part of her head that hit the edge of a step.\""
    new "我喘得厉害，话都说不连贯，视线却始终没离开 Erina。靠得这样近，我才发现她头上撞到台阶边沿的地方还在渗血。"

    # game/script.rpy:67073
    old "\"With what we'd talked about, could Erina's killer be identified? I didn't think so, but there was a chance I was failing to consider something.\""
    new "凭我们刚才说的这些，能找出杀害 Erina 的凶手吗？我觉得不能，但也许有什么是我没想到的。"

    # game/script.rpy:67081
    old "\"She was there, casually leaning against the line of cabinets. I could hardly believe what I was seeing, but there was no wariness in her eyes and not even a trace of blood near her.\""
    new "她就在那里，随意地靠在一排展示柜上。我几乎不敢相信自己的眼睛，可她眼里没有一丝警惕，身旁也看不到半点血迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:67091
    old "Most people weren't aware that traveling to the future was possible. When Miiya noticed the peculiar smell again and touched the Sekimeiya, she immediately thought she'd traveled to the past."
    new "大多数人并不知道穿越到未来是可能的。当 Miiya 再次闻到那股异样的气味、碰到 Sekimeiya 时，她立刻以为自己回到了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:67096
    old "She appeared where she'd been in the past; it was what had happened before. That made her think she'd gone back in time."
    new "她出现在自己过去待过的地方；眼前正是曾经发生过的事。这让她以为自己回到了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:67098
    old "She was alone above the hallway C stairs when she suddenly heard Erina's voice."
    new "她独自待在 C走廊楼梯上方，忽然听到了 Erina 的声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:67107
    old "Erina had seen the bodies in the lobby. Shiroya had died, but she'd just been in the crystal room. Sai hadn't come back.{w} ...Naomi was dead, and earlier in the day, what had happened with the elevator buttons convinced Erina that the killer was someone they'd been unable to find."
    new "Erina 见过大厅里的尸体。Shiroya 死了，可她刚刚还在水晶展室；Sai 没有回来。{w}……Naomi 也死了。而那天早些时候，电梯按钮的事让 Erina 认定，凶手是一个他们始终找不到的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:67108
    old "...Miiya."
    new "……Miiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:67111
    old "The way Miiya looked at her only made her more convinced. When she dismissed the accusation with quiet, cold words, Erina ran up the stairs in sheer agitation."
    new "Miiya 看她的眼神反而让她更加确信。Miiya 用平静而冰冷的话否定了指控，Erina 一时激愤，冲上了楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:67114
    old "She was quickly knocked back. In midair, she let out a yell that cut off upon impact."
    new "她当即被撞了回来。她在半空中喊了一声，撞上时戛然而止。"

    # game/script.rpy:67120
    old "Miiya wasn't sure what to do. She stared at Erina, processing the fact that she wasn't moving. Then, slowly, she took a few steps backward."
    new "Miiya 一时不知如何是好。她盯着 Erina，慢慢意识到她一动不动，随后缓缓退后了几步。"

    # game/script.rpy:67125
    old "Shock rushed through her when she heard footsteps approaching. Atsuki was about to see her."
    new "听到脚步声逼近，她浑身一震。Atsuki 就要看到她了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67129
    old "To hide from him, she rushed into one of the bathrooms on the second floor."
    new "为了躲开他，她冲进了二楼的一间洗手间。"

    # game/script.rpy:67135
    old "The first thing Atsuki did was run down the stairs and check Erina's pulse, which allowed Miiya to escape toward the third floor."
    new "Atsuki 先是跑下楼梯去探 Erina 的脉搏，Miiya 便趁机逃向三楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:67139
    old "There, she heard someone above her. She'd looked at the security cameras and seen no green lights, which perhaps meant that she hadn't been recorded."
    new "在那里，她听见上方有人。她曾看过监控摄像头，没见到绿灯亮起，这或许意味着她没有被拍下。"

    # game/script.rpy:67140
    old "Nonetheless, she was completely certain that she'd changed the past."
    new "即便如此，她十分确信，自己改变了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:67145
    old "However, after Atsuki came running from below, she soon realized that she couldn't easily explain what had happened."
    new "然而，Atsuki 从楼下跑上来之后，她很快意识到，发生的事根本无法轻易解释清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:67151
    old "She attempted to hide her future knowledge. At that point in time, the elevator hadn't been opened yet; nobody knew it was usable despite the broken panels.{w} And despite the fact that they should have been together recently, Atsuki had told her he'd been alone. ...Did that mean that she'd overwritten her past self?"
    new "她想隐瞒自己知道未来的事。那时电梯还没被人打开过；面板虽已破损，却没人知道它还能用。{w} 而不久前他们本该待在一起，Atsuki 却说自己一直独自一人。……这是不是意味着，她覆盖了过去的自己？"

    # game/script.rpy:67155
    old "\"I saw that the attic key was inserted into the door. We all entered to find the missing person.\""
    new "「我看见阁楼的钥匙已经插在门上。我们一起进去找失踪的那个人。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67158
    old "\"I stared at the floor's footprints—the proof that the past had changed. I had no idea how, but it was undeniable that it greatly had.\""
    new "我盯着地板上的脚印——那是过去被改写的证据。我不知道是怎么做到的，但无可否认，过去已经大不一样了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67165
    old "...Should I bring her to the lobby?"
    new "……要我把她带到大厅去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:67169
    old "\"I went quiet. I'd begun to form a small theory, but it appeared I was wrong. After that, I realized I had no idea what had actually happened.\""
    new "「我沉默了。我本已隐约想到一种可能，看来是我猜错了。随后我才意识到，自己根本不清楚究竟发生了什么。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67170
    old "When everyone saw Erina's corpse and began to explain what they'd done, Miiya realized her perception was flawed."
    new "当众人看到 Erina 的尸体、开始说明自己做过什么时，Miiya 意识到自己的认知有误。"

    # game/script.rpy:67171
    old "Had she only traveled a few seconds through time? She wasn't sure."
    new "难道她只穿越了几秒钟的时间？她并不确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:67178
    old "When it was her turn to clear her name, she said she'd left the attic after Atsuki and that she'd stayed on the third floor."
    new "轮到她自证清白时，她说自己是在 Atsuki 之后离开阁楼，然后一直待在三楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:67179
    old "...Did Atsuki notice that contradiction?"
    new "……Atsuki 察觉到那处矛盾了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:67180
    old "I just wanted to be alone for a bit, but I didn't feel like staying put somewhere. However, I ended up spending the most time on the third floor, where I heard the elevator. I spent some time in the offices and some outside."
    new "我只是想一个人待一会儿，却又不愿意老是停在同一个地方。结果，我在三楼待的时间最长，也是在那一层听到了电梯的声音。我在几间办公室待过，也到过外面。"

    # game/script.rpy:67181
    old "Everyone stated that the elevator had been heard once, so she'd been forced to go along with it.{w} However, if she'd really heard it, she should've known that the elevator had ended up on one of the first two floors."
    new "所有人都说只听到过一次电梯的声音，她也只能顺着这么说。{w} 可是，倘若她真的听见了，就该知道电梯最后停在了一楼或二楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:67188
    old "So, why had she said that they couldn't have taken the elevator up when she and Atsuki had seen the body? The panels hadn't been reattached—if the elevator had been above them, they wouldn't have been able to use it. However, if she'd heard it on the third floor, she should've known it was next to Erina's body."
    new "那么，她和 Atsuki 看到尸体时，为什么说他们不可能坐电梯上去？面板还没有装回去——如果电梯当时在他们上方，他们就用不了它。可如果她是在三楼听见的，就该知道电梯当时停在 Erina 的尸体旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:67189
    old "...Did Atsuki make that connection? Did he choose to omit the fact that he hadn't heard Miiya's footsteps above him?"
    new "……Atsuki 想到这一层了吗？他是故意不提自己没听见头顶上 Miiya 的脚步声吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:67197
    old "In any case, they found out that Erina was still alive. She and Isla had been in room A1 since they'd taken the elevator down."
    new "总之，他们得知 Erina 还活着。她和 Isla 乘电梯下去之后，就一直待在 A1房间。"

    # game/script.rpy:67201
    old "The next time a Sekimeiya was found, it was in one of the attic's wardrobes."
    new "下一次发现 Sekimeiya，是在阁楼的一只衣柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:67208
    old "Look what I found!"
    new "看我找到了什么！"

    # game/script.rpy:67209
    old "\"With two hands, Isla was holding one of the bed sheets, folded up into a sphere. It was wrapped around something, and I could tell what Isla was going to say before she did.\""
    new "「Isla 双手捧着一条床单，已经团成了一个球。里面裹着什么东西，而她还没开口，我就猜到她要说什么了。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67220
    old "No, I have it here. It was in the, um... wardrobe."
    new "不对，它就在我手上。它刚才在，呃……衣柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:67221
    old "It was the Future Sekimeiya that Miiya had activated. Within the sheet, it gathered energy very quickly.{w} The killer could've been hiding somewhere, so starting with the attic, they searched every floor. Since they had the Sekimeiya, they figured nobody could use it to hide from them."
    new "那是 Miiya 启动过的未来Sekimeiya。它在床单里蓄能极快。{w} 凶手可能藏在某处，于是他们从阁楼开始，逐层搜查。既然 Sekimeiya 在他们手上，他们便认为谁也没法借它躲过搜查。"

    # game/script.rpy:67227
    old "But the search didn't yield any results..."
    new "然而搜查毫无结果……"

    # game/script.rpy:67233
    old "The world A group was in room B4, but they weren't found."
    new "A世界的一组人就在 B4房间，却没被找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:67234
    old "Akaro, Isla, Atsuki, and Shiroya remained there. Akaro and Isla world switched to world B, but Shiroya and Atsuki stayed behind."
    new "留在那里的是 Akaro、Isla、Atsuki 和 Shiroya。Akaro 与 Isla 世界切换到了 B世界，Shiroya 和 Atsuki 则留了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:67235
    old "The reason they weren't seen was that everyone else world switched."
    new "他们之所以没被看见，是因为其余所有人都发生了世界切换。"

    # game/script.rpy:67238
    old "The world C group world switched..."
    new "C世界的一组人也发生了世界切换……"

    # game/script.rpy:67243
    old "When they were on an office floor. More specifically, on the second floor."
    new "那时他们正在办公楼层。更准确地说，是在二楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:67246
    old "Isla A touched the Past Sekimeiya in the cabinet. Akaro had set it to 5 °C, so it had slowly gathered energy. Since the Future Sekimeiya was on the second floor, the overlapping ranges created a world switch."
    new "Isla A 碰了展示柜里的 过去Sekimeiya。Akaro 把它设成了 5 °C，所以它一直在缓慢蓄能。由于 未来Sekimeiya 就在二楼，两者的重叠范围引发了世界切换。"

    # game/script.rpy:67249
    old "Everyone but Shiroya B and Atsuki A world switched to world B. ...Alongside both groups, there was someone else who world switched as well."
    new "除了 Shiroya B 和 Atsuki A，所有人都世界切换到了 B世界。……而除了这两组人，还有一个人也发生了世界切换。"

    # game/script.rpy:67258
    old "Naomi C, who was in the lobby, world switched too."
    new "待在大厅里的 Naomi C 也发生了世界切换。"

    # game/script.rpy:67264
    old "Naomi and Shiroya were in the lobby, but only Naomi world switched. That happened because she was still alive."
    new "Naomi 和 Shiroya 都在大厅，但只有 Naomi 发生了世界切换，因为她仍活着。"

    # game/script.rpy:67269
    old "When Isla A touched the Past Sekimeiya, the Future Sekimeiya was just outside the partitions on the second floor."
    new "Isla A 碰到 过去Sekimeiya 时，未来Sekimeiya 恰在二楼隔断之外。"

    # game/script.rpy:67279
    old "...Which was right above the lobby.{w} This is why Shiroya and Atsuki were the only two who didn't world switch—they were in hallway C."
    new "……而那里就在大厅的正上方。{w} 正因如此，没有发生世界切换的只有 Shiroya 和 Atsuki 两人——他们当时在 C走廊。"

    # game/script.rpy:67284
    old "When the world switch happened, Isla C had the Future Sekimeiya wrapped up deep inside the bed sheet. She didn't immediately notice its disappearance."
    new "世界切换发生时，Isla C 把未来Sekimeiya 裹在床单深处，并没有立刻察觉它不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67287
    old "However, what everyone did notice was that the elevator panel had reappeared. Not only on the second floor, but on all of them."
    new "不过，所有人都注意到，电梯的面板重新出现了。不只是二楼，每一层都是如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:67291
    old "Shiroya and Atsuki remained in world A with the corpses. When they went to the second floor, they saw the single Sekimeiya outside the partitions, which Shiroya was later able to use to return to world B."
    new "Shiroya 和 Atsuki 与那些尸体一起留在了 A世界。两人上到二楼时，看见隔断外孤零零地放着一个 Sekimeiya，后来 Shiroya 正是用它回到了 B世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:67300
    old "The moment everyone else world switched to world B, the world B group was in the attic. They had locked themselves in a bedroom."
    new "就在其他所有人都世界切换到 B世界的那一刻，B世界那组人正在阁楼里，把自己反锁在一间卧室里。"

    # game/script.rpy:67303
    old "And when the world C group saw the Sekimeiya in the cabinet, Isla unwrapped the bed sheet and saw that hers had disappeared. The Sekimeiya behind the glass was the Past Sekimeiya, which the world B group had left locked in the cabinet before going to the attic."
    new "而当 C世界那组人看到展示柜里的 Sekimeiya 时，Isla 解开了床单，发现自己的那个已经不见了。玻璃后面那个就是过去Sekimeiya。B世界那组人去阁楼前，把它锁在了展示柜里。"

    # game/script.rpy:67317
    old "\"Isla rapidly unwrapped the sheet to prove that she hadn't lied.\""
    new "「Isla 飞快地解开床单，想证明自己没有说谎。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67338
    old "...I-Is this what you're implying? That it was taken out of the cabinet since the thread is gone and then brought to the attic? Then, at some point, it teleported inside again?{w} I have another idea. Let me take the Sekimeiya. Akaro and Katei, you watch the stairs."
    new "……你、你是这个意思？线不见了，说明有人把它从展示柜里拿出来，带到了阁楼？然后某个时刻，它又传送回了柜子里？{w} 我倒有个办法。Sekimeiya 我来拿。Akaro、Katei，你们盯住楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:67360
    old "\"Sai grabbed the Sekimeiya with his sleeves, causing the curtain to fall, and put it in the middle of the sheet.\""
    new "「Sai 隔着袖子抓住 Sekimeiya，遮布随之落下，他把 Sekimeiya 放到了床单中央。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67368
    old "\"He wrapped it around with one layer of the cloth and waited a few seconds with his hand over it.\""
    new "「他用布把它裹了一层，把手覆在上面，等了几秒。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67373
    old "...It is getting hot—definitely.{w} All right, I'm sure there's someone on this floor. Don't take your eyes off the stairs. I'm not sure we'll find them, though."
    new "……热起来了——确实是热了。{w}好，这一层肯定有人。盯紧楼梯。不过能不能找到，就不好说了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67395
    old "\"Sai wrapped the Sekimeiya up completely once again.\""
    new "「Sai 又把 Sekimeiya 整个裹了起来。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67402
    old "Inside the wrapped sheet, the Past Sekimeiya quickly gathered energy. When Sai touched it in hallway A, they world switched to world C, leaving the sheet behind. The Future Sekimeiya had been very close, and its range was considerable, as it would soon make Akaro travel weeks to the future."
    new "裹在布里的过去Sekimeiya 很快积蓄了能量。Sai 在 A走廊碰到它时，众人世界切换到了 C世界，那块布被留在了原地。未来Sekimeiya 就在不远处，作用范围也相当大——很快，它就会让 Akaro 穿越到数周之后的未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:67403
    old "Without realizing it, they were back in their world. They had made a full loop."
    new "不知不觉间，他们已经回到了自己的世界，完成了一次完整的循环。"

    # game/script.rpy:67407
    old "They inspected the crystal floor, but nobody was found. Akaro and Isla A had remained in world B.{w} However, there were many things they noticed: Suripo's body had reappeared, and Shiroya's had disappeared. But Naomi was still there—she had returned to her world too, and the blood that had pooled below her had vanished."
    new "他们查过水晶层，却一个人也没找到。Akaro 和 Isla A 留在了 B世界。{w}不过，他们注意到了不少变化：Suripo 的尸体重新出现，Shiroya 的却不见了。可 Naomi 还在——她也回到了自己的世界，身下积的那摊血却已经消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67410
    old "...Oh wait, look at Naomi's head."
    new "……等等，看 Naomi 的头。"

    # game/script.rpy:67411
    old "\"From the wound she had, quite a bit of blood was pouring out.\""
    new "「她的伤口正往外涌出不少血。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67416
    old "They'd all returned to world C, but during the brief time they'd been in world B, Naomi's had been the only body in the lobby. She'd been bleeding from her head, so she'd left a large spot of blood on the polished floor.{w} That blood confused many people, but the person most thoroughly deceived by it was Sai B.{w} When he world switched to world A, only Shiroya's corpse was in the lobby, and there was blood next to her. Of course, he naturally assumed that it was hers, not Naomi's.{w} However, when he returned to world B, not only had the pool shrunk, but Shiroya's corpse had disappeared—she was still alive in that world."
    new "所有人都回到了 C世界，可他们在 B世界逗留的那短短一段时间里，大厅里的尸体只有 Naomi 一具。血从她头部流出，在光洁的地板上留下一大片血迹。{w}那片血迹让不少人产生了误解，而被它骗得最彻底的，正是 Sai B。{w}当他世界切换到 A世界时，大厅里只有 Shiroya 的尸体，旁边还有一摊血。他自然以为那是她的血，而不是 Naomi 的。{w}可当他回到 B世界，血迹不仅变小了，Shiroya 的尸体也不见了——在那个世界里，她还活着。"

    # game/script.rpy:67425
    old "In world C, it became clear that understanding what had happened around them might've been out of everyone's grasp. Nobody had been found, but the bizarre occurrences within the tower hadn't stopped."
    new "在 C世界，众人渐渐明白，身边发生的一切，或许没人能真正弄懂。一个人也没找到，可塔内的怪事仍未停歇。"

    # game/script.rpy:67426
    old "The security room had unlocked, Erina's body had disappeared, the Sekimeiya had teleported..."
    new "监控室的门开了，Erina 的尸体不见了，Sekimeiya 也传送走了……"

    # game/script.rpy:67427
    old "That time, Miiya had found it in room A1. It was the fake Sekimeiya, which they decided to leave in the event room for good."
    new "那一次，Miiya 在 A1房间找到了它。那是赝品 Sekimeiya，他们决定就把它永远留在活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:67428
    old "After that, things finally slowed down."
    new "那之后，事情总算平息了一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:67431
    old "And a long time later, Miiya had the urge to lie down. She went to the attic, where she fell asleep."
    new "很久之后，Miiya 忽然很想躺下。她去了阁楼，在那里睡着了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67443
    old "When she woke up, the light suddenly turned on. That was the sign of a world switch."
    new "她醒来时，灯忽然亮了。那是世界切换的征兆。"

    # game/script.rpy:67444
    old "The exact appearance of the bed where she'd been had changed, but she couldn't notice that, as the light had been off. In the world where she appeared, the sheets had been messy as well."
    new "她躺的那张床，样子其实已经变了，只是灯一直关着，她没能察觉。在她所抵达的那个世界里，床单同样凌乱。"

    # game/script.rpy:67445
    old "Nobody was above her, and she heard sounds coming from the opposite bedroom. ...It was Shiroya, who'd been trapped there by Sai."
    new "她上方没有人，对面卧室却传来动静。……是 Shiroya，她被 Sai 关在了那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:67446
    old "Is there anything wrong with this?"
    new "这有什么问题吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:67452
    old "...Shiroya was locked behind that door. It follows that Miiya was in world B."
    new "……Shiroya 被锁在那扇门后。照此推断，Miiya 当时在 B世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:67455
    old "However, the first time a world switch happened from world C, everyone went to world A."
    new "可是，第一次从 C世界发生世界切换时，所有人都去了 A世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:67456
    old "The world switch order is A - B - C - A... Why did Miiya go from world C to world B, then?"
    new "世界切换的顺序是 A－B－C－A……那么，Miiya 为什么会从 C世界到 B世界？"

    # game/script.rpy:67463
    old "If she had world switched while she slept, she would have died. By lying in bed, she pressed the mattress down. Upon changing worlds, her body would've been split in half by an uncompressed mattress."
    new "如果她在睡着时发生世界切换，她就死了。躺上床时，她把床垫压了下去。一旦换了世界，未被压下的床垫就会把她的身体从中间劈开。"

    # game/script.rpy:67464
    old "The reason does not follow the order you're accustomed to."
    new "这其中的原因，并不遵循你们习惯的那个顺序。"

    # game/script.rpy:67465
    old "Can you recall another time a backward world switch happened?"
    new "还能想起另一次逆向的世界切换吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:67474
    old "After Sai and Akaro escaped the attic's bedroom, Sai world switched to world A while in room B6. ...From world B, he went to world A."
    new "Sai 和 Akaro 逃出阁楼的卧室之后，Sai 在 B6房间里切换到了 A世界。……他从 B世界去了 A世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:67478
    old "What about a third instance?"
    new "那第三次呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:67485
    old "Yes. When Atsuki and Erina returned to world B, they had been in world C. Once again, they went from world C to world B."
    new "对。Atsuki 和 Erina 回到 B世界的时候，他们原本在 C世界。又一次，他们从 C世界去了 B世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:67487
    old "When Atsuki and Erina returned to world B, they had been in world C. Once again, they went from world C to world B."
    new "Atsuki 和 Erina 回到 B世界的时候，他们原本在 C世界。又一次，他们从 C世界去了 B世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:67492
    old "Is there anything interesting that these examples share?"
    new "这些例子有什么有趣的共同点吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:67499
    old "That is not the case."
    new "并非如此。"

    # game/script.rpy:67500
    old "The similarity is that neither of the Sekimeiya were activated in their world."
    new "共同点是，两个 Sekimeiya 在他们所在的世界里都没有被激活。"

    # game/script.rpy:67502
    old "Exactly. Neither of the Sekimeiya were activated in their world."
    new "正是。两个 Sekimeiya 在他们所在的世界里都没有被激活。"

    # game/script.rpy:67504
    old "That's wrong. In Sai's case, it was his first time."
    new "不对。Sai 那一次是头一回。"

    # game/script.rpy:67507
    old "In Sai's case..."
    new "Sai 那一次……"

    # game/script.rpy:67513
    old "\"Puzzled, he stepped into hallway B. ...What had just happened?{w} Out of nowhere, the Sekimeiya had disappeared.{w} He wondered if he'd traveled through time. Even though he hadn't touched the Sekimeiya, something peculiar had occurred.\""
    new "「他满腹疑惑，走进了 B走廊。……刚才究竟发生了什么？{w}Sekimeiya 忽然不见了。{w}他怀疑自己是不是经历了时间穿越。明明没有碰过 Sekimeiya，却出了怪事。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67514
    old "Sai world switched without touching the Sekimeiya, and he had both of them."
    new "Sai 没碰 Sekimeiya 就切换了世界，而且两个都在他手上。"

    # game/script.rpy:67515
    old "So, then, why did he world switch? Is there another shared similarity?"
    new "那么，他为什么会切换世界？还有别的共同点吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:67526
    old "That's not it. Both Sekimeiya had been used recently when Sai world switched."
    new "不是这个。Sai 切换世界的时候，两个 Sekimeiya 刚被用过不久。"

    # game/script.rpy:67527
    old "...It happened when they were pulled from the previous world."
    new "……是在它们被从前一个世界拉过来时发生的。"

    # game/script.rpy:67530
    old "It happened when they were pulled from the previous world."
    new "事情就发生在它们被从前一个世界拉过来的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:67532
    old "Yes. It happened when they were pulled from the previous world."
    new "没错。事情就发生在他们被从前一个世界拉过来的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:67533
    old "When Sai world switched from world B to world A, someone world switched from world A to world B.{w} ...Shiroya."
    new "当 Sai 从 B世界切换到 A世界时，也有人从 A世界切换到了 B世界。{w}……是 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:67536
    old "In the storeroom, she touched the Sekimeiya to return to her world."
    new "她在储藏室里触碰了 Sekimeiya，回到了自己的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:67545
    old "When Miiya world switched from world C to world B, someone world switched from world B to world C. In the event room, Erina, Atsuki, and Shiroya suddenly appeared in world C."
    new "当 Miiya 从 C世界切换到 B世界时，也有人从 B世界切换到了 C世界。活动室里，Erina、Atsuki 和 Shiroya 突然出现在 C世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:67554
    old "Every time a world switch was activated, it occurred in the world someone would be sent to as well. If someone was in the overlapping ranges of the next world, they would be pulled backward to the previous one. ...This swap begins to define the real meaning of the world switch."
    new "每次有世界切换被触发时，它也会发生在某人即将被送去的那个世界里。若有人身处下一世界的重叠范围内，就会被拉回前一个世界。……这种互换，逐渐揭示出世界切换的真正含义。"

    # game/script.rpy:67562
    old "When Erina and Atsuki returned to world B in the elevator, they had been in world C."
    new "Erina 和 Atsuki 乘电梯回到 B世界时，他们原本身在 C世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:67571
    old "It was Atsuki A—the person behind the \"extra\" elevator sound in world C."
    new "那正是 Atsuki A——在 C世界弄出那声「多余」电梯响动的人。"

    # game/script.rpy:67575
    old "He'd been escaping from Sai in world A and found both Sekimeiya, which brought him to world B."
    new "他在 A世界躲避 Sai 的追赶，找到了两个 Sekimeiya，结果被带到了 B世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:67576
    old "He hadn't experienced the Sekimeiya's powers yet. Startled by the burn, he thought both glowing gems had merely disappeared."
    new "他还没领教过 Sekimeiya 的力量。灼痛令他吃了一惊，他以为那两颗发光的宝石只是凭空消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67579
    old "In world B, he saw the Future Sekimeiya on the floor of the event room, which Erina had activated. He touched it, and as the Past Sekimeiya was still active in Ido's locker, he world switched to world C."
    new "在 B世界，他看见活动室的地板上放着未来Sekimeiya——那是 Erina 启动过的。他伸手碰了它；由于 Ido 储物柜里的过去Sekimeiya 仍处于启动状态，他切换到了 C世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:67583
    old "...He was only there momentarily.{w} After allowing Erina and his world B self to return to world B, he took the elevator up."
    new "……他只在那里停留了片刻。{w} 等 Erina 和 B世界的自己回到 B世界后，他便乘电梯上去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67586
    old "Out of nowhere, the elevator disappeared, and he fell all the way down onto that world's elevator, leaving him unconscious and wounded."
    new "电梯毫无征兆地消失了，他一路坠落，重重摔在那个世界的电梯上，当场昏迷，浑身是伤。"

    # game/script.rpy:67590
    old "That was where the police found him—the only survivor of the incident."
    new "警察就是在那儿发现他的——那起事件唯一的幸存者。"

    # game/script.rpy:67598
    old "The light suddenly turned on; Miiya was pulled to world B. She heard Shiroya's voice and silently left the attic."
    new "灯光骤然亮起；Miiya 被拉到了 B世界。她听见 Shiroya 的声音，悄悄离开了阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:67601
    old "On the crystal floor, she found the Past Sekimeiya in Ido's locker, where Atsuki had kept it."
    new "她在水晶层找到了 Ido 储物柜里的过去Sekimeiya——那是 Atsuki 先前放在那里的。"

    # game/script.rpy:67602
    old "\"Despite being filled with questions, my mind was blank. My hand was drawn to the shape that had begun to take form behind the dark lines, and through the narrow space, I made contact, hoping with all my might that I would be brought to the awaited time.\""
    new "「纵然满腹疑问，我的脑中却一片空白。昏暗的缝隙后，一个轮廓已渐渐成形，我的手不由自主地伸了过去；穿过狭窄的空隙，我触到了它，拼命祈愿自己能抵达那个等待已久的时间。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67603
    old "After what had happened with Erina, Miiya had learned that traveling to the future with the Sekimeiya was possible. She wanted to be brought to {time=21}, out of the tower.{w} Through the slits in the locker, she activated it, and as Erina had just triggered the world switch, the Future Sekimeiya was powered off. Miiya went more than half an hour to the past and reset the Sekimeiya. When Atsuki B, who had originally hidden it there, later activated it, he only went forty minutes back in time."
    new "经历了 Erina 那件事后，Miiya 明白用 Sekimeiya 穿越到未来是可行的。她希望自己被送到 {time=21} 的塔外。{w} 她透过储物柜的缝隙启动了它；由于 Erina 刚触发过世界切换，未来Sekimeiya 已处于关闭状态。Miiya 回到了半个多小时前，并重置了 Sekimeiya。后来，原本把它藏在那里的 Atsuki B 再次启动它时，只回到了四十分钟前。"

    # game/script.rpy:67609
    old "Miiya appeared in hallway A and immediately fell down. An interesting location.{w} After all, forty minutes after the point she traveled, she was back in world C. She and Atsuki were running to the event room, which was what had made her fall in the past. ...The replicated location was from world C, but it was applied in the past of world B."
    new "Miiya 出现在 A走廊，随即摔倒在地。这地点很有意思。{w} 毕竟，穿越到那个时间点四十分钟后，她就回到了 C世界。她之所以会在过去摔倒，正是因为那时的她和 Atsuki 正跑向活动室。……那个被复制的地点来自 C世界，却被套用在了 B世界的过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:67619
    old "At {time=18:21}, Miiya found Katei dead. Following that, she noticed the flickering green lights of the security cameras."
    new "在 {time=18:21}，Miiya 发现 Katei 已经死了。紧接着，她注意到监控摄像头的绿色指示灯在闪烁。"

    # game/script.rpy:67622
    old "\"The cabinet was covered by its curtain. If the Sekimeiya was behind it, it was possible someone else was soon to be on the crystal floor.\""
    new "「展示柜被遮布盖着。若 Sekimeiya 就在后面，说不定很快就会有别人出现在水晶层。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67623
    old "\"It was possible\"... She wasn't sure if she had gone to the past.{w} She couldn't know if she had gone to the future because she had slept for an unknown period of time. The computer's clock couldn't confirm anything for her."
    new "「有可能」……她不确定自己是否回到了过去。{w} 她不知道自己睡了多久，也就无法判断是否去了未来。电脑上的时钟同样无法为她证实什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:67629
    old "Then, in hallway B, she was found by Erina B, who didn't recognize her. They entered room B4 and found the Sekimeiya that Shiroya had left in a cabinet, which they brought to the event room."
    new "随后，Erina B 在 B走廊发现了她，却没有认出她。两人进入 B4房间，在展示柜里找到了 Shiroya 留下的 Sekimeiya，并将它带到了活动室。"

    # game/script.rpy:67638
    old "When Miiya heard Atsuki's yells, she ran away without noticing that she'd dropped the note she'd been trying to prevent him from seeing. Erina had just reached into Miiya's purse to grab her keys, so it had remained slightly open."
    new "听到 Atsuki 的喊声，Miiya 转身就跑，却没发现自己掉落了那张一直不想让他看到的纸条。先前 Erina 刚把手伸进 Miiya 的包里拿钥匙，包口因此还微微敞着。"

    # game/script.rpy:67643
    old "He and Shiroya were there, talking to each other. After Erina joined them, Miiya attempted to eavesdrop from afar."
    new "他和 Shiroya 就在那里交谈。Erina 也过去之后，Miiya 试图从远处偷听。"

    # game/script.rpy:67646
    old "They went to the event room, so Miiya entered the staff room to listen through the wall."
    new "他们去了活动室，于是 Miiya 进了员工室，隔着墙壁偷听。"

    # game/script.rpy:67647
    old "Minutes later, the same world switch that had pulled her to world B took place."
    new "几分钟后，将她拉到 B世界的那场世界切换发生了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67658
    old "She was the fourth person to world switch to world C. With her ear against the wall, both ranges encompassed her too."
    new "她是第四个完成世界切换、来到 C世界的人。当时她耳朵贴着墙壁，两个范围也都覆盖到了她。"

    # game/script.rpy:67659
    old "In world C, the fake Sekimeiya was still in the event room, so it seemed like it teleported into the cabinet."
    new "在 C世界，赝品 Sekimeiya 仍在活动室里，因此看上去就像是它自己传送进了展示柜。"

    # game/script.rpy:67666
    old "Two hours remained until {time=21.}"
    new "距离 {time=21.} 还有两个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:67674
    old "Fortunately, everyone was able to leave safely. That included Naomi, who was woken up by the loud noise of the shutter."
    new "幸运的是，所有人都安然离开了，包括被卷帘门巨响惊醒的 Naomi。"

    # game/script.rpy:67675
    old "However, a single decision nearly sent everything spiraling into destruction."
    new "然而，仅仅一个决定，就险些让一切坠入毁灭。"

    # game/script.rpy:67679
    old "Instead of the shutter, yells of pain that would've woken Naomi up before that time were almost let out. Disastrous yells that would've shattered everything that had been needed to get there."
    new "差点响起的并不是卷帘门的声音，而是痛苦的喊叫——那会在那个时刻之前就把 Naomi 吵醒。那将是灾难般的喊声，足以让一路走到这里所需的一切尽数崩塌。"

    # game/script.rpy:67684
    old "They were yells that, in reality, nobody ever heard. At {time=21:04}, the police entered the building.{w} Even though everyone was alive, Suripo was dead on the floor. The officers could hardly believe their eyes while the survivors emerged."
    new "那些喊声，现实中谁也没有听见。在 {time=21:04}，警察进入了大楼。{w} 尽管所有人都还活着，Suripo 却已倒在地板上，没了气息。幸存者一个个走出来时，警官们几乎不敢相信自己的眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:67685
    old "...Two of whom knew what had happened. They knew that their lives after the 15th were ones that had been gifted to them."
    new "……其中两人知道发生了什么。他们明白，自己十五号之后的人生，是别人赠予的。"

    # game/script.rpy:67694
    old "Hopefully, you enjoyed this story."
    new "希望你喜欢这个故事。"

    # game/script.rpy:67695
    old "It's not made for everyone, but I'm glad you're still here. ...We're pretty high up."
    new "它并非为所有人而作，不过你还在这里，我很高兴。……我们已经爬得相当高了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67697
    old "Let's see... You answered {} out of {} ({}%) questions correctly. I hope you're proud of that."
    new "让我看看……你答对了 {} 道题，共 {} 道（{}%）。希望你能为此感到自豪。"

    # game/script.rpy:67698
    old "Of course, though, there's one last thing for you to see.{w}{w=0.3} The peak."
    new "不过，当然，还有最后一样东西等着你去看。{w}{w=0.3} 顶峰。"

    # game/script.rpy:67699
    old "Did you think you'd already seen it, maybe?"
    new "你是不是以为自己早就见过了？"

    # game/script.rpy:67700
    old "...What exactly is at the very top?"
    new "……最顶端究竟有什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:67712
    old "The Peak"
    new "顶峰"

    # game/script.rpy:67719
    old "The crystal floor was empty. Everyone had disappeared a long time earlier."
    new "水晶层空无一人。所有人早就不见了踪影。"

    # game/script.rpy:67720
    old "My past self was in the attic. I'd been waiting at the bottom of the tower so that the large range of my past travel wouldn't reach me."
    new "过去的我还在阁楼里。我一直等在塔底，以免过去那次大范围的时间穿越把我也卷进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:67721
    old "It's already been more than an hour. It should happen soon."
    new "已经一个多小时了。应该快发生了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67722
    old "What will happen after? Are the others gonna come back?"
    new "之后会怎样？其他人会回来吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:67723
    old "I'd been resting my mind, but the hours that remained were still an unknown area."
    new "我一直在放空思绪，但剩下的几个小时依旧是一片未知。"

    # game/script.rpy:67724
    old "The first time we changed worlds, did we appear in this world? I've been wondering that for a while..."
    new "我们第一次切换世界时，真的出现在这个世界了吗？这个问题我想了好一阵子了……"

    # game/script.rpy:67725
    old "I'm pretty sure the people we met belonged to this world, but the world we went to could've been the one they were sent to. They don't necessarily have to return to this one."
    new "我很确定，我们遇见的人属于这个世界；但我们去到的世界，或许正是他们被送往的那个。他们未必会回到这个世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:67728
    old "I realized I had a new piece of information to work with."
    new "我意识到，自己手上又多了一条可用的信息。"

    # game/script.rpy:67729
    old "...Actually, I'm pretty sure the world we were sent to was this very world.{w} Sai asked me how Shiroya got into the tower. For him, she'd never been there."
    new "……其实，我很确定，我们被送往的世界正是这一个。{w} Sai 问我 Shiroya 是怎么进塔的。对他来说，她根本没来过塔里。"

    # game/script.rpy:67738
    old "I'd appreciate it if you told the truth, though. How did she get in?"
    new "不过，我还是希望你说实话。她究竟是怎么进来的？"

    # game/script.rpy:67747
    old "\"Indifferent to my confusion and rage, Sai walked to hallway C.\""
    new "「Sai 对我的困惑和怒火毫不在意，径直走向 C走廊。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67753
    old "\"Instead of answering, he entered the storeroom.{w} Seconds later, he returned.\""
    new "「他没有回答，直接走进储藏室。{w} 几秒后，又折返回来。」"

    # game/script.rpy:67767
    old "I get it now. He had marked the door in some way—he could tell whether it had opened. So, he went to the storeroom and confirmed that his mark was still there."
    new "我现在明白了。他在门上做了什么标记——只要门开过，他就能看出来。所以他才去储藏室，确认标记还在原处。"

    # game/script.rpy:67768
    old "That implies that it was this world. The mark existed, as the door hadn't opened since he'd left it."
    new "这说明这里就是那个世界。标记还在——他离开之后，门确实没有开过。"

    # game/script.rpy:67769
    old "That means they'll return here. Just like we came back to our world, they'll come back here. It'll happen before {time=19.}"
    new "也就是说，他们会回到这里。就像我们回到了自己的世界一样，他们也会回到这里。而且会发生在 {time=19.} 之前。"

    # game/script.rpy:67771
    old "And that's not all..."
    new "而且还不止这些……"

    # game/script.rpy:67787
    old "{time=18:43.}.. That was almost twenty minutes behind the real time I estimated. That made me think that after traveling, Sai's replicated location had been of twenty minutes prior, and his watch hadn't stopped working."
    new "{time=18:43.}……这比我估算的真实时间慢了将近二十分钟。我因此猜想，Sai 穿越后所在的那个时间点，其实比现在早了二十分钟，而他的手表并没有停。"

    # game/script.rpy:67795
    old "Now, I'm pretty sure that his watch was a bit more than twenty minutes behind, but it wasn't because he had traveled. It was the Sai from this world, who still had the time wrong from when he'd traveled to the future with the other version of me.{w} Later, when we returned to our world, Sai's time was accurate again, and I figured he must've synced it using the computer."
    new "现在，我基本确定，他的手表慢了不止二十分钟，但这并不是因为他穿越过，而是因为这个世界的 Sai 曾和另一个我一起穿越到未来，表上的时间从那时起就一直不准。{w} 后来我们回到自己的世界时，他的手表又准了，我猜他一定用电脑校准过。"

    # game/script.rpy:67799
    old "It happened even before I expected it. Suddenly, I heard a voice in hallway A."
    new "事情比我预想的来得还早。忽然，A走廊里传来一个声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:67800
    old "...pen again."
    new "……又开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67802
    old "But why is the sheet—"
    new "可为什么那块布——"

    # game/script.rpy:67806
    old "I stood up immediately to hide."
    new "我立刻起身躲了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:67807
    old "Everyone's there! Erina too, she's still alive!"
    new "大家都在！Erina 也在，她还活着！"

    # game/script.rpy:67808
    old "She was a bit closer to the staircase with Isla, and it seemed everyone had just appeared. I'd been sitting on the stairs, so they hadn't noticed me."
    new "她和 Isla 站得离楼梯稍近一些，看样子所有人都是刚刚出现的。我一直坐在楼梯上，所以他们没发现我。"

    # game/script.rpy:67809
    old "Sai went to the storeroom."
    new "Sai 走向储藏室。"

    # game/script.rpy:67812
    old "Suddenly, they began to look through every room."
    new "忽然，他们开始逐个房间搜查。"

    # game/script.rpy:67815
    old "They're really all back, and my past self is likely already gone from the attic."
    new "他们真的全都回来了，而过去的我大概已经离开阁楼了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67816
    old "What now, then? I need to have the Sekimeiya for myself...{w} Am I going to be found? The Sekimeiya are in the attic, so I can probably use the future one to escape from them."
    new "那现在怎么办？我必须把 Sekimeiya 拿到手……{w} 我会被他们发现吗？Sekimeiya 都在阁楼，我或许能用未来那个逃离他们。"

    # game/script.rpy:67818
    old "That wasn't needed. They found the third Sekimeiya, but when they were done, they didn't move up to the second floor."
    new "那倒没必要。他们找到了第三个 Sekimeiya，可是搜查完后，并没有上二楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:67819
    old "...{w}Are they not planning to keep going?"
    new "……{w}他们不打算继续往上搜了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:67820
    old "They remained below, separate from each other."
    new "他们留在下面，彼此隔开了一段距离。"

    # game/script.rpy:67821
    old "Why? Why would they search like that only to not continue? Did they only want to find the Sekimeiya?"
    new "为什么？为什么搜成那样，却不继续了？难道他们只想找到 Sekimeiya？"

    # game/script.rpy:67822
    old "...{w}Maybe I get it. They don't know that the world around them just changed.{w} Perhaps they just looked through the whole building, ending at the crystal floor. If that's when they changed worlds, they must think that the whole building is empty."
    new "……{w}也许我明白了。他们不知道周围的世界刚刚切换过。{w} 他们可能把整栋楼都搜了一遍，最后来到水晶层。如果那就是他们切换世界的那一刻，他们一定会以为整栋楼已经空了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67823
    old "...And if that's the case, as long as they stay there, I can move freely above them."
    new "……若真是这样，只要他们留在下面，我就能在他们上方自由行动。"

    # game/script.rpy:67830
    old "Now I'm sure I'm in the world we once went to. That means I can do everything I want."
    new "现在我能确定，我正身处我们曾经去过的那个世界。也就是说，我想做什么都可以。"

    # game/script.rpy:67831
    old "The end of my plan had always been blurry. After everything else, I wanted to find Shiroya and return to our original world, sure that the reality I wanted to shape did exist. I'd never truly known how to do that until just then."
    new "我计划的终点一直都很模糊。在经历了这么多之后，我想找到 Shiroya，回到原本的世界，并确信我想塑造的那个现实真的存在。直到刚才，我才真正明白该怎么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:67832
    old "We arrived in this world at {time=19.} At that time, I'll be able to meet Shiroya again."
    new "我们是在 {time=19.} 来到这个世界的。到了那时，我就能再次见到 Shiroya。"

    # game/script.rpy:67833
    old "She was with us. Her clothes were different, but she was the real one—she had lived through much more than I had imagined.{w} She'll be here at {time=19}, and she'll go to the attic all of a sudden. That's where I'll be."
    new "她曾和我们在一起。衣着虽然不同，但她才是真正的 Shiroya——她经历的事情远比我预想的多。{w} 她会在 {time=19} 来到这里，然后忽然前往阁楼。我也会在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:67834
    old "Then, I know we'll be able to return to our world. We merely have to be in the middle of the building."
    new "那样一来，我就能确定我们可以回到自己的世界。我们只需要待在这栋楼的中间。"

    # game/script.rpy:67835
    old "When we took the elevator up, it stopped on the third floor. That was when we returned.{w} That must mean that the third floor was being encompassed by the ranges of both Sekimeiya, and someone activated one. If we're there at that time, I know for a fact we'll be able to return."
    new "我们坐电梯上去的时候，电梯停在了三楼。我们就是那时回去的。{w}也就是说，当时三楼正处于两个 Sekimeiya 的重叠范围内，而且有人启动了其中一个。只要那时我们在那儿，我可以肯定，我们一定能回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:67839
    old "I went up to the attic."
    new "我上了阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:67845
    old "As I thought, I'm no longer here."
    new "果然，我已经不在这里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67849
    old "The kitchen was empty, but I could see my footprints on the floor. I had very recently traveled to the 24th of November."
    new "厨房空无一人，但地板上能看见我的脚印。我不久前才穿越到 11 月 24 日。"

    # game/script.rpy:67853
    old "The Past Sekimeiya was on the marble countertop, already white again. By its side was the voice recorder with numbers on its screen.{w} 81:04."
    new "过去Sekimeiya 就放在大理石台面上，已经重新变回白色。它旁边是录音笔，屏幕上显示着数字。{w} 81:04。"

    # game/script.rpy:67854
    old "The Future Sekimeiya was still in the refrigerator, so I put the past one inside too."
    new "未来Sekimeiya 还在冰箱里，我便把 过去Sekimeiya 也放了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:67857
    old "I began a new recording."
    new "我重新开始录音。"

    # game/script.rpy:67860
    old "I was about to take the Past Sekimeiya back out, but my arm stopped itself."
    new "我正要把 过去Sekimeiya 取出来，手却停住了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67861
    old "...{w}My heartbeat picked up, causing my fingers to jitter on their own. A thought had suddenly come to me."
    new "……{w}我的心跳快了起来，手指也不受控制地发颤。一个念头忽然冒了出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:67862
    old "...It should be simple. I can travel to November 30th one more time. I know saving Miiya is within my reach—she's alive.{w} Then, I have to do what I just thought. I can enter the tower when the 15th comes. I can be in the attic at {time=19}, before Shiroya appears."
    new "……应该很简单。我可以再穿越到 11 月 30 日一次。我知道救下 Miiya 并非遥不可及——她还活着。{w} 然后，我必须去做刚才想到的事。等 15 日到来，我就能进入塔里。我可以在 {time=19}、Shiroya 出现之前待在阁楼里。"

    # game/script.rpy:67864
    old "Was that really the case, though?"
    new "可事情当真如此吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:67869
    old "According to my estimate, it should've been a little past {time=16.} Three hours still remained until {time=19.}"
    new "照我的估算，此刻应该刚过{time=16.}，距离{time=19.}还有三个小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:67870
    old "My plan had been to use the Past Sekimeiya one more time after my past self's disappearance."
    new "我的计划，是在过去的我消失之后，再用一次 过去Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:67871
    old "I could live through November 30th a third time; I could save Miiya, as the news I'd read was the only obstacle in that pursuit.{w} In the world I was in, Shiroya didn't exist, but I had never seen her blood, no definitive proof of her death. Her absence was no real barrier."
    new "我可以第三次度过十一月三十日，也可以救下 Miiya——毕竟我读到的那则新闻，是这条路上唯一的阻碍。{w}在我此刻所在的世界里，Shiroya 并不存在，但我从未见过她的血，也没有她已死的确证。她的缺席并不能算真正的障碍。"

    # game/script.rpy:67872
    old "After that, I had to return with Shiroya to our world. The way to accomplish it was by being in the center of the building at close to {time=19:30.}"
    new "之后，我必须带着 Shiroya 回到我们的世界。而要做到这一点，就得在将近{time=19:30.}时待在大楼中央。"

    # game/script.rpy:67873
    old "That was how I had to do it. If I attempted to change worlds before that point by using the two Sekimeiya, it was very likely I would appear someplace else. After all, that was how the group from the world I was in had vanished earlier, and I was completely confident they hadn't appeared in our world."
    new "我只能这么做。若是在那之前就用两个 Sekimeiya 切换世界，我很可能会出现在别的地方。毕竟，我所在的这个世界里的那群人，先前正是那样消失的，而且我可以完全肯定，他们并没有出现在我们的世界里。"

    # game/script.rpy:67874
    old "It should've been doable—I'd never really considered otherwise. ...What made my arm stop was the connection I'd just made."
    new "按理说，这应该办得到——我从未想过别的可能。……让我停下手来的，是我刚刚串起的那层关联。"

    # game/script.rpy:67875
    old "Just before {time=19:30}, Sai had gone to the storeroom to check whether his mark had disappeared. At that time, the door hadn't opened yet."
    new "就在{time=19:30}之前，Sai 曾去储藏室确认自己的标记是否消失。那时，门还没有打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:67880
    old "...{w}I left the attic; I didn't feel comfortable thinking there. If anyone came up with the elevator, I wouldn't hear them, so I chose to go to the sixth floor, where I would hear both the elevator and any approaching footsteps."
    new "……{w}我离开了阁楼。我总觉得在那里思考不踏实。要是有人乘电梯上来，我根本听不见，于是我选择去六楼——在那里，电梯的动静和任何靠近的脚步声都能传进耳中。"

    # game/script.rpy:67885
    old "...Of course, my plan implied a future version of myself was in the tower. A version of myself who had been there since the morning.{w} I'd known that, which was why I'd followed the group's movements—so that I could give myself a route to hide throughout the day, aware of where to be at all times."
    new "……当然，我的计划意味着，未来的我就在这座塔里——一个从早晨起便待在这里的我。{w}这一点我早就清楚，所以才一直留意那群人的动向，好给自己安排一条整日藏身的路线，随时知道该待在何处。"

    # game/script.rpy:67886
    old "Could that really be the case, though?"
    new "可是，真的会是这样吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:67887
    old "When I thought about it after having witnessed the whole series of events, my heartbeat grew erratic."
    new "亲眼目睹了整件事的经过之后，再回想起来，我的心跳便乱了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:67888
    old "Is it...?{w} Just before the group left this world, the whole building was searched, when I replaced the other Atsuki without anyone noticing. Naturally, my future self wasn't found—that would've been a paradox, as I would've seen myself before knowing where I would be."
    new "会是这样吗……？{w}在那群人离开这个世界之前，整栋楼都被搜查过——正是在那时，我不动声色地顶替了另一个 Atsuki。未来的我自然没有被发现。若被发现，就会成为悖论：那等于我在得知自己该去何处之前，就先看见了自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:67889
    old "So, why was that me not found? How will I avoid being found?{w} At the time, every single place was inspected except for the hidden area in the storeroom. However, I couldn't have been there, as my own past self already was."
    new "那么，那个我为什么没被找到？我又要怎样才能不被找到？{w}当时，除了储藏室里那处隐蔽的空间，每一处都被查过了。可我不可能待在那里——过去的我已经占着那个位置了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67892
    old "I'd had the thought in the back of my mind: if a similar problem arose, the storeroom's secret could aid me. ...That was no longer the case."
    new "我心里一直存着一个念头：若再遇到类似的难题，储藏室的秘密或许能帮上忙。……如今这念头行不通了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67893
    old "My future self merely has to be here at {time=19:30.} ...It's not exact, but I'll say the search happened at {time=14.}{w} My past self was in the storeroom from {time=9} to {time=14.} Immediately after I left it, the fake wall was found by this world's group.{w} I thought that in the worst-case scenario, I could enter through the storeroom after the attack. ...But that's not possible. As soon as it was found, Sai marked it, and I know that mark will still be there at {time=19:30}, right before we returned to our world."
    new "未来的我只需在{time=19:30.}待在这里就够了。……时间未必精确，但搜查大约是在{time=14.}。{w}从{time=9}到{time=14.}，过去的我一直待在储藏室。我刚离开那里，这个世界的众人就发现了那面假墙。{w}我原以为，最坏的情况下，还能在袭击之后从储藏室进入……但那已不可能。假墙一被发现，Sai 就在上面做了标记，而我知道，就在{time=19:30}、也就是我们即将回到自己的世界之前，那个标记仍然还在。"

    # game/script.rpy:67894
    old "Knowing all that, it wasn't possible that a future self of mine would enter the tower after the {time=14} search."
    new "既然清楚这些，未来的我就不可能在{time=14}的搜查之后进入这座塔。"

    # game/script.rpy:67897
    old "More importantly, it's very unlikely this would be possible either way. I shouldn't assume that I could enter through the storeroom without being seen. Technically, I could enter after {time=19:30} and travel to the past in order to be at the center of the building at the right time, but I don't know whether I'll be seen outside, and if I am, I'll be unable to travel back.{w} I shouldn't go back to the 30th with a plan that could fail, so I have to entirely rule out the storeroom."
    new "更重要的是，无论怎么看，这都极难办到。我不能假定自己能不被人看见就从储藏室进去。严格来说，我可以在{time=19:30}之后进入，再穿越回过去，好在恰当的时刻待在大楼中央；但外面会不会有人看见我，我并不知道，一旦被看见，就没法再穿越回去。{w}我不能带着一个可能失败的方案回到三十日，所以储藏室这条路必须彻底排除。"

    # game/script.rpy:67898
    old "That meant that for a future self of mine to be present at {time=19:30}, he would've had to be in the tower since a time before my past self had begun to wait in the storeroom.{w} Since I was aware of that, how could I avoid being found by the search at {time=14}?"
    new "也就是说，未来的我若要在{time=19:30}出现在这里，就必须在过去的我开始守候于储藏室之前，就已经待在塔里了。{w}既然我清楚这一点，又怎么可能躲过{time=14}的那场搜查？"

    # game/script.rpy:67899
    old "There's one way—by traveling to the future."
    new "只有一个办法——穿越到未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:67903
    old "When could I have used the Future Sekimeiya to not be present at {time=14}?"
    new "我能在什么时候使用未来Sekimeiya，好让自己在{time=14}不在场？"

    # game/script.rpy:67904
    old "After the smoke was released, it was brought to the attic in a suitcase. The next time it moved was when Katei brought it to the crystal floor with the other Atsuki and Miiya."
    new "烟雾放出之后，它被人装进手提箱送上了阁楼。它下一次移动，是在 Katei 和另一个 Atsuki、Miiya 一起把它带到水晶层的时候。"

    # game/script.rpy:67905
    old "I remember how he looked when he had it in his hands. He was in pain because the Sekimeiya hadn't been activated since it had been taken out of the cabinet."
    new "我记得他双手捧着它时的神情。他当时疼得厉害，因为那个 Sekimeiya 从展示柜里被取出后，就一次都没有启动过。"

    # game/script.rpy:67906
    old "If my future self had used it before he brought it down, it would've reset and spent a while powered off. There's no way Katei would've had to hold it carefully like he did."
    new "若是未来的我在他把它带下来之前用过它，它就会重置，并有一段时间处于关闭状态。那样的话，Katei 根本不必像那样小心翼翼地捧着它。"

    # game/script.rpy:67907
    old "If I'd touched it at that point, I would've had to be in the storeroom during the night to appear in the tower in the future. Maybe that's possible, but there's too much uncertainty; there's clear room for failure."
    new "如果我在那个时候碰过它，那么为了让未来的自己出现在塔里，我就必须在夜里进入储藏室。或许这办得到，但不确定的因素太多，明显有失败的可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:67908
    old "I could explain Katei's face in a different way: I could leave the Sekimeiya in a hot place as I touch it. However, both Sekimeiya were in the attic. I would have to find out which was which, keep the past one in the refrigerator due to its large range, and travel to the future."
    new "Katei 的表情也可以有另一种解释：我可以在触碰 Sekimeiya 的同时，把它留在高温的地方。可两个 Sekimeiya 都在阁楼里。我得先弄清楚哪个是哪个，把范围大的那个——也就是过去Sekimeiya——放进冰箱，然后再穿越到未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:67913
    old "...I'd once put some thought into the type of web I was entangled in. I'd considered that in order to work around what you'd observed, having observed too much could be a fatal flaw."
    new "……我曾花过些心思，琢磨自己究竟陷在怎样一张网里。我想到过，为了绕开你所观察到的东西，观察得太多反而可能成为致命的缺陷。"

    # game/script.rpy:67914
    old "At the time, I'd also come up with another concept in the form of thought-up loops, which were fundamentally similar to the way the Past Sekimeiya worked."
    new "当时，我还想到过另一个概念——凭空设想的循环，它与过去Sekimeiya 的运作方式在根本上相似。"

    # game/script.rpy:67915
    old "It's uncertain whether traveling to the future before Katei brought the Sekimeiya down will work out smoothly. However, I have a way to know if it will."
    new "在 Katei 把 Sekimeiya 带下来之前穿越到未来，究竟能否顺利成功，还说不准。不过，我有办法确认它是否行得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:67916
    old "A cue.{w} If I had a loop in my head, I could know whether it could be completed. If I thought about everything that I would do after touching the Past Sekimeiya, I could observe whether a cue I intended to leave would exist."
    new "一个提示。{w}只要脑中存着一个循环，我就能知道它能否成立。若我把触碰过去Sekimeiya 之后要做的每一件事都想清楚，便能观察自己打算留下的那个提示是否存在。"

    # game/script.rpy:67917
    old "So, could I do this? If it works, I'll draw a mark with a pen beneath a drawer on this floor..."
    new "那么，我做得到吗？如果行得通，我就用笔在这一层的某个抽屉底下画一个记号……"

    # game/script.rpy:67923
    old "I went to the offices and walked up to the drawer I'd selected."
    new "我走到办公区，来到自己选定的那个抽屉前。"

    # game/script.rpy:67927
    old "...It's not here. There's no mark."
    new "……没有。这里没有记号。"

    # game/script.rpy:67931
    old "There'd been clear uncertainty behind the loop I'd thought of, but thanks to the lack of the cue, the uncertainty could be erased—that loop wouldn't work."
    new "我设想的那个循环背后，本有明确的不确定之处；而今提示并不存在，这份不确定也就有了答案——那个循环行不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:67932
    old "It's impossible, then. I might be failing to realize the reason why it couldn't be executed. I don't know if it's just a tiny detail."
    new "那么，这不可能。或许我还没意识到它无法执行的真正原因。也许只是某个极小的细节，我也说不准。"

    # game/script.rpy:67936
    old "What about entering through the storeroom after {time=19:30} and then traveling to the past? Could that be possible?"
    new "那在{time=19:30}之后从储藏室进入，再穿越回过去呢？这能办到吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:67939
    old "If it is, I'll go back in time to a point after {time=14} and leave a mark beneath that drawer. If I need to, I'll travel back twice in order to make it to a point prior to now."
    new "若能办到，我就穿越回{time=14}之后的某个时刻，在那个抽屉底下留下记号。如果有必要，我会连续穿越两次，回到比现在更早的时点。"

    # game/script.rpy:67944
    old "There was nothing there."
    new "那里什么也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:67945
    old "That makes sense. That means I couldn't enter the building through the storeroom without being seen from outside."
    new "原来如此。看来只要从储藏室进入大楼，就一定会被外面的人看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:67946
    old "I was growing nervous. Miiya was alive—success must've awaited me.{w} ...But could I be sure of that?{w} It was a guarantee that Miiya was alive, but what about Shiroya? The circumstances around her were what left room for doubt."
    new "我渐渐不安起来。Miiya 还活着——等待我的本该是成功。{w}……可我能确定吗？{w}Miiya 活着是确凿的，但 Shiroya 呢？她那边的情形，才留出了疑问的余地。"

    # game/script.rpy:67952
    old "When the Future Sekimeiya was brought down from the attic, Katei used it. Then, the other Atsuki and Sai traveled minutes forward as well. There's no way I could travel before then."
    new "未来Sekimeiya 从阁楼被带下来时，Katei 用了它。随后，另一个 Atsuki 和 Sai 也向未来穿越了几分钟。在那之前，我不可能穿越。"

    # game/script.rpy:67953
    old "But... the situation is the same later. I saw what happened to the Sekimeiya.{w} Sai, Akaro, and Katei moved them back and forth, but I remember it clearly—no place where the Future Sekimeiya was hidden was accessed by a future self of mine. My line of sight unconsciously blocked myself."
    new "可是……之后的情形也一样。Sekimeiya 的遭遇我都看在眼里。{w}Sai、Akaro 和 Katei 把两个 Sekimeiya 搬来搬去，可我记得很清楚——未来Sekimeiya 藏身过的任何一处，都不曾被未来的我碰过。我的视线在不知不觉间，把自己挡在了外面。"

    # game/script.rpy:67959
    old "There's no way a future self of mine was on the crystal floor and wasn't seen by me or anyone who was there. The Future Sekimeiya wasn't activated, and neither was the past one."
    new "未来的我若在水晶层，不可能瞒过我或在场的任何人。未来Sekimeiya 没有被启动，过去Sekimeiya 也一样。"

    # game/script.rpy:67960
    old "Katei did go a long time to the future, but even if I were to enter his travel's range, I wouldn't go past {time=14.}"
    new "Katei 确实向未来穿越了很长一段，但即使我进入他穿越的范围，也到不了{time=14.}以后。"

    # game/script.rpy:67961
    old "And when the Future Sekimeiya was hidden in the mechanical room, the other Atsuki and Miiya used it to go to the future."
    new "而当未来Sekimeiya 被藏进机械室时，另一个 Atsuki 和 Miiya 用它去了未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:67962
    old "Suripo's killer brought it to a room in hallway B. When I was enacting the search, I felt the air around it, which was burning. There's no way I had touched it before then."
    new "杀害 Suripo 的凶手把它带到了B走廊的一个房间。我搜查时，感觉到它周围的空气烫得厉害。在此之前，我不可能碰过它。"

    # game/script.rpy:67963
    old "...So is it not possible? Was there really no time where I could've gone to the future!?"
    new "……那么，真的办不到？我当真没有一刻能穿越到未来！？"

    # game/script.rpy:67965
    old "I thought of using the Past Sekimeiya instead. Its only use would've been to travel seconds back to a room that had just been inspected. However, I'd also felt the air around it during the search, and it had been even hotter... That path was blocked too."
    new "我转而想到用过去Sekimeiya。它唯一的用处，不过是穿越回几秒之前，回到一间刚刚搜查过的房间。可搜查时我也感觉到了它周围的空气，而且比先前更烫……这条路同样被堵死了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67969
    old "...{w}I felt lost. How the hell could I accomplish anything?"
    new "……{w}我茫然无措。这样下去，我究竟能做成什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:67970
    old "Traveling to the future before the attack won't be doable, and after the 30th, Ashiya already had the Sekimeiya. The days up to the 15th are useless.{w} It was the owner of that gem shop who found the Sekimeiya. On the 30th, it's very likely they were in that box I saw...{w} But they were taken by the man who released the smoke, and he ran away with them."
    new "赶在袭击之前穿越到未来行不通，而30号之后，Sekimeiya 已经落到芦屋手里了。15号之前的日子都没有用。{w}找到 Sekimeiya 的，是那家宝石店的店主。30号那天，它们很可能就在我看到的那只箱子里……{w}可它们被那个释放烟雾的男人抢走了，他带着它们逃了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:67971
    old "I know the smoke was released thanks to the news report I saw, so I can't obtain the Sekimeiya and save Miiya together. Not to mention that to appear in the tower on the 15th, I would also have to be there on the 15th of November.{w} I'm sure that after the man ran away with the box, he was caught. That's what Katei told us about, and it's the reason why the Sekimeiya returned to Ashiya. There's nothing I can do there."
    new "我看到的新闻报道说烟雾被释放了，所以我没法既拿到 Sekimeiya 又救下 Miiya。何况，要在15号出现在塔里，我就得在11月15日待在那里。{w}我确信那个男人带着箱子逃走之后被抓了。Katei 跟我们讲的就是这件事，正因如此 Sekimeiya 才回到了芦屋。那边我插不上手。"

    # game/script.rpy:67972
    old "Just in case, I need to try it.{w} A loop where I go to November 15th and remain inside the tower. Then, on November 30th, I take that box with the Sekimeiya.{w} As fast as possible, I make sure Miiya won't die and run away. Then, I travel to the future and appear after the search that happened at {time=14.}{w} I'll tell the police about the Sekimeiya's location before I travel so that they can find them and return them to Ashiya.{w} If this can work, a mark will be under that drawer."
    new "以防万一，我得试一试。{w}一个循环：我先去11月15日，留在塔里。然后在11月30日，拿走那只装着 Sekimeiya 的箱子。{w}我要尽快确保 Miiya 不会死，然后逃走。接着穿越到未来，出现在{time=14.}那次搜查结束之后。{w}穿越之前，我会先把 Sekimeiya 的位置告诉警方，好让他们找到后归还给芦屋。{w}如果这能行得通，那只抽屉下面就会有记号。"

    # game/script.rpy:67978
    old "{tip=ohnoitdidntwork}It wasn't there{/tip}. It appeared that couldn't work either."
    new "{tip=ohnoitdidntwork}那里什么也没有{/tip}。看来这条路同样走不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:67982
    old "I kept thinking about the events that had occurred throughout the day in case I could find the smallest opening, but it really seemed like there was no place for a future self of mine to exist."
    new "我一整天都在反复回想发生过的事，想找出哪怕一线可能，可看来未来的我根本无处容身。"

    # game/script.rpy:67983
    old "Does this mean that I can't be here at {time=19:30}? But that's the single guaranteed way I have to go back!"
    new "这就是说，我不能在{time=19:30}待在这里？可那是我唯一能确定回去的办法啊！"

    # game/script.rpy:67984
    old "I could change worlds in the morning instead, after Shiroya and Naomi did. That's a lot less likely to bring me to the world I want, though...!"
    new "我也可以改到早上，在 Shiroya 和 Naomi 之后再做世界切换。可那样一来，我就更不可能落到自己想去的世界了……！"

    # game/script.rpy:67985
    old "...Maybe there was no way to skip the {time=14} search, but what about another way around it?"
    new "……也许{time=14}那次搜查是没法跳过的，但换个方向绕开它呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:67986
    old "The Atsuki from this world looked at the rooms in hallway A. Then, I took his place and looked through the rest of the crystal floor.{w} Finally, Miiya and I completed all the other floors."
    new "这个世界的 Atsuki 查看过 A走廊的房间。之后我接替他，把水晶层剩下的地方查了一遍。{w}最后，我和 Miiya 把其余楼层都查完了。"

    # game/script.rpy:67987
    old "What if... my future self was in one of the hallway A rooms? Technically, that's how I was able to not be found that time. I told the Atsuki from this world to stay put, and he did so because it was his own request."
    new "万一……未来的我就在 A走廊的某个房间里呢？严格说来，那次我能不被找到，靠的就是这个。我让这个世界的 Atsuki 待在原地，他照做了，因为那正是他自己的要求。"

    # game/script.rpy:67988
    old "Could I do the same? Could I ask him to ignore having seen me?"
    new "我能照做吗？能让他当作没见过我吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:67989
    old "I wondered that, well aware of the answer."
    new "我这样想着，心里却清楚答案。"

    # game/script.rpy:67992
    old "I recalled the time he'd seen me."
    new "我想起他看见我的那一刻。"

    # game/script.rpy:67998
    old "\"I saw my own body stepping in. As he approached one of the cabinets, I knew there was only one thing I could do.\""
    new "「我看见自己的身体走了进来。当他走向其中一个展示柜时，我知道自己只有一件事能做。」"

    # game/script.rpy:68005
    old "\"He turned around with a startled gasp. His reaction was even more drastic when he saw me.\""
    new "「他吃惊地倒吸一口气，转过身来。等看清是我，他的反应更加剧烈。」"

    # game/script.rpy:68006
    old "Wh-What!? Who are you!?{w=0.7} Are you... me?"
    new "什、什么！？你是谁！？{w=0.7}你是……我？"

    # game/script.rpy:68007
    old "\"I nodded, although it wasn't the entire truth.\""
    new "「我点了点头，虽然那并不完全是实话。」"

    # game/script.rpy:68015
    old "That reaction gave me the answer. That was the first time he'd seen another self of his."
    new "那个反应已经给了我答案。那是他第一次见到另一个自己。"

    # game/script.rpy:68016
    old "Could my future self have told him to react that way? ...Word by word?{w} I didn't think that was how it worked; his reaction seemed completely genuine. Likely, the only way for me to make such a thing work would've been by considering it before seeing his reaction."
    new "未来的我有没有可能教过他那样反应？……一字一句地教？{w}我觉得事情不该是这样运作的；他的反应看起来完全是真心的。恐怕，我要真想促成这种事，唯一的办法就是在他做出反应之前先想到这一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:68017
    old "Nonetheless, I verified whether it would work. If a mark was below the next desk, it would."
    new "尽管如此，我还是验证了一下是否可行。如果下一张桌子下面有记号，那就说明可行。"

    # game/script.rpy:68022
    old "Once again, there was nothing."
    new "还是一样，什么也没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:68026
    old "I thought back to the look in Miiya's eyes. It had changed at one point."
    new "我回想起 Miiya 的眼神。有那么一刻，那眼神变了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68027
    old "What if she saw me? What if my future self was in the partitions on that floor?{w} Could he have told her to not reveal him?"
    new "如果她看见我了呢？如果未来的我就躲在那层楼的隔间里呢？{w}他会不会嘱咐过她别把他暴露出来？"

    # game/script.rpy:68028
    old "That felt a little strange. If that had happened, why would her look have changed in that way? I knew the answer couldn't be that I would instruct her to do so."
    new "这感觉有些奇怪。若真是如此，她的眼神为什么会那样变？我知道答案不可能是「我吩咐她这么做」。"

    # game/script.rpy:68029
    old "Not only that, but if I stayed in that partition, the reason would've been due to knowing how Miiya's demeanor changed. In short, the result would've caused the effect."
    new "不止如此，若我藏在那间隔间里，理由必然是「我知道 Miiya 的神情会如何变化」。简而言之，结果反过来造就了原因。"

    # game/script.rpy:68030
    old "Well, is that so? I did notice a while ago that there's something special about the offices on the fourth floor...{w} I'm pretty sure that nobody ever looked at them—neither in the morning nor later in the day. Miiya was the only person to inspect them. I spent the day following everyone to know where to be in a future loop."
    new "哦，是这样吗？我先前就注意到四楼的办公室有些特别……{w}我敢说，不管是早上还是后来，都没人去看过那里。只有 Miiya 检查过。为了弄清未来的循环里该待在哪里，我一整天都跟着所有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:68031
    old "Could my future self really have been there all the time? Could that work?"
    new "未来的我真能一直待在那里吗？这行得通吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:68032
    old "I tested it right away. If it could, a mark would be below a drawer..."
    new "我立刻去验证。如果行得通，某个抽屉下面就会有记号……"

    # game/script.rpy:68037
    old "There's nothing! What the fuck!?"
    new "什么都没有！他妈的怎么回事！？"

    # game/script.rpy:68038
    old "Once again, it seemed my idea was deemed an impossibility by the universe. For one reason or another, it wasn't something that could occur."
    new "又一次，似乎宇宙判定我的想法不可能实现。不知为什么，这种事就是无法发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:68039
    old "You've gotta be joking. I'm certain Miiya and Shiroya can both be alive in this world, but can I not return to mine? Do I have to hope changing worlds at another time will work?"
    new "开什么玩笑。我确信 Miiya 和 Shiroya 都能在这个世界活着，可我却回不了自己的世界？难道我只能指望换个时间再切换世界就能成功？"

    # game/script.rpy:68040
    old "...It had to be at {time=19:30.} I was fairly certain about that."
    new "……必须是在{time=19:30.}。这一点我相当确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:68046
    old "If my future self had been in the attic when Shiroya and Naomi disappeared this morning, he would've appeared along with them. Even if not in the same world, I would reunite with Shiroya."
    new "如果今早 Shiroya 和 Naomi 消失时，未来的我就在阁楼里，那他就会跟她们一起出现。即便不在同一个世界，我也能和 Shiroya 重逢。"

    # game/script.rpy:68047
    old "I don't think that's possible, though. I would've had to be there before Naomi unlocked the attic. When I looked through the cameras, I saw that our past selves were right behind her.{w} Even then, because the range didn't reach me, I'm not sure it would've reached the kitchen. There's no way I could've been in the living room, and I didn't see my footprints anywhere."
    new "可我觉得那不可能。我得在 Naomi 打开阁楼之前就待在那里。我看监控时，看到过去的我们就跟在她身后。{w}即便那样，因为范围没有覆盖到我，我也不确定它有没有延伸到厨房。我不可能待在客厅，而且哪里都没看到我的脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:68048
    old "...That's not even everything. I need to be certain the travel will work because there's no way I'll have another chance. If I intend to change worlds when Shiroya and Naomi did, even if it works, I'll end up in a different world from this one. This means that I'll be unable to leave a physical indication for me to see now..."
    new "……还不止这些。我必须确定这次穿越一定能成，因为我不可能再有第二次机会。如果我打算像 Shiroya 和 Naomi 那样切换世界，就算成功，我也会落在一个与这里不同的世界。也就是说，我没法给现在的自己留下任何实物记号……"

    # game/script.rpy:68049
    old "I don't think it would work, but what matters is that there's room for failure. I can't afford that."
    new "我觉得那行不通，但关键在于，它仍有失败的可能。而我承受不起失败。"

    # game/script.rpy:68054
    old "I had been lost in thought for a while when something alerted me. Someone was walking up."
    new "我出神地想了许久，忽然有什么让我警觉起来。有人正走上来。"

    # game/script.rpy:68058
    old "I quickly hid in the second partition and saw a single person walking past the glass. Fortunately, they hadn't seen me."
    new "我赶紧躲进第二个隔间，看见一个人从玻璃外走过。幸好对方没有看见我。"

    # game/script.rpy:68059
    old "...Miiya? Why is she alone?"
    new "……Miiya？她怎么一个人？"

    # game/script.rpy:68060
    old "All by herself, she went to the attic. She'd been yawning, so perhaps she wanted to rest on the beds."
    new "她独自一人去了阁楼。她一直在打哈欠，大概是想去床上歇一歇。"

    # game/script.rpy:68062
    old "The Sekimeiya are in the refrigerator. She shouldn't see them."
    new "Sekimeiya 都在冰箱里。不能让她看到它们。"

    # game/script.rpy:68064
    old "I couldn't get distracted. I had to find a solution to my problem."
    new "我不能分心。我必须为自己的问题找到出路。"

    # game/script.rpy:68071
    old "I attempted to come up with something else. There had to be something that would help me...!"
    new "我试着再想别的办法。总该有什么能帮到我……！"

    # game/script.rpy:68072
    old "What if I let the Past Sekimeiya gather energy right now and I bring it somewhere so that its range reaches behind the tower?"
    new "如果我现在就让过去Sekimeiya 蓄能，再把它带到某个地方，让它的范围延伸到塔后方呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:68073
    old "I activate it and go a few minutes to the past, knowing that in the future, my future self will be right outside the tower, waiting to be encompassed. If I do that and think that I'll be in the tower in the future, will I appear inside it?"
    new "我启动它，穿越到几分钟前，并且清楚未来的我正守在塔外，等着被范围覆盖。如果我这么做，同时想着自己将来要在塔里，我会出现在塔内吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:68074
    old "Or would I run into the same issue as trying to appear with an item that I can't obtain? I need to test it."
    new "还是说，我会跟「带着拿不到的东西现身」一样，碰上同样的问题？我得试一试。"

    # game/script.rpy:68079
    old "I failed to see any cue."
    new "我没能捕捉到任何征兆。"

    # game/script.rpy:68080
    old "Really? ...Is it just because I couldn't enter the tower by my own means, or is there another reason...?"
    new "真的？……只是因为我没法靠自己进塔，还是另有原因……？"

    # game/script.rpy:68081
    old "There's gotta be something else. I could get into the tower through the storeroom and affect Sai's mark. That should allow the travel to put me inside the tower, which would bypass the mark. So, his mark would only be affected in a hypothetical world. It should work...!"
    new "肯定还有别的办法。我可以通过储藏室进入塔内，从而影响到 Sai 的标记。这样，时间穿越就该能把我送进塔里，绕开标记。也就是说，他的标记只会在假想世界里受到影响。这应该行得通……！"

    # game/script.rpy:68088
    old "Something else... There had to be something else."
    new "还有别的……一定还有别的什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:68089
    old "What if the Atsuki that Miiya has been with is my future self?"
    new "如果一直陪在 Miiya 身边的人，就是未来的我呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:68090
    old "It sounded interesting. Before that morning, I could've replaced the Atsuki of that world by making him stay outside the tower. Then, I could've hidden in plain sight by acting as the Atsuki who'd gotten trapped."
    new "这个想法很有意思。在那天早晨之前，我本可以设法让那个世界的 Atsuki 留在塔外，从而取代他。然后，我就能扮演那个被困在塔里的 Atsuki，光明正大地藏在众人眼前。"

    # game/script.rpy:68091
    old "Of course, it was an impossibility: I would've observed my own movements all along, giving them no origin. However, if I had thought about that concept early enough, I felt it would've been viable."
    new "当然，这是不可能的：我的行动自始至终都在我自己的观察之中，那样它们就没有源头了。不过，如果能早一点想到这个构想，我觉得它其实行得通。"

    # game/script.rpy:68099
    old "My thoughts went back to the search at {time=14.}"
    new "我的思绪又回到了 {time=14.} 的那次搜索。"

    # game/script.rpy:68102
    old "I had thought about everything: my past self couldn't have been in the rooms I'd investigated. He couldn't have been in the rooms the other Atsuki had investigated. He couldn't have been in the places Miiya had investigated."
    new "我什么都考虑过了：过去的我不可能藏在我查过的房间里，也不可能在另一个 Atsuki 查过的房间里，更不可能在 Miiya 找过的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:68103
    old "And he couldn't have been traveling forward in time."
    new "他也不可能穿越到未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:68104
    old "Where the hell had he been, then? The answer I was looking for had to be somewhere as well."
    new "那他到底藏在哪儿？我想要的答案也一定就在某处。"

    # game/script.rpy:68105
    old "I hadn't forgotten about Miiya's change of attitude. She had come out of the fourth floor's partitions with an entirely different demeanor."
    new "我也没有忘记 Miiya 态度的转变。她从四楼那些隔间里出来时，整个人判若两人。"

    # game/script.rpy:68106
    old "Why? I knew my future self couldn't have been there.{w} So, then, what could she have seen?"
    new "为什么？我明明知道未来的我不可能在那里。{w}那么，她究竟看到了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:68109
    old "It was clear the way I was handling my thoughts wasn't proper; I had to widen their scope."
    new "显然，我这样想问题的方式不对；我得把思路放宽一些。"

    # game/script.rpy:68110
    old "In the end, only two things mattered: saving Miiya and returning to my world. The way I was thinking about it, those two aspects seemed to be incompatible."
    new "说到底，只有两件事要紧：救出 Miiya，回到我的世界。可按我眼下的思路，这两件事似乎无法两全。"

    # game/script.rpy:68111
    old "How else could Miiya be saved, though? How the hell could the news I saw be bypassed?"
    new "可是，除此之外还能怎么救 Miiya？我看到的那条新闻，又到底该怎么绕过去？"

    # game/script.rpy:68112
    old "There's no other way. I have to go back to the past again, to the 30th."
    new "没有别的路。我必须再一次回到过去，回到 30 日那天。"

    # game/script.rpy:68113
    old "This is what I determined. I can salvage this world's history. Since I'm from another world, I can save this one."
    new "我下定了决心。我能挽救这个世界的历史。既然我来自另一个世界，我就能救下这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:68114
    old "It has to be me—someone who hasn't observed the truth of this world yet. That's the only way."
    new "必须是我——一个还没有看清这个世界真相的人。这是唯一的办法。"

    # game/script.rpy:68117
    old "It is the only way, isn't it?"
    new "这是唯一的办法，不是吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:68121
    old "...I suppose it's not. Only one part of that is correct.{w} It doesn't have to be me, but the only reason I can do it is that I'm not from this world. Only someone who isn't from this world can divert this world's history from their own. That's a better way to put it."
    new "……恐怕不是。那句话只有一半说对了。{w}未必非我不可，但我之所以能做到，只是因为我并非来自这个世界。只有不属于这个世界的人，才能让这个世界的历史偏离其原本的轨迹。这么说才更准确。"

    # game/script.rpy:68124
    old "That's... right. I'm not the only person who can do this. It can be anyone from another world.{w} And... at {time=19}, the Shiroya from my world will appear here and go to the attic."
    new "说得……没错。能做到这件事的不止我一个，任何来自其他世界的人都行。{w}而且……到了 {time=19}，我那个世界的 Shiroya 会出现在这里，然后前往阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:68125
    old "She can do this too. ...Would that make a difference, though? Would that solve any problems?"
    new "她也能做这件事。……可那又有什么用呢？能解决什么问题吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:68126
    old "I can tell her what I've learned. I can tell her everything. ...If she went to the past and saved this world, would she be able to be here at {time=19:30}?"
    new "我可以把我查到的一切告诉她，全部告诉她。……如果她回到过去，救下这个世界，她还能在 {time=19:30} 出现在这里吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:68127
    old "She couldn't have been in one of the rooms the Atsuki from this world investigated. The way he looked said more than enough. ...That means there's only one other possibility, but it doesn't make sense either.{w} It doesn't make sense."
    new "她不可能出现在这个世界的 Atsuki 搜查过的任何一个房间里。他当时的神情已经说明了一切。……那就只剩下另一种可能，可那也说不通。{w}说不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:68131
    old "When I looked under the next drawer, it was clear that the universe disagreed with me."
    new "我朝下一个抽屉底下看去，顿时明白，连宇宙都不站在我这边。"

    # game/script.rpy:68136
    old "I almost burst out laughing at what I saw. Not only from the absurdity of it existing, but also from how cartoonish it was. Maybe Shiroya had doodled something so goofy-looking just to elicit that reaction."
    new "看到眼前的东西，我差点笑出声。不只是因为它竟然存在这件事本身就很荒谬，更因为它那副卡通般的滑稽模样。也许 Shiroya 就是故意画了这么个傻乎乎的东西，好让人发笑。"

    # game/script.rpy:68137
    old "Stunned, part of me refused what I was seeing. It flew in the face of what I knew. If that was the truth, what was the meaning behind that search? Why had nobody been found?"
    new "我愣在原地，心里有一部分拒绝接受眼前的景象。它与我已知的一切相悖。若这才是真相，那次搜索又有什么意义？为什么谁都没有被找到？"

    # game/script.rpy:68138
    old "Did it really make more sense than the other ideas I'd envisioned? ...Perhaps it didn't matter. Success had been assured to me—I was extremely puzzled, but I felt relieved more than anything."
    new "它真的比我设想过的其他可能更合理吗？……也许这并不重要。成功已经得到了保证——我满心困惑，但更多的是一种释然。"

    # game/script.rpy:68141
    old "Oh, that's right. The rusty key..."
    new "啊，对了。那把生锈的钥匙……"

    # game/script.rpy:68142
    old "That finally made sense. Before I'd entered the tower, the fact that I'd seen it in the outer keyhole had been almost ridiculous."
    new "这下终于说得通了。进塔之前，我竟在外侧的钥匙孔里看到了它——当时我只觉得荒唐。"

    # game/script.rpy:68143
    old "And..."
    new "还有……"

    # game/script.rpy:68144
    old "I felt a familiar sensation. In a few brief moments, swathes of problems still lingering in my mind slotted into place."
    new "一种熟悉的感觉涌了上来。短短几瞬之间，我脑中仍盘旋的一堆问题都各归其位。"

    # game/script.rpy:68145
    old "At {time=19:30}, that's who activated one of the Sekimeiya. That's why we returned to our world."
    new "在 {time=19:30}，启动其中一个 Sekimeiya 的就是那个人。所以我们才回到了自己的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:68152
    old "I stood up slowly, my vision momentarily blurry. After some seconds, I began to approach the attic."
    new "我缓缓起身，眼前一时有些模糊。过了几秒，我朝阁楼走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:68158
    old "I couldn't see Miiya, but her footprints were visible."
    new "我看不见 Miiya，却能看见她的脚印。"

    # game/script.rpy:68162
    old "I was careful not to make a sound. The bedroom doors were closed, but it was very likely she was behind one of them."
    new "我小心不发出声响。卧室的门都关着，但她很可能就在其中一扇门后。"

    # game/script.rpy:68166
    old "I shut myself in the kitchen. The recorder was still there, counting up the seconds. It had been an hour and a half since I'd started a new recording."
    new "我把自己关进厨房。录音笔还在那里，秒数还在往上跳。距离我开始新的录音，已经过了一个半小时。"

    # game/script.rpy:68167
    old "...It must be about {time=17:30.}{w} I'll take the Sekimeiya out at {time=18:30.}"
    new "……现在应该是 {time=17:30.} 左右吧。{w}我要在 {time=18:30.} 把 Sekimeiya 拿出来。"

    # game/script.rpy:68168
    old "It's strange... I know we'll change worlds at {time=19:30}, so I'll take both Sekimeiya out so that can happen..."
    new "奇怪……我明明知道我们会在 {time=19:30} 切换世界，所以我要把两个 Sekimeiya 都取出来，好让那件事发生……"

    # game/script.rpy:68169
    old "Doesn't that contradict what the universe just repeatedly denied? Won't I allow something to happen because I experienced the result first?"
    new "这难道不和宇宙刚刚一再否决的事情相矛盾吗？我岂不是因为先经历了结果，才让某件事得以发生？"

    # game/script.rpy:68170
    old "Maybe there's something I'm missing. Maybe I don't really understand why it will happen."
    new "也许我漏掉了什么。也许我还没真正明白它为什么会发生。"

    # game/script.rpy:68172
    old "...I suppose it doesn't really matter, though. All I know is that it'll repeat."
    new "……不过，算了，或许也无所谓。我只知道，那一切会重演。"

    # game/script.rpy:68174
    old "I had to wait through the last stretch. I thought of going back to the sixth floor, but I chose to remain near the timer."
    new "最后这段时间，我只能等。我一度想回六楼，最终还是选择留在计时器旁。"

    # game/script.rpy:68182
    old "...{w}The news that I heard matched our world's. It was identical to how it would've been without my input."
    new "……{w}我听到的新闻和我们世界的一样，和我没有插手时的版本完全相同。"

    # game/script.rpy:68183
    old "That's why I imagined everything had happened the same way. Then, I realized that didn't have to be the case. The news was the only thing I'd observed in this world."
    new "正因如此，我才以为一切都以同样的方式发生了。后来我才明白，未必如此。在这个世界里，我观测到的只有那条新闻。"

    # game/script.rpy:68184
    old "One girl had been severely injured, and the other hadn't been found. It matched up with what I'd personally experienced, although it wasn't the end. Seeing as it was the only barrier in this world, I could've gone back in time, saved Miiya, and prevented Shiroya from being found."
    new "一个女孩受了重伤，另一个下落不明。这和我亲身经历的一致，但事情并未到此结束。既然这是这个世界上唯一的障碍，我本可以回到过去，救下 Miiya，并阻止 Shiroya 被发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:68185
    old "That's what I thought as soon as I put together that I could alter this world's history. The news could remain consistent because it didn't lead to a single interpretation.{w} I also thought that everything finally made sense—that it was the reason why Miiya had been in the tower and why Shiroya had been absent. It fit with the plan I came up with, so I thought I finally understood this world."
    new "我意识到自己能改变这个世界的历史时，首先想到的就是这一点。新闻报道之所以能保持一致，是因为它并未引出唯一的解释。{w} 我还以为一切终于说得通了——Miiya 之所以会在塔里、Shiroya 之所以不在，原因就在于此。这与我拟定的计划吻合，于是我以为自己终于理解了这个世界的运作。"

    # game/script.rpy:68186
    old "...It didn't make as much sense as I thought. After all, I saw Miiya in the tower—I saw the result of a loop before I came up with it. The news hadn't actually been the only piece of this world I'd observed.{w} And maybe it makes real sense. ...I believe I know why I saw Miiya before I understood how she'd be saved."
    new "……事情并没有我想的那么合理。毕竟，我是在塔里见到 Miiya 的——在我想出那个循环之前，就已经看到了它的结果。我观察到的这个世界的线索，其实并不只有那则新闻。{w} 也许这样才真正说得通。……我想我知道，为什么我会在明白她将如何获救之前，就先见到了 Miiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:68190
    old "I didn't step out of the kitchen. Miiya was close by, but I hadn't heard anything. If she hadn't silently left, she was sleeping in a bedroom."
    new "我没有走出厨房。Miiya 就在附近，我却什么也没听见。她若不是悄悄离开了，就是在某间卧室里睡着了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68193
    old "Sixty more minutes had been added to the timer. It was finally {time=18:30.}"
    new "计时器上又多了六十分钟。现在终于到了 {time=18:30.}"

    # game/script.rpy:68195
    old "At the same time that I took both Sekimeiya out of the refrigerator, I began a new recording."
    new "我一边把两个 Sekimeiya 从冰箱里取出来，一边开始了新的录音。"

    # game/script.rpy:68196
    old "This is it. When the timer hits sixty minutes, it'll be {time=19:30.}"
    new "就是这个时刻。等计时器跳到六十分钟，时间就会到 {time=19:30.}"

    # game/script.rpy:68199
    old "I should keep waiting on the sixth floor. I don't know if Shiroya will use the elevator, but if she does, that's where she'll come out."
    new "我应该继续在六楼等着。不知道 Shiroya 会不会乘电梯，但如果她乘了，出来的地方就是那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:68201
    old "I was about to leave when I heard someone behind the door."
    new "我正要离开，却听见门后有人。"

    # game/script.rpy:68205
    old "...!{w} Who's here?"
    new "……！{w} 谁在那里？"

    # game/script.rpy:68206
    old "Their steps approached one of the bedrooms and stepped inside."
    new "他们迈步走向其中一间卧室，随后走了进去。"

    # game/script.rpy:68209
    old "Is that all? Are they going to stay inside? I'm pretty sure whoever that was arrived with the elevator."
    new "就这样？他们要待在里面不出来了？我敢肯定，刚才那人是乘电梯上来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:68210
    old "I stood still, awaiting any other movement. ...But it seemed they would remain there."
    new "我站在原地，等着看还有没有别的动静。……但看来，对方会一直待在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:68215
    old "Wait a second. I might have overlooked something important."
    new "等等。我可能漏掉了什么重要的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:68216
    old "Even though I never saw Miiya in our world, Erina apparently did. She was definitely there at one point and left that note behind, right?"
    new "虽然我在我们的世界里从没见过 Miiya，但 Erina 显然见过。她肯定在那里待过，还留下了那张纸条，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:68217
    old "But she didn't stay there, or we would've seen her."
    new "但她没有留在那里，否则我们就会看见她。"

    # game/script.rpy:68218
    old "That's odd. If Erina saw Miiya, it should've been at around this time. Slightly before it, actually."
    new "奇怪。如果 Erina 见到了 Miiya，那应该就是在这个时候。准确说，还要稍微早一点。"

    # game/script.rpy:68219
    old "Isn't she here right now, though...?"
    new "可她此刻不就在这里吗……？"

    # game/script.rpy:68220
    old "There was a chance she was about to appear in our world. If that would happen, it was evident I didn't understand the details behind it."
    new "她有可能马上就要出现在我们的世界里。如果真是这样，那说明我显然还不了解其中的细节。"

    # game/script.rpy:68221
    old "Perhaps {time=19:30} wasn't the only time where returning would be possible. It could occur earlier too, at a time I wasn't aware of."
    new "也许能回去的时间并不只有 {time=19:30}。也可能更早，在我不知道的某个时刻。"

    # game/script.rpy:68222
    old "If that time was still yet to happen, I had to get away from the Sekimeiya, or else I could disappear before Shiroya's arrival."
    new "如果那个时刻还没到，我就必须远离 Sekimeiya；否则，我可能在 Shiroya 到来之前就消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68223
    old "I hid the Sekimeiya on a high cabinet shelf, as keeping them in a drawer would've severely messed with the temperature."
    new "我把 Sekimeiya 藏到了展示柜高处的架子上，因为放进抽屉里会让温度大受影响。"

    # game/script.rpy:68229
    old "Then, I stepped onto the sixth floor, and like before, I entered the offices."
    new "随后，我走上六楼，像之前那样进了办公室。"

    # game/script.rpy:68234
    old "Unless I've made a big mistake, she should be here in thirty minutes."
    new "除非我犯了大错，否则她三十分钟后就该到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68235
    old "If one of the Sekimeiya is activated before then for some reason, that'll cause the world change that could still happen. Since I know we'll return at {time=19:30}, though, I have a pretty strong guarantee that the Past Sekimeiya won't be the one activated."
    new "如果在那之前，其中一个 Sekimeiya 因某种原因被激活，就会引发那场仍可能发生的世界变化。不过，既然我知道我们会在 {time=19:30} 回去，我就能相当肯定，被激活的不会是过去Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:68245
    old "I was so close. It had been more than two weeks since I'd seen her."
    new "就差一点了。我已经两个多星期没见过她。"

    # game/script.rpy:68246
    old "I had plenty of things to say, but I wanted to know her story too. Why would she run up to the attic? Why were her clothes different? What had she done in January?"
    new "我有很多话想说，但也想知道她的经历。她为什么会跑上阁楼？衣服为什么和之前不一样？一月里她到底做了什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:68247
    old "Just thinking about it made the time go by swiftly. The end was truly near."
    new "光是想着这些，时间便过得飞快。终点真的近了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68253
    old "I stood up and walked out. I was sure she was about to appear."
    new "我站起身，走了出去。我确信她马上就要出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:68257
    old "I didn't have the voice recorder with me, but it had been close to half an hour. I stood still, trying to perceive the faintest sound."
    new "我没带录音笔，但已经过了将近半小时。我站定不动，努力捕捉最细微的声响。"

    # game/script.rpy:68259
    old "And it came. Finally, I heard what I'd been desperately wishing for.{w} Footsteps were approaching."
    new "它终于来了。我听见了自己苦苦盼望的声音。{w} 脚步声正在靠近。"

    # game/script.rpy:68271
    old "It wasn't who I'd been expecting. Miiya and the Atsuki she'd been with were there, staring deep into my eyes."
    new "来的人并不是我期待的那一个。Miiya 和跟她在一起的另一个我就站在那里，直直凝视着我的眼睛。"

    # game/script.rpy:68273
    old "What the fuck? Why are they here!? Miiya should be in the attic!"
    new "这他妈怎么回事？他们怎么会在这里！？Miiya 明明应该在阁楼！"

    # game/script.rpy:68296
    old "It must be too early. When we appeared in this world, Shiroya spent a short while on the crystal floor. It must not be time yet."
    new "应该是太早了。我们刚来到这个世界时，Shiroya 在水晶层上待了一小会儿。现在还没到时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:68320
    old "When he heard that, I saw my own body crumple down, and my heart ached. I didn't want to imagine how I felt."
    new "听到那句话，我眼看着自己的身体瘫倒下去，心口一阵发疼。我不愿去想自己当时是什么感受。"

    # game/script.rpy:68331
    old "What...? What does that mean?"
    new "什么……？这是什么意思？"

    # game/script.rpy:68332
    old "It can't be. She won't be in the tower.{w} This is the same as before! Someone is telling me that Shiroya's fate within the tower is death. Why have so many people said that!?"
    new "不可能。她不会在塔里。{w}这和之前一模一样！有人在告诉我，Shiroya 在塔里只有死路一条。为什么这么多人都这么说！？"

    # game/script.rpy:68333
    old "It's not true! I've never seen her dead! That must be a mistake.{w} She'll be fine. It's impossible that she will die in the tower. We'll make sure of that."
    new "不是真的！我从没见过她死！那一定是弄错了。{w}她会没事的。她不可能死在塔里，我们会阻止这种事。"

    # game/script.rpy:68356
    old "I turned around and went to the attic, where Miiya should've been."
    new "我转身去了阁楼，Miiya 本该在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:68360
    old "The Sekimeiya are still here. Neither of them were activated."
    new "Sekimeiya 都还在这里。两个都没有启动。"

    # game/script.rpy:68361
    old "What the hell, then? I don't get what happened...!"
    new "那到底是怎么回事？我根本搞不懂发生了什么……！"

    # game/script.rpy:68362
    old "There was no time to wonder. After I grabbed the Future Sekimeiya, I dashed back out."
    new "没空多想。我抓起未来Sekimeiya，转身冲了出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:68372
    old "I handed him the Sekimeiya."
    new "我把 Sekimeiya 递给了他。"

    # game/script.rpy:68373
    old "You two should hurry back down. On the second floor, enter the second partition, leave the Sekimeiya on the floor, and wait there."
    new "你们俩赶紧下楼去。到二楼，进第二间隔间，把 Sekimeiya 放在{tip=floor}地上{/tip}，就在那儿等着。"

    # game/script.rpy:68385
    old "I wasn't completely sure if Shiroya would walk up or take the elevator. However, a while after that, they would hear Erina and my past self taking it. That would be their cue to go down."
    new "我不确定 Shiroya 会走楼梯还是坐电梯。不过，过一会儿他们会听到 Erina 和过去的我乘坐电梯的声音。那就是该下去的信号。"

    # game/script.rpy:68397
    old "The other Atsuki didn't waste time. As soon as he said that, he ran back toward the stairs."
    new "另一个我没有耽搁，话音一落就朝楼梯跑了回去。"

    # game/script.rpy:68400
    old "It took all I had in me to say that and nothing more. It was a second goodbye. I would never see her again."
    new "我用尽全力，也只说出这一句。这是第二次告别。我再也见不到她了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68407
    old "Oblivious to the gravity of her farewell, she turned around and left my sight."
    new "她并不知道这句告别有多沉重，转身便走出了我的视线。"

    # game/script.rpy:68414
    old "Once I could no longer hear their running, I found myself standing alone. ...I couldn't bring myself to move."
    new "脚步声远去之后，只剩我独自站在那里。……我一步也迈不动。"

    # game/script.rpy:68415
    old "If nothing happened very soon, I would've been wrong about everything."
    new "如果接下来没有立刻发生什么，那就说明我全都错了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68421
    old "When I heard the elevator, all the tension within me was released. She was there."
    new "听到电梯声的那一刻，我全身的紧绷一下子卸了下来。她到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68422
    old "She'd called the elevator from the crystal floor. I waited, and seconds later, I heard it again."
    new "她从水晶层叫了电梯。我等着，几秒后，又听见了一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:68423
    old "Wait, what? Why did I hear it again? Doesn't that mean that it's going to the attic?"
    new "等等，怎么回事？怎么又响了一次？那不就说明电梯是往阁楼去的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:68424
    old "Oh, that's right! She had the key!"
    new "啊，对了！钥匙在她手上！"

    # game/script.rpy:68428
    old "I bolted off as fast as I could."
    new "我拔腿就跑，用尽了全力。"

    # game/script.rpy:68441
    old "She was in the hallway. When she saw me, it was apparent we'd both been looking for each other."
    new "她在走廊里。她一见到我，我就明白，我们俩一直在互相找对方。"

    # game/script.rpy:68456
    old "I nodded slowly. I was right about everything. ...We had reunited in a world other than our own."
    new "我缓缓点头。我全都说对了。……我们重逢的地方，并非我们原本所在的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:68463
    old "I see. So she really is the same person who was here this morning."
    new "原来如此。看来她确实是今天早上在这里的那个人。"

    # game/script.rpy:68479
    old "She frowned. It seemed she hadn't entertained the possibility."
    new "她皱起眉，似乎从未想过这种可能。"

    # game/script.rpy:68509
    old "She looked astonished. For a while, she didn't respond."
    new "她满脸震惊，好一会儿说不出话。"

    # game/script.rpy:68515
    old "A-Are you serious...?"
    new "你、你说的是真的……？"

    # game/script.rpy:68516
    old "I am. I've been able to understand the Sekimeiya.{w} The Future Sekimeiya made us appear where we were in the past; I believe that could be part of your confusion. The Past Sekimeiya made us appear where we would be in the future.{w} ...And, if both ranges overlapped, the world around us would change instead."
    new "是真的。我已经能理解 Sekimeiya 了。{w}未来Sekimeiya 会把我们送到过去我们所在的位置——我想，这可能是让你困惑的原因之一。过去Sekimeiya 则会把我们送到未来我们会在的位置。{w}……而一旦两者的范围重叠，被改变的就会是我们周围的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:68517
    old "O{w=0.2}-Oh!{w=0.3} ...That makes sense. That's how I came back."
    new "噢{w=0.2}——！{w=0.3}……说得通。原来我是那样回来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:68523
    old "She stared off into the hallway, working with the information I'd given her."
    new "她望着走廊出神，在心里盘算着我告诉她的那些事。"

    # game/script.rpy:68525
    old "When she opened her mouth again, she asked what she most wanted an answer to."
    new "等她再次开口时，问的是她最想知道答案的那个问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:68531
    old "So... what now? What will happen at {time=21}?"
    new "那么……现在怎么办？{time=21} 会发生什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:68532
    old "It'll be fine. We'll be able to leave."
    new "{cps=80}没事的。{w=0.4}我们能出去的。{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:68537
    old "She breathed a sigh of relief. Everything could finally end."
    new "她松了口气。一切终于可以结束了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68538
    old "This isn't over yet, though. We have to do one more thing."
    new "{cps=80}不过，{w=0.2}这事还没完。{w=0.5}我们还得再做一件事。{nw}"

    # game/script.rpy:68545
    old "...We{w=0.6} are going to save Miiya."
    new "……我们{w=0.6}要去救 Miiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:68549
    old "Wh-What? Really...?{w} Can the past really be changed after all!?"
    new "什、什么？真的……？{w}过去原来真的能改变吗！？"

    # game/script.rpy:68550
    old "That's not it. The past is set in stone.{w} But in a different world, the past is no different from the future for us."
    new "不是这样。过去是定死的。{w}但在另一个世界里，过去对我们来说，和未来并没有什么区别。"

    # game/script.rpy:68556
    old "We can save her in this world. If you travel, you can save her.{w} ...It has to be you, though."
    new "我们可以在这个世界救她。只要你穿越回去，就能救她。{w}……不过，这件事必须由你来做。"

    # game/script.rpy:68563
    old "I walked to the kitchen. The recorder's timer showed 44:24."
    new "我走进厨房。录音笔上的计时显示着 44:24。"

    # game/script.rpy:68568
    old "That is the Past Sekimeiya. If you activate it when the timer reaches 63:14, you'll appear on November 30th. If you're there, Miiya will not die.{w} I can't come with you, though. If you activate it, anyone in the center of the building will go back to our world. If I travel to the past too, I won't be able to be there.{w} But, if it's you who does this, you will be. When December 15th comes, you'll be able to enter through the storeroom, and if you stay in the third partition on the fourth floor, you'll make it back to this point."
    new "那就是 过去Sekimeiya。等计时走到 63:14 时启动它，你就会出现在 11 月 30 日。只要你在那里，Miiya 就不会死。{w}不过我没办法跟你一起去。你一旦启动它，位于大楼中心的所有人都会回到我们原本的世界。如果我也穿越回过去，我就没法待在那里了。{w}但换成你去做这件事，你就能留在那里。等到 12 月 15 日，你可以从储藏室进来；只要待在四楼第三间隔间里，你就能回到这个时间点。"

    # game/script.rpy:68573
    old "She looked overwhelmed. There was very little time left, so I was trying to explain everything rapidly."
    new "她看上去有些不知所措。剩下的时间太少了，我只能尽量快点把一切讲完。"

    # game/script.rpy:68575
    old "W-Wait, so, I'll be able to prevent her death? And then, at this time, both of us will go back to our world?"
    new "等、等等，也就是说，我能阻止她死去？然后到了这个时间，我们两个都能回到自己的世界？"

    # game/script.rpy:68580
    old "When I nodded, her eyes briefly widened."
    new "我点了点头，她的眼睛一下子睁大了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68583
    old "The seconds were passing quickly, so I had to make sure I could say everything I needed to."
    new "时间一秒一秒地过去，我必须确保把所有该说的话都说清楚。"

    # game/script.rpy:68584
    old "You will appear on November 30th where you will be on December 30th. If you think about where you'll be, that's where you'll appear."
    new "你会在11月30日出现，出现的地点就是你12月30日所在的地方。只要想想自己到时候会在哪儿，你就会在那里出现。"

    # game/script.rpy:68590
    old "On December 30th, you have to be in that gem shop so that you appear there in November."
    new "12月30日那天，你必须待在那家宝石店里，这样你才会在11月出现在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:68591
    old "In the gem shop? I don't think that will be possible. ...It was still closed."
    new "宝石店里？我想那不太可能。……那家店那时还关着。"

    # game/script.rpy:68592
    old "I-In that case, right outside it.{w} It was snowing on November 30th, wasn't it?"
    new "那、那就待在店门外好了。{w}11月30日那天在下雪，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:68593
    old "I bit my lip. I didn't know what would happen if she were to appear right on top of falling snow, given what had happened to me with the elevator's railing."
    new "我咬住了嘴唇。想起自己在电梯扶手上的那番遭遇，我不知道她若是直接出现在飘落的雪上会怎样。"

    # game/script.rpy:68594
    old "You'll have to be below a stone roof, where the snow won't hit you and there'll be none on the ground. Then, you'll be able to prevent Miiya from being hit by the explosion.{w} That's not all, though. There's something else very important. Your body can't be found."
    new "你得待在一方石制屋檐下，雪落不到你身上，地上也没有积雪。这样一来，你就能让 Miiya 免遭爆炸波及。{w}不过不止这些。还有一件非常重要的事——你的身体不能被人发现。"

    # game/script.rpy:68596
    old "M-Mine?"
    new "我、我的？"

    # game/script.rpy:68599
    old "I nodded, although I still didn't fully understand that. ...Why was her body the one that had to go missing? If the news had to be merely followed, why couldn't Miiya's be the one that wouldn't be found despite her well-being? ...The only reason it had to be Shiroya's was because I knew Miiya was in the tower. I still felt like there was something else to all of that."
    new "我点了点头，尽管我依然没能完全弄懂。……为什么偏偏必须是她消失不见？如果只要照着新闻所述去走就行，那为什么不能是 Miiya 平安无事、只是她的身体没被发现呢？……而之所以非得是 Shiroya，唯一的依据就是我知道 Miiya 当时在塔里。可我总觉得，事情并不止于此。"

    # game/script.rpy:68600
    old "Then, early on the 15th, you'll be able to enter the tower through the storeroom. You still have the rusty key, right?"
    new "然后，15日一早，你就能从储藏室进入塔里。生锈的钥匙还在你手上吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:68606
    old "She showed it to me."
    new "她把钥匙拿给我看。"

    # game/script.rpy:68607
    old "You'll be able to stay in the third partition on the fourth floor. I know that'll work, because after {time=14}, you'll go to the sixth floor and leave some kind of indication for me under one of the drawers. The fifth desk from the left, in the first partition.{w} After that, you'll only need to leave momentarily at {time=15:30.} If you're in the floor 2 and 3 staircase, you'll avoid being inside the range of a travel. The range might actually reach the crystal floor, but if you're in a corner of the building a floor above, you'll avoid it. Just not in the crystal floor staircase since that's where I was at the time."
    new "你可以待在四楼的第三个隔间。我知道那样行得通，因为过了 {time=14} 之后，你会去六楼，在某个抽屉下面给我留下某种记号。第一个隔间里，从左数第五张桌子。{w}之后，你只要在 {time=15:30.} 暂时离开一下就行。只要你待在通往二楼和三楼的楼梯上，就不会落在某次穿越的范围之内。范围说不定会延伸到水晶层，但只要你在这栋楼上一层的角落，就能避开。只是别待在水晶层的楼梯——那个时间点我正在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:68610
    old "O-Okay..."
    new "好、好的……"

    # game/script.rpy:68611
    old "I'm sorry. There's not much time left."
    new "抱歉。时间不多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68613
    old "50:06. I had to leave soon to escape the range, and I wasn't sure if I'd explained myself well at all. {tip=rush}Something about the rush I was in felt paradoxical{/tip}, but I had no time to try to think about it."
    new "50:06。我很快就得离开，才能逃出范围，而我不确定自己究竟有没有把话说清楚。{tip=rush}这份匆忙本身似乎带着某种悖论{/tip}，但我没空去细想。"

    # game/script.rpy:68618
    old "Let me check that nobody's in the bedrooms anymore. I don't know what happened to them, but someone might still be here."
    new "我去确认一下卧室里已经没有人了。我不知道他们出了什么事，但说不定还有人留在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:68622
    old "I looked at the four separate bedrooms, which were all vacant. Meanwhile, I felt my fingers beginning to tremble. Shiroya was there again, and it seemed as if the future finally had a distinct shape."
    new "我望向那四间独立的卧室，里面空无一人。与此同时，我感到指尖开始发抖。Shiroya 又站在那里，未来仿佛终于有了清晰的轮廓。"

    # game/script.rpy:68628
    old "That's it, then. Everything is ready."
    new "那就这样吧。一切都准备好了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68629
    old "It will work. I'm sure."
    new "会成功的。我确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:68635
    old "Can I ask, though? ...Why are your clothes like this?"
    new "不过我能不能问一句？……你的衣服怎么是这个样子？"

    # game/script.rpy:68640
    old "O-Oh. I put them on hoping I would come back to the point you saw me."
    new "啊、哦。我穿上这一身，是希望自己能回到你见到我的那个时刻。"

    # game/script.rpy:68641
    old "Really? ...That's interesting."
    new "是吗？……有意思。"

    # game/script.rpy:68642
    old "In fact, it seemed to go against most conclusions I'd made. There was no time to care, however."
    new "事实上，这似乎和我之前得出的大部分结论都对不上。但我已经没有时间在意了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68645
    old "Wait. You have the attic key. You should give it to me."
    new "等等。阁楼的钥匙在你手上。把它交给我吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:68646
    old "You need it?"
    new "你需要它？"

    # game/script.rpy:68647
    old "No, but you will on January 26th. If I don't take it now, you won't be able to have it.{w} Because, at {time=21} today, the police will find you, and they'll take this key from you if you have it. I need to keep it."
    new "我不需要，但1月26日的你会需要。如果我现在不把它拿走，你就拿不到它了。{w}因为今天 {time=21} 的时候，警察会找到你，钥匙要是还在你身上，就会被他们收走。我得留着它。"

    # game/script.rpy:68652
    old "And they won't take it if you have it?"
    new "那要是放在你身上，他们就不会收走？"

    # game/script.rpy:68653
    old "...No.{w} I'd tell you why, but there's not enough time right now."
    new "……不会。{w}原因我可以告诉你，但现在时间不够。"

    # game/script.rpy:68658
    old "Five minutes were left until she would travel to the past. For me, I was five minutes away from returning to our world with her."
    new "距离她穿越回过去还有五分钟。而我，也只剩五分钟就能和她一起回到我们的世界。"

    # game/script.rpy:68659
    old "I grabbed the Past Sekimeiya and left it on the highest cabinet shelf, where it wasn't easy to see."
    new "我拿起过去Sekimeiya，把它放到展示柜最高一层的架子上，那个位置不容易被看见。"

    # game/script.rpy:68660
    old "If you activate it when it's there, in the instance that the people from this world come back up, it's possible they won't find it."
    new "如果它在上面的时候你启动它，万一这个世界的人重新上来，他们也许就找不到它了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68669
    old "...{w}I should go. I'm sure your future self is currently on the fourth floor. She's been there for hours.{w} You understand everything I said, right?"
    new "……{w}我该走了。未来的你此刻一定就在四楼，已经待了好几个小时。{w}我说的话，你都明白了吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:68670
    old "...I think so. When that screen says 63:14, I just have to touch the Sekimeiya."
    new "……大概明白。等那块屏幕上显示 63:14，我只要碰一下 Sekimeiya 就行。"

    # game/script.rpy:68671
    old "You'll appear on the 30th, next to that gem shop.{w} I have to go now, but I guess I'm about to see you again. I'm sorry that there wasn't more time to explain."
    new "你会在30日出现在那家宝石店旁边。{w}我现在得走了，不过看来我很快就会再见到你。抱歉，没能有更多时间解释。"

    # game/script.rpy:68676
    old "A-All right. I'll see you."
    new "好、好的。再见。"

    # game/script.rpy:68684
    old "But before I knew it, my body had jumped forward in a sudden impulse and was tightly embracing Shiroya. I couldn't stand the thought of anything going wrong from that point on."
    new "还没等我反应过来，身体已经在一阵冲动下向前扑去，紧紧抱住了 Shiroya。我无法忍受从这一刻起再出任何差错。"

    # game/script.rpy:68687
    old "Right next to my ear, I felt her surprised breath, and after the initial shock, her hands slowly tightened up behind me. I couldn't believe what was happening, but I took advantage of it and rested my head on her shoulder."
    new "我能感觉到她惊讶的呼吸就在耳边。最初的震惊过后，她的双手缓缓在我背后收紧。我几乎不敢相信眼前发生的事，却还是顺势把头靠在了她的肩上。"

    # game/script.rpy:68688
    old "I wished the moment could go on forever, but the clock was ticking. When I let go of her, I couldn't bring myself to say anything else or even look directly at her again."
    new "我真希望这一刻能永远持续下去，但时间仍在流逝。松开她之后，我再也说不出别的话，甚至连再看她一眼都做不到。"

    # game/script.rpy:68694
    old "It was hard to turn around, but I had to. With my body still shaking, I trudged to the stairs, aware it was the last time my footprints would be left on that floor."
    new "转身是如此艰难，但我非转不可。身体仍在发抖，我拖着步子走向楼梯，心里清楚这是我最后一次在那层楼留下足迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:68706
    old "63 minutes. Shiroya tightly gripped the device that had once been found in Isla's purse while her heart raced from Atsuki's sudden hug."
    new "63分钟。Shiroya 紧紧握住那件曾经在 Isla 手包里被发现的装置，Atsuki 突如其来的拥抱让她心跳不已。"

    # game/script.rpy:68711
    old "Her other hand was reaching high above her, close to the Sekimeiya as she withstood the immense heat around it."
    new "她的另一只手高高伸起，向 Sekimeiya 探去，同时强忍着它周围灼人的高温。"

    # game/script.rpy:68713
    old "She hadn't traveled to the past, but she was about to. She stared firmly at the numbers on the screen and gradually moved her hand deeper into the heat.{w} After fourteen more seconds had gone by, she felt the hard touch."
    new "她还没有穿越回过去，但马上就要。她定定地盯着屏幕上的数字，把手一点点探入那团灼热之中。{w}又过了十四秒，她的指尖触到了坚硬的表面。"

    # game/script.rpy:68729
    old "Light snow was falling on a dim street in Yushibana. Despite the few lit windows, not one of them saw the figure of a young girl appearing by the entrance of a house, below a stone roof."
    new "细雪落在丰花一条昏暗的街道上。几扇窗子亮着灯，却没有一扇看见那个少女的身影——她出现在一户人家的门口，站在石制屋檐下。"

    # game/script.rpy:68734
    old "She found herself leaning on the cold wall and rapidly looked down. There, she was able to see some of the footprints she'd once left."
    new "她发觉自己正倚着一面冰冷的墙，急忙低头看去。在那里，她看见了自己曾经留下的几行足迹。"

    # game/script.rpy:68739
    old "She traced them up to an opaque door on the opposite side of the street. Wasting no time, she dashed over and opened it."
    new "她顺着足迹看去，尽头是街对面一扇不透明的门。她毫不迟疑地冲过去，推开了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:68744
    old "Remnants of the smoke were in the air. It had already been released, but it wasn't too late."
    new "空气里还残留着烟雾。气体已经释放出来了，但还来得及。"

    # game/script.rpy:68745
    old "On the floor, she saw the first two people to fall unconscious—those who had already escaped danger."
    new "地板上躺着最先失去意识的两个人——她们已经脱离了险境。"

    # game/script.rpy:68749
    old "Behind the shelves were two girls. One was being protected by the wooden structures, whereas the other was an open target."
    new "货架后面有两个女孩。一个被木架挡得严实，另一个却完全暴露在外。"

    # game/script.rpy:68752
    old "She crouched and grabbed the shoulders of the girl in red, shuffling backward to drop her behind the shield of shelves."
    new "她蹲下身，抓住红衣女孩的肩膀，向后挪去，把她拖到货架后面，让货架挡住她。"

    # game/script.rpy:68755
    old "Once that danger was removed, she stood up and looked at her own body on the floor. She didn't know the exact time, but her work wasn't finished yet."
    new "危险解除后，她站起身，看向地板上自己的躯体。她不知道确切的时间，但她的工作还没有做完。"

    # game/script.rpy:68758
    old "She picked herself up by her shoulders and began to retreat.{w} However, a slight sound caused her to spin around, and her heart skipped a beat."
    new "她抓住自己的肩膀，撑起身子，开始后退。{w}然而，一点轻微的响动让她猛地转过身，心头骤然一紧。"

    # game/script.rpy:68759
    old "She didn't see the door opening because a wooden shelf was blocking it. However, soon after she heard its squeaky sound, the lights turned off."
    new "一排木架挡住了视线，她没能看见门被打开。可听到吱呀的声响之后不久，灯就灭了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68762
    old "There was practically no time to react. During the instants before the light came back, the girl closed her eyes and attempted to cover her face with her arms."
    new "几乎来不及反应。在灯光重新亮起前的一瞬间，女孩闭上眼睛，抬起手臂护住脸。"

    # game/script.rpy:68770
    old "The floor had been devastated, and she found herself falling with the rubble, the deadly light shrinking as she was consumed by familiar darkness."
    new "地面已被炸得支离破碎，她随着碎石一同坠落，那致命的光芒渐渐远去，熟悉的黑暗将她吞没。"

    # game/script.rpy:68781
    old "She saw something shining above and heard very faint shouts. Her entire body was wracked with pain, but she was able to stand up."
    new "她看见上方有什么在发亮，也听见极其微弱的喊声。全身痛得像散了架，但她还是站了起来。"

    # game/script.rpy:68783
    old "When she looked around her, she saw there was light there too: an egg-shaped gemstone had rolled away, and it gave off a soft glow."
    new "她环顾四周，发现这里也有光：一颗蛋形的宝石滚落在一旁，散发着柔和的光晕。"

    # game/script.rpy:68784
    old "She heard a moan laced with pain. Her other self was conscious. She had been holding her as they'd fallen; that time, neither one of them had lapsed into a lengthy unconsciousness."
    new "她听见一声带着痛楚的呻吟。另一个自己已经恢复了意识。坠落时她一直抱着她；这一次，两人都没有陷入长时间的昏迷。"

    # game/script.rpy:68785
    old "Her friend had told her something very important: her own body couldn't be found. She didn't understand why, but a realization immediately came to her."
    new "朋友告诉过她一件很重要的事：她本人的身体是找不到的。她不明白原因，但立刻意识到了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:68787
    old "As she took a slow step back, she saw her own self awakening. It was difficult to make out, but she saw that the other her was staring at the distant gemstone."
    new "她缓缓后退一步，看见另一个自己正在苏醒。虽然难以看清，但她看得出，另一个她正凝视着远处的宝石。"

    # game/script.rpy:68788
    old "That was when she understood... that the universe would do the rest—that she didn't have to enact something that was already meant to happen."
    new "就在那时她明白了……余下的事，这个世界自会去完成——已经注定会发生的事，不需要由她来推动。"

    # game/script.rpy:68791
    old "She stepped back. She knew the way out of there."
    new "她向后退去。她知道离开这里的路。"

    # game/script.rpy:68793
    old "Meanwhile, the other girl approached the stone. The act of her touching it would be the {tip=force}driving force{/tip} behind a forthcoming attack in her town."
    new "与此同时，另一个女孩走近了那块石头。她伸手触碰它，而这个动作将成为不久后降临在她所居城镇的那场袭击的{tip=force}驱动力{/tip}。"

    # game/script.rpy:68801
    old "The girl found herself looking out upon a nostalgic view, but the snow was still piling up to form the scenery she'd once seen. Once more, she began walking to her empty apartment."
    new "女孩望见一片令人怀念的景色，积雪却仍在不断堆积，渐渐堆成她曾经见过的模样。她又一次迈开步子，走向那间空无一人的公寓。"

    # game/script.rpy:68802
    old "But when she realized that it would soon be December 1st, her destination changed."
    new "但当她意识到12月1日就快到了，她改变了目的地。"

    # game/script.rpy:68803
    old "She had once felt a false sense of freedom walking down that path, but the kind she felt the second time was genuine; she knew where the path went."
    new "她曾在那条路上感到过一种虚假的自由；第二次踏上时，那种自由却是真的——她知道这条路通向何处。"

    # game/script.rpy:68804
    old "It led to a place she hadn't thought existed, and one that she was eager to reach."
    new "它通向一个她从未想过存在的地方，也是她迫切想要抵达的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:68815
    old "I arrived on the fourth floor and looked at the wall to my right. ...She had to be on the other side of it."
    new "我来到四楼，看向右侧的墙壁。……她一定就在墙的另一边。"

    # game/script.rpy:68820
    old "Nobody had been found, but... she was there."
    new "没有找到任何人，可是……她就在那里。"

    # game/script.rpy:68824
    old "I opened the door to the last partition."
    new "我打开最后一个隔间的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:68836
    old "It's been a while."
    new "好久不见。"

    # game/script.rpy:68845
    old "She rose from the chair she'd been sitting in, but she looked worn out. Although I had just left the attic, for her, that had happened fifteen days in the past."
    new "她从椅子上站起身，却显得疲惫不堪。我刚刚才离开阁楼，而对她来说，那已经是十五天前的事了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68849
    old "D-Did everything work out?"
    new "一……一切顺利吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:68854
    old "Before she could answer, we heard a noise.{w} It sounded like the elevator had opened."
    new "她还没来得及回答，我们就听见了响动。{w}听起来像是电梯门开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68857
    old "...ody's here! I... didn't pre—"
    new "……有人来了！我……没想到——"

    # game/script.rpy:68858
    old "Has it been enough time already?"
    new "时间已经到了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:68859
    old "...op the bleedi—"
    new "……快把血止——"

    # game/script.rpy:68860
    old "I looked at Shiroya. We were back. It had really worked.{w} That was happening on the third floor, near the staircase. Our past selves had returned too, although they were unaware of it. Their voices hardly reached us, but I could understand them since I knew what they were saying."
    new "我看向 Shiroya。我们回来了。真的成功了。{w}那声音来自三楼，就在楼梯附近。过去的我们也回来了，只是他们自己并不知道。他们的声音几乎传不到这里，但我听得懂——因为我知道他们在说什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:68862
    old "...A-Ats—{w} ...not bleedi—"
    new "……A-Ats——{w}……没在流——"

    # game/script.rpy:68864
    old "That's right. My past self was waiting outside the offices after traveling to the past. Right now, Shiroya's in the attic, and Sai's on the crystal floor."
    new "没错。穿越到过去之后，过去的我就在办公室外等候。现在，Shiroya 在阁楼里，Sai 在水晶层。"

    # game/script.rpy:68867
    old "What were you gonna say?"
    new "你刚才想说什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:68872
    old "...Um, everything did go well, but...{w} I saw Miiya earlier. She came in here once, and I'm pretty sure she saw me.{w} She didn't say anything, though. I almost froze from the shock, but before I could react, she had already left."
    new "……嗯，事情确实都顺利，只是……{w}我刚才见到 Miiya 了。她进来过一次，而且我敢肯定她看见我了。{w}不过她什么也没说。我吓得几乎僵住，还没等我反应过来，她就已经走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68873
    old "R-Really?"
    new "真……真的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:68874
    old "She nodded, still puzzled.{w} So, it really had been like that. It had happened as I'd imagined it.{w} I didn't get it. I'd known that she wouldn't be found thanks to the drawing under the drawer. Before seeing it, I hadn't come up with a reason to explain why Miiya hadn't found her, but at that point, I had realized that one wasn't needed. If she simply stayed there, she wouldn't be found. ...I still couldn't understand what had happened."
    new "她点了点头，仍是一脸困惑。{w}原来，事情真的就是这样。一切正如我想象的那样发生了。{w}我不明白。多亏抽屉下面那张画，我早就知道她不会被找到。在看到它之前，我一直想不出理由解释 Miiya 为什么没找到她；可那一刻我明白，根本不需要什么理由。只要她就那样待在那里，就不会被找到。……可我还是不懂，到底发生了什么。"

    # game/script.rpy:68878
    old "What about the you from the other world? Is she okay?"
    new "另一个世界的你呢？她没事吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:68883
    old "Yes. She wasn't found at the site of the explosion, but she wasn't harmed.{w} ...Why couldn't she be found?"
    new "嗯。爆炸现场没有找到她，不过她没有受伤。{w}……为什么就是找不到她呢？"

    # game/script.rpy:68884
    old "...To match the news report that I saw. I did travel to November too, before you did, but I failed to accomplish anything."
    new "……为了和我在新闻里看到的报道对上。我也穿越到十一月去过，比你还早，可什么都没能做到。"

    # game/script.rpy:68885
    old "I know. I saw you at the motel. I thought about staying there in case someone found me in my apartment."
    new "我知道。我在鹰旅馆看见你了。我还想过就待在那里，以防有人在公寓里找到我。"

    # game/script.rpy:68886
    old "You were there?{w} By the way, what keeps happening to your clothes? They're the ones you entered the tower with again, but you didn't have them when you went to the past."
    new "你在那儿？{w}话说回来，你的衣服到底是怎么回事？又变回你进塔时穿的那身了，可你回到过去的时候穿的并不是这身。"

    # game/script.rpy:68887
    old "Oh, yeah. They're the ones from that world."
    new "哦，对。这是那个世界的衣服。"

    # game/script.rpy:68889
    old "...Ah. That time, right before {time=21}, I did think that something about her looked strange. It was so late into the day that I didn't realize it was the complete lack of smoke on her clothes. ...And her pendant is gone too—the thing that tied her with Miiya disappeared when she went to the future."
    new "……啊。那一次，就在 {time=21} 之前，我确实觉得她哪里有些不对劲。可当时天色已晚，我没意识到那是因为她衣服上一点烟味都没有。……还有她的吊坠也不见了——那个把她和 Miiya 联系在一起的东西，在她去往未来时消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68892
    old "She took a digital watch out of her purse."
    new "她从手提包里取出一块电子表。"

    # game/script.rpy:68893
    old "You bought a watch? That's smart."
    new "你买了一块手表？这主意不错。"

    # game/script.rpy:68894
    old "It's {time=19:37.}"
    new "现在是 {time=19:37.}"

    # game/script.rpy:68896
    old "Shiroya pointed out very faint footsteps coming from the other side of the wall. Although I hadn't noticed them, I knew she was right."
    new "Shiroya 指出墙的另一侧有极其微弱的脚步声。我虽然没听见，却知道她说得没错。"

    # game/script.rpy:68897
    old "That's us. Myself, Sai, and Erina. We're going to the attic."
    new "是我们。我、Sai 和 Erina，正要去阁楼。"

    # game/script.rpy:68898
    old "They went around the floor and disappeared up the next staircase."
    new "他们绕过这一层，从下一处楼梯上去，随即不见踪影。"

    # game/script.rpy:68903
    old "Now what, then? I don't know what happened at the end."
    new "那接下来呢？最后发生了什么，我可不知道。"

    # game/script.rpy:68905
    old "Let's go down first. I need to do something very important."
    new "先下楼吧。我还有件很重要的事要做。"

    # game/script.rpy:68912
    old "I had very little strength within me, and Shiroya looked dizzy when she moved. We took our time walking down, knowing full well that there was nobody left beneath us."
    new "我浑身几乎使不上力气，Shiroya 走动时也一副眩晕的样子。我们慢慢地往楼下走，心里清楚底下已经没有人了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68919
    old "Let's go to the security room."
    new "去监控室吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:68925
    old "Katei's dead body was there, filling the room with a stench I'd forgotten about. The monitors were working, which meant that someone had been there fifty minutes previously. Although it was slightly strange, I could barely bring myself to care."
    new "Katei 的尸体还在那里，房间里弥漫着一股我早就忘掉的臭味。监视器还亮着，说明五十分钟前有人来过。这虽然有点奇怪，我却几乎没心思去在意。"

    # game/script.rpy:68926
    old "Actually... I bet I know why. Only Sai could have used the computer, and not too long ago, he traveled to the past from the event room with Shiroya.{w} That would've disabled his watch, but the next time we saw him, it was working. Every time that happened, he came here to sync it with the computer's time. There was a drawer with a bunch of batteries."
    new "其实……我想我知道原因。能用那台电脑的只有 Sai，而就在不久前，他还和 Shiroya 一起从活动室穿越回过去。{w}那会让他的手表失效，可我们下一次见到他时，手表又在走了。每次出现这种情况，他都会来这里，把手表与电脑的时间同步。这里有个抽屉，里面放着一堆电池。"

    # game/script.rpy:68933
    old "A USB drive I brought to the tower in the other world. I have enough to put Katei and Akaro in jail with the footage on this."
    new "是我带到另一个世界那座塔里的 U 盘。里面的录像，足够把 Katei 和 Akaro 送进监狱。"

    # game/script.rpy:68937
    old "Once the computer detected it, I saved two copies of the file. The normal folder with the saved footage was nowhere to be found, so I left them elsewhere. If necessary, I would reveal the location to the police. Then, I left the drive behind one of the drawers so that it could also be found."
    new "电脑识别出它之后，我把文件存了两份。原本存放录像的那个文件夹怎么也找不到了，我只好把副本存到别处。若有需要，我会把位置告诉警方。随后，我又把 U 盘塞在某个抽屉后面，好让它也能被人找到。"

    # game/script.rpy:68940
    old "By the way, you left the rusty key outside the storeroom, right? Was that so that it wouldn't open from the inside?"
    new "对了，你把生锈的钥匙留在储藏室外面了吧？是为了防止门从里面被打开吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:68946
    old "That's what I thought. Not completely sure how much sense it makes yet, but there's nothing I can do to fight it.{w} I have the rusty key right here too, by the way, but there's a slight problem. I'll need it on January 5th, and since you gave up yours, you'll also need this one on December 30th."
    new "我就知道。这其中的道理我还没完全弄明白，但也没法违逆。{w}顺便说一句，生锈的钥匙现在也在我手上，不过有个小问题。一月五日我需要用它，而你既然把自己的那把交了出去，十二月三十日你也得用这一把。"

    # game/script.rpy:68947
    old "Oh, I guess so."
    new "哦……好像是这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:68948
    old "I looked under the desk. A Sekimeiya was there."
    new "我朝桌子底下看去，那里放着一个 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:68949
    old "This is the Past Sekimeiya. My past self traveled with it very recently in the staff room, and Sai brought it here. It doesn't have a lot of power right now."
    new "这是过去Sekimeiya。不久之前，过去的我刚在员工室里用它穿越，后来是 Sai 把它带到了这里。它现在的能量不多了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68956
    old "I left the rusty key on the floor of hallway A and closed the door."
    new "我把生锈的钥匙放在 A走廊的地上，随后关上了门。"

    # game/script.rpy:68964
    old "We need to duplicate it. Otherwise, we won't be able to have it on those days."
    new "我们得把它复制一份。否则那两个日子我们就拿不出钥匙了。"

    # game/script.rpy:68969
    old "...{w}She didn't seem to know why that was the case."
    new "……{w}她似乎并不明白为什么会这样。"

    # game/script.rpy:68970
    old "I'll go a very short distance back in time one last time. Since I left the key outside this room, my past self will be able to grab it and have it in the future. But since that will let me appear with it, I won't have to really grab it, which will duplicate it."
    new "我会最后一次回到极近的过去。我把钥匙留在了这间房门外，过去的我便能捡到它，带到未来去。但这样一来，我出现时手里就会带着钥匙，不必真的去捡——于是钥匙就复制成了两把。"

    # game/script.rpy:68971
    old "Will that actually work?"
    new "这样真的行得通？"

    # game/script.rpy:68972
    old "Yes.{w} As soon as I leave, open the door."
    new "行。{w} 我一走，你就开门。"

    # game/script.rpy:68978
    old "I stepped back and touched the Sekimeiya."
    new "我后退一步，伸手碰了碰 Sekimeiya。"

    # game/script.rpy:68986
    old "The light went out, but I knew where I was before I looked around me."
    new "光消失了，可我还没环顾四周，就已知道自己身在何处。"

    # game/script.rpy:68990
    old "The mechanical room."
    new "机械室。"

    # game/script.rpy:68991
    old "I confirmed that the rusty key was in my pocket."
    new "我确认生锈的钥匙就在口袋里。"

    # game/script.rpy:68996
    old "When I went to hallway A, I saw it on the floor too."
    new "我走到 A走廊，也看见它躺在地上。"

    # game/script.rpy:69003
    old "I didn't have to wait very long until the security room opened."
    new "没过多久，监控室的门就开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69004
    old "There we go, now we have two. Take this one."
    new "成了，现在有两把了。这把给你。"

    # game/script.rpy:69010
    old "The movements of the rusty key were interesting. Shiroya had found it on January 5th, in our world. Then, she had traveled to December 15th and had still been holding it. Later, she had traveled to November 30th and had still been holding it. However, she'd used it to lock the storeroom from outside in the other world, which meant it couldn't be recovered."
    new "这把生锈的钥匙经历很有意思。一月五日，Shiroya 在我们的世界里发现了它。之后她穿越到十二月十五日，钥匙仍在她手上；再后来她又穿越到十一月三十日，钥匙也依旧在手。可是在另一个世界，她用这把钥匙从外面锁上了储藏室，这意味着它再也取不回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69011
    old "When we had talked, she had told me about its location, so I'd been able to find it in the other world's security room as well. That was the key we had just duplicated."
    new "我们谈过之后，她告诉了我钥匙的位置，所以我也能在另一个世界的监控室里找到它。那正是我们刚刚复制出来的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:69012
    old "However, it was the one she ended up with, and it was the one she would have on January 26th. As a result, when she had appeared on the 15th, she hadn't been holding the same key she'd found. The fact that she'd had to leave it outside the storeroom had made it transform."
    new "然而，最终落到她手里的是这一把，一月二十六日她手上的也是这一把。所以，当她出现在十五日时，她拿的已经不再是她当初发现的那把钥匙了。她不得不把钥匙留在储藏室外，正是这件事让钥匙发生了变化。"

    # game/script.rpy:69013
    old "What she'd appeared with had been a mesh of both. To obtain that key, both had been needed, and in a single instant, it had changed from the key of our world to the key of the other world."
    new "她现身时带着的那把，是两者交织而成的。要得到那把钥匙，两把都不可或缺；就在一瞬间，它从我们世界的钥匙，变成了另一个世界的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:69023
    old "The powered-off Sekimeiya was on the floor, so I put it back where I'd found it; there was no reason to do otherwise."
    new "断电的 Sekimeiya 就放在地上，我把它放回原处——反正也没有理由不这么做。"

    # game/script.rpy:69024
    old "We need to go to the mechanical room. The others will come back soon."
    new "我们得去机械室。其他人很快就要回来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69037
    old "It's {time=19:45.} I'll travel to the past soon.{w} ...Sorry, to the future."
    new "现在是 {time=19:45.} 我很快就要穿越到过去了。{w} ……抱歉，是未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:69038
    old "Yeah. They must be coming down already."
    new "嗯。他们多半已经在往下走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69041
    old "So, you stayed at Eagle Motel too?"
    new "这么说，你也住在鹰旅馆？"

    # game/script.rpy:69046
    old "Yes. I was there until today. I didn't realize the owner wasn't a native."
    new "是的，我一直住到今天。我都没发觉老板不是本地人。"

    # game/script.rpy:69051
    old "We heard people above us. The group was beginning their wait near the shutter."
    new "我们听见头顶传来人声。那一群人开始在卷帘门附近等候。"

    # game/script.rpy:69052
    old "Will it be fine if we stay here?"
    new "我们待在这里没问题吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:69053
    old "...Hm... Not quite.{w} Once you leave for the bathroom, they'll search everywhere for you."
    new "……唔……不太行。{w} 你一去洗手间，他们就会四处找你。"

    # game/script.rpy:69058
    old "Wait, are they going to see us? They can't, right?"
    new "等等，他们会不会看到我们？不会吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:69059
    old "No. If my past self saw me, that'd be a paradox.{w} But there's no simple way out of this. The Future Sekimeiya will be powered off and Sai will stay next to it when it repowers, and the Past Sekimeiya will send us too far to hide us since it'll build up energy until your past self leaves. I doubt touching it twice would work due to the powered-off time."
    new "不会。如果过去的我看到我，就会形成悖论。{w}但这事没那么容易解决。未来Sekimeiya会被断电，等它重新通电时，Sai 会守在旁边；过去Sekimeiya则会一直蓄能，直到过去的你离开，再把我们送到太远的地方，根本没法藏身。考虑到它断电的那段时间，再碰一次恐怕行不通。"

    # game/script.rpy:69060
    old "It was a very similar dilemma to the one I'd faced when searching the drawers for a marking. However, the answer was much clearer."
    new "这和我翻找抽屉寻找标记时面临的困境十分相似。只是这一次，答案清楚得多。"

    # game/script.rpy:69065
    old "Ah, I need to be found, then. If they find me, the search will stop before they realize you're here."
    new "啊，那我就得让他们找到。只要他们找到我，搜索就会停下，他们也就不会发现你在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:69066
    old "I nodded in the darkness."
    new "我在黑暗中点了点头。"

    # game/script.rpy:69067
    old "That's what you said, right? That I was still here even after I'd traveled from the bathroom."
    new "你是这么说的吧？即使我从浴室穿越离开，我也仍然会留在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:69074
    old "But what about at {time=21}? The shutter won't move, will it?"
    new "可 {time=21} 的时候呢？卷帘门不会动，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:69075
    old "No, it will."
    new "不，会动的。"

    # game/script.rpy:69080
    old "What? Didn't you say that the recording was real?"
    new "什么？你不是说那段录音是真的吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:69081
    old "Yes, but before the exit opened, we went to the future. We appeared on January 5th, where the recording occurred.{w} So, if you're out of that range, you'll stay here and be able to leave."
    new "是，但在出口打开之前，我们去了未来。我们出现在 1 月 5 日，录音就是那天留下的。{w}所以，只要你不在那个范围里，就会留在这里，也就能离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:69086
    old "Oh... that's what happened.{w} Where will the range be?"
    new "哦……原来是这么回事。{w}那范围会在哪里？"

    # game/script.rpy:69087
    old "Here. Just before {time=21:05}, Erina is going to activate it. The Future Sekimeiya has yet to be brought here.{w} It won't be a normal travel, though. When she touches it, she'll trigger a chain reaction that will bring us to January 5th. We'll go twenty minutes to the future repeatedly. Akaro will appear a bit later because he traveled directly from today to January 5th after escaping from the bedroom with Sai."
    new "就在这里。{time=21:05} 之前，Erina 会启动它。未来Sekimeiya 那时还没被带到这里。{w}不过，那不会是一次普通的穿越。她一碰它，就会引发连锁反应，把我们带到 1 月 5 日。我们会反复向前跳二十分钟。Akaro 会稍晚出现，因为他是和 Sai 一起逃出卧室后，直接从今天穿越到了 1 月 5 日。"

    # game/script.rpy:69091
    old "W-Wait, a chain reaction...? Do we just have to avoid being here when that happens?"
    new "等、等等，连锁反应……？我们只要在它发生的时候别待在这里就行了吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:69092
    old "...{w}Not being here twenty minutes before it's activated would also avoid it.{w} It won't be so simple, though...{w} Only you will be able to do that."
    new "……{w}在它启动前二十分钟不在这里，也能避开它。{w}不过没那么简单……{w}能做到这一点的，只有你。"

    # game/script.rpy:69097
    old "Hm? ...Wh-Why?"
    new "嗯？……为、为什么？"

    # game/script.rpy:69098
    old "The people above us will search for you soon. They'll find you, and then the shutter will open. You can leave this place.{w} I can't do that, though. There's something very important that still has to happen.{w} On January 5th, I'll have to be in the tower in order to appear on November 24th with the Sekimeiya. If I stay here, I'll travel to the future one more time. That's when I'll finally be able to leave."
    new "楼上那些人很快就会来找你。他们会找到你，然后卷帘门就会打开。你就能离开这里。{w}可我不行。还有一件非常重要的事必须发生。{w}1 月 5 日，我必须待在塔里，才能在 11 月 24 日带着 Sekimeiya 出现。如果我留在这里，就会再向未来穿越一次。到那时，我才能真正离开。"

    # game/script.rpy:69101
    old "Can't you just enter through the storeroom on the 5th?"
    new "你不能在 5 日从储藏室进去吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:69102
    old "No... there are a few reasons why I can't.{w} The 5th is 21 days away. It's possible that getting out today will prevent me from being in the tower in the future.{w} I don't know what the police will do. If they find any evidence that incriminates me, being here on the 5th might not be possible. I'm sure my parents will keep trying to make me leave with them too. ...Staying here is the only way to guarantee it, and it's what I thought I'd do before I touched the Sekimeiya."
    new "不行……有几个原因。{w}距离 5 日还有 21 天。今天出去的话，我之后可能就没法待在塔里了。{w}我不知道警方会怎么做。如果他们找到任何对我不利的证据，5 日那天也许就没法待在这里了。我父母肯定也会一直想办法让我跟他们走。……留在这里是唯一能保证的办法，也是我在碰 Sekimeiya 之前就打算做的事。"

    # game/script.rpy:69103
    old "Technically, I knew I'd be in Yushibana on January 26th, but my parents had spent the previous two weeks telling me to go live with them. I feared they would give me no option after what had happened in the tower and force me to leave town until after January 5th."
    new "严格来说，我知道自己 1 月 26 日会在丰花，但过去两周里，父母一直在劝我去他们那里住。我担心塔里发生的事会让他们不再给我选择，逼我离开这座小镇，直到 1 月 5 日以后。"

    # game/script.rpy:69106
    old "There are more reasons too. If both of us leave, the attic key will be taken from us, and we need it on the 26th. Leaving it somewhere until the 5th is risky, so I can just bring it there myself."
    new "还有别的原因。如果我们两个都离开，阁楼的钥匙就会被收走，而 26 日我们需要它。把它放在别处留到 5 日太冒险，所以我可以自己把它带过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:69107
    old "...You're right. When I traveled to the 15th, I had the attic key, but the cabinet key was the only one that wasn't in my purse. I still don't get that."
    new "……你说得对。我穿越到 15 日时，身上有阁楼钥匙，但唯一不在我包里的就是展示柜钥匙。我到现在也不明白。"

    # game/script.rpy:69108
    old "The cabinet key? If the police found you with it, they would take it, so the only way to get it to the 26th would be by doing the same thing as with the attic's.{w} Did you ever need to unlock the cabinet?"
    new "展示柜钥匙？如果警方发现你带着它，就会收走。要把它带到 26 日，唯一的办法就是像阁楼钥匙那样处理。{w}你之前有需要打开展示柜的时候吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:69113
    old "...No. I don't think so."
    new "……没有。应该没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:69114
    old "I see. That's why, then. There's no reason to bring it to the 26th, so you didn't appear with it."
    new "原来如此。那就说得通了。既然没有理由把它带到 26 日，你出现时也就没带着它。"

    # game/script.rpy:69120
    old "Wait, so can't I do the same? We can both travel to the 5th."
    new "等等，那我不也能这么做吗？我们都可以穿越到 5 日。"

    # game/script.rpy:69121
    old "That's not true. On November 30th, you appeared outside the gem shop, right?"
    new "不对。11 月 30 日，你出现在了宝石店外，对吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:69123
    old "So, on December 30th, you'll be out of the tower. That's why you can't stay here."
    new "所以，12 月 30 日你会在塔外。正因如此，你不能留在这里。"

    # game/script.rpy:69129
    old "It'll be fine. I'll just take a little longer."
    new "没事的。我不过是多花一点时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:69135
    old "You can stay at my house too. At least you'll be with Maxi and Umi.{w} You were on January 5th once already, right? Was the tower not open?"
    new "你也可以住在我家。至少还有 Maxi 和 Umi 陪着你。{w}你已经去过一次 1 月 5 日，对吧？那时塔没有开放吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:69140
    old "N-No. I don't know why, but it seems it won't open again after today."
    new "没、没有。我不知道为什么，但塔似乎今天之后就不会再开了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69141
    old "...Yeah, that's what I thought."
    new "……嗯，我也这么想。"

    # game/script.rpy:69148
    old "There was a mountain of things I wanted to tell her, but we went silent for a while. Both of us were even more tired than we appeared, and we had to speak very quietly."
    new "我有千言万语想对她说，但我们沉默了一阵。我们两个都比看上去更疲惫，而且说话必须压低声音。"

    # game/script.rpy:69149
    old "Everything we'd gone through since we'd stepped into the tower was like an endless expanse of tangled web. I could hardly even recall what things had been like before I knew what the Sekimeiya were capable of."
    new "自踏入塔以来经历的一切，就像一张无边无际、纠缠不清的网。我甚至快要记不起，在知道 Sekimeiya 能做到什么之前，日子是什么样子了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69150
    old "But we had taken that day to its conclusion. Without any doubt, we were going to make it end."
    new "但我们把这一天走到了尽头。毫无疑问，我们会让这一切结束。"

    # game/script.rpy:69151
    old "People had died in horrible ways. I didn't expect that the outside world would ever learn the full truth of what had happened within the tower, but at the very least, Shiroya and I knew. We had built a better reality out there through our own actions."
    new "有人以惨烈的方式死去。我并不指望外界会知道塔里发生之事的全部真相，但至少 Shiroya 和我清楚。我们用自己的行动，在外面构筑了一个更好的现实。"

    # game/script.rpy:69152
    old "Surprisingly, I wasn't sad that the world where we had saved Miiya wasn't our own. Ours wasn't perfect, and I had no idea what awaited us in the future... but all I wanted was to step outside with Shiroya."
    new "意外的是，我们救下 Miiya 的那个世界并不是我们自己的世界，我却并不为此难过。我们的世界并不完美，我也不知道未来有什么在等着我们……但我只想和 Shiroya 一起走出去。"

    # game/script.rpy:69159
    old "They'll leave soon. There's only forty minutes left."
    new "他们快走了。只剩四十分钟了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69160
    old "Yeah. They'll go to the attic and come back down.{w} By the way, can I borrow your watch? It'll be useful to have it."
    new "嗯。他们会去阁楼，然后再下来。{w}对了，能借你的手表用用吗？带着会方便些。"

    # game/script.rpy:69161
    old "Take it."
    new "拿去吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:69162
    old "Thanks."
    new "谢谢。"

    # game/script.rpy:69164
    old "Our wait was short. When the time came, we heard the group walking to the hallway."
    new "我们没等多久。时间一到，就听见那群人朝走廊走去。"

    # game/script.rpy:69167
    old "...I guess I'll go."
    new "……那我走了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69168
    old "All right. I'll see you soon."
    new "好。回头见。"

    # game/script.rpy:69169
    old "Are you going to stay here? You won't be seen?"
    new "你要留在这里？不会被看到吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:69170
    old "I'm sure I'll be fine."
    new "放心，我不会有事的。"

    # game/script.rpy:69181
    old "Her shadowy figure slowly faded up the stairs.{w} I recalled the time we'd found her drowsy in room A1 and the words she'd told me in hallway C... They were words I'd hated before, but they had grown to bring me happiness."
    new "她的身影渐渐隐没在楼梯上。{w}我想起我们在 A1 房间发现她昏昏欲睡时的情形，还有她在 C走廊对我说过的那番话……那些话我从前很讨厌，后来却渐渐给我带来了幸福。"

    # game/script.rpy:69188
    old "The next time I heard sounds above me, she was already with them."
    new "等我再次听见楼上的动静时，她已经和他们在一起了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69190
    old "I stayed behind the piled furniture in the corner of the room. Like I'd expected, a single person came down soon after."
    new "我躲在房间角落那堆家具后面。果然，没过多久就有一个人走了下来。"

    # game/script.rpy:69191
    old "I couldn't see who they were, but it had to be Sai. He seemed to be looking around in the dark.{w} I feared he would find me until his movements slowed down. He kneeled under a table and stopped."
    new "我看不清来人的脸，但一定是 Sai。他似乎正在黑暗里四下摸索。{w}我生怕他发现我，直到他的动作慢了下来。他在一张桌子下面跪了下来，停住不动了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69192
    old "I bet he's looking for a good place to hide the Sekimeiya. Did he find one under that table?"
    new "他这是在给 Sekimeiya 找个合适的藏处吧。难道他看中的是那张桌子底下？"

    # game/script.rpy:69193
    old "I was doing my best to conceal my breathing, but he remained there for a long time. Finally, he seemed to decide he was done and walked up the stairs."
    new "我极力屏住呼吸，他却在那边待了很久。最后，他似乎觉得已经弄好了，便走上楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:69194
    old "I hardly had time to exhale before he was back. There was a glaring difference—the area between his hands was glowing.{w} Once more, he kneeled under the table and ran back up the stairs as soon as he was finished."
    new "我还没来得及松口气，他就回来了。这次有明显不同——他两手之间正发着光。{w}他又一次在桌下跪下，刚弄完就立刻跑上了楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:69195
    old "The Sekimeiya wasn't simply on the floor. From what I could see, he had tucked it just under the surface of the table—there seemed to be a tiny space where he'd left it."
    new "Sekimeiya 并不是就那样放在地板上。就我所见，他把它塞进了桌面下方——那里似乎有个很小的空隙。"

    # game/script.rpy:69196
    old "...{w}Now, my past self will find the Past Sekimeiya in the security room, and we'll all wait out the last few minutes in the lobby."
    new "……{w}接下来，过去的我会在监控室找到过去Sekimeiya，然后我们所有人就在大厅里熬过最后这几分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:69200
    old "I stared at the glowing numbers on the watch until {time=21:01} came. At that point, someone began to carefully descend the stairs."
    new "我一直盯着表上发光的数字，直到 {time=21:01} 来临。就在这时，有人小心翼翼地走下楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:69201
    old "While I couldn't see their face, I knew it was Erina. She stood still until something caught her eye."
    new "虽然看不清脸，但我知道那是 Erina。她站在原地不动，直到某样东西吸引了她的目光。"

    # game/script.rpy:69202
    old "Perhaps Sai thought he had found a good hiding spot, but he hadn't factored in the mechanical room's darkness. The faint illumination gave it away after Erina looked around a little."
    new "也许 Sai 以为自己找到了个好藏处，却没料到机械室会这么暗。Erina 四下张望了一会儿，那点微光便暴露了它的位置。"

    # game/script.rpy:69204
    old "She approached it and crouched. Her figure covered the light, and suddenly, it was gone."
    new "她走近，蹲下身。她的身影挡住了光，那光便忽然消失了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69211
    old "However, Erina was still there. Her outline had disappeared because the light had moved.{w} The faint ceiling light had turned off, and the Sekimeiya's glow couldn't be seen."
    new "然而，Erina 还留在原处。消失的是她的轮廓，因为光源移开了。{w}天花板上那盏微弱的灯熄灭了，Sekimeiya 的光也看不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69213
    old "I hadn't felt anything myself, but I knew. I was on January 5th of 2012. Since I'd been in the mechanical room during both recurring locations, I had traveled seamlessly, and as my vision was more adjusted to the darkness, I could make out that a few pieces of furniture had moved slightly."
    new "我自己什么都没感觉到，但我知道。我来到了 2012 年 1 月 5 日。两次循环我都待在机械室，所以穿越毫无痕迹；而我的眼睛更适应黑暗，能分辨出有几件家具挪动了一点点。"

    # game/script.rpy:69214
    old "Oblivious, Erina crawled out. To her, the Sekimeiya had simply disappeared. Then, she walked to the stairs, likely thinking she had traveled to the past."
    new "Erina 浑然不觉，从桌下爬了出来。在她看来，Sekimeiya 只是凭空消失了。随后她走向楼梯，大概是以为自己已经回到了过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:69215
    old "...It's still there; the Sekimeiya's on the floor. It rolled up to the wall."
    new "……它还在。Sekimeiya 就在地板上，滚到墙边去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69217
    old "Hey! What's going on!?"
    new "喂！怎么回事！？"

    # game/script.rpy:69218
    old "That time, when the door to the lobby opened, light didn't fill the stairs—the whole building was devoid of it."
    new "那一次，大厅的门打开时，楼梯上并没有照进光——整栋楼里一点光都没有。"

    # game/script.rpy:69222
    old "The watch still showed {time=21:03}, but that was far from the real time. I could hear the others shouting above me. The shutter wasn't opening."
    new "表上仍显示 {time=21:03}，可那离真正的时间还差得远。我能听见头顶上其他人在喊。卷帘门没有打开。"

    # game/script.rpy:69223
    old "I can't get out yet. I'll need to have both Sekimeiya after the watch shows {time=22:30.}"
    new "我还出不去。得等到表上的时间过了 {time=22:30.}，并且两个 Sekimeiya 都到手才行。"

    # game/script.rpy:69228
    old "I was forcing Shiroya to wait, but I had to stay there for a little while longer.{w} When {time=21:50} came, I approached the stairs."
    new "我让 Shiroya 干等着，自己却还得在那里多待一会儿。{w}等到 {time=21:50}，我走向楼梯。"

    # game/script.rpy:69229
    old "At that time, my past self had traveled to the past. The others were soon to notice my absence."
    new "那个时候，过去的我已经回到过去了。其他人很快就会发现我不见了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69233
    old "I grabbed the Future Sekimeiya and stepped up the stairs. I could no longer see the walls of the lobby, but unfortunately, I knew I'd have to see them once more in the future."
    new "我拿起未来Sekimeiya，登上楼梯。大厅的墙壁已经看不见了，可惜我知道，将来我还得再看它们一次。"

    # game/script.rpy:69234
    old "I couldn't shake off the anticipation of stepping out. Even though I'd already left once before, it didn't feel like it."
    new "我按捺不住即将走出去的那份期待。明明之前已经走出去过一次，感觉上却完全不像。"

    # game/script.rpy:69238
    old "I walked to the crystal room the past me had traveled from, B5. After feeling the floor, I realized that the powered-off Past Sekimeiya was there.{w} For the time being, I went to the crystal room at my right and put both inside a temperature regulation cabinet, setting it to where I believed 0 °C was. It seemed the curtains were all still raised."
    new "我走向过去的我穿越离开的那间水晶展室 B5。伸手一探地板，便发现断电的过去Sekimeiya就在那儿。{w}我暂且走进右边那间水晶展室，把两个都放进带温控的展示柜，把温度调到我估计是 0 °C 的位置。看来所有遮布都仍然卷着。"

    # game/script.rpy:69244
    old "I could've gone to the attic, but the last thing I wanted was to have to explain myself to anyone. ...My sole desire was for the final few minutes to elapse."
    new "我本可以去阁楼，但我最不愿的就是向任何人解释。……我唯一的愿望，就是让最后这几分钟赶快过去。"

    # game/script.rpy:69250
    old "I walked to the lobby. I could feel the shutter with my hands."
    new "我走到大厅，伸手摸到了卷帘门。"

    # game/script.rpy:69251
    old "I'd waited patiently all day, but I couldn't take it anymore. I needed time to move faster. The goal was right there, and I was the only person who knew."
    new "我一整天都在耐心等待，如今却再也熬不住了。我只盼时间能走得快些。目标就在眼前，而知道这一切的只有我。"

    # game/script.rpy:69252
    old "...Minutes after I had started staring at Shiroya's watch, I heard voices in the far hallway."
    new "……我盯着 Shiroya 的表看了几分钟后，听见远处的走廊传来人声。"

    # game/script.rpy:69253
    old "...tsuki! Where the fuck—"
    new "……tsuki！你他妈到底在——"

    # game/script.rpy:69257
    old "I kept looking down. It was already past {time=22.}"
    new "我一直低着头。时间已经过了 {time=22.}。"

    # game/script.rpy:69261
    old "Wait... are they actually searching for me?"
    new "等等……他们真的在找我？"

    # game/script.rpy:69262
    old "Sai's yells got closer and closer. It seemed he was looking in every room."
    new "Sai 的喊声越来越近。看来他在一间间地找。"

    # game/script.rpy:69266
    old "This piece of shit! The Sekimeiya's not in the cabinet!"
    new "这混蛋！展示柜里没有 Sekimeiya！"

    # game/script.rpy:69267
    old "Fuck. There's no way he'll find them, right?"
    new "妈的。他总不至于真找到吧？"

    # game/script.rpy:69269
    old "Look! I found the Sekimeiya!"
    new "看！我找到 Sekimeiya 了！"

    # game/script.rpy:69273
    old "What?{w} No. That's the third one."
    new "什么？{w}不对。那是第三个。"

    # game/script.rpy:69274
    old "He had found it in another room in hallway B. He had plenty of energy to spare, as I heard him running to the event room and leaving it there. Fortunately, that caused him not to find the real ones."
    new "他是在 B走廊的另一间房里找到的。他精力多得用不完，我听见他一路跑到活动室，把它丢在了那里。幸好如此，他才没能找到真正的那两个。"

    # game/script.rpy:69279
    old "Atsuki! I know you're here!"
    new "Atsuki！我知道你在这儿！"

    # game/script.rpy:69280
    old "I didn't move. The darkness was all I needed to stay hidden."
    new "我一动不动。只要藏在黑暗里，我就不会暴露。"

    # game/script.rpy:69284
    old "He went to the mechanical room. Maybe he noticed the Sekimeiya he'd hidden was no longer there, but he didn't say anything. Afterward, he walked back with the others.{w} Akaro was there. Hopefully, the recording of him had been obtained by the police.{w} Erina and Isla were the last two. Their stories had been tragic in different ways. They were together again, but it was possible that Erina would never understand that the Isla she'd entered the tower with was gone."
    new "他去了机械室。也许他发现自己藏起来的 Sekimeiya 不见了，可他什么也没说。之后，他和其他人一起走了回去。{w}Akaro 也在。但愿警方已经拿到了录有他的那段录音。{w}最后两个是 Erina 和 Isla。她们两人的遭遇都很悲惨，只是方式不同。她们又在一起了，但 Erina 也许永远无法明白，当初和她一起走进这座塔的那个 Isla 已经不在了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69285
    old "What is going to happen with them? The police must've found her corpse, but now they'll see that she's still alive. ...I suppose the case is similar with Naomi."
    new "他们会怎么样呢？警方肯定已经找到了她的尸体，如今却又会看到她活生生地站在那里。……Naomi 的情况大概也一样吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:69290
    old "I felt their voices fading. They were going back up."
    new "我听着他们的声音渐渐远去。他们回楼上去了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69291
    old "Now that I think about it, it was when I traveled to {time=21:00} that my hand injury disappeared. Even though I only went 45 minutes to the past, it took me many days to reach the proportional future."
    new "说起来，我的手伤正是在穿越到 {time=21:00} 的时候消失的。虽然我只回到了 45 分钟前，却花了好几天才抵达与之对应的未来。"

    # game/script.rpy:69292
    old "Right now, I have Shiroya's watch and the rusty key. When I was briefly at {time=21:00}, I might not have realized that. However, after Shiroya made me travel to the 15th, there's no way I had them.{w} I suppose that makes sense since that location was based on a point much farther into the future. That's still a little strange, though, because Shiroya did have the rusty key."
    new "现在，我手里有 Shiroya 的表和生锈的钥匙。我短暂停留在 {time=21:00} 的时候，也许还没意识到这一点。可是，在 Shiroya 让我穿越到 15 日之后，我绝不可能带着这两样东西。{w}想想也合理，毕竟那个位置对应的，是未来更远处的一个时间点。不过还是有点奇怪——毕竟当时 Shiroya 确实拿着生锈的钥匙。"

    # game/script.rpy:69293
    old "I stopped myself there. I really didn't care anymore. No matter how many details had flown far over my head, I didn't care about any of them."
    new "想到这里，我打住了。我真的已经不在乎了。不管有多少细节让我摸不着头脑，我都无所谓了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69294
    old "I stood there for what seemed like hours, but eventually, {time=22:30} came."
    new "我在原地站着，仿佛过了好几个小时，{time=22:30}终究还是到了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69298
    old "I tried to force myself to breathe properly. It wasn't over yet."
    new "我强迫自己调整呼吸。事情还没有结束。"

    # game/script.rpy:69299
    old "In the staff room, there was a keyring that I needed and I could obtain. I already had it in my pocket, though."
    new "员工室里有一串我需要的钥匙，我也拿得到。可它其实早已在我口袋里了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69300
    old "...I forgot that I need to go to the attic. I thought I'd never see that place again."
    new "……我忘了自己还得去一趟阁楼。我还以为，再也不会见到那个地方了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69301
    old "When I'd thought up the loop to appear on November 24th, I'd imagined appearing with the Sekimeiya in a suitcase. The one in the security room was locked away, so I had to get the one on the attic's sofa."
    new "当初构思出这个让我在11月24日现身的循环时，我想象的是自己带着装在行李箱里的 Sekimeiya 出现。监控室里的那个被锁着，所以我只能去拿阁楼沙发上的那个。"

    # game/script.rpy:69305
    old "I left the watch behind so that it wouldn't cast any light and gradually ascended. Every floor was dark, and my steps echoed more loudly than I liked."
    new "我把手表留在原处，免得它透出光亮，然后慢慢往上走。每一层都一片漆黑，脚步声回荡得比我希望的要响。"

    # game/script.rpy:69309
    old "Once I reached the highest door, I saw that the living room was empty."
    new "走到最上面那扇门时，我看见客厅里空无一人。"

    # game/script.rpy:69310
    old "I was leaving my footprints behind, but it didn't matter. Once I'd taken the suitcase, I dashed back, leaving that place for good."
    new "身后留下了一串脚印，但也无所谓了。拿到行李箱后，我便一路奔回，永远离开了那个地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:69317
    old "I took both Sekimeiya from the cold of the cabinet with my bare hands. The instant I activated them, I traveled the smallest fraction of time. Enough for it to have no real effect."
    new "我赤手从冰凉的展示柜里取出两个 Sekimeiya。启动它们的瞬间，我穿越了极短的一段时间——短到不会产生任何实际影响。"

    # game/script.rpy:69321
    old "With the suitcase in hand, I descended to the lobby and sat on the floor. Then, I put the Sekimeiya inside it and placed both of my hands on them.{w} I suddenly realized a key had fallen from my pocket before I'd even taken it out willingly..."
    new "我提着行李箱下到大厅，坐在地上。随后把两个 Sekimeiya 放进去，双手按在它们上面。{w}我这才猛然发觉，一把钥匙从我口袋里掉了出来——我甚至还没主动掏过它……"

    # game/script.rpy:69323
    old "...That had been my plan before I'd gone to the 24th. I'd wanted to appear with the Sekimeiya, but for that, they had to be powered off in the future. It was very hard to calculate the exact second I needed to have them, so the position I was in was a good way to cover a longer stretch of time."
    new "……那是我去24日之前的计划。我本想带着 Sekimeiya 一起出现，可要做到这一点，它们必须先在未来被关掉。要精确算出我需要在哪一秒拿到它们实在太难，所以我所在的位置正好能覆盖更长的一段时间。"

    # game/script.rpy:69324
    old "Every time a Sekimeiya powered on, my hands would immediately power it off, resulting in no effect whatsoever. Furthermore, they emitted no light, so nobody could see me in the dark."
    new "每当一个 Sekimeiya 启动，我的手就会立刻把它关掉，因此没有产生任何效果。而且它们不会发光，黑暗中谁也看不见我。"

    # game/script.rpy:69330
    old "However, I had calculated enough... I only had to be there for ten more minutes."
    new "不过，该算的我都算好了……只需再在那里待上十分钟。"

    # game/script.rpy:69331
    old "They were the last ten minutes I'd spend trapped in that place. The suitcase was on my lap, and both of my hands were planted firmly on the Sekimeiya's surfaces, too far apart to overlap their minuscule ranges.{w} ...It was the end. I knew I was in the position where I'd appeared on the 24th."
    new "那是我被困在那个地方的最后十分钟。行李箱搁在腿上，双手牢牢按在 Sekimeiya 的表面，彼此相距太远，无法让它们那微小的范围重叠。{w}……结束了。我知道自己所在的位置，正是24日我出现的地方。"

    # game/script.rpy:69332
    old "I couldn't check the time anymore; the watch was hidden behind the reception desk. Instead, I counted the seconds inside my head."
    new "我已经没法再看时间了，手表藏在接待台后面。只能在心里数着秒。"

    # game/script.rpy:69336
    old "...She's there right now. I'm sure."
    new "……她此刻就在那里。我确定。"

    # game/script.rpy:69337
    old "Time had passed. It hadn't frozen—it hadn't forbidden me from taking the final step."
    new "时间已经过去了。它没有冻结——也没有阻止我迈出最后一步。"

    # game/script.rpy:69341
    old "I closed the suitcase and stood up, grabbing the fallen key. Before anything else, I went to retrieve Shiroya's watch."
    new "我合上行李箱站起身，捡起掉落的那把钥匙。别的先不管，我先去把 Shiroya 的手表取了回来。"

    # game/script.rpy:69345
    old "I opened the hallway A door. Each step I took toward the storeroom was more surreal than the last. I took out the rusty key and suddenly understood why I wouldn't have it on the 26th."
    new "我推开A走廊的门。每向储藏室走近一步，都比前一步更像在梦里。我掏出那把生锈的钥匙，忽然明白为什么26日我身上不会有它了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69349
    old "I was there; I could feel the dusty couch, and the wall wasn't blocking my way."
    new "我到了那里。我摸得到那张落满灰尘的沙发，墙也没有挡住我的去路。"

    # game/script.rpy:69350
    old "With bated breath, I approached the final door—the one that could only be opened from the outside."
    new "我屏住呼吸，走向最后那扇门——那扇只能从外面打开的门。"

    # game/script.rpy:69355
    old "...And it was open."
    new "……而门是开着的。"

    # game/script.rpy:69413
    old "Atsuki, you son of a bitch! Open the fucking door!"
    new "Atsuki，你这混蛋！把这该死的门打开！"

    # game/script.rpy:69414
    old "I know you just left! I heard you talking with Shiroya! You better come back right now!"
    new "我知道你刚走！我听见你和 Shiroya 说话了！你最好现在就给我回来！"

    # game/script.rpy:69417
    old "Atsuki! Piece of shit!"
    new "Atsuki！你个王八蛋！"

    # game/script.rpy:69418
    old "I'll convince everyone this was all your doing if you don't open this fucking door!"
    new "你要是不把这该死的门打开，我就让所有人都相信这一切是你干的！"

    # game/script.rpy:69421
    old "At least tell the police we're here! I'm fucking hungry, man!"
    new "至少告诉警察我们在这儿啊！我他妈快饿死了！"

    # game/script.rpy:69424
    old "...I don't think he's coming."
    new "……我觉得他不会来了。"

    # game/script.rpy:69425
    old "Can you just shut up?"
    new "你能不能闭嘴？"

    # game/script.rpy:69426
    old "Atsuki! You think I won't tell them that you left with the Sekimeiya!? This is your last chance to come back!"
    new "Atsuki！你以为我不敢告诉他们，你带着 Sekimeiya 走了吗！？这是你回来的最后机会！"

    # game/script.rpy:69432
    old "\"Atsuki!\"{w=1.1}{nw}"
    new "「Atsuki！」{w=1.1}{nw}"

